tems-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"22b309e6-0fac-4697-82ab-3e136d6d16a7\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-5\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"716\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Kurukshetra University is situated on a sprawling <strong data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"87\">473-acre campus</strong> in Kurukshetra, Haryana, near the historic Brahma Sarovar. The campus provides a vibrant academic environment with modern classrooms, advanced laboratories, a central library, research centers, auditoriums, sports complexes, hostels, healthcare facilities, and student support services. Designed to support both teaching and research activities, the university offers a well-connected and student-friendly infrastructure that promotes academic excellence, innovation, cultural engagement, and holistic development. The green and spacious campus creates an ideal atmosphere for learning, research, and extracurricular activities.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '2026-05-15 08:03:21', '2026-05-15 02:33:21', '2026-06-22 01:32:49', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 'Independent', 0, '[{\"year\":\"2025\",\"total_students\":null,\"total_faculty\":null,\"total_male_students\":null,\"total_female_students\