('6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 61, 'Graphic Era University', 'graphic-era-university-cx7y', 'Main', '1993', 'Dehradun', 'Uttarakhand', 'India', '248002', '566/6, Bell Road, Society Area, Clement Town, Dehradun, Uttarakhand 248002, India', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/eDKRUF9tmbJWJkZr9?g_st=aw', 'ISBT Dehradun (Bus Terminal) ,Dehradun Railway Station, Jolly Grant Airport (Dehradun Airport)', 27.00, 'Acres', 13, 90, 1, 100, 0, 85000, 0, 5, 0, 'Both', 1500, 'Mess, Cafeteria, Multi-cuisine Canteen', 0, '[\"Cricket, Football, Basketball, Volleyball, Tennis, Badminton, Table Tennis, Athletics, Billiards, Chess, Carrom, Throwball, Gym\"]', 1, 0, '[\"University buses operate between the campus and different parts of Dehradun city and nearby residential areas for students and staff.\"]', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, '\"1800 890 6027  ,   +91 9520986895 (WhatsApp)\"', 'enquiry@geu.ac.in', 'https://geu.ac.in/', 0, 1, NULL, NULL, '<p>Graphic Era (Deemed to be University) is located in Dehradun, Uttarakhand, and offers a modern academic environment with state-of-the-art infrastructure, advanced laboratories, smart classrooms, libraries, research centers, sports facilities, auditoriums, hostels, and recreational spaces. The campus is designed to support academic excellence, innovation, research, and holistic student development. Surrounded by the scenic foothills of the Himalayas, the university provides a vibrant learning atmosphere that encourages industry interaction, entrepreneurship, cultural activities, and extracurricular engagement. The campus hosts students from across India and several countries, fostering a diverse and inclusive educational community.</p>', '2026-03-14 06:51:53', '2026-03-14 01:21:53', '2026-06-17 01:00:39', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 'Independent', 0, '[{\"year\":\"2025\",\"total_students\":\"6755\",\"total_faculty\":\"794\",\"total_male_students\":\"4143\",\"total_female_students\":\"2619\",\"total_outside_state\":\"3925\"}]', '[\"96f