('6fcc1b2d-8b66-4428-9778-b7756b51ca03', 65, 'Shoolini University', 'shoolini-university-m2ju', 'Main', '1998', 'Solan', 'Himachal Pradesh', 'India', '173229', 'Solan-Oachghat-Kumarhatti Highway, Bajhol, Himachal Pradesh 173229', NULL, NULL, 25.00, 'Acres', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 0, '[null]', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, '\"+91 9805092570, +91 7018007000\"', 'admissions@shooliniuniversity.com', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, '<p>Shoolini University is a premier private research university located in the serene hills of Solan, Himachal Pradesh. Spread across a 25-acre residential campus, the university offers a modern learning environment with smart classrooms, advanced laboratories, innovation centers, research facilities, libraries, hostels, sports infrastructure, and collaborative learning spaces. Surrounded by natural greenery and the Himalayan landscape, the campus is designed to promote academic excellence, research, entrepreneurship, and holistic student development. The university is recognized for its strong focus on innovation, industry partnerships, global collaborations, and outcome-based education, providing students with a vibrant and future-ready learning experience.</p>', '2026-04-29 06:20:10', '2026-04-29 00:50:10', '2026-06-22 01:20:12', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 'Independent', 0, '[{\"year\":\"2025\",\"total_students\":\"1833\",\"total_faculty\":\"207\",\"total_male_students\":\"822\",\"total_female_students\":\"1011\",\"total_outside_state\":\"994\"}]', '[\"96fd453e-51c1-4cd7-8895-f923463908c3\",\"8e446392-3a73-4c80-a81a-e640a3804847\",\"63c7d429-a553-4965-9f01-5ec7f36da71e\",\"04d613a1-3db6-4eeb-90dd-c7cdf834b45f\",\"186d252b-2c01-4f4b-a3e3-3ed5653b0ea3\",\"9844a1cd-8d0e-44b0-be83-3094b4c31319\",\"7870bf92-24e4-4fc9-b4f0-6d8d780809e1\",\"b520d97d-8cf9-495a-b8e2-0ecd000578d4\",\"d7872157-54b6-4ab2-a183-391991e9a598\",\"1a1416cc-4474-4687-b870-0ae09cee9e6a\",\"c7cf7e57-ab50-4178-85ea-d47d1a696432\",\"4d3310db-54c3-4c5f-b35c-e42a3ec40af5\",\"8f12fd56-6df8-4935-a963-e9b07ab995ae\",\"074d8dab-6fd9-4a55-a5f1-f9ad4d53d413\",\"dd48d1b1-47c9-40ff-b84c-42fb509c0433\",\"8733a3c8-46ef-4e6a-b794-29cfbaa7f463\"]'),
('6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 75, 'Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham', 'amrita-vishwa-vidyapeetham-cycs', 'Main', '1994', 'Amritanagar', 'Tamil Nadu', 'India', '641112', 'Amrita University, Amritanagar, Ettimadai, Tamil Nadu 641112', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Acres', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 0, '[null]', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, '\"+91 422 2685000, +91 422 2686274, +91 422 2686275\"', 'amrita@amrita.edu', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, '<p>Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham features a modern and student-centric campus environment designed to support academic excellence, research innovation, and holistic development. The university\'s campuses are equipped with smart classrooms, advanced laboratories, well-stocked libraries, innovation and research centers, residential facilities, sports infrastructure, and collaborative learning spaces. With a strong emphasis on technology-driven education, industry engagement, global exposure, and value-based learning, Amrita provides students with an enriching academic experience that prepares them for successful careers and leadership roles in a rapidly evolving world.</p>', '2026-05-14 06:29:57', '2026-05-14 00:59:57', '2026-06-20 06:58:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, '[{\"year\":\"2025\",\"total_students\":\"6680\",\"total_faculty\":null,\"total_male_students\":\"3239\",\"total_female_students\":\"3441\",\"total_outside_state\":\"5285\"}]', '[\"96fd453e-51c1-4cd7-8895-f923463908c3\",\"8e446392-3a73-4c80-a81a-e640a3804847\",\"63c7d429-a553-4965-9f01-5ec7f36da71e\",\"04d613a1-3db6-4eeb-90dd-c7cdf834b45f\",\"186d252b-2c01-4f4b-a3e3-3ed5653b0ea3\",\"9844a1cd-8d0e-44b0-be83-3094b4c31319\",\"7870bf92-24e4-4fc9-b4f0-6d8d780809e1\",\"b520d97d-8cf9-495a-b8e2-0ecd000578d4\",\"d7872157-54b6-4ab2-a183-391991e9a598\",\"1a1416cc-4474-4687-b870-0ae09cee9e6a\",\"c7cf7e57-ab50-4178-85ea-d47d1a696432\",\"4d3310db-54c3-4c5f-b35c-e42a3ec40af5\",\"8f12fd56-6df8-4935-a963-e9b07ab995ae\",\"074d8dab-6fd9-4a55-a5f1-f9a