(289, 4, 287, 'NEET', 'neet', NULL, 'Educational Qualification  - Must have passed or be appearing in Class 12 (10+2)\r\nRequired Subjects  -  Physics, Chemistry, Biology/Biotechnology, and English\r\nMinimum Marks  - General – 50% in PCB; OBC/SC/ST – 40%; PwBD – 45% (as per applicable rules)\r\nMinimum Age	 -  17 years on or before 31 December of the admission year\r\nNationality  -  Indian, NRI, OCI, PIO, and Foreign Nationals are eligible (subject to applicable rules)', NULL, '{\"Badge\":\"Fee\",\"Salary\":\"General - \\u20b91,700\\r\\nGeneral-EWS \\/ OBC-NCL  -  \\u20b91,600\\r\\nSC \\/ ST \\/ PwBD \\/ Third Gender  -   \\u20b91,000\"}', 1, '2026-06-25 02:17:41', '2026-06-25 03:47:43'),
