\"fresh_registration_fee\":\"0\",\"additional_security_deposit\":null,\"refund_applicable\":\"Yes\",\"remarks\":null},{\"round_name\":\"round 6\",\"fresh_registration_fee\":\"0\",\"additional_security_deposit\":null,\"refund_applicable\":\"Yes\",\"remarks\":null}]', 'JoSAA follows a seat acceptance fee-based refund system\r\nRefund depends on:\r\nWithdrawal stage\r\nRound of seat acceptance\r\nReporting status at institute\r\nRefund is governed strictly by JoSAA Business Rules (Seat Acceptance Fee & Withdrawal clauses)', '15–30 working days after completion of counselling process', 'Original Payment Method', '[{\"scenario\":\"Seat allotted but not joined\",\"remarks\":null}]', '[\"Debit Card\",\"Credit Card\",\"Net Banking\",\"UPI\"]', 1, 'Candidate', NULL),
