n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">It is the first stage of selection<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Further selection may include:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Additional screening<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Medical fitness<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Interview or other procedures<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Unique Advantage of MNS Pathway<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Opportunity to serve in defence services<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Structured career with:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Job security<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Respectable position<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Government benefits<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Important Condition Across All Organizations<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Common Rule<\\/p>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">All organizations using NEET results:<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Apply their own:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Eligibility criteria<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Rules and regulations<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Admission procedures<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">What Students Must Understand<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Qualifying NEET does not automatically guarantee admission<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">You must:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Fulfill course-specific eligibility<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Participate in respective counselling<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Common Mistakes Students Make<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Thinking NEET is only for MBBS\\/BDS<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Ignoring alternative courses like:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Nursing<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Veterinary<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Not tracking different counselling authorities<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Missing deadlines of other organizations<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Smart Strategy for Maximum Utilization of NEET Score<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Explore all available courses:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">MBBS<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">BDS<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">AYUSH<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Nursing<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Veterinary<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Apply to multiple counselling processes<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Keep track of:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Eligibility differences<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Admission timelines<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', 13, 1, '2026-04-14 01:44:26', '2026-04-14 07:06:49');
INSERT INTO `dynamic_exam_sections` (`id`, `dynamic_exam_id`, `heading`, `content`, `order`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(343, 5, ' Miscellaneous Provisions', '[{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" Caution Notice\",\"name\":\"_caution_notice\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Fraud Awareness, Authentic Information Sources &amp; Candidate Safety Strategy)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The caution notice is one of the most important yet often ignored sections of NEET guidelines. While it appears simple, it directly protects candidates from fraud, misinformation, and career-threatening scams that are very common during the admission cycle.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">This section explains every instruction in depth, along with real risks and practical strategies to stay safe.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Rely Only on Official Information Sources<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Official Advisory<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Candidates must refer only to the official website of the<br>National Testing Agency:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/neet.nta.nic.in\\/\\\">https:\\/\\/neet.nta.nic.in\\/<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Why This Is Critical<\\/p>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">During NEET season, thousands of:<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Fake websites<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Telegram\\/WhatsApp groups<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Coaching institute claims<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">circulate misleading or outdated information.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Hidden Risk<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Relying on unofficial sources can lead to:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Missing important deadlines<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Following incorrect procedures<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Losing admission opportunities<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Smart Practice<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Bookmark the official website<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Check updates regularly instead of relying on others<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Cross-verify any information before acting<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Beware of False Claims &amp; Admission Scams<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Official Warning<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Candidates must be cautious of:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Individuals<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Agents<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Coaching institutes<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">who claim:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">&ldquo;Guaranteed MBBS seat&rdquo;<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">&ldquo;Management\\/NRI seat without merit&rdquo;<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">&ldquo;Direct admission through influence&rdquo;<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Ground Reality<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">NEET-based admissions are strictly merit-based<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Counselling is conducted through centralized systems<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No private person can legally secure a seat for you<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Common Types of Scams<\\/h3>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">1. Seat Guarantee Fraud<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Fraudsters promise admission in exchange for money.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">2. Fake Counselling Offers<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Fake portals pretending to be official counselling platforms.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">3. Rank Manipulation Claims<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Claims of improving rank or marks after result.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Consequences of Falling into Traps<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Financial loss (often lakhs of rupees)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Loss of admission opportunity<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Legal complications in some cases<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Reporting Suspicious Activities<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Official Instruction<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">If you come across:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Fraudulent claims<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Fake admission offers<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Misleading information<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">You must report it to NTA.<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Reporting Channel<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Email: neetug2026@nta.ac.in<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Why Reporting Matters<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Helps authorities take action<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Prevents other students from being scammed<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Maintains fairness in the system<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Practical Safety Strategy for Students<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Always Verify Before You Trust<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Check if information is on official website<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Avoid relying on:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Social media forwards<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Unknown agents<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Never Pay for &ldquo;Guaranteed Admission&rdquo;<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No one can legally guarantee a seat<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Admission depends only on:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">NEET rank<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Counselling process<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Stay Updated Personally<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Do not depend entirely on:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Friends<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Coaching institutes<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Take responsibility for:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Checking official updates<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Tracking counselling schedules<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Common Mistakes Students Make<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Trusting coaching institute promises blindly<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Clicking on fake counselling links<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Ignoring official announcements<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Not reporting suspicious activities<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) \\u2013 NEET (UG) \",\"name\":\"_non-disclosure_agreement_nda__neet_ug_\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">(Confidentiality Rules, Legal Obligations &amp; Serious Consequences Explained)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) in NEET is a legally binding condition that every candidate automatically accepts. It is designed to protect the confidentiality, integrity, and fairness of the examination. Many students overlook this section, but violating it can lead to immediate cancellation of candidature and legal penalties.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">This section explains every aspect in a clear, detailed, and practical way.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Nature of NEET as a High-Stakes Confidential Examination<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">NEET is classified as a high-stakes national-level examination, conducted by the<br>National Testing Agency<br>on behalf of:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">National Medical Commission<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Ministry of Health &amp; Family Welfare (MoHFW), Government of India<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">What &ldquo;Confidential&rdquo; Means in NEET<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">All exam-related content is:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Confidential (not meant to be shared)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Proprietary (owned by official authorities)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Ownership of Content<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The following bodies hold ownership rights:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">NTA<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">NMC<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">MoHFW<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Strict Prohibition on Sharing Exam Content<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">What Is Not Allowed<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Candidates are strictly prohibited from:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Publishing exam questions<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Reproducing content (copying or rewriting)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Sharing questions or answers<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Transmitting content through any medium<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Forms of Prohibited Sharing<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The restriction applies to all formats, including:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Verbal (telling others after exam)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Written (notes, messages)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Electronic (social media, apps, emails)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Mechanical (recording devices, screenshots)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Important Insight<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Even after the exam is over:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">You cannot share or distribute questions<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">You cannot upload memory-based questions online<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">This is where many students unknowingly violate NDA.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Automatic Acceptance of NDA by Candidates<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Key Rule<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">By:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Registering for NEET<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Appearing in the exam<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">You automatically agree to:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">NDA conditions<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Terms of use of NEET<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">What This Means Practically<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No separate signature is required<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Your participation itself is treated as legal consent<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Legal Consequences of NDA Violation<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">If a Candidate Violates NDA<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">They may face:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Immediate cancellation of candidature<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Disqualification from the exam<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Legal\\/penal action under applicable laws<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">&ldquo;Bare Threshold&rdquo; Clause &ndash; What It Means<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The term &ldquo;bare threshold&rdquo; indicates:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Action can be taken immediately upon detection<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No delay or leniency is guaranteed<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Common NDA Violations Students Make (Often Unintentional)<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Sharing questions in WhatsApp\\/Telegram groups<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Discussing exact questions publicly after exam<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Posting memory-based questions online<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Recording or attempting to record exam content<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Hidden Risk Most Candidates Ignore<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Students often think:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">&ldquo;Exam is over, so sharing is fine&rdquo;<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Reality<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">NDA applies before, during, and after the exam<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Violations can be tracked through:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Digital monitoring<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Social media surveillance<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Why NDA Is Strictly Enforced<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The NDA ensures:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Fairness for all candidates<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Prevention of paper leaks<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Integrity of future exams<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Smart Strategy for Candidates<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Do not share exact questions anywhere<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Avoid posting or forwarding exam content<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Discuss only general topics, not specific questions<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Stay cautious on social media<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" Correspondence Regarding NEET (UG)\",\"name\":\"_correspondence_regarding_neet_ug\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">(Official Communication Process, Valid Query Format &amp; Response Limitations Explained)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The correspondence system for NEET is designed to handle candidate queries, grievances, and issues in a structured and controlled manner. However, many students misuse or misunderstand this system, leading to ignored queries or delayed responses.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">This section explains in detail how to correctly communicate with authorities, what is accepted, what is rejected, and the limitations of the system.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Official Channels for Communication<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Candidates must contact the<br>National Testing Agency<br>only through authorized channels.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Helpdesk Numbers<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">011-40759000<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">011-69227700<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Official Email<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">neetug2026@nta.ac.in<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Purpose of Communication<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">You can contact NTA for:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Genuine queries related to your candidature<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Technical issues (application, admit card, etc.)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Grievances regarding exam process<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Mandatory Requirements for Sending Email Queries<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Essential Details (Compulsory)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Your email must include:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Full Name of Candidate<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Application\\/Registration Number<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Roll Number (if available)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Postal Address<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Contact Number<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Why This Is Important<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Without these details:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Your query cannot be verified<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Your request may be ignored<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Strict Rule<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Anonymous emails (without identity) are not accepted<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Types of Queries That Will NOT Be Entertained<\\/h3>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">1. Vague or General Queries<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Examples:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">&ldquo;What should I do next?&rdquo;<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">&ldquo;Tell me about counselling&rdquo;<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Reason<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Such queries lack clarity and cannot be addressed specifically.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">2. Repetitive Emails<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Sending the same query multiple times<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Consequence<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Ignored by NTA<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">May delay response further<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">3. Queries from Third Parties<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Parents, agents, or representatives contacting on behalf of candidate<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Rule<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Only the candidate&rsquo;s own query is considered valid<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Response Limitations of NTA<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Important Reality<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Due to extremely high volume of queries:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">NTA cannot guarantee a reply to every email<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">What This Means for Students<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">You must:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Write clear and precise queries<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Avoid unnecessary communication<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Use official website for general information<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Information That Will NOT Be Shared by NTA<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Certain sensitive information is strictly confidential and will never be disclosed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Non-Disclosable Information<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Internal documentation or status<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Internal decision-making process<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Details of meetings (dates, venues)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Names of officials handling cases<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Any information deemed confidential by NTA<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Why This Restriction Exists<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Maintains transparency and fairness<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Prevents misuse of internal processes<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Protects integrity of examination system<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Alternative Authorities for Grievance Redressal<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">If required, candidates can also approach higher authorities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Relevant Authorities<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Ministry of Health &amp; Family Welfare (MoHFW)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Administrative head of concerned organization<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Key Insight<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">While escalation is possible, it should be used only when:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Issue is genuine<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Not resolved through NTA<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Common Mistakes Students Make<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Sending incomplete emails without details<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Asking vague questions<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Spamming multiple emails<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Relying on third-party communication<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Expecting instant replies<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Smart Strategy for Effective Communication<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Write clear, specific, and concise queries<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Include all required details in first email<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Avoid sending repeated emails<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Use official website for general information<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" Common Services Centres (CSCs) \\/ Facilitation Centres \\u2013 NEET (UG)\",\"name\":\"_common_services_centres_cscs__facilitation_centres__neet_ug\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">(Support System for Application Form Filling, Rural Accessibility &amp; Smart Usage Guide)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Filling the NEET application form is a critical and error-sensitive process, where even a small mistake (wrong category, incorrect details, improper document upload) can lead to rejection or future disqualification. To ensure that every student&mdash;especially those from rural or less digitally familiar backgrounds&mdash;gets equal opportunity, the government provides support through Common Services Centres (CSCs).<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">This section explains the complete role, functioning, benefits, and smart usage of CSCs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">What Are Common Services Centres (CSCs)?<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Common Services Centres are officially authorized service points established under the<br>Ministry of Electronics and Information Technology, Government of India.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Key Purpose<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Provide digital assistance to citizens<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Help in online services like:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Form filling<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Document upload<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Online payments<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Under Which Scheme Do CSCs Operate?<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">CSCs are part of the National e-Governance Plan (NeGP), a major initiative to:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Digitize public services<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Improve accessibility across India<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Bridge the urban-rural digital gap<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Who Manages CSCs?<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Each CSC is operated by a:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Village Level Entrepreneur (VLE)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Role of VLE<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Assists candidates in:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Filling NEET application form<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Uploading documents<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Completing payment process<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Why This System Is Important<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Many students face challenges like:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Lack of computer access<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Poor internet connectivity<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Limited technical knowledge<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">CSCs ensure that such candidates are not disadvantaged in the application process.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Availability of CSCs Across India<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Scale of Network<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">More than 1.5 lakh CSCs are available across India<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Coverage<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Rural areas<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Urban areas<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Accessibility Advantage<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Easily available at village panchayat level<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Reduces dependency on:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Cyber cafes<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Private agents<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Services Provided by CSCs for NEET<\\/h3>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">1. Online Application Form Submission<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Filling complete NEET application form<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Entering correct personal and academic details<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">2. Document Upload Assistance<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Uploading:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Photograph<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Signature<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Required certificates<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Hidden Benefit<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Reduces chances of:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Incorrect format upload<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Rejection due to technical errors<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">3. Fee Payment Support<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Payment through:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">E-wallet<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Digital modes<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Why CSC Is Safer Than Random Cyber Cafes<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Government-authorized<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Standardized process<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Reduced risk of:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Fraud<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Data misuse<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">How to Find a CSC Near You<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Candidates can locate CSCs through:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Official website:<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.csc.gov.in\\\"> www.csc.gov.in<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Practical Tip<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Choose a nearby CSC with good reputation<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Visit during non-rush hours for better attention<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Common Mistakes Students Make While Using CSCs<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Not verifying details entered by operator<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Blindly trusting without cross-checking<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Not keeping a copy of submitted form<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Ignoring confirmation page<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Smart Strategy While Using CSC Services<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Sit with the operator while form is being filled<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Verify:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Name spelling<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Category<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Uploaded documents<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Check preview before final submission<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Download and save confirmation page<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Important Responsibility Reminder<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Even if you use a CSC:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">You are responsible for all details submitted<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Critical Insight<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Mistakes made at CSC:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Will be treated as your own mistakes<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Cannot be easily corrected later<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" Weeding Out Rules \\u2013 NEET (UG) \",\"name\":\"_weeding_out_rules__neet_ug_\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">(Record Retention Policy, Time Limits &amp; Critical Impact on Candidates)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The &ldquo;Weeding Out Rules&rdquo; define how long NEET-related records are officially preserved and when they are permanently deleted. Although this may seem like a minor administrative detail, it has serious implications for candidates, especially during counselling, document verification, or dispute resolution.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">This section explains the rule in depth along with its practical impact and smart precautions you must take.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Official Record Retention Policy<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">As per the guidelines of the<br>National Testing Agency:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">All records\\/documents related to NEET (UG) 2026 are preserved only for a limited period<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Time Limit<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Records are maintained for 90 days from the date of result declaration<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">What Happens After 90 Days?<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">After the completion of this period:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">All records are weeded out (permanently deleted\\/destroyed)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No official data remains available with NTA<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Meaning of &ldquo;Weeding Out&rdquo;<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">In Simple Terms<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Complete removal of:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">OMR records<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Application data<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Internal documents<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Important Insight<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">This is not temporary removal&mdash;it is permanent deletion, meaning:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Data cannot be retrieved later<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No reconstruction is possible<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">No Correspondence After the Time Limit<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Strict Rule<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">After 90 days:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No queries will be entertained<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No requests for:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Data access<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Clarifications<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Corrections<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">What This Means for Candidates<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Even genuine issues raised after this period:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Will not be considered<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Cannot be resolved<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Why This Rule Exists<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The policy ensures:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Efficient data management<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Reduced storage burden<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Closure of examination cycle<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Administrative Logic<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Since NEET involves:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Lakhs of candidates<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Massive data volume<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">It is not feasible to store records indefinitely.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Critical Risks Candidates Must Understand<\\/h3>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">1. Loss of Important Data Access<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">If you fail to:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Download documents on time<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">You may permanently lose:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Scorecard<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">OMR copy<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Other related records<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">2. Inability to Raise Issues<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">After 90 days:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No correction or complaint can be filed<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Even valid concerns become invalid<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">3. Counselling or Admission Complications<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">If any issue arises later:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">You cannot rely on NTA records for proof<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Essential Documents You Must Save Before Deadline<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Candidates should securely download and store:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">NEET Scorecard<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Admit Card<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Confirmation Page<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">OMR Sheet copy (if available)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Answer Key (final)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Smart Storage Strategy<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Keep multiple copies:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Digital (PDF on phone\\/laptop\\/cloud)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Printed copies<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Store in:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Email<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Google Drive or other backup<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Common Mistakes Students Make<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Not downloading scorecard immediately<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Ignoring OMR\\/answer key data<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Assuming data will always be available online<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Delaying issue reporting<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Pro-Level Insight (What Most Candidates Miss)<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Many students think:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">&ldquo;I can download it later anytime&rdquo;<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Reality<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Once 90 days pass:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Even official authorities cannot help<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Your data is permanently gone<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" Legal Jurisdiction \\u2013 NEET (UG)\",\"name\":\"_legal_jurisdiction__neet_ug\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">(Court Authority, Time Limits for Legal Action &amp; Official Legal Communication Process)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The legal jurisdiction clause defines where, when, and how any legal dispute related to NEET can be raised. This is a crucial section because it sets strict boundaries on court authority, time validity of cases, and official legal communication channels. Ignoring these rules can result in your case being rejected without consideration, regardless of its merit.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Exclusive Court Jurisdiction &ndash; Why Only Delhi?<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">All disputes related to NEET (UG) 2026 fall under the jurisdiction of courts located in:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Delhi<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">What This Means Practically<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Any legal case (petition, appeal, dispute) must be filed only in Delhi courts<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Courts in other states do not have authority over NEET-related disputes<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Why This Rule Exists<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">NEET is a centralized national-level examination<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Conducted by a central authority:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">National Testing Agency<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Centralizing jurisdiction ensures:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Uniform legal decisions<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Faster resolution<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Avoidance of conflicting judgments across states<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Time Limit for Raising Legal Issues<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Strict Deadline<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Legal issues must be raised within 30 days from the date of result declaration<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Critical Implication<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">After 30 days:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No legal case will be entertained<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Even valid claims may be rejected due to delay<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Hidden Risk<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Many candidates:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Delay decision-making<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Wait for counselling outcomes<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">By the time they act:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">The legal window has already closed<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Types of Disputes Covered Under Jurisdiction<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The rule applies to all issues related to:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Conduct of examination<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Result declaration<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Evaluation concerns<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Admission-related disputes linked to NEET<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Official Method to Serve Legal Notice<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Mandatory Communication Channel<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">All legal documents must be sent to NTA via:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Email: legal@nta.ac.in<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Documents That Must Be Sent<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Legal Notice<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Writ Petition<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Appeal<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Reply or counter-reply<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Important Rule<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Legal communication must follow official channel only<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Informal or incorrect submission may:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Delay processing<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Weaken your legal case<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Role of Government Authorities in Legal Cases<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Although NEET is conducted by NTA, legal representation involves:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Ministry of Health and Family Welfare<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Important Clarification<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">The Ministry of Health &amp; Family Welfare (MoHFW)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Represents the Union of India in NEET-related cases<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Not handled by:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Ministry of Education<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Why This Matters<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">NEET is a medical entrance exam<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Therefore, governed by the health sector authority<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Common Mistakes Students Make<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Filing cases in local\\/state courts<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Missing the 30-day deadline<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Sending legal notices through incorrect channels<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Delaying action due to confusion or lack of awareness<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Smart Legal Strategy for Candidates<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Act immediately if you identify a genuine issue<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Consult legal advice early (if needed)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Ensure filing is done within 30 days<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Use only official communication channels<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" Safe Custody of OMR Sheet & Scorecard in DigiLocker \\u2013 NEET (UG)\",\"name\":\"_safe_custody_of_omr_sheet__scorecard_in_digilocker__neet_ug\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">In NEET (UG) 2026, the government has introduced a secure digital document storage system through DigiLocker to ensure that candidates can safely access their important exam documents anytime, without the risk of loss or damage. This system is a major step towards paperless governance, transparency, and long-term accessibility of academic records.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">This section explains the complete working, benefits, and strategic importance of DigiLocker in detail.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">What is DigiLocker and Who Manages It?<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">DigiLocker is a government-backed digital platform managed by the<br>Ministry of Electronics and Information Technology.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Core Purpose of DigiLocker<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Provide secure digital storage for documents<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Enable easy access and verification<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Reduce dependency on physical documents<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">How NEET Documents Are Stored in DigiLocker<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Consent-Based System<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Candidates must give consent during NEET application form submission<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Only then will their data be stored in DigiLocker<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Documents Stored in DigiLocker<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Once consent is given, the following documents are securely stored:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Admit Card<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Confirmation Page<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Scanned OMR Answer Sheet<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">NEET Scorecard<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Important Insight<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">These documents are:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Officially issued<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Directly uploaded by authorities<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Digitally verified<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Aadhaar-Linked Secure Storage System<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">DigiLocker provides:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Personal cloud storage linked to<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Aadhaar (UIDAI)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">What This Means<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Only you can access your documents<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">High-level security ensures:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No unauthorized access<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Data protection<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Role of Registered Issuers<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Organizations registered with DigiLocker can:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Directly upload official documents into your account<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Examples<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Government departments<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Educational boards<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Advantage<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Documents are:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Authentic<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Tamper-proof<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Officially verified<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">eSign Facility &ndash; Digital Self-Attestation<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">DigiLocker provides an eSign feature, which allows:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Digital signing of documents<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Why This Matters<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Eliminates need for:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Physical signatures<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Manual attestation<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Key Benefits of DigiLocker for NEET Candidates<\\/h3>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">1. Anytime, Anywhere Access<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Access documents from:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Mobile<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Laptop<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Any location<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Impact<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No dependency on physical copies<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Useful during counselling and admission<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">2. Backup for Forgotten Credentials<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">If you forget:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Application number<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Registered mobile number<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">You can retrieve them from DigiLocker<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">3. Verified &amp; Authentic Documents<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Documents are directly issued by authorities<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Accepted as valid proof in most cases<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">4. Reduced Risk of Document Loss<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">No risk of:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Losing papers<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Damage due to physical handling<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">5. Faster Admission &amp; Verification Process<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Easy sharing with:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Colleges<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Counselling authorities<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Strategic Importance for Candidates<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">DigiLocker becomes extremely useful during:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Counselling rounds<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Document verification<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">College admission process<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Hidden Advantage<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Even after:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Website data removal (after 90 days rule)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Your documents remain safely stored in DigiLocker<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Common Mistakes Students Make<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Not giving consent during application<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Not activating DigiLocker account<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Relying only on website downloads<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Ignoring digital backup<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Smart Usage Strategy<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Always give consent during application<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Activate DigiLocker account early<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Verify uploaded documents<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Keep both:<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Digital copies (DigiLocker)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Offline backups<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}]', 14, 1, '2026-04-14 01:44:26', '2026-04-15 00:06:40');
INSERT INTO `dynamic_exam_sections` (`id`, `dynamic_exam_id`, `heading`, `content`, `order`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(344, 11, 'ABOUT EXAM', '[{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\"INTRODUCTION \",\"name\":\"introduction_\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The CAT (Common Admission Test) is one of India&rsquo;s most competitive national-level management entrance examinations conducted annually by the Indian Institutes of Management (IIMs) for admission to MBA, PGP, and other postgraduate management programs. CAT scores are accepted not only by all IIMs but also by many leading business schools across the country, making it one of the most important exams for students seeking careers in management, finance, consulting, marketing, analytics, and entrepreneurship.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The examination is conducted in computer-based mode at designated test centres across India. It is generally held once every year, usually in November. CAT evaluates a candidate&rsquo;s aptitude, problem-solving ability, communication skills, logical thinking, and decision-making potential&mdash;qualities considered essential for success in management education.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The CAT paper is commonly divided into three major sections: Verbal Ability and Reading Comprehension (VARC), Data Interpretation and Logical Reasoning (DILR), and Quantitative Aptitude (QA). These sections test language comprehension, analytical reasoning, data handling skills, mathematical ability, speed, and accuracy. Since the exam is highly competitive, candidates are ranked by percentile rather than only raw marks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">To apply for CAT, candidates must hold a bachelor&rsquo;s degree from a recognized institution with the required minimum marks. Final-year graduation students are also eligible to apply if they are completing their degree requirements within the prescribed timeline.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">A strong CAT score can open doors to prestigious institutions such as Indian Institute of Management Ahmedabad, Indian Institute of Management Bangalore, Indian Institute of Management Calcutta, and many other top management institutes. However, admission decisions usually consider multiple factors beyond CAT percentile, including academic record, work experience, written ability tests, group discussions, and personal interviews.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">CAT is widely regarded as a gateway to high-quality management education in India. Proper preparation, regular mock tests, time management, and strategic section-wise practice are essential for achieving a competitive percentile.<\\/p>\"}]', 0, 1, '2026-04-16 03:20:48', '2026-04-20 01:04:42');
INSERT INTO `dynamic_exam_sections` (`id`, `dynamic_exam_id`, `heading`, `content`, `order`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(626, 11, ' ELIGIBILITY ', '[{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" ELIGIBILITY \",\"name\":\"_eligibility_\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p data-start=\\\"104\\\" data-end=\\\"520\\\">The <strong data-start=\\\"108\\\" data-end=\\\"141\\\">CAT exam eligibility criteria<\\/strong> are one of the most important factors every MBA aspirant must understand before applying for the Common Admission Test. CAT is the gateway to admission into the Indian Institutes of Management (IIMs) and many other leading business schools across India. However, before focusing on percentile, candidates must first ensure that they meet the official qualification requirements.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"522\\\" data-end=\\\"844\\\">Many students assume that anyone can apply for CAT, but the exam has specific academic standards related to graduation degree, minimum marks, final-year status, professional qualifications, and document verification. Understanding these rules early helps candidates avoid rejection during registration or admission stages.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1pk12kf\\\" data-start=\\\"1314\\\" data-end=\\\"1369\\\">Basic Educational Qualification Required for CAT Exam<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1371\\\" data-end=\\\"1496\\\">To apply for CAT, a candidate must hold a <strong data-start=\\\"1413\\\" data-end=\\\"1465\\\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree or an equivalent qualification<\\/strong> from a recognized institution.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1498\\\" data-end=\\\"1530\\\">The degree should be awarded by:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1532\\\" data-end=\\\"1811\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"wolowd\\\" data-start=\\\"1532\\\" data-end=\\\"1584\\\">A university established by an Act of Parliament<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"369xkh\\\" data-start=\\\"1585\\\" data-end=\\\"1636\\\">A university established by a State Legislature<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1a0chon\\\" data-start=\\\"1637\\\" data-end=\\\"1708\\\">A deemed university recognized under Section 3 of the UGC Act, 1956<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"wf07bf\\\" data-start=\\\"1709\\\" data-end=\\\"1811\\\">An institution whose qualification is recognized by the Ministry of Education, Government of India<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1813\\\" data-end=\\\"1943\\\">This means the candidate must have a valid recognized higher education qualification suitable for postgraduate management studies.<\\/p>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"1945\\\" data-end=\\\"1948\\\">\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"ji489s\\\" data-start=\\\"1950\\\" data-end=\\\"1988\\\">Minimum Marks Required in Graduation<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1990\\\" data-end=\\\"2069\\\">The CAT eligibility criteria include category-wise minimum marks in graduation.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"mgkxt2\\\" data-start=\\\"2071\\\" data-end=\\\"2112\\\">For General, EWS and NC-OBC Candidates<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2114\\\" data-end=\\\"2135\\\">Candidates must have:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2137\\\" data-end=\\\"2236\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"9j01e2\\\" data-start=\\\"2137\\\" data-end=\\\"2192\\\">Minimum <strong data-start=\\\"2147\\\" data-end=\\\"2160\\\">50% marks<\\/strong> in Bachelor&rsquo;s degree<br data-start=\\\"2181\\\" data-end=\\\"2184\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2184\\\" data-end=\\\"2190\\\">or<\\/strong><\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1laniy5\\\" data-start=\\\"2193\\\" data-end=\\\"2236\\\">Equivalent CGPA as per university norms<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"xsjh57\\\" data-start=\\\"2238\\\" data-end=\\\"2270\\\">For SC, ST and PwD Candidates<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2272\\\" data-end=\\\"2293\\\">Candidates must have:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2295\\\" data-end=\\\"2370\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"c717zi\\\" data-start=\\\"2295\\\" data-end=\\\"2350\\\">Minimum <strong data-start=\\\"2305\\\" data-end=\\\"2318\\\">45% marks<\\/strong> in Bachelor&rsquo;s degree<br data-start=\\\"2339\\\" data-end=\\\"2342\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2342\\\" data-end=\\\"2348\\\">or<\\/strong><\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1fhmehd\\\" data-start=\\\"2351\\\" data-end=\\\"2370\\\">Equivalent CGPA<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2372\\\" data-end=\\\"2452\\\">This relaxation supports equal opportunity while maintaining academic standards.<\\/p>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"2454\\\" data-end=\\\"2457\\\">\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1u8kes5\\\" data-start=\\\"2459\\\" data-end=\\\"2499\\\">Can Final Year Students Apply for CAT?<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2501\\\" data-end=\\\"2605\\\">Yes, <strong data-start=\\\"2506\\\" data-end=\\\"2604\\\">students appearing for the final year of their Bachelor&rsquo;s degree are eligible to apply for CAT<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2607\\\" data-end=\\\"2804\\\">This is a major advantage because candidates do not need to wait until graduation results are declared. Students in the last year of college can appear for CAT and secure a strong percentile early.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2806\\\" data-end=\\\"2849\\\">Eligible final-year applicants may include:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2851\\\" data-end=\\\"3047\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1suciqm\\\" data-start=\\\"2851\\\" data-end=\\\"2915\\\">Candidates currently appearing for final semester\\/year exams<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"15dx4u8\\\" data-start=\\\"2916\\\" data-end=\\\"2973\\\">Students who completed exams and are awaiting results<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1ignsfc\\\" data-start=\\\"2974\\\" data-end=\\\"3047\\\">Students whose final result is pending at the time of CAT application<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"3049\\\" data-end=\\\"3052\\\">\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"6ox8ky\\\" data-start=\\\"3054\\\" data-end=\\\"3100\\\">Important Condition for Final Year Students<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3102\\\" data-end=\\\"3234\\\">If such candidates are selected for admission, they may be offered <strong data-start=\\\"3169\\\" data-end=\\\"3194\\\">provisional admission<\\/strong>, subject to proof of degree completion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3236\\\" data-end=\\\"3297\\\">They are generally required to submit a certificate from the:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"3299\\\" data-end=\\\"3376\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1xmtyii\\\" data-start=\\\"3299\\\" data-end=\\\"3312\\\">Principal<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"sdr0nr\\\" data-start=\\\"3313\\\" data-end=\\\"3326\\\">Registrar<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1ytrkfk\\\" data-start=\\\"3327\\\" data-end=\\\"3376\\\">Competent authority of university\\/institution<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3378\\\" data-end=\\\"3517\\\">The certificate should confirm that the candidate has completed all requirements for obtaining the Bachelor&rsquo;s degree by the specified date.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3519\\\" data-end=\\\"3620\\\">Failure to submit required proof within the institute deadline may lead to cancellation of admission.<\\/p>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"3622\\\" data-end=\\\"3625\\\">\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1yom2my\\\" data-start=\\\"3627\\\" data-end=\\\"3676\\\">Who Else Can Apply? Professional Degree Holders<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3678\\\" data-end=\\\"3810\\\">Candidates with certain recognized professional qualifications can also apply for CAT if they meet the required percentage criteria.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3812\\\" data-end=\\\"3861\\\">Eligible professional qualifications may include:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"3863\\\" data-end=\\\"4024\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1xc3ccl\\\" data-start=\\\"3863\\\" data-end=\\\"3893\\\">Chartered Accountancy (CA)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"9gaqaq\\\" data-start=\\\"3894\\\" data-end=\\\"3920\\\">Company Secretary (CS)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1ltysqa\\\" data-start=\\\"3921\\\" data-end=\\\"3967\\\">Cost and Management Accountancy (CMA\\/ICWA)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"z6tmqg\\\" data-start=\\\"3968\\\" data-end=\\\"4024\\\">Fellow of the Institute of Actuaries of India (FIAI)<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4026\\\" data-end=\\\"4102\\\">These qualifications are treated as equivalent pathways for CAT eligibility.<\\/p>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"4104\\\" data-end=\\\"4107\\\">\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1xnjile\\\" data-start=\\\"4109\\\" data-end=\\\"4152\\\">CAT Eligibility Conditions in Simple Form<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4154\\\" data-end=\\\"4233\\\">A candidate is generally eligible if they satisfy <strong data-start=\\\"4204\\\" data-end=\\\"4215\\\">any one<\\/strong> of the following:<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1y8ai3a\\\" data-start=\\\"4235\\\" data-end=\\\"4269\\\">1. Completed Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4271\\\" data-end=\\\"4334\\\">Candidate has completed graduation with required minimum marks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"oa51t4\\\" data-start=\\\"4336\\\" data-end=\\\"4383\\\">2. Completed Recognized Professional Degree<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4385\\\" data-end=\\\"4457\\\">Candidate holds eligible professional qualification with required marks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"9bcmmk\\\" data-start=\\\"4459\\\" data-end=\\\"4501\\\">3. Appearing for Final Year Graduation<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4503\\\" data-end=\\\"4606\\\">Candidate is in final year and expected to complete degree requirements within the prescribed timeline.<\\/p>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"4608\\\" data-end=\\\"4611\\\">\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"181qwq4\\\" data-start=\\\"4613\\\" data-end=\\\"4650\\\">How CGPA Is Converted to Percentage<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4652\\\" data-end=\\\"4769\\\">Many universities use CGPA instead of percentage marks. CAT eligibility accepts CGPA, but conversion rules may apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h4 data-section-id=\\\"h0l1ol\\\" data-start=\\\"4771\\\" data-end=\\\"4791\\\">Standard Practice<\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"4793\\\" data-end=\\\"5013\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"10ruaod\\\" data-start=\\\"4793\\\" data-end=\\\"4881\\\">If university provides an official CGPA-to-percentage formula, that formula is used.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1vubbrl\\\" data-start=\\\"4882\\\" data-end=\\\"5013\\\">If no conversion system exists, percentage may be calculated using recognized equivalence methods based on official guidelines.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5015\\\" data-end=\\\"5089\\\">This ensures fair comparison between students from different universities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"5091\\\" data-end=\\\"5094\\\">\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1lq1zy4\\\" data-start=\\\"5096\\\" data-end=\\\"5128\\\">Important Verification by IIMs<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5130\\\" data-end=\\\"5261\\\">Meeting minimum eligibility allows a candidate to apply, but eligibility may be checked again during different stages of admission.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5263\\\" data-end=\\\"5294\\\">Verification may happen during:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"5296\\\" data-end=\\\"5426\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1im1i7c\\\" data-start=\\\"5296\\\" data-end=\\\"5318\\\">Application review<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"q1u3g\\\" data-start=\\\"5319\\\" data-end=\\\"5341\\\">Shortlisting stage<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"spts5h\\\" data-start=\\\"5342\\\" data-end=\\\"5361\\\">Interview stage<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1btr5s6\\\" data-start=\\\"5362\\\" data-end=\\\"5389\\\">Final admission process<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"kq8otl\\\" data-start=\\\"5390\\\" data-end=\\\"5426\\\">Document verification at joining<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5428\\\" data-end=\\\"5517\\\">If any false claim or mismatch is found later, candidature or admission may be cancelled.<\\/p>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"5519\\\" data-end=\\\"5522\\\">\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"13vw6jq\\\" data-start=\\\"5524\\\" data-end=\\\"5574\\\">Minimum Eligibility Does Not Guarantee Admission<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5576\\\" data-end=\\\"5621\\\">This is one of the most misunderstood points.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5623\\\" data-end=\\\"5762\\\">Just because a candidate meets CAT eligibility rules does <strong data-start=\\\"5681\\\" data-end=\\\"5688\\\">not<\\/strong> mean they will automatically receive an IIM shortlist or final admission.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5764\\\" data-end=\\\"5820\\\">Admission depends on several additional factors such as:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"5822\\\" data-end=\\\"6023\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"vtjvk5\\\" data-start=\\\"5822\\\" data-end=\\\"5840\\\">CAT percentile<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"12hfj6f\\\" data-start=\\\"5841\\\" data-end=\\\"5861\\\">Sectional scores<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1vfm20l\\\" data-start=\\\"5862\\\" data-end=\\\"5886\\\">Academic performance<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"16ckp93\\\" data-start=\\\"5887\\\" data-end=\\\"5906\\\">Work experience<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"cxxc1t\\\" data-start=\\\"5907\\\" data-end=\\\"5934\\\">Personal Interview (PI)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"s89tkk\\\" data-start=\\\"5935\\\" data-end=\\\"5983\\\">Written Ability Test (WAT), where applicable<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"11ywql8\\\" data-start=\\\"5984\\\" data-end=\\\"6023\\\">Institute-specific selection policy<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6025\\\" data-end=\\\"6063\\\">So eligibility is only the first step.<\\/p>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"6065\\\" data-end=\\\"6068\\\">\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"z8lefv\\\" data-start=\\\"6070\\\" data-end=\\\"6122\\\">Mandatory Contact Details During Selection Process<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6124\\\" data-end=\\\"6170\\\">Candidates are generally expected to maintain:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"6172\\\" data-end=\\\"6235\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"xm1e4m\\\" data-start=\\\"6172\\\" data-end=\\\"6201\\\">A valid personal email ID<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1a2vxkl\\\" data-start=\\\"6202\\\" data-end=\\\"6235\\\">A unique active mobile number<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6237\\\" data-end=\\\"6414\\\">These should remain active throughout the admission cycle because important alerts, shortlists, interview calls, and updates may be sent through official communication channels.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6416\\\" data-end=\\\"6490\\\">Using someone else&rsquo;s number or inactive email can create serious problems.<\\/p>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"6492\\\" data-end=\\\"6495\\\">\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1u17zu4\\\" data-start=\\\"6497\\\" data-end=\\\"6528\\\">Common Mistakes Students Make<\\/h2>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"189ucn\\\" data-start=\\\"6530\\\" data-end=\\\"6565\\\">Assuming Any Diploma Is Eligible<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6567\\\" data-end=\\\"6675\\\">A diploma alone may not automatically satisfy Bachelor&rsquo;s degree requirement unless recognized as equivalent.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"159aack\\\" data-start=\\\"6677\\\" data-end=\\\"6713\\\">Ignoring Final-Year Documentation<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6715\\\" data-end=\\\"6778\\\">Many students qualify in CAT but delay degree proof submission.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"s7w2gb\\\" data-start=\\\"6780\\\" data-end=\\\"6804\\\">Wrong CGPA Conversion<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6806\\\" data-end=\\\"6870\\\">Using unofficial formulas can create issues during verification.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"5p54hw\\\" data-start=\\\"6872\\\" data-end=\\\"6912\\\">Believing Eligibility Means Admission<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6914\\\" data-end=\\\"6983\\\">Eligibility only allows exam participation, not guaranteed selection.<\\/p>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"6985\\\" data-end=\\\"6988\\\">\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1gdafh9\\\" data-start=\\\"6990\\\" data-end=\\\"7024\\\">Why CAT Eligibility Rules Matter<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7026\\\" data-end=\\\"7260\\\">CAT is accepted by prestigious institutes such as <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\">Indian Institutes of Management<\\/span><\\/span> and many leading management colleges. Because competition is intense, eligibility rules help maintain fairness and academic quality in admissions.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7262\\\" data-end=\\\"7281\\\">These rules ensure:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"7283\\\" data-end=\\\"7413\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"5deggk\\\" data-start=\\\"7283\\\" data-end=\\\"7316\\\">Standard academic entry level<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"fpazqh\\\" data-start=\\\"7317\\\" data-end=\\\"7354\\\">Equal treatment across categories<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"10m8e4s\\\" data-start=\\\"7355\\\" data-end=\\\"7382\\\">Verified qualifications<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"4ejioi\\\" data-start=\\\"7383\\\" data-end=\\\"7413\\\">Reliable admission process<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" RESERVATION POLICY \",\"name\":\"_reservation_policy_\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p data-start=\\\"113\\\" data-end=\\\"494\\\">The <strong data-start=\\\"117\\\" data-end=\\\"143\\\">CAT reservation policy<\\/strong> is one of the most important topics for candidates applying to the Common Admission Test and seeking admission into the Indian Institutes of Management (IIMs) and other participating management institutes. Reservation benefits are provided according to Government of India norms to ensure inclusive access to higher education for eligible categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"496\\\" data-end=\\\"844\\\">Many candidates focus only on CAT percentile, but category selection during registration is equally critical. A wrong category claim, invalid certificate, or misunderstanding of reservation rules can create serious issues during admission. Therefore, candidates must clearly understand how <strong data-start=\\\"786\\\" data-end=\\\"837\\\">SC, ST, NC-OBC, EWS, and PwD reservation in CAT<\\/strong> works.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"846\\\" data-end=\\\"1014\\\">It is also important to know that reservation helps in admission opportunities, but it does <strong data-start=\\\"938\\\" data-end=\\\"1013\\\">not remove the need to meet eligibility criteria or selection standards<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"m4e6hx\\\" data-start=\\\"1533\\\" data-end=\\\"1575\\\">CAT Category-Wise Reservation Percentage<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1577\\\" data-end=\\\"1699\\\">The CAT exam itself is an entrance test, but admissions to IIMs follow reservation norms in seat allocation as applicable.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"ufjunt\\\" data-start=\\\"1701\\\" data-end=\\\"1743\\\">Reserved Seats for Different Categories<\\/h2>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"kxopx2\\\" data-start=\\\"1745\\\" data-end=\\\"1769\\\">Scheduled Caste (SC)<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1771\\\" data-end=\\\"1818\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1h559ew\\\" data-start=\\\"1771\\\" data-end=\\\"1818\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1773\\\" data-end=\\\"1786\\\">15% seats<\\/strong> are reserved for SC candidates.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1crqg6h\\\" data-start=\\\"1820\\\" data-end=\\\"1844\\\">Scheduled Tribe (ST)<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1846\\\" data-end=\\\"1894\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"19jcrw7\\\" data-start=\\\"1846\\\" data-end=\\\"1894\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1848\\\" data-end=\\\"1862\\\">7.5% seats<\\/strong> are reserved for ST candidates.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"om3flq\\\" data-start=\\\"1896\\\" data-end=\\\"1948\\\">Non-Creamy Layer Other Backward Classes (NC-OBC)<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1950\\\" data-end=\\\"2010\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"8z6aaa\\\" data-start=\\\"1950\\\" data-end=\\\"2010\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1952\\\" data-end=\\\"1965\\\">27% seats<\\/strong> are reserved for eligible NC-OBC candidates.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"104y9hg\\\" data-start=\\\"2012\\\" data-end=\\\"2050\\\">Economically Weaker Sections (EWS)<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2052\\\" data-end=\\\"2115\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"18gigmf\\\" data-start=\\\"2052\\\" data-end=\\\"2115\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2054\\\" data-end=\\\"2073\\\">Up to 10% seats<\\/strong> are reserved for eligible EWS candidates.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"zikv59\\\" data-start=\\\"2117\\\" data-end=\\\"2162\\\">Persons with Benchmark Disabilities (PwD)<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2164\\\" data-end=\\\"2241\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"9to33k\\\" data-start=\\\"2164\\\" data-end=\\\"2241\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2166\\\" data-end=\\\"2178\\\">5% seats<\\/strong> are reserved for eligible PwD candidates under applicable law.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2243\\\" data-end=\\\"2359\\\">These percentages are based on legal provisions applicable to participating institutions following Government norms.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"l8vu4j\\\" data-start=\\\"2366\\\" data-end=\\\"2441\\\">Important Clarification: Reservation Is for Admission, Not Free Selection<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2443\\\" data-end=\\\"2558\\\">A common misunderstanding among students is that reservation automatically guarantees admission. This is incorrect.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2560\\\" data-end=\\\"2655\\\">Reservation generally provides category-based seat opportunities, but candidates still need to:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2657\\\" data-end=\\\"2878\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"mdk07t\\\" data-start=\\\"2657\\\" data-end=\\\"2690\\\">Meet CAT eligibility criteria<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"3ez228\\\" data-start=\\\"2691\\\" data-end=\\\"2713\\\">Appear in the exam<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1cplbal\\\" data-start=\\\"2714\\\" data-end=\\\"2755\\\">Obtain competitive performance levels<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1cd3ebk\\\" data-start=\\\"2756\\\" data-end=\\\"2808\\\">Qualify institute-specific shortlisting criteria<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1io6c8t\\\" data-start=\\\"2809\\\" data-end=\\\"2878\\\">Complete interview and further admission rounds, where applicable<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2880\\\" data-end=\\\"2964\\\">So reservation supports opportunity, but merit and process requirements still apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"faowxq\\\" data-start=\\\"2971\\\" data-end=\\\"3001\\\">CAT SC Reservation Explained<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3003\\\" data-end=\\\"3166\\\">Candidates belonging to the <strong data-start=\\\"3031\\\" data-end=\\\"3055\\\">Scheduled Caste (SC)<\\/strong> category may claim reservation benefits if they possess valid category documents as per official requirements.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3168\\\" data-end=\\\"3206\\\">SC reservation can help candidates in:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"3208\\\" data-end=\\\"3341\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"109u1nd\\\" data-start=\\\"3208\\\" data-end=\\\"3239\\\">Reserved seat consideration<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"174v0hs\\\" data-start=\\\"3240\\\" data-end=\\\"3286\\\">Relaxed eligibility marks where applicable<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"fqa47h\\\" data-start=\\\"3287\\\" data-end=\\\"3341\\\">Category-wise competition pool in admission stages<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3343\\\" data-end=\\\"3397\\\">However, document verification is extremely important.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1r0vcdl\\\" data-start=\\\"3404\\\" data-end=\\\"3434\\\">CAT ST Reservation Explained<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3436\\\" data-end=\\\"3559\\\">Candidates belonging to the <strong data-start=\\\"3464\\\" data-end=\\\"3488\\\">Scheduled Tribe (ST)<\\/strong> category are eligible for reservation benefits under applicable rules.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3561\\\" data-end=\\\"3589\\\">ST candidates should ensure:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"3591\\\" data-end=\\\"3739\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"11y0v90\\\" data-start=\\\"3591\\\" data-end=\\\"3641\\\">Correct category selection during registration<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1r8kt6s\\\" data-start=\\\"3642\\\" data-end=\\\"3674\\\">Valid supporting certificate<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1unfups\\\" data-start=\\\"3675\\\" data-end=\\\"3739\\\">Consistency between application details and official records<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3741\\\" data-end=\\\"3795\\\">Any mismatch can delay or affect admission processing.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"195emi7\\\" data-start=\\\"3802\\\" data-end=\\\"3842\\\">CAT OBC Reservation (NC-OBC) Explained<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3844\\\" data-end=\\\"3893\\\">This is one of the most misunderstood categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3895\\\" data-end=\\\"4013\\\">Reservation is generally available for <strong data-start=\\\"3934\\\" data-end=\\\"3963\\\">NC-OBC (Non-Creamy Layer)<\\/strong> candidates, not all OBC candidates automatically.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4015\\\" data-end=\\\"4026\\\">That means:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"4028\\\" data-end=\\\"4213\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1x0l7g3\\\" data-start=\\\"4028\\\" data-end=\\\"4113\\\">Candidate must fall under eligible Central Government OBC list (where applicable)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"7c38qp\\\" data-start=\\\"4114\\\" data-end=\\\"4168\\\">Candidate must satisfy non-creamy layer conditions<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"13dtgjd\\\" data-start=\\\"4169\\\" data-end=\\\"4213\\\">Proper certificate validity is important<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4215\\\" data-end=\\\"4310\\\">Candidates often make mistakes by selecting OBC instead of NC-OBC without checking eligibility.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Why OBC Verification Is Important<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4355\\\" data-end=\\\"4495\\\">Wrong category declaration can create serious issues during admission. Even a good CAT score may not help if category documents are invalid.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4497\\\" data-end=\\\"4576\\\">Candidates should always verify applicable category status before registration.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1wrg8fj\\\" data-start=\\\"4583\\\" data-end=\\\"4614\\\">CAT EWS Reservation Explained<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4616\\\" data-end=\\\"4782\\\">Economically Weaker Sections (EWS) category reservation provides seat benefits to eligible candidates who satisfy prescribed economic criteria under applicable rules.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4784\\\" data-end=\\\"4801\\\">Important points:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"4803\\\" data-end=\\\"4983\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1t470gx\\\" data-start=\\\"4803\\\" data-end=\\\"4850\\\">EWS is different from OBC\\/SC\\/ST reservation<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"10bvrt7\\\" data-start=\\\"4851\\\" data-end=\\\"4913\\\">Income\\/assets conditions may apply as per government norms<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"18zylnz\\\" data-start=\\\"4914\\\" data-end=\\\"4983\\\">Valid certificate for the required assessment period is important<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4985\\\" data-end=\\\"5052\\\">Candidates should check current certificate requirements carefully.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"7k84ul\\\" data-start=\\\"5059\\\" data-end=\\\"5090\\\">CAT PwD Reservation Explained<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5092\\\" data-end=\\\"5261\\\">Under the Rights of Persons with Disabilities Act, eligible candidates may receive reservation benefits under the <strong data-start=\\\"5206\\\" data-end=\\\"5251\\\">PwD (Persons with Benchmark Disabilities)<\\/strong> category.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"g4ywcm\\\" data-start=\\\"5263\\\" data-end=\\\"5290\\\">Seat Reservation for PwD<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"5292\\\" data-end=\\\"5369\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"fpvryb\\\" data-start=\\\"5292\\\" data-end=\\\"5369\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"5294\\\" data-end=\\\"5306\\\">5% seats<\\/strong> are reserved for eligible Persons with Benchmark Disabilities.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"tzoc8w\\\" data-start=\\\"5371\\\" data-end=\\\"5405\\\">Meaning of Benchmark Disability<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5407\\\" data-end=\\\"5541\\\">Generally, benchmark disability refers to a certified disability meeting the required legal threshold as defined under applicable law.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"132t017\\\" data-start=\\\"5548\\\" data-end=\\\"5589\\\">Disability Categories Covered Under PwD<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5591\\\" data-end=\\\"5634\\\">Eligible disability categories may include:<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"kjxey0\\\" data-start=\\\"5636\\\" data-end=\\\"5659\\\">Visual Disabilities<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"5661\\\" data-end=\\\"5689\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"59k8we\\\" data-start=\\\"5661\\\" data-end=\\\"5674\\\">Blindness<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"e62rw8\\\" data-start=\\\"5675\\\" data-end=\\\"5689\\\">Low vision<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"e2smg2\\\" data-start=\\\"5691\\\" data-end=\\\"5715\\\">Hearing Disabilities<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"5717\\\" data-end=\\\"5745\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1udeapa\\\" data-start=\\\"5717\\\" data-end=\\\"5725\\\">Deaf<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"7ufbi8\\\" data-start=\\\"5726\\\" data-end=\\\"5745\\\">Hard of hearing<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"rwvty0\\\" data-start=\\\"5747\\\" data-end=\\\"5773\\\">Locomotor Disabilities<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5775\\\" data-end=\\\"5804\\\">Including conditions such as:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"5806\\\" data-end=\\\"5927\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"17a8ggj\\\" data-start=\\\"5806\\\" data-end=\\\"5824\\\">Cerebral palsy<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"uo8moc\\\" data-start=\\\"5825\\\" data-end=\\\"5847\\\">Muscular dystrophy<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"zu6eah\\\" data-start=\\\"5848\\\" data-end=\\\"5860\\\">Dwarfism<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1u4fm9o\\\" data-start=\\\"5861\\\" data-end=\\\"5895\\\">Acid attack related disability<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1m2htqr\\\" data-start=\\\"5896\\\" data-end=\\\"5927\\\">Other locomotor limitations<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"m6xt9y\\\" data-start=\\\"5929\\\" data-end=\\\"5974\\\">Neurodevelopmental \\/ Cognitive Conditions<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"5976\\\" data-end=\\\"6107\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"y5o9es\\\" data-start=\\\"5976\\\" data-end=\\\"6006\\\">Autism spectrum conditions<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"18i0ors\\\" data-start=\\\"6007\\\" data-end=\\\"6034\\\">Intellectual disability<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"kac91c\\\" data-start=\\\"6035\\\" data-end=\\\"6067\\\">Specific learning disability<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"9oyvkh\\\" data-start=\\\"6068\\\" data-end=\\\"6107\\\">Mental illness (as defined legally)<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1pd5yp8\\\" data-start=\\\"6109\\\" data-end=\\\"6134\\\">Multiple Disabilities<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6136\\\" data-end=\\\"6196\\\">Combination of eligible disabilities under applicable rules.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6198\\\" data-end=\\\"6269\\\">Candidates must rely on valid certification from competent authorities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1gu59ae\\\" data-start=\\\"6276\\\" data-end=\\\"6312\\\">Which Category List Is Considered?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6314\\\" data-end=\\\"6432\\\">For category-based reservation, the applicable status as on the <strong data-start=\\\"6378\\\" data-end=\\\"6411\\\">last date of CAT registration<\\/strong> is highly important.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6434\\\" data-end=\\\"6445\\\">This means:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"6447\\\" data-end=\\\"6621\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"17rr9oe\\\" data-start=\\\"6447\\\" data-end=\\\"6509\\\">Later changes may not be accepted for that admission cycle<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"39oo5c\\\" data-start=\\\"6510\\\" data-end=\\\"6564\\\">Updated certificates should be arranged in advance<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"gfmfkc\\\" data-start=\\\"6565\\\" data-end=\\\"6621\\\">Waiting until after registration can create problems<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6623\\\" data-end=\\\"6678\\\">This is one of the biggest mistakes many students make.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"uzw2qs\\\" data-start=\\\"6685\\\" data-end=\\\"6724\\\">No Category Change After Registration<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6726\\\" data-end=\\\"6781\\\">One of the most critical rules candidates often ignore:<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1sue112\\\" data-start=\\\"6783\\\" data-end=\\\"6856\\\">Category changes are generally not entertained after CAT registration.<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6858\\\" data-end=\\\"6904\\\">That means if a candidate incorrectly selects:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"6906\\\" data-end=\\\"7008\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"15a9to6\\\" data-start=\\\"6906\\\" data-end=\\\"6932\\\">General instead of EWS<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1cs0o3l\\\" data-start=\\\"6933\\\" data-end=\\\"6958\\\">OBC instead of NC-OBC<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"5w5loy\\\" data-start=\\\"6959\\\" data-end=\\\"6981\\\">Wrong sub-category<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"808nh5\\\" data-start=\\\"6982\\\" data-end=\\\"7008\\\">Misses PwD declaration<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7010\\\" data-end=\\\"7093\\\">it may become difficult or impossible to correct later depending on official rules.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7095\\\" data-end=\\\"7135\\\">Candidates must fill the form carefully.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1rrnvwa\\\" data-start=\\\"7142\\\" data-end=\\\"7178\\\">Minimum Eligibility Still Required<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7180\\\" data-end=\\\"7276\\\">Even reserved category candidates must satisfy minimum eligibility criteria for CAT application.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7278\\\" data-end=\\\"7324\\\">Reservation does <strong data-start=\\\"7295\\\" data-end=\\\"7302\\\">not<\\/strong> replace the need for:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"7326\\\" data-end=\\\"7468\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"e4hjhz\\\" data-start=\\\"7326\\\" data-end=\\\"7364\\\">Required educational qualification<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1a1i162\\\" data-start=\\\"7365\\\" data-end=\\\"7410\\\">Minimum marks criteria (where applicable)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1y4s77m\\\" data-start=\\\"7411\\\" data-end=\\\"7430\\\">Valid documents<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1tkj85d\\\" data-start=\\\"7431\\\" data-end=\\\"7468\\\">Participation in selection stages<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7470\\\" data-end=\\\"7530\\\">This point is extremely important for accurate expectations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"z1p49h\\\" data-start=\\\"7537\\\" data-end=\\\"7574\\\">Institute-Wise Selection May Differ<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7576\\\" data-end=\\\"7780\\\">Although reservation norms apply, each <span class=\\\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\\\"><span class=\\\"whitespace-normal\\\">Indian Institutes of Management<\\/span><\\/span> may have its own admission process, shortlist weightage, interview criteria, academic scoring model, and final merit framework.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7782\\\" data-end=\\\"7872\\\">Candidates should always review individual institute admission policies after CAT results.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"a0xw8k\\\" data-start=\\\"7879\\\" data-end=\\\"7922\\\">Common Reservation Mistakes Students Make<\\/h2>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1cdhymn\\\" data-start=\\\"7924\\\" data-end=\\\"7959\\\">Selecting Wrong Category in Form<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7961\\\" data-end=\\\"8031\\\">Many candidates choose a category without checking actual eligibility.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"cuy5jh\\\" data-start=\\\"8033\\\" data-end=\\\"8072\\\">Using Expired or Invalid Certificate<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"8074\\\" data-end=\\\"8130\\\">Old or incorrect certificates can create rejection risk.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"wx7exw\\\" data-start=\\\"8132\\\" data-end=\\\"8176\\\">Assuming Reservation Guarantees Admission<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"8178\\\" data-end=\\\"8254\\\">Seat reservation improves opportunity, but selection standards still matter.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"umevmv\\\" data-start=\\\"8256\\\" data-end=\\\"8289\\\">Ignoring Institute-Level Rules<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"8291\\\" data-end=\\\"8344\\\">Each IIM may apply separate shortlisting methodology.<\\/p>\"},{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" ADDITIONAL INFORMATION FOR SC , ST , NC-OBC, EWS and PwD\",\"name\":\"_additional_information_for_sc__st__nc-obc_ews_and_pwd\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p data-start=\\\"109\\\" data-end=\\\"407\\\">The <strong data-start=\\\"113\\\" data-end=\\\"147\\\">CAT category certificate rules<\\/strong> are extremely important for candidates applying under reserved categories such as <strong data-start=\\\"230\\\" data-end=\\\"262\\\">SC, ST, NC-OBC, EWS, and PwD<\\/strong>. Many students focus only on CAT preparation and percentile, but category-related document mistakes can create serious admission problems later.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"409\\\" data-end=\\\"711\\\">If a candidate claims reservation benefits in the CAT application, the required certificate must usually be uploaded during registration and later verified during interview\\/admission stages. Failure to submit correct documents may lead to rejection of category benefits or complications in candidature.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"713\\\" data-end=\\\"877\\\">Therefore, understanding the <strong data-start=\\\"742\\\" data-end=\\\"825\\\">CAT caste certificate, OBC certificate, EWS certificate, and PwD document rules<\\/strong> is essential for every reserved category applicant.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-start=\\\"713\\\" data-end=\\\"877\\\">Why Category Certificates Matter in CAT<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1422\\\" data-end=\\\"1622\\\">Candidates applying under reserved categories are often considered under category-specific admission norms. However, benefits are generally available only when valid supporting documents are provided.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1624\\\" data-end=\\\"1669\\\">Without proper certificates, a candidate may:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1671\\\" data-end=\\\"1860\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"112wh27\\\" data-start=\\\"1671\\\" data-end=\\\"1711\\\">Lose reserved category consideration<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"9qw6zk\\\" data-start=\\\"1712\\\" data-end=\\\"1774\\\">Be treated under general category norms (subject to rules)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"jveo4r\\\" data-start=\\\"1775\\\" data-end=\\\"1825\\\">Face registration\\/document verification issues<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"35z1sw\\\" data-start=\\\"1826\\\" data-end=\\\"1860\\\">Risk rejection at later stages<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1862\\\" data-end=\\\"1929\\\">This is why certificate accuracy is just as important as CAT score.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-start=\\\"1862\\\" data-end=\\\"1929\\\">CAT SC\\/ST Certificate Rules Explained<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1977\\\" data-end=\\\"2160\\\">Candidates claiming <strong data-start=\\\"1997\\\" data-end=\\\"2021\\\">Scheduled Caste (SC)<\\/strong> or <strong data-start=\\\"2025\\\" data-end=\\\"2049\\\">Scheduled Tribe (ST)<\\/strong> category benefits must ensure that their caste\\/tribe is included in the relevant Government of India schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2162\\\" data-end=\\\"2260\\\">This means not every similar community name automatically qualifies. Official recognition matters.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"9cif4t\\\" data-start=\\\"2262\\\" data-end=\\\"2310\\\">What SC\\/ST Certificate Should Clearly Mention<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2312\\\" data-end=\\\"2375\\\">A properly issued certificate generally needs to clearly state:<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"kfugd7\\\" data-start=\\\"2377\\\" data-end=\\\"2410\\\">1. Name of the Caste or Tribe<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2412\\\" data-end=\\\"2468\\\">The exact approved caste\\/tribe name should be mentioned.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"18pek1\\\" data-start=\\\"2470\\\" data-end=\\\"2514\\\">2. Whether Candidate Belongs to SC or ST<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2516\\\" data-end=\\\"2568\\\">The certificate should clearly specify the category.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"5o2pvw\\\" data-start=\\\"2570\\\" data-end=\\\"2635\\\">3. District and State \\/ Union Territory of Ordinary Residence<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2637\\\" data-end=\\\"2738\\\">Residence details are important because category recognition may be location-linked in some contexts.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1u72si2\\\" data-start=\\\"2740\\\" data-end=\\\"2787\\\">4. Applicable Government Schedule Reference<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2789\\\" data-end=\\\"2880\\\">The certificate should reflect recognition under the relevant Government of India schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Important Tip for SC\\/ST Candidates<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2925\\\" data-end=\\\"2951\\\">Spelling mismatch between:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2953\\\" data-end=\\\"3017\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"2b3e5s\\\" data-start=\\\"2953\\\" data-end=\\\"2975\\\">Aadhaar \\/ ID proof<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"9416ro\\\" data-start=\\\"2976\\\" data-end=\\\"2996\\\">Application form<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"10bd9ei\\\" data-start=\\\"2997\\\" data-end=\\\"3017\\\">Certificate name<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3019\\\" data-end=\\\"3107\\\">can create avoidable verification delays. Candidates should check consistency carefully.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"8pu452\\\" data-start=\\\"3114\\\" data-end=\\\"3144\\\">CAT NC-OBC Certificate Rules<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3146\\\" data-end=\\\"3292\\\">Candidates applying under <strong data-start=\\\"3172\\\" data-end=\\\"3201\\\">NC-OBC (Non-Creamy Layer)<\\/strong> category should ensure they hold the correct certificate as per applicable official norms.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3294\\\" data-end=\\\"3474\\\">Many students make the mistake of assuming any OBC certificate is enough. However, CAT admission processes often require specific eligibility under the relevant category framework.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1nel6c9\\\" data-start=\\\"3476\\\" data-end=\\\"3498\\\">Common OBC Mistakes<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"3500\\\" data-end=\\\"3672\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ln2q70\\\" data-start=\\\"3500\\\" data-end=\\\"3564\\\">Uploading state-only format when central requirement applies<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ijzelm\\\" data-start=\\\"3565\\\" data-end=\\\"3588\\\">Expired certificate<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1bmkffu\\\" data-start=\\\"3589\\\" data-end=\\\"3633\\\">Creamy layer candidates selecting NC-OBC<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"18pls8a\\\" data-start=\\\"3634\\\" data-end=\\\"3672\\\">Wrong category declaration in form<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3674\\\" data-end=\\\"3727\\\">These errors can affect category benefit eligibility.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1bhzl21\\\" data-start=\\\"3734\\\" data-end=\\\"3761\\\">CAT EWS Certificate Rules<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3763\\\" data-end=\\\"3921\\\">Candidates applying under <strong data-start=\\\"3789\\\" data-end=\\\"3827\\\">EWS (Economically Weaker Sections)<\\/strong> must upload a valid EWS certificate as per applicable rules for the relevant admission cycle.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1lbrtxw\\\" data-start=\\\"3923\\\" data-end=\\\"3948\\\">Important EWS Guidance<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3950\\\" data-end=\\\"4081\\\">Candidates should not assume old income proof or unrelated documents are enough. Only proper EWS certification generally qualifies.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4083\\\" data-end=\\\"4160\\\">Late preparation of EWS documents is one of the most common student mistakes.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"o1n0b\\\" data-start=\\\"4167\\\" data-end=\\\"4194\\\">CAT PwD Certificate Rules<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4196\\\" data-end=\\\"4318\\\">Candidates claiming <strong data-start=\\\"4216\\\" data-end=\\\"4235\\\">PwD reservation<\\/strong> should submit valid disability-related documents as required under applicable law.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4320\\\" data-end=\\\"4403\\\">The user-provided content also mentions encouragement to apply for a <strong data-start=\\\"4389\\\" data-end=\\\"4402\\\">UDID card<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"b47kty\\\" data-start=\\\"4405\\\" data-end=\\\"4421\\\">What is UDID?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4423\\\" data-end=\\\"4556\\\">UDID stands for <strong data-start=\\\"4439\\\" data-end=\\\"4463\\\">Unique Disability ID<\\/strong>, a centralized disability identification system used for eligible persons with disabilities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4558\\\" data-end=\\\"4653\\\">Having proper disability documentation can help smooth verification during admission processes.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"10lo7ke\\\" data-start=\\\"4660\\\" data-end=\\\"4708\\\">Upload of Certificates During CAT Registration<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4710\\\" data-end=\\\"4742\\\">One of the most important rules:<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"5wsqka\\\" data-start=\\\"4744\\\" data-end=\\\"4832\\\">Category certificates must generally be uploaded during CAT application registration.<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4834\\\" data-end=\\\"4935\\\">This means candidates should prepare documents <strong data-start=\\\"4881\\\" data-end=\\\"4904\\\">before form filling<\\/strong>, not after result declaration.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1u9nex9\\\" data-start=\\\"4937\\\" data-end=\\\"4956\\\">Why This Matters<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4958\\\" data-end=\\\"4991\\\">If a candidate waits until later:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"4993\\\" data-end=\\\"5134\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"tu9ath\\\" data-start=\\\"4993\\\" data-end=\\\"5027\\\">Registration may be incomplete<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"18pfupt\\\" data-start=\\\"5028\\\" data-end=\\\"5065\\\">Category claim may face rejection<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"7t4cv1\\\" data-start=\\\"5066\\\" data-end=\\\"5100\\\">Stress increases near deadline<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"epjoai\\\" data-start=\\\"5101\\\" data-end=\\\"5134\\\">Wrong uploads happen in hurry<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5136\\\" data-end=\\\"5177\\\">Early preparation is the safest strategy.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1mn6wb7\\\" data-start=\\\"5184\\\" data-end=\\\"5242\\\">Can Registration Be Rejected Due to Missing Certificate?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5244\\\" data-end=\\\"5383\\\">As per the rules shared , failure to upload the required category certificate may lead to&nbsp;<strong data-start=\\\"5349\\\" data-end=\\\"5382\\\">rejection of CAT registration<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5385\\\" data-end=\\\"5460\\\">That is why candidates should never leave document upload for the last day.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"19zznms\\\" data-start=\\\"5467\\\" data-end=\\\"5516\\\">Certificate Verification During Interview Stage<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5518\\\" data-end=\\\"5626\\\">Uploading documents during registration is not the final step. Certificates are also usually verified later.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5628\\\" data-end=\\\"5651\\\">Candidates may need to:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"5653\\\" data-end=\\\"5825\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ezxlc7\\\" data-start=\\\"5653\\\" data-end=\\\"5682\\\">Show original certificate<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"504o3d\\\" data-start=\\\"5683\\\" data-end=\\\"5710\\\">Submit photocopy\\/copies<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"h357rx\\\" data-start=\\\"5711\\\" data-end=\\\"5752\\\">Produce updated documents if required<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"57oqc\\\" data-start=\\\"5753\\\" data-end=\\\"5825\\\">Complete category verification during interviews or admission rounds<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5827\\\" data-end=\\\"5881\\\">This second-level verification is extremely important.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1k767ul\\\" data-start=\\\"5888\\\" data-end=\\\"5935\\\">Certificate Submission at Time of Joining IIM<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5937\\\" data-end=\\\"6034\\\">Even after final selection, category certificates may again be required during institute joining.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6036\\\" data-end=\\\"6074\\\">This means candidates should preserve:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"6076\\\" data-end=\\\"6140\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ep9o31\\\" data-start=\\\"6076\\\" data-end=\\\"6098\\\">Original documents<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"qiemf2\\\" data-start=\\\"6099\\\" data-end=\\\"6117\\\">Updated copies<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"8utejd\\\" data-start=\\\"6118\\\" data-end=\\\"6140\\\">Supporting records<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6142\\\" data-end=\\\"6210\\\">Many students wrongly believe registration upload is enough forever.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"tyxf7m\\\" data-start=\\\"6217\\\" data-end=\\\"6268\\\">What Happens If Documents Are Not Produced Later?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6270\\\" data-end=\\\"6431\\\">If a candidate fails to submit required category documents during post-CAT selection or admission stages, they may not be considered under the reserved category.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6433\\\" data-end=\\\"6481\\\">This can significantly affect admission chances.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"wdra9g\\\" data-start=\\\"6488\\\" data-end=\\\"6545\\\">CAT Reserved Category Candidates Must Do This Checklist<\\/h2>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1uybqwd\\\" data-start=\\\"6547\\\" data-end=\\\"6569\\\">Before Registration<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"6571\\\" data-end=\\\"6709\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1cjb949\\\" data-start=\\\"6571\\\" data-end=\\\"6610\\\">Confirm actual category eligibility<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"7p8stj\\\" data-start=\\\"6611\\\" data-end=\\\"6640\\\">Arrange valid certificate<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"aqr4c2\\\" data-start=\\\"6641\\\" data-end=\\\"6678\\\">Check name\\/date\\/details match IDs<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1w5wl9v\\\" data-start=\\\"6679\\\" data-end=\\\"6709\\\">Scan clear copy for upload<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"jvtlx1\\\" data-start=\\\"6711\\\" data-end=\\\"6730\\\">Before Interview<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"6732\\\" data-end=\\\"6827\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"xyltct\\\" data-start=\\\"6732\\\" data-end=\\\"6765\\\">Keep original documents ready<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1v96uzg\\\" data-start=\\\"6766\\\" data-end=\\\"6787\\\">Carry photocopies<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"qj0jag\\\" data-start=\\\"6788\\\" data-end=\\\"6827\\\">Verify validity dates if applicable<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"bbxnvi\\\" data-start=\\\"6829\\\" data-end=\\\"6846\\\">Before Joining<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"6848\\\" data-end=\\\"6937\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"u6fj8p\\\" data-start=\\\"6848\\\" data-end=\\\"6894\\\">Keep final required certificates available<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"314vgm\\\" data-start=\\\"6895\\\" data-end=\\\"6937\\\">Follow institute-specific instructions<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"l8a21v\\\" data-start=\\\"6944\\\" data-end=\\\"6984\\\">Common Document Mistakes Students Make<\\/h2>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1ikk2o8\\\" data-start=\\\"6986\\\" data-end=\\\"7011\\\">Uploading Blurry Scans<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7013\\\" data-end=\\\"7052\\\">Unreadable documents can create issues.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"188cr4m\\\" data-start=\\\"7054\\\" data-end=\\\"7081\\\">Wrong Category Selection<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7083\\\" data-end=\\\"7143\\\">Selecting EWS\\/OBC\\/SC\\/ST without proper certificate is risky.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1he38ti\\\" data-start=\\\"7145\\\" data-end=\\\"7161\\\">Name Mismatch<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7163\\\" data-end=\\\"7230\\\">Different spelling across marksheets and certificate causes delays.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"hb3pi7\\\" data-start=\\\"7232\\\" data-end=\\\"7264\\\">Assuming One Upload Is Enough<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"7266\\\" data-end=\\\"7305\\\">Verification may happen multiple times.<\\/p>\"}]', 9, 1, '2026-04-16 03:31:55', '2026-04-20 01:23:43');
INSERT INTO `dynamic_exam_sections` (`id`, `dynamic_exam_id`, `heading`, `content`, `order`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(628, 11, ' REGISTRATION GUIDE ', '[{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" BEFORE REGISTRATION \",\"name\":\"_before_registration_\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The CAT registration process is conducted online within the prescribed application window. Candidates must complete their form submission within the announced dates, as late applications are generally not accepted after the closing deadline. It is advisable to register early to avoid last-day technical issues, payment delays, or limited test city availability.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">For CAT 2025, candidates should carefully note the opening and closing schedule and complete all required steps such as profile creation, form filling, document upload, fee payment, and final submission.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">CAT 2025 Registration Dates<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The registration schedule is as follows:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Registration Opens: 1 August 2025 at 10:00 a.m.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Registration Closes: 13 September 2025 at 5:00 p.m.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Candidates should avoid waiting until the final day, as heavy traffic on the portal may create delays.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">How Registration is Completed<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The CAT application is generally completed through the official online portal. Candidates are required to enter personal, academic, category, and communication details carefully.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Typical steps include:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Create login ID and password<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Enter personal information<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Fill academic qualifications<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Upload required documents<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Select test city preferences<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Pay registration fee<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Submit final application form<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Each detail should be checked before final submission.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Test City Selection<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">During registration, candidates are required to choose five preferred test cities in order of preference from the available list. These choices help the authorities allot a suitable exam centre location.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Important points:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Five city preferences must be selected<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Preferences should be practical and convenient<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Final allotment depends on seat availability<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Early applicants may have better city availability chances<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">City Allotment Process<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">After the registration window closes, exam authorities allot one of the preferred cities based on availability and administrative factors.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Possible outcomes include:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">One of the five selected cities allotted<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">If preferred cities are unavailable, a nearby city may be assigned<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Final exam centre details appear on admit card<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Candidates should therefore choose nearby backup options wisely.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Admit Card Availability<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Candidates who successfully complete registration can download the admit card during the prescribed period.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">For CAT 2025:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Admit Card Download Starts: 5 November 2025<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Admit Card Available Till: 30 November 2025<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The admit card is a mandatory document for entry to the exam centre.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Important Documents to Keep Ready Before Registration<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">To complete the process smoothly, candidates should keep the following ready:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Valid email ID<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Active mobile number<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Passport-size photograph<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Signature scan<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Academic mark sheets<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Category certificate (if applicable)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Payment method for fee submission<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Preparing these in advance reduces mistakes and delays.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Common Mistakes Students Should Avoid<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Many applicants lose time or face rejection due to avoidable errors. Be careful about:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Wrong email or mobile number<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Incorrect marks entry<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Category selected without valid certificate<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Poor quality photo\\/signature upload<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Waiting until the last date<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Forgetting final submission after payment<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h4 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Smart Advice for Candidates<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Complete registration in the first few weeks instead of waiting until the deadline. Early submission gives better flexibility for city choices and reduces stress. Always save copies of the confirmation page, fee receipt, and login credentials for future use.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" REGISTRATION PROCESS \",\"name\":\"_registration_process_\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p data-start=\\\"120\\\" data-end=\\\"453\\\">The <strong data-start=\\\"124\\\" data-end=\\\"152\\\">CAT registration process<\\/strong> is one of the most important stages for MBA aspirants because a single mistake in form filling can create issues in admit card download, result access, category verification, or admission shortlisting later. Many students prepare for months but lose opportunities due to careless registration errors.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"455\\\" data-end=\\\"704\\\">That is why every candidate should understand the complete <strong data-start=\\\"514\\\" data-end=\\\"555\\\">CAT registration step-by-step process<\\/strong>, including how to create User ID, generate OTP, login, fill the application form, upload documents, choose test city, and complete final submission.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"706\\\" data-end=\\\"848\\\">This guide explains the <strong data-start=\\\"730\\\" data-end=\\\"784\\\">CAT online registration process in simple language<\\/strong>, with practical tips and common mistakes students should avoid.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1rab8x5\\\" data-start=\\\"1202\\\" data-end=\\\"1237\\\">CAT Registration Process Overview<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1239\\\" data-end=\\\"1316\\\">The CAT application process is generally completed in <strong data-start=\\\"1293\\\" data-end=\\\"1315\\\">three major stages<\\/strong>:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol data-start=\\\"1318\\\" data-end=\\\"1456\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"nmdfov\\\" data-start=\\\"1318\\\" data-end=\\\"1379\\\">New Candidate Registration (User ID &amp; Password creation)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1h9c4tx\\\" data-start=\\\"1380\\\" data-end=\\\"1414\\\">Login as Registered Candidate<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"12wfw4y\\\" data-start=\\\"1415\\\" data-end=\\\"1456\\\">Fill CAT Application Form and Submit<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1458\\\" data-end=\\\"1536\\\">Understanding these stages before starting helps save time and avoid mistakes.<\\/p>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"1538\\\" data-end=\\\"1541\\\">\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"8qh8vt\\\" data-start=\\\"1543\\\" data-end=\\\"1602\\\">Step 1: New Candidate Registration for User ID &amp; Password<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1604\\\" data-end=\\\"1674\\\">The first step in CAT registration is creating your candidate account.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1676\\\" data-end=\\\"1787\\\">On the official website, candidates usually need to click the <strong data-start=\\\"1738\\\" data-end=\\\"1779\\\">Register \\/ New Candidate Registration<\\/strong> option.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1789\\\" data-end=\\\"1875\\\">After this, the registration form opens where basic details must be entered carefully.<\\/p>\\r\\n<hr data-start=\\\"1877\\\" data-end=\\\"1880\\\">\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1bfdc48\\\" data-start=\\\"1882\\\" data-end=\\\"1926\\\">Details Required in CAT Registration Form<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1928\\\" data-end=\\\"1968\\\">Candidates are generally asked to enter:<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1u1dx2q\\\" data-start=\\\"1970\\\" data-end=\\\"1983\\\">Full Name<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1985\\\" data-end=\\\"2076\\\">Your name should match official educational records, especially Class 10 \\/ SSC certificate.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"jyywse\\\" data-start=\\\"2078\\\" data-end=\\\"2095\\\">Date of Birth<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2097\\\" data-end=\\\"2149\\\">Enter exact date of birth as per official documents.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1lbtejg\\\" data-start=\\\"2151\\\" data-end=\\\"2168\\\">Email Address<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2170\\\" data-end=\\\"2258\\\">Use a valid personal email ID because important communications are generally sent there.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"eove2t\\\" data-start=\\\"2260\\\" data-end=\\\"2277\\\">Mobile Number<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2279\\\" data-end=\\\"2361\\\">Use an active mobile number that remains available throughout the admission cycle.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"uyblqd\\\" data-start=\\\"2368\\\" data-end=\\\"2410\\\">Why Name Accuracy Is Extremely Important<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2412\\\" data-end=\\\"2466\\\">Many candidates make mistakes in spelling or initials.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2468\\\" data-end=\\\"2551\\\">Use the same format as your Class 10 certificate because later mismatch can affect:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2553\\\" data-end=\\\"2637\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1yx9zzd\\\" data-start=\\\"2553\\\" data-end=\\\"2567\\\">Admit card<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"19bce1z\\\" data-start=\\\"2568\\\" data-end=\\\"2593\\\">Identity verification<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"19chpd\\\" data-start=\\\"2594\\\" data-end=\\\"2615\\\">Document checking<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1ncsqfz\\\" data-start=\\\"2616\\\" data-end=\\\"2637\\\">Admission records<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2639\\\" data-end=\\\"2681\\\">Never use nicknames or informal spellings.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"um5590\\\" data-start=\\\"2688\\\" data-end=\\\"2726\\\">OTP Verification in CAT Registration<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2728\\\" data-end=\\\"2801\\\">After entering details, candidates may need to complete OTP verification.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"idk6b5\\\" data-start=\\\"2803\\\" data-end=\\\"2826\\\">How It Usually Works<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2828\\\" data-end=\\\"2943\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1ee981y\\\" data-start=\\\"2828\\\" data-end=\\\"2850\\\">Click Generate OTP<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1sos4wd\\\" data-start=\\\"2851\\\" data-end=\\\"2871\\\">Complete CAPTCHA<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"11r91pb\\\" data-start=\\\"2872\\\" data-end=\\\"2912\\\">OTP sent to registered mobile number<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1pj8jmz\\\" data-start=\\\"2913\\\" data-end=\\\"2926\\\">Enter OTP<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"104ysx1\\\" data-start=\\\"2927\\\" data-end=\\\"2943\\\">Validate OTP<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2945\\\" data-end=\\\"3002\\\">This confirms the mobile number used during registration.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"15ye5qd\\\" data-start=\\\"3009\\\" data-end=\\\"3027\\\">What Is CAPTCHA?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3029\\\" data-end=\\\"3117\\\">CAPTCHA is a security verification box where candidates type characters shown on screen.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3119\\\" data-end=\\\"3177\\\">Its purpose is to prevent fake or automated registrations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3179\\\" data-end=\\\"3244\\\">If characters are unclear, refresh image and try again carefully.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1r5ezuw\\\" data-start=\\\"3251\\\" data-end=\\\"3280\\\">Declaration Section Meaning<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3282\\\" data-end=\\\"3382\\\">Before final registration submission, candidates may need to agree to a declaration confirming that:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"3384\\\" data-end=\\\"3490\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"jbqwmh\\\" data-start=\\\"3384\\\" data-end=\\\"3418\\\">Information entered is correct<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"4q2vxy\\\" data-start=\\\"3419\\\" data-end=\\\"3447\\\">No false claims are made<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"zwfiag\\\" data-start=\\\"3448\\\" data-end=\\\"3490\\\">Candidate accepts rules and conditions<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3492\\\" data-end=\\\"3592\\\">This declaration should be taken seriously. Wrong information may create serious consequences later.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"6owna7\\\" data-start=\\\"3599\\\" data-end=\\\"3639\\\">Registration Confirmation After Step 1<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3641\\\" data-end=\\\"3727\\\">After successful registration, candidates generally receive login credentials such as:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"3729\\\" data-end=\\\"3807\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1qbm8ok\\\" data-start=\\\"3729\\\" data-end=\\\"3740\\\">User ID<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ozy787\\\" data-start=\\\"3741\\\" data-end=\\\"3753\\\">Password<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"69bg5n\\\" data-start=\\\"3754\\\" data-end=\\\"3776\\\">Confirmation email<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1553dvu\\\" data-start=\\\"3777\\\" data-end=\\\"3807\\\">SMS alert (where applicable)<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3809\\\" data-end=\\\"3822\\\">Always check:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"3824\\\" data-end=\\\"3871\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"tfbo62\\\" data-start=\\\"3824\\\" data-end=\\\"3833\\\">Inbox<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"18bpsmp\\\" data-start=\\\"3834\\\" data-end=\\\"3849\\\">Spam folder<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"qkcaym\\\" data-start=\\\"3850\\\" data-end=\\\"3871\\\">Promotions folder<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3873\\\" data-end=\\\"3902\\\">Then save credentials safely.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"xo82s5\\\" data-start=\\\"3909\\\" data-end=\\\"3953\\\">Important Tip: Save Login Details Securely<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"3955\\\" data-end=\\\"4011\\\">Many students lose time later by forgetting credentials.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4013\\\" data-end=\\\"4027\\\">Best practice:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"4029\\\" data-end=\\\"4125\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1epp0n6\\\" data-start=\\\"4029\\\" data-end=\\\"4057\\\">Save in password manager<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ozfug\\\" data-start=\\\"4058\\\" data-end=\\\"4075\\\">Note in diary<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"bn28nn\\\" data-start=\\\"4076\\\" data-end=\\\"4101\\\">Keep email screenshot<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1o7ccf1\\\" data-start=\\\"4102\\\" data-end=\\\"4125\\\">Store backup safely<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"w9klt2\\\" data-start=\\\"4132\\\" data-end=\\\"4186\\\">Step 2: Login to CAT Website as Registered Candidate<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4188\\\" data-end=\\\"4298\\\">After receiving User ID and Password, candidates can login through the <strong data-start=\\\"4259\\\" data-end=\\\"4289\\\">Registered Candidate Login<\\/strong> section.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4300\\\" data-end=\\\"4368\\\">This takes you to the candidate dashboard or applicant profile page.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"cqbcim\\\" data-start=\\\"4375\\\" data-end=\\\"4400\\\">Forgot Password Option<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4402\\\" data-end=\\\"4491\\\">If credentials are forgotten, CAT portals generally provide a <strong data-start=\\\"4464\\\" data-end=\\\"4483\\\">Forgot Password<\\/strong> option.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4493\\\" data-end=\\\"4547\\\">Recovery details are usually sent to registered email.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4549\\\" data-end=\\\"4598\\\">That is why using an active email ID is critical.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"wn3ds8\\\" data-start=\\\"4605\\\" data-end=\\\"4640\\\">Step 3: Fill CAT Application Form<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4642\\\" data-end=\\\"4712\\\">After login, candidates proceed to complete the full application form.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4714\\\" data-end=\\\"4789\\\">The form is usually divided into multiple sections for better organization.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1ayreh6\\\" data-start=\\\"4796\\\" data-end=\\\"4835\\\">Main Sections in CAT Application Form<\\/h2>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"174ynhc\\\" data-start=\\\"4837\\\" data-end=\\\"4859\\\">1. Personal Details<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4861\\\" data-end=\\\"4870\\\">Includes:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"4872\\\" data-end=\\\"4952\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1t2yru7\\\" data-start=\\\"4872\\\" data-end=\\\"4880\\\">Name<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1largbb\\\" data-start=\\\"4881\\\" data-end=\\\"4891\\\">Gender<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1e0942g\\\" data-start=\\\"4892\\\" data-end=\\\"4904\\\">Category<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1q6jbvi\\\" data-start=\\\"4905\\\" data-end=\\\"4916\\\">Address<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1cl7yi2\\\" data-start=\\\"4917\\\" data-end=\\\"4936\\\">Contact details<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ju40j6\\\" data-start=\\\"4937\\\" data-end=\\\"4952\\\">Nationality<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1f2cp4f\\\" data-start=\\\"4954\\\" data-end=\\\"4969\\\">2. Academics<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"4971\\\" data-end=\\\"5008\\\">Includes educational details such as:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"5010\\\" data-end=\\\"5112\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"bz57ep\\\" data-start=\\\"5010\\\" data-end=\\\"5028\\\">Class 10 marks<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"u6h8hv\\\" data-start=\\\"5029\\\" data-end=\\\"5047\\\">Class 12 marks<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"92km36\\\" data-start=\\\"5048\\\" data-end=\\\"5070\\\">Graduation details<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"9mqh57\\\" data-start=\\\"5071\\\" data-end=\\\"5090\\\">University name<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1bk004q\\\" data-start=\\\"5091\\\" data-end=\\\"5112\\\">Percentage \\/ CGPA<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"14gzmv\\\" data-start=\\\"5114\\\" data-end=\\\"5135\\\">3. Work Experience<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5137\\\" data-end=\\\"5190\\\">For employed candidates, work history may be entered.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"qtjei8\\\" data-start=\\\"5192\\\" data-end=\\\"5208\\\">4. Programmes<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5210\\\" data-end=\\\"5273\\\">Candidates may indicate programme preferences where applicable.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"hg41dz\\\" data-start=\\\"5275\\\" data-end=\\\"5302\\\">5. Test City Preferences<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5304\\\" data-end=\\\"5344\\\">Candidates choose preferred exam cities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1jq62b5\\\" data-start=\\\"5346\\\" data-end=\\\"5384\\\">6. Declaration \\/ Final Confirmation<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5386\\\" data-end=\\\"5435\\\">Review details and proceed to payment\\/submission.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"15tpud0\\\" data-start=\\\"5442\\\" data-end=\\\"5467\\\">Save &amp; Continue Feature<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5469\\\" data-end=\\\"5506\\\">Most CAT portals allow candidates to:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"5508\\\" data-end=\\\"5623\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"3pri7o\\\" data-start=\\\"5508\\\" data-end=\\\"5525\\\">Save progress<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1i87b2l\\\" data-start=\\\"5526\\\" data-end=\\\"5553\\\">Logout and return later<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"5got61\\\" data-start=\\\"5554\\\" data-end=\\\"5586\\\">Edit before final submission<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"16t9go1\\\" data-start=\\\"5587\\\" data-end=\\\"5623\\\">Continue section-wise completion<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5625\\\" data-end=\\\"5675\\\">This is helpful, but do not delay until last date.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1t4zd3s\\\" data-start=\\\"5682\\\" data-end=\\\"5706\\\">Can I Edit Form Later?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5708\\\" data-end=\\\"5777\\\">Usually, candidates can edit information <strong data-start=\\\"5749\\\" data-end=\\\"5776\\\">before final submission<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5779\\\" data-end=\\\"5867\\\">However, once final application submission is completed, many details may become locked.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5869\\\" data-end=\\\"5924\\\">That is why careful review before payment is essential.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"q4vamr\\\" data-start=\\\"5931\\\" data-end=\\\"5961\\\">Final Submission and Payment<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"5963\\\" data-end=\\\"6068\\\">After completing all required sections and payment, the CAT application is generally considered complete.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6070\\\" data-end=\\\"6093\\\">Candidates may receive:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"6095\\\" data-end=\\\"6193\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"69bg5n\\\" data-start=\\\"6095\\\" data-end=\\\"6117\\\">Confirmation email<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"rqy2pq\\\" data-start=\\\"6118\\\" data-end=\\\"6141\\\">Application summary<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"j3l0v4\\\" data-start=\\\"6142\\\" data-end=\\\"6165\\\">Printable form copy<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"dlcjf4\\\" data-start=\\\"6166\\\" data-end=\\\"6193\\\">Payment acknowledgement<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6195\\\" data-end=\\\"6226\\\">Always download and save proof.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"op43uq\\\" data-start=\\\"6233\\\" data-end=\\\"6271\\\">What Happens After Final Submission?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6273\\\" data-end=\\\"6288\\\">Once submitted:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"6290\\\" data-end=\\\"6432\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"r8fwcc\\\" data-start=\\\"6290\\\" data-end=\\\"6327\\\">Major changes may not be possible<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"ujks4p\\\" data-start=\\\"6328\\\" data-end=\\\"6384\\\">Form details may be used for future admission stages<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"wxk1pz\\\" data-start=\\\"6385\\\" data-end=\\\"6432\\\">Candidates should preserve copy for records<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6434\\\" data-end=\\\"6477\\\">So final submission should never be rushed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"lzwlhn\\\" data-start=\\\"6484\\\" data-end=\\\"6532\\\">Common CAT Registration Mistakes Students Make<\\/h2>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"19zb4f6\\\" data-start=\\\"6534\\\" data-end=\\\"6554\\\">Wrong Name Format<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6556\\\" data-end=\\\"6591\\\">Mismatch with Class 10 certificate.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"178gol1\\\" data-start=\\\"6593\\\" data-end=\\\"6612\\\">Invalid Email ID<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6614\\\" data-end=\\\"6652\\\">Then candidate misses login or alerts.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1ec71u5\\\" data-start=\\\"6654\\\" data-end=\\\"6679\\\">Waiting Till Last Date<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6681\\\" data-end=\\\"6719\\\">Server load and panic errors increase.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1vpetqm\\\" data-start=\\\"6721\\\" data-end=\\\"6745\\\">Incorrect Marks Entry<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6747\\\" data-end=\\\"6783\\\">CGPA\\/percentage confusion is common.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"10kudlo\\\" data-start=\\\"6785\\\" data-end=\\\"6808\\\">Wrong Category Claim<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6810\\\" data-end=\\\"6855\\\">May create certificate verification problems.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"19is2rw\\\" data-start=\\\"6857\\\" data-end=\\\"6882\\\">Not Saving Credentials<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6884\\\" data-end=\\\"6932\\\">Leads to stress during admit card\\/result stages.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"m1fry6\\\" data-start=\\\"6939\\\" data-end=\\\"6980\\\">Best Strategy to Fill CAT Form Smoothly<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6982\\\" data-end=\\\"7002\\\">Prepare these first:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"7004\\\" data-end=\\\"7202\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1jit5zm\\\" data-start=\\\"7004\\\" data-end=\\\"7028\\\">Class 10 certificate<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1eaztxb\\\" data-start=\\\"7029\\\" data-end=\\\"7051\\\">Class 12 marksheet<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"92km36\\\" data-start=\\\"7052\\\" data-end=\\\"7074\\\">Graduation details<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"14qiub2\\\" data-start=\\\"7075\\\" data-end=\\\"7115\\\">Category certificate (if applicable)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"t04207\\\" data-start=\\\"7116\\\" data-end=\\\"7145\\\">Photo and signature scans<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"10mizif\\\" data-start=\\\"7146\\\" data-end=\\\"7170\\\">Active mobile number<\\/li>\\