-end=\\\"1111\\\">Candidate Name and Date of Birth<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"6w408q\\\" data-start=\\\"1112\\\" data-end=\\\"1141\\\">Parent \\/ Guardian Details<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1k6n7fq\\\" data-start=\\\"1142\\\" data-end=\\\"1168\\\">Gender and Nationality<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"48pghv\\\" data-start=\\\"1169\\\" data-end=\\\"1207\\\">Category \\/ Reservation Information<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"prl9op\\\" data-start=\\\"1208\\\" data-end=\\\"1223\\\">PwD Details<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"upiyf2\\\" data-start=\\\"1224\\\" data-end=\\\"1249\\\">Communication Address<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1dzqt0k\\\" data-start=\\\"1250\\\" data-end=\\\"1271\\\">Permanent Address<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1ftlmr1\\\" data-start=\\\"1272\\\" data-end=\\\"1305\\\">Emergency Contact Information<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"d1bpm\\\" data-start=\\\"1306\\\" data-end=\\\"1336\\\">Passport Size Photo Upload<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"kyz3yn\\\" data-start=\\\"1337\\\" data-end=\\\"1357\\\">Signature Upload<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"vwnrjx\\\" data-start=\\\"1358\\\" data-end=\\\"1390\\\">Category Certificates Upload<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"1xctqao\\\" data-start=\\\"1397\\\" data-end=\\\"1443\\\">Candidate Name and Date of Birth in CAT Form<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1445\\\" data-end=\\\"1574\\\">The <strong data-start=\\\"1449\\\" data-end=\\\"1469\\\">Candidate&rsquo;s Name<\\/strong> and <strong data-start=\\\"1474\\\" data-end=\\\"1491\\\">Date of Birth<\\/strong> may be auto-filled based on the information submitted during initial registration.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"jy2w3j\\\" data-start=\\\"1576\\\" data-end=\\\"1595\\\">Important Advice<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1597\\\" data-end=\\\"1654\\\">Always check these details carefully before moving ahead.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1656\\\" data-end=\\\"1722\\\">Your name and date of birth should match official records such as:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1724\\\" data-end=\\\"1807\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1jit5zm\\\" data-start=\\\"1724\\\" data-end=\\\"1748\\\">Class 10 certificate<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"nadkm8\\\" data-start=\\\"1749\\\" data-end=\\\"1761\\\">Passport<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"97yama\\\" data-start=\\\"1762\\\" data-end=\\\"1778\\\">Aadhaar Card<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1x9mwxy\\\" data-start=\\\"1779\\\" data-end=\\\"1807\\\">Other identity documents<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1809\\\" data-end=\\\"1906\\\">If there is any mismatch, it may create problems during document verification or exam-day checks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\\\"157gkyo\\\" data-start=\\\"1913\\\" data-end=\\\"1951\\\">How to Fill Name Details in CAT Form<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"1953\\\" data-end=\\\"1985\\\">Candidates may be asked to fill:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1987\\\" data-end=\\\"2141\\\">\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"xf5emt\\\" data-start=\\\"1987\\\" data-end=\\\"2001\\\">First Name<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"8m6agx\\\" data-start=\\\"2002\\\" data-end=\\\"2033\\\">Middle Name (if applicable)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1as0kn9\\\" data-start=\\\"2034\\\" data-end=\\\"2047\\\">Last Name<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1a1fm4v\\\" data-start=\\\"2048\\\" data-end=\\\"2078\\\">Father&rsquo;s \\/ Guardian&rsquo;s Name<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"9btbsa\\\" data-start=\\\"2079\\\" data-end=\\\"2109\\\">Mother&rsquo;s \\/ Guardian&rsquo;s Name<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-section-id=\\\"1764uix\\\" data-start=\\\"2110\\\" data-end=\\\"2141\\\">Spouse&rsquo;s Name (if applicable)<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\\\"1j7o9cu\\\" data-start=\\\"2143\\\" data-end=\\\"2159\\\">Best Practice<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"2161\\\" data-end=\\\"2230\\\">Use full legal names exactly as mentioned in official records. Avoid:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-