Math<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Probability<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Permutation and combination<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Set theory basics<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Expert Preparation Advice<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Students often waste time on advanced math first. Start with arithmetic because it usually gives faster returns in MAT.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">4. Data Analysis and Sufficiency<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">This section tests interpretation of data, comparative thinking, and business-style decision making through numbers.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Important Topics:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Data Interpretation<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Tables<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Pie charts<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Bar graphs<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Line graphs<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Mixed graphs<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Caselets<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Paragraph-based data sets requiring calculations and conclusions.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Data Sufficiency<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Determine whether given statements provide enough information to solve a question.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Comparison Sets<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Revenue comparisons<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Percentage growth<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Ratio-based trends<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Profit-loss style charts<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Expert Preparation Advice<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">This section becomes easy if you improve:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">percentage conversions<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">ratio logic<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">approximation methods<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">calculation speed<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">5. Economic and Business Environment<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">This section checks awareness of the economic world, corporate trends, and current affairs. It is highly useful not only for the exam but also for MBA interviews.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Important Topics:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Economy<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Inflation<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">GDP growth<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" role=\\\"presentation\\\">Repo rate<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level=\\\"1\\\">\\r\