(1034, 19, ' TEST CENTRES', '[{\"type\":\"input\",\"inputType\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\" CENTRES \",\"name\":\"_centres_\",\"required\":true,\"options\":\"\",\"value\":\"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The Management Aptitude Test (MAT) 2026 is conducted across multiple cities in India through Paper Based Test (PBT) and Computer Based Test (CBT) modes. A wide network of test centres allows candidates from different regions to appear for the exam conveniently.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Choosing the right MAT test city is more important than many students realize. A practical centre choice can reduce travel fatigue, reporting stress, late-arrival risk, and exam-day anxiety. Candidates should always check the official city list before applying because available centres can vary by exam mode and session.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">MAT Test Centres 2026 &ndash; Official Exam Dates<\\/h2>\\r\\n<div dir=\\\"ltr\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">\\r\\n<table><colgroup><col width=\\\"98\\\"><col width=\\\"152\\\"><col width=\\\"113\\\"><\\/colgroup>\\r\\n<tbody>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Exam Mode<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Full Form<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Test Date<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">PBT<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Paper Based Test<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">31st May 2026<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">CBT<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Computer Based Test<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">14th June 2026<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<h2 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">MAT PBT Test Centres 2026 (Paper Based Test)<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Candidates choosing the offline paper mode can appear in the following officially listed cities:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" aria-level