g>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6880\\\" data-end=\\\"6947\\\">Candidates can download the scorecard through the official website.<\\/p>\\r\\n<strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;50. Does MAT score guarantee admission?<\\/strong>\\r\\n<p data-start=\\\"6998\\\" data-end=\\\"7097\\\">No, final admission depends on college cut-off, interview rounds, academics, and seat availability.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/section>\"}]', 17, 1, '2026-04-21 02:11:24', '2026-04-21 05:19:55'),
