(169, 'ORG-7MOHLUSA', 'Anna University', 'anna-university', 1, '2026-07-17 07:19:58', '2026-07-18 02:36:47', 1, NULL, 'Government of Tamil Nadu (State Government)c', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India', 'c431dfef-bbf8-4c65-a391-cc8572863cfc', 'Anna University', 'AU', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1978, 'State', 'Government', '<p>Anna University, established in <strong data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"86\">1978</strong> in <strong data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"113\">Chennai, Tamil Nadu</strong>, is one of India\'s premier public state universities, renowned for excellence in <strong data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"270\">engineering, technology, architecture, management, and applied sciences</strong>. Recognized by the UGC, the university offers quality education, advanced research opportunities, strong industry collaborations, and excellent placement support through its constituent campuses and affiliated colleges.</p>', '<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\">\r\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:f9bc2f97-d349-4fb4-8336-4f74ba058b28-3\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:f9bc2f97-d349-4fb4-8336-4f74ba058b28-3\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:f9bc2f97-d349-4fb4-8336-4f74ba058b28-3\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-8\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-15 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] 