(170, 'ORG-DFZGQWM2', 'JSS Academy of Higher Education & Research', 'jss-academy-of-higher-education-research', 1, '2026-07-18 02:37:46', '2026-07-18 02:48:12', 1, NULL, 'University Grants Commission', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mysuru, Karnataka, India', '29c193c1-7947-4511-8f6c-f5aeb42e3ad1', 'JSS Academy of Higher Education & Research', 'JSS AHER', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2008, 'Deemed', 'Private', '<p>JSS Academy of Higher Education &amp; Research (JSS AHER), established in <strong data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"423\">2008</strong> and headquartered in <strong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"466\">Mysuru, Karnataka</strong>, is a premier <strong data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"508\">Deemed-to-be University</strong> recognized by the <strong data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"534\">UGC</strong>. Renowned for excellence in <strong data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"657\">medical, dental, pharmacy, life sciences, health sciences, and allied healthcare education</strong>, the university offers industry-focused programs, advanced research facilities, modern infrastructure, and global collaborations. JSS AHER is consistently ranked among India\'s top healthcare universities for its academic excellence, innovation, and quality research.</p>', '<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\">\r\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:f9bc2f97-d349-4fb4-8336-4f74ba058b28-7\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:f9bc2f97-d349-4fb4-8336-4f74ba058b28-7\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:f9bc2f97-d349-4fb4-8336-4f74ba058b28-7\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-16\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div 