ission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<ul data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fgdmjs\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1141\"><strong data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1032\">Foundation Years (1&ndash;3):</strong> Study major areas like Developmental, Cognitive, Social, Abnormal, Personality, and Biological Psychology.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19w7vmf\" data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1261\"><strong data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1177\">Understanding Human Behavior:</strong> Learn how thoughts, emotions, and behaviors develop across different life stages.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wz2r2r\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1377\"><strong data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1294\">Mental Health &amp; Disorders:</strong> Explore psychological conditions, their causes, symptoms, and treatment methods.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xwy732\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1476\"><strong data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1404\">Theories &amp; Concepts:</strong> Understand key psychological theories and the evolution of the field.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m5dsz0\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1573\"><strong data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1499\">Research Skills:</strong> Learn basic research methods, data collection, and analysis techniques.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w82b52\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1694\"><strong data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1615\">Research Specialization (4th Year):</strong> Focus on advanced research, developing skills to design and conduct studies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oivihu\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1795\"><strong data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1714\">Dissertation:</strong> Complete an independent research project to apply learning in a practical way.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xwxdcq\" data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"165\"><strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"58\">Mental Health Counselor:</strong> Support individuals dealing with stress, anxiety, and emotional challenges through guidance and therapy.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juf3uy\" data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"281\"><strong data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"199\">Human Resources Specialist:</strong> Manage hiring, employee relations, and workplace policies within organizations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pg4wkb\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"398\"><strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"315\">Social Services Specialist:</strong> Work with communities to improve living conditions and provide support services.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"87bvcl\" data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"512\"><strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"426\">Marketing Researcher:</strong> Study consumer behavior and market trends to help businesses make better decisions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sacffn\" data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"628\"><strong data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"542\">Educational Consultant:</strong> Guide students and institutions on academic planning, curriculum, and career paths.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5mqujs\" data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"744\"><strong data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"661\">Rehabilitation Specialist:</strong> Help individuals recover and adapt after physical, mental, or social challenges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kh1gwn\" data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"851\"><strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"770\">Research Assistant:</strong> Assist in data collection, analysis, and project support for research studies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tvoae3\" data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"946\"><strong data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"870\">Academician:</strong> Teach at colleges or universities and contribute to academic development.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8x08hu\" data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"1050\"><strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"970\">Research Analyst:</strong> Analyze data and trends to provide insights for business or policy decisions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12d3lgw\" data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1152\"><strong data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1087\">Program Evaluation Specialist:</strong> Assess the effectiveness of programs and suggest improvements.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hzhv19\" data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1248\"><strong data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1179\">Academic Researcher:</strong> Conduct in-depth studies in a specific field and publish findings.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n1wxd0\" data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1346\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1273\">Survey Researcher:</strong> Design and conduct surveys to gather data and understand public opinion.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"63\",\"126\",\"127\",\"128\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 326477.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(42, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '99453965-8696-453e-9a76-1e5899055426', 104, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"18\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-23 05:43:35', '2026-04-07 00:13:15', '<p>Admission is conducted through a <strong data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"90\">merit-based selection process</strong>, where candidates are shortlisted based on their performance in the qualifying degree. A higher score improves the chances of securing admission.</p>', 1, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0d3e9ba6-f060-4cf8-9571-5a77e0e2c189-13\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-24\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"70a6ea5b-ee04-4d0b-ad23-20040ca46499\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"521\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11gbmdx\" data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"367\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"321\">completed a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> in any stream from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5bzrhx\" data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"453\">Final-year students <strong data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"423\">appearing in their graduation</strong> are also eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ioqlst\" data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"521\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"495\">Admission is granted based on merit</strong>, as per university norms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>TOTAL FEE --201970 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<h4><strong>ONE TIME PAYABLE</strong></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>ADMISSION FEE</td>\r\n<td>10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>ENROLMENT FEE</td>\r\n<td>5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>CAUTION MONEY (REFUNDABLE)</td>\r\n<td>3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<h5><strong>OTHER CHARGES</strong></h5>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>YEARLY PAYMENT</td>\r\n<td>18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;HALF YEARLY PAYMENT</td>\r\n<td>9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"167\">The program is designed to provide <strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"109\">advanced understanding of political systems</strong>, combining theory, analysis, and real-world applications.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"997\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hxy7kz\" data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"320\"><strong data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"199\">Core Political Concepts:</strong> Study political theory, political behavior, and functioning of political systems at national and international levels.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"20wmpg\" data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"443\"><strong data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"355\">Public Affairs &amp; Governance:</strong> Learn about government structures, public policies, laws, and administrative systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3wnl3v\" data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"552\"><strong data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"474\">International Relations:</strong> Understand global politics, diplomacy, and relationships between countries.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"466gkr\" data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"646\"><strong data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"580\">Comparative Politics:</strong> Analyze and compare different political systems across nations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jhenma\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"738\"><strong data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"671\">Political Economy:</strong> Explore the relationship between politics and economic policies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7n8ovx\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"842\"><strong data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"776\">Public Policy &amp; Administration:</strong> Study policy-making processes and implementation in governance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lx9z5j\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"997\"><strong data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"870\">Specialization Areas:</strong> Opportunity to focus on areas like political theory, international relations, or public administration for deeper expertise.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2y6ta0\" data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"171\"><strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"54\">Teacher/Academician:</strong> Teach Political Science in schools or colleges and guide students in understanding political systems and theories.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yuw5xo\" data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"305\"><strong data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"213\">Journalist/Political Correspondent:</strong> Report on political events, elections, and policies with strong analytical understanding.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m2xetb\" data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"430\"><strong data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"340\">Politician/Political Worker:</strong> Start a career in active politics by working with leaders or joining political parties.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19szrgv\" data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"558\"><strong data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"460\">Civil Services Officer:</strong> Prepare for UPSC and other government exams where political knowledge gives a strong advantage.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ki0aa6\" data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"664\"><strong data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"586\">Political Consultant:</strong> Plan election campaigns, strategies, and communication to influence voters.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rp1wi\" data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"754\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"686\">Policy Analyst:</strong> Analyze and improve public policies, laws, and government programs.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"135\",\"136\",\"137\",\"138\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 201970.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(43, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '99453965-8696-453e-9a76-1e5899055426', 103, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"18\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-23 05:54:02', '2026-04-07 00:19:59', '<p>Admission is based on a <strong data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"74\">merit-driven selection</strong>, where candidates are shortlisted according to their performance in the qualifying graduation degree. A higher score increases the chances of admission.</p>', 1, '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4nsbpu\" data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"363\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"331\">completed or be appearing in a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rfqjx\" data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"441\">Applicants from <strong data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"416\">any academic background/stream</strong> are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0vf9i\" data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"508\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"477\">Admission is granted on merit</strong>, as per university guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-213465 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"183\">The program is designed to develop a <strong data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"132\">deep understanding of society, human behavior, and social issues</strong>, along with strong research and analytical skills.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"812\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1afpp39\" data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"288\"><strong data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"218\">Core Sociological Theories:</strong> Learn key theories to understand how society functions and evolves.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qinyhb\" data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"406\"><strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"322\">Social Structures &amp; Change:</strong> Study social institutions, cultural norms, and how societies transform over time.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aynvi9\" data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"567\"><strong data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"431\">Key Subject Areas:</strong> Covers topics like social stratification, gender studies, globalization, political sociology, education, religion, and urban society.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y1z55b\" data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"680\"><strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"591\">Research Methods:</strong> Gain skills in data collection, analysis, and interpretation to study social problems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0jpmt\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"812\"><strong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"714\">Specialization &amp; Electives:</strong> Opportunity to focus on specific areas of interest through elective subjects and research work.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vp6wcj\" data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"138\"><strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"51\">Academic Teacher:</strong> Teach sociology in schools or colleges and help students understand social concepts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vf7t7w\" data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"237\"><strong data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"159\">Social Worker:</strong> Work with communities to solve social issues and improve living conditions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ej4xso\" data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"342\"><strong data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"263\">Research &amp; Analyst:</strong> Study social trends and provide insights for policy-making or organizations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4n79m4\" data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"458\"><strong data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"365\">Government Jobs:</strong> Work in public sector roles related to administration, welfare, and policy implementation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugs4g9\" data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"576\"><strong data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"494\">Human Resources Professional:</strong> Manage recruitment, employee relations, and workplace culture in organizations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ysqcw5\" data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"674\"><strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"594\">Journalist:</strong> Report on social issues, trends, and public concerns through media platforms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vbtdaa\" data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"789\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"706\">Public Relations Officer:</strong> Manage communication and build a positive image for organizations or institutions.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"126\",\"134\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 213465.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(44, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '99453965-8696-453e-9a76-1e5899055426', 105, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"18\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-23 05:59:48', '2026-04-07 00:32:11', '<p>Admission is carried out through a <strong data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"84\">merit-based selection</strong>, where candidates are shortlisted based on their performance in the qualifying graduation degree. Better academic scores improve the chances of selection.</p>', 1, '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jd408e\" data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"425\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"343\">completed or be appearing in a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> with <strong data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"393\">Psychology or Science as a major subject</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0vf9i\" data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"492\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"461\">Admission is granted on merit</strong>, as per university guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>TOTAL FEE -201970</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 165.813px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 35.8542px;\">\r\n<td>ONE TIME PAYABLE</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 35.8542px;\">\r\n<td>ADMISSION FEE</td>\r\n<td>10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 35.8542px;\">\r\n<td>ENROLMENT FEE</td>\r\n<td>5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 58.25px;\">\r\n<td>CAUTION MONEY (REFUNDABLE)</td>\r\n<td>3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>OTHER CHARGES</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>YEARLY PAYMENT&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;HALF YEARLY PAYMENT</td>\r\n<td>9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"182\">The program is structured to help students <strong data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"126\">apply psychological concepts to real-life situations</strong>, while building strong analytical and practical skills.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"735\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ylj8l\" data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"338\"><strong data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"212\">Core Psychology Areas:</strong> Study subjects like Cognitive, Social, Developmental, and Abnormal Psychology to understand behavior in different contexts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eyetiu\" data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"467\"><strong data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"359\">Applied Focus:</strong> Learn how psychological principles are used in fields like counseling, education, and workplace settings.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"osbnj\" data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"597\"><strong data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"496\">Research &amp; Statistics:</strong> Develop skills in research design, data analysis, and interpretation to solve real-world problems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fhvm1j\" data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"735\"><strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"629\">Problem-Solving Approach:</strong> Focus on applying theory to practical issues related to mental health, behavior, and social challenges.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"39qiez\" data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"131\"><strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"56\">Clinical Psychologist:</strong> Diagnose and treat mental health disorders using therapeutic techniques.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ik4984\" data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"231\"><strong data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"162\">Counseling Psychologist:</strong> Help individuals manage stress, emotions, and personal challenges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kisphm\" data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"367\"><strong data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"256\">Neuropsychologist:</strong> Study the relationship between the brain and behavior, often working with patients with neurological issues.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y7qk04\" data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"481\"><strong data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"394\">School Psychologist:</strong> Support students&rsquo; emotional, behavioral, and learning needs in educational settings.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3bkfv\" data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"608\"><strong data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"527\">Industrial-Organizational Psychologist:</strong> Improve workplace productivity, employee behavior, and organizational culture.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13dmwzl\" data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"716\"><strong data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"637\">Forensic Psychologist:</strong> Apply psychology in legal settings, working with law enforcement and courts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8b3hxt\" data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"826\"><strong data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"745\">Research Psychologist:</strong> Conduct studies to understand behavior and develop new psychological insights.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hktkyr\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"929\"><strong data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"853\">Health Psychologist:</strong> Focus on how psychological factors affect physical health and well-being.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uo65my\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"1033\"><strong data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"950\">Social Worker:</strong> Assist individuals and communities in overcoming social and personal challenges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nfjkm\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1145\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1067\">Human Resources Specialist:</strong> Manage hiring, employee relations, and workplace well-being in organizations.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"63\"]', 4.0, NULL, '<ul data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"efp3bc\" data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"955\">The program <strong data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"849\">includes practical training or internships</strong>, allowing students to gain hands-on experience by working with clients, institutions, or organizations.</li>\r\n</ul>', '[\"1\"]', 201970.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(45, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '99453965-8696-453e-9a76-1e5899055426', 102, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"18\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-23 06:05:35', '2026-04-07 00:39:23', '<p>Admission is granted through a <strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"87\">purely merit-based selection</strong>, where candidates are evaluated based on their performance in the qualifying graduation degree. Strong academic scores improve the likelihood of selection.</p>', 1, '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4nsbpu\" data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"379\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"347\">completed or be appearing in a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dt9xwd\" data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"446\">Students from <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"421\">any stream/background</strong> are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15oviee\" data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"532\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Final admission is offered <strong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"501\">on the basis of merit</strong>, as per university guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-223820 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:p