d>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Rs. 5000/- sem for first 2 semesters are applicable for bridge course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"295\">The BCA program is designed to build both understanding and practical skills in the field of computers. Students learn important subjects like mathematics, programming, computer networks, operating systems, and database systems to develop a strong technical base.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"575\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Along with theory, the course focuses heavily on practical learning. Students work in computer labs, complete coding assignments, and take part in projects where they solve real-life problems using technology. This balance helps them gain confidence in applying what they learn.</p>', '<p data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"172\"><strong data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"63\">Mobile App Developer</strong><br data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"66\">Creates applications for smartphones and tablets, focusing on user-friendly design and smooth performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"284\"><strong data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"192\">Game Developer</strong><br data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"195\">Designs and develops video games, including graphics, gameplay, and interactive features.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"415\"><strong data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"320\">Quality Assurance (QA) Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"323\">Tests software and applications to find errors and ensure they work properly before release.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"550\"><strong data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"447\">Cloud Computing Specialist</strong><br data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"450\">Works with online storage and computing platforms to manage data and applications over the internet.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"667\"><strong data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"568\">Data Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"571\">Studies data to find useful patterns and insights that help organizations make better decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"785\"><strong data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"686\">Web Developer</strong><br data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"689\">Builds and maintains websites, ensuring they are functional, responsive, and visually appealing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"911\"><strong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"809\">IT Project Manager</strong><br data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"812\">Leads technology projects, managing teams, timelines, and resources to complete tasks successfully.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"1027\"><strong data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"939\">Cyber Security Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"942\">Protects computer systems and data from cyber threats like hacking and data breaches.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1164\"><strong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1061\">Digital Marketing Specialist</strong><br data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1064\">Promotes products or services online using strategies like social media, ads, and content marketing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1270\"><strong data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1181\">SEO Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1184\">Improves website visibility on search engines to increase traffic and online presence.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"3\",\"9\",\"10\",\"11\",\"13\",\"16\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 357879.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(57, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '75c971ef-929d-409c-92fc-0bdc08959955', 75, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"18\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 01:28:43', '2026-04-02 01:09:30', '<p>Students can get admission through entrance exams such as UPTU-SEE or UTU-SEE. In case entrance scores are not applicable, selection may also be done based on marks obtained in the qualifying degree.</p>', 1, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:17302f65-ce7e-4428-86ce-4959939aa2d7-21\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-42\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"ac0fe19f-6a0b-4e2a-82ae-69c588cb8401\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"511\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Candidates must have completed a bachelor&rsquo;s degree of at least three years in BCA, B.Sc IT, or B.Sc Computer Science from a recognized university. Final admission is based on meeting academic requirements and the selection process set by the university.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-311315 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">21100</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">11050</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"140\">The program is designed to gradually build strong coding, problem-solving, and modern technology skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"412\">Students begin by understanding how computers work and learn programming using the C language, which helps them develop logical thinking and basic coding abilities. They then move on to organizing data efficiently and writing programs that are faster and more effective.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"684\">As they progress, students learn object-oriented programming using Java, which helps in building structured and reusable software applications. They also explore how mobile apps are created for smartphones, gaining skills that are highly useful in today&rsquo;s digital world.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"935\">The course introduces how computers communicate over networks, enabling students to build applications that work across systems. It also covers emerging technologies like the Internet of Things (IoT), where devices connect and interact in real time.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1147\">Finally, students learn how to test software properly, ensuring applications are reliable, error-free, and ready for real-world use. This complete learning approach prepares them for modern IT industry demands.</p>', '<p data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"192\"><strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"82\">Software Developer / Programmer</strong><br data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"85\">Creates software and applications by writing code, solving problems, and building useful digital solutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"324\"><strong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"211\">Web Developer</strong><br data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"214\">Designs and develops websites, making them functional, user-friendly, and responsive across different devices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"462\"><strong data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"352\">Database Administrator</strong><br data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"355\">Manages and organizes data in databases, ensuring it is secure, easily accessible, and properly maintained.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"585\"><strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"488\">System Administrator</strong><br data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"491\">Maintains computer systems and networks, ensuring smooth operation, security, and performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"724\"><strong data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"604\">IT Consultant</strong><br data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"607\">Advises organizations on using technology effectively to improve their business processes and solve technical issues.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"835\"><strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"742\">Data Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"745\">Works with data to find patterns and insights that help companies make informed decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"972\"><strong data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"856\">Project Manager</strong><br data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"859\">Handles IT projects from start to finish, managing teams, timelines, and resources to ensure successful delivery.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"3\",\"9\",\"10\",\"11\",\"13\",\"16\",\"31\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 311315.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(58, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'cf55b778-40bb-4f70-ae57-b4a93fb3c3e6', 33, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 02:00:56', '2026-04-01 04:32:00', '<p>Admission is granted based on academic merit, which is prepared using the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. Candidates are shortlisted according to university norms after evaluation of their performance in Class XII.</p>', 1, '<p>Applicants must have completed Class XII from a recognised board, including NIOS, or be currently appearing for Class XII. They should have studied Physics, Mathematics, and Chemistry as core subjects or an equivalent combination approved under AICTE guidelines. This ensures that students entering the programme have a strong foundational understanding of scientific and technical concepts required for engineering studies.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1004436 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"333\">The curriculum is designed to integrate core electrical engineering principles with advanced computing technologies, creating a balanced and future-oriented learning experience. Students gain a strong foundation in electrical concepts while also exploring modern interdisciplinary areas that are shaping today&rsquo;s technology landscape.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"627\">Key focus areas include embedded systems, artificial intelligence, machine learning, Internet of Things (IoT), power electronics, and smart grid technologies. This combination helps students understand how intelligent systems are designed, powered, and deployed across different applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"897\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">By combining hardware knowledge with software-driven technologies, the programme ensures that learners develop versatile technical skills. This interdisciplinary approach prepares students to confidently work across multiple domains and meet evolving industry demands.</p>', '<p data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"685\"><strong data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"188\">Electrical &amp; Core Engineering Roles</strong><br data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"191\"><strong data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"221\">Electrical Design Engineer</strong> &ndash; Designs and develops electrical systems and components.<br data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"282\"><strong data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"308\">Power Systems Engineer</strong> &ndash; Works on generation, transmission, and distribution of electrical power.<br data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"386\"><strong data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"415\">Embedded Systems Engineer</strong> &ndash; Develops hardware&ndash;software integrated systems for smart devices.<br data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"485\"><strong data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"512\">IoT Solutions Architect</strong> &ndash; Designs connected systems and smart IoT-based applications.<br data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"577\"><strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"610\">Automation &amp; Control Engineer</strong> &ndash; Develops automated systems for industrial processes and control systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"1176\"><strong data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"725\">Computer &amp; Software-Oriented Roles</strong><br data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"728\"><strong data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"746\">AI/ML Engineer</strong> &ndash; Builds intelligent systems using artificial intelligence and machine learning.<br data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"830\"><strong data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"846\">Data Analyst</strong> &ndash; Interprets and analyses data to support decision-making.<br data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"908\"><strong data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"934\">Cybersecurity Engineer</strong> &ndash; Protects systems and networks from cyber threats.<br data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"989\"><strong data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1019\">Cloud Computing Specialist</strong> &ndash; Works on cloud-based infrastructure and services.<br data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1074\"><strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1118\">Software Developer (IoT, AI, VLSI, etc.)</strong> &ndash; Develops applications across modern technology domains.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1665\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1209\">Emerging Technology Domains</strong><br data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1212\"><strong data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1243\">Renewable Energy Consultant</strong> &ndash; Works on sustainable and green energy solutions.<br data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1297\"><strong data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1320\">Smart Grid Engineer</strong> &ndash; Develops intelligent electrical grid systems.<br data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1371\"><strong data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1392\">Robotics Engineer</strong> &ndash; Designs and builds robotic systems for automation.<br data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1448\"><strong data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1481\">Semiconductor &amp; VLSI Engineer</strong> &ndash; Works on chip design and semiconductor technologies.<br data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1539\"><strong data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1581\">Digital Twin &amp; Industry 4.0 Specialist</strong> &ndash; Develops virtual models of physical systems for advanced industrial applications.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p>The programme also includes dedicated industrial training supported by strong industry collaborations. This training focuses on skill development through guided exposure to company processes, technologies, and live systems, ensuring students gain deeper technical understanding before graduation.</p>', '<p>Students get opportunities to work with industry partners through structured internships that provide real-world exposure. These internships help learners apply classroom knowledge to practical problems, understand workplace environments, and develop professional skills essential for their careers.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 1004436.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(61, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'f7f8613d-33d5-49f0-9714-ec8cb5a01719', 30, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 02:29:15', '2026-04-01 05:54:25', '<p data-start=\"122\" data-end=\"394\">Admission to the programme is based on a merit list prepared by the university using the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. Selection is carried out as per institutional norms, ensuring a transparent and merit-driven admission process.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"704\">Candidates must have completed or be appearing for Class 12 from a recognised board, including<strong> </strong>NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling). Applicants should have studied Physics, Mathematics, and Chemistry or an equivalent subject combination as per AICTE guidelines.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"851\">Final admission is granted based on merit decided by the university, subject to document verification and fulfilment of eligibility requirements.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1060262 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"531\">The B.Tech Mechanical Engineering programme is designed to build a strong foundation in engineering principles while gradually advancing toward specialised and industry-relevant domains. Students are introduced to core engineering concepts in the initial phase, followed by in-depth mechanical engineering subjects and practical applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"829\">The curriculum covers essential areas such as thermodynamics, fluid mechanics, production technology, machine design, and related core mechanical subjects. It is structured into core courses, electives, and laboratory-based learning to ensure both conceptual understanding and practical exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"1181\">Students also gain interdisciplinary knowledge through courses in computer-aided design (CAD), robotics, automation, and other emerging engineering technologies. Elective options allow learners to explore specialised fields such as automotive engineering, aerospace engineering, and renewable energy systems based on their interests and career goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1515\">Hands-on learning is a key component of the programme, with extensive workshop training, laboratory experiments, and project-based activities. In the final year, students work on team-based capstone projects that focus on solving real engineering problems, encouraging research, innovation, and collaborative problem-solving skills.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lh7d19\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"574\"><strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"490\">Manufacturing Engineer</strong> &ndash; Focus on improving production processes, efficiency, and industrial operations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nnwnxg\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"681\"><strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"605\">Quality Control Engineer</strong> &ndash; Ensure products meet required standards through inspection and testing.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12fj1jq\" data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"791\"><strong data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"719\">Research &amp; Development Engineer</strong> &ndash; Work on innovation, product design, and new technology development.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2hq1mw\" data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"889\"><strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"816\">Production Manager</strong> &ndash; Oversee manufacturing operations, planning, and workflow management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mnpo9c\" data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"998\"><strong data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"916\">Maintenance Engineer</strong> &ndash; Ensure proper functioning and maintenance of machines and industrial systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ieq2p\" data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1103\"><strong data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1019\">Sales Engineer</strong> &ndash; Bridge technical knowledge with customer needs to promote engineering products.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9dnxph\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1195\"><strong data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1126\">Project Engineer</strong> &ndash; Manage engineering projects, timelines, and technical execution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwqivh\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1287\"><strong data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1221\">Automotive Engineer</strong> &ndash; Design and develop vehicle systems and automotive components.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kqnsnn\" data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1382\"><strong data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1312\">Aerospace Engineer</strong> &ndash; Work on aircraft and spacecraft design, systems, and performance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"38ljh\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1484\"><strong data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1404\">Design Engineer</strong> &ndash; Create and develop mechanical systems, products, and engineering solutions.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 1060262.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_p