(63, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'a5c956e1-f294-49ea-8cf6-2a762b3f8803', 32, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"12\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 02:51:05', '2026-04-02 00:32:09', '<p>The selection process is conducted through a merit-based evaluation system, where candidates are assessed on their academic performance in the qualifying examination. The university prepares a merit list and final admission is granted based on ranking, ensuring a fair and transparent selection process aligned with institutional norms.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"976\">Applicants must have completed or be <strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"614\">appearing for Class 12</strong> from a recognised board, including <strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"697\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong>. A background in Physics, Mathematics, and Chemistry (or an equivalent subject combination as per AICTE guidelines) is required to ensure readiness for engineering studies. Admission is offered strictly on merit, subject to verification of documents and university requirements.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1060262 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"424\">The B.Tech in Civil Engineering is a multidisciplinary programme designed to build strong foundational knowledge in core civil engineering while introducing students to advanced infrastructure and technology-driven specialisations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"636\">Students begin with essential engineering concepts that develop analytical and technical problem-solving skills, forming the base for understanding large-scale infrastructure systems and construction practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"1024\">The programme also offers specialised learning in modern civil engineering domains. <strong data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"762\">Geographic Information Systems (GIS)</strong> enables students to collect, analyse, and manage spatial data for solving real-world engineering and planning challenges. <strong data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"911\">Hydropower Engineering</strong> focuses on the planning, design, and operation of hydroelectric power systems for sustainable energy generation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1307\">In addition, students explore <strong data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1080\">Airfield Engineering</strong>, which covers the design, construction, and maintenance of airports and aviation infrastructure, and <strong data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1205\">Harbour Engineering</strong>, which deals with the development and management of ports, coastal structures, and marine facilities.</p>', '<ul data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e75w99\" data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"495\"><strong data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"395\">Construction Manager</strong> &ndash; Oversees construction projects, ensuring timely execution, cost control, and quality standards.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oe83os\" data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"612\"><strong data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"521\">Structural Engineer</strong> &ndash; Designs and analyses buildings, bridges, and other structures for strength and safety.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1erq224\" data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"742\"><strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"642\">Transportation Engineer</strong> &ndash; Plans and develops efficient transportation systems such as roads, highways, and rail networks.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g86uno\" data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"862\"><strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"772\">Water Resource Engineer</strong> &ndash; Works on irrigation systems, dams, water supply networks, and flood control projects.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qghvs8\" data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"968\"><strong data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"890\">Geotechnical Engineer</strong> &ndash; Studies soil and foundation conditions to support safe structural design.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"osxcao\" data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1093\"><strong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"997\">Environmental Engineer</strong> &ndash; Develops solutions for pollution control, waste management, and sustainable infrastructure.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18shv9o\" data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1204\"><strong data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1113\">Urban Planner</strong> &ndash; Designs and plans cities and urban spaces for balanced development and sustainability.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcesc9\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1305\"><strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1219\">Surveyor</strong> &ndash; Measures and maps land areas to support construction and infrastructure projects.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t6j9y0\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1417\"><strong data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1328\">Coastal Engineer</strong> &ndash; Works on coastal protection, harbour development, and marine infrastructure systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c1lelg\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1521\"><strong data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1439\">Project Manager</strong> &ndash; Leads and coordinates civil engineering projects from planning to completion.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"398\">Graphic Era Deemed to be University has established a strong reputation for delivering quality education and preparing students for successful professional careers in core engineering industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"773\">Graduates from the B.Tech Civil Engineering programme have been placed in leading infrastructure, construction, and industrial organisations. Some of the prominent recruiters include <strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"745\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Larsen &amp; Toubro</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Tata Projects</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Adani Group</span></span>, and <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Gammon India Limited</span></span></strong>, among other reputed firms.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"960\">These opportunities reflect the university&rsquo;s strong industry connections and its focus on developing job-ready engineering professionals for the infrastructure and construction sectors.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"20\",\"24\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 1060262.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(64, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'a5c956e1-f294-49ea-8cf6-2a762b3f8803', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"16\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 03:00:54', '2026-04-02 00:32:19', '<p>Students are not selected in a single step. First, their previous academic records are studied to understand their background in engineering. After this initial screening, shortlisted students are invited to interact with the university through an interview. The final decision is made only after both stages are completed.</p>', 1, '<p>To be eligible, a student must have completed an engineering degree such as B.Tech in Civil Engineering or a related B.E program from a recognized institute. Only students who meet this academic requirement are considered for further selection steps.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">256310</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"439\">This program is planned to help students build strong expertise in designing and analyzing advanced engineering structures. Learning is spread across four semesters and gradually moves from foundational understanding to advanced specialization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"751\">In the beginning phase, students focus on core engineering concepts that strengthen their understanding of how structures behave under different conditions. As the program progresses, they explore advanced areas such as earthquake-safe design, foundation systems, and structural behaviour under extreme forces.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"970\">Later, the learning shifts toward specialized applications where students study topics like high-rise building design, modern concrete technologies, and methods used to repair and strengthen old or damaged structures.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1137\">Along with classroom learning, students choose elective subjects that match their interests, allowing them to focus on specific fields within structural engineering.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1319\">A major part of the program is the research-based thesis work, where students independently study a real engineering problem under faculty guidance and develop practical solutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1635\">To support hands-on learning, students use industry-standard software tools such as structural analysis and design programs, along with laboratory testing of materials and site-based learning experiences. These activities help them understand how theoretical concepts are applied in real construction environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1884\">Electives further allow students to explore focused areas like bridge systems, tall structure design, wind effects on buildings, advanced structural behaviour, and monitoring of structural health, helping them prepare for specialized career paths.</p>', '<p data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"402\"><strong data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"261\">Structural Engineer</strong> works on analyzing and designing buildings, bridges, and other structures to ensure they are strong, stable, and safe under different loads.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"541\"><strong data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"423\">Project Manager</strong> oversees the entire construction project, managing teams, timelines, budgets, and ensuring smooth completion of work.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"711\"><strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"594\">Building Information Modelling (BIM) Specialist</strong> creates digital 3D models of construction projects to improve planning, coordination, and accuracy during execution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"860\"><strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"737\">Construction Manager</strong> supervises day-to-day construction activities at the site and ensures that work follows design plans and safety standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"1023\"><strong data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"892\">Structural Design Engineer</strong> focuses specifically on creating detailed structural designs and calculations for safe and efficient buildings and infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1159\"><strong data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1042\">Site Engineer</strong> works directly at construction sites to monitor progress, solve technical issues, and ensure quality work execution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1301\"><strong data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1179\">Design Checker</strong> reviews structural drawings and calculations to identify errors and ensure designs meet safety and engineering standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1443\"><strong data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1329\">Contract Administrator</strong> manages project contracts, including documentation, compliance, and coordination between clients and contractors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1582\"><strong data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1466\">Technical Advisor</strong> provides expert guidance on engineering methods, materials, and construction techniques to improve project quality.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1726\"><strong data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1606\">Contract Inspector</strong> checks construction work and materials on-site to ensure everything matches approved designs and contract requirements.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"23\",\"24\",\"51\"]', 4.0, '<p data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"389\">The university maintains strong connections with companies working in structural engineering, helping students understand how the industry actually works. Through these connections, students get chances to gain real-world experience before completing their degree.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"650\">A dedicated placement team supports students by guiding them, preparing them for interviews, and linking them with well-known organizations. This helps students smoothly move from classroom learning to professional careers in the structural engineering field.</p>', NULL, '[\"1\"]', 256310.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(67, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '46eaed8e-fc85-4932-b701-fccf8c2cd94d', 74, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"16\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 04:16:59', '2026-03-24 04:16:59', '<ul><li>Admission based on <strong>Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering (GATE)</strong> score or merit.</li><li>Direct admission may be offered based on qualifying degree performance.</li><li>Application through university portal followed by counseling/interview.</li></ul>', 1, '<ul><li>B.Tech / B.E. in Biotechnology or related fields (Biochemistry, Microbiology, Life Sciences).</li><li>Minimum <strong>55–60% aggregate marks</strong>.</li><li>GATE score preferred but not mandatory.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Tuition Fees: ₹90,000 – ₹1,50,000 per year (approx.)</li><li>Total Fees (2 years): ₹1,80,000 – ₹3,00,000 (approx.)</li><li>Additional charges: lab, research, hostel, and examination fees.</li></ul>', 'Medium', '<ul><li>Advanced Molecular Biology</li><li>Genetic Engineering &amp; Genomics</li><li>Bioinformatics</li><li>Immunology</li><li>Enzyme Technology</li><li>Bioprocess Engineering</li><li>Research Methodology</li><li>Dissertation / Thesis (final year)</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Biotechnologist</li><li>Research Scientist</li><li>Clinical Research Associate</li><li>Quality Assurance/Control Analyst</li><li>Roles in pharma, biotech companies, and R&amp;D labs</li><li>Opportunities in academia and government research sectors</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Average Package: ₹4 LPA – ₹8 LPA</li><li>Recruiters: Biotech firms, pharmaceutical companies, research organizations</li><li>Placement support with training, internships, and research exposure</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"28\"]', 4.0, '<ul><li>Collaboration with biotech labs and healthcare industries</li><li>Workshops, seminars, and research-based training programs</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Mandatory research internship/project work</li><li>Recognized postgraduate program in Life Sciences domain</li></ul>', '[\"1\"]', 250000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(68, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '46eaed8e-fc85-4932-b701-fccf8c2cd94d', 108, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 04:38:02', '2026-03-24 04:38:02', '<ul><li>Admission based on <strong>merit in Class 12</strong> (PCB/PCM).</li><li>Candidates apply through the university admission portal.</li><li>Shortlisting followed by document verification.</li></ul>', 1, '<ul><li>10+2 with <strong>Biology (preferred)</strong> or Mathematics.</li><li>Minimum <strong>50–60% aggregate marks</strong>.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Tuition Fees: ₹70,000 – ₹1,20,000 per year (approx.)</li><li>Total Fees (3 years): ₹2,00,000 – ₹3,50,000 (approx.)</li><li>Additional charges: lab, examination, and hostel fees.</li></ul>', 'Medium', '<ul><li>General Microbiology</li><li>Medical Microbiology</li><li>Industrial Microbiology</li><li>Immunology</li><li>Microbial Genetics</li><li>Environmental Microbiology</li><li>Biochemistry (basics)</li><li>Practical lab work &amp; projects</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Microbiologist</li><li>Lab Technician</li><li>Quality Control Analyst</li><li>Research Assistant</li><li>Jobs in pharma, food industry, healthcare labs</li><li>Higher studies: M.Sc, Ph.D, research fields</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Average Package: ₹2.5 LPA – ₹5 LPA</li><li>Recruiters: Pharma companies, diagnostic labs, food industries</li><li>Internship support available</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"43\"]', 4.0, '<ul><li>Exposure through lab training, workshops, and seminars</li><li>Collaboration with healthcare and biotech sectors</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Internships in laboratories, hospitals, and research centers</li><li>Recognized Life Sciences program in private universities</li></ul>', '[\"1\"]', 450000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(69, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '46eaed8e-fc85-4932-b701-fccf8c2cd94d', 109, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"18\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 04:45:18', '2026-03-24 04:45:18', '<ul><li>Admission is primarily <strong>merit-based (graduation marks)</strong>.</li><li>Candidates apply through the university admission portal.</li><li>Shortlisting followed by document verification/interview.</li><li>Some seats may consider <strong>Common University Entrance Test – Postgraduate (CUET-PG)</strong> scores (if applicable).</li></ul>', 1, '<ul><li>Bachelor’s degree (B.Sc) in <strong>Microbiology / Biotechnology / Life Sciences</strong> or related field.</li><li>Minimum <strong>50–60% aggregate marks</strong> (varies by category).</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Tuition Fees: ₹60,000 – ₹1,20,000 per year (approx.)</li><li>Total Fees (2 years): ₹1,20,000 – ₹2,50,000 (approx.)</li><li>Additional charges: lab, research, examination, and hostel fees.</li></ul>', 'Medium', '<ul><li>Advanced Microbiology</li><li>Microbial Genetics</li><li>Immunology</li><li>Medical Microbiology</li><li>Industrial Microbiology</li><li>Environmental Microbiology</li><li>Molecular Biology</li><li>Research Methodology &amp; Dissertation</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Microbiologist</li><li>Research Scientist</li><li>Clinical Research Associate</li><li>Quality Control/Assurance Analyst</li><li>Jobs in pharma, healthcare, food, and biotech industries</li><li>Higher studies: Ph.D, research, academia</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Average Package: ₹3 LPA – ₹6 LPA</li><li>Recruiters: Pharma companies, diagnostic labs, research institutes</li><li>Placement assistance with internships and lab training</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"43\"]', 4.0, '<ul><li>Exposure through lab research, seminars, and workshops</li><li>Collaboration with healthcare and biotech sectors</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Mandatory research project / dissertation</li><li>Internship opportunities in labs, hospitals, and industries</li><li>Recognized postgraduate Life Sciences program</li></ul>', '[\"1\"]', 250000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(70, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '46eaed8e-fc85-4932-b701-fccf8c2cd94d', 110, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"18\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 04:51:02', '2026-03-24 04:51:02', '<ul><li>Admission is mainly <strong>merit-based (graduation marks)</strong>.</li><li>Candidates apply via the university admission portal.</li><li>Shortlisting followed by document verification/interview.</li><li>Some cases may consider <strong>Common University Entrance Test – Postgraduate (CUET-PG)</strong> scores.</li></ul>', 1, '<ul><li>Bachelor’s degree (B.Sc) in <strong>Biochemistry / Biotechnology / Microbiology / Life Sciences</strong> or related field.</li><li>Minimum <strong>50–60% aggregate marks</strong> (varies by category).</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Tuition Fees: ₹60,000 – ₹1,20,000 per year (approx.)</li><li>Total Fees (2 years): ₹1,20,000 – ₹2,50,000 (approx.)</li><li>Additional charges: lab, research, exam, and hostel fees.</li></ul>', 'Medium', '<ul><li>Advanced Biochemistry</li><li>Enzymology</li><li>Metabolism &amp; Molecular Biology</li><li>Clinical Biochemistry</li><li>Immunology</li><li>Bioinformatics</li><li>Research Methodology</li><li>Dissertation / Project Work</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Biochemist</li><li>Research Scientist</li><li>Clinical Research Associate</li><li>Lab Analyst / Quality Control</li><li>Jobs in pharma, diagnostics, food, and biotech industries</li><li>Higher studies: Ph.D, research, academia</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Average Package: ₹3 LPA – ₹6 LPA</li><li>Recruiters: Pharma companies, diagnostic labs, research institutes</li><li>Placement support with internships and lab exposure</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"28\",\"44\"]', 3.8, '<ul><li>Industry interaction via seminars and workshops</li><li>Exposure to healthcare, biotech, and research sectors</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Mandatory research project/dissertation</li><li>Internship opportunities in labs and industries</li><li>Recognized Life Sciences postgraduate program</li></ul>', '[\"1\"]', 250000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(72, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '8f687fd6-17b2-4506-98d8-723d9396728e', 113, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 05:21:01', '2026-04-07 04:22:53', '<ul data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"649\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5cuubr\" data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"437\">Admission is primarily based on performance in the <strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"434\">qualifying examination (10+2)</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdqfnc\" data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"511\">A merit list is prepared to shortlist candidates for seat allocation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rhrzkx\" data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"649\">Final selection may also involve an entrance test or personal interview depending on the applicant&rsquo;s profile and eligibility pathway.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<h3 data-section-id=\"1p1jjjm\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"707\">Academic Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ndhxid\" data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"842\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"777\">passed or be appearing for Class 12 (10+2)</strong> from a recognized board (including <strong data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"838\">NIOS board candidates</strong>).</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mut7cr\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"1096\">Applicants must meet any one of the following conditions:\r\n<ul data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15io9ef\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"970\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"938\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in the qualifying examination</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ct28g\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1031\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1029\">40% marks for reserved category candidates</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jk1b23\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1096\">OR completion of <strong data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1094\">D.Voc. in a relevant or allied stream</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5e6a4d\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1135\">Entrance / Selection Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1200\">Admission may be conducted through one of the following routes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dgwf9p\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1263\"><strong data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1232\">University Entrance Test</strong> conducted by the institution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"531c2v\" data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1340\"><strong data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1288\">Personal Interview</strong> to assess creative ability and interest in design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rrftph\" data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1457\">Valid scores from national-level entrance examinations such as:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w0tcsa\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1418\">UCEED</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9d4nav\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1432\">NID-DAT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jo7qiw\" data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1457\">NIFT Entrance Exam</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)--1296750 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"410\">This specialization is focused on developing strong capabilities in designing physical products that are functional, user-friendly, and innovation-driven. It trains students to combine creativity with engineering logic so they can create products that improve everyday life while considering usability, manufacturability, sustainability, and future technologies like AI-enabled systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"624\">The program develops a structured understanding of how products are imagined, developed, tested, and refined, ensuring students are prepared to work across both traditional and advanced product design industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"629\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yfgite\" data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"652\">Key Learning Areas</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zr2zx\" data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"800\"><strong data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"689\">Foundations of Product Design</strong><br data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"692\">Building skills in form exploration, object understanding, spatial reasoning, and basic design principles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4zh1qs\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"960\"><strong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"841\">Technical Drawing &amp; Visualization</strong><br data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"844\">Learning accurate representation of product ideas through sketches, drawings, and visual communication techniques.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1elh29k\" data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1087\"><strong data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"991\">3D Modeling &amp; Rendering</strong><br data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"994\">Creating digital product models and realistic visual outputs using industry-standard tools.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kshjs5\" data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1216\"><strong data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1116\">Prototyping &amp; Testing</strong><br data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1119\">Developing physical and digital prototypes to test usability, function, and design performance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ybcy2\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1366\"><strong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1253\">User Research &amp; Human Factors</strong><br data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1256\">Understanding user needs, behaviors, and ergonomics to create comfortable and effective product experiences.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a8oks2\" data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1492\"><strong data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1401\">Design Research Methodology</strong><br data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1404\">Applying structured research methods to guide product development and decision-making.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2oacv8\" data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1614\"><strong data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1526\">Sustainable Product Design</strong><br data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1529\">Focusing on eco-friendly materials, responsible production, and lifecycle thinking.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x8fzix\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1739\"><strong data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1658\">Manufacturing &amp; Production Awareness</strong><br data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1661\">Understanding production processes, feasibility, and industrial constraints.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6gt4t\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1875\"><strong data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1777\">Smart &amp; AI-Integrated Products</strong><br data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1780\">Exploring how AI and connected systems can enhance product functionality and user experience.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"86m8cc\" data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"2008\"><strong data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1914\">Business &amp; Market Understanding</strong><br data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1917\">Considering product viability, market needs, and business strategy in design development.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"4042\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1elevuj\" data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"3013\"><strong data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2953\">Industrial Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs functional and manufacturable physical products</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ecuui5\" data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3089\"><strong data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3036\">Product Designer</strong> &ndash; Develops user-focused products across industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vguqis\" data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3172\"><strong data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3111\">Design Engineer</strong> &ndash; Combines engineering principles with product development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bjrtxv\" data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3262\"><strong data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3203\">Human Factors Specialist</strong> &ndash; Studies ergonomics and user behavior to improve design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mo6glk\" data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3351\"><strong data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3299\">Automotive / Mobility Designer</strong> &ndash; Works on vehicle and transport design solutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cvhhbv\" data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3432\"><strong data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3381\">Medical Device Designer</strong> &ndash; Creates healthcare-related equipment and tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"131h6wh\" data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3517\"><strong data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3469\">Furniture / Lifestyle Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs everyday use and lifestyle products</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13veh7h\" data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3600\"><strong data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3553\">Sustainable Design Consultant</strong> &ndash; Focuses on eco-friendly product innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1739gev\" data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3689\"><strong data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3637\">CAD / Visualization Specialist</strong> &ndash; Develops detailed 3D product models and renders</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jqhnnl\" data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3782\"><strong data-start=\"3692\" data-end=\"3717\">Innovation Consultant</strong> &ndash; Helps organizations develop new product ideas and strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uvlw2a\" data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3866\"><strong data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3822\">Prototyping &amp; Fabrication Manager</strong> &ndash; Manages product testing and development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15bnx8f\" data-start=\"3867\" data-end=\"3962\"><strong data-start=\"3869\" data-end=\"3905\">Freelance / Independent Designer</strong> &ndash; Works on independent or client-based design projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2xv378\" data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"4042\"><strong data-start=\"3965\" data-end=\"3990\">Academic / Researcher</strong> &ndash; Engages in teaching and product design research</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"78\",\"103\",\"104\",\"105\",\"106\",\"107\",\"108\",\"109\",\"110\"]', 3.8, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 1296750.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(73, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '8f687fd6-17b2-4506-98d8-723d9396728e', 114, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 05:26:57', '2026-04-07 04:29:28', '<ul data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"649\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5cuubr\" data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"437\">Admission is primarily based on performance in the <strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"434\">qualifying examination (10+2)</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdqfnc\" data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"511\">A merit list is prepared to shortlist candidates for seat allocation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rhrzkx\" data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"649\">Final selection may also involve an entrance test or personal interview depending on the applicant&rsquo;s profile and eligibility pathway.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<h3 data-section-id=\"1p1jjjm\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"707\">Academic Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ndhxid\" data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"842\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"777\">passed or be appearing for Class 12 (10+2)</strong> from a recognized board (including <strong data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"838\">NIOS board candidates</strong>).</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mut7cr\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"1096\">Applicants must meet any one of the following conditions:\r\n<ul data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15io9ef\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"970\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"938\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in the qualifying examination</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ct28g\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1031\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1029\">40% marks for reserved category candidates</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jk1b23\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1096\">OR completion of <strong data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1094\">D.Voc. in a relevant or allied stream</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5e6a4d\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1135\">Entrance / Selection Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1200\">Admission may be conducted through one of the following routes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dgwf9p\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1263\"><strong data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1232\">University Entrance Test</strong> conducted by the institution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"531c2v\" data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1340\"><strong data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1288\">Personal Interview</strong> to assess creative ability and interest in design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rrftph\" data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1457\">Valid scores from national-level entrance examinations such as:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w0tcsa\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1418\">UCEED</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9d4nav\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1432\">NID-DAT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jo7qiw\" data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1457\">NIFT Entrance Exam</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)---1296750 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"363\">This specialization focuses on building strong expertise in designing immersive digital worlds, interactive systems, and engaging virtual experiences. It prepares students to combine creativity, storytelling, and technology to develop games, animations, and interactive media that are both visually compelling and functionally interactive.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"597\">The program develops a complete understanding of the digital production pipeline&mdash;from idea generation and storytelling to final real-time execution&mdash;while also introducing advanced tools used in animation, gaming, and VFX industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"602\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yfgite\" data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"625\">Key Learning Areas</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"1829\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3wjyi1\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"765\"><strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"675\">Foundations of Visual Design &amp; Composition</strong><br data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"678\">Learning core principles of layout, color, and visual storytelling for digital media.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10wu2sd\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"889\"><strong data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"801\">Character Design &amp; Animation</strong><br data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"804\">Creating expressive characters and understanding movement, motion, and performance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k9m1a5\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"998\"><strong data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"921\">Game Design Fundamentals</strong><br data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"924\">Studying gameplay mechanics, player interaction, and engagement systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14bdu9n\" data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1109\"><strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1038\">3D Modeling &amp; Environment Design</strong><br data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1041\">Building detailed characters, props, and immersive virtual worlds.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u14rkn\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1226\"><strong data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1144\">Rigging &amp; Motion Techniques</strong><br data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1147\">Understanding skeletal systems, animation rigs, and motion capture workflows.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18lwgxq\" data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1343\"><strong data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1268\">Real-Time Rendering &amp; Game Engines</strong><br data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1271\">Working with engines to develop interactive and playable environments.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g7we1p\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1449\"><strong data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1375\">VFX &amp; Visual Enhancement</strong><br data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1378\">Applying effects to improve realism, storytelling, and visual impact.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iyxpt8\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1565\"><strong data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1496\">Interactive Prototyping &amp; Storyboarding</strong><br data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1499\">Designing and testing game concepts and interactive experiences.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dotuyx\" data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1707\"><strong data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1607\">AI in Animation &amp; Game Development</strong><br data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1610\">Exploring AI tools for procedural content generation, animation support, and game intelligence.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ym903\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1829\"><strong data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1739\">Ethics in Digital Worlds</strong><br data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1742\">Understanding responsible design of engaging and socially aware virtual environments.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"3985\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uz6o58\" data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2823\"><strong data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2762\">Game Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs gameplay systems, mechanics, and user experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j2idru\" data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2893\"><strong data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2844\">Game Developer</strong> &ndash; Builds and programs interactive game systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16q8e5c\" data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2981\"><strong data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2909\">3D Artist</strong> &ndash; Creates characters, props, and environments for games and animation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"209xbg\" data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3055\"><strong data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"2996\">Animator</strong> &ndash; Develops motion and performance for digital characters</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10r73bh\" data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3128\"><strong data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3072\">VFX Artist</strong> &ndash; Works on visual effects for films, games, and media</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"117vy1e\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3208\"><strong data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3149\">Level Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs game environments and player progression paths</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14bsls3\" data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3292\"><strong data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3233\">Character Designer</strong> &ndash; Develops visual identity and personality of characters</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vq07sb\" data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3366\"><strong data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3317\">Environment Artist</strong> &ndash; Builds immersive virtual worlds and settings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rx3h66\" data-start=\"3367\" data-end=\"3441\"><strong data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3389\">Technical Artist</strong> &ndash; Bridges art and programming for game production</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yq5nho\" data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3527\"><strong data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3463\">AR/VR Developer</strong> &ndash; Creates immersive augmented and virtual reality experiences</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11sjbce\" data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3595\"><strong data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3554\">Storyboarding Artist</strong> &ndash; Visualizes narrative flow and scenes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lviz2s\" data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3670\"><strong data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3627\">Motion Capture Specialist</strong> &ndash; Works with performance capture systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h6ph72\" data-start=\"3671\" data-end=\"3744\"><strong data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3703\">Interactive Media Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs engaging digital experiences</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cy3k1k\" data-start=\"3745\" data-end=\"3819\"><strong data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3772\">Creative Technologist</strong> &ndash; Combines technology with design innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16tihp3\" data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3908\"><strong data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3858\">Freelance / Independent Designer</strong> &ndash; Works on gaming, animation, or media projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gp7yjh\" data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"3985\"><strong data-start=\"3911\" data-end=\"3936\">Academic / Researcher</strong> &ndash; Works in teaching and digital media research</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"94\",\"95\",\"96\",\"97\",\"99\",\"100\",\"101\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 1296750.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(75, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '3d9693bf-27bd-4364-a924-77848819ceae', 116, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"21\"]', NULL, 'Full Time', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 05:55:49', '2026-04-07 01:59:58', '<p>Admission is carried out through a <strong data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"84\">merit-based selection</strong>, where candidates are shortlisted based on their <strong data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"158\">Class 12 performance</strong>. As there is no entrance exam, academic scores play a key role in the selection process.</p>', 1, '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vii4pv\" data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"365\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"338\">passed or be appearing for Class 12</strong> from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z8qv99\" data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"450\">Students from <strong data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"425\">any stream (Science, Commerce, or Arts)</strong> are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m8pb4m\" data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"532\"><strong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"500\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> candidates are also eligible.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qi34ah\" data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"620\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Final selection is <strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"589\">based on merit (Class 12 score)</strong>, as per university guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1674134 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uf8enp\" data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"377\"><strong data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"252\">Core Business Subjects:</strong> Includes Principles of Management, Organizational Behavior, and Financial Management to build strong business foundations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fv3aus\" data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"517\"><strong data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"402\">Core Law Subjects:</strong> Covers key legal areas such as Constitutional Law, Family Law, and Corporate Law for strong legal understanding.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1trr5rn\" data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"663\"><strong data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"551\">Interdisciplinary Learning:</strong> Combines business decision-making with legal reasoning to handle complex corporate and regulatory challenges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tp3gmw\" data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"797\"><strong data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"699\">Analytical Skill Development:</strong> Focus on critical thinking, problem-solving, legal analysis, and business strategy development.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dlhjol\" data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"915\"><strong data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"826\">Practical Orientation:</strong> Emphasis on applying theoretical knowledge to real-life business and legal situations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1idmun2\" data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"1072\"><strong data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"949\">Industry-Relevant Training:</strong> Prepares students for roles requiring both legal awareness and business expertise, especially in corporate environments.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yf5zdl\" data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1191\"><strong data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1102\">Leadership Development:</strong> Builds leadership and decision-making skills for managerial and corporate legal roles.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0d3e9ba6-f060-4cf8-9571-5a77e0e2c189-53\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-100\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"d4f02113-6f47-49fe-96e7-56db62f3c039\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"1506\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1deqzto\" data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"196\"><strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"52\">Advocate (Lawyer):</strong> Represent clients in courts, draft legal documents, and provide legal advice in areas like criminal, civil, corporate, or constitutional law.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hl9a3j\" data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"337\"><strong data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"220\">Corporate Lawyer:</strong> Work with companies on contracts, mergers, compliance, and legal regulations, ensuring smooth business operations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h6q94d\" data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"470\"><strong data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"358\">Legal Advisor:</strong> Guide organizations or individuals on legal rights, policies, and risk management to ensure legal compliance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kadrna\" data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"609\"><strong data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"491\">Legal Analyst:</strong> Research case laws, study legal precedents, and support lawyers by preparing reports and analyzing legal documents.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uffko0\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"746\"><strong data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"633\">Legal Journalist:</strong> Report on court cases, legal updates, and judicial decisions, simplifying complex legal issues for the public.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pjli9y\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"909\"><strong data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"781\">Civil Services Professional:</strong> Appear for UPSC or judicial exams to become IAS, IPS, IRS officers or judicial officers serving in courts and administration.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"180gziz\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1054\"><strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"928\">Law Officer:</strong> Work in banks, PSUs, or government organizations to handle legal compliance and represent the institution in legal matters.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1che5e\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1211\"><strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1078\">Legal Consultant:</strong> Provide expert legal advice on corporate law, taxation, contracts, and intellectual property on a freelance or professional basis.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12l4tyt\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1372\"><strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1254\">Judicial Officer (Judge/Magistrate):</strong> Serve in the judiciary by interpreting laws, hearing cases, and delivering judgments after clearing judicial exams.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ktoxtl\" data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1506\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1406\">Law Professor &amp; Researcher:</strong> Enter academia after higher studies to teach law and contribute to legal research and publications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"69\",\"70\",\"116\",\"117\",\"120\",\"121\",\"122\",\"123\",\"125\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\",\"2\"]', 1674134.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(76, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '3d9693bf-27bd-4364-a924-77848819ceae', 117, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"21\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-24 06:01:29', '2026-04-07 01:52:34', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"238\">Admission is granted through a <strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"88\">merit-based selection process</strong>, where candidates are shortlisted based on their <strong data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"189\">performance in the qualifying graduation degree</strong>. Higher scores improve the chances of selection.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"is7nrs\" data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"266\">&nbsp;</h3>', 1, '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4nsbpu\" data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"374\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"342\">completed or be appearing in a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16p62ym\" data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"445\">Applicants from <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"420\">any academic background</strong> are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nrq4nj\" data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"530\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Final admission is <strong data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"504\">based on merit (graduation score)</strong>, as per university norms.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-200830 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\" style=\"width: 99.7436%; height: 875.333px;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" style=\"height: 132.021px;\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" style=\"width: 33.2818%;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" style=\"width: 43.0149%;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" style=\"width: 23.7398%;\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\" style=\"height: 79.0208px;\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" style=\"width: 43.0149%;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" style=\"width: 23.7398%;\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" style=\"height: 109.031px;\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" style=\"width: 43.0149%;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" style=\"width: 23.7398%;\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\" style=\"height: 79.0208px;\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" style=\"width: 33.2818%;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" style=\"width: 43.0149%;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" style=\"width: 23.7398%;\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" style=\"height: 79.0208px;\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" style=\"width: 43.0149%;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" style=\"width: 23.7398%;\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\" style=\"height: 79.0208px;\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" style=\"width: 105.245%;\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" style=\"height: 140.042px;\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" style=\"width: 105.245%;\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\" style=\"height: 140.042px;\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" style=\"width: 105.245%;\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\" style=\"height: 38.1146px;\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" style=\"width: 105.245%;\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"198\">The program is designed to provide <strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"141\">advanced legal knowledge with a strong focus on specialization and research</strong>, preparing students for professional and academic roles.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"1083\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t57m9q\" data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"340\"><strong data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"226\">Core Legal Subjects:</strong> Covers key areas like Law and Justice in a Globalizing World, Research Methodology, and Comparative Public Law.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tisyjs\" data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"479\"><strong data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"370\">Specialization Options:</strong> Choose focused areas such as Corporate Law, Criminal Law, or Constitutional Law based on career interests.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r7n8o1\" data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"627\"><strong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"518\">Conceptual &amp; Practical Learning:</strong> Learn through case studies, group discussions, and presentations to understand real-world legal scenarios.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rx0tru\" data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"751\"><strong data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"661\">Research-Oriented Approach:</strong> Emphasis on legal research, paper writing, and in-depth study of specific legal issues.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bqw2bb\" data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"857\"><strong data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"776\">Skill Development:</strong> Build advocacy, legal drafting, analytical thinking, and communication skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s2ory\" data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"975\"><strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"887\">Moot Courts &amp; Seminars:</strong> Participate in moot court competitions and seminars to gain practical legal exposure.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ql7ibn\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1083\"><strong data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"999\">Research Project:</strong> Complete a major research project to apply legal knowledge and critical analysis.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15u1qcv\" data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"202\"><strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"53\">Legal Practitioner:</strong> Work as a lawyer in law firms, corporate legal departments, or government bodies, handling cases, legal documentation, and providing legal advice.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tnd709\" data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"359\"><strong data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"238\">Legal Academician/Researcher:</strong> Teach law in universities or engage in research, contributing to legal studies and shaping future legal professionals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yw3yu7\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"502\"><strong data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"384\">Judicial Services:</strong> Appear for judicial exams and work within the court system as a judge, ensuring justice and interpretation of laws.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"148qxss\" data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"647\"><strong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"530\">Public Policy Expert:</strong> Analyze and develop laws and policies, working with government or organizations to bring social and legal reforms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16afp66\" data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"802\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"694\">International Organization Professional:</strong> Work with global institutions, offering legal expertise on international laws, treaties, and global issues.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"69\",\"70\",\"120\",\"121\",\"122\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\",\"2\"]', 200830.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(77, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'd141f80f-894c-4fc5-ab4f-bcb911c4ded3', 119, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"12\"]', 'Engineering', 'OFFLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-25 00:08:40', '2026-04-07 07:20:57', '<p>Admission is granted on the basis of <strong data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"145\">merit prepared from the marks obtained in the qualifying examination (Class XII)</strong>. Final selection is made as per the <strong data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"223\">merit list prepared by the university</strong>.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"340\">To be eligible for this program, candidates must fulfill the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"802\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nsqjsv\" data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"407\">Must have <strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"405\">passed Class XII (10+2) from a recognized board</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5cip04\" data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"497\">Must have studied <strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"495\">Physics, Chemistry, and Mathematics (PCM) as mandatory subjects</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fic9b2\" data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"566\">Admission is based on <strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"564\">merit determined from Class XII scores</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yypffo\" data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"692\">Candidates <strong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"633\">appearing for Class 12 are also eligible to apply</strong>, subject to meeting eligibility at the time of admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ezu3io\" data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"802\"><strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"736\">NIOS board students are also eligible</strong>, provided they have PCM subjects and meet the required criteria</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment) -- &nbsp;1004436&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;One Time Payable-</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">&nbsp; 5000&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"461\">The B.Tech Aerospace Engineering program with specialization in Space Technology is designed to build strong foundations in aerospace sciences while focusing on advanced space systems, aircraft engineering, and modern aerospace technologies. The program aims to prepare students for high-impact careers in aerospace, defence, aviation, and space research organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"663\">The curriculum combines engineering fundamentals with industry-driven training, hands-on projects, and emerging technologies to ensure students gain both theoretical knowledge and practical expertise.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"668\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rqbxse\" data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"692\">Core Learning Areas</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rriz7\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"800\"><strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"734\">Aerospace Engineering Fundamentals</strong> &ndash; Principles of flight, aircraft systems, and aerospace science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7amazh\" data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"908\"><strong data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"831\">Space Technology Systems</strong> &ndash; Introduction to spacecraft design, satellite systems, and space missions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9ddxp7\" data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"1023\"><strong data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"940\">Aerodynamics &amp; Propulsion</strong> &ndash; Study of airflow dynamics and propulsion mechanisms in aircraft and spacecraft</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tpz5y0\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1115\"><strong data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1058\">Aircraft Structures &amp; Design</strong> &ndash; Structural analysis and design of aerospace vehicles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkomao\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1216\"><strong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1156\">Control Systems &amp; Flight Mechanics</strong> &ndash; Stability, navigation, and control of aerospace systems</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oqz8n\" data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"372\"><strong data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"292\">Aerospace Engineer</strong> &ndash; Works on designing and developing advanced aircraft and spacecraft systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d7u8w5\" data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"471\"><strong data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"401\">Space Systems Engineer</strong> &ndash; Involved in satellite development and space exploration missions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f213ns\" data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"577\"><strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"498\">Flight Test Engineer</strong> &ndash; Conducts aircraft and spacecraft testing and analyzes performance results.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15etgfe\" data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"693\"><strong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"610\">Defence Aerospace Engineer</strong> &ndash; Focuses on military aviation systems and defence-based aerospace technologies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qg63o9\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"803\"><strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"718\">Materials Engineer</strong> &ndash; Develops lightweight and high-strength materials used in aerospace applications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uftlg2\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"915\"><strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"836\">Rocket Propulsion Engineer</strong> &ndash; Designs and tests propulsion systems for rockets and missile technologies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a0uqp9\" data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"1016\"><strong data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"940\">Payload Specialist</strong> &ndash; Manages design and integration of satellite and space mission payloads.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n70opl\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1126\"><strong data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1055\">Satellite Communication Engineer</strong> &ndash; Works on satellite-based communication systems and infrastructure.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fs2p0x\" data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1236\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1161\">Aerospace Research Scientist</strong> &ndash; Conducts advanced research to develop innovative aerospace technologies.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"14\" data-end=\"361\">Graphic Era Deemed to be University maintains a strong placement ecosystem in the aerospace and aeronautics domain, ensuring students are well-prepared for industry roles. The university has established valuable connections with leading organizations, enabling students to gain exposure to real-world aerospace operations and career opportunities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"713\">The placement support system connects students with reputed recruiters such as <strong data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"565\">ISRO, Indian Air Force, TATA Advanced Systems, Hindustan Aeronautics Limited (HAL), Airbus, DRDO, and MRO organizations</strong>, among others. These collaborations help students access industry-oriented roles and build strong professional foundations in the aerospace sector.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"1049\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">With a dedicated placement team working continuously to support students, more than 90% of students receive internship opportunities in top aerospace organizations. In addition, industrial visits and field exposure programs further enhance practical understanding, bridging the gap between academic learning and industry requirements.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2535\">The program includes strong industry engagement through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2796\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ewl9gk\" data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2607\">Collaboration with aerospace enterprises and research organizations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13azjkm\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2663\">Industrial visits and expert-led technical sessions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i5czc3\" data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2724\">Interaction with aerospace professionals and researchers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fkjgaw\" data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2796\">Exposure to current trends in space technology and aviation systems</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2102\">Students receive direct practical exposure through internships in leading aerospace organizations such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2213\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vchijk\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2142\">HAL (Hindustan Aeronautics Limited)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vco9bp\" data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2151\">DRDO</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qshqtr\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2160\">ISRO</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16vw9or\" data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2168\">NAL</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b9488h\" data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2213\">Private aerospace and aviation companies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2249\">During internships, students gain:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2434\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1clugum\" data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2283\">Real-time industry experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n7v3gi\" data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2332\">Exposure to aerospace engineering operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zyfpop\" data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2382\">Practical application of theoretical concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fug3mn\" data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2434\">Professional training in aerospace environments</li>\r\n</ul>', '[\"1\"]', 1004436.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(78, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '8f687fd6-17b2-4506-98d8-723d9396728e', 120, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-25 00:51:28', '2026-04-07 04:34:07', '<ul data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"649\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5cuubr\" data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"437\">Admission is primarily based on performance in the <strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"434\">qualifying examination (10+2)</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdqfnc\" data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"511\">A merit list is prepared to shortlist candidates for seat allocation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rhrzkx\" data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"649\">Final selection may also involve an entrance test or personal interview depending on the applicant&rsquo;s profile and eligibility pathway.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<h3 data-section-id=\"1p1jjjm\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"707\">Academic Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ndhxid\" data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"842\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"777\">passed or be appearing for Class 12 (10+2)</strong> from a recognized board (including <strong data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"838\">NIOS board candidates</strong>).</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mut7cr\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"1096\">Applicants must meet any one of the following conditions:\r\n<ul data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15io9ef\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"970\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"938\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in the qualifying examination</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ct28g\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1031\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1029\">40% marks for reserved category candidates</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jk1b23\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1096\">OR completion of <strong data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1094\">D.Voc. in a relevant or allied stream</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5e6a4d\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1135\">Entrance / Selection Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1200\">Admission may be conducted through one of the following routes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dgwf9p\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1263\"><strong data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1232\">University Entrance Test</strong> conducted by the institution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"531c2v\" data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1340\"><strong data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1288\">Personal Interview</strong> to assess creative ability and interest in design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rrftph\" data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1457\">Valid scores from national-level entrance examinations such as:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w0tcsa\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1418\">UCEED</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9d4nav\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1432\">NID-DAT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jo7qiw\" data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1457\">NIFT Entrance Exam</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)--1296750 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"478\">This specialization focuses on developing strong expertise in designing physical products that are functional, innovative, and user-centered. It trains students to translate human needs into practical design solutions by combining creativity with engineering principles, usability, and production feasibility. The program also encourages awareness of emerging technologies such as AI-assisted manufacturing and modern business-driven product development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"678\">The learning journey is structured to move from fundamental design skills to advanced product systems, enabling students to confidently work on real-world industrial and consumer product challenges.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"683\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yfgite\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"706\">Key Learning Areas</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"2116\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91scmb\" data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"851\"><strong data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"744\">Fundamentals of Product Design</strong><br data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"747\">Developing understanding of form, structure, and object-based thinking through basic design exercises.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c5o2w0\" data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"984\"><strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"889\">Form Studies &amp; Object Analysis</strong><br data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"892\">Exploring shapes, proportions, and visual balance to improve design clarity and usability.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ezszfe\" data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1124\"><strong data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1025\">Technical Drawing &amp; Visualization</strong><br data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1028\">Learning accurate representation of product ideas using manual and digital drawing techniques.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j3uxzu\" data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1248\"><strong data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1155\">3D Modeling &amp; Rendering</strong><br data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1158\">Creating detailed digital models and realistic visual presentations of product concepts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlih0q\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1373\"><strong data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1288\">Prototyping (Physical &amp; Digital)</strong><br data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1291\">Building and testing models to evaluate function, usability, and design quality.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yyf6rd\" data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1495\"><strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1404\">Design Research Methods</strong><br data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1407\">Conducting structured research to understand user needs and guide product development.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8h54jv\" data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1620\"><strong data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1531\">User Testing &amp; Human Factors</strong><br data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1534\">Studying user interaction, ergonomics, and comfort to improve product effectiveness.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f2zas4\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1750\"><strong data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1654\">Sustainable Product Design</strong><br data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1657\">Designing environmentally responsible products with long-term usability and impact in mind.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ckunrr\" data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1873\"><strong data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1794\">Manufacturing &amp; Production Awareness</strong><br data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1797\">Understanding materials, production processes, and industrial feasibility.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"taq7r8\" data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1988\"><strong data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1907\">AI &amp; Smart Product Systems</strong><br data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1910\">Exploring integration of intelligent features and connected product systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"48cjii\" data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2116\"><strong data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2027\">Business &amp; Market Understanding</strong><br data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2030\">Evaluating product viability, user demand, and market relevance in design decisions.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"1762\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0ms55\" data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"351\"><strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"289\">Spatial Experience (UX) Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs interactive and user-focused spatial environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tdb90g\" data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"436\"><strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"375\">Interior Designer</strong> &ndash; Plans and creates functional and aesthetic indoor spaces</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"111qudi\" data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"520\"><strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"463\">Smart Space Designer</strong> &ndash; Integrates technology into modern built environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yi1jhn\" data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"624\"><strong data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"554\">Biophilic Design Consultant</strong> &ndash; Designs spaces inspired by natural elements to improve well-being</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ptzvey\" data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"724\"><strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"659\">Sustainable Space Strategist</strong> &ndash; Develops eco-friendly and energy-efficient spatial solutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2iemb4\" data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"820\"><strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"764\">Exhibition &amp; Scenography Designer</strong> &ndash; Creates immersive exhibition and stage environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"77wms3\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"909\"><strong data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"853\">Retail Experience Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs engaging and customer-focused retail spaces</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3vjjov\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1004\"><strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"945\">Hospitality Design Specialist</strong> &ndash; Works on hotels, resorts, and hospitality environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jl2sa3\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1112\"><strong data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1050\">3D Visualization &amp; Walkthrough Designer</strong> &ndash; Creates realistic spatial models and virtual walkthroughs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"34xha7\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1223\"><strong data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1166\">BIM (Building Information Modeling) Coordinator</strong> &ndash; Manages digital building design and planning systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6bi7hv\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1322\"><strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1258\">Lighting &amp; Acoustic Designer</strong> &ndash; Plans lighting and sound systems for optimized environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p52vpb\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1416\"><strong data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1354\">Adaptive Reuse Specialist</strong> &ndash; Redesigns and repurposes existing structures for new uses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pntp62\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1512\"><strong data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1450\">Universal Design Consultant</strong> &ndash; Ensures spaces are accessible and inclusive for all users</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i2x6us\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1598\"><strong data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1547\">Furniture &amp; Fixture Designer</strong> &ndash; Designs interior elements and spatial products</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36umrd\" data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1687\"><strong data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1634\">Workplace Strategy Consultant</strong> &ndash; Plans efficient and productive work environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ino5jh\" data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1762\"><strong data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1713\">Design Entrepreneur</strong> &ndash; Builds independent design practice or studio</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"81\",\"82\",\"83\",\"84\",\"85\",\"86\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 1296750.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(79, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'b6b6029a-4a58-4797-80fb-6d2482bd4e36', 122, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-25 03:22:09', '2026-04-07 05:13:49', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"202\">Admission is granted on the basis of <strong data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"145\">merit prepared from the marks obtained in the qualifying examination (Class XII)</strong>. Shortlisting is done according to academic performance.</p>', 1, '<ul data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"624\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18qipyj\" data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"356\">Must have <strong data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"330\">passed Class XII in any stream</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mdqw9s\" data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"502\">Candidates <strong data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"423\">appearing for Class 12 are also eligible to apply</strong>, subject to completion of final examination results at the time of admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yxkf5w\" data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"624\"><strong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"548\">NIOS board candidates are also eligible</strong>, provided they have passed Class XII from a recognized board of education</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)--75430 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(