(80, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'b6b6029a-4a58-4797-80fb-6d2482bd4e36', 121, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-25 03:41:29', '2026-04-07 05:03:59', '<p>Admission to the program is based on a <strong data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"149\">merit list prepared using marks obtained in the qualifying examination (Class XII)</strong>. Candidates are shortlisted according to their academic performance in the final board examination.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"329\">To apply for this program, candidates must have:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"683\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pb26rl\" data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"398\"><strong data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"353\">Passed Class XII</strong> from a <strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"396\">recognized board of examination</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ryovs\" data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"545\">Candidates <strong data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"465\">appearing for Class 12 are also eligible to apply</strong>, subject to meeting final qualification requirements at the time of admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n77qvz\" data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"683\">Students from <strong data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"594\">NIOS board are also eligible</strong>, provided they have passed the required qualifying examination from a recognized board</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)--448495 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"511\">The B.Sc. in Hotel Management program is designed to prepare students for dynamic careers in the global hospitality industry. It focuses on building strong operational knowledge, service excellence, and managerial skills required to work in hotels, resorts, restaurants, airlines, cruise lines, and international hospitality brands. The curriculum blends academic learning with extensive practical training to ensure students gain real-world exposure alongside theoretical understanding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"697\">The program follows a structured learning approach where students gradually progress from core hospitality fundamentals to advanced management concepts and industry-based applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"702\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rqbxse\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"726\">Core Learning Areas</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"1999\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14fdaws\" data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"863\"><strong data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"760\">Food Production Techniques</strong><br data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"763\">Learning culinary fundamentals, kitchen operations, hygiene standards, and international cuisines.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f9ljo1\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"1004\"><strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"905\">Food &amp; Beverage Service Operations</strong><br data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"908\">Understanding restaurant service styles, guest handling, menu planning, and service etiquette.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kgvhy4\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1142\"><strong data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1035\">Front Office Management</strong><br data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1038\">Training in guest reception, reservation systems, check-in/check-out procedures, and customer service.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"60ajz9\" data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1274\"><strong data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1173\">Housekeeping Operations</strong><br data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1176\">Learning cleanliness standards, room maintenance, laundry operations, and hotel hygiene systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o1u81w\" data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1380\"><strong data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1306\">Accommodation Management</strong><br data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1309\">Managing rooms division, guest comfort services, and property upkeep.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h4jsmr\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1506\"><strong data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1410\">Hospitality Accounting</strong><br data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1413\">Understanding financial records, billing systems, budgeting, and basic hospitality finance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr0mj6\" data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1635\"><strong data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1554\">Human Resource Management in Hospitality</strong><br data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1557\">Developing skills in staff management, training, and workplace coordination.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v6sb6m\" data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1766\"><strong data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1667\">Marketing in Hospitality</strong><br data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1670\">Learning promotion strategies, branding, and customer engagement in tourism and hotel sectors.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p2vqhg\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1885\"><strong data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1800\">Event &amp; Banquet Management</strong><br data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1803\">Planning and executing events, conferences, weddings, and hospitality functions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y9gv8c\" data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1999\"><strong data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1908\">Tourism Studies</strong><br data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1911\">Understanding travel industry structure, destination management, and tourism services.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zex84n\" data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"419\"><strong data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"321\">Hotel Manager</strong> &ndash; Manages overall hotel operations and ensures smooth functioning with high guest satisfaction.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3uja6v\" data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"549\"><strong data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"451\">Food and Beverage Manager</strong> &ndash; Handles restaurants, bars, and catering services, ensuring quality service and profitability.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"52jme0\" data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"679\"><strong data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"576\">Front Office Manager</strong> &ndash; Supervises reception, reservations, and guest relations to maintain excellent customer experience.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s2zvca\" data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"786\"><strong data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"699\">Event Manager</strong> &ndash; Plans and executes weddings, conferences, corporate events, and special functions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"altinh\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"901\"><strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"820\">Sales and Marketing Manager</strong> &ndash; Promotes hotel services, builds brand value, and increases business revenue.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1boe48o\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"1016\"><strong data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"923\">Revenue Manager</strong> &ndash; Focuses on pricing strategies, occupancy management, and maximizing hotel profitability.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f47ypv\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1134\"><strong data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1043\">Housekeeping Manager</strong> &ndash; Ensures cleanliness, hygiene standards, and maintenance of hotel rooms and facilities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"352ar7\" data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1253\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1167\">Travel and Tourism Manager</strong> &ndash; Manages travel services, tourism operations, and customer travel planning services.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>The program provides <strong data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1110\">placement assistance and career guidance</strong> to help students transition into the hospitality industry. Students are guided for interviews, grooming, communication development, and professional readiness. Placement opportunities are generally offered in hotels, resorts, airlines, cruise lines, and other hospitality sectors. The focus is on preparing students for entry-level professional roles in reputed hospitality organizations.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"116\",\"117\",\"118\",\"119\"]', 3.8, '<p>The curriculum is supported by strong <strong data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"661\">industry interaction and exposure activities</strong>. Students gain learning opportunities through guest lectures, workshops, and industrial visits to leading hospitality establishments. These interactions help students understand current industry trends, operational challenges, and global service expectations. Such exposure bridges the gap between classroom learning and real-world hospitality practic</p>', '<p data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"528\">The program includes <strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"102\">mandatory industrial training/internship</strong>, designed to give students real exposure to professional hospitality environments. Students work in hotels, resorts, or related hospitality organizations where they observe and participate in daily operations. This training helps them understand service standards, guest handling, and departmental functioning in real-time settings. It also builds discipline, communication skills, and confidence required for industry roles.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 448495.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(81, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'b6b6029a-4a58-4797-80fb-6d2482bd4e36', 123, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-25 04:19:46', '2026-04-07 04:36:21', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(82, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '99453965-8696-453e-9a76-1e5899055426', 124, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-25 06:27:59', '2026-04-07 01:00:55', '<p>Admission is offered through a <strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"77\">merit-based system</strong>, where candidates are shortlisted based on their <strong data-start=\"127\" data-end=\"151\">Class 12 performance</strong>. Since there is no entrance exam, academic scores play a key role in selection</p>', 1, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0d3e9ba6-f060-4cf8-9571-5a77e0e2c189-37\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-68\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"046e9e5f-0ae4-499e-8fba-94b2455eaf0d\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"600\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"om12q6\" data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"363\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"322\">passed or be appearing for Class 12</strong> in any stream from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cnt38r\" data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"447\">Students from <strong data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"410\">Science, Commerce, or Arts</strong> backgrounds are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m8pb4m\" data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"529\"><strong data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"497\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> candidates are also eligible.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m1jmk1\" data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"600\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Final selection is <strong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"569\">based on merit</strong>, as decided by the university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-314122 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"175\">The program is designed to build a <strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"102\">strong foundation in sociology first</strong>, and then gradually develop <strong data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"174\">advanced research and analytical skills</strong>.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"890\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ibry34\" data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"315\"><strong data-start=\"179\" data-end=\"206\">Foundation Years (1&ndash;3):</strong> Introduction to core areas like Sociology, Sociological Theories, critical thinking, and academic writing.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e3z8va\" data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"444\"><strong data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"344\">Understanding Society:</strong> Study social, cultural, economic, political, environmental, and psychological aspects of society.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"81l895\" data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"556\"><strong data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"474\">Concept-Based Learning:</strong> Use of case studies and examples to understand theories in real-world contexts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vo61gy\" data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"666\"><strong data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"591\">Research Skills Development:</strong> Learn basics of research, analysis, and interpretation of social issues.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"czerm7\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"778\"><strong data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"708\">Advanced Research Focus (4th Year):</strong> Specialize in research-oriented subjects like Research Methodology.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bdb0yj\" data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"890\"><strong data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"798\">Dissertation:</strong> Mandatory research project to develop independent thinking and practical research skills.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c069m1\" data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"140\"><strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"49\">Policy Analyst:</strong> Study social issues and evaluate policies to suggest improvements for better governance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hjmpul\" data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"253\"><strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"161\">Criminologist:</strong> Work with law enforcement or research bodies to understand crime patterns and prevention.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19byf4b\" data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"359\"><strong data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"275\">CSR Specialist:</strong> Help companies implement ethical practices and social responsibility initiatives.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fp2w43\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"489\"><strong data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"403\">International Development Specialist:</strong> Work on global projects to improve living conditions and address social challenges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aamjff\" data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"612\"><strong data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"520\">Non-Profit Professional:</strong> Contribute to NGOs and social organizations working on community development and welfare.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6hgbjb\" data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"725\"><strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"633\">HR Specialist:</strong> Manage recruitment, employee relations, and workplace culture using social understanding.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fhijpm\" data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"834\"><strong data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"746\">Urban Planner:</strong> Plan cities and communities by understanding how people live and interact in society.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1myrtu1\" data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"934\"><strong data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"859\">Survey Researcher:</strong> Collect and analyze data to understand public opinion and social trends.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tpv0pu\" data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1053\"><strong data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"967\">Rehabilitation Counsellor:</strong> Support individuals in overcoming personal or social difficulties through guidance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ms5vk\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1146\"><strong data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1071\">Journalist:</strong> Report and analyze social issues with a strong understanding of society.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l23cif\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1253\"><strong data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1167\">Social Worker:</strong> Help individuals and communities solve social problems and improve quality of life.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ouawf9\" data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1373\"><strong data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1278\">Family Counsellor:</strong> Provide guidance to families and individuals to resolve conflicts and improve relationships.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d6v0v1\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1489\"><strong data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1398\">Diversity Manager:</strong> Promote inclusive workplace practices and manage diversity initiatives in organizations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k227e4\" data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1619\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1519\">Civil Services Officer:</strong> Prepare for government roles where understanding society helps in policy-making and administration.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 314122.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(83, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '99453965-8696-453e-9a76-1e5899055426', 125, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-26 00:02:48', '2026-04-07 01:13:24', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"263\">Admission is offered through a <strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"88\">merit-based selection process</strong>, where candidates are shortlisted based on their <strong data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"157\">Class 12 scores</strong>. Since there is no entrance exam, strong academic performance plays an important role in securing a seat.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"is7nrs\" data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"291\">&nbsp;</h3>', 1, '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"om12q6\" data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"395\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"354\">passed or be appearing for Class 12</strong> in any stream from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jobzcb\" data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"479\">Students from <strong data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"454\">Science, Commerce, or Arts backgrounds</strong> are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m8pb4m\" data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"561\"><strong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"529\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> candidates are also eligible.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15d8lva\" data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"635\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Final selection is <strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"601\">based on merit</strong>, as determined by the university.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>TOTAL FEE -388424 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 24.8718%;\"><col style=\"width: 24.8718%;\"><col style=\"width: 24.8718%;\"><col style=\"width: 24.8718%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>ONE TIME PAYABLE</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>ADMISSION FEE - 10000</td>\r\n<td>ENROLMENT FEE- 5000</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>OTHER CHARGES</td>\r\n<td>YEARLY PAYMENT-18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>YEARLY PAYMENT-9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"193\">The program is structured to first build a <strong data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"118\">strong foundation in literature and language</strong>, and then gradually move towards <strong data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"192\">advanced research and specialization</strong>.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"995\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"efvhjg\" data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"361\"><strong data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"224\">Foundation Years (1&ndash;3):</strong> Study core areas like English literature, literary theory, criticism, and academic writing to develop strong conceptual understanding.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eq4g3x\" data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"493\"><strong data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"395\">Language &amp; Literary Skills:</strong> Improve reading, interpretation, and writing skills through analysis of diverse literary texts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oha2kb\" data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"630\"><strong data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"529\">Critical Thinking &amp; Analysis:</strong> Learn how to evaluate texts, form arguments, and express ideas clearly in written and verbal form.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ficcto\" data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"747\"><strong data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"665\">Research Skills Development:</strong> Introduction to research techniques, academic writing, and structured analysis.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gg4niz\" data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"862\"><strong data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"789\">Advanced Research Focus (4th Year):</strong> Specialize in research-oriented subjects such as Research Methodology.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12gqt92\" data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"995\"><strong data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"882\">Dissertation:</strong> Complete an independent research project to apply analytical and research skills in a chosen area of interest.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yxx4y7\" data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"140\"><strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"48\">Writer/Editor:</strong> Create, edit, and refine content for books, magazines, newspapers, and digital platforms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bngehn\" data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"250\"><strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"167\">Teacher/Academician:</strong> Teach English language, literature, or creative writing in schools and colleges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m85tl\" data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"358\"><strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"287\">Advertising &amp; PR Professional:</strong> Develop marketing content and manage brand communication strategies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3vdcmm\" data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"470\"><strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"385\">Journalist/Reporter:</strong> Cover news, write reports, and present stories across print, TV, and online media.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ocrxdx\" data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"581\"><strong data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"493\">Content Creator:</strong> Produce engaging content for websites, social media, and digital marketing platforms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1szmib0\" data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"676\"><strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"607\">Legal Professional:</strong> Move into law by using strong analytical and communication skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f52e6v\" data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"780\"><strong data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"706\">Civil Services Officer:</strong> Prepare for government exams like UPSC or PSC for administrative roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vb5z3q\" data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"888\"><strong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"806\">Content Researcher:</strong> Research and develop content ideas for media, publishing, or digital platforms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oberg\" data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"981\"><strong data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"923\">Academic Research Assistant:</strong> Assist in literary or language-based research projects.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1khgubg\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1081\"><strong data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1010\">Linguistic Researcher:</strong> Study language patterns, structure, and usage in different contexts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yi40g\" data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1161\"><strong data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1105\">Literary Analyst:</strong> Analyze literary works and provide critical insights.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kmliw2\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1265\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1198\">Publishing Research Assistant:</strong> Support publishing houses in content evaluation and research work.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"64\"]', 3.8, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 388424.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
