(87, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 129, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-26 04:27:32', '2026-04-06 00:14:49', '<p data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"211\">Admission is granted based on <strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"94\">merit in the qualifying examination</strong>. Candidates are shortlisted according to their performance in Class 12, as per the criteria set by the university.</p>', 1, '<p>Candidates must have&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"300\">passed Class 12 in any stream</strong> from a recognized board. Students from <strong data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"376\">Commerce, Science, or Humanities</strong> backgrounds are eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"606\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"458\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are also eligible. Candidates from <strong data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"541\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> or other recognized boards are eligible as per university norms.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-428227 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"395\">The B.Voc (Accounting &amp; Finance) curriculum is designed to align with the dynamic needs of the <strong data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"170\">BFSI (Banking, Financial Services &amp; Insurance) sector</strong>, offering a balanced mix of academic knowledge and industry-oriented training. Alongside core subjects inspired by <strong data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"311\">BBA and B.Com (Hons.)</strong>, the program integrates <strong data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"392\">industry-recognized certifications in every semester</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"611\">By the end of the fifth semester, students gain <strong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"485\">multiple professional certifications</strong>, strengthening their practical skills and improving employability before entering the final phase of training or placement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"677\">The program offers a well-rounded learning experience through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"1253\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ccqk6w\" data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"781\"><strong data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"707\">Core Academic Subjects</strong> &ndash; Building fundamentals in finance, accounting, and business management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ofwfh7\" data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"894\"><strong data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"811\">Industry Certifications</strong> &ndash; Covering areas like banking, stock markets, and accounting tools (e.g., Tally)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a38awb\" data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"1006\"><strong data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"921\">Study Tours &amp; Visits</strong> &ndash; Exposure to financial institutions such as stock exchanges and regulatory bodies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3qyyif\" data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1097\"><strong data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1031\">Practical Training</strong> &ndash; On-the-job training and internships for real-world experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fy5iob\" data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1253\"><strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1149\">Higher Education &amp; Competitive Exam Readiness</strong> &ndash; Eligibility for exams like CA, CS, SSC, UPSC, and progression to MBA or other postgraduate programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1441\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, the curriculum ensures a strong blend of <strong data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1381\">theoretical learning, professional certification, and practical exposure</strong>, preparing students for both employment and higher studies&nbsp;</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-21\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-38\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assi