p data.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qgzn0j\" data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"614\"><strong data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"545\">HR / People Analytics Associate</strong> &ndash; Use data to improve workforce planning and employee performance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qyyxcq\" data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"698\"><strong data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"639\">Operations Analyst</strong> &ndash; Enhance business processes and operational efficiency.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n3pr5o\" data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"809\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"739\">Financial / Data Reporting Analyst</strong> &ndash; Prepare reports and dashboards for financial and business analysis.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"261\">The program features an <strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"139\">industry-led curriculum developed in collaboration with GT Bharat practitioners</strong>, ensuring alignment with current trends in <strong data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"258\">analytics, business consulting, AI adoption, and digital transformation</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"562\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students gain strong industry exposure through <strong data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"428\">workshops, professional mentoring, case study competitions, live projects using real datasets, and industry visits</strong>. These initiatives bridge the gap between academic learning and real-world business applications, enhancing overall career readiness.</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-tu