(91, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 132, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-26 05:17:07', '2026-04-06 01:09:29', '<p>Admission is granted based on <strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"105\">merit in the qualifying examination (Class 12)</strong>. Candidates are shortlisted according to their academic performance as per the university&rsquo;s selection criteria.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"335\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"308\">passed Class 12 in any stream</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"537\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"380\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are also eligible to apply. Candidates from <strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"472\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> or other recognized boards are eligible as per university norms.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-722057 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">** An additional fee of Rs. 22000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for ACCA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"381\">The curriculum is designed to integrate <strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"106\">business strategy with emerging technologies</strong>, equipping students with both analytical and managerial capabilities. It covers key domains such as <strong data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"289\">business analysis, data science, machine learning, and enterprise architecture</strong>, enabling students to solve complex business problems using technology-driven approaches.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"581\">Students also gain knowledge of <strong data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"463\">software development methodologies and tools</strong> including Agile, Waterfall, and DevOps, along with insights into <strong data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"578\">global business practices and market dynamics</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"844\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The program further emphasizes <strong data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"714\">marketing principles, regulatory frameworks, and ethical considerations in emerging technologies</strong> like AI and blockchain, ensuring students are prepared to operate effectively in a rapidly evolving digital business environment.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fy289x\" data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"219\"><strong data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"152\">Data Analyst</strong> &ndash; Interpret data to identify trends and support decision-making.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ash9m\" data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"306\"><strong data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"242\">Business Analyst</strong> &ndash; Translate business requirements into data-driven solutions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i6czca\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"395\"><strong data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"330\">Marketing Analyst</strong> &ndash; Analyze customer behavior and optimize marketing strategies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lgwrlv\" data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"477\"><strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"416\">Data Scientist</strong> &ndash; Build models and extract insights from complex datasets.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14itw0e\" data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"572\"><strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"509\">Machine Learning Engineer</strong> &ndash; Develop and deploy predictive algorithms and AI solutions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eehvo9\" data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"666\"><strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"608\">Business Intelligence Analyst</strong> &ndash; Create dashboards and reports for strategic insights.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4uuhvl\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"751\"><strong data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"693\">Analytics Consultant</strong> &ndash; Provide data-driven recommendations to organizations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aqyehf\" data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"845\"><strong data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"783\">Digital Marketing Manager</strong> &ndash; Lead online marketing campaigns and performance analysis.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tovmq5\" data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"936\"><strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"869\">Financial Analyst</strong> &ndash; Evaluate financial data for planning and investment decisions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m46whb\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1025\"><strong data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"961\">Operations Manager</strong> &ndash; Improve processes and ensure efficient business operations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hhj1vh\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1117\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1047\">Project Manager</strong> &ndash; Plan, execute, and manage projects to achieve organizational goals.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\",\"35\",\"140\",\"141\",\"143\"]', 4.0, NULL, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-36\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-68\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative fle