enue growth.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g3rgsl\" data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"698\"><strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"639\">Business Development Manager</strong> &ndash; Identify opportunities and expand business operations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i0b9gf\" data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"772\"><strong data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"720\">Project Manager</strong> &ndash; Plan, execute, and manage projects efficiently.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d8vqw1\" data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"868\"><strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"806\">Financial Analyst / Manager</strong> &ndash; Handle financial planning, analysis, and decision-making.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hplml\" data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"965\"><strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"894\">Social Entrepreneur</strong> &ndash; Build ventures focused on social impact and community development.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1665uhu\" data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1054\"><strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"990\">Non-profit Manager</strong> &ndash; Manage operations and programs in non-profit organizations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ozi9bd\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1135\"><strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1079\">Innovation Manager</strong> &ndash; Drive new ideas, products, and business strategies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"178sj6c\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1226\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1160\">E-commerce Manager</strong> &ndash; Oversee online business operations and digital sales platforms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]',