er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(97, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 138, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-26 06:26:54', '2026-04-06 03:02:28', '<p>Admission is granted through a merit-based evaluation of the candidate&rsquo;s performance in the qualifying examination. The university prepares the selection list after reviewing academic results as per its admission policy.</p>', 1, '<p>Applicants must have completed Class XII or an equivalent qualification from a recognized board. Students from any stream are eligible to apply, including those who are currently appearing for their Class XII examinations and candidates from NIOS, subject to meeting the required academic standards.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-722057 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">** An additional fee of Rs. 22000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for ACCA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-60\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-116\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"a0494939-b800-4d02-b8fe-b193ae527db3\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"244\">The program builds a strong foundation in business studies by introducing key areas such as accounting, finance, economics, and organizational behavior, helping students understand how modern organizations function and grow.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"474\">It also focuses on advanced digital marketing practices, including search engine optimization (SEO), social media marketing, email marketing, content creation, and mobile marketing strategies used in today&rsquo;s digital ecosystem.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"653\">Students are trained in market research techniques and data interpretation, enabling them to evaluate trends and make informed business decisions based on analytical insights.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"839\">The curriculum further introduces the fundamentals of e-commerce, covering online marketplaces, digital payment systems, and logistics operations that support online business models.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"1023\">Brand development is also an important component, where learners understand how to create, position, and manage brand identity and communication effectively in competitive markets.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1214\">In addition, students gain knowledge of web analytics tools such as Google Analytics, helping them track performance metrics and optimize digital marketing campaigns using real-time data.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1403\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Practical exposure is ensured through internships and capstone projects, allowing students to apply theoretical knowledge to real-world digital marketing scenarios and industry practices.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-61\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-118\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"f0523cea-5412-44eb-b77d-33316f41d5b1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"209\">Digital Marketing Manager: Responsible for planning and executing digital marketing strategies to promote products and services online while coordinating and guiding a marketing team.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"400\">Social Media Manager: Handles brand presence across social platforms by creating content, managing accounts, engaging audiences, and analyzing performance to improve reach and engagement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"584\">SEO Specialist: Works on improving website visibility on search engines by optimizing content, analyzing traffic patterns, and implementing strategies to increase organic rankings.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"767\">Content Marketing Manager: Develops and manages content-driven campaigns, evaluates performance metrics, and creates strategies to enhance audience engagement and brand awareness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"937\">E-Commerce Manager: Oversees online business operations, manages digital sales platforms, and formulates strategies to improve online revenue and customer experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1131\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Digital Advertising Manager: Plans and manages online advertising campaigns, monitors performance data, and optimizes strategies to maximize advertising effectiveness and return on investment.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\",\"35\",\"141\",\"143\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 722057.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(98, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 139, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-26 06:51:06', '2026-04-06 03:09:42', '<p>Admission is determined through a merit evaluation based on the candidate&rsquo;s performance in the qualifying examination. Selection is made after assessing academic records as per university guidelines.</p>', 1, '<p>Applicants must have successfully completed Class XII or an equivalent qualification from a recognized board. Candidates from any stream are eligible to apply, including those currently appearing for their Class XII examinations and applicants from NIOS, subject to fulfillment of the required academic standards.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-722057 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">** An additional fee of Rs. 22000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for ACCA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"398\">This program integrates the <strong data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"103\">ACCA (Association of Chartered Certified Accountants)</strong> curriculum, providing students with a strong opportunity to pursue an internationally recognized professional qualification alongside their undergraduate studies. This dual advantage helps learners build global-level competence in accounting, finance, and management during the course itself.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"734\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">ACCA is a globally recognized professional body for accountants that offers industry-relevant qualifications designed for individuals with strong academic ability and career ambition. It focuses on developing expertise in accounting, finance, and management, preparing students for professional roles in global financial environments.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-64\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-124\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"1e4f8628-48a8-431f-8b48-08c79705d609\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"205\">Financial Analyst: Responsible for examining financial data, identifying trends, and providing insights and recommendations to support business and individual financial decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"378\">Accountant: Manages financial records, prepares financial statements, and ensures accuracy in reporting along with compliance to taxation rules and regulatory standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"537\">Auditor: Reviews and verifies financial documents and accounts to ensure correctness, transparency, and adherence to accounting principles and regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"675\">Tax Consultant: Provides expert guidance on taxation matters, including tax planning, filing, and compliance with applicable tax laws.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"853\">Financial Manager: Oversees financial planning and control activities such as budgeting, forecasting, reporting, and overall financial decision-making within an organization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"1012\">Investment Banker: Assists clients with capital raising, investment planning, and financial advisory services for business expansion and wealth management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1157\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Risk Manager: Identifies, assesses, and manages financial and operational risks to protect organizations and individuals from potential losses.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\",\"35\",\"141\",\"143\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 722057.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(99, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 140, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-26 06:58:36', '2026-04-06 03:31:53', '<p>Admission is carried out through a merit-based evaluation of the candidate&rsquo;s performance in the qualifying examination. Final selection is made after reviewing academic merit as per university admission standards.</p>', 1, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-65\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-126\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"97eb6835-c00e-459b-bf4d-2d0078b3f8b2\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"569\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Applicants must have successfully completed Class XII or an equivalent qualification from a recognized board. Students from all streams are eligible to apply, including those currently appearing for their Class XII examinations and candidates from NIOS, subject to meeting the prescribed academic requirements.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-592556 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">* An additional fee of Rs. 17000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for CMA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">** An additional fee of Rs. 22000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for ACCA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">*** An additional fee of Rs. 25000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for CPA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"385\">The B.Com (Hons) program is structured to build a strong academic base in commerce and business studies while gradually advancing toward specialization. In the initial stage of the course, students are introduced to fundamental concepts of business, accounting principles, and financial systems, helping them develop core understanding of how organizations operate.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"633\">As the program progresses, learners gain deeper insights into key business areas such as marketing strategies, human resource management, and other functional domains of business operations, strengthening their analytical and managerial skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"864\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In the final phase of the program, students are given the opportunity to focus on a specialized area of interest, allowing them to develop expertise and prepare for advanced academic or professional careers in their chosen field.</p>', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"163\">Accountant: Handles financial records, prepares statements, and ensures accuracy in accounting and compliance with financial regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"302\">Financial Analyst: Evaluates financial data, studies market trends, and provides insights to support investment and business decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"434\">Investment Banker: Advises organizations on raising capital, mergers, acquisitions, and investment-related financial strategies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"572\">Corporate Lawyer: Deals with legal matters related to businesses, including contracts, compliance, corporate governance, and disputes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"706\">Management Consultant: Analyzes business problems and provides strategic solutions to improve efficiency, growth, and performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"845\">Market Research Analyst: Studies market conditions, customer behavior, and industry trends to support marketing and business decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"973\">Human Resource Manager: Manages recruitment, employee relations, training, and workforce development within an organization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1100\">Financial Manager: Oversees budgeting, forecasting, financial planning, and overall monetary management of an organization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1226\">Risk Manager: Identifies and evaluates potential financial and operational risks and develops strategies to minimize them.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1352\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Business Analyst: Analyzes business processes and requirements to recommend improvements and support better decision-making.</p>', '<p data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"330\">The B.Com (Honours) program is supported by strong career outcomes, as graduates are well-prepared to meet the demands of modern business organizations across various sectors. The curriculum is designed to enhance employability by developing both theoretical understanding and practical business skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"619\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students gain exposure to industry-relevant learning that improves their readiness for professional roles in areas such as finance, accounting, and business management. This ensures they are equipped to begin their careers with confidence and adapt effectively to corporate environments.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 592556.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
