r-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">*** An additional fee of Rs. 25000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for CPA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-88\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-172\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"8bc3edf3-e960-4aa9-8910-6f833b0de7bb\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"390\">B.Com (Hons) in Corporate Accounting and Financial Analysis is designed to provide an advanced understanding of corporate accounting systems and financial analysis techniques. The program builds strong conceptual clarity in accounting principles, financial reporting, auditing, and taxation, enabling students to interpret and analyze complex financial data effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"676\">The curriculum integrates preparation for the Certified Management Accountant (CMA), USA certification, a globally recognized credential in management accounting. This enhances professional competence and improves global employability prospects in the finance and accounting sector.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"990\">A strong research-oriented framework is embedded throughout the program, focusing on analytical thinking, financial research methodologies, and data interpretation skills. Students are trained to make evidence-based financial and business decisions through structured research projects and case-based learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1240\">The program also provides in-depth exposure to corporate financial practices, including financial statement consolidation, corporate transactions, and accounting aspects of mergers and acquisitions, strengthening practical industry understanding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1436\">Students who successfully complete the B.Com (Hons) with Research pathway become eligible for direct admission into a one-year M.Com program, ensuring a seamless progression to higher studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1722\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The research-driven structure of the program also supports academic advancement, enabling eligible graduates (with a minimum of 75% marks) to pursue Ph.D. directly, while others can transition through a mandatory M.Com route, preparing them for advanced academic and research careers.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"198\">Management Consultant: Works with organizations to analyze business problems and develop effective strategies to improve efficiency, profitability, and overall performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"357\">Financial Planner: Helps individuals and businesses plan their finances by creating strategies for investments, savings, retirement, and wealth management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"513\">Internal Auditor: Evaluates internal financial systems and processes of an organization to ensure accuracy, efficiency, and compliance with regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"674\">Management Accountant: Supports managerial decision-making by preparing financial reports, analyzing costs, and providing budgeting and performance insights.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"820\">Investment Manager: Manages investment portfolios for clients or institutions, focusing on maximizing returns while balancing financial risks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"982\">Corporate Accountant: Handles financial reporting, bookkeeping, and compliance activities within corporate organizations to ensure accurate financial records.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1130\">Investment Banker: Assists companies in raising capital, managing mergers and acquisitions, and providing strategic financial advisory services.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1271\">Financial Analyst: Analyzes financial data, market trends, and company performance to support investment decisions and business planning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1411\">Risk Manager: Identifies potential financial and operational risks and develops strategies to minimize their impact on the organization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1579\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Company Secretary: Ensures legal compliance, corporate governance, and regulatory adherence while managing statutory and administrative responsibilities of a company.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 592556.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
