(106, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 147, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 01:31:36', '2026-04-06 04:56:22', '<p>Admission is conducted on the basis of merit, which is determined through the candidate&rsquo;s performance in the qualifying examination. Final selection is made as per the university&rsquo;s merit evaluation process.</p>', 1, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-89\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-174\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"6d86b30b-16b3-4d7a-94be-2bf95e9d5a09\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"517\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Candidates must have successfully completed Class XII from a recognized board. Applicants from any stream are eligible to apply, including those currently appearing for their Class XII examinations, as well as candidates from NIOS or equivalent recognized boards.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-592556 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">* An additional fee of Rs. 17000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for CMA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">** An additional fee of Rs. 22000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for ACCA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">*** An additional fee of Rs. 25000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for CPA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-91\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-178\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"6d972fbb-ed13-4206-ab44-5ffdb07f5067\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"434\">B.Com. (Hons) International Finance and Accounting with ACCA, UK with Research is designed to provide a strong academic foundation in accounting, finance, and global business practices. The program integrates core principles of international finance with advanced accounting concepts, enabling students to build analytical, critical thinking, and problem-solving abilities essential for the modern financial world.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"830\">A key highlight of the curriculum is the complete integration of the ACCA (Association of Chartered Certified Accountants), UK qualification, allowing students to pursue their degree and professional certification simultaneously. Students receive exemptions in up to 9 out of 13 ACCA papers, significantly accelerating their pathway toward becoming a globally recognized finance professional.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"1255\">The program offers multiple exit and qualification milestones. On completion of three Fundamental ACCA papers, students are eligible to earn the Advanced Diploma in Accounting and Business from ACCA, UK. Additionally, students may also obtain a Certificate in IFRS (International Financial Reporting Standards) upon successfully clearing the relevant examination, enhancing their expertise in global accounting standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1446\">The curriculum follows a blended learning approach, combining academic teaching with professional certification training, ensuring both theoretical depth and practical industry relevance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1655\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, the program enhances global career opportunities in finance and accounting, as ACCA is recognized in over 180 countries, including India, making graduates highly employable in international markets.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-90\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-176\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"b366c39a-50ec-49e4-91b0-08f05ce47e83\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"209\">Investment Banking: Involves raising capital for organizations, managing mergers and acquisitions, and providing strategic financial advisory services for large-scale corporate deals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"374\">Risk Management: Focuses on identifying, analyzing, and mitigating financial and operational risks to ensure stability and sustainability of business operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"537\">Financial Planning and Analysis: Deals with budgeting, forecasting, financial modeling, and performance analysis to support strategic business decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"694\">Corporate Finance: Involves managing a company&rsquo;s capital structure, investment decisions, and long-term financial planning to maximize shareholder value.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"875\">Financial Technology (FinTech): Works with digital financial systems, online banking solutions, payment platforms, and innovative technologies transforming the finance industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1026\">Tax Services: Includes tax planning, preparation, and compliance services for individuals and organizations in accordance with applicable tax laws.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1176\">Compliance and Regulatory Affairs: Ensures that organizations follow financial regulations, legal standards, and industry compliance requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1323\">Government Accounting: Manages public funds, budgeting, and financial reporting within government organizations and public sector institutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1471\">Audit Services: Involves examining financial records to ensure accuracy, transparency, and compliance with accounting standards and regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1627\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Forensic Accounting: Applies accounting, auditing, and investigative skills to detect fraud, financial misconduct, and discrepancies in financial records.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 592556.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(107, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 148, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 01:46:03', '2026-04-06 05:27:44', '<p>Admission is finalized through a merit-based system, where selection is made by evaluating the candidate&rsquo;s performance in the qualifying examination. The university prepares a merit list and allocates seats accordingly, ensuring fair selection based on academic performance.</p>', 1, '<p>Applicants must have completed Class XII from a recognized board in any stream. Students who are currently <strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"474\">appearing for Class XII examinations</strong> are also eligible to apply, provided they meet the required academic standards at the time of final admission. Candidates from the <strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"655\">NIOS board or any equivalent recognized board</strong> are equally eligible to apply.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-592556 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">* An additional fee of Rs. 17000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for CMA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">** An additional fee of Rs. 22000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for ACCA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">*** An additional fee of Rs. 25000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for CPA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-100\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-196\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"a3de9cd6-aa08-4d1f-aec0-38754950deca\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"333\">This 3-year B.Com (Hons) program in Accounting, Auditing, and Taxation is designed to build strong expertise in financial systems and business reporting. It focuses on developing a deep understanding of how organizations manage accounts, ensure compliance, and handle taxation in real business environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"859\">Students are trained in core areas such as <strong data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"411\">Corporate Financial Reporting</strong>, where they learn how financial statements are prepared and interpreted, and <strong data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"523\">Advanced Management Accounting</strong>, which focuses on cost control, budgeting, and internal financial decision-making. The curriculum also includes <strong data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"657\">Advanced Auditing</strong>, helping students understand how financial records are examined for accuracy and compliance, along with <strong data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"783\">Advanced Taxation</strong>, which covers direct and indirect tax laws and their practical application.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1219\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In addition, the program introduces <strong data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"916\">Business Ethics</strong>, ensuring students understand professional responsibility and ethical decision-making in financial practices. Alongside technical subjects, students also build essential skills in analysis, problem-solving, and communication, which are crucial for success in accounting, auditing, and taxation careers.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"982\"><strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"627\">Professional Accounting &amp; Certification Path</strong><br data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"630\">Students can pursue globally recognized qualifications such as <strong data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"800\">CA (Chartered Accountant), CPA (Certified Public Accountant), and CMA (Certified Management Accountant)</strong>. These roles focus on advanced accounting, auditing, financial reporting, and strategic cost management, making professionals highly valued in both Indian and international markets.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1268\"><strong data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1022\">Corporate Finance &amp; Business Roles</strong><br data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1025\">In corporate organizations, graduates can work as <strong data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1133\">Accounting Managers or Corporate Finance Professionals</strong>, where they handle budgeting, financial planning, performance analysis, and support key business decisions that impact company growth.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1545\"><strong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1310\">Banking, Investment &amp; Market Careers</strong><br data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1313\">Fields like <strong data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1370\">Investment Banking and Financial Analysis</strong> involve studying markets, evaluating investment opportunities, and helping companies raise funds or make profitable financial decisions in competitive financial environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1825\"><strong data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1579\">Audit, Taxation &amp; Compliance</strong><br data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1582\">Roles such as <strong data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1628\">Auditors and Tax Consultants</strong> focus on ensuring financial accuracy, compliance with tax laws, and proper reporting. These professionals play an important role in preventing errors, fraud, and legal issues in financial systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"2062\"><strong data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1857\">Strategic &amp; Advisory Roles</strong><br data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1860\">Students can also grow into <strong data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1914\">Management Consultants</strong>, where they work with companies to solve business problems, improve efficiency, and design long-term growth strategies based on financial insights.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p>Students are introduced to current industry practices through real-world projects, case studies, and expert guest lectures. This helps them understand how financial and accounting concepts are applied in today&rsquo;s business environment and keeps them updated with evolving industry trends.</p>', '<p>The program includes structured internships and workshops that provide hands-on experience in core areas such as accounting, auditing, and taxation. This practical training helps students develop job-ready skills and understand professional workplace requirements.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 592556.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(108, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 149, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 01:54:32', '2026-04-06 05:40:13', '<p>Admission to the program is based on merit, which is prepared using the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. Selection is done through a merit evaluation system, ensuring that students are admitted based on academic performance.</p>', 1, '<p>Candidates must have passed Class XII from a recognized board in any stream. Students who are <strong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"434\">currently appearing for Class XII examinations</strong> are also eligible to apply, subject to meeting the final eligibility requirements at the time of admission. Applicants from the <strong data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"612\">NIOS board or any equivalent recognized board</strong> are equally eligible.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-592556 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">* An additional fee of Rs. 17000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for CMA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">** An additional fee of Rs. 22000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for ACCA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">*** An additional fee of Rs. 25000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for CPA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-104\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-204\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"d5811112-ebac-4853-b69d-444883b48578\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"429\">This B.Com (Hons) Corporate Accounting and Financial Analysis with CMA (USA) program is structured to build strong expertise in accounting, finance, and corporate decision-making. It covers key subjects such as financial accounting, cost accounting, corporate accounting, financial management, auditing, and company law, helping students develop a complete understanding of financial systems used in businesses.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"740\">The program is closely aligned with the <strong data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"517\">CMA (Certified Management Accountant), USA</strong> curriculum, allowing students to gain in-depth knowledge of global management accounting standards alongside their graduation studies. This integrated approach strengthens both academic learning and professional readiness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"954\">Students also benefit from experienced faculty members who provide focused academic support, guidance, and mentoring to help them perform well in both university examinations and professional certification exams.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1186\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, the curriculum is designed not only to build conceptual clarity in corporate accounting and financial analysis but also to prepare students effectively for the CMA examination and future careers in finance and accounting.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"645\"><strong data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"527\">Management Consultant:</strong> Works with organizations to improve business performance by analyzing problems and suggesting effective strategies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"762\"><strong data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"669\">Financial Planner:</strong> Helps individuals and businesses plan savings, investments, and long-term financial goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"897\"><strong data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"785\">Internal Auditor:</strong> Examines financial records and internal systems to ensure accuracy and compliance with rules and regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"1026\"><strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"925\">Management Accountant:</strong> Prepares financial reports and cost analyses to support internal decision-making in organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1157\"><strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1051\">Investment Manager:</strong> Manages investment portfolios and makes decisions to maximize returns while controlling financial risk.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1268\"><strong data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1184\">Corporate Accountant:</strong> Handles accounting records, financial statements, and reporting within a company.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1380\"><strong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1292\">Investment Banker:</strong> Assists companies in raising funds, mergers, acquisitions, and major financial deals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1493\"><strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1404\">Financial Analyst:</strong> Studies financial data and market trends to support business and investment decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1605\"><strong data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1512\">Risk Manager:</strong> Identifies financial and operational risks and develops strategies to reduce their impact.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1724\"><strong data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1629\">Company Secretary:</strong> Ensures legal compliance, corporate governance, and proper execution of company regulations.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3.9, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 592556.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
