(109, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '1e2d218c-0f15-425e-b1e8-05886e1d0d8f', 150, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"14\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 02:04:09', '2026-04-06 23:34:49', '<p>Admission is based on merit, which is prepared using the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. Candidates are shortlisted and selected according to their academic performance as per university norms.</p>', 1, '<p>Applicants must have passed Class XII from a recognized board in any stream. Students who are <strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"404\">currently appearing for Class XII examinations</strong> are also eligible to apply, subject to meeting final eligibility at the time of admission. Candidates from <strong data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"555\">NIOS or any equivalent recognized board</strong> are also eligible</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-592556 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">* An additional fee of Rs. 17000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for CMA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">** An additional fee of Rs. 22000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for ACCA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">*** An additional fee of Rs. 25000/- is applicable per semester from 1st semester onwards for CPA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"332\">This B.Com (Hons) International Finance and Accounting with ACCA, UK program is designed to build strong foundations in global accounting, finance, and business practices. It develops core skills in critical thinking, problem-solving, and communication while preparing students for international financial careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"626\">A key feature of the curriculum is the full integration of the <strong data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"424\">ACCA (UK) qualification</strong> alongside the undergraduate degree, allowing students to pursue both simultaneously. The program provides in-depth learning in specialized finance and accounting subjects aligned with global standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"1088\">Students receive exemptions in up to <strong data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"692\">9 out of 13 ACCA papers</strong>, which significantly reduces the time required to complete the professional qualification. Along with this, students can achieve multiple milestones, such as the <strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"912\">Advanced Diploma in Accounting and Business from ACCA</strong> after clearing the required fundamental papers, and a <strong data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1036\">Certificate in IFRS (International Financial Reporting Standards)</strong> upon successful completion of the IFRS examination.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1262\">The program follows a blended learning approach, combining academic study with professional certification training, ensuring both conceptual clarity and industry readiness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1425\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, it enhances global career opportunities, as ACCA is recognized in over <strong data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1361\">180 countries</strong>, including India, making graduates highly employable worldwide.</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:27137b3a-37b7-47fa-9284-c4a7351fa601-110\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-210\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"11f55ae3-3078-4424-b980-1300f4b67962\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"402\"><strong data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"283\">Investment Banking:</strong> Focuses on raising capital, mergers, acquisitions, and providing financial advisory services to large organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"534\"><strong data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"424\">Risk Management:</strong> Involves identifying and controlling financial, operational, and market risks to ensure business stability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"675\"><strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"570\">Financial Planning &amp; Analysis:</strong> Deals with budgeting, forecasting, and analyzing financial performance to support strategic decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"806\"><strong data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"699\">Corporate Finance:</strong> Manages company finances, investment decisions, and capital structure planning to improve profitability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"952\"><strong data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"843\">Financial Technology (FinTech):</strong> Works with digital financial systems, online banking platforms, and technology-driven financial solutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1081\"><strong data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"971\">Tax Services:</strong> Includes tax planning, preparation, and compliance for individuals and businesses as per legal regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1217\"><strong data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1119\">Compliance &amp; Regulatory Affairs:</strong> Ensures organizations follow financial laws, accounting standards, and regulatory requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1363\"><strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1245\">Government Accounting:</strong> Focuses on managing public funds, budgeting, and financial reporting in government and public sector organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1499\"><strong data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1384\">Audit Services:</strong> Involves examining financial records to ensure accuracy, transparency, and compliance with accounting standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1630\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1525\">Forensic Accounting:</strong> Applies investigative accounting techniques to detect fraud, financial manipulation, and irregularities.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"360\">This program offers strong placement opportunities due to its global professional alignment with <strong data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"136\">ACCA (UK)</strong>, making graduates highly valued in the finance and accounting industry. Students develop advanced technical knowledge, strategic thinking ability, and professional ethics, which are highly demanded by employers worldwide.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"611\">ACCA-qualified and trained professionals are recruited globally by thousands of <strong data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"490\">approved employers and partner organizations</strong>, providing access to a wide range of job opportunities through dedicated professional career networks and job portals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"820\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Graduates can explore career paths across <strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"766\">financial services, banking, corporate business, management roles, entrepreneurship, and government sectors</strong>, depending on their specialization and interest area.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 592556.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(110, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '7d28dbf6-2f80-49f5-8cfe-35fb87d28f46', 151, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"20\",\"19\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 02:55:40', '2026-04-05 23:25:16', '<p>The selection process is carried out in multiple stages. First, candidates who meet the basic requirements are shortlisted. These applicants then participate in a group discussion followed by a personal interview. Along with this, the university also reviews the overall profile of the candidate before giving final admission confirmation.</p>', 1, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:17302f65-ce7e-4428-86ce-4959939aa2d7-60\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-118\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"8fbd436a-2ac0-4876-bf4e-163305ab1407\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"589\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Applicants should have a valid score of at least 80 percentile in exams like CAT or XAT. Work experience is not compulsory, but it can provide an added advantage during the selection process.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>total Fee (Per Year Installment)-982015 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Global immersion program fee of Rs. 35,000 will be extra per sem (Rs. 70,000 per year)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:17302f65-ce7e-4428-86ce-4959939aa2d7-61\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-120\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"e6dcb31a-7eac-4bd5-9ac8-7c50473ece49\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"296\">This program is designed as an intensive two-year learning experience that focuses on building strong management and leadership skills. It combines classroom learning with practical exposure, helping students understand how real businesses function and make decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"541\">Students develop a solid base in key areas such as finance, marketing, operations, and strategy. Along with this, the program introduces important modern topics like entrepreneurship, global business, sustainability, and social responsibility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"745\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The overall learning approach encourages critical thinking, leadership development, and the ability to handle complex business challenges, preparing students to take on impactful roles in organizations.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:17302f65-ce7e-4428-86ce-4959939aa2d7-62\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-122\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"3ec95ea2-a81e-4c40-b1c0-5f657c9d02af\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"886\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Chief Executive Officer (CEO) &ndash; Leads the overall vision, strategy, and growth of the organization.<br data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"129\">&bull; Chief Operating Officer (COO) &ndash; Oversees daily operations and ensures smooth business execution.<br data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"230\">&bull; Chief Financial Officer (CFO) &ndash; Manages financial planning, budgeting, and investment decisions.<br data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"331\">&bull; Chief Marketing Officer (CMO) &ndash; Leads marketing strategy, branding, and customer engagement.<br data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"428\">&bull; Director of Operations &ndash; Handles operational efficiency and business process improvements.<br data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"523\">&bull; Director of Finance &ndash; Manages financial strategy, reporting, and capital management.<br data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"612\">&bull; Director of Marketing &ndash; Develops and executes high-level marketing and brand strategies.<br data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"705\">&bull; General Manager (GM) &ndash; Supervises overall business functions and team performance.<br data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\">&bull; Management Consultant &ndash; Provides expert advice to improve business performance and strategy.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 982015.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(111, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '7d28dbf6-2f80-49f5-8cfe-35fb87d28f46', 152, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"20\",\"19\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-27 03:04:48', '2026-04-05 23:40:44', '<p data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"196\">The admission process includes an Aptitude Test followed by a Personal Interview or submission of a self-introduction video, both of which are compulsory for selection.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"361\">However, candidates who have secured a 75 percentile or above in CAT, MAT, XAT, or CMAT, or a score of 210 in NMAT are exempted from the aptitude test requirement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"499\">Final admission is granted based on overall merit as decided by the university. Test exemption is also applicable for alumni candidates.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"898\">Candidates must have completed a <strong data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"769\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree of at least 3 years duration</strong> from a recognized university. Final admission is granted based on merit determined through the university&rsquo;s selection process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1016\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students who are in the <strong data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"988\">final year of their Bachelor&rsquo;s degree (appearing candidates)</strong> are also eligible to apply.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-828875 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors hover:bg-blue-50\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Global immersion program fee of Rs. 35,000 will be extra per sem (Rs. 70,000 per year)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors bg-blue-100\">\r\n<td class=\"px-2 py-1 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-10 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"335\">The curriculum is designed to build a strong interdisciplinary foundation by combining <strong data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"163\">business understanding with advanced analytical skills</strong>. Students develop core knowledge in <strong data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"295\">business analytics, financial reporting, management control, and human-computer interaction</strong>, ensuring a well-rounded perspective.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"566\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The program further strengthens technical expertise through in-depth learning in <strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"457\">machine learning and text analytics</strong>, enabling students to extract insights from complex data and support effective, data-driven decision-making.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4nrhrx\" data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"213\"><strong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"138\">Data Scientist</strong> &ndash; Extract insights from complex datasets to support strategic decisions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cz74ds\" data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"290\"><strong data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"236\">Business Analyst</strong> &ndash; Bridge business needs with data-backed solutions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bsoa17\" data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"390\"><strong data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"336\">Artificial Intelligence (AI) Specialist</strong> &ndash; Design intelligent systems and automation models.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gjgevb\" data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"477\"><strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"422\">Machine Learning Engineer</strong> &ndash; Build and deploy predictive algorithms and models.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g0ejie\" data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"571\"><strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"512\">Predictive Analytics Manager</strong> &ndash; Lead forecasting and data-driven planning initiatives.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1agusrt\" data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"655\"><strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"596\">Data Mining Expert</strong> &ndash; Discover patterns and hidden trends in large datasets.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9mrmzi\" data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"757\"><strong data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"691\">Business Intelligence Analyst</strong> &ndash; Develop dashboards and reporting systems for decision-making.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r5p3r3\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"851\"><strong data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"782\">Chief Data Officer</strong> &ndash; Oversee data strategy and governance at an organizational level.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ate11\" data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"939\"><strong data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"883\">Data Analytics Consultant</strong> &ndash; Advise organizations on leveraging data for growth.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"145279n\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1050\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"973\">Marketing Analytics Manager</strong> &ndash; Use data insights to optimize marketing campaigns and customer engagement.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\",\"32\",\"33\",\"34\",\"35\",\"38\",\"39\",\"89\",\"91\",\"140\",\"141\",\"143\"]', 4.0, NULL, '<p>The program emphasizes practical learning through <strong data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"137\">hands-on projects and structured internships</strong> with organizations in the <strong data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"198\">data analytics and AI industry</strong>. Students gain real-world experience by working on live projects, enhancing technical skills, problem-solving abilities, and industry readiness before graduation.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 828875.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
