er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(126, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'f7f8613d-33d5-49f0-9714-ec8cb5a01719', 167, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 00:41:36', '2026-04-01 06:22:58', '<p data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"508\">The selection process is designed to identify academically strong candidates through a transparent merit-based system. The university evaluates applications based on performance in the qualifying examination and prepares a merit list for final admission. The entire process follows institutional guidelines to ensure fairness and consistency.</p>', 1, '<p>Candidates must have completed or be <strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"605\">appearing for Class 12</strong> from a recognised board, including <strong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"688\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong>. A background in Physics, Mathematics, and Chemistry (or an equivalent subject combination as per AICTE norms) is required to ensure foundational readiness for engineering studies. Admission is granted strictly on merit, subject to verification of academic credentials and university requirements.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1004436 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"494\">The Bachelor of Technology in Automobile Engineering is a four-year programme that blends core mechanical engineering principles with modern automotive technologies. It is designed to develop a strong foundation in engineering science while preparing students for innovation in the evolving mobility sector.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"781\">In the initial stage of the programme, students are introduced to fundamental engineering concepts through subjects such as <strong data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"712\">Engineering Physics, Technical English, Mechanics of Machines, and Production Technology</strong>, which build analytical thinking and technical communication skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"1083\">As the programme progresses, learners explore specialised automotive and mechanical domains including <strong data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"972\">fluid mechanics, machine design, material strength, and thermal engineering systems</strong>. These areas help students understand the working principles of automotive structures and performance systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1463\">Advanced topics focus on <strong data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1179\">combustion engines, heat transfer, and petrol engine technologies</strong>, along with modern, information-driven automotive systems that are shaping the future of the industry. The curriculum integrates mechanical engineering with automotive innovation, enabling students to understand both traditional vehicle systems and emerging smart mobility solutions.</p>', '<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"1099\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9m0qa2\" data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"650\"><strong data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"439\">Automobile Engineer</strong> &ndash; Responsible for designing, developing, testing, and improving vehicles. They are also involved in production processes and may contribute to marketing, sales, and after-sales support of automotive products.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l68mzk\" data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"895\"><strong data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"674\">Software Engineer</strong> &ndash; Develops and maintains software systems used in modern vehicles and automotive applications. They analyse system issues, design solutions, and continuously improve applications for better performance and reliability.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r26me8\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"1099\"><strong data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"917\">Design Engineer</strong> &ndash; Focuses on conceptualising and developing new products or vehicle components. They also enhance existing systems and equipment to improve efficiency, performance, and usability.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 1004436.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(127, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'cf55b778-40bb-4f70-ae57-b4a93fb3c3e6', 168, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 01:18:41', '2026-04-01 04:47:24', '<p>Admission to the programme is based on academic performance in the qualifying examination. The university prepares a merit list using the marks obtained in Class XII, and seats are allotted accordingly as per university norms and AICTE guidelines.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"632\">To be eligible, candidates must have passed or be <strong data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"325\">appearing for Class 12</strong> from a recognised board. Students from any recognised national or state board are considered, including <strong data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"477\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> candidates. The core subject requirement generally includes Physics, Mathematics, and Chemistry or an equivalent combination as prescribed by AICTE norms.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"897\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1004436 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"582\">Students begin their learning journey with a strong foundation in electrical engineering, covering essential areas such as circuit behaviour, power systems, control mechanisms, signal processing, and power electronics. These core subjects develop analytical and problem-solving skills required for advanced engineering applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"930\">Building on this base, the program shifts toward electric vehicle&ndash;focused specialisation, offering an additional 18 credits designed around industry needs. Students explore how modern EV systems are designed, powered, and controlled through subjects like electric vehicle architecture, energy storage technologies, and advanced power electronics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"1273\">Practical exposure is integrated through dedicated laboratory work, including EV drives and controllers lab, electrical simulation lab, and battery and charging system experiments. This combination of theory and hands-on training helps students develop a complete understanding of electric mobility systems and their real-world applications.</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:2dcc3475-1d05-4d8a-842c-108fd311e48f-108\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-16\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"326bed97-c393-4f48-a5cb-64b6d433be09\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"259\"><strong data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"62\">Design Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"65\">Design engineers create and develop components or systems used in electric vehicles. They focus on improving efficiency, safety, and performance by using engineering principles and design tools.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"452\"><strong data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"281\">Systems Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"284\">Systems engineers work on integrating different EV subsystems like battery, motor, and control units. They ensure all components work together smoothly and efficiently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"644\"><strong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"476\">Research Scientist</strong><br data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"479\">Research scientists focus on innovation and development of new technologies in electric mobility, such as advanced batteries, energy systems, and charging solutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"828\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"665\">Project Manager</strong><br data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"668\">Project managers plan, coordinate, and oversee EV projects from start to finish. They manage teams, timelines, budgets, and ensure successful project execution.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"526\">Upon completion of the specialised program in Electric Vehicle technology, students can explore diverse career opportunities across the rapidly growing EV industry. Career prospects are expanding in electric vehicle manufacturing companies, research and development organisations, and government agencies focused on sustainable mobility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"835\">Graduates may pursue roles such as design engineer, systems engineer, research scientist, or project manager, depending on their area of expertise and interest. The program equips students with industry-relevant skills to contribute effectively to innovation and development in the electric mobility sector.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"254\">The program is supported by strong industrial collaboration across leading organisations in the automotive, electric vehicle, battery technology, and research sectors, ensuring students are exposed to real-world practices and emerging industry standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"610\">In the automotive domain, students gain exposure to major manufacturers such as <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Tesla</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Tata Motors</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Mahindra Electric</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Bajaj Auto</span></span>, and <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Maruti Suzuki</span></span>, which contribute to advancements in electric and hybrid mobility solutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"997\">Within the electric vehicle manufacturing ecosystem, collaboration opportunities extend to innovative companies like <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Ather Energy</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Ola Electric</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Hero Electric</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Rivian</span></span>, and <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Lucid Motors</span></span>, focusing on next-generation EV design and sustainable transportation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1388\">In the battery and charging technology segment, industry interaction includes organisations such as <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Exide Industries</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Amara Raja Batteries</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Delta Electronics</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">ABB</span></span>, and <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Panasonic</span></span>, providing insights into energy storage systems and fast-charging infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1782\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Research and development exposure is further strengthened through associations with global technology leaders like <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Bosch</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Siemens</span></span>, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Continental</span></span>, and <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">General Electric</span></span>, enabling students to engage with cutting-edge innovation in automotive engineering and industrial automation.</p>', '<p data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"448\">The program emphasizes experiential learning through structured internships and hands-on project work, enabling students to gain real-world industry exposure. During their training period, students work on practical assignments aligned with current electric vehicle technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"753\">They also participate in innovative projects such as designing and developing electric vehicles, building efficient charging systems, and improving battery performance. These experiences help students apply theoretical concepts to real engineering challenges and develop industry-ready technical skills.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 1004436.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(128, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'cf55b778-40bb-4f70-ae57-b4a93fb3c3e6', 169, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 01:27:46', '2026-04-01 05:16:50', '<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"350\">Admission to the programme is conducted on a merit basis, determined by the academic performance in the qualifying examination as per university norms. The final selection is made through a merit list prepared by the university, ensuring transparency and fairness in the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"882\">&nbsp;</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"518\">The programme is open to candidates who have completed a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree (B.Tech / B.E.) in a relevant engineering field such as Automobile Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Electronics &amp; Electrical Engineering (EEE), Mechanical Engineering, Mechatronics, Robotics, or an equivalent discipline from an AICTE or UGC approved institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"848\">Applicants must have a strong foundation in core engineering subjects, as the programme builds upon advanced concepts in electric mobility and vehicle technologies. Admission is granted strictly on merit, based on performance in the qualifying degree, followed by university-defined selection criteria and document verification.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-297350 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<ul data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"898\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9rsq0a\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"289\">Advanced study of electric mobility systems with a strong foundation in electrical engineering principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qzxjrz\" data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"361\">Electric power conversion and modern power electronics applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"53f1gv\" data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"428\">Energy storage systems including advanced battery technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18sedxy\" data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"518\">Battery Management Systems (BMS) for performance, safety, and efficiency optimisation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vitb5b\" data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"580\">Electric drivetrain design and vehicle propulsion systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1daifzj\" data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"636\">Smart and fast-charging infrastructure technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1zmes0\" data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"697\">System-level design and integration of electric vehicles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m8o8oc\" data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"813\">Interdisciplinary exposure combining control systems, embedded technologies, and sustainable mobility solutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mhh9pu\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"898\">Emphasis on practical learning through labs, simulations, and project-based work</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p><strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"421\">Engineering and Design</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"573\">Work on the development of next-generation electric vehicles with a focus on battery innovation, electric drivetrains, and energy efficiency systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"759\"><strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"607\">Manufacturing and Production</strong><br data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"610\">Oversee the production of EV components and complete vehicles, ensuring quality control, process optimisation, and efficient manufacturing practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"926\"><strong data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"785\">Software Development</strong><br data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"788\">Design and develop intelligent software systems for vehicle control, connectivity, energy management, and autonomous driving technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"1101\"><strong data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"951\">Sales and Marketing</strong><br data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"954\">Promote electric mobility solutions by creating awareness, developing market strategies, and supporting EV adoption among consumers and industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1274\"><strong data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1130\">Maintenance and Support</strong><br data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1133\">Provide technical expertise in servicing, troubleshooting, and maintaining electric vehicles to ensure long-term performance and reliability.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p>The programme places strong emphasis on industry collaboration through partnerships with leading organisations in the electric vehicle and energy sector. Students gain exposure to real-world practices via advanced laboratories, industrial visits, expert interactions, and research-driven projects. These collaborations help bridge the gap between academic learning and industry requirements, particularly in areas such as EV manufacturing, renewable energy integration, and automotive innovation.</p>', '<p>Students are provided with structured internship opportunities that allow them to gain practical experience in real industrial environments. These internships focus on solving real-world challenges in electric mobility, including vehicle design, energy systems, and sustainable transportation solutions. Through hands-on training, students develop technical expertise, problem-solving abilities, and industry readiness for careers in EV manufacturing, automotive R&amp;D, and allied sectors.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 297350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(129, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '3f4f0c4f-f40d-49f4-bd1e-2c3ddea06cb5', 34, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 01:43:53', '2026-04-01 02:28:53', '<p>Entry into the programme is based on academic performance rather than multiple screening stages. The university evaluates marks obtained in the qualifying examination and uses them to create a merit-based ranking. Students are then shortlisted accordingly, making the process simple, transparent, and performance-focused.</p>', 1, '<p>Students who have completed their 10+2 education from a recognised board can apply if they come from a science or relevant technical background. Accepted subject combinations are broad and may include Physics, Mathematics, Chemistry, Computer Science, Electronics, Information Technology, Biology, Biotechnology, Informatics Practices, Agriculture, Engineering Graphics, or other vocational/technical subjects. This flexibility allows students from diverse academic streams to pursue the programme while still ensuring they have a suitable foundational base.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)- &nbsp;1004436 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"162\">The curriculum is designed to build expertise in core electronics and emerging technologies by combining strong theoretical concepts with real-world applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"572\">Students begin by exploring essential subjects such as <strong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"251\">Electromagnetic Field Theory</strong>, where they understand how electromagnetic waves behave in different environments&mdash;an important concept for communication and electronic systems. They also study <strong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"454\">Microcontrollers and Embedded Systems</strong>, learning how small computing devices are designed and used in applications like smart infrastructure and automation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"935\">Another key area is <strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"624\">VLSI Technology and Design</strong>, which focuses on creating integrated circuits used in modern electronic devices. Alongside this, subjects like <strong data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"821\">Analog Integrated Circuits, Digital Signal Processing, and Microwave Engineering</strong> help students understand how signals are processed, transmitted, and optimised in advanced communication systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1258\">What makes the programme more effective is its practical approach. Through lab work, projects, and industrial visits, students gain hands-on experience with tools and technologies used in the electronics industry. This not only strengthens their technical understanding but also prepares them for real-world applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1448\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The programme also builds a strong base for higher studies and specialisation, allowing students to move into advanced research or explore interdisciplinary areas based on their interests.</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:c0d9b8c7-d809-4990-a1f7-03bbc7565b1b-65\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-126\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"62d32a91-9f6a-4003-a2ff-129e9889ae55\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"134\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"31\">Telecommunications Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"34\">Works on communication systems like mobile networks, satellites, and data transmission technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"254\"><strong data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"160\">Electronics Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"163\">Designs and develops electronic circuits, devices, and systems used in everyday technology.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"363\"><strong data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"276\">Network Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"279\">Builds and manages computer networks to ensure smooth and secure data communication.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"469\"><strong data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"386\">Software Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"389\">Develops software applications and systems for various platforms and industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"603\"><strong data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"506\">Research &amp; Development Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"509\">Focuses on innovation by developing new technologies, products, or improving existing systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"737\"><strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"643\">Control &amp; Instrumentation Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"646\">Designs systems that monitor and control industrial processes using sensors and automation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"875\"><strong data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"768\">Embedded Systems Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"771\">Develops hardware-software integrated systems used in devices like smart gadgets and automotive systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1008\"><strong data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"907\">Signal Processing Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"910\">Works on analysing and improving signals (audio, video, data) for better transmission and quality.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1136\"><strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1038\">Technical Sales Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1041\">Combines technical knowledge with sales to explain and promote engineering products to clients.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1272\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1157\">Project Manager</strong><br data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1160\">Leads and manages engineering projects, ensuring they are completed on time, within budget, and meet objectives.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"292\">The placement ecosystem of the university is built to consistently connect students with leading employers across the electronics and communication sector. A dedicated placement team actively works with companies to create opportunities that match students&rsquo; technical skills and career goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"564\">Students from the programme get access to a wide range of recruiters, including major organisations such as <strong data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"462\">TCS, Infosys, Cognizant, Ericsson, Nokia, Samsung, Bosch</strong>, and others. These companies offer roles across core electronics, telecommunications, and IT domains.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"840\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">What strengthens the placement outcomes is the continuous support provided to students through training, industry interaction, and skill development. This ensures they are not only eligible for opportunities but also well-prepared to secure and perform in competitive roles.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"16\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 1004436.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(130, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '3f4f0c4f-f40d-49f4-bd1e-2c3ddea06cb5', 93, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 02:00:15', '2026-04-01 02:41:12', '<p>The admission process is designed to be flexible while still focusing on academic performance. Students begin by applying through the university&rsquo;s online portal, where they submit their academic details and required documents. Based on the current admission cycle, the university may shortlist candidates either through merit in the qualifying examination or through an entrance-based evaluation. Final selection is made according to university guidelines, keeping the process structured yet accessible.</p>', 1, '<div id=\"gdlr-core-column-4\" class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-12\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js \" data-sync-height=\"h67\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-column-content clearfix gdlr-core-js  gdlr-core-sync-height-content\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-column-service-item gdlr-core-item-pdb  gdlr-core-left-align gdlr-core-column-service-icon-left gdlr-core-no-caption gdlr-core-item-pdlr\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-column-service-content-wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-column-service-content\">\r\n<p>Students who have completed their 10+2 education from a recognised board are eligible, provided they come from a science or relevant technical background. The programme accepts a wide range of subjects such as Physics, Mathematics, Chemistry, Computer Science, Electronics, Information Technology, Biology, Biotechnology, Informatics Practices, Agriculture, Engineering Graphics, and other vocational or skill-based subjects. This inclusive eligibility allows students from different academic streams to pursue the course while ensuring they have a suitable base for engineering studies.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1004436 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"172\">The programme is designed to give students a strong edge in the specialised field of VLSI and semiconductor technology by combining academic depth with real-world exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"482\">One of its key strengths is the focused learning in areas like chip design, semiconductor systems, and VLSI tools. Students don&rsquo;t just study concepts&mdash;they gain familiarity with the kind of software and design environments actually used in the industry, which makes their learning more relevant and practical.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"736\">The learning environment is further enhanced by advanced laboratories equipped with modern design and simulation tools. These labs allow students to experiment, test ideas, and understand how theoretical concepts translate into real electronic designs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"1011\">Faculty members bring both academic knowledge and industry experience into the classroom, helping students connect theory with practical insights. Their guidance ensures that learners understand not just &ldquo;how&rdquo; things work, but also &ldquo;how they are applied&rdquo; in real scenarios.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1297\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In addition, regular exposure to the industry through internships and visits helps students stay connected with current trends and professional practices. This interaction plays an important role in shaping their understanding of the VLSI domain and preparing them for future careers.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"160\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"24\">VLSI Design Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"27\">Works on creating and designing integrated circuits (chips) used in devices like smartphones, communication systems, and electronics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"289\"><strong data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"180\">ASIC Developer</strong><br data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"183\">Specialises in designing customised chips built for specific applications or dedicated hardware functions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"421\"><strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"310\">FPGA Programmer</strong><br data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"313\">Programs and configures FPGA hardware used in embedded systems, enabling flexible and high-speed processing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"567\"><strong data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"447\">Chip Design Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"450\">Focuses on designing, developing, and validating chips to ensure they perform efficiently for different applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"698\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"586\">Test Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"589\">Ensures the quality and reliability of chips by testing designs and identifying any errors before production.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"80\"]', 4.0, '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"372\">The VLSI domain is closely connected with some of the world&rsquo;s most advanced technology companies, creating strong industry opportunities for students. Leading organisations such as <strong data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"232\">Qualcomm, Intel, AMD, NVIDIA, Texas Instruments</strong> are known for driving innovation in chip design and semiconductor technologies, and they actively hire skilled professionals in this field.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"579\">What makes this area especially promising is the wide range of industries where VLSI expertise is applied. Students are not limited to one sector&mdash;they can explore multiple domains based on their interests:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"1229\"><strong data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"607\">Semiconductor Industry</strong> &ndash; Core chip design, fabrication, and integrated circuit development.<br data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"679\"><strong data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"703\">Consumer Electronics</strong> &ndash; Devices like smartphones, laptops, and smart gadgets.<br data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"762\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"783\">Telecommunication</strong> &ndash; Communication hardware and network infrastructure.<br data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"839\"><strong data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"865\">Automotive Electronics</strong> &ndash; Electronics used in modern vehicles, including automation and EV systems.<br data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"944\"><strong data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"967\">Aerospace &amp; Defense</strong> &ndash; High-reliability electronic systems for critical applications.<br data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1035\"><strong data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1067\">Embedded Systems Development</strong> &ndash; Smart devices and systems with integrated hardware-software design.<br data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1140\"><strong data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1158\">Nanotechnology</strong> &ndash; Advanced miniaturisation and next-generation electronic innovations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1404\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">This strong industry connection ensures that students are exposed to diverse career paths and emerging technologies, making VLSI a highly dynamic and opportunity-rich field.</p>', NULL, '[\"1\"]', 1004436.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(131, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '3f4f0c4f-f40d-49f4-bd1e-2c3ddea06cb5', 170, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 02:17:54', '2026-04-01 03:24:59', '<p>Entry into the programme is designed for working professionals and focuses on their academic background. Instead of multiple screening stages, the university evaluates marks from the required qualification and prepares a merit list. Candidates are then selected based on this ranking, making the process straightforward and performance-oriented.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"818\">This programme is specifically tailored for candidates who are already part of the workforce. Applicants should be employed in a registered organisation&mdash;whether government, private, or MSME&mdash;located within a reasonable distance (around 75 km) from the institute. In addition, a minimum of one year of full-time work experience is required, ensuring that candidates can relate academic learning with professional practice.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"1239\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">From an academic perspective, candidates must have completed either a diploma in engineering (three-year regular or two-year lateral entry) in any branch, or hold a B.Sc. degree from a UGC-recognised university with Mathematics studied at the 10+2 level. This combination of education and work experience ensures that learners are well-prepared to benefit from the programme while continuing their professional journey.</p>', '<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Total Fee (Per Year Installment)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">430513</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">11250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', NULL, '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"123\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"26\">Senior System Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"29\">Manages and improves complex engineering systems, ensuring smooth performance and reliability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"267\"><strong data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"163\">Telecommunications Project Manager</strong><br data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"166\">Plans and oversees telecom projects, coordinating teams to deliver communication systems efficiently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"393\"><strong data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"299\">Embedded Systems Architect</strong><br data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"302\">Designs high-level architecture for embedded systems used in smart devices and electronics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"520\"><strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"413\">R&amp;D Specialist</strong><br data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"416\">Works on research and innovation to develop new technologies and improve existing engineering solutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"651\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"547\">Technology Consultant</strong><br data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"550\">Advises organisations on technical strategies, system improvements, and adoption of new technologies.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:c0d9b8c7-d809-4990-a1f7-03bbc7565b1b-72\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-140\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"20d58fb8-091e-45c0-924f-06bbe979b01e\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"288\"><br data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"30\">The programme offers students opportunities to engage with real-world engineering challenges through collaborations with reputed companies and research organisations. These partnerships help bridge the gap between academic learning and industry requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"569\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">By working on industry-driven projects, students gain exposure to current technologies, professional workflows, and practical problem-solving approaches. This experience enhances their technical understanding and prepares them to adapt effectively to evolving industry standards.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"300\">The programme places strong emphasis on practical learning through well-equipped, modern laboratories. Students work on industry-relevant experiments and projects that help them understand how theoretical concepts are applied in real engineering environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"613\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Regular lab sessions allow learners to develop technical confidence by working with advanced tools and systems used in the electronics and communication field. This hands-on exposure not only strengthens problem-solving skills but also prepares students for real-world technical challenges in industry settings.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 430513.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
