er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(132, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '3f4f0c4f-f40d-49f4-bd1e-2c3ddea06cb5', 171, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"16\"]', NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 02:31:57', '2026-04-01 03:34:14', '<p>Admission to the programme is carried out through a combination of entrance performance and academic merit, as per university guidelines. Applicants are required to submit their applications via the official online portal. Shortlisting is typically done based on GATE scores (if available), performance in the qualifying degree, and, in some cases, a university-level entrance test or interview. Additional weightage may be given to academic excellence and relevant professional experience, ensuring a fair and holistic selection process.</p>', 1, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:c0d9b8c7-d809-4990-a1f7-03bbc7565b1b-76\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-148\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"ea3d2755-3678-4ee7-8e88-4f5199f69b6f\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"1297\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">This programme is open to candidates from a wide range of technical and science backgrounds. Eligible applicants include those holding a B.Tech/B.E. in fields such as Biomedical, Biotechnology, Chemical, Computer Science, Electrical, Electronics &amp; Communication, Instrumentation, Mechanical Engineering, IT, or related branches. Candidates with an M.Sc. in disciplines like Physics, Chemistry, Biotechnology, Life Sciences, or allied areas can also apply. Additionally, graduates in professional healthcare programmes such as MBBS, BDS, or B.Pharm are eligible. The selection is ultimately based on university-defined merit standards, ensuring that candidates with strong academic foundations are admitted.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-296400 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"270\">The programme follows an interdisciplinary approach that integrates core areas such as device design, electronics, biology, and artificial intelligence, enabling students to understand and work across multiple domains of biomedical engineering.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"564\">A strong focus is placed on research-driven learning, where students are encouraged to apply innovative thinking to solve real-world healthcare and engineering challenges. This approach helps in developing analytical and problem-solving abilities essential for modern biomedical advancements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"915\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Students also gain practical exposure through modern laboratories equipped with facilities for tissue engineering, medical imaging, simulation software, and other advanced biomedical tools. These labs provide hands-on experience, helping learners translate theoretical knowledge into practical applications in the healthcare and biomedical industry.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"123\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"21\">Clinical Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"24\">Works in hospitals to manage, maintain, and optimize medical equipment and healthcare technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"240\"><strong data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"152\">Medical Device Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"155\">Designs and develops medical devices used for diagnosis, treatment, and patient care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"372\"><strong data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"275\">Biomedical Research Scientist</strong><br data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"278\">Conducts research to develop new medical technologies, treatments, and healthcare innovations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"524\"><strong data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"403\">Healthcare AI/ML Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"406\">Builds artificial intelligence and machine learning systems for healthcare applications like diagnosis and prediction.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"657\"><strong data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"559\">Regulatory Affairs Specialist</strong><br data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"562\">Ensures medical products and devices meet legal, safety, and quality standards before approval.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"790\"><strong data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"695\">Healthcare Technology Consultant</strong><br data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"698\">Advises healthcare organizations on adopting and implementing advanced medical technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"936\"><strong data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"835\">Rehabilitative Engineering Professional</strong><br data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"838\">Designs assistive devices and systems to support patients in recovery and physical rehabilitation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1057\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"961\">Health Data Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"964\">Analyzes medical and healthcare data to support decision-making and improve patient outcomes.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:c0d9b8c7-d809-4990-a1f7-03bbc7565b1b-80\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-156\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"2192db85-aa5a-4132-a594-5cd1b46c1444\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"321\">The programme maintains strong connections with leading organisations across healthcare, biotechnology, and medical technology sectors. These collaborations help students understand how biomedical engineering solutions are developed and applied in real clinical and industrial environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"608\">Through interaction with industries such as medical device manufacturing units, biotechnology firms, healthcare IT companies, hospitals, pharmaceutical R&amp;D centres, regulatory bodies, and research laboratories, students gain exposure to current technologies and professional practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"820\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">These partnerships also support knowledge exchange, project-based learning, and innovation-driven activities, enabling students to stay aligned with industry needs and emerging trends in biomedical engineering.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, '[\"1\"]', 296400.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(133, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '2db0e336-d9f7-4b76-80af-ae4e989099c6', 172, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 03:30:18', '2026-04-01 03:54:22', '<p>Admission is based on a merit system prepared from the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. The university evaluates academic performance in the required subjects and prepares a merit list accordingly. Candidates are selected and offered admission based on their position in this merit ranking and the availability of seats, ensuring a fair and transparent selection process.</p>', 1, '<p>To be eligible for this programme, candidates must have completed Class XII from a recognised board of examination. They should have studied Physics, Chemistry, and Mathematics (PCM) or an equivalent combination of subjects as specified under AICTE guidelines. This ensures that students have the necessary academic foundation in science and mathematics required for technical and engineering studies.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1624939&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"421\">Students begin with <strong data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"195\">computer programming</strong>, where they learn to write efficient code and understand core programming logic. This is followed by <strong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"331\">data structures and algorithms</strong>, which help them develop the ability to solve complex computational problems effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"799\">The programme also includes <strong data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"482\">database management systems</strong>, enabling students to learn how data is stored, organised, and retrieved efficiently in real-world applications. <strong data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"617\">Operating systems</strong> provide an understanding of how computers manage hardware and software resources, while <strong data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"727\">computer networks</strong> introduce the concepts behind internet communication and data transfer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"1105\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In addition, <strong data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"838\">software engineering</strong> teaches the principles of designing, developing, and maintaining large-scale software systems in a structured way. Along with these core subjects, the curriculum also includes several advanced and emerging topics to keep students aligned with current industry needs.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"213\">Artificial Intelligence and Data Science open up diverse and fast-growing career opportunities across multiple industries, as organisations increasingly rely on data-driven decision-making and intelligent systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"542\">In India, these fields are gaining strong importance in sectors such as healthcare, finance, education, e-commerce, and public services, where technology is being used to improve efficiency and outcomes. Professionals in this domain work with large and complex datasets to extract meaningful insights and build smart solutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"847\">Graduates can pursue roles such as <strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"711\">Data Analyst, Data Scientist, Machine Learning Engineer, AI Developer, Statistical Analyst, and Business Intelligence Specialist</strong>. In these roles, they design predictive models, develop intelligent algorithms, and support organisations in making informed decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"1222\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Beyond industry applications, AI and Data Science also contribute to innovation in areas like personalised learning, disease prediction, fraud detection, and resource management. With continuous advancements in technology and growing global demand, these fields offer strong long-term career prospects for students interested in analytics, programming, and problem-solving.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\"]', 4.0, '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"310\">The university&rsquo;s strong network of collaborations with leading companies and research organisations plays a key role in bridging the gap between academics and industry. These partnerships create valuable opportunities for students to engage with real-world challenges and understand current industry practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"612\">Through these collaborations, students gain access to internships, hands-on exposure to emerging technologies, and the chance to participate in live, industry-driven projects. This practical engagement helps them stay updated with modern tools, trends, and innovations used in the professional world.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"780\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, such industry interaction strengthens their technical skills, builds professional awareness, and prepares them to adapt confidently to future career demands.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"353\">The internship component of the programme is focused on providing students with real-world exposure and practical learning beyond classroom teaching. Through internships in industries, research labs, or organisations, students get the opportunity to work on live projects and understand how theoretical concepts are applied in professional environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"660\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">This hands-on experience helps them develop technical skills, improve problem-solving abilities, and gain confidence in handling real industry challenges. It also enhances their understanding of workplace practices, teamwork, and communication, making them better prepared for future career opportunities.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 1624939.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(134, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '2db0e336-d9f7-4b76-80af-ae4e989099c6', 173, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 03:38:24', '2026-04-01 00:19:38', '<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"01edceae-65be-4191-b37a-3c50f522a02b\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"384\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Admission is based on a merit system prepared from the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. The university evaluates academic performance in the required subjects and prepares a merit list accordingly. Candidates are selected and offered admission based on their position in this merit ranking and the availability of seats, ensuring a fair and transparent selection process.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<div id=\"gdlr-core-column-4\" clas