px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"536\">In the early semesters, students are introduced to core subjects such as <strong data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"382\">computer programming, data structures and algorithms, database management systems, operating systems, computer networks, software engineering</strong>, along with essential concepts of mathematics and computing fundamentals. This phase helps students develop logical thinking and strong technical basics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"944\">As the programme progresses, the focus shifts towards advanced and specialised areas of <strong data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"670\">Artificial Intelligence and Data Science</strong>. Students explore subjects such as <strong data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"824\">machine learning, data mining, natural language processing, deep learning, computer vision, and big data analytics</strong>. These courses are designed to provide in-depth knowledge and practical understanding of modern AI-driven technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"1176\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, the curriculum follows a progressive learning approach that moves from foundational computing concepts to advanced, industry-relevant specialisations, preparing students for real-world challenges in the technology sector.</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:c0d9b8c7-d809-4990-a1f7-03bbc7565b1b-22\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-46\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"728c6226-ca13-4ae6-93ec-836290f06974\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"326\">Artificial Intelligence and Data Science are among the fastest-growing domains, offering a wide range of promising career opportunities across multiple industries. As organisations increasingly depend on data-driven decision-making and intelligent systems, the demand for skilled professionals in this field continues to rise.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"742\">Graduates can explore diverse roles such as <strong data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"535\">Data Analyst, Data Scientist, Machine Learning Engineer, Artificial Intelligence Researcher, Statistical Programming Analyst, and Business Intelligence Analyst</strong>. These professionals work on analysing large and complex datasets, identifying patterns, and developing predictive models and intelligent algorithms that help automate processes and improve decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"1067\">Beyond industry applications, AI and Data Science are also transforming sectors like education by enabling better analysis of student performance and improving learning outcomes through data-driven insights. Similarly, they are widely used in healthcare, finance, and business operations to enhance efficiency and accuracy.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1284\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">With the growing reliance on analytics and automation, this field offers strong long-term career growth for individuals with analytical thinking, programming skills, and a passion for technology and problem-solving.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"407\">The university maintains strong industry integration, especially in the fields of Artificial Intelligence and Data Science, which significantly enhances student placement outcomes. Its consistent placement record reflects the effectiveness of its academic training and industry-focused learning approach, with a large proportion of students securing internships and full-time roles in reputed organisations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"733\">Through well-established collaborations with leading global companies such as <strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"527\">IBM, HSBC, Wipro, Microsoft, Infosys</strong>, and several others, students gain access to a wide range of career opportunities across top-tier industries. These partnerships help bridge the gap between academic learning and professional expectations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"1136\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The placement ecosystem not only focuses on job opportunities but also ensures students are well-prepared through internships and real-world exposure. This combination of training and industry experience equips graduates with strong technical skills, practical knowledge, and the confidence required to contribute effectively in the rapidly evolving fields of Artificial Intelligence and Data Science.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"29\"]', 4.0, '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:c0d9b8c7-d809-4990-a1f7-03bbc7565b1b-24\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-50\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"ca9c4ecd-2970-4ea3-87e5-17128ddf9b17\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"302\">The university maintains strong collaborations with leading companies and research organisations, creating a direct connection between academic learning and industry practices. These partnerships provide students with valuable opportunities to engage in real-world projects and gain practical exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"629\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Through this industry interaction, students can secure internships, work with modern tools and technologies, and stay updated with current trends in the field. This exposure not only enhances their technical skills but also gives them a clear understanding of how the industry operates, preparing them for successful careers.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"333\">The internship component of the programme is designed to strengthen practical learning by connecting academic knowledge with real industry experience. During internships, students get the opportunity to work on live projects, where they apply concepts learned through lab sessions, assignments, and coursework in real-world settings.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"621\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">This hands-on exposure helps them understand industry practices, improve technical skills, and develop problem-solving abilities. It also builds confidence and prepares students to handle professional responsibilities, making them industry-ready by the time they complete the programme.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 1624939.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
