(139, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '2db0e336-d9f7-4b76-80af-ae4e989099c6', 178, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 04:28:51', '2026-04-01 01:49:43', '<p>Instead of multiple rounds or entrance-heavy filtering, the university keeps selection straightforward. Your Class XII performance becomes the deciding factor, where marks are evaluated to create a merit-based ranking. Admission is then offered based on this ranking, making the process clear and purely performance-driven</p>', 1, '<p>Students applying should come from a science background at the 10+2 level, with subjects that develop analytical and numerical understanding. A combination including Physics and Mathematics, along with Chemistry or an equivalent, is required as per AICTE norms. This ensures that applicants already have the logical and technical base needed to handle the demands of an engineering programme.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-1624939 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">15000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"437\"><strong data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"211\">Programming Languages</strong><br data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"214\">Students learn how to think like developers by writing, testing, and debugging code using languages such as C++, Java, and Python. The focus is not just on syntax, but on building logic and developing complete applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"677\"><strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"471\">Data Structures &amp; Algorithms</strong><br data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"474\">This area trains students to approach complex problems efficiently. They work with structures like arrays, trees, and graphs, and learn how to design algorithms that optimise performance and scalability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"934\"><strong data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"700\">Computer Networks</strong><br data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"703\">Students understand how systems communicate over networks, covering concepts like protocols, architectures, and network design. They also gain practical insight into configuring networks and understanding basic security challenges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"1169\"><strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"967\">Database Management Systems</strong><br data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"970\">Here, the focus is on handling data effectively. Students learn how to design databases, use SQL for data operations, maintain data accuracy, and improve system performance through efficient queries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1430\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1192\">Operating Systems</strong><br data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1195\">This subject explains how a computer actually functions internally. Students explore process handling, memory usage, file systems, and how software interacts with hardware, giving them a deeper understanding of system-level operations.</p>', '<p data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"347\"><strong data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"240\">Software Developer (Hindi-Based Applications)</strong><br data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"243\">Develop software, systems, and applications designed for Hindi users, making technology more accessible.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"491\"><strong data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"365\">Data Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"368\">Work with data interpretation and reporting, where insights and outputs can be tailored for Hindi-based platforms or users.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"632\"><strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"513\">Technical Writer</strong><br data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"516\">Create user manuals, guides, and documentation in Hindi, helping users understand technology in a familiar language.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"771\"><strong data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"655\">Content Developer</strong><br data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"658\">Develop digital content in Hindi for websites, blogs, apps, and social media, supporting regional digital growth.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"927\"><strong data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"797\">Mobile App Developer</strong><br data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"800\">Design and build mobile applications focused on Hindi-speaking users, especially important in India&rsquo;s smartphone-driven market.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1102\"><strong data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"970\">Cybersecurity &amp; System Administration</strong><br data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"973\">Manage system security and IT operations while supporting organisations that require Hindi-based communication and documentation.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"277\">A strong connection with industry plays a major role in shaping career outcomes for students at the university. With a consistent record of a high percentage of students securing internships and full-time roles, the focus clearly goes beyond academics to real career readiness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"582\">The university&rsquo;s collaboration with leading organisations such as <strong data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"386\">Amazon, Microsoft, Google, Wipro, Jio</strong>, and others creates multiple entry points for students into the professional world. These connections open doors not only for placements but also for meaningful exposure to how companies operate.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"906\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">What truly makes a difference is the kind of experience students gain. Through internships and industry-linked training, they work in real environments, understand expectations, and apply their skills practically. This exposure helps them build confidence, making them better prepared to perform and grow in their careers.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"2\"]', 1624939.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(141, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '2db0e336-d9f7-4b76-80af-ae4e989099c6', 69, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 04:56:50', '2026-04-01 02:01:22', '<p>The selection process combines academic performance with a personal evaluation stage. Candidates are first shortlisted based on their marks in the qualifying degree, after which they go through a personal interview. This interaction helps assess their understanding, interest, and readiness for the programme. Final selection is then made by preparing a merit list that considers both academic performance and interview evaluation.</p>', 1, '<p>Applicants should come from a relevant technical or computing background. Students who have completed MCA, B.E./B.Tech in streams like Electronics, IT, Computer Science, or Electrical Engineering, or an M.Sc. in Computer Science from an AICTE or UGC-approved institution are eligible. This background ensures that candidates already have the core technical foundation required to handle the advanced concepts covered in the programme.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-468350 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:c0d9b8c7-d809-4990-a1f7-03bbc7565b1b-58\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-112\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"67a02dd7-91c1-4a38-95da-0e77fd8fe0c1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"303\">The M.Tech CSE programme is designed to move beyond basic learning and focus on advanced concepts, research orientation, and real-world problem-solving. It follows a structured progression where students first strengthen their technical depth and later apply it to specialised and research-driven areas.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"636\">In the initial phase, the emphasis is on core advanced subjects such as algorithms, computer architecture, operating systems, and data structures. Alongside these, students explore areas like database systems, computer networks, artificial intelligence, and machine learning, helping them build a strong and updated technical base.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"1007\">As the programme advances, the focus shifts toward emerging and high-demand domains. Students engage with topics such as cybersecurity, big data analytics, cloud computing, and natural language processing. The flexibility of elective subjects allows them to align their learning with specific career goals or research interests, making the curriculum more personalised.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1339\">A defining feature of the programme is its strong research component. In the final stage, students undertake a thesis or major project, where they work on a specific problem, apply their accumulated knowledge, and contribute to innovative solutions. Access to modern labs and advanced tools supports this research-driven learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1706\">Practical exposure is deeply integrated throughout the course. Laboratory sessions allow students to experiment with programming languages, tools, and systems, helping them translate theory into practice. In addition, project-based and field-oriented work provides experience in solving real-world problems while collaborating with peers and industry professionals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1926\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, the programme creates a balanced learning environment that combines advanced theory, hands-on practice, and research, preparing students for both industry roles and higher-level technical or academic pursuits.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"117\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"33\">Software Engineer / Developer</strong><br data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"36\">Builds applications, software systems, and platforms used in everyday technology.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"220\"><strong data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"137\">Data Scientist</strong><br data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"140\">Works with large datasets to extract insights and support data-driven decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"325\"><strong data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"247\">Cybersecurity Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"250\">Protects systems and networks from cyber threats and ensures data security.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"449\"><strong data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"370\">ML Engineer (Machine Learning Engineer)</strong><br data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"373\">Develops models that enable systems to learn from data and make predictions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"557\"><strong data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"468\">AI Researcher</strong><br data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"471\">Focuses on creating new algorithms and advancing artificial intelligence technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"662\"><strong data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"573\">IT Manager</strong><br data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"576\">Oversees an organisation&rsquo;s IT infrastructure and ensures smooth technology operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"763\"><strong data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"682\">System Analyst</strong><br data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"685\">Evaluates systems and designs solutions to improve performance and efficiency.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"869\"><strong data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"784\">Product Manager</strong><br data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"787\">Leads the development of tech products by aligning user needs with business goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"960\"><strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"892\">System Scientists</strong><br data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"895\">Work on advanced computing research and system-level innovations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1077\"><strong data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"978\">NLP Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"981\">Develops systems that understand and process human language, like chatbots and voice assistants.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1192\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1098\">Game Developers</strong><br data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1101\">Design and develop interactive games, combining programming, graphics, and user experience.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"305\">Career support at the university is driven by a dedicated placement team that continuously works to connect students with leading organisations. Instead of limiting opportunities to final-year hiring, the focus is on creating a steady pipeline of internships and job roles throughout the academic journey.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"534\">Students benefit from strong corporate connections, which open doors to reputed companies such as <strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"437\">Microsoft, Google, and Adobe</strong>. These opportunities allow them to step into competitive roles and gain early industry exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"726\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">This proactive approach ensures that a large number of students secure meaningful internships and placements, helping them build confidence and transition smoothly into professional careers.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-title-item gdlr-core-item-pdb clearfix  gdlr-core-left-align gdlr-core-title-item-caption-top gdlr-core-item-pdlr\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-title-item-title-wrap clearfix\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"322\">Industry interaction is built into the learning experience, allowing students to connect their academic knowledge with real-world applications. The university actively engages with leading organisations in the field of computer science and engineering, creating opportunities that go beyond traditional classroom learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"675\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Through these collaborations, students get involved in practical exposure such as working on industry-oriented projects, understanding current technologies, and observing how solutions are developed in professional environments. This kind of engagement helps them gain clarity about industry expectations and improves their readiness for future roles.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:c0d9b8c7-d809-4990-a1f7-03bbc7565b1b-62\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-120\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"e71ca826-e126-4fd5-a3ad-8d007fde7926\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"310\">The internship experience is designed to move learning beyond theory and place students in real engineering environments. Instead of limiting exposure to classrooms, the programme encourages participation in internships, site visits, and project-based work where students engage with actual industry scenarios.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"639\">During this phase, students get the chance to apply their technical knowledge to practical challenges, understand how engineering solutions are implemented, and gain insight into professional workflows. This hands-on involvement helps them build confidence, sharpen problem-solving skills, and adapt to real-world expectations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"828\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">By the time they complete these experiences, students are not only technically prepared but also professionally aware, making them better equipped to succeed in their engineering careers.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '[\"1\"]', 468350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
