-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p>B.Sc. Geology is a three-year undergraduate degree program focusing on the Earth&rsquo;s physical structure, composition, and history. It encompasses various disciplines such as mineralogy, petrology, geochemistry, geophysics, and sedimentology.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Geologist<br>● Geophysicist<br>● Hydrogeologist<br>● Mining geologist<br>● Environmental geologist<br>● Petroleum geologist<br>● Paleontologist<br>● Geochemist<br>● Seismologist<br>● Geotechnical engineer</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"52\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 438933.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(145, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '6f72dd68-c6b0-4070-af2f-6d34d85598e2', 180, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-28 06:49:10', '2026-03-28 06:49:10', '<p>The merit list will be prepared based on the marks obtained in the qualifying examination. Candidates are shortlisted according to their academic performance in the relevant exam. Final selection is subject to fulfillment of eligibility criteria.</p>', 1, '<div id=\"gdlr-core-column-4\" class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-12\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js \" data-sync-height=\"h67\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-column-content clearfix gdlr-core-js  gdlr-core-sync-height-content\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-column-service-item gdlr-core-item-pdb  gdlr-core-left-align gdlr-core-column-service-icon-left gdlr-core-no-caption gdlr-core-item-pdlr\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-column-service-content-wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-column-service-content\">\r\n<p>Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in BSc Geology / BSc Applied Geology / BSc Applied Geo Physics / Geochemistry from a recognized University, with admission granted as per merit decided by the university.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"gdlr-core-column-5\" class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-24\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js \" data-sync-height=\"h67\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-background gdlr-core-parallax gdlr-core-js\" data-parallax-speed=\"0\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-213465 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:bor