reates ample opportunities for students to gain practical exposure. As a result, a substantial number of students successfully secure valuable internships and placement offers with well-established and prestigious organisations, setting a strong foundation for their professional careers.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"28\"]', 4.0, '<p>The institution maintains strong partnerships with leading industry and research organizations. These collaborations facilitate activities such as industrial visits and expert interactions, enabling students to gain insights into current practices and advancements in the biotechnology sector.</p>', '<p>To bridge the gap between theory and practice, the university provides structured internship programs and hands-on project work. These opportunities allow students to apply their academic knowledge to real-life challenges, enhancing their practical skills and industry readiness.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 213465.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
