\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-28\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-14\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"3225d4f0-d1ed-4cc5-9720-18468538a0de\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ol data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"440\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zm70oq\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"13\">Preamble</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"loz97y\" data-start=\"14\" data-end=\"35\">Program Overview</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sljj23\" data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"59\">Vision and Mission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"izg4mw\" data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"102\">Program Educational Objectives (PEOs)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n7zpnc\" data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"155\">Alignment of PEOs with the Department&rsquo;s Mission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulwhi5\" data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"183\">Program Outcomes (POs)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2t2p8i\" data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"221\">Program-Specific Outcomes (PSOs)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rz2gqa\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"244\">Program Structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3mrn0r\" data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"282\">Key Highlights of the Curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r1myq\" data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"302\">Course Scheme</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o1r5p0\" data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"326\">Detailed Syllabus</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15nsctq\" data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"360\">Program Articulation Matrix</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ejnptk\" data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"380\">Exit Pathways</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dcs1to\" data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"440\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Prospective Recruiters for Graduates in Food Technology</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"263\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"22\">Food Technologist:</strong><br data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"25\">A food technologist focuses on analyzing, developing, and enhancing food products to improve their quality, safety, and nutritional value. They play a key role in ensuring that food items meet industry standards and consumer expectations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"532\"><strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"286\">Technical Brewer:</strong><br data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"289\">A technical brewer is responsible for overseeing the brewing process, managing equipment, and ensuring consistency in product quality. The role also involves monitoring production parameters and handling technical as well as operational tasks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"802\"><strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"557\">Production Manager:</strong><br data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"560\">Production managers supervise manufacturing processes, ensuring efficient utilization of resources, adherence to timelines, and maintenance of quality standards. They are involved in planning, organizing, and optimizing production operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"1093\"><strong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"849\">Research and Development (R&amp;D) Scientist:</strong><br data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"852\">R&amp;D scientists work on innovating new food products and refining existing ones. Their role includes conducting experiments, analyzing results, and contributing to advancements in areas such as nutrition, food safety, and product formulation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1347\"><strong data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1125\">Food Marketing Specialist:</strong><br data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1128\">Food marketing specialists focus on promoting food products by analyzing market trends and consumer behavior. They design strategic campaigns to enhance product visibility, boost sales, and strengthen brand positioning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1604\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1378\">Food Processing Engineer:</strong><br data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1381\">Food processing engineers are involved in designing and improving processing techniques and equipment. Their work aims to enhance production efficiency, maintain product quality, and ensure compliance with safety standards.</p>', '<p>Each year, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Graphic Era Deemed to be University</span></span> attracts the participation of numerous reputed global recruiters as part of its placement process, offering students valuable opportunities to begin their professional careers with well-established organizations across diverse industries.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"309\">The program is designed to prepare students for diverse roles across the food industry, including sectors such as dairy, meat processing, fruit and vegetable processing, and beverage manufacturing. It emphasizes industry-oriented skill development to ensure graduates are well-equipped for professional roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"552\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-32\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-22\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"dacddbaa-96b9-4bc6-bbae-753fb5217ce8\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"309\">The program is designed to prepare students for diverse roles across the food industry, including sectors such as dairy, meat processing, fruit and vegetable processing, and beverage manufacturing. It emphasizes industry-oriented skill development to ensure graduates are well-equipped for professional roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"552\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Additionally, students are provided with opportunities to gain practical exposure through internships and industrial training programs, enabling them to apply theoretical knowledge in real-world settings and enhance their industry readiness.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '[\"1\"]', 333341.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(152, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'eaebe0ad-c344-4c2c-a7b5-7b9f329ae248', 107, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-30 02:09:43', '2026-03-30 02:09:43', '<p>Admissions are conducted on a merit-based system, where the selection of candidates is determined by their performance in the qualifying examination. This ensures a transparent and fair evaluation process based on academic achievement.</p>', 1, '<p>Applicants must have successfully completed their 12th grade education with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB) as core subjects from a recognized board of examination, demonstrating the required academic background for pursuing the program.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-455106 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">Quarterly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900 sticky z-10 left-[var(--first-col-width)] bg-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">4500</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">2500</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">1000</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"371\">The curriculum is thoughtfully designed to provide a comprehensive understanding of food science and technology, covering key areas such as Chemistry, Biology, Nutrition, Biochemistry, Microbiology, and elements of Chemical Engineering. It enables students to develop a strong foundation while gaining insights into modern techniques of food preparation and preservation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"815\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">To enhance practical learning, the programme incorporates seminars, educational visits, and industry-oriented training. This integrated approach not only strengthens theoretical knowledge but also prepares students for diverse career opportunities, including product development, improvement of nutritional and sensory qualities of food, and the application of innovative methods in food preservation, processing, packaging, and distribution.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"263\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"22\">Food Technologist:</strong><br data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"25\">A food technologist focuses on analyzing, developing, and enhancing food products to improve their quality, safety, and nutritional value. They play a key role in ensuring that food items meet industry standards and consumer expectations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"532\"><strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"286\">Technical Brewer:</strong><br data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"289\">A technical brewer is responsible for overseeing the brewing process, managing equipment, and ensuring consistency in product quality. The role also involves monitoring production parameters and handling technical as well as operational tasks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"802\"><strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"557\">Production Manager:</strong><br data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"560\">Production managers supervise manufacturing processes, ensuring efficient utilization of resources, adherence to timelines, and maintenance of quality standards. They are involved in planning, organizing, and optimizing production operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"1093\"><strong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"849\">Research and Development (R&amp;D) Scientist:</strong><br data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"852\">R&amp;D scientists work on innovating new food products and refining existing ones. Their role includes conducting experiments, analyzing results, and contributing to advancements in areas such as nutrition, food safety, and product formulation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1347\"><strong data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1125\">Food Marketing Specialist:</strong><br data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1128\">Food marketing specialists focus on promoting food products by analyzing market trends and consumer behavior. They design strategic campaigns to enhance product visibility, boost sales, and strengthen brand positioning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1604\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1378\">Food Processing Engineer:</strong><br data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1381\">Food processing engineers are involved in designing and improving processing techniques and equipment. Their work aims to enhance production efficiency, maintain product quality, and ensure compliance with safety standards.</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-35\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-28\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"6ee15671-adb1-4bbe-9b31-9b44bfa451c8\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"397\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The placement process at <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Graphic Era Deemed to be University</span></span> is marked by the consistent participation of several renowned global recruiters each year. This strong industry engagement provides students with excellent career opportunities, enabling them to secure positions in well-established organizations across a wide range of sectors and begin their professional journey on a promising note.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"54\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 455106.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NUL