(153, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'eaebe0ad-c344-4c2c-a7b5-7b9f329ae248', 187, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-30 02:52:05', '2026-03-30 02:52:05', '<p>Admissions are conducted on a merit-based system, where the selection of candidates is determined by their performance in the qualifying examination. This ensures a transparent and fair evaluation process based on academic achievement.</p>', 1, '<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"50cba973-2200-40e1-8977-19a328cb717a\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"264\" data-end=\"535\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Applicants must have successfully completed their 12th grade education with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB) as core subjects from a recognized board of examination, demonstrating the required academic background for pursuing the program.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-438728 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">18500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"332\">The B.Sc. in Nutrition and Dietetics program is designed to provide a comprehensive understanding of food management, the promotion of health through balanced nutrition, and the vital relationship between diet and the human body. Structured across six semesters, the programme ensures a progressive and in-depth learning experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"585\">The curriculum comprises both core and elective subjects, where core courses form the essential foundation of the discipline. Key areas of study include Food Quality and Management, Family Meal Management, Dietetics and Counselling, and Food Science.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"875\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">To enhance learning outcomes, the programme integrates traditional classroom teaching with practical laboratory sessions. This balanced approach enables students to apply theoretical concepts in real-world contexts, thereby strengthening their practical skills and professional readiness.</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-38\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-34\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"10550d29-d865-4de1-afe7-c90f0274bd04\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"253\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"29\">Nutritionist / Dietitian:</strong><br data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"32\">Professionals in this role design personalized diet plans tailored to individual health conditions and lifestyle needs, working in hospitals, clinics, private practice, or community settings to promote overall well-being.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"492\"><strong data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"280\">Food Service Manager:</strong><br data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"283\">They oversee food preparation, production, and distribution in institutions such as hospitals and schools, ensuring that meals meet nutritional standards, safety regulations, and specific dietary requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"710\"><strong data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"514\">Food Researcher:</strong><br data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"517\">Food researchers conduct studies on the impact of food and nutrients on human health, contribute to the development of new food products, and ensure quality and safety standards are maintained.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"943\"><strong data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"743\">Public Health Professional:</strong><br data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"746\">These professionals focus on promoting healthy eating habits within communities, working on initiatives to prevent and manage nutrition-related diseases through awareness and intervention programs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1124\"><strong data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"969\">Sports Nutritionist:</strong><br data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"972\">Sports nutritionists create specialized diet plans for athletes, helping enhance performance, support recovery, and maintain optimal physical condition.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1305\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1145\">Wellness Coach:</strong><br data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1148\">Wellness coaches guide individuals and groups in adopting healthier lifestyles by providing support and advice on nutrition, fitness, and overall well-being.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-(--header-height)\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"ded30066-bd02-4ff6-9116-23f43702417d\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-27\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"user\"></section>\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-35\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-28\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"6ee15671-adb1-4bbe-9b31-9b44bfa451c8\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"397\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The placement process at <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Graphic Era Deemed to be University</span></span> is marked by the consistent participation of several renowned global recruiters each year. This strong industry engagement provides students with excellent career opportunities, enabling them to secure positions in well-established organizations across a wide range of sectors and begin their professional journey on a promising note.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"55\"]', 4.0, NULL, '<p>The programme is further enriched with structured practical training, including internships and clinical rotations, aimed at providing in-depth industry exposure. Through these experiences, students actively engage with clients and patients, perform comprehensive nutritional assessments, and develop as well as execute tailored dietary plans. This hands-on approach significantly enhances their practical expertise and prepares them for professional practice in the field</p>', '[\"1\"]', 438728.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
