<tr data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"716\">\r\n<td data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"699\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"716\" data-col-size=\"sm\">18,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"760\">\r\n<td data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"743\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Half-Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"760\" data-col-size=\"sm\">9,750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"876\"><em data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"876\">Includes charges for examination, library, insurance, student welfare, sports, online student services, and PDP.</em></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6jfe1r\" data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"898\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"898\">Scholarships</strong></span></h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1219\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"940\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"914\">Category</strong></th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"955\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"953\">Benefit</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1219\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1063\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1049\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Wards of Defence Personnel</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1063\">5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1142\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1103\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Scholarship Seats</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1142\">25% seats (First Come, First Serve)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1219\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1182\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Girl Candidates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1219\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Additional 10% on Net Tuition Fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-48\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-54\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"7f6ed996-f49d-4928-ac2b-a10ca612e7b2\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"356\">The B.Sc. in Nutrition and Dietetics programme offers a well-balanced blend of scientific knowledge and practical understanding, focusing on how food choices directly influence human health and well-being. Designed over six semesters, the course gradually builds students&rsquo; expertise, starting from foundational concepts and moving towards applied learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"647\">At its core, the programme emphasizes essential subjects such as Food Science, Dietetics and Counselling, Food Quality and Management, and Family Meal Planning. Alongside these, elective options allow students to explore specific interests and develop a more personalized academic pathway.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"1127\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">What makes the programme particularly effective is its strong focus on application-based learning. Instead of relying solely on theoretical instruction, students actively engage in laboratory work and practical sessions. This hands-on exposure helps them understand real-world scenarios&mdash;whether it&rsquo;s planning balanced diets, managing food quality, or addressing nutritional needs&mdash;ultimately preparing them for professional roles in the field with greater confidence and clarity.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '<p data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"756\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"301\">Dietitian:</strong><br data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"304\">Dietitians work closely with individuals to design personalized nutrition plans based on their health goals and medical conditions. Whether it involves weight management, improving fitness, or addressing specific health concerns, they carefully analyze dietary needs and create structured meal plans that support long-term wellness. Their role often includes continuous monitoring and guidance to help clients stay consistent with their health journey.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"1204\"><strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"781\">Clinical Dietitian:</strong><br data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"784\">Clinical dietitians primarily work in healthcare settings such as hospitals and clinics, where they manage the nutritional care of patients. They collaborate with medical professionals to design therapeutic diets that support recovery and treatment. With strong knowledge of nutrition, hygiene, and food safety, they ensure that patients receive safe and appropriate dietary support tailored to their medical conditions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1587\"><strong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1223\">Nutritionist:</strong><br data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1226\">Nutritionists focus on promoting healthy eating habits among the general population. They assess dietary patterns, identify nutritional gaps, and guide individuals in improving their everyday food choices. Acting as food and lifestyle advisors, they help people build balanced diets that support overall health, prevention of diseases, and long-term well-being.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"2060\"><strong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1635\">Marketing Manager (Nutrition/Food Sector):</strong><br data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1638\">In the nutrition and food industry, marketing managers are responsible for developing and executing strategies that promote health-related products and services. They ensure effective communication of product benefits to the target audience. In some cases, professionals in this field also engage with communities through seminars or awareness programs, educating people about healthy eating habits and disease prevention.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"55\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 438728.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(155, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', 'eaebe0ad-c344-4c2c-a7b5-7b9f329ae248', 189, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Full Time [offline]', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-03-30 03:50:03', '2026-03-30 03:50:03', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"283\">Admission to the program is granted on the basis of merit, which is determined by a candidate&rsquo;s performance in the qualifying examination. This approach ensures a fair and transparent selection process, giving importance to consistent academic achievement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"662\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>', 1, '<p>Applicants must have successfully completed their 12th grade from a recognized board with either Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB) or Physics, Chemistry, and Mathematics (PCM) as their core subjects. This requirement ensures that students possess the necessary foundational knowledge to effectively understand and engage with the course content.</p>', '<p>Total Fee (Per Year Installment)-213465 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"w-full min-w-max border-collapse text-[10px] sm:text-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">One Time Payable</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Admission Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Enrolment Fee</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Caution Money (Refundable)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">3000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Other Charges^</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20900</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10950</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"365\">The M.Sc. in Foods &amp; Nutrition is a thoughtfully designed postgraduate programme that blends advanced theoretical concepts with hands-on practical learning to build strong expertise in the field of nutrition science. It goes beyond basic knowledge to help students understand food at a deeper scientific level and its role in maintaining and improving human health.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"674\">A major focus of the programme is the scientific study of food composition, nutrient functions, and how dietary patterns influence overall well-being. Students explore how nutrition can be effectively applied not only to promote good health but also to prevent and manage various lifestyle-related diseases.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"901\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Through this integrated approach, learners develop a strong foundation in both food science and clinical nutrition, enabling them to connect dietary knowledge with real-world health outcomes in a meaningful and practical way.</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-55\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-68\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"8bb79755-01bb-4192-8456-721ea970b932\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"495\"><strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"320\">Food Quality Assurance Manager:</strong><br data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"323\">Responsible for ensuring that food products meet safety, hygiene, and quality standards throughout the production process, maintaining compliance with industry regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"678\"><strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"522\">Nutrition Consultant:</strong><br data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"525\">Works with individuals or organizations to provide expert dietary advice, helping design nutrition plans that support health, fitness, and medical needs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"836\"><strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"699\">Food Scientist:</strong><br data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"702\">Focuses on studying food composition, processing, and preservation to improve quality, safety, and nutritional value of food products.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"1018\"><strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"869\">Public Health Nutritionist:</strong><br data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"872\">Works at the community level to promote healthy eating habits, design nutrition programs, and address malnutrition and diet-related health issues.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1182\"><strong data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1055\">Product Development Specialist:</strong><br data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1058\">Involved in creating and improving new food products by combining scientific research with consumer needs and market trends.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1363\"><strong data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1215\">Nutrition Writer / Blogger:</strong><br data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1218\">Communicates nutrition knowledge through articles, blogs, and digital platforms to educate the public about healthy eating and lifestyle choices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1535\"><strong data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1391\">Clinical Nutritionist:</strong><br data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1394\">Works in healthcare settings to design therapeutic diets for patients, supporting recovery and managing medical conditions through nutrition.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1726\"><strong data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1577\">Food Research and Development (R&amp;D):</strong><br data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1580\">Engages in innovation and experimentation to develop new food products and improve existing formulations in terms of taste, nutrition, and safety.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1911\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1753\">Wellness Coordinator:</strong><br data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1756\">Plans and implements wellness programs in organizations, focusing on improving overall health, nutrition, and lifestyle habits of individuals or employees.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"344\">The M.Sc. in Foods &amp; Nutrition programme is closely aligned with industry practices through its strong engagement with food sector organizations and professional bodies. This industry-oriented approach helps students move beyond classroom learning and gain a realistic understanding of how nutrition science is applied in professional settings.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"707\">A key feature of the programme is regular interaction with industry experts through guest lectures, hands-on workshops, and educational visits to relevant facilities. These experiences expose students to current trends, emerging technologies, and practical challenges in the food and nutrition sector, making their learning more relevant and application-driven&nbsp; .&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; In addition, these industry linkages play an important role in professional development by creating valuable networking opportunities. Students are able to connect with experts and practitioners, gain career insights, and explore diverse pathways in nutrition, food science, research, and allied health sectors.</p>', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-53\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-64\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"74cf5fb0-edbf-4ba7-b225-dc849ad81442\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"338\">The M.Sc. in Foods &amp; Nutrition places strong emphasis on experiential learning, ensuring that students are not only conceptually sound but also industry-ready. A significant part of the programme is dedicated to practical training, where learners actively engage in well-equipped laboratories to build technical competence and confidence.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"664\">Through hands-on exposure, students gain valuable experience in areas such as food analysis, advanced food processing techniques, and nutritional assessment methods. This practical engagement helps them understand how scientific principles are applied in real situations, strengthening both accuracy and analytical thinking.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"1038\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In addition, the programme incorporates internships and industry collaborations that bridge the gap between academics and professional practice. By working in real-world environments, students learn to apply their knowledge effectively, develop problem-solving skills, and gain insights into current industry standards and expectations in the field of foods and nutrition.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '[\"1\"]', 213465.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
