of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<div class=\"flex h-svh w-screen flex-col\">\r\n<div class=\"relative z-0 flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1\">\r\n<div class=\"relative flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1\">\r\n<div class=\"@container/main relative flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col -translate-y-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)/2)] pt-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)/2)]\">\r\n<div class=\"@w-sm/main:[scrollbar-gutter:var(--stage-scroll-gutter)] touch:[scrollbar-width:none] group/scroll-root relative flex min-h-0 min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col [scrollbar-gutter:stable] not-print:overflow-x-clip not-print:overflow-y-auto group-data-stream-active/scroll-root:[overflow-anchor:none] scroll-pt-(--header-height) [--sticky-padding-top:var(--header-height)] [--sticky-padding-bottom:0px] [--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-top:calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+env(safe-area-inset-top,0px))] [--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom:calc(var(--sticky-padding-bottom)+var(--screen-keyboard-height,0px)+env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))] [--scroll-root-safe-area-height:calc(100lvh-var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-top)-var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom))] has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xl]:@w-xl/main:scroll-pt-0 has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xl]:@w-xl/main:[--sticky-padding-top:0px] has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xxl]:@w-2xl/main:scroll-pt-0 has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xxl]:@w-2xl/main:[--sticky-padding-top:0px]\" data-scroll-root=\"\" data-scroll-from-top=\"\"><main id=\"main\" class=\"min-h-0 flex-1\">\r\n<div id=\"thread\" class=\"group/thread flex flex-col min-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"composer-parent flex flex-1 flex-col focus-visible:outline-0\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n<div class=\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\">\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0469434a-d430-484a-b5df-98d34f866a17-67\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-90\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"bbdddf70-8e4b-4f23-992f-bdd4b5f62c37\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"319\">The B.Sc. (Hons.) Microbiology programme is designed to build a strong scientific foundation by focusing on the study of microorganisms and their applications in health, industry, and research. The curriculum is carefully structured to help students understand microbial systems at both fundamental and advanced levels.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"685\">At the core of the programme, students study essential subjects such as Microbial Physiology, Microbial Genetics, Immunology, Genetic Engineering, Biotechnology, Molecular Biology, Bioinstrumentation, and General Microbiology. These courses collectively develop a deep understanding of microbial structure, function, and their role in various biological processes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"910\">In addition to core subjects, the programme also offers specialized areas of study including Mycology, Virology, Immunology, and Parasitology, allowing students to explore specific branches of microbiology in greater depth.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1217\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Microbiology also plays a significant role in the study of pathology, as it provides essential insights into disease mechanisms, diagnosis, and prevention. This integrated approach ensures that students are well-prepared for both higher studies and professional careers in biological and medical science<input id=\"upload-files\" tabindex=\"-1\" multiple=\"multiple\" type=\"file\"></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</main></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"844\"><strong data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"349\">Microbiologist:</strong><br data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"352\">Microbiologists work in laboratory environments where they study microorganisms such as bacteria, viruses, and fungi in detail. Their role involves analyzing microbial behavior, documenting research findings, and understanding how these organisms affect human health and the environment. This knowledge is crucial in diagnosing infectious diseases and developing effective solutions such as vaccines, antibiotics, and other therapeutic innovations that help in disease prevention and control.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"1318\"><strong data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"885\">Food Technologist / Food Scientist:</strong><br data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"888\">Food technologists ensure that food products are safe, high in quality, and suitable for consumption. They are actively involved in monitoring food production processes, improving preservation techniques, and enhancing packaging methods to extend shelf life and maintain nutritional value. Their work also includes research on developing better food processing systems that align with safety regulations and consumer expectations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1804\"><strong data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1345\">Biomedical Scientist:</strong><br data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1348\">Biomedical scientists focus on studying human diseases at a scientific level with the goal of improving diagnosis, treatment, and prevention methods. Working primarily in laboratory settings, they analyze biological samples and conduct research to understand disease mechanisms. Their findings contribute to the development of advanced medical treatments, innovative diagnostic tools, and improved healthcare solutions that support better patient outcomes.</p>', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"682\">Graduates of the B.Sc. (Hons.) Microbiology programme from <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Graphic Era Deemed to be University</span></span> have access to a wide spectrum of career opportunities across both public and private sectors. Their expertise is valued in areas such as agriculture departments, beverage and chemical industries, environmental management and conservation organizations, fermentation-based industries, healthcare services, medical and diagnostic laboratories, horticulture, national parks, and pharmaceutical companies, among others. This diversity of opportunities highlights the strong interdisciplinary relevance of microbiology in solving real-world challenges across science, health, and industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"966\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In addition, the university&rsquo;s placement ecosystem is strengthened each year by the participation of several reputed global recruiters, offering students valuable exposure to industry-driven career pathways and opportunities to join established organizations across multiple sectors.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"144\",\"145\",\"146\",\"147\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 438933.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
