\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">9750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"8\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"318\">The program is designed to maintain a strong balance between classroom learning and practical training, helping students build both conceptual understanding and clinical skills. Along with theoretical knowledge, students gain hands-on experience that prepares them for real-world healthcare settings.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"519\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">This integrated approach enables learners to deliver primary care services, recognize early signs of serious conditions, and contribute effectively to improving overall patient health and well-being.</p>', '<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"df8df407-9616-48f6-be31-87f7703333bd\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"347\">A Bachelor of Public Health (BPH) opens up diverse career opportunities across the healthcare and community health sectors. Graduates can work in government health departments, hospitals, NGOs, and public health organizations, where they contribute to disease prevention, health promotion, and community awareness programs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"660\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">They can also pursue roles in research, teaching, and healthcare management, depending on their interests. With the growing focus on preventive healthcare and rising global health challenges, public health professionals are increasingly in demand, offering strong career growth and meaningful impact in society.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"mx-auto\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"inline-flex rounded-xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700\">\r\n<div class=\"me-12 flex items-center px-4 py-3 text-start\">\r\n<div class=\"ms-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-token-main-surface-primary-inverse text-sm font-semibold\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"303\">The program includes a compulsory one-year internship in reputed hospitals and healthcare settings, giving students valuable real-world experience and practical exposure. This phase helps them apply their academic knowledge while building professional skills and confidence.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"505\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">In addition, students receive training in advanced areas of public health, enabling them to understand modern healthcare challenges, prevention strategies, and effective community-based interventions.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 532133.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
