border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">20500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Half Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 text-blue-900\">10750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">Scholarship for Wards of Defence personnel: 5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">25% of all seats are available for scholarship, schorlarship will be given on first come first serve basis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always hover:bg-blue-50\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">^ Includes Examination, Library, Insurance, Student Welfare, Sports, Online student info, PDP etc)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b last:border-0 transition-colors snap-start snap-always bg-blue-100\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<td class=\"px-1.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-3 border-r last:border-0 sticky left-0 z-20 font-semibold bg-blue-800 text-white shadow-[2px_0_5px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\" colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\">10% Additional Scholarship on Net Tuition Fee for Girls Candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p>This specialization trains designers to craft compelling visual narratives and brand experiences across diverse media, enhancing Human Intelligence (HI) by fostering visual literacy, critical thinking, and impactful communication that informs, persuades, engages, and evokes emotional responses, while also considering the strategic role of visual communication in achieving business and social objectives. It integrates design principles with visual storytelling techniques to emphasize typography, composition, information design, and motion graphics, while exploring the potential of AI-assisted design tools to augment creative workflows and the ethical implications of visual messaging.</p>\r\n<p>The curriculum progresses from visual composition and typography fundamentals to advanced skills in branding and identity systems, digital media design, and animation.</p>\r\n<p>Students learn to develop visual identities, design layouts for print and digital publications, create engaging motion graphics, apply strategic design thinking to advertising and campaigns, and understand how visual communication can contribute to brand building, marketing effectiveness, and social change.</p>\r\n<p>This prepares graduates to communicate effectively, build strong brands, create impactful visual communication, and navigate the complexities of the evolving media landscape, with an awareness of both business goals and socio-cultural responsibilities.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 1296750.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(178, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '86f16f1d-cd08-447b-a788-d694fdd6490b', 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-04-24 01:25:05', '2026-06-16 06:48:41', '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:06893536-92e3-4e74-995d-0257f9a82824-16\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-28\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"39f7dc75-5d19-408d-afb2-c8acdef669ca\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"333\">The admission process for the Online BBA course at Graphic Era University is fully digital, making it convenient for students to apply from anywhere. Candidates can complete the entire enrollment process through the official online admission portal without visiting the campus.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 1: Online Registration</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"460\">Visit the official Graphic Era Online website and register using your basic details such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"537\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u7na1o\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"475\">\r\n<p>Full Name</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dep5uz\" data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"493\">\r\n<p>Mobile Number</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36fvl5\" data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"506\">\r\n<p>Email ID</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"22wh5c\" data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"537\">\r\n<p>Preferred Course Selection</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"613\">After registration, login credentials or OTP verification may be provided.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lhthk6\" data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"652\">Step 2: Fill the Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"899\">Log in to the admission portal and complete the Online BBA application form by entering accurate personal, academic, and communication details. Students should carefully review all information before submission to avoid future correction delays.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ff8ob\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"938\">Step 3: Upload Required Documents</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1161\">Upload scanned copies of the required documents in the prescribed format. Usually, students need to submit identity proof, academic documents, photograph, signature, and any additional records requested by the university.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xdy74e\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1193\">Step 4: Pay Admission Fees</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1333\">After form completion, proceed with the online payment process. Fees can generally be paid through secure digital payment methods such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\n<p>Debit Card</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1365\">\r\n<p>Credit Card</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<p>Net Banking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17brhus\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\n<p>UPI</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1456\">Keep the payment receipt or transaction reference for future use.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1r4dibx\" data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1491\">Step 5: Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1670\">The university admission team verifies the submitted application and uploaded documents. If any discrepancy is found, candidates may be contacted for clarification or re-upload.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vyyi4e\" data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1706\">Step 6: Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1865\">Once verification and payment are successfully completed, the university issues admission confirmation through email, SMS, or student dashboard notification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jwbe9p\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1906\">Step 7: Student Portal / LMS Access</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"2106\">After final confirmation, enrolled students receive access to the Learning Management System (LMS), where they can begin classes, access study material, attend lectures, and track academic progress.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kqnjz9\" data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2134\">Quick Admission Summary</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2299\">Register online, fill the application form, upload documents, pay fees, complete verification, receive confirmation, and start learning through the student portal.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', 1, '<p data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"476\">Candidates seeking admission to the Online BBA program at Graphic Era University must have completed <strong data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"203\">10+2 or an equivalent qualification</strong> in any stream from a <strong data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"269\">recognized Board, University, or Council</strong>. Students from Science, Commerce, or Arts backgrounds can apply for the program, making it a suitable option for learners from diverse academic streams who wish to build a career in business and management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"753\">Students <strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"513\">appearing for Class 12</strong> may also apply subject to submission of final qualifying results within the timelines prescribed by the university. This allows eligible students to begin the admission process early and secure their seat for the upcoming academic session.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"901\">Candidates from the <strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"789\">NIOS board</strong> are generally eligible, provided the qualification is recognized and fulfills the university&rsquo;s admission norms.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ja1qv0\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"935\">Accepted Academic Backgrounds</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"993\">Students from the following streams can typically apply:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1106\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4h0lx\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1007\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y83j8c\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1019\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmjua6\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1041\">Arts / Humanities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nbm0t9\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1106\">Vocational streams (equivalent qualification where accepted)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fr96qo\" data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1139\">Important Points to Remember</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1413\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o0oqc0\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1210\">The qualifying examination must be from a recognized institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1166p2k\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1283\">Equivalent qualifications may be considered as per university norms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"149qqug\" data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1340\">Final admission is subject to document verification.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w8djf0\" data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1413\">Students should ensure all submitted records are accurate and valid.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vmy1bl\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1458\">Why This Eligibility is Student-Friendly</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1766\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The broad eligibility structure allows students from multiple streams to pursue management education without restricting admission only to Commerce students. This creates wider opportunities for learners planning careers in business, marketing, finance, entrepreneurship, operations, or future MBA studies.</p>', '<table style=\"width: 509px;\" width=\"509\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 55.0729px;\" width=\"64\"><strong>Year</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.4375px;\" width=\"98\"><strong>Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 82.3542px;\" width=\"99\"><strong>Exam Fee&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.667px;\" width=\"136\"><strong>Online Course Material</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.5938px;\" width=\"112\"><strong>Total Per Year</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.4583px;\"><strong>Monthly fee</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 55.0729px;\"><strong>I</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.4375px;\"><strong>21500</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 82.3542px;\"><strong>1500</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.667px;\"><strong>2000</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.5938px;\"><strong>25000</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.4583px;\"><strong>2083</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 55.0729px;\"><strong>II</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.4375px;\"><strong>21500</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 82.3542px;\"><strong>1500</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.667px;\"><strong>2000</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.5938px;\"><strong>25000</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.4583px;\"><strong>2083</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 55.0729px;\"><strong>III</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.4375px;\"><strong>21500</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 82.3542px;\"><strong>1500</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.667px;\"><strong>2000</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.5938px;\"><strong>25000</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.4583px;\"><strong>2083</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"432\">The <strong data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"100\">Graphic Era University Online BBA curriculum</strong> is strategically designed to develop future business professionals with strong managerial knowledge, leadership ability, communication skills, and industry-ready competencies. This program blends core business education with modern digital learning, helping students understand how organizations operate in real-world environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"877\">The curriculum is structured semester-wise to gradually build knowledge from foundational concepts to advanced management applications. Students learn finance, marketing, human resource management, entrepreneurship, business law, analytics, economics, and modern business technologies. The Online BBA syllabus is highly relevant for students planning careers in management, startups, corporate roles, family business expansion, or MBA studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"1099\">Unlike outdated business programs that focus only on theory, this curriculum is aligned with current market expectations where employers value communication, decision-making, adaptability, and digital business awareness.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"natxoo\" data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1156\">Why the Graphic Era Online BBA Curriculum Stands Out</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1352\">The Online BBA program is designed for students who need flexibility without sacrificing academic quality. It focuses on employability, practical business understanding, and professional growth.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vmwszs\" data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1381\">Key Curriculum Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1771\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uwljzd\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1431\">Strong foundation in business and management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jzsgge\" data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1482\">Exposure to finance, HR, and marketing domains</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pyi2n6\" data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1542\">Practical learning through assignments and case studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2boooi\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1588\">Digital business and technology awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n6xig9\" data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1633\">Communication and leadership development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12t1hdh\" data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1670\">Entrepreneurial mindset building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w9n71l\" data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1722\">Career readiness for private and public sectors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a2gdck\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1771\">Strong base for MBA and postgraduate studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3gttmj\" data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1832\">Semester-Wise Graphic Era University Online BBA Syllabus</h3>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pkxfqe\" data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1884\">First Semester &ndash; Building Business Fundamentals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"2076\">The first semester introduces students to the basic principles of business and communication. It helps learners transition into professional education and understand how businesses function.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zxestg\" data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2097\">Common Subjects</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2250\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ebawn\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2127\">Principles of Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19a9qum\" data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2154\">Business Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2179\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14xanf2\" data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2198\">Microeconomics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x1qbf\" data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2224\">Computer Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g9d8hl\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2250\">Environmental Studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2272\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2403\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qd8rlh\" data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2303\">Basic managerial thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rm2fbg\" data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2332\">Communication confidence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cl2470\" data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2367\">Understanding business systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aacnfx\" data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2403\">Numerical and accounting basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hd5zqf\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2467\">Second Semester &ndash; Core Commerce and Organizational Learning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2630\">This semester strengthens the commercial and operational side of management education. Students begin understanding markets, organizations, and economic systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zxestg\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2651\">Common Subjects</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2796\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q0opgn\" data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2681\">Organizational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"osm8sm\" data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2700\">Macroeconomics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j6xavf\" data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2724\">Business Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1bn7m\" data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2744\">Cost Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"unuf5k\" data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2771\">Marketing Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uhocey\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2796\">Business Mathematics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2818\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uvke42\" data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2843\">Data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t3qkqi\" data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2876\">Organizational understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bg4n2f\" data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2897\">Market awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"db6umo\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2921\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rr38ee\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2972\">Third Semester &ndash; Management Applications Begin</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2974\" data-end=\"3104\">By the third semester, students move into practical management domains. Subjects become more career-oriented and industry-focused.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zxestg\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3125\">Common Subjects</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3287\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fqwsby\" data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3156\">Human Resource Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15obis4\" data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3173\">Business Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6r389b\" data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3196\">Consumer Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jccnay\" data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3222\">Management Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e6ona2\" data-start=\"3223\" data-end=\"3255\">Entrepreneurship Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fot0ut\" data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3287\">Research Methodology Basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3309\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3413\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ldhw3l\" data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3326\">HR concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19cmujq\" data-start=\"3327\" data-end=\"3355\">Legal business awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wetivf\" data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3393\">Customer psychology understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pt64g1\" data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3413\">Startup mindset</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hpawqa\" data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3465\">Fourth Semester &ndash; Functional Business Expertise</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3585\">This semester builds professional specialization knowledge and helps students understand internal business operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zxestg\" data-start=\"3587\" data-end=\"3606\">Common Subjects</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3754\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pbto8i\" data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3632\">Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k01zf9\" data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3673\">Production and Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vj2jpv\" data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3694\">Sales Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i0kwnv\" data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3719\">Business Environment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19l4swt\" data-start=\"3720\" data-end=\"3734\">E-Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m56iy9\" data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3754\">Taxation Basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3776\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3895\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dgrv8b\" data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3807\">Financial decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qqcf2x\" data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3835\">Sales process knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b0rxv1\" data-start=\"3836\" data-end=\"3860\">Operational planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k4if9n\" data-start=\"3861\" data-end=\"3895\">Digital commerce understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11lwmn\" data-start=\"3897\" data-end=\"3944\">Fifth Semester &ndash; Advanced Strategic Learning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"4052\">Students now begin studying higher-level management functions used in real companies and leadership roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zxestg\" data-start=\"4054\" data-end=\"4073\">Common Subjects</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4075\" data-end=\"4243\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"4075\" data-end=\"4099\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4126\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5ct14t\" data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4148\">Talent Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f0uzzq\" data-start=\"4149\" data-end=\"4170\">Digital Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2eg05\" data-start=\"4171\" data-end=\"4198\">Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tn55bc\" data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4243\">Business Ethics and Corporate Governance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4265\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4390\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16cfrod\" data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4289\">Strategic planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y5to1a\" data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4319\">Global business awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m97oc1\" data-start=\"4320\" data-end=\"4358\">Branding and digital growth skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18vd5r\" data-start=\"4359\" data-end=\"4390\">Ethical leadership thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tisbgz\" data-start=\"4392\" data-end=\"4453\">Sixth Semester &ndash; Career Readiness and Industry Orientation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4455\" data-end=\"4567\">The final semester is usually focused on professional readiness, applied learning, and future career transition.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zxestg\" data-start=\"4569\" data-end=\"4588\">Common Subjects</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4590\" data-end=\"4771\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"4590\" data-end=\"4612\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e0tj0u\" data-start=\"4613\" data-end=\"4635\">Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k87wab\" data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4657\">Leadership Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ocll3y\" data-start=\"4658\" data-end=\"4680\">Startup Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bwupxp\" data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4717\">Capstone Project / Major Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1927vgp\" data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4771\">Internship / Practical Assessment (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"4773\" data-end=\"4793\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4795\" data-end=\"4899\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vk6wog\" data-start=\"4795\" data-end=\"4825\">Real-world problem solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xrtiui\" data-start=\"4826\" data-end=\"4849\">Leadership maturity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qs7m6s\" data-start=\"4850\" data-end=\"4875\">Data-driven decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwr3mj\" data-start=\"4876\" data-end=\"4899\">Corporate readiness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3vd295\" data-start=\"4901\" data-end=\"4954\">Major Learning Areas Covered in the Entire Program</h3>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134wfgf\" data-start=\"4956\" data-end=\"4977\">Management Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4979\" data-end=\"5075\">Students understand planning, organizing, staffing, leadership, motivation, and control systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v9ugef\" data-start=\"5077\" data-end=\"5097\">Finance Education</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5099\" data-end=\"5203\">Students learn accounting, budgeting, cost control, financial analysis, and money management principles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"68vrkj\" data-start=\"5205\" data-end=\"5227\">Marketing Knowledge</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5229\" data-end=\"5333\">The syllabus covers branding, promotions, sales, customer acquisition, and digital marketing strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rya283\" data-start=\"5335\" data-end=\"5363\">Human Resource Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5365\" data-end=\"5465\">Students gain understanding of recruitment, training, employee motivation, and workplace management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2jquhj\" data-start=\"5467\" data-end=\"5498\">Entrepreneurship Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5500\" data-end=\"5606\">The program encourages business creation, innovation, startup planning, and self-employment opportunities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cck7ai\" data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5636\">Digital Business Exposure</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5638\" data-end=\"5747\">Modern business tools such as e-commerce, online branding, analytics, and information systems are introduced.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mydqd9\" data-start=\"5749\" data-end=\"5798\">Practical Components of Graphic Era Online BBA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5800\" data-end=\"5883\">A strong curriculum is not only about subjects. Practical exposure matters greatly.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gw8j79\" data-start=\"5885\" data-end=\"5914\">Common Practical Elements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5916\" data-end=\"6086\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"plc8zl\" data-start=\"5916\" data-end=\"5939\">Case study analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1833o25\" data-start=\"5940\" data-end=\"5957\">Presentations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13gg166\" data-start=\"5958\" data-end=\"5982\">Business assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vkcak\" data-start=\"5983\" data-end=\"6001\">Online quizzes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a6ljpg\" data-start=\"6002\" data-end=\"6023\">Group discussions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xhu11v\" data-start=\"6024\" data-end=\"6054\">Industry-oriented projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h49in2\" data-start=\"6055\" data-end=\"6086\">Final semester project work</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16nmy89\" data-start=\"6088\" data-end=\"6131\">Why This Curriculum is Valuable for Jobs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6133\" data-end=\"6246\">Many students choose BBA for employability. This curriculum supports entry-level and growth roles across sectors.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lmi8f8\" data-start=\"6248\" data-end=\"6294\">Career Opportunities After This Curriculum</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6296\" data-end=\"6704\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xob729\" data-start=\"6296\" data-end=\"6352\">Business Development Executive &ndash; Client growth roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0ey57\" data-start=\"6353\" data-end=\"6407\">Marketing Executive &ndash; Promotion and branding roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16cqyqu\" data-start=\"6408\" data-end=\"6460\">HR Executive &ndash; Recruitment and people management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e88p2p\" data-start=\"6461\" data-end=\"6518\">Finance Associate &ndash; Accounts and financial operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"62l1s2\" data-start=\"6519\" data-end=\"6570\">Operations Executive &ndash; Process management roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e6lfpk\" data-start=\"6571\" data-end=\"6617\">Sales Executive &ndash; Revenue generation roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1upd3s5\" data-start=\"6618\" data-end=\"6654\">Entrepreneur &ndash; Start own venture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8dra0y\" data-start=\"6655\" data-end=\"6704\">MBA Aspirant &ndash; Strong postgraduate foundation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tyqff4\" data-start=\"6706\" data-end=\"6747\">Hidden Advantages Most Students Ignore</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6749\" data-end=\"6850\">Students often focus only on degree value, but curriculum quality determines long-term career growth.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pfoad4\" data-start=\"6852\" data-end=\"6876\">Important Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6878\" data-end=\"7108\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"25qvvd\" data-start=\"6878\" data-end=\"6912\">Multi-domain business exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o4znsj\" data-start=\"6913\" data-end=\"6949\">Strong communication improvement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qu0jfl\" data-start=\"6950\" data-end=\"6980\">Better interview readiness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x02qtt\" data-start=\"6981\" data-end=\"7017\">Professional confidence building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v7fcve\" data-start=\"7018\" data-end=\"7060\">Stronger MBA entrance preparation base</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iuzvt3\" data-start=\"7061\" data-end=\"7108\">Corporate vocabulary and business awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"axljpa\" data-start=\"7110\" data-end=\"7161\">Common Mistakes Students Make While Studying BBA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7163\" data-end=\"7208\">Avoid these common errors during the program:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7210\" data-end=\"7393\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1migyd3\" data-start=\"7210\" data-end=\"7243\">Ignoring communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"23dq8a\" data-start=\"7244\" data-end=\"7271\">Studying only for exams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8srmhs\" data-start=\"7272\" data-end=\"7310\">Not learning Excel / digital tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6wedgm\" data-start=\"7311\" data-end=\"7335\">Avoiding internships</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h31kp7\" data-start=\"7336\" data-end=\"7362\">Weak networking habits</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncdql7\" data-start=\"7363\" data-end=\"7393\">No specialization planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7755\" data-end=\"8157\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"32\",\"33\",\"34\",\"35\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 75000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(179, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '86f16f1d-cd08-447b-a788-d694fdd6490b', 39, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-04-24 01:58:31', '2026-06-16 06:47:56', '<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"449\">The <strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"117\">Graphic Era University Online BCA admission process</strong> is designed for students who want to build a career in technology, software development, data science, IT services, and digital industries through a flexible online learning format. The university offers a streamlined digital admission system that allows students to apply from anywhere without the need to visit campus physically.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"811\">The <strong data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"502\">Online BCA course at Graphic Era University</strong> is ideal for fresh students, working learners, and candidates looking for a recognized computer applications degree with modern career relevance. To secure admission smoothly, applicants should understand the complete process, required documents, fee steps, verification stages, and common mistakes to avoid.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"637k1x\" data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"860\">Why Choose Graphic Era University Online BCA</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"1111\">The Online BCA program is suitable for students who want to study computer applications with convenience and career focus. The curriculum generally covers programming, databases, web development, networking, cloud concepts, and digital technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1129\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z7e2jf\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1177\">Flexible online learning from any location</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c2fk3j\" data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1232\">Industry-relevant computer applications curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12p92zo\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1284\">Career opportunities in IT and software sectors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qjbc96\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1336\">Suitable for students and working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a3fmga\" data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1382\">Digital study material and online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1urcfr3\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1431\">Strong foundation for MCA and higher studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1emewyk\" data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1487\">Graphic Era University Online BCA Admission Process</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1630\">The university generally follows a fully online application model for Online BCA admissions. Candidates should complete each stage carefully.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"aqkxdu\" data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1662\">Step 1: Online Registration</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1766\">Visit the official Graphic Era Online admission portal and create an account using your basic details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uf2bi8\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1804\">Usually Required at Registration</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1902\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u7na1o\" data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1819\">Full Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dep5uz\" data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1837\">Mobile Number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36fvl5\" data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1850\">Email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1op555j\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1885\">Preferred Program (Online BCA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ligt3\" data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1902\">State / City</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1966\">After registration, OTP or login credentials may be generated.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"faon2i\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2015\">Step 2: Fill the Online BCA Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2093\">After logging in, candidates need to complete the detailed application form.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"earsr\" data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2128\">Information Commonly Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2287\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2150\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kjoihg\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2184\">Parent / guardian information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v13gkv\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2205\">Academic history</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2225\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkv6b6\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2250\">Identity information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1it83p5\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2287\">Category details (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2333\">Ensure all entries match official documents.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fbg3hk\" data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2371\">Step 3: Upload Required Documents</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2460\">Students are usually asked to upload scanned copies of academic and identity documents.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vk3dum\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2491\">Common Documents Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2674\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulae2l\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2515\">Class 10 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"96qfqx\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2547\">Class 12 marksheet / result</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5tdwx1\" data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2576\">Passport size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yra9zg\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2590\">Signature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"101q05u\" data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2624\">Aadhaar Card / valid ID proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tnka6i\" data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2674\">Transfer / migration certificate if requested</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2721\">Clear and readable uploads help avoid delays.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k854rx\" data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2752\">Step 4: Pay Admission Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2831\">Once the form is completed, candidates usually proceed to online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"no3yo1\" data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2857\">Common Payment Modes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2944\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2873\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2889\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2905\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17brhus\" data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"2913\">UPI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rm4em\" data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2944\">EMI options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2988\">Always save payment confirmation receipts.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12u5pu2\" data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3036\">Step 5: Application Review and Verification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3203\">The university admission team checks submitted information and uploaded documents. If any issue is found, candidates may be contacted for correction or resubmission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gm00t5\" data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3242\">Reasons Verification Gets Delayed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3375\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"71hn9y\" data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3264\">Blurry documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g0s10\" data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3288\">Wrong marks entered</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jj5wrv\" data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3306\">Name mismatch</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gc3zt6\" data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3338\">Incomplete application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ruwjwx\" data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3375\">Unsuccessful payment transaction</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1geb5p9\" data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3410\">Step 6: Admission Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3512\">After successful verification and payment approval, students generally receive confirmation through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3610\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1myk45o\" data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3534\">Registered email</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o96al4\" data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3549\">SMS alerts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vk52md\" data-start=\"3550\" data-end=\"3573\">Admission dashboard</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9q1iee\" data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3610\">Phone support team communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"j6mnpe\" data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3652\">Step 7: LMS Access and Academic Start</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3739\">Once admission is finalized, students receive access to the online learning platform.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o11zn8\" data-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3764\">Students Can Access</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3882\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3fguj\" data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3787\">Recorded lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8imkcm\" data-start=\"3788\" data-end=\"3804\">Live classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12a9mov\" data-start=\"3805\" data-end=\"3824\">Study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f7qwlk\" data-start=\"3825\" data-end=\"3840\">Assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cq9jk1\" data-start=\"3841\" data-end=\"3852\">Notices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"82dhm\" data-start=\"3853\" data-end=\"3862\">Exams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qi0tef\" data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3882\">Faculty support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1y89oy7\" data-start=\"3884\" data-end=\"3950\">Graphic Era University Online BCA Admission Documents Checklist</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"3996\">Before applying, keep these documents ready:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4135\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"blazs4\" data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4021\">Academic marksheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rsbash\" data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4034\">ID proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djs98o\" data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4049\">Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yra9zg\" data-start=\"4050\" data-end=\"4063\">Signature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y1ztlp\" data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4087\">Valid mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jj3bxh\" data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4107\">Active email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"luj9yb\" data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4135\">Payment method for fees</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17470de\" data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4183\">Best Time to Apply for Online BCA Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4323\">Students should apply early in the admission cycle to avoid last-minute technical issues, delayed verification, and seat closure concerns.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dxp2jy\" data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4360\">Advantages of Early Application</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4362\" data-end=\"4502\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1375nuy\" data-start=\"4362\" data-end=\"4388\">Faster document review</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lg6mng\" data-start=\"4389\" data-end=\"4418\">Better onboarding support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q74jwv\" data-start=\"4419\" data-end=\"4447\">Timely access to classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dsjv75\" data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4471\">Smooth fee planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lv0jaf\" data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4502\">Less rush during deadlines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pscl3l\" data-start=\"4504\" data-end=\"4544\">Common Mistakes Students Should Avoid</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4604\">Many applicants face delays because of avoidable mistakes.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ldnamv\" data-start=\"4606\" data-end=\"4628\">Avoid These Errors</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4630\" data-end=\"4825\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wjzdyd\" data-start=\"4630\" data-end=\"4661\">Wrong email or phone number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sqz7jx\" data-start=\"4662\" data-end=\"4692\">Uploading unreadable files</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jix667\" data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4723\">Waiting until deadline day</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s0q865\" data-start=\"4724\" data-end=\"4755\">Selecting wrong course mode</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"82tlb7\" data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4785\">Ignoring admission emails</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ksvm9q\" data-start=\"4786\" data-end=\"4825\">Entering incorrect academic details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16lw70\" data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4861\">Who Should Apply for Online BCA</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4898\">The program is highly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4900\" data-end=\"5136\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hr7u72\" data-start=\"4900\" data-end=\"4937\">Students interested in IT careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ab2vw9\" data-start=\"4938\" data-end=\"4978\">Learners wanting flexible graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wo280o\" data-start=\"4979\" data-end=\"5026\">Working candidates upgrading qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gxms8e\" data-start=\"5027\" data-end=\"5058\">Students planning MCA later</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9ki9lz\" data-start=\"5059\" data-end=\"5089\">Future software developers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3cr48\" data-start=\"5090\" data-end=\"5136\">Tech-oriented learners in remote locations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ovvlnl\" data-start=\"5138\" data-end=\"5169\">Career Value After Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5171\" data-end=\"5280\">The Online BCA degree can support entry into various sectors depending on skills developed during the course.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1elvfui\" data-start=\"5282\" data-end=\"5298\">Career Paths</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5300\" data-end=\"5463\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fx5k08\" data-start=\"5300\" data-end=\"5330\">Software Support Executive</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ihonn2\" data-start=\"5331\" data-end=\"5348\">Web Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i5sjep\" data-start=\"5349\" data-end=\"5365\">IT Associate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"amzcpf\" data-start=\"5366\" data-end=\"5392\">Data Entry / MIS Roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ej45w\" data-start=\"5393\" data-end=\"5424\">Technical Support Executive</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ceq5f\" data-start=\"5425\" data-end=\"5446\">Junior Programmer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wq2y2t\" data-start=\"5447\" data-end=\"5463\">MCA Aspirant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kqnjz9\" data-start=\"5465\" data-end=\"5491\">Quick Admission Summary</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5493\" data-end=\"5673\">Register online, fill the BCA application form, upload documents, pay fees, complete verification, receive confirmation, and start learning through the Graphic Era online platform.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jmkquq\" data-start=\"5675\" data-end=\"5691\">Final Verdict</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5693\" data-end=\"6091\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The <strong data-start=\"5697\" data-end=\"5755\">Graphic Era University Online BCA admission guidelines</strong> are student-friendly, convenient, and digitally accessible. Candidates who prepare documents early, fill forms carefully, and apply on time usually experience a smooth admission journey. For students seeking a flexible technology-focused degree, the Online BCA program offers a practical pathway toward IT careers and higher education.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"490\">The <strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"120\">Graphic Era University Online BCA eligibility criteria</strong> are designed for students who want to pursue a career in computer applications, software development, IT services, data analytics, and digital technology fields. The program is open to candidates who have completed their higher secondary education with the required subject background, making it a strong option for students seeking a flexible online technology degree.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"928\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"556\">Online BCA course at Graphic Era University</strong>, candidates must have completed <strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"644\">10+2 or its equivalent examination with Mathematics</strong> from a recognized <strong data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"696\">Board, University, or Council</strong>. Mathematics is an important requirement because the BCA curriculum includes logical reasoning, programming concepts, problem-solving, data handling, and analytical subjects where mathematical understanding becomes highly valuable.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zqc8hb\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"975\">Basic Eligibility for Online BCA Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1031\">Candidates are generally eligible if they have passed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1214\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175650d\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1065\">10+2 from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jub9qu\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1111\">Equivalent higher secondary qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bmy7bv\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1156\">Any stream with Mathematics as a subject</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3fdnue\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1214\">Recognized Board / University / Council qualification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1361\">Students from <strong data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1285\">Science, Commerce, or Arts streams with Mathematics</strong> can usually apply, depending on document verification and university norms.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ngr639\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1397\">Mathematics Requirement for BCA</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1507\">Mathematics plays an essential role in the BCA program because it supports technical learning areas such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1639\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d24kin\" data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1530\">Programming logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16208l0\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1545\">Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yq9p59\" data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1560\">Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vlunrr\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1587\">Data structures basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cghizo\" data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1612\">Analytical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hfu6go\" data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1639\">Computational thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1746\">Students with a Mathematics background often adapt more smoothly to technical subjects during the course.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1prhrpe\" data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1784\">Candidates Appearing for Class 12</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"2007\">Students <strong data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1821\">appearing for Class 12</strong> may also apply subject to submission of final qualifying results within the timeline prescribed by the university. This can help students secure admission early for the upcoming intake.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18tdedl\" data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2034\">NIOS Board Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2235\">Candidates from the <strong data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2070\">NIOS board</strong> are generally eligible if the qualification is recognized and fulfills the required subject condition, including Mathematics, along with university admission norms.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vfx8lq\" data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2265\">Accepted Academic Streams</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2378\">Students from multiple academic backgrounds may be considered if Mathematics was studied in 10+2 or equivalent.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cg119d\" data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2407\">Common Eligible Streams</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2575\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y046tm\" data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2437\">Science with Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"clatpf\" data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2467\">Commerce with Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vqtsyg\" data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2506\">Arts / Humanities with Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11zalci\" data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2575\">Vocational equivalent programs with Mathematics (where accepted)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"mmq11s\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2628\">Important Documents for Eligibility Verification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2711\">During admission, candidates may need to submit documents to confirm eligibility.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"th5q18\" data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2744\">Common Verification Records</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2877\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulae2l\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2768\">Class 10 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eaztxb\" data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2791\">Class 12 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khor53\" data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2829\">Subject proof showing Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2848\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ba4wyv\" data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2877\">Photograph and signature</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pscl3l\" data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2919\">Common Mistakes Students Should Avoid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"3004\">Many applicants misunderstand the eligibility rule. Be careful about the following:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3235\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v003i4\" data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3061\">Assuming any stream without Mathematics is eligible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4fh6to\" data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3097\">Uploading incomplete marksheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a8y135\" data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3137\">Ignoring subject proof requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bawa9e\" data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3189\">Applying with unclear equivalent qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wt54bz\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3235\">Waiting until deadlines for clarification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dt8zcy\" data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3282\">Why This Eligibility Structure Makes Sense</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3535\">The requirement of <strong data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3328\">10+2 with Mathematics</strong> ensures that students entering the Online BCA program are academically prepared for technical subjects, coding logic, quantitative reasoning, and digital problem-solving concepts used throughout the degree.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zthiq6\" data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3568\">Who Should Choose Online BCA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3625\">This program is ideal for students who want careers in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3771\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12la75g\" data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3651\">Software Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p7ia97\" data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3671\">Web Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uxjo4a\" data-start=\"3672\" data-end=\"3686\">IT Support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ihej2\" data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3705\">Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fqz05t\" data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3724\">Cyber Security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ly71mx\" data-start=\"3725\" data-end=\"3744\">Cloud Computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zyedlo\" data-start=\"3745\" data-end=\"3771\">MCA and higher studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mzq1t\" data-start=\"3773\" data-end=\"3801\">Quick Eligibility Summary</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"4008\">Candidates who have passed <strong data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3931\">10+2 with Mathematics or equivalent qualification from a recognized Board, University, or Council</strong> are eligible for admission to the Graphic Era University Online BCA program.</p>', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-557c324b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading animated fadeIn\" data-id=\"557c324b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_tablet&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_mobile&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-499e684 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"499e684\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-499e684 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"499e684\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<table width=\"509\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"64\"><strong>Year</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"98\"><strong>Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"99\"><strong>Exam Fee&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"136\"><strong>Online Course Material</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"112\"><strong>Total Per Year</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>I</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>21500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>1500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2000</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>25000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>II</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>21500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>1500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2000</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>25000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>III</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>21500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>1500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2000</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>25000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"3\",\"10\",\"11\",\"29\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 75000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(180, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '86f16f1d-cd08-447b-a788-d694fdd6490b', 210, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-04-24 02:08:14', '2026-06-16 06:47:39', NULL, 1, '<div class=\"flex h-svh w-screen flex-col\">\r\n<div class=\"relative z-0 flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1\">\r\n<div class=\"relative flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1\">\r\n<div class=\"@container/main relative flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col -translate-y-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)/2)] pt-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)/2)]\">\r\n<div class=\"@w-sm/main:[scrollbar-gutter:var(--stage-scroll-gutter)] touch:[scrollbar-width:none] group/scroll-root relative flex min-h-0 min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col [scrollbar-gutter:stable] not-print:overflow-x-clip not-print:overflow-y-auto group-data-stream-active/scroll-root:[overflow-anchor:none] scroll-pt-(--header-height) [--sticky-padding-top:var(--header-height)] [--sticky-padding-bottom:0px] [--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-top:calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+env(safe-area-inset-top,0px))] [--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom:calc(var(--sticky-padding-bottom)+var(--screen-keyboard-height,0px)+env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))] [--scroll-root-safe-area-height:calc(100lvh-var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-top)-var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom))] has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xl]:@w-xl/main:scroll-pt-0 has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xl]:@w-xl/main:[--sticky-padding-top:0px] has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xxl]:@w-2xl/main:scroll-pt-0 has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xxl]:@w-2xl/main:[--sticky-padding-top:0px]\" data-scroll-root=\"\" data-scroll-from-top=\"\"><main id=\"main\" class=\"min-h-0 flex-1\">\r\n<div id=\"thread\" class=\"group/thread flex flex-col min-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"composer-parent flex flex-1 flex-col focus-visible:outline-0\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n<div class=\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\">\r\n<di