ata-end=\"4076\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex h-svh w-screen flex-col\">\r\n<div class=\"relative z-0 flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1\">\r\n<div class=\"relative flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1\">\r\n<div class=\"@container/main relative flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col -translate-y-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)/2)] pt-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)/2)]\">\r\n<div class=\"@w-sm/main:[scrollbar-gutter:var(--stage-scroll-gutter)] touch:[scrollbar-width:none] group/scroll-root relative flex min-h-0 min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col [scrollbar-gutter:stable] not-print:overflow-x-clip not-print:overflow-y-auto group-data-stream-active/scroll-root:[overflow-anchor:none] scroll-pt-(--header-height) [--sticky-padding-top:var(--header-height)] [--sticky-padding-bottom:0px] [--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-top:calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+env(safe-area-inset-top,0px))] [--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom:calc(var(--sticky-padding-bottom)+var(--screen-keyboard-height,0px)+env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))] [--scroll-root-safe-area-height:calc(100lvh-var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-top)-var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom))] has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xl]:@w-xl/main:scroll-pt-0 has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xl]:@w-xl/main:[--sticky-padding-top:0px] has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xxl]:@w-2xl/main:scroll-pt-0 has-data-[fixed-header=less-than-xxl]:@w-2xl/main:[--sticky-padding-top:0px]\" data-scroll-root=\"\" data-scroll-from-top=\"\"><main id=\"main\" class=\"min-h-0 flex-1\">\r\n<div id=\"thread\" class=\"group/thread flex flex-col min-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"composer-parent flex flex-1 flex-col focus-visible:outline-0\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n<div class=\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\">\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:06893536-92e3-4e74-995d-0257f9a82824-34\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-46\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"8e67c2be-b707-4f4c-9e23-0079c2507036\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"445\">The <strong data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"122\">Graphic Era University Online BCom eligibility criteria</strong> are designed for students who want to build careers in commerce, accounting, finance, taxation, banking, business management, and corporate sectors through a flexible online learning format. The program provides an excellent pathway for students seeking a recognized undergraduate commerce degree while studying from home.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"837\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"512\">Online BCom course at Graphic Era University</strong>, candidates must have completed <strong data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"613\">10+2 or its equivalent examination in Science or Commerce stream</strong> from a recognized <strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"665\">Board, University, or Council</strong>. This eligibility structure allows students from relevant academic backgrounds to enter the commerce field and develop strong professional skills for future career growth.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1febu4\" data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"885\">Basic Eligibility for Online BCom Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"944\">Candidates are generally eligible if they have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q743ob\" data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"997\">10+2 in Commerce stream from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"503636\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1048\">10+2 in Science stream from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mkcu2e\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1129\">Equivalent higher secondary qualification approved by a recognized authority</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4uw77g\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1195\">Qualification from a recognized Board, University, or Council</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1290\">This broad eligibility creates opportunities for students from multiple academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11afg1p\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1325\">Eligible Streams for Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1407\">The Online BCom program is commonly open to students from the following streams:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f8p3ev\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1428\">Commerce Stream</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1574\">Commerce students often have prior exposure to accounting, economics, and business studies, which supports easier transition into BCom subjects.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cckycu\" data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1594\">Science Stream</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1772\">Science students are also eligible and can successfully shift into commerce education, especially if they are interested in finance, management, analytics, or business careers.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1prhrpe\" data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1810\">Candidates Appearing for Class 12</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"2045\">Students <strong data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1847\">appearing for Class 12</strong> may also apply subject to submission of final qualifying results within the timeline prescribed by the university. This helps students secure admission opportunities early for the upcoming session.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18tdedl\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2072\">NIOS Board Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2234\">Candidates from the <strong data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2108\">NIOS board</strong> are generally eligible if the qualification is recognized and fulfills the required stream conditions under university norms.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ym3ga0\" data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2285\">Why Science and Commerce Students Are Eligible</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2587\">The BCom curriculum includes subjects that can be learned successfully by both Commerce and Science students. While Commerce students may have familiarity with business concepts, Science students often bring analytical strength that is useful in finance, economics, statistics, and taxation subjects.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1a0b30y\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2646\">Common Documents Required for Eligibility Verification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2715\">During admission, candidates may need to provide documents such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2834\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulae2l\" data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2739\">Class 10 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eaztxb\" data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2762\">Class 12 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h4bwto\" data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2786\">Passing certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2805\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djs98o\" data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2820\">Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yra9zg\" data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2834\">Signature</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pscl3l\" data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2876\">Common Mistakes Students Should Avoid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2947\">Many students lose time due to avoidable confusion. Be careful about:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"3182\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdbex1\" data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"3006\">Assuming Arts stream is eligible without confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4fh6to\" data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3042\">Uploading incomplete marksheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xk0bn4\" data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3073\">Name mismatch in documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g9xoy\" data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3128\">Waiting until the last date to clarify eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r3h90q\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3182\">Ignoring official communication after application</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1215gxo\" data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3225\">Career Value After Meeting Eligibility</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3290\">Students who join the Online BCom program can build careers in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3463\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1esivjd\" data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3306\">Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6z7ji\" data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3318\">Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173ueww\" data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3330\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h04yyg\" data-start=\"3331\" data-end=\"3343\">Taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y57aoi\" data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3357\">Insurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vja5oo\" data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3381\">Business Operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vdjfz9\" data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3410\">Corporate Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16mewf2\" data-start=\"3411\" data-end=\"3463\">Higher studies such as MCom, MBA, CA preparation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mzq1t\" data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3493\">Quick Eligibility Summary</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3712\">Candidates who have passed <strong data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3634\">10+2 or equivalent examination in Science or Commerce stream from a recognized Board, University, or Council</strong> are eligible for admission to the Graphic Era University Online BCom program.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</main></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</main></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<table width=\"509\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"64\"><strong>Year</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"98\"><strong>Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"99\"><strong>Exam Fee&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"136\"><strong>Online Course Material</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"112\"><strong>Total Per Year</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>I</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>21500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>1500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2000</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>25000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>II</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>21500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>1500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2000</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>25000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>III</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>21500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>1500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2000</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>25000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"33\",\"35\",\"41\",\"143\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 75000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(181, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '86f16f1d-cd08-447b-a788-d694fdd6490b', 207, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-04-24 02:16:06', '2026-06-16 06:47:20', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"482\">The <strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"120\">Graphic Era University Online MBA eligibility criteria</strong> are structured for graduates who want to advance their careers in management, leadership, business strategy, entrepreneurship, and corporate decision-making through a flexible online learning model. The program is ideal for fresh graduates, working professionals, business owners, and candidates planning career growth without leaving their current commitments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"856\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"548\">Online MBA course at Graphic Era University</strong>, candidates must have completed <strong data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"637\">10+2+3 or its equivalent qualification in any stream</strong> from a recognized <strong data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"689\">Board, University, or Council</strong>. This means applicants should have completed higher secondary education followed by a valid three-year undergraduate degree or an equivalent recognized qualification.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"34whmp\" data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"903\">Basic Eligibility for Online MBA Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"962\">Candidates are generally eligible if they have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175650d\" data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"996\">10+2 from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1czss4k\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1039\">Graduation degree under 10+2+3 pattern</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"so851k\" data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1093\">Equivalent recognized undergraduate qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14y62c1\" data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1143\">Degree from a recognized University / Council</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1260\">The broad eligibility structure allows graduates from multiple academic backgrounds to pursue management education.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vfx8lq\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1290\">Accepted Academic Streams</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1385\">Students from almost all graduation backgrounds can usually apply for the Online MBA program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p09103\" data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1418\">Common Eligible Backgrounds</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1651\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"176uv75\" data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1456\">BBA / BBM / Management graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4tidun\" data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1486\">BCom / Commerce graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9y0xnx\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1503\">BA graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iz44cc\" data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1521\">BSc graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q44rpq\" data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1539\">BCA graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"emx1q8\" data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1573\">BTech / Engineering graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ydh16v\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1604\">Hotel Management graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"peuicl\" data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1651\">Other recognized bachelor&rsquo;s degree holders</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1744\">This diversity is valuable because MBA classrooms benefit from mixed academic perspectives.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cg51b8\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1782\">Why Any Stream Graduate Can Apply</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"2019\">Management education focuses on leadership, business strategy, finance, marketing, human resources, operations, and decision-making. These skills are useful across industries, which is why graduates from different streams are accepted.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ok7b4q\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2067\">Working Professionals Eligibility Advantage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2217\">The Online MBA is especially beneficial for employed candidates who want promotions, salary growth, or managerial roles while continuing their jobs.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gjr76l\" data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2250\">Ideal for Professionals In:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2403\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q7mrah\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2265\">IT sector</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p8zb5b\" data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2289\">Sales and marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ekq80d\" data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2313\">Banking and finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nyjb7y\" data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2328\">Operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3d7yq7\" data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2358\">Healthcare administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12uvwtt\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2383\">Education management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g3mo0o\" data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2403\">Family business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e2q6k5\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2439\">Equivalent Qualification Clause</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2574\">Candidates holding equivalent recognized qualifications may also be considered subject to university norms and document verification.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bs612u\" data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2605\">NIOS Background Candidates</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2806\">Candidates who completed earlier schooling through the <strong data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2676\">NIOS board</strong> are generally eligible if their subsequent graduation qualification is recognized and fulfills university admission requirements.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"mmq11s\" data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2859\">Important Documents for Eligibility Verification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2890\">Applicants may commonly need:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"3020\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulae2l\" data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2914\">Class 10 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eaztxb\" data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2937\">Class 12 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iq9eea\" data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2972\">Graduation marksheets / degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"2991\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djs98o\" data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3006\">Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yra9zg\" data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3020\">Signature</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pscl3l\" data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3062\">Common Mistakes Students Should Avoid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3122\">Many MBA applicants face delays due to preventable issues.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ldnamv\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3146\">Avoid These Errors</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3362\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yfvxux\" data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3197\">Applying with unrecognized degree credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h9apcn\" data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3234\">Incomplete graduation marksheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2tvr9k\" data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3269\">Name mismatch across documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f0uvs7\" data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3329\">Assuming diploma equals graduation without confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18xa7tm\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3362\">Delaying document submission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f2v8wg\" data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3407\">Who Should Choose Graphic Era Online MBA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3440\">The Online MBA is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3663\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rqau5a\" data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3488\">Fresh graduates seeking management careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ilc1da\" data-start=\"3489\" data-end=\"3528\">Professionals aiming for promotions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wfe4pe\" data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3570\">Entrepreneurs scaling business growth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u82yl1\" data-start=\"3571\" data-end=\"3615\">Career switchers entering business roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4zyn0e\" data-start=\"3616\" data-end=\"3663\">Students preparing for leadership positions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3ffwvc\" data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3697\">Career Scope After Online MBA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3756\">Students completing the program can pursue roles such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3930\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4bhtr\" data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3779\">Marketing Manager</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v5ihi9\" data-start=\"3780\" data-end=\"3794\">HR Manager</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1am0kgs\" data-start=\"3795\" data-end=\"3814\">Finance Analyst</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uhhnx9\" data-start=\"3815\" data-end=\"3837\">Operations Manager</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"80m9pq\" data-start=\"3838\" data-end=\"3870\">Business Development Manager</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16n5lam\" data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3890\">Project Manager</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pa9uy3\" data-start=\"3891\" data-end=\"3907\">Entrepreneur</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"45i7o3\" data-start=\"3908\" data-end=\"3930\">Strategy Executive</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mzq1t\" data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"3960\">Quick Eligibility Summary</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"4169\">Candidates who have completed <strong data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4092\">10+2+3 or equivalent qualification in any stream from a recognized Board, University, or Council</strong> are eligible for admission to the Graphic Era University Online MBA program.</p>', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-557c324b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading animated fadeIn\" data-id=\"557c324b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_tablet&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_mobile&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Fee Structure</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-990ca73 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"990ca73\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<table width=\"435\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"64\"><strong>Year</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"98\"><strong>Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"99\"><strong>Exam Fee&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"136\"><strong>Online Course Material</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"112\"><strong>Total Fee Per Year</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>I</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>35000</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>40000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>II</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>35000</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>40000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"32\",\"34\",\"35\",\"37\",\"38\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 80000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(182, 61, '6a319ec1-c3f8-4070-8f30-5152a7411400', '86f16f1d-cd08-447b-a788-d694fdd6490b', 75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-04-24 02:24:17', '2026-06-16 06:49:07', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"505\">The <strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"120\">Graphic Era University Online MCA eligibility criteria</strong> are designed for graduates who want to build advanced careers in software development, data analytics, cloud computing, cyber security, application development, and modern IT industries through a flexible online learning format. The program is ideal for students and working professionals who want to upgrade their technical qualifications without interrupting their current schedule.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"885\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"571\">Online MCA course at Graphic Era University</strong>, candidates must have completed <strong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"677\">10+2+3 with Mathematics or its equivalent qualification in any stream</strong> from a recognized <strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"729\">Board, University, or Council</strong>. This means applicants should have completed higher secondary education, a valid undergraduate degree, and Mathematics as a qualifying subject requirement.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"iks55s\" data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"932\">Basic Eligibility for Online MCA Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"991\">Candidates are generally eligible if they have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1203\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175650d\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1025\">10+2 from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uyshu8\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1061\">Graduation under 10+2+3 pattern</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixtipf\" data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1113\">Mathematics as a qualifying subject requirement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xjapzp\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1153\">Equivalent recognized qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14y62c1\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1203\">Degree from a recognized University / Council</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1303\">This eligibility model ensures students are academically prepared for advanced computing subjects.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hs9wr4\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1343\">Why Mathematics is Required for MCA</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1533\">Mathematics supports many important technical areas studied in the MCA program. Students with mathematical foundations usually adapt more effectively to logical and computational learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bm2dal\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1560\">Mathematics Helps In:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1726\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d24kin\" data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1583\">Programming logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16208l0\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1598\">Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mo16ta\" data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1618\">Data structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yq9p59\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1633\">Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cghizo\" data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1658\">Analytical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cybxuw\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1692\">Computational problem-solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m7a3vr\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1726\">Software development concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vfx8lq\" data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1756\">Accepted Academic Streams</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1856\">Candidates from various graduation backgrounds may apply if they meet the Mathematics requirement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p09103\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1889\">Common Eligible Backgrounds</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"2100\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q44rpq\" data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1908\">BCA graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iz44cc\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1926\">BSc graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ut5ted\" data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1973\">BCom graduates with Mathematics background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f18u45\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2018\">BA graduates with Mathematics background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"emx1q8\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2052\">BTech / Engineering graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i1v6m8\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2100\">Other recognized graduates meeting criteria</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e2q6k5\" data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2136\">Equivalent Qualification Clause</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2270\">Applicants with equivalent recognized qualifications may also be considered subject to university norms and verification procedures.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18tdedl\" data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2297\">NIOS Board Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2496\">Candidates who completed schooling through the <strong data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2360\">NIOS board</strong> are generally eligible if their qualifications are recognized and they meet the Mathematics requirement along with graduation criteria.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"mmq11s\" data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2549\">Important Documents for Eligibility Verification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2590\">Applicants may commonly need to submit:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2750\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulae2l\" data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2614\">Class 10 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eaztxb\" data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2637\">Class 12 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iq9eea\" data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2672\">Graduation marksheets / degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u86vj8\" data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2702\">Mathematics subject proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2721\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djs98o\" data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2736\">Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yra9zg\" data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2750\">Signature</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pscl3l\" data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2792\">Common Mistakes Students Should Avoid</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2850\">Many MCA applicants face delays due to avoidable errors.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1it2rrq\" data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2874\">Avoid These Issues</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"3090\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v4afha\" data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2912\">Ignoring Mathematics requirement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"34om77\" data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2956\">Uploading incomplete graduation records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"53mp6x\" data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"3026\">Assuming any degree is eligible without checking subject criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xk0bn4\" data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3057\">Name mismatch in documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uzt8ap\" data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3090\">Applying late near deadlines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f2v8s1\" data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3135\">Who Should Choose Graphic Era Online MCA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3172\">The program is highly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3429\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"irt4yh\" data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3222\">BCA graduates seeking advanced qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eh7l8d\" data-start=\"3223\" data-end=\"3262\">Students targeting software careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s9eu75\" data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3313\">Working IT professionals upgrading credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j7kvvv\" data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3371\">Candidates planning roles in development or analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17whhmw\" data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3429\">Learners seeking flexible postgraduate tech education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3ffwuh\" data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3463\">Career Scope After Online MCA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3530\">Students completing the program can pursue opportunities such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3721\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p5b4hd\" data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3554\">Software Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i1o6l0\" data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3584\">Web Application Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yerpc4\" data-start=\"3585\" data-end=\"3601\">Data Analyst</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixbsdr\" data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3628\">Cloud Support Engineer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2m8lh\" data-start=\"3629\" data-end=\"3657\">Cyber Security Associate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"je2hee\" data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3684\">Database Administrator</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6qklf6\" data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3702\">IT Consultant</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1swqkj5\" data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3721\">System Analyst</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mzq1t\" data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3751\">Quick Eligibility Summary</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3753\" data-end=\"3977\">Candidates who have completed <strong data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3900\">10+2+3 with Mathematics or equivalent qualification in any stream from a recognized Board, University, or Council</strong> are eligible for admission to the Graphic Era University Online MCA program.</p>', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-557c324b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading animated fadeIn\" data-id=\"557c324b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_tablet&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_mobile&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Fee Structure</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f0d9f6c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f0d9f6c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<table width=\"509\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"64\"><strong>Year</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"98\"><strong>Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"99\"><strong>Exam Fee&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"136\"><strong>Online Course Material</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"112\"><strong>Total Fee Per Year</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>I</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>30000</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>35000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>II</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>30000</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>2500</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>35000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"9\",\"10\",\"29\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 70000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(184, 62, '74106844-2ecd-4ded-ba83-ce892aea405f', '1c9e2d62-f0b0-4b5a-95b5-fd5355b6de84', 75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-04-24 04:06:49', '2026-06-16 04:17:35', '<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"416\">The admission process for the Online MCA at Uttaranchal University is designed to be smooth, fast, and fully digital so that students can apply from anywhere without visiting the campus. This flexible process is ideal for graduates and working professionals who want to pursue a Master of Computer Applications while managing job or personal commitments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"541\">The university follows a simple step-by-step online admission system that makes enrollment convenient and student-friendly.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1lztn74\" data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"578\">Fill the Online Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"756\">The first step is to complete the online application form by entering accurate personal, academic, and contact details. Applicants should carefully fill in information such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"882\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"apwdks\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"771\">Full name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w2tsb\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"789\">Mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36fvl5\" data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"802\">Email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"825\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19381gy\" data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"849\">Address information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efk7a2\" data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"882\">Basic identification details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"978\">It is important that all details match official documents to avoid delays during verification.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1sowbh8\" data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1013\">Proceed to Program Fee Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1203\">After filling out the application form, candidates need to proceed with the Online MCA program fee payment. The university generally provides secure online payment options for convenience.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zp8axk\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1239\">Benefits of Online Fee Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1368\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7y8kn\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1269\">Fast transaction process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14fl5x9\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1296\">Secure payment gateway</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18r1kry\" data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1325\">Multiple payment methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12lzwrc\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1368\">Easy confirmation and receipt generation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1434\">Applicants should save the payment receipt for future reference.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dpp8bj\" data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1478\">Upload Documents and Submit Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1614\">Once the fee payment is completed, candidates need to upload the required documents and submit the final application for verification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1i55uz\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1647\">Commonly Required Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134nxcp\" data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1675\">Graduation mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xdz5q\" data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1713\">Degree certificate (if available)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1732\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1761\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yra9zg\" data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1775\">Signature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dcj5v2\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1814\">Category certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1912\">Students should upload clear and valid scanned copies to prevent rejection or processing delays.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1p0wxfd\" data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1936\">Get LMS Credentials</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2145\">After successful verification and admission approval, students receive their <strong data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2063\">LMS (Learning Management System) credentials</strong>. These login details provide access to the university&rsquo;s online learning platform.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"flonof\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2170\">LMS Access Includes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2351\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pj53nt\" data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2195\">Live online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3fguj\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2217\">Recorded lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12a9mov\" data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2237\">Study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kl6uav\" data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2270\">Assignment submission portal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gukfew\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2294\">Notices and updates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ssqduj\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2325\">Academic support resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j71ka9\" data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2351\">Progress tracking tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tvug2c\" data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2396\">Why This Admission Process is Convenient</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2494\">The Online MCA admission process is designed for modern learners who need flexibility and speed.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7iqibp\" data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2516\">Major Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l2df5d\" data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2551\">100% online admission process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xz2waw\" data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2580\">No campus visit required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19nunpd\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2608\">Apply from any location</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h8l55q\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2639\">Fast document verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"109vrpp\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2676\">Instant academic platform access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zumztn\" data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2713\">Suitable for working professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2bj5lf\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2759\">Common Mistakes to Avoid During Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2829\">Many students face delays because of avoidable errors. Make sure to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"3021\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17xfw3d\" data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2865\">Enter correct academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2niwtq\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2907\">Use active mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jrmhwv\" data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2937\">Upload readable documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w1lgx1\" data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2979\">Double-check fee payment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4ewe8\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3021\">Review the form before final submission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3040\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3310\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online MCA admission process at Uttaranchal University is simple, digital, and student-friendly. From filling the application form to receiving LMS credentials, every step is designed to help students start their postgraduate IT education quickly and conveniently.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"422\">The eligibility criteria for the Online MCA at Uttaranchal University are designed to welcome students from both computer-related and non-computer academic backgrounds. This program is ideal for graduates who want to build careers in software development, data analytics, IT management, cybersecurity, cloud computing, and other fast-growing technology sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"615\">The university provides flexible entry options so that candidates from technical as well as general graduation streams can pursue a Master of Computer Applications degree through online mode.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mhclio\" data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"663\">Basic Academic Qualification for Online MCA</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"856\">Candidates seeking admission must have completed a recognized bachelor&rsquo;s degree from an approved university or institution. The program accepts applicants through two broad academic pathways.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"aom5gw\" data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"915\">Direct Eligibility Through Computer Background Degrees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1004\">Candidates are eligible if they have passed any of the following or equivalent degrees:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1303\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l13asy\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1049\">BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"58ooix\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1076\">B.Sc. Computer Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rudiwg\" data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1109\">B.Sc. Information Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17g17r9\" data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1147\">B.E. Computer Science Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i2ss4\" data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1187\">B.Tech Computer Science Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"amjdid\" data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1219\">B.E. Information Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16up650\" data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1253\">B.Tech Information Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vkvfq3\" data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1303\">Equivalent recognized degree in a related field</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1426\">This pathway is highly suitable for students who already have technical foundations and want advanced computer education.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qof4mh\" data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1472\">Eligibility Through Any Graduation Degree</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1554\">Candidates who have completed <strong data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1529\">any graduation degree</strong> may also apply, such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l65u62\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1565\">B.Sc.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tixe23\" data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1576\">B.Com.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uale4r\" data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1585\">B.A.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uaihxr\" data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1594\">B.E.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y69ov2\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1605\">B.Tech</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1268xzk\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1616\">B.Voc.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bacwl9\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1654\">Other recognized bachelor&rsquo;s degrees</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1777\">However, preference is generally given to candidates who have studied <strong data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1776\">Mathematics at 10+2 level or during graduation</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ky6wm4\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1804\">Minimum Marks Required</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1861\">To qualify for admission, candidates must have secured:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1979\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h6swtf\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1920\"><strong data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1886\">Minimum 50% marks</strong> for General category candidates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h4ydv9\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1979\"><strong data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1944\">Minimum 45% marks</strong> for Reserved category candidates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2045\">These marks are considered in the qualifying degree examination.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fuoezu\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2085\">Eligibility for Final Year Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2288\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2161\">appearing for their final year graduation examination</strong> may also apply, subject to submission of final passing documents, mark sheets, or degree proof within the prescribed timeline.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rz5ujt\" data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2345\">Mathematics Background and Bridge Course Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2530\">Candidates without a Mathematics background can still be eligible. In such cases, the university may require a <strong data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2475\">bridge course</strong> to strengthen mathematical and technical fundamentals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2738\">Additional bridge courses related to computer subjects may also be prescribed according to academic norms. This helps students from non-technical backgrounds transition successfully into the MCA curriculum.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"habq1t\" data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2787\">NIOS and Equivalent Qualification Acceptance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"3015\">Candidates who completed their schooling through <strong data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2878\">NIOS or other recognized open boards</strong> are generally eligible, provided their graduation degree is valid from a recognized institution and all academic criteria are fulfilled.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uhrxca\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3057\">Eligibility for Working Professionals</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3330\">The Online MCA is also suitable for employed candidates who want to upgrade technical qualifications while continuing their careers. Professionals with <strong data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3241\">2 years of work experience</strong> may explore additional admission guidance or support from the university admission team.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16li2b\" data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3366\">Who Should Apply for Online MCA</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3394\">This program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3662\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sycj98\" data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3452\">BCA and IT graduates seeking advanced qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"112rznz\" data-start=\"3453\" data-end=\"3503\">Non-technical graduates entering the IT sector</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"icu3nh\" data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3548\">Working professionals wanting promotions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vchx5b\" data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3603\">Students interested in coding and software careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19j3kcu\" data-start=\"3604\" data-end=\"3662\">Learners planning careers in AI, cloud, or cybersecurity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8nq3te\" data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3699\">Important Advice Before Applying</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3761\">Before submitting the application, candidates should verify:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3763\" data-end=\"3946\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nhum4j\" data-start=\"3763\" data-end=\"3796\">Graduation degree recognition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u4d7bv\" data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3829\">Marks eligibility percentage</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sdwi0f\" data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3867\">Mathematics qualification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hxf64c\" data-start=\"3868\" data-end=\"3917\">Category certificate validity (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o8v3hr\" data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3946\">Correct academic documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"3965\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"4348\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online MCA eligibility criteria at Uttaranchal University are broad and career-friendly, allowing students from technical and non-technical backgrounds to pursue higher education in computer applications. With bridge course support and flexible academic entry pathways, the program creates strong opportunities for learners aiming for successful careers in the digital economy.</p>', '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:93068c47-2461-4276-bbf3-4853c62b5aa1-49\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-22\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"b253217a-54a0-4b58-a2b1-acad6f399f7d\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"412\">The Online MCA fee structure at Uttaranchal University is designed to make advanced computer education affordable, flexible, and accessible for students and working professionals. With scholarship benefits, additional concessions, multiple payment plans, and no-cost EMI options, the university offers several ways to manage educational expenses comfortably.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"679\">This fee model is ideal for learners who want to pursue a Master of Computer Applications degree without the high cost of relocating or attending a regular campus program. Students can choose the payment option that best matches their budget and financial planning.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ik1uyr\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"704\">Online MCA Fee Plans</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"781\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"781\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"727\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"742\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"759\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discounted Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"781\" data-col-size=\"md\">Benefits / Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n<td data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"817\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"832\">INR 1,16,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"849\"><strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"848\">INR 92,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"906\">Scholarship + INR 4,000 additional concession applied</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1007\">\r\n<td data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"920\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"933\">INR 58,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"950\"><strong data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"949\">INR 46,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1007\">Scholarship + INR 2,000 additional concession applied</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1076\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1023\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1036\">INR 30,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1053\"><strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1052\">INR 24,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1076\">Scholarship applied</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1095\">&mdash;</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1132\">Starting from <strong data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1130\">INR 3,872/month</strong>*</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1173\">Affordable monthly installment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qxkph8\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1197\">One-Time Fee Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1294\">Students who prefer to complete the entire fee in one payment can choose the one-time fee plan.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j4srrs\" data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1322\">Why Choose This Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1496\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p50yoe\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1355\">Maximum savings opportunity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"os2cf2\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1389\">Scholarship benefits included</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19a9rq0\" data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1423\">Additional concession applied</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vws5dv\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1460\">No repeated installment tracking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aahh7u\" data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1496\">Convenient for long-term planners</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1578\">This option is often best for students who want the lowest overall payable cost.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"h3royh\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1600\">Annual Fee Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1702\">The annual fee plan offers a balanced payment structure for students who prefer yearly installments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pw3mug\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1734\">Benefits of Annual Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1880\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4icz04\" data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1774\">Lower burden than one-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"os2cf2\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1808\">Scholarship benefits included</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l3hiqs\" data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1844\">Additional concession available</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1am9cgu\" data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1880\">Better for salaried professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1954\">This mode is suitable for learners who want manageable yearly budgeting.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19ln8z2\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1978\">Semester Fee Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2064\">Semester-wise payment helps students divide fees into smaller academic installments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l3n95q\" data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2080\">Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2207\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x26vsl\" data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2107\">Lower upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fxo16d\" data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2139\">Easier short-term budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xzp0z5\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2177\">Suitable for self-funded students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bgc39l\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2207\">Flexible financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2285\">This option is commonly chosen by students who prefer step-by-step payments.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3erpsw\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2308\">No-Cost EMI Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2385\">The university also offers no-cost EMI facilities to improve affordability.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4297he\" data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2406\">EMI Starts From</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2443\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lpxc3\" data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2443\"><strong data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2443\">INR 3,872 per month (approx.)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17ne1ku\" data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2467\">Why EMI is Popular</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2619\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vikkm\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2509\">Reduces immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"154ofbg\" data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2547\">Makes higher education accessible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mrs2xi\" data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2584\">Useful for working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k5u6wt\" data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2619\">Helps maintain monthly cash flow</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14m2nrk\" data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2648\">Examination Fee Included</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2847\">The above fee structure includes the <strong data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2732\">examination fee of INR 2,500 per semester</strong>, which adds strong value because students can plan their costs more transparently without unexpected exam charges.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hjq4yu\" data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2882\">Early Bird Scholarship Benefit</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"3105\">Students may also receive an <strong data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2939\">Early Bird Scholarship</strong> for a limited time, making admission even more cost-effective. Since scholarship windows may close quickly, early application can provide better financial advantage.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"f5rzjm\" data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3142\">Payment Mode for Online MCA Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3263\">Students are required to pay the prescribed fees through the official online admission portal at the time of admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4mp25t\" data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3293\">Accepted Payment Methods</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3401\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3309\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3325\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17brhus\" data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3333\">UPI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i9le70\" data-start=\"3334\" data-end=\"3345\">Wallets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3361\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aa707y\" data-start=\"3362\" data-end=\"3401\">Other approved online payment methods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tglcih\" data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3437\">Important Payment Safety Advice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3503\">Students should always remain careful while making fee payments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yl5n02\" data-start=\"3505\" data-end=\"3530\">Best Safety Practices</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3722\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fq5lsq\" data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3574\">Use only the official admission portal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rimdig\" data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3611\">Avoid unauthorized payment links</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vuue8c\" data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3646\">Do not pay unknown individuals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cnbeeq\" data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3682\">Save payment receipts instantly</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9oj5tc\" data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3722\">Verify confirmation after transaction</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3813\">The university is generally not responsible for payments made through unofficial sources.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"927ctc\" data-start=\"3815\" data-end=\"3849\">Smart Fee Strategy for Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3851\" data-end=\"3900\">Choose your payment mode based on your situation:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3902\" data-end=\"4077\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fbup8o\" data-start=\"3902\" data-end=\"3948\"><strong data-start=\"3904\" data-end=\"3921\">One-Time Fee:</strong> Best for highest savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wn4lau\" data-start=\"3949\" data-end=\"3991\"><strong data-start=\"3951\" data-end=\"3966\">Annual Fee:</strong> Balanced yearly option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"52ii78\" data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4044\"><strong data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4011\">Semester Fee:</strong> Better installment flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1odjiiy\" data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4077\"><strong data-start=\"4047\" data-end=\"4055\">EMI:</strong> Lowest monthly burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"4079\" data-end=\"4096\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4098\" data-end=\"4392\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online MCA fee structure at Uttaranchal University is student-friendly, flexible, and value-driven. With scholarships, concessions, exam fee inclusion, and EMI support, the university provides a practical path for students who want affordable postgraduate education in the technology field.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"563\">The Online MCA curriculum at Uttaranchal University is structured to develop strong technical foundations, advanced programming skills, and industry-ready expertise in computer applications. The program is designed for graduates who want to build successful careers in software development, data science, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, and IT systems. Spread across four semesters, the curriculum gradually moves from core computing concepts to advanced technologies and real-world project applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"751\">This structured learning approach ensures that students gain both theoretical knowledge and practical exposure, making them capable of handling modern IT industry challenges effectively.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yoik43\" data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"811\">Semester 1 &ndash; Core Programming and Computer Fundamentals</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"1045\">The first semester focuses on building a strong base in programming logic, operating systems, mathematics, and computer architecture. These subjects help students understand how computers work and how software systems are developed.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1068\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1717\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rddabr\" data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1211\"><strong data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1101\">OOPS using C++ (OMCA-111)</strong> &ndash; Develops object-oriented programming concepts like classes, inheritance, polymorphism, and encapsulation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2437gz\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1332\"><strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1245\">Operating System (OMCA-112)</strong> &ndash; Covers process management, memory management, file systems, and system operations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19p57v9\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1457\"><strong data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1388\">Computer Organization and Architecture (OMCA-113)</strong> &ndash; Explains hardware structure, CPU design, and system performance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qwiihw\" data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1594\"><strong data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1495\">Discrete Mathematics (OMCA-114)</strong> &ndash; Builds logical thinking, set theory, graph theory, and mathematical foundations for computing.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10gqq3w\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1717\"><strong data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1632\">Financial Accounting (OMCA-115)</strong> &ndash; Introduces basic accounting principles relevant for IT and business understanding.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"omyyie\" data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1783\">Semester 2 &ndash; Programming, Software Development and Networking</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1920\">The second semester strengthens programming skills and introduces software engineering, networking, and theoretical computing concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1943\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"2549\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kx3xro\" data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"2069\"><strong data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1980\">Python Programming (OMCA-121)</strong> &ndash; Focuses on modern programming, automation, and application development using Python.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dx0e1u\" data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2191\"><strong data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2101\">Data Structure (OMCA-122)</strong> &ndash; Covers arrays, stacks, queues, trees, graphs, and efficient data handling techniques.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7jvbnf\" data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2312\"><strong data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2229\">Software Engineering (OMCA-123)</strong> &ndash; Teaches software development lifecycle, design models, and project management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hils24\" data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2436\"><strong data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2363\">Data Communication and Networking (OMCA-124)</strong> &ndash; Explains network architecture, protocols, and communication systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2sw0ii\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2549\"><strong data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2475\">Theory of Computation (OMCA-125)</strong> &ndash; Introduces automata theory, formal languages, and computational models.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w70bwt\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2614\">Semester 3 &ndash; Advanced Technologies and Industry Applications</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2752\">The third semester focuses on modern technologies like databases, web development, cybersecurity, AI, and intelligent computing systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2775\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"3352\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"msvtdu\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2897\"><strong data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2820\">Database Management System (OMCA-232)</strong> &ndash; Covers database design, SQL, normalization, and data storage techniques.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19nhig\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2998\"><strong data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2929\">Web Technology (OMCA-233)</strong> &ndash; Focuses on web development, front-end and back-end technologies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ufcmtx\" data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3121\"><strong data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3036\">Information Security (OMCA-234)</strong> &ndash; Introduces cybersecurity principles, encryption, and network protection methods.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1874tqb\" data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3240\"><strong data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3162\">Artificial Intelligence (OMCA-235)</strong> &ndash; Covers machine learning basics, intelligent systems, and AI applications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1re0ek0\" data-start=\"3241\" data-end=\"3352\"><strong data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3272\">Soft Computing (OMCA-236)</strong> &ndash; Includes neural networks, fuzzy logic, and evolutionary computing techniques.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4th6iq\" data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3415\">Semester 4 &ndash; Capstone Project and Practical Implementation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3578\">The final semester is dedicated to real-world application through a <strong data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3505\">Capstone Project</strong>, where students apply all learned concepts into a practical IT solution.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dodtvm\" data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3600\">Capstone Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3629\">The project helps students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3631\" data-end=\"3818\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7yy2i5\" data-start=\"3631\" data-end=\"3674\">Develop real-time software applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9xestx\" data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3708\">Solve industry-based problems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bk6c1\" data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3758\">Apply programming, AI, and database knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i0icrs\" data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3818\">Build a professional portfolio for career opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3894\">This final stage ensures students are job-ready with practical experience.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qu4cvr\" data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"3942\">Why This MCA Curriculum is Industry-Focused</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"4154\">The Online MCA syllabus is designed to match current IT industry demands and emerging technologies. It builds strong problem-solving ability, coding skills, analytical thinking, and system design understanding.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"coqybl\" data-start=\"4156\" data-end=\"4181\">Key Learning Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4183\" data-end=\"4441\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"140nep5\" data-start=\"4183\" data-end=\"4247\">Strong programming foundation (C++, Python, Data Structures)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vjlrui\" data-start=\"4248\" data-end=\"4291\">Advanced computing and system knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q9h9ai\" data-start=\"4292\" data-end=\"4347\">Exposure to AI, cybersecurity, and web technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y98ued\" data-start=\"4348\" data-end=\"4393\">Real-world project development experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9pza4\" data-start=\"4394\" data-end=\"4441\">Career-oriented technical skill development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"uf60bg\" data-start=\"4443\" data-end=\"4483\">Career Opportunities After Online MCA</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4485\" data-end=\"4546\">Students completing this curriculum can pursue roles such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4714\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p5b4hd\" data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4570\">Software Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ihonn2\" data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4588\">Web Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yerpc4\" data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4605\">Data Analyst</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vub6pj\" data-start=\"4606\" data-end=\"4624\">AI/ML Engineer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xon0fh\" data-start=\"4625\" data-end=\"4650\">Cybersecurity Analyst</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"je2hee\" data-start=\"4651\" data-end=\"4677\">Database Administrator</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1swqkj5\" data-start=\"4678\" data-end=\"4696\">System Analyst</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6qklf6\" data-start=\"4697\" data-end=\"4714\">IT Consultant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"4716\" data-end=\"4733\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4735\" data-end=\"5086\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online MCA curriculum at Uttaranchal University offers a comprehensive and future-ready learning structure that blends core computing fundamentals with advanced technologies. With a strong focus on practical skills, programming expertise, and project-based learning, the program prepares students for high-growth careers in the global IT industry.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"3\",\"9\",\"10\",\"11\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 116000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(185, 62, '74106844-2ecd-4ded-ba83-ce892aea405f', '1c9e2d62-f0b0-4b5a-95b5-fd5355b6de84', 208, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-04-24 04:32:49', '2026-06-16 04:17:55', '<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"443\">The Online BBA admission process at Uttaranchal University is designed to be simple, fully digital, and student-friendly so that learners can apply from anywhere without visiting the campus. The process is structured to ensure smooth enrollment for students who want to pursue a Bachelor of Business Administration in online mode while balancing studies, jobs, or personal commitments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"591\">This step-by-step admission system helps students complete registration, fee payment, document submission, and LMS access in a hassle-free manner.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1lztn74\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"628\">Fill the Online Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"843\">The first step in the Online BBA admission process is to complete the application form through the official online admission portal. Students are required to enter accurate personal, academic, and contact details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19i6rlg\" data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"873\">Key Information Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y2xro9\" data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"905\">Full name of the candidate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q81ytd\" data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"936\">Mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uk5om3\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"985\">Academic qualification details (10th &amp; 12th)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17vgoyl\" data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1024\">Address and identification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t4vyz9\" data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1054\">Basic profile information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1182\">It is important to ensure that all details are correctly entered as per official documents to avoid verification issues later.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1sowbh8\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1217\">Proceed to Program Fee Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1409\">After filling out the application form, candidates need to proceed to the Online BBA program fee payment stage. The university provides secure online payment options for smooth transactions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wqyuil\" data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1435\">Fee Payment Features</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1575\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k1z2iv\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1471\">Secure digital payment gateway</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4n6buf\" data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1510\">Multiple payment methods available</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gj4mw6\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1543\">Instant payment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"voug7u\" data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1575\">Easy fee receipt generation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1676\">Students should carefully check the selected program details before completing the payment process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dpp8bj\" data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1720\">Upload Documents and Submit Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1849\">Once the fee payment is completed, candidates must upload the required documents and submit their application for verification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vk3dum\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1880\">Common Documents Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"2047\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e804nj\" data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1901\">10th mark sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c8v7pp\" data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1921\">12th mark sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mj6p2q\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1963\">Identity proof (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1992\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yra9zg\" data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2006\">Signature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14qiub2\" data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2047\">Category certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2129\">Uploading clear and valid documents is essential for fast approval of admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1p0wxfd\" data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2153\">Get LMS Credentials</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2364\">After successful verification of application and documents, students receive their <strong data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2286\">LMS (Learning Management System) credentials</strong>. These login details provide access to the complete online learning platform.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11v3zan\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2390\">LMS Features Include</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2603\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"txoaj2\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2420\">Live interactive classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2snei\" data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2448\">Recorded video lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1crbmt\" data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2476\">Digital study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3faoig\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2508\">Assignments and submissions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yh3m9y\" data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2539\">Exams and academic updates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1klvvy8\" data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2568\">Student support services</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z5t5vf\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2603\">Performance tracking dashboard</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2tcvby\" data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2654\">Why This Admission Process is Student-Friendly</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2743\">The Online BBA admission process is designed for convenience, speed, and accessibility.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"o7hard\" data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2763\">Major Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2980\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l2df5d\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2798\">100% online admission process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wwtjel\" data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2836\">No physical campus visit required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qftke1\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2868\">Fast application processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rxahb5\" data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2897\">Easy document submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7mdf7s\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2936\">Instant LMS access after admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jqfug5\" data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2980\">Suitable for students from any location</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12nk0sw\" data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3015\">Important Tips Before Applying</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3061\">To ensure smooth admission, students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3262\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dbt0l4\" data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3102\">Keep all documents ready in advance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17xfw3d\" data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3137\">Enter correct academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j5422p\" data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3182\">Use an active mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c5bysd\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3229\">Double-check application before submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10l154o\" data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3262\">Save payment receipts safely</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3281\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3643\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online BBA admission process at Uttaranchal University is structured to provide a seamless and efficient enrollment experience. From filling out the application form to receiving LMS credentials, every step is designed to support students in starting their business administration studies quickly and conveniently through a flexible online learning system.</p>', 1, '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:93068c47-2461-4276-bbf3-4853c62b5aa1-52\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-28\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"4f7ecab4-e065-44fe-8bd3-9dd347de9648\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"482\">The Online BBA program at Uttaranchal University is designed for students who want to build a strong foundation in business management, leadership, marketing, finance, and entrepreneurship right after completing their school education. The eligibility criteria are kept simple and inclusive so that a wide range of learners can begin their journey in the field of business administration through flexible online learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"664\">This program is ideal for students who are interested in pursuing management careers early and want to develop professional skills while studying in a digital learning environment.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zsi1nv\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"697\">Basic Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"834\">To be eligible for admission into the Online BBA program, candidates must have successfully completed their higher secondary education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jxvepb\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"859\">Minimum Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1003\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jit9hb\" data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"932\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"930\">10+2 (Senior Secondary Examination)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"od0x12\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"1003\">The qualification must be from a <strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1001\">recognized board of education</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1137\">Students from any stream&mdash;Commerce, Science, or Arts&mdash;are eligible to apply, making the program highly accessible and career-oriented.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fbb1vk\" data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1170\">Recognized Board Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1388\">The 10+2 qualification must be obtained from a board that is officially recognized by education authorities. This ensures that the academic background of the candidate meets university standards for higher education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"185vw6f\" data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1421\">Accepted Boards May Include</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1543\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bl8q85\" data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1462\">Central Boards (CBSE or equivalent)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1licqzg\" data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1489\">State Education Boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o3srg\" data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1543\">Other recognized national or international boards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e2udby\" data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1582\">Eligibility for Appearing Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1845\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1652\">currently appearing for their 10+2 examinations</strong> may also be eligible to apply, subject to submission of final results within the required timeline. This allows students to plan their higher education in advance without losing academic time.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wo8y5v\" data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1881\">NIOS Board Students Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"2107\">Candidates who have completed their 10+2 education through <strong data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1989\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are also eligible to apply, provided their qualification is from a recognized board and meets admission requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zthisv\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2140\">Who Should Choose Online BBA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2181\">The Online BBA program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2466\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1560kus\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2239\">Students who want early career entry into management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18hndao\" data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2308\">Learners interested in business, marketing, and entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u70rvc\" data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2353\">Students preparing for MBA in the future</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e45f3c\" data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2404\">Individuals seeking flexible online graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hn4s8\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2466\">Aspirants aiming for corporate job roles after graduation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ygzu5t\" data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2513\">Key Advantages of Meeting This Eligibility</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2558\">The simple eligibility requirement ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2803\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yg0c2g\" data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2598\">Easy access after school education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3yr7\" data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2638\">No stream restriction for admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ayb2hn\" data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2689\">Early start in business and management studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hk26uq\" data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2739\">Flexible pathway to higher education like MBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ry0wj\" data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2803\">Opportunity to build professional skills from the beginning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pwbvx8\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2836\">Important Admission Guidance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2871\">Before applying, students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"3057\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cggg0\" data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2907\">Verify 10+2 marksheet accuracy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kwd81n\" data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2943\">Ensure board recognition status</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ie4uws\" data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"2979\">Keep documents ready for upload</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p1450e\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3009\">Check admission deadlines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b4zilg\" data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3057\">Use valid contact details for communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3076\">Final Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3448\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online BBA eligibility criteria at Uttaranchal University make it easy for 10+2 qualified students from any recognized board to begin their journey in business education. With a flexible and inclusive admission structure, the program provides a strong foundation for students aiming to build successful careers in management, entrepreneurship, and corporate sectors.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"631\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"133\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"133\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"75\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"90\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"107\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discounted Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"133\" data-col-size=\"md\">Benefits / Key Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"631\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"260\">\r\n<td data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"174\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"189\">INR 1,20,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"204\">INR 1,02,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"260\">Includes scholarship benefits and overall concession</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"361\">\r\n<td data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"276\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"291\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,14,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"304\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 96,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"361\" data-col-size=\"md\">Scholarship + INR 6,000 additional concession applied</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"458\">\r\n<td data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"375\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"388\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 38,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"401\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 32,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"458\">Scholarship + INR 2,000 additional concession applied</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"523\">\r\n<td data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"474\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"487\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 20,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"500\">INR 17,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"523\">Scholarship applied</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"631\">\r\n<td data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"538\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"571\">Starting from INR 2,693/month*</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"575\">&mdash;</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"631\">Flexible monthly installment option for easy payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"teg2zz\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"661\">Additional Fee Inclusions</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"686\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"686\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"675\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"686\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"775\">\r\n<td data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"715\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"775\" data-col-size=\"md\">INR 2,500 per semester (included in above fee structure)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<td data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"801\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Early Bird Scholarship</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"838\">Available for limited time period</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hw3ltq\" data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"863\">Payment Mode Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"1162\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"887\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"887\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"872\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"887\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"1162\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<td data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"922\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online Payment Portal</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"982\">Fees must be paid only through official admission portal</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1056\">\r\n<td data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1002\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted Methods</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1056\" data-col-size=\"md\">Debit Card, Credit Card, UPI, Net Banking, Wallets</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1162\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1071\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Safety Note</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1162\" data-col-size=\"md\">Avoid unauthorized links or agents; university is not responsible for external payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v2iq3w\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1195\">Smart Fee Selection Guidance</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1468\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1227\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1227\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1206\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1227\" data-col-size=\"md\">Best Suitable For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1468\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1289\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1253\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1289\">Students seeking maximum savings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1343\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1303\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1343\">Learners preferring yearly budgeting</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1359\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1400\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students wanting smaller installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1468\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1414\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Option</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1468\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidates needing lowest monthly financial burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:93068c47-2461-4276-bbf3-4853c62b5aa1-55\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-34\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"1455e663-3a62-48d3-8df2-b56f7f52887d\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"488\">The Online BBA curriculum at Uttaranchal University is designed to build a strong foundation in business administration, management principles, economics, finance, marketing, communication, and entrepreneurship. Spread across six semesters, the program follows a progressive learning structure that starts with basic business concepts and gradually advances toward specialization, strategic thinking, and real-world project applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"728\">This curriculum is highly suitable for students who have completed 10+2 and want to develop professional skills for careers in management, business operations, marketing, finance, HR, and entrepreneurship through flexible online learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"733\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ihqd3p\" data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"788\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundation of Business and Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"917\">The first semester focuses on building core knowledge in economics, accounting, communication, law, and computing fundamentals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"1179\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"960\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"960\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"934\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"944\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"960\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1179\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1015\">\r\n<td data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"987\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-111</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"991\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1015\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Managerial Economics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1047\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1027\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-112</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1031\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1047\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Law</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1093\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1059\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-113</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1063\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1093\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fundamentals of Accounting</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1105\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-114</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1109\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1134\">Communicative English</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1179\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1146\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-115</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1179\">Fundamentals of Computing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1199\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1361\">This semester develops basic understanding of business environment, communication skills, financial basics, and legal awareness required in modern organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ksegbn\" data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1420\">Semester 2 &ndash; Management and Financial Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1542\">The second semester introduces management principles, financial decision-making, corporate laws, and strategic thinking.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1559\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1585\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1640\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1612\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-121</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1616\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1640\">Financial Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1680\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1652\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-122</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1656\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1680\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1692\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-123</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1696\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Company Law</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1752\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-124</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1727\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1752\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Environmental Studies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1764\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-125</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1768\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1796\">Principles of Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1816\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1954\">This semester strengthens decision-making skills, managerial understanding, corporate governance basics, and financial planning concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1959\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18lycri\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2013\">Semester 3 &ndash; Economics, Marketing, and Operations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2144\">The third semester focuses on applied economics, marketing strategies, operations management, and data-driven business decisions.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2449\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2187\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2187\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2161\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2171\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2187\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2449\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2236\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2214\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-231</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2218\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2236\">Macroeconomics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2277\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2248\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-232</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2252\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2277\">Marketing of Services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2326\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2289\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-233</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2293\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2326\">Risk and Insurance Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2365\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2338\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-234</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2342\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2365\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Statistics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2419\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2377\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-235</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2381\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2419\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Production &amp; Operations Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2449\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2431\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-236</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2435\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2449\">E-Commerce</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2469\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2599\">Students gain knowledge of market behavior, service marketing, operational systems, risk management, and digital commerce trends.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2604\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ku056m\" data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2659\">Semester 4 &ndash; Human Resources and Business Research</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2777\">The fourth semester focuses on HR practices, business research, international business, and personality development.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"3117\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2820\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2820\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2794\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2804\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2820\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"3117\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2875\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2847\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-241</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2851\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2875\">Business Mathematics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2920\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2887\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-242</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2891\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2920\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2962\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2932\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-243</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2936\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"2962\">International Business</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"3021\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"2974\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-244</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2974\" data-end=\"2978\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3021\">Research Methods in Business Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3064\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3033\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-245</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3037\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3064\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Personality Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3117\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3076\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-246</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3080\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3117\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advertisement and Sales Promotion</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3137\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3271\">This semester enhances analytical thinking, HR skills, global business awareness, research capability, and communication development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3273\" data-end=\"3276\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7ghnlf\" data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3337\">Semester 5 &ndash; Specialization and Advanced Business Skills</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3469\">The fifth semester focuses on quantitative techniques, management accounting, specialization subjects, and project-based learning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3763\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3512\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3512\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3486\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3486\" data-end=\"3496\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3496\" data-end=\"3512\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3763\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3585\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3539\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-351</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3543\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3585\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Quantitative Techniques for Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3626\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3597\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-352</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3601\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3626\">Management Accounting</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3668\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3638\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-353</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3642\">5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3668\">Specialization Paper 1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3710\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3680\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-354</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3684\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3684\" data-end=\"3710\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization Paper 2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3763\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3722\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-355</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"3726\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3763\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project Report-I and Presentation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3783\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3784\" data-end=\"3916\">This semester prepares students for industry specialization, analytical decision-making, and practical business project development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3921\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z6sxo1\" data-start=\"3923\" data-end=\"3976\">Semester 6 &ndash; Advanced Management and Final Project</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"4094\">The final semester focuses on advanced HR concepts, MIS systems, specialization depth, and final project submission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4382\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4137\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4137\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4111\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4121\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4121\" data-end=\"4137\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4153\" data-end=\"4382\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4153\" data-end=\"4195\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4153\" data-end=\"4164\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-361</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4164\" data-end=\"4168\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4168\" data-end=\"4195\">Compensation Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4196\" data-end=\"4244\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4196\" data-end=\"4207\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-362</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4207\" data-end=\"4211\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4211\" data-end=\"4244\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Management Information System</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4286\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4256\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-363</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4256\" data-end=\"4260\">5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4286\">Specialization Paper 1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4287\" data-end=\"4328\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4287\" data-end=\"4298\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-364</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4298\" data-end=\"4302\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4302\" data-end=\"4328\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization Paper 2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4382\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4340\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBBA-365</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4344\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4344\" data-end=\"4382\">Project Report-II and Presentation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"4384\" data-end=\"4402\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4403\" data-end=\"4541\">This semester builds advanced managerial understanding, IT-based decision systems, and practical industry exposure through final projects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4546\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"29ypux\" data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4600\">Why This Online BBA Curriculum is Career-Oriented</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4602\" data-end=\"4753\">The curriculum is structured to match modern business and industry requirements, ensuring students gain both academic knowledge and practical exposure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"coqybl\" data-start=\"4755\" data-end=\"4780\">Key Learning Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4782\" data-end=\"5104\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3z7er9\" data-start=\"4782\" data-end=\"4840\">Strong foundation in business management and economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o4f40e\" data-start=\"4841\" data-end=\"4893\">Practical exposure to marketing, HR, and finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wj6h0p\" data-start=\"4894\" data-end=\"4950\">Development of analytical and decision-making skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fx3rse\" data-start=\"4951\" data-end=\"5000\">Digital business and e-commerce understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ng9321\" data-start=\"5001\" data-end=\"5051\">Research and project-based learning experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vsh3xz\" data-start=\"5052\" data-end=\"5104\">Specialization-based career growth opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5106\" data-end=\"5109\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"uf5pgy\" data-start=\"5111\" data-end=\"5151\">Career Opportunities After Online BBA</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5153\" data-end=\"5218\">After completing this program, students can pursue roles such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5220\" data-end=\"5414\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lf6jbi\" data-start=\"5220\" data-end=\"5242\">Business Executive</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eyaquk\" data-start=\"5243\" data-end=\"5266\">Marketing Executive</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r6mj2e\" data-start=\"5267\" data-end=\"5283\">HR Assistant</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vz9g1f\" data-start=\"5284\" data-end=\"5301\">Sales Manager</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ukyuri\" data-start=\"5302\" data-end=\"5337\">Financial Analyst (Entry Level)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uwkj7y\" data-start=\"5338\" data-end=\"5362\">Operations Executive</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pa9uy3\" data-start=\"5363\" data-end=\"5379\">Entrepreneur</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z1t8a1\" data-start=\"5380\" data-end=\"5414\">Business Development Associate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5416\" data-end=\"5419\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"5421\" data-end=\"5438\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5440\" data-end=\"5833\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online BBA curriculum at Uttaranchal University offers a well-structured, industry-relevant, and skill-oriented learning journey across six semesters. With a strong balance of theory, practical subjects, specialization papers, and project work, the program prepares students for successful careers in business, management, and entrepreneurship in today&rsquo;s competitive corporate environment.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"32\",\"33\",\"34\",\"35\",\"38\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 120000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(186, 62, '74106844-2ecd-4ded-ba83-ce892aea405f', '1c9e2d62-f0b0-4b5a-95b5-fd5355b6de84', 39, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-04-24 04:48:26', '2026-06-16 04:18:15', '<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"474\">The Online BCA admission process at Uttaranchal University is designed to be simple, fully digital, and student-friendly, allowing candidates to apply from anywhere without visiting the campus. This structured process is especially beneficial for students who have completed their 10+2 and want to build a career in computer applications, software development, and IT-related fields through flexible online learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"628\">The entire admission journey is streamlined into clear steps to ensure smooth enrollment, secure fee payment, and quick access to the learning platform.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"633\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1lztn74\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"670\">Fill the Online Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"878\">The first step in the Online BCA admission process is to complete the application form on the official online admission portal. Candidates must carefully enter their personal, academic, and contact details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"900\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"1068\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jejwk0\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"932\">Full name of the applicant</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pd3dhz\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"969\">Valid mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i6z3br\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"995\">10+2 academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ng1z77\" data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1038\">Address and identification information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t4vyz9\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1068\">Basic profile information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1190\">It is important to ensure that all details are accurate and match official documents to avoid verification issues later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1sowbh8\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1230\">Proceed to Program Fee Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1423\">After completing the application form, candidates must proceed to the Online BCA program fee payment stage. The university provides secure online payment options for hassle-free transactions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"el06bn\" data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1456\">Key Features of Fee Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1589\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"an1h3m\" data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1491\">Secure online payment gateway</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4z0o\" data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1528\">Multiple digital payment options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gj4mw6\" data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1561\">Instant payment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"132fed8\" data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1589\">Easy receipt generation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1666\">Students should verify program details carefully before making the payment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1671\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dpp8bj\" data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1715\">Upload Documents and Submit Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1847\">Once the fee payment is completed, candidates need to upload the required documents and submit their application for verification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1i55uz\" data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1880\">Commonly Required Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"2086\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e804nj\" data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1901\">10th mark sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4gygi\" data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1951\">12th mark sheet (mandatory eligibility proof)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yo4ibq\" data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2002\">Identity proof (Aadhaar Card / Passport / PAN)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2031\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yra9zg\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2045\">Signature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14qiub2\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2086\">Category certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2168\">Clear and readable document uploads are important for smooth admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2173\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1p0wxfd\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2197\">Get LMS Credentials</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2406\">After successful verification and admission confirmation, students receive their <strong data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2328\">LMS (Learning Management System) credentials</strong>. These login details provide access to the complete online learning platform.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11v3zan\" data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2432\">LMS Features Include</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2692\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"txoaj2\" data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2462\">Live interactive classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e4gju4\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2499\">Recorded lectures anytime access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n792jx\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2537\">Digital study materials and notes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kp831y\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2570\">Assignment submission system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lyjc5t\" data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2610\">Online examinations and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp4cje\" data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2649\">Academic updates and notifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j7zap0\" data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2692\">Student support and mentoring services</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2697\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2tcvby\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2748\">Why This Admission Process is Student-Friendly</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2859\">The Online BCA admission process is designed to support modern learners who need flexibility and convenience.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7iqibp\" data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2881\">Major Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"3105\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l2df5d\" data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2916\">100% online admission process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xz2waw\" data-start=\"2917\" data-end=\"2945\">No campus visit required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zo1116\" data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2987\">Quick and easy application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v2qh9p\" data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3026\">Secure and fast fee payment system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7w9oef\" data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3066\">Instant access to learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qt7lt8\" data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3105\">Suitable for students across India</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3110\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wz2jzw\" data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3142\">Important Tips for Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3188\">To ensure smooth admission, students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3401\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dbt0l4\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3229\">Keep all documents ready in advance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2niwtq\" data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3271\">Use active mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175p6zk\" data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3323\">Double-check academic details before submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7dres4\" data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3368\">Upload clear scanned copies of documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10l154o\" data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3401\">Save payment receipts safely</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3406\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3425\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3816\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online BCA admission process at Uttaranchal University is simple, transparent, and fully digital. From filling the application form to receiving LMS credentials, every step is designed to help students start their computer applications journey quickly and efficiently. This streamlined process ensures easy access to quality IT education through a flexible online learning environment.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"487\">The Online BCA program at Uttaranchal University is designed for students who want to build a strong foundation in computer applications, software development, and modern IT skills after completing their school education. The eligibility criteria are kept simple and inclusive so that students from different academic backgrounds can start their journey in the field of information technology through flexible online learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"709\">This program is especially suitable for learners who are interested in coding, programming, web development, data handling, and other core areas of computer science and want to pursue a career-oriented graduation degree.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"714\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zsi1nv\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"747\">Basic Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"884\">To be eligible for admission into the Online BCA program, candidates must have successfully completed their higher secondary education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jxvepb\" data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"909\">Minimum Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"1051\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jit9hb\" data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"982\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"980\">10+2 (Senior Secondary Examination)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7njb92\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1051\">The qualification must be from a <strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1051\">recognized board of education</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1206\">Students from any stream&mdash;Science, Commerce, or Arts&mdash;can apply, making the program widely accessible for all learners interested in computer applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1211\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fbb1vk\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1244\">Recognized Board Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1394\">The 10+2 qualification should be obtained from a board recognized by competent education authorities to ensure academic validity for higher studies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"185vw6f\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1427\">Accepted Boards May Include</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1554\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4c1ndm\" data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1476\">Central Boards (such as CBSE or equivalent)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1licqzg\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1503\">State Education Boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1abffmy\" data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1554\">Other recognized national or equivalent boards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1652\">This ensures that students from across India can apply without restrictions based on board type.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e2udby\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1696\">Eligibility for Appearing Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1952\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1766\">currently appearing for their 10+2 examinations</strong> may also be eligible to apply, subject to submission of final results within the stipulated timeline. This helps students plan their higher education early without losing academic time.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1957\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wo8y5v\" data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1993\">NIOS Board Students Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2216\">Candidates who have completed their 10+2 through <strong data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2091\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are also eligible, provided their qualification is from a recognized board and meets the university&rsquo;s academic requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2221\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zthiq6\" data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2254\">Who Should Choose Online BCA</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2292\">The Online BCA program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2578\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4s8c3c\" data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2348\">Students interested in IT and software development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wyhp\" data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2404\">Learners who want to start a tech career after 12th</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qkd31d\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2461\">Aspirants preparing for future MCA or higher studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ykm1kp\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2519\">Students interested in coding and programming careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wifsrc\" data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2578\">Individuals seeking flexible online graduation options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2583\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ljxzvh\" data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2632\">Key Advantages of This Eligibility Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2677\">The simple eligibility requirement ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2910\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j78gj3\" data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2719\">Easy access after 10+2 qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3yr7\" data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2759\">No stream restriction for admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rtyx6v\" data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2810\">Opportunity for early career entry in IT field</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cw2xn3\" data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2863\">Strong foundation for advanced technical studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lv2g2z\" data-start=\"2864\" data-end=\"2910\">Flexible learning pathway for all students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2915\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pwbvx8\" data-start=\"2917\" data-end=\"2948\">Important Admission Guidance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2990\">Before applying, students should ensure:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3197\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xz8dfo\" data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3032\">10+2 marksheet is valid and complete</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14bcfym\" data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3081\">Board is recognized by education authorities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13v2kjv\" data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3124\">All documents are accurate and updated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hf9ibd\" data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3197\">Correct personal and academic details are entered in the application</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3202\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3221\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3223\" data-end=\"3603\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online BCA eligibility criteria at Uttaranchal University provide an open and student-friendly entry point for 10+2 qualified candidates from any recognized board. With flexible academic requirements and an inclusive structure, the program allows students to begin their journey in computer applications and build strong foundations for a successful career in the IT industry.</p>', '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:93068c47-2461-4276-bbf3-4853c62b5aa1-58\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-40\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"aa473b8c-182a-424e-8742-fa6004188aa0\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"459\">The Online BCA fee structure at Uttaranchal University is designed to offer affordable, flexible, and transparent education for students after 10+2. With multiple payment options such as one-time payment, annual installment plans, semester-wise fees, and no-cost EMI facilities, the university ensures that students from different financial backgrounds can easily pursue a career in computer applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"670\">This structured fee system is especially beneficial for students aiming to build strong careers in IT, software development, and computer science without the financial burden of traditional full-time programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"675\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wy9516\" data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"713\">Online BCA Fee Structure Overview</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"783\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"783\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"736\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"751\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"768\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discounted Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"783\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"904\">\r\n<td data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"819\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"834\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,14,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"847\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 96,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"904\">Scholarship + INR 6,000 additional concession applied</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"1001\">\r\n<td data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"918\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"931\">INR 38,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"944\">INR 32,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"1001\">Scholarship + INR 2,000 additional concession applied</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1066\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1017\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1030\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 20,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1043\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 17,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1066\">Scholarship applied</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1081\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1114\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Starting from INR 2,693/month*</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1118\">&mdash;</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1157\">Flexible monthly installment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1162\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qxkph8\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1186\">One-Time Fee Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1302\">The one-time payment option is ideal for students who want to complete the entire program fee in a single payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1316\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1500\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qe6m6r\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1350\">Maximum cost savings overall</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"os2cf2\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1384\">Scholarship benefits included</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19a9rq0\" data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1418\">Additional concession applied</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"412ksg\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1457\">No installment management required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x272md\" data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1500\">Simple and hassle-free payment process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1604\">This option is suitable for students who prefer long-term financial planning with one-time investment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1609\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"h3royh\" data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1631\">Annual Fee Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1730\">The annual payment structure allows students to pay fees year by year, making it more manageable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1744\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1928\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o9dvoe\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1777\">Balanced financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d8auw0\" data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1814\">Scholarship + concession applied</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sc6o2r\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1856\">Lower burden compared to one-time fee</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y14j1i\" data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1928\">Suitable for students and families with annual budgeting preference</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19ln8z2\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1957\">Semester Fee Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2054\">The semester-wise fee plan offers maximum flexibility for students who prefer smaller payments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2068\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19uqe24\" data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2104\">Lower upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsfd2\" data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2136\">Easy installment management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b72orx\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2169\">Scholarship benefit included</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w1lkrp\" data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2209\">Suitable for self-financed students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3erpsw\" data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2237\">No-Cost EMI Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2330\">To make education more accessible, the university also offers EMI-based payment facilities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16ce89d\" data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2353\">EMI Starting From</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2388\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q8070j\" data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2388\">INR 2,693 per month (approx.)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kx7bmx\" data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2408\">Key Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2577\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vikkm\" data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2450\">Reduces immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jc8sb1\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2488\">Easy monthly installment planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8594kd\" data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2534\">Helpful for students and working learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ht7sqh\" data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2577\">Makes higher education more accessible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2582\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1po4vhq\" data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2612\">Examination Fee Inclusion</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2751\">The above fee structure includes an <strong data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2695\">examination fee of INR 2,500 per semester</strong>, ensuring transparency in total academic cost planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2756\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hjq4yu\" data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2791\">Early Bird Scholarship Benefit</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2965\">Students may also benefit from the <strong data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2854\">Early Bird Scholarship</strong>, which is available for a limited time. This helps reduce the overall course fee further for early applicants.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"2970\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dut68t\" data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3007\">Payment Mode for Online BCA Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3128\">Students are required to pay the prescribed fees through the official online admission portal at the time of admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4mp25t\" data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3158\">Accepted Payment Methods</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3259\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3174\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3190\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17brhus\" data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3198\">UPI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3214\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lr8px2\" data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3259\">Wallets and other online payment options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3264\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x4ksou\" data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3297\">Important Payment Guidelines</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3368\">To ensure safe transactions, students must follow these instructions:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3613\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1evp8hb\" data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3422\">Always pay through the official admission portal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h9k4ke\" data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3464\">Avoid unauthorized websites or agents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wwktqi\" data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3516\">Do not share payment details with third parties</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ttlmdl\" data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3563\">Save payment receipts for future reference</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sofb6y\" data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3613\">Verify transaction confirmation after payment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3696\">The university is not responsible for payments made through unauthorized sources.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3701\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3720\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"4074\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online BCA fee structure at Uttaranchal University is designed to provide affordability, flexibility, and transparency. With scholarship benefits, multiple payment modes, EMI options, and secure payment systems, the program ensures that students can easily pursue quality computer education and build a strong foundation for a successful IT career.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', 'Medium', '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:93068c47-2461-4276-bbf3-4853c62b5aa1-60\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-42\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"756b93ac-c864-4c54-91c9-11aa841fba0e\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"481\">The Online BCA curriculum at Uttaranchal University is designed to build strong foundational knowledge in computer science, programming, software development, and modern IT applications. Structured across six semesters, the program follows a progressive learning approach that starts with basic computing concepts and gradually advances toward advanced programming, networking, data management, and real-world project development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"713\">This curriculum is highly suitable for students after 10+2 who want to build a strong career in the IT industry, software development, data analytics, web technologies, and emerging digital fields through flexible online learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"718\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"eftvzz\" data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"784\">Semester 1 &ndash; Fundamentals of Computing and Programming Basics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"936\">The first semester focuses on building the core foundation of information technology, mathematics, communication skills, and programming fundamentals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"953\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"963\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"979\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1052\">\r\n<td data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1006\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-111</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1010\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1052\">Introduction to Information Technology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1105\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1064\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-112</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1068\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1105\">Digital Computer and Fundamentals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1136\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1117\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-113</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1121\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1136\">Mathematics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1177\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1148\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-114</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1152\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1177\">Communicative English</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-115</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1193\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Programming in C</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1233\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1393\">This semester introduces students to basic IT concepts, logical thinking, programming fundamentals, and communication skills required for software development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1398\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xolnfs\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1465\">Semester 2 &ndash; Programming and Core Computer Science Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1595\">The second semester strengthens mathematical logic, programming skills, and introduces structured programming and Java concepts.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1862\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1638\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1638\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1612\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1622\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1638\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1862\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1693\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1665\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-121</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1669\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1693\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discrete Mathematics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1748\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1705\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-122</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1709\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1748\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accounting and Financial Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1760\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-123</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1764\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1792\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Structure Using &lsquo;C&rsquo;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1821\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1804\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-124</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1808\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1821\">Core JAVA</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1862\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1833\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-125</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1837\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1862\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Environmental Studies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1882\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"2008\">Students develop strong programming logic, data handling skills, object-oriented programming basics, and analytical thinking.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2013\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uc30a7\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2074\">Semester 3 &ndash; System-Level Understanding and Architecture</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2198\">The third semester focuses on system design, operating systems, computer architecture, and management information systems.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2493\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2241\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2241\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2215\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2225\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2241\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2493\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2306\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2268\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-231</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2272\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2306\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Management Information Systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2344\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2318\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-232</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2322\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2344\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Numerical Analysis</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2381\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2356\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-233</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2360\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2381\">Operating Systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2439\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2393\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-234</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2397\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2439\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer Organization and Architecture</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2493\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2451\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-235</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2455\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2493\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Object-Oriented Programming in C++</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2513\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2630\">This semester builds understanding of how computer systems work internally and how software interacts with hardware.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2635\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"l639lf\" data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2700\">Semester 4 &ndash; Networking, Databases, and Software Development</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2810\">The fourth semester focuses on networking, database systems, software engineering, and advanced programming.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"3094\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2853\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2853\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2827\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2837\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2853\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"3094\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2927\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2880\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-241</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2884\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2927\" data-col-size=\"sm\">PC Applications and Internet Technology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2974\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2939\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-242</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2943\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"2974\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Database Management Systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3013\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"2986\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-243</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"2990\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3013\">Computer Networking</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3053\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3025\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-244</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3029\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3053\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Software Engineering</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3094\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3065\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-245</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3069\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3094\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Programming in Python</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3114\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3237\">Students gain practical knowledge in database systems, networking, Python programming, and software development lifecycle.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3242\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gx021w\" data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3299\">Semester 5 &ndash; Advanced Computing and Industrial Tools</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3413\">The fifth semester focuses on advanced algorithms, graphics, system administration, and industrial technologies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3665\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3456\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3456\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3430\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3430\" data-end=\"3440\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3456\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3665\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3524\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3483\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-351</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3487\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3524\">Analysis and Design of Algorithms</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3561\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3536\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-352</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3540\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3561\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer Graphics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3596\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3573\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-353</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3577\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3596\">.NET Technology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3636\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3608\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-354</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3612\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Linux Administration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3637\" data-end=\"3665\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3637\" data-end=\"3648\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-355</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3652\" data-col-size=\"sm\">8</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3665\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project-I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"3667\" data-end=\"3685\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3811\">This semester enhances problem-solving ability, system-level administration skills, and practical exposure through Project-I.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3813\" data-end=\"3816\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"66kohw\" data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3873\">Semester 6 &ndash; Emerging Technologies and Final Project</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"4003\">The final semester focuses on modern technologies like IoT, web development, business intelligence, and final project execution.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4218\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4046\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4046\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4020\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4020\" data-end=\"4030\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4030\" data-end=\"4046\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4218\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4102\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4073\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-361</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4077\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4077\" data-end=\"4102\" data-col-size=\"sm\">IoT Based Application</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4147\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4114\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-362</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4114\" data-end=\"4118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4147\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Web Development Using PHP</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4188\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4159\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-363</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4163\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4163\" data-end=\"4188\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Intelligence</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4218\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4200\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBCA-364</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4204\">8</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4204\" data-end=\"4218\">Project-II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"4220\" data-end=\"4238\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4372\">This semester focuses on real-world applications, advanced development skills, data-driven systems, and final project implementation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4377\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1203u14\" data-start=\"4379\" data-end=\"4431\">Why This Online BCA Curriculum is Career-Oriented</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4433\" data-end=\"4559\">The curriculum is carefully structured to meet modern IT industry demands and prepare students for real-world technical roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"coqybl\" data-start=\"4561\" data-end=\"4586\">Key Learning Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4925\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vq00r0\" data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4644\">Strong foundation in programming and IT fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c94juq\" data-start=\"4645\" data-end=\"4696\">Hands-on experience in C, C++, Java, and Python</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ug6t5r\" data-start=\"4697\" data-end=\"4757\">Database, networking, and software engineering expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11uczeh\" data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4830\">Exposure to emerging technologies like IoT and Business Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y98ued\" data-start=\"4831\" data-end=\"4876\">Real-world project development experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1swhxcy\" data-start=\"4877\" data-end=\"4925\">Industry-aligned technical skill development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4927\" data-end=\"4930\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"uf5pg3\" data-start=\"4932\" data-end=\"4972\">Career Opportunities After Online BCA</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4974\" data-end=\"5039\">After completing this program, students can pursue roles such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5041\" data-end=\"5223\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p5b4hd\" data-start=\"5041\" data-end=\"5063\">Software Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ihonn2\" data-start=\"5064\" data-end=\"5081\">Web Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qtw7ma\" data-start=\"5082\" data-end=\"5103\">Python Programmer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"je2hee\" data-start=\"5104\" data-end=\"5130\">Database Administrator</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1swqkj5\" data-start=\"5131\" data-end=\"5149\">System Analyst</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rbxmtp\" data-start=\"5150\" data-end=\"5175\">Network Administrator</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hmt9ib\" data-start=\"5176\" data-end=\"5199\">IT Support Engineer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"za4jsx\" data-start=\"5200\" data-end=\"5223\">Junior Data Analyst</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5225\" data-end=\"5228\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"5230\" data-end=\"5247\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5249\" data-end=\"5648\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online BCA curriculum at Uttaranchal University offers a well-balanced and industry-focused learning structure that builds strong technical foundations and advanced computing skills. With a combination of programming languages, system design, networking, databases, and project-based learning, the program prepares students for successful careers in the rapidly growing IT and software industry.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"3\",\"9\",\"10\",\"11\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 114000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
