er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(187, 62, '74106844-2ecd-4ded-ba83-ce892aea405f', '1c9e2d62-f0b0-4b5a-95b5-fd5355b6de84', 52, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-04-24 05:09:31', '2026-06-16 04:18:46', '<p data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"454\">The Online BA admission process at Uttaranchal University is designed to be simple, fully digital, and highly accessible for students who want to pursue a Bachelor of Arts through flexible online learning. This structured process allows learners to complete admission from anywhere without visiting the campus, making it ideal for students who need convenience along with quality higher education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"619\">The entire system is streamlined to ensure smooth application submission, quick fee processing, document verification, and instant access to the learning platform.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"624\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1aucqmo\" data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"661\">Fill the Application Form Online</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"877\">The first step in the Online BA admission process is to complete the application form available on the official online admission portal. Students are required to carefully enter their personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19i6rlg\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"907\">Key Information Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"1086\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jejwk0\" data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"939\">Full name of the applicant</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2mj9ql\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"977\">Active mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i6z3br\" data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1003\">10+2 academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ng1z77\" data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1046\">Address and identification information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18w0kjz\" data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1086\">Basic personal and academic profile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1230\">It is important to ensure that all details are accurate and match official documents to avoid verification issues during admission processing.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1sowbh8\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1270\">Proceed to Program Fee Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1478\">After submitting the application form, candidates must proceed to the Online BA program fee payment stage. The university provides a secure online payment system to ensure safe and hassle-free transactions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1496\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1636\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k1z2iv\" data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1532\">Secure digital payment gateway</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m1dwh7\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1571\">Multiple payment options available</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gj4mw6\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1604\">Instant payment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"voug7u\" data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1636\">Easy fee receipt generation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1746\">Students should carefully review program details before completing the payment to ensure correct enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1751\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dpp8bj\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1795\">Upload Documents and Submit Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1927\">Once the fee payment is completed, candidates need to upload the required documents and submit their application for verification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1i55uz\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1960\">Commonly Required Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2161\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e804nj\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1981\">10th mark sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4gygi\" data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2031\">12th mark sheet (mandatory eligibility proof)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12v10j6\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2077\">Identity proof (Aadhaar / PAN / Passport)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2106\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yra9zg\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2120\">Signature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14qiub2\" data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2161\">Category certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2253\">Clear and properly scanned documents are necessary for fast and smooth admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2258\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1p0wxfd\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2282\">Get LMS Credentials</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2491\">After successful verification and admission confirmation, students receive their <strong data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2413\">Learning Management System (LMS) credentials</strong>. These login details provide access to the complete online learning platform.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11v3zan\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2517\">LMS Features Include</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2750\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"txoaj2\" data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2547\">Live interactive classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2snei\" data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2575\">Recorded video lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n792jx\" data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2613\">Digital study materials and notes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kp831y\" data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2646\">Assignment submission system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwds5n\" data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2690\">Exam updates and academic notifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1klvvy8\" data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2719\">Student support services</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jg6ys4\" data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2750\">Performance tracking tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2755\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2tcvby\" data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2806\">Why This Admission Process is Student-Friendly</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2930\">The Online BA admission process is designed to offer maximum flexibility and ease for students from different backgrounds.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7iqibp\" data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2952\">Major Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"3166\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l2df5d\" data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2987\">100% online admission process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gg3uq8\" data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3016\">No need for campus visit</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tu142m\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3058\">Quick application and approval system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2jbz64\" data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3088\">Secure online fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7mdf7s\" data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3127\">Instant LMS access after admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qt7lt8\" data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3166\">Suitable for students across India</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3171\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wz2jzw\" data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3203\">Important Tips for Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3249\">To ensure smooth admission, students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3485\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"akskwh\" data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3299\">Keep all required documents ready in advance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j5422p\" data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3344\">Use an active mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xcomtm\" data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3392\">Enter correct academic and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c5bysd\" data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3439\">Double-check application before submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r37ut3\" data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3485\">Save payment confirmation receipts safely</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3490\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3509\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3868\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online BA admission process at Uttaranchal University is simple, fast, and completely digital, making it highly suitable for students seeking flexible higher education after 10+2. From application submission to LMS access, every step is designed to ensure a smooth and efficient start to a student&rsquo;s academic journey in the field of arts and humanities.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"448\">The Online BA program at Uttaranchal University is designed for students who want to pursue higher education in arts, humanities, and social sciences through a flexible and modern online learning system. The eligibility criteria are kept simple and inclusive so that students from different academic backgrounds can easily begin their graduation journey after completing school education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"714\">This program is ideal for learners who are interested in subjects like literature, history, political science, sociology, and general humanities while building a strong foundation for careers in government services, education, media, and other professional fields.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"719\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zsi1nv\" data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"752\">Basic Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"875\">To be eligible for admission into the Online BA program, candidates must have completed their higher secondary education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jxvepb\" data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"900\">Minimum Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"1042\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jit9hb\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"973\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"971\">10+2 (Senior Secondary Examination)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7njb92\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1042\">The qualification must be from a <strong data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1042\">recognized board of education</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1177\">Students from any stream&mdash;Arts, Commerce, or Science&mdash;are eligible to apply, making the program accessible to a wide range of learners.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fbb1vk\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1215\">Recognized Board Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1365\">The 10+2 qualification must be obtained from a board that is officially recognized by education authorities to ensure validity for higher education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qn306q\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1394\">Accepted Boards Include</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4c1ndm\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1443\">Central Boards (such as CBSE or equivalent)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1licqzg\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1470\">State Education Boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1abffmy\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1521\">Other recognized national or equivalent boards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1622\">This ensures that students from across India can pursue the Online BA program without restrictions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1627\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e2udby\" data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1666\">Eligibility for Appearing Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1941\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1736\">currently appearing for their 10+2 examinations</strong> may also be eligible to apply, provided they submit their final results within the required admission timeline. This allows students to plan their higher education in advance without losing academic time.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1946\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wo8y5v\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1982\">NIOS Board Students Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2206\">Candidates who have completed their 10+2 through <strong data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2080\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are also eligible, provided their qualification is from a recognized board and meets the university&rsquo;s admission requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2211\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vt7m25\" data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2243\">Who Should Choose Online BA</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2283\">The Online BA program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2576\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ysx1z3\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2340\">Students interested in arts and humanities subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rta6fr\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2396\">Learners preparing for government competitive exams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p1lsap\" data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2455\">Aspirants of civil services and administrative careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cw6wcg\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2513\">Students aiming for careers in teaching and education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1akuygb\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2576\">Individuals seeking flexible graduation options after 10+2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2581\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ljxzvh\" data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2630\">Key Advantages of This Eligibility Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2685\">The simple and inclusive eligibility criteria ensure:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2943\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j78gj3\" data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2727\">Easy access after 10+2 qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3yr7\" data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2767\">No stream restriction for admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11hw0tb\" data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2818\">Equal opportunity for all academic backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qxz39g\" data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2888\">Strong foundation for higher studies like MA or competitive exams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yd477i\" data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2943\">Flexible learning pathway for diverse career goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2948\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pwbvx8\" data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2981\">Important Admission Guidance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3023\">Before applying, students should ensure:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3264\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9n6o\" data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3080\">10+2 marksheet is valid and from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10wfgtl\" data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3147\">Academic details are correctly entered in the application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f1ddu\" data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3199\">All required documents are accurate and updated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"or2d5h\" data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3264\">Eligibility criteria are properly reviewed before submission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3269\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3288\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3673\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online BA eligibility criteria at Uttaranchal University are designed to be simple, inclusive, and student-friendly. With the requirement of 10+2 qualification from a recognized board, the program provides an accessible pathway for students to begin their higher education journey in arts and humanities and build a strong foundation for future academic and career opportunities.</p>', '<p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"486\">The Online BA fee structure at Uttaranchal University is designed to make higher education in arts and humanities affordable, flexible, and accessible for students after 10+2. With multiple payment options such as one-time payment, annual installment plans, semester-wise fees, and no-cost EMI facilities, the university ensures that students from different financial backgrounds can easily pursue a graduation degree in online mode.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"650\">This structured fee system is especially beneficial for students who want quality higher education without the financial burden of traditional on-campus programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"655\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1455s8p\" data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"692\">Online BA Fee Structure Overview</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"762\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"762\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"715\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"747\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discounted Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"762\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"881\">\r\n<td data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"798\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 66,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"824\">INR 55,200</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"881\">Scholarship + INR 6,000 additional concession applied</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"978\">\r\n<td data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"895\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"908\">INR 22,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"921\">INR 18,400</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"978\">Scholarship + INR 2,000 additional concession applied</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<td data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"994\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1007\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 12,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1020\">INR 10,200</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1043\">Scholarship applied</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1058\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Starting from INR 3,097/month*</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1095\">&mdash;</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1134\">Flexible monthly installment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1139\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qxkph8\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1163\">One-Time Fee Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1283\">The one-time fee option is ideal for students who want to complete the entire program payment in a single installment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1297\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1467\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ax7x88\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1326\">Maximum overall savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"os2cf2\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1360\">Scholarship benefits included</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19a9rq0\" data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1394\">Additional concession applied</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"412ksg\" data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1433\">No installment management required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12m2yab\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1467\">Hassle-free admission process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1566\">This option is suitable for students who prefer financial convenience with a one-time investment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1571\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"h3royh\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1593\">Annual Fee Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1704\">The annual payment plan allows students to pay fees year-wise, making it more manageable and budget-friendly.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1718\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jg61a7\" data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1757\">Balanced yearly payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1837cqp\" data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1795\">Scholarship + concession benefits</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wfwnfu\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1847\">Lower financial burden compared to one-time fee</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"147zht8\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1887\">Suitable for family budget planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1892\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19ln8z2\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1916\">Semester Fee Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"2033\">The semester-wise fee plan offers the most flexible payment structure for students who prefer smaller installments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2047\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2188\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"66dvi5\" data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2084\">Low upfront payment requirement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h65wl8\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2114\">Easy financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"os2cf2\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2148\">Scholarship benefits included</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w1lkrp\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2188\">Suitable for self-financed students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2193\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3erpsw\" data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2216\">No-Cost EMI Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2308\">To make education more accessible, the university also provides EMI-based payment support.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16ce89d\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2331\">EMI Starting From</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2366\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1esgqm8\" data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2366\">INR 3,097 per month (approx.)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kx7bmx\" data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2386\">Key Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2534\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vikkm\" data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2428\">Reduces immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ooif12\" data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2460\">Monthly affordable payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8594kd\" data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2506\">Helpful for students and working learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13mq0c2\" data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2534\">Easy financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2539\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1po4vhq\" data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2569\">Examination Fee Inclusion</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2703\">The above fee structure includes an <strong data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2652\">examination fee of INR 2,500 per semester</strong>, ensuring complete transparency in academic costs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2708\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hjq4yu\" data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2743\">Early Bird Scholarship Benefit</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2927\">Students applying within the early admission period may also be eligible for an <strong data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2851\">Early Bird Scholarship</strong>, available for a limited time. This further reduces the overall fee burden.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2932\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"103rha\" data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"2968\">Payment Mode for Online BA Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"3089\">Students are required to pay the prescribed fees through the official online admission portal at the time of admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4mp25t\" data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3119\">Accepted Payment Methods</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3286\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3154\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3154\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3138\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Method</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3154\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Availability</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3286\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3190\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3178\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Debit Card</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3190\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3217\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3205\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credit Card</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3217\">Accepted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3236\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3224\" data-col-size=\"sm\">UPI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3236\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3263\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3251\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Net Banking</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3263\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3286\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3274\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Wallets</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3286\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3288\" data-end=\"3291\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x4ksou\" data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3324\">Important Payment Guidelines</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3406\">To ensure safe and secure transactions, students must follow these instructions:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3654\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2dmii2\" data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3458\">Pay only through the official admission portal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1osbjxp\" data-start=\"3459\" data-end=\"3508\">Avoid unauthorized websites, agents, or links</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yaqla3\" data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3562\">Do not share banking details with unknown sources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o0duh4\" data-start=\"3563\" data-end=\"3607\">Always save payment receipts for records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"109q8mg\" data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3654\">Verify successful transaction confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3656\" data-end=\"3736\">The university is not responsible for payments made through unofficial channels.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxh74a\" data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4062\">Final Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4442\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Online BA fee structure at Uttaranchal University is designed to provide affordability, transparency, and flexibility for students after 10+2. With multiple payment options, scholarship benefits, EMI facilities, and secure payment systems, the program ensures that students can easily pursue higher education in arts and humanities while managing their finances effectively.</p>', 'Medium', '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-69eb2de8-24d8-83e8-897f-ae9bdb4f8d78-4\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-52\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"38365a18-2918-4360-91c5-ac5f7e0aa028\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"418\">The Online BA curriculum at Uttaranchal University is designed to provide a strong academic foundation in arts, humanities, social sciences, economics, psychology, sociology, and political studies. The program follows a structured six-semester framework that gradually develops conceptual understanding, analytical thinking, communication skills, and research ability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"682\">This curriculum is ideal for students after 10+2 who want to pursue higher education in humanities and social sciences while preparing for careers in civil services, teaching, administration, media, psychology, and public policy through flexible online learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"687\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xq3iim\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"750\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundational Understanding of Social Sciences</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"891\">The first semester introduces students to basic concepts in sociology, economics, psychology, language skills, and environmental awareness.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"908\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"918\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"934\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"993\">\r\n<td data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"960\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-111</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"964\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"993\">Introduction to Sociology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1032\">\r\n<td data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1004\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-112</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1008\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1032\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Managerial Economics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1067\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1043\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-113</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1047\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1067\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Basic Psychology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1095\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1078\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-114</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1082\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1095\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1135\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1106\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-115</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1110\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1135\">Environmental Science</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1146\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-116</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1168\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Writing Skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1188\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1296\">This semester builds foundational knowledge of human behavior, society, communication, and economic basics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1301\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"tc9szk\" data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1366\">Semester 2 &ndash; Advanced Communication and Social Understanding</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1474\">The second semester focuses on social systems, economic theory, psychology, and communication development.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1752\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1517\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1517\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1491\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1501\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1517\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1752\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1561\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1543\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-121</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1547\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1561\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1601\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1572\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-122</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1576\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1601\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Social Stratification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1635\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1612\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-123</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1616\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1635\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Macro Economics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1674\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1646\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-124</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1650\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1674\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cognitive Psychology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1714\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1685\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-125</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1689\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1714\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Communicative English</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1752\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1725\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-126</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1729\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1752\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Statistics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1772\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1882\">Students gain deeper understanding of society, economy, human cognition, and analytical communication skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"gtp39t\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1950\">Semester 3 &ndash; Society, Institutions, and Behavioral Studies</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2073\">The third semester focuses on social institutions, environmental issues, behavior, governance, and research fundamentals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2417\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2116\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2116\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2090\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2100\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2116\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2417\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2193\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2142\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-231</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2146\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2193\" data-col-size=\"md\">Environmental Waste and Disaster Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2244\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2204\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-232</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2208\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2244\">Social Institutions in Sociology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2296\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2255\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-233</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2259\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2296\" data-col-size=\"md\">Physiological Process &amp; Behaviour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2335\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2307\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-234</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2311\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2335\" data-col-size=\"md\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2375\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2346\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-235</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2350\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2375\" data-col-size=\"md\">Constitution of India</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2417\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2386\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-236</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2390\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2417\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basic Research Skills I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2437\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2548\">This semester builds awareness of societal systems, governance, environmental challenges, and research basics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2553\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8fy9dx\" data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2606\">Semester 4 &ndash; Political Systems and Social Change</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2718\">The fourth semester focuses on political structures, globalization, human behavior, and social transformation.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"3078\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2761\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2761\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2735\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2745\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2761\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"3078\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2818\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2787\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-241</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2791\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2818\" data-col-size=\"md\">International Economics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2856\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2829\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-242</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2829\" data-end=\"2833\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2856\" data-col-size=\"md\">Parliament of India</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2917\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2867\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-243</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2871\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2917\" data-col-size=\"md\">Social Movement and Social Change in India</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2967\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2928\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-244</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2932\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2967\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fundamentals of Human Behaviour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3035\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"2978\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-245</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"2982\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3035\" data-col-size=\"md\">Contemporary Politics and Issues of Globalization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3078\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3046\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OBA-246</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3050\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3078\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basic Research Skills II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3098\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3207\">Students develop understanding of governance systems, global issues, social change, and behavioral sciences.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3212\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dws0zh\" data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3276\">Semester 5 &ndash; Advanced Social Sciences and Applied Economics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3376\">The fifth semester focuses on economics, psychology, sociology, and specialization-based subjects.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3817\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3419\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3419\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3393\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3403\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3419\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3435\" da