tems jobs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4008\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"s8vgrp\" data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4033\">Elective: Agentic AI</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4280\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4047\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4047\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4047\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4054\" data-end=\"4280\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4054\" data-end=\"4087\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4054\" data-end=\"4087\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced NLP &amp; Language Model</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4124\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4124\" data-col-size=\"md\">Agentic AI &amp; Multi-Agent Systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4164\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4164\" data-col-size=\"md\">RAG Systems &amp; Knowledge Engineering</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4165\" data-end=\"4201\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4165\" data-end=\"4201\" data-col-size=\"md\">Large Language Model Engineering</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4280\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4280\" data-col-size=\"md\">AI for FinTech: Fraud Detection, UPI / India Stack Agents, DPDP Compliance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1omkccn\" data-start=\"4282\" data-end=\"4295\">Best For:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4402\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hxdwty\" data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4335\">Next-generation AI product careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gh4jy3\" data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4361\">LLM engineering roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"78o4wt\" data-start=\"4362\" data-end=\"4402\">AI automation and enterprise AI jobs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4404\" data-end=\"4407\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1xyp7ic\" data-start=\"4409\" data-end=\"4474\">Semester 4: Advanced Industry Applications and Capstone Project</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4476\" data-end=\"4575\">The final semester focuses on advanced tools, strategic implementation, and live industry projects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4577\" data-end=\"4580\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n0ovgf\" data-start=\"4582\" data-end=\"4610\">Elective: Cloud Computing</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4612\" data-end=\"4755\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4612\" data-end=\"4624\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4612\" data-end=\"4624\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4612\" data-end=\"4624\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4631\" data-end=\"4755\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4631\" data-end=\"4672\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4631\" data-end=\"4672\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Google Cloud Services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4711\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to IBM Cloud Services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4755\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4755\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Capstone Project (Specialization-Based)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4757\" data-end=\"4760\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5ij3gw\" data-start=\"4762\" data-end=\"4797\">Elective: Full Stack Development</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4960\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4811\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4811\">\r\n<th c