er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(217, 66, '07985905-d41c-4ef5-9e1b-19692cba4a24', '49e8a8f2-d2e5-4b11-8054-2d811d6922b1', 219, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-04-30 04:40:23', '2026-06-16 04:34:04', '<p data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"465\">The <strong data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"123\">MCA Full Stack Development admission process</strong> is designed to be simple, transparent, and student-friendly so candidates can complete enrollment smoothly from anywhere. Whether you are a fresh graduate, working professional, or career switcher planning to enter the software industry, understanding each step helps avoid delays, documentation errors, and missed scholarship opportunities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"800\">Many students assume admission only means filling out a form, but the complete process includes selecting the right program, completing the application correctly, paying fees on time, and finishing final registration. Candidates who follow each stage carefully usually receive faster confirmation and a smoother start to the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"805\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"h8um23\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"834\">Step 1: Program Selection</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yfeghg\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"890\">Choose the Right MCA Full Stack Development Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"1023\">The first stage is selecting the program after evaluating your academic background, technical interest, and long-term career goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1077\">Before selecting the course, students should review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1315\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pxfvj5\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1129\">Full Stack curriculum and specialization depth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvng9i\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1154\">Eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i49ddg\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1191\">Program duration and flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jrzxgp\" data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1226\">Fee structure and scholarships</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"23sp9n\" data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1253\">University recognition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ed40h\" data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1285\">Placement or career support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"142dclq\" data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1315\">Learning platform quality</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6gtrn\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1338\">Practical Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1483\">Choose this program if you are interested in coding, websites, applications, APIs, databases, software products, and technology-driven careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1488\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"6y7zmq\" data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1522\">Step 2: Application Completion</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3tmees\" data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1562\">Fill the Application Form Correctly</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1686\">After selecting the program, candidates need to complete the application form with accurate academic and personal details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1716\">Common information required:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1951\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rumkc6\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1755\">Full name as per official records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q81ytd\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1786\">Mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1809\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6s8n4z\" data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1839\">Marks / percentage / CGPA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1859\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1878\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1907\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jt0oae\" data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1951\">Work experience details (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1981\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2153\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k3h2xl\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2013\">Incorrect spelling of name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ov0u24\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2040\">Wrong academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mffp3p\" data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2072\">Uploading unclear documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uheg68\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2111\">Leaving required fields incomplete</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s2tgqf\" data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2153\">Using inactive email or mobile number</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2211\">Even small mistakes can delay verification and approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2216\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hdpzj5\" data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2239\">Step 3: Fee Payment</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ajo51g\" data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2277\">Confirm Your Seat Through Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2429\">Once the application is reviewed, eligible candidates proceed to fee payment. In many institutions, seats are confirmed only after successful payment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2466\">Common payment options may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2610\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8cihnr\" data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2488\">Full fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iaj6w\" data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2512\">Annual payment mode</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kgt5p6\" data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2543\">Semester-wise payment mode</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p78zdn\" data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2571\">EMI / financing options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3qe9zd\" data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2610\">Scholarship-adjusted payment plans</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"195udbl\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2641\">Why Early Payment Matters</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2784\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xb6c6j\" data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2688\">Secures your seat before admissions close</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1thiunj\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2724\">Helps lock scholarship benefits</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4zdq7m\" data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2753\">Speeds up final approval</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgwtcy\" data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2784\">Reduces last-minute stress</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2f7n3j\" data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2801\">Hidden Risk</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2907\">Many students delay payment after selection and later lose seats because intake capacity may be limited.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2912\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1d5z8n9\" data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2949\">Step 4: Submission &amp; Registration</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14iygin\" data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2987\">Final Verification and Enrollment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3155\">The final stage includes document verification, registration approval, and onboarding. After successful completion, students receive official enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3180\">This stage may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3400\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"egqw0x\" data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3219\">Academic certificate verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kxifw1\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3249\">Identity proof validation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qa0omz\" data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3278\">Fee payment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n8b7e1\" data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3311\">Enrollment number generation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p896bg\" data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3347\">Student portal / LMS activation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"etryrg\" data-start=\"3348\" data-end=\"3371\">Orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6q9q3\" data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3400\">Academic calendar access</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3420\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3550\">Payment alone may not complete admission. Final registration is generally confirmed only after successful document verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3555\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"130qggm\" data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3590\">Admission Process Summary Table</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3959\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3628\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3628\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3599\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3617\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3628\" data-col-size=\"md\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3959\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3749\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3647\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3667\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Selection</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3667\" data-end=\"3749\" data-col-size=\"md\">Choose the right Full Stack Development program based on goals and eligibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3829\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3754\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3754\" data-end=\"3779\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Completion</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3829\">Submit accurate details and required documents</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3880\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3834\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3848\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3880\">Confirm seat through payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3959\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3885\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3913\">Submission &amp; Registration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"3959\">Complete verification and final enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3961\" data-end=\"3964\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"mr4dh4\" data-start=\"3966\" data-end=\"3994\">Documents Usually Required</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4243\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134nxcp\" data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4022\">Graduation mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1la4h9e\" data-start=\"4023\" data-end=\"4059\">Degree / provisional certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1byub2s\" data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4083\">Government ID proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"4084\" data-end=\"4112\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14qiub2\" data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4153\">Category certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"35jpw\" data-start=\"4154\" data-end=\"4193\">Work experience proof (if required)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xwhuwa\" data-start=\"4194\" data-end=\"4243\">Migration / transfer certificate if requested</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"498\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"101\" data-end=\"131\">MCA Full Stack Development</strong> program, candidates must have completed a recognized undergraduate degree with a suitable academic background in computing, mathematics, programming, or analytical subjects. Since Full Stack Development combines front-end, back-end, databases, APIs, cloud tools, and software deployment, institutions generally prefer students with logical and technical foundations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"764\">The eligibility structure is broad and inclusive. It allows both technical graduates and candidates from other streams to apply, provided they have studied <strong data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"721\">Mathematics, Business Mathematics, Programming, or Statistics</strong> at the <strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"763\">10+2 level or graduation level</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"1024\">This makes MCA Full Stack Development an excellent career-focused option for students who want to build careers in <strong data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"1023\">software development, web application engineering, product development, UI/UX systems, DevOps, startups, and digital technology industries</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1029\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15oy5s2\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1059\">Basic Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1201\">A candidate is generally eligible for MCA Full Stack Development admission if they have passed any of the following qualifying examinations:</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"gy1uve\" data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1263\">Directly Eligible Technical / Computer Background Degrees</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1408\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nv7qo8\" data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1276\"><strong data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1274\">BCA</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"167rcso\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1309\"><strong data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1307\">B.Sc. (Computer Science)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xu7gee\" data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1328\"><strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1326\">B.Sc. (IT)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1azmvnf\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1347\"><strong data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1345\">B.E. (CSE)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tg1ojo\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1369\"><strong data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1367\">B.Tech. (CSE)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9snkpf\" data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1387\"><strong data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1385\">B.E. (IT)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kxdmrw\" data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1408\"><strong data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1406\">B.Tech. (IT)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1567\">These degrees are highly aligned with the MCA Full Stack curriculum because they already include programming, systems, databases, and computing fundamentals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1572\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"i7gacq\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1615\">Other Graduation Degrees Also Eligible</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1679\">Candidates with any graduation degree may also apply, such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1758\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12u5hnc\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1701\"><strong data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1699\">B.E / B.Tech</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ae8qnu\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1715\"><strong data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1713\">B.Sc.</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10juesr\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1730\"><strong data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1728\">B.Com.</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uh53kb\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1743\"><strong data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1741\">B.A.</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ib9f9s\" data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1758\"><strong data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1756\">B.Voc.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1869\">However, they must have studied at least one of the following subjects at <strong data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1868\">10+2 level or graduation level</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkuajg\" data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1886\">Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uhocey\" data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1911\">Business Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pmqvf5\" data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1927\">Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yq9p59\" data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1942\">Statistics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1947\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1sd3qkf\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1987\">Why Subject Requirement Is Important</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2036\">Full Stack Development requires skills such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2237\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d24kin\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2059\">Programming logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pcanhh\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2079\">Problem solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qnl0g9\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2106\">Database understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ecbm97\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2141\">Front-end development concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1911ivo\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2167\">Back-end architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixcr8u\" data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2187\">API integration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"db6umo\" data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2211\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10vd5ib\" data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2237\">Testing and debugging</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2333\">Students with prior mathematics or programming exposure often learn faster and perform better.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2338\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"65wtjx\" data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2375\">Recognized University Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2454\">The qualifying degree must be from a <strong data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2453\">recognized University / Institution</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2496\">Accepted institutions generally include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2714\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kiq5ue\" data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2529\">UGC-recognized universities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tucsj\" data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2562\">Government-approved colleges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4nik9f\" data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2611\">AICTE-approved institutions where applicable</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m4v6vg\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2647\">Accredited private institutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zmwn01\" data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2714\">Recognized international institutions (subject to equivalency)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2794\">Degrees from unrecognized institutions may face rejection during verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2799\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1pvmaxh\" data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2833\">Can Final-Year Students Apply?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"3013\">In many institutions, students who are <strong data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2919\">appearing in the final year of graduation</strong> may apply provisionally, subject to submission of final results within the required timeline.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3086\">This helps candidates secure admission without losing an academic year.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3091\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1myqik1\" data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3130\">NIOS Eligibility (Where Applicable)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3409\">Candidates who completed <strong data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3217\">10+2 through NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are generally eligible if their qualification is recognized and they meet the required subject criteria such as Mathematics, Business Mathematics, Programming, or Statistics where applicable.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3411\" data-end=\"3467\">Institution-specific verification rules may still apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3472\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"roudpq\" data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3524\">Who Should Apply for MCA Full Stack Development?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3552\">This program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3912\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ak65p2\" data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3605\">BCA graduates seeking advanced software careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pdmmez\" data-start=\"3606\" data-end=\"3656\">Students interested in web and app development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bnj269\" data-start=\"3657\" data-end=\"3710\">Graduates wanting coding-based technology careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1glw7b1\" data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3792\">Commerce or Arts students with mathematics/programming background entering IT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"115hh7b\" data-start=\"3793\" data-end=\"3847\">Working professionals planning software upskilling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kiu67r\" data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3912\">Candidates interested in startup or product-building careers</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"69\" data-end=\"485\">The total <strong data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"128\">Online MCA Full Stack Development Program Fee</strong> is <strong data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"148\">INR 1,55,000</strong>. With a <strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"187\">25% Early Bird Scholarship</strong>, eligible learners can reduce the payable amount to <strong data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"256\">INR 1,16,250</strong>. This discounted fee structure makes the program more affordable for students and working professionals who want to build careers in software development, web engineering, application architecture, and modern technology domains.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"731\">Flexible payment options are available, allowing learners to pay annually or semester-wise according to convenience. Easy financing options may also be offered, helping students manage academic expenses without heavy upfront financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"736\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"j6hpqa\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"768\">Complete Fee Structure Table</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"930\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"796\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"796\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"786\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"796\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"930\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<td data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"831\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Original Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"847\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,55,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<td data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"879\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Early Bird Scholarship (25%)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"893\">INR 38,750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"930\">\r\n<td data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"914\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Payable Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"930\">INR 1,16,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"935\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1u2ohqe\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"960\">Annual Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1073\">Students who prefer yearly fee planning can divide the scholarship-adjusted amount across the program duration.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1114\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1114\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1090\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1104\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Calculation</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1114\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1147\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1172\">INR 1,16,250 &divide; 2 Years</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1195\">INR 58,125 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1omkccn\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1210\">Best For:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w5w9p8\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1257\">Working professionals with annual budgets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ih2y9i\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1305\">Students preferring fewer payment deadlines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oij3j\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1361\">Learners comfortable with medium-sized installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xp9h6n\" data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1407\">Candidates seeking simpler fee management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jh0q5t\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1439\">Semester Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1539\">Students who prefer smaller and manageable installments can choose the semester-wise payment mode.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1672\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1556\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1570\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Calculation</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1580\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1672\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1672\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1615\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1644\">INR 1,16,250 &divide; 4 Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1672\">INR 29,063 per semester*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1721\">*Rounded amount based on provided fee breakup.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1omkccn\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1736\">Best For:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1909\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6oxeds\" data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1781\">Students wanting lower upfront payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5yiyxk\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1821\">Learners balancing work and studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f2y0g8\" data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1863\">Candidates preferring phased payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kovrbb\" data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1909\">Students seeking smoother budget planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1914\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1571yuk\" data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1950\">Easy Financing Options Available</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2051\">Easy financing options can help students begin the program without paying the full fee immediately.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2079\">Possible benefits include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2281\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juc81q\" data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2119\">Reduced immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yl84yt\" data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2154\">Better monthly budget planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eelirn\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2201\">Ability to continue learning while earning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"98fiz9\" data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2232\">Faster admission decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o2iou9\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2281\">Improved affordability for career upskilling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2398\">Students should always review EMI terms, repayment duration, processing fees, and any applicable charges carefully.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3082\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11rln87\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3127\">Scholarship Advantage Students Should Use</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3225\">The <strong data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3163\">25% Early Bird Scholarship</strong> directly lowers tuition cost and creates significant savings.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8ww4ad\" data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3243\">Hidden Risk:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3432\">Many students delay applications and lose scholarship benefits after deadlines or limited-seat closures. If the program aligns with your goals, early application can be financially smart.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"430\">The <strong data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"106\">MCA Full Stack Development syllabus</strong> is designed for students who want careers in <strong data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"317\">software engineering, web development, application architecture, cloud platforms, DevOps, UI/UX systems, data-driven applications, and modern product development</strong>. The curriculum combines strong computer application fundamentals with industry-ready full stack specialization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"760\">Unlike traditional MCA programs focused only on theory, this program blends <strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"626\">front-end development + back-end systems + databases + cloud technologies + DevOps + cybersecurity + live projects</strong>. This creates strong employability in startups, IT companies, SaaS businesses, e-commerce firms, and global technology organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"961\">The semester-wise structure begins with core computing foundations, then moves into web systems, programming, cybersecurity, and finally specialization-based advanced learning with capstone projects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"966\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1r4o1hf\" data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1019\">Semester-Wise MCA Full Stack Development Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1anu0cz\" data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1062\">Semester 1: Core Computing Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1152\">The first semester builds strong technical basics required for software and web careers.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1166\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1166\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1166\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1212\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1212\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Database Management System</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1243\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1243\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Computer Networks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1263\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1263\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Web Programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1286\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1286\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Python Programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1324\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Network Security and Cryptography</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vujmey\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1363\">What Students Learn in Semester 1</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1594\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ti3u8p\" data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1408\">Advanced database design and management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5axc8e\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1459\">Networking systems and communication protocols</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s78lf9\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1492\">Web programming fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ef9x5\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1546\">Python programming for development and automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19gtnv3\" data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1594\">Security principles and cryptography basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7zaalc\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1625\">Why This Semester Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1746\">Students build the technical foundation needed for later full stack frameworks, deployment tools, and scalable systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1751\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"135mbcy\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1801\">Semester 2: Software Development and Security</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1907\">The second semester focuses on application development, algorithms, software quality, and cybersecurity.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1921\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1921\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1921\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1961\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1961\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Internet Programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1999\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1999\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Design and Analysis of Algorithms</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2020\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Software Testing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2052\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2052\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Web Application Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2071\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cyber Security</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sl4r5f\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2097\">Key Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2301\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ejjfyl\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2133\">Advanced internet technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z9m9ev\" data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2179\">Efficient coding and algorithmic thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y3haug\" data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2222\">Testing software for quality assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sjq40o\" data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2259\">Building modern web applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dpzdq9\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2301\">Protecting systems from cyber threats</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1espbkn\" data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2321\">Industry Value</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2436\">These are essential skills because companies need developers who can build secure and reliable software products.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2441\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1atof98\" data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2481\">Semester 3: Specialization Electives</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2596\">The third semester allows students to choose career-focused specialization pathways based on goals and interests.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2601\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5ij3gw\" data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2638\">Elective: Full Stack Development</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2806\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2652\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2652\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2652\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2806\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2687\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2687\" data-col-size=\"sm\">HTML, CSS and JavaScript</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2726\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2726\" data-col-size=\"sm\">User Interface, Experience, Design</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2764\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2764\" data-col-size=\"sm\">DevOps - I (GIT, Jenkins, Docker)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2790\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2790\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Software Architecture</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2806\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2806\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Prototyping</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1omkccn\" data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2821\">Best For:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2940\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h556r3\" data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2872\">Students targeting Full Stack Developer roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5n1p8h\" data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2904\">Product development careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pagk10\" data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2940\">Startup and web technology jobs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2945\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n0ovgf\" data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2975\">Elective: Cloud Computing</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3163\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"2989\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"2989\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"2989\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3163\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3031\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3031\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Cloud Computing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3071\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3071\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Amazon Web Services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3116\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3116\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Microsoft Azure Services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3138\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3138\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cloud Programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3163\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3163\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cloud Virtualization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1omkccn\" data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3178\">Best For:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3271\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qbybg1\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3206\">Cloud engineer careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12utd2w\" data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3242\">DevOps and infrastructure roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w07yc6\" data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3271\">Enterprise platform jobs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3273\" data-end=\"3276\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15vkyns\" data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3305\">Elective: Data Analytics</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3457\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3319\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3319\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3319\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3457\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3357\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3357\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Analytics Using Python</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3384\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3384\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SQL for Data Analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3402\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3402\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Web Analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3430\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3430\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Digital Media Analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3457\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3457\" data-col-size=\"sm\">IoT and Data Analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3459\" data-end=\"3462\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mlgjbr\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3521\">Elective: Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3733\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3535\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3535\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3535\" data-col-size=\"m