ystems &amp; Knowledge Engineering</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"3931\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"3931\" data-col-size=\"md\">Large Language Model Engineering</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"4010\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"4010\" data-col-size=\"md\">AI for FinTech: Fraud Detection, UPI / India Stack Agents, DPDP Compliance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4015\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16gym3g\" data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4066\">Semester 4: Advanced Tools and Capstone Project</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4068\" data-end=\"4180\">The final semester focuses on advanced implementation, enterprise tools, and specialization-based live projects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4185\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5ij3gw\" data-start=\"4187\" data-end=\"4222\">Elective: Full Stack Development</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4385\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4236\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4236\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4236\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4385\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4299\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4299\" data-col-size=\"md\">Web Services - REST API, ReactJS, NodeJS Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4341\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4341\" data-col-size=\"md\">DevOps - II (Ansible, Puppet, Nagios)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4342\" data-end=\"4385\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4342\" data-end=\"4385\" data-col-size=\"md\">Capstone Project (Specialization-Based)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=