er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(218, 66, '07985905-d41c-4ef5-9e1b-19692cba4a24', '49e8a8f2-d2e5-4b11-8054-2d811d6922b1', 220, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-04-30 05:27:10', '2026-06-16 04:34:26', '<p data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"454\">The <strong data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"109\">MCA Cloud Computing admission process</strong> is designed to be simple, transparent, and student-friendly so candidates can complete enrollment smoothly from anywhere. Whether you are a fresh graduate, working professional, or career switcher planning to enter cloud technology careers, understanding each step helps avoid delays, documentation errors, and missed scholarship opportunities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"785\">Many students assume admission only means filling a form, but the complete process includes selecting the right program, completing the application correctly, paying fees on time, and finishing final registration. Candidates who follow each stage carefully usually receive faster confirmation and a smoother start to the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"790\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"h8um23\" data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"819\">Step 1: Program Selection</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qfzw9n\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"868\">Choose the Right MCA Cloud Computing Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"1001\">The first stage is selecting the program after evaluating your academic background, technical interest, and long-term career goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1055\">Before selecting the course, students should review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1279\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h8m9vd\" data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1093\">Cloud Computing curriculum depth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvng9i\" data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1118\">Eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i49ddg\" data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1155\">Program duration and flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jrzxgp\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1190\">Fee structure and scholarships</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"23sp9n\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1217\">University recognition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ed40h\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1249\">Placement or career support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"142dclq\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1279\">Learning platform quality</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6gtrn\" data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1302\">Practical Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1462\">Choose this program if you are interested in cloud platforms, virtual infrastructure, DevOps, automation, enterprise systems, and scalable technology careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1467\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"6y7zmq\" data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1501\">Step 2: Application Completion</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3tmees\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1541\">Fill the Application Form Correctly</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1665\">After selecting the program, candidates need to complete the application form with accurate academic and personal details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1695\">Common information required:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1930\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rumkc6\" data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1734\">Full name as per official records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q81ytd\" data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1765\">Mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1788\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6s8n4z\" data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1818\">Marks / percentage / CGPA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1838\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1857\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1886\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jt0oae\" data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1930\">Work experience details (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1960\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2133\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k3h2xl\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1992\">Incorrect spelling of name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ov0u24\" data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2019\">Wrong academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mffp3p\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2051\">Uploading unclear documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3cr5cu\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2091\">Leaving mandatory fields incomplete</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s2tgqf\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2133\">Using inactive email or mobile number</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2174\">Even small mistakes can delay approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2179\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hdpzj5\" data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2202\">Step 3: Fee Payment</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ajo51g\" data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2240\">Confirm Your Seat Through Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2402\">Once the application is reviewed, eligible candidates proceed to fee payment. In many institutions, admission seats are confirmed only after successful payment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2439\">Common payment options may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2583\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8cihnr\" data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2461\">Full fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iaj6w\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2485\">Annual payment mode</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kgt5p6\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2516\">Semester-wise payment mode</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p78zdn\" data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2544\">EMI / financing options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3qe9zd\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2583\">Scholarship-adjusted payment plans</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"195udbl\" data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2614\">Why Early Payment Matters</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2757\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xb6c6j\" data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2661\">Secures your seat before admissions close</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1thiunj\" data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2697\">Helps lock scholarship benefits</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4zdq7m\" data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2726\">Speeds up final approval</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgwtcy\" data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2757\">Reduces last-minute stress</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2f7n3j\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2774\">Hidden Risk</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2871\">Many students delay payment after selection and later lose seats because intake may be limited.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2876\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1d5z8n9\" data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2913\">Step 4: Submission &amp; Registration</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14iygin\" data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2951\">Final Verification and Enrollment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"3119\">The final stage includes document verification, registration approval, and onboarding. After successful completion, students receive official enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3144\">This stage may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3364\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"egqw0x\" data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3183\">Academic certificate verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kxifw1\" data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3213\">Identity proof validation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qa0omz\" data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3242\">Fee payment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n8b7e1\" data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3275\">Enrollment number generation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p896bg\" data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3311\">Student portal / LMS activation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"etryrg\" data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3335\">Orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6q9q3\" data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3364\">Academic calendar access</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3384\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3505\">Payment alone may not complete admission. Final registration is generally confirmed only after successful verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3510\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"130qggm\" data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3545\">Admission Process Summary Table</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3907\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3583\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3583\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3554\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3572\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3583\" data-col-size=\"md\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3907\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3697\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3602\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3622\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Selection</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3622\" data-end=\"3697\">Choose the right Cloud Computing program based on goals and eligibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3777\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3702\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3727\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Completion</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3727\" data-end=\"3777\" data-col-size=\"md\">Submit accurate details and required documents</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3828\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3782\" data-end=\"3796\">Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3828\">Confirm seat through payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3907\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3833\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3861\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submission &amp; Registration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3861\" data-end=\"3907\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete verification and final enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"3912\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"mr4dh4\" data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"3942\">Documents Usually Required</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"4191\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134nxcp\" data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"3970\">Graduation mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1la4h9e\" data-start=\"3971\" data-end=\"4007\">Degree / provisional certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1byub2s\" data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4031\">Government ID proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4060\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14qiub2\" data-start=\"4061\" data-end=\"4101\">Category certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"35jpw\" data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4141\">Work experience proof (if required)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xwhuwa\" data-start=\"4142\" data-end=\"4191\">Migration / transfer certificate if requested</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"501\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"117\">MCA Cloud Computing</strong> program, candidates must have completed a recognized undergraduate degree with a suitable academic background in computing, mathematics, programming, or analytical subjects. Since Cloud Computing combines software systems, virtual infrastructure, databases, networking, security, and scalable platforms, institutions generally prefer students with logical and technical fundamentals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"774\">The eligibility criteria are broad and student-friendly. Both technical graduates and candidates from other academic streams may apply, provided they have studied <strong data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"731\">Mathematics, Business Mathematics, Programming, or Statistics</strong> at the <strong data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"773\">10+2 level or graduation level</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"1001\">This makes MCA Cloud Computing an excellent option for students who want careers in <strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"1000\">cloud platforms, DevOps, infrastructure management, software deployment, cybersecurity, IT operations, and enterprise technology systems</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15oy5s2\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1036\">Basic Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1171\">A candidate is generally eligible for MCA Cloud Computing admission if they have passed any of the following qualifying examinations:</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"gy1uve\" data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1233\">Directly Eligible Technical / Computer Background Degrees</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1378\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nv7qo8\" data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1246\"><strong data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1244\">BCA</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"167rcso\" data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1279\"><strong data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1277\">B.Sc. (Computer Science)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xu7gee\" data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1298\"><strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1296\">B.Sc. (IT)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1azmvnf\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1317\"><strong data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1315\">B.E. (CSE)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tg1ojo\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1339\"><strong data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1337\">B.Tech. (CSE)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9snkpf\" data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1357\"><strong data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1355\">B.E. (IT)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kxdmrw\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1378\"><strong data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1376\">B.Tech. (IT)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1545\">These degrees are strongly aligned with the MCA Cloud Computing curriculum because they usually include programming, systems, networking, and technical fundamentals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1550\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"i7gacq\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1593\">Other Graduation Degrees Also Eligible</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1657\">Candidates with any graduation degree may also apply, such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1736\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12u5hnc\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1679\"><strong data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1677\">B.E / B.Tech</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ae8qnu\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1693\"><strong data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1691\">B.Sc.</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10juesr\" data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1708\"><strong data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1706\">B.Com.</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uh53kb\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1721\"><strong data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1719\">B.A.</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ib9f9s\" data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1736\"><strong data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1734\">B.Voc.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1847\">However, they must have studied at least one of the following subjects at <strong data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1846\">10+2 level or graduation level</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1920\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkuajg\" data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1864\">Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uhocey\" data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1889\">Business Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pmqvf5\" data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1905\">Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yq9p59\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1920\">Statistics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1925\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1sd3qkf\" data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1965\">Why Subject Requirement Is Important</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2009\">Cloud Computing requires understanding of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2186\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rlr66e\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2038\">Logical problem solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p0vlzs\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2061\">Programming basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lkg7vb\" data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2089\">Databases and data flow</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lcyp2d\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2113\">Networking concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4gq45x\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2136\">Security awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wndxsz\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2162\">Resource optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"db6umo\" data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2186\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2289\">Students with prior mathematics or programming exposure generally learn faster and adapt more easily.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2294\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"65wtjx\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2331\">Recognized University Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2410\">The qualifying degree must be from a <strong data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2409\">recognized University / Institution</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2452\">Accepted institutions generally include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2676\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kiq5ue\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2485\">UGC-recognized universities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tucsj\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2518\">Government-approved colleges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4nik9f\" data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2567\">AICTE-approved institutions where applicable</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m4v6vg\" data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2603\">Accredited private institutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wmukpo\" data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2676\">Recognized international institutions (subject to equivalency norms)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2756\">Degrees from unrecognized institutions may face rejection during verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2761\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1pvmaxh\" data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2795\">Can Final-Year Students Apply?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2975\">In many institutions, students who are <strong data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2881\">appearing in the final year of graduation</strong> may apply provisionally, subject to submission of final results within the required timeline.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3048\">This helps candidates secure admission without losing an academic year.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3053\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1myqik1\" data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3092\">NIOS Eligibility (Where Applicable)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3362\">Candidates who completed <strong data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3179\">10+2 through NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are generally eligible if the qualification is recognized and required subjects such as Mathematics, Business Mathematics, Programming, or Statistics were completed where applicable.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3407\">Institution-specific rules may still apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3412\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fp6vsx\" data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3457\">Who Should Apply for MCA Cloud Computing?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3459\" data-end=\"3485\">This program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3834\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rodmsk\" data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3532\">BCA graduates seeking advanced IT careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oyrgvm\" data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3608\">Students interested in AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, and enterprise systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzimas\" data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3664\">Graduates wanting infrastructure and DevOps careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mztwtw\" data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3716\">Candidates planning software deployment careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"anvn4c\" data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3767\">Working professionals seeking cloud upskilling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kkyhve\" data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3834\">Students interested in modern scalable technology environments</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"486\">The total <strong data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"114\">Online MCA Cloud Computing Program Fee</strong> is <strong data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"134\">INR 1,55,000</strong>. With a <strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"173\">25% Early Bird Scholarship</strong>, eligible learners can reduce the payable amount to <strong data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"242\">INR 1,16,250</strong>. This discounted fee structure makes the program more affordable for students and working professionals who want to build careers in cloud platforms, DevOps, infrastructure management, enterprise IT systems, and modern technology environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"732\">Flexible payment options are available, allowing learners to pay annually or semester-wise according to convenience. Easy financing options may also be offered, helping students manage academic expenses without heavy upfront financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"j6hpqa\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"769\">Complete Fee Structure Table</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"931\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"787\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"931\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"848\">\r\n<td data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"832\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Original Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"848\">INR 1,55,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"894\">\r\n<td data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"880\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Early Bird Scholarship (25%)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"894\">INR 38,750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"931\">\r\n<td data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"915\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Payable Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"931\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,16,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"936\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1u2ohqe\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"961\">Annual Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1067\">Students who prefer yearly payments can divide the scholarship-adjusted fee across the program duration.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1108\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1108\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1084\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1098\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Calculation</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1108\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1141\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1166\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,16,250 &divide; 2 Years</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 58,125 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1omkccn\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1204\">Best For:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w5w9p8\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1251\">Working professionals with annual budgets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ih2y9i\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1299\">Students preferring fewer payment deadlines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oij3j\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1355\">Learners comfortable with medium-sized installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xw5kb1\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1400\">Candidates seeking simple fee management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1405\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jh0q5t\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1432\">Semester Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1532\">Students who prefer smaller and manageable installments can choose the semester-wise payment mode.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1665\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1573\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1573\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1549\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1563\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Calculation</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1573\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1665\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1665\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1608\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1637\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,16,250 &divide; 4 Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1665\">INR 29,063 per semester*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1714\">*Rounded amount based on provided fee breakup.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1omkccn\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1729\">Best For:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1902\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6oxeds\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1774\">Students wanting lower upfront payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5yiyxk\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1814\">Learners balancing work and studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f2y0g8\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1856\">Candidates preferring phased payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kovrbb\" data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1902\">Students seeking smoother budget planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1907\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1571yuk\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1943\">Easy Financing Options Available</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"2044\">Easy financing options can help learners begin the program without paying the full fee immediately.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2072\">Possible benefits include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2274\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juc81q\" data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2112\">Reduced immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yl84yt\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2147\">Better monthly budget planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eelirn\" data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2194\">Ability to continue learning while earning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"98fiz9\" data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2225\">Faster admission decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o2iou9\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2274\">Improved affordability for career upskilling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2391\">Students should always review EMI terms, repayment duration, processing fees, and any applicable charges carefully.</p>\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rvgrxi\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2441\">Scholarship Advantage Students Should Use</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3206\">The <strong data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3144\">25% Early Bird Scholarship</strong> directly lowers tuition cost and creates significant savings.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8ww4ad\" data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3224\">Hidden Risk:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3413\">Many students delay applications and lose scholarship benefits after deadlines or limited-seat closures. If the program aligns with your goals, early application can be financially smart.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"420\">The <strong data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"92\">MCA Cloud Computing syllabus</strong> is designed for students who want careers in <strong data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"286\">cloud platforms, DevOps, infrastructure management, software deployment, cybersecurity, enterprise systems, and scalable technology environments</strong>. The curriculum combines strong computer application fundamentals with advanced cloud specialization to match modern industry demand.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"813\">Unlike a traditional MCA focused only on programming theory, this program blends <strong data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"628\">software development + networking + databases + virtualization + cloud platforms + DevOps + cybersecurity + live projects</strong>. This creates strong employability in IT services, startups, multinational companies, fintech firms, healthcare organizations, e-commerce businesses, and government technology sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"1078\">The semester-wise structure begins with core technical foundations, progresses into software engineering and secure systems, and later moves into specialization pathways such as Cloud Computing, Full Stack Development, Data Analytics, and Artificial Intelligence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1083\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11hi4zw\" data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1129\">Semester-Wise MCA Cloud Computing Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cj4uq8\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1172\">Semester 1: Core Technical Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1266\">The first semester builds a strong base in programming, networking, databases, and security.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1280\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1280\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1280\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1326\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1326\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Database Management System</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1357\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1357\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Computer Networks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1377\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1377\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Web Programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Python Programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1438\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Network Security and Cryptography</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1463\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ti3u8p\" data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1508\">Advanced database design and management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0hohw\" data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1545\">Computer networking architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s78lf9\" data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1578\">Web programming fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jg5km8\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1620\">Python for development and automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p3atml\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1663\">Cryptography and secure systems basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7zaalc\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1694\">Why This Semester Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1791\">These subjects build the technical base required for cloud architecture and enterprise systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1t7817r\" data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1851\">Semester 2: Software Engineering and Cybersecurity</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1954\">The second semester focuses on modern development systems, algorithms, testing, and cyber protection.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2118\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1968\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1968\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1968\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2118\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2008\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Internet Programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2046\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2046\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Design and Analysis of Algorithms</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2067\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2067\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Software Testing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2099\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2099\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Web Application Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2118\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cyber Security</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sl4r5f\" data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2144\">Key Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2314\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"le1fdv\" data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2184\">Internet-based application systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b6zuh8\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2215\">Efficient algorithm design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"34xk6d\" data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2246\">Software quality assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8gi2oh\" data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2278\">Web application development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wry4f7\" data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2314\">Cybersecurity defense practices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1espbkn\" data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2334\">Industry Value</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2423\">Companies prefer cloud professionals who also understand secure application ecosystems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2428\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1atof98\" data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2468\">Semester 3: Specialization Electives</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2552\">The third semester allows students to choose career-focused specialization tracks.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2557\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n0ovgf\" data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2587\">Elective: Cloud Computing</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2775\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2601\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2601\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2601\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2775\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2643\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2643\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Cloud Computing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2683\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2683\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Amazon Web Services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2728\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2728\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Microsoft Azure Services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2750\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2750\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cloud Programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2775\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2775\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cloud Virtualization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1omkccn\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2790\">Best For:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2909\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13opouy\" data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2837\">Students targeting cloud engineer careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ht676i\" data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2877\">Infrastructure and deployment roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"130oomj\" data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2909\">Enterprise IT platform jobs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2914\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5ij3gw\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2951\">Elective: Full Stack Development</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"3119\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2965\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2965\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2965\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3119\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3000\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3000\" data-col-size=\"sm\">HTML, CSS and JavaScript</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3039\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3039\" data-col-size=\"sm\">User Interface, Experience, Design</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3040\" data-end=\"3077\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3040\" data-end=\"3077\" data-col-size=\"sm\">DevOps - I (GIT, Jenkins, Docker)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3103\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3103\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Software Architecture</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3119\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3119\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Prototyping</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3124\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15vkyns\" data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3153\">Elective: Data Analytics</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3305\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3167\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3167\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3167\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3305\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3205\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3205\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Analytics Using Python</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3232\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3232\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SQL for Data Analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3250\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3250\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Web Analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3278\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3278\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Digital Media Analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3305\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3305\" data-col-size=\"sm\">IoT and Data Analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3310\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mlgjbr\" data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3369\">Elective: Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3581\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3383\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3383\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3383\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3581\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3420\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3420\" data-col-size=\"md\">Machine Learning in Python</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3466\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3466\" data-col-size=\"md\">Statistics and Python in Machine Learning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3511\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3511\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Application of Machine Learning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3537\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3537\" data-col-size=\"md\">Deep Learning and NLP</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3538\" data-end=\"3581\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3538\" data-end=\"3581\" data-col-size=\"md\">Web, Social Analytics and Visualization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3583\" data-end=\"3586\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"npdtip\" data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3638\">Semester 4: Advanced Platforms and Major Project</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3749\">The final semester focuses on advanced enterprise tools and real-world implementation through major projects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3751\" data-end=\"3754\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n0ovgf\" data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3784\">Elective: Cloud Computing</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3903\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3798\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3798\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3798\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3805\" data-end=\"3903\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3805\" data-end=\"3846\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3805\" data-end=\"3846\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Google Cloud Services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"3885\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"3885\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to IBM Cloud Services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3886\" data-end=\"3903\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3886\" data-end=\"3903\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1oxx92n\" data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3929\">Final Semester Value</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"4089\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15mdfpt\" data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"3964\">Multi-cloud platform exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gtwxac\" data-start=\"3965\" data-end=\"4009\">Enterprise cloud ecosystem understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ug09iv\" data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4049\">Practical implementation experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1trkm48\" data-start=\"4050\" data-end=\"4089\">Real-world project execution skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4094\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5ij3gw\" data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4131\">Elective: Full Stack Development</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4268\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4145\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4145\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4145\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4268\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4208\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4208\" data-col-size=\"md\">Web Services - REST API, ReactJS, NodeJS Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4250\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4250\" data-col-size=\"md\">DevOps - II (Ansible, Puppet, Nagios)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4251\" data-end=\"4268\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4251\" data-end=\"4268\" data-col-size=\"md\">Major Project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4270\" data-end=\"4273\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15vkyns\" data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4302\">Elective: Data Analytics</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4406\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4316\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4316\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4316\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4323\" data-end=\"4406\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4323\" data-end=\"4349\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4323\" data-end=\"4349\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Analytics Using R</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4350\" data-end=\"4388\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4350\" data-end=\"4388\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Analytics for Decision Making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4389\" data-end=\"4406\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4389\" data-end=\"4406\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4411\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mlgjbr\" data-start=\"4413\" data-end=\"4470\">Elective: Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4563\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4484\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4484\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4484\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4491\" data-end=\"4563\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4491\" data-end=\"4510\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4491\" data-end=\"4510\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Big Data Hadoop</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4511\" data-end=\"4545\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4511\" data-end=\"4545\" data-col-size=\"sm\">IoT Cloud and Watson Analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4563\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4563\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 155000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0,