er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(234, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 217, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-01 04:09:42', '2026-06-16 06:06:55', '<p data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"730\">Taking admission into an MSc Mathematics program is now easier through a streamlined online process. Students can complete registration, fill the application form, upload documents, pay fees, and receive final confirmation without unnecessary complexity. Understanding each step in advance helps avoid delays, rejection risks, and last-minute mistakes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"1005\">MSc Mathematics is a valuable postgraduate degree for students targeting careers in teaching, research, analytics, quantitative roles, data science foundations, actuarial pathways, and competitive exams. A smooth admission process helps students start this journey on time.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1179\">This detailed guide explains the MSc Mathematics admission process step by step, required documents, expert tips, common mistakes, and smart strategies for faster approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1co83ny\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1230\">MSc Mathematics Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1298\">The online admission process generally includes four major stages:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1430\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nl6le3\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1317\">Registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ylnmm2\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1346\">Online Application Form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"101zuxd\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1387\">Document Verification by University</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19bjzt6\" data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1430\">Student Registration and LMS Activation</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1489\">Completing each step correctly ensures smooth enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1494\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"52akem\" data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1518\">Step 1: Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1582\">The first step is creating an account on the admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1617\">Students usually need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1718\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u7na1o\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1632\">Full Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dep5uz\" data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1650\">Mobile Number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36fvl5\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1663\">Email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ligt3\" data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1680\">State / City</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"68nvg1\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1718\">Preferred Program (MSc Mathematics)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1801\">After sign-up, students pay the initial registration fee to continue the process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1my1m11\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1817\">Expert Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1947\">Use an active email address and mobile number because admission updates, receipts, and login credentials are usually sent there.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10clvjd\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1976\">Common Mistake to Avoid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2044\">Using incorrect contact details may delay important communication.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2049\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vjt9r3\" data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2084\">Step 2: Online Application Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2163\">After registration, students log in and complete the online application form.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2195\">Applicants may need to submit:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2334\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2217\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19byrdb\" data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2245\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2268\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19381gy\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2292\">Address information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yxjbvg\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2313\">Identity details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dx5o5j\" data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2334\">Program preference</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2422\">After completing the form, students pay the program fee and upload relevant documents.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2427\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yirrk\" data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2488\">Documents Commonly Required for MSc Mathematics Admission</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2882\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2512\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2512\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2501\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2512\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2882\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2578\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2544\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Class 10 Marksheet</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2578\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Basic identity/academic record</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2620\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2600\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Class 12 Marksheet</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2620\">Academic history</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2673\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2645\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Marksheets</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2673\">Eligibility verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2724\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2695\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Degree Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2724\">Final qualification proof</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2770\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2753\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics Subject Proof</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2770\">If applicable</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2807\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ID Proof</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2807\">Identity verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2849\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2830\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport Size Photo</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2849\">Student profile</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2882\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2862\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Signature</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2882\">Official records</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2887\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ln8rck\" data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2934\">Step 3: Document Verification by University</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"3026\">Once the form is submitted, the university reviews the application and uploaded documents.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"131lww1\" data-start=\"3028\" data-end=\"3062\">Verification Usually Includes:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3261\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v9ifvn\" data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3085\">Eligibility check</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yukwwr\" data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3121\">Graduation qualification review</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"stjbk4\" data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3183\">Mathematics subject requirement review (where applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qa0omz\" data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3212\">Fee payment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7660be\" data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3236\">Name / DOB matching</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwe261\" data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3261\">Document clarity check</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3356\">If corrections are needed, students may receive communication through email or portal alerts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mcxn79\" data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3386\">Hidden Reasons for Delay</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3423\">Many admissions get delayed due to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3558\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2v78q6\" data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3446\">Blurred documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s54my4\" data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3464\">Missing pages</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10u32sj\" data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3490\">Incorrect marks entry</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h9disy\" data-start=\"3491\" data-end=\"3528\">Name mismatch across certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g5vvd6\" data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3558\">Incomplete application form</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3563\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fuepgv\" data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3614\">Step 4: Student Registration and LMS Activation</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3616\" data-end=\"3729\">After successful verification, final admission is confirmed. Students then receive LMS credentials through email.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k7bjc6\" data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3760\">Students Usually Receive:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3762\" data-end=\"3855\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"el5erz\" data-start=\"3762\" data-end=\"3783\">Enrollment Number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f73c3w\" data-start=\"3784\" data-end=\"3798\">Student ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17cwsxh\" data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3826\">LMS Username &amp; Password</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w9uwii\" data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3855\">Course access instructions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uttsmo\" data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3873\">LMS Benefits</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3928\">The Learning Management System helps students access:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3930\" data-end=\"4038\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8imkcm\" data-start=\"3930\" data-end=\"3946\">Live classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3fguj\" data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3968\">Recorded lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12a9mov\" data-start=\"3969\" data-end=\"3988\">Study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f7qwlk\" data-start=\"3989\" data-end=\"4004\">Assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cq9jk1\" data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4016\">Notices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iyhf8h\" data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4038\">Examination updates</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"814\">MSc Mathematics is one of the most respected postgraduate programs for students who want advanced knowledge in pure mathematics, applied mathematics, statistics, data science foundations, research, teaching, analytics, and competitive exam preparation. Before applying, students should clearly understand the latest MSc Mathematics eligibility criteria, accepted qualifications, and admission requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"1032\">A common misconception is that only BSc Mathematics students can apply. In reality, eligibility is often broader and may include candidates from multiple academic backgrounds if they meet the mathematics requirement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1204\">This detailed guide explains complete MSc Mathematics eligibility, accepted qualifications, who should apply, career value, common mistakes, and smart admission strategy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1209\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15r9tf6\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1258\">MSc Mathematics Eligibility Criteria Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1369\">Candidates are generally eligible for MSc Mathematics admission if they meet one of the following conditions:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1385\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1407\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Status</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1486\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline with Mathematics as a subject</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1498\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1515\" data-col-size=\"md\">B.Tech / B.E.</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1527\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1562\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1550\" data-col-size=\"md\">B.Sc. (Engineering)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1562\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1601\" data-col-size=\"md\">Equivalent recognized qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1613\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1618\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"r70ii\" data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1673\">Minimum Qualification for MSc Mathematics Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1789\">Students may apply if they have completed a <strong data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1788\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline with Mathematics as a subject</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1916\">This means students from multiple graduation backgrounds may become eligible if they studied Mathematics during their degree.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1krudj\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1931\">Examples:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"2083\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k488q4\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1957\">BSc with Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cnj7x9\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1981\">BA with Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1svyugs\" data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2026\">BCom with Mathematics (where applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hvzv0k\" data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2083\">Other bachelor&rsquo;s degrees with Mathematics as a subject</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2088\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kbpzny\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2142\">Engineering Graduates Eligible for MSc Mathematics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2210\">Candidates with the following qualifications may also be eligible:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2285\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y69ov2\" data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2222\">B.Tech</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uaihxr\" data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2231\">B.E.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klgkyq\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2255\">B.Sc. (Engineering)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ecvab\" data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2285\">Equivalent technical degree</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18pwh1z\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2338\">Why Engineering Students Choose MSc Mathematics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2488\">Engineering students often choose MSc Mathematics to strengthen analytical depth, research pathways, computational careers, or academic progression.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2493\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17ssmtu\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2531\">Why Mathematics Background Matters</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2631\">MSc Mathematics is an advanced postgraduate program. Students study higher-level concepts such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2799\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4pmu3s\" data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2653\">Advanced algebra</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itvls\" data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2671\">Real analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hn0492\" data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2698\">Differential equations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"192xu4i\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2720\">Numerical methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ijfad\" data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2736\">Probability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yq9p59\" data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2751\">Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fa141l\" data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2775\">Applied mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g516zx\" data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2799\">Mathematical modeling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2868\">A prior mathematics foundation helps students succeed academically.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2873\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ivock4\" data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2911\">Who Should Choose MSc Mathematics?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2962\">This program is ideal for students interested in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"3163\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1boliqt\" data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"2986\">Higher mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2tlvts\" data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3007\">Research careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19vl9eq\" data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3028\">Teaching careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wptogm\" data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3059\">Data analytics foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12x74es\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3084\">Quantitative careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lqlz3h\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3106\">Competitive exams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oyah7x\" data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3129\">Actuarial pathways</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sdph5r\" data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3163\">Academic progression toward PhD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3168\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ydqskr\" data-start=\"3170\" data-end=\"3199\">Can Non-BSc Students Apply?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3355\">Yes, if they meet the mathematics requirement or hold eligible engineering qualifications. This makes the program more flexible than many students assume.</p>', '<p data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"775\">Choosing the right MSc Mathematics program requires more than checking subjects alone. Students should clearly understand the complete fee structure, payment flexibility, scholarship offers, and overall affordability before taking admission. A transparent fee breakdown helps students and families plan finances, compare universities, and evaluate long-term return on investment (ROI).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"958\">This detailed guide explains the latest MSc Mathematics semester fee, discounted payable amount, EMI options, student grant benefits, hidden charges, and smart admission strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"963\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8k1qy2\" data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"995\">MSc Mathematics Fee Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1314\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1023\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1023\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1013\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1023\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1314\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1059\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1048\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1059\">₹25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1077\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Applicable Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1101\">₹20,400 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student Grant</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">20%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1176\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1153\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Included</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1176\">₹2,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1196\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1223\">₹1,000 (Non-refundable)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1266\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1240\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Modes</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1266\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment / EMI</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1314\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1288\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Preference</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1314\">No-Cost EMI / Standard</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1319\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lm5y7d\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1371\">Current Discounted MSc Mathematics Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1461\">Students can currently avail a <strong data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1425\">20% Student Grant</strong>, reducing the regular semester fee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1606\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1477\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1487\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1606\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1534\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1523\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Original Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1534\">₹25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1572\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1561\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discounted Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1572\">₹20,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1606\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1596\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Savings Per Semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1606\">₹4,600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1684\"><strong data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1627\">Offer Validity:</strong> Till <strong data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1649\">9th May 2026</strong> (subject to terms and conditions).</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1da9b7l\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1720\">Amount Payable Per Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vzwcp3\" data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1743\">₹20,400 / Semester</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1810\">This is the current applicable semester fee after grant benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1815\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"18kzs72\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1848\">Included and Excluded Charges</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"c40zw2\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1877\">Included in Semester Fee</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1964\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dhanzm\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1921\">Examination fee of ₹2,000 per semester</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10nr766\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1964\">Academic tuition charges (as applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ocwtce\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1985\">Excluded Charges</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2081\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12c5wuz\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2042\">Initial registration fee of ₹1,000 (non-refundable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3te4rn\" data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2081\">Optional charges if applicable later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2086\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p7u5zq\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2121\">Eligible Countries for This Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2171\">The above fee is applicable for applicants from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2246\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tgrdfn\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2182\">India</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qjtdvt\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2196\">Sri Lanka</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yxs3bg\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2207\">Bhutan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ef0w72\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2217\">Nepal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xi9ghh\" data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2232\">Bangladesh</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1woqgfi\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2246\">Afghanistan</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2251\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"x5a8d1\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2280\">Payment Options Available</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2343\">Students can choose payment options according to convenience.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2544\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2378\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2378\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2362\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2378\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suitable For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2544\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2427\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2403\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2427\">Lower monthly burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2463\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2439\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2463\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Regular payment mode</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2508\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2483\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2508\">Faster fee completion</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2544\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2515\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2544\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexible installment plan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"755\">The MSc Mathematics syllabus is designed for students who want advanced knowledge in pure mathematics, applied mathematics, research methods, analytical reasoning, and problem-solving. It is one of the strongest postgraduate programs for careers in academics, data analytics, research, quantitative fields, actuarial science, and competitive exams.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"1023\">A well-structured MSc Mathematics curriculum develops conceptual depth, logical rigor, and mathematical maturity through subjects such as Real Analysis, Abstract Algebra, Differential Equations, Complex Analysis, Topology, Functional Analysis, and Dissertation work.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1226\">This detailed semester-wise MSc Mathematics syllabus helps students understand what they will study, what skills they will build, and how each semester supports future careers or PhD-level progression.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1231\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10mhvc4\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1276\">MSc Mathematics Course Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1470\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1299\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1299\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1285\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1299\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1470\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1393\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1323\" data-col-size=\"sm\">First Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1393\">Core advanced mathematics, algebra, analysis, research foundations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1470\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1407\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1470\">Applied mathematics, topology, dissertation, specialization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rrlgx2\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1517\">MSc Mathematics Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"128yyix\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1563\">Semester 1: Core Mathematical Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1696\">The first semester builds rigorous postgraduate foundations in analysis, algebra, differential equations, and research orientation.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1950\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1713\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1729\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1950\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1750\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH515</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1769\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Real Analysis-I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1780\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH516</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1811\">Advanced Abstract Algebra-I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1858\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1822\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH517</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1858\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Theory of Differential Equations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1897\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1869\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ECAP530</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1897\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fundamentals of Research</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1950\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1908\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ECAP145</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1950\">Fundamentals of Information Technology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1972\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2109\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h1mat7\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"1999\">Proof-writing ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyz0gf\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2021\">Logical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hmjckh\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2042\">Analytical rigor</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tn0qzz\" data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2075\">Differential modeling basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jngocw\" data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2109\">Academic research understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2114\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1iwg0aq\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2166\">Semester 2: Advanced Analysis &amp; Research Design</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2288\">Students move deeper into abstract mathematics with higher analysis, complex variables, and formal research methodology.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2568\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2321\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2321\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2305\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2321\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2568\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2362\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2342\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH528</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2362\">Real Analysis-II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2405\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2373\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH529</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2405\">Advanced Abstract Algebra-II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2447\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2416\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EGEN531</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2447\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research Methods and Design</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2480\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2458\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH542</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2480\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complex Analysis-I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2538\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2491\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH655</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2538\">Calculus of Variation and Integral Equation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2568\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2546\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2568\" data-col-size=\"md\">Generic Elective I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7zaalc\" data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2599\">Why This Semester Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2717\">This semester strengthens the conceptual base required for teaching, research, and competitive mathematics pathways.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2722\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11lkpc5\" data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2784\">Semester 3: Topology &amp; Higher-Level Mathematical Thinking</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2865\">The third semester introduces specialized and abstract branches of mathematics.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"3123\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2898\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2898\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2882\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2898\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"3123\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2953\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2919\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH543</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2953\">Partial Differential Equations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2987\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2964\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH530</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"2987\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Complex Analysis-II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3010\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"2998\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH637</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3010\">Topology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3042\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3019\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Generic Elective II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3076\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3052\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3076\">Generic Elective III</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3123\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3087\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH699</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3123\">Term Paper / Alternate GE Course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3145\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3147\" data-end=\"3281\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lmha1x\" data-start=\"3147\" data-end=\"3174\">Multi-variable modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p7tw0r\" data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3203\">Advanced problem solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3qqarv\" data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3229\">Topological reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wtbj9x\" data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3250\">Academic writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b2b0sl\" data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3281\">Research presentation skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3286\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"d05rd9\" data-start=\"3288\" data-end=\"3337\">Semester 4: Functional Analysis &amp; Dissertation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3444\">The final semester focuses on advanced applied theory, independent research, and academic specialization.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3627\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3477\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3477\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3461\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3477\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3627\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3511\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3498\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH532</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3511\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mechanics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3545\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3522\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH642</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3545\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Functional Analysis</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3595\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3556\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMTH669</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3595\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dissertation / Alternate GE Courses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3627\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3604\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-IV</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3604\" data-end=\"3627\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Generic Elective IV</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6lg9m8\" data-start=\"3629\" data-end=\"3658\">Final Semester Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3754\">This semester helps students transition toward research, teaching, analytics, or PhD pathways.</p>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"749\">Placement support is an important factor for students choosing an MSc Mathematics program. While mathematics is highly respected academically, many students want clarity on how the degree converts into careers, job opportunities, and long-term growth. Along with subject expertise, students need career guidance, industry awareness, and employability skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"1021\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Lovely Professional University</span></span> Online offers placement support services designed to enhance students&rsquo; capabilities according to career requirements, create awareness about opportunities, and motivate learners to develop additional skills beyond academic subjects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1175\">Through placement drives and career initiatives, students can interact with recruiters, demonstrate their strengths, and compete for suitable job roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1332\">This guide explains MSc Mathematics placement support, LPU Online career services, ROI value, career opportunities, and how students can maximize outcomes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ioldeu\" data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1399\">Why Placement Support Matters for MSc Mathematics Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1538\">Many students assume mathematics careers are limited to teaching only. In reality, MSc Mathematics graduates may pursue opportunities in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1708\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kvym5q\" data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1558\">Data analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ekq80d\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1582\">Banking and finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hltuce\" data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1603\">Research support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kksp18\" data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1627\">Operations analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40bnec\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1644\">EdTech roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lqlz3h\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1666\">Competitive exams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mjv258\" data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1687\">Academic careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p9m41u\" data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1708\">Quantitative roles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1790\">However, recruiters often evaluate more than academic marks. They also look for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1932\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o10de\" data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1814\">Analytical ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hkzl1e\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1838\">Excel / data skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mfo8p6\" data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1863\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pcanhh\" data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1883\">Problem solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qe7zuk\" data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1908\">Presentation ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12x9mrv\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1932\">Professional attitude</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1974\">Placement support helps bridge this gap.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"1979\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1z0htwh\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2036\">LPU Online MSc Mathematics Placement Support Services</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18k74lo\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2060\">1. Placement Drives</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2147\">Placement drives help students connect directly with hiring companies and recruiters.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2162\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2299\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rrxafr\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2190\">Access to job openings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gad39a\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2218\">Interview opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aakc4x\" data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2249\">Real recruiter interaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lx86g5\" data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2273\">Networking exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ua0u8\" data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2299\">Better hiring awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2304\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zmp5s0\" data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2339\">2. Career Guidance &amp; Awareness</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2459\">Many students know mathematics but are unclear about modern job pathways. Career support can help learners understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2607\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ik2wb5\" data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2496\">Best jobs after MSc Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cgnagt\" data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2522\">Salary growth options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"148tukt\" data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2552\">Analytics career pathways</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h4hjxy\" data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2582\">Teaching and NET pathways</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dcmo6m\" data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2607\">Research opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2612\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"eyxhxz\" data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2644\">3. Add-On Skill Development</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2774\">Modern employers prefer domain knowledge plus practical tools. Students are encouraged to build additional capabilities such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2905\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuqf5\" data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2794\">Advanced Excel</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1srenkl\" data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2812\">Python basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kzohly\" data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2833\">Statistics tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mfo8p6\" data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2858\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"100ww9o\" data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2882\">Presentation skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vfe7od\" data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2905\">Aptitude preparation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2910\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yd933a\" data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2944\">4. Resume &amp; Interview Support</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"3016\">Students often need help presenting mathematics skills professionally.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5f2soq\" data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3042\">Support May Include:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3161\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ewtugo\" data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3063\">Resume creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pr6i54\" data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3089\">Interview preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hg8gpk\" data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3109\">Mock interviews</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kjlyrk\" data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3132\">HR round readiness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qq49b1\" data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3161\">Personal branding guidance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3166\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xl8nvv\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3206\">Best Job Roles After MSc Mathematics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3296\">Depending on skills, certifications, and student performance, opportunities may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3691\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"37xc2k\" data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3359\"><strong data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3316\">Data Analyst</strong> &ndash; Works with business and numerical data</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2t17q\" data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3426\"><strong data-start=\"3362\" data-end=\"3384\">Research Associate</strong> &ndash; Supports academic or private research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ml23lq\" data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3494\"><strong data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3451\">Operations Analyst</strong> &ndash; Solves process and efficiency problems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9pjx3p\" data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3559\"><strong data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3514\">Banking Roles</strong> &ndash; Quantitative and reasoning-based careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vm7hp6\" data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3631\"><strong data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3582\">Teaching Pathway</strong> &ndash; Lecturer route after required qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fsoecm\" data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3691\"><strong data-start=\"3634\" data-end=\"3660\">Actuarial Career Track</strong> &ndash; Insurance and risk analytics</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 100000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(235, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 52, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-01 04:30:54', '2026-06-16 06:10:03', '<p data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"687\">Taking admission into a BA program is now simple and convenient through a fully online process. Students can complete registration, fill the application form, upload documents, pay fees, and receive final admission confirmation without visiting campus. Understanding each step in advance helps avoid delays, mistakes, and last-minute stress.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"935\">BA (Bachelor of Arts) is one of the most flexible undergraduate degrees for students aiming for careers in government sectors, media, teaching, administration, digital marketing, business support roles, and higher studies such as MA, MBA, or law.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1096\">This detailed guide explains the BA admission process step by step, required documents, expert tips, common mistakes, and smart strategies for faster approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1o6wev8\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1134\">BA Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1202\">The online admission process generally includes four major stages:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1334\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nl6le3\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1221\">Registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ylnmm2\" data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1250\">Online Application Form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"101zuxd\" data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1291\">Document Verification by University</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19bjzt6\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1334\">Student Registration and LMS Activation</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1393\">Completing each step carefully ensures smooth enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1398\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"52akem\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1422\">Step 1: Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1486\">The first step is creating an account on the admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1521\">Students usually need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1609\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u7na1o\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1536\">Full Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dep5uz\" data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1554\">Mobile Number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36fvl5\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1567\">Email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ligt3\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1584\">State / City</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3wj7a3\" data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1609\">Preferred Program (BA)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1680\">After sign-up, students pay the initial registration fee to continue.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1my1m11\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1696\">Expert Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1818\">Use an active email address and phone number because fee receipts, updates, and LMS credentials are commonly sent there.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10clvjd\" data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1847\">Common Mistake to Avoid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1905\">Wrong contact details can delay admission communication.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1910\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vjt9r3\" data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1945\">Step 2: Online Application Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"2024\">After registration, students log in and complete the online application form.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2056\">Applicants may need to submit:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2172\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2078\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19byrdb\" data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2106\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2126\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkv6b6\" data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2151\">Identity information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dx5o5j\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2172\">Program preference</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2260\">After completing the form, students pay the program fee and upload relevant documents.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2265\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"o3wj4q\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2313\">Documents Commonly Required for BA Admission</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2621\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2337\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2337\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2326\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2337\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2621\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2401\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2369\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Class 10 Marksheet</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2401\">Identity and academic record</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2451\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2423\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Class 12 Marksheet</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2451\">Eligibility verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2509\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2486\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Appearing Proof (if applicable)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2509\">For pending results</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2546\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2521\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ID Proof</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2546\">Identity verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2588\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport Size Photo</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2588\">Student profile</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2621\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2601\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Signature</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2621\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Official records</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ln8rck\" data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2673\">Step 3: Document Verification by University</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2760\">After form submission, the university reviews the application and uploaded documents.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"131lww1\" data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2796\">Verification Usually Includes:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2931\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v9ifvn\" data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2819\">Eligibility check</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o3vpk6\" data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2853\">Academic qualification review</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qa0omz\" data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2882\">Fee payment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7660be\" data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2906\">Name / DOB matching</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11cu4zw\" data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2931\">Document quality check</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"3030\">If corrections are required, students may receive communication by email or portal notifications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mcxn79\" data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3060\">Hidden Reasons for Delay</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3097\">Many admissions get delayed due to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3229\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ax6vdu\" data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3118\">Blurred uploads</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yy3wzd\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3140\">Wrong marks entry</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1or8hu8\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3162\">Missing documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h9disy\" data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3200\">Name mismatch across certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tzr8jc\" data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3229\">Incomplete form submission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3234\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fuepgv\" data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3285\">Step 4: Student Registration and LMS Activation</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3400\">After successful verification, final admission is confirmed. Students then receive LMS credentials through email.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k7bjc6\" data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3431\">Students Usually Receive:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3526\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"el5erz\" data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3454\">Enrollment Number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f73c3w\" data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3469\">Student ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17cwsxh\" data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3497\">LMS Username &amp; Password</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w9uwii\" data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3526\">Course access instructions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uttsmo\" data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3544\">LMS Benefits</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3599\">The Learning Management System helps students access:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3702\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8imkcm\" data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3617\">Live classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3fguj\" data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3639\">Recorded lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12a9mov\" data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3659\">Study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f7qwlk\" data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3675\">Assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cq9jk1\" data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3687\">Notices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ick1y3\" data-start=\"3688\" data-end=\"3702\">Exam updates</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"775\">BA (Bachelor of Arts) is one of the most flexible and widely chosen undergraduate degree programs for students who want careers in government sectors, media, teaching, administration, content creation, social sciences, business support, and higher studies. Before applying, students should clearly understand the latest BA eligibility criteria, accepted qualifications, and admission requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"1015\">One of the biggest advantages of BA is that students from <strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"858\">any academic stream</strong> can usually apply. This means Science, Commerce, Arts, Humanities, and vocational students can pursue this degree based on their interests and career goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1146\">This detailed guide explains complete BA eligibility, who can apply, career value, common mistakes, and smart admission strategy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1151\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"3rmr08\" data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1187\">BA Eligibility Criteria Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1277\">Candidates are generally eligible for BA admission if they meet the following condition:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1315\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1315\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1293\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1315\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Status</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1390\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1378\" data-col-size=\"md\">Passed 10+2 in any stream from a recognized board</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1390\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1454\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1435\" data-col-size=\"md\">Appearing for Class 12 (where applicable)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1454\" data-col-size=\"sm\">May be Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1494\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1482\" data-col-size=\"md\">Equivalent qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1494\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1519\" data-col-size=\"md\">NIOS board candidates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1548\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible (where accepted)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1553\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"t2vwwg\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1595\">Minimum Qualification for BA Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1706\">Students should have completed <strong data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1650\">10+2 in any stream</strong> or an equivalent qualification from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1765\">This means students from the following streams can apply:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y83j8c\" data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1778\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4h0lx\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1791\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmjua6\" data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1813\">Arts / Humanities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15nt8j1\" data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1836\">Vocational streams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jg8qus\" data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1887\">Other equivalent senior secondary qualifications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mkcn1i\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1904\">Key Benefit</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"2015\">Students do not need a specific stream to pursue BA, making it one of the most accessible graduation options.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1jop22\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2066\">Can Appearing for Class 12 Students Apply?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2212\">Many universities allow students who are <strong data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2135\">appearing for Class 12</strong> to apply, subject to final result submission within the prescribed timeline.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2290\">Students should always verify the latest admission rules during application.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2295\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1nhg85t\" data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2332\">Are NIOS Board Students Eligible?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2461\">Yes, <strong data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2387\">NIOS board candidates are generally eligible</strong> when the qualification is recognized and accepted under university norms.</p>', '<p data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"721\">Choosing the right BA program is not only about subjects and degree value. Students should also clearly understand the complete fee structure, payment flexibility, scholarship offers, and affordability before taking admission. A transparent fee breakdown helps students and families plan finances, compare universities, and evaluate long-term return on investment (ROI).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"891\">This detailed guide explains the latest BA semester fee, discounted payable amount, EMI options, student grant benefits, hidden charges, and smart admission strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"896\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1pp6i5c\" data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"915\">BA Fee Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1234\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"943\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"943\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"933\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"943\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1234\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<td data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"968\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"979\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹20,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<td data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"997\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Applicable Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1021\">₹16,400 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1045\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1038\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student Grant</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1045\">20%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1073\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Included</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1096\">₹2,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1116\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1143\">₹1,000 (Non-refundable)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1160\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Modes</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1186\">One-Time Payment / EMI</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1234\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1208\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Preference</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1234\">No-Cost EMI / Standard</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1239\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1v2zv7n\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1278\">Current Discounted BA Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1368\">Students can currently avail a <strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1332\">20% Student Grant</strong>, reducing the regular semester fee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1513\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1384\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1394\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1513\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1430\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Original Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1441\">₹20,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1479\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1468\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discounted Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1479\">₹16,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1513\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1503\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Savings Per Semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1513\">₹3,600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1591\"><strong data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1534\">Offer Validity:</strong> Till <strong data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1556\">9th May 2026</strong> (subject to terms and conditions).</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1da9b7l\" data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1627\">Amount Payable Per Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1urq1s2\" data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1650\">₹16,400 / Semester</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1717\">This is the current applicable semester fee after grant benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1722\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"18kzs72\" data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1755\">Included and Excluded Charges</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"c40zw2\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1784\">Included in Semester Fee</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1871\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dhanzm\" data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1828\">Examination fee of ₹2,000 per semester</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10nr766\" data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1871\">Academic tuition charges (as applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ocwtce\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1892\">Excluded Charges</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12c5wuz\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1949\">Initial registration fee of ₹1,000 (non-refundable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3te4rn\" data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1988\">Optional charges if applicable later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"1993\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p7u5zq\" data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2028\">Eligible Countries for This Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2078\">The above fee is applicable for applicants from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2153\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tgrdfn\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2089\">India</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qjtdvt\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2103\">Sri Lanka</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yxs3bg\" data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2114\">Bhutan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ef0w72\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2124\">Nepal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xi9ghh\" data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2139\">Bangladesh</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1woqgfi\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2153\">Afghanistan</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2158\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"x5a8d1\" data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2187\">Payment Options Available</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2250\">Students can choose payment options according to convenience.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2451\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2285\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2285\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2269\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2285\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suitable For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2451\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2334\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2310\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2334\">Lower monthly burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2370\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2346\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2370\">Regular payment mode</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2415\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2390\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2415\">Faster fee completion</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2451\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2422\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2451\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexible installment plan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"787\">The BA (Bachelor of Arts) syllabus is designed to develop strong knowledge in humanities, social sciences, communication, analytical thinking, and career-oriented skills. Unlike traditional fixed-degree models, many modern BA programs offer flexible subject baskets, core specializations, electives, projects, and skill enhancement courses that allow students to build a personalized academic pathway.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"1017\">A well-structured BA curriculum prepares students for careers in government sectors, media, teaching, content, administration, business support, social sector roles, and higher studies such as MA, MBA, law, or competitive exams.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1211\">This detailed semester-wise BA syllabus explains the course structure, subject combinations, electives, projects, and how students can use the program strategically for better career outcomes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15ve3n2\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1248\">BA Course Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1271\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1271\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1257\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1271\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1360\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1295\" data-col-size=\"sm\">First Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1360\">Core subject foundation, communication, environmental studies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1429\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1375\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Second Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1429\">Electives, specialization depth, skill development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1443\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1498\">Advanced specialization, research, capstone project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1503\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7b8qh9\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1537\">Understanding Core I &amp; Core II</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1627\">Students generally choose <strong data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1587\">two academic areas</strong> as Core I and Core II in the beginning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x86e0k\" data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1648\">Important Rule:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1780\">Once selected, these core areas continue through later semesters and usually cannot be selected again in Generic Elective baskets.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hsq9x2\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1817\">Examples of Possible Core Areas</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1889\">Depending on university options, students may choose subjects such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"2049\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1odor5h\" data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1912\">Political Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uv5ai\" data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1924\">History</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"48fvv0\" data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1938\">Sociology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hg1ei\" data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1950\">English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19cyfx0\" data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1964\">Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mvey2z\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1979\">Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ujt53\" data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2005\">Public Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8z3ske\" data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2020\">Journalism</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sclwdt\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2049\">Hindi / Regional Languages</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2054\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15r30rw\" data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2083\">BA Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ok6h67\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2116\">Semester 1: Foundation Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2223\">The first semester focuses on two chosen core areas along with communication and environmental awareness.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2413\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2256\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2256\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2240\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2256\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2413\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2299\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2276\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2299\">Chosen Subject Area</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2333\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2310\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2333\">Chosen Subject Area</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2370\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2344\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ECHE110</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2370\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Environmental Sciences</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2413\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2381\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG139</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2413\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Communication Skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2435\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2531\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wtbj9x\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2457\">Academic writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2s3jpd\" data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2482\">Communication basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vmg9i7\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2505\">Subject foundation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v1hjho\" data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2531\">Awareness and reasoning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2536\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1utxdnv\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2587\">Semester 2: Core Continuation + Elective Start</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2662\">Students continue both core subjects and begin generic elective learning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2860\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2695\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2695\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2679\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2695\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2860\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2741\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2715\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2741\">Continued Core Subject</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2778\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2752\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2778\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Continued Core Subject</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2830\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2789\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG140</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2830\">Advanced English Communication Skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2860\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2838\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2860\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Generic Elective I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7zaalc\" data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2891\">Why This Semester Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2948\">Electives help students expand beyond their core areas.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2953\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1s22vj6\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2995\">Semester 3: Career Orientation Begins</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3064\">This semester introduces specialization and project-based exposure.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3299\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3097\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3097\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3081\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3097\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3299\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3143\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3117\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3143\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Continued Core Subject</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3180\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3154\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3180\">Continued Core Subject</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3212\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3189\" data-end=\"3212\">Generic Elective II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3255\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3221\" data-col-size=\"sm\">DSE-I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3255\">Discipline Specific Elective I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3299\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3266\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ESSC102</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3299\">Community Development Project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3317\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3403\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bk6vu6\" data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3342\">Real-world exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tpsg8f\" data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3376\">Subject specialization begins</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bmwk86\" data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3403\">Broader career relevance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3408\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17ty9jf\" data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3448\">Semester 4: Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3522\">Students deepen specialization and build practical employability skills.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3797\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3555\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3555\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3539\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3555\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3797\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3601\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3575\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3601\">Continued Core Subject</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3638\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3612\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3638\">Continued Core Subject</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3639\" data-end=\"3672\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3639\" data-end=\"3648\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3672\">Generic Elective III</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3717\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">DSE-II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3717\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discipline Specific Elective II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3756\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3726\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SEC-I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3756\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Skill Enhancement Course I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3797\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3766\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SEC-II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3797\">Skill Enhancement Course II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3819\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3894\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u5apig\" data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3838\">Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2scvk\" data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3858\">Technical tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pcanhh\" data-start=\"3859\" data-end=\"3878\">Problem solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4bd7hb\" data-start=\"3879\" data-end=\"3894\">Job readiness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"3899\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"whzd58\" data-start=\"3901\" data-end=\"3945\">Semester 5: Advanced Academic Development</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"4020\">Students continue advanced specialization with research-oriented options.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4305\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4053\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4053\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4037\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4037\" data-end=\"4053\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4305\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4099\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4073\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4099\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Continued Core Subject</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4136\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4110\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4110\" data-end=\"4136\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Continued Core Subject</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4168\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4145\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-IV</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4168\">Generic Elective IV</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4169\" data-end=\"4215\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4169\" data-end=\"4179\" data-col-size=\"sm\">DSE-III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4215\">Discipline Specific Elective III</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4258\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4226\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SEC-III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4226\" data-end=\"4258\">Skill Enhancement Course III</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4259\" data-end=\"4305\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4259\" data-end=\"4269\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ESSC303</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4269\" data-end=\"4305\">Term Paper / Alternate GE Course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1r3fpqf\" data-start=\"4307\" data-end=\"4338\">Why Semester 5 is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4409\">The term paper improves research, writing, and analytical capability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4411\" data-end=\"4414\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5k4ij4\" data-start=\"4416\" data-end=\"4455\">Semester 6: Final Career Preparation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4457\" data-end=\"4529\">The final semester focuses on completion projects and advanced learning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4531\" data-end=\"4784\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4531\" data-end=\"4562\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4531\" data-end=\"4562\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4531\" data-end=\"4546\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4562\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4573\" data-end=\"4784\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4573\" data-end=\"4608\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4573\" data-end=\"4582\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4582\" data-end=\"4608\">Continued Core Subject</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4609\" data-end=\"4645\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4609\" data-end=\"4619\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4619\" data-end=\"4645\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Continued Core Subject</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4690\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4655\" data-col-size=\"sm\">DSE-IV</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4655\" data-end=\"4690\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discipline Specific Elective IV</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4691\" data-end=\"4731\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4691\" data-end=\"4700\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SEC-IV</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4731\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Skill Enhancement Course IV</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4732\" data-end=\"4784\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4732\" data-end=\"4741\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SSC304</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4741\" data-end=\"4784\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Capstone Project / Alternate GE Courses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n6gzlb\" data-start=\"4786\" data-end=\"4814\">Final Semester Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4816\" data-end=\"4885\">Capstone projects strengthen resume value and postgraduate readiness.</p>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"679\">Placement support is one of the key factors students consider before choosing a BA program. While BA is often seen as a traditional degree, modern employers value graduates who combine academic knowledge with communication skills, analytical thinking, digital awareness, and professional readiness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"968\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Lovely Professional University</span></span> Online offers placement support services designed to enhance students&rsquo; capabilities according to career requirements, create awareness about employment opportunities, and motivate learners to develop additional skills beyond their academic subjects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1144\">Through placement drives and career initiatives, students can interact with recruiters, showcase their abilities, and compete for promising job roles across multiple sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1288\">This guide explains BA placement support, LPU Online career services, ROI value, career opportunities, and how students can maximize outcomes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1293\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9yc83w\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1342\">Why Placement Support Matters for BA Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1399\">BA graduates can build careers in many sectors such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1603\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c10ew3\" data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1428\">Corporate support roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9095e6\" data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1448\">Human resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j0yuty\" data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1470\">Digital marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qldpvy\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1492\">Content and media</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134w3ye\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1511\">Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18y1fsp\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1534\">Customer relations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lid21k\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1568\">Government sector preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tdmhm0\" data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1603\">Social development organizations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1681\">However, recruiters usually evaluate more than a degree. They also look for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1810\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mfo8p6\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1707\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yojgng\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1722\">Confidence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tfxkh3\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1750\">Problem solving ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wksyvj\" data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1776\">Professional behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ls7gwi\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1795\">Writing skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1impive\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1810\">Adaptability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1890\">Placement support helps students convert academic learning into employability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1895\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gqu3zf\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1939\">LPU Online BA Placement Support Services</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18k74lo\" data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1963\">1. Placement Drives</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2043\">Placement drives help students connect directly with companies and recruiters.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2058\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2198\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rrxafr\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2086\">Access to job openings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sob750\" data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2119\">Real interview opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ji9pn\" data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2145\">Recruiter interaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t6ljvc\" data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2172\">Better hiring exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16j9pbx\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2198\">Professional networking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2203\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zmp5s0\" data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2238\">2. Career Guidance &amp; Awareness</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2344\">Many BA students are unaware of the variety of careers available. Guidance can help learners understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2483\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1phwp5n\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2368\">Best jobs after BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qayq1o\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2395\">Salary growth pathways</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"slmgxa\" data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2420\">Higher study options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1weflhf\" data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2452\">Competitive exam strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ty3nq\" data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2483\">Private sector opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2488\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"eyxhxz\" data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2520\">3. Add-On Skill Development</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2610\">Modern hiring often rewards skills beyond academics. Students are encouraged to develop:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2747\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mfo8p6\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2636\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1afk7p2\" data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2655\">Spoken English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wiy96c\" data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2676\">MS Office skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nzdt2d\" data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2701\">Interview confidence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ca8xhb\" data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2730\">Digital marketing basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13neebt\" data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2747\">Resume writing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2752\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yd933a\" data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2786\">4. Resume &amp; Interview Support</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2850\">Students often need help presenting themselves professionally.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5f2soq\" data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2876\">Support May Include:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"3003\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hew0fb\" data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2897\">Resume building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hg8gpk\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2917\">Mock interviews</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"odu82\" data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2946\">HR interview preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sav0jl\" data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2976\">Group discussion guidance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"824a0y\" data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3003\">Personal branding basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3008\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qry6ht\" data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3035\">Best Job Roles After BA</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3125\">Depending on skills, specialization, and student performance, opportunities may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3523\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a02jn0\" data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3179\"><strong data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3147\">Content Writer</strong> &ndash; Writing and editorial roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oeahyz\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3235\"><strong data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3198\">HR Executive</strong> &ndash; Recruitment and employee support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xg85n7\" data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3294\"><strong data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3266\">Administrative Executive</strong> &ndash; Office management roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uj7tmy\" data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3355\"><strong data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3328\">Digital Marketing Associate</strong> &ndash; Online promotion roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"owhy5v\" data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3413\"><strong data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3388\">Customer Support Executive</strong> &ndash; Client service roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"131p5c8\" data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3464\"><strong data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3435\">Sales Executive</strong> &ndash; Revenue generation roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nns7f6\" data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3523\"><strong data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3496\">NGO / Social Sector Roles</strong> &ndash; Community impact careers</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 120000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(236, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 102, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-01 04:55:46', '2026-06-16 06:11:29', '<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"654\">Admission into MA English has become a fully streamlined digital process, allowing students to complete registration, application, document submission, and enrollment without physical campus visits. A clear understanding of each step helps avoid delays, rejection risks, and last-minute errors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"939\">MA English is a popular postgraduate program for students aiming for careers in teaching, content writing, publishing, media, corporate communication, research, and competitive exams. A smooth admission process ensures students can begin their academic journey without complications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1108\">This detailed guide explains the MA English admission process step by step, required documents, expert tips, common mistakes, and smart strategies for faster approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1113\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"sobqe1\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1154\">MA English Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1221\">The online admission process generally includes four main stages:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1355\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nl6le3\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1240\">Registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ylnmm2\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1269\">Online Application Form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"101zuxd\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1310\">Document Verification by University</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n3o77u\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1355\">Student Registration and LMS Activation</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1420\">Each step must be completed carefully for successful admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1425\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"52akem\" data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1449\">Step 1: Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1520\">The first step is creating a student account on the admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1557\">Students generally need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1653\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u7na1o\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1572\">Full Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dep5uz\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1590\">Mobile Number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36fvl5\" data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1603\">Email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ligt3\" data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1620\">State / City</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wphalf\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1653\">Program Selection (MA English)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1736\">After registration, students pay the initial registration fee to proceed further.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1755\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1881\">Always use an active email ID and mobile number because all admission updates and login credentials are shared through them.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kzox0n\" data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1901\">Common Mistake</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1980\">Incorrect contact details can delay admission communication and verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"1985\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vjt9r3\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2020\">Step 2: Online Application Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2095\">After registration, students must fill out the detailed application form.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"e8wmft\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2122\">Information Required:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2268\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2144\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19byrdb\" data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2172\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2195\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19381gy\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2219\">Address information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yylsws\" data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2241\">Program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fuk8sb\" data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2268\">Category (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2352\">After form submission, students pay the program fee and upload required documents.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2357\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zu19pb\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2404\">Documents Required for MA English Admission</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2759\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2428\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2428\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2417\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2428\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2759\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2491\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2463\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Marksheets</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2491\">Eligibility verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2542\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2513\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Degree Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2542\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final qualification proof</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2587\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2564\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Class 12 Marksheet</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2587\">Academic background</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2628\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2609\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Class 10 Marksheet</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2628\">Identity record</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2679\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2663\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ID Proof (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2679\">Verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2726\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2707\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport Size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2726\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student profile</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2759\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2739\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Signature</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2759\">Official records</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2764\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ln8rck\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2811\">Step 3: Document Verification by University</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2890\">After submission, the university verifies all details and uploaded documents.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kwzrqi\" data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2918\">Verification Includes:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"3068\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10jzhs6\" data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"2950\">Academic eligibility check</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tsd6lg\" data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2983\">Document authenticity review</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qa0omz\" data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3012\">Fee payment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"27zx9a\" data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3038\">Name and DOB matching</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m38fw9\" data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3068\">Completeness of application</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3146\">If errors are found, students may be asked to correct or resubmit documents.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7810j6\" data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3176\">Common Reasons for Delay</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3329\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oa4djl\" data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3210\">Blurred or unclear documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1399npt\" data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3243\">Mismatch in personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qft3oq\" data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3268\">Missing certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3v5bt2\" data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3299\">Incorrect academic entries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g5vvd6\" data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3329\">Incomplete application form</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3331\" data-end=\"3334\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fuepgv\" data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3385\">Step 4: Student Registration and LMS Activation</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3387\" data-end=\"3486\">Once verification is successful, final admission is confirmed and students receive LMS credentials.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bklqlp\" data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3509\">Students Receive:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3601\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"el5erz\" data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3532\">Enrollment Number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f73c3w\" data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3547\">Student ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jnk4gd\" data-start=\"3548\" data-end=\"3575\">LMS Login ID &amp; Password</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ff1lf\" data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3601\">Course access details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mwqh3e\" data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3620\">LMS Benefits:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3622\" data-end=\"3679\">The Learning Management System allows students to access:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3681\" data-end=\"3795\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t66etd\" data-start=\"3681\" data-end=\"3710\">Live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12a9mov\" data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3730\">Study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f7qwlk\" data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3746\">Assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n8vrrj\" data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3767\">Academic updates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d6mmdb\" data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3795\">Exams and notifications</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"795\">MA English is one of the most versatile postgraduate programs for students who want advanced knowledge in literature, language, communication, writing, critical thinking, teaching, research, and media-related careers. Before applying, students should clearly understand the latest MA English eligibility criteria, accepted qualifications, and admission requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"1075\">One of the biggest advantages of MA English is that students from <strong data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"892\">any graduation discipline</strong> can usually apply. This means candidates from Arts, Commerce, Science, Management, Engineering, and other academic backgrounds may pursue this program depending on eligibility norms.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1214\">This detailed guide explains complete MA English eligibility, who can apply, career value, common mistakes, and smart admission strategy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lkquv9\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1263\">MA English Eligibility Criteria Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1361\">Candidates are generally eligible for MA English admission if they meet the following condition:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1700\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1399\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1399\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1377\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1399\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Status</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1700\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1490\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1478\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline from a recognized institution</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1490\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1518\" data-col-size=\"md\">Equivalent qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1530\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1592\" data-col-size=\"md\">Final year / result awaiting candidates (where applicable)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1611\">May be Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1700\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1673\" data-col-size=\"md\">Recognized open schooling / distance background candidates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1700\">Eligible where accepted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1705\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14ap4kt\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1755\">Minimum Qualification for MA English Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1902\">Students should have completed a <strong data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1829\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline</strong> or an equivalent qualification from a recognized university/institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1966\">This means graduates from the following backgrounds may apply:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1974\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wajosr\" data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"1983\">BCom</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z4e4a\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"1991\">BSc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"1999\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2007\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkmi48\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2022\">BTech / BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bacwl9\" data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2060\">Other recognized bachelor&rsquo;s degrees</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mkcn1i\" data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2077\">Key Benefit</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2200\">Students do not need an English Honours degree in many cases, making MA English accessible to a wider range of graduates.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2205\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13vth2q\" data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2256\">Can Non-English Graduates Apply for MA English?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2359\">Yes, candidates from non-English backgrounds can often apply if they meet the graduation requirement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w07hx8\" data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2416\">Who Commonly Chooses MA English from Other Streams?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2635\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vtzwvk\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2466\">BCom graduates wanting communication careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpgc4b\" data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2515\">BBA graduates moving toward content/HR roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dfbb55\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2568\">Science graduates interested in teaching or UPSC</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"97hiw1\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2635\">Engineering graduates shifting toward civil services or academia</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2640\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"z2u1p4\" data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2674\">Can Final Year Students Apply?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2845\">Many universities allow students who are in the final year of graduation or awaiting results to apply, subject to final document submission within the required timeline.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2913\">Students should verify the latest admission rules before applying.</p>', '<p data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"718\">Choosing an MA English program is not only about academics and career growth. Students should also clearly understand the fee structure, semester charges, scholarship benefits, and payment flexibility before taking admission. A transparent fee breakdown helps students plan finances wisely and compare postgraduate options effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"1029\">MA English is a valuable postgraduate degree for students interested in teaching, content writing, publishing, media, communication, research, civil services preparation, and higher studies such as PhD. Understanding total cost and payment options helps students evaluate long-term return on investment (ROI).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1210\">This detailed guide explains the latest MA English semester fee, discounted payable amount, EMI options, student grant benefits, hidden charges, and smart fee planning strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1215\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7b9i2l\" data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1242\">MA English Fee Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1561\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1260\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1270\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1561\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1295\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1306\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹20,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1348\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1324\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Applicable Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1348\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹16,400 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1372\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1365\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student Grant</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1372\">20%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Included</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1423\">₹2,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1470\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1443\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1470\">₹1,000 (Non-refundable)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1513\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1487\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Modes</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1513\">One-Time Payment / EMI</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1561\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1535\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Preference</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1561\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No-Cost EMI / Standard</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1566\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2z7qpq\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1613\">Current Discounted MA English Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1703\">Students can currently avail a <strong data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1667\">20% Student Grant</strong>, reducing the regular semester fee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1848\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1719\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1729\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1848\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1776\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1765\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Original Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1776\">₹20,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1803\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discounted Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1814\">₹16,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1848\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1838\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Savings Per Semester</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1848\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1926\"><strong data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1869\">Offer Validity:</strong> Till <strong data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1891\">9th May 2026</strong> (subject to terms and conditions).</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1931\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1da9b7l\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1962\">Amount Payable Per Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1urq1s2\" data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1985\">₹16,400 / Semester</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2052\">This is the current applicable semester fee after grant benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2057\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"18kzs72\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2090\">Included and Excluded Charges</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"c40zw2\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2119\">Included in Semester Fee</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2206\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dhanzm\" data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2163\">Examination fee of ₹2,000 per semester</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10nr766\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2206\">Academic tuition charges (as applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ocwtce\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2227\">Excluded Charges</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2323\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12c5wuz\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2284\">Initial registration fee of ₹1,000 (non-refundable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3te4rn\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2323\">Optional charges if applicable later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2328\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p7u5zq\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2363\">Eligible Countries for This Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2413\">The above fee is applicable for applicants from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2488\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tgrdfn\" data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2424\">India</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qjtdvt\" data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2438\">Sri Lanka</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yxs3bg\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2449\">Bhutan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ef0w72\" data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2459\">Nepal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xi9ghh\" data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2474\">Bangladesh</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1woqgfi\" data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2488\">Afghanistan</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2493\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"x5a8d1\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2522\">Payment Options Available</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2585\">Students can choose payment options according to convenience.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2786\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2620\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2620\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2604\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suitable For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2786\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2669\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2645\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2669\">Lower monthly burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2705\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2681\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2705\">Regular payment mode</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2750\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2725\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2750\">Faster fee completion</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2786\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2757\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2786\">Flexible installment plan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"750\">The MA English syllabus is designed for students who want advanced expertise in literature, language studies, critical theory, academic writing, research, and communication. It is one of the most valuable postgraduate programs for careers in teaching, content writing, publishing, media, research, civil services preparation, and PhD progression.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"967\">A strong MA English curriculum goes beyond reading novels and poems. It develops analytical thinking, interpretation skills, writing precision, cultural understanding, theoretical knowledge, and research capability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1159\">This detailed semester-wise MA English syllabus explains subjects, course structure, skills developed, career value, and how students can strategically use the program for long-term success.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1164\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"y9zhoz\" data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1204\">MA English Course Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1227\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1227\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1227\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1312\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1251\" data-col-size=\"sm\">First Year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1312\" data-col-size=\"md\">British literature, language studies, research foundation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1326\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1400\" data-col-size=\"md\">Indian literature, literary theory, postcolonial studies, dissertation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1405\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1sdnf75\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1442\">MA English Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1nt64gl\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1497\">Semester 1: Literary Foundations &amp; Academic Skills</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1621\">The first semester builds a strong base in British literature, academic writing, research awareness, and digital literacy.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1844\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1638\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1654\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1844\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1693\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1675\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG513</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1693\" data-col-size=\"sm\">British Poetry</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1721\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1704\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG512</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1721\" data-col-size=\"sm\">British Drama</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1752\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1732\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG539</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1752\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic English</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1791\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1763\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EGEN530</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1791\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fundamentals of Research</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1844\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1802\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ECAP145</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1844\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fundamentals of Information Technology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1866\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jhgx2f\" data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1893\">Poetry interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6kno3l\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1912\">Drama analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wtbj9x\" data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1933\">Academic writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cighq0\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1953\">Research basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5h3byn\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1972\">Digital literacy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"1977\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k7vk39\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2029\">Semester 2: Fiction, Criticism &amp; Language Study</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2108\">Students move into narrative literature, literary criticism, and linguistics.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2328\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2141\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2141\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2141\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2328\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2181\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2162\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG518</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2181\" data-col-size=\"sm\">British Fiction</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2192\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG524</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2214\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Literary Criticism</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2266\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2225\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG514</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2266\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to the Study of Language</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2296\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2274\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2296\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Generic Elective I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2328\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2307\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ESSC501</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2328\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Teaching Aptitude</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7zaalc\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2359\">Why This Semester Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2466\">This semester strengthens understanding of literature, language structure, and academic career readiness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2471\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ayf2lu\" data-start=\"2473\" data-end=\"2521\">Semester 3: Indian Literature &amp; Modern Theory</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2595\">Students study modern critical thought and Indian literary perspectives.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2846\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2628\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2628\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2612\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2628\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2846\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2669\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2649\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG521</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2669\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discursive Prose</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2719\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2680\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG519</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2719\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Post-Independence Indian Literature</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2767\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG525</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2767\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Literary Theory Post World War II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2799\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2776\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2799\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Generic Elective II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2846\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2810\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ESSC608</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2846\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Term Paper / Alternate GE Course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2864\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2980\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u16l9p\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2896\">Advanced critical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13qmw11\" data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2930\">Indian literary understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vg8dji\" data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2960\">Academic writing practice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b6iua\" data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2980\">Research exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"2985\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f20dgk\" data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3036\">Semester 4: Global Perspectives &amp; Dissertation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3117\">The final semester focuses on postcolonial studies and research specialization.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3336\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3150\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3150\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3134\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3150\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3336\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3220\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3171\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG527</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3220\" data-col-size=\"md\">Postcolonial Literatures and Cultural Studies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3254\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3230\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-III</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3254\" data-col-size=\"md\">Generic Elective III</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3286\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3263\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-IV</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3286\" data-col-size=\"md\">Generic Elective IV</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3336\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3297\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EENG692</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3336\" data-col-size=\"md\">Dissertation / Alternate GE Courses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6lg9m8\" data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3367\">Final Semester Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3460\">The dissertation helps students build research depth, writing authority, and PhD readiness.</p>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"859\">Placement support is an important factor for students choosing an MA English program. While MA English is traditionally associated with teaching and academics, the degree now opens opportunities in content creation, publishing, media, communication, corporate sectors, research, and public service careers. However, students often need structured career guidance and employability support to convert academic learning into real job opportunities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1148\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Lovely Professional University</span></span> Online offers placement support services designed to enhance students&rsquo; capabilities according to career requirements, create awareness about employment opportunities, and motivate learners to develop additional skills beyond their academic subjects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1303\">Through placement drives and career initiatives, students can interact with recruiters, demonstrate their strengths, and compete for promising job roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1452\">This guide explains MA English placement support, LPU Online career services, ROI value, job opportunities, and how students can maximize outcomes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15m7mvl\" data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1514\">Why Placement Support Matters for MA English Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1648\">Many students underestimate the market value of strong language and communication skills. MA English graduates can build careers in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h09qj2\" data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1676\">Teaching and academics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1txg6e1\" data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1696\">Content writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a55cmp\" data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1711\">Publishing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"89m8fo\" data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1723\">Editing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16uteh7\" data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1751\">Corporate communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1muqr6t\" data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1768\">Media and PR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nd6ol2\" data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1787\">Research roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"biiy4d\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1814\">Government exam pathways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1882\">Recruiters often assess more than academic marks. They also value:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"2015\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tnvnfh\" data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1903\">Writing quality</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v8vpno\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1928\">Spoken communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yojgng\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1943\">Confidence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"db6umo\" data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1967\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"100ww9o\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1991\">Presentation skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12x9mrv\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2015\">Professional attitude</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2066\">Placement support helps students bridge this gap.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"lqhuk6\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2123\">LPU Online MA English Placement Support Services</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18k74lo\" data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2147\">1. Placement Drives</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2227\">Placement drives help students connect directly with companies and recruiters.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2242\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2371\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rrxafr\" data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2270\">Access to job openings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gad39a\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2298\">Interview opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ji9pn\" data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2324\">Recruiter interaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fki6xc\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2345\">Hiring awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16j9pbx\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2371\">Professional networking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2376\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zmp5s0\" data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2411\">2. Career Guidance &amp; Awareness</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2521\">Many students know literature but are unaware of modern career pathways. Guidance helps learners understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2663\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lfw7ae\" data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2553\">Best jobs after MA English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7eapzb\" data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2578\">Salary growth routes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u8ci5e\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2600\">Teaching pathways</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v1931q\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2629\">Publishing opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uok6my\" data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2663\">Corporate communication careers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"eyxhxz\" data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2700\">3. Add-On Skill Development</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2802\">Employers prefer graduates with practical skills beyond academics. Students are encouraged to build:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2938\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tgbrxo\" data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2831\">Advanced writing skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1afk7p2\" data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2850\">Spoken English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f2zgdy\" data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2870\">Editing ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r3639l\" data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2889\">Resume writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nzdt2d\" data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2914\">Interview confidence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t343ps\" data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2938\">Digital content tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"2943\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yd933a\" data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2977\">4. Resume &amp; Interview Support</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3044\">Students often need help presenting their profile professionally.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5f2soq\" data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3070\">Support May Include:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3196\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hew0fb\" data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3091\">Resume building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hg8gpk\" data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3111\">Mock interviews</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uf9y5l\" data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3136\">HR round preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gfr1ul\" data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3167\">Personal branding guidance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ht76kn\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3196\">Group discussion readiness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3201\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1f17yak\" data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3236\">Best Job Roles After MA English</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3318\">Depending on skills, specialization, and performance, opportunities may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3707\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6cy1yp\" data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3389\"><strong data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3340\">Content Writer</strong> &ndash; Digital, publishing, and brand writing roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ojuvqj\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3433\"><strong data-start=\"3392\" data-end=\"3402\">Editor</strong> &ndash; Publishing and media roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eucafo\" data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3494\"><strong data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3450\">Copywriter</strong> &ndash; Advertising and marketing communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kwd78u\" data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3580\"><strong data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3534\">Corporate Communication Executive</strong> &ndash; Internal and external communication roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wsh3q3\" data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3647\"><strong data-start=\"3583\" data-end=\"3613\">Teacher / Lecturer Pathway</strong> &ndash; After required qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k3xau\" data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3707\"><strong data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3672\">Research Associate</strong> &ndash; Academic and project-based roles</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 80000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(237, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 223, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-01 05:27:40', '2026-06-16 06:09:27', '<p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"713\">The MSc Economics admission process is designed to be simple, fully online, and student-friendly. It allows applicants to complete registration, submit documents, and confirm enrollment without visiting the campus physically. A clear understanding of each step helps students avoid errors, delays, and rejection during admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"1011\">MSc Economics is a highly valuable postgraduate program for students aiming for careers in data analytics, banking, government services, policy research, teaching, and international organizations. A smooth admission process ensures students can begin their academic journey without complications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1166\">This detailed guide explains the complete MSc Economics admission process step by step, required documents, and important tips for successful enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1171\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1h9yr0m\" data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1215\">MSc Economics Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1274\">The admission process generally includes four key stages:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1408\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nl6le3\" data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1293\">Registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ylnmm2\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1322\">Online Application Form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"101zuxd\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1363\">Document Verification by University</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n3o77u\" data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1408\">Student Registration and LMS Activation</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1474\">Each step must be completed correctly to secure final admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1479\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"52akem\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1503\">Step 1: Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1574\">The first step is creating a student account on the admission portal.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jdi9o7\" data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1597\">Details Required:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1712\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u7na1o\" data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1612\">Full Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dep5uz\" data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1630\">Mobile Number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36fvl5\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1643\">Email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bvavek\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1681\">Program Selection (MSc Economics)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ojac4m\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1712\">Basic personal information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1811\">After registration, students are required to pay the initial registration fee to proceed further.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1830\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1942\">Always use an active mobile number and email ID, as all updates and login credentials are shared through them.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1947\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vjt9r3\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1982\">Step 2: Online Application Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2057\">After registration, students must complete the detailed application form.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"e8wmft\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2084\">Information Required:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2229\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2106\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19byrdb\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2134\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2157\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19381gy\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2181\">Address information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i1lfbp\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2202\">Course selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fuk8sb\" data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2229\">Category (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2319\">After filling the form, students must pay the program fee and upload required documents.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2324\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1xox23k\" data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2374\">Documents Required for MSc Economics Admission</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2398\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2398\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2387\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2398\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2461\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2433\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Marksheets</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2461\">Eligibility verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2520\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2497\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Degree Certificate / Provisional</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2520\">Qualification proof</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2565\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2542\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Class 12 Marksheet</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2565\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic background</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2612\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2587\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Class 10 Marksheet</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2612\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identity verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2658\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2635\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Government ID Proof</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2658\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identity validation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2706\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2686\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport Size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2706\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Profile creation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2719\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Signature</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2739\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Official records</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ln8rck\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2791\">Step 3: Document Verification by University</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2864\">Once the application is submitted, the university verifies all details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80vfwh\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2900\">Verification Process Includes:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"3072\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10jzhs6\" data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"2932\">Academic eligibility check</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y72dmv\" data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2971\">Document authenticity verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qa0omz\" data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3000\">Fee payment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17tgy9b\" data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3036\">Name and date of birth matching</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8fsfqi\" data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3072\">Application completeness review</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"p9lbm0\" data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3103\">Common Reasons for Delay:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3242\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0tc99\" data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3133\">Blurred document uploads</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5d3n7a\" data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3164\">Incorrect academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qft3oq\" data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3189\">Missing certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wijxst\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3209\">Name mismatches</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mcxet5\" data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3242\">Incomplete application forms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3247\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fuepgv\" data-start=\"3249\" data-end=\"3298\">Step 4: Student Registration and LMS Activation</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3381\">After successful verification, admission is confirmed and LMS access is provided.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bklqlp\" data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3404\">Students Receive:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3494\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1clo88f\" data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3427\">Enrollment number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f73c3w\" data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3442\">Student ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sars2p\" data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3468\">LMS login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ff1lf\" data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3494\">Course access details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1szuiyx\" data-start=\"3496\" data-end=\"3513\">LMS Features:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3571\">The Learning Management System (LMS) provides access to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3703\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c6bjnj\" data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3591\">Online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12a9mov\" data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3611\">Study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f7qwlk\" data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3627\">Assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h3t5qz\" data-start=\"3628\" data-end=\"3644\">Exam updates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a5yl10\" data-start=\"3645\" data-end=\"3667\">Academic resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hs4b1r\" data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3703\">Notifications and announcements&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"765\">MSc Economics is a highly preferred postgraduate program for students who want to build careers in economics, finance, data analysis, policy research, banking, government services, and international organizations. Before applying, it is important to clearly understand the eligibility requirements, accepted qualifications, and admission conditions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"1036\">One of the major advantages of MSc Economics is its <strong data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"845\">wide eligibility scope</strong>, allowing students from different academic backgrounds to apply. This makes the program flexible and accessible for graduates who want to shift toward analytical and economics-based careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1176\">This detailed guide explains MSc Economics eligibility criteria, who can apply, career relevance, common mistakes, and admission strategy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1181\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wtw67u\" data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1228\">MSc Economics Eligibility Criteria Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1331\">Candidates are generally eligible for MSc Economics admission if they meet the following requirement:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1369\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1369\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1347\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1369\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Status</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1447\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline from a recognized university</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1459\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1499\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1487\" data-col-size=\"md\">Equivalent qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1499\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1561\" data-col-size=\"md\">Final year / result awaiting candidates (where applicable)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1580\">May be Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1d99wuq\" data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1638\">Minimum Qualification for MSc Economics Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1769\">Students must have completed a <strong data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1738\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline or equivalent qualification</strong> from a recognized institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1842\">This means students from the following backgrounds can generally apply:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1956\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1850\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wajosr\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1859\">BCom</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z4e4a\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1867\">BSc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1875\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1883\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e29pq\" data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1913\">Engineering (B.Tech / BE)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1892hkm\" data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1956\">Other recognized undergraduate degrees</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1961\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"lbnwg7\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2000\">Can Students from Any Stream Apply?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2169\">Yes, MSc Economics is often open to graduates from <strong data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2080\">any academic discipline</strong>, making it suitable for career switching into economics, finance, and analytics domains.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tk202q\" data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2221\">Common Backgrounds Applying for MSc Economics:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2440\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g6dtkj\" data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2275\">Commerce graduates shifting to finance/economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1miy8pw\" data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2319\">Science graduates moving into analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z6jw6y\" data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2377\">Arts graduates targeting government exams or teaching</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nown97\" data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2440\">Engineering graduates entering data-driven economics roles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2445\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"z2u1p4\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2479\">Can Final Year Students Apply?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2649\">Many institutions allow <strong data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2569\">final-year graduation students or result-awaiting candidates</strong> to apply, subject to submitting final documents within the prescribed timeline.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2726\">Students should always verify updated admission guidelines before applying.</p>', '<p data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"762\">Understanding the fee structure is a key step before enrolling in an MSc Economics program. Students not only need clarity about tuition cost but also about payment flexibility, scholarships or grants, hidden charges, and long-term return on investment (ROI). A transparent fee breakdown helps students and parents plan finances effectively and choose the right postgraduate path.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"1008\">MSc Economics is a highly valuable program for careers in data analysis, policy research, banking, finance, government services, teaching, and international organizations. Knowing the exact cost structure helps students make informed decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1171\">This guide explains the latest MSc Economics fee structure, discounted semester fee, EMI options, student grant details, and smart financial planning strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1176\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1y79m8y\" data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1206\">MSc Economics Fee Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1525\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1234\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1234\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1224\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1234\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1525\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1259\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1270\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1312\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1288\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Applicable Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1312\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹20,400 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1336\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1329\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student Grant</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1336\" data-col-size=\"sm\">20%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1364\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Included</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1387\">₹2,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1434\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1407\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1434\">₹1,000 (Non-refundable)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1477\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1451\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Modes</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1477\">One-Time Payment / EMI</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1525\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1499\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Preference</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1525\">No-Cost EMI / Standard</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"uyree9\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1580\">Current Discounted MSc Economics Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1670\">Students can currently avail a <strong data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1634\">20% Student Grant</strong>, reducing the overall semester fee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1815\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1696\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1696\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1686\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1696\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1815\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1743\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1732\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Original Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1743\">₹25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1781\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discounted Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1781\">₹20,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1815\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1805\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Savings Per Semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1815\">₹4,600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1893\"><strong data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1836\">Offer Validity:</strong> Till <strong data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1858\">9th May 2026</strong> (subject to terms and conditions).</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1898\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1da9b7l\" data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1929\">Amount Payable Per Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vzwcp3\" data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1952\">₹20,400 / Semester</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2028\">This is the final applicable fee after applying the student grant benefit.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2033\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"18kzs72\" data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2066\">Included and Excluded Charges</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"c40zw2\" data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2095\">Included in Semester Fee</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2182\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dhanzm\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2139\">Examination fee of ₹2,000 per semester</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10nr766\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2182\">Academic tuition charges (as applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ocwtce\" data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2203\">Excluded Charges</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2317\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12c5wuz\" data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2260\">Initial registration fee of ₹1,000 (non-refundable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ku7v0\" data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2317\">Optional certification or additional services (if any)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2322\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"z2kvm9\" data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2366\">Eligible Countries for MSc Economics Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2424\">The applicable fee structure is valid for students from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2501\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tgrdfn\" data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2435\">India</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qjtdvt\" data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2449\">Sri Lanka</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yxs3bg\" data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2460\">Bhutan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ef0w72\" data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2470\">Nepal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xi9ghh\" data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2485\">Bangladesh</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4op832\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2501\">Afghanistan</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2506\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"x5a8d1\" data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2535\">Payment Options Available</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2603\">Students can choose flexible payment methods based on convenience.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2829\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2638\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2638\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2622\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2638\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suitable For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2829\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2688\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2663\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2688\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly affordability</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2734\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2734\">Regular fee submission</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2782\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2754\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full fee payment at once</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2829\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2796\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Option</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2829\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Installment-based flexibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"794\">The MSc Economics syllabus is designed to develop strong analytical, mathematical, and policy-oriented thinking in students. It blends economic theory with quantitative tools, research methodology, and real-world applications. This program is highly valuable for careers in data analytics, banking, government services, policy research, international organizations, and academia.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"978\">A well-structured MSc Economics curriculum focuses on microeconomics, macroeconomics, mathematics for economists, international trade, public policy, and dissertation-based research.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1105\">This detailed guide explains the complete semester-wise syllabus, subject breakdown, skill development, and career relevance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1110\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"nwxycs\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1153\">MSc Economics Course Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1176\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1176\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1162\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1176\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1200\" data-col-size=\"sm\">First Year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1258\" data-col-size=\"md\">Core economic theory, research foundation, mathematics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1272\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1351\">International economics, development studies, policy analysis, dissertation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1356\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1x0ddim\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1396\">MSc Economics Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4pu6jw\" data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1438\">Semester 1: Core Economic Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1516\">This semester builds the base of economic theory and research understanding.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1549\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1549\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1533\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1549\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1570\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EECO525</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Microeconomics Theory and Analysis I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1661\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1621\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EECO526</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1661\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Macroeconomics Theory and Analysis I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1714\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1672\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ECAP145</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1714\">Fundamentals of Information Technology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1756\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1725\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EECO604</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1756\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Economic Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1767\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EGEN530</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1795\">Fundamentals of Research</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1819\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fcuptl\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1855\">Consumer and producer behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1do5ori\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1896\">National income and macro indicators</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ppjch0\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1925\">Indian economy structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cighq0\" data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1945\">Research basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bqj21\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1972\">IT tools for economics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"1977\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1es17u8\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2034\">Semester 2: Mathematical Economics &amp; Advanced Theory</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2102\">This semester focuses on quantitative economics and deeper theory.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2355\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2135\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2135\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2119\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2135\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2355\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2197\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2156\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EECO529</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2197\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Microeconomics Theory and Analysis II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2208\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EECO530</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2249\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Macroeconomics Theory and Analysis II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2290\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2260\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EQTT501</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2290\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics for Economists</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2320\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2298\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2320\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Generic Elective I</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2355\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2331\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMGN832</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2355\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sl4r5f\" data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2381\">Key Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2528\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"72cu46\" data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2421\">Mathematical modeling in economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6r9sx0\" data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2459\">Advanced macroeconomic frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uoolyd\" data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2495\">Research design and methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14casr9\" data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2528\">Quantitative analysis skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2533\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qmo2nn\" data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2582\">Semester 3: Policy, Trade &amp; Public Economics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2649\">This semester focuses on applied economics and policy frameworks.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2682\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2682\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2666\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2730\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2703\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EECO606</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2730\">International Economics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2768\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2741\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EECO538</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2768\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Environmental Economics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2809\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2779\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EECO528</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2809\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monetary Theory and Policy</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2840\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2820\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EECO532</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2840\">Public Economics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2872\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2849\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2872\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Generic Elective II</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2883\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMGN842</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2921\">Term Paper / Alternative GE Course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18630cc\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2948\">Key Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"3099\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ceqy43\" data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2974\">Global trade systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ff3dfw\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3009\">Environmental policy economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f66qtp\" data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3038\">Monetary policy analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sxstt1\" data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3071\">Public finance understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18qeh2j\" data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3099\">Research writing skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3104\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bo9cf3\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3157\">Semester 4: Development Economics &amp; Dissertation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3226\">The final semester focuses on advanced economics and research work.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3462\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3259\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3259\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3243\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Code</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3259\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject Name</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3462\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3308\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3280\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EECO512</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3308\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Economics of Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3309\" data-end=\"3344\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3309\" data-end=\"3319\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EECO607</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3344\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Trade and Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3378\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3354\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3378\">Generic Elective III</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3410\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3387\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GE-IV</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3387\" data-end=\"3410\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Generic Elective IV</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3411\" data-end=\"3462\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3411\" data-end=\"3421\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EECO601</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3462\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dissertation / Alternative GE Courses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6lg9m8\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3493\">Final Semester Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3527\">The dissertation helps students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3709\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"182k9pi\" data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3572\">Develop independent research capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16muute\" data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3623\">Apply economic theories in real-world problems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yne3ze\" data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3669\">Build academic and professional expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"191aenv\" data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3709\">Prepare for PhD or research careers</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"783\">Placement support plays a crucial role in helping MSc Economics students transition from academic learning to real-world careers. While the program builds strong analytical, mathematical, and policy-based knowledge, students also need structured career guidance, skill development, and exposure to industry expectations to secure high-value job roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"1092\">MSc Economics is a powerful postgraduate degree that opens opportunities in banking, finance, data analytics, government services, policy research, consulting, and international organizations. However, success depends not only on academic performance but also on employability skills and practical exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1232\">This guide explains MSc Economics placement support, career services, job roles, ROI value, and how students can maximize career outcomes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"150a0jm\" data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1281\">MSc Economics Placement Support Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1326\">Placement support services are designed to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bu46g9\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1368\">Enhance student employability skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10zxs0n\" data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1416\">Create awareness about career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ajasz6\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1446\">Provide industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1waplat\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1497\">Improve communication and analytical abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qwc1mh\" data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1560\">Bridge the gap between academics and industry requirements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1765\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Lovely Professional University</span></span> Online provides structured placement support designed to prepare MSc Economics students for competitive job markets through training, guidance, and placement drives.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1770\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yujey6\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1830\">Why Placement Support Matters for MSc Economics Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1920\">MSc Economics is not limited to theoretical learning. Employers expect students to have:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"2086\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b5da9v\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1952\">Strong analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zjetu8\" data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1983\">Data interpretation skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8tkhz\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2008\">Quantitative ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ahogcs\" data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2033\">Policy understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mfo8p6\" data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2058\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s3q404\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2086\">Problem-solving mindset</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2159\">Placement support ensures students are prepared for these expectations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2164\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ilzqsp\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2219\">LPU Online MSc Economics Placement Support Services</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18k74lo\" data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2243\">1. Placement Drives</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2322\">Placement drives connect students directly with recruiters and organizations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vyi0sv\" data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2341\">Key Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2498\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"146n2ez\" data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2380\">Direct interaction with employers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k98flo\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2418\">Real-time interview opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r30ci6\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2451\">Exposure to hiring processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d1r3qk\" data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2475\">Industry networking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b99eog\" data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2498\">Job role awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2503\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17575nk\" data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2538\">2. Career Awareness &amp; Guidance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2622\">Many students are unaware of diverse career paths in economics. Guidance helps in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2813\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ogrfa5\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2658\">Identifying suitable job roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ojeddu\" data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2690\">Understanding salary trends</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hegs0o\" data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2734\">Exploring government vs private careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xncjd3\" data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2778\">Planning academic vs corporate pathways</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c59k2z\" data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2813\">Selecting specialization areas</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2818\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1aq9yly\" data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2852\">3. Skill Enhancement Programs</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2921\">Employers prefer candidates with practical skills beyond academics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fz8q1\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2948\">Key Skills Developed:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"3113\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11s1e6r\" data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2993\">Data analysis (Excel, R, Python basics)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oz5mw8\" data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3015\">Economic modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hm64mf\" data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3043\">Research report writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"100ww9o\" data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3067\">Presentation skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hew0fb\" data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3087\">Resume building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pr6i54\" data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3113\">Interview preparation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3118\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7jtc5i\" data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3152\">4. Interview &amp; Resume Support</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3212\">Students receive structured preparation support including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3347\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"47msc0\" data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3237\">Resume optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hg8gpk\" data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3257\">Mock interviews</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zm06bw\" data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3287\">Group discussion practice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"odu82\" data-start=\"3288\" data-end=\"3316\">HR interview preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gfr1ul\" data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3347\">Personal branding guidance</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 100000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(238, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 77, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-01 06:42:33', '2026-06-16 06:12:17', '<p data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"786\">The admission process for the <strong data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"438\">Master of Commerce (M.Com)</strong> program is designed to be fully structured, transparent, and student-friendly so that applicants can complete enrollment smoothly without confusion. The entire process is divided into clear stages, starting from registration and ending with LMS activation, ensuring that students move step by step through a systematic academic onboarding journey.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"983\">Unlike traditional offline admission systems, this process is digital-first, allowing students to complete admission from anywhere while maintaining proper verification and academic authenticity.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"988\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"fjumxd\" data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1039\">Step 1: Registration (Initial Enrollment Stage)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1340\">The first step in the admission process is registration, where students create their account and begin their application journey. At this stage, candidates are required to sign up on the admission portal and pay the initial <strong data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1285\">registration fee</strong>, which confirms their intent to apply for the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1506\">This step is important because it activates the student&rsquo;s application profile in the university system and allows access to the next stage of the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1511\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1odjy41\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1576\">Step 2: Online Application Form (Academic Details Submission)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1847\">After registration, students must fill out the <strong data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1652\">online application form</strong>, where they provide their personal, academic, and contact details. This stage is crucial because it helps the university evaluate the student&rsquo;s eligibility based on their educational background.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1904\">Along with form submission, candidates are required to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2055\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w1ylna\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1945\">Enter academic qualification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e50rr0\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1976\">Select program preferences</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wbl8np\" data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2016\">Pay the program fee (as applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wocmkh\" data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2055\">Upload relevant academic documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2180\">This ensures that the application is complete and ready for verification without missing any required academic information.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2185\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ln8rck\" data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2232\">Step 3: Document Verification by University</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2514\">Once the application form is submitted along with documents, the university begins the <strong data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2345\">verification process</strong>. During this stage, all submitted academic records, identity details, and supporting documents are carefully reviewed to ensure authenticity and eligibility compliance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2759\">Students are not required to take any action during this stage and must simply wait for confirmation. This verification step is essential to maintain academic transparency and ensure that only eligible candidates are admitted into the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2764\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"p0to8y\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2813\">Step 4: Student Registration &amp; LMS Activation</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2994\">After successful verification, the final stage of admission is <strong data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2921\">student registration and LMS activation</strong>. At this point, the student is officially enrolled in the M.Com program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3025\">The university then provides:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3188\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ytl0q2\" data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3061\">Student enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hqkqv4\" data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3124\">Login credentials for the Learning Management System (LMS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tb2tw8\" data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3188\">Access to study materials, lectures, and academic resources</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3327\">Once LMS access is activated, students can begin their academic journey and start attending classes or accessing course materials online.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"880\">The eligibility criteria for the <strong data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"479\">Master of Commerce (M.Com)</strong> program are designed to ensure that students entering this postgraduate course already have a strong academic foundation in commerce-related or analytical subjects. Since M.Com deals with advanced topics such as financial accounting, corporate taxation, business economics, and financial management, students must have prior exposure to core academic concepts that support higher-level understanding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"1231\">To apply for M.Com, a candidate must have completed a <strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"1001\">bachelor&rsquo;s degree from a recognized university or institution</strong>. However, eligibility is not limited to just holding a degree; it also depends on the academic background of the student, as the program requires familiarity with commerce or quantitative subjects for smooth learning progression.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1236\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2tmebf\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1271\">Academic Qualification Required</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1400\">A candidate must have completed a <strong data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1344\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree (10+2+3 system)</strong> from a recognized university or equivalent institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1475\">Students from the following academic backgrounds are considered eligible:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1677\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4h0lx\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1489\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1py2ubf\" data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1504\">Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19cyfx0\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1518\">Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1esivjd\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1533\">Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aheggw\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1615\">Mathematics or Economics (when included as part of the graduation curriculum)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tz1jmt\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1677\">Any equivalent qualification recognized by the university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1897\">This structure ensures that students entering the program already have exposure to analytical thinking, financial reasoning, or business-related academic concepts, which are essential for postgraduate commerce studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1902\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17cqk83\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1949\">Subject Background and Academic Suitability</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"2238\">M.Com is not just based on eligibility qualification but also on academic suitability. Students from commerce and accounting backgrounds generally find it easier to adapt because they already understand financial statements, business transactions, taxation basics, and corporate systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2635\">Students from economics backgrounds develop strong analytical and policy-level thinking, which helps in subjects like business economics and financial analysis. Management students contribute understanding of organizational systems and business processes, while mathematics students bring logical reasoning and numerical strength, which is useful in financial modeling and quantitative analysis.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2780\">This combination of eligible backgrounds ensures that students are academically prepared for the complexity of postgraduate commerce education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2785\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"saa7xt\" data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2843\">Important Admission Condition (University Policy Rule)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"3119\">It is important to understand that eligibility criteria, admission requirements, and related conditions are not fixed permanently. These may be revised or updated by the university from time to time based on academic policies, regulatory changes, or institutional decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3137\">This means that:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3359\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q5zn45\" data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3196\">Admission rules may change in future academic sessions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kwo8h6\" data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3245\">Subject equivalence criteria may be modified</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jeqafn\" data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3301\">Additional eligibility conditions may be introduced</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17oti3w\" data-start=\"3302\" data-end=\"3359\">Final admission authority remains with the university</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"690\">The Master of Commerce (M.Com) program is designed with a <strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"589\">transparent and student-friendly fee model</strong>, making postgraduate commerce education more affordable through grants and flexible payment options.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"996\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"718\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"718\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"718\" data-col-size=\"md\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"996\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"801\">\r\n<td data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"777\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee (Without Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"801\">₹25,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"868\">\r\n<td data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"844\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Applicable Fee (With 20% Student Grant)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"868\">₹20,400 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"939\">\r\n<td data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"887\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"939\">₹2,000 per semester (included in applicable fee)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"996\">\r\n<td data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"959\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"996\">₹1,000 (one-time, non-refundable)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1001\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wwd1oe\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1053\">Key Financial Understanding (Important Insight)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1366\">The <strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1087\">₹20,400 per semester fee</strong> already includes examination charges, which means students do not face hidden academic testing costs during the program. However, the <strong data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1283\">registration fee of ₹1,000 is separate and non-refundable</strong>, which is a standard administrative cost across most university admission systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1543\">The <strong data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1419\">20% Student Grant (valid till 9th May 2026)</strong> significantly reduces financial pressure, making M.Com a comparatively <strong data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1542\">budget-friendly postgraduate degree in commerce</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"18eojnm\" data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1591\">Payment Structure &amp; Flexibility Options</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1690\">The program is designed to support different financial situations through multiple payment modes:</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2hecu7\" data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1716\">1. No-Cost EMI Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1906\">Students can convert their semester fee into <strong data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1826\">easy monthly installments without additional interest burden</strong>, helping working professionals and fresh graduates manage finances efficiently.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yf8m4b\" data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1937\">2. Standard Payment Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2057\">A one-time semester payment option for students who prefer <strong data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2032\">complete fee settlement upfront</strong> without EMI commitments.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"122j7ly\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2092\">3. Semester-Wise Payment Model</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2215\">Fee is paid at the start of each semester, allowing students to manage education costs in a <strong data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2214\">structured academic cycle</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18nwtux\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2245\">4. Lumpsum Payment Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2360\">For students planning full financial closure early, a lumpsum option is available for smoother long-term planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2365\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"anylif\" data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2406\">Applicant Type &amp; Eligibility Coverage</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2464\">The M.Com program is open to a wide range of applicants:</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1odj1ai\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2498\">Eligible Applicant Categories</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2545\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15iacaf\" data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2518\">Indian students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"67m1xk\" data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2545\">International students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kidckc\" data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2587\">Countries Covered Under Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2706\">The applicable fee structure is valid for students from:<br>India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2711\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17tzzko\" data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2779\">Eligibility Criteria (With Academic Clarity + Practical Insight)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2861\">To apply for the M.Com program, candidates must meet the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"3277\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tx5hf7\" data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2966\">Must have completed a <strong data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2935\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree (10+2+3 education pattern)</strong> from a recognized university</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14aumhi\" data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"3051\">Candidates from Commerce, Management, Economics, or related fields are preferred</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sd6n7a\" data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3152\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3150\">appearing for final year graduation examinations are also eligible to apply</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dsjwg4\" data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3277\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3237\">NIOS or equivalent recognized boards/universities are eligible</strong>, subject to validity of qualification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"l78jv2\" data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3325\">Strategic Insight (Important for Students)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3554\">While commerce background is preferred, students from other academic streams may also apply. However, they should be prepared for foundational concepts in <strong data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3529\">accounting, taxation, and business economics</strong> in the initial semester.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"752\">The <strong data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"436\">Master of Commerce (M.Com)</strong> is a postgraduate program designed to develop advanced knowledge in commerce, finance, accounting, economics, taxation, business strategy, and research methodology. The curriculum is structured across four semesters to gradually build conceptual depth, analytical ability, and industry-relevant financial expertise.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"1012\">Unlike undergraduate commerce programs, M.Com focuses heavily on <strong data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"943\">specialized financial systems, corporate decision-making, international business operations, and research-based learning</strong>, preparing students for both professional and academic career paths.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"a82sf\" data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1074\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundation of Advanced Commerce Learning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1271\">The first semester focuses on building a strong conceptual base in economics, finance, human behavior in organizations, research fundamentals, and information technology applications in business.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1472\">Students study <strong data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1312\">Managerial Economics</strong>, which helps in understanding business decision-making using economic principles. This subject forms the backbone of corporate planning and pricing strategies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1681\"><strong data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1530\">Organisational Behaviour and Human Resource Dynamics</strong> introduces students to workplace behavior, leadership patterns, and human resource management systems, which are essential for corporate environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1900\"><strong data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1731\">Financial Reporting, Statements and Analysis</strong> develops expertise in understanding balance sheets, profit and loss statements, and financial performance evaluation, which is crucial for accounting and finance roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"2052\"><strong data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1930\">Fundamentals of Research</strong> builds analytical and academic research skills, preparing students for dissertation work and data-driven decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2230\"><strong data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2096\">Fundamentals of Information Technology</strong> introduces digital systems used in commerce, including business software, data handling, and IT applications in financial operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2235\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"v0g2al\" data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2300\">Semester 2 &ndash; Business Environment and Strategic Understanding</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2457\">The second semester focuses on taxation, international business, marketing, and research methodology, expanding both technical and strategic understanding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2651\"><strong data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2499\">Corporate Tax Structure and Planning</strong> helps students understand taxation systems, tax planning strategies, and compliance frameworks, which are essential for finance and consulting careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2840\"><strong data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2677\">Research Methodology</strong> strengthens academic research capability, data interpretation, and analytical decision-making, which is important for higher studies and corporate research roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"3025\"><strong data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2880\">International Business Environment</strong> provides insight into global trade systems, foreign markets, and international business operations, preparing students for global finance roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3179\"><strong data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3051\">Marketing Management</strong> introduces principles of marketing strategy, consumer behavior, and brand management, which support business development roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3339\"><strong data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3203\">Generic Elective I</strong> allows students to choose a subject from a broader academic basket, enabling interdisciplinary learning and specialization flexibility.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3344\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hep59f\" data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3397\">Semester 3 &ndash; Advanced Finance and Global Commerce</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3522\">The third semester focuses on advanced finance, accounting systems, fraud detection, and international business operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3673\"><strong data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3567\">Corporate Strategy and Entrepreneurship</strong> develops strategic thinking, business planning, and entrepreneurial skills required for leadership roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3881\"><strong data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3720\">Forensic Accounting and Fraud Examination</strong> focuses on detecting financial fraud, auditing irregularities, and investigative accounting techniques, which are highly valued in compliance and audit sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"4034\"><strong data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"3929\">International Banking and Forex Management</strong> introduces global banking systems, currency exchange mechanisms, and international financial operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4149\"><strong data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4064\">International Accounting</strong> focuses on global accounting standards and cross-border financial reporting systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4245\"><strong data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4174\">Generic Elective II</strong> provides further specialization flexibility based on student interest.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4247\" data-end=\"4395\"><strong data-start=\"4247\" data-end=\"4277\">Seminar on Summer Training</strong> allows students to present practical industry exposure gained during internships, improving real-world understanding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4400\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"178i3yn\" data-start=\"4402\" data-end=\"4456\">Semester 4 &ndash; Specialization and Industry Integration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4458\" data-end=\"4572\">The final semester focuses on advanced financial management, strategic analysis, and research-based academic work.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4574\" data-end=\"4699\"><strong data-start=\"4574\" data-end=\"4596\">Management Science</strong> covers quantitative decision-making models, operations research, and business optimization techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4838\"><strong data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4739\">International Financial Management</strong> deals with global financial systems, investment decisions, and multinational financial operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4840\" data-end=\"4926\"><strong data-start=\"4840\" data-end=\"4871\">Generic Elective III and IV</strong> allow further specialization in chosen academic areas.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4928\" data-end=\"5064\"><strong data-start=\"4928\" data-end=\"4942\">Term Paper</strong> involves research-based academic writing, helping students develop analytical depth and dissertation-level understanding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5066\" data-end=\"5222\">Alternatively, students may opt for an elective from a related academic basket depending on earlier subject choices, allowing flexibility in specialization.</p>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"820\">The <strong data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"488\">LPU Online Placement Support Services</strong> are designed as a structured career development ecosystem that focuses on preparing students for real-world employment opportunities. Instead of limiting learning to academic subjects alone, the system emphasizes overall employability development by building professional skills, industry awareness, and job readiness capabilities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"1108\">The core objective of these services is to bridge the gap between academic learning and industry expectations, ensuring that students are not only degree holders but also <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1023\">career-ready professionals</strong> equipped with practical knowledge, communication skills, and workplace competencies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1113\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"nwb5tn\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1158\">Career-Focused Skill Enhancement Approach</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1489\">One of the most important aspects of the placement support system is its focus on <strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1295\">add-on skill development beyond academic subjects</strong>. In today&rsquo;s competitive job market, companies do not evaluate candidates only based on degrees; they assess communication skills, analytical thinking, problem-solving ability, and adaptability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1555\">Through structured guidance, students are encouraged to develop:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1764\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17415pf\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1607\">Professional communication and interview skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hwjm0o\" data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1655\">Industry-relevant technical and soft skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kxv7y1\" data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1707\">Problem-solving and analytical thinking ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fuuo1q\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1764\">Awareness of corporate expectations and work culture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1865\">This approach ensures that students become more confident and capable when entering the job market.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1870\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ma7e0j\" data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1926\">Placement Drives (Direct Industry Interaction Model)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"2108\">A major component of the placement support system is the organization of <strong data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2031\">impactful placement drives</strong>, which serve as direct interaction platforms between students and employers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2151\">These placement drives allow students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2402\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gny9df\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2210\">Interact directly with hiring companies and recruiters</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oyjd4e\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2276\">Understand current industry requirements and job expectations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b90ez3\" data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2338\">Demonstrate their academic knowledge and practical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ev3s28\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2402\">Participate in recruitment processes for suitable job roles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2544\">This structured exposure significantly improves employability by giving students real-time experience of corporate recruitment environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2549\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uvxlem\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2603\">Industry Exposure and Career Awareness Development</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2861\">The placement support system also focuses on creating <strong data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2721\">career awareness and industry understanding among students</strong>. Many students face challenges not due to lack of knowledge, but due to lack of clarity about career direction and job market expectations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2925\">Through continuous guidance, students develop awareness about:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"3117\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1schmd7\" data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2968\">Emerging job roles and industry trends</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14frxm8\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3014\">Required skill sets for different sectors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18e0jay\" data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3069\">Career pathways after graduation or postgraduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1if8eg0\" data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3117\">Corporate expectations from fresh graduates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3224\">This awareness helps students make better career decisions and choose roles aligned with their strengths.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3229\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1oje17c\" data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3274\">Student Readiness and Employability Focus</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3561\">The placement support framework is designed not just to provide job opportunities but to build <strong data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3408\">long-term employability readiness</strong>. Students are trained to understand how to present themselves professionally during interviews and how to align their skills with industry requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3563\" data-end=\"3577\">This includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3774\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m9evjo\" data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3621\">Resume building and profile development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bd5c50\" data-start=\"3622\" data-end=\"3665\">Interview preparation and mock sessions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7i5ses\" data-start=\"3666\" data-end=\"3723\">Personality development and communication enhancement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134wjpl\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3774\">Confidence-building for corporate environments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3847\">The focus is on creating a holistic professional identity for students.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 100000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(239, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 225, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 01:07:33', '2026-06-16 06:12:46', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Securing a seat in a premier MBA in Human Resource Management (HRM) program requires a clear understanding of the administrative milestones that bridge the gap between an applicant and a registered scholar. The 2026 admission cycle is built on a \"Digital-First\" architecture, designed to be transparent, efficient, and user-friendly. This process ensures that high-potential candidates can lock in financial benefits, such as the 20% Student Grant, while transitioning smoothly into the academic environment.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The journey is divided into four critical phases, each serving as a prerequisite for the next. Understanding the \"why\" behind each step is essential for any future HR leader who values organizational precision.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">&nbsp;Admission Breakdown</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following table provides a high-authority roadmap of the enrollment journey, detailing the specific action items required at each stage.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Enrollment Milestone Table</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Step</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Action Item</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Initial Onboarding:</strong> Sign up on the official university portal and settle the <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">₹1,000 non-refundable Registration Fee</strong> to create your unique applicant profile.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Online Application Form</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial &amp; Personal Submission:</strong> Fill in comprehensive details, pay the applicable <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"83\">₹40,400 semester fee</strong>, and upload high-resolution academic documents.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Verification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">University Audit:</strong> The university&rsquo;s admissions office conducts a rigorous audit of your credentials to verify eligibility and ensure document authenticity.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Student Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Activation:</strong> Once verified, you receive your <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">Learning Management System (LMS) credentials</strong> via email, marking your official start as a student.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Topical Coverage: Strategic Value of the Admission Journey</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Each step of this process is calibrated to maximize the student\'s Return on Investment (ROI). The speed at which a candidate moves from Step 1 to Step 4 determines their readiness for the high-paced corporate HR world.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Integrity (Step 1 &amp; 2):</strong> By completing the registration and application early, students safeguard themselves against the expiration of the <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"148\">20% Student Grant (valid until 9th May 2026)</strong>. This early action represents a direct saving of nearly ₹40,000 over the course of the degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Credential Authority (Step 3):</strong> The verification phase is a critical quality-control measure. It ensures that the cohort consists of eligible graduates and certified professionals (CA/CS/CMA), enhancing the peer-to-peer learning experience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Empowerment (Step 4):</strong> LMS activation is the gateway to your career tools. The LMS is not just for lectures; it is where you access <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"139\">HR Metrics tools, Case Study databases, and Global Networking forums.</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<h2 data-path-to-node=\"2\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Foundations: MBA HRM Eligibility &amp; Admission Standards</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The MBA in Human Resource Management (HRM) is designed to be a bridge for diverse talents entering the corporate leadership sphere. The eligibility framework is intentionally broad, recognizing that high-level management capabilities can stem from various academic and professional backgrounds. Whether you are a fresh graduate, a student in their final semester, or a certified professional from a premier national body, the program provides a standardized entry point into strategic human resource studies.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The criteria are structured to ensure that every candidate possesses the foundational analytical skills required to navigate the complexities of organizational behavior, labor laws, and strategic workforce planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Eligibility Requirements for 2026</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To qualify for the MBA HRM program, applicants must meet one of the following academic or professional milestones. These rules ensure a high standard of peer-to-peer learning within the management cohort.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eligibility Matrix</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Entry Pathway</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Specific Requirement</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Traditional Academic</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline (Arts, Science, Commerce, etc.) or an equivalent qualification.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional (CS)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\">Completion of Company Secretary (CS) from the Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI).</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional (CA/CMA)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\">Completion of Chartered Accountancy (CA) from ICAI or Cost &amp; Management Accountancy (CMA) from the Institute of Cost Accountants of India.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Appearing Status</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,0\">Candidates in their final year of graduation or appearing for Class 12 exams are eligible for provisional admission.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">NIOS and \"Appearing\" Candidates</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">A significant advantage of this program&rsquo;s admission policy is its inclusivity toward non-traditional educational timelines. This flexibility is vital for students aiming to transition quickly from basic education to specialized management training.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Provisional Admissions (Appearing Students):</strong> The university allows students currently <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">appearing for their final year of graduation or Class 12</strong> to apply. This is a strategic move that allows candidates to lock in the 20% Student Grant (valid until 9th May 2026) while their final results are still pending.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">NIOS and Open Schooling:</strong> Candidates who have completed their secondary or senior secondary education through the <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"113\">National Institute of Open Schooling (NIOS)</strong> are fully eligible. As long as the degree or certification is recognized by the relevant statutory bodies, open-schooling backgrounds are treated with the same authority as traditional boards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Navigating the financial commitment of a professional degree requires a transparent understanding of both the immediate costs and the long-term fiscal strategies available to students. The MBA in Human Resource Management (HRM) for the 2026 academic session is structured to provide high-value management training with a focus on affordability and liquidity. By integrating student grants directly into the fee framework, the program lowers the entry barrier for high-potential candidates across the Indian subcontinent.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The current fee model is specifically tailored for applicants from <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"67\">India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</strong>, ensuring regional economic alignment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Fee Structure Table</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Amount</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Actual Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\">₹50,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Student Grant (20% Discount)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\">(₹9,600)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Applicable Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\">Included (₹2,000 value)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,5,1,0\">₹1,000 (Non-refundable)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Grant Expiry Date</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">9th May 2026</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment Preferences &amp; Strategic Financing</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">The program offers two distinct financial pathways to accommodate different cash flow requirements. Choosing between these is a strategic decision that affects a student\'s capital management throughout the two-year duration.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lumpsum (One-Time) Payment:</strong> This mode is designed for students who prefer a \"set and forget\" approach. By paying the full amount upfront, students mitigate the risk of future administrative changes or minor inflationary adjustments in processing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No-Cost EMI (Standard Preference):</strong> For those prioritizing monthly liquidity, the No-Cost EMI option allows the total fee to be divided into manageable installments. Unlike traditional educational loans, this \"Standard\" preference ensures that the student pays only the principal applicable fee of ₹40,400 without the burden of accruing interest.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The MBA in Human Resource Management (HRM) is structured as a progressive journey, moving from fundamental business competencies to specialized human capital strategies. The curriculum is meticulously designed to transform students into data-driven leaders who understand both the \"people\" and the \"profit\" sides of an organization. By integrating core management subjects like Economics and Finance with niche HR modules like Analytics and Labor Laws, the program ensures that graduates are not just HR practitioners, but strategic business partners.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The four-semester journey is balanced to provide foundational knowledge in the first year, followed by deep-dive specialization and practical application in the second year.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester-Wise Subject Breakdown</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following table outlines the rigorous academic path required to master the dual domains of general management and human resource dynamics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Syllabus Table</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Semester</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Course Code &amp; Subject Name</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Primary Learning Objective</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sem 1</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\">EACC506: Financial Reporting &amp; Analysis</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,1\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,2\">EECO515: Managerial Economics</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,3\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,4\">EMGN578: Intl. Business Environment</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,5\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,6\">EMKT503: Marketing Management</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,7\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,8\">EMGN581: OB &amp; HR Dynamics</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,2,0\">Building a global business foundation and understanding organizational psychology.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sem 2</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\">EFIN542: Corporate Finance</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,1\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,2\">EOPR639: Operations Research</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,3\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,4\">EMGN801: Business Analytics</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,5\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,6\">EMGN832: Research Methodology</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,7\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,8\">EBSL605: Legal Aspects of Business</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,9\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,10\">EPEL537: Communication for Leaders</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,2,0\">Transitioning into data-driven decision making and leadership communication.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sem 3</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\">EHRM511: Training &amp; Development</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,1\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,2\">EHRM516: Industrial Relations &amp; Labor Laws</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,3\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,4\">EHRM508: HR Metrics &amp; Analytics</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,5\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,6\">EMGN571: Strategy &amp; Entrepreneurship</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,7\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,8\">GE-I: Generic Elective I</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,9\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,10\">EMGN583: Summer Training Seminar</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,2,0\">Specialized HR execution, legal compliance, and corporate strategy alignment.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sem 4</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,0\">EHRM627: Talent Acquisition &amp; Planning</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,1\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,2\">EHRM515: Performance Management Systems</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,3\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,4\">EHRM519: Compensation Management</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,5\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,6\">GE-II: Generic Elective II</p>\r\n<br data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,7\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,8\">EMGN696: Capstone Project</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,2,0\">Mastery of the HR lifecycle and completion of a high-impact rese</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The transition from academic excellence to corporate leadership requires more than just a degree; it demands a robust support system designed to bridge the gap between classroom learning and industry expectations. LPU Online&rsquo;s placement support services are engineered to function as a career catalyst, focusing on a holistic enhancement of student capabilities. Rather than viewing placement as a final step, the university integrates career readiness into the very fabric of the MBA HRM journey, ensuring students are not only technically proficient but also \"corporate-ready\" from day one.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The placement framework is built on the pillars of awareness, motivation, and practical exposure, providing a structured pathway for students to navigate the competitive global job market.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Placement Services &amp; Support Framework</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">LPU Online employs a multi-dimensional approach to ensure that every MBA HRM graduate has access to high-growth career opportunities. The focus remains on aligning student skill sets with the specific, evolving requirements of the modern HR landscape.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Placement Support Components</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Service Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Key Offerings</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Strategic Impact</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Placement Drives</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\">Regular virtual and physical recruitment events with top-tier firms.</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,2,0\">Direct access to prospective employers and immediate job securing.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Enhancement</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\">Workshops on \"add-on\" skills beyond the core HRM syllabus.</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,2,0\">Increases marketability by filling the gap between theory and practice.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Career Counseling</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\">Personalized guidance on career paths and industry trends.</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,2,0\">Helps students align their specialization with long-term professional goals.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mock Interviews</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,0\">Simulated interview sessions and resume-building workshops.</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,2,0\">Builds confidence and ensures high performance during actual recruitment.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Employer Networking</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,1,0\">Interactive sessions with HR leaders and corporate veterans.</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,2,0\">Creates awareness of real-world organizational challenges and culture.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(240, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 226, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 01:40:50', '2026-06-16 06:13:36', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The admission process for the Diploma in Computer Application (DCA) is designed to be a seamless, digital-first experience that prioritizes transparency and student convenience. In the 2026 academic session, the university has refined this four-stage journey to ensure that aspiring technical professionals can transition from applicants to registered scholars without the friction of traditional administrative hurdles. This systematic approach allows students to secure their academic future while maintaining full visibility into their application status.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">By following this structured roadmap, candidates ensure they meet all regulatory requirements while locking in limited-time benefits, such as the <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"146\">20% Student Grant</strong> available for early applicants.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">DCA Admission Process: A Step-by-Step Explanatory Guide</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The enrollment cycle is divided into four distinct phases, each serving as a critical checkpoint to ensure academic and procedural integrity.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 1: Registration (The Initial Enrollment Stage)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">The first step in your technical journey is the <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">Registration</strong> phase. This is where you create your digital identity within the university\'s ecosystem. Candidates are required to sign up on the official admission portal and settle the initial <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"241\">₹1,000 non-refundable Registration Fee</strong>.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Impact:</strong> This step is vital because it activates your unique applicant profile, allowing the university to track your progress and providing you with a dedicated dashboard to manage the subsequent stages of your enrollment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 2: Online Application Form (Academic &amp; Financial Submission)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Once registered, you move into the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">Online Application Form</strong> stage. This is the most comprehensive part of the process where you provide the \"substance\" of your application.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detail Entry:</strong> You must fill in personal details and academic history, ensuring your <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"84\">10+2 credentials</strong> are accurately recorded.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Upload:</strong> You are required to upload high-resolution digital copies of your relevant academic documents and identity proofs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fee Payment:</strong> During this stage, you settle the applicable program fee. For the 2026 session, this is the <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"105\">₹20,400 semester fee</strong> (assuming the 20% grant is applied).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financing:</strong> Students often choose the <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">No-Cost EMI</strong> option at this stage to manage their finances strategically without interest overhead.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 3: Document Verification by University (The Audit Stage)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">After your submission, the university&rsquo;s admissions office initiates the <strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">Document Verification</strong> process. This is a \"behind-the-scenes\" phase where academic auditors review your credentials for eligibility compliance and document authenticity.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Wait:</strong> Candidates are advised to \"sit back and wait\" during this period. The university meticulously checks that 10+2 qualifications (including NIOS) meet the prescribed standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Purpose:</strong> This stage maintains the high-authority status of the DCA program by ensuring that every admitted student meets the rigorous standards required for technical management studies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 4: Student Registration &amp; LMS Activation (The Onboarding Stage)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">The final milestone is <strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">Student Registration and LMS Activation</strong>. Upon successful verification, your status changes from \"Applicant\" to \"Registered Student.\"</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Credentials:</strong> You will receive an automated email containing your unique login credentials for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"102\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Launch:</strong> Activating your LMS is the digital equivalent of entering your classroom. It grants you immediate access to your <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"130\">DCA Semester 1 modules</strong>, such as <em data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"162\">Fundamentals of IT</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"185\">Programming Methodology</em>, along with recorded lectures and digital libraries.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Summary of Admission Milestones</strong></h2>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"22\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Step</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Key Action Item</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,2,0\">Sign up and pay the <strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"20\">₹1,000</strong> initial fee to activate your profile.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Application Form</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,2,2,0\">Fill in details, pay the <strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"25\">₹20,400</strong> fee, and upload academic documents.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,3,2,0\">University audits your 10+2/equivalent records for authenticity.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Activation</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,4,2,0\">Receive email credentials and gain full access to study materials.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The Diploma in Computer Application (DCA) is strategically positioned as an entry-level professional qualification, designed to transition students from basic schooling into the technical workforce. Because the program focuses on building foundational IT competencies&mdash;ranging from office automation to web basics&mdash;the eligibility criteria are intentionally inclusive. This ensures that students from diverse academic backgrounds can pivot toward a career in technology without requiring a prior technical elective at the secondary level.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">As the digital economy matures, the demand for \"computer-literate\" professionals has shifted from a luxury to a baseline requirement. Meeting the eligibility for this program is the first step toward securing a role in this high-growth sector.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Eligibility Criteria for 2026</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The university maintains a clear and straightforward standard for admission into the DCA program. The focus is on ensuring that the candidate has completed a foundational level of higher secondary education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eligibility Matrix</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Criteria Type</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Requirement Details</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Academic</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">10+2 (Higher Secondary)</strong> in any stream (Science, Commerce, or Arts) or its equivalent qualification.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stream Flexibility</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\">No specific subject requirements (e.g., Math or Computer Science are not mandatory).</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Board Recognition</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\">Must be completed from a recognized Board/University.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Regulatory Note</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,0\">All conditions are subject to change as prescribed by the university authorities.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Pathways: NIOS and \"Appearing\" Candidates</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">One of the most critical aspects of the 2026 admission cycle is the flexibility offered to students who do not follow traditional academic timelines. This approach ensures that talent is not sidelined by administrative delays.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">NIOS and Open Schooling:</strong> Candidates who have completed their 10+2 through the <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">National Institute of Open Schooling (NIOS)</strong> or other recognized state open boards are fully eligible. The program treats these certifications with the same authority as traditional CBSE or ICSI boards, provided they are recognized by the appropriate regulatory bodies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Appearing Candidates:</strong> If you are currently <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">appearing for your Class 12 exams</strong>, you are eligible to apply for provisional admission. This is a vital strategic move, as it allows you to secure your seat.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">In an increasingly digitized global economy, a Diploma in Computer Application (DCA) serves as a foundational pillar for technical proficiency. This program is meticulously designed to transform computer literacy into professional competency, covering essential software tools, programming basics, and digital management. For many, this diploma is the primary gateway into the IT sector, providing the practical skills necessary to navigate modern workplace technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The financial structure for the 2026 session is engineered to be inclusive, ensuring that high-quality technical education remains accessible to students across the Indian subcontinent. By integrating significant grants and flexible payment modalities, the program prioritizes student success over administrative barriers.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">DCA Fee Structure &amp; Financial Incentives (2026 Session)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The fee framework is optimized for applicants from <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"51\">India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</strong>. To support early enrollment and technical upskilling, a substantial subsidy is currently available for a limited window.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Comprehensive Fee Breakdown Table</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Details</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\">₹25,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Student Grant (20% Discount)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\">(₹4,600)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Applicable Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹20,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,0\">Included (₹2,000 value per sem)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,1,0\">₹1,000 (One-time, Non-refundable)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Grant Validity Deadline</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">9th May 2026</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment Preferences and Financing</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Recognizing the diverse financial needs of students, the program offers two primary \"Standard\" payment preferences. Students can opt for a <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"139\">Lumpsum (One-Time Payment)</strong> to settle their dues immediately and focus entirely on their studies. Alternatively, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"255\">No-Cost EMI</strong> option allows for greater liquidity, enabling students to spread the ₹20,400 semester fee into manageable installments without incurring interest charges. This flexibility ensures that the pursuit of technical expertise does not create a financial burden.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The Diploma in Computer Application (DCA) is engineered to provide a robust technical foundation in an era defined by rapid digital transformation. The curriculum for the 2026 session is designed to move beyond basic computer literacy, focusing on core engineering principles, logical programming methodologies, and sophisticated data management. By balancing theoretical concepts like <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"386\">Discrete Structures</strong> with highly practical modules like <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"441\">Object-Oriented Programming</strong>, the program ensures that graduates possess the versatility required to adapt to evolving IT landscapes.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">This two-semester roadmap is meticulously structured to build confidence in technical execution while enhancing the \"soft skills\" and environmental awareness necessary for modern professional leadership.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Building the Logical and Technical Foundation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The first semester focuses on establishing a strong conceptual base in computing, logical reasoning, and professional communication. It is designed to take a student from basic awareness to technical proficiency.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fundamentals of Information Technology (ECAP170):</strong> This subject introduces students to the hardware-software paradigm. It covers the internal workings of digital systems, business software applications, and data handling, forming the essential base for all advanced computing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Programming Methodology (ECAP172):</strong> This module is critical for developing \"code-sense.\" It teaches the logic behind software creation, focusing on flowcharts, algorithms, and structured programming techniques that are universal across all coding languages.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Discrete Structures (EMTH136):</strong> Often considered the mathematical backbone of computer science, this subject builds analytical skills through logic, set theory, and combinatorics. It is essential for understanding how data is organized and processed at a granular level.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">English Communication Skills (EENG139):</strong> Recognizing that technical skill must be matched by clear expression, this course focuses on professional vocabulary, grammar, and the ability to articulate complex ideas in a corporate setting.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Environmental Sciences (ECHE110):</strong> This subject introduces the concept of sustainable technology. It educates future IT professionals on the ecological impact of digital waste and the importance of \"Green Computing\" in the modern world.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Advanced Technical Execution and Data Architecture</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">The second semester shifts the focus toward specialized domains such as database architecture, network security, and advanced programming paradigms, preparing students for immediate industry integration.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Database Management Systems (ECAP200):</strong> This course develops expertise in how large-scale data is stored, retrieved, and managed. It is a cornerstone for any role in IT, as it covers the SQL and architectural principles used by every major corporation globally.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Object-Oriented Programming (ECAP202):</strong> Moving beyond basic scripts, this subject introduces \"OOPs\" concepts like inheritance and polymorphism. This is the industry standard for developing complex, reusable, and scalable software applications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Computer Networks (ECAP256):</strong> Students explore the mechanics of global connectivity. This module covers the protocols, security measures, and hardware that allow devices to communicate, which is vital for any role in cybersecurity or system administration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Computer System Architecture (ECAP268):</strong> This subject provides an \"under-the-hood\" understanding of how processors, memory, and I/O devices interact. Understanding this architecture is crucial for optimizing software performance and hardware troubleshooting.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Advanced English Communication Skills (EENG140):</strong> The final communications module focuses on leadership-level interaction, including presentation skills, technical reporting, and negotiation strategies required for career advancement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The transition from a technical student to a corporate professional is a journey that requires more than just a certificate; it demands a robust support system engineered to bridge the gap between academic theory and industry application. LPU Online&rsquo;s placement support services for the Diploma in Computer Application (DCA) are designed as a <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"343\">career catalyst</strong>, focusing on a holistic enhancement of student capabilities. Rather than treating placement as an afterthought, the university integrates \"Placement Preparedness\" into the very fabric of the two-semester program.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The framework is built on the pillars of <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">awareness, motivation, and practical skill acquisition</strong>, ensuring that students are not only technically proficient in DBMS and Programming but also \"corporate-ready\" with the soft skills and specialized add-ons that modern employers demand.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Components of Placement Support Services</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">LPU Online employs a multi-dimensional approach to ensure graduates from the DCA program have access to high-growth career opportunities in the competitive IT sector.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Professional Enhancement Program (PEP)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">One of the most impactful initiatives is the <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">Professional Enhancement Program (PEP)</strong>. These workshops are meticulously designed to refine a student\'s employability index. PEP covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Aptitude &amp; Logical Reasoning:</strong> Essential for clearing the technical screening rounds of top-tier companies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Soft Skills &amp; Communication:</strong> Training in leadership-level interactions, as emphasized in the <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">EENG140 (Advanced English Communication)</strong> module.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Resume Building &amp; Mock Interviews:</strong> Simulated sessions that prepare students to articulate their technical knowledge (from OOPs to Computer Networks) under professional pressure.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Impactful Placement Drives</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">The university conducts high-impact <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"36\">Placement Drives</strong> that serve as direct conduits between students and prospective employers. These events allow students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Demonstrate Technical Prowess:</strong> Showcasing practical projects and programming methodologies learned during the course.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Interact with HR Leaders:</strong> Gaining real-world insights into the expectations of global IT giants and local tech startups.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Secure Promising Roles:</strong> Many eligible DCA students secure job offers or <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">PPO (Pre-Placement Offers)</strong> directly through these on-campus and virtual recruitment events.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Placement Service Matrix</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Service Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Key Offerings</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Strategic Impact</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recruitment Events</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\">Impactful Placement &amp; Internship Drives</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,2,0\">Direct access to top recruiters and immediate job securing.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Enhancement</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,0\">PEP Workshops &amp; Master Classes by Experts</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,2,0\">Closes the gap between traditional syllabus and industry needs.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Career Counseling</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,0\">Personalized psychometric assessments &amp; guidance</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,2,0\">Helps students align their DCA specialization with long-term goals.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Practice Platforms</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1,0\">Industry-grade portals (Examly, Hitbullseye)</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,2,0\">Prepares students for the actual difficulty level of technical rounds.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Alumni Advantage</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,5,1,0\">Networking with a 100k+ Alumni base</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,5,2,0\">Provides mentorship and internal referral opportunities in MNCs.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 50000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(241, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 239, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 02:11:02', '2026-06-16 06:14:21', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The admission process for the Master of Computer Applications (MCA) in Data Science is designed to be a fully structured, transparent, and student-friendly journey. In the 2026 academic cycle, the university has optimized this digital-first transition to ensure that technical aspirants can move from the initial inquiry to active learning without the friction of traditional administrative delays. This systematic onboarding ensures that your academic records are authenticated while you lock in critical financial benefits like the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"534\">20% Student Grant</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">By following this professional four-stage protocol, you ensure your place in a high-authority program that balances advanced machine learning theory with corporate data engineering.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step-by-Step Admission &amp; Enrollment Guide</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The enrollment journey is divided into clear, manageable stages that maintain academic authenticity and procedural integrity.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1: Registration (Initial Enrollment Stage)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">The first step in your data science career is the <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Registration</strong> phase. This is where you establish your digital presence within the university&rsquo;s admission ecosystem.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Candidates are required to sign up on the official admission portal and settle the initial <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"103\">₹1,000 non-refundable Registration Fee</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Importance:</strong> This step is crucial because it activates your unique applicant profile. It signals your intent to the admissions board and opens the secure gateway for document submission and fee management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2: Online Application Form (Academic Details Submission)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">After registration, you enter the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"34\">Online Application</strong> phase, which is the most comprehensive part of the onboarding process. This stage allows the university to evaluate your eligibility based on your graduation background.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Entry:</strong> You will provide your personal, contact, and academic details (ensuring your degree and <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"100\">Math/Computer background</strong> are clearly cited).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Selection:</strong> You will confirm your specialization in <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"59\">Data Science</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fee Payment:</strong> At this stage, you pay the program fee. For 2026, the applicable fee is <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"85\">₹32,400 per semester</strong> (inclusive of the 20% grant).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Upload:</strong> You must upload high-resolution scans of your graduation marksheets, identity proof, and certificates for any bridge course waivers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3: Document Verification by University</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Once your application and documents are submitted, the university begins the <strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">Audit &amp; Verification</strong> stage. This is a \"behind-the-scenes\" process where all submitted academic records and identity details are carefully reviewed.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">University Action:</strong> The admissions team ensures your credentials comply with university standards and regulatory norms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Student Action:</strong> You are not required to take any action here; simply \"sit back and wait.\" This step is essential to maintain the program\'s academic authenticity and ensure only eligible candidates are admitted into the elite Data Science cohort.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4: Student Registration &amp; LMS Activation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">The final stage of admission is the official <strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">Student Registration and LMS Activation</strong>. Once your documents are cleared, you are no longer an \"applicant\" but an \"enrolled scholar.\"</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Credentials:</strong> The university will provide your unique login credentials for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"83\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong> via your registered email.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Launch:</strong> Activating your LMS gives you immediate access to your <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">Semester 1 modules</strong>, such as <em data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"100\">Software Engineering Practices</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"135\">Data Warehousing</em>, allowing you to begin your academic journey and interact with global data science resources instantly.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Summary of Admission Milestones</strong></h2>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"22\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Step</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Key Action Item</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,2,0\">Sign up and pay the <strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"20\">₹1,000</strong> registration fee to activate your profile.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Application Form</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,2,2,0\">Fill in details, pay the <strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"25\">₹32,400</strong> semester fee, and upload documents.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,3,2,0\">University performs a rigorous audit of your graduation and math eligibility.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Activation</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"22,4,2,0\">Receive your credentials and gain full access to the learning ecosystem.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The Master of Computer Applications (MCA) in Data Science is a premier postgraduate specialization designed for the next generation of data architects. In 2026, the eligibility framework has been strategically broadened to welcome diverse academic backgrounds&mdash;ranging from Commerce and Arts to Engineering&mdash;ensuring that logical aptitude is prioritized over prior technical certification.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">By integrating a <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"17\">\"Bridge Course\"</strong> model, the university ensures that every student, regardless of their undergraduate stream, starts with a level playing field. This inclusive approach allows professionals from non-technical sectors to pivot into the high-growth field of Data Science, which is currently seeing a massive demand for over 11 million professionals in India alone.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Eligibility Criteria (2026 Session)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To secure admission into the MCA Data Science program, candidates must meet the following foundational requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b4c0b1731588a983-25\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-22\">Academic Qualification:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-22 citation-end-22\"> A Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any stream (B.E., B.Tech, B.Sc, B.Com, B.A., B.Voc, BCA, etc.) from a recognized university.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from Sri Sri University. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahgKEwj2qMn29ZmUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQxwM\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b4c0b1731588a983-26\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-21\">Minimum Marks:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-21\"> Typically, a minimum of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\"><span class=\"citation-21\">50% aggregate marks</span></strong><span class=\"citation-21 citation-end-21\"> (45% for reserved categories) in the qualifying graduation exam.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from Online Manipal. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahgKEwj2qMn29ZmUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQyAM\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b4c0b1731588a983-27\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-20\">Mathematics Requirement:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-20\"> Candidates should have studied Mathematics, Statistics, QT, or Business Mathematics at either the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"123\"><span class=\"citation-20\">10+2 level</span></strong><span class=\"citation-20\"> or during their </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"150\"><span class=\"citation-20\">Graduation</span></strong><span class=\"citation-20 citation-end-20\">.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from LPU. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahgKEwj2qMn29ZmUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQyQM\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<blockquote data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Note:</strong> Eligibility and admission criteria are subject to periodic updates as prescribed by the university to align with the latest UGC and industry standards.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Bridge Course Advantage: Pathways for Non-Technical Graduates</strong></h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b4c0b1731588a983-28\" data-path-to-node=\"12\"><span class=\"citation-19\">For candidates who do not meet the traditional Mathematics or Computer Science prerequisites, the university offers specialized </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"128\"><span class=\"citation-19\">Bridge Courses</span></strong><span class=\"citation-19 citation-end-19\">.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span> These are introductory modules designed to be completed alongside Semester 1 to build essential foundational knowledge.</p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from Dev Bhoomi Uttarakhand University. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahgKEwj2qMn29ZmUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQygM\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<p><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bridge Course Allocation Matrix</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Candidate Profile</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Required Bridge Course(s)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Strategic Outcome</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No Mathematics Background</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\">01 Mathematics Course</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,2,0\">Develops the statistical and algebraic logic required for Data Science models.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No Computer Background</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,0\">01 Computer Course</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,2,0\">Provides essential programming and hardware-software paradigm knowledge.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Non-Math &amp; Non-Computer</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3,1,0\">Both Math &amp; Computer Courses</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3,2,0\">A comprehensive foundation-building phase to ensure parity with technical peers.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">In the modern industrial landscape, data is the most valuable asset an organization possesses. An MCA in Data Science is a high-authority specialization designed to transform computer science graduates into elite data architects capable of extracting actionable insights from complex datasets. This program bridges the gap between advanced software engineering and statistical modeling, preparing students for leadership roles in AI, machine learning, and big data analytics.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The financial framework for the 2026 session is structured to be both transparent and accessible, ensuring that the next generation of data scientists can access world-class education without immediate financial strain. By integrating significant student grants and flexible financing, the program prioritizes academic merit and professional potential.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">MCA Data Science Fee Structure (2026 Session)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The fee model is specifically optimized for applicants from <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</strong>. The university has introduced a substantial subsidy for the current intake to promote specialized technical upskilling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Comprehensive Fee Breakdown Table</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Details</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\">₹40,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Student Grant (20% Discount)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\">(₹7,600)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Applicable Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹32,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,0\">Included (₹2,000 value per sem)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,1,0\">₹1,000 (One-time, Non-refundable)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Grant Validity Deadline</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">9th May 2026</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment Preferences and Financial Strategy</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Understanding the diverse economic backgrounds of technical aspirants, the program offers two primary \"Standard\" payment preferences. Students can choose a <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"156\">Lumpsum (One-Time Payment)</strong> to settle their semester dues upfront, ensuring a focus on their rigorous technical modules. Alternatively, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"295\">No-Cost EMI</strong> option provides a strategic advantage for those prioritizing liquidity; it allows the ₹32,400 fee to be distributed into manageable monthly installments without any interest overhead. This ensures that the pursuit of high-end data expertise remains financially sustainable.</p>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"13\">&nbsp;</h2>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The Master of Computer Applications (MCA) in Data Science is a high-authority postgraduate program designed to transform technical aspirants into elite data architects. In 2026, the curriculum has been meticulously engineered to balance core software engineering with advanced predictive modeling. This four-semester journey is not merely about learning to code; it is about mastering the \"Data Lifecycle\"&mdash;from initial ingestion and warehousing to complex machine learning and visual storytelling.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">By integrating rigorous mathematical foundations with modern toolkits like Python and Cloud Computing, the program ensures that graduates are prepared for the \"Super-Dream\" roles offered by global tech giants.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester-Wise Subject Breakdown: An Explanatory Guide</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The curriculum is structured to move from foundational computing to specialized data intelligence. Each semester serves as a building block for the next, ensuring a seamless transition into professional expertise.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Building the Technical Core</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">The first semester focuses on establishing a strong conceptual base in software practices, networking, and logical reasoning.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Software Engineering Practices (ECAP437):</strong> Introduces the methodologies used to design and maintain high-quality software systems, forming the backbone of corporate IT operations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Object Oriented Programming using C++ (ECAP444):</strong> Develops the logical thinking required for complex software development through classes, objects, and inheritance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Warehousing and Data Mining (ECAP446):</strong> A foundational subject for data science, focusing on how large datasets are cleaned, stored, and mined for patterns.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Linux and Shell Scripting (ECAP448) &amp; Data Communication (ECAP453):</strong> Provides the administrative and networking skills essential for managing server-side data operations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bridge Courses (ECAP012 &amp; EMTH006):</strong> Ensures students from non-technical backgrounds master C programming and elementary math before advancing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Scalability and Big Data Infrastructure</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">The second semester introduces the tools required to handle massive data scales and cloud-based environments.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Advanced Data Structures (ECAP770):</strong> Teaches the efficient organization of data, which is critical for optimizing search and retrieval algorithms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Introduction to Big Data (ECAP456) &amp; Cloud Computing (ECAP470):</strong> Explores the distributed systems and virtualized infrastructures that power modern giants like Amazon and Netflix.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mathematical Foundation (EMTH403):</strong> Bridges the gap between pure math and computer science logic, essential for cryptography and algorithm design.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Data Science Specialization and Analysis</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">This semester marks the deep dive into the specific toolkits and statistical methods that define a Data Scientist.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Programming in Python (ECAP776):</strong> Mastering the industry-standard language for data analysis and artificial intelligence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Probability and Statistics (ECAP790):</strong> The core engine of data science, providing the tools to make predictions and quantify uncertainty.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Science Tool Box (ECAP792):</strong> A practical dive into the libraries (like NumPy, Pandas, and Scikit-learn) used daily by professional analysts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Seminar on Summer Training (ECAP735):</strong> Allows students to bridge the gap between classroom theory and real-world industry problems encountered during internships.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Mastery, Machine Learning, and Integration</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">The final semester focuses on advanced predictive modeling and the demonstration of cumulative expertise through project work.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Machine Learning (ECAP737):</strong> The pinnacle of the program, teaching students how to build intelligent systems that learn from data.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Advance Data Visualization (ECAP794):</strong> Focuses on the art of \"Data Storytelling\"&mdash;transforming complex results into clear, interactive visuals for stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Work (ECAP788):</strong> A high-stakes capstone project where students solve a real-world problem, serving as a professional portfolio for placement drives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The leap from mastering complex machine learning algorithms to securing a leadership role in a global tech firm requires more than academic excellence; it demands a sophisticated support infrastructure. LPU Online&rsquo;s placement support services for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"251\">MCA in Data Science</strong> are engineered to function as a strategic career transformation engine. In the 2026 job market, where data literacy is the primary currency, the university integrates \"Industry Readiness\" into the core of the postgraduate experience.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The placement framework is built on a foundation of <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">capability enhancement, employer engagement, and specialized skill acquisition.</strong> This ensures that every MCA graduate is not just a coder, but a professional ready to solve real-world organizational challenges using data-driven intelligence.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Components of Placement Support Services</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">LPU Online employs a multi-dimensional strategy to connect MCA Data Science students with \"Super-Dream\" career opportunities across the globe.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Enhancement Program (PEP)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">Professional Enhancement Program (PEP)</strong> is a mandatory capability-building framework that runs alongside your technical semesters. It focuses on the non-technical facets of employability:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Aptitude &amp; Analytical Training:</strong> Preparing students for the rigorous screening tests of top-tier product companies like Google, Amazon, and Microsoft.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technical Interview Readiness:</strong> Deep-dive drills on <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"51\">Data Structures (ECAP770)</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">Machine Learning (ECAP737)</strong> logic, ensuring you can explain \"the why\" behind your models.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Communication for Data Storytelling:</strong> Since Data Scientists must influence stakeholders, PEP refines your ability to present complex insights to non-technical audiences.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Impactful Placement Drives &amp; Employer Interaction</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">The university bridges the gap between talent and demand through <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">Impactful Placement Drives</strong>. These are not merely recruitment fairs but strategic networking events where students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Demonstrate Portfolio Excellence:</strong> Using the <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"44\">Project Work (ECAP788)</strong> to show prospective employers functional solutions to industry problems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Interaction:</strong> Engaging with HR leaders and Technical Architects from Fortune 500 companies to understand the evolving tech stack requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Secure Global Roles:</strong> Facilitating opportunities for both domestic and international placements in high-growth hubs like Bangalore, Dublin, and Singapore.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Placement Service Matrix</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Service Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Key Offerings</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Strategic Impact</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recruitment Drives</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\">On-campus &amp; Virtual Placement Events</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,2,0\">Direct access to 500+ recruiters and immediate job securing.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Add-ons</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,0\">Industry Certifications (Cloud, AI, DevOps)</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,2,0\">Enhances the resume beyond the standard MCA syllabus.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mentorship</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,0\">One-on-One Career Counseling &amp; Alumni Interaction</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,2,0\">Provides a roadmap for specializing in niche areas like NLP or CV.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Assessment Tools</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1,0\">Access to platforms like Examly &amp; MyPerfectice</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,2,0\">Benchmarks your technical skills against global industry standards.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(243, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 216, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 03:02:59', '2026-06-16 06:14:45', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The admission framework for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">MBA in Business Analytics</strong> is engineered to be a streamlined, digital-first experience. In the 2026 academic cycle, the university has optimized this four-stage journey to ensure that aspiring data leaders can transition from candidates to scholars with maximum efficiency. This process is designed to maintain high academic standards while providing a clear roadmap for students to secure their seats and lock in early-bird financial benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step-by-Step Admission Roadmap (2026 Session)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The enrollment sequence is divided into four critical milestones. Each phase is an essential checkpoint to ensure both the candidate and the university are aligned for professional success.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Registration: Creating Your Digital Identity</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The journey begins with the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">Registration</strong> phase. This is the initial \"sign-up\" stage where you establish your presence in the university\'s management portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Applicants must register on the official portal and pay an initial, non-refundable <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"95\">Registration Fee of ₹1,000</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Purpose:</strong> This step creates your unique applicant ID, allowing you to track your status in real-time and ensuring you receive all critical updates regarding the 2026 intake.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Online Application: Document &amp; Fee Submission</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Once registered, you move into the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">Online Application</strong> phase. This is the most comprehensive step, where the \"substance\" of your application is submitted.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Entry:</strong> You will fill in your academic history (Bachelor\'s degree or CA/CS/CMA credentials) and personal details.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fee Payment:</strong> You will pay the applicable program fee. For the 2026 session, utilizing the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"90\">20% Student Grant</strong> brings this to <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"123\">₹40,400 per semester</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Upload:</strong> You must upload high-resolution digital copies of your qualifying certificates and identity proofs for official review.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Document Verification: Academic Audit</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">After submission, the university&rsquo;s admissions office initiates a rigorous <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Document Verification</strong> process.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Candidates are advised to \"sit back and wait\" as university auditors verify the authenticity of the uploaded documents against the prescribed eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Outcome:</strong> This stage ensures that the cohort consists of qualified professionals, maintaining the high-authority status of the MBA Business Analytics degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. LMS Activation: The Gateway to Learning</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">The final milestone is <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">Student Registration and LMS Activation</strong>. This marks your official transition from an applicant to a registered MBA student.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Credential Delivery:</strong> You will receive your unique login credentials for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong> via your registered email.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Immediate Access:</strong> Activating your LMS provides instant access to <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">Semester 1 modules</strong>, including <em data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"95\">Financial Reporting</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"119\">Managerial Economics</em>, allowing you to begin your analytical training immediately.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Admission Milestone Summary</strong></h2>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Stage</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Primary Requirement</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\">Sign up and pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">₹1,000</strong> to initiate the profile.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Application</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\">Fill details, pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"18\">₹40,400</strong>, and upload academic records.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,2,0\">University audit of bachelor\'s degree or professional titles.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Activation</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\">Receive <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"8\">LMS credentials</strong> and begin 2026 coursework.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The MBA in Business Analytics is strategically designed to be an inclusive program that welcomes high-aptitude professionals from various disciplines. In 2026, the eligibility framework recognizes that the most effective data-driven leaders often come from diverse backgrounds&mdash;be it the humanities, engineering, or specialized professional bodies like <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"352\">ICSI</strong> or <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"360\">ICAI</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">By offering multiple entry points, the university ensures that the program attracts individuals with strong analytical foundations, whether they were built through a traditional undergraduate degree or rigorous professional certifications. This cross-disciplinary approach is essential in the modern corporate world, where \"Business Analytics\" is no longer just a technical role but a core leadership requirement.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Eligibility Criteria for 2026</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To secure admission into the MBA Business Analytics program, candidates must fulfill at least one of the following high-authority academic criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree:</strong> A completed undergraduate degree in <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"55\">any discipline</strong> (e.g., B.Com, B.Sc, B.E., B.A., BBA, BCA, etc.) or an equivalent qualification from a recognized university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Company Secretary (CS):</strong> Candidates who have successfully completed the CS program from the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"91\">Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI)</strong> are eligible for direct admission.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Chartered Accountancy (CA):</strong> Qualified Chartered Accountants from the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"69\">Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI)</strong> meet the eligibility threshold.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cost &amp; Management Accountancy (CMA):</strong> Candidates who have completed the CMA program from the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"92\">Institute of Cost Accountants of India (ICAI)</strong> are fully eligible.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<blockquote data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Regulatory Note:</strong> Eligibility standards, admission criteria, and other conditions are subject to change as prescribed by the university to maintain alignment with UGC and industry mandates.</p>\r\n</blockquote>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">In a global economy increasingly dictated by Big Data, the MBA in Business Analytics stands as a high-authority credential for future-ready leaders. This program is engineered to transform management aspirants into data-driven decision-makers, bridging the gap between complex statistical modeling and high-level corporate strategy. By mastering tools for predictive analysis and data visualization, graduates become indispensable assets in sectors ranging from FinTech to Global Supply Chain Management.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The financial architecture for the 2026 intake is designed to be both transparent and accessible, ensuring that top-tier talent can focus on academic rigor rather than financial constraints. By integrating significant student grants and flexible interest-free financing, the program lowers the barrier to entry for the next generation of analysts.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">MBA Business Analytics Fee Structure (2026 Session)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The fee model is specifically optimized for applicants from <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</strong>. To promote data literacy at the leadership level, the university has introduced a substantial subsidy for the current cycle.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Comprehensive Fee Breakdown Table</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Details</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\">₹50,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Student Grant (20% Discount)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\">(₹9,600)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Applicable Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,0\">Included (₹2,000 value per sem)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,1,0\">₹1,000 (One-time, Non-refundable)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Grant Validity Deadline</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">9th May 2026</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment Preferences and Financial Strategy</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Recognizing the diverse financial profiles of postgraduate students, the program offers two primary \"Standard\" payment preferences. Students can choose a <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"154\">Lumpsum (One-Time Payment)</strong> to settle their semester dues upfront, streamlining their administrative journey. Alternatively, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"282\">No-Cost EMI</strong> option provides a strategic advantage for those prioritizing liquidity; it allows the ₹40,400 fee to be distributed into manageable monthly installments without any interest overhead. This ensures that a premier MBA remains a sustainable investment.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The MBA in Business Analytics curriculum is a specialized management framework designed to integrate core business leadership with advanced data intelligence. The four-semester journey transitions from foundational organizational dynamics to high-level functional analytics and big data architecture.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Management Frameworks</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The first semester establishes the essential building blocks of global business operations and economic logic.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Reporting, Statements, and Analysis (EACC506):</strong> Mastering the interpretation of fiscal data to assess corporate health.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Managerial Economics (EECO515):</strong> Applying economic theories to internal decision-making processes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Business Environment (EMGN578):</strong> Analyzing the global factors influencing cross-border commerce.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Marketing Management (EMKT503):</strong> Understanding consumer behavior and strategic market positioning.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Organisational Behaviour and HR Dynamics (EMGN581):</strong> Studying human psychology and structural efficiency within an organization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Analytical Foundations &amp; Business Law</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The second semester introduces technical research methods and the legal landscape of the corporate world.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Finance (EFIN542):</strong> Strategic management of capital, investments, and financial planning.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operations Management and Research (EOPR639):</strong> Optimizing supply chains and production workflows through mathematical modeling.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Analytics (EMGN801):</strong> The core introductory module for data-driven organizational strategy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Research Methodology (EMGN832):</strong> Systematic techniques for data collection and academic inquiry.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Legal Aspects of Business (EBSL605):</strong> Navigating the regulatory and contractual frameworks of industry.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Communication for Leaders (EPEL537):</strong> Refining executive presence and professional persuasion skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Advanced Predictive Modeling</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Semester three marks the transition into specialized analytical toolkits and entrepreneurial strategy.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Spreadsheet Modelling using Excel (EMGN551):</strong> Advanced quantitative analysis and financial modeling using professional Excel frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Predictive Analytics (EMGN534):</strong> Utilizing historical data to forecast future business trends and outcomes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Web and Social Media Analytics (EMKT507):</strong> Measuring and interpreting digital footprints to optimize online marketing ROI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Strategy and Entrepreneurship (EMGN571):</strong> High-level strategic planning and the mechanics of launching new ventures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Seminar on Summer Training (EMGN583):</strong> Professional reflection on industry internships (Optional: 1 Course from GE Basket 1).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective I (GE-I):</strong> Interdisciplinary subject selection for personalized academic growth.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Big Data &amp; Capstone Integration</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">The final semester focuses on the most advanced technical stacks in the data science domain and cumulative practical application.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Advance Data Visualization (ECAP782):</strong> Mastering tools to transform complex datasets into interactive, actionable visual narratives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Big Data Analytics (ECAB302):</strong> Managing and analyzing massive, unstructured data sets using modern computational frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Functional Analytics (EMKT535):</strong> Applying data science techniques specifically to marketing, finance, and HR functions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective II (GE-II):</strong> Further elective specialization to round out the professional profile.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capstone Project (EMGN696):</strong> A cumulative professional project where students solve a real-world business problem using the analytical tools mastered throughout the program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">In the data-centric economy of 2026, a degree is only as powerful as the career opportunities it unlocks. The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"110\">MBA in Business Analytics</strong> at LPU Online is paired with a sophisticated placement ecosystem designed to bridge the gap between academic theory and high-authority corporate roles. This support system is not a passive service but an active \"Career Catalyst\" that begins the moment you enroll.</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_728c30c9e92e412e-75\" data-path-to-node=\"4\">The placement framework is built on three strategic pillars: <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">Capability Enhancement</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"85\">Industry Awareness</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">Direct Recruitment</strong>. <span class=\"citation-108 citation-end-108\">By integrating real-world corporate requirements into the learning journey, the university ensures that graduates transition seamlessly into the global workforce as data-driven leaders.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from LPU. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahgKEwj2qMn29ZmUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ6AY\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<p><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Placement Support Services (2026 Roadmap)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">LPU Online&rsquo;s career services are engineered to move beyond traditional job search methods, focusing on the \"Total Preparedness\" of the candidate.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Impactful Placement Drives</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">The cornerstone of the placement cell is the <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">Impactful Placement Drive</strong>. These events are curated to offer students direct access to prospective employers.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">High-End Networking:</strong> Opportunity to interact with hiring managers from Fortune 500 companies and high-growth startups.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Demonstration:</strong> Platforms for students to showcase their proficiency in <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">Predictive Analytics</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"99\">Big Data</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"113\">Spreadsheet Modelling</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Targeted Roles:</strong> Focused recruitment for specialized roles like Analytics Manager, Data Strategist, and Business Intelligence Consultant.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Capability &amp; Skill Enhancement</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">The 2026 corporate market demands \"Add-on Skills\" that go beyond the standard curriculum. LPU Online motivates students to acquire these through:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">PEP (Professional Enhancement Program):</strong> Specialized workshops on aptitude, logical reasoning, and soft skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Leadership Communication:</strong> Refined training in <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"46\">Communication for Leaders (EPEL537)</strong> to ensure students can present complex data insights to executive boards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_728c30c9e92e412e-76\" data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mock Recruitment Cycles:</strong><span class=\"citation-107 citation-end-107\"> Simulated interviews and group discussions that mimic the actual hiring processes of top recruiters like Amazon, Google, and Deloitte.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from LPU. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahgKEwj2qMn29ZmUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ6QY\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Placement Performance Snapshot (2025-26 Session)</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Metric</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Placement Highlights</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Highest Salary Package</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\">₹49.4 Lakh</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Top 10% Average Package</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,0\">₹13.6 Lakh</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recruiters on Campus</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,0\">450+ Leading Global Brands</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dream &amp; Super Dream Offers</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1,0\">650+ Opportunities</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(244, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 227, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 03:51:58', '2026-06-16 06:17:17', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The admission framework for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">MBA in Marketing</strong> is designed as a streamlined, digital-first experience. For the 2026 academic cycle, the university has optimized this four-stage journey to ensure that aspiring brand leaders and strategists can transition from candidates to scholars with maximum efficiency. This process maintains high academic standards while providing a transparent roadmap for students to secure their seats and lock in early-bird financial benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step-by-Step Admission Roadmap (2026 Session)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The enrollment sequence is divided into four critical milestones. Each phase serves as a checkpoint to ensure the candidate is fully prepared for the rigors of high-stature management training.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Registration: Creating Your Digital Identity</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The journey begins with the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">Registration</strong> phase, which establishes your presence in the university\'s management portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Applicants sign up on the official portal and pay an initial, non-refundable <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"89\">Registration Fee of ₹1,000</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Purpose:</strong> This step generates your unique applicant ID, allowing you to track your admission status in real-time and ensuring you receive all critical updates regarding the 2026 intake.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Online Application: Document &amp; Fee Submission</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Once registered, you move into the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">Online Application</strong> phase. This is the core of the enrollment process.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Entry:</strong> You will input your academic history&mdash;including your Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or professional credentials like CA, CS, or CMA&mdash;and personal details.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fee Payment:</strong> You will settle the program fee. For the 2026 session, utilizing the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">20% Student Grant</strong> brings the applicable fee to <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">₹40,400 per semester</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Upload:</strong> You must upload high-resolution digital copies of your academic certificates and identity proofs for official audit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Document Verification: Academic Audit</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">After submission, the university&rsquo;s admissions office initiates a thorough <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Document Verification</strong> process.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Candidates are advised to \"sit back and wait\" while university auditors verify the authenticity of the submitted documents against the prescribed eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Outcome:</strong> This stage ensures the cohort consists of qualified professionals, maintaining the integrity and authority of the MBA Marketing degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. Student Registration and LMS Activation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">The final milestone is <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">LMS Activation</strong>, marking your official transition into a registered MBA student.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Credential Delivery:</strong> You will receive your unique login credentials for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong> via your registered email.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Immediate Access:</strong> Activating your LMS provides instant access to <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">Semester 1 modules</strong>, such as <em data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Marketing Management</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">Managerial Economics</em>, allowing you to begin your leadership training immediately.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Admission Milestone Summary</strong></h2>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Stage</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Primary Requirement</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\">Sign up and pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">₹1,000</strong> to initiate the profile.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Application</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\">Fill details, pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"18\">₹40,400</strong>, and upload academic records.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,2,0\">University audit of eligibility and documents.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Activation</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\">Receive <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"8\">LMS credentials</strong> and begin 2026 coursework.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Marketing</strong> is designed to be an inclusive yet rigorous program, catering to both traditional graduates and high-level professional practitioners. The 2026 eligibility criteria are structured to recognize diverse academic foundations, ensuring that the cohort comprises individuals with the analytical and strategic potential required for global brand leadership.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">By offering multiple entry pathways&mdash;including recognition for professional certifications&mdash;the university ensures that experts from legal, financial, and management backgrounds can transition seamlessly into the marketing domain.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Eligibility Pathways (2026 Session)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To qualify for admission into the MBA Marketing program, a candidate must fulfill <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">at least one</strong> of the following academic or professional requirements:</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Undergraduate Qualification</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree:</strong> Completion of a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"56\">any discipline</strong> (such as B.A., B.Sc., B.Com, B.E., B.Tech, BBA, etc.) or an equivalent qualification from a recognized university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Discipline Neutrality:</strong> Because modern marketing is inherently interdisciplinary, the university welcomes applicants from various academic backgrounds, provided they possess a foundational degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Professional Titleholders (CS/CA/CMA)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The university grants academic equivalence to specific professional qualifications issued by statutory bodies in India. Qualified professionals in these categories are eligible for direct entry:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Company Secretary (CS):</strong> Candidates who have successfully completed the CS program from the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"91\">Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Chartered Accountancy (CA):</strong> Candidates who have completed the CA program from the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cost &amp; Management Accountancy (CMA):</strong> Candidates who have completed the CMA program from the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"92\">Institute of Cost Accountants of India (ICAI)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Regulatory &amp; Institutional Compliance</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The eligibility framework is governed by the following institutional guidelines to maintain the high-authority status of the management degree:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dynamic Criteria:</strong> Eligibility standards, admission criteria, and other specific conditions mentioned herein are <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"112\">subject to change</strong> as prescribed by the university. This ensures the program remains in alignment with evolving regulatory mandates (such as UGC) and industry expectations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Verification:</strong> All candidates, regardless of their pathway, must undergo a formal <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"90\">Document Verification</strong> process. This involves auditing digital copies of degree certificates or professional memberships to confirm authenticity before admission is finalized.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Marketing</strong> is designed to produce high-authority brand strategists and market leaders. To ensure this professional path is accessible, the 2026 financial framework incorporates strategic subsidies and flexible payment preferences. This transparent fee structure allows students to manage their investment effectively while focusing on mastering global consumer dynamics and digital brand management.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The fee schedule outlined below is specifically tailored for applicants from <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</strong>, ensuring regional affordability for the South Asian management cohort.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Fee Breakdown &amp; Student Grant</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">For the 2026 academic session, the university has implemented a significant <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">Student Grant</strong> to support aspiring marketing professionals. This grant is a direct reduction in the standard tuition cost, provided the enrollment milestones are met within the stipulated timeframe.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Amount / Details</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\">₹50,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Student Grant (20% Discount)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\">(₹9,600)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Applicable Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Grant Validity</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\">Valid until <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">9th May 2026</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5,1,0\">₹2,000 (Included in the semester fee)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,6,1,0\">₹1,000 (One-time, Non-refundable)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment Preferences &amp; Flexible Financing</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">To accommodate diverse financial planning needs, students can choose between various payment modes and preferences. These options are engineered to provide liquidity and reduce the immediate financial burden of postgraduate education.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Payment Preferences</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No-Cost EMI:</strong> A strategic financing option that allows students to break down the semester fee into monthly installments without incurring any interest charges. This is the preferred mode for students looking to maintain monthly cash flow.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard:</strong> The traditional payment route for those who do not require installment-based financing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Fee &amp; Payment Types</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester vs. Lumpsum:</strong> While the standard structure is based on a <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">Semester</strong> cycle, students may opt for <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"102\">Lumpsum</strong> payments depending on their long-term financial strategy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Payment vs. EMI:</strong> Students can settle the entire applicable fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"75\">₹40,400</strong> in a single transaction or utilize the <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"122\">EMI</strong> facility to distribute the cost over the duration of the semester.</p>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Critical Enrollment Terms &amp; Conditions</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Regional Applicability:</strong> The discounted rate of <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"47\">₹40,400</strong> is strictly applicable to students residing in the specified South Asian regions (India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inclusive Examination Costs:</strong> The semester fee is transparent and inclusive of the <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">₹2,000 examination fee</strong>, ensuring there are no hidden recurring costs during the academic year.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Threshold:</strong> Every applicant must settle an initial <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"63\">₹1,000 registration fee</strong>. This fee is non-refundable and is mandatory to activate the student profile and secure the 20% grant.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Deadline Sensitivity:</strong> The 20% Student Grant is time-bound. To benefit from the reduced fee, all admission formalities and initial payments must be completed by <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"160\">9th May 2026</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Marketing</strong> is a strategic management program engineered to build high-stature brand leaders. The four-semester curriculum balances foundational business intelligence with specialized technical expertise in digital ecosystems, consumer psychology, and integrated sales strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Foundations of Management &amp; Economic Logic</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The first semester establishes the essential pillars of corporate administration and the global economic environment.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Reporting, Statements, and Analysis (EACC506):</strong> Focuses on interpreting accounting standards and analyzing corporate financial reports for strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Managerial Economics (EECO515):</strong> The application of microeconomic theories to solve managerial problems and optimize firm resources.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Business Environment (EMGN578):</strong> Analyzing global trade theories and the PESTLE factors influencing cross-border operations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Marketing Management (EMKT503):</strong> Core frameworks for market segmentation, targeting, and the strategic marketing mix.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Organisational Behaviour and HR Dynamics (EMGN581):</strong> Exploring human behavior in workplace structures, focusing on leadership, motivation, and team performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Operational Intelligence &amp; Leadership</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">The second semester transitions into the technical research methodologies and legal frameworks that govern modern industry.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Finance (EFIN542):</strong> Strategic management of capital, resource allocation, and shareholder wealth maximization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operations Management and Research (EOPR639):</strong> Utilizing quantitative models to streamline supply chains and production efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Analytics (EMGN801):</strong> The core introduction to leveraging data as a strategic tool for organizational success.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Research Methodology (EMGN832):</strong> Systematic training in data collection, hypothesis testing, and academic proposal writing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Legal Aspects of Business (EBSL605):</strong> Navigating contract law, company statutes, and the regulatory environment of commercial transactions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Communication for Leaders (EPEL537):</strong> Refining executive presence, persuasive messaging, and professional storytelling for board-level impact.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Consumer Intelligence &amp; Digital Strategy</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">Semester three marks the deep dive into specialized marketing verticals and the psychological triggers of market demand.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Consumer Behaviour (EMKT529):</strong> Analyzing the psychological and sociological factors that drive purchasing decisions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital and Social Media Marketing (EMKT525):</strong> Mastering the digital ecosystem, including SEO, SEM, and strategic social media engagement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Customer Relationship Management (EMKT527):</strong> Strategies for building long-term brand loyalty and managing the lifecycle of a customer.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Strategy and Entrepreneurship (EMGN571):</strong> High-level strategic management and the mechanics of launching innovative business ventures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Seminar on Summer Training (EMGN583):</strong> Practical application and professional reflection on industry internships (Optional: 1 Course from GE Basket 1).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective I (GE-I):</strong> Interdisciplinary elective selection for personalized career niche development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Advanced Integrated Marketing &amp; Capstone</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">The final semester focuses on practical execution, service-led strategy, and cumulative project synthesis.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sales and Distribution Management (EMKT619):</strong> Planning and managing sales force operations and complex distribution networks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Integrated Marketing Communication (EMKT518):</strong> Designing a unified brand message across advertising, PR, and promotional channels.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Services Marketing (ECOM268):</strong> Specialized strategies for intangible products, focusing on service quality and customer satisfaction.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective II (GE-II):</strong> Final elective specialization to round out the professional profile.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capstone Project (EMGN696):</strong> A comprehensive, real-world project where students solve a complex marketing challenge using the full suite of tools mastered during the program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">In the competitive landscape of 2026, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">MBA in Marketing</strong> at LPU Online provides more than just a degree; it offers a comprehensive professional launchpad. The placement support services are strategically engineered to align student capabilities with the precise requirements of the global marketing industry. By fostering a culture of continuous skill acquisition and direct industry engagement, the university ensures that graduates are not just \"job-ready\" but \"leadership-ready.\"</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The placement framework is designed to move students beyond theoretical knowledge, motivating them to acquire high-authority add-on skills that distinguish them in the corporate marketplace.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Placement Support Services (2026 Framework)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The career services department operates through a multi-dimensional approach to ensure every student has a pathway to a high-ROI professional role.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Impactful Placement Drives</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">LPU Online makes a dedicated effort to bridge the gap between academic completion and professional employment through localized and virtual recruitment events.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Employer Interaction:</strong> These drives provide a high-stature platform for students to interact directly with prospective global and national employers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Demonstration:</strong> Students are given the opportunity to present their expertise in <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">Digital Marketing</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"105\">Consumer Behaviour</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">Corporate Strategy</strong> to hiring managers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Diverse Opportunities:</strong> Recruitment cycles are tailored to secure promising job roles across sectors including FMCG, E-commerce, Financial Services, and Tech.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Capability &amp; Skill Enhancement</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">To meet the evolving demands of the 2026 market, the university focuses on \"Total Professional Readiness.\"</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Beyond the Syllabus:</strong> Motivation and resources are provided to acquire specialized certifications and add-on skills that complement the core MBA modules.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Career Awareness:</strong> Regular workshops and seminars are conducted to keep students informed about emerging marketing trends, such as AI-driven consumer insights and sustainable branding.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Interview Preparedness:</strong> Targeted support in refining soft skills, executive presence, and professional communication to ensure success during the recruitment process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Career Outcomes in Marketing</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Participation in the placement ecosystem prepares students for high-authority roles that command significant industry respect and competitive compensation.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Marketing Strategist:</strong> Designing long-term growth roadmaps for global brands.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sales &amp; Distribution Manager:</strong> Leading complex supply chains and high-performance sales teams.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Growth Lead:</strong> Managing multi-channel digital campaigns to maximize market share.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Service Excellence Manager:</strong> Specializing in customer experience and service-led brand loyalty.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"19\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Enrollment Advantage: Securing Your Future</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">To maximize the ROI of your MBA Marketing journey, students are encouraged to leverage the <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"91\">20% Student Grant</strong>, which reduces the applicable semester fee to <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"155\">₹40,400</strong>. This grant is a strategic financial tool valid until <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"217\">9th May 2026</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Path to Success:</strong></h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"22\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Early Enrollment:</strong> Securing the grant before the May deadline.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Engagement:</strong> Immediate access to <strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"36\">Semester 1</strong> modules upon activation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Active Placement Participation:</strong> Engaging with the career cell from the early stages of the program to build a professional profile that resonates with 2026 recruiters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(245, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 138, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 04:07:02', '2026-06-16 06:19:58', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The admission framework for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">MBA in Digital Marketing</strong> is designed as a streamlined, digital-first experience. For the 2026 academic cycle, the university has optimized this four-stage journey to ensure that aspiring digital strategists can transition from candidates to scholars with maximum efficiency. This process maintains high academic standards while providing a transparent roadmap for students to secure their seats and lock in early-bird financial benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step-by-Step Admission Roadmap (2026 Session)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The enrollment sequence is divided into four critical milestones. Each phase serves as a checkpoint to ensure the candidate is fully prepared for the rigors of high-stature management training in the digital domain.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Registration: Creating Your Digital Identity</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The journey begins with the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">Registration</strong> phase, which establishes your presence in the university\'s management portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Applicants sign up on the official portal and pay an initial, non-refundable <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"89\">Registration Fee of ₹1,000</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Purpose:</strong> This step generates your unique applicant ID, allowing you to track your admission status in real-time and ensuring you receive all critical updates regarding the 2026 intake.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Online Application: Document &amp; Fee Submission</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Once registered, you move into the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">Online Application</strong> phase. This is the core of the enrollment process where your academic and financial foundations are set.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Entry:</strong> You will input your academic history&mdash;including your Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or professional credentials like CA, CS, or CMA&mdash;and personal details.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fee Payment:</strong> You will settle the program fee. For the 2026 session, utilizing the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">20% Student Grant</strong> brings the applicable fee to <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">₹40,400 per semester</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Upload:</strong> You must upload high-resolution digital copies of your academic certificates and identity proofs for official audit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Document Verification: Academic Audit</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">After submission, the university&rsquo;s admissions office initiates a thorough <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Document Verification</strong> process.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Candidates are advised to \"sit back and wait\" while university auditors verify the authenticity of the submitted documents against the prescribed eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Outcome:</strong> This stage ensures the cohort consists of qualified professionals, maintaining the integrity and authority of the MBA Digital Marketing degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. Student Registration and LMS Activation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">The final milestone is <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">LMS Activation</strong>, marking your official transition into a registered MBA student.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Credential Delivery:</strong> You will receive your unique login credentials for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong> via your registered email.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Immediate Access:</strong> Activating your LMS provides instant access to <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">Semester 1 modules</strong>, such as <em data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Foundation of Digital Marketing</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">Marketing Management</em>, allowing you to begin your leadership training immediately.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Admission Milestone Summary</strong></h2>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Stage</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Primary Requirement</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\">Sign up and pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">₹1,000</strong> to initiate the profile.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Application</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\">Fill details, pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"18\">₹40,400</strong>, and upload academic records.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,2,0\">University audit of eligibility and documents.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Activation</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\">Receive <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"8\">LMS credentials</strong> and begin 2026 coursework.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Digital Marketing</strong> is designed to attract a diverse cohort of professionals capable of navigating the complex intersection of technology and consumer psychology. The 2026 eligibility framework is intentionally broad, recognizing that high-stature digital leaders can emerge from various academic and professional backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Whether you are a traditional graduate or a certified professional from the legal or financial sectors, the program offers a clear pathway to transition into the high-growth digital economy.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Eligibility Pathways</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To qualify for the 2026 intake, applicants must meet <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">at least one</strong> of the following requirements:</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Undergraduate Degree Qualification</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree:</strong> Completion of a degree in <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">any discipline</strong> (e.g., B.Tech, B.Com, B.A., B.Sc., BBA) or an equivalent qualification from a recognized institution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Interdisciplinary Entry:</strong> The university encourages applicants from diverse fields&mdash;from engineering to humanities&mdash;recognizing that unique perspectives are vital for innovative digital strategies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Professional Certification Route</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The university grants academic equivalence to prestigious professional certifications. You are eligible if you have successfully completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Company Secretary (CS):</strong> From the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Chartered Accountancy (CA):</strong> From the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cost &amp; Management Accountancy (CMA):</strong> From the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"46\">Institute of Cost Accountants of India (ICAI)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Regulatory Compliance &amp; Institutional Policy</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Subject to Revision:</strong> It is important to note that <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">eligibility criteria, admission conditions, and program requirements</strong> are subject to change as prescribed by the university. This ensures the program remains aligned with the latest educational regulations and industry standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification Standards:</strong> All applicants must undergo <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">Document Verification (Step 3)</strong>, where digital copies of degrees or professional memberships are audited for authenticity to maintain the program\'s academic integrity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Investing in an <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">MBA in Digital Marketing</strong> is a strategic move toward mastering the modern attention economy. To facilitate this professional transition, the 2026 fee structure is designed with transparency and flexibility at its core. By offering significant grants and interest-free payment plans, the university ensures that high-stature management education remains accessible to the next generation of digital strategists.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The financial framework detailed below is specifically optimized for applicants from <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"85\">India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</strong>, reflecting a commitment to regional academic growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fee Breakdown &amp; The 20% Student Grant</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">For the current enrollment cycle, students can benefit from a substantial <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Student Grant</strong>, which significantly lowers the capital investment required for the program.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Amount / Details</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\">₹50,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Student Grant (20% Savings)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\">(₹9,600)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Applicable Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Grant Deadline</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\">Valid until <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">9th May 2026</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5,1,0\">₹2,000 (Integrated into the semester fee)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,6,1,0\">₹1,000 (One-time, non-refundable)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment Preferences &amp; Financing Options</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">To cater to diverse financial profiles, the university offers multiple payment modes. These are engineered to provide students with liquidity and ease of planning throughout the four-semester duration.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Payment Preferences</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No-Cost EMI:</strong> A high-value financing option allowing students to distribute the semester fee into monthly installments without any additional interest burden.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard:</strong> The traditional direct payment method for applicants who prefer immediate settlement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Fee &amp; Payment Types</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester vs. Lumpsum:</strong> While the core structure is <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Semester</strong>-based, students have the option to pay a <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"100\">Lumpsum</strong> amount to simplify their financial records.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Payment vs. EMI:</strong> Choose between settling the total applicable fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">₹40,400</strong> at once or opting for <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"108\">EMI</strong> to manage monthly cash flows effectively.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Digital Marketing</strong> is a high-authority program engineered to blend traditional management excellence with cutting-edge technical expertise. The four-semester curriculum is designed to transform students into data-driven strategists capable of navigating the complex global digital ecosystem.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The syllabus moves strategically from foundational business intelligence in the first year to deep-tier digital specialization and capstone execution in the final year.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Management Foundations &amp; Economic Logic</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The first semester focuses on building the essential pillars of corporate administration and understanding the global economic environment.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Reporting, Statements, and Analysis (EACC506):</strong> Mastering the interpretation of corporate financial data to drive fiscal strategy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Managerial Economics (EECO515):</strong> Applying economic theories to solve internal business challenges and resource optimization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Business Environment (EMGN578):</strong> Analyzing the PESTLE factors and trade policies that govern global market entry.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Marketing Management (EMKT503):</strong> Core frameworks for brand positioning, segmentation, and the strategic marketing mix.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Organisational Behaviour and HR Dynamics (EMGN581):</strong> Understanding workplace psychology, leadership styles, and human capital management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Operational Research &amp; Executive Presence</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The second semester introduces technical research methods, data tools, and the legal landscape of modern business.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Finance (EFIN542):</strong> Strategic management of an organization\'s capital structure and investment evaluation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operations Management and Research (EOPR639):</strong> Using quantitative models to optimize production and supply chain efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Analytics (EMGN801):</strong> The gateway into leveraging data sets for actionable business intelligence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Research Methodology (EMGN832):</strong> Systematic training in data collection, hypothesis testing, and academic inquiry.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Legal Aspects of Business (EBSL605):</strong> Navigating the laws of contracts, intellectual property, and corporate governance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Communication for Leaders (EPEL537):</strong> Advanced training in professional persuasion, executive storytelling, and board-level communication.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Digital Specialization &amp; Search Strategy</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Semester three marks the transition into technical digital domains, focusing on organic growth and social engagement.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Foundation of Digital Marketing (EMKT804):</strong> A comprehensive overview of the digital landscape and multi-channel marketing integration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Social Media Marketing (EMKT805):</strong> Strategic planning and execution of brand narratives across global social platforms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Search Engine Optimization (EMKT806):</strong> Mastering the technical and content-driven aspects of organic search ranking and visibility.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Strategy and Entrepreneurship (EMGN571):</strong> High-level strategic planning combined with the mechanics of scaling new digital ventures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Seminar on Summer Training (EMGN583):</strong> Practical application and reflection on industry internships (Optional: 1 Course from GE Basket).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective I (GE-I):</strong> An interdisciplinary elective choice to tailor the degree to specific career goals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Advanced Paid Media &amp; Strategic Synthesis</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">The final semester focuses on paid acquisition, data interpretation, and the cumulative application of all analytical skills.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Online Advertising (MKTM807):</strong> Deep dive into PPC, programmatic buying, and performance marketing across display and video networks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Web and Social Media Analytics (EMKT507):</strong> Utilizing advanced tools to track consumer behavior and measure digital ROI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Marketing Strategy (EMKT533):</strong> The final synthesis of digital tools into a cohesive, high-level corporate growth strategy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective II (GE-II):</strong> Final specialization elective to round out the professional profile.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capstone Project (EMGN696):</strong> A culminating project where students solve a complex, real-world digital challenge using their full analytical toolkit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">In the rapidly evolving landscape of 2026, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"47\">MBA in Digital Marketing</strong> at LPU Online provides more than just a credential; it offers a comprehensive professional launchpad. The placement support services are strategically engineered to align student capabilities with the precise requirements of the global digital industry. By fostering a culture of continuous skill acquisition and direct industry engagement, the university ensures that graduates are not just \"job-ready\" but \"leadership-ready.\"</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The placement framework is designed to move students beyond theoretical knowledge, motivating them to acquire high-authority add-on skills&mdash;such as advanced data visualization and AI-driven consumer modeling&mdash;that distinguish them in the corporate marketplace.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Placement Support Services (2026 Roadmap)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The career services department operates through a multi-dimensional approach to ensure every student has a clear pathway to a high-ROI professional role.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Impactful Placement Drives</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">LPU Online makes a dedicated effort to bridge the gap between academic completion and professional employment through high-stakes recruitment events.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Employer Interaction:</strong> These drives provide a high-stature platform for students to interact directly with prospective global and national employers from the tech, retail, and media sectors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Demonstration:</strong> Students are given the opportunity to present their technical proficiency in <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"98\">Search Engine Optimization (SEO)</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"132\">Web Analytics</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"151\">Social Media Strategy</strong> to hiring managers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Diverse Job Prospects:</strong> Recruitment cycles are tailored to secure promising job roles, ranging from niche agency positions to corporate digital leadership.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Capability &amp; Skill Enhancement</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">To meet the specific demands of the 2026 market, the university focuses on \"Total Professional Readiness.\"</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Add-on Skills Acquisition:</strong> Students are motivated to acquire certifications and skills outside their core subjects, ensuring a versatile professional profile.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Market Awareness:</strong> Regular sessions are conducted to create awareness about shifting digital trends and the specific talent requirements of Fortune 500 companies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Interview Preparedness:</strong> Targeted support in refining executive presence and professional communication ensures students can effectively pitch their digital expertise to top-tier recruiters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Career Outcomes in Digital Marketing</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Participation in the placement ecosystem prepares students for high-authority roles that command significant industry respect and competitive compensation.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Performance Marketing Manager:</strong> Driving high-ROI growth through data-backed ad strategies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Brand Strategist:</strong> Crafting unified brand narratives across complex online ecosystems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">E-commerce Specialist:</strong> Managing the end-to-end digital sales funnel for major retail brands.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Content Growth Lead:</strong> Overseeing organic traffic growth and engagement strategies for global platforms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"19\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Enrollment Advantage: Securing Your Professional Future</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">To maximize the ROI of your MBA Digital Marketing journey, students are encouraged to leverage the <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"99\">20% Student Grant</strong>, which reduces the applicable semester fee to <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"163\">₹40,400</strong>. This grant is a strategic financial tool valid until <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"225\">9th May 2026</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Path to Career Success:</strong></h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"22\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Early Enrollment:</strong> Secure the grant before the May deadline to maximize your educational ROI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Engagement:</strong> Gain immediate access to <strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">Semester 1</strong> modules upon activation to start building your technical foundation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Active Placement Participation:</strong> Engage with the career cell from the early stages of the program to build a professional profile that resonates with 2026 digital recruiters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 300000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(246, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 240, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 04:29:39', '2026-06-16 06:20:39', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The admission framework for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">MBA in Data Science</strong> is designed as a streamlined, digital-first experience. For the 2026 academic cycle, the university has optimized this four-stage journey to ensure that aspiring data leaders and analysts can transition from candidates to scholars with maximum efficiency. This process maintains high academic standards while providing a transparent roadmap for students to secure their seats and lock in early-bird financial benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step-by-Step Admission Roadmap (2026 Session)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The enrollment sequence is divided into four critical milestones. Each phase serves as a checkpoint to ensure the candidate is fully prepared for the rigors of high-stature management training in the data domain.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Registration: Creating Your Digital Identity</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The journey begins with the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">Registration</strong> phase, which establishes your presence in the university\'s management portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Applicants sign up on the official portal and pay an initial, non-refundable <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"89\">Registration Fee of ₹1,000</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Purpose:</strong> This step generates your unique applicant ID, allowing you to track your admission status in real-time and ensuring you receive all critical updates regarding the 2026 intake.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Online Application: Document &amp; Fee Submission</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Once registered, you move into the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">Online Application</strong> phase. This is the core of the enrollment process where your academic and financial foundations are set.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Entry:</strong> You will input your academic history&mdash;including your Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or professional credentials like CA, CS, or CMA&mdash;and personal details.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fee Payment:</strong> You will settle the program fee. For the 2026 session, utilizing the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">20% Student Grant</strong> brings the applicable fee to <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">₹40,400 per semester</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Upload:</strong> You must upload high-resolution digital copies of your academic certificates and identity proofs for official audit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Document Verification: Academic Audit</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">After submission, the university&rsquo;s admissions office initiates a thorough <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Document Verification</strong> process.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Candidates are advised to \"sit back and wait\" while university auditors verify the authenticity of the submitted documents against the prescribed eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Outcome:</strong> This stage ensures the cohort consists of qualified professionals, maintaining the integrity and authority of the MBA Data Science degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. Student Registration and LMS Activation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">The final milestone is <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">LMS Activation</strong>, marking your official transition into a registered MBA student.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Credential Delivery:</strong> You will receive your unique login credentials for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong> via your registered email.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Immediate Access:</strong> Activating your LMS provides instant access to <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">Semester 1 modules</strong>, such as <em data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Financial Reporting</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"117\">Marketing Management</em>, allowing you to begin your leadership training immediately.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Admission Milestone Summary</strong></h2>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Stage</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Primary Requirement</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\">Sign up and pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">₹1,000</strong> to initiate the profile.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Application</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\">Fill details, pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"18\">₹40,400</strong>, and upload academic records.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,2,0\">University audit of eligibility and documents.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Activation</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\">Receive <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"8\">LMS credentials</strong> and begin 2026 coursework.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Data Science</strong> is a high-stature program designed to bridge the gap between technical data expertise and executive leadership. The 2026 eligibility framework is engineered to be inclusive, recognizing that the potential for data-driven management exists across various academic and professional landscapes.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Whether you come from a traditional science background, a creative field, or hold a prestigious professional title in finance or law, the program offers a structured pathway to enter the high-growth field of data-led decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Eligibility Pathways</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To qualify for the 2026 academic session, applicants must fulfill <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"66\">at least one</strong> of the following requirements:</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Undergraduate Qualification</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree:</strong> Completion of a degree in <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">any discipline</strong> (e.g., B.Tech, B.Sc., B.Com, B.A., BBA) or an equivalent qualification from a recognized university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Discipline Neutrality:</strong> The university acknowledges that data science is a cross-functional tool. Therefore, candidates from non-technical backgrounds are encouraged to apply, provided they hold a foundational degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Professional Titleholders (CS/CA/CMA)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The university grants academic equivalence to high-authority professional certifications. Qualified professionals from the following statutory bodies are eligible for direct entry:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Company Secretary (CS):</strong> From the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Chartered Accountancy (CA):</strong> From the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cost &amp; Management Accountancy (CMA):</strong> From the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"46\">Institute of Cost Accountants of India (ICAI)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Institutional Compliance &amp; Policy</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dynamic Criteria:</strong> Eligibility standards, admission protocols, and other specific conditions are <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"96\">subject to change</strong> as prescribed by the university. This ensures the program remains in alignment with evolving global education standards and UGC mandates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification Process:</strong> All candidates must undergo <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Document Verification (Step 3)</strong>. This involves a rigorous audit of digital academic records or professional memberships to confirm authenticity before the admission is finalized.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Data Science</strong> is a high-authority program designed to produce leaders who can navigate the intersection of complex data architectures and strategic business management. To support this professional journey, the 2026 fee structure is engineered for transparency and flexibility. By integrating substantial student grants and interest-free payment pathways, the university ensures that top-tier technical education remains accessible to the next generation of data-driven executives.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The financial schedule detailed below is specifically applicable to applicants from <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"84\">India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</strong>, ensuring regional affordability and academic parity.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fee Breakdown &amp; The 20% Student Grant</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">For the current enrollment cycle, students can benefit from a strategic <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">Student Grant</strong>, which significantly reduces the capital investment required to master high-level data science.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Amount / Details</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\">₹50,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Student Grant (20% Discount)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\">(₹9,600)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Applicable Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Grant Validity Deadline</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\">Valid until <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">9th May 2026</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5,1,0\">₹2,000 (Included in the semester fee)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,6,1,0\">₹1,000 (One-time, Non-refundable)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment Preferences &amp; Flexible Financing</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">To accommodate varying financial planning requirements, the university offers multiple payment modes. These are designed to provide liquidity and ease of management throughout the four-semester curriculum.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Payment Preferences</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No-Cost EMI:</strong> A strategic financing option that allows students to break down the <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">₹40,400</strong> semester fee into monthly installments without any additional interest charges. This is the preferred mode for professionals managing their own education costs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard:</strong> The direct payment route for those who prefer to settle their academic dues in full at the start of the term.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Fee &amp; Payment Types</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester vs. Lumpsum:</strong> While the primary model is <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"49\">Semester</strong>-based, students have the option to pay a <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"99\">Lumpsum</strong> amount for the entire program to streamline their financial records.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Payment vs. EMI:</strong> Choose between a single transaction of the applicable fee or utilizing the <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"101\">EMI</strong> facility to distribute the investment over time.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Data Science</strong> is a high-authority program engineered to merge executive leadership with advanced computational intelligence. The four-semester curriculum is designed to transition students from foundational business principles to high-level technical mastery in machine learning and big data.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">By integrating traditional management modules with a specialized data science toolbox, the university ensures that 2026 graduates are equipped to lead digital transformations and solve complex organizational challenges through predictive modeling.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Management Foundations &amp; Economic Logic</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The first semester establishes the essential pillars of corporate administration and the global economic environment.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Reporting, Statements, and Analysis (EACC506):</strong> Techniques for interpreting fiscal data to drive strategic business decisions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Managerial Economics (EECO515):</strong> The application of economic theory to internal resource optimization and market analysis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Business Environment (EMGN578):</strong> Evaluating global trade policies and the external factors affecting multi-national operations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Marketing Management (EMKT503):</strong> Frameworks for brand positioning and consumer-centric marketing strategies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Organisational Behaviour and HR Dynamics (EMGN581):</strong> Analyzing human capital, leadership styles, and workplace psychology.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Operational Research &amp; Analytical Basics</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The second semester transitions into quantitative modeling, research ethics, and the legal landscape of business.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Finance (EFIN542):</strong> Strategic management of capital investment, risk, and corporate value.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operations Management and Research (EOPR639):</strong> Utilizing mathematical models to optimize supply chain and production workflows.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Analytics (EMGN801):</strong> The core introduction to transforming raw data into actionable business intelligence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Research Methodology (EMGN832):</strong> Systematic training in data collection, hypothesis testing, and academic integrity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Legal Aspects of Business (EBSL605):</strong> Navigating the regulatory frameworks and laws governing commercial enterprises.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Communication for Leaders (EPEL537):</strong> Refining executive presence and high-stakes persuasive communication skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Data Science Specialization &amp; Visualization</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Semester three marks the deep dive into the technical core of data science and strategic entrepreneurship.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Probability and Statistics (ECAP780):</strong> Mathematical foundations required for predictive modeling and data inference.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Science Toolbox (ECAP781):</strong> Mastery of the essential software and technical frameworks used by modern data scientists.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Advance Data Visualization (ECAP782):</strong> Techniques for crafting high-authority visual narratives to communicate complex data insights.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Strategy and Entrepreneurship (EMGN571):</strong> High-level strategic planning and the mechanics of scaling innovative ventures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Seminar on Summer Training (EMGN583):</strong> Professional reflection on industry internships (Optional: 1 Course from GE Basket 1).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective I (GE-I):</strong> Interdisciplinary elective selection for personalized niche development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Machine Learning &amp; Big Data Analytics</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">The final semester focuses on advanced computational techniques and the cumulative application of the entire analytical suite.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fundamental of Machine Learning (ECAP521):</strong> Building and deploying algorithms that learn from and make predictions on data.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Analytics with Python (ECAP518):</strong> Utilizing the industry-standard programming language for sophisticated data manipulation and analysis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Big Data Analytics (EMGN803):</strong> Strategies for processing and extracting value from high-volume, high-velocity data sets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective II (GE-II):</strong> Final elective specialization to round out the professional profile.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capstone Project (EMGN696):</strong> A comprehensive, real-world project where students solve a complex business problem using their full data science toolkit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">In the data-centric economy of 2026, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">MBA in Data Science</strong> at LPU Online serves as a high-authority professional launchpad. The placement support services are meticulously engineered to align student capabilities with the technical and managerial requirements of global enterprises. By fostering a culture of continuous learning and providing direct access to industry leaders, the university ensures that graduates transition seamlessly into high-stature leadership roles.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The framework is designed to move students beyond traditional management, motivating them to acquire high-authority add-on skills&mdash;such as advanced Python libraries, cloud computing, and AI ethics&mdash;that distinguish them in the competitive 2026 job market.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Placement Support Services (2026 Framework)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The career services department utilizes a multi-dimensional approach to ensure every student has a pathway to a high-ROI professional role in the analytics domain.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Impactful Placement Drives</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">LPU Online makes a dedicated effort to bridge the gap between academic completion and high-level employment through strategic recruitment events.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Employer Interaction:</strong> These drives provide a platform for students to engage directly with prospective employers from top-tier tech firms, financial institutions, and global consulting groups.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Demonstration:</strong> Students have the opportunity to showcase their technical mastery in <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"90\">Machine Learning</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"108\">Big Data Analytics</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"132\">Data Visualization</strong> to hiring managers through live interactions and portfolio presentations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Promising Job Roles:</strong> The drives are curated to offer roles that match the specialized training of an MBA Data Science candidate, ensuring a \"fitting\" professional match.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Capability &amp; Skill Enhancement</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">To meet the rigorous demands of the 2026 corporate sector, the university focuses on \"Total Professional Readiness.\"</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Add-on Skills Motivation:</strong> Students are encouraged to look beyond their core subjects to acquire supplementary technical certifications and soft skills that enhance their employability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Career Awareness:</strong> Regular workshops and seminars create awareness regarding emerging data trends and the specific talent requirements of Fortune 500 companies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Leadership Grooming:</strong> Targeted support in executive communication and professional ethics ensures that students can lead technical teams with confidence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Career Outcomes in Data Science</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Participation in the placement ecosystem prepares students for high-authority roles that command significant industry respect and competitive compensation.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Science Manager:</strong> Leading multi-disciplinary teams to execute predictive business strategies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Intelligence Director:</strong> Overseeing the strategic data architecture for global organizations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Machine Learning Consultant:</strong> Implementing algorithmic solutions to drive operational efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Chief Data Officer (CDO) Path:</strong> Setting the foundation for C-suite roles focused on organizational data governance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"19\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Enrollment Advantage: Securing Your Future</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">To maximize the ROI of your MBA Data Science journey, students are encouraged to leverage the <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"94\">20% Student Grant</strong>, which reduces the applicable semester fee to <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"158\">₹40,400</strong>. This grant is a strategic financial tool valid until <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"220\">9th May 2026</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Path to Success:</strong></h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"22\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Early Enrollment:</strong> Secure the 20% grant before the May deadline to maximize your educational investment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Engagement:</strong> Gain immediate access to <strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">Semester 1</strong> modules upon activation to start building your technical foundation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Active Placement Participation:</strong> Engage with the career cell from the early stages of the program to build a professional profile that resonates with 2026 recruiters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(247, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 219, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 04:50:31', '2026-06-16 06:21:39', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The admission framework for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">MCA in Full Stack Development</strong> is designed as a streamlined, digital-first experience. For the 2026 academic cycle, the university has optimized this four-stage journey to ensure that aspiring software architects can transition from candidates to scholars with maximum efficiency. This process maintains high academic standards while providing a transparent roadmap for students to secure their seats and lock in early-bird financial benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step-by-Step Admission Roadmap (2026 Session)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The enrollment sequence is divided into four critical milestones. Each phase serves as a checkpoint to ensure the candidate is fully prepared for the rigors of high-stature technical training.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Registration: Creating Your Digital Identity</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The journey begins with the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">Registration</strong> phase, which establishes your presence in the university\'s technical portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Applicants sign up on the official portal and pay an initial, non-refundable <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"89\">Registration Fee of ₹1,000</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Purpose:</strong> This step generates your unique applicant ID, allowing you to track your admission status in real-time and ensuring you receive all critical updates regarding the 2026 intake.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Online Application: Document &amp; Fee Submission</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Once registered, you move into the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">Online Application</strong> phase. This is the core of the enrollment process where your academic and financial foundations are set.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Entry:</strong> You will input your academic history&mdash;including your Bachelor&rsquo;s degree and any relevant mathematics or computer science background&mdash;and personal details.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fee Payment:</strong> You will settle the program fee. For the 2026 session, utilizing the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">20% Student Grant</strong> brings the applicable fee to <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">₹32,400 per semester</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Upload:</strong> You must upload high-resolution digital copies of your academic certificates and identity proofs for official audit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Document Verification: Academic Audit</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">After submission, the university&rsquo;s admissions office initiates a thorough <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Document Verification</strong> process.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Candidates are advised to \"sit back and wait\" while university auditors verify the authenticity of the submitted documents against the prescribed eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Outcome:</strong> This stage ensures the cohort consists of qualified professionals, maintaining the integrity and authority of the MCA Full Stack Development degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. Student Registration and LMS Activation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">The final milestone is <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">LMS Activation</strong>, marking your official transition into a registered MCA student.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Credential Delivery:</strong> You will receive your unique login credentials for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong> via your registered email.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Immediate Access:</strong> Activating your LMS provides instant access to <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">Semester 1 modules</strong>, such as <em data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Software Engineering Practices</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"128\">Object Oriented Programming using C++</em>, allowing you to begin your technical training immediately.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Admission Milestone Summary</strong></h2>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Stage</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Primary Requirement</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\">Sign up and pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">₹1,000</strong> to initiate the profile.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Application</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\">Fill details, pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"18\">₹32,400</strong>, and upload academic records.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,2,0\">University audit of eligibility and documents.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Activation</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\">Receive <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"8\">LMS credentials</strong> and begin 2026 coursework.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MCA in Full Stack Development</strong> is a high-stature technical program designed to transform graduates into proficient software architects. The 2026 eligibility framework is intentionally flexible, ensuring that students from diverse academic streams&mdash;including Commerce, Arts, and Science&mdash;can pivot into the technology sector.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">By offering integrated <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">Bridge Courses</strong>, the university ensures that all candidates, regardless of their previous academic specialization, possess the foundational logic and technical baseline required for advanced software engineering.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Eligibility Criteria</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To qualify for the 2026 academic intake, applicants must meet the following primary requirement:</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Undergraduate Qualification</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree:</strong> Completion of a degree in <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">any discipline</strong> (e.g., B.E., B.Tech, B.Sc., B.Com, B.A., B.Voc., BCA) or an equivalent qualification from a recognized university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mathematical Foundation:</strong> Candidates should ideally have studied Mathematics (or Statistics/QT/Business Math) at the 10+2 level or during their Graduation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bridge Course Requirements (The \"Level-Up\" Framework)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">For candidates who do not meet the traditional technical or mathematical prerequisites, the university mandates specific <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"121\">Bridge Courses</strong>. These are designed to bring all students to a uniform level of proficiency.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Candidate Profile</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Required Bridge Course(s)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No Mathematics Background</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\">01 Mathematics Course</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No Computer Background</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\">01 Computer Course</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No Math AND No Computer Background</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,1,0\">01 Mathematics &amp; 01 Computer Course</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Institutional Compliance &amp; Policy</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dynamic Standards:</strong> Eligibility criteria, admission protocols, and other specific conditions are <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"96\">subject to change</strong> as prescribed by the university. This ensures the curriculum and entry standards remain aligned with modern industry benchmarks and UGC guidelines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification Standards:</strong> All candidates must undergo <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">Document Verification (Step 3)</strong>. Digital copies of degrees and marksheet evidence of mathematics/computer study will be audited for authenticity before the final admission is confirmed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Investing in an <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">MCA in Full Stack Development</strong> is a strategic move toward mastering the architecture of modern digital solutions. To facilitate this professional transition, the 2026 fee structure is designed with transparency and flexibility at its core. By offering significant grants and interest-free payment plans, the university ensures that high-stature technical education remains accessible to the next generation of software engineers and developers.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The financial framework detailed below is specifically optimized for applicants from <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"85\">India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</strong>, reflecting a commitment to regional academic growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fee Breakdown &amp; The 20% Student Grant</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">For the current enrollment cycle, students can benefit from a substantial <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Student Grant</strong>, which significantly lowers the capital investment required for the program.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Amount / Details</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\">₹40,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Student Grant (20% Savings)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\">(₹7,600)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Applicable Semester Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹32,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Grant Deadline</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\">Valid until <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">9th May 2026</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5,1,0\">₹2,000 (Integrated into the semester fee)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,6,1,0\">₹1,000 (One-time, non-refundable)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment Preferences &amp; Financing Options</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">To cater to diverse financial profiles, the university offers multiple payment modes. These are engineered to provide students with liquidity and ease of planning throughout the four-semester duration.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Payment Preferences</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No-Cost EMI:</strong> A high-value financing option allowing students to distribute the semester fee into monthly installments without any additional interest burden.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard:</strong> The traditional direct payment method for applicants who prefer immediate settlement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Fee &amp; Payment Types</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester vs. Lumpsum:</strong> While the core structure is <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Semester</strong>-based, students have the option to pay a <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"100\">Lumpsum</strong> amount to simplify their financial records.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Payment vs. EMI:</strong> Choose between settling the total applicable fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">₹32,400</strong> at once or opting for <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"108\">EMI</strong> to manage monthly cash flows effectively.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MCA in Full Stack Development</strong> is a high-authority technical program designed to build versatile software architects. The four-semester curriculum is strategically structured to move from foundational programming and systems logic to advanced specialized development in the final year.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">By integrating modern frameworks like <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"38\">ReactJS</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Django</strong> with core computer science principles, the university ensures that 2026 graduates are prepared to design, develop, and deploy complex, scalable digital solutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Technical Foundations &amp; Systems Logic</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The first semester establishes the core logic and systems knowledge required for advanced software engineering.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Software Engineering Practices (ECAP437):</strong> Methodologies for systematic software design and development lifecycles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Object Oriented Programming using C++ (ECAP444):</strong> Mastering OOP principles like inheritance, polymorphism, and encapsulation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Warehousing and Data Mining (ECAP446):</strong> Strategies for extracting insights from large-scale data repositories.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Linux and Shell Scripting (ECAP448):</strong> Proficiency in command-line environments and automated system tasking.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Communication and Networking (ECAP453):</strong> Understanding the protocols that govern global data exchange.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Enhancement Course I (SEC-I):</strong> Specialized training to boost professional technical efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fundamentals of Computer &amp; C Programming (ECAP012):</strong> (Bridge) The foundational syntax and logic of computational thinking.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,7,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Elementary Mathematics (EMTH006):</strong> (Bridge) Building the quantitative baseline for complex algorithms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Advanced Programming &amp; Infrastructure</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Semester two focuses on high-level languages, data organization, and cloud ecosystems.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Programming in Java (ECAP615):</strong> Building platform-independent, robust, and secure applications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Advanced Data Structures (ECAP770):</strong> Optimizing memory and speed through complex data organization techniques.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Introduction to Big Data (ECAP456):</strong> Managing and processing high-volume datasets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cloud Computing (ECAP470):</strong> Architecting solutions on virtualized infrastructure and distributed systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mathematical Foundation for Computer Science (EMTH403):</strong> Discrete math and logic essential for software theory.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Web Technologies (ECAP472):</strong> Mastering the core languages of the internet (HTML/CSS/JS).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,6,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Enhancement Course II (SEC-II):</strong> Further technical refinement in specialized tools.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: The Front-End Stack &amp; Frameworks</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The third semester marks the deep dive into modern web development and interactive user interfaces.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Programming in Python (ECAP776):</strong> Versatile scripting for automation, data science, and web backends.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Front End Web Developer (ECAP510):</strong> Mastering advanced UI/UX implementation and responsive design.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Web Development using ReactJS (ECAP511):</strong> Building dynamic, component-based user interfaces with the industry-standard library.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Strategy &amp; Entrepreneurship:</strong> (GE-I/II) High-level strategic planning for tech ventures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Seminar on Summer Training (ECAP735):</strong> Professional reflection on real-world industry internships.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Enhancement Course III (SEC-III):</strong> Industry-aligned technical specialization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Back-End Mastery &amp; Strategic Synthesis</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">The final semester focuses on advanced backend architectures, Python frameworks, and cumulative project execution.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Advanced Web Development (ECAP513):</strong> Deep dive into server-side logic and complex database integration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Web Development in Python using Django (ECAP514):</strong> Utilizing the high-level Python framework for rapid, secure web application development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Electives (GE-III/IV):</strong> Final interdisciplinary specializations to round out the professional profile.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Work (ECAP788):</strong> A culminating <strong data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"38\">Capstone Project</strong> where students build a complete Full Stack application from scratch.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Enhancement Course IV (SEC-IV):</strong> Final polish of technical skills for the 2026 job market.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">In the competitive technology landscape of 2026, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">MCA in Full Stack Development</strong> at LPU Online serves as a high-authority professional launchpad. The placement support services are meticulously engineered to align student capabilities with the precise technical requirements of the global software industry. By fostering a culture of continuous learning and direct industry engagement, the university ensures that graduates are prepared to lead the next generation of digital innovation.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The framework is designed to move students beyond traditional coding, motivating them to acquire high-authority add-on skills&mdash;such as AI-driven development, DevOps, and specialized cybersecurity protocols&mdash;that distinguish them in the 2026 corporate marketplace.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Placement Support Services (2026 Roadmap)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The career services department utilizes a multi-dimensional approach to ensure every student has a clear pathway to a high-ROI professional role in software engineering.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Impactful Placement Drives</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">LPU Online makes a dedicated effort to bridge the gap between academic completion and professional employment through high-stakes recruitment events.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Employer Interaction:</strong> These drives provide a platform for students to engage directly with prospective employers from global tech giants, innovative startups, and Fortune 500 companies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Demonstration:</strong> Students have the opportunity to showcase their proficiency in the <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">MERN/MEAN stack</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"105\">ReactJS</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">Django</strong> to hiring managers through live technical interviews and portfolio presentations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Promising Job Roles:</strong> The drives are curated to secure roles that match the specialized training of a Full Stack candidate, ensuring a \"fitting\" professional match.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Capability &amp; Skill Enhancement</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">To meet the rigorous demands of the 2026 tech sector, the university focuses on \"Total Professional Readiness.\"</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Add-on Skills Acquisition:</strong> Students are motivated to look beyond their core subjects to acquire supplementary certifications in emerging technologies like Blockchain or Cloud Architecture.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Market Awareness:</strong> Regular sessions are conducted to create awareness regarding shifting industry trends and the specific talent requirements of international software firms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Interview Grooming:</strong> Targeted support in technical communication and executive presence ensures that students can effectively pitch their architectural solutions to recruiters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Career Outcomes in Full Stack Development</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Participation in the placement ecosystem prepares students for high-authority roles that command significant industry respect and competitive compensation.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Senior Full Stack Developer:</strong> Leading the end-to-end development of scalable web applications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Software Architect:</strong> Designing the underlying structures and logic of complex digital systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">DevOps Engineer:</strong> Bridging the gap between software development and IT operations for seamless deployment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Technical Lead:</strong> Overseeing technical teams to deliver high-impact digital products.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"19\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Enrollment Advantage: Securing Your Future</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">To maximize the ROI of your MCA Full Stack journey, students are encouraged to leverage the <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"92\">20% Student Grant</strong>, which reduces the applicable semester fee to <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"156\">₹32,400</strong>. This grant is a strategic financial tool valid until <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"218\">9th May 2026</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Path to Career Success:</strong></h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"22\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Early Enrollment:</strong> Secure the grant before the May deadline to maximize your educational investment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Engagement:</strong> Gain immediate access to <strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">Semester 1</strong> modules upon activation to start building your technical foundation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Active Placement Participation:</strong> Engage with the career cell from the early stages of the program to build a professional profile that resonates with 2026 tech recruiters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(248, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 103, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 05:28:27', '2026-06-16 06:22:54', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The admission framework for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">MA in Sociology</strong> is designed as a streamlined, digital-first experience. For the 2026 academic cycle, the university has optimized this four-stage journey to ensure that aspiring sociologists and social researchers can transition from candidates to scholars with maximum efficiency. This process maintains high academic standards while providing a transparent roadmap for students to secure their seats and lock in early-bird financial benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step-by-Step Admission Roadmap (2026 Session)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The enrollment sequence is divided into four critical milestones. Each phase serves as a checkpoint to ensure the candidate is fully prepared for the rigors of high-stature social science training.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Registration: Creating Your Digital Identity</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The journey begins with the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">Registration</strong> phase, which establishes your presence in the university\'s academic portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Applicants sign up on the official portal and pay an initial, non-refundable <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"89\">Registration Fee of ₹1,000</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Purpose:</strong> This step generates your unique applicant ID, allowing you to track your admission status in real-time and ensuring you receive all critical updates regarding the 2026 intake.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Online Application: Document &amp; Fee Submission</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Once registered, you move into the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">Online Application</strong> phase. This is the core of the enrollment process where your academic and financial foundations are set.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Entry:</strong> You will input your academic history&mdash;including your Bachelor&rsquo;s degree details&mdash;and personal information.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fee Payment:</strong> You will settle the program fee. For the 2026 session, utilizing the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">20% Student Grant</strong> brings the applicable fee to <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">₹16,400 per semester</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Upload:</strong> You must upload high-resolution digital copies of your academic certificates and identity proofs for official university audit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Document Verification: Academic Audit</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">After submission, the university&rsquo;s admissions office initiates a thorough <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Document Verification</strong> process.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Candidates are advised to \"sit back and wait\" while university auditors verify the authenticity of the submitted documents against the prescribed eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Outcome:</strong> This stage ensures the cohort consists of qualified individuals, maintaining the integrity and authority of the MA Sociology degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. Student Registration and LMS Activation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">The final milestone is <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">LMS Activation</strong>, marking your official transition into a registered Master\'s student.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Credential Delivery:</strong> You will receive your unique login credentials for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong> via your registered email.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Immediate Access:</strong> Activating your LMS provides instant access to <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">Semester 1 modules</strong>, such as <em data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Classical Sociological Tradition</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"130\">Fundamentals of Sociology</em>, allowing you to begin your academic journey immediately.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Admission Milestone Summary</strong></h2>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Stage</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Primary Requirement</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\">Sign up and pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">₹1,000</strong> to initiate the profile.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Application</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\">Fill details, pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"18\">₹16,400</strong>, and upload academic records.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,2,0\">University audit of eligibility and documents.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Activation</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\">Receive <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"8\">LMS credentials</strong> and begin 2026 coursework.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MA in Sociology</strong> is a high-stature program designed for thinkers, researchers, and professionals who aim to analyze the complexities of social behavior and institutional structures. The 2026 eligibility framework is intentionally inclusive, recognizing that sociological insights are valuable across various professional fields.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Whether your background is in the arts, sciences, commerce, or a technical field, the program provides a structured pathway to master the theories and methodologies of social science.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Eligibility Criteria</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To qualify for the 2026 academic intake, applicants must fulfill the following primary requirement:</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Undergraduate Qualification</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree:</strong> Completion of a degree in <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">any discipline</strong> (e.g., B.A., B.Sc., B.Com, BBA, B.Tech, etc.) or an equivalent qualification from a recognized university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stream Neutrality:</strong> The university acknowledges that social analysis benefits from diverse perspectives. Therefore, candidates from non-social science backgrounds are fully eligible to apply.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Institutional Compliance &amp; Policy</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dynamic Standards:</strong> Eligibility criteria, admission protocols, and other specific conditions are <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"96\">subject to change</strong> as prescribed by the university. This ensures that the program remains in alignment with contemporary academic benchmarks and UGC regulations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification Standards:</strong> All candidates must undergo <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">Document Verification (Step 3)</strong>. Digital copies of degree certificates and marksheets will be audited for authenticity before the admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Pursuing an MA in Sociology is a journey into understanding the complex structures of human society. To support this academic pursuit, the 2026 fee structure is designed to be one of the most accessible and transparent in higher education. By integrating significant student grants and flexible, interest-free payment pathways, the university ensures that aspiring sociologists and social researchers can focus on their studies without financial strain.The financial schedule detailed below is specifically applicable to applicants from India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan, ensuring regional affordability.Fee Breakdown &amp; The 20% Student GrantFor the current enrollment cycle, students can benefit from a strategic Student Grant, which significantly reduces the semester-wise investment.Fee ComponentAmount / DetailsStandard Semester Fee₹20,000Student Grant (20% Discount)(₹3,600)Applicable Semester Fee₹16,400Grant Validity DeadlineValid until 9th May 2026Examination Fee₹2,000 (Included in the semester fee)Registration Fee₹1,000 (One-time, Non-refundable)Payment Preferences &amp; Flexible FinancingTo accommodate varying financial planning requirements, the university offers multiple payment modes designed to provide liquidity throughout the two-year program.1. Payment PreferencesNo-Cost EMI: A strategic financing option that allows students to break down the ₹16,400 semester fee into smaller monthly installments without any additional interest charges.Standard: The direct payment route for those who prefer to settle their academic dues in full at the start of the term.2. Fee &amp; Payment TypesSemester vs. Lumpsum: While the primary model is Semester-based, students have the option to pay a Lumpsum amount for the entire program to streamline their academic records.One-Time Payment vs. EMI: Choose between a single transaction of the applicable fee or utilizing the EMI facility to distribute the cost effectively.&nbsp;</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MA in Sociology</strong> is a high-stature program designed to cultivate a deep understanding of social dynamics, cultural evolution, and institutional structures. The 2026 curriculum is meticulously structured to transition students from foundational sociological theories to advanced specialized research and contemporary social issues.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">By merging classical thought with modern challenges like technology and globalization, the university ensures that 2026 graduates possess the analytical tools to navigate and influence the social landscapes of the future.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Foundations of Social Thought &amp; Research</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The first semester establishes the theoretical and methodological bedrock of the discipline.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Classical Sociological Tradition (ESOC505):</strong> An in-depth study of the pioneering thinkers who shaped the field of sociology.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fundamentals of Sociology (ESOC515):</strong> Mastery of core concepts, social processes, and the structural components of society.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Science, Technology, and Society (ESOC516):</strong> Analyzing the symbiotic relationship between technological advancement and social change.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fundamentals of Research (EGEN530):</strong> An introduction to the systematic investigation of social phenomena.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fundamentals of Information Technology (ECAP145):</strong> Equipping social scientists with essential digital tools for data management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Global Dynamics &amp; Social Justice</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Semester two expands the scope to global systems, research methodologies, and the legal framework of society.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Globalization and Society (ESOC506):</strong> Examining the impact of global integration on local cultures and economies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Methodology of Social Research (ESOC558):</strong> Training in qualitative and quantitative techniques for advanced social inquiry.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Criminal Justice and Correctional Management (ESOC580):</strong> Analyzing the sociology of crime, punishment, and the legal system.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Teaching Aptitude (ESSC501):</strong> Developing the pedagogical skills necessary for academic and instructional roles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective I (GE-I):</strong> Interdisciplinary selection to broaden the student\'s academic perspective.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Identity, Kinship, and Population</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The third semester focuses on the intimate and demographic structures that define human experience.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Gender and Society (ESOC507):</strong> A critical analysis of gender roles, identity, and social stratification.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sociology of Kinship, Family, and Marriage (ESOC553):</strong> Exploring the evolving structures of domestic life and social lineage.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sociology of Demography (ESOC611):</strong> Studying population trends, migration, and their socio-economic implications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Term Paper (ESSC608):</strong> An intensive research project focused on a specific sociological niche (Optional: 1 Course from GE Basket 1).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective II (GE-II):</strong> Further interdisciplinary study tailored to career goals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Health, Specialization, and Synthesis</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">The final semester is dedicated to specialized social sectors and the culmination of independent research.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sociology of Health (ESOC614):</strong> Analyzing the social determinants of health, illness, and healthcare systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective III &amp; IV (GE-III/IV):</strong> Final elective choices to refine professional expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dissertation:</strong> A comprehensive independent research thesis representing the pinnacle of the Master\'s journey (Optional: 2 courses from specialized GE baskets).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">In the evolving social landscape of 2026, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"46\">MA in Sociology</strong> at LPU Online serves as a high-authority professional launchpad. The placement support services are meticulously engineered to align student capabilities with the requirements of NGOs, research institutes, corporate social responsibility (CSR) wings, and government bodies. By fostering a culture of continuous learning and direct industry engagement, the university ensures that graduates transition into high-stature roles focused on social impact and policy design.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The framework is designed to move students beyond theoretical study, motivating them to acquire high-authority add-on skills&mdash;such as social data analytics, community management, and grant writing&mdash;that distinguish them in the 2026 professional marketplace.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Placement Support Services (2026 Framework)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The career services department utilizes a multi-dimensional approach to ensure every student has a pathway to a high-ROI professional role in the social sciences.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Impactful Placement Drives</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">LPU Online makes a dedicated effort to bridge the gap between academic completion and high-level employment through strategic recruitment events.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Employer Interaction:</strong> These drives provide a platform for students to engage directly with prospective employers from global NGOs, social enterprises, and public sector organizations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Demonstration:</strong> Students have the opportunity to showcase their technical mastery in <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"90\">Social Research Methodology</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"119\">Gender Studies</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"139\">Demographic Analysis</strong> to hiring managers through live interactions and research portfolio presentations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Promising Job Roles:</strong> The drives are curated to offer roles that match the specialized training of an MA Sociology candidate, ensuring a \"fitting\" professional match.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Capability &amp; Skill Enhancement</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">To meet the rigorous demands of the 2026 social sector, the university focuses on \"Total Professional Readiness.\"</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Add-on Skills Motivation:</strong> Students are encouraged to look beyond their core subjects to acquire supplementary skills in digital literacy, survey design, and cross-cultural communication.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Career Awareness:</strong> Regular workshops create awareness regarding emerging trends in social policy, sustainability, and international development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Executive Grooming:</strong> Targeted support in persuasive writing and public speaking ensures that students can represent organizational missions with authority.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Career Outcomes in Sociology</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Participation in the placement ecosystem prepares students for high-authority roles that command significant industry respect:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Social Policy Consultant:</strong> Advising organizations on social welfare and community development strategies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Market Research Analyst:</strong> Utilizing sociological insights to analyze consumer behavior and social trends.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">CSR Manager:</strong> Directing corporate social responsibility initiatives for large-scale enterprises.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Social Welfare Officer:</strong> Managing community-based programs and social justice projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"19\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Enrollment Advantage: Securing Your Future</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">To maximize the ROI of your MA Sociology journey, students are encouraged to leverage the <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"90\">20% Student Grant</strong>, which reduces the applicable semester fee to <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"154\">₹16,400</strong>. This grant is a strategic financial tool valid until <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"216\">9th May 2026</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Path to Success:</strong></h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"22\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Early Enrollment:</strong> Secure the 20% grant before the May deadline to maximize your educational investment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Engagement:</strong> Gain immediate access to <strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">Semester 1</strong> modules upon activation to start building your analytical foundation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Active Placement Participation:</strong> Engage with the career cell early in the program to build a professional profile that resonates with 2026 recruiters in the social sector.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 65000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(249, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 229, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 05:53:12', '2026-06-16 06:23:22', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MCA in Cybersecurity</strong> admission process is designed to be as seamless and technologically advanced as the program itself. Moving away from traditional, cumbersome administrative hurdles, the university employs a direct four-step digital enrollment funnel. This streamlined approach ensures that high-potential candidates can transition from the interest phase to the active learning phase with minimal friction, allowing them to focus on the technical rigors of the cybersecurity curriculum.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The process is structured to maintain high academic integrity through rigorous verification while providing immediate access to learning resources upon confirmation. For students aiming to secure their seats before the expiry of early-bird grants, understanding the sequence of these stages is vital for effective time management and strategic planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Step-by-Step Enrollment Guide</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following roadmap outlines the official procedure to secure your admission:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1: Initial Registration</strong> The journey begins with basic sign-up on the official portal. At this stage, applicants are required to pay the initial, non-refundable <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"165\">Registration Fee</strong> (typically ₹1,000) to create their unique applicant profile and initiate the formal process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2: Online Application Form &amp; Fee Payment</strong> Once registered, you must fill in your comprehensive personal and academic details. During this phase, you will also upload the necessary digital copies of your qualifying documents and pay the applicable program fee. Students should decide their <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"293\">Payment Preference</strong> (Lumpsum or No-Cost EMI) at this juncture.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3: Document Verification by University</strong> After submission, the university\'s admission cell conducts a detailed audit of the provided documents to ensure they align with the eligibility criteria (including Bachelor&rsquo;s degree and Mathematics prerequisites). This is a \"wait-and-watch\" phase where the university confirms your official admission status.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4: Student Registration and LMS Activation</strong> Upon successful verification, you receive your official student registration details. The final hallmark of your enrollment is the activation of your <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"198\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong> credentials, which are sent directly to your registered email, providing immediate access to course materials and virtual classrooms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Securing admission into a specialized program like the <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"55\">MCA in Cybersecurity</strong> requires a specific academic foundation, though the criteria are designed to be inclusive of various undergraduate backgrounds. As the cybersecurity sector demands both logical reasoning and technical proficiency, the eligibility framework ensures that every incoming student&mdash;regardless of their initial field of study&mdash;possesses the core competencies needed to excel in digital defense.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The program is structured to accommodate students from diverse streams including engineering, science, commerce, and the arts. This interdisciplinary approach recognizes that cybersecurity professionals often need to understand the business and legal contexts of the data they protect. By standardizing the entry requirements while offering corrective pathways for those without technical backgrounds, the university maintains high academic rigor without excluding high-potential candidates from non-traditional paths.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Core Academic Qualifications</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To be considered for the MCA in Cybersecurity, candidates must meet the following primary educational benchmarks:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_82da1a5550db5282-118\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Undergraduate Degree:</strong> Applicants must hold a Bachelor\'s degree in any discipline. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-241\">Recognized degrees include but are not limited to B.E., B.Tech., B.Sc., B.Com., B.A., B.Voc., and BCA</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-241 citation-end-241\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_82da1a5550db5282-119\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-240\">The Mathematics Prerequisite:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-240\"> A critical requirement is having studied </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"71\"><span class=\"citation-240\">Mathematics</span></strong><span class=\"citation-240\"> (or related subjects such as Statistics, Quantitative Techniques, or Business Mathematics) at either the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"188\"><span class=\"citation-240\">10+2 level</span></strong><span class=\"citation-240\"> or during </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"209\"><span class=\"citation-240\">Graduation</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-240 citation-end-240\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_82da1a5550db5282-120\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-239\">NIOS &amp; Open Schooling:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-239\"> Candidates who have completed their qualifying examinations through the National Institute of Open Schooling (NIOS) or other recognized open universities are eligible, provided they meet the core subject requirements</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-239 citation-end-239\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_82da1a5550db5282-121\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Appearing Candidates:</strong> Students currently appearing for their final year examinations of their Bachelor\'s degree are also eligible to apply. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-238\">In such cases, admission is typically provisional until final mark sheets are submitted</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-238 citation-end-238\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Strategic Path for Non-Technical Backgrounds: Bridge Courses</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">One of the most significant advantages of this program is the \"Bridge Course\" system. This is a strategic academic intervention designed to bring students without a background in computers or mathematics up to the required technical level. This removes the \"skill-gap risk\" that often prevents talented individuals from switching careers into cybersecurity.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Candidate Background</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Mandatory Requirement</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No Mathematics Background</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-237\">Completion of 01 Mathematics Bridge Course </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No Computer Background</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-236\">Completion of 01 Computer Bridge Course </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Neither Mathematics nor Computer Background</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-235\">Completion of both 01 Mathematics and 01 Computer Bridge Course</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Choosing an advanced degree in a specialized field like cybersecurity requires a clear understanding of the financial commitment involved. The fee structure for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"165\">MCA in Cybersecurity</strong> is designed to provide high-level technical training while remaining accessible through strategic financial aids and flexible payment plans. For students prioritizing a strong <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"362\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong>, the current fee framework balances top-tier curriculum delivery with significant cost-saving opportunities through early application grants.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The program\'s financial architecture is built on a semester-based model, ensuring that students can manage their cash flow without the burden of a massive upfront payment. Furthermore, the inclusion of specific regional pricing for Indian and SAARC applicants makes it a competitive choice for students across the subcontinent. By understanding the nuances of the <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"364\">Student Grant</strong> and the distinction between standard and applicable fees, candidates can effectively reduce their total educational expenditure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Detailed Fee Breakdown (Indian &amp; SAARC Applicants)</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following table outlines the current cost of the program for applicants from India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Standard Fee (Per Semester)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Applicable Fee (With 20% Grant)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Tuition &amp; Exam Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\">₹40,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹32,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\">₹1,000 (One-time)</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\">₹1,000 (One-time)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Semestral Payable</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\">₹40,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹32,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Strategic Financial Planning: Grants and Payment Modes</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">20% Student Grant</strong> is a pivotal factor in the decision-making process for many applicants. This grant effectively reduces the per-semester cost from the actual fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"170\">₹40,000</strong> to an applicable fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"202\">₹32,400</strong>. It is critical to note that this financial advantage is time-sensitive, typically valid for applications submitted before <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"333\">9th May \'26</strong>. For students looking to maximize their ROI, securing this grant is the most effective way to lower the total cost of their postgraduate education.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Beyond the tuition, the university offers diverse <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Payment Preferences</strong> to suit different financial backgrounds:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No-Cost EMI:</strong> Allows students to distribute the semester fee into manageable monthly installments without accruing interest.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lumpsum Payment:</strong> A one-time payment mode for those who prefer to clear the semester dues in a single transaction.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Mode:</strong> Regular semester-wise payments as per the university\'s standard academic calendar.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MCA in Cybersecurity</strong> curriculum is a high-authority academic framework meticulously designed to transform graduates into industry-ready security specialists. The syllabus follows a progressive learning trajectory, moving from foundational computer application principles to advanced, offensive, and defensive security strategies. By integrating core programming with specialized security modules, the program ensures that students develop the technical \"muscle memory\" required to defend complex digital infrastructures.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The academic journey is divided into four distinct phases, each focusing on a specific layer of the technology stack. In the initial semesters, the emphasis is on building a robust structural foundation in software engineering and object-oriented paradigms. As students progress into the final year, the focus shifts heavily toward high-stakes specializations such as <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"368\">Cyber Forensics</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"385\">Vulnerability Assessment</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"415\">Network Infrastructure Security</strong>, providing the deep topical coverage necessary to compete in the global cybersecurity market.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Semester-Wise Subject Breakdown</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following tables outline the specific modules and courses students will master throughout the program duration.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Year 1: Foundations of Development and Networking</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">The first year is dedicated to establishing proficiency in core programming and data management. It also includes mandatory bridge courses for students coming from non-technical backgrounds to ensure parity across the cohort.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 1</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 2</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\">Software Engineering Practices</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\">Programming in Java</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0,0\">Object Oriented Programming using C++</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0\">Advanced Data Structures</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0,0\">Data Warehousing and Data Mining</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,0\">Introduction to Big Data</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0,0\">Linux and Shell Scripting</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,4,1,0\">Cloud Computing</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,5,0,0\">Data Communication and Networking</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,5,1,0\">Mathematical Foundation for Computer Science</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,6,0,0\">Skill Enhancement Course I</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,6,1,0\">Web Technologies</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bridge:</strong> Fundamentals of Computer &amp; C</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,7,1,0\">Skill Enhancement Course II</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bridge:</strong> Elementary Mathematics</span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Year 2: Advanced Specialization and Offensive Security</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">The second year shifts into specialized security domains and practical application. Students engage in rigorous training for identifying system weaknesses and conducting digital investigations.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 3</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 4</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\">Programming in Python</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\">Securing Networks and its Infrastructure</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,0\">Network Administration</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\">Vulnerability Assessment &amp; Penetration Testing</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,0\">Cyber Forensic</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,1,0\">Project Work</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,4,0,0\">Seminar on Summer Training</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,4,1,0\">Generic Elective III &amp; IV</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,5,0,0\">Generic Elective I &amp; II</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,5,1,0\">Skill Enhancement Course IV</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,6,0,0\">Skill Enhancement Course III</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', NULL, '<p id=\"p-rc_dc78ffcca8896145-141\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0\">The true value of a specialized postgraduate degree lies in its ability to translate academic knowledge into high-impact professional roles. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-334\">The </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,2\" data-index-in-node=\"4\"><span class=\"citation-334\">MCA in Cybersecurity</span></strong><span class=\"citation-334\"> placement ecosystem is built on the principle of \"Career Readiness,\" ensuring that students do not just graduate with a degree but with a portfolio of market-relevant skills</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\"><span class=\"citation-334 citation-end-334\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-333\">LPU Online placement support services are strategically designed to bridge the gap between theoretical security protocols and the dynamic requirements of the global cybersecurity workforce</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\"><span class=\"citation-333 citation-end-333\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,8\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_dc78ffcca8896145-142\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1\"><span class=\"citation-332\">This robust support structure focuses on enhancing student capabilities beyond the core syllabus, fostering an environment where awareness and motivation drive the acquisition of supplementary skills</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-332 citation-end-332\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5\"><span class=\"citation-331\">By aligning student development with contemporary industry standards, the program minimizes the \"employment risk\" often associated with online education, positioning its graduates as preferred candidates for top-tier technology firms</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,6\"><span class=\"citation-331 citation-end-331\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Dedicated Career Support Services</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To ensure students are prepared for the competitive job market, a multi-layered support strategy is implemented:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_dc78ffcca8896145-143\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-330\">Impactful Placement Drives:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-330\"> The university conducts dedicated events that provide a direct interface between students and prospective employers, allowing for real-time skill demonstration and recruitment</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-330 citation-end-330\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_dc78ffcca8896145-144\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-329\">Skill Enhancement Initiatives:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-329\"> Students are motivated to acquire \"add-on\" skills that complement their cybersecurity expertise, such as cloud security or specialized compliance knowledge</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-329 citation-end-329\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_dc78ffcca8896145-145\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-328\">Career Awareness Programs:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-328\"> Continuous guidance is provided to help students understand the nuances of the cybersecurity job market and the specific expectations of different sectors like FinTech or Defense</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-328 citation-end-328\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_dc78ffcca8896145-146\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-327\">Employer Interaction:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-327\"> Students gain opportunities to engage with industry leaders, gaining insights into the practical challenges and professional ethics of the digital defense industry</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-327 citation-end-327\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(250, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 230, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 06:20:13', '2026-06-16 06:23:51', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Finance</strong> admission process is architected to be as efficient and professional as the industry it represents. Designed for busy professionals and aspiring financial analysts, the enrollment funnel is a direct, four-step digital journey that eliminates traditional bureaucratic delays. This streamlined approach ensures that high-potential candidates&mdash;whether they are fresh graduates or qualified professionals like CAs and CSs&mdash;can transition into their specialized business education with absolute clarity and administrative ease.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">By digitizing every phase of the onboarding process, the university ensures that your transition from an applicant to a management student is seamless. For those looking to secure the <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"184\">20% Student Grant</strong> before the deadline, understanding this sequence is critical for timely submission and financial optimization.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Step-by-Step Enrollment Guide</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following roadmap outlines the official digital procedure to secure your seat in the MBA Finance program.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1: Registration and Profile Creation</strong> The process begins with an initial sign-up on the university\'s admission portal. During this phase, you will create your unique applicant profile and pay the initial <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"208\">Registration Fee</strong> (typically ₹1,000). This step locks in your intent to apply and opens the formal communication channel with the university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2: Online Application Form &amp; Documentation</strong> In the second stage, you will provide comprehensive personal and academic details. You are required to upload digital copies of your relevant documents (Degree certificates or CA/CS/CMA credentials) and pay the applicable program fee. This is the stage where you choose your <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"323\">Payment Mode</strong> (Lumpsum or EMI) to suit your financial strategy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3: Document Verification by University</strong> Once your application is submitted, the university&rsquo;s admission cell performs a rigorous audit of your credentials. They verify that your academic background meets the eligibility standards for an MBA in Finance. During this \"Sit back and wait\" phase, the university ensures all regulatory and academic compliance is met before issuing a formal confirmation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4: Student Registration and LMS Activation</strong> The final milestone is your official integration into the university system. You will receive your official Student Registration details and your <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"194\">LMS (Learning Management System)</strong> credentials via your registered email. Activation of the LMS marks the beginning of your academic journey, giving you instant access to financial reporting modules, video lectures, and digital libraries.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Strategic Insights: Efficiency, ROI, and Risk Mitigation</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">From a strategic perspective, the timing of your application is the most significant factor affecting your <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"107\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong>. Initiating Step 1 early ensures you are not rushed during Step 2, which is where most clerical errors occur. To secure the financial advantage of the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"285\">20% Student Grant</strong>, it is highly recommended to complete the registration and fee payment well before the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"390\">9th May \'26</strong> cutoff.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk Assessment &amp; Mistake Insights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Clarity:</strong> A common mistake is uploading low-resolution or \"cropped\" document scans. This leads to rejection during <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"123\">Step 3</strong>, causing a delay that could push your enrollment past grant deadlines. Ensure all transcripts and professional certificates are clear and officially stamped.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Decision-Making:</strong> Candidates often delay Step 2 because they are undecided between <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"92\">No-Cost EMI</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"108\">Lumpsum</strong> payments. Deciding on your financial mode before starting the application form prevents administrative timeouts and ensures a smooth checkout.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Appearing\" Strategy:</strong> If you are in your final year of graduation, do not wait for the final degree to start Step 1. You can apply with your current mark sheets for provisional admission, securing your place while you wait for your final results.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Finance</strong> is a prestigious postgraduate program designed to cultivate high-level leadership and analytical skills within the global financial sector. To ensure a cohort of capable and driven professionals, the eligibility framework is structured to recognize both traditional academic achievements and elite professional qualifications. Whether you are a fresh graduate or a seasoned professional with a certification from India&rsquo;s top accounting bodies, the admission criteria provide a clear and accessible pathway to advanced business education.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The program&rsquo;s inclusive approach allows students from diverse undergraduate streams&mdash;including arts, science, and engineering&mdash;to transition into the finance domain. By acknowledging professional certifications as equivalent to a degree for admission purposes, the university fosters an environment where academic theory meets practical, professional expertise, ensuring that every candidate is prepared for the rigorous quantitative and strategic demands of the curriculum.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Core Academic &amp; Professional Qualifications</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To qualify for admission into the MBA in Finance, applicants must satisfy one of the following primary educational benchmarks:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Graduate Entry:</strong> Candidates must hold a <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline</strong> (e.g., B.Com, B.A., B.Sc, B.Tech, BCA, etc.) or an equivalent qualification from a recognized university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Certification Entry (CS):</strong> Individuals who have successfully completed the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"87\">Company Secretary (CS)</strong> program from the Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI) are eligible for direct admission.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Certification Entry (CA/CMA):</strong> Candidates who have completed <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"73\">Chartered Accountancy (CA)</strong> from the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI) or <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"163\">Cost &amp; Management Accountancy (CMA)</strong> from the Institute of Cost Accountants of India (ICAI) meet the full eligibility requirements for this program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Appearing Candidates:</strong> Students in the final year of their Bachelor&rsquo;s degree are eligible to apply provisionally. Admission is typically finalized upon the submission of proof that the candidate has met the graduation requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Investing in an&nbsp;<strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">MBA in Finance</strong> is a strategic decision that requires a clear understanding of the financial commitment and the potential <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"137\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong>. The program is priced to provide elite-level business education while remaining accessible through structured grants and flexible payment pathways. For students aiming to specialize in capital markets, corporate finance, or investment banking, the fee framework is designed to be transparent, covering everything from core tuition to administrative assessments.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The financial architecture of the program is built on a semester-based model, which is particularly beneficial for working professionals managing their own cash flows. By leveraging the current <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"194\">Student Grant</strong>, applicants can significantly lower their total educational expenditure, making high-quality financial education more affordable without compromising on the depth of the curriculum or the prestige of the degree.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Official Fee Structure Table</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following table details the cost for applicants from India and SAARC nations (Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan). This format is optimized for clear data portability.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Description</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Standard Fee (Actual)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Applicable Fee (With 20% Grant)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Fee (Per Semester)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\">₹50,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee (Included)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\">₹2,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹2,000</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\">₹1,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹1,000</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Payable per Semester</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹50,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Strategic Financial Incentives: Grants and Payment Flexibility</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The most critical factor in reducing the cost of the MBA in Finance is the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"75\">20% Student Grant</strong>. This grant effectively slashes the standard semester fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"154\">₹50,000</strong> down to <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"170\">₹40,400</strong>. To maximize this benefit, students must complete their enrollment before the deadline of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"268\">9th May \'26</strong>. This strategic entry point ensures that the student locks in a lower rate for the duration of the program, directly impacting the overall ROI by lowering the \"break-even\" point of the degree.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">To accommodate different financial backgrounds, the program offers versatile <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">Payment Preferences</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No-Cost EMI:</strong> A strategic choice for those who wish to pay in monthly installments without interest, preserving their monthly liquidity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lumpsum Payment:</strong> Ideal for students who prefer a one-time settlement per semester to avoid monthly tracking.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Payment vs. EMI:</strong> Students can choose between paying the full semester fee at once or utilizing the EMI mode based on their individual financial health.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Finance</strong> curriculum is a high-authority academic framework designed to bridge the gap between traditional management principles and the high-stakes world of global finance. The syllabus is architected to evolve with the market, moving from the fundamentals of economic theory and reporting to specialized, industry-shaping domains like <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"346\">Investment Banking</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"366\">Forex Management</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"388\">Financial Derivatives</strong>. This rigorous academic roadmap ensures that graduates possess the quantitative precision and strategic foresight required to navigate complex fiscal landscapes.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The program is structured across four semesters, each meticulously balanced to ensure a high <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong> for the learner. While the first year focuses on building a \"Business Generalist\" foundation with a quantitative edge, the second year pivots into deep technical specializations. By integrating <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"314\">Business Analytics</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"337\">Legal Aspects of Business</strong>, the curriculum ensures that financial leaders are not just number-crunchers but legally-sound, data-driven decision-makers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Semester-Wise Subject Breakdown</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following tables provide a granular look at the subjects you will master throughout your MBA journey.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Year 1: Core Management and Financial Fundamentals</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">The first year establishes the bedrock of business intelligence. It introduces students to the language of financial reporting and the economic environments that dictate market movements.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 1</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 2</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\">Financial <span class=\"citation-750 citation-end-750\">Reporting, Statements and Analysis<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\"><span class=\"citation-749 citation-end-749\">Corporate Finance<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0,0\"><span class=\"citation-748 citation-end-748\">Managerial Economics<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0\"><span class=\"citation-747 citation-end-747\">Operations Management and Research<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0,0\"><span class=\"citation-746 citation-end-746\">International Business Environment<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,0\"><span class=\"citation-745 citation-end-745\">Business Analytics<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0,0\"><span class=\"citation-744 citation-end-744\">Marketing Management<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,4,1,0\"><span class=\"citation-743 citation-end-743\">Research Methodology<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,5,0,0\"><span class=\"citation-742 citation-end-742\">Organisati<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span>onal Behaviour &amp; HR Dynamics</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,5,1,0\">Legal Aspects of Business</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,6,1,0\">Communication for Leaders</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Year 2: Advanced Finance Specialization and Strategy</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">In the second year, the focus narrows toward high-value financial sectors. This phase is designed to prepare students for elite roles in global banking, risk mitigation, and corporate strategy.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 3</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 4</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\">International Financial Management</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\">Financial Risk Management</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,0\">International Banking and Forex Management</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\">Investment Banking</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,0\">Security Analysis and Portfolio Management</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,1,0\">Financial Derivatives</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,4,0,0\">Corporate Strategy and Entrepreneurship</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,4,1,0\">Capstone Project</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,5,0,0\">Generic Elective I</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,5,1,0\">Generic Elective II</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,6,0,0\">Seminar on Summer Training</span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\">Strategic Depth: Curriculum ROI and Market Alignment</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">The strategic advantage of this syllabus lies in its focus on <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">International Finance</strong>. Modules like <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"98\">International Banking and Forex Management</strong> are critical in today&rsquo;s globalized economy, where currency fluctuations directly impact corporate bottom lines. For a student, the ROI of mastering <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"289\">Security Analysis and Portfolio Management</strong> in Semester 3 is immediate, as it aligns with the core requirements of equity research and wealth management firms.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">Furthermore, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"17\">Capstone Project</strong> in Semester 4 serves as the ultimate decision-making exercise. It requires students to synthesize their learning from <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"152\">Financial Risk Management</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"182\">Derivatives</strong> to solve a real-world financial problem. This practical application is a key differentiator in the job market, transforming a theoretical degree into a proven track record of competency.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\">Decision-Making Insights: Risks and Technical Mastery</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">A common mistake students make is underestimating the importance of <strong data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"68\">Business Analytics (Semester 2)</strong>. In the modern financial era, finance is inextricably linked with data science. Ignoring the analytical tools provided in this module can leave a graduate ill-equipped for the \"FinTech\" and \"Quant\" roles that currently dominate high-salary brackets.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk Assessment:</strong> The curriculum transition from Semester 2 to Semester 3 involves a significant jump in mathematical complexity. Subjects like <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"143\">Financial Derivatives</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"169\">Risk Management</strong> require a high degree of quantitative comfort. To mitigate the risk of academic struggle, students should ensure they fully grasp the <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"319\">Mathematical Foundations</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"348\">Managerial Economics</strong> taught in the early phases. Strategically choosing your <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"425\">Generic Electives (GE)</strong> is also vital; these should be selected to complement your specific career goal&mdash;whether it be in FinTech, Consultancy, or Corporate Treasury.</p>', NULL, '<p id=\"p-rc_c8c6f8cbb676227a-184\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-886\">The culmination of an </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,1\" data-index-in-node=\"22\"><span class=\"citation-886\">MBA in Finance</span></strong><span class=\"citation-886\"> is the successful transition into high-impact professional roles within the global financial architecture. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-886 citation-end-886\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,4\"><span class=\"citation-885\">LPU Online Placement Support Services are strategically engineered to enhance student capabilities, ensuring they meet the evolving requirements of modern career paths. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-885 citation-end-885\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\"><span class=\"citation-884\">By moving beyond the core curriculum, the university fosters a culture of awareness and motivation, encouraging students to acquire critical add-on skills that are essential for long-term career success. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,8\"><span class=\"citation-884 citation-end-884\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c8c6f8cbb676227a-185\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1\"><span class=\"citation-883\">At the heart of this ecosystem is a proactive effort to offer fitting job prospects through impactful </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,1\" data-index-in-node=\"102\"><span class=\"citation-883\">Placement Drives</span></strong><span class=\"citation-883\">. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-883 citation-end-883\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4\"><span class=\"citation-882\">These events act as a vital bridge between academic theory and corporate practice, providing students with direct opportunities to interact with prospective employers, demonstrate their specialized financial skills, and secure promising roles in a competitive market. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5\"><span class=\"citation-882 citation-end-882\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,7\"><span class=\"citation-881\">This holistic approach ensures that graduates are not only academically proficient but also industry-ready and professionally networked. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,8\"><span class=\"citation-881 citation-end-881\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Dedicated Placement Support Services</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c8c6f8cbb676227a-186\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1\"><span class=\"citation-880\">To maximize student employability in the finance sector, the university implements a multi-layered support strategy: </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2\"><span class=\"citation-880 citation-end-880\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c8c6f8cbb676227a-187\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-879\">Impactful Placement Drives:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-879\"> Dedicated recruitment events provide a direct interface with employers for real-time skill demonstration and job securing. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-879 citation-end-879\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c8c6f8cbb676227a-188\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-878\">Career-Aligned Capability Building:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-878\"> Services are specifically designed to enhance student capabilities in accordance with current global career requirements. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-878 citation-end-878\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c8c6f8cbb676227a-189\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-877\">Add-on Skill Acquisition:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-877\"> Students are motivated to pursue skills beyond their core subjects to ensure they possess a versatile professional toolkit. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-877 citation-end-877\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c8c6f8cbb676227a-190\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-876\">Employer Interaction Opportunities:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-876\"> Regular events allow students to engage with prospective employers, gaining insights into industry expectations and professional standards. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-876 citation-end-876\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"16\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Strategic Advantage: Maximizing Career ROI</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c8c6f8cbb676227a-191\" data-path-to-node=\"11\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1\"><span class=\"citation-875\">From a strategic perspective, these placement services are essential for securing a high </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1\" data-index-in-node=\"89\"><span class=\"citation-875\">Return on Investment (ROI)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-875\">. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2\"><span class=\"citation-875 citation-end-875\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"17\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"17\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,4\"><span class=\"citation-874\">While the degree provides the foundation, the university\'s additional efforts in conducting placement drives act as a catalyst for entry into elite financial institutions. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,5\"><span class=\"citation-874 citation-end-874\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,7\"><span class=\"citation-873\">For prospective students, the ability to interact directly with employers and demonstrate technical expertise before graduation is a primary decision-making factor that mitigates the risk of post-degree unemployment. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,8\"><span class=\"citation-873 citation-end-873\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c8c6f8cbb676227a-192\" data-path-to-node=\"13\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-872\">Risk Assessment:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-872\"> A common mistake made by postgraduate students is a narrow focus on academic grades while neglecting the \"add-on skills\" and networking opportunities provided by career services. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1\"><span class=\"citation-872 citation-end-872\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"20\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"20\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3\"><span class=\"citation-871\">To mitigate the risk of skill gaps, students should actively participate in all placement drives and skill enhancement workshops from their early semesters. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,4\"><span class=\"citation-871 citation-end-871\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"21\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"21\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"21\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"21\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,6\"><span class=\"citation-870\">This proactive engagement ensures that by the final semester, the student has a professional portfolio that aligns perfectly with the high-stakes requirements of the financial industry. </span></span></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
