er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(251, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 218, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 06:42:49', '2026-06-16 06:24:27', '<p id=\"p-rc_72a8310290e461e8-63\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MCA in AI &amp; ML</strong> admission process is architected to be as innovative and efficient as the field itself. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-181\">Designed for aspiring tech leaders and data scientists, the enrollment funnel is a direct, four-step digital journey that eliminates traditional bureaucratic delays</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\"><span class=\"citation-181 citation-end-181\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-180\">This streamlined approach ensures that high-potential candidates can transition into their specialized technical education with absolute clarity and administrative ease</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\"><span class=\"citation-180 citation-end-180\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,8\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_72a8310290e461e8-64\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1\"><span class=\"citation-179\">By digitizing every phase of the onboarding process, the university ensures that your transition from an applicant to a postgraduate student is seamless</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-179 citation-end-179\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5\"><span class=\"citation-178\">For those looking to secure student grants before the deadline, understanding this sequence is critical for timely submission and professional optimization</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,6\"><span class=\"citation-178 citation-end-178\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Step-by-Step Enrollment Guide</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following roadmap outlines the official digital procedure to secure your seat in the MCA AI &amp; ML program.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_72a8310290e461e8-65\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1: Registration and Profile Creation</strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-177\">The journey begins with an initial sign-up on the official portal</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-177 citation-end-177\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,6\"><span class=\"citation-176\">At this stage, applicants pay the initial, non-refundable </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,6\" data-index-in-node=\"58\"><span class=\"citation-176\">Registration Fee</span></strong><span class=\"citation-176\"> to create their unique applicant profile and initiate the formal process</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,7\"><span class=\"citation-176 citation-end-176\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,8\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_72a8310290e461e8-66\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2: Online Application Form &amp; Documentation</strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-175\">Once registered, you must fill in your comprehensive personal and academic details</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-175 citation-end-175\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,6\"><span class=\"citation-174\">During this phase, you will also pay the program fee and upload relevant digital documents for review</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,7\"><span class=\"citation-174 citation-end-174\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,8\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_72a8310290e461e8-67\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3: Document Verification by University</strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-173\">After submission, the university\'s admission cell conducts a rigorous audit of the provided credentials</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-173 citation-end-173\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,6\"><span class=\"citation-172\">This is a \"sit back and wait\" phase where the university confirms your official admission status and alignment with eligibility criteria</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,7\"><span class=\"citation-172 citation-end-172\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,8\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_72a8310290e461e8-68\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4: Student Registration and LMS Activation</strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-171\">Upon successful verification, you receive your official student registration details</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-171 citation-end-171\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,6\"><span class=\"citation-170\">The final hallmark of your enrollment is receiving your </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,6\" data-index-in-node=\"56\"><span class=\"citation-170\">LMS (Learning Management System)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-170\"> credentials over email, providing immediate access to your virtual classroom</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,7\"><span class=\"citation-170 citation-end-170\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,8\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Strategic Insights: Efficiency, ROI, and Risk Mitigation</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_72a8310290e461e8-69\" data-path-to-node=\"11\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1\"><span class=\"citation-169\">From a strategic perspective, the timing of your application is a significant factor affecting your </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1\" data-index-in-node=\"100\"><span class=\"citation-169\">Return on Investment (ROI)</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2\"><span class=\"citation-169 citation-end-169\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,5\"><span class=\"citation-168\">Initiating Step 1 early ensures you are not rushed during documentation, where clerical errors are most common</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,6\"><span class=\"citation-168 citation-end-168\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,7\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,9\"><span class=\"citation-167\">To maximize the financial advantage of current grants, it is highly recommended to complete the registration and fee payment well before administrative cutoffs</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,10\"><span class=\"citation-167 citation-end-167\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,11\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk Assessment &amp; Mistake Insights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_72a8310290e461e8-70\" data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-166\">Document Clarity:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-166\"> A common mistake is uploading low-resolution or incomplete document scans</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-166 citation-end-166\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"16\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-165\">This leads to delays during </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,4\" data-index-in-node=\"28\"><span class=\"citation-165\">Step 3</span></strong><span class=\"citation-165\">, potentially missing enrollment windows</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-165 citation-end-165\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"17\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,6\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,8\"><span class=\"citation-164\">Ensure all transcripts, especially those verifying the mathematics prerequisite, are clear</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,9\"><span class=\"citation-164 citation-end-164\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,10\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_72a8310290e461e8-71\" data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-163\">Financial Decision-Making:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-163\"> Candidates often delay Step 2 because they are undecided on payment modes</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-163 citation-end-163\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-162\">Deciding on your financial strategy&mdash;whether Lumpsum or EMI&mdash;before starting the application form ensures a smooth onboarding</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-162 citation-end-162\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"20\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_72a8310290e461e8-72\" data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-161\">Monitoring Communication:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-161\"> Many students miss their </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"51\"><span class=\"citation-161\">LMS Activation</span></strong><span class=\"citation-161\"> email (Step 4) because it lands in a \"Spam\" folder</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-161 citation-end-161\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"21\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-160\">Regular monitoring of your registered email is essential once verification is complete</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-160 citation-end-160\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"22\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,6\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MCA in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</strong> is a rigorous technical program designed to build high-level expertise in predictive modeling and autonomous systems. To ensure that students can keep pace with the complex mathematical and computational demands of the curriculum, the eligibility criteria are structured to be both inclusive and foundational. While the program welcomes applicants from diverse undergraduate backgrounds&mdash;ranging from Engineering to the Arts&mdash;it emphasizes a baseline proficiency in logical and quantitative reasoning.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The university&rsquo;s approach recognizes that the next generation of AI innovators may come from non-traditional fields. By providing a structured pathway for students who may not have a background in computer science or advanced mathematics, the program maintains high academic standards while fostering an interdisciplinary learning environment. This ensures that every student, regardless of their starting point, is equipped with the core competencies required for the high-growth AI industry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Core Academic Qualifications</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To be eligible for admission into the MCA in AI &amp; ML, candidates must fulfill the following primary educational requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Undergraduate Degree:</strong> Applicants must hold a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline (B.E., B.Tech., B.Sc., B.Com., B.A., B.Voc., BCA, etc.) or an equivalent qualification from a recognized institution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Mathematics Foundation:</strong> A mandatory requirement is having studied <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"70\">Mathematics</strong> (including Statistics, Quantitative Techniques, or Business Mathematics) at either the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"169\">10+2 level</strong> or during <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"190\">Graduation</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">NIOS and Open Schooling:</strong> Candidates who have completed their 10+2 or degree through the National Institute of Open Schooling (NIOS) or other recognized distance education bodies are eligible, provided the subject prerequisites are met.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Appearing Candidates:</strong> Students currently appearing for their final year examinations of Class 12 (for the math requirement) or their Bachelor&rsquo;s degree can apply for provisional admission.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Strategic Pathway: Bridge Courses for Career Switchers</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">One of the most significant strategic advantages of this program is the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">Bridge Course</strong> system. This initiative is specifically designed to mitigate the \"entry risk\" for students transitioning from non-technical backgrounds. It ensures that students without prior exposure to coding or advanced calculus can reach the technical parity required for AI and ML modules.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Candidate Background</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Mandatory Requirement</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No Mathematics Background</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\">Completion of 01 Mathematics Course</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No Computer Background</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\">Completion of 01 Computer Course</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Neither Math nor Computer Background</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"12,3,1,0\">Completion of 01 Mathematics &amp; 01 Computer Course</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Decision-Making Insights: Risks and Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">A common mistake made by applicants is underestimating the quantitative intensity of Artificial Intelligence. While the <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"120\">Bridge Courses</strong> provide the necessary foundation, students coming from non-math backgrounds must dedicate significant effort to these courses in the first semester. AI and ML are heavily reliant on linear algebra, probability, and calculus; therefore, mastering the bridge material is not just a formality but a critical component of your <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"458\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk Assessment:</strong> The primary risk for students is academic lag if the foundational requirements are treated lightly. To mitigate this, candidates should ensure all transcripts&mdash;especially those highlighting Mathematics/Statistics&mdash;are verified during the admission process. It is also important to note that <strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"306\">eligibility rules are subject to change</strong> as per university discretion. Staying updated with the latest administrative notifications is essential for a successful and risk-free enrollment.</p>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Choosing an <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning</strong> is a high-stakes investment in one of the most transformative sectors of the modern economy. The fee structure for this specialized program is engineered to provide world-class technical training while maintaining a focus on accessibility and financial transparency. For students looking to master neural networks, deep learning, and predictive modeling, understanding the total cost of ownership for this degree is the first step toward a high-growth career.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The program utilizes a semester-based financial model, which allows for better liquidity management compared to traditional upfront annual payments. By integrating significant student grants and flexible payment pathways, the university ensures that financial barriers do not impede the progress of aspiring AI specialists. For those targeting a strong <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"353\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong>, the early-bird grant remains the most effective tool to lower the \"capital expenditure\" of their education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Official Fee Structure Breakdown (Indian &amp; SAARC Applicants)</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following table outlines the transparent cost breakdown for students from India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Standard Fee (Actual)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Applicable Fee (With 20% Grant)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Fee (Per Semester)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\">₹40,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹32,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee (Included)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\">₹2,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹2,000</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\">₹1,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹1,000</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Semestral Payable</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹32,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Strategic Financial Advantages: Grants &amp; EMI Flexibility</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The core of the program\'s affordability is the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"47\">20% Student Grant</strong>, which reduces the actual semester fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"107\">₹40,000</strong> to an applicable rate of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"140\">₹32,400</strong>. This grant is a time-sensitive financial incentive, currently valid for enrollments processed until <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"249\">9th May \'26</strong>. Locking in this rate early is a critical decision-making move, as it protects the student from future fee escalations and significantly improves the overall ROI of the postgraduate degree.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">To further ease the transition, the university provides multiple <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">Payment Preferences</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No-Cost EMI:</strong> This is a strategic tool for students who prefer to break down their semester dues into smaller, interest-free monthly payments, ensuring their education does not disrupt their current financial stability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lumpsum Payment:</strong> Ideal for those who prefer the \"One-Time Payment\" mode to clear their semestral obligations in a single transaction.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Mode:</strong> Regular payment cycles as per the university&rsquo;s academic schedule.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MCA in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</strong> offers a cutting-edge curriculum designed to transform students into high-level tech architects. This program is not merely a traditional computer applications degree; it is a specialized journey into the mechanics of \"intelligent\" software. The syllabus is architected to balance core software engineering principles with advanced mathematical foundations and the latest industry-standard tools like Python, Java, and Linux scripting.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">By moving through a structured four-semester roadmap, students transition from foundational programming to the complex realms of <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">Deep Learning</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"147\">Natural Language Processing (NLP)</strong>. This ensures that graduates are not just coders, but problem-solvers capable of designing autonomous systems that can analyze, learn, and evolve.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Semester-Wise Subject Breakdown</h3>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Semester 1: The Technical Foundation</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The first semester focuses on building a robust base in software design, networking, and core programming logic.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP437: Software Engineering Practices</strong> &ndash; Mastering the lifecycle of software development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP444: Object Oriented Programming using C++</strong> &ndash; Learning the fundamental OOP concepts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP446: Data Warehousing and Data Mining</strong> &ndash; Understanding how to extract value from vast data repositories.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP448: Linux and Shell Scripting</strong> &ndash; Gaining proficiency in the OS that powers the global cloud.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP453: Data Communication and Networking</strong> &ndash; The backbone of digital interaction.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">SEC-I:</strong> Skill Enhancement Course I.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,6,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bridge Courses (If Applicable):</strong> <em data-path-to-node=\"9,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">ECAP012: Fundamentals of Computer and C Programming</em> &amp; <em data-path-to-node=\"9,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">EMTH006: Elementary Mathematics</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Semester 2: Advanced Infrastructure &amp; Data</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Students pivot toward modern infrastructure and high-level data handling.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP615: Programming in Java</strong> &ndash; Developing enterprise-level applications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP770: Advanced Data Structures</strong> &ndash; Optimizing algorithms for speed and efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP456: Introduction to Big Data</strong> &ndash; Handling the volume, velocity, and variety of modern data.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP470: Cloud Computing</strong> &ndash; Deployment strategies in virtualized environments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">EMTH403: Mathematical Foundation for Computer Science</strong> &ndash; The logic and calculus behind AI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP472: Web Technologies</strong> &ndash; Building the front-end and back-end of the digital world.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,6,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">SEC-II:</strong> Skill Enhancement Course II.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Semester 3: The AI &amp; Machine Learning Core</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">The \"specialization\" takes center stage with a heavy focus on predictive modeling and intelligent scripts.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP776: Programming in Python</strong> &ndash; Mastering the primary language of the AI industry.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP515: Fundamentals of Machine Learning</strong> &ndash; Training models to recognize patterns.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP516: Natural Language Processing (NLP)</strong> &ndash; Enabling machines to understand human language.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">GE-I &amp; GE-II:</strong> Generic Electives to broaden professional expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP735: Seminar on Summer Training</strong> (or a course from GE Basket 1).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">SEC-III:</strong> Skill Enhancement Course III.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"16\">Semester 4: Deep Learning &amp; Capstone Execution</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">The final semester prepares students for high-stakes roles through advanced neural networks and project work.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP527: Deep Learning</strong> &ndash; Diving into neural networks and complex AI structures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP794: Advance Data Visualization</strong> &ndash; Turning complex data into actionable visual insights.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ECAP788: Project Work</strong> &ndash; A comprehensive capstone project demonstrating industry readiness.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">GE-III &amp; GE-IV:</strong> Final Generic Electives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">SEC-IV:</strong> Skill Enhancement Course IV.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\">Strategic Depth: Curriculum ROI and Market Alignment</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">From a strategic perspective, this syllabus is highly optimized for <strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"68\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong>. By including <strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">Cloud Computing</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">Big Data</strong> alongside <strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"148\">AI</strong>, the university ensures that students are prepared for the \"Full Stack\" of data intelligence. In the current job market, an AI Engineer who also understands <strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"308\">Linux Scripting</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"328\">Cloud Deployment</strong> (taught in Semesters 1 &amp; 2) commands a significantly higher salary than a specialist who only knows algorithms.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk Assessment &amp; Strategic Insights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"23\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Python Pivot\":</strong> Students often wait until Semester 3 to take Python seriously. This is a strategic mistake. Since Python is the lifeblood of AI/ML, successful students begin self-learning Python basics during Semester 1 to hit the ground running.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bridge Course Strategy:</strong> For those in the bridge courses (ECAP012/EMTH006), these subjects are non-credit but high-value. Failing to master <strong data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"139\">Elementary Mathematics</strong> will create a significant risk when attempting <strong data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"209\">Mathematical Foundations</strong> in Semester 2.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capstone Weight:</strong> The <strong data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"21\">ECAP788 Project Work</strong> in the final semester is your \"portfolio.\" In the AI industry, employers value a working GitHub repository of your project more than your GPA. Strategy: Choose a project that solves a real-world business problem in finance or healthcare to maximize employability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p id=\"p-rc_0cc48da6481a11d0-233\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0\">In the modern professional landscape, a degree alone is often insufficient without a robust support system to translate academic knowledge into high-value employment. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-962\">LPU Online Placement Support Services</span></strong><span class=\"citation-962\"> are strategically architected to enhance student capabilities, ensuring they meet the precise requirements of today&rsquo;s dynamic career market. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\"><span class=\"citation-962 citation-end-962\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-961\">This ecosystem goes beyond traditional lecturing to create deep professional awareness and motivate students to acquire vital \"add-on\" skills that are highly prized by recruiters outside of their core subject matter. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-961 citation-end-961\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0cc48da6481a11d0-234\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0\">The university&rsquo;s proactive stance involves significant additional effort to offer fitting job prospects to its global student body. By facilitating direct interactions between aspiring professionals and established organizations, the program ensures that every learner has a platform to demonstrate their technical proficiency. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-960\">This specialized support is a critical component for students aiming to penetrate competitive sectors like cybersecurity, where practical demonstration of skill is often the primary gatekeeper to employment. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\"><span class=\"citation-960 citation-end-960\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Core Pillars of Career Success</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0cc48da6481a11d0-235\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1\"><span class=\"citation-959\">To ensure students are fully prepared for the competitive and rapidly evolving job market, LPU Online provides a multi-layered support strategy: </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2\"><span class=\"citation-959 citation-end-959\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0cc48da6481a11d0-236\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-958\">Impactful Placement Drives:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-958\"> These events are designed as high-intensity networking hubs where students can interact directly with prospective employers, showcasing their technical and soft skills to secure promising job roles. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-958 citation-end-958\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0cc48da6481a11d0-237\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-957\">Capability Enhancement:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-957\"> Services are precisely tailored to align a student\'s existing strengths with specific career requirements, ensuring their profile stands out in a crowded digital recruitment landscape. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-957 citation-end-957\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0cc48da6481a11d0-238\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-956\">Add-on Skill Motivation:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-956\"> Beyond the standard curriculum, the placement cell identifies emerging industry trends and encourages students to master supplementary tools and certifications. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-956 citation-end-956\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0cc48da6481a11d0-239\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-955\">Direct Employer Networking:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-955\"> Impactful drives provide a transparent environment for students to understand employer expectations and negotiate career trajectories in real-time. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-955 citation-end-955\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Strategic Depth: Maximizing Your Career ROI</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0cc48da6481a11d0-240\" data-path-to-node=\"10\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0\">From a decision-making perspective, the placement support system is the single most important factor in determining the <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0\" data-index-in-node=\"120\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong> of an online degree. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2\"><span class=\"citation-954\">While the curriculum provides the \"how-to,\" the placement drive provides the \"where-to.\" </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3\"><span class=\"citation-954 citation-end-954\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,5\"><span class=\"citation-953\">For students, the strategic advantage lies in the university&rsquo;s ability to bypass traditional cold-application methods, placing them directly in front of hiring managers who already recognize the value of the university&rsquo;s rigorous training. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,6\"><span class=\"citation-953 citation-end-953\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0cc48da6481a11d0-241\" data-path-to-node=\"11\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk Assessment &amp; Strategic Planning:</strong> A common mistake among postgraduate students is waiting until the final semester to engage with placement services. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2\"><span class=\"citation-952\">To mitigate the risk of a slow start to their career, students should utilize the \"career awareness\" pillar of the service as early as the first year. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3\"><span class=\"citation-952 citation-end-952\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,5\"><span class=\"citation-951\">By identifying the specific \"add-on\" skills requested by recruiters during early-stage placement drives, students can tailor their elective choices and project work to match high-demand niches, effectively pre-selling their expertise before they even graduate. </span></span></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(252, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 231, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-02 07:11:59', '2026-06-16 06:02:31', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Information Technology</strong> admission process is architected to be as efficient and professional as the industry it represents. Designed for busy professionals and aspiring tech leaders, the enrollment funnel is a direct, four-step digital journey that eliminates traditional bureaucratic delays. This streamlined approach ensures that high-potential candidates&mdash;whether they are fresh graduates or qualified professionals like CAs and CSs&mdash;can transition into their specialized business education with absolute clarity and administrative ease.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">By digitizing every phase of the onboarding process, the university ensures that your transition from an applicant to a management student is seamless. For those looking to secure student grants before the upcoming deadline, understanding this sequence is critical for timely submission and financial optimization.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Step-by-Step Enrollment Guide</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following roadmap outlines the official digital procedure to secure your seat in the MBA IT program.</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1f97cd1e461f9867-119\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration and Profile Creation</strong> The process begins with an initial sign-up on the university\'s admission portal. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-645\">During this phase, you will create your unique applicant profile and pay the initial Registration Fee</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-645 citation-end-645\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0,4\">. This step locks in your intent to apply and opens the formal communication channel with the university.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1f97cd1e461f9867-120\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Online Application Form &amp; Documentation</strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-644\">In the second stage, you will fill in your comprehensive personal and academic details</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-644 citation-end-644\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,6\"><span class=\"citation-643\">You are required to pay the program fee and upload relevant digital documents, such as degree certificates or professional credentials</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,7\"><span class=\"citation-643 citation-end-643\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,8\">. This is the stage where you finalize your financial plan and choose your preferred payment mode.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1f97cd1e461f9867-121\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Verification by University</strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-642\">Once your application is submitted, the university&rsquo;s admission cell performs a rigorous audit of your credentials</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-642 citation-end-642\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,4\">. They verify that your academic background meets the eligibility standards for an MBA in Information Technology. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,6\"><span class=\"citation-641\">During this phase, students are advised to \"sit back and wait\" for the formal admission confirmation</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,7\"><span class=\"citation-641 citation-end-641\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,8\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1f97cd1e461f9867-122\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Student Registration and LMS Activation</strong> The final milestone is your official integration into the university system. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-640\">You will receive your official student registration details and your </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,2\" data-index-in-node=\"69\"><span class=\"citation-640\">LMS (Learning Management System)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-640\"> credentials over email</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-640 citation-end-640\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,4\">. Activation of the LMS marks the beginning of your academic journey, giving you instant access to IT management modules and digital libraries.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Information Technology (IT)</strong> is a high-authority program designed to produce leaders who can navigate the complexities of digital infrastructure and corporate strategy. To maintain an elite standard of peer-to-peer learning, the eligibility framework is meticulously structured to recognize both traditional academic pathways and rigorous professional certifications. This inclusive approach ensures that the program attracts a diverse group of thinkers&mdash;from tech-savvy engineers to financially disciplined professionals&mdash;all aiming to master the business of technology.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">Whether you are transitioning from a non-technical background or looking to add a layer of management expertise to your existing professional credentials, the admission criteria provide a transparent roadmap. By treating elite certifications from India&rsquo;s premier professional bodies as equivalent to a degree, the university bridges the gap between specialized technical knowledge and broad-based strategic leadership.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Core Academic &amp; Professional Qualifications</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To qualify for the MBA in Information Technology, an applicant must satisfy one of the following primary educational benchmarks:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Graduate Entry:</strong> Candidates must hold a <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline</strong> (e.g., B.A., B.Sc., B.Com., B.Tech., BCA, B.BA., etc.) or an equivalent qualification from a recognized university. No specific prior IT experience is mandatory at the entry level.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Certification Entry (CS):</strong> Individuals who have completed the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Company Secretary (CS)</strong> program from the Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI) are eligible for direct admission, recognizing their expertise in corporate governance and law.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Certification Entry (CA/CMA):</strong> Candidates who have successfully completed <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">Chartered Accountancy (CA)</strong> from the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI) or <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"176\">Cost &amp; Management Accountancy (CMA)</strong> from the Institute of Cost Accountants of India (ICAI) meet the full eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Strategic Insights: Maximizing Admission Success &amp; ROI</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">From a strategic perspective, the MBA in Information Technology serves as a \"career accelerant.\" For professionals like <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"120\">CAs or CMAs</strong>, adding an IT-focused MBA is a high-ROI move that prepares them for \"FinTech\" leadership or Chief Information Officer (CIO) roles, where understanding both the balance sheet and the tech stack is critical.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk Assessment &amp; Decision-Making Insights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Any Discipline\" Factor:</strong> A common mistake is for Arts or Commerce graduates to assume they cannot succeed in an IT-focused MBA. The curriculum is designed to build tech-management skills from the ground up; however, the primary risk for non-technical students is the initial learning curve of systems analysis. To mitigate this, students are encouraged to engage with basic digital literacy modules before the first semester starts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Verification:</strong> For those applying via the professional route (CA/CS/CMA), ensuring you have the \"Final Completion Certificate\" is vital. \"Inter-level\" qualifications are generally not sufficient to meet the degree-equivalence requirement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Policy Fluidity:</strong> It is essential to remember that <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">eligibility and admission criteria are subject to change</strong> as prescribed by the university. Strategically, candidates should complete their \"Step 1: Registration\" early to lock in the criteria applicable at the time of their application, especially regarding the current grant cycle ending on <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"341\">9th May \'26</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Choosing an <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">MBA in Information Technology (IT)</strong> is a pivotal step for professionals aiming to lead at the intersection of business strategy and technological innovation. The fee framework for this program is designed to be transparent and accessible, providing high-authority business education while accommodating various financial backgrounds. For candidates targeting leadership roles in tech-consulting, systems management, or digital transformation, understanding the semestral investment is key to calculating the long-term <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"529\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The program follows a semester-based payment model, which is highly advantageous for working professionals who prefer managing their educational expenses alongside their monthly income. By leveraging the current <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"212\">Student Grant</strong>, applicants can significantly lower their total capital outlay, making a top-tier MBA more affordable without compromising on the depth of the technological curriculum or the global recognition of the degree.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Detailed Fee Structure Breakdown (Indian &amp; SAARC)</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The fees outlined below are specifically applicable to applicants from India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan. This table format is optimized for clear data portability and comparison.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Standard Fee (Actual)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Applicable Fee (With 20% Grant)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Fee (Per Semester)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\">₹50,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee (Included)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\">₹2,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹2,000</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\">₹1,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹1,000</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Payable per Semester</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹50,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Strategic Financial Incentives: Grants and Payment Flexibility</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The most influential factor in maximizing the ROI of your MBA IT is the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">20% Student Grant</strong>. This financial incentive effectively reduces the actual semester fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"163\">₹50,000</strong> to an applicable rate of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"196\">₹40,400</strong>. To secure this benefit, students must complete their enrollment before the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"280\">9th May \'26</strong> deadline. From a decision-making standpoint, applying before this cutoff is essential to lock in the lower rate for the duration of the program, directly reducing the \"payback period\" of your degree.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">To support diverse financial strategies, the program offers versatile <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"70\">Payment Preferences</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No-Cost EMI:</strong> An ideal choice for those who wish to distribute the semester cost into interest-free monthly installments, preserving their monthly cash flow.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lumpsum Payment:</strong> Preferred by students who wish to settle their semester obligations in a single \"One-Time Payment\" to avoid monthly tracking.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Payment:</strong> Available for those who prefer the traditional university payment cycles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Decision-Making Insights: Risks and Hidden Costs</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">A common mistake made by applicants is overlooking the distinction between bundled and unbundled costs. While the <strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"114\">Applicable Fee of ₹40,400</strong> includes the <strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"153\">₹2,000 examination fee</strong>, it excludes the <strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"193\">initial non-refundable registration fee of ₹1,000</strong>. This registration fee is an upfront, one-time cost required to initiate the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk Assessment:</strong> The primary financial risk is missing the grant deadline. Applying after <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"90\">9th May \'26</strong> could lead to an increase of nearly ₹10,000 per semester, significantly impacting the overall cost of the program. Additionally, while the MBA IT covers core management and technology modules, students should budget for external professional certifications (such as PMP, ITIL, or AWS Cloud Practitioner) which are often pursued alongside the degree to further enhance employability in the high-stakes IT sector.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">MBA in Information Technology</strong> curriculum is a high-authority academic framework designed to merge traditional management prowess with the technical agility required in the digital age. This syllabus is architected to evolve with the global tech landscape, moving from the core principles of financial reporting and economics to specialized, industry-shaping domains like <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"375\">Database Management Systems</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"404\">Python Analytics</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"426\">Information Security</strong>. This rigorous academic roadmap ensures that graduates are prepared to lead digital transformations and manage complex IT infrastructures within global corporations.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The program is structured across four semesters, meticulously balanced to ensure a high <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong> for the learner. The first year focuses on building a \"Business Generalist\" foundation with a quantitative edge, while the second year pivots into deep technical and strategic specializations. By integrating <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"323\">Business Analytics</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"346\">Legal Aspects of Business</strong> early on, the curriculum ensures that IT leaders are data-driven and legally compliant in their decision-making processes.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Semester-Wise Subject Breakdown</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following tables provide a granular look at the subjects you will master throughout your MBA IT journey.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Year 1: Management Foundations &amp; Analytical Core</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">The first year establishes the bedrock of business intelligence, introducing students to the language of financial reporting and the economic environments that dictate market movements.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 1</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 2</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\">Financial <span class=\"citation-541 citation-end-541\">Reporting, Statements and Analysis<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\"><span class=\"citation-540 citation-end-540\">Corporate Finance<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0,0\"><span class=\"citation-539 citation-end-539\">Managerial Economics<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0\"><span class=\"citation-538 citation-end-538\">Operations Management and Research<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0,0\"><span class=\"citation-537 citation-end-537\">International Business Environment<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,0\"><span class=\"citation-536 citation-end-536\">Business Analytics<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0,0\"><span class=\"citation-535 citation-end-535\">Marketing Management<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,4,1,0\"><span class=\"citation-534 citation-end-534\">Research Methodology<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,5,0,0\"><span class=\"citation-533 citation-end-533\">Organisati<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span>onal Behaviour &amp; HR Dynamics</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,5,1,0\">Legal Aspects of Business</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,6,1,0\">Communication for Leaders</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Year 2: IT Specialization &amp; Strategic Leadership</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">In the second year, the focus narrows toward high-value technology sectors. This phase is designed to prepare students for elite roles in systems management, data science, and IT security.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 3</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 4</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\">Database Management Systems</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\">Advance Data Visualization</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,0\">Managing Information Systems</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\">Information Security and Privacy</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,0\">Data Analytics with Python</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,1,0\">Planning Enterprise Resources</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,4,0,0\">Corporate Strategy and Entrepreneurship</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,4,1,0\">Capstone Project</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,5,0,0\">Generic Elective I</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,5,1,0\">Generic Elective II</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,6,0,0\">Seminar on Summer Training</span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\">Strategic Depth: Curriculum ROI and Market Alignment</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">The strategic advantage of this syllabus lies in its focus on <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">Data-Driven Decision Making</strong>. Modules like <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"104\">Data Analytics with Python</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"135\">Advance Data Visualization</strong> are critical in today&rsquo;s economy, where the ability to interpret \"Big Data\" directly impacts a company\'s competitive edge. For a student, the ROI of mastering <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"320\">Managing Information Systems</strong> in Semester 3 is immediate, as it aligns with the core requirements of IT consultancy and systems architecture roles.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">Furthermore, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"17\">Capstone Project</strong> in Semester 4 serves as the ultimate professional exercise. It requires students to synthesize their learning from <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"149\">Information Security</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"174\">ERP Planning</strong> to solve real-world organizational challenges. This practical application is a key differentiator in the job market, transforming a theoretical degree into a proven track record of competency.</p>', NULL, '<p id=\"p-rc_b64c6caa2647e834-95\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0\">In the contemporary competitive job market, academic knowledge must be supplemented with robust professional readiness. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-610\">LPU Online Placement Support Services</span></strong><span class=\"citation-610\"> are architected to bridge the gap between classroom learning and industry requirements</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\"><span class=\"citation-610 citation-end-610\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-609\">These services are specifically designed to enhance student capabilities, ensuring they align with the latest career standards and expectations</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\"><span class=\"citation-609 citation-end-609\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,8\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,10\"><span class=\"citation-608\">Beyond the core curriculum, the university places a heavy emphasis on creating awareness and motivating students to acquire critical \"add-on\" skills that provide a distinctive edge in the corporate landscape</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,11\"><span class=\"citation-608 citation-end-608\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,12\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b64c6caa2647e834-96\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0\">At the heart of the LPU Online experience is a proactive commitment to student success. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-607\">The university makes a concerted additional effort to offer fitting job prospects by organizing and conducting </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,2\" data-index-in-node=\"111\"><span class=\"citation-607\">Impactful Placement Drives</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\"><span class=\"citation-607 citation-end-607\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,6\"><span class=\"citation-606\">These high-value events serve as a direct bridge to the professional world, providing students with unique opportunities to interact with prospective employers, demonstrate their specialized skills in real-time, and secure promising job roles that define their future career trajectories</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,7\"><span class=\"citation-606 citation-end-606\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,8\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Strategic Advantage: Enhancing Marketability and ROI</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">From a strategic perspective, these placement services are essential for maximizing the <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong> of an online degree. While the degree provides the foundation, the university\'s placement drives act as the catalyst for entry into prestigious organizations. For students, the ability to interact directly with recruiters and demonstrate practical expertise before graduation is a primary decision-making factor that significantly reduces the risk of post-degree job searching.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Decision-Making &amp; Risk Insights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Proactive Engagement:</strong> A common mistake made by postgraduate students is waiting until the final semester to utilize career services. To mitigate the risk of a slow career start, students should participate in \"awareness\" sessions early to identify which \"add-on skills\" are currently in high demand.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b64c6caa2647e834-97\" data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Demonstration:</strong> During placement drives, the risk lies in failing to articulate technical expertise effectively. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-605\">Students are encouraged to use the university\'s enhancement services to practice their demonstrations, ensuring they can showcase their capabilities convincingly to prospective employers</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-605 citation-end-605\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b64c6caa2647e834-98\" data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Career Alignment:</strong> Strategic success depends on choosing roles that offer long-term growth. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-604\">The placement support team assists students in evaluating job prospects to ensure they are \"fitting\" for their specific career goals</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-604 citation-end-604\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,4\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(253, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 232, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-03 23:46:55', '2026-06-16 06:26:42', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Navigating the admission process for a high-stakes technical degree like the MCA in Cybersecurity shouldn\'t be a source of stress. LPU Online has engineered a digital-first, streamlined onboarding experience that minimizes administrative friction, allowing you to focus on your upcoming academic journey. The process is designed to be transparent, ensuring that every applicant knows exactly where they stand&mdash;from the initial sign-up to the moment their virtual classroom is activated.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Understanding this roadmap is essential for securing your seat, especially when aiming for deadline-sensitive benefits like student grants. By following the structured steps below, you can transition from an applicant to a registered cybersecurity scholar with confidence and clarity.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Admission Workflow</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The enrollment journey is divided into four distinct phases, each serving a specific purpose in your academic integration.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Step</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Action</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Description</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">01</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\">Visit the official portal to sign up. You will be required to pay the initial <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">₹1,000 Registration Fee</strong> to initiate your application file.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">02</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Online Application Form</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\">Provide comprehensive personal and academic details. At this stage, you must pay the program fee and upload all relevant digital documents.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">03</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Verification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\">The University&rsquo;s admission audit team reviews your credentials. During this phase, you can sit back as the university ensures all eligibility standards are met.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">04</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Activation</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,2,0\">Once verified, you are officially registered. Your unique <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">LMS credentials</strong> will be sent to your registered email, granting access to the learning ecosystem.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Enrollment: Decision-Making &amp; Risk Management</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">While the process is straightforward, strategic timing and attention to detail are paramount to avoid common pitfalls:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Timing:</strong> To take advantage of the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"46\">20% Student Grant</strong> (valid until 9th May \'26), you should complete Step 1 and Step 2 well in advance. Delayed document uploads can push your verification past the grant deadline.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Incomplete Application\" Risk:</strong> One of the most common mistakes is uploading low-resolution or incomplete documents in Step 2. This triggers a \"re-upload\" request, which can delay your LMS activation by several days or even weeks. Ensure all transcripts and IDs are scanned from the originals, not photocopies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_bf0ad8c914bb769e-145\" data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Insight:</strong><span class=\"citation-344 citation-end-344\"> The initial ₹1,000 registration fee is a non-refundable administrative charge.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span> It is separate from the tuition fee. It is wise to verify your core eligibility (Bachelor&rsquo;s degree/CA/CS) before paying this fee to ensure you are a viable candidate</p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from LPU Online. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahgKEwi4_uev7Z6UAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQjgE\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Onboarding:</strong> Do not wait until the day of your first lecture to check your credentials. Once you receive your email in Step 4, immediately log in to the Learning Management System (LMS) to familiarize yourself with the interface and available bridge courses.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p id=\"p-rc_a445447bced55340-107\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\">The MCA in Cybersecurity is designed to bridge the gap between traditional academic foundations and the advanced technical skills required for digital defense. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-267\">The eligibility framework is intentionally broad, recognizing that the most effective cybersecurity professionals often come from diverse analytical backgrounds, including finance, law, and general business.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\"><span class=\"citation-267 citation-end-267\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,6\"><span class=\"citation-266\">By opening doors to both traditional graduates and certified professional experts, the program fosters an interdisciplinary environment essential for understanding the modern threat landscape.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,7\"><span class=\"citation-266 citation-end-266\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,8\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a445447bced55340-108\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0\">For students transitioning from non-technical fields, this degree provides a structured pathway to gain technical mastery. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-265\">The university maintains a standard of academic rigor while ensuring that professionals from various sectors can pivot into this high-growth industry.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\"><span class=\"citation-265 citation-end-265\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Academic &amp; Professional Qualifications</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To be eligible for admission into the MCA in Cybersecurity, an applicant must fulfill one of the following primary criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a445447bced55340-109\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-264\">Standard Undergraduate Path:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-264\"> A Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline or its equivalent from a recognized institution.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-264 citation-end-264\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Accounting Path:</strong> Candidates who have completed <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">Chartered Accountancy (CA)</strong> from the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI) or <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"150\">Cost &amp; Management Accountancy (CMA)</strong> from the Institute of Cost Accountants of India (ICAI) are eligible.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Governance Path:</strong> Individuals who have completed <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">Company Secretary (CS)</strong> from the Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI) meet the eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Insights: Decision-Making &amp; Risk Assessment</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">When evaluating eligibility, it is vital to look beyond the basic requirements to understand the long-term academic commitment:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Advantage of Professional Backgrounds:</strong> Professionals like CAs or CSs often possess an inherent advantage in cybersecurity domains such as <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"142\">Governance, Risk, and Compliance (GRC)</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"185\">Cyber Law</strong>. Their existing expertise in audit and regulation aligns perfectly with the policy side of security.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a445447bced55340-110\" data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-263\">Risk of Academic Evolution:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-263\"> It is crucial for applicants to note that eligibility rules, admission criteria, and other conditions are subject to change as prescribed by the university.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-263 citation-end-263\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,2\">. A common mistake is delaying an application based on old criteria; always verify the current standards before starting your application.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a445447bced55340-111\" data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Decision-Making Psychology:</strong> Many candidates from non-IT backgrounds hesitate to apply due to \"technical anxiety.\" </span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-262\">However, the program\'s inclusive eligibility suggests that the focus is on analytical capability rather than just prior coding experience.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-262 citation-end-262\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,4\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p id=\"p-rc_f443d438c5dec87a-73\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\">Choosing an advanced degree in a specialized field like cybersecurity requires a clear understanding of the financial commitment and the potential Return on Investment (ROI). </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-209\">The fee structure for the MCA in Cybersecurity is designed to provide high-level technical training while remaining accessible through strategic financial aids and flexible payment plans</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\"><span class=\"citation-209 citation-end-209\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,6\"><span class=\"citation-208\">For students prioritizing long-term career growth, the current fee framework balances top-tier curriculum delivery with significant cost-saving opportunities through early application grants</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,7\"><span class=\"citation-208 citation-end-208\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,8\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_f443d438c5dec87a-74\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-207\">The program\'s financial architecture is built on a semester-based model, ensuring that students can manage their cash flow without the burden of a massive upfront payment</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-207 citation-end-207\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-206\">Furthermore, the inclusion of specific regional pricing for Indian and SAARC applicants makes it a competitive choice for students across the subcontinent</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-206 citation-end-206\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,9\"><span class=\"citation-205\">By understanding the nuances of the Student Grant and the distinction between standard and applicable fees, candidates can effectively reduce their total educational expenditure</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,10\"><span class=\"citation-205 citation-end-205\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,11\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Fee Breakdown (Indian &amp; SAARC Applicants)</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_f443d438c5dec87a-75\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1\"><span class=\"citation-204\">The following table outlines the current cost of the program for applicants from India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2\"><span class=\"citation-204 citation-end-204\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Standard Fee (Per Semester)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Applicable Fee (With 20% Grant)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Tuition &amp; Exam Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\">₹50,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\">₹40,400</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\">₹1,000 (One-time)</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\">₹1,000 (One-time)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Semestral Payable</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹50,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Financial Planning: Grants and Payment Modes</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_f443d438c5dec87a-76\" data-path-to-node=\"11\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1\"><span class=\"citation-203\">The 20% Student Grant is a pivotal factor in the decision-making process for many applicants</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2\"><span class=\"citation-203 citation-end-203\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,5\"><span class=\"citation-202\">This grant effectively reduces the per-semester cost from the actual fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,5\" data-index-in-node=\"76\"><span class=\"citation-202\">₹50,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-202\"> to an applicable fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,5\" data-index-in-node=\"108\"><span class=\"citation-202\">₹40,400</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,6\"><span class=\"citation-202 citation-end-202\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,7\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,9\"><span class=\"citation-201\">It is critical to note that this financial advantage is time-sensitive, currently valid for applications submitted before </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,9\" data-index-in-node=\"122\"><span class=\"citation-201\">9th May \'26</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,10\"><span class=\"citation-201 citation-end-201\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,11\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Beyond the tuition, the university offers diverse <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Payment Preferences</strong> to suit different financial backgrounds:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_f443d438c5dec87a-77\" data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-200\">No-Cost EMI:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-200\"> Allows students to distribute the semester fee into manageable monthly installments without accruing interest</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-200 citation-end-200\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_f443d438c5dec87a-78\" data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-199\">Standard EMI:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-199\"> Regular installment plans for flexible budgeting</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-199 citation-end-199\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_f443d438c5dec87a-79\" data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-198\">Lumpsum Payment:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-198\"> A one-time payment mode for those who prefer to clear the semester dues in a single transaction</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-198 citation-end-198\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The MBA in Supply Chain Management (SCM) is a high-authority academic framework meticulously designed to transform graduates into industry-ready leaders in global trade and operations. The syllabus follows a progressive learning trajectory, moving from foundational business principles to advanced, strategic logistics and analytical strategies. In a globalized economy where efficiency is the primary competitive advantage, this degree provides the technical and managerial depth required to optimize complex supply networks.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Choosing this specialization is a strategic move for students who wish to blend organizational behavior with the mathematical precision of operations research. The curriculum bridges the gap between traditional management and modern, data-driven supply chain protocols, ensuring that graduates are prepared to proactive design resilient systems that can withstand global market fluctuations.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester-Wise Subject Breakdown</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Building the Management Foundation</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The first semester focuses on the core pillars of business administration, providing the analytical tools necessary for advanced specialization.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Reporting, Statements and Analysis (EACC506):</strong> Mastering the language of business through financial data.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Managerial Economics (EECO515):</strong> Applying economic theories to organizational decision-making.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Business Environment (EMGN578):</strong> Understanding the global forces shaping modern trade.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Marketing Management (EMKT503):</strong> Strategies for market penetration and brand sustainability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Organisational Behaviour and Human Resource Dynamics (EMGN581):</strong> Managing the human element within complex structures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Analytical Mastery &amp; Leadership</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The second semester introduces technical proficiency and leadership communication essential for operations managers.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Finance (EFIN542):</strong> Strategic capital management and investment analysis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operations Management and Research (EOPR639):</strong> Quantitative methods for optimizing production and service delivery.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Analytics (EMGN801):</strong> Leveraging data to drive operational efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Research Methodology (EMGN832):</strong> Systematic approaches to solving industrial problems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Legal Aspects of Business (EBSL605):</strong> Navigating the regulatory and contractual landscape.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Communication for Leaders (EPEL537):</strong> Developing the soft skills required for executive influence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Core Specialization &amp; Quality Standards</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">The third semester dives deep into the technicalities of supply chain components and quality control.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Management (EOPR508):</strong> Frameworks for delivering complex initiatives on time and within budget.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Quality Management (EOPR509):</strong> Implementing Six Sigma and Lean methodologies for operational excellence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inventory Management (EOPR513):</strong> Strategic control of stock levels to minimize costs and maximize service.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Strategy and Entrepreneurship (EMGN571):</strong> High-level planning for business growth and innovation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective I (GE-I):</strong> Specialized elective choice to broaden professional expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Seminar on Summer Training (EMGN583):</strong> Practical application and reflection on industry internship experience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Strategic Global Integration</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">The final semester focuses on the macro-level integration of logistics and the execution of a major research project.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Supply Chain Management (EOPR523):</strong> Aligning supply chain capabilities with corporate goals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Logistics Management (EOPR524):</strong> Efficient movement and storage of goods across the value chain.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Supply Chain (EOPR536):</strong> Managing cross-border logistics and international vendor relations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective II (GE-II):</strong> Final elective to round out the management profile.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capstone Project (EMGN696):</strong> An intensive, research-driven project demonstrating mastery of SCM principles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p id=\"p-rc_618bb34ef14085f0-123\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\">The transition from academic mastery to professional excellence is a critical phase in any technologist\'s journey. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-324\">At LPU Online, placement support services are meticulously designed to enhance students&rsquo; capabilities in direct alignment with modern career requirements</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\"><span class=\"citation-324 citation-end-324\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4\">. In an industry as dynamic as cybersecurity, possessing a degree is only the first step; the ability to demonstrate specialized, \"field-ready\" skills is what ultimately secures high-value roles in top-tier organizations.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_618bb34ef14085f0-124\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0\">The program\'s placement ecosystem goes beyond traditional job listings. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-323\">It focuses on creating awareness of the evolving threat landscape and motivating students to acquire critical add-on skills that fall outside their core subject modules</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\"><span class=\"citation-323 citation-end-323\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,4\">. This holistic approach ensures that graduates are not just technically proficient but also possess the professional agility required to navigate the complex corporate environments of the cybersecurity sector.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Advantage: Impactful Placement Drives</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_618bb34ef14085f0-125\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0\">A cornerstone of the career support framework is the execution of targeted placement drives. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2\"><span class=\"citation-322\">LPU Online makes an additional effort to offer fitting job prospects to students by conducting these impactful events</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3\"><span class=\"citation-322 citation-end-322\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4\">. These drives serve as a bridge between the classroom and the high-stakes world of digital defense, providing a controlled yet realistic environment for career advancement.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Key benefits of these placement initiatives include:<span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-321\">Employer Interaction:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-321\"> Students gain unique opportunities to interact directly with prospective employers, gaining insights into what industry leaders are currently seeking</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-321 citation-end-321\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_618bb34ef14085f0-127\" data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-320\">Skill Demonstration:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-320\"> The drives provide a platform for students to demonstrate their technical skills, from ethical hacking to network administration, in front of hiring managers</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-320 citation-end-320\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_618bb34ef14085f0-128\" data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-319\">Job Security:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-319\"> The ultimate goal of these events is to help students secure promising job roles that offer long-term stability and growth in the tech industry</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-319 citation-end-319\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(254, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 233, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 00:18:49', '2026-06-16 06:30:17', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The journey toward a world-class education should be defined by intellectual growth, not administrative hurdles. LPU Online has meticulously engineered a streamlined, digital-first admission process that ensures transparency and efficiency at every stage. Designed to cater to global applicants, this roadmap allows you to transition from an aspirant to a registered scholar with minimal friction. By following these four critical steps, you can secure your future in high-demand fields like Management, Information Technology, or Finance.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Understanding the sequence of enrollment is vital, especially when aiming to capitalize on early application benefits such as the <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"130\">20% Student Grant</strong> (valid until 9th May \'26). Below is the comprehensive breakdown of the official enrollment lifecycle.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Enrollment Workflow</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Step</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Action &amp; Description</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">01</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sign up and pay the initial Registration Fee.</strong> Visit the official admission portal to create your profile. A non-refundable registration fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"143\">₹1,000</strong> is required to initiate your application file.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">02</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Online Application Form</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fill details, pay program fee, and upload documents.</strong> Complete your personal and academic profile. This stage requires you to choose your payment preference (Lumpsum or EMI) and upload high-resolution scans of your degrees and ID.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">03</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Verification by University.</strong> Once submitted, the university\'s audit team reviews your credentials. This ensures all eligibility criteria are met. During this time, you can sit back and wait for the formal admission confirmation.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">04</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Activation</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Student Registration and LMS Activation.</strong> Upon successful verification, your status is finalized. You will receive your <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"119\">Learning Management System (LMS) credentials</strong> via your registered email to begin your academic journey.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Insights: Decision-Making &amp; Risk Mitigation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Early Bird\" Strategy:</strong> To ensure you benefit from current financial grants, complete Step 1 and Step 2 before the <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">9th May \'26 deadline</strong>. Verification (Step 3) can take a few business days, so initiating your application early prevents last-minute technical delays from affecting your fee status.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Integrity Risk:</strong> One of the most common reasons for admission delays is the submission of blurred or incomplete documents. Ensure that all uploads in Step 2 are scanned from original documents (not photocopies) to pass the Step 3 audit on the first attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Onboarding Insight:</strong> Your LMS is the heart of your education. Once you reach Step 4, immediately log in to verify your credentials. This portal is where you will access live lectures, digital study material, and your personalized academic calendar.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Provisional Admission:</strong> If you are in your final semester of graduation, you can still initiate the process. You can apply with your current mark sheets for provisional admission, securing your place while you wait for your final results.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The eligibility framework for LPU Online programs is strategically engineered to welcome a diverse spectrum of learners, ranging from traditional university graduates to seasoned professional experts. By recognizing high-tier professional qualifications as equivalent to academic degrees, the university ensures that its postgraduate programs&mdash;especially the MBA and MCA in Cybersecurity&mdash;are accessible to individuals with strong analytical and governance backgrounds. This inclusive approach fosters a multi-disciplinary learning environment essential for modern leadership and technical excellence.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Whether you are transitioning from a core technical field or a rigorous professional practice in finance or law, the 2026 admission criteria provide a clear, standardized pathway for enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Eligibility Framework: 2026 Admission</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To be eligible for admission into the postgraduate programs, an applicant must satisfy one of the following primary academic or professional requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Academic Path:</strong> Possession of a <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"40\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline</strong> or an equivalent qualification from a recognized institution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Corporate Governance Route:</strong> Successful completion of the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">Company Secretary (CS)</strong> qualification from the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"107\">Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Financial Expertise Route:</strong> Completion of <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">Chartered Accountancy (CA)</strong> from the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI)</strong> OR <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"135\">Cost &amp; Management Accountancy (CMA)</strong> from the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"180\">Institute of Cost Accountants of India (ICAI)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">[Image Suggestion: A pyramid infographic showing \'Bachelor\'s Degree\', \'CA/CMA\', and \'CS\' at the base leading to \'Masters Admission\' at the apex]</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Insights: Decision-Making &amp; Risk Assessment</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Equivalence Advantage:</strong> For professionals such as CAs or CSs, this eligibility criteria is a significant career accelerator. It recognizes their years of rigorous professional training as a direct substitute for a traditional undergraduate degree, allowing them to add a formal Master\'s degree (like an MBA or MCA) to their portfolio without needing to return to a three-year undergraduate program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Any Discipline\" Opportunity:</strong> The flexibility of the \"Bachelor\'s degree in any discipline\" is particularly beneficial for those looking to pivot careers. For instance, an Arts graduate can enter the MCA in Cybersecurity, provided they are willing to bridge the technical gap through the university\'s structured modules.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk of Regulatory Evolution:</strong> It is imperative to note that <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">eligibility, admission criteria, or any other condition is subject to change</strong> as prescribed by the university. Relying on outdated requirements is a high-risk strategy; always ensure your qualification aligns with the latest university guidelines before paying the registration fee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Provisional Admission Insight:</strong> If you are appearing for your final year exams or professional finals, you may be eligible for provisional admission. Securing your seat early is recommended to avoid missing out on grant deadlines, such as the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"242\">20% Student Grant</strong> valid until 9th May \'26.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Choosing an advanced degree in a specialized field like cybersecurity requires a clear understanding of the financial commitment and the potential Return on Investment (ROI). The fee structure for the MCA in Cybersecurity is designed to provide high-level technical training while remaining accessible through strategic financial aids and flexible payment plans. For students prioritizing long-term career growth, the current fee framework balances top-tier curriculum delivery with significant cost-saving opportunities through early application grants.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The program\'s financial architecture is built on a semester-based model, ensuring that students can manage their cash flow without the burden of a massive upfront payment. Furthermore, the inclusion of specific regional pricing for Indian and SAARC applicants makes it a competitive choice for students across the subcontinent. By understanding the nuances of the Student Grant and the distinction between standard and applicable fees, candidates can effectively reduce their total educational expenditure.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Fee Breakdown (Indian &amp; SAARC Applicants)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The following table outlines the current cost of the program for applicants from India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Standard Fee (Per Semester)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Applicable Fee (With 20% Grant)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Tuition &amp; Exam Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\">₹50,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\">₹40,400</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\">₹1,000 (One-time)</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\">₹1,000 (One-time)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Semestral Payable</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹50,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Financial Planning: Grants and Payment Modes</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The 20% Student Grant is a pivotal factor in the decision-making process for many applicants. This grant effectively reduces the per-semester cost from the actual fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"170\">₹50,000</strong> to an applicable fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"202\">₹40,400</strong>. It is critical to note that this financial advantage is time-sensitive, currently valid for applications submitted before <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"333\">9th May \'26</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Beyond the tuition, the university offers diverse <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Payment Preferences</strong> to suit different financial backgrounds:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No-Cost EMI:</strong> Allows students to distribute the semester fee into manageable monthly installments without accruing interest.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard EMI:</strong> Regular installment plans for flexible budgeting.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lumpsum Payment:</strong> A one-time payment mode for those who prefer to clear the semester dues in a single transaction.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The MBA in Finance is a rigorous, high-authority program designed to produce elite financial architects capable of navigating the complexities of global capital markets. The curriculum is meticulously structured to transition students from fundamental economic principles to high-stakes strategic decision-making in areas like Investment Banking and Risk Management. In an era of volatile markets and rapid digital transformation, this syllabus ensures graduates possess both the traditional expertise and the modern analytical tools required to drive organizational value.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">This specialization is ideal for those aiming for leadership roles in banking, fintech, and corporate treasury. By integrating quantitative rigor with leadership dynamics, the program prepares candidates to manage multi-billion dollar portfolios and lead financial institutions with precision and ethical integrity.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester-Wise Subject Breakdown</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Mastering Business Foundations</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The first semester establishes the bedrock of management and economic logic, essential for any finance professional.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Reporting, Statements and Analysis (EACC506):</strong> Decoding corporate health through balance sheets and cash flows.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Managerial Economics (EECO515):</strong> Applying micro and macro-economic models to firm-level decisions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Business Environment (EMGN578):</strong> Analyzing global trade policies and geopolitical risks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Marketing Management (EMKT503):</strong> Understanding value creation and market positioning.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Organisational Behaviour and Human Resource Dynamics (EMGN581):</strong> Managing human capital within financial structures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Analytical Core &amp; Corporate Governance</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The second semester introduces advanced quantitative techniques and the legal frameworks of the business world.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Finance (EFIN542):</strong> Strategic capital budgeting and dividend policy management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operations Management and Research (EOPR639):</strong> Optimizing internal processes through mathematical modeling.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Analytics (EMGN801):</strong> Harnessing big data to predict financial trends and consumer behavior.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Research Methodology (EMGN832):</strong> Scientific approaches to financial data gathering and hypothesis testing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Legal Aspects of Business (EBSL605):</strong> Navigating the regulatory landscape and contract law.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Communication for Leaders (EPEL537):</strong> Persuasive communication strategies for boardroom influence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Specialized Banking &amp; Credit Mastery</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">Semester three pivots into deep-domain specialization, focusing on institutional banking and credit risk.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Banking (EFIN530):</strong> Managing large-scale commercial loans and industrial credit facilities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Statement Analysis and Credit Management (EFIN811):</strong> Advanced techniques for assessing borrower creditworthiness.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Banking and Forex Management (EFIN566):</strong> Navigating global currency markets and cross-border transactions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Strategy and Entrepreneurship (EMGN571):</strong> Driving long-term growth and innovative business models.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective I (GE-I):</strong> Tailoring the degree with elective choices from various management baskets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Seminar on Summer Training (EMGN583):</strong> Professional reflection and reporting on industrial internship experiences.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Strategic Finance &amp; Risk Mitigation</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">The final semester focuses on high-tier financial services and the execution of a major research initiative.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Investment Banking (EFIN509):</strong> Managing M&amp;As, IPOs, and corporate restructuring.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Management of Financial Services (EFIN528):</strong> Overview of insurance, mutual funds, and wealth management sectors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk Management (EFIN529):</strong> Identifying and hedging against market, credit, and operational risks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective II (GE-II):</strong> Final elective to round out the professional management profile.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capstone Project (EMGN696):</strong> An intensive, original research project demonstrating mastery of financial concepts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p id=\"p-rc_86d46a58a18e2c90-157\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\">The transition from academic excellence to professional success is a journey that requires more than just a degree. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-428\">LPU Online Placement Support Services are strategically designed to enhance students&rsquo; capabilities in direct alignment with current career requirements. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\"><span class=\"citation-428 citation-end-428\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,5\"><span class=\"citation-427\">In a competitive global economy, the university focuses on creating awareness and motivating students to acquire critical add-on skills beyond their core subjects. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,6\"><span class=\"citation-427 citation-end-427\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,7\"> This holistic approach ensures that graduates are not only masters of their theoretical domains but are also equipped with the professional agility needed to thrive in high-stakes corporate environments.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_86d46a58a18e2c90-158\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0\">By fostering a culture of continuous improvement, LPU Online prepares its students for the rigors of the modern workforce. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-426\">The services aim to bridge the gap between classroom knowledge and industry expectations, ensuring that every learner has the tools to build a sustainable and rewarding career path. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\"><span class=\"citation-426 citation-end-426\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Advantage: Impactful Placement Drives</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_86d46a58a18e2c90-159\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1\"><span class=\"citation-425\">A defining feature of the career ecosystem at LPU Online is the additional effort made to offer fitting job prospects to students through impactful Placement Drives. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2\"><span class=\"citation-425 citation-end-425\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3\"> These events are more than just recruitment cycles; they are professional platforms where theory meets practice.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Key benefits of these placement initiatives include:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_86d46a58a18e2c90-160\" data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-424\">Employer Interaction:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-424\"> Students gain the opportunity to interact directly with prospective employers, gaining firsthand insight into organizational cultures and expectations. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-424 citation-end-424\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_86d46a58a18e2c90-161\" data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-423\">Skill Demonstration:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-423\"> These drives provide a vital stage for students to demonstrate their technical and managerial skills to industry leaders. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-423 citation-end-423\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_86d46a58a18e2c90-162\" data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-422\">Job Security:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-422\"> The primary goal of these organized events is to help students secure promising job roles that offer professional growth and financial stability. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-422 citation-end-422\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Career Planning: ROI, Risks, and Decision-Making</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_86d46a58a18e2c90-163\" data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The ROI of Career Support:</strong> The true Return on Investment of an online degree is measured by its career mobility. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-421\">Engaging with placement services early ensures you are targeting roles with high salary potential, moving beyond entry-level positions. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-421 citation-end-421\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_86d46a58a18e2c90-164\" data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-420\">Risk of Skill Stagnation:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-420\"> A common mistake students make is focusing solely on their grades while ignoring \"add-on skills.\" </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-420 citation-end-420\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,3\"><span class=\"citation-419\">In fields like finance or cybersecurity, lacking a supplementary certification or soft-skill training can significantly lower your success rate during placement drives. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-419 citation-end-419\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_86d46a58a18e2c90-165\" data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Decision-Making Insight:</strong> High-authority careers are built on networking. Use the university\'s placement drives not just to find a job, but to build a network of prospective employers.&nbsp; </span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-418\">This proactive strategy reduces the risk of long-term career plateaus. </span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(255, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 104, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 00:35:08', '2026-06-16 06:30:39', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Securing your place in a premier online program is a streamlined, four-stage journey designed to transition you from an applicant to a registered student with minimal friction. In the digital-first academic landscape of 2026, the admission process emphasizes both security and speed, ensuring that your academic credentials are thoroughly vetted while providing rapid access to your virtual learning environment. Understanding each phase of this process is critical not just for successful enrollment, but for ensuring you capitalize on time-sensitive financial benefits like the 20% Student Grant (valid until 9th May \'26).</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The transition into high-authority online education requires a disciplined approach to documentation and fee management. By following the structured roadmap provided by the university, candidates can avoid common pitfalls such as verification delays or missing the window for early-bird LMS activation.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The 4-Step Enrollment Blueprint</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1: Registration &ndash; Securing Your Candidacy</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The journey begins with the creation of your digital profile. This initial phase involves signing up on the official admission portal and paying a non-refundable <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"162\">Registration Fee of ₹1,000</strong>. This step is vital as it officially marks your entry into the university\'s database and locks in your eligibility for current scholarship cycles.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1f9a3e2bfbc65000-370\" data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-787\">Key Action:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-787\"> Create a unique user ID and complete the registration payment. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-787 citation-end-787\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2: Online Application &ndash; Comprehensive Data Submission</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Once registered, you must provide detailed academic and personal information. This stage requires you to pay the applicable program fee&mdash;which could be as low as <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"161\">₹16,400 per semester</strong> for regional applicants&mdash;and upload all relevant supporting documents.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1f9a3e2bfbc65000-371\" data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-786\">Key Action:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-786\"> Ensure all scanned copies of degrees, mark sheets, and ID proofs are clear and legible to prevent Step 3 delays. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-786 citation-end-786\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3: Document Verification &ndash; The University Audit</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">After submission, the university&rsquo;s registrar office performs a high-authority audit of your credentials. You do not need to take any action during this phase. The university cross-references your submitted documents with eligibility standards to provide a formal admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1f9a3e2bfbc65000-372\" data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-785\">Key Action:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-785\"> Monitor your registered email for status updates or requests for additional clarification. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-785 citation-end-785\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4: Student Registration &amp; LMS Activation &ndash; Accessing the Future</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">Upon successful verification, your journey as a student officially begins. The university will send your <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"105\">Learning Management System (LMS) credentials</strong> via email. These credentials provide you with 24/7 access to recorded lectures, digital libraries, and your academic schedule.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1f9a3e2bfbc65000-373\" data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-784\">Key Action:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-784\"> Log in immediately to verify access and explore the orientation modules</span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p id=\"p-rc_69ee6a44469c130b-315\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\">The eligibility standards for the 2026 academic intake reflect a modern, inclusive approach to higher education, recognizing that leadership and specialized expertise can stem from any foundational background. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-685\">By establishing a \"Bachelor\'s degree in any discipline\" as the primary qualifying benchmark, the university encourages multi-disciplinary professional shifts, allowing individuals from diverse academic roots to pivot into high-growth sectors like Technology, Management, and Finance. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\"><span class=\"citation-685 citation-end-685\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,5\"><span class=\"citation-684\">This flexibility is a strategic advantage for those looking to redefine their career trajectories without being constrained by their initial undergraduate specialization. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,6\"><span class=\"citation-684 citation-end-684\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_69ee6a44469c130b-316\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0\">Adhering to these criteria is the first critical step in a successful admission journey. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-683\">While the current framework is designed for broad accessibility, it maintains a high standard of academic rigor, ensuring that all enrolled candidates possess the baseline analytical and cognitive skills required to master advanced postgraduate curricula. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\"><span class=\"citation-683 citation-end-683\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Admission Criteria: 2026 Academic Intake</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To qualify for admission, applicants must satisfy the following fundamental requirement:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_69ee6a44469c130b-317\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-682\">Academic Prerequisite:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-682\"> Possession of a </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\"><span class=\"citation-682\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline</span></strong><span class=\"citation-682\"> or an equivalent qualification recognized by the university. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-682 citation-end-682\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">[Image Suggestion: A \"Global Career Pathway\" infographic showing various undergraduate degrees (Arts, Science, Commerce) funneling into a unified Postgraduate program]</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Insights: Decision-Making, Risks, and ROI</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_69ee6a44469c130b-318\" data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-681\">The Power of Generalist Degrees:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-681\"> The \"any discipline\" clause is a significant booster for ROI. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-681 citation-end-681\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,3\"><span class=\"citation-680\">It allows students who may have pursued a generalist degree (such as a BA or B.Sc.) to upgrade their credentials into specialized professional roles, effectively \"re-skilling\" for the modern digital economy. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-680 citation-end-680\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_69ee6a44469c130b-319\" data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk of Regulatory Evolution:</strong> A critical risk factor for applicants is the fluid nature of admission rules. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,2\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-679\">Eligibility, admission criteria, or any other condition is subject to change</span></strong><span class=\"citation-679\"> as prescribed by the university. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-679 citation-end-679\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,5\"><span class=\"citation-678\">Relying on historical data without verifying the current 2026 statutes could lead to application rejection. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,6\"><span class=\"citation-678 citation-end-678\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_69ee6a44469c130b-320\" data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-677\">Equivalence Verification:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-677\"> For those with international degrees or non-traditional diplomas, \"equivalence\" is a high-authority determination made by the university. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-677 citation-end-677\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,3\"><span class=\"citation-676\">A common mistake is assuming a certification is equivalent to a degree without a formal audit, which can result in the loss of the initial non-refundable registration fee. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-676 citation-end-676\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_69ee6a44469c130b-321\" data-path-to-node=\"12,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-675\">Provisional Admission Strategy:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-675\"> Applicants currently in their final year of graduation are often eligible to apply. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-675 citation-end-675\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"16\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,3,1,3\"><span class=\"citation-674\">By applying early, you can secure early-bird financial benefits, such as the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,1,3\" data-index-in-node=\"77\"><span class=\"citation-674\">20% Student Grant</span></strong><span class=\"citation-674\"> (valid until 9th May \'26), even if your final degree certificate is still pending. </span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-193\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1\"><span class=\"citation-511\">Investing in a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) is a foundational step toward a lucrative career in the global technology sector. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-511 citation-end-511\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4\"><span class=\"citation-510\">The fee structure for the Online BCA program is engineered to provide high-authority technical training while remaining accessible through strategic financial aids and flexible payment plans. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,5\"><span class=\"citation-510 citation-end-510\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,7\"><span class=\"citation-509\">For students prioritizing long-term career growth, the current fee framework balances top-tier curriculum delivery with significant cost-saving opportunities through early application grants. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,8\"><span class=\"citation-509 citation-end-509\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-194\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-508\">The program\'s financial architecture is built on a semester-based model, ensuring that students can manage their cash flow without the burden of a massive upfront payment. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-508 citation-end-508\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,4\"><span class=\"citation-507\">Furthermore, the inclusion of specific regional pricing for Indian and SAARC applicants makes it a competitive choice for students across the subcontinent. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-507 citation-end-507\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\"><span class=\"citation-506\">By understanding the nuances of the Student Grant and the distinction between standard and applicable fees, candidates can effectively reduce their total educational expenditure. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,8\"><span class=\"citation-506 citation-end-506\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Fee Breakdown (Indian &amp; SAARC Applicants)</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-195\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1\"><span class=\"citation-505\">The following table outlines the current cost of the program for applicants from India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2\"><span class=\"citation-505 citation-end-505\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Standard Fee (Per Semester)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Applicable Fee (With 20% Grant)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Tuition &amp; Exam Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-196\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-504\">₹20,000 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-504 citation-end-504\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-197\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-503\">₹16,400 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-503 citation-end-503\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-198\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-502\">₹1,000 (One-time) </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-502 citation-end-502\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-199\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-501\">₹1,000 (One-time) </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-501 citation-end-501\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Semestral Payable</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-200\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-500\">₹20,000</span></strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-500 citation-end-500\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"16\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-201\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-499\">₹16,400</span></strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-499 citation-end-499\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"17\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Financial Planning: Grants and Payment Modes</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-202\" data-path-to-node=\"11\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0\">The 20% Student Grant is a pivotal factor in the decision-making process for many applicants. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2\"><span class=\"citation-498\">This grant effectively reduces the per-semester cost from the actual fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2\" data-index-in-node=\"76\"><span class=\"citation-498\">₹20,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-498\"> to an applicable fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2\" data-index-in-node=\"108\"><span class=\"citation-498\">₹16,400</span></strong><span class=\"citation-498\">. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3\"><span class=\"citation-498 citation-end-498\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,5\"><span class=\"citation-497\">It is critical to note that this financial advantage is time-sensitive, currently valid for applications submitted before </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,5\" data-index-in-node=\"122\"><span class=\"citation-497\">9th May \'26</span></strong><span class=\"citation-497\">. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,6\"><span class=\"citation-497 citation-end-497\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Beyond the tuition, the university offers diverse <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Payment Preferences</strong> to suit different financial backgrounds:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-203\" data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-496\">No-Cost EMI:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-496\"> Allows students to distribute the semester fee into manageable monthly installments without accruing interest. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-496 citation-end-496\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"20\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-204\" data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-495\">Standard EMI:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-495\"> Regular installment plans for flexible budgeting. </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-495 citation-end-495\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"21\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8bc72b3b67bf833b-205\" data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-494\">Lumpsum Payment:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-494\"> A one-time payment mode for those who prefer to clear the semester dues in a single transaction. </span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The MA Political Science program is a high-authority academic journey designed for future diplomats, policy analysts, and governance experts. The curriculum provides a rigorous exploration of political power, international dynamics, and the institutional frameworks that shape modern societies. In an era of shifting global alliances and complex internal political processes, this syllabus offers the analytical tools required to interpret and influence the political landscape with precision and strategic depth.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">This specialization is ideal for individuals aiming for careers in the civil services, international NGOs, political consultancy, or academia. By blending classical political thought with modern diplomatic practice, the program prepares candidates to navigate the nuances of both national governance and global international relations.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester-Wise Subject Breakdown</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Foundations of Political Thought and Research</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The first semester builds a strong theoretical and analytical foundation, essential for understanding the complexities of the state and global interactions.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Relations-Theory and Practice (EPOL552):</strong> Analyzing the theoretical frameworks that govern interactions between nation-states.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Political Theory (EPOL524):</strong> Exploring the classical and modern concepts of justice, liberty, and power.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Political Institutions in India (EPOL525):</strong> A deep dive into the constitutional and structural pillars of Indian democracy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fundamentals of Research (EGEN530):</strong> Mastering the qualitative and quantitative methodologies used in political inquiry.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fundamentals of Information Technology (ECAP145):</strong> Equipping political analysts with the essential digital tools for data management and communication.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Indian Thought and Policy Governance</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The second semester focuses on localized political intelligence and the practical application of governance.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Indian Political Thought (EPOL528):</strong> Studying the contributions of Indian thinkers to political philosophy and statecraft.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Public Policy and Governance in India (EPOL527):</strong> Analyzing how policies are formulated, implemented, and evaluated within the Indian context.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Diplomacy in Modern World (EPOL529):</strong> Exploring the evolving art of negotiation and representation in contemporary international affairs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective I (GE-I):</strong> Diversifying expertise with a choice from multidisciplinary academic baskets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Teaching Aptitude (ESSC501):</strong> Developing pedagogical skills for those targeting careers in higher education and research.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Comparative Analysis and Foreign Policy</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">Semester three pivots into comparative studies and the strategic execution of India\'s role on the global stage.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Comparative Political Analysis (EPOL650):</strong> Systematically comparing political systems and processes across different countries.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">India&rsquo;s Foreign Policy (EPOL618):</strong> Examining the strategic objectives and historical evolution of India&rsquo;s global engagement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Peace and Conflict Resolution (EPOL633):</strong> Studying the mechanisms of diplomacy and intervention used to resolve regional and global disputes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective II (GE-II):</strong> Further elective specialization to round out the professional profile.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Term Paper (ESSC608):</strong> An intensive research module focusing on a specific political problem (students may also choose a course from the GE basket).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Advanced Processes and Independent Research</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">The final semester culminates in specialized electives and an original contribution to political scholarship.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Political Processes in India (EPOL617):</strong> Analyzing elections, social movements, and the dynamic forces within Indian politics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective III &amp; IV (GE-III &amp; GE-IV):</strong> Advanced elective choices to deepen domain expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dissertation (EPOL692):</strong> An original, high-authority research project demonstrating mastery of political science (or elective courses in lieu of the dissertation).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p id=\"p-rc_ae910b9606e40c99-344\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\">In today&rsquo;s rapidly evolving job market, a degree is most valuable when paired with industry-ready capabilities. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-745\">LPU Online Placement Support Services are strategically designed to enhance students&rsquo; capabilities as per specific career requirements</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\"><span class=\"citation-745 citation-end-745\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,6\"><span class=\"citation-744\">Beyond traditional academics, the university focuses on creating awareness and motivating students to acquire critical add-on skills other than their core subjects</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,7\"><span class=\"citation-744 citation-end-744\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,8\">. This proactive approach ensures that learners are not just graduates, but competitive professionals ready to navigate the complexities of their chosen industries.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">By fostering a culture of continuous learning, LPU Online bridges the gap between theoretical knowledge and practical application. The support services act as a catalyst for professional growth, encouraging students to stay ahead of the curve by mastering emerging tools and methodologies that employers value most.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Connecting Talent with Opportunity: Impactful Placement Drives</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_ae910b9606e40c99-345\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0\">A cornerstone of the career ecosystem at LPU Online is the dedication to providing students with tangible career outcomes. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2\"><span class=\"citation-743\">The university makes an additional effort to offer fitting job prospects to students by conducting impactful Placement Drives</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3\"><span class=\"citation-743 citation-end-743\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4\">. These organized events serve as a high-authority bridge between academic life and the corporate world, ensuring that distance is never a barrier to opportunity.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Key advantages of these placement initiatives include:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_ae910b9606e40c99-346\" data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-742\">Direct Employer Interaction:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-742\"> These events provide students with invaluable opportunities to interact directly with prospective employers</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-742 citation-end-742\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_ae910b9606e40c99-347\" data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-741\">Platform for Demonstration:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-741\"> Students are given a formal stage to demonstrate their technical and soft skills to industry leaders</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-741 citation-end-741\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_ae910b9606e40c99-348\" data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-740\">Career Security:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-740\"> The ultimate goal of these drives is to help students secure promising job roles that align with their long-term career aspirations</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-740 citation-end-740\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Career Planning: ROI, Risks, and Insights</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_ae910b9606e40c99-349\" data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Maximizing ROI through Skill Integration:</strong> The Return on Investment (ROI) of your online degree is significantly amplified when you utilize placement support to transition into higher-paying roles. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-739\">By focusing on \"add-on skills\" early in your program, you position yourself as a high-value candidate during university drives</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-739 citation-end-739\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_ae910b9606e40c99-350\" data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk of Passive Learning:</strong> A common mistake students make is relying solely on the curriculum. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-738\">The risk of skill stagnation is high in the digital age; hence, the university\'s emphasis on add-on skills is a vital strategy to maintain professional relevance</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-738 citation-end-738\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_ae910b9606e40c99-351\" data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Decision-Making Insight:</strong> Treat placement drives as networking goldmines. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-737\">Even if a specific role is not your final goal, the opportunity to interact with employers provides real-world feedback on your skill demonstration, helping you refine your approach for future high-authority roles</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-737 citation-end-737\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0,4\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(256, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 234, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 00:54:43', '2026-06-16 06:33:46', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Joining our academic community is a straightforward four-step journey. We have designed our process to be transparent and efficient, ensuring you can focus on your future studies while we handle the logistics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\">1. Registration</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1: Sign up and pay the initial Registration Fee</strong> The journey begins at our Admissions Portal. Create your unique student profile by providing your basic contact information. To secure your place in the applicant pool, you will be required to pay a non-refundable registration fee. This step grants you full access to the comprehensive application dashboard.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\">2. Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2: Fill in details, pay program fee, and upload relevant documents</strong> Once registered, complete the detailed application form. This includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic History:</strong> Details of your previous schooling and qualifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Selection:</strong> Choosing your specific major or area of study.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Upload:</strong> You will need to upload scanned copies of your transcripts, identity proof, and recent photographs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Fee:</strong> Complete the payment for your specific program tuition or processing fee to move your application to the review stage.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\">3. Document Verification by University</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3: Sit back and wait for admission confirmation</strong> Our admissions committee and registrar\'s office will meticulously review your submitted documents to ensure they meet the university\'s eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Note:</em> You may be contacted via email if any additional information or clarification is required. You can track your real-time application status through the portal.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\">4. Student Registration and LMS Activation</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4: Get your LMS credentials over the email</strong> Once your documents are verified and admission is officially confirmed, you are officially a student!</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Welcome Kit:</strong> You will receive a formal \"Letter of Admission.\"</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Access:</strong> We will email your login credentials for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong>. This platform is where you will access your course materials, attend virtual lectures, and interact with faculty.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Securing a seat in a premier MBA program requires a clear understanding of the diverse entry pathways available to modern candidates. The eligibility framework for the 2026 academic cycle is designed to be inclusive, recognizing both traditional academic milestones and rigorous professional certifications. This multifaceted approach ensures that the cohort consists of individuals with a wide array of technical and analytical backgrounds, fostering a rich learning environment.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Whether you are a fresh graduate or a seasoned professional with a specialized certification, the admission criteria provide a streamlined route to advanced management education.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Academic and Professional Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Traditional Academic Pathway</strong></h4>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f887b724345b766-414\" data-path-to-node=\"8\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1\"><span class=\"citation-861\">The foundational requirement for most applicants remains a </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1\" data-index-in-node=\"59\"><span class=\"citation-861\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2\"><span class=\"citation-861 citation-end-861\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3\">. This includes arts, science, commerce, or engineering. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5\"><span class=\"citation-860\">Candidates must ensure their degree is recognized or equivalent to standard university requirements to meet the baseline for postgraduate study</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,6\"><span class=\"citation-860 citation-end-860\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Professional Qualification Route</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">A significant advantage of this program is the recognition of professional excellence. Candidates who have completed high-level certifications from India\'s premier professional bodies are eligible for direct admission:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f887b724345b766-415\" data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-859\">Company Secretary (CS):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-859\"> Individuals who have completed their CS from the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"73\"><span class=\"citation-859\">Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-859\"> are recognized as meeting the eligibility standards</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-859 citation-end-859\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f887b724345b766-416\" data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-858\">Chartered Accountancy (CA):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-858\"> Completion of the CA program from the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"66\"><span class=\"citation-858\">Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-858\"> serves as a valid entry qualification</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-858 citation-end-858\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f887b724345b766-417\" data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-857\">Cost &amp; Management Accountancy (CMA):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-857\"> Graduates from the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"56\"><span class=\"citation-857\">Institute of Cost Accountants of India (ICAI)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-857\"> are also eligible to apply</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-857 citation-end-857\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Insights: Decision-Making, Risks, and Compliance</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Professional Parity\" Strategy:</strong> Utilizing a CA or CS qualification for MBA entry is a high-authority move that signals advanced analytical skills. Professionals should leverage this by highlighting how their technical certification complements the broader management curriculum, potentially increasing their ROI during placement cycles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f887b724345b766-418\" data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-856\">Regulatory Fluidity Risk:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-856\"> It is vital for applicants to note that </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"66\"><span class=\"citation-856\">eligibility, admission criteria, or any other condition is subject to change</span></strong><span class=\"citation-856\"> as prescribed by the university</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-856 citation-end-856\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,2\">. This means that while you may meet current standards, staying updated with the latest university notifications is essential to avoid last-minute disqualification.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification Accuracy:</strong> A common mistake is failing to provide \"equivalent\" documentation for degrees earned from non-traditional or international institutions. Ensuring your Bachelor\'s degree carries the necessary equivalency certification is a critical step in the risk-mitigation process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Choosing an advanced degree in a specialized field like cybersecurity is a significant investment in your professional future. For the 2026 academic cycle, the fee structure for the Online MCA in Cybersecurity has been engineered to provide high-authority training at a competitive price point. By leveraging current student grants and flexible payment models, candidates can access world-class technical education while maintaining financial stability.</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_16d4cc652f0eb91f-384\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-824\">The program\'s pricing is localized, specifically catering to applicants from India and the SAARC region, including Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-824 citation-end-824\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\">. This regional pricing strategy ensures that high-level technical expertise remains accessible to the next generation of global security experts.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Fee Breakdown &amp; Regional Grants</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard vs. Applicable Fees</strong></h4>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_16d4cc652f0eb91f-385\" data-path-to-node=\"8\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1\"><span class=\"citation-823\">The standard investment for this program is established at </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1\" data-index-in-node=\"59\"><span class=\"citation-823\">₹50,000 per semester</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2\"><span class=\"citation-823 citation-end-823\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3\">. However, a strategic <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">Student Grant of 20%</strong> is currently available, significantly reducing the cost for eligible candidates.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_16d4cc652f0eb91f-386\" data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-822\">Actual Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-822\"> ₹50,000 per semester</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-822 citation-end-822\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_16d4cc652f0eb91f-387\" data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-821\">Applicable Fee (with 20% Grant):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-821\"> ₹40,400 per semester</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-821 citation-end-821\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_16d4cc652f0eb91f-388\" data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-820\">Validity:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-820\"> This 20% grant is time-sensitive and valid until </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"59\"><span class=\"citation-820\">9th May \'26</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-820 citation-end-820\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mandatory Charges and Inclusions</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Understanding the full cost of the degree requires looking beyond the base tuition:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_16d4cc652f0eb91f-389\" data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-819\">Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-819\"> The applicable fee already includes a mandatory examination charge of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"87\"><span class=\"citation-819\">₹2,000 per semester</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-819 citation-end-819\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_16d4cc652f0eb91f-390\" data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-818\">Registration Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-818\"> There is an initial, </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\"><span class=\"citation-818\">non-refundable registration fee of ₹1,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-818\"> which is excluded from the semester fee and must be paid at the start of the admission process</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-818 citation-end-818\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Financial Planning: ROI, Risks, and Insights</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial ROI Strategy:</strong> To maximize the Return on Investment, students should prioritize applying before the <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">May 9th deadline</strong> to secure the 20% grant. Over a four-semester program, this translates to total savings of nearly <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"224\">₹38,400</strong>, which can be reinvested into professional certifications like CISSP or CEH to further boost market value.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_16d4cc652f0eb91f-391\" data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment Flexibility:</strong> For those managing their own education costs, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"71\">No-Cost EMI</strong> option is a high-authority financial tool. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-817\">Choosing the EMI mode allows you to spread the ₹40,400 cost over several months without incurring interest, effectively preserving your monthly cash flow while earning your degree</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-817 citation-end-817\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_16d4cc652f0eb91f-392\" data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"SAARC Advantage\" Risk:</strong> While the pricing is optimized for India and SAARC nations, applicants must ensure their documentation proves residency in these regions to qualify for this specific fee tier. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-816\">International applicants from outside this group will be subject to a different fee schedule</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-816 citation-end-816\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_16d4cc652f0eb91f-393\" data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time vs. Semesterly Decisions:</strong> While the fee is listed as <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">₹40,400/Semester</strong>, some students may consider a <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">Lumpsum</strong> payment. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-815\">Choosing Lumpsum can often simplify the administrative process and may offer additional peace of mind against future fee adjustments</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-815 citation-end-815\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,4\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The MBA in Healthcare Management is a rigorous, interdisciplinary program designed to bridge the gap between clinical excellence and administrative efficiency. The 2026 curriculum is structured to provide a solid foundation in core business principles during the first year, followed by deep immersion into the specialized nuances of healthcare delivery, medical records, and insurance systems in the second year. This balanced approach ensures that graduates are not only skilled managers but also visionary leaders capable of navigating the complex regulatory and operational landscapes of the global healthcare industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Year 1: Foundation in Business Excellence and Leadership</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Core Management Competencies</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The journey begins with a focus on the essential pillars of business. Candidates develop a strong analytical mindset through <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"125\">Financial Reporting, Statements, and Analysis (EACC506)</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"185\">Managerial Economics (EECO515)</strong>. To ensure a global perspective, the curriculum includes the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"277\">International Business Environment (EMGN578)</strong>. Human-centric leadership is cultivated through <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"370\">Marketing Management (EMKT503)</strong> and the study of <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"418\">Organisational Behaviour and Human Resource Dynamics (EMGN581)</strong>.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Operational and Analytical Depth</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">The second semester shifts toward execution and strategic decision-making. Students master the financial health of organizations with <strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"134\">Corporate Finance (EFIN542)</strong> and optimize processes through <strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"193\">Operations Management and Research (EOPR639)</strong>. The modern healthcare leader must be data-driven; hence, <strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"296\">Business Analytics (EMGN801)</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"329\">Research Methodology (EMGN832)</strong> are core requirements. Compliance and soft skills are refined via <strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"426\">Legal Aspects of Business (EBSL605)</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"466\">Communication for Leaders (EPEL537)</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Year 2: Specialized Healthcare Mastery</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Healthcare Systems and Strategic Integration</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">As students move into their second year, the focus narrows to the healthcare sector. <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"85\">Healthcare Delivery Systems and Public Health Administration (EHLT501)</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"160\">Medical Terminology and Medical Records (EHLT502)</strong> provide the technical baseline needed for hospital operations. The integration of technology is covered in <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"317\">Hospital and Healthcare Information Management (EHLT605)</strong>. This semester also bridges specialized knowledge with high-level business goals through <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"463\">Corporate Strategy and Entrepreneurship (EMGN571)</strong> and practical exposure via the <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"544\">Seminar on Summer Training (EMGN583)</strong>.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Quality, Risk, and Industry Application</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">The final semester prepares candidates for high-stakes environments. <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"69\">Quality Assurance in Healthcare (EHLT607)</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"115\">Healthcare Insurance and Managed Care (EHLT615)</strong> address the critical aspects of patient safety and financial sustainability. Given the unpredictable nature of the sector, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"286\">Disaster Management in Healthcare (EHLT616)</strong> is a mandatory specialization. The program culminates in the <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"391\">Capstone Project (EMGN696)</strong>, where students apply their four-semester journey to solve real-world healthcare challenges.</p>', NULL, '<p id=\"p-rc_5c0ee575d987e029-434\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-900\">LPU Online Placement Support Services are strategically designed to enhance students&rsquo; capabilities, aligning their professional profile with modern career requirements</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-900 citation-end-900\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-899\">The initiative goes beyond standard curriculum delivery by creating awareness and motivating students to acquire add-on skills that complement their primary subjects</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-899 citation-end-899\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\">. This holistic approach ensures that graduates are not only academically proficient but also possess the versatile skill sets demanded by global employers.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5c0ee575d987e029-435\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1\"><span class=\"citation-898\">At the core of this support system is a proactive effort to offer fitting job prospects through the execution of impactful Placement Drives</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-898 citation-end-898\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5\"><span class=\"citation-897\">These events serve as a critical bridge, providing students with direct opportunities to interact with prospective employers and demonstrate their technical and soft skills in real-time</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,6\"><span class=\"citation-897 citation-end-897\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,7\">. By facilitating these high-stakes interactions, the university empowers students to secure promising job roles that align with their career aspirations and ROI expectations.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Strategic Career Growth &amp; Placement Insights</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Navigating the transition from an online degree to a corporate career requires more than just a certificate; it requires a strategic mindset. LPU Online focuses on removing the \"hidden costs\" of career stagnation by providing a structured pathway to employment. Students are encouraged to view placement services not as a final step, but as a continuous process of professional evolution.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Career Opportunities &amp; Roles (Concise Format):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Strategist:</strong> Analyzing market trends to drive organizational growth.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Development Manager:</strong> Identifying new opportunities and managing client relationships.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technical Specialist:</strong> Applying subject-matter expertise to solve complex industrial problems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operational Excellence Lead:</strong> Optimizing internal processes for maximum efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Navigating the Placement Ecosystem: Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">A common mistake students make is waiting until the final semester to engage with placement services. To maximize ROI, students should participate in skill-enhancement workshops early. Risk-averse candidates often miss out on high-growth roles by failing to network during university-led drives. Engaging early with the LPU Online placement portal ensures that your profile is visible to recruiters the moment a drive is announced.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(257, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 235, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 01:18:20', '2026-06-16 06:34:43', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Navigating the transition from an applicant to a registered student is a streamlined, four-phase digital process designed to ensure academic integrity and administrative efficiency.. The university\'s online admission framework leverages automated systems and manual audits to verify candidate eligibility while providing a frictionless experience for the applicant.. By centralizing all stages&mdash;from the initial sign-up to the final activation of learning resources&mdash;the process minimizes the need for physical documentation and travel, making higher education accessible to global learners..</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">Understanding this lifecycle is crucial for maintaining your admission timeline and securing your seat within competitive program windows.. Each step is interdependent, meaning the speed of your transition into the Learning Management System (LMS) depends heavily on the accuracy of the data provided during the early application phases..</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Step-by-Step Enrollment Guide</h3>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\">1. Initial Registration and Sign-Up</h4>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_2bdc6f7bd2e3bad4-264\" data-path-to-node=\"8\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1\"><span class=\"citation-691\">The journey begins with the creation of your unique applicant profile.. During this phase, you are required to sign up on the official portal and pay the initial Registration Fee</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2\"><span class=\"citation-691 citation-end-691\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3\">.. This fee is a non-refundable administrative charge that initiates your file within the university system..</span><!----></p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"9\">2. Comprehensive Online Application</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Once registered, you move into the detailed data-entry phase..</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Information Filing</strong>: Complete all personal, professional, and academic fields accurately..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_2bdc6f7bd2e3bad4-265\" data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-690\">Program Fee Payment</span></strong><span class=\"citation-690\">: Process the tuition or semester fees as per your chosen payment plan</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-690 citation-end-690\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,2\">..</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_2bdc6f7bd2e3bad4-266\" data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-689\">Document Upload</span></strong><span class=\"citation-689\">: Provide scanned, high-resolution copies of your transcripts, identity proofs, and photographs for the registrar\'s review</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-689 citation-end-689\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,2\">..</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"12\">3. University-Level Document Verification</h4>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_2bdc6f7bd2e3bad4-267\" data-path-to-node=\"13\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0\">After submission, your application enters the \"Audit Phase.\". </span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2\"><span class=\"citation-688\">The university&rsquo;s admissions committee meticulously reviews every uploaded document to ensure it aligns with the prescribed eligibility criteria</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3\"><span class=\"citation-688 citation-end-688\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,4\">.. During this time, applicants are advised to monitor their emails for any \"clarification requests\" regarding their academic history or document clarity..</span><!----></p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\">4. Student Registration and LMS Activation</h4>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_2bdc6f7bd2e3bad4-268\" data-path-to-node=\"15\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1\"><span class=\"citation-687\">The final milestone is the formal conversion from an applicant to a student.. Once verification is successful, your admission is officially confirmed </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2\"><span class=\"citation-687 citation-end-687\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4\"><span class=\"citation-686\">.. You will receive your official \"Letter of Admission\" and, more importantly, your unique LMS credentials via email</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,5\"><span class=\"citation-686 citation-end-686\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,6\">.. This allows you to log in, access course materials, and begin your academic sessions immediately..</span></p>', 1, '<p id=\"p-rc_c98ee7462d252d7f-178\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-445\">The MCA in Cybersecurity is designed to be an inclusive yet rigorous program, welcoming candidates from a vast array of academic backgrounds to specialize in the critical field of digital defense.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-445 citation-end-445\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-444\">By maintaining a broad eligibility framework, the university recognizes that the most effective cybersecurity professionals often emerge from diverse analytical disciplines.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-444 citation-end-444\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,9\"><span class=\"citation-443\">This approach ensures that the program fosters an interdisciplinary environment where technical skills are blended with the varied perspectives of graduates from different fields.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,10\"><span class=\"citation-443 citation-end-443\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,11\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c98ee7462d252d7f-179\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1\"><span class=\"citation-442\">The curriculum is structured to support students transitioning from non-technical backgrounds, providing the necessary academic scaffolding to achieve technical mastery in information security.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-442 citation-end-442\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5\"><span class=\"citation-441\">While the program is accessible, it maintains the high academic rigor required to prepare students for the complex and evolving threat landscape.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,6\"><span class=\"citation-441 citation-end-441\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Core Academic Qualifications</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To secure admission into the MCA in Cybersecurity, applicants must satisfy the following primary eligibility benchmark:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c98ee7462d252d7f-180\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-440\">Standard Undergraduate Path</span></strong><span class=\"citation-440\">: A Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline or its equivalent from a recognized university or institution.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-440 citation-end-440\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c98ee7462d252d7f-181\" data-path-to-node=\"9\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1\"><span class=\"citation-439\">This \"any discipline\" rule allows graduates from Science, Commerce, Arts, and other streams to pivot their careers toward high-growth cybersecurity roles.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2\"><span class=\"citation-439 citation-end-439\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Strategic Insights: Decision-Making &amp; Risk Assessment</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">When planning your application, it is essential to consider the strategic nuances of the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c98ee7462d252d7f-182\" data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-438\">The Advantage of Diverse Backgrounds</span></strong><span class=\"citation-438\">: Candidates from non-IT backgrounds should not let \"technical anxiety\" deter them; the program\'s inclusive eligibility is a testament to the value placed on analytical capability and problem-solving over prior coding experience.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-438 citation-end-438\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c98ee7462d252d7f-183\" data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-437\">Risk of Academic Evolution</span></strong><span class=\"citation-437\">: It is a critical administrative reality that eligibility, admission criteria, or any other conditions mentioned for the program are subject to change as prescribed by the university.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-437 citation-end-437\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_c98ee7462d252d7f-184\" data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-436\">Decision-Making Strategy</span></strong><span class=\"citation-436\">: A common mistake is delaying an application based on outdated criteria; prospective students should always verify the most current standards to mitigate the risk of missing admission windows.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-436 citation-end-436\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p id=\"p-rc_ff7d14a4869880e0-217\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-570\">Choosing an advanced degree in a specialized field like cybersecurity requires a clear understanding of the financial commitment involved.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-570 citation-end-570\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-569\">The fee structure for the MCA in Cybersecurity is designed to provide high-level technical training while remaining accessible through strategic financial aids and flexible payment plans.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-569 citation-end-569\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,9\"><span class=\"citation-568\">For students prioritizing a strong Return on Investment (ROI), the current fee framework balances top-tier curriculum delivery with significant cost-saving opportunities through early application grants.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,10\"><span class=\"citation-568 citation-end-568\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,11\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_ff7d14a4869880e0-218\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1\"><span class=\"citation-567\">The program\'s financial architecture is built on a semester-based model, ensuring that students can manage their cash flow without the burden of a massive upfront payment.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-567 citation-end-567\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5\"><span class=\"citation-566\">Furthermore, the inclusion of specific regional pricing for Indian and SAARC applicants makes it a competitive choice for students across the subcontinent.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,6\"><span class=\"citation-566 citation-end-566\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,7\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,9\"><span class=\"citation-565\">By understanding the nuances of the Student Grant and the distinction between standard and applicable fees, candidates can effectively reduce their total educational expenditure.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,10\"><span class=\"citation-565 citation-end-565\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,11\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Detailed Fee Breakdown (Indian &amp; SAARC Applicants)</h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"2\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Standard Amount (Per Semester)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Applicable Amount (With 20% Student Grant)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Tuition &amp; Exam Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5cecdbc011c29f04-244\" data-path-to-node=\"2,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-657\">₹50,000 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-657 citation-end-657\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5cecdbc011c29f04-245\" data-path-to-node=\"2,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-656\">₹40,400 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-656 citation-end-656\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee (One-time)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5cecdbc011c29f04-246\" data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-655\">₹1,000 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-655 citation-end-655\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5cecdbc011c29f04-247\" data-path-to-node=\"2,2,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-654\">₹1,000 (Non-refundable) </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-654 citation-end-654\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Semestral Payable</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2,3,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5cecdbc011c29f04-248\" data-path-to-node=\"2,3,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-653\">₹50,000</span></strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-653 citation-end-653\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2,3,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5cecdbc011c29f04-249\" data-path-to-node=\"2,3,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,3,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-652\">₹40,400</span></strong> </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5cecdbc011c29f04-250\" data-path-to-node=\"5,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-651\">Regional Applicability</span></strong><span class=\"citation-651\">: The fees mentioned above apply to candidates from India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-651 citation-end-651\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5cecdbc011c29f04-251\" data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-650\">Student Grant Deadline</span></strong><span class=\"citation-650\">: The 20% Student Grant (reducing the semester fee to ₹40,400) is a limited-time offer valid for applications submitted before </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"149\"><span class=\"citation-650\">9th May \'26</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-650 citation-end-650\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5cecdbc011c29f04-252\" data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-649\">Inclusive Charges</span></strong><span class=\"citation-649\">: The indicated semester fee of ₹40,400 already includes an examination fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"96\"><span class=\"citation-649\">₹2,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-649\"> per semester</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-649 citation-end-649\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5cecdbc011c29f04-253\" data-path-to-node=\"5,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-648\">Flexible Payment Modes</span></strong><span class=\"citation-648\">: Students can opt for </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\"><span class=\"citation-648\">No-Cost EMI</span></strong><span class=\"citation-648\">, standard EMI, or Lumpsum one-time payments</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-648 citation-end-648\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_ff7d14a4869880e0-219\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"></p>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The Master of Arts (MA) in History is meticulously designed to provide an exhaustive chronological and thematic understanding of human civilization, with a specialized focus on the Indian subcontinent.. This curriculum transitions from foundational ancient history to complex modern global movements, ensuring that students develop a sophisticated lens through which to analyze social, political, and economic evolutions.. By integrating subjects like \"Fundamentals of Research\" and \"Information Technology,\" the program bridges the gap between traditional historiography and modern academic requirements..</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">A strategic highlight of this curriculum is the flexibility offered in the later semesters through Generic Electives and Dissertation tracks.. This allows students to tailor their expertise&mdash;whether they aim for a career in competitive examinations (UPSC/NET), academia, or archival research.. The inclusion of courses on \"Women in Indian History\" and \"Economic History\" reflects a modern, inclusive approach to historical study that goes beyond mere dates and dynasties..</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Semester-Wise Course Distribution</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The program is structured across four semesters, balancing core historical knowledge with research-oriented pedagogy..</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Semester 1: Foundations of Indian History &amp; Research</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">The first semester establishes the timeline of Indian civilization and introduces the technical tools required for advanced historical inquiry..</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ancient &amp; Medieval Roots</strong>: EHIS551 (Upto AD 650) and EHIS533 (1200&ndash;1750 AD) cover the foundational polity and economy..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Colonial Beginnings</strong>: EHIS507 explores the transformative century from 1757 to 1857..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technical Edge</strong>: ECAP145 (IT Fundamentals) and EGEN530 (Research Fundamentals) equip students for modern data handling and thesis writing..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Semester 2: Societal Evolution &amp; Pedagogy</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Semester 2 shifts focus toward social structures and the transition from medieval to modern eras..</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Social Fabric</strong>: EHIS536 analyzes Indian society and culture (1200&ndash;1750 AD)..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Historical Transitions</strong>: EHIS553 (650&ndash;1200 AD) and EHIS656 (1858&ndash;1964 AD) bridge the gap into post-independence India..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Teaching Skills</strong>: ESSC501 (Teaching Aptitude) prepares students specifically for the National Eligibility Test (NET) and academic careers..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Semester 3: Thematic Depth &amp; European Context</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">In the third semester, students engage with specialized themes and international history..</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Thematic Studies</strong>: EHIS632 focuses on the often-overlooked role of women in history, while EHIS636 analyzes economic transitions under colonial rule..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Perspective</strong>: EHIS657 introduces Modern Europe, crucial for understanding global geopolitical shifts..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Research Prelude</strong>: ESSC608 allows a choice between a Term Paper or an additional elective to sharpen specific interests..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Semester 4: Global Modernity &amp; Specialization</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">The final semester culminates in a global outlook and independent research..</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Modern World</strong>: EHIS631 covers the 20th-century world, focusing on the World Wars and the Cold War era..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Specialization (Dissertation/Electives)</strong>: EHIS692 provides a critical choice: completing a comprehensive <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"104\">Dissertation</strong> (ideal for Ph.D. aspirants) or opting for additional elective courses from designated baskets..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">In the contemporary job market, an academic degree serves as the foundation, but specialized placement support acts as the catalyst for career acceleration.. LPU Online Placement Support Services are strategically engineered to enhance students&rsquo; capabilities in direct alignment with modern career requirements.. Recognizing that technical knowledge alone is insufficient, the university prioritizes creating awareness and motivating students to acquire critical add-on skills that extend beyond their core academic subjects..</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The placement ecosystem at LPU Online is not merely a recruitment portal but a comprehensive career-readiness framework.. By integrating professional grooming with high-impact employer networking, the university ensures that distance learners receive the same level of corporate exposure as traditional on-campus students.. This proactive approach mitigates the historical bias against online education, positioning LPU Online graduates as industry-ready professionals..</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Core Pillars of the Placement Ecosystem</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The support services are built on three fundamental pillars designed to maximize student employability:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Enhancement &amp; Awareness</strong>: Beyond the syllabus, students are encouraged to engage in certifications and workshops that address industry-specific gaps.. This includes soft skills, interview etiquette, and technical \"add-on\" proficiencies that make a resume stand out..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Impactful Placement Drives</strong>: LPU Online makes an additional effort to offer fitting job prospects by conducting organized recruitment events.. These drives serve as a bridge, allowing students to interact directly with prospective employers and demonstrate their potential in real-time..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Motivation</strong>: Career counselors work to instill the confidence necessary for students to navigate competitive hiring landscapes, ensuring they remain motivated to pursue roles that offer high-growth trajectories..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(258, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 236, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 01:30:56', '2026-06-16 06:35:07', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Embarking on a digital learning journey requires a clear roadmap to ensure that administrative hurdles do not interfere with academic goals. The <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"145\">LPU Online Admission Process</strong> is engineered for simplicity, transparency, and speed, allowing students from across the globe to secure their future in just four distinct phases. By digitizing every touchpoint&mdash;from the initial sign-up to the final activation of the Learning Management System (LMS)&mdash;the university ensures that your transition into the virtual classroom is professional and efficient.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">This structured approach is designed to provide clarity at every stage, eliminating the guesswork often associated with distance learning enrollments. Whether you are a fresh graduate or a working professional, understanding these steps is the first move toward professional empowerment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">The 4-Step Enrollment Framework</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The university follows a linear progression to ensure all legal and academic standards are met before a student begins their coursework:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_04fcdd4f2d08501b-372\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1024\">Step 1: Registration</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1024\">: The journey begins with creating your unique student profile on the official portal</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1024 citation-end-1024\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-1023\">During this stage, you are required to sign up and pay the initial Registration Fee, which initiates your formal relationship with the university</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-1023 citation-end-1023\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_04fcdd4f2d08501b-373\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1022\">Step 2: Online Application Form</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1022\">: Once registered, you must complete the detailed application form</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1022 citation-end-1022\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-1021\">This involves filling in personal and academic details, paying the required program fee, and uploading scanned copies of relevant documents such as transcripts and identity proof</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-1021 citation-end-1021\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_04fcdd4f2d08501b-374\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1020\">Step 3: Document Verification by University</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1020\">: After submission, the university\'s registrar office meticulously audits your credentials to ensure they meet the eligibility criteria</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1020 citation-end-1020\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-1019\">This is a \"wait-and-watch\" phase where the university confirms the authenticity of your academic history</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-1019 citation-end-1019\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_04fcdd4f2d08501b-375\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1018\">Step 4: Student Registration and LMS Activation</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1018\">: Upon successful verification, you receive your official \"Letter of Admission\"</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1018 citation-end-1018\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,2\">. Your final step is the activation of your digital campus; </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-1017\">LMS credentials (username and password) are sent directly to your registered email, granting you immediate access to lectures and study materials</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-1017 citation-end-1017\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,6\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p id=\"p-rc_6f598d811328b13a-333\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-893\">The admission framework for our advanced programs is designed to foster a diverse and highly qualified academic environment by recognizing both traditional degree paths and elite professional certifications</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-893 citation-end-893\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-892\">By maintaining an inclusive eligibility structure, the university acknowledges that leadership and technical expertise can be cultivated through various rigorous educational journeys</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-892 citation-end-892\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,9\"><span class=\"citation-891\">Whether a candidate holds a standard undergraduate degree or has achieved specialized status through India\'s premier professional bodies, the entry requirements are calibrated to ensure academic success</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,10\"><span class=\"citation-891 citation-end-891\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,11\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f598d811328b13a-334\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1\"><span class=\"citation-890\">This multi-faceted approach specifically targets professionals in the corporate and financial sectors, bridging the gap between practice-based certification and advanced academic study</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-890 citation-end-890\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5\"><span class=\"citation-889\">The university remains committed to a dynamic admission policy, where standards are periodically refined to meet evolving global educational benchmarks</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,6\"><span class=\"citation-889 citation-end-889\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Academic Pathways to Admission</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Candidates can qualify for enrollment through any of the following three distinct pathways:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f598d811328b13a-335\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-888\">Traditional Academic Route</span></strong><span class=\"citation-888\">: Possession of a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline from a recognized institution, or an equivalent qualification, serves as the primary entry point</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-888 citation-end-888\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f598d811328b13a-336\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-887\">Corporate Secretarial Pathway</span></strong><span class=\"citation-887\">: Successful completion of the Company Secretary (CS) program from the Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI) is recognized as full eligibility for admission</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-887 citation-end-887\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f598d811328b13a-337\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-886\">Financial &amp; Management Accounting Pathway</span></strong><span class=\"citation-886\">: Candidates who have completed Chartered Accountancy (CA) from the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI) or Cost &amp; Management Accountancy (CMA) from the Institute of Cost Accountants of India (ICAI) are equally eligible</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-886 citation-end-886\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Strategic Insights: ROI, Risks, and Decision-Making</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f598d811328b13a-338\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-885\">Interdisciplinary Advantage</span></strong><span class=\"citation-885\">: The \"any discipline\" clause represents a significant opportunity for career switchers</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-885 citation-end-885\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-884\">An arts or science graduate can pivot into specialized management or technical programs, maximizing their ROI by adding a professional layer to their diverse background</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-884 citation-end-884\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f598d811328b13a-339\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-883\">The Professional Equivalent Risk</span></strong><span class=\"citation-883\">: A common mistake is assuming that \"partial completion\" of CA or CS qualifies for admission</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-883 citation-end-883\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"16\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-882\">The criteria explicitly require the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,4\" data-index-in-node=\"36\"><span class=\"citation-882\">completion</span></strong><span class=\"citation-882\"> of these professional programs to bypass traditional degree requirements</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-882 citation-end-882\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"17\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f598d811328b13a-340\" data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-881\">Prescriptive Flexibility</span></strong><span class=\"citation-881\">: Applicants must remain aware that all eligibility conditions are subject to change as prescribed by the university</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-881 citation-end-881\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-880\">It is a strategic necessity to verify the specific criteria at the exact moment of registration to avoid administrative delays</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-880 citation-end-880\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,6\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-286\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-811\">Investing in a specialized postgraduate degree like the MCA in Cybersecurity is a strategic move toward a high-growth career in digital defense </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-811 citation-end-811\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,4\"><span class=\"citation-810\">.. The university has structured its fee model to remain accessible through significant student grants and flexible payment preferences, ensuring that financial barriers do not impede academic excellence </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-810 citation-end-810\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\"><span class=\"citation-809\">.. For the 2026 academic cycle, the fee structure emphasizes transparency by bundling essential costs like examination fees into the semester total, while providing distinct regional pricing for applicants from the Indian subcontinent</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,8\"><span class=\"citation-809 citation-end-809\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,9\">..</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-287\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1\"><span class=\"citation-808\">The core of the financial value proposition lies in the \"Student Grant,\" which offers a substantial 20% reduction on the actual fee for early applicants </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-808 citation-end-808\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4\"><span class=\"citation-807\">.. By understanding the interplay between standard fees, applicable fees, and one-time registration costs, prospective students can accurately calculate their total educational expenditure and plan their investment for maximum ROI</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5\"><span class=\"citation-807 citation-end-807\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,6\">..</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Detailed Fee Breakdown (Indian &amp; SAARC Applicants)</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-288\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1\"><span class=\"citation-806\">The following fee structure is applicable specifically to applicants from India, Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2\"><span class=\"citation-806 citation-end-806\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3\">..</span><!----></p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Standard Amount (Per Semester)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Applicable Amount (With 20% Student Grant)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Tuition &amp; Exam Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-289\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-805\">₹50,000 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-805 citation-end-805\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-290\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-804\">₹40,400 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-804 citation-end-804\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee (One-time)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-291\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-803\">₹1,000 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-803 citation-end-803\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-292\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-802\">₹1,000 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-802 citation-end-802\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Semestral Payable</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-293\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-801\">₹50,000</span></strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-801 citation-end-801\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-294\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-800\">₹40,400</span></strong> </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-295\" data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-799\">Examination Fee</span></strong><span class=\"citation-799\">: The semestral amount already includes a mandatory examination fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\"><span class=\"citation-799\">₹2,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-799\"> per semester</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-799 citation-end-799\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,2\">..</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-296\" data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-798\">Registration Fee</span></strong><span class=\"citation-798\">: This is a non-refundable initial charge of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\"><span class=\"citation-798\">₹1,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-798\"> required to start the enrollment process</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-798 citation-end-798\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,2\">..</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Strategic Financial Insights: Grants and Payment Flexibility</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-297\" data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-797\">Student Grant Opportunity</span></strong><span class=\"citation-797\">: The current 20% Student Grant reduces the per-semester burden from ₹50,000 to ₹40,400 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-797 citation-end-797\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,3\"><span class=\"citation-796\">.. To avail of this benefit, applications must be submitted by the deadline of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,3\" data-index-in-node=\"79\"><span class=\"citation-796\">9th May \'26</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-796 citation-end-796\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"16\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,5\">..</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-298\" data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-795\">Payment Preferences</span></strong><span class=\"citation-795\">: Candidates can choose between </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"51\"><span class=\"citation-795\">Standard</span></strong><span class=\"citation-795\"> semester-wise payments or a </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"88\"><span class=\"citation-795\">Lumpsum</span></strong><span class=\"citation-795\"> payment for the entire program duration</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-795 citation-end-795\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"17\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,2\">..</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-299\" data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-794\">EMI Options</span></strong><span class=\"citation-794\">: To facilitate easier cash flow management, the university offers </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\"><span class=\"citation-794\">No-Cost EMI</span></strong><span class=\"citation-794\"> and standard EMI modes, allowing students to pay in monthly installments rather than a one-time semester payment</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-794 citation-end-794\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,2\">..</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0f5f35a143cea440-300\" data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-793\">Regional Pricing Strategy</span></strong><span class=\"citation-793\">: Applicants should note that the indicated fees are subsidized for the SAARC region; international applicants outside these specific countries will follow a separate international fee tier</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-793 citation-end-793\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,2\">..</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The Master of Business Administration (MBA) with a focus on Operations Management is a premier program designed to transform students into high-impact organizational leaders.. This curriculum meticulously balances foundational management principles with specialized operational technicalities, ensuring graduates can optimize complex supply chains and drive organizational efficiency.. By integrating cutting-edge subjects like \"Business Analytics\" and \"Management Information Systems,\" the program bridges the gap between traditional administrative roles and modern, data-driven decision-making..</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">A hallmark of this curriculum is its practical orientation, culminating in a \"Capstone Project\" and \"Seminar on Summer Training\".. This allows students to apply theoretical frameworks&mdash;such as Total Quality Management (TQM) and Service Operations&mdash;to real-world industrial challenges.. The inclusion of \"Communication for Leaders\" and \"Legal Aspects of Business\" ensures that technical experts also possess the soft skills and regulatory knowledge required for executive-level management..</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Semester-Wise Course Distribution</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The program is structured across four intensive semesters, moving from broad management fundamentals to hyper-specialized operational strategies..</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Semester 1: Core Management Foundations</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">The first semester builds the essential toolkit required for any business leader, focusing on the internal and external environments of a firm..</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial &amp; Economic Insight</strong>: EACC506 (Financial Reporting) and EECO515 (Managerial Economics) provide the quantitative basis for fiscal control..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Human &amp; Market Dynamics</strong>: EMGN581 explores HR dynamics, while EMKT503 introduces strategic marketing management..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Context</strong>: EMGN578 (International Business Environment) prepares students for the complexities of global trade from day one..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Semester 2: Analytical Rigor &amp; Leadership</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Semester 2 shifts toward the technical and legal frameworks necessary for operational oversight..</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data-Driven Decisions</strong>: EMGN801 (Business Analytics) and EMGN832 (Research Methodology) equip students to handle big data and industrial research..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operational Core</strong>: EOPR639 (Operations Management and Research) and EFIN542 (Corporate Finance) link production efficiency with financial health..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Leadership Soft Skills</strong>: EPEL537 (Communication for Leaders) focuses on executive presence and persuasive communication..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Semester 3: Advanced Supply Chain &amp; Strategy</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The third semester dives deep into the \"Operations\" specialization while fostering entrepreneurial thinking..</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Efficiency Suite</strong>: EOPR509 (Total Quality Management), EOPR505 (Logistics &amp; SCM), and EOPR508 (Project Management) form the core of operational excellence..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Vision</strong>: EMGN571 (Corporate Strategy and Entrepreneurship) prepares students to lead startups or scale established firms..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Practical Exposure</strong>: Students choose between a Seminar on Summer Training (EMGN583) or an elective, ensuring industry-aligned learning..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Semester 4: Global Logistics &amp; Specialized Mastery</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">The final semester prepares students for the global marketplace and independent problem-solving..</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Logistics</strong>: EOPR512 (International Trade Logistics) and OPRM534 (Service Operations) focus on the complexities of movement and service delivery..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">System Integration</strong>: HMT177 (Management Information System) provides the IT backbone for modern organizational management..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capstone Finale</strong>: EMGN696 (Capstone Project) is the final assessment where students demonstrate their mastery through a comprehensive industrial project..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">In the modern competitive landscape, a degree is only the starting point. LPU Online recognizes that the true ROI of higher education is measured by professional success and career mobility.. To ensure this, the university has established a robust <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"248\">Placement Support Services</strong> ecosystem designed to do more than just list jobs; it transforms students into highly employable professionals.. These services focus on holistic capability enhancement, aligning student skills with the dynamic requirements of global industries..</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The placement strategy at LPU Online is dual-layered.. First, it focuses on <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">skill-readiness</strong>, motivating students to acquire \"add-on skills\" that complement their core academic subjects.. Second, it provides <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"207\">direct market access</strong> through impactful Placement Drives, where students transition from the virtual classroom to real-world interviews with prospective employers.. This proactive approach ensures that distance learners are never \"distant\" from the job market..</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">The Core Pillars of Placement Excellence</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The placement cell operates through a structured framework aimed at maximizing student visibility and competence:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capability Enhancement</strong>: Detailed sessions are conducted to align student outputs with modern career requirements.. This includes resume building, mock interviews, and professional etiquette training..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Add-on Skill Integration</strong>: Understanding that technology and management trends shift rapidly, LPU Online creates awareness about certifications and technical skills outside the standard syllabus that can give students a competitive edge..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Impactful Placement Drives</strong>: The university hosts dedicated recruitment events specifically for online students.. These drives facilitate direct interaction with HR leaders and technical recruiters from top-tier MNCs and startups..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Motivational Mentoring</strong>: Continuous guidance is provided to help students navigate career transitions, especially for working professionals looking to pivot into new sectors or seniority levels..</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(259, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 237, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 01:52:35', '2026-06-16 06:36:37', '<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"546\">Understanding the admission process is not just about filling a form&mdash;it directly affects whether your application gets approved smoothly or gets delayed due to avoidable mistakes. Many students lose time or even admission opportunities because they misunderstand steps like document submission, fee payment timing, or verification stages. Below is a <strong data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"482\">fully explained, structured, and decision-focused admission process</strong> to help you complete your application correctly without errors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"551\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xw2byf\" data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"601\">Step 1: Registration (Start Your Application)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"926\">The first step is to create your account on the university admission portal by completing the registration process. You will be required to provide basic details such as your name, email ID, and contact information. After submitting these details, you must pay the <strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"896\">initial registration fee</strong> to activate your application.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"957\">This step is crucial because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kiryh\" data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1009\">Your application journey officially begins here</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yn1ika\" data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1063\">Login credentials are generated for further steps</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ydwllx\" data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1125\">Without fee payment, you cannot proceed to the next stage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1291\"><strong data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1145\">Strategic Tip:</strong> Always use an active email ID and phone number, as all future communication (including admission confirmation and LMS access) will be sent there.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1296\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qm1254\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1357\">Step 2: Online Application Form (Core Application Stage)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1526\">Once registered, you need to complete the detailed online application form. This is the most important stage where your academic and personal information is evaluated.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1552\">You will be required to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x3se1q\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1621\">Fill in academic qualifications (10th, 12th, graduation details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g9ktc4\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1666\">Provide personal and contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ms7rbj\" data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1737\">Upload required documents (marksheets, ID proof, photograph, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19gcy4z\" data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1792\">Pay the <strong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1763\">program fee</strong> as per the selected course</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1819\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1843\">This stage determines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1980\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aa6mzh\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1885\">Whether you meet eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u4mwqe\" data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1923\">Accuracy of your academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k8tmu5\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1980\">Your chances of quick approval without re-submission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2011\"><strong data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2011\">Common Mistakes to Avoid:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2156\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iad4s1\" data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2056\">Uploading unclear or incorrect documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173i81e\" data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2109\">Entering mismatched marks compared to marksheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ykh2jb\" data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2156\">Delaying fee payment after form completion</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2237\">These mistakes can lead to <strong data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2236\">application rejection or delays in verification</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2242\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"96su3j\" data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2306\">Step 3: Document Verification (University Evaluation Stage)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2487\">After submitting your application, the university reviews your documents and verifies your eligibility. This is a backend process where your provided information is cross-checked.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2507\">During this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2641\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c98xqz\" data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2549\">Academic qualifications are validated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzy237\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2588\">Eligibility criteria are confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"21yhtw\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2641\">Uploaded documents are verified for authenticity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2760\">You are required to <strong data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2698\">wait for admission confirmation</strong>, which will be communicated via email or portal notification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2783\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2852\">This stage often takes time, and many students make the mistake of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2929\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bk9wwk\" data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2893\">Re-uploading documents unnecessarily</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14fwuh8\" data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2929\">Assuming rejection due to delay</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"3046\"><strong data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2952\">Strategic Advice:</strong> Only take action if the university specifically requests corrections or additional documents.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"j0xkvg\" data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3126\">Step 4: Student Registration &amp; LMS Activation (Final Enrollment Stage)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3226\">Once your documents are successfully verified, your admission is confirmed. You will then receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3368\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ggd1d7\" data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3267\">Official confirmation of enrollment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ctfyky\" data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3300\">Student registration details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"115cdwn\" data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3368\">Access credentials for the <strong data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3366\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3396\">The LMS is where you will:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3492\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"82dbsu\" data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3415\">Attend classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xzdf1k\" data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3441\">Access study material</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13jaf0c\" data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3464\">Submit assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7w3ny7\" data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3492\">Track academic progress</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sfpnp\" data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3523\">Why This Step is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3569\">Many students underestimate this stage, but:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3681\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8cnz4n\" data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3628\">Delay in LMS activation can affect your academic start</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lwud03\" data-start=\"3629\" data-end=\"3681\">Missing initial classes can create learning gaps</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3792\"><strong data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3701\">Best Practice:</strong> Log in immediately after receiving credentials and familiarize yourself with the platform.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"69\" data-end=\"505\">Understanding the eligibility criteria for MCA is not just about checking whether you qualify&mdash;it directly impacts your admission approval, academic difficulty level, and even placement readiness later. Many students ignore small conditions like Mathematics background or bridge courses, which often leads to struggle during the program. Below is a <strong data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"472\">fully explained, decision-focused eligibility guide</strong> to help you avoid such mistakes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"510\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vd27nh\" data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"550\">Academic Qualification Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"683\">To apply for the MCA program, candidates must have completed a <strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"636\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> in any of the following or equivalent streams:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"794\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yti5w6\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"702\">B.E. / B.Tech</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ub0l3o\" data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"711\">B.Sc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuwkdh\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"721\">B.Com</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uale4r\" data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"730\">B.A.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l4c7b2\" data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"740\">B.Voc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"748\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1668qyb\" data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"794\">Any other recognized undergraduate degree</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"896\">In addition to the degree, <strong data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"862\">Mathematics (or equivalent subject)</strong> must have been studied at either:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"943\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1phyljr\" data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"920\"><strong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"914\">10+2 level</strong>, OR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f7ikau\" data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"943\"><strong data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"943\">Graduation level</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w3vyce\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"986\">Accepted Mathematics-Related Subjects</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1095\">If you are unsure whether you meet the Mathematics requirement, the following subjects are considered valid:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1185\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkuajg\" data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1112\">Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yq9p59\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1127\">Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11rpgz2\" data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1160\">Quantitative Techniques (QT)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uhocey\" data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1185\">Business Mathematics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1288\">This flexibility ensures that students from commerce and non-engineering backgrounds can still apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1293\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bu66w3\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1356\">Eligibility for Current Students (Important Clarification)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1539\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1423\">appearing for their final year of graduation</strong> are also eligible to apply, provided they complete their degree within the required timeline set by the university.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1544\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qi9pf9\" data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1582\">NIOS &amp; Open Schooling Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1814\">Candidates who have completed their <strong data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1680\">10+2 through NIOS or any recognized open schooling board</strong> are eligible for admission. There is no discrimination against open schooling backgrounds as long as the qualification is recognized.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1819\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5imkk1\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1888\">Bridge Courses Requirement (Critical for Non-Technical Students)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"2145\">One of the most important aspects of MCA eligibility&mdash;often ignored by students&mdash;is the <strong data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2005\">bridge course requirement</strong>. If you do not have the required background in Mathematics or Computer Science, the university will assign compulsory foundational courses.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vc908h\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2174\">Bridge Course Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2451\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2223\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2223\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2197\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student Background</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2223\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Bridge Course</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2451\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2321\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2296\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No Mathematics background</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2321\">01 Mathematics course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2369\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2347\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No Computer background</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2369\">01 Computer course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2451\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2412\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No Mathematics &amp; No Computer background</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2451\">01 Mathematics + 01 Computer course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p id=\"p-rc_416b8156becb87b7-404\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0\">Choosing to pursue an Online MCA in Cybersecurity is a significant step toward a high-growth career in digital defense. Understanding the financial commitment is essential for long-term planning. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-1124\">The program is structured to provide high-quality technical education while remaining accessible through strategic grants and flexible payment pathways</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\"><span class=\"citation-1124 citation-end-1124\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Fee Breakdown for 2026</strong></h4>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_416b8156becb87b7-405\" data-path-to-node=\"6\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1\"><span class=\"citation-1123\">The current fee structure is specifically designed for residents of India and the SAARC region, including Sri Lanka, Bhutan, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Afghanistan</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2\"><span class=\"citation-1123 citation-end-1123\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_416b8156becb87b7-406\" data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1122\">Standard Semester Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1122\"> The base cost for the program is set at ₹40,000 per semester</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1122 citation-end-1122\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_416b8156becb87b7-407\" data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1121\">Applicable Fee (With Grant):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1121\"> Eligible students can take advantage of a </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"71\"><span class=\"citation-1121\">20% Student Grant</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1121\">, reducing the payable amount to </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"121\"><span class=\"citation-1121\">₹32,400 per semester</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1121 citation-end-1121\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_416b8156becb87b7-408\" data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1120\">Grant Validity:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1120\"> This 20% financial aid is a limited-time offer, currently valid for applications submitted by </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"110\"><span class=\"citation-1120\">9th May \'26</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1120 citation-end-1120\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_416b8156becb87b7-409\" data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1119\">Included Costs:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1119\"> The semester fee conveniently includes the examination fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\"><span class=\"citation-1119\">₹2,000 per semester</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1119 citation-end-1119\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_416b8156becb87b7-410\" data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1118\">Initial Costs:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1118\"> Applicants should note a one-time, non-refundable registration fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"85\"><span class=\"citation-1118\">₹1,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1118\"> required at the start of the journey</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1118 citation-end-1118\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Flexible Payment Solutions</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">To ensure that financial constraints do not hinder academic progress, multiple payment modes are available:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_416b8156becb87b7-411\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1117\">Standard Payment:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1117\"> Students can choose to pay the full semester fee upfront or opt for a lumpsum payment for the entire program</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1117 citation-end-1117\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_416b8156becb87b7-412\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1116\">No-Cost EMI Options:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1116\"> For those preferring to spread the cost, the university offers No-Cost EMI plans, allowing you to pay the applicable fee in manageable monthly installments without added interest</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1116 citation-end-1116\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_416b8156becb87b7-413\" data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1115\">Standard EMI:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1115\"> Traditional EMI options are also available for those who need more extended payment timelines</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1115 citation-end-1115\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"490\">The MCA curriculum is strategically designed to transform students from diverse academic backgrounds into industry-ready professionals with strong programming, system design, and emerging technology expertise. Unlike basic syllabus lists, understanding <strong data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"426\">how each semester builds your skills, what you actually learn, and how it impacts your career</strong> is critical for making the right academic and career decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"718\">This semester-wise structure follows a <strong data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"561\">progressive learning model</strong>&mdash;starting from fundamentals, moving to core technical mastery, and finally advancing into specialized domains like AI, cloud computing, and game development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"723\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"h68au1\" data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"792\">Semester 1: Foundation Building (Core Concepts + Technical Base)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"1022\">The first semester focuses on building a <strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"866\">strong technical foundation</strong>, especially for students from non-technical backgrounds. It introduces programming, system concepts, and mathematical logic essential for future semesters.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kaiyn9\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1044\">Subjects Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"2222\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1av5jzu\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1239\"><strong data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1082\">Software Engineering Practices</strong><br data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1085\">Focuses on software development lifecycle, project planning, and industry-standard methodologies. Helps you understand how real-world software is built.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v1k2sf\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1403\"><strong data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1284\">Object Oriented Programming using C++</strong><br data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1287\">Introduces OOP concepts like classes, inheritance, and polymorphism&mdash;critical for all future programming languages.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hzer8\" data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1530\"><strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1443\">Data Warehousing and Data Mining</strong><br data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1446\">Covers how large datasets are stored, managed, and analyzed for business insights.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ing24i\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1680\"><strong data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1563\">Linux and Shell Scripting</strong><br data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1566\">Teaches command-line operations and scripting&mdash;important for backend development and system administration roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18d2a3r\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1834\"><strong data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1721\">Data Communication and Networking</strong><br data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1724\">Builds understanding of how data is transmitted across networks, a base for cybersecurity and cloud careers.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ofl0zg\" data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1953\"><strong data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1876\">Skill Enhancement Course I (SEC-I)</strong><br data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1879\">Focuses on soft skills, communication, and basic professional readiness.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qv98e3\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"2107\"><strong data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"2003\">Fundamentals of Computer and C Programming</strong><br data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2006\">Essential for beginners&mdash;covers logic building, structured programming, and problem-solving using C.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ad1lta\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2222\"><strong data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2137\">Elementary Mathematics</strong><br data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2140\">Strengthens basic mathematical concepts required for programming and algorithms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2227\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11vuciz\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2291\">Semester 2: Core Technical Strength (Programming + Systems)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2432\">This semester shifts towards <strong data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2370\">advanced programming and modern technologies</strong>, forming the backbone of technical interviews and placements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kaiyn9\" data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2454\">Subjects Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"3275\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bagl3v\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2554\"><strong data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2481\">Programming in Java</strong><br data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2484\">Object-oriented programming with real-world application development.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rfwzz8\" data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2698\"><strong data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2586\">Advanced Data Structures</strong><br data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2589\">One of the most important subjects for placements&mdash;focuses on algorithms, optimization, and problem-solving.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d69p5j\" data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2808\"><strong data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2730\">Introduction to Big Data</strong><br data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2733\">Basics of handling large-scale data systems and technologies like Hadoop.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vd3mgs\" data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2924\"><strong data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2831\">Cloud Computing</strong><br data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2834\">Covers cloud architecture, deployment models, and platforms widely used in the industry.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ybqpzx\" data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"3044\"><strong data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2976\">Mathematical Foundation for Computer Science</strong><br data-start=\"2976\" data-end=\"2979\">Includes discrete mathematics, logic, and computational theory.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xym695\" data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3165\"><strong data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3068\">Web Technologies</strong><br data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3071\">Frontend and backend web development basics&mdash;HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and server-side concepts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6tckyz\" data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3275\"><strong data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3209\">Skill Enhancement Course II (SEC-II)</strong><br data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3212\">Focuses on employability skills and professional development.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3280\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"en1uq\" data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3331\">Semester 3: Specialization &amp; Industry Exposure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3513\">This semester introduces <strong data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3397\">specialized and high-demand domains</strong>, allowing students to align their learning with career goals such as game development, AI, or software engineering.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kaiyn9\" data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3535\">Subjects Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"4236\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ffzyqn\" data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3662\"><strong data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3564\">Programming in Python</strong><br data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3567\">Widely used for AI, data science, and automation&mdash;highly valuable skill in current job market.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18byhp3\" data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3781\"><strong data-start=\"3666\" data-end=\"3705\">Game Development using Unity Engine</strong><br data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3708\">Introduction to game design, development, and interactive environments.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eu008w\" data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3903\"><strong data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3817\">Unreal Programming using C++</strong><br data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3820\">Advanced game development using Unreal Engine, used in AAA games and simulations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jcn773\" data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"4026\"><strong data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3943\">Generic Electives (GE-I &amp; GE-II)</strong><br data-start=\"3943\" data-end=\"3946\">Students can choose subjects based on interest&mdash;helps in career specialization.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tzs42k\" data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4126\"><strong data-start=\"4030\" data-end=\"4060\">Seminar on Summer Training</strong><br data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4063\">Presentation and evaluation of practical training experience.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pvni9z\" data-start=\"4128\" data-end=\"4236\"><strong data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4172\">Skill Enhancement Course III (SEC-III)</strong><br data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4175\">Focuses on industry readiness, teamwork, and communication.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4238\" data-end=\"4241\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"109b31r\" data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4298\">Semester 4: Advanced Technologies &amp; Career Readiness</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4438\">The final semester is focused on <strong data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4389\">cutting-edge technologies and real-world application</strong>, preparing students directly for industry roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kaiyn9\" data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4460\">Subjects Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"5087\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v0f32h\" data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"4590\"><strong data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4500\">Game AI &amp; Reinforcement Learning</strong><br data-start=\"4500\" data-end=\"4503\">Covers artificial intelligence techniques used in gaming and decision-making systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12a2w3e\" data-start=\"4592\" data-end=\"4732\"><strong data-start=\"4594\" data-end=\"4643\">Virtual Reality (VR) &amp; Augmented Reality (AR)</strong><br data-start=\"4643\" data-end=\"4646\">Advanced immersive technologies used in gaming, simulation, and training industries.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3v9333\" data-start=\"4734\" data-end=\"4824\"><strong data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4774\">Generic Electives (GE-III &amp; GE-IV)</strong><br data-start=\"4774\" data-end=\"4777\">Further specialization based on career goals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b224z0\" data-start=\"4826\" data-end=\"4960\"><strong data-start=\"4828\" data-end=\"4844\">Project Work</strong><br data-start=\"4844\" data-end=\"4847\">A major practical component where students build real-world applications&mdash;critical for placements and portfolio.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"riryv4\" data-start=\"4962\" data-end=\"5087\"><strong data-start=\"4964\" data-end=\"5004\">Skill Enhancement Course IV (SEC-IV)</strong><br data-start=\"5004\" data-end=\"5007\">Final stage of professional skill development including interview preparation.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"429\">Placement support in an online program is not just about getting interview calls&mdash;it is about building the <strong data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"245\">right skills, awareness, and confidence required by the industry</strong>. LPU Online Placement Support Services are structured to ensure that students are not only academically qualified but also professionally prepared to meet real-world job expectations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"842\">The university follows a <strong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"487\">holistic placement approach</strong>, where the focus goes beyond subject knowledge and extends to skill development, career readiness, and employability enhancement. Students are continuously guided to understand industry requirements and are encouraged to develop <strong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"767\">additional skills alongside their core program</strong>, which significantly improves their chances of securing quality job roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kcq0hq\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"917\">How Placement Support Actually Works (Beyond Basic Understanding)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"983\">LPU Online actively works on improving student employability by:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15jghsz\" data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1073\">Enhancing <strong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1040\">technical and professional capabilities</strong> as per current industry demand</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lqxnrh\" data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1173\">Creating <strong data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1105\">career awareness</strong>, helping students understand available job roles and career paths</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ddi2gg\" data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1292\">Motivating students to acquire <strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1224\">add-on skills</strong> such as communication, problem-solving, and domain-specific tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1431\">This approach ensures that students are not limited to theoretical knowledge but are equipped with <strong data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1430\">practical, job-ready competencies</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1436\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xy3245\" data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1480\">Placement Drives &amp; Industry Interaction</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1639\">To bridge the gap between students and employers, LPU Online conducts <strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1583\">structured placement drives</strong> where students get direct exposure to hiring companies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1689\">These placement drives provide opportunities to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1924\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d064ne\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1743\">Interact with <strong data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1741\">recruiters and hiring managers</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9rdldi\" data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1791\">Showcase <strong data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1789\">technical and practical skills</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k9yc3x\" data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1851\">Participate in real-time <strong data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1849\">interviews and assessments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tzh18m\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1924\">Secure <strong data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1922\">relevant job roles based on their profile and performance</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"2071\">Unlike passive placement support, these drives are designed to be <strong data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2025\">impactful and result-oriented</strong>, giving students actual hiring opportunities.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(260, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 238, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 02:07:10', '2026-06-16 06:36:56', '<p data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"478\">The admission process for M.Com is designed to be simple, but <strong data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"205\">small mistakes at any stage can delay or even affect your admission approval</strong>. Many students underestimate steps like document accuracy, fee timing, or verification, which leads to unnecessary complications. Below is a <strong data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"416\">fully explained, structured, and strategy-focused admission guide</strong> to help you complete your application smoothly and correctly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"483\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xkto3b\" data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"541\">Step 1: Registration (Start Your Application Journey)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"784\">The first step is to register on the university portal by providing your basic details such as name, email ID, and contact number. After submitting this information, you must pay the <strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"754\">initial registration fee</strong> to activate your application.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"817\">This step is essential because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"121cr2d\" data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"864\">It creates your official applicant profile</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gb3dvy\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"914\">Gives you login credentials for further steps</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nrdwlf\" data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"972\">Without payment, you cannot proceed to the next stage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1139\"><strong data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"996\">Strategic Insight:</strong> Always use an active email ID and phone number, as all important updates (including admission confirmation and LMS access) will be sent there.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1144\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"gfrl7b\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1202\">Step 2: Online Application Form (Most Critical Stage)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1379\">After registration, you need to fill out the detailed application form. This stage plays a major role in determining whether your application gets approved quickly or delayed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1405\">You will be required to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1628\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3zeb9l\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1484\">Enter academic details (10th, 12th, graduation/professional qualification)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g9ktc4\" data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1529\">Provide personal and contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ms7rbj\" data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1600\">Upload required documents (marksheets, ID proof, photograph, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ldtpnv\" data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1628\">Pay the <strong data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1626\">program fee</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1655\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1671\">This is where:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1803\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sb8mp\" data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1705\">Your eligibility is evaluated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t88wn1\" data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1754\">Your documents are recorded for verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yddc5q\" data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1803\">Your application becomes officially complete</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1834\"><strong data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1834\">Common Mistakes to Avoid:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1975\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iad4s1\" data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1879\">Uploading unclear or incorrect documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ursyvr\" data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1927\">Entering incorrect marks or mismatched data</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jnh5j9\" data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1975\">Delaying fee payment after filling the form</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2043\">These mistakes often lead to <strong data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2042\">verification delays or rejection</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2048\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15z6dqi\" data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2099\">Step 3: Document Verification (Approval Stage)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2287\">Once your application is submitted, the university reviews and verifies your documents. This process ensures that all provided information is accurate and meets eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2307\">During this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2431\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c98xqz\" data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2349\">Academic qualifications are validated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f1t44n\" data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2392\">Documents are checked for authenticity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzy237\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2431\">Eligibility criteria are confirmed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2549\">You need to wait for <strong data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2480\">admission confirmation</strong>, which will be communicated through email or the application portal.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2572\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2635\">Many students panic during this stage due to delays. However:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2737\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18isfr5\" data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2695\">Verification takes time depending on application volume</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nhbjfq\" data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2737\">Re-upload documents only if requested</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2839\"><strong data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2758\">Smart Approach:</strong> Regularly check your email and portal for updates instead of assuming rejection.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2844\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1358h9k\" data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2913\">Step 4: Student Registration &amp; LMS Activation (Final Enrollment)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2996\">After successful verification, your admission is confirmed, and you will receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3113\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3025\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ctfyky\" data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3058\">Student registration details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q70pcy\" data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3113\">LMS (Learning Management System) login credentials</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3172\">The LMS is your primary academic platform where you will:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3260\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xzdf1k\" data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3198\">Access study material</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14zx5bd\" data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3218\">Attend lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13jaf0c\" data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3241\">Submit assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16rei6y\" data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3260\">Track progress</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gkgnfx\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3290\">Why This Step Is Crucial</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3404\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"io3glh\" data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3350\">Delays in accessing LMS can impact your academic start</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tpflwf\" data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3404\">Missing initial sessions may create learning gaps</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3487\"><strong data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3424\">Best Practice:</strong> Log in immediately and familiarize yourself with the platform.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"570\">Choosing the right postgraduate program starts with clearly understanding whether you are eligible&mdash;not just technically, but strategically. The M.Com eligibility criteria are designed to accommodate students from <strong data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"360\">diverse academic as well as professional backgrounds</strong>, making it a flexible option for both fresh graduates and finance professionals. However, many students misunderstand these criteria and make poor admission decisions without evaluating long-term academic fit.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"735\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"625\">detailed, decision-focused explanation</strong> of M.Com eligibility to help you determine whether this program aligns with your background and career goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"740\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kwwpse\" data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"779\">Academic Qualification Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"834\">To apply for the M.Com program, candidates must have:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"925\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xfeciy\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"925\">A <strong data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"879\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline</strong> from a recognized university or institution</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1031\">This means students from commerce, arts, science, management, or any other stream are eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1054\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1162\">While the eligibility allows <strong data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1103\">any discipline</strong>, students from non-commerce backgrounds should understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gxnnq1\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1236\">The course includes subjects like accounting, finance, and economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6g1e3t\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1311\">Lack of prior exposure may require <strong data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1309\">additional self-learning effort</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lohokr\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1387\">Initial semesters may feel challenging without basic commerce knowledge</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1392\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3xhfdq\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1457\">Professional Qualification Pathway (Alternative Eligibility)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1557\">In addition to a bachelor&rsquo;s degree, candidates with professional qualifications are also eligible:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jqgj67\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1599\">Completed <strong data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1597\">Company Secretary (CS)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l5hfqg\" data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1644\">Completed <strong data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1642\">Chartered Accountancy (CA)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c43gjl\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1698\">Completed <strong data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1696\">Cost &amp; Management Accountancy (CMA)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1798\">These qualifications are recognized as equivalent to a bachelor&rsquo;s degree for admission into M.Com.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"181lajy\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1820\">Why This Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1866\">This pathway is particularly beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"2092\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7mx2fo\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1918\">Working professionals in finance and accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16b74sn\" data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"2002\">Students who pursued professional certifications instead of traditional degrees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g44wcp\" data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2092\">Candidates aiming to strengthen academic credentials alongside professional expertise</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2097\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tc8ekn\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2137\">Eligibility for Final-Year Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2301\">Candidates who are <strong data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2206\">appearing for their final year of graduation</strong> are also eligible to apply, provided they complete their degree within the specified timeline.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2391\">This ensures that students do not lose an academic year while waiting for final results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2396\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qi9pf9\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2434\">NIOS &amp; Open Schooling Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2653\">Candidates who have completed their earlier education (such as 10+2) through <strong data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2560\">NIOS or any recognized open schooling board</strong> are eligible, as long as their qualifications are recognized by the appropriate authorities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2658\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"m8uzo\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2703\">Admission Condition &amp; Policy Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2845\">The eligibility criteria, admission conditions, and related requirements are <strong data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2832\">subject to change as per university guidelines</strong>. This means:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"3028\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fd100k\" data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2891\">Requirements may be updated periodically</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r0otww\" data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2953\">Final admission approval depends on document verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3nidzq\" data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"3028\">Candidates must ensure all submitted information is accurate and valid</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"505\">Understanding the MCA fee structure is not just about the total amount&mdash;it directly impacts your financial planning, affordability, and return on investment (ROI). Many students focus only on the per-semester fee and ignore additional components like registration charges, included costs, and payment flexibility. Below is a <strong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"463\">fully detailed, decision-focused fee breakdown</strong> to help you plan your investment smartly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"510\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10glg1g\" data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"561\">MCA Fee Structure (With Current Student Grant)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"786\">The university is currently offering a <strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"623\">20% student grant</strong>, significantly reducing the overall tuition cost. This discounted fee is valid for a limited period, making timing an important factor in your admission decision.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1phtd4\" data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"819\">Fee Details (Semester-Wise)</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"1152\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"853\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"853\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"837\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"853\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"1152\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"924\">\r\n<td data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"913\" data-col-size=\"md\">Actual Fee (Per Semester)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"924\">₹50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"968\">\r\n<td data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"957\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discounted Fee (Per Semester)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"968\">₹40,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"992\">\r\n<td data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"987\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"992\">4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1042\">\r\n<td data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1029\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total Course Fee (After Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1042\">₹1,61,600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1095\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1072\" data-col-size=\"md\">Examination Fee (Included)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1095\">₹2,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1152\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1142\" data-col-size=\"md\">Registration Fee (One-Time, Non-Refundable)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1152\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wlu9cb\" data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1214\">Payment Options Available (Flexibility for Students)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1299\">To make the program financially accessible, multiple payment options are available:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"186264o\" data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1329\">1. Semester-Wise Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkmqh8\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1358\">Pay ₹40,400 per semester</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"awbvl9\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1426\">Suitable for students who prefer <strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1426\">low upfront financial burden</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t88jkf\" data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1450\">2. Lumpsum Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1539\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i1u98z\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1483\">Pay full program fee at once</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10l55ln\" data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1539\">Useful if you want to <strong data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1539\">avoid repeated transactions</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"li1gzi\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1566\">3. No-Cost EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1687\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tgdd37\" data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1636\">Convert fees into <strong data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1634\">monthly installments without extra interest</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7m25kr\" data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1687\">Ideal for students managing budget constraints</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m5owxx\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1715\">4. Standard EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1837\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z0ciin\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1766\">Flexible EMI plans depending on provider terms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mh8e9h\" data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1837\">May include <strong data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1835\">processing charges or interest (depending on plan)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"471\">The M.Com curriculum is designed to build <strong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"216\">deep expertise in finance, management, international business, and strategic decision-making</strong>. Unlike basic course outlines, this program follows a structured progression&mdash;starting from core business fundamentals, moving towards analytical and financial depth, and finally developing <strong data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"470\">global trade expertise and strategic leadership capabilities</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"754\">Understanding the syllabus in detail is critical because it directly impacts your <strong data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"614\">career direction, specialization, and job opportunities</strong>. Below is a <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"670\">fully explained semester-wise breakdown</strong> with real insights into what you will actually learn and how it shapes your career.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10ze51m\" data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"813\">Semester 1: Core Business &amp; Financial Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"979\">The first semester focuses on building a <strong data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"920\">strong base in finance, management, and business environment</strong>, which is essential for advanced subjects in later stages.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kaiyn9\" data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1001\">Subjects Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1706\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1stpc6t\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1197\"><strong data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1053\">Financial Reporting, Statements and Analysis</strong><br data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1056\">Develops understanding of financial statements, balance sheets, and company performance analysis&mdash;critical for accounting and finance roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14o2jgm\" data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1325\"><strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1225\">Managerial Economics</strong><br data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1228\">Focuses on economic decision-making, demand-supply analysis, and business strategy formulation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f7f5kn\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1465\"><strong data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1367\">International Business Environment</strong><br data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1370\">Introduces global business dynamics, trade environments, and international market structures.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mcs0xe\" data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1578\"><strong data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1493\">Marketing Management</strong><br data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1496\">Covers branding, consumer behavior, and marketing strategies used by businesses.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3qpbnr\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1706\"><strong data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1638\">Organisational Behaviour and Human Resource Dynamics</strong><br data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1641\">Explains workplace behavior, team management, and HR practices.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h3vd5a\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1725\">What You Gain</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1748\">This semester builds:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1843\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yglvet\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1776\">Financial understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1wa6u\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1812\">Business decision-making skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wy0f2r\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1843\">Basic management knowledge</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1848\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"s6a3dh\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1897\">Semester 2: Analytical &amp; Financial Expertise</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"2084\">The second semester strengthens your <strong data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"2017\">financial knowledge, analytical skills, and business operations understanding</strong>, which are highly important for placements and professional roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kaiyn9\" data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2106\">Subjects Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2772\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1axjumr\" data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2207\"><strong data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2131\">Corporate Finance</strong><br data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2134\">Covers investment decisions, capital structure, and financial planning.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g0o5a2\" data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2330\"><strong data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2249\">Operations Management and Research</strong><br data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2252\">Focuses on business processes, efficiency optimization, and decision models.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w2xjln\" data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2421\"><strong data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2356\">Business Analytics</strong><br data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2359\">Introduces data-driven decision-making and analytical tools.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iie5zs\" data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2563\"><strong data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2449\">Research Methodology</strong><br data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2452\">Develops skills in research design, data collection, and analysis&mdash;important for academic and corporate roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13pfhca\" data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2661\"><strong data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2596\">Legal Aspects of Business</strong><br data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2599\">Covers corporate laws, contracts, and regulatory frameworks.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cmmkjv\" data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2772\"><strong data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2694\">Communication for Leaders</strong><br data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2697\">Enhances professional communication, leadership, and presentation skills.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h3vd5a\" data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2791\">What You Gain</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2814\">This semester builds:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2937\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckf7z5\" data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2861\">Strong financial and analytical capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"orl6zg\" data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2901\">Legal and operational understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h5e9qr\" data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"2937\">Leadership communication skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2942\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4158pw\" data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"2999\">Semester 3: International Trade &amp; Strategic Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3166\">This semester introduces <strong data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3087\">specialized subjects related to global trade and strategy</strong>, allowing students to align with careers in international business and policy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kaiyn9\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3188\">Subjects Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3814\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bkme8t\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3301\"><strong data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3224\">Export and Import Management</strong><br data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3227\">Covers procedures, documentation, and policies involved in global trade.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"147w5v2\" data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3420\"><strong data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3338\">International Trade Logistics</strong><br data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3341\">Focuses on supply chain, shipping, and logistics management across countries.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k634qk\" data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3519\"><strong data-start=\"3424\" data-end=\"3451\">International Economics</strong><br data-start=\"3451\" data-end=\"3454\">Explains global economic systems, trade theories, and policies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9tufiy\" data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3631\"><strong data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3566\">Corporate Strategy and Entrepreneurship</strong><br data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3569\">Covers business growth strategies, startups, and innovation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14nsxmw\" data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3707\"><strong data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3662\">Generic Elective (GE-I)</strong><br data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3665\">Allows specialization based on interest.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ziq83\" data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3814\"><strong data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3741\">Seminar on Summer Training</strong><br data-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3744\">Practical exposure and presentation of industry training experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h3vd5a\" data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3833\">What You Gain</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3835\" data-end=\"3856\">This semester builds:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3942\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ce1yjb\" data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3883\">Global trade knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10jagvm\" data-start=\"3884\" data-end=\"3914\">Strategic thinking ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iqtf5v\" data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3942\">Entrepreneurial mindset</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"3947\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1y2jy20\" data-start=\"3949\" data-end=\"4006\">Semester 4: Advanced Global Trade &amp; Career Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4157\">The final semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"4038\" data-end=\"4114\">policy-level understanding, legal frameworks, and real-world application</strong>, preparing students for specialized roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kaiyn9\" data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4179\">Subjects Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4667\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xb8sq2\" data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4278\"><strong data-start=\"4183\" data-end=\"4212\">WTO &amp; International Trade</strong><br data-start=\"4212\" data-end=\"4215\">Covers global trade regulations and international agreements.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8nh7ft\" data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4381\"><strong data-start=\"4282\" data-end=\"4312\">India Foreign Trade Policy</strong><br data-start=\"4312\" data-end=\"4315\">Explains India&rsquo;s trade strategies and export-import regulations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oexyck\" data-start=\"4383\" data-end=\"4472\"><strong data-start=\"4385\" data-end=\"4413\">International Trade Laws</strong><br data-start=\"4413\" data-end=\"4416\">Focuses on legal frameworks governing global business.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tlyyoj\" data-start=\"4474\" data-end=\"4554\"><strong data-start=\"4476\" data-end=\"4504\">Generic Elective (GE-II)</strong><br data-start=\"4504\" data-end=\"4507\">Further specialization based on career goals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6t6saq\" data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4667\"><strong data-start=\"4558\" data-end=\"4578\">Capstone Project</strong><br data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4581\">A major project where students apply their learning to real-world business problems.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h3vd5a\" data-start=\"4669\" data-end=\"4686\">What You Gain</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4709\">This semester builds:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4710\" data-end=\"4829\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5z12gn\" data-start=\"4710\" data-end=\"4740\">Policy-level understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ou5a9\" data-start=\"4741\" data-end=\"4783\">Legal expertise in international trade</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xemwru\" data-start=\"4784\" data-end=\"4829\">Practical experience through project work</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"483\">Placement support is one of the most critical factors when choosing an online degree, especially for programs like M.Com where <strong data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"299\">career outcomes depend heavily on skills, exposure, and industry alignment</strong>. LPU Online Placement Support Services are designed not just to provide job opportunities, but to systematically prepare students for the <strong data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"482\">real expectations of the corporate world</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"674\">This approach ensures that students are not limited to academic knowledge but are continuously guided to become <strong data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"673\">job-ready professionals with practical skills, awareness, and confidence</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"679\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1r44yzz\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"745\">How LPU Online Prepares You for Placements (Beyond Academics)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"834\">LPU Online follows a structured system to enhance student employability by focusing on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b5u34a\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"1062\"><strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"894\">Skill development aligned with industry requirements</strong><br data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"897\">Students are guided to build skills that employers actively look for, such as financial analysis, business decision-making, communication, and analytical thinking.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ngkbh0\" data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1355\"><strong data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1103\">Career awareness and role clarity</strong><br data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1106\">Many students lack clarity about job roles after M.Com. The placement support system helps them understand:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1355\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f15anw\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1291\">Available career paths (finance, banking, analytics, corporate roles)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pkl6w3\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1327\">Required skills for each role</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jxkqxv\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1355\">Industry expectations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tace48\" data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1596\"><strong data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1394\">Encouragement for add-on skills</strong><br data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1397\">Students are motivated to develop additional competencies beyond their syllabus, such as:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k49h3n\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1527\">Advanced Excel / analytics tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w2teku\" data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1552\">Financial modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wtvslz\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1596\">Communication and presentation skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1601\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16v0wd6\" data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1645\">Placement Drives &amp; Employer Interaction</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1818\">One of the strongest aspects of LPU Online placement support is the organization of <strong data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1762\">structured placement drives</strong>, designed to connect students directly with recruiters.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16bmqvg\" data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1856\">What Happens in Placement Drives</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"2146\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ko9gcm\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1929\">Students get opportunities to <strong data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1927\">interact with potential employers</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nutac2\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1998\">Participate in <strong data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1996\">interviews, assessments, and screening rounds</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5kyj7\" data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2077\">Showcase their <strong data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2075\">technical knowledge, projects, and communication skills</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bimza0\" data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2146\">Compete for <strong data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2144\">relevant job roles based on their specialization</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2276\">These drives are not just formal events&mdash;they are <strong data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2231\">practical hiring opportunities</strong> where students can secure actual job offers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2281\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16ntand\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2346\">Why Placement Support Alone Is Not Enough (Critical Reality)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2439\">A major misconception among students is that placement support guarantees jobs. In reality:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2688\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10cfz58\" data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2513\">Placement success depends on <strong data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2511\">student preparation + participation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"baz6oo\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2600\">Universities provide opportunities, but <strong data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2598\">students must convert them into offers</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kklswz\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2688\">Lack of skill development leads to missed opportunities, even with placement access</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2693\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"598q4f\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2759\">Common Mistakes Students Make (That Reduce Placement Chances)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2988\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hie91r\" data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2830\">Focusing only on academic subjects and ignoring skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dpb9ic\" data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2881\">Not participating actively in placement drives</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qbvets\" data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2939\">Waiting until the final semester to start preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"igdx7u\" data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"2988\">Weak communication and interview performance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3089\">These mistakes often result in <strong data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3088\">low placement outcomes despite having support systems available</strong>.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(261, 69, 'd67d3d73-4a79-4175-89f0-c61979138bac', '956f52ba-dcf0-4224-9a30-f9f785980fe3', 224, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 02:21:52', '2026-06-16 06:37:59', '<p data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"468\">The admission process for undergraduate (UG) programs may look simple, but <strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"195\">precision at each step is critical</strong>. Small errors in form filling, document submission, or payment timing can delay your admission or create unnecessary complications. This guide explains the process in a <strong data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"412\">clear, structured, and strategy-focused way</strong>, so you can complete your application without mistakes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"473\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xw2byf\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"523\">Step 1: Registration (Start Your Application)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"771\">The first step is to register on the university admission portal by entering your basic details such as name, email ID, and mobile number. After submitting these details, you must pay the <strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"741\">initial registration fee</strong> to activate your application.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"804\">This step is important because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"938\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pe8jc4\" data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"842\">It creates your applicant profile</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n202w3\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"891\">Provides login credentials for further steps</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u78qvv\" data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"938\">Allows access to the full application form</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1092\"><strong data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"958\">Strategic Tip:</strong> Use an active email ID and phone number, as all future communication (including admission updates and LMS access) will be sent there.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"gfrl7b\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1155\">Step 2: Online Application Form (Most Critical Stage)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1345\">After registration, you need to complete the detailed application form. This is the most important stage, as your admission approval depends on the accuracy of the information you provide.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1371\">You will be required to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1566\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c552zn\" data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1426\">Enter academic details (10th and 12th information)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"103zsq2\" data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1467\">Provide personal and contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ms7rbj\" data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1538\">Upload required documents (marksheets, ID proof, photograph, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ldtpnv\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1566\">Pay the <strong data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1564\">program fee</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1593\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1617\">This stage determines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1717\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2sljgt\" data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1651\">Your eligibility verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pxz6k3\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1680\">Accuracy of your records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11pqqwp\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1717\">Speed of your admission approval</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1748\"><strong data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1748\">Common Mistakes to Avoid:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iad4s1\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1793\">Uploading unclear or incorrect documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ursyvr\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1841\">Entering incorrect marks or mismatched data</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ykh2jb\" data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1888\">Delaying fee payment after form completion</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1954\">These errors often lead to <strong data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1953\">verification delays or rejection</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1959\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6j2gwr\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2017\">Step 3: Document Verification (University Evaluation)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2185\">Once you submit your application, the university verifies your documents and checks your eligibility. This is an internal process where your information is validated.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2205\">During this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2321\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n9xihv\" data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2239\">Academic records are verified</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f1t44n\" data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2282\">Documents are checked for authenticity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzy237\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2321\">Eligibility criteria are confirmed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2432\">You need to wait for <strong data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2370\">admission confirmation</strong>, which will be communicated via email or portal notification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2455\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2510\">Students often panic if verification takes time, but:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2625\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4bmbk8\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2562\">Delays are normal during peak admission periods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qc191\" data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2625\">You should only act if the university requests corrections</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"111tp6m\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2693\">Step 4: Student Registration &amp; LMS Activation (Final Step)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2772\">After successful verification, your admission is confirmed. You will receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2889\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2801\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ctfyky\" data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2834\">Student registration details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q70pcy\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2889\">LMS (Learning Management System) login credentials</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2955\">The LMS is where your academic journey begins. It allows you to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"3052\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xzdf1k\" data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2981\">Access study material</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14zx5bd\" data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3001\">Attend lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13jaf0c\" data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3024\">Submit assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7w3ny7\" data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3052\">Track academic progress</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kwr939\" data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3083\">Why This Step Is Critical</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3189\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pqiypi\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3136\">Delay in accessing LMS can affect your learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kjxssb\" data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3189\">Missing initial classes may create academic gaps</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3268\"><strong data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3209\">Best Practice:</strong> Log in immediately and explore the platform to stay ahead.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"499\">Understanding eligibility after Class 12 is not just about meeting a basic requirement&mdash;it directly impacts your admission approval, course suitability, and long-term academic success. Many students assume that &ldquo;any stream&rdquo; eligibility means &ldquo;anyone can easily manage the course,&rdquo; which is not always true. Below is a <strong data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"453\">detailed, decision-focused eligibility explanation</strong> to help you make a smart and informed choice.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"504\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kwwpse\" data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"543\">Academic Qualification Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"611\">To apply for the undergraduate (UG) program, candidates must have:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"673\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dcrj25\" data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"673\">Completed <strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"647\">10+2 in any stream</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"703\">This includes students from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"748\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y83j8c\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"715\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4h0lx\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"728\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4bazzi\" data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"748\">Arts/Humanities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"905\">The eligibility is designed to provide <strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"812\">maximum flexibility</strong>, allowing students from different academic backgrounds to apply without stream restrictions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bu66w3\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"973\">Eligibility for Current Students (Important Clarification)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1141\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1018\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are also eligible to apply, provided they complete their qualification within the required timeline set by the university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1225\">This ensures that students can secure admission without waiting for final results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1230\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qi9pf9\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1268\">NIOS &amp; Open Schooling Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1454\">Candidates who have completed their <strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1366\">10+2 through NIOS or any recognized open schooling board</strong> are eligible for admission. There is no restriction as long as the board is recognized.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"m8uzo\" data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1504\">Admission Condition &amp; Policy Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1623\">The eligibility criteria and admission conditions are <strong data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1610\">subject to change as per university guidelines</strong>. This means:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1785\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fd100k\" data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1669\">Requirements may be updated periodically</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hvpc8n\" data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1722\">Final admission depends on document verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10aralz\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1785\">Students must ensure all submitted information is accurate</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"475\">Understanding the M.Com fee structure requires more than just looking at the per-semester cost. A smart decision involves analyzing the <strong data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"335\">total investment, available discounts, payment flexibility, and long-term return on investment (ROI)</strong>. Many students overlook key details like included components, registration charges, and grant deadlines&mdash;leading to poor financial planning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"588\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"535\">fully detailed, SEO-optimized fee breakdown</strong> to help you make an informed and strategic decision.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"593\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b739pz\" data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"642\">M.Com Fee Structure (With 20% Student Grant)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"859\">The university is currently offering a <strong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"704\">20% student grant</strong>, reducing the overall cost significantly. This offer is <strong data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"809\">valid for a limited time (until 9th May &rsquo;26)</strong>, making early application financially beneficial.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1phtd4\" data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"892\">Fee Details (Semester-Wise)</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"910\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"926\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"997\">\r\n<td data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"986\" data-col-size=\"md\">Actual Fee (Per Semester)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"997\">₹25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1041\">\r\n<td data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1030\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discounted Fee (Per Semester)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1041\">₹20,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1065\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1060\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1065\">4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1113\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1102\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total Course Fee (After Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1113\">₹81,600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1166\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1143\" data-col-size=\"md\">Examination Fee (Included)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1166\">₹2,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1213\" data-col-size=\"md\">Registration Fee (One-Time, Non-Refundable)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1223\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12n0bpf\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1288\">Payment Options Available (Flexible Plans for Students)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1361\">To make the program accessible, multiple payment methods are available:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"186264o\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1391\">1. Semester-Wise Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1474\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"79074a\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1420\">Pay ₹20,400 per semester</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p5jscj\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1474\">Best for students who prefer <strong data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1474\">lower upfront cost</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t88jkf\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1498\">2. Lumpsum Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1589\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c6de2i\" data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1530\">Pay full course fee at once</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qgcg5q\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1589\">Suitable if you want a <strong data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1589\">one-time financial commitment</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"li1gzi\" data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1616\">3. No-Cost EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1718\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tgdd37\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1686\">Convert fees into <strong data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1684\">monthly installments without extra interest</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i2bkjk\" data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1718\">Ideal for budget management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m5owxx\" data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1746\">4. Standard EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1852\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"668vvy\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1777\">Flexible installment plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j1rgdj\" data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1852\">May include <strong data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1850\">interest or processing charges (depending on provider)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"434\">The undergraduate (UG) curriculum is designed to build a <strong data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"224\">strong foundation in business, management, communication, and practical workplace skills</strong>. Unlike traditional programs that focus only on theory, this structure gradually develops <strong data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"394\">analytical thinking, business understanding, and professional communication</strong>, which are essential for employability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"775\">Understanding the syllabus in depth is important because your performance in these foundational semesters directly impacts your <strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"635\">confidence, specialization choices, and future career opportunities</strong>. Below is a <strong data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"691\">fully explained semester-wise breakdown</strong> with real insights into what you will actually learn and how it shapes your career.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"780\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1k8k8kg\" data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"842\">Semester 1: Foundation of Business &amp; Communication Skills</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"1012\">The first semester focuses on building <strong data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"940\">core business understanding and communication ability</strong>, which are essential regardless of the specialization you choose later.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kaiyn9\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1034\">Subjects Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1762\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qgku07\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1189\"><strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1060\">Business Economics</strong><br data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1063\">Introduces economic concepts like demand, supply, and market behavior, helping you understand how businesses make decisions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ig30i\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1324\"><strong data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1217\">Business Environment</strong><br data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1220\">Covers external factors affecting businesses such as economic conditions, policies, and market trends.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14t5xq1\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1484\"><strong data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1368\">Business Organisation and Management</strong><br data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1371\">Builds fundamental knowledge of how organizations operate, including planning, leadership, and decision-making.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rc59mc\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1634\"><strong data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1515\">Office Automation Tools</strong><br data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1518\">Focuses on practical tools like MS Office, spreadsheets, and presentations&mdash;skills directly used in corporate jobs.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x9v1ic\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1762\"><strong data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1670\">English Communication Skills</strong><br data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1673\">Develops basic communication abilities, including writing, speaking, and comprehension.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h3vd5a\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1781\">What You Gain</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1813\">This semester helps you build:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1935\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6z4rj\" data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1842\">Basic business awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cd3vza\" data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1888\">Understanding of organizational structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ulfz9\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1935\">Essential digital and communication skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1940\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"znbncr\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2009\">Semester 2: Core Functional Knowledge &amp; Professional Development</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2161\">The second semester moves towards <strong data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2098\">core business functions and ethical understanding</strong>, while also strengthening communication and analytical skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kaiyn9\" data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2183\">Subjects Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wahw9t\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2318\"><strong data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2206\">Business Ethics</strong><br data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2209\">Focuses on ethical decision-making and corporate responsibility, which is critical in modern organizations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ifpg6g\" data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2425\"><strong data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2351\">Human Resource Management</strong><br data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2354\">Covers recruitment, employee management, and organizational behavior.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rgmcf\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2543\"><strong data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2453\">Financial Accounting</strong><br data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2456\">Introduces accounting principles, financial statements, and basic financial analysis.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13u1nuh\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2660\"><strong data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2573\">Environmental Sciences</strong><br data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2576\">Explains sustainability, environmental impact, and responsible business practices.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajw6i3\" data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2815\"><strong data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2705\">Advanced English Communication Skills</strong><br data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2708\">Enhances professional communication, including presentations, business writing, and interpersonal skills.&nbsp;<br>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h3vd5a\" data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2834\">What You Gain</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2866\">This semester helps you build:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"3032\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9jilu4\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2914\">Financial understanding (accounting basics)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nm508r\" data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2953\">HR and people management knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1htbkxf\" data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2998\">Ethical and responsible business mindset</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h846ic\" data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3032\">Advanced communication skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"497\">Placement support in undergraduate programs plays a crucial role in shaping a student&rsquo;s career, especially when the goal is to transition from <strong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"299\">basic academic knowledge to real-world employability</strong>. LPU Online Placement Support Services are structured to ensure that students are not only degree holders but also <strong data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"496\">industry-ready professionals with practical skills, awareness, and confidence</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"692\">Unlike traditional placement systems that focus only on final-year hiring, LPU Online follows a <strong data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"637\">continuous career development approach</strong>, helping students prepare from early semesters itself.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"697\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7nklop\" data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"761\">How Placement Support Builds Your Career (Beyond Academics)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"889\">LPU Online focuses on developing <strong data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"821\">overall employability</strong>, not just subject knowledge. The placement support system works on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"1569\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zdkt1v\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"1069\"><strong data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"929\">Enhancing career-relevant skills</strong><br data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"932\">Students are guided to develop skills required by employers, such as communication, analytical thinking, teamwork, and problem-solving.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"144h1s8\" data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1307\"><strong data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1102\">Creating career awareness</strong><br data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1105\">Many UG students lack clarity about career paths. The system helps them understand:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pr16nc\" data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1243\">Different job roles available after graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7odz5v\" data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1279\">Skills required for each role</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jxkqxv\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1307\">Industry expectations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k6whvu\" data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1569\"><strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1351\">Encouraging add-on skill development</strong><br data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1354\">Students are motivated to go beyond the syllabus and build additional competencies like:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1569\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"120llkx\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1482\">Advanced Excel and office tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wtvslz\" data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1526\">Communication and presentation skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cipu2d\" data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1569\">Basic business and analytical skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1656\">This ensures that students are prepared not just academically but <strong data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1655\">professionally</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1661\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16v0wd6\" data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1705\">Placement Drives &amp; Employer Interaction</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1850\">To connect students directly with recruiters, LPU Online conducts <strong data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1803\">impactful placement drives</strong> designed to provide real hiring opportunities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1g3g5zt\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1900\">What Students Experience in Placement Drives</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"2163\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13gbwyy\" data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1968\">Direct interaction with <strong data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1966\">potential employers and recruiters</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pchn1n\" data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2037\">Participation in <strong data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2035\">interviews, aptitude tests, and assessments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"129ltq7\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2096\">Opportunity to <strong data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2094\">demonstrate skills and project work</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19yry28\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2163\">Access to <strong data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2161\">job roles aligned with their academic background</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2282\">These drives are not just formal events&mdash;they are <strong data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2281\">practical platforms where students can secure job opportunities</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2287\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1k5tcys\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2349\">Why Placement Support Alone Is Not Enough (Reality Check)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2444\">A common misconception among students is that placement support guarantees a job. In reality:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2670\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14f2n8s\" data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2520\">Placement success depends on <strong data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2518\">student preparation and participation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"baz6oo\" data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2607\">Universities provide opportunities, but <strong data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2605\">students must convert them into offers</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f67wqp\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2670\">Lack of skills or confidence leads to missed opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 100000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(262, 70, '49437806-a611-4b43-be94-45dc030c12dc', '4562f6ef-0233-46a0-b1a3-4fa4ee4bb38c', 208, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 04:14:09', '2026-06-16 06:41:25', '<p id=\"p-rc_5b3aa50d4c98ea49-549\" data-path-to-node=\"2\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,0\">The admission process for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">Online Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA)</strong> at D.Y. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2\"><span class=\"citation-1351\">Patil University is a sophisticated, multi-phased digital workflow designed to ensure high academic standards while maintaining accessibility</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3\"><span class=\"citation-1351 citation-end-1351\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,6\"><span class=\"citation-1350\">The university utilizes a decentralized digital system, ensuring that geographic location is never a barrier to high-quality business education</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,7\"><span class=\"citation-1350 citation-end-1350\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,8\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,10\"><span class=\"citation-1349\">It is critical for applicants to understand that upon the final confirmation of admission and the processing of relevant fees, a candidate is legally treated as a registered student of the University</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,11\"><span class=\"citation-1349 citation-end-1349\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,12\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,14\"><span class=\"citation-1348\">From this point forward, the student is strictly governed by all formal university rules, academic regulations, and disciplinary codes, which include maintaining academic integrity and adhering to digital conduct protocols</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,15\"><span class=\"citation-1348 citation-end-1348\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,16\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5b3aa50d4c98ea49-550\" data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1: Digital Application &amp; Profile Creation</strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-1347\">The journey begins with the creation of a unique user profile on the official university admission portal</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-1347 citation-end-1347\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0,6\"><span class=\"citation-1346\">Candidates must complete a comprehensive application form that meticulously captures their academic history, personal identification, and professional background if applicable</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0,7\"><span class=\"citation-1346 citation-end-1346\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0,8\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0,10\"><span class=\"citation-1345\">Maintaining absolute accuracy during this stage is paramount; any discrepancies in the initial profile can lead to significant mismatches during the later verification phases, potentially resulting in a rejection of the application</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0,11\"><span class=\"citation-1345 citation-end-1345\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0,12\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5b3aa50d4c98ea49-551\" data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2: High-Quality Digital Document Submission</strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-1344\">Once the profile is established, candidates are required to upload high-quality, scanned digital copies of essential academic and personal records</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-1344 citation-end-1344\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,6\"><span class=\"citation-1343\">This includes 10th and 12th-grade mark sheets, valid government-issued identification (such as an Aadhar card or passport), and recent professional photographs</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,7\"><span class=\"citation-1343 citation-end-1343\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,8\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,10\"><span class=\"citation-1342\">For students currently </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,10\" data-index-in-node=\"23\"><span class=\"citation-1342\">appearing for Class 12</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1342\"> examinations, the system allows for the submission of provisional documents to keep the application moving forward while final results are awaited</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,11\"><span class=\"citation-1342 citation-end-1342\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,12\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5b3aa50d4c98ea49-552\" data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3: Administrative Verification &amp; Eligibility Audit</strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-1341\">During this phase, the university administration conducts a thorough internal audit of all submitted credentials</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-1341 citation-end-1341\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,6\"><span class=\"citation-1340\">This is not merely a document check but a strategic verification to ensure the candidate strictly aligns with the university\'s rigorous eligibility criteria, including board recognition and minimum aggregate percentage requirements</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,7\"><span class=\"citation-1340 citation-end-1340\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,8\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,10\"><span class=\"citation-1339\">This phase is designed to protect the academic integrity of the BBA program by ensuring only qualified candidates proceed to enrollment</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,11\"><span class=\"citation-1339 citation-end-1339\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,12\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5b3aa50d4c98ea49-553\" data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4: Formal Admission Offer &amp; Secure Confirmation</strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-1338\">Following a successful verification of all credentials, the university issues a formal offer of admission</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-1338 citation-end-1338\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0,6\"><span class=\"citation-1337\">However, an offer does not guarantee a seat; the admission is only officially confirmed once the candidate accepts the offer and completes the payment of the required tuition fees through the university&rsquo;s secure digital portal</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0,7\"><span class=\"citation-1337 citation-end-1337\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0,8\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0,10\"><span class=\"citation-1336\">This step acts as the final commitment from the student\'s side to join the academic community</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0,11\"><span class=\"citation-1336 citation-end-1336\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"16\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0,12\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5b3aa50d4c98ea49-554\" data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 5: Final University Registration &amp; Resource Provisioning</strong> </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-1335\">Immediately after the fee is successfully processed, the candidate is formally registered in the university&rsquo;s central student database</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-1335 citation-end-1335\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"17\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0,6\"><span class=\"citation-1334\">This official registration status triggers the provisioning of academic resources, granting the student full access to the Learning Management System (LMS), the extensive digital library, and the global alumni network</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0,7\"><span class=\"citation-1334 citation-end-1334\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0,8\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0,10\"><span class=\"citation-1333\">From this moment, the student is fully integrated into the university\'s digital campus</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0,11\"><span class=\"citation-1333 citation-end-1333\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0,12\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strict Eligibility Rules &amp; Academic Standards</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5b3aa50d4c98ea49-555\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0\">To maintain its competitive, high-authority ranking, D.Y. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-1332\">Patil University enforces the following eligibility framework for all Online BBA applicants</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\"><span class=\"citation-1332 citation-end-1332\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"20\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4\">:</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5b3aa50d4c98ea49-556\" data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1331\">Standard Academic Qualification:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1331\"> All applicants must have successfully completed their </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"87\"><span class=\"citation-1331\">10+2 (HSC)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1331\"> or an equivalent examination from a recognized national or state educational board</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1331 citation-end-1331\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"21\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5b3aa50d4c98ea49-557\" data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1330\">Provisional Entry for Class 12 Students:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1330\"> The university actively supports students currently </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\"><span class=\"citation-1330\">appearing for Class 12</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1330\"> exams by allowing them to apply on a provisional basis</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1330 citation-end-1330\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"22\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-1329\">However, it is explicitly understood that final admission is strictly contingent upon the candidate submitting passing certificates that meet the university&rsquo;s specific aggregate requirements upon result declaration</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-1329 citation-end-1329\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"23\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5b3aa50d4c98ea49-558\" data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1328\">NIOS &amp; Open Schooling Inclusion:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1328\"> In a commitment to inclusive education, candidates from the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\"><span class=\"citation-1328\">National Institute of Open Schooling (NIOS)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1328\"> and other recognized open schooling platforms are fully eligible for admission</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1328 citation-end-1328\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"24\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-1327\">They must meet the same core subject requirements and aggregate standards defined by the university council as traditional board students</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-1327 citation-end-1327\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"25\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_5b3aa50d4c98ea49-559\" data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1326\">Technical Diploma Equivalency:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1326\"> Individuals who hold a recognized </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\"><span class=\"citation-1326\">3-year technical diploma</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1326\"> from a state board of technical education are also considered for admission, facilitating a pathway for vocational students into professional management education</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1326 citation-end-1326\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"26\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p id=\"p-rc_0fc31e513e5272fe-573\" data-path-to-node=\"2\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,0\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">Online Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA)</strong> at D.Y. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2\"><span class=\"citation-1425\">Patil University is a digital-first degree designed to bridge the gap between academic theory and corporate application</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3\"><span class=\"citation-1425 citation-end-1425\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,6\"><span class=\"citation-1424\">To maintain institutional excellence, the university enforces rigorous yet inclusive eligibility rules that ensure all registered students have the foundational knowledge necessary to succeed in a professional business environment</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,7\"><span class=\"citation-1424 citation-end-1424\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,8\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,10\"><span class=\"citation-1423\">It is critical for applicants to understand that upon confirmed admission, they are treated as registered students and are strictly governed by the University\'s formal rules and regulations</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,11\"><span class=\"citation-1423 citation-end-1423\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,12\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0fc31e513e5272fe-574\" data-path-to-node=\"3,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1422\">Standard Academic Requirement:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1422\"> Prospective students must have successfully completed their </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"91\"><span class=\"citation-1422\">HSC (10+2)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1422\"> or an equivalent examination from a recognized national or state educational board</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1422 citation-end-1422\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0fc31e513e5272fe-575\" data-path-to-node=\"3,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1421\">Stream Flexibility:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1421\"> The program is open to candidates from </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"59\"><span class=\"citation-1421\">any stream</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1421\"> (Science, Commerce, or Arts), provided they have studied </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"127\"><span class=\"citation-1421\">English</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1421\"> as one of their primary subjects</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1421 citation-end-1421\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0fc31e513e5272fe-576\" data-path-to-node=\"3,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1420\">Provisional Entry for Class 12 Students:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1420\"> In a move to support early career planning, students currently </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"104\"><span class=\"citation-1420\">appearing for their final Class 12 examinations</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1420\"> are eligible to apply on a provisional basis</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1420 citation-end-1420\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-1419\">However, final admission is strictly contingent upon the submission of passing certificates that meet the university&rsquo;s minimum aggregate standards</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-1419 citation-end-1419\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0fc31e513e5272fe-577\" data-path-to-node=\"3,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1418\">NIOS &amp; Open Schooling Recognition:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1418\"> Candidates from the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"55\"><span class=\"citation-1418\">National Institute of Open Schooling (NIOS)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1418\"> and other recognized open schooling platforms are fully eligible to apply, provided they meet the core subject requirements defined by the university council</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1418 citation-end-1418\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0fc31e513e5272fe-578\" data-path-to-node=\"3,4,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1417\">Technical Diploma Equivalency:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1417\"> Individuals holding a recognized </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"64\"><span class=\"citation-1417\">3-year technical diploma</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1417\"> from a state board of technical education are also considered for admission, facilitating a pathway for vocational students into professional management education</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1417 citation-end-1417\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Career Trajectories &amp; Salary ROI</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0fc31e513e5272fe-579\" data-path-to-node=\"6\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0\">An Online BBA from D.Y. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2\"><span class=\"citation-1416\">Patil University&mdash;a brand that has been a staple in Indian education since </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2\" data-index-in-node=\"74\"><span class=\"citation-1416\">1983</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1416\">&mdash;offers a distinct competitive advantage</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3\"><span class=\"citation-1416 citation-end-1416\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4\">. Graduates are prepared for high-growth roles across multiple global sectors:</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0fc31e513e5272fe-580\" data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1415\">Digital Marketing:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1415\"> Strategic management of brand presence and online corporate outreach</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1415 citation-end-1415\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0fc31e513e5272fe-581\" data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1414\">Human Resources:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1414\"> Specialized roles in talent acquisition and organizational development</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1414 citation-end-1414\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0fc31e513e5272fe-582\" data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1413\">Financial Analysis:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1413\"> Entry-level positions in corporate finance and global banking sectors</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1413 citation-end-1413\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0fc31e513e5272fe-583\" data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1412\">Project Management:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1412\"> Professional roles within regional industrial and manufacturing clusters</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1412 citation-end-1412\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_0fc31e513e5272fe-584\" data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1411\">Salary Potential:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1411\"> Graduates typically see starting salaries ranging from </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"73\"><span class=\"citation-1411\">₹3.5 LPA to ₹6.5 LPA</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1411\">, depending on their chosen specialization and previous experience</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1411 citation-end-1411\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p id=\"p-rc_46583a49b3acce67-619\" data-path-to-node=\"2\"><span class=\"citation-1478\">The </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"4\"><span class=\"citation-1478\">Online Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1478\"> at D.Y. Patil University offers a flexible and transparent academic framework, allowing students to choose between a standard </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"179\"><span class=\"citation-1478\">3-year</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1478\"> degree or a comprehensive </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"212\"><span class=\"citation-1478\">4-year</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1478 citation-end-1478\"> track.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span> As a candidate, once your admission is confirmed, you are legally treated as a registered student of the University and are strictly governed by its formal financial rules and academic regulations. <span class=\"citation-1477 citation-end-1477\">The fee structure is meticulously designed to cater to both Indian and International applicants, ensuring that high-quality management education remains accessible on a global scale.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><button class=\"button multiple-button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citations from 1st Flagship University Founded by Dr. D Y Patil and DPU Online. Opens side panel.\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<p><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Degree Phase</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Student Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Sem I</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Sem II</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Sem III</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Sem IV</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Sem V</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Sem VI</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Total (3 Yrs)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Sem VII</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Sem VIII</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Total (4 Yrs)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Indian Civilian</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,1,0\">General</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,2,0\">₹35,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,3,0\">₹35,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,4,0\">₹30,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,5,0\">₹30,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,6,0\">₹15,400</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,7,0\">----</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,8,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,1,8,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹1,45,400</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,9,0\">₹32,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,10,0\">₹15,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,11,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,1,11,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹1,92,400</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,1,0\">Overseas</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,2,0\">$600</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,3,0\">$600</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,4,0\">$600</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,5,0\">$600</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,6,0\">$400</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,7,0\">----</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,8,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,2,8,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">$2,800</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,9,0\">$500</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,10,0\">$400</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,11,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,2,11,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">$3,700</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Early Payment Scholarship &amp; Financial Incentives</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_46583a49b3acce67-620\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span class=\"citation-1476\">To reward disciplined financial planning and encourage early enrollment, the university offers a strategic </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"107\"><span class=\"citation-1476\">Scholarship of ₹5,000/-</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1476 citation-end-1476\"> for BBA aspirants.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span> This scholarship is exclusively available to Indian students who complete their <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"230\">full fee payment in two transactions within 15 days</strong> of admission confirmation. By utilizing this incentive, students can immediately improve their Return on Investment (ROI) by lowering the total cost of their degree. It is vital to note that this scholarship is strictly time-bound; failing to meet the 15-day window requires the student to adhere to the standard semester-wise payment schedule as detailed in the table.</p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from DPU Online. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahgKEwieq46LiZ-UAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQogM\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<p><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eligibility Standards &amp; Provisional Entry Rules</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To maintain a high-authority ranking, the university enforces strict eligibility guidelines that ensure students are academically prepared for the rigors of the BBA program.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_46583a49b3acce67-621\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1475\">Academic Qualification:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1475\"> Applicants must have passed </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"52\"><span class=\"citation-1475\">HSC (10+2)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1475 citation-end-1475\"> or its equivalent examination from a recognized Board in any stream.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from DPU Online. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahgKEwieq46LiZ-UAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQowM\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Subject Requirement:</strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"21\">English</strong> must have been a core subject in the qualifying examination.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Provisional Eligibility (Class 12):</strong> Students currently <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"55\">appearing for their final Class 12 examinations</strong> are eligible to apply on a provisional basis. Final admission is strictly contingent upon the submission of passing certificates that meet the university&rsquo;s minimum aggregate standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">NIOS Recognition:</strong> Candidates from the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"38\">National Institute of Open Schooling (NIOS)</strong> are fully recognized and eligible to apply, provided they satisfy the core subject requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"1146\">The Online BBA program is structured across <strong data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"855\">6 semesters</strong>, progressively building foundational business knowledge in the initial years and advancing into specialization-focused learning in later semesters. This design ensures that students first develop a strong understanding of core management principles before choosing a career-oriented domain.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1473\">A key strategic advantage of this structure is flexibility&mdash;students can align their specialization with career goals such as marketing, finance, HR, IT, or international business. However, selecting the wrong specialization without understanding long-term career implications is one of the most common mistakes students make.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1478\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"t25n6x\" data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1521\">Semester 1 Subjects (Foundation Level)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1616\">The first semester focuses on building basic business understanding and communication skills.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1800\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cmr5za\" data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1648\">Fundamentals of Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l6l6do\" data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1672\">Basics of Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"siyio9\" data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1697\">Basics of Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"88yhbj\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1727\">Introduction to Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7657os\" data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1779\">Environmental Awareness and Disaster Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r4ovx8\" data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1800\">Business English</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1954\">This phase is crucial as it forms the base for all advanced management concepts. Weak understanding here often leads to difficulties in later semesters.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1959\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"a2wcni\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2013\">Semester 2 Subjects (Core Business Understanding)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2099\">Students are introduced to real-world business environments and behavioral concepts.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2244\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q0opgn\" data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2129\">Organizational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"87tpkh\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2148\">Indian Economy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2173\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i0kwnv\" data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2198\">Business Environment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bw92b2\" data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2224\">Indian Banking System</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11vuake\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2244\">Soft Skills &ndash; I</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2375\">This semester begins connecting theory with practical business scenarios, especially in understanding how organizations function.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2380\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"38wbd2\" data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2432\">Semester 3 Subjects (Applied Business Concepts)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2526\">The third semester deepens functional knowledge and introduces analytical and legal aspects.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2674\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fqwsby\" data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2557\">Human Resource Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vtajs8\" data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2580\">Banking Operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18wh040\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2611\">Introduction to Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jpcxlo\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2636\">Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15obis4\" data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2653\">Business Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16nwtx3\" data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2674\">Soft Skills &ndash; II</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2791\">This stage is important for developing decision-making and analytical thinking skills required in management roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2796\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b82o52\" data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2855\">Semester 4 Subjects (Advanced Core + Digital Exposure)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2920\">Students move toward advanced topics and modern business tools.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"3132\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kgicc2\" data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2955\">Management Information System</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e6ona2\" data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2988\">Entrepreneurship Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16lnhov\" data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3031\">Introduction to International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"skuumi\" data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3059\">Quantitative Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nizlsi\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3094\">Basics of Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p3eljh\" data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3132\">Introduction to Digital Marketing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3281\">This semester is strategically important because it introduces digital and entrepreneurial skills, which are highly relevant in today&rsquo;s job market.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3286\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"t9u7dw\" data-start=\"3288\" data-end=\"3340\">Semester 5 Subjects (Specialization Phase Begins)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3342\" data-end=\"3469\">From Semester 5 onwards, students choose a specialization. Along with common subjects, domain-specific subjects are introduced.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xjy4l4\" data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3512\">Common Subjects (All Specializations)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3661\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51ml37\" data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3555\">Introduction to Production Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tn55bc\" data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3600\">Business Ethics and Corporate Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17pvm02\" data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3636\">Marketing of Financial Services</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r091cr\" data-start=\"3637\" data-end=\"3661\">Introduction to SMEs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3666\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12mo24w\" data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3705\">Specialization Options &amp; Subjects</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3707\" data-end=\"3737\">Marketing Management (MM)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3738\" data-end=\"3806\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"3738\" data-end=\"3762\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6r389b\" data-start=\"3763\" data-end=\"3785\">Consumer Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vj2jpv\" data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3806\">Sales Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3844\">Human Resource Management (HRM)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3845\" data-end=\"3931\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fqwsby\" data-start=\"3845\" data-end=\"3874\">Human Resource Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6xp4o0\" data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3902\">Human Resource Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ud9ssw\" data-start=\"3903\" data-end=\"3931\">Training and Development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"3961\">Finance Management (FM)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"4071\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r3fng3\" data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"3984\">Finance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"atpv1o\" data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"4021\">Analysis of Financial Statements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pbzkk4\" data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4071\">Indian Financial System and Financial Markets</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4107\">IT &amp; Systems Management (ITM)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4153\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p5jmfi\" data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4130\">Introduction to IT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"764b79\" data-start=\"4131\" data-end=\"4153\">Applications of IT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4199\">International Business Management (IBM)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4296\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uaukvd\" data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4242\">Fundamentals of International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c0r2v8\" data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4296\">International Institutions and Trade Implications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4298\" data-end=\"4320\">Retail Management</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4321\" data-end=\"4398\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16hagrl\" data-start=\"4321\" data-end=\"4358\">Fundamentals of Retail Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15dr1tp\" data-start=\"4359\" data-end=\"4398\">Retail Sales Techniques &amp; Promotion</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4400\" data-end=\"4451\">Banking, Financial Services &amp; Insurance (BFSI)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4510\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mw710p\" data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4478\">Banking Law &amp; Practice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wv6ec\" data-start=\"4479\" data-end=\"4510\">Insurance &amp; Risk Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4512\" data-end=\"4538\">E-Commerce Management</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4539\" data-end=\"4592\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ik3dk7\" data-start=\"4539\" data-end=\"4570\">Digital Business Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f0uzzq\" data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4592\">Digital Marketing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4594\" data-end=\"4632\">Shipping and Logistics Management</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4701\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3iqug7\" data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4670\">Introduction to Shipping Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1529yt5\" data-start=\"4671\" data-end=\"4701\">Multi-Modal Transportation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4706\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jpfwfx\" data-start=\"4708\" data-end=\"4771\">Semester 6 Subjects (Advanced Specialization + Project Work)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4773\" data-end=\"4862\">The final semester focuses on practical exposure, strategic management, and project work.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xjy4l4\" data-start=\"4864\" data-end=\"4905\">Common Subjects (All Specializations)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4907\" data-end=\"4998\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e0tj0u\" data-start=\"4907\" data-end=\"4929\">Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c8a9uf\" data-start=\"4930\" data-end=\"4950\">Event Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18zib1c\" data-start=\"4951\" data-end=\"4981\">Fundamentals of E-Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nsli58\" data-start=\"4982\" data-end=\"4998\">Project Work</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5000\" data-end=\"5003\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bj13gm\" data-start=\"5005\" data-end=\"5032\">Specialization Subjects</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5034\" data-end=\"5064\">Marketing Management (MM)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5065\" data-end=\"5122\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bkndma\" data-start=\"5065\" data-end=\"5100\">Advertising and Sales Promotion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mveyk\" data-start=\"5101\" data-end=\"5122\">Retail Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5124\" data-end=\"5160\">Human Resource Management (HRM)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5161\" data-end=\"5223\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19qbue7\" data-start=\"5161\" data-end=\"5201\">Industrial Relations and Labour Laws</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mhzcpp\" data-start=\"5202\" data-end=\"5223\">Change Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5225\" data-end=\"5253\">Finance Management (FM)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5254\" data-end=\"5303\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fr4cec\" data-start=\"5254\" data-end=\"5275\">Long Term Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e08eg9\" data-start=\"5276\" data-end=\"5303\">Direct and Indirect Tax</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5305\" data-end=\"5339\">IT &amp; Systems Management (ITM)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5411\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yovjob\" data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5370\">Database Management System</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pgjkhn\" data-start=\"5371\" data-end=\"5411\">Innovation and Technology Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5413\" data-end=\"5457\">International Business Management (IBM)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5458\" data-end=\"5542\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ym12z\" data-start=\"5458\" data-end=\"5503\">Export Import Documentation and Logistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"omrmeh\" data-start=\"5504\" data-end=\"5542\">International Strategic Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5544\" data-end=\"5566\">Retail Management</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5567\" data-end=\"5658\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oja8bj\" data-start=\"5567\" data-end=\"5615\">Merchandise Management and Stores Operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gldq06\" data-start=\"5616\" data-end=\"5658\">Customer Relationship Management (CRM)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5660\" data-end=\"5669\">BFSI</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5670\" data-end=\"5742\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19glneo\" data-start=\"5670\" data-end=\"5704\">Financial Securities &amp; Markets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3z8fdy\" data-start=\"5705\" data-end=\"5742\">Investment &amp; Portfolio Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5744\" data-end=\"5770\">E-Commerce Management</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5771\" data-end=\"5847\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5jhq2o\" data-start=\"5771\" data-end=\"5804\">Business Models in E-Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11132r3\" data-start=\"5805\" data-end=\"5847\">E-Commerce Applications and Securities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5849\" data-end=\"5887\">Shipping and Logistics Management</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5888\" data-end=\"5970\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g4fr6y\" data-start=\"5888\" data-end=\"5939\">International Shipping Policies and Regulations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l65u87\" data-start=\"5940\" data-end=\"5970\">Customs Law and Procedures</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"1095\">The Online BBA placement journey is a structured, multi-stage process designed to transform students from learners into job-ready professionals. Unlike traditional placements where students often prepare at the last moment, this process begins early and focuses on continuous skill development, career clarity, and industry readiness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1359\">A major advantage of this structured journey is that it reduces uncertainty and improves placement outcomes. However, students who ignore early stages&mdash;especially evaluation and resume building&mdash;often struggle during final placement drives despite having a degree.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1364\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tmxgh8\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1402\">Step 1: Evaluation &amp; Introduction</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1560\">This is the foundation stage of the placement journey, where students are introduced to the placement ecosystem and their current skill levels are assessed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1784\">The process includes a detailed briefing about program objectives, career pathways, and placement expectations. At the same time, an analysis of existing skills and competencies is conducted to identify strengths and gaps.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"2019\">This step is strategically important because it helps students understand where they stand and what improvements are needed. Ignoring this stage or taking it lightly can result in poor preparation later, especially during interviews.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2024\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qgjvxx\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2073\">Step 2: Career Exploration &amp; Resume Building</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2238\">In this phase, students explore different career options aligned with their specialization and interests. Based on this, they start building a professional resume.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2412\">Resume building is not just about listing qualifications&mdash;it involves presenting skills, internships, projects, and achievements in a way that matches industry expectations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2640\">A common mistake students make is creating generic resumes without customization. This significantly reduces shortlisting chances. A well-structured, role-specific resume can increase interview opportunities by a large margin.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2645\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11zf5ty\" data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2680\">Step 3: Placement Registration</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2801\">Students who meet eligibility criteria and are ready for placements must officially register for the placement process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"3013\">This step ensures that only serious and prepared candidates participate in placement drives. Missing deadlines or failing to complete registration properly can result in losing placement opportunities entirely.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3018\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7zw9y\" data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3049\">Step 4: Placement Guidance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3177\">This stage focuses on intensive preparation through training sessions, mock interviews, aptitude tests, and group discussions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3208\">Students receive guidance on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3355\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bqu7wn\" data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3259\">Interview techniques and communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c9sy9d\" data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3306\">Aptitude and logical reasoning preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yiqbzr\" data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3355\">Industry-specific knowledge and expectations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3537\">This is where students transition from academic learners to job-ready candidates. Those who actively participate in mock sessions perform significantly better in actual interviews.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3542\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cmwi0t\" data-start=\"3544\" data-end=\"3570\">Step 5: Placement Drive</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3717\">The final stage involves participation in placement drives where students interact with recruiters, attend interviews, and compete for job roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3856\">Placement drives provide real opportunities to secure employment, and performance here depends heavily on preparation in previous stages.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"4049\">A critical insight is that students who rely only on last-minute preparation often fail at this stage, while those who consistently build skills throughout the journey achieve better results.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 130000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(263, 70, '49437806-a611-4b43-be94-45dc030c12dc', '4562f6ef-0233-46a0-b1a3-4fa4ee4bb38c', 207, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 04:47:15', '2026-06-16 06:41:56', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">The admission protocol at D.Y. Patil University (established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">1983</strong>) is a sophisticated, three-stage digital journey designed to ensure high-integrity student onboarding. This process is fully optimized for remote access, allowing global aspirants to secure their seats through a streamlined, AI-powered interface.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 01: Learner&rsquo;s Authentication &amp; Digital Identity Setup</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">Before accessing the formal application, every candidate must undergo a multi-factor authentication process to establish their digital identity within the university&rsquo;s ecosystem.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accessing the DPU Gateway:</strong> Candidates must visit the official <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">DPU Login Page</strong>. This portal serves as the primary interface for the duration of the MBA program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Initial Registration:</strong> You are required to fill in basic profile details to create your student account.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">DEB Unique ID Integration:</strong> As a UGC-DEB recognized program, candidates must enter their <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">DEB Unique ID</strong>. This ensures that your enrollment is synchronized with the national distance education database.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Multi-Channel Verification:</strong> The system triggers a dual verification protocol:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mobile Verification:</strong> via a secure OTP (One-Time Password).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Email Verification:</strong> to ensure all future academic correspondence is directed to a secure, active inbox.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Identity Upload:</strong> Candidates must upload their official identity document (such as a Digital ID card) to finalize the authentication phase.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 02: Comprehensive Admission Form &amp; Fee Submission</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Once authenticated, the candidate enters the \"Active Application\" phase. This stage requires granular detail to build your permanent academic record.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Personal &amp; Professional Profiling:</strong> You must provide comprehensive personal data along with an exhaustive history of your <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"121\">educational and employment details</strong>. This information is used to verify eligibility (50% aggregate for General, 45% for Reserved categories).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Biometric Uploads:</strong> Candidates must upload a high-resolution, passport-size <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"75\">photo</strong> and a digital copy of their <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">signature</strong>. These must adhere to the university&rsquo;s specific technical dimensions (see the \'Document Format\' section below).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Online Fee Payment:</strong> The integrated payment gateway allows for the secure processing of the <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"91\">Semester I fee (₹50,000)</strong>.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Note:</em> If you complete the full program payment within this 15-day window, you qualify for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"104\">₹10,000 scholarship</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Submission:</strong> After a thorough review of the inputted data, the form is submitted to the university&rsquo;s administrative board for auditing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 03: Administrative Verification &amp; Admission Confirmation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">The final phase is managed by the D.Y. Patil University Admissions Office, where a rigorous document audit is performed.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Verification:</strong> The university&rsquo;s verification team cross-references your uploaded marks and identification with the originals. Any discrepancy at this stage represents an admission <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"188\">risk</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Receipting:</strong> Once the payment is cleared and documents are verified, the university issues official <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">Fee Receipts</strong> for your records.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Enrollment:</strong> Successful candidates receive a formal <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"57\">Admission Confirmation Email</strong>. This is followed by an <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"110\">SMS containing your unique login credentials</strong>, granting you 24/7 access to the AI-powered Learning Management System (LMS).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mandatory Documents &amp; Technical Specifications</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">To ensure a \"First-Time-Right\" application and avoid administrative delays, adhere to the following documentation standards:</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Required Documentation</strong></h4>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Government-Issued ID:</strong> A valid identity proof (e.g., Passport or equivalent Government ID).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Passport-Size Photograph:</strong> Must be a recent color photo.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Signature:</strong> A clear scan of the student&rsquo;s formal signature on white paper.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Legal Name Change Documentation:</strong> * <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">Female Candidates:</strong> Marriage Certificate (if applicable).</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Male Candidates:</strong> Official Gazette of India notification (if a name change has occurred)<br><br></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Format &amp; Upload Guidelines</strong></h4>\r\n<table style=\"height: 228px; width: 115.484%;\" data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 80px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.1959%;\"><strong>Document Type</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 17.0013%;\"><strong>File Format</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.2614%;\"><strong>File Size Limit</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 29.3179%;\"><strong>Dimension Requirement</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 85px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.1959%;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Photo &amp; Signature</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 17.0013%;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\">JPEG / JPG / PNG</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.2614%;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\">&lt; 600 KB</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 29.3179%;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,3,0\">320px X 240px</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.1959%;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Certificates</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 17.0013%;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\">PDF / JPEG</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.2614%;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\">1 MB</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 29.3179%;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,3,0\">Standard A4 Scan</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">To maintain its standing as a premier institution (founded in <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">1983</strong>), D.Y. Patil University enforces strict eligibility standards for its Online MBA program. These criteria ensure that all registered students possess the foundational academic rigour necessary to succeed in a high-intensity, digital learning environment.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"3\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Mandatory Educational Qualifications</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recognized Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree:</strong> All applicants must possess a <strong data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> from a university recognized by the University Grants Commission (UGC) or an equivalent governing body.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Disciplinary Flexibility:</strong> The program is open to graduates from <strong data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">any discipline</strong>. Whether your background is in Commerce, Arts, Science, Engineering, or Law, you are eligible to apply, provided you meet the minimum aggregate requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Graduation Format:</strong> The university typically recognizes the standard <strong data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\">10+2+3</strong> or <strong data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">10+2+4</strong> education pattern.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Minimum Aggregate Performance Standards</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The university maintains specific \"cutoff\" percentages to ensure a high quality of peer interaction and academic performance:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">General Category Students:</strong> A minimum of <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"40\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in the qualifying graduation examination is mandatory.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Reserved Category Students:</strong> In accordance with government regulations and institutional policy, a relaxation is provided for candidates belonging to reserved categories (such as SC/ST/OBC). These candidates must secure a minimum of <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"232\">45% aggregate marks</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Critical Admission Directives for Applicants</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Year Students:</strong> Candidates who are currently in their <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"59\">final year of graduation</strong> are generally permitted to apply on a <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"122\">provisional basis</strong>. However, admission is only finalized upon the submission of a passing certificate that meets the 50%/45% aggregate rule.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Verification Strategy:</strong> To mitigate the <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">risk</strong> of admission cancellation, all submitted transcripts must be high-resolution and verifiable. The university performs a rigorous administrative audit of all digital documents during the registration phase.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Work Experience (Optional but Recommended):</strong> While not a mandatory eligibility constraint for the general Online MBA, professional experience is highly valued. It allows students to better grasp the practical applications of the Year 1 management core and Year 2 specializations&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">D.Y. Patil University (legacy established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">1983</strong>) offers a transparent and competitive investment model for its Online MBA program. The following tables outline the semester-wise expenditure for both domestic and international candidates.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"3\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Indian Civilian Fee Structure (INR)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">For domestic applicants, the fee is structured to provide a balanced distribution of costs over the two-year duration.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Academic Term</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Fees (in ₹)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Status</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester I</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,0\">₹ 50,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,2,0\">Mandatory Registration + Tuition</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester II</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1,0\">₹ 50,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,2,0\">Core Management Tuition</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester III</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,1,0\">₹ 45,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,2,0\">Specialization Tuition</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester IV</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4,1,0\">₹ 44,400</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4,2,0\">Advanced Specialization + Project</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Program Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,5,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹ 1,89,400</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,5,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Comprehensive Academic Cost</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. International Student Fee Structure (USD)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The university maintains a global standard for international candidates, ensuring 24/7 access to the digital ecosystem.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Academic Term</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Fees (in $)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Status</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester I</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\">$ 1,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\">Enrollment &amp; E-Tutorial Access</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester II</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\">$ 1,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\">Functional Core Modules</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester III</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\">$ 800</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\">Specialized Industry Tracks</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester IV</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,1,0\">$ 800</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4,2,0\">Final Project &amp; Assessment</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Program Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,5,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">$ 3,600</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,5,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total International Investment</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Scholarship: The ₹10,000 Full-Payment Incentive</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">To incentivize financial discipline and academic commitment, the university provides a high-value scholarship for proactive students.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Scholarship Value:</strong> A flat reduction of <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">₹ 10,000</strong> on the total program fee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eligibility Window:</strong> This offer is strictly valid for candidates who complete their full fee payment <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"100\">within 15 days</strong> of admission confirmation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Transaction Mode:</strong> The payment must be completed in either a <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">single transaction</strong> or a maximum of <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"95\">two transactions</strong> to qualify for the waiver.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Net Effective Fee:</strong> For Indian Civilians utilizing this scholarship, the total academic investment reduces to <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">₹ 1,79,400</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">&nbsp;</h3>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">Online Master of Business Administration (MBA)</strong> at D.Y. Patil University is a multi-dimensional program designed to cultivate high-level leadership and specialized technical expertise. The curriculum follows a strategic four-semester progression: the first year establishes a multidisciplinary foundation in core management, while the second year allows for profound specialization across modern industry clusters.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase I: Foundational Management Core (Year 1)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The initial phase of the MBA journey is designed to synchronize students from diverse academic backgrounds with the complexities of global business operations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: The Pillars of Business Administration</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Semester 1 focuses on the fundamental scientific and economic principles that govern organizational success.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Principles &amp; Practices of Management:</strong> A deep dive into classical and modern management theories, planning, and organizational design.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Organisational Behaviour:</strong> Analyzing individual and group dynamics within a corporate setting to optimize productivity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Management Accounting:</strong> Focuses on internal financial reporting, cost analysis, and decision-making frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Managerial Economics:</strong> Applying micro and macroeconomic theories to solve business problems and forecast market trends.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Communication:</strong> Developing high-level executive presence, reporting, and negotiation skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Research Methodology:</strong> Mastery of data collection, hypothesis testing, and analytical frameworks required for the Semester 4 project.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Environment Awareness and Disaster Management:</strong> Integrating sustainability and risk mitigation into the corporate strategy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Functional Mastery &amp; Strategy</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Semester 2 expands into the functional domains required for operational leadership.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Human Resource Management:</strong> Advanced strategies for talent acquisition, retention, and human capital development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Marketing Management:</strong> Developing comprehensive market strategies, segmentation, and competitive positioning.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Management:</strong> Focuses on capital budgeting, working capital management, and dividend policies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operations Management:</strong> Streamlining manufacturing and service delivery through lean principles and quality control.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Management Information System (MIS):</strong> Leveraging data architecture and IT for strategic organizational alignment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Management &amp; Business Policy:</strong> The capstone of Year 1, focusing on long-term competitive advantage and policy formulation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,6,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Entrepreneurship Development:</strong> Cultivating the \"intrapreneurial\" mindset required for corporate innovation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase II: Specialized Vertical Mastery (Year 2)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">In Year 2, the curriculum transitions to specialist mastery. Students engage with five to six domain-specific subjects alongside <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">Generic Electives</strong> like Digital Marketing or Business English.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Specialization Clusters</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning:</strong> Includes <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">Basics of AI &amp; ML</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">Machine Learning</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"90\">Performing Analytics with Python</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"124\">Statistics &amp; Quantitative Techniques</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"162\">Business Intelligence</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"189\">R-Programming</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">FinTech Specialization:</strong> Modules on <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">FinTech Management</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"55\">Financial Institutions and Banking</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"91\">Quantitative Methods</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"113\">E-Commerce Trends</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"132\">Security Analysis</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"155\">Capital Markets</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Analytics:</strong> Focuses on <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"31\">Business Analytics I &amp; II</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">DBMS</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">Business Statistics and Econometrics</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"102\">Python Analytics</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"124\">R-Programming</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management:</strong> Deep topical coverage of <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">Inventory Management &amp; MRP Systems</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"98\">Production Planning</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"119\">Packaging and Distribution</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"151\">World Class Manufacturing</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Marketing Specialization:</strong> Covers <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">Introduction to Digital Marketing</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">SEO</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">Integrated Marketing Communication</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"117\">Social Media Marketing</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"141\">Emerging IT Trends</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"165\">Web Designing</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Business Management:</strong> Explores <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"44\">WTO &amp; Trade Policy</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">Business Laws</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">International Marketing</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"108\">International Finance</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,6,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sectoral Specializations:</strong> Detailed tracks in <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">Healthcare &amp; Hospital Management (HAHM)</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">AgriBusiness Management</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">Project Management</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"135\">IT Management</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Advanced Specialization &amp; Capstone Project</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">The final semester focuses on advanced niche subjects and the practical application of the MBA learning.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Advanced Modules:</strong> Strategic HR, HR Audit (for HR track); Project Finance, Insurance &amp; Risk Management (for Finance); Application of AI in Business (for AI/ML).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generic Elective-II:</strong> Students must complete <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"44\">Soft Skill</strong> or <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">Business Ethics and Corporate Governance</strong> modules.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Project Work Report:</strong> This is the most critical component. Registered students must conduct original research in their chosen specialization, applying the <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"158\">Research Methodology</strong> learned in Semester 1 to a real-world business problem.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">At D.Y. Patil University (established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">1983</strong>), the placement journey is not merely a final event but a curated, multi-stage evolution. This AI-powered ecosystem ensures that by the time a student reaches the final semester, they are equipped with the technical mastery and executive presence required by over <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"310\">300+ global hiring partners</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 01: Evaluation &amp; Introduction &ndash; The Foundation of Growth</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The journey begins with a granular assessment of the learner&rsquo;s professional starting point. This stage is critical for aligning academic effort with industry expectations.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Objective Briefing:</strong> Students are introduced to the global benchmarks of the Online MBA program. This involves understanding the ROI of their chosen specialization, whether in <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"183\">FinTech</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"192\">Business Analytics</strong>, or <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"215\">Healthcare Management</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Gap Analysis:</strong> A comprehensive evaluation of existing competencies. By identifying strengths and weaknesses early, the university helps students focus on specific \"upskilling\" modules throughout the curriculum.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Competency Mapping:</strong> Aligning the student&rsquo;s natural aptitude with the most lucrative career paths within their specialization vertical.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 02: Career Exploration &amp; Resume Building &ndash; Crafting the Executive Persona</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">In this phase, the focus shifts to personal branding and market positioning.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Industry Deep-Dives:</strong> Students explore various job roles and market trends associated with their domain. For instance, an AI student would explore roles from Data Architect to AI Strategy Consultant.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Resume Engineering:</strong> Professional mentors guide students in building a high-authority, ATS-friendly (Applicant Tracking System) resume. This involves highlighting the <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"166\">Semester 4 Project Work Report</strong> as a primary evidence of practical expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn &amp; Digital Presence:</strong> Strategies for optimizing professional digital profiles to attract global headhunters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 03: Placement Registration &ndash; Entering the Corporate Arena</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Once the persona is built, the student formally enters the university&rsquo;s placement ecosystem.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Formal Enrollment:</strong> Students register their profiles on the centralized DPU Placement Portal.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Synchronization:</strong> All academic records, including the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">50% graduation aggregate</strong> (or 45% for reserved categories), are verified to ensure the candidate meets the baseline criteria of premium hiring partners.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Database Activation:</strong> The student\'s profile becomes visible to recruiters scouting for specialized talent in niche sectors like <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"127\">Logistics</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"138\">Digital Marketing</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"161\">Agribusiness</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 04: Placement Guidance &ndash; Rigorous Interview Preparation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">This is the \"polishing\" phase where theoretical knowledge is converted into interview-room success.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mock Interviews:</strong> Simulated interview sessions with industry veterans to build confidence and refine communication.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Soft Skill Development:</strong> Leveraging the <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">Generic Elective-II</strong> modules (Soft Skills &amp; Business Ethics) to enhance executive presence and negotiation tactics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Specialization-Specific Coaching:</strong> Technical drills focusing on domain-heavy subjects such as <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Python Analytics</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">Financial Modeling</strong>, or <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"134\">Labour Laws</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 05: Placement Drive &ndash; The Final Launch</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">The culmination of the MBA journey where students interact directly with top-tier organizations.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recruitment Events:</strong> Integrated virtual and physical placement drives where candidates interview for high-growth roles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Job Offer Management:</strong> Guidance on evaluating offer letters, understanding compensation structures, and selecting the right career trajectory.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corporate Networking:</strong> Direct access to a vast alumni network and a diverse portfolio of companies, ensuring starting packages typically ranging from <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"149\">₹5 LPA to ₹18 LPA</strong>.<br><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Section: Strategic Placement Journey Table (Copy/Paste Ready)</strong></h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Phase</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Title</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Key Objective</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Critical Components</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">01</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Evaluation</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\">Skill Analysis</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,3,0\">Objective Briefing, Competency Mapping, Gap Identification</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">02</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Exploration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\">Resume Building</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,3,0\">Persona Crafting, ATS Optimization, Industry Exploration</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">03</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,2,0\">Portal Entry</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3,3,0\">Placement Database Activation, Academic Verification</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">04</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Guidance</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,2,0\">Interview Prep</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,4,3,0\">Mock Interviews, Soft Skill Drills, Technical Coaching</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">05</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,5,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,5,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Drive</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,5,2,0\">Recruitment</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,5,3,0\">Interaction with 300+ Partners, Offer Selection, ROI Realization</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 189400.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(264, 70, '49437806-a611-4b43-be94-45dc030c12dc', '4562f6ef-0233-46a0-b1a3-4fa4ee4bb38c', 75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 05:02:40', '2026-06-16 06:42:54', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The admission protocol at D.Y. Patil University (a legacy established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"73\">1983</strong>) is a sophisticated, AI-powered digital journey. Designed for global accessibility, the process ensures that every candidate is authenticated and verified according to the highest academic and regulatory standards.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 01: Learner&rsquo;s Authentication &amp; Digital Onboarding</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The journey begins with the establishment of your digital identity within the DPU ecosystem. This phase is critical for ensuring secure communication and regulatory compliance.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accessing the DPU Gateway:</strong> Candidates must navigate to the official <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\">DPU Login Page</strong>, the central hub for all student interactions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Profile Initiation:</strong> Enter your primary details to create a unique learner profile.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">DEB Unique ID Verification:</strong> As part of the UGC-DEB mandate, you must provide your <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">DEB Unique ID</strong>. This synchronizes your record with the national database for recognized online education.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Multi-Channel Authentication:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mobile Verification:</strong> A secure OTP (One-Time Password) is sent to your registered mobile number.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Email Verification:</strong> A confirmation link is sent to your inbox to establish a formal line of academic correspondence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Identity Upload:</strong> Candidates are required to upload a digital version of their <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">Aadhaar</strong> or equivalent government ID to finalize the authentication phase.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 02: Comprehensive Admission Form &amp; Documentation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Once authenticated, you enter the formal application stage. This step requires granular data entry to build your permanent academic and professional record.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Profiling:</strong> You must provide exhaustive information regarding your <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"75\">personal, educational, and employment history</strong>. This data is used to verify your eligibility (typically a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with 50% aggregate for General and 45% for Reserved categories).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Biometric &amp; Signature Uploads:</strong> You must upload a high-resolution, passport-size <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">photograph</strong> and a digital scan of your <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">signature</strong>. These must adhere to the university&rsquo;s strict technical dimensions to avoid administrative rejection.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Online Fee Payment:</strong> The integrated gateway allows for the secure processing of the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"83\">Semester I fee (₹40,000)</strong>.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Scholarship Note:</em> Full-program payment within <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"56\">15 days</strong> of admission triggers a <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">₹10,000 scholarship</strong>, significantly improving your ROI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Submission:</strong> After a final review of the data for accuracy, the form is submitted for institutional audit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 03: Administrative Audit &amp; Confirmation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">The final phase is managed by the D.Y. Patil University Admissions Office, where your application undergoes a rigorous verification cycle.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Verification:</strong> The university team cross-references your uploaded marks and identity documents with the originals. Ensuring document clarity is vital to mitigate any admission <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"184\">risk</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Receipting:</strong> Upon successful verification and payment clearance, official <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"83\">Fee Receipts</strong> are generated and available for download.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Admission Confirmation:</strong> Successful candidates receive a formal <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"63\">Admission Confirmation Email</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Credentialing:</strong> You will receive an <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">SMS containing your unique login credentials</strong> for the AI-powered Learning Management System (LMS), granting you immediate access to the Semester I technical modules.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mandatory Documentation &amp; Formatting Checklist</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">To ensure a \"First-Time-Right\" application, adhere to the following documentation standards:</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Required Document</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Note</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Government ID</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0\">e-Aadhaar or Passport</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1,2,0\">Must be a valid, government-issued document</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Visual Identity</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,0\">Passport-size Photograph</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2,2,0\">Recent, color photograph in professional attire</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Authorization</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0\">Student\'s Signature</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,3,2,0\">Clear scan on a plain white background</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Name Change (F)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,0\">Marriage Certificate</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,4,2,0\">Required if your name differs from your degree</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Name Change (M)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,5,1,0\">Gazette of India Notification</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,5,2,0\">Required for any formal or legal name change</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technical Upload Specifications</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Format:</strong> JPEG / JPG / PNG</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dimensions:</strong> 320px X 240px</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">File Size (Photo/Sign):</strong> Must be <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">less than 600 KB</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">File Size (Educational):</strong> Must be <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">less than 1 MB</strong> per document</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">To ensure the high technical rigour of the <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">Master of Computer Applications (MCA)</strong> program, D.Y. Patil University (a legacy established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"137\">1983</strong>) maintains a comprehensive set of eligibility requirements. These standards ensure that every registered student possesses the analytical foundation necessary to master advanced computational modules.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Mandatory Educational Qualifications</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The Online MCA program is designed for graduates who wish to pivot into high-level software development or systems architecture.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Diverse Undergraduate Backgrounds:</strong> Applicants must have successfully passed <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">any graduation degree</strong>. This inclusive policy welcomes candidates from various streams, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Engineering/Technology:</strong> B.E. / B.Tech.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Science &amp; IT:</strong> B.Sc., BCA, B.Voc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Commerce &amp; Arts:</strong> B.Com., B.A.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Mathematics Preference:</strong> While the program is open to all graduates, the university indicates a <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"99\">preference for candidates who have studied Mathematics</strong> at the 10+2 (Higher Secondary) level or during their Graduation. This ensures the learner can handle the complexity of Semester 1 modules like <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"297\">Discrete Mathematics and Combinatorics</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Minimum Aggregate Performance Benchmarks</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Academic merit is a core pillar of the D.Y. Patil registration process. Candidates must meet the following \"cutoff\" percentages in their qualifying degree:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">General Category (Unreserved):</strong> A minimum of <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"44\">50% aggregate marks</strong> is mandatory.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Reserved Categories (SC/ST/OBC):</strong> In compliance with institutional and government norms, a relaxation is provided. Candidates from reserved categories must secure at least <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"171\">45% aggregate marks</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Critical Admission Directives &amp; Document Integrity</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recognized Institutions:</strong> Your undergraduate degree must be from a university recognized by the <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"95\">University Grants Commission (UGC)</strong>. Degrees from unrecognized or \"autonomous only\" colleges may pose a significant admission <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"220\">risk</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Year Applicants:</strong> Students awaiting their final year results are typically allowed to apply on a <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"102\">provisional basis</strong>. However, the degree and final mark sheet must be submitted to confirm the registration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">DEB Unique ID Synchronization:</strong> For the Online MCA, your eligibility is cross-verified via the <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"94\">DEB Unique ID</strong> during the authentication phase. This ensures your technical degree carries full legal weight for government and international employment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Investing in a D.Y. Patil University Online MBA (a legacy brand established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">1983</strong>) is a strategic move toward global leadership. The fee structure is designed to be transparent, ensuring that registered students can plan their academic journey without hidden financial risks.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Comprehensive Fee Breakdown</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The university offers a tiered payment structure, allowing students to manage their finances across the four-semester duration of the program.<br><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0,0\"><br></span></p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Student Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 1</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 2</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 3</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 4</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Indian Civilian</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹ 1,40,000/-</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,2,0\">₹ 40,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,3,0\">₹ 40,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,4,0\">₹ 30,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,5,0\">₹ 30,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Students</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">US$ 2,700</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,2,0\">US$ 750</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,3,0\">US$ 750</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,4,0\">US$ 600</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2,5,0\">US$ 600<br></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Financial Incentives &amp; Scholarship Opportunities</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">To reward proactive enrollment and financial discipline, the university provides specific concessions:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Full-Payment Scholarship:</strong> A significant scholarship of <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"59\">₹10,000/-</strong> is awarded to students who settle the entire program fee in either a single transaction or two transactions.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Critical Condition:</em> This payment must be completed <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"51\">within 15 days</strong> of admission to qualify.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No-Cost EMI Options:</strong> To reduce the immediate financial burden, D.Y. Patil offers <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">No-Cost EMI</strong> facilities, allowing students to pay in manageable monthly installments without additional interest.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">Online Master of Computer Applications (MCA)</strong> at D.Y. Patil University (a legacy established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"99\">1983</strong>) is engineered to bridge the gap between academic theory and high-level software engineering. The curriculum is strategically divided into a <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"245\">Foundational Core (Year 1)</strong> that solidifies computer science fundamentals and a <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"324\">Specialization Phase (Year 2)</strong> designed for domain-specific mastery.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase I: Foundation Core (Year 1)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The first two semesters are common for all learners, ensuring that every candidate&mdash;regardless of their undergraduate background&mdash;attains a unified, high-level technical vocabulary.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: The Building Blocks of Computation</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Computer Organization and Architecture (OMCA 101):</strong> An in-depth exploration of hardware-software interfaces, CPU design, memory hierarchy, and I/O subsystems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Structure Using C (OMCA 102):</strong> Mastery of efficient data organization, focusing on linked lists, stacks, queues, trees, and graphs, implemented in the robust C language.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Object-Oriented Programming Using C++ (OMCA 103):</strong> Introduction to the OOP paradigm, covering encapsulation, inheritance, polymorphism, and abstraction.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Discrete Mathematics and Combinatorics (OMCA 104):</strong> The mathematical backbone of computer science, including logic, set theory, graph theory, and algorithmic complexity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lab - OOPS using C++ (OMCA 105):</strong> Practical application of Semester 1 concepts through intensive coding sessions and project-based learning.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Communication (OMCA 106):</strong> Equipping tech leaders with the ability to draft technical reports, lead executive meetings, and manage global stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Modern Software Engineering &amp; Web Systems</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Database Management System (OMCA 201):</strong> Comprehensive study of relational databases, SQL mastery, normalization, and transaction management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Full Stack Web Development (OMCA 202):</strong> Training in end-to-end web architecture, from front-end UI/UX to back-end server logic and database integration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Software Engineering (OMCA 203):</strong> Exploration of the Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC), Agile methodologies, and quality assurance protocols.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Communication and Computer Networks (OMCA 204):</strong> Detailed analysis of the OSI model, TCP/IP protocols, network security, and wireless communication.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lab - DBMS (OMCA 205) &amp; Lab - Full Stack (OMCA 206):</strong> Hands-on technical labs where students build and deploy scalable database-driven web applications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase II: Specialized Vertical Mastery (Year 2)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">In the second year, the Online MCA branches into five high-demand technical verticals. Each specialization is integrated with a <strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"128\">Core Java + Python Analytics Lab</strong> to ensure cross-platform proficiency.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Available Specializations (Semester III &amp; IV)</strong></h4>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Artificial Intelligence &amp; ML:</strong> Focuses on neural networks, deep learning, and predictive modeling using Python.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Blockchain Technology:</strong> Deep-dives into decentralized ledgers, smart contracts, and cryptography.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Analytics:</strong> Leveraging big data to drive corporate decision-making through statistical modeling.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Marketing:</strong> Exploring the technical side of growth hacking, SEO algorithms, and data-driven marketing stacks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">FinTech:</strong> Analyzing the intersection of financial services and technology, including payment gateways and algorithmic trading.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 140000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(265, 70, '49437806-a611-4b43-be94-45dc030c12dc', '4562f6ef-0233-46a0-b1a3-4fa4ee4bb38c', 241, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 05:51:57', '2026-06-16 06:43:15', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">The enrollment protocol at D.Y. Patil University (a legacy brand established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">1983</strong>) is a sophisticated, three-stage journey. By leveraging AI-powered authentication, the university ensures a seamless and secure onboarding experience for global learners.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 01: Learner&rsquo;s Authentication &amp; Identity Setup</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">Before accessing the formal application, every candidate must establish a verified digital profile within the DPU ecosystem.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accessing the DPU Gateway:</strong> Candidates must visit the official <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">DPU Login Page</strong> to initiate their journey.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">DEB Unique ID Integration:</strong> As a UGC-DEB recognized institution, D.Y. Patil requires the entry of a <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"99\">DEB Unique ID</strong>. This ensures that your technical or management degree is synchronized with national regulatory databases.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Multi-Channel Verification:</strong> The system triggers a dual-layer security check:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mobile Verification:</strong> via a secure OTP.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Email Verification:</strong> to establish a primary channel for all future academic correspondence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital ID Upload:</strong> To finalize the authentication, students must upload their <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">e-Aadhaar</strong> or a valid government identification document.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 02: Comprehensive Admission Form &amp; Fee Submission</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Once authenticated, the candidate moves into the \"Active Application\" phase, where detailed profiling is required for eligibility auditing.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic &amp; Professional History:</strong> You must fill in exhaustive details regarding your <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"84\">educational background and employment history</strong>. (Note: MBA/MCA programs typically require a 50% aggregate for General and 45% for Reserved categories).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Biometric &amp; Signature Uploads:</strong> High-resolution uploads of your <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"63\">Passport-size Photo</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"87\">Digital Signature</strong> are mandatory. Adherence to technical dimensions is critical to avoid administrative delays.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Online Fee Payment:</strong> The integrated gateway allows for the secure processing of the initial semester fees.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Scholarship Tip:</em> Completing the full program fee payment within <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">15 days</strong> of confirmation qualifies the student for a <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"126\">₹10,000 scholarship</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Submission:</strong> A final review of the data is conducted before submitting the form to the university\'s administrative board.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 03: Administrative Audit &amp; Enrollment Confirmation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">The final stage involves a rigorous back-end verification process by the D.Y. Patil Admissions Office.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Verification:</strong> The university&rsquo;s verification team cross-references uploaded certificates with original data to mitigate admission <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"138\">risk</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Receipting:</strong> Once the payment is cleared, the system generates official <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">Fee Receipts</strong> for the student\'s records.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Access Granting:</strong> Successful candidates receive an <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Admission Confirmation Email</strong> and an <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">SMS containing login credentials</strong> for the AI-powered Learning Management System (LMS).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mandatory Documentation &amp; Technical Specifications</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">To ensure a \"First-Time-Right\" application, adhere to the following documentation standards:</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Required Documents Checklist</strong></h4>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Government ID:</strong> e-Aadhaar or Passport.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Visual Identity:</strong> Recent Passport-size color photograph.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Authorization:</strong> Digital scan of the student&rsquo;s signature.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Legal Name Change (if applicable):</strong> * <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">Female Candidates:</strong> Marriage Certificate.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Male Candidates:</strong> Gazette of India Notification.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technical Upload Guidelines</strong></h4>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>File Format</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Max File Size</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Photo &amp; Signature</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\">JPEG / JPG / PNG</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,2,0\">&lt; 600 KB</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,3,0\">320px X 240px</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Educational Docs</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,1,0\">JPEG / JPG / PNG</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,2,0\">1 MB</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2,3,0\">Standard A4 Scan</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">To maintain the academic prestige associated with the D.Y. Patil name (a legacy established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"95\">1983</strong>), the university enforces inclusive yet rigorous eligibility standards. These criteria ensure that every registered student possesses the foundational education required to navigate advanced professional modules.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Mandatory Educational Qualifications</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The university&rsquo;s online programs are designed for maximum accessibility, catering to both traditional students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree Holders:</strong> Applicants must hold a graduation degree from a university recognized by the <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"104\">University Grants Commission (UGC)</strong> or an equivalent global accrediting body.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Disciplinary Flexibility:</strong> True to the institution\'s commitment to cross-functional leadership, the program is open to graduates from <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"133\">any discipline</strong> (e.g., Commerce, Science, Arts, Engineering, or Management).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Diploma Holders:</strong> In a move to support technical and vocational education, the university explicitly recognizes <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">Diploma Holders</strong>. If you have completed a recognized professional diploma after your 10th or 12th grade, you are eligible to apply for the respective advancement programs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Academic Integrity &amp; Recognition Standards</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">To ensure your degree or diploma carries full legal weight for government jobs and international career progression, the following standards are verified during the registration phase:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recognized Universities:</strong> Your previous degree must have been awarded by a recognized State, Central, or Deemed University.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Equivalency Audits:</strong> For international applicants or those with professional certifications, the university performs an internal equivalency audit to ensure the prior qualification meets the foundational requirements of the DPU curriculum.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The DEB Unique ID Factor:</strong> For all online programs, your eligibility is synchronized with the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Distance Education Bureau (DEB)</strong> via a unique ID during the authentication phase. This mitigates the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"193\">risk</strong> of academic invalidation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Strategic Enrollment Checklist</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">Before initiating the AI-powered admission process, ensure you have the following verified components:</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Degree/Diploma Certificate:</strong> A high-resolution scan of your final passing certificate.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Consolidated Marksheets:</strong> Evidence of your aggregate performance across all years of study.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Identity Synchronization:</strong> Ensure the name on your academic documents matches your Government-issued ID (Aadhaar/Passport). If not, a Marriage Certificate or Gazette notification is required.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">D.Y. Patil University (a legacy established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"47\">1983</strong>) offers this intensive certificate program designed for rapid upskilling in the digital economy. The fee structure is globally competitive, ensuring that aspiring digital marketers can access premium academic resources.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"3\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Comprehensive Fee Structure</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The program follows a transparent, single-tier pricing model for the entire duration of the certification.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Student Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Scholarship Status</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Indian Civilian</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,0\">Not Applicable (NA)</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹ 28,000</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Students</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1,0\">Not Applicable (NA)</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">$ 625</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Value &amp; ROI of the Digital Marketing Certification</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">From a strategic standpoint, this certificate is engineered to provide immediate marketability. In an era where traditional marketing is being superseded by data-driven strategies, this program serves as a critical bridge to modern corporate roles.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Academic Pillars</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Algorithmic Mastery:</strong> Learners gain deep insights into Search Engine Optimization (SEO) and Search Engine Marketing (SEM), learning how to rank content on Page 1 of global search engines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data-Driven Decision Making:</strong> The curriculum focuses on web analytics, teaching students how to interpret consumer behavior data to optimize marketing spend.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Social Media Engineering:</strong> Beyond simple posting, the program covers advanced social media advertising, targeting, and retargeting strategies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Content Strategy:</strong> Developing high-authority content that aligns with the university\'s standards of professional excellence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<h4 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Introduction to Digital Marketing (DM-101)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">This foundational module provides a high-level overview of the digital landscape. It serves as the \"entry point\" for understanding how consumer behavior has shifted from offline to online channels.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Focus:</strong> Understanding the Digital Marketing Framework, 7Ps of digital marketing, and the integration of traditional and digital media.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Goal:</strong> To build a holistic view of how brands create value in a hyper-connected world.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Search Engine Optimization - SEO (DM-102)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">SEO is the backbone of organic digital growth. This module teaches students how to make content discoverable by global search engines like Google and Bing.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Focus:</strong> On-page optimization (keywords, meta-tags, header structures), Off-page optimization (backlinking strategies), and Technical SEO (site speed, mobile responsiveness, and sitemaps).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Goal:</strong> To master the art of ranking on \"Page 1\" without relying on paid advertising, ensuring long-term sustainable traffic.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Integrated Marketing Communication - IMC (DM-103)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">In a fragmented digital world, consistency is key. IMC focuses on ensuring that a brand&rsquo;s message remains unified across all platforms, from email and blogs to TV and outdoor ads.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Focus:</strong> Brand positioning, messaging hierarchy, and the \"Omnichannel\" approach. It explores how to align Public Relations (PR), Direct Marketing, and Sales Promotion.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Goal:</strong> To develop a \"One Voice\" strategy that prevents brand dilution and maximizes the impact of every marketing dollar spent.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. Social Media Marketing - SMM (DM-104)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">This module moves beyond casual social networking to professional brand management. It covers the technical side of the major platforms including Meta (Facebook/Instagram), LinkedIn, and X.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Focus:</strong> Paid Social (Ad-campaign management, targeting, and retargeting), organic community building, and influencer marketing strategies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Goal:</strong> To leverage social algorithms to drive high-intent traffic and foster deep consumer engagement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">5. Emerging Trends in Information Technology (DM-105)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">To mitigate the <strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">risk</strong> of technical obsolescence, this forward-looking module explores the technologies currently disrupting the marketing industry.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Focus:</strong> The impact of <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"26\">Artificial Intelligence (AI)</strong> and Machine Learning on consumer personalization, the role of Big Data in marketing analytics, and the emerging influence of the Metaverse and Blockchain in digital branding.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Goal:</strong> To prepare marketers for the \"future-state\" of the industry, ensuring they can lead AI-powered marketing initiatives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 28000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(266, 70, '49437806-a611-4b43-be94-45dc030c12dc', '4562f6ef-0233-46a0-b1a3-4fa4ee4bb38c', 242, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 06:09:15', '2026-06-16 06:43:36', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The admission protocol at D.Y. Patil University (a legacy established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"73\">1983</strong>) is a sophisticated, digital-first journey. Designed for global accessibility, the process ensures that every candidate is authenticated and verified according to the highest academic and regulatory standards.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 01: Learner&rsquo;s Authentication &amp; Digital Onboarding</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The journey begins with the establishment of your digital identity within the DPU ecosystem. This phase is critical for ensuring secure communication and regulatory compliance.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accessing the DPU Gateway:</strong> Candidates must navigate to the official <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\">DPU Login Page</strong>, the central hub for all student interactions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Profile Initiation:</strong> Enter your primary details to create a unique learner profile.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">DEB Unique ID Verification:</strong> As part of the UGC-DEB mandate, you must provide your <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">DEB Unique ID</strong>. This synchronizes your record with the national database for recognized online education.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Multi-Channel Authentication:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mobile Verification:</strong> A secure OTP (One-Time Password) is sent to your registered mobile number.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Email Verification:</strong> A confirmation link is sent to your inbox to establish a formal line of academic correspondence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Identity Upload:</strong> Candidates are required to upload a digital version of their <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">e-Aadhaar</strong> or equivalent government ID to finalize the authentication phase.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 02: Comprehensive Admission Form &amp; Documentation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Once authenticated, you enter the formal application stage. This step requires granular data entry to build your permanent academic and professional record.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Profiling:</strong> You must provide exhaustive information regarding your <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"75\">personal, educational, and employment history</strong>. This data is used to verify your eligibility (typically a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with 50% aggregate).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Biometric &amp; Signature Uploads:</strong> You must upload a high-resolution, passport-size <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">photograph</strong> and a digital scan of your <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">signature</strong>. These must adhere to the university&rsquo;s strict technical dimensions to avoid administrative rejection.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Online Fee Payment:</strong> The integrated gateway allows for the secure processing of program fees.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Scholarship Note:</em> Full-program payment within <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"56\">15 days</strong> of admission triggers a <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">₹10,000 scholarship</strong>, significantly improving your ROI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Submission:</strong> After a final review of the data for accuracy, the form is submitted for institutional audit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 03: Administrative Audit &amp; Confirmation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">The final phase is managed by the D.Y. Patil University Admissions Office, where your application undergoes a rigorous verification cycle.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Verification:</strong> The university team cross-references your uploaded marks and identity documents with the originals. Ensuring document clarity is vital to mitigate any admission <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"184\">risk</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Receipting:</strong> Upon successful verification and payment clearance, official <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"83\">Fee Receipts</strong> are generated and available for download.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Admission Confirmation:</strong> Successful candidates receive a formal <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"63\">Admission Confirmation Email</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Credentialing:</strong> You will receive an <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">SMS containing your unique login credentials</strong> for the AI-powered Learning Management System (LMS), granting you immediate access to your course modules.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mandatory Documentation &amp; Formatting Checklist</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">To ensure a \"First-Time-Right\" application, adhere to the following standards:</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Required Document</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Note</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Government ID</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0\">e-Aadhaar or Passport</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1,2,0\">Must be a valid, government-issued document</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Visual Identity</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,0\">Passport-size Photograph</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2,2,0\">Recent, <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"8\">Color</strong> photograph required</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Authorization</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0\">Student\'s Signature</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,3,2,0\">Clear scan on a plain white background</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Name Change (F)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,0\">Marriage Certificate</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,4,2,0\">Required if name differs from degree certificates</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Name Change (M)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,5,1,0\">Gazette of India Notification</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"19,5,2,0\">Required for any formal legal name transition</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technical Upload Specifications</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">File Formats:</strong> JPEG / JPG / PNG</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dimensions:</strong> 320px X 240px</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Photo &amp; Signature Size:</strong> Must be <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">less than 600 KB</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Educational Documents:</strong> Must be <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"31\">less than 1 MB</strong> per document</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">To maintain the academic prestige associated with the D.Y. Patil name (a legacy established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"95\">1983</strong>), the university enforces inclusive yet rigorous eligibility standards. These criteria ensure that every registered student possesses the foundational education required to navigate advanced professional modules and secure high-impact placement opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Mandatory Educational Qualifications</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The university&rsquo;s online programs are designed for maximum accessibility, catering to both traditional students and working professionals looking to transition into leadership roles.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree Holders:</strong> Applicants must hold a graduation degree from a university recognized by the <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"104\">University Grants Commission (UGC)</strong> or an equivalent global accrediting body.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Disciplinary Flexibility:</strong> True to the institution\'s commitment to cross-functional leadership, the program is open to graduates from <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"133\">any discipline</strong>. Whether your background is in Commerce, Science, Arts, Engineering, or Management, you are eligible to pivot into specialized management tracks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Diploma Holders:</strong> In a move to support technical and vocational education, the university explicitly recognizes <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">Diploma Holders</strong>. If you have completed a recognized professional diploma after your 10th or 12th grade, you are eligible to apply for the respective advancement programs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Academic Integrity &amp; Recognition Standards</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">To ensure your degree or diploma carries full legal weight for government jobs and international career progression, the following standards are verified during the <strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"165\">Step 03: Document Verification</strong> phase:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recognized Universities:</strong> Your previous degree must have been awarded by a recognized State, Central, or Deemed University.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Equivalency Audits:</strong> For international applicants or those with unique professional certifications, the university performs an internal equivalency audit to ensure the prior qualification meets the foundational requirements of the DPU curriculum.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The DEB Unique ID Factor:</strong> For all online programs, your eligibility is synchronized with the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Distance Education Bureau (DEB)</strong> via a unique ID. This mitigates the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"161\">risk</strong> of academic invalidation and ensures global degree portability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Strategic Enrollment Checklist</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">Before initiating the AI-powered admission process, ensure you have the following verified components ready:</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Degree/Diploma Certificate:</strong> A high-resolution scan of your final passing certificate.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Consolidated Marksheets:</strong> Evidence of your aggregate performance (typically a 50% benchmark is preferred for premium programs).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Identity Synchronization:</strong> Ensure the name on your academic documents matches your Government-issued ID (Aadhaar/Passport). If there is a discrepancy, a Marriage Certificate or Gazette notification is required.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The university&rsquo;s flagship postgraduate programs follow a consistent semester-wise payment plan. This model allows students to manage their investment across the four-semester duration of the program.<br><br></p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Student Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 1</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 2</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 3</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester 4</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Indian Civilian</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹ 1,40,000/-</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,2,0\">₹ 40,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,3,0\">₹ 40,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,4,0\">₹ 30,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,5,0\">₹ 30,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Students</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">US$ 2,700</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,2,0\">US$ 750</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,3,0\">US$ 750</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,4,0\">US$ 600</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,5,0\">US$ 600</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Financial Incentives &amp; Scholarship Policy</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">To maximize the Return on Investment (ROI) for its learners, the university offers specific financial provisions:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Full-Payment Scholarship:</strong> Indian students who complete their total program fee payment (either in a single transaction or two transactions) within <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"151\">15 days</strong> of admission are granted a scholarship of <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"201\">₹ 10,000/-</strong>. This reduces the effective total fee for an Indian Civilian to <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"276\">₹ 1,30,000/-</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Flexible Payment Solutions:</strong> For candidates who prefer to distribute their costs, the university provides <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"105\">No-Cost EMI</strong> facilities. This allows for the smooth payment of Semester 1&ndash;4 fees without the burden of accruing interest.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a2b0d2c92db57e6e-682\" data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1570\">Legacy Value:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1570\"> Your investment is backed by a 40-year academic legacy (est. 1983), ensuring that the degree or certificate carries high authority in the professional job market</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1570 citation-end-1570\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The HAHM curriculum at D.Y. Patil University (a legacy established in <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"70\">1983</strong>) is strategically designed to bridge the gap between clinical excellence and administrative efficiency. The program focuses on the \"Business of Care,\" ensuring that healthcare leaders can manage complex hospital ecosystems while maintaining high standards of patient safety.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Hospital Administration (HAHM-101)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">This core module serves as the foundational pillar for healthcare leadership. It shifts the focus from individual patient care to the macroscopic management of the entire facility.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Focus:</strong> Organizational structure of hospitals, department coordination, resource allocation, and front-office management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Goal:</strong> To master the operational workflow of a hospital, ensuring seamless integration between clinical and non-clinical departments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Marketing of Health Care Services (HAHM-102)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">In an increasingly competitive healthcare market, branding and patient acquisition are critical. This module applies modern marketing principles to the unique sensitivities of the medical field.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Focus:</strong> Healthcare service differentiation, patient relationship management (PRM), hospital branding, and digital outreach for medical services.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Goal:</strong> To build a high-authority brand presence that communicates trust and clinical expertise to the community.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Indoor and Outdoor Hospital Services (HAHM-103)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">A deep-dive into the \"Patient Journey,\" this module analyzes the management of both Out-Patient Departments (OPD) and In-Patient Departments (IPD).</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Focus:</strong> Admissions and discharge protocols, ward management, operation theater (OT) scheduling, emergency services, and pharmacy logistics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Goal:</strong> To optimize facility utilization and reduce patient wait times, directly impacting the overall \"Patient Experience\" score.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. Quality Management in HealthCare Services (HAHM-104)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">Quality is non-negotiable in healthcare. This module focuses on the frameworks required to achieve national and international accreditation (such as NABH and JCI).</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Focus:</strong> Total Quality Management (TQM), patient safety protocols, infection control, medical auditing, and Six Sigma applications in healthcare.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Goal:</strong> To eliminate clinical errors and establish a culture of continuous improvement, mitigating the <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">risk</strong> of medical negligence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">5. Legal Aspects of Hospital and Health Management (HAHM-105)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">Healthcare is one of the most heavily regulated industries. This module ensures that administrators are equipped to navigate the complex legal landscape of medical practice.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Focus:</strong> Medico-legal cases (MLC), the Consumer Protection Act as applied to hospitals, labor laws for healthcare staff, and ethical considerations in patient confidentiality.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Goal:</strong> To ensure the institution remains 100% compliant with state and central healthcare regulations, protecting the facility from legal liabilities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 140000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(267, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 243, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-04 07:17:06', '2026-06-16 06:51:04', '<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">Navigating the admission landscape of a premier <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">NAAC A++ accredited</strong> institution like JAIN (Deemed-to-be University) requires a strategic understanding of the enrollment lifecycle. From the initial foundation in 1990 to its current status as a global education hub, JAIN University has streamlined its onboarding to ensure students can transition seamlessly from applicants to scholars. Below is an exhaustive, SEO-optimized breakdown of the four-step admission journey, including critical insights into financial planning and risk mitigation.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"2\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Strategic 4-Step Admission Roadmap</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The university employs a high-authority, digital-first approach to admissions, designed to be transparent and user-centric.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1: Application Submission &amp; Profile Creation</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The journey begins with the digital submission of your academic and personal profile.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8d8520a597637346-956\" data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2360\">Action</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2360\">: Complete the online application form by providing comprehensive details regarding your educational background and the specific program of interest</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2360 citation-end-2360\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategy</strong>: Ensure all data matches your official transcripts exactly to avoid the \"Verification Trap,\" where discrepancies can lead to significant processing delays or application rejection.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2: Program Selection &amp; Enrollment Verification</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Once the initial profile is reviewed, the university moves into the formal enrollment phase.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8d8520a597637346-957\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2359\">Action</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2359\">: Select your preferred specialization&mdash;such as high-ROI tracks like FinTech or Business Analytics&mdash;and verify your enrollment details</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2359 citation-end-2359\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8d8520a597637346-958\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2358\">Insight</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2358\">: This is the stage where students must confirm they meet the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"69\"><span class=\"citation-2358\">50% aggregate eligibility</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2358\"> (45% for SC/ST) to avoid provisional status complications</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2358 citation-end-2358\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3: Strategic Payment &amp; Financial Planning</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">JAIN University offers diverse liquidity options to cater to a global student base.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8d8520a597637346-959\" data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2357\">One-Time Payment</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2357\">: Choosing to pay the full program fee upfront allows students to avail of a </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\"><span class=\"citation-2357\">15% discount</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2357\">, significantly improving the program\'s overall Return on Investment (ROI)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2357 citation-end-2357\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8d8520a597637346-960\" data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2356\">Education Loan / EMI</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2356\">: For those preferring to manage cash flow, the university facilitates financing through </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\"><span class=\"citation-2356\">0% interest monthly installments</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2356\">, lowering the barrier to entry for premium postgraduate education</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2356 citation-end-2356\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4: Seat Securing &amp; Final Confirmation</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The final phase solidifies your place within the academic cohort.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_8d8520a597637346-961\" data-path-to-node=\"16,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"16,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2355\">Action</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2355\">: Admission is formally confirmed once the payment is processed or financing is approved, at which point your seat is officially secured</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"16,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2355 citation-end-2355\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"16,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Risk Mitigation</strong>: Delaying payment until the final window is a common mistake; seats in high-demand specializations are often filled on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p id=\"p-rc_d79135b638dfd2ad-883\" data-path-to-node=\"2\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1\"><span class=\"citation-2177\">JAIN (Deemed-to-be University) maintains a high-authority academic standard, requiring a robust foundation for all postgraduate applicants</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2\"><span class=\"citation-2177 citation-end-2177\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,5\"><span class=\"citation-2176\">The university\'s eligibility framework is designed to ensure that incoming students possess the necessary research capabilities and professional discipline to succeed in a multi-disciplinary environment</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,6\"><span class=\"citation-2176 citation-end-2176\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Postgraduate Eligibility Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">To secure admission into a Master&rsquo;s program at JAIN University, candidates must adhere to the following strictly defined criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_d79135b638dfd2ad-884\" data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2175\">Undergraduate Degree Foundation</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2175\">: Applicants must have successfully completed an Undergraduate (Bachelor) Program from a university recognized by the University Grants Commission (UGC)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2175 citation-end-2175\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-2174\">The degree must have a minimum duration of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,4\" data-index-in-node=\"43\"><span class=\"citation-2174\">three (3) years</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-2174 citation-end-2174\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,6\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,8\"><span class=\"citation-2173\">This ensures that the candidate has undergone the standard academic rigor required for advanced specialization</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,9\"><span class=\"citation-2173 citation-end-2173\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,10\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_d79135b638dfd2ad-885\" data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2172\">Minimum Academic Performance</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2172\">: A competitive benchmark is set at a </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"66\"><span class=\"citation-2172\">minimum aggregate of 50%</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2172 citation-end-2172\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-2171\">This percentage (or an equivalent letter/numerical grade) serves as a primary filter to maintain the university\'s NAAC A++ academic integrity</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-2171 citation-end-2171\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_d79135b638dfd2ad-886\" data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2170\">Social Equity Relaxations</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2170\">: In alignment with inclusive education policies, JAIN University provides a </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"102\"><span class=\"citation-2170\">5% relaxation</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2170\"> in the minimum aggregate for candidates belonging to </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"169\"><span class=\"citation-2170\">SC/ST categories</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2170 citation-end-2170\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-2169\">Consequently, these candidates are eligible to apply with a minimum aggregate of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,4\" data-index-in-node=\"81\"><span class=\"citation-2169\">45%</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-2169 citation-end-2169\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_d79135b638dfd2ad-887\" data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2168\">Final Year Provision (Appearing Candidates)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2168\">: Recognizing the academic cycle, the university allows students currently in their </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"127\"><span class=\"citation-2168\">final semester</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2168\"> of a Bachelor&rsquo;s Program to apply</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2168 citation-end-2168\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-2167\">This \"appearing\" status facilitates a direct transition into postgraduate studies without a gap year, provided the student eventually meets the 50% aggregate requirement upon the declaration of their final results</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-2167 citation-end-2167\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Insights for Applicants</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_d79135b638dfd2ad-888\" data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2166\">Decision-Making &amp; Strategy</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2166\">: Prospective students should ensure their undergraduate stream aligns with their desired postgraduate specialization</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2166 citation-end-2166\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-2165\">A common mistake is failing to verify if their specific degree duration meets the mandatory 3-year UGC requirement before applying</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-2165 citation-end-2165\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_d79135b638dfd2ad-889\" data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2164\">Topical Risk Assessment</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2164\">: Candidates applying in their final semester should be aware of the risk involved; admission remains provisional and is subject to the successful completion of their current degree with the required marks</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2164 citation-end-2164\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-2163\">Failure to meet the 50% (or 45% for SC/ST) threshold will result in the cancellation of the provisional seat</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-2163 citation-end-2163\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,6\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-919\" data-path-to-node=\"1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2306\">Navigating the financial landscape of higher education requires more than just knowing the base cost; it demands a comprehensive understanding of payment flexibility, administrative overheads, and long-term value</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,2\"><span class=\"citation-2306 citation-end-2306\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2305\">JAIN (Deemed-to-be University)</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2305\">, a premier </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,5\" data-index-in-node=\"42\"><span class=\"citation-2305\">NAAC A++ accredited</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2305\"> institution, offers a structured MBA fee model designed to align with both domestic and international financial planning standards while maximizing student </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,5\" data-index-in-node=\"218\"><span class=\"citation-2305\">Return on Investment (ROI)</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,6\"><span class=\"citation-2305 citation-end-2305\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"2\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Comprehensive Breakdown of MBA Tuition Fees</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-920\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-2304\">The university provides multiple avenues for fee remittance, ensuring that the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,1\" data-index-in-node=\"79\"><span class=\"citation-2304\">total program investment of ₹175,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2304\"> remains accessible through diverse liquidity options</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-2304 citation-end-2304\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-2303\">This high-authority fee structure is inclusive of the core academic framework and industry-integrated training modules</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-2303 citation-end-2303\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Schedule</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Amount</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Strategic Financial Context</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Payment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹175,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-2302\">Ideal for students looking to settle all financial obligations upfront to avoid future administrative processing</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,2,0,3\">.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Yearly Installment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹87,500</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,2,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-2301\">A balanced approach that breaks the total cost into two annual payments</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,2,0,3\">.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semesterly Installment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹43,750</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,3,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-2300\">The most flexible standard plan, dividing the cost into four manageable payments over two years</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,2,0,3\">.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-921\" data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2299\">Financial Flexibility:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2299\"> To further lower the barrier to entry, the university facilitates </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"89\"><span class=\"citation-2299\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) options</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2299\">, allowing students to distribute the program\'s cost over a more granular timeline</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2299 citation-end-2299\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Administrative and Mandatory Fees</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-922\" data-path-to-node=\"9\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0\">Beyond core tuition, mandatory one-time and recurring fees are categorized by the student\'s residency status. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2\"><span class=\"citation-2298\">These fees cover critical academic infrastructure, including global registration and annual examination processing</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3\"><span class=\"citation-2298 citation-end-2298\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Domestic Candidates (India)</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-923\" data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2297\">One-Time Registration:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2297\"> ₹2,500 (Initial admission processing)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2297 citation-end-2297\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-924\" data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2296\">Annual Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2296\"> ₹3,000 (Required for every academic year)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2296 citation-end-2296\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. SAARC Region Candidates</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-925\" data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2295\">Registration Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2295\"> ₹11,250 (One-time administrative setup)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2295 citation-end-2295\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-926\" data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2294\">Annual Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2294\"> ₹3,750 (Recurring yearly cost)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2294 citation-end-2294\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. International Candidates</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-927\" data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2293\">Registration Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2293\"> $150 (One-time global enrollment)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2293 citation-end-2293\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-928\" data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2292\">Annual Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2292\"> $50 (Recurring yearly cost)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2292 citation-end-2292\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Decision-Making: Risks, Strategy, and Hidden Costs</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-929\" data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-2291\">Topical Risk Assessment (Hidden Costs):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2291\"> While the base fee is locked at ₹175,000, students should strategically budget for </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"123\"><span class=\"citation-2291\">elective international study tours</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2291\"> or specialized </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"173\"><span class=\"citation-2291\">global certifications</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2291\"> (such as ACCA or CMA) which may carry independent assessment and material fees</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-2291 citation-end-2291\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-930\" data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Maximizing ROI Strategy:</strong> To ensure the highest return, students should align their investment with high-demand specializations like <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"132\">FinTech or Business Analytics</strong>. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-2290\">These tracks often command higher starting salaries that justify the upfront educational expenditure more rapidly</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-2290 citation-end-2290\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41945df3239af505-931\" data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Late Fee Trap:</strong> A critical mistake for many students is missing the tight windows for semesterly or examination fee payments. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-2289\">This can lead to penalties or temporary suspension of access to vital university portals and learning management systems</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-2289 citation-end-2289\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0,4\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">JAIN (Deemed-to-be University), a premier <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">NAAC A++ accredited</strong> institution, offers a meticulously designed MBA curriculum that integrates core management principles with cutting-edge technical skills. The program is structured into four distinct semesters, each focusing on a specific layer of professional development&mdash;from foundational theories to advanced strategic execution and digital mastery.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"2\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Semester-Wise Curriculum Breakdown</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">The curriculum is built around the \"Corporate Excellence\" model, ensuring that every course is paired with practical skill attainment and global industry certifications.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Building the Core Pillars</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The first semester focuses on establishing a robust managerial foundation, blending traditional economics with modern AI requirements.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Courses</strong>: Business Economics, Sustainability &amp; Ethics, Financial Reporting &amp; Corporate Finance, Organizational Behavior and HR Management, Quantitative Techniques, and AI Skills for Future.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition</strong>: Students develop <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"36\">18 critical skills</strong>, including Financial Modelling, ESG Analysis, Ethical Leadership, and LLM Fundamentals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Certifications</strong>: 9 LinkedIn Learning certifications focusing on essential soft skills like Negotiation Foundations, Business Writing, and Developing Executive Presence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Operational Excellence &amp; Entrepreneurship</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">This phase shifts the focus toward the functional mechanics of business and the innovative mindset required for market leadership.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Courses</strong>: Entrepreneurship, Marketing Management, Operations Research, Business Law &amp; Corporate Governance, and Business Analytics &amp; AI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition</strong>: Focuses on <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">11 technical skills</strong>, including Market Segmentation, Linear Programming, Project Scheduling, and Entrepreneurial Strategy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Certifications</strong>: 14 high-impact certifications such as Cloud Computing for Digital Business, Agile Business Analysis, and Advanced Tableau.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Advanced Analytical Tools &amp; Taxation</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">In the third semester, students dive deep into specialized analytical frameworks and the complexities of the financial landscape.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Courses</strong>: Business Research Methods, Operations Management, Direct and Indirect Taxes, Investment Analysis, Consumer Behavior, and Market Research Tools.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition</strong>: Mastery of <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">16 analytical skills</strong>, including Portfolio Management, Investment Advisory, Competitive Intelligence, and Customer Relationship Management (CRM).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Certifications</strong>: 8 finance-centric certifications, including Business Valuation, Fintech Introduction, and ESG for Corporate Finance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Strategic Mastery &amp; Digital Transformation</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The final semester prepares graduates for top-tier leadership roles by focusing on high-level strategy and the digital marketing ecosystem.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Courses</strong>: Strategic Management, Indian Financial System, Risk Management &amp; Behavioural Finance, Retail Marketing, and Digital Marketing &amp; Brand Management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition</strong>: Development of <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"34\">16 leadership skills</strong>, including SEO/SEM, Performance Marketing, Financial Risk Management, and SEBI Regulations &amp; Compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Certifications</strong>: 11 final certifications, including Google Ads Essential Training, Content Marketing, and Banking Basics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 175000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(268, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 225, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 00:13:10', '2026-06-16 06:52:11', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Securing a seat in a premier institution like JAIN (Deemed-to-be University) is a structured, student-centric process designed to be entirely digital and hassle-free. As a NAAC A++ accredited institution, JAIN University ensures that the transition from applicant to student is seamless, transparent, and financially flexible.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Below is a detailed, explanatory breakdown of the four-step enrollment framework to help you navigate your admission with confidence.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Step 1: Digital Application &amp; Profile Creation</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The journey begins with the <strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">Online Application</strong>. This is more than just a form; it is your professional introduction to the university.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Personal &amp; Educational Details:</strong> You will be required to input your academic history (10th, 12th, and Graduation scores). Ensure these match your official certificates to avoid verification delays.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Selection:</strong> At this stage, you choose your specific MBA specialization (e.g., Business Analytics, FinTech, or HRM).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Expert Guidance:</strong> Once you submit the initial form, a dedicated admissions counselor often reaches out to assist with document formatting and specialization queries.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Step 2: Program Enrollment &amp; Verification</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">After your application is reviewed, you move into the <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">Formal Enrollment</strong> phase. This is the \"Verification Gateway.\"</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Upload:</strong> You must provide scanned copies of your degree certificates, mark sheets, and a valid Government ID (Aadhaar/Passport).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Validation:</strong> The university&rsquo;s administrative team verifies your eligibility (minimum 50% aggregate for General, 45% for SC/ST).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detail Confirmation:</strong> You will review your chosen elective and program duration to ensure every detail is aligned with your career goals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Step 3: Strategic Financial Settlement</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">JAIN University offers two primary financial pathways, allowing you to choose the one that best suits your liquidity and financial strategy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Option A: The \"One-Time Payment\" Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">If you have the capital available, paying the full program fee upfront is the most cost-effective strategy.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The 15% Incentive:</strong> By settling the fee in one go, you receive a <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">15% discount</strong> on the total tuition.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Focus:</strong> This removes the administrative burden of tracking semester deadlines, allowing you to focus purely on your learning and certifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\">Option B: Education Loan / 0% Interest EMI</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">For students who prefer to preserve their savings or manage monthly cash flow, the university facilitates specialized financing.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">0% Interest:</strong> Through partners like Liquiloan, you can break down the cost into monthly installments without paying a single rupee in interest.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Manageable Tiers:</strong> With EMI options, the premium education of JAIN University becomes as affordable as a monthly subscription, spreading the cost over 16 to 24 months.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"19\">Step 4: Final Confirmation &amp; Seat Security</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">The final step is the transition from \"Applicant\" to \"Enrolled Student.\"</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Seat Allocation:</strong> Once the payment is processed or the financing is approved, your seat in the cohort is officially locked.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Access:</strong> Upon confirmation, you receive your credentials for the <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong>. This gives you immediate access to pre-recorded lectures, LinkedIn Learning tracks, and the digital library.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Official Welcome:</strong> You will receive a formal Admission Letter via email, marking the start of your MBA transformation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">The first step toward securing a seat in one of India&rsquo;s most prestigious management programs is understanding the academic benchmarks. JAIN (Deemed-to-be University), a NAAC <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"A++\" data-index-in-node=\"174\">$A++$</span> accredited institution, maintains a merit-driven admission policy designed to identify high-potential candidates from diverse academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">This guide provides a deep-dive into the formal eligibility requirements, relaxation policies for inclusive education, and strategic advice for final-year applicants.</p>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">1. Core Academic Foundations: The 3-Year Benchmark</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">To ensure that all students possess the foundational critical thinking and analytical skills required for high-level management, JAIN University mandates specific undergraduate qualifications:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Undergraduate Degree:</strong> Applicants must have successfully completed a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree from a university recognized by the University Grants Commission (<strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"152\">UGC</strong>).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Minimum Duration:</strong> The program must have a minimum duration of <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">three (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"69\">$3$</span>) years</strong>. This ensures that the candidate has undergone comprehensive academic rigor across standard semesters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stream Neutrality:</strong> One of the key strengths of the JAIN MBA is its inclusivity. Candidates from <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"96\">any stream</strong>&mdash;be it Commerce, Science, Arts, Engineering, or Law&mdash;are eligible to apply, fostering a multi-disciplinary learning environment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"7\">2. The Aggregate Threshold: Defining Academic Merit</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">JAIN University uses aggregate percentages as a primary filter to maintain academic excellence within its cohorts.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">General Category:</strong> Candidates are required to have secured a minimum of <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"71\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"50\\%\" data-index-in-node=\"71\">$50\\%$</span> aggregate</strong> in their undergraduate studies. This includes the total marks/grades obtained across all semesters or years of the degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Numerical/Letter Grades:</strong> For universities that use CGPA or letter grades, the university applies a standard conversion formula to ensure the candidate meets the equivalent of the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"50\\%\" data-index-in-node=\"179\">$50\\%$</span> benchmark.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Inclusivity and Relaxations (SC/ST Candidates)</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">As part of its commitment to social equity and diverse representation in leadership, JAIN University provides a <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"112\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"5\\%\" data-index-in-node=\"112\">$5\\%$</span> relaxation</strong> in the minimum aggregate score for candidates belonging to the Scheduled Caste (<strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"207\">SC</strong>) and Scheduled Tribe (<strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"232\">ST</strong>) categories.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Revised Requirement:</strong> SC/ST candidates are eligible to apply with a minimum aggregate of <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"88\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"45\\%\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">$45\\%$</span></strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"13\">3. Provision for Final-Year Students (Early-Mover Advantage)</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">One of the most student-centric policies at JAIN University is the eligibility for appearing candidates.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Semester Eligibility:</strong> If you are currently in your <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"57\">final semester</strong> or final year of your Bachelor&rsquo;s program, you are fully eligible to apply and participate in the selection process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Provisional Admission:</strong> Successful candidates in this category are granted provisional admission. They are required to submit their final mark sheets and degree certificates once their results are declared to confirm their enrollment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Advantage:</strong> This allows students to secure their MBA seat months before their graduation, ensuring a seamless transition from undergraduate to postgraduate studies without a \"gap year.\"</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"16\">4. Strategic Insights: Maximizing Your Application Success</h2>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Avoiding Common Mistakes</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Backlog\" Risk:</strong> While final-year students can apply, the eligibility criteria require a \"Pass\" in the program. Having active backlogs at the time of final document verification can lead to the cancellation of provisional admission. It is critical to clear all papers before the MBA session begins.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Aggregate Calculation Error:</strong> Many students calculate their percentage based only on \"core\" subjects. However, JAIN University typically looks at the <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"149\">total aggregate</strong>, including languages and electives. Ensure your calculation is comprehensive to avoid surprises during document verification.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p id=\"p-rc_946316086128580c-89\" data-path-to-node=\"2\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1\"><span class=\"citation-183\">Navigating the financial commitment of a postgraduate degree is a pivotal step in professional career planning</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2\"><span class=\"citation-183 citation-end-183\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,5\"><span class=\"citation-182\">JAIN (Deemed-to-be University), a premier NAAC A++ accredited institution, provides a transparent and highly competitive fee model for its Master of Business Administration (MBA) program</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,6\"><span class=\"citation-182 citation-end-182\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,7\">. This guide provides an exhaustive deep-dive into the core tuition costs, the strategic logic behind their flexible payment schedules, and a detailed explanation of the EMI facilities available to students.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"3\">Comprehensive Breakdown of MBA Tuition Fees</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_946316086128580c-90\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-181\">The core tuition investment for the MBA program is fixed at </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,1\" data-index-in-node=\"60\"><span class=\"citation-181\">₹160,000</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-181 citation-end-181\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-180\">This fee is designed to be inclusive of the high-authority academic framework and industry-integrated training modules that define the JAIN curriculum</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-180 citation-end-180\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Schedule</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Amount</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Strategic Financial Context</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Payment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹160,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-179\">Ideal for students looking to settle all financial obligations upfront to avoid recurring administrative cycles</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,2,0,3\">.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Yearly Installment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹80,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,2,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-178\">A balanced approach that divides the total cost into two equal annual payments</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,2,0,3\">.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semesterly Installment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,3,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-177\">The most granular standard plan, breaking the cost into four manageable payments over two years</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,2,0,3\">.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Deep-Dive: Payment Flexibility and Liquidity Options</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_946316086128580c-91\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1\"><span class=\"citation-176\">JAIN University employs a \"Student-First\" financial strategy, recognizing that upfront costs can often be a barrier to premium education</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2\"><span class=\"citation-176 citation-end-176\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3\">. The flexibility offered is not merely administrative but is a strategic tool for students to manage their personal or family cash flow.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\">1. The Power of Choice: Remittance Frameworks</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_946316086128580c-92\" data-path-to-node=\"9\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1\"><span class=\"citation-175\">The university allows students to switch between payment modes based on their evolving financial situation</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2\"><span class=\"citation-175 citation-end-175\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_946316086128580c-93\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-174\">One-Time Settlement:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-174\"> By choosing the one-time payment of ₹160,000, students minimize the risk of missing future payment windows and simplify their focus toward academics</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-174 citation-end-174\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_946316086128580c-94\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-173\">Installment Logic:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-173\"> The yearly and semesterly options are designed to align with the typical Indian corporate and agricultural income cycles, ensuring that students do not have to rely on high-interest personal loans to cover tuition</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-173 citation-end-173\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\">2. EMI Options and Education Financing</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_946316086128580c-95\" data-path-to-node=\"12\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1\"><span class=\"citation-172\">To further lower the barrier to entry, the university facilitates specialized </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1\" data-index-in-node=\"78\"><span class=\"citation-172\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) options</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2\"><span class=\"citation-172 citation-end-172\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_946316086128580c-96\" data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-171\">0% Interest Philosophy:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-171\"> Many of the facilitated financing plans offer </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"70\"><span class=\"citation-171\">0% interest monthly installments</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-171 citation-end-171\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-170\">This means students can distribute the program\'s ₹160,000 cost over a granular timeline without the burden of heavy interest accrual that usually accompanies bank loans</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-170 citation-end-170\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-169\">Financial Aid Integration:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-169\"> This strategic financial aid ensures that merit-driven students can secure their seats regardless of immediate liquidity or cash flow constraints</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-169 citation-end-169\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,2\">.<br><br><br></span></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">In the landscape of global management education, JAIN (Deemed-to-be University) stands out not only for its <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"108\">NAAC A++ accreditation</strong> but also for its transparent and geographically tailored financial structure. While the core tuition fee for the MBA program is <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"259\">₹160,000</strong>, it is essential for prospective leaders to understand the ancillary costs and global fee variations that ensure a smooth academic journey.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">This guide provides a detailed explanation of the additional fees and payment flexibility for students across three distinct geographic categories: India, SAARC nations, and International regions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">1. Geographic Fee Customization: A Detailed Breakdown</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">JAIN University follows a structured \"Global Access\" pricing model. This ensures that administrative and examination services are aligned with the regulatory and logistical requirements of the student\'s home region.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Student Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>One-Time Registration Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Annual Examination Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Total Ancillary (2 Years)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">India</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\">₹2,500</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,2,0\">₹3,000</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹8,500</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">SAARC Countries</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\">₹11,250</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,2,0\">₹3,750</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹18,750</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\">$150</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,0\">$50</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">$250</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_946316086128580c-97\" data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1\"></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">In an era defined by rapid technological disruption, the value of an MBA is measured by the agility of its curriculum. JAIN (Deemed-to-be University) has engineered its MBA program to be a powerhouse of \"Future-Ready\" skills. By integrating core academic rigor with <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"266\">AI competencies</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"286\">LinkedIn Learning certifications</strong>, the university ensures that every graduate is not just a degree-holder, but a high-authority specialist.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Below is a detailed, explanatory roadmap of the four-semester journey that transforms ambitious learners into global business leaders.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Semester 1: Foundations of Management &amp; AI Literacy</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The first semester is designed to build a robust foundation in traditional management while immediately introducing the \"future of work\" through AI.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (6):</strong> You start with the essentials like <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">Business Economics</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">Financial Reporting</strong>. However, the inclusion of <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"123\">AI Skills for Future</strong> in the first semester is a strategic differentiator, ensuring you understand automation from day one.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (18 Skills):</strong> You will master <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"47\">Financial Modelling</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\">ESG Analysis</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">LLM (Large Language Model) Fundamentals</strong>. This blend ensures you can read a balance sheet while understanding the capabilities of generative AI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn Learning (9 Certifications):</strong> Beyond the classroom, you will earn certifications in <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"92\">Negotiation Foundations</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"120\">AI Literacy</strong>, building a digital portfolio that proves your soft skills and tech-savviness.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Semester 2: Strategic Scaling &amp; Digital Transformation</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Semester 2 shifts the focus from foundational knowledge to operational execution and the legal framework of business.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (5):</strong> This semester introduces <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">Entrepreneurship</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">Marketing Management</strong>. A standout course here is <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"112\">Business Analytics and Artificial Intelligence</strong>, where data becomes a decision-making tool.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (11 Skills):</strong> You will dive deep into <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"55\">Market Segmentation</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">Linear Programming</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"100\">Product Lifecycle Pricing</strong>. These are the \"hard skills\" required to launch products and optimize supply chains.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn Learning (14 Certifications):</strong> This is a heavy certification phase covering <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"84\">Digital Transformation</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"108\">Cloud Computing</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">Agile Business Analysis</strong>. These certifications signal to employers that you understand modern project management methodologies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Semester 3: Human Capital &amp; Specialized Operations</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">The third semester is where leadership and people management take center stage, complemented by an <strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"99\">Open Elective</strong> that allows for personal customization.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (7):</strong> Focus areas include <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"38\">Talent Acquisition</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">Industrial Relations</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"84\">Labor Laws</strong>. This is critical for anyone aiming for HR leadership or operational management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (17 Skills):</strong> You will master the \"human\" side of business, including <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"87\">Conflict Resolution</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"108\">Grievance Management</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"134\">Competency-Based Interviewing</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn Learning (10 Certifications):</strong> Certifications like <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"59\">Employer Branding</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">Applied AI for Human Resources</strong> ensure you are equipped to manage the workforce of the 2030s.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Semester 4: Global Strategy &amp; Master Project</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The final semester is the \"Synthesis Phase,\" where all previous learning is funneled into high-level strategy and a final Master Thesis.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (6):</strong> You will study <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">Strategic Management</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">International HRM</strong>. The <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">Master Thesis / Project</strong> serves as your capstone, allowing you to solve a real-world business problem.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (11 Skills):</strong> High-level skills like <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">Strategic Decision Making</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">Global Talent Acquisition</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"112\">Organizational Development</strong> are the focus here.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn Learning (10 Certifications):</strong> The final certifications focus on the <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">Future of Work</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Generative AI in HR</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">Strategic Workforce Planning</strong>, ensuring you graduate with a cutting-edge resume.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(269, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 227, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 00:26:41', '2026-06-16 06:53:15', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">++ accredited</strong> institution&mdash;is a streamlined, digital-first experience. Designed for the modern professional, the process removes traditional bureaucratic hurdles, allowing you to move from applicant to future marketing leader in a few simple steps.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">This guide provides a deep-dive into the four critical stages of enrollment, emphasizing the financial incentives and strategic advantages available to you.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Step 1: Digital Application &amp; Profile Initialization</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The first step is your entry into the JAIN ecosystem. You are required to submit an <strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"84\">Online Application</strong> that acts as the blueprint for your academic journey.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Accuracy:</strong> You will fill out your personal, educational (10th, 12th, and Graduation scores), and program-specific details.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Choice:</strong> In this stage, you explicitly select the <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"59\">Marketing Specialization</strong>. This is crucial because JAIN&rsquo;s Marketing MBA is uniquely integrated with AI skills and LinkedIn Learning certifications from Semester 1.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification Prep:</strong> Ensure your graduation details reflect the <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">50% aggregate</strong> (45% for SC/ST) required by the university to avoid delays in the next phase.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Step 2: Program Enrollment &amp; Credential Verification</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Once your application is submitted, you enter the <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Enrollment Phase</strong>. This is where the university&rsquo;s administrative team validates your candidacy.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Submission:</strong> You will upload scanned copies of your degree, mark sheets, and government-issued ID.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Enrollment Confirmation:</strong> After verifying that your undergraduate degree is from a <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">UGC-recognized university</strong> and spans a minimum of three years, you will be invited to confirm your specific elective choices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Advisory Support:</strong> During this stage, admission counselors are available to clarify how the Marketing curriculum aligns with current industry trends like Digital Transformation and Consumer Analytics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Step 3: Strategic Financial Settlement &amp; Incentives</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">This is the most critical step for your financial planning. JAIN University offers two high-value pathways to settle your tuition.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Pathway A: The Upfront \"Incentive\" Plan</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">If you choose the <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"18\">One-Time Payment</strong> for the full program fee (₹160,000), the university rewards your commitment with a <strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">15% discount</strong>.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic ROI:</strong> This reduces your total expenditure significantly, providing the highest possible Return on Investment before you even start your first class.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\">Pathway B: The 0% Interest Financing Plan</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">For those who prefer to maintain liquidity, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">Education Loan / EMI</strong> option is the standard choice.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Monthly Management:</strong> You can pay through easy monthly installments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Zero Hidden Costs:</strong> The \"0% Interest\" feature ensures you aren\'t paying bank premiums, making the cost of your MBA as manageable as a monthly utility expense.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"19\">Step 4: Seat Securing &amp; Academic Onboarding</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">The final stage is the official confirmation of your status as an MBA Marketing student.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Confirmation of Funds:</strong> Your seat is officially secured once the one-time payment is received or your EMI financing is approved by the partner institution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Kit Access:</strong> Upon confirmation, you receive access to the <strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">Student Portal and LMS (Learning Management System)</strong>. This includes your early-access credentials to LinkedIn Learning tracks specifically curated for Marketing, such as \"Brand Management\" and \"Market Research Foundations.\"</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Official Admission Letter:</strong> A formal admission letter is generated, which can be used for professional records or corporate reimbursement programs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Entering the world of high-impact marketing requires a blend of creative intuition and analytical rigor. JAIN (Deemed-to-be University), a <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"139\">NAAC A++ accredited</strong> powerhouse, ensures that its MBA Marketing cohort is comprised of individuals who meet high academic standards. Whether you come from a background in arts, science, or commerce, the eligibility framework is designed to be inclusive yet merit-driven.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Below is a detailed, explanatory breakdown of the requirements you must satisfy to begin your journey in MBA Marketing.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">1. Academic Foundation: The Three-Year Degree Rule</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The core requirement for the MBA Marketing program is a recognized undergraduate foundation. Marketing today involves complex data analysis and consumer psychology, requiring the maturity developed during a full degree cycle.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Minimum Duration:</strong> You must have passed an Undergraduate (Bachelor) Program of at least <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"87\">three (3) years</strong> in duration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stream Neutrality:</strong> The university welcomes diversity. You can apply regardless of your stream&mdash;whether you studied B.Com, B.A., B.Sc., BBA, or B.Tech, you are eligible as long as your degree is from a <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"200\">UGC Recognized University</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why this matters:</strong> Marketing leaders often benefit from \"interdisciplinary\" thinking. An engineer might bring analytical skills to digital marketing, while an arts graduate might excel in brand storytelling.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">2. The Performance Benchmark: Aggregate Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">To ensure a high standard of academic peer-to-peer learning, JAIN University sets specific percentage thresholds:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">General Category:</strong> You must have secured a <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">minimum aggregate of 50%</strong> (or an equivalent letter/numerical grade) in your qualifying undergraduate examination.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Comprehensive Calculation:</strong> This aggregate usually includes all subjects studied over the three or four years of your degree, not just your major or \"honors\" subjects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Equivalency:</strong> If your university uses a CGPA system, the university will apply its conversion formula to ensure you meet the 50% benchmark.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Social Equity: Relaxations for SC/ST Candidates</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">JAIN University is committed to inclusive education and leadership development across all sectors of society.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">5% Relaxation:</strong> Candidates belonging to Scheduled Caste (SC) or Scheduled Tribe (ST) categories are granted a 5% relaxation in the aggregate score.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Revised Threshold:</strong> SC/ST candidates are eligible to apply with a <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">minimum aggregate of 45%</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"16\">3. The \"Early-Bird\" Clause: Final Semester Applicants</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">One of the most advantageous policies for students is the ability to bridge the gap between graduation and post-graduation immediately.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Year Eligibility:</strong> If you are currently in your <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">final semester</strong> of your Bachelor&rsquo;s program, you don\'t have to wait for your final results to apply.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Provisional Admission:</strong> You can complete the admission process and secure your seat. Your admission will remain \"provisional\" until you submit your final degree certificates and mark sheets proving you met the 50% (or 45%) criteria.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Avoiding a Gap Year:</strong> This allows you to transition straight into your MBA Marketing specialization, keeping your career momentum high.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Investing in an MBA is a significant milestone that requires clear financial visibility. JAIN (Deemed-to-be University), a prestigious <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"135\">NAAC A++ accredited</strong> institution, offers a highly structured and transparent fee model designed to be accessible to a global student base.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">This comprehensive guide breaks down the total investment, flexible payment frameworks, and the specific ancillary costs for domestic and international candidates.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">1. Core Tuition Investment: The ₹160,000 Framework</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The total tuition fee for the JAIN University MBA program is <strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">₹160,000</strong>. This amount covers the comprehensive academic delivery, access to the Learning Management System (LMS), and industry-integrated course modules. To ensure students can manage this investment without financial strain, the university provides three primary remittance paths:</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Plan</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Amount</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Strategic Financial Context</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Payment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹160,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,2,0\">Best for students with immediate liquidity; often eligible for upfront settlement incentives.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Yearly Installment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹80,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,2,0\">Divides the cost into two annual segments, aligning with corporate bonus or fiscal cycles.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semesterly Installment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹40,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,2,0\">The most popular option, distributing the cost into four manageable segments over two years.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\">0% Interest EMI &amp; Financing</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">To further lower the barrier to premium education, JAIN University facilitates <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment)</strong> options.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Zero Interest:</strong> Many financing partners offer <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">0% interest plans</strong>, allowing students to pay their tuition in small monthly bites rather than large lump sums.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Approval Process:</strong> This is a digital-first process requiring standard KYC (Aadhaar/PAN), ensuring that merit-driven students can secure their future without immediate cash flow constraints.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"12\">2. Global Fee Structure: Registration &amp; Examination Costs</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Beyond the core tuition, students must account for administrative and assessment fees. These are categorized based on the student\'s geographic residency to align with regional administrative logistics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">For Students in India</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The domestic fee structure is the most cost-effective, designed for residents of India.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Registration:</strong> ₹2,500 (Paid at the start of the program).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Examination Fee:</strong> ₹3,000 (Paid every year).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total 2-Year Ancillary Cost:</strong> ₹8,500.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\">For Students in SAARC Countries</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">Tailored for students from the South Asian Association for Regional Cooperation (e.g., Nepal, Bhutan, Sri Lanka).</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Registration:</strong> ₹11,250.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Examination Fee:</strong> ₹3,750.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total 2-Year Ancillary Cost:</strong> ₹18,750.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\">For International Students</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">Standardized in USD for students residing in the Middle East, USA, UK, and other global regions.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"22\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Registration:</strong> $150.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Examination Fee:</strong> $50 per year.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total 2-Year Ancillary Cost:</strong> $250.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">In today&rsquo;s data-driven economy, a traditional marketing degree is no longer enough. The MBA in Marketing at JAIN (Deemed-to-be University)&mdash;a <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"141\">NAAC A++ accredited</strong> institution&mdash;is strategically engineered to merge classical consumer psychology with cutting-edge <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"258\">AI and Digital Analytics</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">This comprehensive roadmap details the four-semester journey that equips students with 50+ high-authority skills and over 40 LinkedIn Learning certifications, ensuring maximum career ROI.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Semester 1: Management Foundations &amp; AI Literacy</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The first semester builds the bedrock of business intelligence while introducing the transformative power of Artificial Intelligence.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (6):</strong> You will master <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"34\">Business Economics</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">Financial Reporting</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">Organizational Behavior</strong>. Crucially, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"119\">AI Skills for Future</strong> course starts your journey into automation and machine learning.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (18 Skills):</strong> Focuses on <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">Financial Modelling</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"63\">ESG Analysis</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">LLM (Large Language Model) Fundamentals</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Certifications (9):</strong> Includes <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">Negotiation Foundations</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"70\">AI Literacy</strong>, building your digital brand on LinkedIn from day one.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Semester 2: Strategic Scaling &amp; Digital Business</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">The second semester transitions into the mechanics of marketing and the operational logic of entrepreneurship.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (5):</strong> Highlights include <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">Marketing Management</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">Business Analytics and Artificial Intelligence</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (11 Skills):</strong> You will gain expertise in <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">Market Segmentation</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">Linear Programming</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"103\">Integrated Marketing Communications (IMC) Planning</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Certifications (14):</strong> A heavy emphasis on tech-stack mastery with <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">Cloud Computing</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"95\">Power BI</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">Advanced Tableau Desktop</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Semester 3: Consumer Insights &amp; Omni-Channel Strategy</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">This semester is dedicated to the \"Core Marketing\" experience, focusing on how to track, understand, and influence modern consumers.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (7):</strong> Detailed study of <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"36\">Consumer Behavior</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"55\">Omni-Channel Marketing</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"83\">Market Research Tools</strong>. An <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">Open Elective</strong> allows you to customize your learning path.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (12 Skills):</strong> Mastering <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">Customer Journey Awareness</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"69\">Data Interpretation</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"94\">Channel Integration</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Certifications (10):</strong> Specialized tracks in <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"56\">Growth Marketing</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Email Marketing</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"95\">AI for Marketing</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Semester 4: Global Strategy &amp; Brand Leadership</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The final semester prepares you for high-level leadership and global market entry, culminating in a real-world research project.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (6):</strong> Focuses on <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"29\">Global Marketing</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"47\">B2B Marketing</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"66\">Strategic Management</strong>. The <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"92\">Master Thesis / Project</strong> serves as your capstone achievement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (12 Skills):</strong> Strategic planning, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"51\">Relationship Marketing</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">Analytical Method Development</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Certifications (10):</strong> Advanced credentials in <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">Neuromarketing</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Python for Marketing</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"100\">Salesforce Marketing Associate Prep</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(270, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 244, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 01:20:03', '2026-06-16 06:53:37', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Embarking on an MBA journey at JAIN (Deemed-to-be University)&mdash;a <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">NAAC A++ accredited</strong> global institution&mdash;is a streamlined, digital-first experience. The admission process is designed to be user-centric, ensuring that high-potential candidates can transition from applicant to student with ease and transparency.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Below is a detailed, explanatory breakdown of the four critical milestones you will encounter on your way to securing a seat in one of India\'s most future-ready management programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Step 1: Digital Application Submission</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The journey begins with the creation of your digital academic profile. This is the stage where you introduce your professional and academic aspirations to the university.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Online Integration:</strong> You must fill out the comprehensive online application form. This requires your personal identification details, educational history (from 10th grade to Graduation), and your specific choice of MBA specialization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accuracy is Key:</strong> Ensure that the data entered matches your official government IDs and degree certificates, as this data will be used for all future university communications and your final degree conferral.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Step 2: Program Selection &amp; Document Verification</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Once your initial application is in the system, the university moves into the \"Verification &amp; Matching\" phase.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Specialization Finalization:</strong> During this step, you formally select your preferred program track (e.g., Marketing, Finance, or Business Analytics).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Validation:</strong> The university admissions team reviews your submitted details against the eligibility criteria (minimum 50% aggregate in graduation). This step ensures that you meet the high-authority academic standards required for a NAAC A++ institution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Enrollment Confirmation:</strong> Once your details are verified, you are moved from the \"Applicant\" pool to \"Eligible for Enrollment.\"</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Step 3: Strategic Payment &amp; Financial Planning</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">JAIN University offers one of the most flexible fee-payment frameworks in the country, allowing you to choose a path that fits your current liquidity.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\">Option A: The One-Time Payment Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">If you have the capital available, this is the most financially strategic choice.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The 15% Incentive:</strong> By paying the full program fee upfront, you receive a <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"73\">15% discount</strong>. This significantly lowers the overall cost of your MBA and improves your immediate ROI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\">Option B: Education Loan &amp; 0% Interest EMI</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">For students who prefer to manage their cash flow month-to-month, the university provides robust financing support.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Zero Interest:</strong> You can apply for internal or partner-bank financing, allowing you to pay through easy monthly installments (EMI) without any additional interest burden.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Paperless Approval:</strong> The financing process is integrated into the admission portal, making it a \"one-stop-shop\" for both admission and funding.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"22\">Step 4: Seat Securing &amp; Official Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">This is the final milestone where your status changes from a candidate to a JAIN University student.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"24\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Confirmation:</strong> Once your payment is processed or your financing/loan is approved by the partner bank, your admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Seat Security:</strong> At this stage, your seat is legally secured within the cohort. You will receive your official Admission Letter and access to the <strong data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"144\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong>, where your journey into management begins.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Securing a seat at JAIN (Deemed-to-be University)&mdash;a <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">NAAC A++ accredited</strong> institution&mdash;starts with a clear understanding of the academic entry barriers. The university maintains a merit-driven yet inclusive eligibility policy to ensure that its MBA cohorts consist of diverse, high-potential individuals.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Whether you are a fresh graduate or a working professional looking to pivot into management, here is a detailed, explanatory breakdown of the requirements you must satisfy.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">1. The Undergraduate Foundation: The Three-Year Rule</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The primary prerequisite for the MBA program is a recognized bachelor\'s degree. This ensures that every student brings a baseline of critical thinking and academic discipline to the classroom.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Minimum Duration:</strong> You must have successfully completed an Undergraduate (Bachelor) Program with a minimum duration of <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">three (3) years</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stream Neutrality:</strong> Diversity is a core value at JAIN. You can apply regardless of your undergraduate background&mdash;whether it is in <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">Arts, Commerce, Science, Engineering, or Fine Arts</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recognition Status:</strong> The degree must be conferred by a <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">UGC Recognized University</strong>. This is a non-negotiable legal requirement to ensure the validity of your postgraduate credentials.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">2. Academic Benchmarks: The 50% Aggregate Rule</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">JAIN University looks for consistent academic performance to ensure students can keep up with the rigorous MBA curriculum.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The 50% Threshold:</strong> General category candidates must have secured a <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"67\">minimum aggregate of 50%</strong> (or an equivalent letter/numerical grade) in their qualifying examination.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">What is \"Aggregate\"?:</strong> This usually refers to the combined marks of all subjects across all years of your degree, not just your major or \"honors\" subjects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Equivalent Grades:</strong> If your university uses a CGPA system, the university will follow standard conversion formulas to verify that your score meets the 50% benchmark.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Social Equity: Relaxations for SC/ST Candidates</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">In alignment with national educational standards and a commitment to inclusive growth, JAIN University offers specific relaxations:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">5% Mark Relaxation:</strong> Candidates belonging to Scheduled Caste (SC) or Scheduled Tribe (ST) categories are granted a relaxation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Revised Benchmark:</strong> For SC/ST applicants, the minimum required aggregate is <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"75\">45%</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"16\">3. The \"Early-Bird\" Clause: Final Semester Applicants</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">One of the most student-friendly aspects of the JAIN MBA admission policy is the provision for current students to apply before they even have their final degree in hand.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Current Students:</strong> If you are in the <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"36\">final semester</strong> of your Bachelor\'s Program, you are fully eligible to apply.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Provisional Admission:</strong> You can complete the selection process and secure your seat. Your admission remains \"Provisional\" until you submit your final semester mark sheets and degree certificate.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Compliance Requirement:</strong> While you can apply early, your final results must eventually meet the 50% (or 45% for SC/ST) criteria. Failure to meet this at the time of document verification will result in the cancellation of the provisional seat.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Investing in a Master of Business Administration (MBA) is a pivotal career decision. JAIN (Deemed-to-be University), a prestigious <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"131\">NAAC A++ accredited</strong> institution, offers a transparent and structured fee model designed to be accessible to a global student base.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">This comprehensive guide breaks down the total investment, flexible payment frameworks, and the specific ancillary costs for domestic and international candidates.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">1. Core Tuition Investment: The ₹196,000 Framework</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The total tuition fee for the JAIN University MBA program is <strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">₹196,000</strong>. This investment covers the comprehensive academic delivery, access to the high-tech Learning Management System (LMS), and industry-integrated course modules. To ensure students can manage this investment without financial strain, the university provides three primary remittance paths:<br><br></p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Plan</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Amount</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Strategic Financial Context</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Payment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹196,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,2,0\">Best for students who want to settle the full liability upfront to avoid periodic administrative tasks.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Yearly Installment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹98,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,2,0\">Divides the cost into two annual segments, aligning perfectly with fiscal year planning.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semesterly Installment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹49,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,2,0\">The most flexible option, distributing the cost into four manageable segments over the two-year duration.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\">0% Interest EMI &amp; Financing</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">To further lower the barrier to premium education, JAIN University facilitates <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment)</strong> options.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Zero Interest Advantage:</strong> Through university-tied financing partners, students can access <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"89\">0% interest plans</strong>, allowing you to pay the tuition in small monthly installments rather than large lump sums.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rapid Approval:</strong> The process is typically digital-first, requiring standard KYC (Aadhaar/PAN), ensuring that financial constraints never stand in the way of academic merit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"12\">2. Global Fee Structure: Registration &amp; Examination Costs</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Beyond the core tuition, students must account for administrative and assessment fees. These are categorized based on the student\'s geographic residency to align with regional administrative logistics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">For Students in India</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The domestic fee structure is optimized for residents of India, ensuring affordability without compromising quality.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Registration:</strong> ₹2,500 (Paid at the start of the program).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Examination Fee:</strong> ₹3,000 (Paid every year).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total 2-Year Ancillary Cost:</strong> ₹8,500.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\">For Students in SAARC Countries</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">Tailored for students from the South Asian Association for Regional Cooperation (e.g., Nepal, Bhutan, Sri Lanka).</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Registration:</strong> ₹11,250.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Examination Fee:</strong> ₹3,750.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total 2-Year Ancillary Cost:</strong> ₹18,750.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\">For International Students</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">Standardized in USD for students residing in the Middle East, USA, UK, and other global regions.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"22\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Registration:</strong> $150.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Examination Fee:</strong> $50 per year.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total 2-Year Ancillary Cost:</strong> $250.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"23\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"24\">3. Topical Deep-Dive: ROI and Financial Strategy</h2>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"25\">Strategic Decision: Upfront vs. Installments</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26\">While the <strong data-path-to-node=\"26\" data-index-in-node=\"10\">Semesterly Installment</strong> of ₹49,000 offers the best cash-flow management, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"26\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">One-Time Payment</strong> path is strategically superior for those looking to eliminate \"administrative friction.\" By paying once, you avoid the risk of missing payment windows, which can lead to temporary loss of access to university portals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"27\">Maximizing Return on Investment (ROI)</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28\">The total cost of the JAIN MBA is highly competitive when compared to other Tier-1 institutions where fees often exceed ₹10&ndash;15 Lakhs.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"29\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"29,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"29,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Silicon Valley\" Edge:</strong> Being headquartered in Bengaluru, JAIN provides access to a job market where starting salaries for specialized MBA graduates often range from ₹6 LPA to ₹12 LPA.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"29,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"29,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Bundling:</strong> The fee includes access to <strong data-path-to-node=\"29,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">40+ LinkedIn Learning certifications</strong> and specialized <strong data-path-to-node=\"29,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"96\">AI Skill modules</strong>, significantly increasing your market value per rupee spent.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">To thrive in the modern corporate landscape, a Master of Business Administration (MBA) must be more than just a degree; it must be a toolkit for digital and strategic mastery. JAIN (Deemed-to-be University)&mdash;a <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"209\">NAAC A++ accredited</strong> institution&mdash;has engineered a four-semester roadmap that bridges the gap between traditional management and the AI-driven future.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">This guide provides a granular look at the academic journey, the specialized skills you will attain, and the professional certifications that will define your resume.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Semester 1: The Foundations of Leadership &amp; AI</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The first semester is designed to build a robust \"Academic Core\" while immediately introducing students to the next generation of business tools.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (6):</strong> You will dive into <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">Business Economics</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">Financial Reporting</strong>, coupled with a unique focus on <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"112\">Sustainability &amp; Ethics</strong>. Notably, the <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"150\">AI Skills for Future</strong> course starts your journey into the world of LLMs and generative tech.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (18 Skills):</strong> Beyond the classroom, you develop practical competencies in <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"91\">Financial Modelling</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"112\">ESG Analysis</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"130\">Regressional Analysis</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Edge:</strong> You are suggested <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">9 LinkedIn Learning certifications</strong>, including <em data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"83\">Negotiation Foundations</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">AI Literacy</em>, ensuring you speak the language of modern boardrooms from day one.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Semester 2: Scaling Strategy &amp; Digital Transformation</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Semester 2 shifts the focus from individual core subjects to organizational growth and systemic efficiency.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (5):</strong> This phase covers the \"Engine Room\" of business: <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"67\">Entrepreneurship</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"85\">Marketing Management</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">Operations Research</strong>. You also study <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"147\">Business Law</strong> to understand the regulatory boundaries of global trade.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (11 Skills):</strong> You master <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">Product Lifecycle &amp; Pricing Strategy</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">Market Segmentation</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"105\">Advanced Excel</strong>&mdash;the universal language of business data.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Certifications (14):</strong> A heavy emphasis on digital leadership with certifications like <em data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"95\">Cloud Computing for Digital Business</em>, <em data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"133\">Agile Business Analysis</em>, and <em data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"162\">Artificial Intelligence and Business Strategy</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Semester 3: Data Architecture &amp; Technical Mastery</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">The third semester is where the \"Business Intelligence\" specialization truly takes flight, moving into heavy-duty data management and analytics.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (5):</strong> The curriculum gets technical with <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">Analytics Language for Managers</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">DBMS (Database Management Systems)</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"126\">BI Reporting</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (24 Skills):</strong> This is your most skill-intensive period. You will learn <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">Python Programming</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"108\">SQL</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"113\">NumPy</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"120\">Pandas</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"132\">MongoDB</strong>. You will transition from \"using\" data to \"architecting\" it through <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"208\">Relational Data Modeling</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technical Certifications (8):</strong> High-authority credentials including <em data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"67\">Microsoft SQL Server 2022 Essential Training</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"116\">Python Essential Training</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Semester 4: Intelligence, Warehousing &amp; Strategic Capstone</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">The final semester culminates in advanced intelligence systems and high-level strategic management, preparing you for C-suite decision-making.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (5):</strong> Focus on the \"Big Picture\" with <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Strategic Management</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">Data Warehousing</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"94\">Web Data Extraction and Analytics</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (17 Skills):</strong> Mastery of the backend of big business, including <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">ETL (Extract, Transform, Load)</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"113\">OLAP Cubes</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"125\">Snowflake Schema</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"147\">Data Governance</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Mastery Certifications (12):</strong> You wrap up with specializations in <em data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"71\">Apache Spark Big Data Engineering</em>, <em data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"106\">SAP BI/BW</em>, and <em data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"121\">Enterprise Architecture Foundations</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(271, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 245, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 01:37:43', '2026-06-16 06:54:00', '<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"520\">Understanding the admission process in detail is essential for students who want a <strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"207\">smooth, error-free enrollment experience</strong>. While the steps may appear simple, each stage carries important decisions that can impact your admission confirmation, fee savings, and even your long-term academic journey. Below is a <strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"438\">fully explained, SEO-optimized breakdown</strong> of the MBA admission process with strategic insights that most students overlook.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"525\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hx505v\" data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"596\">Step 1: Submit Your Application &ndash; The Foundation of Your Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"740\">The admission journey begins with filling out the <strong data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"675\">online application form</strong>, which acts as the primary evaluation document for your profile.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"785\">At this stage, you are required to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"946\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1819cb0\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"851\">Personal details (name, contact information, identity details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vhwh06\" data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"910\">Academic qualifications (10th, 12th, graduation details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aw3clb\" data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"946\">Program selection and preferences</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kwr939\" data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"977\">Why This Step Is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1129\">This is not just a formality &mdash; it is the <strong data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1048\">first level of screening</strong>. Any incorrect or inconsistent information can lead to delays or even rejection.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1159\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1353\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6pzebk\" data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1220\">Entering incorrect marks or mismatched academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jy1x0z\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1297\">Using an inactive email or phone number (you may miss important updates)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5borpt\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1353\">Selecting the wrong program without proper research</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yfazgm\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1366\">Pro Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1544\">Double-check every detail before submission. Even small errors (like spelling mistakes in your name) can create complications during document verification and final enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1549\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vep7qg\" data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1619\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program &ndash; Making the Right Academic Choice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1713\">Once your application is submitted, the next step is to <strong data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1712\">confirm your program enrollment</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1729\">This includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1867\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjkr2\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1786\">Selecting your preferred MBA specialization/program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10d33dz\" data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1830\">Reviewing all entered details carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wa74q2\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1867\">Confirming your intent to enroll</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"liukvd\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1901\">What Students Often Overlook</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"2046\">Many students rush through this step without understanding the <strong data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2007\">long-term impact of program selection</strong>. Your specialization directly affects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2116\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj5fkl\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2072\">Career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vyy424\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2093\">Salary potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4cdz6b\" data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2116\">Industry relevance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2139\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2170\">Choose your program based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2293\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jljzan\" data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2212\">Future career goals (not just trends)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1buqm4c\" data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2250\">Industry demand and job stability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gmyjm7\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2293\">Your academic background and strengths</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2387\">Making a wrong choice here can limit your career options later, so take this step seriously.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2392\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4tvu00\" data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2457\">Step 3: Complete Payment &ndash; Understanding Fee Options Smartly</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2592\">After enrollment confirmation, you need to <strong data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2530\">complete the fee payment</strong>, which officially moves your application toward confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2637\">You typically get multiple payment options:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13dsnnn\" data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2666\">One-Time Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2763\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"182hmgs\" data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2708\">Pay the <strong data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2706\">full program fee upfront</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1usqg1r\" data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2763\">Get a <strong data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2733\">15% discount</strong>, reducing your overall cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kcshpp\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2796\">Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2909\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"blh4ri\" data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2838\">Pay through <strong data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2836\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ky49q1\" data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2909\">Often comes with <strong data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2873\">0% interest</strong>, making it financially manageable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2914\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c52l4g\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2951\">Which Option Should You Choose?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"3177\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5xdw16\" data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"3061\"><strong data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2986\">Choose One-Time Payment if:</strong>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3061\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xiherl\" data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3023\">You can afford upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2i431\" data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3061\">You want to minimize total cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klcvjr\" data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3177\"><strong data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3088\">Choose EMI/Loan if:</strong>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3177\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16rcd6x\" data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3127\">You prefer financial flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8sg2u4\" data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3177\">You want to manage cash flow during studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dk0zcq\" data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3206\">Hidden Decision Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3382\">Many students blindly choose EMI without realizing they are missing out on <strong data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3332\">significant savings through upfront discounts</strong>. Always calculate the total cost before deciding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3387\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5qr8cl\" data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3447\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat &ndash; Final Admission Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3562\">Once your payment is completed or financing is approved, your admission reaches the <strong data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3561\">final confirmation stage</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3578\">At this point:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3718\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mb1a5p\" data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3634\">Your <strong data-start=\"3587\" data-end=\"3632\">seat in the program is officially secured</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1insbj8\" data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3683\">You receive confirmation from the university</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cku521\" data-start=\"3684\" data-end=\"3718\">You become an enrolled student</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gg7hdf\" data-start=\"3720\" data-end=\"3752\">Important Things to Remember</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3754\" data-end=\"3897\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k7k4no\" data-start=\"3754\" data-end=\"3820\">Admission is confirmed <strong data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3818\">only after payment or loan approval</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g6im9j\" data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3897\">Delays in payment can result in <strong data-start=\"3855\" data-end=\"3895\">losing your preferred seat or intake</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"3899\" data-end=\"3914\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"4052\">Seats in popular MBA specializations can fill quickly. Waiting too long after application approval can lead to <strong data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4051\">missed opportunities</strong>.</p>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Securing a seat in a premier <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"29\">NAAC A++ accredited</strong> institution requires a clear understanding of the academic threshold. JAIN (Deemed-to-be University) maintains a standardized eligibility framework to ensure that all candidates possess the foundational academic rigour necessary to succeed in a fast-paced, AI-integrated MBA environment.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Whether you are a working professional or a fresh graduate, here is the detailed breakdown of what you need to qualify.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">1. Core Academic Qualifications</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The primary requirement is the completion of a formal undergraduate education. JAIN University adheres to UGC (University Grants Commission) guidelines to maintain the highest standards of academic integrity.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Degree Type:</strong> You must have successfully passed an Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Duration:</strong> The program must have a minimum duration of <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">three (3) years</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stream Neutrality:</strong> Diversity is a core value at JAIN. You can apply regardless of your undergraduate stream&mdash;be it <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"114\">Commerce, Arts, Science, Engineering, or Management</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">2. The Merit Threshold: Minimum Percentage</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Academic performance in your undergraduate years is a key indicator of your readiness for postgraduate studies.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">General Category:</strong> Candidates must have secured a minimum aggregate of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"70\">50% marks</strong> (or an equivalent letter/numerical grade) in their qualifying examination.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inclusivity &amp; Relaxation:</strong> In alignment with social equity norms, a <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"67\">5% relaxation</strong> is provided to candidates belonging to <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"120\">SC/ST categories</strong>. This means a minimum aggregate of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"172\">45%</strong> is required for these applicants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"13\">3. Special Provisions for Final Year Students</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">JAIN University offers a \"Early Bird\" advantage for students who are currently in the final stages of their undergraduate journey.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Semester Eligibility:</strong> If you are currently in your <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"57\">final semester</strong> or awaiting your final year results, you are fully eligible to apply.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Provisional Admission:</strong> In such cases, admission is granted provisionally. You will be required to submit your final marks card and degree certificate once they are issued by your parent university to formalize your enrollment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Navigating the financial commitment of a postgraduate degree is a pivotal step in career planning. <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"99\">JAIN (Deemed-to-be University)</strong>, a premier <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"141\">NAAC A++ accredited</strong> institution with a legacy dating back to its 1990 foundation, offers a highly competitive and transparent fee model for its Master of Business Administration (MBA) program.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">This guide provides a deep-dive into the cost of education, strategic payment options, and the long-term value proposition that justifies the investment.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">1. Comprehensive Breakdown of MBA Tuition Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The MBA program at JAIN University is structured to provide high-authority academic rigor while maintaining financial accessibility. The total tuition investment for the program is set at <strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"188\">₹160,000</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">To accommodate diverse financial backgrounds, the university offers three distinct payment \"pathways\":</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Yearly Plan:</strong> Pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"17\">₹80,000 per year</strong>. This is ideal for students who want to clear their dues in two large installments and focus entirely on their studies for the remainder of the year.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semesterly Plan:</strong> Pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"21\">₹40,000 per semester</strong>. This is the most popular \"pay-as-you-go\" model, breaking the total cost into four manageable parts across two years.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Payment:</strong> Clear the full <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">₹160,000 upfront</strong>. As mentioned in our admission guide, this often unlocks administrative ease and ensures you are immune to any future fee revisions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"10\">2. Mandatory Additional Fees: A Global Perspective</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Beyond the core tuition, there are essential administrative costs that vary based on the student\'s geographic location. These cover the registration of your academic identity and the processing of examinations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">A. Domestic Students (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee:</strong> ₹2,500 (One-time at the start)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee:</strong> ₹3,000 (Per Year)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Administrative Cost over 2 Years:</em> ₹8,500</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">B. SAARC Country Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee:</strong> ₹11,250 (One-time)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee:</strong> ₹3,750 (Per Year)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\">C. International Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee:</strong> $150 (One-time)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee:</strong> $50 (Per Year)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"19\">3. Financial Inclusivity: EMI &amp; Financing</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">Understanding that an MBA is a significant milestone, JAIN University provides robust financial support systems to ensure no student is held back by immediate liquidity constraints.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">0% Interest EMI:</strong> The university partners with leading financial institutions to offer monthly installment plans. This allows you to spread the cost over several months without the burden of added interest.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Education Loans:</strong> As a NAAC A++ university, JAIN&rsquo;s degrees are highly valued by banks, making the loan approval process for students faster and more seamless.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"22\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"23\">4. The ROI Perspective: Cost vs. Career Value</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24\">When evaluating a fee of ₹160,000, it is crucial to look at the <strong data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong>.</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"25\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"25,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"25,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Placement Potential:</strong> With JAIN\'s headquarters in Bengaluru (the Silicon Valley of India), graduates often secure roles with starting salaries ranging from <strong data-path-to-node=\"25,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"155\">₹6 LPA to ₹12 LPA</strong>. In many cases, students recover their entire program cost within the first 4&ndash;6 months of their new job.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Bundling:</strong> The fee includes more than just lectures. It covers a curriculum integrated with <strong data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"97\">AI skills</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"108\">Python</strong>, and over <strong data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"125\">40+ LinkedIn Learning certifications</strong>, which would cost significantly more if pursued independently.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Network Value:</strong> You gain access to an alumni network of over <strong data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">100,000+ global professionals</strong>, a \"hidden asset\" that provides lifelong career leads.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"99\" data-end=\"435\">A well-designed MBA curriculum is not just about subjects&mdash;it is a <strong data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"294\">strategic roadmap that builds managerial thinking, analytical ability, leadership skills, and industry readiness step by step</strong>. This program is structured across four semesters, where each phase progressively transforms a student from a learner into a decision-maker.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"798\">Unlike traditional programs that focus only on theory, this curriculum integrates <strong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"595\">practical skills, real-world tools, and industry-relevant certifications</strong>, ensuring that students are job-ready from day one. Below is a <strong data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"694\">deep, semester-wise explanation</strong> of what you will study, the skills you will gain, and how each stage contributes to your career growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"803\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mtdtma\" data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"857\">Semester 1 &ndash; Building Strong Business Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"1076\">The first semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"919\">core business fundamentals</strong>, helping students develop a strong understanding of how organizations operate across finance, economics, human resources, and emerging technologies like AI.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1097\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1328\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1121\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rf69vv\" data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1149\">Sustainability &amp; Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5ih8i\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1193\">Financial Reporting &amp; Corporate Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1of72ks\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1252\">Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9vwaxg\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1303\">Quantitative Techniques for Business Decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1328\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"etc6ef\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1373\">What You Actually Learn (Beyond Theory)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1524\">This semester is designed to <strong data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1441\">change how you think as a student</strong>. Instead of memorizing concepts, you start analyzing real-world business problems.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1865\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ebez6i\" data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1590\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1590\">market behavior and economic decision-making</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"144z780\" data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1648\">Applying <strong data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1648\">financial principles to business scenarios</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dthqak\" data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1728\">Learning how organizations function through <strong data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1728\">human behavior and leadership</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ycznfd\" data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1802\">Using <strong data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1763\">data-driven techniques</strong> like regression and hypothesis testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gm6ssr\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1865\">Getting introduced to <strong data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1865\">AI and its role in modern business</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1889\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"2153\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n8z6fy\" data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1935\">Managerial economics and market analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sv2syo\" data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1984\">Financial modelling and accounting standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iwev16\" data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2023\">Talent management and HR analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4sfclu\" data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2068\">Descriptive and predictive data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5o7x68\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2114\">AI fundamentals and business applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2560j\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2153\">Time Value of Money (TVM) analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2183\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2248\">Students are introduced to professional certifications such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2452\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qmzthi\" data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2292\">Negotiation and business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nj0qck\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2330\">Executive presence and networking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdun9m\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2362\">Cross-cultural intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15l6kp1\" data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2393\">Risk management strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"194ahfv\" data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2436\">Design thinking and data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vv2xlp\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2452\">AI literacy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2475\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2695\">Most students underestimate Semester 1, but this is where your <strong data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2576\">core analytical mindset is built</strong>. Weak understanding here can create long-term difficulties in advanced subjects like finance, analytics, and strategy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2700\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10r9lwi\" data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2772\">Semester 2 &ndash; Developing Business Functions &amp; Decision-Making Skills</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2993\">In the second semester, the focus shifts toward <strong data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2851\">functional business areas</strong> like marketing, operations, entrepreneurship, and analytics. This is where students begin to <strong data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2992\">connect theory with real business execution</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3014\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3174\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3036\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3061\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ngrelz\" data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3085\">Operations Research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k770wv\" data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3125\">Business Law &amp; Corporate Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1psm699\" data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3174\">Business Analytics &amp; Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3203\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3285\">This semester teaches you how businesses grow, compete, and operate efficiently:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3575\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bd54c3\" data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3328\">How to <strong data-start=\"3296\" data-end=\"3328\">launch and manage a business</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vmzs9x\" data-start=\"3329\" data-end=\"3394\">Building <strong data-start=\"3340\" data-end=\"3394\">marketing strategies and customer targeting models</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkl812\" data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3456\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"3411\" data-end=\"3456\">legal frameworks and corporate governance</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10w56sj\" data-start=\"3457\" data-end=\"3514\">Applying <strong data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3514\">analytics and AI tools for decision-making</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mah95\" data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3575\">Solving operational problems using <strong data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3575\">quantitative models</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3599\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3832\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i19h56\" data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3645\">Market segmentation and pricing strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vy21qr\" data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3685\">Corporate governance and compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4xijua\" data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3731\">Linear programming and project scheduling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10tegga\" data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3778\">Business data analytics and advanced Excel</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"trdhkv\" data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3832\">Entrepreneurial thinking and opportunity analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3862\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3864\" data-end=\"3930\">Certifications focus on <strong data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"3929\">modern business transformation skills</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"4155\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ad8scp\" data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"3978\">Digital transformation and cloud computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14v3ohk\" data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4022\">AI strategy and consulting fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"70mbup\" data-start=\"4023\" data-end=\"4069\">Product management and customer experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"un2ijz\" data-start=\"4070\" data-end=\"4114\">Supply chain and agile business analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12va53h\" data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4155\">Data tools like Power BI and Tableau</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"4157\" data-end=\"4178\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4180\" data-end=\"4369\">This semester plays a major role in <strong data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4246\">career direction selection</strong>. Whether you choose marketing, finance, HR, or analytics later depends heavily on your understanding and performance here.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4371\" data-end=\"4374\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6sx57k\" data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4438\">Semester 3 &ndash; Specialization &amp; Advanced Business Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4615\">The third semester is where students move toward <strong data-start=\"4489\" data-end=\"4532\">specialization and advanced application</strong>. The focus is on <strong data-start=\"4550\" data-end=\"4614\">real-world problem-solving, research, and strategic thinking</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"4617\" data-end=\"4636\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4638\" data-end=\"4841\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zoxbqz\" data-start=\"4638\" data-end=\"4667\">Business Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4693\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gsyan\" data-start=\"4694\" data-end=\"4731\">Talent Acquisition and Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bsj24k\" data-start=\"4732\" data-end=\"4766\">Consumer Behavior and Insights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wq9qrd\" data-start=\"4767\" data-end=\"4815\">Investment Analysis and Portfolio Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n3p35q\" data-start=\"4816\" data-end=\"4841\">Market Research Tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"4843\" data-end=\"4870\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4872\" data-end=\"4969\">At this stage, you begin working on <strong data-start=\"4908\" data-end=\"4968\">complex business scenarios and industry-level challenges</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4971\" data-end=\"5279\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ow5ncr\" data-start=\"4971\" data-end=\"5028\">Conducting <strong data-start=\"4984\" data-end=\"5028\">research and data-driven decision-making</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f0cck7\" data-start=\"5029\" data-end=\"5090\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"5045\" data-end=\"5090\">customer psychology and behavior patterns</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wmp1gt\" data-start=\"5091\" data-end=\"5155\">Managing <strong data-start=\"5102\" data-end=\"5155\">operations, supply chains, and efficiency systems</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml0lvm\" data-start=\"5156\" data-end=\"5217\">Learning <strong data-start=\"5167\" data-end=\"5217\">investment strategies and portfolio management</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fz4okr\" data-start=\"5218\" data-end=\"5279\">Using market research tools to derive actionable insights</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"5281\" data-end=\"5303\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5305\" data-end=\"5537\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ev1u5z\" data-start=\"5305\" data-end=\"5341\">Inventory and quality management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jvxlx\" data-start=\"5342\" data-end=\"5396\">Consumer behavior analysis and engagement strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t4jlhg\" data-start=\"5397\" data-end=\"5440\">Market research and data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jptrm8\" data-start=\"5441\" data-end=\"5490\">Demand forecasting and operational efficiency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t41pmg\" data-start=\"5491\" data-end=\"5537\">Reporting and business insights generation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"5539\" data-end=\"5567\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5569\" data-end=\"5752\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iqq6yc\" data-start=\"5569\" data-end=\"5607\">Economic data analysis using Excel</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y38l9i\" data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5657\">Integrated marketing communication strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"812s\" data-start=\"5658\" data-end=\"5684\">Business plan creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10eotzi\" data-start=\"5685\" data-end=\"5720\">CRM systems for business growth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"513o4t\" data-start=\"5721\" data-end=\"5752\">Market research foundations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"5754\" data-end=\"5775\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5777\" data-end=\"5953\">This is the semester where your profile starts becoming <strong data-start=\"5833\" data-end=\"5846\">job-ready</strong>. Students who actively engage in projects and research here gain a <strong data-start=\"5914\" data-end=\"5952\">significant edge during placements</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5955\" data-end=\"5958\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6qz1da\" data-start=\"5960\" data-end=\"6017\">Semester 4 &ndash; Strategy, Leadership &amp; Industry Readiness</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6019\" data-end=\"6182\">The final semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"6049\" data-end=\"6119\">strategic leadership, business expansion, and real-world execution</strong>. It prepares students to take <strong data-start=\"6150\" data-end=\"6181\">high-level managerial roles</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"6184\" data-end=\"6203\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6205\" data-end=\"6437\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"6205\" data-end=\"6229\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m0hsha\" data-start=\"6230\" data-end=\"6273\">Retail Marketing and Service Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wbm5cu\" data-start=\"6274\" data-end=\"6324\">Organization Development and Change Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pbzkk4\" data-start=\"6325\" data-end=\"6374\">Indian Financial System and Financial Markets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1riwf4l\" data-start=\"6375\" data-end=\"6409\">Performance Management Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rx70fy\" data-start=\"6410\" data-end=\"6437\">Master Thesis / Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"6439\" data-end=\"6466\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6468\" data-end=\"6538\">This semester transforms you into a <strong data-start=\"6504\" data-end=\"6537\">decision-maker and strategist</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6540\" data-end=\"6811\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t171wi\" data-start=\"6540\" data-end=\"6596\">Designing <strong data-start=\"6552\" data-end=\"6596\">business growth and expansion strategies</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13mthtq\" data-start=\"6597\" data-end=\"6659\">Managing <strong data-start=\"6608\" data-end=\"6659\">organizational change and leadership challenges</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sgvrcw\" data-start=\"6660\" data-end=\"6716\">Understanding financial markets and economic systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ko1g5w\" data-start=\"6717\" data-end=\"6763\">Creating <strong data-start=\"6728\" data-end=\"6763\">performance frameworks and KPIs</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tkitg\" data-start=\"6764\" data-end=\"6811\">Working on a <strong data-start=\"6779\" data-end=\"6811\">real-world project or thesis</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"6813\" data-end=\"6835\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6837\" data-end=\"7043\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kk41wb\" data-start=\"6837\" data-end=\"6883\">Business expansion and commercial strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11j5pvs\" data-start=\"6884\" data-end=\"6925\">KPI design and performance management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iqvb0c\" data-start=\"6926\" data-end=\"6961\">Revenue optimization techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19iinwr\" data-start=\"6962\" data-end=\"6998\">Organizational change management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdopi9\" data-start=\"6999\" data-end=\"7043\">Strategic research and business insights</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"7045\" data-end=\"7073\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7075\" data-end=\"7274\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iqgs8\" data-start=\"7075\" data-end=\"7102\">Revenue growth strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rwugoj\" data-start=\"7103\" data-end=\"7148\">Marketing analytics and conversion funnel</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dypppq\" data-start=\"7149\" data-end=\"7194\">KPI development for data-driven decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"biecuv\" data-start=\"7195\" data-end=\"7239\">Business funding and capital acquisition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sti311\" data-start=\"7240\" data-end=\"7274\">Performance management systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"7276\" data-end=\"7297\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7299\" data-end=\"7474\">Your final project or thesis can significantly impact your <strong data-start=\"7358\" data-end=\"7385\">placement opportunities</strong>. Many students ignore it, but it can act as a <strong data-start=\"7432\" data-end=\"7473\">portfolio piece to impress recruiters</strong>.&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(272, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 246, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 02:23:04', '2026-06-16 06:54:19', '<p data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"439\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"135\">MBA admission process</strong> in detail is essential for securing your seat without delays, errors, or financial confusion. While the steps may appear simple on the surface, each stage involves <strong data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"366\">critical decisions, verification points, and strategic choices</strong> that directly impact your admission confirmation and overall experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"631\">This guide explains the <strong data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"507\">entire enrollment journey step by step</strong>, along with practical insights, hidden risks, and expert tips to help you complete your admission smoothly and confidently.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"636\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pxa142\" data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"708\">Step 1: Submit Application &ndash; Start Your Admission Journey Correctly</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"851\">The first step in the MBA admission process is to <strong data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"798\">submit the online application form</strong>, which acts as your official entry into the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yj1j1t\" data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"878\">What You Need to Fill</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"1044\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"88k87g\" data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"946\">Personal details (name, contact information, identity details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tnnd1m\" data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"1000\">Academic records (10th, 12th, graduation details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17d6yjp\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1044\">Program selection and basic preferences</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"841bev\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1095\">Why This Step Is More Important Than It Looks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1231\">This is not just a basic form&mdash;it is the <strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1184\">foundation of your entire admission process</strong>. The information you provide here is used for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tha142\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1269\">Initial eligibility verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j71i4p\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1300\">Future document validation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s00ep1\" data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1341\">Communication and admission tracking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1a4vzv0\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1376\">Common Mistakes Students Make</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1533\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n9xpn\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1437\">Entering incorrect marks or incomplete academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f4qhbf\" data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1478\">Using inactive email or phone number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rgezs4\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1533\">Rushing through the form without reviewing entries</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jt31xg\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1553\">Smart Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1742\">Always <strong data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1609\">double-check every detail before submission</strong>. Even small inconsistencies (like mismatched marks or spelling errors) can cause issues during verification or delay your admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1747\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tt7b22\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1816\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program &ndash; Making a Career-Defining Choice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1909\">After submitting your application, the next step is to <strong data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1908\">confirm your program enrollment</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1940\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2085\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e2z25b\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2001\">You select your preferred MBA program or specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wlujea\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2047\">You verify all previously entered details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1puk1m1\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2085\">You confirm your intent to enroll</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fjj6lv\" data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2128\">Why This Step Matters for Your Future</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2224\">This is where you decide your <strong data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2180\">career direction</strong>. Your chosen specialization will influence:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2312\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"178q088\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2257\">Job roles you can apply for</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xszf1\" data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2284\">Industry opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ddqon8\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2312\">Long-term salary growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"24cpou\" data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2340\">Common Student Mistake</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2425\">Many students choose a specialization based on trends or peer influence instead of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2485\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"138t7zq\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2448\">Personal interest</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3akl8\" data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2465\">Career goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fvqqz9\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2485\">Industry demand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2505\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2657\">Take time to evaluate your strengths and career plans before confirming enrollment. A wrong decision here can <strong data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2656\">limit your career flexibility later</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2662\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1k0dkvj\" data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2736\">Step 3: Complete Payment &ndash; Financial Planning &amp; Smart Decision-Making</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2872\">Once enrollment is confirmed, the next step is to <strong data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2817\">complete your fee payment</strong>, which moves your admission toward final confirmation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2903\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2926\">One-Time Payment</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"3014\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohza4c\" data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2964\">Pay the full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bqwy26\" data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3014\">Get a <strong data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"2989\">15% discount</strong>, reducing overall cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3048\">Education Loan / EMI Option</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3171\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"blh4ri\" data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3090\">Pay through <strong data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3088\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ove0cv\" data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3171\">Often available with <strong data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3129\">0% interest</strong>, making it easier to manage financially</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3176\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15xs7tp\" data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3214\">Choosing the Right Payment Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3340\">Selecting the right payment method is not just about affordability&mdash;it&rsquo;s about <strong data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3339\">financial strategy and long-term planning</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f8r5bc\" data-start=\"3342\" data-end=\"3373\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3508\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m914eg\" data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3418\">Students who can afford upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ir8ajk\" data-start=\"3419\" data-end=\"3463\">Those looking to <strong data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3461\">minimize total cost</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ocdqp9\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3508\">Avoiding long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lzmvu4\" data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3535\">EMI / Loan &ndash; Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3644\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"197frn1\" data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3590\">Students who prefer <strong data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3588\">flexible monthly payments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bsb6ok\" data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3644\">Those managing education alongside other expenses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9u2hd7\" data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3666\">Critical Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3830\">Many students choose EMI for convenience but overlook the <strong data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3758\">benefit of upfront discounts</strong>. Always compare the <strong data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3804\">total cost difference</strong> before making a decision.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3835\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5qr8cl\" data-start=\"3837\" data-end=\"3895\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat &ndash; Final Admission Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3897\" data-end=\"3966\">This is the final stage where your admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjl3k3\" data-start=\"3968\" data-end=\"3998\">What Happens After Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4000\" data-end=\"4157\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"69g0rb\" data-start=\"4000\" data-end=\"4047\">Your <strong data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4045\">seat in the MBA program is secured</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e267pj\" data-start=\"4048\" data-end=\"4095\">You receive official admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n6ojy8\" data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4157\">You gain access to academic systems and program resources</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"265v1c\" data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4183\">Important Conditions</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4349\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jbnjwo\" data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4262\">Admission is confirmed <strong data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4260\">only after successful payment or loan approval</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l7ilsd\" data-start=\"4263\" data-end=\"4349\">Delayed payment may result in <strong data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4311\">loss of seat</strong>, especially in high-demand programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"4351\" data-end=\"4366\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4368\" data-end=\"4508\">MBA programs often have <strong data-start=\"4392\" data-end=\"4409\">limited seats</strong>, and waiting too long after approval can result in losing your preferred specialization or intake.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"539\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"126\">MBA eligibility criteria</strong> is a crucial step for any student planning to pursue management education. While the requirements may appear straightforward, many applicants face rejection due to <strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"422\">misinterpretation of rules, incorrect assumptions about percentage calculation, or lack of clarity about eligibility conditions</strong>. This section provides a <strong data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"485\">deep, fully explanatory breakdown</strong> so you can confidently determine whether you qualify.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"544\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ebuv35\" data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"599\">Minimum Educational Qualification &ndash; Who Can Apply?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"695\">To be eligible for the MBA program, a candidate must fulfill the following academic condition:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1es1mi9\" data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"759\">Must have completed an <strong data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"759\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) degree</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hsr2it\" data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"815\">The program should be of <strong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"815\">minimum 3 years duration</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sot0vx\" data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"915\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"857\">any academic stream</strong> are eligible (Arts, Commerce, Science, Engineering, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1njdi7g\" data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"982\">The degree must be obtained from a <strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"982\">UGC-recognized university</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jwvp81\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1016\">Why This Requirement Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1228\">This ensures that all applicants have a <strong data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1123\">basic academic foundation and exposure to structured learning</strong>, which is essential for understanding advanced business concepts like finance, marketing, and analytics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1251\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1470\">Students from non-commerce or non-management backgrounds often hesitate to apply. However, MBA programs are specifically designed to <strong data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1427\">accommodate diverse academic profiles</strong>, making this eligibility highly inclusive.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jwyhd6\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1534\">Minimum Marks Requirement &ndash; Understanding the 50% Rule</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1637\">Academic performance plays a key role in MBA admissions. Candidates must meet the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1781\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1psgby\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1693\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1677\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ukzk9\" data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1781\">Equivalent grades (CGPA or letter grades) are also accepted as per university norms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wvf11s\" data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1821\">Relaxation for Reserved Categories</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1978\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4qscw\" data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1908\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1869\">SC/ST categories</strong> are eligible for a <strong data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1906\">5% relaxation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gh313x\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1978\">This means they can apply with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1978\">45% aggregate marks</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"498\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"124\">MBA fees structure</strong> is one of the most important steps before taking admission. Many students focus only on the total fee, but a smart decision requires analyzing <strong data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"358\">payment flexibility, additional costs, long-term affordability, and financial strategy</strong>. Below is a <strong data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"416\">fully detailed, SEO-optimized explanation</strong> of the MBA fee structure along with practical insights that help you plan better.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"503\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"orit9b\" data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"545\">Total MBA Fees &ndash; Overall Program Cost</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"593\">The total academic fee for the MBA program is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"634\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ikqw1x\" data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"634\"><strong data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"634\">₹1,75,000 (Complete Program Cost)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"769\">This fee covers the <strong data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"694\">entire duration of the MBA program</strong>, including academic delivery, learning resources, and core program access.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18yzclb\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"803\">What This Means for Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"1051\">Compared to traditional MBA programs that often cost ₹5&ndash;15 lakhs, this structure offers a <strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"966\">cost-effective alternative without compromising on curriculum depth</strong>, making it highly attractive for students seeking strong ROI (Return on Investment).</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1056\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"lwyo7p\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1114\">Flexible Payment Options &ndash; Choose What Suits You Best</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1273\">One of the biggest advantages of this MBA program is its <strong data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1203\">flexible payment structure</strong>, allowing students to manage their finances based on their situation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9q8v0q\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1298\">Fee Payment Options</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1687\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1319\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1337\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1349\" data-col-size=\"md\">Best For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1687\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1489\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1417\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1410\">Yearly</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1436\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹87,500 per year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1489\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students who prefer moderate financial commitment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1509\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1509\">Semester-wise</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1532\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹43,750 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1585\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students looking for smaller, manageable payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1687\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1605\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1600\">One-Time</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1630\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,75,000 full payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1687\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students aiming for simplicity and long-term planning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1692\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jhm4sp\" data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1736\">Which Payment Option Should You Choose?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1836\">Choosing the right payment mode is not just about affordability&mdash;it&rsquo;s about <strong data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1835\">financial strategy</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tn9s2j\" data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1867\">One-Time Payment Strategy</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"2022\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v2jxgz\" data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1920\">Best for students who can afford upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12du6na\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1980\">Helps avoid repeated transactions and future fee stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jtmyge\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2022\">Ideal for long-term financial clarity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6rtrz1\" data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2051\">Yearly Payment Strategy</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2178\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y33wx0\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2110\">Balanced approach between affordability and commitment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ogzq8q\" data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2178\">Suitable for students with <strong data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2176\">stable annual financial planning</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ornmp8\" data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2214\">Semester-Wise Payment Strategy</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2335\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fm0dv0\" data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2252\">Lowest immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1njulq8\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2335\">Ideal for students managing education alongside work or other responsibilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"140hypg\" data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2382\">EMI Option &ndash; Study Now, Pay Gradually</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2488\">For students who prefer not to pay upfront, <strong data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2487\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) options are available</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16lssot\" data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2513\">Key Benefits of EMI</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2663\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9twsr\" data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2570\">Converts large fees into <strong data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2568\">small monthly payments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vikkm\" data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2611\">Reduces immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fkw06a\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2663\">Makes MBA accessible without delaying education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2686\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2745\">While EMI improves affordability, students should always:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2886\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f4k98g\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2783\">Check total repayment obligations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b3g1yi\" data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2833\">Ensure consistent income or financial support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kbcv9s\" data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2886\">Avoid over-dependence on credit without planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2891\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1imxrzz\" data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2948\">Additional Fees &ndash; Important Costs Most Students Miss</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"3115\">Apart from the tuition fee, there are <strong data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3020\">mandatory additional charges</strong> depending on your location. These are often overlooked but are crucial for accurate budgeting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1woz4k1\" data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3154\">Fee Structure for Indian Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3240\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pxmkb4\" data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3198\"><strong data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3196\">₹2,500 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17o46gq\" data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3240\"><strong data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3238\">₹3,000 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nkgaye\" data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3278\">Fee Structure for SAARC Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3356\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"613tr0\" data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3314\"><strong data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3312\">₹11,250 (Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dzg920\" data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3356\"><strong data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3354\">₹3,750 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xqfgz2\" data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3402\">Fee Structure for International Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3483\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lyt09e\" data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3444\"><strong data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3442\">$150 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43rawd\" data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3483\"><strong data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3481\">$50 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"462\">A high-quality MBA curriculum is not just about subjects&mdash;it is a <strong data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"233\">carefully structured progression of knowledge, skills, and industry exposure</strong>. This program is designed to move students from <strong data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"350\">foundational understanding to advanced strategic decision-making</strong>, while simultaneously building <strong data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"434\">practical skills and professional certifications</strong> that enhance employability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"771\">Each semester plays a <strong data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"526\">specific role in your transformation</strong>, and understanding this structure helps you maximize outcomes instead of just completing the degree. Below is a <strong data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"676\">deep, fully explanatory breakdown</strong> of all four semesters, including courses, skills, certifications, and their real-world impact.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ne6tms\" data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"850\">Semester 1 &ndash; Building Core Business Foundations &amp; Analytical Thinking</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"1005\">The first semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"941\">fundamental business concepts and analytical frameworks</strong>, which form the base for all advanced learning in later stages.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1026\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1257\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1050\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rf69vv\" data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1078\">Sustainability &amp; Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5ih8i\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1122\">Financial Reporting &amp; Corporate Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1of72ks\" data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1181\">Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9vwaxg\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1232\">Quantitative Techniques for Business Decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1257\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1286\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1387\">This semester shifts your thinking from academic learning to <strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1386\">business-oriented problem-solving</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1413\">You begin to understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1790\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187tdi3\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1471\">How <strong data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1469\">economic principles drive business decisions</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"elm6my\" data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1540\">The importance of <strong data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1538\">ethical and sustainable business practices</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dlzmh4\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1618\">Financial systems including <strong data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1616\">corporate finance and reporting standards</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vjnhf\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1674\">Human behavior in organizations and <strong data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1672\">HR dynamics</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xlbma5\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1735\">Data-driven decision-making using <strong data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1733\">quantitative tools</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3w6gs\" data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1790\">The role of <strong data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1788\">AI in modern business environments</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1819\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1906\">You gain a strong mix of <strong data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1894\">analytical, financial, and managerial skills</strong>, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"2332\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n8z6fy\" data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1952\">Managerial economics and market analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ezovcu\" data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"2010\">Organizational behavior and macroeconomic application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ifzwn\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2063\">ESG (Environmental, Social, Governance) analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v5nfa1\" data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2108\">Ethical leadership and business strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sv2syo\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2157\">Financial modelling and accounting standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1thui2i\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2196\">HR analytics and talent management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frzo8w\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2247\">Data analysis (regression, hypothesis testing)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5o7x68\" data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2293\">AI fundamentals and business applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2560j\" data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2332\">Time Value of Money (TVM) analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2337\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7fyvrp\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2366\">Certification Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2440\">Students are introduced to <strong data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2430\">career-enhancing certifications</strong>, such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2682\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2u51e\" data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2482\">Negotiation and communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iv4rt0\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2526\">Business writing and executive presence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poihj4\" data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2565\">Professional networking strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdun9m\" data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2597\">Cross-cultural intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gyduj5\" data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2637\">Risk management and design thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"if7ine\" data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2682\">Data visualization for business insights</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2687\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2710\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2896\">This semester is the <strong data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2767\">foundation of your MBA journey</strong>. Students who build strong conceptual clarity here perform significantly better in analytics, finance, and strategy roles later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2901\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13955ta\" data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2966\">Semester 2 &ndash; Functional Expertise &amp; Business Decision-Making</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3122\">The second semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3050\">core business functions and practical execution</strong>, helping students understand how organizations operate in real markets.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3143\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3303\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3165\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"3166\" data-end=\"3190\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ngrelz\" data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3214\">Operations Research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k770wv\" data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3254\">Business Law &amp; Corporate Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1psm699\" data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3303\">Business Analytics &amp; Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3308\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3337\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3420\">At this stage, you start applying concepts to <strong data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3419\">real-world business situations</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3748\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"148gggx\" data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3482\">How to <strong data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3480\">build and scale a business (entrepreneurship)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kbggaa\" data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3550\">Creating <strong data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3548\">marketing strategies and customer targeting models</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mm5rom\" data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3614\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3612\">legal frameworks and corporate governance</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulkjyg\" data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3677\">Solving business problems using <strong data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3675\">analytics and AI tools</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s958sc\" data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3748\">Improving operational efficiency using <strong data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3746\">quantitative techniques</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3753\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3777\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"4063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12zoe2z\" data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3829\">Corporate governance and regulatory compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b4bwej\" data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3874\">Product lifecycle and pricing strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2faid5\" data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3919\">Marketing communication and segmentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4xijua\" data-start=\"3920\" data-end=\"3965\">Linear programming and project scheduling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12wwuoq\" data-start=\"3966\" data-end=\"4007\">Advanced Excel and business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lk5rv\" data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4063\">Entrepreneurial thinking and opportunity evaluation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4065\" data-end=\"4068\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7fyvrp\" data-start=\"4070\" data-end=\"4097\">Certification Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4179\">This semester introduces certifications aligned with <strong data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4178\">modern business trends</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4468\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ad8scp\" data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4227\">Digital transformation and cloud computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14v3ohk\" data-start=\"4228\" data-end=\"4271\">AI strategy and consulting fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0jphv\" data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4325\">Product management and customer experience design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b4wyhm\" data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4372\">Supply chain management and agile analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12va53h\" data-start=\"4373\" data-end=\"4413\">Data tools like Power BI and Tableau</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vqffyt\" data-start=\"4414\" data-end=\"4468\">Influencing, PR, and business communication skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4473\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"4475\" data-end=\"4496\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4693\">This semester is critical for <strong data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4557\">choosing your career path</strong>. Your interest and performance here often determine whether you move toward <strong data-start=\"4634\" data-end=\"4692\">marketing, analytics, HR, finance, or entrepreneurship</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4695\" data-end=\"4698\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xu5dlj\" data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4763\">Semester 3 &ndash; Specialization, Research &amp; Industry Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4765\" data-end=\"4921\">The third semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"4795\" data-end=\"4867\">advanced application, specialization, and real-world problem-solving</strong>. This is where you start becoming <strong data-start=\"4902\" data-end=\"4920\">industry-ready</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"4923\" data-end=\"4942\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4944\" data-end=\"5138\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zoxbqz\" data-start=\"4944\" data-end=\"4973\">Business Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"4974\" data-end=\"4999\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gsyan\" data-start=\"5000\" data-end=\"5037\">Talent Acquisition and Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fzn3ka\" data-start=\"5038\" data-end=\"5077\">Industrial Relations and Labor Laws</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bsj24k\" data-start=\"5078\" data-end=\"5112\">Consumer Behavior and Insights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n3p35q\" data-start=\"5113\" data-end=\"5138\">Market Research Tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5140\" data-end=\"5143\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"5145\" data-end=\"5172\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5174\" data-end=\"5240\">This semester emphasizes <strong data-start=\"5199\" data-end=\"5239\">deep analysis and business execution</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5242\" data-end=\"5594\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"142al9\" data-start=\"5242\" data-end=\"5310\">Conducting <strong data-start=\"5255\" data-end=\"5308\">business research and data-driven decision-making</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9nmqct\" data-start=\"5311\" data-end=\"5374\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"5327\" data-end=\"5372\">consumer psychology and behavior patterns</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e0zo6l\" data-start=\"5375\" data-end=\"5441\">Managing <strong data-start=\"5386\" data-end=\"5439\">operations, supply chains, and efficiency systems</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tt0nbd\" data-start=\"5442\" data-end=\"5529\">Learning HR processes including <strong data-start=\"5476\" data-end=\"5527\">recruitment, workforce planning, and compliance</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jpihas\" data-start=\"5530\" data-end=\"5594\">Applying <strong data-start=\"5541\" data-end=\"5592\">market research tools for insights and strategy</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5596\" data-end=\"5599\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"5601\" data-end=\"5623\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5625\" data-end=\"5705\">This semester offers one of the <strong data-start=\"5657\" data-end=\"5693\">most skill-intensive experiences</strong>, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5707\" data-end=\"6032\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1447rg9\" data-start=\"5707\" data-end=\"5756\">Research design, sampling, and survey methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ev1u5z\" data-start=\"5757\" data-end=\"5793\">Inventory and quality management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y2oyol\" data-start=\"5794\" data-end=\"5835\">Market research and consumer insights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fanxkr\" data-start=\"5836\" data-end=\"5878\">CRM and customer engagement strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m1dj4x\" data-start=\"5879\" data-end=\"5939\">Talent acquisition, HR analytics, and workforce planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12hmsk\" data-start=\"5940\" data-end=\"5989\">Industrial relations and labor law compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hijpt4\" data-start=\"5990\" data-end=\"6032\">Operations and supply chain management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6034\" data-end=\"6037\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7fyvrp\" data-start=\"6039\" data-end=\"6066\">Certification Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6068\" data-end=\"6112\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cqwozq\" data-start=\"6068\" data-end=\"6112\">Human resource compensation and benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6114\" data-end=\"6117\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"6119\" data-end=\"6140\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6142\" data-end=\"6322\">This is the stage where your profile becomes <strong data-start=\"6187\" data-end=\"6206\">placement-ready</strong>. Students who actively work on projects, research, and tools here gain a <strong data-start=\"6280\" data-end=\"6321\">major advantage during job interviews</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6324\" data-end=\"6327\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16npsms\" data-start=\"6329\" data-end=\"6384\">Semester 4 &ndash; Strategy, Leadership &amp; Career Execution</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6386\" data-end=\"6533\">The final semester is focused on <strong data-start=\"6419\" data-end=\"6491\">strategic thinking, leadership development, and real-world execution</strong>, preparing students for managerial roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"6535\" data-end=\"6554\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6556\" data-end=\"6781\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"6556\" data-end=\"6580\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m0hsha\" data-start=\"6581\" data-end=\"6624\">Retail Marketing and Service Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y2f0fp\" data-start=\"6625\" data-end=\"6667\">Digital Marketing and Brand Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1riwf4l\" data-start=\"6668\" data-end=\"6702\">Performance Management Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wbm5cu\" data-start=\"6703\" data-end=\"6753\">Organization Development and Change Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rx70fy\" data-start=\"6754\" data-end=\"6781\">Master Thesis / Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6783\" data-end=\"6786\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"6788\" data-end=\"6815\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6817\" data-end=\"6887\">This semester transforms you into a <strong data-start=\"6853\" data-end=\"6886\">decision-maker and strategist</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6889\" data-end=\"7172\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7scs57\" data-start=\"6889\" data-end=\"6937\">Developing <strong data-start=\"6902\" data-end=\"6935\">long-term business strategies</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mkqmaj\" data-start=\"6938\" data-end=\"6999\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"6954\" data-end=\"6997\">digital marketing and brand positioning</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"198h81l\" data-start=\"7000\" data-end=\"7066\">Managing organizational performance using <strong data-start=\"7044\" data-end=\"7064\">KPIs and metrics</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ppg3y\" data-start=\"7067\" data-end=\"7123\">Leading <strong data-start=\"7077\" data-end=\"7121\">organizational change and transformation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yj3uhq\" data-start=\"7124\" data-end=\"7172\">Executing a <strong data-start=\"7138\" data-end=\"7170\">real-world project or thesis</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7174\" data-end=\"7177\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"7179\" data-end=\"7201\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7203\" data-end=\"7483\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p9z7ih\" data-start=\"7203\" data-end=\"7248\">Strategic planning and business expansion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oh1wdh\" data-start=\"7249\" data-end=\"7286\">Digital and performance marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w5q016\" data-start=\"7287\" data-end=\"7340\">Brand strategy and customer experience management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5rhgt\" data-start=\"7341\" data-end=\"7390\">Marketing analytics and data-driven decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rpx7en\" data-start=\"7391\" data-end=\"7436\">Organizational development and leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nr83kq\" data-start=\"7437\" data-end=\"7483\">Stakeholder management and decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7485\" data-end=\"7488\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7fyvrp\" data-start=\"7490\" data-end=\"7517\">Certification Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7519\" data-end=\"7582\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yvn866\" data-start=\"7519\" data-end=\"7549\">Content marketing strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fofvrn\" data-start=\"7550\" data-end=\"7582\">Brand design and positioning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7584\" data-end=\"7587\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"7589\" data-end=\"7610\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7612\" data-end=\"7824\">Your <strong data-start=\"7617\" data-end=\"7644\">final project or thesis</strong> can act as a <strong data-start=\"7658\" data-end=\"7684\">career-launching asset</strong>. Many recruiters evaluate candidates based on their practical work, making this one of the most important components of the entire program.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 175000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(274, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 247, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 02:39:57', '2026-06-16 06:57:37', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"391\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"127\">MBA admission process</strong> is essential for students who want a <strong data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"209\">smooth, error-free enrollment experience</strong>. While the steps may appear simple, each stage involves <strong data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"339\">important decisions, verification checkpoints, and financial planning</strong>, which directly impact your admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"562\">This guide explains the <strong data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"490\">complete admission process in a structured and highly detailed manner</strong>, helping you avoid mistakes and make informed decisions at every stage.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"567\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"mh5pvt\" data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"629\">Step 1: Submit Application &ndash; Start Your Admission Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"767\">The first step is to <strong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"703\">fill out and submit the online application form</strong>, which acts as the foundation of your entire admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qitdjh\" data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"797\">What You Need to Provide</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"957\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"88k87g\" data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"865\">Personal details (name, contact information, identity details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tnnd1m\" data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"919\">Academic records (10th, 12th, graduation details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1smgj27\" data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"957\">Program selection and preferences</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fg0bqg\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"989\">Why This Step Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1115\">This is not just a basic form&mdash;it is your <strong data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1072\">official academic profile submission</strong>. The university uses this information for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1215\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qkkbh8\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1145\">Eligibility verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cfknkx\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1175\">Communication and updates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vd1q4y\" data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1215\">Document validation in later stages</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1245\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1392\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n9xpn\" data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1306\">Entering incorrect marks or incomplete academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0fcec\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1350\">Using an inactive email or phone number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fv0h9t\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1392\">Submitting without reviewing the form</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"oagcgz\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1411\">Strategic Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1586\">Always <strong data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1471\">double-check your information before submission</strong>. Even small errors (like incorrect percentages or spelling mistakes) can create complications during verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1591\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rpfzkj\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1655\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program &ndash; Confirm Your Academic Path</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1751\">After submitting the application, the next step is to <strong data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1750\">select and confirm your MBA program</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1782\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1901\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k0pgc5\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1832\">Choose your preferred specialization/program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sjoird\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1873\">Verify all details submitted earlier</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z30nxr\" data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1901\">Confirm your enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kwr939\" data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1932\">Why This Step Is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2028\">This is where you define your <strong data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1984\">career direction</strong>. Your chosen specialization will influence:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2118\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rkr526\" data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2068\">Job roles and career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvphi9\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2090\">Industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ddqon8\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2118\">Long-term salary growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xvkk9r\" data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2152\">Common Mistake Students Make</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2229\">Many students choose programs based on trends or peer pressure rather than:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2290\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gipeh1\" data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2253\">Personal interests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3akl8\" data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2270\">Career goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fvqqz9\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2290\">Industry demand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2310\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2441\">Take time to evaluate your goals before confirming enrollment. A wrong choice here can <strong data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2440\">limit your career opportunities later</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2446\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1upc974\" data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2511\">Step 3: Complete Payment &ndash; Choose the Right Financial Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2643\">Once your enrollment is confirmed, you need to <strong data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2588\">complete the fee payment</strong>, which moves your admission toward final confirmation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2674\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2697\">One-Time Payment</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2789\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohza4c\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2735\">Pay the full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tt3luf\" data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2789\">Get a <strong data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2760\">15% discount</strong>, reducing the overall cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2823\">Education Loan / EMI Option</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2938\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"blh4ri\" data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2865\">Pay through <strong data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2863\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"53zu15\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2938\">Often available with <strong data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2904\">0% interest</strong>, making it financially flexible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"2943\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19rto43\" data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2985\">How to Choose the Best Payment Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3082\">Choosing the right payment mode is a <strong data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3056\">strategic financial decision</strong>, not just a payment step.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f8r5bc\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3115\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3260\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m914eg\" data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3160\">Students who can afford upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tbozym\" data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3215\">Those who want to <strong data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3213\">save money through discounts</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ocdqp9\" data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3260\">Avoiding long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lzmvu4\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3287\">EMI / Loan &ndash; Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3396\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"197frn1\" data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3342\">Students who prefer <strong data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3340\">flexible monthly payments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bsb6ok\" data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3396\">Those managing education alongside other expenses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"3398\" data-end=\"3419\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3579\">Many students choose EMI for convenience but ignore the <strong data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3519\">cost-saving benefit of upfront payment</strong>. Always compare the total financial impact before deciding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3584\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5qr8cl\" data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3644\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat &ndash; Final Admission Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3714\">This is the final step where your admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjl3k3\" data-start=\"3716\" data-end=\"3746\">What Happens After Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3897\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"69g0rb\" data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3795\">Your <strong data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3793\">seat in the MBA program is secured</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e267pj\" data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3843\">You receive official admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ynof2s\" data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3897\">You gain access to academic systems and resources</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"265v1c\" data-start=\"3899\" data-end=\"3923\">Important Conditions</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"4091\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jbnjwo\" data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"4002\">Admission is confirmed <strong data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"4000\">only after successful payment or loan approval</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3u3qjl\" data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4091\">Delays in payment can result in <strong data-start=\"4037\" data-end=\"4053\">loss of seat</strong>, especially in high-demand programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"4093\" data-end=\"4108\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4110\" data-end=\"4237\">Seats are often limited, and waiting too long after approval can cause you to <strong data-start=\"4188\" data-end=\"4236\">miss your preferred intake or specialization</strong>.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"569\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"136\">MBA eligibility criteria</strong> is a critical first step for any student planning to pursue management education. While the requirements may seem simple at first glance, many applicants face rejection due to <strong data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"432\">misinterpretation of rules, incorrect percentage calculation, or incomplete understanding of eligibility conditions</strong>. This section provides a <strong data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"495\">deep, fully explanatory breakdown</strong> so you can confidently assess your eligibility and avoid common mistakes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"574\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kzmz8\" data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"637\">Minimum Educational Qualification &ndash; Who Can Apply for MBA?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"725\">To apply for the MBA program, candidates must meet the following academic requirement:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"1268\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10bj641\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"791\">Must have completed an <strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"789\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) degree</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mok0cl\" data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"848\">The degree should be of <strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"846\">minimum 3 years duration</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cfddvc\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"941\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"881\">any stream</strong> are eligible (Arts, Commerce, Science, Engineering, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cquiqa\" data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1001\">The degree must be from a <strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"999\">UGC-recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tu21s7\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1128\"><strong data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1126\">Candidates appearing for Class 12 earlier and now completing graduation are eligible as per standard progression norms</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"agz2ls\" data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1268\"><strong data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1207\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling) candidates are also eligible</strong>, provided their graduation is from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dglr5x\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1307\">Why This Requirement Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1541\">This ensures that students entering the MBA program have a <strong data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1433\">basic academic foundation and exposure to structured learning</strong>, which is essential for understanding advanced subjects like finance, marketing, operations, and analytics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"123vz07\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1558\">Key Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1811\">MBA programs are designed to be <strong data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1612\">highly inclusive</strong>, allowing students from diverse academic backgrounds to transition into management roles. Even if you do not have prior business knowledge, the curriculum starts with fundamentals to bridge the gap.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1816\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"g93xx3\" data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1879\">Minimum Marks Requirement &ndash; Understanding the 50% Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1954\">Academic performance plays a significant role in determining eligibility:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2102\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1dofx\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2022\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1994\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in graduation is required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4e6cht\" data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2102\">Equivalent <strong data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2063\">CGPA or grading systems</strong> are accepted as per university norms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wvf11s\" data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2142\">Relaxation for Reserved Categories</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2294\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4qscw\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2229\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2190\">SC/ST categories</strong> are eligible for a <strong data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2227\">5% relaxation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tl907g\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2294\">Minimum required marks for these categories: <strong data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2294\">45% aggregate</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2299\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1sfh339\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2358\">How to Calculate Your Eligibility Percentage Correctly</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2425\">This is one of the most misunderstood aspects of MBA eligibility.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2609\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q1avki\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2526\">The percentage is calculated based on <strong data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2499\">all semesters/years combined</strong>, not just the final year</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iudere\" data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2609\">Backlogs, re-evaluations, or grade conversions can impact your final aggregate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10clvjd\" data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2638\">Common Mistake to Avoid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2830\">Many students assume they are eligible based on <strong data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2714\">final-year marks alone</strong>, which can lead to disqualification later. Always calculate your <strong data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2813\">overall graduation percentage</strong> before applying.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2835\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1as5pk5\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2912\">Eligibility for Final-Year Students &ndash; Apply Before Graduation Completion</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2988\">Students who are still completing their degree are also eligible to apply:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3128\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j6ax5x\" data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3076\">Candidates who are in the <strong data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3064\">final semester of their Bachelor&rsquo;s program</strong> can apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14yvqy\" data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3128\">Admission is granted on a <strong data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3126\">provisional basis</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aql1h1\" data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3166\">What Provisional Admission Means</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3378\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sktpxp\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3235\">You can secure admission before your final results are declared</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9y5gx\" data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3303\">You must complete your graduation within the specified timeline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yghmph\" data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3378\">You must still meet the <strong data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3378\">minimum percentage requirement after results</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3395\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3530\">If your final results fall below the required eligibility criteria, your admission may be <strong data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3500\">cancelled</strong>, even after initial approval.</p>', '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"481\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"133\">MBA fees structure</strong> is not just about knowing the total amount&mdash;it&rsquo;s about making a <strong data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"225\">smart financial decision</strong> that aligns with your budget, career goals, and long-term return on investment. Many students focus only on the headline fee and ignore payment flexibility, additional charges, and hidden cost implications, which can lead to poor financial planning later.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"701\">This section provides a <strong data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"552\">fully detailed, SEO-optimized explanation</strong> of the MBA fee structure, including payment options, additional fees, real cost estimation, and expert insights to help you make the right decision.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"706\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"s6q2np\" data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"754\">Total MBA Fees &ndash; Overall Program Investment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"793\">The total fee for the MBA program is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"830\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmwtjz\" data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"830\"><strong data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"830\">₹1,75,000 (Full Program Cost)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"977\">This amount covers the <strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"896\">complete academic duration of the MBA</strong>, including access to course content, learning platforms, and academic resources.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18yzclb\" data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1011\">What This Means for Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1260\">Compared to traditional MBA programs that often cost between ₹5&ndash;15 lakhs, this program offers a <strong data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1182\">cost-effective alternative with strong academic and skill-based value</strong>, making it ideal for students looking for <strong data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1259\">high ROI at a lower investment</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1265\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pj8wj7\" data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1335\">Flexible Payment Options &ndash; Designed for Every Financial Situation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1508\">One of the biggest advantages of this MBA program is its <strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1424\">flexible payment structure</strong>, allowing students to choose how they want to pay based on their financial comfort.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9q8v0q\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1533\">Fee Payment Options</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1925\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1589\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1589\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1556\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1576\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1589\" data-col-size=\"md\">Ideal For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1925\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1732\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1664\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1663\">One-Time Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1683\">₹1,75,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1732\">Students who want to avoid future liabilities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1825\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1756\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1753\">Yearly Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1775\">₹87,500 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1825\">Students who prefer structured annual payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1925\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1849\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1845\">Semester-Wise</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1872\">₹43,750 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1925\">Students looking for low upfront financial burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1930\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1az62do\" data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1995\">Choosing the Right Payment Option &ndash; Strategic Decision Guide</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2139\">Selecting the right payment method is not just about affordability&mdash;it&rsquo;s about <strong data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2138\">minimizing cost and managing financial pressure effectively</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"m5lybm\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2190\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Cost Optimization Strategy</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2343\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v2jxgz\" data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2244\">Best for students who can afford upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"shw4aw\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2294\">Eliminates the need for repeated transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"153ymtc\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2343\">Helps in better long-term financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h8a7mp\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2383\">Yearly Payment &ndash; Balanced Approach</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2503\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jzfu8l\" data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2447\">Divides the total cost into manageable yearly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hrqh75\" data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2503\">Suitable for students with stable financial support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y60ngx\" data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2552\">Semester-Wise Payment &ndash; Maximum Flexibility</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2664\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fm0dv0\" data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2591\">Lowest immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmx1e2\" data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2664\">Ideal for students managing studies alongside work or other expenses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2669\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vma1bn\" data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2735\">EMI Option &ndash; Financial Flexibility Without Delaying Education</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2888\">The program also offers <strong data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2806\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) options</strong>, making it easier for students to pursue MBA without paying the full fee upfront.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k49m0a\" data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2909\">Benefits of EMI</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"3072\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9twsr\" data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2966\">Converts large fees into <strong data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2964\">small monthly payments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lzgtv\" data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"3005\">Reduces immediate financial stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g0k3iv\" data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3072\">Makes higher education accessible to a wider range of students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"thivjj\" data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3105\">Important Financial Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3157\">While EMI improves affordability, students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3329\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rs28k3\" data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3209\">Evaluate total repayment commitments carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z8wwi6\" data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3259\">Ensure consistent income or financial backing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yp6bz1\" data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3329\">Avoid choosing EMI purely for convenience without cost comparison</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3331\" data-end=\"3334\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f7o6wj\" data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3392\">Additional Fees &ndash; Mandatory Charges You Must Consider</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3577\">Apart from tuition fees, there are <strong data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3461\">additional mandatory charges</strong> that vary based on the student&rsquo;s location. These are often overlooked but are essential for accurate cost planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1woz4k1\" data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3616\">Fee Structure for Indian Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3702\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pxmkb4\" data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3660\"><strong data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3658\">₹2,500 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17o46gq\" data-start=\"3661\" data-end=\"3702\"><strong data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3700\">₹3,000 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nkgaye\" data-start=\"3704\" data-end=\"3740\">Fee Structure for SAARC Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3742\" data-end=\"3818\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"613tr0\" data-start=\"3742\" data-end=\"3776\"><strong data-start=\"3744\" data-end=\"3774\">₹11,250 (Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dzg920\" data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"3818\"><strong data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3816\">₹3,750 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xqfgz2\" data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3864\">Fee Structure for International Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3945\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lyt09e\" data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3906\"><strong data-start=\"3868\" data-end=\"3904\">$150 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43rawd\" data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3945\"><strong data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"3943\">$50 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"501\">A well-designed MBA curriculum is more than a list of subjects&mdash;it is a <strong data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"207\">strategically layered learning journey</strong> that transforms a student into a <strong data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"301\">business professional, decision-maker, and future leader</strong>. This program is structured across four semesters, where each phase builds on the previous one to develop <strong data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"500\">strong fundamentals, functional expertise, analytical capability, and strategic thinking</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"777\">What makes this curriculum powerful is its integration of <strong data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"642\">industry-relevant skills, AI-driven learning, and professional certifications</strong>, ensuring that students are not just academically qualified but also <strong data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"776\">job-ready and competitive in the modern business environment</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"910\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"844\">deep, fully explanatory breakdown of each semester</strong>, including courses, skills, certifications, and real-world value.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"915\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b89h38\" data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"987\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundation Building with Business, Finance &amp; Analytics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1145\">The first semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1049\">core business fundamentals</strong>, helping students build a strong base in economics, finance, human behavior, and data analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1166\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1397\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1190\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rf69vv\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1218\">Sustainability &amp; Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5ih8i\" data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1262\">Financial Reporting &amp; Corporate Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1of72ks\" data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1321\">Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9vwaxg\" data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1372\">Quantitative Techniques for Business Decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1397\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1402\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1431\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1556\">This semester is designed to shift your mindset from theoretical learning to <strong data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1555\">analytical and business-oriented thinking</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1582\">You begin to understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1979\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18vi4v6\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1644\">How <strong data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1642\">economic principles influence business decisions</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ioqeqb\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1715\">The role of <strong data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1713\">ethical and sustainable practices in organizations</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dlzmh4\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1793\">Financial systems including <strong data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1791\">corporate finance and reporting standards</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ucp13n\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1861\">Human behavior and its impact on <strong data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1859\">organizational performance</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xlbma5\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1922\">Data-driven decision-making using <strong data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1920\">quantitative tools</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1km3n2p\" data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1979\">Introduction to <strong data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1977\">AI and its business applications</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"1984\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2008\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2104\">This semester builds a strong combination of <strong data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2103\">analytical, financial, and managerial skills</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n8z6fy\" data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2150\">Managerial economics and market analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ifzwn\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2203\">ESG (Environmental, Social, Governance) analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v5nfa1\" data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2248\">Ethical leadership and business strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sv2syo\" data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2297\">Financial modelling and accounting standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iwev16\" data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2336\">Talent management and HR analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulmhya\" data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2397\">Descriptive analysis, regression, and hypothesis testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mqr712\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2439\">LLM fundamentals and AI understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2560j\" data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2478\">Time Value of Money (TVM) analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2483\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2513\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2604\">Students gain access to certifications focused on <strong data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2603\">professional and analytical growth</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2823\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qmzthi\" data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2648\">Negotiation and business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nj0qck\" data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2686\">Executive presence and networking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdun9m\" data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2718\">Cross-cultural intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15l6kp1\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2749\">Risk management strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ry6d7w\" data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2784\">Design thinking and innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vma4xo\" data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2823\">Data visualization and AI literacy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2828\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2851\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"3021\">Semester 1 is the <strong data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2906\">most important foundation phase</strong>. Weak understanding here can create difficulties in advanced subjects like analytics, finance, and strategy later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3026\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cwox5y\" data-start=\"3028\" data-end=\"3085\">Semester 2 &ndash; Functional Expertise &amp; Business Execution</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3239\">The second semester moves toward <strong data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3174\">core business functions and real-world application</strong>, helping students understand how businesses operate and compete.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"3241\" data-end=\"3260\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3420\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3282\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3307\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ngrelz\" data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3331\">Operations Research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k770wv\" data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3371\">Business Law &amp; Corporate Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1psm699\" data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3420\">Business Analytics &amp; Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3425\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3454\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3515\">This semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3514\">execution and decision-making</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3832\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"148gggx\" data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3577\">How to <strong data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3575\">build and scale a business (entrepreneurship)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kbggaa\" data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3645\">Creating <strong data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3643\">marketing strategies and customer targeting models</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mm5rom\" data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3709\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3707\">legal frameworks and corporate governance</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulkjyg\" data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3772\">Solving business problems using <strong data-start=\"3744\" data-end=\"3770\">analytics and AI tools</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g2fk1m\" data-start=\"3773\" data-end=\"3832\">Improving operations through <strong data-start=\"3804\" data-end=\"3830\">data-driven techniques</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3837\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3861\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"4149\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12zoe2z\" data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3913\">Corporate governance and regulatory compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1js0bot\" data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"3956\">Product lifecycle and pricing strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2mdop0\" data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"4007\">Market segmentation and communication planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4xijua\" data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4053\">Linear programming and project scheduling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12wwuoq\" data-start=\"4054\" data-end=\"4095\">Advanced Excel and business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"trdhkv\" data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4149\">Entrepreneurial thinking and opportunity analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4154\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"4156\" data-end=\"4184\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4246\">Certifications are aligned with <strong data-start=\"4218\" data-end=\"4245\">modern industry demands</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4248\" data-end=\"4489\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ad8scp\" data-start=\"4248\" data-end=\"4294\">Digital transformation and cloud computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14v3ohk\" data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4338\">AI strategy and consulting fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"70mbup\" data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4385\">Product management and customer experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xdlbwc\" data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4441\">Supply chain management and agile business analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a0u78s\" data-start=\"4442\" data-end=\"4489\">Power BI and Tableau for data visualization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4491\" data-end=\"4494\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"4496\" data-end=\"4517\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4519\" data-end=\"4702\">This semester is crucial for <strong data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4578\">career direction selection</strong>. Your interest and performance here influence whether you move into marketing, HR, finance, analytics, or entrepreneurship.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4704\" data-end=\"4707\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18zc5ni\" data-start=\"4709\" data-end=\"4777\">Semester 3 &ndash; Specialization, Finance, HR &amp; Operational Excellence</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4779\" data-end=\"4936\">The third semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"4809\" data-end=\"4873\">advanced application, specialization, and industry readiness</strong>, where students start handling <strong data-start=\"4905\" data-end=\"4935\">complex business scenarios</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"4938\" data-end=\"4957\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4959\" data-end=\"5203\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zoxbqz\" data-start=\"4959\" data-end=\"4988\">Business Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"4989\" data-end=\"5014\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gequhr\" data-start=\"5015\" data-end=\"5044\">Direct and Indirect Taxes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wq9qrd\" data-start=\"5045\" data-end=\"5093\">Investment Analysis and Portfolio Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gsyan\" data-start=\"5094\" data-end=\"5131\">Talent Acquisition and Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fpdrmb\" data-start=\"5132\" data-end=\"5178\">Employee Management and Negotiation Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"thsz5s\" data-start=\"5179\" data-end=\"5203\">Open Elective Course</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5205\" data-end=\"5208\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"5210\" data-end=\"5237\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5239\" data-end=\"5304\">This semester emphasizes <strong data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5303\">real-world business problem-solving</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5306\" data-end=\"5603\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19yykxn\" data-start=\"5306\" data-end=\"5365\">Conducting <strong data-start=\"5319\" data-end=\"5363\">research and data-driven decision-making</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"svfl1k\" data-start=\"5366\" data-end=\"5418\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"5382\" data-end=\"5416\">taxation and financial systems</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9ubvcs\" data-start=\"5419\" data-end=\"5462\">Managing <strong data-start=\"5430\" data-end=\"5460\">investments and portfolios</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"188hhr2\" data-start=\"5463\" data-end=\"5546\">Handling <strong data-start=\"5474\" data-end=\"5544\">HR processes like recruitment, negotiation, and workforce planning</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ed5f4j\" data-start=\"5547\" data-end=\"5603\">Improving <strong data-start=\"5559\" data-end=\"5601\">operations and supply chain efficiency</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5605\" data-end=\"5608\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"5610\" data-end=\"5632\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5697\">This semester offers a <strong data-start=\"5657\" data-end=\"5696\">high-intensity skill-building phase</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5699\" data-end=\"6013\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ev1u5z\" data-start=\"5699\" data-end=\"5735\">Inventory and quality management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5h6z10\" data-start=\"5736\" data-end=\"5778\">Market research and data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"krql0i\" data-start=\"5779\" data-end=\"5829\">Competitive intelligence and business insights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kbzyka\" data-start=\"5830\" data-end=\"5877\">Investment analysis and financial modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x6qdt4\" data-start=\"5878\" data-end=\"5920\">Supply chain and operations management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r2jyhs\" data-start=\"5921\" data-end=\"5964\">Employer branding and HR systems (HRIS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1spsjpo\" data-start=\"5965\" data-end=\"6013\">Fundamental and technical financial analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6015\" data-end=\"6018\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"6020\" data-end=\"6048\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6050\" data-end=\"6217\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dbksr3\" data-start=\"6050\" data-end=\"6082\">AI-driven HR decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cb1c2f\" data-start=\"6083\" data-end=\"6121\">International business and finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xkqsa7\" data-start=\"6122\" data-end=\"6177\">Technical recruiting and LinkedIn recruitment tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14154gf\" data-start=\"6178\" data-end=\"6217\">Strategies for external recruitment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6219\" data-end=\"6222\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"6224\" data-end=\"6245\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6247\" data-end=\"6409\">This is the <strong data-start=\"6259\" data-end=\"6290\">placement preparation phase</strong>. Students who actively work on tools, analytics, and projects here gain a <strong data-start=\"6365\" data-end=\"6408\">significant advantage in job interviews</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6411\" data-end=\"6414\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kld7c3\" data-start=\"6416\" data-end=\"6475\">Semester 4 &ndash; Strategy, Leadership &amp; Real-World Execution</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6477\" data-end=\"6614\">The final semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"6507\" data-end=\"6572\">strategic thinking, leadership, and real-world implementation</strong>, preparing students for managerial roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"6616\" data-end=\"6635\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6637\" data-end=\"6894\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"6637\" data-end=\"6661\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1riwf4l\" data-start=\"6662\" data-end=\"6696\">Performance Management Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wbm5cu\" data-start=\"6697\" data-end=\"6747\">Organization Development and Change Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pbzkk4\" data-start=\"6748\" data-end=\"6797\">Indian Financial System and Financial Markets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16fmr0r\" data-start=\"6798\" data-end=\"6866\">Risk Management and Behavioural Finance / Performance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rx70fy\" data-start=\"6867\" data-end=\"6894\">Master Thesis / Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6896\" data-end=\"6899\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"6901\" data-end=\"6928\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6930\" data-end=\"6995\">This semester transforms you into a <strong data-start=\"6966\" data-end=\"6994\">strategic decision-maker</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6997\" data-end=\"7298\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dof5do\" data-start=\"6997\" data-end=\"7057\">Designing <strong data-start=\"7009\" data-end=\"7055\">business growth and competitive strategies</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ojdh9k\" data-start=\"7058\" data-end=\"7110\">Managing <strong data-start=\"7069\" data-end=\"7108\">organizational performance and KPIs</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"niuqg9\" data-start=\"7111\" data-end=\"7170\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"7127\" data-end=\"7168\">financial markets and risk management</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eufpi6\" data-start=\"7171\" data-end=\"7249\">Exploring modern systems like <strong data-start=\"7203\" data-end=\"7247\">FinTech, blockchain, and digital banking</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yj3uhq\" data-start=\"7250\" data-end=\"7298\">Executing a <strong data-start=\"7264\" data-end=\"7296\">real-world project or thesis</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7300\" data-end=\"7303\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"7305\" data-end=\"7327\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7329\" data-end=\"7652\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"63fx4k\" data-start=\"7329\" data-end=\"7374\">Strategic marketing and business planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mqvzhn\" data-start=\"7375\" data-end=\"7418\">Financial risk and derivatives analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yqldhh\" data-start=\"7419\" data-end=\"7462\">Customer experience and retail strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g3gop9\" data-start=\"7463\" data-end=\"7494\">Data-driven decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ompfdt\" data-start=\"7495\" data-end=\"7553\">FinTech ecosystem understanding (UPI, Neo-banks, APIs)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dy9hiw\" data-start=\"7554\" data-end=\"7601\">KPI, KRA, and balanced scorecard frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ssi2l2\" data-start=\"7602\" data-end=\"7652\">Organizational development and global strategy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7654\" data-end=\"7657\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"7659\" data-end=\"7687\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7689\" data-end=\"7799\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qwj58c\" data-start=\"7689\" data-end=\"7722\">Business banking fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kofj9e\" data-start=\"7723\" data-end=\"7762\">Compensation negotiation strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a2hh9t\" data-start=\"7763\" data-end=\"7799\">Accounting and internal controls</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7801\" data-end=\"7804\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"7806\" data-end=\"7827\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7829\" data-end=\"7977\">Your <strong data-start=\"7834\" data-end=\"7861\">final project or thesis</strong> is a major differentiator. It acts as a <strong data-start=\"7902\" data-end=\"7925\">practical portfolio</strong>, which recruiters often evaluate during placements.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 175000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(275, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 248, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 03:11:19', '2026-06-16 06:57:58', '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"417\">The <strong data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"122\">MBA admission process</strong> is designed to be simple, but every step involves <strong data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"241\">important decisions, verification points, and financial planning</strong> that directly impact your admission confirmation. Students who clearly understand each stage are able to <strong data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"416\">avoid delays, prevent mistakes, and secure their seat confidently</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"594\">This section provides a <strong data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"488\">fully detailed, SEO-optimized explanation</strong> of the entire admission journey, along with practical insights to help you complete the process smoothly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"599\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"mh5pvt\" data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"661\">Step 1: Submit Application &ndash; Start Your Admission Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"792\">The first step is to <strong data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"735\">fill out and submit the online application form</strong>, which acts as your official entry into the MBA program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qitdjh\" data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"822\">What You Need to Provide</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"88k87g\" data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"890\">Personal details (name, contact information, identity details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tnnd1m\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"944\">Academic records (10th, 12th, graduation details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1smgj27\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"982\">Program selection and preferences</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fg0bqg\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1014\">Why This Step Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1153\">This stage is not just a formality&mdash;it is the <strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1108\">foundation of your entire admission process</strong>. The information submitted here is used for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qkkbh8\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1183\">Eligibility verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aur99o\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1207\">Document validation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cfknkx\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1237\">Communication and updates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1267\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1414\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dwwouj\" data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1328\">Entering incorrect academic marks or incomplete details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0fcec\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1372\">Using an inactive email or phone number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hyp775\" data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1414\">Submitting the form without reviewing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1my1m11\" data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1430\">Expert Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1579\">Always <strong data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1489\">double-check all information before submission</strong>. Even small errors can create complications during verification and delay your admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1584\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zycrn8\" data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1646\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program &ndash; Confirm Your Career Path</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1761\">After submitting your application, the next step is to <strong data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1760\">select and confirm your MBA program or specialization</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1792\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ylzmdx\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1827\">Choose your preferred program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jgk1od\" data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1860\">Verify all submitted details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z30nxr\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1888\">Confirm your enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kwr939\" data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1919\">Why This Step Is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"2020\">This is where you make a <strong data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1974\">career-defining decision</strong>. Your selected specialization will influence:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2093\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj5fkl\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2046\">Career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oobufp\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2065\">Industry roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iq6gfx\" data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2093\">Salary growth potential</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xvkk9r\" data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2127\">Common Mistake Students Make</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2204\">Many students choose a program based on trends or peer pressure instead of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2264\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"138t7zq\" data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2227\">Personal interest</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3akl8\" data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2244\">Career goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fvqqz9\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2264\">Industry demand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2287\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2412\">Take time to evaluate your strengths and future plans. A wrong decision here can <strong data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2411\">limit your career opportunities later</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2417\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g8vszp\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2484\">Step 3: Complete Payment &ndash; Financial Planning &amp; Smart Decision</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2611\">Once enrollment is confirmed, you need to <strong data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2556\">complete the fee payment</strong>, which moves your admission toward final confirmation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2642\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2665\">One-Time Payment</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2755\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohza4c\" data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2703\">Pay the full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bezpoe\" data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2755\">Receive a <strong data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2732\">15% discount</strong>, reducing total cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2789\">Education Loan / EMI Option</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2898\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"blh4ri\" data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2831\">Pay through <strong data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2829\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rasczj\" data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2898\">Available with <strong data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2864\">0% interest</strong>, making it financially flexible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2903\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ykyl83\" data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2946\">How to Choose the Right Payment Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"3043\">Selecting the right payment mode is a <strong data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"3018\">strategic financial decision</strong>, not just a transaction.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f8r5bc\" data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3076\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3220\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m914eg\" data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3121\">Students who can afford upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aujcmt\" data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3175\">Those looking to <strong data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3173\">save money through discounts</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ocdqp9\" data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3220\">Avoiding long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lzmvu4\" data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3247\">EMI / Loan &ndash; Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3249\" data-end=\"3357\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"197frn1\" data-start=\"3249\" data-end=\"3302\">Students who prefer <strong data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3300\">flexible monthly payments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ryxvju\" data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3357\">Those managing multiple financial responsibilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3380\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3541\">Many students choose EMI for convenience but overlook the <strong data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3481\">cost-saving advantage of full payment</strong>. Always compare the total financial impact before deciding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3546\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5qr8cl\" data-start=\"3548\" data-end=\"3606\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat &ndash; Final Admission Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3677\">This is the final stage where your admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjl3k3\" data-start=\"3679\" data-end=\"3709\">What Happens After Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3871\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"69g0rb\" data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3758\">Your <strong data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3756\">seat in the MBA program is secured</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e267pj\" data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3806\">You receive official admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wu0g9m\" data-start=\"3807\" data-end=\"3871\">You gain access to learning platforms and academic resources</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"265v1c\" data-start=\"3873\" data-end=\"3897\">Important Conditions</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3899\" data-end=\"4063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jbnjwo\" data-start=\"3899\" data-end=\"3976\">Admission is confirmed <strong data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3974\">only after successful payment or loan approval</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hqfw38\" data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"4063\">Delayed payment can result in <strong data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4025\">loss of seat</strong>, especially in high-demand programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"4065\" data-end=\"4080\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4082\" data-end=\"4217\">MBA programs often have limited seats. Waiting too long after approval can lead to <strong data-start=\"4165\" data-end=\"4216\">missing your preferred specialization or intake</strong>.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"500\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"133\">MBA eligibility criteria</strong> is the first and most important step before applying. While the requirements may look simple, many students face rejection due to <strong data-start=\"264\" data-end=\"363\">misunderstanding percentage rules, ignoring eligibility conditions, or missing key requirements</strong>. This guide provides a <strong data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"440\">deep, structured, and fully explanatory breakdown</strong> so you can evaluate your eligibility with complete clarity.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"505\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kzmz8\" data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"568\">Minimum Educational Qualification &ndash; Who Can Apply for MBA?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"662\">To be eligible for the MBA program, candidates must meet the following academic requirement:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"1158\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10bj641\" data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"728\">Must have completed an <strong data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"726\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) degree</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14h3or7\" data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"783\">The degree must be of <strong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"781\">minimum 3 years duration</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cfddvc\" data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"876\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"816\">any stream</strong> are eligible (Arts, Commerce, Science, Engineering, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cquiqa\" data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"936\">The degree must be from a <strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"934\">UGC-recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bbafgw\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1056\"><strong data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1054\">Candidates appearing for Class 12 earlier and now completing graduation follow standard eligibility progression</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpipqs\" data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1158\"><strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1097\">NIOS board candidates are eligible</strong>, provided their graduation is from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jwvp81\" data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1192\">Why This Requirement Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1399\">This ensures that students entering the MBA program have a <strong data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1282\">basic academic foundation</strong>, which is essential for understanding advanced concepts like finance, marketing, operations, and business analytics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"123vz07\" data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1416\">Key Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1596\">MBA programs are intentionally designed to be <strong data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1505\">inclusive across academic backgrounds</strong>, allowing students without prior business education to transition into management careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1601\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jwyhd6\" data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1660\">Minimum Marks Requirement &ndash; Understanding the 50% Rule</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1711\">Academic performance is a key eligibility factor:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1862\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1dofx\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1779\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1751\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in graduation is required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w0stfc\" data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1862\">Equivalent grades (CGPA or letter grades) are accepted as per university norms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wvf11s\" data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1902\">Relaxation for Reserved Categories</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"2016\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9t5lg3\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1972\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1942\">SC/ST categories</strong> receive a <strong data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1970\">5% relaxation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rfmem\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2016\">Minimum required marks: <strong data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2016\">45% aggregate</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2021\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1as5pk5\" data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2645\">Eligibility for Final-Year Students &ndash; Apply Before Graduation Completion</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2712\">Students who are still completing their degree are also eligible:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2844\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ubvab\" data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2792\">Candidates in the <strong data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2780\">final semester of their Bachelor&rsquo;s program</strong> can apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14yvqy\" data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2844\">Admission is granted on a <strong data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2842\">provisional basis</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aql1h1\" data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2882\">What Provisional Admission Means</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"3085\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"awv8i1\" data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2943\">You can apply and secure admission before final results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dxity2\" data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3010\">You must complete your graduation within the required timeline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yghmph\" data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3085\">You must still meet the <strong data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3085\">minimum percentage requirement after results</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3102\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3228\">If your final percentage falls below eligibility criteria, your admission may be <strong data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3198\">cancelled</strong>, even after initial approval.</p>', '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"402\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"133\">MBA fees structure</strong> is essential for making a <strong data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"208\">smart and informed investment in your career</strong>. Many students focus only on the total fee, but a well-informed decision requires analyzing <strong data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"401\">payment flexibility, additional charges, affordability, and long-term return on investment (ROI)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"574\">This guide provides a <strong data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"471\">fully detailed, SEO-optimized explanation</strong> of the MBA fee structure, helping you understand the real cost and choose the best financial strategy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"579\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"orit9b\" data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"621\">Total MBA Fees &ndash; Overall Program Cost</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"660\">The total fee for the MBA program is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"696\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7k0igv\" data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"696\"><strong data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"696\">₹1,96,000 (Full Program Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"851\">This fee covers the <strong data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"751\">complete MBA program duration</strong>, including academic content, learning resources, and access to the university&rsquo;s learning ecosystem.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18yzclb\" data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"885\">What This Means for Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"1111\">Compared to traditional MBA programs that can cost ₹5&ndash;15 lakhs, this program offers a <strong data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1030\">cost-effective alternative with strong academic value</strong>, making it ideal for students looking for <strong data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1110\">maximum ROI at a lower investment</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1116\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bclwcz\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1182\">Flexible Payment Options &ndash; Designed for Financial Convenience</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1319\">The program offers multiple payment options, allowing students to choose a plan based on their financial comfort and planning strategy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9q8v0q\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1344\">Fee Payment Options</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1756\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1368\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1388\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1400\" data-col-size=\"md\">Best For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1756\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1476\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1475\">One-Time Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1495\">₹1,96,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1556\">Students who prefer upfront payment and long-term clarity</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1652\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1580\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1577\">Yearly Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1599\">₹98,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1652\">Students who want balanced financial distribution</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1756\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1676\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1672\">Semester-Wise</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1699\">₹49,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1756\">Students looking for lower immediate financial burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1761\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"133ns2n\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1830\">Choosing the Right Payment Option &ndash; Strategic Financial Decision</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1970\">Selecting the right payment mode is not just about affordability&mdash;it&rsquo;s about <strong data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1969\">minimizing cost and managing financial stress effectively</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fd9zl0\" data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2016\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Best for Cost Control</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2177\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ztfvp\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2076\">Ideal for students who can afford full payment upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8l7ajh\" data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2120\">Eliminates future financial commitments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c948xc\" data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2177\">Simplifies financial planning for the entire program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h8a7mp\" data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2217\">Yearly Payment &ndash; Balanced Approach</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2329\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cc5xp7\" data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2273\">Splits the fee into manageable yearly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hrqh75\" data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2329\">Suitable for students with stable financial support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y60ngx\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2378\">Semester-Wise Payment &ndash; Maximum Flexibility</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2473\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yj4wov\" data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2418\">Lowest upfront payment requirement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"109necw\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2473\">Ideal for students managing studies alongside work</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ci3ldn\" data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2528\">EMI Option &ndash; Study Without Financial Pressure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2674\">The MBA program also offers <strong data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2603\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) options</strong>, allowing students to pay fees in smaller, manageable monthly amounts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k49m0a\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2695\">Benefits of EMI</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2828\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rttxl\" data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2735\">Reduces immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fkw06a\" data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2787\">Makes MBA accessible without delaying education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ml1wl\" data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2828\">Helps in better cash flow management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2851\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2903\">While EMI improves affordability, students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"3044\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rs28k3\" data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2955\">Evaluate total repayment commitments carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19o8hqs\" data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2995\">Ensure consistent financial support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f2z3es\" data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3044\">Avoid relying on EMI without proper planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3049\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f7o6wj\" data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3107\">Additional Fees &ndash; Mandatory Charges You Must Consider</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3221\">In addition to tuition fees, there are <strong data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3165\">extra charges</strong> that students must include in their financial planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t268wb\" data-start=\"3223\" data-end=\"3248\">For Students in India</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3334\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pxmkb4\" data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3292\"><strong data-start=\"3252\" data-end=\"3290\">₹2,500 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17o46gq\" data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3334\"><strong data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3332\">₹3,000 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rjtz3g\" data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3371\">For Students in SAARC Countries</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3449\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"613tr0\" data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3407\"><strong data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3405\">₹11,250 (Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dzg920\" data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3449\"><strong data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3447\">₹3,750 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bnizb1\" data-start=\"3451\" data-end=\"3481\">For International Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3562\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lyt09e\" data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3523\"><strong data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3521\">$150 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43rawd\" data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3562\"><strong data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3560\">$50 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"381\">A specialized MBA in Digital Marketing is designed to go far beyond traditional management education. Instead of focusing only on theory, this program builds <strong data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"331\">hands-on expertise in SEO, paid ads, analytics, branding, and growth marketing</strong>, which are the core drivers of modern businesses.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"731\">This curriculum follows a <strong data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"443\">progressive learning structure</strong>, where you start with business fundamentals, move into marketing execution, and finally master <strong data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"591\">advanced digital growth strategies and analytics</strong>. Below is a <strong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"658\">deep, fully explanatory breakdown of each semester</strong>, including courses, skills, certifications, and real-world applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"736\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16hg6zt\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"796\">Semester 1 &ndash; Business Foundations &amp; Analytical Thinking</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"963\">The first semester builds a <strong data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"895\">strong foundation in business, finance, and quantitative analysis</strong>, which is essential before moving into digital marketing execution.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"984\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1165\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1008\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rf69vv\" data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1036\">Sustainability &amp; Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5ih8i\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1080\">Financial Reporting &amp; Corporate Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"52a9mr\" data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1114\">Organizational Behavior &amp; HRM</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9vwaxg\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1165\">Quantitative Techniques for Business Decisions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1170\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1199\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1345\">This semester focuses on developing a <strong data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1259\">business mindset</strong>, helping you understand how organizations operate before diving into marketing tools.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1357\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1691\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jwah0g\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1435\">How <strong data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1433\">economic forces impact business decisions and pricing strategies</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qj3yat\" data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1509\">The role of <strong data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1507\">ethical and sustainable practices in modern companies</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bf517o\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1580\">Financial fundamentals such as <strong data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1578\">corporate finance and reporting</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19fh8ci\" data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1630\">Organizational behavior and <strong data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1628\">team dynamics</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19qms7i\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1691\">Data interpretation and <strong data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1689\">quantitative decision-making</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1696\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1720\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1995\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"143fomv\" data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1768\">Statistical and quantitative data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qbfl7g\" data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1831\">Business data interpretation and market structure analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vf0wls\" data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1888\">Financial understanding (cost-benefit and reporting)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3u4qgc\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1942\">Decision-making frameworks like the Delphi method</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pc8h59\" data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1995\">Analytical thinking for business problem-solving</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2000\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2030\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2204\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mhvff5\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2065\">Analytical skills development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g15s5r\" data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2097\">Cost-volume-profit analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12fftd3\" data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2140\">Digital market structure understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s169g4\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2173\">Business data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q0rbqw\" data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2204\">Affiliate marketing basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2232\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2393\">Students often underestimate this semester, but it builds the <strong data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2392\">analytical foundation required for SEO, marketing analytics, and performance marketing later</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2398\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"177wyd9\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2459\">Semester 2 &ndash; Core Digital Marketing &amp; Business Execution</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2585\">This semester introduces <strong data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2521\">core digital marketing concepts</strong>, focusing on content, SEO, and customer acquisition strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2606\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2776\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2628\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2653\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ngrelz\" data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2677\">Operations Research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3el9uu\" data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2727\">Inbound Marketing: Content &amp; Search Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1psm699\" data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2776\">Business Analytics &amp; Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2781\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2810\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2871\">You begin working on <strong data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2870\">real digital marketing strategies</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"3196\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1htanc8\" data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2929\">How to create <strong data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2927\">content-driven marketing campaigns</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a1xw6q\" data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"3001\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2999\">SEO, keyword research, and search engine behavior</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13jd8go\" data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3072\">Building <strong data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3070\">brand storytelling and customer engagement strategies</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q80h8z\" data-start=\"3073\" data-end=\"3139\">Running <strong data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3137\">Google Ads campaigns and paid marketing strategies</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12zar18\" data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3196\">Using analytics and AI for <strong data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3194\">data-driven decisions</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3201\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3225\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3457\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oh52ie\" data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3267\">Content creation and blog management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14nvd08\" data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3325\">SEO (Search Engine Optimization) and keyword strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18u5gq2\" data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3370\">Google Search Console and campaign setup</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ol7sbn\" data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3416\">Competitive analysis and growth marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lmqu6n\" data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3457\">Understanding SEO vs SEM differences</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3459\" data-end=\"3462\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3492\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3708\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"76dpa6\" data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3541\">SEO copywriting and conversion optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12s038n\" data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3579\">Paid media advertising strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1csrhq1\" data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3632\">Startup ecosystem and opportunity identification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wd6hpx\" data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3668\">B2B vs B2C marketing strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mjay7s\" data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3708\">Marketing mix and campaign planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3713\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"3715\" data-end=\"3736\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3738\" data-end=\"3926\">This semester is where you start building <strong data-start=\"3780\" data-end=\"3808\">job-ready digital skills</strong>. Students who practice SEO and ads practically gain a <strong data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3925\">major advantage in internships and freelance opportunities</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"3931\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11u6vw8\" data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"4008\">Semester 3 &ndash; Advanced Digital Marketing, E-Commerce &amp; Campaign Execution</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4150\">The third semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4122\">advanced digital marketing tools, paid advertising, and e-commerce integration</strong>, making you industry-ready.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4171\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4359\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zoxbqz\" data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4202\">Business Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"4203\" data-end=\"4228\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9wyf6\" data-start=\"4229\" data-end=\"4251\">Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5g2a9r\" data-start=\"4252\" data-end=\"4302\">Outbound Marketing: Digital Ads &amp; Social Media</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1202ai6\" data-start=\"4303\" data-end=\"4338\">Brand Management for E-Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ual2mx\" data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4359\">Applied Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4361\" data-end=\"4364\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4393\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4395\" data-end=\"4464\">This semester emphasizes <strong data-start=\"4420\" data-end=\"4463\">execution and optimization of campaigns</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4466\" data-end=\"4768\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o0myn9\" data-start=\"4466\" data-end=\"4533\">Running <strong data-start=\"4476\" data-end=\"4531\">Google Ads, display ads, and social media campaigns</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zovzw3\" data-start=\"4534\" data-end=\"4588\">Managing <strong data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4586\">e-commerce platforms and integrations</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zbijen\" data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4648\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4646\">brand identity and customer targeting</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jovqjm\" data-start=\"4649\" data-end=\"4706\">Analyzing campaign performance and optimizing results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yjeayt\" data-start=\"4707\" data-end=\"4768\">Using data visualization tools for <strong data-start=\"4744\" data-end=\"4766\">marketing insights</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4770\" data-end=\"4773\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"4775\" data-end=\"4797\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"5095\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mesfuc\" data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4856\">Paid media strategy and campaign performance analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uu3nlm\" data-start=\"4857\" data-end=\"4895\">Multi-platform marketing campaigns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jzoc83\" data-start=\"4896\" data-end=\"4943\">Brand identity and brand equity development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11l1gfd\" data-start=\"4944\" data-end=\"4993\">E-commerce tools like WooCommerce integration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14may1f\" data-start=\"4994\" data-end=\"5032\">SEO metrics like SEM quality score</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ocfa06\" data-start=\"5033\" data-end=\"5095\">Inventory and operational management for online businesses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5097\" data-end=\"5100\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"5102\" data-end=\"5130\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5132\" data-end=\"5328\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ynu9w\" data-start=\"5132\" data-end=\"5160\">Programmatic advertising</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8aoyny\" data-start=\"5161\" data-end=\"5202\">Advanced SEO and website optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"roqy8r\" data-start=\"5203\" data-end=\"5240\">Web design and development basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ioioa\" data-start=\"5241\" data-end=\"5280\">E-commerce logistics and Amazon SEO</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12qq9bd\" data-start=\"5281\" data-end=\"5328\">Audience targeting and digital architecture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5330\" data-end=\"5333\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"5335\" data-end=\"5356\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5358\" data-end=\"5539\">This semester is the <strong data-start=\"5379\" data-end=\"5414\">core industry preparation phase</strong>. Students who actively work on live campaigns and tools here can <strong data-start=\"5480\" data-end=\"5538\">start freelancing or earning before completing the MBA</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5541\" data-end=\"5544\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mjf81g\" data-start=\"5546\" data-end=\"5612\">Semester 4 &ndash; Growth Marketing, Analytics &amp; Strategic Leadership</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5614\" data-end=\"5770\">The final semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"5644\" data-end=\"5728\">high-level marketing strategies, growth hacking, and data-driven decision-making</strong>, preparing students for leadership roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"5772\" data-end=\"5791\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5793\" data-end=\"5941\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"5793\" data-end=\"5817\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n30js0\" data-start=\"5818\" data-end=\"5865\">Integrated Marketing Communication Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lprqmi\" data-start=\"5866\" data-end=\"5896\">Digital Product Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xii8hp\" data-start=\"5897\" data-end=\"5917\">Growth Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ng8j22\" data-start=\"5918\" data-end=\"5941\">Marketing Analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5943\" data-end=\"5946\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"5948\" data-end=\"5975\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5977\" data-end=\"6034\">You move from execution to <strong data-start=\"6004\" data-end=\"6033\">strategy and optimization</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6359\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1722pmf\" data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6101\">Designing <strong data-start=\"6048\" data-end=\"6099\">integrated marketing campaigns across platforms</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"754c76\" data-start=\"6102\" data-end=\"6157\">Managing <strong data-start=\"6113\" data-end=\"6155\">digital products and customer journeys</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lcuzz2\" data-start=\"6158\" data-end=\"6223\">Using analytics for <strong data-start=\"6180\" data-end=\"6221\">performance tracking and optimization</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jjc66o\" data-start=\"6224\" data-end=\"6286\">Applying <strong data-start=\"6235\" data-end=\"6284\">growth hacking techniques to scale businesses</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o8lsdb\" data-start=\"6287\" data-end=\"6359\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"6303\" data-end=\"6357\">multi-channel and omnichannel marketing strategies</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6361\" data-end=\"6364\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"6366\" data-end=\"6388\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6390\" data-end=\"6666\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ja5cg4\" data-start=\"6390\" data-end=\"6439\">Performance marketing and funnel optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lfq116\" data-start=\"6440\" data-end=\"6480\">A/B testing and multivariate testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a01sl0\" data-start=\"6481\" data-end=\"6527\">Marketing automation and growth strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xcghln\" data-start=\"6528\" data-end=\"6570\">Web analytics and attribution modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cavgmw\" data-start=\"6571\" data-end=\"6615\">Omnichannel marketing and media planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14o6awh\" data-start=\"6616\" data-end=\"6666\">Agile, SCRUM, and product lifecycle management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6668\" data-end=\"6671\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"6673\" data-end=\"6701\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6703\" data-end=\"6889\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12xi7d1\" data-start=\"6703\" data-end=\"6737\">Google Tag and analytics tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5rqwqe\" data-start=\"6738\" data-end=\"6779\">Email and mobile marketing strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mjtsww\" data-start=\"6780\" data-end=\"6807\">CRM and lead management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kg4w0y\" data-start=\"6808\" data-end=\"6830\">UI/UX fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"139ktwo\" data-start=\"6831\" data-end=\"6889\">Digital business strategy and programmatic advertising</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6891\" data-end=\"6894\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"6896\" data-end=\"6917\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6919\" data-end=\"7131\">This semester prepares you for <strong data-start=\"6950\" data-end=\"7024\">high-paying roles in digital marketing, analytics, and growth strategy</strong>. Your understanding of analytics and performance marketing becomes a <strong data-start=\"7094\" data-end=\"7130\">key differentiator in placements</strong>.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(276, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 249, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 04:02:43', '2026-06-16 06:58:16', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Securing your place at JAIN (Deemed-to-be University)&mdash;a NAAC A++ rated institution&mdash;requires navigating a structured, four-step digital enrollment pathway. This process is designed to be streamlined, ensuring that high-potential candidates can transition from applicant to student with administrative ease.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 1: Digital Application Submission</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The journey begins with the creation of your academic profile. This is more than just a form; it is your first introduction to the university&rsquo;s evaluation committee.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Fill out the comprehensive online application form.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Points Required:</strong> You must provide accurate personal identification, a detailed chronological history of your educational qualifications (specifically your 3-year undergraduate degree details), and your specific MBA program preference.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Tip:</strong> Ensure all digital copies of your transcripts are ready for upload to avoid session timeouts during the application phase.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 2: Program Selection &amp; Verification</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Once your basic profile is in the system, the focus shifts to academic alignment.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Action:</strong> Select your specific MBA elective or specialization track.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification:</strong> The university&rsquo;s system allows you to review and verify all entered details. This \"Double-Check\" phase is critical to ensure that your eligibility (the required 50% aggregate or 45% for SC/ST) matches the university records.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Confirmation:</strong> Proceeding past this stage locks in your intent to enroll in the specific academic cohort.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 3: Strategic Financial Remittance</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">JAIN University offers unique financial incentives that allow students to optimize their investment based on their liquidity.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Option A: The One-Time Payment Advantage:</strong> By paying the full program fee (₹175,000) upfront, students can receive a <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"116\">15% discount</strong>. This is a high-ROI decision for those with immediate capital, significantly lowering the total cost of the degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Option B: Education Loan &amp; 0% Interest EMI:</strong> To ensure accessibility, the university facilitates financing through banking partners. This allows students to spread the cost over monthly installments without the burden of added interest, making a premium MBA affordable on a monthly budget.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Additional Costs:</strong> Remember to account for your region-specific registration and examination fees (e.g., ₹2,500 registration for Indian students).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 4: Admission Finalization &amp; Seat Securing</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The final phase is the formal transition into the student body.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Trigger:</strong> Your seat is only officially \"Secured\" once the payment transaction is successful or your financing/loan application is officially approved and logged by the university&rsquo;s finance department.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Immediate Benefits:</strong> Upon securing your seat, you gain immediate access to the student portal, which includes your initial learning modules and the integrated LinkedIn Learning tracks (up to 42 certifications available throughout the program).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p id=\"p-rc_6777390ee60be7e2-130\" data-path-to-node=\"2\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1\"><span class=\"citation-188\">The first step toward securing a seat in one of India&rsquo;s most prestigious management programs is understanding the academic benchmarks</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2\"><span class=\"citation-188 citation-end-188\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,5\"><span class=\"citation-187\">JAIN (Deemed-to-be University), a NAAC A++ accredited institution, maintains rigorous yet inclusive eligibility standards designed to attract a diverse cohort of future leaders</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,6\"><span class=\"citation-187 citation-end-187\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Core Academic Qualifications</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">To be considered for the MBA program, applicants must meet the following foundational criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6777390ee60be7e2-131\" data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-186\">Undergraduate Degree:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-186\"> Candidates must have successfully completed a Bachelor&rsquo;s program with a minimum duration of three (3) years</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-186 citation-end-186\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6777390ee60be7e2-132\" data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-185\">Stream Inclusivity:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-185\"> The university accepts graduates from </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\"><span class=\"citation-185\">any stream</span></strong><span class=\"citation-185\">&mdash;be it Arts, Commerce, Science, Engineering, or others&mdash;provided the degree is from a UGC-recognized university</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-185 citation-end-185\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6777390ee60be7e2-133\" data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-184\">Aggregate Marks:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-184\"> General category candidates must possess a minimum aggregate of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\"><span class=\"citation-184\">50%</span></strong><span class=\"citation-184\"> or an equivalent letter/numerical grade in their qualifying examination</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-184 citation-end-184\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Strategic Relaxations and Inclusive Policies</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">JAIN University is committed to social equity and providing opportunities for students at various stages of their academic journey.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6777390ee60be7e2-134\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-183\">SC/ST Category Relaxation:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-183\"> A </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"29\"><span class=\"citation-183\">5% relaxation</span></strong><span class=\"citation-183\"> in the minimum aggregate is granted to candidates belonging to SC/ST categories</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-183 citation-end-183\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-182\">This means these candidates are eligible with a minimum aggregate of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,4\" data-index-in-node=\"69\"><span class=\"citation-182\">45%</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-182 citation-end-182\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6777390ee60be7e2-135\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-181\">Final Year Students:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-181\"> Candidates who are currently in their </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"59\"><span class=\"citation-181\">final semester</span></strong><span class=\"citation-181\"> of a Bachelor&rsquo;s program are also eligible to apply</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-181 citation-end-181\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-180\">This policy allows for a seamless transition into postgraduate studies without a gap year</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-180 citation-end-180\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,6\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-58\" data-path-to-node=\"2\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1\"><span class=\"citation-85\">Navigating the financial commitment of a postgraduate degree is a pivotal step in professional career planning</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2\"><span class=\"citation-85 citation-end-85\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,5\"><span class=\"citation-84\">JAIN (Deemed-to-be University), a premier NAAC A++ accredited institution with a legacy dating back to its 1990 foundation, offers a transparent and geographically tailored fee model for its Master of Business Administration (MBA) program</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,6\"><span class=\"citation-84 citation-end-84\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,7\">. This guide provides a deep-dive into the core tuition costs, the strategic logic behind flexible payment schedules, and a detailed explanation of the additional fees required for domestic and international cohorts.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Comprehensive Breakdown of MBA Tuition Fees</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-59\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1\"><span class=\"citation-83\">The core tuition investment for the MBA program is designed to be inclusive of a high-authority academic framework and industry-integrated training modules</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-83 citation-end-83\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5\"><span class=\"citation-82\">To accommodate diverse financial backgrounds, the university offers a flexible remittance framework that allows students to choose the plan that best aligns with their liquidity</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,6\"><span class=\"citation-82 citation-end-82\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Schedule</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Amount</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Strategic Financial Context</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Program Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹175,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,2,0\">The complete tuition investment for the two-year MBA degree.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Payment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹175,000</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-81\">Ideal for students looking to settle all obligations upfront to avoid recurring administrative cycles</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,2,0,3\">.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Yearly Installment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹87,500</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-80\">A balanced approach, dividing the total cost into two equal annual payments</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,0,3\">.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semesterly Installment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">₹43,750</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-79\">The most granular standard plan, breaking the cost into four manageable payments over two years</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,2,0,3\">.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Geographic Fee Customization: Registration &amp; Examination Costs</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-60\" data-path-to-node=\"9\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1\"><span class=\"citation-78\">JAIN University follows a structured \"Global Access\" pricing model to ensure administrative and examination services are aligned with the logistical requirements of a student\'s home region</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2\"><span class=\"citation-78 citation-end-78\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">For Students in India</strong></h4>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-61\" data-path-to-node=\"11\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1\"><span class=\"citation-77\">Domestic students benefit from localized infrastructure, allowing for cost-effective administrative processing</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2\"><span class=\"citation-77 citation-end-77\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-62\" data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-76\">One-Time Registration:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-76\"> ₹2,500 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-76 citation-end-76\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-63\" data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-75\">Annual Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-75\"> ₹3,000 per year </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-75 citation-end-75\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-64\" data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-74\">Total Ancillary Cost (2 Years):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-74\"> ₹8,500 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-74 citation-end-74\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">For Students in SAARC Countries</strong></h4>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-65\" data-path-to-node=\"14\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1\"><span class=\"citation-73\">Tailored for regional neighbors (e.g., Nepal, Bhutan, Sri Lanka), these fees facilitate academic mobility within the SAARC region</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2\"><span class=\"citation-73 citation-end-73\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-66\" data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-72\">One-Time Registration:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-72\"> ₹11,250 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-72 citation-end-72\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-67\" data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-71\">Annual Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-71\"> ₹3,750 per year </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-71 citation-end-71\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-68\" data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-70\">Total Ancillary Cost (2 Years):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-70\"> ₹18,750 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-70 citation-end-70\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">For International Students</strong></h4>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-69\" data-path-to-node=\"17\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,1\"><span class=\"citation-69\">Fees are standardized in USD for students in regions such as the US, UK, and Middle East, covering the complexities of international academic logistics</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,2\"><span class=\"citation-69 citation-end-69\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-70\" data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-68\">One-Time Registration:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-68\"> $150 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-68 citation-end-68\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-71\" data-path-to-node=\"18,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"18,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-67\">Annual Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-67\"> $50 per year </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-67 citation-end-67\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"16\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-72\" data-path-to-node=\"18,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"18,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-66\">Total Ancillary Cost (2 Years):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-66\"> $250 </span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-66 citation-end-66\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"17\"><!----></sup></span></span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Strategic Flexibility: EMI and Liquidity Options</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-73\" data-path-to-node=\"21\"><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1\"><span class=\"citation-65\">Recognizing that upfront costs can be a barrier to premium education, the university employs a \"Student-First\" financial strategy</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"21,2\"><span class=\"citation-65 citation-end-65\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"21,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"22\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-74\" data-path-to-node=\"22,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"22,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-64\">0% Interest Philosophy:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-64\"> JAIN University facilitates specialized EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) options</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-64 citation-end-64\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-63\">Many of these plans offer </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,0,1,4\" data-index-in-node=\"26\"><span class=\"citation-63\">0% interest</span></strong><span class=\"citation-63\">, allowing students to distribute the program\'s cost over a granular timeline without the burden of heavy interest accrual typical of traditional bank loans</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-63 citation-end-63\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"20\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,0,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-75\" data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-62\">The Power of Choice:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-62\"> The university allows students to switch between payment modes based on their evolving financial situation</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-62 citation-end-62\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"21\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-61\">For instance, a student may start with semesterly payments and move to a one-time settlement if their liquidity increases</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-61 citation-end-61\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"22\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_1214183bd4fc9c5a-76\" data-path-to-node=\"22,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"22,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"22,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-60\">Financial Aid Integration:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-60\"> These strategic aid options ensure that merit-driven students can secure their seats regardless of immediate cash flow constraints</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-60 citation-end-60\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"23\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,2,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The MBA program at JAIN (Deemed-to-be University)&mdash;a NAAC A++ accredited institution&mdash;is engineered to bridge the gap between traditional management theory and the high-tech demands of the modern global economy. By integrating <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"225\">LinkedIn Learning</strong> directly into the credit system, the university ensures that every student graduates with a dual edge: an academic degree and a massive portfolio of 42 professional certifications.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Building the Strategic Foundation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The first semester is designed to reset your analytical mindset, focusing on the intersection of human behavior, financial literacy, and emerging technology.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Core (6 Courses):</strong> Focuses on foundational pillars like <em data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">Business Economics</em>, <em data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"84\">Organizational Behavior</em>, and the critical <em data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"126\">AI Skills for Future</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (18 Skills):</strong> You will master the <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"51\">Time Value of Money (TVM)</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">Financial Modelling</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"103\">LLM Fundamentals</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn Learning (9 Certifications):</strong> These focus on \"Soft Power\" and professional survival, including <em data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"103\">Negotiation Foundations</em>, <em data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"128\">Executive Presence</em>, and <em data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"152\">AI Literacy</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Advantage:</strong> By learning <em data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">AI Skills</em> in your first 90 days, you gain an immediate competitive advantage over traditional MBA cohorts who often wait until the final year for tech integration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Operational Excellence &amp; Digital Transformation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">In the second phase, the curriculum shifts toward how businesses scale, govern themselves, and utilize data for complex decision-making.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Core (5 Courses):</strong> Highlights include <em data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"46\">Marketing Management</em>, <em data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\">Operations Research</em>, and <em data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Business Analytics &amp; AI</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (11 Skills):</strong> Intensive training in <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">Advanced Excel</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"69\">Project Scheduling</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Regulatory Compliance</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn Learning (14 Certifications):</strong> The highest volume of certifications in the program, covering <em data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"101\">Cloud Computing</em>, <em data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">Agile Business Analysis</em>, and <em data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"147\">Power BI</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Advantage:</strong> The focus on <em data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"34\">Business Law &amp; Corporate Governance</em> ensures you understand the ethical and legal frameworks required for C-suite leadership.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Specialized Insights &amp; Analytical Rigor</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Semester 3 moves into \"Deep-Dive\" territory, focusing on consumer psychology and the technical tools required to influence market behavior.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Core (7 Courses):</strong> This semester introduces <em data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">Consumer Behavior</em>, <em data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"71\">Data Analytics with Python</em>, and a customizable <em data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">Open Elective Course</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (13 Skills):</strong> Mastery of <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">Dashboard Building</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">Marketing Campaign Planning</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"95\">Media Planning</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn Learning (8 Certifications):</strong> Specialized marketing and data tracks such as <em data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"84\">Performance Marketing</em>, <em data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"107\">SQL for Data Engineering</em>, and <em data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"137\">A/B Testing</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Advantage:</strong> Learning <em data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">Python</em> for data visualization transforms you from a manager who \"reads reports\" to a leader who \"builds insights.\"</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Strategy, Mastery &amp; The Digital Frontier</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The final semester is the \"Synthesis Phase,\" where all previous learnings are applied to high-level strategic management and a capstone Master Thesis.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Core (6 Courses):</strong> Includes <em data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"36\">Strategic Management</em>, <em data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">Advanced Spreadsheet Modelling</em>, and <em data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"94\">Digital Marketing and Brand Management</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (17 Skills):</strong> Deep technical skills in <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"56\">SPSS Advanced Analysis</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">Predictive Modelling</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"102\">SEO</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">Brand Architecture</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn Learning (11 Certifications):</strong> High-level technical certifications including <em data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"85\">Google Analytics 4 (GA4)</em>, <em data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">Python for Data Science</em>, and <em data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"140\">Mobile Marketing Strategy</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Capstone:</strong> The <em data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"18\">Master Thesis / Project</em> acts as your professional calling card, allowing you to solve a real-world business problem using the 59+ skills acquired.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 175000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(277, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 04:28:25', '2026-06-16 06:58:43', '<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Securing your place in a NAAC A++ accredited institution requires a clear understanding of the administrative journey. JAIN (Deemed-to-be University) has streamlined its enrollment into a digital-first, four-stage \"Success Schema.\" This process is designed to be transparent, efficient, and supportive of your financial liquidity.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 1: Strategic Application Submission (The Data Entry Stage)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Your journey begins with the digital application portal. This is more than just a form; it is your initial professional pitch to the university.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Action:</strong> Fill out the online application with precise personal, educational, and program-specific details.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Requirement:</strong> Ensure your undergraduate marks (minimum 50% aggregate for General, 45% for SC/ST) are ready for verification.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Pro-Tip:</strong> Double-check your contact details, as all further communication regarding entrance tests or interview schedules will be sent to your registered email and phone number.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 2: Program Enrollment &amp; Validation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">In this stage, you transition from an \"Applicant\" to a \"Candidate.\"</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Action:</strong> Formally select your MBA specialization (e.g., Marketing, Data Analytics, or Entrepreneurship) and verify all uploaded documentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Topical Coverage:</strong> This is the phase where you align your career goals with the 59+ skills offered in the JAIN MBA curriculum. Whether you are targeting AI-integrated roles or strategic management, your program selection here defines your academic trajectory for the next two years.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 3: Financial Remittance &amp; Strategic Cost Management</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">JAIN University offers one of the most flexible payment structures in the Indian management education sector. You have two primary pathways to fulfill your financial obligation:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Efficiency\" Path (One-Time Payment):</strong> Pay the full program fee (₹175,000) upfront.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Benefit:</strong> You receive an <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"34\">immediate 15% discount</strong>, significantly lowering the total cost of your degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Liquidity\" Path (EMI / Education Loan):</strong> Partner with the university&rsquo;s financial affiliates to pay through <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">0% interest installments</strong>.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Benefit:</strong> This allows you to manage your cash flow without the burden of interest, making a high-authority MBA accessible to professionals on a budget.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 4: Admission Finalization &amp; Seat Securing</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">The final phase is the formal \"Seat Secure\" stage.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Action:</strong> Once the university\'s finance department logs your successful payment or loan approval, your admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Immediate Result:</strong> You receive your formal <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">Admission Letter</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Integration:</strong> Securing your seat triggers immediate access to the student portal, allowing you to begin the Semester 1 modules, including foundational \"AI Skills for the Future\" and the massive portfolio of LinkedIn Learning certifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The first step toward securing a seat in one of India&rsquo;s most prestigious management programs is understanding the academic benchmarks. JAIN (Deemed-to-be University), a NAAC A++ accredited institution with a legacy dating back to 1990, maintains rigorous yet inclusive eligibility standards designed to attract a diverse cohort of future leaders.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Core Academic Qualifications</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">To be considered for the MBA program, applicants must meet the following foundational criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Undergraduate Degree:</strong> Candidates must have successfully completed a Bachelor&rsquo;s program with a minimum duration of <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"114\">three (3) years</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stream Inclusivity:</strong> The university maintains an \"Open Stream\" policy. Whether your background is in Arts, Commerce, Science, Engineering, or Fine Arts, you are eligible to apply provided the degree is from a <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"208\">UGC-Recognized University</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Aggregate Marks:</strong> General category candidates must possess a minimum aggregate of <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">50%</strong> or an equivalent letter/numerical grade in their qualifying examination.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Strategic Relaxations and Inclusive Policies</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">JAIN University is committed to social equity and providing opportunities for students at various stages of their academic journey.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">SC/ST Category Relaxation:</strong> In alignment with educational equity standards, a <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">5% relaxation</strong> in the minimum aggregate is granted to candidates belonging to SC/ST categories. This means these candidates are eligible with a minimum aggregate of <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"241\">45%</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Year Eligibility:</strong> If you are currently in your <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">final semester</strong> of a Bachelor&rsquo;s program, you do not need to wait for your final results to begin the application process. You are eligible to apply and secure a provisional seat, ensuring a seamless transition into postgraduate studies without a gap year.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Strategic Insights for Prospective MBA Students</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Any Stream\" Advantage</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">Because the program accepts \"any stream,\" it offers a massive opportunity for non-business students (Engineers, Humanities graduates) to pivot their careers. For instance, an Engineering graduate can combine their technical background with JAIN&rsquo;s industry-integrated curriculum to enter high-paying sectors like FinTech or Product Management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">High ROI and Career Momentum</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">By meeting these eligibility criteria, you gain entry into a university headquartered in Bengaluru&mdash;India&rsquo;s \"Silicon Valley.\" This provides an unparalleled ecosystem for networking and high-salary placements, which often reach up to <strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"232\">₹36.86 LPA</strong> for top-tier candidates.</p>', '<p id=\"p-rc_7b394a3e5bb51a27-156\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-251\">Navigating the financial commitment of a postgraduate degree is a pivotal step in professional career planning</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-251 citation-end-251\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-250\">JAIN (Deemed-to-be University), a premier NAAC A++ accredited institution with a legacy dating back to its 1990 foundation, offers a transparent and geographically tailored fee model for its Master of Business Administration (MBA) program</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-250 citation-end-250\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">This guide provides a detailed deep-dive into the total costs, flexible payment schedules, and regional fee variations.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Comprehensive Breakdown of MBA Tuition Fees</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_7b394a3e5bb51a27-157\" data-path-to-node=\"8\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1\"><span class=\"citation-249\">The core tuition investment for the MBA program is designed to provide high-authority academic rigor while maintaining accessibility through several remittance tempos</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2\"><span class=\"citation-249 citation-end-249\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_7b394a3e5bb51a27-158\" data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-248\">Total Program Fee:</span></strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"19\"><span class=\"citation-248\">₹175,000</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-248 citation-end-248\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_7b394a3e5bb51a27-159\" data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-247\">One-Time Payment:</span></strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"18\"><span class=\"citation-247\">₹175,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-247\"> upfront, which may qualify students for strategic institutional discounts</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-247 citation-end-247\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_7b394a3e5bb51a27-160\" data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-246\">Yearly Installment Plan:</span></strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"25\"><span class=\"citation-246\">₹87,500 per year</span></strong><span class=\"citation-246\">, paid at the start of each academic year</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-246 citation-end-246\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_7b394a3e5bb51a27-161\" data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-245\">Semesterly Installment Plan:</span></strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"29\"><span class=\"citation-245\">₹43,750 per semester</span></strong><span class=\"citation-245\">, breaking the cost into four manageable payments over two years</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-245 citation-end-245\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_7b394a3e5bb51a27-162\" data-path-to-node=\"11\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-244\">EMI and Liquidity Options:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-244\"> For students preferring to preserve liquidity, the university facilitates specialized </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0\" data-index-in-node=\"113\"><span class=\"citation-244\">0% interest EMI options</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1\"><span class=\"citation-244 citation-end-244\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,4\"><span class=\"citation-243\">These plans allow for the distribution of costs over monthly installments without the burden of interest accrual</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,5\"><span class=\"citation-243 citation-end-243\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Regional Fee Customization: Registration &amp; Examination Costs</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_7b394a3e5bb51a27-163\" data-path-to-node=\"14\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1\"><span class=\"citation-242\">To align with regional administrative and logistical requirements, additional fees are categorized based on the student\'s geographic residency</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2\"><span class=\"citation-242 citation-end-242\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>One-Time Registration Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Annual Examination Fee</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">For Students in India</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-241\">₹2,500 </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-240\">₹3,000 per year </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">For Students in SAARC Countries</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-239\">₹11,250 </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-238\">₹3,750 per year </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">For International Students</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-237\">$150 </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-236\">$50 per year</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">In an era where traditional management degrees are being outpaced by technology, JAIN (Deemed-to-be University)&mdash;a NAAC A++ institution&mdash;has engineered a curriculum that merges classical business theory with cutting-edge \"New Age\" competencies.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">This program is not just about passing exams; it is an intensive upskilling journey featuring <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"94\">23 core courses</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">48 targeted skills</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"135\">33 global certifications</strong> powered by LinkedIn Learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1: Building the Analytical Foundation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The first semester focuses on \"The Logic of Business.\" It bridges the gap between undergraduate theory and professional application.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Highlight:</strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">AI Skills for Future</strong> &ndash; Unlike traditional MBAs, JAIN introduces AI literacy in month one.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Core:</strong> Covers Business Economics, Sustainability &amp; Ethics, and Financial Reporting.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition:</strong> You gain 18 distinct skills, including <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">Financial Modelling</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">LLM Fundamentals</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Edge:</strong> 9 LinkedIn Certifications, such as <em data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">Negotiation Foundations</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">AI Literacy</em>, ensure you are workplace-ready from the start.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2: Scalability, Marketing &amp; Advanced Analytics</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Semester 2 shifts toward \"Market Presence and Operational Efficiency.\"</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Highlight:</strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">Business Analytics &amp; Artificial Intelligence</strong> &ndash; Moving from theory to data-driven decision making.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Core:</strong> Marketing Management, Entrepreneurship, and Business Law.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition:</strong> 11 skills including <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">Integrated Marketing Communications</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">Project Scheduling</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Edge:</strong> This is the most intensive certification phase with <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">14 LinkedIn tracks</strong>, covering <em data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"94\">Power BI</em>, <em data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"104\">Agile Business Analysis</em>, and <em data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"133\">Cloud Computing</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 3: Specialization &amp; Technical Proficiency</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">The third semester is where students become specialists. There is a heavy emphasis on Fintech and Data Science.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Highlight:</strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">Fintech Foundations &amp; R for Finance</strong> &ndash; Preparing students for the high-frequency trading and digital banking sectors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Core:</strong> Investment Analysis, Portfolio Management, and Research Methods.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition:</strong> 12 skills including <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">Time Series Forecasting</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"67\">Business Intelligence Dashboard Design</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Edge:</strong> Certifications include <em data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"36\">Microsoft Power BI Analyst (PL-300)</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">Time Series Analysis with GPT-4o</em>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 4: Strategy, Risk &amp; Professional Mastery</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">The final semester is about \"The Executive Viewpoint,\" focusing on high-level strategy and the final Master Thesis.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Highlight:</strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">Risk Management &amp; Behavioral Finance</strong> &ndash; Understanding the psychology behind market movements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Core:</strong> Strategic Management and Data Analytics using SPSS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition:</strong> 7 high-level skills, including <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Predictive Analytics</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"75\">Strategic Decision Making</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Edge:</strong> Final certifications in <em data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">Financial Forecasting</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"63\">SPSS Statistics</em> to solidify your profile for top-tier placements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 175000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(278, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 251, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 04:51:22', '2026-06-16 06:59:01', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"386\">The <strong data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"113\">MBA admission process</strong> is a structured pathway that ensures students move smoothly from application to confirmed enrollment. While it may appear straightforward, each step involves <strong data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"339\">critical decisions, verification checks, and financial planning</strong>, which directly impact your admission success.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"599\">This guide provides a <strong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"463\">fully SEO-optimized, deeply explanatory breakdown</strong> of the entire admission journey, helping you avoid mistakes, understand each stage clearly, and secure your seat without complications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"604\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1aoulq8\" data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"670\">Step 1: Submit Application &ndash; Begin Your MBA Admission Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"802\">The admission process starts with filling out the <strong data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"749\">online application form</strong>, which acts as your official entry into the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yj1j1t\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"829\">What You Need to Fill</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"1001\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lfcogv\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"902\">Personal details (full name, contact information, identity details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mktod2\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"963\">Academic qualifications (10th, 12th, graduation details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1smgj27\" data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1001\">Program selection and preferences</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fg0bqg\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1033\">Why This Step Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1144\">This step forms the <strong data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1102\">foundation of your entire admission process</strong>. The information you provide is used for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1245\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qkkbh8\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1174\">Eligibility verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"168bb3p\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1209\">Academic background assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mvfyu0\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1245\">Communication for further steps</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1275\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n9xpn\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1336\">Entering incorrect marks or incomplete academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ssmzye\" data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1380\">Using inactive email ID or phone number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hyp775\" data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1422\">Submitting the form without reviewing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1my1m11\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1438\">Expert Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1571\">Always <strong data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1498\">double-check your application before submission</strong>. Even minor errors can delay verification or create complications later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1576\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rh5u8k\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1641\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program &ndash; Confirm Your Specialization</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1755\">After submitting the application, the next step is to <strong data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1754\">select and confirm your MBA program or specialization</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1786\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1884\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ylzmdx\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1821\">Choose your preferred program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9imu8o\" data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1861\">Verify previously submitted details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vxm4ji\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1884\">Confirm enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kwr939\" data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1915\">Why This Step Is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"2006\">This is where you define your <strong data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1967\">career direction</strong>. Your selected program will influence:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2098\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj5fkl\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2032\">Career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zwvtdd\" data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2070\">Industry roles and specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ddqon8\" data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2098\">Long-term salary growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xvkk9r\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2132\">Common Mistake Students Make</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2209\">Many students choose programs based on trends or peer influence instead of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2268\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rpwd8m\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2233\">Personal strengths</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3akl8\" data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2250\">Career goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dr3hzf\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2268\">Market demand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2291\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2422\">Take time to evaluate your long-term goals before confirming. A wrong choice here can <strong data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2421\">limit your career growth opportunities</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2427\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xmhkqh\" data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2490\">Step 3: Complete Payment &ndash; Smart Financial Decision Making</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2630\">Once enrollment is confirmed, you need to <strong data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2562\">complete the fee payment</strong>, which is essential for moving toward final admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2661\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2684\">One-Time Payment</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2772\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohza4c\" data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2722\">Pay the full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bqwy26\" data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2772\">Get a <strong data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2747\">15% discount</strong>, reducing overall cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2806\">Education Loan / EMI Option</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2911\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"scu1xe\" data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2843\">Pay in <strong data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2841\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e9q0lr\" data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2911\">Often available with <strong data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2882\">0% interest</strong>, making it budget-friendly</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2916\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zeow70\" data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2972\">Choosing the Right Payment Option &ndash; Strategic Guide</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2974\" data-end=\"3087\">Selecting a payment mode is not just about affordability&mdash;it&rsquo;s about <strong data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3086\">financial planning and cost optimization</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f8r5bc\" data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3120\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3264\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m914eg\" data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3165\">Students who can afford upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aujcmt\" data-start=\"3166\" data-end=\"3219\">Those looking to <strong data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3217\">save money through discounts</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ocdqp9\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3264\">Avoiding long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lzmvu4\" data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3291\">EMI / Loan &ndash; Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3401\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"197frn1\" data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3346\">Students who prefer <strong data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3344\">flexible monthly payments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ryxvju\" data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3401\">Those managing multiple financial responsibilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3424\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3426\" data-end=\"3571\">Many students opt for EMI without evaluating the <strong data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3516\">total cost benefit of upfront payment</strong>. Always compare both options before making a decision.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3576\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5qr8cl\" data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3636\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat &ndash; Final Admission Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3712\">This is the final stage where your admission becomes officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjl3k3\" data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3744\">What Happens After Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3905\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"69g0rb\" data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3793\">Your <strong data-start=\"3753\" data-end=\"3791\">seat in the MBA program is secured</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e267pj\" data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3841\">You receive official admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mhbzfx\" data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3905\">You get access to learning platforms and academic resources</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"265v1c\" data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3931\">Important Conditions</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"4098\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jbnjwo\" data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"4010\">Admission is confirmed <strong data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"4008\">only after successful payment or loan approval</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lwshdd\" data-start=\"4011\" data-end=\"4098\">Delay in payment can result in <strong data-start=\"4044\" data-end=\"4060\">loss of seat</strong>, especially in competitive programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4115\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4225\">Seats are limited, and postponing payment can cause you to <strong data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4224\">miss your preferred intake or specialization</strong>.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"435\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"138\">MBA eligibility criteria</strong> is crucial because even small misunderstandings can lead to <strong data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"259\">application rejection, delays, or admission cancellation</strong>. While the requirements appear straightforward, the real challenge lies in <strong data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"434\">correct interpretation of academic qualifications, percentage rules, and eligibility conditions</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"574\">This section provides a <strong data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"498\">deep, fully explanatory breakdown</strong> so you can confidently evaluate your eligibility and avoid costly mistakes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"579\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pofefn\" data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"644\">Minimum Educational Qualification &ndash; Who Is Eligible for MBA?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"732\">To apply for the MBA program, candidates must meet the following academic requirement:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10bj641\" data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"798\">Must have completed an <strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"796\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) degree</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mok0cl\" data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"855\">The degree should be of <strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"853\">minimum 3 years duration</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cfddvc\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"948\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"888\">any stream</strong> are eligible (Arts, Commerce, Science, Engineering, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cquiqa\" data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1008\">The degree must be from a <strong data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1006\">UGC-recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tu21s7\" data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1135\"><strong data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1133\">Candidates appearing for Class 12 earlier and now completing graduation are eligible as per standard progression norms</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3k8a69\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1270\"><strong data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1209\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling) candidates are eligible</strong>, provided their graduation is from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jwvp81\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1304\">Why This Requirement Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1519\">This ensures that students entering the MBA program have a <strong data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1411\">strong academic base and learning exposure</strong>, which is essential for understanding subjects like finance, marketing, analytics, and management strategy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"123vz07\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1536\">Key Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1714\">MBA programs are intentionally designed to be <strong data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1597\">inclusive</strong>, allowing students from non-commerce or non-management backgrounds to transition into business and leadership roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1719\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jwyhd6\" data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1778\">Minimum Marks Requirement &ndash; Understanding the 50% Rule</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1829\">Academic performance is a key eligibility factor:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1989\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1dofx\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1897\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1869\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in graduation is required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16e19dq\" data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1989\">Equivalent grading formats (CGPA or letter grades) are accepted as per university norms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wvf11s\" data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2029\">Relaxation for Reserved Categories</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2151\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hqds4z\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2107\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2077\">SC/ST categories</strong> receive a <strong data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2105\">5% relaxation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rfmem\" data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2151\">Minimum required marks: <strong data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2151\">45% aggregate</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1as5pk5\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2790\">Eligibility for Final-Year Students &ndash; Apply Before Graduation Completion</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2864\">Students who are still pursuing their degree are also eligible to apply:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2996\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ubvab\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2944\">Candidates in the <strong data-start=\"2886\" data-end=\"2932\">final semester of their Bachelor&rsquo;s program</strong> can apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14yvqy\" data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2996\">Admission is granted on a <strong data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"2994\">provisional basis</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aql1h1\" data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3034\">What Provisional Admission Means</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3245\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sktpxp\" data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3103\">You can secure admission before your final results are declared</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dxity2\" data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3170\">You must complete your graduation within the required timeline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yghmph\" data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3245\">You must still meet the <strong data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3245\">minimum percentage requirement after results</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"3247\" data-end=\"3262\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3397\">If your final results fall below the required eligibility criteria, your admission may be <strong data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3367\">cancelled</strong>, even after initial approval.</p>', '<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-213\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"><span class=\"citation-362\">Navigating the financial commitment of a postgraduate degree is a pivotal step in professional career planning</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2\"><span class=\"citation-362 citation-end-362\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,5\"><span class=\"citation-361\">JAIN (Deemed-to-be University), a premier NAAC A++ accredited institution with a legacy dating back to its 1990 foundation</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,6\"><span class=\"citation-361 citation-end-361\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,7\">, offers a transparent and geographically tailored fee model for its Master of Business Administration (MBA) program. This guide provides an exhaustive breakdown of the updated ₹196,000 tuition structure, additional administrative costs, and the flexible payment pathways designed for modern professionals.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">1. Comprehensive Breakdown of MBA Tuition Fees</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-214\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0\">The MBA program at JAIN University is structured to provide high-authority academic rigor while maintaining financial accessibility. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2\"><span class=\"citation-360\">The total tuition investment for the program is set at </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2\" data-index-in-node=\"55\"><span class=\"citation-360\">₹196,000</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3\"><span class=\"citation-360 citation-end-360\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4\">. To accommodate diverse financial backgrounds, the university offers three distinct payment tracks:</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-215\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-359\">One-Time Payment:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-359\"> For students who prefer to settle their academic investment upfront, a single payment of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"107\"><span class=\"citation-359\">₹196,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-359\"> covers the entire program duration</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-359 citation-end-359\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-216\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-358\">Yearly Installment Plan:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-358\"> This plan divides the cost into two equal annual payments of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\"><span class=\"citation-358\">₹98,000</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-358 citation-end-358\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-217\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-357\">Semester-Wise Payment:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-357\"> The most flexible option allows students to pay </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"71\"><span class=\"citation-357\">₹49,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-357\"> at the start of each of the four semesters</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-357 citation-end-357\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">2. Mandatory Additional Fees &amp; Global Cost Schema</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Beyond the core tuition, students are required to account for registration and examination fees, which vary based on the student\'s residency status:</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">A. Students in India</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-218\" data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-356\">Registration Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-356\"> ₹2,500 (One-time payment)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-356 citation-end-356\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-219\" data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-355\">Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-355\"> ₹3,000 per year (Totaling ₹6,000 for the program)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-355 citation-end-355\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">B. Students in SAARC Countries</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-220\" data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-354\">Registration Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-354\"> ₹11,250 (One-time payment)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-354 citation-end-354\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-221\" data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-353\">Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-353\"> ₹3,750 per year (Totaling ₹7,500 for the program)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-353 citation-end-353\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">C. International Students</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-222\" data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-352\">Registration Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-352\"> $150 (One-time payment)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-352 citation-end-352\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-223\" data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-351\">Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-351\"> $50 per year (Totaling $100 for the program)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-351 citation-end-351\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"19\">3. Flexible Financing: EMI and Interest-Free Options</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-224\" data-path-to-node=\"20\"><span data-path-to-node=\"20,1\"><span class=\"citation-350\">To ensure that financial constraints do not hinder academic progress, JAIN University partners with various financial institutions to provide </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,1\" data-index-in-node=\"142\"><span class=\"citation-350\">EMI options</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,2\"><span class=\"citation-350 citation-end-350\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,3\">. These facilities often include:</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"21\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-225\" data-path-to-node=\"21,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"21,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-349\">0% Interest EMI:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-349\"> Allowing students to spread the cost over monthly payments without additional interest burdens</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"21,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-349 citation-end-349\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"21,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-226\" data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-348\">Preservation of Liquidity:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-348\"> Enabling professionals to manage their monthly cash flow while pursuing a high-ROI degree</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-348 citation-end-348\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"21,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"22\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"23\">4. ROI and Value Proposition: Why Invest?</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24\">An MBA from JAIN University is more than a degree; it is a strategic asset. The curriculum is integrated with advanced technical prowess and global certifications:</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"25\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"25,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-227\" data-path-to-node=\"25,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"25,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"25,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-347\">AI-Integrated Curriculum:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-347\"> Students gain proficiency in AI skills for the future, business analytics, and AI-assisted forecasting</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"25,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-347 citation-end-347\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"16\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"25,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-228\" data-path-to-node=\"25,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"25,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-346\">Software Mastery:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-346\"> Hands-on training in Advanced Excel, Power BI, Tableau, R Programming, and SPSS</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-346 citation-end-346\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"17\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9529b99f442f5485-229\" data-path-to-node=\"25,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"25,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-345\">LinkedIn Learning Path:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-345\"> Access to 33+ (up to 42) certifications distributed across four semesters, ranging from soft skills to niche technical expertise</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-345 citation-end-345\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"547\">An MBA in <strong data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"154\">Operations &amp; Supply Chain Management</strong> is designed to develop professionals who can <strong data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"303\">manage production systems, optimize supply chains, reduce costs, and improve operational efficiency</strong>. Unlike general MBA programs, this specialization focuses heavily on <strong data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"454\">logistics, inventory control, manufacturing systems, and process optimization</strong>, which are critical for industries like e-commerce, manufacturing, retail, and global trade.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"833\">This curriculum follows a <strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"605\">progressive learning model</strong>, starting with business fundamentals and advancing toward <strong data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"749\">specialized supply chain strategies, global logistics, and operational leadership</strong>. Below is a <strong data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"815\">deep, structured, and fully explanatory breakdown</strong> of each semester.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"59aoq9\" data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"905\">Semester 1 &ndash; Business Foundations, Analytics &amp; Decision-Making</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1108\">The first semester builds a <strong data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1025\">strong base in business fundamentals, financial understanding, and analytical thinking</strong>, which is essential before moving into operations and supply chain specialization.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1129\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1360\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1153\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rf69vv\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1181\">Sustainability &amp; Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5ih8i\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1225\">Financial Reporting &amp; Corporate Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1of72ks\" data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1284\">Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9vwaxg\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1335\">Quantitative Techniques for Business Decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1360\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1365\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1394\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1489\">This semester helps you understand how <strong data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1488\">business systems function at a foundational level</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1837\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1st99ez\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1571\">Economic principles and their impact on <strong data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1569\">production and pricing decisions</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nnp60z\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1631\">Importance of <strong data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1629\">sustainability and ethical operations</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bttc97\" data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1709\">Financial systems including <strong data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1707\">costing, reporting, and corporate finance</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fvyqd2\" data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1762\">Organizational behavior and workforce management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h1qlt3\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1837\">Data-driven decision-making using <strong data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1835\">quantitative tools and AI basics</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1842\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1866\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"2203\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n8z6fy\" data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1912\">Managerial economics and market analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dstd4h\" data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1970\">ESG (Environmental, Social, Governance) understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sv2syo\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2019\">Financial modelling and accounting standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1thui2i\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2058\">HR analytics and talent management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rnzrq\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2118\">Statistical techniques (regression, hypothesis testing)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5o7x68\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2164\">AI fundamentals and business applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2560j\" data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2203\">Time Value of Money (TVM) analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2208\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2238\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qmzthi\" data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2282\">Negotiation and business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nj0qck\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2320\">Executive presence and networking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdun9m\" data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2352\">Cross-cultural intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15l6kp1\" data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2383\">Risk management strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"194ahfv\" data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2426\">Design thinking and data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vv2xlp\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2442\">AI literacy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2447\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2470\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2673\">This semester is critical because <strong data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2577\">operations decisions rely heavily on data, finance, and forecasting</strong>. A weak foundation here can affect your ability to handle advanced supply chain concepts later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2678\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7lajv2\" data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2743\">Semester 2 &ndash; Core Business Functions &amp; Analytical Operations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2917\">The second semester introduces <strong data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2826\">core operational concepts and analytical tools</strong>, helping students understand how organizations manage processes and resources efficiently.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2938\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"3102\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"2960\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2985\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ngrelz\" data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"3009\">Operations Research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zfiueq\" data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3051\">Business Law and Corporate Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s8llsw\" data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3102\">Business Analytics and Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3107\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3136\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3203\">This semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3202\">business execution and optimization</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3500\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h4jb7z\" data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3263\">How businesses are built and scaled (entrepreneurship)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187j5pt\" data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3329\">Marketing&rsquo;s role in <strong data-start=\"3286\" data-end=\"3327\">demand generation and supply planning</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rsyjmr\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3380\">Legal frameworks governing business operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15wqaeb\" data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3445\">Optimization techniques using <strong data-start=\"3413\" data-end=\"3443\">operations research models</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8dv5lq\" data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3500\">Data-driven decision-making using analytics and AI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3505\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3529\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3818\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vy21qr\" data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3570\">Corporate governance and compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14emhj9\" data-start=\"3571\" data-end=\"3617\">Demand forecasting and market segmentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k65dih\" data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3668\">Linear programming and optimization techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1umwnsj\" data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3716\">Project scheduling and operational planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12wwuoq\" data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3758\">Advanced Excel and business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"65j6vg\" data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3818\">Entrepreneurial strategy and opportunity identification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3823\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"3825\" data-end=\"3853\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3855\" data-end=\"4069\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jpnh4z\" data-start=\"3855\" data-end=\"3908\">Digital transformation and cloud-based operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"evpug5\" data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"3946\">AI strategy and consulting basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eh79id\" data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3986\">Product and supply chain management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1790me2\" data-start=\"3987\" data-end=\"4014\">Agile business analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18p69kn\" data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4069\">Data visualization tools like Power BI and Tableau</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4074\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4097\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4246\">This semester acts as a <strong data-start=\"4123\" data-end=\"4174\">bridge between theory and real-world operations</strong>, preparing you for specialized supply chain subjects in the next phase.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4248\" data-end=\"4251\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1t3qe9g\" data-start=\"4253\" data-end=\"4313\">Semester 3 &ndash; Core Supply Chain &amp; Logistics Specialization</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4315\" data-end=\"4459\">The third semester is the <strong data-start=\"4341\" data-end=\"4370\">core specialization phase</strong>, focusing entirely on <strong data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4458\">logistics, inventory, manufacturing, and supply chain systems</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"4461\" data-end=\"4480\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4723\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zoxbqz\" data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4511\">Business Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"4512\" data-end=\"4537\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uxmkpp\" data-start=\"4538\" data-end=\"4579\">Logistics and Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uz04oy\" data-start=\"4580\" data-end=\"4618\">Materials and Inventory Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xcztjk\" data-start=\"4619\" data-end=\"4662\">Agile Manufacturing and Lean Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fi8buw\" data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4698\">Export and Import Documentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"thsz5s\" data-start=\"4699\" data-end=\"4723\">Open Elective Course</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4725\" data-end=\"4728\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4757\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4828\">This semester develops <strong data-start=\"4782\" data-end=\"4827\">deep expertise in supply chain operations</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4830\" data-end=\"5148\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7gous\" data-start=\"4830\" data-end=\"4880\">Managing end-to-end <strong data-start=\"4852\" data-end=\"4878\">supply chain processes</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jgbpz4\" data-start=\"4881\" data-end=\"4940\">Inventory control and <strong data-start=\"4905\" data-end=\"4938\">stock optimization techniques</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fhjc2v\" data-start=\"4941\" data-end=\"5002\">Lean manufacturing to reduce waste and improve efficiency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cztgiy\" data-start=\"5003\" data-end=\"5070\">Logistics planning including <strong data-start=\"5034\" data-end=\"5068\">transportation and warehousing</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vscjsd\" data-start=\"5071\" data-end=\"5148\">Understanding international trade through <strong data-start=\"5115\" data-end=\"5146\">export-import documentation</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5150\" data-end=\"5153\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"5155\" data-end=\"5177\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5179\" data-end=\"5433\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nitg5d\" data-start=\"5179\" data-end=\"5226\">Supply chain operations and demand planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mgost2\" data-start=\"5227\" data-end=\"5277\">Production planning and inventory optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ba7rf\" data-start=\"5278\" data-end=\"5314\">Supplier relationship management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m58yri\" data-start=\"5315\" data-end=\"5361\">Quality management and process improvement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fd0ecf\" data-start=\"5362\" data-end=\"5399\">Facility and inventory management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xsypus\" data-start=\"5400\" data-end=\"5433\">Business process optimization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5435\" data-end=\"5438\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"5440\" data-end=\"5468\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5470\" data-end=\"5622\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pat3op\" data-start=\"5470\" data-end=\"5506\">Inventory management foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1db3cr8\" data-start=\"5507\" data-end=\"5532\">Lean Six Sigma basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mbw6rd\" data-start=\"5533\" data-end=\"5575\">Supply chain implementation strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y3a0i5\" data-start=\"5576\" data-end=\"5622\">Data visualization for operations analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5624\" data-end=\"5627\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"5629\" data-end=\"5650\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5652\" data-end=\"5828\">This is the <strong data-start=\"5664\" data-end=\"5740\">most important semester for placements in operations and logistics roles</strong>. Practical understanding of tools and concepts here directly impacts job opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5830\" data-end=\"5833\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9zqs52\" data-start=\"5835\" data-end=\"5898\">Semester 4 &ndash; Strategic Supply Chain &amp; Leadership Development</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5900\" data-end=\"6048\">The final semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"5930\" data-end=\"6006\">strategic management, global supply chain systems, and leadership skills</strong>, preparing students for managerial roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"6050\" data-end=\"6069\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6071\" data-end=\"6297\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"6071\" data-end=\"6095\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gi0470\" data-start=\"6096\" data-end=\"6149\">Information System for Logistics and Supply Chain</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jbcv2i\" data-start=\"6150\" data-end=\"6200\">Negotiation Skills for Supply Chain Operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rhz22w\" data-start=\"6201\" data-end=\"6240\">Sustainable Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qz6oms\" data-start=\"6241\" data-end=\"6269\">Total Quality Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rx70fy\" data-start=\"6270\" data-end=\"6297\">Master Thesis / Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6299\" data-end=\"6302\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"6304\" data-end=\"6331\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6333\" data-end=\"6413\">This semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"6358\" data-end=\"6412\">high-level decision-making and strategic execution</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6415\" data-end=\"6740\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j8ag3b\" data-start=\"6415\" data-end=\"6476\">Designing <strong data-start=\"6427\" data-end=\"6474\">efficient and scalable supply chain systems</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fcp461\" data-start=\"6477\" data-end=\"6546\">Using information systems for logistics tracking and optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"99e38i\" data-start=\"6547\" data-end=\"6595\">Managing supplier negotiations and contracts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"135k2yt\" data-start=\"6596\" data-end=\"6670\">Implementing sustainable and environmentally responsible supply chains</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wzq4s8\" data-start=\"6671\" data-end=\"6740\">Applying quality management frameworks for operational excellence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6742\" data-end=\"6745\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"6747\" data-end=\"6769\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6771\" data-end=\"7017\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2oohj\" data-start=\"6771\" data-end=\"6816\">Lean processes and operational efficiency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h1ybwu\" data-start=\"6817\" data-end=\"6851\">Global supply chain management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10asxtv\" data-start=\"6852\" data-end=\"6896\">Logistics coordination and KPI reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l9zm24\" data-start=\"6897\" data-end=\"6939\">Strategic planning and decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rsdx3h\" data-start=\"6940\" data-end=\"6972\">Business process improvement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cqh556\" data-start=\"6973\" data-end=\"7017\">Quality control and operational strategy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7019\" data-end=\"7022\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"7024\" data-end=\"7052\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7054\" data-end=\"7156\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jtqma5\" data-start=\"7054\" data-end=\"7086\">Demand and capacity planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2sgsf4\" data-start=\"7087\" data-end=\"7117\">Quality management systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m6rj2p\" data-start=\"7118\" data-end=\"7156\">Supply chain analytics using Excel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7158\" data-end=\"7161\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"7163\" data-end=\"7184\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7186\" data-end=\"7367\">Your <strong data-start=\"7191\" data-end=\"7218\">final project or thesis</strong> plays a crucial role in placements. It demonstrates your ability to <strong data-start=\"7287\" data-end=\"7328\">solve real-world operational problems</strong>, which is highly valued by recruiters.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(279, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 252, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 05:03:50', '2026-06-16 06:59:22', '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"437\">The <strong data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"122\">MBA admission process</strong> is designed to be simple and student-friendly, but each step involves <strong data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"261\">important decisions, verification checks, and financial planning</strong> that directly impact your admission confirmation. A clear understanding of this process helps you <strong data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"436\">avoid delays, prevent errors, and secure your seat without complications</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"584\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"495\">fully detailed, SEO-optimized explanation</strong> of each step, including what to do, why it matters, and how to complete it successfully.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"589\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"mh5pvt\" data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"651\">Step 1: Submit Application &ndash; Start Your Admission Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"788\">The first step in the MBA admission process is to <strong data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"743\">fill out the online application form</strong>, which officially initiates your enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kcrm5x\" data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"813\">What You Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"987\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q37w4k\" data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"887\">Enter personal details (name, contact information, identity details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mvjmz\" data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"953\">Provide academic information (10th, 12th, graduation details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oxv1kw\" data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"987\">Select your preferred program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fg0bqg\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1019\">Why This Step Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1093\">This step creates your <strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1073\">official academic profile</strong>, which is used for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qkkbh8\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1123\">Eligibility verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aur99o\" data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1147\">Document validation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"96v4tf\" data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1192\">Future communication regarding admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1222\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1346\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mb053i\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1274\">Entering incorrect marks or incomplete details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17wbpjd\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1313\">Using inactive contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"823rni\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1346\">Submitting without reviewing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1my1m11\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1362\">Expert Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1482\">Always <strong data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1411\">verify all details before submission</strong>, as even minor errors can lead to delays during document verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rh5u8k\" data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1552\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program &ndash; Confirm Your Specialization</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1666\">After submitting the application, the next step is to <strong data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1665\">select and confirm your MBA program or specialization</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kcrm5x\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1691\">What You Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1791\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"belplk\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1724\">Choose your desired program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2sjbjo\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1768\">Review all previously submitted details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vxm4ji\" data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1791\">Confirm enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kwr939\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1822\">Why This Step Is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1922\">This is where you define your <strong data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1869\">career path</strong>. Your chosen specialization will directly influence:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"2009\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj5fkl\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1948\">Career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oobufp\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1967\">Industry roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h7tcjj\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2009\">Long-term growth and salary potential</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xvkk9r\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2043\">Common Mistake Students Make</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2108\">Choosing a program based on trends or peer pressure instead of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2167\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gipeh1\" data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2132\">Personal interests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3akl8\" data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2149\">Career goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dr3hzf\" data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2167\">Market demand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2190\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2305\">Take time to analyze your goals before confirming. A wrong decision here can <strong data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2304\">limit your future opportunities</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2310\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g8vszp\" data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2377\">Step 3: Complete Payment &ndash; Financial Planning &amp; Smart Decision</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2511\">Once enrollment is confirmed, you must <strong data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2446\">complete the fee payment</strong>, which is essential for moving forward in the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2542\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2565\">One-Time Payment</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2655\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohza4c\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2603\">Pay the full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kwadmi\" data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2655\">Get a <strong data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2628\">15% discount</strong>, reducing the total cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2689\">Education Loan / EMI Option</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2794\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"scu1xe\" data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2726\">Pay in <strong data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2724\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juapd3\" data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2794\">Often available with <strong data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2765\">0% interest</strong>, making it more affordable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2799\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zeow70\" data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2855\">Choosing the Right Payment Option &ndash; Strategic Guide</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2978\">Selecting the right payment method is not just about affordability&mdash;it&rsquo;s about <strong data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2977\">financial planning and cost efficiency</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f8r5bc\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3011\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3153\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kxdk73\" data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3053\">Students who can afford full payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tbozym\" data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3108\">Those who want to <strong data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3106\">save money through discounts</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ocdqp9\" data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3153\">Avoiding long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lzmvu4\" data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3180\">EMI / Loan &ndash; Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3290\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"197frn1\" data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3235\">Students who prefer <strong data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3233\">flexible monthly payments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ryxvju\" data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3290\">Those managing multiple financial responsibilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3313\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3462\">Many students choose EMI for convenience but overlook the <strong data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3415\">cost-saving benefit of upfront payment</strong>. Always evaluate both options before deciding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3467\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5qr8cl\" data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3527\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat &ndash; Final Admission Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3607\">This is the final stage where your admission becomes <strong data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3606\">officially confirmed</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjl3k3\" data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3639\">What Happens After Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3792\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"69g0rb\" data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3688\">Your <strong data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3686\">seat in the MBA program is secured</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wr0fmu\" data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3727\">You receive admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wu0g9m\" data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3792\">You gain access to learning platforms and academic resources</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"265v1c\" data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3818\">Important Conditions</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3985\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jbnjwo\" data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3897\">Admission is confirmed <strong data-start=\"3845\" data-end=\"3895\">only after successful payment or loan approval</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3whoi3\" data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3985\">Delay in payment may result in <strong data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"3947\">loss of seat</strong>, especially in high-demand programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"3987\" data-end=\"4002\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4004\" data-end=\"4112\">Since seats are limited, delaying payment can cause you to <strong data-start=\"4063\" data-end=\"4111\">miss your preferred intake or specialization</strong>.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"438\">Before applying, it&rsquo;s essential to clearly understand the <strong data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"178\">MBA eligibility criteria</strong>, because even small misunderstandings can lead to <strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"274\">application rejection or admission delays</strong>. While the rules seem simple, the real challenge lies in <strong data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"437\">correctly interpreting degree validity, percentage calculation, and final-year eligibility conditions</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"593\">This section provides a <strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"516\">deep, fully explanatory, SEO-optimized breakdown</strong> so you can confidently determine your eligibility and avoid common mistakes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"598\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kzmz8\" data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"661\">Minimum Educational Qualification &ndash; Who Can Apply for MBA?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"755\">To be eligible for the MBA program, candidates must meet the following academic requirement:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"1298\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10bj641\" data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"821\">Must have completed an <strong data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"819\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) degree</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14h3or7\" data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"876\">The degree must be of <strong data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"874\">minimum 3 years duration</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cfddvc\" data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"969\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"909\">any stream</strong> are eligible (Arts, Commerce, Science, Engineering, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cquiqa\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1029\">The degree must be from a <strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1027\">UGC-recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ltvkyo\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1163\"><strong data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1161\">Candidates appearing for Class 12 earlier and now completing graduation follow standard academic progression and are eligible</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3k8a69\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1298\"><strong data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1237\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling) candidates are eligible</strong>, provided their graduation is from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jwvp81\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1332\">Why This Requirement Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1572\">This ensures that students entering the MBA program have a <strong data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1455\">basic academic foundation and structured learning exposure</strong>, which is essential for understanding advanced subjects like finance, marketing, analytics, and management strategy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"123vz07\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1589\">Key Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1779\">MBA programs are designed to be <strong data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1649\">inclusive and flexible</strong>, allowing students from non-commerce or non-management backgrounds to successfully transition into business and leadership roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1784\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jwyhd6\" data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1843\">Minimum Marks Requirement &ndash; Understanding the 50% Rule</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1903\">Academic performance plays a critical role in eligibility:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1dofx\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1971\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1943\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in graduation is required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16e19dq\" data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2063\">Equivalent grading formats (CGPA or letter grades) are accepted as per university norms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wvf11s\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2103\">Relaxation for Reserved Categories</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2234\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4qscw\" data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2190\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2151\">SC/ST categories</strong> are eligible for a <strong data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2188\">5% relaxation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rfmem\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2234\">Minimum required marks: <strong data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2234\">45% aggregate</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2239\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1nr6yk0\" data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2297\">How to Calculate Your Graduation Percentage Correctly</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2384\">One of the most common reasons for rejection is <strong data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2383\">incorrect percentage calculation</strong>.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2596\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lo2tz7\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2466\">Your percentage must be calculated based on <strong data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2464\">all semesters/years combined</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4xxghy\" data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2511\">Not just the final year or last semester</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13k4din\" data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2596\">Backlogs, improvements, or re-evaluation results may impact your final aggregate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10clvjd\" data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2625\">Common Mistake to Avoid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2839\">Many students assume they are eligible based on <strong data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2700\">final-year marks only</strong>, which can lead to disqualification during document verification. Always calculate your <strong data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2822\">overall graduation percentage</strong> before applying.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2844\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1as5pk5\" data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2921\">Eligibility for Final-Year Students &ndash; Apply Before Graduation Completion</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2995\">Students who are still pursuing their degree are also eligible to apply:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3127\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ubvab\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3075\">Candidates in the <strong data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3063\">final semester of their Bachelor&rsquo;s program</strong> can apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14yvqy\" data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3127\">Admission is granted on a <strong data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3125\">provisional basis</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aql1h1\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3165\">What Provisional Admission Means</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3381\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w5ryn7\" data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3239\">You can apply and secure admission before final results are declared</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dxity2\" data-start=\"3240\" data-end=\"3306\">You must complete your graduation within the required timeline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yghmph\" data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3381\">You must still meet the <strong data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3381\">minimum percentage requirement after results</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3398\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3400\" data-end=\"3531\">If your final marks fall below the required eligibility criteria, your admission may be <strong data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3501\">cancelled</strong>, even after initial approval.</p>', '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"441\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"133\">MBA fees structure</strong> is not just about knowing the total amount&mdash;it&rsquo;s about making a <strong data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"229\">strategic financial decision</strong> that aligns with your budget, career goals, and long-term return on investment (ROI). Many students overlook hidden costs, payment flexibility, and financial planning, which can lead to unnecessary stress later.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"617\">This section provides a <strong data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"510\">fully detailed, SEO-optimized breakdown</strong> of the MBA fees, including payment options, additional charges, real cost estimation, and expert insights.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"622\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"s6q2np\" data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"670\">Total MBA Fees &ndash; Overall Program Investment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"701\">The total MBA program fee is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"736\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"112f9i3\" data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"736\"><strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"736\">₹1,75,000 (Full Course Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"883\">This amount covers the <strong data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"799\">entire duration of the MBA program</strong>, including academic delivery, digital learning access, and core academic resources.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18yzclb\" data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"917\">What This Means for Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"1120\">Compared to traditional MBA programs (₹5&ndash;15 lakhs), this program offers a <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1035\">high-value, cost-effective alternative</strong>, making it ideal for students seeking <strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1119\">strong ROI without heavy financial burden</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1godpdh\" data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1183\">Flexible Payment Options &ndash; Designed for Every Student</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1279\">The program offers multiple payment modes to ensure <strong data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1278\">maximum affordability and convenience</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18dujtw\" data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1308\">MBA Fee Payment Options</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1371\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1371\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1332\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1352\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1371\" data-col-size=\"md\">Best Suited For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1517\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1454\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1453\">One-Time Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1473\">₹1,75,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1517\">Students who prefer full upfront payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1541\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1538\">Yearly Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1560\">₹87,500 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1610\">Students who want balanced yearly installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1634\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1630\">Semester-Wise</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1657\">₹43,750 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1694\">Students seeking low upfront cost</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1699\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1az62do\" data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1764\">Choosing the Right Payment Option &ndash; Strategic Decision Guide</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1863\">Selecting the correct payment option is crucial for <strong data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1862\">financial planning and cost optimization</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d9lrvo\" data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1913\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Cost Efficiency Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"2052\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6t1fi4\" data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1957\">Ideal for students who can pay upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fmgg5o\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2001\">Eliminates future financial obligations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gsgb51\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2052\">Helps in better financial control and planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15yrprc\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2102\">Yearly Payment &ndash; Balanced Financial Approach</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2217\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1igifg3\" data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2155\">Divides total cost into two manageable payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"etfk27\" data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2217\">Suitable for students with moderate financial flexibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y60ngx\" data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2266\">Semester-Wise Payment &ndash; Maximum Flexibility</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2362\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fm0dv0\" data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2305\">Lowest immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4pkh9v\" data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2362\">Ideal for students managing education alongside work</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2367\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1sfm0jr\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2429\">EMI Option &ndash; Affordable Learning Without Financial Stress</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2555\">The MBA program also provides <strong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2506\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) options</strong>, enabling students to spread the cost over time.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k49m0a\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2576\">Benefits of EMI</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9twsr\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2633\">Converts large fees into <strong data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2631\">small monthly payments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vikkm\" data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2674\">Reduces immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dpfoqw\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2713\">Makes MBA accessible without delay</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"thivjj\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2746\">Important Financial Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2781\">While EMI improves affordability:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2951\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"climcq\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2830\">Always evaluate your <strong data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2828\">repayment capacity</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzgvat\" data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2897\">Avoid choosing EMI without understanding long-term commitments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aldo49\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2951\">Compare EMI vs one-time payment for cost benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2956\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"167rwh0\" data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"3013\">Additional Fees &ndash; Mandatory Charges You Must Include</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3151\">Apart from tuition fees, students must account for <strong data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3088\">additional charges</strong>, which are often ignored but essential for accurate budgeting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1woz4k1\" data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3190\">Fee Structure for Indian Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3276\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pxmkb4\" data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3234\"><strong data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3232\">₹2,500 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17o46gq\" data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3276\"><strong data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3274\">₹3,000 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nkgaye\" data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3314\">Fee Structure for SAARC Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3392\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"613tr0\" data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3350\"><strong data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3348\">₹11,250 (Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dzg920\" data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3392\"><strong data-start=\"3353\" data-end=\"3390\">₹3,750 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xqfgz2\" data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3438\">Fee Structure for International Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3519\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lyt09e\" data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3480\"><strong data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3478\">$150 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43rawd\" data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3519\"><strong data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3517\">$50 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"514\">An MBA in <strong data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"156\">HR Analytics and Data-Driven Management</strong> is designed for students who want to combine <strong data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"294\">human resource management with data analytics, technology, and strategic decision-making</strong>. Unlike traditional HR programs, this curriculum focuses on <strong data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"443\">data-backed hiring, workforce analytics, performance optimization, and HR tech tools</strong>, making you highly relevant in today&rsquo;s AI-driven business environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"748\">This program follows a <strong data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"572\">progressive learning approach</strong>, where you begin with business fundamentals, move into HR and analytics integration, and finally develop <strong data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"747\">strategic leadership and data-driven decision-making capabilities</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"899\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"826\">fully detailed, SEO-optimized breakdown of all four semesters</strong>, including courses, skills, certifications, and real-world applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"904\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3uqvaw\" data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"965\">Semester 1 &ndash; Business Foundations, Analytics &amp; HR Basics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1134\">The first semester builds a <strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1077\">strong foundation in business, finance, analytics, and organizational behavior</strong>, which is essential before specializing in HR analytics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1155\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1386\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1179\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rf69vv\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1207\">Sustainability &amp; Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5ih8i\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1251\">Financial Reporting &amp; Corporate Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1of72ks\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1310\">Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9vwaxg\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1361\">Quantitative Techniques for Business Decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1386\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1391\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1420\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1504\">This semester focuses on building a <strong data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1503\">business mindset with analytical thinking</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1903\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o2lt2i\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1591\">Understanding how economic factors influence <strong data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1589\">business and workforce decisions</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1q8xr\" data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1660\">Learning ethical practices and <strong data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1658\">sustainability in HR policies</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x29wc4\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1741\">Gaining financial knowledge for <strong data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1739\">budgeting, compensation, and HR planning</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ws1r9j\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1821\">Understanding employee behavior, motivation, and <strong data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1819\">organizational culture</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y8su6t\" data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1903\">Applying quantitative methods and <strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1901\">basic AI concepts in business decisions</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1908\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1932\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2308\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n8z6fy\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1978\">Managerial economics and market analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nyqa8n\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2026\">Organizational behavior and HR fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9vm037\" data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2067\">ESG and sustainability understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eh2l41\" data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2113\">Financial modelling and accounting basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gnm2te\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2164\">HR analytics foundations and talent management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rnzrq\" data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2224\">Statistical techniques (regression, hypothesis testing)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18dvo28\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2269\">AI fundamentals and data-driven thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2560j\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2308\">Time Value of Money (TVM) analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2313\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2343\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2560\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qmzthi\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2387\">Negotiation and business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rb30pb\" data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2438\">Executive presence and professional networking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdun9m\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2470\">Cross-cultural intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15l6kp1\" data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2501\">Risk management strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"194ahfv\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2544\">Design thinking and data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vv2xlp\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2560\">AI literacy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2565\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2588\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2755\">This semester is critical because <strong data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2652\">modern HR is data-driven</strong>. Without understanding analytics and finance, you cannot effectively manage workforce decisions later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2760\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ylg6nm\" data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2828\">Semester 2 &ndash; Core HR Functions &amp; Business Analytics Integration</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2998\">The second semester introduces <strong data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2928\">core HR functions combined with analytics and business strategy</strong>, helping you understand how HR contributes to organizational success.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3019\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3183\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3041\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3066\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ngrelz\" data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3090\">Operations Research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zfiueq\" data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3132\">Business Law and Corporate Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s8llsw\" data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3183\">Business Analytics and Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3188\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3217\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3287\">You begin integrating <strong data-start=\"3241\" data-end=\"3286\">HR with business operations and analytics</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3627\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wmixah\" data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3358\">Understanding corporate governance and <strong data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3356\">legal compliance in HR</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nltyb2\" data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3443\">Learning marketing concepts that influence <strong data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3441\">employer branding and recruitment</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g00gty\" data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3517\">Using operations research for <strong data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3515\">resource and workforce optimization</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5gz3qm\" data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3573\">Applying analytics and AI in <strong data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3571\">HR decision-making</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12n1kqb\" data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3627\">Building entrepreneurial thinking for HR strategy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3629\" data-end=\"3632\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"3634\" data-end=\"3656\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3942\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12zoe2z\" data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3708\">Corporate governance and regulatory compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"odm454\" data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3755\">Workforce planning and market segmentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t6zffn\" data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3804\">Optimization techniques (linear programming)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"es67cb\" data-start=\"3805\" data-end=\"3840\">Project scheduling and planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12wwuoq\" data-start=\"3841\" data-end=\"3882\">Advanced Excel and business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"65j6vg\" data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"3942\">Entrepreneurial strategy and opportunity identification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"3947\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"3949\" data-end=\"3977\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4177\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f03wy1\" data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4032\">Digital transformation and cloud-based HR systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcjgqi\" data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4060\">AI strategy in business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7w3hu2\" data-start=\"4061\" data-end=\"4101\">Product and operations understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1790me2\" data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4129\">Agile business analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a0u78s\" data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4177\">Power BI and Tableau for data visualization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4182\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4205\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4207\" data-end=\"4346\">This semester builds the <strong data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4275\">bridge between HR and business strategy</strong>, which is essential for roles like HR Business Partner and HR Analyst.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4348\" data-end=\"4351\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10b7h1c\" data-start=\"4353\" data-end=\"4422\">Semester 3 &ndash; Advanced HR Analytics, Technology &amp; Talent Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4424\" data-end=\"4556\">This is the <strong data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4465\">core specialization phase</strong>, where HR meets <strong data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4555\">data analytics, automation, and technology-driven recruitment systems</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"4558\" data-end=\"4577\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4579\" data-end=\"4786\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zoxbqz\" data-start=\"4579\" data-end=\"4608\">Business Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"4609\" data-end=\"4634\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gsyan\" data-start=\"4635\" data-end=\"4672\">Talent Acquisition and Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fpdrmb\" data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4719\">Employee Management and Negotiation Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yoeshk\" data-start=\"4720\" data-end=\"4750\">Data Analytics with Python</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"81e517\" data-start=\"4751\" data-end=\"4786\">Data Visualization and Analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4788\" data-end=\"4791\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"4793\" data-end=\"4820\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4822\" data-end=\"4895\">This semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"4847\" data-end=\"4894\">practical HR analytics and technology tools</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4897\" data-end=\"5201\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nhh5o5\" data-start=\"4897\" data-end=\"4963\">Designing and executing <strong data-start=\"4923\" data-end=\"4961\">data-driven recruitment strategies</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v03iyp\" data-start=\"4964\" data-end=\"5025\">Using Python for <strong data-start=\"4983\" data-end=\"5023\">data analysis and workforce insights</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15pngq3\" data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5073\">Understanding employee lifecycle management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iol37\" data-start=\"5074\" data-end=\"5141\">Applying data visualization tools like <strong data-start=\"5115\" data-end=\"5139\">Power BI and Tableau</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yfnzkz\" data-start=\"5142\" data-end=\"5201\">Learning negotiation and conflict resolution techniques</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5203\" data-end=\"5206\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"5208\" data-end=\"5230\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5232\" data-end=\"5632\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nvfm3c\" data-start=\"5232\" data-end=\"5283\">Research methodologies and statistical analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pv2lz6\" data-start=\"5284\" data-end=\"5340\">Workforce planning and talent acquisition frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fyfsf\" data-start=\"5341\" data-end=\"5397\">Employer branding and employee engagement strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"htkmb9\" data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5441\">HR analytics and recruitment technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l14lh8\" data-start=\"5442\" data-end=\"5482\">Python programming for data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oq3mcd\" data-start=\"5483\" data-end=\"5535\">Data cleaning, transformation, and visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1md4f57\" data-start=\"5536\" data-end=\"5577\">Data storytelling for decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b19622\" data-start=\"5578\" data-end=\"5632\">Applicant tracking systems and workflow automation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5637\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"5639\" data-end=\"5667\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5669\" data-end=\"5848\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t3r0b9\" data-start=\"5669\" data-end=\"5713\">Core HR fundamentals and payroll systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itwuj9\" data-start=\"5714\" data-end=\"5738\">Technical recruiting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13k1fnt\" data-start=\"5739\" data-end=\"5784\">HR systems (SAP Human Capital Management)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hapcqn\" data-start=\"5785\" data-end=\"5810\">SQL for data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"imeni0\" data-start=\"5811\" data-end=\"5848\">HR technology tools and platforms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5850\" data-end=\"5853\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"5855\" data-end=\"5876\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5878\" data-end=\"6020\">This is the <strong data-start=\"5890\" data-end=\"5932\">most important semester for placements</strong>, as you gain <strong data-start=\"5946\" data-end=\"6019\">job-ready skills in HR analytics, data tools, and recruitment systems</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6022\" data-end=\"6025\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1a9qrop\" data-start=\"6027\" data-end=\"6087\">Semester 4 &ndash; Strategic HR Leadership &amp; Advanced Analytics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6089\" data-end=\"6223\">The final semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"6119\" data-end=\"6186\">leadership, strategic HR planning, and advanced analytics tools</strong>, preparing you for managerial roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"6225\" data-end=\"6244\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6246\" data-end=\"6449\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"6246\" data-end=\"6270\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wbm5cu\" data-start=\"6271\" data-end=\"6321\">Organization Development and Change Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1riwf4l\" data-start=\"6322\" data-end=\"6356\">Performance Management Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h4rbf\" data-start=\"6357\" data-end=\"6391\">Advanced Spreadsheet Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13u5qrv\" data-start=\"6392\" data-end=\"6421\">Data Analytics using SPSS</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rx70fy\" data-start=\"6422\" data-end=\"6449\">Master Thesis / Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6451\" data-end=\"6454\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"6456\" data-end=\"6483\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6485\" data-end=\"6551\">This semester prepares you for <strong data-start=\"6516\" data-end=\"6550\">leadership and strategic roles</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6553\" data-end=\"6836\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y4gkcj\" data-start=\"6553\" data-end=\"6608\">Designing HR strategies aligned with business goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ypa7vo\" data-start=\"6609\" data-end=\"6659\">Managing organizational change and development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h2ya1\" data-start=\"6660\" data-end=\"6712\">Building performance management systems and KPIs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0dxuy\" data-start=\"6713\" data-end=\"6769\">Using advanced tools like SPSS for <strong data-start=\"6750\" data-end=\"6767\">data analysis</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"an1i69\" data-start=\"6770\" data-end=\"6836\">Solving real-world business problems through research projects</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6838\" data-end=\"6841\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"6843\" data-end=\"6865\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6867\" data-end=\"7157\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y6sf56\" data-start=\"6867\" data-end=\"6914\">Strategic planning and competitive strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mipakz\" data-start=\"6915\" data-end=\"6967\">Organizational development and change management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dlxa9h\" data-start=\"6968\" data-end=\"7017\">KPI design and workforce performance analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tcx9aj\" data-start=\"7018\" data-end=\"7052\">Advanced spreadsheet modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ey1hb\" data-start=\"7053\" data-end=\"7094\">Statistical and multivariate analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ueah4w\" data-start=\"7095\" data-end=\"7129\">Research-based problem solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1in9bgj\" data-start=\"7130\" data-end=\"7157\">Strategic HR leadership</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7159\" data-end=\"7162\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"7164\" data-end=\"7192\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7194\" data-end=\"7393\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gt5pl9\" data-start=\"7194\" data-end=\"7239\">Leadership coaching and management skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105g328\" data-start=\"7240\" data-end=\"7280\">Compensation and benefits management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"47nc41\" data-start=\"7281\" data-end=\"7323\">Microsoft Power Apps and HR tech tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w1f7b4\" data-start=\"7324\" data-end=\"7356\">Change management strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qb0sdx\" data-start=\"7357\" data-end=\"7393\">Employee experience optimization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7395\" data-end=\"7398\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"7400\" data-end=\"7421\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7423\" data-end=\"7612\">Your <strong data-start=\"7428\" data-end=\"7454\">final project (thesis)</strong> plays a crucial role in placements. It demonstrates your ability to <strong data-start=\"7523\" data-end=\"7573\">solve real HR problems using data and strategy</strong>, which is highly valued by recruiters.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 175000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(280, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 253, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 05:17:46', '2026-06-16 06:59:39', '<p data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"365\">The <strong data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"107\">MBA admission process</strong> is structured to be simple, but each stage involves <strong data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"230\">critical decisions, verification checks, and financial commitments</strong>. Understanding every step in detail ensures that you <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"364\">avoid delays, prevent rejection, and secure your admission without confusion</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"557\">This section provides a <strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"444\">fully SEO-optimized, deeply explanatory breakdown</strong> of the admission process, helping you move from application to confirmed enrollment with clarity and confidence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"562\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"lq2g32\" data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"618\">Step 1: Submit Application &ndash; Start Your MBA Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"745\">The admission process begins with filling out the <strong data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"697\">online application form</strong>, which is your official entry into the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kcrm5x\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"770\">What You Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"935\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eb82ny\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"831\">Enter personal details (name, contact number, email ID)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mvjmz\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"897\">Provide academic information (10th, 12th, graduation details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1umyk6m\" data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"935\">Select your preferred MBA program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fg0bqg\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"967\">Why This Step Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1032\">This step creates your <strong data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1012\">academic profile</strong>, which is used for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1137\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qkkbh8\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1062\">Eligibility verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aur99o\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1086\">Document validation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p1rd7q\" data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1137\">Communication throughout the admission process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1167\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1297\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i1qldm\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1206\">Entering incorrect academic marks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f4qhbf\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1247\">Using inactive email or phone number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p7w837\" data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1297\">Submitting the form without reviewing details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1my1m11\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1313\">Expert Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1469\">Always <strong data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1362\">double-check all entered information</strong> before submission. Even small errors can delay your admission or create complications during verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1474\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rh5u8k\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1539\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program &ndash; Confirm Your Specialization</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1654\">After submitting your application, the next step is to <strong data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1653\">select and confirm your MBA program or specialization</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kcrm5x\" data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1679\">What You Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pkuyku\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1721\">Choose your preferred specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dvkii7\" data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1764\">Review all submitted details carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z30nxr\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1792\">Confirm your enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kwr939\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1823\">Why This Step Is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1941\">This decision defines your <strong data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1897\">career direction and future opportunities</strong>. Your chosen specialization will influence:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"2035\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bbq4hr\" data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1971\">Job roles and industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pagfrk\" data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2007\">Skill development and expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ddqon8\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2035\">Long-term salary growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xvkk9r\" data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2069\">Common Mistake Students Make</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2128\">Many students choose programs based on trends instead of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2188\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"138t7zq\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2151\">Personal interest</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3akl8\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2168\">Career goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fvqqz9\" data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2188\">Industry demand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2211\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2340\">Take time to evaluate your strengths and career plans. A wrong choice at this stage can <strong data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2339\">limit your career growth potential</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2345\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1sjlz2p\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2410\">Step 3: Complete Payment &ndash; Financial Planning &amp; Fee Strategy</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2534\">Once enrollment is confirmed, you must complete the <strong data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2479\">fee payment</strong>, which is essential for proceeding to final admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2565\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2588\">One-Time Payment</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2672\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pg4148\" data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2618\">Pay the full fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tt3luf\" data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2672\">Get a <strong data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2643\">15% discount</strong>, reducing the overall cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2706\">Education Loan / EMI Option</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2816\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"blh4ri\" data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2748\">Pay through <strong data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2746\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juapd3\" data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2816\">Often available with <strong data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2787\">0% interest</strong>, making it more affordable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2821\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"199q9bx\" data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2882\">Choosing the Right Payment Option &ndash; Smart Decision Guide</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2995\">Selecting the right payment mode is not just about affordability&mdash;it&rsquo;s about <strong data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"2994\">long-term financial efficiency</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f8r5bc\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3028\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3170\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m914eg\" data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3073\">Students who can afford upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tbozym\" data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3128\">Those who want to <strong data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3126\">save money through discounts</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nzeqy8\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3170\">Avoiding future financial obligations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lzmvu4\" data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3197\">EMI / Loan &ndash; Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3294\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j1vwmg\" data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3244\">Students who prefer <strong data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3242\">flexible payments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1obmysg\" data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3294\">Those managing multiple financial commitments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"3296\" data-end=\"3317\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3466\">Many students choose EMI for convenience but ignore the <strong data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3420\">cost-saving advantage of one-time payment</strong>. Always compare both options before deciding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3471\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5qr8cl\" data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3531\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat &ndash; Final Admission Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3611\">This is the final stage where your admission becomes <strong data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3610\">officially confirmed</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjl3k3\" data-start=\"3613\" data-end=\"3643\">What Happens After Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3645\" data-end=\"3805\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"69g0rb\" data-start=\"3645\" data-end=\"3692\">Your <strong data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3690\">seat in the MBA program is secured</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e267pj\" data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3740\">You receive official admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wu0g9m\" data-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3805\">You gain access to learning platforms and academic resources</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"265v1c\" data-start=\"3807\" data-end=\"3831\">Important Conditions</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3987\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k7k4no\" data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3899\">Admission is confirmed <strong data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3897\">only after payment or loan approval</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jqilrm\" data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3987\">Delay in payment can result in <strong data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"3949\">loss of seat</strong>, especially in high-demand programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"3989\" data-end=\"4004\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4114\">Seats are limited, and postponing payment may cause you to <strong data-start=\"4065\" data-end=\"4113\">miss your preferred intake or specialization</strong>.&nbsp;</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"430\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"137\">MBA eligibility criteria</strong> is essential before applying, because even small misunderstandings can lead to <strong data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"282\">rejection during verification or cancellation after admission</strong>. While the criteria look simple, the real importance lies in <strong data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"429\">how you interpret your degree, calculate marks, and meet conditional requirements</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"582\">This section provides a <strong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"508\">deep, fully explanatory, SEO-optimized breakdown</strong> so you can confidently assess your eligibility and avoid common mistakes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"587\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kzmz8\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"650\">Minimum Educational Qualification &ndash; Who Can Apply for MBA?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"741\">To apply for the MBA program, candidates must fulfill the following academic requirement:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"1295\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10bj641\" data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"807\">Must have completed an <strong data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"805\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) degree</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mok0cl\" data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"864\">The degree should be of <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"862\">minimum 3 years duration</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ntjr5p\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"966\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"906\">any academic stream</strong> are eligible (Arts, Commerce, Science, Engineering, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cquiqa\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1026\">The degree must be from a <strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1024\">UGC-recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ltvkyo\" data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1160\"><strong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1158\">Candidates appearing for Class 12 earlier and now completing graduation follow standard academic progression and are eligible</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3k8a69\" data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1295\"><strong data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1234\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling) candidates are eligible</strong>, provided their graduation is from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jwvp81\" data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1329\">Why This Requirement Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1625\">MBA programs are designed to build <strong data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1411\">advanced management and leadership skills</strong>, which require a foundational understanding of structured learning. A recognized bachelor&rsquo;s degree ensures that students are academically prepared for subjects like <strong data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1624\">finance, marketing, analytics, and strategy</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1648\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1841\">The MBA is intentionally flexible, allowing students from <strong data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1738\">non-management backgrounds</strong> to transition into business roles. This makes it one of the most <strong data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1840\">accessible postgraduate programs</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jwyhd6\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1905\">Minimum Marks Requirement &ndash; Understanding the 50% Rule</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1972\">Academic performance plays a key role in determining eligibility:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2136\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1dofx\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2040\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2012\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in graduation is required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ct3a5\" data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2136\">Equivalent grading systems (CGPA or letter grades) are accepted as per university standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wvf11s\" data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2176\">Relaxation for Reserved Categories</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2298\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hqds4z\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2254\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2224\">SC/ST categories</strong> receive a <strong data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2252\">5% relaxation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rfmem\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2298\">Minimum required marks: <strong data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2298\">45% aggregate</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2876\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kjm50j\" data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2939\">Eligibility for Final-Year Students &ndash; Apply Before Results</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"3012\">Students who have not yet completed their graduation are also eligible:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3144\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ubvab\" data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3092\">Candidates in the <strong data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3080\">final semester of their Bachelor&rsquo;s program</strong> can apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14yvqy\" data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3144\">Admission is granted on a <strong data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3142\">provisional basis</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aql1h1\" data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3182\">What Provisional Admission Means</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3389\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mv3lvc\" data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3256\">You can apply and secure your seat before final results are declared</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2vs9i\" data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3319\">You must complete your degree within the required timeline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11bpzrf\" data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3389\">You must still meet the <strong data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3389\">minimum marks requirement after results</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3406\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3545\">If your final results fall below the required eligibility criteria, your admission may be <strong data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3511\">cancelled</strong>, even after initial confirmation.</p>', '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"407\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"133\">MBA fees structure</strong> is critical because it directly impacts your <strong data-start=\"179\" data-end=\"248\">financial planning, affordability, and return on investment (ROI)</strong>. Many students only look at the total fee, but a smart decision requires analyzing <strong data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"406\">payment flexibility, additional charges, and long-term cost efficiency</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"561\">This section provides a <strong data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"478\">fully detailed, SEO-optimized explanation</strong> of the MBA fee structure, helping you make a <strong data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"560\">well-informed financial decision</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"566\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"orit9b\" data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"608\">Total MBA Fees &ndash; Overall Program Cost</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"647\">The total fee for the MBA program is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"685\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvkdq7\" data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"685\"><strong data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"683\">₹1,96,000 (Full Program Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"814\">This fee covers the <strong data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"731\">complete MBA program</strong>, including academic delivery, learning resources, and access to digital platforms.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18yzclb\" data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"848\">What This Means for Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"1050\">Compared to traditional MBA programs (₹5&ndash;20 lakhs), this program offers a <strong data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"962\">high-value, affordable alternative</strong>, making it ideal for students who want <strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1049\">quality education with lower financial risk</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8yj8sk\" data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1113\">MBA Fee Payment Options &ndash; Flexible &amp; Student-Friendly</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1198\">The program offers multiple payment options to suit different financial situations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14vczfv\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1223\">Fee Structure Table</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1280\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1280\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1247\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1267\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1280\" data-col-size=\"md\">Ideal For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1408\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1357\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1356\">One-Time Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1376\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,96,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1408\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students who can pay upfront</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1496\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1432\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1429\">Yearly Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1451\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹98,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1496\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students preferring moderate installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1520\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1516\">Semester-Wise</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1543\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹49,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1580\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students seeking low upfront cost</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"swa4q3\" data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1646\">Payment Options Explained &ndash; Which One Should You Choose?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1773\">Choosing the right payment option is not just about affordability&mdash;it&rsquo;s about <strong data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1772\">long-term financial efficiency and planning</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"771879\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1826\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Maximum Financial Efficiency</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1955\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v2jxgz\" data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1880\">Best for students who can afford upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i470h0\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1916\">No future financial obligations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwiqax\" data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1955\">Helps in better financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h8a7mp\" data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1995\">Yearly Payment &ndash; Balanced Approach</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2089\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15sc5a2\" data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2033\">Splits cost into two equal parts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hrqh75\" data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2089\">Suitable for students with stable financial support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18sg4qd\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2138\">Semester-Wise Payment &ndash; Highest Flexibility</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2237\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fm0dv0\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2177\">Lowest immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wxmyld\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2237\">Ideal for working professionals or self-funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2242\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1d0yb7r\" data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2280\">EMI Option &ndash; Study Now, Pay Later</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2395\">The MBA program also provides <strong data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2357\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) options</strong>, making it easier to manage finances.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k49m0a\" data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2416\">Benefits of EMI</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2557\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1afqnz\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2478\">Converts large fees into <strong data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2476\">manageable monthly payments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dpzg1j\" data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2509\">Reduces financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n972e8\" data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2557\">Allows students to pursue MBA without delay</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"thivjj\" data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2590\">Important Financial Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2625\">While EMI improves accessibility:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"climcq\" data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2674\">Always evaluate your <strong data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2672\">repayment capacity</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qruqsc\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2721\">Understand long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3lkljy\" data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2777\">Compare EMI with one-time payment for cost benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2782\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"akfixr\" data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2835\">Additional Fees &ndash; Hidden Costs You Must Consider</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2954\">Many students ignore additional charges, which leads to <strong data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2927\">underestimating the total cost</strong>. Here&rsquo;s a clear breakdown:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t268wb\" data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2981\">For Students in India</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3067\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pxmkb4\" data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3025\"><strong data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3023\">₹2,500 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17o46gq\" data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3067\"><strong data-start=\"3028\" data-end=\"3065\">₹3,000 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rjtz3g\" data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3104\">For Students in SAARC Countries</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3182\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"613tr0\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3140\"><strong data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3138\">₹11,250 (Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dzg920\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3182\"><strong data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3180\">₹3,750 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bnizb1\" data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3214\">For International Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3295\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lyt09e\" data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3256\"><strong data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3254\">$150 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43rawd\" data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3295\"><strong data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3293\">$50 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"517\">An MBA in <strong data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"160\">AI-Powered Business Management</strong> is designed for the next generation of professionals who want to combine <strong data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"327\">business strategy with artificial intelligence, data analytics, and emerging technologies</strong>. This is not a traditional MBA&mdash;it is a <strong data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"393\">future-focused program</strong> that prepares you to work in <strong data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"516\">AI-driven organizations, fintech, consulting, analytics, and digital transformation roles</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"747\">The curriculum follows a <strong data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"587\">progressive, industry-aligned structure</strong>, where you start with fundamentals, move into AI-integrated business functions, and finally master <strong data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"746\">advanced AI strategy, fintech, and predictive analytics</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"907\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"834\">deep, fully explanatory, SEO-optimized breakdown of all four semesters</strong>, including courses, skills, certifications, and real-world applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"912\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5i4wsv\" data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"971\">Semester 1 &ndash; Business Fundamentals with AI Integration</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1125\">The first semester builds a <strong data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1069\">strong foundation in business, communication, and data analytics</strong>, enhanced with <strong data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1124\">AI tools and practical applications</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1146\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1403\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1htbvo9\" data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1201\">Financial and Management Accounting with AI Tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bmrabj\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1243\">Managerial Economics in the Age of AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18207x3\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1287\">Marketing Principles with Generative AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yivzty\" data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1326\">AI Tools for Business Productivity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mk87of\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1363\">Data Analytics and Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n90es6\" data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1403\">The Art of Persuasive Communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1408\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1437\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1515\">This semester introduces how <strong data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1514\">AI is transforming core business functions</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"2002\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j7fdob\" data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1597\">Understanding financial statements and budgeting using <strong data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1595\">AI-assisted tools</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6pf7te\" data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1678\">Applying economic principles in <strong data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1676\">data-driven decision-making environments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bbn7f\" data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1764\">Using generative AI for <strong data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1762\">marketing content, campaigns, and customer engagement</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zv2t51\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1845\">Learning productivity tools powered by AI to <strong data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1843\">automate business workflows</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bgqjdp\" data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1916\">Building dashboards and visualizing data for <strong data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1914\">business insights</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1skvpcs\" data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"2002\">Developing communication skills for <strong data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"2000\">presentations, persuasion, and leadership</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2007\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2031\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2380\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ylnsj\" data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2088\">Financial analysis and cost-benefit decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wif5pn\" data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2138\">Budgeting, forecasting, and anomaly detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ewhufe\" data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2185\">AI platform usage (low-code/no-code tools)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1irupzr\" data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2239\">Ethical AI practices and governance understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rua43s\" data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2286\">Statistical analysis and data storytelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ai5cam\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2336\">Report writing and professional communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l2t5h6\" data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2380\">Public speaking and presentation skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2385\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2415\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2565\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fif21q\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2444\">SQL for data management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b1j4hf\" data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2479\">Tableau for data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"amhhek\" data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2524\">ESG fundamentals for financial decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k89imq\" data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2565\">Prompt engineering for generative AI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2570\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2593\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2782\">This semester builds your <strong data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2654\">core AI + business foundation</strong>. Students who actively practice AI tools here gain an early advantage in <strong data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2781\">internships, freelancing, and real-world projects</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2787\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"y0t4ss\" data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2850\">Semester 2 &ndash; AI in Business Functions &amp; Strategic Thinking</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"3008\">The second semester focuses on integrating <strong data-start=\"2895\" data-end=\"2959\">AI into business operations, HR, sales, and entrepreneurship</strong>, helping you understand real-world applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3029\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3263\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mshtcg\" data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3085\">AI in Sales Intelligence and Distribution Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xnhppo\" data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3134\">Organizational Behavior and People Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a476tq\" data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3185\">Operations and Supply Chain with AI Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wwgsxf\" data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3231\">Business Communication and Report Writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4q6ulg\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3263\">Entrepreneurship Essentials</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3268\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3297\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3373\">This semester emphasizes <strong data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3372\">AI-driven decision-making across departments</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3664\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2jlhw\" data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3439\">Using AI for <strong data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3437\">sales forecasting and customer intelligence</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hud11q\" data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3495\">Applying people analytics in <strong data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3493\">HR decision-making</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"paiqf6\" data-start=\"3496\" data-end=\"3547\">Automating supply chain and operations using AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b0qmm1\" data-start=\"3548\" data-end=\"3602\">Improving professional communication and reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hvkjfm\" data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3664\">Building entrepreneurial skills for <strong data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3662\">AI-based startups</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3666\" data-end=\"3669\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"3671\" data-end=\"3693\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3915\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qecepb\" data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3732\">Strategic planning and leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1al65o3\" data-start=\"3733\" data-end=\"3784\">Organizational behavior and workforce analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cr0u72\" data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3826\">Business research and design thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p70ja6\" data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3870\">Business planning and venture financing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gucgo7\" data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3915\">AI integration into operations and sales</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3917\" data-end=\"3920\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"3950\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"4069\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1optrg9\" data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"3990\">Scrum and agile project management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x45kuf\" data-start=\"3991\" data-end=\"4030\">Python and Pandas for data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j1x1w\" data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4069\">Power BI for business intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4074\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4097\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4250\">This semester builds your ability to <strong data-start=\"4136\" data-end=\"4178\">connect AI with real business problems</strong>, which is essential for roles in consulting, analytics, and management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4252\" data-end=\"4255\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"iej3bo\" data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4320\">Semester 3 &ndash; Advanced AI Strategy, Finance &amp; Risk Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4322\" data-end=\"4465\">This is the <strong data-start=\"4334\" data-end=\"4363\">core specialization phase</strong>, where you gain expertise in <strong data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4464\">AI strategy, fintech, risk management, and advanced decision-making</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"4467\" data-end=\"4486\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4488\" data-end=\"4791\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zoxbqz\" data-start=\"4488\" data-end=\"4517\">Business Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zg2y7e\" data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4553\">AI for Business Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xhodub\" data-start=\"4554\" data-end=\"4592\">Strategic Management in the AI Era</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jmlntg\" data-start=\"4593\" data-end=\"4634\">AI in Corporate Finance and Valuation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nfblj3\" data-start=\"4635\" data-end=\"4684\">AI-Driven Risk Management and Fraud Detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cdt3uj\" data-start=\"4685\" data-end=\"4713\">Psychology of Leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"681sdp\" data-start=\"4714\" data-end=\"4791\">Design Thinking and Product Development / Business Law in the Digital Age</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4793\" data-end=\"4796\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"4798\" data-end=\"4825\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4903\">This semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"4852\" data-end=\"4902\">high-impact, industry-level applications of AI</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4905\" data-end=\"5310\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uf3y8\" data-start=\"4905\" data-end=\"4970\">Using AI for <strong data-start=\"4920\" data-end=\"4968\">strategic business decisions and forecasting</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s8wgqy\" data-start=\"4971\" data-end=\"5030\">Applying AI in financial modeling and company valuation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4bfdsq\" data-start=\"5031\" data-end=\"5094\">Detecting fraud and managing risks using advanced analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mdgm8g\" data-start=\"5095\" data-end=\"5165\">Understanding fintech ecosystems including <strong data-start=\"5140\" data-end=\"5163\">blockchain and DeFi</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2yo2e9\" data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5239\">Developing leadership psychology for managing teams and organizations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kzjd8c\" data-start=\"5240\" data-end=\"5310\">Designing innovative products using <strong data-start=\"5278\" data-end=\"5308\">design thinking principles</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5312\" data-end=\"5315\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"5317\" data-end=\"5339\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5341\" data-end=\"5635\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fepvpw\" data-start=\"5341\" data-end=\"5385\">AI tools for productivity and automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ir0gc0\" data-start=\"5386\" data-end=\"5422\">Robotic Process Automation (RPA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywi0zy\" data-start=\"5423\" data-end=\"5458\">Blockchain and fintech analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17xssop\" data-start=\"5459\" data-end=\"5506\">Financial modeling and valuation techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t8rcu7\" data-start=\"5507\" data-end=\"5551\">Fraud detection and behavioral analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e7tcdy\" data-start=\"5552\" data-end=\"5599\">Strategic restructuring and decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12pmhqn\" data-start=\"5600\" data-end=\"5635\">Entrepreneurship and innovation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5637\" data-end=\"5640\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"5642\" data-end=\"5670\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5672\" data-end=\"5844\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bpijeh\" data-start=\"5672\" data-end=\"5720\">Python for data science and machine learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mj3wnc\" data-start=\"5721\" data-end=\"5762\">Treasury and derivatives fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eskms2\" data-start=\"5763\" data-end=\"5796\">Business valuation techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ini8zq\" data-start=\"5797\" data-end=\"5844\">Prompt engineering with advanced frameworks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5846\" data-end=\"5849\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"5851\" data-end=\"5872\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5874\" data-end=\"6055\">This is the <strong data-start=\"5886\" data-end=\"5930\">most critical semester for career growth</strong>, as it builds <strong data-start=\"5945\" data-end=\"6011\">high-demand skills in AI strategy, fintech, and risk analytics</strong>, which are highly valued in the job market.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6057\" data-end=\"6060\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1satsc8\" data-start=\"6062\" data-end=\"6131\">Semester 4 &ndash; Leadership, Fintech Innovation &amp; Predictive Analytics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6133\" data-end=\"6242\">The final semester prepares you for <strong data-start=\"6169\" data-end=\"6241\">leadership roles and advanced decision-making using AI and analytics</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"6244\" data-end=\"6263\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6265\" data-end=\"6546\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12kmran\" data-start=\"6265\" data-end=\"6312\">AI-Enabled Leadership and Change Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i8yzt8\" data-start=\"6313\" data-end=\"6364\">Fintech Innovations: Blockchain, RPA and Beyond</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ld0or\" data-start=\"6365\" data-end=\"6422\">Predictive Financial Modelling for Business Decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i7scpk\" data-start=\"6423\" data-end=\"6470\">Tech-Driven M&amp;A and Corporate Restructuring</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p31pm3\" data-start=\"6471\" data-end=\"6500\">Emerging Tech in Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qs5p96\" data-start=\"6501\" data-end=\"6546\">Research / Project (Earn While You Learn)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6548\" data-end=\"6551\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"6553\" data-end=\"6580\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6582\" data-end=\"6668\">This semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"6607\" data-end=\"6667\">real-world business leadership and advanced technologies</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6670\" data-end=\"7029\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jiyzoh\" data-start=\"6670\" data-end=\"6732\">Leading organizations through <strong data-start=\"6702\" data-end=\"6730\">AI-driven transformation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"au84he\" data-start=\"6733\" data-end=\"6801\">Understanding fintech innovations like blockchain and automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q9vim9\" data-start=\"6802\" data-end=\"6875\">Building predictive models for <strong data-start=\"6835\" data-end=\"6873\">financial and business forecasting</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6z5koz\" data-start=\"6876\" data-end=\"6946\">Managing mergers, acquisitions, and restructuring using technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eue3af\" data-start=\"6947\" data-end=\"7029\">Working on real-world projects to gain <strong data-start=\"6988\" data-end=\"7027\">practical experience while learning</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7031\" data-end=\"7034\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"7036\" data-end=\"7058\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7060\" data-end=\"7352\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f765o9\" data-start=\"7060\" data-end=\"7112\">Financial data analysis and predictive analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dyrzri\" data-start=\"7113\" data-end=\"7157\">CRM systems and customer data management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p59sxl\" data-start=\"7158\" data-end=\"7212\">Supply chain and business operations understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x6y0si\" data-start=\"7213\" data-end=\"7260\">Deep learning basics and advanced analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gpwwg1\" data-start=\"7261\" data-end=\"7312\">Credit risk management and financial evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16bd76d\" data-start=\"7313\" data-end=\"7352\">Blockchain and fintech applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7354\" data-end=\"7357\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"7359\" data-end=\"7387\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7389\" data-end=\"7586\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sukzxk\" data-start=\"7389\" data-end=\"7429\">Advanced Python for machine learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hbzeq1\" data-start=\"7430\" data-end=\"7466\">AI-based time series forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7v2wan\" data-start=\"7467\" data-end=\"7501\">Financial modeling using Excel</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4z26h\" data-start=\"7502\" data-end=\"7550\">AI in fintech and cloud certifications (AWS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkdgjx\" data-start=\"7551\" data-end=\"7586\">Generative AI for data analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7588\" data-end=\"7591\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"7593\" data-end=\"7614\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7616\" data-end=\"7823\">Your <strong data-start=\"7621\" data-end=\"7662\">final project and hands-on experience</strong> play a major role in placements. This is where you demonstrate your ability to <strong data-start=\"7742\" data-end=\"7781\">apply AI in real business scenarios</strong>, making you highly valuable to employers.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(281, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 254, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 05:54:42', '2026-06-16 07:00:05', '<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"356\">The <strong data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"117\">MBA admission process</strong> is designed to be simple, but each stage involves <strong data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"239\">important decisions, verification checks, and financial commitments</strong>. A clear understanding of every step helps you <strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"355\">avoid delays, prevent errors, and secure your admission smoothly</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"487\">This is a <strong data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"413\">fully detailed, SEO-optimized explanation</strong> of the complete admission journey&mdash;from application to final confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"492\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1blthk8\" data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"553\">Step 1: Submit Application &ndash; Begin Your MBA Registration</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"668\">The first step is to complete the <strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"616\">online application form</strong>, which officially initiates your admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kcrm5x\" data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"693\">What You Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oxcj4u\" data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"760\">Fill in <strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"725\">personal details</strong> (name, contact number, email ID)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10jgdde\" data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"830\">Enter <strong data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"789\">academic details</strong> (graduation marks, university details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fdzmm3\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"872\">Choose your <strong data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"870\">preferred MBA program</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"877\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"117svo1\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"912\">What Happens After Submission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"929\">Once submitted:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1071\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fut7mb\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"972\">Your profile is created in the system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8uxg5\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1005\">Your eligibility is reviewed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r8hkd5\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1071\">You start receiving official updates regarding your admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1076\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kwr939\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1107\">Why This Step Is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1209\">This stage forms the <strong data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1177\">foundation of your entire admission process</strong>. Any incorrect information can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x7daec\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1233\">Delay verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7u7kxt\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1278\">Lead to rejection during document checks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v0sqrt\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1316\">Create issues in final enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1321\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1351\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n9xpn\" data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1412\">Entering incorrect marks or incomplete academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0fcec\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1456\">Using an inactive email or phone number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hyp775\" data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1498\">Submitting the form without reviewing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1503\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1my1m11\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1519\">Expert Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1673\">Always <strong data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1574\">double-check all details before submission</strong>, especially your <strong data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1628\">name, marks, and contact details</strong>, as corrections later can be time-consuming.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1678\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rs9oje\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1747\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program &ndash; Confirm Your MBA Specialization</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1858\">After submitting your application, the next step is to <strong data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1857\">select and confirm your program or specialization</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kcrm5x\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1883\">What You Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1995\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y83yxx\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1923\">Choose your <strong data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1921\">MBA specialization</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1imvvuh\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1967\">Verify all previously submitted details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z30nxr\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1995\">Confirm your enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2000\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2027\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2060\">Your chosen program determines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2200\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vp87jx\" data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2100\">Your <strong data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2098\">career path and job roles</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eiuf5b\" data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2136\">The <strong data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2134\">skills you will develop</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15nwjzq\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2200\">Your <strong data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2198\">future salary potential and industry opportunities</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2205\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2228\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2336\">Many students make the mistake of choosing a specialization based on trends. Instead, you should evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2441\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5u8tz6\" data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2373\">Your <strong data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2371\">interest and strengths</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cx1ry0\" data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2413\">Market demand and job opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b07u0i\" data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2441\">Long-term career growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2446\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kzox0n\" data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2466\">Common Mistake</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2584\">Selecting a program without proper research can lead to <strong data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2577\">low career satisfaction and limited opportunities</strong> later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2589\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1upc974\" data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2654\">Step 3: Complete Payment &ndash; Choose the Right Financial Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2758\">After enrollment, you must complete the <strong data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2711\">fee payment</strong>, which is essential to proceed with admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2789\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2812\">One-Time Payment</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2896\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zay3ag\" data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2846\">Pay the <strong data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2844\">full fee upfront</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bqwy26\" data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2896\">Get a <strong data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2871\">15% discount</strong>, reducing overall cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2930\">Education Loan / EMI Option</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"3031\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"blh4ri\" data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2972\">Pay through <strong data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2970\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qyogik\" data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3031\">Often comes with <strong data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3007\">0% interest</strong>, making it affordable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3036\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tg6uz4\" data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3079\">How to Choose the Best Payment Option</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3125\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Best for Cost Saving</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3255\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xo1vr6\" data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3168\">Ideal if you have financial readiness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ujmv7z\" data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3216\">Helps avoid long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ve7pzg\" data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3255\">Maximizes savings through discount</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3295\">EMI / Loan &ndash; Best for Flexibility</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3416\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dcghk4\" data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3355\">Suitable if you prefer <strong data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3353\">manageable monthly payments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajvx5k\" data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3416\">Useful for working professionals or self-funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3418\" data-end=\"3421\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"thivjj\" data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3454\">Important Financial Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3616\">Many students choose EMI for convenience but ignore the <strong data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3560\">long-term cost advantage of one-time payment</strong>. Always compare both options carefully before deciding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3621\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5qr8cl\" data-start=\"3623\" data-end=\"3681\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat &ndash; Final Admission Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3765\">This is the final stage where your MBA admission becomes <strong data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3764\">officially confirmed</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjl3k3\" data-start=\"3767\" data-end=\"3797\">What Happens After Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3962\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w2jcz2\" data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3843\">Your <strong data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"3841\">seat is reserved in the program</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qfjbb\" data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3895\">You receive <strong data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3893\">official admission confirmation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h0rmiy\" data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"3962\">Access to academic systems and learning platforms is initiated</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3964\" data-end=\"3967\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"265v1c\" data-start=\"3969\" data-end=\"3993\">Important Conditions</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"4160\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jbnjwo\" data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"4072\">Admission is confirmed <strong data-start=\"4020\" data-end=\"4070\">only after successful payment or loan approval</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3whoi3\" data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4160\">Delay in payment may result in <strong data-start=\"4106\" data-end=\"4122\">loss of seat</strong>, especially in high-demand programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4162\" data-end=\"4165\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"4167\" data-end=\"4182\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4238\">Seats are limited, and postponing payment can lead to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4240\" data-end=\"4320\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eno2df\" data-start=\"4240\" data-end=\"4280\">Losing your preferred specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3s1951\" data-start=\"4281\" data-end=\"4320\">Missing the current admission cycle</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"510\">Before applying for an MBA, understanding the <strong data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"177\">eligibility criteria in depth</strong> is essential. While the requirements may appear simple, many students face rejection due to <strong data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"383\">misinterpretation of rules, incorrect percentage calculation, or lack of clarity about final-year eligibility</strong>. This guide explains everything in a <strong data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"462\">clear, detailed, and strategic manner</strong> so you can confidently assess your eligibility.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"515\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pofefn\" data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"580\">Minimum Educational Qualification &ndash; Who Is Eligible for MBA?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"669\">To apply for the MBA program, candidates must meet the following academic requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"1171\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"193fejn\" data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"722\">A <strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"696\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> (Undergraduate program)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1spgyzq\" data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"758\">Minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"756\">3 years</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"spb8az\" data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"814\">Degree must be from a <strong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"812\">UGC-recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w8joag\" data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"900\">Open to students from <strong data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"853\">any stream</strong> (Arts, Commerce, Science, Engineering, etc.)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4a7cih\" data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1204\">Why This Requirement Exists</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1494\">MBA programs are designed to build <strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1299\">advanced managerial, analytical, and leadership skills</strong>. A recognized bachelor&rsquo;s degree ensures that students already have a <strong data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1398\">basic academic foundation</strong>, making them capable of handling subjects like <strong data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1493\">finance, analytics, marketing, and strategy</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1499\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jwyhd6\" data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1558\">Minimum Marks Requirement &ndash; Understanding the 50% Rule</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1617\">Academic performance plays a crucial role in eligibility:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1773\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4utl5\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1690\">Candidates must have at least <strong data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1674\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tqqdyj\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1773\">Equivalent grading systems such as <strong data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1753\">CGPA or letter grades</strong> are also accepted</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wvf11s\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1813\">Relaxation for Reserved Categories</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1944\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cif7vo\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1881\"><strong data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1837\">SC/ST candidates</strong> are eligible with <strong data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1879\">45% aggregate marks</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3vkwki\" data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1944\">A <strong data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1903\">5% relaxation</strong> is provided as per standard guidelines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2565\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"y54num\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2638\">Final-Year Students Eligibility &ndash; Apply Before Graduation Completion</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2694\">Students currently in their final year can also apply:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2833\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w1p688\" data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2776\">Candidates in the <strong data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2774\">final semester of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree are eligible</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mczjbt\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2833\">Admission will be granted on a <strong data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2831\">provisional basis</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aql1h1\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2871\">What Provisional Admission Means</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"3083\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tjnq9e\" data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2932\">You can apply and secure your seat before final results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ul0ix1\" data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2996\">You must complete your degree within the required timeframe</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g3p90\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3083\">Final eligibility depends on meeting the <strong data-start=\"3040\" data-end=\"3083\">minimum marks requirement after results</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3100\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3159\">If your final result falls below the required percentage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3248\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xnn561\" data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3200\">Your admission may be <strong data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3198\">cancelled</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n1vtwc\" data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3248\">Fees paid may be subject to refund policies</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"425\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"133\">MBA fees structure</strong> is not just about knowing the total amount&mdash;it&rsquo;s about evaluating <strong data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"288\">payment flexibility, hidden costs, financial planning, and return on investment (ROI)</strong>. Many students make decisions based only on headline fees, but a smarter approach involves analyzing the <strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"424\">complete financial picture</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"557\">This section provides a <strong data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"496\">fully detailed, SEO-optimized explanation</strong> to help you make a confident and financially sound decision.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"562\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13u4tj7\" data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"601\">Total MBA Fees &ndash; Full Program Cost</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"648\">The total tuition fee for the MBA program is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"690\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dv96qt\" data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"690\"><strong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"688\">₹1,96,000 (Complete Program Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"720\">This fee generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s43z3u\" data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"783\">Academic delivery (lectures, digital content, LMS access)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q935g0\" data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"828\">Curriculum resources and study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15d0wz1\" data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"863\">Program-level academic support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18yzclb\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"897\">What This Means for Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"1147\">Compared to traditional MBA programs that often cost <strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"967\">₹5&ndash;20 lakhs</strong>, this program is positioned as a <strong data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1043\">cost-effective, high-value alternative</strong>, especially for students targeting careers in <strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1146\">business analytics, AI, marketing, HR, or operations</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1152\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e15y2a\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1219\">MBA Fee Payment Options &ndash; Flexible &amp; Student-Centric Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1352\">To make the program accessible, multiple payment options are available. Each option is designed for different financial situations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14vczfv\" data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1377\">Fee Structure Table</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1802\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1401\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1421\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1440\" data-col-size=\"md\">Best Suited For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1802\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1523\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1522\">One-Time Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1542\">₹1,96,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1607\">Students who want to pay upfront and avoid future obligations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1700\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1631\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1628\">Yearly Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1650\">₹98,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1700\">Students preferring structured annual payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1802\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1724\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1720\">Semester-Wise</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1747\">₹49,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1802\">Students looking for lower upfront financial burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1807\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fdd7n5\" data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1874\">Payment Options Explained &ndash; Strategic Financial Decision Guide</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"2013\">Choosing the right payment option is not just about convenience&mdash;it directly affects your <strong data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2012\">financial efficiency and long-term planning</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18xf2pa\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2057\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Best Value Approach</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2206\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dlayby\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2095\">Eliminates future payment stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwiqax\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2134\">Helps in better financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"152y3w4\" data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2206\">Typically beneficial if you want to <strong data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2204\">avoid long-term commitments</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g323ys\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2244\">Yearly Payment &ndash; Balanced Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2366\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3zofvh\" data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2303\">Splits the total cost into manageable yearly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11gp03f\" data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2366\">Ideal for students with <strong data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2364\">moderate financial flexibility</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y60ngx\" data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2415\">Semester-Wise Payment &ndash; Maximum Flexibility</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2507\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13dvrch\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2440\">Lowest upfront cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9bwmvp\" data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2507\">Suitable for <strong data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2505\">self-funded students or working professionals</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2512\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yglwkq\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2557\">EMI Option &ndash; Affordable Monthly Payments</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2684\">The program also provides <strong data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2630\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) options</strong>, allowing students to pay in smaller monthly amounts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k49m0a\" data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2705\">Benefits of EMI</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2859\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rttxl\" data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2745\">Reduces immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5a9bci\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2795\">Enables students to start MBA without waiting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"na0rl\" data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2859\">Useful for working professionals managing multiple expenses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"thivjj\" data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2892\">Important Financial Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2927\">While EMI improves affordability:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"3086\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x10dps\" data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2982\">Always assess your <strong data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2980\">monthly repayment capacity</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18gul15\" data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3033\">Compare total cost vs upfront payment benefits</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kbcv9s\" data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3086\">Avoid over-dependence on credit without planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3091\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f00z5h\" data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3147\">Additional Fees &ndash; Complete Breakdown of Extra Costs</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3256\">Ignoring additional charges is one of the <strong data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3229\">most common mistakes students make</strong>. Here&rsquo;s a clear breakdown:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t268wb\" data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3283\">For Students in India</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3285\" data-end=\"3369\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pxmkb4\" data-start=\"3285\" data-end=\"3327\"><strong data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3325\">₹2,500 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17o46gq\" data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3369\"><strong data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3367\">₹3,000 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rjtz3g\" data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3406\">For Students in SAARC Countries</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3484\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"613tr0\" data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3442\"><strong data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3440\">₹11,250 (Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dzg920\" data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3484\"><strong data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3482\">₹3,750 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bnizb1\" data-start=\"3486\" data-end=\"3516\">For International Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3597\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lyt09e\" data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3558\"><strong data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3556\">$150 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43rawd\" data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3597\"><strong data-start=\"3561\" data-end=\"3595\">$50 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"457\">An MBA in <strong data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"164\">Business Analytics and Artificial Intelligence</strong> is designed to prepare students for <strong data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"294\">data-driven decision-making, strategic management, and AI-powered business transformation</strong>. Unlike traditional MBA programs, this curriculum focuses heavily on <strong data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"456\">analytics, predictive modeling, and real-world business problem-solving using technology</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"657\">The program follows a <strong data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"506\">progressive structure</strong>, where you first build strong business fundamentals, then move into analytics integration, and finally master <strong data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"656\">AI-driven strategic decision-making</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"801\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"732\">fully detailed, SEO-optimized explanation of each semester</strong>, including course purpose, practical learning, and career relevance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"806\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18ucz17\" data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"878\">Semester 1 &ndash; Building Business Foundations with Analytical Thinking</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"1161\">The first semester focuses on developing a <strong data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1026\">strong understanding of core business concepts combined with analytical and ethical decision-making</strong>. Even though there are no explicitly listed skills or certifications, the learning outcomes are foundational for all future semesters.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1182\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1417\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1206\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fgzig6\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1236\">Sustainability and Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klvmq7\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1282\">Financial Reporting and Corporate Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1of72ks\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1341\">Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9vwaxg\" data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1392\">Quantitative Techniques for Business Decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1417\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1451\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1575\">This semester establishes your <strong data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1516\">business and analytical base</strong>, which is critical for advanced AI and analytics learning:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"2204\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mp5d9y\" data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1679\">Understanding economic principles and how they influence <strong data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1677\">business strategy and market behavior</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"no7k8u\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1814\">Learning sustainability practices and ethical decision-making, which are increasingly important in <strong data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1812\">modern corporate governance</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"duquzx\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1932\">Gaining financial knowledge to interpret reports, manage budgets, and support <strong data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1930\">data-backed financial decisions</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lfefuh\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"2020\">Understanding human behavior in organizations, helping you manage teams effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aki2vs\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2120\">Applying quantitative techniques such as statistics and mathematical models for decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"128gzay\" data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2204\">Getting introduced to AI concepts and their role in <strong data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2202\">business transformation</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2232\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2459\">Many students underestimate this semester, but it is crucial. Without a solid foundation in <strong data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2363\">finance, economics, and analytics</strong>, advanced subjects like predictive modeling and AI applications become difficult to understand.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2464\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14ktiky\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2525\">Semester 2 &ndash; Core Business Functions with AI Integration</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2725\">The second semester focuses on integrating <strong data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2636\">business operations with analytics and artificial intelligence</strong>, helping students understand how technology enhances decision-making across departments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2746\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2910\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2768\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2793\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ngrelz\" data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2817\">Operations Research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zfiueq\" data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2859\">Business Law and Corporate Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s8llsw\" data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2910\">Business Analytics and Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2915\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"2917\" data-end=\"2944\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"3034\">This semester bridges the gap between <strong data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3033\">business knowledge and analytical application</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3534\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ods4ma\" data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3127\">Understanding how businesses are built and scaled through <strong data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3125\">entrepreneurship concepts</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvkd62\" data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3232\">Learning marketing strategies and how data helps in <strong data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3230\">customer targeting and campaign optimization</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ov7o1e\" data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3338\">Applying operations research techniques for <strong data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3336\">efficiency, cost reduction, and resource optimization</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sg8wd5\" data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3434\">Understanding legal frameworks and corporate governance, which are essential for compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zw9u1a\" data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3534\">Exploring how analytics and AI are used to improve <strong data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3532\">business performance and decision-making</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3539\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3562\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3714\">This semester helps you start thinking like a <strong data-start=\"3610\" data-end=\"3673\">business strategist who uses data as a decision-making tool</strong>, rather than relying on intuition alone.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3716\" data-end=\"3719\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17ur9k5\" data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3785\">Semester 3 &ndash; Advanced Analytics &amp; AI Applications in Business</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3934\">This is where the program becomes <strong data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3843\">highly specialized</strong>, focusing on <strong data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3933\">business intelligence, machine learning, and statistical decision-making</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"3955\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"4177\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zoxbqz\" data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"3986\">Business Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"3987\" data-end=\"4012\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bu7c6v\" data-start=\"4013\" data-end=\"4059\">Business Intelligence &amp; Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e761c7\" data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4133\">Business Applications of Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wb3hdz\" data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4177\">Business Statistics for Decision Making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4182\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4211\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4213\" data-end=\"4313\">This semester is focused on <strong data-start=\"4241\" data-end=\"4312\">practical analytics and AI tools used in real business environments</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4315\" data-end=\"4774\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o8z8da\" data-start=\"4315\" data-end=\"4400\">Learning research methodologies to solve <strong data-start=\"4358\" data-end=\"4398\">complex business problems using data</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1otstwg\" data-start=\"4401\" data-end=\"4490\">Understanding operations management for optimizing processes and improving efficiency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yudx64\" data-start=\"4491\" data-end=\"4577\">Using business intelligence tools to create <strong data-start=\"4537\" data-end=\"4575\">dashboards and data visualizations</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qnimzp\" data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4692\">Applying AI and machine learning models to solve business challenges such as forecasting and customer analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1auj7kp\" data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4774\">Using statistical techniques for <strong data-start=\"4728\" data-end=\"4772\">accurate and data-driven decision-making</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4776\" data-end=\"4779\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"4781\" data-end=\"4802\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4804\" data-end=\"5012\">This is the <strong data-start=\"4816\" data-end=\"4877\">most important semester for placements in analytics roles</strong>. Students who actively practice tools like <strong data-start=\"4921\" data-end=\"4975\">Power BI, Python, and data visualization platforms</strong> gain a strong competitive advantage.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5014\" data-end=\"5017\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12rzx55\" data-start=\"5019\" data-end=\"5083\">Semester 4 &ndash; Strategic Decision-Making &amp; Predictive Analytics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5085\" data-end=\"5232\">The final semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"5115\" data-end=\"5195\">advanced analytics, AI-driven strategy, and real-world business applications</strong>, preparing you for leadership roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"5234\" data-end=\"5253\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5255\" data-end=\"5467\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"5255\" data-end=\"5279\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g7j2y2\" data-start=\"5280\" data-end=\"5332\">Predictive Modeling for Business Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tb8h3d\" data-start=\"5333\" data-end=\"5380\">Text Analytics for Business Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5zgc4s\" data-start=\"5381\" data-end=\"5435\">Managerial Applications of Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uzzzzz\" data-start=\"5436\" data-end=\"5467\">Applied Marketing Analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5469\" data-end=\"5472\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"5474\" data-end=\"5501\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5503\" data-end=\"5583\">This semester prepares you to <strong data-start=\"5533\" data-end=\"5582\">lead organizations using data and AI insights</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5585\" data-end=\"5976\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16biesq\" data-start=\"5585\" data-end=\"5657\">Developing strategic thinking and long-term business planning skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rf3vrl\" data-start=\"5658\" data-end=\"5732\">Using predictive models to forecast trends and support decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ck7bx0\" data-start=\"5733\" data-end=\"5820\">Applying text analytics to analyze customer feedback, reviews, and market sentiment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mpw36c\" data-start=\"5821\" data-end=\"5905\">Understanding how AI can be used in management for <strong data-start=\"5874\" data-end=\"5903\">automation and efficiency</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jk4oro\" data-start=\"5906\" data-end=\"5976\">Applying marketing analytics to optimize campaigns and improve ROI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5978\" data-end=\"5981\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"5983\" data-end=\"6004\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6006\" data-end=\"6213\">This semester transforms you from a learner into a <strong data-start=\"6057\" data-end=\"6075\">decision-maker</strong>. You gain the ability to <strong data-start=\"6101\" data-end=\"6168\">interpret data, predict outcomes, and drive business strategies</strong>, which is highly valued in leadership roles.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(282, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 255, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 06:08:09', '2026-06-16 07:00:38', '<p data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"444\">The <strong data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"127\">MBA admission process</strong> is structured to be simple, but each step plays a critical role in ensuring your <strong data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"290\">application approval, program selection accuracy, and final seat confirmation</strong>. A clear understanding of this process helps you avoid <strong data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"397\">delays, rejection risks, and financial mistakes</strong>, while ensuring a smooth admission experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"589\">This detailed guide explains each stage in a <strong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"542\">clear, structured, and fully explanatory manner</strong>, helping you navigate the process confidently.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"594\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"lq2g32\" data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"650\">Step 1: Submit Application &ndash; Start Your MBA Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"791\">The admission process begins with filling out the <strong data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"729\">online application form</strong>, which officially registers your interest in the MBA program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kcrm5x\" data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"816\">What You Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wrk2qo\" data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"891\">Enter your <strong data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"851\">personal details</strong> (name, contact information, email ID)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13w953q\" data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"979\">Provide your <strong data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"937\">educational qualifications</strong> (graduation details, marks, university)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1585mys\" data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1038\">Select your <strong data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1036\">intended MBA program or specialization</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fg0bqg\" data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1075\">Why This Step Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1176\">This is the <strong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1129\">foundation of your admission process</strong>. The information you provide here is used for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qkkbh8\" data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1206\">Eligibility verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cfknkx\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1236\">Communication and updates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17jct1v\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1264\">Final admission records</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1299\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1453\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n9xpn\" data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1360\">Entering incorrect marks or incomplete academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0fcec\" data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1404\">Using an inactive email or phone number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187frul\" data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1453\">Submitting without reviewing the application</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1478\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1592\">Even small errors at this stage can create <strong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1565\">verification delays or rejection risks</strong>, so accuracy is essential.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1597\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rh5u8k\" data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1662\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program &ndash; Confirm Your Specialization</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1759\">After submitting your application, the next step is to <strong data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1758\">select and confirm your MBA program</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kcrm5x\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1784\">What You Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1909\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fc3rz6\" data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1831\">Choose your <strong data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1829\">specialization or program</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1imvvuh\" data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1875\">Verify all previously submitted details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e3y3u7\" data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1909\">Proceed to confirm enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1914\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1941\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1980\">Your chosen program directly impacts:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2124\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2sr7ol\" data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2028\">Your <strong data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2026\">career path and job opportunities</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eiuf5b\" data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2064\">The <strong data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2062\">skills you will develop</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gdhq20\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2124\">Your <strong data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2122\">future salary potential and industry relevance</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2129\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t7fg7n\" data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2157\">Strategic Decision Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2232\">Avoid selecting a specialization based only on trends. Instead, evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2334\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tu005t\" data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2266\">Your interests and strengths</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wbhd9b\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2307\">Industry demand and growth potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ib049h\" data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2334\">Long-term career goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2339\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kzox0n\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2359\">Common Mistake</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2484\">Choosing a program without proper research can lead to <strong data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2483\">limited career satisfaction and restricted growth opportunities</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2489\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1upc974\" data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2554\">Step 3: Complete Payment &ndash; Choose the Right Financial Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2660\">Once enrollment is confirmed, you must proceed with <strong data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2623\">fee payment</strong>, which is essential to move forward.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2691\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2714\">One-Time Payment</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2802\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohza4c\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2752\">Pay the full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bqwy26\" data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2802\">Get a <strong data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2777\">15% discount</strong>, reducing overall cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2829\">Education Loan / EMI</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2945\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"scu1xe\" data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2866\">Pay in <strong data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2864\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i759ou\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2945\">Typically available with <strong data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2909\">0% interest</strong>, making it financially manageable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2950\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ed00a2\" data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"2986\">How to Choose the Right Option</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3033\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Best for Cost Savings</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3154\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xo1vr6\" data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3076\">Ideal if you have financial readiness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fw77cd\" data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3117\">Reduces overall cost due to discount</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dlayby\" data-start=\"3118\" data-end=\"3154\">Eliminates future payment stress</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3194\">EMI / Loan &ndash; Best for Flexibility</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3297\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2kw2r\" data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3258\">Suitable for students who prefer <strong data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3256\">lower upfront payment</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h75hzs\" data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3297\">Helps manage cash flow effectively</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3302\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"thivjj\" data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3335\">Important Financial Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3387\">While EMI improves affordability, always evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3503\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qu7ged\" data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3428\">Your <strong data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3426\">monthly repayment capacity</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13dphzv\" data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3469\">Total financial commitment over time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j5q4od\" data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3503\">Long-term financial stability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3505\" data-end=\"3508\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5qr8cl\" data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3568\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat &ndash; Final Admission Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3648\">This is the final stage where your MBA admission becomes officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjl3k3\" data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3680\">What Happens After Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3829\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w2jcz2\" data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3726\">Your <strong data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3724\">seat is reserved in the program</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2jtwm\" data-start=\"3727\" data-end=\"3769\">You receive <strong data-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3767\">admission confirmation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oaf435\" data-start=\"3770\" data-end=\"3829\">Access to academic platforms and resources is initiated</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3831\" data-end=\"3834\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"265v1c\" data-start=\"3836\" data-end=\"3860\">Important Conditions</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"4027\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jbnjwo\" data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3939\">Admission is confirmed <strong data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3937\">only after successful payment or loan approval</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3whoi3\" data-start=\"3940\" data-end=\"4027\">Delay in payment may result in <strong data-start=\"3973\" data-end=\"3989\">loss of seat</strong>, especially in high-demand programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4029\" data-end=\"4032\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21irzc\" data-start=\"4034\" data-end=\"4049\">Risk Factor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4074\">If you delay this step:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4186\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ceeoxz\" data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4132\">Your preferred specialization may become unavailable</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4ja94\" data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4186\">You may have to wait for the next admission cycle</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"457\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"139\">MBA eligibility criteria</strong> is critical before applying, because even small misunderstandings&mdash;like incorrect percentage calculation or confusion about final-year status&mdash;can lead to rejection during verification. This section explains the eligibility in a <strong data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"405\">clear, detailed, and practical way</strong>, so you can confidently assess whether you qualify.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"462\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kzmz8\" data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"525\">Minimum Educational Qualification &ndash; Who Can Apply for MBA?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"619\">To be eligible for the MBA program, candidates must meet the following academic requirement:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"857\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1okbmub\" data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"672\">A <strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"670\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree (Undergraduate program)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1spgyzq\" data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"708\">Minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"706\">3 years</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"spb8az\" data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"764\">Degree must be from a <strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"762\">UGC-recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cxk1q0\" data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"857\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"797\">any stream</strong> (Commerce, Science, Arts, Engineering, etc.) are eligible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5gvu9j\" data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"897\">What This Means in Practical Terms</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"1118\">MBA programs are designed to accept students from <strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"981\">diverse academic backgrounds</strong>. Whether you studied B.Com, BBA, B.Sc, BA, B.Tech, or any other stream, you are eligible as long as your degree is valid and recognized.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1123\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"g93xx3\" data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1186\">Minimum Marks Requirement &ndash; Understanding the 50% Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1241\">Academic performance plays a key role in eligibility:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1370\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i7qj5y\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1292\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1276\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvh0d6\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1370\">Equivalent grading systems such as <strong data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1355\">CGPA or letter grades</strong> are accepted</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wvf11s\" data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1410\">Relaxation for Reserved Categories</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1539\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cif7vo\" data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1478\"><strong data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1434\">SC/ST candidates</strong> are eligible with <strong data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1476\">45% aggregate marks</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fccqhq\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1539\">A <strong data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1500\">5% relaxation</strong> is provided as per eligibility norms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2006\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"tiqazk\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2076\">Final-Year Students Eligibility &ndash; Apply Before Graduation Results</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2158\">Students who are currently in the last stage of their graduation can also apply.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2293\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iw0nyg\" data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2241\">Candidates in the <strong data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2239\">final semester of their bachelor&rsquo;s program are eligible</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14yvqy\" data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2293\">Admission is granted on a <strong data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2291\">provisional basis</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aql1h1\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2331\">What Provisional Admission Means</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2551\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"awv8i1\" data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2392\">You can apply and secure admission before final results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2vs9i\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2455\">You must complete your degree within the required timeline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nycv2l\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2551\">Final admission is confirmed only if you meet the <strong data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2551\">minimum marks requirement after results</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"437\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"144\">MBA fee structure</strong> goes beyond just knowing the total amount. A well-informed decision requires clarity on <strong data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"335\">payment flexibility, additional charges, real total cost, and long-term return on investment (ROI)</strong>. Many students overlook hidden components and end up underestimating the actual financial commitment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"567\">This section provides a <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"518\">deep, SEO-optimized and fully explanatory breakdown</strong> to help you evaluate the MBA cost strategically.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"572\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10klbub\" data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"615\">Total MBA Fees &ndash; Program Cost Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"654\">The total fee for the MBA program is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvkdq7\" data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"692\"><strong data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"690\">₹1,96,000 (Full Program Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"720\">This fee generally covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"897\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nr83n0\" data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"754\">Academic curriculum delivery</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gyoezq\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"801\">Access to LMS (Learning Management System)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v5zm40\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"851\">Digital learning resources and study material</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lujaln\" data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"897\">Academic support and internal assessments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"902\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qbxms8\" data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"935\">What This Means Practically</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1169\">Compared to traditional MBA programs costing <strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"997\">₹5&ndash;20 lakhs</strong>, this program offers a <strong data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1063\">high-value, cost-efficient alternative</strong>, especially for students aiming to build careers in <strong data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1168\">finance, marketing, analytics, HR, or operations</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1174\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p0heen\" data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1249\">MBA Fee Payment Options &ndash; Flexible Plans for Different Financial Needs</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1405\">To make the program accessible, multiple payment options are available. Choosing the right one is critical for <strong data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1404\">financial planning and cost efficiency</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14vczfv\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1430\">Fee Structure Table</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1829\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1454\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1474\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1486\" data-col-size=\"md\">Best For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1829\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1646\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1562\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1561\">One-Time Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1581\">₹1,96,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1646\">Students who want to pay upfront and avoid future liabilities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1739\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1670\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1667\">Yearly Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1689\">₹98,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1739\">Students preferring structured yearly payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1829\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1763\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1759\">Semester-Wise</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1786\">₹49,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1829\">Students looking for lower upfront cost</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1834\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z9z6ud\" data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1892\">Payment Options Explained &ndash; Strategic Decision Making</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"2038\">Selecting the right payment mode is not just about affordability&mdash;it directly impacts your <strong data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2037\">financial stability and long-term cost management</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fc8nef\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2087\">One-Time Payment &ndash; Maximum Savings Strategy</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2245\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pg4148\" data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2117\">Pay the full fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ga5ft\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2167\">Eligible for <strong data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2165\">15% discount (if applicable)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wh4ujg\" data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2196\">No future payment burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u28qky\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2245\">Best for students with <strong data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2245\">financial readiness</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2250\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h8a7mp\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2290\">Yearly Payment &ndash; Balanced Approach</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2447\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5yhhd3\" data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2340\">Divides cost into manageable yearly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"az4onj\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2406\">Suitable for students with <strong data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2404\">moderate financial flexibility</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"150u7uz\" data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2447\">Easier planning compared to lump sum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2452\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14tbkk4\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2505\">Semester-Wise Payment &ndash; High Flexibility Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2666\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yj4wov\" data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2545\">Lowest upfront payment requirement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a5pdqh\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2625\">Ideal for <strong data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2623\">self-funded students or those managing expenses independently</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ml1wl\" data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2666\">Helps in better cash flow management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2671\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17mkiix\" data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2710\">EMI Option &ndash; Pay Monthly with Ease</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2822\">The availability of <strong data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2769\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment)</strong> allows students to pay fees in smaller installments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k49m0a\" data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2843\">Benefits of EMI</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2977\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rttxl\" data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2883\">Reduces immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lzc9y6\" data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2938\">Makes MBA accessible without large upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19uriaj\" data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2977\">Suitable for working professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"2982\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9u2hd7\" data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3004\">Critical Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3040\">While EMI increases affordability:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3182\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vvaj1r\" data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3097\">Always evaluate your <strong data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3095\">monthly repayment capacity</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ensfah\" data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3131\">Avoid over-reliance on credit</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18gul15\" data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3182\">Compare total cost vs upfront payment benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3187\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1se7mx\" data-start=\"3189\" data-end=\"3236\">Additional Fees &ndash; Hidden Costs You Must Know</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3367\">Many students make the mistake of considering only tuition fees. However, <strong data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3366\">additional charges significantly impact total cost</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lnlidp\" data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3386\">Fee Breakdown</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3414\">For Students in India</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3500\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pxmkb4\" data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3458\"><strong data-start=\"3418\" data-end=\"3456\">₹2,500 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17o46gq\" data-start=\"3459\" data-end=\"3500\"><strong data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3498\">₹3,000 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3505\">\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3543\">For Students in SAARC Countries</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3621\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"613tr0\" data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3579\"><strong data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3577\">₹11,250 (Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dzg920\" data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3621\"><strong data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3619\">₹3,750 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3623\" data-end=\"3626\">\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3628\" data-end=\"3659\">For International Students</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3661\" data-end=\"3740\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lyt09e\" data-start=\"3661\" data-end=\"3701\"><strong data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3699\">$150 (One-Time Registration Fee)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43rawd\" data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3740\"><strong data-start=\"3704\" data-end=\"3738\">$50 per year (Examination Fee)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"537\">An MBA in <strong data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"148\">Finance and Financial Analytics</strong> is designed for students who want to build expertise in <strong data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"312\">financial management, investment strategy, corporate finance, and data-driven financial decision-making</strong>. This program goes beyond traditional finance by integrating <strong data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"430\">analytics, risk management, and strategic leadership</strong>, making graduates highly valuable in sectors like <strong data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"536\">banking, consulting, fintech, and corporate finance</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"756\">The curriculum follows a <strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"589\">progressive structure</strong>, starting with business fundamentals, moving into core financial concepts, and finally advancing toward <strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"755\">strategic finance, analytics, and real-world applications</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"761\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"luks1w\" data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"839\">Semester 1 &ndash; Business Foundations with Financial &amp; Analytical Orientation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"1016\">The first semester builds a <strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"950\">strong base in business, finance, analytics, and organizational understanding</strong>, which is essential before moving into advanced financial topics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1037\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1268\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1061\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rf69vv\" data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1089\">Sustainability &amp; Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5ih8i\" data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1133\">Financial Reporting &amp; Corporate Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1of72ks\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1192\">Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9vwaxg\" data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1243\">Quantitative Techniques for Business Decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1268\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1273\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1302\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1390\">This semester introduces the <strong data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1389\">core pillars of finance and business decision-making</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1909\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqx6wk\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1490\">Understanding economic principles that influence <strong data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1488\">financial markets and business strategies</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsn9um\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1597\">Learning sustainability and ethical practices critical for <strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1595\">corporate governance and ESG compliance</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xr5826\" data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1678\">Gaining strong fundamentals in <strong data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1676\">financial reporting and corporate finance</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xc3hjb\" data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1747\">Understanding workforce dynamics and <strong data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1745\">organizational behavior</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kfc432\" data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1827\">Applying statistical and quantitative techniques for <strong data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1825\">financial analysis</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ehdqwh\" data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1909\">Exploring AI fundamentals and their role in <strong data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1907\">modern finance and automation</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1914\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1938\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"2275\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n8z6fy\" data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1984\">Managerial economics and market analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sv2syo\" data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2033\">Financial modelling and accounting standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k3unrs\" data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2071\">ESG and sustainability frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1unelc2\" data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2116\">HR analytics and organizational strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yfofpu\" data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2171\">Statistical tools (regression, hypothesis testing)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e15rdl\" data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2231\">Time Value of Money (TVM) and financial decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vhtbrb\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2275\">AI fundamentals and analytical thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2280\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2310\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2496\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2u51e\" data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2352\">Negotiation and communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nj0qck\" data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2390\">Executive presence and networking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdun9m\" data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2422\">Cross-cultural intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15l6kp1\" data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2453\">Risk management strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"194ahfv\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2496\">Design thinking and data visualization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2501\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2524\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2710\">This semester lays the groundwork for everything ahead. Students who <strong data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2680\">master financial basics and analytical thinking here perform significantly better</strong> in advanced finance subjects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2715\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1icign6\" data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2786\">Semester 2 &ndash; Core Financial Planning, Taxation &amp; Business Strategy</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2923\">The second semester shifts focus toward <strong data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2895\">practical financial management, taxation, and business strategy</strong>, making you industry-ready.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2944\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"3062\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2966\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"2991\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1449joc\" data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3022\">Corporate and Business Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h04yyg\" data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3035\">Taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kdo0z\" data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3062\">Performance Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3067\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3096\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3172\">This semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3171\">real-world financial operations and planning</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3495\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4q6gts\" data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3236\">Understanding taxation systems and compliance requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xiph3x\" data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3296\">Learning financial planning, budgeting, and forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ir5p3\" data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3365\">Applying marketing and strategy concepts for <strong data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3363\">business growth</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t0qtwt\" data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3430\">Understanding legal frameworks governing financial decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12x6ut3\" data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3495\">Managing organizational performance and financial efficiency</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3500\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3524\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3767\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ccky0q\" data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3566\">Cost variance analysis and budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jtmgps\" data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3607\">Cash flow management and forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xokf82\" data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3657\">Financial reporting and managerial accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"102un72\" data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3689\">Tax compliance and planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lmsx2\" data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3723\">Business strategy development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b3a99o\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3767\">Customer engagement and market analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3769\" data-end=\"3772\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"3774\" data-end=\"3802\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3804\" data-end=\"3924\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q8gy5m\" data-start=\"3804\" data-end=\"3838\">Business taxation fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bayh1x\" data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3881\">Financial planning and analysis (FP&amp;A)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jcvrg5\" data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"3924\">Corporate financial statement analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3926\" data-end=\"3929\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"3952\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3954\" data-end=\"4100\">This semester prepares you for <strong data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"4020\">finance roles in real companies</strong>, where compliance, taxation, and budgeting are critical daily responsibilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4105\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17bb37d\" data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4182\">Semester 3 &ndash; Advanced Financial Management, Audit &amp; Strategic Leadership</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4346\">This semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4286\">high-level financial decision-making, auditing, and investment strategies</strong>, making it one of the most important phases of the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"4348\" data-end=\"4367\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4531\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zoxbqz\" data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4398\">Business Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"4399\" data-end=\"4424\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"165kb9r\" data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4448\">Financial Reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3z48jl\" data-start=\"4449\" data-end=\"4472\">Audit and Assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pbto8i\" data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4497\">Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"szafz3\" data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4531\">Strategic Business Leadership</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4533\" data-end=\"4536\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"4538\" data-end=\"4565\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4567\" data-end=\"4633\">You begin working on <strong data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4632\">complex financial and strategic problems</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4635\" data-end=\"4919\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jt33pu\" data-start=\"4635\" data-end=\"4690\">Conducting financial audits and ensuring compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nalhm3\" data-start=\"4691\" data-end=\"4754\">Understanding corporate valuation and investment strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5tysor\" data-start=\"4755\" data-end=\"4806\">Managing financial risks and optimizing returns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dt9qh4\" data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4866\">Applying research methods to solve financial challenges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51stnq\" data-start=\"4867\" data-end=\"4919\">Developing leadership skills for strategic roles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4921\" data-end=\"4924\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"4926\" data-end=\"4948\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4950\" data-end=\"5176\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w1ljfe\" data-start=\"4950\" data-end=\"4987\">Financial auditing and compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9zqf86\" data-start=\"4988\" data-end=\"5022\">Corporate and equity valuation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"65lq6d\" data-start=\"5023\" data-end=\"5062\">Investment and portfolio strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19xpidt\" data-start=\"5063\" data-end=\"5092\">Financial risk management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6t8qd\" data-start=\"5093\" data-end=\"5130\">Business and operations analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yhni5k\" data-start=\"5131\" data-end=\"5176\">Enterprise risk management and governance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5178\" data-end=\"5181\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"5183\" data-end=\"5211\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5213\" data-end=\"5303\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mfnjqp\" data-start=\"5213\" data-end=\"5235\">Cash flow analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eskms2\" data-start=\"5236\" data-end=\"5269\">Business valuation techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bn1fy1\" data-start=\"5270\" data-end=\"5303\">Capital markets understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5305\" data-end=\"5308\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"5310\" data-end=\"5331\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5333\" data-end=\"5478\">This is a <strong data-start=\"5343\" data-end=\"5374\">placement-critical semester</strong>, as it builds skills required for roles like <strong data-start=\"5420\" data-end=\"5477\">financial analyst, auditor, and investment consultant</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5480\" data-end=\"5483\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"190uy1o\" data-start=\"5485\" data-end=\"5557\">Semester 4 &ndash; Financial Analytics, Markets &amp; Strategic Decision-Making</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5559\" data-end=\"5685\">The final semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"5589\" data-end=\"5648\">advanced finance, analytics, and real-world application</strong>, preparing you for leadership roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa3af8\" data-start=\"5687\" data-end=\"5706\">Courses Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5708\" data-end=\"5886\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16e7fvx\" data-start=\"5708\" data-end=\"5733\">Analytics for Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nu0biu\" data-start=\"5734\" data-end=\"5755\">Financial Markets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"623sq4\" data-start=\"5756\" data-end=\"5789\">Advanced Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i9ck71\" data-start=\"5790\" data-end=\"5825\">Advanced Performance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2zqotk\" data-start=\"5826\" data-end=\"5858\">Strategic Business Reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rx70fy\" data-start=\"5859\" data-end=\"5886\">Master Thesis / Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5888\" data-end=\"5891\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"5893\" data-end=\"5920\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5922\" data-end=\"6021\">This semester prepares you for <strong data-start=\"5953\" data-end=\"6020\">high-level financial decision-making and analytics-driven roles</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6023\" data-end=\"6318\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nym091\" data-start=\"6023\" data-end=\"6088\">Understanding global financial markets and investment systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dy4n6f\" data-start=\"6089\" data-end=\"6142\">Applying advanced financial management techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12i5l2l\" data-start=\"6143\" data-end=\"6194\">Using analytics and machine learning in finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s0wlhf\" data-start=\"6195\" data-end=\"6255\">Building strategic financial reports for decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ap0qfm\" data-start=\"6256\" data-end=\"6318\">Working on real-world projects to solve financial problems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6320\" data-end=\"6323\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jvqhye\" data-start=\"6325\" data-end=\"6347\">Skills You Develop</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6349\" data-end=\"6603\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ft33o\" data-start=\"6349\" data-end=\"6392\">Capital markets and securities analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9gvn0r\" data-start=\"6393\" data-end=\"6432\">Investment and portfolio management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vkaaj8\" data-start=\"6433\" data-end=\"6489\">Financial data analytics and machine learning basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dbs3lm\" data-start=\"6490\" data-end=\"6526\">Algorithmic trading fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kps7re\" data-start=\"6527\" data-end=\"6570\">Risk analytics and valuation techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10kpkfo\" data-start=\"6571\" data-end=\"6603\">Strategic financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6605\" data-end=\"6608\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sqkdba\" data-start=\"6610\" data-end=\"6638\">Certifications Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6640\" data-end=\"6707\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jshu2w\" data-start=\"6640\" data-end=\"6675\">International finance knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qgghfn\" data-start=\"6676\" data-end=\"6707\">Advanced business valuation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6709\" data-end=\"6712\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"6714\" data-end=\"6735\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6737\" data-end=\"6931\">Your <strong data-start=\"6742\" data-end=\"6768\">final project (thesis)</strong> plays a key role in placements. It demonstrates your ability to <strong data-start=\"6833\" data-end=\"6899\">apply financial concepts and analytics in real-world scenarios</strong>, which recruiters highly value.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(283, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 256, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 06:54:20', '2026-06-16 07:01:10', '<p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"424\">Understanding the admission process is not just about following steps&mdash;it&rsquo;s about <strong data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"332\">making the right decisions at each stage to secure your seat early, avoid errors, and maximize financial and academic advantages</strong>. Many students lose time or face rejection due to incomplete applications or poor planning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"559\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"494\">complete, detailed breakdown of the admission journey</strong>, along with expert insights to help you navigate it effectively.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"564\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1f2q59b\" data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"613\">Step 1: Submit Application (Foundation Stage)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kcrm5x\" data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"638\">What You Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"806\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cj9gmr\" data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"684\">Fill out the <strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"682\">online application form</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qeuo6m\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"806\">Provide accurate details including:\r\n<ul data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"806\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"749\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"782\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yylsws\" data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"806\">Program selection</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"901\">This is your <strong data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"869\">first interaction with the university system</strong>, and accuracy here is critical.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"snp8je\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"939\">What Most Students Overlook</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1098\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mb053i\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"991\">Entering incorrect marks or incomplete details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iad4s1\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1036\">Uploading unclear or incorrect documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b4yllm\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1098\">Choosing the program without understanding specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1103\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1126\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1185\">This step is more than just form filling&mdash;it is where you:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ft5ug8\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1223\">Establish your <strong data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1223\">academic profile</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oeusi\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1257\">Ensure eligibility compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jelruz\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1294\">Avoid future verification issues</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1383\">👉 Even small errors can delay your admission or lead to rejection during verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1d6518d\" data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1439\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program (Decision Stage)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xlktxj\" data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1462\">What Happens Here</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1615\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yl5r2l\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1524\">You select your <strong data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1522\">preferred MBA program/specialization</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2w85o\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1568\">Review and verify all submitted details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ebmwr\" data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1615\">Proceed to confirm your <strong data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1615\">intent to enroll</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1620\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sfpnp\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1651\">Why This Step is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1710\">This is where many students make a <strong data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1709\">long-term mistake</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1781\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bx2uvt\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1781\">Selecting a specialization based on trends instead of career goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1786\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wpw590\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1815\">Smart Decision Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1860\">Before confirming enrollment, ask yourself:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"2073\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fhe5av\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1949\">Does this program align with my <strong data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1947\">career goals (marketing, analytics, management)?</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vtyocc\" data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"2008\">Am I comfortable with <strong data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2006\">AI and data-driven learning?</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zkpjov\" data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2073\">Does it offer <strong data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2073\">skills that are in demand in the job market?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2138\">👉 Once confirmed, changing the program later may be difficult.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2143\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1v7wuv5\" data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2200\">Step 3: Complete Payment (Financial Commitment Stage)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2231\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2472\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gs9k1s\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2356\"><strong data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2255\">One-Time Payment</strong>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2356\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nw7ojp\" data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2290\">Pay full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xayff\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2356\">Eligible for <strong data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2324\">15% discount</strong> (major cost-saving opportunity)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gdm1tu\" data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2472\"><strong data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2384\">Education Loan / EMI</strong>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2472\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"scu1xe\" data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2422\">Pay in <strong data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2420\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t28zuo\" data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2472\">0% interest makes it financially manageable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2477\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1067e77\" data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2510\">What This Step Really Means</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2536\">This is the stage where:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2667\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v8gxjk\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2591\">Your admission moves from <strong data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2589\">intent to commitment</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iozmri\" data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2667\">Your <strong data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2667\">financial planning directly impacts your stress level during MBA</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2672\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17i7uoq\" data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2703\">Expert Financial Strategy</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2740\">If You Can Afford Full Payment</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2808\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e00oib\" data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2768\">Choose one-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t84rvb\" data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2808\">Save significantly through discount</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2835\">If Budget is Limited</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2933\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b1oto4\" data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2850\">Choose EMI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gmk0pp\" data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2933\">Maintain liquidity for:\r\n<ul data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2933\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gyqrz7\" data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2897\">Certifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13sut4z\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2909\">Tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"buy5xm\" data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2933\">Skill development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2938\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gxruj2\" data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"2967\">Hidden Mistake to Avoid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"2983\">Many students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3089\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ceq2xy\" data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3016\">Spend entire savings on fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uw0364\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3089\">Have no budget left for <strong data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3089\">practical learning tools or certifications</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3130\">👉 This reduces overall ROI of the MBA.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3135\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wxuvsp\" data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3190\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat (Final Confirmation Stage)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjl3k3\" data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3222\">What Happens After Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3361\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13qpbcv\" data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3272\">Your payment is verified OR loan is approved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yizw6l\" data-start=\"3273\" data-end=\"3319\">Your <strong data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3317\">admission is officially confirmed</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ege0p\" data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3361\">Your <strong data-start=\"3327\" data-end=\"3361\">seat in the program is secured</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3363\" data-end=\"3366\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"74katu\" data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3403\">What You Get After Confirmation</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3549\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n64k6n\" data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3440\">Official admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8h7n8u\" data-start=\"3441\" data-end=\"3501\">Access to academic systems (LMS, course materials, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7eaqoo\" data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3549\">Enrollment into the upcoming academic cycle</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3554\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q9p31j\" data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3595\">Why Early Seat Confirmation Matters</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3719\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1218ga1\" data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3634\">Limited seats in popular programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t5uo18\" data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3673\">Early access to learning platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jp421g\" data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3719\">More time to prepare before classes begin</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3724\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7u9yg1\" data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3770\">End-to-End Admission Flow (Quick Overview)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"4086\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"3811\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"3811\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"3779\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3787\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3800\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Action</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3800\" data-end=\"3811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"4086\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3906\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3859\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3859\" data-end=\"3873\">Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3873\" data-end=\"3887\">Submit form</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3906\">Profile created</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3966\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3916\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"3929\">Enrollment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3929\" data-end=\"3946\">Select program</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"3966\">Intent confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"4026\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"3976\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3976\" data-end=\"3986\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3986\" data-end=\"4003\">Pay fees / EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4026\">Admission initiated</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4086\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4036\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4051\">Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4070\">Payment verified</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4070\" data-end=\"4086\">Seat secured</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"319\">Before applying, it&rsquo;s important to clearly understand the eligibility requirements&mdash;not just to confirm qualification, but to ensure you are academically prepared to handle the <strong data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"306\">analytical, AI-driven, and business-focused curriculum</strong> of this MBA.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"324\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wz2kvb\" data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"355\">Core Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"431\">To be eligible for admission, candidates must meet the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"626\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6mgzo6\" data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"505\">A <strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"485\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree (minimum 3 years duration)</strong> in any discipline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cquiqa\" data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"565\">The degree must be from a <strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"563\">UGC-recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dj9kz9\" data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"626\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"624\">50% aggregate marks or equivalent grade</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"800\">This ensures that applicants have a foundational academic background necessary to understand advanced business, analytics, and AI-integrated concepts taught in the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"805\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wvf11s\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"845\">Relaxation for Reserved Categories</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"950\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7m45ay\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"950\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"893\">SC/ST categories</strong> are eligible with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"948\">45% aggregate marks</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1068\">This relaxation follows standard academic norms and allows broader access while maintaining overall program quality.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1073\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ktu0q2\" data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1109\">Final-Year Graduation Students</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10h1xml\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1216\">Candidates <strong data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1187\">appearing for the final semester of their Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> are also eligible to apply</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1280\">Admission in such cases is typically <strong data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1270\">provisional</strong>, meaning:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1411\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jz5tvp\" data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1325\">You can apply and secure admission early</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2m2j2\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1411\">Final confirmation depends on meeting the required marks after graduation results</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1526\">This is strategically beneficial as it helps students <strong data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1525\">avoid last-minute competition and secure seats earlier</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1531\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"97rxcg\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1568\">Academic Background Flexibility</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1675\">One of the major strengths of this MBA program is its <strong data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1663\">open eligibility across all streams</strong>, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1775\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16qhdo4\" data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1702\">Commerce (B.Com, BBA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"esdvo7\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1747\">Science &amp; Technology (B.Sc, B.Tech, BCA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f2dxfv\" data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1775\">Arts &amp; Humanities (B.A)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1960\">This allows students to transition into <strong data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1905\">high-growth fields like marketing, business analytics, and AI-driven decision-making</strong>, regardless of their previous academic specialization.</p>', '<p data-start=\"127\" data-end=\"432\">Understanding the MBA fee structure is not just about knowing the total cost&mdash;it&rsquo;s about evaluating <strong data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"304\">payment flexibility, hidden expenses, ROI, and financial planning strategy</strong>. Many students make poor decisions because they only look at the headline fee and ignore the <strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"431\">actual payable cost over time</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"529\">This detailed breakdown will help you make a <strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"528\">financially smart and career-aligned decision</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"534\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12tfypo\" data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"561\">Total MBA Fees Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"618\">The total academic fee for the complete MBA program is:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"705\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"646\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"646\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"646\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"705\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"705\">\r\n<td data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"693\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"705\">₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"733\">This fee typically covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"828\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nr83n0\" data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"766\">Academic curriculum delivery</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j6tiqk\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"802\">Learning resources / LMS access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ovzk7t\" data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"828\">Core academic support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"958\">However, <strong data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"899\">it does NOT include certain mandatory additional charges</strong>, which you must factor into your budget (explained below).</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"963\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"fvs08e\" data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1020\">Flexible Payment Options (Student-Friendly Structure)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1164\">One of the biggest advantages of this program is its <strong data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1102\">flexible payment system</strong>, which reduces financial pressure and improves accessibility.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1507\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1202\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1202\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1181\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1190\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1202\" data-col-size=\"md\">Best For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1507\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1327\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1257\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1276\">₹98,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1327\">Students who prefer moderate financial planning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1413\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1352\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-wise Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1375\">₹49,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1413\">Students who want low upfront cost</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1507\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1433\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1459\">₹196,000 (full program)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1507\">Students who want to avoid repeated payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1512\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zb3gfw\" data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1575\">How to Choose the Right Payment Option (Strategic Insight)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ggy5oe\" data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1612\">Semester-wise Payment (₹49,000)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1762\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"73y9zk\" data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1638\">Lowest upfront burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aaxsmi\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1688\">Ideal if you are managing funds independently</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ofn24w\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1762\">Slight risk: <strong data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1762\">requires disciplined financial planning every 6 months</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kwf9r7\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1792\">Yearly Payment (₹98,000)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w397uk\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1814\">Balanced approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tb20vd\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1863\">Fewer transactions compared to semester mode</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h9ym00\" data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1923\">Works well for students with <strong data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1923\">stable financial support</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7qvod6\" data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1956\">One-Time Payment (₹196,000)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i46dym\" data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1995\">Hassle-free (no repeated payments)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tqtpqs\" data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2070\">Sometimes universities offer <strong data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2068\">discounts or benefits (if applicable)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v23d8n\" data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2145\">Best for students who want <strong data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2145\">long-term clarity and zero payment stress</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2150\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yzfrno\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2199\">Additional Fees (Often Ignored but Important)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2292\">Many students overlook these charges, which leads to <strong data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2291\">unexpected financial stress later</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7lpn1d\" data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2316\">For Indian Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2438\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2339\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2339\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2329\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2339\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2438\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2390\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2400\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2438\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2419\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2438\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6hwxo\" data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2473\">Total Additional Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2564\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdlvf5\" data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2499\">Registration: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ubx4x1\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2533\">Examination (2 years): ₹6,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vspr95\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2564\"><strong data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2564\">Total Extra Cost: ₹8,500</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2608\"><strong data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2608\">Actual Total Cost (India): ₹204,500</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2613\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j9gx8m\" data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2636\">For SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2750\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2659\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2659\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2649\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2659\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2750\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2712\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2701\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2712\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2750\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2731\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2750\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nuzsgl\" data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2785\">Total Additional Cost (SAARC)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2878\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"120jgip\" data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2812\">Registration: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3hoko1\" data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2846\">Examination (2 years): ₹7,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nb0tlb\" data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2878\"><strong data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2878\">Total Extra Cost: ₹18,750</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2922\"><strong data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2922\">Actual Total Cost (SAARC): ₹214,750</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2927\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2958\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"3077\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"2981\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"2981\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"2971\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2981\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3077\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3042\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3023\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3042\">$150 (one-time)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3077\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3061\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3077\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hgyah9\" data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3120\">Total Additional Cost (International)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3205\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gvprwz\" data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3144\">Registration: $150</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2c8y4j\" data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3176\">Examination (2 years): $100</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6qt0aa\" data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3205\"><strong data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3205\">Total Extra Cost: $250</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3210\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"r886iw\" data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3248\">EMI Options &ndash; What It Really Means</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3358\">The availability of EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) is a <strong data-start=\"3309\" data-end=\"3328\">major advantage</strong>, especially for students who:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3477\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8dhkvj\" data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3404\">Do not want to pay large amounts upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5l06nb\" data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3434\">Are working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nxdr37\" data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3477\">Want to align fees with monthly income</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dah55u\" data-start=\"3479\" data-end=\"3500\">Practical Benefit</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3688\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aeeir8\" data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3565\">Converts ₹49,000 semester fee into smaller monthly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5g1bku\" data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3615\">Makes MBA accessible without financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"odxd35\" data-start=\"3616\" data-end=\"3688\">Allows you to invest in <strong data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3688\">skills, certifications, or tools alongside</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"470\">If you&rsquo;re evaluating this MBA program, don&rsquo;t just look at the course names&mdash;understand <strong data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"277\">what you&rsquo;ll actually learn, how it builds your career, and where students usually go wrong</strong>. This program is heavily aligned with <strong data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"403\">AI-driven business decision-making, marketing analytics, and digital transformation</strong>, which makes it far more industry-relevant than a traditional MBA.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"600\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"528\">deep, structured, and strategic breakdown</strong> of each semester with insights, practical value, and hidden advantages.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"605\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1jgne0y\" data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"658\">Semester 1: Building the Business + AI Foundation</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18j9r4c\" data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"708\">Core Focus: Fundamentals + Early AI Exposure</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"887\">The first semester is designed to <strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"805\">bridge traditional business concepts with modern AI tools</strong>, which is critical because most students struggle later due to weak fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mll19q\" data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"910\">Courses Explained</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"2100\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18tt609\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1190\"><strong data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"967\">Financial and Management Accounting with AI Tools</strong><br data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"970\">You&rsquo;ll learn how to interpret financial data while using AI tools for faster analysis. This is important because companies now expect managers to <strong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1189\">use automation for financial insights, not just manual calculations</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j74hjo\" data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1394\"><strong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1235\">Managerial Economics in the Age of AI</strong><br data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1238\">Focuses on decision-making using economic principles combined with AI-driven forecasting models. Helps in pricing, demand prediction, and market strategy.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p7qfwk\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1578\"><strong data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1441\">Marketing Principles with Generative AI</strong><br data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1444\">Goes beyond traditional marketing by integrating AI tools like content generators, campaign automation, and personalization engines.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"chwcc6\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1735\"><strong data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1620\">AI Tools for Business Productivity</strong><br data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1623\">Practical exposure to tools that automate workflows&mdash;this is where you start becoming <strong data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1734\">industry-ready early</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1luvnq\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1923\"><strong data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1775\">Data Analytics and Visualization</strong><br data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1778\">One of the most critical subjects. You&rsquo;ll learn how to <strong data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1877\">turn raw data into actionable insights</strong>, which is a core skill for high-paying roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ofezh\" data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"2100\"><strong data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1966\">The Art of Persuasive Communication</strong><br data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1969\">Focuses on business storytelling, presentations, and influencing decisions&mdash;often underestimated but crucial for leadership roles.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2105\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17wf73u\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2149\">Skills You Actually Build (Real Value)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2215\">Instead of just listing them, here&rsquo;s what they mean in practice:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2625\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vt0qpp\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2296\">You learn <strong data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2271\">how to run digital marketing campaigns</strong>, not just study theory</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1crgul2\" data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2372\">You develop <strong data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2336\">AI prompt engineering</strong>, which is now a high-demand skill</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x76n5z\" data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2440\">You gain <strong data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2420\">basic coding exposure (Python/R)</strong> for handling data</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17k4swd\" data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2531\">You understand <strong data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2498\">consumer psychology and segmentation</strong>, essential for marketing roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y75dom\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2625\">You build <strong data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2567\">analytical thinking</strong>, which is the backbone of consulting and analytics jobs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"187lrdv\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2668\">Certifications &ndash; Why They Matter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2781\">The LinkedIn certifications (SEO, content strategy, Google Analytics, etc.) are not just add-ons&mdash;they help you:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2930\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1whedhg\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2824\">Build a <strong data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2824\">portfolio before graduation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kke5ns\" data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2871\">Improve your <strong data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2871\">LinkedIn profile visibility</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jdun8\" data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2930\">Gain <strong data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2930\">practical exposure recruiters actually look for</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2935\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x980f\" data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2970\">Strategic Insight (Important)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3006\">Most students make a mistake here:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3098\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m7n5qa\" data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3043\">They focus only on passing exams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pn8j4\" data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3098\">Ignore tools like analytics, SEO, and AI platforms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3183\">&nbsp;If you <strong data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3140\">master tools in Semester 1</strong>, you gain a huge advantage in internships.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3188\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wrd8nm\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3240\">Semester 2: Sales, Operations &amp; Market Execution</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ulr34q\" data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3298\">Core Focus: Applying Business + AI in Real Scenarios</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3412\">This semester shifts from theory to <strong data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3411\">execution&mdash;how businesses actually generate revenue and scale operations</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3417\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mll19q\" data-start=\"3419\" data-end=\"3440\">Courses Explained</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"4125\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"142skn0\" data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3596\"><strong data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3498\">AI in Sales Intelligence and Distribution Strategy</strong><br data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3501\">Learn how companies use AI to track leads, predict sales, and optimize distribution channels.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lagduz\" data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3734\"><strong data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3648\">Organizational Behavior and People Analytics</strong><br data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3651\">Helps you understand team dynamics and use data to improve workforce performance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15xm1qk\" data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3898\"><strong data-start=\"3738\" data-end=\"3788\">Operations and Supply Chain with AI Automation</strong><br data-start=\"3788\" data-end=\"3791\">Focuses on logistics, inventory, and automation&mdash;critical for companies like e-commerce and manufacturing.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3bnfhn\" data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"4015\"><strong data-start=\"3902\" data-end=\"3947\">Business Communication and Report Writing</strong><br data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3950\">Teaches professional documentation and corporate communication.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13plylz\" data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4125\"><strong data-start=\"4019\" data-end=\"4050\">Entrepreneurship Essentials</strong><br data-start=\"4050\" data-end=\"4053\">Helps you understand startup ecosystems, funding, and business models.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4130\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10dskav\" data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4175\">Skills That Actually Impact Your Career</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4395\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kdez8s\" data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4234\">Designing <strong data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4234\">sales funnels and lead generation systems</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4czul1\" data-start=\"4235\" data-end=\"4295\">Understanding <strong data-start=\"4251\" data-end=\"4295\">CRM tools and AI-based customer insights</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9ucxs\" data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4344\">Learning <strong data-start=\"4307\" data-end=\"4344\">revenue analytics and forecasting</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iwohh4\" data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4395\">Exposure to <strong data-start=\"4359\" data-end=\"4395\">RPA (Robotic Process Automation)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4400\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12uf1om\" data-start=\"4402\" data-end=\"4442\">Certifications &ndash; Practical Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"4464\">Certifications like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4465\" data-end=\"4530\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k22zts\" data-start=\"4465\" data-end=\"4484\">Email marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v4e74m\" data-start=\"4485\" data-end=\"4503\">PPC strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lhe6bx\" data-start=\"4504\" data-end=\"4530\">Conversion copywriting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4532\" data-end=\"4559\">These directly help you in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4603\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jngg9o\" data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4573\">Freelancing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3s2g43\" data-start=\"4574\" data-end=\"4587\">Internships</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o6ohvu\" data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4603\">Startup roles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4608\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n9tsay\" data-start=\"4610\" data-end=\"4628\">Hidden Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4630\" data-end=\"4671\">This semester decides whether you become:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4672\" data-end=\"4741\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1he3pz7\" data-start=\"4672\" data-end=\"4702\">A <strong data-start=\"4676\" data-end=\"4702\">job-ready professional</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j0uht1\" data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4741\">Or just a theoretical MBA graduate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4743\" data-end=\"4832\">&nbsp;Students who actively build projects here often land <strong data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4832\">internships before Semester 3</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4834\" data-end=\"4837\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2mb4o1\" data-start=\"4839\" data-end=\"4899\">Semester 3: Strategy, Leadership &amp; Advanced AI Integration</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j9rb0i\" data-start=\"4901\" data-end=\"4953\">Core Focus: Decision-Making + Strategic Thinking</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4955\" data-end=\"5024\">This is where the program becomes <strong data-start=\"4989\" data-end=\"5023\">high-value and differentiating</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5029\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mll19q\" data-start=\"5031\" data-end=\"5052\">Courses Explained</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5054\" data-end=\"5787\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rmxa6p\" data-start=\"5054\" data-end=\"5164\"><strong data-start=\"5056\" data-end=\"5085\">Business Research Methods</strong><br data-start=\"5085\" data-end=\"5088\">Teaches how to conduct research&mdash;useful for consulting and analytics roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vhk00x\" data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5267\"><strong data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5203\">AI for Business Decision Making</strong><br data-start=\"5203\" data-end=\"5206\">Helps you use AI models for solving real business problems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sjni5s\" data-start=\"5269\" data-end=\"5391\"><strong data-start=\"5271\" data-end=\"5309\">Strategic Management in the AI Era</strong><br data-start=\"5309\" data-end=\"5312\">Focuses on long-term planning, competitive advantage, and digital disruption.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1linwwp\" data-start=\"5393\" data-end=\"5484\"><strong data-start=\"5395\" data-end=\"5436\">AI in Corporate Finance and Valuation</strong><br data-start=\"5436\" data-end=\"5439\">Combines finance with predictive analytics.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3tf7zi\" data-start=\"5486\" data-end=\"5598\"><strong data-start=\"5488\" data-end=\"5537\">AI-Driven Risk Management and Fraud Detection</strong><br data-start=\"5537\" data-end=\"5540\">Important for fintech, banking, and cybersecurity roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cfut0g\" data-start=\"5600\" data-end=\"5686\"><strong data-start=\"5602\" data-end=\"5630\">Psychology of Leadership</strong><br data-start=\"5630\" data-end=\"5633\">Focuses on leadership behavior and decision-making.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gha2ss\" data-start=\"5688\" data-end=\"5787\"><strong data-start=\"5690\" data-end=\"5724\">Design Thinking / Business Law</strong><br data-start=\"5724\" data-end=\"5727\">Gives you a choice between innovation or legal frameworks.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5789\" data-end=\"5792\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1te7nta\" data-start=\"5794\" data-end=\"5828\">Skills That Make You Stand Out</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5830\" data-end=\"6010\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"122mtm9\" data-start=\"5830\" data-end=\"5877\">Advanced <strong data-start=\"5841\" data-end=\"5877\">SEO tools (SEMrush, Ahrefs, Moz)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5t14fl\" data-start=\"5878\" data-end=\"5914\"><strong data-start=\"5880\" data-end=\"5914\">Omnichannel marketing strategy</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gvcpst\" data-start=\"5915\" data-end=\"5968\"><strong data-start=\"5917\" data-end=\"5968\">Customer profiling (RFM, firmographic analysis)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pobmpb\" data-start=\"5969\" data-end=\"6010\"><strong data-start=\"5971\" data-end=\"6010\">Product design and agile management</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6012\" data-end=\"6015\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k0rot9\" data-start=\"6017\" data-end=\"6053\">Certifications &ndash; Career Boosters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6055\" data-end=\"6085\">These certifications focus on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6086\" data-end=\"6185\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lm5maz\" data-start=\"6086\" data-end=\"6110\">Influencer marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kzj0us\" data-start=\"6111\" data-end=\"6145\">Instagram &amp; LinkedIn marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iza8py\" data-start=\"6146\" data-end=\"6170\">Conversion analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q301nu\" data-start=\"6171\" data-end=\"6185\">Web design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6187\" data-end=\"6292\">&nbsp;This makes you <strong data-start=\"6205\" data-end=\"6222\">multi-skilled</strong>, which is extremely valuable in startups and digital-first companies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6294\" data-end=\"6297\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9u2hd7\" data-start=\"6299\" data-end=\"6319\">Critical Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6321\" data-end=\"6348\">This is the semester where:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6349\" data-end=\"6428\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jiokko\" data-start=\"6349\" data-end=\"6390\">Your <strong data-start=\"6356\" data-end=\"6390\">specialization becomes visible</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1taep07\" data-start=\"6391\" data-end=\"6428\">Your <strong data-start=\"6398\" data-end=\"6428\">resume becomes competitive</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6430\" data-end=\"6495\">&nbsp;If you don&rsquo;t build projects here, placements become difficult.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6497\" data-end=\"6500\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1oo70ky\" data-start=\"6502\" data-end=\"6559\">Semester 4: Leadership, Innovation &amp; Industry Readiness</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"e0arhd\" data-start=\"6561\" data-end=\"6621\">Core Focus: Real-World Application + High-Level Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6623\" data-end=\"6699\">This semester prepares you for <strong data-start=\"6654\" data-end=\"6698\">leadership roles and high-paying domains</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6701\" data-end=\"6704\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mll19q\" data-start=\"6706\" data-end=\"6727\">Courses Explained</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6729\" data-end=\"7369\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rc1emq\" data-start=\"6729\" data-end=\"6839\"><strong data-start=\"6731\" data-end=\"6778\">AI-Enabled Leadership and Change Management</strong><br data-start=\"6778\" data-end=\"6781\">Focuses on managing teams during digital transformation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zlipd6\" data-start=\"6841\" data-end=\"6947\"><strong data-start=\"6843\" data-end=\"6884\">Fintech Innovations (Blockchain, RPA)</strong><br data-start=\"6884\" data-end=\"6887\">Covers emerging technologies shaping finance and business.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fc8yed\" data-start=\"6949\" data-end=\"7041\"><strong data-start=\"6951\" data-end=\"6985\">Predictive Financial Modelling</strong><br data-start=\"6985\" data-end=\"6988\">Teaches forecasting and business decision modeling.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u19qwg\" data-start=\"7043\" data-end=\"7156\"><strong data-start=\"7045\" data-end=\"7092\">Tech-Driven M&amp;A and Corporate Restructuring</strong><br data-start=\"7092\" data-end=\"7095\">Covers mergers, acquisitions, and restructuring strategies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13xhekp\" data-start=\"7158\" data-end=\"7253\"><strong data-start=\"7160\" data-end=\"7189\">Emerging Tech in Business</strong><br data-start=\"7189\" data-end=\"7192\">Explores future trends like AI, blockchain, and automation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bg8xu2\" data-start=\"7255\" data-end=\"7369\"><strong data-start=\"7257\" data-end=\"7302\">Research / Project (Earn While You Learn)</strong><br data-start=\"7302\" data-end=\"7305\">The most important component&mdash;real-world project or internship.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7371\" data-end=\"7374\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ob84xv\" data-start=\"7376\" data-end=\"7418\">Skills You Gain (High-Level Expertise)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7420\" data-end=\"7474\">This semester is extremely powerful because it covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7476\" data-end=\"7689\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juuvcu\" data-start=\"7476\" data-end=\"7530\"><strong data-start=\"7478\" data-end=\"7530\">Performance marketing &amp; programmatic advertising</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1awmsg4\" data-start=\"7531\" data-end=\"7570\"><strong data-start=\"7533\" data-end=\"7570\">AI-driven personalization engines</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ri2a5\" data-start=\"7571\" data-end=\"7608\"><strong data-start=\"7573\" data-end=\"7608\">Full-funnel campaign automation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"womjg1\" data-start=\"7609\" data-end=\"7646\"><strong data-start=\"7611\" data-end=\"7646\">Brand strategy and storytelling</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h3dscl\" data-start=\"7647\" data-end=\"7689\"><strong data-start=\"7649\" data-end=\"7689\">Blockchain and innovation frameworks</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7691\" data-end=\"7694\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c0o44b\" data-start=\"7696\" data-end=\"7735\">Certifications &ndash; Industry Alignment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7737\" data-end=\"7748\">Focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7749\" data-end=\"7845\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5f1qsd\" data-start=\"7749\" data-end=\"7769\">Growth marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwzqht\" data-start=\"7770\" data-end=\"7789\">PPC advertising</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k89v5v\" data-start=\"7790\" data-end=\"7809\">AI in marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mk6cm\" data-start=\"7810\" data-end=\"7845\">Integrated marketing strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7847\" data-end=\"7906\">These directly align with&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"7876\" data-end=\"7906\">top recruiter expectations</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7908\" data-end=\"7911\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6i6d07\" data-start=\"7913\" data-end=\"7951\">Strategic Insight (Very Important)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7953\" data-end=\"7978\">This semester determines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7979\" data-end=\"8033\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y959gq\" data-start=\"7979\" data-end=\"8007\">Your <strong data-start=\"7986\" data-end=\"8007\">placement package</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gotllo\" data-start=\"8008\" data-end=\"8033\">Your <strong data-start=\"8015\" data-end=\"8033\">job role level<br></strong>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(284, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 257, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 07:09:49', '2026-06-16 07:01:48', '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"410\">The admission process may look simple on the surface, but each step carries <strong data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"298\">important decisions that directly impact your seat confirmation, financial planning, and overall MBA experience</strong>. Understanding this process in detail helps you avoid delays, secure early admission, and make smarter choices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"491\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"466\">fully explained, step-by-step breakdown</strong> with practical insights.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"496\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"my402e\" data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"551\">Step 1: Submit Application (Profile Creation Stage)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kcrm5x\" data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"576\">What You Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"744\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cj9gmr\" data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"622\">Fill out the <strong data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"620\">online application form</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wajate\" data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"744\">Enter accurate details, including:\r\n<ul data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"744\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"686\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"719\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ufjxmv\" data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"744\">Program preference</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"841\">This is the stage where your <strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"840\">official academic profile is created in the university system</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"846\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sfpnp\" data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"877\">Why This Step is Critical</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"1062\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yw83rj\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"935\">All future steps depend on the accuracy of this form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tgi3w5\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"1062\">Errors here can lead to:\r\n<ul data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1062\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ijhv85\" data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"990\">Application rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qbqlf4\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1019\">Delays in verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j2xj0n\" data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1062\">Issues during admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1067\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1097\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n9xpn\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1158\">Entering incorrect marks or incomplete academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14tudgt\" data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1204\">Uploading unclear or mismatched documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xdhok6\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1251\">Rushing through the form without reviewing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1279\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1414\">Treat this step seriously&mdash;this is not just form filling. It defines your <strong data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1413\">eligibility validation and admission eligibility status</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1419\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wlvygn\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1477\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program (Decision-Making Stage)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1508\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1631\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"138ejs\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1560\">You select your <strong data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1558\">MBA specialization/program</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"czvigu\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1597\">Review all submitted information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4hux6\" data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1631\">Confirm your intent to enroll</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1636\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1663\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1737\">This is one of the most important decisions in your MBA journey because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1875\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4jgj9a\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1799\">Your specialization determines your <strong data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1797\">career direction</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cmx10m\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1875\">It influences your <strong data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1873\">skills, internships, and placement opportunities</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1880\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12vdqyh\" data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1909\">Smart Decision Approach</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1950\">Before confirming enrollment, evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2182\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yavhv\" data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2034\">Does the program align with your <strong data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2032\">career goals (HR, analytics, management)?</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x4l1ru\" data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2113\">Are you ready for <strong data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2111\">AI-integrated learning and analytics-based subjects?</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iwfwoy\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2182\">Does it offer <strong data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2182\">practical exposure and industry-relevant skills?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2187\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kzox0n\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2207\">Common Mistake</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2237\">Choosing a program based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2287\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x119pu\" data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2248\">Trends</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2xtlb\" data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2266\">Peer pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k9pyql\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2287\">Lack of research</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2337\">This often leads to poor career alignment later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2342\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1v7wuv5\" data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2399\">Step 3: Complete Payment (Financial Commitment Stage)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2430\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2647\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14oih46\" data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2538\"><strong data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2454\">One-Time Payment</strong>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2538\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pg4148\" data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2485\">Pay the full fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xtkq4g\" data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2538\">Get a <strong data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2512\">15% discount</strong> (significant cost saving)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jbtxsb\" data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2647\"><strong data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2566\">Education Loan / EMI</strong>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2647\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"scu1xe\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2604\">Pay in <strong data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2602\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15hi4sp\" data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2647\">0% interest makes it more manageable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2652\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"p8tb64\" data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2678\">What This Step Means</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2720\">This is where your admission moves from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2756\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18fpg6e\" data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2756\"><strong data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2756\">Intent &rarr; Confirmed commitment</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2802\">Your financial choice here directly affects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2904\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4rbsma\" data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2844\">Your stress levels during the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uil7gg\" data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2904\">Your ability to invest in additional learning resources</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"2909\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"l1ybm5\" data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2939\">Smart Financial Strategy</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"2977\">If You Have Financial Stability</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3060\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e00oib\" data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3005\">Choose one-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zq25pq\" data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3060\">Benefit from discount and avoid future liabilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3087\">If Budget is Limited</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3192\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12lp4jp\" data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3110\">Choose EMI or loan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pj1azw\" data-start=\"3111\" data-end=\"3192\">Keep funds available for:\r\n<ul data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3192\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gyqrz7\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3159\">Certifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13sut4z\" data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3171\">Tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1duwn6q\" data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3192\">Skill-building</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3197\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gxruj2\" data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3226\">Hidden Mistake to Avoid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3242\">Many students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3343\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ceq2xy\" data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3275\">Spend entire savings on fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j1byza\" data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3343\">Have no budget left for <strong data-start=\"3302\" data-end=\"3343\">practical exposure and certifications</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3370\">This reduces overall ROI.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3375\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wxuvsp\" data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3430\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat (Final Confirmation Stage)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjl3k3\" data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3462\">What Happens After Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3596\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jasfbi\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3507\">Payment is verified OR loan is approved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gdxf3h\" data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3550\">Your admission is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dg3787\" data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3596\">Your <strong data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3596\">seat in the MBA program is secured</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3601\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1atjakk\" data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3623\">What You Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3758\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3651\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e0qiu5\" data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3683\">Enrollment into the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3gq39z\" data-start=\"3684\" data-end=\"3758\">Access to academic systems (learning platform, course materials, etc.)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3760\" data-end=\"3763\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3795\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3970\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jpu2am\" data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3821\">Seats may be limited</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xnbmrw\" data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3970\">Early confirmation ensures:\r\n<ul data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3970\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eu9n0f\" data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3878\">Guaranteed admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qgxcnt\" data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3919\">Early access to learning resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a5jpg2\" data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"3970\">Better preparation time before classes begin</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3972\" data-end=\"3975\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"3biw2b\" data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"4019\">Complete Admission Flow (Quick Overview)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4345\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4060\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4060\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4028\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4036\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4049\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Action</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4060\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4345\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4155\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4108\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4122\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4136\">Submit form</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4136\" data-end=\"4155\">Profile created</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4156\" data-end=\"4226\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4156\" data-end=\"4165\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4165\" data-end=\"4178\">Enrollment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4195\">Select program</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4195\" data-end=\"4226\">Enrollment intent confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4285\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4236\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4246\">Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4262\">Pay fee / EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4285\">Admission initiated</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4345\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4295\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4310\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4310\" data-end=\"4329\">Payment verified</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4345\">Seat secured</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"444\">Before applying, it is essential to understand the eligibility criteria not just at a surface level, but in terms of <strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"331\">what it means for your admission chances, academic readiness, and long-term success in the program</strong>. Many applicants meet the minimum criteria but fail to perform well later due to lack of preparation or clarity.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"449\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2c0aqd\" data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"478\">Core Academic Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"582\">To be eligible for admission into the MBA program, candidates must fulfill the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"781\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13uvda6\" data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"657\">A <strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"637\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree of minimum 3 years duration</strong> in any discipline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cquiqa\" data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"717\">The degree must be from a <strong data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"715\">UGC-recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yqfoyi\" data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"781\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"779\">50% aggregate marks or an equivalent grade</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"952\">This ensures that candidates have a basic academic foundation required to understand <strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"928\">business concepts, analytics, and AI-integrated subjects</strong> covered in the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"957\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"c2xkg\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"995\">Relaxation for Reserved Categories</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7m45ay\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1100\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1043\">SC/ST categories</strong> are eligible with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1098\">45% aggregate marks</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1232\">This relaxation follows standard academic norms and enables broader access to higher education while maintaining academic quality.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pfjmxw\" data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1276\">Eligibility for Final-Year Students</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1383\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10h1xml\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1383\">Candidates <strong data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1354\">appearing for the final semester of their Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> are also eligible to apply</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qbxms8\" data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1416\">What This Means Practically</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11lp1f3\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1469\">You can apply before completing your graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xgbfjk\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1512\">Admission is typically <strong data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1510\">provisional</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s86uub\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1610\">Final confirmation depends on achieving the required minimum marks after results are declared</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1735\">This gives students a strategic advantage by allowing them to <strong data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1734\">secure admission early and avoid last-minute competition</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1740\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1opy88g\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1775\">Academic Background Flexibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1848\">The program allows applicants from <strong data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1836\">all academic streams</strong>, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1952\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16qhdo4\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1875\">Commerce (B.Com, BBA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g8laey\" data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1922\">Science and Technology (B.Sc, B.Tech, BCA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kwwvxi\" data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1952\">Arts and Humanities (B.A)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hik4e2\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1979\">Practical Implication</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2206\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y5u9op\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2073\">You can transition into HR, analytics, or management roles regardless of your background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g1qfqv\" data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2206\">However, students from non-commerce or non-technical backgrounds may need to <strong data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2206\">adapt quickly to business and analytical subjects</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"418\">Choosing an MBA is not just an academic decision&mdash;it is a <strong data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"189\">financial investment</strong>. To make the right choice, you need clarity on the <strong data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"347\">total payable cost, flexible payment options, hidden charges, and long-term return on investment (ROI)</strong>. Below is a complete, detailed breakdown to help you plan effectively.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"423\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12tfypo\" data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"450\">Total MBA Fees Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"503\">The total academic fee for the full MBA program is:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"531\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"531\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"521\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"531\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<td data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"578\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"590\">₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"620\">This fee generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"awy15m\" data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"664\">Academic curriculum and course delivery</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jcacgo\" data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"702\">Learning resources and LMS access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jdee47\" data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"737\">Core academic support services</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"833\">However, this is <strong data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"793\">not the final amount you will pay</strong>, as additional mandatory charges apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zff0iv\" data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"897\">Flexible Payment Options (Financial Planning Advantage)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"980\">The program offers multiple payment modes to suit different financial situations:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1022\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1022\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"997\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1006\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1022\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suitable For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1140\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1080\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-wise</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1103\">₹49,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1140\">Students seeking low upfront cost</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1212\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1169\">₹98,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1212\">Students preferring structured payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1224\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-time</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1250\">₹196,000 (full payment)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1292\">Students wanting a one-time settlement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1297\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"89xe6w\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1343\">Payment Strategy (What You Should Choose)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1udfl87\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1370\">Semester-wise Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fttkcl\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1424\">Best for students managing finances independently</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"133abd\" data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1461\">Lower immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6rnceb\" data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1509\">Requires consistent planning every 6 months</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s8zxza\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1529\">Yearly Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1627\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wvjnk5\" data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1585\">Balanced approach between flexibility and stability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"152dpz6\" data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1627\">Fewer transactions than semester mode</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1458i2o\" data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1649\">One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1799\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ss5mm\" data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1682\">Eliminates repeated payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ynlv3u\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1732\">Suitable if you have strong financial support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1753yew\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1799\">May offer indirect benefits like reduced administrative hassle</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1804\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1yyaoxg\" data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1841\">EMI Option &ndash; Accessibility Factor</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1916\">The availability of EMI (Equated Monthly Installments) makes the program:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12ki5eg\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1971\">More accessible to students without upfront funds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1llilx5\" data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2018\">Easier for working professionals to manage</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9lz3op\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2075\">Financially flexible without large one-time pressure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2098\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2122\">EMI is useful only if:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2230\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a3scgj\" data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2162\">You maintain a steady income source</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xhhcfy\" data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2230\">You simultaneously invest in skill-building to justify the cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2235\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w7wo3t\" data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2283\">Additional Fees (Critical but Often Ignored)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2361\">These are mandatory charges and must be included in your financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2366\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2392\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2516\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2415\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2415\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2405\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2415\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2516\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2468\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2478\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2516\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2497\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2516\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6hwxo\" data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2551\">Total Additional Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2642\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdlvf5\" data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2577\">Registration: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ubx4x1\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2611\">Examination (2 years): ₹6,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vspr95\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2642\"><strong data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2642\">Total Extra Cost: ₹8,500</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1inirl7\" data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2673\">Actual Total Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2813\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2697\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2697\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2687\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2697\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2813\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2747\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2735\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2747\">₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2776\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2766\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2776\">₹8,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2813\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2797\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2796\">Total Payable</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2813\"><strong data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2811\">₹204,500</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2818\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vl7an\" data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2854\">For Students in SAARC Countries</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2968\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2877\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2877\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2867\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2877\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2968\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2930\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2919\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2930\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2968\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2949\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2968\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nuzsgl\" data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"3003\">Total Additional Cost (SAARC)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"120jgip\" data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3030\">Registration: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3hoko1\" data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3064\">Examination (2 years): ₹7,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nb0tlb\" data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3096\"><strong data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3096\">Total Extra Cost: ₹18,750</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xbr8hu\" data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3127\">Actual Total Cost (SAARC)</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3268\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3151\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3151\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3141\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3151\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3268\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3201\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3189\" data-end=\"3201\">₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3231\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3220\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3231\">₹18,750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3268\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3252\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3251\">Total Payable</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3252\" data-end=\"3268\"><strong data-start=\"3254\" data-end=\"3266\">₹214,750</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3273\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"3275\" data-end=\"3304\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3423\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3327\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3327\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3317\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3327\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3423\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3388\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3380\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3388\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3423\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3407\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3423\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hgyah9\" data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3466\">Total Additional Cost (International)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3551\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gvprwz\" data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3490\">Registration: $150</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2c8y4j\" data-start=\"3491\" data-end=\"3522\">Examination (2 years): $100</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6qt0aa\" data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3551\"><strong data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3551\">Total Extra Cost: $250</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"457\">This MBA specialization is designed for students who want to build a career in <strong data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"265\">modern HR powered by analytics, AI, and strategic workforce management</strong>. Unlike traditional HR programs, this curriculum goes beyond theory and focuses on <strong data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"414\">data-driven HR decisions, automation, and talent intelligence</strong>, which are now essential in top companies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"652\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"537\">deep, structured, and strategic breakdown of all four semesters</strong>, including what you will actually learn, how it connects to real jobs, and where students typically make mistakes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"657\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12m7llb\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"724\">Semester 1: Business Foundation + AI Introduction in HR Context</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1eh7h9f\" data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"787\">Core Focus: Building Strong Fundamentals with AI Exposure</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"933\">The first semester establishes <strong data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"892\">core business understanding while introducing AI tools and analytics</strong>, which are critical for modern HR roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"938\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"188nna1\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"977\">Courses &amp; Practical Understanding</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1866\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v14j4j\" data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1202\"><strong data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1032\">Financial &amp; Management Accounting with AI Tools</strong><br data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1035\">Helps you understand budgets, cost control, and financial decision-making&mdash;important for HR roles involving <strong data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1201\">compensation planning and workforce cost optimization</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17prtv4\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1376\"><strong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1249\">Marketing Principles with Generative AI</strong><br data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1252\">Teaches branding and consumer behavior, which directly connects to <strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1375\">employer branding and talent attraction strategies</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j6bqms\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1534\"><strong data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1418\">AI Tools for Business Productivity</strong><br data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1421\">Introduces automation tools used in HR for tasks like <strong data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1533\">resume screening, workflow automation, and reporting</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qmswhx\" data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1703\"><strong data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1574\">Data Analytics and Visualization</strong><br data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1577\">One of the most important subjects&mdash;builds your ability to <strong data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1702\">analyze employee data, performance metrics, and HR dashboards</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bycza4\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1866\"><strong data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1746\">The Art of Persuasive Communication</strong><br data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1749\">Develops communication skills required for <strong data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1865\">interviews, negotiations, employee engagement, and leadership roles</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1871\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ku1q33\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1922\">Skills You Actually Build (Industry-Relevant)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1962\">This semester is heavily skill-driven:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2335\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yes2j2\" data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2010\">Financial planning and workforce budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v8qesc\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2085\">Market analysis and pricing logic (useful for compensation strategies)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1il00tm\" data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2140\">Digital marketing basics for <strong data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2138\">employer branding</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mdzjcy\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2181\">Generative AI and prompt engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15cauxq\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2232\">Workflow automation (reducing manual HR tasks)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"71j35j\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2284\">Data analysis and visualization (HR dashboards)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pat0x\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2335\">Business communication and presentation skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17v4tjz\" data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2383\">Certifications (Early Technical Edge)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2468\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ushwes\" data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2431\">Python for Data Science &amp; Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1snw0vn\" data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2468\">AI Foundations: Machine Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2500\">These certifications help you:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2587\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ms5b0\" data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2552\">Build <strong data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2550\">technical credibility in HR analytics</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kbwgd1\" data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2587\">Stand out in internships early</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2592\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2615\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2776\">Most HR students ignore analytics in Semester 1. That is a mistake.<br data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2687\">Companies now prefer HR professionals who can <strong data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2775\">interpret data, not just manage people</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2781\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7gkm8n\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2835\">Semester 2: HR Operations + Organizational Systems</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g5cap6\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2889\">Core Focus: Managing People Using Data &amp; Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"3010\">This semester transitions from fundamentals to <strong data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"3009\">real HR functions such as workforce management, CRM, and operations</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3012\" data-end=\"3015\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"188nna1\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3054\">Courses &amp; Practical Understanding</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3799\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"srccnt\" data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3216\"><strong data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3104\">Organizational Behavior &amp; People Analytics</strong><br data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3107\">Focuses on understanding employee behavior using data&mdash;critical for <strong data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3215\">engagement and retention strategies</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"go1qj9\" data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3386\"><strong data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3272\">AI in Sales Intelligence &amp; Distribution Strategy</strong><br data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3275\">Helps HR understand business revenue systems, which is important for <strong data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3385\">aligning hiring with business goals</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1let5w8\" data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3538\"><strong data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3438\">Operations &amp; Supply Chain with AI Automation</strong><br data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3441\">Builds understanding of operational workflows&mdash;useful when managing <strong data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3537\">large workforce systems</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mwa8k3\" data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3662\"><strong data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3585\">Business Communication &amp; Report Writing</strong><br data-start=\"3585\" data-end=\"3588\">Essential for creating HR reports, policies, and internal communication.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g7mt0j\" data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3799\"><strong data-start=\"3666\" data-end=\"3697\">Entrepreneurship Essentials</strong><br data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3700\">Helps in understanding startups and business models&mdash;useful for HR roles in <strong data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"3798\">growing companies</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3804\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rdj10a\" data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"3842\">Skills That Matter in HR Careers</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"4081\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vo4n9g\" data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3882\">Workforce analytics and HR metrics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdcilw\" data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"3924\">Organizational design and development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xd7d94\" data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3966\">CRM and employee lifecycle management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s1y7pz\" data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"4006\">Sales and operational understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"136slg3\" data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4041\">Business writing and reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ysp08m\" data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4081\">Startup and agile business thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4086\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xzufsc\" data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4126\">Certifications (Niche HR Exposure)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4128\" data-end=\"4148\">Focus areas include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4149\" data-end=\"4251\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c9ol6s\" data-start=\"4149\" data-end=\"4187\">Staffing and recruitment processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4pm1am\" data-start=\"4188\" data-end=\"4221\">Recruitment outsourcing (RPO)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uy3y4b\" data-start=\"4222\" data-end=\"4251\">Talent acquisition models</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4253\" data-end=\"4256\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n9tsay\" data-start=\"4258\" data-end=\"4276\">Hidden Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4278\" data-end=\"4319\">This semester defines whether you become:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4320\" data-end=\"4415\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i07qeg\" data-start=\"4320\" data-end=\"4352\">A <strong data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4352\">traditional HR executive</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rl05c9\" data-start=\"4353\" data-end=\"4415\">Or a <strong data-start=\"4360\" data-end=\"4415\">strategic HR professional with analytics capability</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4417\" data-end=\"4420\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"v8jga6\" data-start=\"4422\" data-end=\"4465\">Semester 3: Strategic HR + AI Integration</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2ommor\" data-start=\"4467\" data-end=\"4529\">Core Focus: Advanced HR Strategy, Recruitment &amp; Leadership</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4531\" data-end=\"4598\">This is the most important semester for <strong data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4597\">core HR specialization</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4600\" data-end=\"4603\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"188nna1\" data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4642\">Courses &amp; Practical Understanding</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4644\" data-end=\"5482\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zuzyt4\" data-start=\"4644\" data-end=\"4744\"><strong data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4684\">Strategic Management in the AI Era</strong><br data-start=\"4684\" data-end=\"4687\">Teaches how HR aligns with long-term business strategy.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i6xpqs\" data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4873\"><strong data-start=\"4748\" data-end=\"4794\">AI for Recruitment &amp; Onboarding Automation</strong><br data-start=\"4794\" data-end=\"4797\">Focuses on automated hiring systems, ATS tools, and AI-driven recruitment.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k72fc6\" data-start=\"4875\" data-end=\"5008\"><strong data-start=\"4877\" data-end=\"4926\">Performance &amp; Engagement Measurement using AI</strong><br data-start=\"4926\" data-end=\"4929\">Helps track employee productivity, engagement, and retention using analytics.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1do63c7\" data-start=\"5010\" data-end=\"5098\"><strong data-start=\"5012\" data-end=\"5040\">Psychology of Leadership</strong><br data-start=\"5040\" data-end=\"5043\">Builds leadership mindset and emotional intelligence.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pe0wg3\" data-start=\"5100\" data-end=\"5217\"><strong data-start=\"5102\" data-end=\"5145\">Design Thinking and Product Development</strong><br data-start=\"5145\" data-end=\"5148\">Useful for creating HR solutions and improving employee experience.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hde0f8\" data-start=\"5219\" data-end=\"5294\"><strong data-start=\"5221\" data-end=\"5256\">Business Law in the Digital Age</strong><br data-start=\"5256\" data-end=\"5259\">Covers labor laws and compliance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9gkcf\" data-start=\"5296\" data-end=\"5379\"><strong data-start=\"5298\" data-end=\"5327\">Business Research Methods</strong><br data-start=\"5327\" data-end=\"5330\">Important for HR analytics and decision-making.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13eng0w\" data-start=\"5381\" data-end=\"5482\"><strong data-start=\"5383\" data-end=\"5418\">AI for Business Decision Making</strong><br data-start=\"5418\" data-end=\"5421\">Strengthens your ability to use AI for strategic decisions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5484\" data-end=\"5487\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"139duz1\" data-start=\"5489\" data-end=\"5523\">Skills That Make You Job-Ready</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5525\" data-end=\"5808\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y1rgaz\" data-start=\"5525\" data-end=\"5572\">Talent acquisition and recruitment strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yz1aiy\" data-start=\"5573\" data-end=\"5609\">Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fogrex\" data-start=\"5610\" data-end=\"5643\">HRIS (HR Information Systems)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sti311\" data-start=\"5644\" data-end=\"5678\">Performance management systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18y9re2\" data-start=\"5679\" data-end=\"5713\">Employee engagement strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xbwjwv\" data-start=\"5714\" data-end=\"5753\">Leadership development and coaching</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p4aiqe\" data-start=\"5754\" data-end=\"5782\">Labor law and compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3q375g\" data-start=\"5783\" data-end=\"5808\">HR project management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5810\" data-end=\"5813\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jg4elv\" data-start=\"5815\" data-end=\"5855\">Certifications (High Industry Value)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5857\" data-end=\"5877\">Focus areas include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5878\" data-end=\"5977\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fn4jan\" data-start=\"5878\" data-end=\"5904\">AI-powered recruitment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w1he80\" data-start=\"5905\" data-end=\"5925\">Diversity hiring</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uel13a\" data-start=\"5926\" data-end=\"5947\">Employer branding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geyi3\" data-start=\"5948\" data-end=\"5977\">LinkedIn recruiting tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5979\" data-end=\"6042\">These are directly aligned with <strong data-start=\"6011\" data-end=\"6041\">modern HR hiring practices</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6044\" data-end=\"6047\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9u2hd7\" data-start=\"6049\" data-end=\"6069\">Critical Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6071\" data-end=\"6096\">This semester determines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6097\" data-end=\"6161\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fnipj\" data-start=\"6097\" data-end=\"6130\">Your <strong data-start=\"6104\" data-end=\"6130\">core HR specialization</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wgxzk0\" data-start=\"6131\" data-end=\"6161\">Your <strong data-start=\"6138\" data-end=\"6161\">placement readiness</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6163\" data-end=\"6213\">Students who build projects here get better roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6215\" data-end=\"6218\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"mlri0e\" data-start=\"6220\" data-end=\"6287\">Semester 4: Advanced HR Analytics, Leadership &amp; Industry Exposure</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"b28yty\" data-start=\"6289\" data-end=\"6345\">Core Focus: Future-Ready HR + Real-World Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6347\" data-end=\"6428\">This semester prepares you for <strong data-start=\"6378\" data-end=\"6427\">leadership roles and high-impact HR positions</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6430\" data-end=\"6433\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"188nna1\" data-start=\"6435\" data-end=\"6472\">Courses &amp; Practical Understanding</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6474\" data-end=\"7114\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1typgwl\" data-start=\"6474\" data-end=\"6587\"><strong data-start=\"6476\" data-end=\"6515\">Predictive Human Resource Analytics</strong><br data-start=\"6515\" data-end=\"6518\">Uses data to predict employee behavior, attrition, and performance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jmycpt\" data-start=\"6589\" data-end=\"6716\"><strong data-start=\"6591\" data-end=\"6645\">Diversity, Inclusion &amp; Retention Prediction Models</strong><br data-start=\"6645\" data-end=\"6648\">Focuses on inclusive workforce strategies and retention analytics.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1260fqa\" data-start=\"6718\" data-end=\"6813\"><strong data-start=\"6720\" data-end=\"6765\">AI-Enabled Leadership &amp; Change Management</strong><br data-start=\"6765\" data-end=\"6768\">Helps manage organizational transformation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105hbp6\" data-start=\"6815\" data-end=\"6920\"><strong data-start=\"6817\" data-end=\"6864\">Smart Talent Development &amp; Learning Systems</strong><br data-start=\"6864\" data-end=\"6867\">Focuses on training systems and learning platforms.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"122voy4\" data-start=\"6922\" data-end=\"6998\"><strong data-start=\"6924\" data-end=\"6953\">Emerging Tech in Business</strong><br data-start=\"6953\" data-end=\"6956\">Covers future technologies impacting HR.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tlcrf4\" data-start=\"7000\" data-end=\"7114\"><strong data-start=\"7002\" data-end=\"7047\">Research / Project (Earn While You Learn)</strong><br data-start=\"7047\" data-end=\"7050\">Real-world project or internship&mdash;most critical for placements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7116\" data-end=\"7119\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o3nuen\" data-start=\"7121\" data-end=\"7157\">Skills You Gain (Advanced Level)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7159\" data-end=\"7400\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rsja9w\" data-start=\"7159\" data-end=\"7208\">Workforce planning and human capital strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xj6fqk\" data-start=\"7209\" data-end=\"7249\">Learning &amp; development systems (LMS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mxuppf\" data-start=\"7250\" data-end=\"7296\">Instructional design and training programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"llaup3\" data-start=\"7297\" data-end=\"7330\">AI and machine learning in HR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hknplx\" data-start=\"7331\" data-end=\"7367\">Diversity and inclusion strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sd7jps\" data-start=\"7368\" data-end=\"7400\">Emerging technology adoption</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7402\" data-end=\"7405\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13hix1h\" data-start=\"7407\" data-end=\"7452\">Certifications (Final Industry Alignment)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7454\" data-end=\"7474\">Focus areas include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7475\" data-end=\"7573\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n2zhpv\" data-start=\"7475\" data-end=\"7504\">Compensation and benefits</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b00csb\" data-start=\"7505\" data-end=\"7521\">Pay strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"womcym\" data-start=\"7522\" data-end=\"7545\">Succession planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jwjf55\" data-start=\"7546\" data-end=\"7573\">Strategic HR management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7575\" data-end=\"7578\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"7580\" data-end=\"7601\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7603\" data-end=\"7630\">Your final project decides:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7631\" data-end=\"7677\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19wn83u\" data-start=\"7631\" data-end=\"7650\">Your <strong data-start=\"7638\" data-end=\"7650\">job role</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8c1431\" data-start=\"7651\" data-end=\"7677\">Your <strong data-start=\"7658\" data-end=\"7677\">starting salary</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7679\" data-end=\"7763\">Students who choose strong, industry-relevant projects perform significantly better.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(285, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 255, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-05 07:19:38', '2026-06-16 07:02:27', '<p data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"466\">The admission process is structured into four clear steps, but each stage plays a <strong data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"299\">critical role in determining your admission confirmation, financial planning, and overall readiness for the program</strong>. Since this MBA includes <strong data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"355\">ACCA-integrated components</strong>, it is important to approach the process with careful planning rather than treating it as a routine formality.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"585\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"524\">complete, detailed breakdown of each step</strong>, along with practical insights and common mistakes to avoid.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"66btrv\" data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"649\">Step 1: Submit Application (Initial Registration Stage)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kcrm5x\" data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"674\">What You Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"843\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cj9gmr\" data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"720\">Fill out the <strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"718\">online application form</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u45y02\" data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"843\">Provide accurate details, including:\r\n<ul data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"843\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"786\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"819\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yylsws\" data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"843\">Program selection</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"924\">This step officially creates your <strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"923\">academic profile in the admission system</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"929\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"961\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1158\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bsc2b1\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1028\">All further stages depend on the accuracy of your application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kg94d1\" data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1158\">Errors can lead to:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1158\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pn5mf6\" data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1077\">Delays in processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ykp391\" data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1113\">Rejection during verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xlhwj3\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1158\">Issues in final admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1163\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1193\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1345\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n9xpn\" data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1254\">Entering incorrect marks or incomplete academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iad4s1\" data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1299\">Uploading unclear or incorrect documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sajlff\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1345\">Submitting the form without proper review</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1350\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1373\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1504\">This step determines your <strong data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1427\">eligibility validation</strong>. Even small mistakes can cause unnecessary delays, so accuracy is essential.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1f3zard\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1569\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program (Program Selection Stage)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xlktxj\" data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1592\">What Happens Here</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1724\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12txvcm\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1655\">You select your <strong data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1653\">MBA Finance (ACCA Integrated) program</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tg2wk0\" data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1688\">Review all submitted details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f40gga\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1724\">Confirm your <strong data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1724\">intent to enroll</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sfpnp\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1760\">Why This Step is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1886\">This is where you make a <strong data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1829\">long-term academic and career decision</strong>. Since the program includes finance and ACCA components:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"2022\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ogyt40\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1948\">It is more <strong data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1927\">technical and rigorous</strong> than a general MBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5nthta\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"2022\">It requires commitment to <strong data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2022\">accounting, audit, and financial concepts</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2027\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12vdqyh\" data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2056\">Smart Decision Approach</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2095\">Before confirming enrollment, ensure:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2277\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z9zzo5\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2164\">You are interested in <strong data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2162\">finance, accounting, or audit careers</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vib803\" data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2212\">You are ready for <strong data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2210\">ACCA-aligned subjects</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lkc0oa\" data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2277\">You are comfortable with <strong data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2277\">numerical and analytical learning</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2282\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kzox0n\" data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2302\">Common Mistake</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2348\">Selecting the program without understanding:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2416\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f9ylbl\" data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2377\">The technical difficulty</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14su4lu\" data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2416\">The importance of ACCA integration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2462\">This often leads to academic struggle later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2467\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1v7wuv5\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2524\">Step 3: Complete Payment (Financial Commitment Stage)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2555\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2761\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19isayd\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2647\"><strong data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2579\">One-Time Payment</strong>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2647\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nw7ojp\" data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2614\">Pay full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c7d6am\" data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2647\">Receive a <strong data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2645\">15% discount</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i2vck5\" data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2761\"><strong data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2675\">Education Loan / EMI</strong>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2761\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"blh4ri\" data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2718\">Pay through <strong data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2716\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6l98rv\" data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2761\">0% interest reduces financial burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sh2gpj\" data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2797\">What This Step Represents</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2849\">This is the stage where your admission moves from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2885\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18fpg6e\" data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2885\"><strong data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2885\">Intent &rarr; Confirmed commitment</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2951\">It also defines your <strong data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2950\">financial stability during the program</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2956\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"l1ybm5\" data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2986\">Smart Financial Strategy</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3029\">If You Have Strong Financial Support</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3102\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e00oib\" data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3057\">Choose one-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uwvvtn\" data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3102\">Benefit from cost savings and simplicity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3129\">If Budget is Limited</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3250\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12lp4jp\" data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3152\">Choose EMI or loan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr0vgk\" data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3250\">Keep funds available for:\r\n<ul data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3250\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqz8qn\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3204\">ACCA-related fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12a9mov\" data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3226\">Study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"buy5xm\" data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3250\">Skill development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3252\" data-end=\"3255\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gxruj2\" data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3284\">Hidden Mistake to Avoid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3286\" data-end=\"3300\">Many students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3400\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kndxcd\" data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3342\">Spend all their funds on tuition fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sxhz68\" data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3400\">Do not plan for <strong data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3400\">ACCA fees and exam-related expenses</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3449\">This affects long-term progress in the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3451\" data-end=\"3454\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wxuvsp\" data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3509\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat (Final Confirmation Stage)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjl3k3\" data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3541\">What Happens After Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3676\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mi59n3\" data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3591\">Payment is verified OR financing is approved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gdxf3h\" data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3634\">Your admission is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ege0p\" data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3676\">Your <strong data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3676\">seat in the program is secured</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3681\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1atjakk\" data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3703\">What You Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3822\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3731\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdidbw\" data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3770\">Enrollment into the academic cycle</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qx3kt7\" data-start=\"3771\" data-end=\"3822\">Access to learning systems and course materials</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"3827\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"f88t0k\" data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3863\">Why Early Confirmation Matters</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"4017\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ccz6an\" data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3906\">Limited seats in specialized programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1npm0dw\" data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3948\">Early access to preparation resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"131dnez\" data-start=\"3949\" data-end=\"4017\">More time to get ready for <strong data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"4017\">technical subjects and ACCA modules</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4019\" data-end=\"4022\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"3biw2b\" data-start=\"4024\" data-end=\"4066\">Complete Admission Flow (Quick Overview)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4068\" data-end=\"4385\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4068\" data-end=\"4107\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4068\" data-end=\"4107\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4068\" data-end=\"4075\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4075\" data-end=\"4083\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4096\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Action</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4107\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4146\" data-end=\"4385\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4146\" data-end=\"4202\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4146\" data-end=\"4155\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4169\">Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4169\" data-end=\"4183\">Submit form</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4183\" data-end=\"4202\">Profile created</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4203\" data-end=\"4266\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4203\" data-end=\"4212\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4212\" data-end=\"4225\">Enrollment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4242\">Select program</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4242\" data-end=\"4266\">Enrollment confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4325\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4276\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4276\" data-end=\"4286\">Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4302\">Pay fee / EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4302\" data-end=\"4325\">Admission initiated</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4385\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4335\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4335\" data-end=\"4350\">Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4350\" data-end=\"4369\">Payment verified</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4385\">Seat secured</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"459\">Before applying, it is important to understand the eligibility criteria not just as a checklist, but in terms of <strong data-start=\"224\" data-end=\"288\">academic readiness, program difficulty, and career alignment</strong>. This MBA is more rigorous than a general program because it includes <strong data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"411\">finance specialization and ACCA-aligned subjects</strong>, which require strong conceptual understanding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"464\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2c0aqd\" data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"493\">Core Academic Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"577\">To apply for this MBA program, candidates must fulfill the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"775\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6mgzo6\" data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"651\">A <strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"631\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree (minimum 3 years duration)</strong> in any discipline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cquiqa\" data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"711\">The degree must be from a <strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"709\">UGC-recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yqfoyi\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"775\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"773\">50% aggregate marks or an equivalent grade</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"944\">This ensures that students have the necessary academic base to handle <strong data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"919\">financial reporting, taxation, audit, and strategic finance subjects</strong> included in the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"949\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"c2xkg\" data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"987\">Relaxation for Reserved Categories</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7m45ay\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1092\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1035\">SC/ST categories</strong> are eligible with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1090\">45% aggregate marks</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1215\">This relaxation is provided as per standard academic norms while maintaining the overall academic quality of the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1220\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pfjmxw\" data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1259\">Eligibility for Final-Year Students</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1361\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xnl1e4\" data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1361\">Candidates <strong data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1337\">appearing for the final semester of their Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> are eligible to apply</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qbxms8\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1394\">What This Means Practically</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bc61fi\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1442\">You can apply before completing graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3zc4u4\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1485\">Admission is generally <strong data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1483\">provisional</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yympxc\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1568\">Final confirmation depends on meeting the minimum required marks after results</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1649\">This allows you to <strong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1648\">secure admission early and avoid last-stage competition</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1opy88g\" data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1689\">Academic Background Flexibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1766\">The program is open to candidates from <strong data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1754\">all academic streams</strong>, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1870\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16qhdo4\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1793\">Commerce (B.Com, BBA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g8laey\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1840\">Science and Technology (B.Sc, B.Tech, BCA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kwwvxi\" data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1870\">Arts and Humanities (B.A)</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"458\">Choosing this MBA is not just about academics&mdash;it is a <strong data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"207\">financial and professional investment</strong>, especially because it includes <strong data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"260\">ACCA integration</strong>, which adds both value and additional costs. To make a smart decision, you must understand the <strong data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"457\">total payable amount, hidden charges, professional fees, and long-term return on investment (ROI)</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"463\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12tfypo\" data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"490\">Total MBA Fees Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"534\">The total academic fee for the program is:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"661\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"562\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"562\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"552\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"562\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"661\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"621\">\r\n<td data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"609\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"621\">₹298,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"661\">\r\n<td data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"638\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Breakdown</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"661\">₹2,08,000 + ₹90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"690\">This combined fee reflects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"758\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hchpni\" data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"718\">MBA academic curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qamptm\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"758\">ACCA-integrated learning components</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"763\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cbcwjd\" data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"791\">Flexible Payment Options</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"864\">The program offers multiple payment modes to reduce financial pressure:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"1123\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"881\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"890\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"906\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suitable For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1123\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1008\">\r\n<td data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"957\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"977\">₹149,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1008\">Balanced financial planning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1072\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1025\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-wise</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1048\">₹97,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1072\">Lower upfront burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1123\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1084\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-time</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1095\">₹298,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1123\">Full payment convenience</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1128\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"89xe6w\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1174\">Payment Strategy (What You Should Choose)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1udfl87\" data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1201\">Semester-wise Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1327\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fttkcl\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1255\">Best for students managing finances independently</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gksick\" data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1278\">Lower upfront cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1csszx2\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1327\">Requires disciplined planning every semester</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s8zxza\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1347\">Yearly Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q3fsos\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1370\">Fewer transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1knxdh1\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1426\">Suitable for students with stable financial backing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1458i2o\" data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1448\">One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fif386\" data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1473\">No repeated payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qtjt4o\" data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1521\">Ideal if you want financial clarity upfront</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1526\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"k3713l\" data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1567\">EMI Options (Financial Accessibility)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1633\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) is available, allowing you to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1740\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ddmxx1\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1669\">Pay in smaller monthly amounts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fkdju5\" data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1702\">Avoid large upfront payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ovwfzf\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1740\">Manage finances alongside studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1763\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1783\">EMI works best if:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1891\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aibzqd\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1833\">You have a stable income or financial support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nong0z\" data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1891\">You also invest in skill-building to justify the cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1896\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"fd6aph\" data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1935\">Additional Fees (Mandatory Charges)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"2011\">These charges are <strong data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1987\">not included in the base fee</strong> and must be considered.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2016\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2042\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2166\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2065\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2065\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2055\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2065\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2166\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2128\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2128\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2166\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2147\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2166\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6hwxo\" data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2201\">Total Additional Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2292\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdlvf5\" data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2227\">Registration: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ubx4x1\" data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2261\">Examination (2 years): ₹6,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vspr95\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2292\"><strong data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2292\">Total Extra Cost: ₹8,500</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2297\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vl7an\" data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2333\">For Students in SAARC Countries</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2447\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2356\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2356\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2346\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2356\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2447\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2409\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2398\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2409\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2447\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2428\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2447\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nuzsgl\" data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2482\">Total Additional Cost (SAARC)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2575\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"120jgip\" data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2509\">Registration: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3hoko1\" data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2543\">Examination (2 years): ₹7,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nb0tlb\" data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2575\"><strong data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2575\">Total Extra Cost: ₹18,750</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2580\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2611\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2719\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2634\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2634\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2624\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2634\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2719\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2684\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2676\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2684\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2719\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2703\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2719\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hgyah9\" data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2762\">Total Additional Cost (International)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2847\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gvprwz\" data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2786\">Registration: $150</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2c8y4j\" data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2818\">Examination (2 years): $100</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6qt0aa\" data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2847\"><strong data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2847\">Total Extra Cost: $250</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"606\">This MBA program is designed for students aiming to build careers in <strong data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"253\">finance, accounting, auditing, and global financial management</strong>, with a strong alignment to the <strong data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"357\">ACCA (Association of Chartered Certified Accountants) qualification</strong>. Unlike a traditional MBA in Finance, this program integrates <strong data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"528\">professional accounting standards, global compliance frameworks, and strategic financial decision-making</strong>, making it highly relevant for both Indian and international finance careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"796\">Below is a <strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"678\">deep, structured, and strategically explained breakdown</strong> of all four semesters, including what you actually learn, how it connects to ACCA, and what it means for your career.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"801\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yb3unn\" data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"870\">Semester 1: Foundation in Business, Finance &amp; Analytical Thinking</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s1fo3\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"937\">Core Focus: Building Strong Financial &amp; Business Fundamentals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1127\">The first semester establishes a <strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1064\">solid base in economics, finance, quantitative methods, and organizational understanding</strong>, while introducing modern elements like AI and sustainability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"l0fx48\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1171\">Courses &amp; What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"2160\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1phbwbf\" data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1337\"><strong data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1197\">Business Economics</strong><br data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1200\">Develops understanding of demand, supply, pricing, and market behavior. This is critical for financial decision-making and forecasting.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18sacpo\" data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1537\"><strong data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1370\">Sustainability and Ethics</strong><br data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1373\">Focuses on ethical business practices, ESG (Environmental, Social, Governance), and sustainable financial strategies&mdash;important for modern corporate finance roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"96eogk\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1721\"><strong data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1586\">Financial Reporting and Corporate Finance</strong><br data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1589\">Introduces accounting principles, financial statements, and capital management&mdash;forming the backbone for advanced finance subjects.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i0pfg6\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1877\"><strong data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1783\">Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management</strong><br data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1786\">Helps understand organizational structure, workforce management, and leadership dynamics.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kbek2m\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"2036\"><strong data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1931\">Quantitative Techniques for Business Decisions</strong><br data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1934\">Covers statistical tools, data analysis, and decision-making models&mdash;essential for finance analytics.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i8ihtu\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2160\"><strong data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2064\">AI Skills for Future</strong><br data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2067\">Introduces AI tools and digital technologies relevant for finance automation and analytics.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2165\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2188\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2223\">This semester is crucial because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2407\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ecyu2f\" data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2294\">It builds the <strong data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2292\">conceptual base required for ACCA subjects later</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19uc33x\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2407\">Students who ignore quantitative techniques and accounting fundamentals often struggle in advanced semesters</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2412\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"59ibxt\" data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2470\">Semester 2: Core Finance + ACCA-Aligned Subjects Begin</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uekfua\" data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2535\">Core Focus: Entry into Professional Accounting &amp; Compliance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2669\">This semester marks the transition into <strong data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2605\">ACCA-integrated subjects</strong>, combining MBA learning with professional accounting standards.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2674\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"188nna1\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2713\">Courses &amp; Practical Understanding</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"3299\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sx59dw\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2814\"><strong data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2737\">Entrepreneurship</strong><br data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2740\">Teaches business creation, funding, and financial planning for startups.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fqltt1\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2922\"><strong data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2842\">Marketing Management</strong><br data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2845\">Helps finance students understand revenue generation and business strategy.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yvbby5\" data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"3067\"><strong data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2963\">Corporate and Business Law (ACCA)</strong><br data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"2966\">Covers legal frameworks, corporate governance, and compliance&mdash;critical for audit and finance roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vsvvoq\" data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3182\"><strong data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3090\">Taxation (ACCA)</strong><br data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3093\">Focuses on tax systems, planning, and compliance&mdash;highly valuable in accounting careers.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uz2a4x\" data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3299\"><strong data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3219\">Performance Management (ACCA)</strong><br data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3222\">Teaches cost control, budgeting, and organizational performance evaluation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3304\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3327\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3329\" data-end=\"3482\">This is where your profile starts becoming <strong data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3408\">professionally aligned with ACCA</strong>.<br data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3412\">Students who take these subjects seriously gain a strong advantage in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3484\" data-end=\"3567\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3z9m5m\" data-start=\"3484\" data-end=\"3504\">Accounting firms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"btl4tg\" data-start=\"3505\" data-end=\"3532\">Corporate finance roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xrtbuh\" data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3567\">Audit and compliance positions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3572\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16nwu5e\" data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3639\">Semester 3: Advanced Finance, Audit &amp; Strategic Decision-Making</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fl6q95\" data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3701\">Core Focus: Deep Financial Expertise + Audit &amp; Reporting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3839\">This semester strengthens your <strong data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3793\">technical finance knowledge and strategic understanding</strong>, making you job-ready for core finance roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3841\" data-end=\"3844\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"188nna1\" data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3883\">Courses &amp; Practical Understanding</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"4533\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1onu52d\" data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3989\"><strong data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3916\">Business Research Methods</strong><br data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"3919\">Teaches financial research, data interpretation, and report writing.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yf8y4\" data-start=\"3991\" data-end=\"4088\"><strong data-start=\"3993\" data-end=\"4018\">Operations Management</strong><br data-start=\"4018\" data-end=\"4021\">Focuses on efficiency, cost optimization, and process management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gnnkw3\" data-start=\"4090\" data-end=\"4193\"><strong data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4122\">Financial Reporting (ACCA)</strong><br data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4125\">Advanced accounting standards and financial statement preparation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vxwtn4\" data-start=\"4195\" data-end=\"4304\"><strong data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4227\">Audit and Assurance (ACCA)</strong><br data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4230\">Covers auditing processes, risk assessment, and compliance verification.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1673r1c\" data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4419\"><strong data-start=\"4308\" data-end=\"4339\">Financial Management (ACCA)</strong><br data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4342\">Focuses on investment decisions, capital structure, and financial strategy.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3yneo\" data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4533\"><strong data-start=\"4423\" data-end=\"4463\">Strategic Business Leadership (ACCA)</strong><br data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4466\">Develops leadership and strategic thinking in financial contexts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4535\" data-end=\"4538\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"4540\" data-end=\"4561\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4563\" data-end=\"4605\">This semester is highly important because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4606\" data-end=\"4759\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7uzsb9\" data-start=\"4606\" data-end=\"4675\">It defines your <strong data-start=\"4624\" data-end=\"4673\">technical expertise in finance and accounting</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u9af3j\" data-start=\"4676\" data-end=\"4759\">It directly prepares you for <strong data-start=\"4707\" data-end=\"4757\">audit, consulting, and financial analyst roles</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4761\" data-end=\"4840\">Students who master these subjects often secure better placement opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4842\" data-end=\"4845\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rqief2\" data-start=\"4847\" data-end=\"4917\">Semester 4: Advanced Financial Strategy, Markets &amp; Industry Exposure</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1st1ar6\" data-start=\"4919\" data-end=\"4978\">Core Focus: High-Level Finance + Real-World Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4980\" data-end=\"5113\">The final semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"5010\" data-end=\"5084\">advanced financial management, global markets, and strategic reporting</strong>, along with a major project.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5115\" data-end=\"5118\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"188nna1\" data-start=\"5120\" data-end=\"5157\">Courses &amp; Practical Understanding</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5159\" data-end=\"5848\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sb4wh8\" data-start=\"5159\" data-end=\"5263\"><strong data-start=\"5161\" data-end=\"5186\">Analytics for Finance</strong><br data-start=\"5186\" data-end=\"5189\">Uses data analytics tools for financial forecasting and decision-making.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tg2wsj\" data-start=\"5265\" data-end=\"5368\"><strong data-start=\"5267\" data-end=\"5288\">Financial Markets</strong><br data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5291\">Covers stock markets, investment instruments, and global financial systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nxv3po\" data-start=\"5370\" data-end=\"5489\"><strong data-start=\"5372\" data-end=\"5412\">Advanced Financial Management (ACCA)</strong><br data-start=\"5412\" data-end=\"5415\">Strategic financial planning, risk management, and investment decisions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15za469\" data-start=\"5491\" data-end=\"5604\"><strong data-start=\"5493\" data-end=\"5535\">Advanced Performance Management (ACCA)</strong><br data-start=\"5535\" data-end=\"5538\">Focuses on business performance evaluation at a strategic level.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y03ueg\" data-start=\"5606\" data-end=\"5718\"><strong data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5647\">Strategic Business Reporting (ACCA)</strong><br data-start=\"5647\" data-end=\"5650\">Advanced financial reporting aligned with international standards.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"93s2vt\" data-start=\"5720\" data-end=\"5848\"><strong data-start=\"5722\" data-end=\"5749\">Master Thesis / Project</strong><br data-start=\"5749\" data-end=\"5752\">A real-world project or research work that significantly impacts your placement opportunities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5850\" data-end=\"5853\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"5855\" data-end=\"5876\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5878\" data-end=\"5922\">Your final project plays a critical role in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5923\" data-end=\"6088\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aal4r9\" data-start=\"5923\" data-end=\"5969\">Demonstrating your <strong data-start=\"5944\" data-end=\"5967\">practical knowledge</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qtp9l3\" data-start=\"5970\" data-end=\"6025\">Strengthening your <strong data-start=\"5991\" data-end=\"6023\">resume and interview profile</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i36u61\" data-start=\"6026\" data-end=\"6088\">Improving your <strong data-start=\"6043\" data-end=\"6086\">placement outcomes and salary potential</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 300000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(287, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 259, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 00:37:56', '2026-06-16 07:03:09', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Securing your future at a NAAC A++ accredited institution like JAIN (Deemed-to-be University) is a streamlined, digital-first experience. Whether you are applying for a specialized MBA or a technical MCA, the university has engineered a four-step pathway designed for speed, transparency, and financial flexibility.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Below is a detailed breakdown of each phase of the enrollment cycle.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"5\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 1: Digital Application &amp; Profile Creation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The journey begins with the <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">Submit Application</strong> phase. Unlike traditional paper-based systems, this is a fully digital portal where you provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Personal Identification:</strong> Standard KYC details to establish your student record.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Educational History:</strong> Uploading transcripts from your (10+2) or Bachelor&rsquo;s degree to verify the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"95\">50% aggregate eligibility</strong> (45% for reserved categories).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Selection:</strong> Choosing your specific track (e.g., MBA in FinTech, MCA in Cloud Computing).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Tip:</strong> Ensure all documents are scanned in high resolution to avoid \"RFI\" (Request for Information) delays during the verification stage.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 2: Program Enrollment &amp; Verification</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Once your initial application is processed, you move to the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">Enroll in Your Program</strong> stage. This is the \"Verification Gate\" where the university\'s admission office reviews your credentials against the program\'s statutory requirements.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Validation:</strong> The university verifies your marks and university recognition.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Selection Confirmation:</strong> You will receive a formal notification to proceed if you meet the prerequisites.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Alignment:</strong> For programs like MCA, this is where your background in Mathematics is checked to determine if you require a <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"126\">Bridge Course</strong> in Semester 1.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 3: Flexible Financial Planning (Payment)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">JAIN University offers one of the most versatile fee payment structures in the online education sector, designed to accommodate diverse financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Option A: One-Time Payment (The ROI Booster)</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Benefit:</strong> By paying the full program fee upfront (e.g., ₹175,000 for certain MBA tracks), students receive a <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"112\">15% discount</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Advantage:</strong> This significantly lowers the \"Cost of Acquisition\" for your degree, maximizing your eventual Return on Investment (ROI).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Option B: Education Loan / 0% Interest EMI</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accessibility:</strong> For students who prefer liquidity, JAIN partners with leading financial institutions to offer <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">0% interest EMI</strong> options.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Flexibility:</strong> You can pay in manageable monthly installments without the burden of accumulating interest, making premium education affordable on a standard monthly salary.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Phase 4: Admission Finalization &amp; Seat Securing</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">The final step, <strong data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">Secure Your Seat</strong>, is triggered the moment the financial transaction is successful or the loan is sanctioned.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"23\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Confirmation Receipt:</strong> You will receive an official admission letter and a permanent student ID.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LMS Access:</strong> Securing your seat grants you immediate access to the <strong data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"66\">Learning Management System (LMS)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Immediate Benefits:</strong> You can begin your <strong data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">LinkedIn Learning</strong> certifications (part of the 33+ certifications offered) and explore Semester 1 modules even before the formal session commences.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Securing admission into a premier NAAC A++ accredited institution like JAIN (Deemed-to-be University) requires a clear understanding of the academic prerequisites. Whether you are aiming for a postgraduate leadership role via an MBA or a technical career through an MCA, the university maintains transparent standards to ensure student success.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Postgraduate (PG) Programs: MBA &amp; MCA</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The eligibility for PG programs is designed to identify candidates with a strong foundational knowledge base and the capacity for advanced analytical study.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Master of Business Administration (MBA)</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_98928c13418f4e3c-58\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-70\">Academic Qualification:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-70 citation-end-70\"> Candidates must have successfully completed a three-year Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree program in any stream from a UGC-recognized university.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from Learning Routes. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahcKEwim7aGx86OUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQUw\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_98928c13418f4e3c-59\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-69\">Minimum Marks:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-69\"> A minimum aggregate of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"38\"><span class=\"citation-69\">50% marks</span></strong><span class=\"citation-69 citation-end-69\"> (or an equivalent letter/numerical grade) in the qualifying examination.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from Learning Routes. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahcKEwim7aGx86OUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQVA\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_98928c13418f4e3c-60\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-68\">Reserved Categories:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-68\"> A relaxation of 5% is provided; candidates from </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"69\"><span class=\"citation-68\">SC/ST categories require 45% aggregate</span></strong><span class=\"citation-68 citation-end-68\">.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from JAIN Online. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahcKEwim7aGx86OUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQVQ\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_98928c13418f4e3c-61\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-67\">Final Year Students:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-67 citation-end-67\"> If you are in your final semester of graduation, you are eligible to apply, provided you meet the requirements upon completion.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from Learning Routes. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahcKEwim7aGx86OUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQVg\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Master of Computer Applications (MCA)</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_98928c13418f4e3c-62\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-66\">Academic Qualification:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-66 citation-end-66\"> A 3-year Undergraduate degree (Level 5.5) from a recognized university.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from JAIN Online. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahcKEwim7aGx86OUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQVw\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Subject Prerequisite:</strong> Preference is given to candidates with <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">Mathematics</strong> at the 10+2 level or during Graduation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bridge Course:</strong> Candidates coming from a non-mathematics or non-technical background are required to undergo a compulsory <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"121\">Bridge Course</strong> to align their skills with the technical curriculum.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_98928c13418f4e3c-63\" data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-65\">Minimum Marks:</span></strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"15\"><span class=\"citation-65\">50% aggregate</span></strong><span class=\"citation-65\"> for General category and </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\"><span class=\"citation-65\">45% for SC/ST candidates</span></strong><span class=\"citation-65 citation-end-65\">.<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from JAIN Online. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahcKEwim7aGx86OUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQWA\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. <span class=\"citation-64\">Undergraduate (UG) Programs: BBA, B.Com &amp; BCA</span></strong><span class=\"citation-64 citation-end-64\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">JAIN University&rsquo;s undergraduate programs act as the first step toward professional excellence, focusing on students who have completed their higher secondary education.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Program</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Academic Requirement</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Minimum Aggregate</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Subject Preferences</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">BBA</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\">Pass in (10+2) / Pre-University</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,2,0\">50%</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,3,0\">Open to all streams (Arts/Science/Commerce).</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">B.Com</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,0\">Pass in (10+2) / Pre-University</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,2,0\">50%</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,3,0\">Commerce background is preferred but not mandatory.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">BCA</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3,1,0\">Pass in (10+2) / Pre-University</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3,2,0\">50%</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,3,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mathematics or Computer Science</strong> is typically required.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Global &amp; International Eligibility</strong></h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_98928c13418f4e3c-64\" data-path-to-node=\"17\"><span class=\"citation-63 citation-end-63\">As an authorized partner for the \"Study in India\" program, JAIN University accommodates international learners with specific verification processes:<sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button class=\"button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"View source details for citation from JAIN Online. Opens side panel.\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahcKEwim7aGx86OUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQXA\"><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----></div>\r\n<p><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Certification Equivalence:</strong> International students must provide an equivalence certificate from the Association of Indian Universities (AIU) if their schooling/graduation was completed outside India.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Documentation:</strong> Mandatory submission of valid Passport copies and transcripts translated into English (if applicable).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Navigating the financial commitment of a professional degree is a critical step in your career roadmap. <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"104\">JAIN (Deemed-to-be University)</strong>, an institution recognized with a <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"169\">NAAC A++ grade</strong>, offers a transparent and flexible fee model for its Online Master of Computer Applications (MCA) program. This guide provides a deep-dive into the ₹160,000 investment, explaining the payment schedules, EMI availability, and specific additional costs based on your geographic location.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Comprehensive Breakdown of Online MCA Tuition Fees</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The total tuition investment for the Online MCA program is set at <strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"66\">₹160,000</strong>. To ensure financial inclusivity, JAIN University provides three distinct pathways for payment, allowing students to choose a plan that best fits their liquidity and financial planning.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\">1. Payment Flexibility Options</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Students can opt for a \"One-Time\" payment to clear the academic dues upfront or utilize installment-based structures:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Payment</strong>: <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"18\">₹160,000</strong> (Full program cost paid at admission).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Yearly Installment</strong>: <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"20\">₹80,000 per year</strong> (Divided into two equal annual payments).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester-Wise Installment</strong>: <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"27\">₹40,000 per semester</strong> (Spread across the four semesters of the program).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\">2. EMI and Financing Solutions</h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Recognizing the need for manageable monthly outflows, JAIN University offers <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) options</strong>. This enables students to break down the semester or yearly fee into smaller monthly payments, often through university-partnered financial institutions. This is particularly beneficial for working professionals who wish to fund their education through their monthly salary without depleting their savings.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Additional Administrative &amp; Global Fees</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">Beyond the base tuition, there are mandatory administrative charges. These are categorized based on the student\'s residency status to accommodate global learners.</p>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">For Students in India</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Registration Fee</strong>: ₹2,500 (Payable at the time of admission).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong>: ₹3,000 per year (Covers the cost of digital assessments and university processing).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">For SAARC Country Students</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong>: ₹11,250 (One-time).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong>: ₹3,750 per year.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"19\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">For International Students (Non-SAARC)</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">One-Time Registration Fee</strong>: $150.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong>: $50 per year.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p id=\"p-rc_41ae5e5f021b488f-28\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\">Navigating the intersection of financial services and advanced computing requires a curriculum that is both technologically rigorous and industry-aligned. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-35\">JAIN (Deemed-to-be University), a premier NAAC A++ accredited institution with a legacy dating back to its 1990 foundation</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\"><span class=\"citation-35 citation-end-35\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4\">, offers a specialized Master of Computer Applications (MCA) in FinTech designed to bridge the gap between traditional software engineering and the evolving digital finance ecosystem. This guide provides a deep-dive into the four-semester journey, highlighting the core competencies, practical skill acquisition, and global certifications that define the program.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Semester 1: The Foundation of Computing and AI</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The first semester is architected to establish a high-authority baseline in computer science while introducing the \"AI-first\" mindset that characterizes JAIN&rsquo;s modern pedagogy.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (7 Subjects):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mathematical Foundations for Computer Science</strong>: Critical for algorithmic logic and cryptographic structures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Computing Concepts and Problem Solving using C</strong>: The structural bedrock of programming.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operating Systems &amp; Data Structures</strong>: Essential for understanding system-level architecture and data efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41ae5e5f021b488f-29\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-34\">AI Skills for Future</span></strong><span class=\"citation-34\">: A strategic introductory module ensuring students are proficient in modern technological tools from day one</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-34 citation-end-34\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (14 Key Skills):</strong> Students transition from theoretical knowledge to practical application, mastering <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">Mathematical Modeling</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"141\">Discrete Mathematics</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"167\">System Architecture</strong>. Early focus on <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"203\">Memory Management</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"225\">Modular Programming</strong> ensures a robust development foundation.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn Learning Global Certifications (10 Suggested):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\">C Essential Training</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\">Programming Foundations: Data Structures</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\">Artificial Intelligence Foundations: Thinking Machines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\">Learning Discrete Mathematics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Semester 2: Full-Stack Development and Cloud Architecture</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">In Semester 2, the curriculum shifts toward scalable applications and cloud-native development, focusing on the tools required for modern enterprise IT.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (7 Subjects):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Advanced Database Systems</strong>: Mastery of complex data environments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Java Programming &amp; Web Technologies</strong>: Developing the \"Full Stack\" capability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cloud Computing Foundations</strong>: Understanding the infrastructure behind digital finance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">ESG in IT</strong>: Integrating Environmental, Social, and Governance principles into technology management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (15 Key Skills):</strong> The skill set expands into <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">Spring Framework</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">RESTful APIs</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"94\">Microservices</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"113\">DevOps</strong>. Hands-on training in <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"142\">Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"180\">Application Security</strong> prepares students for the rigorous security requirements of the finance sector.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn Learning Global Certifications (10 Suggested):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\">Java Essential Training</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\">AWS Essential Training for Developers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\">SQL Essential Training</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\">Cloud Computing Foundations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"21\">Semester 3: Artificial Intelligence and the FinTech Ecosystem</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">This phase represents a deep topical pivot into the core of FinTech, blending data science with financial market intelligence.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (6 Subjects):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"24\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</strong>: Deep-dive into predictive modeling.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Python Programming</strong>: The primary language for data science and AI development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Finance and FinTech Ecosystem</strong>: Understanding the landscape of neobanks, digital payments, and lending tech.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41ae5e5f021b488f-30\" data-path-to-node=\"24,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"24,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"24,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-33\">Open Elective</span></strong><span class=\"citation-33\">: Allows students to customize their learning path based on specific career goals</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-33 citation-end-33\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"25\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (15 Key Skills):</strong> Focus moves toward <strong data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">Deep Learning Fundamentals</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">Financial Data Analysis</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">Supervised &amp; Unsupervised Learning</strong>. Students learn <strong data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"162\">Statistical Analysis</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"187\">Feature Engineering</strong> specifically tailored for financial datasets.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"26\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn Learning Global Certifications (12 Suggested):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"27\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,0,0\">FinTech Foundations and Overview</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,1,0\">Machine Learning with Python: Foundations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,2,0\">Financial Modeling Foundations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,3,0\">Python for Data Science and Machine Learning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"28\">\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"29\">Semester 4: Advanced Technologies and Strategic Leadership</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\">The final semester focuses on \"bleeding-edge\" technologies like Blockchain and Generative AI, culminating in a major industry-aligned project.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"31\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Courses (6 Subjects):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"32\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"32,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"32,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Analytics using AI</strong>: Applying predictive models to market trends.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"32,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"32,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Blockchain and Decentralized Finance (DeFi)</strong>: Mastering the tech behind smart contracts and cryptocurrencies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"32,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"32,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Generative AI for FinTech Development</strong>: Leveraging LLMs for financial text analysis and customer service automation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"32,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"32,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Leadership in IT</strong>: Preparing students for management roles in technical environments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"33\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"33\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Acquisition (13 Key Skills):</strong> Specialization in <strong data-path-to-node=\"33\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">Algorithmic Trading</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"33\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Smart Contracts</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"33\" data-index-in-node=\"91\">Cybersecurity in Financial Systems</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"33\" data-index-in-node=\"131\">AI Governance</strong>. Students attain proficiency in <strong data-path-to-node=\"33\" data-index-in-node=\"177\">NLP for Financial Text Analysis</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"33\" data-index-in-node=\"213\">Credit Risk Assessment Models</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"34\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"34\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">LinkedIn Learning Global Certifications (12 Suggested):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"35\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"35,0,0\">Blockchain Basics &amp; Beyond the Basics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"35,1,0\">Generative AI for Software Developers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"35,2,0\">Cybersecurity Foundations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"35,3,0\">Risk Management Foundations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(288, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 260, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 00:49:33', '2026-06-16 07:03:33', '<p data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"704\">The MCA admission process is designed to be <strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"520\">simple, structured, and fully online</strong>, ensuring students can complete enrollment without confusion. However, each step plays a critical role in determining your final admission status, fee benefits, and seat confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"758\">This process is not just formal&mdash;it directly impacts:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2noy8\" data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"798\">Your <strong data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"796\">program selection accuracy</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h2rf0o\" data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"860\">Your <strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"858\">financial planning (discounts &amp; EMI eligibility)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13solfy\" data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"900\">Your <strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"898\">seat confirmation timeline</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1pgmr9s\" data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"943\">Step-by-Step MCA Admission Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qdghf6\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"974\">STEP 1: Submit Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1044\">The first stage begins with filling out the online application form.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cwdw33\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1070\">What You Need to Do:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1271\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b4zpm2\" data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1122\">Enter personal details (name, contact, address)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a1ivm9\" data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1199\">Provide academic qualifications (10+2, graduation details if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lycgf\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1237\">Select your preferred MCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rduacw\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1271\">Submit the application online</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1291\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1467\">This step is often underestimated, but it is <strong data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1389\">your official entry into the admission pipeline</strong>. Any incorrect detail can delay verification or even lead to rejection later.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1487\">⚠️ Common Mistake:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hqp3wn\" data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1554\">Students rush this step and enter incorrect marks or documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wuguhn\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1607\">This causes verification failure in later stages</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1612\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2oga3v\" data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1647\">STEP 2: Enroll in Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1721\">Once your application is submitted, the next step is program enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nshoil\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1745\">What Happens Here:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9hsea2\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1804\">You select your final MCA specialization/program track</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hg1tby\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1841\">You verify all submitted details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3nsi4j\" data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1888\">You confirm your program choice officially</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1920\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1970\">This is the <strong data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1957\">decision-lock stage</strong>. After this:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2097\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kcv9cb\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2011\">Your program selection becomes fixed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15dmx\" data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2059\">Changes may not be allowed without approval</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10n6ngx\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2097\">Your fee structure gets finalized</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2120\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2140\">Before confirming:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2289\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a9zs3w\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2178\">Compare specializations carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r97t6s\" data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2249\">Understand career outcomes (AI, Cyber Security, Development, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f13yr9\" data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2289\">Avoid choosing based on trend alone</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2294\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b6yujx\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2323\">STEP 3: Complete Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2385\">After enrollment confirmation, you proceed with fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"39wqun\" data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2417\">Payment Options Available:</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2443\">1. One-Time Payment</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2509\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nw7ojp\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2476\">Pay full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o28yfp\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2509\">Get <strong data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2507\">15% discount benefit</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2537\">Strategic Advantage:</h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2649\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"80p9ua\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2573\">Lowest overall financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wmat7q\" data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2602\">No future payment stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8nwadj\" data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2649\">Best for students with financial stability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2654\">\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2691\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2783\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5mzfby\" data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2728\">Pay through monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k4k3a2\" data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2783\"><strong data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2781\">0% interest EMI available (as per eligibility)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2804\">Key Benefits:</h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12tnm4d\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2842\">No heavy upfront payment required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"akrylx\" data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"2872\">Easier financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"162zepx\" data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2921\">Accessible for students from all backgrounds</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2947\">Important Warning:</h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"3058\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11vhvon\" data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2999\">Always check loan tenure and processing charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uoswk6\" data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3058\">Long EMI periods may affect total repayment discipline</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3063\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3083\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3144\">Choosing between one-time payment and EMI should depend on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3218\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17jtnfo\" data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3168\">Financial stability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xm6dim\" data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3190\">Career confidence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2x3few\" data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3218\">Family income structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3306\">Do not choose EMI just for convenience&mdash;choose it based on <strong data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3305\">long-term affordability</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3311\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8oixmk\" data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3340\">STEP 4: Secure Your Seat</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3342\" data-end=\"3411\">This is the final and most important stage of admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mz6gtj\" data-start=\"3413\" data-end=\"3430\">What Happens:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3596\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jasfbi\" data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3474\">Payment is verified OR loan is approved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkwzx8\" data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3512\">Admission is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bp7kel\" data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3553\">Seat is allocated in the MCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bep21u\" data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3596\">You receive confirmation of enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"az31sb\" data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3623\">Outcome of This Step:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3748\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gdasug\" data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3659\">You become a registered student</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"voqaop\" data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3702\">Access to academic resources may begin</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uujss6\" data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3748\">Orientation and onboarding process starts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3753\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rhyztk\" data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3788\">Complete Admission Flow Summary</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"4072\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3817\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3817\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3806\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Action</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"3817\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"4072\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3905\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3855\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3855\" data-end=\"3876\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit Application</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3876\" data-end=\"3905\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Initial eligibility entry</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3906\" data-end=\"3963\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3906\" data-end=\"3915\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3936\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Enrollment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"3963\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final program selection</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3964\" data-end=\"4014\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3964\" data-end=\"3973\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3973\" data-end=\"3994\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Completion</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4014\">Fee confirmation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4072\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4024\" data-end=\"4044\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Seat Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4044\" data-end=\"4072\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final admission approval</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"708\">The eligibility criteria for MCA (Master of Computer Applications) is designed to ensure that students entering the program have the <strong data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"639\">right academic foundation and analytical ability</strong> required for advanced computing, programming, and IT specialization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"940\">The eligibility primarily depends on the <strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"796\">level of the program you are applying for</strong>, as MCA is a postgraduate degree. However, institutions may also define pathways for students based on their <strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"939\">10+2 or graduation background</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"945\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15oy5s2\" data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"975\">Basic Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1052\">To apply for MCA, candidates must meet the following academic requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15nla4j\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1128\">A <strong data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1079\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> from a recognized university in any discipline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"386a60\" data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1230\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1183\">minimum 50% aggregate marks</strong> (45% for reserved categories, if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12dq154\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1341\">Students must have studied <strong data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1275\">Mathematics</strong> either at:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmloe3\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1318\">Class 12 level (10+2), or</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17h0qfa\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1341\">Graduation level</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lyol6d\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1375\">Important Inclusion Criteria</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1593\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ealr5\" data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1459\">Students <strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1430\">appearing for final year of graduation</strong> are also eligible to apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"suf5sk\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1593\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1525\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are eligible, provided their qualification meets university norms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1598\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gche1p\" data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1654\">Alternative Entry Understanding (10+2 vs Graduation)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1773\">The mention of &ldquo;10+2 or Bachelor&rsquo;s degree depending on program&rdquo; can often confuse students. Here&rsquo;s a clear breakdown:</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kjcbgu\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1815\">For Undergraduate Programs (like BCA)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1953\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tvbl17\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1864\">Eligibility is based on <strong data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1862\">10+2 (Class 12)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"127yam8\" data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1917\">Students <strong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1902\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are eligible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yi0n3f\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1953\">NIOS students are also eligible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rnk215\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1988\">For MCA (Postgraduate Program)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2103\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10j2cab\" data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2048\">Eligibility is strictly based on <strong data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2046\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"an1mr5\" data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2103\">10+2 alone is <strong data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2083\">not sufficient</strong> for MCA admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"123vz07\" data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2120\">Key Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2150\">If you are planning for MCA:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2264\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bwvu9l\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2208\">Your <strong data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2206\">graduation background matters more than 10+2</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7wqbet\" data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2264\">However, having Mathematics at any stage is crucial</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2269\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xtipjk\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2303\">Subject Requirements Explained</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1glzb6s\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2335\">Why Mathematics is Required</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2386\">Mathematics plays a critical role in MCA because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2560\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h5x3m2\" data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2450\">It builds <strong data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2448\">logical thinking and problem-solving ability</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bjyu34\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2560\">It is essential for:\r\n<ul data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2560\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pmqvf5\" data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2491\">Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mo16ta\" data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2513\">Data structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16208l0\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2530\">Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajo29n\" data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2560\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a1hl89\" data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2601\">What If You Don&rsquo;t Have Mathematics?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2631\">Some universities may offer:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2667\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xzcgsq\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2667\"><strong data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2667\">Bridge Courses in Mathematics</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2689\">These help students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2767\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x2lsy0\" data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2725\">Catch up with required concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16rsfuk\" data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2767\">Become eligible without losing a year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2850\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2794\">Important Warning:</strong><br data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2797\">Skipping math fundamentals can lead to difficulty in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2901\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bdqeao\" data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2861\">Coding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16208l0\" data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2876\">Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jqmch\" data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2901\">Technical interviews</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2906\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ux6rxl\" data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2935\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"3085\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2974\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2974\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2948\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2974\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks Required</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3085\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3047\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3030\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3047\">50% aggregate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3085\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3068\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reserved Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3085\">45% aggregate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3108\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3123\">Higher marks:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3210\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ol9r4d\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3167\">Improve chances in <strong data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3165\">top universities</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181s1wj\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3210\">Help during <strong data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3208\">placement shortlisting</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3215\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q9yv3r\" data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3258\">Eligibility for Different Student Types</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ffb9p2\" data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3301\">Students from Non-Technical Background</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3444\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hhzfhs\" data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3348\">Eligible if they meet graduation criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sebu40\" data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3444\">Must be ready to:\r\n<ul data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3444\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y5wk4v\" data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3405\">Learn programming from scratch</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5wxflx\" data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3444\">Work harder in initial semesters</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tu9w1o\" data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3470\">Working Professionals</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3624\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vja1ug\" data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3523\">Eligible if they hold a valid bachelor&rsquo;s degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"by8a8\" data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3624\">Can pursue MCA to:\r\n<ul data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3624\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n1rey2\" data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3573\">Switch careers into IT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16sewzo\" data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3624\">Upskill in AI, development, or cybersecurity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bkpizg\" data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3644\">Diploma Holders</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3739\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i4vifb\" data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3693\">Must first complete a <strong data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3691\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l1q54a\" data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3739\">Direct MCA entry is generally not allowed</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"617\">The total fee for the MCA program is designed to be <strong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"541\">affordable, flexible, and student-friendly</strong>, allowing multiple payment options without increasing the financial burden.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"754\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jmjgkc\" data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"655\"><strong data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"643\">Total Program Fee:</strong> ₹1,60,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3ha41\" data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"713\"><strong data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"679\">Program Duration:</strong> Typically 2 years (4 semesters)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gin9la\" data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"754\"><strong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"754\">Flexible Payment Options Available</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"968\">Unlike many institutions that increase total cost through installment premiums, this structure ensures that <strong data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"929\">students pay the same total amount regardless of payment mode</strong>, which is a major financial advantage.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"973\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1i09g45\" data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1011\">MCA Fee Structure (Detailed Table)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1326\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1071\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1071\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1028\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1041\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fees</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1058\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payable Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1071\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Frequency</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1326\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1151\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1163\">₹1,60,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1175\">₹1,60,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1191\">Full upfront</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1209\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1221\">₹1,60,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1240\">₹80,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1251\">2 years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1326\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1276\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-wise Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1288\">₹1,60,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1311\">₹40,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1326\">4 semesters</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1331\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"dfxu5l\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1387\">Payment Options Explained (Strategic Decision Guide)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u17aw3\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1408\">One-Time Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1478\">Paying the full ₹1,60,000 upfront is ideal for students who want to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16cxiig\" data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1513\">Avoid payment tracking stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3q1kx\" data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1545\">Simplify financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137oksg\" data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1602\">Sometimes unlock early payment benefits (if offered)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sd8dce\" data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1624\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1752\">If you already have funds available, this is the <strong data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1707\">lowest mental overhead option</strong>, but ensure you keep emergency funds intact.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1757\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xxixd1\" data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1776\">Yearly Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1798\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1anqqfh\" data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1798\">₹80,000 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1829\">Best suited for students who:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1952\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ml89z\" data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1864\">Have partial financial support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jfa7i0\" data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1894\">Want moderate flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"166q69l\" data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1952\">Prefer structured payments without frequent deadlines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18zeyg7\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1976\">Hidden Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2068\">Balances affordability and discipline&mdash;<strong data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2067\">less frequent payments compared to semester mode</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2073\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"s9e1h0\" data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2099\">Semester-wise Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2125\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12mttfk\" data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2125\">₹40,000 per semester</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2150\">Ideal for students who:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2259\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11z3n9t\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2179\">Want maximum flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j06lua\" data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2219\">Are managing finances independently</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c4fayg\" data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2259\">Prefer smaller, manageable payments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8ypr0w\" data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2281\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2359\">While flexible, this requires <strong data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2358\">strict financial discipline every 6 months</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2364\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18fztsd\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2390\">EMI Options Available</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2491\">EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) options make the program accessible to a wider range of students.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k49m0a\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2512\">Benefits of EMI</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2638\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ieat5n\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2551\">No need for large upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lvcttt\" data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2580\">Easier monthly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"orc9vg\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2638\">Enables students to invest in education without delay</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jy74ob\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2662\">Critical Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2683\">Before choosing EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2798\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xg8y6k\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2732\">Check <strong data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2730\">interest rates and processing fees</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1een6mc\" data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2798\">Avoid long tenure EMIs that increase total cost significantly</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2803\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ofqfdg\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2850\">Additional Fees (Important &ndash; Often Ignored)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2980\">Many students focus only on tuition fees and ignore additional charges, which can lead to <strong data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2979\">unexpected financial stress later</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7lpn1d\" data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3004\">For Indian Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3080\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"101tavf\" data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3043\">One-Time Registration Fee: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ein341\" data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3080\">Examination Fee: ₹3,000 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6hwxo\" data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3115\">Total Additional Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3173\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14y7w2z\" data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3173\">₹2,500 + ₹6,000 (for 2 years) = <strong data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3173\">₹8,500 total extra</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3178\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j9gx8m\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3201\">For SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3269\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"linrs7\" data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3232\">Registration Fee: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b8eg6b\" data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3269\">Examination Fee: ₹3,750 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c4o446\" data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3296\">Total Additional Cost</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3342\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ldxoe5\" data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3342\">₹11,250 + ₹7,500 = <strong data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3342\">₹18,750 total extra</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3347\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3378\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3451\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h11jxk\" data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3417\">Registration Fee: $150 (one-time)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16pkt12\" data-start=\"3418\" data-end=\"3451\">Examination Fee: $50 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c4o446\" data-start=\"3453\" data-end=\"3478\">Total Additional Cost</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3516\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qpvxf4\" data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3516\">$150 + $100 = <strong data-start=\"3496\" data-end=\"3516\">$250 total extra</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3521\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"692nbz\" data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3571\">Total MCA Cost Calculation (Real Cost Insight)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3735\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3598\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3598\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3584\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3584\" data-end=\"3598\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Cost</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3735\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3653\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3640\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3653\">₹1,60,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3690\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3680\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fees (India)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3690\">₹8,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"3735\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"3718\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3717\">Total Estimated Cost</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3735\"><strong data-start=\"3720\" data-end=\"3733\">₹1,68,500</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"883\">The BCA in AI &amp; Cyber Security is strategically designed to build a <strong data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"578\">strong computing foundation</strong>, followed by <strong data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"631\">enterprise-level development skills</strong>, and finally <strong data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"691\">advanced AI-driven cyber defense expertise</strong>. Unlike traditional BCA programs, this curriculum integrates <strong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"830\">Artificial Intelligence, Cybersecurity, Cloud, and Full Stack Development</strong>, ensuring graduates are industry-ready from day one.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"954\">A key advantage of this program is its <strong data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"953\">layered learning approach</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1116\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1idsu0k\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1009\"><strong data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"968\">Year 1:</strong> Core programming + system fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ke6i6m\" data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1066\"><strong data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1023\">Year 2:</strong> Development + cloud + enterprise systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fh6mxn\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1116\"><strong data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1080\">Year 3:</strong> AI + cybersecurity specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1282\">This progression reduces one of the biggest risks students face&mdash;<strong data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1235\">learning tools without understanding fundamentals</strong>, which often leads to weak placement outcomes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gnedbw\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1342\">Semester 1: Core Computing &amp; Programming Foundation</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1362\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1475\">The first semester focuses on building the <strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1441\">logical and technical backbone</strong> required for all advanced topics.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1700\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"puxsj6\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1526\">Mathematical Foundations for Computer Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nprf48\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1577\">Computing Concepts and Problem Solving using C</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fbi6bn\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1599\">Operating Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2ewta\" data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1619\">Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u9xyq7\" data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1651\">Problem Solving using C Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fbf0sx\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1675\">Data Structures Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1700\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aw108j\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1744\">What You Actually Learn (Deep Insight)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1890\">This semester is not just theoretical&mdash;it directly shapes your <strong data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1835\">problem-solving ability</strong>, which is the most critical skill recruiters evaluate.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"2208\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10wt7bh\" data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1968\"><strong data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1927\">Mathematics + Discrete Logic:</strong> Helps in algorithm design and AI later</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3owtnf\" data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2051\"><strong data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1989\">C Programming:</strong> Builds memory-level understanding (unlike Python beginners)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gatwt6\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2123\"><strong data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2076\">Operating Systems:</strong> Teaches how systems actually work internally</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c9v2le\" data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2208\"><strong data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2146\">Data Structures:</strong> The backbone of coding interviews and real-world efficiency</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2364\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2232\">Common Mistake:</strong><br data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2235\">Students often ignore C and Data Structures thinking they&rsquo;ll &ldquo;learn later.&rdquo; This leads to <strong data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2363\">placement failure in coding rounds</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2369\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14cre69\" data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2389\">Skills Attained</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2802\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0rtsk\" data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2422\">Core Computing Competencies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vfhh2o\" data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2446\">Analytical Thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zbjk0o\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2473\">Computational Thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1y49x\" data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2502\">Programming Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51g7ul\" data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2534\">Software Development Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"it2az9\" data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2555\">Algorithm Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2ewta\" data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2575\">Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17t5lps\" data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2606\">Operating Systems Concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4bnhfp\" data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2626\">Problem Solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5kijw7\" data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2658\">Software Engineering Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sgewnh\" data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2684\">Mathematical Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17hz4o7\" data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2709\">Discrete Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1awdg9h\" data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2732\">Algorithm Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ffk9p\" data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2756\">Modular Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s0zyy\" data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2778\">Memory Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p7y63c\" data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2802\">System Architecture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"smltqd\" data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2823\">Strategic Value</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2854\">These skills directly impact:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2958\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19gd45m\" data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2883\">Coding interview success</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ssbxs\" data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2908\">Internship readiness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w4rgwc\" data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2958\">Ability to learn advanced technologies faster</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"2963\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1v3btiz\" data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"2994\">Recommended Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3339\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"104kjvr\" data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3037\">Programming Foundations: Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rh0lth\" data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3062\">C Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l73on9\" data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3107\">Programming Foundations: Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10z2mg8\" data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3140\">Operating System Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lxm3ir\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3174\">Learning Discrete Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rryhh9\" data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3216\">Python Data Structures and Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n14rxt\" data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3267\">AI Foundations (Thinking Machines &amp; ML Basics)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1co00im\" data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3299\">Computer Science Principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14uqrz\" data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3339\">Programming Foundations: Algorithms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1my1m11\" data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3355\">Expert Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3483\">Do at least <strong data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3417\">2&ndash;3 certifications seriously (project-based)</strong> instead of rushing through all. Depth matters more than quantity.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3488\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ir4yf2\" data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3534\">Semester 2: Development, Databases &amp; Cloud</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3554\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3732\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fa2wed\" data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3585\">Advanced Database Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efpi4t\" data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3606\">Java Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkem60\" data-start=\"3607\" data-end=\"3627\">Web Technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"td1sk1\" data-start=\"3628\" data-end=\"3659\">Cloud Computing Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f4yrgq\" data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3693\">Advanced Database Systems Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u98j5u\" data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3718\">Java Programming Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10c2dgj\" data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3732\">ESG in IT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3761\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3763\" data-end=\"3831\">This semester transitions you from <strong data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3830\">basic programmer &rarr; developer</strong>.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"4076\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1db7ilq\" data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3890\"><strong data-start=\"3835\" data-end=\"3850\">Java + OOP:</strong> Industry-standard backend development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sz3rkw\" data-start=\"3891\" data-end=\"3957\"><strong data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3913\">Databases (SQL):</strong> Core requirement in almost every tech job</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q4n2lm\" data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"4009\"><strong data-start=\"3960\" data-end=\"3981\">Web Technologies:</strong> Frontend + backend basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zctmd6\" data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4076\"><strong data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4032\">Cloud Computing:</strong> Introduction to AWS/modern infrastructure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4194\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"4081\" data-end=\"4097\">Hidden Risk:</strong><br data-start=\"4097\" data-end=\"4100\">Students often learn syntax but ignore <strong data-start=\"4139\" data-end=\"4159\">project building</strong>, which results in weak portfolios.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4196\" data-end=\"4199\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14cre69\" data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4219\">Skills Attained</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4570\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"adibxj\" data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4241\">Java Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mt9tpo\" data-start=\"4242\" data-end=\"4269\">Spring Framework Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j90r3q\" data-start=\"4270\" data-end=\"4299\">SQL &amp; Database Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"urtsj\" data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4324\">REST API Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xfc8di\" data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4351\">Full Stack Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p7ia97\" data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4371\">Web Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sy0smn\" data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4395\">Git Version Control</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o2wair\" data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4427\">Object-Oriented Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bf5lrp\" data-start=\"4428\" data-end=\"4452\">Microservices Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5ferl0\" data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4477\">Application Security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4idvj3\" data-start=\"4478\" data-end=\"4497\">Database Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ly71mx\" data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4517\">Cloud Computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y16lcq\" data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4535\">DevOps Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m8qh13\" data-start=\"4536\" data-end=\"4553\">Data Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"22v7yw\" data-start=\"4554\" data-end=\"4570\">Unit Testing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"smltqd\" data-start=\"4572\" data-end=\"4591\">Strategic Value</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4593\" data-end=\"4633\">These skills directly map to roles like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4634\" data-end=\"4703\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p5b4hd\" data-start=\"4634\" data-end=\"4656\">Software Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6uy04a\" data-start=\"4657\" data-end=\"4678\">Backend Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y7icv7\" data-start=\"4679\" data-end=\"4703\">Full Stack Developer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4705\" data-end=\"4708\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1v3btiz\" data-start=\"4710\" data-end=\"4739\">Recommended Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4741\" data-end=\"4940\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19momne\" data-start=\"4741\" data-end=\"4768\">Java Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6fzfc0\" data-start=\"4769\" data-end=\"4789\">Learning Java 11</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17yt9j4\" data-start=\"4790\" data-end=\"4820\">HTML &amp; JavaScript Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"td1sk1\" data-start=\"4821\" data-end=\"4852\">Cloud Computing Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kbqbwb\" data-start=\"4853\" data-end=\"4879\">AWS Developer Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"emss6m\" data-start=\"4880\" data-end=\"4913\">Database &amp; SQL Certifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"szbzba\" data-start=\"4914\" data-end=\"4940\">Java Memory Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"4942\" data-end=\"4960\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4962\" data-end=\"4980\">Focus on building:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4981\" data-end=\"5060\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p2olbe\" data-start=\"4981\" data-end=\"5021\"><strong data-start=\"4983\" data-end=\"5019\">1 full-stack project (mandatory)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sg04m0\" data-start=\"5022\" data-end=\"5060\"><strong data-start=\"5024\" data-end=\"5060\">1 cloud-based deployment project</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5062\" data-end=\"5112\">This significantly improves placement probability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5114\" data-end=\"5117\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ya8mtp\" data-start=\"5119\" data-end=\"5174\">Semester 3: AI &amp; Cyber Security Specialization Begins</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"5176\" data-end=\"5194\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5196\" data-end=\"5355\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r6w9b5\" data-start=\"5196\" data-end=\"5244\">Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dq3gv9\" data-start=\"5245\" data-end=\"5267\">Python Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d9v31e\" data-start=\"5268\" data-end=\"5306\">Cyber Threat Intelligence using AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2u11k\" data-start=\"5307\" data-end=\"5322\">AI &amp; ML Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k4l0xf\" data-start=\"5323\" data-end=\"5337\">Python Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqmzod\" data-start=\"5338\" data-end=\"5355\">Open Elective</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"5357\" data-end=\"5384\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5386\" data-end=\"5472\">This is where specialization begins and differentiates you from a regular BCA student.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5474\" data-end=\"5654\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ojw0h\" data-start=\"5474\" data-end=\"5534\"><strong data-start=\"5476\" data-end=\"5495\">AI &amp; ML Models:</strong> Core concepts of intelligent systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ewr0f\" data-start=\"5535\" data-end=\"5589\"><strong data-start=\"5537\" data-end=\"5548\">Python:</strong> Primary language for AI and automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fd06b\" data-start=\"5590\" data-end=\"5654\"><strong data-start=\"5592\" data-end=\"5622\">Cyber Threat Intelligence:</strong> Real-world security analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5656\" data-end=\"5791\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"5659\" data-end=\"5680\">Critical Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"5680\" data-end=\"5683\">Many students learn AI theoretically but fail to apply it. This semester must include <strong data-start=\"5769\" data-end=\"5790\">hands-on projects</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5793\" data-end=\"5796\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14cre69\" data-start=\"5798\" data-end=\"5816\">Skills Attained</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5818\" data-end=\"6105\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4b25a4\" data-start=\"5818\" data-end=\"5835\">AI Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ic68cl\" data-start=\"5836\" data-end=\"5874\">Machine Learning Model Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"164r2jz\" data-start=\"5875\" data-end=\"5892\">Python for AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sjmqoc\" data-start=\"5893\" data-end=\"5922\">Cyber Threat Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16qcgjr\" data-start=\"5923\" data-end=\"5946\">Pattern Recognition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1di89x5\" data-start=\"5947\" data-end=\"5967\">Threat Detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qzhtg4\" data-start=\"5968\" data-end=\"5990\">Data Preprocessing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3jvp8x\" data-start=\"5991\" data-end=\"6011\">Model Evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nxvzm0\" data-start=\"6012\" data-end=\"6037\">Security Log Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ujumb\" data-start=\"6038\" data-end=\"6059\">Threat Prediction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"755h0m\" data-start=\"6060\" data-end=\"6081\">Malware Detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3p3gwx\" data-start=\"6082\" data-end=\"6105\">Security Automation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"smltqd\" data-start=\"6107\" data-end=\"6126\">Strategic Value</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6128\" data-end=\"6175\">You become eligible for emerging roles such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6176\" data-end=\"6245\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l869km\" data-start=\"6176\" data-end=\"6192\">AI Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lne802\" data-start=\"6193\" data-end=\"6213\">Security Analyst</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dh4g5b\" data-start=\"6214\" data-end=\"6245\">Threat Intelligence Analyst</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6247\" data-end=\"6250\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1v3btiz\" data-start=\"6252\" data-end=\"6281\">Recommended Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6283\" data-end=\"6407\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3jgmb\" data-start=\"6283\" data-end=\"6310\">Python for Data Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dq3gv9\" data-start=\"6311\" data-end=\"6333\">Python Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nn6kp9\" data-start=\"6334\" data-end=\"6363\">Data Structures in Python</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vnxoph\" data-start=\"6364\" data-end=\"6407\">AI Foundations (ML + Thinking Machines)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wyht1v\" data-start=\"6409\" data-end=\"6428\">Expert Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6430\" data-end=\"6445\">Start building:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6446\" data-end=\"6507\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cki7ll\" data-start=\"6446\" data-end=\"6472\">AI-based mini projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p2ij3l\" data-start=\"6473\" data-end=\"6507\">Security analysis case studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6509\" data-end=\"6547\">These are highly valued in interviews.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6549\" data-end=\"6552\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"e1p1mp\" data-start=\"6554\" data-end=\"6611\">Semester 4: Advanced Cyber Defense &amp; Industry Readiness</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"6613\" data-end=\"6631\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6633\" data-end=\"6830\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iuzcpl\" data-start=\"6633\" data-end=\"6661\">Ethical Hacking using AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hv8f3g\" data-start=\"6662\" data-end=\"6699\">Intelligent Cyber Defense Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hnw7c4\" data-start=\"6700\" data-end=\"6737\">Vulnerability Assessment using AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9juv8m\" data-start=\"6738\" data-end=\"6781\">Penetration Testing &amp; Attack Simulation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jt7oir\" data-start=\"6782\" data-end=\"6812\">Strategic Leadership in IT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1785yup\" data-start=\"6813\" data-end=\"6830\">Final Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u10c3k\" data-start=\"6832\" data-end=\"6859\">What You Actually Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6861\" data-end=\"6938\">This semester transforms you into a <strong data-start=\"6897\" data-end=\"6937\">job-ready cybersecurity professional</strong>.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6940\" data-end=\"7098\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yn10wo\" data-start=\"6940\" data-end=\"6970\">Ethical hacking techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xj7qwe\" data-start=\"6971\" data-end=\"7005\">Real-world penetration testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h4k5y8\" data-start=\"7006\" data-end=\"7034\">Cyber defense strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"70r41e\" data-start=\"7035\" data-end=\"7065\">Risk assessment frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"me6zbj\" data-start=\"7066\" data-end=\"7098\">Security automation using AI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7100\" data-end=\"7214\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"7103\" data-end=\"7127\">High-Impact Mistake:</strong><br data-start=\"7127\" data-end=\"7130\">Students treat the final project casually. This is your <strong data-start=\"7186\" data-end=\"7213\">biggest placement asset</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7216\" data-end=\"7219\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14cre69\" data-start=\"7221\" data-end=\"7239\">Skills Attained</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7241\" data-end=\"7547\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yxxlhz\" data-start=\"7241\" data-end=\"7260\">Ethical Hacking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sdqsyj\" data-start=\"7261\" data-end=\"7284\">Penetration Testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z8gxu2\" data-start=\"7285\" data-end=\"7313\">Vulnerability Assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14hm4u5\" data-start=\"7314\" data-end=\"7331\">Cyber Defense</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3t5sp\" data-start=\"7332\" data-end=\"7349\">Risk Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pop5m0\" data-start=\"7350\" data-end=\"7373\">Intrusion Detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p9iret\" data-start=\"7374\" data-end=\"7395\">Threat Simulation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5k7oql\" data-start=\"7396\" data-end=\"7417\">Incident Response</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3p3gwx\" data-start=\"7418\" data-end=\"7441\">Security Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"755h0m\" data-start=\"7442\" data-end=\"7463\">Malware Detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"101drxf\" data-start=\"7464\" data-end=\"7487\">Threat Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fpjrle\" data-start=\"7488\" data-end=\"7511\">Security Monitoring</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pklhx8\" data-start=\"7512\" data-end=\"7547\">Information Security Governance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7549\" data-end=\"7552\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1v3btiz\" data-start=\"7554\" data-end=\"7583\">Recommended Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7585\" data-end=\"7670\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1022h23\" data-start=\"7585\" data-end=\"7617\">Penetration Testing Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lkay1\" data-start=\"7618\" data-end=\"7647\">Cybersecurity Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkzumo\" data-start=\"7648\" data-end=\"7670\">Strategic Thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"7672\" data-end=\"7690\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7692\" data-end=\"7748\">If done properly, this semester alone can help you land:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7749\" data-end=\"7845\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"129cyku\" data-start=\"7749\" data-end=\"7802\">Cybersecurity roles with strong starting packages</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lniruj\" data-start=\"7803\" data-end=\"7845\">High-demand niche roles in AI security</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(289, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 261, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 01:02:36', '2026-06-16 07:03:57', '<p data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"690\">The MCA admission process is designed to be <strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"554\">simple, structured, and fully digital</strong>, allowing students to complete enrollment without confusion. However, each step is strategically important because it directly impacts:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"835\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2noy8\" data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"731\">Your <strong data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"729\">program selection accuracy</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h69lbb\" data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"791\">Your <strong data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"789\">fee payment method and benefits (discount/EMI)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cctv9p\" data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"835\">Your <strong data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"833\">final seat confirmation status</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"995\">Many students treat admission as a formality, but in reality, it is a <strong data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"956\">multi-stage verification and decision process</strong> that determines your academic journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1000\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wxpq7q\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1048\">Step-by-Step MCA Admission Process Explained</h1>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1053\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qdghf6\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1084\">STEP 1: Submit Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1165\">This is the <strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1138\">first and most important entry stage</strong> of your admission journey.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cwdw33\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1191\">What You Need to Do:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qxr7w\" data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1243\">Fill out the online application form carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xqjy7t\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1308\">Enter personal details (name, contact number, address, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pylx53\" data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1368\">Provide academic details (10+2, graduation marks, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gxehgq\" data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1403\">Select the desired MCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gsu7lq\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1441\">Submit the application for review</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sfpnp\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1477\">Why This Step is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1619\">This step creates your <strong data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1531\">official admission record</strong> in the system. Even a small mistake here can create problems later during verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1624\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1644\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1706\">Many students underestimate this stage and make errors like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1788\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10u32sj\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1732\">Incorrect marks entry</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ukvb2p\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1762\">Spelling mistakes in name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r1plih\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1788\">Wrong contact details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1820\">⚠️ These mistakes can lead to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ijhv85\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1846\">Application rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eb55ur\" data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1872\">Delay in verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nus4qo\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1923\">Communication failure during admission updates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1928\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p3qaaw\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1962\">STEP 2: Enroll in Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2067\">Once your application is submitted successfully, the next stage is <strong data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2066\">program enrollment confirmation</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"igagno\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2099\">What Happens in This Step:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2241\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ilj34a\" data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2153\">You select your final MCA program specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ax90g1\" data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2200\">You verify all submitted details carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1set5i4\" data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2241\">You confirm your enrollment decision</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2246\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2273\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2324\">This is the <strong data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2310\">decision-lock stage</strong> of admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2343\">Once you confirm:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2477\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jdd8uy\" data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2381\">Your program choice becomes final</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lbfpbx\" data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2428\">Your academic track is officially assigned</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gjg0bm\" data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2477\">Fee structure and payment mode are activated</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2482\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2502\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2569\">Before confirming enrollment, students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2723\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5nki86\" data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2648\">Career outcomes of specialization (AI, Cyber Security, Development, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mls3ru\" data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2691\">Skill alignment with personal interest</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12e08wp\" data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2723\">Long-term job opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2862\">⚠️ Mistake to Avoid:<br>Choosing a program based on trend rather than career fit often leads to lack of interest and weak performance later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2864\" data-end=\"2867\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cz9jn2\" data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2895\">STEP 3: Complete Payment</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"3035\">After enrollment confirmation, you proceed to the <strong data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2968\">fee payment stage</strong>, which is one of the most flexible parts of the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3040\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3070\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h4qv18\" data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3102\">1. One-Time Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3178\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nw7ojp\" data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3136\">Pay full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lpwm1p\" data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3178\">Eligible for <strong data-start=\"3152\" data-end=\"3176\">15% discount benefit</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3200\">Key Advantages:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3296\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wh4ujg\" data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3229\">No future payment burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"917kpq\" data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3265\">Simplified financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gx0z8h\" data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3296\">Maximum cost-saving option</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3318\">Expert Insight:</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3423\">This is ideal for students who have financial stability and want to avoid long-term payment commitments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3428\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ano7td\" data-start=\"3430\" data-end=\"3464\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3586\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cbspgr\" data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3507\">Pay fees through monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qtvqlr\" data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3586\">Available with <strong data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3584\">0% interest EMI (as per eligibility and provider terms)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3608\">Key Advantages:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3735\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12tnm4d\" data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3646\">No heavy upfront payment required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s6373k\" data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3684\">Easier monthly financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juhit3\" data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3735\">Accessible for students from all income groups</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3740\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p5ckw0\" data-start=\"3742\" data-end=\"3763\">Critical Advisory</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3786\">Before selecting EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3917\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tupifl\" data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3825\">Always check loan tenure carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d4nj75\" data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3872\">Understand processing fees (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15yf3ho\" data-start=\"3873\" data-end=\"3917\">Ensure monthly installment is affordable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"4036\">⚠️ Mistake to Avoid:<br>Choosing EMI without understanding repayment structure can lead to long-term financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4038\" data-end=\"4041\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ge60cf\" data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4069\">STEP 4: Secure Your Seat</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4137\">This is the <strong data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4111\">final confirmation stage</strong> of the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4139\" data-end=\"4142\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nshoil\" data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4166\">What Happens Here:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4168\" data-end=\"4358\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ubnrk5\" data-start=\"4168\" data-end=\"4229\">Payment is successfully processed OR EMI/loan is approved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bazrmx\" data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4262\">Admission status is verified</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"anrnuq\" data-start=\"4263\" data-end=\"4319\">Your seat in the MCA program is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wr0fmu\" data-start=\"4320\" data-end=\"4358\">You receive admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4360\" data-end=\"4363\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"axh9kw\" data-start=\"4365\" data-end=\"4382\">Final Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4384\" data-end=\"4412\">Once this step is completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4413\" data-end=\"4539\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g989c7\" data-start=\"4413\" data-end=\"4452\">You become a registered MCA student</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a70c5n\" data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4495\">You gain access to academic onboarding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mgf73x\" data-start=\"4496\" data-end=\"4539\">Your learning journey officially begins</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4541\" data-end=\"4544\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4564\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4566\" data-end=\"4725\">This step is not just a formality&mdash;it is the <strong data-start=\"4610\" data-end=\"4648\">official academic activation point</strong>. Any delay in payment or approval can directly delay your seat confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4727\" data-end=\"4730\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ufvq7r\" data-start=\"4732\" data-end=\"4769\">Complete MCA Admission Flow Summary</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4771\" data-end=\"5079\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4771\" data-end=\"4799\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4771\" data-end=\"4799\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4771\" data-end=\"4778\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4788\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Process</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4788\" data-end=\"4799\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"5079\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4892\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4836\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4836\" data-end=\"4857\">Submit Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4857\" data-end=\"4892\">Initial admission entry created</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4893\" data-end=\"4959\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4893\" data-end=\"4902\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4902\" data-end=\"4922\">Enroll in Program</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4922\" data-end=\"4959\">Final program selection confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"5017\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"4969\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"4990\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Completion</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4990\" data-end=\"5017\">Fee structure activated</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5018\" data-end=\"5079\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5018\" data-end=\"5027\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5027\" data-end=\"5047\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Seat Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5047\" data-end=\"5079\">Admission officially secured&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"836\">The eligibility criteria for MCA admissions are designed to ensure that students entering the program have the <strong data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"685\">right academic foundation and logical understanding of computing concepts</strong>. Since MCA is a postgraduate-level program in most cases, eligibility depends mainly on the <strong data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"835\">educational level of the program you are applying for</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"1079\">The statement &ldquo;Basic eligibility: Pass in (10+2) examination or Bachelor&rsquo;s degree depending on program&rdquo; means that eligibility is not uniform and varies based on whether the student is applying for an <strong data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1078\">undergraduate or postgraduate track</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1084\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ui8hdy\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1125\">1. Eligibility Based on Program Level</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dys477\" data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1195\">For Undergraduate Programs (e.g., BCA or entry-level IT programs)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1546\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m4wxv5\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1271\">Candidate must have passed <strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1269\">10+2 (Class 12) from a recognized board</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"evg22u\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1351\">Students <strong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1349\">appearing for Class 12 examinations are also eligible to apply</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dql9eo\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1467\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1417\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are eligible if they meet academic requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lfkkrk\" data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1546\">No specific stream restriction in most cases (Science/Commerce/Arts allowed)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"123vz07\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1563\">Key Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1592\">At this level, focus is on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1700\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ovgk82\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1628\">Basic mathematics understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17dfhxp\" data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1658\">Logical reasoning ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eby56o\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1700\">Introduction to computer fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1705\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rnk215\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1740\">For MCA (Postgraduate Program)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"2035\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nxoilv\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1836\">Candidate must have a <strong data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1834\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline from a recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1imyjmc\" data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1958\">Minimum required marks:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1958\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ebtla\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1907\"><strong data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1905\">50% aggregate (General category)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yn8x\" data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1958\"><strong data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1956\">45% (Reserved categories, if applicable)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13z34yw\" data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2035\">Mathematics must be studied at:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2035\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4e075n\" data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2012\">10+2 level OR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17h0qfa\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2035\">Graduation level</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2055\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2139\">Unlike undergraduate programs, <strong data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2138\">10+2 alone is not sufficient for MCA admission</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2144\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11mim8r\" data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2204\">2. Mathematics Requirement (Critical Eligibility Factor)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2313\">Mathematics plays a central role in MCA eligibility because it directly impacts your ability to understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2420\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16208l0\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2329\">Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d24kin\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2351\">Programming logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mo16ta\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2371\">Data structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajo29n\" data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2399\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ob487t\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2420\">Machine Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jvdjg9\" data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2455\">If You Do NOT Have Mathematics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2503\">Some institutions may allow admission through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2539\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w7tnje\" data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2539\"><strong data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2539\">Bridge courses in Mathematics</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xkhqdo\" data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2568\">What Bridge Courses Do:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2720\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ihxusl\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2611\">Strengthen basic mathematical concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"adxgvj\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2673\">Prepare students for programming and algorithmic thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wn6sm4\" data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2720\">Ensure academic readiness for MCA subjects</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2848\">⚠️ Important Insight:<br data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2746\">Students who skip math preparation often struggle in <strong data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2847\">core subjects like Data Structures and AI/ML</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2853\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hthlo4\" data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2885\">3. Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"3037\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2898\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2921\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Eligibility</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"3037\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2995\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2974\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2974\" data-end=\"2995\" data-col-size=\"sm\">50% in graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3037\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3016\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reserved Category</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3037\" data-col-size=\"sm\">45% in graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bddi4d\" data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3059\">Why Marks Matter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3084\">Higher academic scores:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3224\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpjpl9\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3138\">Improve admission chances in competitive programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"104kfex\" data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3185\">Indicate stronger conceptual understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lmycyr\" data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3224\">Help during placement shortlisting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3229\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1q7odrv\" data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3281\">4. Eligibility for Different Student Backgrounds</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1w5ink3\" data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3310\">Students from Any Stream</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3417\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dihn1v\" data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3364\">Eligible if they complete required qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vvp4dj\" data-start=\"3365\" data-end=\"3417\">Must be willing to learn programming from basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tu9w1o\" data-start=\"3419\" data-end=\"3443\">Working Professionals</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3565\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vja1ug\" data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3496\">Eligible if they hold a valid bachelor&rsquo;s degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kldzir\" data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3565\">Ideal for career transition into IT, AI, or software development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kin9t0\" data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3583\">NIOS Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3585\" data-end=\"3699\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ih8ma9\" data-start=\"3585\" data-end=\"3632\">Fully eligible if degree/10+2 is recognized</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vkrphx\" data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3699\">Must meet same academic requirements as regular board students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2n6al8\" data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3723\">Final Year Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3725\" data-end=\"3872\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vzd3gb\" data-start=\"3725\" data-end=\"3805\">Students <strong data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3803\">appearing for final year graduation exams are eligible to apply</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cg85vg\" data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"3872\">Admission may be provisional until final results are submitted</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"663\">The MCA program is structured with a <strong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"546\">transparent and affordable fee system</strong>, designed to support students from diverse financial backgrounds. The total tuition fee for the complete program is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"697\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d377vm\" data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"697\"><strong data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"685\">Total MCA Fee:</strong> ₹1,30,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"907\">This fee is considered competitive in comparison to many postgraduate IT programs, especially considering the inclusion of modern subjects like <strong data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"906\">AI, Cloud Computing, Data Science, and Software Development</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"912\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cbcwjd\" data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"940\">Flexible Payment Options</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1110\">One of the strongest advantages of this MCA fee structure is its <strong data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1041\">flexibility in payment methods</strong>, allowing students to choose according to their financial situation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1115\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16psrcv\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1146\">1. One-Time Payment Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1180\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lfng6p\" data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1180\"><strong data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1168\">Total Payment:</strong> ₹1,30,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vyi0sv\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1199\">Key Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wmat7q\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1228\">No future payment stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pv2r68\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1262\">Simplified financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10769pn\" data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1313\">Often preferred by financially stable students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6971mc\" data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1334\">Expert Insight:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1504\">This option is financially efficient for students who can afford upfront payment, as it helps avoid repeated financial tracking and ensures uninterrupted academic focus.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cjmxlm\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1538\">2. Yearly Payment Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pswcuy\" data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1569\"><strong data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1559\">Per Year Fee:</strong> ₹65,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f1ade7\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1611\"><strong data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1591\">Total Duration:</strong> Typically 2 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vyi0sv\" data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1630\">Key Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o9dvoe\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1662\">Balanced financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3fxk2\" data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1689\">Less frequent payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0s233\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1723\">Easier budgeting for families</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ocobte\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1747\">Strategic Insight:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1851\">This option is ideal for students who prefer <strong data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1850\">moderate financial flexibility without monthly burden</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1856\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bpbgqy\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1892\">3. Semester-Wise Payment Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1966\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h2n09o\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1927\"><strong data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1917\">Per Semester Fee:</strong> ₹32,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mn8wuz\" data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1966\"><strong data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1950\">Total Semesters:</strong> 4 (generally)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vyi0sv\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1985\">Key Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2082\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9fmjqy\" data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2011\">Maximum affordability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j64ysa\" data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2044\">Smaller payment installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xzp0z5\" data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2082\">Suitable for self-funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rmz6m4\" data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2106\">Important Insight:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2251\">While this option reduces upfront pressure, it requires <strong data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2210\">strict discipline to avoid missed deadlines</strong>, which can impact enrollment continuity.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2256\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ww66y\" data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2291\">4. EMI (Education Loan) Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2365\">EMI facilities are available to make the program financially accessible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"omsogg\" data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2387\">Benefits of EMI:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2535\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jddcoz\" data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2423\">Pay monthly instead of lump sum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rttxl\" data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2462\">Reduces immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p7p6o2\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2535\">Helps students from all economic backgrounds access higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tu2cgb\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2557\">Critical Advice:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2579\">Before selecting EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2710\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ps0bdm\" data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2620\">Check interest rates (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c17ny7\" data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2654\">Understand repayment duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0l283\" data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2710\">Avoid long-term debt traps that increase total cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2715\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1t20357\" data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2761\">Additional Fees (Important Cost Breakdown)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2897\">Apart from tuition fees, there are <strong data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2830\">mandatory additional charges</strong> that students must consider while planning their education budget.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2899\" data-end=\"2902\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2928\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"3004\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"101tavf\" data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2967\">One-Time Registration Fee: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ein341\" data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3004\">Examination Fee: ₹3,000 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jhkbxi\" data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3048\">Total Additional Cost (India Students)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3111\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q34t3q\" data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3083\">₹2,500 + ₹6,000 (for 2 years)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p5x11e\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3111\"><strong data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3111\">Total: ₹8,500 approx.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3116\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3tswjy\" data-start=\"3118\" data-end=\"3147\">For SAARC Country Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3215\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"linrs7\" data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3178\">Registration Fee: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b8eg6b\" data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3215\">Examination Fee: ₹3,750 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c4o446\" data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3242\">Total Additional Cost</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3293\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vg1d6e\" data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3264\">₹11,250 + ₹7,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3tfz6c\" data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3293\"><strong data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3293\">Total: ₹18,750 approx.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3298\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3329\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3331\" data-end=\"3402\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h11jxk\" data-start=\"3331\" data-end=\"3368\">Registration Fee: $150 (one-time)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16pkt12\" data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3402\">Examination Fee: $50 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c4o446\" data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3429\">Total Additional Cost</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3486\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7agype\" data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3460\">$150 + $100 (for 2 years)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hi9csp\" data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3486\"><strong data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3486\">Total: $250 approx.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3491\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hmsfp2\" data-start=\"3493\" data-end=\"3533\">Total MCA Cost (Realistic Calculation)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3684\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3554\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3554\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3546\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3554\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cost</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3684\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3602\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3589\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3602\">₹1,30,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3639\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3629\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fees (India)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3629\" data-end=\"3639\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹8,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3684\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3667\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3666\">Total Estimated Cost</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3667\" data-end=\"3684\"><strong data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3682\">₹1,38,500</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"683\">The MCA curriculum is designed as a <strong data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"547\">progressive skill-building framework</strong>, where each semester moves you from <strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"682\">basic computing fundamentals &rarr; development skills &rarr; AI, ML, and advanced industry applications</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"755\">Unlike traditional theoretical programs, this structure is focused on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"902\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n73ghd\" data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"786\"><strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"786\">Practical coding ability</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7bn6ra\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"825\"><strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"825\">Industry-ready skill development</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ami2hg\" data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"863\"><strong data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"863\">AI, data, and cloud integration</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i1ucnk\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"902\"><strong data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"902\">Project-driven learning approach</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1012\">This ensures students are not just degree holders but <strong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"985\">job-ready professionals</strong> by the end of the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"k4v62y\" data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1080\">Semester 1: Computer Science Foundation &amp; Programming Logic</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1100\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1325\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"puxsj6\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1151\">Mathematical Foundations for Computer Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nprf48\" data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1202\">Computing Concepts and Problem Solving using C</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fbi6bn\" data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1224\">Operating Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2ewta\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1244\">Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u9xyq7\" data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1276\">Problem Solving using C Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fbf0sx\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1300\">Data Structures Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1325\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1330\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qt95qq\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1379\">What You Actually Learn (Deep Understanding)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1529\">Semester 1 focuses on building your <strong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1471\">computational thinking and problem-solving mindset</strong>, which forms the backbone of all future technical skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wzjx7b\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1555\">Core Learning Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1909\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r6dpii\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1635\"><strong data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1588\">Mathematical Foundations:</strong> Logic building for algorithms and AI systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"97e1yo\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1705\"><strong data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1656\">C Programming:</strong> Low-level programming and memory understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tluhy3\" data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1769\"><strong data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1730\">Operating Systems:</strong> How software interacts with hardware</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rmka69\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1851\"><strong data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1792\">Data Structures:</strong> Efficient data handling (critical for coding interviews)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6im41p\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1909\"><strong data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1874\">AI Introduction:</strong> Awareness of future technologies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1914\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14cre69\" data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1934\">Skills Attained</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"2311\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w081eq\" data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1957\">Analytical Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1y49x\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1986\">Programming Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51g7ul\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2018\">Software Development Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xkzlo0\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2047\">Algorithms Understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tppluj\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2075\">Data Structures Mastery</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13xdgwh\" data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2107\">Operating Systems Knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f9yuqv\" data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2135\">Problem Solving Ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5kijw7\" data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2167\">Software Engineering Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sgewnh\" data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2193\">Mathematical Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17hz4o7\" data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2218\">Discrete Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1awdg9h\" data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2241\">Algorithm Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ffk9p\" data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2265\">Modular Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s0zyy\" data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2287\">Memory Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p7y63c\" data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2311\">System Architecture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2316\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ppjpj0\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2358\">LinkedIn Certifications (Recommended)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2663\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"104kjvr\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2401\">Programming Foundations: Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rh0lth\" data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2426\">C Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ink7wq\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2459\">Data Structures Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mtgant\" data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2487\">Operating System Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17hz4o7\" data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2512\">Discrete Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n533rk\" data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2552\">Python Data Structures &amp; Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n14rxt\" data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2603\">AI Foundations (Thinking Machines &amp; ML Basics)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1co00im\" data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2635\">Computer Science Principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tpmbhc\" data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2663\">Algorithms Fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2687\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2815\">Semester 1 is the <strong data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2741\">make-or-break foundation phase</strong>. Students who ignore C programming and data structures often struggle in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2896\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"noyfzu\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2837\">Coding interviews</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b0jxmo\" data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2862\">Internship selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h165gg\" data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2896\">Advanced programming subjects</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2901\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"i3vexy\" data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2959\">Semester 2: Development, Databases &amp; Cloud Foundations</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2979\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3148\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fa2wed\" data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3010\">Advanced Database Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efpi4t\" data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3031\">Java Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkem60\" data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3052\">Web Technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"td1sk1\" data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3084\">Cloud Computing Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187hfbo\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3109\">Database Systems Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u98j5u\" data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3134\">Java Programming Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10c2dgj\" data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3148\">ESG in IT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3153\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p9tok2\" data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3181\">What You Learn in Depth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3282\">This semester transforms you from a beginner coder into a <strong data-start=\"3241\" data-end=\"3281\">software development-focused student</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1oj9pi4\" data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3308\">Key Technical Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3632\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ar879q\" data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3372\"><strong data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3333\">Java Programming:</strong> Enterprise-level backend development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w7m8gb\" data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3438\"><strong data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3396\">Database Systems:</strong> Data storage, SQL queries, optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3tur0d\" data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3495\"><strong data-start=\"3441\" data-end=\"3462\">Web Technologies:</strong> Frontend + backend integration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pzvzs3\" data-start=\"3496\" data-end=\"3564\"><strong data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3518\">Cloud Computing:</strong> Introduction to AWS and distributed systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f9hghv\" data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3632\"><strong data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3581\">ESG in IT:</strong> Ethical and sustainable technology understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3634\" data-end=\"3637\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14cre69\" data-start=\"3639\" data-end=\"3657\">Skills Attained</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3659\" data-end=\"4025\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efpi4t\" data-start=\"3659\" data-end=\"3679\">Java Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mt9tpo\" data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3707\">Spring Framework Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"snfdg7\" data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3733\">SQL &amp; Database Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"urtsj\" data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3758\">REST API Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xfc8di\" data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3785\">Full Stack Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p7ia97\" data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3805\">Web Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sy0smn\" data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"3829\">Git Version Control</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10rudu\" data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3867\">Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gk7n55\" data-start=\"3868\" data-end=\"3898\">Microservices Architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5ferl0\" data-start=\"3899\" data-end=\"3923\">Application Security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4idvj3\" data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3943\">Database Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pjn90g\" data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"3970\">Cloud Computing Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h2szcw\" data-start=\"3971\" data-end=\"3990\">DevOps Concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m8qh13\" data-start=\"3991\" data-end=\"4008\">Data Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"22v7yw\" data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4025\">Unit Testing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4030\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b22q20\" data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4058\">LinkedIn Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4251\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19momne\" data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4087\">Java Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1me9o5p\" data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4111\">Java 11 Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ghft9\" data-start=\"4112\" data-end=\"4144\">HTML &amp; JavaScript Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ky4mdg\" data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4170\">AWS Cloud Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yaof51\" data-start=\"4171\" data-end=\"4198\">SQL &amp; Database Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gq4dj\" data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4224\">Programming Databases</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"szbzba\" data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4251\">Java Memory Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4253\" data-end=\"4256\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"4258\" data-end=\"4275\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4277\" data-end=\"4328\">Semester 2 is where students should start building:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4419\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s9qbvx\" data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4366\"><strong data-start=\"4331\" data-end=\"4366\">Real-world projects (mandatory)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fztetz\" data-start=\"4367\" data-end=\"4385\">GitHub portfolio</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5wcqej\" data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4419\">Basic full-stack applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4474\">Without this, placement chances reduce significantly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4476\" data-end=\"4479\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tdm4sa\" data-start=\"4481\" data-end=\"4547\">Semester 3: AI, Machine Learning &amp; Advanced Software Engineering</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"4549\" data-end=\"4567\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4569\" data-end=\"4710\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r6w9b5\" data-start=\"4569\" data-end=\"4617\">Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dq3gv9\" data-start=\"4618\" data-end=\"4640\">Python Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h4aufl\" data-start=\"4641\" data-end=\"4661\">Software Testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2u11k\" data-start=\"4662\" data-end=\"4677\">AI &amp; ML Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k4l0xf\" data-start=\"4678\" data-end=\"4692\">Python Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqmzod\" data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4710\">Open Elective</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4715\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p9tok2\" data-start=\"4717\" data-end=\"4743\">What You Learn in Depth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4836\">This is the <strong data-start=\"4757\" data-end=\"4786\">core specialization phase</strong>, where students enter advanced computing domains.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12g84eb\" data-start=\"4838\" data-end=\"4858\">Key Focus Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4860\" data-end=\"5147\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18yt05s\" data-start=\"4860\" data-end=\"4923\"><strong data-start=\"4862\" data-end=\"4890\">Artificial Intelligence:</strong> Intelligent system development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aj88rh\" data-start=\"4924\" data-end=\"4975\"><strong data-start=\"4926\" data-end=\"4947\">Machine Learning:</strong> Predictive model building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rh30tq\" data-start=\"4976\" data-end=\"5030\"><strong data-start=\"4978\" data-end=\"5001\">Python Programming:</strong> AI and automation backbone</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7fwuyc\" data-start=\"5031\" data-end=\"5088\"><strong data-start=\"5033\" data-end=\"5054\">Software Testing:</strong> Quality assurance and debugging</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cehwxs\" data-start=\"5089\" data-end=\"5147\"><strong data-start=\"5091\" data-end=\"5116\">Deep Learning Basics:</strong> Neural network understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5149\" data-end=\"5152\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fk9zt4\" data-start=\"5154\" data-end=\"5189\">Skills Attained (Advanced Level)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5191\" data-end=\"5653\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e49hcd\" data-start=\"5191\" data-end=\"5226\">Artificial Intelligence Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pdveo5\" data-start=\"5227\" data-end=\"5254\">Machine Learning Models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kd0zdb\" data-start=\"5255\" data-end=\"5277\">Python Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ktw4i0\" data-start=\"5278\" data-end=\"5295\">Deep Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aqpuxf\" data-start=\"5296\" data-end=\"5333\">NLP (Natural Language Processing)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"97fso4\" data-start=\"5334\" data-end=\"5353\">Neural Networks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gfvbko\" data-start=\"5354\" data-end=\"5383\">Data Science Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fbz1sx\" data-start=\"5384\" data-end=\"5422\">Supervised &amp; Unsupervised Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3jvp8x\" data-start=\"5423\" data-end=\"5443\">Model Evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"euezvp\" data-start=\"5444\" data-end=\"5467\">Feature Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qzhtg4\" data-start=\"5468\" data-end=\"5490\">Data Preprocessing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bjenra\" data-start=\"5491\" data-end=\"5515\">TensorFlow &amp; PyTorch</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1alp8ir\" data-start=\"5516\" data-end=\"5542\">Reinforcement Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vhxzxa\" data-start=\"5543\" data-end=\"5563\">Model Deployment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fz5i5h\" data-start=\"5564\" data-end=\"5573\">MLOps</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vmvxni\" data-start=\"5574\" data-end=\"5605\">Software Testing Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j3e3ej\" data-start=\"5606\" data-end=\"5625\">CI/CD Pipelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jj9ipv\" data-start=\"5626\" data-end=\"5653\">Version Control Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5655\" data-end=\"5658\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b22q20\" data-start=\"5660\" data-end=\"5686\">LinkedIn Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5688\" data-end=\"5883\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1snw0vn\" data-start=\"5688\" data-end=\"5724\">AI Foundations: Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6bj2a\" data-start=\"5725\" data-end=\"5754\">Python Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yemo1w\" data-start=\"5755\" data-end=\"5787\">Python for Data Science &amp; ML</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpgsp5\" data-start=\"5788\" data-end=\"5820\">Software Testing Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17653fs\" data-start=\"5821\" data-end=\"5847\">Test Automation Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlqqq8\" data-start=\"5848\" data-end=\"5883\">Data Visualization Storytelling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5885\" data-end=\"5888\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"5890\" data-end=\"5907\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5909\" data-end=\"5963\">This semester is highly critical for career direction:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5964\" data-end=\"6036\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iegopn\" data-start=\"5964\" data-end=\"5985\">AI Developer path</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hey8sd\" data-start=\"5986\" data-end=\"6009\">Data Scientist path</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14g0veb\" data-start=\"6010\" data-end=\"6036\">Software Engineer path</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6038\" data-end=\"6109\">⚠️ Mistake to avoid: Only learning theory without building ML projects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6111\" data-end=\"6114\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"y9rpwp\" data-start=\"6116\" data-end=\"6172\">Semester 4: Industry Readiness, Analytics &amp; Leadership</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"6174\" data-end=\"6192\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6194\" data-end=\"6347\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7u6yyb\" data-start=\"6194\" data-end=\"6219\">IT Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jymbcy\" data-start=\"6220\" data-end=\"6242\">Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tpfy01\" data-start=\"6243\" data-end=\"6275\">Low-Code/No-Code Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9wyf6\" data-start=\"6276\" data-end=\"6298\">Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jt7oir\" data-start=\"6299\" data-end=\"6329\">Strategic Leadership in IT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1785yup\" data-start=\"6330\" data-end=\"6347\">Final Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6349\" data-end=\"6352\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p9tok2\" data-start=\"6354\" data-end=\"6380\">What You Learn in Depth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6382\" data-end=\"6466\">This semester prepares you for <strong data-start=\"6413\" data-end=\"6465\">real corporate environments and leadership roles</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1g5rej\" data-start=\"6468\" data-end=\"6491\">Key Learning Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6493\" data-end=\"6767\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xph6lh\" data-start=\"6493\" data-end=\"6548\"><strong data-start=\"6495\" data-end=\"6518\">Project Management:</strong> Agile &amp; Scrum methodologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b00ewb\" data-start=\"6549\" data-end=\"6604\"><strong data-start=\"6551\" data-end=\"6574\">Big Data Analytics:</strong> Large-scale data processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1z5xb4\" data-start=\"6605\" data-end=\"6660\"><strong data-start=\"6607\" data-end=\"6630\">Data Visualization:</strong> Business intelligence tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u1xi6l\" data-start=\"6661\" data-end=\"6718\"><strong data-start=\"6663\" data-end=\"6686\">Low-Code Platforms:</strong> Rapid application development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zpmzl0\" data-start=\"6719\" data-end=\"6767\"><strong data-start=\"6721\" data-end=\"6739\">IT Leadership:</strong> Strategic decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6769\" data-end=\"6772\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14cre69\" data-start=\"6774\" data-end=\"6792\">Skills Attained</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6794\" data-end=\"7086\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e0tj0u\" data-start=\"6794\" data-end=\"6816\">Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"722zax\" data-start=\"6817\" data-end=\"6848\">Agile &amp; Scrum Methodologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jymbcy\" data-start=\"6849\" data-end=\"6871\">Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9wyf6\" data-start=\"6872\" data-end=\"6894\">Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9wg5sr\" data-start=\"6895\" data-end=\"6920\">Business Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vuwor4\" data-start=\"6921\" data-end=\"6943\">Power BI &amp; Tableau</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7gik3z\" data-start=\"6944\" data-end=\"6968\">Low-Code Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yqeu5f\" data-start=\"6969\" data-end=\"6995\">Digital Transformation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dgy00s\" data-start=\"6996\" data-end=\"7017\">Business Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"66lra7\" data-start=\"7018\" data-end=\"7043\">Dashboard Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xzd9sp\" data-start=\"7044\" data-end=\"7068\">Predictive Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c4r74r\" data-start=\"7069\" data-end=\"7086\">IT Governance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7088\" data-end=\"7091\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b22q20\" data-start=\"7093\" data-end=\"7119\">LinkedIn Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7121\" data-end=\"7368\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11tdd06\" data-start=\"7121\" data-end=\"7155\">Project Management Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19pjp3u\" data-start=\"7156\" data-end=\"7178\">Agile Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d8bhe3\" data-start=\"7179\" data-end=\"7208\">Big Data Analytics Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g2r1zw\" data-start=\"7209\" data-end=\"7230\">Power BI Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlqqq8\" data-start=\"7231\" data-end=\"7266\">Data Visualization Storytelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"192u6sj\" data-start=\"7267\" data-end=\"7301\">Low-Code Development Platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkzumo\" data-start=\"7302\" data-end=\"7324\">Strategic Thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yqu4ho\" data-start=\"7325\" data-end=\"7350\">Innovation Leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c4r74r\" data-start=\"7351\" data-end=\"7368\">IT Governance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7370\" data-end=\"7373\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"7375\" data-end=\"7392\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7394\" data-end=\"7424\">The final semester determines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7425\" data-end=\"7496\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bz7ve9\" data-start=\"7425\" data-end=\"7448\">Placement readiness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmsh1z\" data-start=\"7449\" data-end=\"7471\">Portfolio strength</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1facj9k\" data-start=\"7472\" data-end=\"7496\">Industry credibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7t7m49\" data-start=\"7498\" data-end=\"7526\">Critical Success Factor:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7527\" data-end=\"7596\">Your <strong data-start=\"7532\" data-end=\"7595\">final project must integrate AI + Data + Development skills</strong>.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 130000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(290, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 262, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 01:14:23', '2026-06-16 07:04:19', '<p data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"724\">The MCA admission process is a <strong data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"562\">structured, multi-step system</strong> designed to ensure that students are properly verified, correctly enrolled in the right program, and financially prepared before starting their academic journey.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"786\">This process is not just administrative&mdash;it directly impacts:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"948\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2noy8\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"826\">Your <strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"824\">program selection accuracy</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ysduh\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"886\">Your <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"884\">fee payment benefits (discounts &amp; EMI options)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51skwb\" data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"948\">Your <strong data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"946\">final admission confirmation and seat allocation</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1074\">Understanding each step in detail is important because mistakes at any stage can delay or even affect your admission status.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1079\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wxpq7q\" data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1127\">Step-by-Step MCA Admission Process Explained</h1>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qdghf6\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1163\">STEP 1: Submit Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1277\">This is the <strong data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1221\">starting point of your admission journey</strong> where your profile is created in the university system.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cwdw33\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1303\">What You Need to Do:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1586\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qxr7w\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1355\">Fill out the online application form carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efvtjq\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1425\">Enter personal details (name, contact information, address, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a1ivm9\" data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1502\">Provide academic qualifications (10+2, graduation details if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lycgf\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1540\">Select your preferred MCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qz0n0g\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1586\">Submit the application for initial review</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1591\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1623\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1697\">This step creates your <strong data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1677\">official admission record</strong>, which is used for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1809\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qkkbh8\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1726\">Eligibility verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hfnao4\" data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1772\">Communication regarding admission updates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6vxu90\" data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1809\">Further processing of enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1834\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1872\">Most admission delays happen due to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1959\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kwwh9s\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1900\">Incorrect name spelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ov0u24\" data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1927\">Wrong academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3od76d\" data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1959\">Invalid contact information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2025\">⚠️ Even small errors can create major verification issues later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2030\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p3qaaw\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2064\">STEP 2: Enroll in Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2157\">After your application is submitted, the next stage is <strong data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2156\">program enrollment confirmation</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"igagno\" data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2189\">What Happens in This Step:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2344\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19yepj6\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2246\">You choose your final MCA program or specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yb8vx6\" data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2301\">You verify all details entered in your application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4rh048\" data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2344\">You confirm your enrollment officially</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2349\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sfpnp\" data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2380\">Why This Step is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2444\">This is the <strong data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2417\">decision-lock stage</strong> of your admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2463\">Once you proceed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2607\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ks845t\" data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2504\">Your program selection becomes final</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t8wku7\" data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2550\">Your academic path is officially assigned</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10boom8\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2607\">Your fee structure and payment options are activated</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2612\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2632\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2699\">Before confirming enrollment, students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2858\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fxwhtx\" data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2790\">Career opportunities in chosen specialization (AI, Cyber Security, Data Science, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tecw6p\" data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2828\">Skill requirements of the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12kb6zg\" data-start=\"2829\" data-end=\"2858\">Long-term industry demand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"3009\">⚠️ Mistake to Avoid:<br>Choosing a program based on trend rather than interest often leads to poor academic performance and reduced career satisfaction.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3014\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cz9jn2\" data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3042\">STEP 3: Complete Payment</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3157\">Once your enrollment is confirmed, you move to the <strong data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3116\">fee payment stage</strong>, which offers multiple flexible options.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3162\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"3164\" data-end=\"3192\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h4qv18\" data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3224\">1. One-Time Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3300\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i1u98z\" data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3258\">Pay full program fee at once</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lpwm1p\" data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3300\">Eligible for <strong data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3298\">15% discount benefit</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3302\" data-end=\"3320\">Key Benefits:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3445\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wh4ujg\" data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3349\">No future payment burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7as9wc\" data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3374\">Maximum cost savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pv2r68\" data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3408\">Simplified financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b4xwjg\" data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3445\">No installment tracking required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3467\">Expert Insight:</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3553\">This option is best for students who want financial simplicity and long-term savings.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3558\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ano7td\" data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3594\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3713\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cbspgr\" data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3637\">Pay fees through monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e320ay\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3713\"><strong data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3711\">0% interest EMI available (subject to eligibility and lender terms)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3715\" data-end=\"3733\">Key Benefits:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3863\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kpxvur\" data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3771\">No large upfront payment required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bjlvcp\" data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"3809\">Easy monthly financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f8ijsc\" data-start=\"3810\" data-end=\"3863\">Makes higher education accessible to all students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3868\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"f2fz65\" data-start=\"3870\" data-end=\"3892\">Important Advisory</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3894\" data-end=\"3915\">Before selecting EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"4039\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aylzpd\" data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"3952\">Check repayment tenure carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3nbpaw\" data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"3990\">Understand any processing charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"imnj97\" data-start=\"3991\" data-end=\"4039\">Ensure monthly EMI is financially manageable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4041\" data-end=\"4175\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br>Students often choose EMI without understanding total repayment structure, leading to long-term financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4180\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ge60cf\" data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4208\">STEP 4: Secure Your Seat</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4281\">This is the <strong data-start=\"4222\" data-end=\"4255\">final and most important step</strong> in the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4283\" data-end=\"4286\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nshoil\" data-start=\"4288\" data-end=\"4310\">What Happens Here:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4312\" data-end=\"4521\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15e3nuq\" data-start=\"4312\" data-end=\"4373\">Payment is successfully completed OR EMI/loan is approved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1of66ln\" data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4418\">Admission is verified by the institution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"anrnuq\" data-start=\"4419\" data-end=\"4475\">Your seat in the MCA program is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lmq0z6\" data-start=\"4476\" data-end=\"4521\">You receive admission confirmation status</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"4526\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"axh9kw\" data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4545\">Final Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4547\" data-end=\"4575\">Once this step is completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4716\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g989c7\" data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4615\">You become a registered MCA student</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d40njt\" data-start=\"4616\" data-end=\"4672\">You gain access to academic resources and onboarding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"airk9\" data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4716\">Your classes and learning journey begin</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4721\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"4723\" data-end=\"4741\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4743\" data-end=\"4861\">This step is the <strong data-start=\"4760\" data-end=\"4809\">official transition from applicant to student</strong>. Any delay in payment or approval directly affects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4862\" data-end=\"4946\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c29n8f\" data-start=\"4862\" data-end=\"4892\">Seat confirmation timeline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11h8d5\" data-start=\"4893\" data-end=\"4916\">Academic start date</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sscu6k\" data-start=\"4917\" data-end=\"4946\">Program access activation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4948\" data-end=\"4951\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ufvq7r\" data-start=\"4953\" data-end=\"4990\">Complete MCA Admission Flow Summary</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4992\" data-end=\"5294\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4992\" data-end=\"5020\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4992\" data-end=\"5020\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4992\" data-end=\"4999\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4999\" data-end=\"5009\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Process</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5020\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5294\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5107\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5057\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5057\" data-end=\"5078\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit Application</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5078\" data-end=\"5107\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission profile created</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5174\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5117\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5117\" data-end=\"5138\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Enrollment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5138\" data-end=\"5174\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final course selection confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5175\" data-end=\"5232\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5175\" data-end=\"5184\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5184\" data-end=\"5205\">Payment Completion</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5205\" data-end=\"5232\">Fee structure activated</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5233\" data-end=\"5294\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5233\" data-end=\"5242\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5242\" data-end=\"5262\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Seat Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5262\" data-end=\"5294\">Admission officially secured</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"749\">The eligibility criteria for MCA-related academic pathways is structured to ensure that students entering the program have the <strong data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"748\">right academic foundation, logical thinking ability, and basic understanding of mathematics and computing concepts</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"1023\">The statement &ldquo;Basic eligibility: Pass in the (10+2) examination or Bachelor&rsquo;s degree depending on program&rdquo; indicates that eligibility is <strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"923\">not universal for all programs</strong>, and it varies based on whether the course is at the <strong data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1022\">undergraduate level or postgraduate level</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1041\">In simple terms:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1164\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lulumr\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1101\">Some programs require <strong data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1085\">Class 12 (10+2)</strong> qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ej7aie\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1164\">MCA-level programs generally require a <strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1164\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1169\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ui8hdy\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1210\">1. Eligibility Based on Program Level</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6hf8m7\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1283\">For Undergraduate-Level Programs (Example: BCA or Entry IT Programs)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1330\">If the program is at the undergraduate level:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fqh4yy\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1355\">Basic Requirements:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1624\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175auas\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1420\">Must have passed <strong data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1418\">10+2 (Class 12) from a recognized board</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"evg22u\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1500\">Students <strong data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1498\">appearing for Class 12 examinations are also eligible to apply</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r60q4p\" data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1624\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1566\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are eligible if recognized qualifications are completed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"r8i0kd\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1649\">Stream Flexibility:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1777\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1458age\" data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1715\">Science, Commerce, or Arts students can apply (in most cases)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5vglcs\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1777\">No strict stream restriction for basic computing programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w2ocki\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1811\">What This Means Practically:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1843\">At this stage, the focus is on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1930\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rd9s45\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1871\">Basic logical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5egl3b\" data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1901\">Introduction to computers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p42swq\" data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1930\">Foundational mathematics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1935\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rnk215\" data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1970\">For MCA (Postgraduate Program)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2051\">MCA is a <strong data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2017\">higher-level professional degree</strong>, so eligibility is more advanced.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fqh4yy\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2076\">Basic Requirements:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2370\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xocwrq\" data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2161\">Must have a <strong data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2159\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline from a recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16vzpx5\" data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2288\">Minimum marks required:\r\n<ul data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2288\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ev32es\" data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2234\"><strong data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2232\">50% aggregate for general category</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wohcw6\" data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2288\"><strong data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2286\">45% for reserved categories (if applicable)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9l6rku\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2370\">Mathematics must be studied either in:\r\n<ul data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2370\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c6n9h4\" data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2347\">Class 12 OR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17h0qfa\" data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2370\">Graduation level</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2375\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"m34u1t\" data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2416\">Why Graduation is Mandatory for MCA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2452\">MCA involves advanced topics like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2609\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11bcpye\" data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2493\">Programming and software development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"221mdl\" data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2528\">Data structures and algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a9zta9\" data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2577\">Artificial intelligence and machine learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11wnebs\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2609\">Database management systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2661\">A bachelor&rsquo;s degree ensures students already have:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2759\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t67xx2\" data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2683\">Academic maturity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mdg0wa\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2713\">Basic analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b1ikxl\" data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2759\">Learning readiness for advanced computing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2764\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1n49x0j\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2818\">2. Mathematics Requirement (Very Important Factor)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2912\">Mathematics is one of the <strong data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2886\">most critical eligibility components</strong> for MCA-related programs.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"78so8t\" data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2946\">Why Mathematics is Required:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"3106\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f96jsg\" data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2976\">Helps in algorithm design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xriqbg\" data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3012\">Builds logical thinking ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3amtnr\" data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3051\">Essential for programming concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h5hhn0\" data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3106\">Required for AI and machine learning understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3111\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qa1xmh\" data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3146\">If You Do Not Have Mathematics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3200\">Some institutions may still allow admission through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3237\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xzcgsq\" data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3237\"><strong data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3237\">Bridge Courses in Mathematics</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xkhqdo\" data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3266\">What Bridge Courses Do:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3389\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12qln9b\" data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3301\">Strengthen basic math concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wf5yov\" data-start=\"3302\" data-end=\"3344\">Prepare students for programming logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xzynrn\" data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3389\">Help students meet academic requirements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3394\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3414\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3472\">Students without mathematics often face difficulties in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3556\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2ewta\" data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3492\">Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16208l0\" data-start=\"3493\" data-end=\"3507\">Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x36sdd\" data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3526\">AI/ML subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ifs2s6\" data-start=\"3527\" data-end=\"3556\">Competitive coding rounds</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3628\">So even if eligible, preparation in mathematics is highly recommended.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3633\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hthlo4\" data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3665\">3. Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3667\" data-end=\"3819\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3667\" data-end=\"3701\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3667\" data-end=\"3701\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3667\" data-end=\"3678\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3701\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Eligibility</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3819\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3775\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3754\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3754\" data-end=\"3775\">50% in graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3819\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3798\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reserved Categories</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3819\" data-col-size=\"sm\">45% in graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3824\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bddi4d\" data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3846\">Why Marks Matter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3909\">Minimum marks are not just formal requirements. They reflect:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"4006\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rkx9f\" data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"3934\">Academic consistency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3k5e8k\" data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"3963\">Conceptual understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g3jpxw\" data-start=\"3964\" data-end=\"4006\">Ability to handle technical coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4050\">Higher academic performance also improves:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4103\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cjrvq2\" data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4075\">Admission preference</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1688lvi\" data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4103\">Placement opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4108\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zdy9jh\" data-start=\"4110\" data-end=\"4154\">4. Eligibility for Different Student Types</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"y6uwzd\" data-start=\"4156\" data-end=\"4195\">1. Students from Any Academic Stream</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4320\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zpxlr7\" data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4240\">Eligible if graduation criteria are met</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e7xgif\" data-start=\"4241\" data-end=\"4320\">Must be ready to learn programming from scratch if non-technical background</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4322\" data-end=\"4325\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"y40oo0\" data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4354\">2. Working Professionals</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4499\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r7dszf\" data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4397\">Eligible with valid bachelor&rsquo;s degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19giftv\" data-start=\"4398\" data-end=\"4499\">Ideal for career transition into:\r\n<ul data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4499\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juljie\" data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4454\">IT development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l7br7t\" data-start=\"4457\" data-end=\"4472\">AI/ML roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"svhmji\" data-start=\"4475\" data-end=\"4499\">Software engineering</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4501\" data-end=\"4504\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17x1ja1\" data-start=\"4506\" data-end=\"4525\">3. NIOS Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4527\" data-end=\"4620\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mej84j\" data-start=\"4527\" data-end=\"4576\">Fully eligible if qualification is recognized</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hjxecw\" data-start=\"4577\" data-end=\"4620\">Treated equally as other board students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4622\" data-end=\"4625\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n7ox1i\" data-start=\"4627\" data-end=\"4652\">4. Final Year Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4654\" data-end=\"4801\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w1faeb\" data-start=\"4654\" data-end=\"4732\">Students <strong data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4730\">currently appearing for final year graduation exams can apply</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lp9zoi\" data-start=\"4733\" data-end=\"4801\">Admission is often provisional until final results are submitted</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"660\">The MCA program is structured with a <strong data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"539\">clear and transparent fee system</strong>, ensuring students can plan their education without hidden confusion. The total tuition fee for the complete program is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"695\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v72j90\" data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"695\"><strong data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"683\">Total MCA Fees:</strong> ₹1,60,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"811\">This fee covers the complete academic program, including coursework, labs, and academic delivery across semesters.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"1034\">From a value perspective, this fee is considered <strong data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"906\">affordable for a postgraduate IT program</strong>, especially considering the inclusion of advanced subjects like AI, Cloud Computing, Data Structures, and Software Development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1039\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ial7e9\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1094\">Flexible Payment Structure (Student-Friendly Model)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1251\">One of the biggest advantages of this MCA fee system is its <strong data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1188\">flexibility in payment modes</strong>, allowing students to choose based on their financial comfort.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16psrcv\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1287\">1. One-Time Payment Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1321\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zdypuc\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1321\"><strong data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1309\">Total Payment:</strong> ₹1,60,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qr42hw\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1343\">What This Means:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1398\">You pay the full program fee at once during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vyi0sv\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1417\">Key Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1575\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wmat7q\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1446\">No future payment stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pv2r68\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1480\">Simplified financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ptw9ae\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1524\">No semester or yearly tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10769pn\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1575\">Often preferred by financially stable students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6971mc\" data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1596\">Expert Insight:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1730\">This is the most <strong data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1645\">cost-stable option mentally</strong>, as students can fully focus on academics without worrying about recurring payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1735\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cjmxlm\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1764\">2. Yearly Payment Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1825\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r155fk\" data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1793\"><strong data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1783\">Annual Fee:</strong> ₹80,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p9vf7k\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1825\"><strong data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1815\">Total Duration:</strong> 2 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qr42hw\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1847\">What This Means:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1904\">You divide the total fee into two equal yearly payments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vyi0sv\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1923\">Key Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"2015\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i472h1\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1951\">Balanced financial load</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e7txkx\" data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1983\">Less frequent payment cycle</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10snaq1\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2015\">Easier for family budgeting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ocobte\" data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2039\">Strategic Insight:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2148\">This option works best for students who want <strong data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2147\">medium-term financial flexibility without monthly pressure</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2153\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bpbgqy\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2189\">3. Semester-Wise Payment Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2261\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frp4l8\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2224\"><strong data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2214\">Per Semester Fee:</strong> ₹40,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"38liom\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2261\"><strong data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2247\">Total Semesters:</strong> Typically 4</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qr42hw\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2283\">What This Means:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2339\">You pay the fee in smaller installments every semester.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vyi0sv\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2358\">Key Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2450\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c53r5w\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2388\">Lowest per-payment burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tfb2e5\" data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2412\">Maximum flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b4kxfh\" data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2450\">Easier for self-financed students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hoi6k0\" data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2474\">Important Warning:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2554\">While flexible, this requires strict discipline. Missing deadlines may lead to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2603\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ms5l3j\" data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2577\">Late fee penalties</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rpcw4q\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2603\">Academic restrictions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2608\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ww66y\" data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2643\">4. EMI (Education Loan) Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2722\">EMI facilities are available to support students who prefer monthly payments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vyi0sv\" data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2741\">Key Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2875\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gfbqfx\" data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2779\">Pay in small monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kvtcc3\" data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2818\">Reduces upfront financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmfjpn\" data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2875\">Makes higher education accessible to all backgrounds</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zopb4v\" data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2897\">Expert Advisory:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2919\">Before selecting EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"3057\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x9wxzw\" data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"2969\">Check interest rate structure (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c17ny7\" data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"3003\">Understand repayment duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v2s5i\" data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3057\">Avoid long-term financial burden without planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3193\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br>Students often choose EMI without calculating total repayment cost, leading to <strong data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3192\">higher long-term financial load</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3198\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12dpyl3\" data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3262\">Additional Fees Breakdown (Important for Real Cost Planning)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3344\">Apart from tuition fees, students must also consider mandatory academic charges.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3349\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3375\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3451\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"101tavf\" data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3414\">One-Time Registration Fee: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ein341\" data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3451\">Examination Fee: ₹3,000 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6hwxo\" data-start=\"3453\" data-end=\"3486\">Total Additional Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3584\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdlvf5\" data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3512\">Registration: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cvhln0\" data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3540\">Exams (2 years): ₹6,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k9ts5s\" data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3584\"><strong data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3584\">Total Additional Cost: ₹8,500 approx.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3589\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3tswjy\" data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3620\">For SAARC Country Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3622\" data-end=\"3688\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"linrs7\" data-start=\"3622\" data-end=\"3651\">Registration Fee: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b8eg6b\" data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3688\">Examination Fee: ₹3,750 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c4o446\" data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3715\">Total Additional Cost</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3815\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"120jgip\" data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3742\">Registration: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rqrjd4\" data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3770\">Exams (2 years): ₹7,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dx85s6\" data-start=\"3771\" data-end=\"3815\"><strong data-start=\"3773\" data-end=\"3815\">Total Additional Cost: ₹18,750 approx.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3820\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3851\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3853\" data-end=\"3922\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0d155\" data-start=\"3853\" data-end=\"3888\">One-Time Registration Fee: $150</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16pkt12\" data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3922\">Examination Fee: $50 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c4o446\" data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3949\">Total Additional Cost</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3951\" data-end=\"4041\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gvprwz\" data-start=\"3951\" data-end=\"3973\">Registration: $150</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1doszhm\" data-start=\"3974\" data-end=\"3999\">Exams (2 years): $100</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0s72z\" data-start=\"4000\" data-end=\"4041\"><strong data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4041\">Total Additional Cost: $250 approx.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4046\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"qv1na4\" data-start=\"4048\" data-end=\"4102\">Real Total Cost Analysis (Actual Financial Planning)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4104\" data-end=\"4253\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4104\" data-end=\"4123\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4104\" data-end=\"4123\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4104\" data-end=\"4115\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4123\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cost</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4253\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4171\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4158\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4171\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,60,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4208\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4198\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fees (India)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4208\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹8,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4253\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4236\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4211\" data-end=\"4235\">Total Estimated Cost</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4253\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4238\" data-end=\"4251\">₹1,68,500</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"645\">This MCA curriculum is structured as a <strong data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"596\">progressive technology pipeline</strong>, where each semester systematically builds from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"800\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gpcjwl\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"675\">Programming fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cq54jm\" data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"708\">Software development systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"twltha\" data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"746\">AI, statistics &amp; machine learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17oe23g\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"800\">Advanced AI systems (GenAI, NLP, Computer Vision)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"953\">Unlike traditional MCA programs, this structure is highly aligned with <strong data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"952\">modern industry demands in AI, Data Science, Cloud, and Intelligent Systems</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"958\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"a2fxw8\" data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1037\">Semester 1: Core Programming, Logic Building &amp; Computer Science Foundations</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1057\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"puxsj6\" data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1108\">Mathematical Foundations for Computer Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nprf48\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1159\">Computing Concepts and Problem Solving using C</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fbi6bn\" data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1181\">Operating Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2ewta\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1201\">Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u9xyq7\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1233\">Problem Solving using C Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fbf0sx\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1257\">Data Structures Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1282\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p9tok2\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1315\">What You Learn in Depth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1423\">Semester 1 focuses on building the <strong data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1398\">thinking framework of a computer scientist</strong>, not just coding skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wzjx7b\" data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1449\">Core Learning Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1822\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u7ld8j\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1524\"><strong data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1482\">Mathematical Foundations:</strong> Logical reasoning for algorithms and AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"atv1nl\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1605\"><strong data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1545\">C Programming:</strong> Low-level memory understanding and structured programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nxlc86\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1685\"><strong data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1630\">Operating Systems:</strong> Process management, memory handling, system behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1531g3a\" data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1758\"><strong data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1708\">Data Structures:</strong> Efficient data storage and retrieval techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kcnaix\" data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1822\"><strong data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1778\">AI Awareness:</strong> Introduction to future-ready technologies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1827\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1if56nb\" data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1848\">Skills Developed</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"2256\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vfhh2o\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1873\">Analytical Thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zbjk0o\" data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1900\">Computational Thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1y49x\" data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1929\">Programming Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51g7ul\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1961\">Software Development Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xkzlo0\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1990\">Algorithms Understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tppluj\" data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2018\">Data Structures Mastery</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yug4mb\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2048\">Operating System Concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f9yuqv\" data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2076\">Problem Solving Ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s6mrdn\" data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2112\">Software Engineering Principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sgewnh\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2138\">Mathematical Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17hz4o7\" data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2163\">Discrete Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1awdg9h\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2186\">Algorithm Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ffk9p\" data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2210\">Modular Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s0zyy\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2232\">Memory Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p7y63c\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2256\">System Architecture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2261\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c82z46\" data-start=\"2263\" data-e