ion-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"2920\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"3098\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fa2wed\" data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2951\">Advanced Database Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efpi4t\" data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"2972\">Java Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkem60\" data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"2993\">Web Technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"td1sk1\" data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3025\">Cloud Computing Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f4yrgq\" data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3059\">Advanced Database Systems Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u98j5u\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3084\">Java Programming Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10c2dgj\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3098\">ESG in IT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3103\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p9tok2\" data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3131\">What You Learn in Depth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3214\">This semester transitions you into <strong data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3213\">real-world software engineering practices</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1oj9pi4\" data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3240\">Key Technical Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3537\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bnma4z\" data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3308\"><strong data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3265\">Java Programming:</strong> Enterprise-grade application development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jk7220\" data-start=\"3309\" data-end=\"3360\"><strong data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3325\">Databases:</strong> SQL, schema design, optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19bg6b2\" data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3416\"><strong data-start=\"3363\" data-end=\"3383\">Web Development:</strong> Frontend + backend integration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16xlxdd\" data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3476\"><strong data-start=\"3419\" data-end=\"3439\">Cloud Computing:</strong> AWS and distributed systems basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hgvx7s\" data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3537\"><strong data-start=\"3479\" data-end=\"3493\">ESG in IT:</strong> Ethical, sustainable technology practices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3542\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1if56nb\" data-start=\"3544\" data-end=\"3563\">Skills Developed</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3929\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"adibxj\" data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3585\">Java Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mt9tpo\" data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3613\">Spring Framework Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"snfdg7\" data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"3639\">SQL &amp; Database Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hve2hf\" data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3653\">REST APIs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xfc8di\" data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3680\">Full Stack Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkem60\" data-start=\"3681\" data-end=\"3701\">Web Technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sy0smn\" data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3725\">Git Version Control</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10rudu\" data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3763\">Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gk7n55\" data-start=\"3764\" data-end=\"3794\">Microservices Architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5ferl0\" data-start=\"3795\" data-end=\"3819\">Application Security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rlcdia\" data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3841\">Database Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9zve62\" data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3870\">Cloud Computing Concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rsz3ir\" data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3894\">DevOps Introduction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m8qh13\" data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"3912\">Data Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"22v7yw\" data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"3929\">Unit Testing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"3934\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"3953\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"4149\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19momne\" data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"3982\">Java Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1me9o5p\" data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"4006\">Java 11 Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ghft9\" data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4039\">HTML &amp; JavaScript Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ky4mdg\" data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4065\">AWS Cloud Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bs6ghk\" data-start=\"4066\" data-end=\"4092\">SQL Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"njucuz\" data-start=\"4093\" data-end=\"4122\">Database Systems Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"szbzba\" data-start=\"4123\" data-end=\"4149\">Java Memory Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4154\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"4156\" data-end=\"4173\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4217\">Semester 2 is where students should start:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4218\" data-end=\"4337\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1086gjh\" data-start=\"4218\" data-end=\"4268\">Building <strong data-start=\"4229\" data-end=\"4266\">real applications (not just labs)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1llpe6d\" data-start=\"4269\" data-end=\"4299\">Creating GitHub portfolios</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2siyd1\" data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4337\">Practicing full-stack development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4385\">Without this, placement readiness remains low.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4387\" data-end=\"4390\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"o3enlo\" data-start=\"4392\" data-end=\"4453\">Semester 3: AI, Machine Learning &amp; Statistical Intelligence</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"4455\" data-end=\"4473\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4475\" data-end=\"4638\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r6w9b5\" data-start=\"4475\" data-end=\"4523\">Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dq3gv9\" data-start=\"4524\" data-end=\"4546\">Python Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16qob2n\" data-start=\"4547\" data-end=\"4589\">Statistical Methods in Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2u11k\" data-start=\"4590\" data-end=\"4605\">AI &amp; ML Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k4l0xf\" data-start=\"4606\" data-end=\"4620\">Python Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqmzod\" data-start=\"4621\" data-end=\"4638\">Open Elective</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4640\" data-end=\"4643\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p9tok2\" data-start=\"4645\" data-end=\"4671\">What You Learn in Depth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4758\">This semester introduces <strong data-start=\"4698\" data-end=\"4734\">data-driven intelligence systems</strong> and advanced analytics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lj2x2n\" data-start=\"4760\" data-end=\"4781\">Core Focus Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"5051\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sgtzy8\" data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4844\"><strong data-start=\"4785\" data-end=\"4813\">Artificial Intelligence:</strong> Intelligent decision systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3f983h\" data-start=\"4845\" data-end=\"4898\"><strong data-start=\"4847\" data-end=\"4868\">Machine Learning:</strong> Predictive modeling systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wruvjb\" data-start=\"4899\" data-end=\"4953\"><strong data-start=\"4901\" data-end=\"4924\">Python Programming:</strong> AI &amp; data science language</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181bj4c\" data-start=\"4954\" data-end=\"5004\"><strong data-start=\"4956\" data-end=\"4971\">Statistics:</strong> Mathematical foundation for ML</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6a4n9d\" data-start=\"5005\" data-end=\"5051\"><strong data-start=\"5007\" data-end=\"5024\">Data Science:</strong> Real-world data analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5053\" data-end=\"5056\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1if56nb\" data-start=\"5058\" data-end=\"5077\">Skills Developed</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5431\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e49hcd\" data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5114\">Artificial Intelligence Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"su3hj9\" data-start=\"5115\" data-end=\"5146\">Machine Learning Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dq3gv9\" data-start=\"5147\" data-end=\"5169\">Python Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18uu38h\" data-start=\"5170\" data-end=\"5194\">Statistical Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aj7e5n\" data-start=\"5195\" data-end=\"5235\">Probability &amp; Inferential Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tr9ufk\" data-start=\"5236\" data-end=\"5259\">Supervised Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e6cpmz\" data-start=\"5260\" data-end=\"5285\">Unsupervised Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3jvp8x\" data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5306\">Model Evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"va3un1\" data-start=\"5307\" data-end=\"5324\">Data Cleaning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"euezvp\" data-start=\"5325\" data-end=\"5348\">Feature Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124b7b4\" data-start=\"5349\" data-end=\"5371\">Hypothesis Testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"70b0ow\" data-start=\"5372\" data-end=\"5395\">Predictive Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h81f9a\" data-start=\"5396\" data-end=\"5412\">Scikit-learn</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ivvsoo\" data-start=\"5413\" data-end=\"5431\">NumPy &amp; Pandas</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5433\" data-end=\"5436\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"5438\" data-end=\"5455\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5457\" data-end=\"5740\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1snw0vn\" data-start=\"5457\" data-end=\"5493\">AI Foundations: Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s840fj\" data-start=\"5494\" data-end=\"5526\">Machine Learning with Python</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6bj2a\" data-start=\"5527\" data-end=\"5556\">Python Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mq7cjr\" data-start=\"5557\" data-end=\"5597\">Statistics Foundations (Level 1 &amp; 2)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k5x0c5\" data-start=\"5598\" data-end=\"5633\">Applied Machine Learning Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gfvbko\" data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5663\">Data Science Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12wzoum\" data-start=\"5664\" data-end=\"5695\">Data Analytics Introduction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eji9mi\" data-start=\"5696\" data-end=\"5716\">REST APIs Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o3hsf5\" data-start=\"5717\" data-end=\"5740\">Software Testing QA</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5742\" data-end=\"5745\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"5747\" data-end=\"5764\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5766\" data-end=\"5810\">This semester defines your career direction:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5811\" data-end=\"5862\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yd0nnd\" data-start=\"5811\" data-end=\"5826\">AI Engineer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q1u5e8\" data-start=\"5827\" data-end=\"5845\">Data Scientist</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3yz9b\" data-start=\"5846\" data-end=\"5862\">ML Developer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5864\" data-end=\"5981\">⚠️ Critical Mistake:<br data-start=\"5884\" data-end=\"5887\">Students often ignore statistics, but it is the <strong data-start=\"5935\" data-end=\"5980\">core backbone of machine learning success</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5983\" data-end=\"5986\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dmpqdo\" data-start=\"5988\" data-end=\"6047\">Semester 4: Advanced AI Systems, Big Data &amp; Generative AI</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"6049\" data-end=\"6067\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6069\" data-end=\"6268\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e26hdt\" data-start=\"6069\" data-end=\"6108\">Data Visualization &amp; Explainable AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g864l9\" data-start=\"6109\" data-end=\"6143\">Big Data Analytics with Hadoop</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"329gua\" data-start=\"6144\" data-end=\"6183\">Natural Language Processing &amp; GenAI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jb53cd\" data-start=\"6184\" data-end=\"6219\">Computer Vision &amp; Deep Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jt7oir\" data-start=\"6220\" data-end=\"6250\">Strategic Leadership in IT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1785yup\" data-start=\"6251\" data-end=\"6268\">Final Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6270\" data-end=\"6273\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p9tok2\" data-start=\"6275\" data-end=\"6301\">What You Learn in Depth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6303\" data-end=\"6394\">This is the <strong data-start=\"6315\" data-end=\"6363\">most advanced and industry-relevant semester</strong>, focused on modern AI systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12g84eb\" data-start=\"6396\" data-end=\"6416\">Key Focus Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6418\" data-end=\"6696\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vej1d5\" data-start=\"6418\" data-end=\"6474\"><strong data-start=\"6420\" data-end=\"6445\">Explainable AI (xAI):</strong> Understanding AI decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18pat63\" data-start=\"6475\" data-end=\"6528\"><strong data-start=\"6477\" data-end=\"6490\">Big Data:</strong> Large-scale data processing systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c9o4gm\" data-start=\"6529\" data-end=\"6592\"><strong data-start=\"6531\" data-end=\"6547\">NLP &amp; GenAI:</strong> Language models like ChatGPT-style systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ep5ns7\" data-start=\"6593\" data-end=\"6643\"><strong data-start=\"6595\" data-end=\"6615\">Computer Vision:</strong> Image recognition systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmo9sx\" data-start=\"6644\" data-end=\"6696\"><strong data-start=\"6646\" data-end=\"6664\">Deep Learning:</strong> Neural networks and AI models</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6698\" data-end=\"6701\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1if56nb\" data-start=\"6703\" data-end=\"6722\">Skills Developed</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6724\" data-end=\"7077\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9wyf6\" data-start=\"6724\" data-end=\"6746\">Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9uce0s\" data-start=\"6747\" data-end=\"6771\">Explainable AI (xAI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3f8di\" data-start=\"6772\" data-end=\"6798\">SHAP &amp; LIME Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jymbcy\" data-start=\"6799\" data-end=\"6821\">Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fzb3o9\" data-start=\"6822\" data-end=\"6842\">Hadoop Ecosystem</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g8xpp\" data-start=\"6843\" data-end=\"6859\">Apache Spark</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aw0g43\" data-start=\"6860\" data-end=\"6897\">Natural Language Processing (NLP)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5bk5t\" data-start=\"6898\" data-end=\"6923\">Generative AI (GenAI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kbi5fz\" data-start=\"6924\" data-end=\"6946\">Transformer Models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ng4ybj\" data-start=\"6947\" data-end=\"6969\">Hugging Face Tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lf5m3\" data-start=\"6970\" data-end=\"6989\">Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ktw4i0\" data-start=\"6990\" data-end=\"7007\">Deep Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8u5v1\" data-start=\"7008\" data-end=\"7029\">CNN Architectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vhxzxa\" data-start=\"7030\" data-end=\"7050\">Model Deployment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a9lmog\" data-start=\"7051\" data-end=\"7077\">AI System Architecture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7079\" data-end=\"7082\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"7084\" data-end=\"7101\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7103\" data-end=\"7430\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t2zlne\" data-start=\"7103\" data-end=\"7137\">Data Visualization Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vezg7h\" data-start=\"7138\" data-end=\"7156\">Explainable AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cg24s5\" data-start=\"7157\" data-end=\"7176\">Hadoop Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q2vhc\" data-start=\"7177\" data-end=\"7204\">Apache Spark Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10vm9vw\" data-start=\"7205\" data-end=\"7224\">NLP with Python</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mso0a2\" data-start=\"7225\" data-end=\"7257\">Generative AI for Developers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmkdgz\" data-start=\"7258\" data-end=\"7289\">Computer Vision Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"no3h45\" data-start=\"7290\" data-end=\"7318\">Deep Learning Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"117errt\" data-start=\"7319\" data-end=\"7343\">Strategic Leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13t6nzp\" data-start=\"7344\" data-end=\"7376\">Technology Leadership Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hr6up7\" data-start=\"7377\" data-end=\"7399\">DevOps Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12090he\" data-start=\"7400\" data-end=\"7430\">Agile Software Development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7432\" data-end=\"7435\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"7437\" data-end=\"7454\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7456\" data-end=\"7533\">Semester 4 is where students transition into <strong data-start=\"7501\" data-end=\"7532\">industry-level AI engineers</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h4ahxw\" data-start=\"7535\" data-end=\"7555\">Key Requirement:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7556\" data-end=\"7588\">Your final project must include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7589\" data-end=\"7644\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yqz6rl\" data-start=\"7589\" data-end=\"7604\">AI/ML model</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ns9wje\" data-start=\"7605\" data-end=\"7622\">Data pipeline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14e2ctw\" data-start=\"7623\" data-end=\"7644\">Deployment system</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7646\" data-end=\"7708\">Without this, placement competitiveness reduces significantly</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(291, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 218, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 01:27:07', '2026-06-16 07:04:44', '<p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"630\">The MCA admission process is a <strong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"528\">structured multi-stage system</strong> designed to ensure transparency, proper student verification, and smooth enrollment into the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"667\">Each step is carefully designed to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"798\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1585aqy\" data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"700\">Validate student eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ask566\" data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"730\">Confirm program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bk37cd\" data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"766\">Facilitate flexible fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gfnqft\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"798\">Secure final admission seat</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"941\">Understanding each stage clearly is important because every step directly affects your <strong data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"940\">final admission confirmation and academic journey</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"946\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wxpq7q\" data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"994\">Step-by-Step MCA Admission Process Explained</h1>\r\n<hr data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qdghf6\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1030\">STEP 1: Submit Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1140\">This is the <strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1088\">starting point of your admission journey</strong>, where your academic profile is officially created.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cwdw33\" data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1166\">What You Need to Do:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qxr7w\" data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1218\">Fill out the online application form carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efvtjq\" data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1288\">Enter personal details (name, contact information, address, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nhrc3m\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1353\">Provide academic qualifications (10+2 or graduation details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1stiqte\" data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1389\">Select your desired MCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fjr9bj\" data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1431\">Submit the application for processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1436\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1468\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1493\">This step creates your:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x6lrt9\" data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1523\">Official admission record</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fqjheg\" data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1558\">Eligibility evaluation profile</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ifsdu\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1596\">Communication channel for updates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1659\">Without this step, the admission process cannot move forward.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1664\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1684\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1736\">Many students make mistakes at this stage such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1830\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k3h2xl\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1767\">Incorrect spelling of name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ov0u24\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1794\">Wrong academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x9qrfv\" data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1830\">Invalid contact number or email</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1905\">⚠️ These errors can delay verification or even affect admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1910\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p3qaaw\" data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1944\">STEP 2: Enroll in Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"2033\">After submitting the application, the next step is <strong data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2032\">program enrollment confirmation</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nshoil\" data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2057\">What Happens Here:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2204\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"193lexj\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2114\">You select your final MCA program or specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fk2ptm\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2163\">You verify all application details carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1set5i4\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2204\">You confirm your enrollment decision</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2236\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2291\">This is a <strong data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2282\">critical decision-making stage</strong> because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2410\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jdd8uy\" data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2329\">Your program choice becomes final</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hmntx3\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2374\">Your academic track is officially locked</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kcx9e5\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2410\">Your fee structure is activated</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2415\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2435\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2492\">Before confirming enrollment, students should evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2657\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jnfe2m\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2575\">Career scope of chosen specialization (AI, Data Science, Cyber Security, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4qwnj9\" data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2615\">Industry demand for selected skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ogsn6\" data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2657\">Personal interest and long-term goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2786\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br>Choosing a program based only on trends often leads to lack of interest and poor academic performance later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2791\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cz9jn2\" data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2819\">STEP 3: Complete Payment</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2932\">Once enrollment is confirmed, you proceed to the <strong data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2891\">fee payment stage</strong>, which offers multiple flexible options.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"2937\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"148ijp2\" data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2967\">Payment Options Available</h2>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"2972\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h4qv18\" data-start=\"2974\" data-end=\"3004\">1. One-Time Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3066\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"so0mh4\" data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3034\">Pay full MCA fee at once</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"38w5pm\" data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3066\">Eligible for <strong data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3066\">15% discount</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3086\">Key Benefits:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3209\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wh4ujg\" data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3115\">No future payment burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7as9wc\" data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3140\">Maximum cost savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1whu2m4\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3172\">Simple financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b4xwjg\" data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3209\">No installment tracking required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3231\">Expert Insight:</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3321\">This option is best for students who want <strong data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3320\">financial simplicity and long-term savings</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3326\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ano7td\" data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3362\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3466\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5mzfby\" data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3400\">Pay through monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ma0mff\" data-start=\"3401\" data-end=\"3466\"><strong data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3464\">0% interest EMI option available (subject to eligibility)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3486\">Key Benefits:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3610\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kpxvur\" data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3524\">No large upfront payment required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1whhpi\" data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3551\">Easy monthly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12vwq8c\" data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3610\">Accessible for students from all financial backgrounds</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3636\">Important Advisory:</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3637\" data-end=\"3658\">Before selecting EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3659\" data-end=\"3763\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c17ny7\" data-start=\"3659\" data-end=\"3692\">Understand repayment duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"196nnc0\" data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3723\">Check loan terms carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kcet8q\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3763\">Ensure EMI fits your monthly budget</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3880\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br>Choosing EMI without understanding total repayment cost can create long-term financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"3885\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ge60cf\" data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3913\">STEP 4: Secure Your Seat</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3987\">This is the <strong data-start=\"3927\" data-end=\"3961\">final and most important stage</strong> of the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3989\" data-end=\"3992\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"igagno\" data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4024\">What Happens in This Step:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4229\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15e3nuq\" data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4087\">Payment is successfully completed OR EMI/loan is approved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cbh433\" data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4127\">Admission verification is completed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"anrnuq\" data-start=\"4128\" data-end=\"4184\">Your seat in the MCA program is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ik5yei\" data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4229\">You receive final admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4231\" data-end=\"4234\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"axh9kw\" data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4253\">Final Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4271\">After this step:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4397\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kjpaut\" data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4312\">You officially become an MCA student</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3t9ise\" data-start=\"4313\" data-end=\"4353\">You get access to academic resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"airk9\" data-start=\"4354\" data-end=\"4397\">Your classes and learning journey begin</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4399\" data-end=\"4402\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"4404\" data-end=\"4422\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4424\" data-end=\"4539\">This step marks the <strong data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"4493\">transition from applicant to enrolled student</strong>. Any delay in payment or approval may affect:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4540\" data-end=\"4625\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c29n8f\" data-start=\"4540\" data-end=\"4570\">Seat confirmation timeline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11h8d5\" data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4594\">Academic start date</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12c77jp\" data-start=\"4595\" data-end=\"4625\">Access to learning systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4627\" data-end=\"4630\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19ithmv\" data-start=\"4632\" data-end=\"4663\">MCA Admission Process Summary</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4958\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4693\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4693\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4672\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4672\" data-end=\"4682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Process</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4682\" data-end=\"4693\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4721\" data-end=\"4958\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4721\" data-end=\"4780\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4721\" data-end=\"4730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4751\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4751\" data-end=\"4780\">Admission profile created</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4781\" data-end=\"4838\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4781\" data-end=\"4790\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4790\" data-end=\"4811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Enrollment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4811\" data-end=\"4838\">Final program confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4839\" data-end=\"4896\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4839\" data-end=\"4848\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4848\" data-end=\"4869\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Completion</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4869\" data-end=\"4896\">Fee structure activated</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4897\" data-end=\"4958\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4897\" data-end=\"4906\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4906\" data-end=\"4926\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Seat Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4926\" data-end=\"4958\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission officially secured</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"707\">The eligibility criteria for MCA-related academic programs is designed to ensure that students entering the course have the <strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"706\">necessary academic foundation, logical thinking ability, and basic understanding of mathematics and computing concepts</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"741\">The basic eligibility statement:</p>\r\n<blockquote data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"819\">\r\n<p data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"819\">&ldquo;Pass in the (10+2) examination or Bachelor&rsquo;s degree depending on program&rdquo;</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"929\">indicates that eligibility varies depending on the <strong data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"928\">level of the program (undergraduate or postgraduate)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1038\">This means students may enter different stages of computer education based on their academic qualification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ui8hdy\" data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1084\">1. Eligibility Based on Program Level</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pcyeiu\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1145\">For Undergraduate-Level Programs (Foundation IT Courses)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1201\">If the program is at the undergraduate or entry level:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fqh4yy\" data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1226\">Basic Requirements:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1465\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175auas\" data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1291\">Must have passed <strong data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1289\">10+2 (Class 12) from a recognized board</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yup722\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1381\">Students <strong data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1379\">currently appearing for Class 12 examinations are also eligible to apply</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dcvli7\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1465\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1463\">NIOS board are also eligible if qualification is recognized</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gfycfj\" data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1489\">Key Understanding:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1530\">At this level, the focus is on building:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1628\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hffy80\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1562\">Basic programming awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17dfhxp\" data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1592\">Logical reasoning ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"we9gu3\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1628\">Foundational computer knowledge</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1633\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rnk215\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1668\">For MCA (Postgraduate Program)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1765\">MCA is a <strong data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1716\">professional postgraduate program</strong>, so eligibility is more advanced and structured.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fqh4yy\" data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1790\">Basic Requirements:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xocwrq\" data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1875\">Must have a <strong data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1873\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline from a recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13jvpsq\" data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"2011\">Minimum marks required:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ybrvuc\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1944\"><strong data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1944\">50% aggregate for general category</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13x78sl\" data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"2011\"><strong data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"2009\">45% aggregate for reserved categories (where applicable)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2016\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wtz4ef\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2064\">Mathematics Requirement (Important Factor)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2124\">Mathematics is considered a key subject for MCA readiness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2168\">Students must have studied Mathematics in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2205\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c6n9h4\" data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2184\">Class 12 OR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17h0qfa\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2205\">Graduation level</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2210\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"oh89d4\" data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2244\">Why Mathematics is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2292\">Mathematics is essential because MCA includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2420\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d24kin\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2314\">Programming logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jttlyt\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2335\">Algorithm design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mo16ta\" data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2355\">Data structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nonhxk\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2392\">Artificial intelligence concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19m91mt\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2420\">Machine learning models</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2499\">Without mathematical understanding, these subjects become difficult to grasp.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2504\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"p5mlp9\" data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2546\">2. Stream Eligibility (Who Can Apply?)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2637\">One of the biggest advantages of MCA eligibility is its <strong data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2636\">inclusive academic structure</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1oaohjp\" data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2659\">Eligible Streams:</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2753\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15m2ibq\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2680\">Science students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p9znzj\" data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2702\">Commerce students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nir0p\" data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2753\">Arts students (if graduation criteria are met)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2758\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yhhxxq\" data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2775\">Key Insight:</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2885\">Unlike many technical programs, MCA does not restrict students based on their stream, but instead focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2886\" data-end=\"2962\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o10de\" data-start=\"2886\" data-end=\"2908\">Analytical ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyz0gf\" data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2930\">Logical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ryx84\" data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2962\">Basic mathematics knowledge</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"2967\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1girpcn\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"2999\">3. NIOS Students Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3081\">Students from <strong data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3062\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are also eligible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q04fw\" data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3098\">Conditions:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3200\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"muhwng\" data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3148\">Qualification must be from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yl7qzd\" data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3200\">Academic documents must be valid and verifiable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej3e\" data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3221\">Important Note:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3306\">NIOS students are treated equally in admission evaluation as regular board students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3311\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w5ipfs\" data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3349\">4. Final Year Students Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3417\">Students who are in their final year of graduation can also apply.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q04fw\" data-start=\"3419\" data-end=\"3434\">Conditions:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3545\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14yvqy\" data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3486\">Admission is granted on a <strong data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3484\">provisional basis</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t5jpkm\" data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3545\">Final admission depends on submission of final results</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kx7bog\" data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3565\">Key Advantage:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3590\">This allows students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3675\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3j4v3\" data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3606\">Apply early</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gix909\" data-start=\"3607\" data-end=\"3648\">Secure admission before final results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ucgz1u\" data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3675\">Avoid admission delays</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3677\" data-end=\"3680\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1g38yll\" data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3727\">5. Minimum Academic Performance Requirement</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3729\" data-end=\"3882\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3729\" data-end=\"3763\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3729\" data-end=\"3763\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3729\" data-end=\"3740\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3763\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3882\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3838\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3817\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3838\" data-col-size=\"sm\">50% in Graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3882\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3861\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reserved Categories</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3861\" data-end=\"3882\" data-col-size=\"sm\">45% in Graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3884\" data-end=\"3887\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j3em7f\" data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3917\">Why Minimum Marks Matter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"3959\">Minimum marks ensure that students have:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3960\" data-end=\"4056\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rkx9f\" data-start=\"3960\" data-end=\"3984\">Academic consistency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3k5e8k\" data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"4013\">Conceptual understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g3jpxw\" data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4056\">Ability to handle technical coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4058\" data-end=\"4101\">Higher academic performance often improves:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4175\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u03jzk\" data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4123\">Admission chances</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"my26q1\" data-start=\"4124\" data-end=\"4147\">Academic confidence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1688lvi\" data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4175\">Placement opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"668\">The MCA program is structured with a <strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"547\">transparent and flexible fee system</strong>, designed to make higher education in computer applications accessible to students from different financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"703\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v72j90\" data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"703\"><strong data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"691\">Total MCA Fees:</strong> ₹1,60,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"822\">This amount represents the <strong data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"772\">complete tuition cost of the program</strong>, covering academic delivery across all semesters.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"1062\">From a value perspective, this fee is considered <strong data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"928\">cost-effective for a postgraduate technical program</strong>, especially when compared to similar industry-aligned MCA programs that include AI, programming, databases, and software development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1067\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wspzrm\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1121\">Flexible Payment Structure (Student-Centric Model)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1303\">One of the strongest advantages of this MCA fee system is its <strong data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1217\">flexibility in payment modes</strong>, allowing students to choose according to their financial comfort and planning style.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1308\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16psrcv\" data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1339\">1. One-Time Payment Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"54dsbk\" data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1382\"><strong data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1357\">Total Fee:</strong> ₹1,60,000 (full payment)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jpnx7i\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1403\">What This Means</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1460\">You pay the entire program fee at once during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1478\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1642\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bwp75b\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1509\">No future financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bquo5t\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1539\">Simplified fee management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rbof6d\" data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1580\">No reminders or installment tracking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nn03ks\" data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1642\">Complete focus on studies without financial interruptions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1662\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1808\">This option is ideal for students or families with strong financial stability. It also helps in <strong data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1807\">reducing long-term financial planning stress</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1813\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cjmxlm\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1842\">2. Yearly Payment Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1897\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r155fk\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1871\"><strong data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1861\">Annual Fee:</strong> ₹80,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1osgkiq\" data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1897\"><strong data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1887\">Duration:</strong> 2 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jpnx7i\" data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1918\">What This Means</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1979\">The total fee is divided into two equal yearly installments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"1997\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2117\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i472h1\" data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2025\">Balanced financial load</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0s233\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2059\">Easier budgeting for families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lhiok4\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2117\">Less frequent payment cycle compared to semester mode</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2140\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2257\">This option is suitable for students who want <strong data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2256\">moderate flexibility without monthly or frequent payment pressure</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2262\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bpbgqy\" data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2298\">3. Semester-Wise Payment Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2370\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frp4l8\" data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2333\"><strong data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2323\">Per Semester Fee:</strong> ₹40,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efatlj\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2370\"><strong data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2356\">Total Semesters:</strong> 4 (typically)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jpnx7i\" data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2391\">What This Means</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2462\">The fee is divided into four smaller installments paid every semester.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2480\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2595\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmx3a9\" data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2517\">Lowest individual payment amount</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mtgbw\" data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2559\">Maximum affordability and flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wqvw15\" data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2595\">Easier for self-funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"f2fz65\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2619\">Important Advisory</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2678\">While this option reduces financial pressure, it requires:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7g5icu\" data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2721\">Strict discipline in meeting deadlines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdci1q\" data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2766\">Proper financial planning every 6 months</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2845\">⚠️ Missing deadlines can lead to penalties or academic administrative issues.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2850\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ww66y\" data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2885\">4. EMI (Education Loan) Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2939\">Students can also opt for EMI-based payment support.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"2957\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"3085\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9rbjuq\" data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2989\">Pay in monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ybwizg\" data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3026\">Reduces upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v4l6h\" data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3085\">Makes higher education accessible to all income groups</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3105\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3126\">Before choosing EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3254\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tmwjls\" data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3170\">Check interest rate structure carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"efu55o\" data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3202\">Understand repayment tenure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hwuv9u\" data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3254\">Ensure monthly EMI fits your financial capacity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3387\">⚠️ Common Mistake: Students often select EMI without evaluating long-term repayment cost, which increases financial pressure later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3392\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"40xxwv\" data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3461\">Additional Fees Breakdown (Very Important for Real Cost Planning)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3565\">Apart from tuition fees, students must also consider mandatory academic charges based on their region.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3570\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3596\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3672\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"101tavf\" data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3635\">One-Time Registration Fee: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ein341\" data-start=\"3636\" data-end=\"3672\">Examination Fee: ₹3,000 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6hwxo\" data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3707\">Total Additional Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3805\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdlvf5\" data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3733\">Registration: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cvhln0\" data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3761\">Exams (2 years): ₹6,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k9ts5s\" data-start=\"3762\" data-end=\"3805\"><strong data-start=\"3764\" data-end=\"3805\">Total Additional Cost: ₹8,500 approx.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3807\" data-end=\"3810\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mr6e7y\" data-start=\"3812\" data-end=\"3848\">For Students from SAARC Countries</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3916\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"linrs7\" data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3879\">Registration Fee: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b8eg6b\" data-start=\"3880\" data-end=\"3916\">Examination Fee: ₹3,750 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c4o446\" data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3943\">Total Additional Cost</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"4043\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"120jgip\" data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"3970\">Registration: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rqrjd4\" data-start=\"3971\" data-end=\"3998\">Exams (2 years): ₹7,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dx85s6\" data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4043\"><strong data-start=\"4001\" data-end=\"4043\">Total Additional Cost: ₹18,750 approx.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4048\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"4050\" data-end=\"4079\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4081\" data-end=\"4150\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0d155\" data-start=\"4081\" data-end=\"4116\">One-Time Registration Fee: $150</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16pkt12\" data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4150\">Examination Fee: $50 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c4o446\" data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4177\">Total Additional Cost</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4269\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gvprwz\" data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4201\">Registration: $150</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1doszhm\" data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4227\">Exams (2 years): $100</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0s72z\" data-start=\"4228\" data-end=\"4269\"><strong data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4269\">Total Additional Cost: $250 approx.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4274\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vbwlxe\" data-start=\"4276\" data-end=\"4323\">Total MCA Cost (Real Financial Planning View)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4474\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4344\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4344\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4336\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4344\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cost</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4365\" data-end=\"4474\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4365\" data-end=\"4392\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4365\" data-end=\"4379\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4379\" data-end=\"4392\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,60,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4429\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4419\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fees (India)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4419\" data-end=\"4429\">₹8,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4430\" data-end=\"4474\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4430\" data-end=\"4457\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4432\" data-end=\"4456\">Total Estimated Cost</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4457\" data-end=\"4474\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4472\">₹1,68,500</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"710\">This MCA curriculum is designed as a <strong data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"588\">future-ready technology roadmap</strong>, gradually transforming students from <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"709\">basic programmers &rarr; AI engineers &rarr; advanced machine learning system architects</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"756\">The structure follows a logical progression:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12winsi\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"830\"><strong data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"777\">Semester 1&ndash;2:</strong> Core programming + software development foundation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ums89h\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"895\"><strong data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"848\">Semester 3:</strong> AI, ML, statistics, and predictive analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x6gdki\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"971\"><strong data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"913\">Semester 4:</strong> Advanced AI systems (GenAI, LLMs, MLOps, Deep Learning)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1102\">This ensures students are not just learning theory but are being prepared for <strong data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1101\">real-world AI and software engineering careers</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1107\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ryxag1\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1169\">Semester 1: Core Computing Foundations &amp; Programming Logic</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1189\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1414\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"puxsj6\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1240\">Mathematical Foundations for Computer Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nprf48\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1291\">Computing Concepts and Problem Solving using C</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fbi6bn\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1313\">Operating Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2ewta\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1333\">Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u9xyq7\" data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1365\">Problem Solving using C Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fbf0sx\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1389\">Data Structures Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1414\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1419\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p9tok2\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1447\">What You Learn in Depth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1547\">Semester 1 focuses on building the <strong data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1546\">core thinking structure of a computer science professional</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1g5rej\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1572\">Key Learning Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1935\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"934slt\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1646\"><strong data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1605\">Mathematical Foundations:</strong> Logical reasoning and algorithm design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"97e1yo\" data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1716\"><strong data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1667\">C Programming:</strong> Low-level programming and memory understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nxlc86\" data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1796\"><strong data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1741\">Operating Systems:</strong> Process management, memory handling, system behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11jbhzj\" data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1866\"><strong data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1819\">Data Structures:</strong> Efficient data storage and retrieval systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kw7gke\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1935\"><strong data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1886\">AI Awareness:</strong> Introduction to future technologies and trends</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1940\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1if56nb\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1961\">Skills Developed</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2395\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0rtsk\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1994\">Core Computing Competencies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w081eq\" data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2016\">Analytical Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zbjk0o\" data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2043\">Computational Thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1y49x\" data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2072\">Programming Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51g7ul\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2104\">Software Development Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xkzlo0\" data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2133\">Algorithms Understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tppluj\" data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2161\">Data Structures Mastery</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yug4mb\" data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2191\">Operating System Concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f9yuqv\" data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2219\">Problem Solving Ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5kijw7\" data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2251\">Software Engineering Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sgewnh\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2277\">Mathematical Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17hz4o7\" data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2302\">Discrete Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1awdg9h\" data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2325\">Algorithm Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ffk9p\" data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2349\">Modular Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s0zyy\" data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2371\">Memory Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p7y63c\" dat