"6181\" data-end=\"6210\">Generative AI development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwrwlv\" data-start=\"6211\" data-end=\"6231\">NLP applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ht1oh\" data-start=\"6232\" data-end=\"6255\">Advanced ML systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6257\" data-end=\"6260\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1003kxw\" data-start=\"6262\" data-end=\"6340\">Semester 4: Advanced Generative AI, RAG Systems &amp; Enterprise AI Architecture</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"6342\" data-end=\"6360\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6362\" data-end=\"6535\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tnyyo2\" data-start=\"6362\" data-end=\"6379\">Multimodal AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ce6pzx\" data-start=\"6380\" data-end=\"6420\">Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dt2c2x\" data-start=\"6421\" data-end=\"6451\">Fine-Tuning &amp; Optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iqwmfc\" data-start=\"6452\" data-end=\"6486\">AI Guardrails and Traceability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jt7oir\" data-start=\"6487\" data-end=\"6517\">Strategic Leadership in IT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1785yup\" data-start=\"6518\" data-end=\"6535\">Final Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6537\" data-end=\"6540\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p9tok2\" data-start=\"6542\" data-end=\"6568\">What You Learn in Depth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6570\" data-end=\"6678\">This is the <strong data-start=\"6582\" data-end=\"6677\">most advanced semester focused on real-world AI systems used in industry-scale applications</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12g84eb\" data-start=\"6680\" data-end=\"6700\">Key Focus Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6702\" data-end=\"7001\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e2mq4q\" data-start=\"6702\" data-end=\"6754\"><strong data-start=\"6704\" data-end=\"6722\">Multimodal AI:</strong> Text, image, audio AI systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"apv2n7\" data-start=\"6755\" data-end=\"6824\"><strong data-start=\"6757\" data-end=\"6773\">RAG Systems:</strong> AI systems connected to external knowledge bases</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ijckun\" data-start=\"6825\" data-end=\"6881\"><strong data-start=\"6827\" data-end=\"6843\">Fine-Tuning:</strong> Customizing LLMs for specific tasks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ht6zy2\" data-start=\"6882\" data-end=\"6936\"><strong data-start=\"6884\" data-end=\"6902\">AI Guardrails:</strong> Safe and responsible AI systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mqi4i5\" data-start=\"6937\" data-end=\"7001\"><strong data-start=\"6939\" data-end=\"6970\">Enterprise AI Architecture:</strong> Large-scale AI system design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7003\" data-end=\"7006\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1if56nb\" data-start=\"7008\" data-end=\"7027\">Skills Developed</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7029\" data-end=\"7418\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ubx2lw\" data-start=\"7029\" data-end=\"7054\">Multimodal AI Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jgu58w\" data-start=\"7055\" data-end=\"7095\">Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1waibjb\" data-start=\"7096\" data-end=\"7116\">Vector Databases</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tlvsng\" data-start=\"7117\" data-end=\"7136\">Semantic Search</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fqpk7p\" data-start=\"7137\" data-end=\"7159\">Prompt Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"162jqlz\" data-start=\"7160\" data-end=\"7189\">AI Agents &amp; Orchestration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mfuq51\" data-start=\"7190\" data-end=\"7221\">Function Calling &amp; Tool Use</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p51xwh\" data-start=\"7222\" data-end=\"7248\">Fine-Tuning Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u4h497\" data-start=\"7249\" data-end=\"7279\">LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1duqkpy\" data-start=\"7280\" data-end=\"7302\">Model Optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b6q2rf\" data-start=\"7303\" data-end=\"7327\">Distributed Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vhxzxa\" data-start=\"7328\" data-end=\"7348\">Model Deployment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19xvl3v\" data-start=\"7349\" data-end=\"7368\">LLM Integration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18l9y9s\" data-start=\"7369\" data-end=\"7399\">Enterprise AI Architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l653vo\" data-start=\"7400\" data-end=\"7418\">Responsible AI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7420\" data-end=\"7423\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"7425\" data-end=\"7442\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7444\" data-end=\"7739\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmkdgz\" data-start=\"7444\" data-end=\"7475\">Computer Vision Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8vjeax\" data-start=\"7476\" data-end=\"7506\">Deep Learning Optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1831vnr\" data-start=\"7507\" data-end=\"7536\">Generative AI Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pxnjga\" data-start=\"7537\" data-end=\"7575\">AI-Powered Application Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1desqtd\" data-start=\"7576\" data-end=\"7605\">Responsible AI Principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12ur3mg\" data-start=\"7606\" data-end=\"7641\">AI Governance &amp; Risk Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ry9fc\" data-start=\"7642\" data-end=\"7680\">Strategic Leadership in Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12090he\" data-start=\"7681\" data-end=\"7711\">Agile Software Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z8nfuu\" data-start=\"7712\" data-end=\"7739\">SDLC Advanced Practices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7741\" data-end=\"7744\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"7746\" data-end=\"7763\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7765\" data-end=\"7882\">Semester 4 transforms students into <strong data-start=\"7801\" data-end=\"7881\">industry-ready AI engineers capable of building production-grade LLM systems</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s1bivc\" data-start=\"7884\" data-end=\"7909\">Critical Requirement:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7910\" data-end=\"7944\">Your final project should include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7945\" data-end=\"8048\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywyapv\" data-start=\"7945\" data-end=\"7970\">LLM-based application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fcenu6\" data-start=\"7971\" data-end=\"7993\">RAG implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wz0ger\" data-start=\"7994\" data-end=\"8017\">Deployment pipeline</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vk6wog\" data-start=\"8018\" data-end=\"8048\">Real-world problem solving</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8050\" data-end=\"8108\">Without this, industry readiness is significantly reduced.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(293, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 264, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 01:59:32', '2026-06-16 07:05:21', '<p data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"658\">The MCA admission process is a <strong data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"559\">structured step-by-step enrollment system</strong> designed to ensure smooth verification, transparent selection, and hassle-free student onboarding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"787\">Each stage in this process plays a specific role in moving a student from <strong data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"786\">initial application to final confirmed admission</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"819\">The complete journey includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qs7656\" data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"846\">Application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"69hmvn\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"883\">Program selection and enrollment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bvl8ji\" data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"924\">Fee payment or financial arrangement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a5qsco\" data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"952\">Final seat confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"957\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wxpq7q\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1005\">Step-by-Step MCA Admission Process Explained</h1>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qdghf6\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1041\">STEP 1: Submit Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1152\">This is the <strong data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1095\">first stage of the admission journey</strong>, where a student officially enters the admission system.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cwdw33\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1178\">What You Need to Do:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1449\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qxr7w\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1230\">Fill out the online application form carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18bo13n\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1304\">Enter personal details such as name, contact information, and address</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nhrc3m\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1369\">Provide academic qualifications (10+2 or graduation details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lycgf\" data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1407\">Select your preferred MCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fjr9bj\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1449\">Submit the application for processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1454\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1486\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1511\">This step creates your:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1637\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fwmh8r\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1542\">Official admission profile</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mphez5\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1578\">Eligibility verification record</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v7xupw\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1637\">Communication channel for updates and admission status</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1700\">Without this step, further admission processing cannot begin.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1705\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1725\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1789\">Students should be very careful while filling details because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1965\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1859a2g\" data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1847\">Incorrect academic information can delay verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lmko8n\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1905\">Wrong contact details may block communication updates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xnfjw6\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1965\">Spelling mistakes may create documentation issues later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2039\">Accuracy at this stage ensures <strong data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2038\">smooth and fast admission processing</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2044\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p3qaaw\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2078\">STEP 2: Enroll in Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2163\">After application submission, the next step is <strong data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2162\">program enrollment confirmation</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nshoil\" data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2187\">What Happens Here:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2334\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19yepj6\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2244\">You choose your final MCA program or specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fk2ptm\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2293\">You verify all application details carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1set5i4\" data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2334\">You confirm your enrollment decision</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2339\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2366\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2421\">This is a <strong data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2412\">critical decision-making stage</strong> because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2573\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"it92mw\" data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2461\">Your selected program becomes final</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qgzn9t\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2513\">Your academic structure and subjects are locked</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9k190h\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2573\">Your fee structure is finalized based on program choice</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2578\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2598\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2655\">Before confirming enrollment, students should evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2797\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13zu9q9\" data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2705\">Career opportunities in chosen specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qa6taj\" data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2764\">Industry demand for skills (AI, Cloud, Software, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s77r0\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2797\">Long-term professional goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2926\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br>Choosing a program based only on popularity often leads to lack of interest and weaker academic performance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2931\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cz9jn2\" data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2959\">STEP 3: Complete Payment</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"3077\">Once enrollment is confirmed, students proceed to the <strong data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3036\">fee payment stage</strong>, which offers multiple flexible options.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3082\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"148ijp2\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3112\">Payment Options Available</h2>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3117\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h4qv18\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3149\">1. One-Time Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3211\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"so0mh4\" data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3179\">Pay full MCA fee at once</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"38w5pm\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3211\">Eligible for <strong data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3211\">15% discount</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3231\">Key Benefits:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3358\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wmat7q\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3260\">No future payment stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7as9wc\" data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3285\">Maximum cost savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"917kpq\" data-start=\"3286\" data-end=\"3321\">Simplified financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b4xwjg\" data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3358\">No installment tracking required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3380\">Expert Insight:</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3499\">This option is ideal for students who prefer <strong data-start=\"3426\" data-end=\"3498\">financial stability and long-term savings without recurring payments</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3504\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ano7td\" data-start=\"3506\" data-end=\"3540\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3637\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5mzfby\" data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3578\">Pay through monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dw72vc\" data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3637\"><strong data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3635\">0% interest EMI available (subject to eligibility)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3639\" data-end=\"3657\">Key Benefits:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3787\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2fjb1v\" data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3695\">No large upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1whhpi\" data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3722\">Easy monthly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b3h63s\" data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3787\">Accessible for students from different financial backgrounds</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3813\">Important Advisory:</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3834\">Before choosing EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3835\" data-end=\"3934\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19cgxhr\" data-start=\"3835\" data-end=\"3872\">Understand total repayment amount</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sr74fy\" data-start=\"3873\" data-end=\"3899\">Check repayment tenure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7wxz5n\" data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3934\">Ensure EMI fits monthly budget</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"4065\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br>Focusing only on EMI amount without calculating total repayment cost can lead to long-term financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4067\" data-end=\"4070\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ge60cf\" data-start=\"4072\" data-end=\"4098\">STEP 4: Secure Your Seat</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4172\">This is the <strong data-start=\"4112\" data-end=\"4171\">final and most important stage of the admission process</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4177\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"igagno\" data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4209\">What Happens in This Step:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4211\" data-end=\"4414\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15e3nuq\" data-start=\"4211\" data-end=\"4272\">Payment is successfully completed OR EMI/loan is approved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3g0m4\" data-start=\"4273\" data-end=\"4312\">Admission verification is finalized</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"anrnuq\" data-start=\"4313\" data-end=\"4369\">Your seat in the MCA program is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ik5yei\" data-start=\"4370\" data-end=\"4414\">You receive final admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4416\" data-end=\"4419\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"axh9kw\" data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4438\">Final Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4456\">After this step:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4457\" data-end=\"4582\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kjpaut\" data-start=\"4457\" data-end=\"4497\">You officially become an MCA student</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3t9ise\" data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4538\">You get access to academic resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"airk9\" data-start=\"4539\" data-end=\"4582\">Your classes and learning journey begin</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4584\" data-end=\"4587\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4607\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4609\" data-end=\"4724\">This step marks the <strong data-start=\"4629\" data-end=\"4678\">transition from applicant to enrolled student</strong>. Any delay in payment or approval may affect:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4725\" data-end=\"4808\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vew7h0\" data-start=\"4725\" data-end=\"4753\">Seat confirmation timing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11h8d5\" data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4777\">Academic start date</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12c77jp\" data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4808\">Access to learning systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4810\" data-end=\"4813\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19ithmv\" data-start=\"4815\" data-end=\"4846\">MCA Admission Process Summary</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4848\" data-end=\"5145\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4848\" data-end=\"4876\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4848\" data-end=\"4876\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4848\" data-end=\"4855\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4865\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Process</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4865\" data-end=\"4876\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4904\" data-end=\"5145\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4904\" data-end=\"4963\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4904\" data-end=\"4913\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4913\" data-end=\"4934\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4934\" data-end=\"4963\">Admission profile created</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4964\" data-end=\"5025\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4964\" data-end=\"4973\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4973\" data-end=\"4994\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Enrollment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4994\" data-end=\"5025\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program selection finalized</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5083\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5035\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5035\" data-end=\"5056\">Payment Completion</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5056\" data-end=\"5083\">Fee structure activated</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5084\" data-end=\"5145\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5084\" data-end=\"5093\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5093\" data-end=\"5113\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Seat Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5113\" data-end=\"5145\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission officially secured</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"725\">The eligibility criteria for MCA-related academic programs is designed to ensure that students entering the course have a <strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"724\">proper academic foundation, logical thinking ability, and basic understanding of mathematics and computing concepts</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"741\">The statement:</p>\r\n<blockquote data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<p data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"838\">&ldquo;Basic eligibility: Pass in the (10+2) examination or Bachelor\'s degree depending on program&rdquo;</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"1021\">means that eligibility is <strong data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"906\">not fixed at a single academic level</strong>. Instead, it changes depending on whether the program is <strong data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1020\">undergraduate-level or postgraduate-level (like MCA)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1143\">This ensures that students enter the program at a level that matches their <strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1142\">academic readiness and learning capacity</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1q9q86g\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1188\">1. Eligibility Based on Program Type</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11l44q7\" data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1258\">For Undergraduate-Level Programs (Foundation or Entry IT Courses)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1365\">If the program is at an entry or undergraduate level, the eligibility requirements are relatively simple.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fqh4yy\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1390\">Basic Requirements:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1675\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175auas\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1456\">Must have passed <strong data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1454\">10+2 (Class 12) from a recognized board</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yup722\" data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1546\">Students <strong data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1544\">currently appearing for Class 12 examinations are also eligible to apply</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nty72q\" data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1675\">Students from <strong data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1610\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are also eligible if the qualification is valid and recognized</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1680\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jpnx7i\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1701\">What This Means</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1745\">At this stage, students are introduced to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1878\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fknuv5\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1777\">Basic computer fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qaewr1\" data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1806\">Logical reasoning skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xmaua6\" data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1844\">Introductory programming concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ovsrkn\" data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1878\">Foundation-level IT knowledge</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1974\">This stage is designed for beginners who are just entering the field of computer applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"1979\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1eyap6j\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2028\">2. Eligibility for MCA (Postgraduate Program)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2155\">MCA is a <strong data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2075\">professional postgraduate degree</strong>, so the eligibility requirements are more structured and academically advanced.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fqh4yy\" data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2180\">Basic Requirements:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2402\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xocwrq\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2266\">Must have a <strong data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2264\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline from a recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"839dei\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2402\">Minimum required marks:\r\n<ul data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2402\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ybrvuc\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2335\"><strong data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2335\">50% aggregate for general category</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13x78sl\" data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2402\"><strong data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2400\">45% aggregate for reserved categories (where applicable)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2407\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lhn44y\" data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2453\">Mathematics Requirement (Very Important)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2547\">Mathematics is an essential requirement for MCA because it supports core technical subjects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2598\">Students must have studied Mathematics in either:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2642\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nl8z3o\" data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2619\"><strong data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2613\">Class 12</strong>, OR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f7ikau\" data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2642\"><strong data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2642\">Graduation level</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2647\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9x27q8\" data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2688\">Why Mathematics is Important in MCA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2725\">Mathematics is used extensively in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2886\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d24kin\" data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2747\">Programming logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g47zd\" data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2782\">Algorithms and data structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a9zta9\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2831\">Artificial intelligence and machine learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gluvln\" data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2852\">Database systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j7bt4d\" data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2886\">Software engineering concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2975\">Without mathematical understanding, these subjects become significantly more difficult.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"2980\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yhgkho\" data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3022\">3. Stream Eligibility (Who Can Apply?)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3115\">One of the key strengths of MCA eligibility is its <strong data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3114\">flexibility across academic streams</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13xzlnr\" data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3141\">Eligible Backgrounds:</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3261\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"myp6uy\" data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3170\">Science stream students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mslysz\" data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3199\">Commerce stream students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3lioa\" data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3261\">Arts stream students (if graduation requirements are met)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3266\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"123vz07\" data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3283\">Key Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3285\" data-end=\"3371\">MCA does not restrict students based on their academic stream. Instead, it focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3490\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l6p0d5\" data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3400\">Logical thinking ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lmbv9e\" data-start=\"3401\" data-end=\"3422\">Analytical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k7e388\" data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3453\">Problem-solving capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pzhlo\" data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3490\">Basic mathematical understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3551\">This makes MCA a <strong data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3550\">highly inclusive professional program</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3553\" data-end=\"3556\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"e08jij\" data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3592\">4. Eligibility for NIOS Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3674\">Students from <strong data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3655\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are also eligible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q04fw\" data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3691\">Conditions:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3815\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18tzgup\" data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3756\">Qualification must be from a <strong data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3754\">recognized and valid board</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"761a26\" data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3815\">Academic documents must be verifiable during admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3820\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3840\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3943\">NIOS students are treated equally with regular board students if they meet all academic requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"3948\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rwp1hu\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3990\">5. Eligibility for Final Year Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4070\">Students who are currently in the <strong data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4054\">final year of graduation</strong> can also apply.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q04fw\" data-start=\"4072\" data-end=\"4087\">Conditions:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4089\" data-end=\"4212\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14yvqy\" data-start=\"4089\" data-end=\"4140\">Admission is granted on a <strong data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4138\">provisional basis</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mkp2uw\" data-start=\"4141\" data-end=\"4212\">Final admission is confirmed after submission of final year results</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4214\" data-end=\"4217\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pyzr8r\" data-start=\"4219\" data-end=\"4250\">Advantage of This Provision</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4252\" data-end=\"4276\">This allows students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4277\" data-end=\"4396\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1adgc7p\" data-start=\"4277\" data-end=\"4326\">Apply early without waiting for final results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14lf25n\" data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4358\">Secure admission in advance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mhr0zt\" data-start=\"4359\" data-end=\"4396\">Avoid missing admission deadlines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4398\" data-end=\"4401\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1u4blyi\" data-start=\"4403\" data-end=\"4448\">6. Minimum Academic Performance Requirement</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4603\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4484\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4484\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4461\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4461\" data-end=\"4484\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4519\" data-end=\"4603\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4519\" data-end=\"4559\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4519\" data-end=\"4538\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4538\" data-end=\"4559\">50% in Graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4603\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4582\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reserved Categories</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4582\" data-end=\"4603\" data-col-size=\"sm\">45% in Graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"695\">The MCA program is designed with a <strong data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"584\">clear, structured, and flexible fee system</strong> that allows students from different financial backgrounds to pursue higher education in computer applications.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"730\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v72j90\" data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"730\"><strong data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"718\">Total MCA Fees:</strong> ₹1,60,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"917\">This amount represents the <strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"810\">complete tuition fee for the entire MCA program</strong>, covering academic learning, technical training, lab work, and structured coursework across all semesters.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"1146\">Compared to many postgraduate technical programs, this fee structure is considered <strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1037\">affordable and student-friendly</strong>, especially considering the inclusion of modern subjects like AI, cloud computing, and software development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1151\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ora2rr\" data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1216\">Flexible Payment Structure (Designed for Student Convenience)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1376\">One of the most important features of this MCA program is its <strong data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1307\">flexible payment system</strong>, which allows students to choose a plan based on financial capacity.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16psrcv\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1412\">1. One-Time Payment Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1463\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bxrnxu\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1463\"><strong data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1430\">Total Fee:</strong> ₹1,60,000 (full payment at once)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jpnx7i\" data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1484\">What This Means</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1558\">Students pay the entire program fee in a single payment during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1576\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"broqvp\" data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1607\">No future financial stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gk8ref\" data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1636\">Simplified fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bi49gr\" data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1686\">Maximum overall savings in long-term planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b4xwjg\" data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1723\">No installment tracking required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1743\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1878\">This option is ideal for students who want <strong data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1855\">financial stability and complete freedom from recurring payments</strong> throughout the course.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1883\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cjmxlm\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1912\">2. Yearly Payment Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1967\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r155fk\" data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1941\"><strong data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1931\">Annual Fee:</strong> ₹80,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1osgkiq\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1967\"><strong data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1957\">Duration:</strong> 2 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jpnx7i\" data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1988\">What This Means</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2057\">The total MCA fee is divided into <strong data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2056\">two equal yearly installments</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2075\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2204\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o9dvoe\" data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2107\">Balanced financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vk6k7p\" data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2148\">Easier yearly budgeting for families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t93smf\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2204\">Reduced payment frequency compared to semester mode</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2227\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2332\">This option is suitable for students who prefer <strong data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2331\">moderate flexibility without monthly EMI complexity</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2337\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bpbgqy\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2373\">3. Semester-Wise Payment Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2435\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frp4l8\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2408\"><strong data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2398\">Per Semester Fee:</strong> ₹40,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1brk8ih\" data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2435\"><strong data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2431\">Total Semesters:</strong> 4</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jpnx7i\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2456\">What This Means</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2519\">The fee is divided into four equal parts, paid every semester.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2537\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2658\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ai1tgr\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2578\">Low financial burden per installment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16t73hw\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2626\">High affordability for self-funded students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fu6w5c\" data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2658\">Better cash flow management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"f2fz65\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2682\">Important Advisory</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2723\">Although flexible, this option requires:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2811\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ahyoel\" data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2766\">Strict discipline in payment deadlines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdci1q\" data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2811\">Proper financial planning every 6 months</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2880\">⚠️ Missing payments may lead to penalties or administrative delays.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2885\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ww66y\" data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2920\">4. EMI (Education Loan) Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2973\">Students can also choose EMI-based payment support.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"2991\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3120\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wdk4qe\" data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3032\">Pay monthly instead of lump sum fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rttxl\" data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3071\">Reduces immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ll6fxf\" data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3120\">Makes MCA accessible to wider student groups</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3140\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3161\">Before choosing EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3288\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gkdmlp\" data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3194\">Check total repayment amount</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qiqbx8\" data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3244\">Understand interest structure (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1z0ts8w\" data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3288\">Ensure EMI fits monthly income planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3435\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br>Students often focus only on monthly EMI amount but ignore total repayment cost, which increases long-term financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3440\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"40xxwv\" data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3509\">Additional Fees Breakdown (Very Important for Real Cost Planning)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3635\">Apart from tuition fees, students must also pay <strong data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3608\">mandatory academic and administrative charges</strong> depending on their region.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3637\" data-end=\"3640\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3666\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3742\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"101tavf\" data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3705\">One-Time Registration Fee: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ein341\" data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3742\">Examination Fee: ₹3,000 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c4o446\" data-start=\"3744\" data-end=\"3769\">Total Additional Cost</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3771\" data-end=\"3873\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdlvf5\" data-start=\"3771\" data-end=\"3795\">Registration: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ubx4x1\" data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3829\">Examination (2 years): ₹6,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k9ts5s\" data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3873\"><strong data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3873\">Total Additional Cost: ₹8,500 approx.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3878\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vl7an\" data-start=\"3880\" data-end=\"3914\">For Students in SAARC Countries</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"3982\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"linrs7\" data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"3945\">Registration Fee: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b8eg6b\" data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"3982\">Examination Fee: ₹3,750 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c4o446\" data-start=\"3984\" data-end=\"4009\">Total Additional Cost</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4011\" data-end=\"4115\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"120jgip\" data-start=\"4011\" data-end=\"4036\">Registration: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3hoko1\" data-start=\"4037\" data-end=\"4070\">Examination (2 years): ₹7,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dx85s6\" data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4115\"><strong data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4115\">Total Additional Cost: ₹18,750 approx.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4120\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4151\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4153\" data-end=\"4222\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0d155\" data-start=\"4153\" data-end=\"4188\">One-Time Registration Fee: $150</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16pkt12\" data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4222\">Examination Fee: $50 per year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c4o446\" data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4249\">Total Additional Cost</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4251\" data-end=\"4347\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gvprwz\" data-start=\"4251\" data-end=\"4273\">Registration: $150</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2c8y4j\" data-start=\"4274\" data-end=\"4305\">Examination (2 years): $100</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0s72z\" data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4347\"><strong data-start=\"4308\" data-end=\"4347\">Total Additional Cost: $250 approx.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4349\" data-end=\"4352\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"kbzc3v\" data-start=\"4354\" data-end=\"4406\">Real Total Cost Analysis (Complete Financial View)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4557\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4427\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4427\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4419\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4419\" data-end=\"4427\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cost</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4557\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4475\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4462\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"4475\">₹1,60,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4476\" data-end=\"4512\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4476\" data-end=\"4502\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fees (India)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4512\">₹8,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4557\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4540\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4515\" data-end=\"4539\">Total Estimated Cost</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4540\" data-end=\"4557\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4555\">₹1,68,500</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"633\">This MCA curriculum is designed as a <strong data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"594\">modern industry-aligned technical program</strong> that prepares students for careers in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"787\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ly71mx\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"654\">Cloud Computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u08d4u\" data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"679\">Software Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bfvu\" data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"703\">DevOps &amp; Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajo29n\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"731\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xfc8di\" data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"758\">Full Stack Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hbo9vs\" data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"787\">Multi-Cloud Architecture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"895\">The program follows a <strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"841\">progressive learning model</strong>, where each semester builds stronger technical depth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fs7j9h\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"970\">Semester 1: Programming Foundations &amp; Core Computer Science Basics</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"990\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1215\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"puxsj6\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1041\">Mathematical Foundations for Computer Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nprf48\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1092\">Computing Concepts and Problem Solving using C</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fbi6bn\" data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1114\">Operating Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2ewta\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1134\">Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u9xyq7\" data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1166\">Problem Solving using C Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fbf0sx\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1190\">Data Structures Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1215\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1220\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gnvpe6\" data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1249\">What You Learn in Detail</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1410\">Semester 1 builds the <strong data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1321\">core foundation of computer science thinking</strong>. It focuses on logic building, programming fundamentals, and system-level understanding.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wzjx7b\" data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1436\">Core Learning Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1625\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kbs2w7\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1473\">Mathematical logic for computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a5af00\" data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1513\">C programming for structured coding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nx7678\" data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1547\">Operating system fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p536z8\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1588\">Data structures for efficient coding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5oafci\" data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1625\">Problem-solving using algorithms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1630\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1if56nb\" data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1651\">Skills Developed</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"2046\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w081eq\" data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1674\">Analytical Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zbjk0o\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1701\">Computational Thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1y49x\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1730\">Programming Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51g7ul\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1762\">Software Development Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xkzlo0\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1791\">Algorithms Understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2ewta\" data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1811\">Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17t5lps\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1842\">Operating Systems Concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f9yuqv\" data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1870\">Problem Solving Ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5kijw7\" data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1902\">Software Engineering Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sgewnh\" data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1928\">Mathematical Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17hz4o7\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1953\">Discrete Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1awdg9h\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1976\">Algorithm Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ffk9p\" data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2000\">Modular Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s0zyy\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2022\">Memory Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p7y63c\" data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2046\">System Architecture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2051\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2070\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2362\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"104kjvr\" data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2113\">Programming Foundations: Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wi8mov\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2142\">C Programming Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"reod1i\" data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2174\">Data Structures Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mtgant\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2202\">Operating System Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17hz4o7\" data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2227\">Discrete Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15dagkq\" data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2254\">Python Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13mhcd2\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2304\">AI Foundations (Thinking Machines &amp; ML Intro)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1co00im\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2336\">Computer Science Principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7zsgn3\" data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2362\">Algorithm Foundations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2367\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2386\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2501\">Semester 1 is the <strong data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2452\">foundation of all future technical success</strong>. Weak understanding here leads to difficulty in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2562\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tuwmeh\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2521\">Cloud computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo5ho\" data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2543\">DevOps automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wmquf1\" data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2562\">AI/ML concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2567\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"u1kehb\" data-start=\