" data-end=\"5871\">Google Cloud Platform Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jt7oir\" data-start=\"5872\" data-end=\"5902\">Strategic Leadership in IT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1785yup\" data-start=\"5903\" data-end=\"5920\">Final Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5922\" data-end=\"5925\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gnvpe6\" data-start=\"5927\" data-end=\"5954\">What You Learn in Detail</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5956\" data-end=\"6053\">This semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"5981\" data-end=\"6052\">enterprise-level cloud infrastructure and DevOps automation systems</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6055\" data-end=\"6058\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hc8idf\" data-start=\"6060\" data-end=\"6075\">Core Areas:</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6077\" data-end=\"6101\">DevOps &amp; Automation</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6102\" data-end=\"6180\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ujp3iz\" data-start=\"6102\" data-end=\"6121\">CI/CD pipelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5qcbb\" data-start=\"6122\" data-end=\"6146\">Automation workflows</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bveosq\" data-start=\"6147\" data-end=\"6180\">Continuous deployment systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6182\" data-end=\"6213\">Containers &amp; Microservices</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6214\" data-end=\"6300\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e8gjx1\" data-start=\"6214\" data-end=\"6241\">Docker containerization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15uffg1\" data-start=\"6242\" data-end=\"6270\">Kubernetes orchestration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12hfad6\" data-start=\"6271\" data-end=\"6300\">Microservice architecture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6302\" data-end=\"6326\">Multi-Cloud Systems</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6327\" data-end=\"6415\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r6z8xq\" data-start=\"6327\" data-end=\"6360\">AWS + Azure + GCP integration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kgp7zy\" data-start=\"6361\" data-end=\"6390\">Cloud architecture design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ehsjb7\" data-start=\"6391\" data-end=\"6415\">Hybrid cloud systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6417\" data-end=\"6420\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1if56nb\" data-start=\"6422\" data-end=\"6441\">Skills Developed</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6443\" data-end=\"6787\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s0vol1\" data-start=\"6443\" data-end=\"6470\">Docker Containerization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13iapg1\" data-start=\"6471\" data-end=\"6499\">Kubernetes Orchestration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j3e3ej\" data-start=\"6500\" data-end=\"6519\">CI/CD Pipelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s433e4\" data-start=\"6520\" data-end=\"6541\">DevOps Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oveavc\" data-start=\"6542\" data-end=\"6565\">Jenkins Integration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ocbmji\" data-start=\"6566\" data-end=\"6585\">GitHub Workflow</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19wyg6p\" data-start=\"6586\" data-end=\"6618\">Microsoft Azure Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gknrju\" data-start=\"6619\" data-end=\"6650\">Google Cloud Platform (GCP)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v5csd3\" data-start=\"6651\" data-end=\"6689\">Infrastructure as Code (Terraform)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"popdf3\" data-start=\"6690\" data-end=\"6708\">Cloud Security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aiuzl9\" data-start=\"6709\" data-end=\"6727\">Load Balancing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rmh8xt\" data-start=\"6728\" data-end=\"6757\">High Availability Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lnympq\" data-start=\"6758\" data-end=\"6787\">Cloud Architecture Design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6789\" data-end=\"6792\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"6794\" data-end=\"6811\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6813\" data-end=\"7059\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"svux4h\" data-start=\"6813\" data-end=\"6834\">Docker Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14s2byf\" data-start=\"6835\" data-end=\"6860\">Kubernetes Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdrfs\" data-start=\"6861\" data-end=\"6888\">CI/CD Pipeline Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vj272h\" data-start=\"6889\" data-end=\"6911\">Jenkins Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t9vj3f\" data-start=\"6912\" data-end=\"6943\">Azure Fundamentals (AZ-900)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pwc4w5\" data-start=\"6944\" data-end=\"6973\">Google Cloud Architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hr6up7\" data-start=\"6974\" data-end=\"6996\">DevOps Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10o62ks\" data-start=\"6997\" data-end=\"7028\">Cloud Infrastructure Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jt7oir\" data-start=\"7029\" data-end=\"7059\">Strategic Leadership in IT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7061\" data-end=\"7064\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"7066\" data-end=\"7083\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7085\" data-end=\"7186\">Semester 4 is the <strong data-start=\"7103\" data-end=\"7164\">final transformation stage into a cloud + DevOps engineer</strong>. Students who master:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7187\" data-end=\"7235\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jjd7sa\" data-start=\"7187\" data-end=\"7201\">Kubernetes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j43ruy\" data-start=\"7202\" data-end=\"7211\">CI/CD</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18r728b\" data-start=\"7212\" data-end=\"7235\">Multi-cloud systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7237\" data-end=\"7287\">become highly employable in global tech companies.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3.9, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 160000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(294, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 219, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 02:24:29', '2026-06-16 07:05:43', '<p data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"749\">The MCA admission process is a <strong data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"534\">systematic, multi-step procedure</strong> designed to ensure that students are admitted smoothly, transparently, and without confusion. Each stage has a specific purpose&mdash;from verifying your academic eligibility to confirming your final seat in the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"884\">The entire process is structured into <strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"809\">four major steps</strong>, and completing each step correctly is essential for successful admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wxpq7q\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"937\">Step-by-Step MCA Admission Process Explained</h1>\r\n<hr data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"942\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qdghf6\" data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"973\">STEP 1: Submit Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1077\">This is the <strong data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1028\">entry point of your admission journey</strong>, where you officially apply for the MCA program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cwdw33\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1103\">What You Need to Do:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1345\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13men77\" data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1145\">Fill out the online application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b8dbvg\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1206\">Enter accurate personal details (name, contact, address)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"25sx1w\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1272\">Provide academic qualifications (10+2 and graduation details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lycgf\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1310\">Select your preferred MCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s98uub\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1345\">Submit the form for processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1350\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1382\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1407\">This step creates your:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fwmh8r\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1438\">Official admission profile</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1or63ix\" data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1471\">Academic verification record</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ifsdu\" data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1509\">Communication channel for updates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1599\">Without submitting the application, you cannot proceed further in the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ardyec\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1635\">Expert Insight (Critical)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1677\">Most admission issues begin here due to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10u32sj\" data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1703\">Incorrect marks entry</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wjzdyd\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1735\">Wrong email or phone number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18lc5kx\" data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1767\">Incomplete academic details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1848\">⚠️ Even small errors can delay admission or create verification problems later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1853\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p3qaaw\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1887\">STEP 2: Enroll in Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"2000\">After submitting the application, you move to the <strong data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1967\">program enrollment stage</strong>, where you finalize your course.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2005\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"igagno\" data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2037\">What Happens in This Step:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2178\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j5z0xx\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2091\">You select your final MCA program/specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wlujea\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2137\">You verify all previously entered details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1set5i4\" data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2178\">You confirm your enrollment decision</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2183\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2210\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2257\">This is a <strong data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2248\">decision-defining step</strong> because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2388\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bjbjm5\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2296\">Your chosen program becomes final</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1na9toh\" data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2329\">Your academic path is locked</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nysf4h\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2388\">Your fee structure is assigned based on your selection</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2413\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2454\">Before confirming enrollment, evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2593\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mcq9v8\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2512\">Career scope (AI, Cloud, Software Development, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dteuyg\" data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2555\">Industry demand for the specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csc2y3\" data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2593\">Your interest and long-term goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2739\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2616\">Choosing a program based only on trends instead of personal interest leads to poor performance and low career satisfaction.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cz9jn2\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2772\">STEP 3: Complete Payment</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2885\">Once enrollment is confirmed, the next step is to <strong data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2852\">complete the fee payment</strong>, which activates your admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2890\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"148ijp2\" data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2920\">Payment Options Available</h2>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2925\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"68vlua\" data-start=\"2927\" data-end=\"2969\">1. One-Time Payment (Best for Savings)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3032\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i1u98z\" data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3003\">Pay full program fee at once</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i0rzlo\" data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3032\">Get <strong data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3032\">up to 15% discount</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3048\">Benefits:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3160\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bwp75b\" data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3080\">No future financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7as9wc\" data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3105\">Maximum cost savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gej1at\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3133\">No installment tracking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hbvcis\" data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3160\">Simple and stress-free</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3165\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ano7td\" data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3201\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3296\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z78ztj\" data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3239\">Pay fees in monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gk2xq7\" data-start=\"3240\" data-end=\"3296\"><strong data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3294\">0% interest EMI available (based on eligibility)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3312\">Benefits:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3414\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ymvioa\" data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3342\">No large upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1whhpi\" data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3369\">Easy monthly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"50vij3\" data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3414\">Financial accessibility for all students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3419\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"thivjj\" data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3452\">Important Financial Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3474\">Before choosing EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3581\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gkdmlp\" data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3508\">Check total repayment amount</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3phths\" data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3541\">Understand loan/EMI duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kcet8q\" data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3581\">Ensure EMI fits your monthly budget</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3583\" data-end=\"3711\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3604\">Students focus only on low EMI amounts and ignore total repayment, leading to long-term financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3713\" data-end=\"3716\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ge60cf\" data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3744\">STEP 4: Secure Your Seat</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3838\">This is the <strong data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3798\">final stage of the admission process</strong>, where your admission becomes official.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3840\" data-end=\"3843\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"igagno\" data-start=\"3845\" data-end=\"3875\">What Happens in This Step:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3877\" data-end=\"4081\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g3tpaa\" data-start=\"3877\" data-end=\"3938\">Payment is successfully completed OR loan/EMI is approved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oq8x3\" data-start=\"3939\" data-end=\"3985\">University verifies your admission details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"anrnuq\" data-start=\"3986\" data-end=\"4042\">Your seat in the MCA program is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wr0fmu\" data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4081\">You receive admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4086\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"axh9kw\" data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4105\">Final Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4123\">After this step:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4287\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"699ccb\" data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4175\">You are officially enrolled in the MCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oviuzt\" data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4243\">You get access to academic systems (LMS, study materials, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"airk9\" data-start=\"4244\" data-end=\"4287\">Your classes and learning journey begin</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4289\" data-end=\"4292\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"4294\" data-end=\"4312\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4314\" data-end=\"4406\">This stage determines your <strong data-start=\"4341\" data-end=\"4367\">final admission status</strong>. Any delay in payment or approval can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4496\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c1nzkh\" data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4435\">Delay seat confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fjvi9j\" data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4463\">Affect batch allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12b4fsc\" data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4496\">Impact course start timeline</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4501\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"db69eh\" data-start=\"4503\" data-end=\"4540\">MCA Admission Process Summary Table</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4813\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4570\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4570\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4549\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4549\" data-end=\"4559\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Process</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4559\" data-end=\"4570\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4813\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4657\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4607\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4628\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4628\" data-end=\"4657\">Admission profile created</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4658\" data-end=\"4709\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4658\" data-end=\"4667\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4667\" data-end=\"4688\">Program Enrollment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4709\">Program finalized</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4710\" data-end=\"4756\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4710\" data-end=\"4719\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4719\" data-end=\"4733\">Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4733\" data-end=\"4756\">Admission activated</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4757\" data-end=\"4813\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4757\" data-end=\"4766\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4766\" data-end=\"4786\">Seat Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4786\" data-end=\"4813\">Final admission secured</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"506\">The eligibility statement:</p>\r\n<blockquote data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"603\">\r\n<p data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"603\">&ldquo;Basic eligibility: Pass in the (10+2) examination or Bachelor\'s degree depending on program&rdquo;</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"753\">may appear simple, but it actually reflects a <strong data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"686\">multi-level admission structure</strong>. The eligibility varies depending on whether you are applying for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"837\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bqjvye\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"800\"><strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"794\">Undergraduate (UG) level programs</strong>, OR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mxsg3q\" data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"837\"><strong data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"837\">Postgraduate programs like MCA</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"1035\">This distinction is important because MCA is an <strong data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"916\">advanced technical degree</strong>, and universities ensure that students have the required <strong data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1017\">academic foundation and logical ability</strong> before admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1040\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ui8hdy\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1081\">1. Eligibility Based on Program Level</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8vrde5\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1146\">A. For Undergraduate-Level Programs (Entry-Level IT Courses)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1241\">If the program is at a beginner or undergraduate level, the eligibility is based on Class 12.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fqh4yy\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1266\">Basic Requirements:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1524\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175auas\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1332\">Must have passed <strong data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1330\">10+2 (Class 12) from a recognized board</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18abgnw\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1405\">Students <strong data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1403\">appearing for Class 12 exams are also eligible to apply</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qs910v\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1524\">Students from <strong data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1469\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are also eligible if the qualification is recognized</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1529\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jpnx7i\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1550\">What This Means</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1594\">At this level, students are introduced to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t3jxf5\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1623\">Basic computing concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyz0gf\" data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1645\">Logical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rszs9p\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1674\">Introductory programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bfv3ep\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1694\">IT fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1786\">This is designed for students who are <strong data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1785\">starting their journey in computer applications</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1791\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ibbwo8\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1841\">B. Eligibility for MCA (Postgraduate Program)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1929\">MCA is a <strong data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1889\">professional postgraduate program</strong>, so eligibility is based on graduation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pflxd7\" data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1953\">Core Requirements:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"2154\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xocwrq\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"2039\">Must have a <strong data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2037\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline from a recognized university</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14d7bgb\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2154\">Minimum marks required:\r\n<ul data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2154\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ebtla\" data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2108\"><strong data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2106\">50% aggregate (General category)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y9utmm\" data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2154\"><strong data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2152\">45% aggregate (Reserved categories)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2159\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11mim8r\" data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2219\">2. Mathematics Requirement (Critical Eligibility Factor)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2266\">Mathematics is a <strong data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2257\">key requirement</strong> for MCA.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n8o26\" data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2314\">Students must have studied Mathematics in:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2359\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nl8z3o\" data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2336\"><strong data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2330\">Class 12</strong>, OR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f7ikau\" data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2359\"><strong data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2359\">Graduation level</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2364\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ohko87\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2397\">Why Mathematics is Required</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2459\">Mathematics is essential because MCA includes subjects like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2611\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"89lrft\" data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2495\">Algorithms and Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a100jw\" data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2542\">Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"46s5az\" data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2563\">Database Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14oehkv\" data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2585\">Programming Logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rm5ryb\" data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2611\">Statistical Computing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2674\">Without mathematical knowledge, students often struggle with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2736\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"det1ke\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2691\">Coding logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hj98eg\" data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2711\">Problem-solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cghizo\" data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2736\">Analytical reasoning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2741\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4x3mx8\" data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2783\">3. Stream Flexibility (Who Can Apply?)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2878\">MCA eligibility is <strong data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2843\">not restricted to a specific stream</strong>, which makes it highly accessible.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tki9i8\" data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2901\">Eligible Students:</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2995\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15m2ibq\" data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2923\">Science students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p9znzj\" data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2945\">Commerce students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4xeh6t\" data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2995\">Arts students (if graduation criteria is met)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3000\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"123vz07\" data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3017\">Key Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3066\">Unlike many technical programs, MCA focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3137\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tf7y57\" data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3087\">Logical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o10de\" data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3110\">Analytical ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l7g5m2\" data-start=\"3111\" data-end=\"3137\">Problem-solving skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3183\">rather than only prior technical background.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3188\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"e08jij\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3224\">4. Eligibility for NIOS Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3307\">Students from <strong data-start=\"3240\" data-end=\"3287\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are fully eligible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q04fw\" data-start=\"3309\" data-end=\"3324\">Conditions:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3424\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y69ibg\" data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3376\">Qualification must be <strong data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3374\">recognized and valid</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uwdp9c\" data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3424\">Documents must be verified during admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3426\" data-end=\"3429\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3449\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3451\" data-end=\"3553\">NIOS students are treated equally to regular board students, provided they meet all academic criteria.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3558\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rwp1hu\" data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3600\">5. Eligibility for Final Year Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3675\">Students in the <strong data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3659\">final year of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> can also apply.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q04fw\" data-start=\"3677\" data-end=\"3692\">Conditions:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3794\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x4va1r\" data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3726\">Admission is <strong data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3724\">provisional</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"185pp71\" data-start=\"3727\" data-end=\"3794\">Final confirmation is granted after submission of final results</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3799\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qaitp\" data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3814\">Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3840\">This allows students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3841\" data-end=\"3920\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3j4v3\" data-start=\"3841\" data-end=\"3856\">Apply early</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ualv9x\" data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3892\">Secure admission before results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kwlaw0\" data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3920\">Avoid missing deadlines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"3925\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16indjl\" data-start=\"3927\" data-end=\"3957\">6. Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"4100\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"3987\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"3987\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"3970\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3970\" data-end=\"3987\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4100\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4056\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4035\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4056\">50% in Graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4100\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4079\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reserved Categories</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4079\" data-end=\"4100\">45% in Graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4105\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j3em7f\" data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4135\">Why Minimum Marks Matter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4158\">Minimum marks ensure:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4263\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rkx9f\" data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4183\">Academic consistency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9euwg7\" data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4224\">Ability to handle technical subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91jrp0\" data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4263\">Readiness for advanced IT learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4315\">Students with stronger academic performance often:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4316\" data-end=\"4430\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g7d0nx\" data-start=\"4316\" data-end=\"4352\">Perform better in MCA coursework</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8bfqtw\" data-start=\"4353\" data-end=\"4392\">Have better placement opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ibk7xn\" data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4430\">Learn complex technologies faster</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"712\">The MCA program is structured with a <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"578\">transparent, flexible, and student-friendly fee model</strong> that allows learners to manage their finances efficiently while pursuing a professional postgraduate degree in computer applications.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xpvun0\" data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"750\"><strong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"738\">Total Tuition Fee:</strong> ₹1,60,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"768\">This fee covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"932\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nr83n0\" data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"801\">Academic curriculum delivery</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rqbugp\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"828\">Practical lab sessions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im8gr6\" data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"859\">Technical training modules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ctdrx\" data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"932\">Industry-oriented coursework (AI, cloud, software development, etc.)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"1095\">Compared to many private MCA programs, this cost is considered <strong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1030\">high-value and cost-effective</strong>, especially considering the advanced technical exposure offered.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17jdxni\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1157\">Flexible Payment Options (Designed for Accessibility)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1265\">The program provides <strong data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1206\">multiple payment modes</strong> so students can choose based on their financial situation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10zd03v\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1306\">One-Time Payment (Full Payment)</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1333\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1333\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1323\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1333\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1374\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1387\">₹1,60,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1404\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1474\">Students pay the entire course fee upfront at the time of admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l3n95q\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1490\">Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u60mwl\" data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1527\">No future financial commitments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ldhmtk\" data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1577\">Simplified fee structure (single transaction)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z9m76o\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1616\">Better long-term financial clarity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"evntjg\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1660\">No risk of missed installment deadlines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1680\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1798\">This option is ideal for students who want <strong data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1797\">peace of mind and zero financial pressure during the course duration</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1803\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fy0op2\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1829\">Yearly Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1927\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1856\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1856\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1846\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1856\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1927\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1904\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1893\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1904\">₹80,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1927\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1916\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1927\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1944\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"2055\">The total fee is split into <strong data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2003\">two equal yearly payments</strong>, making it easier to manage compared to a lump sum.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l3n95q\" data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2071\">Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2200\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o9dvoe\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2104\">Balanced financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rht98\" data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2150\">Less frequent payments than semester mode</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sis0s1\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2200\">Easier for families with annual income cycles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2223\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2329\">Best suited for students who want <strong data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2328\">moderate flexibility without handling multiple payments each year</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2334\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10okfbr\" data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2367\">Semester-Wise Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2470\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2394\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2394\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2384\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2394\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2470\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2446\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2435\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2446\">₹40,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2470\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2465\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2470\">4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2487\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2562\">The fee is divided into <strong data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2540\">four equal installments</strong>, paid every semester.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l3n95q\" data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2578\">Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2709\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"131oueh\" data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2620\">Lower payment amount per installment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqe154\" data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2666\">More flexibility for self-funded students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12ttiru\" data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2709\">Easier short-term financial management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"f2fz65\" data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2733\">Important Advisory</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2749\">Students must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2830\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1smefq3\" data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2787\">Track payment deadlines carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wwzpk5\" data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2830\">Maintain consistent financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2865\">⚠️ Missing deadlines can lead to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2928\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ub1vy9\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2879\">Late fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u8ur8r\" data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2903\">Access restrictions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ot1wp7\" data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2928\">Academic disruptions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2933\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"g5qwq6\" data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2965\">EMI / Education Loan Option</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"2983\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3125\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"147w4uw\" data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3022\">Monthly installment-based payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ma0mff\" data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3088\"><strong data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3086\">0% interest EMI option available (subject to eligibility)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ybwizg\" data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3125\">Reduces upfront financial burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3130\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l3n95q\" data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3146\">Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3289\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bejckl\" data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3193\">Makes MCA accessible to all income groups</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p0uruh\" data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3247\">Allows students to study without financial stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19poudl\" data-start=\"3248\" data-end=\"3289\">Supports long-term financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3294\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15djsoy\" data-start=\"3296\" data-end=\"3326\">Critical Financial Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3348\">Before choosing EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3456\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12s0z4f\" data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3385\">Calculate total repayment amount</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8824gt\" data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3414\">Check repayment duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ap7qla\" data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3456\">Ensure EMI fits within monthly budget</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3609\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3479\">Students often focus only on &ldquo;low monthly EMI&rdquo; and ignore <strong data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3561\">total payable amount</strong>, which can increase financial burden over time.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3614\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"fd6aph\" data-start=\"3616\" data-end=\"3653\">Additional Fees (Mandatory Charges)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3655\" data-end=\"3756\">These charges are <strong data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3703\">separate from tuition fees</strong> and must be considered for accurate cost estimation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3761\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"3763\" data-end=\"3787\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3913\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3810\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3810\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3800\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3800\" data-end=\"3810\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3913\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3873\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3863\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3873\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3913\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3903\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3903\" data-end=\"3913\">₹3,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6hwxo\" data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3948\">Total Additional Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"4026\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdlvf5\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3974\">Registration: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2dkfpm\" data-start=\"3975\" data-end=\"4006\">Exam Fees (2 years): ₹6,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11g4eh4\" data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4026\"><strong data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4026\">Total: ₹8,500</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4031\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vl7an\" data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4067\">For Students in SAARC Countries</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4183\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4090\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4090\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4080\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4090\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4183\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4143\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4132\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4143\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4183\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4173\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4183\">₹3,750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nuzsgl\" data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4218\">Total Additional Cost (SAARC)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4220\" data-end=\"4298\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"120jgip\" data-start=\"4220\" data-end=\"4245\">Registration: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hehpxq\" data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4277\">Exam Fees (2 years): ₹7,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"152ruzi\" data-start=\"4278\" data-end=\"4298\"><strong data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4298\">Total: ₹18,750</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4303\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"4305\" data-end=\"4334\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4444\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4357\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4357\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4347\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4347\" data-end=\"4357\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4380\" data-end=\"4444\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4380\" data-end=\"4407\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4380\" data-end=\"4399\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4399\" data-end=\"4407\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4444\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4437\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4437\" data-end=\"4444\">$50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hgyah9\" data-start=\"4446\" data-end=\"4487\">Total Additional Cost (International)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4489\" data-end=\"4559\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gvprwz\" data-start=\"4489\" data-end=\"4511\">Registration: $150</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uhr0fg\" data-start=\"4512\" data-end=\"4541\">Exam Fees (2 years): $100</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wjmfur\" data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4559\"><strong data-start=\"4544\" data-end=\"4559\">Total: $250</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4561\" data-end=\"4564\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"inqra\" data-start=\"4566\" data-end=\"4603\">Real Total Cost Calculation (India)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4751\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4627\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4627\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4617\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4617\" data-end=\"4627\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4650\" data-end=\"4751\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4650\" data-end=\"4677\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4650\" data-end=\"4664\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4664\" data-end=\"4677\">₹1,60,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4678\" data-end=\"4706\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4678\" data-end=\"4696\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4696\" data-end=\"4706\">₹8,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4707\" data-end=\"4751\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4707\" data-end=\"4734\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4709\" data-end=\"4733\">Total Estimated Cost</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4734\" data-end=\"4751\"><strong data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4749\">₹1,68,500</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"688\">This MCA curriculum is designed as a <strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"596\">deep technical and industry-oriented program</strong> that develops students into <strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"687\">software engineers, AI developers, and cloud professionals</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"780\">The structure follows a <strong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"745\">progressive learning system</strong>, where each semester increases in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"876\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5q5qsf\" data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"805\">Technical complexity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p35zns\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"828\">Practical exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4cdz6b\" data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"851\">Industry relevance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l1d7tc\" data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"876\">Job-readiness skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"939\">By the end of the program, students are trained for roles in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xfc8di\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"966\">Full Stack Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a100jw\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1013\">Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p70hcw\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1035\">Cloud Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s433e4\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1057\">DevOps Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oft0\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1089\">Enterprise Software Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"t8y4iq\" data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1163\">Semester 1: Core Computer Science Foundations &amp; Programming Logic</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1183\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1408\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"puxsj6\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1234\">Mathematical Foundations for Computer Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nprf48\" data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1285\">Computing Concepts and Problem Solving using C</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fbi6bn\" data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1307\">Operating Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2ewta\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1327\">Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u9xyq7\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1359\">Problem Solving using C Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fbf0sx\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1383\">Data Structures Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1408\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1413\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p9tok2\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1441\">What You Learn in Depth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1543\">Semester 1 focuses on building a <strong data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1542\">strong technical foundation in computing and programming logic</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wzjx7b\" data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1569\">Core Learning Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1779\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i942mn\" data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1618\">Mathematical thinking for computing systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ec5g2u\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1649\">C programming fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ov57j7\" data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1679\">Operating system concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1whhvun\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1713\">Data structure implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s686ty\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1749\">Algorithm-based problem solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17syvpn\" data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1779\">AI awareness introduction</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1784\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ggg0md\" data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1817\">Skills Developed (32 Skills)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1895\">This semester builds a <strong data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1883\">strong base of computational thinking</strong>, including:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c1t6o0\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1929\">Core Computing Competencies:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"2708\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vfhh2o\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1953\">Analytical Thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zbjk0o\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1980\">Computational Thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1y49x\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2009\">Programming Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51g7ul\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2041\">Software Development Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fig2ei\" data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2073\">Algorithms &amp; Logic Building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v37vf0\" data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2108\">Data Structures Implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ob7j7r\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2144\">Operating Systems Understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wjroqy\" data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2175\">Problem Solving Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s6mrdn\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2211\">Software Engineering Principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sgewnh\" data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2237\">Mathematical Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17hz4o7\" data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2262\">Discrete Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1awdg9h\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2285\">Algorithm Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ffk9p\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2309\">Modular Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s0zyy\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2331\">Memory Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p7y63c\" data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2355\">System Architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5guocv\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2380\">Recursion Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5kojto\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2408\">Multithreading Concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3qjqub\" data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2431\">Process Scheduling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m8qh13\" data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2449\">Data Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13m2l66\" data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2472\">Sorting Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"76zz1g\" data-start=\"2473\" data-end=\"2494\">Code Optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gfy4po\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2515\">Debugging Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18g7coo\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2536\">Test Case Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v0mc1q\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2561\">Secure Coding Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yqkohy\" data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2585\">Performance Testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z8rxrd\" data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2613\">Technical Documentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3rv5w\" data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2634\">Flowchart Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4idvj3\" data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2654\">Database Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1it6i8z\" data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2677\">Query Optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hpdhk4\" data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2708\">Distributed Systems Basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2732\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"3032\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"104kjvr\" data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2775\">Programming Foundations: Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wi8mov\" data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2804\">C Programming Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"reod1i\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2836\">Data Structures Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mtgant\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2864\">Operating System Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17hz4o7\" data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2889\">Discrete Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15dagkq\" data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2916\">Python Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10fsuw8\" data-start=\"2917\" data-end=\"2974\">AI Foundations (Thinking Machines &amp; Machine Learning)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1co00im\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3006\">Computer Science Principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7zsgn3\" data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3032\">Algorithm Foundations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3037\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3056\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3161\">Semester 1 is the <strong data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3110\">most critical foundation stage</strong>. Weak understanding here leads to difficulties in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3235\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o7bgcu\" data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3171\">AI/ML</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tuwmeh\" data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3191\">Cloud computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ubf99h\" data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3210\">DevOps systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91mar3\" data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3235\">Advanced programming</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3240\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cmrk0p\" data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3310\">Semester 2: Enterprise Programming, Cloud &amp; Full Stack Development</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3330\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3508\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fa2wed\" data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3361\">Advanced Database Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efpi4t\" data-start=\"3362\" data-end=\"3382\">Java Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkem60\" data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3403\">Web Technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"td1sk1\" data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3435\">Cloud Computing Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f4yrgq\" data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3469\">Advanced Database Systems Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u98j5u\" data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3494\">Java Programming Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10c2dgj\" data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3508\">ESG in IT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3513\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p9tok2\" data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3541\">What You Learn in Depth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3633\">This semester introduces <strong data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3632\">real-world software development and enterprise-level systems</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hc8idf\" data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3650\">Core Areas:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3829\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qp2yqp\" data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3690\">Java-based application development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4qgw5h\" data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"3720\">Advanced database systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2g434b\" data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"376