(295, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 265, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 03:46:12', '2026-06-16 07:06:04', '<p data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"730\">The M.Com admission process is designed to be <strong data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"515\">simple, structured, and fully online</strong>, ensuring that students can complete their enrollment without unnecessary complexity. However, each stage plays a critical role in confirming your admission, and even small mistakes can lead to delays or rejection.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"831\">The process consists of <strong data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"774\">four key steps</strong>, each contributing to your final admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gl1k71\" data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"876\">Step-by-Step M.Com Admission Process</h1>\r\n<hr data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"881\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qdghf6\" data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"912\">STEP 1: Submit Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1004\">This is the <strong data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"959\">first and most important step</strong>, where you officially apply for the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cwdw33\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1030\">What You Need to Do:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1272\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13men77\" data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1072\">Fill out the online application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rn6f9i\" data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1136\">Enter personal details (name, contact information, address)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fs10d6\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1199\">Provide academic details (10+2 and graduation information)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bk1la5\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1245\">Upload required documents (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ekbdsv\" data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1272\">Submit the application</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1304\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1329\">This step creates your:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1439\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jsciln\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1358\">Official student profile</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1or63ix\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1391\">Academic verification record</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ohmt7f\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1439\">Communication channel for admission updates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1444\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1464\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1505\">Many students make errors here such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lu7jpd\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1540\">Incorrect marks or percentages</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2npet3\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1569\">Wrong email/phone number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uz6cga\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1596\">Incomplete information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1678\">⚠️ These mistakes can delay your admission or create issues during verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1683\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2oga3v\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1718\">STEP 2: Enroll in Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1842\">After submitting your application, you move to the <strong data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1799\">program enrollment stage</strong>, where you finalize your course selection.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1847\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"igagno\" data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1879\">What Happens in This Step:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"2014\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vd7sx4\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1945\">Select your M.Com specialization (Finance, Accounting, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qry8kq\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1986\">Verify all entered details carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z30nxr\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2014\">Confirm your enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2019\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sfpnp\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2050\">Why This Step is Critical</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2181\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jdd8uy\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2089\">Your program choice becomes final</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1na9toh\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2122\">Your academic path is locked</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y2dld2\" data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2181\">Your fee structure is assigned based on this selection</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2186\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2209\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2229\">Before confirming:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10h8ruz\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2293\">Evaluate career opportunities in your chosen specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i8j3fg\" data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2350\">Check industry demand (finance, taxation, analytics)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yxz54y\" data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2393\">Align your choice with long-term goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2536\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2416\">Choosing a specialization based on trends instead of interest can lead to poor academic performance and dissatisfaction.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2541\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b6yujx\" data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2570\">STEP 3: Complete Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2663\">Once enrollment is confirmed, you must <strong data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2635\">pay the program fees</strong> to activate your admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"148ijp2\" data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2698\">Payment Options Available</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m56itb\" data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2723\">1. One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2785\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vlk3l8\" data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2756\">Pay full course fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i0rzlo\" data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2785\">Get <strong data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2785\">up to 15% discount</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2801\">Benefits:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2880\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5n0b5j\" data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2836\">No future payment obligations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2l76lw\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2853\">Cost savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hbvcis\" data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2880\">Simple and stress-free</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2885\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ano7td\" data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2921\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"3013\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9rbjuq\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2954\">Pay in monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dw72vc\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"3013\"><strong data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"3011\">0% interest EMI available (subject to eligibility)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3029\">Benefits:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3103\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16afxx7\" data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3056\">No large upfront cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"krvng\" data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3082\">Financial flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13i6rl0\" data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3103\">Easier budgeting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3108\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1llziol\" data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3140\">Important Financial Advice</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3162\">Before choosing EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3243\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14zy3pf\" data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3192\">Calculate total repayment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vydrdk\" data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3218\">Check duration of EMI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pigpbc\" data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3243\">Ensure affordability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3323\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3266\">Focusing only on low EMI instead of total repayment cost.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3328\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8oixmk\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3357\">STEP 4: Secure Your Seat</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3433\">This is the <strong data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3386\">final stage</strong>, where your admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3438\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nshoil\" data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3462\">What Happens Here:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3622\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a7xnzc\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3507\">Payment is completed OR EMI is approved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vp811q\" data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3544\">University verifies your details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s1pz3i\" data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3585\">Your seat is reserved in the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"axp7bd\" data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3622\">Admission confirmation is issued</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3627\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"axh9kw\" data-start=\"3629\" data-end=\"3646\">Final Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3664\">After this step:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3666\" data-end=\"3810\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rrzd4d\" data-start=\"3666\" data-end=\"3711\">You become an officially enrolled student</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2gh2l1\" data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3777\">You receive access to learning systems (LMS, study materials)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1az3cyg\" data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3810\">Your academic journey begins</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3812\" data-end=\"3815\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3835\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3837\" data-end=\"3871\">Delays in this step can result in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3950\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nb4dvf\" data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3899\">Loss of preferred batch</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dop95z\" data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3920\">Admission delays</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y57h9q\" data-start=\"3921\" data-end=\"3950\">Limited seat availability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"3955\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"130qggm\" data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"3990\">Admission Process Summary Table</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4254\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4020\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4020\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"3999\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4009\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Process</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4020\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4048\" data-end=\"4254\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4048\" data-end=\"4105\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4048\" data-end=\"4057\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4078\">Submit Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4105\">Student profile created</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4106\" data-end=\"4156\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4106\" data-end=\"4115\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4136\">Program Enrollment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4136\" data-end=\"4156\">Course finalized</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4157\" data-end=\"4203\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4157\" data-end=\"4166\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4180\">Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4180\" data-end=\"4203\">Admission activated</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4204\" data-end=\"4254\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4204\" data-end=\"4213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4213\" data-end=\"4233\">Seat Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4233\" data-end=\"4254\">Admission secured</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"459\">The eligibility statement:</p>\r\n<blockquote data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"537\">\r\n<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"537\">&ldquo;Pass in the (10+2) examination or Bachelor\'s degree depending on program&rdquo;</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"719\">indicates that <strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"605\">eligibility depends on the level of the program</strong>. Since M.Com is a <strong data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"647\">postgraduate degree</strong>, the primary requirement is based on <strong data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"699\">graduation</strong>, not just Class 12.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"833\">Understanding this distinction is crucial because many students misunderstand eligibility and apply incorrectly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ui8hdy\" data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"879\">1. Eligibility Based on Program Level</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17f9u7h\" data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"928\">A. For Undergraduate-Level Commerce Programs</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"1003\">If you are applying for entry-level commerce programs (like B.Com), then:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j0fx74\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1022\">Requirements:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175auas\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1088\">Must have passed <strong data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1086\">10+2 (Class 12) from a recognized board</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jy9tfi\" data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1155\">Students <strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1153\">appearing for Class 12 are also eligible to apply</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cvba08\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1264\"><strong data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1227\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling) students are eligible</strong> if the qualification is recognized</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jpnx7i\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1290\">What This Means</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1314\">This level focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6rx4yo\" data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1344\">Basic accounting concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vo7ynu\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1370\">Business fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1su7230\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1395\">Introductory finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19v90x1\" data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1452\">B. Eligibility for M.Com (Postgraduate Program)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1516\">For M.Com, eligibility is based on your <strong data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1515\">bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pflxd7\" data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1540\">Core Requirements:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1608\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zllq71\" data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1608\">Must have a <strong data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1606\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree from a recognized university</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wefd14\" data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1656\">Preferred Background (Highly Recommended):</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1773\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oqs05o\" data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1690\">B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19lw6id\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1736\">BBA (Bachelor of Business Administration)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xhqrel\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1773\">BA/BSc with Economics or Finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1778\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1808\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1943\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1838\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1838\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1838\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1943\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1903\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1886\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1903\">50% aggregate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1943\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1926\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reserved Categories</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1943\">45% aggregate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1948\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j3em7f\" data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1978\">Why Minimum Marks Matter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2015\">Minimum marks ensure that students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2166\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"njvw34\" data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2053\">Have strong academic fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n6rxfh\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2109\">Can handle advanced finance and accounting subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l9sex8\" data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2166\">Are prepared for analytical and technical coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2171\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"6ekkt\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2213\">2. Stream Flexibility (Who Can Apply?)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2268\">M.Com is relatively flexible in terms of eligibility.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mt0azg\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2293\">Eligible Candidates:</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2437\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fnu8qa\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2334\">Commerce graduates (most preferred)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j5hgn5\" data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2364\">Management students (BBA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m9f77y\" data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2387\">Economics students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18tx2yd\" data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2437\">Other graduates (subject to university rules)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2465\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2518\">Students from non-commerce backgrounds may need to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2612\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1br0mw8\" data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2558\">Work harder in accounting subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jo4fnm\" data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2612\">Build basic knowledge before starting the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2617\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1v3wbo4\" data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2659\">3. Eligibility for Final Year Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2747\">Students currently in the <strong data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2728\">final year of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> are also eligible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q04fw\" data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2764\">Conditions:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2887\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14yvqy\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2817\">Admission is granted on a <strong data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2815\">provisional basis</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e01nl7\" data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2887\">Final admission confirmation requires submission of final results</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2892\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qaitp\" data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2907\">Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"3017\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m7ivp6\" data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2943\">You can secure admission early</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kwlaw0\" data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"2971\">Avoid missing deadlines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i80n5g\" data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3017\">Get a head start in your academic journey</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3022\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8tawfe\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3045\">4. NIOS Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3155\">Students who completed their education through <strong data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3141\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are eligible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q04fw\" data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3172\">Conditions:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3264\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qg07mp\" data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3210\">Qualification must be recognized</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tnmh49\" data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3264\">Proper documentation is required during admission</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"670\">The M.Com (Master of Commerce) program is designed with a <strong data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"563\">cost-effective and flexible fee structure</strong>, making it accessible for students aiming to build careers in finance, accounting, and business analytics.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"708\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cbzecd\" data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"708\"><strong data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"696\">Total Tuition Fee:</strong> ₹1,25,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"728\">This fee includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"931\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nr83n0\" data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"761\">Academic curriculum delivery</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kkvxre\" data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"797\">Finance and accounting training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cwck8f\" data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"860\">Practical exposure (labs, financial tools, Excel modeling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eo4xlq\" data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"931\">Industry-oriented modules (FinTech, AI in finance, GST, valuation)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"1092\">Compared to MBA programs, M.Com offers <strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1035\">significantly lower cost with strong ROI in finance careers</strong>, especially for accounting, auditing, and analyst roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"fvs08e\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1154\">Flexible Payment Options (Student-Friendly Structure)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1284\">To ensure affordability, the fee can be paid through <strong data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1235\">multiple payment modes</strong>, allowing students to plan finances effectively.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1289\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4i3vqg\" data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1332\">One-Time Payment (Full Payment Option)</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1413\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1349\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1359\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1413\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1413\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1413\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1430\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1485\">Students pay the entire fee at once during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l3n95q\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1501\">Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1638\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5n0b5j\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1536\">No future payment obligations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bquo5t\" data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1566\">Simplified fee management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gej1at\" data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1594\">No installment tracking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"npp91k\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1638\">Financial clarity throughout the course</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1658\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1689\">Best suited for students who:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1804\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oray25\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1726\">Have financial support available</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6eljud\" data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1762\">Want to avoid repeated payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y49aqr\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1804\">Prefer stress-free financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1809\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fy0op2\" data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1835\">Yearly Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1862\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1862\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1852\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1862\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1910\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1899\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1910\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹62,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1922\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1933\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1950\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2040\">The total fee is divided into <strong data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2005\">two annual payments</strong>, making it easier than a lump sum.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l3n95q\" data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2056\">Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2181\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17g6ukp\" data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2087\">Balanced financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"152dpz6\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2129\">Fewer transactions than semester mode</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3s5lwq\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2181\">Suitable for families with yearly income cycles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2186\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10okfbr\" data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2219\">Semester-Wise Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2322\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2246\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2246\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2236\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2246\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2322\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2298\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2287\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2298\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹31,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2322\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2317\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2322\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2339\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2419\">The fee is divided into <strong data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2394\">four smaller installments</strong>, payable every semester.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l3n95q\" data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2435\">Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2531\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x26vsl\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2462\">Lower upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i4w9ri\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2496\">Greater financial flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oulojp\" data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2531\">Ideal for self-funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2536\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"f2fz65\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2560\">Important Advisory</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2597\">Students choosing this option must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2669\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1smefq3\" data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2636\">Track payment deadlines carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"crmel8\" data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2669\">Ensure timely fee submission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2704\">⚠️ Missing deadlines may lead to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2774\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17hap0z\" data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2731\">Late payment penalties</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mf26hh\" data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2774\">Temporary academic access restrictions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2779\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"g5qwq6\" data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2811\">EMI / Education Loan Option</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2829\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2956\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"147w4uw\" data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2868\">Monthly installment-based payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w9rs8h\" data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2917\"><strong data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2915\">0% interest EMI (subject to eligibility)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rttxl\" data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2956\">Reduces immediate financial burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2961\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l3n95q\" data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"2977\">Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"154ofbg\" data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3016\">Makes higher education accessible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ieat5n\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3054\">No need for large upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2jhxt\" data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3096\">Better financial planning flexibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3101\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15djsoy\" data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3133\">Critical Financial Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3156\">Before selecting EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3262\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gkdmlp\" data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3190\">Check total repayment amount</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"efu55o\" data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3222\">Understand repayment tenure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kcet8q\" data-start=\"3223\" data-end=\"3262\">Ensure EMI fits your monthly budget</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3401\">⚠️ Common Mistake:<br data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3285\">Students often choose EMI based only on low monthly payments without calculating the <strong data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3400\">total financial commitment</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3406\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"fd6aph\" data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3445\">Additional Fees (Mandatory Charges)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3542\">These charges are <strong data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3495\">separate from tuition fees</strong> and must be considered for accurate budgeting.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3544\" data-end=\"3547\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3573\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3699\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3596\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3596\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3586\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3596\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3619\" data-end=\"3699\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3619\" data-end=\"3659\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3619\" data-end=\"3649\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3659\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3699\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3689\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3699\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6hwxo\" data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3734\">Total Additional Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3812\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdlvf5\" data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3760\">Registration: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2dkfpm\" data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"3792\">Exam Fees (2 years): ₹6,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11g4eh4\" data-start=\"3793\" data-end=\"3812\"><strong data-start=\"3795\" data-end=\"3812\">Total: ₹8,500</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3817\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vl7an\" data-start=\"3819\" data-end=\"3853\">For Students in SAARC Countries</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3855\" data-end=\"3969\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3855\" data-end=\"3876\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3855\" data-end=\"3876\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3855\" data-end=\"3866\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3876\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3899\" data-end=\"3969\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3899\" data-end=\"3929\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3899\" data-end=\"3918\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3929\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3930\" data-end=\"3969\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3930\" data-end=\"3959\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"3969\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nuzsgl\" data-start=\"3971\" data-end=\"4004\">Total Additional Cost (SAARC)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4084\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"120jgip\" data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4031\">Registration: ₹11,250</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hehpxq\" data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4063\">Exam Fees (2 years): ₹7,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"152ruzi\" data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4084\"><strong data-start=\"4066\" data-end=\"4084\">Total: ₹18,750</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4086\" data-end=\"4089\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4120\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4230\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4143\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4143\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4133\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4143\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4230\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4193\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4185\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4193\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4194\" data-end=\"4230\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4194\" data-end=\"4223\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4223\" data-end=\"4230\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hgyah9\" data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4273\">Total Additional Cost (International)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4345\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gvprwz\" data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4297\">Registration: $150</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uhr0fg\" data-start=\"4298\" data-end=\"4327\">Exam Fees (2 years): $100</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wjmfur\" data-start=\"4328\" data-end=\"4345\"><strong data-start=\"4330\" data-end=\"4345\">Total: $250</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4347\" data-end=\"4350\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"inqra\" data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4389\">Real Total Cost Calculation (India)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4537\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4413\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4413\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4403\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4403\" data-end=\"4413\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4537\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4463\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4450\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4463\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4492\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4482\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4492\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹8,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4493\" data-end=\"4537\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4493\" data-end=\"4520\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4495\" data-end=\"4519\">Total Estimated Cost</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4537\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4522\" data-end=\"4535\">₹1,33,500</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"617\">The M.Com (Finance &amp; Accounting) program is a <strong data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"583\">highly specialized postgraduate course</strong> designed to develop expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"804\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c3a98o\" data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"655\">Financial accounting &amp; reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hgjopi\" data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"689\">Corporate finance &amp; valuation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"142ki7z\" data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"718\">Taxation (GST &amp; customs)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t8kxo4\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"765\">Investment analysis &amp; portfolio management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15myhfs\" data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"804\">FinTech, analytics &amp; AI in finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"950\">This program is structured to transform students into <strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"936\">finance professionals, analysts, auditors, and corporate decision-makers</strong> by combining:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1whb40w\" data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"981\">Core accounting knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cb763m\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1034\">Practical financial tools (Excel, SAP, modeling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a0kudz\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1070\">Regulatory and legal frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19b05gm\" data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1122\">Emerging technologies (AI, Blockchain, FinTech)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1127\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ct5yu8\" data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1198\">Semester 1: Foundations of Accounting, Business &amp; Financial Systems</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1218\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1244\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xlxzmr\" data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1272\">Business and Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1449joc\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1303\">Corporate and Business Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10wnqrm\" data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1337\">Entrepreneurship &amp; Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1362\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jccnay\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1388\">Management Accounting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1393\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ebgwu\" data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1431\">What You Learn (Deep Explanation)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1524\">Semester 1 builds a <strong data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1523\">strong foundation in finance, accounting, and business environment</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1546\">You will understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1725\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r21oaj\" data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1595\">How businesses record financial transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pvoiwr\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1643\">How financial decisions are made internally</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8t8mg2\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1684\">Legal frameworks governing companies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vgizpb\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1725\">Role of technology and AI in finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hhv17k\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1763\">Skills Developed (15 Skills)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13vgsk7\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1799\">Core Finance &amp; Business Skills</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gxmb8f\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1887\">Banking and Financial Services &rarr; Understanding financial institutions and services</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k1yihg\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1958\">Commercial Banking &rarr; Corporate, retail, and SME banking operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17pt5pa\" data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2037\">Digital Banking &amp; Payment Systems &rarr; UPI, online banking, fintech platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l1vyf\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2094\">Credit Appraisal &rarr; Loan approval and risk assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ucnrji\" data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2159\">Investment Products &rarr; Mutual funds, stocks, asset allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1btffe0\" data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2209\">Insurance Products &rarr; Risk coverage strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k55jo3\" data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2248\">Analytical &amp; Research Skills</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2553\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"miydy\" data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2314\">Business Research Methodology &rarr; Structured research approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13vcqax\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2384\">Research Design &amp; Hypothesis Testing &rarr; Data-based decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z30zzy\" data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2452\">Data Analysis using Excel &rarr; Financial calculations and modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wvg38l\" data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2499\">Demand Forecasting &rarr; Predict market trends</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i0hgp5\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2553\">Market Analysis &rarr; Business environment evaluation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2558\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kfhfjp\" data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2589\">Strategic &amp; Modern Skills</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2756\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sretvd\" data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2642\">Entrepreneurship &amp; Innovation &rarr; Startup mindset</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ol1kqw\" data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2695\">International Business Analysis &rarr; Global markets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pbg5p8\" data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2756\">AI &amp; Data Analytics Fundamentals &rarr; Role of AI in finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2761\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2780\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2941\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15b6m8l\" data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2841\">Accounting Foundations (Bookkeeping &amp; Accounting Cycle)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oiv77i\" data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2867\">Managerial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j688k7\" data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2891\">QuickBooks Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91sjt2\" data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2912\">AI in Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wutjqz\" data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2941\">Generative AI in Finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"2946\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2965\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"3059\">This semester builds the <strong data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3025\">base layer of finance careers</strong>. Weak understanding here affects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3120\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kf16en\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3083\">Financial reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h04yyg\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3096\">Taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ehmny3\" data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3120\">Investment analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3125\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1whztxg\" data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3197\">Semester 2: Advanced Accounting, Corporate Laws &amp; Financial Analysis</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3217\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3388\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3243\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"102gyiq\" data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3262\">Corporate Laws</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l3d8xf\" data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3299\">Quantitative Research Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11mqdf7\" data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3325\">Advanced Accounting-I</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sfaglo\" data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3361\">International Financial Markets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2lyav\" data-start=\"3362\" data-end=\"3388\">Virtual Accounting Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3393\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11p23ko\" data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3412\">What You Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3501\">This semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3500\">advanced accounting systems and financial decision-making</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3513\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3662\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"erfdo2\" data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3552\">Financial statements and reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q5mxjg\" data-start=\"3553\" data-end=\"3588\">Corporate accounting structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"38rxru\" data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3625\">Legal compliance and regulations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o73c5h\" data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3662\">Investment and capital budgeting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3667\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hhv17k\" data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3700\">Skills Developed (15 Skills)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"127ifzj\" data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3728\">Accounting &amp; Reporting</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3915\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d0fg8g\" data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3782\">GAAP, IFRS, Ind AS &rarr; Global accounting standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1blcpz1\" data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3818\">Financial Statement Preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"he7hz6\" data-start=\"3819\" data-end=\"3870\">Corporate Accounting &rarr; Shares, debentures, ESOP</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ow6ylu\" data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3915\">Amalgamation &amp; Reconstruction Accounting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3917\" data-end=\"3920\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1or9lbx\" data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"3944\">Financial Analysis</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"4099\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rmjg6\" data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"3978\">Financial Statement Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18a2u1t\" data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4008\">Time Value of Money (TVM)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"55dcf3\" data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4039\">Discounted Cash Flow (DCF)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nic98j\" data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4072\">Capital Budgeting (NPV, IRR)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wnmved\" data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4099\">Risk &amp; Return Analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4101\" data-end=\"4104\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x2931f\" data-start=\"4106\" data-end=\"4138\">Legal &amp; Market Understanding</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4140\" data-end=\"4237\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1allzsp\" data-start=\"4140\" data-end=\"4176\">Corporate Laws (SEBI, FEMA, IBC)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sfaglo\" data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4212\">International Financial Markets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g33hi4\" data-start=\"4213\" data-end=\"4237\">Bond Pricing &amp; Yield</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4242\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2xrgif\" data-start=\"4244\" data-end=\"4264\">Technical Skills</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4266\" data-end=\"4345\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8lmee7\" data-start=\"4266\" data-end=\"4300\">Financial Modeling using Excel</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ek8c7e\" data-start=\"4301\" data-end=\"4318\">Data Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15kfty4\" data-start=\"4319\" data-end=\"4345\">Statistical Techniques</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4347\" data-end=\"4350\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4369\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4371\" data-end=\"4513\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mb5ank\" data-start=\"4371\" data-end=\"4402\">GAAP &amp; Accounting Standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4zqsts\" data-start=\"4403\" data-end=\"4432\">Internal Controls &amp; Audit</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s4fycj\" data-start=\"4433\" data-end=\"4459\">SAP Financial Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qp5h83\" data-start=\"4460\" data-end=\"4491\">Accounts Payable/Receivable</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18fozgc\" data-start=\"4492\" data-end=\"4513\">Audit Preparation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4515\" data-end=\"4518\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4537\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4539\" data-end=\"4635\">This semester is <strong data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4623\">critical for careers in accounting, auditing, and finance roles</strong>. It builds:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4716\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"knjaoh\" data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4667\">Corporate finance knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ue58k\" data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4692\">Compliance expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"db6umo\" data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4716\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4721\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1biyz4c\" data-start=\"4723\" data-end=\"4797\">Semester 3: Taxation, FinTech, Investment &amp; Advanced Financial Analytics</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4817\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4819\" data-end=\"5000\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"176o9o5\" data-start=\"4819\" data-end=\"4860\">Introduction to FinTech and Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"47pnuh\" data-start=\"4861\" data-end=\"4884\">GST and Customs Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yb7aje\" data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"4911\">Advanced Accounting-II</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pu36l0\" data-start=\"4912\" data-end=\"4958\">Investment Analysis &amp; Portfolio Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqmzod\" data-start=\"4959\" data-end=\"4976\">Open Elective</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rdg3fy\" data-start=\"4977\" data-end=\"5000\">Virtual Finance Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5002\" data-end=\"5005\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11p23ko\" data-start=\"5007\" data-end=\"5024\">What You Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5121\">This semester introduces <strong data-start=\"5051\" data-end=\"5120\">real-world finance applications and modern financial technologies</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5123\" data-end=\"5126\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hhv17k\" data-start=\"5128\" data-end=\"5159\">Skills Developed (15 Skills)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jzyqdp\" data-start=\"5161\" data-end=\"5186\">Taxation &amp; Compliance</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5188\" data-end=\"5295\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kcdhjp\" data-start=\"5188\" data-end=\"5221\">GST System (CGST, SGST, IGST)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iugvos\" data-start=\"5222\" data-end=\"5261\">GST Return Filing (GSTR-1, GSTR-3B)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n9rebm\" data-start=\"5262\" data-end=\"5295\">Customs Duty &amp; Tax Compliance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5297\" data-end=\"5300\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pxpkt5\" data-start=\"5302\" data-end=\"5325\">Advanced Accounting</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5327\" data-end=\"5431\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a1gizj\" data-start=\"5327\" data-end=\"5359\">Financial Reporting (Ind AS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2ojd7\" data-start=\"5360\" data-end=\"5404\">Financial Instruments &amp; Hedge Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sugl0v\" data-start=\"5405\" data-end=\"5431\">Fixed Asset Accounting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5433\" data-end=\"5436\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tiy7ns\" data-start=\"5438\" data-end=\"5475\">Investment &amp; Portfolio Management</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5477\" data-end=\"5552\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16mbzum\" data-start=\"5477\" data-end=\"5511\">Portfolio Theories (CAPM, APT)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x6372l\" data-start=\"5512\" data-end=\"5534\">Security Valuation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3t5sp\" data-start=\"5535\" data-end=\"5552\">Risk Analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5554\" data-end=\"5557\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1oz8l1s\" data-start=\"5559\" data-end=\"5593\">Financial Modeling &amp; Analytics</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5595\" data-end=\"5690\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yhktc8\" data-start=\"5595\" data-end=\"5612\">DCF, NPV, IRR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19jyvs5\" data-start=\"5613\" data-end=\"5647\">Excel-based Financial Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3swut1\" data-start=\"5648\" data-end=\"5674\">Monte Carlo Simulation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s7jvgz\" data-start=\"5675\" data-end=\"5690\">Forecasting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5692\" data-end=\"5695\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1frbdlf\" data-start=\"5697\" data-end=\"5713\">FinTech &amp; AI</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5715\" data-end=\"5794\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a3beoe\" data-start=\"5715\" data-end=\"5746\">Blockchain &amp; Cryptocurrency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jymbcy\" data-start=\"5747\" data-end=\"5769\">Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oj3ypf\" data-start=\"5770\" data-end=\"5794\">AI Models in Finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5796\" data-end=\"5799\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"5801\" data-end=\"5818\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5947\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cg2m9a\" data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5842\">Financial Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgg3mj\" data-start=\"5843\" data-end=\"5866\">Investment Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xybtm4\" data-start=\"5867\" data-end=\"5888\">Excel for Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9z0r39\" data-start=\"5889\" data-end=\"5910\">Blockchain Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ioefa4\" data-start=\"5911\" data-end=\"5928\">AI in FinTech</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ihej2\" data-start=\"5929\" data-end=\"5947\">Data Analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5949\" data-end=\"5952\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"5954\" data-end=\"5971\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5973\" data-end=\"6038\">This semester gives students a <strong data-start=\"6004\" data-end=\"6024\">competitive edge</strong> by combining:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6039\" data-end=\"6095\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ta36jx\" data-start=\"6039\" data-end=\"6063\">Finance + Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10np1lb\" data-start=\"6064\" data-end=\"6095\">Analytics + Decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6097\" data-end=\"6100\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"qhgpxz\" data-start=\"6102\" data-end=\"6168\">Semester 4: Financial Strategy, Valuation &amp; Corporate Leadership</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"6170\" data-end=\"6188\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6190\" data-end=\"6334\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cg2m9a\" data-start=\"6190\" data-end=\"6212\">Financial Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzjudj\" data-start=\"6213\" data-end=\"6240\">Business Ethics and CSR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vbi2hs\" data-start=\"6241\" data-end=\"6273\">Intellectual Property Rights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xels6x\" data-start=\"6274\" data-end=\"6313\">Corporate Restructuring &amp; Valuation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yg84bo\" data-start=\"6314\" data-end=\"6334\">Research Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6336\" data-end=\"6339\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11p23ko\" data-start=\"6341\" data-end=\"6358\">What You Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-