er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(296, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 266, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 03:56:00', '2026-06-16 07:06:24', '<p data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"710\">The M.Com admission process is designed to be <strong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"534\">fully online, simple, and student-friendly</strong>, but each stage carries significant importance. A small mistake&mdash;such as incorrect details or delayed payment&mdash;can affect your admission timeline or even your seat availability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"822\">The process is divided into <strong data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"765\">four structured steps</strong>, ensuring clarity, transparency, and ease of enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"827\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gl1k71\" data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"867\">Step-by-Step M.Com Admission Process</h1>\r\n<hr data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qdghf6\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"903\">STEP 1: Submit Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"1003\">This is the <strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"958\">entry point of your admission journey</strong>, where you officially apply for the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kcrm5x\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1028\">What You Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1267\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13men77\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1070\">Fill out the online application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c8ovux\" data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1136\">Enter personal details (name, contact number, email, address)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fs10d6\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1199\">Provide academic details (10+2 and graduation information)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xjwn54\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1240\">Upload required documents (if asked)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ekbdsv\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1267\">Submit the application</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1272\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sfpnp\" data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1303\">Why This Step is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1328\">This step creates your:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1433\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ehn9nx\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1357\">Official student record</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l0al27\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1391\">Academic verification profile</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ys1ir\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1433\">Communication channel for all updates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1458\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1519\">Many students underestimate this step and make errors like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lu7jpd\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1555\">Incorrect marks or percentages</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r1plih\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1581\">Wrong contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ukvb2p\" data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1611\">Spelling mistakes in name</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1711\">⚠️ These errors can lead to <strong data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1684\">verification issues or admission delays</strong>, so accuracy is essential.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1716\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2oga3v\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1751\">STEP 2: Enroll in Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1868\">After submitting your application, you proceed to <strong data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1825\">program enrollment</strong>, where you finalize your course selection.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1873\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1904\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"2039\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vd7sx4\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1970\">Select your M.Com specialization (Finance, Accounting, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q8mabr\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2011\">Review all entered details carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z30nxr\" data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2039\">Confirm your enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2044\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2071\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2208\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"69dkoa\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2110\">Your specialization becomes final</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d29cki\" data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2149\">Your academic direction is defined</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nysf4h\" data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2208\">Your fee structure is assigned based on your selection</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2213\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2236\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2269\">Before confirming your program:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2440\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a9pnfa\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2326\">Analyze career opportunities in each specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1of5z67\" data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2374\">Choose based on your interest and strengths</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lxbrwj\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2440\">Consider long-term goals (finance, analytics, taxation, etc.)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2530\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2464\">Common Mistake:</strong> Choosing a specialization based only on trends or peer influence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2535\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b6yujx\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2564\">STEP 3: Complete Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2654\">This step activates your admission. Without payment, your enrollment remains incomplete.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2659\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"x5a8d1\" data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2688\">Payment Options Available</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dfunr0\" data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2712\">1. One-Time Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2779\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohza4c\" data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2750\">Pay the full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i0rzlo\" data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2779\">Get <strong data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2779\">up to 15% discount</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2794\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2874\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tsd74f\" data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2818\">Lower overall cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wmat7q\" data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2847\">No future payment stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4uv53o\" data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2874\">Simple and hassle-free</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2879\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eyji2a\" data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2914\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"3015\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h2frr\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2956\">Pay fees in <strong data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2954\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q1wrew\" data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"3015\"><strong data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2988\">0% interest EMI available</strong> (subject to eligibility)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3030\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3143\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5mjmjo\" data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3059\">No heavy upfront burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y7r94r\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3091\">Easier financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qjbc96\" data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3143\">Suitable for students and working professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3148\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"thivjj\" data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3181\">Important Financial Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3204\">Before selecting EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3321\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uam9x9\" data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3245\">Understand total repayment duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vw54vg\" data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3280\">Evaluate monthly affordability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uli3r\" data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3321\">Check terms and conditions carefully</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3417\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3345\">Common Mistake:</strong><br data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3348\">Students focus only on low EMI amounts and ignore total payable cost.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3419\" data-end=\"3422\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8oixmk\" data-start=\"3424\" data-end=\"3451\">STEP 4: Secure Your Seat</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3453\" data-end=\"3544\">This is the <strong data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3497\">final and most crucial stage</strong>, where your admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3549\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3580\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3748\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3amowe\" data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3629\">Fee payment is completed OR EMI is approved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h7p6mu\" data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3670\">University verifies your application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s1pz3i\" data-start=\"3671\" data-end=\"3711\">Your seat is reserved in the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"axp7bd\" data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3748\">Admission confirmation is issued</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3753\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"axh9kw\" data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3772\">Final Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3774\" data-end=\"3790\">After this step:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3936\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kbmxee\" data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3844\">You are officially enrolled in the M.Com program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134ezgu\" data-start=\"3845\" data-end=\"3903\">You receive access to LMS (Learning Management System)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1az3cyg\" data-start=\"3904\" data-end=\"3936\">Your academic journey begins</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3938\" data-end=\"3941\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlzevi\" data-start=\"3943\" data-end=\"3961\">Expert Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"4011\">Delays in payment or verification can result in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4013\" data-end=\"4098\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17yfum3\" data-start=\"4013\" data-end=\"4041\">Loss of preferred intake</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y57h9q\" data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4071\">Limited seat availability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ybm5b\" data-start=\"4072\" data-end=\"4098\">Admission postponement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4103\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ykkb9k\" data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4132\">Admission Process Summary</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4419\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4162\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4162\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4141\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4141\" data-end=\"4151\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Process</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4162\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4419\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4247\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4199\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4220\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4220\" data-end=\"4247\">Student profile created</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4248\" data-end=\"4315\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4248\" data-end=\"4257\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4278\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Enrollment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4278\" data-end=\"4315\">Course &amp; specialization confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4316\" data-end=\"4362\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4316\" data-end=\"4325\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4339\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4362\">Admission activated</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4363\" data-end=\"4419\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4363\" data-end=\"4372\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4392\">Seat Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4392\" data-end=\"4419\">Final admission secured</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<h1 data-section-id=\"pt1786\" data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"917\">1. Program-Level Eligibility Breakdown</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rwc5g1\" data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"984\">A. Eligibility for Undergraduate Commerce Programs (Reference)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1022\">For entry-level programs like B.Com:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1273\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175auas\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1088\">Must have passed <strong data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1086\">10+2 (Class 12) from a recognized board</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jy9tfi\" data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1155\">Students <strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1153\">appearing for Class 12 are also eligible to apply</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mj9pzb\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1273\"><strong data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1227\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling) students are eligible</strong>, provided their qualification is recognized</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"181lajy\" data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1300\">Why This Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1427\">This clarification helps students understand the <strong data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1395\">difference between UG and PG eligibility</strong>, avoiding application mistakes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1432\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19v90x1\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1484\">B. Eligibility for M.Com (Postgraduate Program)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3exyrm\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1506\">Core Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1572\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oorpi5\" data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1572\">Must have a <strong data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1572\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree from a recognized university</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1577\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zdzi20\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1612\">Preferred Academic Background</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1685\">Although multiple streams are accepted, preference is usually given to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1817\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oqs05o\" data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1719\">B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19lw6id\" data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1765\">BBA (Bachelor of Business Administration)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18fp4hi\" data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1784\">BA (Economics)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kc9u1x\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1817\">BSc (Mathematics/Statistics)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1822\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a7tjrd\" data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1853\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1893\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1893\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1866\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1893\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Aggregate Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1958\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1951\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1958\">50%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1981\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reserved Categories</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"1988\">45%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"1993\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ytw8v4\" data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2030\">Why Minimum Marks Are Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2067\">Minimum marks ensure that students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2219\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s3v2\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2106\">Have a strong academic foundation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8twn49\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2176\">Can handle advanced subjects like financial modeling and taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fe7xdg\" data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2219\">Are prepared for analytical coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2224\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"sdqh6d\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2266\">2. Eligibility for Final Year Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2362\">Students who are currently in the <strong data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2343\">final year of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> are also eligible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q04fw\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2379\">Conditions:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14yvqy\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2432\">Admission is granted on a <strong data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2430\">provisional basis</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8jl0dz\" data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2499\">Final admission is confirmed after submission of final results</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2504\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qaitp\" data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2519\">Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2629\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ril7yz\" data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2552\">Early admission opportunity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pyrvqq\" data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2584\">No need to wait for results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10kfuxm\" data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2629\">Better planning for postgraduate studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2634\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w9oa6v\" data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2675\">3. Stream Flexibility: Who Can Apply?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2751\">M.Com offers flexibility, but your background impacts your learning curve.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11j40u7\" data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2777\">Eligible Candidates:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2926\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fnu8qa\" data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2818\">Commerce graduates (most preferred)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j5hgn5\" data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2848\">Management students (BBA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m9f77y\" data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2871\">Economics students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zjze8f\" data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2926\">Other graduates (subject to university guidelines)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2931\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2954\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"3018\">Students from non-commerce backgrounds may face challenges in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3093\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m5mhfh\" data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3047\">Accounting fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kf16en\" data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3071\">Financial reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vx4o5n\" data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3093\">Taxation concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3167\">👉 Such students should prepare in advance to avoid academic difficulty.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3172\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8tawfe\" data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3195\">4. NIOS Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3299\">Students who completed education through <strong data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3285\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are eligible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q04fw\" data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3316\">Conditions:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3396\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qg07mp\" data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3354\">Qualification must be recognized</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r9rkn3\" data-start=\"3355\" data-end=\"3396\">Proper documentation must be provided</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"767\">The total M.Com program fee is structured to provide <strong data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"559\">flexibility, affordability, and multiple payment options</strong>, making it accessible for students from different financial backgrounds. The program allows students to pay fees <strong data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"727\">semester-wise, yearly, or in one-time payment mode</strong>, depending on their financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"772\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"s4l19v\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"792\">Total M.Com Fees</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"888\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"820\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"820\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"810\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"820\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"888\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"888\">\r\n<td data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"872\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"871\">Total Program Fees</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"888\"><strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"886\">₹125,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"916\">This fee typically covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1028\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdlrq1\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"938\">Academic tuition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ngaw9\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"991\">Learning resources (LMS access, study materials)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d054qj\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1028\">Faculty sessions and assessments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cbcwjd\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1061\">Flexible Payment Options</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1140\">Students can choose a payment mode that best suits their financial situation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dtnkqh\" data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1169\">1. Yearly Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1253\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1196\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1196\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1186\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1196\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1253\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1253\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1238\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1237\">Per Year</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1253\"><strong data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1251\">₹62,500</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1270\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15c3dxo\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1327\">The total fee is divided into 2 yearly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cjyrmt\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1394\">Ideal for students who want <strong data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1392\">moderate financial flexibility</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1399\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1z9n63\" data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1435\">2. Semester-Wise Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1523\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1462\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1462\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1452\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1462\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1523\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1523\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1508\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1507\">Per Semester</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1523\"><strong data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1521\">₹31,250</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1540\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1642\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"te176y\" data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1581\">Fees are divided across 4 semesters</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qbfb22\" data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1642\">This is the <strong data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1640\">most flexible and budget-friendly option</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4xl6pp\" data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1678\">3. One-Time Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1705\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1705\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1695\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1705\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1751\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1750\">Full Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1767\"><strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1765\">₹125,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1784\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1932\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1upfv4q\" data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1816\">Pay the entire fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rtx2bi\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1854\">Helps avoid repeated transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mtui2i\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1932\">Often preferred by students who want a <strong data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1930\">hassle-free payment experience</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1937\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rhbvl0\" data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1971\">Which Payment Option is Best?</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2162\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ky4xan\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2044\"><strong data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2042\">Low budget / students managing finances monthly &rarr; Semester-wise</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oaoj31\" data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2095\"><strong data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2093\">Stable income / moderate planning &rarr; Yearly</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fnwa0p\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2162\"><strong data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2160\">Want peace of mind / possible discounts &rarr; One-time payment</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2167\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17b2gvx\" data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2208\">EMI (Easy Monthly Installment) Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2308\">The program offers <strong data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2244\">EMI options</strong>, allowing students to pay fees in smaller monthly installments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vyi0sv\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2327\">Key Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2448\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x5moe4\" data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2366\">No need to pay large upfront fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"akrylx\" data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2396\">Easier financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lcbami\" data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2448\">Suitable for working professionals and students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2453\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2476\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2498\">Before choosing EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2593\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1allfly\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2537\">Understand the repayment duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nt8vtu\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2568\">Check total payable amount</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pigpbc\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2593\">Ensure affordability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2690\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2617\">Common Mistake:</strong><br data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2620\">Students focus only on low monthly EMI without calculating total cost.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2695\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"kove6l\" data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2726\">Additional Fees (Important)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2798\">Apart from tuition fees, students must pay certain additional charges.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2803\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2829\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2955\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2852\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2852\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2842\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2852\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2955\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2915\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2905\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2915\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2955\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2945\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2955\">₹3,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2960\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vl7an\" data-start=\"2962\" data-end=\"2996\">For Students in SAARC Countries</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3112\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3019\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3019\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3009\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3019\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3112\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3072\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3061\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3072\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3073\" data-end=\"3112\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3073\" data-end=\"3102\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3112\">₹3,750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3117\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3148\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3258\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3171\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3171\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3161\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3171\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3258\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3221\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3221\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3258\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3251\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3258\">$50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3263\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"iwra4k\" data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3305\">Total Cost Estimation (India Students)</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"f83nr9\" data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3334\">Approximate Total Cost:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3430\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ag6hb4\" data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3362\">Tuition Fees: ₹125,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uve7mf\" data-start=\"3363\" data-end=\"3391\">Registration Fee: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qcb6y8\" data-start=\"3392\" data-end=\"3430\">Examination Fees (2 years): ₹6,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w2s6pi\" data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3470\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3470\">Total Estimated Cost: ₹133,500</strong></span></h3>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"613\">The M.Com in AI-Driven Finance &amp; Accounting is a <strong data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"598\">next-generation postgraduate program</strong> that combines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"857\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"29xlyp\" data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"653\">Traditional accounting and finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dz7571\" data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"710\">Artificial Intelligence (AI) &amp; Generative AI (GenAI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hyykfx\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"752\">FinTech and digital financial systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cahfmr\" data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"794\">Data analytics and financial modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lewowr\" data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"857\">ESG (Environmental, Social, Governance) and sustainability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"927\">This program is specifically designed for students aiming to become:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8mtim\" data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"962\">AI-enabled financial analysts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ekdfpn\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"988\">FinTech professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8jgpzw\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1022\">Corporate finance strategists</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g6j4w9\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1054\">Data-driven decision-makers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1235\">Unlike traditional M.Com programs, this curriculum focuses on <strong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1178\">automation, analytics, and intelligent financial systems</strong>, which are becoming essential in modern finance careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1240\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gredxa\" data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1317\">Semester 1: Foundations of AI-Enabled Accounting, Law &amp; Business Strategy</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1337\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1587\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10wn79q\" data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1382\">Technology-Enabled Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nykauo\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1434\">Business Technology and Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qbdnrl\" data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1490\">AI-enabled International Corporate &amp; Commercial Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iu3hm7\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1526\">Entrepreneurship and Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1551\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rolvy5\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1587\">AI-Driven Management Accounting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dhaeuy\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1634\">What You Learn (Detailed Explanation)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1707\">Semester 1 builds a <strong data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1706\">hybrid foundation of finance + technology + AI</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1729\">Students understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1897\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2b4skg\" data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1780\">Core accounting principles using digital tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"shyfta\" data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1820\">Business strategy using AI insights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c2micg\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1859\">Legal frameworks in global finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"274ob8\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1897\">Startup ecosystems and innovation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1902\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hhv17k\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1935\">Skills Developed (15 Skills)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qp8f4h\" data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1975\">Core Accounting &amp; Financial Skills</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2171\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b4vpij\" data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2034\">Consignment Accounting &rarr; Handling goods sent for sale</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r1467g\" data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2084\">Depreciation Methods &rarr; WDV &amp; SLM calculations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rqtyal\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2141\">Financial Statements &rarr; P&amp;L, Balance Sheet, Cash Flow</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aypv4l\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2171\">Trial Balance Preparation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2176\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s17xm4\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2209\">Strategic &amp; Business Skills</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2373\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gxc8i3\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2269\">PESTLE &amp; SWOT Analysis &rarr; Business environment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wp9xe2\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2321\">ESG Framework &rarr; Sustainable business evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y0rn92\" data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2373\">Digital Transformation &rarr; Technology in business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2378\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5xf1po\" data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2409\">Legal &amp; Innovation Skills</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2570\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18mgpur\" data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2447\">Companies Act &amp; SEBI Regulations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"121cycx\" data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2482\">Intellectual Property (IP) Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ipqiyy\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2502\">Design Thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"74za75\" data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2544\">Startup Ecosystem &amp; Venture Financing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uilefd\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2570\">Business Model Canvas</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2575\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pqnxh0\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2601\">AI &amp; Advanced Skills</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2673\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kxyax5\" data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2635\">AI for Financial Forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lh3j8i\" data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2673\">Generative AI (LLMs) Applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2678\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2697\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2885\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9izblk\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2735\">Financial Accounting Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"efr319\" data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2771\">Internal Controls in Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ahbwd9\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2809\">Budgeting &amp; Managerial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"celryq\" data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2850\">Prompt Engineering for Generative AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8lmee7\" data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2885\">Financial Modeling using Excel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2890\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2909\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"3053\">This semester creates the <strong data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2985\">foundation for AI-integrated finance careers</strong>. Students who ignore AI tools here may struggle in later semesters.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3058\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"460luv\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3117\">Semester 2: AI in Taxation, Audit &amp; Financial Analytics</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3137\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3420\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s6268\" data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3192\">Digital Tax Systems &amp; Cross-Border Tax Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8sicd1\" data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3239\">AI-Enabled Audit, Risk &amp; Assurance Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l3d8xf\" data-start=\"3240\" data-end=\"3276\">Quantitative Research Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"117aq0n\" data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3340\">AI-driven Performance Analytics &amp; Strategic Cost Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15w34mu\" data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3393\">Intelligent Financial Reporting &amp; IFRS Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2lyav\" data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3420\">Virtual Accounting Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3425\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11p23ko\" data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3444\">What You Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3527\">This semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3526\">automation and intelligence in financial operations</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3539\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3735\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ol645v\" data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3598\">Digital taxation systems (GST, international taxation)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rkq2fe\" data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3640\">AI-based auditing and risk management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qa1zmv\" data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3688\">Cost optimization and performance analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fcflmy\" data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3735\">Financial reporting using global standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3740\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yt1n52\" data-start=\"3742\" data-end=\"3773\">Skills Developed (13 Skills)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jzyqdp\" data-start=\"3775\" data-end=\"3800\">Taxation &amp; Compliance</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3802\" data-end=\"3878\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fnzm73\" data-start=\"3802\" data-end=\"3824\">Income Tax Returns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xgr3e8\" data-start=\"3825\" data-end=\"3852\">GST Filing &amp; Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ql013\" data-start=\"3853\" data-end=\"3878\">Cross-border taxation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3880\" data-end=\"3883\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fz1nst\" data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3912\">Audit &amp; Risk Management</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"3986\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rwkysq\" data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"3937\">Auditing Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bynu72\" data-start=\"3938\" data-end=\"3966\">Internal Control Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"imckd9\" data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"3986\">Risk Assessment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"3991\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ezw3j6\" data-start=\"3993\" data-end=\"4026\">Financial Analysis &amp; Research</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4136\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"piws9d\" data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4057\">Statistical Data Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124b7b4\" data-start=\"4058\" data-end=\"4080\">Hypothesis Testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rmjg6\" data-start=\"4081\" data-end=\"4113\">Financial Statement Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tl2r75\" data-start=\"4114\" data-end=\"4136\">Cash Flow Analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4141\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18v1k9s\" data-start=\"4143\" data-end=\"4171\">Cost &amp; Corporate Finance</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4308\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19l1ioh\" data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4202\">Cost Control &amp; Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gtrlww\" data-start=\"4203\" data-end=\"4223\">Marginal Costing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l3l727\" data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4245\">Variance Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"31l6dm\" data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4270\">Corporate Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6g549d\" data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4308\">Financial Performance Improvement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4310\" data-end=\"4313\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"4315\" data-end=\"4332\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4334\" data-end=\"4512\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n4wc8u\" data-start=\"4334\" data-end=\"4360\">Income Tax Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wf1f6d\" data-start=\"4361\" data-end=\"4386\">Audit &amp; Due Diligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r6t0f\" data-start=\"4387\" data-end=\"4414\">CISA Certification Prep</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1bn7m\" data-start=\"4415\" data-end=\"4434\">Cost Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rmjg6\" data-start=\"4435\" data-end=\"4467\">Financial Statement Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wckbug\" data-start=\"4468\" data-end=\"4512\">Data Analytics (Python, Excel, Power BI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4514\" data-end=\"4517\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"4519\" data-end=\"4536\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4538\" data-end=\"4577\">This semester is critical for roles in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4644\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bddh6m\" data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4600\">Audit &amp; compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g66pi1\" data-start=\"4601\" data-end=\"4619\">Tax consulting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"27kg4q\" data-start=\"4620\" data-end=\"4644\">Corporate accounting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4649\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1xs4ub5\" data-start=\"4651\" data-end=\"4706\">Semester 3: FinTech, Corporate Finance &amp; ESG Strategy</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"4708\" data-end=\"4726\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4728\" data-end=\"4981\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"176o9o5\" data-start=\"4728\" data-end=\"4769\">Introduction to FinTech and Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6vb4kf\" data-start=\"4770\" data-end=\"4836\">Intelligent Financial Management &amp; AI-driven Corporate Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqgp53\" data-start=\"4837\" data-end=\"4887\">Strategic Leadership in Digital Global Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7z7hk6\" data-start=\"4888\" data-end=\"4939\">AI-enabled Corporate Reporting &amp; Sustainability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqmzod\" data-start=\"4940\" data-end=\"4957\">Open Elective</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rdg3fy\" data-start=\"4958\" data-end=\"4981\">Virtual Finance Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4983\" data-end=\"4986\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11p23ko\" data-start=\"4988\" data-end=\"5005\">What You Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5007\" data-end=\"5069\">This semester integrates <strong data-start=\"5032\" data-end=\"5068\">finance, AI, and global strategy</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5071\" data-end=\"5086\">Students learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5087\" data-end=\"5248\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i4vkk5\" data-start=\"5087\" data-end=\"5125\">Financial decision-making using AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nrvqsq\" data-start=\"5126\" data-end=\"5171\">Capital markets and investment strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rkdpll\" data-start=\"5172\" data-end=\"5208\">ESG and sustainability reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zqvfp8\" data-start=\"5209\" data-end=\"5248\">Digital business and global finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5250\" data-end=\"5253\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19hngfb\" data-start=\"5255\" data-end=\"5286\">Skills Developed (12 Skills)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1871g19\" data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5309\">Corporate Finance</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5311\" data-end=\"5417\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qhaztb\" data-start=\"5311\" data-end=\"5339\">Capital Markets Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dl47ao\" data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5366\">Credit Risk Assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nw7tqp\" data-start=\"5367\" data-end=\"5384\">WACC Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nic98j\" data-start=\"5385\" data-end=\"5417\">Capital Budgeting (NPV, IRR)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5419\" data-end=\"5422\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cyywjc\" data-start=\"5424\" data-end=\"5453\">Strategy &amp; Global Finance</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5455\" data-end=\"5531\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z9govo\" data-start=\"5455\" data-end=\"5479\">Competitive Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12umgyv\" data-start=\"5480\" data-end=\"5512\">Digital Business Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nbj0mj\" data-start=\"5513\" data-end=\"5531\">Global Finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5533\" data-end=\"5536\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yojq5w\" data-start=\"5538\" data-end=\"5562\">ESG &amp; Sustainability</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5564\" data-end=\"5626\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t7eem9\" data-start=\"5564\" data-end=\"5605\">ESG Reporting (GRI, SASB, TCFD, BRSR)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fvvxeh\" data-start=\"5606\" data-end=\"5626\">Impact Investing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5628\" data-end=\"5631\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dps10z\" data-start=\"5633\" data-end=\"5649\">AI &amp; FinTech</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5651\" data-end=\"5731\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cuvl72\" data-start=\"5651\" data-end=\"5685\">AI-based Financial Forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mka17p\" data-start=\"5686\" data-end=\"5705\">FinTech Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rhotj6\" data-start=\"5706\" data-end=\"5731\">Climate Risk Analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5733\" data-end=\"5736\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"5738\" data-end=\"5755\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5757\" data-end=\"5933\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ioefa4\" data-start=\"5757\" data-end=\"5774\">AI in FinTech</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aoh6m5\" data-start=\"5775\" data-end=\"5794\">Capital Markets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cg2m9a\" data-start=\"5795\" data-end=\"5817\">Financial Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z786lp\" data-start=\"5818\" data-end=\"5838\">ESG Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1st3a8a\" data-start=\"5839\" data-end=\"5875\">ERP Systems (Microsoft Dynamics)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mcvim2\" data-start=\"5876\" data-end=\"5901\">Financial Forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ywurv4\" data-start=\"5902\" data-end=\"5933\">Business Intelligence Tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5935\" data-end=\"5938\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"5940\" data-end=\"5957\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5959\" data-end=\"6017\">This semester provides a <strong data-start=\"5984\" data-end=\"6005\">future-ready edge</strong>, combining:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6018\" data-end=\"6093\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ta36jx\" data-start=\"6018\" data-end=\"6042\">Finance + Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wjlq2x\" data-start=\"6043\" data-end=\"6061\">ESG + Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10np1lb\" data-start=\"6062\" data-end=\"6093\">Analytics + Decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6095\" data-end=\"6098\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w9uqwm\" data-start=\"6100\" data-end=\"6172\">Semester 4: Advanced AI Finance, Analytics &amp; Strategic Decision-Making</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"6174\" data-end=\"6192\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6194\" data-end=\"6361\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zjjbke\" data-start=\"6194\" data-end=\"6251\">AI Applications in International Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"va3hpp\" data-start=\"6252\" data-end=\"6310\">Advanced Performance Intelligence &amp; Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"118bl64\" data-start=\"6311\" data-end=\"6340\">Advanced Taxation with AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yg84bo\" data-start=\"6341\" data-end=\"6361\">Research Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6363\" data-end=\"6366\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11p23ko\" data-start=\"6368\" data-end=\"6385\">What You Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6387\" data-end=\"6485\">This final semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"6418\" data-end=\"6484\">high-level financial intelligence and global financial systems</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6487\" data-end=\"6490\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pryffh\" data-start=\"6492\" data-end=\"6522\">Skills Developed (9 Skills)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14nj6xp\" data-start=\"6524\" data-end=\"6552\">Financial Markets &amp; Risk</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6554\" data-end=\"6635\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51v0h1\" data-start=\"6554\" data-end=\"6587\">Foreign Exchange (FX) Markets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1svpsxn\" data-start=\"6588\" data-end=\"6611\">Derivatives Trading</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgg3mj\" data-start=\"6612\" data-end=\"6635\">Investment Analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6637\" data-end=\"6640\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rrw9x0\" data-start=\"6642\" data-end=\"6664\">Financial Strategy</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6666\" data-end=\"6758\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dl47ao\" data-start=\"6666\" data-end=\"6692\">Credit Risk Assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"annj7f\" data-start=\"6693\" data-end=\"6727\">Financial Modeling &amp; Valuation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19givn1\" data-start=\"6728\" data-end=\"6758\">Capital Structure Analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6760\" data-end=\"6763\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16063ji\" data-start=\"6765\" data-end=\"6787\">Advanced Analytics</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6789\" data-end=\"6832\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ncvxej\" data-start=\"6789\" data-end=\"6814\">Strategic Forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gfsawn\" data-start=\"6815\" data-end=\"6832\">ESG Reporting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6834\" data-end=\"6837\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"61lfla\" data-start=\"6839\" data-end=\"6856\">Certifications</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6858\" data-end=\"7004\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"32s00f\" data-start=\"6858\" data-end=\"6882\">Power BI for Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ieg4z\" data-start=\"6883\" data-end=\"6917\">Tableau for Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tp7jm7\" data-start=\"6918\" data-end=\"6935\">AI in Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jkwj5k\" data-start=\"6936\" data-end=\"6955\">Risk Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4g26u3\" data-start=\"6956\" data-end=\"6979\">AI Auditing Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dvaq7u\" data-start=\"6980\" data-end=\"7004\">Data-driven Auditing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7006\" data-end=\"7009\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b96p4d\" data-start=\"7011\" data-end=\"7028\">Expert Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7030\" data-end=\"7066\">This semester prepares students for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7067\" data-end=\"7159\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lppzyu\" data-start=\"7067\" data-end=\"7087\">Leadership roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xjt83m\" data-start=\"7088\" data-end=\"7119\">Strategic finance positions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gruz4s\" data-start=\"7120\" data-end=\"7159\">AI-driven financial decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 125000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(297, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 267, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 04:19:52', '2026-06-16 07:06:43', '<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"841\">The admission process for the <strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"520\">M.Com (ACCA Integrated)</strong> program is designed to be <strong data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"581\">simple, fast, and fully online</strong>, ensuring that students can complete enrollment without unnecessary delays. However, while the process looks straightforward, understanding each step in detail is critical to avoid mistakes that may lead to <strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"840\">application rejection or delays in confirmation</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"945\">The process consists of <strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"888\">four major stages</strong>, each playing a crucial role in securing your admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"950\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1f2q59b\" data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"999\">Step 1: Submit Application (Foundation Stage)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19bejcm\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1023\">What You Need to Do</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1136\">At this stage, you are required to fill out the <strong data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1100\">online application form</strong> with accurate and complete details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"e8wmft\" data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1163\">Information Required:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1350\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zvld0u\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1222\">Personal details (name, contact information, address)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mktod2\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1283\">Academic qualifications (10th, 12th, graduation details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mguxst\" data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1323\">Program selection (M.Com with ACCA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vd6fls\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1350\">Identification details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1355\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f87ror\" data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1386\">Why This Step is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1458\">This is the <strong data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1425\">first screening stage</strong>, where the university evaluates:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1532\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1phng6s\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1480\">Your eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e37z7\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1504\">Academic background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ycz4a8\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1532\">Accuracy of information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1537\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f1ilob\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1559\">Critical Insights</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1704\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l3np53\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1653\">Even small errors (like incorrect marks or spelling mistakes) can delay your application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j0fvy9\" data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1704\">Ensure documents match the information entered</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1831\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1728\">Common Mistake:</strong><br data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1731\">Students rush this step and submit incorrect academic details, leading to verification issues later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1836\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9bf41e\" data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1903\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program (Selection &amp; Verification Stage)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ncw11g\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1925\">What Happens Here</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1960\">After submitting the application:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lpqugx\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2006\">You select your <strong data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2004\">final program choice</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3xuwvs\" data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2037\">Review all entered details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4hux6\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2071\">Confirm your intent to enroll</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2076\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qtr9wt\" data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2113\">What You Should Verify Carefully</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2219\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bl0zbq\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2158\">Correct program (M.Com ACCA Integrated)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fzwd98\" data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2192\">Personal and academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2tq1zs\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2219\">Eligibility compliance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2224\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hjrt4v\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2250\">Why This Step Matters</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2324\">This is your <strong data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2298\">last chance to correct errors</strong> before moving to payment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2329\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1w3btjl\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2350\">Strategic Advice</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2487\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vbqs7t\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2394\">Double-check your eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wp88dj\" data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2440\">Ensure you meet minimum marks requirement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3bmr8h\" data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2487\">Confirm you are ready for ACCA integration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2604\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2508\">Hidden Risk:</strong><br data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2511\">Selecting the wrong program or ignoring eligibility can lead to rejection even after payment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2609\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1v7wuv5\" data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2666\">Step 3: Complete Payment (Financial Commitment Stage)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2696\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m56itb\" data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2721\">1. One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2783\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nw7ojp\" data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2755\">Pay full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ygf49l\" data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2783\"><strong data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2783\">Benefit: 15% discount</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2788\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f3hgk2\" data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2817\">2. Education Loan / EMI</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2882\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9rbjuq\" data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2850\">Pay in monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f5rv37\" data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2882\"><strong data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2882\">0% interest EMI available</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2887\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2918\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"2995\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r5lj5w\" data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"2943\">Payment is recorded</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ciole0\" data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"2995\">Application moves to <strong data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"2993\">final processing stage</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3000\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"l3fdsh\" data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3031\">Financial Strategy Insight</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"faasug\" data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3069\">When to Choose One-Time Payment:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3149\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gnp6jy\" data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3108\">If you can afford upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b6x6ec\" data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3149\">To maximize savings through discount</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nvuixb\" data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3174\">When to Choose EMI:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3249\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"djm3a4\" data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3213\">If you want financial flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gmuwwl\" data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3249\">To manage cash flow efficiently</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3254\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3278\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3278\">Common Mistake:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3381\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1crvrd0\" data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3336\">Choosing EMI without calculating total affordability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kyifyi\" data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3381\">Ignoring additional costs like ACCA fees</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3386\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wxuvsp\" data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3441\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat (Final Confirmation Stage)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3472\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3495\">Once your payment is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3539\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9wor08\" data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3513\">Completed OR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12x5vbo\" data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3539\">Financing is approved</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3586\">👉 Your <strong data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3586\">admission is officially confirmed</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3591\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"37ucfb\" data-start=\"3593\" data-end=\"3612\">What You Receive</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"3736\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"3640\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vj5ez2\" data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3663\">Enrollment details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a0dxie\" data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3700\">Access to learning systems (LMS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n26ln0\" data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3736\">Program onboarding instructions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3738\" data-end=\"3741\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u3cbja\" data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3771\">Why This Step is Critical</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3773\" data-end=\"3797\">This is the stage where:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3858\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1emnzmy\" data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3822\">Your seat is locked</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8i14c4\" data-start=\"3823\" data-end=\"3858\">You officially become a student</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3860\" data-end=\"3863\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3887\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"3868\" data-end=\"3887\">Important Note:</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3953\">Delay in payment or incomplete financing approval may result in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"3991\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ikn9gh\" data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"3971\">Loss of seat</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xsj0wk\" data-start=\"3972\" data-end=\"3991\">Admission delay</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3993\" data-end=\"3996\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4032\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4034\" data-end=\"4076\">To avoid delays, keep the following ready:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4218\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e804nj\" data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4097\">10th mark sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c8v7pp\" data-start=\"4098\" data-end=\"4117\">12th mark sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xnrhcy\" data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4153\">Graduation mark sheets / degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c9gsg9\" data-start=\"4154\" data-end=\"4189\">ID proof (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4218\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4220\" data-end=\"4223\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"mndsvx\" data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4260\">Admission Timeline (Typical Flow)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4466\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4284\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4284\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4270\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4270\" data-end=\"4284\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Time Taken</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4466\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4340\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4331\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Submission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4331\" data-end=\"4340\">1 Day</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4341\" data-end=\"4368\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4341\" data-end=\"4356\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Verification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4368\">1&ndash;3 Days</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4415\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4394\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment &amp; Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4394\" data-end=\"4415\">Instant to 2 Days</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4416\" data-end=\"4466\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4416\" data-end=\"4447\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Admission Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4447\" data-end=\"4466\">Within 3&ndash;5 Days</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<h1 data-section-id=\"1ih8zj3\" data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"973\">1. Program-Level Eligibility Clarification</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"179kj5k\" data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1042\">A. For Undergraduate Commerce Programs (Reference Understanding)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1260\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175auas\" data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1108\">Must have passed <strong data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1106\">10+2 (Class 12) from a recognized board</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jy9tfi\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1175\">Students <strong data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1173\">appearing for Class 12 are also eligible to apply</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10hjvxx\" data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1260\"><strong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1216\">NIOS board candidates are eligible</strong>, provided the qualification is recognized</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1324\">👉 This applies only to <strong data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1312\">UG programs like B.Com</strong>, not M.Com.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1329\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2a8qtn\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1376\">B. Eligibility for M.Com (ACCA Integrated)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3exyrm\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1398\">Core Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1464\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oorpi5\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1464\">Must have a <strong data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1464\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree from a recognized university</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1469\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zdzi20\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1504\">Preferred Academic Background</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1576\">While multiple streams are accepted, preference is generally given to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1708\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oqs05o\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1610\">B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19lw6id\" data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1656\">BBA (Bachelor of Business Administration)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18fp4hi\" data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1675\">BA (Economics)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kc9u1x\" data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1708\">BSc (Mathematics/Statistics)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1713\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a7tjrd\" data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1744\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1879\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1757\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1774\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1879\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1839\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1822\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1839\">50% aggregate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1879\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1862\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reserved Categories</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1879\">45% aggregate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1884\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"geh0yd\" data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1917\">Why Graduation is Mandatory</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1952\">M.Com (ACCA integrated) involves:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2101\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vxmuo4\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1986\">Advanced accounting concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mz6qxv\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2042\">Financial reporting (aligned with global standards)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eeyhha\" data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2065\">Audit and taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"186drdq\" data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2101\">Corporate finance and analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2190\">👉 Without a bachelor&rsquo;s foundation, students may struggle with these advanced subjects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2195\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"sdqh6d\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2237\">2. Eligibility for Final Year Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2323\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2304\">appearing for their final year of graduation</strong> are also eligible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q04fw\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2340\">Conditions:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2453\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14yvqy\" data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2393\">Admission is granted on a <strong data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2391\">provisional basis</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"152q83m\" data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2453\">Final confirmation requires submission of final results</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2458\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qaitp\" data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2473\">Advantage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2580\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ril7yz\" data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2506\">Early admission opportunity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ugaip2\" data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2543\">No academic gap after graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14rps58\" data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2580\">Better planning for ACCA pathway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2585\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w9oa6v\" data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2626\">3. Stream Flexibility: Who Can Apply?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2680\">M.Com (ACCA) is flexible but academically demanding.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11j40u7\" data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2706\">Eligible Candidates:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2850\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fnu8qa\" data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2747\">Commerce graduates (most preferred)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j5hgn5\" data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2777\">Management students (BBA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m9f77y\" data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2800\">Economics students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18tx2yd\" data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2850\">Other graduates (subject to university rules)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2855\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2878\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2931\">Students from non-commerce backgrounds may need to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"3044\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1prit03\" data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2971\">Strengthen accounting fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t751le\" data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3008\">Learn financial reporting basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wqfuai\" data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3044\">Prepare for ACCA-level concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3135\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3068\">Common Mistake:</strong><br data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3071\">Assuming ACCA integration is easy without accounting background.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3140\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8tawfe\" data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3163\">4. NIOS Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3240\">Students from <strong data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3226\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> are eligible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q04fw\" data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3257\">Conditions:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3353\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qg07mp\" data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3295\">Qualification must be recognized</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dvsnta\" data-start=\"3296\" data-end=\"3353\">Required documents must be submitted during admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3355\" data-end=\"3358\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"qj71gr\" data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3404\">5. ACCA-Specific Eligibility Consideration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3474\">Although basic eligibility is graduation, ACCA integration requires:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3617\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"loobss\" data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3519\">Strong numerical and analytical ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"151eeg0\" data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3565\">Interest in global finance and accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13n0sm3\" data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3617\">Commitment to clearing professional-level exams</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"626\">The M.Com program integrated with <strong data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"541\">ACCA (Association of Chartered Certified Accountants)</strong> is a <strong data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"592\">premium, globally aligned commerce degree</strong>. The fee structure reflects both:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"709\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yhpsto\" data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"653\">Academic tuition fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14erhmk\" data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"709\">Professional certification (ACCA) integration costs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"714\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10bn17q\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"737\">Total Program Fees</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"765\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"765\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"755\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"765\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"820\">\r\n<td data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"807\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"820\">₹1,20,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"858\">\r\n<td data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"847\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Program Cost</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"858\">₹61,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<td data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"876\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"875\">Total Fees</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"893\"><strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"891\">₹1,81,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"898\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6y4m0z\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"926\">What This Fee Includes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"1067\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l7p0h3\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"968\">Academic learning (M.Com curriculum)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"612dyn\" data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1000\">Industry-aligned coursework</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1964ban\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1033\">Access to learning platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xitcba\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1067\">Integration with ACCA pathway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1072\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cbcwjd\" data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1100\">Flexible Payment Options</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1187\">Students can choose from multiple payment modes depending on their financial comfort.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"c1uzi2\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1214\">1. Yearly Payment</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1290\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1241\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1241\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1231\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1241\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1290\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1290\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1279\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1290\">₹90,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1omkccn\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1305\">Best For:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f10uqt\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1354\">Students with moderate financial flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nj8xbf\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1394\">Those who want fewer payment cycles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1399\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wbuxjc\" data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1428\">2. Semester-Wise Payment</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1508\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1455\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1455\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1445\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1455\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1508\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1508\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1497\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1508\">₹60,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1omkccn\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1523\">Best For:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1598\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k4k2po\" data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1568\">Students who prefer smaller installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"90pe33\" data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1598\">Budget-conscious planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1603\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6xgp4u\" data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1627\">3. One-Time Payment</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1644\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1654\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1696\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1709\">₹1,81,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1omkccn\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1724\">Best For:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1802\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fpoox4\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1771\">Students who want a hassle-free experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1udnqrm\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1802\">Avoiding repeated payments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1807\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17b2gvx\" data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1848\">EMI (Easy Monthly Installment) Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1954\">The program offers <strong data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1887\">EMI facilities</strong>, allowing students to pay fees in manageable monthly installments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1969\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2076\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2fjb1v\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2008\">No large upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fu6w5c\" data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2040\">Better cash flow management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gwfu9b\" data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2076\">Ideal for working professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2081\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9u2hd7\" data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2103\">Critical Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2127\">Before opting for EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2226\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c17ny7\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2162\">Understand repayment duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nt8vtu\" data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2193\">Check total payable amount</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uejaj1\" data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2226\">Ensure monthly affordability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2328\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2250\">Common Mistake:</strong> Choosing EMI based only on low monthly payment without evaluating total cost.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2333\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1n6x1gc\" data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2364\">Additional Fees (Mandatory)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2390\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2516\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2413\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2413\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2403\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2413\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2516\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2476\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2466\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2476\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2516\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2506\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2516\">₹3,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2521\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j9gx8m\" data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2544\">For SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2660\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2567\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2567\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2557\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2567\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2660\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2620\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2609\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2620\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2660\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2650\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2660\">₹3,750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2665\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2696\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2806\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2719\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2719\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2709\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2719\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2806\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2769\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2761\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2769\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2806\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2799\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2806\">$50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"534\">The M.Com (Master of Commerce) program is a <strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"497\">comprehensive postgraduate degree</strong> designed to build deep expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"735\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e0d8dh\" data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"574\">Accounting and financial reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v1l1a\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"597\">Taxation and audit</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t05ge9\" data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"645\">Financial management and corporate strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9kdphi\" data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"689\">Business leadership and decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"th160p\" data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"735\">Emerging areas like FinTech and analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"901\">This curriculum is structured across <strong data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"792\">four semesters</strong>, progressively moving from <strong data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"900\">fundamental commerce concepts to advanced strategic and analytical expertise</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"959\">Unlike undergraduate programs, M.Com focuses heavily on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"182nhr1\" data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"997\">Real-world financial applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"db6umo\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1021\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kdfqn0\" data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1060\">Strategic business decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1065\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"76eaj0\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1134\">Semester 1: Foundation in Accounting, Law &amp; Business Fundamentals</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1154\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1180\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xlxzmr\" data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1208\">Business and Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1449joc\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1239\">Corporate and Business Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10wnqrm\" data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1273\">Entrepreneurship &amp; Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hitc0s\" data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1298\">AI Skills for Future</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jccnay\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1324\">Management Accounting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1329\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wam42a\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1363\">Detailed Learning Explanation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1451\">Semester 1 builds a <strong data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1411\">strong conceptual base</strong> required for advanced commerce studies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n4z6nl\" data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1482\">1. Financial Accounting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1505\">Students learn how to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1640\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"148amg\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1559\">Prepare financial statements (P&amp;L, Balance Sheet)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yjbath\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1595\">Understand accounting standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s70euz\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1640\">Record and analyze business transactions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1705\">👉 This subject is the backbone of all finance-related careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1710\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48fay9\" data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1744\">2. Business and Technology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1756\">Focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1859\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"agj442\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1791\">Role of technology in business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"89izer\" data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1818\">Digital transformation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gxmnw2\" data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1859\">Automation in accounting and finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1864\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j89wy7\" data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1901\">3. Corporate and Business Law</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1909\">Covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8t8mg2\" data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1950\">Legal frameworks governing companies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j0fvba\" data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1990\">Contracts and corporate regulations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fw7mvk\" data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2020\">Compliance and governance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2025\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6ei6u\" data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2065\">4. Entrepreneurship &amp; Innovation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2083\">Students explore:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2160\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rsw4nm\" data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2106\">Startup ecosystems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcebe0\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2134\">Business model creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ncutko\" data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2160\">Innovation strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2165\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mlw9e1\" data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2196\">5. AI Skills for Future</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2208\">Introduces:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2330\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13tkorf\" data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2246\">Basics of Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s2ajb3\" data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2285\">Role of AI in finance and business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ecex02\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2330\">Automation tools and future technologies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2335\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p47p4c\" data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2367\">6. Management Accounting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2379\">Focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2440\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uck381\" data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2397\">Cost analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"29jgbx\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2411\">Budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14utvqt\" data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2440\">Internal decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2445\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cie0ge\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2475\">Key Outcome of Semester 1</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2494\">Students develop:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2600\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j6feb2\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2529\">Strong accounting fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v69smi\" data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2556\">Business understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9koax\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2600\">Basic legal and technological awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2605\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"118atg0\" data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2658\">Semester 2: Taxation, Audit &amp; Financial Reporting</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2678\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2831\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h04yyg\" data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2692\">Taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3z48jl\" data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2716\">Audit and Assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l3d8xf\" data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2753\">Quantitative Research Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kdo0z\" data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2780\">Performance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"165kb9r\" data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2804\">Financial Reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2lyav\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2831\">Virtual Accounting Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2836\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wam42a\" data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2870\">Detailed Learning Explanation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2946\">This semester shifts focus toward <strong data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"2945\">compliance, reporting, and analysis</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2951\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"osfhk9\" data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2970\">1. Taxation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2978\">Covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3055\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cvq379\" data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3002\">Income tax concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cydkcc\" data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3023\">GST fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3y5pri\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3055\">Tax planning and compliance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3060\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ealphv\" data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3090\">2. Audit and Assurance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3106\">Students learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3169\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gdx8zf\" data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3127\">Audit procedures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zhwe2j\" data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3149\">Internal controls</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uv0rr1\" data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3169\">Risk assessment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3174\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"z7wbmo\" data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3217\">3. Quantitative Research Techniques</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3229\">Focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3305\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p7xbpd\" data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3254\">Statistical analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uvke42\" data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3278\">Data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bk3kt6\" data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3305\">Research methodologies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3310\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jx0rav\" data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3343\">4. Performance Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3351\">Covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3451\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rmn0y3\" data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3379\">Cost control techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i99dqp\" data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3415\">Budgeting and variance analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15xcfuo\" data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3451\">Business performance evaluation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3453\" data-end=\"3456\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bcbpru\" data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3486\">5. Financial Reporting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3507\">Students understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3604\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vq62vd\" data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3541\">Advanced financial statements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bwqx8w\" data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3580\">Accounting standards (IFRS/Ind AS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rbd0ed\" data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3604\">Corporate reporting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3606\" data-end=\"3609\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1q1npo1\" data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3642\">6. Virtual Accounting Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3652\">Provides:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3754\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wfi1tl\" data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3695\">Practical exposure to accounting tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19nlrp9\" data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3722\">Real-world simulations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"soeken\" data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3754\">Hands-on financial analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3759\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cie0gd\" data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"3789\">Key Outcome of Semester 2</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"3805\">Students gain:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"3914\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lmrgan\" data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"3845\">Strong taxation and audit knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y2phrk\" data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3880\">Analytical and research skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ijreix\" data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3914\">Practical accounting exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"3919\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19vdg68\" data-start=\"3921\" data-end=\"3976\">Semester 3: Finance, Strategy &amp; Emerging Technologies</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"3996\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4180\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"176o9o5\" data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4039\">Introduction to FinTech and Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pbto8i\" data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4064\">Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"szafz3\" data-start=\"4065\" data-end=\"4098\">Strategic Business Leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2zqotk\" data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4131\">Strategic Business Reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"thsz5s\" data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4156\">Open Elective Course</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rdg3fy\" data-start=\"4157\" data-end=\"4180\">Virtual Finance Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4185\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wam42a\" data-start=\"4187\" data-end=\"4219\">Detailed Learning Explanation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4294\">Semester 3 focuses on <strong data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4293\">strategic finance and modern financial systems</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4299\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"96huv8\" data-start=\"4301\" data-end=\"4347\">1. Introduction to FinTech and Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4348\" data-end=\"4355\">Covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4445\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"myfj9p\" data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4385\">Digital financial systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10009xw\" data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4421\">Blockchain and digital payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7nsodb\" data-start=\"4422\" data-end=\"4445\">Data-driven finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4447\" data-end=\"4450\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xnx128\" data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4481\">2. Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4497\">Students learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4573\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wt4ndb\" data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4519\">Capital budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8smakq\" data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4544\">Investment decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y9pp2w\" data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4573\">Risk and return analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4575\" data-end=\"4578\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8njf1o\" data-start=\"4580\" data-end=\"4618\">3. Strategic Business Leadership</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4619\" data-end=\"4630\">Focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4631\" data-end=\"4700\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"um42c3\" data-start=\"4631\" data-end=\"4652\">Leadership skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4okhut\" data-start=\"4653\" data-end=\"4680\">Organizational strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uz1xle\" data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4700\">Decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4702\" data-end=\"4705\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"afiku4\" data-start=\"4707\" data-end=\"4744\">4. Strategic Business Reporting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4752\">Covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4753\" data-end=\"4848\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bfld8x\" data-start=\"4753\" data-end=\"4777\">Integrated reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqxy2a\" data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4820\">Financial analysis for decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16uteh7\" data-start=\"4821\" data-end=\"4848\">Corporate communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4850\" data-end=\"4853\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bd5uy0\" data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4877\">5. Open Elective</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4878\" data-end=\"4897\">Allows students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4898\" data-end=\"4960\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u1p2ol\" data-start=\"4898\" data-end=\"4932\">Choose specialization subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rw2pg3\" data-start=\"4933\" data-end=\"4960\">Align with career goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4962\" data-end=\"4965\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wv0u7s\" data-start=\"4967\" data-end=\"4995\">6. Virtual Finance Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5005\">Provides:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5006\" data-end=\"5096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a9ulle\" data-start=\"5006\" data-end=\"5041\">Practical financial simulations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jgkn9c\" data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5069\">Real-world case studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iu5ic7\" data-start=\"5070\" data-end=\"5096\">Hands-on finance tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5098\" data-end=\"5101\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cie0gc\" data-start=\"5103\" data-end=\"5131\">Key Outcome of Semester 3</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5133\" data-end=\"5150\">Students develop:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5151\" data-end=\"5261\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6x50c0\" data-start=\"5151\" data-end=\"5173\">Strategic thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9jqcgp\" data-start=\"5174\" data-end=\"5210\">Financial decision-making skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7w2c9f\" data-start=\"5211\" data-end=\"5261\">Understanding of modern financial technologies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5263\" data-end=\"5266\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9su3c\" data-start=\"5268\" data-end=\"5322\">Semester 4: Advanced Finance, Audit &amp; Specialization</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"5324\" data-end=\"5342\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5344\" data-end=\"5489\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"623sq4\" data-start=\"5344\" data-end=\"5377\">Advanced Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i9ck71\" data-start=\"5378\" data-end=\"5413\">Advanced Performance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6mnpra\" data-start=\"5414\" data-end=\"5435\">Advanced Taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wd009r\" data-start=\"5436\" data-end=\"5468\">Advanced Audit and Assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yg84bo\" data-start=\"5469\" data-end=\"5489\">Research Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5491\" data-end=\"5494\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wam42a\" data-start=\"5496\" data-end=\"5528\">Detailed Learning Explanation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5530\" data-end=\"5589\">This semester is focused on <strong data-start=\"5558\" data-end=\"5588\">mastery and specialization</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5591\" data-end=\"5594\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vmiot9\" data-start=\"5596\" data-end=\"5634\">1. Advanced Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5635\" data-end=\"5642\">Covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5643\" data-end=\"5736\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17avxb2\" data-start=\"5643\" data-end=\"5675\">Corporate finance strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14grzt9\" data-start=\"5676\" data-end=\"5702\">Mergers &amp; acquisitions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ohqlw\" data-start=\"5703\" data-end=\"5736\">Advanced investment decisions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5738\" data-end=\"5741\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"owtkbz\" data-start=\"5743\" data-end=\"5783\">2. Advanced Performance Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5784\" data-end=\"5795\">Focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5796\" data-end=\"5887\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jqsew\" data-start=\"5796\" data-end=\"5825\">Strategic cost management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2mzy7g\" data-start=\"5826\" data-end=\"5861\">Performance measurement systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1zxm8f\" data-start=\"5862\" data-end=\"5887\">Business optimization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5889\" data-end=\"5892\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wh5251\" data-start=\"5894\" data-end=\"5920\">3. Advanced Taxation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5921\" data-end=\"5936\">Students learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5937\" data-end=\"6012\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6yd2bn\" data-start=\"5937\" data-end=\"5963\">Complex tax structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iy203f\" data-start=\"5964\" data-end=\"5986\">Corporate taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fi2yat\" data-start=\"5987\" data-end=\"6012\">Advanced GST concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6014\" data-end=\"6017\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c2705n\" data-start=\"6019\" data-end=\"6056\">4. Advanced Audit and Assurance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6057\" data-end=\"6064\">Covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6065\" data-end=\"6141\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s3uh9w\" data-start=\"6065\" data-end=\"6097\">Advanced auditing techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xpqen7\" data-start=\"6098\" data-end=\"6117\">Fraud detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z3jy0q\" data-start=\"6118\" data-end=\"6141\">Risk-based auditing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6143\" data-end=\"6146\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hvayk1\" data-start=\"6148\" data-end=\"6173\">5. Research Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6174\" data-end=\"6183\">Students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6184\" data-end=\"6298\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ux5gz\" data-start=\"6184\" data-end=\"6216\">Conduct independent research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ussdjw\" data-start=\"6217\" data-end=\"6248\">Apply theoretical knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"129nvc8\" data-start=\"6249\" data-end=\"6298\">Develop analytical and problem-solving skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6300\" data-end=\"6303\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cie0gb\" data-start=\"6305\" data-end=\"6333\">Key Outcome of Semester 4</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6335\" data-end=\"6352\">Students achieve:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6353\" data-end=\"6465\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d9i9sy\" data-start=\"6353\" data-end=\"6401\">Advanced expertise in finance and accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kqoav8\" data-start=\"6402\" data-end=\"6442\">Research and analytical capabilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x1b2yq\" data-start=\"6443\" data-end=\"6465\">Industry readiness</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 120000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(298, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 134, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 04:54:33', '2026-06-16 07:07:06', '<p data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"761\">Understanding the admission process is critical because many students lose seats&mdash;not due to eligibility&mdash;but due to <strong data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"670\">process mistakes, delays, or incorrect decisions</strong>. Below is a <strong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"722\">fully explained, step-by-step guide</strong> to help you secure admission smoothly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"766\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ph40vs\" data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"827\">Step 1: Submit Application (Start Your Admission Journey)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19bejcm\" data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"851\">What You Need to Do</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"1112\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cj9gmr\" data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"897\">Fill out the <strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"895\">online application form</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hydlmy\" data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"1112\">Enter accurate details such as:\r\n<ul data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"1112\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h7vehg\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"982\">Personal information (name, contact details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16x56ew\" data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1052\">Academic details (Class 10, Class 12 marks or appearing status)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p0dnp4\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1112\">Preferred program (BBA specialization, if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hjrt4v\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1138\">Why This Step Matters</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1201\">This is the <strong data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1177\">first filtering stage</strong>. Universities evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1276\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"thkjid\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1217\">Eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vivu0p\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1247\">Basic academic background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7x1pww\" data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1276\">Application completeness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i1cc0i\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1301\">Expert Insight 💡</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1378\">Even small mistakes (wrong marks, spelling errors, incorrect documents) can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1445\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pwzlmt\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1403\">Delay your admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pruute\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1445\">Lead to rejection during verification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8enzcm\" data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1510\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program (Critical Decision Stage)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yzfqb1\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1540\">What Happens in This Step</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1661\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f9txyj\" data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1583\">You select your <strong data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1581\">final BBA program</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2w85o\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1627\">Review and verify all submitted details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4hux6\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1661\">Confirm your intent to enroll</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"l3eop6\" data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1695\">What You Must Check Carefully</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1842\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12xuepy\" data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1754\">Program specialization (Finance, Marketing, AI, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"195ryy\" data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1792\">Fee structure and payment options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"73404g\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1820\">Duration and curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ebpce\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1842\">Placement support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"p735ds\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1864\">Hidden Risk ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1898\">Many students rush this step and:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1968\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gwieqo\" data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1934\">Choose the wrong specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1usgwr1\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1968\">Ignore long-term career goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2054\">👉 This decision directly impacts your <strong data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2053\">career direction for the next 5&ndash;10 years</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2059\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"108twsa\" data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2108\">Step 3: Complete Payment (Most Decisive Step)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2138\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1458i2o\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2160\">One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2229\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nw7ojp\" data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2193\">Pay full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bhuzfr\" data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2229\"><strong data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2227\">Benefit: Up to 15% discount</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"r4kgvi\" data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2255\">EMI / Education Loan</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2343\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9rbjuq\" data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2287\">Pay in monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3wl4k5\" data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2343\"><strong data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2341\">0% interest financing available (in many cases)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1y1jdfx\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2373\">Why This Step is Crucial</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2463\">Your admission is <strong data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2462\">not confirmed until payment is completed or financing is approved</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2468\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1d6ac2z\" data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2497\">Strategic Payment Advice</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sifxs8\" data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2530\">Choose One-Time Payment if:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2589\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"55gigo\" data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2559\">You want maximum savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g3h912\" data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2589\">You have financial backup</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xott3j\" data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2609\">Choose EMI if:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2688\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vzh1vj\" data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2645\">You want low financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xdukyi\" data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2688\">You prefer manageable monthly payments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x24ye2\" data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2716\">Important Insight 💡</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2750\">Students who delay payment often:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2811\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8wn3n7\" data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2784\">Lose early admission benefits</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s4qiym\" data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2811\">Miss seat availability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2816\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wxuvsp\" data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2871\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat (Final Confirmation Stage)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2902\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"3121\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gdxf3h\" data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2946\">Your admission is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y78fi1\" data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2990\">Your <strong data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2988\">seat in the program is secured</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o7mze4\" data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3121\">You receive:\r\n<ul data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3121\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3034\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vj5ez2\" data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3059\">Enrollment details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i3xnvd\" data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3121\">LMS (Learning Management System) access (in most cases)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hjrt4v\" data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3147\">Why This Step Matters</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3210\">Seats in popular BBA programs are <strong data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3194\">limited</strong>, especially in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3276\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"syvupt\" data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3276\">High-demand specializations (Finance, AI, Business Analytics)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wahi6c\" data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3303\">Critical Insight ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3400\">Until payment is done:<br>👉 Your seat is <strong data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3359\">NOT reserved</strong>, even if you completed the application</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3405\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1jw5r8v\" data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3442\">Timeline of the Admission Process</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3662\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3466\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3466\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3452\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3452\" data-end=\"3466\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Time Taken</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3662\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3530\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3513\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Submission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3530\">10&ndash;20 minutes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3569\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3557\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3569\">Same day</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3614\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3591\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Processing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3614\">Instant / Few hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3662\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3640\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3662\">Within 24&ndash;48 hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<h1 data-section-id=\"kvgn5g\" data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"483\">What is the Basic Eligibility for BBA Admission?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"576\">To apply for a BBA program, students must meet the following <strong data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"575\">core academic requirement</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"771\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cel94i\" data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"662\">Must have <strong data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"636\">passed or be appearing for Class 12 (10+2)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wtz3o3\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"771\">Some programs may also accept <strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"736\">graduates (Bachelor&rsquo;s degree holders)</strong> for lateral or specialized entry</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"875\">This makes BBA one of the most <strong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"865\">accessible and flexible undergraduate management programs</strong> in India.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"880\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1auvqyq\" data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"937\">Detailed BBA Eligibility Criteria (Explained Clearly)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kwwpse\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"976\">Academic Qualification Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1030\">Students must fulfill at least one of the following:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y11ar9\" data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1102\">Successfully completed <strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1076\">10+2 (Class 12)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15e2cvy\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1169\">Students <strong data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1140\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are also eligible to apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pw5ge0\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1281\">In some cases, candidates with a <strong data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1226\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> can apply for advanced or second-degree BBA programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8e6sy6\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1302\">Accepted Boards</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1406\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uej2m7\" data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1311\">CBSE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qhw6us\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1320\">ICSE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1olewja\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1337\">State Boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w7a9s\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1406\"><strong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1387\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> &ndash; Fully eligible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1516\">👉 This ensures that students from both traditional and open schooling backgrounds have equal opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1551\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1636\">While the exact requirement may vary across universities, the general guideline is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tazqx3\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1689\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1675\">45%&ndash;60% aggregate marks</strong> in Class 12</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x24ye2\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1717\">Important Insight 💡</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1839\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t6xg6l\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1779\">Tier-1 universities may demand <strong data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1777\">higher cut-offs (60%+)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vxpyjb\" data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1839\">Online or flexible programs may have <strong data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1839\">relaxed criteria</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1844\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1h9x7eq\" data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1884\">Stream Eligibility (Who Can Apply?)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1960\">One of the biggest advantages of BBA is that it is <strong data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1959\">stream-independent</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1998\">Students from all streams can apply:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2085\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7vh27a\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2035\">Commerce students (most common)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15m2ibq\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2056\">Science students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a5wx2s\" data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2085\">Arts/Humanities students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zkuzid\" data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2112\">Strategic Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2219\">Non-commerce students often gain <strong data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2174\">strong business exposure</strong>, making BBA a powerful career switch option.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2224\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w3jba8\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2247\">Age Limit Criteria</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zpf5lj\" data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2305\">Most universities <strong data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2303\">do not have a strict age limit</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w526gb\" data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2400\">Some institutions may prefer candidates between <strong data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2371\">17&ndash;25 years</strong>, but this is not mandatory</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2405\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hxvvsc\" data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2451\">Entrance Exam Requirement (If Applicable)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2499\">Depending on the university, admission may be:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i73z1\" data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2516\">Merit-Based</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2544\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tvk3gz\" data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2544\">Based on Class 12 marks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14yawri\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2564\">Entrance-Based</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2643\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17iijhy\" data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2600\">University-level entrance tests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"km4ni2\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2643\">National-level exams (in top colleges)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xfjza0\" data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2665\">Key Insight ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2758\">Many students assume entrance exams are mandatory &mdash; this is not always true, especially for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2807\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17xcoyp\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2782\">Online BBA programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"psv4av\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2807\">Private universities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2812\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2kxrsh\" data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2863\">Eligibility for Different Types of BBA Programs</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6w24bo\" data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2892\">Regular BBA (After 12th)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2968\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1buovbx\" data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2932\">10+2 pass or appearing for Class 12</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7irmqx\" data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2968\">Minimum marks as per university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wdsbnr\" data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"2994\">Online / Distance BBA</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzts92\" data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3028\">10+2 pass (flexible criteria)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aey3eh\" data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3063\">No entrance exam in most cases</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"itrvpe\" data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3096\">Lateral Entry / Advanced BBA</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3164\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1njhgy6\" data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3164\">Requires a <strong data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3142\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or diploma</strong> (varies by program)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3166\" data-end=\"3169\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"107lb6f\" data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3219\">Hidden Eligibility Factors Students Often Miss</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u9xc7n\" data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3245\">Document Verification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3305\">Even if you meet eligibility, admission can be rejected if:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3386\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7gxyor\" data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3333\">Documents are incorrect</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1atpvpg\" data-start=\"3334\" data-end=\"3365\">Marksheets are not verified</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ufw34e\" data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3386\">Details mismatch</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"38zwdq\" data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3410\">English Proficiency</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3411\" data-end=\"3436\">Some universities expect:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3524\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qnobsy\" data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3475\">Basic English communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fqjyh8\" data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3524\">Especially for presentations and assignments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"scfab9\" data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3549\">Subject Requirements</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3550\" data-end=\"3671\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"878m7b\" data-start=\"3550\" data-end=\"3610\">No compulsory subjects required (unlike B.Com or B.Tech)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l0s2lt\" data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3671\">However, basic math or business understanding is helpful</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"392\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"145\">full cost of a BBA program</strong> is critical before taking admission. Many students only look at tuition fees and ignore additional charges, which can impact the total investment significantly. Below is a <strong data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"361\">transparent, student-friendly breakdown</strong> of the complete fee structure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"397\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1oxdsqb\" data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"424\">Total BBA Fees Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"459\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"459\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"449\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"459\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"530\">\r\n<td data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"517\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"516\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"530\">₹1,35,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"565\">\r\n<td data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"554\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"545\">Duration</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"565\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<td data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"589\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"576\">Mode</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"632\">Flexible (Semester / Yearly / One-Time)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"637\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1weqjzy\" data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"677\">Payment Options (Flexible Fee Plans)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"745\">Students can choose a payment mode based on financial convenience:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"1116\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"790\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"790\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"766\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"775\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"790\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explanation</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"1116\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<td data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"854\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"853\">Yearly Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"873\">₹45,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"905\">Pay once every academic year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"1000\">\r\n<td data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"934\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"933\">Semester-wise Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"957\">₹22,500 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1000\">Lower upfront cost, ideal for budgeting</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1116\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1024\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1023\">One-Time Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1036\">₹1,35,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1116\">Full payment at once (sometimes eligible for discounts in some universities)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h074hp\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1144\">EMI Option Available</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l25lg7\" data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1206\">Students can opt for EMI plans to reduce financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12kmsku\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1270\">Ideal for students who want to avoid large upfront payments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fcdy8c\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1327\">Additional Fees (Very Important &ndash; Often Ignored)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1353\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1485\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1376\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1376\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1366\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1376\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1485\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1443\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1433\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1432\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1443\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1485\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1466\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1465\">Examination Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1485\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w6jfdx\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1524\">Total Extra Cost (India Students)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1620\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdlvf5\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1549\">Registration: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19nya17\" data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1583\">Examination (3 years): ₹9,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1540pk2\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1620\"><strong data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1620\">Total Additional Cost: ₹11,500</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1663\">👉 <strong data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1663\">Actual Total Investment: ₹1,46,500</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1668\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j9gx8m\" data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1691\">For SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1805\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1714\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1714\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1704\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1714\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1805\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1756\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1767\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1805\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1786\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1805\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1810\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1841\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1960\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1864\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1864\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1854\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1864\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1960\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1925\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1906\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1925\">$150 (One-Time)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1960\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1944\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1960\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"1144\">The traditional BBA degree is no longer enough in today&rsquo;s competitive job market. Recruiters now expect <strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1055\">data-driven decision-making, AI awareness, and financial intelligence</strong> in graduates. This curriculum is strategically designed to bridge that gap by combining:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jt7ujl\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1176\">Core business fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tnwaa5\" data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1206\">Advanced finance concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ktkuv\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1239\">Real-world analytical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ra2eog\" data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1287\">Generative AI and digital business exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1411\">Unlike outdated programs, this structure ensures <strong data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1379\">industry readiness from Year 1 itself</strong>, not just theoretical learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1416\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kx4ovu\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1470\">Semester 1: Foundation + Future Skills Integration</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1490\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hg1ei\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1502\">English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2rut8u\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1538\">HRM and Organizational Behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1563\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jd10lg\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1595\">Modern Business Environment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x3yp80\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1627\">Essentials of Generative AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zdlnqi\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1663\">Financial Literacy and Planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u0f8ls\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1706\">What You Actually Learn (Deep Insight)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1903\">The first semester builds your <strong data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1794\">business mindset + communication + financial basics</strong>. However, the real differentiator is the early introduction of <strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1875\">Generative AI</strong>, which most colleges delay.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1929\">You begin understanding:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"2095\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wdppgg\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1971\">How organizations function internally</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i2c7sx\" data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2031\">How financial transactions are recorded and interpreted</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t92g4b\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2095\">How AI tools like ChatGPT are used in business environments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2118\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2420\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"195szrd\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2182\">Professional writing (critical for corporate communication)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1x0jc\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2244\">Financial reporting basics (foundation for finance roles)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xyq8kg\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2301\">Budgeting and planning (real-life application skill)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6p9fao\" data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2352\">ESG awareness (important for modern companies)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"puo555\" data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2398\">Prompt engineering (high-demand AI skill)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1soa09s\" data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2420\">Investment basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2449\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2471\">You gain exposure to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2568\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jtm87i\" data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2498\">Business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15mih7v\" data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2525\">Emotional intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dicrkd\" data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2549\">Conflict management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m48cn3\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2568\">Excel BI tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f7bq2p\" data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2593\">Expert Insight ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2715\">Most students ignore Semester 1 thinking it&rsquo;s basic &mdash; this is a major mistake. These foundational skills directly impact:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2789\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b0jxmo\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2740\">Internship selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"141aotw\" data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2760\">Resume strength</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rm2fbg\" data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2789\">Communication confidence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2794\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"plb7ux\" data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2849\">Semester 2: Business Systems + Data Analytics Entry</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2869\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"3055\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13j6kzu\" data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2903\">Business Regulatory Framework</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kljc57\" data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2941\">Financial Markets and Instruments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17aknr1\" data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2965\">Business Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"2988\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozme4o\" data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3014\">Communicative English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2np2s7\" data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3055\">Quantitative Techniques for Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3083\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3185\">This semester introduces <strong data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3147\">how businesses operate externally</strong> &mdash; markets, laws, and economic forces.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3187\" data-end=\"3215\">More importantly, you begin:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3274\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rj78q2\" data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3233\">Data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s7jvgz\" data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3249\">Forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15gc31k\" data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3274\">Market understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3297\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3482\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ce4i6e\" data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3343\">Business law and compliance understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3vr3\" data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3381\">Data analysis &amp; regression models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10bb9rz\" data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3434\">Demand forecasting (used in finance &amp; marketing)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqpxbt\" data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3452\">Risk analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gtj1fe\" data-start=\"3453\" data-end=\"3482\">Strategic decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"3484\" data-end=\"3511\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3601\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dl8et8\" data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3524\">Power BI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14naa1z\" data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3555\">Algorithmic trading basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tzi5mu\" data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3578\">Scrum fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13afyi9\" data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3601\">Economic analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"saa9zv\" data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3628\">Hidden Advantage 💡</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3629\" data-end=\"3774\">Students who actively learn tools like <strong data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3704\">Power BI and data analytics here</strong> gain a massive edge in internships over others who only study theory.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3779\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1yapip9\" data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3837\">Semester 3: Core Finance + Marketing + Research Skills</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3857\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"4027\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u1qapj\" data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3880\">Managerial Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3905\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0xup0\" data-start=\"3906\" data-end=\"3948\">Business Ethics and Negotiation Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ibobe\" data-start=\"3949\" data-end=\"3976\">Indian Knowledge System</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jpcxlo\" data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"4001\">Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1skrokk\" data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4027\">Environmental Science</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"4029\" data-end=\"4055\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4123\">This is where the program becomes <strong data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4122\">serious and career-oriented</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4144\">You start learning:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4240\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wt4ndb\" data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4166\">Capital budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dgrv8b\" data-start=\"4167\" data-end=\"4196\">Financial decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xcc75m\" data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4218\">Consumer behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"as06kx\" data-start=\"4219\" data-end=\"4240\">Market strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"4242\" data-end=\"4263\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4264\" data-end=\"4411\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w2teku\" data-start=\"4264\" data-end=\"4286\">Financial modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hfczuj\" data-start=\"4287\" data-end=\"4305\">Ratio analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mktgl7\" data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4326\">Pricing strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3s06q\" data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4350\">Market segmentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hssyo\" data-start=\"4351\" data-end=\"4373\">Hypothesis testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xgyh85\" data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4411\">Negotiation &amp; conflict resolution</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"4413\" data-end=\"4440\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4441\" data-end=\"4571\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eum6d7\" data-start=\"4441\" data-end=\"4475\">Excel statistics with AI tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o8v98g\" data-start=\"4476\" data-end=\"4507\">Data-driven decision making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x8kklz\" data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4544\">Environmental risk understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k74cxu\" data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4571\">Leadership development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hj1lpc\" data-start=\"4573\" data-end=\"4607\">Critical Mistake to Avoid ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4608\" data-end=\"4674\">Students often treat marketing and finance separately. In reality:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4675\" data-end=\"4774\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jgo6xy\" data-start=\"4675\" data-end=\"4727\">Finance + consumer behavior = investment success</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y1q14h\" data-start=\"4728\" data-end=\"4774\">Finance + pricing strategy = profitability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4776\" data-end=\"4779\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ql07ck\" data-start=\"4781\" data-end=\"4839\">Semester 4: Advanced Finance + Digital Business Exposure</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"4841\" data-end=\"4859\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4860\" data-end=\"5038\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"4860\" data-end=\"4880\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"4881\" data-end=\"4906\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wq9qrd\" data-start=\"4907\" data-end=\"4955\">Investment Analysis and Portfolio Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"95z1kn\" data-start=\"4956\" data-end=\"4979\">Financial Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ik3dk7\" data-start=\"4980\" data-end=\"5011\">Digital Business Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"5012\" data-end=\"5038\">International Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"5040\" data-end=\"5066\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5068\" data-end=\"5160\">This semester is heavily focused on <strong data-start=\"5104\" data-end=\"5139\">real-world finance applications</strong> and global exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5162\" data-end=\"5172\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5173\" data-end=\"5301\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t5kvsz\" data-start=\"5173\" data-end=\"5210\">Portfolio creation and management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14tkaez\" data-start=\"5211\" data-end=\"5244\">Financial data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vh4grt\" data-start=\"5245\" data-end=\"5276\">Digital business strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ceqy43\" data-start=\"5277\" data-end=\"5301\">Global trade systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"5303\" data-end=\"5324\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5325\" data-end=\"5459\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sbn8g1\" data-start=\"5325\" data-end=\"5349\">Portfolio management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ppfqzx\" data-start=\"5350\" data-end=\"5378\">Risk-return optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"119ffx3\" data-start=\"5379\" data-end=\"5402\">Financial analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oap7in\" data-start=\"5403\" data-end=\"5432\">Digital business strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11a2yx3\" data-start=\"5433\" data-end=\"5459\">Operational efficiency</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"5461\" data-end=\"5488\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5489\" data-end=\"5583\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w2teku\" data-start=\"5489\" data-end=\"5511\">Financial modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"srhled\" data-start=\"5512\" data-end=\"5536\">Banking &amp; compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9161l\" data-start=\"5537\" data-end=\"5561\">Startup fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1byyrws\" data-start=\"5562\" data-end=\"5583\">Excel for finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"138kxf8\" data-start=\"5585\" data-end=\"5611\">Strategic Insight 💡</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5612\" data-end=\"5654\">This semester directly impacts careers in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5655\" data-end=\"5722\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z0lpin\" data-start=\"5655\" data-end=\"5677\">Investment banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iq9s37\" data-start=\"5678\" data-end=\"5700\">Financial analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qo6udd\" data-start=\"5701\" data-end=\"5722\">Startup ecosystem</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5724\" data-end=\"5727\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rwto8l\" data-start=\"5729\" data-end=\"5774\">Semester 5: Specialization + AI Integration</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"5776\" data-end=\"5794\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5795\" data-end=\"5975\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bee724\" data-start=\"5795\" data-end=\"5818\">Indian Constitution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"anv8l6\" data-start=\"5819\" data-end=\"5853\">Cost and Management Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"623sq4\" data-start=\"5854\" data-end=\"5887\">Advanced Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8r930h\" data-start=\"5888\" data-end=\"5910\">Behavioral Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n070eg\" data-start=\"5911\" data-end=\"5947\">Digital Marketing and E-Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajo29n\" data-start=\"5948\" data-end=\"5975\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"5977\" data-end=\"6003\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6005\" data-end=\"6075\">This is where your profile becomes <strong data-start=\"6040\" data-end=\"6074\">specialized and industry-ready</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6077\" data-end=\"6089\">You explore:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6090\" data-end=\"6209\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ormt97\" data-start=\"6090\" data-end=\"6124\">Cost control and profitability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e5f50a\" data-start=\"6125\" data-end=\"6174\">Human financial behavior (behavioral finance)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cq2hob\" data-start=\"6175\" data-end=\"6209\">AI in business decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"6211\" data-end=\"6232\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6233\" data-end=\"6368\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10fwd5h\" data-start=\"6233\" data-end=\"6259\">Cost sheet preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1enktr4\" data-start=\"6260\" data-end=\"6281\">Budgetary control</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dv9072\" data-start=\"6282\" data-end=\"6315\">Financial decision techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17uzi82\" data-start=\"6316\" data-end=\"6344\">Behavioral bias analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k5qms9\" data-start=\"6345\" data-end=\"6368\">AI-driven analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"6370\" data-end=\"6397\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6398\" data-end=\"6500\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19xpidt\" data-start=\"6398\" data-end=\"6427\">Financial risk management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ppuwm1\" data-start=\"6428\" data-end=\"6450\">Corporate analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wt1xtr\" data-start=\"6451\" data-end=\"6470\">Banking careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r2bxg8\" data-start=\"6471\" data-end=\"6500\">Advanced statistics tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"p735ds\" data-start=\"6502\" data-end=\"6522\">Hidden Risk ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6523\" data-end=\"6624\">Students often underestimate <strong data-start=\"6552\" data-end=\"6574\">Behavioral Finance</strong>, but it is one of the most powerful subjects for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6625\" data-end=\"6695\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cv3ipp\" data-start=\"6625\" data-end=\"6649\">Stock market careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"123elu\" data-start=\"6650\" data-end=\"6673\">Investment strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14qnso\" data-start=\"6674\" data-end=\"6695\">Wealth management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6697\" data-end=\"6700\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1thsd8u\" data-start=\"6702\" data-end=\"6755\">Semester 6: Strategy + FinTech + Industry Readiness</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"6757\" data-end=\"6775\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6776\" data-end=\"6937\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"6776\" data-end=\"6800\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1658k77\" data-start=\"6801\" data-end=\"6817\">Business Tax</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"28hzzc\" data-start=\"6818\" data-end=\"6856\">International Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13vzbbv\" data-start=\"6857\" data-end=\"6893\">Financial Technologies (FinTech)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"6894\" data-end=\"6916\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yg84bo\" data-start=\"6917\" data-end=\"6937\">Research Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"6939\" data-end=\"6965\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6967\" data-end=\"7046\">This final semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"6998\" data-end=\"7045\">real industry application + decision-making</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7048\" data-end=\"7059\">You master:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7060\" data-end=\"7165\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7xmp3k\" data-start=\"7060\" data-end=\"7082\">Corporate strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9l8c8\" data-start=\"7083\" data-end=\"7099\">Tax planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oby6iz\" data-start=\"7100\" data-end=\"7118\">Global finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g56l9p\" data-start=\"7119\" data-end=\"7142\">FinTech innovations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nbyed4\" data-start=\"7143\" data-end=\"7165\">Business analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"7167\" data-end=\"7188\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7189\" data-end=\"7308\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sfrq8o\" data-start=\"7189\" data-end=\"7207\">Tax compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qxx3bz\" data-start=\"7208\" data-end=\"7236\">Currency risk management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yd373r\" data-start=\"7237\" data-end=\"7262\">FinTech understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ve6sdc\" data-start=\"7263\" data-end=\"7285\">Advanced analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6x50c0\" data-start=\"7286\" data-end=\"7308\">Strategic thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"7310\" data-end=\"7337\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7338\" data-end=\"7452\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rczpek\" data-start=\"7338\" data-end=\"7364\">FinTech specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tnobqn\" data-start=\"7365\" data-end=\"7382\">AI in finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ah9bs\" data-start=\"7383\" data-end=\"7421\">Banking standards (IFRS, AML, KYC)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"getn5k\" data-start=\"7422\" data-end=\"7452\">Corporate finance strategy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1003kca\" data-start=\"7454\" data-end=\"7476\">Career Impact 💡</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7477\" data-end=\"7549\">This semester defines your final placement opportunities, especially in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7550\" data-end=\"7622\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13jd51u\" data-start=\"7550\" data-end=\"7571\">FinTech companies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kyaf\" data-start=\"7572\" data-end=\"7592\">Consulting firms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19h6hg0\" data-start=\"7593\" data-end=\"7622\">Financial analytics roles</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 135000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(299, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 268, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 05:19:34', '2026-06-16 07:07:24', '<p data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"682\">The BBA admission process is designed to be <strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"574\">simple, fast, and student-friendly</strong>, but many students still face rejection or delays due to <strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"681\">small mistakes, poor planning, or late action</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"787\">This guide explains each step in detail so you can <strong data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"786\">secure your admission without confusion or risk</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ph40vs\" data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"853\">Step 1: Submit Application (Start Your Admission Journey)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19bejcm\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"877\">What You Need to Do</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"1118\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cj9gmr\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"923\">Fill out the <strong data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"921\">online application form</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x85doe\" data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"1118\">Provide accurate details:\r\n<ul data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1118\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h7vehg\" data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1002\">Personal information (name, contact details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16x56ew\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1072\">Academic details (Class 10, Class 12 marks or appearing status)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c1mljc\" data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1118\">Program preference (BBA specialization)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1123\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f87ror\" data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1154\">Why This Step is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1231\">This is the <strong data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1195\">initial screening stage</strong>, where your eligibility is checked.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yw8bjp\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1263\">What Universities Evaluate</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1354\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nb99wg\" data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1288\">Academic eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16c41dl\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1320\">Completeness of application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1feycvz\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1354\">Accuracy of submitted details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19w8zv5\" data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1383\">Expert Insight&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1407\">Even small errors like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1476\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q7r707\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1427\">Incorrect marks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hfgcz5\" data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1449\">Spelling mistakes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"79dnf8\" data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1476\">Wrong document uploads</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1493\">&nbsp;Can lead to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1540\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ijhv85\" data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1519\">Application rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dop95z\" data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1540\">Admission delays</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1545\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wlvygn\" data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1603\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program (Decision-Making Stage)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yzfqb1\" data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1633\">What Happens in This Step</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1735\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f9txyj\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1676\">You select your <strong data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1674\">final BBA program</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d71a39\" data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1707\">Verify all entered details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z30nxr\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1735\">Confirm your enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1740\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"l3eop6\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1774\">What You Must Check Carefully</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1917\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wmqggi\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1825\">Specialization (Marketing, Finance, AI, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oabpkp\" data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1860\">Fee structure and payment plan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hs03gk\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1895\">Curriculum and skill offerings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ebpce\" data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1917\">Placement support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1922\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wq8vfn\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1943\">Hidden Risk&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1977\">Many students rush this step and:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2041\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gwieqo\" data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2013\">Choose the wrong specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fle0zx\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2041\">Ignore career alignment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2106\">&nbsp;This mistake can affect your <strong data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2105\">career direction for years</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2111\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1tghawr\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2159\">Step 3: Complete Payment (Most Crucial Step)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2231\">Your admission moves forward only after payment or financing approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2236\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"148ijp2\" data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2266\">Payment Options Available</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1458i2o\" data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2288\">One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2359\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nw7ojp\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2321\">Pay full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ubhehd\" data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2359\"><strong data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2359\">Benefit: Get up to 15% discount</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2364\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kcshpp\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2397\">Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19kados\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2434\">Pay in easy monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2rmzj3\" data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2470\"><strong data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2468\">0% interest (in most cases)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sqb714\" data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2499\">Reduces financial burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2504\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1d6ac2z\" data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2533\">Strategic Payment Advice</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sifxs8\" data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2566\">Choose One-Time Payment if:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2628\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"55gigo\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2595\">You want maximum savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kdxrq5\" data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2628\">You have financial stability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xott3j\" data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2648\">Choose EMI if:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2736\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xex4kl\" data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2684\">You prefer low monthly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1elr04a\" data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2736\">You want to invest in additional certifications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2741\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19us1yx\" data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2768\">Important Insight&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2796\">Students who delay payment:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2857\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ezloa\" data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2823\">Risk losing their seat</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3xdr4y\" data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2857\">Miss early admission benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2862\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wxuvsp\" data-start=\"2864\" data-end=\"2917\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat (Final Confirmation Stage)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2948\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2992\">Once you complete payment or EMI approval:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3177\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1izb4ml\" data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3040\">Your admission is <strong data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3038\">officially confirmed</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fzwpkj\" data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3069\">Your <strong data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3067\">seat is secured</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s105y1\" data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3177\">You receive:\r\n<ul data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3177\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3113\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vj5ez2\" data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3138\">Enrollment details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1psbmrw\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3177\">LMS access (for online programs)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3182\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u3cbja\" data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3212\">Why This Step is Critical</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3244\">&nbsp;Until payment is completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3276\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zstht\" data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3276\">Your seat is <strong data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3276\">NOT reserved</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fsqmy6\" data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3303\">High-Demand Risk&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3337\">Popular BBA specializations like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3382\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m6xjvw\" data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3351\">Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173ueww\" data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3363\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bpomc0\" data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3382\">AI &amp; Analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3419\">&nbsp;Fill quickly due to high demand.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3424\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11gmrv6\" data-start=\"3426\" data-end=\"3473\">Admission Timeline (How Fast is the Process?)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3690\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3499\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3499\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3482\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3499\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Time Required</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3690\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3559\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3542\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Form</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3559\">10&ndash;20 minutes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3598\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3586\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3598\">Same day</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3643\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Processing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3643\">Instant / Few hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3644\" data-end=\"3690\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3644\" data-end=\"3675\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Admission Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3690\">24&ndash;48 hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3692\" data-end=\"3695\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3731\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3733\" data-end=\"3862\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulae2l\" data-start=\"3733\" data-end=\"3755\">Class 10 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b8874g\" data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3799\">Class 12 marksheet (or appearing proof)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bg5v2s\" data-start=\"3800\" data-end=\"3833\">Identity proof (Aadhar, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3862\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"565\">To apply for a BBA program, students must meet a <strong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"564\">simple but important academic requirement</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"777\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cel94i\" data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"651\">Must have <strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"625\">passed or be appearing for Class 12 (10+2)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8hijgy\" data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"777\">In some cases, candidates with a <strong data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"708\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> may also apply (depending on program type or advanced entry options)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"878\">👉 This flexibility makes BBA one of the <strong data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"877\">most accessible and student-friendly business degrees</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"883\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"sn2iry\" data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"926\">Detailed Eligibility Criteria Explained</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"115hq6s\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"972\">Academic Qualification (Core Requirement)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1017\">Students must satisfy one of the following:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1245\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zv1uws\" data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1076\">Completed <strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1050\">10+2 (Class 12)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15e2cvy\" data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1143\">Students <strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1114\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are also eligible to apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cfesrk\" data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1245\">Candidates with a <strong data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1185\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> can apply for certain advanced or additional BBA pathways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1250\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e0gm45\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1297\">Accepted Boards (Including Open Schooling)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1323\">Eligible boards include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1411\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uej2m7\" data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1333\">CBSE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qhw6us\" data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1342\">ICSE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1olewja\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1359\">State Boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmj5uk\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1411\"><strong data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1409\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1522\">👉 This ensures that students from <strong data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1491\">both regular and open education systems</strong> can apply without restriction.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1557\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1628\">Although it varies across institutions, general eligibility includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1679\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1258ivb\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1679\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1679\">45%&ndash;60% aggregate marks in Class 12</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x24ye2\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1707\">Important Insight 💡</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1827\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dpxe7z\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1762\">Top-tier universities may require <strong data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1760\">60% or above</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1be82ol\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1827\">Online or flexible programs may accept <strong data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1825\">lower percentages</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1890\">👉 Always check specific university cut-offs before applying.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1895\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1h9x7eq\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1935\">Stream Eligibility (Who Can Apply?)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1989\">BBA is a <strong data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1975\">stream-independent course</strong>, which means:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2068\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x2n997\" data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2014\">Commerce students&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xs162a\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2037\">Science students&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mytpa8\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2068\">Arts/Humanities students&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"138kxf8\" data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2096\">Strategic Insight&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2147\">Students from non-commerce backgrounds benefit by:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2225\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"habw1r\" data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2183\">Gaining business exposure early</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wxmh15\" data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2225\">Building diverse career opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2230\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w3jba8\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2253\">Age Limit Criteria</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n1qmao\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2313\">Most universities <strong data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2311\">do not impose a strict age limit</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"db3q07\" data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2400\">Some may prefer candidates in the <strong data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2371\">17&ndash;25 years range</strong>, but this is not mandatory</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2405\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pskkpb\" data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2435\">Entrance Exam Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2470\">Admission to BBA programs can be:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ermp78\" data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2497\">Merit-Based Admission</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2525\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tvk3gz\" data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2525\">Based on Class 12 marks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t6ny3b\" data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2555\">Entrance-Based Admission</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2638\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17iijhy\" data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2591\">University-level entrance tests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t4bdtx\" data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2638\">National-level exams (in top institutions)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xfjza0\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2660\">Key Insight ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2758\">Many students assume entrance exams are compulsory &mdash; this is <strong data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2741\">not always true</strong>, especially for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2807\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17xcoyp\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2782\">Online BBA programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"psv4av\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2807\">Private universities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2812\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"drxz7b\" data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2849\">Eligibility Based on Program Type</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6w24bo\" data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2878\">Regular BBA (After 12th)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2948\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1buovbx\" data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2918\">10+2 pass or appearing for Class 12</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ynl8n7\" data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2948\">Minimum marks as required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wdsbnr\" data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2974\">Online / Distance BBA</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1988kkh\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"2988\">10+2 pass</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xojupv\" data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3022\">Flexible eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"73tg5z\" data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3051\">Usually no entrance exam</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ps0742\" data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3084\">Advanced / Lateral Entry BBA</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3152\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1njhgy6\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3152\">Requires a <strong data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3130\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or diploma</strong> (varies by program)</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"698\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"497\">actual cost of a BBA program</strong> is essential before taking admission. Many students only consider tuition fees, but a smart decision requires evaluating <strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"697\">complete financial investment, flexibility, and return on investment (ROI)</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bi4uzx\" data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"721\">Core Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"756\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"756\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"746\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"756\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"827\">\r\n<td data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"814\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"813\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"827\">₹1,35,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"862\">\r\n<td data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"851\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"849\">Course Duration</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"862\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"921\">\r\n<td data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"889\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"888\">Payment Flexibility</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"921\">Semester / Yearly / One-Time</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<td data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"939\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"938\">EMI Option</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"952\">Available</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"957\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"78ij29\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1015\">Flexible Payment Options (Choose Based on Your Budget)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1178\">One of the biggest advantages of this BBA program is <strong data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1099\">flexible payment planning</strong>, allowing students from different financial backgrounds to enroll comfortably.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pzf00i\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1206\">Payment Plans Breakdown</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1244\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1244\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1223\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1232\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1244\" data-col-size=\"md\">Best For</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1365\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1302\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1301\">Semester-wise</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1325\">₹22,500 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1365\">Students who prefer low upfront cost</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1436\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1387\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1386\">Yearly Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1406\">₹45,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1436\">Balanced payment structure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1460\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1459\">One-Time Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1472\">₹1,35,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1521\">Students who want to complete payment at once</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1526\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15pha9f\" data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1576\">EMI Option (Zero Financial Pressure Strategy)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1802\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f56oki\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1636\">EMI plans allow you to pay in <strong data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1634\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqieoy\" data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1694\">In many cases, <strong data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1679\">0% interest financing</strong> is available</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yqjm3\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1802\">Ideal for students who want to:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1802\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vta3lu\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1751\">Manage cash flow</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dfhv94\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1802\">Invest in additional certifications or tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i1cc0i\" data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1827\">Expert Insight 💡</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1897\">Choosing EMI is not a disadvantage if used smartly. It allows you to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1989\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rzqqc0\" data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1934\">Preserve cash for skill-building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wzxv3u\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1989\">Invest in certifications that improve job outcomes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"1994\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qbm3z7\" data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2060\">Additional Fees (Critical Cost Component Most Students Ignore)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2086\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2218\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2109\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2109\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2099\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2218\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2176\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2166\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2165\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2176\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2218\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2199\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2198\">Examination Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2218\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6hwxo\" data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2253\">Total Additional Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2321\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uve7mf\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2283\">Registration Fee: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1up7jwt\" data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2321\">Examination Fee (3 years): ₹9,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2355\">👉 <strong data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2355\">Total Extra Cost: ₹11,500</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2398\">👉 <strong data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2398\">Actual Total Investment: ₹1,46,500</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2403\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j9gx8m\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2426\">For SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2540\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2449\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2449\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2439\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2449\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2540\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2502\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2491\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2502\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2540\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2521\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2540\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2545\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2576\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2695\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2599\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2599\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2589\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2599\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2695\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2660\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2641\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2660\">$150 (One-Time)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2695\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2679\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2695\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"647\">The marketing industry has completely transformed. Traditional advertising alone is no longer enough &mdash; companies now demand professionals who understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yyort\" data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"685\"><strong data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"683\">Digital marketing ecosystems</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xikuhk\" data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"732\"><strong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"730\">Consumer psychology and data analytics</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bpxdo2\" data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"784\"><strong data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"782\">AI-driven content and campaign optimization</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"962\">This BBA program is designed to build <strong data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"858\">end-to-end marketing expertise</strong>, starting from fundamentals and progressing to <strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"961\">advanced digital, branding, and AI-based strategies</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1094\">👉 By the end of this course, you are not just a graduate&mdash;you become a <strong data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1093\">job-ready marketing professional with practical skills</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1099\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"dglzc6\" data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1168\">Semester 1: Business Foundation + Communication + AI Introduction</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1188\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1361\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hg1ei\" data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1200\">English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2rut8u\" data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1236\">HRM and Organizational Behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1261\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jd10lg\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1293\">Modern Business Environment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x3yp80\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1325\">Essentials of Generative AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zdlnqi\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1361\">Financial Literacy and Planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1389\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1517\">This semester builds your <strong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1473\">core business understanding and communication skills</strong>, which are essential for marketing success.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1538\">You start learning:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1696\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d4pzv6\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1569\">How organizations function</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djdy6r\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1622\">How financial decisions affect marketing budgets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z6p6fs\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1696\">Basics of <strong data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1694\">Generative AI (content, automation, productivity tools)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1719\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1995\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"widwai\" data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1767\">Professional writing (ads, emails, content)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16stn1l\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1801\">Business environment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ycac36\" data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1849\">Budgeting (important for campaign planning)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l85xrg\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1901\">ESG awareness (important for brand positioning)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1844w5l\" data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1945\">Prompt engineering (AI marketing skill)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"viasbh\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1995\">Investment basics (understanding ROI mindset)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2024\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2121\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jtm87i\" data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2051\">Business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15mih7v\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2078\">Emotional intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dicrkd\" data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2102\">Conflict management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m48cn3\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2121\">Excel BI tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f7bq2p\" data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2146\">Expert Insight ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2261\">Marketing is heavily communication-driven. Students who ignore writing and communication skills struggle later in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2320\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p5atdx\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2283\">Content marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19e0142\" data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2299\">Advertising</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h09kw\" data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2320\">Brand management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2325\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kw4s45\" data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2384\">Semester 2: Business Ecosystem + Data &amp; Analytics Entry</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2404\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2590\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13j6kzu\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2438\">Business Regulatory Framework</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kljc57\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2476\">Financial Markets and Instruments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17aknr1\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2500\">Business Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2523\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozme4o\" data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2549\">Communicative English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2np2s7\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2590\">Quantitative Techniques for Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2618\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2644\">You begin understanding:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2720\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dhku7e\" data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2666\">Market structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w7eyjv\" data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2688\">Economic behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g3gop9\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2720\">Data-driven decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2776\">This is your <strong data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2775\">entry point into marketing analytics</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2799\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2928\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rj78q2\" data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2817\">Data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h16k9g\" data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2840\">Demand forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hrsw2d\" data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2860\">Market research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqpxbt\" data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2878\">Risk analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16cfrod\" data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2901\">Strategic planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"th04jy\" data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"2928\">Decision-making models</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2957\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"3068\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19v5boh\" data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2989\">Power BI (high-demand tool)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6sa8t\" data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3014\">Algorithmic thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14s5cdx\" data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3045\">Scrum (project management)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13afyi9\" data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3068\">Economic analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"saa9zv\" data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3095\">Hidden Advantage 💡</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3161\">Students who master <strong data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3139\">data analysis early</strong> outperform others in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3234\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dz0knl\" data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3189\">Digital marketing roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsfsno\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3215\">Performance marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sj7g60\" data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3234\">Growth hacking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3239\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1aoqjgr\" data-start=\"3241\" data-end=\"3301\">Semester 3: Core Marketing + Finance + Consumer Psychology</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3321\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3491\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u1qapj\" data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3344\">Managerial Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3369\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0xup0\" data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3412\">Business Ethics and Negotiation Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ibobe\" data-start=\"3413\" data-end=\"3440\">Indian Knowledge System</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jpcxlo\" data-start=\"3441\" data-end=\"3465\">Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1skrokk\" data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3491\">Environmental Science</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"3493\" data-end=\"3519\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3561\">This is where <strong data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3560\">real marketing begins</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3563\" data-end=\"3573\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3686\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xcc75m\" data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3595\">Consumer behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3s06q\" data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3619\">Market segmentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5q6rx9\" data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3642\">Pricing strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i8lvsd\" data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3686\">Financial impact of marketing decisions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"3688\" data-end=\"3709\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3884\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rvd3u\" data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3752\">Financial modeling (budget allocation)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1afqh1x\" data-start=\"3753\" data-end=\"3776\">Consumer psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mktgl7\" data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"3797\">Pricing strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3s06q\" data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3821\">Market segmentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hssyo\" data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3844\">Hypothesis testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11bev5k\" data-start=\"3845\" data-end=\"3884\">Negotiation and conflict resolution</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"3886\" data-end=\"3913\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"4023\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o8v98g\" data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"3945\">Data-driven decision making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vb0n16\" data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"3966\">Excel statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xq417\" data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"3990\">Process improvement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yzkb20\" data-start=\"3991\" data-end=\"4023\">Environmental risk awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wahi6c\" data-start=\"4025\" data-end=\"4050\">Critical Insight ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4113\">Students often ignore finance in marketing. This is a mistake.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4169\">👉 Marketing without financial understanding leads to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4170\" data-end=\"4221\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"148d69f\" data-start=\"4170\" data-end=\"4192\">Poor ROI campaigns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0l0jm\" data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4221\">Ineffective budget usage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4223\" data-end=\"4226\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1f27h1v\" data-start=\"4228\" data-end=\"4288\">Semester 4: Advanced Marketing + Digital &amp; Global Exposure</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4308\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4459\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4329\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"4330\" data-end=\"4355\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dplhzu\" data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4377\">Consumer Behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"henw76\" data-start=\"4378\" data-end=\"4400\">Services Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ik3dk7\" data-start=\"4401\" data-end=\"4432\">Digital Business Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"4433\" data-end=\"4459\">International Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"4461\" data-end=\"4487\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4489\" data-end=\"4514\">This semester focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4515\" data-end=\"4595\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmzdjy\" data-start=\"4515\" data-end=\"4536\">Digital platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jf0fil\" data-start=\"4537\" data-end=\"4564\">Service-based marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ul2zc\" data-start=\"4565\" data-end=\"4595\">Global business strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"4597\" data-end=\"4618\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4619\" data-end=\"4760\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcebe0\" data-start=\"4619\" data-end=\"4646\">Business model creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eevipt\" data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4681\">Customer experience management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xxkklc\" data-start=\"4682\" data-end=\"4707\">E-commerce strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l0qfbq\" data-start=\"4708\" data-end=\"4735\">International marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7scfsy\" data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4760\">Process optimization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"4762\" data-end=\"4789\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4790\" data-end=\"4891\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c9j71v\" data-start=\"4790\" data-end=\"4822\">Conversion rate optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uknehb\" data-start=\"4823\" data-end=\"4841\">Neuromarketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"giffb\" data-start=\"4842\" data-end=\"4866\">Graphic design tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9161l\" data-start=\"4867\" data-end=\"4891\">Startup fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"138kxf8\" data-start=\"4893\" data-end=\"4919\">Strategic Insight 💡</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4920\" data-end=\"4951\">This semester prepares you for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4952\" data-end=\"5035\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kncpvu\" data-start=\"4952\" data-end=\"4969\">Startup roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pgo27b\" data-start=\"4970\" data-end=\"5000\">Digital marketing agencies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o51ws4\" data-start=\"5001\" data-end=\"5035\">International brand strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5037\" data-end=\"5040\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1aedppe\" data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5107\">Semester 5: Specialization in Digital Marketing + Branding + AI</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"5109\" data-end=\"5127\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5128\" data-end=\"5325\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bee724\" data-start=\"5128\" data-end=\"5151\">Indian Constitution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fdubuk\" data-start=\"5152\" data-end=\"5190\">Content Marketing and Storytelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bkndma\" data-start=\"5191\" data-end=\"5226\">Advertising and Sales Promotion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yrvtow\" data-start=\"5227\" data-end=\"5260\">Brand Strategy and Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n070eg\" data-start=\"5261\" data-end=\"5297\">Digital Marketing and E-Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajo29n\" data-start=\"5298\" data-end=\"5325\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"5327\" data-end=\"5353\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5355\" data-end=\"5397\">This is the <strong data-start=\"5367\" data-end=\"5396\">core specialization phase</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5399\" data-end=\"5421\">You gain expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5422\" data-end=\"5535\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6rcn75\" data-start=\"5422\" data-end=\"5459\">Content creation and storytelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qvw1la\" data-start=\"5460\" data-end=\"5483\">Branding strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8u82n\" data-start=\"5484\" data-end=\"5505\">Digital campaigns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s8k98g\" data-start=\"5506\" data-end=\"5535\">AI-driven marketing tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"5537\" data-end=\"5558\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5559\" data-end=\"5724\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k52x1g\" data-start=\"5559\" data-end=\"5590\">Digital marketing execution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"em822y\" data-start=\"5591\" data-end=\"5612\">Brand positioning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f6v6q3\" data-start=\"5613\" data-end=\"5634\">Campaign planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3yd523\" data-start=\"5635\" data-end=\"5673\">Integrated marketing communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k89v5v\" data-start=\"5674\" data-end=\"5693\">AI in marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"117npse\" data-start=\"5694\" data-end=\"5724\">Sales promotion strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"5726\" data-end=\"5753\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5754\" data-end=\"5834\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1moniyq\" data-start=\"5754\" data-end=\"5780\">Web design (WordPress)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"giffb\" data-start=\"5781\" data-end=\"5805\">Graphic design tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1brzoam\" data-start=\"5806\" data-end=\"5834\">Creative software skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"p735ds\" data-start=\"5836\" data-end=\"5856\">Hidden Risk ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5857\" data-end=\"5922\">Students focus only on theory but ignore <strong data-start=\"5898\" data-end=\"5916\">hands-on tools</strong> like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5923\" data-end=\"5965\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a9yjut\" data-start=\"5923\" data-end=\"5943\">Website building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9h8o9k\" data-start=\"5944\" data-end=\"5965\">Ad campaign tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5967\" data-end=\"6011\">👉 This reduces employability significantly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6013\" data-end=\"6016\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"khqiqr\" data-start=\"6018\" data-end=\"6073\">Semester 6: Strategy + Analytics + Industry Readiness</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"6075\" data-end=\"6093\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6094\" data-end=\"6228\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"6094\" data-end=\"6118\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1658k77\" data-start=\"6119\" data-end=\"6135\">Business Tax</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"euijij\" data-start=\"6136\" data-end=\"6156\">Retail Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h0mkhi\" data-start=\"6157\" data-end=\"6184\">International Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"6185\" data-end=\"6207\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yg84bo\" data-start=\"6208\" data-end=\"6228\">Research Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"6230\" data-end=\"6256\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6258\" data-end=\"6326\">This final semester prepares you for <strong data-start=\"6295\" data-end=\"6325\">real-world marketing roles</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6328\" data-end=\"6338\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6339\" data-end=\"6458\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gtj1fe\" data-start=\"6339\" data-end=\"6368\">Strategic decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4t0tyj\" data-start=\"6369\" data-end=\"6400\">Retail and global marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nbyed4\" data-start=\"6401\" data-end=\"6423\">Business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ueah4w\" data-start=\"6424\" data-end=\"6458\">Research-based problem solving</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"6460\" data-end=\"6481\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6482\" data-end=\"6618\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m5rwv1\" data-start=\"6482\" data-end=\"6506\">Competitive analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nbyed4\" data-start=\"6507\" data-end=\"6529\">Business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"idzr3o\" data-start=\"6530\" data-end=\"6549\">Retail strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vrcfu\" data-start=\"6550\" data-end=\"6577\">Performance measurement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n731x0\" data-start=\"6578\" data-end=\"6598\">Applied research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pcanhh\" data-start=\"6599\" data-end=\"6618\">Problem solving</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"6620\" data-end=\"6647\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6648\" data-end=\"6733\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2znj2h\" data-start=\"6648\" data-end=\"6681\">Social media marketing trends</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y7ub24\" data-start=\"6682\" data-end=\"6697\">UX research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mk6cm\" data-start=\"6698\" data-end=\"6733\">Integrated marketing strategies</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 135000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(300, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 269, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 05:38:08', '2026-06-16 07:07:44', '<p data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"764\">The BBA admission process is designed to be <strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"575\">simple, fast, and accessible</strong>, but many students still face delays or rejection due to lack of clarity or poor planning. Understanding each stage in detail helps ensure <strong data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"763\">smooth admission and early seat confirmation</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ph40vs\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"830\">Step 1: Submit Application (Start Your Admission Journey)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19bejcm\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"854\">What You Need to Do</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cj9gmr\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"900\">Fill out the <strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"898\">online application form</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1keqcux\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"1122\">Enter accurate details, including:\r\n<ul data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h7vehg\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"988\">Personal information (name, contact details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kvqkdb\" data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1061\">Academic details (Class 10 and Class 12 marks or appearing status)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uhh752\" data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1122\">Program preference (BBA specialization, if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1127\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"gvq1oy\" data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1161\">What Happens After Submission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1195\">Once you submit the application:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1338\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8uxg5\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1229\">Your eligibility is reviewed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fqy72r\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1283\">Your details are recorded in the admission system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1treilu\" data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1338\">You move to the next stage if requirements are met</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1343\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jcsss4\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1359\">Key Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1407\">Accuracy is critical at this stage. Errors in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1461\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9o2b2\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1417\">Marks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1438\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dt7tsm\" data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1461\">Uploaded documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1524\">can lead to <strong data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1523\">application rejection or verification delays</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1529\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8enzcm\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1589\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program (Critical Decision Stage)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19bejcm\" data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1613\">What You Need to Do</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1755\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187pllm\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1670\">Select your <strong data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1668\">final BBA program or specialization</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsjrc2\" data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1718\">Review and verify all submitted information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pgxzfj\" data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1755\">Confirm your enrollment decision</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1760\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mj76kh\" data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1799\">What You Should Evaluate Carefully</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1849\">Before confirming enrollment, ensure clarity on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"2038\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ec5s1w\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1904\">Specialization (Marketing, Finance, HR, AI, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aqqou0\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1949\">Course curriculum and industry relevance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cancfr\" data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1991\">Fee structure and payment flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"whqqvs\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2038\">Placement support and career opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2043\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k2lei3\" data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2065\">Strategic Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2158\">This is one of the most important steps because your choice of program directly influences:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2236\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mjtkvb\" data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2175\">Career path</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"buy5xm\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2197\">Skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fscpho\" data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2236\">Job opportunities after graduation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2307\">Students who rush this step often make <strong data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2306\">long-term career mistakes</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2312\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vw1kie\" data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2369\">Step 3: Complete Payment (Admission Activation Stage)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2450\">Admission is not finalized until payment is completed or financing is approved.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2455\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2485\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1458i2o\" data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2507\">One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2584\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohza4c\" data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2544\">Pay the full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmflx0\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2584\">Eligible for <strong data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2582\">up to 15% discount</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2589\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kcshpp\" data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2622\">Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2752\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"scu1xe\" data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2658\">Pay in <strong data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2656\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ztq2f6\" data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2713\">Typically available with <strong data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2711\">0% interest financing</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rttxl\" data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2752\">Reduces immediate financial burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2757\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z6ez5y\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2786\">Important Considerations</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2956\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rtbvwa\" data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2840\">Payment confirms your intent to join the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4h6dkp\" data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2956\">Delay in payment may result in:\r\n<ul data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2956\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"188osnt\" data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2907\">Loss of admission priority</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1996roh\" data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2956\">Unavailability of preferred specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2961\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1a757lz\" data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"2992\">Strategic Payment Decision</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3103\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l3li5w\" data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3038\">Choose one-time payment for cost savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5l04ah\" data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3103\">Choose EMI if you prefer financial flexibility and liquidity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3108\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"u2rsfo\" data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3167\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat (Final Admission Confirmation)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3198\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3251\">Once payment is completed or financing is approved:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3464\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1izb4ml\" data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3299\">Your admission is <strong data-start=\"3273\" data-end=\"3297\">officially confirmed</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y78fi1\" data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3343\">Your <strong data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3341\">seat in the program is secured</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17jztom\" data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3464\">You receive:\r\n<ul data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3464\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3387\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vj5ez2\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3412\">Enrollment details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kktjw3\" data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3464\">Access to student systems (LMS, portal, etc.)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3469\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u3cbja\" data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3499\">Why This Step is Critical</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3528\">Until payment is completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3610\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1595j1t\" data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3563\">Your seat is <strong data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3561\">not reserved</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qphudy\" data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3610\">You are not considered officially admitted</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3696\">In high-demand programs, seats can fill quickly, especially in specializations like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3773\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m6xjvw\" data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3711\">Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173ueww\" data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3723\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3746\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6c6srh\" data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3773\">AI-integrated programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3775\" data-end=\"3778\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11gmrv6\" data-start=\"3780\" data-end=\"3827\">Admission Timeline (How Fast is the Process?)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"4054\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3855\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3855\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3837\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3837\" data-end=\"3855\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Estimated Time</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"4054\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3923\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3906\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Submission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3906\" data-end=\"3923\">10&ndash;20 minutes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3962\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3950\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3962\">Same day</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"4007\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"3984\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Processing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3984\" data-end=\"4007\">Instant / Few hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4054\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4039\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Admission Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4054\">24&ndash;48 hour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"627\">The fundamental eligibility requirement for admission into a BBA program is straightforward but must be clearly understood to avoid admission issues later.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"870\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ij2ndg\" data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"724\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"698\">passed or be appearing for Class 12 (10+2)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g59nqn\" data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"870\">In certain cases, candidates who already hold a <strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"796\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> may also apply, depending on the program type or advanced entry options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"1021\">This flexibility makes BBA one of the most <strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"963\">accessible undergraduate management programs</strong>, suitable for students from diverse academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1026\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1xwalus\" data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1084\">Detailed BBA Eligibility Criteria (Explained in Depth)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vd27nh\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1124\">Academic Qualification Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1212\">To qualify for admission, students must meet at least one of the following conditions:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1497\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y11ar9\" data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1284\">Successfully completed <strong data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1258\">10+2 (Class 12)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fu16ki\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1400\">Students <strong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1322\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are also eligible to apply (provisional admission is granted in most cases)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pi9vv6\" data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1497\">Candidates with a <strong data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1442\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> may apply for specialized or additional BBA pathways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1502\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z5hfys\" data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1551\">Recognized Boards (Including Open Schooling)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1586\">Eligible academic boards include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1674\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uej2m7\" data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1596\">CBSE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qhw6us\" data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1605\">ICSE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1olewja\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1622\">State Boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmj5uk\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1674\"><strong data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1672\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1795\">This ensures that students from both <strong data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1773\">traditional schooling systems and open education systems</strong> are equally eligible.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1800\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1830\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1910\">Although eligibility criteria vary by institution, the general requirement is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1964\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pzwvov\" data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1964\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1964\">45% to 60% aggregate marks in Class 12</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hkdw53\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1983\">Key Insight</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2136\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t0untu\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2062\">Competitive institutions may require <strong data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2060\">higher percentages (60% or above)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t788d6\" data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2136\">Online or flexible programs may have <strong data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2134\">relaxed eligibility criteria</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2229\">Students should always verify the specific cut-off requirements of their chosen university.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2234\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1h9x7eq\" data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2274\">Stream Eligibility (Who Can Apply?)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2377\">BBA is a <strong data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2315\">stream-independent program</strong>, which means students from all academic streams are eligible:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2423\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4h0lx\" data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2391\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y83j8c\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2403\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4bazzi\" data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2423\">Arts/Humanities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zkuzid\" data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2450\">Strategic Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2523\">Students from non-commerce backgrounds can use BBA as an opportunity to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2618\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1urqzz4\" data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2565\">Build business knowledge from scratch</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ig8cr5\" data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2618\">Transition into management and corporate careers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2623\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w3jba8\" data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2646\">Age Limit Criteria</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2821\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rpqyqj\" data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2707\">Most universities <strong data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2705\">do not enforce a strict age limit</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cy79i9\" data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2821\">Some institutions may prefer candidates within the <strong data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2782\">17&ndash;25 years range</strong>, but this is generally not mandatory</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2826\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xumdi4\" data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2857\">Entrance Exam Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2914\">Admission to BBA programs can follow two main pathways:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ermp78\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2941\">Merit-Based Admission</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2984\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4o9ffs\" data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2984\">Based on Class 12 academic performance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t6ny3b\" data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"3014\">Entrance-Based Admission</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3115\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2e1if\" data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3053\">University-specific entrance exams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f16me5\" data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3115\">National-level entrance tests (for top-tier institutions)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bunx2c\" data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3146\">Important Clarification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3147\" data-end=\"3323\">Not all BBA programs require entrance exams. Many institutions, especially those offering <strong data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3277\">online or flexible learning programs</strong>, provide <strong data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3322\">direct admission based on merit</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3328\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"drxz7b\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3365\">Eligibility Based on Program Type</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xo3h6e\" data-start=\"3367\" data-end=\"3398\">Regular BBA (After Class 12)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3491\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvvzdy\" data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3448\">Must have passed or be appearing for Class 12</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ylqbpz\" data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3491\">Minimum marks requirement as specified</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wdsbnr\" data-start=\"3493\" data-end=\"3517\">Online / Distance BBA</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3610\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19h3ne0\" data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3549\">10+2 qualification required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m2fzlz\" data-start=\"3550\" data-end=\"3581\">Flexible admission criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"73tg5z\" data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3610\">Usually no entrance exam</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vf0gs0\" data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3644\">Advanced or Lateral Entry BBA</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3645\" data-end=\"3722\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h5ffff\" data-start=\"3645\" data-end=\"3722\">Requires a <strong data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3690\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or diploma</strong> (varies by program structure)</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"748\">Choosing a BBA program is not only about academics&mdash;it is also a <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"597\">financial decision that directly impacts your return on investment (ROI)</strong>. Many students evaluate only the headline fee, but a proper analysis includes <strong data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"747\">tuition, additional costs, payment flexibility, and long-term value</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19hhs0q\" data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"769\">Core Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"804\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"804\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"794\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"804\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"875\">\r\n<td data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"862\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"861\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"875\">₹1,35,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<td data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"899\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"897\">Course Duration</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"910\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<td data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"937\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"936\">Payment Flexibility</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"974\">Semester-wise / Yearly / One-Time</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<td data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"998\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"997\">EMI Availability</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1005\">Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1v9xuua\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1073\">Flexible Payment Options (Designed for Student Convenience)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1211\">This BBA program offers <strong data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1127\">multiple payment options</strong>, allowing students to choose a structure that aligns with their financial planning.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7gvvzz\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1229\">Payment Plans</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1283\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1283\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1253\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1262\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1283\" data-col-size=\"md\">Payment Structure</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1425\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1356\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1354\">Semester-wise</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1379\">₹22,500 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1425\">Pay in smaller installments every 6 months</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1447\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1438\">Yearly</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1466\">₹45,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1498\">Moderate annual payment plan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1520\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1513\">One-Time</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1532\">₹1,35,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1556\">Full payment upfront</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1561\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"seyy09\" data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1609\">EMI Option (Financial Flexibility Strategy)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1794\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18787cf\" data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1676\">EMI plans allow <strong data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1674\">monthly payments instead of lump sum fees</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dl3gzf\" data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1727\">Often available with <strong data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1725\">0% interest financing</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"seegjk\" data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1794\">Helps students maintain liquidity while investing in education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ma27zc\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1819\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1871\">Students who opt for EMI can allocate funds toward:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1950\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gyqrz7\" data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1890\">Certifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v3qpgh\" data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1918\">Skill development tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wnm1s1\" data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1950\">Internship-related expenses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2033\">This approach can significantly improve <strong data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2032\">career outcomes and salary potential</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2038\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ahb6u3\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2095\">Additional Fees (Critical for Accurate Cost Planning)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2236\">Most students overlook these charges, which leads to <strong data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2187\">unexpected financial burden later</strong>. A clear understanding ensures better budgeting.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2241\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2267\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2399\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2290\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2290\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2280\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2290\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2399\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2357\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2347\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2346\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2357\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2399\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2380\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2379\">Examination Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2399\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6hwxo\" data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2434\">Total Additional Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2503\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uve7mf\" data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2464\">Registration Fee: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f7gpq\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2503\">Examination Fees (3 years): ₹9,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2539\"><strong data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2539\">Total Additional Cost: ₹11,500</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2579\"><strong data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2579\">Actual Total Investment: ₹1,46,500</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2584\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j9gx8m\" data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2607\">For SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2721\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2630\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2721\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2683\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2672\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2683\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2721\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2702\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2721\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2726\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2757\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2876\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2780\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2780\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2780\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2876\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2841\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2822\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2841\">$150 (One-Time)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2876\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2860\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2876\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"591\">Human Resource Management is no longer limited to hiring and payroll. Modern HR roles demand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"760\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1da9wj4\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"646\"><strong data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"644\">People analytics and data-driven HR decisions</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9vgyso\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"700\"><strong data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"698\">AI-based recruitment and workforce automation</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tpf0js\" data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"760\"><strong data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"758\">Strategic workforce planning and global HR exposure</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"889\">This program is designed to build a <strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"833\">next-generation HR professional</strong> who understands both <strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"888\">human behavior and technology</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"1015\">👉 By the end of this course, you are prepared for <strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1014\">corporate HR roles, HR analytics, and strategic management positions</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15i1l9k\" data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1086\">Semester 1: Foundation in Business + Communication + AI Basics</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1106\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1285\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hg1ei\" data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1118\">English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2rut8u\" data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1154\">HRM and Organizational Behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1179\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jd10lg\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1211\">Modern Business Environment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18w1smo\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1249\">Generative AI for Online Learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zdlnqi\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1285\">Financial Literacy and Planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1313\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1440\">This semester builds your <strong data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1395\">foundation in HR concepts and communication skills</strong>, which are critical for working with people.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1452\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2g2bc\" data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1504\">Organizational behavior and employee psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9hpo4v\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1542\">Business environment fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0af92\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1607\">Basics of AI tools used in HR (resume screening, automation)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1612\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1635\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1927\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2vra8j\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1687\">Professional writing (emails, HR communication)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tvgd5b\" data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1723\">Human capital management basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x8pxqj\" data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1761\">Financial reporting understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1klgwf1\" data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1808\">Budgeting (important for HR cost planning)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vnpnde\" data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1854\">ESG awareness (important for HR policies)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19er8ct\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1888\">Prompt engineering (AI skill)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r4hhpc\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1927\">Investment and financial awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1932\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1961\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2058\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jtm87i\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1988\">Business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15mih7v\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2015\">Emotional intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dicrkd\" data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2039\">Conflict management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m48cn3\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2058\">Excel BI tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f7bq2p\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2083\">Expert Insight ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2190\">HR is a <strong data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2115\">people-centric role</strong>, so communication and emotional intelligence learned here directly impact:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2243\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ooifrt\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2216\">Interview performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3hrv2z\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2243\">Workplace interactions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2248\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"fyqb9w\" data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2309\">Semester 2: Business Environment + Data &amp; Decision-Making</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2329\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2515\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13j6kzu\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2363\">Business Regulatory Framework</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kljc57\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2401\">Financial Markets and Instruments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17aknr1\" data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2425\">Business Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2448\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozme4o\" data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2474\">Communicative English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2np2s7\" data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2515\">Quantitative Techniques for Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2543\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2570\">This semester introduces:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2661\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n161uf\" data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2606\">Legal and regulatory frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13n8m08\" data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2630\">Business operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13fhjfi\" data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2661\">Data-based decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2666\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2689\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2823\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xp9fxe\" data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2721\">Business law and compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tx16e2\" data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2755\">Data analysis and forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqpxbt\" data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2773\">Risk analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16cfrod\" data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2796\">Strategic planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"th04jy\" data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2823\">Decision-making models</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2828\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2857\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2969\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qg1iht\" data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2898\">Power BI (critical for HR analytics)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r1e0z3\" data-start=\"2899\" data-end=\"2938\">Algorithmic and data analysis tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14s5cdx\" data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2969\">Scrum (project management)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"saa9zv\" data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2996\">Hidden Advantage 💡</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3069\">HR professionals with <strong data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3043\">data analysis skills</strong> are highly in demand for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3135\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j80v2b\" data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3092\">HR analytics roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4orsfd\" data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3115\">Workforce planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11z48dx\" data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3135\">Talent strategy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3140\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1v5vefx\" data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3192\">Semester 3: Core Business + HR + Research Skills</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3212\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3382\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u1qapj\" data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3235\">Managerial Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3260\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0xup0\" data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3303\">Business Ethics and Negotiation Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ibobe\" data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3331\">Indian Knowledge System</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jpcxlo\" data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3356\">Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1skrokk\" data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3382\">Environmental Science</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3410\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3478\">You begin developing <strong data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3477\">analytical and strategic thinking skills</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3490\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3491\" data-end=\"3589\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dgrv8b\" data-start=\"3491\" data-end=\"3520\">Financial decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"93k37\" data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3555\">Consumer and employee behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a5qntw\" data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3589\">Research and analysis methods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3594\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3617\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3783\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wjt61z\" data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3647\">Financial modeling basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1byh3kr\" data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3689\">Market and employee behavior analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11bev5k\" data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3729\">Negotiation and conflict resolution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hhrzrg\" data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3757\">Ethical decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v2kg7t\" data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3783\">Cultural intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3788\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3817\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3926\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gax2xl\" data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3847\">HR digital transformation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o8v98g\" data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3879\">Data-driven decision making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vb0n16\" data-start=\"3880\" data-end=\"3900\">Excel statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"755ph6\" data-start=\"3901\" data-end=\"3926\">Leadership and ethics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wahi6c\" data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"3953\">Critical Insight ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3954\" data-end=\"4065\">HR decisions must be backed by <strong data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"4006\">data and research</strong>, not just intuition. This semester builds that capability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4067\" data-end=\"4070\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"b6aimk\" data-start=\"4072\" data-end=\"4131\">Semester 4: Core HR Specialization + Workforce Management</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4151\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4309\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4172\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4198\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g6r2o9\" data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4221\">Workforce Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ud9ssw\" data-start=\"4222\" data-end=\"4250\">Training and Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ik3dk7\" data-start=\"4251\" data-end=\"4282\">Digital Business Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"4283\" data-end=\"4309\">International Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"4311\" data-end=\"4337\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4384\">This is the <strong data-start=\"4351\" data-end=\"4383\">core HR specialization phase</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4396\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4521\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xkpeh\" data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4435\">Workforce planning and forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ej001e\" data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4473\">Employee training and development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b769ox\" data-start=\"4474\" data-end=\"4497\">Global HR practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13n8m08\" data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4521\">Business operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"4526\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4549\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4550\" data-end=\"4729\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p9eegj\" data-start=\"4550\" data-end=\"4582\">Workforce forecasting models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12pv39f\" data-start=\"4583\" data-end=\"4610\">Training needs analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dk5lpr\" data-start=\"4611\" data-end=\"4652\">Learning &amp; development program design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3yh2s8\" data-start=\"4653\" data-end=\"4681\">HR metrics and analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7scfsy\" data-start=\"4682\" data-end=\"4706\">Process optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ebncmi\" data-start=\"4707\" data-end=\"4729\">Global HR exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4731\" data-end=\"4734\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4763\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4764\" data-end=\"4880\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17p91z5\" data-start=\"4764\" data-end=\"4806\">Recruitment tools (LinkedIn Recruiter)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cls0h2\" data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4828\">Hiring strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uel13a\" data-start=\"4829\" data-end=\"4850\">Employer branding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"108x0ii\" data-start=\"4851\" data-end=\"4880\">Startup and HR operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"138kxf8\" data-start=\"4882\" data-end=\"4908\">Strategic Insight 💡</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4909\" data-end=\"4940\">This semester prepares you for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4941\" data-end=\"5021\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqf0wl\" data-start=\"4941\" data-end=\"4963\">HR executive roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lkg2o7\" data-start=\"4964\" data-end=\"4986\">Talent acquisition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ujraw\" data-start=\"4987\" data-end=\"5021\">Learning &amp; development careers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5023\" data-end=\"5026\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1pne07i\" data-start=\"5028\" data-end=\"5081\">Semester 5: Advanced HR + Strategy + AI Integration</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"5083\" data-end=\"5101\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5102\" data-end=\"5263\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bee724\" data-start=\"5102\" data-end=\"5125\">Indian Constitution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"anv8l6\" data-start=\"5126\" data-end=\"5160\">Cost and Management Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16wggvu\" data-start=\"5161\" data-end=\"5177\">Strategic HR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aekbe0\" data-start=\"5178\" data-end=\"5198\">International HR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n070eg\" data-start=\"5199\" data-end=\"5235\">Digital Marketing and E-Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajo29n\" data-start=\"5236\" data-end=\"5263\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"5265\" data-end=\"5291\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5293\" data-end=\"5350\">You move into <strong data-start=\"5307\" data-end=\"5349\">strategic HR roles and global exposure</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5352\" data-end=\"5362\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5363\" data-end=\"5485\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sczu9t\" data-start=\"5363\" data-end=\"5395\">Strategic workforce planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ozb7cr\" data-start=\"5396\" data-end=\"5427\">International HR management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iisbaf\" data-start=\"5428\" data-end=\"5456\">AI in HR decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9xdxsg\" data-start=\"5457\" data-end=\"5485\">Cost and budgeting in HR</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5487\" data-end=\"5490\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"5492\" data-end=\"5513\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5514\" data-end=\"5645\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ib959j\" data-start=\"5514\" data-end=\"5539\">Strategic HR planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dvgao\" data-start=\"5540\" data-end=\"5560\">HR policy design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jgych1\" data-start=\"5561\" data-end=\"5580\">Global staffing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jwjy6b\" data-start=\"5581\" data-end=\"5610\">AI-based decision support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ju43x2\" data-start=\"5611\" data-end=\"5645\">Compliance and legal awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5647\" data-end=\"5650\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"5652\" data-end=\"5679\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5680\" data-end=\"5788\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywia8h\" data-start=\"5680\" data-end=\"5701\">Leadership ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nb7rz9\" data-start=\"5702\" data-end=\"5726\">Corporate governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aywmp2\" data-start=\"5727\" data-end=\"5760\">Workforce planning frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l4usbe\" data-start=\"5761\" data-end=\"5788\">AI in business strategy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"p735ds\" data-start=\"5790\" data-end=\"5810\">Hidden Risk ⚠️</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5811\" data-end=\"5852\">Ignoring <strong data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5832\">AI in HR</strong> is a major mistake.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5854\" data-end=\"5879\">👉 Modern HR uses AI for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5880\" data-end=\"5956\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a1a3tp\" data-start=\"5880\" data-end=\"5900\">Resume screening</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"100isfx\" data-start=\"5901\" data-end=\"5934\">Employee performance tracking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nb515o\" data-start=\"5935\" data-end=\"5956\">Predictive hiring</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5958\" data-end=\"5961\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"k47yie\" data-start=\"5963\" data-end=\"6025\">Semester 6: HR Analytics + Compensation + Industry Readiness</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"6027\" data-end=\"6045\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6046\" data-end=\"6191\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"6046\" data-end=\"6070\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1658k77\" data-start=\"6071\" data-end=\"6087\">Business Tax</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fzolno\" data-start=\"6088\" data-end=\"6104\">HR Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uxk7uh\" data-start=\"6105\" data-end=\"6147\">Compensation and Compliance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"6148\" data-end=\"6170\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yg84bo\" data-start=\"6171\" data-end=\"6191\">Research Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"6193\" data-end=\"6219\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6221\" data-end=\"6294\">This final semester prepares you for <strong data-start=\"6258\" data-end=\"6293\">advanced HR and corporate roles</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6296\" data-end=\"6306\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6307\" data-end=\"6424\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t4hrt3\" data-start=\"6307\" data-end=\"6347\">HR analytics and predictive modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18teuz8\" data-start=\"6348\" data-end=\"6384\">Payroll and compensation systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7xmp3k\" data-start=\"6385\" data-end=\"6407\">Corporate strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9l8c8\" data-start=\"6408\" data-end=\"6424\">Tax planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6426\" data-end=\"6429\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"6431\" data-end=\"6452\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6453\" data-end=\"6598\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ikl33k\" data-start=\"6453\" data-end=\"6473\">HR data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mhz41l\" data-start=\"6474\" data-end=\"6498\">Predictive analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ahbbv\" data-start=\"6499\" data-end=\"6532\">Compensation structure design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rbzak6\" data-start=\"6533\" data-end=\"6555\">Payroll processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7xmp3k\" data-start=\"6556\" data-end=\"6578\">Corporate strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1htn6ib\" data-start=\"6579\" data-end=\"6598\">Research skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6600\" data-end=\"6603\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"6605\" data-end=\"6632\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6633\" data-end=\"6734\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18x2oyl\" data-start=\"6633\" data-end=\"6653\">People analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tgslhn\" data-start=\"6654\" data-end=\"6673\">Payroll systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pevid2\" data-start=\"6674\" data-end=\"6695\">HR software tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5clo3a\" data-start=\"6696\" data-end=\"6734\">Professional HR certification prep</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1003kca\" data-start=\"6736\" data-end=\"6758\">Career Impact 💡</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6759\" data-end=\"6799\">This semester directly prepares you for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6800\" data-end=\"6891\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yndzwp\" data-start=\"6800\" data-end=\"6820\">HR analyst roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iy88zg\" data-start=\"6821\" data-end=\"6861\">Compensation and benefits specialist</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hzztel\" data-start=\"6862\" data-end=\"6891\">HR business partner roles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6893\" data-end=\"6896\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"mzyfx4\" data-start=\"6898\" data-end=\"6944\">Tools You Will Master (High-Demand HR Tools)</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6946\" data-end=\"7090\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gwu0dt\" data-start=\"6946\" data-end=\"6976\">Excel &amp; Advanced Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dl8et8\" data-start=\"6977\" data-end=\"6989\">Power BI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gjnfov\" data-start=\"6990\" data-end=\"7012\">HR analytics tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g0qoxh\" data-start=\"7013\" data-end=\"7043\">AI tools for HR automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ub0eyu\" data-start=\"7044\" data-end=\"7090\">Recruitment platforms (LinkedIn Recruiter)</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 135000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
