er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(301, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 138, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 05:51:20', '2026-06-16 07:08:11', '<p data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"766\">The BBA admission process is structured to be <strong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"574\">simple, fast, and accessible</strong>, but many students still face delays due to lack of clarity or poor execution. Understanding each step in detail ensures <strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"765\">smooth admission, faster confirmation, and better decision-making</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"771\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ph40vs\" data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"832\">Step 1: Submit Application (Start Your Admission Journey)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19bejcm\" data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"856\">What You Need to Do</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"1124\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cj9gmr\" data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"902\">Fill out the <strong data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"900\">online application form</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16jjhec\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"1124\">Enter complete and accurate details:\r\n<ul data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"1124\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h7vehg\" data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"992\">Personal information (name, contact details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rtp2tl\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1078\">Academic details (Class 10 and Class 12 marks or appearing for Class 12 status)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4sskdm\" data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1124\">Preferred BBA program or specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"gvq1oy\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1163\">What Happens After Submission</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgr35g\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1213\">Your application is reviewed for eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"85tjsb\" data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1266\">Your details are verified at a preliminary level</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"146h1q8\" data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1320\">You are moved to the enrollment stage if eligible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1325\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u4bvwo\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1346\">Critical Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1395\">Accuracy is essential at this stage. Errors in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1462\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z8juh7\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1414\">Academic marks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1439\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dt7tsm\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1462\">Uploaded documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1478\">can result in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1559\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ijhv85\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1504\">Application rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f9u9o7\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1528\">Verification delays</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"188osnt\" data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1559\">Loss of admission priority</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1564\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vrtpec\" data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1630\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program (Decision &amp; Confirmation Stage)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19bejcm\" data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1654\">What You Need to Do</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1786\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vnjilv\" data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1715\">Select your <strong data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1713\">preferred BBA program or specialization</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dvkii7\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1758\">Review all submitted details carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z30nxr\" data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1786\">Confirm your enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1791\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1i9qlyt\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1836\">What You Must Evaluate Before Enrollment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"2035\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ub9cu\" data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1902\">Specialization (Marketing, Finance, HR, AI, Analytics, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqu1ea\" data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1946\">Curriculum relevance to industry demand</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cancfr\" data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1988\">Fee structure and payment flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"whqqvs\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2035\">Placement support and career opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2040\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k2lei3\" data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2062\">Strategic Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2145\">This is one of the most critical steps because your choice of program determines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2231\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmg266\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2172\">Your career direction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y31lzc\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2202\">Skill development pathway</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cv91dh\" data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2231\">Future job opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2309\">Students who make rushed decisions often face <strong data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2308\">career misalignment later</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2314\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vw1kie\" data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2371\">Step 3: Complete Payment (Admission Activation Stage)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2452\">Admission is not finalized until payment is completed or financing is approved.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2457\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"148ijp2\" data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2487\">Payment Options Available</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1458i2o\" data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2509\">One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2586\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohza4c\" data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2546\">Pay the full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmflx0\" data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2586\">Eligible for <strong data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2584\">up to 15% discount</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2591\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kcshpp\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2624\">Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2755\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"blh4ri\" data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2665\">Pay through <strong data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2663\">monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dl3gzf\" data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2716\">Often available with <strong data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2714\">0% interest financing</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rttxl\" data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2755\">Reduces immediate financial burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2760\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z6ez5y\" data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2789\">Important Considerations</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2985\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ysgyl3\" data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2842\">Payment confirms your commitment to the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wccz6w\" data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"2985\">Delay in payment may lead to:\r\n<ul data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2985\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17sguw8\" data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2913\">Loss of preferred specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7oxh6k\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2951\">Delay in admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nlw5cb\" data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2985\">Risk of seat unavailability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"2990\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1a757lz\" data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3021\">Strategic Payment Decision</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3138\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l3li5w\" data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3067\">Choose one-time payment for cost savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y9ch9m\" data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3138\">Choose EMI if you want flexibility and better cash flow management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3143\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"u2rsfo\" data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3202\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat (Final Admission Confirmation)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3233\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3289\">Once payment is completed or EMI approval is received:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3489\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1izb4ml\" data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3337\">Your admission is <strong data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3335\">officially confirmed</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y78fi1\" data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3381\">Your <strong data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3379\">seat in the program is secured</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"migom0\" data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3489\">You receive:\r\n<ul data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3489\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3425\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11d9b1w\" data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3454\">Enrollment credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gidelz\" data-start=\"3457\" data-end=\"3489\">Access to student portal/LMS</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3491\" data-end=\"3494\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u3cbja\" data-start=\"3496\" data-end=\"3524\">Why This Step is Critical</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3553\">Until payment is completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3635\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1595j1t\" data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3588\">Your seat is <strong data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3586\">not reserved</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qphudy\" data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3635\">You are not considered officially admitted</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3637\" data-end=\"3707\">In high-demand specializations, seats can fill quickly, especially in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3792\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f0uzzq\" data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3730\">Digital Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173ueww\" data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3742\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3765\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6c6srh\" data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3792\">AI-integrated programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3797\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a6nf37\" data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3840\">Admission Timeline (Speed &amp; Efficiency)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"4067\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3868\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3868\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3850\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3868\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Estimated Time</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3894\" data-end=\"4067\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3894\" data-end=\"3936\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3894\" data-end=\"3919\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Submission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"3936\">10&ndash;20 minutes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3937\" data-end=\"3975\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3937\" data-end=\"3963\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"3975\">Same day</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3976\" data-end=\"4020\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3976\" data-end=\"3997\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Processing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4020\">Instant / Few hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4067\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4052\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Admission Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4052\" data-end=\"4067\">24&ndash;48 hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4072\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4108\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4110\" data-end=\"4162\">To avoid delays, keep the following documents ready:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4164\" data-end=\"4318\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulae2l\" data-start=\"4164\" data-end=\"4186\">Class 10 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v3ep5\" data-start=\"4187\" data-end=\"4246\">Class 12 marksheet (or proof if appearing for Class 12)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ghlrx5\" data-start=\"4247\" data-end=\"4289\">Valid ID proof (Aadhaar or equivalent)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4318\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"656\">The eligibility criteria for BBA are designed to be <strong data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"554\">inclusive and flexible</strong>, allowing students from different academic backgrounds to pursue a career in business and management.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"866\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ij2ndg\" data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"753\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"727\">passed or be appearing for Class 12 (10+2)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eeni7y\" data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"866\">In certain cases, candidates with a <strong data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"813\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> may also apply, depending on the program structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"1001\">This ensures that BBA remains a <strong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"943\">widely accessible undergraduate program</strong> suitable for early career entry into the business domain.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cfcqak\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1066\">Detailed BBA Eligibility Criteria (In-Depth Explanation)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vd27nh\" data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1106\">Academic Qualification Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1189\">To apply for a BBA program, candidates must meet one of the following conditions:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1490\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y11ar9\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1261\">Successfully completed <strong data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1235\">10+2 (Class 12)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c5wct1\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1378\">Students <strong data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1299\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are also eligible (provisional admission applies until results are declared)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ait3fs\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1490\">Candidates holding a <strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1423\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> may be eligible for certain advanced or specialized BBA pathways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1495\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"tad8bq\" data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1527\">Recognized Education Boards</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1553\">Eligible boards include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uej2m7\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1563\">CBSE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qhw6us\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1572\">ICSE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1olewja\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1589\">State Boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmj5uk\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1641\"><strong data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1639\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1756\">This ensures equal opportunities for students from both <strong data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1755\">formal schooling systems and open learning platforms</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1761\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1791\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1892\">Although the exact percentage requirement varies across institutions, the general criteria include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1946\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pzwvov\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1946\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1946\">45% to 60% aggregate marks in Class 12</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1969\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sufx21\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2026\">Top-tier universities may require <strong data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2024\">60% or higher</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1069u3l\" data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2096\">Some online or flexible programs may accept <strong data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2094\">lower percentages</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2210\">Students should always verify the specific eligibility requirements of their chosen institution before applying.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2215\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1h9x7eq\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2255\">Stream Eligibility (Who Can Apply?)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2353\">BBA is a <strong data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2295\">stream-independent course</strong>, meaning students from all academic streams are eligible:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2399\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4h0lx\" data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2367\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y83j8c\" data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2379\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4bazzi\" data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2399\">Arts/Humanities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bz1u85\" data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2424\">Strategic Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2480\">Students from non-commerce backgrounds can use BBA to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2650\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wcd9l8\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2523\">Build foundational business knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ig8cr5\" data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2576\">Transition into management and corporate careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k19klz\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2650\">Explore diverse career paths in marketing, finance, HR, and analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2655\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w3jba8\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2678\">Age Limit Criteria</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2829\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ronjut\" data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2738\">Most institutions <strong data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2736\">do not impose a strict age limit</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"179muf9\" data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2829\">Some may prefer candidates within the <strong data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2800\">17&ndash;25 years range</strong>, but this is not mandatory</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"728\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"493\">BBA fee structure</strong> is essential for making a smart academic and financial decision. While the total fee appears straightforward, students must evaluate <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"710\">payment flexibility, additional costs, and long-term return on investment (ROI)</strong> before enrolling.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19hhs0q\" data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"749\">Core Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"774\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"784\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"855\">\r\n<td data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"842\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"841\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"855\">₹1,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"890\">\r\n<td data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"879\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"877\">Course Duration</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"890\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"951\">\r\n<td data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"914\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"912\">Payment Options</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"951\">Semester-wise / Yearly / One-Time</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<td data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"975\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"974\">EMI Availability</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"982\">Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"987\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1j9ii76\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1052\">Flexible Payment Options (Designed for Financial Convenience)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1186\">The program offers multiple payment structures, allowing students to choose based on their financial capacity and planning strategy.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7gvvzz\" data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1204\">Payment Plans</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1488\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1228\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1237\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1258\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Frequency</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1488\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1372\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1331\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1329\">Semester-wise</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1354\">₹25,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1372\">Every 6 months</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1430\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1394\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1385\">Yearly</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1413\">₹50,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1430\">Once per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1488\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1452\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1445\">One-Time</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1464\">₹1,50,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1488\">Full upfront payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1493\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8qunsb\" data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1535\">EMI Option (Smart Financial Planning)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1592\">Students can opt for EMI-based payments, which provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1734\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173mzxf\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1629\">Monthly installment flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r8zymu\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1683\">Reduced financial burden at the time of admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dl3gzf\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1734\">Often available with <strong data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1732\">0% interest financing</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkfaw8\" data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1757\">Strategic Insight</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1821\">EMI helps students preserve capital, which can be invested in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gyqrz7\" data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1840\">Certifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q9yv95\" data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1859\">Industry tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f2c0hr\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1888\">Internship opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1952\">This approach enhances <strong data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1951\">career readiness and employability</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1957\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1pkwhf4\" data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2017\">Additional Fees (Important for Accurate Cost Estimation)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2160\">Many students overlook these charges, leading to underestimation of total investment. A detailed breakdown ensures proper financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2165\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2191\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2323\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2204\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2214\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2323\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2281\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2271\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2270\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2281\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2323\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2304\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2303\">Examination Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2323\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6hwxo\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2358\">Total Additional Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2427\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uve7mf\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2388\">Registration Fee: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f7gpq\" data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2427\">Examination Fees (3 years): ₹9,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2463\"><strong data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2463\">Total Additional Cost: ₹11,500</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2504\"><strong data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2504\">Total Investment (India): ₹1,61,500</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2509\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j9gx8m\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2532\">For SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2646\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2555\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2555\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2545\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2555\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2646\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2608\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2597\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2608\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2646\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2627\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2646\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2651\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2682\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2801\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2705\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2705\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2695\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2705\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2801\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2747\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2766\">$150 (One-Time)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2801\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2785\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2801\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"667\">Digital marketing has evolved into a <strong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"620\">data-driven, AI-powered, performance-focused domain</strong>. Companies today demand professionals who can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"839\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o6li35\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"715\">Drive <strong data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"713\">measurable ROI through campaigns</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m1vpog\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"772\">Use <strong data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"770\">analytics and dashboards for decision-making</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v9rd7n\" data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"839\">Leverage <strong data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"837\">AI for automation, targeting, and personalization</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"953\">This program is structured to transform students into <strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"941\">full-stack digital marketing professionals</strong>, combining:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1atf4ew\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"981\">Marketing fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y98zai\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1016\">Advanced performance marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g9k88v\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1053\">Analytics and data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xbr8ls\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1089\">AI-driven campaign optimization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"dglzc6\" data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1163\">Semester 1: Business Foundation + Communication + AI Introduction</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1183\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hg1ei\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1195\">English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2rut8u\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1231\">HRM and Organizational Behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1256\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jd10lg\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1288\">Modern Business Environment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18w1smo\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1326\">Generative AI for Online Learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zdlnqi\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1362\">Financial Literacy and Planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1390\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1523\">The first semester builds your <strong data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1479\">core business understanding and communication skills</strong>, which are essential for marketing success.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1537\">You develop:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15np5lp\" data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1581\">Understanding of how businesses operate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3mxaz1\" data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1640\">Financial awareness (important for campaign budgeting)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sqe74y\" data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1702\">Introduction to AI tools used in content and productivity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1707\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1730\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1966\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12t7hlx\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1785\">Professional writing (content, ads, communication)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16stn1l\" data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1819\">Business environment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g2gudu\" data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1856\">Budgeting and financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0mdql\" data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1894\">ESG awareness for modern branding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"duwlk8\" data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1934\">Prompt engineering (AI usage skill)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7g2hqe\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1966\">Investment and ROI thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1971\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2000\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2123\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11og5el\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2039\">Business communication and writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vljkcb\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2084\">Emotional intelligence and team dynamics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yedlwo\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2123\">Excel BI tools for basic analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2128\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k2lei3\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2150\">Strategic Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2237\">Strong communication and financial understanding in this semester directly influence:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2304\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eizang\" data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2257\">Content quality</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0e7se\" data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2282\">Campaign performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"em822y\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2304\">Brand positioning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2309\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ff3m5j\" data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2374\">Semester 2: Business Systems + Data &amp; Digital Marketing Entry</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2394\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2568\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f0uzzq\" data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2416\">Digital Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kljc57\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2454\">Financial Markets and Instruments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17aknr1\" data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2478\">Business Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2501\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozme4o\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2527\">Communicative English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2np2s7\" data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2568\">Quantitative Techniques for Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2596\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2623\">This semester introduces:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2754\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1il4nfi\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2659\">Core digital marketing concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"67jjr3\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2697\">Business and economic environment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x0ziny\" data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2754\">Data-driven thinking through quantitative techniques</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2759\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2782\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2926\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tx16e2\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2816\">Data analysis and forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2yqa0m\" data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2845\">Risk and market analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16cfrod\" data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2868\">Strategic planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w5bxb7\" data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2899\">Professional communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"th04jy\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2926\">Decision-making models</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2931\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2960\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y7l68x\" data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2992\">Power BI for data analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fqtsif\" data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3028\">Economic and financial analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tzi5mu\" data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3051\">Scrum fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3056\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"131vg78\" data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3077\">Hidden Advantage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3155\">Students who start learning <strong data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3132\">analytics tools early</strong> gain a strong edge in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3243\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsfsno\" data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3181\">Performance marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16sdyu5\" data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3211\">Marketing analytics roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g3gop9\" data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3243\">Data-driven decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3248\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"l7s5se\" data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3322\">Semester 3: Core Digital Marketing + Performance Marketing + Analytics</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3342\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3553\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"426s09\" data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3411\">Search Engine Optimization (SEO) &amp; Search Engine Marketing (SEM)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3436\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0xup0\" data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3479\">Business Ethics and Negotiation Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9wyf6\" data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3502\">Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jpcxlo\" data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3527\">Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1skrokk\" data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3553\">Environmental Science</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3558\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3586\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3678\">This is the <strong data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3629\">core specialization phase</strong>, where you learn real-world marketing execution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3702\">You gain expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3844\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1okoqup\" data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3747\">SEO and search engine ranking strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zk8nds\" data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3781\">Paid advertising (Google Ads)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsfsno\" data-start=\"3782\" data-end=\"3807\">Performance marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xdp4pr\" data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3844\">Data visualization and analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3849\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"3851\" data-end=\"3872\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3873\" data-end=\"4078\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyz6gx\" data-start=\"3873\" data-end=\"3888\">SEO and SEM</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"534zoa\" data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3923\">Google Ads campaign management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsfsno\" data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3949\">Performance marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ynu9w\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3978\">Programmatic advertising</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"opcz1c\" data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4011\">Brand and product management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mktgl7\" data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4032\">Pricing strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ir0qu2\" data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4078\">Marketing analytics and consumer insights</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4083\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"4085\" data-end=\"4112\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4236\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fr9738\" data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4139\">Google Analytics (GA4)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dd19n8\" data-start=\"4140\" data-end=\"4166\">AI tools for marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ieefse\" data-start=\"4167\" data-end=\"4199\">Branding and PR fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j74mlx\" data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4236\">Power BI for marketing analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4238\" data-end=\"4241\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u4bvwo\" data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4262\">Critical Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4264\" data-end=\"4332\">This semester directly impacts employability. Students who practice:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4395\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y87nq7\" data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4354\">Campaign creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pchfe8\" data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4375\">SEO optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nrbygl\" data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4395\">Analytics tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4438\">become job-ready much faster than others.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4443\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"63fnzb\" data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4507\">Semester 4: Advanced Digital Marketing + Growth &amp; Engagement</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"4509\" data-end=\"4527\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4694\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4548\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"4549\" data-end=\"4574\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z1fb8b\" data-start=\"4575\" data-end=\"4608\">User Retention and Engagement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kus4hf\" data-start=\"4609\" data-end=\"4635\">Social Media Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ik3dk7\" data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4667\">Digital Business Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4694\">International Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4696\" data-end=\"4699\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4727\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4729\" data-end=\"4806\">This semester focuses on <strong data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4805\">growth marketing and user engagement strategies</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4808\" data-end=\"4818\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4819\" data-end=\"4949\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q194tz\" data-start=\"4819\" data-end=\"4852\">Customer retention techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"urlh4r\" data-start=\"4853\" data-end=\"4887\">Social media growth strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p2j85u\" data-start=\"4888\" data-end=\"4919\">Digital business operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1665438\" data-start=\"4920\" data-end=\"4949\">Global marketing exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4951\" data-end=\"4954\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"4956\" data-end=\"4977\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4978\" data-end=\"5149\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wg3qtq\" data-start=\"4978\" data-end=\"5015\">Customer engagement and retention</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bjnb6o\" data-start=\"5016\" data-end=\"5047\">Growth marketing strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mz4djn\" data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5094\">Social media strategy and content planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"89izer\" data-start=\"5095\" data-end=\"5121\">Digital transformation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l0qfbq\" data-start=\"5122\" data-end=\"5149\">International marketing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5151\" data-end=\"5154\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"5156\" data-end=\"5183\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5184\" data-end=\"5307\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"41il85\" data-start=\"5184\" data-end=\"5215\">Content creation strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fjj1ju\" data-start=\"5216\" data-end=\"5239\">Marketing analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"snzm4r\" data-start=\"5240\" data-end=\"5265\">Email marketing tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmd5q5\" data-start=\"5266\" data-end=\"5307\">Cross-cultural business understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5309\" data-end=\"5312\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k2lei3\" data-start=\"5314\" data-end=\"5334\">Strategic Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5336\" data-end=\"5447\">Retention and engagement are more valuable than acquisition in many businesses. This semester prepares you for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5448\" data-end=\"5524\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"72d3yy\" data-start=\"5448\" data-end=\"5474\">Growth marketing roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvmbnr\" data-start=\"5475\" data-end=\"5496\">Product marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sez75w\" data-start=\"5497\" data-end=\"5524\">Social media management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5526\" data-end=\"5529\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"101rd0u\" data-start=\"5531\" data-end=\"5587\">Semester 5: Advanced Digital Channels + AI Integration</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"5589\" data-end=\"5607\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5785\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h219cr\" data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5629\">Ethics and Values</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"anv8l6\" data-start=\"5630\" data-end=\"5664\">Cost and Management Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o95hiu\" data-start=\"5665\" data-end=\"5698\">Email and Affiliate Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i7n945\" data-start=\"5699\" data-end=\"5720\">Content Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n070eg\" data-start=\"5721\" data-end=\"5757\">Digital Marketing and E-Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajo29n\" data-start=\"5758\" data-end=\"5785\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5787\" data-end=\"5790\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"5792\" data-end=\"5818\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5881\">You move into <strong data-start=\"5834\" data-end=\"5880\">advanced marketing channels and automation</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5883\" data-end=\"5905\">You gain expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5906\" data-end=\"6029\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17t8r7t\" data-start=\"5906\" data-end=\"5933\">Email marketing funnels</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1udj3yk\" data-start=\"5934\" data-end=\"5968\">Affiliate marketing strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3xwqez\" data-start=\"5969\" data-end=\"5994\">E-commerce operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13yh9xw\" data-start=\"5995\" data-end=\"6029\">AI-driven marketing automation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6031\" data-end=\"6034\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6057\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6058\" data-end=\"6202\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gxyneq\" data-start=\"6058\" data-end=\"6077\">Lead generation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5gmf81\" data-start=\"6078\" data-end=\"6105\">Conversion optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fiktfg\" data-start=\"6106\" data-end=\"6144\">Content marketing and storytelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rb1hmb\" data-start=\"6145\" data-end=\"6169\">Marketing automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hormfe\" data-start=\"6170\" data-end=\"6202\">AI applications in marketing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6204\" data-end=\"6207\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"6209\" data-end=\"6236\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6237\" data-end=\"6340\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i9lt6d\" data-start=\"6237\" data-end=\"6261\">Adobe Creative tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7rcrma\" data-start=\"6262\" data-end=\"6285\">Analytics platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"755ph6\" data-start=\"6286\" data-end=\"6311\">Leadership and ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h6aq3n\" data-start=\"6312\" data-end=\"6340\">Sustainability reporting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6342\" data-end=\"6345\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1w18h0s\" data-start=\"6347\" data-end=\"6361\">Hidden Risk</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6363\" data-end=\"6426\">Students who ignore tools and automation platforms struggle in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6427\" data-end=\"6486\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d6wpjy\" data-start=\"6427\" data-end=\"6454\">Real campaign execution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aq6gyb\" data-start=\"6455\" data-end=\"6486\">Performance marketing roles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6488\" data-end=\"6491\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xnwwef\" data-start=\"6493\" data-end=\"6558\">Semester 6: Strategy + Marketing Analytics + Industry Readiness</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"6560\" data-end=\"6578\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6579\" data-end=\"6752\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"6579\" data-end=\"6603\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1658k77\" data-start=\"6604\" data-end=\"6620\">Business Tax</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m51e4t\" data-start=\"6621\" data-end=\"6684\">Web, Mobile &amp; Social Media Analytics and Prompt Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ng8j22\" data-start=\"6685\" data-end=\"6708\">Marketing Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"6709\" data-end=\"6731\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yg84bo\" data-start=\"6732\" data-end=\"6752\">Research Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6754\" data-end=\"6757\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"6759\" data-end=\"6785\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6787\" data-end=\"6867\">This final semester prepares you for <strong data-start=\"6824\" data-end=\"6866\">data-driven marketing leadership roles</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6869\" data-end=\"6879\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6880\" data-end=\"7014\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17s38of\" data-start=\"6880\" data-end=\"6923\">Marketing analytics and ROI measurement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17d15sq\" data-start=\"6924\" data-end=\"6958\">Web and social media analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gtj1fe\" data-start=\"6959\" data-end=\"6988\">Strategic decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nobe9n\" data-start=\"6989\" data-end=\"7014\">Business intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7016\" data-end=\"7019\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"7021\" data-end=\"7042\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7043\" data-end=\"7203\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17d15sq\" data-start=\"7043\" data-end=\"7077\">Web and social media analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bvckws\" data-start=\"7078\" data-end=\"7111\">Campaign performance analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dsxewj\" data-start=\"7112\" data-end=\"7128\">ROI tracking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4almn9\" data-start=\"7129\" data-end=\"7151\">Dashboard creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g3gop9\" data-start=\"7152\" data-end=\"7183\">Data-driven decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hrsw2d\" data-start=\"7184\" data-end=\"7203\">Market research</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7205\" data-end=\"7208\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"7210\" data-end=\"7237\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7238\" data-end=\"7321\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dd92nc\" data-start=\"7238\" data-end=\"7255\">Looker Studio</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mhz41l\" data-start=\"7256\" data-end=\"7280\">Predictive analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0foq\" data-start=\"7281\" data-end=\"7302\">Data storytelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m48cn3\" data-start=\"7303\" data-end=\"7321\">Excel BI tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7323\" data-end=\"7326\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hln5ph\" data-start=\"7328\" data-end=\"7344\">Career Impact</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7346\" data-end=\"7386\">This semester directly prepares you for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7387\" data-end=\"7484\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s36yqf\" data-start=\"7387\" data-end=\"7414\">Marketing analyst roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ki5jnp\" data-start=\"7415\" data-end=\"7448\">Performance marketing careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19f2axl\" data-start=\"7449\" data-end=\"7484\">Data-driven marketing positions</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 150000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(302, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 270, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 06:05:11', '2026-06-16 07:08:27', '<p data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"756\">The BBA admission process is designed to be <strong data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"563\">simple, fast, and student-friendly</strong>, but successful admission depends on how accurately and strategically you complete each step. Many students lose their preferred seats due to delays or incomplete understanding of the process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"866\">This guide explains every stage in detail so you can <strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"865\">secure admission quickly and avoid common mistakes</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"871\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ph40vs\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"932\">Step 1: Submit Application (Start Your Admission Journey)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19bejcm\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"956\">What You Need to Do</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1208\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cj9gmr\" data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1002\">Fill out the <strong data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1000\">online application form</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"85x6pr\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1208\">Provide accurate details:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1208\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h7vehg\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1081\">Personal information (name, contact details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ny6h2c\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1165\">Academic details (Class 10 &amp; Class 12 marks or appearing for Class 12 status)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eyu9jp\" data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1208\">Program or specialization preference</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"gvq1oy\" data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1247\">What Happens After Submission</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1397\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgr35g\" data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1297\">Your application is reviewed for eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jh6rrz\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1344\">Basic verification of details is conducted</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jpwyt4\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1397\">Eligible candidates move to the enrollment stage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1402\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u4bvwo\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1423\">Critical Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1490\">This step looks simple but is highly sensitive. Mistakes such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1584\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10u32sj\" data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1517\">Incorrect marks entry</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nlm7vc\" data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1557\">Spelling errors in personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"79dnf8\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1584\">Wrong document uploads</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1598\">can lead to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1678\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ijhv85\" data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1624\">Application rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"120dh93\" data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1647\">Delayed processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"188osnt\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1678\">Loss of admission priority</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1683\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wlvygn\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1741\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program (Decision-Making Stage)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19bejcm\" data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1765\">What You Need to Do</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1euk91y\" data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1816\">Select your <strong data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1814\">BBA program or specialization</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15hufwi\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1859\">Verify all submitted details carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z30nxr\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1887\">Confirm your enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1892\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1030o3r\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1936\">What You Must Evaluate Before Enrolling</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2157\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lnpz8e\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2002\">Specialization (Marketing, Finance, HR, Analytics, AI, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sqm3fm\" data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2047\">Curriculum relevance and industry demand</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kf9gc\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2110\">Fee structure and flexibility (EMI, yearly, semester-wise)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"whqqvs\" data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2157\">Placement support and career opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2162\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k2lei3\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2184\">Strategic Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2281\">This is the most important academic decision in the entire process because it directly impacts:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2364\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9hk7lb\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2303\">Career direction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"buy5xm\" data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2325\">Skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fscpho\" data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2364\">Job opportunities after graduation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2461\">Students who rush this step often face <strong data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2460\">career misalignment and limited opportunities later</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2466\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vw1kie\" data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2523\">Step 3: Complete Payment (Admission Activation Stage)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2604\">Admission is not finalized until payment is completed or financing is approved.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2609\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"148ijp2\" data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2639\">Payment Options Available</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1458i2o\" data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2661\">One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2738\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohza4c\" data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2698\">Pay the full program fee upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmflx0\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2738\">Eligible for <strong data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2736\">up to 15% discount</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2743\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kcshpp\" data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2776\">Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2912\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yat74g\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2822\">Pay through <strong data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2820\">easy monthly installments</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dl3gzf\" data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2873\">Often available with <strong data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2871\">0% interest financing</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rttxl\" data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2912\">Reduces immediate financial burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2917\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z6ez5y\" data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2946\">Important Considerations</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"3145\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ysgyl3\" data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2999\">Payment confirms your commitment to the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cks8jm\" data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3145\">Delays in payment may result in:\r\n<ul data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3145\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17sguw8\" data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3073\">Loss of preferred specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7oxh6k\" data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3111\">Delay in admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nlw5cb\" data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3145\">Risk of seat unavailability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3147\" data-end=\"3150\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1a757lz\" data-start=\"3152\" data-end=\"3181\">Strategic Payment Decision</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3298\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"149nhuk\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3235\">Choose one-time payment for maximum cost savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u0b2lt\" data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3298\">Choose EMI for better cash flow management and flexibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3303\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"u2rsfo\" data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3362\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat (Final Admission Confirmation)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3393\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3446\">Once payment is completed or financing is approved:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3646\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1izb4ml\" data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3494\">Your admission is <strong data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3492\">officially confirmed</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y78fi1\" data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3538\">Your <strong data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3536\">seat in the program is secured</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohrji0\" data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3646\">You receive:\r\n<ul data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3646\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3582\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11d9b1w\" data-start=\"3585\" data-end=\"3611\">Enrollment credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8lj09j\" data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"3646\">Access to LMS/student portal</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3651\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u3cbja\" data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3681\">Why This Step is Critical</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3710\">Until payment is completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3781\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1595j1t\" data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3745\">Your seat is <strong data-start=\"3727\" data-end=\"3743\">not reserved</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d154cc\" data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3781\">You are not officially admitted</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3841\">In high-demand programs, seats fill quickly&mdash;especially in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3933\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f0uzzq\" data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3864\">Digital Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3887\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173ueww\" data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"3899\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1564kna\" data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3933\">AI-integrated specializations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"3938\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a6nf37\" data-start=\"3940\" data-end=\"3981\">Admission Timeline (Speed &amp; Efficiency)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"4208\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"4009\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"4009\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"3991\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3991\" data-end=\"4009\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Estimated Time</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4208\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4077\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4060\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Submission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4077\">10&ndash;20 minutes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4116\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4104\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4104\" data-end=\"4116\">Same day</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4161\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4138\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Processing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4161\">Instant / Few hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4162\" data-end=\"4208\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4162\" data-end=\"4193\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Admission Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4208\">24&ndash;48 hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4213\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"4215\" data-end=\"4249\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4251\" data-end=\"4295\">To avoid delays, keep these documents ready:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4451\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulae2l\" data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4319\">Class 10 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v3ep5\" data-start=\"4320\" data-end=\"4379\">Class 12 marksheet (or proof if appearing for Class 12)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ghlrx5\" data-start=\"4380\" data-end=\"4422\">Valid ID proof (Aadhaar or equivalent)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"4423\" data-end=\"4451\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"741\">The eligibility criteria for BBA are designed to ensure <strong data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"593\">maximum accessibility while maintaining academic standards</strong>. Whether you are a commerce, science, or arts student, the program allows a wide range of applicants to enter the field of business and management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"962\">The basic requirement is simple, but understanding the <strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"882\">detailed eligibility conditions, hidden requirements, and admission expectations</strong> can significantly improve your chances of securing admission in a good program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"967\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"94aw2q\" data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1006\">Basic Eligibility for BBA Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1088\">To apply for a BBA program, candidates must meet the following core requirement:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cel94i\" data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1174\">Must have <strong data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1148\">passed or be appearing for Class 12 (10+2)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yupxrm\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1264\">In some program formats, candidates with a <strong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1241\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> may also be eligible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1381\">This makes BBA one of the most <strong data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1332\">flexible undergraduate programs</strong>, allowing early entry into management education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1386\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1mnrgvx\" data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1442\">Detailed Eligibility Criteria (In-Depth Explanation)</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17b33f5\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1469\">Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1525\">Applicants must fulfill at least one of the following:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1828\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y11ar9\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1597\">Successfully completed <strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1571\">10+2 (Class 12)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m22r54\" data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1714\">Students <strong data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1635\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are also eligible (admission remains provisional until results are declared)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bupxpq\" data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1828\">Candidates with a <strong data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1756\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> may be considered for certain advanced or flexible program structures</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1833\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"au0q6n\" data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1872\">Recognized Boards (Including NIOS)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1937\">Eligible candidates can apply if they have completed 10+2 from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"2025\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uej2m7\" data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1947\">CBSE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qhw6us\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1956\">ICSE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1olewja\" data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1973\">State Boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmj5uk\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2025\"><strong data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2023\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2118\">This ensures inclusivity for students from <strong data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2117\">both traditional and open schooling systems</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2123\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2153\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2228\">While exact criteria may vary by institution, the general requirement is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2282\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pzwvov\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2282\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2282\">45% to 60% aggregate marks in Class 12</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plsll2\" data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2305\">Important Insight</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2426\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xe9w9e\" data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2365\">Competitive universities may require <strong data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2363\">60% or higher</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ithnv9\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2426\">Flexible or online programs may accept lower percentages</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2503\">Students should always check specific program requirements before applying.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2508\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1h9x7eq\" data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2548\">Stream Eligibility (Who Can Apply?)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2641\">BBA is a <strong data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2588\">stream-independent course</strong>, meaning students from all backgrounds are eligible:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2687\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4h0lx\" data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2655\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y83j8c\" data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2667\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4bazzi\" data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2687\">Arts/Humanities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"181lajy\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2709\">Why This Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2765\">Students from non-commerce backgrounds can use BBA to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2938\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13vwe1k\" data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2823\">Build business and management knowledge from scratch</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b1jiyn\" data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2859\">Transition into corporate roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1seq2gd\" data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2938\">Explore careers in marketing, finance, HR, analytics, and entrepreneurship</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"2943\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w3jba8\" data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2966\">Age Limit Criteria</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3121\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n1qmao\" data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3026\">Most universities <strong data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3024\">do not impose a strict age limit</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w526gb\" data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3121\">Some institutions may prefer candidates between <strong data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3092\">17&ndash;25 years</strong>, but this is not mandatory</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"767\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"514\">BBA fee structure</strong> is essential before taking admission, as the actual cost goes beyond just tuition fees. This guide provides a <strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"728\">complete breakdown of total fees, payment flexibility, hidden costs, and return on investment (ROI)</strong> to help you make an informed decision.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"772\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19hhs0q\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"793\">Core Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<td data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"872\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"871\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"885\">₹1,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"912\">\r\n<td data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"901\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"900\">Duration</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"912\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<td data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"935\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"934\">Payment Options</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"972\">Semester-wise / Yearly / One-time</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<td data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"992\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"991\">EMI Facility</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1005\">Available</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"5dav2z\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1069\">Payment Options Explained (Flexible &amp; Student-Friendly)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1159\">The program offers multiple payment modes to accommodate different financial situations.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1s6kad5\" data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1181\">Fee Payment Plans</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1220\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1220\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1198\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1207\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1220\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Frequency</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1279\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1278\">Semester-wise</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1289\">₹25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1307\">Every 6 months</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1348\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1321\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1320\">Yearly</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1331\">₹50,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1348\">Once per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1364\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1363\">One-time</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1376\">₹1,50,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1400\">Full upfront payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1405\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1757ynm\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1444\">EMI Option (Financial Flexibility)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1499\">Students can opt for EMI-based payments, which allow:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1686\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x5601d\" data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1553\">Monthly installments instead of lump sum payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fu6w5c\" data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1585\">Better cash flow management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2ikuw\" data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1635\">Reduced financial pressure at admission stage</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dl3gzf\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1686\">Often available with <strong data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1684\">0% interest financing</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1691\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k2lei3\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1713\">Strategic Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1764\">Choosing EMI can help you allocate funds towards:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1901\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gmb7ix\" data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1830\">Certifications (data analytics, digital marketing, AI tools)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s5a4d9\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1862\">Industry tools and software</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dfkdgf\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1901\">Internships and practical learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1966\">This improves your <strong data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1965\">career readiness and placement outcomes</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1971\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19u14df\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2027\">Additional Fees (Critical for Real Cost Calculation)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2145\">Many students ignore additional charges, which leads to incorrect financial planning. Below is a detailed breakdown.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2150\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pltyrs\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2176\">For Students in India</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2308\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2199\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2199\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2199\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2308\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2266\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2256\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2255\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2266\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2308\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2289\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2288\">Examination Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2308\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6hwxo\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2343\">Total Additional Cost (India)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2412\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uve7mf\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2373\">Registration Fee: ₹2,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f7gpq\" data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2412\">Examination Fees (3 years): ₹9,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2448\"><strong data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2448\">Total Additional Fees: ₹11,500</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2453\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j9gx8m\" data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2476\">For SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2590\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2489\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2499\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2590\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2552\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2541\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2552\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2590\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2571\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2590\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2595\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o70cv2\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2626\">For International Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2745\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2649\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2649\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2639\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2649\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2745\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2710\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2691\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2710\">$150 (One-Time)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2745\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2729\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2745\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"633\">Business Analytics has become one of the <strong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"577\">most in-demand domains</strong> across industries. Organizations today rely heavily on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"774\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4j25mo\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"670\"><strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"668\">Data-driven decision making</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15fvq1r\" data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"727\"><strong data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"725\">Predictive analytics and machine learning models</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rhu1tl\" data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"774\"><strong data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"772\">AI-based business intelligence systems</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"948\">This program is designed to develop professionals who can <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"900\">combine business understanding with technical analytics skills</strong>, making them highly valuable in the job market.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"6ywkx0\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"983\">Program Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1020\">This BBA specialization integrates:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1179\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vo7ynu\" data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1047\">Business fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r8o1sv\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1084\">Data analytics and visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"35isw6\" data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1114\">Programming (Python, SQL)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b7axdm\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1142\">Machine learning and AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14mye3b\" data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1179\">Marketing and business analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1310\">By the end of the program, students gain <strong data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1258\">end-to-end analytical capability</strong>, from data collection to strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1315\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zkmgv6\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1380\">Semester 1: Foundation in Business, Communication &amp; AI Basics</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1400\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1573\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hg1ei\" data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1412\">English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2rut8u\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1448\">HRM and Organizational Behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1473\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jd10lg\" data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1505\">Modern Business Environment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x3yp80\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1537\">Essentials of Generative AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zdlnqi\" data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1573\">Financial Literacy and Planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1578\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1606\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1731\">This semester builds your <strong data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1672\">business and analytical foundation</strong>, which is critical before moving into technical analytics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1743\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1862\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d4pzv6\" data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1774\">How organizations function</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xuee8e\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1810\">Basics of finance and budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lq9ebq\" data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1862\">Introduction to AI tools and prompt engineering</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1867\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1890\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"2137\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kt3l0w\" data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1933\">Professional writing and communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b0jfen\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1986\">HR fundamentals and organizational understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xy06e9\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2024\">Financial reporting and budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hgcrma\" data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2042\">ESG awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16stn1l\" data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2076\">Business environment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jjpir9\" data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2099\">Prompt engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gtfs1h\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2137\">Personal finance and ROI analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2142\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2171\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2288\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11og5el\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2211\">Business communication and writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15mih7v\" data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2238\">Emotional intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dicrkd\" data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2262\">Conflict management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1539tuo\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2288\">Excel BI fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2293\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k2lei3\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2315\">Strategic Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2406\">Students who take this semester seriously build strong fundamentals that directly impact:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2492\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"db6umo\" data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2430\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qibuwg\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2456\">Communication clarity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"do6zei\" data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2492\">Business decision understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2497\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13dawke\" data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2552\">Semester 3: Programming + Data Analytics Foundation</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2572\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2737\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rclezo\" data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2595\">Python Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2620\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0xup0\" data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2663\">Business Ethics and Negotiation Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9wyf6\" data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2686\">Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jpcxlo\" data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2711\">Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1skrokk\" data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2737\">Environmental Science</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2742\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2770\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2871\">This is the <strong data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2824\">entry point into technical analytics</strong>, where you begin working with real data tools.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2883\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2996\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l14lh8\" data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2924\">Python programming for data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cm3ot\" data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2958\">Data visualization techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qf2no1\" data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2996\">Research and statistical thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3001\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3024\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3277\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t12n5x\" data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3047\">Python programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nymaxh\" data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3068\">NumPy and Pandas</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10rudu\" data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3106\">Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"efrkn5\" data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3133\">Jupyter Notebook usage</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jakfcz\" data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3168\">Tableau and data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eu81yf\" data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3198\">Exploratory Data Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"221mdl\" data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3233\">Data structures and algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bu5mwu\" data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3277\">Hypothesis testing and research methods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3282\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3311\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3418\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aqsxf5\" data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3340\">Python scientific stack</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bfesqn\" data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3360\">SQL programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"neitqw\" data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3390\">Data science fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xpn6py\" data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3418\">Data quality management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3423\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u4bvwo\" data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3444\">Critical Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3565\">This semester determines your <strong data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3498\">technical strength</strong>. Students who practice coding regularly gain a major advantage in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3629\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vama37\" data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3581\">Internships</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4x7q6x\" data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3601\">Analytics roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1688lvi\" data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3629\">Placement opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3631\" data-end=\"3634\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1chmsg7\" data-start=\"3636\" data-end=\"3710\">Semester 4: Advanced Analytics + Machine Learning + Business Integration</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3730\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3900\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3751\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3777\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14k1gjy\" data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3825\">Predictive Analytics using Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mhgdjz\" data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3841\">Text Mining</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ik3dk7\" data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3873\">Digital Business Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3900\">International Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3902\" data-end=\"3905\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3933\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"4015\">This semester moves into <strong data-start=\"3960\" data-end=\"4014\">advanced analytics and AI applications in business</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4039\">You gain expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4168\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19m91mt\" data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4067\">Machine learning models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oq8jq8\" data-start=\"4068\" data-end=\"4099\">Natural language processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lgit73\" data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4133\">Data cleaning and preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mqe02u\" data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4168\">Business analytics integration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4170\" data-end=\"4173\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4196\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4423\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iewhl1\" data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4228\">Machine learning algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"swxo62\" data-start=\"4229\" data-end=\"4264\">Data cleaning and preprocessing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xxq3q2\" data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4291\">NLP and text analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"93bbki\" data-start=\"4292\" data-end=\"4322\">Business model development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pszdwg\" data-start=\"4323\" data-end=\"4349\">Supply chain analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fyshq\" data-start=\"4350\" data-end=\"4387\">Digital transformation strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"quswjq\" data-start=\"4388\" data-end=\"4423\">International business analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4428\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"4430\" data-end=\"4457\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4582\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v0jvj0\" data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4490\">Power Platform fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pszdwg\" data-start=\"4491\" data-end=\"4517\">Supply chain analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rg1ono\" data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4554\">Global trade and business models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ohqabe\" data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4582\">Data quality frameworks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4584\" data-end=\"4587\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k2lei3\" data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4609\">Strategic Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4611\" data-end=\"4650\">This is where students transition from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4651\" data-end=\"4713\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a68bks\" data-start=\"4651\" data-end=\"4713\">Learning tools &rarr; Applying tools in real business scenarios</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4715\" data-end=\"4718\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"lw3sc9\" data-start=\"4720\" data-end=\"4778\">Semester 5: Data Science + Forecasting + AI Applications</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"4780\" data-end=\"4798\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4966\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bee724\" data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4822\">Indian Constitution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"anv8l6\" data-start=\"4823\" data-end=\"4857\">Cost and Management Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bruzqq\" data-start=\"4858\" data-end=\"4873\">Data Mining</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16y90gt\" data-start=\"4874\" data-end=\"4901\">Time Series Forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n070eg\" data-start=\"4902\" data-end=\"4938\">Digital Marketing and E-Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajo29n\" data-start=\"4939\" data-end=\"4966\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4968\" data-end=\"4971\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"4973\" data-end=\"4999\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5001\" data-end=\"5061\">You move into <strong data-start=\"5015\" data-end=\"5060\">core data science and predictive modeling</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5063\" data-end=\"5073\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5074\" data-end=\"5201\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v9unvh\" data-start=\"5074\" data-end=\"5100\">Data mining techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12v6orh\" data-start=\"5101\" data-end=\"5128\">Time series forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hbu517\" data-start=\"5129\" data-end=\"5162\">AI models and neural networks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19m3h6g\" data-start=\"5163\" data-end=\"5201\">Business applications of analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5203\" data-end=\"5206\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"5208\" data-end=\"5229\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5230\" data-end=\"5401\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tehxmo\" data-start=\"5230\" data-end=\"5264\">Data mining and model building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15w0ka6\" data-start=\"5265\" data-end=\"5291\">Decision trees and SVM</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5te3p8\" data-start=\"5292\" data-end=\"5316\">Statistical modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hrfatf\" data-start=\"5317\" data-end=\"5351\">Forecasting and trend analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1riju69\" data-start=\"5352\" data-end=\"5376\">Deep learning basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n7bnwr\" data-start=\"5377\" data-end=\"5401\">E-commerce analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5403\" data-end=\"5406\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"5408\" data-end=\"5435\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5437\" data-end=\"5570\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jc3ky2\" data-start=\"5437\" data-end=\"5473\">Data engineering and warehousing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sesmpu\" data-start=\"5474\" data-end=\"5508\">AI strategy and implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j1q3yw\" data-start=\"5509\" data-end=\"5539\">Marketing automation tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13wz9vv\" data-start=\"5540\" data-end=\"5570\">Probability and statistics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5572\" data-end=\"5575\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1w18h0s\" data-start=\"5577\" data-end=\"5591\">Hidden Risk</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5593\" data-end=\"5658\">Students who skip hands-on practice in this semester struggle in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5659\" data-end=\"5717\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12h7sst\" data-start=\"5659\" data-end=\"5692\">Real-world analytics projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jqmch\" data-start=\"5693\" data-end=\"5717\">Technical interviews</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5719\" data-end=\"5722\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"epee85\" data-start=\"5724\" data-end=\"5788\">Semester 6: Business Analytics + Strategy + Industry Readiness</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g852uq\" data-start=\"5790\" data-end=\"5808\">Courses Offered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5809\" data-end=\"5984\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"5809\" data-end=\"5833\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1658k77\" data-start=\"5834\" data-end=\"5850\">Business Tax</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ynvm0w\" data-start=\"5851\" data-end=\"5916\">Web, Mobile and Social Media Analytics and Prompt Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ng8j22\" data-start=\"5917\" data-end=\"5940\">Marketing Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"5941\" data-end=\"5963\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yg84bo\" data-start=\"5964\" data-end=\"5984\">Research Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5986\" data-end=\"5989\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uuho3n\" data-start=\"5991\" data-end=\"6017\">What You Actually Learn</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6019\" data-end=\"6090\">The final semester prepares you for <strong data-start=\"6055\" data-end=\"6089\">industry-level analytics roles</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6092\" data-end=\"6102\">You learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6103\" data-end=\"6239\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14mye3b\" data-start=\"6103\" data-end=\"6139\">Marketing and business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ykhhke\" data-start=\"6140\" data-end=\"6178\">Web and social media data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"isgirj\" data-start=\"6179\" data-end=\"6209\">ROI and campaign analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gtj1fe\" data-start=\"6210\" data-end=\"6239\">Strategic decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6241\" data-end=\"6244\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gwytz9\" data-start=\"6246\" data-end=\"6267\">Skills You Develop</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6268\" data-end=\"6438\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nbyed4\" data-start=\"6268\" data-end=\"6290\">Business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fjj1ju\" data-start=\"6291\" data-end=\"6314\">Marketing analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17d15sq\" data-start=\"6315\" data-end=\"6349\">Web and social media analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4almn9\" data-start=\"6350\" data-end=\"6372\">Dashboard creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g3gop9\" data-start=\"6373\" data-end=\"6404\">Data-driven decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gfw00g\" data-start=\"6405\" data-end=\"6438\">Market research and reporting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6440\" data-end=\"6443\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e8gz45\" data-start=\"6445\" data-end=\"6472\">Certifications Advantage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6474\" data-end=\"6557\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dd92nc\" data-start=\"6474\" data-end=\"6491\">Looker Studio</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mhz41l\" data-start=\"6492\" data-end=\"6516\">Predictive analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0foq\" data-start=\"6517\" data-end=\"6538\">Data storytelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m48cn3\" data-start=\"6539\" data-end=\"6557\">Excel BI tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6559\" data-end=\"6562\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hln5ph\" data-start=\"6564\" data-end=\"6580\">Career Impact</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6582\" data-end=\"6622\">This semester directly prepares you for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6623\" data-end=\"6708\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"924fdv\" data-start=\"6623\" data-end=\"6645\">Data analyst roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xzbkew\" data-start=\"6646\" data-end=\"6676\">Business analyst positions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rr1xcb\" data-start=\"6677\" data-end=\"6708\">Marketing analytics careers</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 150000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(303, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 271, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-06 23:45:35', '2026-06-16 07:08:43', '<p data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"791\">The admission process for the BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications) program is designed to be simple, structured, and student-friendly so that applicants can complete enrollment without confusion. The entire process is divided into clear stages that guide students from initial application to final seat confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"1093\">Unlike traditional admission systems that often involve complex offline procedures, this modern admission workflow is fully streamlined and digital-first. It allows students to apply online, verify their details, choose their program, complete payment, and secure their seat in a step-by-step manner.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1236\">This structured approach ensures transparency, reduces delays, and helps students easily track their admission status throughout the process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1241\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17qwtd3\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1276\">Step 1: Submit Application Form</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pud9hh\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1316\">Begin Your Admission Journey Online</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1492\">The first step in the BCA admission process is submitting the online application form. This is the entry point where the student officially expresses interest in the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1587\">Students are required to provide basic academic and personal details in the application form.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pq5iq0\" data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1633\">Information Required in Application Form</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1951\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yhfzl1\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1663\">Full name of the student</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fgia91\" data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1709\">Contact details (mobile number, email ID)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcjsc9\" data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1771\">Academic qualification details (10+2 or appearing status)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cgh4mq\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1828\">Choice of program (BCA specialization if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ol8s6a\" data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1870\">Basic personal identification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9loe89\" data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1951\">Educational board information (CBSE, State Board, NIOS, ICSE, IB, IGCSE, etc.)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11w912n\" data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1980\">Importance of This Step</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2200\">This step is extremely important because it creates the initial academic profile of the student in the admission system. All future communication, verification, and enrollment activities are linked to this application.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2364\">Students should ensure that all details are entered correctly, as incorrect information may delay the admission process or require correction during verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2369\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"goeszs\" data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2426\">Step 2: Program Selection and Enrollment Confirmation</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w15xmi\" data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2486\">Choose Your Specialization and Confirm Admission Intent</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2710\">Once the application is submitted, the next step is program selection and enrollment confirmation. In this stage, students actively choose the BCA program they wish to pursue and verify their academic and personal details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"igadrs\" data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2742\">What Happens in This Stage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2967\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wx0eoc\" data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2776\">Selection of the BCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rqnwsh\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2826\">Verification of submitted application details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c4yhxk\" data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2884\">Confirmation of eligibility based on academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o1ctxu\" data-start=\"2885\" data-end=\"2924\">Final review of student information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yyslny\" data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2967\">Enrollment approval process initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"2999\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3212\">This stage ensures that students are correctly mapped to their chosen program. It eliminates errors in course allocation and ensures that the student&rsquo;s academic records align with the selected program structure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3342\">It also acts as a validation checkpoint before payment is initiated, ensuring transparency and accuracy in the admission system.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3347\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ngqmmg\" data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3385\">Step 3: Payment Completion Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pajmal\" data-start=\"3387\" data-end=\"3431\">Flexible Fee Payment Options for Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3642\">After enrollment confirmation, students proceed to the payment stage. The BCA admission process offers multiple flexible payment options to ensure financial convenience for students from different backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3644\" data-end=\"3833\">This flexibility is one of the strongest advantages of the admission system, as it reduces financial pressure and allows students to choose a payment method that best suits their situation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3835\" data-end=\"3838\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"3840\" data-end=\"3868\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t67n64\" data-start=\"3870\" data-end=\"3898\">1. One-Time Full Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3975\">Students can choose to pay the entire program fee at once during admission.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"4148\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t2ahjl\" data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"4010\">Full program fee paid upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rgn9ha\" data-start=\"4011\" data-end=\"4055\">No further tuition installments required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"917kpq\" data-start=\"4056\" data-end=\"4091\">Simplified financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18e3hsp\" data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4148\">Ideal for students preferring a single payment cycle</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4302\">This option is often chosen by students who want to complete financial formalities at the beginning of the course and avoid recurring payment deadlines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4307\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ano7td\" data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4343\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4419\">Students also have the option to pay through flexible financing solutions.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4618\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oy3e3h\" data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4465\">Monthly installment-based payment system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2vjn88\" data-start=\"4466\" data-end=\"4524\">Zero or low-interest EMI options (subject to approval)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xbo23r\" data-start=\"4525\" data-end=\"4581\">Financial assistance through education loan partners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gd1xij\" data-start=\"4582\" data-end=\"4618\">Reduced upfront financial burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"95n5su\" data-start=\"4620\" data-end=\"4651\">Why EMI Option is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4653\" data-end=\"4728\">This option makes higher education more accessible by allowing students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4914\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"50u867\" data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4774\">Manage expenses without financial stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"upzgro\" data-start=\"4775\" data-end=\"4823\">Start studies without waiting for full funds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gfbqfx\" data-start=\"4824\" data-end=\"4861\">Pay in small monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"grznfa\" data-start=\"4862\" data-end=\"4914\">Focus on academics instead of financial pressure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4916\" data-end=\"5062\">This is especially beneficial for students from middle-income families who want to invest in a professional IT degree without heavy upfront costs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5064\" data-end=\"5067\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"sd84ov\" data-start=\"5069\" data-end=\"5103\">Importance of the Payment Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5105\" data-end=\"5315\">The payment stage is not just a financial step&mdash;it is a confirmation milestone in the admission process. Once payment is completed or financing is approved, the admission process moves toward final confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5317\" data-end=\"5320\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"28p54m\" data-start=\"5322\" data-end=\"5376\">Step 4: Seat Confirmation and Admission Finalization</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b8lzt6\" data-start=\"5378\" data-end=\"5416\">Secure Your Seat in the BCA Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5418\" data-end=\"5581\">The final step in the admission process is seat confirmation. Once payment or financing is successfully completed, the student&rsquo;s admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3r0w07\" data-start=\"5583\" data-end=\"5624\">What Happens After Payment Completion</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5626\" data-end=\"5836\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pg5iq\" data-start=\"5626\" data-end=\"5670\">Admission status is updated to confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a9y8x6\" data-start=\"5671\" data-end=\"5718\">Seat is officially reserved for the student</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hykcm2\" data-start=\"5719\" data-end=\"5755\">Enrollment records are finalized</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1te3dzh\" data-start=\"5756\" data-end=\"5797\">Access to student portal is activated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"re5n8p\" data-start=\"5798\" data-end=\"5836\">Academic onboarding process begins</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1y1jdfx\" data-start=\"5838\" data-end=\"5866\">Why This Step is Crucial</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5868\" data-end=\"6063\">This step ensures that the student has a guaranteed seat in the program. Without completing this step, admission remains incomplete and the student may not be officially registered in the course.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6065\" data-end=\"6173\">Seat confirmation is essentially the final validation that the student is fully enrolled in the BCA program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6175\" data-end=\"6178\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rhyztk\" data-start=\"6180\" data-end=\"6213\">Complete Admission Flow Summary</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6215\" data-end=\"6313\">To understand the process clearly, here is a simplified breakdown of the entire admission journey:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5kos6l\" data-start=\"6315\" data-end=\"6351\">Step 1: Application Submission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6352\" data-end=\"6437\">Student fills and submits online application form with personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"m4qpgs\" data-start=\"6439\" data-end=\"6471\">Step 2: Program Enrollment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6472\" data-end=\"6537\">Student selects BCA program and verifies eligibility and details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7aiqyr\" data-start=\"6539\" data-end=\"6571\">Step 3: Payment Completion</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6572\" data-end=\"6650\">Student chooses one-time payment or EMI/loan option and completes fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3p9a2e\" data-start=\"6652\" data-end=\"6683\">Step 4: Seat Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6684\" data-end=\"6753\">Admission is finalized and seat is officially secured in the program.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"874\">The eligibility criteria for a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program define the academic qualifications and conditions a student must fulfill before applying for admission. Understanding eligibility is extremely important because it determines whether a student is academically qualified to pursue the course and ensures smooth admission without rejection or documentation issues.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"1274\">BCA is one of the most popular undergraduate programs for students interested in computer science, programming, artificial intelligence, software development, and emerging technologies. Since it is an entry-level professional degree in the IT field, the eligibility criteria are designed to be accessible to students from multiple educational backgrounds while still maintaining academic standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1410\">This flexibility allows students from different school boards and education systems to pursue a career in technology without barriers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1415\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"lu44pk\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1468\">Basic Educational Qualification for BCA Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1621\">The primary requirement for admission into the BCA program is successful completion of the 10+2 (Higher Secondary) examination from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4aqbai\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1660\">Accepted Qualification Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1681\">Students must have:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1789\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1siutv5\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1739\">Passed 10+2 examination from a recognized board<br data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1735\">OR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x1902d\" data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1789\">Be currently appearing for the 10+2 examination</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1881\">This ensures that both completed and final-year school students can apply for the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1886\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"110am8p\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1927\">Recognized Boards for BCA Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"2164\">One of the most important aspects of this eligibility structure is its wide acceptance of educational boards. Students from various national and international boards are considered eligible, making the program inclusive and accessible.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p5fv8t\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2192\">1. State Board Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2311\">Students who have completed their 10+2 education from any recognized State Board in India are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2429\">State Boards follow region-specific curricula but are fully recognized across India for higher education admissions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2434\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dktm32\" data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2461\">2. CBSE Board Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2564\">Students from the Central Board of Secondary Education (CBSE) are fully eligible for the BCA program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2712\">CBSE is one of the most widely accepted boards in India, and its curriculum is highly aligned with competitive and professional academic programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2717\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17x1ja1\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2738\">3. NIOS Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2820\">Students from the National Institute of Open Schooling (NIOS) are also eligible.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"3022\">This is particularly important because it ensures that students who completed their education through distance or open schooling are not restricted from pursuing higher education in technology fields.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3073\">NIOS eligibility makes the program inclusive for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3183\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ergm37\" data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3093\">Working students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tcims\" data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3129\">Students who took academic breaks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qoe3re\" data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3183\">Students from non-traditional education backgrounds</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3188\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"y30bsp\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3209\">4. ICSE Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3311\">Students from the Indian Certificate of Secondary Education (ICSE) board are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3466\">ICSE students often have strong English communication and analytical skills, which are highly beneficial in programming and software development careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3471\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"r24iix\" data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3520\">5. IB (International Baccalaureate) Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3625\">Students completing their 10+2 equivalent education from IB (International Baccalaureate) are eligible.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3804\">IB is internationally recognized and focuses on analytical thinking, research skills, and global learning standards, which align well with modern computer applications programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"3809\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gn7irg\" data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"3831\">6. IGCSE Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3960\">Students from the International General Certificate of Secondary Education (IGCSE) board are also eligible for the BCA program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"4142\">IGCSE is widely accepted globally and provides a strong foundation in mathematics, science, and logical reasoning, which are essential for programming and computer science studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4147\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"134pbc9\" data-start=\"4149\" data-end=\"4205\">Eligibility for Students Appearing in 10+2 Examination</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4207\" data-end=\"4367\">One of the most student-friendly aspects of this eligibility structure is that students who are currently in their final year of 10+2 are also allowed to apply.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"166q3np\" data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4402\">Appearing Students Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4404\" data-end=\"4421\">Students who are:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4423\" data-end=\"4505\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d5ta9d\" data-start=\"4423\" data-end=\"4457\">Currently studying in Class 12</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khijle\" data-start=\"4458\" data-end=\"4505\">Appearing for 10+2 final board examinations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4507\" data-end=\"4555\">are eligible to apply for provisional admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"181lajy\" data-start=\"4557\" data-end=\"4577\">Why This Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4579\" data-end=\"4831\">This provision ensures that students do not lose admission opportunities due to timing differences between board exams and university admission cycles. It allows students to secure their seat in advance while completing their final school examinations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4833\" data-end=\"4938\">However, final admission is typically confirmed only after successful completion of the 10+2 examination.</p>', '<p data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"838\">Understanding the complete fee structure of a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is one of the most important steps before taking admission. Many students focus only on the tuition fee mentioned on promotional pages and later face confusion regarding examination fees, registration charges, semester payments, or additional academic expenses.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"1044\">A clear understanding of the fee structure helps students and parents plan finances properly, avoid unexpected expenses, and choose the most suitable payment method based on affordability and convenience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1390\">The BCA program fee structure has been designed with flexible payment options so that students from different financial backgrounds can comfortably pursue their education without excessive financial pressure. Instead of forcing students to make a full upfront payment, the institution allows semester-wise, yearly, and one-time payment options.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1529\">This flexibility becomes especially useful for students who want to manage educational expenses gradually while continuing their studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1534\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rpalu4\" data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1559\">Total BCA Course Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1616\">The total academic fee for the complete BCA program is:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1692\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1644\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1644\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1634\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1644\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1692\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1692\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1680\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total BCA Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1692\">₹120,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1852\">The total fee covers the academic curriculum, learning resources, program delivery, and access to the course structure throughout the duration of the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"2003\">However, students should also understand that additional charges such as examination fees and registration fees are separate from the tuition amount.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xmqwzd\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2040\">Flexible BCA Payment Options</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2242\">One of the strongest advantages of this fee structure is payment flexibility. Students are not restricted to a single payment method and can choose the option that best suits their financial planning.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fy0op2\" data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2268\">Yearly Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2295\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2295\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2285\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2295\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2320\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2340\">₹40,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2475\">This option is suitable for students who prefer paying once every academic year instead of handling semester transactions repeatedly.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gbnr3t\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2525\">Benefits of Choosing the Yearly Payment Plan</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2678\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10knrp\" data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2552\">Lower payment frequency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yyy35h\" data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2580\">Easier financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o4xkls\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2612\">Reduced administrative hassle</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fo5b7t\" data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2643\">Better budgeting for parents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fp5din\" data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2678\">Convenient for salaried families</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2781\">Many families prefer yearly payments because they align better with annual financial planning cycles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2786\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10okfbr\" data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2819\">Semester-Wise Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2897\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2846\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2846\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2836\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2846\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2897\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2897\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2873\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2897\">₹20,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2899\" data-end=\"2989\">The semester-wise option is ideal for students who want lower short-term financial burden.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nvz34l\" data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3031\">Advantages of Semester-Wise Payments</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3217\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mw2soi\" data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3069\">Smaller payment amount at one time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4ac8z\" data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3105\">Better affordability for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19qdt9p\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3142\">Easier installment-style budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8g6spd\" data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3181\">Reduced immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8l22mh\" data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3217\">More flexibility during education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3333\">This option is often preferred by students managing education alongside work or those planning finances gradually.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3338\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"118e5g3\" data-start=\"3340\" data-end=\"3371\">One-Time Full Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3445\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3398\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3398\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3388\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3398\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3445\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3445\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3433\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Full Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3445\">₹120,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3528\">Students can also choose to pay the complete course fee at once during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cizlxt\" data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3564\">Advantages of One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3697\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tvgumi\" data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3596\">No repeated payment tracking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w50h2s\" data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3626\">Avoids future fee deadlines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17p47ir\" data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3660\">Long-term financial convenience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cshu2r\" data-start=\"3661\" data-end=\"3697\">Simplifies academic fee management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3825\">Some students and parents prefer full payment because it eliminates recurring payment concerns throughout the course duration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3830\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qqn3gu\" data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3869\">Additional Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3969\">Apart from tuition fees, Indian students are required to pay registration and examination charges.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fq8a5m\" data-start=\"3971\" data-end=\"4007\">Fee Breakdown for Indian Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4128\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4041\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4041\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4031\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4041\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4052\" data-end=\"4128\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4052\" data-end=\"4090\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4052\" data-end=\"4080\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4090\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4128\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4109\" data-end=\"4128\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4133\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uz24b3\" data-start=\"4135\" data-end=\"4172\">Understanding the Registration Fee</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4276\">The one-time registration fee is generally charged during the admission process. This fee is used for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4278\" data-end=\"4442\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w7zyj2\" data-start=\"4278\" data-end=\"4309\">Student enrollment processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aunx49\" data-start=\"4310\" data-end=\"4336\">Academic record creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c99h2c\" data-start=\"4337\" data-end=\"4374\">University registration formalities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"drhyox\" data-start=\"4375\" data-end=\"4414\">Identity generation and documentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xbwlfl\" data-start=\"4415\" data-end=\"4442\">Student portal activation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"4535\">Since this is a one-time payment, students do not need to pay it repeatedly every semester.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4537\" data-end=\"4540\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17hibpx\" data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4578\">Understanding the Examination Fee</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4580\" data-end=\"4631\">The examination fee is charged yearly and supports:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4757\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4jriql\" data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4658\">Conduct of examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h6bin7\" data-start=\"4659\" data-end=\"4681\">Evaluation processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o2l2fe\" data-start=\"4682\" data-end=\"4701\">Result processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nsw9dv\" data-start=\"4702\" data-end=\"4727\">Academic administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5bnsen\" data-start=\"4728\" data-end=\"4757\">Digital examination systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4952\">Students should always include examination fees while calculating the total educational expense because many students mistakenly calculate only tuition fees and ignore yearly examination costs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4954\" data-end=\"4957\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"173n3up\" data-start=\"4959\" data-end=\"5003\">Additional Fees for SAARC Country Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5005\" data-end=\"5097\">Students from SAARC nations have a separate fee structure for registration and examinations.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5099\" data-end=\"5210\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5099\" data-end=\"5131\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5099\" data-end=\"5131\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5099\" data-end=\"5121\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5121\" data-end=\"5131\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5142\" data-end=\"5210\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5142\" data-end=\"5172\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5142\" data-end=\"5161\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5161\" data-end=\"5172\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5173\" data-end=\"5210\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5173\" data-end=\"5191\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5191\" data-end=\"5210\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"5212\" data-end=\"5303\">This fee structure is applicable to eligible students applying from SAARC-region countries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5305\" data-end=\"5308\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"puptap\" data-start=\"5310\" data-end=\"5354\">Additional Fees for International Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5356\" data-end=\"5417\">International students have fee components structured in USD.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5419\" data-end=\"5533\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5419\" data-end=\"5451\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5419\" data-end=\"5451\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5419\" data-end=\"5441\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5441\" data-end=\"5451\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5533\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5498\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5490\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5490\" data-end=\"5498\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5499\" data-end=\"5533\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5499\" data-end=\"5517\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5517\" data-end=\"5533\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"1033\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) in Artificial Intelligence and Emerging Technologies is designed for students who want to build strong expertise in software development, programming, AI systems, cloud technologies, cybersecurity, blockchain, web technologies, databases, and machine learning. Unlike a traditional BCA program that focuses mainly on coding fundamentals, this specialized curriculum integrates modern industry-driven technologies from the very first semester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1431\">The program gradually develops students from beginners in programming to professionals capable of working on AI-powered applications, cloud platforms, intelligent systems, web technologies, and data-driven solutions. The curriculum combines theoretical concepts, coding labs, real-world projects, LinkedIn Learning certifications, and industry-oriented skills that help students become job-ready.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1785\">One of the biggest advantages of this curriculum is that it follows a progressive learning structure. Students first build logic, mathematical understanding, and programming fundamentals, then move toward advanced technologies like databases, networking, cybersecurity, cloud computing, blockchain, big data analytics, IoT, and artificial intelligence.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1973\">This approach helps students avoid one of the most common mistakes in tech education &mdash; jumping directly into advanced AI tools without strong programming and problem-solving foundations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"1978\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gghstm\" data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2016\">Why This BCA Curriculum Stands Out</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2295\">Most students today want to enter fields like Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, Software Development, Cybersecurity, or Cloud Computing. However, many programs teach concepts theoretically without practical implementation. This curriculum stands out because it emphasizes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2561\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2x986\" data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2330\">Strong programming fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oo2m0f\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2354\">Practical coding labs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"197opqx\" data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2380\">Industry certifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"141vdyo\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2404\">Emerging technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o2e6vp\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2429\">Project-based learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dbifyf\" data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2456\">AI-integrated curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17lp4tq\" data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2489\">Career-ready skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11pu937\" data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2529\">Modern software development practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19phta5\" data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2561\">Real-world technical exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2718\">Students also gain exposure to platforms and learning ecosystems widely used in the tech industry, improving employability from the early semesters itself.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2723\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"kgcit3\" data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2778\">Semester 1: Building Programming and AI Foundations</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14olmdj\" data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2811\">Core Objective of Semester 1</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"3152\">The first semester focuses on building logical thinking, mathematical understanding, programming basics, and AI awareness. This semester is extremely important because students who develop strong logic-building skills early usually perform much better in advanced subjects like algorithms, machine learning, and software engineering later.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3387\">Many students underestimate foundational subjects and focus only on AI buzzwords. This becomes a major problem during technical interviews because companies evaluate coding logic, analytical ability, and problem-solving skills first.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12cwz3y\" data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3422\">Subjects Covered in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vaosqc\" data-start=\"3424\" data-end=\"3435\">English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3698\">This subject improves communication abilities, comprehension, vocabulary, technical writing, and professional communication skills. Strong communication is essential because technical professionals often work in teams, prepare reports, and interact with clients.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5cl54f\" data-start=\"3700\" data-end=\"3731\">Fundamentals of Mathematics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3956\">Students learn mathematical concepts required for programming, algorithms, logical reasoning, and computational thinking. Mathematics becomes especially important later in AI, machine learning, and data science applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d4mtri\" data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"3985\">Problem Solving using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3986\" data-end=\"4149\">This subject introduces programming fundamentals using the C language. Students learn variables, loops, conditions, functions, arrays, and logical problem-solving.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5rc8r8\" data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4176\">Computer Architecture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4345\">Students understand how computers internally process instructions, store data, manage memory, and execute programs. This creates strong hardware-software understanding.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f55vj2\" data-start=\"4347\" data-end=\"4378\">Essentials of Generative AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4379\" data-end=\"4554\">This modern subject introduces students to artificial intelligence, machine learning concepts, generative AI tools, and the future impact of AI technologies across industries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13z5in5\" data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4587\">Problem Solving using C Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4686\">The practical lab strengthens coding implementation skills through hands-on programming exercises.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4691\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gveden\" data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4726\">Skills Developed in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4728\" data-end=\"4785\">Students develop foundational technical skills including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4787\" data-end=\"5045\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10v4scw\" data-start=\"4787\" data-end=\"4808\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ijgu3j\" data-start=\"4809\" data-end=\"4828\">Programming logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ygfb3o\" data-start=\"4829\" data-end=\"4852\">Algorithm development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16xjajk\" data-start=\"4853\" data-end=\"4877\">Structured programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g516zx\" data-start=\"4878\" data-end=\"4901\">Mathematical modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vma3rj\" data-start=\"4902\" data-end=\"4921\">Logical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mbphap\" data-start=\"4922\" data-end=\"4944\">Debugging techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cao1z2\" data-start=\"4945\" data-end=\"4982\">Computer architecture understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l6zbfx\" data-start=\"4983\" data-end=\"5009\">Code optimization basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iscfv4\" data-start=\"5010\" data-end=\"5045\">Artificial intelligence awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5047\" data-end=\"5131\">These skills form the backbone for advanced software development and AI engineering.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5133\" data-end=\"5136\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3yqru4\" data-start=\"5138\" data-end=\"5178\">Industry Certifications in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5180\" data-end=\"5266\">Students are introduced to beginner-friendly industry learning certifications such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5268\" data-end=\"5524\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qe07fr\" data-start=\"5268\" data-end=\"5307\">Programming Foundations: Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zu14ad\" data-start=\"5308\" data-end=\"5330\">C Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kab05r\" data-start=\"5331\" data-end=\"5368\">Programming Foundations: Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yyb24l\" data-start=\"5369\" data-end=\"5411\">Programming Foundations: Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mvkm2n\" data-start=\"5412\" data-end=\"5468\">Artificial Intelligence Foundations: Thinking Machines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u5rt54\" data-start=\"5469\" data-end=\"5524\">Artificial Intelligence Foundations: Machine Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5526\" data-end=\"5671\">These certifications help students gain practical exposure beyond classroom learning and improve resume quality from the beginning of the degree.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5673\" data-end=\"5676\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1twslgh\" data-start=\"5678\" data-end=\"5738\">Semester 2: Data Structures, Databases &amp; Operating Systems</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14olmdg\" data-start=\"5740\" data-end=\"5771\">Core Objective of Semester 2</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5773\" data-end=\"6059\">The second semester shifts focus toward core computer science concepts including data organization, database systems, and operating systems. This semester is highly important for technical interviews because data structures and SQL are among the most asked topics in software companies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6061\" data-end=\"6147\">Students who ignore data structures often struggle during coding rounds in placements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6149\" data-end=\"6152\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12cwz3x\" data-start=\"6154\" data-end=\"6187\">Subjects Covered in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sr0i3q\" data-start=\"6189\" data-end=\"6214\">Communicative English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6215\" data-end=\"6330\">This subject further improves professional communication, presentation abilities, and workplace interaction skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"np08ta\" data-start=\"6332\" data-end=\"6352\">Operating System</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6353\" data-end=\"6459\">Students learn process management, memory management, file systems, CPU scheduling, and system operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m64tpx\" data-start=\"6461\" data-end=\"6488\">Data Structures using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6489\" data-end=\"6599\">This subject teaches efficient data organization techniques including stacks, queues, linked lists, and trees.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1581opq\" data-start=\"6601\" data-end=\"6632\">Relational Database Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6633\" data-end=\"6737\">Students learn database design, SQL queries, normalization, relational models, and data storage systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yhpx33\" data-start=\"6739\" data-end=\"6762\">Data Structures Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6763\" data-end=\"6832\">Practical implementation of data structures through coding exercises.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fealwj\" data-start=\"6834\" data-end=\"6847\">RDBMS Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6848\" data-end=\"6895\">Hands-on database programming and SQL practice.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6897\" data-end=\"6900\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedek\" data-start=\"6902\" data-end=\"6935\">Skills Developed in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6937\" data-end=\"7002\">Students gain important backend and systems-level skills such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7004\" data-end=\"7217\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13imx8s\" data-start=\"7004\" data-end=\"7036\">Data structures implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdcpxb\" data-start=\"7037\" data-end=\"7054\">Database design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"goc9of\" data-start=\"7055\" data-end=\"7072\">SQL programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nhkwsw\" data-start=\"7073\" data-end=\"7093\">Process management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7fgn22\" data-start=\"7094\" data-end=\"7113\">Memory management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qb9fy3\" data-start=\"7114\" data-end=\"7133\">Database security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6akjt5\" data-start=\"7134\" data-end=\"7164\">Relational database handling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f3eb7e\" data-start=\"7165\" data-end=\"7193\">Stack and queue operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hbdvsk\" data-start=\"7194\" data-end=\"7217\">Tree-based structures</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7219\" data-end=\"7345\">These are essential for careers in software engineering, backend development, database administration, and system programming.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7347\" data-end=\"7350\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7kliy4\" data-start=\"7352\" data-end=\"7391\">Certifications Offered in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7393\" data-end=\"7587\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15skkmd\" data-start=\"7393\" data-end=\"7429\">Programming Foundations: Databases</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uki588\" data-start=\"7430\" data-end=\"7454\">SQL Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gt7zb\" data-start=\"7455\" data-end=\"7492\">Database Foundations: Core Concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3tyisr\" data-start=\"7493\" data-end=\"7519\">Learning SQL Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yyb24l\" data-start=\"7520\" data-end=\"7562\">Programming Foundations: Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14hrwbw\" data-start=\"7563\" data-end=\"7587\">Git Essential Training</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7589\" data-end=\"7695\">Learning Git early is extremely valuable because version control is used in almost every software company.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7697\" data-end=\"7700\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"i6umj9\" data-start=\"7702\" data-end=\"7757\">Semester 3: Python, Algorithms &amp; Software Engineering</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14olmdh\" data-start=\"7759\" data-end=\"7790\">Core Objective of Semester 3</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7792\" data-end=\"7951\">Semester 3 introduces professional-level programming practices, algorithm optimization, networking, software development methodologies, and Python programming.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7953\" data-end=\"8048\">Python is one of the most demanded programming languages globally because it is widely used in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8050\" data-end=\"8176\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qfianv\" data-start=\"8050\" data-end=\"8075\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qonj7w\" data-start=\"8076\" data-end=\"8090\">Data Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d3mavt\" data-start=\"8091\" data-end=\"8109\">Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"399lfb\" data-start=\"8110\" data-end=\"8122\">Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ihirfv\" data-start=\"8123\" data-end=\"8140\">Web Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b3zhwx\" data-start=\"8141\" data-end=\"8156\">Cybersecurity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kzrt28\" data-start=\"8157\" data-end=\"8176\">Cloud Engineering</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8178\" data-end=\"8181\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12cwz3w\" data-start=\"8183\" data-end=\"8216\">Subjects Covered in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"116sc7f\" data-start=\"8218\" data-end=\"8240\">Python Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8241\" data-end=\"8345\">Students learn Python syntax, functions, object-oriented programming, modules, libraries, and scripting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ec7haw\" data-start=\"8347\" data-end=\"8384\">Design and Analysis of Algorithms</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8385\" data-end=\"8478\">This subject teaches efficient problem-solving methods and algorithm optimization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tasahc\" data-start=\"8480\" data-end=\"8504\">Software Engineering</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8505\" data-end=\"8613\">Students understand the software development lifecycle, project planning, testing, and software maintenance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ah5kss\" data-start=\"8615\" data-end=\"8636\">Computer Networks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8637\" data-end=\"8742\">Topics include networking protocols, internet communication, network architecture, and data transmission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ubipe5\" data-start=\"8744\" data-end=\"8757\">ESG in IT</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8758\" data-end=\"8848\">Students explore Environmental, Social, and Governance practices in the technology sector.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xu3cck\" data-start=\"8850\" data-end=\"8876\">Python Programming Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8877\" data-end=\"8909\">Practical Python implementation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fp89w5\" data-start=\"8911\" data-end=\"8929\">Algorithms Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8930\" data-end=\"8978\">Hands-on algorithm development and optimization.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8980\" data-end=\"8983\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedel\" data-start=\"8985\" data-end=\"9018\">Skills Developed in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9020\" data-end=\"9073\">Students gain advanced technical abilities including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9075\" data-end=\"9316\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sw0tl1\" data-start=\"9075\" data-end=\"9095\">Python programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k30kcj\" data-start=\"9096\" data-end=\"9125\">Object-oriented programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b5rh0j\" data-start=\"9126\" data-end=\"9143\">API development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yox94h\" data-start=\"9144\" data-end=\"9162\">Software testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qgiv19\" data-start=\"9163\" data-end=\"9182\">Agile development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10xhz7a\" data-start=\"9183\" data-end=\"9206\">Network communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i9bgrm\" data-start=\"9207\" data-end=\"9227\">Data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vcntcf\" data-start=\"9228\" data-end=\"9255\">Debugging and refactoring</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e4dkp5\" data-start=\"9256\" data-end=\"9281\">Technical documentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sxbbrp\" data-start=\"9282\" data-end=\"9316\">Software lifecycle understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"9318\" data-end=\"9400\">These skills are directly aligned with software development industry requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9402\" data-end=\"9405\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7kliy5\" data-start=\"9407\" data-end=\"9446\">Certifications Offered in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9448\" data-end=\"9690\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p3lrr6\" data-start=\"9448\" data-end=\"9475\">Python Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ombvy5\" data-start=\"9476\" data-end=\"9515\">Python Data Structures and Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1208fkz\" data-start=\"9516\" data-end=\"9541\">Python for Data Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cbpwll\" data-start=\"9542\" data-end=\"9572\">Software Testing Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"75e2z2\" data-start=\"9573\" data-end=\"9597\">Networking Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11qszbq\" data-start=\"9598\" data-end=\"9617\">Agile Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13sy1nv\" data-start=\"9618\" data-end=\"9638\">DevOps Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14hrwbw\" data-start=\"9639\" data-end=\"9663\">Git Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ngiac\" data-start=\"9664\" data-end=\"9690\">Data Science Foundations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"9692\" data-end=\"9753\">This semester significantly improves technical employability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9755\" data-end=\"9758\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"121dpfu\" data-start=\"9760\" data-end=\"9811\">Semester 4: Java, Cybersecurity &amp; Web Development</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14olmde\" data-start=\"9813\" data-end=\"9844\">Core Objective of Semester 4</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9846\" data-end=\"9976\">Semester 4 focuses on enterprise application development, cybersecurity concepts, advanced databases, and modern web technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"9978\" data-end=\"10075\">Students begin learning full-stack development concepts and secure application design principles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10077\" data-end=\"10080\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12cwz3v\" data-start=\"10082\" data-end=\"10115\">Subjects Covered in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mvwlhy\" data-start=\"10117\" data-end=\"10137\">Web Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10138\" data-end=\"10233\">Students learn HTML, CSS, JavaScript, web architecture, and responsive application development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1shzesj\" data-start=\"10235\" data-end=\"10255\">Java Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10256\" data-end=\"10335\">Java programming introduces object-oriented enterprise application development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8b5860\" data-start=\"10337\" data-end=\"10365\">Advanced Database System</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10366\" data-end=\"10467\">Students learn query optimization, normalization, advanced SQL, and database performance improvement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2xicjg\" data-start=\"10469\" data-end=\"10493\">Information Security</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10494\" data-end=\"10602\">This subject introduces encryption, authentication, cybersecurity principles, and system protection methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wd8pb8\" data-start=\"10604\" data-end=\"10631\">Quantitative Techniques</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10632\" data-end=\"10725\">Students learn statistical and quantitative methods useful for analytics and decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zokqhl\" data-start=\"10727\" data-end=\"10751\">Web Technologies Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10752\" data-end=\"10790\">Practical web application development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t0hwq4\" data-start=\"10792\" data-end=\"10816\">Java Programming Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10817\" data-end=\"10846\">Hands-on Java implementation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10848\" data-end=\"10851\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedei\" data-start=\"10853\" data-end=\"10886\">Skills Developed in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"10888\" data-end=\"10915\">Students develop skills in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10917\" data-end=\"11149\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2o2fs\" data-start=\"10917\" data-end=\"10940\">Front-end development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o7lp8x\" data-start=\"10941\" data-end=\"10970\">Web application development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4tv36\" data-start=\"10971\" data-end=\"10990\">JDBC connectivity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h4ui72\" data-start=\"10991\" data-end=\"11015\">Authentication systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"126jync\" data-start=\"11016\" data-end=\"11039\">Encryption techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gu7aw5\" data-start=\"11040\" data-end=\"11068\">Cybersecurity fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pmwe0z\" data-start=\"11069\" data-end=\"11089\">Query optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o23ejy\" data-start=\"11090\" data-end=\"11107\">API integration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"evugvc\" data-start=\"11108\" data-end=\"11131\">Database connectivity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z1z1u8\" data-start=\"11132\" data-end=\"11149\">Troubleshooting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"11151\" data-end=\"11245\">This semester creates strong foundations for full-stack development and cybersecurity careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11247\" data-end=\"11250\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7kliy2\" data-start=\"11252\" data-end=\"11291\">Certifications Offered in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11293\" data-end=\"11452\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o0lfbf\" data-start=\"11293\" data-end=\"11318\">HTML Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ark9c5\" data-start=\"11319\" data-end=\"11350\">JavaScript Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bl4kyy\" data-start=\"11351\" data-end=\"11376\">Java Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mqgex4\" data-start=\"11377\" data-end=\"11411\">Advanced SQL for Data Scientists</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z0vzpv\" data-start=\"11412\" data-end=\"11427\">Learning JDBC</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uki588\" data-start=\"11428\" data-end=\"11452\">SQL Essential Training</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"11454\" data-end=\"11536\">These certifications align well with web development and enterprise software jobs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11538\" data-end=\"11541\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cxx0r8\" data-start=\"11543\" data-end=\"11595\">Semester 5: Cloud Computing, Blockchain &amp; Big Data</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14olmdf\" data-start=\"11597\" data-end=\"11628\">Core Objective of Semester 5</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"11630\" data-end=\"11753\">Semester 5 introduces highly in-demand modern technologies used in enterprise IT infrastructure and digital transformation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"11755\" data-end=\"11900\">This semester is extremely important because cloud computing, blockchain, and big data are among the fastest-growing technology sectors globally.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11902\" data-end=\"11905\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12cwz3u\" data-start=\"11907\" data-end=\"11940\">Subjects Covered in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wp6bxe\" data-start=\"11942\" data-end=\"11969\">Blockchain Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"11970\" data-end=\"12086\">Students learn distributed ledger systems, blockchain architecture, smart contracts, and decentralized technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"r5e9wd\" data-start=\"12088\" data-end=\"12113\">IT Project Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"12114\" data-end=\"12215\">This subject teaches project planning, execution, monitoring, risk management, and team coordination.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qtp0dj\" data-start=\"12217\" data-end=\"12236\">Cloud Computing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"12237\" data-end=\"12342\">Students understand cloud deployment models, virtualization, cloud services, and scalable infrastructure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rdxio8\" data-start=\"12344\" data-end=\"12373\">Advanced Web Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"12374\" data-end=\"12442\">Advanced frameworks and modern web development concepts are covered.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5igl0s\" data-start=\"12444\" data-end=\"12466\">Big Data Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"12467\" data-end=\"12533\">Students learn large-scale data processing and analytical methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xg2x70\" data-start=\"12535\" data-end=\"12578\">Advanced Software Development Practices</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"12579\" data-end=\"12670\">Focus on DevOps, microservices, software delivery models, and modern development practices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"12672\" data-end=\"12675\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedej\" data-start=\"12677\" data-end=\"12710\">Skills Developed in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"12712\" data-end=\"12739\">Students gain expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"12741\" data-end=\"12946\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kf2mwq\" data-start=\"12741\" data-end=\"12761\">Blockchain systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h5kpud\" data-start=\"12762\" data-end=\"12779\">Cloud platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"68lbze\" data-start=\"12780\" data-end=\"12799\">Hadoop ecosystems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sezx7f\" data-start=\"12800\" data-end=\"12818\">DevOps practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l8yrhh\" data-start=\"12819\" data-end=\"12840\">Agile methodologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3mxeoj\" data-start=\"12841\" data-end=\"12852\">REST APIs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kjfnz\" data-start=\"12853\" data-end=\"12877\">Project implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f1f1eg\" data-start=\"12878\" data-end=\"12895\">Risk management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"99py6h\" data-start=\"12896\" data-end=\"12924\">Microservices architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lbqrj\" data-start=\"12925\" data-end=\"12946\">Big data processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"12948\" data-end=\"13003\">These are highly valuable skills for modern IT careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"13005\" data-end=\"13008\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7kliy3\" data-start=\"13010\" data-end=\"13049\">Certifications Offered in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"13051\" data-end=\"13190\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16zqvtx\" data-start=\"13051\" data-end=\"13070\">Blockchain Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13sy1nv\" data-start=\"13071\" data-end=\"13091\">DevOps Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6dohs8\" data-start=\"13092\" data-end=\"13118\">Agile Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gmag0k\" data-start=\"13119\" data-end=\"13138\">REST API Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14eqpp2\" data-start=\"13139\" data-end=\"13171\">Project Management Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c5h2rs\" data-start=\"13172\" data-end=\"13190\">SDLC Foundations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"13192\" data-end=\"13274\">These certifications strengthen professional portfolios and technical credibility.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"13276\" data-end=\"13279\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gwtn0g\" data-start=\"13281\" data-end=\"13342\">Semester 6: Artificial Intelligence, IoT &amp; Industry Project</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14olmdc\" data-start=\"13344\" data-end=\"13375\">Core Objective of Semester 6</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"13377\" data-end=\"13561\">The final semester focuses on advanced intelligent systems, machine learning implementation, software testing, data visualization, IoT technologies, and real-world project development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"13563\" data-end=\"13649\">This semester helps students transition from learners to industry-ready professionals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"13651\" data-end=\"13654\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12cwz3t\" data-start=\"13656\" data-end=\"13689\">Subjects Covered in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"khfv0v\" data-start=\"13691\" data-end=\"13739\">Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"13740\" data-end=\"13848\">Students learn machine learning algorithms, predictive modeling, feature engineering, and AI implementation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rxbtnw\" data-start=\"13850\" data-end=\"13872\">Data Visualization</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"13873\" data-end=\"13983\">Focus on converting raw data into meaningful visual insights using visualization tools and analytical methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9q7ni7\" data-start=\"13985\" data-end=\"14005\">Software Testing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"14006\" data-end=\"14108\">Students understand defect tracking, quality assurance, automation testing, and testing methodologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uy6ru0\" data-start=\"14110\" data-end=\"14138\">Internet of Things (IoT)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"14139\" data-end=\"14218\">Students learn smart devices, embedded systems, sensors, and IoT communication.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ydousz\" data-start=\"14220\" data-end=\"14231\">Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"14232\" data-end=\"14340\">Students work on industry-oriented projects integrating multiple technologies learned throughout the course.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"14342\" data-end=\"14345\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedeg\" data-start=\"14347\" data-end=\"14380\">Skills Developed in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"14382\" data-end=\"14412\">Students develop expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"14414\" data-end=\"14643\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t74zp\" data-start=\"14414\" data-end=\"14443\">Machine learning algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kxi37d\" data-start=\"14444\" data-end=\"14466\">Predictive analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u78spn\" data-start=\"14467\" data-end=\"14492\">Artificial intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jgp350\" data-start=\"14493\" data-end=\"14510\">IoT integration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4dm4gg\" data-start=\"14511\" data-end=\"14529\">Embedded systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"myn84l\" data-start=\"14530\" data-end=\"14558\">Software quality assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i9bgrm\" data-start=\"14559\" data-end=\"14579\">Data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"59elc5\" data-start=\"14580\" data-end=\"14601\">Feature engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"maqs1e\" data-start=\"14602\" data-end=\"14619\">Defect tracking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ccct11\" data-start=\"14620\" data-end=\"14643\">Testing methodologies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"14645\" data-end=\"14728\">These skills prepare students for advanced technical roles in AI-driven industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"14730\" data-end=\"14733\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7kliy0\" data-start=\"14735\" data-end=\"14774\">Certifications Offered in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"14776\" data-end=\"14932\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u5rt54\" data-start=\"14776\" data-end=\"14831\">Artificial Intelligence Foundations: Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bvav5b\" data-start=\"14832\" data-end=\"14862\">Machine Learning with Python</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edn4nw\" data-start=\"14863\" data-end=\"14891\">Tableau Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1maaxco\" data-start=\"14892\" data-end=\"14908\">AI Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w39h4o\" data-start=\"14909\" data-end=\"14932\">Learning Data Science</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"14934\" data-end=\"15015\">These certifications enhance AI and analytics career opportunities significantly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"15017\" data-end=\"15020\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1pvqk9t\" data-start=\"15022\" data-end=\"15072\">Complete Technology Stack Covered in the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"15074\" data-end=\"15126\">By the end of the course, students gain exposure to:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"15128\" data-end=\"15585\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"15128\" data-end=\"15166\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"15128\" data-end=\"15166\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"15128\" data-end=\"15146\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Technology Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"15146\" data-end=\"15166\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tools &amp; Concepts</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"15177\" data-end=\"15585\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"15177\" data-end=\"15210\">\r\n<td data-start=\"15177\" data-end=\"15191\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Programming</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"15191\" data-end=\"15210\" data-col-size=\"sm\">C, Python, Java</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"15211\" data-end=\"15256\">\r\n<td data-start=\"15211\" data-end=\"15221\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AI &amp; ML</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"15221\" data-end=\"15256\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Machine Learning, Generative AI</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"15257\" data-end=\"15298\">\r\n<td data-start=\"15257\" data-end=\"15269\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Databases</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"15269\" data-end=\"15298\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SQL, RDBMS, Advanced DBMS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"15299\" data-end=\"15343\">\r\n<td data-start=\"15299\" data-end=\"15317\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Web Development</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"15317\" data-end=\"15343\">HTML, JavaScript, APIs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"15344\" data-end=\"15386\">\r\n<td data-start=\"15344\" data-end=\"15362\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cloud Computing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"15362\" data-end=\"15386\">Cloud Infrastructure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"15387\" data-end=\"15433\">\r\n<td data-start=\"15387\" data-end=\"15403\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cybersecurity</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"15403\" data-end=\"15433\">Encryption, Authentication</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"15434\" data-end=\"15480\">\r\n<td data-start=\"15434\" data-end=\"15447\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Blockchain</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"15447\" data-end=\"15480\">Distributed Ledger Technology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"15481\" data-end=\"15519\">\r\n<td data-start=\"15481\" data-end=\"15492\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Big Data</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"15492\" data-end=\"15519\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Hadoop, Data Processing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"15520\" data-end=\"15549\">\r\n<td data-start=\"15520\" data-end=\"15529\" data-col-size=\"sm\">DevOps</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"15529\" data-end=\"15549\">Agile, SDLC, Git</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"15550\" data-end=\"15585\">\r\n<td data-start=\"15550\" data-end=\"15556\" data-col-size=\"sm\">IoT</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"15556\" data-end=\"15585\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Embedded Systems, Sensors</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 120000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(304, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 272, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 00:03:35', '2026-06-16 07:09:04', '<p data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"768\">The admission process for the Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is designed to be simple, structured, and fully student-friendly. It ensures that students can complete the entire admission journey smoothly without confusion or unnecessary complexity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"1075\">Unlike traditional offline admission systems that require multiple visits and paperwork, this modern admission process is streamlined and digital-first. Students can apply online, choose their program, complete enrollment, make payment, and secure their seat through a clearly defined step-by-step system.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1233\">This structured process ensures transparency, faster processing, and better accessibility for students from different locations and educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1238\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17qwtd3\" data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1273\">Step 1: Submit Application Form</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dm8pal\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1309\">Starting Your Admission Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1508\">The first and most important step in the admission process is submitting the online application form. This step marks the official beginning of the student&rsquo;s admission journey into the BCA program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1607\">Students are required to fill in basic academic, personal, and program-related details carefully.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1orrt9i\" data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1649\">Details Required in Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1699\">Students must provide the following information:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jejwk0\" data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1731\">Full name of the applicant</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uhbs3e\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1768\">Contact number and email address</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s8z1ko\" data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1804\">Personal identification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k2c4aj\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1858\">Academic qualification (10+2 or appearing status)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f7eccp\" data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1941\">Educational board information (CBSE, State Board, NIOS, ICSE, IB, IGCSE, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y7y4zs\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2011\">Preferred program selection (BCA or specialization if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2016\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d9gedl\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2058\">Importance of Application Submission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2101\">This step is extremely important because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2296\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16k9k2j\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2158\">It creates the student&rsquo;s official admission profile</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jeqdxq\" data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2200\">It initiates the verification process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o8lf7z\" data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2244\">It ensures eligibility is checked early</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x56fye\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2296\">It connects the student to the admission system</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2410\">Any incorrect or incomplete information can delay the admission process, so accuracy is essential at this stage.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2415\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gintl4\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2449\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yxgx1j\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2494\">Program Selection and Verification Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2695\">After submitting the application form, the next step is program enrollment. In this stage, students officially confirm their interest in the BCA program and proceed toward final admission processing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"igadrs\" data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2727\">What Happens in This Stage</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2949\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wx0eoc\" data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2761\">Selection of the BCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmsii4\" data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2811\">Verification of academic and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s69mqm\" data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2874\">Confirmation of eligibility based on submitted information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yb5a6o\" data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2915\">Final review of application accuracy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6lojmc\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2949\">Preparation for payment stage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2954\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2986\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3011\">This step ensures that:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3218\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m3y8gt\" data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3070\">Students are correctly mapped to the selected program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bauno8\" data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3120\">Academic details are validated before payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13vuke6\" data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3167\">Errors in application are identified early</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x5af6k\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3218\">Admission process moves in an organized manner</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3304\">It acts as a bridge between application submission and final admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3309\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1jgmfxh\" data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3345\">Step 3: Complete Payment Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"i8aam4\" data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3378\">Flexible Fee Payment Options</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3567\">Once enrollment is verified, students move to the payment stage. The BCA program offers flexible payment options to ensure financial accessibility for students from different backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3683\">This flexibility allows students to choose a payment method that suits their financial situation without pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3688\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3718\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t67n64\" data-start=\"3720\" data-end=\"3748\">1. One-Time Full Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3810\">Students can choose to pay the complete program fee at once.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12jh0uk\" data-start=\"3812\" data-end=\"3829\">Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"4019\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y54ays\" data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3878\">Full course fee paid in a single transaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"55bge1\" data-start=\"3879\" data-end=\"3922\">No future installment tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x272md\" data-start=\"3923\" data-end=\"3965\">Simple and hassle-free payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t8nh5b\" data-start=\"3966\" data-end=\"4019\">Suitable for students with full financial support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4034\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4159\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dlayby\" data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4071\">Eliminates future payment stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18o3dgm\" data-start=\"4072\" data-end=\"4101\">Simplifies fee management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m81e6g\" data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4159\">Ensures complete financial closure at admission stage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4161\" data-end=\"4164\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ano7td\" data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4200\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4306\">Students can also choose flexible monthly installment options through education loans or EMI facilities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12jh0uk\" data-start=\"4308\" data-end=\"4325\">Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4501\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oy3e3h\" data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4370\">Monthly installment-based payment system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ppsy3\" data-start=\"4371\" data-end=\"4420\">0% interest EMI options (subject to approval)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w203s0\" data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4464\">Loan assistance from financial partners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gd1xij\" data-start=\"4465\" data-end=\"4501\">Reduced upfront financial burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4503\" data-end=\"4506\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fxs65l\" data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4534\">Benefits of EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4536\" data-end=\"4722\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d6gt29\" data-start=\"4536\" data-end=\"4583\">Makes education affordable for all students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6trjj\" data-start=\"4584\" data-end=\"4641\">Allows students to start studies without full payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m8yeee\" data-start=\"4642\" data-end=\"4684\">Reduces financial pressure on families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ff8ou\" data-start=\"4685\" data-end=\"4722\">Enables better financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4724\" data-end=\"4844\">This option is especially useful for students who want to manage education expenses gradually while focusing on studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4846\" data-end=\"4849\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sfyihx\" data-start=\"4851\" data-end=\"4882\">Importance of Payment Stage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4884\" data-end=\"4933\">The payment stage is a crucial milestone because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4935\" data-end=\"5105\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nk5ihq\" data-start=\"4935\" data-end=\"4971\">It confirms financial commitment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187vgvi\" data-start=\"4972\" data-end=\"5016\">It moves admission toward final approval</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3hqtp3\" data-start=\"5017\" data-end=\"5062\">It activates further admission processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10zen7m\" data-start=\"5063\" data-end=\"5105\">It ensures seat allocation eligibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5107\" data-end=\"5182\">Without successful payment or loan approval, admission cannot be finalized.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5184\" data-end=\"5187\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7jvyu7\" data-start=\"5189\" data-end=\"5215\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2xiv4b\" data-start=\"5217\" data-end=\"5254\">Final Admission Confirmation Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5256\" data-end=\"5431\">The final step in the admission process is seat confirmation. Once the payment is completed or education loan/EMI is approved, the student&rsquo;s admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5433\" data-end=\"5436\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjl3k3\" data-start=\"5438\" data-end=\"5468\">What Happens After Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5470\" data-end=\"5498\">Once this step is completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5500\" data-end=\"5700\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkwzx8\" data-start=\"5500\" data-end=\"5537\">Admission is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c2mtr2\" data-start=\"5538\" data-end=\"5574\">Seat is reserved for the student</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ge4zfb\" data-start=\"5575\" data-end=\"5607\">Enrollment status is updated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cghf0q\" data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5659\">Student access to academic systems is activated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3dlx3\" data-start=\"5660\" data-end=\"5700\">Admission documentation is finalized</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5702\" data-end=\"5705\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2i4v2o\" data-start=\"5707\" data-end=\"5745\">Why Seat Confirmation is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5747\" data-end=\"5797\">Seat confirmation is the final stage that ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5799\" data-end=\"5980\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16nbfxh\" data-start=\"5799\" data-end=\"5852\">The student is officially part of the BCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xx8nus\" data-start=\"5853\" data-end=\"5890\">No seat reservation issues remain</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8kglo2\" data-start=\"5891\" data-end=\"5931\">Academic records are fully activated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"izd8pt\" data-start=\"5932\" data-end=\"5980\">The student can begin classes without delays</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5982\" data-end=\"6042\">Without this step, the admission process remains incomplete.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6044\" data-end=\"6047\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p1ofsx\" data-start=\"6049\" data-end=\"6085\">Complete Admission Process Summary</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6087\" data-end=\"6154\">To make the process easy to understand, here is a simple breakdown:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9rzptd\" data-start=\"6156\" data-end=\"6188\">Step 1: Submit Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6189\" data-end=\"6249\">Fill out the online form with personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bazspl\" data-start=\"6251\" data-end=\"6282\">Step 2: Enroll in Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6283\" data-end=\"6334\">Select BCA program and verify details for accuracy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kyof3i\" data-start=\"6336\" data-end=\"6366\">Step 3: Complete Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6367\" data-end=\"6435\">Choose one-time payment or EMI/loan option and complete fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"62gr72\" data-start=\"6437\" data-end=\"6462\">Step 4: Secure Seat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6463\" data-end=\"6520\">Receive final admission confirmation and seat allocation.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"873\">The eligibility criteria for a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program define the minimum academic qualification required for students to apply for admission. This step is extremely important because it ensures that students have the basic educational foundation needed to understand programming, computer fundamentals, and advanced technology concepts taught during the course.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"1202\">BCA is designed as an entry-level professional degree in computer applications, which means it is accessible to students from multiple academic backgrounds. The eligibility structure is kept flexible so that students from different boards and education systems can pursue careers in technology without unnecessary restrictions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1440\">This inclusiveness is one of the key reasons why BCA is one of the most popular undergraduate programs for students aiming to enter fields like software development, artificial intelligence, data science, cybersecurity, and IT services.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1445\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"lu44pk\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1498\">Basic Educational Qualification for BCA Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1651\">The primary requirement for admission into the BCA program is successful completion of the 10+2 (Higher Secondary) examination from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1omerho\" data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1684\">Core Eligibility Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1750\">A student must satisfy at least one of the following conditions:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1879\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nssjcd\" data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1830\">Must have <strong data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1795\">passed the 10+2 examination</strong> from a recognized board<br data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1822\"><strong data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1828\">OR</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1exmcd2\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1879\">Must be <strong data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1879\">appearing for the 10+2 examination</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1986\">This means both passed-out students and final-year school students are eligible to apply for the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"1991\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"110am8p\" data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2032\">Recognized Boards for BCA Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2302\">One of the most important strengths of this eligibility structure is its wide acceptance of different education boards. Students from national and international boards are all considered eligible if their qualification is recognized by the State or Central Government.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2307\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p5fv8t\" data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2335\">1. State Board Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2458\">Students who have completed their 10+2 education from any recognized State Board in India are eligible for BCA admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2662\">State Boards follow region-specific syllabi, but they are fully recognized for higher education admissions across India. Students from State Boards are equally eligible as students from national boards.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2667\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dktm32\" data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2694\">2. CBSE Board Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2797\">Students from the Central Board of Secondary Education (CBSE) are fully eligible for the BCA program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"3017\">CBSE is one of the most widely accepted education boards in India and provides a strong academic foundation in mathematics, science, and logical reasoning, which are essential for computer applications and programming.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3022\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17x1ja1\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3043\">3. NIOS Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3134\">Students from the National Institute of Open Schooling (NIOS) are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3291\">This is particularly important because it ensures equal opportunity for students who completed their education through open schooling or distance learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"adru7h\" data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3332\">Who benefits from NIOS eligibility?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3521\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zli347\" data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3380\">Students who studied through open schooling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jy5om3\" data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3428\">Working students completing education later</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bkjcdi\" data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3465\">Students who had academic breaks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pvc6v4\" data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3521\">Learners from non-traditional education backgrounds</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3626\">NIOS eligibility ensures that education flexibility does not become a barrier to entering the IT field.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3628\" data-end=\"3631\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"y30bsp\" data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3652\">4. ICSE Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3784\">Students who have completed their 10+2 from the Indian Certificate of Secondary Education (ICSE) board are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3997\">ICSE students often have strong English communication skills, analytical thinking ability, and conceptual understanding, which are highly useful in programming, software development, and technical communication.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4002\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"r24iix\" data-start=\"4004\" data-end=\"4051\">5. IB (International Baccalaureate) Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4053\" data-end=\"4168\">Students completing their higher secondary education from the International Baccalaureate (IB) system are eligible.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4170\" data-end=\"4374\">IB is internationally recognized and focuses heavily on research-based learning, analytical thinking, and problem-solving skills&mdash;qualities that align well with computer applications and modern IT careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4379\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gn7irg\" data-start=\"4381\" data-end=\"4401\">6. IGCSE Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4403\" data-end=\"4510\">Students from the International General Certificate of Secondary Education (IGCSE) board are also eligible.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4512\" data-end=\"4692\">IGCSE is globally recognized and provides strong academic grounding in mathematics, science, and logical reasoning, which are essential for coding and software development careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4694\" data-end=\"4697\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"134pbc9\" data-start=\"4699\" data-end=\"4755\">Eligibility for Students Appearing in 10+2 Examination</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4757\" data-end=\"4930\">One of the most student-friendly aspects of the BCA eligibility structure is that students who are currently appearing for their 10+2 examinations are also allowed to apply.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fipp12\" data-start=\"4932\" data-end=\"4975\">Appearing Students Eligibility Condition</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4977\" data-end=\"4994\">Students who are:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5078\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d5ta9d\" data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5030\">Currently studying in Class 12</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gp7nw2\" data-start=\"5031\" data-end=\"5078\">Appearing for final 10+2 board examinations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5080\" data-end=\"5145\">are eligible to apply for the BCA program on a provisional basis.</p>', '<p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"813\">The fee structure of a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program plays a crucial role in helping students and parents plan their academic journey effectively. A clear understanding of total fees, installment options, and additional charges ensures financial transparency and avoids unexpected expenses during the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"1138\">This BCA program is designed with a flexible and student-friendly fee structure, allowing learners from different financial backgrounds to choose a suitable payment method. Whether a student prefers paying in installments or making a one-time payment, multiple options are available to ensure accessibility and convenience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1291\">The program also includes separate charges for registration and examinations, which are standard components in most university-level academic programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1296\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rpalu4\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1321\">Total BCA Course Fees</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yx9wzi\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1346\">Complete Program Fee</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1374\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1374\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1364\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1374\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1410\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total BCA Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1422\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹150,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1619\">The total fee of ₹150,000 covers the complete academic program, including structured learning modules, curriculum delivery, and access to academic resources throughout the duration of the course.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1692\">This amount represents the core tuition fee for the entire BCA program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1697\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1bffc1j\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1738\">Flexible Payment Options for BCA Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1976\">One of the key advantages of this fee structure is flexibility. Students are not required to pay the entire amount at once unless they choose to do so. Instead, they can select from multiple payment modes based on financial convenience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"1981\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83is7d\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2008\">1. Yearly Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2079\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2035\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2035\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2025\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2035\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2079\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2079\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2059\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2079\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹50,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5aebbm\" data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2114\">Understanding the Yearly Plan</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2249\">In this option, the total program fee is divided into yearly installments. Students pay ₹50,000 each year during the course duration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15xlm0b\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2281\">Benefits of Yearly Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2472\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g7zk1q\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2325\">Easier financial planning for families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1axnroo\" data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2359\">Reduced frequency of payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jobbpe\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2419\">Suitable for students with stable annual income support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0fdnt\" data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2472\">Simplifies fee management over the course period</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2585\">This option is ideal for students who prefer structured yearly budgeting instead of frequent semester payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2590\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1minad7\" data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2624\">2. Semester-Wise Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2701\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2651\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2651\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2641\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2651\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2701\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2701\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2677\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2701\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹25,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xv2tom\" data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2738\">Understanding the Semester Plan</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2861\">The semester-wise payment option divides the total fee into smaller installments, making it more manageable for students.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lbyyin\" data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2895\">Benefits of Semester Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"3060\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djvlbw\" data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2939\">Lower financial burden per installment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1785r9v\" data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"2991\">Easier affordability for middle-income families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fu6w5c\" data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3023\">Better cash flow management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2cjd3e\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3060\">Flexibility in academic planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3160\">This is one of the most preferred payment methods because it reduces immediate financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3165\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yt3u32\" data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3201\">3. One-Time Full Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3266\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3228\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3228\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3218\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3228\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3266\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3266\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3254\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3254\" data-end=\"3266\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹150,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19lh2mc\" data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3302\">Understanding One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3402\">Students can choose to pay the entire course fee in a single transaction at the time of admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v322b1\" data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3436\">Benefits of One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3606\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"55bge1\" data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3481\">No future installment tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bquo5t\" data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3511\">Simplified fee management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"132appz\" data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3549\">Avoids future fee deadline stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ldht7l\" data-start=\"3550\" data-end=\"3606\">Suitable for students with full funding availability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3717\">This option is ideal for students who prefer completing financial commitments at the beginning of the course.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3722\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1euoihx\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3757\">Additional Fees for BCA Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3967\">Apart from the tuition fee, students are required to pay additional charges related to registration and examinations. These fees are standard academic charges applicable across most higher education programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3969\" data-end=\"3972\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"l6m2st\" data-start=\"3974\" data-end=\"4012\">Additional Fees for Indian Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4122\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4035\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4035\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4025\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4025\" data-end=\"4035\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4122\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4084\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4074\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4084\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4085\" data-end=\"4122\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4085\" data-end=\"4103\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4122\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4124\" data-end=\"4127\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"f1026c\" data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4160\">1. Registration Fee (India)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4162\" data-end=\"4232\">The registration fee is a one-time charge applicable during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17p4kli\" data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4265\">Purpose of Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4435\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dpq5xe\" data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4308\">Student enrollment in academic system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ea8uhq\" data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4349\">Creation of official student records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hg2ei0\" data-start=\"4350\" data-end=\"4392\">Access to academic portals and systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eptt33\" data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4435\">Administrative processing of admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4437\" data-end=\"4528\">Since this is a one-time payment, students do not need to pay it again in subsequent years.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4530\" data-end=\"4533\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1564crh\" data-start=\"4535\" data-end=\"4565\">2. Examination Fee (India)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4567\" data-end=\"4648\">The examination fee is charged annually and is required for academic assessments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16cnfi4\" data-start=\"4650\" data-end=\"4680\">Purpose of Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4682\" data-end=\"4837\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h1j2ey\" data-start=\"4682\" data-end=\"4718\">Conducting semester examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a963jr\" data-start=\"4719\" data-end=\"4755\">Evaluation and result processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18so5gc\" data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4801\">Question paper and exam system management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9y4mk\" data-start=\"4802\" data-end=\"4837\">Academic administration support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4839\" data-end=\"4924\">Students must ensure this fee is paid every year to remain eligible for examinations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4926\" data-end=\"4929\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"173n3up\" data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4975\">Additional Fees for SAARC Country Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4977\" data-end=\"5084\">Students from SAARC countries have a separate fee structure designed for international regional applicants.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5086\" data-end=\"5186\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5086\" data-end=\"5107\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5086\" data-end=\"5107\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5086\" data-end=\"5097\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5097\" data-end=\"5107\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5118\" data-end=\"5186\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5118\" data-end=\"5148\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5118\" data-end=\"5137\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5137\" data-end=\"5148\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5149\" data-end=\"5186\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5149\" data-end=\"5167\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5167\" data-end=\"5186\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5188\" data-end=\"5191\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12h5u5v\" data-start=\"5193\" data-end=\"5230\">Understanding SAARC Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5232\" data-end=\"5369\">The SAARC fee structure is designed to accommodate students from neighboring countries while maintaining standardized academic processes.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5371\" data-end=\"5571\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xif2cw\" data-start=\"5371\" data-end=\"5447\">Registration fee is higher due to international documentation processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10feb82\" data-start=\"5448\" data-end=\"5516\">Examination fee is slightly higher compared to domestic students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"phb5ho\" data-start=\"5517\" data-end=\"5571\">Ensures smooth academic integration across regions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5573\" data-end=\"5576\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"puptap\" data-start=\"5578\" data-end=\"5622\">Additional Fees for International Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5624\" data-end=\"5718\">For students applying from outside India and SAARC regions, fees are structured in US dollars.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5720\" data-end=\"5830\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5720\" data-end=\"5741\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5720\" data-end=\"5741\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5720\" data-end=\"5731\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5731\" data-end=\"5741\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5752\" data-end=\"5830\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5752\" data-end=\"5788\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5752\" data-end=\"5780\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5780\" data-end=\"5788\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5789\" data-end=\"5830\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5789\" data-end=\"5814\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5814\" data-end=\"5830\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"893\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) in Cyber Security and Artificial Intelligence is a highly advanced and industry-focused program designed for students who want to build careers in modern technology domains such as cybersecurity, ethical hacking, artificial intelligence, machine learning, blockchain security, cloud protection, and secure software development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"1132\">Unlike traditional computer science programs that focus mainly on general programming, this specialized BCA curriculum integrates real-world security systems, AI-driven threat detection, cryptography, and advanced computing technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1415\">The program is structured in a progressive learning model where students begin with programming and foundational computing concepts and gradually move toward advanced cybersecurity systems, AI-based security frameworks, penetration testing, and intelligent threat analysis systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1574\">This makes the program highly relevant in today&rsquo;s digital world where cyber threats, data breaches, and AI-driven security challenges are rapidly increasing.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1579\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hyfw7t\" data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1636\">Why This BCA Cyber Security &amp; AI Program is Important</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1889\">The demand for cybersecurity professionals and AI experts is increasing globally due to rising digital transformation. Almost every industry&mdash;banking, healthcare, IT, defense, e-commerce, and government systems&mdash;requires strong cybersecurity frameworks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1919\">This program is designed to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"2225\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4rhho\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1961\">Build strong programming foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6cv4e9\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1997\">Develop cybersecurity expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"njwo96\" data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2039\">Introduce AI-powered security systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19y3vt6\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2077\">Train students in ethical hacking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r02phe\" data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2127\">Strengthen network and data protection skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d7lodk\" data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2175\">Teach machine learning for threat detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jlhgfj\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2225\">Prepare students for global IT security roles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2349\">Students are trained not only in theoretical concepts but also in practical tools used in real cybersecurity environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2354\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ociteo\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2415\">Semester 1: Programming, Logic Building &amp; AI Introduction</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2434\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2585\">The first semester focuses on building strong programming logic, mathematical thinking, and introductory exposure to artificial intelligence systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2743\">This is the foundation stage where students learn how computers work, how algorithms are designed, and how programming is used to solve real-world problems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2748\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12cwz3y\" data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2783\">Subjects Covered in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vaosqc\" data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2796\">English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2911\">Improves communication skills, technical writing, and professional interaction abilities required in IT companies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5cl54f\" data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2944\">Fundamentals of Mathematics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"3051\">Builds logical reasoning, algebraic thinking, and mathematical modeling used in algorithms and AI systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d4mtri\" data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3080\">Problem Solving using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3193\">Introduces programming basics such as loops, conditions, functions, arrays, and logic building using C language.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5rc8r8\" data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3220\">Computer Architecture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3313\">Explains how computers process instructions, memory management, and system-level operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f55vj2\" data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3346\">Essentials of Generative AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3448\">Introduces AI concepts, machine learning basics, and generative AI applications in modern industries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13z5in5\" data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3481\">Problem Solving using C Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3550\">Practical coding sessions focused on implementing programming logic.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3555\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gveden\" data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3590\">Skills Developed in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3642\">Students develop core technical abilities such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3644\" data-end=\"3909\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"db6umo\" data-start=\"3644\" data-end=\"3667\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gpcjwl\" data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3696\">Programming fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jttlyt\" data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3717\">Algorithm design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e4ht0g\" data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3744\">Structured programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyz0gf\" data-start=\"3745\" data-end=\"3766\">Logical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sfeiyk\" data-start=\"3767\" data-end=\"3787\">Debugging skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vmb5f1\" data-start=\"3788\" data-end=\"3813\">Mathematical modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"issa6m\" data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3847\">Computer system understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h895uh\" data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3871\">Data representation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1witvm8\" data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3909\">Artificial intelligence awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3911\" data-end=\"3981\">These skills form the base for advanced cybersecurity and AI learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"3986\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e52\" data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"4019\">Certifications in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4247\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"104kjvr\" data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4062\">Programming Foundations: Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rh0lth\" data-start=\"4063\" data-end=\"4087\">C Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14uqrz\" data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4127\">Programming Foundations: Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l73on9\" data-start=\"4128\" data-end=\"4172\">Programming Foundations: Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199axno\" data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4210\">AI Foundations: Thinking Machines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1snw0vn\" data-start=\"4211\" data-end=\"4247\">AI Foundations: Machine Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4249\" data-end=\"4252\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"izwhxs\" data-start=\"4254\" data-end=\"4319\">Semester 2: Data Structures, Databases &amp; System Security Basics</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"4321\" data-end=\"4338\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4510\">This semester strengthens data handling, database management, and operating system fundamentals, which are essential for cybersecurity systems and secure data processing.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4512\" data-end=\"4515\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12cwz3x\" data-start=\"4517\" data-end=\"4550\">Subjects Covered in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sr0i3q\" data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4577\">Communicative English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4648\">Enhances technical communication and professional presentation skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"np08ta\" data-start=\"4650\" data-end=\"4670\">Operating System</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4671\" data-end=\"4757\">Covers process management, memory allocation, scheduling, and system-level operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m64tpx\" data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4786\">Data Structures using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4787\" data-end=\"4865\">Teaches stacks, queues, trees, and linked lists for efficient data management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1581opq\" data-start=\"4867\" data-end=\"4898\">Relational Database Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4899\" data-end=\"4969\">Introduces SQL, database design, normalization, and relational models.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yhpx33\" data-start=\"4971\" data-end=\"4994\">Data Structures Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4995\" data-end=\"5039\">Practical implementation of data structures.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fealwj\" data-start=\"5041\" data-end=\"5054\">RDBMS Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5055\" data-end=\"5101\">Hands-on SQL and database management practice.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5103\" data-end=\"5106\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedek\" data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5141\">Skills Developed in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5370\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p2ag98\" data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5177\">Data structures implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"okpz22\" data-start=\"5178\" data-end=\"5208\">Stack and queue operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aq4d1g\" data-start=\"5209\" data-end=\"5231\">Tree-based systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uaoedo\" data-start=\"5232\" data-end=\"5257\">SQL database handling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uioquq\" data-start=\"5258\" data-end=\"5286\">Database security basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rt7mst\" data-start=\"5287\" data-end=\"5317\">Operating system processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s8n96i\" data-start=\"5318\" data-end=\"5339\">Memory management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y6qw44\" data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5370\">Relational database design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5372\" data-end=\"5452\">These skills are critical for backend systems and cybersecurity data management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5454\" data-end=\"5457\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e51\" data-start=\"5459\" data-end=\"5490\">Certifications in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5492\" data-end=\"5683\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bs6ghk\" data-start=\"5492\" data-end=\"5518\">SQL Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e55t85\" data-start=\"5519\" data-end=\"5543\">Database Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l73on9\" data-start=\"5544\" data-end=\"5588\">Programming Foundations: Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mj2y5o\" data-start=\"5589\" data-end=\"5615\">Git Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hgrhyj\" data-start=\"5616\" data-end=\"5644\">Learning SQL Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hi8p2d\" data-start=\"5645\" data-end=\"5683\">Programming Foundations: Databases</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5685\" data-end=\"5688\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"h67dw7\" data-start=\"5690\" data-end=\"5745\">Semester 3: Python, AI Systems &amp; Software Engineering</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"5747\" data-end=\"5764\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5766\" data-end=\"5890\">This semester introduces Python programming, software engineering principles, algorithms, and network communication systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5892\" data-end=\"5984\">Python plays a crucial role in cybersecurity, AI development, automation, and data analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5986\" data-end=\"5989\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12cwz3w\" data-start=\"5991\" data-end=\"6024\">Subjects Covered in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"116sc7f\" data-start=\"6026\" data-end=\"6048\">Python Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6049\" data-end=\"6110\">Covers Python syntax, OOP concepts, libraries, and scripting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ec7haw\" data-start=\"6112\" data-end=\"6149\">Design and Analysis of Algorithms</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6150\" data-end=\"6227\">Focuses on optimizing performance and solving complex computational problems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tasahc\" data-start=\"6229\" data-end=\"6253\">Software Engineering</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6254\" data-end=\"6319\">Teaches software lifecycle, Agile development, and system design.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ah5kss\" data-start=\"6321\" data-end=\"6342\">Computer Networks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6343\" data-end=\"6421\">Covers communication protocols, networking systems, and internet architecture.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ubipe5\" data-start=\"6423\" data-end=\"6436\">ESG in IT</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6437\" data-end=\"6498\">Introduces environmental and ethical practices in IT systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xu3cck\" data-start=\"6500\" data-end=\"6526\">Python Programming Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6527\" data-end=\"6562\">Hands-on coding practice in Python.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ke407a\" data-start=\"6564\" data-end=\"6581\">Algorithm Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6582\" data-end=\"6618\">Real-world algorithm implementation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6620\" data-end=\"6623\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedel\" data-start=\"6625\" data-end=\"6658\">Skills Developed in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6660\" data-end=\"6884\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t12n5x\" data-start=\"6660\" data-end=\"6682\">Python programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sqinpf\" data-start=\"6683\" data-end=\"6714\">Object-oriented programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1zm1nn\" data-start=\"6715\" data-end=\"6734\">API development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l8yflv\" data-start=\"6735\" data-end=\"6756\">Agile methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lgxlv5\" data-start=\"6757\" data-end=\"6777\">Software testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dv2sc6\" data-start=\"6778\" data-end=\"6803\">Network communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"164618v\" data-start=\"6804\" data-end=\"6833\">Debugging and refactoring</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9evc2\" data-start=\"6834\" data-end=\"6856\">Data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zqb8y1\" data-start=\"6857\" data-end=\"6884\">Technical documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6886\" data-end=\"6889\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e50\" data-start=\"6891\" data-end=\"6922\">Certifications in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6924\" data-end=\"7184\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6bj2a\" data-start=\"6924\" data-end=\"6953\">Python Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rryhh9\" data-start=\"6954\" data-end=\"6995\">Python Data Structures and Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ppzwu\" data-start=\"6996\" data-end=\"7022\">Networking Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bzkwnq\" data-start=\"7023\" data-end=\"7044\">Agile Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hr6up7\" data-start=\"7045\" data-end=\"7067\">DevOps Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mj2y5o\" data-start=\"7068\" data-end=\"7094\">Git Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14hbo9g\" data-start=\"7095\" data-end=\"7123\">Data Science Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpgsp5\" data-start=\"7124\" data-end=\"7156\">Software Testing Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3jgmb\" data-start=\"7157\" data-end=\"7184\">Python for Data Science</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7186\" data-end=\"7189\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"lxpo4z\" data-start=\"7191\" data-end=\"7244\">Semester 4: Cybersecurity Fundamentals &amp; AI Systems</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"7246\" data-end=\"7263\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7265\" data-end=\"7382\">This semester introduces cybersecurity principles, secure software development, AI foundations, and web technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7384\" data-end=\"7387\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12cwz3v\" data-start=\"7389\" data-end=\"7422\">Subjects Covered in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mvwlhy\" data-start=\"7424\" data-end=\"7444\">Web Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7445\" data-end=\"7498\">Covers web development, frontend and backend systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1shzesj\" data-start=\"7500\" data-end=\"7520\">Java Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7521\" data-end=\"7599\">Introduces object-oriented programming and enterprise application development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fuxn2j\" data-start=\"7601\" data-end=\"7632\">Cyber Security Fundamentals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7633\" data-end=\"7702\">Covers encryption, authentication, cyber threats, and secure systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v7ng2p\" data-start=\"7704\" data-end=\"7744\">Artificial Intelligence Fundamentals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7745\" data-end=\"7816\">Introduces AI models, machine learning basics, and intelligent systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wd8pb8\" data-start=\"7818\" data-end=\"7845\">Quantitative Techniques</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7846\" data-end=\"7902\">Covers statistical analysis and decision-making methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ynkm9m\" data-start=\"7904\" data-end=\"7912\">Labs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7913\" data-end=\"7956\">Hands-on Java and web development practice.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7958\" data-end=\"7961\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedei\" data-start=\"7963\" data-end=\"7996\">Skills Developed in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7998\" data-end=\"8241\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vim0vw\" data-start=\"7998\" data-end=\"8024\">Secure web development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b37w8n\" data-start=\"8025\" data-end=\"8048\">Cryptography basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qq839c\" data-start=\"8049\" data-end=\"8069\">Network security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dja2ou\" data-start=\"8070\" data-end=\"8096\">Authentication systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19z45zz\" data-start=\"8097\" data-end=\"8124\">Secure coding practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wbs1da\" data-start=\"8125\" data-end=\"8151\">Vulnerability analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eij8dd\" data-start=\"8152\" data-end=\"8179\">AI system understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"172oaft\" data-start=\"8180\" data-end=\"8200\">Threat detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uv0rr1\" data-start=\"8201\" data-end=\"8220\">Risk assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dglxf1\" data-start=\"8221\" data-end=\"8241\">Java programming</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8243\" data-end=\"8246\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4z\" data-start=\"8248\" data-end=\"8279\">Certifications in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8281\" data-end=\"8433\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lkay1\" data-start=\"8281\" data-end=\"8310\">Cybersecurity Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efpi4t\" data-start=\"8311\" data-end=\"8331\">Java Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ghft9\" data-start=\"8332\" data-end=\"8364\">HTML &amp; JavaScript Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bapbrz\" data-start=\"8365\" data-end=\"8386\">Networking Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"172xx08\" data-start=\"8387\" data-end=\"8405\">AI Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ftzw0\" data-start=\"8406\" data-end=\"8433\">Machine Learning Basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8435\" data-end=\"8438\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1e9x8fw\" data-start=\"8440\" data-end=\"8499\">Semester 5: AI Security, Blockchain &amp; Threat Intelligence</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"8501\" data-end=\"8518\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8520\" data-end=\"8649\">This semester focuses on advanced cybersecurity systems, AI-driven threat detection, blockchain security, and cyber intelligence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8651\" data-end=\"8654\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12cwz3u\" data-start=\"8656\" data-end=\"8689\">Subjects Covered in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wp6bxe\" data-start=\"8691\" data-end=\"8718\">Blockchain Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8719\" data-end=\"8772\">Covers decentralized systems and blockchain security.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15o4mvp\" data-start=\"8774\" data-end=\"8813\">Machine Learning for Cyber Security</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8814\" data-end=\"8866\">Uses AI for threat prediction and anomaly detection.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1024m6\" data-start=\"8868\" data-end=\"8903\">Network Security &amp; Cryptography</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8904\" data-end=\"8962\">Focuses on encryption algorithms and secure communication.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3xcj8i\" data-start=\"8964\" data-end=\"8993\">Cyber Threat Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8994\" data-end=\"9035\">Analyzes cyber attacks and security data.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jq8lqv\" data-start=\"9037\" data-end=\"9067\">Generative AI for Security</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9068\" data-end=\"9129\">Introduces prompt engineering for cybersecurity applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xf39s4\" data-start=\"9131\" data-end=\"9164\">Advanced Software Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9165\" data-end=\"9219\">Covers secure DevOps and modern development practices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9221\" data-end=\"9224\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedej\" data-start=\"9226\" data-end=\"9259\">Skills Developed in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9261\" data-end=\"9496\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rkwmxd\" data-start=\"9261\" data-end=\"9293\">Threat intelligence analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ns39ys\" data-start=\"9294\" data-end=\"9327\">Machine learning for security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jemg20\" data-start=\"9328\" data-end=\"9351\">Intrusion detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zdx66e\" data-start=\"9352\" data-end=\"9373\">Malware detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18r2o7u\" data-start=\"9374\" data-end=\"9397\">Blockchain security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xey8qf\" data-start=\"9398\" data-end=\"9428\">AI-based threat prediction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qhjbi9\" data-start=\"9429\" data-end=\"9452\">Security automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bygqgr\" data-start=\"9453\" data-end=\"9478\">Cryptographic systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2mx1g\" data-start=\"9479\" data-end=\"9496\">Secure DevOps</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9498\" data-end=\"9501\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4y\" data-start=\"9503\" data-end=\"9534\">Certifications in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9536\" data-end=\"9668\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k56f6\" data-start=\"9536\" data-end=\"9560\">AI for Cybersecurity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9z0r39\" data-start=\"9561\" data-end=\"9582\">Blockchain Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hr6up7\" data-start=\"9583\" data-end=\"9605\">DevOps Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lzd7hp\" data-start=\"9606\" data-end=\"9639\">Machine Learning Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14hbo9g\" data-start=\"9640\" data-end=\"9668\">Data Science Foundations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9670\" data-end=\"9673\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hy6s7t\" data-start=\"9675\" data-end=\"9741\">Semester 6: Ethical Hacking, Deep Learning &amp; AI Security Systems</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"9743\" data-end=\"9760\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9762\" data-end=\"9905\">The final semester focuses on advanced cybersecurity practices, ethical hacking, penetration testing, AI governance, and deep learning systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9907\" data-end=\"9910\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12cwz3t\" data-start=\"9912\" data-end=\"9945\">Subjects Covered in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qpj4h0\" data-start=\"9947\" data-end=\"9983\">Deep Learning for Cyber Security</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9984\" data-end=\"10031\">Uses neural networks for security applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pwr8as\" data-start=\"10033\" data-end=\"10064\">NLP for Threat Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10065\" data-end=\"10122\">Analyzes cyber threats using natural language processing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ggjbcc\" data-start=\"10124\" data-end=\"10165\">Ethical Hacking &amp; Penetration Testing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10166\" data-end=\"10225\">Teaches real-world hacking techniques for security testing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1guc89c\" data-start=\"10227\" data-end=\"10262\">AI Ethics &amp; Security Governance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10263\" data-end=\"10312\">Focuses on responsible AI usage and data privacy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19kz0wv\" data-start=\"10314\" data-end=\"10331\">Final Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10332\" data-end=\"10384\">Industry-based cybersecurity or AI security project.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10386\" data-end=\"10389\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedeg\" data-start=\"10391\" data-end=\"10424\">Skills Developed in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10426\" data-end=\"10682\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yn10wo\" data-start=\"10426\" data-end=\"10456\">Ethical hacking techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1982100\" data-start=\"10457\" data-end=\"10486\">Penetration testing tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6nehhc\" data-start=\"10487\" data-end=\"10513\">Cyber attack detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5qv622\" data-start=\"10514\" data-end=\"10542\">Vulnerability assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1962zlb\" data-start=\"10543\" data-end=\"10573\">AI-driven security systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10sbbm7\" data-start=\"10574\" data-end=\"10607\">Threat intelligence platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w13gw\" data-start=\"10608\" data-end=\"10631\">Security governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2lgr02\" data-start=\"10632\" data-end=\"10657\">Cyber risk assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ceel10\" data-start=\"10658\" data-end=\"10682\">Deep learning models</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10684\" data-end=\"10687\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4x\" data-start=\"10689\" data-end=\"10720\">Certifications in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10722\" data-end=\"10885\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yt6ck6\" data-start=\"10722\" data-end=\"10756\">Penetration Testing Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dn5ie4\" data-start=\"10757\" data-end=\"10790\">Security Testing Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5l44zv\" data-start=\"10791\" data-end=\"10816\">Neural Networks in AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"akv64a\" data-start=\"10817\" data-end=\"10846\">Offensive Security Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rpcyz8\" data-start=\"10847\" data-end=\"10885\">Machine Learning Advanced Concepts</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 150000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(305, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 273, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 00:18:38', '2026-06-16 07:09:25', '<p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"788\">The admission process for the Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is designed to be simple, structured, and completely student-friendly. It allows applicants to complete their entire admission journey in a step-by-step digital format without any unnecessary complexity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"1098\">This structured process ensures transparency, quick processing, and easy accessibility for students from different academic backgrounds and locations. Whether a student is applying after completing 10+2 or while appearing for final examinations, the admission system is designed to support smooth onboarding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1246\">The entire process is divided into four major stages: application submission, program enrollment, payment completion, and final seat confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17qwtd3\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1286\">Step 1: Submit Application Form</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12f7zho\" data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1322\">Beginning the Admission Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1495\">The first step in the BCA admission process is filling out the online application form. This step officially starts the student&rsquo;s journey toward enrollment in the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1622\">Students are required to enter their basic personal, academic, and program-related details carefully in the application form.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1627\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dod3hn\" data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1672\">Information Required in Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1709\">Students typically need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"2043\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jejwk0\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1741\">Full name of the applicant</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t6aeea\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1790\">Contact details (mobile number and email ID)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcjsc9\" data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1852\">Academic qualification details (10+2 or appearing status)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gzzert\" data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1935\">Educational board information (CBSE, State Board, ICSE, NIOS, IB, IGCSE, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fgvesi\" data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1997\">Program selection details (BCA or related specialization)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jxj0ng\" data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2043\">Basic personal identification information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2048\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25y54a\" data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2089\">Importance of Application Submission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2142\">Submitting the application is important because it:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2330\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ynucg0\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2195\">Creates the student&rsquo;s official admission record</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9yxo5o\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2234\">Initiates eligibility verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"792ule\" data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2285\">Connects the student with the admission system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e8dzh7\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2330\">Starts the enrollment evaluation process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2444\">Any incorrect or incomplete information may delay the admission process, so accuracy is essential at this stage.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2449\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gintl4\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2483\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3my97u\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2526\">Program Selection &amp; Verification Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2682\">After submitting the application, students move to the enrollment stage. This step involves selecting the BCA program and verifying all submitted details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2798\">At this stage, the system reviews the student&rsquo;s eligibility and academic information before proceeding to payment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2803\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yzfqb1\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2833\">What Happens in This Step</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"3048\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wx0eoc\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2867\">Selection of the BCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2nnssn\" data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2922\">Verification of academic documents and eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yyu4ct\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2969\">Review of personal and educational details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n7czxl\" data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"3010\">Confirmation of application accuracy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1airpiq\" data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3048\">Preparation for fee payment stage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3053\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yqhnym\" data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3087\">Importance of Enrollment Step</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3135\">This step is critical because it ensures that:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3368\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j6r4sw\" data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3196\">Students are correctly assigned to the selected program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wxjpe0\" data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3259\">Academic details are validated before financial commitment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bgeb8s\" data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3305\">Errors or mismatches are identified early</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13xb9u\" data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3368\">Admission process moves in an organized and structured way</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3454\">It acts as a bridge between application submission and final admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3459\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1jgmfxh\" data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3495\">Step 3: Complete Payment Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"i8aam4\" data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3528\">Flexible Fee Payment Options</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3706\">Once enrollment is verified, students proceed to the payment stage. The BCA program provides flexible payment options to make education financially accessible for all students.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3827\">This flexibility allows students and families to choose a payment method based on their financial comfort and planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3832\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"r38xuy\" data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3862\">Available Payment Methods</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t67n64\" data-start=\"3864\" data-end=\"3892\">1. One-Time Full Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3894\" data-end=\"3988\">Students can choose to pay the entire course fee in a single payment at the time of admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12jh0uk\" data-start=\"3990\" data-end=\"4007\">Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4161\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fyffyd\" data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4033\">Full fee paid upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"55bge1\" data-start=\"4034\" data-end=\"4077\">No future installment tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lspsrq\" data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4110\">Simplified financial process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1temrqt\" data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4161\">Immediate confirmation of financial commitment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"4163\" data-end=\"4176\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4306\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wyrm8y\" data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4208\">No recurring payment stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tr9su6\" data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4235\">Easy financial closure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1etbmga\" data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4274\">Suitable for fully funded students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wj5nlp\" data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4306\">Faster admission processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4308\" data-end=\"4311\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ano7td\" data-start=\"4313\" data-end=\"4347\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4349\" data-end=\"4442\">Students can also choose installment-based payment through education loans or EMI facilities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12jh0uk\" data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"4461\">Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"4639\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q8mr0n\" data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"4500\">Monthly installment payment option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cf7xct\" data-start=\"4501\" data-end=\"4558\">0% interest EMI (subject to approval and eligibility)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ylpgrq\" data-start=\"4559\" data-end=\"4602\">Financial support from lending partners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gd1xij\" data-start=\"4603\" data-end=\"4639\">Reduced upfront financial burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4641\" data-end=\"4644\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fxs65l\" data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4672\">Benefits of EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4674\" data-end=\"4857\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ht7sqh\" data-start=\"4674\" data-end=\"4716\">Makes higher education more accessible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vikkm\" data-start=\"4717\" data-end=\"4757\">Reduces immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6trjj\" data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4815\">Allows students to start studies without full payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19poudl\" data-start=\"4816\" data-end=\"4857\">Supports long-term financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4859\" data-end=\"4960\">This option is especially helpful for students who want to manage their education expenses gradually.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4962\" data-end=\"4965\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mbgkrq\" data-start=\"4967\" data-end=\"4997\">Importance of Payment Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4999\" data-end=\"5039\">The payment stage is crucial because it:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5041\" data-end=\"5203\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11shd4z\" data-start=\"5041\" data-end=\"5074\">Confirms financial commitment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v31wg\" data-start=\"5075\" data-end=\"5109\">Activates admission processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1szvamf\" data-start=\"5110\" data-end=\"5156\">Moves student toward final seat allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rotjuc\" data-start=\"5157\" data-end=\"5203\">Ensures eligibility for final confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5205\" data-end=\"5295\">Without successful payment or loan approval, the admission process cannot proceed further.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5297\" data-end=\"5300\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7jvyu7\" data-start=\"5302\" data-end=\"5328\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2xiv4b\" data-start=\"5330\" data-end=\"5367\">Final Admission Confirmation Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5369\" data-end=\"5560\">The final step in the admission process is seat confirmation. Once the payment is successfully completed or an education loan/EMI is approved, the student&rsquo;s admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5562\" data-end=\"5565\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"5567\" data-end=\"5596\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5598\" data-end=\"5625\">After completing this step:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5627\" data-end=\"5816\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkwzx8\" data-start=\"5627\" data-end=\"5664\">Admission is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c2mtr2\" data-start=\"5665\" data-end=\"5701\">Seat is reserved for the student</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ge4zfb\" data-start=\"5702\" data-end=\"5734\">Enrollment status is updated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4i48z\" data-start=\"5735\" data-end=\"5778\">Access to academic systems is activated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cg0gqd\" data-start=\"5779\" data-end=\"5816\">Admission documents are finalized</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5818\" data-end=\"5821\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"727l4k\" data-start=\"5823\" data-end=\"5857\">Importance of Seat Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5859\" data-end=\"5934\">Seat confirmation is the final and most important stage because it ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5936\" data-end=\"6125\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ogcywi\" data-start=\"5936\" data-end=\"5989\">Student is officially enrolled in the BCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w8tvso\" data-start=\"5990\" data-end=\"6036\">No uncertainty remains regarding admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dlv8g8\" data-start=\"6037\" data-end=\"6082\">Academic participation can begin smoothly</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8fpm2l\" data-start=\"6083\" data-end=\"6125\">Seat allocation is secured permanently</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6127\" data-end=\"6187\">Without this step, the admission process remains incomplete.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6189\" data-end=\"6192\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p1ofsx\" data-start=\"6194\" data-end=\"6230\">Complete Admission Process Summary</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6232\" data-end=\"6283\">To simplify the process, here is a clear breakdown:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9rzptd\" data-start=\"6285\" data-end=\"6317\">Step 1: Submit Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6318\" data-end=\"6378\">Fill out the online form with personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bazspl\" data-start=\"6380\" data-end=\"6411\">Step 2: Enroll in Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6412\" data-end=\"6454\">Select BCA program and verify all details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kyof3i\" data-start=\"6456\" data-end=\"6486\">Step 3: Complete Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6487\" data-end=\"6555\">Choose one-time payment or EMI/loan option and complete fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"62gr72\" data-start=\"6557\" data-end=\"6582\">Step 4: Secure Seat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6583\" data-end=\"6636\">Receive final confirmation and secure admission seat.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"859\">The eligibility criteria for the Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program define the academic qualifications and conditions required for students to apply for admission. These requirements ensure that students entering the program have the necessary foundational knowledge to successfully understand programming, computer systems, and advanced IT concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1138\">BCA is one of the most flexible undergraduate programs in the field of computer applications. It is designed in such a way that students from different educational backgrounds can apply, provided they have completed or are appearing for their higher secondary education (10+2).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1283\">This inclusiveness makes BCA an ideal choice for students who want to enter the IT and software industry without restrictive academic barriers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1288\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"eqzgb8\" data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1336\">Basic Academic Requirement for BCA Admission</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ndwnwr\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1371\">Minimum Qualification Required</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1468\">To be eligible for admission into the BCA program, a student must meet the following condition:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cy3fxp\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1548\">Must have passed the <strong data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1513\">10+2 examination</strong> from a recognized board<br data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1540\"><strong data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1546\">OR</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12njkx6\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1607\">Must be <strong data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1607\">currently appearing for the 10+2 examination</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1747\">This means students who have completed Class 12 as well as those who are still in their final year of schooling can apply for the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1752\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"110am8p\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1793\">Recognized Boards for BCA Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"2039\">One of the most important aspects of BCA eligibility is that it accepts multiple recognized education boards. This ensures that students from different academic systems have equal opportunity to pursue higher education in computer applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2044\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ppm60i\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2069\">State Board Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2185\">Students who have completed their 10+2 education from any recognized State Board are fully eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2381\">State Boards are widely accepted across India and provide a strong academic foundation in core subjects. Students from these boards are considered equally eligible as any other recognized board.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2386\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xyhe0j\" data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2434\">CBSE (Central Board of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2494\">Students from CBSE are fully eligible for the BCA program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2725\">CBSE is one of the most structured and widely accepted boards in India. It provides strong training in mathematics, logical reasoning, and science-based subjects, which are highly useful for programming and computer applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2730\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b0ffe9\" data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2778\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2834\">Students from NIOS are also eligible to apply for BCA.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2951\">NIOS is an open schooling system that provides flexibility for students who are unable to attend regular schooling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"adru7h\" data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2992\">Who benefits from NIOS eligibility?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3168\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15yr46x\" data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3038\">Students from open schooling backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jy5om3\" data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3086\">Working students completing education later</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bkjcdi\" data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3123\">Students who had academic breaks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6r3rb\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3168\">Learners from flexible education systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3170\" data-end=\"3253\">This ensures equal opportunity for all learners regardless of their education path.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3258\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n4i1v5\" data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3311\">ICSE (Indian Certificate of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3389\">Students who have completed their 10+2 from ICSE are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3555\">ICSE students generally have strong communication skills and conceptual clarity, which are beneficial for coding, software development, and technical understanding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3560\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x008qw\" data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3597\">IB (International Baccalaureate)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3644\">Students from the IB board are also eligible.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3827\">IB is internationally recognized and focuses on research-based learning, analytical thinking, and problem-solving skills, which align well with computer applications and IT careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3832\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tkcnz\" data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3901\">IGCSE (International General Certificate of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3903\" data-end=\"3954\">Students from IGCSE are eligible for BCA admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"4120\">IGCSE is globally recognized and provides strong academic exposure in mathematics, science, and logical reasoning, making it suitable for technology-based programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4125\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"134pbc9\" data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4183\">Eligibility for Students Appearing in 10+2 Examination</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1nr201x\" data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4231\">Important Provision for Final-Year Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4233\" data-end=\"4370\">Students who are currently in Class 12 or are appearing for their 10+2 final examinations are also eligible to apply for the BCA program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4499\">This is an important flexibility feature that allows students to secure admission in advance without waiting for final results.</p>', '<p data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"806\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) fee structure is designed to provide students with a clear, flexible, and transparent understanding of their complete academic financial requirements. A well-structured fee system helps students and parents plan education expenses in advance without confusion or hidden cost uncertainty.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"1105\">This BCA program offers multiple payment options including semester-wise, yearly, and one-time payment plans, making it accessible for students from different financial backgrounds. In addition, separate registration and examination fees are applicable depending on the student&rsquo;s country category.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1295\">Understanding the full fee structure is essential because many students only focus on tuition fees and overlook additional academic charges such as examination fees and registration costs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1300\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rpalu4\" data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1325\">Total BCA Course Fees</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vidkoj\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1351\">Complete Program Cost</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1369\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1379\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1415\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total BCA Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1427\">₹150,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1638\">The total fee of ₹150,000 represents the complete tuition cost of the BCA program. This covers the academic curriculum, structured learning modules, and program delivery across the full duration of the course.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1801\">However, students should also consider additional academic charges such as registration and examination fees, which are mandatory and separate from tuition fees.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1806\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1bffc1j\" data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1847\">Flexible Payment Options for BCA Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"2040\">To make higher education more accessible, the BCA program provides flexible payment structures. Students can choose a payment method based on their financial comfort and planning preferences.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2045\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dtnkqh\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2074\">1. Yearly Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2101\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2101\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2145\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹50,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3ze0g2\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2179\">Understanding Yearly Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2312\">In this method, the total fee is divided into three yearly payments. Students pay ₹50,000 per year throughout the program duration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15xlm0b\" data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2344\">Benefits of Yearly Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2496\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g7zk1q\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2388\">Easier financial planning for families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6suuq\" data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2418\">Reduced payment frequency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jlcedq\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2455\">Suitable for long-term budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9gfnk8\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2496\">Less administrative payment tracking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2618\">This option is ideal for students who prefer structured yearly financial planning instead of frequent semester payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2623\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1z9n63\" data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2659\">2. Semester-Wise Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2736\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2686\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2686\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2676\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2686\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2736\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2736\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2712\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2736\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹25,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xzc3ti\" data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2772\">Understanding Semester Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2915\">The semester-wise option divides the total fee into smaller installments, making it more manageable for students who prefer gradual payments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1inq21m\" data-start=\"2917\" data-end=\"2954\">Benefits of Semester-Wise Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"3108\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djvlbw\" data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2998\">Lower financial burden per installment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpci95\" data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3036\">Better affordability for families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y9112x\" data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3068\">Easier cash flow management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"526j3r\" data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3108\">Flexible academic payment structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3201\">This is one of the most preferred payment options due to its affordability and flexibility.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3206\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yt3u32\" data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3242\">3. One-Time Full Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3311\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3269\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3269\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3259\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3269\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3311\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3311\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3299\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3311\">₹150,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19lh2mc\" data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3347\">Understanding One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3444\">Students can choose to pay the entire program fee in a single payment at the time of admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v322b1\" data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3478\">Benefits of One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3629\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7nnhg0\" data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3519\">No future payment tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"917kpq\" data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3555\">Simplified financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvjouc\" data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3588\">Avoids installment deadlines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ycgghe\" data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3629\">Convenient for fully funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3631\" data-end=\"3742\">This option is suitable for students who want to complete financial obligations at the beginning of the course.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3744\" data-end=\"3747\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1euoihx\" data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3782\">Additional Fees for BCA Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3784\" data-end=\"3986\">Apart from the tuition fee, students are required to pay additional charges for registration and examinations. These fees are standard academic components and apply across all higher education programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"3991\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qqn3gu\" data-start=\"3993\" data-end=\"4030\">Additional Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4140\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4053\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4053\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4043\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4053\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4140\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4102\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4092\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4102\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4140\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4121\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4121\" data-end=\"4140\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4142\" data-end=\"4145\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1opp6jc\" data-start=\"4147\" data-end=\"4174\">Registration Fee (India)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4245\">The registration fee is a one-time charge collected during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17p4kli\" data-start=\"4247\" data-end=\"4278\">Purpose of Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4446\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dpq5xe\" data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4321\">Student enrollment in academic system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvgloy\" data-start=\"4322\" data-end=\"4363\">Creation of official academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qke0ex\" data-start=\"4364\" data-end=\"4406\">Access to learning portals and systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fb82ye\" data-start=\"4407\" data-end=\"4446\">Administrative admission processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4521\">Since it is a one-time payment, it is not required again in future years.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"4526\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mswdcy\" data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4554\">Examination Fee (India)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4653\">The examination fee is charged annually and is required for appearing in university examinations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16cnfi4\" data-start=\"4655\" data-end=\"4685\">Purpose of Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4687\" data-end=\"4814\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h1j2ey\" data-start=\"4687\" data-end=\"4723\">Conducting semester examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cd7z4j\" data-start=\"4724\" data-end=\"4756\">Paper evaluation and grading</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xrnz0q\" data-start=\"4757\" data-end=\"4778\">Result processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9y4mk\" data-start=\"4779\" data-end=\"4814\">Academic administration support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4816\" data-end=\"4890\">Students must pay this fee every year to remain eligible for examinations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4892\" data-end=\"4895\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1b3aond\" data-start=\"4897\" data-end=\"4933\">Additional Fees for SAARC Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4935\" data-end=\"5042\">Students from SAARC countries have a separate fee structure designed for regional international applicants.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5144\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5065\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5065\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5055\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5055\" data-end=\"5065\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5076\" data-end=\"5144\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5076\" data-end=\"5106\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5076\" data-end=\"5095\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5095\" data-end=\"5106\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5107\" data-end=\"5144\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5107\" data-end=\"5125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5125\" data-end=\"5144\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5146\" data-end=\"5149\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"sqvnlc\" data-start=\"5151\" data-end=\"5187\">Understanding SAARC Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5189\" data-end=\"5314\">This structure is designed to support students from neighboring countries while maintaining standardized academic processing.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5316\" data-end=\"5467\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b0lv88\" data-start=\"5316\" data-end=\"5375\">Higher registration fee due to international processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ac18d\" data-start=\"5376\" data-end=\"5414\">Slightly increased examination fee</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k4z70n\" data-start=\"5415\" data-end=\"5467\">Ensures smooth cross-border academic integration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5469\" data-end=\"5472\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"puptap\" data-start=\"5474\" data-end=\"5518\">Additional Fees for International Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5520\" data-end=\"5600\">For students outside India and SAARC regions, fees are structured in US dollars.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5602\" data-end=\"5712\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5602\" data-end=\"5623\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5602\" data-end=\"5623\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5602\" data-end=\"5613\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5613\" data-end=\"5623\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5712\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5670\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5662\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5662\" data-end=\"5670\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5671\" data-end=\"5712\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5671\" data-end=\"5696\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5696\" data-end=\"5712\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"887\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) in Data Science and Artificial Intelligence is a highly advanced undergraduate program designed for students who want to build careers in modern data-driven technologies such as machine learning, artificial intelligence, big data analytics, cloud computing, predictive modeling, and intelligent systems development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"1253\">This program is structured to provide a strong balance between programming fundamentals, mathematical reasoning, data handling, and advanced AI technologies. It is specifically designed for students who want to move beyond basic computer applications and enter high-demand fields like data science engineering, AI development, and analytics-driven decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1526\">The curriculum follows a progressive learning approach where students begin with programming fundamentals and gradually move toward advanced machine learning models, deep learning systems, natural language processing, blockchain technologies, and AI-powered applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1531\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"qfiqy0\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1582\">Why BCA in Data Science &amp; AI is Highly Valuable</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1840\">The demand for data science and AI professionals is increasing rapidly across industries such as healthcare, finance, e-commerce, education, cybersecurity, and government systems. Every organization today depends on data for decision-making and automation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1870\">This program helps students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"2278\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4rhho\" data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1912\">Build strong programming foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"489t80\" data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1960\">Understand real-world data handling systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rye3r\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2003\">Develop machine learning and AI models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"121n278\" data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2044\">Learn big data processing techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jce6fj\" data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2085\">Work on predictive analytics systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"60a81k\" data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2141\">Gain expertise in deep learning and neural networks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wq2akf\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2192\">Understand data visualization and storytelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dxhthy\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2237\">Learn blockchain and distributed systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ai6jle\" data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2278\">Prepare for high-paying tech careers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2402\">Unlike traditional computer courses, this program focuses heavily on real-world data applications and AI-driven solutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2407\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7629ho\" data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2464\">Semester 1: Programming Foundations &amp; AI Introduction</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2483\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2651\">The first semester focuses on building logical thinking, programming fundamentals, mathematical reasoning, and basic understanding of artificial intelligence systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2783\">This is the foundation stage where students learn how computers process logic, execute programs, and solve computational problems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2788\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1r\" data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2822\">Courses Covered in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vaosqc\" data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2835\">English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2956\">Develops communication skills, technical writing ability, and professional interaction skills required in IT industries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5cl54f\" data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2989\">Fundamentals of Mathematics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3102\">Builds logical reasoning, algebraic understanding, and mathematical modeling used in programming and AI systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d4mtri\" data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3131\">Problem Solving using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3225\">Introduces programming concepts such as loops, functions, arrays, and structured programming.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5rc8r8\" data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3252\">Computer Architecture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3345\">Explains how computer systems work internally including memory, CPU, and processing systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f55vj2\" data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3378\">Essentials of Generative AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3459\">Introduces AI concepts, machine learning basics, and generative AI applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13z5in5\" data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3492\">Problem Solving using C Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3493\" data-end=\"3554\">Practical coding sessions for real-time programming practice.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3559\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gveden\" data-start=\"3561\" data-end=\"3594\">Skills Developed in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3873\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"db6umo\" data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3619\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gpcjwl\" data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3648\">Programming fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ijlu5w\" data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3674\">Algorithm development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e4ht0g\" data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3701\">Structured programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyz0gf\" data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3723\">Logical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jl9g41\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3748\">Debugging techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vmb5f1\" data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3774\">Mathematical modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vub2wu\" data-start=\"3775\" data-end=\"3814\">Computer architecture understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h895uh\" data-start=\"3815\" data-end=\"3838\">Data representation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19k5mhe\" data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3873\">Artificial intelligence basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3878\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e52\" data-start=\"3880\" data-end=\"3911\">Certifications in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"4121\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"104kjvr\" data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"3954\">Programming Foundations: Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rh0lth\" data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"3979\">C Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14uqrz\" data-start=\"3980\" data-end=\"4019\">Programming Foundations: Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jekct3\" data-start=\"4020\" data-end=\"4046\">Data Structures Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199axno\" data-start=\"4047\" data-end=\"4084\">AI Foundations: Thinking Machines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1snw0vn\" data-start=\"4085\" data-end=\"4121\">AI Foundations: Machine Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4123\" data-end=\"4126\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"uh2phz\" data-start=\"4128\" data-end=\"4189\">Semester 2: Data Structures, Databases &amp; System Foundations</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"4191\" data-end=\"4208\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4353\">This semester focuses on data organization, database systems, and operating systems which are essential for data science and analytics systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4358\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1o\" data-start=\"4360\" data-end=\"4392\">Courses Covered in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sr0i3q\" data-start=\"4394\" data-end=\"4419\">Communicative English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4420\" data-end=\"4485\">Improves technical communication and professional writing skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"np08ta\" data-start=\"4487\" data-end=\"4507\">Operating System</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4580\">Covers process management, memory handling, and system-level operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m64tpx\" data-start=\"4582\" data-end=\"4609\">Data Structures using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4610\" data-end=\"4668\">Teaches stacks, queues, trees, and linked list structures.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1581opq\" data-start=\"4670\" data-end=\"4701\">Relational Database Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4702\" data-end=\"4757\">Introduces SQL, database design, and relational models.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yhpx33\" data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4782\">Data Structures Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4826\">Hands-on implementation of data structures.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fealwj\" data-start=\"4828\" data-end=\"4841\">RDBMS Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4842\" data-end=\"4879\">Practical SQL and database exercises.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4881\" data-end=\"4884\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedek\" data-start=\"4886\" data-end=\"4919\">Skills Developed in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4921\" data-end=\"5101\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p2ag98\" data-start=\"4921\" data-end=\"4955\">Data structures implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uaoedo\" data-start=\"4956\" data-end=\"4981\">SQL database handling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r1zcbz\" data-start=\"4982\" data-end=\"5011\">Tree and graph structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13xezb3\" data-start=\"5012\" data-end=\"5031\">Database design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7p0jkg\" data-start=\"5032\" data-end=\"5054\">Process management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s8n96i\" data-start=\"5055\" data-end=\"5076\">Memory management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"srukhz\" data-start=\"5077\" data-end=\"5101\">Data security basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5103\" data-end=\"5106\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e51\" data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5139\">Certifications in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5141\" data-end=\"5315\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bs6ghk\" data-start=\"5141\" data-end=\"5167\">SQL Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e55t85\" data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5192\">Database Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l73on9\" data-start=\"5193\" data-end=\"5237\">Programming Foundations: Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mj2y5o\" data-start=\"5238\" data-end=\"5264\">Git Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hgrhyj\" data-start=\"5265\" data-end=\"5293\">Learning SQL Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ardiqm\" data-start=\"5294\" data-end=\"5315\">Database Concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5317\" data-end=\"5320\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"i6umj9\" data-start=\"5322\" data-end=\"5377\">Semester 3: Python, Algorithms &amp; Software Engineering</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"5379\" data-end=\"5396\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5518\">This semester introduces Python programming, algorithm design, software engineering principles, and computer networking.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5520\" data-end=\"5598\">Python plays a key role in data science, machine learning, and AI development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5600\" data-end=\"5603\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1p\" data-start=\"5605\" data-end=\"5637\">Courses Covered in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"116sc7f\" data-start=\"5639\" data-end=\"5661\">Python Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5662\" data-end=\"5727\">Covers Python syntax, object-oriented programming, and libraries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ec7haw\" data-start=\"5729\" data-end=\"5766\">Design and Analysis of Algorithms</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5767\" data-end=\"5827\">Focuses on algorithm efficiency and optimization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tasahc\" data-start=\"5829\" data-end=\"5853\">Software Engineering</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5854\" data-end=\"5918\">Teaches SDLC, Agile development, and software design principles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ah5kss\" data-start=\"5920\" data-end=\"5941\">Computer Networks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5942\" data-end=\"6000\">Introduces networking systems and communication protocols.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ubipe5\" data-start=\"6002\" data-end=\"6015\">ESG in IT</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6016\" data-end=\"6074\">Focuses on environmental and ethical technology practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ynkm9m\" data-start=\"6076\" data-end=\"6084\">Labs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6085\" data-end=\"6130\">Python and algorithm implementation practice.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6132\" data-end=\"6135\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedel\" data-start=\"6137\" data-end=\"6170\">Skills Developed in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6172\" data-end=\"6370\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t12n5x\" data-start=\"6172\" data-end=\"6194\">Python programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sqinpf\" data-start=\"6195\" data-end=\"6226\">Object-oriented programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1zm1nn\" data-start=\"6227\" data-end=\"6246\">API development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l8yflv\" data-start=\"6247\" data-end=\"6268\">Agile methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lgxlv5\" data-start=\"6269\" data-end=\"6289\">Software testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"164618v\" data-start=\"6290\" data-end=\"6319\">Debugging and refactoring</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9evc2\" data-start=\"6320\" data-end=\"6342\">Data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zqb8y1\" data-start=\"6343\" data-end=\"6370\">Technical documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6375\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e50\" data-start=\"6377\" data-end=\"6408\">Certifications in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6410\" data-end=\"6680\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6bj2a\" data-start=\"6410\" data-end=\"6439\">Python Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vbbz0a\" data-start=\"6440\" data-end=\"6468\">Data Science with Python</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ftzw0\" data-start=\"6469\" data-end=\"6496\">Machine Learning Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ppzwu\" data-start=\"6497\" data-end=\"6523\">Networking Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hr6up7\" data-start=\"6524\" data-end=\"6546\">DevOps Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wsgf25\" data-start=\"6547\" data-end=\"6568\">Agile Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mj2y5o\" data-start=\"6569\" data-end=\"6595\">Git Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpgsp5\" data-start=\"6596\" data-end=\"6628\">Software Testing Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gfvbko\" data-start=\"6629\" data-end=\"6658\">Data Science Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rhunr4\" data-start=\"6659\" data-end=\"6680\">Python Algorithms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6682\" data-end=\"6685\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19kddbh\" data-start=\"6687\" data-end=\"6744\">Semester 4: Data Science Foundations &amp; Machine Learning</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"6746\" data-end=\"6763\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6765\" data-end=\"6880\">This semester focuses on data science, machine learning fundamentals, data visualization, and statistical analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6882\" data-end=\"6885\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1m\" data-start=\"6887\" data-end=\"6919\">Courses Covered in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mvwlhy\" data-start=\"6921\" data-end=\"6941\">Web Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6942\" data-end=\"6990\">HTML, CSS, JavaScript for basic web development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1shzesj\" data-start=\"6992\" data-end=\"7012\">Java Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7013\" data-end=\"7068\">Object-oriented programming and enterprise development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j8e4gj\" data-start=\"7070\" data-end=\"7101\">Foundations of Data Science</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7102\" data-end=\"7164\">Introduction to data collection, preprocessing, and analytics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fw7yl0\" data-start=\"7166\" data-end=\"7203\">Data Management and Visualization</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7204\" data-end=\"7266\">Covers data cleaning, visualization, and reporting techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wd8pb8\" data-start=\"7268\" data-end=\"7295\">Quantitative Techniques</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7296\" data-end=\"7334\">Statistical methods for data analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7336\" data-end=\"7339\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedei\" data-start=\"7341\" data-end=\"7374\">Skills Developed in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7376\" data-end=\"7567\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"obneoe\" data-start=\"7376\" data-end=\"7395\">Data collection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rd865w\" data-start=\"7396\" data-end=\"7418\">Data preprocessing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jpbots\" data-start=\"7419\" data-end=\"7446\">Machine learning basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p7xbpd\" data-start=\"7447\" data-end=\"7471\">Statistical analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9evc2\" data-start=\"7472\" data-end=\"7494\">Data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gqmmq4\" data-start=\"7495\" data-end=\"7511\">SQL querying</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b1f1c5\" data-start=\"7512\" data-end=\"7535\">Feature engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o8v98g\" data-start=\"7536\" data-end=\"7567\">Data-driven decision making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7569\" data-end=\"7572\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4z\" data-start=\"7574\" data-end=\"7605\">Certifications in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7607\" data-end=\"7881\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ym05s1\" data-start=\"7607\" data-end=\"7639\">Machine Learning Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6xg4y3\" data-start=\"7640\" data-end=\"7669\">Data Visualization Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3jgmb\" data-start=\"7670\" data-end=\"7697\">Python for Data Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kyyz4l\" data-start=\"7698\" data-end=\"7724\">Statistics Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jepeah\" data-start=\"7725\" data-end=\"7749\">SQL for Data Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkqcg2\" data-start=\"7750\" data-end=\"7776\">Web Development Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13zu9a\" data-start=\"7777\" data-end=\"7804\">Data Analytics Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gfvbko\" data-start=\"7805\" data-end=\"7834\">Data Science Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvacll\" data-start=\"7835\" data-end=\"7862\">Programming Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dfqn3z\" data-start=\"7863\" data-end=\"7881\">ML with Python</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7883\" data-end=\"7886\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15cqrit\" data-start=\"7888\" data-end=\"7929\">Semester 5: Advanced AI, Big Data &amp; NLP</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"7931\" data-end=\"7948\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7950\" data-end=\"8071\">This semester focuses on advanced machine learning, NLP, blockchain, big data analytics, and model deployment techniques.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8073\" data-end=\"8076\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1n\" data-start=\"8078\" data-end=\"8110\">Courses Covered in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wp6bxe\" data-start=\"8112\" data-end=\"8139\">Blockchain Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8140\" data-end=\"8194\">Covers distributed ledger systems and smart contracts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7haq1e\" data-start=\"8196\" data-end=\"8224\">Applied Machine Learning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8225\" data-end=\"8263\">Focuses on real-world ML applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kaydy\" data-start=\"8265\" data-end=\"8295\">Data Analytics with Python</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8296\" data-end=\"8328\">Advanced analytics using Python.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rv5ea6\" data-start=\"8330\" data-end=\"8361\">Natural Language Processing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8362\" data-end=\"8397\">Text mining and sentiment analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5igl0s\" data-start=\"8399\" data-end=\"8421\">Big Data Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8422\" data-end=\"8458\">Large-scale data processing systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xf39s4\" data-start=\"8460\" data-end=\"8493\">Advanced Software Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8494\" data-end=\"8532\">Modern software engineering practices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8534\" data-end=\"8537\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedej\" data-start=\"8539\" data-end=\"8572\">Skills Developed in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8574\" data-end=\"8758\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19m91mt\" data-start=\"8574\" data-end=\"8601\">Machine learning models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jj6n05\" data-start=\"8602\" data-end=\"8620\">NLP techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5u85rz\" data-start=\"8621\" data-end=\"8644\">Big data processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ahssa\" data-start=\"8645\" data-end=\"8667\">Blockchain systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j32ea1\" data-start=\"8668\" data-end=\"8686\">Data pipelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yhb7eu\" data-start=\"8687\" data-end=\"8709\">Model optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36g8tp\" data-start=\"8710\" data-end=\"8732\">Sentiment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e007vw\" data-start=\"8733\" data-end=\"8758\">Deployment strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8760\" data-end=\"8763\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4y\" data-start=\"8765\" data-end=\"8796\">Certifications in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8798\" data-end=\"9011\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vccxks\" data-start=\"8798\" data-end=\"8826\">Applied Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10vm9vw\" data-start=\"8827\" data-end=\"8846\">NLP with Python</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5i73v0\" data-start=\"8847\" data-end=\"8871\">Big Data Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9z0r39\" data-start=\"8872\" data-end=\"8893\">Blockchain Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g8xpp\" data-start=\"8894\" data-end=\"8910\">Apache Spark</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bruzqq\" data-start=\"8911\" data-end=\"8926\">Data Mining</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"172xx08\" data-start=\"8927\" data-end=\"8945\">AI Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uwhxj\" data-start=\"8946\" data-end=\"8969\">DevOps Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b6afg8\" data-start=\"8970\" data-end=\"8993\">Python Data Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xavhlh\" data-start=\"8994\" data-end=\"9011\">ML Algorithms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9013\" data-end=\"9016\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"knuds9\" data-start=\"9018\" data-end=\"9073\">Semester 6: Deep Learning, AI Systems &amp; Final Project</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"9075\" data-end=\"9092\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9094\" data-end=\"9206\">The final semester focuses on deep learning, neural networks, AI systems, ethics in AI, and project development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9208\" data-end=\"9211\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1k\" data-start=\"9213\" data-end=\"9245\">Courses Covered in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jsobpo\" data-start=\"9247\" data-end=\"9282\">Deep Learning &amp; Neural Networks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9283\" data-end=\"9321\">Covers CNNs, RNNs, and model training.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"znf7js\" data-start=\"9323\" data-end=\"9360\">Data Visualization &amp; Storytelling</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9361\" data-end=\"9404\">Focuses on presenting insights effectively.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tm0sd3\" data-start=\"9406\" data-end=\"9435\">AI Systems &amp; Applications</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9436\" data-end=\"9469\">Real-world AI system development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xj81hg\" data-start=\"9471\" data-end=\"9501\">AI Ethics &amp; Responsible AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9502\" data-end=\"9534\">Ethical AI usage and governance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19kz0wv\" data-start=\"9536\" data-end=\"9553\">Final Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9554\" data-end=\"9596\">Industry-based AI or data science project.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9598\" data-end=\"9601\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedeg\" data-start=\"9603\" data-end=\"9636\">Skills Developed in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9638\" data-end=\"9840\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ceel10\" data-start=\"9638\" data-end=\"9662\">Deep learning models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ro70n8\" data-start=\"9663\" data-end=\"9682\">Neural networks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0foq\" data-start=\"9683\" data-end=\"9704\">Data storytelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11xsg11\" data-start=\"9705\" data-end=\"9732\">AI lifecycle management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dhmsi5\" data-start=\"9733\" data-end=\"9768\">Model training and optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vezg7h\" data-start=\"9769\" data-end=\"9787\">Explainable AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qr48i\" data-start=\"9788\" data-end=\"9814\">Responsible AI systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p0vdof\" data-start=\"9815\" data-end=\"9840\">Dashboard development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9842\" data-end=\"9845\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4x\" data-start=\"9847\" data-end=\"9878\">Certifications in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9880\" data-end=\"10149\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vgws0g\" data-start=\"9880\" data-end=\"9909\">Deep Learning Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gae75w\" data-start=\"9910\" data-end=\"9938\">Neural Networks Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1it1tqa\" data-start=\"9939\" data-end=\"9960\">TensorFlow Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lguqg\" data-start=\"9961\" data-end=\"9988\">AI Ethics Certification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"186wp55\" data-start=\"9989\" data-end=\"10017\">Data Visualization Tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ti4gf\" data-start=\"10018\" data-end=\"10040\">Tableau Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14jucpz\" data-start=\"10041\" data-end=\"10070\">Machine Learning Advanced</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7hxhhw\" data-start=\"10071\" data-end=\"10101\">Data Science Certification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"172xx08\" data-start=\"10102\" data-end=\"10120\">AI Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jkldoa\" data-start=\"10121\" data-end=\"10149\">Neural Networks Advanced</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 150000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
