er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(306, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 274, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 00:37:24', '2026-06-16 07:09:45', '<p data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"809\">The admission process for the Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is designed to be simple, structured, and fully student-friendly. It ensures that every applicant can complete their admission journey in a smooth and transparent manner without confusion or unnecessary complexity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"1072\">This process is divided into four clear stages: application submission, program enrollment, payment completion, and final seat confirmation. Each step plays an important role in ensuring that the student&rsquo;s admission is properly verified, processed, and secured.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1231\">The system is fully digital, allowing students to complete the entire admission process online from anywhere, making it highly accessible and time-efficient.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1236\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17qwtd3\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1271\">Step 1: Submit Application Form</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a6885\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1306\">Starting the Admission Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1473\">The first step in the BCA admission process is submitting the online application form. This step officially begins the student&rsquo;s enrollment journey into the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1613\">Students must carefully enter their personal, academic, and program-related details in the application form to ensure accurate processing.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1618\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qry1vp\" data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1659\">Details Required in Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1704\">Students are generally required to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"2040\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b5yh2l\" data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1740\">Full name and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xeeclo\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1793\">Contact information (mobile number and email ID)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcjsc9\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1855\">Academic qualification details (10+2 or appearing status)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gzzert\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1938\">Educational board information (CBSE, State Board, ICSE, NIOS, IB, IGCSE, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7z0p0z\" data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1991\">Program selection (BCA specialization or stream)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dw9kt4\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2040\">Basic identification and academic background</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2045\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25y54a\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2086\">Importance of Application Submission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2144\">Submitting the application form is essential because it:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2332\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ynucg0\" data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2197\">Creates the student&rsquo;s official admission record</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9yxo5o\" data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2236\">Initiates eligibility verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"172y9o6\" data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2280\">Starts the admission evaluation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ly7nz\" data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2332\">Connects the student with the enrollment system</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2452\">Any incorrect or incomplete details may delay the admission process, so accuracy is extremely important at this stage.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2457\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gintl4\" data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2491\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3my97u\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2534\">Program Selection &amp; Verification Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2705\">After submitting the application, students proceed to the enrollment stage. This step involves selecting the desired BCA program and verifying all submitted information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2834\">At this stage, the system ensures that the student meets the eligibility criteria before moving forward to the payment process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2839\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yzfqb1\" data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2869\">What Happens in This Step</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"3092\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5nq5c7\" data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2917\">Selection of BCA program or specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmsii4\" data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2967\">Verification of academic and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10694nj\" data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3012\">Confirmation of eligibility requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y3a5f4\" data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3053\">Review of submitted application data</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mn0gxn\" data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3092\">Preparation for payment processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3097\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9se09k\" data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3132\">Importance of Enrollment Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3179\">This step is crucial because it ensures that:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3384\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m3y8gt\" data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3238\">Students are correctly mapped to the selected program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mfyufu\" data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3281\">Eligibility is verified before payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19k3y50\" data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3327\">Errors in application are corrected early</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ovquop\" data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3384\">Admission process remains structured and transparent</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3464\">It acts as a bridge between application submission and financial confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3469\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1jgmfxh\" data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3505\">Step 3: Complete Payment Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"i8aam4\" data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3538\">Flexible Fee Payment Options</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3716\">Once enrollment is verified, students proceed to the payment stage. The BCA program provides multiple payment options to make education financially accessible for all students.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3835\">This flexibility ensures that students can choose a payment method based on their financial planning and convenience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3837\" data-end=\"3840\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3870\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t67n64\" data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3900\">1. One-Time Full Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3902\" data-end=\"3993\">Students can pay the complete program fee in a single transaction at the time of admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q4c1cr\" data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"4008\">Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4134\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fyffyd\" data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4034\">Full fee paid upfront</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hmbshc\" data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4069\">No future installment tracking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1de53hd\" data-start=\"4070\" data-end=\"4101\">Immediate financial closure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jlse4m\" data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4134\">Simplified admission process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"4136\" data-end=\"4149\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4284\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wyrm8y\" data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4181\">No recurring payment stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h65wl8\" data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4211\">Easy financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rp0oyh\" data-start=\"4212\" data-end=\"4245\">Faster admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1etbmga\" data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4284\">Suitable for fully funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4289\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ano7td\" data-start=\"4291\" data-end=\"4325\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4419\">Students can also choose installment-based payment through EMI or education loan facilities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q4c1cr\" data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4434\">Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4435\" data-end=\"4579\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mljhp3\" data-start=\"4435\" data-end=\"4467\">Monthly installment payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xwq1tn\" data-start=\"4468\" data-end=\"4509\">0% interest EMI (subject to approval)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ujzk79\" data-start=\"4510\" data-end=\"4542\">Loan-based financing options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gd1xij\" data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4579\">Reduced upfront financial burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"4581\" data-end=\"4594\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4595\" data-end=\"4765\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17brufs\" data-start=\"4595\" data-end=\"4632\">Makes higher education affordable</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7rnhn1\" data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4690\">Allows students to study without full upfront payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwiqax\" data-start=\"4691\" data-end=\"4729\">Helps in better financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b22s13\" data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4765\">Supports middle-income families</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4767\" data-end=\"4878\">This option is especially helpful for students who want to manage their education expenses gradually over time.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4880\" data-end=\"4883\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mbgkrq\" data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"4915\">Importance of Payment Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4917\" data-end=\"4959\">The payment stage is essential because it:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4961\" data-end=\"5117\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11shd4z\" data-start=\"4961\" data-end=\"4994\">Confirms financial commitment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v31wg\" data-start=\"4995\" data-end=\"5029\">Activates admission processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oo2b7v\" data-start=\"5030\" data-end=\"5070\">Moves student toward seat allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rotjuc\" data-start=\"5071\" data-end=\"5117\">Ensures eligibility for final confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5119\" data-end=\"5206\">Without successful payment or loan approval, the admission process cannot be completed.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5208\" data-end=\"5211\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7jvyu7\" data-start=\"5213\" data-end=\"5239\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5tw1jj\" data-start=\"5241\" data-end=\"5272\">Final Admission Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5274\" data-end=\"5466\">The final step in the admission process is seat confirmation. Once the payment is successfully completed or the education loan/EMI is approved, the student&rsquo;s admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5468\" data-end=\"5471\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"5473\" data-end=\"5502\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5504\" data-end=\"5531\">After completing this step:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5533\" data-end=\"5739\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkwzx8\" data-start=\"5533\" data-end=\"5570\">Admission is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c2mtr2\" data-start=\"5571\" data-end=\"5607\">Seat is reserved for the student</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5w1b64\" data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5654\">Enrollment status is updated in the system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4i48z\" data-start=\"5655\" data-end=\"5698\">Access to academic systems is activated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3dlx3\" data-start=\"5699\" data-end=\"5739\">Admission documentation is finalized</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5741\" data-end=\"5744\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"727l4k\" data-start=\"5746\" data-end=\"5780\">Importance of Seat Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5782\" data-end=\"5834\">This is the most important stage because it ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5836\" data-end=\"5983\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"115vyt8\" data-start=\"5836\" data-end=\"5884\">Guaranteed admission in the selected program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"97aeqp\" data-start=\"5885\" data-end=\"5914\">Permanent seat allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ih52ha\" data-start=\"5915\" data-end=\"5953\">Finalization of student enrollment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljnj04\" data-start=\"5954\" data-end=\"5983\">Start of academic journey</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5985\" data-end=\"6049\">Without this step, admission remains incomplete and unconfirmed.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6051\" data-end=\"6054\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p1ofsx\" data-start=\"6056\" data-end=\"6092\">Complete Admission Process Summary</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6094\" data-end=\"6132\">To simplify, here is the full process:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9rzptd\" data-start=\"6134\" data-end=\"6166\">Step 1: Submit Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6167\" data-end=\"6219\">Fill online form with academic and personal details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bazspl\" data-start=\"6221\" data-end=\"6252\">Step 2: Enroll in Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6253\" data-end=\"6295\">Select BCA program and verify eligibility.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kyof3i\" data-start=\"6297\" data-end=\"6327\">Step 3: Complete Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6328\" data-end=\"6371\">Choose one-time payment or EMI/loan option.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"62gr72\" data-start=\"6373\" data-end=\"6398\">Step 4: Secure Seat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6399\" data-end=\"6449\">Receive final confirmation and complete admission.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"917\">The eligibility criteria for the Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program define the academic qualification standards that students must meet before applying for admission. These criteria ensure that students entering the program have the necessary foundational knowledge in subjects such as mathematics, logical reasoning, and basic communication skills required for computer applications and programming studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"1242\">The BCA program is designed to be inclusive and accessible, allowing students from different educational boards and academic backgrounds to apply. It does not restrict admission to a single stream or specialization, making it suitable for a wide range of students who want to build a career in the IT and software industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1447\">Understanding eligibility clearly is important because it helps students avoid confusion during the admission process and ensures smooth application submission without rejection due to academic mismatch.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fnrrsk\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1507\">Minimum Educational Qualification for BCA Admission</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"elhdmo\" data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1529\">Basic Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1626\">To be eligible for admission into the BCA program, a student must meet the following condition:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1760\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xvcgrm\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1701\">Must have passed the <strong data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1690\">10+2 (Higher Secondary) examination</strong><br data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1693\"><strong data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1699\">OR</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12njkx6\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1760\">Must be <strong data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1760\">currently appearing for the 10+2 examination</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1855\">This means both passed-out students and final-year school students can apply for the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1860\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1haxkce\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1913\">Recognized Educational Boards for BCA Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"2085\">The BCA program accepts students from multiple recognized national and international boards. This ensures equal opportunity for students from different education systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ppm60i\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2115\">State Board Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2210\">Students who have completed their 10+2 from any recognized State Board are eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2357\">State Boards follow curriculum guidelines approved by state education authorities and are widely accepted for higher education programs like BCA.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kx7bog\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2377\">Key Advantage:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2497\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zi6c4j\" data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2416\">Strong foundation in core subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bjvcvq\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2451\">Widely recognized across India</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la6zmy\" data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2497\">Suitable for technical education pathways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2502\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xyhe0j\" data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2550\">CBSE (Central Board of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2603\">CBSE students are fully eligible for BCA admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2761\">CBSE is one of the most structured and widely accepted boards in India, known for its focus on analytical thinking, mathematics, and science-based learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kx7bog\" data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2781\">Key Advantage:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2896\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wwqt13\" data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2821\">Strong logical reasoning foundation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6lxk6y\" data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2866\">Focus on mathematics and problem-solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"afd0e7\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2896\">High national recognition</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2901\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b0ffe9\" data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2949\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"3005\">Students from NIOS are also eligible to apply for BCA.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3130\">NIOS provides open and distance learning education, making it suitable for students who could not follow regular schooling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kx7bog\" data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3150\">Key Advantage:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3287\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmr98s\" data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3179\">Flexible learning system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hs723z\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3240\">Suitable for working students or re-appearing candidates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kaac7v\" data-start=\"3241\" data-end=\"3287\">Fully recognized by government authorities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3292\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n4i1v5\" data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3345\">ICSE (Indian Certificate of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3392\">ICSE students are eligible for BCA admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3481\">ICSE curriculum is known for its strong English language skills and conceptual clarity.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kx7bog\" data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3501\">Key Advantage:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3614\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o55tix\" data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3533\">Strong communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"47i82e\" data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"3569\">Concept-based learning approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wk42gf\" data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3614\">Useful for programming and documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3616\" data-end=\"3619\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x008qw\" data-start=\"3621\" data-end=\"3656\">IB (International Baccalaureate)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3708\">Students from IB board are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3814\">IB is an internationally recognized curriculum focused on research-based learning and critical thinking.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kx7bog\" data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3834\">Key Advantage:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3835\" data-end=\"3949\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rp9bh5\" data-start=\"3835\" data-end=\"3868\">Global curriculum recognition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oaiydf\" data-start=\"3869\" data-end=\"3910\">Strong analytical and research skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16cjcqo\" data-start=\"3911\" data-end=\"3949\">Ideal for international IT careers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3951\" data-end=\"3954\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tkcnz\" data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"4023\">IGCSE (International General Certificate of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4025\" data-end=\"4071\">IGCSE students are eligible for BCA admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4166\">This is an internationally accepted qualification that emphasizes application-based learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kx7bog\" data-start=\"4168\" data-end=\"4186\">Key Advantage:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4187\" data-end=\"4284\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"96jeyd\" data-start=\"4187\" data-end=\"4216\">International recognition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"85qus5\" data-start=\"4217\" data-end=\"4247\">Strong academic foundation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rtyctu\" data-start=\"4248\" data-end=\"4284\">Focus on practical understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4289\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"134pbc9\" data-start=\"4291\" data-end=\"4347\">Eligibility for Students Appearing in 10+2 Examination</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bbvfnb\" data-start=\"4349\" data-end=\"4383\">Important Admission Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4385\" data-end=\"4522\">Students who are currently in Class 12 or are appearing for their final 10+2 examinations are also eligible to apply for the BCA program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4524\" data-end=\"4628\">This is an important feature that allows students to secure admission without waiting for final results.</p>', '<p data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"785\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) fee structure is designed to offer complete clarity, flexibility, and affordability for students from different financial backgrounds. A well-defined fee system helps students and parents plan their education journey without confusion or unexpected financial pressure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"1176\">This BCA program provides multiple payment options such as semester-wise, yearly, and one-time payment plans, ensuring that students can choose a method that best suits their financial situation. Along with tuition fees, students are also required to pay additional charges such as registration fees and annual examination fees depending on their category (India, SAARC, or International).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1327\">Understanding the full fee structure is important because it gives a complete picture of the total cost of education, not just the basic tuition fee.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rpalu4\" data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1357\">Total BCA Course Fees</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yx9wzi\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1382\">Complete Program Fee</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1410\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1446\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total BCA Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1458\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹150,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1676\">The total fee of ₹150,000 represents the complete tuition cost of the BCA program. This amount covers academic learning, structured curriculum delivery, and access to course materials throughout the program duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1830\">However, students must also consider additional mandatory fees such as registration and examination charges to understand the total investment required.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1835\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1bffc1j\" data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1876\">Flexible Payment Options for BCA Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"2066\">To make higher education accessible, the BCA program offers flexible payment structures. Students can choose from different payment modes based on their financial planning and convenience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83is7d\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2098\">1. Yearly Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2169\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2125\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2125\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2115\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2169\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2169\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2169\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹50,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3ze0g2\" data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2203\">Understanding Yearly Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2358\">In the yearly payment option, the total fee is divided into equal annual installments. Students pay ₹50,000 each year during the duration of the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15xlm0b\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2390\">Benefits of Yearly Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2575\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e461a\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2435\">Simplifies long-term financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c1e14v\" data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2469\">Reduces frequency of payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pi3p73\" data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2524\">Suitable for families with annual budgeting cycles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fastk0\" data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2575\">Easier fee management over the course duration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2700\">This option is ideal for students who prefer structured yearly financial commitments instead of frequent semester payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2705\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1minad7\" data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2739\">2. Semester-Wise Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2816\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2756\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2766\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2816\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2816\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2792\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2816\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹25,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xzc3ti\" data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2852\">Understanding Semester Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2983\">The semester-wise payment option divides the total program fee into smaller installments, making it more manageable for students.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1inq21m\" data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3022\">Benefits of Semester-Wise Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3190\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djvlbw\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3066\">Lower financial burden per installment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xqb31m\" data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3118\">Better affordability for middle-income families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y9112x\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3150\">Easier cash flow management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"526j3r\" data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3190\">Flexible academic payment structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3308\">This is one of the most popular options because it reduces upfront financial pressure while maintaining flexibility.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3313\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yt3u32\" data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3349\">3. One-Time Full Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3418\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3376\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3376\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3366\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3376\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3387\" data-end=\"3418\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3387\" data-end=\"3418\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3387\" data-end=\"3406\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3418\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹150,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19lh2mc\" data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3454\">Understanding One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3530\">Students can choose to pay the entire course fee at once during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v322b1\" data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3564\">Benefits of One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3723\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"55bge1\" data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3609\">No future installment tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"917kpq\" data-start=\"3610\" data-end=\"3645\">Simplified financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g1ib0\" data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3684\">Avoids recurring payment deadlines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1etbmga\" data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3723\">Suitable for fully funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3725\" data-end=\"3827\">This option is ideal for students who want complete financial closure at the beginning of the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3832\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1euoihx\" data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3867\">Additional Fees for BCA Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3869\" data-end=\"4037\">Apart from tuition fees, students must also pay additional academic charges. These include registration fees and examination fees, which are mandatory for all students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4042\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qqn3gu\" data-start=\"4044\" data-end=\"4081\">Additional Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4191\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4104\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4104\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4094\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4094\" data-end=\"4104\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4191\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4153\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4143\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4143\" data-end=\"4153\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4154\" data-end=\"4191\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4154\" data-end=\"4172\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4191\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4196\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1opp6jc\" data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4225\">Registration Fee (India)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4305\">The registration fee is a one-time payment collected at the time of admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17p4kli\" data-start=\"4307\" data-end=\"4338\">Purpose of Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4509\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dpq5xe\" data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4381\">Student enrollment in academic system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvgloy\" data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4423\">Creation of official academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qke0ex\" data-start=\"4424\" data-end=\"4466\">Access to learning portals and systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d8sqb7\" data-start=\"4467\" data-end=\"4509\">Admission processing and documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4511\" data-end=\"4580\">Since this is a one-time fee, it is not required in subsequent years.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4582\" data-end=\"4585\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mswdcy\" data-start=\"4587\" data-end=\"4613\">Examination Fee (India)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4615\" data-end=\"4710\">The examination fee is charged annually and is required for appearing in semester examinations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16cnfi4\" data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4742\">Purpose of Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4744\" data-end=\"4873\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"162zpv4\" data-start=\"4744\" data-end=\"4782\">Conducting university examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cd7z4j\" data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4815\">Paper evaluation and grading</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xrnz0q\" data-start=\"4816\" data-end=\"4837\">Result processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9y4mk\" data-start=\"4838\" data-end=\"4873\">Academic administration support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4875\" data-end=\"4942\">Students must pay this fee every year to remain eligible for exams.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4944\" data-end=\"4947\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1b3aond\" data-start=\"4949\" data-end=\"4985\">Additional Fees for SAARC Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4987\" data-end=\"5106\">Students from SAARC countries have a slightly different fee structure to accommodate international academic processing.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5208\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5129\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5129\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5119\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5119\" data-end=\"5129\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5140\" data-end=\"5208\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5140\" data-end=\"5170\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5140\" data-end=\"5159\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5159\" data-end=\"5170\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5171\" data-end=\"5208\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5171\" data-end=\"5189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5189\" data-end=\"5208\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5210\" data-end=\"5213\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"sqvnlc\" data-start=\"5215\" data-end=\"5251\">Understanding SAARC Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5253\" data-end=\"5338\">The SAARC fee structure is designed for regional international students and includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5486\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ttd9rk\" data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5399\">Higher registration cost due to cross-border processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kvp51g\" data-start=\"5400\" data-end=\"5435\">Slightly higher examination fee</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wn7x6i\" data-start=\"5436\" data-end=\"5486\">Standardized academic support across countries</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5488\" data-end=\"5564\">This ensures smooth academic participation for neighboring country students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5566\" data-end=\"5569\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"puptap\" data-start=\"5571\" data-end=\"5615\">Additional Fees for International Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5617\" data-end=\"5698\">For students outside India and SAARC regions, the fee structure is in US dollars.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5700\" data-end=\"5810\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5700\" data-end=\"5721\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5700\" data-end=\"5721\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5700\" data-end=\"5711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5711\" data-end=\"5721\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5732\" data-end=\"5810\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5732\" data-end=\"5768\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5732\" data-end=\"5760\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5760\" data-end=\"5768\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5769\" data-end=\"5810\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5769\" data-end=\"5794\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5794\" data-end=\"5810\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"792\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) in Cloud Computing and DevOps is a modern, industry-aligned undergraduate program designed for students who want to build careers in cloud infrastructure, software deployment, automation, DevOps engineering, and distributed systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"1084\">This program is structured to provide strong foundational knowledge in programming and software engineering in the initial semesters, followed by advanced specialization in cloud platforms, containerization, microservices, automation tools, DevOps pipelines, and AI-driven cloud operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1302\">Unlike traditional computer science programs, this specialization focuses heavily on real-world IT infrastructure, scalable cloud systems, and continuous software delivery practices used in top global tech companies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1474\">Students are trained to work with technologies like AWS, Azure, Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins, Terraform, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud-native application development systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1479\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1mclomg\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1533\">Why BCA in Cloud Computing &amp; DevOps is High Demand</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1717\">Cloud computing and DevOps have become the backbone of modern IT systems. Every organization today depends on cloud infrastructure for storage, deployment, scalability, and security.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1801\">This program is designed to prepare students for high-demand roles by focusing on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"2100\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17f8ib1\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1838\">Cloud infrastructure management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d0osd2\" data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1874\">Automation and DevOps pipelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jp0hb2\" data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1915\">Containerized application deployment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e7eoe6\" data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1955\">Scalable microservices architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vblw77\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1987\">Real-time system monitoring</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"174xtlu\" data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2030\">Cloud security and DevSecOps practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e3mult\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2066\">AI-driven IT operations (AIOps)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9tov1\" data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2100\">Distributed computing systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2206\">These skills are essential in modern IT companies where speed, reliability, and automation are critical.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2211\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7629ho\" data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2268\">Semester 1: Programming Foundations &amp; AI Introduction</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2287\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2458\">The first semester focuses on building programming logic, mathematical understanding, and foundational computing concepts required for advanced cloud and DevOps systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2463\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1r\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2497\">Courses Covered in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vaosqc\" data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2510\">English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2591\">Develops communication and technical writing skills required in IT environments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5cl54f\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2624\">Fundamentals of Mathematics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2716\">Builds logical reasoning and analytical thinking required for algorithms and system design.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d4mtri\" data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2745\">Problem Solving using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2818\">Introduces structured programming, loops, functions, and logic building.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5rc8r8\" data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2845\">Computer Architecture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2906\">Explains CPU, memory, and system-level computing operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f55vj2\" data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2939\">Essentials of Generative AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"3001\">Introduces AI concepts and modern generative AI applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fpnbv7\" data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3024\">C Programming Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3072\">Practical coding and problem-solving exercises.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3077\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gveden\" data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3112\">Skills Developed in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3345\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gpcjwl\" data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3142\">Programming fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ijlu5w\" data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3168\">Algorithm development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e4ht0g\" data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3195\">Structured programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyz0gf\" data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3217\">Logical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sfeiyk\" data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3238\">Debugging skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vmb5f1\" data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3264\">Mathematical modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19k5mhe\" data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3299\">Artificial intelligence basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h895uh\" data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3323\">Data representation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mxe3no\" data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3345\">Code optimization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3350\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e52\" data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3383\">Certifications in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3581\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"104kjvr\" data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3426\">Programming Foundations: Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rh0lth\" data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3451\">C Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19h5kzh\" data-start=\"3452\" data-end=\"3473\">Algorithms Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i15jz2\" data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3506\">Data Structures Introduction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199axno\" data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3544\">AI Foundations: Thinking Machines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1snw0vn\" data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3581\">AI Foundations: Machine Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3583\" data-end=\"3586\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"146dl2b\" data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3636\">Semester 2: Data Structures &amp; Database Systems</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3655\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3657\" data-end=\"3749\">This semester focuses on data handling, database systems, and operating system fundamentals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3751\" data-end=\"3754\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1o\" data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3788\">Courses Covered in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sr0i3q\" data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3815\">Communicative English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3856\">Enhances technical communication skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"np08ta\" data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3878\">Operating System</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3879\" data-end=\"3938\">Covers process management, memory handling, and scheduling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m64tpx\" data-start=\"3940\" data-end=\"3967\">Data Structures using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3968\" data-end=\"4016\">Teaches stacks, queues, trees, and linked lists.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1581opq\" data-start=\"4018\" data-end=\"4049\">Relational Database Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4050\" data-end=\"4105\">Introduces SQL, database design, and relational models.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yhpx33\" data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4130\">Data Structures Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4131\" data-end=\"4175\">Practical implementation of data structures.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fealwj\" data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4190\">RDBMS Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4191\" data-end=\"4213\">Hands-on SQL practice.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4215\" data-end=\"4218\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedek\" data-start=\"4220\" data-end=\"4253\">Skills Developed in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4419\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mo16ta\" data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4274\">Data structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1md5rlc\" data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4302\">SQL database management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r1zcbz\" data-start=\"4303\" data-end=\"4332\">Tree and graph structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13xezb3\" data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4352\">Database design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7p0jkg\" data-start=\"4353\" data-end=\"4375\">Process management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s8n96i\" data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4397\">Memory management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o630fv\" data-start=\"4398\" data-end=\"4419\">Database security</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4424\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e51\" data-start=\"4426\" data-end=\"4457\">Certifications in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4612\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bs6ghk\" data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4485\">SQL Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e55t85\" data-start=\"4486\" data-end=\"4510\">Database Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"188c18n\" data-start=\"4511\" data-end=\"4542\">Programming Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wrtg8v\" data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4561\">Git Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hgrhyj\" data-start=\"4562\" data-end=\"4590\">Learning SQL Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ardiqm\" data-start=\"4591\" data-end=\"4612\">Database Concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4614\" data-end=\"4617\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"i6umj9\" data-start=\"4619\" data-end=\"4674\">Semester 3: Python, Algorithms &amp; Software Engineering</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"4676\" data-end=\"4693\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4695\" data-end=\"4790\">This semester introduces Python programming, software engineering, and networking fundamentals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4792\" data-end=\"4795\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1p\" data-start=\"4797\" data-end=\"4829\">Courses Covered in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"116sc7f\" data-start=\"4831\" data-end=\"4853\">Python Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4854\" data-end=\"4892\">Core Python programming and scripting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ec7haw\" data-start=\"4894\" data-end=\"4931\">Design and Analysis of Algorithms</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4932\" data-end=\"4970\">Algorithm efficiency and optimization.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tasahc\" data-start=\"4972\" data-end=\"4996\">Software Engineering</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4997\" data-end=\"5046\">Software development lifecycle and Agile methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ah5kss\" data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5069\">Computer Networks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5070\" data-end=\"5117\">Networking protocols and communication systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ubipe5\" data-start=\"5119\" data-end=\"5132\">ESG in IT</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5133\" data-end=\"5172\">Ethical and environmental IT practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ynkm9m\" data-start=\"5174\" data-end=\"5182\">Labs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5183\" data-end=\"5213\">Python and algorithm practice.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5215\" data-end=\"5218\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedel\" data-start=\"5220\" data-end=\"5253\">Skills Developed in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5255\" data-end=\"5421\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t12n5x\" data-start=\"5255\" data-end=\"5277\">Python programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1zm1nn\" data-start=\"5278\" data-end=\"5297\">API development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lgxlv5\" data-start=\"5298\" data-end=\"5318\">Software testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"159s9lp\" data-start=\"5319\" data-end=\"5340\">Agile development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"164618v\" data-start=\"5341\" data-end=\"5370\">Debugging and refactoring</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9evc2\" data-start=\"5371\" data-end=\"5393\">Data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zqb8y1\" data-start=\"5394\" data-end=\"5421\">Technical documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5423\" data-end=\"5426\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e50\" data-start=\"5428\" data-end=\"5459\">Certifications in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5461\" data-end=\"5683\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6bj2a\" data-start=\"5461\" data-end=\"5490\">Python Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rhunr4\" data-start=\"5491\" data-end=\"5512\">Python Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14hbo9g\" data-start=\"5513\" data-end=\"5541\">Data Science Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mqzug\" data-start=\"5542\" data-end=\"5569\">Software Testing Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bzkwnq\" data-start=\"5570\" data-end=\"5591\">Agile Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hr6up7\" data-start=\"5592\" data-end=\"5614\">DevOps Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bapbrz\" data-start=\"5615\" data-end=\"5636\">Networking Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wrtg8v\" data-start=\"5637\" data-end=\"5655\">Git Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3jgmb\" data-start=\"5656\" data-end=\"5683\">Python for Data Science</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5685\" data-end=\"5688\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"qf7j2l\" data-start=\"5690\" data-end=\"5747\">Semester 4: Cloud Computing Foundations &amp; Microservices</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"5749\" data-end=\"5766\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5768\" data-end=\"5875\">This semester focuses on cloud computing, virtualization, containerization, and microservices architecture.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5877\" data-end=\"5880\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1m\" data-start=\"5882\" data-end=\"5914\">Courses Covered in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mvwlhy\" data-start=\"5916\" data-end=\"5936\">Web Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5937\" data-end=\"5993\">Web application development using HTML, CSS, JavaScript.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1shzesj\" data-start=\"5995\" data-end=\"6015\">Java Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6016\" data-end=\"6071\">Object-oriented programming and enterprise development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11by1od\" data-start=\"6073\" data-end=\"6109\">Containerization &amp; Microservices</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6110\" data-end=\"6172\">Docker, microservices architecture, and scalable applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"m8txdr\" data-start=\"6174\" data-end=\"6205\">Cloud Computing Foundations</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6206\" data-end=\"6246\">Cloud service models (IaaS, PaaS, SaaS).</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wd8pb8\" data-start=\"6248\" data-end=\"6275\">Quantitative Techniques</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6276\" data-end=\"6325\">Statistical analysis and performance measurement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ynkm9m\" data-start=\"6327\" data-end=\"6335\">Labs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6336\" data-end=\"6370\">Java and web development practice.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6375\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedei\" data-start=\"6377\" data-end=\"6410\">Skills Developed in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6412\" data-end=\"6582\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hve2hf\" data-start=\"6412\" data-end=\"6425\">REST APIs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1du0493\" data-start=\"6426\" data-end=\"6444\">Virtualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18vq8td\" data-start=\"6445\" data-end=\"6465\">Containerization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8nz4g9\" data-start=\"6466\" data-end=\"6496\">Microservices architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t96ohs\" data-start=\"6497\" data-end=\"6517\">Cloud deployment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s892rn\" data-start=\"6518\" data-end=\"6539\">Kubernetes basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n9vxrv\" data-start=\"6540\" data-end=\"6553\">Java JDBC</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vo3no1\" data-start=\"6554\" data-end=\"6582\">Performance optimization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6584\" data-end=\"6587\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4z\" data-start=\"6589\" data-end=\"6620\">Certifications in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6622\" data-end=\"6882\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"td1sk1\" data-start=\"6622\" data-end=\"6653\">Cloud Computing Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"svux4h\" data-start=\"6654\" data-end=\"6675\">Docker Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xle86b\" data-start=\"6676\" data-end=\"6697\">Kubernetes Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"urtsj\" data-start=\"6698\" data-end=\"6722\">REST API Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ua7oc\" data-start=\"6723\" data-end=\"6749\">Microservices Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efpi4t\" data-start=\"6750\" data-end=\"6770\">Java Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hr6up7\" data-start=\"6771\" data-end=\"6793\">DevOps Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1918eud\" data-start=\"6794\" data-end=\"6823\">Cloud Architecture Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g367eb\" data-start=\"6824\" data-end=\"6855\">Web Development Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qei5zc\" data-start=\"6856\" data-end=\"6882\">Object-Oriented Design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6884\" data-end=\"6887\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dnje62\" data-start=\"6889\" data-end=\"6935\">Semester 5: DevOps, CI/CD &amp; Cloud Automation</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"6937\" data-end=\"6954\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6956\" data-end=\"7072\">This semester focuses on DevOps practices, automation tools, cloud infrastructure, and machine learning integration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7074\" data-end=\"7077\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1n\" data-start=\"7079\" data-end=\"7111\">Courses Covered in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wp6bxe\" data-start=\"7113\" data-end=\"7140\">Blockchain Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7141\" data-end=\"7189\">Distributed systems and blockchain fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7haq1e\" data-start=\"7191\" data-end=\"7219\">Applied Machine Learning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7220\" data-end=\"7256\">Machine learning model applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kaydy\" data-start=\"7258\" data-end=\"7288\">Data Analytics with Python</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7289\" data-end=\"7318\">Data processing and analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rv5ea6\" data-start=\"7320\" data-end=\"7351\">Natural Language Processing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7352\" data-end=\"7387\">Text mining and sentiment analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5igl0s\" data-start=\"7389\" data-end=\"7411\">Big Data Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7412\" data-end=\"7444\">Large-scale distributed systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tjgynz\" data-start=\"7446\" data-end=\"7477\">Advanced Software Practices</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7478\" data-end=\"7511\">CI/CD pipelines and DevOps tools.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7513\" data-end=\"7516\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedej\" data-start=\"7518\" data-end=\"7551\">Skills Developed in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7553\" data-end=\"7779\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ujp3iz\" data-start=\"7553\" data-end=\"7572\">CI/CD pipelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oikasp\" data-start=\"7573\" data-end=\"7595\">Jenkins automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uitoy5\" data-start=\"7596\" data-end=\"7616\">GitHub workflows</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14gfdzd\" data-start=\"7617\" data-end=\"7645\">Terraform infrastructure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15uffg1\" data-start=\"7646\" data-end=\"7674\">Kubernetes orchestration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i0a1fs\" data-start=\"7675\" data-end=\"7703\">Multi-cloud architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"166havv\" data-start=\"7704\" data-end=\"7724\">DevOps practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hpf0q4\" data-start=\"7725\" data-end=\"7751\">Monitoring and logging</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jpbots\" data-start=\"7752\" data-end=\"7779\">Machine learning basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7781\" data-end=\"7784\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4y\" data-start=\"7786\" data-end=\"7817\">Certifications in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7819\" data-end=\"8069\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mvbbnm\" data-start=\"7819\" data-end=\"7849\">DevOps Continuous Delivery</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k3k1hy\" data-start=\"7850\" data-end=\"7870\">Jenkins Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w0rqsj\" data-start=\"7871\" data-end=\"7895\">Terraform Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yx6d4a\" data-start=\"7896\" data-end=\"7922\">AWS Cloud Practitioner</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9umu85\" data-start=\"7923\" data-end=\"7945\">Azure Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"60qi55\" data-start=\"7946\" data-end=\"7969\">Google Cloud Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s4snw4\" data-start=\"7970\" data-end=\"7999\">Kubernetes for Developers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qb8jzx\" data-start=\"8000\" data-end=\"8021\">MLOps Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9z0r39\" data-start=\"8022\" data-end=\"8043\">Blockchain Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vupjf5\" data-start=\"8044\" data-end=\"8069\">Cloud DevOps Concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8071\" data-end=\"8074\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"p2bxv1\" data-start=\"8076\" data-end=\"8118\">Semester 6: Cloud-Native Systems &amp; AIOps</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"8120\" data-end=\"8137\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8139\" data-end=\"8264\">The final semester focuses on advanced cloud-native development, DevSecOps, distributed systems, and AI-driven IT operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8266\" data-end=\"8269\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1k\" data-start=\"8271\" data-end=\"8303\">Courses Covered in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k6rnrm\" data-start=\"8305\" data-end=\"8345\">Cloud-Native Application Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8346\" data-end=\"8381\">Modern scalable cloud applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"108nybt\" data-start=\"8383\" data-end=\"8413\">Cloud Security &amp; DevSecOps</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8414\" data-end=\"8455\">Security integration in DevOps pipelines.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lh693q\" data-start=\"8457\" data-end=\"8497\">Distributed Systems &amp; Edge Computing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8498\" data-end=\"8534\">Real-time distributed architectures.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1oo511r\" data-start=\"8536\" data-end=\"8570\">AIOps &amp; Intelligent Monitoring</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8571\" data-end=\"8605\">AI-based IT operations management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19kz0wv\" data-start=\"8607\" data-end=\"8624\">Final Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8625\" data-end=\"8661\">Industry-based cloud/DevOps project.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8663\" data-end=\"8666\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedeg\" data-start=\"8668\" data-end=\"8701\">Skills Developed in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8703\" data-end=\"8891\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k9wv18\" data-start=\"8703\" data-end=\"8732\">Cloud-native applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sxw50u\" data-start=\"8733\" data-end=\"8756\">DevSecOps practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hdw1hr\" data-start=\"8757\" data-end=\"8785\">Vulnerability management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iat5gt\" data-start=\"8786\" data-end=\"8809\">Distributed systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t059mj\" data-start=\"8810\" data-end=\"8828\">Edge computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18flp0h\" data-start=\"8829\" data-end=\"8853\">Real-time processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tc7pp6\" data-start=\"8854\" data-end=\"8871\">AIOps systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tw3taj\" data-start=\"8872\" data-end=\"8891\">Fault tolerance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8893\" data-end=\"8896\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4x\" data-start=\"8898\" data-end=\"8929\">Certifications in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8931\" data-end=\"9214\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a71sgb\" data-start=\"8931\" data-end=\"8959\">Cloud Native Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f5ystj\" data-start=\"8960\" data-end=\"8992\">Kubernetes Advanced Concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mn9iw6\" data-start=\"8993\" data-end=\"9015\">DevSecOps Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oe8c7a\" data-start=\"9016\" data-end=\"9041\">Cloud Security Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nf2kyd\" data-start=\"9042\" data-end=\"9077\">Distributed Systems Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bowf5e\" data-start=\"9078\" data-end=\"9103\">Edge Computing Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11y6llg\" data-start=\"9104\" data-end=\"9127\">AIOps Certification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qxfldr\" data-start=\"9128\" data-end=\"9158\">Monitoring &amp; Observability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n2r2tu\" data-start=\"9159\" data-end=\"9182\">Prometheus Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13eq2lu\" data-start=\"9183\" data-end=\"9214\">Cloud Architecture Advanced</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 150000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(307, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 275, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 00:51:47', '2026-06-16 07:10:09', '<p data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"748\">The admission process for the Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is designed to be simple, structured, and fully digital so that students can complete their enrollment without any confusion or physical documentation delays.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"1025\">This process ensures transparency at every stage&mdash;from application submission to final seat confirmation&mdash;so that students clearly understand what is required at each step. The entire system is built to support smooth admission for students from different academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1163\">The admission journey is divided into four major steps, each playing a critical role in ensuring successful enrollment into the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17qwtd3\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1203\">Step 1: Submit Application Form</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a6885\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1238\">Starting the Admission Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1414\">The first step in the BCA admission process is submitting the online application form. This is the entry point where the student officially expresses interest in the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1645\">At this stage, students are required to carefully fill in their personal, academic, and program-related details. This information forms the foundation of the admission process and is used for verification and enrollment purposes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1650\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qry1vp\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1691\">Details Required in Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1736\">Students are typically required to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"2085\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b5yh2l\" data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1772\">Full name and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xeeclo\" data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1825\">Contact information (mobile number and email ID)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"76addg\" data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1897\">Academic qualification details (10+2 completed or appearing status)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gzzert\" data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1980\">Educational board information (CBSE, State Board, ICSE, NIOS, IB, IGCSE, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lnrs6o\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2037\">Program selection (BCA specialization if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sj7r5r\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2085\">Basic identification and background details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25y54a\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2131\">Importance of Application Submission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2189\">Submitting the application form is important because it:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2386\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ynucg0\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2242\">Creates the student&rsquo;s official admission record</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i8wqmc\" data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2286\">Starts eligibility verification process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10uhdxg\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2341\">Initiates communication with admission authorities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2luq7a\" data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2386\">Allows program allocation and processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2510\">Any incorrect or incomplete information may delay the admission process, so accuracy is extremely important at this stage.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2515\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gintl4\" data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2549\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3my97u\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2592\">Program Selection &amp; Verification Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2759\">After submitting the application form, students move to the enrollment stage. This step focuses on selecting the desired program and verifying the submitted details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2932\">The enrollment stage ensures that the student is correctly matched with the selected BCA program and meets all eligibility requirements before moving to the payment stage.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"2937\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yzfqb1\" data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2967\">What Happens in This Step</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3191\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5nq5c7\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3015\">Selection of BCA program or specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmsii4\" data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3065\">Verification of academic and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mlr428\" data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3106\">Confirmation of eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nm318x\" data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3152\">Review and validation of application data</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mn0gxn\" data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3191\">Preparation for payment processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3196\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9se09k\" data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3231\">Importance of Enrollment Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3273\">This step is crucial because it ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3275\" data-end=\"3464\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"153twqr\" data-start=\"3275\" data-end=\"3317\">Only eligible students proceed further</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2zlf2l\" data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3361\">Program selection is correctly assigned</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19k3y50\" data-start=\"3362\" data-end=\"3407\">Errors in application are corrected early</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14mcgvt\" data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3464\">Admission process remains transparent and structured</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3533\">It acts as a bridge between application submission and fee payment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3538\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1jgmfxh\" data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3574\">Step 3: Complete Payment Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"i8aam4\" data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3607\">Flexible Fee Payment Options</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3776\">Once enrollment is verified, students proceed to the payment stage. The BCA program offers flexible payment options to ensure financial accessibility for all students.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3873\">Students can choose a payment method based on their financial comfort and planning preferences.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3878\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"3880\" data-end=\"3908\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h4qv18\" data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"3940\">1. One-Time Payment Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3942\" data-end=\"4017\">Students can pay the full program fee in a single payment during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q4c1cr\" data-start=\"4019\" data-end=\"4032\">Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4170\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a420nn\" data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4058\">Full fee paid at once</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"55bge1\" data-start=\"4059\" data-end=\"4102\">No future installment tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z6dhw4\" data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4137\">Immediate financial completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jlse4m\" data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4170\">Simplified admission process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4185\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4326\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z00784\" data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4218\">Stress-free academic journey</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"youksv\" data-start=\"4219\" data-end=\"4253\">No recurring payment reminders</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rp0oyh\" data-start=\"4254\" data-end=\"4287\">Faster admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1etbmga\" data-start=\"4288\" data-end=\"4326\">Suitable for fully funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4328\" data-end=\"4331\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ano7td\" data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4367\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4461\">Students can also choose installment-based payment through EMI or education loan facilities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q4c1cr\" data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4476\">Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4477\" data-end=\"4622\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mljhp3\" data-start=\"4477\" data-end=\"4509\">Monthly installment payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"guw80e\" data-start=\"4510\" data-end=\"4538\">Easy EMI-based structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wu91dl\" data-start=\"4539\" data-end=\"4583\">0% interest option (subject to approval)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"190cxp\" data-start=\"4584\" data-end=\"4622\">Financial flexibility for students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"4624\" data-end=\"4637\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4638\" data-end=\"4794\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ybwizg\" data-start=\"4638\" data-end=\"4674\">Reduces upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ht7sqh\" data-start=\"4675\" data-end=\"4717\">Makes higher education more accessible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nyi31i\" data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4754\">Allows better financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wrwm29\" data-start=\"4755\" data-end=\"4794\">Suitable for middle-income families</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4796\" data-end=\"4880\">This option ensures that financial limitations do not become a barrier to education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4882\" data-end=\"4885\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mbgkrq\" data-start=\"4887\" data-end=\"4917\">Importance of Payment Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4919\" data-end=\"4961\">The payment stage is essential because it:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4963\" data-end=\"5131\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gd8r8g\" data-start=\"4963\" data-end=\"5006\">Confirms student&rsquo;s financial commitment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v31wg\" data-start=\"5007\" data-end=\"5041\">Activates admission processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p98phc\" data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5085\">Moves application toward final approval</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g5xcrf\" data-start=\"5086\" data-end=\"5131\">Ensures eligibility for seat confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5133\" data-end=\"5208\">Without payment or loan approval, the admission process remains incomplete.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5210\" data-end=\"5213\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7jvyu7\" data-start=\"5215\" data-end=\"5241\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5tw1jj\" data-start=\"5243\" data-end=\"5274\">Final Admission Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5276\" data-end=\"5464\">The final step in the admission process is seat confirmation. Once payment is successfully completed or the education loan/EMI is approved, the student&rsquo;s admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5466\" data-end=\"5567\">This step marks the completion of the admission journey and the beginning of the academic enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5569\" data-end=\"5572\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"5574\" data-end=\"5603\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5605\" data-end=\"5646\">After successful completion of this step:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5648\" data-end=\"5861\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkwzx8\" data-start=\"5648\" data-end=\"5685\">Admission is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z1q48m\" data-start=\"5686\" data-end=\"5730\">Seat is reserved in the selected program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17xhzvc\" data-start=\"5731\" data-end=\"5774\">Student record is updated in the system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f2ijgs\" data-start=\"5775\" data-end=\"5820\">Access to academic resources is activated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3dlx3\" data-start=\"5821\" data-end=\"5861\">Admission documentation is finalized</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5863\" data-end=\"5866\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"727l4k\" data-start=\"5868\" data-end=\"5902\">Importance of Seat Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5904\" data-end=\"5956\">This stage is the most important because it ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5958\" data-end=\"6109\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8gawid\" data-start=\"5958\" data-end=\"6001\">Guaranteed admission in the BCA program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"97aeqp\" data-start=\"6002\" data-end=\"6031\">Permanent seat allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lm5fsa\" data-start=\"6032\" data-end=\"6068\">Completion of enrollment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1szaado\" data-start=\"6069\" data-end=\"6109\">Readiness to begin academic sessions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6111\" data-end=\"6175\">Without this step, admission remains incomplete and unconfirmed.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6177\" data-end=\"6180\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p1ofsx\" data-start=\"6182\" data-end=\"6218\">Complete Admission Process Summary</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6220\" data-end=\"6251\">To simplify the entire journey:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9rzptd\" data-start=\"6253\" data-end=\"6285\">Step 1: Submit Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6286\" data-end=\"6341\">Fill in online form with academic and personal details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bazspl\" data-start=\"6343\" data-end=\"6374\">Step 2: Enroll in Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6375\" data-end=\"6424\">Verify eligibility and confirm program selection.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kyof3i\" data-start=\"6426\" data-end=\"6456\">Step 3: Complete Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6457\" data-end=\"6500\">Choose one-time payment or EMI/loan option.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"62gr72\" data-start=\"6502\" data-end=\"6527\">Step 4: Secure Seat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6528\" data-end=\"6585\">Receive final admission confirmation and seat allocation.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"745\">The eligibility criteria for the Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program define the basic academic qualification required for students who wish to pursue a career in computer applications, software development, and information technology.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"950\">This eligibility framework ensures that students entering the program have the necessary academic foundation to understand programming concepts, mathematical logic, and computer fundamentals effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1238\">The criteria are designed to be inclusive so that students from multiple educational boards and academic backgrounds can apply without unnecessary restrictions. This makes the BCA program accessible to a wide range of learners who are interested in building a future in the IT industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1243\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9onb20\" data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1293\">Minimum Academic Requirement for BCA Admission</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13o1yha\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1317\">Basic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1422\">To be eligible for admission into the BCA program, a student must meet one of the following conditions:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1569\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bd1yrv\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1510\">Must have successfully passed the <strong data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1499\">10+2 (Higher Secondary) examination</strong><br data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1502\"><strong data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1508\">OR</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12njkx6\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1569\">Must be <strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1569\">currently appearing for the 10+2 examination</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1654\">This ensures that both completed and final-year students can apply for the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1659\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"90dtz3\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1710\">Accepted Educational Boards for BCA Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1887\">The BCA program accepts students from all major recognized educational boards in India and abroad. This ensures equal opportunity for students from different academic systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1892\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ppm60i\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1917\">State Board Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"2023\">Students who have completed their 10+2 from any recognized State Board are fully eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2172\">State Boards follow curriculum guidelines approved by respective state education authorities and are widely accepted for higher education programs.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2193\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2329\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r20ipu\" data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2229\">Recognized by state governments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s8yyxy\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2277\">Strong academic foundation in core subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nbgyrj\" data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2329\">Suitable for technical and professional courses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2334\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xyhe0j\" data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2382\">CBSE (Central Board of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2435\">CBSE students are fully eligible for BCA admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2593\">CBSE is one of the most widely accepted boards in India and is known for its structured syllabus and focus on mathematics, science, and analytical thinking.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2614\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"augqa2\" data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2645\">National-level recognition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1imf693\" data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2687\">Strong focus on logic and mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lh2qar\" data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2739\">Ideal foundation for programming and IT careers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b0ffe9\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2792\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2840\">Students from NIOS are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2983\">NIOS provides flexible learning opportunities through open schooling, making it suitable for students who could not attend regular schooling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3004\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3165\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ogflii\" data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3036\">Government-recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmr98s\" data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3065\">Flexible learning system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yxskv1\" data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3118\">Suitable for working or non-traditional students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l60dlh\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3165\">Fully valid for higher education admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3170\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n4i1v5\" data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3223\">ICSE (Indian Certificate of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3225\" data-end=\"3270\">ICSE students are eligible for BCA admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3385\">ICSE is known for its detailed curriculum and strong emphasis on English language skills and conceptual learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"3387\" data-end=\"3406\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3540\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lwbeoq\" data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3453\">Strong communication and analytical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"47i82e\" data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3489\">Concept-based learning approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eng399\" data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3540\">Useful for documentation and technical writing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3545\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x008qw\" data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3582\">IB (International Baccalaureate)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3584\" data-end=\"3636\">Students from IB board are eligible for the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3757\">IB is an internationally recognized curriculum focusing on research, critical thinking, and global education standards.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3778\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3906\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uq5uvk\" data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3817\">International academic recognition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywe4t0\" data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3857\">Research-oriented learning approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14lsjoa\" data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3906\">Strong analytical and problem-solving skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3908\" data-end=\"3911\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tkcnz\" data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"3980\">IGCSE (International General Certificate of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3982\" data-end=\"4029\">IGCSE students are also eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4130\">This international qualification emphasizes practical understanding and application-based learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4151\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4260\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xtmy7i\" data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4189\">Globally recognized certification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14408bi\" data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4230\">Application-based academic structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16xddi3\" data-start=\"4231\" data-end=\"4260\">Strong conceptual clarity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4265\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"134pbc9\" data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4323\">Eligibility for Students Appearing in 10+2 Examination</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bbvfnb\" data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4359\">Important Admission Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4361\" data-end=\"4533\">One of the most student-friendly aspects of the BCA eligibility criteria is that students who are currently appearing for their 10+2 examination are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4535\" data-end=\"4638\">This means students do not need to wait for their final results before beginning the admission process.</p>', '<p data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"819\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) fee structure is designed to offer complete transparency, flexibility, and financial convenience for students coming from different academic and economic backgrounds. A well-structured fee system ensures that students can plan their education without confusion about hidden costs or unexpected charges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"1182\">This program provides multiple payment options such as semester-wise, yearly, and one-time payment plans, allowing students to choose a method that best suits their financial situation. Along with tuition fees, additional charges such as registration fees and examination fees are applicable depending on the student&rsquo;s category (India, SAARC, or International).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1335\">Understanding the complete fee structure is important because it gives a clear picture of the total investment required for completing the BCA program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1340\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rpalu4\" data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1365\">Total BCA Course Fees</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yx9wzi\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1390\">Complete Program Fee</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1408\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1418\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1454\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total BCA Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1466\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹150,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1684\">The total fee of ₹150,000 represents the complete tuition cost of the BCA program. This amount covers academic learning, structured curriculum delivery, and access to program resources throughout the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1829\">However, students must also consider additional academic charges such as registration and examination fees to calculate the total overall cost.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1834\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1bffc1j\" data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1875\">Flexible Payment Options for BCA Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"2065\">To make higher education more accessible, the BCA program offers flexible payment structures. Students can select a payment method based on their financial comfort and planning preference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2070\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83is7d\" data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2097\">1. Yearly Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2168\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2124\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2124\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2114\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2124\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2168\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2168\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2148\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2168\">₹50,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3ze0g2\" data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2202\">Understanding Yearly Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2351\">In this option, the total program fee is divided into equal yearly installments. Students pay ₹50,000 every year during the duration of the course.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15xlm0b\" data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2383\">Benefits of Yearly Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2528\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pwfyk\" data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2421\">Easier annual financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1axnroo\" data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2455\">Reduced frequency of payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jlcedq\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2492\">Suitable for long-term budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vsjv7q\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2528\">Simple fee management structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2611\">This option is ideal for students who prefer stable yearly financial commitments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2616\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1minad7\" data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2650\">2. Semester-Wise Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2727\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2677\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2677\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2667\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2677\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2727\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2727\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2703\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2727\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹25,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xzc3ti\" data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2763\">Understanding Semester Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2855\">The semester-wise option divides the total fee into smaller, more manageable installments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1inq21m\" data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2894\">Benefits of Semester-Wise Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"3048\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djvlbw\" data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2938\">Lower financial burden per installment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpci95\" data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2976\">Better affordability for families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l46hqv\" data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3017\">Easier monthly and academic planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tr47oy\" data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3048\">Flexible payment structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3140\">This is one of the most preferred options due to its affordability and ease of management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3145\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yt3u32\" data-start=\"3147\" data-end=\"3181\">3. One-Time Full Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3250\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3208\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3208\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3198\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3208\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3250\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3250\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3238\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3250\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹150,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19lh2mc\" data-start=\"3252\" data-end=\"3286\">Understanding One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3288\" data-end=\"3373\">Students can pay the entire program fee in a single payment at the time of admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v322b1\" data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3407\">Benefits of One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3559\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7nnhg0\" data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3448\">No future payment tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lspsrq\" data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3481\">Simplified financial process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vzjbo3\" data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3525\">Immediate completion of fee obligations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dqk0ex\" data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3559\">Stress-free academic planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3561\" data-end=\"3668\">This option is suitable for students who prefer complete financial closure at the beginning of the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3673\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1euoihx\" data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3708\">Additional Fees for BCA Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3879\">Apart from tuition fees, students are required to pay additional academic charges. These include registration and examination fees, which are mandatory for all students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3884\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qqn3gu\" data-start=\"3886\" data-end=\"3923\">Additional Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"4033\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3946\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3946\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3936\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"3946\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"4033\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"3995\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"3985\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"3995\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4033\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4014\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4033\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4038\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1opp6jc\" data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4067\">Registration Fee (India)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4138\">The registration fee is a one-time charge collected during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17p4kli\" data-start=\"4140\" data-end=\"4171\">Purpose of Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4344\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dpq5xe\" data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4214\">Student enrollment in academic system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvgloy\" data-start=\"4215\" data-end=\"4256\">Creation of official academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ddj9bm\" data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4301\">Access to learning platforms and systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d8sqb7\" data-start=\"4302\" data-end=\"4344\">Admission processing and documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4413\">Since it is a one-time fee, it is not required in subsequent years.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4415\" data-end=\"4418\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mswdcy\" data-start=\"4420\" data-end=\"4446\">Examination Fee (India)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4543\">The examination fee is charged annually and is required for appearing in semester examinations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16cnfi4\" data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4575\">Purpose of Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4577\" data-end=\"4690\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gd8178\" data-start=\"4577\" data-end=\"4604\">Conducting examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rvxnd9\" data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4632\">Answer sheet evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xrnz0q\" data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4654\">Result processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9y4mk\" data-start=\"4655\" data-end=\"4690\">Academic administration support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4692\" data-end=\"4759\">Students must pay this fee every year to remain eligible for exams.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4761\" data-end=\"4764\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1b3aond\" data-start=\"4766\" data-end=\"4802\">Additional Fees for SAARC Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4804\" data-end=\"4930\">Students from SAARC countries have a slightly different fee structure designed for regional international academic processing.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4932\" data-end=\"5032\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4932\" data-end=\"4953\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4932\" data-end=\"4953\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4932\" data-end=\"4943\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4943\" data-end=\"4953\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4964\" data-end=\"5032\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4964\" data-end=\"4994\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4964\" data-end=\"4983\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4983\" data-end=\"4994\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4995\" data-end=\"5032\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4995\" data-end=\"5013\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5013\" data-end=\"5032\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5034\" data-end=\"5037\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"sqvnlc\" data-start=\"5039\" data-end=\"5075\">Understanding SAARC Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5077\" data-end=\"5192\">This structure is designed to support neighboring country students while maintaining standardized academic systems.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5194\" data-end=\"5341\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b0lv88\" data-start=\"5194\" data-end=\"5253\">Higher registration fee due to international processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ac18d\" data-start=\"5254\" data-end=\"5292\">Slightly increased examination fee</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kziv8y\" data-start=\"5293\" data-end=\"5341\">Ensures smooth cross-border education access</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5343\" data-end=\"5346\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"puptap\" data-start=\"5348\" data-end=\"5392\">Additional Fees for International Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5394\" data-end=\"5474\">For students outside India and SAARC regions, fees are structured in US dollars.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5476\" data-end=\"5579\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5476\" data-end=\"5497\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5476\" data-end=\"5497\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5476\" data-end=\"5487\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5487\" data-end=\"5497\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5508\" data-end=\"5579\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5508\" data-end=\"5544\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5508\" data-end=\"5536\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5536\" data-end=\"5544\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5545\" data-end=\"5579\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5545\" data-end=\"5563\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5563\" data-end=\"5579\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"828\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) in Artificial Intelligence and Data Science is a modern, industry-focused undergraduate program designed for students who want to build strong careers in AI engineering, machine learning, data science, and intelligent systems development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"1135\">This program is structured to provide a strong foundation in programming, mathematics, and software engineering in the early semesters, followed by advanced specialization in artificial intelligence, predictive analytics, deep learning, natural language processing (NLP), and large language models (LLMs).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1371\">Unlike traditional computer programs, this specialization focuses heavily on real-world AI applications such as recommendation systems, chatbots, generative AI tools, predictive modeling, and data-driven business intelligence systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1545\">Students are trained using industry-relevant tools and technologies such as Python, TensorFlow, Power BI, Tableau, machine learning frameworks, and generative AI platforms.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1550\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vm8xm8\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1589\">Why Choose BCA in AI &amp; Data Science</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1789\">Artificial Intelligence and Data Science are among the fastest-growing fields in the global technology industry. Every modern company relies on data-driven decision-making and AI-powered automation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1861\">This program prepares students for high-demand careers by focusing on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"2193\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c08a5f\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1908\">Machine learning and predictive analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1io3fp8\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1956\">Artificial intelligence and neural networks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bb71eb\" data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1994\">Natural language processing (NLP)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19kn1z3\" data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2030\">Deep learning and generative AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qnhsze\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2079\">Data visualization and business intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1diuysz\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2118\">Big data analytics and data mining</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f44x3d\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2149\">AI-driven decision systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1auel6\" data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2193\">Prompt engineering and LLM applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2328\">These skills are essential in industries such as IT services, fintech, healthcare, e-commerce, automation, and cloud-based analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2333\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"m8vj45\" data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2384\">Semester 1: Programming Foundations &amp; AI Basics</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2403\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2533\">The first semester builds strong foundations in programming, mathematics, and logical thinking required for AI and data science.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2538\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1r\" data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2572\">Courses Covered in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vaosqc\" data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2585\">English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2678\">Develops communication skills required for technical documentation and AI project reporting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5cl54f\" data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2711\">Fundamentals of Mathematics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2803\">Builds logical reasoning, algebra, and mathematical modeling required for machine learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d4mtri\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2832\">Problem Solving using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2907\">Introduces programming logic, loops, functions, and algorithm development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5rc8r8\" data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2934\">Computer Architecture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"3001\">Explains system-level computing, memory, and processor operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f55vj2\" data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3034\">Essentials of Generative AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3086\">Introduces modern AI systems and generative models.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fpnbv7\" data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3109\">C Programming Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3155\">Hands-on coding practice and problem-solving.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3160\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gveden\" data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3195\">Skills Developed in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3403\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gpcjwl\" data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3225\">Programming fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jttlyt\" data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3246\">Algorithm design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyz0gf\" data-start=\"3247\" data-end=\"3268\">Logical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jl9g41\" data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3293\">Debugging techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e4ht0g\" data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3320\">Structured programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vmb5f1\" data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3346\">Mathematical modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19k5mhe\" data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3381\">Artificial intelligence basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mxe3no\" data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3403\">Code optimization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3408\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e52\" data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3441\">Certifications in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3629\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvacll\" data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3470\">Programming Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wi8mov\" data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3499\">C Programming Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tpmbhc\" data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3527\">Algorithms Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jekct3\" data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3554\">Data Structures Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199axno\" data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3592\">AI Foundations: Thinking Machines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1snw0vn\" data-start=\"3593\" data-end=\"3629\">AI Foundations: Machine Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3631\" data-end=\"3634\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"146dl2b\" data-start=\"3636\" data-end=\"3684\">Semester 2: Data Structures &amp; Database Systems</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3703\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3799\">This semester focuses on data handling, database systems, and structured programming concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3804\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1o\" data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"3838\">Courses Covered in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sr0i3q\" data-start=\"3840\" data-end=\"3865\">Communicative English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3924\">Improves technical communication and documentation skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"np08ta\" data-start=\"3926\" data-end=\"3946\">Operating System</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"4005\">Covers memory management, scheduling, and process control.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m64tpx\" data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4034\">Data Structures using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4083\">Teaches stacks, queues, trees, and linked lists.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1581opq\" data-start=\"4085\" data-end=\"4116\">Relational Database Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4161\">Introduces SQL and database design concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yhpx33\" data-start=\"4163\" data-end=\"4186\">Data Structures Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4187\" data-end=\"4231\">Practical implementation of data structures.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fealwj\" data-start=\"4233\" data-end=\"4246\">RDBMS Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4247\" data-end=\"4269\">Hands-on SQL practice.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4274\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedek\" data-start=\"4276\" data-end=\"4309\">Skills Developed in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4311\" data-end=\"4467\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mo16ta\" data-start=\"4311\" data-end=\"4330\">Data structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bfesqn\" data-start=\"4331\" data-end=\"4350\">SQL programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13xezb3\" data-start=\"4351\" data-end=\"4370\">Database design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r1zcbz\" data-start=\"4371\" data-end=\"4400\">Tree and graph structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7p0jkg\" data-start=\"4401\" data-end=\"4423\">Process management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s8n96i\" data-start=\"4424\" data-end=\"4445\">Memory management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o630fv\" data-start=\"4446\" data-end=\"4467\">Database security</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4472\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e51\" data-start=\"4474\" data-end=\"4505\">Certifications in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4507\" data-end=\"4665\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bs6ghk\" data-start=\"4507\" data-end=\"4533\">SQL Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e55t85\" data-start=\"4534\" data-end=\"4558\">Database Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mtrqtj\" data-start=\"4559\" data-end=\"4590\">Data Structures Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wrtg8v\" data-start=\"4591\" data-end=\"4609\">Git Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hgrhyj\" data-start=\"4610\" data-end=\"4638\">Learning SQL Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nt6hyd\" data-start=\"4639\" data-end=\"4665\">Database Core Concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4667\" data-end=\"4670\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kwumoa\" data-start=\"4672\" data-end=\"4730\">Semester 3: Python, Software Engineering &amp; AI Foundation</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"4732\" data-end=\"4749\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4751\" data-end=\"4849\">This semester introduces Python programming, software engineering principles, and AI fundamentals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4851\" data-end=\"4854\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1p\" data-start=\"4856\" data-end=\"4888\">Courses Covered in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"116sc7f\" data-start=\"4890\" data-end=\"4912\">Python Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4913\" data-end=\"4961\">Core Python programming for AI and data science.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ec7haw\" data-start=\"4963\" data-end=\"5000\">Design and Analysis of Algorithms</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5001\" data-end=\"5050\">Algorithm efficiency and optimization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tasahc\" data-start=\"5052\" data-end=\"5076\">Software Engineering</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5077\" data-end=\"5130\">Software development lifecycle and Agile methodology.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ah5kss\" data-start=\"5132\" data-end=\"5153\">Computer Networks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5154\" data-end=\"5202\">Networking concepts and communication protocols.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ubipe5\" data-start=\"5204\" data-end=\"5217\">ESG in IT</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5218\" data-end=\"5257\">Ethical and environmental IT practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ynkm9m\" data-start=\"5259\" data-end=\"5267\">Labs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5268\" data-end=\"5304\">Python and algorithm implementation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5306\" data-end=\"5309\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedel\" data-start=\"5311\" data-end=\"5344\">Skills Developed in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5346\" data-end=\"5512\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t12n5x\" data-start=\"5346\" data-end=\"5368\">Python programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1zm1nn\" data-start=\"5369\" data-end=\"5388\">API development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lgxlv5\" data-start=\"5389\" data-end=\"5409\">Software testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"159s9lp\" data-start=\"5410\" data-end=\"5431\">Agile development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"164618v\" data-start=\"5432\" data-end=\"5461\">Debugging and refactoring</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9evc2\" data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5484\">Data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zqb8y1\" data-start=\"5485\" data-end=\"5512\">Technical documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5514\" data-end=\"5517\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e50\" data-start=\"5519\" data-end=\"5550\">Certifications in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5552\" data-end=\"5805\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6bj2a\" data-start=\"5552\" data-end=\"5581\">Python Essential Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rhunr4\" data-start=\"5582\" data-end=\"5603\">Python Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14hbo9g\" data-start=\"5604\" data-end=\"5632\">Data Science Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mqzug\" data-start=\"5633\" data-end=\"5660\">Software Testing Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19gr282\" data-start=\"5661\" data-end=\"5688\">Networking Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bzkwnq\" data-start=\"5689\" data-end=\"5710\">Agile Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y16lcq\" data-start=\"5711\" data-end=\"5728\">DevOps Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wrtg8v\" data-start=\"5729\" data-end=\"5747\">Git Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3jgmb\" data-start=\"5748\" data-end=\"5775\">Python for Data Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gfvbko\" data-start=\"5776\" data-end=\"5805\">Data Science Fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5807\" data-end=\"5810\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12if5cd\" data-start=\"5812\" data-end=\"5861\">Semester 4: Artificial Intelligence Foundations</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"5863\" data-end=\"5880\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5882\" data-end=\"5977\">This semester focuses on AI fundamentals, statistical learning, and intelligent systems design.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5979\" data-end=\"5982\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1m\" data-start=\"5984\" data-end=\"6016\">Courses Covered in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mvwlhy\" data-start=\"6018\" data-end=\"6038\">Web Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6039\" data-end=\"6097\">Basics of web development using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1shzesj\" data-start=\"6099\" data-end=\"6119\">Java Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6120\" data-end=\"6176\">Object-oriented programming and application development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t7wrm0\" data-start=\"6178\" data-end=\"6221\">Fundamentals of Artificial Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6222\" data-end=\"6280\">Introduction to AI systems and problem-solving techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kqk69n\" data-start=\"6282\" data-end=\"6317\">Probability &amp; Statistics for AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6318\" data-end=\"6370\">Mathematical foundation for machine learning models.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wd8pb8\" data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6399\">Quantitative Techniques</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6400\" data-end=\"6439\">Data analysis and statistical modeling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ynkm9m\" data-start=\"6441\" data-end=\"6449\">Labs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6450\" data-end=\"6483\">Java and web technology practice.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6485\" data-end=\"6488\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedei\" data-start=\"6490\" data-end=\"6523\">Skills Developed in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6525\" data-end=\"6745\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j0e9u7\" data-start=\"6525\" data-end=\"6565\">Artificial intelligence fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jpbots\" data-start=\"6566\" data-end=\"6593\">Machine learning basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7dft6x\" data-start=\"6594\" data-end=\"6610\">NLP concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b1f1c5\" data-start=\"6611\" data-end=\"6634\">Feature engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p7xbpd\" data-start=\"6635\" data-end=\"6659\">Statistical analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10w4njb\" data-start=\"6660\" data-end=\"6683\">Pattern recognition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kooddk\" data-start=\"6684\" data-end=\"6713\">Intelligent system design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8gi2oh\" data-start=\"6714\" data-end=\"6745\">Web application development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6747\" data-end=\"6750\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4z\" data-start=\"6752\" data-end=\"6783\">Certifications in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6785\" data-end=\"6992\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199axno\" data-start=\"6785\" data-end=\"6822\">AI Foundations: Thinking Machines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1snw0vn\" data-start=\"6823\" data-end=\"6859\">AI Foundations: Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3jgmb\" data-start=\"6860\" data-end=\"6887\">Python for Data Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dukl1h\" data-start=\"6888\" data-end=\"6911\">Data Science Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q68lp2\" data-start=\"6912\" data-end=\"6942\">Data Analytics Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pfmp2j\" data-start=\"6943\" data-end=\"6972\">Data Cleaning with Python</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vnciyd\" data-start=\"6973\" data-end=\"6992\">Power BI Basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6994\" data-end=\"6997\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iep48k\" data-start=\"6999\" data-end=\"7044\">Semester 5: Machine Learning &amp; Data Science</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"7046\" data-end=\"7063\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7065\" data-end=\"7152\">This semester focuses on machine learning, data mining, and AI-driven decision systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7154\" data-end=\"7157\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1n\" data-start=\"7159\" data-end=\"7191\">Courses Covered in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wp6bxe\" data-start=\"7193\" data-end=\"7220\">Blockchain Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7221\" data-end=\"7272\">Distributed systems and decentralized applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"o2d2ng\" data-start=\"7274\" data-end=\"7310\">Introduction to Machine Learning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7311\" data-end=\"7355\">Supervised and unsupervised learning models.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jt35xu\" data-start=\"7357\" data-end=\"7394\">Data Mining &amp; Predictive Modeling</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7395\" data-end=\"7435\">Extracting patterns from large datasets.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l5ah4x\" data-start=\"7437\" data-end=\"7464\">Data Visualization &amp; BI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7465\" data-end=\"7509\">Business intelligence and reporting systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14mnitd\" data-start=\"7511\" data-end=\"7549\">Prompt Engineering &amp; Generative AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7550\" data-end=\"7589\">AI model interaction and prompt design.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tjgynz\" data-start=\"7591\" data-end=\"7622\">Advanced Software Practices</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7623\" data-end=\"7659\">AI-integrated development workflows.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7661\" data-end=\"7664\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedej\" data-start=\"7666\" data-end=\"7699\">Skills Developed in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7701\" data-end=\"7915\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iewhl1\" data-start=\"7701\" data-end=\"7732\">Machine learning algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1arslzu\" data-start=\"7733\" data-end=\"7766\">Regression and classification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kyus5p\" data-start=\"7767\" data-end=\"7792\">Clustering techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dp4bjy\" data-start=\"7793\" data-end=\"7816\">Data mining methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ndk8dc\" data-start=\"7817\" data-end=\"7840\">Predictive modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nobe9n\" data-start=\"7841\" data-end=\"7866\">Business intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3tb8i\" data-start=\"7867\" data-end=\"7892\">Generative AI systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jjpir9\" data-start=\"7893\" data-end=\"7915\">Prompt engineering</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7917\" data-end=\"7920\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4y\" data-start=\"7922\" data-end=\"7953\">Certifications in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7955\" data-end=\"8123\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"su3hj9\" data-start=\"7955\" data-end=\"7986\">Machine Learning Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlqqq8\" data-start=\"7987\" data-end=\"8022\">Data Visualization Storytelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1obeiz5\" data-start=\"8023\" data-end=\"8046\">Power BI Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x3bmte\" data-start=\"8047\" data-end=\"8067\">Tableau Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ckc3we\" data-start=\"8068\" data-end=\"8092\">Python Data Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sdi9k9\" data-start=\"8093\" data-end=\"8123\">Generative AI for Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8125\" data-end=\"8128\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1k05fr6\" data-start=\"8130\" data-end=\"8179\">Semester 6: Deep Learning &amp; Advanced AI Systems</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"8181\" data-end=\"8198\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8200\" data-end=\"8283\">The final semester focuses on deep learning, NLP, LLMs, and responsible AI systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8285\" data-end=\"8288\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1k\" data-start=\"8290\" data-end=\"8322\">Courses Covered in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s4ic4m\" data-start=\"8324\" data-end=\"8341\">Deep Learning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8342\" data-end=\"8388\">Neural networks and advanced AI architectures.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rv5ea6\" data-start=\"8390\" data-end=\"8421\">Natural Language Processing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8422\" data-end=\"8458\">Text processing and language models.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1plvpmw\" data-start=\"8460\" data-end=\"8498\">Large Language Models &amp; Agentic AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8499\" data-end=\"8534\">ChatGPT-like systems and AI agents.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15adjep\" data-start=\"8536\" data-end=\"8568\">Explainable &amp; Responsible AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8569\" data-end=\"8603\">Ethical AI and governance systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19kz0wv\" data-start=\"8605\" data-end=\"8622\">Final Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8623\" data-end=\"8662\">Industry-based AI solution development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8664\" data-end=\"8667\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedeg\" data-start=\"8669\" data-end=\"8702\">Skills Developed in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8704\" data-end=\"8862\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ceel10\" data-start=\"8704\" data-end=\"8728\">Deep learning models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ro70n8\" data-start=\"8729\" data-end=\"8748\">Neural networks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1upeeun\" data-start=\"8749\" data-end=\"8771\">Transformer models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxffe4\" data-start=\"8772\" data-end=\"8787\">NLP systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ma833q\" data-start=\"8788\" data-end=\"8807\">LLM development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x267nd\" data-start=\"8808\" data-end=\"8825\">AI deployment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l653vo\" data-start=\"8826\" data-end=\"8844\">Responsible AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14wxt8u\" data-start=\"8845\" data-end=\"8862\">AI governance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8864\" data-end=\"8867\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4x\" data-start=\"8869\" data-end=\"8900\">Certifications in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8902\" data-end=\"9049\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ofy30c\" data-start=\"8902\" data-end=\"8933\">Neural Networks Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14jucpz\" data-start=\"8934\" data-end=\"8963\">Machine Learning Advanced</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t5tk54\" data-start=\"8964\" data-end=\"8990\">NLP &amp; LLM Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m8160b\" data-start=\"8991\" data-end=\"9019\">TensorFlow Deep Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jxlwpy\" data-start=\"9020\" data-end=\"9049\">Prompt Engineering for AI</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 150000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(308, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 276, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 01:23:33', '2026-06-16 07:10:23', '<p data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"738\">The admission process for the Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) program is designed to be simple, transparent, and fully structured so that students can complete their enrollment without confusion or delays.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"1008\">This process ensures that every student goes through a clear step-by-step system&mdash;from submitting the application form to securing final admission. It is built to make higher education accessible to students from different academic backgrounds and financial conditions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1160\">The entire admission journey is divided into four structured stages, each playing an important role in confirming student enrollment into the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1165\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17qwtd3\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1200\">Step 1: Submit Application Form</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12f7zho\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1236\">Beginning the Admission Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1417\">The first step in the B.Com admission process is submitting the online application form. This is the official starting point where students register their interest in the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1617\">At this stage, students are required to carefully enter their personal, academic, and program-related details. This information is used for eligibility verification and further admission processing.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1622\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qry1vp\" data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1663\">Details Required in Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1716\">Students must provide accurate information such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"2049\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b5yh2l\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1752\">Full name and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vrosch\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1784\">Contact number and email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2g8v9\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1842\">10+2 academic details (completed or appearing status)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gzzert\" data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1925\">Educational board information (CBSE, State Board, ICSE, NIOS, IB, IGCSE, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16cjui2\" data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1970\">Stream details (Commerce, Arts, Science)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1987wpc\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2000\">Program selection (B.Com)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dw9kt4\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2049\">Basic identification and academic background</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2054\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25y54a\" data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2095\">Importance of Application Submission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2153\">Submitting the application form is important because it:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2325\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8vdfzp\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2195\">Creates an official admission record</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vzfmvj\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2231\">Starts eligibility verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10uhdxg\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2286\">Initiates communication with admission authorities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ryc8v\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2325\">Opens access to enrollment process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2424\">Incorrect or incomplete details may delay admission, so accuracy is very important at this stage.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2429\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gintl4\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2463\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yxgx1j\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2508\">Program Selection and Verification Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2670\">After submitting the application, students move to the enrollment stage. This step ensures that the student is correctly assigned to the selected B.Com program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2799\">It also includes verification of academic details and eligibility to confirm that the student meets all admission requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2804\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xhta3f\" data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2835\">What Happens in This Stage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"3019\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l9mw54\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2867\">Selection of B.Com program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1asjco1\" data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2906\">Verification of academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mlr428\" data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2947\">Confirmation of eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rl2vm\" data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2985\">Validation of application details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6lojmc\" data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"3019\">Preparation for payment stage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3024\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9se09k\" data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3059\">Importance of Enrollment Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3101\">This step is crucial because it ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3291\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"153twqr\" data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3145\">Only eligible students proceed further</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lgadn7\" data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3190\">Program selection is correctly finalized</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rys1bt\" data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3234\">Application errors are identified early</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ovquop\" data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3291\">Admission process remains structured and transparent</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3360\">It acts as a bridge between application submission and fee payment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3362\" data-end=\"3365\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1jgmfxh\" data-start=\"3367\" data-end=\"3401\">Step 3: Complete Payment Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"i8aam4\" data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3434\">Flexible Fee Payment Options</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3611\">Once enrollment is verified, students proceed to the payment stage. The B.Com program offers flexible payment methods to support students from different financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3613\" data-end=\"3691\">Students can choose a payment option that best suits their financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3696\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3726\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h4qv18\" data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3758\">1. One-Time Payment Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3760\" data-end=\"3823\">Students can pay the full program fee at once during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q4c1cr\" data-start=\"3825\" data-end=\"3838\">Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3992\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137fx3t\" data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3880\">Full fee paid in a single transaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"55bge1\" data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3924\">No future installment tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z6dhw4\" data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3959\">Immediate financial completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jlse4m\" data-start=\"3960\" data-end=\"3992\">Simplified admission process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4007\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4136\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z00784\" data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4040\">Stress-free academic journey</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m2y4o1\" data-start=\"4041\" data-end=\"4066\">No recurring payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rp0oyh\" data-start=\"4067\" data-end=\"4100\">Faster admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nu66xq\" data-start=\"4101\" data-end=\"4136\">Ideal for fully funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4141\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ano7td\" data-start=\"4143\" data-end=\"4177\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4268\">Students can also choose installment-based payment through EMI or education loan options.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q4c1cr\" data-start=\"4270\" data-end=\"4283\">Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4284\" data-end=\"4423\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mljhp3\" data-start=\"4284\" data-end=\"4316\">Monthly installment payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kpqagi\" data-start=\"4317\" data-end=\"4339\">Easy EMI structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wu91dl\" data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4384\">0% interest option (subject to approval)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"190cxp\" data-start=\"4385\" data-end=\"4423\">Financial flexibility for students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4438\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4439\" data-end=\"4585\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sqb714\" data-start=\"4439\" data-end=\"4467\">Reduces financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12jjiqo\" data-start=\"4468\" data-end=\"4503\">Makes education more accessible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17y84z4\" data-start=\"4504\" data-end=\"4545\">Helps in long-term financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wrwm29\" data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4585\">Suitable for middle-income families</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4587\" data-end=\"4686\">This option ensures that financial limitations do not stop students from pursuing higher education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4691\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mbgkrq\" data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4723\">Importance of Payment Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4725\" data-end=\"4767\">The payment stage is essential because it:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4769\" data-end=\"4925\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzf56r\" data-start=\"4769\" data-end=\"4800\">Confirms student commitment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v31wg\" data-start=\"4801\" data-end=\"4835\">Activates admission processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p98phc\" data-start=\"4836\" data-end=\"4879\">Moves application toward final approval</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g5xcrf\" data-start=\"4880\" data-end=\"4925\">Ensures eligibility for seat confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4927\" data-end=\"4991\">Without payment or loan approval, admission cannot be completed.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4993\" data-end=\"4996\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7jvyu7\" data-start=\"4998\" data-end=\"5024\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2xiv4b\" data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5063\">Final Admission Confirmation Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5065\" data-end=\"5226\">The final step in the admission process is seat confirmation. Once payment is completed or EMI/loan is approved, the student&rsquo;s admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5228\" data-end=\"5339\">This step marks the completion of the admission journey and allows the student to begin their academic program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5341\" data-end=\"5344\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"5346\" data-end=\"5375\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5377\" data-end=\"5418\">After successful completion of this step:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5420\" data-end=\"5630\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkwzx8\" data-start=\"5420\" data-end=\"5457\">Admission is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"160xfci\" data-start=\"5458\" data-end=\"5499\">Seat is reserved in the B.Com program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17xhzvc\" data-start=\"5500\" data-end=\"5543\">Student record is updated in the system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f2ijgs\" data-start=\"5544\" data-end=\"5589\">Access to academic resources is activated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3dlx3\" data-start=\"5590\" data-end=\"5630\">Admission documentation is finalized</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5632\" data-end=\"5635\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"727l4k\" data-start=\"5637\" data-end=\"5671\">Importance of Seat Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5673\" data-end=\"5725\">This stage is the most important because it ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5727\" data-end=\"5864\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vx9cr9\" data-start=\"5727\" data-end=\"5766\">Guaranteed admission in the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"97aeqp\" data-start=\"5767\" data-end=\"5796\">Permanent seat allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lm5fsa\" data-start=\"5797\" data-end=\"5833\">Completion of enrollment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15asbhw\" data-start=\"5834\" data-end=\"5864\">Smooth academic onboarding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5866\" data-end=\"5914\">Without this step, admission remains incomplete.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5916\" data-end=\"5919\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16devak\" data-start=\"5921\" data-end=\"5963\">Complete B.Com Admission Process Summary</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5965\" data-end=\"5996\">To simplify the entire journey:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9rzptd\" data-start=\"5998\" data-end=\"6030\">Step 1: Submit Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6031\" data-end=\"6076\">Fill in personal and academic details online.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bazspl\" data-start=\"6078\" data-end=\"6109\">Step 2: Enroll in Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6110\" data-end=\"6159\">Verify eligibility and confirm program selection.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kyof3i\" data-start=\"6161\" data-end=\"6191\">Step 3: Complete Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6192\" data-end=\"6235\">Choose one-time payment or EMI/loan option.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"62gr72\" data-start=\"6237\" data-end=\"6262\">Step 4: Secure Seat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6263\" data-end=\"6320\">Receive final admission confirmation and seat allocation.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"768\">The Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) eligibility criteria define the minimum academic qualification required for students who wish to pursue undergraduate studies in commerce, accounting, finance, taxation, and business management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"1078\">These eligibility standards ensure that students entering the program have the necessary academic foundation in subjects like mathematics, business studies, economics, and basic accounting principles. This foundation helps students understand advanced concepts in commerce more effectively during the course.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1263\">The eligibility structure is designed to be inclusive and flexible, allowing students from different educational boards and academic streams to apply without unnecessary restrictions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1268\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1bfl0lz\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1322\">Minimum Qualification Required for B.Com Admission</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ra33z9\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1353\">Basic Academic Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1463\">To be eligible for admission into the B.Com program, a student must fulfill one of the following conditions:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bd1yrv\" data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1551\">Must have successfully passed the <strong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1540\">10+2 (Higher Secondary) examination</strong><br data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1543\"><strong data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1549\">OR</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12njkx6\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1610\">Must be <strong data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1610\">currently appearing for the 10+2 examination</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1714\">This ensures that both completed and final-year school students are eligible to apply for the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1719\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"f6eknm\" data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1772\">Accepted Educational Boards for B.Com Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1969\">Students from multiple recognized national and international boards are eligible for admission into the B.Com program. This ensures equal opportunity for learners from different academic systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1974\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ppm60i\" data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"1999\">State Board Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2111\">Students who have completed their 10+2 from any recognized State Board are fully eligible for B.Com admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2251\">State Boards are governed by respective state education authorities and provide a strong academic foundation in commerce-related subjects.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2272\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2467\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uubd4i\" data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2324\">Recognized by State Government education boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oyvxnz\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2380\">Strong foundation in business studies and economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dv957a\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2428\">Suitable for commerce and finance education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ropjyg\" data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2467\">Widely accepted for higher studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2472\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xyhe0j\" data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2520\">CBSE (Central Board of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2575\">CBSE students are fully eligible for B.Com admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2724\">CBSE is one of the most widely recognized boards in India and offers a structured curriculum focused on analytical thinking and conceptual clarity.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2745\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2944\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s0zpef\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2781\">National-level recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nsjfmw\" data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2838\">Strong focus on commerce, economics, and mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9hzuln\" data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2889\">Builds analytical and logical reasoning skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9bj06t\" data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2944\">Highly preferred for professional commerce courses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2949\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b0ffe9\" data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2997\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3057\">Students from NIOS are fully eligible for B.Com admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3158\">NIOS is a government-recognized open schooling system designed for flexible learning opportunities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3179\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3361\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ad1jlw\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3217\">Recognized by Government of India</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ohtcue\" data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3264\">Flexible study system for diverse learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mikri9\" data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3320\">Suitable for working students and distance learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15d1t1e\" data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3361\">Fully valid for university admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3363\" data-end=\"3366\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n4i1v5\" data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3419\">ICSE (Indian Certificate of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3467\">ICSE students are eligible for B.Com programs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3598\">ICSE is known for its detailed syllabus and strong emphasis on English language, commerce concepts, and analytical understanding.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3619\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3794\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16fe0ld\" data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3659\">Strong conceptual learning approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17kck1a\" data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3705\">Excellent communication skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"136spe5\" data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3749\">Focus on detailed subject understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hdp7ah\" data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3794\">Helpful for business and finance careers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3799\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x008qw\" data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3836\">IB (International Baccalaureate)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3838\" data-end=\"3894\">Students from IB board are eligible for B.Com admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"4000\">IB is an internationally recognized education system focusing on research-based and analytical learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4021\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4174\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mb3tqe\" data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4057\">Globally accepted qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywe4t0\" data-start=\"4058\" data-end=\"4097\">Research-oriented learning approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oynplf\" data-start=\"4098\" data-end=\"4138\">Strong critical thinking development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rqx0bo\" data-start=\"4139\" data-end=\"4174\">International academic exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4179\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tkcnz\" data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4248\">IGCSE (International General Certificate of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4250\" data-end=\"4303\">IGCSE students are also eligible for B.Com admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4305\" data-end=\"4408\">IGCSE is an internationally recognized curriculum focusing on practical and application-based learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"4410\" data-end=\"4429\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4430\" data-end=\"4601\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fgnth2\" data-start=\"4430\" data-end=\"4474\">Internationally recognized qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14408bi\" data-start=\"4475\" data-end=\"4515\">Application-based academic structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1utrxuq\" data-start=\"4516\" data-end=\"4558\">Strong foundation in business concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vv0fma\" data-start=\"4559\" data-end=\"4601\">Suitable for global education pathways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4603\" data-end=\"4606\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"134pbc9\" data-start=\"4608\" data-end=\"4664\">Eligibility for Students Appearing in 10+2 Examination</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bbvfnb\" data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4700\">Important Admission Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4702\" data-end=\"4877\">One of the most important advantages of the B.Com eligibility structure is that students who are currently <strong data-start=\"4809\" data-end=\"4849\">appearing for their 10+2 examination</strong> are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4879\" data-end=\"4982\">This allows students to begin the admission process even before their final board results are declared.</p>', '<p data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"697\">The Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) fee structure is designed to provide clarity, affordability, and flexibility for students pursuing careers in commerce, accounting, finance, and business management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"1044\">This program offers structured payment options that allow students to choose between semester-wise, yearly, or one-time payment plans based on their financial convenience. Along with tuition fees, additional charges such as registration fees and examination fees are applicable depending on the student&rsquo;s region (India, SAARC, or International).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1197\">A clear understanding of the complete fee structure helps students and parents plan their education investment in a more organized and stress-free way.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1202\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4plhy9\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1229\">Total B.Com Course Fees</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yx9wzi\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1254\">Complete Program Fee</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1272\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1282\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1320\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total B.Com Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1332\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹120,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1548\">The total fee of ₹120,000 represents the complete tuition cost of the B.Com program. This includes structured academic delivery, curriculum coverage, and access to learning resources throughout the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1698\">However, students should also consider additional mandatory charges like registration and examination fees to understand the full cost of education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1703\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15lf1kq\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1746\">Flexible Payment Options for B.Com Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1924\">To make higher education more accessible, the B.Com program provides multiple payment options. Students can select a plan that suits their financial planning and affordability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1929\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83is7d\" data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1956\">1. Yearly Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2027\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1983\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1983\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1973\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"1983\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2027\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2027\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2007\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2027\">₹40,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3ze0g2\" data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2061\">Understanding Yearly Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2201\">In this option, the total program fee is divided into equal yearly installments. Students pay ₹40,000 annually during the course duration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15xlm0b\" data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2233\">Benefits of Yearly Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2366\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n1wi1n\" data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2266\">Simplified yearly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6suuq\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2296\">Reduced payment frequency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"akrylx\" data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2326\">Easier financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9aq64\" data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2366\">Suitable for stable income families</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2440\">This option is ideal for students who prefer structured annual payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2445\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1minad7\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2479\">2. Semester-Wise Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2556\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2506\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2506\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2496\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2506\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2556\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2556\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2532\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2556\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹20,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xzc3ti\" data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2592\">Understanding Semester Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2718\">The semester-wise plan divides the total fee into smaller installments, making it more manageable and flexible for students.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1inq21m\" data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2757\">Benefits of Semester-Wise Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2908\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djvlbw\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2801\">Lower financial burden per installment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpci95\" data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2839\">Better affordability for families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ixqqe7\" data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2872\">Easier academic fee planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x24pqa\" data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2908\">Widely preferred payment method</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2971\">This is one of the most convenient options for most students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"2976\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yt3u32\" data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3012\">3. One-Time Full Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3081\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3039\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3039\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3029\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3039\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3081\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3081\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3069\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3081\">₹120,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19lh2mc\" data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3117\">Understanding One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3186\">Students can choose to pay the entire fee at once during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v322b1\" data-start=\"3188\" data-end=\"3220\">Benefits of One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3368\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7nnhg0\" data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3261\">No future payment tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3p5j8l\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3305\">Complete financial closure at admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dqk0ex\" data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3339\">Stress-free academic planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gk8ref\" data-start=\"3340\" data-end=\"3368\">Simplified fee structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3439\">This option is suitable for students who prefer full upfront payment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3441\" data-end=\"3444\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"71nsi0\" data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3481\">Additional Fees for B.Com Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3654\">Apart from tuition fees, students are required to pay additional academic charges such as registration and examination fees. These fees vary based on the student&rsquo;s region.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3656\" data-end=\"3659\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qqn3gu\" data-start=\"3661\" data-end=\"3698\">Additional Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3700\" data-end=\"3808\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3700\" data-end=\"3721\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3700\" data-end=\"3721\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3700\" data-end=\"3711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3721\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3808\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3770\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3760\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3760\" data-end=\"3770\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3771\" data-end=\"3808\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3771\" data-end=\"3789\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3808\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3810\" data-end=\"3813\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1opp6jc\" data-start=\"3815\" data-end=\"3842\">Registration Fee (India)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3922\">The registration fee is a one-time payment collected at the time of admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17p4kli\" data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3955\">Purpose of Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"4116\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dpq5xe\" data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"3998\">Student enrollment in academic system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvgloy\" data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4040\">Creation of official academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1964ban\" data-start=\"4041\" data-end=\"4073\">Access to learning platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d8sqb7\" data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4116\">Admission processing and documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4175\">Once paid, this fee is not required again in later years.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4180\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mswdcy\" data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4208\">Examination Fee (India)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4294\">The examination fee is charged annually and is required to appear in semester exams.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16cnfi4\" data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4326\">Purpose of Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4328\" data-end=\"4445\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gd8178\" data-start=\"4328\" data-end=\"4355\">Conducting examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yk3zzr\" data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4387\">Evaluation of answer sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xrnz0q\" data-start=\"4388\" data-end=\"4409\">Result processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9y4mk\" data-start=\"4410\" data-end=\"4445\">Academic administration support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4447\" data-end=\"4506\">Students must pay this fee every year for exam eligibility.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4511\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1b3aond\" data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4549\">Additional Fees for SAARC Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4551\" data-end=\"4647\">Students from SAARC countries follow a different fee structure for regional academic processing.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4649\" data-end=\"4749\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4649\" data-end=\"4670\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4649\" data-end=\"4670\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4649\" data-end=\"4660\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4660\" data-end=\"4670\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4749\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4711\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4700\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4749\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4749\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4751\" data-end=\"4754\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"sqvnlc\" data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4792\">Understanding SAARC Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4794\" data-end=\"4873\">This structure ensures smooth academic participation for neighboring countries.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4875\" data-end=\"5011\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ag7k5a\" data-start=\"4875\" data-end=\"4930\">Higher registration due to international processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h9bg7o\" data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4963\">Slightly increased exam fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"115fh9w\" data-start=\"4964\" data-end=\"5011\">Standardized academic access across regions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5013\" data-end=\"5016\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"puptap\" data-start=\"5018\" data-end=\"5062\">Additional Fees for International Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5064\" data-end=\"5141\">For students outside India and SAARC regions, fees are charged in US dollars.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5246\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5164\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5164\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5154\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5154\" data-end=\"5164\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5175\" data-end=\"5246\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5175\" data-end=\"5211\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5175\" data-end=\"5203\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5203\" data-end=\"5211\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5212\" data-end=\"5246\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5212\" data-end=\"5230\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5230\" data-end=\"5246\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"825\">The Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) in Finance &amp; Accounting is a specialized undergraduate program designed to build strong foundations in financial management, accounting systems, business analytics, taxation, auditing, and modern AI-driven financial technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"1098\">This program goes beyond traditional commerce education by integrating <strong data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"1027\">Artificial Intelligence, Business Analytics, ESG (Environmental, Social, Governance), Digital Finance, and Financial Modeling</strong>, making it highly relevant for today&rsquo;s corporate and banking industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1301\">Students are trained to understand real-world financial systems, corporate decision-making, investment planning, regulatory compliance, and advanced financial technologies used in global organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19mvk1g\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1348\">Why Choose BBA in Finance &amp; Accounting</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1479\">This program is ideal for students who want to build careers in finance, banking, taxation, investment, and corporate management.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c29vu6\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1508\">Key Learning Focus Areas</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1855\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lfkgx0\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1557\">Financial Accounting &amp; Corporate Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kb6sfg\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1601\">Financial Markets &amp; Investment Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19lrj09\" data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1641\">Taxation (Direct Tax, GST, Customs)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r9am8c\" data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1666\">Auditing &amp; Assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lvxv\" data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1703\">Financial Modeling &amp; Forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n1mnh5\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1742\">Business Analytics &amp; AI in Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"716l6\" data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1772\">ESG &amp; Sustainable Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xnbe7h\" data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1815\">Digital Marketing &amp; E-Commerce Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juwabi\" data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1855\">Risk Management &amp; Strategic Finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1974\">This combination makes graduates industry-ready for both traditional finance roles and modern fintech-driven careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"1979\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cjv7dn\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2034\">Semester 1: Business Foundations &amp; Financial Basics</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2053\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2195\">The first semester builds a strong foundation in business communication, accounting basics, organizational behavior, and financial literacy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2200\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1r\" data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2234\">Courses Covered in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vaosqc\" data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2247\">English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2312\">Develops business communication and professional writing skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15uexkd\" data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2347\">HRM &amp; Organizational Behavior</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2415\">Understanding workplace culture, leadership, and employee behavior.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uwif2m\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2441\">Financial Accounting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2522\">Introduction to ledger systems, financial statements, and accounting principles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sq8i0a\" data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2555\">Modern Business Environment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2625\">Covers business structure, market systems, and corporate environment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f55vj2\" data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2658\">Essentials of Generative AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2714\">Introduction to AI tools used in business productivity.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ee4dl\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2749\">Financial Literacy &amp; Planning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2806\">Covers personal finance, investments, and risk planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2811\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gveden\" data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2846\">Skills Developed in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"3114\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jtm87i\" data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2874\">Business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r8urzv\" data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2899\">Professional writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gn6vlc\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2929\">Recruitment understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dgc5og\" data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2965\">Organizational culture analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lx3i5l\" data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"2997\">Financial accounting basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9xprs\" data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3024\">SWOT &amp; PESTLE analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p3uzzg\" data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3057\">Risk management fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cwbt64\" data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3090\">Personal investment planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15mmfap\" data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3114\">Generative AI usage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3119\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e52\" data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3152\">Certifications in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3379\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vnciyd\" data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3173\">Power BI Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2zius\" data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3201\">Business Writing Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dq90kr\" data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3231\">AI Literacy for Beginners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19f1hrl\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3258\">Accounting Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4fvkki\" data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3283\">Tableau Introduction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9519bp\" data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3313\">Financial Planning Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13zc4vj\" data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3350\">Generative AI Productivity Tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yilnje\" data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3379\">Corporate Finance Basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3384\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"18m77ah\" data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3444\">Semester 2: Business Law, Accounting &amp; Financial Markets</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3463\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3575\">This semester focuses on legal frameworks, corporate accounting, financial markets, and regulatory compliance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3580\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1o\" data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3614\">Courses Covered in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mcp9gk\" data-start=\"3616\" data-end=\"3649\">Business Regulatory Framework</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3702\">Business laws, compliance, and corporate governance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1akqhlh\" data-start=\"3704\" data-end=\"3741\">Financial Markets and Instruments</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3742\" data-end=\"3799\">Understanding stock markets, bonds, and investment tools.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11v852c\" data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3825\">Corporate Accounting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3878\">Advanced accounting and financial reporting systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15wo94s\" data-start=\"3880\" data-end=\"3902\">Business Economics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3903\" data-end=\"3950\">Micro and macroeconomic principles in business.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sr0i3q\" data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"3977\">Communicative English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"4017\">Professional communication development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bblc21\" data-start=\"4019\" data-end=\"4045\">Virtual Accounting Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4083\">Practical accounting system training.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4085\" data-end=\"4088\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedek\" data-start=\"4090\" data-end=\"4123\">Skills Developed in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4354\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13259ao\" data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4155\">Business law understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nb7rz9\" data-start=\"4156\" data-end=\"4180\">Corporate governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12130tz\" data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4210\">Financial market analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g6wh7g\" data-start=\"4211\" data-end=\"4239\">Capital market knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5m487\" data-start=\"4240\" data-end=\"4264\">Accounting reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nubl0x\" data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4290\">Tax compliance basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tzksm7\" data-start=\"4291\" data-end=\"4322\">Financial record management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"799bg5\" data-start=\"4323\" data-end=\"4354\">Professional report writing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4359\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e51\" data-start=\"4361\" data-end=\"4392\">Certifications in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4394\" data-end=\"4527\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i0c6f6\" data-start=\"4394\" data-end=\"4419\">SAP Accounting Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"blg1gi\" data-start=\"4420\" data-end=\"4451\">QuickBooks Payroll Training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wmclg8\" data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4475\">Finance Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xybtm4\" data-start=\"4476\" data-end=\"4497\">Excel for Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18837qs\" data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4527\">Business Valuation Basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4529\" data-end=\"4532\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"uz506\" data-start=\"4534\" data-end=\"4580\">Semester 3: Audit, Finance &amp; Cost Management</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"4582\" data-end=\"4599\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4601\" data-end=\"4705\">This semester builds expertise in auditing, financial management, cost accounting, and research methods.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4707\" data-end=\"4710\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1p\" data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4744\">Courses Covered in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q4b2q3\" data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4758\">Auditing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4808\">Internal control systems and compliance auditing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lxyal0\" data-start=\"4810\" data-end=\"4835\">Management Accounting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4836\" data-end=\"4879\">Decision-making through financial analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1shtuak\" data-start=\"4881\" data-end=\"4905\">Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4906\" data-end=\"4949\">Capital budgeting and investment decisions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qpjgz6\" data-start=\"4951\" data-end=\"4975\">Research Methodology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4976\" data-end=\"5017\">Business research and analytical methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7e8j7u\" data-start=\"5019\" data-end=\"5044\">Environmental Science</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5045\" data-end=\"5083\">Sustainability in business operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5085\" data-end=\"5088\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedel\" data-start=\"5090\" data-end=\"5123\">Skills Developed in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5125\" data-end=\"5314\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lpeefk\" data-start=\"5125\" data-end=\"5152\">Budgeting &amp; forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rmn0y3\" data-start=\"5153\" data-end=\"5180\">Cost control techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11m5m73\" data-start=\"5181\" data-end=\"5202\">Variance analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dgrv8b\" data-start=\"5203\" data-end=\"5232\">Financial decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mfnjqp\" data-start=\"5233\" data-end=\"5255\">Cash flow analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wq2vxx\" data-start=\"5256\" data-end=\"5288\">Environmental sustainability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yz8oo9\" data-start=\"5289\" data-end=\"5314\">Green business models</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5316\" data-end=\"5319\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e50\" data-start=\"5321\" data-end=\"5352\">Certifications in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5354\" data-end=\"5460\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13gw86p\" data-start=\"5354\" data-end=\"5380\">Risk Management Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7g1hir\" data-start=\"5381\" data-end=\"5405\">FinTech Introduction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nvbxgw\" data-start=\"5406\" data-end=\"5433\">Financial Risk Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ac9ucz\" data-start=\"5434\" data-end=\"5460\">Emerging Finance Tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5465\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cce4i8\" data-start=\"5467\" data-end=\"5518\">Semester 4: Advanced Finance &amp; Financial Modeling</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"5520\" data-end=\"5537\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5539\" data-end=\"5650\">This semester focuses on advanced accounting, financial modeling, marketing finance, and quantitative analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5652\" data-end=\"5655\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1m\" data-start=\"5657\" data-end=\"5689\">Courses Covered in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kyhn8x\" data-start=\"5691\" data-end=\"5715\">Marketing Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5716\" data-end=\"5753\">Consumer behavior and brand strategy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xfye3w\" data-start=\"5755\" data-end=\"5774\">Cost Accounting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5775\" data-end=\"5814\">Cost analysis and financial efficiency.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plylfm\" data-start=\"5816\" data-end=\"5849\">Advanced Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5850\" data-end=\"5884\">Investment and financial planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"28h87k\" data-start=\"5886\" data-end=\"5919\">Advanced Financial Accounting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5920\" data-end=\"5946\">IFRS and Ind AS standards.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wd8pb8\" data-start=\"5948\" data-end=\"5975\">Quantitative Techniques</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5976\" data-end=\"6019\">Statistical and financial modeling methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fi23pc\" data-start=\"6021\" data-end=\"6044\">Virtual Finance Lab</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6045\" data-end=\"6087\">Practical financial tools and simulations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6089\" data-end=\"6092\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedei\" data-start=\"6094\" data-end=\"6127\">Skills Developed in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6129\" data-end=\"6311\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w2teku\" data-start=\"6129\" data-end=\"6151\">Financial modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hrsw2d\" data-start=\"6152\" data-end=\"6171\">Market research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n83bxk\" data-start=\"6172\" data-end=\"6190\">Brand strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12oqtux\" data-start=\"6191\" data-end=\"6222\">IFRS &amp; accounting standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1z0vu2k\" data-start=\"6223\" data-end=\"6252\">Derivatives understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6l15g7\" data-start=\"6253\" data-end=\"6278\">Quantitative analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10kpkfo\" data-start=\"6279\" data-end=\"6311\">Strategic financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6313\" data-end=\"6316\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4z\" data-start=\"6318\" data-end=\"6349\">Certifications in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6351\" data-end=\"6450\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tq90tk\" data-start=\"6351\" data-end=\"6371\">SAP Business One</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s3yhjz\" data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6397\">Investment Evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jghxup\" data-start=\"6398\" data-end=\"6422\">Accounting Standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nvbxgw\" data-start=\"6423\" data-end=\"6450\">Financial Risk Analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6452\" data-end=\"6455\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"423mwk\" data-start=\"6457\" data-end=\"6507\">Semester 5: Taxation, Strategy &amp; Digital Finance</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"6509\" data-end=\"6526\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6528\" data-end=\"6637\">This semester focuses on taxation, strategic management, financial forecasting, and digital business systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6639\" data-end=\"6642\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1n\" data-start=\"6644\" data-end=\"6676\">Courses Covered in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nmb2km\" data-start=\"6678\" data-end=\"6692\">Direct Tax</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6693\" data-end=\"6732\">Income tax laws and corporate taxation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hm2r8d\" data-start=\"6734\" data-end=\"6758\">Strategic Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6759\" data-end=\"6800\">Corporate strategy and business planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17lh874\" data-start=\"6802\" data-end=\"6824\">Financial Modeling</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6825\" data-end=\"6862\">Forecasting and valuation techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"144nhvv\" data-start=\"6864\" data-end=\"6898\">Digital Marketing &amp; E-Commerce</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6899\" data-end=\"6935\">Online business and revenue systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j3fk7t\" data-start=\"6937\" data-end=\"6969\">Cost &amp; Management Accounting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6970\" data-end=\"7005\">Advanced cost control and analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7007\" data-end=\"7010\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedej\" data-start=\"7012\" data-end=\"7045\">Skills Developed in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7047\" data-end=\"7208\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9l8c8\" data-start=\"7047\" data-end=\"7063\">Tax planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7xmp3k\" data-start=\"7064\" data-end=\"7086\">Corporate strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xzsowq\" data-start=\"7087\" data-end=\"7112\">Financial forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yb1nt\" data-start=\"7113\" data-end=\"7140\">SEO &amp; digital marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n7bnwr\" data-start=\"7141\" data-end=\"7165\">E-commerce analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19pm6q3\" data-start=\"7166\" data-end=\"7186\">Transfer pricing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pwhucb\" data-start=\"7187\" data-end=\"7208\">Scenario planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7210\" data-end=\"7213\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4y\" data-start=\"7215\" data-end=\"7246\">Certifications in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7248\" data-end=\"7349\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qypopx\" data-start=\"7248\" data-end=\"7267\">SAP ERP Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1onzz22\" data-start=\"7268\" data-end=\"7290\">Forex Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tlo1ib\" data-start=\"7291\" data-end=\"7319\">Risk Management Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12k62k4\" data-start=\"7320\" data-end=\"7349\">AI Forecasting in Finance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7351\" data-end=\"7354\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1abomz0\" data-start=\"7356\" data-end=\"7410\">Semester 6: Global Finance, ESG &amp; Business Analytics</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"7412\" data-end=\"7429\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7431\" data-end=\"7536\">The final semester focuses on international finance, ESG, AI in finance, and advanced business analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7538\" data-end=\"7541\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1k\" data-start=\"7543\" data-end=\"7575\">Courses Covered in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"68mke2\" data-start=\"7577\" data-end=\"7603\">International Business</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7604\" data-end=\"7637\">Global trade and finance systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4qp5q8\" data-start=\"7639\" data-end=\"7662\">GST and Customs Tax</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7663\" data-end=\"7696\">Indirect taxation and compliance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ngxgj8\" data-start=\"7698\" data-end=\"7727\">Sustainable Finance &amp; ESG</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7728\" data-end=\"7760\">Green finance and ESG reporting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pzu8s8\" data-start=\"7762\" data-end=\"7789\">Business Analytics &amp; AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7790\" data-end=\"7828\">Data-driven financial decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"v64y0s\" data-start=\"7830\" data-end=\"7860\">Advanced Audit &amp; Assurance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7861\" data-end=\"7891\">Professional auditing systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7893\" data-end=\"7896\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvedeg\" data-start=\"7898\" data-end=\"7931\">Skills Developed in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7933\" data-end=\"8103\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j8n2e5\" data-start=\"7933\" data-end=\"7959\">Global finance systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nx0jq6\" data-start=\"7960\" data-end=\"7991\">Foreign exchange management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"126bfrr\" data-start=\"7992\" data-end=\"8009\">ESG reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fstzli\" data-start=\"8010\" data-end=\"8034\">Financial dashboards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tnobqn\" data-start=\"8035\" data-end=\"8052\">AI in finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nbyed4\" data-start=\"8053\" data-end=\"8075\">Business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mnpvda\" data-start=\"8076\" data-end=\"8103\">Risk management systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8105\" data-end=\"8108\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a5e4x\" data-start=\"8110\" data-end=\"8141\">Certifications in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8143\" data-end=\"8353\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g2t6u8\" data-start=\"8143\" data-end=\"8175\">Digital Banking Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ckj7ig\" data-start=\"8176\" data-end=\"8206\">AI in Finance &amp; Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ipt98\" data-start=\"8207\" data-end=\"8231\">SAP Finance Advanced</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqpmjh\" data-start=\"8232\" data-end=\"8263\">Tableau Financial Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u76ucj\" data-start=\"8264\" data-end=\"8294\">Commercial Banking Careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ka0m8c\" data-start=\"8295\" data-end=\"8323\">Derivatives Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ly6hl5\" data-start=\"8324\" data-end=\"8353\">ESG Finance Certification</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3.9, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 120000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
