(309, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 277, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 01:33:31', '2026-06-16 07:10:58', '<p data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"803\">The admission process for the B.Com program is designed to be simple, structured, and fully student-friendly. It ensures that every applicant goes through a clear step-by-step system that covers <strong data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"802\">application submission, program selection, fee payment, and final seat confirmation</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"967\">This structured admission flow helps students avoid confusion and ensures a smooth transition from school-level education (10+2) to professional commerce studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1095\">The entire process is divided into four major stages, each playing an important role in confirming admission into the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17qwtd3\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1135\">Step 1: Submit Application Form</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"aqstcd\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1168\">Start Your Admission Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1354\">The first step in the B.Com admission process is filling out the online application form. This step officially begins your admission journey and registers your interest in the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1474\">Students must provide accurate academic and personal details to ensure proper verification and eligibility assessment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1479\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qry1vp\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1520\">Details Required in Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1555\">Students are required to fill in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1879\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b5yh2l\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1591\">Full name and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bqh4ox\" data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1642\">Contact information (mobile number &amp; email ID)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wsp2iv\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1684\">Academic qualification (10+2 details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9h08cu\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1755\">Board information (CBSE, State Board, ICSE, NIOS, IB, IGCSE, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jloqx6\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1802\">Stream details (Commerce / Arts / Science)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1987wpc\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1832\">Program selection (B.Com)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ddttw\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1879\">Basic identity and educational information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1884\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25y54a\" data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1925\">Importance of Application Submission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1961\">This step is important because it:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2144\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q4edir\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2008\">Creates official student admission record</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i8wqmc\" data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2052\">Starts eligibility verification process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nnew6r\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2103\">Opens communication with admission authorities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wbpvqf\" data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2144\">Allows further enrollment processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2210\">Incorrect or incomplete details may delay the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2215\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gintl4\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2249\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3my97u\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2292\">Program Selection &amp; Verification Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2449\">After submitting the application, students move to the enrollment stage. This is where the selected program is confirmed and academic details are verified.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2536\">This step ensures that only eligible students proceed to the next stage of admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2541\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xhta3f\" data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2572\">What Happens in This Stage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2774\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1heef6f\" data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2619\">Selection of B.Com program specialization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmq4hv\" data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2656\">Verification of academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mlr428\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2697\">Confirmation of eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rl2vm\" data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2735\">Validation of application details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mn0gxn\" data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2774\">Preparation for payment processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2779\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9se09k\" data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2814\">Importance of Enrollment Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2835\">This stage ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2963\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x1tm86\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2866\">Proper program allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lzjxaf\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2904\">Elimination of application errors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"148dpl6\" data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2933\">Eligibility confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19p53n4\" data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"2963\">Smooth admission workflow</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3032\">It acts as a bridge between application submission and fee payment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3037\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1jgmfxh\" data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3073\">Step 3: Complete Payment Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pajmal\" data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3119\">Flexible Fee Payment Options for Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3277\">Once enrollment is confirmed, students proceed to the payment stage. The B.Com program offers flexible payment methods to support different financial needs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3366\">Students can choose a payment option based on their convenience and financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3371\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16psrcv\" data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3402\">1. One-Time Payment Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3466\">Students can pay the full program fee in a single transaction.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q4c1cr\" data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3481\">Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3627\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zjddin\" data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3514\">Complete fee payment at once</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"55bge1\" data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3558\">No future installment tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rp0oyh\" data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3592\">Faster admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s6esf\" data-start=\"3593\" data-end=\"3627\">Simple and hassle-free process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"3629\" data-end=\"3642\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3794\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1473fos\" data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3682\">Financial closure of entire program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fq1bho\" data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3715\">No EMI or installment burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gbz6ta\" data-start=\"3716\" data-end=\"3755\">Immediate seat confirmation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1etbmga\" data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3794\">Suitable for fully funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3799\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eyji2a\" data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3834\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3836\" data-end=\"3917\">Students can also choose installment-based payment through EMI or education loan.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q4c1cr\" data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"3932\">Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"4072\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mljhp3\" data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"3965\">Monthly installment payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kpqagi\" data-start=\"3966\" data-end=\"3988\">Easy EMI structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wu91dl\" data-start=\"3989\" data-end=\"4033\">0% interest option (subject to approval)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"190cxp\" data-start=\"4034\" data-end=\"4072\">Financial flexibility for students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4087\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4233\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dpzg1j\" data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4118\">Reduces financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"154ofbg\" data-start=\"4119\" data-end=\"4156\">Makes higher education accessible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nyi31i\" data-start=\"4157\" data-end=\"4193\">Allows better financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wrwm29\" data-start=\"4194\" data-end=\"4233\">Suitable for middle-income families</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4235\" data-end=\"4319\">This option ensures that financial limitations do not become a barrier to education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4321\" data-end=\"4324\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mbgkrq\" data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4356\">Importance of Payment Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4358\" data-end=\"4398\">The payment stage is crucial because it:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4400\" data-end=\"4547\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzf56r\" data-start=\"4400\" data-end=\"4431\">Confirms student commitment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v3ty4s\" data-start=\"4432\" data-end=\"4469\">Activates final admission process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lp2zf0\" data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4507\">Moves application toward approval</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ddlsv\" data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4547\">Ensures seat allocation eligibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4549\" data-end=\"4613\">Without payment or loan approval, admission cannot be completed.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4615\" data-end=\"4618\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7jvyu7\" data-start=\"4620\" data-end=\"4646\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2xiv4b\" data-start=\"4648\" data-end=\"4685\">Final Admission Confirmation Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4687\" data-end=\"4835\">This is the final step of the admission process. Once payment is completed or EMI/loan is approved, the student&rsquo;s admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4837\" data-end=\"4904\">At this stage, the student&rsquo;s seat is reserved in the B.Com program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4906\" data-end=\"4909\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"4911\" data-end=\"4940\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4942\" data-end=\"4970\">After successful completion:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4972\" data-end=\"5159\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkwzx8\" data-start=\"4972\" data-end=\"5009\">Admission is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pfswuy\" data-start=\"5010\" data-end=\"5042\">Seat is permanently reserved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"td72v7\" data-start=\"5043\" data-end=\"5072\">Student record is updated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13wqy5s\" data-start=\"5073\" data-end=\"5115\">Access to academic system is activated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ufhqdz\" data-start=\"5116\" data-end=\"5159\">Admission confirmation letter is issued</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5161\" data-end=\"5164\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"727l4k\" data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5200\">Importance of Seat Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5202\" data-end=\"5220\">This step ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5222\" data-end=\"5361\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vx9cr9\" data-start=\"5222\" data-end=\"5261\">Guaranteed admission in the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f506bo\" data-start=\"5262\" data-end=\"5293\">Final enrollment completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19wslyu\" data-start=\"5294\" data-end=\"5323\">Academic seat reservation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlqy4p\" data-start=\"5324\" data-end=\"5361\">Smooth onboarding into the course</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5363\" data-end=\"5411\">Without this step, admission remains incomplete.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5413\" data-end=\"5416\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16devak\" data-start=\"5418\" data-end=\"5460\">Complete B.Com Admission Process Summary</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19z7gf1\" data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5486\">Step-by-Step Overview</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9rzptd\" data-start=\"5488\" data-end=\"5520\">Step 1: Submit Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5521\" data-end=\"5567\">Fill out personal and academic details online.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bazspl\" data-start=\"5569\" data-end=\"5600\">Step 2: Enroll in Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5601\" data-end=\"5649\">Verify eligibility and confirm course selection.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kyof3i\" data-start=\"5651\" data-end=\"5681\">Step 3: Complete Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5682\" data-end=\"5725\">Choose one-time or EMI/loan payment option.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"62gr72\" data-start=\"5727\" data-end=\"5752\">Step 4: Secure Seat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5753\" data-end=\"5790\">Receive final admission confirmation.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"812\">The eligibility criteria for the B.Com program define the minimum academic qualification required for students who wish to pursue a professional career in <strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"811\">commerce, accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, and business management</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"1068\">Since this is an <strong data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"882\">advanced commerce program with ACCA integration</strong>, the eligibility structure ensures that students entering the course have a strong academic foundation in commerce-related subjects such as mathematics, economics, and business studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1229\">The eligibility guidelines are designed to be inclusive so that students from multiple education boards and academic backgrounds can apply without limitations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1234\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1bfl0lz\" data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1288\">Minimum Qualification Required for B.Com Admission</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ra33z9\" data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1319\">Basic Academic Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1438\">To be eligible for admission into the B.Com program, a student must satisfy at least one of the following conditions:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bd1yrv\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1526\">Must have successfully passed the <strong data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1515\">10+2 (Higher Secondary) examination</strong><br data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1518\"><strong data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1524\">OR</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12njkx6\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1585\">Must be <strong data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1585\">currently appearing for the 10+2 examination</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1692\">This ensures that both completed and final-year school students are eligible for admission consideration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1697\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"f6eknm\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1750\">Accepted Educational Boards for B.Com Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1941\">Students from various recognized national and international boards are eligible for admission into this program. This ensures equal opportunity for learners from different academic systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1946\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ppm60i\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1971\">State Board Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2077\">Students who have completed their 10+2 from any recognized State Board are fully eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2256\">State Boards are governed by respective state education authorities and follow a structured curriculum designed to build foundational knowledge in commerce and business studies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2277\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2480\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x70cfg\" data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2334\">Recognized by State Government education departments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ct2swt\" data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2382\">Strong foundation in commerce and economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dyvu7d\" data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2430\">Suitable for finance and accounting studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mthjsc\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2480\">Widely accepted for higher education programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2485\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xyhe0j\" data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2533\">CBSE (Central Board of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2590\">CBSE students are fully eligible for the B.Com program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2737\">CBSE is one of the most widely recognized boards in India and offers a structured syllabus focused on conceptual clarity and analytical learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2758\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2959\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s0zpef\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2794\">National-level recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ocjmnc\" data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2851\">Strong focus on commerce, mathematics, and economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fjd0c\" data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2904\">Develops analytical and logical reasoning skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9bj06t\" data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2959\">Highly preferred for professional commerce courses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2964\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b0ffe9\" data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"3012\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3061\">Students from NIOS are fully eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3148\">NIOS is a government-recognized open schooling system designed for flexible learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3169\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3170\" data-end=\"3349\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ad1jlw\" data-start=\"3170\" data-end=\"3207\">Recognized by Government of India</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3fwt3h\" data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3249\">Flexible learning system for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ladfrr\" data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3302\">Suitable for working or non-traditional learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l60dlh\" data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3349\">Fully valid for higher education admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3354\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n4i1v5\" data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3407\">ICSE (Indian Certificate of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3450\">ICSE students are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3452\" data-end=\"3566\">ICSE is known for its detailed syllabus and strong emphasis on English communication and conceptual understanding.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3587\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3753\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16fe0ld\" data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3627\">Strong conceptual learning approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17kck1a\" data-start=\"3628\" data-end=\"3673\">Excellent communication skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pj1itz\" data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3708\">In-depth subject understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mwgsz6\" data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3753\">Helpful for commerce and finance careers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3758\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x008qw\" data-start=\"3760\" data-end=\"3795\">IB (International Baccalaureate)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3847\">Students from IB board are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3936\">IB is internationally recognized and focuses on research-based and analytical learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"3938\" data-end=\"3957\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"4109\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mb3tqe\" data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"3993\">Globally accepted qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1buwlzq\" data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4031\">Research-oriented academic system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oynplf\" data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4072\">Strong critical thinking development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vfd89v\" data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4109\">International education standard</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4114\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tkcnz\" data-start=\"4116\" data-end=\"4183\">IGCSE (International General Certificate of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4218\">IGCSE students are also eligible.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4220\" data-end=\"4296\">IGCSE is an international curriculum focusing on application-based learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"4298\" data-end=\"4317\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4318\" data-end=\"4480\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fgnth2\" data-start=\"4318\" data-end=\"4362\">Internationally recognized qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"knkfxe\" data-start=\"4363\" data-end=\"4407\">Practical and application-based learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16xddi3\" data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4437\">Strong conceptual clarity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vv0fma\" data-start=\"4438\" data-end=\"4480\">Suitable for global education pathways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4485\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"134pbc9\" data-start=\"4487\" data-end=\"4543\">Eligibility for Students Appearing in 10+2 Examination</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bbvfnb\" data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4579\">Important Admission Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4581\" data-end=\"4754\">One of the most important features of the B.Com eligibility criteria is that students who are currently <strong data-start=\"4685\" data-end=\"4726\">appearing for their 10+2 examinations</strong> are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4842\">This allows students to start the admission process without waiting for final results.</p>', '<p data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"750\">The B.Com program with ACCA integration is a professionally structured commerce degree designed to combine <strong data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"749\">core accounting education with globally recognized finance and accounting certification exposure</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"953\">This program is more advanced than a regular B.Com because it includes additional professional learning components that align with international accounting standards and corporate finance requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1103\">The total fee structure includes academic tuition fees, professional fees, registration charges, examination fees, and ACCA-related mandatory costs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1108\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1mz2ab5\" data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1138\">Total B.Com Fees Breakdown</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ltgawb\" data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1173\">Complete Program Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1329\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1191\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1201\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1329\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1245\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1233\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic B.Com Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1245\">₹120,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1275\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Component Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1287\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹108,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1329\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1313\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1312\">Total Program Fees</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1329\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1327\">₹228,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18e5evl\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1356\">Total Fee Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1394\">The total cost of ₹228,000 includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1513\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t7ozzl\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1441\">Core B.Com academic curriculum (₹120,000)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17a03df\" data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1513\">Professional finance and ACCA-aligned training component (₹108,000)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1635\">This combination ensures students gain both <strong data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1634\">university degree knowledge and global professional accounting exposure</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1640\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15lf1kq\" data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1683\">Flexible Payment Options for B.Com Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1792\">To support students from different financial backgrounds, the program provides multiple payment structures.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1797\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83is7d\" data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1824\">1. Yearly Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1851\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1851\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1841\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1851\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1875\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1888\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹76,000/-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3ze0g2\" data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1922\">Understanding Yearly Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"2006\">In this option, the total program cost is divided into annual payments of ₹76,000.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2020\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2170\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13fjezz\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2058\">Easier yearly financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nc5d3f\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2095\">Reduced payment burden per cycle</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jlcedq\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2132\">Suitable for long-term budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u4tsb6\" data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2170\">Simplified academic fee structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1minad7\" data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2209\">2. Semester-Wise Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2275\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2236\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2236\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2226\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2236\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2275\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2275\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2262\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2275\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹56,000/-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xzc3ti\" data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2311\">Understanding Semester Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2363\">Students pay ₹56,000 per semester under this plan.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2377\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2542\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"odu98z\" data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2423\">Lower financial pressure per installment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e6mq93\" data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2455\">Flexible payment scheduling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4pgpe\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2499\">Easier management of education expenses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pj9gzs\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2542\">Most preferred student-friendly option</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2547\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yt3u32\" data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2583\">3. One-Time Full Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2654\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2610\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2610\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2600\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2654\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2654\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2640\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2654\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹228,000/-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19lh2mc\" data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2690\">Understanding One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2749\">Students can pay the entire fee at once during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2763\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2897\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hmbshc\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2799\">No future installment tracking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wn4k55\" data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2830\">Complete financial closure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rp0oyh\" data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2864\">Faster admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z00784\" data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2897\">Stress-free academic journey</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2899\" data-end=\"2902\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1u3o8jj\" data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2931\">Additional Fees Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"3089\">Apart from the main tuition and professional fees, students must also pay additional mandatory charges based on their region and certification requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3094\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qqn3gu\" data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3133\">Additional Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3243\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3156\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3156\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3146\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3156\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3243\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3205\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3195\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3205\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3243\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3224\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3243\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pigotn\" data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3270\">Purpose of These Fees</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3394\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i2ei6j\" data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3333\">Registration Fee: Enrollment and academic record creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5pqdr\" data-start=\"3334\" data-end=\"3394\">Examination Fee: Conducting exams and evaluation process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3399\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1b3aond\" data-start=\"3401\" data-end=\"3437\">Additional Fees for SAARC Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3539\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3460\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3460\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3450\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3460\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3539\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3501\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3490\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3501\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3539\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3520\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3539\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3556\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3634\">These charges support cross-border academic administration and exam systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3636\" data-end=\"3639\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"puptap\" data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3685\">Additional Fees for International Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3786\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3708\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3708\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3698\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3786\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3751\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3743\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3751\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3786\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3770\" data-end=\"3786\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"3788\" data-end=\"3803\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3805\" data-end=\"3886\">This structure ensures global accessibility and standardized academic evaluation.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"756\">The B.Com program is designed to build strong academic and practical expertise in <strong data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"755\">accounting, taxation, auditing, financial management, business law, economics, and modern business technologies</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"967\">This curriculum is structured in a semester-wise format to gradually develop students from foundational commerce concepts to advanced financial analysis, strategic management, and AI-driven business analytics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1164\">The program also integrates <strong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1107\">Generative AI, Digital Finance, ESG (Sustainable Finance), Business Analytics, and Virtual Accounting Labs</strong>, making it highly relevant for modern corporate careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1169\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"v0k31g\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1242\">Semester 1: Foundations of Commerce, Accounting &amp; Business Technology</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1261\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1401\">The first semester focuses on building a strong base in accounting principles, business environment understanding, and financial literacy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1406\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1r\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1440\">Courses Covered in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1598\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hg1ei\" data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1453\">English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jccnay\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1479\">Management Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1504\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xlxzmr\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1532\">Business and Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x3yp80\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1564\">Essentials of Generative AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mcgclj\" data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1598\">Financial Literacy &amp; Planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1603\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qnj3z4\" data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1636\">What You Learn in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1705\">This semester introduces the basic structure of commerce education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1741\">Students develop understanding of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1935\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p5gqy0\" data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1781\">Core financial accounting concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19f5b8d\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1817\">Business decision-making basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q0lah2\" data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1859\">Technology in modern business systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2rmzxc\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1889\">AI tools for productivity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lwwox6\" data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1935\">Personal financial planning and budgeting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1940\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bwuu5n\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1968\">Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2103\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m5mhfh\" data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"1997\">Accounting fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jtm87i\" data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2024\">Business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7mzqcc\" data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2047\">Financial literacy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rey25j\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2079\">AI-based productivity tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"db6umo\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2103\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2108\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kln0q6\" data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2171\">Semester 2: Business Law, Economics &amp; Taxation Fundamentals</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2190\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2286\">This semester builds knowledge of legal frameworks, taxation systems, and economic principles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2291\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1o\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2325\">Courses Covered in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2473\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1449joc\" data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2357\">Corporate and Business Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h04yyg\" data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2370\">Taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kdo0z\" data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2397\">Performance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2420\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozme4o\" data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2446\">Communicative English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2lyav\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2473\">Virtual Accounting Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qnj3z7\" data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2511\">What You Learn in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2544\">Students gain understanding of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wue4j7\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2595\">Business legal structure and compliance rules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rhi471\" data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2635\">Direct and indirect taxation basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rnmkhg\" data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2688\">Economic principles affecting business decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p1jxfy\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2724\">Corporate governance and ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"luzw93\" data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2766\">Accounting software and virtual tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2771\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bwuu5n\" data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2799\">Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2946\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ffupkt\" data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2831\">Legal compliance awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n0tuoc\" data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2857\">Taxation fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"178d4kz\" data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2888\">Business economic analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mbhqau\" data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2915\">Performance evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w5bxb7\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2946\">Professional communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2951\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"bzrdpj\" data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"3012\">Semester 3: Audit, Financial Management &amp; Research Skills</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3031\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3131\">This semester focuses on auditing systems, financial decision-making, and research-based learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3136\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1p\" data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3170\">Courses Covered in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3323\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3z48jl\" data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3195\">Audit and Assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pbto8i\" data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3220\">Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"165kb9r\" data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3244\">Financial Reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ibobe\" data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3272\">Indian Knowledge System</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jpcxlo\" data-start=\"3273\" data-end=\"3297\">Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1skrokk\" data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3323\">Environmental Science</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3328\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qnj3z6\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3361\">What You Learn in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3363\" data-end=\"3421\">Students develop deeper financial understanding including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3635\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1da44rj\" data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3454\">Internal auditing processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hfqwwl\" data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3502\">Financial planning and investment decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"49n144\" data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3546\">Corporate financial reporting standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3iudkm\" data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3590\">Research techniques in business studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hg66pg\" data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3635\">Environmental sustainability in business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3637\" data-end=\"3640\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bwuu5n\" data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3668\">Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3795\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gdx8zf\" data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3690\">Audit procedures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dgrv8b\" data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"3720\">Financial decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gxu9n2\" data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3744\">Reporting standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"127dk6b\" data-start=\"3745\" data-end=\"3766\">Research analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yw88km\" data-start=\"3767\" data-end=\"3795\">Sustainability awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3800\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ozhpex\" data-start=\"3802\" data-end=\"3863\">Semester 4: Entrepreneurship, Marketing &amp; Strategic Finance</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3882\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3884\" data-end=\"3993\">This semester focuses on entrepreneurship development, marketing strategies, and advanced financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"3998\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1m\" data-start=\"4000\" data-end=\"4032\">Courses Covered in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4034\" data-end=\"4198\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"4034\" data-end=\"4054\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"4055\" data-end=\"4079\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"szafz3\" data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4113\">Strategic Business Leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2zqotk\" data-start=\"4114\" data-end=\"4146\">Strategic Business Reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"skuumi\" data-start=\"4147\" data-end=\"4174\">Quantitative Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rdg3fy\" data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4198\">Virtual Finance Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4203\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qnj3z9\" data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4236\">What You Learn in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4238\" data-end=\"4306\">Students learn how businesses operate strategically in real markets.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4308\" data-end=\"4335\">Key learning areas include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4337\" data-end=\"4531\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uosr4k\" data-start=\"4337\" data-end=\"4378\">Startup and entrepreneurship concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x2upfw\" data-start=\"4379\" data-end=\"4420\">Market research and consumer behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"awwq4n\" data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4457\">Leadership and business strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11dilpu\" data-start=\"4458\" data-end=\"4499\">Financial reporting at advanced level</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o8v98g\" data-start=\"4500\" data-end=\"4531\">Data-driven decision making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4533\" data-end=\"4536\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bwuu5n\" data-start=\"4538\" data-end=\"4564\">Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4566\" data-end=\"4703\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lmsx2\" data-start=\"4566\" data-end=\"4599\">Business strategy development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iq9s37\" data-start=\"4600\" data-end=\"4622\">Financial analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fxzicx\" data-start=\"4623\" data-end=\"4645\">Marketing planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"um42c3\" data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4667\">Leadership skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lply83\" data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4703\">Quantitative financial modeling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4705\" data-end=\"4708\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cm036f\" data-start=\"4710\" data-end=\"4769\">Semester 5: Advanced Finance, Taxation &amp; Digital Business</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"4771\" data-end=\"4788\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4790\" data-end=\"4883\">This semester focuses on advanced taxation systems, financial modeling, and digital commerce.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"4888\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1n\" data-start=\"4890\" data-end=\"4922\">Courses Covered in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4924\" data-end=\"5086\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bee724\" data-start=\"4924\" data-end=\"4947\">Indian Constitution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"4948\" data-end=\"4972\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6mnpra\" data-start=\"4973\" data-end=\"4994\">Advanced Taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"623sq4\" data-start=\"4995\" data-end=\"5028\">Advanced Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cg2m9a\" data-start=\"5029\" data-end=\"5051\">Financial Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v5xjmt\" data-start=\"5052\" data-end=\"5086\">Digital Marketing &amp; E-Commerce</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5088\" data-end=\"5091\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qnj3z8\" data-start=\"5093\" data-end=\"5124\">What You Learn in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5126\" data-end=\"5168\">Students gain industry-level expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5170\" data-end=\"5351\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djgjhs\" data-start=\"5170\" data-end=\"5210\">Tax structure and compliance systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qjtp9a\" data-start=\"5211\" data-end=\"5243\">Corporate strategic planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w4n30e\" data-start=\"5244\" data-end=\"5282\">Financial forecasting and modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1549oon\" data-start=\"5283\" data-end=\"5310\">Online business systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d48v89\" data-start=\"5311\" data-end=\"5351\">Digital marketing and SEO strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5353\" data-end=\"5356\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bwuu5n\" data-start=\"5358\" data-end=\"5384\">Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5386\" data-end=\"5546\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cn6jcc\" data-start=\"5386\" data-end=\"5416\">Tax advisory understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xzsowq\" data-start=\"5417\" data-end=\"5442\">Financial forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0nq9k\" data-start=\"5443\" data-end=\"5481\">Digital business growth strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gtj1fe\" data-start=\"5482\" data-end=\"5511\">Strategic decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ovtlj1\" data-start=\"5512\" data-end=\"5546\">E-commerce business operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5548\" data-end=\"5551\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1abomz0\" data-start=\"5553\" data-end=\"5607\">Semester 6: Global Finance, ESG &amp; Business Analytics</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"5609\" data-end=\"5626\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5628\" data-end=\"5734\">The final semester focuses on global business systems, sustainability, and AI-powered financial analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5736\" data-end=\"5739\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1k\" data-start=\"5741\" data-end=\"5773\">Courses Covered in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5775\" data-end=\"5973\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"5775\" data-end=\"5801\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v2a7n3\" data-start=\"5802\" data-end=\"5842\">Human Values and Professional Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wd009r\" data-start=\"5843\" data-end=\"5875\">Advanced Audit and Assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i9ck71\" data-start=\"5876\" data-end=\"5911\">Advanced Performance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q9qqaf\" data-start=\"5912\" data-end=\"5943\">Sustainable Finance and ESG</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13btnln\" data-start=\"5944\" data-end=\"5973\">Business Analytics and AI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5975\" data-end=\"5978\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qnj3zb\" data-start=\"5980\" data-end=\"6011\">What You Learn in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6013\" data-end=\"6072\">This semester prepares students for global finance careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6074\" data-end=\"6092\">Key areas include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6094\" data-end=\"6295\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sa84ei\" data-start=\"6094\" data-end=\"6144\">International trade and global finance systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1louozc\" data-start=\"6145\" data-end=\"6175\">Ethical business practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s3uh9w\" data-start=\"6176\" data-end=\"6208\">Advanced auditing techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eto2u2\" data-start=\"6209\" data-end=\"6263\">ESG (Environmental, Social, Governance) frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hcelv0\" data-start=\"6264\" data-end=\"6295\">AI-based business analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6297\" data-end=\"6300\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bwuu5n\" data-start=\"6302\" data-end=\"6328\">Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6330\" data-end=\"6500\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bz9kft\" data-start=\"6330\" data-end=\"6361\">Global financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kgvjix\" data-start=\"6362\" data-end=\"6398\">ESG reporting and sustainability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cq2hob\" data-start=\"6399\" data-end=\"6433\">AI in business decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ft7l3h\" data-start=\"6434\" data-end=\"6460\">Advanced audit systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y7wsg6\" data-start=\"6461\" data-end=\"6500\">Business intelligence and analytics</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 228000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(310, 71, 'cdb58585-8964-437a-ac11-333f9095f63e', '56ec32ec-5b08-4bff-8471-060a243aa7d9', 278, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 01:54:44', '2026-06-16 07:11:47', '<p data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"789\">The admission process for the B.Com program is structured to make enrollment <strong data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"660\">simple, transparent, and fully student-friendly</strong>. It is designed so that students can complete the entire process in a clear step-by-step manner without confusion or complexity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"968\">This process ensures that every applicant moves through a defined pathway that includes <strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"967\">application submission, program enrollment, fee payment, and final seat confirmation</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1105\">The system is designed to support both regular students and working aspirants by offering flexibility in admission and payment options.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1110\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17qwtd3\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1145\">Step 1: Submit Application Form</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12a6885\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1180\">Starting the Admission Journey</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1331\">The first step in the B.Com admission process is submitting the online application form. This step officially begins the student&rsquo;s admission journey.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1475\">At this stage, students are required to enter their personal, academic, and program-related details for initial registration and verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1480\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qry1vp\" data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1521\">Details Required in Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1581\">Students must fill in the following information carefully:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1892\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b5yh2l\" data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1617\">Full name and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uhbs3e\" data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1654\">Contact number and email address</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w643qe\" data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1694\">10+2 academic qualification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9h08cu\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1765\">Board information (CBSE, State Board, ICSE, NIOS, IB, IGCSE, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16cjui2\" data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1810\">Stream details (Commerce, Arts, Science)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1987wpc\" data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1840\">Program selection (B.Com)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xpygfu\" data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1892\">Basic identification and educational background</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1897\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25y54a\" data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1938\">Importance of Application Submission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1974\">This step is important because it:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2164\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8vdfzp\" data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2016\">Creates an official admission record</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u6yzbb\" data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2063\">Initiates eligibility verification process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hp7tay\" data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2113\">Allows academic evaluation of student profile</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nnew6r\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2164\">Opens communication with admission authorities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2246\">Accurate details are essential to avoid delays or rejection during verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2251\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gintl4\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2285\">Step 2: Enroll in Your Program</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yxgx1j\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2330\">Program Selection and Verification Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2487\">After submitting the application, students proceed to the enrollment stage. This step ensures that the selected program is correctly assigned and verified.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2585\">It also confirms that the student meets the required eligibility criteria for the B.Com program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2590\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xhta3f\" data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2621\">What Happens in This Stage</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2805\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l9mw54\" data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2653\">Selection of B.Com program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1asjco1\" data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2692\">Verification of academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ypiipg\" data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2731\">Validation of eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"141jupi\" data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2771\">Confirmation of application details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6lojmc\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2805\">Preparation for payment stage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2810\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9se09k\" data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2845\">Importance of Enrollment Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2866\">This stage ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"3021\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nv6twv\" data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2896\">Proper course allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i6d805\" data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2942\">Elimination of incorrect application data</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g7aoww\" data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"2981\">Smooth transition to payment stage</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15sspp3\" data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3021\">Confirmation of admission readiness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3091\">It acts as a crucial bridge between application and final admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3096\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1jgmfxh\" data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3132\">Step 3: Complete Payment Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b02oez\" data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3174\">Flexible Payment Options for Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3361\">Once enrollment is confirmed, students move to the payment stage. The B.Com program provides <strong data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3301\">flexible fee payment options</strong> to make education accessible for all financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3363\" data-end=\"3427\">Students can choose a payment method based on their convenience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3432\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16psrcv\" data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3463\">1. One-Time Payment Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3528\">Students can pay the full program fee at once during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12jh0uk\" data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3547\">Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3548\" data-end=\"3702\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137fx3t\" data-start=\"3548\" data-end=\"3589\">Full fee paid in a single transaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"55bge1\" data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3633\">No future installment tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ld0waj\" data-start=\"3634\" data-end=\"3668\">Immediate admission processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w6acfr\" data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3702\">Simple and hassle-free option</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"3704\" data-end=\"3717\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3856\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bcs475\" data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3751\">Financial closure in one step</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rp0oyh\" data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3785\">Faster admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wyrm8y\" data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3817\">No recurring payment stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1etbmga\" data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3856\">Suitable for fully funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3861\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eyji2a\" data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3896\">2. Education Loan / EMI Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3980\">Students can also opt for installment-based payment through EMI or education loan.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12jh0uk\" data-start=\"3982\" data-end=\"3999\">Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4000\" data-end=\"4143\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p13g97\" data-start=\"4000\" data-end=\"4033\">Monthly installment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h2tbny\" data-start=\"4034\" data-end=\"4059\">Easy repayment system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wu91dl\" data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4104\">0% interest option (subject to approval)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"190cxp\" data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4143\">Financial flexibility for students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iaul7c\" data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4158\">Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4301\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sqb714\" data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4187\">Reduces financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"154ofbg\" data-start=\"4188\" data-end=\"4225\">Makes higher education accessible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15kgqi8\" data-start=\"4226\" data-end=\"4264\">Supports better financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g820p1\" data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4301\">Ideal for middle-income families</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4303\" data-end=\"4387\">This option ensures that financial limitations do not become a barrier to education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4389\" data-end=\"4392\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mbgkrq\" data-start=\"4394\" data-end=\"4424\">Importance of Payment Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4426\" data-end=\"4467\">The payment stage is critical because it:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4626\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ge5gtj\" data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4511\">Confirms student enrollment commitment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2qf58\" data-start=\"4512\" data-end=\"4552\">Activates final admission processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lp2zf0\" data-start=\"4553\" data-end=\"4590\">Moves application toward approval</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sn2o8y\" data-start=\"4591\" data-end=\"4626\">Enables seat allocation process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4628\" data-end=\"4703\">Without successful payment or loan approval, admission cannot be finalized.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4705\" data-end=\"4708\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7jvyu7\" data-start=\"4710\" data-end=\"4736\">Step 4: Secure Your Seat</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2xiv4b\" data-start=\"4738\" data-end=\"4775\">Final Admission Confirmation Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4777\" data-end=\"4925\">This is the final step in the admission process. Once payment is completed or EMI/loan is approved, the student&rsquo;s admission is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4927\" data-end=\"4994\">At this stage, the student&rsquo;s seat in the B.Com program is reserved.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"4999\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"5001\" data-end=\"5030\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5032\" data-end=\"5073\">After successful completion of this step:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5075\" data-end=\"5256\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkwzx8\" data-start=\"5075\" data-end=\"5112\">Admission is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o46tl3\" data-start=\"5113\" data-end=\"5146\">Seat is permanently allocated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ldchgh\" data-start=\"5147\" data-end=\"5186\">Student record is updated in system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fj2rbi\" data-start=\"5187\" data-end=\"5219\">Academic access is activated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"axp7bd\" data-start=\"5220\" data-end=\"5256\">Admission confirmation is issued</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5258\" data-end=\"5261\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"727l4k\" data-start=\"5263\" data-end=\"5297\">Importance of Seat Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5299\" data-end=\"5317\">This step ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5319\" data-end=\"5462\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vx9cr9\" data-start=\"5319\" data-end=\"5358\">Guaranteed admission in the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f506bo\" data-start=\"5359\" data-end=\"5390\">Final enrollment completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4jj4zl\" data-start=\"5391\" data-end=\"5427\">Secure academic seat reservation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"57ro9w\" data-start=\"5428\" data-end=\"5462\">Smooth onboarding into studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5464\" data-end=\"5524\">Without this step, the admission process remains incomplete.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5526\" data-end=\"5529\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16devak\" data-start=\"5531\" data-end=\"5573\">Complete B.Com Admission Process Summary</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"a102a4\" data-start=\"5575\" data-end=\"5595\">Step-by-Step Flow</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9rzptd\" data-start=\"5597\" data-end=\"5629\">Step 1: Submit Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5630\" data-end=\"5675\">Fill in personal and academic details online.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bazspl\" data-start=\"5677\" data-end=\"5708\">Step 2: Enroll in Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5709\" data-end=\"5757\">Verify eligibility and confirm course selection.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kyof3i\" data-start=\"5759\" data-end=\"5789\">Step 3: Complete Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5790\" data-end=\"5825\">Choose one-time or EMI/loan option.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"62gr72\" data-start=\"5827\" data-end=\"5852\">Step 4: Secure Seat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5853\" data-end=\"5890\">Receive final admission confirmation.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"762\">The eligibility criteria for the B.Com program define the <strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"643\">minimum academic qualification required</strong> for students who wish to pursue a career in commerce, accounting, finance, taxation, banking, and business management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"1030\">This program is structured to be <strong data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"825\">inclusive and accessible</strong>, allowing students from different educational boards and backgrounds to apply without restrictions. It ensures that every eligible student gets an equal opportunity to pursue higher education in commerce.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1186\">The eligibility rules are designed in accordance with standard university admission norms, making the program widely acceptable and academically credible.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1bfl0lz\" data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1245\">Minimum Qualification Required for B.Com Admission</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ra33z9\" data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1276\">Basic Academic Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1392\">To be eligible for admission into the B.Com program, a student must meet at least one of the following conditions:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1539\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bd1yrv\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1480\">Must have successfully passed the <strong data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1469\">10+2 (Higher Secondary) examination</strong><br data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1472\"><strong data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1478\">OR</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12njkx6\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1539\">Must be <strong data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1539\">currently appearing for the 10+2 examination</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1641\">This ensures that both completed and final-year school students are eligible to apply for admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1646\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"b1adj3\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1693\">Accepted Educational Boards for Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1886\">Students from multiple recognized national and international education boards are eligible for admission into the B.Com program. This ensures flexibility and equal access to higher education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1891\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ppm60i\" data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1916\">State Board Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"2008\">Students who have completed their 10+2 from any recognized State Board are fully eligible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2029\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2228\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nsho24\" data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2086\">Recognized by State Government education authorities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n7itze\" data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2128\">Offers structured academic curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15wkqeg\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2184\">Strong foundation in commerce and business subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l8nepc\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2228\">Valid for all higher education programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2335\">State Board students form a major portion of commerce aspirants and are fully prepared for B.Com studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xyhe0j\" data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2388\">CBSE (Central Board of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2437\">CBSE students are fully eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2458\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2625\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s0zpef\" data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2494\">National-level recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"176a77l\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2536\">Concept-based and structured syllabus</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15xdzo\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2581\">Strong focus on commerce and mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zfcop3\" data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2625\">Widely accepted across India and abroad</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2712\">CBSE students are often well-prepared for analytical and financial subjects in B.Com.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2717\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n4i1v5\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2770\">ICSE (Indian Certificate of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2819\">ICSE board students are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2840\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"3016\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"120dipc\" data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2880\">Detailed and comprehensive syllabus</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m11hpq\" data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2923\">Strong English and communication focus</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tvkrvh\" data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2967\">Conceptual clarity in commerce subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rvtfpd\" data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3016\">Suitable for professional courses like B.Com</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3109\">ICSE students develop strong analytical and writing skills beneficial for commerce careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3111\" data-end=\"3114\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b0ffe9\" data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3162\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3164\" data-end=\"3206\">NIOS students are fully eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3227\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3407\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sf1vlh\" data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3275\">Government-recognized open schooling system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h3wu1o\" data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3307\">Flexible learning structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yxskv1\" data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3360\">Suitable for working or non-traditional students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l60dlh\" data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3407\">Fully valid for higher education admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3492\">NIOS provides equal opportunity to students who follow alternative education paths.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3497\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x008qw\" data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3534\">IB (International Baccalaureate)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3575\">IB students are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3596\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3745\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w34gff\" data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3631\">Globally recognized curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ryhl3j\" data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3668\">Research-based learning approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oynplf\" data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3709\">Strong critical thinking development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rqx0bo\" data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3745\">International academic exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3817\">IB students are well-suited for global finance and business education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3819\" data-end=\"3822\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tkcnz\" data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"3891\">IGCSE (International General Certificate of Secondary Education)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3926\">IGCSE students are also eligible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80isq0\" data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"3947\">Key Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"4117\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19qua1j\" data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"3990\">Internationally accepted qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lkgnmn\" data-start=\"3991\" data-end=\"4028\">Application-based learning system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"md4zc7\" data-start=\"4029\" data-end=\"4064\">Strong conceptual understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vqk3rm\" data-start=\"4065\" data-end=\"4117\">Prepares students for global education standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4119\" data-end=\"4188\">IGCSE students bring strong analytical and practical learning skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4193\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"134pbc9\" data-start=\"4195\" data-end=\"4251\">Eligibility for Students Appearing in 10+2 Examination</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bbvfnb\" data-start=\"4253\" data-end=\"4287\">Important Admission Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4289\" data-end=\"4407\">Students who are currently <strong data-start=\"4316\" data-end=\"4357\">appearing for their 10+2 examinations</strong> are also eligible to apply for the B.Com program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4409\" data-end=\"4494\">This provision allows students to apply in advance without waiting for final results.</p>', '<p data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"679\">The B.Com program fee structure is designed to remain <strong data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"598\">affordable, flexible, and student-friendly</strong>, while still maintaining high academic standards and quality education delivery.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"878\">The total cost of the program is structured in a way that allows students to choose between <strong data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"835\">one-time payment, yearly payment, or semester-wise payment</strong>, depending on their financial convenience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"1036\">This flexible system ensures that students from different financial backgrounds can easily pursue a professional commerce degree without financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1041\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1bd9pd4\" data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1069\">Total B.Com Program Fees</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1a2htk7\" data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1096\">Complete Fee Breakdown</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1166\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1124\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1124\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1114\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1124\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1166\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1166\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1154\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total B.Com Fees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1166\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹120,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6y4m0z\" data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1194\">What This Fee Includes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1229\">The total fee of ₹120,000 covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1496\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uzk4k1\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1278\">Academic tuition for the full B.Com program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"amx8xp\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1345\">Core commerce subjects (accounting, taxation, economics, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zrvvdb\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1387\">Business and finance-related training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c3usse\" data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1439\">Digital learning resources and academic support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xjdfq8\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1496\">Examination preparation support (excluding exam fee)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1562\">This is the base program fee required for completing the degree.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1567\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"r21gzc\" data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1608\">Flexible Payment Options for Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1700\">To make higher education accessible, the B.Com program offers multiple payment structures.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1705\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83is7d\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1732\">1. Yearly Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1759\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1783\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1796\">₹40,000/-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xgbuwx\" data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1837\">Understanding Yearly Payment Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1922\">Under this plan, the total program cost is divided into annual payments of ₹40,000.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1940\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2129\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o3rz0d\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1980\">Easier financial planning per year</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dxhgyf\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2024\">Reduced burden compared to full payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c4a7es\" data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2081\">Suitable for students preferring structured payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bohjvy\" data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2129\">Helps manage education expenses efficiently</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2134\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1minad7\" data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2168\">2. Semester-Wise Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2234\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2195\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2195\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2185\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2195\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2234\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2234\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2221\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2234\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹20,000/-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tg8ndh\" data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2277\">Understanding Semester Payment Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2329\">In this option, students pay ₹20,000 per semester.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2347\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2491\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tara13\" data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2378\">Lower installment amounts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"huky77\" data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2420\">Flexible short-term payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h65wl8\" data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2450\">Easy financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18c9cgr\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2491\">Most preferred option among students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2496\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yt3u32\" data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2532\">3. One-Time Full Payment Option</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2603\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2559\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2559\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2549\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2559\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2603\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2603\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2589\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2603\">₹120,000/-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19lh2mc\" data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2639\">Understanding One-Time Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2714\">Students can choose to pay the full program fee at once during admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2732\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2869\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7nnhg0\" data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2773\">No future payment tracking required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wn4k55\" data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2804\">Complete financial closure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wj5nlp\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2836\">Faster admission processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z00784\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2869\">Stress-free academic journey</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2874\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gyhbak\" data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2902\">Additional Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"3011\">Apart from the main tuition fee, students are required to pay additional charges depending on their region.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3073\">These include registration fees and annual examination fees.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3078\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qqn3gu\" data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3117\">Additional Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3227\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3140\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3140\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3130\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3140\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3227\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3189\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3179\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3189\">₹2,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3227\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3208\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3227\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pigotn\" data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3254\">Purpose of These Fees</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3415\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tnrsql\" data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3335\">Registration Fee: Used for admission processing and student record creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xfkqwh\" data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3415\">Examination Fee: Covers conduct of exams, evaluation, and result processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3420\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1b3aond\" data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3458\">Additional Fees for SAARC Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3460\" data-end=\"3560\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3460\" data-end=\"3481\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3460\" data-end=\"3481\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3460\" data-end=\"3471\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3481\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3560\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3522\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3511\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3522\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹11,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3560\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3541\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3560\">₹3,750 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3577\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3704\">These charges apply to students from SAARC countries and support cross-border academic administration and evaluation systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3709\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"puptap\" data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3755\">Additional Fees for International Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3860\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3778\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3778\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3768\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3778\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3860\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3825\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3817\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3825\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3860\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3844\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3860\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$50 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"862\">The B.Com program with AI integration is a next-generation commerce degree designed to combine <strong data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"723\">traditional accounting, taxation, audit, and finance</strong> with modern technologies such as <strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"861\">Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Data Analytics, ESG Finance, and Digital Business Systems</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"1085\">This syllabus is structured to build students into <strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"955\">industry-ready finance professionals</strong> who can work in corporate accounting, auditing, financial analysis, taxation, banking, fintech, and global business environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1225\">Each semester progressively develops skills from foundational business knowledge to advanced AI-powered financial decision-making systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1230\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kz23b2\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1296\">Semester 1: Business Foundations, Accounting &amp; AI Introduction</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1315\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1481\">The first semester focuses on building strong foundations in accounting, business communication, human resource basics, and introductory AI applications in finance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1r\" data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1520\">Courses Covered in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1737\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hg1ei\" data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1533\">English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"df3ssj\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1567\">HRM &amp; Organizational Behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mml2zh\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1616\">AI-Enabled Financial Accounting for Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tiyk2b\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1670\">AI and Business Technology in the Digital Economy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1otf8f9\" data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1703\">Foundations of Generative AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mcgclj\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1737\">Financial Literacy &amp; Planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qnj3z4\" data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1775\">What You Learn in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1823\">Students begin their journey by understanding:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"2117\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qprkyp\" data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1873\">Basics of financial accounting with AI tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10xcb5i\" data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1925\">Business communication and professional writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ecdti6\" data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1970\">Human resource behavior in organizations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2pic7o\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2017\">Digital transformation in business systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yn1h9j\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2071\">Personal financial planning and investment basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bwvkcu\" data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2117\">Introduction to Generative AI in business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2122\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bwuu5n\" data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2150\">Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2300\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jtm87i\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2178\">Business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m5mhfh\" data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2206\">Accounting fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g74mtu\" data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2234\">Organizational behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9baolp\" data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2264\">AI-driven financial tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1syv3ze\" data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2300\">Financial literacy and planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2305\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1t6aw7q\" data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2368\">Semester 2: Management Accounting, Law &amp; Digital Governance</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2387\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2518\">This semester focuses on financial decision-making, corporate law, taxation basics, and AI applications in management accounting.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1o\" data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2557\">Courses Covered in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2759\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hqyc6d\" data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2596\">Data-Driven Management Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s1wkz2\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2637\">Corporate Law and Digital Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tdw1l1\" data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2683\">AI Applications in Performance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2706\">Business Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozme4o\" data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2732\">Communicative English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2lyav\" data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2759\">Virtual Accounting Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2764\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qnj3z7\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2797\">What You Learn in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2833\">Students develop understanding of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"3101\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j03ycs\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2877\">Cost and management accounting systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11jazwx\" data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2923\">Corporate legal frameworks and compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u7v9ag\" data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2968\">Digital governance and data privacy laws</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"41xm1d\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3011\">Business economics and market behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g9guv3\" data-start=\"3012\" data-end=\"3054\">Performance measurement using AI tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8uks45\" data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3101\">Virtual accounting systems and simulations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3106\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bwuu5n\" data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3134\">Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3296\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ns06u7\" data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3167\">Budgeting and cost analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17lvchy\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3200\">KPI and performance tracking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1691a88\" data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3231\">GST and compliance systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9etdcd\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3265\">Data visualization in finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nre2h1\" data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3296\">Managerial decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3301\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"d07acf\" data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3367\">Semester 3: Smart Auditing, Financial Reporting &amp; AI Assurance</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3386\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3498\">This semester focuses on auditing systems, financial reporting standards, and AI-assisted assurance processes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3503\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1p\" data-start=\"3505\" data-end=\"3537\">Courses Covered in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3740\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9l00lo\" data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3580\">Smart Auditing and AI-Based Assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml60gp\" data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3617\">AI-Assisted Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2s74wu\" data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3661\">Intelligent Financial Reporting Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ibobe\" data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3689\">Indian Knowledge System</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jpcxlo\" data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3714\">Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1skrokk\" data-start=\"3715\" data-end=\"3740\">Environmental Science</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3742\" data-end=\"3745\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qnj3z6\" data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3778\">What You Learn in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3780\" data-end=\"3816\">Students gain advanced knowledge in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"4043\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzdy07\" data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3847\">AI-based auditing systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q305bb\" data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3879\">Internal control frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16r14a0\" data-start=\"3880\" data-end=\"3920\">Financial reporting standards (IFRS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b258sc\" data-start=\"3921\" data-end=\"3963\">Ratio and financial statement analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z92re9\" data-start=\"3964\" data-end=\"3998\">Research techniques in finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hg66pg\" data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4043\">Environmental sustainability in business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4048\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bwuu5n\" data-start=\"4050\" data-end=\"4076\">Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4235\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djxbb9\" data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4110\">Audit and compliance systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ibcmu\" data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4147\">Financial analysis and reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xi1ije\" data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4172\">Data-driven auditing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0gx17\" data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4207\">Environmental financial impact</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"osmywb\" data-start=\"4208\" data-end=\"4235\">Risk evaluation systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4237\" data-end=\"4240\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ka0b2n\" data-start=\"4242\" data-end=\"4304\">Semester 4: Taxation, Strategy &amp; Data-Driven Decision Making</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4323\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4443\">This semester focuses on taxation systems, business strategy, marketing analytics, and advanced decision intelligence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4448\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1m\" data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4482\">Courses Covered in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4484\" data-end=\"4724\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"4484\" data-end=\"4508\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"op1b9w\" data-start=\"4509\" data-end=\"4559\">AI-Enabled Tax Planning and Digital Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uviazr\" data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4610\">Business Strategy and Leadership in the AI Era</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mchf4v\" data-start=\"4611\" data-end=\"4672\">Data-Driven Strategic Reporting and Decision Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"skuumi\" data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4700\">Quantitative Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rdg3fy\" data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4724\">Virtual Finance Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4726\" data-end=\"4729\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qnj3z9\" data-start=\"4731\" data-end=\"4762\">What You Learn in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4764\" data-end=\"4834\">Students learn how businesses use data and AI for strategic decisions:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4836\" data-end=\"5071\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fe1qmw\" data-start=\"4836\" data-end=\"4872\">GST, income tax, and TDS systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8fdt3v\" data-start=\"4873\" data-end=\"4909\">Advanced tax planning strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19mmmi3\" data-start=\"4910\" data-end=\"4954\">Business leadership in AI-driven economy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"23p9yd\" data-start=\"4955\" data-end=\"4994\">Statistical and regression analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r4poqq\" data-start=\"4995\" data-end=\"5034\">Market segmentation and forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9fzlc0\" data-start=\"5035\" data-end=\"5071\">Power BI for financial reporting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5073\" data-end=\"5076\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bwuu5n\" data-start=\"5078\" data-end=\"5104\">Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5106\" data-end=\"5288\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yagbo6\" data-start=\"5106\" data-end=\"5144\">Tax computation and filing systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4kabzh\" data-start=\"5145\" data-end=\"5183\">Strategic planning and forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nmjebw\" data-start=\"5184\" data-end=\"5224\">Data analytics in business decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l92n6d\" data-start=\"5225\" data-end=\"5259\">Statistical financial modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r19ycy\" data-start=\"5260\" data-end=\"5288\">Market behavior analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5290\" data-end=\"5293\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lnn2b6\" data-start=\"5295\" data-end=\"5365\">Semester 5: Global Finance, Blockchain &amp; Advanced Financial Modeling</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"5367\" data-end=\"5384\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5386\" data-end=\"5504\">This semester focuses on global taxation, financial modeling, blockchain systems, and digital business transformation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5506\" data-end=\"5509\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1n\" data-start=\"5511\" data-end=\"5543\">Courses Covered in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5545\" data-end=\"5757\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bee724\" data-start=\"5545\" data-end=\"5568\">Indian Constitution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10lqe5v\" data-start=\"5569\" data-end=\"5593\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8dg3ng\" data-start=\"5594\" data-end=\"5647\">AI-Driven Advanced Taxation and Global Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s4f581\" data-start=\"5648\" data-end=\"5699\">Digital Finance and AI Applications in Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cg2m9a\" data-start=\"5700\" data-end=\"5722\">Financial Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v5xjmt\" data-start=\"5723\" data-end=\"5757\">Digital Marketing &amp; E-Commerce</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5759\" data-end=\"5762\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qnj3z8\" data-start=\"5764\" data-end=\"5795\">What You Learn in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5797\" data-end=\"5852\">Students gain high-level financial expertise including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5854\" data-end=\"6063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qxtff8\" data-start=\"5854\" data-end=\"5888\">International taxation systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9xpp7h\" data-start=\"5889\" data-end=\"5925\">Foreign exchange risk management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n0deur\" data-start=\"5926\" data-end=\"5958\">Company valuation techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t3v3vj\" data-start=\"5959\" data-end=\"5992\">Merger &amp; acquisition analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f4t4lf\" data-start=\"5993\" data-end=\"6018\">Blockchain in finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1igoike\" data-start=\"6019\" data-end=\"6063\">Digital marketing and e-commerce systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6065\" data-end=\"6068\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bwuu5n\" data-start=\"6070\" data-end=\"6096\">Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6098\" data-end=\"6277\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w3lj1z\" data-start=\"6098\" data-end=\"6138\">DCF valuation and financial modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2qcltx\" data-start=\"6139\" data-end=\"6173\">Global compliance and taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10s2ii2\" data-start=\"6174\" data-end=\"6208\">Blockchain and fintech systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"us9zw7\" data-start=\"6209\" data-end=\"6244\">SEO and digital business growth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mvy8z7\" data-start=\"6245\" data-end=\"6277\">Investment and risk analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6279\" data-end=\"6282\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wzavxb\" data-start=\"6284\" data-end=\"6355\">Semester 6: ESG Finance, AI Audit Systems &amp; Global Business Analytics</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nxsmup\" data-start=\"6357\" data-end=\"6374\">Core Objective</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6376\" data-end=\"6488\">The final semester focuses on global finance, ESG frameworks, AI audit systems, and advanced business analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6490\" data-end=\"6493\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8ew1k\" data-start=\"6495\" data-end=\"6527\">Courses Covered in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6529\" data-end=\"6778\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"6529\" data-end=\"6555\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v2a7n3\" data-start=\"6556\" data-end=\"6596\">Human Values and Professional Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c8l810\" data-start=\"6597\" data-end=\"6640\">AI Tools for Audit, Risk and Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"skfqlm\" data-start=\"6641\" data-end=\"6705\">Digital Tools for Performance Monitoring and Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1twsvd6\" data-start=\"6706\" data-end=\"6748\">Sustainable Finance and ESG Strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13btnln\" data-start=\"6749\" data-end=\"6778\">Business Analytics and AI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6780\" data-end=\"6783\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qnj3zb\" data-start=\"6785\" data-end=\"6816\">What You Learn in Semester 6</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6818\" data-end=\"6848\">Students develop expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6850\" data-end=\"7120\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eto2u2\" data-start=\"6850\" data-end=\"6904\">ESG (Environmental, Social, Governance) frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i4gs3m\" data-start=\"6905\" data-end=\"6947\">AI-driven auditing and fraud detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sl1sct\" data-start=\"6948\" data-end=\"6992\">Global capital markets and forex systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nvi4z1\" data-start=\"6993\" data-end=\"7035\">SAP ERP and enterprise finance systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q8xpu4\" data-start=\"7036\" data-end=\"7079\">Continuous auditing and risk monitoring</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tvuazl\" data-start=\"7080\" data-end=\"7120\">Sustainable and green finance models</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7122\" data-end=\"7125\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bwuu5n\" data-start=\"7127\" data-end=\"7153\">Skill Development Focus</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7155\" data-end=\"7325\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eb6na9\" data-start=\"7155\" data-end=\"7187\">ESG reporting and compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u77s5t\" data-start=\"7188\" data-end=\"7233\">Capital markets and fixed income analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a9ct2r\" data-start=\"7234\" data-end=\"7266\">Corporate governance systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g5re47\" data-start=\"7267\" data-end=\"7295\">AI-based fraud detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19xpidt\" data-start=\"7296\" data-end=\"7325\">Financial risk management</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 120000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(311, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 279, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 03:54:12', '2026-06-16 07:14:37', '<p data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1046\">The online enrollment system allows students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ka3omd\" data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1066\">Apply from home</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tma8ew\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1097\">Upload documents digitally</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dprsan\" data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1131\">Complete fee payment securely</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"125oekq\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1173\">Receive admission confirmation online</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1382\">The process is structured in a way that minimizes paperwork and simplifies admissions. However, accuracy is extremely important because even small mistakes in personal or academic details can delay approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dhi5f6\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1447\">Step 1: Visit the Official Vignan Online Enrollment Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1543\">The first stage of admission begins by accessing the official Vignan Online enrollment portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1562\">Students need to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15w9lxf\" data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1627\">Click on the official <strong data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1618\">&ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo; or &ldquo;Enroll Now&rdquo;</strong> option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6r5ko\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1663\">Open the online enrollment form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ghbur\" data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1730\">Begin the registration process through the admission dashboard</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1r7vydk\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1771\">Why This Step Is Extremely Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1877\">Many students make the mistake of filling forms on unofficial or third-party websites. This can lead to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1986\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zs7rqb\" data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1914\">Incorrect application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9r7ch1\" data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1942\">Fraudulent fee payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nb80by\" data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1965\">Data privacy risks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dop95z\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1986\">Admission delays</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2106\">Always verify that you are using the official Vignan Online admission portal before entering any personal information.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2111\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4hsgq2\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2165\">Information You Should Keep Ready Before Starting</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2271\">Preparing documents and information beforehand helps avoid interruptions during the application process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h3mlaj\" data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2303\">Important Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2484\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b7olm6\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2347\">Full name as per official certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mizif\" data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2372\">Active mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pp80n3\" data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2391\">Valid email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18y1vi6\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2426\">Academic qualification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2455\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kzxp52\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2484\">Identity proof documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1my1m11\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2500\">Expert Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2659\">Use an email ID and mobile number that you regularly access because all admission updates, login credentials, and important notifications will be sent there.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2664\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"c5gpum\" data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2719\">Step 2: Sign Up and Complete the Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2827\">Once you access the portal, the next stage involves account creation and completing the application steps.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2829\" data-end=\"2832\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1r4o12w\" data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2864\">Create Your Student Account</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2920\">Students must first register themselves on the portal.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gbxzar\" data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2955\">Registration Process Includes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"3088\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1saf2d4\" data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2983\">Entering basic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jr0s2\" data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3014\">Creating login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ado5bg\" data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3053\">Verifying mobile/email through OTP</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o4zxb9\" data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3088\">Activating the student account</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3173\">After successful registration, students can proceed with the full application form.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3178\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"puevgu\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3222\">Complete the Essential Enrollment Steps</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3316\">The admission process generally includes multiple sections that must be completed carefully.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12xfb76\" data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3342\">Personal Information</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3369\">Students need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3440\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2yru7\" data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3378\">Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3396\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3416\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19381gy\" data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3440\">Address information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"185bhtt\" data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3462\">Academic Details</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3484\">Students must enter:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3592\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tbi9z9\" data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3505\">Class 10 details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bd864n\" data-start=\"3506\" data-end=\"3526\">Class 12 details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ooktt\" data-start=\"3527\" data-end=\"3565\">Graduation details (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ghiw9n\" data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3592\">Marks and passing year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cx2cgi\" data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3615\">Program Selection</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3664\">Choose your preferred online program carefully.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3666\" data-end=\"3704\">This is an important decision because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3829\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ndnexm\" data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3749\">Changing programs later may be difficult</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1joo5h4\" data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3777\">Fee structures can vary</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m26o2w\" data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3829\">Career outcomes depend on specialization choice</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18v9r9m\" data-start=\"3831\" data-end=\"3850\">Document Upload</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3852\" data-end=\"3880\">Students may need to upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3965\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"88qwiz\" data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3906\">Academic certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rsbash\" data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3919\">ID proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djs98o\" data-start=\"3920\" data-end=\"3934\">Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qzduov\" data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"3965\">Other supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"3970\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"f493m3\" data-start=\"3972\" data-end=\"4021\">Common Mistakes Students Make During Enrollment</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4023\" data-end=\"4127\">A large number of application delays happen because students rush through the form without verification.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1na3ypn\" data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4153\">Major Errors to Avoid</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4330\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwodsa\" data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4186\">Incorrect spelling of names</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18uzkm3\" data-start=\"4187\" data-end=\"4217\">Wrong marks or percentages</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kxf499\" data-start=\"4218\" data-end=\"4249\">Uploading blurred documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g0ia1z\" data-start=\"4250\" data-end=\"4284\">Using inactive contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19b9srs\" data-start=\"4285\" data-end=\"4330\">Selecting the wrong course specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17gkbsd\" data-start=\"4332\" data-end=\"4363\">Hidden Risk Students Ignore</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4365\" data-end=\"4529\">If your name in the application does not exactly match your certificates, the university may request correction documents later, which can delay admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4531\" data-end=\"4534\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vxyo72\" data-start=\"4536\" data-end=\"4565\">Step 3: Pay the Program Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4567\" data-end=\"4663\">After completing the application form, students must pay the required fee to confirm enrollment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4713\">The payment process is fully online and secured.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4715\" data-end=\"4718\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"r38xuy\" data-start=\"4720\" data-end=\"4748\">Available Payment Methods</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"4773\">Students can pay using:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4774\" data-end=\"4858\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"4774\" data-end=\"4789\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"4790\" data-end=\"4804\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"4805\" data-end=\"4820\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sezyli\" data-start=\"4821\" data-end=\"4858\">Easy EMI Options with 0% Interest</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4860\" data-end=\"4863\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18os7q6\" data-start=\"4865\" data-end=\"4902\">Understanding EMI Payment Benefits</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4904\" data-end=\"4976\">Many students prefer EMI options because they reduce financial pressure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vd3t06\" data-start=\"4978\" data-end=\"4999\">Advantages of EMI</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5001\" data-end=\"5131\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"133abd\" data-start=\"5001\" data-end=\"5037\">Lower immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yml52y\" data-start=\"5038\" data-end=\"5067\">Flexible payment planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b2ywq0\" data-start=\"5068\" data-end=\"5131\">Easier affordability for working professionals and students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1llziol\" data-start=\"5133\" data-end=\"5163\">Important Financial Advice</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5165\" data-end=\"5185\">Before choosing EMI:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5186\" data-end=\"5299\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wc5ocj\" data-start=\"5186\" data-end=\"5216\">Check installment duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"142i907\" data-start=\"5217\" data-end=\"5251\">Understand repayment schedules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2zl8jy\" data-start=\"5252\" data-end=\"5299\">Verify whether any processing charges apply</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5301\" data-end=\"5427\">Although 0% interest EMI sounds attractive, students should still understand the complete payment structure before proceeding.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"433\">Understanding the eligibility criteria is one of the most important steps before applying for any undergraduate management program. Many students focus only on course selection and ignore admission requirements, which later leads to application rejection, counseling confusion, or document verification problems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"827\">The eligibility rules for this program are designed to ensure that students possess the academic foundation required to handle business studies, analytical subjects, and modern management concepts effectively. Since the curriculum includes areas such as finance, business analytics, economics, and Artificial Intelligence fundamentals, mathematical understanding becomes especially important.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"1094\">This detailed guide explains the complete eligibility criteria, minimum marks requirements, accepted boards, mathematics eligibility, reserved category relaxation, appearing student eligibility, and important admission insights students should know before applying.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1099\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hzlzxs\" data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1143\">Basic Eligibility Criteria for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1239\">Students seeking admission must fulfill the academic requirements specified by the university.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ctvsl9\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1266\">Required Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1426\">Applicants must have passed the <strong data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1320\">10+2 examination</strong> or equivalent from a recognized educational board approved by the State Government or Central Government.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1f2ghu1\" data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1462\">Accepted Educational Boards</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1553\">Students from multiple recognized educational boards are eligible to apply for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"m7gfw1\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1581\">Accepted Boards Include</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1751\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j42xq\" data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1630\">CBSE (Central Board of Secondary Education)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1olewja\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1647\">State Boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1inkw64\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1695\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qhw6us\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1704\">ICSE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4sf703\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1714\">IGCSE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"90i5z9\" data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1751\">IB (International Baccalaureate)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1756\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ux6rxl\" data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1785\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1899\">Students must secure a minimum aggregate score in their qualifying examination to become eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"2036\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1912\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1942\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Aggregate Required</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"2036\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1995\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1972\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"1995\">50% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2036\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2013\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SC/ST Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2036\">45% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2145\">A relaxation of 5% marks is provided to students belonging to SC/ST categories as per admission guidelines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2150\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w4pkkr\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2187\">Mathematics Requirement Explained</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2331\">One of the most important eligibility conditions is that students must have studied <strong data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2306\">Mathematics as a core subject</strong> in their 10+2 education.</p>', '<p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"472\">Understanding the complete fee structure before taking admission is one of the most important steps for students planning to pursue an online degree program. Many students focus only on the tuition fee and ignore additional expenses such as registration charges, examination fees, and long-term payment planning. This often creates financial confusion later during the course.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"783\">The Vignan Online fee structure is designed to provide flexibility through semester-wise, annual, and total payment plans for both Indian and international students. The university also offers multiple payment options, making higher education more accessible for students from different financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"986\">This detailed guide explains the complete fee structure, additional charges, payment strategy, hidden cost insights, and important financial considerations students should understand before enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"991\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ouaexz\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1042\">Vignan Online Fee Structure for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1249\">The fee structure for Indian students and SAARC nation candidates is designed with flexible installment options so students can choose a payment model according to their convenience and financial planning.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nqewss\" data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1293\">Fee Structure Table for Indian Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1306\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1316\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1358\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1347\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1358\">₹18,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1377\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1388\">₹36,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1409\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1422\">₹1,08,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"akhdg1\" data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1470\">Additional Charges for Indian Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1556\">Apart from tuition fees, students should also consider mandatory university charges.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1674\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1575\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1585\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1674\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1636\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1626\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1636\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1674\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1664\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1674\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1679\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19kzlc5\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1722\">Fee Structure for SAARC Nation Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1819\">Students from SAARC countries may have slightly different registration and examination charges.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vz6nli\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1861\">Additional Charges for SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1968\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1890\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1890\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1880\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1890\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1968\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1930\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1920\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1930\">₹2,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1968\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1958\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1968\">₹4,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"1973\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aabzoc\" data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2025\">Vignan Online Fee Structure for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2131\">International students can also enroll in the program through a dedicated foreign student fee structure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1po900n\" data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2176\">Fee Structure Table for Foreign Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2296\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2199\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2199\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2199\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2296\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2238\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2230\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2238\">$300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2265\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2257\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2265\">$600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2296\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2286\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2296\">$1,800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2301\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1r1ke0a\" data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2345\">Additional Charges for Foreign Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2457\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2374\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2374\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2364\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2374\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2457\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2422\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2415\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2422\">$30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2457\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2450\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2457\">$60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<h1 data-section-id=\"1pndr23\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1044\">First Semester: Building Core Business Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1332\">The first semester focuses on helping students understand how businesses function, how managers make decisions, and how communication and economics influence organizations. This stage is extremely important because it creates the academic base required for advanced management learning.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"20ahq1\" data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1375\">Principles and Practices of Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1514\">This subject introduces students to the fundamentals of management, including planning, organizing, staffing, directing, and controlling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1538\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzew2r\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1566\">Functions of management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mmyupg\" data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1592\">Leadership principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im6e7f\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1621\">Organizational structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h1du7j\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1651\">Decision-making processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kd6hdd\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1702\">Management theories and practical applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aqi6he\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1732\">Why This Subject Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1962\">Students often underestimate this paper, but it forms the backbone of every managerial role. Understanding management principles early helps students perform better in HR, marketing, operations, and entrepreneurship roles later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1967\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19odwf7\" data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1994\">Business Communication</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2178\">Strong communication skills are one of the biggest differentiators in corporate careers. This subject develops professional communication abilities required in business environments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2198\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2337\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r1fa5i\" data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2223\">Verbal communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wtjx3d\" data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2258\">Written business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"100ww9o\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2282\">Presentation skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x3682n\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2310\">Corporate email writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"125j4sf\" data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2337\">Professional etiquette</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wji1vs\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2362\">Industry Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2562\">Many graduates struggle during placements not because of low technical knowledge but because of poor communication confidence. This subject directly improves employability and interview performance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2567\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dj4fjh\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2592\">Financial Accounting</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2704\">Financial Accounting teaches students how organizations record, analyze, and interpret financial transactions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6gypbi\" data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2723\">Core Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2838\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bpdehn\" data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2743\">Journal entries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hfbe30\" data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2766\">Ledger preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gtld0s\" data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2784\">Trial balance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"390cs7\" data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2809\">Financial statements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fhy9qc\" data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2838\">Profit and loss analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qzu2it\" data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2860\">Career Relevance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"3018\">Accounting knowledge is valuable even for non-finance careers because managers across departments must understand budgets, costs, and financial performance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3023\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10mn6tz\" data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3048\">Business Mathematics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3123\">This subject develops analytical and quantitative problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wyagg4\" data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3144\">Important Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3260\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7o697a\" data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3156\">Algebra</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ijfad\" data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3172\">Probability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uopys\" data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3198\">Interest calculations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"judcey\" data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3219\">Linear equations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rmkqhm\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3260\">Business-related mathematical models</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"smltqd\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3281\">Strategic Value</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3425\">Students planning careers in finance, analytics, operations, or MBA entrance exams benefit significantly from strong mathematical foundations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3430\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pi2n1b\" data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3453\">Business Economics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3553\">Business Economics explains how economic principles affect business decisions and market behavior.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3574\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3684\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11dawvr\" data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3596\">Demand and supply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dhku7e\" data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3618\">Market structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xcc75m\" data-start=\"3619\" data-end=\"3640\">Consumer behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h3mpcz\" data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3662\">Pricing decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11x4kld\" data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3684\">Economic policies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qzyb9l\" data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3712\">Real-World Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3819\">This subject helps students understand why businesses succeed or fail under changing economic conditions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3824\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"csmqax\" data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3888\">Second Semester: Developing Business and Legal Understanding</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3890\" data-end=\"4019\">The second semester expands the student&rsquo;s understanding of the external business environment, law, statistics, and cost analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4024\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qtx87q\" data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4049\">Business Environment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4149\">Students learn how political, economic, technological, and social factors influence organizations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8amtvm\" data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4167\">Key Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4168\" data-end=\"4296\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"emnswr\" data-start=\"4168\" data-end=\"4191\">Government policies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10fov5h\" data-start=\"4192\" data-end=\"4212\">Economic reforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dmabt\" data-start=\"4213\" data-end=\"4237\">Business regulations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tlcjio\" data-start=\"4238\" data-end=\"4269\">Global business environment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u9nudq\" data-start=\"4270\" data-end=\"4296\">Emerging market trends</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lrggvp\" data-start=\"4298\" data-end=\"4316\">Why It Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4318\" data-end=\"4441\">Managers who understand external business environments make smarter strategic decisions and adapt faster to market changes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4443\" data-end=\"4446\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fqjs33\" data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4466\">Cost Accounting</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4468\" data-end=\"4533\">This subject focuses on analyzing and controlling business costs.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yg7hu1\" data-start=\"4535\" data-end=\"4552\">Core Learning</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4553\" data-end=\"4666\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yeem2d\" data-start=\"4553\" data-end=\"4576\">Cost classification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10fwd5h\" data-start=\"4577\" data-end=\"4603\">Cost sheet preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"29jgbx\" data-start=\"4604\" data-end=\"4617\">Budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rmn0y3\" data-start=\"4618\" data-end=\"4645\">Cost control techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dga09c\" data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4666\">Marginal costing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2xukcv\" data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4688\">Career Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4690\" data-end=\"4796\">Cost understanding is highly valuable in finance, manufacturing, operations, and strategic planning roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4798\" data-end=\"4801\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hisg6e\" data-start=\"4803\" data-end=\"4825\">Business Statistics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4917\">Business Statistics introduces data analysis techniques used for business decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ffhpan\" data-start=\"4919\" data-end=\"4935\">Major Topics</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4936\" data-end=\"5065\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uvke42\" data-start=\"4936\" data-end=\"4959\">Data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n8k69g\" data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"4990\">Correlation and regression</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zz6a6b\" data-start=\"4991\" data-end=\"5015\">Statistical averages</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"75g9mf\" data-start=\"5016\" data-end=\"5040\">Probability analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xg9dyt\" data-start=\"5041\" data-end=\"5065\">Business forecasting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6slual\" data-start=\"5067\" data-end=\"5089\">Industry Relevance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5091\" data-end=\"5266\">Modern companies increasingly depend on data-driven decisions. Statistical knowledge strengthens analytical thinking and supports future learning in business analytics and AI.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5268\" data-end=\"5271\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8jxhsp\" data-start=\"5273\" data-end=\"5288\">Business Law</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5290\" data-end=\"5352\">Students learn legal principles governing business operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"5354\" data-end=\"5372\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5373\" data-end=\"5502\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uczlls\" data-start=\"5373\" data-end=\"5389\">Contract law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsh3bw\" data-start=\"5390\" data-end=\"5418\">Consumer protection laws</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n4jm0s\" data-start=\"5419\" data-end=\"5441\">Company law basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ebybv\" data-start=\"5442\" data-end=\"5475\">Legal obligations in business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"61a27n\" data-start=\"5476\" data-end=\"5502\">Commercial regulations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1r01u8r\" data-start=\"5504\" data-end=\"5522\">Hidden Benefit</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5524\" data-end=\"5632\">Understanding business law helps future managers avoid compliance mistakes and legal risks in organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5637\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"za8nr\" data-start=\"5639\" data-end=\"5701\">Coding for Managers &amp; Environmental Studies (Field Project)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5703\" data-end=\"5793\">This innovative subject combines basic technology awareness with sustainability education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"5795\" data-end=\"5815\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5816\" data-end=\"5932\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2i2p0f\" data-start=\"5816\" data-end=\"5848\">Introductory coding concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17wd50i\" data-start=\"5849\" data-end=\"5869\">Digital thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wc2cfv\" data-start=\"5870\" data-end=\"5897\">Environmental awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ns6pp\" data-start=\"5898\" data-end=\"5932\">Field-based project experience</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kfhzz6\" data-start=\"5934\" data-end=\"5973\">Why This Subject Is Future-Oriented</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5975\" data-end=\"6112\">Managers today work closely with technology teams. Basic coding understanding improves digital adaptability and managerial effectiveness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6114\" data-end=\"6117\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"equyat\" data-start=\"6119\" data-end=\"6177\">Third Semester: Introduction to Modern Management and AI</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6179\" data-end=\"6299\">The third semester marks the transition from basic business education to advanced managerial and technological concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6301\" data-end=\"6304\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18qb91t\" data-start=\"6306\" data-end=\"6332\">Introduction to AI &amp; ML</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6334\" data-end=\"6487\">Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning are transforming every business sector. This subject introduces students to AI-driven business applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48l5vi\" data-start=\"6489\" data-end=\"6507\">Learning Focus</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6508\" data-end=\"6662\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13tkorf\" data-start=\"6508\" data-end=\"6545\">Basics of Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bpcjyi\" data-start=\"6546\" data-end=\"6575\">Machine Learning concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rdxwqe\" data-start=\"6576\" data-end=\"6602\">Automation in business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8t9j8p\" data-start=\"6603\" data-end=\"6633\">AI-powered decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9e9fld\" data-start=\"6634\" data-end=\"6662\">Future technology trends</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16dpikw\" data-start=\"6664\" data-end=\"6685\">Career Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6687\" data-end=\"6819\">Students with AI awareness gain a major competitive advantage in modern industries including marketing, finance, HR, and operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6821\" data-end=\"6824\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vg99fs\" data-start=\"6826\" data-end=\"6867\">Business Ethics &amp; Corporate Governance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6869\" data-end=\"6952\">This subject teaches ethical business practices and responsible corporate behavior.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"6954\" data-end=\"6973\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6974\" data-end=\"7079\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n03bnv\" data-start=\"6974\" data-end=\"6994\">Corporate ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lrp0m8\" data-start=\"6995\" data-end=\"7011\">Transparency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ejixpn\" data-start=\"7012\" data-end=\"7030\">Accountability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h46009\" data-start=\"7031\" data-end=\"7056\">Governance frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mvumbz\" data-start=\"7057\" data-end=\"7079\">Ethical leadership</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qghllv\" data-start=\"7081\" data-end=\"7106\">Industry Significance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7108\" data-end=\"7228\">Companies increasingly prioritize ethical decision-making and governance compliance, especially in leadership positions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7230\" data-end=\"7233\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rbu3di\" data-start=\"7235\" data-end=\"7263\">Business Research Methods</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7265\" data-end=\"7343\">Students learn how to conduct professional business research and analyze data.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"7345\" data-end=\"7367\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7368\" data-end=\"7469\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1skil7n\" data-start=\"7368\" data-end=\"7387\">Research design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kidw3e\" data-start=\"7388\" data-end=\"7406\">Survey methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12bszz8\" data-start=\"7407\" data-end=\"7430\">Sampling techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"obneoe\" data-start=\"7431\" data-end=\"7450\">Data collection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vq9ra6\" data-start=\"7451\" data-end=\"7469\">Report writing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lrggvp\" data-start=\"7471\" data-end=\"7489\">Why It Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7491\" data-end=\"7621\">Research skills are essential for strategic planning, market analysis, and higher education studies like MBA or research programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7623\" data-end=\"7626\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qwpzvj\" data-start=\"7628\" data-end=\"7654\">Organizational Behavior</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7656\" data-end=\"7720\">This subject studies employee psychology and workplace behavior.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"7722\" data-end=\"7740\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7741\" data-end=\"7848\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"142gaos\" data-start=\"7741\" data-end=\"7755\">Motivation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kbcn1v\" data-start=\"7756\" data-end=\"7773\">Team dynamics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rliq65\" data-start=\"7774\" data-end=\"7797\">Leadership behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p9eq2a\" data-start=\"7798\" data-end=\"7824\">Organizational culture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dicrkd\" data-start=\"7825\" data-end=\"7848\">Conflict management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wo7ig1\" data-start=\"7850\" data-end=\"7874\">Practical Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7876\" data-end=\"7959\">Managers who understand human behavior become better leaders and team coordinators.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7961\" data-end=\"7964\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wt2xxz\" data-start=\"7966\" data-end=\"7990\">Management Accounting</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7992\" data-end=\"8085\">Management Accounting focuses on using financial information for internal business decisions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6gypbi\" data-start=\"8087\" data-end=\"8104\">Core Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8105\" data-end=\"8225\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6hqxxb\" data-start=\"8105\" data-end=\"8124\">Budget analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1frs40s\" data-start=\"8125\" data-end=\"8147\">Financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u8egu1\" data-start=\"8148\" data-end=\"8173\">Decision-making tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mbhqau\" data-start=\"8174\" data-end=\"8200\">Performance evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8jarjl\" data-start=\"8201\" data-end=\"8225\">Managerial reporting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imna61\" data-start=\"8227\" data-end=\"8248\">Strategic Benefit</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8250\" data-end=\"8339\">This subject strengthens business decision-making abilities using financial intelligence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8341\" data-end=\"8344\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"154tavw\" data-start=\"8346\" data-end=\"8406\">Fourth Semester: Understanding Functional Management Areas</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"8408\" data-end=\"8497\">The fourth semester focuses on the major operational functions of business organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8499\" data-end=\"8502\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10peha7\" data-start=\"8504\" data-end=\"8527\">Financial Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8529\" data-end=\"8615\">Students learn how organizations manage investments, capital, and financial resources.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcpm5x\" data-start=\"8617\" data-end=\"8630\">Key Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8631\" data-end=\"8749\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wt4ndb\" data-start=\"8631\" data-end=\"8652\">Capital budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1frs40s\" data-start=\"8653\" data-end=\"8675\">Financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqpxbt\" data-start=\"8676\" data-end=\"8693\">Risk analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8smakq\" data-start=\"8694\" data-end=\"8718\">Investment decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15j167s\" data-start=\"8719\" data-end=\"8749\">Working capital management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8751\" data-end=\"8754\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vg1qkw\" data-start=\"8756\" data-end=\"8785\">Human Resources Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8787\" data-end=\"8854\">This subject focuses on employee management and workforce planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fqbqb6\" data-start=\"8856\" data-end=\"8876\">Important Topics</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8877\" data-end=\"8996\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18y7gic\" data-start=\"8877\" data-end=\"8892\">Recruitment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ao7pyo\" data-start=\"8893\" data-end=\"8921\">Training and development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a19rpf\" data-start=\"8922\" data-end=\"8948\">Performance management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ko0hre\" data-start=\"8949\" data-end=\"8973\">Compensation systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jde8v\" data-start=\"8974\" data-end=\"8996\">Employee relations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8998\" data-end=\"9001\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xtt7de\" data-start=\"9003\" data-end=\"9026\">Marketing Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9028\" data-end=\"9102\">Marketing Management explains how businesses attract and retain customers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"9104\" data-end=\"9123\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9124\" data-end=\"9230\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"veb4vn\" data-start=\"9124\" data-end=\"9136\">Branding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xcc75m\" data-start=\"9137\" data-end=\"9158\">Consumer behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ca8xhb\" data-start=\"9159\" data-end=\"9187\">Digital marketing basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lqlrx7\" data-start=\"9188\" data-end=\"9206\">Sales strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3s06q\" data-start=\"9207\" data-end=\"9230\">Market segmentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejt8xa\" data-start=\"9232\" data-end=\"9248\">Career Scope</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9250\" data-end=\"9368\">Marketing remains one of the highest-growth career fields due to digital transformation and online business expansion.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9370\" data-end=\"9373\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p6j9n4\" data-start=\"9375\" data-end=\"9399\">Operations Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9401\" data-end=\"9479\">Students learn how organizations manage production and operational efficiency.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1icij39\" data-start=\"9481\" data-end=\"9497\">Key Learning</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9498\" data-end=\"9619\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qthnt1\" data-start=\"9498\" data-end=\"9525\">Supply chain management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"spkv2d\" data-start=\"9526\" data-end=\"9547\">Inventory control</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t32do6\" data-start=\"9548\" data-end=\"9570\">Quality management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vvhfyu\" data-start=\"9571\" data-end=\"9594\">Production planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7scfsy\" data-start=\"9595\" data-end=\"9619\">Process optimization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9621\" data-end=\"9624\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"prqp8t\" data-start=\"9626\" data-end=\"9694\">Design Thinking &amp; Socially Relevant Project Using Design Thinking</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9696\" data-end=\"9775\">This practical subject develops innovation and creative problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"9777\" data-end=\"9797\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9798\" data-end=\"9903\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tki905\" data-start=\"9798\" data-end=\"9821\">Innovation thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"127qid9\" data-start=\"9822\" data-end=\"9854\">User-centric problem solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mwb0pb\" data-start=\"9855\" data-end=\"9876\">Project execution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uupotf\" data-start=\"9877\" data-end=\"9903\">Social impact analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wj9zye\" data-start=\"9905\" data-end=\"9938\">Why This Subject Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9940\" data-end=\"10058\">Modern companies value professionals who can solve real-world problems creatively rather than simply follow processes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10060\" data-end=\"10063\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13hu794\" data-start=\"10065\" data-end=\"10131\">Fifth Semester: Advanced Business and Global Management Learning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"10133\" data-end=\"10213\">The fifth semester introduces strategic and international business perspectives.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10215\" data-end=\"10218\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ihin5v\" data-start=\"10220\" data-end=\"10241\">Project Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"10243\" data-end=\"10321\">Students learn how to plan, execute, and manage business projects effectively.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"10323\" data-end=\"10341\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10342\" data-end=\"10444\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1undee8\" data-start=\"10342\" data-end=\"10362\">Project planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134sh9k\" data-start=\"10363\" data-end=\"10377\">Scheduling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ak4c8i\" data-start=\"10378\" data-end=\"10401\">Resource allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zpui1k\" data-start=\"10402\" data-end=\"10421\">Risk management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iilyh7\" data-start=\"10422\" data-end=\"10444\">Project evaluation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10446\" data-end=\"10449\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1elnnmh\" data-start=\"10451\" data-end=\"10476\">International Business</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"10478\" data-end=\"10549\">This subject explains global trade and international market operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rev59q\" data-start=\"10551\" data-end=\"10569\">Major Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10570\" data-end=\"10707\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ul2zc\" data-start=\"10570\" data-end=\"10600\">Global business strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19pbbkk\" data-start=\"10601\" data-end=\"10624\">International trade</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7jcu7g\" data-start=\"10625\" data-end=\"10654\">Cross-cultural management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fak3ja\" data-start=\"10655\" data-end=\"10679\">Foreign market entry</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q9hxkq\" data-start=\"10680\" data-end=\"10707\">Global economic systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6slual\" data-start=\"10709\" data-end=\"10731\">Industry Relevance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10733\" data-end=\"10852\">Globalization has increased demand for professionals who understand international markets and global business dynamics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10854\" data-end=\"10857\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xgdldp\" data-start=\"10859\" data-end=\"10891\">Discipline Specific Electives</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"10893\" data-end=\"11003\">The elective subjects allow students to specialize in specific career-oriented areas based on their interests.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n6pakw\" data-start=\"11005\" data-end=\"11038\">Possible Specialization Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11039\" data-end=\"11136\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173ueww\" data-start=\"11039\" data-end=\"11050\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m6xjvw\" data-start=\"11051\" data-end=\"11064\">Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3shte\" data-start=\"11065\" data-end=\"11071\">HR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"11072\" data-end=\"11094\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"11095\" data-end=\"11115\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ivjxjo\" data-start=\"11116\" data-end=\"11136\">Digital Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gpb16a\" data-start=\"11138\" data-end=\"11158\">Strategic Advice</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"11160\" data-end=\"11254\">Students should choose electives based on long-term career goals rather than temporary trends.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11256\" data-end=\"11259\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"lpskif\" data-start=\"11261\" data-end=\"11320\">Sixth Semester: Strategic Leadership and Entrepreneurship</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"11322\" data-end=\"11426\">The final semester prepares students for leadership, entrepreneurship, and professional decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11428\" data-end=\"11431\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6in7z8\" data-start=\"11433\" data-end=\"11452\">Entrepreneurship</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"11454\" data-end=\"11525\">Students learn how to build and manage startups or innovative ventures.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"11527\" data-end=\"11549\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11550\" data-end=\"11674\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bfmwtw\" data-start=\"11550\" data-end=\"11579\">Business idea development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16kccds\" data-start=\"11580\" data-end=\"11600\">Startup planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wlzn70\" data-start=\"11601\" data-end=\"11623\">Funding strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uv0rr1\" data-start=\"11624\" data-end=\"11643\">Risk assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lbbq52\" data-start=\"11644\" data-end=\"11674\">Entrepreneurial leadership</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lrggvp\" data-start=\"11676\" data-end=\"11694\">Why It Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"11696\" data-end=\"11818\">Entrepreneurship skills are valuable even for corporate careers because companies seek innovative and proactive employees.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11820\" data-end=\"11823\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25iabi\" data-start=\"11825\" data-end=\"11848\">Strategic Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"11850\" data-end=\"11938\">This subject focuses on high-level business strategy and organizational growth planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"11940\" data-end=\"11959\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11960\" data-end=\"12078\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmk0lw\" data-start=\"11960\" data-end=\"11984\">Competitive strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h678z6\" data-start=\"11985\" data-end=\"12007\">Strategic analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bqqng7\" data-start=\"12008\" data-end=\"12030\">Business expansion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zx18dn\" data-start=\"12031\" data-end=\"12055\">Industry positioning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g60a58\" data-start=\"12056\" data-end=\"12078\">Long-term planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ehqn4f\" data-start=\"12080\" data-end=\"12096\">Career Value</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"12098\" data-end=\"12200\">Strategic thinking is one of the most important skills for leadership and senior management positions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"12202\" data-end=\"12205\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tc7xrd\" data-start=\"12207\" data-end=\"12226\">Research Project</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"12228\" data-end=\"12322\">The research project helps students apply their learning to solve practical business problems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6vc6xq\" data-start=\"12324\" data-end=\"12360\">Benefits of the Research Project</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"12361\" data-end=\"12502\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sxuc4p\" data-start=\"12361\" data-end=\"12393\">Enhances analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0v95r\" data-start=\"12394\" data-end=\"12429\">Improves industry understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qvsh8h\" data-start=\"12430\" data-end=\"12460\">Strengthens resume quality</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m4e1ai\" data-start=\"12461\" data-end=\"12502\">Develops professional research skills</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 108000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(312, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 280, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 04:15:45', '2026-06-16 07:15:11', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Navigating the transition into higher education requires a clear, streamlined process. For students aiming to excel in the 2026 Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) program, Vignan Online has engineered a digital-first enrollment experience. This guide provides an exhaustive breakdown of the enrollment steps, payment flexibility, and strategic advice to ensure your registration is seamless and successful.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Step-by-Step Enrollment Guide: A Simplified 3-Step Process</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">Enrolling in a professional degree should be as efficient as the management principles you are about to study. Follow this structured roadmap to complete your registration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Step 1: Accessing the Enrollment Gateway</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The journey begins at the official portal. Prospective candidates must first navigate to the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Vignan Online Enrollment Form</strong>. This centralized hub is designed to capture all necessary academic and personal data securely.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Step 2: Account Creation and Essential Documentation</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Once on the portal, you must <strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"29\">Sign up</strong> to create your unique student profile. This stage is subdivided into four essential sub-steps:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Personal Profile:</strong> Entering basic demographic details and contact information.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic History:</strong> Uploading transcripts from recognized boards (CBSE, ICSE, NIOS, etc.) ensuring you meet the mandatory <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"120\">50% to 55% aggregate</strong> threshold.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Verification:</strong> Providing identity proof and digital photographs for official university records.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Selection:</strong> Formally selecting the BBA track to finalize your academic path.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Step 3: Strategic Fee Settlement</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">The final step in the enrollment process is the fulfillment of financial obligations. Vignan Online provides a range of secure digital payment gateways to accommodate diverse financial needs:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Digital Payments:</strong> Fees can be settled instantly using <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">Net Banking, Debit Cards, or Credit Cards</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Flexibility:</strong> To ensure education is accessible, the university offers <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">easy EMI options with 0% interest</strong>. This allows students to manage their investment without the burden of immediate large-scale capital outflow.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Securing admission into a premier Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) program requires more than just intent; it demands a precise alignment with established academic benchmarks. This guide provides a deep-dive analysis of the eligibility criteria for the 2026 intake, ensuring prospective candidates understand the core requirements, mandatory subject prerequisites, and the strategic pathways available for various learner categories.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Comprehensive Academic Qualifying Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">To maintain the high-authority academic standards of the program, candidates must adhere to a specific set of qualifying rules designed to ensure they possess the foundational knowledge necessary for advanced management studies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Core Educational Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_d6ef1fe7c749a46b-513\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1042\">10+2 Certification:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1042\"> Candidates must have successfully passed the Higher Secondary (10+2) or equivalent examination from a recognized educational board</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1042 citation-end-1042\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_d6ef1fe7c749a46b-514\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1041\">Recognized Boards:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1041\"> Eligible certifications include those from State Boards, CBSE, NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling), IGCSE, IB, or ICSE, provided they are recognized by the State or Central Government</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1041 citation-end-1041\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_d6ef1fe7c749a46b-515\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The \"Mathematics\" Mandate:</strong> A critical prerequisite for the 2026 intake is that candidates <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"90\">must have Mathematics as a core subject</strong> in their 10+2 curriculum. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-1040\">This ensures students possess the quantitative aptitude required for subjects like Business Statistics and Financial Management</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-1040 citation-end-1040\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Merit-Based Performance Thresholds</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">General Aggregate:</strong> A minimum aggregate of <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">50% (or an equivalent letter/numerical grade)</strong> is required for general category candidates to be eligible for the selection process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Social Category Relaxations:</strong> In line with inclusive education policies, a <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">relaxation of 5%</strong> is provided to SC/ST candidates. This means a minimum aggregate of 45% is required for these categories to apply.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Strategic Pathways for Diverse Candidates</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">The eligibility framework is engineered to be inclusive, offering specific provisions for students in transition or those from non-traditional schooling backgrounds.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Appearing Candidates (Class of 2026)</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_d6ef1fe7c749a46b-516\" data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1039\">Result Awaited Category:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1039\"> Students who are currently </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"52\"><span class=\"citation-1039\">due to appear for their 10+2 examinations</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1039\"> in 2026 are fully eligible to apply</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1039 citation-end-1039\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_d6ef1fe7c749a46b-517\" data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1038\">Provisional Admission:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1038\"> Such candidates can secure provisional admission based on their previous academic records, with final confirmation contingent upon meeting the 50% threshold (45% for SC/ST) once results are declared</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1038 citation-end-1038\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\">Alternative and International Schooling</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_d6ef1fe7c749a46b-518\" data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1037\">NIOS and Open Schooling:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1037\"> Candidates from the National Institute of Open Schooling (NIOS) are encouraged to apply, provided they meet the core subject requirements</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1037 citation-end-1037\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Baccalaureate (IB) and IGCSE:</strong> Students following international curricula (IB/IGCSE) must ensure their grades are converted to the equivalent percentage recognized by Indian regulatory bodies to meet the 50% minimum criteria.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Navigating the financial requirements of a Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) is a critical step in a student&rsquo;s academic planning. A clear understanding of tuition fees, registration costs, and examination charges ensures a smooth administrative experience. Below is the exhaustive fee breakdown categorized by residency status, designed to help students and parents make informed investment decisions for the 2026 academic year.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Fee Structure for Indian Nationals &amp; SAARC Nations</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The fee plan for Indian and SAARC students is structured to provide flexibility, offering both semester-based and annual payment options to suit different financial strategies.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Plan</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Amount (INR)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\">₹ 18,000.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\">₹ 36,000.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Program Fee (3 Years)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\">₹ 1,08,000.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Critical Administrative Charges (Domestic &amp; SAARC)</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">University Registration Fee:</strong> A one-time charge of <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">₹ 1,000.00</strong> for Indian students. For SAARC country students, this registration fee is <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"135\">₹ 2,250.00</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee:</strong> An annual recurring charge of <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"47\">₹ 4,000.00</strong> is applicable for Indian students. Students from SAARC nations are required to pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"141\">₹ 4,500.00</strong> per year.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Fee Structure for Foreign Students</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">To facilitate international diversity, the university provides a standardized USD-based fee structure for foreign nationals.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Plan</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Amount (USD)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\">$ 300.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\">$ 600.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Program Fee (3 Years)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,1,0\">$ 1,800.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Critical Administrative Charges (Foreign)</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">University Registration Fee:</strong> A one-time mandatory fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"57\">$ 30.00</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee:</strong> A recurring fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"36\">$ 60.00 per year</strong> is applicable to cover the costs of academic assessment and certification.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-327\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1\"><span class=\"citation-745\">A Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) in 2026 is a dynamic fusion of traditional management theory and cutting-edge technological integration</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-745 citation-end-745\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,5\"><span class=\"citation-744\">This exhaustive guide breaks down the full 6-semester journey, providing the strategic insights needed to transition from a student to a corporate leader</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,6\"><span class=\"citation-744 citation-end-744\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">1st Semester: Establishing the Foundational Bedrock</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-328\" data-path-to-node=\"6\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1\"><span class=\"citation-743\">The first semester focuses on the core mechanics of how businesses operate and communicate</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2\"><span class=\"citation-743 citation-end-743\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-329\" data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-742\">Principles and Practices of Management:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-742\"> Explores the \"POLC\" framework&mdash;Planning, Organizing, Leading, and Controlling&mdash;to achieve maximum organizational efficiency</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-742 citation-end-742\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-330\" data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-741\">Business Communication:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-741\"> The primary lifeblood of any firm, focusing on multi-directional information flow and professional clarity</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-741 citation-end-741\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-331\" data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-740\">Financial Accounting:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-740\"> Often called the \"Language of Business,\" this covers the double-entry system and the three core financial statements</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-740 citation-end-740\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-332\" data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-739\">Business Mathematics:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-739\"> Provides quantitative tools like algebra and optimization techniques for precise, data-driven decision-making</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-739 citation-end-739\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-333\" data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-738\">Business Economics:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-738\"> Applies economic theories, such as supply and demand dynamics and capital budgeting, to real-world challenges</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-738 citation-end-738\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">2nd Semester: Technical Competence and Legal Frameworks</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-334\" data-path-to-node=\"10\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1\"><span class=\"citation-737\">The second semester shifts focus toward the internal mechanics of a firm and its regulatory environment</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2\"><span class=\"citation-737 citation-end-737\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-335\" data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-736\">Business Environment:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-736\"> Analyzes external political, economic, and social factors that dictate market survival</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-736 citation-end-736\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-336\" data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-735\">Cost Accounting:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-735\"> Focuses on cost ascertainment and control, which is vital for internal auditing and pricing strategies</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-735 citation-end-735\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-337\" data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-734\">Business Statistics:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-734\"> Introduces trend analysis and probability to predict market shifts with data</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-734 citation-end-734\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-338\" data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-733\">Business Law:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-733\"> Covers the legal framework of commerce, including contracts and partnership acts to ensure compliance</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-733 citation-end-733\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,4,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-339\" data-path-to-node=\"11,4,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-732\">Coding for Managers:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-732\"> A modern addition that ensures future leaders can communicate effectively with technical development teams</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,4,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-732 citation-end-732\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,4,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"13\">3rd Semester: Integrating Technology and Human Behavior</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-340\" data-path-to-node=\"14\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1\"><span class=\"citation-731\">This stage introduces advanced analytical tools and the moral compass required for modern leadership</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2\"><span class=\"citation-731 citation-end-731\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-341\" data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-730\">Introduction to AI &amp; ML:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-730\"> Equips managers to leverage artificial intelligence for process automation and predictive analytics</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-730 citation-end-730\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"16\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-342\" data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-729\">Business Ethics &amp; Corporate Governance:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-729\"> Focuses on transparency and the \"Triple Bottom Line\"&mdash;People, Planet, and Profit</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-729 citation-end-729\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"17\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-343\" data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-728\">Business Research Methods:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-728\"> Teaches a scientific approach to problem-solving through data collection and hypothesis testing</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-728 citation-end-728\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-344\" data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-727\">Organizational Behavior:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-727\"> Explores workplace psychology, focusing on leadership styles and conflict resolution</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-727 citation-end-727\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-345\" data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-726\">Management Accounting:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-726\"> Provides the internal data necessary for strategic, long-term executive investments</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-726 citation-end-726\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"20\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"17\">4th Semester: Core Functional Specialization</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-346\" data-path-to-node=\"18\"><span data-path-to-node=\"18,1\"><span class=\"citation-725\">The fourth semester is the \"engine room\" of the BBA, covering the four pillars of organizational success</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,2\"><span class=\"citation-725 citation-end-725\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"21\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-347\" data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-724\">Financial Management:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-724\"> Focuses on capital structure and dividend policies to maximize shareholder wealth</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-724 citation-end-724\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"22\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-348\" data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-723\">Human Resources Management:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-723\"> Covers the entire employee lifecycle, from recruitment to performance appraisal</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-723 citation-end-723\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"23\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-349\" data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-722\">Marketing Management:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-722\"> Explores the 4Ps (Product, Price, Place, Promotion) within a digital-first economy</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-722 citation-end-722\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"24\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-350\" data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-721\">Operations Management:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-721\"> Streamlines production processes, focusing on supply chain efficiency and quality control</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-721 citation-end-721\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"25\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,4,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-351\" data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-720\">Design Thinking Project:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-720\"> A hands-on module where students solve socially relevant problems using human-centric methodologies</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-720 citation-end-720\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"26\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"21\">5th &amp; 6th Semesters: Advanced Strategy and Execution</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-352\" data-path-to-node=\"22\"><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1\"><span class=\"citation-719\">The final year prepares students for global market complexities and boardroom decision-making</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,2\"><span class=\"citation-719 citation-end-719\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"27\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"23\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-353\" data-path-to-node=\"23,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"23,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-718\">Project Management (5th Sem):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-718\"> Teaches the lifecycle of a project, focusing on resource allocation and critical path methods</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"23,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-718 citation-end-718\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"28\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"23,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-354\" data-path-to-node=\"23,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"23,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-717\">International Business (5th Sem):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-717\"> Analyzes global trade, foreign exchange, and cross-border operations</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"23,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-717 citation-end-717\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"29\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"23,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-355\" data-path-to-node=\"23,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"23,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-716\">Entrepreneurship (6th Sem):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-716\"> Focuses on venture creation, from ideation to securing venture capital</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"23,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-716 citation-end-716\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"30\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"23,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-356\" data-path-to-node=\"23,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"23,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-715\">Strategic Management (6th Sem):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-715\"> The capstone course where all previous learnings are integrated for competitive advantage</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"23,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-715 citation-end-715\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"31\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"23,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,4,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_becfb2a3bcac0897-357\" data-path-to-node=\"23,4,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"23,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-714\">Research Project:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-714\"> A deep-dive dissertation allowing students to prove their analytical prowess in a specific niche</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"23,4,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-714 citation-end-714\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"32\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"23,4,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 108000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
