er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(313, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 281, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 04:28:26', '2026-06-16 07:16:04', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Transitioning into a professional technical program requires a clear understanding of the administrative gateway. For aspiring developers and IT professionals looking to join the 2026 Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) cohort, Vignan Online has streamlined the enrollment journey. This comprehensive guide provides a strategic breakdown of the three-step enrollment process, document requirements, and flexible financial solutions designed to make high-tier tech education accessible to all.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Simplified 3-Step Enrollment Roadmap</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The enrollment process at Vignan Online is engineered to be as logical and efficient as the programs it hosts. Follow these three strategic steps to secure your admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Step 1: Navigating to the Digital Enrollment Gateway</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">The first phase involves accessing the official <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">Vignan Online Enrollment Form</strong>. This secure portal acts as the primary interface between the applicant and the university&rsquo;s admission board. It is designed to be mobile-responsive, allowing candidates to initiate their journey from any device, though a desktop is recommended for the final document upload phase.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Step 2: Account Creation and the 4 Essential Pillars</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Once you have accessed the portal, you must <strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"44\">Sign up</strong> to create your student credentials. Following the sign-up, you are required to complete four essential sub-steps to finalize your application:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Verification:</strong> Uploading scanned copies of your 10th and 12th-grade mark sheets. For BCA, the system will specifically verify the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"138\">Mathematics core subject mandate</strong> and the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"179\">50% aggregate</strong> threshold.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Identity Documentation:</strong> Providing valid government-issued ID (such as Aadhaar or Passport) to establish your residency status (Indian, SAARC, or Foreign).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Customization:</strong> Formally selecting the \"Bachelor of Computer Applications\" and choosing your preferred specialization or elective tracks if applicable.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Profile Completion:</strong> Finalizing your personal details, including emergency contacts and communication preferences.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Step 3: Secure Fee Settlement and Financial Flexibility</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">The final step involves the fulfillment of the semester or annual fee. Vignan Online offers multiple secure channels to accommodate global candidates:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Instant Payment Modes:</strong> You can settle your fees via <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">Net Banking, Debit Cards, or Credit Cards</strong> through encrypted gateways.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Financial Support:</strong> Recognizing the importance of financial planning, the university offers <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"101\">easy EMI options with 0% interest</strong>. This allows students to distribute the cost of their education over several months without incurring additional interest burdens, effectively maximizing their personal ROI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Securing a seat in a high-caliber Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program requires more than just technical passion; it necessitates a strict adherence to specific academic prerequisites. For the 2026 academic session, the eligibility framework is designed to filter for candidates who possess the logical and quantitative foundations required to master complex software architectures. This guide provides an exhaustive breakdown of board recognitions, percentage benchmarks, and mandatory subject mandates.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Academic Qualification and Recognized Boards</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">To ensure global academic parity and high-authority standards, the program recognizes a wide spectrum of educational boards. Candidates must have successfully cleared their (10+2) or equivalent Higher Secondary examination from institutions recognized by the State or Central Government.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Recognized Educational Pathways</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">National Boards:</strong> Full recognition is extended to the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">CBSE</strong> (Central Board of Secondary Education) and <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"101\">ICSE</strong> (Indian Certificate of Secondary Education).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Open Schooling (NIOS):</strong> In a move toward educational inclusivity, students qualifying through the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"97\">National Institute of Open Schooling (NIOS)</strong> are fully eligible, provided they meet the core subject requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">International Curricula:</strong> Candidates from <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">IGCSE</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"51\">IB (International Baccalaureate)</strong> backgrounds are welcome, provided their letter/numerical grades are equivalent to the Indian percentage standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">State Boards:</strong> All standard State Government recognized boards are valid for the application process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"10\">The Mathematics Mandate: A Core Prerequisite</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">A defining characteristic of the 2026 BCA eligibility is the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">Mathematics Mandate</strong>. Unlike general degrees, a BCA is heavily rooted in computational logic, cryptography, and algorithm design.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mandatory Core Subject:</strong> Candidates <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">must have Mathematics as a core subject</strong> in their 10+2 curriculum.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strategic Importance:</strong> This requirement ensures that students can navigate 1st-semester modules like <em data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"100\">Mathematical Foundations for Computer Science</em> and advanced topics like <em data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"171\">Machine Learning</em> and <em data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"192\">Cryptography</em> in later semesters without a foundational gap.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Percentage Benchmarks and Category Relaxations</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The university maintains a rigorous meritocratic filter while ensuring social equity through structured relaxations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\">General Merit Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Minimum Aggregate:</strong> Candidates are required to secure a minimum of <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"66\">50% aggregate</strong> in their 10+2 examinations. This percentage is calculated based on the total marks of all subjects listed in the final mark sheet.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Equivalent Grades:</strong> For boards using CGPA or letter grades (like IB or IGCSE), an equivalent numerical percentage will be calculated based on official conversion formulas.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\">Social Category Relaxations</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">SC/ST Provisions:</strong> A <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"20\">relaxation of 5%</strong> is granted to candidates belonging to SC/ST categories.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Revised Threshold:</strong> For these candidates, the qualifying aggregate stands at <strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">45%</strong>, ensuring broader access to high-tier technical education.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"21\">Eligibility for Appearing Candidates (Class of 2026)</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">The admission cycle is designed to synchronize with the national board exam calendar to ensure students do not lose an academic year.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"23\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Current Students:</strong> Candidates who are <strong data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">due to appear for their (10+2) examinations</strong> in 2026 are fully eligible to apply for the program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Provisional Enrollment:</strong> These applicants can undergo the entrance and interview phases. Their admission will remain provisional until they provide a final mark sheet that satisfies the 50% (or 45% for relaxed categories) criteria.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Planning for a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) requires a precise understanding of the financial commitment involved. In the rapidly evolving tech landscape of 2026, investing in a BCA is not just an educational expense but a strategic move toward a high-growth career in software development, AI, and cybersecurity. This guide provides a deep-dive analysis of the fee structures for domestic and international candidates, ensuring total transparency for your academic journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Detailed Fee Structure for Indian Nationals and SAARC Nations</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The fee plan for Indian and SAARC students is designed to offer maximum flexibility, allowing for semester-based or annual budgeting to suit different financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Plan Type</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Amount (INR)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\">₹ 18,000.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\">₹ 36,000.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Program Fee (3 Years)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\">₹ 1,08,000.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Essential Administrative and Examination Charges</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Beyond the core tuition, students must factor in mandatory university charges that support academic infrastructure and assessment.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">University Registration Fee:</strong> Indian nationals are required to pay a one-time fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"84\">₹ 1,000.00</strong>. For students from SAARC nations, this registration fee is set at <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"161\">₹ 2,250.00</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Examination Fee:</strong> To cover the costs of continuous assessment and certification, Indian students pay <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"107\">₹ 4,000.00 per year</strong>. Students from SAARC countries have a recurring examination fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"194\">₹ 4,500.00 per year</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Fee Structure for Foreign Students (International Candidates)</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">For students outside the SAARC region, the university provides a standardized USD-based fee structure to facilitate global enrollment and international diversity.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Plan Type</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Amount (USD)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\">$ 300.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,0\">$ 600.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Program Fee (3 Years)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3,1,0\">$ 1,800.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\">Mandatory International Administrative Fees</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">University Registration Fee:</strong> A one-time mandatory charge of <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">$ 30.00</strong> is required at the time of enrollment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee:</strong> An annual recurring fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"44\">$ 60.00</strong> is applicable for all foreign national students to cover academic evaluation processes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) has emerged as a cornerstone degree for the tech-driven global economy. As industries transition toward total digitization, the demand for professionals who can bridge the gap between complex software engineering and practical business solutions is at an all-time high. This exhaustive guide provides a detailed breakdown of the BCA academic roadmap, specialized technical modules, and the strategic career paths available to graduates in 2026.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Semester-Wise Academic Roadmap: From Code to Architecture</h2>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">1st Semester: Establishing the Digital Foundations</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The first semester is designed to introduce students to the fundamental logic of computing and the mathematical structures that support modern software.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Computer Fundamentals:</strong> Explores the hardware-software interface, binary logic, and the internal architecture of modern computing systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Programming for Problem Solving:</strong> Focuses on the core logic of algorithmic thinking, typically utilizing C or C++ to build a strong foundation in syntax and execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mathematical Foundations for Computer Science:</strong> Covers discrete mathematics, set theory, and logic&mdash;essential for understanding complex data structures later in the program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Web Technologies:</strong> Introduces the building blocks of the internet, including HTML, CSS, and basic JavaScript for front-end development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technical English Communication:</strong> Ensures that future developers can document code, write professional reports, and communicate complex technical ideas to stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">2nd Semester: Object Orientation and Data Management</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">The second semester shifts focus toward efficient coding practices and how data is organized for high-performance applications.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Object-Oriented Programming (OOP):</strong> Introduces the concepts of Classes, Objects, Inheritance, and Polymorphism, allowing for scalable and reusable code.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Structures:</strong> A critical module focusing on how to store and manage data efficiently using arrays, linked lists, stacks, queues, and trees.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technology for Business:</strong> Explores how IT infrastructure supports organizational goals, from ERP systems to e-commerce frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Visualization &amp; Environmental Studies:</strong> A unique blend that teaches students how to represent complex data patterns visually while maintaining an awareness of sustainable tech practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">3rd Semester: Advanced Programming and Systems Logic</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">This stage introduces high-level languages and the internal mechanics of operating environments.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Python Programming:</strong> Focuses on one of the most versatile languages in the world, essential for data science, automation, and backend development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Database Systems:</strong> Covers SQL and NoSQL frameworks, teaching students how to design, query, and manage large-scale data repositories.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operating Systems Using Linux:</strong> Explores the kernel, file management, and shell scripting within the Linux environment&mdash;the backbone of most global servers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Probability and Statistics:</strong> Provides the mathematical rigor needed for data analysis and predictive modeling.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\">4th Semester: Networks, Algorithms, and Human-Centric Design</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">The middle of the program focuses on how systems communicate and the efficiency of the software they run.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Computer Networks:</strong> Deep-dives into the OSI model, TCP/IP protocols, and the architecture of local and wide-area networks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Design and Analysis of Algorithms:</strong> Teaches students how to measure and optimize the efficiency (time and space complexity) of their code.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Software Engineering:</strong> Covers the SDLC (Software Development Life Cycle), Agile methodologies, and quality assurance protocols.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Design Thinking Project:</strong> A hands-on module where students solve socially relevant problems using human-centric design and rapid prototyping.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\">5th &amp; 6th Semesters: Specialization and Real-World Execution</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">The final year is where students specialize in emerging technologies and prove their skills through a capstone project.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Machine Learning (5th Sem):</strong> Introduces supervised and unsupervised learning, neural networks, and the future of automated decision-making.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cloud Computing Foundations (5th Sem):</strong> Explores AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud architectures, focusing on virtualization and scalable storage.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cryptography &amp; Network Security (5th Sem):</strong> Teaches the principles of data encryption, cybersecurity threats, and the defense mechanisms needed to protect digital assets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Electives (III &amp; IV):</strong> Allows students to specialize in niches such as Blockchain, IoT, Cyber Forensics, or Full-Stack Development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"20,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Work (6th Sem):</strong> The final dissertation where students build a fully functional application, demonstrating their technical and project management mastery.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 108000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(314, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 227, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 04:42:09', '2026-06-16 07:17:10', '<p id=\"p-rc_6f0af5b735ea2dde-561\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\">Securing a place in a premier online degree program requires more than just academic eligibility; it necessitates a clear understanding of the digital admission gateway. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-1108\">Vignan Online has engineered a streamlined, three-step enrollment architecture designed to transition students from applicants to learners with maximum efficiency</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\"><span class=\"citation-1108 citation-end-1108\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4\">. This guide provides an exhaustive breakdown of the registration phases, document requirements, and financial flexibility options available for the 2026 academic session.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">The Strategic 3-Step Enrollment Framework</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f0af5b735ea2dde-562\" data-path-to-node=\"6\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1\"><span class=\"citation-1107\">The enrollment process is built to be intuitive, ensuring that candidates can complete their application from any location globally without administrative friction</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2\"><span class=\"citation-1107 citation-end-1107\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Step 1: Accessing the Centralized Enrollment Portal</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f0af5b735ea2dde-563\" data-path-to-node=\"8\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0\">The journey begins at the <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0\" data-index-in-node=\"26\">Vignan Online Enrollment Form</strong>. This secure digital interface is the primary touchpoint for all prospective students. It is critical to use the official university link to ensure your data is processed through the encrypted admission server. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2\"><span class=\"citation-1106\">This portal remains active 24/7, allowing students to initiate their application at their convenience</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3\"><span class=\"citation-1106 citation-end-1106\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Step 2: Account Creation and the 4 Pillars of Verification</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f0af5b735ea2dde-564\" data-path-to-node=\"10\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0\">Once you have accessed the portal, you must <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0\" data-index-in-node=\"44\">Sign up</strong> to create your unique student identity. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2\"><span class=\"citation-1105\">After registration, the system guides you through four essential substeps that are mandatory for program enrollment</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3\"><span class=\"citation-1105 citation-end-1105\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,4\">:</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f0af5b735ea2dde-565\" data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1104\">Personal Profiling:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1104\"> Entering core biographical data and contact information to establish your student record</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1104 citation-end-1104\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f0af5b735ea2dde-566\" data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1103\">Academic Documentation:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1103\"> Uploading digital copies of your qualifying transcripts (e.g., 10th, 12th, or Graduation mark sheets) for eligibility vetting</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1103 citation-end-1103\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f0af5b735ea2dde-567\" data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1102\">Program Selection:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1102\"> Formally choosing your degree and specialization (such as BBA, MBA, or BCA) from the available 2026 cohorts</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1102 citation-end-1102\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f0af5b735ea2dde-568\" data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1101\">Final Review:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1101\"> A comprehensive audit of your submitted data before moving to the financial settlement phase</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1101 citation-end-1101\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Step 3: Financial Settlement and Payment Versatility</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">The final stage of enrollment is the fulfillment of the program fees. Vignan Online offers a variety of secure channels to ensure global accessibility:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f0af5b735ea2dde-569\" data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1100\">Instant Payment Methods:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1100\"> Integration with major banking gateways allows for immediate payment via </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"98\"><span class=\"citation-1100\">Net Banking, Debit Cards, or Credit Cards</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1100 citation-end-1100\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6f0af5b735ea2dde-570\" data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1099\">Financial Inclusion (EMI):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1099\"> To alleviate the immediate financial burden, the university provides </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"96\"><span class=\"citation-1099\">easy EMI options with 0% interest</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1099 citation-end-1099\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-1098\">This allows students to distribute their educational investment over manageable monthly installments without any additional interest overhead</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-1098 citation-end-1098\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,6\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Entering a premier Master of Business Administration (MBA) program is a transformative step for any professional. However, the gateway to advanced management leadership is governed by strict academic benchmarks designed to ensure all candidates possess the foundational rigor necessary for high-level strategic study. For the 2026 academic cycle, the eligibility framework emphasizes institutional credibility, consistent academic performance, and inclusivity. This guide provides an exhaustive breakdown of the prerequisites required to secure your place in the cohort.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">The Graduation Mandate: Recognized Degree &amp; Duration</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The primary pillar of MBA eligibility is the successful completion of foundational higher education.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Minimum Duration:</strong> Candidates must hold an Undergraduate (Bachelor) degree with a <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">minimum duration of three (3) years</strong>. This aligns with the standard degree structures (such as BBA, B.Com, B.Sc, or B.A.) and ensures a comprehensive academic background.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stream Neutrality:</strong> The program is \"stream-agnostic,\" meaning graduates from <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">any discipline</strong>&mdash;be it Arts, Commerce, Science, Engineering, or Humanities&mdash;are eligible to apply. This diversity is strategic, as it brings varied perspectives into the MBA classroom.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Institutional Credibility (UGC Recognition):</strong> The degree must be obtained from a <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">UGC Recognized University</strong>. This is a non-negotiable standard that guarantees the quality and legal validity of your previous education in the eyes of corporate recruiters and global academic bodies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Percentage Benchmarks and Merit Thresholds</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">To maintain a competitive and high-authority learning environment, specific numerical benchmarks are enforced.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\">General Merit Category</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Minimum Aggregate:</strong> Candidates are required to have secured a <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">minimum of 50% aggregate</strong> or an equivalent letter/numerical grade in their Bachelor&rsquo;s program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Holistic Evaluation:</strong> This percentage is typically calculated based on the marks obtained across all semesters/years of the undergraduate journey, reflecting consistent academic dedication.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Social Category Relaxations</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">SC/ST Provisions:</strong> In accordance with inclusive educational policies, a <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"71\">relaxation of 5%</strong> is provided to candidates belonging to SC/ST categories.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Adjusted Threshold:</strong> For these candidates, the qualifying aggregate is set at <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">45%</strong>, facilitating broader access to leadership roles for underrepresented communities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"16\">Eligibility for Final Semester Students</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">The 2026 admission cycle is designed to be proactive, allowing students to transition seamlessly from their undergraduate studies to their Master\'s.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Year Candidates:</strong> If you are currently in the <strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"51\">final semester of your Bachelor\'s Program</strong>, you are fully eligible to apply.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Provisional Admission:</strong> Successful applicants in this category will receive provisional admission. You can participate in the entire selection process; however, your seat is confirmed only upon the submission of a final marksheet that meets the 50% (or 45% for relaxed categories) criteria.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Evaluating a Master of Business Administration (MBA) goes beyond curriculum assessment; it requires a transparent and detailed understanding of the financial commitment involved. In 2026, as the demand for specialized management leaders grows, Vignan Online provides a structured and competitive fee model designed to accommodate both domestic and international candidates. This guide serves as a comprehensive financial roadmap, detailing every aspect of the program\'s costs, administrative charges, and the potential return on your educational investment.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Detailed Fee Roadmap for Indian National and SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">For students from the Indian subcontinent and SAARC nations, the program offers tiered payment plans to ensure fiscal flexibility and long-term budget stability.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Plan Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Amount (INR)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester-Based Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\">₹ 22,500.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Payment Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\">₹ 45,000.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Program Investment (2 Years)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\">₹ 90,000.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Essential Administrative and Examination Charges</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Beyond the core tuition, students must account for mandatory regulatory and assessment fees that facilitate the official university registration and certification process.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">University Registration Fee:</strong> A one-time charge of <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">₹ 1,000.00</strong> is mandatory for Indian nationals. For applicants from <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"116\">SAARC nations</strong>, this registration fee is set at <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"163\">₹ 2,250.00</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Examination Fee:</strong> To maintain the integrity of the assessment process, Indian students pay a recurring fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"116\">₹ 4,000.00 per year</strong>. For SAARC candidates, the annual examination fee is <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"189\">₹ 4,500.00</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Global Enrollment: Fee Structure for Foreign Students</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">To foster a diverse international cohort, Vignan Online provides a standardized USD-based fee structure for students residing outside the SAARC region.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Plan Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Amount (USD)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester-Based Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\">$ 375.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Payment Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,0\">$ 750.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Program Investment (2 Years)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3,1,0\">$ 1,500.00</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\">International Administrative Mandates</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">University Registration Fee:</strong> All foreign national students are required to settle a one-time registration fee of <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"113\">$ 30.00</strong> at the commencement of the program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Examination Fee:</strong> A recurring charge of <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"46\">$ 60.00 per year</strong> is applicable for international students to cover the global Proctoring and evaluation standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The Master of Business Administration (BBA) has evolved into a strategic necessity for those aspiring to navigate the complexities of the global corporate landscape. In 2026, a high-caliber MBA curriculum must do more than teach theory; it must build a practical bridge between traditional leadership and digital-first execution. This guide provides an exhaustive breakdown of the four-semester academic roadmap and the sophisticated learning methodologies designed to produce industry-ready executives.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Semester-Wise Academic Roadmap: From Foundations to Global Strategy</h2>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">1st Semester: Building the Leadership Core</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The first semester is designed to establish a rigorous foundation in the internal mechanics of a firm and the ethical frameworks that guide modern leadership.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Management Concepts and Practices:</strong> Explores the evolution of management thought and the \"POLC\" (Planning, Organizing, Leading, Controlling) framework in the context of 2026\'s volatile markets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Principles of Economics and Markets:</strong> Applies micro and macro-economic theories to real-world business challenges, focusing on supply-demand dynamics and market equilibrium.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Managerial Effectiveness and Ethics:</strong> A critical module focusing on soft skills, emotional intelligence, and the moral compass required for corporate governance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accounting and Finance:</strong> Equips students with the ability to read and interpret financial statements, ensuring every decision is backed by fiscal health.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Organizational Behavior and HRM:</strong> Analyzes human psychology in the workplace and the strategic management of talent as a competitive advantage.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Quantitative Techniques and Analytics:</strong> Introduces data-driven decision-making using statistical tools and predictive modeling.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">2nd Semester: Functional Mastery and Marketing Depth</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">The second semester shifts focus toward the external market and the operational \"engine room\" of the organization.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Entrepreneurship:</strong> Teaches the lifecycle of venture creation, from ideation and business modeling to securing venture capital.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Marketing Management and Research:</strong> Explores consumer insights and the scientific methods used to identify market gaps and opportunities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operations and Supply Chain Management:</strong> Streamlines the flow of goods and services, focusing on lean principles and global logistics efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Consumer Behavior:</strong> Deep-dives into the \"Why\" behind the purchase, analyzing psychological and social triggers that drive market trends.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sales and Distribution Management:</strong> Focuses on the \"Place\" element of the marketing mix, ensuring products reach the target audience through optimized channels.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">3rd Semester: Strategic Integration and Rural Focus</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">The second year begins with an emphasis on high-level strategy and the unique challenges of emerging rural markets.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Business Environment and Strategy:</strong> Analyzes PESTLE (Political, Economic, Social, Technological, Legal, Environmental) factors to create sustainable competitive advantages.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Management:</strong> Teaches the methodologies (Agile, Waterfall) required to bring complex business initiatives from concept to completion.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Agricultural and Rural Marketing:</strong> A specialized module exploring the massive potential and unique distribution logistics of rural economies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Integrated Marketing Communications (IMC):</strong> Synchronizes brand messaging across digital, social, and traditional platforms for a cohesive brand identity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Services Marketing and CRM:</strong> Focuses on the intangibles of the service sector and the technology used to maintain high-value customer relationships.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\">4th Semester: Global Specialized Execution</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">The final semester prepares students for international markets and deep-dives into the digital revolution.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Marketing:</strong> Explores cross-border trade, foreign market entry strategies, and cultural nuances in international business.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">B2B Marketing:</strong> Focuses on the complexities of industrial markets and long-term organizational sales cycles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Retail Marketing and Brand Management:</strong> Teaches the mechanics of modern retail and the strategic positioning required to build lasting brand equity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Digital Marketing and Data Analytics:</strong> The capstone of modern marketing, utilizing AI and big data to optimize digital campaigns and conversion rates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Master Thesis / Project:</strong> An intensive research dissertation where students solve a real-world business problem, demonstrating their total program mastery.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 90000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(315, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 230, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 05:05:35', '2026-06-16 07:17:43', '<h3 data-path-to-node=\"1\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Guide to Vignan Online Enrollment</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Whether you are looking to advance your career with an MBA or start fresh with a BCA/BBA, the Vignan Online portal is designed for ease of use. Follow these detailed steps to secure your admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1: Access the Official Enrollment Portal</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The first step is to visit the official <!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><a class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://apply.vignanonline.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwjNrMzgsKaUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsQU\">Vignan Online Enrollment Form</a><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Pro Tip:</strong> Ensure you are using a stable internet connection and a modern browser (Chrome or Firefox) for a seamless experience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why it matters:</strong> Accessing the official site ensures your data is secure and you are viewing the most up-to-date program offerings and fee structures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2: Sign Up and Complete the 4 Essential Stages</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Once you land on the portal, you will need to \"Sign Up\" to create your student account. This creates your unique <strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"113\">Student Dashboard</strong>. The enrollment process is broken down into four critical stages:</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration &amp; OTP Verification:</strong> Enter your basic details (Name, Email, Mobile Number). You will receive an OTP to verify your contact information&mdash;this is crucial as all future communication will be sent here.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Personal &amp; Academic Information:</strong> Fill in your background details and upload your educational qualifications (10th, 12th, and Degree certificates if applying for PG).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Document Upload (KYC):</strong> Upload scanned copies of your ID proof (Aadhar/Passport) and your Academic Bank of Credits (ABC) ID.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Program Selection:</strong> Finalize the specific elective or specialization you wish to pursue within your chosen degree (e.g., MBA in Finance, MCA in Cloud Computing).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3: Fee Payment &amp; Flexible Financing</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Vignan Online is known for its affordability and \"Learner-First\" financial models. After your documents are verified, you will proceed to the payment gateway.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment Methods:</strong> You can pay using <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">Net Banking, Debit Cards, or Credit Cards</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">0% Interest EMI:</strong> To make education accessible, Vignan offers <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">easy EMI options with 0% interest</strong>. This allows you to break down the total program fee into manageable monthly installments without any extra cost.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Admission Confirmation:</strong> Once the fee (or the first installment) is processed, you will receive a confirmation email and your login credentials for the Learning Management System (LMS).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p id=\"p-rc_6313e31a2ca0aaf0-744\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1\"><span class=\"citation-1423\">Choosing the right academic path is a significant milestone, and understanding the entry requirements is the first step toward securing your future</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-1423 citation-end-1423\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,5\"><span class=\"citation-1422\">Vignan University maintains a transparent and inclusive eligibility framework designed to identify and welcome dedicated learners from diverse backgrounds</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,6\"><span class=\"citation-1422 citation-end-1422\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,7\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,9\"><span class=\"citation-1421\">Whether you are a fresh graduate or a working professional looking to upskill, meeting these foundational requirements ensures you are prepared for the rigorous, high-quality curriculum offered by our UGC-recognized institution</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,10\"><span class=\"citation-1421 citation-end-1421\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,11\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Core Academic Requirements for Undergraduate and Postgraduate Success</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6313e31a2ca0aaf0-745\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1\"><span class=\"citation-1420\">The cornerstone of the Vignan University admission process is academic excellence and formal recognition of prior learning</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-1420 citation-end-1420\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,5\"><span class=\"citation-1419\">To maintain high educational standards, the university has established specific benchmarks for candidate selection</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,6\"><span class=\"citation-1419 citation-end-1419\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,7\">:</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6313e31a2ca0aaf0-746\" data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1418\">Degree Recognition</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1418\">: All applicants must have successfully completed an undergraduate (Bachelor) program from a university recognized by the University Grants Commission (UGC)</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1418 citation-end-1418\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6313e31a2ca0aaf0-747\" data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1417\">Program Duration</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1417\">: The qualifying bachelor\'s degree must have a minimum duration of three (3) years</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1417 citation-end-1417\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6313e31a2ca0aaf0-748\" data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1416\">Stream Versatility</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1416\">: Admissions are open to students from any academic stream, allowing for a multidisciplinary approach to higher education</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1416 citation-end-1416\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6313e31a2ca0aaf0-749\" data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1415\">Aggregate Benchmarks</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1415\">: General category candidates must possess a minimum aggregate of 50% marks or an equivalent numerical/letter grade as defined by their previous institution</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1415 citation-end-1415\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Inclusive Education: Strategic Relaxations and Final Year Provisions</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6313e31a2ca0aaf0-750\" data-path-to-node=\"8\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1\"><span class=\"citation-1414\">Vignan University is committed to educational equity and recognizes the diverse circumstances of its applicant pool</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2\"><span class=\"citation-1414 citation-end-1414\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,5\"><span class=\"citation-1413\">To support this vision, specific provisions have been integrated into the eligibility policy</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,6\"><span class=\"citation-1413 citation-end-1413\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,7\">:</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6313e31a2ca0aaf0-751\" data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1412\">SC/ST Candidate Support</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1412\">: In accordance with inclusive education guidelines, a 5% relaxation in the minimum aggregate marks is provided to candidates belonging to SC/ST categories</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1412 citation-end-1412\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6313e31a2ca0aaf0-752\" data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1411\">Minimum Threshold for Reserved Categories</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1411\">: Candidates from SC/ST backgrounds are eligible for admission with a minimum aggregate of 45%</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1411 citation-end-1411\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6313e31a2ca0aaf0-753\" data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1410\">Provisional Eligibility for Final Year Students</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1410\">: Students currently enrolled in their final semester of a Bachelor\'s program are encouraged to apply</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1410 citation-end-1410\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_6313e31a2ca0aaf0-754\" data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1409\">Continuous Learning Path</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1409\">: This final-semester eligibility allows students to transition seamlessly into higher education without unnecessary administrative gaps</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1409 citation-end-1409\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p id=\"p-rc_41c2a691923eac1c-692\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\">Navigating the financial aspects of higher education is a critical step in a student&rsquo;s professional journey. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-1304\">Vignan Online offers a transparent and structured fee model designed to accommodate students from diverse economic backgrounds, including Indian nationals, SAARC residents, and international applicants</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\"><span class=\"citation-1304 citation-end-1304\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,6\"><span class=\"citation-1303\">This guide provides a meticulous breakdown of tuition plans and mandatory administrative costs to help you plan your academic investment effectively</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,7\"><span class=\"citation-1303 citation-end-1303\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,8\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Comprehensive Fee Breakdown for Indian and SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41c2a691923eac1c-693\" data-path-to-node=\"6\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1\"><span class=\"citation-1302\">For students residing within India and SAARC nations, Vignan provides multiple payment tiers to ensure financial flexibility</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2\"><span class=\"citation-1302 citation-end-1302\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5\"><span class=\"citation-1301\">These plans allow for better cash flow management through semester-based or annual installments</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6\"><span class=\"citation-1301 citation-end-1301\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Tuition Fee Schedule (Indian &amp; SAARC)</h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Plan Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Amount (INR)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Frequency</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0\">₹ 22,500.00</span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-1300\">Every 6 Months </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0\">₹ 45,000.00</span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,2,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-1299\">Once Per Year </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,1,0\">₹ 90,000.00</span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,3,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-1298\">Full Course Settlement </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Mandatory Administrative Charges</h3>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41c2a691923eac1c-694\" data-path-to-node=\"10\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1\"><span class=\"citation-1297\">Beyond the standard tuition, students must account for registration and recurring examination fees which vary slightly based on regional status</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2\"><span class=\"citation-1297 citation-end-1297\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41c2a691923eac1c-695\" data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1296\">University Registration Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1296\"> A one-time payment of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"51\"><span class=\"citation-1296\">₹ 1,000.00</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1296\"> for Indian Nationals or </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\"><span class=\"citation-1296\">₹ 2,250.00</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1296\"> for students from SAARC countries</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1296 citation-end-1296\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41c2a691923eac1c-696\" data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1295\">Annual Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1295\"> A recurring charge of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"46\"><span class=\"citation-1295\">₹ 4,000.00</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1295\"> per year for Indian students or </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"89\"><span class=\"citation-1295\">₹ 4,500.00</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1295\"> per year for SAARC students</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1295 citation-end-1295\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Global Enrollment: Fee Structure for Foreign Students</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41c2a691923eac1c-697\" data-path-to-node=\"14\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1\"><span class=\"citation-1294\">To maintain a standardized global academic environment, foreign students follow a USD-based fee structure</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2\"><span class=\"citation-1294 citation-end-1294\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,5\"><span class=\"citation-1293\">This ensures that international candidates have a clear understanding of their total investment regardless of local currency volatility</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,6\"><span class=\"citation-1293 citation-end-1293\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\">Tuition Fee Schedule (Foreign Students)</h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Plan Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Amount (USD)</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Frequency</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,1,1,0\">$ 375.00</span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"16,1,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-1292\">Every 6 Months </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,2,1,0\">$ 750.00</span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"16,2,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-1291\">Once Per Year </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Fee Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,3,1,0\">$ 1,500.00</span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"16,3,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-1290\">Full Course Settlement </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\">International Administrative Costs</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41c2a691923eac1c-698\" data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1289\">University Registration Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1289\"> Foreign students are required to pay a one-time registration fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"97\"><span class=\"citation-1289\">$ 30.00</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1289 citation-end-1289\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_41c2a691923eac1c-699\" data-path-to-node=\"18,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"18,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1288\">Annual Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1288\"> An examination fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"18,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"46\"><span class=\"citation-1288\">$ 60.00 per year</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1288\"> is applicable to all foreign international students</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1288 citation-end-1288\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,1,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">In the rapidly evolving corporate landscape of 2026, an MBA is no longer just a degree&mdash;it is a sophisticated toolkit for navigating complex global markets. The curriculum provided here is a strategic blend of foundational management principles and high-end financial analytics, designed to produce leaders who are as comfortable with balance sheets as they are with disruptive technology. This guide provides an exhaustive, semester-wise exploration of the subjects that will define the next generation of C-suite executives.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Semester 1: Establishing the Leadership Foundation</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The first semester is designed to reset the candidate&rsquo;s perspective, moving from operational execution to strategic management.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-616\" data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Principles of Management and Organizational Behaviour (PMOB):</strong> This course dives deep into human psychology within the workplace. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-1218\">You will explore leadership styles, conflict resolution, and the organizational culture required to drive innovation</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-1218 citation-end-1218\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-617\" data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1217\">Managerial Economics (ME):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1217\"> Moving beyond basic theory, ME applies microeconomic analysis to practical business decisions, focusing on pricing strategies, demand forecasting, and market equilibrium</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1217 citation-end-1217\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-618\" data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1216\">Accounting for Managers (AFM):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1216\"> Designed for decision-makers, this subject teaches you to interpret financial statements, manage costs, and utilize accounting data for internal strategic planning</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1216 citation-end-1216\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-619\" data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1215\">Business Statistics and Analytics for Decision Making (BSAD):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1215\"> In the age of Big Data, this course provides the mathematical rigor needed to turn raw data into actionable business intelligence</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1215 citation-end-1215\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-620\" data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1214\">Legal Environment for Business (LEB):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1214\"> High-authority leadership requires a deep understanding of corporate law, contract management, and the regulatory frameworks that govern global commerce</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1214 citation-end-1214\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,4,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Semester 2: Operational Excellence and Market Dynamics</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">The second semester shifts focus toward the core functional areas of an enterprise, integrating technical skills with market-facing strategies.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-621\" data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1213\">Marketing Management (MM):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1213\"> This goes beyond advertising to cover consumer behavior, brand equity, and digital-first marketing funnels in the 2026 economy</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1213 citation-end-1213\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-622\" data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1212\">Financial Markets &amp; Corporate Finance (FM &amp; CF):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1212\"> A critical pillar for any MBA, this course explores capital structure, dividend policies, and the mechanics of global financial markets</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1212 citation-end-1212\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-623\" data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1211\">Human Resource Management (HRM):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1211\"> Focuses on the strategic acquisition of talent, performance management systems, and building resilient workforces in a hybrid work world</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1211 citation-end-1211\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-624\" data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1210\">Operations Management (OM):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1210\"> Teaches the optimization of supply chains, lean manufacturing principles, and service delivery efficiency</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1210 citation-end-1210\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,4,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-625\" data-path-to-node=\"11,4,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"11,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1209\">Business Research Methods (BRM) &amp; Business Analytics (BA):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1209\"> These twin subjects empower students to conduct primary research and apply advanced analytical tools to solve complex business problems</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,4,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1209 citation-end-1209\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,4,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Semester 3: Strategic Specialization and Advanced Finance</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">The third semester marks the transition into specialized expertise, focusing heavily on the financial sector and real-world application.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-626\" data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1208\">Business Environment and Strategy:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1208\"> This is the \"capstone\" of management, where students learn to synthesize information from all departments to create long-term competitive advantages</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1208 citation-end-1208\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-627\" data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1207\">Management of Banking and Financial Services:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1207\"> Covers the evolution of modern banking, risk management, and the operational nuances of the financial services industry</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1207 citation-end-1207\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-628\" data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1206\">Direct and Indirect Taxation:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1206\"> A deep dive into the fiscal responsibilities of a corporation, covering corporate tax planning and international tax regulations</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1206 citation-end-1206\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-629\" data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1205\">Fixed Income Securities and Derivatives:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1205\"> Essential for finance specialists, this course explores debt markets, hedging strategies, and the valuation of complex financial instruments</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1205 citation-end-1205\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,4,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-630\" data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1204\">Research-Based Learning-I:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1204\"> This unique component allows students to apply theoretical knowledge to an industry-linked research project, fostering critical thinking</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1204 citation-end-1204\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"15,4,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Semester 4: Innovation, Fintech, and Investment Banking</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">The final semester is geared toward the \"Future of Finance,\" focusing on entrepreneurship and the high-stakes world of investment banking.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-631\" data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1203\">Entrepreneurship Development:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1203\"> Designed for the next generation of founders, this course covers venture capital, business scaling, and the \"lean startup\" methodology</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1203 citation-end-1203\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"16\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-632\" data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1202\">Investment Analysis and Portfolio Management:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1202\"> Learn the art and science of wealth creation through asset allocation, risk-return trade-offs, and sophisticated portfolio construction</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1202 citation-end-1202\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"17\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-633\" data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1201\">Fintech Foundation and Applications:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1201\"> As technology disrupts finance, this course covers blockchain, AI in credit scoring, and the digital transformation of the financial sector</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1201 citation-end-1201\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-634\" data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1200\">Corporate Valuation and Investment Banking:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1200\"> The pinnacle of finance education, focusing on M&amp;A (Mergers and Acquisitions), IPOs, and determining the intrinsic value of global enterprises</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1200 citation-end-1200\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,4,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_b5e87a3fa149b304-635\" data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1199\">Research-Based Learning-II:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1199\"> The final phase of independent study, where students finalize their research, often leading to industry whitepapers or high-impact business proposals</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-1199 citation-end-1199\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"20\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,4,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 90000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(316, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 225, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 05:21:25', '2026-06-16 07:18:23', '<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"492\">Enrolling in an online MBA program is one of the most important career decisions for students and working professionals aiming to improve their leadership skills, managerial expertise, and long-term career growth. However, many applicants make avoidable mistakes during the admission process due to lack of clarity about enrollment steps, payment procedures, and document verification requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"806\">The Vignan Online enrollment system is designed to provide a smooth, fully digital admission experience for students across India and international learners. The process is simple, but completing every stage carefully is extremely important to avoid delays, verification issues, or payment-related complications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"847\">This detailed admission guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f43m5x\" data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"892\">Complete enrollment process step-by-step</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zolod2\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"936\">Registration and application procedures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rbdl44\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"960\">Fee payment options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y8htlj\" data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1005\">Important mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"44u9k\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1039\">Hidden risks during admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vpxb3l\" data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1089\">Strategic enrollment tips for faster approval</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"f3x9j6\" data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1148\">Understanding the Vignan Online Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1315\">The Vignan Online admission process is fully digital and allows students to complete the entire enrollment procedure remotely without visiting the campus physically.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1344\">The system is designed for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1504\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1370\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19hdfr0\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1390\">Remote learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gimp1\" data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1425\">Students from different states</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tvf4t\" data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1454\">International applicants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14fw7sc\" data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1504\">Individuals seeking flexible higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1534\">The online process includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1648\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r633i1\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1551\">Registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t46q9s\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1583\">Application form completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yylsws\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1605\">Program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csrces\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1621\">Fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o227h4\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1648\">Admission verification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1653\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dhi5f6\" data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1713\">Step 1: Visit the Official Vignan Online Enrollment Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1813\">The first step in the admission process is accessing the official Vignan Online enrollment portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1832\">Students need to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"2004\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8hr2o3\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1901\">Click on the official <strong data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1872\">&ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo;</strong> or <strong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1892\">&ldquo;Enroll Now&rdquo;</strong> option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6r5ko\" data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1937\">Open the online enrollment form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ghbur\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2004\">Begin the registration process through the admission dashboard</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2009\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o39v0r\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2040\">Why This Step Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2133\">Many students unknowingly use unofficial websites or third-party portals, which may create:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2253\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4ruiu\" data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2157\">Payment fraud risks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ddals\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2195\">Incorrect application submissions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v2cthx\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2221\">Data privacy concerns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klk2hs\" data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2253\">Admission processing issues</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2402\">Students should always verify that they are using the official university admission portal before entering personal information or making payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2407\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xbc3on\" data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2466\">Information Students Should Keep Ready Before Applying</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2567\">Preparing documents and details in advance helps students complete the enrollment process smoothly.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2322h\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2599\">Basic Information Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2801\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b7olm6\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2643\">Full name as per official certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mizif\" data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2668\">Active mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pp80n3\" data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2687\">Valid email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18y1vi6\" data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2722\">Academic qualification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2741\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2770\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"160b141\" data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2801\">Scanned academic documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"138onh0\" data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2820\">Expert Advice</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2910\">Always use an active email ID and mobile number because all important updates including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"3009\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2937\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w54iqq\" data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2957\">LMS credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17351q3\" data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2982\">Fee payment receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mrw1f\" data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3009\">Academic notifications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3061\">will be sent through these communication channels.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3066\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"c5gpum\" data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3121\">Step 2: Sign Up and Complete the Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3239\">After accessing the portal, students must create their account and complete the required enrollment steps carefully.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3241\" data-end=\"3244\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iqj42j\" data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3275\">Create Your Student Account</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3321\">The registration process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3426\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e15fdm\" data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3351\">Entering personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jr0s2\" data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3382\">Creating login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zkzjzu\" data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3403\">OTP verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ujxzul\" data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3426\">Account activation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3515\">Once registration is completed, students can proceed to the full admission application.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3520\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rmyoml\" data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3563\">Complete the Essential Enrollment Steps</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3660\">The online admission process includes multiple sections that students must complete accurately.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cb15o8\" data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3693\">Personal Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3720\">Students need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3791\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2yru7\" data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3729\">Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3747\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3767\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19381gy\" data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3791\">Address information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3793\" data-end=\"3796\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5cxjpn\" data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3825\">Academic Details Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3847\">Students must enter:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3939\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3870\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ng48fx\" data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3895\">Marks and percentage</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lx9va\" data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"3912\">Passing year</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdp0ww\" data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"3939\">University information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3941\" data-end=\"4028\">Appearing final semester students may also need to upload provisional academic details.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4030\" data-end=\"4033\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n3xcpd\" data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4055\">Program Selection</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4123\">Students must select their preferred MBA specialization carefully.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1zi2k\" data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4158\">Why Program Selection Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4160\" data-end=\"4205\">Choosing the wrong specialization can affect:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4206\" data-end=\"4308\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9hk7lb\" data-start=\"4206\" data-end=\"4226\">Career direction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xszf1\" data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4253\">Industry opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d4hgod\" data-start=\"4254\" data-end=\"4274\">Future job roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ot5agr\" data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4308\">Long-term professional growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4310\" data-end=\"4341\">Students should evaluate their:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4342\" data-end=\"4432\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3akl8\" data-start=\"4342\" data-end=\"4358\">Career goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ahbjrb\" data-start=\"4359\" data-end=\"4381\">Industry interests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"skbz67\" data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4401\">Skill strengths</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ordm0\" data-start=\"4402\" data-end=\"4432\">Future salary expectations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4434\" data-end=\"4468\">before selecting a specialization.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4473\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83j5nm\" data-start=\"4475\" data-end=\"4501\">Document Upload Process</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4503\" data-end=\"4538\">Students may be required to upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4539\" data-end=\"4631\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"88qwiz\" data-start=\"4539\" data-end=\"4564\">Academic certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rsbash\" data-start=\"4565\" data-end=\"4577\">ID proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4606\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"780zuj\" data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4631\">Supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"645a63\" data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4661\">Common Document Mistakes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4717\">Many applications get delayed because students upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4815\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2v78q6\" data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4739\">Blurred documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sx5g9z\" data-start=\"4740\" data-end=\"4766\">Incorrect file formats</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ib334\" data-start=\"4767\" data-end=\"4794\">Incomplete certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hggyx3\" data-start=\"4795\" data-end=\"4815\">Unreadable scans</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4817\" data-end=\"4883\">Clear and properly formatted documents improve verification speed.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"4888\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vxyo72\" data-start=\"4890\" data-end=\"4919\">Step 3: Pay the Program Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4921\" data-end=\"5016\">After completing the application form, students must pay the program fee to confirm enrollment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5018\" data-end=\"5070\">The payment process is secure and completely online.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5072\" data-end=\"5075\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pp6z2h\" data-start=\"5077\" data-end=\"5104\">Available Payment Methods</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5106\" data-end=\"5136\">Students can pay fees through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5137\" data-end=\"5221\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"5137\" data-end=\"5152\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"5153\" data-end=\"5167\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5183\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sezyli\" data-start=\"5184\" data-end=\"5221\">Easy EMI Options with 0% Interest</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5223\" data-end=\"5226\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cprctf\" data-start=\"5228\" data-end=\"5266\">Understanding the EMI Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5268\" data-end=\"5314\">The EMI facility is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5315\" data-end=\"5439\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"5315\" data-end=\"5340\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"78269a\" data-start=\"5341\" data-end=\"5377\">Students with budget limitations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y3wmqm\" data-start=\"5378\" data-end=\"5439\">Individuals preferring installment-based payment planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17bfro3\" data-start=\"5441\" data-end=\"5467\">Benefits of EMI Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5469\" data-end=\"5572\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"133abd\" data-start=\"5469\" data-end=\"5505\">Lower immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tr47oy\" data-start=\"5506\" data-end=\"5536\">Flexible payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16xprqg\" data-start=\"5537\" data-end=\"5572\">Easier affordability management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5574\" data-end=\"5577\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u202ba\" data-start=\"5579\" data-end=\"5628\">Important Financial Advice Before Choosing EMI</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5630\" data-end=\"5665\">Students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5666\" data-end=\"5787\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o6r50g\" data-start=\"5666\" data-end=\"5688\">Repayment schedule</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8w4ed3\" data-start=\"5689\" data-end=\"5714\">Monthly affordability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3sb9ga\" data-start=\"5715\" data-end=\"5751\">Additional processing conditions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h8ds60\" data-start=\"5752\" data-end=\"5787\">Long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5789\" data-end=\"5874\">Even when EMI options offer 0% interest, proper financial planning remains important.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"460\">Understanding the MBA eligibility criteria is one of the most important steps before applying for admission. Many students focus only on course specialization and career opportunities while ignoring detailed eligibility conditions. This often creates confusion during document verification, admission approval, or counseling stages.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"876\">The MBA admission requirements are designed to ensure that students possess the academic foundation, analytical capability, and professional readiness needed to handle advanced management education. Since MBA programs involve strategic thinking, business analytics, leadership, finance, research, and organizational management, universities require applicants to meet specific academic standards before enrollment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"907\">This detailed guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"1226\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jlmxh9\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"972\">Minimum educational qualification required for MBA admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nro8hu\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1004\">Aggregate marks eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v59n6k\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1034\">SC/ST relaxation criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wwtqi6\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1073\">Final semester student eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixkcr6\" data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1106\">UGC recognition requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bjzc0b\" data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1150\">Common admission mistakes students make</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hckvex\" data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1226\">Important strategic insights students should understand before applying</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1231\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ndqt0s\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1265\">Basic MBA Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1392\">Students seeking admission to the MBA program must fulfill the academic eligibility requirements specified by the university.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z5vvlm\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1431\">Required Educational Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1584\">Applicants must have completed an <strong data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1512\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) Degree Program</strong> of a minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1553\">three years</strong> from a recognized institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1725\">The bachelor&rsquo;s degree can be from <strong data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1648\">any stream or discipline</strong>, making the MBA accessible to students from diverse educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"sm9xnj\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1763\">Accepted Academic Backgrounds</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1903\">One of the major advantages of MBA programs is their multidisciplinary accessibility. Students from almost every academic field can apply.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"t51tbn\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1932\">Eligible Streams Include</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2107\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1941\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuwkdh\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1951\">B.Com</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1958\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ub0l3o\" data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1967\">B.Sc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hnd5hy\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1983\">B.Tech / BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"1991\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kzfkr9\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2034\">Bachelor of Arts &amp; Humanities Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1evj2kq\" data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2071\">Commerce and Management Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dpvr9y\" data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2107\">Science and Technology Programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2232\">This flexibility allows students from different educational backgrounds to transition into business and management careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2237\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1m8zall\" data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2278\">UGC Recognition Requirement Explained</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2359\">The undergraduate degree must be obtained from a <strong data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2358\">UGC Recognized University</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jhqza5\" data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2391\">Why UGC Recognition Matters</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2422\">UGC recognition ensures that:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2602\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ag1n3o\" data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2459\">The degree is academically valid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fghzkz\" data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2518\">The institution follows approved educational standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ud1b2v\" data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2602\">The qualification is accepted for higher education and employment opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2664\">Students graduating from unrecognized institutions may face:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2754\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwrtt2\" data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2688\">Admission rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kvnulg\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2715\">Degree validity issues</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3cnx7n\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2754\">Employment complications in future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2759\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qgebw5\" data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2806\">Minimum Marks Requirement for MBA Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2901\">Students must secure the required minimum aggregate marks in their bachelor&rsquo;s degree program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1504p6g\" data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2933\">Minimum Percentage Criteria</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"3070\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2976\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2976\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2946\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2976\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Aggregate Required</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3070\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3029\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3006\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3029\">50% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3070\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3047\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SC/ST Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3070\">45% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3182\">A relaxation of 5% marks is provided for candidates belonging to SC/ST categories as per admission guidelines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3187\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xmefjw\" data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3668\">Final Semester Students Are Also Eligible</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3802\">Candidates currently studying in the final semester of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree program are also eligible to apply for MBA admission.</p>', '<p data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"482\">Understanding the complete MBA fee structure before enrollment is extremely important for students planning their higher education journey. Many students focus only on the tuition fee and ignore additional academic expenses such as examination charges, registration fees, and long-term financial planning. This often creates confusion later during the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"807\">The MBA in Human Resource Management fee structure is designed to provide flexibility through semester-wise, annual, and total program payment options for both Indian and international students. The structure supports affordability while allowing students to choose a payment model according to their financial convenience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"838\">This detailed guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v52ked\" data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"866\">Semester-wise fee plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jx4pjs\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"902\">Annual and total fee structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aflusc\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"936\">Additional university charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14d059j\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"966\">SAARC student fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q37kuk\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1000\">Foreign student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bs1rgt\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1044\">Hidden costs students should understand</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12fojsz\" data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1096\">Strategic fee planning advice for MBA aspirants</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jjnxcv\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1142\">MBA Fee Structure for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1276\">The fee structure for Indian students is divided into multiple payment options to provide flexibility and easier financial planning.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4labb\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1316\">Indian Students Fee Structure Table</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1339\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1339\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1329\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1339\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1370\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1381\">₹22,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1411\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1411\">₹45,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1429\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1440\">₹90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1445\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rkz2z6\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1487\">Additional Charges for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1577\">Apart from the tuition fee, students must also pay mandatory university-related charges.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cws2c8\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1604\">Additional Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1726\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1637\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1637\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1627\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1637\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1726\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1688\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1678\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1688\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1726\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1716\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1726\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1731\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19kzlc5\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1774\">Fee Structure for SAARC Nation Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1867\">Students from SAARC nations are also eligible for admission under a dedicated fee category.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vz6nli\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1909\">Additional Charges for SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1932\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1942\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1982\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1972\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"1982\">₹2,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2010\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2020\">₹4,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2025\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9weag4\" data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2067\">MBA Fee Structure for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2210\">The university also provides affordable online MBA opportunities for international students through a separate foreign student fee structure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ulpmr0\" data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2251\">Foreign Students Fee Structure Table</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2368\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2274\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2274\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2264\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2274\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2368\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2313\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2305\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2313\">$375</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2332\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2340\">$750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2368\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2358\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2368\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$1,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2373\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g7i4sp\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2416\">Additional Charges for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2532\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2449\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2449\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2439\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2449\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2532\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2497\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2490\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2497\">$30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2532\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2525\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2532\">$60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"101\" data-end=\"497\">The MBA in Human Resource Management program is designed to develop future-ready HR professionals with expertise in workforce management, leadership, business strategy, organizational development, and HR analytics. The curriculum follows a progressive learning structure where students first build strong management fundamentals and then gradually move toward advanced HR specialization subjects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"536\">This semester-wise syllabus combines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"771\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8izl11\" data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"574\">Core business management concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1nem5\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"617\">Human resource specialization subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v5gmtz\" data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"660\">Leadership and organizational strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19867la\" data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"700\">HR analytics and workforce planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tcc2f6\" data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"731\">Research-oriented learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iryfxu\" data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"771\">Industry-focused practical exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"837\">The curriculum is structured to prepare students for careers in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fqwsby\" data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"867\">Human Resource Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"165ps87\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"890\">Talent Acquisition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fzolno\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"907\">HR Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k2sgfh\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"938\">Organizational Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"czohq7\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"961\">Employee Relations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"repznz\" data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"999\">Leadership and Strategic HR Roles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"o1zi5n\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1082\">1st Semester: Foundation of Management, Analytics &amp; Business Understanding</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1350\">The first semester focuses on building strong managerial, analytical, and organizational foundations. Students develop understanding of business economics, management principles, accounting, statistics, and legal frameworks that support effective HR decision-making.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1372\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ugvgkz\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1441\">1. Principles of Management and Organizational Behaviour (PMOB)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1558\">Understanding management functions, leadership, employee behavior, teamwork, motivation, and organizational culture.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qkzcew\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1592\">2. Managerial Economics (ME)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1708\">Learning economic principles related to business decision-making, market analysis, pricing, and strategic planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p0e40a\" data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1746\">3. Accounting for Managers (AFM)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1851\">Introduction to financial statements, budgeting, accounting concepts, and managerial financial analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5fqyor\" data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1920\">4. Business Statistics and Analytics for Decision Making (BSAD)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"2033\">Developing analytical thinking, statistical interpretation, forecasting, and data-driven decision-making skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n5fa8s\" data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2078\">5. Legal Environment for Business (LEB)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2185\">Understanding business laws, organizational compliance, legal responsibilities, and corporate regulations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2190\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1id7yj7\" data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2258\">2nd Semester: Core Business Functions &amp; HR Operational Expertise</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2469\">The second semester introduces students to major business functions along with operational HR concepts and business analytics. This phase strengthens both managerial understanding and HR specialization skills.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2491\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ghvte7\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2525\">1. Marketing Management (MM)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2639\">Learning branding, customer behavior, marketing strategies, promotional planning, and digital marketing concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19tx4zk\" data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2695\">2. Financial Markets &amp; Corporate Finance (FM &amp; CF)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2797\">Understanding financial systems, investment decisions, corporate financing, and risk-return analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"f4g0qz\" data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2837\">3. Human Resource Management (HRM)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2945\">Studying recruitment, employee training, compensation systems, workforce planning, and employee engagement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18xzksq\" data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2980\">4. Operations Management (OM)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3085\">Learning process optimization, productivity management, supply chain basics, and operational efficiency.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p8bbrm\" data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3125\">5. Business Research Methods (BRM)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3243\">Developing professional research skills including data collection, sampling, report writing, and analysis techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12lup1o\" data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3275\">6. Business Analytics (BA)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3377\">Introduction to business intelligence, analytical tools, data visualization, and predictive analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3382\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"26ph3y\" data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3461\">3rd Semester: Advanced HR Strategy, Talent Management &amp; Workforce Relations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3681\">The third semester focuses on specialized HR functions and strategic workforce management. Students gain expertise in talent acquisition, industrial relations, organizational strategy, and employee performance systems.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3703\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6fq62\" data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3745\">1. Business Environment and Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3858\">Understanding strategic business planning, competitive analysis, market trends, and organizational adaptability.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i6co3x\" data-start=\"3860\" data-end=\"3900\">2. Talent Acquisition and Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3901\" data-end=\"4018\">Learning recruitment strategy, employer branding, employee retention, succession planning, and workforce development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mpch6p\" data-start=\"4020\" data-end=\"4061\">3. Industrial Relations &amp; Labour Laws</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4178\">Studying labor laws, industrial disputes, employee rights, workplace compliance, and union-management relationships.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nlityv\" data-start=\"4180\" data-end=\"4209\">4. Performance Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4320\">Understanding employee evaluation systems, KPI frameworks, productivity enhancement, and appraisal mechanisms.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ayrt3q\" data-start=\"4322\" data-end=\"4356\">5. Research-Based Learning &ndash; I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4357\" data-end=\"4457\">Applying analytical and research methods to solve real-world organizational and HR-related problems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4462\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"p2vjv3\" data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4547\">4th Semester: Leadership, Organizational Transformation &amp; Strategic HR Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4549\" data-end=\"4780\">The final semester develops leadership capabilities and advanced strategic HR expertise. Students learn how organizations manage change, build leadership systems, use HR analytics, and align workforce strategy with business growth.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"4782\" data-end=\"4802\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15uh7nv\" data-start=\"4804\" data-end=\"4839\">1. Entrepreneurship Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4840\" data-end=\"4952\">Learning startup planning, innovation management, entrepreneurial leadership, and business development concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ltfnzg\" data-start=\"4954\" data-end=\"5007\">2. Organizational Development &amp; Change Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5008\" data-end=\"5118\">Understanding organizational transformation, culture management, employee adaptability, and change leadership.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qlnpfv\" data-start=\"5120\" data-end=\"5151\">3. HR Metrics and Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5152\" data-end=\"5263\">Studying workforce analytics, employee productivity metrics, attrition analysis, and data-driven HR strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jcllbt\" data-start=\"5265\" data-end=\"5294\">4. Leadership in Practice</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5295\" data-end=\"5417\">Developing practical leadership skills including communication, conflict resolution, decision-making, and team management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx7ec3\" data-start=\"5419\" data-end=\"5461\">5. Strategic Human Resource Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5589\">Learning long-term workforce planning, strategic talent development, organizational competitiveness, and HR-business alignment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s9hpr0\" data-start=\"5591\" data-end=\"5626\">6. Research-Based Learning &ndash; II</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5627\" data-end=\"5733\">Advanced research-oriented learning focused on solving organizational and workforce management challenges.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 90000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(317, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 216, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 05:38:50', '2026-06-16 07:18:55', '<p data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"548\">Enrolling in an MBA in Business Analytics program is a major step toward building a career in data-driven management, business intelligence, analytics consulting, and AI-powered decision-making. However, many students and working professionals face confusion during the admission process because they do not fully understand how online enrollment works, what documents are required, or how fee payment and verification procedures are completed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"880\">The online enrollment process is designed to provide a smooth and flexible admission experience for students across India and international learners. Since the entire process is digital, applicants can complete registration, application submission, document upload, and fee payment remotely without visiting the campus physically.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"911\">This detailed guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1217\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r7kvff\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"960\">Complete MBA enrollment process step-by-step</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yq2e2j\" data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"994\">Online registration procedure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i0imla\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1034\">Application and document submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"no8wn6\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1074\">Fee payment methods and EMI options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ev5oj9\" data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1126\">Common admission mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d46asa\" data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1168\">Hidden risks during online enrollment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d3h02k\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1217\">Strategic admission tips for faster approval</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1222\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10agwut\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1273\">Understanding the MBA Online Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1440\">The MBA in Business Analytics admission system is fully online and designed for modern learners who prefer flexibility, convenience, and faster admission processing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1484\">The enrollment process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r633i1\" data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1501\">Registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1af4njd\" data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1530\">Student account creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t46q9s\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1562\">Application form completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yylsws\" data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1584\">Program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f12ekk\" data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1604\">Document upload</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csrces\" data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1620\">Fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o227h4\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1647\">Admission verification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1701\">This digital structure is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1878\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1727\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19hdfr0\" data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1747\">Remote learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gimp1\" data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1782\">Students from different states</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tvf4t\" data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1811\">International applicants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4fqcs1\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1878\">Individuals balancing jobs and higher education simultaneously</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1883\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1puox4j\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1934\">Step 1: Visit the Vignan Online Enrollment Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"2027\">The first step in the admission process is accessing the official online enrollment portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2046\">Students need to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2221\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a035jh\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2098\">Visit the official Vignan Online admission page</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzyxpe\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2150\">Click on the &ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo; or &ldquo;Enroll Now&rdquo; option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6r5ko\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2186\">Open the online enrollment form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aaic30\" data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2221\">Begin the registration process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2226\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o39v0r\" data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2257\">Why This Step Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2362\">Many students unknowingly use unofficial websites or unauthorized admission portals, which may lead to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2483\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ddals\" data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2400\">Incorrect application submissions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4ruiu\" data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2424\">Payment fraud risks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jaqzut\" data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2451\">Data security concerns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlj2y4\" data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2483\">Admission processing delays</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2626\">Students should always verify that they are using the official university admission platform before entering personal or payment information.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2631\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kg91z5\" data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2693\">Information Students Should Keep Ready Before Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2821\">Preparing all required information in advance helps students complete the enrollment process smoothly and avoid interruptions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17ujh2s\" data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2848\">Basic Details Required</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"3057\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gix4lm\" data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2892\">Full name as per academic certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mizif\" data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2917\">Active mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pp80n3\" data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2936\">Valid email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2954\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2974\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jab06a\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3009\">Academic qualification records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3028\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3057\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3062\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"psychq\" data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3090\">Expert Admission Advice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3119\">Students should always use:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3178\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"69xv3c\" data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3147\">An active mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pqaqnk\" data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3178\">A frequently used email ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3223\">because important notifications related to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3345\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3250\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fvno0x\" data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3267\">Fee receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1775k9y\" data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3294\">LMS access credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jxjo99\" data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3321\">Academic communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a6dza9\" data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3345\">Examination updates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3383\">will be sent through these channels.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3388\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"c5gpum\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3443\">Step 2: Sign Up and Complete the Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3557\">After accessing the portal, students must create their online account and complete the admission form carefully.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3562\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iqj42j\" data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3593\">Create Your Student Account</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"3637\">The registration process usually includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3739\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1saf2d4\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3664\">Entering basic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jr0s2\" data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3695\">Creating login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zkzjzu\" data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3716\">OTP verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ujxzul\" data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3739\">Account activation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3841\">Once registration is completed successfully, students can proceed to the full admission application.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3846\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rmyoml\" data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3889\">Complete the Essential Enrollment Steps</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3891\" data-end=\"3974\">The application form contains multiple sections that students must fill accurately.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3976\" data-end=\"3979\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cb15o8\" data-start=\"3981\" data-end=\"4012\">Personal Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4039\">Students need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4141\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2yru7\" data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4048\">Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4072\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4092\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"4093\" data-end=\"4110\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2n6ge\" data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4141\">Identification information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4143\" data-end=\"4146\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ta2jvp\" data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4179\">Academic Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4203\">Applicants must enter:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4204\" data-end=\"4331\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"4204\" data-end=\"4226\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fde55\" data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4259\">Aggregate percentage or CGPA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdp0ww\" data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4286\">University information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lx9va\" data-start=\"4287\" data-end=\"4303\">Passing year</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0cc02\" data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4331\">Academic specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4406\">Final semester students may need to provide provisional academic records.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4411\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n3xcpd\" data-start=\"4413\" data-end=\"4433\">Program Selection</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4435\" data-end=\"4529\">Students must select the MBA in Business Analytics specialization carefully during enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1zi2k\" data-start=\"4531\" data-end=\"4564\">Why Program Selection Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4566\" data-end=\"4643\">Choosing the correct specialization is important because it directly affects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4644\" data-end=\"4757\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9hk7lb\" data-start=\"4644\" data-end=\"4664\">Career direction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xszf1\" data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4691\">Industry opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdy81l\" data-start=\"4692\" data-end=\"4723\">Technical skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ot5agr\" data-start=\"4724\" data-end=\"4757\">Long-term professional growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4782\">Students interested in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4906\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kvym5q\" data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4801\">Data analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nobe9n\" data-start=\"4802\" data-end=\"4827\">Business intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2uq61o\" data-start=\"4828\" data-end=\"4852\">AI-driven management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5i64b6\" data-start=\"4853\" data-end=\"4885\">Predictive business strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n5zrbg\" data-start=\"4886\" data-end=\"4906\">Decision science</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4908\" data-end=\"4960\">typically find Business Analytics highly beneficial.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4962\" data-end=\"4965\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83j5nm\" data-start=\"4967\" data-end=\"4993\">Document Upload Process</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4995\" data-end=\"5037\">Students are generally required to upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5038\" data-end=\"5155\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134nxcp\" data-start=\"5038\" data-end=\"5064\">Graduation mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dsun3\" data-start=\"5065\" data-end=\"5113\">Degree certificates or provisional documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rsbash\" data-start=\"5114\" data-end=\"5126\">ID proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"5127\" data-end=\"5155\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5157\" data-end=\"5160\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"d7hyu3\" data-start=\"5162\" data-end=\"5196\">Common Document Upload Mistakes</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5198\" data-end=\"5252\">Many applications are delayed because students upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5253\" data-end=\"5359\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43co8u\" data-start=\"5253\" data-end=\"5270\">Blurred scans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sx5g9z\" data-start=\"5271\" data-end=\"5297\">Incorrect file formats</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ib334\" data-start=\"5298\" data-end=\"5325\">Incomplete certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v0us2\" data-start=\"5326\" data-end=\"5359\">Unreadable academic documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5361\" data-end=\"5441\">Clear and properly formatted documents improve verification speed significantly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5443\" data-end=\"5446\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vxyo72\" data-start=\"5448\" data-end=\"5477\">Step 3: Pay the Program Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5479\" data-end=\"5573\">After completing the enrollment form, students must pay the required fee to confirm admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5575\" data-end=\"5622\">The payment process is fully online and secure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5624\" data-end=\"5627\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pp6z2h\" data-start=\"5629\" data-end=\"5656\">Available Payment Methods</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5658\" data-end=\"5688\">Students can pay fees through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5689\" data-end=\"5773\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"5689\" data-end=\"5704\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"5705\" data-end=\"5719\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"5720\" data-end=\"5735\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sezyli\" data-start=\"5736\" data-end=\"5773\">Easy EMI Options with 0% Interest</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5775\" data-end=\"5778\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cprctf\" data-start=\"5780\" data-end=\"5818\">Understanding the EMI Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5862\">The EMI option is particularly useful for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5863\" data-end=\"5983\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"5863\" data-end=\"5888\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ri80sk\" data-start=\"5889\" data-end=\"5932\">Students managing financial limitations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d1zziy\" data-start=\"5933\" data-end=\"5983\">Learners preferring installment-based payments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"156lf58\" data-start=\"5985\" data-end=\"6012\">Benefits of EMI Facility</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6014\" data-end=\"6135\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"133abd\" data-start=\"6014\" data-end=\"6050\">Lower immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p9zgoi\" data-start=\"6051\" data-end=\"6087\">Easier monthly budget management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i67n6s\" data-start=\"6088\" data-end=\"6135\">Improved affordability for higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6137\" data-end=\"6140\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u202ba\" data-start=\"6142\" data-end=\"6191\">Important Financial Advice Before Choosing EMI</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6193\" data-end=\"6228\">Students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6229\" data-end=\"6349\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pfemi8\" data-start=\"6229\" data-end=\"6261\">Monthly repayment capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kj8uhq\" data-start=\"6262\" data-end=\"6295\">Overall financial commitments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ltcrne\" data-start=\"6296\" data-end=\"6317\">Payment timelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xtzyvd\" data-start=\"6318\" data-end=\"6349\">Future educational expenses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6351\" data-end=\"6430\">Even with 0% interest EMI options, proper financial planning remains essential.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"531\">Understanding the eligibility criteria is one of the most important parts of the MBA admission process. Many students focus heavily on specialization, placement opportunities, and salary expectations but often overlook detailed admission requirements. This can lead to application rejection, document verification delays, or eligibility confusion later during admission counseling.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"1003\">The MBA in Business Analytics program is designed for students who want to combine management expertise with analytics, data-driven decision-making, Artificial Intelligence fundamentals, and business intelligence systems. Since the curriculum involves analytical reasoning, strategic business understanding, and quantitative interpretation, universities establish specific academic eligibility standards to ensure students are prepared for advanced management education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1034\">This detailed guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1331\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rouitd\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1081\">Minimum educational qualification required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9rtw58\" data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1110\">Aggregate marks criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3teybl\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1142\">UGC recognition requirement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqw3f6\" data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1169\">SC/ST relaxation rules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wwtqi6\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1208\">Final semester student eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bv7gi9\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1242\">Accepted academic backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w489b\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1288\">Common eligibility mistakes students make</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15naqu2\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1331\">Important strategic admission insights</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1336\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"80hkjf\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1392\">Basic MBA in Business Analytics Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1497\">Students seeking admission must fulfill the required academic qualifications specified for the program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z5vvlm\" data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1536\">Required Educational Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1696\">Applicants must have completed an <strong data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1617\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) Degree Program</strong> of a minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1658\">three years</strong> from a <strong data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1695\">UGC Recognized University</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1841\">The degree can belong to <strong data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1760\">any academic stream or discipline</strong>, making the program accessible to students from diverse educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ux6rxl\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1875\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1972\">Students must meet the required aggregate marks criteria in their undergraduate degree program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ycqnta\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2011\">Category-Wise Eligibility Criteria</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2148\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2054\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2054\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2054\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Aggregate Required</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2148\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2107\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2084\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2107\" data-col-size=\"sm\">50% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2148\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SC/ST Category</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2148\" data-col-size=\"sm\">45% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2265\">A relaxation of 5% marks is provided to candidates belonging to SC/ST categories according to admission guidelines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2270\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xmefjw\" data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2315\">Final Semester Students Are Also Eligible</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2433\">Candidates currently studying in the final semester of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree program can also apply for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fvye\" data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2482\">Important Guidelines for Final Year Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2532\">Students appearing in the final semester should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2708\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edkzqf\" data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2589\">Submit available academic records during application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"119vux1\" data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2635\">Provide provisional documents if required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12y4ecr\" data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2708\">Complete all degree requirements before final admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s0s68o\" data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2736\">Why This Is Beneficial</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2762\">This allows students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2907\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1adgc7p\" data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2812\">Apply early without waiting for final results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgofck\" data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2861\">Participate in the admission process on time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nqm8qc\" data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2907\">Secure seats before competition increases</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2912\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1m8zall\" data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2953\">UGC Recognition Requirement Explained</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"3075\">The undergraduate qualification must be obtained from a university recognized by the University Grants Commission (UGC).</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13c0ynd\" data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3112\">Why UGC Recognition Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3138\">UGC recognition ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3308\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wp36kb\" data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3174\">Academic validity of the degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"siye8e\" data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3219\">Acceptance for higher education programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"thevrr\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3257\">Recognition in employment sectors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncpjn\" data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3308\">Compliance with approved educational standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3372\">Students graduating from non-recognized institutions may face:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3456\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwrtt2\" data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3396\">Admission rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mug8e3\" data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3420\">Verification issues</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"48mf6s\" data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3456\">Future employment complications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3461\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lztnlk\" data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3499\">Students from Any Stream Can Apply</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3637\">One of the major advantages of MBA in Business Analytics is that students from multiple academic backgrounds are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4sxlms\" data-start=\"3639\" data-end=\"3679\">Eligible Academic Backgrounds Include</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3681\" data-end=\"3831\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"3681\" data-end=\"3688\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuwkdh\" data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3698\">B.Com</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ub0l3o\" data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3707\">B.Sc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3714\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"3715\" data-end=\"3722\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hnd5hy\" data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3738\">B.Tech / BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kb4bqe\" data-start=\"3739\" data-end=\"3764\">Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8ezea\" data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3786\">Commerce Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nj617f\" data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3807\">Science Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xqsf76\" data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3831\">Humanities Programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3962\">This multidisciplinary eligibility structure supports diverse classroom learning and broader business problem-solving approaches.</p>', '<p data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"828\">The MBA in Business Analytics fee structure is designed to provide flexible payment options for Indian students, SAARC nation students, and international learners. Students can choose semester-wise, annual, or total program payment plans according to their financial convenience and academic planning preferences.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"859\">This detailed guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"1141\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fm7uhq\" data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"895\">Semester-wise MBA fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q9b1vi\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"926\">Annual and total fee plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aflusc\" data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"960\">Additional university charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14d059j\" data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"990\">SAARC student fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q37kuk\" data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1024\">Foreign student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bwucac\" data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1062\">Hidden costs students should know</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8jm392\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1102\">ROI and financial planning insights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ndw8x\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1141\">Strategic advice before enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1146\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19vevzc\" data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1209\">MBA in Business Analytics Fee Structure for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1346\">The fee structure for Indian students is divided into flexible payment plans to help students manage educational expenses conveniently.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"f8bwvd\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1380\">Indian Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1504\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1403\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1403\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1393\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1403\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1504\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1445\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1434\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1445\">₹22,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1464\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1475\">₹45,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1504\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1493\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1504\">₹90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rkz2z6\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1551\">Additional Charges for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1649\">Apart from tuition fees, students are also required to pay certain mandatory university charges.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cws2c8\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1676\">Additional Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1798\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1699\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1709\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1798\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1760\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1750\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1760\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1798\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1788\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1798\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1803\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1657bl7\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1850\">MBA Fee Structure for SAARC Nation Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1977\">Students from SAARC countries are eligible under a dedicated fee category with separate registration and examination charges.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vz6nli\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2019\">Additional Charges for SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2130\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2052\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2052\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2052\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2130\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2092\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2082\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2092\">₹2,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2130\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2120\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2130\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2135\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"5mlchf\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2199\">MBA in Business Analytics Fee Structure for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2351\">The university also offers affordable management education opportunities for international students through a dedicated foreign student fee structure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cgz08i\" data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2386\">Foreign Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2503\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2409\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2409\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2399\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2409\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2503\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2448\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2440\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2448\">$375</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2475\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2467\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2475\">$750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2503\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2493\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2503\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$1,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2508\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g7i4sp\" data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2551\">Additional Charges for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2667\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2584\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2584\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2574\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2584\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2667\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2632\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2625\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2632\">$30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2667\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2660\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2667\">$60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"577\">The MBA in Business Analytics is designed for students who want to combine management expertise with data-driven decision-making, analytics, Artificial Intelligence fundamentals, and business intelligence systems. In today&rsquo;s digital economy, organizations increasingly rely on analytics professionals who can transform raw business data into strategic insights that improve profitability, operational efficiency, customer experience, and long-term business growth.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"678\">Unlike traditional MBA programs that focus only on management concepts, this curriculum integrates:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"925\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q9jyp1\" data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"714\">Business management foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r8o1sv\" data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"751\">Data analytics and visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w8i6y5\" data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"785\">Machine learning fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sit7vx\" data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"819\">Business intelligence systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v9unvh\" data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"846\">Data mining techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kdfqn0\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"885\">Strategic business decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ujaxjb\" data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"925\">Project and research-based learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1227\">The semester-wise syllabus is carefully structured to gradually develop both managerial understanding and analytical expertise. Students first build strong business fundamentals and later move toward advanced analytics, data warehousing, business intelligence, and predictive decision-making systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1278\">This curriculum prepares students for careers in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1301\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ihej2\" data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1320\">Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9wg5sr\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1346\">Business Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17jqvo\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1361\">Consulting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s7u0c8\" data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1382\">Product Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1owsvvc\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1407\">Operations Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0eu8q\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1441\">AI-driven Business Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17cggcl\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1534\">1st Semester: Foundation of Management, Business Understanding &amp; Analytical Thinking</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1810\">The first semester focuses on building a strong understanding of management principles, organizational behavior, economics, accounting, and quantitative analysis. Students begin developing analytical thinking skills that are essential for future business analytics learning.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1832\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xnypa2\" data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1874\">1. Management Concepts and Practices</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"2020\">This subject introduces the core functions of management including planning, organizing, leadership, coordination, and business decision-making.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2045\">Key Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2189\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1av7el3\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2074\">Principles of management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19nfjbt\" data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2118\">Leadership and organizational structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ml5hm\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2154\">Business planning and execution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ifhlnq\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2189\">Strategic managerial functions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2220\">Why This Subject Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2369\">A strong management foundation is essential because business analytics professionals often work closely with senior leadership and strategic teams.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2374\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2oan92\" data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2418\">2. Principles of Economics and Markets</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2534\">Students learn how economic systems and market forces influence business operations and corporate decision-making.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2555\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2682\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jh284l\" data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2586\">Demand and supply analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dhku7e\" data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2608\">Market structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xcc75m\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2630\">Consumer behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e6pbr0\" data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2655\">Economic forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ztnq9c\" data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2682\">Business market trends</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2708\">Industry Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2829\">Analytics professionals frequently analyze economic patterns and market performance to support organizational strategy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2834\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s84tsx\" data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2878\">3. Managerial Effectiveness and Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"3001\">This subject develops professional leadership skills while emphasizing ethical decision-making in corporate environments.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3028\">Major Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3173\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5wpsn\" data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3057\">Leadership effectiveness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"605w4j\" data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3081\">Professional ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1irfwgi\" data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3115\">Organizational responsibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wdz4bs\" data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3144\">Corporate accountability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tz1e0v\" data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3173\">Managerial communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3195\">Strategic Value</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3330\">Modern businesses increasingly prioritize ethical leadership and responsible decision-making, especially in data-driven environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3335\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m1roou\" data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3366\">4. Accounting and Finance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3474\">Students develop understanding of financial systems, accounting concepts, and business financial analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3494\">Core Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3602\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"390cs7\" data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3519\">Financial statements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o3h32l\" data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3545\">Budgeting and costing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1soa09s\" data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3567\">Investment basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kmssej\" data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3602\">Financial performance analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3604\" data-end=\"3645\">Why Financial Knowledge Is Important</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3770\">Business analytics professionals often work with financial datasets and performance metrics to support strategic decisions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"3775\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s3lhnd\" data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"3838\">5. Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3840\" data-end=\"3941\">This subject explains employee behavior, organizational culture, and workforce management principles.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3943\" data-end=\"3957\">Key Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"4076\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3uwexa\" data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"3987\">Motivation and leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kbcn1v\" data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"4005\">Team dynamics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16tiufr\" data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4029\">Employee engagement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p9eq2a\" data-start=\"4030\" data-end=\"4056\">Organizational culture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17rd4p2\" data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4076\">HR fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4099\">Career Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4101\" data-end=\"4198\">Analytics-driven workforce management is becoming increasingly important in modern organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4203\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zfjsox\" data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4249\">6. Quantitative Techniques and Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4251\" data-end=\"4342\">Students begin learning mathematical and statistical techniques used for business analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4344\" data-end=\"4365\">Skills Developed</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4503\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p7xbpd\" data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4390\">Statistical analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uvke42\" data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4414\">Data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rdm9dr\" data-start=\"4415\" data-end=\"4447\">Quantitative decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xg9dyt\" data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4472\">Business forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17wncn4\" data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4503\">Analytical problem-solving</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4505\" data-end=\"4531\">Industry Significance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4533\" data-end=\"4673\">This subject forms the analytical backbone for advanced business intelligence and machine learning concepts introduced later in the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4675\" data-end=\"4678\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1v5czu\" data-start=\"4680\" data-end=\"4754\">2nd Semester: Core Business Operations &amp; Technical Analytics Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4861\">The second semester strengthens both business management expertise and technical analytical capabilities.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4883\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"108nxtk\" data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"4908\">1. Entrepreneurship</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4910\" data-end=\"5007\">Students learn innovation management, startup planning, and entrepreneurial business development.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5028\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5029\" data-end=\"5134\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcebe0\" data-start=\"5029\" data-end=\"5056\">Business model creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nc1mfq\" data-start=\"5057\" data-end=\"5077\">Startup strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hhk6nq\" data-start=\"5078\" data-end=\"5103\">Innovation management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lbbq52\" data-start=\"5104\" data-end=\"5134\">Entrepreneurial leadership</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5136\" data-end=\"5165\">Why This Subject Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5167\" data-end=\"5264\">Analytics professionals increasingly work in startup ecosystems and technology-driven businesses.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5266\" data-end=\"5269\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ht73y7\" data-start=\"5271\" data-end=\"5311\">2. Marketing Management and Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5313\" data-end=\"5415\">This subject focuses on customer behavior analysis, market research, and strategic marketing planning.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5417\" data-end=\"5436\">Major Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5437\" data-end=\"5562\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4a7y8\" data-start=\"5437\" data-end=\"5459\">Consumer analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n4a5ns\" data-start=\"5460\" data-end=\"5481\">Branding strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3s06q\" data-start=\"5482\" data-end=\"5505\">Market segmentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bk3kt6\" data-start=\"5506\" data-end=\"5532\">Research methodologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1548uqe\" data-start=\"5533\" data-end=\"5562\">Marketing decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5564\" data-end=\"5588\">Industry Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5590\" data-end=\"5682\">Modern marketing heavily depends on customer data analysis and predictive business insights.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5684\" data-end=\"5687\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rjs9vy\" data-start=\"5689\" data-end=\"5717\">3. Operations Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5719\" data-end=\"5806\">Students learn how organizations optimize operational systems and improve productivity.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5808\" data-end=\"5827\">Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5828\" data-end=\"5930\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qthnt1\" data-start=\"5828\" data-end=\"5855\">Supply chain management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7scfsy\" data-start=\"5856\" data-end=\"5880\">Process optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zuemei\" data-start=\"5881\" data-end=\"5906\">Productivity analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ak4c8i\" data-start=\"5907\" data-end=\"5930\">Resource allocation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5932\" data-end=\"5956\">Strategic Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5958\" data-end=\"6056\">Analytics tools are extensively used in operations and logistics management to improve efficiency.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6058\" data-end=\"6061\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wy7pab\" data-start=\"6063\" data-end=\"6101\">4. Analytics Language for Managers</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6103\" data-end=\"6210\">This subject introduces programming and analytics languages relevant for managerial analytics applications.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6212\" data-end=\"6233\">Skills Developed</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6234\" data-end=\"6344\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11hy7vm\" data-start=\"6234\" data-end=\"6272\">Analytics-oriented coding concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19l21tq\" data-start=\"6273\" data-end=\"6297\">Data handling basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nogyab\" data-start=\"6298\" data-end=\"6344\">Business-focused programming understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6346\" data-end=\"6367\">Career Advantage</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6369\" data-end=\"6479\">Managers with basic analytical coding understanding adapt faster to modern AI and analytics-driven workplaces.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6481\" data-end=\"6484\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"105s60u\" data-start=\"6486\" data-end=\"6510\">5. DBMS for Managers</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6512\" data-end=\"6588\">Students learn database management systems and data organization techniques.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6590\" data-end=\"6608\">Core Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6609\" data-end=\"6712\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"168b3or\" data-start=\"6609\" data-end=\"6632\">Database structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q6xo36\" data-start=\"6633\" data-end=\"6653\">SQL fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x2dlbr\" data-start=\"6654\" data-end=\"6678\">Data storage systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kfb4lq\" data-start=\"6679\" data-end=\"6712\">Information retrieval methods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6714\" data-end=\"6740\">Why DBMS Is Important</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6742\" data-end=\"6838\">Business analytics depends heavily on structured data management and efficient database systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6840\" data-end=\"6843\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"49g5lh\" data-start=\"6845\" data-end=\"6896\">6. Mathematical Foundation for Machine Learning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6898\" data-end=\"7000\">This subject builds mathematical understanding required for machine learning and predictive analytics.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7002\" data-end=\"7021\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7022\" data-end=\"7108\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c2ennv\" data-start=\"7022\" data-end=\"7040\">Linear algebra</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"asedi0\" data-start=\"7041\" data-end=\"7063\">Probability theory</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j6uaxf\" data-start=\"7064\" data-end=\"7083\">Calculus basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5te3p8\" data-start=\"7084\" data-end=\"7108\">Statistical modeling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7110\" data-end=\"7136\">Future Industry Value</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"7138\" data-end=\"7250\">Machine learning is becoming a major component of business analytics, automation, and AI-driven decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7252\" data-end=\"7255\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1xlockg\" data-start=\"7257\" data-end=\"7334\">3rd Semester: Business Intelligence, Data Warehousing &amp; Strategic Analytics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7336\" data-end=\"7457\">The third semester focuses on advanced business analytics systems and intelligence frameworks used in modern enterprises.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"7459\" data-end=\"7479\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6fq62\" data-start=\"7481\" data-end=\"7521\">1. Business Environment and Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7523\" data-end=\"7593\">Students learn strategic business planning and environmental analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7595\" data-end=\"7618\">Key Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7619\" data-end=\"7725\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmk0lw\" data-start=\"7619\" data-end=\"7643\">Competitive strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sm8svy\" data-start=\"7644\" data-end=\"7663\">Market analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gtj1fe\" data-start=\"7664\" data-end=\"7693\">Strategic decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wrxrb0\" data-start=\"7694\" data-end=\"7725\">Organizational adaptability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7727\" data-end=\"7750\">Industry Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"7752\" data-end=\"7865\">Analytics professionals help organizations make strategic decisions based on market intelligence and data trends.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7867\" data-end=\"7870\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5v1wt8\" data-start=\"7872\" data-end=\"7897\">2. Project Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7899\" data-end=\"8001\">This subject teaches project execution, scheduling, resource planning, and risk management techniques.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8003\" data-end=\"8024\">Skills Developed</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8025\" data-end=\"8122\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1undee8\" data-start=\"8025\" data-end=\"8045\">Project planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uv0rr1\" data-start=\"8046\" data-end=\"8065\">Risk assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ak4c8i\" data-start=\"8066\" data-end=\"8089\">Resource allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sy3x6f\" data-start=\"8090\" data-end=\"8122\">Project performance analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8124\" data-end=\"8143\">Why It Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"8145\" data-end=\"8227\">Analytics projects require strong project coordination and execution capabilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8229\" data-end=\"8232\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yha0b7\" data-start=\"8234\" data-end=\"8278\">3. Introduction to Business Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8280\" data-end=\"8373\">Students are introduced to business intelligence systems and enterprise reporting frameworks.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8375\" data-end=\"8394\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8395\" data-end=\"8507\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t3tgmm\" data-start=\"8395\" data-end=\"8433\">Business intelligence architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9evc2\" data-start=\"8434\" data-end=\"8456\">Data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qiop80\" data-start=\"8457\" data-end=\"8478\">Reporting systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16lstxd\" data-start=\"8479\" data-end=\"8507\">Decision support systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8509\" data-end=\"8533\">Career Significance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"8535\" data-end=\"8639\">Business Intelligence (BI) is one of the fastest-growing domains in analytics and enterprise technology.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8641\" data-end=\"8644\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fil1v0\" data-start=\"8646\" data-end=\"8669\">4. Data Warehousing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8671\" data-end=\"8753\">This subject explains enterprise data storage and centralized information systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8755\" data-end=\"8772\">Key Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8773\" data-end=\"8876\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n2ke88\" data-start=\"8773\" data-end=\"8804\">Data warehouse architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ujopxk\" data-start=\"8805\" data-end=\"8822\">ETL processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9ndja\" data-start=\"8823\" data-end=\"8843\">Data integration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vou0n9\" data-start=\"8844\" data-end=\"8876\">Enterprise reporting systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8878\" data-end=\"8912\">Why This Subject Is Important</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"8914\" data-end=\"9017\">Modern organizations rely on centralized data systems for strategic analytics and business forecasting.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9019\" data-end=\"9022\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v6h44p\" data-start=\"9024\" data-end=\"9059\">5. Data Mining for Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9061\" data-end=\"9145\">Students learn techniques used to extract patterns and insights from large datasets.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9147\" data-end=\"9172\">Major Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9173\" data-end=\"9301\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ndk8dc\" data-start=\"9173\" data-end=\"9196\">Predictive modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10w4njb\" data-start=\"9197\" data-end=\"9220\">Pattern recognition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oejfn5\" data-start=\"9221\" data-end=\"9250\">Classification techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bnkrzi\" data-start=\"9251\" data-end=\"9273\">Clustering methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18u5p3g\" data-start=\"9274\" data-end=\"9301\">Data-driven forecasting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9303\" data-end=\"9323\">Industry Demand</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"9325\" data-end=\"9355\">Data mining is widely used in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9356\" data-end=\"9431\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6z7ji\" data-start=\"9356\" data-end=\"9367\">Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16igutd\" data-start=\"9368\" data-end=\"9382\">Healthcare</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjyobz\" data-start=\"9383\" data-end=\"9393\">Retail</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m6xjvw\" data-start=\"9394\" data-end=\"9407\">Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"119ffx3\" data-start=\"9408\" data-end=\"9431\">Financial analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9433\" data-end=\"9436\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14u2hjq\" data-start=\"9438\" data-end=\"9465\">6. Open Elective Course</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9467\" data-end=\"9569\">Students can choose interdisciplinary subjects according to career interests and specialization goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9571\" data-end=\"9574\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yj42b0\" data-start=\"9576\" data-end=\"9650\">4th Semester: Advanced Analytics, BI Reporting &amp; Research-Based Learning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9652\" data-end=\"9811\">The final semester focuses on practical analytics applications, business intelligence reporting, anomaly detection systems, and research-oriented project work.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"9813\" data-end=\"9833\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mu2e7v\" data-start=\"9835\" data-end=\"9865\">1. Analytics in Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9867\" data-end=\"9948\">This subject focuses on applying analytics in real business management scenarios.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9950\" data-end=\"9975\">Applications Include</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9976\" data-end=\"10071\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16cfrod\" data-start=\"9976\" data-end=\"9998\">Strategic planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15jesg6\" data-start=\"9999\" data-end=\"10024\">Operational analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13w2dbu\" data-start=\"10025\" data-end=\"10047\">Customer analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x3rcea\" data-start=\"10048\" data-end=\"10071\">Workforce analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10073\" data-end=\"10076\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"o73wrm\" data-start=\"10078\" data-end=\"10118\">2. Web Data Extraction and Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10120\" data-end=\"10196\">Students learn methods for collecting and analyzing web-based business data.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10198\" data-end=\"10217\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10218\" data-end=\"10332\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9h2peg\" data-start=\"10218\" data-end=\"10243\">Web scraping concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugkvb5\" data-start=\"10244\" data-end=\"10270\">Online data collection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n2up7w\" data-start=\"10271\" data-end=\"10300\">Digital behavior analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fwrzyc\" data-start=\"10301\" data-end=\"10332\">Web-based analytics systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10334\" data-end=\"10358\">Industry Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"10360\" data-end=\"10461\">Businesses increasingly use online customer behavior and web analytics for strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10463\" data-end=\"10466\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xl6gma\" data-start=\"10468\" data-end=\"10503\">3. Anomaly Detection Techniques</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10505\" data-end=\"10598\">This subject introduces techniques for identifying unusual patterns or risks in data systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10600\" data-end=\"10623\">Major Applications</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10624\" data-end=\"10723\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xpqen7\" data-start=\"10624\" data-end=\"10643\">Fraud detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ji02br\" data-start=\"10644\" data-end=\"10671\">Cybersecurity analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqpxbt\" data-start=\"10672\" data-end=\"10689\">Risk analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15e9i2d\" data-start=\"10690\" data-end=\"10723\">Predictive monitoring systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10725\" data-end=\"10728\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nbzeci\" data-start=\"10730\" data-end=\"10762\">4. BI Reporting for Managers</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10764\" data-end=\"10869\">Students learn how to create business intelligence reports and dashboards for managerial decision-making.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10871\" data-end=\"10892\">Skills Developed</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10893\" data-end=\"11001\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4almn9\" data-start=\"10893\" data-end=\"10915\">Dashboard creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cx8ke8\" data-start=\"10916\" data-end=\"10938\">Business reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9evc2\" data-start=\"10939\" data-end=\"10961\">Data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173gv1l\" data-start=\"10962\" data-end=\"11001\">Executive-level data interpretation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11003\" data-end=\"11006\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5wa2ot\" data-start=\"11008\" data-end=\"11047\">5. Cross-Functional Elective Course</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"11049\" data-end=\"11124\">Students gain exposure to interdisciplinary business and analytics domains.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11126\" data-end=\"11129\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ipu0o8\" data-start=\"11131\" data-end=\"11161\">6. Master Thesis / Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"11163\" data-end=\"11263\">The final project allows students to apply analytics concepts to solve real-world business problems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"11265\" data-end=\"11293\">Benefits of the Project</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11294\" data-end=\"11418\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105k36a\" data-start=\"11294\" data-end=\"11325\">Practical industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kgtizl\" data-start=\"11326\" data-end=\"11365\">Research and analytical development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cf2rpg\" data-start=\"11366\" data-end=\"11388\">Portfolio building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"inncwp\" data-start=\"11389\" data-end=\"11418\">Problem-solving expertise</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 90000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(318, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 282, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 05:54:10', '2026-06-16 07:19:54', '<p data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"594\">Enrolling in an MBA in FinTech and Human Resource Management program is an important step for students and working professionals aiming to build careers in digital finance, banking technology, strategic HR management, workforce analytics, and organizational leadership. However, many applicants face difficulties during admission because they do not fully understand the online enrollment process, required documents, fee payment procedures, or verification requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"948\">The online admission system is designed to provide a smooth, flexible, and fully digital enrollment experience for learners across India and international students. Since the entire process is conducted online, students can complete registration, application submission, document upload, and fee payment remotely without visiting the campus physically.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"989\">This detailed admission guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r7kvff\" data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1038\">Complete MBA enrollment process step-by-step</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zry049\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1089\">Online registration and application procedures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vfbyfx\" data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1134\">Document upload and verification process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nw18p9\" data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1177\">Fee payment options and EMI facilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ev5oj9\" data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1229\">Common admission mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d46asa\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1271\">Hidden risks during online enrollment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d3h02k\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1320\">Strategic admission tips for faster approval</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1325\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10agwut\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1376\">Understanding the MBA Online Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1500\">The MBA admission process is completely online and designed for modern learners who require flexibility and accessibility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1543\">The enrollment system generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1706\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r633i1\" data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1560\">Registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1af4njd\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1589\">Student account creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t46q9s\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1621\">Application form completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yylsws\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1643\">Program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f12ekk\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1663\">Document upload</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csrces\" data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1679\">Fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o227h4\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1706\">Admission verification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1760\">This digital structure is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1786\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19hdfr0\" data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1806\">Remote learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gimp1\" data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1841\">Students from different states</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tvf4t\" data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1870\">International applicants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yfxu31\" data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1905\">Career-switching professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1910\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1puox4j\" data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1961\">Step 1: Visit the Vignan Online Enrollment Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2054\">The first step in the admission process is accessing the official online enrollment portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2073\">Students need to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2248\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a035jh\" data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2125\">Visit the official Vignan Online admission page</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzyxpe\" data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2177\">Click on the &ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo; or &ldquo;Enroll Now&rdquo; option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6r5ko\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2213\">Open the online enrollment form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aaic30\" data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2248\">Begin the registration process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2253\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o39v0r\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2284\">Why This Step Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2388\">Many students unknowingly use unofficial websites or unauthorized admission portals, which may create:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2510\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ddals\" data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2426\">Incorrect application submissions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4ruiu\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2450\">Payment fraud risks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v2cthx\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2476\">Data privacy concerns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ltn1su\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2510\">Admission verification delays</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2650\">Students should always verify that they are using the official university enrollment platform before entering personal or payment details.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2655\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kg91z5\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2717\">Information Students Should Keep Ready Before Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2822\">Preparing all necessary information in advance helps students complete the enrollment process smoothly.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c5fod6\" data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2853\">Basic Information Required</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"3049\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mi9lua\" data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2892\">Full name as per academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mizif\" data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2917\">Active mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pp80n3\" data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2936\">Valid email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2954\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2974\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dnebzw\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3001\">Graduation information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3020\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3049\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3054\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"psychq\" data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3082\">Expert Admission Advice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3111\">Students should always use:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3170\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lqrkl7\" data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3144\">A frequently active email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqjx5o\" data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3170\">A valid mobile number</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3209\">because important updates related to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3338\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3236\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17351q3\" data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3261\">Fee payment receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w54iqq\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3281\">LMS credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jmdcbh\" data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3311\">Examination notifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jxjo99\" data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3338\">Academic communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3340\" data-end=\"3376\">will be sent through these channels.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3381\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"c5gpum\" data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3436\">Step 2: Sign Up and Complete the Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3557\">After accessing the portal, students must create their online account and complete the admission application carefully.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3562\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iqj42j\" data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3593\">Create Your Student Account</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"3639\">The registration process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3744\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e15fdm\" data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3669\">Entering personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jr0s2\" data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3700\">Creating login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zkzjzu\" data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3721\">OTP verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ujxzul\" data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"3744\">Account activation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3831\">After successful registration, students can proceed to the complete application form.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3836\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rmyoml\" data-start=\"3838\" data-end=\"3879\">Complete the Essential Enrollment Steps</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3971\">The online application form includes multiple sections that students must fill accurately.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3973\" data-end=\"3976\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cb15o8\" data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"4009\">Personal Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4011\" data-end=\"4036\">Students need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4037\" data-end=\"4138\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2yru7\" data-start=\"4037\" data-end=\"4045\">Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4069\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"4070\" data-end=\"4089\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2n6ge\" data-start=\"4090\" data-end=\"4120\">Identification information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"4121\" data-end=\"4138\">Date of birth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4140\" data-end=\"4143\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ta2jvp\" data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4176\">Academic Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4200\">Applicants must enter:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4323\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4223\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"183w91j\" data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4251\">Aggregate marks or CGPA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdp0ww\" data-start=\"4252\" data-end=\"4278\">University information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lx9va\" data-start=\"4279\" data-end=\"4295\">Passing year</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0cc02\" data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4323\">Academic specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4419\">Students appearing in the final semester may also need to upload provisional academic records.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4424\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n3xcpd\" data-start=\"4426\" data-end=\"4446\">Program Selection</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4561\">Students must carefully select the MBA in FinTech and Human Resource Management specialization during enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1zi2k\" data-start=\"4563\" data-end=\"4596\">Why Program Selection Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4644\">The chosen specialization directly influences:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4645\" data-end=\"4757\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj5fkl\" data-start=\"4645\" data-end=\"4669\">Career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvphi9\" data-start=\"4670\" data-end=\"4691\">Industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdy81l\" data-start=\"4692\" data-end=\"4723\">Technical skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ot5agr\" data-start=\"4724\" data-end=\"4757\">Long-term professional growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4829\">This specialization is especially suitable for students interested in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4830\" data-end=\"4966\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x0wwrr\" data-start=\"4830\" data-end=\"4854\">Financial technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cg0vco\" data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4874\">Banking systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"defudr\" data-start=\"4875\" data-end=\"4897\">Workforce strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ow6p8a\" data-start=\"4898\" data-end=\"4917\">Digital finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zbkqh7\" data-start=\"4918\" data-end=\"4935\">HR leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sk4az1\" data-start=\"4936\" data-end=\"4966\">Organizational development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4968\" data-end=\"4971\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83j5nm\" data-start=\"4973\" data-end=\"4999\">Document Upload Process</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5001\" data-end=\"5043\">Students are generally required to upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5166\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134nxcp\" data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5070\">Graduation mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v45ing\" data-start=\"5071\" data-end=\"5118\">Degree certificate or provisional documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"5119\" data-end=\"5137\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"5138\" data-end=\"5166\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5171\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"d7hyu3\" data-start=\"5173\" data-end=\"5207\">Common Document Upload Mistakes</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5209\" data-end=\"5263\">Many applications are delayed because students upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5361\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2v78q6\" data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5285\">Blurred documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sx5g9z\" data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5312\">Incorrect file formats</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ib334\" data-start=\"5313\" data-end=\"5340\">Incomplete certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hggyx3\" data-start=\"5341\" data-end=\"5361\">Unreadable scans</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5363\" data-end=\"5451\">Properly scanned and clearly visible documents significantly improve verification speed.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5453\" data-end=\"5456\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vxyo72\" data-start=\"5458\" data-end=\"5487\">Step 3: Pay the Program Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5489\" data-end=\"5585\">After completing the application form, students must pay the required fee to confirm enrollment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5587\" data-end=\"5634\">The payment process is secure and fully online.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5636\" data-end=\"5639\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pp6z2h\" data-start=\"5641\" data-end=\"5668\">Available Payment Methods</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5670\" data-end=\"5700\">Students can pay fees through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5701\" data-end=\"5785\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"5701\" data-end=\"5716\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"5717\" data-end=\"5731\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"5732\" data-end=\"5747\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sezyli\" data-start=\"5748\" data-end=\"5785\">Easy EMI Options with 0% Interest</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5787\" data-end=\"5790\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cprctf\" data-start=\"5792\" data-end=\"5830\">Understanding the EMI Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5832\" data-end=\"5878\">The EMI facility is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5879\" data-end=\"6008\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"5879\" data-end=\"5904\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vv1znh\" data-start=\"5905\" data-end=\"5947\">Students with financial planning needs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khgvkf\" data-start=\"5948\" data-end=\"6008\">Learners preferring installment-based payment structures</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17bfro3\" data-start=\"6010\" data-end=\"6036\">Benefits of EMI Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6038\" data-end=\"6151\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juc81q\" data-start=\"6038\" data-end=\"6076\">Reduced immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lvcttt\" data-start=\"6077\" data-end=\"6105\">Easier monthly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzih0q\" data-start=\"6106\" data-end=\"6151\">Better affordability for higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6153\" data-end=\"6156\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u202ba\" data-start=\"6158\" data-end=\"6207\">Important Financial Advice Before Choosing EMI</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6209\" data-end=\"6244\">Students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6245\" data-end=\"6371\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pfemi8\" data-start=\"6245\" data-end=\"6277\">Monthly repayment capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h8ds60\" data-start=\"6278\" data-end=\"6313\">Long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ltcrne\" data-start=\"6314\" data-end=\"6335\">Payment timelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11tkeut\" data-start=\"6336\" data-end=\"6371\">Additional educational expenses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6373\" data-end=\"6453\">Even with 0% interest EMI options, proper budgeting remains extremely important.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"541\">Understanding the eligibility criteria is one of the most important steps before applying for MBA admission. Many students focus mainly on specialization choices, placements, salary expectations, and career opportunities while overlooking detailed admission requirements. This often leads to confusion during document verification, counseling, or final admission approval.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"1040\">The MBA in FinTech and Human Resource Management is a specialized management program that combines financial technology, banking systems, workforce management, leadership development, and strategic business administration. Since the program involves analytical decision-making, digital finance understanding, organizational leadership, and people management expertise, universities establish specific academic eligibility standards to ensure students are prepared for advanced management learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1083\">This detailed eligibility guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1406\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rouitd\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1130\">Minimum educational qualification required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hcz6sx\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1171\">Aggregate marks eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixkcr6\" data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1204\">UGC recognition requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqw3f6\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1231\">SC/ST relaxation rules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wwtqi6\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1270\">Final semester student eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bv7gi9\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1304\">Accepted academic backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vv1835\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1358\">Common eligibility mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rvf1u0\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1406\">Strategic admission insights for applicants</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1411\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ndqt0s\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1445\">Basic MBA Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1584\">Students seeking admission to the MBA in FinTech and Human Resource Management program must fulfill the required academic qualifications.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z5vvlm\" data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1623\">Required Educational Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1783\">Applicants must have completed an <strong data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1704\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) Degree Program</strong> of a minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1745\">three years</strong> from a <strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1782\">UGC Recognized University</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1913\">The bachelor&rsquo;s degree can belong to <strong data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1849\">any stream or discipline</strong>, allowing students from multiple academic backgrounds to apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1918\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ux6rxl\" data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1947\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"2038\">Students must secure the required minimum aggregate marks in their undergraduate program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ycqnta\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2077\">Category-Wise Eligibility Criteria</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2120\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2120\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2090\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2120\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Aggregate Required</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2173\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2173\">50% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2191\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SC/ST Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2214\">45% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2331\">A relaxation of 5% marks is provided to candidates belonging to SC/ST categories according to admission guidelines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2336\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xmefjw\" data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2381\">Final Semester Students Are Also Eligible</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2512\">Candidates currently appearing in the final semester of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree program are also eligible to apply for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fvye\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2561\">Important Guidelines for Final Year Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2601\">Students in the final semester should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edkzqf\" data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2658\">Submit available academic records during application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"119vux1\" data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2704\">Provide provisional documents if required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12y4ecr\" data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2777\">Complete all degree requirements before final admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qspa7l\" data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2815\">Why This Provision Is Beneficial</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2841\">This allows students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2986\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1adgc7p\" data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2891\">Apply early without waiting for final results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgofck\" data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2940\">Participate in the admission process on time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nqm8qc\" data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"2986\">Secure seats before competition increases</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"2991\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1m8zall\" data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3032\">UGC Recognition Requirement Explained</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3147\">The undergraduate degree must be obtained from a university recognized by the University Grants Commission (UGC).</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13c0ynd\" data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3184\">Why UGC Recognition Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3210\">UGC recognition ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3378\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wp36kb\" data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3246\">Academic validity of the degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wn6suh\" data-start=\"3247\" data-end=\"3282\">Acceptance for higher education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgnmsx\" data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3327\">Eligibility for employment opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncpjn\" data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3378\">Compliance with approved educational standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3442\">Students graduating from non-recognized institutions may face:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3526\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwrtt2\" data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3466\">Admission rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10l5zgo\" data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3497\">Verification complications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ngvemv\" data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3526\">Future employment issues</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3531\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lztnlk\" data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3569\">Students from Any Stream Can Apply</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3571\" data-end=\"3734\">One of the major advantages of this MBA program is its multidisciplinary accessibility. Students from different educational backgrounds are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4sxlms\" data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3776\">Eligible Academic Backgrounds Include</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3941\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3785\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuwkdh\" data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3795\">B.Com</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3802\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ub0l3o\" data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"3811\">B.Sc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hnd5hy\" data-start=\"3812\" data-end=\"3827\">B.Tech / BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3835\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8ezea\" data-start=\"3836\" data-end=\"3857\">Commerce Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nj617f\" data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3878\">Science Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xqsf76\" data-start=\"3879\" data-end=\"3902\">Humanities Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y7tcgj\" data-start=\"3903\" data-end=\"3941\">Technology and Engineering Streams</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3943\" data-end=\"4060\">This broad eligibility structure supports diverse learning perspectives and interdisciplinary business understanding.</p>', '<p data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"500\">Understanding the complete MBA fee structure is extremely important before applying for admission. Many students focus only on tuition fees while ignoring additional academic expenses such as registration charges, examination fees, certification costs, technology requirements, and long-term financial planning. This often creates confusion later during the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"833\">The MBA in FinTech and Human Resource Management fee structure is designed to provide flexibility and affordability for Indian students, SAARC nation applicants, and international learners. Students can choose semester-wise, annual, or full program payment plans according to their financial comfort and academic planning strategy.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"868\">This detailed fee guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"1180\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fm7uhq\" data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"904\">Semester-wise MBA fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q9b1vi\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"935\">Annual and total fee plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aflusc\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"969\">Additional university charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14d059j\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"999\">SAARC student fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q37kuk\" data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1033\">Foreign student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l8fuk3\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1083\">Hidden educational costs students should know</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5y1406\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1122\">ROI and career investment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n7n35h\" data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1180\">Strategic financial planning advice before enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1185\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a2ibse\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1267\">MBA in FinTech and Human Resource Management Fee Structure for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1378\">The university offers flexible payment models to help students manage educational expenses more conveniently.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"f8bwvd\" data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1412\">Indian Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1435\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1435\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1425\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1435\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1477\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1466\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1477\">₹22,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1507\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1496\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1507\">₹45,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1525\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1536\">₹90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1541\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rkz2z6\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1583\">Additional Charges for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1663\">Apart from tuition fees, certain university charges are applicable separately.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cws2c8\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1690\">Additional Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1812\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1713\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1812\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1764\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1774\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1812\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1802\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1812\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1817\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19kzlc5\" data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1860\">Fee Structure for SAARC Nation Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1987\">Students from SAARC countries are eligible under a dedicated fee category with separate registration and examination charges.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vz6nli\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2029\">Additional Charges for SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2140\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2062\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2062\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2052\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2062\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2140\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2102\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2092\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2102\">₹2,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2140\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2130\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2140\">₹4,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9weag4\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2187\">MBA Fee Structure for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2327\">The university also offers globally accessible MBA education for international students through a dedicated foreign student fee structure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cgz08i\" data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2362\">Foreign Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2479\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2385\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2385\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2375\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2385\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2479\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2424\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2416\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2424\">$375</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2451\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2443\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2451\">$750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2479\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2469\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2479\">$1,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2484\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g7i4sp\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2527\">Additional Charges for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2643\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2560\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2560\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2550\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2560\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2643\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2608\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2601\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2608\">$30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2643\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2643\">$60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"613\">The MBA in FinTech and Human Resource Management is a modern interdisciplinary management program designed to combine financial technology expertise with advanced human resource management skills. As organizations rapidly adopt digital finance systems, AI-powered financial services, workforce analytics, and technology-driven HR operations, the demand for professionals who understand both financial innovation and strategic people management is increasing significantly.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"684\">This MBA curriculum is carefully structured to help students develop:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oov1v4\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"718\">Strong management foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14woo1v\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"757\">Financial technology understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1poardc\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"802\">Banking and financial services knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qlued4\" data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"840\">Strategic HR management expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17xh8l9\" data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"893\">Leadership and organizational development skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2ufg9\" data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"947\">Business analytics and decision-making capability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1052\">Unlike traditional MBA programs that focus only on a single specialization, this curriculum integrates:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1233\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pu72y9\" data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1077\">Management education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dke6th\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1097\">FinTech systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tifrbd\" data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1113\">HR strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vhigwy\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1148\">Banking and financial services</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c0hfkq\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1174\">Investment management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jub4un\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1208\">Organizational transformation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z7ok25\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1233\">Workforce leadership</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1373\">The semester-wise syllabus gradually develops both managerial and industry-specific expertise, preparing students for leadership roles in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1574\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13jd51u\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1395\">FinTech companies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jeh97v\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1434\">Banking and financial institutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3gxaqu\" data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1463\">Corporate HR departments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gejw6p\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1506\">Investment and wealth management firms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d8d387\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1538\">Digital financial platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ru57mx\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1574\">Technology-driven organizations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1579\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cd1nu2\" data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1652\">1st Semester: Building Management Foundations and Analytical Thinking</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1982\">The first semester focuses on developing strong business management fundamentals, organizational understanding, analytical thinking, and professional leadership skills. Students gain exposure to economics, finance, quantitative analysis, and workforce management concepts that form the base for advanced specialization learning.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2004\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xnypa2\" data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2046\">1. Management Concepts and Practices</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2140\">This subject introduces the core principles of management and organizational administration.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2165\">Key Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2318\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vlf11g\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2198\">Planning and decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19nfjbt\" data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2242\">Leadership and organizational structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19dn5ze\" data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2284\">Coordination and managerial functions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14hjtz4\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2318\">Strategic business operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2349\">Why This Subject Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2516\">Strong managerial understanding is essential because both FinTech and HR leadership roles require effective business decision-making and organizational coordination.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2521\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2oan92\" data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2565\">2. Principles of Economics and Markets</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2682\">Students learn how economic systems and market forces influence business performance and financial decision-making.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2703\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2828\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jh284l\" data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2734\">Demand and supply analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yhupvh\" data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2754\">Economic trends</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dhku7e\" data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2776\">Market structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xcc75m\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2798\">Consumer behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qiiwrn\" data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2828\">Financial market dynamics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2853\">Industry Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"3012\">Professionals working in financial technology and investment management must understand how economic conditions impact financial systems and business growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3017\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s84tsx\" data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3061\">3. Managerial Effectiveness and Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3176\">This subject focuses on leadership effectiveness, ethical business conduct, and professional managerial behavior.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3203\">Major Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3327\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ktbdd\" data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3232\">Leadership communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hhrzrg\" data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3260\">Ethical decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40fzzb\" data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3289\">Corporate responsibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j9g01k\" data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3327\">Professional management practices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3329\" data-end=\"3354\">Strategic Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3492\">Modern organizations increasingly prioritize ethical leadership, especially in financial services and workforce management environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3497\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m1roou\" data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3528\">4. Accounting and Finance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3632\">Students develop foundational understanding of accounting systems and financial management principles.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3634\" data-end=\"3652\">Core Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3764\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ax4ily\" data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3685\">Financial statement analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o7y8am\" data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3719\">Budgeting and cost management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1soa09s\" data-start=\"3720\" data-end=\"3741\">Investment basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1frs40s\" data-start=\"3742\" data-end=\"3764\">Financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3807\">Why Financial Knowledge Is Important</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3936\">FinTech professionals and HR leaders both benefit from understanding organizational finance and business profitability systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3938\" data-end=\"3941\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s3lhnd\" data-start=\"3943\" data-end=\"4004\">5. Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4119\">This subject explains employee behavior, organizational culture, workforce motivation, and HR management systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4121\" data-end=\"4143\">Key Areas Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4264\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uh3hqe\" data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4163\">Team management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16tiufr\" data-start=\"4164\" data-end=\"4187\">Employee engagement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10qfiam\" data-start=\"4188\" data-end=\"4220\">Organizational communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17rd4p2\" data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4240\">HR fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rliq65\" data-start=\"4241\" data-end=\"4264\">Leadership behavior</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4266\" data-end=\"4287\">Career Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4289\" data-end=\"4411\">Understanding workforce psychology and employee management is essential for future HR and organizational leadership roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4413\" data-end=\"4416\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zfjsox\" data-start=\"4418\" data-end=\"4462\">6. Quantitative Techniques and Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4538\">Students develop analytical and quantitative problem-solving capabilities.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4540\" data-end=\"4561\">Skills Developed</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4562\" data-end=\"4668\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p7xbpd\" data-start=\"4562\" data-end=\"4586\">Statistical analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xg9dyt\" data-start=\"4587\" data-end=\"4611\">Business forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uvke42\" data-start=\"4612\" data-end=\"4635\">Data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rdm9dr\" data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4668\">Quantitative decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4670\" data-end=\"4694\">Industry Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4696\" data-end=\"4812\">Analytics-driven decision-making is now critical in both financial technology and human resource management sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4814\" data-end=\"4817\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"j4a3b7\" data-start=\"4819\" data-end=\"4896\">2nd Semester: Core Business Operations, FinTech Systems &amp; Talent Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4898\" data-end=\"5075\">The second semester introduces specialized subjects related to financial technology, banking systems, operations management, marketing, and modern talent acquisition strategies.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"5077\" data-end=\"5097\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"108nxtk\" data-start=\"5099\" data-end=\"5122\">1. Entrepreneurship</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5124\" data-end=\"5221\">Students learn startup development, innovation management, and entrepreneurial business planning.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5223\" data-end=\"5242\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5243\" data-end=\"5351\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rsw4nm\" data-start=\"5243\" data-end=\"5265\">Startup ecosystems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"93bbki\" data-start=\"5266\" data-end=\"5296\">Business model development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y05mxq\" data-start=\"5297\" data-end=\"5320\">Innovation strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lbbq52\" data-start=\"5321\" data-end=\"5351\">Entrepreneurial leadership</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5353\" data-end=\"5382\">Why This Subject Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5384\" data-end=\"5458\">The FinTech industry is heavily driven by startups and digital innovation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5460\" data-end=\"5463\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ht73y7\" data-start=\"5465\" data-end=\"5505\">2. Marketing Management and Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5507\" data-end=\"5590\">This subject focuses on customer behavior analysis and strategic marketing systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5592\" data-end=\"5617\">Major Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5618\" data-end=\"5731\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4a7y8\" data-start=\"5618\" data-end=\"5640\">Consumer analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qvw1la\" data-start=\"5641\" data-end=\"5664\">Branding strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w49wmy\" data-start=\"5665\" data-end=\"5695\">Market research techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11tis6q\" data-start=\"5696\" data-end=\"5731\">Digital marketing understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5733\" data-end=\"5756\">Industry Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5758\" data-end=\"5863\">Both financial technology companies and HR platforms depend on customer engagement and brand positioning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5865\" data-end=\"5868\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rjs9vy\" data-start=\"5870\" data-end=\"5898\">3. Operations Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5900\" data-end=\"5971\">Students learn process optimization and operational efficiency systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5973\" data-end=\"5991\">Core Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5992\" data-end=\"6093\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pawdt\" data-start=\"5992\" data-end=\"6015\">Resource management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vrjus0\" data-start=\"6016\" data-end=\"6044\">Productivity improvement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b0rxv1\" data-start=\"6045\" data-end=\"6069\">Operational planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pfpd33\" data-start=\"6070\" data-end=\"6093\">Supply chain basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6095\" data-end=\"6120\">Strategic Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6122\" data-end=\"6233\">Efficient operational systems are critical for financial institutions and large workforce-driven organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6235\" data-end=\"6238\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1na5xhw\" data-start=\"6240\" data-end=\"6283\">4. FinTech: Foundation and Applications</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6285\" data-end=\"6371\">This subject introduces financial technology systems and digital financial innovation.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6373\" data-end=\"6392\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6393\" data-end=\"6535\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cz39we\" data-start=\"6393\" data-end=\"6420\">Digital payment systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ym8jnp\" data-start=\"6421\" data-end=\"6442\">Blockchain basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w54i81\" data-start=\"6443\" data-end=\"6474\">Online banking technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g2ya7d\" data-start=\"6475\" data-end=\"6502\">FinTech business models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xrryg\" data-start=\"6503\" data-end=\"6535\">Financial automation systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6537\" data-end=\"6577\">Why This Subject Is Highly Valuable</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6579\" data-end=\"6709\">FinTech is one of the fastest-growing sectors globally due to increasing digital transformation in banking and financial services.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6711\" data-end=\"6714\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"axa1xd\" data-start=\"6716\" data-end=\"6764\">5. Banking, Financial Services and Insurance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6766\" data-end=\"6846\">Students gain understanding of banking operations and financial service systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6848\" data-end=\"6862\">Key Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6863\" data-end=\"6963\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zfdw20\" data-start=\"6863\" data-end=\"6885\">Banking operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17r8c68\" data-start=\"6886\" data-end=\"6914\">Financial service models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hojhxg\" data-start=\"6915\" data-end=\"6936\">Insurance systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wc7koh\" data-start=\"6937\" data-end=\"6963\">Risk management basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6965\" data-end=\"6987\">Career Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6989\" data-end=\"7105\">This subject prepares students for careers in banking, insurance, digital finance, and financial consulting sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7107\" data-end=\"7110\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ys9409\" data-start=\"7112\" data-end=\"7152\">6. Talent Acquisition and Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7154\" data-end=\"7230\">This subject focuses on recruitment strategy and workforce planning systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7232\" data-end=\"7251\">Major Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7252\" data-end=\"7344\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ydtwv\" data-start=\"7252\" data-end=\"7276\">Recruitment strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uel13a\" data-start=\"7277\" data-end=\"7298\">Employer branding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18wupb2\" data-start=\"7299\" data-end=\"7321\">Employee retention</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"npi7x9\" data-start=\"7322\" data-end=\"7344\">Talent development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7346\" data-end=\"7380\">Why Talent Management Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"7382\" data-end=\"7502\">Modern organizations compete heavily for skilled professionals, making strategic talent acquisition extremely important.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7504\" data-end=\"7507\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"167n3c4\" data-start=\"7509\" data-end=\"7587\">3rd Semester: Strategic Management, Taxation &amp; Workforce Performance Systems</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7589\" data-end=\"7738\">The third semester develops advanced expertise in organizational strategy, project management, taxation systems, and employee performance management.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"7740\" data-end=\"7760\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6fq62\" data-start=\"7762\" data-end=\"7802\">1. Business Environment and Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7804\" data-end=\"7879\">Students learn strategic business planning and competitive market analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7881\" data-end=\"7900\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7901\" data-end=\"8011\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7xmp3k\" data-start=\"7901\" data-end=\"7923\">Corporate strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p1yj70\" data-start=\"7924\" data-end=\"7949\">Business adaptability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6zzb0g\" data-start=\"7950\" data-end=\"7976\">Market competitiveness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bj36fm\" data-start=\"7977\" data-end=\"8011\">Organizational growth planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8013\" data-end=\"8036\">Industry Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"8038\" data-end=\"8135\">Strategic thinking is essential for leadership positions in financial services and HR management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8137\" data-end=\"8140\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5v1wt8\" data-start=\"8142\" data-end=\"8167\">2. Project Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8169\" data-end=\"8250\">This subject focuses on planning, execution, and management of business projects.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8252\" data-end=\"8273\">Skills Developed</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8274\" data-end=\"8360\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h1sr0d\" data-start=\"8274\" data-end=\"8296\">Project scheduling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zpui1k\" data-start=\"8297\" data-end=\"8316\">Risk management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bj63un\" data-start=\"8317\" data-end=\"8338\">Resource planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7u42xm\" data-start=\"8339\" data-end=\"8360\">Team coordination</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8362\" data-end=\"8391\">Why This Subject Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"8393\" data-end=\"8506\">FinTech implementation projects and HR transformation initiatives require strong project management capabilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8508\" data-end=\"8511\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ktyou3\" data-start=\"8513\" data-end=\"8530\">3. Direct Tax</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8532\" data-end=\"8616\">Students gain understanding of taxation systems and financial compliance structures.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8618\" data-end=\"8641\">Key Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8642\" data-end=\"8749\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1afeu0i\" data-start=\"8642\" data-end=\"8669\">Income tax fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iy203f\" data-start=\"8670\" data-end=\"8692\">Corporate taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v5gdox\" data-start=\"8693\" data-end=\"8716\">Tax planning basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f1hley\" data-start=\"8717\" data-end=\"8749\">Financial compliance systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8751\" data-end=\"8773\">Career Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"8775\" data-end=\"8868\">Taxation knowledge supports careers in financial management, banking, and investment sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8870\" data-end=\"8873\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uav5y2\" data-start=\"8875\" data-end=\"8908\">4. Employee Reward Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8910\" data-end=\"8987\">This subject explains compensation systems and employee incentive structures.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8989\" data-end=\"9009\">Topics Included</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9010\" data-end=\"9128\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sss438\" data-start=\"9010\" data-end=\"9039\">Salary structure planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yd136p\" data-start=\"9040\" data-end=\"9067\">Compensation strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lujmvs\" data-start=\"9068\" data-end=\"9097\">Employee benefits systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q0noa2\" data-start=\"9098\" data-end=\"9128\">Reward management policies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9130\" data-end=\"9155\">Strategic Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"9157\" data-end=\"9246\">Reward systems strongly influence employee motivation and organizational retention rates.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9248\" data-end=\"9251\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"m189me\" data-start=\"9253\" data-end=\"9282\">5. Performance Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9284\" data-end=\"9361\">Students learn how organizations evaluate and improve workforce productivity.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9363\" data-end=\"9381\">Core Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9382\" data-end=\"9488\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kj7pbd\" data-start=\"9382\" data-end=\"9401\">KPI development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14icl8q\" data-start=\"9402\" data-end=\"9433\">Employee evaluation systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rx0bts\" data-start=\"9434\" data-end=\"9462\">Productivity enhancement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gegazq\" data-start=\"9463\" data-end=\"9488\">Performance analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9490\" data-end=\"9509\">Industry Value</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"9511\" data-end=\"9595\">Performance-driven work cultures are increasingly important in modern organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9597\" data-end=\"9600\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14u2hjq\" data-start=\"9602\" data-end=\"9629\">6. Open Elective Course</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9631\" data-end=\"9729\">Students can select interdisciplinary subjects based on career interests and specialization goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9731\" data-end=\"9734\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1h9bp7a\" data-start=\"9736\" data-end=\"9823\">4th Semester: Strategic Leadership, Wealth Management &amp; Organizational Transformation</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9825\" data-end=\"9975\">The final semester focuses on advanced leadership development, investment management, behavioral finance, and organizational transformation expertise.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"9977\" data-end=\"9997\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"197v0ev\" data-start=\"9999\" data-end=\"10041\">1. Strategic Human Resource Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10043\" data-end=\"10119\">This subject connects workforce strategy with long-term business objectives.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10121\" data-end=\"10146\">Major Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10147\" data-end=\"10275\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sczu9t\" data-start=\"10147\" data-end=\"10179\">Strategic workforce planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16e6hae\" data-start=\"10180\" data-end=\"10205\">HR-business alignment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19qadci\" data-start=\"10206\" data-end=\"10240\">Organizational competitiveness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ba7sgk\" data-start=\"10241\" data-end=\"10275\">Leadership development systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10277\" data-end=\"10280\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e3nhvw\" data-start=\"10282\" data-end=\"10335\">2. Organization Development and Change Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10337\" data-end=\"10428\">Students learn how organizations manage structural transformation and workforce adaptation.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10430\" data-end=\"10449\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10450\" data-end=\"10568\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i8e8o1\" data-start=\"10450\" data-end=\"10487\">Organizational culture management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ngl7b\" data-start=\"10488\" data-end=\"10509\">Change leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"twveq0\" data-start=\"10510\" data-end=\"10535\">Employee adaptability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mt17bt\" data-start=\"10536\" data-end=\"10568\">Organizational restructuring</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10570\" data-end=\"10604\">Why This Subject Is Important</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"10606\" data-end=\"10683\">Modern businesses constantly evolve due to technology and market disruptions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10685\" data-end=\"10688\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s60bvu\" data-start=\"10690\" data-end=\"10741\">3. Investment Analysis and Portfolio Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10743\" data-end=\"10831\">Students gain understanding of investment evaluation and financial portfolio strategies.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10833\" data-end=\"10847\">Key Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10848\" data-end=\"10956\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ehmny3\" data-start=\"10848\" data-end=\"10871\">Investment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp9c62\" data-start=\"10872\" data-end=\"10898\">Risk-return evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s07aph\" data-start=\"10899\" data-end=\"10928\">Portfolio diversification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sfcl9e\" data-start=\"10929\" data-end=\"10956\">Asset management basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10958\" data-end=\"10979\">Career Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"10981\" data-end=\"11080\">Investment management skills are highly valuable in financial services and wealth advisory sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11082\" data-end=\"11085\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w8bmem\" data-start=\"11087\" data-end=\"11134\">4. Wealth Management and Behavioral Finance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"11136\" data-end=\"11227\">This subject combines financial planning with psychological aspects of investment behavior.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"11229\" data-end=\"11249\">Topics Included</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11250\" data-end=\"11357\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12y4oae\" data-start=\"11250\" data-end=\"11269\">Wealth planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mcvu11\" data-start=\"11270\" data-end=\"11293\">Investor psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18x1gyn\" data-start=\"11294\" data-end=\"11325\">Financial behavior analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d1thyj\" data-start=\"11326\" data-end=\"11357\">Personal finance management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"11359\" data-end=\"11379\">Industry Demand</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"11381\" data-end=\"11487\">Behavioral finance is becoming increasingly important in modern financial advisory and investment sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11489\" data-end=\"11492\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5wa2ot\" data-start=\"11494\" data-end=\"11533\">5. Cross-Functional Elective Course</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"11535\" data-end=\"11609\">Students gain interdisciplinary exposure beyond their core specialization.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11611\" data-end=\"11614\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ipu0o8\" data-start=\"11616\" data-end=\"11646\">6. Master Thesis / Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"11648\" data-end=\"11758\">The final research project allows students to apply theoretical concepts to solve practical industry problems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"11760\" data-end=\"11794\">Benefits of the Final Project</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11795\" data-end=\"11904\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvphi9\" data-start=\"11795\" data-end=\"11816\">Industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tsf6ea\" data-start=\"11817\" data-end=\"11841\">Research development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cf2rpg\" data-start=\"11842\" data-end=\"11864\">Portfolio building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17728ru\" data-start=\"11865\" data-end=\"11904\">Practical problem-solving expertise</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 90000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(319, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 231, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 06:05:00', '2026-06-16 07:20:29', '<p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"638\">Enrolling in an MBA in Information Technology Management program is an important step for students and working professionals who want to build careers in digital transformation, enterprise technology systems, IT project management, business analytics, cybersecurity, and technology leadership. However, many applicants face confusion during the admission process because they do not fully understand how online enrollment works, what documents are required, or how fee payment and verification procedures are completed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"993\">The online enrollment process is designed to provide a smooth, flexible, and fully digital admission experience for learners across India and international students. Since the entire process is conducted online, students can complete registration, application submission, document upload, and fee payment remotely without physically visiting the campus.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1035\">This detailed enrollment guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ecqs6\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1083\">Complete MBA admission process step-by-step</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zry049\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1134\">Online registration and application procedures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vfbyfx\" data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1179\">Document upload and verification process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"no8wn6\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1219\">Fee payment methods and EMI options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u8bp4o\" data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1272\">Common enrollment mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9lpjr\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1313\">Hidden risks during online admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d3h02k\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1362\">Strategic admission tips for faster approval</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1367\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10agwut\" data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1418\">Understanding the MBA Online Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1573\">The MBA in Information Technology Management admission system is fully online and designed for modern learners who require flexibility and accessibility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1617\">The enrollment process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1780\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r633i1\" data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1634\">Registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1af4njd\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1663\">Student account creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t46q9s\" data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1695\">Application form completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yylsws\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1717\">Program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f12ekk\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1737\">Document upload</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csrces\" data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1753\">Fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o227h4\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1780\">Admission verification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1834\">This digital structure is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1980\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1860\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19hdfr0\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1880\">Remote learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gimp1\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1915\">Students from different states</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tvf4t\" data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1944\">International applicants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wsn4ls\" data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1980\">Career-transition professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"1985\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1puox4j\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2036\">Step 1: Visit the Vignan Online Enrollment Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2129\">The first step in the admission process is accessing the official online enrollment portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2148\">Students need to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2323\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a035jh\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2200\">Visit the official Vignan Online admission page</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzyxpe\" data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2252\">Click on the &ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo; or &ldquo;Enroll Now&rdquo; option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6r5ko\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2288\">Open the online enrollment form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aaic30\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2323\">Begin the registration process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2328\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o39v0r\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2359\">Why This Step Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2463\">Many students unknowingly use unofficial websites or unauthorized admission portals, which may create:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2583\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ddals\" data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2501\">Incorrect application submissions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4ruiu\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2525\">Payment fraud risks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v2cthx\" data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2551\">Data privacy concerns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlj2y4\" data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2583\">Admission processing delays</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2729\">Students should always verify that they are using the official university enrollment platform before entering personal or financial information.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2734\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kg91z5\" data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2796\">Information Students Should Keep Ready Before Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2925\">Preparing all required information in advance helps students complete the admission process smoothly and without interruptions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c5fod6\" data-start=\"2927\" data-end=\"2956\">Basic Information Required</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"3152\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mi9lua\" data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2995\">Full name as per academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mizif\" data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3020\">Active mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pp80n3\" data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3039\">Valid email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"3040\" data-end=\"3057\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3077\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dnebzw\" data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3104\">Graduation information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3123\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3152\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3157\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"psychq\" data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3185\">Expert Admission Advice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3187\" data-end=\"3214\">Students should always use:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3279\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19w6v56\" data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3237\">An active email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0qt9v\" data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3279\">A frequently accessible mobile number</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3318\">because important updates related to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3453\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3345\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17351q3\" data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3370\">Fee payment receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sars2p\" data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3396\">LMS login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jmdcbh\" data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3426\">Examination notifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jxjo99\" data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3453\">Academic communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3491\">will be sent through these channels.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3493\" data-end=\"3496\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"c5gpum\" data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3551\">Step 2: Sign Up and Complete the Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3553\" data-end=\"3665\">After accessing the portal, students must create their online account and complete the admission form carefully.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3667\" data-end=\"3670\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iqj42j\" data-start=\"3672\" data-end=\"3701\">Create Your Student Account</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3747\">The registration process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3852\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e15fdm\" data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3777\">Entering personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jr0s2\" data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3808\">Creating login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zkzjzu\" data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3829\">OTP verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ujxzul\" data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3852\">Account activation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3949\">Once registration is completed successfully, students can proceed to the full application form.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3951\" data-end=\"3954\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rmyoml\" data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"3997\">Complete the Essential Enrollment Steps</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4082\">The application form includes multiple sections that students must fill accurately.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4084\" data-end=\"4087\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cb15o8\" data-start=\"4089\" data-end=\"4120\">Personal Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4147\">Students need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4245\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2yru7\" data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4156\">Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"4157\" data-end=\"4176\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19381gy\" data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4200\">Address information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4218\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vd6fls\" data-start=\"4219\" data-end=\"4245\">Identification details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4247\" data-end=\"4250\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ta2jvp\" data-start=\"4252\" data-end=\"4283\">Academic Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4285\" data-end=\"4307\">Applicants must enter:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4308\" data-end=\"4435\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"4308\" data-end=\"4330\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fde55\" data-start=\"4331\" data-end=\"4363\">Aggregate percentage or CGPA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdp0ww\" data-start=\"4364\" data-end=\"4390\">University information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lx9va\" data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4407\">Passing year</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0cc02\" data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4435\">Academic specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4437\" data-end=\"4532\">Students appearing in the final semester may also need to provide provisional academic records.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4534\" data-end=\"4537\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n3xcpd\" data-start=\"4539\" data-end=\"4559\">Program Selection</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4561\" data-end=\"4670\">Students must carefully select the MBA in Information Technology Management specialization during enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1zi2k\" data-start=\"4672\" data-end=\"4705\">Why Program Selection Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4707\" data-end=\"4752\">The selected specialization directly affects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4753\" data-end=\"4865\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj5fkl\" data-start=\"4753\" data-end=\"4777\">Career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdy81l\" data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4809\">Technical skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvphi9\" data-start=\"4810\" data-end=\"4831\">Industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ot5agr\" data-start=\"4832\" data-end=\"4865\">Long-term professional growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4867\" data-end=\"4923\">This specialization is ideal for students interested in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4924\" data-end=\"5076\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jnw8il\" data-start=\"4924\" data-end=\"4949\">Technology management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u3zqq3\" data-start=\"4950\" data-end=\"4972\">Enterprise systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12osxeh\" data-start=\"4973\" data-end=\"4998\">IT project leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nbyed4\" data-start=\"4999\" data-end=\"5021\">Business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"89izer\" data-start=\"5022\" data-end=\"5048\">Digital transformation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1092jne\" data-start=\"5049\" data-end=\"5076\">Cybersecurity awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5078\" data-end=\"5081\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83j5nm\" data-start=\"5083\" data-end=\"5109\">Document Upload Process</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5111\" data-end=\"5153\">Students are generally required to upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5154\" data-end=\"5276\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134nxcp\" data-start=\"5154\" data-end=\"5180\">Graduation mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v45ing\" data-start=\"5181\" data-end=\"5228\">Degree certificate or provisional documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"5229\" data-end=\"5247\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"5248\" data-end=\"5276\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5278\" data-end=\"5281\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"d7hyu3\" data-start=\"5283\" data-end=\"5317\">Common Document Upload Mistakes</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5319\" data-end=\"5373\">Many applications are delayed because students upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5374\" data-end=\"5480\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43co8u\" data-start=\"5374\" data-end=\"5391\">Blurred scans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sx5g9z\" data-start=\"5392\" data-end=\"5418\">Incorrect file formats</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ib334\" data-start=\"5419\" data-end=\"5446\">Incomplete certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v0us2\" data-start=\"5447\" data-end=\"5480\">Unreadable academic documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5482\" data-end=\"5570\">Properly scanned and clearly visible documents improve verification speed significantly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5572\" data-end=\"5575\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vxyo72\" data-start=\"5577\" data-end=\"5606\">Step 3: Pay the Program Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5702\">After completing the enrollment form, students must pay the required fee to confirm admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5704\" data-end=\"5751\">The payment process is fully online and secure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5753\" data-end=\"5756\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pp6z2h\" data-start=\"5758\" data-end=\"5785\">Available Payment Methods</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5787\" data-end=\"5817\">Students can pay fees through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5818\" data-end=\"5902\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"5818\" data-end=\"5833\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"5834\" data-end=\"5848\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"5849\" data-end=\"5864\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sezyli\" data-start=\"5865\" data-end=\"5902\">Easy EMI Options with 0% Interest</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5904\" data-end=\"5907\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cprctf\" data-start=\"5909\" data-end=\"5947\">Understanding the EMI Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5949\" data-end=\"5995\">The EMI facility is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5996\" data-end=\"6126\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"5996\" data-end=\"6021\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ri80sk\" data-start=\"6022\" data-end=\"6065\">Students managing financial limitations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khgvkf\" data-start=\"6066\" data-end=\"6126\">Learners preferring installment-based payment structures</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17bfro3\" data-start=\"6128\" data-end=\"6154\">Benefits of EMI Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6156\" data-end=\"6269\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juc81q\" data-start=\"6156\" data-end=\"6194\">Reduced immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lvcttt\" data-start=\"6195\" data-end=\"6223\">Easier monthly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzih0q\" data-start=\"6224\" data-end=\"6269\">Better affordability for higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6271\" data-end=\"6274\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u202ba\" data-start=\"6276\" data-end=\"6325\">Important Financial Advice Before Choosing EMI</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6327\" data-end=\"6362\">Students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6363\" data-end=\"6489\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pfemi8\" data-start=\"6363\" data-end=\"6395\">Monthly repayment capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h8ds60\" data-start=\"6396\" data-end=\"6431\">Long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11tkeut\" data-start=\"6432\" data-end=\"6467\">Additional educational expenses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ltcrne\" data-start=\"6468\" data-end=\"6489\">Payment timelines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6491\" data-end=\"6580\">Even with 0% interest EMI options, proper financial planning remains extremely important.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"528\">Understanding the eligibility criteria is one of the most important parts of the MBA admission process. Many students focus mainly on placements, specialization choices, salary packages, and career opportunities while overlooking detailed admission requirements. This often leads to confusion during document verification, counseling, or final admission approval.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"1009\">The MBA in Information Technology Management is a specialized management program that combines business administration, enterprise technology systems, IT project management, business analytics, cybersecurity awareness, and digital transformation leadership. Since the program involves both managerial and technology-oriented learning, universities establish specific academic eligibility standards to ensure students are prepared for advanced management and IT-focused education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1052\">This detailed eligibility guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1375\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rouitd\" data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1099\">Minimum educational qualification required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hcz6sx\" data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1140\">Aggregate marks eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixkcr6\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1173\">UGC recognition requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqw3f6\" data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1200\">SC/ST relaxation rules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wwtqi6\" data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1239\">Final semester student eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bv7gi9\" data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1273\">Accepted academic backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vv1835\" data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1327\">Common eligibility mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rvf1u0\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1375\">Strategic admission insights for applicants</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1380\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ndqt0s\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1414\">Basic MBA Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1549\">Students seeking admission to the MBA in Information Technology Management program must fulfill the required academic qualifications.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z5vvlm\" data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1588\">Required Educational Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1748\">Applicants must have completed an <strong data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1669\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) Degree Program</strong> of a minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1710\">three years</strong> from a <strong data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1747\">UGC Recognized University</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1878\">The bachelor&rsquo;s degree can belong to <strong data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1814\">any stream or discipline</strong>, allowing students from multiple academic backgrounds to apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1883\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ux6rxl\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1912\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"2010\">Students must secure the required minimum aggregate marks in their undergraduate degree program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ycqnta\" data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2049\">Category-Wise Eligibility Criteria</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2186\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2092\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2092\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2062\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2092\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Aggregate Required</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2186\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2122\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2145\">50% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2186\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2163\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SC/ST Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2186\">45% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2303\">A relaxation of 5% marks is provided to candidates belonging to SC/ST categories according to admission guidelines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2308\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xmefjw\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2353\">Final Semester Students Are Also Eligible</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2484\">Candidates currently appearing in the final semester of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree program are also eligible to apply for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fvye\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2533\">Important Guidelines for Final Year Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2573\">Students in the final semester should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2752\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edkzqf\" data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2630\">Submit available academic records during application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bzt13z\" data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2679\">Provide provisional certificates if required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12y4ecr\" data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2752\">Complete all degree requirements before final admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qspa7l\" data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2790\">Why This Provision Is Beneficial</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2816\">This allows students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2961\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1adgc7p\" data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2866\">Apply early without waiting for final results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgofck\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2915\">Participate in the admission process on time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nqm8qc\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2961\">Secure seats before competition increases</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"2966\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1m8zall\" data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3007\">UGC Recognition Requirement Explained</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3129\">The undergraduate qualification must be obtained from a university recognized by the University Grants Commission (UGC).</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13c0ynd\" data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3166\">Why UGC Recognition Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3192\">UGC recognition ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3360\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wp36kb\" data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3228\">Academic validity of the degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wn6suh\" data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3264\">Acceptance for higher education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgnmsx\" data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3309\">Eligibility for employment opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncpjn\" data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3360\">Compliance with approved educational standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3362\" data-end=\"3424\">Students graduating from non-recognized institutions may face:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3515\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwrtt2\" data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3448\">Admission rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mug8e3\" data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3472\">Verification issues</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"198i0wq\" data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3515\">Employment complications in the future</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3520\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lztnlk\" data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3558\">Students from Any Stream Can Apply</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3753\">One of the biggest advantages of the MBA in Information Technology Management is its multidisciplinary accessibility. Students from different educational backgrounds are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4sxlms\" data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3795\">Eligible Academic Backgrounds Include</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3986\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3804\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuwkdh\" data-start=\"3805\" data-end=\"3814\">B.Com</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"3815\" data-end=\"3822\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ub0l3o\" data-start=\"3823\" data-end=\"3831\">B.Sc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3838\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hnd5hy\" data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3854\">B.Tech / BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8ezea\" data-start=\"3855\" data-end=\"3876\">Commerce Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nj617f\" data-start=\"3877\" data-end=\"3897\">Science Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xqsf76\" data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3921\">Humanities Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kb4bqe\" data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"3947\">Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g28h77\" data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"3986\">Engineering and Technology Streams</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"4105\">This broad eligibility structure supports diverse learning perspectives and interdisciplinary business understanding.</p>', '<p data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"509\">Understanding the complete MBA fee structure is extremely important before applying for admission because many students focus only on tuition fees while ignoring additional academic expenses such as registration charges, examination fees, certification costs, technology requirements, and long-term educational budgeting. This often creates financial confusion later during the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"856\">The MBA in Information Technology Management fee structure is designed to provide affordability and flexibility for Indian students, SAARC nation applicants, and international learners. Students can choose semester-wise, annual, or full program payment plans according to their financial comfort, educational planning strategy, and career goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"901\">This detailed fee structure guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"1214\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n4jt2h\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"935\">Semester-wise MBA fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ffjya\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"970\">Annual and total payment plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aflusc\" data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1004\">Additional university charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ykevk\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1036\">SAARC student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q37kuk\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1070\">Foreign student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5vii0\" data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1123\">Hidden educational expenses students should know</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5y1406\" data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1162\">ROI and career investment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17yku4c\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1214\">Financial planning strategies before enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rlnxpd\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1297\">MBA in Information Technology Management Fee Structure for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1446\">The university provides flexible fee payment options so students can manage educational expenses conveniently without excessive financial pressure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"f8bwvd\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1480\">Indian Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1503\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1503\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1493\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1503\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1545\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1534\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1545\">₹22,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1575\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1564\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1575\">₹45,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1593\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1604\">₹90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1609\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rkz2z6\" data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1651\">Additional Charges for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1739\">Apart from tuition fees, certain university-related charges are applicable separately.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cws2c8\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1766\">Additional Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1799\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1799\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1789\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1799\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1850\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1840\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1850\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1878\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1888\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1893\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19kzlc5\" data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1936\">Fee Structure for SAARC Nation Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2063\">Students from SAARC countries are eligible under a dedicated fee category with separate registration and examination charges.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vz6nli\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2105\">Additional Charges for SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2216\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2138\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2138\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2128\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2138\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2216\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2178\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2168\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2178\">₹2,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2216\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2206\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2216\">₹4,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2221\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1y4he0a\" data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2277\">MBA IT Management Fee Structure for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2402\">The university also offers internationally accessible MBA education through a dedicated fee structure for foreign students.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cgz08i\" data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2437\">Foreign Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2554\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2460\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2460\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2450\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2460\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2554\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2491\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2499\">$375</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2526\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2518\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2526\">$750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2554\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2544\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2554\">$1,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2559\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g7i4sp\" data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2602\">Additional Charges for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2718\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2635\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2635\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2625\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2635\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2718\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2683\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2676\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2683\">$30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2718\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2718\">$60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"615\">The MBA in Information Technology Management is a modern industry-oriented management program designed for students who want to combine business leadership with advanced technology management expertise. As businesses rapidly adopt digital transformation, cloud systems, enterprise software, cybersecurity frameworks, business analytics, and data-driven operations, organizations increasingly require professionals who can manage both technology systems and business strategies effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"734\">Unlike traditional MBA programs that focus mainly on business administration, this specialized curriculum integrates:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmq896\" data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"764\">Core management education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sl84xg\" data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"799\">Information technology systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rpd3ju\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"836\">Software and database management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tudbm2\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"869\">Enterprise resource planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1234jsj\" data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"895\">IT project management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d86cqf\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"921\">Technology leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d7keew\" data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"971\">Business analytics and digital transformation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1037\">The semester-wise curriculum is structured to gradually develop:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"38sgzn\" data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1064\">Management foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wfei1i\" data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1108\">Financial and operational understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5wq3ik\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1144\">Technology management expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4outqk\" data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1194\">Strategic business decision-making capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11tnia5\" data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1235\">IT governance and security awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1296\">This program prepares students for leadership roles across:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nqshn8\" data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1313\">IT companies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12aarld\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1345\">Technology consulting firms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dv0cun\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1372\">Software organizations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181lwl5\" data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1409\">Digital transformation divisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wf2dnw\" data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1447\">Enterprise technology departments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpcbsr\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1491\">Business analytics and operations teams</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1531\">This detailed syllabus guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1758\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dy0fry\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1578\">Semester-wise MBA IT Management curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d1r8eq\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1625\">Subject explanations and learning outcomes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12sx8lq\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1664\">Industry-relevant skills developed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w3z4mh\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1706\">Career opportunities after graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y4fnpb\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1758\">Future industry demand and specialization value</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1763\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cd1nu2\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1836\">1st Semester: Building Management Foundations and Analytical Thinking</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"2117\">The first semester focuses on developing strong business management fundamentals, leadership capability, analytical reasoning, and organizational understanding. Students gain the foundational knowledge required for advanced IT and business management learning in later semesters.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2139\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xnypa2\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2181\">1. Management Concepts and Practices</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2275\">This subject introduces the core principles of management and organizational administration.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2300\">Key Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2463\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vlf11g\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2333\">Planning and decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im6e7f\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2362\">Organizational structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mmyupg\" data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2388\">Leadership principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qjrvc\" data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2428\">Business coordination and execution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ifhlnq\" data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2463\">Strategic managerial functions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2494\">Why This Subject Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2644\">Technology managers must understand how businesses operate because IT systems are designed to support organizational goals and business performance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2649\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2oan92\" data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2693\">2. Principles of Economics and Markets</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2805\">Students learn how economic systems and market dynamics influence organizational growth and business strategy.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2826\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2953\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jh284l\" data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2857\">Demand and supply analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dhku7e\" data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2879\">Market structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e6pbr0\" data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2904\">Economic forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xcc75m\" data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2926\">Consumer behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ztnq9c\" data-start=\"2927\" data-end=\"2953\">Business market trends</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2978\">Industry Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3103\">Technology investments and digital transformation projects are heavily influenced by market conditions and economic trends.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3108\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s84tsx\" data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3152\">3. Managerial Effectiveness and Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3240\">This subject focuses on professional leadership skills and ethical business practices.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3261\">Major Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3384\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ktbdd\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3290\">Leadership communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hhrzrg\" data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3318\">Ethical decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40fzzb\" data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3347\">Corporate responsibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rjm5w8\" data-start=\"3348\" data-end=\"3384\">Professional managerial behavior</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3411\">Strategic Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3413\" data-end=\"3555\">Technology leaders frequently handle sensitive business information and organizational systems, making ethical management extremely important.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3560\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m1roou\" data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3591\">4. Accounting and Finance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3593\" data-end=\"3684\">Students develop understanding of financial systems and organizational budgeting processes.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3702\">Core Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3812\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ax4ily\" data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3735\">Financial statement analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u7x2vc\" data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3760\">Budgeting principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oyorzk\" data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"3780\">Cost management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xqmeuy\" data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3812\">Business financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3855\">Why Financial Knowledge Is Important</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3904\">IT managers often participate in budgeting for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"4032\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1irlo9h\" data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3932\">Software implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xocl1q\" data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"3962\">Infrastructure investment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1in4151\" data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"3998\">Digital transformation projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wcapjh\" data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4032\">Enterprise technology systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4034\" data-end=\"4037\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s3lhnd\" data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4100\">5. Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4198\">This subject explains workforce behavior, organizational culture, and people management systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4222\">Key Areas Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4223\" data-end=\"4343\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h0vue6\" data-start=\"4223\" data-end=\"4246\">Employee motivation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uh3hqe\" data-start=\"4247\" data-end=\"4266\">Team management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10qfiam\" data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4299\">Organizational communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17rd4p2\" data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4319\">HR fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5li53\" data-start=\"4320\" data-end=\"4343\">Leadership dynamics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4366\">Career Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4368\" data-end=\"4467\">Technology project success depends heavily on effective team coordination and workforce management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4472\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zfjsox\" data-start=\"4474\" data-end=\"4518\">6. Quantitative Techniques and Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4593\">Students develop analytical and statistical problem-solving capabilities.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4595\" data-end=\"4616\">Skills Developed</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4617\" data-end=\"4748\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uvke42\" data-start=\"4617\" data-end=\"4640\">Data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xg9dyt\" data-start=\"4641\" data-end=\"4665\">Business forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6l15g7\" data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4691\">Quantitative analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jfnzrr\" data-start=\"4692\" data-end=\"4717\">Statistical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s64wgq\" data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4748\">Analytical decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"4774\">Industry Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4776\" data-end=\"4874\">Modern IT management increasingly depends on data-driven business decisions and analytics systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4876\" data-end=\"4879\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1bk2eso\" data-start=\"4881\" data-end=\"4956\">2nd Semester: Core Business Operations and Technology-Oriented Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4958\" data-end=\"5091\">The second semester develops stronger business operational understanding while introducing analytics and corporate financial systems.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"5093\" data-end=\"5113\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rfp0b2\" data-start=\"5115\" data-end=\"5142\">1. Marketing Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5144\" data-end=\"5218\">Students learn customer behavior analysis and strategic marketing systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5220\" data-end=\"5239\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5240\" data-end=\"5347\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qvw1la\" data-start=\"5240\" data-end=\"5263\">Branding strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4a7y8\" data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5286\">Consumer analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3s06q\" data-start=\"5287\" data-end=\"5310\">Market segmentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc2pqz\" data-start=\"5311\" data-end=\"5347\">Customer relationship management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5349\" data-end=\"5378\">Why This Subject Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5380\" data-end=\"5490\">Technology products and digital services require strong market positioning and customer engagement strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5492\" data-end=\"5495\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pu39jd\" data-start=\"5497\" data-end=\"5541\">2. Financial Markets &amp; Corporate Finance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5543\" data-end=\"5637\">This subject focuses on corporate financial systems and investment-related business decisions.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5639\" data-end=\"5664\">Major Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5665\" data-end=\"5774\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2z0bcm\" data-start=\"5665\" data-end=\"5686\">Financial markets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k8zpo7\" data-start=\"5687\" data-end=\"5722\">Corporate investment strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y9pp2w\" data-start=\"5723\" data-end=\"5751\">Risk and return analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ak0sbd\" data-start=\"5752\" data-end=\"5774\">Capital management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5776\" data-end=\"5800\">Strategic Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5802\" data-end=\"5927\">Technology organizations require strong financial planning for innovation, expansion, and digital infrastructure investments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5929\" data-end=\"5932\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15kqfkt\" data-start=\"5934\" data-end=\"5966\">3. Human Resource Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5968\" data-end=\"6055\">Students gain understanding of workforce planning and organizational talent management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6057\" data-end=\"6077\">Topics Included</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6078\" data-end=\"6191\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rnalqa\" data-start=\"6078\" data-end=\"6101\">Recruitment systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jtgmux\" data-start=\"6102\" data-end=\"6126\">Employee development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a19rpf\" data-start=\"6127\" data-end=\"6153\">Performance management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1031u5b\" data-start=\"6154\" data-end=\"6191\">Organizational workforce planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6193\" data-end=\"6217\">Industry Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6219\" data-end=\"6303\">IT companies heavily depend on talent acquisition and employee retention strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6305\" data-end=\"6308\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"190tt5\" data-start=\"6310\" data-end=\"6338\">4. Operations Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6340\" data-end=\"6420\">This subject teaches process optimization and operational efficiency management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6422\" data-end=\"6439\">Key Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6440\" data-end=\"6547\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vrjus0\" data-start=\"6440\" data-end=\"6468\">Productivity improvement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bj63un\" data-start=\"6469\" data-end=\"6490\">Resource planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7scfsy\" data-start=\"6491\" data-end=\"6515\">Process optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u1vsei\" data-start=\"6516\" data-end=\"6547\">Operational decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6549\" data-end=\"6571\">Career Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6573\" data-end=\"6661\">Technology operations and digital service delivery require efficient management systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6663\" data-end=\"6666\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lohm1a\" data-start=\"6668\" data-end=\"6700\">5. Business Research Methods</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6702\" data-end=\"6780\">Students learn structured business research and data collection methodologies.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6782\" data-end=\"6803\">Skills Developed</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6804\" data-end=\"6914\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1skil7n\" data-start=\"6804\" data-end=\"6823\">Research design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ek4rpd\" data-start=\"6824\" data-end=\"6854\">Data collection techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q5png7\" data-start=\"6855\" data-end=\"6884\">Business problem analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x7351m\" data-start=\"6885\" data-end=\"6914\">Analytical interpretation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6916\" data-end=\"6949\">Why This Subject Is Valuable</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6951\" data-end=\"7047\">Research capability supports strategic business analysis and technology implementation planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7049\" data-end=\"7052\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"de5y4u\" data-start=\"7054\" data-end=\"7079\">6. Business Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7081\" data-end=\"7149\">This subject introduces data analytics for business decision-making.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7151\" data-end=\"7169\">Core Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7170\" data-end=\"7278\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rj78q2\" data-start=\"7170\" data-end=\"7187\">Data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z7bl6k\" data-start=\"7188\" data-end=\"7220\">Predictive business insights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uspotu\" data-start=\"7221\" data-end=\"7253\">Business intelligence basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dg0t0s\" data-start=\"7254\" data-end=\"7278\">Data-driven strategy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7280\" data-end=\"7307\">Future Industry Demand</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"7309\" data-end=\"7417\">Business analytics is becoming a critical component of technology management and enterprise decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7419\" data-end=\"7422\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1x23x7r\" data-start=\"7424\" data-end=\"7490\">3rd Semester: Enterprise Systems, Software &amp; Database Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7492\" data-end=\"7622\">The third semester introduces specialized IT management subjects focused on enterprise technology systems and software operations.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"7624\" data-end=\"7644\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6fq62\" data-start=\"7646\" data-end=\"7686\">1. Business Environment and Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7688\" data-end=\"7763\">Students learn strategic business planning and competitive market analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7765\" data-end=\"7784\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7785\" data-end=\"7894\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmk0lw\" data-start=\"7785\" data-end=\"7809\">Competitive strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wrxrb0\" data-start=\"7810\" data-end=\"7841\">Organizational adaptability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vpzedz\" data-start=\"7842\" data-end=\"7871\">Strategic business growth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xt9rp\" data-start=\"7872\" data-end=\"7894\">Market positioning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7896\" data-end=\"7916\">Strategic Value</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"7918\" data-end=\"7989\">Technology leaders must align IT systems with long-term business goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7991\" data-end=\"7994\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yyq6l4\" data-start=\"7996\" data-end=\"8031\">2. Enterprise Resource Planning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8033\" data-end=\"8098\">This subject focuses on integrated enterprise management systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8100\" data-end=\"8125\">Major Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8126\" data-end=\"8244\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fsajne\" data-start=\"8126\" data-end=\"8146\">ERP architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6yti57\" data-start=\"8147\" data-end=\"8179\">Business process integration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ti59s4\" data-start=\"8180\" data-end=\"8211\">Enterprise software systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17abo3k\" data-start=\"8212\" data-end=\"8244\">Resource planning automation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8246\" data-end=\"8270\">Industry Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"8272\" data-end=\"8328\">ERP systems are widely used across industries to manage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8329\" data-end=\"8403\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173ueww\" data-start=\"8329\" data-end=\"8340\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3shte\" data-start=\"8341\" data-end=\"8347\">HR</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t66846\" data-start=\"8348\" data-end=\"8364\">Supply chain</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nyjb7y\" data-start=\"8365\" data-end=\"8379\">Operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yzb0f3\" data-start=\"8380\" data-end=\"8403\">Customer management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8405\" data-end=\"8408\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x9arql\" data-start=\"8410\" data-end=\"8437\">3. Software Engineering</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8439\" data-end=\"8530\">Students gain understanding of software development processes and system design principles.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8532\" data-end=\"8551\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8552\" data-end=\"8664\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"125ofaa\" data-start=\"8552\" data-end=\"8586\">Software development lifecycle</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tlcd8f\" data-start=\"8587\" data-end=\"8606\">System analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vdxqfc\" data-start=\"8607\" data-end=\"8634\">Testing and maintenance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tb2o33\" data-start=\"8635\" data-end=\"8664\">Software project planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8666\" data-end=\"8687\">Career Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"8689\" data-end=\"8777\">IT managers frequently coordinate software teams and technology implementation projects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8779\" data-end=\"8782\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ovasun\" data-start=\"8784\" data-end=\"8817\">4. Database Management System</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8819\" data-end=\"8893\">This subject explains database systems and organizational data management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8895\" data-end=\"8912\">Key Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8913\" data-end=\"9018\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15oflk\" data-start=\"8913\" data-end=\"8938\">Database architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q6xo36\" data-start=\"8939\" data-end=\"8959\">SQL fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x2dlbr\" data-start=\"8960\" data-end=\"8984\">Data storage systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kfb4lq\" data-start=\"8985\" data-end=\"9018\">Information retrieval methods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9020\" data-end=\"9046\">Why DBMS Is Important</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"9048\" data-end=\"9140\">Modern businesses rely heavily on secure and organized data systems for operational success.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9142\" data-end=\"9145\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ks9g08\" data-start=\"9147\" data-end=\"9179\">5. Research-Based Learning-I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9181\" data-end=\"9263\">Students begin research-oriented academic and industry problem-solving activities.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9265\" data-end=\"9278\">Benefits</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9279\" data-end=\"9383\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jjx683\" data-start=\"9279\" data-end=\"9314\">Analytical thinking development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105k36a\" data-start=\"9315\" data-end=\"9346\">Practical industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w8lso6\" data-start=\"9347\" data-end=\"9383\">Research methodology application</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9385\" data-end=\"9388\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14u2hjq\" data-start=\"9390\" data-end=\"9417\">6. Open Elective Course</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9419\" data-end=\"9508\">Students can choose interdisciplinary subjects based on their interests and career goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9510\" data-end=\"9513\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aio6j4\" data-start=\"9515\" data-end=\"9588\">4th Semester: Technology Leadership, Cybersecurity &amp; Project Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9590\" data-end=\"9727\">The final semester focuses on advanced technology leadership, innovation management, cybersecurity, and practical project implementation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"9729\" data-end=\"9749\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15uh7nv\" data-start=\"9751\" data-end=\"9786\">1. Entrepreneurship Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9788\" data-end=\"9862\">Students learn startup development and innovation-based business creation.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9864\" data-end=\"9883\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9884\" data-end=\"9989\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rsw4nm\" data-start=\"9884\" data-end=\"9906\">Startup ecosystems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y05mxq\" data-start=\"9907\" data-end=\"9930\">Innovation strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcebe0\" data-start=\"9931\" data-end=\"9958\">Business model creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lbbq52\" data-start=\"9959\" data-end=\"9989\">Entrepreneurial leadership</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9991\" data-end=\"10015\">Industry Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"10017\" data-end=\"10092\">Technology entrepreneurship is one of the fastest-growing sectors globally.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10094\" data-end=\"10097\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zfejjj\" data-start=\"10099\" data-end=\"10127\">2. Technology Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10129\" data-end=\"10210\">This subject focuses on managing technology-driven organizational transformation.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10212\" data-end=\"10235\">Key Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10236\" data-end=\"10340\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ikynqb\" data-start=\"10236\" data-end=\"10261\">Technology innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"89izer\" data-start=\"10262\" data-end=\"10288\">Digital transformation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13cfngb\" data-start=\"10289\" data-end=\"10306\">IT governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"53zebf\" data-start=\"10307\" data-end=\"10340\">Strategic technology planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10342\" data-end=\"10363\">Career Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"10365\" data-end=\"10463\">Organizations increasingly require leaders who understand both technology and business management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10465\" data-end=\"10468\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"173dmo\" data-start=\"10470\" data-end=\"10498\">3. IT Project Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10500\" data-end=\"10565\">Students learn technology project planning and execution systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10567\" data-end=\"10588\">Skills Developed</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10589\" data-end=\"10677\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h1sr0d\" data-start=\"10589\" data-end=\"10611\">Project scheduling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zpui1k\" data-start=\"10612\" data-end=\"10631\">Risk management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ak4c8i\" data-start=\"10632\" data-end=\"10655\">Resource allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7u42xm\" data-start=\"10656\" data-end=\"10677\">Team coordination</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10679\" data-end=\"10708\">Why This Subject Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"10710\" data-end=\"10811\">IT project management is critical for software implementation and digital transformation initiatives.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10813\" data-end=\"10816\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1soo8ka\" data-start=\"10818\" data-end=\"10848\">4. IT Privacy and Security</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10850\" data-end=\"10925\">This subject explains cybersecurity principles and data protection systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10927\" data-end=\"10946\">Major Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10947\" data-end=\"11055\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jvr3m\" data-start=\"10947\" data-end=\"10971\">Information security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vld2d4\" data-start=\"10972\" data-end=\"10996\">Cybersecurity basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zrap9\" data-start=\"10997\" data-end=\"11024\">Data privacy management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13nv4ut\" data-start=\"11025\" data-end=\"11055\">Risk mitigation strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"11057\" data-end=\"11084\">Future Industry Demand</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"11086\" data-end=\"11170\">Cybersecurity and data privacy have become major organizational priorities globally.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11172\" data-end=\"11175\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1amn6dd\" data-start=\"11177\" data-end=\"11210\">5. Research-Based Learning-II</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"11212\" data-end=\"11290\">Students continue practical research and project-oriented learning activities.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"11292\" data-end=\"11305\">Benefits</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11306\" data-end=\"11420\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s6qk9p\" data-start=\"11306\" data-end=\"11336\">Real-world problem-solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0udj5\" data-start=\"11337\" data-end=\"11362\">Portfolio development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvphi9\" data-start=\"11363\" data-end=\"11384\">Industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mo435l\" data-start=\"11385\" data-end=\"11420\">Research capability enhancement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11422\" data-end=\"11425\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1248vmq\" data-start=\"11427\" data-end=\"11493\">Key Skills Developed Throughout the MBA IT Management Curriculum</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"11495\" data-end=\"11587\">The semester-wise curriculum helps students develop multiple industry-relevant competencies.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1oqcxfg\" data-start=\"11589\" data-end=\"11614\">Major Skills Developed</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11616\" data-end=\"11918\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pj1fgd\" data-start=\"11616\" data-end=\"11641\">Technology Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"11642\" data-end=\"11664\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ionq16\" data-start=\"11665\" data-end=\"11697\">Enterprise Resource Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1onviv2\" data-start=\"11698\" data-end=\"11721\">Database Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7u6yyb\" data-start=\"11722\" data-end=\"11747\">IT Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"162imwq\" data-start=\"11748\" data-end=\"11777\">Strategic Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n645p6\" data-start=\"11778\" data-end=\"11805\">Cybersecurity Awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jn3776\" data-start=\"11806\" data-end=\"11848\">Leadership &amp; Organizational Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15j0tbp\" data-start=\"11849\" data-end=\"11883\">Software Systems Understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cae3nz\" data-start=\"11884\" data-end=\"11918\">Research &amp; Analytical Thinking</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 90000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(320, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 234, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 06:18:44', '2026-06-16 07:20:52', '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"645\">Enrolling in an MBA in Healthcare Management program is an important step for students and working professionals who want to build careers in hospital administration, healthcare operations, patient care management, healthcare consulting, insurance systems, healthcare technology, and medical services management. However, many applicants face confusion during the admission process because they do not fully understand how online enrollment works, what documents are required, or how fee payment and verification procedures are completed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"1000\">The online enrollment process is designed to provide a smooth, flexible, and fully digital admission experience for learners across India and international students. Since the entire process is conducted online, students can complete registration, application submission, document upload, and fee payment remotely without physically visiting the campus.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1042\">This detailed enrollment guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1391\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rc6zkc\" data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1112\">Complete MBA Healthcare Management admission process step-by-step</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zry049\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1163\">Online registration and application procedures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vfbyfx\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1208\">Document upload and verification process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"no8wn6\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1248\">Fee payment methods and EMI options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u8bp4o\" data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1301\">Common enrollment mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9lpjr\" data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1342\">Hidden risks during online admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d3h02k\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1391\">Strategic admission tips for faster approval</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1396\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10agwut\" data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1447\">Understanding the MBA Online Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1590\">The MBA in Healthcare Management admission system is fully online and designed for modern learners who require flexibility and accessibility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1634\">The enrollment process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1797\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r633i1\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1651\">Registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1af4njd\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1680\">Student account creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t46q9s\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1712\">Application form completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yylsws\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1734\">Program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f12ekk\" data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1754\">Document upload</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csrces\" data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1770\">Fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o227h4\" data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1797\">Admission verification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1851\">This digital structure is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1997\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1877\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19hdfr0\" data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1897\">Remote learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gimp1\" data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1932\">Students from different states</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tvf4t\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1961\">International applicants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wsn4ls\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1997\">Career-transition professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2002\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1puox4j\" data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2053\">Step 1: Visit the Vignan Online Enrollment Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2146\">The first step in the admission process is accessing the official online enrollment portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2165\">Students need to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a035jh\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2217\">Visit the official Vignan Online admission page</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzyxpe\" data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2269\">Click on the &ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo; or &ldquo;Enroll Now&rdquo; option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6r5ko\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2305\">Open the online enrollment form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aaic30\" data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2340\">Begin the registration process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2345\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o39v0r\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2376\">Why This Step Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2480\">Many students unknowingly use unofficial websites or unauthorized admission portals, which may create:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2600\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ddals\" data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2518\">Incorrect application submissions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4ruiu\" data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2542\">Payment fraud risks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v2cthx\" data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2568\">Data privacy concerns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlj2y4\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2600\">Admission processing delays</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2746\">Students should always verify that they are using the official university enrollment platform before entering personal or financial information.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2751\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kg91z5\" data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2813\">Information Students Should Keep Ready Before Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2942\">Preparing all required information in advance helps students complete the admission process smoothly and without interruptions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c5fod6\" data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"2973\">Basic Information Required</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3169\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mi9lua\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3012\">Full name as per academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mizif\" data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3037\">Active mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pp80n3\" data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3056\">Valid email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3074\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3094\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dnebzw\" data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3121\">Graduation information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3140\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3169\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3174\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"psychq\" data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3202\">Expert Admission Advice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3231\">Students should always use:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3296\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19w6v56\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3254\">An active email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0qt9v\" data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3296\">A frequently accessible mobile number</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3335\">because important updates related to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3470\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3362\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17351q3\" data-start=\"3363\" data-end=\"3387\">Fee payment receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sars2p\" data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3413\">LMS login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jmdcbh\" data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3443\">Examination notifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jxjo99\" data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3470\">Academic communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3508\">will be sent through these channels.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3513\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"c5gpum\" data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3568\">Step 2: Sign Up and Complete the Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3682\">After accessing the portal, students must create their online account and complete the admission form carefully.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3684\" data-end=\"3687\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iqj42j\" data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3718\">Create Your Student Account</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3720\" data-end=\"3764\">The registration process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3869\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e15fdm\" data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3794\">Entering personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jr0s2\" data-start=\"3795\" data-end=\"3825\">Creating login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zkzjzu\" data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3846\">OTP verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ujxzul\" data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"3869\">Account activation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3966\">Once registration is completed successfully, students can proceed to the full application form.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3968\" data-end=\"3971\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rmyoml\" data-start=\"3973\" data-end=\"4014\">Complete the Essential Enrollment Steps</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4099\">The application form includes multiple sections that students must fill accurately.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4101\" data-end=\"4104\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cb15o8\" data-start=\"4106\" data-end=\"4137\">Personal Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4139\" data-end=\"4164\">Students need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4165\" data-end=\"4262\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2yru7\" data-start=\"4165\" data-end=\"4173\">Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4193\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19381gy\" data-start=\"4194\" data-end=\"4217\">Address information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"4218\" data-end=\"4235\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vd6fls\" data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4262\">Identification details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4264\" data-end=\"4267\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ta2jvp\" data-start=\"4269\" data-end=\"4300\">Academic Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4302\" data-end=\"4324\">Applicants must enter:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4452\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4347\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fde55\" data-start=\"4348\" data-end=\"4380\">Aggregate percentage or CGPA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdp0ww\" data-start=\"4381\" data-end=\"4407\">University information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lx9va\" data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4424\">Passing year</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0cc02\" data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4452\">Academic specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4454\" data-end=\"4549\">Students appearing in the final semester may also need to provide provisional academic records.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4551\" data-end=\"4554\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n3xcpd\" data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4576\">Program Selection</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4675\">Students must carefully select the MBA in Healthcare Management specialization during enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1zi2k\" data-start=\"4677\" data-end=\"4710\">Why Program Selection Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4757\">The selected specialization directly affects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4860\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj5fkl\" data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4782\">Career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvphi9\" data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4804\">Industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"buy5xm\" data-start=\"4805\" data-end=\"4826\">Skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ot5agr\" data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4860\">Long-term professional growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4862\" data-end=\"4932\">This specialization is especially suitable for students interested in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4933\" data-end=\"5133\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4yt3o2\" data-start=\"4933\" data-end=\"4960\">Hospital administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"46j3lz\" data-start=\"4961\" data-end=\"4986\">Healthcare operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k5sh7c\" data-start=\"4987\" data-end=\"5011\">Patient care systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"spzjwf\" data-start=\"5012\" data-end=\"5045\">Healthcare quality management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gbm7lb\" data-start=\"5046\" data-end=\"5075\">Medical insurance systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b8jru9\" data-start=\"5076\" data-end=\"5133\">Healthcare technology and digital healthcare services</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5135\" data-end=\"5138\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83j5nm\" data-start=\"5140\" data-end=\"5166\">Document Upload Process</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5210\">Students are generally required to upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5211\" data-end=\"5333\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134nxcp\" data-start=\"5211\" data-end=\"5237\">Graduation mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v45ing\" data-start=\"5238\" data-end=\"5285\">Degree certificate or provisional documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5304\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"5305\" data-end=\"5333\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5335\" data-end=\"5338\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"d7hyu3\" data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5374\">Common Document Upload Mistakes</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5376\" data-end=\"5430\">Many applications are delayed because students upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5431\" data-end=\"5537\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43co8u\" data-start=\"5431\" data-end=\"5448\">Blurred scans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sx5g9z\" data-start=\"5449\" data-end=\"5475\">Incorrect file formats</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ib334\" data-start=\"5476\" data-end=\"5503\">Incomplete certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v0us2\" data-start=\"5504\" data-end=\"5537\">Unreadable academic documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5539\" data-end=\"5627\">Properly scanned and clearly visible documents improve verification speed significantly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5629\" data-end=\"5632\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vxyo72\" data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5663\">Step 3: Pay the Program Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5665\" data-end=\"5759\">After completing the enrollment form, students must pay the required fee to confirm admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5761\" data-end=\"5808\">The payment process is fully online and secure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5810\" data-end=\"5813\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pp6z2h\" data-start=\"5815\" data-end=\"5842\">Available Payment Methods</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5844\" data-end=\"5874\">Students can pay fees through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5875\" data-end=\"5959\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"5875\" data-end=\"5890\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"5891\" data-end=\"5905\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"5906\" data-end=\"5921\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sezyli\" data-start=\"5922\" data-end=\"5959\">Easy EMI Options with 0% Interest</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5961\" data-end=\"5964\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cprctf\" data-start=\"5966\" data-end=\"6004\">Understanding the EMI Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6006\" data-end=\"6052\">The EMI facility is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6053\" data-end=\"6183\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"6053\" data-end=\"6078\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ri80sk\" data-start=\"6079\" data-end=\"6122\">Students managing financial limitations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khgvkf\" data-start=\"6123\" data-end=\"6183\">Learners preferring installment-based payment structures</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17bfro3\" data-start=\"6185\" data-end=\"6211\">Benefits of EMI Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6213\" data-end=\"6326\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juc81q\" data-start=\"6213\" data-end=\"6251\">Reduced immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lvcttt\" data-start=\"6252\" data-end=\"6280\">Easier monthly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzih0q\" data-start=\"6281\" data-end=\"6326\">Better affordability for higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6328\" data-end=\"6331\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u202ba\" data-start=\"6333\" data-end=\"6382\">Important Financial Advice Before Choosing EMI</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6384\" data-end=\"6419\">Students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6420\" data-end=\"6546\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pfemi8\" data-start=\"6420\" data-end=\"6452\">Monthly repayment capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h8ds60\" data-start=\"6453\" data-end=\"6488\">Long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11tkeut\" data-start=\"6489\" data-end=\"6524\">Additional educational expenses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ltcrne\" data-start=\"6525\" data-end=\"6546\">Payment timelines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6548\" data-end=\"6637\">Even with 0% interest EMI options, proper financial planning remains extremely important.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"513\">Understanding the eligibility criteria is one of the most important steps before applying for MBA admission. Many students focus mainly on placements, salary packages, specialization options, and career growth while overlooking detailed admission requirements. This often creates confusion during document verification, counseling, or final admission approval.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"1041\">The MBA in Healthcare Management is a specialized management program designed to prepare students for leadership roles in hospitals, healthcare organizations, insurance companies, pharmaceutical industries, healthcare startups, diagnostic centers, wellness companies, and public health systems. Since the program combines business administration with healthcare operations and hospital management, universities establish specific academic eligibility standards to ensure students are prepared for advanced management learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1084\">This detailed eligibility guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1405\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rouitd\" data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1131\">Minimum educational qualification required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hcz6sx\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1172\">Aggregate marks eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixkcr6\" data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1205\">UGC recognition requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqw3f6\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1232\">SC/ST relaxation rules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wwtqi6\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1271\">Final semester student eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bv7gi9\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1305\">Accepted academic backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ev5oj9\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1357\">Common admission mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rvf1u0\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1405\">Strategic admission insights for applicants</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ndqt0s\" data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1444\">Basic MBA Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1567\">Students seeking admission to the MBA in Healthcare Management program must fulfill the required academic qualifications.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z5vvlm\" data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1606\">Required Educational Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1766\">Applicants must have completed an <strong data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1687\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) Degree Program</strong> of a minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1728\">three years</strong> from a <strong data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1765\">UGC Recognized University</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1895\">The bachelor&rsquo;s degree can belong to <strong data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1832\">any stream or discipline</strong>, allowing students from diverse academic backgrounds to apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ux6rxl\" data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1929\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"2019\">Students must secure the required aggregate marks in their undergraduate degree program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ycqnta\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2058\">Category-Wise Eligibility Criteria</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2195\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2101\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2101\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2071\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Aggregate Required</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2195\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2154\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2131\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2154\">50% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2195\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2172\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SC/ST Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2195\">45% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2312\">A relaxation of 5% marks is provided to candidates belonging to SC/ST categories according to admission guidelines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2317\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xmefjw\" data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2362\">Final Semester Students Are Also Eligible</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2493\">Candidates currently appearing in the final semester of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree program are also eligible to apply for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fvye\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2542\">Important Guidelines for Final Year Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2582\">Students in the final semester should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2761\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edkzqf\" data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2639\">Submit available academic records during application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bzt13z\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2688\">Provide provisional certificates if required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12y4ecr\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2761\">Complete all degree requirements before final admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qspa7l\" data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2799\">Why This Provision Is Beneficial</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2825\">This allows students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2970\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1adgc7p\" data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2875\">Apply early without waiting for final results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgofck\" data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2924\">Participate in the admission process on time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nqm8qc\" data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2970\">Secure seats before competition increases</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"2975\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1m8zall\" data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3016\">UGC Recognition Requirement Explained</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3138\">The undergraduate qualification must be obtained from a university recognized by the University Grants Commission (UGC).</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13c0ynd\" data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3175\">Why UGC Recognition Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3201\">UGC recognition ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3369\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wp36kb\" data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3237\">Academic validity of the degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wn6suh\" data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3273\">Acceptance for higher education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgnmsx\" data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3318\">Eligibility for employment opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncpjn\" data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3369\">Compliance with approved educational standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3433\">Students graduating from non-recognized institutions may face:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3528\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwrtt2\" data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3457\">Admission rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10l5zgo\" data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3488\">Verification complications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4bejac\" data-start=\"3489\" data-end=\"3528\">Employment-related challenges later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3533\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lztnlk\" data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3571\">Students from Any Stream Can Apply</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3757\">One of the biggest advantages of the MBA in Healthcare Management program is its multidisciplinary accessibility. Students from various academic backgrounds are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4sxlms\" data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3799\">Eligible Academic Backgrounds Include</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3976\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3808\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuwkdh\" data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3818\">B.Com</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ub0l3o\" data-start=\"3819\" data-end=\"3827\">B.Sc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3834\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"3835\" data-end=\"3842\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hnd5hy\" data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3858\">B.Tech / BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"27mxe2\" data-start=\"3859\" data-end=\"3891\">Pharmacy-related backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1amaxux\" data-start=\"3892\" data-end=\"3909\">Life Sciences</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8ezea\" data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"3931\">Commerce Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xqsf76\" data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"3955\">Humanities Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nj617f\" data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"3976\">Science Programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"4094\">This broad eligibility structure supports interdisciplinary learning and diverse healthcare management perspectives.</p>', '<p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"544\">Understanding the complete MBA fee structure is one of the most important parts of higher education planning. Many students focus only on tuition fees while ignoring additional academic expenses such as registration charges, examination fees, healthcare management certifications, technology requirements, project expenses, and long-term educational budgeting. This lack of financial planning often creates stress during the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"880\">The MBA in Healthcare Management fee structure is designed to provide affordability and flexibility for Indian students, SAARC nation applicants, and international learners. Students can choose semester-wise, annual, or full program payment plans according to their financial comfort, educational goals, and long-term career strategy.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"925\">This detailed fee structure guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"1259\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19nrrjn\" data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"981\">Semester-wise MBA Healthcare Management fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ffjya\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1016\">Annual and total payment plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aflusc\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1050\">Additional university charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ykevk\" data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1082\">SAARC student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q37kuk\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1116\">Foreign student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5vii0\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1169\">Hidden educational expenses students should know</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5y1406\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1208\">ROI and career investment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"115jdyp\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1259\">Financial planning strategies before admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rpkozm\" data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1330\">MBA in Healthcare Management Fee Structure for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1446\">The university provides flexible payment structures to help students manage educational expenses more efficiently.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"f8bwvd\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1480\">Indian Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1503\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1503\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1493\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1503\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1545\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1534\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1545\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹22,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1575\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1564\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1575\">₹45,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1593\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1604\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1609\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rkz2z6\" data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1651\">Additional Charges for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1763\">Apart from tuition fees, students must also consider certain university-related charges applicable separately.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cws2c8\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1790\">Additional Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1912\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1823\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1823\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1813\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1823\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1912\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1874\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1864\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1874\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1912\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1902\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1912\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1917\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19kzlc5\" data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1960\">Fee Structure for SAARC Nation Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2097\">Students from SAARC countries are eligible under a separate fee structure category with dedicated registration and examination charges.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vz6nli\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2139\">Additional Charges for SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2250\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2172\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2172\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2162\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2172\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2250\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2212\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2202\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2212\">₹2,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2250\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2240\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2250\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2255\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1r5upxa\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2319\">MBA Healthcare Management Fee Structure for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2461\">The university also offers globally accessible healthcare management education through a dedicated fee structure for international students.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cgz08i\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2496\">Foreign Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2613\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2519\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2519\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2509\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2519\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2613\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2558\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2550\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2558\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$375</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2585\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2577\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2585\">$750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2613\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2603\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2613\">$1,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2618\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g7i4sp\" data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2661\">Additional Charges for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2694\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2694\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2684\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2694\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2742\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2735\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2742\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2777\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"660\">The MBA in Healthcare Management is a specialized management program designed to prepare students for leadership roles in the rapidly expanding healthcare and hospital administration sector. As healthcare systems become more technology-driven, patient-focused, data-oriented, and operationally complex, the demand for professionally trained healthcare managers is increasing significantly across hospitals, healthcare startups, insurance companies, pharmaceutical organizations, wellness industries, and public health systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"771\">Unlike traditional MBA programs that focus only on general business administration, this curriculum combines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmq896\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"801\">Core management education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3d7yq7\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"831\">Healthcare administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ngspm\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"855\">Hospital operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmiq9m\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"886\">Healthcare quality systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1zwxb1\" data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"914\">Patient care management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11kp8hz\" data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"940\">Healthcare technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bpaxf6\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"982\">Medical insurance and healthcare laws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1070\">The semester-wise syllabus is carefully structured to help students gradually develop:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1276\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"38sgzn\" data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1097\">Management foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vax5vs\" data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1134\">Healthcare operational expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3anily\" data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1175\">Strategic healthcare planning skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gagoxc\" data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1221\">Leadership and decision-making capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"souiet\" data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1276\">Healthcare compliance and technology understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1356\">This program prepares students for managerial and administrative roles across:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1syksy7\" data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1370\">Hospitals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vlrqcf\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1392\">Healthcare chains</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"47zu8j\" data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1416\">Insurance companies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0pvkn\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1439\">Diagnostic centers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kq21vr\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1472\">Pharmaceutical organizations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6k1n32\" data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1504\">Healthcare consulting firms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vdignd\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1534\">Medical tourism companies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14c8p1f\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1560\">Public health systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1600\">This detailed syllabus guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1855\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dy88ay\" data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1655\">Semester-wise MBA Healthcare Management curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hg7axt\" data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1712\">Subject explanations and practical learning outcomes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12sx8lq\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1751\">Industry-relevant skills developed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w3z4mh\" data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1793\">Career opportunities after graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"35ubmn\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1855\">Long-term healthcare industry demand and growth potential</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1860\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1q70cv7\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1936\">1st Semester: Building Core Management Foundations and Analytical Skills</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2233\">The first semester focuses on developing strong business management fundamentals, leadership capability, financial understanding, analytical reasoning, and organizational behavior knowledge. These subjects create the foundation for advanced healthcare administration learning in later semesters.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2255\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xnypa2\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2297\">1. Management Concepts and Practices</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2392\">This subject introduces the basic principles of management and organizational administration.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2417\">Key Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2574\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16xwdx9\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2459\">Planning and organizational structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mmyupg\" data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2485\">Leadership principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1doutfl\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2511\">Business coordination</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ws5c4\" data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2539\">Decision-making systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tghy1u\" data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2574\">Strategic management functions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2605\">Why This Subject Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2799\">Healthcare organizations require efficient management systems because hospitals and healthcare institutions operate through large multidisciplinary teams and complex administrative structures.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2804\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2oan92\" data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2848\">2. Principles of Economics and Markets</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2962\">Students learn how economic systems and market dynamics influence healthcare services and organizational growth.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"2983\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3112\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jh284l\" data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3014\">Demand and supply analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dhku7e\" data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3036\">Market structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e6pbr0\" data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3061\">Economic forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xcc75m\" data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3083\">Consumer behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bwnbb3\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3112\">Healthcare market trends</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3137\">Industry Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3266\">Healthcare organizations are significantly influenced by economic conditions, healthcare spending patterns, and policy changes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3271\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s84tsx\" data-start=\"3273\" data-end=\"3315\">3. Managerial Effectiveness and Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3397\">This subject focuses on leadership development and ethical managerial practices.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3424\">Major Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3559\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ktbdd\" data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3453\">Leadership communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hhrzrg\" data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3481\">Ethical decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j9g01k\" data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3519\">Professional management practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18hgrsn\" data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3559\">Corporate and social responsibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3561\" data-end=\"3586\">Strategic Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3731\">Ethics is extremely important in healthcare management because administrators directly influence patient care systems and organizational trust.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3733\" data-end=\"3736\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m1roou\" data-start=\"3738\" data-end=\"3767\">4. Accounting and Finance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3769\" data-end=\"3859\">Students develop understanding of organizational finance and healthcare budgeting systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3861\" data-end=\"3877\">Core Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3878\" data-end=\"3983\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ax4ily\" data-start=\"3878\" data-end=\"3910\">Financial statement analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lx2040\" data-start=\"3911\" data-end=\"3930\">Budget planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oyorzk\" data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"3950\">Cost management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"embtwe\" data-start=\"3951\" data-end=\"3983\">Healthcare financial systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"4026\">Why Financial Knowledge Is Important</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4177\">Healthcare managers must understand financial operations because hospitals and healthcare institutions require strong budget and resource management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4182\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s3lhnd\" data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4245\">5. Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4247\" data-end=\"4339\">This subject explains workforce behavior and people management systems within organizations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4341\" data-end=\"4361\">Topics Included</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4362\" data-end=\"4476\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h0vue6\" data-start=\"4362\" data-end=\"4385\">Employee motivation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uh3hqe\" data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4405\">Team management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p9eq2a\" data-start=\"4406\" data-end=\"4432\">Organizational culture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17rd4p2\" data-start=\"4433\" data-end=\"4452\">HR fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5li53\" data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4476\">Leadership dynamics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4478\" data-end=\"4499\">Career Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4501\" data-end=\"4639\">Healthcare institutions depend heavily on coordinated teamwork between doctors, nurses, administrative staff, and operational departments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4641\" data-end=\"4644\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zfjsox\" data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4690\">6. Quantitative Techniques and Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4692\" data-end=\"4759\">Students develop analytical and statistical problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4761\" data-end=\"4782\">Skills Developed</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4884\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rj78q2\" data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4800\">Data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jfnzrr\" data-start=\"4801\" data-end=\"4826\">Statistical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xg9dyt\" data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4851\">Business forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rdm9dr\" data-start=\"4852\" data-end=\"4884\">Quantitative decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4886\" data-end=\"4910\">Industry Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4912\" data-end=\"5034\">Modern healthcare systems increasingly rely on data analytics and operational performance metrics for strategic decisions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5036\" data-end=\"5039\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ag36hu\" data-start=\"5041\" data-end=\"5114\">2nd Semester: Healthcare Operations, Patient Services &amp; Risk Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5116\" data-end=\"5284\">The second semester introduces specialized healthcare management subjects focused on hospital operations, patient care systems, healthcare quality, and risk management.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5306\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"108nxtk\" data-start=\"5308\" data-end=\"5331\">1. Entrepreneurship</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5333\" data-end=\"5405\">Students learn startup development and healthcare innovation management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5407\" data-end=\"5426\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5427\" data-end=\"5536\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18b1sk7\" data-start=\"5427\" data-end=\"5450\">Healthcare startups</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y05mxq\" data-start=\"5451\" data-end=\"5474\">Innovation strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"93bbki\" data-start=\"5475\" data-end=\"5505\">Business model development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lbbq52\" data-start=\"5506\" data-end=\"5536\">Entrepreneurial leadership</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5538\" data-end=\"5567\">Why This Subject Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5569\" data-end=\"5638\">The healthcare startup ecosystem is growing rapidly in areas such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5639\" data-end=\"5745\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9iz504\" data-start=\"5639\" data-end=\"5655\">Telemedicine</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19x75ke\" data-start=\"5656\" data-end=\"5670\">HealthTech</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nms612\" data-start=\"5671\" data-end=\"5694\">Digital diagnostics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i63ra5\" data-start=\"5695\" data-end=\"5717\">Wellness platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mda62r\" data-start=\"5718\" data-end=\"5745\">Healthcare AI solutions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5747\" data-end=\"5750\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ht73y7\" data-start=\"5752\" data-end=\"5792\">2. Marketing Management and Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5794\" data-end=\"5871\">This subject focuses on healthcare marketing strategies and research systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5873\" data-end=\"5896\">Key Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5897\" data-end=\"6009\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cxmhfe\" data-start=\"5897\" data-end=\"5920\">Healthcare branding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vzh54c\" data-start=\"5921\" data-end=\"5956\">Patient relationship management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bq76gh\" data-start=\"5957\" data-end=\"5978\">Service marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w49wmy\" data-start=\"5979\" data-end=\"6009\">Market research techniques</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6011\" data-end=\"6034\">Industry Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6151\">Hospitals and healthcare providers increasingly compete on service quality, patient trust, and healthcare branding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6153\" data-end=\"6156\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rjs9vy\" data-start=\"6158\" data-end=\"6186\">3. Operations Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6188\" data-end=\"6260\">Students learn operational efficiency and healthcare process management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6262\" data-end=\"6281\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6282\" data-end=\"6392\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bj63un\" data-start=\"6282\" data-end=\"6303\">Resource planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w55nw1\" data-start=\"6304\" data-end=\"6332\">Operational optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vrjus0\" data-start=\"6333\" data-end=\"6361\">Productivity improvement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"190jhsg\" data-start=\"6362\" data-end=\"6392\">Service management systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6394\" data-end=\"6416\">Career Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6418\" data-end=\"6546\">Hospital operations require highly efficient systems to manage patient flow, medical resources, and emergency response services.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6548\" data-end=\"6551\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ajoga3\" data-start=\"6553\" data-end=\"6589\">4. Healthcare Quality Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6591\" data-end=\"6671\">This subject focuses on healthcare quality standards and patient safety systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6673\" data-end=\"6692\">Major Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6693\" data-end=\"6816\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"421gcj\" data-start=\"6693\" data-end=\"6726\">Healthcare quality frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eslec2\" data-start=\"6727\" data-end=\"6754\">Accreditation standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14mq3v5\" data-start=\"6755\" data-end=\"6781\">Patient safety systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m9o4dc\" data-start=\"6782\" data-end=\"6816\">Continuous quality improvement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6818\" data-end=\"6851\">Why This Subject Is Valuable</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6853\" data-end=\"6889\">Healthcare quality directly impacts:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6890\" data-end=\"6991\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"onn533\" data-start=\"6890\" data-end=\"6914\">Patient satisfaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yxpg9z\" data-start=\"6915\" data-end=\"6938\">Hospital reputation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11a2yx3\" data-start=\"6939\" data-end=\"6965\">Operational efficiency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11nip71\" data-start=\"6966\" data-end=\"6991\">Regulatory compliance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6993\" data-end=\"6996\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yykma1\" data-start=\"6998\" data-end=\"7033\">5. Risk and Disaster Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7035\" data-end=\"7108\">Students learn healthcare emergency planning and risk management systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7110\" data-end=\"7130\">Topics Included</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7131\" data-end=\"7249\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nugcs6\" data-start=\"7131\" data-end=\"7162\">Hospital emergency response</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8c6m09\" data-start=\"7163\" data-end=\"7188\">Disaster preparedness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13nv4ut\" data-start=\"7189\" data-end=\"7219\">Risk mitigation strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cympss\" data-start=\"7220\" data-end=\"7249\">Crisis management systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7251\" data-end=\"7275\">Industry Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"7277\" data-end=\"7328\">Healthcare institutions must be prepared to handle:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7329\" data-end=\"7427\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fpnkr0\" data-start=\"7329\" data-end=\"7352\">Medical emergencies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13n6vfs\" data-start=\"7353\" data-end=\"7377\">Public health crises</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m5gdqd\" data-start=\"7378\" data-end=\"7399\">Natural disasters</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yeb3ue\" data-start=\"7400\" data-end=\"7427\">Operational disruptions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7429\" data-end=\"7432\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qeofbf\" data-start=\"7434\" data-end=\"7464\">6. Patient Care Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7466\" data-end=\"7533\">This subject focuses on patient-centered healthcare administration.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7535\" data-end=\"7549\">Key Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7550\" data-end=\"7672\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7nk2r4\" data-start=\"7550\" data-end=\"7577\">Patient service systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"438i9t\" data-start=\"7578\" data-end=\"7606\">Healthcare communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oa5yx8\" data-start=\"7607\" data-end=\"7642\">Patient satisfaction management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y9ah50\" data-start=\"7643\" data-end=\"7672\">Care coordination systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7674\" data-end=\"7698\">Strategic Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"7700\" data-end=\"7792\">Patient experience has become a major performance indicator in modern healthcare management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7794\" data-end=\"7797\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qbulbm\" data-start=\"7799\" data-end=\"7873\">3rd Semester: Healthcare Planning, Supply Chain &amp; Medical Administration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7875\" data-end=\"8034\">The third semester develops advanced expertise in healthcare planning, medical record systems, hospital supply chains, and strategic healthcare administration.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"8036\" data-end=\"8056\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6fq62\" data-start=\"8058\" data-end=\"8098\">1. Business Environment and Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8100\" data-end=\"8184\">Students learn strategic business planning and healthcare organizational management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8186\" data-end=\"8205\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8206\" data-end=\"8334\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmk0lw\" data-start=\"8206\" data-end=\"8230\">Competitive strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q5kbyb\" data-start=\"8231\" data-end=\"8261\">Healthcare market dynamics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wrxrb0\" data-start=\"8262\" data-end=\"8293\">Organizational adaptability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d9iz8l\" data-start=\"8294\" data-end=\"8334\">Strategic healthcare growth planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8336\" data-end=\"8359\">Industry Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"8361\" data-end=\"8448\">Healthcare organizations operate in highly regulated and rapidly changing environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8450\" data-end=\"8453\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5v1wt8\" data-start=\"8455\" data-end=\"8480\">2. Project Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8482\" data-end=\"8560\">This subject focuses on planning and execution of healthcare-related projects.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8562\" data-end=\"8583\">Skills Developed</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8584\" data-end=\"8672\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h1sr0d\" data-start=\"8584\" data-end=\"8606\">Project scheduling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ak4c8i\" data-start=\"8607\" data-end=\"8630\">Resource allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7u42xm\" data-start=\"8631\" data-end=\"8652\">Team coordination</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zpui1k\" data-start=\"8653\" data-end=\"8672\">Risk management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8674\" data-end=\"8703\">Why This Subject Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"8705\" data-end=\"8759\">Hospitals and healthcare systems frequently implement:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8760\" data-end=\"8875\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5d07l9\" data-start=\"8760\" data-end=\"8783\">Technology upgrades</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1npnbiu\" data-start=\"8784\" data-end=\"8812\">Infrastructure expansion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nhq8nf\" data-start=\"8813\" data-end=\"8845\">Quality improvement projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n4eebe\" data-start=\"8846\" data-end=\"8875\">Public health initiatives</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8877\" data-end=\"8880\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1oawra0\" data-start=\"8882\" data-end=\"8939\">3. Supply Chain and Material Management in Healthcare</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8941\" data-end=\"9020\">Students learn healthcare procurement and medical inventory management systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9022\" data-end=\"9045\">Key Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9046\" data-end=\"9162\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xshbi\" data-start=\"9046\" data-end=\"9075\">Medical inventory control</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9sq2\" data-start=\"9076\" data-end=\"9109\">Pharmaceutical supply systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1248cx1\" data-start=\"9110\" data-end=\"9136\">Procurement management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wndxsz\" data-start=\"9137\" data-end=\"9162\">Resource optimization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9164\" data-end=\"9188\">Industry Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"9190\" data-end=\"9291\">Efficient supply chain management is critical for uninterrupted patient care and hospital operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9293\" data-end=\"9296\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3i1und\" data-start=\"9298\" data-end=\"9330\">4. Medical Record Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9332\" data-end=\"9411\">This subject explains healthcare documentation and patient information systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9413\" data-end=\"9432\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9433\" data-end=\"9551\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g49hxk\" data-start=\"9433\" data-end=\"9462\">Electronic health records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ko5eu8\" data-start=\"9463\" data-end=\"9490\">Medical data management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kz9svg\" data-start=\"9491\" data-end=\"9516\">Documentation systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gao7bo\" data-start=\"9517\" data-end=\"9551\">Healthcare information storage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9553\" data-end=\"9587\">Why This Subject Is Important</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"9589\" data-end=\"9622\">Accurate medical records support:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9623\" data-end=\"9717\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ob9swu\" data-start=\"9623\" data-end=\"9646\">Better patient care</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qk9awm\" data-start=\"9647\" data-end=\"9667\">Legal compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"176jbfd\" data-start=\"9668\" data-end=\"9692\">Insurance processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"js2i9j\" data-start=\"9693\" data-end=\"9717\">Healthcare analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9719\" data-end=\"9722\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13gtijy\" data-start=\"9724\" data-end=\"9762\">5. Planning of Healthcare Services</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9764\" data-end=\"9845\">Students learn healthcare infrastructure planning and service management systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9847\" data-end=\"9866\">Major Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9867\" data-end=\"9990\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yh729l\" data-start=\"9867\" data-end=\"9899\">Healthcare facility planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kvkubf\" data-start=\"9900\" data-end=\"9926\">Public health services</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a689bj\" data-start=\"9927\" data-end=\"9955\">Healthcare accessibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"309gtr\" data-start=\"9956\" data-end=\"9990\">Resource allocation strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"9992\" data-end=\"10013\">Career Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"10015\" data-end=\"10100\">Healthcare administrators play a major role in improving healthcare delivery systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10102\" data-end=\"10105\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14u2hjq\" data-start=\"10107\" data-end=\"10134\">6. Open Elective Course</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10136\" data-end=\"10225\">Students can choose interdisciplinary subjects based on their interests and career goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10227\" data-end=\"10230\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qntoz8\" data-start=\"10232\" data-end=\"10314\">4th Semester: Healthcare Technology, Insurance, Laws &amp; Global Healthcare Systems</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"10316\" data-end=\"10464\">The final semester focuses on healthcare technology systems, insurance administration, legal frameworks, and international healthcare opportunities.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"10466\" data-end=\"10486\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dhqu2\" data-start=\"10488\" data-end=\"10528\">1. Healthcare Information Technology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10530\" data-end=\"10625\">This subject introduces digital healthcare systems and technology-driven healthcare management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10627\" data-end=\"10646\">Topics Covered</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10647\" data-end=\"10769\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ab7t2\" data-start=\"10647\" data-end=\"10679\">Hospital information systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t05zmq\" data-start=\"10680\" data-end=\"10710\">Healthcare data management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1428ts2\" data-start=\"10711\" data-end=\"10735\">Telemedicine systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tjzy2l\" data-start=\"10736\" data-end=\"10769\">Digital healthcare operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"10771\" data-end=\"10798\">Future Industry Demand</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"10800\" data-end=\"10904\">Healthcare technology is rapidly transforming hospital administration and patient care systems globally.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10906\" data-end=\"10909\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9v958p\" data-start=\"10911\" data-end=\"10938\">2. Healthcare Insurance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10940\" data-end=\"11020\">Students learn health insurance systems and healthcare reimbursement structures.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"11022\" data-end=\"11045\">Key Learning Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11046\" data-end=\"11154\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4l24vc\" data-start=\"11046\" data-end=\"11075\">Health insurance policies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18qerr\" data-start=\"11076\" data-end=\"11104\">Claim management systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ms0xkc\" data-start=\"11105\" data-end=\"11129\">Healthcare financing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1de3eic\" data-start=\"11130\" data-end=\"11154\">Insurance operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"11156\" data-end=\"11179\">Industry Relevance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"11181\" data-end=\"11299\">Healthcare insurance is becoming increasingly important due to rising medical costs and expanding healthcare coverage.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11301\" data-end=\"11304\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cm6917\" data-start=\"11306\" data-end=\"11328\">3. Healthcare Laws</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"11330\" data-end=\"11399\">This subject explains legal regulations governing healthcare systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"11401\" data-end=\"11421\">Topics Included</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11422\" data-end=\"11519\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rtnhyq\" data-start=\"11422\" data-end=\"11448\">Medical ethics and law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jfe5wc\" data-start=\"11449\" data-end=\"11474\">Healthcare compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d9tgg8\" data-start=\"11475\" data-end=\"11493\">Patient rights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la10f3\" data-start=\"11494\" data-end=\"11519\">Regulatory frameworks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"11521\" data-end=\"11550\">Why This Subject Matters</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"11552\" data-end=\"11629\">Healthcare organizations must comply with strict legal and ethical standards.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11631\" data-end=\"11634\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"phvdfg\" data-start=\"11636\" data-end=\"11658\">4. Medical Tourism</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"11660\" data-end=\"11755\">Students gain understanding of international healthcare services and global patient management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"11757\" data-end=\"11776\">Major Concepts</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11777\" data-end=\"11916\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6lbz4l\" data-start=\"11777\" data-end=\"11814\">International healthcare services</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r8wk8v\" data-start=\"11815\" data-end=\"11846\">Global patient coordination</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ldmwgp\" data-start=\"11847\" data-end=\"11880\">Healthcare tourism management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ztbb7s\" data-start=\"11881\" data-end=\"11916\">Cross-border healthcare systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"11918\" data-end=\"11942\">Industry Importance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"11944\" data-end=\"12057\">India is becoming a major destination for medical tourism due to affordable and high-quality healthcare services.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"12059\" data-end=\"12062\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5wa2ot\" data-start=\"12064\" data-end=\"12103\">5. Cross-Functional Elective Course</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"12105\" data-end=\"12193\">Students gain interdisciplinary exposure beyond core healthcare specialization subjects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"12195\" data-end=\"12198\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ipu0o8\" data-start=\"12200\" data-end=\"12230\">6. Master Thesis / Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"12232\" data-end=\"12347\">The final research project allows students to apply theoretical knowledge to real healthcare management challenges.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"12349\" data-end=\"12383\">Benefits of the Final Project</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"12384\" data-end=\"12517\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105k36a\" data-start=\"12384\" data-end=\"12415\">Practical industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vjmr6a\" data-start=\"12416\" data-end=\"12451\">Research capability development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"inncwp\" data-start=\"12452\" data-end=\"12481\">Problem-solving expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"130yi0f\" data-start=\"12482\" data-end=\"12517\">Professional portfolio building</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 90000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(321, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 232, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 06:29:01', '2026-06-16 07:21:17', '<p data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"576\">Enrolling in an MBA program is one of the most important career decisions for students and working professionals who want to build expertise in business management, leadership, finance, marketing, analytics, operations, entrepreneurship, and strategic decision-making. However, many applicants face confusion during the admission process because they do not fully understand how online enrollment works, what documents are required, or how fee payment and verification procedures are completed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"931\">The online enrollment process is designed to provide a smooth, flexible, and fully digital admission experience for learners across India and international students. Since the entire process is conducted online, students can complete registration, application submission, document upload, and fee payment remotely without physically visiting the campus.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"973\">This detailed enrollment guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1300\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ecqs6\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1021\">Complete MBA admission process step-by-step</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zry049\" data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1072\">Online registration and application procedures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vfbyfx\" data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1117\">Document upload and verification process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"no8wn6\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1157\">Fee payment methods and EMI options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u8bp4o\" data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1210\">Common enrollment mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9lpjr\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1251\">Hidden risks during online admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d3h02k\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1300\">Strategic admission tips for faster approval</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1305\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10agwut\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1356\">Understanding the MBA Online Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1474\">The MBA admission system is fully online and designed for modern learners who require flexibility and accessibility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1518\">The enrollment process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r633i1\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1535\">Registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1af4njd\" data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1564\">Student account creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t46q9s\" data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1596\">Application form completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yylsws\" data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1618\">Program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f12ekk\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1638\">Document upload</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csrces\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1654\">Fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o227h4\" data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1681\">Admission verification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1735\">This digital structure is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1881\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1761\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19hdfr0\" data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1781\">Remote learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gimp1\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1816\">Students from different states</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tvf4t\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1845\">International applicants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wsn4ls\" data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1881\">Career-transition professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1886\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1puox4j\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1937\">Step 1: Visit the Vignan Online Enrollment Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"2030\">The first step in the admission process is accessing the official online enrollment portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2049\">Students need to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2224\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a035jh\" data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2101\">Visit the official Vignan Online admission page</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzyxpe\" data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2153\">Click on the &ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo; or &ldquo;Enroll Now&rdquo; option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6r5ko\" data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2189\">Open the online enrollment form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aaic30\" data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2224\">Begin the registration process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2229\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o39v0r\" data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2260\">Why This Step Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2364\">Many students unknowingly use unofficial websites or unauthorized admission portals, which may create:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2484\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ddals\" data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2402\">Incorrect application submissions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4ruiu\" data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2426\">Payment fraud risks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v2cthx\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2452\">Data privacy concerns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlj2y4\" data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2484\">Admission processing delays</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2630\">Students should always verify that they are using the official university enrollment platform before entering personal or financial information.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2635\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kg91z5\" data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2697\">Information Students Should Keep Ready Before Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2826\">Preparing all required information in advance helps students complete the admission process smoothly and without interruptions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c5fod6\" data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2857\">Basic Information Required</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"3053\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mi9lua\" data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2896\">Full name as per academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mizif\" data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2921\">Active mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pp80n3\" data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2940\">Valid email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"2958\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2978\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dnebzw\" data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3005\">Graduation information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3024\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3053\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3058\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"psychq\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3086\">Expert Admission Advice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3115\">Students should always use:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3180\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19w6v56\" data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3138\">An active email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0qt9v\" data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3180\">A frequently accessible mobile number</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3219\">because important updates related to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3354\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3246\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17351q3\" data-start=\"3247\" data-end=\"3271\">Fee payment receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sars2p\" data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3297\">LMS login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jmdcbh\" data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3327\">Examination notifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jxjo99\" data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3354\">Academic communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3392\">will be sent through these channels.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3397\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"c5gpum\" data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3452\">Step 2: Sign Up and Complete the Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3566\">After accessing the portal, students must create their online account and complete the admission form carefully.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3571\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iqj42j\" data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3602\">Create Your Student Account</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3604\" data-end=\"3648\">The registration process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3753\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e15fdm\" data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3678\">Entering personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jr0s2\" data-start=\"3679\" data-end=\"3709\">Creating login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zkzjzu\" data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3730\">OTP verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ujxzul\" data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3753\">Account activation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3850\">Once registration is completed successfully, students can proceed to the full application form.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3852\" data-end=\"3855\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rmyoml\" data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3898\">Complete the Essential Enrollment Steps</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3983\">The application form includes multiple sections that students must fill accurately.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"3988\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cb15o8\" data-start=\"3990\" data-end=\"4021\">Personal Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4023\" data-end=\"4048\">Students need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4146\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2yru7\" data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4057\">Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"4058\" data-end=\"4077\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19381gy\" data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4101\">Address information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4119\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vd6fls\" data-start=\"4120\" data-end=\"4146\">Identification details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4151\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ta2jvp\" data-start=\"4153\" data-end=\"4184\">Academic Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4208\">Applicants must enter:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4336\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4231\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fde55\" data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4264\">Aggregate percentage or CGPA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdp0ww\" data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4291\">University information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lx9va\" data-start=\"4292\" data-end=\"4308\">Passing year</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0cc02\" data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4336\">Academic specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4338\" data-end=\"4433\">Students appearing in the final semester may also need to provide provisional academic records.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4435\" data-end=\"4438\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n3xcpd\" data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4460\">Program Selection</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"4534\">Students must carefully select the MBA specialization during enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1zi2k\" data-start=\"4536\" data-end=\"4569\">Why Program Selection Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4616\">The selected specialization directly affects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4617\" data-end=\"4719\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj5fkl\" data-start=\"4617\" data-end=\"4641\">Career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvphi9\" data-start=\"4642\" data-end=\"4663\">Industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"buy5xm\" data-start=\"4664\" data-end=\"4685\">Skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ot5agr\" data-start=\"4686\" data-end=\"4719\">Long-term professional growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4721\" data-end=\"4753\">MBA specializations may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4922\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m6xjvw\" data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4767\">Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173ueww\" data-start=\"4768\" data-end=\"4779\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fqwsby\" data-start=\"4780\" data-end=\"4809\">Human Resource Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"4810\" data-end=\"4832\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"klr871\" data-start=\"4833\" data-end=\"4858\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"facnu9\" data-start=\"4859\" data-end=\"4896\">Information Technology Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"983wcy\" data-start=\"4897\" data-end=\"4922\">Healthcare Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4924\" data-end=\"4983\">Students should choose a specialization aligned with their:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4984\" data-end=\"5069\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16tc49r\" data-start=\"4984\" data-end=\"5004\">Career interests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t5xwk\" data-start=\"5005\" data-end=\"5023\">Industry goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"skbz67\" data-start=\"5024\" data-end=\"5043\">Skill strengths</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2vfy2e\" data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5069\">Long-term aspirations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5071\" data-end=\"5074\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83j5nm\" data-start=\"5076\" data-end=\"5102\">Document Upload Process</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5104\" data-end=\"5146\">Students are generally required to upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5147\" data-end=\"5269\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134nxcp\" data-start=\"5147\" data-end=\"5173\">Graduation mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v45ing\" data-start=\"5174\" data-end=\"5221\">Degree certificate or provisional documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"5222\" data-end=\"5240\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"5241\" data-end=\"5269\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5271\" data-end=\"5274\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"d7hyu3\" data-start=\"5276\" data-end=\"5310\">Common Document Upload Mistakes</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5312\" data-end=\"5366\">Many applications are delayed because students upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5367\" data-end=\"5473\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43co8u\" data-start=\"5367\" data-end=\"5384\">Blurred scans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sx5g9z\" data-start=\"5385\" data-end=\"5411\">Incorrect file formats</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ib334\" data-start=\"5412\" data-end=\"5439\">Incomplete certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v0us2\" data-start=\"5440\" data-end=\"5473\">Unreadable academic documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5475\" data-end=\"5563\">Properly scanned and clearly visible documents improve verification speed significantly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5565\" data-end=\"5568\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vxyo72\" data-start=\"5570\" data-end=\"5599\">Step 3: Pay the Program Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5601\" data-end=\"5695\">After completing the enrollment form, students must pay the required fee to confirm admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5697\" data-end=\"5744\">The payment process is fully online and secure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5746\" data-end=\"5749\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pp6z2h\" data-start=\"5751\" data-end=\"5778\">Available Payment Methods</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5780\" data-end=\"5810\">Students can pay fees through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5811\" data-end=\"5895\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"5811\" data-end=\"5826\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"5827\" data-end=\"5841\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"5842\" data-end=\"5857\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sezyli\" data-start=\"5858\" data-end=\"5895\">Easy EMI Options with 0% Interest</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5897\" data-end=\"5900\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cprctf\" data-start=\"5902\" data-end=\"5940\">Understanding the EMI Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5942\" data-end=\"5988\">The EMI facility is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5989\" data-end=\"6119\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"5989\" data-end=\"6014\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ri80sk\" data-start=\"6015\" data-end=\"6058\">Students managing financial limitations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khgvkf\" data-start=\"6059\" data-end=\"6119\">Learners preferring installment-based payment structures</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17bfro3\" data-start=\"6121\" data-end=\"6147\">Benefits of EMI Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6149\" data-end=\"6262\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juc81q\" data-start=\"6149\" data-end=\"6187\">Reduced immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lvcttt\" data-start=\"6188\" data-end=\"6216\">Easier monthly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzih0q\" data-start=\"6217\" data-end=\"6262\">Better affordability for higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6264\" data-end=\"6267\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u202ba\" data-start=\"6269\" data-end=\"6318\">Important Financial Advice Before Choosing EMI</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6320\" data-end=\"6355\">Students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6356\" data-end=\"6482\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pfemi8\" data-start=\"6356\" data-end=\"6388\">Monthly repayment capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h8ds60\" data-start=\"6389\" data-end=\"6424\">Long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11tkeut\" data-start=\"6425\" data-end=\"6460\">Additional educational expenses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ltcrne\" data-start=\"6461\" data-end=\"6482\">Payment timelines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6484\" data-end=\"6573\">Even with 0% interest EMI options, proper financial planning remains extremely important.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"502\">Understanding the MBA eligibility criteria is one of the most important steps before applying for admission. Many students focus mainly on placements, salary packages, specialization options, and career growth opportunities while overlooking detailed admission requirements. This often creates confusion during document verification, counseling, or final admission approval.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"956\">The MBA program is designed to prepare students for leadership, management, analytics, operations, finance, marketing, entrepreneurship, and strategic business roles across industries. Since the curriculum combines analytical learning, business strategy, management principles, research, and organizational leadership, universities establish specific academic eligibility standards to ensure students are prepared for postgraduate management education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"999\">This detailed eligibility guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rouitd\" data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1046\">Minimum educational qualification required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hcz6sx\" data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1087\">Aggregate marks eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixkcr6\" data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1120\">UGC recognition requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqw3f6\" data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1147\">SC/ST relaxation rules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wwtqi6\" data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1186\">Final semester student eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bv7gi9\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1220\">Accepted academic backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ev5oj9\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1272\">Common admission mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sjpc6e\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1324\">Strategic admission insights for MBA applicants</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1329\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ndqt0s\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1363\">Basic MBA Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1461\">Students seeking admission to the MBA program must fulfill the required academic qualifications.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z5vvlm\" data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1500\">Required Educational Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1660\">Applicants must have completed an <strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1581\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) Degree Program</strong> of a minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1622\">three years</strong> from a <strong data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1659\">UGC Recognized University</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1789\">The bachelor&rsquo;s degree can belong to <strong data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1726\">any stream or discipline</strong>, allowing students from diverse academic backgrounds to apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1794\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ux6rxl\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1823\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1913\">Students must secure the required aggregate marks in their undergraduate degree program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ycqnta\" data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1952\">Category-Wise Eligibility Criteria</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2089\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1995\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1995\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1965\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1995\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Aggregate Required</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2089\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2048\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2025\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2048\">50% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2089\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2066\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SC/ST Category</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2089\" data-col-size=\"sm\">45% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2206\">A relaxation of 5% marks is provided to candidates belonging to SC/ST categories according to admission guidelines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2211\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xmefjw\" data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2256\">Final Semester Students Are Also Eligible</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2387\">Candidates currently appearing in the final semester of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree program are also eligible to apply for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fvye\" data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2436\">Important Guidelines for Final Year Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2476\">Students in the final semester should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2655\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edkzqf\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2533\">Submit available academic records during application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bzt13z\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2582\">Provide provisional certificates if required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12y4ecr\" data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2655\">Complete all degree requirements before final admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qspa7l\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2693\">Why This Provision Is Beneficial</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2719\">This allows students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2864\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1adgc7p\" data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2769\">Apply early without waiting for final results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgofck\" data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2818\">Participate in the admission process on time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nqm8qc\" data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2864\">Secure seats before competition increases</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2869\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1m8zall\" data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2910\">UGC Recognition Requirement Explained</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"3032\">The undergraduate qualification must be obtained from a university recognized by the University Grants Commission (UGC).</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13c0ynd\" data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3069\">Why UGC Recognition Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3095\">UGC recognition ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3263\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wp36kb\" data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3131\">Academic validity of the degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wn6suh\" data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3167\">Acceptance for higher education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgnmsx\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3212\">Eligibility for employment opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncpjn\" data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3263\">Compliance with approved educational standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3327\">Students graduating from non-recognized institutions may face:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3422\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwrtt2\" data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3351\">Admission rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10l5zgo\" data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3382\">Verification complications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4bejac\" data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3422\">Employment-related challenges later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3424\" data-end=\"3427\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lztnlk\" data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3465\">Students from Any Stream Can Apply</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3626\">One of the biggest advantages of the MBA program is its multidisciplinary accessibility. Students from various academic backgrounds are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4sxlms\" data-start=\"3628\" data-end=\"3668\">Eligible Academic Backgrounds Include</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3845\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3677\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuwkdh\" data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3687\">B.Com</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ub0l3o\" data-start=\"3688\" data-end=\"3696\">B.Sc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3703\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"3704\" data-end=\"3711\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hnd5hy\" data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3727\">B.Tech / BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8ezea\" data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3749\">Commerce Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nj617f\" data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3770\">Science Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xqsf76\" data-start=\"3771\" data-end=\"3794\">Humanities Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kb4bqe\" data-start=\"3795\" data-end=\"3820\">Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4xjti\" data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3845\">Engineering Programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"3950\">This broad eligibility structure supports interdisciplinary learning and diverse business perspectives.</p>', '<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"538\">Understanding the complete MBA fee structure is one of the most important steps before taking admission into a postgraduate management program. Many students only compare tuition fees while ignoring additional academic expenses such as registration charges, examination fees, certification costs, technology requirements, project expenses, and long-term educational investment planning. This often creates financial pressure during the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"859\">The MBA program fee structure is designed to provide affordability and payment flexibility for Indian students, SAARC nation applicants, and international learners. Students can choose semester-wise, annual, or total program payment plans depending on their financial comfort, budgeting strategy, and educational goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1022\">Since MBA education is considered a long-term professional investment, students should evaluate the fee structure not only from a cost perspective but also from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1203\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1og6ns4\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1054\">Career growth opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ild5j5\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1082\">Skill development value</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fvqqz9\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1102\">Industry demand</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19s8fbl\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1126\">Placement potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w529pi\" data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1162\">Leadership development benefits</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r7e6la\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1203\">Long-term return on investment (ROI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1248\">This detailed fee structure guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1566\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n4jt2h\" data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1282\">Semester-wise MBA fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q9b1vi\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1313\">Annual and total fee plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aflusc\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1347\">Additional university charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ykevk\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1379\">SAARC student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q37kuk\" data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1413\">Foreign student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ea9u6h\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1464\">Hidden educational costs students often ignore</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h41z0t\" data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1509\">ROI analysis and career investment value</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s0f9wn\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1566\">Strategic financial planning advice for MBA students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1571\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jjnxcv\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1612\">MBA Fee Structure for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1749\">The university offers flexible payment options to make MBA education more accessible for students from different financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"f8bwvd\" data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1783\">Indian Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1907\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1806\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1806\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1796\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1806\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1907\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1848\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1837\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1848\">₹22,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1878\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1867\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1878\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹45,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1907\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1896\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1907\">₹90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1912\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rkz2z6\" data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1954\">Additional Charges for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2101\">Apart from the tuition fee, students should also consider additional university-related charges applicable separately during the course duration.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cws2c8\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2128\">Additional Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2250\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2161\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2161\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2151\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2161\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2250\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2212\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2202\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2212\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2250\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2240\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2250\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2255\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1657bl7\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2302\">MBA Fee Structure for SAARC Nation Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2408\">Students belonging to SAARC nations are eligible under a dedicated international fee structure category.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vz6nli\" data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2450\">Additional Charges for SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2561\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2483\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2483\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2473\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2473\" data-end=\"2483\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2561\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2513\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2523\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2561\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2551\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2561\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2566\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9weag4\" data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2608\">MBA Fee Structure for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2750\">The university also provides globally accessible MBA education for international learners through a dedicated foreign student fee structure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cgz08i\" data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2785\">Foreign Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2902\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2808\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2808\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2798\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2808\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2902\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2847\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2839\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2847\">$375</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2874\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2866\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2874\">$750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2902\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2892\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2902\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$1,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2907\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g7i4sp\" data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2950\">Additional Charges for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"3066\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"2983\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"2983\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"2973\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"2983\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3066\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3031\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3031\">$30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3066\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3059\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3066\">$60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"706\">The MBA program is one of the most career-focused and industry-relevant postgraduate management degrees designed to prepare students for leadership, strategic decision-making, business administration, entrepreneurship, analytics, operations, finance, marketing, and organizational management roles. In today&rsquo;s competitive business environment, companies are no longer looking only for theoretical graduates. Organizations increasingly prefer professionals who understand business strategy, analytics, financial systems, human resources, operations, and modern market dynamics together.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"784\">The MBA curriculum is carefully structured to help students gradually build:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"1035\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15by0fo\" data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"823\">Core business management knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ift60o\" data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"863\">Leadership and communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x6uyne\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"904\">Strategic decision-making capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pin4sj\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"942\">Analytical and research expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5jq1qs\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"988\">Industry specialization through electives</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mihywv\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1035\">Practical business problem-solving ability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1251\">Unlike short-term management certifications, the MBA program provides comprehensive exposure to multiple business domains, allowing students to develop both broad managerial understanding and specialized expertise.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1291\">This detailed syllabus guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13hixwl\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1334\">Semester-wise MBA curriculum structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nk009j\" data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1376\">Core management subjects and concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16kzo9\" data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1418\">Elective specialization opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"78rk9x\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1457\">Research-based learning components</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12sx8lq\" data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1496\">Industry-relevant skills developed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1idbpen\" data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1531\">Career opportunities after MBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"egpu6f\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1568\">Long-term value of MBA education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1573\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hy63ya\" data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1627\">1st Semester: Building Core Management Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1866\">The first semester focuses on building strong management fundamentals and analytical thinking skills. Students develop understanding of organizational systems, economics, business law, finance, statistics, and managerial decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"2025\">These foundational subjects are extremely important because advanced MBA learning depends heavily on managerial basics developed during the initial semester.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2030\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p6esba\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2058\">Subjects in 1st Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kw24ap\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2119\">1. Principles of Management and Organizational Behaviour</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2228\">This subject introduces students to the fundamentals of business management and organizational functioning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sghyn\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2252\">Key Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2396\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t5w526\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2278\">Management principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g1janp\" data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2300\">Leadership styles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im6e7f\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2329\">Organizational structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q6a0km\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2351\">Employee behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uh3hqe\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2371\">Team management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rnjiau\" data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2396\">Workplace motivation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wj9zye\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2431\">Why This Subject Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2624\">Organizations operate through people, processes, and leadership systems. Understanding employee behavior and management principles helps students become effective future managers and leaders.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2629\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uu301e\" data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2657\">2. Managerial Economics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2749\">This subject focuses on applying economic principles to managerial and business decisions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p766j1\" data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2775\">Major Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2898\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jh284l\" data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2806\">Demand and supply analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dhku7e\" data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2828\">Market structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xcc75m\" data-start=\"2829\" data-end=\"2850\">Consumer behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5q6rx9\" data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2873\">Pricing strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e6pbr0\" data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2898\">Economic forecasting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6slual\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2922\">Industry Relevance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"3041\">Managers regularly make decisions influenced by market trends, customer demand, competition, and economic conditions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3046\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kqxnpe\" data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3077\">3. Accounting for Managers</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3160\">Students learn financial management basics and organizational accounting systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3181\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3306\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ax4ily\" data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3214\">Financial statement analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tvcbp7\" data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3236\">Budgeting systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uck381\" data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3254\">Cost analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u49l1m\" data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3283\">Profitability evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1frs40s\" data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3306\">Financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16s060j\" data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3343\">Why Financial Knowledge Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3504\">Even non-finance managers must understand business financial performance because every organizational decision impacts costs, profits, and resource allocation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3506\" data-end=\"3509\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"bjfjsd\" data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3570\">4. Business Statistics and Analytics for Decision Making</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3659\">This subject develops quantitative analysis and data-driven decision-making capability.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"3661\" data-end=\"3681\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3826\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p7xbpd\" data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3706\">Statistical analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uvke42\" data-start=\"3707\" data-end=\"3730\">Data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tricxo\" data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3757\">Forecasting techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w3mg24\" data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3793\">Business analytics fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5mtaw5\" data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3826\">Quantitative problem-solving</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pw168d\" data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3858\">Future Industry Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3860\" data-end=\"3955\">Modern organizations increasingly rely on data analytics and evidence-based business decisions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"3960\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"st9e7p\" data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"3998\">5. Legal Environment for Business</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4000\" data-end=\"4087\">Students learn legal principles governing business operations and corporate activities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"4089\" data-end=\"4107\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4230\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gkdps0\" data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4137\">Business law fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zj2xr2\" data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4165\">Corporate legal systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7h3xeb\" data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4183\">Contract laws</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la10f3\" data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4209\">Regulatory frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qk9awm\" data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4230\">Legal compliance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k82apw\" data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4264\">Why This Subject Is Valuable</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4266\" data-end=\"4365\">Managers must understand legal frameworks to avoid regulatory risks and organizational liabilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4367\" data-end=\"4370\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16embh\" data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4433\">2nd Semester: Business Functions and Operational Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4435\" data-end=\"4602\">The second semester develops deeper understanding of major business functions such as marketing, finance, operations, analytics, human resources, and research systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4604\" data-end=\"4703\">This semester helps students connect theoretical management concepts with real business operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4705\" data-end=\"4708\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"i52xrs\" data-start=\"4710\" data-end=\"4736\">Subjects in 2nd Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"db624t\" data-start=\"4738\" data-end=\"4764\">1. Marketing Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4766\" data-end=\"4853\">This subject focuses on customer behavior, branding strategies, and market positioning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4877\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4878\" data-end=\"5020\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1afqh1x\" data-start=\"4878\" data-end=\"4901\">Consumer psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sylnxu\" data-start=\"4902\" data-end=\"4930\">Branding and advertising</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ca8xhb\" data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4959\">Digital marketing basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3s06q\" data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"4983\">Market segmentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc2pqz\" data-start=\"4984\" data-end=\"5020\">Customer relationship management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6slual\" data-start=\"5022\" data-end=\"5044\">Industry Relevance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5046\" data-end=\"5154\">Marketing plays a critical role in organizational growth, customer acquisition, and competitive positioning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5156\" data-end=\"5159\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dmbo8a\" data-start=\"5161\" data-end=\"5204\">2. Financial Markets &amp; Corporate Finance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5206\" data-end=\"5291\">Students gain understanding of financial systems and corporate investment management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"5293\" data-end=\"5311\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5312\" data-end=\"5431\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2z0bcm\" data-start=\"5312\" data-end=\"5333\">Financial markets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iqbu1y\" data-start=\"5334\" data-end=\"5357\">Corporate financing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fil5zo\" data-start=\"5358\" data-end=\"5383\">Investment strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ak0sbd\" data-start=\"5384\" data-end=\"5406\">Capital management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5gman2\" data-start=\"5407\" data-end=\"5431\">Risk-return analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aqi6he\" data-start=\"5433\" data-end=\"5461\">Why This Subject Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5463\" data-end=\"5556\">Financial decision-making is essential for business sustainability and organizational growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5558\" data-end=\"5561\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1umnn5q\" data-start=\"5563\" data-end=\"5594\">3. Human Resource Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5596\" data-end=\"5673\">This subject explains workforce management and organizational talent systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rev59q\" data-start=\"5675\" data-end=\"5693\">Major Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5694\" data-end=\"5822\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pgvv0f\" data-start=\"5694\" data-end=\"5723\">Recruitment and selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzk6ei\" data-start=\"5724\" data-end=\"5745\">Employee training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a19rpf\" data-start=\"5746\" data-end=\"5772\">Performance management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p9eq2a\" data-start=\"5773\" data-end=\"5799\">Organizational culture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4orsfd\" data-start=\"5800\" data-end=\"5822\">Workforce planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2hj4re\" data-start=\"5824\" data-end=\"5848\">Strategic Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5850\" data-end=\"5922\">Human resources are one of the most valuable assets of any organization.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5924\" data-end=\"5927\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hurg7e\" data-start=\"5929\" data-end=\"5956\">4. Operations Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5958\" data-end=\"6029\">Students learn operational systems and process optimization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"6031\" data-end=\"6051\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6052\" data-end=\"6187\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vrjus0\" data-start=\"6052\" data-end=\"6080\">Productivity improvement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ak4c8i\" data-start=\"6081\" data-end=\"6104\">Resource allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7p0jkg\" data-start=\"6105\" data-end=\"6127\">Process management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pfpd33\" data-start=\"6128\" data-end=\"6151\">Supply chain basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xciv5m\" data-start=\"6152\" data-end=\"6187\">Operational efficiency planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wji1vs\" data-start=\"6189\" data-end=\"6212\">Industry Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6214\" data-end=\"6299\">Efficient operations directly influence organizational performance and profitability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6301\" data-end=\"6304\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kvrhbh\" data-start=\"6306\" data-end=\"6337\">5. Business Research Methods</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6339\" data-end=\"6432\">This subject develops structured business research and analytical problem-solving capability.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"6434\" data-end=\"6453\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6454\" data-end=\"6564\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1skil7n\" data-start=\"6454\" data-end=\"6473\">Research design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ek4rpd\" data-start=\"6474\" data-end=\"6504\">Data collection techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q5png7\" data-start=\"6505\" data-end=\"6534\">Business problem analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x7351m\" data-start=\"6535\" data-end=\"6564\">Analytical interpretation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gc3hsw\" data-start=\"6566\" data-end=\"6596\">Why Research Skills Matter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6598\" data-end=\"6685\">Research capability helps managers make informed and evidence-based business decisions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6687\" data-end=\"6690\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yf17t9\" data-start=\"6692\" data-end=\"6716\">6. Business Analytics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6718\" data-end=\"6821\">Students learn how organizations use data analytics for strategic planning and operational improvement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8amtvm\" data-start=\"6823\" data-end=\"6839\">Key Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6840\" data-end=\"6961\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"141wnol\" data-start=\"6840\" data-end=\"6868\">Data analysis techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mhz41l\" data-start=\"6869\" data-end=\"6893\">Predictive analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uspotu\" data-start=\"6894\" data-end=\"6926\">Business intelligence basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"byywde\" data-start=\"6927\" data-end=\"6961\">Data-driven strategic planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"39fece\" data-start=\"6963\" data-end=\"6989\">Future Industry Demand</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6991\" data-end=\"7074\">Business analytics is becoming one of the most valuable management skills globally.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7076\" data-end=\"7079\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"njcuh5\" data-start=\"7081\" data-end=\"7145\">3rd Semester: Strategic Management and Elective Specialization</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7147\" data-end=\"7261\">The third semester focuses on strategic business understanding and specialized learning through elective subjects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7263\" data-end=\"7385\">At this stage, students begin developing domain-specific expertise according to their career interests and industry goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7387\" data-end=\"7390\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1prb879\" data-start=\"7392\" data-end=\"7418\">Subjects in 3rd Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mdvrrt\" data-start=\"7420\" data-end=\"7459\">1. Business Environment and Strategy</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7461\" data-end=\"7541\">This subject focuses on competitive strategy and organizational growth planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"7543\" data-end=\"7561\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7562\" data-end=\"7677\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gx0xcj\" data-start=\"7562\" data-end=\"7586\">Strategic management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m5rwv1\" data-start=\"7587\" data-end=\"7611\">Competitive analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p1yj70\" data-start=\"7612\" data-end=\"7637\">Business adaptability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wd6i6v\" data-start=\"7638\" data-end=\"7677\">Organizational strategy formulation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wj9zye\" data-start=\"7679\" data-end=\"7712\">Why This Subject Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7714\" data-end=\"7831\">Managers must understand how businesses respond to market competition, technological change, and economic challenges.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7833\" data-end=\"7836\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6uzsua\" data-start=\"7838\" data-end=\"7856\">2. Elective &ndash; I</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7858\" data-end=\"7935\">Students choose a specialization subject aligned with their career interests.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sks375\" data-start=\"7937\" data-end=\"7967\">Examples of Elective Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7968\" data-end=\"8115\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173ueww\" data-start=\"7968\" data-end=\"7979\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m6xjvw\" data-start=\"7980\" data-end=\"7993\">Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwwpym\" data-start=\"7994\" data-end=\"8013\">Human Resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"8014\" data-end=\"8036\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nyjb7y\" data-start=\"8037\" data-end=\"8051\">Operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"983wcy\" data-start=\"8052\" data-end=\"8077\">Healthcare Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"facnu9\" data-start=\"8078\" data-end=\"8115\">Information Technology Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8117\" data-end=\"8120\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e7dooa\" data-start=\"8122\" data-end=\"8141\">3. Elective &ndash; II</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8143\" data-end=\"8246\">The second elective allows students to deepen specialization knowledge and industry-specific expertise.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8248\" data-end=\"8251\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8tmfz8\" data-start=\"8253\" data-end=\"8273\">4. Elective &ndash; III</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8275\" data-end=\"8376\">Students continue advanced specialization learning and practical industry-oriented skill development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8378\" data-end=\"8381\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1035cad\" data-start=\"8383\" data-end=\"8416\">5. Research-Based Learning &ndash; I</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8418\" data-end=\"8527\">This research-oriented component introduces practical problem-solving and industry-based analytical learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"8529\" data-end=\"8541\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8542\" data-end=\"8674\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p35zns\" data-start=\"8542\" data-end=\"8564\">Practical exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n1w268\" data-start=\"8565\" data-end=\"8598\">Critical thinking development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixjs6z\" data-start=\"8599\" data-end=\"8631\">Industry research capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16vyqc2\" data-start=\"8632\" data-end=\"8674\">Analytical decision-making improvement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8676\" data-end=\"8679\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1njin7d\" data-start=\"8681\" data-end=\"8749\">4th Semester: Entrepreneurship, Advanced Specialization &amp; Research</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"8751\" data-end=\"8884\">The final semester focuses on advanced specialization, entrepreneurial capability, and practical application of management knowledge.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"8886\" data-end=\"8994\">Students integrate all previous learning into strategic leadership and research-oriented business solutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8996\" data-end=\"8999\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"m6dhgo\" data-start=\"9001\" data-end=\"9027\">Subjects in 4th Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19awuvc\" data-start=\"9029\" data-end=\"9063\">1. Entrepreneurship Development</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9065\" data-end=\"9152\">This subject focuses on innovation, startup management, and entrepreneurial leadership.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"9154\" data-end=\"9176\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9177\" data-end=\"9295\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcebe0\" data-start=\"9177\" data-end=\"9204\">Business model creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n666jp\" data-start=\"9205\" data-end=\"9240\">Startup ecosystem understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hhk6nq\" data-start=\"9241\" data-end=\"9266\">Innovation management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jm90tu\" data-start=\"9267\" data-end=\"9295\">Entrepreneurial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"p85i95\" data-start=\"9297\" data-end=\"9329\">Why Entrepreneurship Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9331\" data-end=\"9450\">The startup ecosystem is growing rapidly across industries, creating opportunities for innovation-driven professionals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9452\" data-end=\"9455\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6uzsua\" data-start=\"9457\" data-end=\"9475\">2. Elective &ndash; I</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9477\" data-end=\"9561\">Students continue advanced specialization learning aligned with their chosen domain.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9563\" data-end=\"9566\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e7dooa\" data-start=\"9568\" data-end=\"9587\">3. Elective &ndash; II</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9589\" data-end=\"9649\">This subject enhances industry-specific strategic expertise.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9651\" data-end=\"9654\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8tmfz8\" data-start=\"9656\" data-end=\"9676\">4. Elective &ndash; III</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9678\" data-end=\"9773\">The final elective develops deeper professional competency and practical managerial capability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9775\" data-end=\"9778\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ie3dy4\" data-start=\"9780\" data-end=\"9814\">5. Research-Based Learning &ndash; II</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9816\" data-end=\"9891\">Students continue applied research and business problem-solving activities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cjj316\" data-start=\"9893\" data-end=\"9932\">Benefits of Research-Based Learning</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9933\" data-end=\"10071\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"batg50\" data-start=\"9933\" data-end=\"9965\">Real-world industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rj19ca\" data-start=\"9966\" data-end=\"10004\">Professional portfolio development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m0o7e1\" data-start=\"10005\" data-end=\"10037\">Analytical skill enhancement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3vdls\" data-start=\"10038\" data-end=\"10071\">Strategic thinking capability</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 90000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(322, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 261, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 07:00:31', '2026-06-16 07:21:38', '<p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"610\">Enrolling in an MCA in Cyber Security program is an important career step for students and working professionals who want to build expertise in cybersecurity, ethical hacking, cloud security, network protection, blockchain systems, cryptography, and advanced digital defense technologies. However, many applicants face confusion during the admission process because they do not fully understand how online enrollment works, what documents are required, or how fee payment and verification procedures are completed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"965\">The online enrollment process is designed to provide a smooth, flexible, and fully digital admission experience for learners across India and international students. Since the entire process is conducted online, students can complete registration, application submission, document upload, and fee payment remotely without physically visiting the campus.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1007\">This detailed enrollment guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jgo5ny\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1070\">Complete MCA Cyber Security admission process step-by-step</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zry049\" data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1121\">Online registration and application procedures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vfbyfx\" data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1166\">Document upload and verification process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"no8wn6\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1206\">Fee payment methods and EMI options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u8bp4o\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1259\">Common enrollment mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9lpjr\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1300\">Hidden risks during online admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d3h02k\" data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1349\">Strategic admission tips for faster approval</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1354\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"t3lw6l\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1420\">Understanding the MCA Cyber Security Online Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1553\">The MCA Cyber Security admission system is fully online and designed for modern learners who require flexibility and accessibility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1597\">The enrollment process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1760\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r633i1\" data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1614\">Registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1af4njd\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1643\">Student account creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t46q9s\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1675\">Application form completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yylsws\" data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1697\">Program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f12ekk\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1717\">Document upload</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csrces\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1733\">Fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o227h4\" data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1760\">Admission verification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1814\">This digital structure is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1960\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1840\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19hdfr0\" data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1860\">Remote learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gimp1\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1895\">Students from different states</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tvf4t\" data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1924\">International applicants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wsn4ls\" data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1960\">Career-transition professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1965\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1puox4j\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2016\">Step 1: Visit the Vignan Online Enrollment Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2109\">The first step in the admission process is accessing the official online enrollment portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2128\">Students need to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2303\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a035jh\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2180\">Visit the official Vignan Online admission page</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzyxpe\" data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2232\">Click on the &ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo; or &ldquo;Enroll Now&rdquo; option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6r5ko\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2268\">Open the online enrollment form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aaic30\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2303\">Begin the registration process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2308\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o39v0r\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2339\">Why This Step Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2443\">Many students unknowingly use unofficial websites or unauthorized admission portals, which may create:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2563\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ddals\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2481\">Incorrect application submissions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4ruiu\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2505\">Payment fraud risks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v2cthx\" data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2531\">Data privacy concerns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlj2y4\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2563\">Admission processing delays</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2709\">Students should always verify that they are using the official university enrollment platform before entering personal or financial information.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2714\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kg91z5\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2776\">Information Students Should Keep Ready Before Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2905\">Preparing all required information in advance helps students complete the admission process smoothly and without interruptions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c5fod6\" data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2936\">Basic Information Required</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"3132\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mi9lua\" data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2975\">Full name as per academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mizif\" data-start=\"2976\" data-end=\"3000\">Active mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pp80n3\" data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3019\">Valid email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3037\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3057\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dnebzw\" data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3084\">Graduation information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3103\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3132\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3137\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"psychq\" data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3165\">Expert Admission Advice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3194\">Students should always use:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3259\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19w6v56\" data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3217\">An active email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0qt9v\" data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3259\">A frequently accessible mobile number</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3298\">because important updates related to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3433\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3325\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17351q3\" data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3350\">Fee payment receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sars2p\" data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3376\">LMS login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jmdcbh\" data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3406\">Examination notifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jxjo99\" data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3433\">Academic communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3471\">will be sent through these channels.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3476\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"c5gpum\" data-start=\"3478\" data-end=\"3531\">Step 2: Sign Up and Complete the Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3645\">After accessing the portal, students must create their online account and complete the admission form carefully.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3650\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iqj42j\" data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3681\">Create Your Student Account</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3727\">The registration process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3832\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e15fdm\" data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3757\">Entering personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jr0s2\" data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3788\">Creating login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zkzjzu\" data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3809\">OTP verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ujxzul\" data-start=\"3810\" data-end=\"3832\">Account activation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3929\">Once registration is completed successfully, students can proceed to the full application form.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"3934\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rmyoml\" data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"3977\">Complete the Essential Enrollment Steps</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4062\">The application form includes multiple sections that students must fill accurately.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4067\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cb15o8\" data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4100\">Personal Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4127\">Students need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4128\" data-end=\"4225\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2yru7\" data-start=\"4128\" data-end=\"4136\">Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4156\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19381gy\" data-start=\"4157\" data-end=\"4180\">Address information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4198\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vd6fls\" data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4225\">Identification details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4230\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ta2jvp\" data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4263\">Academic Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4287\">Applicants must enter:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4288\" data-end=\"4415\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"4288\" data-end=\"4310\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fde55\" data-start=\"4311\" data-end=\"4343\">Aggregate percentage or CGPA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdp0ww\" data-start=\"4344\" data-end=\"4370\">University information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lx9va\" data-start=\"4371\" data-end=\"4387\">Passing year</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0cc02\" data-start=\"4388\" data-end=\"4415\">Academic specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4417\" data-end=\"4512\">Students appearing in the final semester may also need to provide provisional academic records.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4514\" data-end=\"4517\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n3xcpd\" data-start=\"4519\" data-end=\"4539\">Program Selection</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4541\" data-end=\"4631\">Students must carefully select the MCA in Cyber Security specialization during enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1zi2k\" data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4666\">Why Program Selection Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4713\">The selected specialization directly affects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4714\" data-end=\"4853\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj5fkl\" data-start=\"4714\" data-end=\"4738\">Career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdy81l\" data-start=\"4739\" data-end=\"4770\">Technical skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvphi9\" data-start=\"4771\" data-end=\"4792\">Industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2fsfkx\" data-start=\"4793\" data-end=\"4819\">Certification pathways</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ot5agr\" data-start=\"4820\" data-end=\"4853\">Long-term professional growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4925\">This specialization is especially suitable for students interested in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4926\" data-end=\"5109\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cbw9tj\" data-start=\"4926\" data-end=\"4945\">Ethical hacking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qq839c\" data-start=\"4946\" data-end=\"4966\">Network security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2kmhb\" data-start=\"4967\" data-end=\"4985\">Cloud security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ahssa\" data-start=\"4986\" data-end=\"5008\">Blockchain systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d8s64d\" data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5039\">Cyber defense technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lqu98m\" data-start=\"5040\" data-end=\"5067\">Secure software systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p9jqi8\" data-start=\"5068\" data-end=\"5109\">Data protection and digital forensics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5111\" data-end=\"5114\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83j5nm\" data-start=\"5116\" data-end=\"5142\">Document Upload Process</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5144\" data-end=\"5186\">Students are generally required to upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5187\" data-end=\"5309\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134nxcp\" data-start=\"5187\" data-end=\"5213\">Graduation mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v45ing\" data-start=\"5214\" data-end=\"5261\">Degree certificate or provisional documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"5262\" data-end=\"5280\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"5281\" data-end=\"5309\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5311\" data-end=\"5314\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"d7hyu3\" data-start=\"5316\" data-end=\"5350\">Common Document Upload Mistakes</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5352\" data-end=\"5406\">Many applications are delayed because students upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5407\" data-end=\"5513\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43co8u\" data-start=\"5407\" data-end=\"5424\">Blurred scans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sx5g9z\" data-start=\"5425\" data-end=\"5451\">Incorrect file formats</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ib334\" data-start=\"5452\" data-end=\"5479\">Incomplete certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v0us2\" data-start=\"5480\" data-end=\"5513\">Unreadable academic documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5515\" data-end=\"5603\">Properly scanned and clearly visible documents improve verification speed significantly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5605\" data-end=\"5608\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vxyo72\" data-start=\"5610\" data-end=\"5639\">Step 3: Pay the Program Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5641\" data-end=\"5735\">After completing the enrollment form, students must pay the required fee to confirm admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5737\" data-end=\"5784\">The payment process is fully online and secure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5786\" data-end=\"5789\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pp6z2h\" data-start=\"5791\" data-end=\"5818\">Available Payment Methods</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5850\">Students can pay fees through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5851\" data-end=\"5935\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"5851\" data-end=\"5866\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"5867\" data-end=\"5881\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"5882\" data-end=\"5897\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sezyli\" data-start=\"5898\" data-end=\"5935\">Easy EMI Options with 0% Interest</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5937\" data-end=\"5940\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cprctf\" data-start=\"5942\" data-end=\"5980\">Understanding the EMI Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5982\" data-end=\"6028\">The EMI facility is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6029\" data-end=\"6159\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"6029\" data-end=\"6054\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ri80sk\" data-start=\"6055\" data-end=\"6098\">Students managing financial limitations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khgvkf\" data-start=\"6099\" data-end=\"6159\">Learners preferring installment-based payment structures</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17bfro3\" data-start=\"6161\" data-end=\"6187\">Benefits of EMI Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6189\" data-end=\"6302\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juc81q\" data-start=\"6189\" data-end=\"6227\">Reduced immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lvcttt\" data-start=\"6228\" data-end=\"6256\">Easier monthly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzih0q\" data-start=\"6257\" data-end=\"6302\">Better affordability for higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6304\" data-end=\"6307\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u202ba\" data-start=\"6309\" data-end=\"6358\">Important Financial Advice Before Choosing EMI</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6360\" data-end=\"6395\">Students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6396\" data-end=\"6522\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pfemi8\" data-start=\"6396\" data-end=\"6428\">Monthly repayment capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h8ds60\" data-start=\"6429\" data-end=\"6464\">Long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11tkeut\" data-start=\"6465\" data-end=\"6500\">Additional educational expenses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ltcrne\" data-start=\"6501\" data-end=\"6522\">Payment timelines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6524\" data-end=\"6613\">Even with 0% interest EMI options, proper financial planning remains extremely important.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"573\">Understanding the MCA in Cyber Security eligibility criteria is one of the most important steps before applying for admission. Many students focus mainly on placements, cybersecurity certifications, ethical hacking opportunities, salary packages, and future technology careers while overlooking detailed admission requirements. This often creates confusion during document verification, counseling, or final admission approval.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"665\">The MCA in Cyber Security program is designed to prepare students for advanced careers in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"871\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j9hbe9\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"683\">Cybersecurity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cbw9tj\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"703\">Ethical hacking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2kmhb\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"722\">Cloud security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2ri0l\" data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"745\">Network protection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tcx9ze\" data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"771\">Blockchain technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"145yre6\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"789\">Data security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5m5xvn\" data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"821\">Secure software development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cm38vf\" data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"871\">Threat intelligence and cyber defense systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"1169\">Since the curriculum combines advanced programming, network systems, operating systems, cloud computing, cryptography, and cybersecurity technologies, universities establish specific academic eligibility standards to ensure students are academically prepared for postgraduate technical education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1212\">This detailed eligibility guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1552\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rouitd\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1259\">Minimum educational qualification required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hcz6sx\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1300\">Aggregate marks eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixkcr6\" data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1333\">UGC recognition requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqw3f6\" data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1360\">SC/ST relaxation rules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wwtqi6\" data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1399\">Final semester student eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bv7gi9\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1433\">Accepted academic backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ev5oj9\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1485\">Common admission mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2tzsta\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1552\">Strategic admission insights for MCA Cyber Security applicants</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1557\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"f336s3\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1609\">Basic MCA in Cyber Security Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1725\">Students seeking admission to the MCA in Cyber Security program must fulfill the required academic qualifications.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z5vvlm\" data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1764\">Required Educational Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1924\">Applicants must have completed an <strong data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1845\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) Degree Program</strong> of a minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1886\">three years</strong> from a <strong data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1923\">UGC Recognized University</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"2053\">The bachelor&rsquo;s degree can belong to <strong data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1990\">any stream or discipline</strong>, allowing students from diverse academic backgrounds to apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2058\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ux6rxl\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2087\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2177\">Students must secure the required aggregate marks in their undergraduate degree program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ycqnta\" data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2216\">Category-Wise Eligibility Criteria</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2353\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2259\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2259\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2229\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2259\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Aggregate Required</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2353\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2312\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2289\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2312\" data-col-size=\"sm\">50% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2353\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2330\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SC/ST Category</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2353\" data-col-size=\"sm\">45% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2470\">A relaxation of 5% marks is provided to candidates belonging to SC/ST categories according to admission guidelines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2475\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xmefjw\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2520\">Final Semester Students Are Also Eligible</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2651\">Candidates currently appearing in the final semester of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree program are also eligible to apply for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fvye\" data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2700\">Important Guidelines for Final Year Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2740\">Students in the final semester should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2919\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edkzqf\" data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2797\">Submit available academic records during application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bzt13z\" data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2846\">Provide provisional certificates if required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12y4ecr\" data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2919\">Complete all degree requirements before final admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qspa7l\" data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2957\">Why This Provision Is Beneficial</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2983\">This allows students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3128\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1adgc7p\" data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3033\">Apply early without waiting for final results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgofck\" data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3082\">Participate in the admission process on time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nqm8qc\" data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3128\">Secure seats before competition increases</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3133\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1m8zall\" data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3174\">UGC Recognition Requirement Explained</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3296\">The undergraduate qualification must be obtained from a university recognized by the University Grants Commission (UGC).</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13c0ynd\" data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3333\">Why UGC Recognition Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3359\">UGC recognition ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3527\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wp36kb\" data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3395\">Academic validity of the degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wn6suh\" data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3431\">Acceptance for higher education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgnmsx\" data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3476\">Eligibility for employment opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncpjn\" data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3527\">Compliance with approved educational standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3591\">Students graduating from non-recognized institutions may face:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3686\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwrtt2\" data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3615\">Admission rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10l5zgo\" data-start=\"3616\" data-end=\"3646\">Verification complications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4bejac\" data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3686\">Employment-related challenges later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3688\" data-end=\"3691\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lztnlk\" data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3729\">Students from Any Stream Can Apply</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3908\">One of the biggest advantages of the MCA in Cyber Security program is its multidisciplinary accessibility. Students from various academic backgrounds are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4sxlms\" data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"3950\">Eligible Academic Backgrounds Include</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"4119\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"3959\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ub0l3o\" data-start=\"3960\" data-end=\"3968\">B.Sc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hnd5hy\" data-start=\"3969\" data-end=\"3984\">B.Tech / BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuwkdh\" data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"3994\">B.Com</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"4001\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kb4bqe\" data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4027\">Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nj617f\" data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4048\">Science Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8ezea\" data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4070\">Commerce Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4xjti\" data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4095\">Engineering Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xqsf76\" data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4119\">Humanities Programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4121\" data-end=\"4263\">This broad eligibility structure supports interdisciplinary learning and technology accessibility for students from multiple academic domains.</p>', '<p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"588\">Understanding the complete MCA in Cyber Security fee structure is one of the most important steps before taking admission into a postgraduate technology program. Many students only compare tuition fees while ignoring additional academic expenses such as registration charges, examination fees, certification costs, software tools, cybersecurity lab requirements, cloud platform access, and project development expenses. This often creates financial pressure during the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"679\">The MCA in Cyber Security program is designed to provide advanced technical education in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"860\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x8piuf\" data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"705\">Cybersecurity systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cbw9tj\" data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"725\">Ethical hacking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2kmhb\" data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"744\">Cloud security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tcx9ze\" data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"770\">Blockchain technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2ri0l\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"793\">Network protection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5m5xvn\" data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"825\">Secure software development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4axwqb\" data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"860\">Data security and cryptography</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"1223\">As cyber threats continue to increase globally, the demand for cybersecurity professionals is growing rapidly across industries including banking, healthcare, IT services, e-commerce, defense, cloud computing, and digital finance. Because of this strong industry demand, students should evaluate the fee structure not only from a cost perspective but also from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1og6ns4\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1255\">Career growth opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fvqqz9\" data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1275\">Industry demand</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdy81l\" data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1307\">Technical skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19s8fbl\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1331\">Placement potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18py66f\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1377\">Global cybersecurity career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r7e6la\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1418\">Long-term return on investment (ROI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1463\">This detailed fee structure guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1787\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gw52s1\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1512\">Semester-wise MCA Cyber Security fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ffjya\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1547\">Annual and total payment plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aflusc\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1581\">Additional university charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ykevk\" data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1613\">SAARC student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q37kuk\" data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1647\">Foreign student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zv2q7m\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1701\">Hidden educational expenses students often ignore</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5y1406\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1740\">ROI and career investment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"acf026\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1787\">Financial planning advice for MCA students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ilpybk\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1851\">MCA in Cyber Security Fee Structure for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1971\">The university offers flexible payment options to support affordability and financial convenience for Indian students.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"f8bwvd\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2005\">Indian Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2129\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2028\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2028\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2018\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2028\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2129\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2070\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2059\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2070\">₹22,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2100\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2089\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2100\">₹45,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2129\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2129\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2134\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rkz2z6\" data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2176\">Additional Charges for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2337\">Apart from the tuition fee, students should also consider additional academic and university-related charges applicable separately during the program duration.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cws2c8\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2364\">Additional Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2486\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2397\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2397\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2387\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2397\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2486\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2448\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2438\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2448\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2486\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2476\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2486\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2491\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"47abmo\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2546\">MCA Cyber Security Fee Structure for SAARC Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2634\">Students from SAARC nations are eligible under a dedicated international fee category.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vz6nli\" data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2676\">Additional Charges for SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2787\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2709\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2709\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2699\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2709\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2787\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2749\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2739\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2749\">₹2,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2787\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2777\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2787\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2792\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"i9z6mz\" data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2852\">MCA in Cyber Security Fee Structure for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2960\">The university also provides globally accessible online learning opportunities for international students.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cgz08i\" data-start=\"2962\" data-end=\"2995\">Foreign Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3112\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3018\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3018\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3008\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3018\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3112\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3057\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3049\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3057\">$375</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3084\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3076\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3084\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3112\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3102\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3112\" data-col-size=\"sm\">$1,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3117\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g7i4sp\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3160\">Additional Charges for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3276\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3193\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3193\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3183\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3193\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3276\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3241\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3234\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3241\">$30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3276\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3269\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3276\">$60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"739\">The MCA in Cyber Security is an advanced postgraduate program designed to prepare students for high-demand careers in cybersecurity, ethical hacking, network protection, cloud security, blockchain systems, data protection, and secure software development. As organizations rapidly shift toward digital infrastructure, cloud computing, AI-powered systems, and online financial transactions, cyber threats are becoming more sophisticated and dangerous. This has created massive global demand for cybersecurity professionals who can secure digital systems, prevent cyberattacks, and protect sensitive organizational data.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"868\">Unlike traditional computer application programs that focus mainly on software development, the MCA in Cyber Security combines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"1138\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mxymgk\" data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"907\">Core computer science fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d55p5p\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"942\">Advanced programming knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h51knx\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"970\">Data management systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12aitcl\" data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1011\">Network infrastructure understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rshfkh\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1042\">Cybersecurity technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ahssa\" data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1065\">Blockchain systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4b70h3\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1094\">Cloud security practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u3zcn\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1138\">Machine learning and analytics exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1226\">The semester-wise curriculum is carefully structured to help students gradually build:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1456\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rbqka\" data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1261\">Strong programming foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mh4puk\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1298\">System and network understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1amevby\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1335\">Advanced cybersecurity expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2jhp9g\" data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1370\">Cloud and blockchain knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5kxy6w\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1410\">Real-world cyber defense capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b7nhfx\" data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1456\">Industry-level project development skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1496\">This detailed syllabus guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1791\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nk319k\" data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1544\">Semester-wise MCA Cyber Security curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2nxyro\" data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1592\">Subject explanations and industry relevance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h3aaf\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1642\">Technical skills developed during the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nfb291\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1690\">Emerging cybersecurity technologies covered</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tyikmf\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1740\">Career opportunities after MCA Cyber Security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xmewgr\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1791\">Long-term demand in the cybersecurity industry</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1j3xx7f\" data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1867\">1st Semester: Building Strong Computing and Programming Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"2175\">The first semester focuses on creating a strong technical foundation in programming, operating systems, statistics, data structures, web technologies, and computer architecture. These subjects are extremely important because advanced cybersecurity systems depend heavily on core computer science knowledge.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2317\">Students first learn how computers, networks, software systems, and web applications function before moving into advanced security concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2322\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p6esba\" data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2350\">Subjects in 1st Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1x3rmd5\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2384\">1. Probability and Statistics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2465\">This subject develops analytical thinking and statistical reasoning capability.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2489\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2623\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"asedi0\" data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2512\">Probability theory</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p7xbpd\" data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2537\">Statistical analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uvke42\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2561\">Data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e4qedl\" data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2592\">Predictive modeling basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17wncn4\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2623\">Analytical problem-solving</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xddgdo\" data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2671\">Why This Subject Matters in Cyber Security</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2710\">Cybersecurity increasingly relies on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2823\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pyshv0\" data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2738\">Threat pattern analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nvgf5r\" data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2763\">Behavioral analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fgwlrf\" data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2791\">Risk assessment systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lrtm8i\" data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2823\">AI-driven attack prediction</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2927\">Statistical knowledge helps students understand cybersecurity analytics and anomaly detection systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2932\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"77efbe\" data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"2959\">2. C &amp; Data Structures</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"3045\">Students learn core programming concepts and efficient data organization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3065\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3196\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ec5g2u\" data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3096\">C programming fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"drty1l\" data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3124\">Arrays and linked lists</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hpbbzw\" data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3146\">Stacks and queues</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xi21k9\" data-start=\"3147\" data-end=\"3167\">Trees and graphs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rknykz\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3196\">Memory management basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wji1vs\" data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3221\">Industry Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3223\" data-end=\"3265\">Strong programming logic is essential for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3383\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1au0ebb\" data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3283\">Secure coding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m9rej\" data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3304\">Malware analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2n2mt\" data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3334\">Security tool development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cbw9tj\" data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3354\">Ethical hacking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5qv622\" data-start=\"3355\" data-end=\"3383\">Vulnerability assessment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3388\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6j6lb4\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3412\">3. Operating System</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3496\">This subject explains how computer systems manage hardware and software resources.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rev59q\" data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3516\">Major Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3626\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7p0jkg\" data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3539\">Process management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s8n96i\" data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3561\">Memory management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f728ig\" data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3578\">File systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zkjygo\" data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3602\">System architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ak4c8i\" data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3626\">Resource allocation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pwss2z\" data-start=\"3628\" data-end=\"3660\">Why This Subject Is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3757\">Cybersecurity professionals must understand operating systems because many cyberattacks target:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3862\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xsgt6u\" data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3780\">OS vulnerabilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4l7dji\" data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3809\">System-level permissions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10en8by\" data-start=\"3810\" data-end=\"3830\">Kernel processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g6mo87\" data-start=\"3831\" data-end=\"3862\">Resource management systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3864\" data-end=\"3867\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ko21x9\" data-start=\"3869\" data-end=\"3913\">4. Computer Architecture and Organization</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3985\">Students learn how computer hardware systems are designed and managed.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"3987\" data-end=\"4006\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4110\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m6uo17\" data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4033\">Processor architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bkbkl4\" data-start=\"4034\" data-end=\"4058\">Input/output systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fx4yny\" data-start=\"4059\" data-end=\"4079\">Memory hierarchy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nzzppk\" data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4110\">Digital logic fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9jtzb2\" data-start=\"4112\" data-end=\"4139\">Cybersecurity Relevance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4141\" data-end=\"4195\">Understanding system architecture helps professionals:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4196\" data-end=\"4303\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11xr81s\" data-start=\"4196\" data-end=\"4233\">Identify hardware vulnerabilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h2wg21\" data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4266\">Analyze system-level attacks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wz5g77\" data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4303\">Improve secure computing systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4305\" data-end=\"4308\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yy3yge\" data-start=\"4310\" data-end=\"4332\">5. Web Technologies</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4334\" data-end=\"4411\">This subject introduces website development and web application technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"4413\" data-end=\"4435\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4549\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rxkx8\" data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4468\">HTML, CSS, JavaScript basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nfnl9q\" data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4484\">Web servers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16klt4v\" data-start=\"4485\" data-end=\"4519\">Front-end and back-end systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13da60n\" data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4549\">Web application structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aqi6he\" data-start=\"4551\" data-end=\"4579\">Why This Subject Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4581\" data-end=\"4617\">Modern cyber threats heavily target:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4618\" data-end=\"4695\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"96qe74\" data-start=\"4618\" data-end=\"4630\">Websites</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ff1wx\" data-start=\"4631\" data-end=\"4651\">Web applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l680rv\" data-start=\"4652\" data-end=\"4672\">Online platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a3atgr\" data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4695\">E-commerce systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4697\" data-end=\"4791\">Understanding web technologies is essential for web security analysis and penetration testing.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4793\" data-end=\"4796\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tl9qol\" data-start=\"4798\" data-end=\"4860\">2nd Semester: Core Software Development and Database Systems</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4862\" data-end=\"5065\">The second semester focuses on algorithms, databases, software engineering, and modern programming languages. Students develop deeper understanding of application development and secure software systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5067\" data-end=\"5070\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"i52xrs\" data-start=\"5072\" data-end=\"5098\">Subjects in 2nd Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e4fs10\" data-start=\"5100\" data-end=\"5139\">1. Design and Analysis of Algorithms</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5141\" data-end=\"5220\">Students learn efficient problem-solving and algorithm optimization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"5222\" data-end=\"5240\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5241\" data-end=\"5347\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jttlyt\" data-start=\"5241\" data-end=\"5261\">Algorithm design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l377ge\" data-start=\"5262\" data-end=\"5285\">Complexity analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17z2pug\" data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5322\">Searching and sorting techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a0uit\" data-start=\"5323\" data-end=\"5347\">Optimization methods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x1mrd7\" data-start=\"5349\" data-end=\"5377\">Cybersecurity Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5379\" data-end=\"5408\">Algorithms are essential for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5409\" data-end=\"5529\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gtn69\" data-start=\"5409\" data-end=\"5431\">Encryption systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mst646\" data-start=\"5432\" data-end=\"5458\">Cyber threat detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"awjmmh\" data-start=\"5459\" data-end=\"5492\">Secure authentication systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1njhsi7\" data-start=\"5493\" data-end=\"5529\">AI-based cybersecurity solutions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5531\" data-end=\"5534\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pm23ii\" data-start=\"5536\" data-end=\"5568\">2. Database Management System</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5570\" data-end=\"5643\">This subject focuses on data storage and database administration systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rev59q\" data-start=\"5645\" data-end=\"5663\">Major Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5664\" data-end=\"5782\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bfesqn\" data-start=\"5664\" data-end=\"5683\">SQL programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13xezb3\" data-start=\"5684\" data-end=\"5703\">Database design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hh9mud\" data-start=\"5704\" data-end=\"5726\">Data normalization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3cgi67\" data-start=\"5727\" data-end=\"5753\">Transaction management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uioquq\" data-start=\"5754\" data-end=\"5782\">Database security basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6slual\" data-start=\"5784\" data-end=\"5806\">Industry Relevance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5808\" data-end=\"5931\">Organizations store sensitive business and customer information in databases, making database security extremely important.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5933\" data-end=\"5936\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ydam7i\" data-start=\"5938\" data-end=\"5964\">3. Software Engineering</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5966\" data-end=\"6047\">Students learn software development methodologies and project management systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"6049\" data-end=\"6068\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6069\" data-end=\"6186\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"125ofaa\" data-start=\"6069\" data-end=\"6103\">Software development lifecycle</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11i31l1\" data-start=\"6104\" data-end=\"6128\">Requirement analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10vd5ib\" data-start=\"6129\" data-end=\"6154\">Testing and debugging</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9094vp\" data-start=\"6155\" data-end=\"6186\">Agile development practices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aqi6he\" data-start=\"6188\" data-end=\"6216\">Why This Subject Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6218\" data-end=\"6254\">Secure software engineering reduces:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6255\" data-end=\"6339\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4zctc\" data-start=\"6255\" data-end=\"6286\">Application vulnerabilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q5fzgf\" data-start=\"6287\" data-end=\"6309\">Security loopholes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jdmmia\" data-start=\"6310\" data-end=\"6339\">Exploitable coding errors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6341\" data-end=\"6344\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13o0yvu\" data-start=\"6346\" data-end=\"6368\">4. Java Programming</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6370\" data-end=\"6436\">Students gain expertise in object-oriented programming using Java.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"6438\" data-end=\"6458\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6459\" data-end=\"6556\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5j2ciz\" data-start=\"6459\" data-end=\"6475\">OOP concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ksxlv4\" data-start=\"6476\" data-end=\"6498\">Exception handling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5r5yr3\" data-start=\"6499\" data-end=\"6517\">Multithreading</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tvdmqc\" data-start=\"6518\" data-end=\"6556\">Enterprise application development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wji1vs\" data-start=\"6558\" data-end=\"6581\">Industry Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6583\" data-end=\"6606\">Java is widely used in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6607\" data-end=\"6719\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ti59s4\" data-start=\"6607\" data-end=\"6638\">Enterprise software systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gp18p3\" data-start=\"6639\" data-end=\"6663\">Banking applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v1m4zs\" data-start=\"6664\" data-end=\"6694\">Secure backend development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lj0256\" data-start=\"6695\" data-end=\"6719\">Android applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6721\" data-end=\"6724\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"g7s9ir\" data-start=\"6726\" data-end=\"6750\">5. Python Programming</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6752\" data-end=\"6824\">This subject introduces Python-based programming and automation systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"6826\" data-end=\"6848\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6849\" data-end=\"6953\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l41v7r\" data-start=\"6849\" data-end=\"6880\">Python syntax and libraries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c6eik8\" data-start=\"6881\" data-end=\"6905\">Automation scripting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12dc0w3\" data-start=\"6906\" data-end=\"6930\">Data analysis basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1flfhzl\" data-start=\"6931\" data-end=\"6953\">Security scripting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10nbi50\" data-start=\"6955\" data-end=\"6998\">Why Python Is Valuable in Cybersecurity</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7000\" data-end=\"7027\">Python is heavily used for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7028\" data-end=\"7150\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xpuxy4\" data-start=\"7028\" data-end=\"7053\">Ethical hacking tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vd5hac\" data-start=\"7054\" data-end=\"7088\">Penetration testing automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o26fge\" data-start=\"7089\" data-end=\"7116\">Cybersecurity scripting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11hnkmo\" data-start=\"7117\" data-end=\"7150\">Machine learning applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7152\" data-end=\"7155\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10ri2w4\" data-start=\"7157\" data-end=\"7217\">3rd Semester: Advanced Networking, AI &amp; Cloud Technologies</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7219\" data-end=\"7369\">The third semester introduces advanced technologies such as cloud computing, machine learning, big data analytics, networking, and data visualization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7371\" data-end=\"7442\">This semester bridges cybersecurity with emerging digital technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7444\" data-end=\"7447\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1prb879\" data-start=\"7449\" data-end=\"7475\">Subjects in 3rd Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"lnpwds\" data-start=\"7477\" data-end=\"7500\">1. Computer Networks</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7502\" data-end=\"7577\">Students learn communication systems and network infrastructure management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"7579\" data-end=\"7597\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7598\" data-end=\"7698\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lyrfo3\" data-start=\"7598\" data-end=\"7619\">Network protocols</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hmlfjh\" data-start=\"7620\" data-end=\"7645\">Routing and switching</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lw6kug\" data-start=\"7646\" data-end=\"7672\">Wireless communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mfecp2\" data-start=\"7673\" data-end=\"7698\">Internet architecture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x1mrd7\" data-start=\"7700\" data-end=\"7728\">Cybersecurity Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7730\" data-end=\"7853\">Most cyberattacks occur through network vulnerabilities, making network understanding essential for security professionals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7855\" data-end=\"7858\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4j45xv\" data-start=\"7860\" data-end=\"7884\">2. Big Data Analytics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7886\" data-end=\"7959\">This subject focuses on large-scale data processing and analysis systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rev59q\" data-start=\"7961\" data-end=\"7979\">Major Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7980\" data-end=\"8088\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ggkr8b\" data-start=\"7980\" data-end=\"8003\">Big data frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xawozg\" data-start=\"8004\" data-end=\"8034\">Data processing techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"haj72g\" data-start=\"8035\" data-end=\"8056\">Analytics systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g3gop9\" data-start=\"8057\" data-end=\"8088\">Data-driven decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6slual\" data-start=\"8090\" data-end=\"8112\">Industry Relevance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8114\" data-end=\"8219\">Cybersecurity systems increasingly analyze massive volumes of security logs and threat intelligence data.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8221\" data-end=\"8224\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rfzaaa\" data-start=\"8226\" data-end=\"8250\">3. Data Visualization</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8252\" data-end=\"8315\">Students learn techniques for presenting complex data visually.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"8317\" data-end=\"8337\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8338\" data-end=\"8440\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4almn9\" data-start=\"8338\" data-end=\"8360\">Dashboard creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kv7iqc\" data-start=\"8361\" data-end=\"8392\">Security data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w8dib7\" data-start=\"8393\" data-end=\"8411\">Trend analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmyero\" data-start=\"8412\" data-end=\"8440\">Visual reporting systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aqi6he\" data-start=\"8442\" data-end=\"8470\">Why This Subject Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8472\" data-end=\"8520\">Cybersecurity analysts use visual dashboards to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8521\" data-end=\"8601\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pv7c67\" data-start=\"8521\" data-end=\"8540\">Monitor attacks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pm7els\" data-start=\"8541\" data-end=\"8573\">Track system vulnerabilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rpmsp\" data-start=\"8574\" data-end=\"8601\">Analyze threat patterns</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8603\" data-end=\"8606\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"112ij4e\" data-start=\"8608\" data-end=\"8630\">4. Machine Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8632\" data-end=\"8700\">This subject introduces AI-powered systems and predictive analytics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"8702\" data-end=\"8721\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8722\" data-end=\"8813\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"us53jk\" data-start=\"8722\" data-end=\"8745\">Supervised learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jn86sr\" data-start=\"8746\" data-end=\"8771\">Unsupervised learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ndk8dc\" data-start=\"8772\" data-end=\"8795\">Predictive modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jhpi4\" data-start=\"8796\" data-end=\"8813\">AI algorithms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19osldi\" data-start=\"8815\" data-end=\"8845\">Cybersecurity Applications</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8847\" data-end=\"8876\">Machine learning is used for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8877\" data-end=\"8972\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"172oaft\" data-start=\"8877\" data-end=\"8897\">Threat detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xpqen7\" data-start=\"8898\" data-end=\"8917\">Fraud detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vaeuqk\" data-start=\"8918\" data-end=\"8940\">Malware prediction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b4i9zy\" data-start=\"8941\" data-end=\"8972\">Intrusion detection systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8974\" data-end=\"8977\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gnefz3\" data-start=\"8979\" data-end=\"9000\">5. Cloud Computing</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9002\" data-end=\"9067\">Students learn cloud infrastructure and cloud service management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"9069\" data-end=\"9091\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9092\" data-end=\"9188\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j3b2t\" data-start=\"9092\" data-end=\"9111\">Cloud platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1du0493\" data-start=\"9112\" data-end=\"9130\">Virtualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ipuaba\" data-start=\"9131\" data-end=\"9156\">Cloud storage systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwai8r\" data-start=\"9157\" data-end=\"9188\">Cloud security fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wji1vs\" data-start=\"9190\" data-end=\"9213\">Industry Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9215\" data-end=\"9345\">Organizations increasingly depend on cloud infrastructure, making cloud security one of the fastest-growing cybersecurity domains.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9347\" data-end=\"9350\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a11bq3\" data-start=\"9352\" data-end=\"9417\">4th Semester: Advanced Security Technologies &amp; Industry Project</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9419\" data-end=\"9526\">The final semester focuses on specialized cybersecurity technologies and real-world project implementation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"9528\" data-end=\"9634\">Students apply all previous learning to practical cybersecurity systems and research-oriented development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9636\" data-end=\"9639\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"m6dhgo\" data-start=\"9641\" data-end=\"9667\">Subjects in 4th Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wbcwgf\" data-start=\"9669\" data-end=\"9708\">1. Cryptography and Network Security</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9710\" data-end=\"9778\">This subject focuses on encryption and secure communication systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"9780\" data-end=\"9798\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9799\" data-end=\"9921\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tni2pn\" data-start=\"9799\" data-end=\"9824\">Encryption algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1683p5a\" data-start=\"9825\" data-end=\"9859\">Public and private key systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j89wmy\" data-start=\"9860\" data-end=\"9894\">Secure communication protocols</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dja2ou\" data-start=\"9895\" data-end=\"9921\">Authentication systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pwss2z\" data-start=\"9923\" data-end=\"9955\">Why This Subject Is Critical</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9957\" data-end=\"9992\">Cryptography forms the backbone of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9993\" data-end=\"10103\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rfjgjz\" data-start=\"9993\" data-end=\"10019\">Secure banking systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hwq5bv\" data-start=\"10020\" data-end=\"10040\">Digital payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199yioj\" data-start=\"10041\" data-end=\"10075\">Secure communication platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g7ykzx\" data-start=\"10076\" data-end=\"10103\">Data protection systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10105\" data-end=\"10108\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w0m197\" data-start=\"10110\" data-end=\"10138\">2. Block Chain Technology</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"10140\" data-end=\"10220\">Students learn decentralized digital ledger systems and blockchain architecture.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rev59q\" data-start=\"10222\" data-end=\"10240\">Major Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10241\" data-end=\"10335\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gajkgp\" data-start=\"10241\" data-end=\"10265\">Blockchain structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a40e11\" data-start=\"10266\" data-end=\"10291\">Cryptocurrency basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"erh9ow\" data-start=\"10292\" data-end=\"10311\">Smart contracts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iat5gt\" data-start=\"10312\" data-end=\"10335\">Distributed systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"39fece\" data-start=\"10337\" data-end=\"10363\">Future Industry Demand</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10365\" data-end=\"10407\">Blockchain technology is expanding across:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10408\" data-end=\"10478\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173ueww\" data-start=\"10408\" data-end=\"10419\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16igutd\" data-start=\"10420\" data-end=\"10434\">Healthcare</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1396vqd\" data-start=\"10435\" data-end=\"10452\">Supply chains</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x8piuf\" data-start=\"10453\" data-end=\"10478\">Cybersecurity systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10480\" data-end=\"10483\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11cgxa9\" data-start=\"10485\" data-end=\"10505\">3. Cyber Security</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"10507\" data-end=\"10591\">This subject focuses on advanced cybersecurity practices and threat defense systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"10593\" data-end=\"10612\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10613\" data-end=\"10729\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cbw9tj\" data-start=\"10613\" data-end=\"10632\">Ethical hacking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ftcygr\" data-start=\"10633\" data-end=\"10656\">Penetration testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hv755x\" data-start=\"10657\" data-end=\"10678\">Threat management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjj761\" data-start=\"10679\" data-end=\"10705\">Cyberattack prevention</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l3cm41\" data-start=\"10706\" data-end=\"10729\">Security frameworks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16dpikw\" data-start=\"10731\" data-end=\"10752\">Career Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10754\" data-end=\"10831\">This subject directly prepares students for professional cybersecurity roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10833\" data-end=\"10836\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rwabai\" data-start=\"10838\" data-end=\"10851\">4. Project</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"10853\" data-end=\"10971\">The final project allows students to implement practical cybersecurity solutions using industry-relevant technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9b5vm3\" data-start=\"10973\" data-end=\"11006\">Benefits of the Final Project</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11007\" data-end=\"11138\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ug09iv\" data-start=\"11007\" data-end=\"11046\">Practical implementation experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0udj5\" data-start=\"11047\" data-end=\"11072\">Portfolio development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k7e388\" data-start=\"11073\" data-end=\"11103\">Problem-solving capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"192hhe2\" data-start=\"11104\" data-end=\"11138\">Industry readiness improvement</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 90000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(323, 72, 'fd1d822f-671c-42d9-8bdb-d5e38c1f4984', '2ac12cbc-f576-4f3e-ac75-32c294b85601', 239, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-07 07:10:00', '2026-06-16 07:22:00', '<p data-start=\"124\" data-end=\"690\">Enrolling in an MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning program is a major career step for students and working professionals who want to build expertise in AI technologies, machine learning systems, data science, predictive analytics, intelligent automation, natural language processing, and next-generation software development. However, many applicants face confusion during the admission process because they do not fully understand how online enrollment works, what documents are required, or how fee payment and verification procedures are completed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"1036\">The online enrollment system is designed to provide a smooth, flexible, and fully digital admission experience for learners across India and international students. Since the complete process is conducted online, students can register, upload documents, select their specialization, and pay fees remotely without physically visiting the campus.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1078\">This detailed enrollment guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1413\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cxp94o\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1134\">Complete MCA AI &amp; ML admission process step-by-step</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zry049\" data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1185\">Online registration and application procedures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vfbyfx\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1230\">Document upload and verification process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"no8wn6\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1270\">Fee payment methods and EMI options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u8bp4o\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1323\">Common enrollment mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9lpjr\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1364\">Hidden risks during online admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d3h02k\" data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1413\">Strategic admission tips for faster approval</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12rzm9n\" data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1477\">Understanding the MCA AI &amp; ML Online Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1642\">The MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning admission process is fully online and designed for modern learners who require flexibility and accessibility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1686\">The enrollment process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1849\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r633i1\" data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1703\">Registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1af4njd\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1732\">Student account creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t46q9s\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1764\">Application form completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yylsws\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1786\">Program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f12ekk\" data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1806\">Document upload</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csrces\" data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1822\">Fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o227h4\" data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1849\">Admission verification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1910\">This digital admission system is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"2056\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1936\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19hdfr0\" data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1956\">Remote learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gimp1\" data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1991\">Students from different states</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tvf4t\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2020\">International applicants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wsn4ls\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2056\">Career-transition professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2061\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1puox4j\" data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2112\">Step 1: Visit the Vignan Online Enrollment Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2205\">The first step in the admission process is accessing the official online enrollment portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2224\">Students need to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2403\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"196ucap\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2280\">Visit the official Vignan Online admission platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzyxpe\" data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2332\">Click on the &ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo; or &ldquo;Enroll Now&rdquo; option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6r5ko\" data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2368\">Open the online enrollment form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aaic30\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2403\">Begin the registration process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2408\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1r7vydk\" data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2449\">Why This Step Is Extremely Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2542\">Many students unknowingly use unofficial websites or third-party portals, which may create:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2651\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ddals\" data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2580\">Incorrect application submissions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4ruiu\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2604\">Payment fraud risks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v2cthx\" data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2630\">Data privacy concerns</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dop95z\" data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2651\">Admission delays</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2795\">Students should always verify that they are using the official university enrollment system before entering personal or financial information.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2800\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kg91z5\" data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2862\">Information Students Should Keep Ready Before Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2864\" data-end=\"2991\">Preparing all required information in advance helps students complete the admission process smoothly and without interruptions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c5fod6\" data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3022\">Basic Information Required</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3218\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mi9lua\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3061\">Full name as per academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mizif\" data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3086\">Active mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pp80n3\" data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3105\">Valid email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3123\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15di1ss\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3143\">Address details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dnebzw\" data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3170\">Graduation information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3189\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3218\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3223\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"psychq\" data-start=\"3225\" data-end=\"3251\">Expert Admission Advice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3280\">Students should always use:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3345\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0qt9v\" data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3322\">A frequently accessible mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19w6v56\" data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3345\">An active email ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3384\">because important updates related to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3519\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3411\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17351q3\" data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3436\">Fee payment receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sars2p\" data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3462\">LMS login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jmdcbh\" data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3492\">Examination notifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jxjo99\" data-start=\"3493\" data-end=\"3519\">Academic communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3557\">will be sent through these channels.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3562\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"c5gpum\" data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3617\">Step 2: Sign Up and Complete the Enrollment Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3619\" data-end=\"3731\">After accessing the portal, students must create their online account and complete the admission form carefully.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3733\" data-end=\"3736\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iqj42j\" data-start=\"3738\" data-end=\"3767\">Create Your Student Account</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3769\" data-end=\"3813\">The registration process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3918\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e15fdm\" data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3843\">Entering personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jr0s2\" data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3874\">Creating login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zkzjzu\" data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3895\">OTP verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ujxzul\" data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"3918\">Account activation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3920\" data-end=\"4019\">Once registration is completed successfully, students can proceed to the complete application form.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4024\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rmyoml\" data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4067\">Complete the Essential Enrollment Steps</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4152\">The application form includes multiple sections that students must fill accurately.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4154\" data-end=\"4157\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cb15o8\" data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4190\">Personal Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4192\" data-end=\"4217\">Students need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4218\" data-end=\"4315\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2yru7\" data-start=\"4218\" data-end=\"4226\">Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4246\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19381gy\" data-start=\"4247\" data-end=\"4270\">Address information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y682wg\" data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4288\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vd6fls\" data-start=\"4289\" data-end=\"4315\">Identification details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4317\" data-end=\"4320\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ta2jvp\" data-start=\"4322\" data-end=\"4353\">Academic Information Section</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4377\">Applicants must enter:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4378\" data-end=\"4505\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"4378\" data-end=\"4400\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fde55\" data-start=\"4401\" data-end=\"4433\">Aggregate percentage or CGPA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdp0ww\" data-start=\"4434\" data-end=\"4460\">University information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lx9va\" data-start=\"4461\" data-end=\"4477\">Passing year</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0cc02\" data-start=\"4478\" data-end=\"4505\">Academic specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4507\" data-end=\"4659\">Candidates appearing for the final semester of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree are also eligible to apply and may need to upload provisional academic documents.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4661\" data-end=\"4664\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n3xcpd\" data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4686\">Program Selection</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4806\">Students must carefully select the MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning specialization during enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1zi2k\" data-start=\"4808\" data-end=\"4841\">Why Program Selection Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4843\" data-end=\"4888\">The selected specialization directly affects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4889\" data-end=\"5030\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj5fkl\" data-start=\"4889\" data-end=\"4913\">Career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fdy81l\" data-start=\"4914\" data-end=\"4945\">Technical skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvphi9\" data-start=\"4946\" data-end=\"4967\">Industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wszs8a\" data-start=\"4968\" data-end=\"4996\">AI project opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ot5agr\" data-start=\"4997\" data-end=\"5030\">Long-term professional growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5032\" data-end=\"5102\">This specialization is especially suitable for students interested in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5103\" data-end=\"5274\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajo29n\" data-start=\"5103\" data-end=\"5130\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ob487t\" data-start=\"5131\" data-end=\"5151\">Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"32no5o\" data-start=\"5152\" data-end=\"5168\">Data Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jymbcy\" data-start=\"5169\" data-end=\"5191\">Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"70b0ow\" data-start=\"5192\" data-end=\"5215\">Predictive Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12lvq0g\" data-start=\"5216\" data-end=\"5242\">Intelligent Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixvwdf\" data-start=\"5243\" data-end=\"5274\">AI-Powered Business Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5276\" data-end=\"5279\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"83j5nm\" data-start=\"5281\" data-end=\"5307\">Document Upload Process</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5309\" data-end=\"5351\">Students are generally required to upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5352\" data-end=\"5474\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134nxcp\" data-start=\"5352\" data-end=\"5378\">Graduation mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v45ing\" data-start=\"5379\" data-end=\"5426\">Degree certificate or provisional documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"5427\" data-end=\"5445\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"5446\" data-end=\"5474\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5476\" data-end=\"5479\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"d7hyu3\" data-start=\"5481\" data-end=\"5515\">Common Document Upload Mistakes</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5517\" data-end=\"5571\">Many applications are delayed because students upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5572\" data-end=\"5678\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43co8u\" data-start=\"5572\" data-end=\"5589\">Blurred scans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sx5g9z\" data-start=\"5590\" data-end=\"5616\">Incorrect file formats</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"87e7z9\" data-start=\"5617\" data-end=\"5653\">Incomplete academic certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i8t4if\" data-start=\"5654\" data-end=\"5678\">Unreadable documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5680\" data-end=\"5768\">Properly scanned and clearly visible documents improve verification speed significantly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5770\" data-end=\"5773\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vxyo72\" data-start=\"5775\" data-end=\"5804\">Step 3: Pay the Program Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5806\" data-end=\"5900\">After completing the enrollment form, students must pay the required fee to confirm admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5902\" data-end=\"5949\">The payment process is fully online and secure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5951\" data-end=\"5954\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pp6z2h\" data-start=\"5956\" data-end=\"5983\">Available Payment Methods</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5985\" data-end=\"6015\">Students can pay fees through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6016\" data-end=\"6100\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181u65t\" data-start=\"6016\" data-end=\"6031\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124dfgi\" data-start=\"6032\" data-end=\"6046\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f8o4x\" data-start=\"6047\" data-end=\"6062\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sezyli\" data-start=\"6063\" data-end=\"6100\">Easy EMI Options with 0% Interest</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6102\" data-end=\"6105\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cprctf\" data-start=\"6107\" data-end=\"6145\">Understanding the EMI Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6147\" data-end=\"6193\">The EMI facility is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6194\" data-end=\"6324\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"6194\" data-end=\"6219\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ri80sk\" data-start=\"6220\" data-end=\"6263\">Students managing financial limitations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khgvkf\" data-start=\"6264\" data-end=\"6324\">Learners preferring installment-based payment structures</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17bfro3\" data-start=\"6326\" data-end=\"6352\">Benefits of EMI Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6354\" data-end=\"6467\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1juc81q\" data-start=\"6354\" data-end=\"6392\">Reduced immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lvcttt\" data-start=\"6393\" data-end=\"6421\">Easier monthly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzih0q\" data-start=\"6422\" data-end=\"6467\">Better affordability for higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6469\" data-end=\"6472\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"u202ba\" data-start=\"6474\" data-end=\"6523\">Important Financial Advice Before Choosing EMI</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6525\" data-end=\"6560\">Students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6561\" data-end=\"6687\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pfemi8\" data-start=\"6561\" data-end=\"6593\">Monthly repayment capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h8ds60\" data-start=\"6594\" data-end=\"6629\">Long-term financial commitments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11tkeut\" data-start=\"6630\" data-end=\"6665\">Additional educational expenses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ltcrne\" data-start=\"6666\" data-end=\"6687\">Payment timelines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6689\" data-end=\"6778\">Even with 0% interest EMI options, proper financial planning remains extremely important.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"632\">Understanding the MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning eligibility criteria is one of the most important steps before applying for admission. Many students focus mainly on placements, AI technologies, machine learning tools, salary packages, and future career opportunities while ignoring detailed admission requirements. This often creates confusion during application submission, document verification, counseling, or final admission approval.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"717\">The MCA in AI &amp; ML program is designed to prepare students for advanced careers in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajo29n\" data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"745\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ob487t\" data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"766\">Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"32no5o\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"783\">Data Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jymbcy\" data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"806\">Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fw7tpc\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"838\">Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12lvq0g\" data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"865\">Intelligent Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xzd9sp\" data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"890\">Predictive Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jnqw33\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"926\">AI-Powered Software Development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"1255\">Since the curriculum combines advanced programming, mathematics, data science, machine learning algorithms, database systems, cloud technologies, and intelligent automation systems, universities establish specific academic eligibility standards to ensure students are academically prepared for postgraduate technical education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1298\">This detailed eligibility guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1631\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rouitd\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1345\">Minimum educational qualification required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hcz6sx\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1386\">Aggregate marks eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixkcr6\" data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1419\">UGC recognition requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqw3f6\" data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1446\">SC/ST relaxation rules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wwtqi6\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1485\">Final semester student eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bv7gi9\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1519\">Accepted academic backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ev5oj9\" data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1571\">Common admission mistakes students should avoid</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fjajew\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1631\">Strategic admission insights for MCA AI &amp; ML applicants</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1636\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4cpudh\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1681\">Basic MCA in AI &amp; ML Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1825\">Students seeking admission to the MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning program must fulfill the required academic qualifications.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z5vvlm\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1864\">Required Educational Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"2024\">Applicants must have completed an <strong data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1945\">Undergraduate (Bachelor&rsquo;s) Degree Program</strong> of a minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1986\">three years</strong> from a <strong data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2023\">UGC Recognized University</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2169\">The bachelor&rsquo;s degree can belong to <strong data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2090\">any stream or discipline</strong>, making the program accessible to students from multiple academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2174\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ux6rxl\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2203\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2293\">Students must secure the required aggregate marks in their undergraduate degree program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ycqnta\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2332\">Category-Wise Eligibility Criteria</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2469\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2375\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2375\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2345\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2375\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Aggregate Required</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2469\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2428\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2405\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2428\" data-col-size=\"sm\">50% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2469\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2446\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SC/ST Category</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2469\">45% Aggregate Marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2586\">A relaxation of 5% marks is provided to candidates belonging to SC/ST categories according to admission guidelines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2591\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xmefjw\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2636\">Final Semester Students Are Also Eligible</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2767\">Candidates currently appearing in the final semester of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree program are also eligible to apply for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fvye\" data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2816\">Important Guidelines for Final Year Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2856\">Students in the final semester should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"3035\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edkzqf\" data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2913\">Submit available academic records during application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bzt13z\" data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2962\">Provide provisional certificates if required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12y4ecr\" data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"3035\">Complete all degree requirements before final admission confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qspa7l\" data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3073\">Why This Provision Is Beneficial</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3099\">This allows students to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3268\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1adgc7p\" data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3149\">Apply early without waiting for final results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgofck\" data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3198\">Participate in the admission process on time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ia0tv\" data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3268\">Secure admission opportunities before seat availability decreases</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3273\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1m8zall\" data-start=\"3275\" data-end=\"3314\">UGC Recognition Requirement Explained</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3436\">The undergraduate qualification must be obtained from a university recognized by the University Grants Commission (UGC).</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13c0ynd\" data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3473\">Why UGC Recognition Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3499\">UGC recognition ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3667\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wp36kb\" data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3535\">Academic validity of the degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wn6suh\" data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3571\">Acceptance for higher education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgnmsx\" data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3616\">Eligibility for employment opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncpjn\" data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3667\">Compliance with approved educational standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3731\">Students graduating from non-recognized institutions may face:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3823\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwrtt2\" data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3755\">Admission rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10l5zgo\" data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3786\">Verification complications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b0u4m5\" data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3823\">Career-related limitations later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3825\" data-end=\"3828\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lztnlk\" data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3866\">Students from Any Stream Can Apply</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3868\" data-end=\"4038\">One of the major advantages of the MCA AI &amp; ML program is its multidisciplinary accessibility. Students from different educational backgrounds are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4sxlms\" data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4080\">Eligible Academic Backgrounds Include</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4082\" data-end=\"4249\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"4082\" data-end=\"4089\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ub0l3o\" data-start=\"4090\" data-end=\"4098\">B.Sc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hnd5hy\" data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4114\">B.Tech / BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuwkdh\" data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4124\">B.Com</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4131\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kb4bqe\" data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4157\">Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nj617f\" data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4178\">Science Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8ezea\" data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4200\">Commerce Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4xjti\" data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4225\">Engineering Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xqsf76\" data-start=\"4226\" data-end=\"4249\">Humanities Programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4251\" data-end=\"4397\">This flexible eligibility structure supports interdisciplinary learning and encourages technology accessibility for students from various domains.</p>', '<p data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"596\">Understanding the complete MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning fee structure is extremely important before applying for admission. Many students compare only the tuition fee while ignoring additional academic expenses such as registration charges, examination fees, software subscriptions, cloud platform usage, AI tools, project development costs, and certification-related expenses. This often creates financial confusion during the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"688\">The MCA in AI &amp; ML program is designed to provide advanced industry-oriented education in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"911\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajo29n\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"716\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ob487t\" data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"737\">Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"32no5o\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"754\">Data Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jymbcy\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"777\">Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fw7tpc\" data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"809\">Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1alp8ir\" data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"836\">Reinforcement Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12lvq0g\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"863\">Intelligent Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17mgd4o\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"911\">Data Visualization and Predictive Analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"1294\">As industries continue adopting AI-powered technologies, automation systems, intelligent business solutions, and data-driven decision-making models, the demand for AI professionals is increasing rapidly across the globe. Because of this strong industry growth, students should evaluate the fee structure not only as an educational expense but also as a long-term career investment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1339\">This detailed fee structure guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1645\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14nhltz\" data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1381\">Semester-wise MCA AI &amp; ML fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q9b1vi\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1412\">Annual and total fee plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aflusc\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1446\">Additional university charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ykevk\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1478\">SAARC student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q37kuk\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1512\">Foreign student fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vmrg14\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1556\">Hidden expenses students usually ignore</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5y1406\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1595\">ROI and career investment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lmobu0\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1645\">Financial planning strategies for AI students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1650\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uk80k6\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1702\">MCA in AI &amp; ML Fee Structure for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1812\">The university offers flexible payment structures to help students manage educational expenses conveniently.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"f8bwvd\" data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1846\">Indian Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1970\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1869\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1869\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1859\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1869\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1970\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1911\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1900\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1911\">₹22,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1941\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1930\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1941\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹45,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1970\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1959\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1970\">₹90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"1975\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rkz2z6\" data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2017\">Additional Charges for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2124\">Apart from tuition fees, certain university-related charges apply separately during the program duration.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cws2c8\" data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2151\">Additional Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2273\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2184\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2184\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2174\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2184\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2273\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2235\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2225\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2235\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2273\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2263\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2273\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2278\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1llj15i\" data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2326\">MCA AI &amp; ML Fee Structure for SAARC Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2410\">Students from SAARC nations are eligible under a dedicated fee structure category.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vz6nli\" data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2452\">Additional Charges for SAARC Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2563\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2485\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2485\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2475\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2485\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2563\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2525\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2515\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2525\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2563\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2553\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2563\">₹4,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2568\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ow54y5\" data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2621\">MCA in AI &amp; ML Fee Structure for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2793\">The university also offers online learning accessibility for international students who want to pursue advanced education in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cgz08i\" data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2828\">Foreign Students Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2945\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2851\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2851\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2841\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2851\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2945\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2890\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2882\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2890\">$375</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2917\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2909\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2917\">$750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2945\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2935\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2945\">$1,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2950\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g7i4sp\" data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"2993\">Additional Charges for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3109\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3026\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3026\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3016\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Charges</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3026\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3109\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3074\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3067\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3074\">$30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3109\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3102\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Per Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3109\">$60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"696\">The MCA in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning is an advanced postgraduate program designed to prepare students for high-demand careers in AI development, machine learning engineering, data science, intelligent automation, deep learning, natural language processing, and next-generation software technologies. As industries increasingly adopt AI-powered systems for automation, prediction, analytics, customer intelligence, robotics, and digital transformation, the demand for skilled AI professionals is growing rapidly across the world.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"818\">Unlike traditional computer application programs that focus mainly on software development, the MCA in AI &amp; ML combines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"1099\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mxymgk\" data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"857\">Core computer science fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1orckou\" data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"892\">Advanced programming expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ngcxnw\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"922\">Data science technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m17rm5\" data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"958\">Artificial intelligence systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iewhl1\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"990\">Machine learning algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1khhmo2\" data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1013\">Big data analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oq8jq8\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1045\">Natural language processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tg93xs\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1099\">Reinforcement learning and intelligent automation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1173\">The curriculum is carefully designed to help students gradually develop:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1419\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rbqka\" data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1208\">Strong programming foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jvobip\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1249\">Analytical and mathematical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vx3bpo\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1285\">AI model development capability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"156zhw5\" data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1324\">Data-driven problem-solving skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q24fg7\" data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1374\">Intelligent application development expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kf2q3c\" data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1419\">Real-world project implementation skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1459\">This detailed syllabus guide explains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1725\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1043ywu\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1500\">Semester-wise MCA AI &amp; ML curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2nxyro\" data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1548\">Subject explanations and industry relevance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h3aaf\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1598\">Technical skills developed during the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17vtpuc\" data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1635\">Emerging AI technologies covered</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17mufch\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1678\">Career opportunities after MCA AI &amp; ML</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"coi8wo\" data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1725\">Future industry demand and long-term scope</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1bykzfm\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1798\">1st Semester: Building Core Computing and Analytical Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"2119\">The first semester focuses on creating a strong technical base in programming, operating systems, computer architecture, web technologies, and statistics. These foundational subjects are extremely important because advanced AI systems depend heavily on mathematics, algorithms, computing systems, and programming logic.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2284\">Students first understand how computer systems, software environments, and data structures work before moving toward advanced AI and machine learning technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2289\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p6esba\" data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2317\">Subjects in 1st Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1x3rmd5\" data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2351\">1. Probability and Statistics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2440\">This subject develops mathematical reasoning and analytical problem-solving capability.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2464\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2601\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"asedi0\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2487\">Probability theory</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ji1zru\" data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2517\">Statistical distributions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hssyo\" data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2540\">Hypothesis testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uvke42\" data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2564\">Data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r7wq6h\" data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2601\">Predictive analysis fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13k6s0e\" data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2647\">Why This Subject Is Important in AI &amp; ML</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2718\">Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning systems heavily rely on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2832\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5te3p8\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2743\">Statistical modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"75g9mf\" data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2768\">Probability analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m64ox9\" data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2800\">Predictive learning systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g3gop9\" data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2832\">Data-driven decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2911\">A strong statistical foundation is essential for building accurate AI models.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2916\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"77efbe\" data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2943\">2. C &amp; Data Structures</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"3028\">Students learn programming fundamentals and efficient data organization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3048\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3166\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q3e2z6\" data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3066\">C programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"drty1l\" data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3094\">Arrays and linked lists</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hpbbzw\" data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3116\">Stacks and queues</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xi21k9\" data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3137\">Trees and graphs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rknykz\" data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3166\">Memory management basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6slual\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3190\">Industry Relevance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3229\">Data structures form the backbone of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3328\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jhpi4\" data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3247\">AI algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tekshc\" data-start=\"3248\" data-end=\"3266\">Search systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n91ava\" data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3294\">Optimization techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hzjscp\" data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3328\">Intelligent computing systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3395\">Strong programming logic is critical for advanced AI development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3400\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6j6lb4\" data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3424\">3. Operating System</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3426\" data-end=\"3511\">This subject explains how computers manage hardware resources and software execution.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rev59q\" data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3531\">Major Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3648\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7p0jkg\" data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3554\">Process management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1982md5\" data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3576\">Memory allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f728ig\" data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3593\">File systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hjdpia\" data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3617\">Resource scheduling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bdrjm9\" data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3648\">System architecture basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aqi6he\" data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3678\">Why This Subject Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3705\">AI systems often require:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3808\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j8t4sj\" data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3736\">High-performance computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uzfbl4\" data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3770\">Efficient resource management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13thgmk\" data-start=\"3771\" data-end=\"3808\">Parallel processing understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3810\" data-end=\"3893\">Operating system knowledge helps students optimize intelligent systems effectively.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"3898\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ko21x9\" data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3944\">4. Computer Architecture and Organization</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"4020\">Students learn internal computer system design and hardware functionality.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4041\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4149\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0eo5\" data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4068\">Processor organization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bkbkl4\" data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4093\">Input/output systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fx4yny\" data-start=\"4094\" data-end=\"4114\">Memory hierarchy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w4ek2e\" data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4149\">Digital computing fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16ooqpp\" data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4171\">Importance in AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4203\">AI applications often involve:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4204\" data-end=\"4316\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l3eqe0\" data-start=\"4204\" data-end=\"4235\">High-performance processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w4761n\" data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4261\">GPU-based computation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bnqrrf\" data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4316\">Hardware optimization for machine learning systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4318\" data-end=\"4396\">Understanding architecture improves system-level AI implementation capability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4398\" data-end=\"4401\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yy3yge\" data-start=\"4403\" data-end=\"4425\">5. Web Technologies</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4427\" data-end=\"4499\">This subject introduces website development and web application systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"4501\" data-end=\"4523\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4524\" data-end=\"4639\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rxkx8\" data-start=\"4524\" data-end=\"4556\">HTML, CSS, JavaScript basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2gow65\" data-start=\"4557\" data-end=\"4578\">Front-end systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ju4zu1\" data-start=\"4579\" data-end=\"4606\">Web server fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16aaj3r\" data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4639\">Web application architecture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k82apw\" data-start=\"4641\" data-end=\"4673\">Why This Subject Is Valuable</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4675\" data-end=\"4726\">Modern AI systems are increasingly integrated into:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4727\" data-end=\"4847\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ff1wx\" data-start=\"4727\" data-end=\"4747\">Web applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g11jvx\" data-start=\"4748\" data-end=\"4777\">Online business platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kct1nl\" data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4812\">AI-powered customer interfaces</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10zugzq\" data-start=\"4813\" data-end=\"4847\">Intelligent automation systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4849\" data-end=\"4852\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15vj7z3\" data-start=\"4854\" data-end=\"4911\">2nd Semester: Advanced Programming and Software Systems</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4913\" data-end=\"5072\">The second semester focuses on algorithms, software engineering, databases, and modern programming languages essential for AI and machine learning development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5074\" data-end=\"5158\">Students build strong software development and computational problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5160\" data-end=\"5163\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"i52xrs\" data-start=\"5165\" data-end=\"5191\">Subjects in 2nd Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e4fs10\" data-start=\"5193\" data-end=\"5232\">1. Design and Analysis of Algorithms</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5234\" data-end=\"5327\">Students learn efficient computational problem-solving and algorithm optimization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"5329\" data-end=\"5347\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5348\" data-end=\"5454\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jttlyt\" data-start=\"5348\" data-end=\"5368\">Algorithm design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l377ge\" data-start=\"5369\" data-end=\"5392\">Complexity analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pdnt23\" data-start=\"5393\" data-end=\"5426\">Searching and sorting methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n91ava\" data-start=\"5427\" data-end=\"5454\">Optimization techniques</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1b38vgo\" data-start=\"5456\" data-end=\"5487\">Why Algorithms Matter in AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5489\" data-end=\"5539\">Machine learning and AI systems heavily depend on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5540\" data-end=\"5667\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wf5uod\" data-start=\"5540\" data-end=\"5564\">Efficient algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ebkl0p\" data-start=\"5565\" data-end=\"5603\">Intelligent decision-making models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yqn301\" data-start=\"5604\" data-end=\"5635\">Pattern recognition systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w5fjj8\" data-start=\"5636\" data-end=\"5667\">Data optimization processes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5669\" data-end=\"5672\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pm23ii\" data-start=\"5674\" data-end=\"5706\">2. Database Management System</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5708\" data-end=\"5781\">This subject focuses on data storage and database administration systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rev59q\" data-start=\"5783\" data-end=\"5801\">Major Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5802\" data-end=\"5916\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y789l6\" data-start=\"5802\" data-end=\"5817\">SQL queries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13xezb3\" data-start=\"5818\" data-end=\"5837\">Database design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hh9mud\" data-start=\"5838\" data-end=\"5860\">Data normalization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3cgi67\" data-start=\"5861\" data-end=\"5887\">Transaction management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uioquq\" data-start=\"5888\" data-end=\"5916\">Database security basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xo3ahh\" data-start=\"5918\" data-end=\"5943\">AI Industry Relevance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5945\" data-end=\"6035\">AI systems depend on massive datasets, making database management extremely important for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6128\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"obneoe\" data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6055\">Data collection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6t9dar\" data-start=\"6056\" data-end=\"6075\">Data processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xpyp7z\" data-start=\"6076\" data-end=\"6097\">AI model training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ap8vse\" data-start=\"6098\" data-end=\"6128\">Business analytics systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6130\" data-end=\"6133\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ydam7i\" data-start=\"6135\" data-end=\"6161\">3. Software Engineering</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6163\" data-end=\"6255\">Students learn structured software development methodologies and project management systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"6257\" data-end=\"6276\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6277\" data-end=\"6394\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"125ofaa\" data-start=\"6277\" data-end=\"6311\">Software development lifecycle</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11i31l1\" data-start=\"6312\" data-end=\"6336\">Requirement analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gx3rlh\" data-start=\"6337\" data-end=\"6362\">Testing methodologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9094vp\" data-start=\"6363\" data-end=\"6394\">Agile development practices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aqi6he\" data-start=\"6396\" data-end=\"6424\">Why This Subject Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6426\" data-end=\"6450\">AI applications require:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6451\" data-end=\"6550\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z6trk5\" data-start=\"6451\" data-end=\"6485\">Scalable software architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c26xlr\" data-start=\"6486\" data-end=\"6517\">Reliable deployment systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ghde0\" data-start=\"6518\" data-end=\"6550\">Efficient testing frameworks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6552\" data-end=\"6555\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13o0yvu\" data-start=\"6557\" data-end=\"6579\">4. Java Programming</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6581\" data-end=\"6647\">Students gain expertise in object-oriented programming using Java.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"6649\" data-end=\"6669\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6670\" data-end=\"6767\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5j2ciz\" data-start=\"6670\" data-end=\"6686\">OOP concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5r5yr3\" data-start=\"6687\" data-end=\"6705\">Multithreading</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ksxlv4\" data-start=\"6706\" data-end=\"6728\">Exception handling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tvdmqc\" data-start=\"6729\" data-end=\"6767\">Enterprise application development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wji1vs\" data-start=\"6769\" data-end=\"6792\">Industry Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6794\" data-end=\"6817\">Java is widely used in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6818\" data-end=\"6902\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jtdfoj\" data-start=\"6818\" data-end=\"6843\">Enterprise AI systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p8n473\" data-start=\"6844\" data-end=\"6867\">Backend development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qxahtc\" data-start=\"6868\" data-end=\"6902\">Scalable business applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6904\" data-end=\"6907\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"g7s9ir\" data-start=\"6909\" data-end=\"6933\">5. Python Programming</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6935\" data-end=\"7007\">This subject introduces Python-based development and automation systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"7009\" data-end=\"7031\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7032\" data-end=\"7143\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l41v7r\" data-start=\"7032\" data-end=\"7063\">Python syntax and libraries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c6eik8\" data-start=\"7064\" data-end=\"7088\">Automation scripting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12dc0w3\" data-start=\"7089\" data-end=\"7113\">Data analysis basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7z2xdi\" data-start=\"7114\" data-end=\"7143\">AI programming frameworks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"plipof\" data-start=\"7145\" data-end=\"7178\">Why Python Is Essential in AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7180\" data-end=\"7224\">Python is the most widely used language for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7225\" data-end=\"7328\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t9w189\" data-start=\"7225\" data-end=\"7245\">Machine learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kvvfl4\" data-start=\"7246\" data-end=\"7263\">Deep learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14bkl24\" data-start=\"7264\" data-end=\"7288\">AI model development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pouz1o\" data-start=\"7289\" data-end=\"7305\">Data science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6gqijl\" data-start=\"7306\" data-end=\"7328\">Automation systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7330\" data-end=\"7333\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"223mma\" data-start=\"7335\" data-end=\"7391\">3rd Semester: AI, Analytics &amp; Intelligent Data Systems</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7393\" data-end=\"7548\">The third semester introduces advanced technologies such as machine learning, big data analytics, data visualization, networking, and SQL for data science.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7550\" data-end=\"7623\">This semester bridges core computing with intelligent system development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7625\" data-end=\"7628\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1prb879\" data-start=\"7630\" data-end=\"7656\">Subjects in 3rd Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"lnpwds\" data-start=\"7658\" data-end=\"7681\">1. Computer Networks</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7683\" data-end=\"7760\">Students learn communication systems and network infrastructure fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"7762\" data-end=\"7780\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7781\" data-end=\"7888\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lyrfo3\" data-start=\"7781\" data-end=\"7802\">Network protocols</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mfecp2\" data-start=\"7803\" data-end=\"7828\">Internet architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hmlfjh\" data-start=\"7829\" data-end=\"7854\">Routing and switching</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mpwjvl\" data-start=\"7855\" data-end=\"7888\">Wireless communication basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1az85og\" data-start=\"7890\" data-end=\"7916\">AI Industry Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7918\" data-end=\"7963\">Modern AI systems frequently operate through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7964\" data-end=\"8069\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nx0i21\" data-start=\"7964\" data-end=\"7989\">Cloud-based platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5v79fa\" data-start=\"7990\" data-end=\"8014\">Distributed networks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gvdrfg\" data-start=\"8015\" data-end=\"8035\">IoT environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gqw77q\" data-start=\"8036\" data-end=\"8069\">Intelligent connected systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8071\" data-end=\"8074\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4j45xv\" data-start=\"8076\" data-end=\"8100\">2. Big Data Analytics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8102\" data-end=\"8177\">This subject focuses on large-scale data processing and analytical systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rev59q\" data-start=\"8179\" data-end=\"8197\">Major Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8198\" data-end=\"8305\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ggkr8b\" data-start=\"8198\" data-end=\"8221\">Big data frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g97eth\" data-start=\"8222\" data-end=\"8249\">Data processing systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mhz41l\" data-start=\"8250\" data-end=\"8274\">Predictive analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s64wgq\" data-start=\"8275\" data-end=\"8305\">Analytical decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"175j35n\" data-start=\"8307\" data-end=\"8337\">Why Big Data Matters in AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8339\" data-end=\"8377\">AI systems require large datasets for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8378\" data-end=\"8452\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v4bw07\" data-start=\"8378\" data-end=\"8396\">Model training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bz4h9u\" data-start=\"8397\" data-end=\"8417\">Pattern analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f75qbw\" data-start=\"8418\" data-end=\"8452\">Intelligent prediction systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8454\" data-end=\"8457\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rfzaaa\" data-start=\"8459\" data-end=\"8483\">3. Data Visualization</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8485\" data-end=\"8554\">Students learn visual representation techniques for complex datasets.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"8556\" data-end=\"8576\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8577\" data-end=\"8669\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4almn9\" data-start=\"8577\" data-end=\"8599\">Dashboard creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ryq34l\" data-start=\"8600\" data-end=\"8623\">Graphical analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"log9n\" data-start=\"8624\" data-end=\"8647\">Trend visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qiop80\" data-start=\"8648\" data-end=\"8669\">Reporting systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6slual\" data-start=\"8671\" data-end=\"8693\">Industry Relevance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8695\" data-end=\"8745\">AI professionals must present insights clearly to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8746\" data-end=\"8813\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9g0neo\" data-start=\"8746\" data-end=\"8764\">Business teams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uvzhee\" data-start=\"8765\" data-end=\"8784\">Decision-makers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1az4x6y\" data-start=\"8785\" data-end=\"8813\">Clients and stakeholders</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8815\" data-end=\"8818\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"112ij4e\" data-start=\"8820\" data-end=\"8842\">4. Machine Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8844\" data-end=\"8918\">This subject introduces AI model training and predictive learning systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"8920\" data-end=\"8939\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8940\" data-end=\"9063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"us53jk\" data-start=\"8940\" data-end=\"8963\">Supervised learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jn86sr\" data-start=\"8964\" data-end=\"8989\">Unsupervised learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g9sqpn\" data-start=\"8990\" data-end=\"9011\">Regression models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s59e7c\" data-start=\"9012\" data-end=\"9038\">Classification systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mhz41l\" data-start=\"9039\" data-end=\"9063\">Predictive analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4o1oa5\" data-start=\"9065\" data-end=\"9102\">Why Machine Learning Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9104\" data-end=\"9128\">Machine learning powers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9129\" data-end=\"9244\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vk43pz\" data-start=\"9129\" data-end=\"9155\">Recommendation systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xpqen7\" data-start=\"9156\" data-end=\"9175\">Fraud detection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14bbhmn\" data-start=\"9176\" data-end=\"9209\">Predictive business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10zugzq\" data-start=\"9210\" data-end=\"9244\">Intelligent automation systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9246\" data-end=\"9249\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xnmhsf\" data-start=\"9251\" data-end=\"9277\">5. SQL for Data Science</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9279\" data-end=\"9348\">Students learn advanced SQL techniques for data science applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"9350\" data-end=\"9372\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9373\" data-end=\"9471\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15jjl99\" data-start=\"9373\" data-end=\"9392\">Data extraction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2kiq9v\" data-start=\"9393\" data-end=\"9415\">Query optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1in8p88\" data-start=\"9416\" data-end=\"9434\">Data filtering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kqdvnm\" data-start=\"9435\" data-end=\"9471\">Data manipulation for AI systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wji1vs\" data-start=\"9473\" data-end=\"9496\">Industry Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9498\" data-end=\"9596\">Data scientists and AI engineers constantly work with structured datasets stored in SQL databases.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9598\" data-end=\"9601\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"a0v1j9\" data-start=\"9603\" data-end=\"9662\">4th Semester: Advanced AI Technologies &amp; Industry Project</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9664\" data-end=\"9756\">The final semester focuses on advanced AI technologies and practical project implementation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"9758\" data-end=\"9866\">Students apply all previous learning to real-world intelligent systems and research-oriented AI development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9868\" data-end=\"9871\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"m6dhgo\" data-start=\"9873\" data-end=\"9899\">Subjects in 4th Semester</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wbcwgf\" data-start=\"9901\" data-end=\"9940\">1. Cryptography and Network Security</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9942\" data-end=\"10015\">This subject focuses on secure communication and data protection systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2nxil4\" data-start=\"10017\" data-end=\"10035\">Topics Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10036\" data-end=\"10151\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gtn69\" data-start=\"10036\" data-end=\"10058\">Encryption systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j89wmy\" data-start=\"10059\" data-end=\"10093\">Secure communication protocols</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dja2ou\" data-start=\"10094\" data-end=\"10120\">Authentication systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvuph0\" data-start=\"10121\" data-end=\"10151\">Data protection techniques</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"psvawh\" data-start=\"10153\" data-end=\"10183\">Why Security Matters in AI</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10185\" data-end=\"10214\">AI systems frequently handle:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10215\" data-end=\"10313\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v5ps05\" data-start=\"10215\" data-end=\"10238\">Sensitive user data</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sit7vx\" data-start=\"10239\" data-end=\"10272\">Business intelligence systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1maebqn\" data-start=\"10273\" data-end=\"10313\">Financial and healthcare information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"10315\" data-end=\"10371\">Secure AI deployment is becoming increasingly important.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10373\" data-end=\"10376\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ccyqnm\" data-start=\"10378\" data-end=\"10406\">2. Reinforcement Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"10408\" data-end=\"10501\">Students learn advanced AI systems that improve performance through interaction and feedback.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rev59q\" data-start=\"10503\" data-end=\"10521\">Major Concepts</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10522\" data-end=\"10646\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o2beg1\" data-start=\"10522\" data-end=\"10555\">Reward-based learning systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"154ebdf\" data-start=\"10556\" data-end=\"10588\">Decision-making optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xvjm3u\" data-start=\"10589\" data-end=\"10619\">Autonomous learning models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j8gs40\" data-start=\"10620\" data-end=\"10646\">Intelligent automation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"39fece\" data-start=\"10648\" data-end=\"10674\">Future Industry Demand</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10676\" data-end=\"10710\">Reinforcement learning is used in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10711\" data-end=\"10806\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xjcgz9\" data-start=\"10711\" data-end=\"10723\">Robotics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a2jkp5\" data-start=\"10724\" data-end=\"10747\">Autonomous vehicles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pt1oxp\" data-start=\"10748\" data-end=\"10769\">AI gaming systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8fez55\" data-start=\"10770\" data-end=\"10806\">Advanced automation technologies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10808\" data-end=\"10811\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5x85c3\" data-start=\"10813\" data-end=\"10852\">3. Natural Language Processing (NLP)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"10854\" data-end=\"10924\">This subject focuses on human language understanding using AI systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u27nws\" data-start=\"10926\" data-end=\"10945\">Topics Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10946\" data-end=\"11058\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hszvpj\" data-start=\"10946\" data-end=\"10963\">Text analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36g8tp\" data-start=\"10964\" data-end=\"10986\">Sentiment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lyc3bp\" data-start=\"10987\" data-end=\"11008\">Language modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15hfvbt\" data-start=\"11009\" data-end=\"11028\">Chatbot systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dho5q\" data-start=\"11029\" data-end=\"11058\">Speech recognition basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mdjelq\" data-start=\"11060\" data-end=\"11084\">Why NLP Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"11086\" data-end=\"11097\">NLP powers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11098\" data-end=\"11213\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1867uzy\" data-start=\"11098\" data-end=\"11120\">Virtual assistants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o7m19w\" data-start=\"11121\" data-end=\"11136\">AI chatbots</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"193aut7\" data-start=\"11137\" data-end=\"11155\">Search engines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q058v\" data-start=\"11156\" data-end=\"11185\">Voice recognition systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u12kmw\" data-start=\"11186\" data-end=\"11213\">Generative AI platforms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11215\" data-end=\"11218\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rwabai\" data-start=\"11220\" data-end=\"11233\">4. Project</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"11235\" data-end=\"11363\">The final project allows students to implement practical AI and machine learning solutions using industry-relevant technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9b5vm3\" data-start=\"11365\" data-end=\"11398\">Benefits of the Final Project</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11399\" data-end=\"11536\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11sj18x\" data-start=\"11399\" data-end=\"11439\">Real-world implementation experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0udj5\" data-start=\"11440\" data-end=\"11465\">Portfolio development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mo435l\" data-start=\"11466\" data-end=\"11501\">Research capability enhancement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"192hhe2\" data-start=\"11502\" data-end=\"11536\">Industry readiness improvement</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 90000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(324, 73, 'cb1d0e55-4d52-4f8e-a95d-1e010c5143ea', 'e1f8adbd-4aaf-45d3-bf3c-53ff249b11e1', 207, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 00:39:42', '2026-06-16 07:25:07', '<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"379\">Applying to GLA Online is designed to be simple, fast, and completely digital so students can complete the entire admission journey from anywhere. The university has structured the admission workflow into clear stages that help students move smoothly from registration to final enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"704\">Understanding every step carefully is extremely important because many students face delays due to incomplete forms, incorrect document uploads, payment mistakes, or missing verification requirements. A proper understanding of the process helps applicants avoid unnecessary complications and complete admission confidently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"784\">Below is the complete 6-step GLA Online admission process explained in detail.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"789\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vaxbr6\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"826\">Step 1: Fill the Required Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1028\">The admission process begins with entering basic details on the online application portal. This initial registration helps the university create the student profile and start the enrollment procedure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cgszcb\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1061\">Information Usually Required</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uzprjw\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1074\">Full name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h04qtn\" data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1090\">Mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6nm42x\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1101\">Email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wr39ao\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1130\">Preferred course selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tbsncu\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1163\">Academic qualification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5vnbz\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1192\">State and city information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1339\">Students should ensure that the details entered are accurate because these records are later used during verification and admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yz2xhq\" data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1357\">Important Tip</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1537\">Always use an active email ID and mobile number because all future communication, login credentials, fee updates, and admission notifications will be sent through these channels.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1542\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"nnhrlq\" data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1589\">Step 2: Receive Login Credentials via Email</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1775\">After submitting the initial details, students receive login credentials on their registered email address. These credentials allow applicants to access the online admission dashboard.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hdn9j2\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1801\">What Students Receive</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1912\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1icq2uo\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1834\">User ID or application number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ojjb04\" data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1851\">Login password</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i2rvtd\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1877\">Admission portal access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nc4e8j\" data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1912\">Further application instructions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"2062\">The admission portal acts as the main platform for completing all remaining formalities including form submission, fee payment, and document upload.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1q25kbu\" data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2090\">Common Mistake to Avoid</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2124\">Students should regularly check:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2163\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16tcfq2\" data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2132\">Inbox</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yjmisx\" data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2146\">Spam folder</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9hom7\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2163\">Promotions tab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2221\">Sometimes official emails may be filtered automatically.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2226\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"z97g6k\" data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2264\">Step 3: Fill the Registration Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2504\">After logging into the admission portal, students must complete the detailed registration form carefully. This is one of the most critical stages because the submitted information becomes part of the university&rsquo;s official student records.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"auje4m\" data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2550\">Details Included in the Registration Form</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fkli58\" data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2572\">Personal Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3z0bz\" data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2579\">Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14lnz5c\" data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2595\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pt4cvs\" data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2616\">Parent information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ibp5y6\" data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2626\">Address</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"185bhtt\" data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2648\">Academic Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2770\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vuenmz\" data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2671\">Class 10 information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1803h2h\" data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2694\">Class 12 information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16mbxjz\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2745\">Graduation details (for postgraduate admissions)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tvzknv\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2770\">Marks and passing year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18cuojd\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2790\">Course Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2860\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yv82ak\" data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2810\">Program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g5hxv0\" data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2834\">Specialization choice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmm9ez\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2860\">Study mode confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2865\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jwthoc\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2901\">Step 4: Pay the Registration Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"3027\">Once the registration form is completed, students must pay the registration fee to proceed further in the admission process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"r38xuy\" data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3057\">Available Payment Methods</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3132\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nlqvoi\" data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3071\">Debit card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dnpt3l\" data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3085\">Credit card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hf7qq9\" data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3099\">Net banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4vms\" data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3105\">UPI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xzu1mr\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3132\">Digital payment gateways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3206\">The online payment system is designed for secure and quick transactions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jy2w3j\" data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3227\">Important Advice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3245\">Students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3362\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkysqk\" data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3269\">Save payment receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xos0um\" data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3315\">Take screenshots of successful transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pn0dv7\" data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3362\">Avoid refreshing the payment page repeatedly</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3408\">This helps prevent duplicate payment issues.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3413\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kyfezx\" data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3446\">Step 5: Document Verification</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3636\">Document verification is one of the most important stages of online admission. During this process, the university verifies the authenticity of the student&rsquo;s academic and personal records.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hfjbc8\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3668\">Commonly Required Documents</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zl2vgf\" data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3692\">Academic Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3776\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17fpgl9\" data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3713\">Class 10 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqxqv3\" data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3734\">Class 12 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ca671x\" data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3776\">Graduation certificates (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"taixd8\" data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3800\">Identity Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3844\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jslcwy\" data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3815\">Aadhaar card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xrh0kk\" data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3844\">Government-issued ID proof</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"spyfb2\" data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3865\">Other Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3943\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lye5s8\" data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3892\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199lc0c\" data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3904\">Signature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dcj5v2\" data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3943\">Category certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"3948\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1d56c05\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3981\">Why Verification Is Important</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"4004\">Verification ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4112\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cmopca\" data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4031\">Eligibility confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v5oioy\" data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4059\">Authentic student records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ylw23t\" data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4093\">Accurate academic documentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nlt7ey\" data-start=\"4094\" data-end=\"4112\">Fraud prevention</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4114\" data-end=\"4203\">Students should upload clear and readable scanned documents to avoid rejection or delays.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4208\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1scprv2\" data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4258\">Step 6: Enrollment Confirmation and LMS Access</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4423\">After successful verification and approval, students receive final admission confirmation from the university. This marks the completion of the enrollment process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fl9s51\" data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4468\">What Students Receive After Confirmation</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4622\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bx4sz3\" data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4489\">Enrollment number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1smq61c\" data-start=\"4490\" data-end=\"4521\">Admission confirmation letter</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wm636u\" data-start=\"4522\" data-end=\"4544\">Student login access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzs6ox\" data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4591\">Learning Management System (LMS) credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mjs849\" data-start=\"4592\" data-end=\"4622\">Academic orientation details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4624\" data-end=\"4700\">The LMS platform becomes the central learning hub where students can access:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4791\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3d0q73\" data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4718\">Study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pack97\" data-start=\"4719\" data-end=\"4738\">Recorded lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lie7pk\" data-start=\"4739\" data-end=\"4752\">Assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mgmktp\" data-start=\"4753\" data-end=\"4766\">Assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1so1bun\" data-start=\"4767\" data-end=\"4791\">Academic announcements</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"507\">Before applying for an Online MBA program, students must clearly understand the eligibility criteria because admission requirements directly determine whether an applicant can successfully enroll in the program. Many students focus only on the admission form and later discover eligibility mismatches related to academic qualifications, university recognition, or final-year status.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"835\">The Online MBA program offered by GLA Online is designed to provide flexible access to management education for graduates from different academic backgrounds. The eligibility structure is inclusive and allows students from multiple disciplines to pursue advanced management studies without restrictive specialization barriers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"1009\">This flexibility makes the program suitable for fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, career switchers, and students planning long-term managerial careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"dzjro1\" data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1069\">Basic Eligibility Criteria for Online MBA Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1199\">To apply for the Online MBA program, candidates must possess a bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline from a recognized university.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ja1qv0\" data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1233\">Accepted Academic Backgrounds</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1301\">Students from various educational streams are eligible, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1444\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fr3fit\" data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1313\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tue68s\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1323\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j435ks\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1330\">Arts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p06fqp\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1344\">Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9rx33v\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1357\">Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p3jjs6\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1381\">Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ttf991\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1394\">Humanities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xewgp3\" data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1413\">Business Studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cjccmo\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1444\">Professional Degree Programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1627\">The multidisciplinary eligibility structure ensures that students from diverse academic backgrounds can develop managerial expertise and transition into leadership-oriented careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1632\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1alkyfu\" data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1672\">Recognition of the Qualifying Degree</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1931\">The bachelor&rsquo;s degree must be obtained from a recognized university or higher education institution. Recognition is important because universities generally verify whether the applicant&rsquo;s previous academic qualification meets accepted educational standards.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ydh2co\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1970\">Why University Recognition Matters</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"1997\">Recognition helps ensure:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2127\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xsqfqs\" data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2021\">Academic authenticity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d3t7vr\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2053\">Valid qualification standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1evmtug\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2078\">Eligibility compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a2ycya\" data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2127\">Acceptance for higher education and employment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2239\">Students should verify that their previous university or institution is officially recognized before applying.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2244\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pfjmxw\" data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2283\">Eligibility for Final-Year Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2443\">One of the major advantages of the Online MBA admission process is that final-year undergraduate students who are awaiting results are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2595\">This flexibility allows students to continue their academic progression without wasting an academic year waiting for final results or degree issuance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1h185ri\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2632\">Benefits for Final-Year Students</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ixas5v\" data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2651\">No Career Gap</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2755\">Students can begin the admission process immediately instead of delaying their higher education plans.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8p29q5\" data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2784\">Early Academic Planning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2907\">Applying early helps students secure admission, prepare financially, and transition smoothly into postgraduate education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"iw2jxi\" data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2938\">Faster Career Progression</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"3093\">Students aiming for management careers can start developing leadership and business skills sooner, giving them a competitive advantage in the job market.</p>', '<p data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"493\">Understanding the complete fee structure before taking admission is extremely important for students and parents. Many students only focus on the tuition fee and later discover additional charges such as examination fees, registration costs, alumni charges, or yearly payment conditions. To avoid confusion during the admission process, students should always analyze the total academic cost carefully.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"792\">GLA University follows a transparent fee structure that includes tuition fees along with a few mandatory academic and administrative charges. The university also provides different payment options, allowing students to choose semester-wise or annual payment methods based on financial convenience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"997\">This detailed fee breakdown will help students understand the complete program cost, one-time charges, yearly expenses, hidden considerations, and important financial planning insights before enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1002\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ani41c\" data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1048\">GLA University Semester-Wise Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1330\">Students who prefer flexible payments generally choose the semester-wise fee option because it reduces the immediate financial burden. This mode is suitable for families who want to distribute educational expenses across the academic year instead of paying a large amount at once.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ee01v3\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1355\">Semester Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1383\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1383\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1373\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1383\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1432\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1424\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1432\">₹500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1467\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1457\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1467\">₹1,800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1493\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1482\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1493\">₹24,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1520\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Semester)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1530\">₹1,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18ins4k\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1565\">Total Semester Payable Amount</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1786\">The semester-wise payment structure includes tuition charges along with examination and institutional fees. Since registration and alumni fees are one-time charges, they are generally paid during initial admission only.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1878\">Students selecting semester payment mode should also plan for additional expenses such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"2025\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3d0q73\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1896\">Study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6hv6o0\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1930\">Laptop or software requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1geiam\" data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1954\">Certification courses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k4b8eo\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1994\">Internet expenses for online learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nk0nvh\" data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2025\">Project and assignment costs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2134\">Proper budgeting helps students avoid financial pressure during examinations or project submission periods.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2139\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zjlg4i\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2178\">GLA University Annual Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2444\">The annual payment option is designed for students who prefer paying the fee once every academic year instead of every semester. This option is often considered more convenient because it reduces repeated payment formalities and provides a small financial benefit.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"blk1a0\" data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2467\">Annual Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2638\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2495\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2495\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2485\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2495\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2638\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2544\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2536\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2544\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2579\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2579\">₹1,800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2605\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2594\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2605\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹48,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2638\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2628\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2638\">₹3,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mhxx4e\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2662\">Annual Fee Benefit</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2854\">Students choosing the annual payment mode receive a benefit of ₹2,000 on the first-year fee. This concession makes annual payment slightly more economical compared to semester-wise payments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"3029\">For students who already have planned educational budgets or education loan approvals, the annual option can help simplify financial management throughout the academic year.</p>\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wvxorx\" data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3080\">GLA University Total Program Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3276\">Understanding the total program fee is important because many students only calculate yearly tuition costs and overlook the complete financial commitment required for the entire course duration.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16di4nr\" data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3306\">Total Program Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3466\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3334\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3334\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3324\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3334\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3466\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3383\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3375\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3383\">₹500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3418\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3408\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3418\">₹1,800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3419\" data-end=\"3444\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3419\" data-end=\"3433\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3444\">₹97,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3466\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3456\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3466\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹6,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"494\">The Online MBA curriculum is carefully designed to prepare students for today&rsquo;s rapidly changing business environment. Modern organizations no longer look for professionals who only possess theoretical knowledge. Companies now demand managers who can analyze business problems, understand market trends, manage teams, use data for decision-making, and adapt to global business challenges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"917\">This Online MBA syllabus focuses on building strong managerial foundations during the initial semesters and gradually moves toward strategic leadership, specialization expertise, research capability, and practical business application. The curriculum combines management principles, analytics, finance, marketing, operations, human resources, and industry-focused electives to develop well-rounded business professionals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"1165\">Unlike traditional outdated MBA structures that rely heavily on theory, this program emphasizes practical thinking, analytical decision-making, strategic leadership, and professional problem-solving skills required in real corporate environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1170\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"y9t4w5\" data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1211\">Online MBA Program Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1360\">The Online MBA program is divided into four semesters. Each semester is strategically planned to develop different levels of managerial competence.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kur7ng\" data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1397\">Key Highlights of the Curriculum</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dsix3d\" data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1438\">Industry-oriented management subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"102p93l\" data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1486\">Strong focus on analytics and decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"162yvij\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1532\">Practical business problem-solving approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11iuqvm\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1577\">Research and strategic management exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k66hsw\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1605\">Open elective flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ew7nhp\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1648\">Specialization-focused advanced learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19v0vem\" data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1696\">Research project for practical implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"60ff19\" data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1765\">Balanced mix of finance, marketing, HR, operations, and leadership</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1834\">The progression of the syllabus follows a structured learning path:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1999\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d5aqmw\" data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1871\">Foundation of management concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1enbfmq\" data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1904\">Functional business knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1in07mo\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1945\">Strategic and specialization learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ad7img\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1999\">Global business application and research execution</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2098\">This gradual progression helps students build confidence and professional expertise step by step.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2103\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1h87dws\" data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2165\">Semester 1: Foundation of Management and Business Concepts</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2381\">The first semester focuses on building core managerial understanding. Students are introduced to the fundamentals of business administration, organizational systems, economics, accounting, analytics, and marketing.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"psenhu\" data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2408\">Subjects in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2852\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2434\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2434\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2420\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2434\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2852\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2471\" data-col-size=\"md\">Accounting for Managers</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2523\">Financial understanding for managerial decisions</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2602\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2560\" data-col-size=\"md\">Contemporary Managerial Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2602\">Economic concepts in business strategy</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2702\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2652\" data-col-size=\"md\">Management Process and Organizational Behavior</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2702\">Organizational structure and employee behavior</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2785\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2739\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Statistics and Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2785\">Data interpretation and business analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2852\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2809\" data-col-size=\"md\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2852\">Market strategies and consumer behavior</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2857\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5ahri7\" data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2885\">Accounting for Managers</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"3159\">This subject helps students understand financial statements, budgeting, cost analysis, and business financial performance. Managers must know how to interpret financial data even if they are not finance specialists. This course builds that essential managerial capability.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ejbzus\" data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3181\">Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3290\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13i94d7\" data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3209\">Financial decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ygqgiv\" data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3233\">Budget interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bo9cjy\" data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3258\">Profitability analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oqzzv8\" data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3290\">Cost management understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3295\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"98vw6v\" data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3333\">Contemporary Managerial Economics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3536\">Managerial economics teaches how economic principles influence business operations and market behavior. Students learn demand analysis, pricing strategies, market competition, and economic forecasting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aqi6he\" data-start=\"3538\" data-end=\"3566\">Why This Subject Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3721\">Businesses constantly face economic uncertainty. Managers who understand economic patterns can make smarter strategic decisions and reduce business risks.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3726\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1iavh7w\" data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3777\">Management Process and Organizational Behavior</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3973\">This subject explains how organizations function and how human behavior impacts workplace performance. Students learn leadership, teamwork, motivation, communication, and organizational culture.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wbwk9t\" data-start=\"3975\" data-end=\"3997\">Key Learning Areas</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4106\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10wevqt\" data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4017\">Leadership styles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lburye\" data-start=\"4018\" data-end=\"4035\">Team management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml6kv2\" data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4057\">Employee motivation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dbgqkt\" data-start=\"4058\" data-end=\"4079\">Conflict management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpcbxn\" data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4106\">Organizational structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4280\">Strong organizational behavior understanding is extremely valuable because many management failures happen due to poor people management rather than technical incompetence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4282\" data-end=\"4285\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wobe7v\" data-start=\"4287\" data-end=\"4323\">Business Statistics and Analytics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4516\">Modern businesses rely heavily on data-driven decisions. This subject introduces students to statistical techniques, business forecasting, data interpretation, and analytical decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wji1vs\" data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4541\">Industry Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4686\">Professionals with analytical skills are highly demanded because companies increasingly depend on business intelligence and predictive analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4691\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xtt7de\" data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4716\">Marketing Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4871\">Marketing management develops understanding of customer behavior, branding, market segmentation, digital promotion, pricing, and competitive positioning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qzu2it\" data-start=\"4873\" data-end=\"4893\">Career Relevance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4894\" data-end=\"5009\">Even professionals outside marketing benefit from understanding consumer psychology and business growth strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5011\" data-end=\"5014\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xglho9\" data-start=\"5016\" data-end=\"5078\">Semester 2: Functional Management and Operational Excellence</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5080\" data-end=\"5224\">The second semester strengthens business management knowledge through finance, operations, human resources, research, and supply chain concepts.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"psenht\" data-start=\"5226\" data-end=\"5251\">Subjects in Semester 2</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5253\" data-end=\"5596\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5253\" data-end=\"5277\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5253\" data-end=\"5277\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5253\" data-end=\"5263\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5263\" data-end=\"5277\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5596\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5343\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5311\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5311\" data-end=\"5343\">Corporate financial planning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5344\" data-end=\"5399\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5344\" data-end=\"5367\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5367\" data-end=\"5399\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business research techniques</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5400\" data-end=\"5454\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5400\" data-end=\"5422\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operations Research</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5422\" data-end=\"5454\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Quantitative decision-making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5455\" data-end=\"5532\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5455\" data-end=\"5496\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operations and Supply Chain Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5496\" data-end=\"5532\">Production and logistics systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5533\" data-end=\"5596\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5533\" data-end=\"5561\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5561\" data-end=\"5596\">Workforce management strategies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5598\" data-end=\"5601\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10peha7\" data-start=\"5603\" data-end=\"5626\">Financial Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5628\" data-end=\"5734\">This subject focuses on investment decisions, capital management, financial planning, and risk evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cglr6n\" data-start=\"5736\" data-end=\"5766\">Important Concepts Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5767\" data-end=\"5865\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vuyz7z\" data-start=\"5767\" data-end=\"5786\">Capital budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dszu0o\" data-start=\"5787\" data-end=\"5815\">Working capital management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"58but7\" data-start=\"5816\" data-end=\"5837\">Investment analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d3574h\" data-start=\"5838\" data-end=\"5865\">Financial risk management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5867\" data-end=\"5993\">Financial literacy is critical for managerial growth because every department ultimately impacts organizational profitability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5995\" data-end=\"5998\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xtwscx\" data-start=\"6000\" data-end=\"6023\">Research Methodology</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6025\" data-end=\"6141\">Research methodology trains students in systematic business research, data collection, analysis, and interpretation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jsr8sh\" data-start=\"6143\" data-end=\"6166\">Why It Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6167\" data-end=\"6341\">Managers often need to analyze business problems scientifically before making strategic decisions. This subject improves critical thinking and evidence-based decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6343\" data-end=\"6346\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16csdju\" data-start=\"6348\" data-end=\"6370\">Operations Research</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6493\">Operations research introduces mathematical and analytical models used for business optimization and resource allocation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12l3o4a\" data-start=\"6495\" data-end=\"6522\">Real-World Applications</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6523\" data-end=\"6618\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pqdthy\" data-start=\"6523\" data-end=\"6544\">Production planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bstjrl\" data-start=\"6545\" data-end=\"6567\">Inventory management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xxo9ef\" data-start=\"6568\" data-end=\"6597\">Transportation optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qyh5xa\" data-start=\"6598\" data-end=\"6618\">Scheduling systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6620\" data-end=\"6708\">This subject is particularly valuable for operations, consulting, and analytics careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6710\" data-end=\"6713\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14gyibp\" data-start=\"6715\" data-end=\"6756\">Operations and Supply Chain Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6758\" data-end=\"6871\">Students learn how products and services move from production to consumers through efficient operational systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ex46yh\" data-start=\"6873\" data-end=\"6894\">Key Areas Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6895\" data-end=\"7009\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6shbd7\" data-start=\"6895\" data-end=\"6918\">Supply chain planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d8qifo\" data-start=\"6919\" data-end=\"6938\">Inventory systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13oni5k\" data-start=\"6939\" data-end=\"6961\">Logistics management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"884dqa\" data-start=\"6962\" data-end=\"6984\">Process optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jh5493\" data-start=\"6985\" data-end=\"7009\">Operational efficiency</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7011\" data-end=\"7117\">Global businesses heavily depend on efficient supply chains, making this subject highly industry-relevant.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7119\" data-end=\"7122\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rya283\" data-start=\"7124\" data-end=\"7152\">Human Resource Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7154\" data-end=\"7302\">Human resources management focuses on recruitment, employee development, performance management, training, compensation, and organizational culture.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"igu9s5\" data-start=\"7304\" data-end=\"7329\">Managerial Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7330\" data-end=\"7489\">People are one of the most valuable organizational assets. Managers who understand workforce management contribute significantly to long-term business success.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7491\" data-end=\"7494\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ggmokq\" data-start=\"7496\" data-end=\"7559\">Semester 3: Strategic Learning and Specialization Development</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7561\" data-end=\"7676\">The third semester transitions students from functional learning to strategic and specialized management expertise.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"psenhs\" data-start=\"7678\" data-end=\"7703\">Subjects in Semester 3</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"7705\" data-end=\"8063\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"7705\" data-end=\"7729\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"7705\" data-end=\"7729\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"7705\" data-end=\"7715\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"7715\" data-end=\"7729\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"7740\" data-end=\"8063\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"7740\" data-end=\"7794\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7740\" data-end=\"7763\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"7763\" data-end=\"7794\">Long-term business strategy</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7795\" data-end=\"7855\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7795\" data-end=\"7813\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Open Elective 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"7813\" data-end=\"7855\">Liberal arts and managerial enrichment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7856\" data-end=\"7916\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7856\" data-end=\"7874\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Open Elective 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"7874\" data-end=\"7916\">Leadership and innovation perspectives</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7917\" data-end=\"7965\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7917\" data-end=\"7945\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization Elective 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"7945\" data-end=\"7965\">Domain expertise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7966\" data-end=\"8014\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7966\" data-end=\"7994\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization Elective 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"7994\" data-end=\"8014\">Domain expertise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8015\" data-end=\"8063\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8015\" data-end=\"8043\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization Elective 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"8043\" data-end=\"8063\">Domain expertise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8065\" data-end=\"8068\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jbaubh\" data-start=\"8070\" data-end=\"8092\">Strategic Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"8094\" data-end=\"8238\">Strategic management is one of the most important MBA subjects because it teaches long-term organizational planning and competitive positioning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7wiebs\" data-start=\"8240\" data-end=\"8258\">Students Learn</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8259\" data-end=\"8383\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hkfh6v\" data-start=\"8259\" data-end=\"8290\">Business strategy formulation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lv5zx\" data-start=\"8291\" data-end=\"8313\">Competitive analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1io984v\" data-start=\"8314\" data-end=\"8344\">Corporate expansion planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18hpwl1\" data-start=\"8345\" data-end=\"8365\">Market positioning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"to9e65\" data-start=\"8366\" data-end=\"8383\">Risk assessment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8385\" data-end=\"8463\">This subject helps students think like senior executives and business leaders.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8465\" data-end=\"8468\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"kzw3rv\" data-start=\"8470\" data-end=\"8522\">Open Electives: Expanding Professional Perspective</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"8524\" data-end=\"8658\">The curriculum includes liberal arts electives that improve communication, ethics, innovation, leadership, and societal understanding.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"d2ba08\" data-start=\"8660\" data-end=\"8687\">Elective Options Include</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8688\" data-end=\"8949\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a5d24o\" data-start=\"8688\" data-end=\"8730\">Corporate Governance and Business Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xzka3j\" data-start=\"8731\" data-end=\"8757\">Managerial Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4tiklc\" data-start=\"8758\" data-end=\"8781\">Science of Well Being</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpn29i\" data-start=\"8782\" data-end=\"8800\">Economy of India</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13kpjrn\" data-start=\"8801\" data-end=\"8846\">Entrepreneurship and Innovation in Practice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iw8rhr\" data-start=\"8847\" data-end=\"8867\">Ethical Leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rebac6\" data-start=\"8868\" data-end=\"8908\">Corporate Legal Environment and Policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uji4eq\" data-start=\"8909\" data-end=\"8949\">Global Wellbeing and Human Flourishing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8951\" data-end=\"9127\">These subjects are extremely valuable because modern leadership requires emotional intelligence, ethical awareness, and communication skills in addition to technical expertise.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9129\" data-end=\"9132\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1o0drrv\" data-start=\"9134\" data-end=\"9160\">Specialization Electives</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9162\" data-end=\"9268\">The specialization electives allow students to build advanced expertise in their chosen management domain.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fii7hs\" data-start=\"9270\" data-end=\"9309\">Benefits of Specialization Learning</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9310\" data-end=\"9473\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yugx61\" data-start=\"9310\" data-end=\"9339\">Stronger industry alignment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u8v50g\" data-start=\"9340\" data-end=\"9374\">Improved placement opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12kb5aj\" data-start=\"9375\" data-end=\"9400\">Better career targeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1py3uns\" data-start=\"9401\" data-end=\"9429\">Advanced subject knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15cokvg\" data-start=\"9430\" data-end=\"9473\">Competitive advantage in specific sectors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"9475\" data-end=\"9571\">Students should choose specializations carefully based on career goals rather than trends alone.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9573\" data-end=\"9576\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xdgwqe\" data-start=\"9578\" data-end=\"9634\">Semester 4: Global Management and Research Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9636\" data-end=\"9789\">The final semester focuses on global business understanding, project management, advanced specialization learning, and practical research implementation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"psenhz\" data-start=\"9791\" data-end=\"9816\">Subjects in Semester 4</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"9818\" data-end=\"10200\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"9818\" data-end=\"9842\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"9818\" data-end=\"9842\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"9818\" data-end=\"9828\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"9828\" data-end=\"9842\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"9853\" data-end=\"10200\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"9853\" data-end=\"9919\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9853\" data-end=\"9889\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Business Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"9889\" data-end=\"9919\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Global business operations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"9920\" data-end=\"9975\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9920\" data-end=\"9941\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"9941\" data-end=\"9975\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project execution and planning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"9976\" data-end=\"10033\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9976\" data-end=\"10004\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization Elective 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"10004\" data-end=\"10033\">Advanced domain expertise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"10034\" data-end=\"10091\">\r\n<td data-start=\"10034\" data-end=\"10062\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization Elective 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"10062\" data-end=\"10091\">Advanced domain expertise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"10092\" data-end=\"10149\">\r\n<td data-start=\"10092\" data-end=\"10120\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization Elective 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"10120\" data-end=\"10149\">Advanced domain expertise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"10150\" data-end=\"10200\">\r\n<td data-start=\"10150\" data-end=\"10169\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"10169\" data-end=\"10200\">Practical business research</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10202\" data-end=\"10205\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"uq3ko9\" data-start=\"10207\" data-end=\"10242\">International Business Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"10244\" data-end=\"10398\">This subject explores global trade systems, international marketing, cross-border business operations, foreign investment, and global business strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lt6cfv\" data-start=\"10400\" data-end=\"10432\">Importance in Modern Careers</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10433\" data-end=\"10571\">Globalization has increased the need for managers who understand international business environments and multicultural business practices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10573\" data-end=\"10576\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"34n9kw\" data-start=\"10578\" data-end=\"10598\">Project Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"10600\" data-end=\"10716\">Project management teaches planning, execution, budgeting, scheduling, and monitoring of projects across industries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18po81j\" data-start=\"10718\" data-end=\"10748\">Practical Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10749\" data-end=\"10850\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ofqmb6\" data-start=\"10749\" data-end=\"10770\">Resource allocation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cq9n5s\" data-start=\"10771\" data-end=\"10792\">Timeline management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e22v70\" data-start=\"10793\" data-end=\"10807\">Risk control</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6nrnmi\" data-start=\"10808\" data-end=\"10827\">Team coordination</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iq0pz3\" data-start=\"10828\" data-end=\"10850\">Performance tracking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"10852\" data-end=\"10973\">Project management knowledge is useful across IT, operations, consulting, marketing, construction, and corporate sectors.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 100000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(325, 73, 'cb1d0e55-4d52-4f8e-a95d-1e010c5143ea', 'e1f8adbd-4aaf-45d3-bf3c-53ff249b11e1', 75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 01:02:22', '2026-06-16 07:25:31', '<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"498\">Applying to GLA Online is a structured, fully digital process designed to make higher education access simple, transparent, and student-friendly. The admission system ensures that students from any location can complete their enrollment without visiting the campus physically. From entering basic details to final admission confirmation, every step is designed to reduce complexity and improve accessibility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"782\">Understanding the complete admission process is extremely important because many students face delays or rejection due to incomplete forms, incorrect document uploads, or missed payment steps. A clear understanding of each stage ensures a smooth and error-free admission experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"851\">Below is the complete 6-step admission process explained in detail.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"856\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vaxbr6\" data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"893\">Step 1: Fill the Required Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"1108\">The admission journey begins with entering basic personal and academic information on the official online portal. This step helps create the initial student profile in the system and starts the enrollment process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1aq2h09\" data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1143\">Details Required at This Stage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1186\">Students are typically required to enter:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1317\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uzprjw\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1198\">Full name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h04qtn\" data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1214\">Mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6nm42x\" data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1225\">Email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tbsncu\" data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1258\">Academic qualification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ks0njt\" data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1288\">Preferred program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ur1hb3\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1317\">City and state information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1459\">Accuracy is extremely important in this stage because all future communication and verification will be based on the details submitted here.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"q63l1o\" data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1491\">Important Admission Insight</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1530\">Students should ensure that they use:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1609\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s886ud\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1548\">Active email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mfcf1\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1570\">Valid mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u4mgta\" data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1609\">Correct spelling of academic details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1703\">Even small errors at this stage can lead to communication gaps or verification issues later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1708\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17mmce3\" data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1759\">Step 2: You Will Get Login Credentials via Mail</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1942\">After successfully submitting the required details, students receive login credentials on their registered email ID. These credentials allow access to the official admission portal.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hdn9j2\" data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1968\">What Students Receive</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18xehjo\" data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"1998\">Username or application ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kco1yn\" data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2019\">Password for login</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"atjxzn\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2048\">Portal access instructions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"27vged\" data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2075\">Admission dashboard link</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2181\">This login system acts as the central platform where students complete all further admission activities.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1q25kbu\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2209\">Common Mistake to Avoid</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2254\">Students often miss this step because they:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2383\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ebpcpg\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2295\">Do not check spam or promotions folder</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7o1e7e\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2342\">Enter incorrect email ID during registration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hxy9vs\" data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2383\">Delay checking emails after submission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2443\">It is important to regularly monitor email after applying.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2448\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1j1ttf9\" data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2482\">Step 3: Fill Registration Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2686\">After receiving login credentials, students must log into the portal and complete the detailed registration form. This step finalizes the student&rsquo;s academic and personal record in the university system.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"95r1ls\" data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2732\">Information Required in Registration Form</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fkli58\" data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2754\">Personal Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2833\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uzprjw\" data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2766\">Full name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14lnz5c\" data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2782\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gye5ns\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2811\">Parent or guardian details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1elagoi\" data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2833\">Address information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"185bhtt\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2855\">Academic Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2955\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wrqa6d\" data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2874\">Class 10 details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f1swhz\" data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2893\">Class 12 details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14chlgx\" data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2930\">Graduation details (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tvzknv\" data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2955\">Marks and passing year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dyb7x7\" data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2977\">Course Selection</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3046\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y9208l\" data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"2996\">Selected program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g5hxv0\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3020\">Specialization choice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmm9ez\" data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3046\">Study mode confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1416g3q\" data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3081\">Why This Step Is Critical</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3132\">This is one of the most important stages because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3251\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cxmikt\" data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3172\">It becomes official university record</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"80ldal\" data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3211\">It determines eligibility validation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jz4er4\" data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3251\">It affects admission approval process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3327\">Incorrect information may lead to delays or rejection during verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3329\" data-end=\"3332\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4feeh1\" data-start=\"3334\" data-end=\"3364\">Step 4: Pay Registration Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3486\">Once the registration form is completed, students must proceed to pay the registration fee to confirm their application.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"r38xuy\" data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3516\">Available Payment Methods</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3551\">Students can generally pay using:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3616\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nlqvoi\" data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3564\">Debit card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dnpt3l\" data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3578\">Credit card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hf7qq9\" data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3592\">Net banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4vms\" data-start=\"3593\" data-end=\"3598\">UPI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nxtwyu\" data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3616\">Digital wallets</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3718\">All payments are processed through secure online gateways to ensure safety and instant confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3720\" data-end=\"3723\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ur5qvb\" data-start=\"3725\" data-end=\"3750\">Important Payment Tips</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3775\">Students should always:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3916\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ky8m27\" data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3798\">Save payment receipt</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l8tfke\" data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3842\">Take screenshot of successful transaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ludpc9\" data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3876\">Avoid multiple payment attempts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e5aveu\" data-start=\"3877\" data-end=\"3916\">Wait for confirmation before retrying</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"4003\">Duplicate transactions can occur if students refresh or repeat payment unnecessarily.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4008\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kyfezx\" data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4041\">Step 5: Document Verification</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4210\">After fee payment, the university begins the document verification process. This step ensures that all submitted academic and personal details are authentic and valid.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17is2nm\" data-start=\"4212\" data-end=\"4250\">Documents Required for Verification</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zl2vgf\" data-start=\"4252\" data-end=\"4274\">Academic Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4357\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17fpgl9\" data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4295\">Class 10 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqxqv3\" data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4316\">Class 12 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18wwe92\" data-start=\"4317\" data-end=\"4357\">Graduation certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o7vn78\" data-start=\"4359\" data-end=\"4377\">Identity Proof</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4378\" data-end=\"4421\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jslcwy\" data-start=\"4378\" data-end=\"4392\">Aadhaar card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xrh0kk\" data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4421\">Government-issued ID proof</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n02tc3\" data-start=\"4423\" data-end=\"4447\">Additional Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4523\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lye5s8\" data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4474\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199lc0c\" data-start=\"4475\" data-end=\"4486\">Signature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pp8gmi\" data-start=\"4487\" data-end=\"4523\">Category certificate (if required)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4525\" data-end=\"4528\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ssmp0u\" data-start=\"4530\" data-end=\"4568\">Importance of Document Verification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4570\" data-end=\"4597\">This step is essential for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4723\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kzf7mf\" data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4622\">Confirming eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q330j\" data-start=\"4623\" data-end=\"4656\">Verifying academic authenticity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1scuug3\" data-start=\"4657\" data-end=\"4686\">Ensuring admission accuracy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dto92l\" data-start=\"4687\" data-end=\"4723\">Preventing fraudulent applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4725\" data-end=\"4728\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1czejm5\" data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4755\">Common Errors to Avoid</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4757\" data-end=\"4779\">Students should avoid:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4780\" data-end=\"4899\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f7skcm\" data-start=\"4780\" data-end=\"4806\">Blurry scanned documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1asgt5m\" data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4842\">Mismatched names across documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oiv0yv\" data-start=\"4843\" data-end=\"4867\">Incorrect file formats</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2cm9v\" data-start=\"4868\" data-end=\"4899\">Missing required certificates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4901\" data-end=\"4975\">Proper document preparation helps speed up the admission approval process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4977\" data-end=\"4980\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1c1jz1a\" data-start=\"4982\" data-end=\"5041\">Step 6: Pay Admission Fee &amp; Final Enrollment Confirmation</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5043\" data-end=\"5167\">The final step in the admission process is payment of the admission fee, after which the enrollment is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fsry00\" data-start=\"5169\" data-end=\"5198\">What Happens After Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5200\" data-end=\"5262\">Once the admission fee is paid successfully, students receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5263\" data-end=\"5401\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dth682\" data-start=\"5263\" data-end=\"5293\">Final admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bx4sz3\" data-start=\"5294\" data-end=\"5313\">Enrollment number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r16p5m\" data-start=\"5314\" data-end=\"5341\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h6iczz\" data-start=\"5342\" data-end=\"5377\">Access to learning platform (LMS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pt6ufa\" data-start=\"5378\" data-end=\"5401\">Academic instructions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5403\" data-end=\"5463\">This marks the official completion of the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5465\" data-end=\"5468\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hjrt4v\" data-start=\"5470\" data-end=\"5494\">Why This Step Matters</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5496\" data-end=\"5514\">This step ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5515\" data-end=\"5646\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"57klla\" data-start=\"5515\" data-end=\"5549\">Seat confirmation in the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1udn63h\" data-start=\"5550\" data-end=\"5581\">Activation of student account</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w565m3\" data-start=\"5582\" data-end=\"5612\">Access to academic resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xql2kz\" data-start=\"5613\" data-end=\"5646\">Enrollment in the chosen course</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5648\" data-end=\"5707\">Without completing this step, admission remains incomplete.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"511\">Choosing the right postgraduate program begins with understanding the eligibility criteria in detail. Many students apply for MCA programs without properly analyzing whether their academic background, technical understanding, or career goals align with the curriculum. This often leads to confusion later regarding subject difficulty, programming requirements, or specialization suitability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"898\">The Online MCA program offered by GLA Online is designed for students who want to build strong expertise in computer applications, software development, programming, data handling, and modern IT systems. The eligibility structure focuses on providing opportunities to learners who have an academic foundation related to technology, computer applications, or analytical problem-solving.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1139\">This program is particularly suitable for students aiming to build careers in software development, IT services, application design, cloud technologies, cybersecurity, data analytics, and other rapidly growing technology-driven industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1144\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tfff74\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1199\">Basic Eligibility Criteria for Online MCA Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1311\">To apply for the Online MCA program, candidates must possess a bachelor&rsquo;s degree from a recognized university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1394\">The program generally prefers applicants with educational backgrounds related to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tue68s\" data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1404\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p3jjs6\" data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1428\">Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h8t22m\" data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1458\">Information Technology (IT)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1631\">This preference exists because the MCA curriculum involves technical subjects that require analytical thinking, logical reasoning, and familiarity with computing concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1636\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lkmf3p\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1687\">Preferred Academic Background for MCA Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1902\">Although students from different educational streams may apply depending on university policies, candidates with technical or computer-related backgrounds often find it easier to adapt to the curriculum structure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k76lkn\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1945\">Common Preferred Undergraduate Degrees</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"r4k1fg\" data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1990\">Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2048\">BCA graduates already possess foundational knowledge in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2127\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11hmqq8\" data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2072\">Programming languages</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w57mf2\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2084\">Databases</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geuef6\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2104\">Computer networks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z57xjo\" data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2127\">Software development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2208\">This background creates a smoother transition into advanced MCA-level learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2213\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yg02t0\" data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2246\">Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2445\">Students from science streams, especially those with mathematics or computer science exposure, usually develop strong analytical and problem-solving skills that are highly valuable in MCA programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2450\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cftu6a\" data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2489\">Information Technology Background</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2558\">Candidates with IT-related educational experience often understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2646\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k9ure3\" data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2578\">System operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kcix4r\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2600\">Technical workflows</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1silapg\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2621\">Basic coding logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"or1h05\" data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2646\">Digital infrastructure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2717\">This helps them adapt more efficiently to software-oriented subjects.<br><br></p>\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93sruh\" data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4326\">Eligibility for Final-Year Undergraduate Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4328\" data-end=\"4431\">GLA Online also allows undergraduate final-year students awaiting results to apply for the MCA program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4433\" data-end=\"4541\">This flexibility helps students continue their academic journey without unnecessary delays after graduation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xt5l76\" data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4580\">Advantages for Final-Year Students</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2i15i9\" data-start=\"4582\" data-end=\"4612\">Smooth Academic Continuity</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4614\" data-end=\"4714\">Students can transition directly into postgraduate studies instead of losing valuable academic time.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ad7lb2\" data-start=\"4716\" data-end=\"4744\">Early Career Preparation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4865\">Starting an MCA program earlier allows students to enter the technology industry faster with advanced technical skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jc99u2\" data-start=\"4867\" data-end=\"4892\">Competitive Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4894\" data-end=\"5047\">Technology industries evolve rapidly. Students who begin postgraduate specialization early often gain better opportunities in placements and internships.</p>', '<p data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"470\">Understanding the complete MCA fee structure before taking admission is one of the most important steps for students and parents. Many applicants only focus on the tuition fee while ignoring other academic charges such as examination fees, registration costs, alumni charges, and payment mode benefits. This often creates confusion later during enrollment and financial planning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"793\">The Online MCA program at GLA Online is structured to provide flexible payment options so students can choose a fee plan according to their financial comfort and educational goals. The university offers semester-wise, annual, and complete program payment structures, allowing learners to manage expenses more efficiently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"982\">This detailed guide explains the full MCA fee structure, payment options, benefits, hidden considerations, and important financial planning insights students should know before admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"987\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jvxaac\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1033\">GLA Online MCA Semester-Wise Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1202\">The semester payment option is ideal for students who prefer dividing educational expenses into smaller installments rather than paying the full yearly amount at once.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1244\">This model is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1392\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jlmdgf\" data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1293\">Students managing personal educational budgets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"103yrxw\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1344\">Working professionals balancing monthly expenses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ubmkj\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1392\">Families preferring phased financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ee01v3\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1417\">Semester Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1445\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1445\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1435\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1445\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1494\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1486\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1494\">₹500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1529\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1519\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1529\">₹1,800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1555\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1544\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1555\">₹21,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1582\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Semester)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1592\">₹1,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1597\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4hwub0\" data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1643\">Understanding the Semester Fee Components</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bsq28h\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1665\">Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1825\">The registration fee is a one-time administrative charge collected during the admission process for application processing and student enrollment formalities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v5fb8y\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1841\">Alumni Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"2022\">The alumni fee helps students become part of the university&rsquo;s alumni network, which can support future professional networking, career opportunities, and institutional engagement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ownqvo\" data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2039\">Tuition Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2064\">The tuition fee covers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2179\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sal845\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2087\">Academic instruction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cv58kq\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2115\">Online learning resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91t2ji\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2128\">LMS access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16xy0rb\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2146\">Faculty support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14uer0u\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2179\">Course delivery infrastructure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c7isgb\" data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2200\">Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2327\">Examination fees are charged separately for conducting semester assessments, evaluations, and academic processing activities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2332\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8qnm86\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2371\">GLA Online MCA Annual Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2592\">The annual fee option allows students to pay the academic charges once every year instead of semester-wise. Many students prefer this mode because it simplifies financial management and provides additional fee benefits.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"blk1a0\" data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2615\">Annual Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2786\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2643\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2643\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2633\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2643\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2786\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2692\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2684\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2692\">₹500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2727\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2717\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2727\">₹1,800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2753\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2742\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2753\">₹43,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2786\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2776\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2786\">₹3,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2791\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"155mp3d\" data-start=\"3365\" data-end=\"3409\">GLA Online MCA Total Program Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3411\" data-end=\"3566\">Understanding the total program fee is essential because many students underestimate the complete financial commitment required for postgraduate education.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16di4nr\" data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3596\">Total Program Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3756\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3624\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3624\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3614\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"3624\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3756\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3673\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3665\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3673\">₹500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3708\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3698\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3708\">₹1,800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3734\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3734\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹86,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3756\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3746\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3756\">₹6,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"688\">The Online MCA curriculum is designed to prepare students for modern technology-driven careers by combining programming knowledge, software development skills, database management, networking concepts, machine learning fundamentals, and real-world project experience. In today&rsquo;s digital economy, companies no longer seek professionals who only possess theoretical computer knowledge. Industries now require technically skilled professionals capable of solving practical problems, developing applications, managing systems, and adapting to rapidly evolving technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"1232\">The Online MCA program follows a progressive learning structure where students first build strong computer science foundations and gradually move toward advanced development technologies, machine learning concepts, mobile applications, and project implementation. The curriculum focuses on both theoretical understanding and hands-on technical training, making it suitable for students aiming to build successful careers in software engineering, web development, cloud technologies, data systems, mobile applications, and emerging IT sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1471\">Unlike traditional programs that rely heavily on outdated theory, this MCA syllabus emphasizes industry-oriented practical learning, coding proficiency, logical problem-solving, communication skills, and project-based technical exposure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1476\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"owndz8\" data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1517\">Online MCA Program Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1654\">The Online MCA program is divided into four semesters. Each semester is carefully structured to build technical expertise step by step.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kur7ng\" data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1691\">Key Highlights of the Curriculum</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"2043\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w9kvqh\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1724\">Strong programming foundation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12hvb8m\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1758\">Full stack development training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vr6cjt\" data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1794\">Database and networking expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jhkfcd\" data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1826\">Software engineering concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nmm7zt\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1858\">Machine learning introduction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vu5na9\" data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1891\">Mobile application development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"djcv07\" data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1935\">Communication and soft skills enhancement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1038a8x\" data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1968\">Industry-oriented project work</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1odamnf\" data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2000\">Practical laboratory exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bstbi0\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2043\">Real-world application development focus</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2114\">The curriculum progression follows a logical technical learning path:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2294\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"72trpi\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2152\">Core computer science fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wgsp57\" data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2191\">Advanced programming and networking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rzx476\" data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2244\">Emerging technologies and application development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10nyxnt\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2294\">Final industry-oriented project implementation</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2411\">This structure helps students gradually develop confidence and technical competency required for modern IT careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2416\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10pt8g\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2478\">Semester 1: Foundation of Computer Science and Programming</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2741\">The first semester focuses on building the technical base required for advanced computing and software development. Students learn computer science fundamentals, programming logic, database systems, web technologies, mathematics, and professional communication.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2765\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"3248\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2791\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2791\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2777\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2791\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"3248\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2864\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2837\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fundamentals of Computer Science</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2864\">Core computing concepts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2934\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2900\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Software Engineering and Testing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2934\">Software development lifecycle</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2994\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2966\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Problem Solving Using Python</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"2994\">Programming fundamentals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3063\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Stack Development &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3063\">Front-end and basic web development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3119\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3078\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3119\">Computational and logical foundations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3180\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Database Management System</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3180\">Data storage and management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3248\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3214\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Communication &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3248\">Technical communication skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1r4tsd6\" data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3272\">Practical Subjects</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3518\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3294\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3294\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3280\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lab</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3294\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3518\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3353\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3318\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Python Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3353\">Practical coding implementation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3411\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3383\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Stack Development Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3411\">Web application practice</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3458\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3423\" data-col-size=\"sm\">DBMS Lab</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3458\" data-col-size=\"md\">Database queries and management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3459\" data-end=\"3518\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3459\" data-end=\"3473\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soft Skills</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3518\" data-col-size=\"md\">Personality and communication development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3523\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rl58x4\" data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3559\">Fundamentals of Computer Science</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3561\" data-end=\"3699\">This subject introduces students to the fundamental concepts of computing, hardware, software systems, algorithms, and digital operations.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19bo35x\" data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3733\">Why This Subject Is Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3798\">A strong computer science foundation helps students understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3891\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1axhb20\" data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3820\">System architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3rkldy\" data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3842\">Computational logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fesfhj\" data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3863\">Software workflows</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ejusxn\" data-start=\"3864\" data-end=\"3891\">Technical problem-solving</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3998\">Without these basics, advanced programming and development subjects become difficult to understand later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4000\" data-end=\"4003\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"epm78t\" data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4039\">Software Engineering and Testing</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4041\" data-end=\"4187\">Software engineering teaches systematic software development processes, project planning, testing methodologies, debugging, and quality assurance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1if56nb\" data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4208\">Skills Developed</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4335\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sxbbrp\" data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4244\">Software lifecycle understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aods29\" data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4265\">Testing techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t3rkl6\" data-start=\"4266\" data-end=\"4288\">Error identification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o3p6f9\" data-start=\"4289\" data-end=\"4311\">Requirement analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ssi233\" data-start=\"4312\" data-end=\"4335\">Project documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4337\" data-end=\"4454\">Modern companies highly value professionals who understand both development and software quality assurance processes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4456\" data-end=\"4459\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1845peh\" data-start=\"4461\" data-end=\"4491\">Problem Solving Using Python</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4493\" data-end=\"4606\">Python is one of the most in-demand programming languages globally due to its simplicity and wide application in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4697\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mp09nw\" data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4621\">Data science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"399lfb\" data-start=\"4622\" data-end=\"4634\">Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u78spn\" data-start=\"4635\" data-end=\"4660\">Artificial intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vetgzv\" data-start=\"4661\" data-end=\"4678\">Web development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmznp5\" data-start=\"4679\" data-end=\"4697\">Machine learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4699\" data-end=\"4772\">This subject develops programming logic and problem-solving capabilities.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yfgite\" data-start=\"4774\" data-end=\"4795\">Key Learning Areas</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4797\" data-end=\"4893\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r4te25\" data-start=\"4797\" data-end=\"4823\">Variables and data types</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15d2gcs\" data-start=\"4824\" data-end=\"4846\">Loops and conditions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"195wzmh\" data-start=\"4847\" data-end=\"4858\">Functions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y1f34x\" data-start=\"4859\" data-end=\"4874\">File handling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3drc1a\" data-start=\"4875\" data-end=\"4893\">Basic algorithms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4895\" data-end=\"4898\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19a606q\" data-start=\"4900\" data-end=\"4928\">Full Stack Development &ndash; I</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4930\" data-end=\"5025\">This subject introduces students to modern web technologies and front-end development concepts.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pvok2z\" data-start=\"5027\" data-end=\"5044\">Students Learn</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5046\" data-end=\"5135\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3sm39\" data-start=\"5046\" data-end=\"5052\">HTML</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4e2z\" data-start=\"5053\" data-end=\"5058\">CSS</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18gli38\" data-start=\"5059\" data-end=\"5081\">Basic web interfaces</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9troc5\" data-start=\"5082\" data-end=\"5110\">Responsive design concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fnsjq6\" data-start=\"5111\" data-end=\"5135\">Front-end architecture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5137\" data-end=\"5268\">Full stack development skills are highly valuable because businesses increasingly depend on digital platforms and web applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5270\" data-end=\"5273\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wnilud\" data-start=\"5275\" data-end=\"5303\">Database Management System</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5305\" data-end=\"5443\">Database management is a critical area in software and business applications because almost every modern system stores and processes data.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1roeqch\" data-start=\"5445\" data-end=\"5469\">Core Concepts Covered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5471\" data-end=\"5560\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wl0ikq\" data-start=\"5471\" data-end=\"5484\">SQL queries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdcpxb\" data-start=\"5485\" data-end=\"5502\">Database design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15rdp45\" data-start=\"5503\" data-end=\"5523\">Data normalization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ubfni\" data-start=\"5524\" data-end=\"5540\">Data retrieval</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qb9fy3\" data-start=\"5541\" data-end=\"5560\">Database security</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5562\" data-end=\"5658\">Strong database knowledge is essential for software developers, analysts, and backend engineers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5660\" data-end=\"5663\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1e6js8a\" data-start=\"5665\" data-end=\"5709\">Professional Communication and Soft Skills</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5711\" data-end=\"5843\">Technical expertise alone is not sufficient for career success. Students also need communication, teamwork, and presentation skills.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1irk9lg\" data-start=\"5845\" data-end=\"5870\">Why Soft Skills Matter</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5872\" data-end=\"6009\">Many technically strong students struggle during placements because of poor communication abilities. This subject helps students improve:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6010\" data-end=\"6106\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14kg2e1\" data-start=\"6010\" data-end=\"6036\">Professional interaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yr6r51\" data-start=\"6037\" data-end=\"6059\">Interview confidence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b277ju\" data-start=\"6060\" data-end=\"6080\">Team collaboration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12ddhu\" data-start=\"6081\" data-end=\"6106\">Workplace communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6108\" data-end=\"6111\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pl67ei\" data-start=\"6113\" data-end=\"6170\">Semester 2: Advanced Programming and System Development</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6172\" data-end=\"6336\">The second semester strengthens software development expertise and introduces advanced data structures, networking concepts, and full-stack application development.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"6338\" data-end=\"6360\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"6362\" data-end=\"6772\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"6362\" data-end=\"6386\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6362\" data-end=\"6386\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"6362\" data-end=\"6372\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6386\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"6397\" data-end=\"6772\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6397\" data-end=\"6457\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6397\" data-end=\"6426\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Problem Solving Using Java</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6426\" data-end=\"6457\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Object-oriented programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6458\" data-end=\"6529\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6458\" data-end=\"6500\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Applied Data Structure and Applications</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6500\" data-end=\"6529\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Efficient data management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6530\" data-end=\"6589\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6530\" data-end=\"6560\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Stack Development &ndash; II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6560\" data-end=\"6589\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced web technologies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6590\" data-end=\"6643\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6590\" data-end=\"6610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer Networks</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6610\" data-end=\"6643\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Network communication systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6644\" data-end=\"6711\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6644\" data-end=\"6678\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Communication &ndash; II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6678\" data-end=\"6711\">Advanced communication skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6712\" data-end=\"6772\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6712\" data-end=\"6730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ethics &amp; Values</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6730\" data-end=\"6772\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional ethics and responsibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1r4tsd6\" data-start=\"6774\" data-end=\"6796\">Practical Subjects</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"6798\" data-end=\"7032\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"6798\" data-end=\"6818\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6798\" data-end=\"6818\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"6798\" data-end=\"6804\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lab</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"6804\" data-end=\"6818\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"6829\" data-end=\"7032\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6829\" data-end=\"6869\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6829\" data-end=\"6840\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Java Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6840\" data-end=\"6869\">Java programming practice</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6870\" data-end=\"6919\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6870\" data-end=\"6891\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Structure Lab</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6891\" data-end=\"6919\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Algorithm implementation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6920\" data-end=\"6985\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6920\" data-end=\"6949\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Stack Development Lab</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6949\" data-end=\"6985\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced application development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6986\" data-end=\"7032\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6986\" data-end=\"7000\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soft Skills</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"7000\" data-end=\"7032\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Career readiness enhancement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7034\" data-end=\"7037\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16tgipd\" data-start=\"7039\" data-end=\"7067\">Problem Solving Using Java</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7069\" data-end=\"7149\">Java remains one of the most important enterprise programming languages used in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7150\" data-end=\"7232\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13cboem\" data-start=\"7150\" data-end=\"7173\">Software applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13b6b3s\" data-start=\"7174\" data-end=\"7191\">Banking systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j6aiv4\" data-start=\"7192\" data-end=\"7213\">Android development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mxvan6\" data-start=\"7214\" data-end=\"7232\">Backend services</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wxjubg\" data-start=\"7234\" data-end=\"7257\">Skills Students Gain</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7259\" data-end=\"7369\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k30kcj\" data-start=\"7259\" data-end=\"7288\">Object-oriented programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oxo8a8\" data-start=\"7289\" data-end=\"7309\">Exception handling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r42re3\" data-start=\"7310\" data-end=\"7337\">Class and object concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hz8cfj\" data-start=\"7338\" data-end=\"7369\">Application logic development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7371\" data-end=\"7461\">Java helps students build strong coding discipline and scalable application understanding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7463\" data-end=\"7466\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1yblqjb\" data-start=\"7468\" data-end=\"7510\">Applied Data Structures and Applications</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7512\" data-end=\"7576\">Data structures form the backbone of efficient software systems.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1lvzpcq\" data-start=\"7578\" data-end=\"7597\">Concepts Covered</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7599\" data-end=\"7683\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wk5hmq\" data-start=\"7599\" data-end=\"7607\">Arrays</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bu3ztk\" data-start=\"7608\" data-end=\"7622\">Linked lists</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"660xth\" data-start=\"7623\" data-end=\"7631\">Stacks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"78yjoq\" data-start=\"7632\" data-end=\"7640\">Queues</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"177pcv1\" data-start=\"7641\" data-end=\"7648\">Trees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rjjfij\" data-start=\"7649\" data-end=\"7683\">Searching and sorting algorithms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7685\" data-end=\"7750\">This subject improves coding efficiency and algorithmic thinking.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7752\" data-end=\"7755\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cvdizw\" data-start=\"7757\" data-end=\"7776\">Computer Networks</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7778\" data-end=\"7874\">Computer networking explains how systems communicate and share data across digital environments.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ozus00\" data-start=\"7876\" data-end=\"7889\">Key Topics</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7891\" data-end=\"7998\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vbdugz\" data-start=\"7891\" data-end=\"7913\">Network architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hoiuly\" data-start=\"7914\" data-end=\"7934\">Internet protocols</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u1imte\" data-start=\"7935\" data-end=\"7952\">Routing systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y4bff2\" data-start=\"7953\" data-end=\"7972\">Data transmission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqumy1\" data-start=\"7973\" data-end=\"7998\">Network security basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8000\" data-end=\"8131\">Networking knowledge is important for cloud computing, cybersecurity, system administration, and infrastructure management careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8133\" data-end=\"8136\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13hddw5\" data-start=\"8138\" data-end=\"8157\">Ethics and Values</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"8159\" data-end=\"8342\">Technology professionals often handle sensitive user data and critical systems. Ethical understanding helps students develop professional responsibility and decision-making awareness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8344\" data-end=\"8347\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zlv4ij\" data-start=\"8349\" data-end=\"8412\">Semester 3: Emerging Technologies and Application Development</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"8414\" data-end=\"8545\">The third semester introduces advanced technologies such as machine learning, mobile application development, and .NET programming.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"8547\" data-end=\"8569\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"8571\" data-end=\"8989\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"8571\" data-end=\"8595\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"8571\" data-end=\"8595\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"8571\" data-end=\"8581\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"8581\" data-end=\"8595\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"8606\" data-end=\"8989\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"8606\" data-end=\"8670\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8606\" data-end=\"8641\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to Machine Learning</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"8641\" data-end=\"8670\">AI and predictive systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8671\" data-end=\"8751\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8671\" data-end=\"8713\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to .NET and C# Programming</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"8713\" data-end=\"8751\">Microsoft development technologies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8752\" data-end=\"8832\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8752\" data-end=\"8799\" data-col-size=\"md\">Applied Data Structure and Applications &ndash; II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"8799\" data-end=\"8832\">Advanced algorithmic concepts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8833\" data-end=\"8896\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8833\" data-end=\"8866\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mobile Application Development</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"8866\" data-end=\"8896\">Android and mobile systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8897\" data-end=\"8949\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8897\" data-end=\"8921\" data-col-size=\"md\">Environmental Science</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"8921\" data-end=\"8949\">Sustainability awareness</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8950\" data-end=\"8989\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8950\" data-end=\"8964\" data-col-size=\"md\">Soft Skills</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"8964\" data-end=\"8989\">Workplace preparation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1r4tsd6\" data-start=\"8991\" data-end=\"9013\">Practical Subjects</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"9015\" data-end=\"9255\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"9015\" data-end=\"9035\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"9015\" data-end=\"9035\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"9015\" data-end=\"9021\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lab</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"9021\" data-end=\"9035\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"9046\" data-end=\"9255\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"9046\" data-end=\"9096\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9046\" data-end=\"9069\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Machine Learning Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"9069\" data-end=\"9096\">ML model implementation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"9097\" data-end=\"9151\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9097\" data-end=\"9126\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mobile App Development Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"9126\" data-end=\"9151\">App-building practice</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"9152\" data-end=\"9205\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9152\" data-end=\"9173\" data-col-size=\"sm\">C# Programming Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"9173\" data-end=\"9205\">.NET application development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"9206\" data-end=\"9255\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9206\" data-end=\"9227\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Structure Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"9227\" data-end=\"9255\">Advanced coding practice</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9257\" data-end=\"9260\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"kzhqk\" data-start=\"9262\" data-end=\"9296\">Introduction to Machine Learning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9298\" data-end=\"9372\">Machine learning is one of the fastest-growing technology fields globally.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pvok2z\" data-start=\"9374\" data-end=\"9391\">Students Learn</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9393\" data-end=\"9510\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ysbq00\" data-start=\"9393\" data-end=\"9414\">Predictive modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6r4iyr\" data-start=\"9415\" data-end=\"9437\">Data analysis basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xpa0k9\" data-start=\"9438\" data-end=\"9466\">Machine learning workflows</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hqzy4t\" data-start=\"9467\" data-end=\"9492\">Classification concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ppruc\" data-start=\"9493\" data-end=\"9510\">AI fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"9512\" data-end=\"9614\">Even introductory ML knowledge can significantly improve career opportunities in modern IT industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9616\" data-end=\"9619\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4pgz0e\" data-start=\"9621\" data-end=\"9662\">Introduction to .NET and C# Programming</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9664\" data-end=\"9784\">This subject focuses on Microsoft-based application development technologies widely used in enterprise software systems.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ogm5ly\" data-start=\"9786\" data-end=\"9805\">Career Relevance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9807\" data-end=\"9840\">C# and .NET are commonly used in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9841\" data-end=\"9944\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18vodqs\" data-start=\"9841\" data-end=\"9866\">Enterprise applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rjoa6n\" data-start=\"9867\" data-end=\"9882\">Cloud systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bq7y5e\" data-start=\"9883\" data-end=\"9916\">Corporate software environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2d82pm\" data-start=\"9917\" data-end=\"9944\">Business automation tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9946\" data-end=\"9949\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jiuezz\" data-start=\"9951\" data-end=\"9983\">Mobile Application Development</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9985\" data-end=\"10124\">With the growth of smartphones and digital platforms, mobile application development has become one of the most in-demand technical skills.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pvok2z\" data-start=\"10126\" data-end=\"10143\">Students Learn</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10145\" data-end=\"10244\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r1rpif\" data-start=\"10145\" data-end=\"10168\">Mobile UI development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wu1j98\" data-start=\"10169\" data-end=\"10187\">App architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"145y1s2\" data-start=\"10188\" data-end=\"10217\">Mobile programming concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r84jhx\" data-start=\"10218\" data-end=\"10244\">User interaction systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"10246\" data-end=\"10358\">Mobile development skills open opportunities in startups, software firms, and freelance application development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10360\" data-end=\"10363\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"97btcs\" data-start=\"10365\" data-end=\"10419\">Semester 4: Industry-Oriented Project Implementation</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"10421\" data-end=\"10513\">The fourth semester is entirely focused on project development and practical implementation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xvndv\" data-start=\"10515\" data-end=\"10536\">Semester 4 Subject</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"10538\" data-end=\"10622\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"10538\" data-end=\"10562\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"10538\" data-end=\"10562\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"10538\" data-end=\"10548\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"10548\" data-end=\"10562\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"10573\" data-end=\"10622\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"10573\" data-end=\"10622\">\r\n<td data-start=\"10573\" data-end=\"10583\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"10583\" data-end=\"10622\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Real-world technical implementation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10624\" data-end=\"10627\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"qiwyj8\" data-start=\"10629\" data-end=\"10666\">Importance of the Final MCA Project</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"10668\" data-end=\"10833\">The project is one of the most important components of the MCA curriculum because it allows students to apply their technical knowledge to solve real-world problems.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rl0xto\" data-start=\"10835\" data-end=\"10862\">Benefits of Project Work</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10864\" data-end=\"11009\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"165fg5w\" data-start=\"10864\" data-end=\"10905\">Practical software development exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"98djmj\" data-start=\"10906\" data-end=\"10926\">Portfolio creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"614bia\" data-start=\"10927\" data-end=\"10947\">Industry readiness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ttsh5\" data-start=\"10948\" data-end=\"10979\">Technical confidence building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fm8ey8\" data-start=\"10980\" data-end=\"11009\">Problem-solving enhancement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"11011\" data-end=\"11110\">Students who build strong projects often perform better during placements and technical interviews.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11112\" data-end=\"11115\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rc6rm0\" data-start=\"11117\" data-end=\"11179\">Technical Skills Developed Through the Online MCA Curriculum</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"11181\" data-end=\"11293\">The Online MCA syllabus helps students develop both theoretical understanding and practical technical expertise.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"oxirfr\" data-start=\"11295\" data-end=\"11324\">Major Skills Students Gain</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11326\" data-end=\"11578\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i9x7fs\" data-start=\"11326\" data-end=\"11351\">Programming proficiency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uau5ye\" data-start=\"11352\" data-end=\"11376\">Full stack development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"od5bxa\" data-start=\"11377\" data-end=\"11398\">Database management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8p1nj8\" data-start=\"11399\" data-end=\"11421\">Networking knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v17asw\" data-start=\"11422\" data-end=\"11447\">Machine learning basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vu5na9\" data-start=\"11448\" data-end=\"11480\">Mobile application development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yox94h\" data-start=\"11481\" data-end=\"11499\">Software testing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"109ijwq\" data-start=\"11500\" data-end=\"11525\">Problem-solving ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"11526\" data-end=\"11548\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"svbdh8\" data-start=\"11549\" data-end=\"11578\">Technical project execution</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11580\" data-end=\"11583\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"95s5fj\" data-start=\"11585\" data-end=\"11624\">Career Opportunities After Online MCA</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"11626\" data-end=\"11707\">The MCA curriculum prepares students for multiple high-demand technology careers.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"syuj7p\" data-start=\"11709\" data-end=\"11732\">Popular Career Roles</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11734\" data-end=\"11953\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"157ove9\" data-start=\"11734\" data-end=\"11754\">Software Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3gf92b\" data-start=\"11755\" data-end=\"11777\">Full Stack Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15clqa2\" data-start=\"11778\" data-end=\"11796\">Python Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n81602\" data-start=\"11797\" data-end=\"11813\">Java Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mxzt4e\" data-start=\"11814\" data-end=\"11829\">Web Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v7ntk4\" data-start=\"11830\" data-end=\"11860\">Mobile Application Developer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h6d6om\" data-start=\"11861\" data-end=\"11885\">Database Administrator</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fgfld\" data-start=\"11886\" data-end=\"11902\">System Analyst</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qn00lp\" data-start=\"11903\" data-end=\"11931\">Machine Learning Associate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ru8rc3\" data-start=\"11932\" data-end=\"11953\">IT Support Engineer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"11955\" data-end=\"12077\">Technology-driven industries continue expanding rapidly, creating strong demand for skilled software and IT professionals.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 86000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(327, 73, 'cb1d0e55-4d52-4f8e-a95d-1e010c5143ea', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 01:26:35', '2026-05-08 01:26:35', '<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"379\">Applying to GLA Online is designed to be simple, fast, and completely digital so students can complete the entire admission journey from anywhere. The university has structured the admission workflow into clear stages that help students move smoothly from registration to final enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"704\">Understanding every step carefully is extremely important because many students face delays due to incomplete forms, incorrect document uploads, payment mistakes, or missing verification requirements. A proper understanding of the process helps applicants avoid unnecessary complications and complete admission confidently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"784\">Below is the complete 6-step GLA Online admission process explained in detail.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"789\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vaxbr6\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"826\">Step 1: Fill the Required Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1028\">The admission process begins with entering basic details on the online application portal. This initial registration helps the university create the student profile and start the enrollment procedure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cgszcb\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1061\">Information Usually Required</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uzprjw\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1074\">Full name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h04qtn\" data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1090\">Mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6nm42x\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1101\">Email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wr39ao\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1130\">Preferred course selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tbsncu\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1163\">Academic qualification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5vnbz\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1192\">State and city information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1339\">Students should ensure that the details entered are accurate because these records are later used during verification and admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yz2xhq\" data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1357\">Important Tip</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1537\">Always use an active email ID and mobile number because all future communication, login credentials, fee updates, and admission notifications will be sent through these channels.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1542\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"nnhrlq\" data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1589\">Step 2: Receive Login Credentials via Email</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1775\">After submitting the initial details, students receive login credentials on their registered email address. These credentials allow applicants to access the online admission dashboard.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hdn9j2\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1801\">What Students Receive</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1912\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1icq2uo\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1834\">User ID or application number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ojjb04\" data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1851\">Login password</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i2rvtd\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1877\">Admission portal access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nc4e8j\" data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1912\">Further application instructions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"2062\">The admission portal acts as the main platform for completing all remaining formalities including form submission, fee payment, and document upload.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1q25kbu\" data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2090\">Common Mistake to Avoid</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2124\">Students should regularly check:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2163\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16tcfq2\" data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2132\">Inbox</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yjmisx\" data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2146\">Spam folder</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9hom7\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2163\">Promotions tab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2221\">Sometimes official emails may be filtered automatically.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2226\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"z97g6k\" data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2264\">Step 3: Fill the Registration Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2504\">After logging into the admission portal, students must complete the detailed registration form carefully. This is one of the most critical stages because the submitted information becomes part of the university&rsquo;s official student records.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"auje4m\" data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2550\">Details Included in the Registration Form</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fkli58\" data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2572\">Personal Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3z0bz\" data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2579\">Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14lnz5c\" data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2595\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pt4cvs\" data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2616\">Parent information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ibp5y6\" data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2626\">Address</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"185bhtt\" data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2648\">Academic Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2770\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vuenmz\" data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2671\">Class 10 information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1803h2h\" data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2694\">Class 12 information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16mbxjz\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2745\">Graduation details (for postgraduate admissions)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tvzknv\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2770\">Marks and passing year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18cuojd\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2790\">Course Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2860\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yv82ak\" data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2810\">Program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g5hxv0\" data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2834\">Specialization choice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmm9ez\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2860\">Study mode confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2865\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jwthoc\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2901\">Step 4: Pay the Registration Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"3027\">Once the registration form is completed, students must pay the registration fee to proceed further in the admission process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"r38xuy\" data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3057\">Available Payment Methods</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3132\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nlqvoi\" data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3071\">Debit card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dnpt3l\" data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3085\">Credit card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hf7qq9\" data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3099\">Net banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4vms\" data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3105\">UPI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xzu1mr\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3132\">Digital payment gateways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3206\">The online payment system is designed for secure and quick transactions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jy2w3j\" data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3227\">Important Advice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3245\">Students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3362\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkysqk\" data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3269\">Save payment receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xos0um\" data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3315\">Take screenshots of successful transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pn0dv7\" data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3362\">Avoid refreshing the payment page repeatedly</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3408\">This helps prevent duplicate payment issues.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3413\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kyfezx\" data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3446\">Step 5: Document Verification</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3636\">Document verification is one of the most important stages of online admission. During this process, the university verifies the authenticity of the student&rsquo;s academic and personal records.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hfjbc8\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3668\">Commonly Required Documents</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zl2vgf\" data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3692\">Academic Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3776\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17fpgl9\" data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3713\">Class 10 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqxqv3\" data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3734\">Class 12 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ca671x\" data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3776\">Graduation certificates (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"taixd8\" data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3800\">Identity Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3844\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jslcwy\" data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3815\">Aadhaar card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xrh0kk\" data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3844\">Government-issued ID proof</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"spyfb2\" data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3865\">Other Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3943\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lye5s8\" data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3892\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199lc0c\" data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3904\">Signature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dcj5v2\" data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3943\">Category certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"3948\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1d56c05\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3981\">Why Verification Is Important</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"4004\">Verification ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4112\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cmopca\" data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4031\">Eligibility confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v5oioy\" data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4059\">Authentic student records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ylw23t\" data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4093\">Accurate academic documentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nlt7ey\" data-start=\"4094\" data-end=\"4112\">Fraud prevention</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4114\" data-end=\"4203\">Students should upload clear and readable scanned documents to avoid rejection or delays.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4208\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1scprv2\" data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4258\">Step 6: Enrollment Confirmation and LMS Access</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4423\">After successful verification and approval, students receive final admission confirmation from the university. This marks the completion of the enrollment process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fl9s51\" data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4468\">What Students Receive After Confirmation</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4622\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bx4sz3\" data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4489\">Enrollment number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1smq61c\" data-start=\"4490\" data-end=\"4521\">Admission confirmation letter</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wm636u\" data-start=\"4522\" data-end=\"4544\">Student login access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzs6ox\" data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4591\">Learning Management System (LMS) credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mjs849\" data-start=\"4592\" data-end=\"4622\">Academic orientation details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4624\" data-end=\"4700\">The LMS platform becomes the central learning hub where students can access:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4791\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3d0q73\" data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4718\">Study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pack97\" data-start=\"4719\" data-end=\"4738\">Recorded lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lie7pk\" data-start=\"4739\" data-end=\"4752\">Assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mgmktp\" data-start=\"4753\" data-end=\"4766\">Assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1so1bun\" data-start=\"4767\" data-end=\"4791\">Academic announcements</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">Embarking on a Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) journey is a pivotal decision for any aspiring leader. At <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"115\">GLA University Online</strong>, the admissions process is designed to be inclusive, ensuring that high-quality management education is accessible to a broad spectrum of learners. As a <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"290\">NAAC A+ accredited institution</strong>, the university maintains rigorous academic standards while providing a welcoming entry point for students from diverse educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Understanding the eligibility requirements is the essential first step in securing your place in this industry-aligned program. Below is a comprehensive and descriptive guide to the qualifications needed to join the GLA University Online BBA community.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Detailed Academic Requirements and Qualifications</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The primary gateway to the online BBA program is rooted in a student\'s foundational secondary education. The university has streamlined these requirements to ensure that every applicant has the necessary academic base to excel in a business environment.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Requirement Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Eligibility Criteria Details</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Minimum Educational Qualification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\">Completion of <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"14\">10+2 (Intermediate)</strong> or an equivalent examination.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recognized Boards</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\">The qualification must be from a <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">recognized national or state board</strong> of education.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stream Flexibility</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\">Open to students from <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"22\">any academic stream</strong> (Science, Commerce, Arts, or Vocational).</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Aspirational Alignment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\">Ideal for those targeting careers in <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">Management, Entrepreneurship, or Corporate Leadership</strong>.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">An Inclusive Approach: Welcoming All Academic Backgrounds</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">One of the standout features of the GLA University Online BBA is its multidisciplinary inclusivity. The university recognizes that business leaders come from various walks of life, and the curriculum is structured to support students regardless of their previous field of study.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_7fa4e3b84c780bc4-169\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-307\">Commerce Students:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-307\"> Those with a background in commerce will find a natural progression into the program, building upon existing knowledge of accounting and business studies</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-307 citation-end-307\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_7fa4e3b84c780bc4-170\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Science and Arts Students:</strong> Applicants from Science or Arts backgrounds are highly encouraged to apply. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-306\">The first year of the program is specifically designed to bridge any knowledge gaps, introducing </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,2\" data-index-in-node=\"97\"><span class=\"citation-306\">Principles of Management</span></strong><span class=\"citation-306\"> and </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,2\" data-index-in-node=\"126\"><span class=\"citation-306\">Basic Accounting</span></strong><span class=\"citation-306\"> from the ground up</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-306 citation-end-306\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vocational Backgrounds:</strong> Students who have completed vocational studies are also eligible, bringing unique practical perspectives to the digital classroom.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">This \"open-stream\" policy ensures that a passion for business and a drive for professional growth are the primary factors for admission, rather than just previous subject choices.</p>', '<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-109\" data-path-to-node=\"1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,1\"><span class=\"citation-224\">Selecting an Online Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) is a transformative step for students and professionals aiming for leadership roles in the corporate world</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,2\"><span class=\"citation-224 citation-end-224\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,5\"><span class=\"citation-223\">GLA University, distinguished by its </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,5\" data-index-in-node=\"37\"><span class=\"citation-223\">NAAC A+ accreditation</span></strong><span class=\"citation-223\">, provides a top-tier educational experience characterized by financial transparency and accessibility</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,6\"><span class=\"citation-223 citation-end-223\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,7\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,9\"><span class=\"citation-222\">By understanding the specific components of the fee structure, students can strategically plan their academic investment to maximize value while minimizing out-of-pocket expenses</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,10\"><span class=\"citation-222 citation-end-222\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,11\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-110\" data-path-to-node=\"2\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1\"><span class=\"citation-221\">The program is meticulously designed to offer a balance between high-quality instructional content and an affordable cost-to-benefit ratio</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2\"><span class=\"citation-221 citation-end-221\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,5\"><span class=\"citation-220\">Below is a deep, explanatory breakdown of the financial commitments required for the Online BBA program, presented in a structured format for maximum clarity</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,6\"><span class=\"citation-220 citation-end-220\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Complete BBA Fee Breakdown and Comparative Analysis</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-111\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0\">The table below summarizes the core financial requirements of the GLA University Online BBA. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-219\">It contrasts the three primary payment tracks&mdash;Semester-wise, Annual, and Total Program&mdash;to highlight the direct savings available to students who commit to longer-term payment cycles</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\"><span class=\"citation-219 citation-end-219\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester-Wise Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Annual Payment Plan</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Total Program Payment</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-218\">₹ 500 (One-time) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-217\">₹ 500 (One-time) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,3,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-216\">₹ 500 (One-time) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Alumni Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-215\">₹ 1,800 (One-time) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-214\">₹ 1,800 (One-time) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,3,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-213\">₹ 1,800 (One-time) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tuition Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-212\">₹ 14,750</span></strong> </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-211\">₹ 29,500</span></strong> </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-210\">₹ 88,500</span></strong> </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-209\">₹ 1,500 </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-208\">₹ 3,000 </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,3,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-207\">₹ 9,000 </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Special Benefits</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,1,0\">None (Pay-as-you-go)</span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,5,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-206\">₹ 1,000 Off</span></strong><span class=\"citation-206\"> (1st Year) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,5,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-205\">₹ 3,000 Off</span></strong><span class=\"citation-205\"> (Full Course) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Flexibility</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,6,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-204\">Highest flexibility </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,6,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-203\">Moderate savings </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,6,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,6,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-202\">Maximum Savings</span></strong> </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Detailed Explanation of Individual Fee Components</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-112\" data-path-to-node=\"9\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1\"><span class=\"citation-201\">To ensure complete transparency, it is vital to understand what each specific fee covers and how it contributes to your overall academic journey</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2\"><span class=\"citation-201 citation-end-201\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Admission and Networking (One-Time Fees):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-113\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-200\">Registration:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-200\"> A nominal charge of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"34\"><span class=\"citation-200\">₹ 500</span></strong><span class=\"citation-200\"> is required during the initial application process</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-200 citation-end-200\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-199\">This non-refundable fee covers all preliminary administrative verification and student onboarding</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-199 citation-end-199\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-114\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-198\">Alumni Association:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-198\"> A one-time investment of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\"><span class=\"citation-198\">₹ 1,800</span></strong><span class=\"citation-198\"> connects you to a global network of professionals</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-198 citation-end-198\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-197\">This fee ensures you remain a part of the university ecosystem long after graduation, providing access to exclusive career resources and networking portals</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-197 citation-end-197\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Academic Costs:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-115\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-196\">Tuition Fees:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-196\"> This represents the primary cost of instruction, faculty access, and digital learning materials</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-196 citation-end-196\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-195\">While the standard semester rate is </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,4\" data-index-in-node=\"36\"><span class=\"citation-195\">₹ 14,750</span></strong><span class=\"citation-195\">, the university incentivizes upfront payments with tiered discounts</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-195 citation-end-195\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-116\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-194\">Examination Fees:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-194\"> To maintain rigorous academic standards, a fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\"><span class=\"citation-194\">₹ 1,500</span></strong><span class=\"citation-194\"> is charged for each of the six semesters</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-194 citation-end-194\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-193\">This totals </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,4\" data-index-in-node=\"12\"><span class=\"citation-193\">₹ 9,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-193\"> for the full three-year duration</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-193 citation-end-193\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p id=\"p-rc_bea80f39ce61c29d-143\" data-path-to-node=\"1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0\">Choosing an Online Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) at <strong data-path-to-node=\"1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">GLA University</strong> is a strategic step toward mastering the complexities of the modern corporate landscape. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,2\"><span class=\"citation-279\">As a </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,2\" data-index-in-node=\"5\"><span class=\"citation-279\">NAAC A+ accredited institution</span></strong><span class=\"citation-279\">, GLA University offers a curriculum that is not only academically rigorous but also industry-aligned, ensuring students gain both theoretical depth and practical expertise</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,3\"><span class=\"citation-279 citation-end-279\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">The BBA program is structured across six comprehensive semesters, focusing on core management principles, multidisciplinary skills, and specialized electives. Below is an in-depth exploration of the subjects you will encounter throughout this three-year professional journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Foundation and Core Principles: Semester 1 and 2</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The first year of the Online BBA is designed to build a robust foundation in business mechanics. Students are introduced to the fundamental pillars of management, accounting, and human behavior to prepare them for advanced leadership roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Year 1: Building the Business Bedrock</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_bea80f39ce61c29d-144\" data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-278\">Fundamental Accounting and Management:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-278\"> In the first semester, students engage with </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"83\"><span class=\"citation-278\">Basic Accounting</span></strong><span class=\"citation-278\"> and </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"104\"><span class=\"citation-278\">Principles of Management</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-278 citation-end-278\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,2\">. These subjects provide the essential vocabulary and tools needed to understand financial health and organizational hierarchy.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Behavioral Sciences and Marketing:</strong> Subjects like <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"49\">Organizational Behaviour</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">Marketing Theory and Practices</strong> help students understand the psychology of both employees and consumers, which is critical for effective team management and brand growth.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Analytical Foundations:</strong> To ensure data-driven decision-making, the curriculum includes <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"87\">Business Mathematics</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"112\">Business Economics</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_bea80f39ce61c29d-145\" data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-277\">Ethics and Finance:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-277\"> Moving into the second semester, the focus shifts toward </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"77\"><span class=\"citation-277\">Business Ethics and Governance</span></strong><span class=\"citation-277\"> and </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"112\"><span class=\"citation-277\">Business Finance</span></strong><span class=\"citation-277\">, emphasizing the importance of integrity and capital management in the corporate sector</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-277 citation-end-277\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Enhancement:</strong> Practical subjects like <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">Fundamentals of MS-Excel</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">AI for Beginners</strong> ensure that students are technologically proficient from the start of their degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Intermediate Mastery and Digital Integration: Semester 3 and 4</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">The second year transitions from general principles to specialized applications. This phase emphasizes the legal, technological, and analytical frameworks that govern modern businesses.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Year 2: Specialized Knowledge and Analytical Tools</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Advanced Resource Management:</strong> Students dive deep into <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">Management and Cost Accounting</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"89\">Human Resource Development</strong>. These courses teach students how to optimize both financial and human capital.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Legal and Environmental Context:</strong> Understanding the \"rules of the game\" is vital, provided through <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"98\">Business Law</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"115\">Business Environment</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_bea80f39ce61c29d-146\" data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-276\">Digital and Tactical Skills:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-276\"> The inclusion of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"46\"><span class=\"citation-276\">Computer Application</span></strong><span class=\"citation-276\">, </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\"><span class=\"citation-276\">Advertising Management</span></strong><span class=\"citation-276\">, and </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"96\"><span class=\"citation-276\">R-Programming Lab</span></strong><span class=\"citation-276\"> reflects the program\'s commitment to modern digital marketing and data analytics</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-276 citation-end-276\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operations and Policy:</strong> Semester 4 introduces high-level operational subjects like <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">Production Management</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"105\">Research Methodology</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"131\">Business Policy</strong>, which are essential for students aiming for operations or consultancy roles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Social Connectivity:</strong> Courses such as the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">Social Internship Project</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"71\">Social Responsibility and Community Engagement</strong> ensure that future managers are socially conscious and ethically grounded.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Strategic Leadership and Specialization: Semester 5 and 6</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The final year is where students refine their expertise through elective groups and strategic studies. This stage is designed to transform students into industry-ready leaders capable of navigating international markets.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\">Year 3: Strategic Excellence and Elective Tracks</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_bea80f39ce61c29d-147\" data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-275\">Entrepreneurial Mindset:</span></strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"25\"><span class=\"citation-275\">Entrepreneurship and Small Business Management</span></strong><span class=\"citation-275\"> empowers students to innovate and potentially launch their own ventures, while </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"151\"><span class=\"citation-275\">International Trade</span></strong><span class=\"citation-275\"> provides a global perspective on commerce</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-275 citation-end-275\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Specialization Electives:</strong> During the final two semesters, students select from <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">Specialization Elective Groups (A and B)</strong>. These electives allow for deep-diving into specific sectors such as Finance, Marketing, or HR, tailoring the degree to specific career aspirations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capstone Strategy:</strong> The program culminates with <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"47\">Strategic Management</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">Company Law</strong>, providing a \"big picture\" view of how large-scale corporations are steered and regulated.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_bea80f39ce61c29d-148\" data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-274\">Career Readiness:</span></strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"18\"><span class=\"citation-274\">Managerial Aptitude</span></strong><span class=\"citation-274\"> sessions and the final </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\"><span class=\"citation-274\">Research Project</span></strong><span class=\"citation-274\"> serve as the bridge between academic learning and professional employment, ensuring students can apply their knowledge to real-world business problems</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-274 citation-end-274\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1,2\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(328, 73, 'cb1d0e55-4d52-4f8e-a95d-1e010c5143ea', 'e1f8adbd-4aaf-45d3-bf3c-53ff249b11e1', 208, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 01:30:28', '2026-06-16 07:26:05', '<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"379\">Applying to GLA Online is designed to be simple, fast, and completely digital so students can complete the entire admission journey from anywhere. The university has structured the admission workflow into clear stages that help students move smoothly from registration to final enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"704\">Understanding every step carefully is extremely important because many students face delays due to incomplete forms, incorrect document uploads, payment mistakes, or missing verification requirements. A proper understanding of the process helps applicants avoid unnecessary complications and complete admission confidently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"784\">Below is the complete 6-step GLA Online admission process explained in detail.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"789\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vaxbr6\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"826\">Step 1: Fill the Required Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1028\">The admission process begins with entering basic details on the online application portal. This initial registration helps the university create the student profile and start the enrollment procedure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cgszcb\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1061\">Information Usually Required</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uzprjw\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1074\">Full name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h04qtn\" data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1090\">Mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6nm42x\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1101\">Email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wr39ao\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1130\">Preferred course selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tbsncu\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1163\">Academic qualification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5vnbz\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1192\">State and city information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1339\">Students should ensure that the details entered are accurate because these records are later used during verification and admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yz2xhq\" data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1357\">Important Tip</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1537\">Always use an active email ID and mobile number because all future communication, login credentials, fee updates, and admission notifications will be sent through these channels.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1542\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"nnhrlq\" data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1589\">Step 2: Receive Login Credentials via Email</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1775\">After submitting the initial details, students receive login credentials on their registered email address. These credentials allow applicants to access the online admission dashboard.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hdn9j2\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1801\">What Students Receive</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1912\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1icq2uo\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1834\">User ID or application number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ojjb04\" data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1851\">Login password</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i2rvtd\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1877\">Admission portal access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nc4e8j\" data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1912\">Further application instructions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"2062\">The admission portal acts as the main platform for completing all remaining formalities including form submission, fee payment, and document upload.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1q25kbu\" data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2090\">Common Mistake to Avoid</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2124\">Students should regularly check:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2163\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16tcfq2\" data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2132\">Inbox</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yjmisx\" data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2146\">Spam folder</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9hom7\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2163\">Promotions tab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2221\">Sometimes official emails may be filtered automatically.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2226\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"z97g6k\" data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2264\">Step 3: Fill the Registration Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2504\">After logging into the admission portal, students must complete the detailed registration form carefully. This is one of the most critical stages because the submitted information becomes part of the university&rsquo;s official student records.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"auje4m\" data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2550\">Details Included in the Registration Form</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fkli58\" data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2572\">Personal Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3z0bz\" data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2579\">Name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14lnz5c\" data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2595\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pt4cvs\" data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2616\">Parent information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ibp5y6\" data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2626\">Address</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"185bhtt\" data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2648\">Academic Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2770\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vuenmz\" data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2671\">Class 10 information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1803h2h\" data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2694\">Class 12 information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16mbxjz\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2745\">Graduation details (for postgraduate admissions)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tvzknv\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2770\">Marks and passing year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18cuojd\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2790\">Course Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2860\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yv82ak\" data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2810\">Program selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g5hxv0\" data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2834\">Specialization choice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmm9ez\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2860\">Study mode confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2865\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jwthoc\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2901\">Step 4: Pay the Registration Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"3027\">Once the registration form is completed, students must pay the registration fee to proceed further in the admission process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"r38xuy\" data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3057\">Available Payment Methods</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3132\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nlqvoi\" data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3071\">Debit card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dnpt3l\" data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3085\">Credit card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hf7qq9\" data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3099\">Net banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4vms\" data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3105\">UPI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xzu1mr\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3132\">Digital payment gateways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3206\">The online payment system is designed for secure and quick transactions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jy2w3j\" data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3227\">Important Advice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3245\">Students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3362\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkysqk\" data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3269\">Save payment receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xos0um\" data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3315\">Take screenshots of successful transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pn0dv7\" data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3362\">Avoid refreshing the payment page repeatedly</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3408\">This helps prevent duplicate payment issues.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3413\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kyfezx\" data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3446\">Step 5: Document Verification</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3636\">Document verification is one of the most important stages of online admission. During this process, the university verifies the authenticity of the student&rsquo;s academic and personal records.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hfjbc8\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3668\">Commonly Required Documents</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zl2vgf\" data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3692\">Academic Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3776\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17fpgl9\" data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3713\">Class 10 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqxqv3\" data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3734\">Class 12 marksheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ca671x\" data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3776\">Graduation certificates (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"taixd8\" data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3800\">Identity Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3844\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jslcwy\" data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3815\">Aadhaar card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xrh0kk\" data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3844\">Government-issued ID proof</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"spyfb2\" data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3865\">Other Documents</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3943\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lye5s8\" data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3892\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199lc0c\" data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3904\">Signature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dcj5v2\" data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3943\">Category certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"3948\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1d56c05\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3981\">Why Verification Is Important</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"4004\">Verification ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4112\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cmopca\" data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4031\">Eligibility confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v5oioy\" data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4059\">Authentic student records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ylw23t\" data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4093\">Accurate academic documentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nlt7ey\" data-start=\"4094\" data-end=\"4112\">Fraud prevention</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4114\" data-end=\"4203\">Students should upload clear and readable scanned documents to avoid rejection or delays.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4208\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1scprv2\" data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4258\">Step 6: Enrollment Confirmation and LMS Access</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4423\">After successful verification and approval, students receive final admission confirmation from the university. This marks the completion of the enrollment process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fl9s51\" data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4468\">What Students Receive After Confirmation</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4622\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bx4sz3\" data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4489\">Enrollment number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1smq61c\" data-start=\"4490\" data-end=\"4521\">Admission confirmation letter</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wm636u\" data-start=\"4522\" data-end=\"4544\">Student login access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzs6ox\" data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4591\">Learning Management System (LMS) credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mjs849\" data-start=\"4592\" data-end=\"4622\">Academic orientation details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4624\" data-end=\"4700\">The LMS platform becomes the central learning hub where students can access:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4791\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3d0q73\" data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4718\">Study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pack97\" data-start=\"4719\" data-end=\"4738\">Recorded lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lie7pk\" data-start=\"4739\" data-end=\"4752\">Assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mgmktp\" data-start=\"4753\" data-end=\"4766\">Assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1so1bun\" data-start=\"4767\" data-end=\"4791\">Academic announcements</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">Embarking on a Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) journey is a pivotal decision for any aspiring leader. At <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"115\">GLA University Online</strong>, the admissions process is designed to be inclusive, ensuring that high-quality management education is accessible to a broad spectrum of learners. As a <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"290\">NAAC A+ accredited institution</strong>, the university maintains rigorous academic standards while providing a welcoming entry point for students from diverse educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Understanding the eligibility requirements is the essential first step in securing your place in this industry-aligned program. Below is a comprehensive and descriptive guide to the qualifications needed to join the GLA University Online BBA community.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Detailed Academic Requirements and Qualifications</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The primary gateway to the online BBA program is rooted in a student\'s foundational secondary education. The university has streamlined these requirements to ensure that every applicant has the necessary academic base to excel in a business environment.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Requirement Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Eligibility Criteria Details</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Minimum Educational Qualification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\">Completion of <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"14\">10+2 (Intermediate)</strong> or an equivalent examination.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recognized Boards</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\">The qualification must be from a <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">recognized national or state board</strong> of education.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stream Flexibility</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\">Open to students from <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"22\">any academic stream</strong> (Science, Commerce, Arts, or Vocational).</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Aspirational Alignment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\">Ideal for those targeting careers in <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">Management, Entrepreneurship, or Corporate Leadership</strong>.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">An Inclusive Approach: Welcoming All Academic Backgrounds</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">One of the standout features of the GLA University Online BBA is its multidisciplinary inclusivity. The university recognizes that business leaders come from various walks of life, and the curriculum is structured to support students regardless of their previous field of study.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_7fa4e3b84c780bc4-169\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-307\">Commerce Students:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-307\"> Those with a background in commerce will find a natural progression into the program, building upon existing knowledge of accounting and business studies</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-307 citation-end-307\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_7fa4e3b84c780bc4-170\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Science and Arts Students:</strong> Applicants from Science or Arts backgrounds are highly encouraged to apply. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-306\">The first year of the program is specifically designed to bridge any knowledge gaps, introducing </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,2\" data-index-in-node=\"97\"><span class=\"citation-306\">Principles of Management</span></strong><span class=\"citation-306\"> and </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,2\" data-index-in-node=\"126\"><span class=\"citation-306\">Basic Accounting</span></strong><span class=\"citation-306\"> from the ground up</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-306 citation-end-306\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vocational Backgrounds:</strong> Students who have completed vocational studies are also eligible, bringing unique practical perspectives to the digital classroom.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">This \"open-stream\" policy ensures that a passion for business and a drive for professional growth are the primary factors for admission, rather than just previous subject choices.</p>', '<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-122\" data-path-to-node=\"1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,1\"><span class=\"citation-224\">Selecting an Online Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) is a transformative step for students and professionals aiming for leadership roles in the corporate world</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,2\"><span class=\"citation-224 citation-end-224\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,5\"><span class=\"citation-223\">GLA University, distinguished by its </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,5\" data-index-in-node=\"37\"><span class=\"citation-223\">NAAC A+ accreditation</span></strong><span class=\"citation-223\">, provides a top-tier educational experience characterized by financial transparency and accessibility</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,6\"><span class=\"citation-223 citation-end-223\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,7\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,9\"><span class=\"citation-222\">By understanding the specific components of the fee structure, students can strategically plan their academic investment to maximize value while minimizing out-of-pocket expenses</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,10\"><span class=\"citation-222 citation-end-222\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,11\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-123\" data-path-to-node=\"2\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1\"><span class=\"citation-221\">The program is meticulously designed to offer a balance between high-quality instructional content and an affordable cost-to-benefit ratio</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2\"><span class=\"citation-221 citation-end-221\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,5\"><span class=\"citation-220\">Below is a deep, explanatory breakdown of the financial commitments required for the Online BBA program, presented in a structured format for maximum clarity</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,6\"><span class=\"citation-220 citation-end-220\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,7\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Complete BBA Fee Breakdown and Comparative Analysis</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-124\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0\">The table below summarizes the core financial requirements of the GLA University Online BBA. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\"><span class=\"citation-219\">It contrasts the three primary payment tracks&mdash;Semester-wise, Annual, and Total Program&mdash;to highlight the direct savings available to students who commit to longer-term payment cycles</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3\"><span class=\"citation-219 citation-end-219\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Fee Component</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Semester-Wise Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Annual Payment Plan</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Total Program Payment</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-218\">₹ 500 (One-time) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-217\">₹ 500 (One-time) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,3,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-216\">₹ 500 (One-time) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Alumni Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-215\">₹ 1,800 (One-time) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-214\">₹ 1,800 (One-time) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,3,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-213\">₹ 1,800 (One-time) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tuition Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-212\">₹ 14,750</span></strong> </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-211\">₹ 29,500</span></strong> </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-210\">₹ 88,500</span></strong> </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Examination Fee</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-209\">₹ 1,500 </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-208\">₹ 3,000 </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,3,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-207\">₹ 9,000 </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Special Benefits</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,1,0\">None (Pay-as-you-go)</span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,5,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-206\">₹ 1,000 Off</span></strong><span class=\"citation-206\"> (1st Year) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,5,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-205\">₹ 3,000 Off</span></strong><span class=\"citation-205\"> (Full Course) </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Financial Flexibility</strong></span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,6,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,1,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-204\">Highest flexibility </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,6,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-203\">Moderate savings </span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,6,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,6,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-202\">Maximum Savings</span></strong> </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Detailed Explanation of Individual Fee Components</h2>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-125\" data-path-to-node=\"9\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1\"><span class=\"citation-201\">To ensure complete transparency, it is vital to understand what each specific fee covers and how it contributes to your overall academic journey</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2\"><span class=\"citation-201 citation-end-201\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Admission and Networking (One-Time Fees):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-126\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-200\">Registration:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-200\"> A nominal charge of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"34\"><span class=\"citation-200\">₹ 500</span></strong><span class=\"citation-200\"> is required during the initial application process</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-200 citation-end-200\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-199\">This non-refundable fee covers all preliminary administrative verification and student onboarding</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-199 citation-end-199\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"9\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-127\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-198\">Alumni Association:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-198\"> A one-time investment of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\"><span class=\"citation-198\">₹ 1,800</span></strong><span class=\"citation-198\"> connects you to a global network of professionals</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-198 citation-end-198\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"10\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-197\">This fee ensures you remain a part of the university ecosystem long after graduation, providing access to exclusive career resources and networking portals</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-197 citation-end-197\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"11\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Academic Costs:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-128\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-196\">Tuition Fees:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-196\"> This represents the primary cost of instruction, faculty access, and digital learning materials</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-196 citation-end-196\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"12\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-195\">While the standard semester rate is </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,4\" data-index-in-node=\"36\"><span class=\"citation-195\">₹ 14,750</span></strong><span class=\"citation-195\">, the university incentivizes upfront payments with tiered discounts</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-195 citation-end-195\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"13\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_a08efaf426010be8-129\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-194\">Examination Fees:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-194\"> To maintain rigorous academic standards, a fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\"><span class=\"citation-194\">₹ 1,500</span></strong><span class=\"citation-194\"> is charged for each of the six semesters</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-194 citation-end-194\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"14\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-193\">This totals </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,4\" data-index-in-node=\"12\"><span class=\"citation-193\">₹ 9,000</span></strong><span class=\"citation-193\"> for the full three-year duration</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-193 citation-end-193\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"15\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p id=\"p-rc_bea80f39ce61c29d-151\" data-path-to-node=\"1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0\">Choosing an Online Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) at <strong data-path-to-node=\"1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">GLA University</strong> is a strategic step toward mastering the complexities of the modern corporate landscape. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,2\"><span class=\"citation-279\">As a </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,2\" data-index-in-node=\"5\"><span class=\"citation-279\">NAAC A+ accredited institution</span></strong><span class=\"citation-279\">, GLA University offers a curriculum that is not only academically rigorous but also industry-aligned, ensuring students gain both theoretical depth and practical expertise</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,3\"><span class=\"citation-279 citation-end-279\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">The BBA program is structured across six comprehensive semesters, focusing on core management principles, multidisciplinary skills, and specialized electives. Below is an in-depth exploration of the subjects you will encounter throughout this three-year professional journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Foundation and Core Principles: Semester 1 and 2</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The first year of the Online BBA is designed to build a robust foundation in business mechanics. Students are introduced to the fundamental pillars of management, accounting, and human behavior to prepare them for advanced leadership roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Year 1: Building the Business Bedrock</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_bea80f39ce61c29d-152\" data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-278\">Fundamental Accounting and Management:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-278\"> In the first semester, students engage with </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"83\"><span class=\"citation-278\">Basic Accounting</span></strong><span class=\"citation-278\"> and </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"104\"><span class=\"citation-278\">Principles of Management</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-278 citation-end-278\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,2\">. These subjects provide the essential vocabulary and tools needed to understand financial health and organizational hierarchy.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Behavioral Sciences and Marketing:</strong> Subjects like <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"49\">Organizational Behaviour</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">Marketing Theory and Practices</strong> help students understand the psychology of both employees and consumers, which is critical for effective team management and brand growth.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Analytical Foundations:</strong> To ensure data-driven decision-making, the curriculum includes <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"87\">Business Mathematics</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"112\">Business Economics</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_bea80f39ce61c29d-153\" data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-277\">Ethics and Finance:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-277\"> Moving into the second semester, the focus shifts toward </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"77\"><span class=\"citation-277\">Business Ethics and Governance</span></strong><span class=\"citation-277\"> and </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"112\"><span class=\"citation-277\">Business Finance</span></strong><span class=\"citation-277\">, emphasizing the importance of integrity and capital management in the corporate sector</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-277 citation-end-277\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skill Enhancement:</strong> Practical subjects like <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">Fundamentals of MS-Excel</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">AI for Beginners</strong> ensure that students are technologically proficient from the start of their degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Intermediate Mastery and Digital Integration: Semester 3 and 4</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">The second year transitions from general principles to specialized applications. This phase emphasizes the legal, technological, and analytical frameworks that govern modern businesses.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Year 2: Specialized Knowledge and Analytical Tools</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Advanced Resource Management:</strong> Students dive deep into <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">Management and Cost Accounting</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"89\">Human Resource Development</strong>. These courses teach students how to optimize both financial and human capital.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Legal and Environmental Context:</strong> Understanding the \"rules of the game\" is vital, provided through <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"98\">Business Law</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"115\">Business Environment</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_bea80f39ce61c29d-154\" data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-276\">Digital and Tactical Skills:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-276\"> The inclusion of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"46\"><span class=\"citation-276\">Computer Application</span></strong><span class=\"citation-276\">, </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\"><span class=\"citation-276\">Advertising Management</span></strong><span class=\"citation-276\">, and </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"96\"><span class=\"citation-276\">R-Programming Lab</span></strong><span class=\"citation-276\"> reflects the program\'s commitment to modern digital marketing and data analytics</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-276 citation-end-276\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"12,2,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Operations and Policy:</strong> Semester 4 introduces high-level operational subjects like <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">Production Management</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"105\">Research Methodology</strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"131\">Business Policy</strong>, which are essential for students aiming for operations or consultancy roles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Social Connectivity:</strong> Courses such as the <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">Social Internship Project</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"71\">Social Responsibility and Community Engagement</strong> ensure that future managers are socially conscious and ethically grounded.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"13\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Strategic Leadership and Specialization: Semester 5 and 6</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The final year is where students refine their expertise through elective groups and strategic studies. This stage is designed to transform students into industry-ready leaders capable of navigating international markets.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\">Year 3: Strategic Excellence and Elective Tracks</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_bea80f39ce61c29d-155\" data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-275\">Entrepreneurial Mindset:</span></strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"25\"><span class=\"citation-275\">Entrepreneurship and Small Business Management</span></strong><span class=\"citation-275\"> empowers students to innovate and potentially launch their own ventures, while </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"151\"><span class=\"citation-275\">International Trade</span></strong><span class=\"citation-275\"> provides a global perspective on commerce</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-275 citation-end-275\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Specialization Electives:</strong> During the final two semesters, students select from <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">Specialization Elective Groups (A and B)</strong>. These electives allow for deep-diving into specific sectors such as Finance, Marketing, or HR, tailoring the degree to specific career aspirations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capstone Strategy:</strong> The program culminates with <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"47\">Strategic Management</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">Company Law</strong>, providing a \"big picture\" view of how large-scale corporations are steered and regulated.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_bea80f39ce61c29d-156\" data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-274\">Career Readiness:</span></strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"18\"><span class=\"citation-274\">Managerial Aptitude</span></strong><span class=\"citation-274\"> sessions and the final </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\"><span class=\"citation-274\">Research Project</span></strong><span class=\"citation-274\"> serve as the bridge between academic learning and professional employment, ensuring students can apply their knowledge to real-world business problems</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-274 citation-end-274\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,3,1,2\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 88500.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(329, 73, 'cb1d0e55-4d52-4f8e-a95d-1e010c5143ea', 'e1f8adbd-4aaf-45d3-bf3c-53ff249b11e1', 39, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 01:46:55', '2026-06-16 07:26:26', '<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">Navigating the admission landscape for higher education can often feel overwhelming, but <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"89\">GLA University Online</strong> has revolutionized the experience with a streamlined, six-step digital enrollment process. As a <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"207\">NAAC A+ accredited institution</strong>, the university prioritizes student convenience, ensuring that your transition from an applicant to a registered scholar is efficient, transparent, and entirely remote.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Whether you are applying for the BBA, BCA, or any other professional degree, understanding each phase of the \"Click-to-Classroom\" journey is vital. Below is a comprehensive, deep-dive explanation of the admission steps designed to help you secure your future with total clarity.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">The Six Essential Steps to Enrollment</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The admission cycle is engineered to verify your credentials while providing maximum flexibility. By following these structured milestones, you can complete your application from the comfort of your home.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Step Number</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase of Admission</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Core Action Required</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 1</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Initial Inquiry</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,2,0\">Submit primary contact and background details via the official portal.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 2</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Credential Acquisition</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,2,0\">Check your registered email for secure login and password details.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 3</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Formal Application</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,2,0\">Complete the detailed registration form with academic history.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 4</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Payment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,2,0\">Pay the nominal processing fee of ₹ 500 to activate your file.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 5</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,5,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Authentication</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,2,0\">Digital submission and verification of academic transcripts.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Step 6</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Onboarding</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,2,0\">Payment of admission/tuition fees to confirm your seat.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><br><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Phase 1: Initiating the Digital Application</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The journey begins at the official GLA Online portal. Here, you will find the \"Fill Required Details\" section. This is a preliminary step where you provide your basic identity, contact information, and the specific program of interest (such as BCA or BBA). Clicking the <strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"270\">\"Click Here\"</strong> button initiates the university\'s automated response system, flagging your interest for the admissions committee.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Phase 2: Secure Access and Identity</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Once your initial details are logged, the university\'s central system generates unique <strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"87\">Login Credentials</strong>. These are sent directly to your provided email address. This step ensures the security of your data and provides you with a dedicated student dashboard where you can track your application status in real-time.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Phase 3: Comprehensive Registration Form</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">With your new credentials, you will log in to the student portal to \"Fill the Registration Form.\" This is the most descriptive part of the process, where you provide detailed information regarding:</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Records:</strong> 10th and 12th-grade marks and board details.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Personal Background:</strong> Address, guardian details, and identity proofs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional Goals:</strong> Selecting your specific elective groups or specialization tracks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Phase 4: Activating the Application</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">To move from a \"lead\" to an \"active applicant,\" you must <strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"57\">Pay the Registration Fee</strong>. This is a one-time, nominal charge of <strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"121\">₹ 500</strong>. This payment covers the administrative costs of processing your digital file and moving it into the formal verification queue.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"19\">Phase 5: Rigorous Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">Quality assurance is a hallmark of an NAAC A+ university. During the <strong data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"69\">Document Verification</strong> phase, the admissions team reviews your uploaded digital transcripts. They ensure that you meet the core eligibility criteria (such as completing 10+2 from a recognized board). This step is critical for maintaining the academic integrity of the institution and ensures your degree remains globally recognized.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"21\">Phase 6: Finalizing Your Seat</h3>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">The final step is the <strong data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"22\">Payment of the Admission Fee</strong>. Once your documents are cleared, you are officially invited to join the program. By paying the initial tuition or admission fee&mdash;which can be managed via <strong data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"205\">No-Cost EMI options</strong>&mdash;you lock in your seat and gain full access to the Learning Management System (LMS), virtual classrooms, and the global alumni network.</p>', 1, '<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">The digital era has transformed the <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"36\">Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</strong> into one of the most sought-after professional degrees. At <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"135\">GLA University Online</strong>, the BCA program is designed with an \"inclusive-first\" philosophy, ensuring that the next generation of tech innovators isn\'t limited by their past academic choices. As a <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"328\">NAAC A+ accredited institution</strong>, GLA University provides a transparent, accessible, and high-value entry point for students looking to pivot into the world of software development, cybersecurity, and data science.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Understanding the eligibility criteria is the foundation of your professional journey. Below is a deep, explanatory analysis of the requirements, expectations, and the zero-barrier approach adopted by the university.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Detailed Academic Qualifications and Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The primary requirement for admission into the Online BCA program is straightforward, focusing on fundamental academic completion rather than specific subject restrictions. This ensures a diverse cohort of learners from various educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Criteria Category</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Requirement Details</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Minimum Education</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\">Successful completion of <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"25\">10+2 (Intermediate)</strong> or an equivalent qualification.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Board Recognition</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\">The certificate must be issued by a <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"36\">recognized national or state board</strong> of education.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stream Inclusivity</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\">Open to candidates from <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"24\">any stream</strong> (Science, Commerce, Arts, or Vocational).</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technical Background</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">No prior coding experience</strong> or computer science background is required.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">An Open Pathway for All Streams: Science, Commerce, and Arts</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Unlike traditional technical programs that often mandate a background in Mathematics or Physics, the GLA University Online BCA program welcomes students from all academic disciplines. This multidisciplinary approach recognizes that logical thinking and problem-solving&mdash;the core of computer applications&mdash;can be developed regardless of previous study areas.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Science Stream Graduates:</strong> Students from science backgrounds will find that their analytical training provides a smooth transition into complex algorithms and system architecture.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Commerce Stream Graduates:</strong> With the rise of FinTech (Financial Technology), commerce students are uniquely positioned to apply BCA skills to the banking and insurance sectors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Arts and Humanities Graduates:</strong> These students often bring creative problem-solving skills that are invaluable in UI/UX design and front-end web development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">Choosing to pursue an <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"22\">Online Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</strong> is a definitive step toward a high-growth career in the technology sector. As a <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"149\">NAAC A+ accredited institution</strong>, GLA University provides an industry-aligned curriculum supported by a transparent and highly competitive fee model. For students aiming to master software development, data analytics, or cloud computing, understanding the full financial roadmap is essential for long-term academic success.</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">The GLA University Online BCA program is structured to deliver exceptional informational value while ensuring that the cost of professional education remains accessible. Below is an exhaustive and descriptive breakdown of the BCA fee components, diverse payment tracks, and exclusive financial incentives.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Detailed Breakdown of BCA Program Costs</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The financial framework for the online BCA degree is categorized into four distinct areas: initial admission charges, recurring tuition costs, semester-based examination fees, and long-term alumni membership. This transparent approach ensures students can budget effectively without encountering hidden administrative expenses.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9628a8df1048dded-203\" data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-347\">Registration Fee (One-Time):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-347\"> A foundational fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"51\"><span class=\"citation-347\">₹ 500</span></strong><span class=\"citation-347\"> is required during the initial enrollment phase</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-347 citation-end-347\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,2\">. This non-refundable charge covers the administrative processing and technical onboarding of your student profile.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9628a8df1048dded-204\" data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-346\">Alumni Fee (One-Time):</span></strong><span class=\"citation-346\"> To provide lifelong access to a global network of tech professionals, a one-time fee of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"111\"><span class=\"citation-346\">₹ 1,800</span></strong><span class=\"citation-346\"> is collected</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-346 citation-end-346\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"2\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,2\">. This ensures graduates maintain a permanent connection with the university&rsquo;s career resources and professional ecosystem.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9628a8df1048dded-205\" data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-345\">Examination Fee:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-345\"> To maintain rigorous evaluation standards, students pay </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"73\"><span class=\"citation-345\">₹ 1,500 per semester</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-345 citation-end-345\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,2\">. For the entire six-semester (three-year) program, the total examination investment is <strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,2\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">₹ 9,000</strong>.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9628a8df1048dded-206\" data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tuition Fee:</strong> This is the core investment in your technical education. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,2\"><span class=\"citation-344\">The university offers tiered pricing based on your chosen payment frequency&mdash;semester-wise, annual, or total program&mdash;to provide maximum flexibility</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,3\"><span class=\"citation-344 citation-end-344\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,4\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Comparative Analysis of BCA Payment Tracks</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">GLA University offers three strategic payment modes designed to align with various financial goals. Each mode provides a different level of immediate cash-flow management or long-term tuition savings.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Payment Frequency</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Tuition Fee Amount</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Strategic Financial Benefit</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester-Wise</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,1,0\">₹ 14,750</span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-343\">Provides the highest level of budget flexibility for managing short-term cash flow</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,2,0,3\">.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Annual Payment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,1,0\">₹ 29,500</span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-342\">Includes a direct benefit of ₹ 1,000 applicable on the first-year tuition fee</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,2,0,3\">.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Program</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,0\">₹ 88,500</span></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3,2,0,1\"><span class=\"citation-341\">The most cost-effective path, offering a substantial benefit of ₹ 3,000 on the total tuition cost</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3,2,0,3\">.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Strategic Financial Support: No-Cost EMI and Discounts</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">To ensure that financial barriers do not prevent talented students from accessing a top-tier degree, GLA University has integrated supportive financial aid features into its online platform.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9628a8df1048dded-207\" data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-340\">No-Cost EMI Availability:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-340\"> In collaboration with leading financial partners, the university offers </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"98\"><span class=\"citation-340\">No-Cost EMI options</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-340 citation-end-340\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"5\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,2\">. </span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,4\"><span class=\"citation-339\">This feature allows students to distribute their tuition payments into manageable, interest-free monthly installments, making professional-grade computer education affordable on a month-to-month basis</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,5\"><span class=\"citation-339 citation-end-339\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"6\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,6\">.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9628a8df1048dded-208\" data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-338\">Significant Upfront Savings:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-338\"> Students who choose to pay their fees annually or for the entire three-year program upfront can unlock tuition waivers ranging from </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"161\"><span class=\"citation-338\">₹ 1,000 to ₹ 3,000</span></strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-338 citation-end-338\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"7\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,2\">. These benefits are designed to reward students who commit to their academic journey early.</span><!----></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"p-rc_9628a8df1048dded-209\" data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-337\">Estimated Total Investment:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-337\"> For a student opting for the standard semester-wise payment cycle, the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"99\"><span class=\"citation-337\">approximate total cost</span></strong><span class=\"citation-337\">&mdash;encompassing all registration, alumni, tuition, and examination fees&mdash;is </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"194\"><span class=\"citation-337\">₹ 99,800</span></strong><span class=\"citation-337\"> spread across three years</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,1\"><span class=\"citation-337 citation-end-337\"><sup class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"8\"><!----></sup></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"14,2,1,2\">. This comprehensive figure allows for total financial clarity from day one.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">Choosing to pursue an <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"22\">Online Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</strong> at GLA University is a strategic investment in your future within the global technology landscape. As a <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"173\">NAAC A+ accredited institution</strong>, GLA University provides a curriculum that perfectly balances fundamental computer science principles with the emerging technologies demanded by \"Industry 4.0.\"</p>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">The program is meticulously structured over six semesters, transitioning students from foundational logic to advanced architectural and security concepts. Below is a detailed, descriptive breakdown of the subjects offered in this comprehensive degree program.</p>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"3\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Foundation of Programming and Digital Literacy: Semester 1 and 2</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The first year of the Online BCA program focuses on establishing a \"computational thinking\" mindset. It introduces students to the core logic of programming while equipping them with essential professional tools.</p>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Semester</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Theoretical Subjects</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Practical &amp; Skill Labs</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 1</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\">Problem Solving using Computer-I, Mathematics-I, Office Management Tools, Introduction to Digital Marketing, Language Skill-I, First Aid And Basic Health</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,2,0\">Software Lab Using Python-I, Office Management Tools Lab, Digital Marketing Lab</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Semester 2</strong></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\">Database Management Systems, Problem Solving using Computer-II, Web Technology-I, Soft Skills-I, Language Skill-II, Human Values and Environment Studies</span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,2,0\">Database Management System Lab, Software Lab Using Python-II, Web Technology-I Lab</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Logic and Python Mastery:</strong> Starting with <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"40\">Problem Solving using Computer</strong>, students learn to break down complex challenges. This is complemented by the <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"149\">Software Lab Using Python</strong>, providing a hands-on start with one of the world\'s most popular programming languages.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data and Web Basics:</strong> The second semester introduces <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">Database Management Systems (DBMS)</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"91\">Web Technology-I</strong>, ensuring students understand how information is stored and how the basic internet fabric is constructed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Holistic Development:</strong> Unique inclusions like <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">Digital Marketing</strong> and <strong data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"67\">Soft Skills</strong> ensure that graduates are not just technically proficient but also business-savvy and effective communicators.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Intermediate Application and System Architecture: Semester 3 and 4</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">In the second year, the curriculum shifts toward internal system mechanics and high-level application development. This phase is crucial for understanding how software interacts with hardware and users.</p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Systems:</strong> Students dive into <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">Operating Systems</strong>, learning the software that manages computer hardware. This is paired with <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"126\">Programming in Java</strong>, a cornerstone for enterprise-level application development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Emerging Technologies:</strong> Semester 3 offers a multidisciplinary choice between <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">Emerging Technology</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"97\">IoT &amp; Robotics</strong>, or <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"116\">Basic Competitive Programming</strong>, allowing students to customize their learning path.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Algorithms and Engineering:</strong> Semester 4 focuses on efficiency through <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"69\">Analysis of Algorithms and Data Structures</strong>. This is paired with <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"133\">Software Engineering and Testing</strong>, teaching students the lifecycle of professional software creation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mobile Innovation:</strong> The introduction of <strong data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">Mobile Application Development-I</strong> acknowledges the \"mobile-first\" reality of modern technology, providing the skills to build apps for handheld devices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Advanced Computing and Cyber Security: Semester 5 and 6</h2>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">The final year prepares students for specialized roles and leadership. The focus moves toward intelligent computing, network security, and real-world research.</p>\r\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\">Year 3: Strategic Tech and Professional Readiness</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Intelligent Systems:</strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"21\">Soft Computing</strong> in Semester 5 introduces students to advanced concepts like neural networks and fuzzy logic, which are essential for AI development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Connectivity:</strong> Understanding how data moves across the globe is covered in <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Data Communication and Computer Networks</strong>, supported by a dedicated <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"141\">Lab on Computer Networks</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Security and Ethics:</strong> The program culminates in Semester 6 with <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"63\">Cyber Security &amp; Cyber Laws</strong>. This subject is critical in an era of increasing digital threats, ensuring graduates understand both the defensive techniques and the legal frameworks of the internet.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hardware Insights:</strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"19\">Computer System Architecture</strong> provides a deep look into the design and functionality of computer components, closing the loop between code and physical hardware.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capstone Excellence:</strong> The <strong data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"25\">Research Project</strong> in the final semester allows students to apply three years of learning to a specific problem, proving their readiness for the professional world or higher academic pursuits.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 88500.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(330, 73, 'cb1d0e55-4d52-4f8e-a95d-1e010c5143ea', 'e1f8adbd-4aaf-45d3-bf3c-53ff249b11e1', 140, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 01:57:06', '2026-06-16 07:26:55', '<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"361\">The admission process at GLA Online is structured in a simple 6-step flow so that students can complete their enrollment smoothly without confusion. Each stage is designed to ensure transparency, accuracy, and quick processing&mdash;from initial application to final admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"529\">Understanding all six steps properly is important because even a small mistake in form filling, payment, or document upload can delay or affect the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"534\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vaxbr6\" data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"571\">Step 1: Fill the Required Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"668\">The process begins by entering basic personal and academic information on the admission portal.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"190b0zy\" data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"689\">Details Required</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"785\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"apwdks\" data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"704\">Full name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w2tsb\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"722\">Mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36fvl5\" data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"735\">Email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19byrdb\" data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"763\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yylsws\" data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"785\">Program selection</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"802\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"963\">This step creates your initial profile in the system. Accurate information is important because all communication and admission updates depend on these details.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"968\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9soc20\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1018\">Step 2: You Will Get Login Credential via Mail</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1110\">After submitting details, students receive login credentials on their registered email ID.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"37ucfb\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1131\">What You Receive</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1208\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12hhbl2\" data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1162\">Username / Application ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ozy787\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1175\">Password</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a9v91t\" data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1208\">Admission portal access link</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1225\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1401\">These credentials allow students to log in and continue the admission process through the official dashboard. It is important to check email regularly, including spam folders.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1406\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1j1ttf9\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1440\">Step 3: Fill Registration Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1512\">Once logged in, students must complete the detailed registration form.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eiziqo\" data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1537\">Information Required</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1664\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1559\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"78ln86\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1619\">Academic history (10th, 12th, graduation if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i1lfbp\" data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1640\">Course selection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9tnx1w\" data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1664\">Program preferences</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1681\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1851\">This is a crucial step as the information entered becomes part of the official university record. Any mismatch or incorrect detail can create issues during verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1856\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4feeh1\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1888\">Step 4: Pay Registration Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1975\">After completing the form, students must pay the registration fee to proceed further.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dydr7z\" data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"1995\">Payment Options</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2051\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lma7vm\" data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2011\">Debit card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwzhch\" data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2027\">Credit card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"804vtd\" data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2043\">Net banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17brhus\" data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2051\">UPI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2068\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2217\">The registration fee confirms your application in the system. Students should save payment receipts or transaction screenshots for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2222\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kyfezx\" data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2255\">Step 5: Document Verification</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2339\">After payment, the university verifies submitted documents to confirm eligibility.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xv1awg\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2362\">Required Documents</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2514\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kctdci\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2428\">Academic certificates (10th, 12th, graduation if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ks3otw\" data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2471\">Identity proof (Aadhaar or equivalent)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2500\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yra9zg\" data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2514\">Signature</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2531\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2687\">Document verification ensures that all submitted details are genuine and match official records. Clear and correct documents help avoid delays in approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2692\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a08v1a\" data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2726\">Step 6: Admission Confirmation</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2807\">Once verification is completed, final admission is confirmed by the university.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hdn9j2\" data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2833\">What Students Receive</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2943\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml4mxa\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2861\">Admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1clo88f\" data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2883\">Enrollment number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1en0fay\" data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2913\">Login credentials for LMS</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zc1pk0\" data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2943\">Access to study materials</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2960\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"3103\">This step marks the completion of the admission process. Students can now officially begin their learning journey through the online platform.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"550\">The Bachelor of Commerce (Honours) program is one of the most popular undergraduate courses for students aiming to build strong careers in banking, finance, accounting, business management, and corporate sectors. The Online B.Com (Hons.) program by GLA Online is designed to provide flexible, industry-relevant commerce education that helps students develop strong conceptual knowledge along with practical business understanding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"929\">Before applying, it is important for students to clearly understand the eligibility criteria because it ensures smooth admission processing and helps avoid rejection due to academic mismatch or incomplete qualifications. The program is structured to be inclusive, allowing students from different educational backgrounds to pursue commerce education at the undergraduate level.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"43geql\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"993\">Eligibility Criteria for Online B.Com (Hons.) Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1133\">To apply for the B.Com (Hons.) program, candidates must have completed their <strong data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1132\">10+2 or equivalent qualification from a recognized board</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8aw0w\" data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1165\">Key Eligibility Requirement</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dx94tx\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1240\">Candidates must have passed Class 12 (10+2) or equivalent examination</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kgyqiu\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1300\">Qualification must be from a recognized education board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1epfpfe\" data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1381\">Students from any stream are eligible (Commerce, Science, Arts, or Vocational)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1386\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dkyo16\" data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1424\">Stream Flexibility: Who Can Apply?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1586\">One of the major advantages of the Online B.Com (Hons.) program is its inclusive eligibility structure. Students are not restricted to only commerce background.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cocyve\" data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1616\">Eligible Academic Streams</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1768\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p9znzj\" data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1639\">Commerce students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15m2ibq\" data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1660\">Science students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5reg44\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1691\">Arts / Humanities students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2fg7yd\" data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1722\">Vocational course students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5mlkq8\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1768\">Any equivalent 10+2 qualification holders</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1785\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"2054\">This flexibility allows students to switch their career path toward commerce and business fields even if they did not study commerce in school. It is especially beneficial for students who want to build careers in finance, banking, or corporate sectors after Class 12.</p>', '<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"453\">The GLA Online fee structure is designed to provide flexible payment options so that students can manage their education expenses easily without financial stress. It includes semester-wise, annual, and total program payment modes along with one-time charges and examination fees. Below is the complete fee breakdown explained in a clear and structured table format.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"458\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1t1n50e\" data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"489\">Semester-Wise Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"596\">The semester-wise plan is suitable for students who prefer paying in smaller installments every semester.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ee01v3\" data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"621\">Semester Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"663\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"663\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"639\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"648\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"663\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explanation</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"772\">\r\n<td data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"715\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"772\">Paid only once at admission for enrollment processing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"848\">\r\n<td data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"806\">₹1,800</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"848\">One-time fee for alumni network access</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"931\">\r\n<td data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"863\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"873\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹10,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"931\" data-col-size=\"md\">Academic learning and course delivery fee per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<td data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"958\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Semester)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"967\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,500</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1014\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers semester examinations and evaluation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1031\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1208\">The semester plan helps students manage their budget in smaller intervals. It is especially useful for working professionals or students who prefer flexible financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"j8xrd8\" data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1237\">Annual Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1328\">The annual plan allows students to pay once every year, reducing frequent payment hassle.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"blk1a0\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1351\">Annual Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1393\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1393\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1369\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1378\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1393\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explanation</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1438\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1445\">₹500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1475\">Paid once during admission</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1544\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1500\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1509\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,800</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1544\" data-col-size=\"md\">Lifetime alumni association fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1621\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1559\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1569\">₹20,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1621\">Yearly academic fee for learning content and LMS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1644\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1653\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1694\">Annual examination and assessment fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1711\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1937\">Students opting for annual payment get a <strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1793\">₹1,000 benefit on the first-year fee</strong>, making it more cost-effective compared to semester-wise payments. This option is convenient for students who prefer yearly financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qidkn7\" data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1973\">Total Program Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2049\">The total program fee represents the complete cost of the academic course.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x8if8j\" data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2071\">Total Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2385\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2113\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2113\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2089\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2098\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2113\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explanation</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2385\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2193\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2158\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2165\">₹500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2193\">Admission processing fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2252\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2218\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2227\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,800</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2252\" data-col-size=\"md\">Alumni membership fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2318\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2267\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2277\">₹60,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2318\">Total academic fee for entire program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2385\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2330\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2339\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹9,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2385\">Total examination charges for full program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2402\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2558\">Students choosing the full payment option receive a <strong data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2498\">₹3,000 benefit on the total program fee</strong>, making it a more economical choice for long-term planners.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2563\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1yf8ujn\" data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2585\">No-Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2784\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2608\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2608\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2597\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Feature</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2608\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2784\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2645\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2630\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Type</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2645\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2687\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2657\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2687\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0% (No additional charges)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2735\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2698\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2735\">Easy monthly installment payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2784\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2746\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2784\">Financial flexibility for students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"61i3lh\" data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2801\">Explanation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"3048\">The No-Cost EMI facility allows students to divide their fees into affordable monthly installments without paying any extra interest. This makes higher education more accessible, especially for students managing limited budgets or monthly income.</p>', 'Medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 60000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(331, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 02:39:52', '2026-06-16 07:28:53', '<p data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"721\">The Amity Online admission process is designed to be simple, fully digital, and student-friendly so that applicants can complete their enrollment without any confusion. The process follows a structured step-by-step system that ensures transparency, smooth documentation, and quick admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"923\">Each stage of the admission journey is important because it ensures proper program selection, accurate application submission, secure fee payment, and successful enrollment into the university system.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"928\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"lj9al8\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"971\">Step-by-Step Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1524\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1013\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1013\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"980\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"998\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1013\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1524\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1153\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1063\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1085\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Select Your Program</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1153\">Choose the right program based on your academic and career goals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1249\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1163\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1186\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Complete Application</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1249\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fill in personal, academic, and required details accurately</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1334\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1259\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1278\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Pay Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1334\" data-col-size=\"md\">Make secure online payment through available options</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1429\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1344\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1364\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit &amp; Register</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1429\" data-col-size=\"md\">Final submission of application and registration confirmation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1524\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1439\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1466\">Await Enrollment Details</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1524\">Receive confirmation and further academic instructions</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1529\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dnyb6j\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1561\">Step 1 &ndash; Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1680\">The first and most important step is selecting the right program that aligns with your career goals and future plans.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1717\">Students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1878\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qlzcal\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1783\">Career interests (business, management, marketing, finance, HR)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u63rq1\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1813\">Long-term job opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19url4j\" data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1839\">Skill development needs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9l32lb\" data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1878\">Industry demand and growth potential</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"2049\"><strong data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1896\">Key Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1899\">Choosing the correct program at this stage is crucial because it directly impacts your career direction, specialization, and future job opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2054\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9f7qk7\" data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2092\">Step 2 &ndash; Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2196\">After selecting the program, students must fill out the online application form with accurate details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2212\">This includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"598smm\" data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2268\">Personal information (name, contact details, address)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bgrjgf\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2330\">Academic qualifications (10th, 12th, or equivalent details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gpa2u6\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2358\">Program selection details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u1qial\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2393\">Supporting documents if required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2550\"><strong data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2413\">Important Tip:</strong><br data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2416\">Incorrect or incomplete information can delay the admission process or lead to verification issues, so careful attention is necessary.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2555\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"18y61b3\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2593\">Step 3 &ndash; Pay Program Fees Securely</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2705\">Once the application is completed, students must proceed with fee payment using secure online payment options.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2733\">Available options include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2825\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19szntp\" data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2757\">One-time full payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h8hprs\" data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2779\">Annual payment plan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1khgit5\" data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2803\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f0vv0e\" data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2825\">No-cost EMI options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2956\"><strong data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2843\">Key Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"2846\">Students can choose a payment method based on financial comfort, making education accessible without pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2961\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a2idqx\" data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"3004\">Step 4 &ndash; Submit &amp; Complete Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3106\">After payment, students must submit the final application form to complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3122\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3275\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ht0y3\" data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3175\">Application is officially recorded in the system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8hk0ma\" data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3227\">Admission request is processed for verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18o4vo7\" data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3275\">Student receives confirmation of submission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3388\"><strong data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3296\">Important Note:</strong><br data-start=\"3296\" data-end=\"3299\">This step ensures that your admission request is formally registered with the university.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3393\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4r6bni\" data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3430\">Step 5 &ndash; Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3546\">Once registration is completed, students must wait for official enrollment confirmation and academic instructions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3548\" data-end=\"3584\">During this stage, students receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3585\" data-end=\"3734\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dsy75\" data-start=\"3585\" data-end=\"3620\">Enrollment confirmation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4nxzoj\" data-start=\"3621\" data-end=\"3664\">Login credentials for learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ivitp5\" data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3693\">Course start information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1861gwr\" data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3734\">Academic guidance and support access</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3878\"><strong data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3752\">Key Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3755\">This stage officially marks your entry into the academic system, enabling access to learning resources and virtual classes.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"774\">The Amity Online eligibility criteria are designed to ensure that students from diverse academic and professional backgrounds can apply for the program. The university maintains a flexible yet structured admission policy that welcomes fresh school graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, and international applicants.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"968\">This inclusive approach ensures that learners with different goals and educational backgrounds can build a strong foundation in business management, finance, HR, marketing, and related fields.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"973\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1oi2628\" data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1029\">Eligibility Criteria Overview (Simple Understanding)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1069\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1069\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1069\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1196\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fresh Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1196\" data-col-size=\"md\">10+2 pass or appearing candidates interested in business management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entrepreneurs</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1278\" data-col-size=\"md\">Individuals seeking to improve business and management skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1304\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Aspirants</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1389\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students interested in HR, Banking, Law, Accounting from a management perspective</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1413\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1466\">Must have basic understanding of English language</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1471\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wzi6i2\" data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1515\">Academic Eligibility for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1640\">Indian applicants must fulfill basic schooling requirements to ensure readiness for higher education in management studies.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1930\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"meh308\" data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1725\">10th Class Certificate &ndash; Completion of 10 years of formal schooling is required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ay5krq\" data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1810\">12th Class Certificate &ndash; Completion of 12 years of formal schooling is mandatory</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ol4sv5\" data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1930\">Students currently <strong data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1858\">appearing for Class 12</strong> are also eligible to apply (final admission depends on passing results)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"2110\"><strong data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1954\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1957\">This eligibility structure ensures that even early applicants can secure admission and plan their academic journey without losing time after board exams.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2115\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1xlprln\" data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2170\">Eligibility for Entrepreneurs and Working Aspirants</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2307\">The program is not limited to school graduates. It is also designed for individuals already engaged in business or professional fields.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2337\">Eligible candidates include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2565\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rqy1kf\" data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2394\">Business owners looking to improve managerial skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ggxkf0\" data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2445\">Working professionals aiming for career growth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wk2iod\" data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2500\">Individuals wanting to shift into management roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dl53d3\" data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2565\">Aspirants seeking practical knowledge in business operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2728\"><strong data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2588\">Why this matters:</strong><br data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2591\">This flexibility makes the program highly suitable for real-world learners who want skill enhancement alongside professional commitments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2733\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7j9uzd\" data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2765\">English Language Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2845\">A basic understanding of the English language is mandatory for all applicants.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2873\">This is important because:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"3047\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17r3dmd\" data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2917\">Course material is delivered in English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"346kvg\" data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2979\">Assignments and assessments require written communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wb0iqi\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3047\">Business communication skills are a core part of the curriculum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3213\"><strong data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3065\">Key Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3068\">Students with weak English skills may face difficulty in understanding business concepts, so basic proficiency is essential for academic success.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3218\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g5t9g4\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3254\">Eligibility for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3357\">International applicants must meet equivalent academic standards to ensure global academic alignment.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3551\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bg6h7l\" data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3427\">O Level Certificate &ndash; Completion of 10 years of formal schooling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mdljvx\" data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3496\">A Level Certificate &ndash; Completion of 12 years of formal schooling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gern8w\" data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3551\">Diplomas are not accepted for eligibility purposes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3553\" data-end=\"3715\"><strong data-start=\"3553\" data-end=\"3572\">Important Note:</strong><br data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3575\">Foreign students must obtain a Certificate of Equivalence from the Association of Indian Universities (AIU) to apply for admission in India.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"708\">The Amity Online fee structure is designed to give students maximum flexibility in paying their program cost. Whether you prefer a one-time payment, yearly installment, semester-wise fee, or monthly EMI, each option is structured to reduce financial pressure while making higher education accessible.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"793\">Below is the complete fee breakdown in a clear table format for easy understanding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"798\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qg12c2\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"832\">Fee Structure Comparison Table</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"1330\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"907\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"907\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"849\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"864\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"892\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay / Discounted Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"907\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1330\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n<td data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1002\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1014\">₹1,99,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1026\">₹1,75,120</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1064\">Lowest total cost, maximum savings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1150\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1078\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1097\">₹66,333 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1116\">₹63,020 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1150\">Balanced yearly payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1170\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1193\">₹33,200 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1211\">₹1,99,000 total</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1246\">Flexible academic-based payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1330\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1263\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1278\">₹8,292/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1293\">₹7,877/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1330\">0% interest, easy monthly payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1335\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dr2dbr\" data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1377\">Admission Fee&nbsp;</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1614\">The admission process requires students to select a payment mode based on their financial convenience. There is no separate hidden admission fee structure; instead, the total program fee is distributed across different payment options.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1636\">Students can choose:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1820\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3mkf7b\" data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1681\">Full payment at once for maximum savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o2gbxi\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1732\">Yearly payment for moderate financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fddv4v\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1774\">Semester-wise payment for flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3tcrpp\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1820\">Monthly EMI for lowest financial pressure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1937\">Each option ensures that students can start their program without financial stress while maintaining affordability.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"893\">The Amity Online program curriculum is carefully designed to build strong foundational knowledge in management, business administration, marketing, finance, human resources, and digital business practices. It follows a progressive learning structure where students move from basic business concepts in early semesters to advanced strategic, analytical, and industry-oriented subjects in later stages.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"1121\">This structure ensures that learners not only gain theoretical knowledge but also develop practical decision-making abilities, analytical thinking, and professional skills required in today&rsquo;s competitive corporate environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1126\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1brwa5p\" data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1178\">Program Structure Overview and Learning Approach</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1284\">The curriculum is divided into six semesters, each focusing on a specific stage of learning development:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nwvcpp\" data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1353\">Foundational understanding of business concepts and communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g6z4ut\" data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1421\">Intermediate exposure to management, finance, and IT applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pg4x9a\" data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1495\">Advanced learning in organizational behaviour, research, and operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15lamzv\" data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1571\">Strategic business and marketing knowledge with entrepreneurship exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19i6yiu\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1652\">Industry-oriented specialization through electives and digital business skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rbi0y\" data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1730\">Final integration of global management concepts and research-based learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1823\">This step-by-step academic progression ensures strong employability and industry readiness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1828\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"m8sljq\" data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1882\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundation of Business and Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"2014\">The first semester focuses on building core business understanding and communication skills required in professional environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2033\">Subjects include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2544\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187gkfo\" data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2141\">Accounting Fundamentals &ndash; Basics of financial recording, accounting principles, and business transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"84isah\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2246\">Principles of Marketing &ndash; Introduction to market behavior, branding basics, and customer understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ak3k1u\" data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2344\">Management Foundation &ndash; Core management principles, planning, organizing, and leadership basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19z92up\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2437\">Business Statistics &ndash; Data interpretation, statistical tools, and decision-making analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fbzco2\" data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2544\">Business Communication &ndash; Professional writing, communication etiquette, and corporate interaction skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2658\">This semester plays a critical role in shaping analytical thinking and business awareness from the ground level.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2663\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1pekami\" data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2721\">Semester 2 &ndash; Human Resource and Financial Fundamentals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2835\">This semester strengthens understanding of workforce management, financial systems, and technology applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2854\">Subjects include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"3362\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13v5vl7\" data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2960\">Fundamentals of Human Resource Management &ndash; Recruitment, training, employee relations, and HR processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u1hxio\" data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"3062\">Fundamentals of Financial Management &ndash; Capital management, budgeting, and financial decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"45val6\" data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3170\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamics &ndash; Personality development, teamwork, and interpersonal behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36ewri\" data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3266\">IT Applications in Business &ndash; Use of digital tools, software systems, and business automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ygzkc8\" data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3362\">Environmental Studies &ndash; Sustainability, environmental awareness, and corporate responsibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3449\">This stage enhances both technical and soft skills essential for workplace readiness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3451\" data-end=\"3454\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13ckmnh\" data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3520\">Semester 3 &ndash; Organizational Behaviour and Research Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3623\">Students begin exploring organizational systems, business research, and global business environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3642\">Subjects include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"4172\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ges3zv\" data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3752\">Principles of Organizational Behaviour &ndash; Understanding employee behavior, motivation, and workplace culture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yell81\" data-start=\"3753\" data-end=\"3877\">Essentials of Production and Operations Management &ndash; Production systems, workflow optimization, and efficiency improvement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2ghkf\" data-start=\"3878\" data-end=\"3984\">Research Methods for Managers &ndash; Business research techniques, data collection, and analytical frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmu7l4\" data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"4076\">Cross Cultural Management &ndash; Managing global teams and cultural diversity in organizations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hd0aq1\" data-start=\"4077\" data-end=\"4172\">Financial Markets and Services &ndash; Banking systems, investment instruments, and capital markets</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4258\">This semester builds analytical and managerial depth for real-world decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4263\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w4s7us\" data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4330\">Semester 4 &ndash; Operations, Entrepreneurship and Consumer Insights</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4332\" data-end=\"4442\">This semester focuses on operations efficiency, entrepreneurship mindset, and customer behavior understanding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"4461\">Subjects include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"4944\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11oq80v\" data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"4551\">Operations Research &ndash; Mathematical models for business optimization and decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4x41ec\" data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4652\">Principles of Consumer Behaviour &ndash; Psychological and social factors influencing customer decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3n16cr\" data-start=\"4653\" data-end=\"4752\">Fundamentals of Entrepreneurship &ndash; Startup planning, innovation, and business creation strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uv6h2g\" data-start=\"4753\" data-end=\"4852\">Sales and Distribution Management &ndash; Sales planning, channel management, and distribution networks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5zp04r\" data-start=\"4853\" data-end=\"4944\">Fundamentals of Project Management &ndash; Project planning, execution, and resource allocation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4946\" data-end=\"5019\">This stage develops strategic thinking and business execution capability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5021\" data-end=\"5024\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12z5u02\" data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5082\">Semester 5 &ndash; Strategic Business and Digital Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5084\" data-end=\"5190\">This semester introduces advanced business strategy, digital transformation, and specialization electives.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5192\" data-end=\"5209\">Subjects include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5210\" data-end=\"5798\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"blc04p\" data-start=\"5210\" data-end=\"5308\">Marketing in Digital Age &ndash; Digital marketing tools, online branding, and social media strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mqckzw\" data-start=\"5309\" data-end=\"5403\">Business Strategy &ndash; Long-term planning, competitive advantage, and corporate decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"61vl5k\" data-start=\"5404\" data-end=\"5502\">Professional Ethics &ndash; Corporate governance, ethical decision-making, and business responsibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uvalzx\" data-start=\"5503\" data-end=\"5608\">Managing Customer Relationships (Elective) &ndash; CRM systems, customer retention, and engagement strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u2jiis\" data-start=\"5609\" data-end=\"5695\">Financial Planning (Elective) &ndash; Personal and corporate financial planning techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xncuep\" data-start=\"5696\" data-end=\"5798\">Quality Management (Elective) &ndash; Process improvement, Six Sigma concepts, and quality control systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5800\" data-end=\"5883\">This semester significantly enhances employability in modern business environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5885\" data-end=\"5888\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vj67mk\" data-start=\"5890\" data-end=\"5954\">Semester 6 &ndash; Global Business Integration and Industry Exposure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5956\" data-end=\"6051\">The final semester focuses on international business understanding and research-based learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6053\" data-end=\"6070\">Subjects include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6071\" data-end=\"6476\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"100qk0t\" data-start=\"6071\" data-end=\"6189\">Fundamentals of International Human Resource Management &ndash; Global workforce management and international HR practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qfw0s0\" data-start=\"6190\" data-end=\"6271\">Brand Management &ndash; Building, positioning, and maintaining strong brand identity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ujle9\" data-start=\"6272\" data-end=\"6363\">Fundamentals of Retailing &ndash; Retail operations, consumer experience, and retail strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14m74ww\" data-start=\"6364\" data-end=\"6476\">Dissertation &ndash; Research-based project integrating all learned concepts into practical business problem-solving</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6478\" data-end=\"6564\">This stage prepares students for leadership roles and industry-level responsibilities.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(332, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 207, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 03:34:37', '2026-06-16 07:30:32', '<p data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"709\">The Amity Online MBA admission process is designed to provide a smooth, fully online, and student-friendly enrollment experience. The process is structured in a simple step-by-step format so that fresh graduates, working professionals, and entrepreneurs can complete their admission without unnecessary complexity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"860\">From program selection to final enrollment confirmation, every stage is digitally managed to ensure convenience, transparency, and faster processing.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"865\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gn3usp\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"899\">MBA Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"1448\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"908\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"926\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"941\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1448\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1080\">\r\n<td data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"991\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1013\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Select Your Program</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1080\">Choose the MBA program and specialization based on career goals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1169\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1090\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1113\">Complete Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1169\">Fill in personal, academic, and professional details</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1179\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1198\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Pay Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1261\">Choose preferred payment option and complete secure payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1348\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1271\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1291\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit &amp; Register</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1348\">Submit application and complete official registration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1448\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1358\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1385\">Await Enrollment Details</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1448\">Receive enrollment confirmation and academic access details</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1453\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dnyb6j\" data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1485\">Step 1 &ndash; Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1625\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the MBA program that aligns with your career objectives and specialization interests.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1652\">Students should evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1859\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p54qye\" data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1693\">Career goals and industry preference</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nszgkp\" data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1766\">Specialization options such as Marketing, Finance, HR, or Operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1si5iqm\" data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1811\">Future salary growth and industry demand</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e7l07h\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1859\">Professional skill development requirements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"2011\"><strong data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1883\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1886\">Choosing the correct specialization is important because it directly impacts future job opportunities and career progression.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2016\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9f7qk7\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2054\">Step 2 &ndash; Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2164\">After selecting the program, applicants must complete the online application form with accurate information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2201\">The application generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2351\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2222\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2253\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11f0hy9\" data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2288\">Graduation marks and documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2312\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15qvb0i\" data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2351\">Professional details (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2487\"><strong data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2365\">Key Tip:</strong><br data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2368\">Incorrect information or incomplete forms can delay the admission approval process, so careful submission is important.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2492\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q99ygt\" data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2521\">Step 3 &ndash; Pay Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2632\">Once the application is completed, students must proceed with fee payment using their preferred payment mode.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2668\">Available payment options include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2771\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2689\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cnzsmw\" data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2713\">Annual payment plan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yedjnd\" data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2739\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qvx3iu\" data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2771\">24-month no-cost EMI option</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2917\"><strong data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2795\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2798\">Flexible payment options help students manage education expenses based on financial convenience and long-term planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2922\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a2idqx\" data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2965\">Step 4 &ndash; Submit &amp; Complete Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"3065\">After successful fee payment, students must submit the final application to complete registration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3081\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3237\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"doz042\" data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3126\">Admission request is officially recorded</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v6ghz8\" data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3153\">Documents are verified</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x3harp\" data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3191\">Registration process is completed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c3e63s\" data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3237\">Application moves for enrollment approval</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3313\">This step officially confirms your participation in the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3318\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4r6bni\" data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3355\">Step 5 &ndash; Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3468\">After registration verification, students receive enrollment-related communication and academic access details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3484\">This includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3604\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3512\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3542\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j50tbg\" data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3569\">Learning portal access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tf80c5\" data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3604\">Academic schedule and guidance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3606\" data-end=\"3690\"><strong data-start=\"3606\" data-end=\"3622\">Key Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"3622\" data-end=\"3625\">This stage marks the official start of your MBA learning journey.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"789\">The Amity Online MBA eligibility criteria are designed to provide admission opportunities for fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, and career-focused aspirants who want to build advanced management skills. The program follows a flexible admission structure while maintaining essential academic standards required for MBA-level learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"967\">This approach allows students from diverse educational and professional backgrounds to pursue higher management education and prepare for leadership roles in modern industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1u5hkd7\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1005\">Eligibility Criteria Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1469\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1045\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1045\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1018\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1045\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1469\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1142\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1102\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fresh Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1142\">Eligible after completing graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1167\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Working Professionals</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1223\">Eligible for career growth and management upskilling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1303\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1240\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entrepreneurs</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1303\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitable for business owners managing or scaling businesses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1401\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1323\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Career Aspirants</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1401\" data-col-size=\"md\">Ideal for careers in Finance, Marketing, Sales, Operations, and Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1469\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1424\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1469\">Basic proficiency in English is mandatory</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1474\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uhj2b3\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1509\">Eligibility for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1610\">Indian applicants must meet the following academic requirements for admission into the MBA program.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1637\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1637\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1626\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1637\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1754\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1692\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1754\">Graduation in any discipline from a recognized institution</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1801\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1771\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1801\">Minimum 40% marks required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1866\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1823\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Below 40% Criteria</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1866\">Admission test required for eligibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1890\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1923\">English proficiency mandatory</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"2117\"><strong data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1947\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1950\">The flexible graduation criteria make the program accessible to students from various academic streams including commerce, science, arts, and professional backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2122\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1t353jp\" data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2164\">Admission Test Requirement (Below 40%)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2333\">Students who have scored below 40% marks in graduation are still eligible, but they must qualify through an admission test conducted as part of the evaluation process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2348\">This ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17lcuhi\" data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2412\">Equal opportunity for applicants with lower academic scores</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4g3ux6\" data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2470\">Assessment based on aptitude and management readiness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1klzj92\" data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2523\">Broader access to higher education opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2528\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wmvyoi\" data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2587\">Eligibility for Working Professionals and Entrepreneurs</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2724\">The MBA program is highly suitable for professionals and business owners who want to strengthen management and leadership capabilities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2754\">Eligible candidates include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2992\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wqnie4\" data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2819\">Working professionals seeking promotions or role transitions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16qlerq\" data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2865\">Entrepreneurs scaling existing businesses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fsehdx\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2910\">Managers aiming for leadership positions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11y6jlh\" data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2992\">Professionals wanting specialization in marketing, finance, HR, or operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3155\"><strong data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3010\">Key Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3013\">The curriculum is designed to support practical business understanding, making it valuable for both corporate professionals and entrepreneurs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3160\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7j9uzd\" data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3192\">English Language Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3298\">Applicants must possess basic proficiency in English because the program is delivered in English medium.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3337\">English proficiency is important for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3496\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pbftan\" data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3390\">Understanding business concepts and case studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11966q8\" data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3441\">Participating in assignments and presentations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lylxr\" data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3496\">Professional communication and management learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3608\">Students with strong communication skills generally perform better in MBA environments and corporate settings.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3610\" data-end=\"3613\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g5t9g4\" data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3649\">Eligibility for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3651\" data-end=\"3738\">International applicants must fulfill equivalent academic qualifications for admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3933\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3765\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3765\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3754\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3754\" data-end=\"3765\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3933\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3863\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3820\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3863\">Graduation from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3864\" data-end=\"3933\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3864\" data-end=\"3889\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3933\">AIU Certificate of Equivalence mandatory</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"4134\">Foreign students must obtain a <strong data-start=\"3966\" data-end=\"3996\">Certificate of Equivalence</strong> from the <strong data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4050\">Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</strong> to validate their educational qualifications for Indian higher education standards.</p>', '<p data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"751\">The Amity Online MBA fee structure is designed to provide flexible payment options for different financial needs. Students can choose from one-time payment, annual installment, semester-wise fee, or no-cost EMI. Each option has a different total cost impact, but all are structured to make higher education more accessible and manageable.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"853\">Below is the complete and simplified fee breakdown in a clear table format for better understanding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"858\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"124dwav\" data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"894\">MBA Fee Structure (Table Format)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"977\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"977\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"911\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"926\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"941\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"962\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Average Total Cost</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"977\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1147\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1079\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1103\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,07,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1115\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,07,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1147\">Lowest cost, maximum savings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1161\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1178\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,12,500/year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1195\">₹1,06,880/year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1207\">₹2,13,750</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1235\">Balanced yearly payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1255\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1274\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹56,300/semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1278\">&mdash;</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1290\">₹2,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1320\">Flexible academic payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1337\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1352\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹9,375/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1367\">₹8,906/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1379\">₹2,13,750</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1407\">0% interest monthly plan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ckhzd4\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1456\">Quick Fee Insight</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1739\">The average total cost of the Amity Online MBA program ranges between <strong data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1556\">₹2.07 lakh to ₹2.25 lakh</strong>, depending on the payment option selected. The one-time payment option provides the lowest overall cost, while EMI and annual plans offer flexibility for managing finances over time.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"805\">The Amity Online MBA program curriculum is designed to develop strong managerial, analytical, and leadership skills required in today&rsquo;s competitive business environment. It follows a structured four-semester learning model that gradually shifts from foundational business knowledge to advanced strategic thinking, specialization, and real-world project implementation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"1005\">This curriculum is industry-aligned and focuses on building decision-making ability, problem-solving skills, and digital business understanding, making students job-ready for modern corporate roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1y3t08c\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1041\">Program Curriculum Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1506\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1087\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1087\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1054\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1067\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1087\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1506\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1146\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1171\">Management Foundations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1223\">Build core business and analytical understanding</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1310\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1237\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1258\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Functions</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1310\">Strengthen finance, HR, law, and research skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1403\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1324\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1352\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategy &amp; Specialization</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1403\">Develop strategic thinking and domain expertise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1506\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1417\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1440\">Industry Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1506\">Apply knowledge through projects and digital business exposure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1511\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"s39t9n\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1572\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundation of Management &amp; Business Thinking</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1707\">The first semester focuses on building strong conceptual clarity in economics, accounting, communication, and marketing fundamentals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1726\">Subjects include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"2207\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lf5q2b\" data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1819\">Managerial Economics &ndash; Understanding demand, supply, pricing, and business decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"viq8p3\" data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1916\">Statistics for Management &ndash; Data analysis, interpretation, and business forecasting techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vgr3g2\" data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"2014\">Professional Communication &ndash; Business writing, presentation skills, and corporate communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10s2psp\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2119\">Accounting for Managers &ndash; Financial statements, accounting principles, and managerial decision support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sbcr1w\" data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2207\">Marketing Management &ndash; Basics of market segmentation, branding, and consumer behavior</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2368\"><strong data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2234\">Key Learning Outcome:</strong><br data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2237\">This semester builds the foundation of business thinking and analytical decision-making, essential for all future managerial roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2373\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"mdeop0\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2435\">Semester 2 &ndash; Core Business Functions &amp; Legal Understanding</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2555\">This semester focuses on strengthening functional knowledge of business operations, finance, HR, and legal frameworks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2574\">Subjects include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"3048\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7lcujx\" data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2669\">Legal Aspects of Business &ndash; Business laws, contracts, compliance, and regulatory environment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uwtubt\" data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2765\">Business Research Methods &ndash; Research design, data collection, and analytical business studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0245n\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2854\">Financial Management &ndash; Investment decisions, capital structure, and financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hpd7mi\" data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2954\">Human Resource Management &ndash; Recruitment, training, performance management, and employee relations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rjyc6l\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"3048\">Conflict Resolution and Management &ndash; Workplace conflict handling and negotiation strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3187\"><strong data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3075\">Key Learning Outcome:</strong><br data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3078\">Students develop practical understanding of how organizations function across finance, HR, and legal systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3189\" data-end=\"3192\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"700822\" data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3256\">Semester 3 &ndash; Strategic Thinking &amp; Specialization Development</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3393\">This semester focuses on advanced business strategy and allows students to choose specialization electives based on their career goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3412\">Subjects include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3413\" data-end=\"3790\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ounwv\" data-start=\"3413\" data-end=\"3509\">Strategic Management &ndash; Business planning, competitive advantage, and long-term decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wq2xt\" data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3602\">Minor Project &ndash; Practical application of learned concepts in a real-world business problem</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9w876e\" data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3702\">Professional Ethics &ndash; Corporate responsibility, ethical decision-making, and governance standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17b7yvk\" data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3790\">Specialization Electives (1&ndash;4) &ndash; Domain-specific subjects based on chosen career path</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3942\"><strong data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3817\">Key Learning Outcome:</strong><br data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3820\">Students begin developing expertise in their selected specialization while strengthening strategic business understanding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"3947\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1jm52li\" data-start=\"3949\" data-end=\"4012\">Semester 4 &ndash; Industry Application &amp; Digital Business Exposure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4128\">The final semester focuses on practical exposure, digital transformation, and real-world business problem-solving.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4147\">Subjects include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4560\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v477s1\" data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4243\">Major Project &ndash; Comprehensive research-based project applying MBA knowledge in real scenarios</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ab73ha\" data-start=\"4244\" data-end=\"4369\">Management in Action (Social, Economic &amp; Ethical Issues) &ndash; Understanding real-world business challenges and societal impact</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xlw33p\" data-start=\"4370\" data-end=\"4469\">Digital Marketing &ndash; Online branding, SEO, social media marketing, and digital business strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dk2cxz\" data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4560\">Specialization Electives (1&ndash;2) &ndash; Advanced domain-focused subjects for career enhancement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4562\" data-end=\"4699\"><strong data-start=\"4562\" data-end=\"4587\">Key Learning Outcome:</strong><br data-start=\"4587\" data-end=\"4590\">This semester prepares students for real corporate environments by combining theory with practical execution.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 225000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(333, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 39, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 03:44:25', '2026-06-16 07:31:22', '<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"690\">The Amity Online BCA admission process is designed to provide students with a smooth, fully digital, and easy enrollment experience. The process is structured in simple stages so that students can apply, submit documents, complete payment, and receive enrollment confirmation without unnecessary complications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"918\">This online admission system is especially beneficial for students who want flexible access to higher education in computer applications, software development, cloud computing, AI, cybersecurity, and related technology fields.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"bkiton\" data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"957\">BCA Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"966\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"984\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"999\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1124\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1049\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1071\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Select Your Program</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1124\">Choose the BCA program based on your career goals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1208\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1134\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1157\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Complete Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1208\">Fill in academic, personal, and contact details</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1288\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1218\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1237\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Pay Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1288\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete payment using preferred payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1372\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1298\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1318\">Submit &amp; Register</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1372\">Submit final application and complete registration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1382\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1409\">Await Enrollment Details</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1466\">Receive enrollment confirmation and academic guidance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1471\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dnyb6j\" data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1503\">Step 1 &ndash; Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1614\">The first stage of admission is choosing the BCA program according to your career interests and future goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1641\">Students should evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1859\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"txrcrr\" data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1694\">Interest in programming and software development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yk5xe\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1740\">Career opportunities in IT and technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17tubl4\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1808\">Future demand for AI, cloud computing, and cybersecurity skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d59arq\" data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1859\">Long-term higher education and placement goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"2001\"><strong data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1883\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1886\">Selecting the right program at the beginning helps students build a focused career path in the technology industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2006\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9f7qk7\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2044\">Step 2 &ndash; Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2136\">After selecting the program, students must complete the online application form carefully.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2178\">The application form generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2325\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2203\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18y1vi6\" data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2238\">Academic qualification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2262\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yrzl9a\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2292\">Program selection details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mtdj5y\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2325\">Required document submission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2432\"><strong data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2339\">Key Tip:</strong><br data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2342\">Incorrect details or incomplete information may delay verification and admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2437\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q99ygt\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2466\">Step 3 &ndash; Pay Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2579\">Once the application form is completed, students must proceed with fee payment using available payment methods.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2605\">Payment options include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2699\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2626\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cnzsmw\" data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2650\">Annual payment plan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yedjnd\" data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2676\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xmj4q5\" data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2699\">No-cost EMI option</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2831\"><strong data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2723\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2726\">Flexible payment methods help students manage educational expenses according to their financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2836\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a2idqx\" data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2879\">Step 4 &ndash; Submit &amp; Complete Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2979\">After successful fee payment, students must submit the final application to complete registration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"2995\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3147\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"doz042\" data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3040\">Admission request is officially recorded</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3plzde\" data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3079\">Application moves for verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ch807t\" data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3117\">Student registration is confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4aysfn\" data-start=\"3118\" data-end=\"3147\">Enrollment process begins</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3226\">This step is important because it finalizes the admission submission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3231\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4r6bni\" data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3268\">Step 5 &ndash; Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3367\">After verification and registration approval, students receive official enrollment communication.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3396\">Students generally receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3529\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3424\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3454\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1da02k\" data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3486\">Access to learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8y8ytb\" data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3529\">Academic schedule and further guidance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3629\"><strong data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3547\">Key Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3550\">This stage officially starts the student&rsquo;s academic journey in the BCA program.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"793\">The Amity Online BCA eligibility criteria are designed for students who want to build careers in computer applications, software development, networking, cybersecurity, database management, and other IT-related fields. The admission requirements are structured to ensure that students possess the basic academic foundation necessary for technical and professional learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"955\">The program is suitable for fresh 10+2 students, technology aspirants, and learners interested in developing industry-relevant computing and programming skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"960\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1u5hkd7\" data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"993\">Eligibility Criteria Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1347\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1006\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1033\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1347\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1097\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1132\" data-col-size=\"md\">10+2 pass or appearing students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1215\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1152\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Career Aspirants</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1215\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students interested in computer applications and IT careers</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1285\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1239\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1285\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basic understanding of English recommended</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1347\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1310\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Student Type</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1347\" data-col-size=\"md\">Indian and international students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2249\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2254\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uhj2b3\" data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2289\">Eligibility for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2367\">Indian students must meet the following academic requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2394\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2394\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2383\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2394\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2442\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10th Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2499\" data-col-size=\"md\">10th Class Certificate (10 years of formal schooling)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2578\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2521\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12th Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2578\" data-col-size=\"md\">12th Class Certificate (12 years of formal schooling)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2597\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Boards</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2633\" data-col-size=\"md\">Recognized boards including NIOS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2774\"><strong data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2657\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2660\">Students appearing for Class 12 are also eligible to apply, subject to fulfillment of final academic requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2779\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g5t9g4\" data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2815\">Eligibility for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2914\">International students must meet equivalent educational qualifications for admission eligibility.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"3274\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2941\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2941\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2930\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2941\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3274\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3053\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"2990\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Secondary Education</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3053\" data-col-size=\"md\">Secondary School Certificate (10 years of formal schooling)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3153\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3083\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Senior Secondary Education</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3153\" data-col-size=\"md\">Senior Secondary School Certificate (12 years of formal schooling)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3204\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3175\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diploma Acceptance</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3204\" data-col-size=\"md\">Diplomas are not accepted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3274\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3230\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3274\" data-col-size=\"md\">AIU Certificate of Equivalence mandatory</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3465\">Foreign applicants must obtain a <strong data-start=\"3309\" data-end=\"3339\">Certificate of Equivalence</strong> from the <strong data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3393\">Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</strong> to validate their qualifications for Indian higher education standards.</p>', '<p data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"710\">The Amity Online BCA fee structure is designed to provide flexible and affordable payment options for students pursuing careers in computer applications, software development, cloud computing, AI, and data science. Students can choose different payment modes according to their financial convenience and planning preferences.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"865\">The program offers one-time payment benefits, semester-wise flexibility, annual payment options, and no-cost EMI support for easier financial management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"870\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1leyka1\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"906\">BCA Fee Structure (Table Format)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"1472\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"923\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"938\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"953\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"974\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Average Total Cost</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"989\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1472\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1103\">₹1,75,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1115\">₹1,54,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1127\">₹1,54,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1168\">Maximum savings and lowest total cost</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1182\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1197\">₹58,333/year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1212\">₹55,420/year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1224\">₹1,66,250</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1261\">Balanced yearly payment structure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1357\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1281\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1300\">₹29,200/semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1304\">&mdash;</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1316\">₹1,75,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1357\">Flexible semester-wise payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1472\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1382\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1397\">₹7,292/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1412\">₹6,927/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1424\">₹1,66,250</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1472\">Affordable monthly payments with 0% interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1477\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iolzy8\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1501\">Average Fee Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1773\">The average total cost of the Amity Online BCA program ranges between <strong data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1601\">₹1.54 lakh to ₹1.75 lakh</strong>, depending on the selected payment option. Students choosing one-time payment receive the highest savings benefit, while EMI and semester plans provide better flexibility.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"830\">The Amity Online BCA curriculum is designed to build strong technical, analytical, and software development skills required in the modern IT industry. The program follows a structured six-semester learning model that gradually develops knowledge from computer fundamentals to advanced technologies such as Artificial Intelligence, Cloud Computing, Blockchain, Data Science, and Cyber Security.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"1015\">This curriculum is industry-oriented and focuses on both theoretical understanding and practical application, helping students become job-ready for rapidly growing technology sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1y3t08c\" data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1051\">Program Curriculum Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1763\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1064\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1077\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1097\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1763\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1157\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1194\">Computer &amp; Programming Foundations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1246\">Build basic programming and communication skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1353\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1260\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1296\">Core Software &amp; Operating Systems</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1353\">Understand software development and system operations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1460\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1367\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1392\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Databases &amp; Networking</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1460\">Learn data handling, networking, and object-oriented programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1554\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1474\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1501\">Cloud, Security &amp; Python</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1554\">Develop modern technical and cybersecurity skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1568\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1598\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AI, IoT &amp; Data Technologies</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1654\">Explore emerging technologies and enterprise systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1763\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1668\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 6</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1703\">Advanced Technologies &amp; Projects</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1763\">Apply technical learning through projects and innovation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1768\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ujw9zb\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1822\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundation of Computing &amp; Programming</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1953\">The first semester introduces students to the core fundamentals of computers, programming, mathematics, and communication skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1976\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2467\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jj4ji8\" data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2090\">Computer and Information Technology &ndash; Basics of computer systems, hardware, software, and digital technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sr86vx\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2182\">Basic Mathematics I &ndash; Mathematical concepts used in computing and logical problem-solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6hx3t3\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2279\">Programming in C &ndash; Fundamental programming concepts including loops, conditions, and functions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12e2jfj\" data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2366\">Business Communication &ndash; Professional communication and workplace interaction skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7pi8fn\" data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2467\">Human Computer Interaction &ndash; Understanding how users interact with computer systems and interfaces</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2493\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2634\">Students build foundational programming knowledge and gain basic understanding of how computer systems function in real-world environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2639\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"57qseu\" data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2703\">Semester 2 &ndash; Data Structures &amp; Software Development Concepts</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2822\">This semester focuses on software engineering fundamentals, operating systems, and structured programming techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2845\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"3293\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3ep1p\" data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2936\">Data Structure using C &ndash; Arrays, linked lists, stacks, queues, and algorithm efficiency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a0lk58\" data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"3022\">Operating System Concepts &ndash; Process management, memory systems, and OS fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"riwkkb\" data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3111\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic &ndash; Personality development and teamwork skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1orp09n\" data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3195\">Environmental Studies &ndash; Sustainability awareness and environmental responsibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nat8z4\" data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3293\">Software Engineering and Modeling &ndash; Software development lifecycle and system design techniques</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3319\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3414\">Students begin understanding how large software systems are designed, managed, and optimized.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3419\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"102tpom\" data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3468\">Semester 3 &ndash; Database Management &amp; Networking</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3607\">The third semester introduces students to databases, networking, and object-oriented programming concepts widely used in the IT industry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3630\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"4088\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wysqsp\" data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3716\">Computational Statistics &ndash; Statistical analysis and data interpretation techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4r8deh\" data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3808\">Introduction to Database Management Systems &ndash; Database design, SQL, and data organization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ifwkns\" data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3894\">Green Computing &ndash; Sustainable computing practices and energy-efficient technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11zr71a\" data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"3980\">Network Basics &ndash; Computer networking concepts, protocols, and communication systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5tmedf\" data-start=\"3981\" data-end=\"4088\">Object Oriented Programming Using Java &ndash; Classes, objects, inheritance, and Java programming fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"4090\" data-end=\"4114\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4116\" data-end=\"4225\">Students develop database management and networking skills essential for software and web-based applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4230\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2y46y1\" data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4287\">Semester 4 &ndash; Python, Cloud Computing &amp; Cyber Security</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4289\" data-end=\"4399\">This semester focuses on modern technologies including cloud computing, cybersecurity, and Python programming.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"4401\" data-end=\"4422\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4424\" data-end=\"4967\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xi83kj\" data-start=\"4424\" data-end=\"4521\">Unix Operating System and Shell Programming &ndash; Linux/Unix environment and command-line scripting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19fzm8a\" data-start=\"4522\" data-end=\"4603\">Python Programming &ndash; Python syntax, automation, and software development basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1azjqqs\" data-start=\"4604\" data-end=\"4700\">Cyber and Information Security &ndash; Data protection, cyber threats, and network security concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16nhyeo\" data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4806\">Fundamental of Cloud Computing and Enterprise &ndash; Cloud platforms, virtualization, and enterprise systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hp769g\" data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4895\">Fundamentals of Digital Marketing &ndash; SEO, online marketing, and digital business basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o5w18z\" data-start=\"4896\" data-end=\"4967\">IT Project Management &ndash; Planning, managing, and executing IT projects</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"4993\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4995\" data-end=\"5087\">Students gain exposure to some of the most in-demand technologies in the modern IT industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5089\" data-end=\"5092\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ld7tfy\" data-start=\"5094\" data-end=\"5158\">Semester 5 &ndash; Artificial Intelligence &amp; Enterprise Technologies</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5160\" data-end=\"5262\">The fifth semester introduces advanced industry-oriented technologies shaping the future of computing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5285\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5287\" data-end=\"5815\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ej4gx\" data-start=\"5287\" data-end=\"5372\">Professional Ethics &ndash; Ethical practices in technology and professional environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2os0a\" data-start=\"5373\" data-end=\"5478\">Introduction to Artificial Intelligence &ndash; AI concepts, machine learning basics, and intelligent systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i9nsth\" data-start=\"5479\" data-end=\"5564\">Fundamentals of E-Commerce &ndash; Digital business models and online transaction systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9ne93d\" data-start=\"5565\" data-end=\"5642\">Data Warehousing and Mining &ndash; Big data storage and data analysis techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11d0fu2\" data-start=\"5643\" data-end=\"5721\">Internet of Things (IoT) &ndash; Connected devices and smart technology ecosystems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cit07f\" data-start=\"5722\" data-end=\"5815\">Introduction to Enterprise Resource Planning &ndash; Business process integration and ERP systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"5817\" data-end=\"5841\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5843\" data-end=\"5932\">Students begin exploring emerging technologies that are transforming industries globally.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5934\" data-end=\"5937\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"fzfx1l\" data-start=\"5939\" data-end=\"5995\">Semester 6 &ndash; Advanced Technologies &amp; Industry Projects</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5997\" data-end=\"6093\">The final semester focuses on innovation, real-world projects, and advanced technology concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"6095\" data-end=\"6116\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6118\" data-end=\"6599\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"scg6pg\" data-start=\"6118\" data-end=\"6222\">Major Project &ndash; Practical implementation of technical knowledge through real-world project development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"no3bmu\" data-start=\"6223\" data-end=\"6320\">Blockchain Technologies &ndash; Distributed systems, cryptocurrency concepts, and secure transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vm5fgs\" data-start=\"6321\" data-end=\"6406\">Human Resource Management &ndash; Workplace management and organizational behavior basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8hb47q\" data-start=\"6407\" data-end=\"6495\">Introduction to Data Science &ndash; Data analytics, interpretation, and predictive analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v7jfxe\" data-start=\"6496\" data-end=\"6599\">Introduction to E-Governance &ndash; Technology use in digital public administration and governance systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"6601\" data-end=\"6625\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6627\" data-end=\"6722\">Students gain practical exposure and project experience to prepare for professional IT careers.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 175000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(334, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 04:00:27', '2026-06-16 07:30:59', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"631\">The Amity Online MCA admission process is designed to provide a smooth, flexible, and fully online enrollment experience for students and working professionals interested in advanced computer application and technology education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"971\">The admission system is structured in simple stages so applicants can easily complete the process from program selection to final enrollment confirmation without visiting campus physically. This online approach makes the process convenient, time-efficient, and accessible for learners from different locations and educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1206\">The MCA admission process focuses on simplicity, transparency, and faster onboarding for students pursuing careers in software development, artificial intelligence, cloud computing, cybersecurity, blockchain, and advanced IT sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1211\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lxrh7s\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1245\">MCA Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1254\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1272\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1287\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1416\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1337\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1359\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Select Your Program</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1416\" data-col-size=\"md\">Choose the MCA program according to your career goals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1505\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1426\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1449\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Complete Application</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1505\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fill in personal, academic, and professional details</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1587\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1515\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1534\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Pay Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1587\">Complete payment through preferred payment method</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1597\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1617\">Submit &amp; Register</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1673\">Submit application and complete registration process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1683\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1710\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Await Enrollment Details</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1767\">Receive enrollment confirmation and academic guidance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1772\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dnyb6j\" data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1804\">Step 1 &ndash; Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1961\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the MCA program based on your career objectives, technical interests, and future specialization plans.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1998\">Students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2265\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1syb11s\" data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2058\">Interest in software development and advanced computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vv1555\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2125\">Career opportunities in AI, cloud computing, and cybersecurity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mzko3v\" data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2165\">Long-term technology industry goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4jyb01\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2208\">Skill requirements for future IT roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u2bt36\" data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2265\">Interest in research and advanced technical learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2437\"><strong data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2289\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2292\">Choosing the right program with clear career planning helps students build stronger technical expertise and better long-term professional growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9f7qk7\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2480\">Step 2 &ndash; Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2612\">After selecting the program, applicants must fill out the online application form with accurate academic and personal information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2654\">The application form generally requires:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2845\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2675\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2706\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pyo15r\" data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2739\">Graduation details and marks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2763\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"llt67w\" data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2815\">Professional experience details (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qkxy1q\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2845\">Required document uploads</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gpk3hn\" data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2878\">Documents Commonly Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"3023\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134nxcp\" data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2906\">Graduation mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2925\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2954\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r7lrne\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2972\">Address proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zv1arm\" data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3023\">Additional eligibility documents if applicable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3159\"><strong data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3037\">Key Tip:</strong><br data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3040\">Providing incorrect information or incomplete documentation may delay application verification and enrollment approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3164\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q99ygt\" data-start=\"3166\" data-end=\"3193\">Step 3 &ndash; Pay Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3310\">After completing the application form, students must proceed with fee payment using their preferred payment method.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3360\">Available fee payment options generally include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3455\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3381\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rj4yp9\" data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3404\">Annual fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yedjnd\" data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3430\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j7uob\" data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3455\">No-cost EMI facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19c1bic\" data-start=\"3457\" data-end=\"3496\">Why Flexible Payment Options Matter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3536\">Flexible fee structures help students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3726\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j65kol\" data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3580\">Manage educational expenses effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16umdrz\" data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3631\">Reduce financial pressure through installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ubta8h\" data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3670\">Access higher education affordably</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f9vtpr\" data-start=\"3671\" data-end=\"3726\">Plan long-term academic investment more efficiently</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3878\"><strong data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3750\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3753\">Students should compare total costs before selecting a payment mode because one-time payment usually provides higher savings.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3880\" data-end=\"3883\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a2idqx\" data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3926\">Step 4 &ndash; Submit &amp; Complete Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"4036\">Once fee payment is completed, students must submit the final application to complete official registration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4038\" data-end=\"4052\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4053\" data-end=\"4231\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j51k2m\" data-start=\"4053\" data-end=\"4092\">Application submission is finalized</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lvczxi\" data-start=\"4093\" data-end=\"4141\">Academic and eligibility verification begins</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4dwidi\" data-start=\"4142\" data-end=\"4184\">Registration confirmation is processed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wkf9jb\" data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4231\">Enrollment request moves to approval stage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4233\" data-end=\"4323\">This step officially records the student&rsquo;s admission request within the university system.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4328\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4r6bni\" data-start=\"4330\" data-end=\"4365\">Step 5 &ndash; Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4367\" data-end=\"4502\">After successful verification and registration approval, students receive enrollment-related communication and academic access details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4504\" data-end=\"4531\">Students generally receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4532\" data-end=\"4734\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"4532\" data-end=\"4559\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uddgry\" data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4596\">Student portal login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mymzny\" data-start=\"4597\" data-end=\"4634\">Learning management system access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jfpson\" data-start=\"4635\" data-end=\"4680\">Academic schedule and orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mprpqg\" data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4734\">Further learning guidance and support information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4866\"><strong data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4752\">Key Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"4752\" data-end=\"4755\">This stage officially marks the beginning of the MCA academic journey and access to digital learning resources.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"701\">The Amity Online MCA eligibility criteria are designed for students and professionals who want to build advanced careers in computer applications, software development, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, cloud computing, blockchain, and related technology sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"933\">The eligibility structure is flexible enough to accommodate graduates from multiple academic backgrounds while ensuring that students possess the foundational analytical and technical understanding required for MCA-level learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1109\">This makes the program suitable for fresh graduates, final-year students, working professionals, and career transition aspirants interested in the IT and software industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1114\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1u5hkd7\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1147\">Eligibility Criteria Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1720\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1160\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1187\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1720\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1244\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fresh Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1291\">Eligible after bachelor&rsquo;s degree completion</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1377\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1314\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final-Year Students</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1377\">Eligible to apply subject to final qualification completion</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1461\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1402\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Working Professionals</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1461\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitable for career growth in technology and IT sectors</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1554\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1484\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Background</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1554\">BCA preferred, but science, commerce, and arts graduates can apply</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1633\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1581\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1633\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematics required at 10+2 or graduation level</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1720\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1660\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alternative Eligibility</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1720\">Bridge course available for students without Mathematics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1725\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uhj2b3\" data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2391\">Eligibility for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2457\">Indian applicants must meet the following academic requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2845\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2484\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2484\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2473\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2473\" data-end=\"2484\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2845\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2585\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2537\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Preferred Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2585\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in BCA or equivalent field</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2682\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2611\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Other Eligible Degrees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2682\" data-col-size=\"md\">Science, Commerce, or Arts graduates with Mathematics at 10+2 level</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2762\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2709\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2762\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematics mandatory at 10+2 or graduation level</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2845\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2785\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alternative Pathway</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2845\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bridge course available for students without Mathematics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2850\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w4pkkr\" data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2887\">Mathematics Requirement Explained</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"3113\">Mathematics plays a critical role in advanced computing, programming logic, algorithms, and analytical problem-solving. Therefore, students are generally expected to have studied Mathematics either during 10+2 or graduation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3208\">However, students without Mathematics are still eligible through an additional bridge course.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vscger\" data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3243\">Why the Bridge Course Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3278\">The bridge course helps students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3474\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b1y1bq\" data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3319\">Build basic mathematical foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17mjndk\" data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3361\">Understand logical reasoning concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11bx3xr\" data-start=\"3362\" data-end=\"3416\">Prepare for programming and computational subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3xjbz\" data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3474\">Transition smoothly into MCA-level technical learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3584\">This flexibility makes the program accessible to a broader range of students from non-technical backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3589\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g5t9g4\" data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3625\">Eligibility for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3729\">International applicants must fulfill equivalent educational qualifications and language requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"4001\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3756\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3756\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3745\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3745\" data-end=\"3756\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"4001\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3862\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"3862\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree (BCA or equivalent preferred)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3931\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3886\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3886\" data-end=\"3931\">Proficiency in written and spoken English</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"4001\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"3957\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"4001\" data-col-size=\"md\">AIU Certificate of Equivalence mandatory</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4209\">Foreign students must obtain a <strong data-start=\"4034\" data-end=\"4064\">Certificate of Equivalence</strong> from the <strong data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4118\">Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</strong> to validate their academic qualifications for Indian higher education admission standards.</p>', '<p data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"635\">The Amity Online MCA fee structure is designed to provide affordable and flexible payment options for students pursuing advanced careers in software development, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, cloud computing, blockchain, and data science.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"824\">Students can choose from multiple payment plans according to their financial convenience, including one-time payment, annual fee structure, semester-wise payment, and no-cost EMI options.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"829\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"s4eszq\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"865\">MCA Fee Structure (Table Format)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"948\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"948\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"882\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"897\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"912\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"933\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Average Total Cost</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"948\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1128\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1050\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1062\">₹1,99,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1074\">₹1,83,080</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1086\">₹1,83,080</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1128\">Lowest total cost with maximum savings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1142\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1157\">₹99,500/year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1172\">₹94,530/year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1184\">₹1,89,050</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1218\">Balanced yearly payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1308\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1238\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1257\">₹49,800/semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1261\">&mdash;</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1273\">₹1,99,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1308\">Flexible semester-wise payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1333\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1348\">₹8,292/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1363\">₹7,877/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1375\">₹1,89,050</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1423\">Affordable monthly payments with 0% interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1428\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iolzy8\" data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1452\">Average Fee Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1734\">The average total cost of the Amity Online MCA program ranges between <strong data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1552\">₹1.83 lakh to ₹1.99 lakh</strong>, depending on the selected payment plan. Students opting for one-time payment receive the maximum savings benefit, while EMI and semester options provide better payment flexibility.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"773\">The Amity Online MCA curriculum is designed to provide advanced technical knowledge and professional computing skills required in today&rsquo;s rapidly evolving technology industry. The program focuses on software development, artificial intelligence, machine learning, blockchain, cybersecurity, cloud computing, and advanced programming concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"982\">This curriculum follows a structured four-semester learning model that gradually develops students from core programming fundamentals to advanced emerging technologies and industry-oriented project exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1184\">The program is highly suitable for students who want to build careers in software engineering, AI development, cloud technologies, cybersecurity, blockchain systems, and data-driven computing domains.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15m5ymv\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1216\">MCA Curriculum Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1720\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1229\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1242\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1262\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1720\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1409\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1322\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1359\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Programming &amp; Software Foundations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1409\">Build advanced programming and database skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1508\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1423\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1447\">Algorithms &amp; Security</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1508\">Develop analytical, research, and cybersecurity expertise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1616\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1522\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1551\">Cloud &amp; System Programming</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1616\">Learn cloud technologies and professional computing practices</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1720\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1630\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1663\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AI, ML &amp; Emerging Technologies</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1720\">Gain exposure to advanced future-focused technologies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1725\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13pf5b9\" data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1797\">Semester 1 &ndash; Advanced Programming &amp; Software Engineering Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1947\">The first semester focuses on strengthening core software development and computational thinking skills required for advanced computer applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1970\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2502\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13g39j3\" data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2084\">Professional Communication &ndash; Corporate communication, technical presentation, and workplace interaction skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b8p52m\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2173\">Core Java &ndash; Object-oriented programming concepts and enterprise-level Java development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"32wytj\" data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2277\">Advanced Database Management Systems &ndash; Advanced SQL, database architecture, and data handling systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ch1dpu\" data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2388\">Advanced Software Engineering Principles &ndash; Software lifecycle, design models, testing, and quality assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3vqv0y\" data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2502\">Graph Theory and Combinatorics &ndash; Mathematical structures and logical problem-solving for computing applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2528\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2653\">Students develop strong programming, database, and software engineering foundations essential for advanced technical roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2658\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14px56n\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2712\">Semester 2 &ndash; Algorithms, Research &amp; Cyber Security</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2817\">This semester focuses on advanced problem-solving, research methodology, and network security concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2840\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"3263\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pavwzx\" data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2939\">Research Methodology &ndash; Research design, data collection, and analytical problem-solving methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"izs6xw\" data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"3044\">Data Structures and Algorithm Design &ndash; Advanced algorithms, optimization, and computational efficiency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jo8alh\" data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3160\">Cognitive Analytics and Social Skills for Professional &ndash; Analytical thinking, teamwork, and professional behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n7dg9l\" data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3263\">Network Security and Cryptography &ndash; Data encryption, cyber threats, and secure communication systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3289\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3421\">Students learn how to design secure, efficient, and scalable computing systems while improving analytical and professional skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3426\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"3d0nxk\" data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3485\">Semester 3 &ndash; Cloud Computing &amp; System-Level Programming</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3596\">The third semester introduces cloud infrastructure, Linux programming, and professional evaluation practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3619\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3621\" data-end=\"4050\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pv1a7j\" data-start=\"3621\" data-end=\"3712\">Unix/Linux Programming &ndash; Shell scripting, Linux environment, and system-level programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fzqa7m\" data-start=\"3713\" data-end=\"3789\">Seminar (Evaluation) &ndash; Technical presentation and project-based evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v97kpv\" data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3889\">Cloud Infrastructure and Services &ndash; Cloud platforms, virtualization, and enterprise cloud systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ujlero\" data-start=\"3890\" data-end=\"3971\">Quantitative Aptitude &ndash; Numerical reasoning and analytical aptitude development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h1verr\" data-start=\"3972\" data-end=\"4050\">Professional Ethics &ndash; Ethical standards and responsible technology practices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"4052\" data-end=\"4076\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4174\">Students gain industry-relevant exposure to cloud systems and enterprise computing environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4179\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ildvbe\" data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4255\">Semester 4 &ndash; Artificial Intelligence, Blockchain &amp; Emerging Technologies</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4345\">The final semester focuses on future technologies and industry-transforming innovations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"4347\" data-end=\"4368\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4370\" data-end=\"4977\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rkuh15\" data-start=\"4370\" data-end=\"4471\">Augmented Reality and Virtual Reality &ndash; Immersive digital environments and interactive technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vj5c2n\" data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4582\">Blockchain Technology and Management: Business Management &ndash; Blockchain implementation in business operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o5hylu\" data-start=\"4583\" data-end=\"4705\">Blockchain Technology and Management: Technical Development &ndash; Technical architecture and blockchain development concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hnotvs\" data-start=\"4706\" data-end=\"4778\">Elective Courses (General) &ndash; Specialized domain-based learning options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15u7dv7\" data-start=\"4779\" data-end=\"4866\">Machine Learning &ndash; Predictive models, data-driven learning systems, and AI algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1krhbpk\" data-start=\"4867\" data-end=\"4977\">Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence &ndash; Intelligent systems, automation, and advanced AI applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"4979\" data-end=\"5003\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5005\" data-end=\"5129\">Students develop future-ready technical expertise aligned with emerging technology industries and innovation-driven careers.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(335, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 140, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 04:15:02', '2026-06-16 07:31:46', '<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"716\">The Amity Online BCom admission process is designed to provide students with a smooth, fully online, and easy enrollment experience. The admission system follows a simple step-by-step structure that allows students to apply, upload documents, complete fee payment, and receive enrollment confirmation without visiting campus physically.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"959\">The online process is especially beneficial for students planning careers in accounting, finance, banking, taxation, auditing, and corporate business management because it provides flexibility, accessibility, and faster admission processing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1154\">The structured digital admission model ensures that students from different locations can complete their enrollment conveniently while receiving proper academic guidance throughout the process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"dzz604\" data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1194\">BCom Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1236\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1236\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1203\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1221\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1236\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1286\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1308\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Select Your Program</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1366\">Choose the BCom program according to your career goals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1376\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1399\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Complete Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1450\">Fill in academic, personal, and contact details</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1460\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1479\">Pay Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1530\">Complete payment using preferred payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1608\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1540\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1560\">Submit &amp; Register</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1608\">Submit application and complete registration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1618\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1645\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Await Enrollment Details</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1702\">Receive enrollment confirmation and academic guidance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1707\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dnyb6j\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1739\">Step 1 &ndash; Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1873\">The first stage of the admission process is selecting the BCom program based on your career interests and future professional goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1900\">Students should evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"2134\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7zqy8b\" data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1939\">Interest in accounting and finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ajkjkf\" data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1988\">Career opportunities in banking and taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rx29ro\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2029\">Future plans for MBA, CA, CS, or CMA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"102udky\" data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2084\">Skills required for commerce and corporate sectors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oehvip\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2134\">Long-term financial and business career goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2308\"><strong data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2158\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2161\">Choosing the right commerce program at the beginning helps students build a stronger academic and professional foundation for future career growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2313\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9f7qk7\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2351\">Step 2 &ndash; Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2465\">After selecting the program, students must complete the online application form carefully with accurate details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2507\">The application form generally requires:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2640\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2532\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19byrdb\" data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2560\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2580\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yrzl9a\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2610\">Program selection details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qkxy1q\" data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2640\">Required document uploads</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gpk3hn\" data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2673\">Documents Commonly Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2812\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jv793l\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2710\">10th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9g1oz\" data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2746\">12th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2765\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2794\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r7lrne\" data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2812\">Address proof</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2936\"><strong data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2826\">Key Tip:</strong><br data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2829\">Incorrect information or incomplete documentation may delay admission verification and enrollment approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2941\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q99ygt\" data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"2970\">Step 3 &ndash; Pay Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3088\">Once the application form is completed, students must proceed with fee payment using their preferred payment method.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3134\">Available payment options generally include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3229\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3155\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rj4yp9\" data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3178\">Annual fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yedjnd\" data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3204\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j7uob\" data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3229\">No-cost EMI facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15rdh88\" data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3266\">Why Flexible Fee Options Matter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3310\">Flexible payment structures help students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3478\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rrlrgh\" data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3354\">Manage educational expenses efficiently</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15olntm\" data-start=\"3355\" data-end=\"3392\">Reduce immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ij65ie\" data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3438\">Plan long-term academic investment better</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b3uthh\" data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3478\">Access quality education affordably</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3622\"><strong data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3502\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3505\">Students selecting one-time payment generally receive maximum savings benefits compared to installment-based options.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3627\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a2idqx\" data-start=\"3629\" data-end=\"3670\">Step 4 &ndash; Submit &amp; Complete Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3672\" data-end=\"3779\">After successful fee payment, students must submit the final application to complete official registration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3795\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3956\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j51k2m\" data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3835\">Application submission is finalized</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ulecqp\" data-start=\"3836\" data-end=\"3871\">Academic documents are verified</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4dwidi\" data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3914\">Registration confirmation is processed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nhaz43\" data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3956\">Enrollment request moves for approval</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"4059\">This step officially confirms the student&rsquo;s admission request within the university admission system.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4061\" data-end=\"4064\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4r6bni\" data-start=\"4066\" data-end=\"4101\">Step 5 &ndash; Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4242\">After successful verification and registration approval, students receive enrollment-related communication and academic access information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4244\" data-end=\"4271\">Students generally receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4466\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4299\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uddgry\" data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4336\">Student portal login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mymzny\" data-start=\"4337\" data-end=\"4374\">Learning management system access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yxxqjn\" data-start=\"4375\" data-end=\"4421\">Academic schedule and orientation guidance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dx2wg9\" data-start=\"4422\" data-end=\"4466\">Further instructions for online learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4468\" data-end=\"4568\"><strong data-start=\"4468\" data-end=\"4484\">Key Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"4484\" data-end=\"4487\">This stage officially marks the beginning of the student&rsquo;s BCom academic journey.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"781\">The Amity Online BCom eligibility criteria are designed for students who want to build careers in finance, accounting, taxation, banking, auditing, and corporate business management. The eligibility structure is simple and accessible, allowing students from different educational backgrounds to pursue commerce and financial studies through a flexible online learning system.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"990\">The program is suitable for fresh 10+2 pass students, commerce aspirants, and learners interested in developing strong financial and business management skills for modern corporate and accounting industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"995\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1u5hkd7\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1028\">Eligibility Criteria Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1068\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1068\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1041\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1068\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1167\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1132\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1167\" data-col-size=\"md\">10+2 pass or appearing students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1255\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1187\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Career Aspirants</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1255\">Students interested in finance, accounting, and commerce careers</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1319\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1278\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1319\">Basic proficiency in English required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1344\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Student Type</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1381\">Indian and international students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1949\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1954\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uhj2b3\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1989\">Eligibility for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2072\">Indian applicants must fulfill the following academic requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2360\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2099\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2099\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2088\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2099\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2360\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2215\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2147\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10th Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2215\">10th Class Certificate (Completing 10 years of formal schooling)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2305\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2237\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12th Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2305\" data-col-size=\"md\">12th Class Certificate (Completing 12 years of formal schooling)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2360\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2324\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Boards</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2360\">Recognized boards including NIOS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2515\"><strong data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2384\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2387\">Students appearing for Class 12 are also eligible to apply, subject to fulfillment of final academic qualification requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2520\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7j9uzd\" data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2552\">English Language Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2638\">Applicants should possess basic proficiency in English because the program includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2781\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kp1bj5\" data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2674\">Business communication subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1awrut8\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2707\">Financial reporting concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"108o2mt\" data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2739\">Corporate law understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rgywy2\" data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2781\">Accounting and management terminology</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2909\">Students with better communication skills generally adapt more effectively to commerce and professional business environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2914\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g5t9g4\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2950\">Eligibility for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"3049\">International students must meet equivalent educational qualifications for admission eligibility.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3406\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3076\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3076\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3065\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3076\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3406\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3183\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3129\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Secondary Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3183\">O Level Certificate (10 years of formal schooling)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3271\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3217\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Senior Secondary Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3271\">A Level Certificate (12 years of formal schooling)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3336\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3293\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diploma Acceptance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3336\">Diploma qualifications are not accepted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3406\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3362\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3362\" data-end=\"3406\">AIU Certificate of Equivalence mandatory</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3604\">Foreign students must obtain a <strong data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3469\">Certificate of Equivalence</strong> from the <strong data-start=\"3479\" data-end=\"3523\">Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</strong> to validate their qualifications according to Indian higher education standards.</p>', '<p data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"606\">The Amity Online BCom fee structure is designed to provide affordable and flexible payment options for students planning careers in accounting, finance, taxation, banking, auditing, and corporate business management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"829\">Students can choose from multiple payment modes including one-time payment, annual payment plans, semester-wise fee structure, and no-cost EMI facilities according to their financial convenience and budgeting preferences.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"834\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16xjtai\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"871\">BCom Fee Structure (Table Format)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"1434\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"954\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"954\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"888\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"903\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"918\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"939\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Average Total Cost</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"954\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1434\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1136\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1056\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1068\">₹1,15,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1080\">₹1,01,200</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1092\">₹1,01,200</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1136\">Lowest overall cost with maximum savings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1229\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1165\">₹38,334/year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1180\">₹36,420/year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1192\">₹1,09,260</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1229\">Balanced yearly payment structure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1319\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1249\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1268\">₹19,200/semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1272\">&mdash;</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1284\">₹1,15,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1319\">Flexible semester-wise payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1434\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1344\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1359\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,792/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1374\">₹4,552/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1386\">₹1,09,260</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1434\">Affordable monthly payments with 0% interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1439\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iolzy8\" data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1463\">Average Fee Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1756\">The average total cost of the Amity Online BCom program ranges between <strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1564\">₹1.01 lakh to ₹1.15 lakh</strong>, depending on the selected payment plan. Students choosing the one-time payment option receive the maximum savings benefit, while EMI and semester plans provide greater financial flexibility.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"770\">The Amity Online BCom curriculum is designed to build strong foundations in commerce, accounting, taxation, finance, corporate law, and business management. The program follows a structured six-semester learning model that gradually develops financial understanding, analytical skills, business decision-making ability, and practical accounting knowledge.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"964\">The curriculum is industry-oriented and focuses on preparing students for careers in accounting, taxation, banking, finance, auditing, investment management, and corporate business operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1179\">Through a combination of theoretical learning, financial analysis, research methodology, and project-based exposure, the program helps students develop both academic expertise and practical business understanding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1y3t08c\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1215\">Program Curriculum Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1932\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1228\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1241\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1261\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1932\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1321\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1344\">Commerce Foundations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1407\">Build basics of accounting, law, and business communication</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1510\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1421\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1454\">Economics &amp; Corporate Concepts</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1510\">Strengthen finance, law, and marketing understanding</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1524\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1548\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accounting &amp; Taxation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1602\">Develop accounting and statistical analysis skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1716\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1616\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1651\">Auditing &amp; Management Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1716\">Learn auditing, taxation, and financial management techniques</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1818\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1760\">Financial Systems &amp; Economy</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1818\">Understand financial reporting and business operations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1932\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1832\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 6</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1865\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Finance &amp; Investment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1932\">Gain expertise in investment and strategic financial management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1937\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1whjuor\" data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1999\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundation of Commerce &amp; Financial Accounting</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2128\">The first semester introduces students to core commerce principles, accounting systems, business law, and communication skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2151\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2623\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6y7ld3\" data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2256\">Business Mathematics I &ndash; Mathematical concepts used in finance, accounting, and business calculations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hjjxmh\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2358\">Financial Accounting I &ndash; Basics of accounting principles, journal entries, and financial statements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13za2ik\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2453\">Mercantile Law &ndash; Legal principles related to business transactions and commercial activities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"112bjdf\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2536\">Environmental Studies &ndash; Environmental awareness and sustainability understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12e2jfj\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2623\">Business Communication &ndash; Professional communication and workplace interaction skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2649\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2794\">Students develop fundamental understanding of accounting systems, business laws, and professional communication essential for commerce careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2799\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12uibn9\" data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2865\">Semester 2 &ndash; Corporate Law, Marketing &amp; Economic Understanding</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2958\">This semester focuses on economics, corporate legal frameworks, and marketing fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"2981\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3437\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x8t0xu\" data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3069\">Business Mathematics II &ndash; Advanced business calculations and quantitative techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"krsb7y\" data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3160\">Financial Accounting II &ndash; Advanced accounting procedures and financial record management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"anewn4\" data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3253\">Fundamentals of Corporate Law &ndash; Company formation, governance, and corporate legal systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3044gv\" data-start=\"3254\" data-end=\"3345\">Macroeconomics &ndash; National economy, inflation, fiscal policy, and economic growth concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"133698c\" data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3437\">Principles of Marketing &ndash; Consumer behavior, market strategies, and branding fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3463\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3575\">Students gain broader understanding of corporate structures, economic systems, and business market operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3580\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1of9iiw\" data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3641\">Semester 3 &ndash; Corporate Accounting &amp; Taxation Fundamentals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3760\">The third semester strengthens accounting, taxation, and statistical analysis skills important for financial careers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3762\" data-end=\"3783\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"4188\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"riwkkb\" data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3873\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic &ndash; Personality development and teamwork skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2hh9kj\" data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3960\">Corporate Accounting I &ndash; Accounting systems used in companies and corporate entities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17e98dm\" data-start=\"3961\" data-end=\"4040\">Cost Accounting &ndash; Cost analysis, budgeting, and expense management techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0k1o9\" data-start=\"4041\" data-end=\"4114\">Direct Tax I &ndash; Introduction to income tax concepts and taxation systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ofzvj7\" data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4188\">Business Statistics &ndash; Data analysis and business forecasting techniques</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4214\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4326\">Students begin developing practical financial and taxation knowledge used in accounting and corporate sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4328\" data-end=\"4331\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13ul15i\" data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4380\">Semester 4 &ndash; Auditing &amp; Management Accounting</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4484\">This semester focuses on auditing practices, advanced taxation, and financial decision-making systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"4486\" data-end=\"4507\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4509\" data-end=\"4909\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9t1l4\" data-start=\"4509\" data-end=\"4596\">Auditing &ndash; Audit procedures, verification systems, and financial compliance processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1urxy0z\" data-start=\"4597\" data-end=\"4675\">Corporate Accounting II &ndash; Advanced corporate financial accounting techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11hsbl5\" data-start=\"4676\" data-end=\"4750\">Direct Tax II &ndash; Advanced taxation concepts and tax planning fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rt0mzo\" data-start=\"4751\" data-end=\"4826\">Management Accounting &ndash; Financial analysis for managerial decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o99h50\" data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4909\">Research Methodology &ndash; Research design, business studies, and analytical methods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"4911\" data-end=\"4935\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4937\" data-end=\"5049\">Students learn how businesses manage financial reporting, taxation compliance, and strategic financial analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5051\" data-end=\"5054\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"kxcbpb\" data-start=\"5056\" data-end=\"5109\">Semester 5 &ndash; Financial Reporting &amp; Business Systems</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5111\" data-end=\"5222\">The fifth semester introduces computerized accounting, financial reporting systems, and economic understanding.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"5224\" data-end=\"5245\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5247\" data-end=\"5765\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eayxgn\" data-start=\"5247\" data-end=\"5329\">Business Organisation &ndash; Organizational structure and business operation concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1da84t1\" data-start=\"5330\" data-end=\"5427\">Computerized Accounting System &ndash; Digital accounting tools and software-based accounting systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"54tvr6\" data-start=\"5428\" data-end=\"5514\">Financial Reporting &ndash; Corporate financial reporting standards and disclosure systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3lr1og\" data-start=\"5515\" data-end=\"5609\">Fundamentals of Financial Management &ndash; Investment planning, budgeting, and financial control</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u6h6n5\" data-start=\"5610\" data-end=\"5684\">Indian Economy &ndash; Structure and functioning of the Indian economic system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7pqr5e\" data-start=\"5685\" data-end=\"5765\">Professional Ethics &ndash; Ethical practices in commerce and corporate environments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"5767\" data-end=\"5791\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5793\" data-end=\"5906\">Students gain exposure to modern financial systems and digital accounting technologies widely used in industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5908\" data-end=\"5911\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hlsg0i\" data-start=\"5913\" data-end=\"5969\">Semester 6 &ndash; Investment Management &amp; Corporate Finance</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5971\" data-end=\"6078\">The final semester focuses on advanced financial management, investment analysis, and corporate governance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"6080\" data-end=\"6101\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6103\" data-end=\"6577\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"517qrc\" data-start=\"6103\" data-end=\"6189\">Ethics and Corporate Governance &ndash; Corporate responsibility and governance frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ls2rpc\" data-start=\"6190\" data-end=\"6294\">Major Project &ndash; Practical application of commerce and finance concepts through research-based projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7j4xp1\" data-start=\"6295\" data-end=\"6370\">Corporate Tax Planning &ndash; Strategic tax planning and compliance management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1grxa41\" data-start=\"6371\" data-end=\"6467\">International Financial Management &ndash; Global finance systems and international business finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7mnzog\" data-start=\"6468\" data-end=\"6577\">Investment Analysis and Portfolio Management &ndash; Investment strategies, portfolio building, and risk analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"6579\" data-end=\"6603\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6605\" data-end=\"6729\">Students develop strategic financial decision-making abilities and practical understanding of investment management systems.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 115000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(336, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 229, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 04:27:52', '2026-06-16 07:32:06', '<p data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"685\">The Online MCA Cyber Security admission process is designed to provide a smooth, fully digital, and student-friendly enrollment experience for learners interested in advanced careers in cybersecurity, information security, cloud protection, ethical hacking, and software technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"1015\">The admission system follows a structured step-by-step approach that allows students and working professionals to complete the entire process online without visiting campus physically. From selecting the program to receiving enrollment confirmation, every stage is designed for convenience, accessibility, and faster processing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1196\">This flexible online admission model is especially beneficial for students seeking higher education alongside professional responsibilities or those living in different locations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hm0fn5\" data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1250\">MCA Cyber Security Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1259\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1277\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1292\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1342\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1364\">Select Your Program</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1431\">Choose the MCA Cyber Security program according to career goals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1517\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1441\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1464\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Complete Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1517\">Fill personal, academic, and professional details</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1527\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1546\">Pay Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1596\">Complete secure payment through preferred mode</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1680\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1606\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1626\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit &amp; Register</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1680\">Submit final application and complete registration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1690\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1717\">Await Enrollment Details</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1774\">Receive enrollment confirmation and academic guidance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1779\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dnyb6j\" data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1811\">Step 1 &ndash; Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1965\">The first step of the admission process is selecting the MCA Cyber Security program according to your career interests and long-term professional goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1992\">Students should evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2262\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"162awas\" data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2042\">Interest in cybersecurity and ethical hacking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lv54q0\" data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2091\">Career opportunities in information security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d9ed4r\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2154\">Future demand for cloud and network security professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n63r1c\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2204\">Technical skill requirements in IT industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ycxp9u\" data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2262\">Long-term goals in software and cyber defense domains</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1zi2k\" data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2297\">Why Program Selection Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2350\">Choosing the correct specialization helps students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2550\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jhs3m9\" data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2388\">Build focused technical expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v1ho3a\" data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2439\">Develop industry-relevant cybersecurity skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1no5bs3\" data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2497\">Prepare for future certifications and technical roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8gayi\" data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2550\">Align education with long-term career objectives</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2719\"><strong data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2574\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2577\">Cybersecurity is one of the fastest-growing technology sectors globally, making early specialization highly valuable for future career growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2724\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9f7qk7\" data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2762\">Step 2 &ndash; Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2868\">After selecting the program, applicants must fill out the online application form with accurate details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2905\">The application generally requires:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"3087\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"2930\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19byrdb\" data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2958\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92km36\" data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2981\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3005\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"llt67w\" data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3057\">Professional experience details (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qkxy1q\" data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3087\">Required document uploads</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gpk3hn\" data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3120\">Documents Commonly Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3290\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oe1cic\" data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3165\">Graduation certificates and mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"3166\" data-end=\"3184\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3213\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r7lrne\" data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3231\">Address proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mpzbsw\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3290\">Additional eligibility-related documents if applicable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3399\"><strong data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3304\">Key Tip:</strong><br data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3307\">Incorrect or incomplete information may delay document verification and enrollment approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3401\" data-end=\"3404\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q99ygt\" data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3433\">Step 3 &ndash; Pay Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3521\">Once the application form is completed, students must proceed with secure fee payment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3567\">Available payment methods generally include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3679\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s0j5do\" data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3591\">Full course payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yedjnd\" data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3617\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i2l4zs\" data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3644\">Zero-cost EMI facility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12hwign\" data-start=\"3645\" data-end=\"3679\">Online digital payment options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ryrhvz\" data-start=\"3681\" data-end=\"3727\">Why Flexible Payment Options are Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3729\" data-end=\"3767\">Flexible fee structures help students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3939\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rrlrgh\" data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3811\">Manage educational expenses efficiently</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15olntm\" data-start=\"3812\" data-end=\"3849\">Reduce immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vowr9c\" data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3893\">Continue education without interruption</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ij65ie\" data-start=\"3894\" data-end=\"3939\">Plan long-term academic investment better</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3941\" data-end=\"4130\"><strong data-start=\"3941\" data-end=\"3963\">Important Insight:</strong><br data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"3966\">Students should compare payment plans carefully because EMI and semester options provide flexibility, while full payment may offer better long-term cost advantages.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4135\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a2idqx\" data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4178\">Step 4 &ndash; Submit &amp; Complete Registration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4180\" data-end=\"4287\">After successful fee payment, students must submit the final application to complete official registration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4289\" data-end=\"4303\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4480\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"doz042\" data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4348\">Admission request is officially recorded</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lvczxi\" data-start=\"4349\" data-end=\"4397\">Academic and eligibility verification begins</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4dwidi\" data-start=\"4398\" data-end=\"4440\">Registration confirmation is processed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ewupij\" data-start=\"4441\" data-end=\"4480\">Enrollment approval workflow starts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4563\">This step finalizes the student&rsquo;s admission request within the university system.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4565\" data-end=\"4568\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4r6bni\" data-start=\"4570\" data-end=\"4605\">Step 5 &ndash; Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4742\">After successful verification and approval, students receive official enrollment-related communication and academic access information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4744\" data-end=\"4771\">Students generally receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4772\" data-end=\"4952\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"4772\" data-end=\"4799\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uddgry\" data-start=\"4800\" data-end=\"4836\">Student portal login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mymzny\" data-start=\"4837\" data-end=\"4874\">Learning management system access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19qsbvd\" data-start=\"4875\" data-end=\"4907\">Academic orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11mk1s2\" data-start=\"4908\" data-end=\"4952\">Program guidance and support information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"4954\" data-end=\"4984\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4986\" data-end=\"5096\">This stage officially marks the beginning of the student&rsquo;s academic journey in the MCA Cyber Security program.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"710\">The Online MCA Cyber Security eligibility criteria are designed for students and professionals who want to build advanced careers in cybersecurity, ethical hacking, information security, cloud security, software development, and enterprise technology systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"1084\">The eligibility structure supports applicants from multiple academic backgrounds while ensuring that students possess the analytical and technical foundation required for advanced cybersecurity learning. The program is suitable for fresh graduates, final-year students, working professionals, and technology aspirants looking to enter high-demand digital security domains.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1266\">This flexibility makes the program highly accessible for students planning careers in IT, cyber defense, software engineering, cloud security, and enterprise technology management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1271\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1u5hkd7\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1304\">Eligibility Criteria Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1317\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1344\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1448\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1401\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fresh Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1448\">Eligible after bachelor&rsquo;s degree completion</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1471\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final-Year Students</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1528\">Eligible to apply subject to qualification completion</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1624\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1553\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Working Professionals</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1624\">Suitable for career growth in computer technology and cybersecurity</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1693\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1651\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Preferred Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1693\">BCA or Computer Science-related degree</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1763\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1720\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1763\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematics at 10+2 or graduation level</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1790\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alternative Eligibility</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1846\">Bridge course available for non-Mathematics students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2551\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2556\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uhj2b3\" data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2591\">Eligibility for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2666\">Indian applicants must meet one of the following academic qualifications.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"3134\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2693\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2693\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2693\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"3134\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2789\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2746\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Preferred Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2789\">Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2874\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2818\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alternative Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2874\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science or Engineering</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2971\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2900\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Other Eligible Degrees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2971\">Science, Commerce, or Arts graduates with Mathematics at 10+2 level</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"2998\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3051\">Mathematics mandatory at 10+2 or graduation level</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3134\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3074\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alternative Pathway</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3134\">Bridge course available for students without Mathematics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3139\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w4pkkr\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3176\">Mathematics Requirement Explained</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3257\">Mathematics is important in advanced computer applications because it supports:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3402\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d24kin\" data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3279\">Programming logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g47zd\" data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3314\">Algorithms and data structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ji02br\" data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3342\">Cybersecurity analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6169rh\" data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3368\">Cryptography concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cybxuw\" data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3402\">Computational problem-solving</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3493\">However, students without Mathematics are also eligible after completing a bridge course.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1r1cyo7\" data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3533\">Why the Bridge Course is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3568\">The bridge course helps students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3763\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k605o7\" data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3617\">Build fundamental mathematical understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14pcc3g\" data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3657\">Improve analytical reasoning skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1po7ycz\" data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3701\">Prepare for advanced computing subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ju30r6\" data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3763\">Transition smoothly into technical cybersecurity learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3879\">This pathway allows students from non-technical backgrounds to access advanced technology education opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3884\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g5t9g4\" data-start=\"3886\" data-end=\"3920\">Eligibility for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"4026\">International applicants must fulfill equivalent academic qualifications and communication requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4345\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4053\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4053\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4053\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4345\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4157\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4108\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4157\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree or equivalent qualification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4198\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4181\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Preferred Background</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4198\">BCA preferred</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4271\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4222\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4222\" data-end=\"4271\">Strong spoken and written English proficiency</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4345\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4291\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Degrees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4291\" data-end=\"4345\">Same degree categories accepted as Indian students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4347\" data-end=\"4533\">Foreign students should possess strong communication abilities because the curriculum includes technical documentation, research work, cybersecurity reporting, and project presentations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4535\" data-end=\"4538\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"6y6ehv\" data-start=\"4540\" data-end=\"4573\">Why English Proficiency Matters</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4575\" data-end=\"4698\">Cybersecurity and IT industries operate in highly technical global environments where communication is extremely important.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4742\">Strong English proficiency helps students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4743\" data-end=\"4980\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2engbl\" data-start=\"4743\" data-end=\"4793\">Understand technical concepts more effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mpjbqf\" data-start=\"4794\" data-end=\"4838\">Write reports and security documentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"op21rx\" data-start=\"4839\" data-end=\"4886\">Collaborate in professional IT environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kno32o\" data-start=\"4887\" data-end=\"4932\">Participate in global technology projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oapkpt\" data-start=\"4933\" data-end=\"4980\">Improve placement and interview performance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4982\" data-end=\"5084\">Students with better communication skills generally adapt faster to enterprise-level technology roles.</p>', '<p data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"713\">The online program fee structure is designed to provide flexible and student-friendly payment options for learners pursuing higher education through digital learning platforms. The fee model includes full course payment, semester-wise payment, and 24-month zero cost EMI facilities to help students manage educational expenses conveniently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"886\">The availability of multiple payment methods allows students and working professionals to select a plan according to their financial capacity and long-term academic goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"891\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dnrikq\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"932\">Fee Structure Overview (Table Format)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"998\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"998\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"949\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"962\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"983\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Average Total Cost</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"998\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1083\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Course Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1095\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,75,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1107\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,75,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1148\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Best for one-time academic investment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1238\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1168\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1191\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹68,800 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1203\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,75,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1238\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexible semester-wise payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1265\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1285\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹10,885 per month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1305\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,61,240 approx.</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1344\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest-free monthly affordability</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iolzy8\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1373\">Average Fee Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1623\">The average total cost of the program is approximately <strong data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1458\">₹2.61 lakh to ₹2.75 lakh</strong>, depending on the selected payment option. Students choosing the zero-cost EMI facility benefit from manageable monthly payments without additional interest burden.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"889\">The Online MCA Cyber Security curriculum is designed to prepare students for advanced careers in cybersecurity, information security, ethical hacking, cloud protection, cyber defense operations, and digital risk management. The program combines core computer application concepts with highly specialized cybersecurity technologies used in modern enterprises, financial institutions, cloud environments, and government systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"1220\">The curriculum follows a structured semester-wise approach where students first build strong foundations in programming, software engineering, databases, and algorithms before progressing into advanced cyber intelligence, cloud security, malware analysis, SIEM systems, vulnerability assessment, and incident response management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1418\">This industry-oriented curriculum is highly aligned with modern cybersecurity challenges and focuses on practical security frameworks, analytical thinking, and enterprise-level protection systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1y3t08c\" data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1454\">Program Curriculum Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"2027\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1500\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1500\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1467\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1480\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1500\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"2027\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1667\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1560\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1600\">Core Computing &amp; Security Foundations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1667\">Build programming, database, and software engineering expertise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1788\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1681\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1719\">Cyber Defense &amp; Threat Intelligence</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1788\">Learn cybersecurity operations, cryptography, and risk management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1904\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1802\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1832\">Cloud &amp; Security Operations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1904\">Gain expertise in cloud security, malware analysis, and SIEM systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2027\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1918\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1964\">Industry Project &amp; Practical Implementation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2027\">Apply cybersecurity concepts through project-based learning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2032\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1o959ae\" data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2102\">Semester 1 &ndash; Computing Foundations &amp; Advanced Software Development</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2310\">The first semester establishes strong technical foundations required for advanced cybersecurity learning. Students develop expertise in programming, software engineering, databases, and computational logic.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2332\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"p6d6rt\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2368\">Graph Theory and Combinatorics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2530\">Students learn mathematical structures, logical reasoning, and computational problem-solving concepts used in cybersecurity algorithms and cryptographic systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fqc35k\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2572\">Advanced Database Management Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2708\">This subject focuses on database architecture, advanced SQL concepts, data management systems, and secure database handling techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yyi3l\" data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2723\">Core Java</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2889\">Students build strong object-oriented programming skills using Java, one of the most important languages for enterprise applications and secure software development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ry87jf\" data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2935\">Advanced Software Engineering Principles</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"3087\">This subject covers software development lifecycle, system design, testing methodologies, quality assurance, and secure software engineering practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jvqwrx\" data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3119\">Professional Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3272\">Students develop technical communication, workplace interaction, presentation, and professional documentation skills required in corporate environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3277\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1tosjvl\" data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3347\">Semester 2 &ndash; Cyber Security, Threat Intelligence &amp; Risk Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3497\">The second semester introduces advanced cybersecurity concepts, security frameworks, network protection mechanisms, and threat intelligence systems.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3519\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qpjgz6\" data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3545\">Research Methodology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3685\">Students learn research design, analytical methods, technical investigation, and problem-solving techniques used in cybersecurity analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vtwcee\" data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3727\">Data Structures and Algorithm Design</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3878\">This subject focuses on advanced algorithms, optimization techniques, and efficient computing structures essential for secure application development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jpioxf\" data-start=\"3880\" data-end=\"3917\">Network Security and Cryptography</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"4047\">Students learn encryption systems, network protection protocols, cyber defense mechanisms, and secure communication technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1usa75a\" data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4106\">Cognitive Analytics &amp; Social Skills for Professionals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4229\">This subject develops analytical thinking, professional collaboration, decision-making, and workplace adaptability skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"og96cj\" data-start=\"4231\" data-end=\"4290\">Information Security, Cloud Security, Risk &amp; Compliance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4291\" data-end=\"4429\">Students understand cloud security architecture, organizational risk management, compliance frameworks, and enterprise security standards.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nb59k1\" data-start=\"4431\" data-end=\"4542\">Cyber Security Information Threat Intelligence &amp; Hunting, Cyber Incident Response, Vulnerability Assessment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4589\">This advanced cybersecurity module focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4590\" data-end=\"4780\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5jibd4\" data-start=\"4590\" data-end=\"4633\">Threat detection and cyber intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m9nsn8\" data-start=\"4634\" data-end=\"4665\">Security monitoring systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10qqzse\" data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4698\">Incident response management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qir72o\" data-start=\"4699\" data-end=\"4740\">Vulnerability scanning and assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8bdqr9\" data-start=\"4741\" data-end=\"4780\">Enterprise cyber defense strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4782\" data-end=\"4785\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rcb44o\" data-start=\"4787\" data-end=\"4844\">Semester 3 &ndash; Cloud Infrastructure &amp; Security Operations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4846\" data-end=\"4985\">The third semester focuses heavily on enterprise security systems, cloud environments, Linux programming, and advanced security operations.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"4987\" data-end=\"5007\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jsrzp\" data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5046\">Cloud Infrastructure and Services</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5047\" data-end=\"5164\">Students learn cloud architecture, virtualization, cloud deployment systems, and enterprise cloud service management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lqx724\" data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5194\">UNIX / Linux Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5195\" data-end=\"5345\">This subject focuses on Linux systems, shell scripting, system administration, and command-line programming widely used in cybersecurity environments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lq5xkd\" data-start=\"5347\" data-end=\"5370\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5371\" data-end=\"5497\">Students understand ethical standards, responsible cybersecurity practices, and professional conduct in technology industries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kwl02v\" data-start=\"5499\" data-end=\"5524\">Quantitative Aptitude</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5525\" data-end=\"5684\">This subject strengthens logical reasoning, numerical analysis, and analytical problem-solving skills useful for technical interviews and industry assessments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19e0d26\" data-start=\"5686\" data-end=\"5710\">Seminar (Evaluation)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5711\" data-end=\"5835\">Students present technical concepts, research findings, and cybersecurity topics through seminars and evaluation activities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lqhpb\" data-start=\"5837\" data-end=\"5894\">Application Security, Data Security, Malware Analysis</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5895\" data-end=\"5928\">This advanced subject focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5929\" data-end=\"6079\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fkucn9\" data-start=\"5929\" data-end=\"5969\">Application vulnerability protection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g7ykzx\" data-start=\"5970\" data-end=\"5997\">Data protection systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0h0sf\" data-start=\"5998\" data-end=\"6040\">Malware detection and reverse analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xt1k12\" data-start=\"6041\" data-end=\"6079\">Cyber attack prevention techniques</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18m5w8z\" data-start=\"6081\" data-end=\"6118\">SIEM and Security Operation, UEBA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6119\" data-end=\"6145\">Students gain exposure to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6146\" data-end=\"6341\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dmpn0j\" data-start=\"6146\" data-end=\"6206\">Security Information and Event Management (SIEM) systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kapvqs\" data-start=\"6207\" data-end=\"6241\">Security monitoring operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gxla75\" data-start=\"6242\" data-end=\"6287\">User and Entity Behavior Analytics (UEBA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlyizt\" data-start=\"6288\" data-end=\"6341\">Threat detection automation and incident analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6343\" data-end=\"6457\">These are highly important enterprise-level cybersecurity technologies used in security operations centers (SOCs).</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6459\" data-end=\"6462\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1o2k4m5\" data-start=\"6464\" data-end=\"6522\">Semester 4 &ndash; Major Project &amp; Practical Industry Exposure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6524\" data-end=\"6618\">The final semester focuses on practical implementation and industry-level project development.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7bo05n\" data-start=\"6620\" data-end=\"6636\">Major Project</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6638\" data-end=\"6703\">Students work on a comprehensive cybersecurity project involving:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6704\" data-end=\"6890\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1597ak\" data-start=\"6704\" data-end=\"6725\">Security analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dbu8zz\" data-start=\"6726\" data-end=\"6754\">Threat detection systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cig0t\" data-start=\"6755\" data-end=\"6788\">Cloud security implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5qv622\" data-start=\"6789\" data-end=\"6817\">Vulnerability assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5m5xvn\" data-start=\"6818\" data-end=\"6849\">Secure software development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cxg7yz\" data-start=\"6850\" data-end=\"6890\">Research and technical documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6892\" data-end=\"6985\">The project helps students apply theoretical knowledge to real-world cybersecurity scenarios.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(337, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 283, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 06:31:50', '2026-06-16 07:32:34', '<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"498\">Understanding the MBA admission process is extremely important for students because even small mistakes during registration, fee payment, or document submission can delay approval, affect seat confirmation, or create issues during enrollment verification. Many applicants focus only on eligibility and specialization selection but fail to understand how the admission process actually works from start to finish.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"918\">A properly structured admission process helps students complete their application smoothly while ensuring transparency, secure fee submission, accurate document verification, and timely enrollment confirmation. Whether you are a fresh graduate, working professional, or entrepreneur planning to pursue an MBA, knowing each stage in detail can save time, reduce confusion, and improve your overall admission experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1176\">The MBA admission process is designed to be simple, student-friendly, and accessible from anywhere. Applicants can complete most stages online without visiting the campus physically, making the process convenient for both Indian and international students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1181\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1u1uzsh\" data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1219\">Step-by-Step MBA Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1393\">The MBA admission journey generally includes five important stages. Each stage plays a critical role in securing successful admission and final enrollment into the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1398\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"eeuf76\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1429\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1647\">The first and most important stage of the admission process is choosing the right MBA program or specialization according to your career goals, academic background, industry interests, and future salary expectations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1901\">Many students make the mistake of selecting a specialization based only on trends or popularity without understanding career alignment. Choosing the wrong specialization can affect long-term job satisfaction, placement opportunities, and career growth.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1966\">Before selecting a program, students should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2144\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o49pb\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1986\">Career interests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vl0pat\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2004\">Industry demand</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uqnqfd\" data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2030\">Future salary potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"90yhs6\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2051\">Personal strengths</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2q2gt1\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2076\">Long-term career goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lb1x6m\" data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2102\">Placement opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"osfkr7\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2123\">Industry relevance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gh9v6d\" data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2144\">Skill requirements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1iupas2\" data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2176\">Popular MBA Specializations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2276\">Students usually get options to choose from multiple in-demand management specializations such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2510\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14a7y0w\" data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2287\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3xmdbg\" data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2299\">Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aogelq\" data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2327\">Human Resource Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r3blbx\" data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2351\">Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v3fx4\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2372\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1faqfbo\" data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2397\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13oqsnk\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2435\">Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13jgnxy\" data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2455\">Digital Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wts4z5\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2491\">Information Technology Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15qe4o9\" data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2510\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2622\">Each specialization leads to different career paths, salary structures, and job responsibilities. For example:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2914\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iw9kzi\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2690\">Finance is suitable for analytical and numbers-oriented students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12cv3bi\" data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2754\">Marketing fits creative and communication-focused individuals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bod4pt\" data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2815\">HR is ideal for leadership and people management interests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hmsavr\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2861\">Analytics suits data-driven decision-makers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qjv0wu\" data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2914\">Operations benefits process-oriented professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"peasig\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2963\">Important Advice Before Selecting a Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3097\">Students should avoid blindly following peers or social media trends while selecting specializations. Instead, they should focus on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3224\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ozvgm\" data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3131\">Their genuine career interests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187uakz\" data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3159\">Industry growth potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lo8x1r\" data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3190\">Personal skill compatibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s4bpom\" data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3224\">Long-term career sustainability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3340\">This early decision significantly impacts internship opportunities, placements, networking, and future promotions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3342\" data-end=\"3345\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1viqrjy\" data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3382\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3550\">After selecting the desired MBA program, applicants must fill out the admission application form carefully with accurate academic, personal, and professional details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3628\">This stage is extremely important because incorrect information can lead to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3728\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43dxlh\" data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3653\">Application rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ek4ygn\" data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3675\">Verification delays</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dojhnf\" data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3701\">Enrollment cancellation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4jvkbt\" data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3728\">Document mismatch issues</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ujwjsn\" data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3781\">Details Usually Required in the Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3820\">Applicants generally need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"4021\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uzprjw\" data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3833\">Full name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\" data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3855\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6nm42x\" data-start=\"3856\" data-end=\"3866\">Email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"3867\" data-end=\"3895\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ejxkr6\" data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"3916\">Graduation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19qr286\" data-start=\"3917\" data-end=\"3932\">Marks or CGPA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qfgqig\" data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"3957\">Identity proof details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1elagoi\" data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"3979\">Address information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bde9va\" data-start=\"3980\" data-end=\"4021\">Work experience details (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4023\" data-end=\"4102\">Students should ensure that all details match their official documents exactly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4104\" data-end=\"4107\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1281frl\" data-start=\"4109\" data-end=\"4158\">Documents Commonly Required During Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4160\" data-end=\"4196\">Most universities typically ask for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4393\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dv6pll\" data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4221\">Graduation marksheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hkwm89\" data-start=\"4222\" data-end=\"4242\">Degree certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tq1vi3\" data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4270\">Passport-size photographs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s7ptuf\" data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4297\">Aadhaar card or passport</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1re1gdv\" data-start=\"4298\" data-end=\"4314\">Signature scan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dcj5v2\" data-start=\"4315\" data-end=\"4353\">Category certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16b5l8w\" data-start=\"4354\" data-end=\"4393\">Work experience proof (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4395\" data-end=\"4443\">International students may additionally require:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4527\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlohxf\" data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4462\">Passport copies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y3hk9n\" data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4487\">Visa-related documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"btsqc3\" data-start=\"4488\" data-end=\"4527\">Equivalent qualification certificates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4529\" data-end=\"4532\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yj7d31\" data-start=\"4534\" data-end=\"4584\">Common Application Mistakes Students Must Avoid</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4586\" data-end=\"4692\">Many students lose valuable admission opportunities due to avoidable errors during application submission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15wqof8\" data-start=\"4694\" data-end=\"4721\">Major mistakes include:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4723\" data-end=\"4918\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15i77t6\" data-start=\"4723\" data-end=\"4752\">Incorrect spelling of names</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xhhyol\" data-start=\"4753\" data-end=\"4782\">Uploading unclear documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uy2oq1\" data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4806\">Wrong contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q1c6yd\" data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4832\">Invalid email addresses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ejnnun\" data-start=\"4833\" data-end=\"4865\">Incorrect academic percentages</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gnifnd\" data-start=\"4866\" data-end=\"4896\">Incomplete application forms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f3v9mv\" data-start=\"4897\" data-end=\"4918\">Delayed submissions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4920\" data-end=\"5026\">Even minor mismatches between documents and application forms may create verification complications later.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5028\" data-end=\"5101\">Students should carefully review the application before final submission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5103\" data-end=\"5106\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16w6tlx\" data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5139\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5141\" data-end=\"5238\">Once the application form is completed successfully, candidates proceed to the fee payment stage.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5240\" data-end=\"5334\">This step officially moves the application toward admission processing and seat consideration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5336\" data-end=\"5419\">Most universities now provide secure digital payment systems for easy transactions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"q28mw7\" data-start=\"5421\" data-end=\"5456\">Common Payment Methods Available</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5458\" data-end=\"5491\">Students may usually pay through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5493\" data-end=\"5602\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3lk5t\" data-start=\"5493\" data-end=\"5506\">Debit cards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"512ev6\" data-start=\"5507\" data-end=\"5521\">Credit cards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hf7qq9\" data-start=\"5522\" data-end=\"5535\">Net banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4vms\" data-start=\"5536\" data-end=\"5541\">UPI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18a65ee\" data-start=\"5542\" data-end=\"5567\">Online payment gateways</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"101ln4v\" data-start=\"5568\" data-end=\"5602\">EMI facilities (where available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5604\" data-end=\"5688\">Secure payment systems help students complete transactions safely from any location.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5690\" data-end=\"5693\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"unnohc\" data-start=\"5695\" data-end=\"5732\">Why Fee Payment Timing Is Important</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5734\" data-end=\"5913\">Many students delay fee payment assuming seats will remain available indefinitely. However, MBA admissions often operate on limited seat availability and rolling admission cycles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5915\" data-end=\"5946\">Delaying payment may result in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5948\" data-end=\"6090\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1apxyu9\" data-start=\"5948\" data-end=\"5969\">Seat unavailability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eg6xok\" data-start=\"5970\" data-end=\"5990\">Higher competition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ynysew\" data-start=\"5991\" data-end=\"6025\">Missed scholarship opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xdvmnz\" data-start=\"6026\" data-end=\"6055\">Delayed enrollment approval</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xm0eib\" data-start=\"6056\" data-end=\"6090\">Preferred specialization closure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6092\" data-end=\"6175\">Early fee payment often improves the chances of securing preferred program options.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6177\" data-end=\"6180\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1nkdsy4\" data-start=\"6182\" data-end=\"6234\">Important Financial Considerations Before Payment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6236\" data-end=\"6270\">Students should always understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6272\" data-end=\"6446\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vohqjc\" data-start=\"6272\" data-end=\"6291\">Total program fee</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ki9qx8\" data-start=\"6292\" data-end=\"6325\">Semester-wise payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51xydi\" data-start=\"6326\" data-end=\"6341\">Refund policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yszcvt\" data-start=\"6342\" data-end=\"6355\">EMI options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mvjt8z\" data-start=\"6356\" data-end=\"6388\">Additional examination charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p1rltr\" data-start=\"6389\" data-end=\"6412\">Hidden academic costs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y06181\" data-start=\"6413\" data-end=\"6446\">Placement or certification fees</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6448\" data-end=\"6539\">Understanding the full financial commitment helps students avoid unexpected expenses later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6541\" data-end=\"6544\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cfgr7l\" data-start=\"6546\" data-end=\"6573\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6575\" data-end=\"6688\">After successful fee payment, applicants must submit the final application and complete registration formalities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6690\" data-end=\"6715\">This stage confirms that:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6717\" data-end=\"6857\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o9zoq0\" data-start=\"6717\" data-end=\"6764\">The application has been officially submitted</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlm4v4\" data-start=\"6765\" data-end=\"6795\">Documents have been uploaded</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9untfs\" data-start=\"6796\" data-end=\"6821\">Fee payment is verified</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yw6nyd\" data-start=\"6822\" data-end=\"6857\">Registration process is completed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6859\" data-end=\"6954\">Once registration is completed successfully, students generally receive acknowledgment through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6956\" data-end=\"7063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fi73ij\" data-start=\"6956\" data-end=\"6976\">Email confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dpqtzl\" data-start=\"6977\" data-end=\"6997\">Application number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187hh78\" data-start=\"6998\" data-end=\"7015\">Registration ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13q25q\" data-start=\"7016\" data-end=\"7033\">Payment receipt</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ml2ojs\" data-start=\"7034\" data-end=\"7063\">Admission reference details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7065\" data-end=\"7157\">Students should save these details carefully for future communication and tracking purposes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7159\" data-end=\"7162\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uwhy51\" data-start=\"7164\" data-end=\"7204\">Why Registration Confirmation Matters</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7206\" data-end=\"7330\">Many applicants mistakenly assume payment alone guarantees admission. However, registration completion is equally important.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7332\" data-end=\"7374\">Without final submission and registration:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7376\" data-end=\"7524\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mh7n7q\" data-start=\"7376\" data-end=\"7412\">Applications may remain incomplete</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i6yq52\" data-start=\"7413\" data-end=\"7441\">Verification may not begin</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8shjoh\" data-start=\"7442\" data-end=\"7480\">Enrollment processing may be delayed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"glw16h\" data-start=\"7481\" data-end=\"7524\">Student records may not activate properly</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7526\" data-end=\"7606\">Always ensure that both payment and final submission are completed successfully.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7608\" data-end=\"7611\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1tozxz\" data-start=\"7613\" data-end=\"7647\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7649\" data-end=\"7740\">After registration, the university begins the verification and enrollment processing stage.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7742\" data-end=\"7799\">During this period, the admission team generally reviews:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7801\" data-end=\"7921\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"erg4f4\" data-start=\"7801\" data-end=\"7823\">Academic eligibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nnpkce\" data-start=\"7824\" data-end=\"7847\">Document authenticity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fz5y1p\" data-start=\"7848\" data-end=\"7870\">Payment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xuxv8w\" data-start=\"7871\" data-end=\"7897\">Application completeness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xwce93\" data-start=\"7898\" data-end=\"7921\">Identity verification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7923\" data-end=\"8016\">Once verification is completed successfully, students receive enrollment-related information.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8018\" data-end=\"8021\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dz5wcx\" data-start=\"8023\" data-end=\"8080\">What Students Usually Receive After Enrollment Approval</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"8082\" data-end=\"8122\">Successful applicants generally receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8124\" data-end=\"8323\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bx4sz3\" data-start=\"8124\" data-end=\"8143\">Enrollment number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r16p5m\" data-start=\"8144\" data-end=\"8171\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nyka5o\" data-start=\"8172\" data-end=\"8196\">Learning portal access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pwegko\" data-start=\"8197\" data-end=\"8216\">Academic schedule</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14l0ybg\" data-start=\"8217\" data-end=\"8238\">Orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f1636y\" data-start=\"8239\" data-end=\"8272\">Course commencement information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qbw38m\" data-start=\"8273\" data-end=\"8297\">LMS access credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oxqbve\" data-start=\"8298\" data-end=\"8323\">Study material guidance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8325\" data-end=\"8359\">Students should regularly monitor:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8361\" data-end=\"8454\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ruee69\" data-start=\"8361\" data-end=\"8382\">Registered email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h04qtn\" data-start=\"8383\" data-end=\"8398\">Mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12kscqt\" data-start=\"8399\" data-end=\"8420\">Admission dashboard</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m41k55\" data-start=\"8421\" data-end=\"8454\">Official communication channels</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8456\" data-end=\"8512\">Missing enrollment emails may delay academic onboarding.</p>', 1, '<h1 data-section-id=\"1uz894d\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1346\">Who Can Apply for MBA Admission?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1715\">The MBA program accepts applicants from diverse academic and professional backgrounds. Unlike highly specialized technical programs, MBA admissions are open to graduates from almost every stream because management education values analytical thinking, communication ability, leadership potential, and problem-solving skills more than a specific undergraduate subject.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1745\">The program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"2203\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v1paqa\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1802\">Fresh graduates planning to start a management career</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dza34h\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1862\">Working professionals seeking promotions or salary growth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hm52c3\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1916\">Entrepreneurs wanting business management knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"my719s\" data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1977\">Candidates planning career transitions into business roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nhvxav\" data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2039\">Professionals aiming for leadership or managerial positions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1no0eaz\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2089\">Students interested in global corporate careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fww1a4\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2203\">Aspirants targeting sectors like finance, marketing, HR, operations, analytics, consulting, sales, or logistics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2411\">One major advantage of MBA admissions is that students from commerce, science, arts, engineering, computer applications, pharmacy, hotel management, law, or other educational streams are generally eligible.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2416\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"bhlo36\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2464\">MBA Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2589\">Indian students applying for MBA admission must fulfill the academic and language eligibility requirements mentioned below.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"esneuk\" data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2631\">Educational Qualification Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2737\">Candidates must have completed graduation in any discipline from a recognized university or institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2785\">Eligible graduation streams typically include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2911\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16wlm79\" data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2794\">B.Com</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4g15\" data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2800\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yhmtt7\" data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2805\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j40gr8\" data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2812\">B.Sc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uatuam\" data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2821\">B.Tech</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4g5k\" data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2827\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4fzj\" data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2833\">BHM</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2wl1e\" data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2843\">B.Pharm</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uak4u4\" data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2852\">B.Arch</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4gjy\" data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2858\">BSW</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pow991\" data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2872\">Law degrees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mtdx25\" data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2911\">Other recognized bachelor&rsquo;s programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"3115\">Students appearing for the final year of graduation may also apply, provided they complete their degree within the university&rsquo;s prescribed timeline and submit the required documents during verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3253\">Candidates from recognized universities, including UGC-approved institutions and equivalent educational systems, are generally accepted.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3405\">NIOS board candidates are also eligible if they have completed their qualifying education from recognized institutions meeting admission requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3410\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3440\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3523\">Applicants must secure at least <strong data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3522\">40% marks in the last qualifying examination</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3764\">This flexibility makes the MBA program accessible to a wider group of students, including candidates who may not have achieved very high graduation scores but possess strong career potential, practical experience, or leadership capability.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11xcc34\" data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3815\">Important Relaxation for Candidates Below 40%</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3875\">Students scoring below 40% are not automatically rejected.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3877\" data-end=\"3891\">In such cases:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"4094\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15g6yw1\" data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3953\">The university may conduct an eligibility or aptitude test</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bdzy2u\" data-start=\"3954\" data-end=\"4029\">Candidates who successfully pass the test can still qualify for admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ozi3zn\" data-start=\"4030\" data-end=\"4094\">This provides an additional opportunity for deserving students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4137\">This policy is especially beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4139\" data-end=\"4388\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1112lv4\" data-start=\"4139\" data-end=\"4168\">Students with academic gaps</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mwnwho\" data-start=\"4169\" data-end=\"4242\">Candidates who faced personal or financial challenges during graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o8rz90\" data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4309\">Working professionals returning to academics after several years</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15p7ujf\" data-start=\"4310\" data-end=\"4388\">Entrepreneurs without strong academic scores but good business understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4390\" data-end=\"4545\">However, students should not treat this relaxation casually. Failing the test may delay admission or reduce seat availability in preferred specializations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4547\" data-end=\"4550\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7j9uzd\" data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4582\">English Language Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4584\" data-end=\"4671\">Applicants must possess sufficient knowledge and understanding of the English language.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4700\">Since MBA programs involve:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4702\" data-end=\"4843\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1320yha\" data-start=\"4702\" data-end=\"4726\">Business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yi9ak5\" data-start=\"4727\" data-end=\"4741\">Case studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z73kb1\" data-start=\"4742\" data-end=\"4757\">Presentations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"st1uys\" data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4777\">Group discussions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rudy8h\" data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4800\">Research assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"37b0nq\" data-start=\"4801\" data-end=\"4820\">Corporate reports</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dcz4mg\" data-start=\"4821\" data-end=\"4843\">Industry interaction</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4845\" data-end=\"4920\">basic English proficiency becomes extremely important for academic success.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4922\" data-end=\"4984\">Students with weak communication skills often struggle during:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4986\" data-end=\"5102\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yigusb\" data-start=\"4986\" data-end=\"5008\">Placement interviews</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tw3wjj\" data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5035\">Internship opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yu2sry\" data-start=\"5036\" data-end=\"5061\">Corporate presentations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17mkreb\" data-start=\"5062\" data-end=\"5077\">Team projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"166iro4\" data-start=\"5078\" data-end=\"5102\">Leadership assessments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5104\" data-end=\"5141\">Therefore, candidates should work on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5252\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xwdq46\" data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5159\">Spoken English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ughi63\" data-start=\"5160\" data-end=\"5182\">Professional writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b20w2k\" data-start=\"5183\" data-end=\"5204\">Presentation skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17my8wx\" data-start=\"5205\" data-end=\"5227\">Corporate vocabulary</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1320yha\" data-start=\"5228\" data-end=\"5252\">Business communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5254\" data-end=\"5414\">Even though advanced fluency may not be mandatory during admission, improving communication ability significantly enhances career outcomes after MBA completion.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5416\" data-end=\"5419\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a3ib55\" data-start=\"5421\" data-end=\"5468\">MBA Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5470\" data-end=\"5553\">International applicants seeking MBA admission must fulfill the following criteria.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17b33f5\" data-start=\"5555\" data-end=\"5580\">Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5582\" data-end=\"5705\">Candidates must have completed a graduation degree from a recognized institution or university in their respective country.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5707\" data-end=\"5817\">Equivalent international qualifications are generally accepted after evaluation according to university norms.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5819\" data-end=\"5883\">Students from various academic disciplines can apply, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5885\" data-end=\"6001\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iykumm\" data-start=\"5885\" data-end=\"5895\">Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p06fqp\" data-start=\"5896\" data-end=\"5909\">Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j435ks\" data-start=\"5910\" data-end=\"5916\">Arts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tue68s\" data-start=\"5917\" data-end=\"5926\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ocmvwi\" data-start=\"5927\" data-end=\"5951\">Information Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c1jzmc\" data-start=\"5952\" data-end=\"5963\">Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16p2y2p\" data-start=\"5964\" data-end=\"5976\">Healthcare</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sykz2w\" data-start=\"5977\" data-end=\"5990\">Hospitality</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fr3fit\" data-start=\"5991\" data-end=\"6001\">Commerce</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6003\" data-end=\"6006\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"d3kmv5\" data-start=\"6008\" data-end=\"6041\">English Language Understanding</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6043\" data-end=\"6174\">Since the program is delivered in English, international students should have a working understanding of English communication for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6176\" data-end=\"6276\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eus27o\" data-start=\"6176\" data-end=\"6200\">Academic participation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lie7pk\" data-start=\"6201\" data-end=\"6214\">Assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z73kb1\" data-start=\"6215\" data-end=\"6230\">Presentations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14glb2b\" data-start=\"6231\" data-end=\"6254\">Classroom interaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13uvxq2\" data-start=\"6255\" data-end=\"6276\">Research activities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6278\" data-end=\"6417\">Some universities may request additional documentation or proof of English proficiency depending on the applicant&rsquo;s educational background.</p>', '<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"440\">Understanding the MBA fee structure is extremely important before taking admission because many students only focus on tuition fees and ignore additional financial planning, installment flexibility, and long-term return on investment. A clear understanding of the complete fee structure helps students and working professionals manage their education expenses more effectively without unnecessary financial stress.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"826\">The MBA program offers flexible payment options, including semester-wise payments and zero-cost EMI facilities, making management education more accessible for students from different financial backgrounds. This structure is especially beneficial for working professionals, fresh graduates, and entrepreneurs who want to continue their education while maintaining financial stability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"831\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"60gkxk\" data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"861\">MBA Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"879\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"889\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n<td data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"926\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"947\">₹13,023 per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"978\">\r\n<td data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"967\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"978\">₹82,300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n<td data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"997\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Course Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1010\">₹3,29,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1015\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s5zdhp\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1039\">Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1201\">The MBA program provides a <strong data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1103\">24-month zero-cost EMI facility</strong>, allowing students to pay approximately <strong data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1165\">₹13,023 per month</strong> without additional interest burden.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1248\">This payment option is highly beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1435\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t08o2q\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1299\">Working professionals managing monthly salaries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dashtb\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1343\">Students avoiding large one-time payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y4289q\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1387\">Entrepreneurs balancing business expenses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"23cpqq\" data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1435\">Families seeking flexible education financing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13bw1eo\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1465\">Benefits of Zero Cost EMI</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1670\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lzdqg6\" data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1505\">Reduces immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"88hm1m\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1543\">Makes MBA education more affordable</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yda76s\" data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1582\">Helps maintain savings and cash flow</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ii0ypf\" data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1617\">Enables easier monthly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jxr0md\" data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1670\">Avoids high-interest education loans in many cases</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1710\">However, students should still verify:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1861\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a0n3hg\" data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1740\">EMI eligibility conditions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tnd7qk\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1768\">Partner bank requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cj87e1\" data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1805\">Processing charges (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gcuq4q\" data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1832\">Missed payment penalties</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10csepo\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1861\">EMI approval documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1964\">Proper financial planning before selecting EMI options is important to avoid future repayment stress.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1969\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1t1n50e\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2000\">Semester-Wise Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2110\">Students who prefer installment-based academic payments can choose the <strong data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2109\">semester-wise fee payment option</strong>.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2182\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2141\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2141\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2131\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Payment</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2141\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2182\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2182\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2171\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2182\">₹82,300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2283\">This option provides flexibility for students who do not want to pay the entire course fee upfront.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2717\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rg7www\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2740\">Full MBA Course Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2788\">The total fee for the complete MBA program is:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2868\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2821\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2821\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2808\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2868\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2868\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2855\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full MBA Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2868\">₹3,29,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2969\">The complete course fee generally covers major academic components associated with the MBA program.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"787\">The Online MBA curriculum is designed to develop advanced business management, leadership, strategic decision-making, and industry-oriented professional skills required in modern corporate environments. The program combines management fundamentals with specialization-focused learning, practical business applications, research exposure, and project-based training.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"1021\">The curriculum follows a structured four-semester model where students gradually move from foundational management concepts to advanced specialization subjects, strategic business practices, and real-world corporate problem-solving.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1242\">This industry-focused learning structure prepares students for careers in finance, marketing, operations, human resources, consulting, entrepreneurship, digital business, and leadership roles across multiple industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1247\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10vcli1\" data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1281\">Online MBA Curriculum Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1794\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1327\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1327\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1294\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1307\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1327\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcome</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1794\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1464\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1387\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1412\">Management Foundations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1464\">Build core business and managerial understanding</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1565\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1478\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1511\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Operations &amp; Strategy</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1565\">Develop finance, HR, legal, and research expertise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1674\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1579\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1617\">Specialization &amp; Practical Exposure</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1674\">Gain advanced domain knowledge and project experience</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1794\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1688\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1734\">Strategic Leadership &amp; Industry Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1794\">Learn digital business and advanced management practices</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1799\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vwcead\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1862\">Semester 1 &ndash; Management Foundations &amp; Business Fundamentals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"2012\">The first semester focuses on developing strong foundational understanding of business management, economics, communication, and marketing concepts.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2034\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"txb4e4\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2063\">Accounting for Managers</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2207\">Students learn financial statement interpretation, accounting systems, budgeting concepts, and managerial financial decision-making techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gaaurx\" data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2233\">Managerial Economics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2373\">This subject focuses on economic principles, market behavior, demand analysis, pricing strategies, and business decision-making frameworks.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kyhn8x\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2399\">Marketing Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2525\">Students understand consumer behavior, branding strategies, market positioning, product management, and promotional planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5kwcx7\" data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2556\">Statistics for Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2682\">This subject develops analytical thinking, business forecasting, data interpretation, and statistical decision-making skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jvqwrx\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2714\">Professional Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2833\">Students improve workplace communication, presentation ability, business writing, and professional interaction skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2838\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7fja4u\" data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2886\">Semester 2 &ndash; Finance, HR &amp; Business Research</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"3019\">The second semester focuses on organizational management, financial systems, legal business frameworks, and research methodologies.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3041\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bsf5hx\" data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3072\">Business Research Methods</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3073\" data-end=\"3193\">Students learn research design, data collection techniques, analytical methods, and business problem-solving frameworks.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1shtuak\" data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3219\">Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3343\">This subject focuses on investment planning, capital management, financial analysis, and corporate finance decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nmnkqo\" data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3374\">Human Resource Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3485\">Students understand recruitment systems, employee management, organizational behavior, and workforce planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hd7p55\" data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3516\">Legal Aspects of Business</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3629\">This subject introduces corporate laws, legal compliance systems, contracts, and business regulatory frameworks.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t3rzfq\" data-start=\"3631\" data-end=\"3669\">Conflict Resolution and Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3810\">Students learn negotiation techniques, workplace conflict handling, leadership communication, and organizational problem-solving strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3812\" data-end=\"3815\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rxl4mu\" data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3875\">Semester 3 &ndash; Advanced Specialization &amp; Industry Exposure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3877\" data-end=\"3963\">The third semester focuses on domain specialization and practical management exposure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"3965\" data-end=\"3985\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8p09ll\" data-start=\"3987\" data-end=\"4022\">Major Specialization Course 1&ndash;4</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4023\" data-end=\"4112\">Students study advanced subjects related to their selected specialization domain such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4254\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173ueww\" data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4124\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m6xjvw\" data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4138\">Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fqwsby\" data-start=\"4139\" data-end=\"4168\">Human Resource Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nyjb7y\" data-start=\"4169\" data-end=\"4183\">Operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4210\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geatzs\" data-start=\"4211\" data-end=\"4233\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmgc6h\" data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4254\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4256\" data-end=\"4331\">These subjects provide deeper expertise aligned with specific career goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19i7ck2\" data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4366\">Minor Specialization Course 1</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4367\" data-end=\"4487\">Students gain interdisciplinary exposure by learning an additional management domain outside their major specialization.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lq5xkd\" data-start=\"4489\" data-end=\"4512\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4627\">This subject focuses on ethical leadership, responsible management practices, and corporate governance principles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j9llqc\" data-start=\"4629\" data-end=\"4646\">Minor Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4753\">Students work on practical business problems and apply management concepts through project-based learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4755\" data-end=\"4758\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"oo26fi\" data-start=\"4760\" data-end=\"4818\">Semester 4 &ndash; Strategic Management &amp; Business Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4820\" data-end=\"4958\">The final semester emphasizes strategic leadership, digital transformation, social responsibility, and real-world business implementation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"4980\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wy9d22\" data-start=\"4982\" data-end=\"5015\">Major Specialization Course 5</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5016\" data-end=\"5139\">Students gain advanced expertise in their chosen management specialization through strategic and industry-focused learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17onves\" data-start=\"5141\" data-end=\"5178\">Minor Specialization Course 2 &amp; 3</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5179\" data-end=\"5290\">These subjects provide additional multidisciplinary business understanding and broaden managerial capabilities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lbo7o8\" data-start=\"5292\" data-end=\"5313\">Digital Marketing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5314\" data-end=\"5329\">Students learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5330\" data-end=\"5481\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lo7xq9\" data-start=\"5330\" data-end=\"5360\">Online branding strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10o8swc\" data-start=\"5361\" data-end=\"5388\">Search engine marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p9zf3n\" data-start=\"5389\" data-end=\"5415\">Social media marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2y7r4\" data-start=\"5416\" data-end=\"5445\">Digital consumer behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fro86a\" data-start=\"5446\" data-end=\"5481\">Performance marketing analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ykx02c\" data-start=\"5483\" data-end=\"5544\">Management in Action &ndash; Social Economic and Ethical Issues</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5545\" data-end=\"5569\">This subject focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5570\" data-end=\"5691\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qfzoj2\" data-start=\"5570\" data-end=\"5589\">Business ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yyudpz\" data-start=\"5590\" data-end=\"5613\">Economic challenges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xh23y4\" data-start=\"5614\" data-end=\"5649\">Corporate social responsibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tfxtmc\" data-start=\"5650\" data-end=\"5691\">Real-world management decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jyxpw4\" data-start=\"5693\" data-end=\"5725\">Major Project / Dissertation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5726\" data-end=\"5779\">Students complete a research-based project involving:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5780\" data-end=\"5891\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tzoed8\" data-start=\"5780\" data-end=\"5801\">Business analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hrsw2d\" data-start=\"5802\" data-end=\"5821\">Market research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12e3ce2\" data-start=\"5822\" data-end=\"5851\">Strategic recommendations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zu2rh6\" data-start=\"5852\" data-end=\"5891\">Practical management implementation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5893\" data-end=\"5977\">This project helps students apply theoretical concepts to real corporate situations.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 330000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(338, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 130, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 06:49:06', '2026-06-16 07:33:18', '<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"539\">Understanding the BBA admission process is extremely important for students planning to begin their management education after Class 12. Many applicants focus only on selecting a college or specialization but ignore the actual admission procedure, document verification process, registration formalities, and enrollment stages. Even small mistakes during admission can delay approval, create verification issues, or affect final enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"991\">A structured admission process helps students complete their application smoothly while ensuring transparency, secure fee payment, accurate documentation, and timely enrollment. Whether you are a fresh Class 12 student, an aspiring entrepreneur, or someone planning a career in business management, finance, HR, marketing, accounting, or banking, understanding each stage carefully can help avoid confusion and make the admission journey much easier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1164\">The BBA admission process is designed to be simple, student-friendly, and accessible online, allowing students to complete most formalities conveniently from any location.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1169\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1a5zike\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1207\">Step-by-Step BBA Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1374\">The BBA admission procedure generally includes five major stages. Each step plays an important role in securing successful admission and enrollment into the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"eeuf76\" data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1410\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1553\">The first stage of the admission process is selecting the BBA program that best matches your career goals, interests, and future aspirations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1711\">This is one of the most important decisions because the right program helps students build relevant business skills and career direction from the beginning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1768\">Before selecting the program, students should evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1939\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o49pb\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1788\">Career interests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jia7ss\" data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1819\">Long-term professional goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vl0pat\" data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1837\">Industry demand</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18eobha\" data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1869\">Future higher education plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dxq9i9\" data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1907\">Management specialization interests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fvzjar\" data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1939\">Business career opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1944\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ea2mpp\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1986\">Why Choosing the Right Program Matters</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2123\">Many students choose management programs simply because they are popular without understanding how they align with future career plans.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2209\">Selecting the right BBA program early helps students build a stronger foundation in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2369\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hpk7og\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2236\">Business administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3xmdbg\" data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2248\">Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14a7y0w\" data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2258\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aogelq\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2286\">Human Resource Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15qe4o9\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2305\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nlcqeh\" data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2318\">Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zgg8az\" data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2344\">Corporate communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19a9p1e\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2369\">Leadership development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2494\">Students planning future MBA studies also benefit greatly from choosing a strong management-oriented undergraduate program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rc8jff\" data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2557\">Common Mistakes Students Make During Program Selection</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1y266ns\" data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2601\">Following Trends Without Career Clarity</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2709\">Some students select programs based only on social trends or peer influence instead of personal interests.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2733\">This may later create:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2828\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"viiqcn\" data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2762\">Lack of academic interest</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ugjnds\" data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2781\">Career confusion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"169b0se\" data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2807\">Poor specialization fit</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yaqny0\" data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2828\">Reduced motivation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2916\">Students should focus on long-term career alignment rather than short-term popularity.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xvuhzp\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2954\">Ignoring Future Career Scope</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"3048\">Before choosing a BBA program, students should understand potential future opportunities in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3181\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q676k8\" data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3072\">Corporate management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uwl75a\" data-start=\"3073\" data-end=\"3082\">Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3xmdbg\" data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3094\">Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14a7y0w\" data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3104\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11arg1a\" data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3122\">Human Resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15qe4o9\" data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3141\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1th4uuw\" data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3162\">Business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16rpu43\" data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3181\">Sales management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3255\">Understanding future scope helps students make more strategic decisions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3260\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1viqrjy\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3297\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3444\">Once students select the program, the next stage is completing the online admission application form with accurate personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3522\">This stage is extremely important because incorrect information may lead to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3615\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5bu9wn\" data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3542\">Admission delays</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hllbaz\" data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3564\">Verification issues</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43dxlh\" data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3588\">Application rejection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ja2zmd\" data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3615\">Enrollment complications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3678\">Students should carefully fill out every section of the form.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3683\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kegwnb\" data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3736\">Details Commonly Required in the Application Form</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3738\" data-end=\"3775\">Applicants generally need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"3946\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uzprjw\" data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"3788\">Full name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b09bze\" data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3806\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c1efm\" data-start=\"3807\" data-end=\"3822\">Email address</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14lnz5c\" data-start=\"3823\" data-end=\"3838\">Date of birth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hqf9pd\" data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3861\">Academic information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wrqa6d\" data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3880\">Class 10 details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f1swhz\" data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3899\">Class 12 details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1elagoi\" data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3921\">Address information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qfgqig\" data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"3946\">Identity proof details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"4023\">Students must ensure all details match official academic documents exactly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4025\" data-end=\"4028\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"h7kyp7\" data-start=\"4030\" data-end=\"4076\">Documents Usually Required for BBA Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4113\">Most institutions commonly request:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4416\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4147\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4147\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4136\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Documents</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4136\" data-end=\"4147\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4416\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4208\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4183\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10th Marks Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4183\" data-end=\"4208\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4262\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4234\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12th Marks Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4262\">Eligibility confirmation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4263\" data-end=\"4316\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4263\" data-end=\"4291\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport-size Photographs</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4291\" data-end=\"4316\">Identity verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4317\" data-end=\"4368\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4317\" data-end=\"4341\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Aadhaar Card/ID Proof</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4341\" data-end=\"4368\">Personal identification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4416\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4386\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Signature Scan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4416\">Registration documentation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4418\" data-end=\"4466\">International students may additionally require:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4468\" data-end=\"4546\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlohxf\" data-start=\"4468\" data-end=\"4485\">Passport copies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10yod9z\" data-start=\"4486\" data-end=\"4506\">Visa documentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"btsqc3\" data-start=\"4507\" data-end=\"4546\">Equivalent qualification certificates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4551\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8l05pa\" data-start=\"4553\" data-end=\"4602\">Common Application Mistakes Students Must Avoid</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o0maj9\" data-start=\"4604\" data-end=\"4637\">Incorrect Academic Information</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4639\" data-end=\"4737\">Entering wrong percentages, roll numbers, or spelling errors can create verification issues later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4739\" data-end=\"4742\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x85f94\" data-start=\"4744\" data-end=\"4774\">Uploading Unclear Documents</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4776\" data-end=\"4844\">Blurred or incomplete document uploads may delay admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4846\" data-end=\"4849\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10229di\" data-start=\"4851\" data-end=\"4889\">Using Incorrect Contact Information</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4891\" data-end=\"4929\">Students should always provide active:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4965\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wk4l9g\" data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4948\">Email addresses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18dn9so\" data-start=\"4949\" data-end=\"4965\">Mobile numbers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4967\" data-end=\"5030\">because important admission updates are usually sent digitally.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5032\" data-end=\"5035\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16w6tlx\" data-start=\"5037\" data-end=\"5068\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5070\" data-end=\"5164\">After successfully completing the application form, students proceed to the fee payment stage.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5289\">This step confirms the seriousness of the application and moves the admission process toward registration and verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5291\" data-end=\"5374\">Most institutions provide secure online payment systems for convenience and safety.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5376\" data-end=\"5379\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1y5kfg8\" data-start=\"5381\" data-end=\"5415\">Common Payment Options Available</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5417\" data-end=\"5455\">Students can usually pay fees through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5457\" data-end=\"5561\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3lk5t\" data-start=\"5457\" data-end=\"5470\">Debit cards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"512ev6\" data-start=\"5471\" data-end=\"5485\">Credit cards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hf7qq9\" data-start=\"5486\" data-end=\"5499\">Net banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4vms\" data-start=\"5500\" data-end=\"5505\">UPI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xzu1mr\" data-start=\"5506\" data-end=\"5532\">Digital payment gateways</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cc94jy\" data-start=\"5533\" data-end=\"5561\">EMI options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5563\" data-end=\"5671\">Secure payment systems allow students to complete transactions from anywhere without physical campus visits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5673\" data-end=\"5676\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19picio\" data-start=\"5678\" data-end=\"5715\">Why Timely Fee Payment Is Important</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5717\" data-end=\"5889\">Many students delay payments assuming seats will remain available indefinitely. However, admissions often operate on limited seat availability and rolling admission cycles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5891\" data-end=\"5916\">Late payment may lead to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5918\" data-end=\"6035\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iuyksa\" data-start=\"5918\" data-end=\"5950\">Delayed admission confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vyjxym\" data-start=\"5951\" data-end=\"5978\">Limited seat availability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1403ihc\" data-start=\"5979\" data-end=\"6008\">Missed enrollment deadlines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ceo0dc\" data-start=\"6009\" data-end=\"6035\">Preferred intake closure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6037\" data-end=\"6113\">Early payment generally improves the chances of smooth admission processing.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6115\" data-end=\"6118\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1j4sgz3\" data-start=\"6120\" data-end=\"6171\">Important Financial Considerations Before Payment</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6173\" data-end=\"6212\">Students and parents should understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6214\" data-end=\"6389\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vohqjc\" data-start=\"6214\" data-end=\"6233\">Total program fee</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ki9qx8\" data-start=\"6234\" data-end=\"6267\">Semester-wise payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yeh21s\" data-start=\"6268\" data-end=\"6285\">Refund policies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jx4own\" data-start=\"6286\" data-end=\"6316\">Additional academic expenses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e5fcp6\" data-start=\"6317\" data-end=\"6338\">Examination charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ihh23\" data-start=\"6339\" data-end=\"6356\">Technology fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tgouh6\" data-start=\"6357\" data-end=\"6389\">EMI conditions (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6391\" data-end=\"6477\">Understanding the complete financial commitment helps avoid future financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6479\" data-end=\"6482\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cfgr7l\" data-start=\"6484\" data-end=\"6511\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6513\" data-end=\"6613\">After fee payment, students must submit the final application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6615\" data-end=\"6646\">This stage officially confirms:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6648\" data-end=\"6750\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1383zve\" data-start=\"6648\" data-end=\"6672\">Application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dhvn0g\" data-start=\"6673\" data-end=\"6701\">Document upload completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"faajt7\" data-start=\"6702\" data-end=\"6724\">Payment verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hko29j\" data-start=\"6725\" data-end=\"6750\">Registration initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6752\" data-end=\"6822\">Once registration is completed successfully, students usually receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6824\" data-end=\"6943\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b7fs52\" data-start=\"6824\" data-end=\"6851\">Registration confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dpqtzl\" data-start=\"6852\" data-end=\"6872\">Application number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jtyio7\" data-start=\"6873\" data-end=\"6897\">Admission reference ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fgfcnp\" data-start=\"6898\" data-end=\"6922\">Payment acknowledgment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f7bk0b\" data-start=\"6923\" data-end=\"6943\">Confirmation email</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6945\" data-end=\"7035\">Students should safely store these details for future communication and tracking purposes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7037\" data-end=\"7040\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wpcwnx\" data-start=\"7042\" data-end=\"7079\">Why Registration Completion Matters</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7081\" data-end=\"7201\">Some students assume that fee payment alone guarantees admission. However, registration completion is equally important.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7203\" data-end=\"7245\">Without final submission and registration:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7247\" data-end=\"7380\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mh7n7q\" data-start=\"7247\" data-end=\"7283\">Applications may remain incomplete</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i6yq52\" data-start=\"7284\" data-end=\"7312\">Verification may not begin</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e334a\" data-start=\"7313\" data-end=\"7345\">Enrollment processing may stop</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z8f2rq\" data-start=\"7346\" data-end=\"7380\">Student records may not activate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7382\" data-end=\"7448\">Students should always verify successful submission after payment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7450\" data-end=\"7453\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1tozxz\" data-start=\"7455\" data-end=\"7489\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7491\" data-end=\"7581\">After registration, the institution begins application review and enrollment verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7583\" data-end=\"7646\">During this stage, the admission department generally verifies:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7648\" data-end=\"7765\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16l82hi\" data-start=\"7648\" data-end=\"7670\">Eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kiptgx\" data-start=\"7671\" data-end=\"7691\">Academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fz5y1p\" data-start=\"7692\" data-end=\"7714\">Payment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xwce93\" data-start=\"7715\" data-end=\"7738\">Identity verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xuxv8w\" data-start=\"7739\" data-end=\"7765\">Application completeness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7767\" data-end=\"7860\">Once verification is completed successfully, students receive enrollment-related information.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7862\" data-end=\"7865\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fgtlbq\" data-start=\"7867\" data-end=\"7915\">What Students Usually Receive After Enrollment</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7917\" data-end=\"7956\">Successful applicants commonly receive:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"7958\" data-end=\"8288\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"7958\" data-end=\"7994\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"7958\" data-end=\"7994\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"7958\" data-end=\"7983\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Information</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"7983\" data-end=\"7994\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"8005\" data-end=\"8288\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"8005\" data-end=\"8055\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8005\" data-end=\"8025\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Number</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"8025\" data-end=\"8055\">Student identity reference</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8056\" data-end=\"8110\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8056\" data-end=\"8084\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student Login Credentials</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"8084\" data-end=\"8110\">Academic portal access</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8111\" data-end=\"8152\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8111\" data-end=\"8124\" data-col-size=\"sm\">LMS Access</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"8124\" data-end=\"8152\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning platform access</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8153\" data-end=\"8203\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8153\" data-end=\"8179\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Orientation Information</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"8179\" data-end=\"8203\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program introduction</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8204\" data-end=\"8243\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8204\" data-end=\"8224\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Schedule</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"8224\" data-end=\"8243\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course planning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8244\" data-end=\"8288\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8244\" data-end=\"8263\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Study Guidelines</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"8263\" data-end=\"8288\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning instructions</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"8290\" data-end=\"8324\">Students should regularly monitor:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8326\" data-end=\"8426\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ruee69\" data-start=\"8326\" data-end=\"8347\">Registered email ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u7lkk6\" data-start=\"8348\" data-end=\"8370\">Mobile notifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12kscqt\" data-start=\"8371\" data-end=\"8392\">Admission dashboard</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m41k55\" data-start=\"8393\" data-end=\"8426\">Official communication channels</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8428\" data-end=\"8491\">Missing enrollment communication may delay academic onboarding.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"414\">Choosing the right undergraduate management program begins with understanding the complete eligibility criteria. Many students focus only on admission forms and fee structures but ignore important eligibility conditions that directly affect admission approval, document verification, and enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"688\">The BBA eligibility criteria are designed to make business management education accessible to students from different academic backgrounds who want to build careers in management, finance, banking, HR, entrepreneurship, accounting, marketing, and corporate administration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"1115\">This program is highly suitable for students who want to start management education immediately after Class 12 and develop strong business fundamentals at an early stage. Unlike technical programs that focus only on specialized skills, BBA provides broad exposure to multiple business domains, helping students explore different career opportunities before choosing a specialization in higher studies or professional careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1324\">The eligibility structure is flexible, student-friendly, and suitable for both Indian and international applicants who fulfill the required educational qualifications and language understanding requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1329\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aojuv7\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1370\">Who Should Apply for the BBA Program?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1501\">The BBA program is ideal for students and professionals who want to build a strong foundation in business and management studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1532\">This program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1920\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0ehn1\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1592\">Fresh 10+2 pass-out students planning management careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1doktnj\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1647\">Aspirants seeking careers in business administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rl3e9s\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1713\">Students interested in finance, banking, HR, law, or accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hm52c3\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1767\">Entrepreneurs wanting business management knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ky4wpa\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1821\">Students aiming for leadership and managerial roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"139kdu9\" data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1862\">Candidates planning future MBA studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sgeh8x\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1920\">Individuals interested in corporate business operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"2108\">One of the biggest advantages of BBA is that students can begin developing business and management understanding immediately after school instead of waiting until postgraduate education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2113\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"qnioil\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2161\">BBA Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2267\">Indian applicants seeking admission to the BBA program must fulfill the following academic requirements.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"esneuk\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2309\">Educational Qualification Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2336\">Candidates must complete:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2531\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2377\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2377\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2366\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Qualification Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2377\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2531\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2459\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2413\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10th Class Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2459\">Completion of 10 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2531\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2485\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12th Class Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2531\">Completion of 12 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2701\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations are also eligible to apply, subject to final document submission and verification within the prescribed admission timeline.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2809\">NIOS board candidates are also eligible if their qualifications meet the recognized academic requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2814\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fp0t6s\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2857\">Minimum Academic Background Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2947\">The BBA program generally accepts students from multiple educational streams, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"3039\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fr3fit\" data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2959\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tue68s\" data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"2969\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"160c5ri\" data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"2987\">Arts/Humanities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cfot0t\" data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3008\">Vocational streams</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14hsel6\" data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3039\">Business studies backgrounds</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3137\">This flexibility allows students from diverse academic interests to pursue management education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3259\">Unlike many specialized degree programs, BBA does not restrict applicants to a specific subject combination in Class 12.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3264\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7j9uzd\" data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3296\">English Language Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3385\">Applicants must possess sufficient knowledge and understanding of the English language.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3387\" data-end=\"3414\">Since BBA programs involve:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3539\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z73kb1\" data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3431\">Presentations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1320yha\" data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3456\">Business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"st1uys\" data-start=\"3457\" data-end=\"3476\">Group discussions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yi9ak5\" data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3491\">Case studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jxwred\" data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3501\">Reports</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lie7pk\" data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3515\">Assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q6e20h\" data-start=\"3516\" data-end=\"3539\">Corporate interaction</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3649\">basic English communication skills become extremely important for academic success and future employability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3651\" data-end=\"3721\">Students with strong communication skills generally perform better in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3821\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3s2g43\" data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3736\">Internships</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gp8hf5\" data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3759\">Corporate interviews</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17mkreb\" data-start=\"3760\" data-end=\"3775\">Team projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fk5mxo\" data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3797\">Placement processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g1t6hm\" data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3821\">Leadership activities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3823\" data-end=\"3826\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xeayv0\" data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3870\">Why English Communication Matters in BBA</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"4096\">Many students underestimate communication skills during admission because they believe management education focuses only on theory. However, business careers rely heavily on professional interaction and presentation ability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4098\" data-end=\"4153\">Weak communication skills can later create problems in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4261\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wlussr\" data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4174\">Campus placements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sizj4h\" data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4197\">Client communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17xokzp\" data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4215\">Public speaking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yu2sry\" data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4241\">Corporate presentations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6nrnmi\" data-start=\"4242\" data-end=\"4261\">Team coordination</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4263\" data-end=\"4295\">Students should begin improving:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4410\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xwdq46\" data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4313\">Spoken English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"42wel6\" data-start=\"4314\" data-end=\"4339\">Presentation confidence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1id5ax0\" data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4361\">Business vocabulary</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ughi63\" data-start=\"4362\" data-end=\"4384\">Professional writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"agom9\" data-start=\"4385\" data-end=\"4410\">Interview communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4412\" data-end=\"4457\">from the beginning of the BBA program itself.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4462\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1v7n6u\" data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4511\">BBA Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4612\">International applicants must fulfill equivalent academic qualification requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vd27nh\" data-start=\"4614\" data-end=\"4652\">Academic Qualification Requirements</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4654\" data-end=\"4887\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4654\" data-end=\"4693\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4654\" data-end=\"4693\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4654\" data-end=\"4682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Qualification Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4682\" data-end=\"4693\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4704\" data-end=\"4887\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4704\" data-end=\"4795\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4704\" data-end=\"4726\" data-col-size=\"sm\">O Level Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4726\" data-end=\"4795\">Completion of 10 years of formal schooling (Diploma not accepted)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4796\" data-end=\"4887\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4796\" data-end=\"4818\" data-col-size=\"sm\">A Level Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4818\" data-end=\"4887\">Completion of 12 years of formal schooling (Diploma not accepted)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4889\" data-end=\"4981\">Diploma qualifications are generally not accepted in place of formal schooling requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4983\" data-end=\"5091\">Applicants must complete recognized academic education equivalent to Indian Class 10 and Class 12 standards.</p>', '<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"531\">Understanding the BBA fee structure is one of the most important parts of the admission process because many students and parents focus only on the total tuition amount while ignoring payment flexibility, installment planning, long-term return on investment, and additional academic expenses. Proper financial understanding helps students plan their education more effectively without unnecessary financial pressure during the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"930\">The BBA program is designed to provide flexible payment options, including semester-wise fee payment and zero-cost EMI facilities, making management education more accessible for students from different financial backgrounds. This flexibility is especially beneficial for families planning higher education immediately after Class 12 while managing other financial responsibilities simultaneously.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"1203\">The fee structure also reflects the broader value of management education, including exposure to business fundamentals, communication development, leadership training, analytical learning, and corporate readiness that can contribute significantly to future career growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1208\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ur71p3\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1238\">BBA Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1266\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1266\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1256\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1266\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1303\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1324\">₹9,896* per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1355\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1344\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1355\">₹41,700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1374\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Course Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1387\">₹2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1392\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1426\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1622\">The BBA program offers a <strong data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1488\">24-month zero-cost EMI facility</strong>, allowing students and parents to manage educational expenses through smaller monthly installments instead of large upfront payments.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1653\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1653\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1635\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1653\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1690\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹9,896* per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1798\">This option helps make management education financially manageable for many families.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2525\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15qtxmz\" data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2588\">Important Things Students Should Verify Before Choosing EMI</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2657\">Before selecting EMI options, students should carefully understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2845\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a0n3hg\" data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2687\">EMI eligibility conditions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"szgkbg\" data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2728\">Partner bank or financing requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cj87e1\" data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2765\">Processing charges (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mj1jbf\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2785\">Payment deadlines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wus76r\" data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2816\">Missed installment penalties</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0gviu\" data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2845\">Documentation requirements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2960\">Even though EMI options reduce immediate financial stress, proper repayment planning remains extremely important.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2962\" data-end=\"2965\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"v7l2tb\" data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"3000\">Semester-Wise BBA Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3102\">Students who prefer installment-based academic payments can choose the semester-wise payment option.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3174\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3133\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3133\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3123\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Payment</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3133\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3174\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3174\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3163\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3174\">₹41,700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3293\">This structure allows students to pay fees gradually during the program instead of making a complete upfront payment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4149\" data-end=\"4152\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9cvhlb\" data-start=\"4154\" data-end=\"4175\">Full BBA Course Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4223\">The total fee for the complete BBA program is:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4310\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4264\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4264\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4243\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4264\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4310\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4310\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4297\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full BBA Course Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4310\">₹2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4312\" data-end=\"4416\">The full course fee generally includes major academic components associated with the management program.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"101\" data-end=\"405\">Choosing an MBA program is not only about earning a management degree. The real value of an MBA depends heavily on the curriculum structure, industry relevance of subjects, practical exposure, analytical skill development, and how effectively the syllabus prepares students for real corporate challenges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"851\">A well-designed MBA curriculum helps students develop managerial thinking, business problem-solving ability, communication skills, leadership qualities, strategic decision-making capability, and modern digital business expertise. The curriculum below is structured to gradually build foundational business understanding in the early semesters and advanced analytical, strategic, operational, and digital management capabilities in later stages.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"925\">One major advantage of this MBA syllabus is its balanced combination of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1phl52s\" data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"957\">Core management fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1320yha\" data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"982\">Business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1721zx8\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1018\">Financial and marketing knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tw3s8r\" data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1052\">Operations and HR understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e62eeo\" data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1093\">Data analytics and technology exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w3xw20\" data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1122\">Consumer behavior analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16j0293\" data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1152\">Digital business management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qgkjj6\" data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1186\">Research and strategic thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vo3sl6\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1217\">Entrepreneurship development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"188ncp4\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1251\">Practical industry applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1555\">This combination helps students prepare for modern business environments where management knowledge alone is no longer enough. Companies now increasingly demand professionals who can combine business strategy with analytics, technology understanding, customer insights, and data-driven decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gwk7t7\" data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1602\">MBA Semester-Wise Curriculum Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1756\">The MBA curriculum is divided across six semesters, with each semester focusing on specific business competencies and career-oriented skill development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1761\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"e0h0t\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1826\">Semester 1: Building Strong Business &amp; Management Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"2063\">The first semester focuses on developing core business understanding and introducing students to essential management principles. This stage is extremely important because it creates the conceptual base for advanced MBA subjects later.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2085\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2562\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2120\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2120\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2098\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2120\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2562\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2224\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2157\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accounting Fundamentals</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2224\">Financial recording, accounting concepts, business transactions</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2320\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2250\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2320\">Corporate communication, presentation skills, professional writing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2408\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2345\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Management Foundation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2408\">Basic principles of management and organizational structure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2487\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2435\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Principles of Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2487\" data-col-size=\"md\">Marketing concepts, branding, customer targeting</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2562\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2510\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2562\">Statistical methods for business decision-making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2567\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1aw6r95\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2605\">What Students Learn in Semester 1</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2717\">Students begin understanding how organizations operate from financial, managerial, and marketing perspectives.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tooh27\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2745\">Major Skills Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fbhdvw\" data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2779\">Business communication ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10v4scw\" data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2801\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pju1y7\" data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2833\">Basic financial understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lwc6c8\" data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2858\">Marketing fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9scz41\" data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2883\">Quantitative reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16bwb84\" data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2921\">Corporate terminology understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2926\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ihxuw3\" data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2968\">Why Semester 1 Is Extremely Important</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"3209\">Many students underestimate foundational subjects because they appear basic initially. However, weak understanding in this stage often creates problems later in advanced topics like analytics, strategic management, finance, and operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3223\">For example:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3225\" data-end=\"3391\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jkc84d\" data-start=\"3225\" data-end=\"3278\">Poor accounting basics affect finance understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wc2ci9\" data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3334\">Weak statistics skills create difficulty in analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9jdipn\" data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3391\">Communication gaps impact placements and presentations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3490\">Students who build strong fundamentals early generally perform better throughout the MBA program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3495\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19fsqu2\" data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3551\">Semester 2: Developing Functional Business Knowledge</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3553\" data-end=\"3675\">The second semester introduces operational and managerial business functions while expanding practical business awareness.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"3677\" data-end=\"3697\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"4190\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3732\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3732\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3710\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3732\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"4190\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3838\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3786\" data-col-size=\"md\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3838\">Personality development and interpersonal skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3917\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3869\" data-col-size=\"md\">IT Applications in Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3869\" data-end=\"3917\">Technology use in modern business operations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3993\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3942\" data-col-size=\"md\">Environmental Studies</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3942\" data-end=\"3993\">Sustainability and environmental responsibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4077\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4033\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fundamentals of Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4077\">Financial planning and investment basics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4190\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4122\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fundamentals of Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4190\">Recruitment, employee management, organizational behavior basics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4192\" data-end=\"4195\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z9qb2i\" data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4235\">Key Learning Outcomes of Semester 2</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4237\" data-end=\"4318\">This semester focuses on improving managerial efficiency and workplace readiness.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14zgo1k\" data-start=\"4320\" data-end=\"4350\">Students Develop Skills In</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4502\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17mp3vq\" data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4377\">Leadership and teamwork</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7t5903\" data-start=\"4378\" data-end=\"4401\">Technology adaptation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zo7i3a\" data-start=\"4402\" data-end=\"4420\">HR understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13i94d7\" data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4448\">Financial decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gxij3\" data-start=\"4449\" data-end=\"4472\">Professional behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gl485t\" data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4502\">Organizational coordination</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4504\" data-end=\"4507\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7hwr1t\" data-start=\"4509\" data-end=\"4554\">Industry Importance of Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4702\">Modern companies increasingly value professionals who can combine management ability with technological adaptability and people management skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4704\" data-end=\"4718\">Subjects like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4720\" data-end=\"4776\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cwvhr5\" data-start=\"4720\" data-end=\"4735\">HR management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o03g9o\" data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4753\">IT applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sizwia\" data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4776\">Financial management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4876\">help students prepare for practical business environments rather than purely theoretical learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4878\" data-end=\"4881\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10n9b82\" data-start=\"4883\" data-end=\"4945\">Semester 3: Advanced Organizational &amp; Research Understanding</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4947\" data-end=\"5082\">The third semester shifts toward organizational behavior, operations management, research capability, and data management fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"5084\" data-end=\"5104\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5106\" data-end=\"5520\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5106\" data-end=\"5139\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5106\" data-end=\"5139\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5106\" data-end=\"5117\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5117\" data-end=\"5139\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5150\" data-end=\"5520\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5150\" data-end=\"5236\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5150\" data-end=\"5190\" data-col-size=\"md\">Principles of Organizational Behavior</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5190\" data-end=\"5236\">Employee behavior and workplace psychology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5237\" data-end=\"5339\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5237\" data-end=\"5290\" data-col-size=\"md\">Essentials of Production and Operations Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5290\" data-end=\"5339\">Operational efficiency and process management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5424\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5372\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research Methods for Managers</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5372\" data-end=\"5424\">Business research and decision-making techniques</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5425\" data-end=\"5520\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5425\" data-end=\"5468\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fundamentals of Data and Data Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5468\" data-end=\"5520\">Data handling and information management systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5522\" data-end=\"5525\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8lsl39\" data-start=\"5527\" data-end=\"5554\">Importance of Semester 3</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5556\" data-end=\"5691\">This semester acts as a transition phase from traditional management learning toward analytical and operational business understanding.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17fcars\" data-start=\"5693\" data-end=\"5723\">Students Gain Knowledge In</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5725\" data-end=\"5882\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uyiqf1\" data-start=\"5725\" data-end=\"5752\">Organizational psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uiswma\" data-start=\"5753\" data-end=\"5788\">Operational workflow optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ez1oe0\" data-start=\"5789\" data-end=\"5819\">Business research techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18jvl3z\" data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5850\">Data management fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yqkugo\" data-start=\"5851\" data-end=\"5882\">Strategic analytical thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5884\" data-end=\"5887\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e617pm\" data-start=\"5889\" data-end=\"5925\">Why Research Skills Matter in MBA</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5927\" data-end=\"6094\">Many students ignore research-based subjects assuming they are only academic requirements. However, research skills are extremely valuable in real business situations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6096\" data-end=\"6123\">Managers regularly perform:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6125\" data-end=\"6232\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a3qxfi\" data-start=\"6125\" data-end=\"6142\">Market analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10w821h\" data-start=\"6143\" data-end=\"6162\">Customer research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"leo7xi\" data-start=\"6163\" data-end=\"6184\">Competitive studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kn1jv9\" data-start=\"6185\" data-end=\"6210\">Performance evaluations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rngwdu\" data-start=\"6211\" data-end=\"6232\">Data interpretation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6234\" data-end=\"6308\">Strong research capability improves decision-making quality significantly.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6310\" data-end=\"6313\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1pnilz2\" data-start=\"6315\" data-end=\"6381\">Semester 4: Entrepreneurship, Operations &amp; Big Data Applications</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6383\" data-end=\"6504\">The fourth semester introduces modern business analytics, entrepreneurship, consumer psychology, and operations research.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"6506\" data-end=\"6526\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"6528\" data-end=\"6923\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"6528\" data-end=\"6561\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6528\" data-end=\"6561\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"6528\" data-end=\"6539\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"6539\" data-end=\"6561\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"6572\" data-end=\"6923\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6572\" data-end=\"6651\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6572\" data-end=\"6607\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fundamentals of Entrepreneurship</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6607\" data-end=\"6651\">Startup management and business creation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6652\" data-end=\"6729\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6652\" data-end=\"6686\" data-col-size=\"md\">Principles of Consumer Behavior</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6686\" data-end=\"6729\">Customer psychology and buying behavior</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6730\" data-end=\"6792\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6730\" data-end=\"6752\" data-col-size=\"md\">Operations Research</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6752\" data-end=\"6792\">Quantitative decision-making methods</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6793\" data-end=\"6923\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6793\" data-end=\"6873\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Engineering Tools &amp; Working with Big Data Architecture &amp; its Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6873\" data-end=\"6923\">Big data systems and analytical infrastructure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6925\" data-end=\"6928\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cnjze9\" data-start=\"6930\" data-end=\"6975\">Why Semester 4 Is Highly Industry Relevant</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6977\" data-end=\"7100\">This semester reflects modern business transformation where data-driven management is becoming essential across industries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uusyo5\" data-start=\"7102\" data-end=\"7126\">Students Learn About</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7128\" data-end=\"7280\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2r2es\" data-start=\"7128\" data-end=\"7158\">Consumer purchasing behavior</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b536ol\" data-start=\"7159\" data-end=\"7191\">Startup ecosystem fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h1c2pf\" data-start=\"7192\" data-end=\"7222\">Business optimization models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14pf9s1\" data-start=\"7223\" data-end=\"7246\">Big data architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sj1o6n\" data-start=\"7247\" data-end=\"7280\">Analytical tools and frameworks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7282\" data-end=\"7285\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"77jdaa\" data-start=\"7287\" data-end=\"7327\">Hidden Advantage of Big Data Exposure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7329\" data-end=\"7451\">Most traditional MBA programs focus heavily on theoretical management concepts but lack analytical and technical exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7453\" data-end=\"7462\">Learning:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7464\" data-end=\"7527\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qb4bhp\" data-start=\"7464\" data-end=\"7483\">Data architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17v6syl\" data-start=\"7484\" data-end=\"7507\">Big data applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kpve1m\" data-start=\"7508\" data-end=\"7527\">Engineering tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7529\" data-end=\"7595\">gives students a competitive advantage in modern corporate hiring.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7597\" data-end=\"7642\">This is especially beneficial for careers in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7644\" data-end=\"7746\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1th4uuw\" data-start=\"7644\" data-end=\"7664\">Business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ute6u\" data-start=\"7665\" data-end=\"7684\">Digital marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ynyad\" data-start=\"7685\" data-end=\"7702\">Market research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18hxrjk\" data-start=\"7703\" data-end=\"7723\">Product management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ruyd6k\" data-start=\"7724\" data-end=\"7746\">Strategic consulting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7748\" data-end=\"7751\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12577hg\" data-start=\"7753\" data-end=\"7813\">Semester 5: Strategic Business &amp; Digital Management Skills</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7815\" data-end=\"7949\">The fifth semester focuses on digital transformation, customer relationship management, strategic thinking, and statistical analytics.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"7951\" data-end=\"7971\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"7973\" data-end=\"8383\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"7973\" data-end=\"8006\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"7973\" data-end=\"8006\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"7973\" data-end=\"7984\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"7984\" data-end=\"8006\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"8017\" data-end=\"8383\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"8017\" data-end=\"8096\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8017\" data-end=\"8044\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing in Digital Age</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"8044\" data-end=\"8096\">Digital marketing and online consumer engagement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8097\" data-end=\"8156\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8097\" data-end=\"8119\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"8119\" data-end=\"8156\" data-col-size=\"md\">Ethical corporate decision-making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8157\" data-end=\"8223\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8157\" data-end=\"8177\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Strategy</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"8177\" data-end=\"8223\" data-col-size=\"md\">Competitive strategy and business planning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8224\" data-end=\"8295\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8224\" data-end=\"8257\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Managing Customer Relationship</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"8257\" data-end=\"8295\">CRM systems and customer retention</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8296\" data-end=\"8383\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8296\" data-end=\"8337\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Understanding of Statistical Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"8337\" data-end=\"8383\">Data interpretation and business analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8385\" data-end=\"8388\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bckgg0\" data-start=\"8390\" data-end=\"8429\">Major Skills Developed in Semester 5</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8431\" data-end=\"8516\">Students begin applying management knowledge strategically across business scenarios.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"f90xl6\" data-start=\"8518\" data-end=\"8549\">Core Competencies Developed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8551\" data-end=\"8709\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4ovgw\" data-start=\"8551\" data-end=\"8583\">Digital business understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z2cfdp\" data-start=\"8584\" data-end=\"8604\">Strategic planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bh9opr\" data-start=\"8605\" data-end=\"8626\">Customer management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10rxyj3\" data-start=\"8627\" data-end=\"8647\">Ethical leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lr6wga\" data-start=\"8648\" data-end=\"8675\">Analytical interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ylck1e\" data-start=\"8676\" data-end=\"8709\">Market competitiveness analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8711\" data-end=\"8714\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3qmb8x\" data-start=\"8716\" data-end=\"8765\">Why Digital Marketing &amp; Analytics Matter Today</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8767\" data-end=\"8801\">Modern businesses rely heavily on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8803\" data-end=\"8904\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jd7i2u\" data-start=\"8803\" data-end=\"8818\">Consumer data</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r17dyy\" data-start=\"8819\" data-end=\"8838\">Online engagement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iq0pz3\" data-start=\"8839\" data-end=\"8861\">Performance tracking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ylzssa\" data-start=\"8862\" data-end=\"8882\">Customer analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ibwbc\" data-start=\"8883\" data-end=\"8904\">Digital advertising</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8906\" data-end=\"8993\">Students with digital-age business understanding often receive better opportunities in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8995\" data-end=\"9115\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w36re7\" data-start=\"8995\" data-end=\"9012\">Marketing firms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h2bfuk\" data-start=\"9013\" data-end=\"9035\">E-commerce companies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jk8g7w\" data-start=\"9036\" data-end=\"9062\">Consulting organizations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n4rgwv\" data-start=\"9063\" data-end=\"9084\">Analytics companies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1856x01\" data-start=\"9085\" data-end=\"9115\">Technology-driven businesses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9117\" data-end=\"9120\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"3pjt9j\" data-start=\"9122\" data-end=\"9178\">Semester 6: Practical Analytics &amp; Industry Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9180\" data-end=\"9290\">The final semester focuses on practical implementation, research application, and advanced analytics exposure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"9292\" data-end=\"9312\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"9314\" data-end=\"9632\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"9314\" data-end=\"9347\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"9314\" data-end=\"9347\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"9314\" data-end=\"9325\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"9325\" data-end=\"9347\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"9358\" data-end=\"9632\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"9358\" data-end=\"9414\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9358\" data-end=\"9373\" data-col-size=\"md\">Dissertation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"9373\" data-end=\"9414\" data-col-size=\"md\">Independent business research project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"9415\" data-end=\"9538\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9415\" data-end=\"9492\" data-col-size=\"md\">Exploratory Data Analysis and Visualization using Python/Tableau for Leads</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"9492\" data-end=\"9538\">Practical analytics and data visualization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"9539\" data-end=\"9632\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9539\" data-end=\"9587\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Analytics in Marketing &amp; Market Research</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"9587\" data-end=\"9632\" data-col-size=\"md\">Marketing analytics and research insights</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9634\" data-end=\"9637\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1x16ofu\" data-start=\"9639\" data-end=\"9670\">Importance of Final Semester</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9672\" data-end=\"9802\">The final semester is highly career-oriented because students apply theoretical and analytical concepts to real business problems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1axll3u\" data-start=\"9804\" data-end=\"9843\">Students Gain Practical Exposure In</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9845\" data-end=\"9992\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ojgr72\" data-start=\"9845\" data-end=\"9871\">Business problem-solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i9bgrm\" data-start=\"9872\" data-end=\"9892\">Data visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ctp35o\" data-start=\"9893\" data-end=\"9915\">Python/Tableau usage</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rpb6l6\" data-start=\"9916\" data-end=\"9937\">Marketing analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uyktw6\" data-start=\"9938\" data-end=\"9966\">Research project execution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4idy36\" data-start=\"9967\" data-end=\"9992\">Analytical storytelling</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 250000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(339, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 285, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 07:07:19', '2026-06-16 07:33:47', '<p data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"408\">The BCA admission process is designed to be simple, smooth, and student-friendly so that applicants can complete their enrollment without unnecessary complications. Whether you are a fresh Class 12 student or someone planning a career in the IT and technology sector, understanding each admission step properly helps avoid mistakes during registration and document verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"546\">The entire process can usually be completed online, making it convenient for students from different cities and educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"551\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zvhjz3\" data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"589\">Step-by-Step BCA Admission Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f67ya9\" data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"621\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"711\">The first step is choosing the BCA program that matches your career goals and interests.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"799\">Students should select the program carefully based on their interest in areas such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p5h0ok\" data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"823\">Software Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17fjk41\" data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"837\">Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"342mc1\" data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"854\">Cyber Security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kh1pft\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"872\">Cloud Computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fhbifq\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"885\">Networking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yeyxxq\" data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"902\">Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p3jjs6\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"926\">Computer Applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"1034\">Choosing the right program helps students build the correct technical foundation for future career growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1039\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"chdhb1\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1077\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1188\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the online application form with the required details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1227\">Applicants generally need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1321\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18iy9j0\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1251\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bjwm6n\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1270\">Academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1292\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1321\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1442\">Students should ensure that all information entered in the application form is accurate and matches official documents.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vk3dum\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1473\">Common Documents Required</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1507\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1507\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1496\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Documents</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1507\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1562\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1537\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10th Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1562\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1582\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12th Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1610\">Eligibility verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1638\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport-size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1663\">Identity verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1675\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ID Proof</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1702\">Personal identification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1772\">Incorrect or incomplete information may delay the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1777\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zz7wxy\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1811\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1935\">Once the application form is completed, students need to pay the program fee through the available online payment methods.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1972\">Common payment options may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2049\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nl3oci\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"1986\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dn2lyp\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2000\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lkc75d\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2014\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4vms\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2020\">UPI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"167094e\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2049\">EMI Options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2137\">Secure online payment systems make the process convenient and accessible for students.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2205\">Students should keep payment receipts safely for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2210\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2xelpe\" data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2240\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2347\">After successful fee payment, students must submit the application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2373\">This step confirms that:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2520\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wzmarz\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2423\">The application form is successfully submitted</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3uuv0f\" data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2457\">Documents are uploaded properly</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4xwco3\" data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2484\">Fee payment is completed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qluxyu\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2520\">Registration process is finalized</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2549\">Students generally receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2641\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b7fs52\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2578\">Registration confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dpqtzl\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2599\">Application number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nbva6e\" data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2626\">Admission acknowledgment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ssiojy\" data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2641\">Reference ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2708\">These details should be saved carefully for future communication.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vw8oac\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2750\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2848\">After registration, the university reviews the application and verifies the submitted documents.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2951\">Once verification is completed successfully, students receive enrollment-related information such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"3067\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bx4sz3\" data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2972\">Enrollment number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r16p5m\" data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3000\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nyka5o\" data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3025\">Learning portal access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pwegko\" data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3045\">Academic schedule</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14l0ybg\" data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3067\">Orientation details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3157\">Students should regularly check their registered email ID and mobile number for updates.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"358\">The BCA program is designed for students who want to build a career in Computer Applications, Software Development, IT Services, Cyber Security, Cloud Computing, Networking, and related technology fields. The eligibility criteria are simple and suitable for students who want to start their technology journey after Class 12.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"648\">This program is ideal for students interested in programming, software systems, databases, networking, and modern IT technologies. It also provides a strong academic foundation for higher studies like MCA, MBA, Data Science, Artificial Intelligence, and other technology-focused programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"653\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13sh622\" data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"679\">Who Can Apply for BCA?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"713\">The BCA program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"1063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q44ad8\" data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"781\">Fresh 10+2 pass-out students interested in Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ipsl17\" data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"833\">Aspirants seeking careers in IT &amp; ITES industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pf8888\" data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"896\">Students planning careers in software and technology domains</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hpb34\" data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"982\">Learners interested in programming, networking, cloud computing, and cyber security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mailrr\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1063\">Students aiming for higher education in technology and computer science fields</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1179\">The course is also beneficial for students who want opportunities in both private and public sector organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"88i4yk\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1232\">BCA Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1326\">Indian students applying for BCA admission must fulfill the following academic requirements:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1554\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1367\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1367\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1356\" data-col-size=\"md\">Qualification Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1367\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1554\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1462\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1416\" data-col-size=\"md\">Secondary School (10th) Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1462\">Completion of 10 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1554\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1508\" data-col-size=\"md\">Senior Secondary School (12th) Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1554\">Completion of 12 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1655\">Students appearing for Class 12 are also eligible to apply, subject to final document verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1738\">NIOS board candidates are eligible if they meet the required academic conditions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1743\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7j9uzd\" data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1775\">English Language Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1882\">Applicants must possess sufficient knowledge and understanding of the English language and communication.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1918\">Since the BCA curriculum includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11hmqq8\" data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1943\">Programming languages</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e4dkp5\" data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1969\">Technical documentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t5thm4\" data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"1986\">Software tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lumjfw\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2005\">Coding platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"id5tfg\" data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2020\">Project work</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2084\">basic English understanding is important for academic success.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2228\">Candidates who have not studied in English for at least three years in their academic qualifications are generally not eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2233\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"71mqrz\" data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2293\">Eligibility Criteria for Students with Foreign Education</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2370\">International students must complete equivalent educational qualifications.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2411\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2411\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Qualification Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2411\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2522\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2453\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Secondary School Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2522\">Completion of 10 years of formal schooling (Diploma not accepted)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2561\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Senior Secondary School Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2630\">Completion of 12 years of formal schooling (Diploma not accepted)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2713\">Students must provide valid academic documents during admission and verification.</p>', '<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"419\">Understanding the BCA fee structure is important for students and parents before taking admission because proper financial planning helps avoid confusion during the course duration. The BCA program offers flexible payment options, including semester-wise payments and zero-cost EMI facilities, making technology education more accessible and affordable for students from different backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"680\">The fee structure is designed to support students who want to build careers in software development, cloud computing, cyber security, programming, networking, and other IT-related fields without facing heavy financial pressure at the beginning of the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"685\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ujtamu\" data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"715\">BCA Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"860\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"743\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"743\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"733\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"743\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"860\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"800\">\r\n<td data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"780\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"800\">₹9,896 per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"827\">\r\n<td data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"816\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"827\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹41,700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"860\">\r\n<td data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"847\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"860\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"865\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"899\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"1033\">Students can choose the <strong data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"958\">24-month zero-cost EMI option</strong>, which allows them to pay the program fee in smaller monthly installments.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1121\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1046\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1064\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1121\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1121\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1121\">₹9,896 per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1250\">This option is beneficial for students and families looking for flexible payment management without additional interest burden.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13bw1eo\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1280\">Benefits of Zero Cost EMI</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1coe7jn\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1318\">Reduces upfront financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17t8j5a\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1369\">Makes fee payment easier in monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tm6xhb\" data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1437\">Helps students continue education without large one-time payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gtk7f5\" data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1486\">Provides better financial planning flexibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1609\">Students should still check EMI-related terms, eligibility conditions, and payment timelines before selecting the option.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1614\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1t1n50e\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1645\">Semester-Wise Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1770\">The BCA program also offers a semester-wise payment option for students who prefer paying fees gradually during the course.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1838\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1801\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1801\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1791\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Payment</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1801\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1838\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1838\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1827\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1838\">₹41,700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1955\">This payment structure helps students manage educational expenses more comfortably throughout the academic program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1960\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"5da2lj\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1980\">Full Program Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2028\">The total fee for the complete BCA program is:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2105\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2062\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2062\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2049\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2062\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2105\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2105\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2092\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2105\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2202\">The full program fee generally covers the major academic components associated with the course.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"750\">The BCA curriculum is designed to prepare students for the rapidly evolving technology industry by combining programming fundamentals, software development, cloud computing, cyber security, artificial intelligence, analytics, and database management into a structured learning path. In today&rsquo;s digital economy, companies no longer look for graduates who only understand theoretical computer concepts. Modern employers increasingly demand professionals who can solve real-world problems, work with modern technologies, understand security systems, manage cloud infrastructure, and adapt to fast-changing digital environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"1121\">A well-structured BCA syllabus helps students build both technical expertise and practical industry readiness. The curriculum below gradually develops core programming knowledge during the initial semesters and then moves toward advanced technologies such as artificial intelligence, cloud architecture, cyber security, data mining, and cryptography in later semesters.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1391\">One of the biggest strengths of this BCA curriculum is its industry-oriented approach. Instead of focusing only on outdated theoretical subjects, the syllabus introduces students to highly relevant modern technologies that are currently driving the IT sector globally.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1417\">The curriculum combines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1671\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hx4o1x\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1445\">Programming fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z57xjo\" data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1468\">Software development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"od5bxa\" data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1490\">Database management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iu0her\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1510\">Operating systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gis6hx\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1532\">Networking concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u78spn\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1558\">Artificial intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"181z2ll\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1576\">Cloud computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"144tqwh\" data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1593\">Cyber security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13kuhim\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1610\">Data analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ox1bhu\" data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1633\">Information security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3j9oda\" data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1648\">Cryptography</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a2qevy\" data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1671\">Software engineering</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1779\">This balanced structure helps students prepare for both higher studies and modern IT career opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1784\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xrpeg5\" data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1826\">BCA Semester-Wise Curriculum Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1978\">The BCA program is divided into six semesters, with each semester focusing on specific technical competencies and industry-oriented skill development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"1983\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ug9bru\" data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2048\">Semester 1: Building Core Programming &amp; Technical Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2195\">The first semester introduces students to the fundamentals of computing, programming logic, communication skills, and mathematical understanding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2357\">This stage is extremely important because it creates the technical base required for advanced software development and analytical subjects later in the program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2379\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2821\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2414\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2414\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2392\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2414\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2821\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2505\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2447\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Basic Mathematics-I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2505\">Mathematical concepts for computing and logic building</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2585\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2531\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2585\">Professional communication and presentation skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2665\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2624\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer and Information Technology</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2665\">Computer fundamentals and IT concepts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2743\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2695\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Computer Interaction</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2743\">User interaction and interface understanding</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2821\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2763\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Programming in C</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2821\">Core programming logic and software development basics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2826\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"k18ha8\" data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2867\">Why Semester 1 Is Extremely Important</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"3069\">Many students underestimate introductory programming subjects because they appear basic initially. However, weak programming foundations often create major difficulties in advanced technologies later.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3083\">For example:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3259\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o9iswo\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3143\">Weak C programming affects data structures understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16krjku\" data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3203\">Poor mathematical logic impacts analytics and AI learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ydmfnj\" data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3259\">Weak communication skills reduce placement confidence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3389\">Students who build strong coding fundamentals in Semester 1 usually adapt more easily to advanced software development subjects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3394\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8ns1zb\" data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3434\">Major Skills Developed in Semester 1</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvs8tw\" data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3455\">Technical Skills</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3457\" data-end=\"3573\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a35o3p\" data-start=\"3457\" data-end=\"3482\">Basic programming logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"109ijwq\" data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3508\">Problem-solving ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4xpevy\" data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3543\">Computer operation understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"127m3b1\" data-start=\"3544\" data-end=\"3573\">Software development basics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3578\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"owdooc\" data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3602\">Professional Skills</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3604\" data-end=\"3695\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"660w4q\" data-start=\"3604\" data-end=\"3627\">Communication ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"42wel6\" data-start=\"3628\" data-end=\"3653\">Presentation confidence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wwlhqz\" data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3672\">Logical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wnu0kk\" data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3695\">Analytical reasoning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3767\">These foundational skills become essential throughout the BCA journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3769\" data-end=\"3772\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7cg5n9\" data-start=\"3774\" data-end=\"3832\">Semester 2: Strengthening Core Computer Science Concepts</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3972\">The second semester focuses on essential software engineering concepts, operating systems, data structures, and technical problem-solving.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"3974\" data-end=\"3994\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4434\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4029\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4029\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4007\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4029\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4434\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4112\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4066\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Structures Using C</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4066\" data-end=\"4112\">Data organization and algorithm efficiency</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4183\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4137\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Environmental Studies</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4183\">Sustainability and environmental awareness</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4272\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4227\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4272\">Personality and interpersonal development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4273\" data-end=\"4345\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4273\" data-end=\"4301\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operating System Concepts</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4301\" data-end=\"4345\">Memory, processes, and system operations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4434\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4382\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Software Engineering and Modeling</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4434\">Software development lifecycle and system design</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4439\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8fkssq\" data-start=\"4441\" data-end=\"4479\">Importance of Data Structures in BCA</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4481\" data-end=\"4621\">Data structures are one of the most important subjects in computer science because they form the backbone of efficient software development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4623\" data-end=\"4645\">Students learn how to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4768\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a4qr13\" data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4674\">Organize data efficiently</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eyu75x\" data-start=\"4675\" data-end=\"4705\">Improve software performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"141nasz\" data-start=\"4706\" data-end=\"4744\">Solve complex computational problems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"egsv88\" data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4768\">Optimize applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4770\" data-end=\"4905\">Weak understanding of data structures often affects placement preparation because technical interviews heavily focus on these concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4907\" data-end=\"4910\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kg5ise\" data-start=\"4912\" data-end=\"4946\">Why Software Engineering Matters</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4948\" data-end=\"5090\">Many students focus only on coding languages and ignore software engineering principles. However, companies require developers who understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5092\" data-end=\"5200\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkjxdp\" data-start=\"5092\" data-end=\"5111\">Project workflows</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o3p6f9\" data-start=\"5112\" data-end=\"5134\">Requirement analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ccct11\" data-start=\"5135\" data-end=\"5158\">Testing methodologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1axhb20\" data-start=\"5159\" data-end=\"5180\">System architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yya73c\" data-start=\"5181\" data-end=\"5200\">Software modeling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5202\" data-end=\"5301\">This subject helps students understand how real-world software projects are managed professionally.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5303\" data-end=\"5306\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dyvhyz\" data-start=\"5308\" data-end=\"5372\">Semester 3: Database, Networking &amp; Object-Oriented Programming</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5374\" data-end=\"5505\">The third semester introduces database systems, networking fundamentals, computational statistics, and object-oriented programming.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"5507\" data-end=\"5527\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5529\" data-end=\"5925\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5529\" data-end=\"5562\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5529\" data-end=\"5562\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5529\" data-end=\"5540\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"5540\" data-end=\"5562\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5573\" data-end=\"5925\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5573\" data-end=\"5660\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5573\" data-end=\"5619\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to Database Management Systems</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5619\" data-end=\"5660\">Data storage and relational databases</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5661\" data-end=\"5725\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5661\" data-end=\"5688\" data-col-size=\"md\">Computational Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5688\" data-end=\"5725\">Statistical methods for computing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5726\" data-end=\"5779\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5726\" data-end=\"5744\" data-col-size=\"md\">Green Computing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5744\" data-end=\"5779\" data-col-size=\"md\">Sustainable computing practices</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5780\" data-end=\"5846\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5780\" data-end=\"5797\" data-col-size=\"md\">Network Basics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5797\" data-end=\"5846\">Networking concepts and communication systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5847\" data-end=\"5925\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5847\" data-end=\"5888\" data-col-size=\"md\">Object Oriented Programming Using Java</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5888\" data-end=\"5925\">OOP concepts and Java development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5927\" data-end=\"5930\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1nh2eow\" data-start=\"5932\" data-end=\"5971\">Why Java &amp; OOP Are Industry Important</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5973\" data-end=\"6051\">Object-oriented programming is widely used in enterprise software development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6053\" data-end=\"6085\">Java remains highly relevant in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6087\" data-end=\"6188\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18vodqs\" data-start=\"6087\" data-end=\"6112\">Enterprise applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13b6b3s\" data-start=\"6113\" data-end=\"6130\">Banking systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j6aiv4\" data-start=\"6131\" data-end=\"6152\">Android development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qlupoa\" data-start=\"6153\" data-end=\"6170\">Backend systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h5kpud\" data-start=\"6171\" data-end=\"6188\">Cloud platforms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6190\" data-end=\"6205\">Students learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6207\" data-end=\"6299\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16qm6ot\" data-start=\"6207\" data-end=\"6228\">Classes and objects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qm0rfo\" data-start=\"6229\" data-end=\"6242\">Inheritance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ay6jh\" data-start=\"6243\" data-end=\"6257\">Polymorphism</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pzvgzq\" data-start=\"6258\" data-end=\"6273\">Encapsulation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwudq1\" data-start=\"6274\" data-end=\"6299\">Modular software design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6301\" data-end=\"6370\">These concepts are essential for modern software engineering careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6375\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1mnno57\" data-start=\"6377\" data-end=\"6420\">Importance of Database Management Systems</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6422\" data-end=\"6474\">Almost every modern application relies on databases.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6476\" data-end=\"6507\">Students gain understanding of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6509\" data-end=\"6610\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wl0ikq\" data-start=\"6509\" data-end=\"6522\">SQL queries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdcpxb\" data-start=\"6523\" data-end=\"6540\">Database design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ubfni\" data-start=\"6541\" data-end=\"6557\">Data retrieval</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lgb268\" data-start=\"6558\" data-end=\"6585\">Data storage optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10eci53\" data-start=\"6586\" data-end=\"6610\">Information management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6612\" data-end=\"6712\">Database skills are highly valuable in software development, analytics, and cloud computing careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6714\" data-end=\"6717\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vf8z43\" data-start=\"6719\" data-end=\"6779\">Semester 4: Python, Cloud Computing &amp; Information Security</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6781\" data-end=\"6917\">The fourth semester introduces modern technologies including Python programming, cloud computing, data mining, and information security.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"6919\" data-end=\"6939\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"6941\" data-end=\"7395\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"6941\" data-end=\"6974\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6941\" data-end=\"6974\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"6941\" data-end=\"6952\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"6952\" data-end=\"6974\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"6985\" data-end=\"7395\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6985\" data-end=\"7076\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6985\" data-end=\"7031\" data-col-size=\"md\">Unix Operating System and Shell Programming</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"7031\" data-end=\"7076\">Linux systems and command-line operations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7077\" data-end=\"7135\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7077\" data-end=\"7098\" data-col-size=\"md\">Python Programming</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"7098\" data-end=\"7135\">Modern programming and automation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7136\" data-end=\"7228\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7136\" data-end=\"7186\" data-col-size=\"md\">Practical Approach to Data Mining and Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"7186\" data-end=\"7228\">Data extraction and analytical methods</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7229\" data-end=\"7300\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7229\" data-end=\"7255\" data-col-size=\"md\">Applied Cloud Computing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"7255\" data-end=\"7300\">Cloud platforms and infrastructure basics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7301\" data-end=\"7395\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7301\" data-end=\"7353\" data-col-size=\"md\">Information Security - Practitioner\'s Perspective</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"7353\" data-end=\"7395\">Security concepts and cyber protection</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7397\" data-end=\"7400\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"l4roqk\" data-start=\"7402\" data-end=\"7456\">Why Python Is One of the Most Important Skills Today</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7458\" data-end=\"7555\">Python has become one of the most in-demand programming languages globally because of its use in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7557\" data-end=\"7666\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u78spn\" data-start=\"7557\" data-end=\"7582\">Artificial intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmznp5\" data-start=\"7583\" data-end=\"7601\">Machine learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"399lfb\" data-start=\"7602\" data-end=\"7614\">Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13kuhim\" data-start=\"7615\" data-end=\"7631\">Data analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"144tqwh\" data-start=\"7632\" data-end=\"7648\">Cyber security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vetgzv\" data-start=\"7649\" data-end=\"7666\">Web development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7668\" data-end=\"7759\">Students with strong Python knowledge often gain better opportunities in modern IT sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7761\" data-end=\"7764\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q7aw9\" data-start=\"7766\" data-end=\"7806\">Importance of Cloud Computing Exposure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7808\" data-end=\"7871\">Cloud computing is now a critical technology across industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7873\" data-end=\"7924\">Companies increasingly rely on cloud platforms for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7926\" data-end=\"8029\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3mvvmp\" data-start=\"7926\" data-end=\"7940\">Data storage</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lji9cb\" data-start=\"7941\" data-end=\"7965\">Application deployment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sxxbv1\" data-start=\"7966\" data-end=\"7987\">Security management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yc90gn\" data-start=\"7988\" data-end=\"8001\">Scalability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"inrs64\" data-start=\"8002\" data-end=\"8029\">Infrastructure management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8031\" data-end=\"8119\">Learning cloud computing improves employability significantly in modern IT environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8121\" data-end=\"8124\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"kopvg2\" data-start=\"8126\" data-end=\"8192\">Semester 5: Artificial Intelligence, Cyber Security &amp; E-Commerce</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"8194\" data-end=\"8275\">The fifth semester focuses on emerging technologies and digital business systems.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"8277\" data-end=\"8297\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"8299\" data-end=\"8689\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"8299\" data-end=\"8332\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"8299\" data-end=\"8332\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"8299\" data-end=\"8310\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"8310\" data-end=\"8332\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"8343\" data-end=\"8689\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"8343\" data-end=\"8424\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8343\" data-end=\"8385\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Artificial Intelligence</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"8385\" data-end=\"8424\">AI concepts and intelligent systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8425\" data-end=\"8493\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8425\" data-end=\"8453\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fundamentals of Ecommerce</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"8453\" data-end=\"8493\">Digital business and online commerce</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8494\" data-end=\"8544\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8494\" data-end=\"8516\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"8516\" data-end=\"8544\">Ethical technology usage</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8545\" data-end=\"8632\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8545\" data-end=\"8584\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Practical Approach to Cyber Security</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"8584\" data-end=\"8632\">Cyber attack prevention and security systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8633\" data-end=\"8689\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8633\" data-end=\"8653\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cloud Development</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"8653\" data-end=\"8689\">Cloud-based software development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8691\" data-end=\"8694\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15e4k8i\" data-start=\"8696\" data-end=\"8751\">Why Artificial Intelligence Matters in Modern Careers</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"8753\" data-end=\"8804\">AI is transforming almost every industry including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8806\" data-end=\"8891\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16p2y2p\" data-start=\"8806\" data-end=\"8818\">Healthcare</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14a7y0w\" data-start=\"8819\" data-end=\"8828\">Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3lapp\" data-start=\"8829\" data-end=\"8841\">E-commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uwl75a\" data-start=\"8842\" data-end=\"8851\">Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3xmdbg\" data-start=\"8852\" data-end=\"8863\">Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0dh7m\" data-start=\"8864\" data-end=\"8875\">Education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ctpr48\" data-start=\"8876\" data-end=\"8891\">Manufacturing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8893\" data-end=\"8997\">Even foundational AI understanding significantly improves career opportunities in the technology sector.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8999\" data-end=\"9002\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rdbey7\" data-start=\"9004\" data-end=\"9042\">Growing Importance of Cyber Security</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9044\" data-end=\"9108\">As digital systems expand, cyber threats are increasing rapidly.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"9110\" data-end=\"9161\">Organizations now require professionals skilled in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9163\" data-end=\"9268\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t90ghs\" data-start=\"9163\" data-end=\"9181\">Network security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q1hz8k\" data-start=\"9182\" data-end=\"9208\">Ethical hacking concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wg13iz\" data-start=\"9209\" data-end=\"9226\">Data protection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12sncds\" data-start=\"9227\" data-end=\"9246\">Threat prevention</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xhv8cy\" data-start=\"9247\" data-end=\"9268\">Security monitoring</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"9270\" data-end=\"9351\">Cyber security is becoming one of the fastest-growing IT career domains globally.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9353\" data-end=\"9356\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xwo9n\" data-start=\"9358\" data-end=\"9425\">Semester 6: Advanced Security, Cloud Architecture &amp; Final Project</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9427\" data-end=\"9530\">The final semester focuses on advanced industry-oriented practical learning and project implementation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"9532\" data-end=\"9552\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"9554\" data-end=\"9877\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"9554\" data-end=\"9587\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"9554\" data-end=\"9587\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"9554\" data-end=\"9565\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"9565\" data-end=\"9587\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"9598\" data-end=\"9877\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"9598\" data-end=\"9659\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9598\" data-end=\"9614\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"9614\" data-end=\"9659\" data-col-size=\"md\">Real-world software or technology project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"9660\" data-end=\"9741\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9660\" data-end=\"9686\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Cyber Security</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"9686\" data-end=\"9741\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced protection systems and security techniques</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"9742\" data-end=\"9809\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9742\" data-end=\"9763\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cloud Architecture</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"9763\" data-end=\"9809\">Cloud infrastructure design and deployment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"9810\" data-end=\"9877\">\r\n<td data-start=\"9810\" data-end=\"9825\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cryptography</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"9825\" data-end=\"9877\">Data encryption and secure communication systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9879\" data-end=\"9882\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cqayx8\" data-start=\"9884\" data-end=\"9917\">Importance of the Major Project</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"9919\" data-end=\"10084\">The major project is one of the most important parts of the BCA curriculum because it allows students to apply their technical learning to practical problem-solving.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"10086\" data-end=\"10114\">Students gain experience in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10116\" data-end=\"10259\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"59ctvy\" data-start=\"10116\" data-end=\"10137\">Project development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t52ql1\" data-start=\"10138\" data-end=\"10163\">Software implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b277ju\" data-start=\"10164\" data-end=\"10184\">Team collaboration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1au0k3e\" data-start=\"10185\" data-end=\"10200\">Documentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"egm0fh\" data-start=\"10201\" data-end=\"10225\">Technical presentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xnve1d\" data-start=\"10226\" data-end=\"10259\">Real-world application building</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"10261\" data-end=\"10327\">Strong projects can significantly improve placement opportunities.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 250000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(340, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 52, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 07:24:30', '2026-06-16 07:34:42', '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"398\">The BA admission process is designed to provide students with a smooth and convenient enrollment experience. Whether students are planning careers in Economics, English, Political Science, Sociology, research, public administration, media, or higher education, understanding the admission steps properly helps avoid delays during registration and document verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"502\">The complete process is simple, student-friendly, and can generally be completed online from anywhere.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"507\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"nis0kc\" data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"544\">Step-by-Step BA Admission Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f67ya9\" data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"576\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"699\">The first step is choosing the BA specialization or program that matches your academic interests and future career goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"750\">Students can choose specialization areas such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"805\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c1jzmc\" data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"763\">Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l7hnru\" data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"773\">English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqbpbp\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"793\">Political Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ypifik\" data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"805\">Sociology</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"862\">Before selecting the program, students should consider:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"991\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o49pb\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"882\">Career interests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qzacuz\" data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"907\">Higher education plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oxz7o1\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"944\">Competitive exam preparation goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9x4l2a\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"964\">Subject strengths</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"djoeyd\" data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"991\">Future job opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1106\">Choosing the right specialization helps students build stronger academic and career direction from the beginning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1111\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"chdhb1\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1149\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1282\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the online application form with the required personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1321\">Applicants generally need to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uzprjw\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1334\">Full name</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b09bze\" data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1352\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1381\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1elagoi\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1403\">Address information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qptakz\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1422\">Academic records</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1538\">Students should ensure that all details entered in the application form are accurate and match official documents.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1543\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ajhke6\" data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1572\">Common Documents Required</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1801\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1606\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1606\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1595\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Documents</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1606\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1801\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1661\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10th Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1661\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1681\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12th Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1709\">Eligibility verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1762\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1737\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport-size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1762\">Identity verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1801\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1774\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ID Proof</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1801\">Personal identification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1894\">Providing incorrect or incomplete information may delay admission approval or verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1899\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zz7wxy\" data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1933\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"2057\">Once the application form is completed, students need to pay the program fee through the available online payment options.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2094\">Common payment methods may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2171\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nl3oci\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2108\">Debit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dn2lyp\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2122\">Credit Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lkc75d\" data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2136\">Net Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4vms\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2142\">UPI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"167094e\" data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2171\">EMI Options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2261\">The online payment system helps students complete the process securely and conveniently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2350\">Students should save fee payment receipts and transaction details for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2355\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2xelpe\" data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2385\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2492\">After successful fee payment, students must submit the application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2513\">This step confirms:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2634\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ijhy12\" data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2550\">Successful application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11uf4pc\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2575\">Fee payment completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1btw725\" data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2606\">Document upload verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b7fs52\" data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2634\">Registration confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2663\">Students generally receive:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2755\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7no12y\" data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2686\">Registration number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2u00t\" data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2713\">Application confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nbva6e\" data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2740\">Admission acknowledgment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ssiojy\" data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2755\">Reference ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2833\">These details are important for future admission tracking and communication.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2838\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vw8oac\" data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2875\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2985\">Once registration is completed, the university reviews the application and verifies all submitted documents.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3074\">After successful verification, students receive enrollment-related information such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3194\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bx4sz3\" data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3095\">Enrollment number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r16p5m\" data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3123\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nyka5o\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3148\">Learning portal access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fxj6ky\" data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3174\">Orientation information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kxexgb\" data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3194\">Academic guidance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3319\">Students should regularly check their registered email ID and mobile number for updates regarding admission and enrollment.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"378\">The BA program is designed for students who want to build careers in fields such as Economics, Sociology, English, Political Science, public administration, research, media, education, civil services, and social sciences. The eligibility criteria are simple and suitable for students who want to pursue higher education after completing Class 12.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"585\">This program helps students develop analytical thinking, communication skills, research ability, and subject specialization while preparing for both professional careers and higher education opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12o97j8\" data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"627\">Who Can Apply for the BA Program?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"657\">The BA program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"1063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eunfel\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"745\">10+2 pass students interested in Economics, Sociology, English, or Political Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dyl3st\" data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"818\">Students preparing for competitive examinations and government careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csa0c6\" data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"899\">Aspirants planning careers in teaching, journalism, public policy, or research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"58olff\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"975\">Learners interested in social sciences, literature, politics, and society</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1absrzd\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1063\">Students aiming for higher studies such as MA, MBA, LLB, Journalism, or Public Policy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1192\">The program provides strong academic foundations along with practical understanding of social, political, and economic systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17d46sf\" data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1244\">BA Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1327\">Indian applicants must fulfill the following academic requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1368\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1368\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1357\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Qualification Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1368\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1404\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10th Class Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1450\">Completion of 10 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1476\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12th Class Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1522\">Completion of 12 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1658\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations are also eligible to apply, subject to final result verification and document submission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1744\">NIOS board candidates are eligible if they fulfill the required academic conditions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1749\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7j9uzd\" data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1781\">English Language Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1849\">Applicants must possess basic proficiency in the English language.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1884\">Since the BA curriculum includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k1ykph\" data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1904\">Academic writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fwn9e8\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1920\">Research work</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z73kb1\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1936\">Presentations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b2or74\" data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1957\">Literature studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"163o03f\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1988\">Communication-based subjects</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2083\">basic English understanding is important for successful learning and classroom participation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2204\">Candidates from non-English medium backgrounds must have completed at least three years of education in English medium.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2254\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2356\">International students applying for the BA program must complete equivalent academic qualifications.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2591\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2397\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2397\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2386\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Qualification Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2397\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2591\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2430\" data-col-size=\"sm\">O Level Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2499\" data-col-size=\"md\">Completion of 10 years of formal schooling (Diploma not accepted)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2591\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2522\" data-col-size=\"sm\">A Level Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2591\">Completion of 12 years of formal schooling (Diploma not accepted)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2674\">Students must provide valid academic documents during admission and verification.</p>', '<p data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"442\">Understanding the BA fee structure is important for students and parents before taking admission because it helps in better financial planning throughout the course duration. The program offers multiple payment options including one-time payment, annual payment, semester-wise payment, and no-cost EMI facilities, making higher education more flexible and accessible for students from different financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"646\">The flexible fee structure allows students to choose a payment method according to their convenience while pursuing academic specializations such as Economics, English, Political Science, and Sociology.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"651\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rieaol\" data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"680\">BA Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"848\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"708\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"708\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"698\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"848\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"751\">\r\n<td data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"738\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"751\">₹1,01,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n<td data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"765\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"776\">₹36,420</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"807\">\r\n<td data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"796\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"807\">₹19,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"848\">\r\n<td data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"832\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"848\">₹4,552/month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"853\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tjzp9f\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"880\">One-Time Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"1002\">Students choosing the one-time payment option can complete the entire program fee at once and receive self-pay benefits.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1112\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1029\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1029\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1019\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1029\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1112\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1068\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1055\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Original Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1068\">₹1,15,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1112\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1099\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effective Fee After Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1112\">₹1,01,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvxiq6\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1145\">Benefits of One-Time Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1330\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ijykmq\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1174\">Lower overall course cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ntjvkw\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1222\">Easy fee management without repeated payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1auab3m\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1268\">No future payment burden during the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1abbhii\" data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1330\">Suitable for students preferring single-payment convenience</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1421\">This option is often beneficial for students who want to reduce the total payable amount.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"j8xrd8\" data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1450\">Annual Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1566\">The annual payment option allows students to pay the fee year-wise instead of paying the complete amount together.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1603\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1603\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1593\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Payment Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1603\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Original Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1647\">₹38,334</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1678\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effective Fee After Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1689\">₹36,420</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xb6q7r\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1722\">Advantages of Annual Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1896\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6zlws\" data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1754\">Better financial flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8g6spd\" data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1793\">Reduced immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1017kyd\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1832\">Easier yearly budgeting for families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y7qhmt\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1896\">Suitable for students preferring medium-term payment planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1901\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1t1n50e\" data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1932\">Semester-Wise Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2030\">Students can also choose the semester-wise payment option for more manageable academic payments.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2098\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2057\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2057\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2047\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2057\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2098\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2098\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2087\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2098\">₹19,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2182\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2142\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2142\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2119\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay Benefit</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2142\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effective Total Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2182\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2182\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2169\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effective Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2182\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,15,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2278\">This option helps students distribute educational expenses across the duration of the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2283\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"170q69y\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2315\">24 Months No-Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2434\">The BA program also provides a 24-month no-cost EMI facility for students seeking affordable monthly payment options.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2525\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2457\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2457\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2447\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2457\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2525\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2498\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2482\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2498\">₹4,552/month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2525\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2510\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2525\">0% Interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2637\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2551\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2551\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2541\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Benefit</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2551\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2637\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2593\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2577\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Original Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2593\">₹4,792/month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2637\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2624\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effective Fee After Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2637\">₹1,09,260</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ucxeha\" data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2665\">Benefits of No-Cost EMI</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2853\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vivz2o\" data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2714\">Makes higher education financially accessible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10whx02\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2753\">Reduces large upfront payment burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ndhqe\" data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2790\">Allows monthly payment convenience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vuf3l\" data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2853\">Helps students continue studies with manageable installments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2970\">Students should still review EMI terms, eligibility conditions, and payment schedules before selecting this option.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"486\">The BA program is designed to provide students with strong academic knowledge, analytical thinking, communication skills, and subject specialization across disciplines like Economics, English, Political Science, and Sociology. The curriculum combines theoretical learning with practical understanding of society, politics, literature, economics, public policy, research methods, and global issues.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"843\">One of the biggest advantages of this BA curriculum is the flexibility it offers through multiple specialization options. Students can build expertise in their preferred subject while also developing communication, research, critical thinking, and analytical skills that are highly valuable across government, private, academic, media, and social sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"1044\">The program gradually moves from foundational concepts in the early semesters to advanced research, policy, international studies, literature analysis, and applied social sciences in later semesters.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1049\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ys51vk\" data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1079\">BA Specializations Offered</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1130\">Students can choose specialization areas such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1185\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c1jzmc\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1143\">Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l7hnru\" data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1153\">English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqbpbp\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1173\">Political Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ypifik\" data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1185\">Sociology</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1279\">Each specialization is designed to provide both academic depth and career-oriented learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1284\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1i4xzfs\" data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1329\">Semester 1: Building Academic Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1482\">The first semester focuses on introducing students to core concepts of their chosen specialization along with communication and analytical development.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yfgite\" data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1505\">Key Learning Areas</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17l6hyy\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1520\">Economics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1536\">Students learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nr9lji\" data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1554\">Micro Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0slsr\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1588\">Fundamentals of Macro Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ksdmlj\" data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1616\">Economic History of India</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hwvu7i\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1641\">Business Communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vaosqc\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1654\">English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1670\">Students study:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1800\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjo3vk\" data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1702\">History of English Literature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ktdvje\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1736\">Elizabethan &amp; Restoration Drama</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m7vh5k\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1775\">English Poetry from Chaucer to Blake</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hwvu7i\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1800\">Business Communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"27ypaz\" data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1823\">Political Science</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1841\">Subjects include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1937\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dpiugd\" data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1864\">Nationalism in India</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15644mc\" data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1891\">Introduction to Politics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vr9v3w\" data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1910\">Political Theory</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1osifp5\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1937\">Indian Political Thought</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7s52oy\" data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1952\">Sociology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1970\">Students explore:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ktcg3\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1996\">Indian Social Structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cpcdtg\" data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2018\">Social Institutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"104jad8\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2047\">Kinship, Marriage &amp; Family</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"amdq2f\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2075\">Introduction to Sociology</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2228\">The first semester helps students develop foundational understanding of society, politics, economics, and literature depending on their specialization.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2233\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1yqobdq\" data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2280\">Semester 2: Expanding Subject Understanding</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2415\">The second semester strengthens theoretical concepts while introducing environmental studies, research, and advanced academic topics.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12m3iot\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2442\">Major Subjects Covered</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2706\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2481\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2481\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2461\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2481\" data-col-size=\"md\">Important Topics</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2706\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2552\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2504\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2552\">Statistical Methods, Micro &amp; Macro Economics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2596\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2563\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2596\" data-col-size=\"md\">Indian English Poetry &amp; Novel</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2652\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2617\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Political Science</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2652\" data-col-size=\"md\">Constitutional History of India</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2706\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2665\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sociology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2706\" data-col-size=\"md\">Population Studies &amp; Social Movements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2826\">Students also study Environmental Studies, which helps build awareness about sustainability and social responsibility.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2831\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hf62ke\" data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2883\">Semester 3: Analytical &amp; Research-Based Learning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2885\" data-end=\"2988\">In the third semester, students begin developing deeper analytical and research-oriented understanding.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7ob88c\" data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3011\">Important Subjects</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17l6hyy\" data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3026\">Economics</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3087\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fjoxu6\" data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3052\">International Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hz6b26\" data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3065\">Demography</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1scr65b\" data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3087\">Statistical Methods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vaosqc\" data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3100\">English</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3156\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gufgtx\" data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3121\">Literary Criticism</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i6skk\" data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3137\">English Novel</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4zz5gr\" data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3156\">Creative Writing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"27ypaz\" data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3179\">Political Science</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3251\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xq2rpj\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3203\">Public Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11g0l76\" data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3226\">Comparative Politics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p6dwt5\" data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3251\">Contemporary Diplomacy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7s52oy\" data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3266\">Sociology</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3333\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y9niy3\" data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3290\">Social Stratification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"348ek2\" data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3314\">Sociology of Deviance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bwqpkt\" data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3333\">Research Methods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3481\">This semester focuses heavily on analytical thinking, writing ability, research skills, and understanding real-world social and political systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3486\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"sno651\" data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3538\">Semester 4: Advanced &amp; Applied Subject Knowledge</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3630\">The fourth semester introduces advanced academic concepts and applied learning approaches.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ge1nxq\" data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3655\">Major Learning Areas</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3657\" data-end=\"3942\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3657\" data-end=\"3688\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3657\" data-end=\"3688\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3657\" data-end=\"3674\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3688\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Topics</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3942\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3757\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Economics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3757\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industrial Economics, Economic Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3801\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3768\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3801\" data-col-size=\"md\">Literary Theory, Modern Drama</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3802\" data-end=\"3873\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3802\" data-end=\"3822\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Political Science</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3873\">Public Policy, Global Concerns, Indian Politics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3942\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3886\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sociology</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3886\" data-end=\"3942\">Gender Studies, Urban Sociology, Political Sociology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"4057\">Students also begin understanding policy-making, social development, globalization, and applied economic systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4059\" data-end=\"4062\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ql5wzn\" data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4116\">Semester 5: Specialized &amp; Career-Oriented Learning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4212\">The fifth semester focuses on specialized topics and industry-relevant academic understanding.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1148t19\" data-start=\"4214\" data-end=\"4229\">Key Subjects</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17l6hyy\" data-start=\"4231\" data-end=\"4244\">Economics</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4332\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ou8lrn\" data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4263\">Labour Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1revomg\" data-start=\"4264\" data-end=\"4282\">Health Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43oekg\" data-start=\"4283\" data-end=\"4306\">Behavioural Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6h3hv0\" data-start=\"4307\" data-end=\"4332\">Environmental Economics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vaosqc\" data-start=\"4334\" data-end=\"4345\">English</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4429\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8bhcww\" data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4369\">Modern English Poetry</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zjsybx\" data-start=\"4370\" data-end=\"4386\">American Drama</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i4tmuh\" data-start=\"4387\" data-end=\"4407\">African Literature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"thwfsz\" data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4429\">Professional Ethics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"27ypaz\" data-start=\"4431\" data-end=\"4452\">Political Science</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4521\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5plo5k\" data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4472\">International Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n4266v\" data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4497\">India&rsquo;s Foreign Policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yru64b\" data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4521\">Constitution of India</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7s52oy\" data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"4536\">Sociology</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4537\" data-end=\"4607\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1na1vor\" data-start=\"4537\" data-end=\"4559\">Industrial Sociology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eg78gp\" data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4581\">Sociology of Health</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"syzth1\" data-start=\"4582\" data-end=\"4607\">Globalization &amp; Society</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4609\" data-end=\"4724\">This semester helps students connect academic learning with practical societal, economic, and political challenges.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4726\" data-end=\"4729\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gv058m\" data-start=\"4731\" data-end=\"4782\">Semester 6: Research, Projects &amp; Advanced Studies</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4784\" data-end=\"4890\">The final semester focuses on advanced understanding, major projects, dissertations, and applied research.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7ob88c\" data-start=\"4892\" data-end=\"4913\">Important Subjects</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4915\" data-end=\"5224\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4915\" data-end=\"4957\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4915\" data-end=\"4957\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4915\" data-end=\"4932\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4932\" data-end=\"4957\" data-col-size=\"md\">Final Semester Topics</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4968\" data-end=\"5224\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4968\" data-end=\"5031\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4968\" data-end=\"4980\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Economics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4980\" data-end=\"5031\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Markets, Growth Models, Major Project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5032\" data-end=\"5080\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5032\" data-end=\"5042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5080\" data-col-size=\"md\">Modern English Novel, Dissertation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5081\" data-end=\"5151\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5081\" data-end=\"5101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Political Science</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5101\" data-end=\"5151\" data-col-size=\"md\">Foreign Policy, Budget Analysis, Major Project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5152\" data-end=\"5224\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5152\" data-end=\"5164\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sociology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5164\" data-end=\"5224\" data-col-size=\"md\">Economic Sociology, Sociology of Religion, Major Project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"5226\" data-end=\"5340\">The major project or dissertation helps students apply their academic learning to practical research and analysis.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 115000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(341, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 53, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-08 07:31:32', '2026-06-16 07:35:07', NULL, 1, NULL, '<p data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"481\">Understanding the BA Journalism &amp; Mass Communication fee structure is important for students planning careers in journalism, digital media, advertising, public relations, filmmaking, content creation, and mass communication. The program offers flexible payment options including one-time payment, annual payment, semester-wise fees, and no-cost EMI facilities, helping students manage educational expenses more conveniently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"676\">The fee structure is designed to make media and communication education more accessible while allowing students to choose a payment plan according to their financial comfort and academic goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"681\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"i7pkyx\" data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"742\">BA Journalism &amp; Mass Communication Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"770\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"770\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"760\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"813\">\r\n<td data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"800\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"813\">₹1,67,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<td data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"827\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"838\">₹60,170</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"869\">\r\n<td data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"858\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"869\">₹31,700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<td data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"894\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"910\">₹7,521/month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"915\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tjzp9f\" data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"942\">One-Time Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"1060\">Students choosing the one-time payment option can pay the complete course fee at once and receive self-pay benefits.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1090\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1090\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1080\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1090\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1116\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Original Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1129\">₹1,90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1160\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effective Fee After Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1173\">₹1,67,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gvxiq6\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1206\">Benefits of One-Time Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1336\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ijykmq\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1235\">Lower overall course cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d6l4da\" data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1281\">No repeated fee payments during the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rzps7a\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1308\">Better long-term savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11701mk\" data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1336\">Easy financial management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1450\">This option is suitable for students who prefer completing the financial process at the beginning of the course.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1455\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"j8xrd8\" data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1479\">Annual Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1599\">The annual fee option allows students to pay the program fee year-wise instead of paying the complete amount together.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1718\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1632\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1632\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1622\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1632\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1718\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1676\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1665\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Original Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1676\">₹63,334</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1718\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1707\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effective Fee After Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1718\">₹60,170</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xb6q7r\" data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1751\">Advantages of Annual Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1898\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cjoofz\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1781\">Better payment flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ahkxq\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1818\">Reduced immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"skkjqs\" data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1854\">Easier yearly education budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d9mjz3\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1898\">Suitable for long-term financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1979\">This option is often preferred by students seeking balanced payment management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"1984\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1t1n50e\" data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2015\">Semester-Wise Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2101\">Students can also choose semester-wise fee payments throughout the program duration.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2169\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2128\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2128\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2128\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2169\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2169\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2158\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2169\">₹31,700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2253\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2213\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2213\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2190\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay Benefit</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effective Total Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2253\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2253\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2240\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effective Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2253\">₹1,90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2359\">Semester-wise payment helps students distribute educational expenses more comfortably during the course.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2364\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"170q69y\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2396\">24 Months No-Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2516\">The program also provides a 24-month no-cost EMI facility for students looking for affordable monthly payment options.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2607\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2539\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2539\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2529\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2539\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2607\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2580\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2564\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2580\">₹7,521/month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2607\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2592\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2607\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0% Interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2719\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2623\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Benefit</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2633\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2719\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2675\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2659\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Original EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2675\">₹7,917/month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2719\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2706\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effective Fee After Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2719\">₹1,80,510</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ucxeha\" data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2747\">Benefits of No-Cost EMI</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2888\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xwa8vz\" data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2782\">Affordable monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wxrmzg\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2814\">No additional interest burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gohz26\" data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2855\">Easier financial planning for families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vyzppn\" data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2888\">Reduces large upfront payments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2975\">Students should review EMI terms and payment conditions before selecting this option.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"480\">The BA Journalism &amp; Mass Communication curriculum is designed to prepare students for careers in media, journalism, advertising, public relations, digital communication, filmmaking, broadcasting, and content creation. The program combines theoretical understanding with practical media training, helping students build industry-relevant communication and production skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"884\">In today&rsquo;s digital era, the media industry is rapidly expanding across television, radio, digital platforms, social media, advertising agencies, news organizations, and corporate communication sectors. This curriculum focuses on modern communication methods, digital storytelling, media ethics, marketing, content development, and campaign planning to help students become industry-ready professionals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"1076\">The semester-wise structure gradually develops students&rsquo; understanding of journalism, media production, advertising, public relations, photography, digital media, and communication strategy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1081\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"687hm6\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1147\">Semester 1: Introduction to Media &amp; Communication Fundamentals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1313\">The first semester focuses on introducing students to the basics of journalism, communication theories, visual communication, and professional communication skills.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1335\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1370\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1370\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1348\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1370\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1474\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1420\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mass Communication Models and Theory</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1474\">Basics of communication systems and media theories</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1494\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Print Journalism</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1547\">News writing, reporting, and newspaper journalism</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1631\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1584\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graphics and Visual Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1631\">Visual storytelling and media design basics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1657\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1711\">Professional communication and presentation skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1853\">This semester helps students understand how media and communication industries function while building foundational communication abilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1858\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kuau0x\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1907\">Semester 2: Audio, Photography &amp; Media Ethics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"2012\">The second semester introduces students to radio communication, photography techniques, and media laws.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2034\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2069\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2069\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2047\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2069\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2174\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2124\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to Radio and Audio Technique</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2174\">Audio production and radio broadcasting basics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2254\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2209\" data-col-size=\"md\">Photography Theory and Practice</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2254\">Camera techniques and visual storytelling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2322\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2279\" data-col-size=\"md\">Media Ethics and Laws</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2322\">Ethical practices and media regulations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2347\" data-col-size=\"md\">Environmental Studies</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2393\">Environmental awareness and sustainability</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2538\">Students begin learning practical media production skills along with understanding ethical responsibilities in journalism and media industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2543\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"a6stb4\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2599\">Semester 3: Advertising, Television &amp; Media Research</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2714\">The third semester focuses on advertising, television production, media research, and global media understanding.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2736\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"3170\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2771\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2771\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2771\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"3170\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2851\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2805\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advertising Concepts</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2851\">Advertising principles and campaign basics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2938\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2892\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Television Production</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2938\">TV production techniques and studio basics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"3014\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2972\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Media Research</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3014\">Research methods and audience analysis</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3081\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3039\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Global Media Scenario</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3081\">International media systems and trends</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3170\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3170\">Personality and interpersonal development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3267\">This semester helps students develop creative, analytical, and production-related media skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3272\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12pe416\" data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3320\">Semester 4: Digital Media &amp; Public Relations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3440\">The fourth semester introduces online journalism, digital communication, public relations, and marketing fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3462\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3905\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3497\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3497\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3475\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3497\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3905\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3595\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3546\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online Journalism and Digital Media</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3595\">Digital reporting and online content creation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3659\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3610\" data-col-size=\"md\">PR Concepts</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3610\" data-end=\"3659\" data-col-size=\"md\">Public relations strategies and communication</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3756\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3704\" data-col-size=\"md\">Communication for Sustainable Development</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3704\" data-end=\"3756\">Media role in social and sustainable development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3838\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3785\" data-col-size=\"md\">Principles of Marketing I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3838\">Marketing fundamentals and consumer understanding</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3905\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3864\" data-col-size=\"md\">Writing for Specialism</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3864\" data-end=\"3905\">Specialized media and content writing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"4024\">Students learn how modern media industries operate across digital platforms and corporate communication environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4029\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"z1rp34\" data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4084\">Semester 5: Event Management, Filmmaking &amp; Branding</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4086\" data-end=\"4192\">The fifth semester focuses on creative media production, event management, branding, and client servicing.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"4194\" data-end=\"4214\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4634\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4249\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4249\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4227\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4249\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4634\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4335\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4288\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Event Management Concepts</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4288\" data-end=\"4335\">Event planning and media event coordination</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4408\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4361\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Film Making Techniques</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4361\" data-end=\"4408\">Film production and storytelling techniques</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4409\" data-end=\"4497\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4409\" data-end=\"4442\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Client Servicing and Creatives</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4442\" data-end=\"4497\">Agency communication and creative campaign handling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4563\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4517\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Brand Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4517\" data-end=\"4563\">Brand strategy and marketing communication</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4564\" data-end=\"4634\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4564\" data-end=\"4586\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4586\" data-end=\"4634\">Professional standards and ethical practices</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4749\">This semester helps students understand the commercial and creative side of the media and communication industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4751\" data-end=\"4754\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wpicdd\" data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4817\">Semester 6: Campaign Planning &amp; Digital Content Development</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4819\" data-end=\"4941\">The final semester focuses on advanced public relations, digital marketing, practical production skills, and project work.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4m0qky\" data-start=\"4943\" data-end=\"4963\">Subjects Included</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"5410\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"4998\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"4998\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"4976\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4976\" data-end=\"4998\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5410\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5093\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5036\" data-col-size=\"md\">PR and Campaign Planning</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5036\" data-end=\"5093\">Public relations campaigns and communication planning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5094\" data-end=\"5154\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5094\" data-end=\"5110\" data-col-size=\"md\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5110\" data-end=\"5154\">Practical media or communication project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5155\" data-end=\"5226\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5155\" data-end=\"5175\" data-col-size=\"md\">Camera Operations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5175\" data-end=\"5226\">Technical camera handling and production skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5227\" data-end=\"5322\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5227\" data-end=\"5271\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Marketing and Content Development</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5271\" data-end=\"5322\">Online marketing and digital content strategies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5323\" data-end=\"5410\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5323\" data-end=\"5361\" data-col-size=\"md\">Ad Production and Campaign Planning</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5361\" data-end=\"5410\">Advertising production and campaign execution</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"5412\" data-end=\"5520\">The major project allows students to apply their learning to real-world media or communication-related work.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 167200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(342, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 286, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 00:02:21', '2026-06-16 07:35:27', '<p data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"426\">The MBA in Finance admission process is designed to be simple, flexible, and student-friendly. The complete process can be completed online, allowing students and working professionals to apply conveniently from anywhere. From program selection to final enrollment confirmation, each step is structured to ensure a smooth admission experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"645\">Students interested in building careers in banking, investment management, corporate finance, insurance, and financial services can follow the admission procedure below to secure enrollment in the MBA Finance program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"650\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1oe9uxw\" data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"688\">MBA Finance Admission Process 2026</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"806\">The admission process includes five major steps that guide students from application submission to final enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"811\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"eeuf76\" data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"842\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"978\">The first step in the admission process is choosing the MBA Finance program according to your career goals and professional interests.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cjvtyk\" data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1008\">What Students Need to Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1226\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f402pf\" data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1045\">Explore the MBA Finance curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wh88p8\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1075\">Review eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2n03g\" data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1117\">Check fee structure and payment options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ug1yyg\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1169\">Understand career opportunities after the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12yddxh\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1226\">Select the specialization that matches long-term goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fg0bqg\" data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1258\">Why This Step Is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1431\">Choosing the right management specialization is essential because it directly influences future career opportunities in finance, banking, investment, and corporate sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1599\">Students should carefully evaluate their interests in financial analysis, investment planning, risk management, or corporate finance before proceeding with admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1viqrjy\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1641\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1777\">After selecting the program, candidates must fill out the online application form with the required academic and personal information.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fiy0o0\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1813\">Information Generally Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t7bwlu\" data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1832\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1861\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1883\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9yt0qi\" data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1900\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kiptgx\" data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1921\">Academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l9kzjk\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1942\">Recent photographs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"llz\" data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1968\">Important Guidelines</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2147\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dxq1hv\" data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2005\">Ensure all information is accurate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r8vrgq\" data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2054\">Verify spelling and academic details carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18srdub\" data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2089\">Upload clear and valid documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tbr3s6\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2147\">Double-check eligibility requirements before submission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"110ikka\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2177\">Common Mistakes to Avoid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2320\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1einov1\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2209\">Incorrect contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xhhyol\" data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2239\">Uploading unclear documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ypw4wy\" data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2278\">Entering mismatched academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v0947t\" data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2320\">Submitting incomplete application forms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2418\">Properly filling out the application form helps avoid delays during verification and enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2423\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16w6tlx\" data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2456\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2580\">Once the application form is completed, students must pay the applicable program fees using the available payment methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2611\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2697\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pgy04u\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2630\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xm72ul\" data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2651\">Annual fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1khgit5\" data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2675\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f0vv0e\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2697\">No-cost EMI options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hnzf6g\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2719\">Payment Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2848\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7c67jj\" data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2750\">Secure online payment system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a3zedj\" data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2775\">Flexible payment plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1om57ke\" data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2814\">EMI support for easier affordability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wbyrgs\" data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2848\">Convenient digital transactions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2962\">Students should save payment receipts and transaction details for future reference during the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"2967\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cfgr7l\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"2996\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3111\">After successful fee payment, candidates must submit the final application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3142\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3290\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lqdsk7\" data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3184\">Final verification of submitted details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pty1b0\" data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3225\">Confirmation of application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zu0euu\" data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3259\">Registration process completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m50hn8\" data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3290\">Initial admission processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y7wyk9\" data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3320\">Why Registration Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3438\">Registration officially records the student&rsquo;s admission request and begins the verification and enrollment procedure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3567\">Students should ensure all submitted information is correct before final submission because changes may become difficult later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3572\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1tozxz\" data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3608\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3610\" data-end=\"3722\">After completing registration, students need to wait for official enrollment confirmation and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w362g\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3754\">Students Typically Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3885\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s7ga8z\" data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3780\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r16p5m\" data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3808\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nyka5o\" data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3833\">Learning portal access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m8bwtm\" data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3855\">Academic guidelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"huhm4k\" data-start=\"3856\" data-end=\"3885\">Course commencement details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"o9nv40\" data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3918\">Next Steps After Enrollment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"4041\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tlpwrf\" data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"3943\">Access study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kema0t\" data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"3973\">Attend orientation sessions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"814emw\" data-start=\"3974\" data-end=\"3996\">Begin online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qewet\" data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4041\">Participate in assignments and assessments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4157\">This final stage completes the admission process and officially starts the student&rsquo;s MBA Finance learning journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4162\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1x8fsbj\" data-start=\"4164\" data-end=\"4219\">Documents Commonly Required for MBA Finance Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4301\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4303\" data-end=\"4699\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4303\" data-end=\"4334\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4303\" data-end=\"4334\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4303\" data-end=\"4323\" data-col-size=\"md\">Required Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"4323\" data-end=\"4334\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4699\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4404\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4376\" data-col-size=\"md\">10th Marksheet &amp; Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4404\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4405\" data-end=\"4468\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4405\" data-end=\"4436\" data-col-size=\"md\">12th Marksheet &amp; Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4468\">Academic qualification proof</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4527\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4499\" data-col-size=\"md\">Graduation Marksheet/Degree</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4499\" data-end=\"4527\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4564\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4539\" data-col-size=\"md\">ID Proof</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4539\" data-end=\"4564\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identity confirmation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4565\" data-end=\"4625\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4565\" data-end=\"4592\" data-col-size=\"md\">Passport Size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4592\" data-end=\"4625\">Student profile documentation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4626\" data-end=\"4699\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4626\" data-end=\"4670\" data-col-size=\"md\">Work Experience Documents (if applicable)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4670\" data-end=\"4699\">Professional verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4802\">International students may also require additional educational equivalency or professional documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"478\">The MBA in Finance program is designed for students and working professionals who want to build strong expertise in financial management, banking, investment analysis, corporate finance, and related business sectors. The program is suitable for fresh graduates, final-year students, entrepreneurs, and professionals aiming to advance their careers in the finance industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"654\">The eligibility criteria ensure that students possess the required academic background and foundational education needed to successfully pursue management studies in finance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1356\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"fw79iy\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1412\">MBA Finance Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1522\">Indian students must fulfill the following academic requirements for admission into the MBA Finance program.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"2014\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1561\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1561\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1550\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1561\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"2014\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1652\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1593\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10th Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1652\">10th Class Certificate with formal schooling completion</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1724\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1674\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12th Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1724\">12th Class Certificate from a recognized board</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1789\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1750\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1789\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1884\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1812\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Year Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1884\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students appearing for final-year graduation exams are also eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1906\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diploma Acceptance</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1942\" data-col-size=\"md\">Diploma holders are not eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"2014\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1959\" data-col-size=\"sm\">NIOS Students</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2014\">Candidates from recognized NIOS boards are eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2019\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w5wbjn\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2054\">Academic Qualification Details</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"p979m2\" data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2082\">10th Class Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2181\">Students must have completed 10 years of formal schooling through a recognized educational board.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"f23hm0\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2209\">12th Class Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2339\">Candidates should have successfully completed Class 12 from a recognized board in any stream such as Commerce, Science, or Arts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2hhhsx\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2367\">Graduation Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2553\">Applicants must hold a bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline from a recognized university. Students from B.Com, BBA, BA, B.Sc, BCA, Engineering, and other academic backgrounds can apply.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kj4x5t\" data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2589\">Final Year Student Eligibility</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2772\">Students appearing for their final year graduation examinations are also eligible to apply for admission, subject to completion of degree requirements within the specified timeline.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8ij2o7\" data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2794\">Diploma Criteria</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2923\">Candidates holding only diploma qualifications without a recognized bachelor&rsquo;s degree are generally not eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2928\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"umy90h\" data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2985\">MBA Finance Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3076\">International students must fulfill the following academic and professional requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3462\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3115\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3115\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3104\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3115\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3462\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3196\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">O Level Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3196\">Completion of 10 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3267\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3221\" data-col-size=\"sm\">A Level Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3267\">Completion of 12 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3332\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3293\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3332\" data-col-size=\"md\">Degree from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3401\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3351\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Work Experience</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3401\" data-col-size=\"md\">Minimum 36 months of executive work experience</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3462\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3423\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diploma Acceptance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3462\">Diplomas are generally not accepted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3467\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ye3zl0\" data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3520\">Eligibility Details for International Applicants</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1flozkf\" data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3558\">O Level and A Level Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3695\">Foreign students must complete educational qualifications equivalent to Indian 10th and 12th standards through recognized institutions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2hhhsx\" data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3723\">Graduation Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3725\" data-end=\"3841\">Applicants should possess a valid undergraduate degree from a recognized university or higher education institution.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19z2f15\" data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3872\">Executive Work Experience</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"4060\">International applicants are generally required to have at least 36 months of executive-level work experience. This helps ensure professional readiness for advanced management education.</p>', '<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"369\">The MBA in Finance program offers flexible fee payment options for students, including one-time payment, annual payment, semester-wise payment, and no-cost EMI facilities. This flexibility helps students choose a payment structure according to their financial comfort and academic planning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"571\">The fee structure is designed to make management education more accessible while providing value through industry-oriented curriculum, practical learning, and career-focused specialization in finance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"576\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1aez5mb\" data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"605\">MBA Finance Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"1008\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"678\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"678\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"628\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"641\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"667\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discounted/Self Pay Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"678\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"1008\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"775\">\r\n<td data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"716\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"728\">₹1,50,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"740\">₹1,38,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"775\">Best option for maximum savings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"845\">\r\n<td data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"789\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"799\">₹75,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"809\">₹71,250</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"845\">Pay yearly with self-pay benefit</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"927\">\r\n<td data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"865\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"875\">₹37,500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"893\">₹1,50,000 Total</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"927\">Flexible semester-wise payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"1008\">\r\n<td data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"952\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"967\">₹6,250/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"982\">₹5,938/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1008\">0% interest EMI option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1013\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tjzp9f\" data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1040\">One-Time Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1154\">Students who choose the one-time payment option receive the highest fee benefit compared to other payment plans.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1171\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1225\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"udtn2o\" data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1197\">Original Fee: ₹1,50,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sa2lcr\" data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1225\">Discounted Fee: ₹1,38,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1239\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gj21sr\" data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1268\">Lower overall program cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"166zoum\" data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1298\">No repeated payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1quxf2e\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1325\">Better financial savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14rbywz\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1388\">Suitable for students planning long-term education budgeting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1489\">This option is ideal for students who want to reduce the total financial burden of the MBA program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1494\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cdcpkw\" data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1523\">Annual Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1639\">The annual payment structure allows students to pay fees year-wise instead of paying the complete amount together.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1656\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1712\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjkzxm\" data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1678\">Annual Fee: ₹75,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i5wb9l\" data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1712\">Effective Self Pay Fee: ₹71,250</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l3n95q\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1728\">Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1842\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uyhfan\" data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1763\">Easier yearly financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8g6spd\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1802\">Reduced immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14xx8al\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1842\">More manageable than lump-sum payment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1930\">Students who prefer balanced financial flexibility generally choose this payment mode.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1935\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"so292p\" data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1964\">Semester-Wise Fee Payment</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2077\">The semester-wise payment option provides maximum flexibility by allowing students to pay before each semester.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2094\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2153\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fx4wex\" data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2122\">Per Semester Fee: ₹37,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r6anun\" data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2153\">Total Program Fee: ₹1,50,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2167\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2272\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kt3y5e\" data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2195\">Flexible payment schedule</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zumztn\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2232\">Suitable for working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1278jg0\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2272\">Lower short-term financial commitment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2377\">This option is commonly preferred by students who want gradual fee payments during the course duration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2382\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"170q69y\" data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2414\">24 Months No-Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2559\">The MBA Finance program also offers a no-cost EMI facility that helps students continue their education without paying the full amount upfront.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2576\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2696\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7halru\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2607\">EMI Amount: ₹5,938 per month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1454vd7\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2640\">Standard EMI: ₹6,250 per month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"od1cyt\" data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2669\">Interest Rate: 0% Interest</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15dha8y\" data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2696\">Effective Fee: ₹1,42,500</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"485\">An MBA in Finance is designed to provide students with strong knowledge of financial management, investment strategies, risk analysis, corporate finance, and business decision-making. The program combines theoretical concepts with practical financial applications to prepare students for careers in banking, investment management, corporate finance, fintech, insurance, and financial consulting.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"694\">The curriculum is divided into four semesters, where students gradually learn accounting fundamentals, investment analysis, portfolio management, treasury operations, and research-based financial strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"699\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1v9p009\" data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"737\">MBA Finance Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"761\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"894\">The first semester focuses on building a strong foundation in accounting, economics, finance, statistics, and communication skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"28h87k\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"929\">Advanced Financial Accounting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1085\">This subject helps students understand financial reporting, accounting principles, and preparation of financial statements used in business organizations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1102\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1221\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csc9mf\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1125\">Financial statements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bxs3sa\" data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1148\">Corporate accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ilswu9\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1171\">Accounting standards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l0u7n5\" data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1192\">Cash flow analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lo0ulh\" data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1221\">Profit and loss management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1244\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1346\">Students develop the ability to analyze and interpret financial records for business decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gaaurx\" data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1377\">Managerial Economics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1489\">Managerial Economics explains how economic concepts are applied in business management and financial planning.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1506\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1619\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zslwrp\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1535\">Demand and supply analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2eadb7\" data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1555\">Pricing decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ucdnd\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1576\">Market competition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"106ita4\" data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1599\">Economic forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr3262\" data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1619\">Consumer behavior</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1642\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1727\">Students learn how businesses make strategic decisions based on economic conditions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1732\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1shtuak\" data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1758\">Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1861\">This subject focuses on managing company finances, investment planning, and maximizing profitability.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1878\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1989\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vuyz7z\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1898\">Capital budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10u20yk\" data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1919\">Financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1azxzbe\" data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1937\">Risk and return</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dszu0o\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1966\">Working capital management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"185z2iy\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1989\">Investment decisions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2012\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2090\">Students understand how organizations manage financial resources effectively.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2095\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5kwcx7\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2126\">Statistics for Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2232\">Statistics for Management introduces analytical tools used for business research and financial analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2249\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2362\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xhi0kq\" data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2265\">Data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wq55km\" data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2288\">Probability concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hvlm8l\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2310\">Regression analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yrcjj\" data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2332\">Forecasting methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w8w5t5\" data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2362\">Statistical decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2385\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2478\">Students learn how to use statistical techniques for business and financial problem-solving.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2483\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jvqwrx\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2515\">Professional Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2595\">This subject improves business communication and corporate interaction skills.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2612\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2725\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1320yha\" data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2637\">Business communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b20w2k\" data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2659\">Presentation skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ughi63\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2682\">Professional writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"83ecdx\" data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2703\">Team communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"etvtlj\" data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2725\">Corporate etiquette</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2748\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2838\">Students develop professional communication abilities required in corporate environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2843\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uew5qt\" data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2866\">Semester 2 Subjects</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2990\">The second semester introduces advanced finance concepts related to investments, analytics, research, and risk management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"2995\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ma9wuu\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3016\">Risk Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3102\">Risk Management teaches students how businesses identify and reduce financial risks.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3119\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3220\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9top4g\" data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3145\">Financial risk analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1do1ft2\" data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3159\">Credit risk</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"njv3tb\" data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3173\">Market risk</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"165mlgx\" data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3199\">Risk control strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ckudup\" data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3220\">Insurance concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3243\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3318\">Students gain knowledge of handling uncertainties in financial operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3323\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bsf5hx\" data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3354\">Business Research Methods</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3449\">This subject focuses on research techniques used in business analysis and strategic planning.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3451\" data-end=\"3466\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3563\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b1a4\" data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3489\">Research methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1chgpe6\" data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3507\">Data collection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b1x8x0\" data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3525\">Survey analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"elvdum\" data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3542\">Report writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1th4uuw\" data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3563\">Business analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3586\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3587\" data-end=\"3658\">Students learn to conduct professional business and financial research.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3663\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8az840\" data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3723\">Cognitive Analytics and Social Skills for Professional</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3725\" data-end=\"3821\">This subject combines analytical thinking with workplace communication and interpersonal skills.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3823\" data-end=\"3838\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3946\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"txf2oj\" data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3858\">Critical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vprqh4\" data-start=\"3859\" data-end=\"3876\">Problem-solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jh49m3\" data-start=\"3877\" data-end=\"3901\">Emotional intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b277ju\" data-start=\"3902\" data-end=\"3922\">Team collaboration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gxij3\" data-start=\"3923\" data-end=\"3946\">Professional behavior</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"3969\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3970\" data-end=\"4052\">Students improve analytical and professional skills required in modern workplaces.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4054\" data-end=\"4057\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"iwvvvk\" data-start=\"4059\" data-end=\"4105\">Security Analysis and Portfolio Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4187\">This subject focuses on investment analysis and portfolio management strategies.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4204\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4315\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wzn8ke\" data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4228\">Stock market analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cqz7ud\" data-start=\"4229\" data-end=\"4256\">Portfolio diversification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"122zkk\" data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4280\">Investment strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jajjqu\" data-start=\"4281\" data-end=\"4295\">Mutual funds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ucpbbv\" data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4315\">Equity evaluation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4317\" data-end=\"4338\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4429\">Students learn how investment portfolios are managed to maximize returns and reduce risks.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4431\" data-end=\"4434\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t4cn7a\" data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4461\">Financial Engineering</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4550\">Financial Engineering introduces modern financial models and advanced investment tools.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4567\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4568\" data-end=\"4688\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n3ys7l\" data-start=\"4568\" data-end=\"4591\">Financial derivatives</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3w2zx\" data-start=\"4592\" data-end=\"4614\">Quantitative finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wyv5vy\" data-start=\"4615\" data-end=\"4635\">Financial modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xaurjv\" data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4656\">Hedging strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qi77vs\" data-start=\"4657\" data-end=\"4688\">Structured financial products</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4690\" data-end=\"4711\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4797\">Students understand advanced financial instruments used in modern finance industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4802\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2gswok\" data-start=\"4804\" data-end=\"4825\">Semester 3 Subjects</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4923\">The third semester focuses on financial reporting, ethics, and practical project-based learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4925\" data-end=\"4928\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6ph63h\" data-start=\"4930\" data-end=\"4973\">Financial Reporting and Decision Making</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4975\" data-end=\"5061\">This subject explains how financial reports support business and investment decisions.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5063\" data-end=\"5078\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5206\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"74b1yu\" data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5109\">Financial statement analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7hs2md\" data-start=\"5110\" data-end=\"5131\">Corporate reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r76eql\" data-start=\"5132\" data-end=\"5160\">Decision-making techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s4y5ly\" data-start=\"5161\" data-end=\"5185\">Performance evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10u20yk\" data-start=\"5186\" data-end=\"5206\">Financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5208\" data-end=\"5229\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5230\" data-end=\"5321\">Students develop the ability to use financial information for strategic business decisions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5323\" data-end=\"5326\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j9llqc\" data-start=\"5328\" data-end=\"5345\">Minor Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5347\" data-end=\"5450\">The minor project provides practical exposure through research and business problem-solving activities.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5452\" data-end=\"5466\">Key Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5467\" data-end=\"5571\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"132zu54\" data-start=\"5467\" data-end=\"5487\">Financial research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"stwau8\" data-start=\"5488\" data-end=\"5507\">Industry analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rngwdu\" data-start=\"5508\" data-end=\"5529\">Data interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vprqh4\" data-start=\"5530\" data-end=\"5547\">Problem-solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j2ewzl\" data-start=\"5548\" data-end=\"5571\">Practical application</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5573\" data-end=\"5594\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5595\" data-end=\"5683\">Students gain hands-on experience in applying finance concepts to real-world situations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5685\" data-end=\"5688\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lq5xkd\" data-start=\"5690\" data-end=\"5713\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5715\" data-end=\"5810\">Professional Ethics teaches ethical practices and responsible behavior in business and finance.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5812\" data-end=\"5827\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5828\" data-end=\"5937\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mpwqiz\" data-start=\"5828\" data-end=\"5846\">Corporate ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n8pb0k\" data-start=\"5847\" data-end=\"5871\">Professional integrity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10rxyj3\" data-start=\"5872\" data-end=\"5892\">Ethical leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mn8xqa\" data-start=\"5893\" data-end=\"5918\">Business responsibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lohmuq\" data-start=\"5919\" data-end=\"5937\">Workplace ethics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5939\" data-end=\"5960\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5961\" data-end=\"6052\">Students understand the importance of ethical decision-making in professional environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6054\" data-end=\"6057\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1i9d55f\" data-start=\"6059\" data-end=\"6080\">Semester 4 Subjects</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6082\" data-end=\"6159\">The final semester focuses on treasury operations and advanced research work.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6161\" data-end=\"6164\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mhm6uy\" data-start=\"6166\" data-end=\"6189\">Treasury Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6191\" data-end=\"6288\">Treasury Management explains how organizations manage cash flow, liquidity, and financial assets.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6290\" data-end=\"6305\">Key Topics</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6306\" data-end=\"6431\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ao21cy\" data-start=\"6306\" data-end=\"6323\">Cash management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19lzrwd\" data-start=\"6324\" data-end=\"6344\">Liquidity planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13t5dni\" data-start=\"6345\" data-end=\"6374\">Foreign exchange management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e730rm\" data-start=\"6375\" data-end=\"6406\">Corporate treasury operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v2onk5\" data-start=\"6407\" data-end=\"6431\">Financial risk control</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6433\" data-end=\"6454\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6455\" data-end=\"6535\">Students learn treasury functions used in banking and corporate finance sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6537\" data-end=\"6540\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17tx505\" data-start=\"6542\" data-end=\"6558\">Dissertation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6560\" data-end=\"6647\">The dissertation is a research-based academic project completed under faculty guidance.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6649\" data-end=\"6663\">Key Areas</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6664\" data-end=\"6778\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wa8sxj\" data-start=\"6664\" data-end=\"6686\">Independent research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nsp1f7\" data-start=\"6687\" data-end=\"6707\">Financial analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w2c5f6\" data-start=\"6708\" data-end=\"6734\">Industry problem-solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b1a4\" data-start=\"6735\" data-end=\"6757\">Research methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"djzhmn\" data-start=\"6758\" data-end=\"6778\">Report preparation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6780\" data-end=\"6801\">Learning Outcome</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"6802\" data-end=\"6874\">Students strengthen research, analytical, and strategic thinking skills.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 150000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(343, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 287, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 00:44:36', '2026-06-16 07:35:50', '<p data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"325\">The admission process for the MA in Journalism and Mass Communication program is simple, structured, and fully online. It is designed to help students easily apply, submit documents, and complete enrollment without confusion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"495\">Students interested in careers in journalism, media, public relations, advertising, and digital communication can follow the step-by-step admission process given below.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"500\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"nenej8\" data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"556\">MA Journalism &amp; Mass Communication Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"666\">The admission journey consists of five simple steps from program selection to final enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"671\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f67ya9\" data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"703\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"812\">The first step is to choose the MA in Journalism and Mass Communication program based on your career goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7tl3m5\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"836\">What You Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"1018\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e8xk7y\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"877\">Review course structure and subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m7zodr\" data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"937\">Understand career opportunities in media and journalism</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k86cxc\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"968\">Check eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12dxm3n\" data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1018\">Choose the program that matches your interest</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1045\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1190\">Selecting the right program ensures that your academic path aligns with your career goals in media, journalism, or digital communication fields.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"chdhb1\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1233\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1358\">After selecting the program, students must fill out the online application form with correct personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1380\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1494\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1405\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"163ne75\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1432\">Educational background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1452\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11fgyy9\" data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1475\">Academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1494\">Identity proof</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lh1x3y\" data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1514\">Important Tips</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1662\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gg45yz\" data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1545\">Fill all details carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h98t1v\" data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1585\">Ensure accuracy in academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mt41ub\" data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1622\">Upload clear and valid documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ipbj1\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1662\">Avoid errors in contact information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1738\">A properly filled application helps avoid delays in the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1743\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zz7wxy\" data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1777\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1887\">Once the application is completed, students must pay the program fee using available online payment methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qeqfpo\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1908\">Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"2001\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1929\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rj4yp9\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1952\">Annual fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yedjnd\" data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1978\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xmj4q5\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2001\">No-cost EMI option</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2019\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2143\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l7aft3\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2050\">Secure online transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uob3t3\" data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2077\">Flexible payment plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xja85y\" data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2111\">Easy EMI options for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tvgheo\" data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2143\">Hassle-free payment process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2204\">Students should keep payment receipts for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2xelpe\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2239\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2333\">After payment, students must submit their application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xlktxj\" data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2356\">What Happens Here</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2487\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m6rt8p\" data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2397\">Final submission of application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lyy6ii\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2425\">Verification of details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gnyjzq\" data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2455\">Registration confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p84ce6\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2487\">Admission processing begins</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2507\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2623\">Make sure all details are correct before final submission, as this step confirms your admission request officially.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2628\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vw8oac\" data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2665\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2773\">After successful registration, students need to wait for enrollment confirmation and further instructions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jlog7k\" data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2795\">You Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2945\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2823\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2853\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w37yl3\" data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2883\">Access to learning portal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vguqy\" data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2913\">Academic schedule details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cygedg\" data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2945\">Course commencement updates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"o9nv40\" data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2978\">Next Steps After Enrollment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3106\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"95g07s\" data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3003\">Begin online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jykvbv\" data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3030\">Access study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsy1iu\" data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3074\">Participate in assignments and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rymgng\" data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3106\">Start your academic journey</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3111\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10j1vcx\" data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3147\">Required Documents for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3229\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3394\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e804nj\" data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3250\">10th mark sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c8v7pp\" data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3270\">12th mark sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gw96x1\" data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3297\">Graduation certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mj6p2q\" data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3339\">Identity proof (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3340\" data-end=\"3368\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"no71h8\" data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3394\">Valid contact details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3464\">Foreign students may need additional academic equivalency documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"127\" data-end=\"472\">The MA in Journalism and Mass Communication program is designed for students who want to build careers in media, journalism, digital communication, advertising, public relations, and content creation. The eligibility criteria ensure that applicants have the basic academic foundation and communication skills required for advanced media studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"637\">This program is suitable for both fresh graduates and working professionals who want to explore opportunities in the fast-growing media and communication industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"642\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aaxm2i\" data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"699\">Who Can Apply for MA Journalism &amp; Mass Communication?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"811\">The program is ideal for candidates who are interested in media-related careers and communication-based roles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"829\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"1204\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u44zoi\" data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"924\">Graduates or final-year students aspiring for careers in journalism and mass communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g5rw2o\" data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"1028\">Working professionals looking to move into media, PR, advertising, and digital communication fields</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19jpzdo\" data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1107\">Candidates interested in content creation, reporting, and media management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ie5y8f\" data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1204\">Individuals aiming for careers in news media, corporate communication, and digital platforms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1302\">This program supports both freshers and experienced individuals depending on their career goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1351\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1462\">Indian applicants must meet the following academic and skill-based requirements to be eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"129mv2n\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1489\">Academic Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1670\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bemiwo\" data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1551\">Graduation in any discipline from a recognized university</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jmmqpb\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1596\">Minimum 40% marks required in graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h63s89\" data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1670\">Candidates scoring below 40% may need to appear for an admission test</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cjse4g\" data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1698\">Additional Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1812\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ykqcqt\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1812\">Proficiency in English is mandatory for better understanding of media, communication, and journalism concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1a075vl\" data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1826\">Key Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1967\">Students from any academic background such as Arts, Commerce, Science, or Management can apply, as journalism is an interdisciplinary field.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2017\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2136\">International applicants must fulfill equivalent academic qualifications along with language and education standards.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"129mv2n\" data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2163\">Academic Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2345\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ehnrgz\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2232\">O Level Certificate (completion of 10 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10v476n\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2301\">A Level Certificate (completion of 12 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ibmcxv\" data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2345\">Graduation from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wxzqur\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2370\">Important Condition</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2444\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p5br1a\" data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2444\">Diplomas are not accepted as a substitute for academic qualifications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2565\">Foreign students should ensure that their academic records are recognized and equivalent to Indian education standards.</p>', '<p data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"363\">The MA in Journalism and Mass Communication program offers flexible and student-friendly fee payment options. Students can choose from one-time payment, annual payment, semester-wise payment, or 24-month no-cost EMI based on their financial convenience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"540\">This flexible structure helps students manage their education costs while pursuing careers in journalism, media, digital communication, public relations, and content creation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"545\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"5s7bm0\" data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"599\">MA Journalism and Mass Communication Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"671\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"671\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"616\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"629\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"656\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay / Effective Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"671\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n<td data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"709\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"721\">₹1,90,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"733\">₹1,74,800</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"759\">Maximum savings option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"823\">\r\n<td data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"773\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"783\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹95,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"793\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹90,250</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"823\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly payment flexibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"891\">\r\n<td data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"843\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"853\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹47,500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"871\">₹1,90,000 Total</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"891\">Pay per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<td data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"916\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"931\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹7,917/month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"946\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹7,521/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"972\">0% interest EMI option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"977\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tjzp9f\" data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1004\">One-Time Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1146\">The one-time payment option is ideal for students who want to complete their fee payment in a single transaction and save more overall cost.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1163\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b8iv7r\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1188\">Total Fee: ₹1,90,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4lfa3\" data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1218\">Discounted Fee: ₹1,74,800</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1232\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eqk5w2\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1278\">Highest savings among all payment options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wtrmoo\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1310\">No recurring payment burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s6esf\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1345\">Simple and hassle-free process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gb20i\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1381\">Suitable for long-term planners</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1470\">This option is best for students who want financial ease during their academic journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cdcpkw\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1504\">Annual Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1613\">The annual payment option allows students to pay fees once every year, making it easier to manage finances.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1630\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rubl7o\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1654\">Annual Fee: ₹95,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d4vsuq\" data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1681\">Effective Fee: ₹90,250</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1695\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1783\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ju0rjt\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1721\">Easy yearly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ayzthc\" data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1752\">Reduced financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yynyx1\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1783\">Balanced payment structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1864\">This option is suitable for students who prefer medium-term financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1869\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"so292p\" data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1898\">Semester-Wise Fee Payment</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"2019\">The semester-wise payment option is designed for maximum flexibility, allowing students to pay in smaller installments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2036\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2099\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l9yf2\" data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2066\">Per Semester Fee: ₹47,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tay6r7\" data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2099\">Total Program Fee: ₹1,90,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2113\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2233\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pii3m\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2143\">Flexible payment schedule</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19uqe24\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2178\">Lower upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lfhepj\" data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2233\">Convenient for students managing multiple expenses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2325\">This is one of the most commonly preferred options for working professionals and students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2330\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"170q69y\" data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2362\">24 Months No-Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2472\">The EMI option allows students to pay monthly without any interest, making higher education more accessible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2489\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2600\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1viyez8\" data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2518\">EMI Amount: ₹7,521/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qkvwi2\" data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2549\">Standard EMI: ₹7,917/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n19r5v\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2571\">Interest Rate: 0%</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7pid2k\" data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2600\">Effective Fee: ₹1,80,500</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"446\">The MA in Journalism and Mass Communication program is designed to help students build knowledge in journalism, digital media, communication, reporting, content creation, and media technologies. The course combines theoretical learning with practical media skills to prepare students for careers in news media, digital platforms, advertising, public relations, and corporate communication.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"451\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"806k3a\" data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"474\">Semester 1 Subjects</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"586\">The first semester focuses on communication basics, journalism writing, media design, and professional skills.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6gtclg\" data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"629\">Mass Communication Theory and Practice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"786\">This subject introduces the fundamentals of mass communication, media systems, and communication models used in print, television, radio, and digital media.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ctuhph\" data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"817\">Writing Analysis for Print</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"936\">Students learn news writing, article writing, headline creation, and content development for newspapers and magazines.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hb2mwy\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"971\">Visualization and Media Design</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1077\">This subject focuses on visual communication, media layouts, graphics, and creative content presentation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"q34gbj\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1115\">Photography Concepts and Practice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1208\">Students understand camera techniques, photo composition, and the basics of photojournalism.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ccfda\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1239\">Professional Communication</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1356\">This subject improves communication, presentation, and professional interaction skills required in media industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1361\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uew5qt\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1384\">Semester 2 Subjects</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1496\">The second semester introduces media laws, journalism ethics, marketing, and investigative reporting concepts.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xtt7de\" data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1521\">Marketing Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1619\">Students learn basic marketing strategies, branding, consumer behavior, and advertising concepts.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11azxi9\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1670\">Development Communication: Theory and Practice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1774\">This subject explains how media supports social awareness, education, and public development campaigns.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"167uvu5\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1811\">Media Ethics Laws and Governance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1914\">Students understand media ethics, journalism laws, press freedom, and responsible reporting practices.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kvaboh\" data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1943\">Investigative Journalism</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2052\">This subject teaches research-based reporting, fact verification, and investigative news writing techniques.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"tl3b5f\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2111\">Cognitive Analytics and Social Skills for Professional</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2208\">Students develop analytical thinking, teamwork, communication, and professional behavior skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2213\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2gswok\" data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2236\">Semester 3 Subjects</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2337\">The third semester focuses on digital media, research, financial reporting, and multimedia editing.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jk7v8p\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2372\">Media Research and Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2466\">Students learn research methods, audience analysis, and media data interpretation techniques.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10bryyy\" data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2503\">New Media and Digital Technology</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2604\">This subject introduces digital journalism, social media platforms, and emerging media technologies.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"i7d68q\" data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2629\">Financial Journalism</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2715\">Students learn reporting techniques related to business, economy, and financial news.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pb5f7s\" data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2743\">Basics of Video Editing</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2847\">This subject covers video editing fundamentals, multimedia storytelling, and content production basics.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"b55rfy\" data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2871\">Professional Ethics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2961\">Students understand ethical practices and professional responsibilities in media careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"2966\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1i9d55f\" data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"2989\">Semester 4 Subjects</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3103\">The final semester focuses on digital marketing, political communication, sustainability, and research projects.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qb28yj\" data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3125\">Digital Marketing</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3222\">Students learn SEO, social media marketing, online advertising, and digital branding strategies.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qz712k\" data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3250\">Political Communication</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3343\">This subject explains the role of media in politics, elections, and public opinion building.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"tt7nqt\" data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3378\">Gender, Human Rights and Media</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3476\">Students study media representation, equality, human rights, and ethical communication practices.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"h1mlkm\" data-start=\"3478\" data-end=\"3493\">Dissertation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3612\">The dissertation is a research-based project where students apply their media and communication knowledge practically.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kpfad6\" data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"3655\">Media, CSR and Sustainable Development</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3656\" data-end=\"3774\">This subject focuses on corporate social responsibility, sustainability communication, and social awareness campaigns.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(344, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 288, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 01:04:58', '2026-06-16 07:38:07', '<p data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"451\">The admission process for the <strong data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"171\">MA in Public Policy (Online)</strong> is simple, fully digital, and designed for smooth enrollment. Along with admission, students also get access to strong career support, AI-powered learning tools, and placement assistance that helps build careers in policy making, governance, consulting, NGOs, and public affairs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"600\">This program is ideal for students who want to enter government, policy research, international organizations, or advisory roles in public systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"605\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"utv8xf\" data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"658\">MA Public Policy Admission Process (Step-by-Step)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"767\">The admission journey is structured into five simple steps to ensure easy enrollment and smooth onboarding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"772\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"799\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"935\">The first step is choosing the MA in Public Policy program based on your career goals in governance, policy, or public administration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7tl3m5\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"959\">What You Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1147\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ruef4\" data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1004\">Understand course structure and subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k86cxc\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1035\">Check eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"109bpq\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1093\">Explore career opportunities in policy and governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rncztr\" data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1147\">Select the specialization aligned with your goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1174\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1338\">Selecting the right program ensures you move in the right direction for careers in public policy, civil services, consulting, or international development sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1343\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1376\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1504\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the online application form with correct personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"48hsg3\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1530\">Required Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1650\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1551\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1582\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1606\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"orho9u\" data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1629\">Identity documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1782no3\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1650\">Academic records</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1669\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1764\">Make sure all details are accurate to avoid delays during verification and admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1798\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1907\">Once the application is completed, students must pay the program fee through secure online payment methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8tvtsf\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1930\">Available Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"2037\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1951\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cnzsmw\" data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1975\">Annual payment plan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yedjnd\" data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2001\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5ddfho\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2037\">EMI (no-cost installment options)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2055\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2157\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7gb22n\" data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2082\">Secure digital payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zhibym\" data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2109\">Flexible fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2vnuk7\" data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2130\">Easy EMI options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1muq8be\" data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2157\">Hassle-free processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2162\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2187\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2267\">After payment, students must submit the application and complete registration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xlktxj\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2290\">What Happens Here</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2411\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2323\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b3d332\" data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2349\">Document verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gnyjzq\" data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2379\">Registration confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p84ce6\" data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2411\">Admission processing begins</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2481\">This step officially activates your admission request in the system.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2486\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g5inpu\" data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2518\">5. Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2615\">After registration, students receive official enrollment confirmation and further instructions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jlog7k\" data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2637\">You Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2787\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2665\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4nxzoj\" data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2709\">Login credentials for learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ifuwyy\" data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2733\">Academic guidelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ff1lf\" data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2759\">Course access details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"htsqdu\" data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2787\">Orientation information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2856\">This marks the beginning of your academic journey in public policy.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"492\">The MA in Public Administration program is designed for students and professionals who want to build careers in governance, public policy, civil services, NGOs, and international organizations. The eligibility criteria ensure that candidates have the basic academic foundation and communication skills required for understanding administrative systems and policy frameworks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"643\">This program is suitable for both fresh graduates and working professionals who want to move into policy-making, governance, and public sector roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"648\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17qzu21\" data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"695\">Who Can Apply for MA Public Administration?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"814\">The program is ideal for candidates interested in government systems, policy development, and public service careers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"832\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"1177\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hn7bvp\" data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"917\">Aspiring policy professionals aiming for careers in public policy and governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ngikxc\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1009\">Graduates planning to work in government organizations, NGOs, or international agencies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zfh6xg\" data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1108\">Working professionals looking to shift into policy-making, consulting, or public affairs roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yr9obn\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1177\">Students interested in civil services and administrative careers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1309\">This course supports individuals from diverse academic and professional backgrounds who want to enter the public sector ecosystem.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1314\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1358\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1462\">Indian applicants must meet the following academic and language requirements to qualify for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"129mv2n\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1489\">Academic Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1693\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bemiwo\" data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1551\">Graduation in any discipline from a recognized university</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zmh1l4\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1609\">Diploma qualifications are not accepted for admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w5jiti\" data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1693\">Proficiency in English is required for academic understanding and communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qj78ia\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1708\">Key Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1951\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ev05fi\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1787\">Students from Arts, Commerce, Science, or Management backgrounds can apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7yk6ok\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1865\">Final-year students may also be eligible (depending on completion status)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bx872i\" data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1951\">Strong communication and analytical skills are recommended for better performance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1956\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2001\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2114\">International applicants must meet equivalent academic qualifications along with formal schooling requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"129mv2n\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2141\">Academic Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2323\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ehnrgz\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2210\">O Level Certificate (completion of 10 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10v476n\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2279\">A Level Certificate (completion of 12 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ibmcxv\" data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2323\">Graduation from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wxzqur\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2348\">Important Condition</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2430\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y7qjb2\" data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2430\">Diplomas are not accepted as an alternative to formal academic qualifications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2546\">Foreign students must ensure their qualifications are from recognized institutions and meet equivalency standards.</p>', '<p data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"370\">The MA in Public Administration program offers flexible and student-friendly fee payment options to support learners from different financial backgrounds. Students can choose between one-time payment, annual payment, semester-wise payment, and 24-month no-cost EMI options.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"540\">This structure ensures that students interested in governance, public policy, civil services, and administration can pursue higher education without financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"545\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wq0i52\" data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"587\">MA Public Administration Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"664\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"664\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"606\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"619\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"646\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay / Effective Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"664\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"752\">\r\n<td data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"702\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"714\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,50,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"726\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,38,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"752\">Maximum savings option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"819\">\r\n<td data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"766\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"776\">₹75,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"786\">₹71,250</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"819\">Year-wise payment flexibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"901\">\r\n<td data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"839\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"849\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹37,500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"867\">₹1,50,000 Total</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"901\">Easy installment-based payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<td data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"926\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"941\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹6,250/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"956\">₹5,938/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"982\">0% interest EMI option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"987\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tjzp9f\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1014\">One-Time Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1132\">The one-time payment option is the most cost-effective choice for students who prefer to pay the entire fee at once.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1149\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1204\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3amwi3\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1174\">Total Fee: ₹1,50,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z8hw63\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1204\">Discounted Fee: ₹1,38,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1218\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hte6vu\" data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1242\">Lowest overall cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wh4ujg\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1271\">No future payment burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s6esf\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1306\">Simple and hassle-free process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cv60a3\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1349\">Ideal for long-term financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1429\">This option is suitable for students who want maximum savings on tuition fees.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1434\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cdcpkw\" data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1463\">Annual Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1578\">The annual payment plan allows students to pay the fee once every year instead of paying the full amount at once.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1595\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1646\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19kp36y\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1619\">Annual Fee: ₹75,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2dlgf1\" data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1646\">Effective Fee: ₹71,250</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1660\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1750\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hjmm6\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1688\">Easier yearly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ayzthc\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1719\">Reduced financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yynyx1\" data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1750\">Balanced payment structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1828\">This option is ideal for students who prefer medium-term financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1833\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"so292p\" data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1862\">Semester-Wise Fee Payment</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1964\">The semester-wise payment plan allows students to pay fees in smaller installments across semesters.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1981\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2044\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5tr4ex\" data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2011\">Per Semester Fee: ₹37,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13jiekf\" data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2044\">Total Program Fee: ₹1,50,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2058\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2151\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tr47oy\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2089\">Flexible payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gksick\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2112\">Lower upfront cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19uriaj\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2151\">Suitable for working professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2237\">This option is preferred by students who want manageable installment-based payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2242\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"170q69y\" data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2274\">24 Months No-Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2384\">The EMI option allows students to pay monthly without any interest, making higher education more affordable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2401\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2512\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ombsi\" data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2430\">EMI Amount: ₹5,938/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r6uxqb\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2461\">Standard EMI: ₹6,250/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n19r5v\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2483\">Interest Rate: 0%</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n6g7fm\" data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2512\">Effective Fee: ₹1,42,500</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2526\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2666\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0q6ue\" data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2550\">No interest charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nq3w8a\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2576\">Easy monthly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l7g139\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2616\">Budget-friendly option for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d1g91z\" data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2666\">Suitable for salaried and working individuals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2755\">This is one of the most convenient options for students who want financial flexibility.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"403\">The MA in Public Administration program is designed to build a strong understanding of governance, public policy, administration systems, law, and public service delivery. It prepares students for careers in civil services, policy making, government organizations, NGOs, and public sector management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"552\">The course focuses on both theoretical foundations and practical administrative skills required for effective governance and policy implementation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"557\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7fezpo\" data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"608\">MA Public Administration Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"632\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"754\">The first semester introduces basic concepts of public administration, political systems, and public policy foundations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nclcaw\" data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"804\">Public Administration: Concept &amp; Theory</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"895\">This subject explains the basic principles, scope, and theories of public administration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"911\"><strong data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"911\">Key Topics</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1040\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1smxp87\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"947\">Nature of public administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m0xzwv\" data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"975\">Administrative theories</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wdzh8n\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1011\">Role of government institutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l412wx\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1040\">Public service structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1045\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5fyzz\" data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1074\">Indian Political System</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1152\">Students study the structure and functioning of the Indian political system.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1168\"><strong data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1168\">Key Topics</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3kflvf\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1194\">Constitution of India</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z12h8y\" data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1225\">Union and state government</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j3fixu\" data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1253\">Democratic institutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2zento\" data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1277\">Political processes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5ryvy4\" data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1317\">Introduction to Public Policy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1390\">This subject introduces how public policies are formed and implemented.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1406\"><strong data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1406\">Key Topics</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1519\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i0gxxt\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1437\">Policy formulation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f1bjdz\" data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1468\">Government decision-making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdrnkq\" data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1494\">Policy implementation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e8k8uu\" data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1519\">Role of stakeholders</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1524\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"axo1pq\" data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1564\">Political Theory &ndash; An Introduction</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1633\">This subject covers basic political ideas and ideological concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1649\"><strong data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1649\">Key Topics</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1727\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wncg59\" data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1674\">Political ideologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9hx3x\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1698\">Governance theories</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6c4z08\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1727\">State and power concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1732\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jvqwrx\" data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1764\">Professional Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1852\">Students develop communication skills required in administration and governance roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1868\"><strong data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1868\">Key Topics</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1964\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wppppv\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1893\">Formal communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vq9ra6\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1912\">Report writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"100ww9o\" data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1936\">Presentation skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"riz10r\" data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1964\">Official correspondence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1969\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aidqhq\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1985\">Term Paper</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2058\">Students work on a research-based paper to apply theoretical knowledge.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2063\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uew5qt\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2086\">Semester 2 Subjects</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2188\">The second semester focuses on administration systems, law, personnel management, and policy models.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2193\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12gl1e6\" data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2263\">Cognitive Analytics &amp; Social Skills for Professional Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2343\">This subject improves analytical thinking and professional workplace behavior.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2348\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yhtcwg\" data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2386\">Dynamics of State Administration</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2467\">This subject explains how state administration functions in governance systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2472\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sw8lee\" data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2499\">Law and Public Policy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2578\">Students understand the relationship between legal systems and public policy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2583\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14a5k3f\" data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2620\">Public Personnel Administration</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2708\">This subject focuses on recruitment, training, and management of government employees.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1il7j4z\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2752\">Public Policy Concepts and Models</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2824\">Students study different policy models and decision-making frameworks.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2829\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1784ei1\" data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2842\">Seminar</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2916\">Students present research topics and enhance academic discussion skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2gswok\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2944\">Semester 3 Subjects</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"3042\">The third semester focuses on governance, globalization, civil services, and development issues.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3047\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uvwqoy\" data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3081\">Public Policy and Governance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3170\">This subject explains governance systems and policy execution in public administration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3175\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dc4kjt\" data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3212\">Globalization and Public Policy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3288\">Students study how globalization impacts national policies and governance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3293\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qs34hp\" data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3322\">Civil Services in India</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3399\">This subject focuses on structure, role, and functioning of civil services.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3401\" data-end=\"3404\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vu8n9l\" data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3426\">Elective Courses</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3475\">Students choose one elective based on interest:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3592\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s4uw8i\" data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3519\">Leadership and Administrative Thinkers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cvkgji\" data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3551\">Economics and Public Policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cxwj9q\" data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3592\">Urban and Rural Development in India</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3597\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1404sig\" data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3618\">Internship (PG)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3708\">Students gain practical experience in government offices, NGOs, or policy organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3713\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lq5xkd\" data-start=\"3715\" data-end=\"3738\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3819\">This subject teaches ethical responsibilities in public service and governance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3824\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1i9d55f\" data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3847\">Semester 4 Subjects</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3945\">The final semester focuses on policy evaluation, governance systems, finance, and research work.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3950\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nzo221\" data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"3986\">Policy Analysis and Evaluation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"4068\">Students learn how public policies are analyzed and evaluated for effectiveness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4070\" data-end=\"4073\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gcse2d\" data-start=\"4075\" data-end=\"4110\">Civil Society and Public Action</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4112\" data-end=\"4204\">This subject explains the role of NGOs and citizens in governance and policy implementation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4206\" data-end=\"4209\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"feqvsw\" data-start=\"4211\" data-end=\"4227\">E-Governance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4229\" data-end=\"4311\">Students study digital governance systems and technology in public administration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4313\" data-end=\"4316\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ut8mfj\" data-start=\"4318\" data-end=\"4336\">Public Finance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4338\" data-end=\"4419\">This subject focuses on government budgeting, taxation, and financial management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4424\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qd7ll0\" data-start=\"4426\" data-end=\"4457\">Public Policy and Diplomacy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4543\">Students understand international relations and policy decision-making in diplomacy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4548\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17tx505\" data-start=\"4550\" data-end=\"4566\">Dissertation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4568\" data-end=\"4634\">Students complete a research-based project under faculty guidance.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 150000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(346, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 294, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 01:33:34', '2026-06-16 07:38:28', '<p data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"355\">The admission process for the Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is simple, fully online, and designed to make enrollment smooth for students. It allows applicants to easily select their program, submit details, pay fees, and complete registration without any complicated steps.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"505\">This process is suitable for students who want to build careers in IT, software development, cybersecurity, networking, and other technology fields.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"510\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"w8w0ou\" data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"550\">BCA Admission Process (Step-by-Step)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"664\">The admission journey is divided into five simple steps from program selection to final enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"669\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"696\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"806\">The first step is choosing the BCA program based on your academic interest and career goals in the IT field.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7tl3m5\" data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"830\">What You Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"1027\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e8xk7y\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"871\">Review course structure and subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"62vx8\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"938\">Understand career opportunities in IT and software development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"idfran\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"973\">Check eligibility requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bhetqb\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1027\">Select the program that matches your future goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1054\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1163\">Choosing the right program helps you start your journey in the correct direction for a successful IT career.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1201\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1329\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the online application form with correct personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1351\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1376\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hpkesq\" data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1429\">Educational qualifications (10th &amp; 12th details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1449\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1468\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11fgyy9\" data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1491\">Academic documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1510\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1620\">Ensure all details are accurate and properly filled to avoid delays in verification and admission processing.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1625\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1654\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1760\">Once the application is completed, students must proceed with fee payment through secure online methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qeqfpo\" data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1781\">Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1869\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1802\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k9klmc\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1838\">Installment-based fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rm4em\" data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1869\">EMI options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1887\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ed3dm\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1921\">Secure digital payment system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rqtllr\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1950\">Flexible payment choices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17q2i68\" data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1983\">Easy and transparent process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mmc2k\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2020\">Quick confirmation after payment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2081\">Students should keep payment receipts for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2086\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2111\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2205\">After payment, students must submit their application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xlktxj\" data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2228\">What Happens Here</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2391\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m6rt8p\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2269\">Final submission of application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2wezkx\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2310\">Document verification process begins</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ir1w0z\" data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2353\">Registration confirmation is generated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19p6elh\" data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2391\">Admission is officially processed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2411\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2514\">Make sure all information is correct before final submission, as this confirms your admission request.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2519\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g5inpu\" data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2551\">5. Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2656\">After successful registration, students must wait for enrollment confirmation and further instructions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jlog7k\" data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2678\">You Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2847\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dsy75\" data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2714\">Enrollment confirmation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2744\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w37yl3\" data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2774\">Access to learning portal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6cx1ac\" data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2811\">Academic schedule and guidelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s73nl6\" data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2847\">Course commencement information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2923\">This step marks the beginning of your academic journey in the BCA program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2928\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2964\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"3046\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3215\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e804nj\" data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3067\">10th mark sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c8v7pp\" data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3087\">12th mark sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xnyd82\" data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3129\">Identity proof (Aadhaar/Passport/PAN)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3158\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"no71h8\" data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3184\">Valid contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zmfki\" data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3215\">Email ID for communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3279\">Foreign students may need additional equivalency certificates.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"438\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is designed for students who want to build a strong foundation in computer science, programming, software development, and IT systems. The eligibility criteria ensure that students entering the program have basic academic knowledge, communication skills, and readiness for technical learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"612\">This course is suitable for students aiming for careers in IT, software development, cybersecurity, networking, database management, and other technology-driven industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"617\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13sh622\" data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"643\">Who Can Apply for BCA?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"802\">The BCA program is ideal for students who want to start a career in the IT and computer applications field after completing their higher secondary education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"820\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"1163\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1my9bzw\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"889\">Fresh 10+2 pass-out students interested in computer applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wxdhq0\" data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"951\">Aspirants planning careers in IT and software development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15c4eu4\" data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1012\">Students aiming for private or government sector IT jobs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r3h8t4\" data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1088\">Learners preparing for higher studies in computer science or technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kx8t17\" data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1163\">Candidates interested in programming, networking, and software systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1259\">This program is designed for beginners as well as students with strong interest in technology.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1308\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1416\">Indian applicants must meet the following academic and language requirements to be eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"129mv2n\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1443\">Academic Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1587\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tzot7d\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1515\">10th Class Certificate (completion of 10 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e0eqft\" data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1587\">12th Class Certificate (completion of 12 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"scuwag\" data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1614\">Language Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1794\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gmjm22\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1690\">Good knowledge of English language and communication skills is required</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2emli5\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1794\">Candidates must have studied in English medium for at least 3 years during their academic education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1814\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1915\">Students without English medium background for the required duration are not eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1920\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1965\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2076\">International students must meet equivalent academic qualifications along with formal schooling requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"129mv2n\" data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2103\">Academic Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2241\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ehnrgz\" data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2172\">O Level Certificate (completion of 10 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10v476n\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2241\">A Level Certificate (completion of 12 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wxzqur\" data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2266\">Important Condition</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2411\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qew4zd\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2332\">Diplomas are not accepted in place of academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1izifcg\" data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2411\">Students must ensure their qualifications are from recognized institutions</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"352\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) fee structure is designed to offer flexible and student-friendly payment options. It allows students to choose between semester-wise payments, full course payment, or 24-month zero-cost EMI options based on their financial convenience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"517\">This structure makes the program accessible for students aiming to build careers in IT, software development, cybersecurity, networking, and emerging technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"522\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ujtamu\" data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"552\">BCA Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"603\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"603\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"571\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"585\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"603\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"681\">\r\n<td data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Course Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"648\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,50,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"681\">One-time complete program fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"731\">\r\n<td data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"701\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹41,700</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"731\">Pay per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<td data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"758\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"774\">₹9,896/month*</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"808\">Interest-free installment plan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"813\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iuzivh\" data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"839\">Full Course Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"939\">The full payment option is suitable for students who prefer to pay the entire program fee at once.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"956\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13e6v8c\" data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"989\">Total Program Fee: ₹2,50,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1003\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1167\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t9cvgr\" data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1039\">Simple one-time payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ihji8h\" data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1075\">No recurring installment burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nv8s2n\" data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1121\">Suitable for long-term financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h1yo76\" data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1167\">Easy fee management throughout the course</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1245\">This option is ideal for students who want a hassle-free payment experience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1250\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1277\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1378\">The semester-wise fee option allows students to pay fees in installments across academic semesters.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1395\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1425\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kk864a\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1425\">Per Semester Fee: ₹41,700</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1439\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tr47oy\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1470\">Flexible payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"196nnup\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1506\">Lower financial burden per term</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4xgy05\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1540\">Easier budgeting for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10pim3i\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1592\">Suitable for working professionals and freshers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1675\">This option is commonly preferred for its balanced affordability and convenience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1680\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1714\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1832\">The EMI option allows students to pay monthly without any interest charges, making higher education more affordable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1849\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1941\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kjs435\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1879\">EMI Amount: ₹9,896/month*</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17r3n9m\" data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1917\">Interest Rate: 0% (Zero Cost EMI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cew809\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1941\">Duration: 24 Months</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1955\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2108\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wrlzkh\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1989\">No interest or hidden charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nq3w8a\" data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2015\">Easy monthly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"190cxp\" data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2054\">Financial flexibility for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1guv2g0\" data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2108\">Suitable for salaried and self-financing learners</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2205\">This option ensures that financial limitations do not stop students from pursuing a BCA degree.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"404\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is designed to build strong foundations in programming, software development, database systems, networking, cloud computing, and artificial intelligence. It prepares students for careers in IT, software development, data analytics, cybersecurity, and emerging technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"598\">The curriculum is structured step-by-step so students can start from basic programming and gradually move toward advanced technologies like AI, DevOps, and cloud-based application development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"603\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1u7smy7\" data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"633\">BCA Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"657\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"786\">The first semester focuses on building foundational knowledge in mathematics, communication, computing, and programming basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ohwsgi\" data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"815\">Basic Mathematics &ndash; I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"932\">This subject helps students develop logical thinking and mathematical skills required for programming and computing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"41le4g\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"962\">Business Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1047\">Students learn communication skills used in professional and technical environments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o13yow\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1090\">Computer and Information Technology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1159\">Introduction to computers, IT systems, and basic computing concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"564l9g\" data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1193\">Human Computer Interaction</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1264\">Focuses on how users interact with systems and software design basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1a66auz\" data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1288\">Programming in C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1364\">Introduces programming fundamentals, logic building, and C language basics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1369\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1393\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1496\">The second semester focuses on data structures, operating systems, and software engineering concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n0m5th\" data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1527\">Data Structures using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1612\">Covers arrays, stacks, queues, linked lists, and basic data organization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aa32vr\" data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1641\">Environmental Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1705\">Introduces environmental awareness and sustainability concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iqajdb\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1754\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1819\">Focuses on personality development, teamwork, and social skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11okhu5\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1852\">Operating System Concepts</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1928\">Covers fundamentals of operating systems, processes, and memory management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1curtec\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1969\">Software Engineering and Modeling</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2043\">Introduces software development lifecycle and system modeling techniques.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2048\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2072\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2180\">The third semester builds knowledge in databases, statistics, networking, and object-oriented programming.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c8ei6\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2230\">Introduction to Database Management System</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2287\">Covers database concepts, SQL, and data storage systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kxhqjn\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2319\">Computational Statistics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2387\">Introduces statistical methods used in computing and data analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"141mhnx\" data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2410\">Green Computing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2487\">Focuses on eco-friendly computing practices and energy-efficient IT systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4ol01\" data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2509\">Network Basics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2579\">Covers fundamentals of computer networks and communication protocols.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u3p0re\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2625\">Object Oriented Programming using Java</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2682\">Introduces OOP concepts using Java programming language.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2687\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2711\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2807\">The fourth semester focuses on advanced programming, web development, and scripting languages.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"btbxx4\" data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2858\">Unix Operating System and Shell Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2907\">Introduces UNIX OS and shell scripting concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ap1xl7\" data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2933\">Python Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"2985\">Covers Python basics, data handling, and scripting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lrzaqq\" data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3030\">Getting Started with Java Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3095\">Strengthens Java programming and application development skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10x9v5y\" data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3128\">Java Database Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3173\">Focuses on database connectivity using Java.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5fz3pp\" data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3207\">Developing Web Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3275\">Introduces web development using frontend and backend technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3280\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nyzmvl\" data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3304\">Semester 5 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3415\">The fifth semester focuses on advanced technologies like AI, cloud computing, DevOps, and e-commerce systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16ms3fy\" data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3462\">Introduction to Artificial Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3510\">Covers AI fundamentals and intelligent systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"173dfou\" data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3544\">Fundamentals of E-commerce</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3605\">Introduces online business systems and digital transactions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"3607\" data-end=\"3632\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3693\">Focuses on ethical practices in IT and software development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ivxp4u\" data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3720\">Getting Cloud Ready</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3770\">Introduces cloud computing concepts and services.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rwgbz\" data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"3827\">DevOps Principles, Practices and Tools with Cloud</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3886\">Covers DevOps workflow, automation, and cloud integration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"3891\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10le376\" data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3915\">Semester 6 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3917\" data-end=\"4006\">The final semester focuses on advanced cloud development, DevOps, and major project work.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ydv96w\" data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4027\">Major Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4087\">Students work on a real-world software development project.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mma75g\" data-start=\"4089\" data-end=\"4117\">Planning for a Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4180\">Focuses on project planning, design, and execution strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17xnjo2\" data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4241\">Cloud (AWS) Based Application Development with DevOps</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4242\" data-end=\"4310\">Introduces cloud application development using AWS and DevOps tools.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d5dflb\" data-start=\"4312\" data-end=\"4362\">Apply Agile Principles and Develop a Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4363\" data-end=\"4413\">Covers Agile methodology for software development.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 250000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(347, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 295, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 02:18:38', '2026-06-17 00:02:01', '<p data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"344\">The admission process for the Master of Computer Applications (MCA) program is simple, fully online, and designed to help students complete enrollment without any complexity. It allows applicants to smoothly select the program, submit details, pay fees, and complete registration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"495\">This process is suitable for students aiming to build careers in software development, cloud computing, cybersecurity, data science, and IT services.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"500\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pzfs7l\" data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"540\">MCA Admission Process (Step-by-Step)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"652\">The admission journey is divided into five easy steps from program selection to final enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"657\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"684\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"812\">The first step is choosing the MCA program based on your academic background and career goals in the IT and software industry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7tl3m5\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"836\">What You Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fampxt\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"881\">Review MCA course structure and subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"62vx8\" data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"948\">Understand career opportunities in IT and software development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"idfran\" data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"983\">Check eligibility requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s2xrxi\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1030\">Select the program that matches your goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1057\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1197\">Choosing the right program ensures you start your journey toward advanced careers in software engineering, cloud computing, and IT systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1202\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1235\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1361\">After selecting the program, students must fill out the online application form with accurate personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1383\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1532\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1408\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp7yxa\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1464\">Academic qualifications (Bachelor&rsquo;s degree details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1488\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1507\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"780zuj\" data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1532\">Supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1551\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1645\">Ensure all details are correct and properly filled to avoid delays in admission verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1650\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1679\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1788\">Once the application is completed, students need to proceed with fee payment through secure online methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qeqfpo\" data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1809\">Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1830\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yedjnd\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1856\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rm4em\" data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1887\">EMI options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1905\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"2026\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"197t8c2\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1937\">Secure digital transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v60yd3\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1966\">Flexible payment options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mcb9s3\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1996\">Easy and quick processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gee6gt\" data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2026\">Transparent fee structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2087\">Students should keep payment receipts for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2092\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2117\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2209\">After payment, students must submit the application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xlktxj\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2232\">What Happens Here</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2387\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2265\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2wezkx\" data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2306\">Document verification process begins</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ir1w0z\" data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2349\">Registration confirmation is generated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19p6elh\" data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2387\">Admission is officially processed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2407\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2501\">Ensure all details are correct before final submission, as this step confirms your admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2506\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g5inpu\" data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2538\">5. Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2637\">After successful registration, students receive enrollment confirmation and further instructions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jlog7k\" data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2659\">You Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2828\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dsy75\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2695\">Enrollment confirmation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4nxzoj\" data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2739\">Login credentials for learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xyk7st\" data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2769\">Course access information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tj9t4\" data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2791\">Academic schedule</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f5jv6p\" data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2828\">Orientation and guidance details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2889\">This marks the official start of your MCA academic journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2894\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"sy2ioe\" data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2934\">Required Documents for MCA Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"3016\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3211\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wvspjd\" data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3073\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree certificate (or final-year proof)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nefft4\" data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3103\">10th and 12th mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mj6p2q\" data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3145\">Identity proof (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3174\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wvpk2f\" data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3211\">Valid email ID and mobile number</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3287\">Foreign students may require additional academic equivalency certificates.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"467\">The Master of Computer Applications (MCA) program is designed for students who want to build advanced careers in software development, IT systems, cloud computing, cybersecurity, and full-stack application development. The eligibility criteria ensure that applicants have the required academic background and technical readiness for advanced-level computer science studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"611\">This program is suitable for both fresh graduates and working professionals who want to upgrade their skills in modern computing technologies.</p>\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13sf35x\" data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"642\">Who Can Apply for MCA?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"777\">The MCA program is suitable for candidates from technical and non-technical backgrounds who want to enter or grow in the IT industry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"795\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ajiwr\" data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"873\">Fresh graduates or final-year students aiming for IT and software careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efi4gs\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"947\">Working professionals seeking higher education in computer technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zy5nrk\" data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1022\">Candidates looking to build expertise in advanced software development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bpc7w9\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1123\">Aspirants targeting careers in IT, financial services, cybersecurity, and data-driven industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19kavrf\" data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1197\">Students aiming for roles like developer, analyst, or system engineer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1645\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1689\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1793\">Indian applicants must meet one of the following academic qualifications to be eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"174571h\" data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1822\">Accepted Qualifications</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"2108\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7p4s2a\" data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1866\">Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u205fe\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1923\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science or Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qbm8rh\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"2005\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in Science / Commerce / Arts with Mathematics at 10+2 level</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"121tz82\" data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2108\">Students without Mathematics in 10+2 or graduation can also apply after completing a bridge course</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2129\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2362\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1czc0r1\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2200\">Mathematics background is preferred but not mandatory in all cases</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mw70di\" data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2292\">Bridge courses help students strengthen foundational mathematics and computing concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"33h0ze\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2362\">Final-year students can also apply depending on completion status</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2367\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2412\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2495\">International applicants must meet equivalent academic and language requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"129mv2n\" data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2522\">Academic Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2669\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"400r7r\" data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2613\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in Computer Applications or equivalent qualification (BCA preferred)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mlve4z\" data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2669\">Any equivalent degree as listed for Indian students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uxnvv\" data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2695\">Language Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2756\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"clkmlw\" data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2756\">Strong command of spoken and written English is required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2776\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2915\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n9shye\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2841\">Academic qualifications must be from recognized institutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1snu9ac\" data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2915\">English proficiency is essential for understanding technical subjects</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"427\">The Master of Computer Applications (MCA) fee structure is designed to offer flexibility and financial ease for students pursuing advanced studies in software development, cloud computing, cybersecurity, and IT systems. The program provides multiple payment options, including full course payment, semester-wise fee structure, and 24-month zero-cost EMI.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"564\">This flexible model helps students manage their education costs while focusing on building strong technical careers in the IT industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"569\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"r14ym1\" data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"599\">MCA Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"860\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"650\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"650\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"618\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"632\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"650\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"860\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"724\">\r\n<td data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"683\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Course Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"695\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,75,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"724\">One-time complete payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"783\">\r\n<td data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"744\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"754\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹68,800</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"783\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Pay per academic semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"860\">\r\n<td data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"810\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"826\">₹10,885/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"860\">Interest-free installment plan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"865\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iuzivh\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"891\">Full Course Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"994\">The full fee payment option is suitable for students who prefer to pay the entire course fee at once.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1011\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1044\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hk7qe3\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1044\">Total Program Fee: ₹2,75,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1058\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1221\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c9zxvb\" data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1091\">One-time hassle-free payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ihji8h\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1127\">No recurring installment burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yrzjb6\" data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1175\">Simple fee management throughout the course</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nv8s2n\" data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1221\">Suitable for long-term financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1313\">This option is ideal for students who want to complete their financial commitment upfront.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1345\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1441\">The semester-wise fee option allows students to pay in installments across academic semesters.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1458\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1488\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10issvy\" data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1488\">Per Semester Fee: ₹68,800</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1502\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1662\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tr47oy\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1533\">Flexible payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"113ige4\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1576\">Easier financial planning per semester</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vozlz6\" data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1603\">Reduced upfront burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7f6hx8\" data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1662\">Suitable for working professionals and fresh graduates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1734\">This is a commonly preferred option due to its balanced affordability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1739\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1773\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1891\">The EMI option allows students to pay monthly without any interest charges, making higher education more accessible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1908\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"2000\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"euycsh\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1938\">EMI Amount: ₹10,885/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17r3n9m\" data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1976\">Interest Rate: 0% (Zero Cost EMI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cew809\" data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2000\">Duration: 24 Months</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2014\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2168\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wrlzkh\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2048\">No interest or hidden charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nq3w8a\" data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2074\">Easy monthly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l7g139\" data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2114\">Budget-friendly option for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1guv2g0\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2168\">Suitable for salaried and self-financing learners</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2253\">This option ensures financial flexibility while pursuing a professional MCA degree.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"406\">The Master of Computer Applications (MCA) program is designed for students who want to build advanced expertise in software development, cloud computing, cybersecurity, data structures, and modern application development. The course focuses on both theoretical concepts and practical implementation of advanced IT technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"548\">It prepares students for high-demand careers in software engineering, cloud architecture, DevOps, cybersecurity, and full-stack development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"553\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1mmqkzk\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"583\">MCA Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"607\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"736\">The first semester focuses on strengthening core computer science fundamentals, programming, and software engineering concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yokps9\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"774\">Graph Theory and Combinatorics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"857\">This subject introduces mathematical foundations used in algorithms and computing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d7i67s\" data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"901\">Advanced Database Management Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"977\">Covers advanced database concepts, data storage, and management techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fkbvz5\" data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"994\">Core Java</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1054\">Focuses on object-oriented programming using Java language.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1164lrf\" data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1102\">Advanced Software Engineering Principles</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1180\">Introduces software design, development lifecycle, and engineering practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gwmigd\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1214\">Professional Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1276\">Builds communication skills for professional IT environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1305\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1405\">The second semester focuses on algorithms, cybersecurity, DevOps, and web application development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"twrsqa\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1433\">Research Methodology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1502\">Teaches research techniques used in academic and technical projects.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ube3pi\" data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1546\">Data Structures and Algorithm Design</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1617\">Covers advanced data structures and algorithm optimization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6k98s3\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1658\">Network Security and Cryptography</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1721\">Introduces cybersecurity concepts and data protection methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sya14e\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1782\">Cognitive Analytics &amp; Social Skills for Professionals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1850\">Focuses on analytical thinking and professional workplace behavior.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18kkhto\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1896\">DevOps Principles, Practices and Tools</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1953\">Covers DevOps workflow, automation, and CI/CD pipelines.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fsuvbp\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"2010\">Developing a Single Page Application with Angular</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2067\">Introduces frontend development using Angular framework.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2072\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2096\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2199\">The third semester focuses on cloud computing, Linux programming, and advanced development practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uombsl\" data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2240\">Cloud Infrastructure and Services</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2301\">Introduces cloud platforms, services, and deployment models.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u3o8ak\" data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2333\">UNIX / Linux Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2395\">Covers operating system concepts and Linux-based programming.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2422\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2483\">Focuses on ethical practices in IT and software development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zr9vaf\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2512\">Quantitative Aptitude</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2577\">Improves logical reasoning and numerical problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qboyhq\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2605\">Seminar (Evaluation)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2664\">Students present technical topics for academic evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k7x9y\" data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2707\">Getting Cloud Ready for Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2763\">Focuses on preparing applications for cloud deployment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xcydc7\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2797\">Microservices Architecture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2865\">Introduces modular software development using microservices design.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2870\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2894\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2985\">The final semester focuses on real-world application development through a major project.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ydv96w\" data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3006\">Major Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3091\">Students work on a complete software development project using learned technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3128\">This project helps apply skills in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3234\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pmqvf5\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3144\">Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tuwmeh\" data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3164\">Cloud computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r4upw8\" data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3181\">DevOps tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5wudg2\" data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3207\">Software architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3plurv\" data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3234\">Full-stack development</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(348, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 296, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 02:40:03', '2026-06-17 00:02:40', '<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"369\">The admission process for the MSc Data Science program is simple, fully online, and designed to help students complete enrollment without any difficulty. It allows applicants to smoothly select the program, submit their application, pay fees, and complete registration in a structured manner.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"527\">This process is suitable for students and professionals who want to build careers in data science, artificial intelligence, machine learning, and analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"532\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12fta2v\" data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"585\">MSc Data Science Admission Process (Step-by-Step)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"713\">The admission journey is divided into five easy and transparent steps from program selection to final enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"718\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"745\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"870\">The first step is selecting the MSc Data Science program based on your academic background and career goals in data and AI.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7tl3m5\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"894\">What You Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"1072\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e8xk7y\" data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"935\">Review course structure and subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m8q829\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"994\">Understand career opportunities in data science and AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k86cxc\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1025\">Check eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jo59gx\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1072\">Choose the program aligned with your goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1099\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1243\">Selecting the right program helps you start your journey in advanced fields like machine learning, data analytics, and artificial intelligence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1248\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1281\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1406\">After selecting the program, students must fill out the online application form with correct personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1428\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1586\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1453\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp7yxa\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1509\">Academic qualifications (Bachelor&rsquo;s degree details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1533\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1552\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rckef2\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1586\">Supporting academic documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1605\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1713\">Ensure all details are accurate and properly filled to avoid delays in verification and admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1718\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1747\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1853\">Once the application is completed, students must proceed with fee payment through secure online methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qeqfpo\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1874\">Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1952\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1895\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yedjnd\" data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1921\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rm4em\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1952\">EMI options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1970\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2088\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l7aft3\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2001\">Secure online transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uob3t3\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2028\">Flexible payment plans</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mcb9s3\" data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2058\">Easy and quick processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gee6gt\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2088\">Transparent fee structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2149\">Students should keep payment receipts for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2154\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2179\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2275\">After fee payment, students must submit the application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xlktxj\" data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2298\">What Happens Here</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2453\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2331\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2wezkx\" data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2372\">Document verification process begins</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ir1w0z\" data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2415\">Registration confirmation is generated</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19p6elh\" data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2453\">Admission is officially processed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2473\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2570\">Ensure all information is correct before final submission, as this step confirms your admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2575\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g5inpu\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2607\">5. Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2715\">After successful registration, students receive official enrollment confirmation and further instructions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jlog7k\" data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2737\">You Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2908\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dsy75\" data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2773\">Enrollment confirmation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4nxzoj\" data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2817\">Login credentials for learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xyk7st\" data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2847\">Course access information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tj9t4\" data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2869\">Academic schedule</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9c3qzw\" data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2908\">Orientation and onboarding details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2982\">This marks the official start of your MSc Data Science academic journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"2987\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1i0a2c8\" data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3040\">Documents Required for MSc Data Science Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3122\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3317\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wvspjd\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3179\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree certificate (or final-year proof)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nefft4\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3209\">10th and 12th mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mj6p2q\" data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3251\">Identity proof (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3252\" data-end=\"3280\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wvpk2f\" data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3317\">Valid email ID and mobile number</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3393\">Foreign students may require additional academic equivalency certificates.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"444\">The MSc in Data Science program is designed for students and professionals who want to build strong careers in data science, artificial intelligence, machine learning, and analytics. The eligibility criteria ensure that applicants have the necessary academic background to understand advanced data-driven concepts and technical subjects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"580\">This program is ideal for learners who want to work in IT companies, research organizations, analytics firms, and AI-based industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"585\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qgtf3n\" data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"624\">Who Can Apply for MSc Data Science?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"742\">The program is suitable for candidates who are interested in working with data, technology, and intelligent systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"760\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"1069\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jd0guc\" data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"858\">Professionals aiming to build careers in data science, analytics, and artificial intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"op1wr8\" data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"934\">Graduates interested in advanced computing and data-driven technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w81v7s\" data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"998\">Students planning to enter IT, AI, and analytics industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la31q7\" data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1069\">Learners who want to upgrade their technical and analytical skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1074\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1118\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1214\">Indian applicants must meet the following academic qualification to be eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1240\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1317\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lrzm2e\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1317\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any Science discipline from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1338\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1554\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sv961a\" data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1422\">Science background is required to understand statistical and technical concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tqlk83\" data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1492\">Final-year students may also apply depending on completion status</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z21icz\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1554\">Strong analytical and mathematical skills are recommended</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1559\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1604\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1688\">International applicants must meet equivalent academic requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1714\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1783\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kdugf0\" data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1783\">Graduation from a recognized university in a relevant discipline</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1804\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1963\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15d1jlz\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1870\">Academic qualification must be from an accredited institution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w50u41\" data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1963\">Applicants should have strong academic foundations in quantitative or technical subjects</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"433\">The MSc in Data Science fee structure is designed to offer flexible payment options for students pursuing advanced studies in artificial intelligence, machine learning, big data analytics, and data engineering. The program provides multiple payment modes, including one-time payment, annual fee plan, semester-wise fee, and 24-month zero-cost EMI.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"580\">This structure helps students manage their education expenses while focusing on building strong careers in data science and AI-driven industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"585\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2wnd67\" data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"628\">MSc Data Science Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"1026\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"705\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"705\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"647\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"660\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"687\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay / Effective Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"705\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"1026\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"793\">\r\n<td data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"743\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"755\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,75,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"767\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,53,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"793\">Maximum savings option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"864\">\r\n<td data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"807\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"819\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,37,500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"831\">₹1,30,630</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"864\">Year-wise payment flexibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<td data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"884\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"894\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹68,800</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"912\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,75,000 Total</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"941\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Installment-based payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1026\">\r\n<td data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"968\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"984\">₹11,458/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1000\">₹10,885/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1026\">0% interest EMI option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1031\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tjzp9f\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1058\">One-Time Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1182\">The one-time payment option is ideal for students who prefer to pay the entire course fee at once and reduce overall cost.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1199\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tr0f1r\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1224\">Total Fee: ₹2,75,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t3sth1\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1254\">Discounted Fee: ₹2,53,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1268\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1434\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zynenf\" data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1310\">Maximum savings on total program cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0zfg2\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1348\">No recurring installment payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x272md\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1391\">Simple and hassle-free payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cv60a3\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1434\">Ideal for long-term financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1514\">This option is suitable for students who want complete fee settlement upfront.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1519\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cdcpkw\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1548\">Annual Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1658\">The annual payment plan allows students to pay the fee once every year, making it easier to manage finances.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1675\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rkal5g\" data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1701\">Annual Fee: ₹1,37,500</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hmbs7\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1730\">Effective Fee: ₹1,30,630</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1744\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1891\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13fjezz\" data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1781\">Easier yearly financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vozlz6\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1808\">Reduced upfront burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yynyx1\" data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1839\">Balanced payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lcbami\" data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1891\">Suitable for working professionals and students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1961\">This option provides flexibility with moderate financial commitment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1966\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1993\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2093\">The semester-wise fee option allows students to pay in installments across each academic semester.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2110\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2173\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10issvy\" data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2140\">Per Semester Fee: ₹68,800</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hk7qe3\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2173\">Total Program Fee: ₹2,75,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2187\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2336\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12i1fob\" data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2222\">Flexible installment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"156pwuv\" data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2251\">Easier budget management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xouxa\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2289\">Lower financial pressure per term</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h8u1c2\" data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2336\">Suitable for students and working learners</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2426\">This is a commonly preferred option due to its balance of affordability and flexibility.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2431\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2465\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2575\">The EMI option allows students to pay monthly without any interest, making higher education more accessible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2592\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2731\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hbv2ve\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2632\">EMI Amount: ₹10,885/month (approx.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13o418b\" data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2664\">Standard EMI: ₹11,458/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17r3n9m\" data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2702\">Interest Rate: 0% (Zero Cost EMI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ge5ywx\" data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2731\">Effective Fee: ₹2,61,260</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2745\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2879\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wrlzkh\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2779\">No interest or hidden charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cxa6ub\" data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2809\">Easy monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nvfjvq\" data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2842\">Budget-friendly for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aitnij\" data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"2879\">Ideal for salaried professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2948\">This option ensures financial ease throughout the program duration.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"411\">The MSc in Data Science program is designed to build strong expertise in statistics, programming, machine learning, artificial intelligence, big data analytics, and data engineering. It prepares students for high-demand careers in data science, AI development, business analytics, and data-driven decision-making roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"597\">The curriculum is structured progressively, starting from foundational mathematics and programming, and advancing toward machine learning, AI, and real-world data science applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"602\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ae1eza\" data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"645\">MSc Data Science Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"669\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"794\">The first semester focuses on building core foundations in statistics, programming, and introductory data science concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7z88ql\" data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"840\">Probability and Statistical Structures</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"932\">This subject introduces statistical concepts used in data analysis and predictive modeling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f7dj61\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"963\">Programming with Python</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1044\">Covers Python programming fundamentals used widely in data science applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uzus2q\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1064\">Data Science</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1144\">Introduces core concepts of data science, including data handling and analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ao6psn\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1179\">Data Warehousing and Mining</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1261\">Focuses on storing, managing, and extracting useful insights from large datasets.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gwmigd\" data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1295\">Professional Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1377\">Builds communication skills required for technical and professional environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1406\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1505\">The second semester focuses on mathematics, data engineering, visualization, and analytics tools.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ra22wo\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1540\">Linear Algebra and Matrices</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1615\">Covers mathematical concepts essential for machine learning and AI models.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"119o7f6\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1642\">Data Science with R</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1714\">Introduces data analysis and statistical computing using R programming.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gcs66n\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1738\">Data Engineering</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1804\">Focuses on building and managing data pipelines and data systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p6cvli\" data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1830\">Business Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1898\">Teaches how data is used for business decision-making and strategy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9ygtf0\" data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1924\">Data Visualization</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1996\">Covers tools and techniques for representing data in graphical formats.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sya14e\" data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2057\">Cognitive Analytics &amp; Social Skills for Professionals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2122\">Improves analytical thinking and workplace communication skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2127\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2151\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2252\">The third semester focuses on advanced AI, machine learning, big data, and real-world applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iesqw\" data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2283\">Optimization Techniques</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2355\">Introduces methods for improving model performance and decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"199xabg\" data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2397\">Machine Learning and Deep Learning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2460\">Covers supervised, unsupervised learning, and neural networks.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mfpge5\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2501\">Natural Language Processing (NLP)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2578\">Focuses on text analysis, sentiment analysis, and language-based AI systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10u79t8\" data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2604\">Big Data Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2672\">Introduces tools and techniques for analyzing large-scale datasets.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bxjjbp\" data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2703\">Artificial Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2773\">Covers AI concepts, intelligent systems, and automation technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yxhw0q\" data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2813\">Data Science Product Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2877\">Focuses on building real-world data science-based applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hymo5a\" data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2913\">Big Data &amp; Analytics using R</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2969\">Uses R programming for handling and analyzing big data.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"m83xac\" data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2990\">Minor Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3066\">Students work on a small-scale data science project for practical exposure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3093\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3152\">Covers ethical practices in data usage, AI, and analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3157\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3181\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3281\">The final semester focuses on real-world industry experience through project work and internships.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uud5bl\" data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3316\">Project Work and Internship</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3405\">Students gain practical experience by working on real industry projects and internships.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3434\">This helps apply skills in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3539\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t9w189\" data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3455\">Machine learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rj78q2\" data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3473\">Data analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8e0xlf\" data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3492\">AI development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11lsmn6\" data-start=\"3493\" data-end=\"3513\">Big data systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nobe9n\" data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3539\">Business intelligence</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(349, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 140, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 03:25:25', '2026-06-17 00:03:35', '<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"346\">The admission process for the BCom (Hons) ACCA Integrated program is simple, fully online, and designed to make enrollment easy for students. The process allows applicants to smoothly complete every step, from selecting the program to receiving enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"514\">This structured admission system helps students quickly begin their journey toward careers in accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, and global business management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"519\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"l9mq5i\" data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"572\">BCom (Hons) ACCA Admission Process (Step-by-Step)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"687\">The admission process is divided into five simple steps that guide students from application to final enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"719\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"834\">The first step is choosing the BCom (Hons) ACCA program based on your academic interests and future career goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7tl3m5\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"858\">What You Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q3w6j3\" data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"921\">Review the course curriculum and ACCA-integrated structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7et7ec\" data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"983\">Understand career opportunities in finance and accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17l35j2\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1041\">Check eligibility criteria and admission requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3lp5ne\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1101\">Choose the program aligned with your professional goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1128\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1257\">Selecting the right program helps students build a strong academic and professional foundation in global finance and accounting.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1295\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1424\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the online application form with accurate personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1446\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1471\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hpkesq\" data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1524\">Educational qualifications (10th &amp; 12th details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1548\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1567\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xmb1j0\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1607\">Academic documents and certificates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1626\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1742\">Students should ensure all details are correctly filled to avoid delays during verification and admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1747\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1776\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1895\">Once the application form is completed, students must proceed with fee payment through secure online payment methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qeqfpo\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1916\">Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"2017\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1937\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rj4yp9\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1960\">Annual fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yedjnd\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1986\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rm4em\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2017\">EMI options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2035\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2160\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l7aft3\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2066\">Secure online transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tr47oy\" data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2097\">Flexible payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12cy4k9\" data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2132\">Quick and easy payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"167omru\" data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2160\">Transparent fee details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2240\">Students are advised to keep payment receipts and confirmation details safely.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2245\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2270\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2366\">After fee payment, students must submit the application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xlktxj\" data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2389\">What Happens Here</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2530\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2422\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6nf5n\" data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2457\">Academic document verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a0atw0\" data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2498\">Registration confirmation generation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p84ce6\" data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2530\">Admission processing begins</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2550\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2677\">This step officially confirms your admission request, so students should carefully review all details before final submission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2682\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g5inpu\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2714\">5. Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2836\">After successful registration and verification, students receive official enrollment confirmation and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jlog7k\" data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2858\">You Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"3035\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dsy75\" data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2894\">Enrollment confirmation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"2895\" data-end=\"2924\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w37yl3\" data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2954\">Access to learning portal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sdvlp8\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2995\">Course schedule and academic updates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15tsm54\" data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3035\">Orientation and onboarding guidance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3113\">This marks the official beginning of your BCom (Hons) ACCA academic journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3118\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3154\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3236\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3417\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jv793l\" data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3273\">10th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9g1oz\" data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3309\">12th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mj6p2q\" data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3351\">Identity proof (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3380\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wvpk2f\" data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3417\">Valid email ID and mobile number</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3419\" data-end=\"3490\">Foreign students may require additional academic equivalency documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"428\">The BCom (Hons) ACCA Integrated program is designed for students who want to build strong careers in accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, and corporate management. The eligibility criteria ensure that students have the required academic foundation to understand business, commerce, and financial concepts effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"580\">This program is ideal for students aiming to pursue professional finance careers and global accounting opportunities through ACCA-integrated learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"585\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16luhg2\" data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"624\">Who Can Apply for BCom (Hons) ACCA?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"761\">The program is suitable for students who have completed higher secondary education and want to build careers in finance and accounting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"779\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"1116\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wqpnq9\" data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"837\">Students interested in accounting and finance careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"noun5w\" data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"900\">Aspirants planning to pursue ACCA and global finance roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1re7ty8\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"967\">Learners aiming for careers in taxation, auditing, and banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"186on4c\" data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1040\">Students looking for corporate and business management opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v4dj4r\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1116\">Candidates interested in professional commerce education after Class 12</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1202\">This course helps students build both academic and professional financial knowledge.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1207\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1251\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1331\">Indian applicants must meet the following academic requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1357\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1508\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lc4dhe\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1408\">Completion of 10+2 with a minimum of 55% marks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wwemsf\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1508\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations may also apply, subject to result submission later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1529\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1781\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ex9zni\" data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1578\">Students from recognized boards are eligible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x5znuq\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1661\">NIOS board students are also eligible if they meet the required marks criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iqj4rp\" data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1781\">Commerce background is preferred but students from other streams may also apply depending on eligibility guidelines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1890\">A strong understanding of mathematics, accounting, or business studies can be beneficial during the course.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1895\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1940\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2024\">International students must meet equivalent academic qualifications for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"129mv2n\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2051\">Academic Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2189\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ehnrgz\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2120\">O Level Certificate (completion of 10 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10v476n\" data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2189\">A Level Certificate (completion of 12 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"265v1c\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2215\">Important Conditions</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2354\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ye7t3n\" data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2289\">Diplomas are not accepted in place of formal schooling qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n9shye\" data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2354\">Academic qualifications must be from recognized institutions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2458\">Students should ensure that their educational qualifications meet international equivalency standards.</p>', '<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"332\">The BCom (Hons) ACCA fee structure is designed to provide students with flexible and affordable payment options. It allows learners to choose between one-time payment, annual installment, semester-wise payment, and 24-month zero-cost EMI options.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"513\">This structure is ideal for students aiming to build careers in accounting, finance, auditing, taxation, and corporate management while managing their education costs effectively.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"518\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ltujym\" data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"561\">BCom (Hons) ACCA Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"580\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"593\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay / Effective Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"638\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"726\">\r\n<td data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"676\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"688\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,75,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"700\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,54,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"726\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum savings option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"793\">\r\n<td data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"740\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"750\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹58,334</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"760\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹55,420</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"793\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Year-wise payment flexibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"870\">\r\n<td data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"813\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"823\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹29,200</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"841\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,75,000 Total</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"870\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Installment-based payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n<td data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"897\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"912\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹7,292/month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"927\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹6,927/month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"953\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0% interest EMI option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"958\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tjzp9f\" data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"985\">One-Time Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1111\">The one-time payment option is suitable for students who prefer to pay the full program fee at once and reduce overall cost.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1128\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1183\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p4m1cc\" data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1153\">Total Fee: ₹1,75,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"txcw5t\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1183\">Discounted Fee: ₹1,54,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1197\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1371\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jvkpwv\" data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1237\">Maximum savings on total course fee</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b7wv4u\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1282\">No installment burden during the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x272md\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1325\">Simple and hassle-free payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nv8s2n\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1371\">Suitable for long-term financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1448\">This option is ideal for students who want complete fee settlement upfront.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1453\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cdcpkw\" data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1482\">Annual Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1589\">The annual payment plan allows students to pay fees once every year, making it easier to manage finances.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1606\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1liv9kx\" data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1630\">Annual Fee: ₹58,334</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"42gkje\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1657\">Effective Fee: ₹55,420</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1671\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1813\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hjmm6\" data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1699\">Easier yearly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ayzthc\" data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1730\">Reduced financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tr47oy\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1761\">Flexible payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rnigab\" data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1813\">Suitable for both students and working learners</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1888\">This option is balanced and commonly preferred for financial convenience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1893\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1920\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"2021\">The semester-wise fee option allows students to pay fees in installments across academic semesters.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2038\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2101\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10w4dt\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2068\">Per Semester Fee: ₹29,200</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vxnoc8\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2101\">Total Program Fee: ₹1,75,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2115\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2271\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o2xag\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2154\">Flexible installment-based payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eeoidd\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2194\">Lower financial burden per semester</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"igzuda\" data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2219\">Easy budget planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jkn7a6\" data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2271\">Suitable for freshers and working professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2347\">This option is ideal for students who prefer smaller, manageable payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2352\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2386\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2497\">The EMI option allows students to pay monthly without any interest charges, making education more affordable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2514\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2651\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixdqdw\" data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2553\">EMI Amount: ₹6,927/month (approx.)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kdfpqk\" data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2584\">Standard EMI: ₹7,292/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17r3n9m\" data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2622\">Interest Rate: 0% (Zero Cost EMI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"77zqqt\" data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2651\">Effective Fee: ₹1,66,260</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2665\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2807\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wrlzkh\" data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2699\">No interest or hidden charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fdefgj\" data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2733\">Easy monthly installment plan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nvfjvq\" data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2766\">Budget-friendly for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c4zjw6\" data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2807\">Financial flexibility during studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2881\">This option is especially useful for students managing monthly expenses.</p>\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14t1k19\" data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2916\">&nbsp;</h1>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"461\">The BCom (Hons) ACCA Integrated program is designed for students who want to build strong expertise in accounting, finance, taxation, business laws, auditing, and strategic management along with global ACCA-aligned knowledge. This program helps students develop both academic understanding and professional skills required in finance, banking, consulting, and corporate sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"659\">The syllabus is structured in a progressive way, starting from basic business and accounting concepts and gradually moving toward advanced financial reporting, analytics, and strategic leadership.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"664\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s8q5dj\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"707\">BCom (Hons) ACCA Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"731\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"853\">The first semester focuses on building a strong foundation in business, accounting, economics, and communication skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1a9p2q6\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"895\">Business Organization &amp; Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"996\">Introduces basic concepts of business structure, management principles, and organizational behavior.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mtnhjg\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1029\">Corporate &amp; Business Laws</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1110\">Covers legal frameworks related to business operations and corporate governance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3ti8ic\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1142\">Financial Accounting &ndash; I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1230\">Focuses on basic accounting principles, financial statements, and bookkeeping concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eum2hz\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1269\">Microeconomics for Business &ndash; I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1336\">Introduces economic principles affecting business decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18oxhit\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1364\">Business Environment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1423\">Covers internal and external business environment factors.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"41le4g\" data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1453\">Business Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1518\">Develops professional communication and business writing skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1523\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1547\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1655\">The second semester focuses on advanced accounting, taxation basics, data analytics, and research methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lay4rm\" data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1683\">Auditing &amp; Assurance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1753\">Introduces auditing principles and verification of financial records.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j0mp99\" data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1786\">Financial Accounting &ndash; II</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1851\">Builds advanced knowledge of financial accounting and reporting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14a9fin\" data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1884\">Income Tax Law &amp; Practice</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1945\">Covers taxation laws, rules, and practical tax calculations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rvkvda\" data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1985\">Microeconomics for Business &ndash; II</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2050\">Expands understanding of economic concepts in business contexts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"l9qkbk\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2072\">Data Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2148\">Introduces data interpretation and analytical tools for business decisions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17ft0mn\" data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2187\">Statistical Methods in Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2248\">Focuses on statistical techniques used in business research.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2253\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2277\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2372\">The third semester focuses on financial management, cost accounting, reporting, and taxation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ksf6ho\" data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2400\">Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2473\">Covers financial planning, investment decisions, and capital management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fs15mw\" data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2502\">Financial Reporting I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2560\">Introduces preparation and analysis of financial reports.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ffvib\" data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2600\">Cost &amp; Management Accounting &ndash; I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2659\">Focuses on cost control and internal financial management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16o9fbn\" data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2694\">Indirect Taxes &amp; Amendments</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2742\">Covers GST and other indirect taxation systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aa32vr\" data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2771\">Environmental Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2838\">Introduces environmental awareness and sustainability in business.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2843\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2867\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2963\">The fourth semester focuses on advanced reporting, strategic leadership, and research methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nh7dkx\" data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"2993\">Financial Reporting II</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3057\">Advanced financial statement analysis and reporting techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idzdwa\" data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3092\">Strategic Business Leader I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3152\">Introduces leadership concepts in business decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p73mr3\" data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3190\">Strategic Business Reporting I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3251\">Focuses on advanced reporting aligned with global standards.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1b5macq\" data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3292\">Cost &amp; Management Accounting &ndash; II</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3344\">Advanced cost management and decision-making tools.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h63el1\" data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3377\">Business Research Methods</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3440\">Covers research techniques for business analysis and projects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3445\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nyzmvl\" data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3469\">Semester 5 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3568\">The fifth semester focuses on strategic leadership, internships, analytics, and domain electives.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"j1jymr\" data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3604\">Strategic Business Leader II</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3605\" data-end=\"3666\">Advanced leadership strategies and corporate decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sbsw18\" data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3702\">Analytical Skill Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3763\">Improves data interpretation and analytical thinking skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"un3v9i\" data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3802\">Strategic Business Reporting II</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"3869\">Advanced reporting aligned with professional accounting standards.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vpr4tb\" data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3894\">Summer Internship</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"3956\">Provides real-world industry exposure and practical learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"46ecgc\" data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"3993\">Domain Electives (Choose Any 2)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"4105\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"4021\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w03oj9\" data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4050\">Business Data Processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poqna7\" data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4075\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fqwsby\" data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4105\">Human Resource Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4180\">These electives allow students to specialize based on their career goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4185\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10le376\" data-start=\"4187\" data-end=\"4209\">Semester 6 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4211\" data-end=\"4314\">The final semester focuses on advanced leadership, financial analytics, research, and entrepreneurship.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o6dq2i\" data-start=\"4316\" data-end=\"4351\">Strategic Business Leader III</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4421\">Final stage of strategic leadership and business management learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10c8h1g\" data-start=\"4423\" data-end=\"4464\">Fundamentals of Financial Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4465\" data-end=\"4526\">Introduces financial data analysis and decision-making tools.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ycvixh\" data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4546\">Dissertation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4547\" data-end=\"4610\">Research-based project on a selected business or finance topic.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10lx3wu\" data-start=\"4612\" data-end=\"4656\">Non-ACCA Domain Electives (Choose Any 2)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4658\" data-end=\"4762\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e6ona2\" data-start=\"4658\" data-end=\"4690\">Entrepreneurship Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ch11v8\" data-start=\"4691\" data-end=\"4728\">Spreadsheet Modelling in Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxg1ng\" data-start=\"4729\" data-end=\"4762\">E-Commerce &amp; Its Applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4764\" data-end=\"4847\">These subjects help students develop practical business and entrepreneurial skills.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 175000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(350, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 298, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 03:55:05', '2026-06-17 00:07:26', '<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"378\">The admission process for the Integrated BBA + MBA program is simple, fully online, and designed to provide students with a smooth enrollment experience. From selecting the program to receiving enrollment confirmation, every step is structured to make the application process easy and transparent.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"549\">This process helps students quickly begin their academic journey toward careers in business management, finance, marketing, operations, consulting, and entrepreneurship.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"554\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"902j4d\" data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"611\">Integrated BBA + MBA Admission Process (Step-by-Step)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"732\">The admission procedure is divided into five simple stages that guide students through the complete enrollment process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"764\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"890\">The first step is choosing the Integrated BBA + MBA program according to your academic interests and long-term career goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7tl3m5\" data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"914\">What You Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"1130\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hbd2xo\" data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"962\">Review the curriculum and program structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4eh7o1\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1015\">Understand career opportunities after completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1basqe7\" data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1062\">Check eligibility criteria and fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ig2hm\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1130\">Choose the specialization and program best suited to your goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1157\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1282\">Selecting the right management program helps students build a strong foundation for future leadership and corporate careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1320\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1446\">After selecting the program, students must fill out the online application form with accurate academic and personal details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1468\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1603\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1493\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1524\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1544\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1563\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xmb1j0\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1603\">Academic documents and certificates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1622\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1748\">Students should carefully verify all information before submission to avoid delays during document verification and approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1753\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1782\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1876\">Once the application form is completed, students can proceed with secure online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1frahit\" data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1907\">Payment Options Available</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1928\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"158vps8\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1954\">Annual payment option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yedjnd\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1980\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rm4em\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2011\">EMI options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2025\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2177\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zr81bj\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2058\">Secure online payment system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uvj5nz\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2099\">Multiple payment flexibility options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1272xro\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2140\">Fast and transparent payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ouhn6\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2177\">Easy fee management for students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2253\">Students are advised to keep payment receipts safely for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2258\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2283\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2390\">After successful fee payment, students must submit the application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2421\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2565\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2454\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1asjco1\" data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2493\">Verification of academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkq1vh\" data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2531\">Registration confirmation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sj6t3c\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2565\">Admission approval initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2585\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2717\">This step officially confirms the student&rsquo;s admission request, so all details should be reviewed carefully before final submission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2722\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g5inpu\" data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2754\">5. Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2875\">After successful verification and approval, students receive enrollment confirmation and further academic instructions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tzag21\" data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2902\">Students Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"3105\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dsy75\" data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2938\">Enrollment confirmation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2968\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qbr030\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3013\">Access to the learning management system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jfpson\" data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3059\">Academic schedule and orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckxgom\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3105\">Guidance regarding classes and coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3185\">This marks the official beginning of the Integrated BBA + MBA program journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3187\" data-end=\"3190\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3226\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3308\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3503\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dfca1g\" data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3353\">Graduation mark sheets and certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"27nld3\" data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3384\">10th and 12th certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13gbnd3\" data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3437\">Government identity proof (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3466\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pd3dhz\" data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3503\">Valid mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3505\" data-end=\"3582\">Foreign students may require additional qualification verification documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"487\">The Integrated BBA + MBA program is designed for students, fresh graduates, entrepreneurs, and working professionals who want to build strong careers in business management, finance, marketing, operations, and leadership roles. The eligibility criteria ensure that applicants have the required academic foundation and communication skills to successfully complete the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"614\">This program is suitable for learners aiming for long-term career growth in corporate management and business administration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"619\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"44703d\" data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"662\">Who Can Apply for Integrated BBA + MBA?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"818\">The program is suitable for candidates from different academic and professional backgrounds who want to develop advanced management and leadership skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"836\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"1232\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kprol7\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"909\">Fresh graduates planning careers in management and corporate sectors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iwnix4\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"972\">Working professionals looking to upgrade managerial skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2tmdkc\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1049\">Entrepreneurs aiming to manage and scale business operations effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f5he5b\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1133\">Aspirants seeking global career opportunities in management and business fields</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uo2m7t\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1232\">Students interested in finance, marketing, sales, operations, logistics, and business strategy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1337\">The program helps learners build strong business knowledge along with leadership and analytical skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1342\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1386\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1469\">Indian applicants must fulfill the following academic requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1495\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1761\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0qceo\" data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1556\">Graduation in any discipline with a minimum of 40% marks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z1kmvt\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1640\">Students scoring below 40% may be required to qualify through an admission test</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l785yz\" data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1761\">Candidates appearing for final year graduation examinations may also apply, subject to eligibility fulfillment later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cjse4g\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1789\">Additional Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1828\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mlpxfb\" data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1828\">Proficiency in English is required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1849\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"2063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ryui6t\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1904\">Students from recognized universities are eligible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t6ezpk\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1982\">Graduates from arts, commerce, science, or professional streams can apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ym1fpi\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2063\">Strong communication and analytical skills are beneficial during the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2176\">The flexible eligibility criteria make the program accessible to students from diverse educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2181\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2226\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2298\">International applicants must meet the following academic requirement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2324\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2368\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ibmcxv\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2368\">Graduation from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2389\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2556\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kqfvfm\" data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2468\">Academic qualifications must be from an approved or accredited institution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u8pg75\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2556\">Students should have sufficient English communication ability for academic learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2645\">Foreign students must ensure their qualification meets the required academic standards.</p>', '<p data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"414\">The Integrated BBA + MBA fee structure is designed to provide flexible and affordable payment options for students who want to pursue long-term management education. The program offers multiple payment modes including one-time payment, annual fee plans, semester-wise installments, and 24-month zero-cost EMI options.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"605\">This flexible structure helps students manage educational expenses while preparing for careers in business management, marketing, finance, human resources, consulting, and entrepreneurship.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"610\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13zp1wl\" data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"657\">Integrated BBA + MBA Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"1052\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"734\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"734\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"676\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"689\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"716\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay / Effective Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"734\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"1052\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"822\">\r\n<td data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"772\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"784\">₹4,02,800</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"796\">₹3,70,570</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"822\">Maximum savings option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"887\">\r\n<td data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"836\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"848\">₹1,34,270</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"860\">₹1,27,560</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"887\">Flexible yearly payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"965\">\r\n<td data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"907\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"917\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹67,200</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"935\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,02,800 Total</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"965\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-wise installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1052\">\r\n<td data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"992\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1008\">₹16,783/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1024\">₹10,629/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1052\">0% interest EMI facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1057\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tjzp9f\" data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1084\">One-Time Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1227\">The one-time payment option is suitable for students who prefer paying the entire program fee upfront while reducing the overall course cost.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1244\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1317\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k13dit\" data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1277\">Total Program Fee: ₹4,02,800</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19gblwa\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1317\">Discounted Effective Fee: ₹3,70,570</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1331\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16q7pch\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1355\">Maximum fee savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0zfg2\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1393\">No recurring installment payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bquo5t\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1423\">Simplified fee management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v3yrv7\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1459\">Long-term financial convenience</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1554\">This option is ideal for students and families looking for complete upfront payment benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1559\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cdcpkw\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1588\">Annual Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1703\">The annual payment plan allows students to pay the course fee year-wise instead of making a full upfront payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1720\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1775\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j7ymuv\" data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1746\">Annual Fee: ₹1,34,270</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14v7cfb\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1775\">Effective Fee: ₹1,27,560</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1789\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1920\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hjmm6\" data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1817\">Easier yearly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19uqe24\" data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1852\">Lower upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b6t5xk\" data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1880\">Flexible fee management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohugu4\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1920\">Suitable for long-duration programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1985\">This option provides a balanced payment structure for students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"1990\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2017\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2119\">The semester-wise payment option allows students to pay fees in smaller installments every semester.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2136\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2199\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ba4lyz\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2166\">Per Semester Fee: ₹67,200</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k13dit\" data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2199\">Total Program Fee: ₹4,02,800</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2213\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2363\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12i1fob\" data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2248\">Flexible installment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"akrylx\" data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2278\">Easier financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11cojzu\" data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2316\">Reduced payment pressure per term</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h8u1c2\" data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2363\">Suitable for students and working learners</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2437\">This option is commonly chosen due to its affordability and convenience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2476\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2591\">The EMI facility allows students to pay the course fee through monthly installments without any interest charges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2608\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2753\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6faias\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2654\">EMI Amount: ₹10,629/month (effective EMI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l1s87t\" data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2686\">Standard EMI: ₹16,783/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17r3n9m\" data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2724\">Interest Rate: 0% (Zero Cost EMI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12cwjs9\" data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2753\">Effective Fee: ₹3,82,660</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2767\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2913\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wrlzkh\" data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2801\">No interest or hidden charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nq3w8a\" data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2827\">Easy monthly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c4zjw6\" data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2868\">Financial flexibility during studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gteuua\" data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2913\">Budget-friendly for students and parents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2980\">This option makes long-term management education more accessible.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"457\">The Integrated BBA + MBA program is designed for students who want to build strong business management knowledge from the undergraduate level to advanced managerial expertise. The curriculum combines business fundamentals, marketing, finance, human resource management, entrepreneurship, operations, and strategic management into a structured long-term program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"668\">This course helps students develop leadership, analytical, communication, and decision-making skills required for careers in corporate management, business consulting, marketing, finance, and entrepreneurship.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"673\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gz0of0\" data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"720\">Integrated BBA + MBA Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"744\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"865\">The first semester focuses on building foundational knowledge in accounting, management, statistics, and communication.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k61koj\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"896\">Accounting Fundamentals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"978\">Introduces accounting principles, financial transactions, and bookkeeping basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d7eb7i\" data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1007\">Management Foundation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1083\">Covers basic management concepts, functions, and organizational structures.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a1fd72\" data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1114\">Principles of Marketing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1184\">Introduces marketing concepts, customer needs, and market strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16j16n9\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1211\">Business Statistics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1289\">Focuses on statistical methods used in business analysis and decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"41le4g\" data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1319\">Business Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1397\">Develops communication and presentation skills for professional environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1402\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1426\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1525\">The second semester focuses on finance, HR management, IT applications, and personal development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xopzeb\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1560\">IT Applications in Business</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1644\">Introduces the use of information technology in business operations and management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aa32vr\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1673\">Environmental Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1746\">Covers sustainability and environmental awareness in business practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"159npgh\" data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1790\">Fundamentals of Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1855\">Introduces financial planning, budgeting, and investment basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lmegrh\" data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1904\">Fundamentals of Human Resource Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1981\">Focuses on employee management, recruitment, and organizational development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vsjjss\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2029\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2106\">Develops interpersonal skills, leadership qualities, and personality growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2111\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2135\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2233\">The third semester focuses on organizational behavior, financial systems, and business research.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dw26v9\" data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2279\">Principles of Organizational Behaviour</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2343\">Covers employee behavior, motivation, and workplace management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ek8b5r\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2401\">Essentials of Production and Operations Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2467\">Introduces operations planning and production management systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"muukiw\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2504\">Research Methods for Managers</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2571\">Focuses on business research techniques and data analysis methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15omn7h\" data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2609\">Financial Markets and Services</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2685\">Introduces banking systems, investment markets, and financial institutions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t2227j\" data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2718\">Cross Cultural Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2787\">Covers management practices in diverse global business environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2792\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2816\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2911\">The fourth semester focuses on entrepreneurship, operations research, and project management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"byxqt6\" data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2951\">Fundamentals of Entrepreneurship</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"3027\">Introduces startup development, innovation, and business planning concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15payjx\" data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3067\">Principles of Consumer Behaviour</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3131\">Focuses on customer buying behavior and market decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11kdntl\" data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3158\">Operations Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3218\">Covers analytical techniques for solving business problems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18brc8c\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3259\">Sales and Distribution Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3332\">Introduces sales planning, distribution systems, and channel management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rxk1zx\" data-start=\"3334\" data-end=\"3374\">Fundamentals of Project Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3435\">Focuses on project planning, execution, and risk management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3440\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nyzmvl\" data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3464\">Semester 5 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3557\">The fifth semester focuses on digital marketing, strategy, ethics, and customer management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3vpli4\" data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3589\">Marketing in Digital Age</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3671\">Covers digital marketing strategies, online branding, and social media marketing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pg1hdn\" data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3696\">Business Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3761\">Introduces strategic planning and competitive business analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"3763\" data-end=\"3788\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3847\">Focuses on ethical practices and corporate responsibility.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1axka9\" data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3886\">Managing Customer Relationships</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3952\">Covers customer retention and relationship management strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17o9nki\" data-start=\"3954\" data-end=\"3978\">Financial Planning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4043\">Introduces personal and corporate financial planning techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"z34b7c\" data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4069\">Quality Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4070\" data-end=\"4146\">Focuses on maintaining quality standards and continuous improvement systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4151\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10le376\" data-start=\"4153\" data-end=\"4175\">Semester 6 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4278\">The final semester focuses on advanced HR management, branding, retail management, and research work.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aqjpxj\" data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4341\">Fundamentals of International Human Resource Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4342\" data-end=\"4412\">Introduces global HR practices and international workforce management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"o6m5vy\" data-start=\"4414\" data-end=\"4436\">Brand Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4437\" data-end=\"4500\">Focuses on brand positioning, brand value, and market identity.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cbuy58\" data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4533\">Fundamentals of Retailing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4534\" data-end=\"4603\">Covers retail business operations and customer experience management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ycvixh\" data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4623\">Dissertation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4624\" data-end=\"4693\">Students conduct research on a selected business or management topic.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4695\" data-end=\"4792\">This research project helps students apply managerial concepts to real-world business challenges.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 402800.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(351, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 04:10:31', '2026-06-17 00:08:04', '<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"352\">The admission process for the BCom program is simple, fully online, and designed to provide students with a smooth enrollment experience. The process allows applicants to complete registration easily, from selecting the program to receiving enrollment confirmation and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"515\">This structured admission system helps students begin their journey toward careers in accounting, finance, banking, taxation, marketing, and business management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"520\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15dql0d\" data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"561\">BCom Admission Process (Step-by-Step)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"686\">The BCom admission procedure is divided into five simple steps that guide students through the complete enrollment process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"691\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"718\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"825\">The first step is choosing the BCom program according to your academic interests and future career goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7tl3m5\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"849\">What You Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9p534f\" data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"895\">Review the course curriculum and subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h27v9y\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"942\">Understand career opportunities after BCom</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1basqe7\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"989\">Check eligibility criteria and fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13fffl3\" data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1043\">Choose the program that matches your career plans</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1070\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1216\">Selecting the right commerce program helps students build a strong academic foundation in finance, accounting, taxation, and business management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1221\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1254\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1361\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the online application form with accurate details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1383\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1518\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1408\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1439\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1459\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1478\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"177lpss\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1518\">Academic certificates and documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1537\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1661\">Students should ensure that all information is correct to avoid delays during document verification and admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1666\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1695\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1789\">Once the application form is completed, students can proceed with secure online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1frahit\" data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1820\">Payment Options Available</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1927\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1841\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cnzsmw\" data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1865\">Annual payment plan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16jkhr7\" data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1896\">Semester-wise installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rm4em\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1927\">EMI options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1941\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2066\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l7aft3\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1972\">Secure online transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1whjmej\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2001\">Flexible payment methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4gjlv\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2029\">Transparent fee process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ouhn6\" data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2066\">Easy fee management for students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2152\">Students should save payment receipts and confirmation details for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2157\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2182\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2289\">After successful fee payment, students must submit the application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2320\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2464\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2353\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1asjco1\" data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2392\">Verification of academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkq1vh\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2430\">Registration confirmation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sj6t3c\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2464\">Admission approval initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2484\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2622\">This step officially confirms the admission request, so students should carefully review all submitted details before final registration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2627\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g5inpu\" data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2659\">5. Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2772\">After successful verification and approval, students receive enrollment confirmation and academic instructions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tzag21\" data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2799\">Students Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2996\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dsy75\" data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2835\">Enrollment confirmation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2865\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m4ry5v\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2904\">Access to online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jfpson\" data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2950\">Academic schedule and orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckxgom\" data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2996\">Guidance regarding classes and coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3060\">This marks the official beginning of the BCom program journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3065\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"v2b14y\" data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3106\">Documents Required for BCom Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3188\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3383\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dfca1g\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3233\">Graduation mark sheets and certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"27nld3\" data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3264\">10th and 12th certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13gbnd3\" data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3317\">Government identity proof (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3346\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pd3dhz\" data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3383\">Valid mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3462\">Foreign students may require additional qualification verification documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"470\">The BCom program is designed for students, fresh graduates, working professionals, and aspiring entrepreneurs who want to build strong careers in commerce, finance, accounting, banking, marketing, and business management. The eligibility criteria ensure that applicants have the required academic background and communication skills to successfully pursue commerce education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"613\">This program is suitable for learners aiming for careers in corporate sectors, financial services, business operations, and management roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"618\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yjove1\" data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"645\">Who Can Apply for BCom?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"795\">The BCom program is suitable for candidates from different academic and professional backgrounds who want to build business and financial knowledge.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"813\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"36dvxs\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"883\">Fresh graduates planning careers in commerce and business sectors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cbzwq9\" data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"958\">Working professionals looking to improve business and financial skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hums8a\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1030\">Entrepreneurs aiming to manage business operations more effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0a460\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1116\">Aspirants seeking careers in finance, marketing, sales, logistics, and management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19t8z44\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1189\">Students planning to pursue higher studies in commerce or management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1316\">The course helps students build analytical, managerial, and financial understanding required in modern business environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1321\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1365\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1448\">Indian applicants must fulfill the following academic requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1474\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1755\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0qceo\" data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1535\">Graduation in any discipline with a minimum of 40% marks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"773sbp\" data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1621\">Candidates scoring below 40% may be required to qualify through an admission test</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wcclno\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1755\">Students appearing for final year graduation examinations may also apply, subject to completion of eligibility requirements later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cjse4g\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1783\">Additional Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1822\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mlpxfb\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1822\">Proficiency in English is required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1843\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fnebrd\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1899\">Graduates from recognized universities are eligible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"famsic\" data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1976\">Students from commerce, science, arts, or professional streams can apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g7goij\" data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2060\">Strong communication and analytical skills can be beneficial during the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2160\">The flexible eligibility structure allows students from multiple educational backgrounds to apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2165\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2210\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2281\">International students must meet the following admission requirement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2307\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2351\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ibmcxv\" data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2351\">Graduation from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2372\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2529\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6lk1as\" data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2439\">Academic qualifications must be from an accredited institution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l0szhd\" data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2529\">Students should possess sufficient English communication skills for academic learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2621\">Foreign applicants must ensure their qualifications meet university equivalency standards.</p>', '<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"424\">The BCom fee structure is designed to provide flexible and student-friendly payment options for learners pursuing careers in accounting, finance, taxation, banking, and business management. Students can choose from multiple payment modes including one-time payment, annual plans, semester-wise installments, and 24-month zero-cost EMI options.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"542\">This flexible fee system helps students manage educational expenses while completing a professional commerce degree.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"547\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1m7f439\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"578\">BCom Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"655\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"655\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"597\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"637\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay / Effective Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"655\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"743\">\r\n<td data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"693\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"705\">₹3,23,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"717\">₹2,97,160</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"743\">Maximum savings option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<td data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"757\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"769\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,07,670</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"781\">₹1,02,290</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"808\">Flexible yearly payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"892\">\r\n<td data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"828\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"838\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹53,900</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"856\">₹3,23,000 Total</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"892\">Semester-wise installment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<td data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"919\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"935\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹13,460/month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"951\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹12,785/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"979\">0% interest EMI facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"984\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tjzp9f\" data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1011\">One-Time Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1145\">The one-time payment option is ideal for students who want to pay the complete program fee upfront and reduce the total course cost.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1162\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tcyp5l\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1195\">Total Program Fee: ₹3,23,000</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16uask7\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1235\">Discounted Effective Fee: ₹2,97,160</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1249\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1402\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ppivfw\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1285\">Maximum savings on overall fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ihji8h\" data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1321\">No recurring installment burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x1fj45\" data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1362\">Easy and hassle-free payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"99g4dh\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1402\">Better long-term financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1521\">This option is suitable for students and families preferring complete fee settlement at the beginning of the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1526\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cdcpkw\" data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1555\">Annual Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1677\">The annual payment plan allows students to pay fees once every academic year instead of paying the full amount together.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1694\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1749\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"na6fdf\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1720\">Annual Fee: ₹1,07,670</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v7xnwo\" data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1749\">Effective Fee: ₹1,02,290</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1763\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1910\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13fjezz\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1800\">Easier yearly financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gd1xij\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1837\">Reduced upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tr47oy\" data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1868\">Flexible payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q5fgys\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1910\">Convenient for long-duration programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1963\">This option balances affordability and convenience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1968\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"1995\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2097\">The semester-wise payment option allows students to pay fees in smaller installments every semester.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2114\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2177\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vf6wuv\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2144\">Per Semester Fee: ₹53,900</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tcyp5l\" data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2177\">Total Program Fee: ₹3,23,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2191\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2352\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qls9ye\" data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2228\">Flexible semester-based payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4xgy05\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2262\">Easier budgeting for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xouxa\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2300\">Lower financial pressure per term</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rnigab\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2352\">Suitable for both students and working learners</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2424\">This option is commonly preferred for manageable installment payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2429\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2463\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2560\">The EMI option helps students pay monthly installments without any additional interest charges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2577\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2722\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"607ech\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2623\">EMI Amount: ₹12,785/month (effective EMI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"57gaj6\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2655\">Standard EMI: ₹13,460/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17r3n9m\" data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2693\">Interest Rate: 0% (Zero Cost EMI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a0w0y2\" data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2722\">Effective Fee: ₹3,06,870</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2736\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2873\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4ig1s\" data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2768\">No interest or hidden costs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ukdeeu\" data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2800\">Affordable monthly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xcxnsc\" data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2833\">Better financial flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w1lkrp\" data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2873\">Suitable for self-financed students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2946\">This option makes higher education more accessible and budget-friendly.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"428\">The Bachelor of Commerce (BCom) program is designed to provide students with strong knowledge in accounting, taxation, finance, economics, business law, and corporate management. The curriculum helps students develop analytical, financial, and managerial skills required for careers in banking, finance, taxation, accounting, and corporate sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"631\">The semester-wise syllabus gradually builds from basic commerce concepts to advanced financial management and taxation topics, helping students prepare for both professional careers and higher studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"636\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kkyuj0\" data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"667\">BCom Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"691\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"805\">The first semester focuses on building a foundation in accounting, mathematics, business law, and communication.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"192yvml\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"835\">Business Mathematics I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"922\">Introduces mathematical concepts used in business calculations and financial analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aa32vr\" data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"951\">Environmental Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1015\">Focuses on environmental awareness and sustainability concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kkihpj\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1045\">Financial Accounting I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1122\">Covers accounting basics, bookkeeping, and preparation of financial records.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ah11z2\" data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1144\">Mercantile Law</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1221\">Introduces legal principles related to commercial and business transactions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"41le4g\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1251\">Business Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1312\">Develops professional communication and presentation skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1317\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1341\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1435\">The second semester focuses on advanced accounting, economics, marketing, and corporate law.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v3rxbo\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1466\">Business Mathematics II</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1537\">Covers advanced mathematical techniques used in business and commerce.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k01pse\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1568\">Financial Accounting II</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1643\">Builds knowledge of advanced accounting concepts and financial statements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10a825e\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1680\">Fundamentals of Corporate Law</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1754\">Introduces company law, corporate regulations, and governance principles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10hfiaw\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1776\">Macroeconomics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1854\">Focuses on economic systems, inflation, national income, and fiscal policies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a1fd72\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1885\">Principles of Marketing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1960\">Introduces marketing strategies, customer behavior, and branding concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1965\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1989\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2094\">The third semester focuses on corporate accounting, taxation, cost management, and business statistics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7zt9zh\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2124\">Corporate Accounting I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2197\">Covers accounting practices related to companies and corporate entities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ftonho\" data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2220\">Cost Accounting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2291\">Focuses on cost control, budgeting, and internal financial management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"z8a23z\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2311\">Direct Tax I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2367\">Introduces income tax laws and basic taxation concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16j16n9\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2394\">Business Statistics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2467\">Covers statistical techniques for business analysis and decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vsjjss\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2515\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2587\">Develops interpersonal skills, leadership, and personality development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2592\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2616\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2711\">The fourth semester focuses on auditing, advanced accounting, taxation, and research methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vxzg23\" data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2727\">Auditing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2799\">Introduces auditing procedures, verification, and financial compliance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1eqh15w\" data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2830\">Corporate Accounting II</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2892\">Advanced corporate accounting concepts and reporting methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q3flc6\" data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2913\">Direct Tax II</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2976\">Focuses on advanced taxation laws and tax planning techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"omdfys\" data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3005\">Management Accounting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3064\">Covers financial decision-making and management reporting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"twrsqa\" data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3092\">Research Methodology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3172\">Introduces research techniques and data collection methods in business studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3177\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nyzmvl\" data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3201\">Semester 5 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3305\">The fifth semester focuses on financial management, ethics, accounting systems, and economic analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q7yxwy\" data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3334\">Business Organisation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3416\">Covers organizational structures, management principles, and business operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"159npgh\" data-start=\"3418\" data-end=\"3460\">Fundamentals of Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3537\">Introduces financial planning, capital management, and investment decisions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3564\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3632\">Focuses on ethical business practices and corporate responsibility.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rybafr\" data-start=\"3634\" data-end=\"3670\">Computerized Accounting System</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3671\" data-end=\"3741\">Introduces accounting software and digital financial management tools.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7duysh\" data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3768\">Financial Reporting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3769\" data-end=\"3828\">Covers preparation and interpretation of financial reports.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rkus0v\" data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3850\">Indian Economy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3851\" data-end=\"3922\">Focuses on the structure, growth, and challenges of the Indian economy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3927\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10le376\" data-start=\"3929\" data-end=\"3951\">Semester 6 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"4045\">The final semester focuses on corporate governance, taxation, investments, and project work.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11pi4cg\" data-start=\"4047\" data-end=\"4084\">Ethics and Corporate Governance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4085\" data-end=\"4156\">Introduces ethical standards and governance practices in organizations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ydv96w\" data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4177\">Major Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4257\">Students work on a research or commerce-related project for practical exposure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aoe39x\" data-start=\"4259\" data-end=\"4287\">Corporate Tax Planning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4288\" data-end=\"4347\">Focuses on corporate tax strategies and financial planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8eadom\" data-start=\"4349\" data-end=\"4389\">International Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4390\" data-end=\"4471\">Covers global financial systems, foreign exchange, and international investments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c5v2af\" data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4523\">Investment Analysis and Portfolio Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4524\" data-end=\"4609\">Introduces investment strategies, risk analysis, and portfolio management techniques.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.1, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 323000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(352, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 300, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 04:31:23', '2026-06-17 00:08:24', '<p data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"458\">The admission process for the BCA program is simple, fully online, and designed to provide students with a smooth and hassle-free enrollment experience. From selecting the program to receiving enrollment confirmation, every step is structured to help students begin their journey toward careers in software development, cloud computing, cybersecurity, artificial intelligence, and data science.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"582\">The admission system is designed for both fresh graduates and working professionals seeking flexible technology education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"587\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"w8w0ou\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"627\">BCA Admission Process (Step-by-Step)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"766\">The BCA admission procedure is divided into five easy steps that guide students through the complete registration and enrollment process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"771\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"798\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"904\">The first step is choosing the BCA program according to your academic interests and future career goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7tl3m5\" data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"928\">What You Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vbevvo\" data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"988\">Review the course curriculum and semester-wise subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g6cm5x\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1034\">Understand career opportunities after BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1basqe7\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1081\">Check eligibility criteria and fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13s5of\" data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1159\">Select the program that matches your technical interests and career plans</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1186\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1336\">Choosing the right IT program helps students build a strong foundation in programming, software development, data science, and emerging technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1374\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1507\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the online application form with accurate academic and personal information.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1529\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1675\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1550\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1581\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1605\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1624\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ry4c1f\" data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1675\">Academic certificates and supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1694\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1821\">Students should carefully verify all information before submission to avoid delays during admission verification and approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1826\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1855\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1949\">Once the application form is completed, students can proceed with secure online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1frahit\" data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1980\">Payment Options Available</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2083\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2001\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ivejno\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2021\">Annual fee plan</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16jkhr7\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2052\">Semester-wise installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rm4em\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2083\">EMI options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2097\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2251\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a3u3ed\" data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2139\">Safe and secure online payment system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r8qave\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2181\">Flexible payment methods for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4gjlv\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2209\">Transparent fee process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nzzhxh\" data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2251\">Convenient financial planning options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2333\">Students are advised to save payment confirmation receipts for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2338\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2363\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2470\">After successful fee payment, students must submit the application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2501\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2645\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2534\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1swlyme\" data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2573\">Verification of uploaded documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkq1vh\" data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2611\">Registration confirmation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sj6t3c\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2645\">Admission approval initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2665\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2776\">Students should review all entered details carefully before final submission to avoid correction delays later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2781\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g5inpu\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2813\">5. Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2922\">After successful verification and approval, students receive enrollment confirmation and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tzag21\" data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2949\">Students Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"3154\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dsy75\" data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2985\">Enrollment confirmation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"3015\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj90sq\" data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3058\">Access to the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1waf8k9\" data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3108\">Academic schedule and orientation information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckxgom\" data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3154\">Guidance regarding classes and coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3225\">This step officially marks the beginning of the BCA academic journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3230\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1c7494x\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3270\">Documents Required for BCA Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3352\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3547\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dfca1g\" data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3397\">Graduation mark sheets and certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"27nld3\" data-start=\"3398\" data-end=\"3428\">10th and 12th certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13gbnd3\" data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3481\">Government identity proof (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3510\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pd3dhz\" data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3547\">Valid mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3618\">Foreign students may need additional academic verification documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"493\">The BCA program is designed for students and professionals who want to build successful careers in software development, data science, artificial intelligence, machine learning, cybersecurity, cloud computing, and modern IT industries. The eligibility criteria ensure that applicants have the required academic foundation and communication skills to successfully pursue computer application studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"647\">This program is suitable for learners aiming to develop strong technical expertise and practical computing skills for future technology-focused careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"652\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13sh622\" data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"678\">Who Can Apply for BCA?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"830\">The BCA program is suitable for students, fresh graduates, professionals, and aspiring entrepreneurs interested in technology and software industries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"848\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"1233\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bsahuf\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"918\">Students planning careers in software development and programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o3pbvo\" data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"1002\">Aspirants interested in data science, AI/ML, cybersecurity, and cloud computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ggv9o\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1064\">Working professionals looking to upgrade technical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pncniq\" data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1145\">Individuals aiming to build technology-driven startups or digital businesses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92mvp7\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1233\">Learners interested in modern IT tools, software systems, and emerging technologies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1353\">The program helps students build practical and industry-oriented technical knowledge required in the modern IT sector.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1358\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1402\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1485\">Indian applicants must fulfill the following academic requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1511\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0qceo\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1572\">Graduation in any discipline with a minimum of 40% marks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"773sbp\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1658\">Candidates scoring below 40% may be required to qualify through an admission test</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wcclno\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1792\">Students appearing for final year graduation examinations may also apply, subject to completion of eligibility requirements later</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cjse4g\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1820\">Additional Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1859\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mlpxfb\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1859\">Proficiency in English is required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1880\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"2100\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fnebrd\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1936\">Graduates from recognized universities are eligible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcs5tg\" data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"2013\">Students from science, commerce, arts, or professional streams can apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ge27hx\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2100\">Basic analytical and logical reasoning skills can be beneficial during the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2221\">The flexible eligibility structure allows students from multiple educational backgrounds to pursue technical education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2226\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2271\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2342\">International students must meet the following admission requirement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2368\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2412\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ibmcxv\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2412\">Graduation from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2433\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kqfvfm\" data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2512\">Academic qualifications must be from an approved or accredited institution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u8ka9p\" data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2630\">Students should possess sufficient English communication skills for academic learning and technical understanding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2722\">Foreign applicants must ensure their qualifications meet university equivalency standards.</p>', '<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"467\">The BCA fee structure is designed to provide flexible and affordable payment options for students planning careers in software development, programming, cybersecurity, cloud computing, artificial intelligence, and IT management. Students can choose from multiple payment options including one-time payment, annual plans, semester-wise installments, and 24-month zero-cost EMI facilities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"585\">The flexible fee system helps students manage educational expenses while gaining industry-oriented technical skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ujtamu\" data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"620\">BCA Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"697\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"697\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"639\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"652\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Actual Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"679\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Self Pay / Effective Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"697\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"785\">\r\n<td data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"735\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"747\">₹3,55,300</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"759\">₹3,26,870</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"785\">Maximum savings option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n<td data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"799\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,18,440</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"823\">₹1,12,510</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"850\">Flexible yearly payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n<td data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"870\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"880\">₹59,300</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"898\">₹3,55,300 Total</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"934\">Semester-wise installment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<td data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"961\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"977\">₹14,805/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"993\">₹14,064/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1021\">0% interest EMI facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1026\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tjzp9f\" data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1053\">One-Time Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1198\">The one-time payment option is suitable for students who prefer paying the complete course fee upfront while reducing the overall program cost.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1215\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1288\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iu00or\" data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1248\">Total Program Fee: ₹3,55,300</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t2nmk4\" data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1288\">Discounted Effective Fee: ₹3,26,870</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1302\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1436\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16q7pch\" data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1326\">Maximum fee savings</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0zfg2\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1364\">No recurring installment payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1zq3bv\" data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1402\">Easy long-term financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qdbqul\" data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1436\">Simplified payment management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1534\">This option is ideal for students and families looking for complete upfront payment convenience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1539\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cdcpkw\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1568\">Annual Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1702\">The annual payment plan allows students to pay the course fee once every academic year instead of paying the entire amount together.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1719\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ginrw\" data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1745\">Annual Fee: ₹1,18,440</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i6i99i\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1774\">Effective Fee: ₹1,12,510</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1788\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1954\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hjmm6\" data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1816\">Easier yearly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xdaspw\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1859\">Reduced financial pressure at one time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bss3tf\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1908\">Flexible fee planning for long-term programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rim53j\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1954\">Convenient payment structure for students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2033\">This option offers a balanced approach between affordability and convenience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2038\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2065\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2174\">The semester-wise fee option allows students to pay smaller installments every semester during the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2191\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2254\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17cnwwn\" data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2221\">Per Semester Fee: ₹59,300</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iu00or\" data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2254\">Total Program Fee: ₹3,55,300</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2268\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2431\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m2qhyz\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2308\">Flexible installment-based payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rrkt4z\" data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2353\">Better financial management for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"26befm\" data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2391\">Lower payment burden per semester</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ddcrz\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2431\">Suitable for self-financed learners</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2507\">This option is commonly preferred due to its manageable payment structure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2512\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2546\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2672\">The EMI facility allows students to pay the course fee through monthly installments without any additional interest charges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2689\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2834\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11urc4v\" data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2735\">EMI Amount: ₹14,064/month (effective EMI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yy8l96\" data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2767\">Standard EMI: ₹14,805/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17r3n9m\" data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2805\">Interest Rate: 0% (Zero Cost EMI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11xjlcx\" data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2834\">Effective Fee: ₹3,37,530</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2848\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2989\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1csxrqh\" data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2888\">No hidden charges or interest costs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ukdeeu\" data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2920\">Affordable monthly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xcxnsc\" data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2953\">Better financial flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pceskw\" data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2989\">Budget-friendly learning option</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3084\">This option makes technical education more accessible for students and working professionals.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"450\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is designed to provide students with strong knowledge in computer programming, software development, databases, networking, cloud computing, cybersecurity, artificial intelligence, and emerging technologies. The curriculum focuses on both theoretical concepts and practical technical skills required in the IT industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"624\">The semester-wise syllabus gradually develops students from basic programming and computer fundamentals to advanced technologies like AI, blockchain, IoT, and data science.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"629\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1u7smy7\" data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"659\">BCA Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"683\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"805\">The first semester focuses on building foundational knowledge in computers, programming, mathematics, and communication.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o13yow\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"848\">Computer and Information Technology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"918\">Introduces computer systems, hardware, software, and IT fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1a66auz\" data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"942\">Programming in C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"1010\">Covers basic programming concepts using the C programming language.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"564l9g\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1044\">Human Computer Interaction</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1115\">Focuses on user interaction, interface design, and usability concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"83dk4h\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1142\">Basic Mathematics I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1210\">Introduces mathematical concepts used in programming and computing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"41le4g\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1240\">Business Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1318\">Develops communication and presentation skills for professional environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1323\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1347\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1466\">The second semester focuses on operating systems, data structures, software engineering, and personality development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11okhu5\" data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1499\">Operating System Concepts</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1572\">Introduces operating system functions, processes, and memory management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ea184m\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1602\">Data Structure using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1685\">Covers data organization techniques like arrays, stacks, queues, and linked lists.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bnidmg\" data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1727\">Software Engineering and Modelling</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1803\">Focuses on software development life cycle and system modelling techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aa32vr\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1832\">Environmental Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1896\">Introduces sustainability and environmental awareness concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vsjjss\" data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1944\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"2015\">Develops leadership, teamwork, and interpersonal communication skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2044\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2132\">The third semester focuses on Java programming, networking, databases, and statistics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"abraii\" data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2178\">Object Oriented Programming Using Java</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2236\">Introduces Java programming and object-oriented concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4ol01\" data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2258\">Network Basics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2333\">Covers computer networking concepts, protocols, and communication systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"187r3dp\" data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2384\">Introduction to Database Management Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2444\">Focuses on database creation, management, and SQL concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kxhqjn\" data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2476\">Computational Statistics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2544\">Introduces statistical methods used in computing and data analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"141mhnx\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2567\">Green Computing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2644\">Covers energy-efficient and environmentally sustainable computing practices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2649\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2673\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2783\">The fourth semester focuses on Python programming, cloud computing, cybersecurity, and digital technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ap1xl7\" data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2809\">Python Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2877\">Covers Python programming for software and application development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"btbxx4\" data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2928\">Unix Operating System and Shell Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2986\">Introduces UNIX environment and shell scripting concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v7y7k5\" data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3027\">Fundamentals of Digital Marketing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3028\" data-end=\"3094\">Focuses on online marketing strategies and digital business tools.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hdylct\" data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3123\">IT Project Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3196\">Introduces project planning, execution, and management techniques in IT.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wp9xef\" data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3249\">Fundamental of Cloud Computing and Enterprise</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3318\">Covers cloud platforms, services, and enterprise computing concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16gjom0\" data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3356\">Cyber and Information Security</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3443\">Focuses on cybersecurity threats, data protection, and information security practices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3448\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nyzmvl\" data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3472\">Semester 5 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3563\">The fifth semester focuses on artificial intelligence, IoT, ERP systems, and data mining.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16ms3fy\" data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3610\">Introduction to Artificial Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3684\">Introduces AI concepts, intelligent systems, and automation technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sv58j\" data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3717\">Fundamentals of Ecommerce</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3780\">Covers online business systems and electronic commerce models.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"3782\" data-end=\"3807\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3883\">Focuses on ethical practices and professional standards in the IT industry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zjhxew\" data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3915\">Internet of Things (IoT)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"3973\">Introduces connected devices, sensors, and smart systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5wup8f\" data-start=\"3975\" data-end=\"4025\">Introduction to Enterprise Resource Planning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4082\">Covers ERP systems used for business process management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ao6psn\" data-start=\"4084\" data-end=\"4117\">Data Warehousing and Mining</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4177\">Focuses on storing, managing, and analyzing large datasets.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4182\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10le376\" data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4206\">Semester 6 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4208\" data-end=\"4309\">The final semester focuses on advanced technologies, management concepts, and practical project work.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1defr5i\" data-start=\"4311\" data-end=\"4345\">Introduction to e Governance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4426\">Introduces digital governance systems and public sector technology applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"j4eke8\" data-start=\"4428\" data-end=\"4459\">Human Resource Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4460\" data-end=\"4527\">Covers employee management and organizational development concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i0x082\" data-start=\"4529\" data-end=\"4558\">Blockchain Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4559\" data-end=\"4640\">Introduces blockchain systems, cryptocurrency basics, and decentralized networks.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ppy7sp\" data-start=\"4642\" data-end=\"4676\">Introduction to Data Science</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4677\" data-end=\"4751\">Focuses on data analysis, visualization, and predictive modeling concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ydv96w\" data-start=\"4753\" data-end=\"4772\">Major Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4773\" data-end=\"4855\">Students work on a real-world software or IT-based project for practical exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4857\" data-end=\"4943\">This project helps students apply technical concepts in real development environments.</p>\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hhmn9z\" data-start=\"4950\" data-end=\"4983\">&nbsp;</h1>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 355300.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(353, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 281, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 04:46:56', '2026-06-17 00:09:38', '<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"478\">The admission process for the BCA in Data Science program is simple, fully online, and designed to provide students with a smooth enrollment experience. From selecting the program to receiving enrollment confirmation, every step is structured to help students easily begin their journey toward careers in data science, artificial intelligence, machine learning, software development, and analytics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"597\">The process is suitable for fresh 10+2 students as well as learners planning careers in modern technology industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"602\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qiexod\" data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"658\">BCA in Data Science Admission Process (Step-by-Step)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"795\">The admission procedure is divided into five simple stages that guide students through the complete application and enrollment process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"800\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"827\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"943\">The first step is choosing the BCA in Data Science program according to your career goals and technical interests.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7tl3m5\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"967\">What You Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1209\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vbevvo\" data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1027\">Review the course curriculum and semester-wise subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4eh7o1\" data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1080\">Understand career opportunities after completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1basqe7\" data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1127\">Check eligibility criteria and fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12mgke6\" data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1209\">Choose the program that matches your interests in data science and technology</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1236\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1392\">Selecting the right program helps students build a strong foundation in programming, analytics, artificial intelligence, and modern computing technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1397\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1430\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1559\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the online application form with accurate personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1581\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1727\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1606\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1637\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1657\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1676\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ry4c1f\" data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1727\">Academic certificates and supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1746\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1878\">Students should carefully verify all details before submission to avoid delays during document verification and admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1883\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1912\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"2006\">Once the application form is completed, students can proceed with secure online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1frahit\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2037\">Payment Options Available</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2149\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2058\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rj4yp9\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2081\">Annual fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gcxc6r\" data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2118\">Semester-wise installment option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rm4em\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2149\">EMI options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2163\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2298\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"czinu9\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2200\">Secure online transaction system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1whjmej\" data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2229\">Flexible payment methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4gjlv\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2257\">Transparent fee process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"goodf7\" data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2298\">Easy financial planning for students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2379\">Students should keep payment confirmation receipts safely for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2384\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2409\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2516\">After successful fee payment, students must submit the application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2547\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2691\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2580\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1swlyme\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2619\">Verification of uploaded documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkq1vh\" data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2657\">Registration confirmation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sj6t3c\" data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2691\">Admission approval initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2711\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2826\">Students should review all submitted details carefully before final registration to avoid correction issues later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2831\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"tm9ntv\" data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2868\">5. Await Your Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2977\">After successful verification and approval, students receive enrollment confirmation and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tzag21\" data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3004\">Students Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3209\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dsy75\" data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3040\">Enrollment confirmation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3070\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj90sq\" data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3113\">Access to the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1waf8k9\" data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3163\">Academic schedule and orientation information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckxgom\" data-start=\"3164\" data-end=\"3209\">Guidance regarding classes and coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3295\">This step officially marks the beginning of the BCA in Data Science program journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3300\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3302\" data-end=\"3336\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3418\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3610\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jv793l\" data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3455\">10th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9g1oz\" data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3491\">12th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13gbnd3\" data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3544\">Government identity proof (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3573\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pd3dhz\" data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3610\">Valid mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3684\">Foreign students may require additional academic verification documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"497\">The BCA in Data Science program is designed for students who want to build strong careers in software development, data analytics, artificial intelligence, machine learning, cloud technologies, and modern IT industries. The eligibility criteria ensure that students have the required academic background and communication skills to successfully pursue technical and analytical education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"652\">This program is suitable for learners aiming to develop strong programming, analytical, and problem-solving skills for future technology-focused careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"657\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1y3vvl5\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"699\">Who Can Apply for BCA in Data Science?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"831\">The program is suitable for students and aspirants interested in computer applications, programming, and data-driven technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"849\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"1248\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1my9bzw\" data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"918\">Fresh 10+2 pass-out students interested in computer applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ccg5a\" data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"1002\">Aspirants planning careers in data science, AI, machine learning, and analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bs0xlz\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1077\">Students interested in software development and modern IT technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8uqauv\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1166\">Learners aiming to build a strong academic foundation for higher technical education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15sqgi3\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1248\">Individuals seeking careers in IT, financial services, and digital industries</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1355\">The course provides a strong technical foundation for both employment and higher education opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1360\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1404\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1485\">Indian students must fulfill the following academic requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1511\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1843\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u67rmg\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1580\">10th Class Certificate (Completing 10 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ywvyw\" data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1649\">12th Class Certificate (Completing 12 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3drox\" data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1755\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations may also apply, subject to eligibility fulfillment later</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jfwn4t\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1843\">NIOS board candidates are also eligible if they meet the required academic criteria</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"necfy1\" data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1877\">English Language Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"2104\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qb55tz\" data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1982\">Applicants must possess sufficient knowledge and understanding of English language and communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ppo4b1\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2104\">Candidates who have not studied in English for at least three years in their academic qualifications are not eligible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2125\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2329\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ex9zni\" data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2174\">Students from recognized boards are eligible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wajx33\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2258\">Basic analytical and logical reasoning skills can be helpful during the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1axogfj\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2329\">Interest in technology and computing can improve learning outcomes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2444\">The eligibility structure allows students from multiple educational backgrounds to pursue data science education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2449\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2494\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2567\">International applicants must meet the following academic requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2593\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2794\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zj7pnc\" data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2690\">Secondary School Certificate (Completing 10 years of formal schooling; diploma not accepted)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13z4vfa\" data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2794\">Senior Secondary School Certificate (Completing 12 years of formal schooling; diploma not accepted)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cjse4g\" data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2822\">Additional Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2930\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9j3n8\" data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2930\">Students should possess sufficient English communication and comprehension skills for academic learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"3032\">Foreign students must ensure that their qualifications are from recognized educational institutions.</p>', '<p data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"484\">The BCA in Data Science fee structure is designed to provide affordable and flexible payment options for students planning careers in data science, artificial intelligence, machine learning, analytics, and software development. The program offers semester-wise payment flexibility along with a 24-month zero-cost EMI option, helping students manage educational expenses more comfortably.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"636\">This flexible fee structure makes technical education more accessible for students aiming to enter the fast-growing technology and analytics industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"641\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ho1e8l\" data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"687\">BCA in Data Science Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"738\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"738\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"706\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"720\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"738\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"818\">\r\n<td data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"772\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"784\">₹1,75,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"818\">Total fee for complete program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"882\">\r\n<td data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"838\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"848\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹29,200</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"882\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexible semester-wise payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<td data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"909\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"924\">₹6,927/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"952\">Interest-free EMI option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"957\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"5da2lj\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"977\">Full Program Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1156\">The total fee for the complete BCA in Data Science program is structured to provide students with access to industry-oriented technical education and digital learning resources.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1173\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1205\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ucm1k9\" data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1205\">Full Program Fee: ₹1,75,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1219\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1403\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yf1bv\" data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1266\">Covers complete academic program structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dep1ne\" data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1322\">Access to technical and analytical learning modules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w8ad6j\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1364\">Industry-oriented curriculum exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljnep5\" data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1403\">Long-term career-focused education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1493\">The fee structure is designed to balance affordability with modern technology education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1525\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1634\">Students can also choose the semester-wise payment option for easier financial planning during the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1651\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10w4dt\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1681\">Per Semester Fee: ₹29,200</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1695\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1885\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m2qhyz\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1735\">Flexible installment-based payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ohjx3g\" data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1774\">Lower financial burden at one time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"avxula\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1821\">Easier budgeting for students and families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pgu0zl\" data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1885\">Convenient payment structure throughout the course duration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1964\">This option is suitable for students preferring manageable academic payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1969\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2003\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2139\">The zero-cost EMI facility allows students to pay the course fee through monthly installments without any additional interest charges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2156\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2227\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ykhy7\" data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2185\">EMI Amount: ₹6,927/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kg8l8c\" data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2227\">Interest Rate: 0% (Interest-Free EMI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2241\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2406\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xb937v\" data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2281\">No hidden charges or extra interest</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ukdeeu\" data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2313\">Affordable monthly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xtsqel\" data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2359\">Better financial flexibility for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m4vnhi\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2406\">Makes technology education more accessible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2498\">This option is especially beneficial for self-financed learners and working professionals.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"457\">The BCA in Data Science program is designed to provide students with strong technical knowledge in programming, databases, artificial intelligence, machine learning, data analytics, visualization, and big data technologies. The curriculum combines computer application fundamentals with modern data science tools and analytical techniques used across industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"659\">The semester-wise syllabus gradually develops students from programming basics to advanced concepts like deep learning, AI, and big data analytics, preparing them for modern technology-driven careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"664\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gj3crw\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"710\">BCA in Data Science Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"734\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"841\">The first semester focuses on foundational computing, programming, mathematics, and communication skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o13yow\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"884\">Computer and Information Technology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"954\">Introduces computer systems, software, hardware, and IT fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"83dk4h\" data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"981\">Basic Mathematics I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1053\">Covers mathematical concepts important for computing and data analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1a66auz\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1077\">Programming in C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1166\">Introduces programming logic, coding fundamentals, and problem-solving using C language.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"41le4g\" data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1196\">Business Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1271\">Develops communication, presentation, and professional interaction skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"564l9g\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1305\">Human Computer Interaction</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1390\">Focuses on user interface design and interaction between users and computer systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1419\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1513\">The second semester focuses on software development, operating systems, and data structures.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ea184m\" data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1543\">Data Structure using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1630\">Introduces data organization techniques like arrays, stacks, queues, and linked lists.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11okhu5\" data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1663\">Operating System Concepts</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1739\">Covers process management, memory handling, and operating system functions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vsjjss\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1787\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1858\">Develops teamwork, leadership, and interpersonal communication skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aa32vr\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1887\">Environmental Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1949\">Focuses on environmental awareness and sustainable practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1curtec\" data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1990\">Software Engineering and Modeling</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2065\">Introduces software development processes and system design methodologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2070\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2094\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2192\">The third semester focuses on databases, networking, Java programming, and statistical concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kxhqjn\" data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2224\">Computational Statistics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2295\">Introduces statistical techniques used in data analysis and computing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"187r3dp\" data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2346\">Introduction to Database Management Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2409\">Covers database concepts, SQL, and data management techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"141mhnx\" data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2432\">Green Computing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2495\">Focuses on environmentally sustainable computing technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4ol01\" data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2517\">Network Basics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2587\">Introduces networking concepts, protocols, and communication systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"abraii\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2633\">Object Oriented Programming Using Java</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2699\">Covers Java programming and object-oriented development concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2704\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2728\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2844\">The fourth semester introduces students to data science tools, Python, R programming, and visualization platforms.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"btbxx4\" data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2895\">Unix Operating System and Shell Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2949\">Introduces UNIX systems and shell scripting concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ap1xl7\" data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2975\">Python Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2976\" data-end=\"3046\">Focuses on Python language for software and data science applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bs7ouh\" data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3085\">Data Science Using R and Python</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3160\">Covers data analysis, manipulation, and modeling using R and Python tools.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u24qg0\" data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3200\">Data Visualization using Tableau</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3279\">Introduces data visualization techniques and dashboard creation using Tableau.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nqh1ob\" data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3318\">Data Science Essentials Using R</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3390\">Focuses on core data science methods and analytical techniques using R.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3392\" data-end=\"3470\">This semester builds strong analytical and practical data science foundations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3475\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nyzmvl\" data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3499\">Semester 5 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3587\">The fifth semester focuses on artificial intelligence and machine learning techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16ms3fy\" data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3634\">Introduction to Artificial Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3708\">Introduces AI concepts, intelligent systems, and automation technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sv58j\" data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3741\">Fundamentals of Ecommerce</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3742\" data-end=\"3801\">Covers online business systems and digital commerce models.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"3828\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3909\">Focuses on ethical standards and responsible practices in technology industries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c2xdzl\" data-start=\"3911\" data-end=\"3947\">Supervised Learning Techniques</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"4009\">Introduces machine learning models based on labeled datasets.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bqtywa\" data-start=\"4011\" data-end=\"4049\">Unsupervised Learning Techniques</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4050\" data-end=\"4129\">Focuses on clustering, pattern recognition, and predictive analysis techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4131\" data-end=\"4227\">Students gain practical understanding of machine learning applications in real-world industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4229\" data-end=\"4232\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10le376\" data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4256\">Semester 6 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4258\" data-end=\"4350\">The final semester focuses on advanced analytics, deep learning, and practical project work.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ydv96w\" data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4371\">Major Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4458\">Students work on a real-world data science or software project for practical exposure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10u79t8\" data-start=\"4460\" data-end=\"4484\">Big Data Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4485\" data-end=\"4550\">Introduces large-scale data processing and big data technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"90ywyu\" data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4571\">Deep Learning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4572\" data-end=\"4647\">Covers neural networks, advanced AI models, and deep learning applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yxvrf1\" data-start=\"4649\" data-end=\"4697\">Fundamentals of Image and Video Processing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4698\" data-end=\"4770\">Focuses on image analysis, video processing, and computer vision basics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4772\" data-end=\"4869\">This semester helps students apply technical and analytical skills to industry-oriented projects.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 175000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(354, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 301, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 05:06:04', '2026-06-17 00:10:11', '<p data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"506\">The admission process for the BCA in Cloud &amp; Data Engineering program is simple, fully online, and designed to provide students with a smooth enrollment experience. From selecting the program to receiving enrollment confirmation, every step is structured to help students begin their journey toward careers in cloud computing, data engineering, big data analytics, software development, and modern IT technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"657\">The admission system is designed for fresh 10+2 students and learners interested in building technical expertise in cloud and data-driven industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"662\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1by6wiv\" data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"730\">BCA in Cloud &amp; Data Engineering Admission Process (Step-by-Step)</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"867\">The admission procedure is divided into five simple stages that guide students through the complete application and enrollment process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"899\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"1027\">The first step is choosing the BCA in Cloud &amp; Data Engineering program according to your career goals and technical interests.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7tl3m5\" data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1051\">What You Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1323\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wtcy98\" data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1114\">Review the semester-wise syllabus and curriculum structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fb8az0\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1174\">Understand career opportunities after course completion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1basqe7\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1221\">Check eligibility criteria and fee details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fo5lf8\" data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1323\">Select the program based on your interest in cloud computing, big data, and software technologies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1350\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1501\">Choosing the right specialization helps students build strong foundations in cloud systems, analytics, programming, and data engineering technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1506\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1539\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1668\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the online application form with accurate academic and personal details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1690\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1836\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1715\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1746\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1766\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1785\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ry4c1f\" data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1836\">Academic certificates and supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1855\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1987\">Students should carefully verify all details before submission to avoid delays during document verification and admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"1992\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2021\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2115\">Once the application form is completed, students can proceed with secure online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1frahit\" data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2146\">Payment Options Available</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2261\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugicoe\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2167\">One-time payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rj4yp9\" data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2190\">Annual fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gcxc6r\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2227\">Semester-wise installment option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17sohi5\" data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2261\">EMI facilities (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2275\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2422\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zr81bj\" data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2308\">Secure online payment system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r8qave\" data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2350\">Flexible payment methods for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gee6gt\" data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2380\">Transparent fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nzzhxh\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2422\">Convenient financial planning options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2511\">Students are advised to keep payment confirmation receipts safely for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2516\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2541\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2648\">After successful fee payment, students must submit the application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2679\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2823\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2712\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1swlyme\" data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2751\">Verification of uploaded documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkq1vh\" data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2789\">Registration confirmation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sj6t3c\" data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2823\">Admission approval initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2843\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2964\">Students should review all entered details carefully before final registration to avoid correction-related delays later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"2969\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k4gqa1\" data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3005\">5. Await for Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3114\">After successful verification and approval, students receive enrollment confirmation and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tzag21\" data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3141\">Students Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3342\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dsy75\" data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3177\">Enrollment confirmation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3207\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj90sq\" data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3250\">Access to the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jfpson\" data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3296\">Academic schedule and orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckxgom\" data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3342\">Guidance regarding classes and coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3441\">This step officially marks the beginning of the BCA in Cloud &amp; Data Engineering academic journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3446\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3482\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3484\" data-end=\"3564\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3756\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jv793l\" data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3601\">10th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9g1oz\" data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3637\">12th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13gbnd3\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3690\">Government identity proof (Aadhaar/PAN/Passport)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"3719\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pd3dhz\" data-start=\"3720\" data-end=\"3756\">Valid mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3830\">Foreign students may require additional academic verification documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"496\">The BCA in Cloud &amp; Data Engineering program is designed for students who want to build strong careers in software development, cloud computing, big data, cybersecurity, data engineering, and modern IT industries. The eligibility criteria ensure that students have the required academic background and communication skills to successfully pursue technical and analytical education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"651\">This program is suitable for learners aiming to develop practical technical expertise and build strong foundations for future technology-focused careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"656\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vvsrar\" data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"710\">Who Can Apply for BCA in Cloud &amp; Data Engineering?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"842\">The program is suitable for students and aspirants interested in computer applications, cloud technologies, and modern IT systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"860\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1266\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1my9bzw\" data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"929\">Fresh 10+2 pass-out students interested in computer applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fzn0h9\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"1023\">Aspirants planning careers in cloud computing, data engineering, and software development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qozkev\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1094\">Students interested in IT, analytics, and cybersecurity industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"70unf6\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1174\">Learners aiming to build a strong technical foundation for higher education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nl5g93\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1266\">Individuals seeking opportunities in private and public sector technology organizations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1387\">The course helps students gain industry-oriented technical and analytical skills required in modern digital industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1392\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1436\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1519\">Indian applicants must fulfill the following academic requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1545\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1877\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u67rmg\" data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1614\">10th Class Certificate (Completing 10 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ywvyw\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1683\">12th Class Certificate (Completing 12 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3drox\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1789\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations may also apply, subject to eligibility fulfillment later</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jfwn4t\" data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1877\">NIOS board candidates are also eligible if they meet the required academic criteria</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"necfy1\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1911\">English Language Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"2138\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qb55tz\" data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"2016\">Applicants must possess sufficient knowledge and understanding of English language and communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ppo4b1\" data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2138\">Candidates who have not studied in English for at least three years in their academic qualifications are not eligible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2159\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f31ixl\" data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2220\">Students from recognized educational boards are eligible</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ge27hx\" data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2307\">Basic analytical and logical reasoning skills can be beneficial during the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zwjosl\" data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2400\">Interest in computers, cloud technologies, and programming can improve learning outcomes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2527\">The eligibility structure allows students from different academic backgrounds to pursue cloud and data engineering education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2532\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2577\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2648\">International students must meet the following academic requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou4858\" data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2674\">Academic Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2875\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zj7pnc\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2771\">Secondary School Certificate (Completing 10 years of formal schooling; diploma not accepted)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13z4vfa\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2875\">Senior Secondary School Certificate (Completing 12 years of formal schooling; diploma not accepted)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cjse4g\" data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2903\">Additional Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"3011\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9j3n8\" data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"3011\">Students should possess sufficient English communication and comprehension skills for academic learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3115\">Foreign applicants must ensure that their qualifications are from recognized educational institutions.</p>', '<p data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"499\">The BCA in Cloud &amp; Data Engineering fee structure is designed to provide flexible and affordable payment options for students planning careers in cloud computing, big data analytics, software development, data engineering, and modern IT industries. The program offers semester-wise payment flexibility along with a 24-month zero-cost EMI facility to make technical education more accessible.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"623\">The fee structure is suitable for students seeking industry-oriented education with manageable financial planning options.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"628\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12zlixb\" data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"686\">BCA in Cloud &amp; Data Engineering Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"975\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"705\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"719\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"737\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"975\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"820\">\r\n<td data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Course Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,50,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"820\">Total fee for the complete program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"891\">\r\n<td data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"840\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"850\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹41,700</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"891\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexible semester-wise payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"975\">\r\n<td data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"918\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"933\">₹9,896/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"975\">Interest-free monthly installment plan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"980\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w5653i\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"999\">Full Course Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1181\">The total fee for the complete BCA in Cloud &amp; Data Engineering program is structured to provide students with access to advanced technical learning and industry-focused curriculum.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1198\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1229\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b3jrd0\" data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1229\">Full Course Fee: ₹2,50,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1243\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1424\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3rrrvb\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1284\">Covers the complete academic program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ufw09l\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1342\">Access to cloud and data engineering learning modules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1et3197\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1385\">Industry-oriented technical curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljnep5\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1424\">Long-term career-focused education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1544\">The program fee is designed to balance affordability with modern technology education and practical skill development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1549\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1576\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1690\">Students can choose the semester-wise payment option for easier financial management during the course duration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1707\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1737\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kk864a\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1737\">Per Semester Fee: ₹41,700</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1751\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zq2svx\" data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1800\">Flexible installment-based payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlr07f\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1841\">Reduced financial burden at one time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"avxula\" data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1888\">Easier budgeting for students and families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qqcj7s\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1942\">Convenient payment process throughout the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2021\">This option is suitable for students preferring manageable academic payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2026\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2060\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2196\">The zero-cost EMI facility allows students to pay the course fee through monthly installments without any additional interest charges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2213\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2284\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t72d2z\" data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2242\">EMI Amount: ₹9,896/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kg8l8c\" data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2284\">Interest Rate: 0% (Interest-Free EMI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2298\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2448\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ouu4qb\" data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2344\">No hidden charges or extra interest costs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ukdeeu\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2376\">Affordable monthly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xcxnsc\" data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2409\">Better financial flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11nkytc\" data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2448\">Easy access to technical education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2577\">This option is especially beneficial for self-financed learners and working professionals planning to upgrade technical skills.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"448\">The BCA in Cloud &amp; Data Engineering program is designed to provide students with strong technical knowledge in programming, databases, cloud computing, big data technologies, analytics, and software development. The curriculum combines computer application fundamentals with modern cloud and data engineering concepts used across industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"654\">The semester-wise syllabus gradually develops students from basic computing and programming concepts to advanced cloud platforms, data analytics, big data applications, and cloud engineering technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"659\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1jg3diu\" data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"717\">BCA in Cloud &amp; Data Engineering Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"741\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"854\">The first semester focuses on computer fundamentals, mathematics, communication skills, and programming basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ohwsgi\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"883\">Basic Mathematics &ndash; I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"967\">Introduces mathematical concepts important for programming and analytical thinking.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"41le4g\" data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"997\">Business Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1072\">Develops communication, presentation, and professional interaction skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o13yow\" data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1115\">Computer and Information Technology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1181\">Covers computer systems, software, hardware, and IT fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"564l9g\" data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1215\">Human Computer Interaction</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1304\">Focuses on interaction between users and computer systems and interface design concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1a66auz\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1328\">Programming in C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1417\">Introduces coding fundamentals, programming logic, and problem-solving using C language.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1515\">This semester builds the foundational technical skills required for advanced computing subjects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1520\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1544\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1638\">The second semester focuses on software development, operating systems, and data structures.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n0m5th\" data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1669\">Data Structures using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1756\">Introduces data organization methods such as arrays, stacks, queues, and linked lists.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aa32vr\" data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1785\">Environmental Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1847\">Focuses on environmental awareness and sustainable practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vsjjss\" data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1895\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1969\">Develops leadership, teamwork, and interpersonal communication abilities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11okhu5\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2002\">Operating System Concepts</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2078\">Covers process management, memory handling, and operating system functions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1curtec\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2119\">Software Engineering and Modeling</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2202\">Introduces software development processes, system design, and modeling techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2282\">Students gain practical understanding of software and system-level operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2287\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2311\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2411\">The third semester focuses on databases, networking, Java programming, and computational concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c8ei6\" data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2461\">Introduction to Database Management System</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2524\">Covers database concepts, SQL, and data management techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kxhqjn\" data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2556\">Computational Statistics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2620\">Introduces statistical methods used in computing and analytics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"141mhnx\" data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2643\">Green Computing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2706\">Focuses on environmentally sustainable computing technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4ol01\" data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2728\">Network Basics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2811\">Introduces networking concepts, communication protocols, and network architecture.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u3p0re\" data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2857\">Object Oriented Programming using Java</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2934\">Covers Java programming and object-oriented software development principles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"3018\">This semester strengthens programming, networking, and database management skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3023\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3047\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3150\">The fourth semester introduces cloud, data management, Python programming, and big data fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"btbxx4\" data-start=\"3152\" data-end=\"3201\">Unix Operating System and Shell Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3255\">Introduces UNIX systems and shell scripting concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ap1xl7\" data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3281\">Python Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3364\">Focuses on Python language for software development and data-related applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"onudib\" data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3412\">Fundamentals of Data and Data Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3413\" data-end=\"3474\">Covers data organization, storage, and management techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gaawmz\" data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3511\">Data Engineering Fundamentals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3585\">Introduces data pipelines, processing systems, and engineering workflows.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kv84bs\" data-start=\"3587\" data-end=\"3638\">Understanding of Big Data and its Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3639\" data-end=\"3722\">Focuses on big data technologies, frameworks, and real-world business applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3813\">This semester builds strong foundations in data engineering and modern computing systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3815\" data-end=\"3818\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nyzmvl\" data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3842\">Semester 5 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3960\">The fifth semester focuses on artificial intelligence, data transformation, analytics, and visualization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16ms3fy\" data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"4007\">Introduction to Artificial Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4081\">Introduces AI concepts, intelligent systems, and automation technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sv58j\" data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4114\">Fundamentals of Ecommerce</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4174\">Covers digital business models and online commerce systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4201\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4288\">Focuses on ethical standards and professional responsibility in technology industries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hvxm1c\" data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4354\">Understanding Statistical Concepts for Data Transformation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4427\">Introduces statistical methods used for transforming and analyzing data.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zt54wa\" data-start=\"4429\" data-end=\"4491\">Exploratory Data Analysis and Visualization using Python</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4492\" data-end=\"4576\">Focuses on data analysis, interpretation, and visualization techniques using Python.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4672\">Students develop practical analytical and problem-solving skills for data-driven environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4674\" data-end=\"4677\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10le376\" data-start=\"4679\" data-end=\"4701\">Semester 6 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4797\">The final semester focuses on cloud computing, advanced analytics, and practical project work.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ydv96w\" data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4818\">Major Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4819\" data-end=\"4915\">Students work on a real-world cloud or data engineering project for practical industry exposure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yh9awz\" data-start=\"4917\" data-end=\"4963\">PySpark Data Analytics and Visualization</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4964\" data-end=\"5040\">Introduces big data processing and visualization using PySpark technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mspa7c\" data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5075\">Introduction to Cloud (AWS)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5076\" data-end=\"5136\">Covers cloud computing fundamentals and AWS platform basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sg213y\" data-start=\"5138\" data-end=\"5163\">Cloud Data Engineer</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5164\" data-end=\"5235\">Focuses on cloud-based data systems, storage, and engineering concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5237\" data-end=\"5337\">This semester helps students apply technical knowledge to practical cloud and big data environments.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 250000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(355, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 302, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 05:15:33', '2026-06-17 00:10:31', '<p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"381\">The admission process for the BBA in Tourism &amp; Travel Management program is simple, fully online, and designed to help students complete enrollment smoothly. The process guides students from program selection to final enrollment confirmation in a structured and student-friendly manner.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"573\">This admission system is ideal for students planning careers in tourism management, hospitality, aviation, travel operations, customer relationship management, and global tourism industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"578\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rhpbfo\" data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"634\">BBA in Tourism &amp; Travel Management Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"750\">The admission procedure is divided into five easy steps to help students complete registration without difficulty.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"755\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"782\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"911\">The first step is selecting the BBA in Tourism &amp; Travel Management program according to your career interests and future goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uo5xys\" data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"940\">What Students Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19f3b7d\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"993\">Review the curriculum and semester-wise syllabus</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1voneu9\" data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1053\">Understand tourism and hospitality career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l0pp60\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1102\">Check eligibility criteria and fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4d1o22\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1195\">Select the program based on career interests in tourism, aviation, and travel industries</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1222\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1356\">Choosing the right program helps students build a strong foundation in tourism management, customer service, and business operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1361\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1394\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1489\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the online application form carefully.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1511\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1646\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1536\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19byrdb\" data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1564\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1584\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1603\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ifo4pq\" data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1646\">Educational certificates and documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1665\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1791\">Students should verify all information before submission to avoid delays during document verification and admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1825\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1946\">Once the application form is completed, students can proceed with fee payment through available online payment methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qeqfpo\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1967\">Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6e4qb7\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1996\">Full program fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oweka\" data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2029\">Semester-wise payment option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17sohi5\" data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2063\">EMI facilities (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2077\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2183\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11cpyht\" data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2111\">Secure online payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1whjmej\" data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2140\">Flexible payment methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10zz4dx\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2183\">Convenient fee management for students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2269\">Students should save payment receipts and confirmation details for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2274\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2299\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2401\">After fee payment, students must complete the final application submission and registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2432\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2576\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2465\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1swlyme\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2504\">Verification of uploaded documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkq1vh\" data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2542\">Registration confirmation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sj6t3c\" data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2576\">Admission approval initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2596\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2702\">Students should review all details carefully before final submission to avoid future correction requests.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2707\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bdn7gh\" data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2736\">5. Await Your Enrollment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2840\">After successful verification and approval, students receive enrollment details and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tzag21\" data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2867\">Students Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"3061\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2895\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2925\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj90sq\" data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2968\">Access to the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jfpson\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3014\">Academic schedule and orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kmuug5\" data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3061\">Guidance related to classes and coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3155\">This step officially begins the student&rsquo;s academic journey in tourism and travel management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3160\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3196\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3278\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3441\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jv793l\" data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3315\">10th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9g1oz\" data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3351\">12th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1byub2s\" data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3375\">Government ID proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3404\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pd3dhz\" data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3441\">Valid mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3512\">Foreign students may need additional academic verification documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"503\">The BBA in Tourism &amp; Travel Management program is designed for students who want to build successful careers in tourism, hospitality, aviation, travel operations, customer relationship management, and business administration. The eligibility criteria ensure that students have the required academic background and communication skills needed for professional business and tourism education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"685\">This program is suitable for students, entrepreneurs, and aspirants looking to gain strong managerial knowledge along with specialized expertise in the tourism and travel industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"690\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pplz62\" data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"747\">Who Can Apply for BBA in Tourism &amp; Travel Management?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"848\">The program is ideal for students interested in business management and tourism-related industries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"866\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"1271\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hxnwq1\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"950\">Fresh 10+2 pass-out students seeking careers in business and tourism management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"159t0ua\" data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"1032\">Aspirants interested in travel, hospitality, aviation, and tourism industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"66s4k9\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1096\">Entrepreneurs looking to enhance business management skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13fhzu1\" data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1184\">Students wanting knowledge of HR, banking, accounting, law, and management concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dacm08\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1271\">Learners aiming to build careers in customer service and global tourism industries</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1368\">The program provides a combination of management education and tourism industry specialization.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1417\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1550\">Indian students must fulfill the following academic requirements for admission into the BBA in Tourism &amp; Travel Management program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p1jjjm\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1578\">Academic Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1878\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u67rmg\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1647\">10th Class Certificate (Completing 10 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ywvyw\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1716\">12th Class Certificate (Completing 12 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qt9k06\" data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1792\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations are also eligible to apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lv804l\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1878\">NIOS board candidates are eligible if they fulfill the required academic criteria</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"necfy1\" data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1912\">English Language Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"2117\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"145ixit\" data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"2003\">Applicants must possess sufficient knowledge and understanding of the English language</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1brmp7w\" data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2117\">Basic communication and comprehension skills are important for academic learning and professional development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2138\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2316\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5p0bg2\" data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2196\">Students from recognized educational boards can apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ezvw2\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2244\">No specific stream is mandatory in Class 12</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124kcys\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2316\">Commerce, Arts, and Science students are all eligible for admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2419\">The eligibility structure makes the program accessible to students from diverse academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2424\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2469\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2559\">International students applying for the program must fulfill the following requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p1jjjm\" data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2587\">Academic Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2763\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u5qfjj\" data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2675\">O Level Certificate (Completing 10 years of formal schooling; diploma not accepted)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nm68v7\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2763\">A Level Certificate (Completing 12 years of formal schooling; diploma not accepted)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cjse4g\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2791\">Additional Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2891\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dzt71w\" data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2891\">Students should have basic English communication and comprehension skills for academic learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"3004\">Foreign applicants must ensure that their educational qualifications are obtained from recognized institutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3009\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11qwqqx\" data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3061\">Why English Proficiency Matters in This Program?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3248\">Since the tourism and travel industry involves customer interaction, hospitality communication, and international business exposure, English communication skills play an important role.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bq01cq\" data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3293\">Benefits of Strong Communication Skills</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3533\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"84kycm\" data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3325\">Better customer interaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q5smpo\" data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3376\">Improved presentation and management abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pxr6r\" data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3428\">Stronger hospitality and tourism service skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17lnuwf\" data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3496\">Better career opportunities in international tourism industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f4bzex\" data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3533\">Enhanced professional confidence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3630\">Good communication skills help students perform effectively in tourism and hospitality sectors.</p>', '<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"477\">The BCA fee structure is designed to provide students with flexible and affordable payment options while pursuing careers in software development, programming, cloud computing, cybersecurity, data analytics, and modern IT industries. The program offers semester-wise payment flexibility along with a 24-month zero-cost EMI facility, helping students manage educational expenses more conveniently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"603\">The fee structure is suitable for students seeking industry-oriented technical education with budget-friendly payment plans.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"608\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ujtamu\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"638\">BCA Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"908\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"689\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"689\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"657\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"671\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"689\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"908\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"772\">\r\n<td data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"735\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,99,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"772\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total fee for the complete course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<td data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"792\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"802\">₹33,200</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"836\">Flexible semester-wise payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"908\">\r\n<td data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"863\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"878\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹7,877/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"908\">Interest-free EMI facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"913\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"5da2lj\" data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"933\">Full Program Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1086\">The total fee for the complete BCA program is structured to provide access to technical learning, practical skill development, and modern IT education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1103\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1135\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hhav1n\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1135\">Full Program Fee: ₹1,99,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1149\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1323\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"202hzy\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1193\">Covers the complete academic curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h7yrc0\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1234\">Access to digital learning resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1avew6k\" data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1276\">Industry-oriented technical education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r7ijgi\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1323\">Long-term career-focused program structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1413\">The fee structure is designed to balance affordability with quality technical education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1445\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1557\">Students can choose the semester-wise payment option for easier financial planning during the course duration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1574\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f6rlsq\" data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1604\">Per Semester Fee: ₹33,200</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1618\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1803\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zq2svx\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1667\">Flexible installment-based payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlr07f\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1708\">Reduced financial burden at one time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"avxula\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1755\">Easier budgeting for students and families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2tw0i\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1803\">Convenient payment process across semesters</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1882\">This option is suitable for students who prefer manageable academic payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1921\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"2053\">The zero-cost EMI facility allows students to pay the course fee through monthly installments without additional interest charges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2070\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2141\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"192333u\" data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2099\">EMI Amount: ₹7,877/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kg8l8c\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2141\">Interest Rate: 0% (Interest-Free EMI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2155\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2318\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xb937v\" data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2195\">No hidden charges or extra interest</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bvracm\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2233\">Affordable monthly payment option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xtsqel\" data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2279\">Better financial flexibility for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11nkytc\" data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2318\">Easy access to technical education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2394\">This option is beneficial for self-financed students and working learners.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"545\">The BBA in Tourism &amp; Travel Management program is designed to provide students with strong business management knowledge along with specialized expertise in tourism, hospitality, aviation, travel operations, customer service, and destination management. The curriculum combines core management subjects with industry-oriented tourism and travel concepts to prepare students for careers in the fast-growing global tourism industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"737\">The semester-wise syllabus gradually develops students from management fundamentals to advanced tourism operations, airline management, travel planning, and international tourism strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"742\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12r3ewf\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"803\">BBA in Tourism &amp; Travel Management Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"827\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"926\">The first semester focuses on business fundamentals, communication skills, and management basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k61koj\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"957\">Accounting Fundamentals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1035\">Introduces financial accounting concepts and business transaction management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"41le4g\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1065\">Business Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1140\">Develops communication, presentation, and professional interaction skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d7eb7i\" data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1169\">Management Foundation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1239\">Covers basic principles of management and organizational functioning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a1fd72\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1270\">Principles of Marketing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1355\">Introduces marketing concepts, customer behavior, and business promotion strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16j16n9\" data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1382\">Business Statistics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1461\">Focuses on statistical concepts used in business analysis and decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1541\">This semester builds a strong foundation in business and management education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1546\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1570\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1684\">The second semester focuses on financial management, HR fundamentals, IT applications, and personal development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vsjjss\" data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1732\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1806\">Develops leadership, teamwork, and interpersonal communication abilities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xopzeb\" data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1841\">IT Applications in Business</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1922\">Introduces business technologies and digital applications used in organizations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aa32vr\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1951\">Environmental Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2024\">Focuses on environmental awareness and sustainable development concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"159npgh\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2068\">Fundamentals of Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2138\">Covers financial planning, budgeting, and resource management basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lmegrh\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2187\">Fundamentals of Human Resource Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2265\">Introduces recruitment, employee management, and organizational HR practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2353\">Students gain practical understanding of business operations and management functions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2358\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2382\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2492\">The third semester introduces tourism management, aviation operations, and organizational behavior concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dw26v9\" data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2538\">Principles of Organizational Behaviour</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2606\">Focuses on employee behavior, motivation, and workplace management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ek8b5r\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2664\">Essentials of Production and Operations Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2733\">Introduces operational processes and business efficiency management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"muukiw\" data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2770\">Research Methods for Managers</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2835\">Covers business research techniques and data collection methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wevkq8\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2874\">Tourism Principles and Concepts</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2953\">Introduces tourism industry structure, travel systems, and tourism operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kupmmg\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"3006\">Introduction to Aviation &amp; Airport Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3086\">Focuses on airline operations, airport systems, and aviation management basics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3171\">This semester helps students understand tourism and aviation industry fundamentals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3176\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3200\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3312\">The fourth semester focuses on entrepreneurship, customer behavior, operations research, and heritage tourism.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"byxqt6\" data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3352\">Fundamentals of Entrepreneurship</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3353\" data-end=\"3430\">Introduces startup planning, business innovation, and entrepreneurial skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15payjx\" data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3470\">Principles of Consumer Behaviour</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3536\">Focuses on customer decision-making and market behavior analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11kdntl\" data-start=\"3538\" data-end=\"3563\">Operations Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3649\">Covers analytical methods used for business problem-solving and operational planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dh8xub\" data-start=\"3651\" data-end=\"3688\">Culture and Heritage Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3776\">Introduces cultural tourism, heritage preservation, and tourism destination management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3869\">Students gain specialized knowledge related to tourism experiences and cultural industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3874\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nyzmvl\" data-start=\"3876\" data-end=\"3898\">Semester 5 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"4020\">The fifth semester focuses on digital marketing, tourism customer service, airline ticketing, and international tourism.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3vpli4\" data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4052\">Marketing in Digital Age</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4053\" data-end=\"4124\">Introduces digital marketing strategies and online customer engagement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"4126\" data-end=\"4151\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4238\">Focuses on ethical standards and professional conduct in business and tourism sectors.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pg1hdn\" data-start=\"4240\" data-end=\"4263\">Business Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4264\" data-end=\"4335\">Covers strategic planning and competitive business management concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1736oua\" data-start=\"4337\" data-end=\"4373\">Managing Customer Relationship</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4446\">Focuses on customer satisfaction and relationship management techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v2ru26\" data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4503\">Customer Care and Interpersonal Skills in Tourism</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4504\" data-end=\"4581\">Develops communication and customer service skills for tourism professionals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"by0qbj\" data-start=\"4583\" data-end=\"4614\">Airline Ticketing and CRS</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4615\" data-end=\"4692\">Introduces airline reservation systems and computerized ticketing operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11dn0la\" data-start=\"4694\" data-end=\"4744\">International Tourism and Leisure Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4811\">Focuses on global tourism markets and leisure industry operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4813\" data-end=\"4893\">This semester prepares students for practical tourism and travel industry roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4895\" data-end=\"4898\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10le376\" data-start=\"4900\" data-end=\"4922\">Semester 6 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4924\" data-end=\"5012\">The final semester focuses on specialized tourism management and practical project work.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ycvixh\" data-start=\"5014\" data-end=\"5032\">Dissertation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5033\" data-end=\"5116\">Students complete a research-based project related to tourism or travel management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wvmv8c\" data-start=\"5118\" data-end=\"5148\">Medical &amp; Health Tourism</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5149\" data-end=\"5217\">Introduces healthcare tourism and wellness travel industry concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1loafso\" data-start=\"5219\" data-end=\"5268\">Travel Agency and Tour Operation Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5269\" data-end=\"5340\">Covers travel planning, tour operations, and agency management systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ngzwj7\" data-start=\"5342\" data-end=\"5373\">World Tourism Destination</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5374\" data-end=\"5457\">Focuses on major global tourism destinations and destination management strategies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5459\" data-end=\"5550\">This semester helps students apply theoretical learning to real tourism industry scenarios.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(356, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 130, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 05:31:42', '2026-06-17 00:11:03', '<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"358\">The admission process for the BBA in Business Analytics program is simple, fully online, and designed to help students complete enrollment smoothly. The process allows students to apply easily from anywhere while ensuring a transparent and convenient admission experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"527\">This admission system is ideal for students interested in business analytics, management, digital business, marketing, finance, operations, and data-driven industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"532\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"elalwy\" data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"579\">BBA in Business Analytics Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"713\">The admission procedure is divided into five easy steps that guide students from program selection to final enrollment confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"718\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"745\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"858\">The first step is selecting the BBA in Business Analytics program according to your career goals and interests.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uo5xys\" data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"887\">What Students Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mw02vt\" data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"940\">Review the semester-wise syllabus and curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18vdu2g\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1004\">Understand career opportunities in analytics and management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l0pp60\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1053\">Check eligibility criteria and fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"136duz4\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1143\">Choose the program based on your interest in business and data-driven decision-making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1170\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1298\">Selecting the right program helps students build strong foundations in management, analytics, marketing, and business strategy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1303\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1336\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1428\">After selecting the program, students must fill out the online application form carefully.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1450\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1475\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19byrdb\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1503\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1523\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1542\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vd08c1\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1596\">Educational certificates and supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1615\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1743\">Students should verify all details before final submission to avoid delays during document verification and admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1748\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1777\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1871\">Once the application form is completed, students can proceed with secure online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1frahit\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1902\">Payment Options Available</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1998\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6e4qb7\" data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1931\">Full program fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oweka\" data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1964\">Semester-wise payment option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17sohi5\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1998\">EMI facilities (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2012\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2185\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11cpyht\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2046\">Secure online payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r8qave\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2088\">Flexible payment methods for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nzzhxh\" data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2130\">Convenient financial planning options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a8138c\" data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2185\">Easy fee management throughout the course duration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2278\">Students should keep payment receipts and confirmation details safely for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2283\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2308\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2424\">After successful fee payment, students need to complete the final application submission and registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2455\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2599\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2488\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1swlyme\" data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2527\">Verification of uploaded documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkq1vh\" data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2565\">Registration confirmation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sj6t3c\" data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2599\">Admission approval initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2619\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2740\">Students should carefully review all entered details before final registration to avoid correction-related delays later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2745\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bdn7gh\" data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2774\">5. Await Your Enrollment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2878\">After successful verification and approval, students receive enrollment details and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tzag21\" data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2905\">Students Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"3110\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dsy75\" data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"2941\">Enrollment confirmation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2971\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj90sq\" data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3014\">Access to the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1waf8k9\" data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3064\">Academic schedule and orientation information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckxgom\" data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3110\">Guidance regarding classes and coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3208\">This step officially begins the student&rsquo;s academic journey in business analytics and management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3213\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3249\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3331\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3500\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jv793l\" data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3368\">10th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9g1oz\" data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3404\">12th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e3bfan\" data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3434\">Government identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3463\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pd3dhz\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3500\">Valid mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3571\">Foreign students may need additional academic verification documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"480\">The BBA in Business Analytics program is designed for students who want to build careers in business management, analytics, digital business, marketing, finance, operations, and data-driven industries. The eligibility criteria are structured to ensure that students have the required academic background and communication skills needed for management and analytical education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"620\">This program is suitable for fresh students, aspiring managers, and entrepreneurs looking to gain strong business and analytics knowledge.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"625\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2kela4\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"673\">Who Can Apply for BBA in Business Analytics?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"774\">The program is ideal for students interested in business management and analytical decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"792\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"1177\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im7n55\" data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"864\">Fresh 10+2 pass-out students seeking careers in business management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xb9jsi\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"932\">Entrepreneurs looking to enhance management and business skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"39bes4\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"1010\">Aspirants interested in analytics, marketing, HR, finance, and operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3twe1n\" data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1095\">Students wanting to understand banking, accounting, law, and management concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yjr9p7\" data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1177\">Learners aiming to build careers in business analytics and digital industries</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1273\">The course combines business fundamentals with modern analytical and decision-making concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1322\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1448\">Indian applicants must fulfill the following academic requirements for admission into the BBA in Business Analytics program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p1jjjm\" data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1476\">Academic Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1773\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u67rmg\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1545\">10th Class Certificate (Completing 10 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ywvyw\" data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1614\">12th Class Certificate (Completing 12 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qt9k06\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1690\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations are also eligible to apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i2rlv0\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1773\">NIOS board candidates are eligible if they meet the required academic criteria</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"necfy1\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1807\">English Language Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1998\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"145ixit\" data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1898\">Applicants must possess sufficient knowledge and understanding of the English language</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hpr3fj\" data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1998\">Basic communication and comprehension skills are important for business and analytical learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2019\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2271\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6wxndl\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2096\">Students from any stream including Commerce, Science, and Arts can apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r4gy96\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2167\">Admission is open to candidates from recognized educational boards</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uz8q6h\" data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2271\">Interest in management, business, and analytics can help students perform better during the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2406\">The eligibility criteria are designed to provide flexible admission opportunities to students from different educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2411\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2456\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2555\">International students applying for the program must fulfill the following academic requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p1jjjm\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2583\">Academic Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2759\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u5qfjj\" data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2671\">O Level Certificate (Completing 10 years of formal schooling; diploma not accepted)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nm68v7\" data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2759\">A Level Certificate (Completing 12 years of formal schooling; diploma not accepted)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cjse4g\" data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2787\">Additional Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2890\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5yjmc\" data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2890\">Students should possess basic English communication and comprehension skills for academic learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"3001\">Foreign students must ensure that their educational qualifications are obtained from recognized institutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3006\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"oe6t60\" data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3047\">Why English Proficiency is Important?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3230\">Since business analytics involves communication, presentations, reporting, and business decision-making, English language skills are important for academic and professional success.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bq01cq\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3275\">Benefits of Strong Communication Skills</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3527\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zx9fm7\" data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3323\">Better presentation and reporting abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t8pus0\" data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3374\">Improved teamwork and professional interaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wpq1zc\" data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3417\">Stronger business communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ds30iw\" data-start=\"3418\" data-end=\"3479\">Better understanding of analytics and management concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s14qh9\" data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3527\">Enhanced employability in corporate sectors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3621\">Good communication skills help students perform effectively in modern business environments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"511\">The BBA in Tourism &amp; Travel Management fee structure is designed to provide affordable and flexible payment options for students planning careers in tourism, hospitality, aviation, travel operations, and customer relationship management. The program offers semester-wise payment flexibility along with a 24-month zero-cost EMI facility, helping students manage educational expenses more conveniently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"650\">The fee structure supports students who want industry-oriented business and tourism education with manageable financial planning options.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"655\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13342l2\" data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"716\">BBA in Tourism &amp; Travel Management Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"767\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"767\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"735\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"767\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n<td data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"800\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Course Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"812\">₹2,30,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"850\">Total fee for the complete program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"921\">\r\n<td data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"870\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"880\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹38,400</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"921\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexible semester-wise payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<td data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"948\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"963\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹9,104/month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1005\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest-free monthly installment plan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w5653i\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1029\">Full Course Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1204\">The total fee for the complete BBA in Tourism &amp; Travel Management program is structured to provide students with access to business management and tourism-focused education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1221\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1252\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1830woy\" data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1252\">Full Course Fee: ₹2,30,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1266\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1454\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"202hzy\" data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1310\">Covers the complete academic curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17lpevt\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1364\">Access to tourism and management learning modules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m23ql5\" data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1405\">Industry-oriented business education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yyo15\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1454\">Long-term career-focused learning experience</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1560\">The program fee is designed to balance affordability with professional tourism and management education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1565\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1592\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1710\">Students can choose the semester-wise payment option for easier financial management throughout the course duration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1727\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1757\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kajgd3\" data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1757\">Per Semester Fee: ₹38,400</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1771\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1950\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"78iq0e\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1814\">Flexible installment-based fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlr07f\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1855\">Reduced financial burden at one time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"avxula\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1902\">Easier budgeting for students and families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2tw0i\" data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1950\">Convenient payment process across semesters</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2032\">This option is suitable for students preferring manageable educational expenses.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2037\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2071\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2198\">The zero-cost EMI facility allows students to pay the course fee in monthly installments without additional interest charges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2215\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eftp21\" data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2244\">EMI Amount: ₹9,104/month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kg8l8c\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2286\">Interest Rate: 0% (Interest-Free EMI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2300\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2480\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pjkgco\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2345\">No hidden charges or additional interest</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hurfrk\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2386\">Affordable monthly payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xtsqel\" data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2432\">Better financial flexibility for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17evl59\" data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2480\">Easy access to quality management education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2563\">This option is especially useful for self-financed students and working learners.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"473\">The BBA in Business Analytics program is designed to combine business management education with modern data analytics, statistical analysis, data visualization, and business intelligence concepts. The curriculum helps students develop strong management knowledge along with analytical and decision-making skills required in today&rsquo;s data-driven business environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"745\">The semester-wise syllabus gradually builds expertise in management fundamentals, marketing, finance, operations, data analytics, and business strategy, preparing students for careers in analytics, business consulting, digital business, and data-driven management roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1h28ri1\" data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"802\">BBA in Business Analytics Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"826\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"925\">The first semester focuses on management basics, communication skills, and business fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k61koj\" data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"956\">Accounting Fundamentals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1046\">Introduces accounting principles, financial transactions, and business record management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"41le4g\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1076\">Business Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1153\">Develops professional communication, presentation, and interpersonal skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d7eb7i\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1182\">Management Foundation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1263\">Covers the basic principles of business management and organizational structure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a1fd72\" data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1294\">Principles of Marketing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1380\">Introduces marketing concepts, branding, customer behavior, and promotion strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16j16n9\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1407\">Business Statistics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1486\">Focuses on statistical methods used for business analysis and decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1568\">This semester creates a strong foundation in management and business operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1573\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1597\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1707\">The second semester introduces financial management, HR concepts, IT applications, and personal development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vsjjss\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1755\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1822\">Develops teamwork, leadership, and personality enhancement skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xopzeb\" data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1857\">IT Applications in Business</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1931\">Introduces business technologies and digital tools used in organizations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aa32vr\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1960\">Environmental Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2031\">Focuses on environmental awareness and sustainable business practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"159npgh\" data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2075\">Fundamentals of Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2145\">Covers budgeting, financial planning, and resource allocation basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lmegrh\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2194\">Fundamentals of Human Resource Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2257\">Introduces recruitment, employee management, and HR practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2339\">Students gain practical knowledge of business operations and management systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2344\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2368\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2474\">The third semester introduces organizational management, research methods, and data management concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16ep5qo\" data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2519\">Principles of Organizational Behavior</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2599\">Focuses on workplace behavior, employee motivation, and organizational culture.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ek8b5r\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2657\">Essentials of Production and Operations Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2727\">Introduces operational planning and production management techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"muukiw\" data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2764\">Research Methods for Managers</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2839\">Covers business research techniques, surveys, and data collection methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"onudib\" data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2887\">Fundamentals of Data and Data Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2970\">Introduces data handling, data organization, and business data management systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3081\">This semester helps students understand how data supports business decision-making and organizational growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3086\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3110\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3204\">The fourth semester focuses on entrepreneurship, analytics tools, and big data architecture.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"byxqt6\" data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3244\">Fundamentals of Entrepreneurship</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3327\">Introduces startup development, innovation, and entrepreneurial management skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ronago\" data-start=\"3329\" data-end=\"3366\">Principles of Consumer Behavior</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3367\" data-end=\"3432\">Focuses on customer decision-making and buying behavior analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11kdntl\" data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3459\">Operations Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3460\" data-end=\"3540\">Covers analytical techniques used for solving business and operational problems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"impize\" data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3625\">Data Engineering Tools &amp; Working with Big Data Architecture &amp; Its Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3735\">Introduces big data systems, data engineering concepts, and analytics applications used in modern businesses.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3827\">Students begin developing technical and analytical understanding of business data systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3832\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nyzmvl\" data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3856\">Semester 5 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3955\">The fifth semester focuses on digital marketing, strategic management, and statistical analytics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3vpli4\" data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"3987\">Marketing in Digital Age</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"4078\">Introduces digital marketing strategies, online branding, and digital customer engagement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4105\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4106\" data-end=\"4176\">Focuses on ethical business practices and professional responsibility.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pg1hdn\" data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4201\">Business Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4282\">Covers strategic planning, competitive analysis, and business growth management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1736oua\" data-start=\"4284\" data-end=\"4320\">Managing Customer Relationship</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4321\" data-end=\"4390\">Introduces customer relationship management and retention strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mghd2e\" data-start=\"4392\" data-end=\"4436\">Understanding of Statistical Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4437\" data-end=\"4524\">Focuses on statistical analysis techniques used in business intelligence and analytics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4526\" data-end=\"4603\">This semester strengthens analytical and strategic decision-making abilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4608\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10le376\" data-start=\"4610\" data-end=\"4632\">Semester 6 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4634\" data-end=\"4724\">The final semester focuses on practical analytics applications and project-based learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ycvixh\" data-start=\"4726\" data-end=\"4744\">Dissertation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4832\">Students complete a research-based project related to business analytics or management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4c4a8b\" data-start=\"4834\" data-end=\"4914\">Exploratory Data Analysis and Visualization Using Python/Tableau for Leads</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4915\" data-end=\"4999\">Introduces data visualization and exploratory analytics using modern business tools.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1skw41k\" data-start=\"5001\" data-end=\"5052\">Data Analytics in Marketing &amp; Market Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5053\" data-end=\"5145\">Focuses on using analytics for marketing strategies, consumer insights, and market research.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5147\" data-end=\"5235\">This semester helps students apply analytical concepts to real-world business scenarios.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 230000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(357, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 310, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 05:49:16', '2026-06-17 00:11:22', '<p data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"383\">The admission process for the BCA in Applied Data Engineering program is simple, student-friendly, and fully online. The process is designed to help students complete their enrollment smoothly while providing easy access to industry-oriented computer application and data engineering education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"574\">Students interested in programming, cloud computing, DevOps, artificial intelligence, database management, and software development can complete the admission process in a few simple steps.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"579\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2yzsjz\" data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"632\">BCA in Applied Data Engineering Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"757\">The admission procedure is divided into five structured steps to help students complete registration and enrollment easily.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"762\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"789\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"915\">The first step is selecting the BCA in Applied Data Engineering program according to your career interests and future goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uo5xys\" data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"944\">What Students Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11a3jrv\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"992\">Review the complete syllabus and curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rkjwqx\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1055\">Understand career opportunities in IT and data engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l0pp60\" data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1104\">Check eligibility criteria and fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lu72yh\" data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1188\">Explore specialization subjects like cloud computing, DevOps, AI, and databases</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1220\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1358\">Choosing the right program helps students build strong technical and professional foundations for future careers in modern IT industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1363\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1396\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1507\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the online application form with the required details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19msnr7\" data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1533\">Information Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1679\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1554\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19byrdb\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1582\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1606\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1625\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vd08c1\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1679\">Educational certificates and supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1698\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1808\">Students should carefully verify all details before submission to avoid delays during admission verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1813\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1842\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1941\">Once the application form is completed, students can proceed with the online fee payment process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1frahit\" data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1972\">Payment Options Available</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2067\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fdsh7e\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2000\">Full course fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oweka\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2033\">Semester-wise payment option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17sohi5\" data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2067\">EMI facilities (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2081\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2268\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nshl9p\" data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2129\">Secure and convenient online payment system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r8qave\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2171\">Flexible payment methods for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16004gb\" data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2220\">Easier financial planning and fee management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ctxayo\" data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2268\">Quick confirmation after successful payment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2359\">Students are advised to save fee receipts and payment confirmations for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2364\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2389\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2491\">After fee payment, students must complete the final registration and application submission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2522\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2666\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2555\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1swlyme\" data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2594\">Verification of uploaded documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lxkklx\" data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2628\">Registration approval process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s5qgps\" data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2666\">Admission confirmation initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2686\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2814\">Students should review all information carefully before final registration submission to avoid correction-related delays later.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2819\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bdn7gh\" data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2848\">5. Await Your Enrollment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2952\">Once the verification process is completed, students receive enrollment details and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tzag21\" data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2979\">Students Will Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3174\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3007\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3037\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qbr030\" data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3082\">Access to the learning management system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jfpson\" data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3128\">Academic schedule and orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckxgom\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3174\">Guidance regarding classes and coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3289\">This step officially starts the student&rsquo;s learning journey in applied data engineering and computer applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3294\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3296\" data-end=\"3330\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3412\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3588\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jv793l\" data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3449\">10th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9g1oz\" data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3485\">12th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vgcg9r\" data-start=\"3486\" data-end=\"3522\">Government-issued identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3551\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pd3dhz\" data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3588\">Valid mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3662\">Foreign students may require additional academic verification documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"501\">The BCA in Applied Data Engineering program is designed for students who want to build careers in software development, cloud computing, data engineering, DevOps, artificial intelligence, and modern IT industries. The eligibility criteria are structured to ensure students have the required academic foundation and communication skills needed for technical education and professional growth.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"677\">This program is suitable for fresh 10+2 students, aspiring IT professionals, and learners planning to build strong careers in computer applications and emerging technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"682\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"o5vo2p\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"736\">Who Can Apply for BCA in Applied Data Engineering?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"866\">The program is ideal for students interested in computer applications, programming, cloud technologies, and data-driven systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"884\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"1249\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pc5oaa\" data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"958\">Fresh 10+2 pass-out students seeking careers in Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14rtekf\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1030\">Aspirants interested in software development and cloud technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3npk0m\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1086\">Students aiming for careers in IT &amp; ITES industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"srcblf\" data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1157\">Learners interested in AI, DevOps, databases, and data engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l1n721\" data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1249\">Students planning to pursue higher education in technology and computer science domains</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1346\">The course provides strong technical foundations along with industry-oriented computing skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1395\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1527\">Indian applicants must fulfill the following academic requirements for admission into the BCA in Applied Data Engineering program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p1jjjm\" data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1555\">Academic Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1852\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u67rmg\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1624\">10th Class Certificate (Completing 10 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ywvyw\" data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1693\">12th Class Certificate (Completing 12 years of formal schooling)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qt9k06\" data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1769\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations are also eligible to apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i2rlv0\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1852\">NIOS board candidates are eligible if they meet the required academic criteria</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"necfy1\" data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1886\">English Language Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"2117\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uyzwe6\" data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1995\">Applicants must possess sufficient knowledge and understanding of the English language and communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ppo4b1\" data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2117\">Candidates who have not studied in English for at least three years in their academic qualifications are not eligible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5ej4z\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2138\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2337\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hc90w1\" data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2205\">Students from Science, Commerce, or Arts backgrounds can apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xcmzp0\" data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2266\">Basic interest in computers and technology is beneficial</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r4gy96\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2337\">Admission is open to candidates from recognized educational boards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2453\">The eligibility structure ensures flexible admission opportunities for students from multiple educational streams.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2458\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2503\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2579\">International applicants must fulfill the following academic requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p1jjjm\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2607\">Academic Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2808\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zj7pnc\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2704\">Secondary School Certificate (Completing 10 years of formal schooling; diploma not accepted)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13z4vfa\" data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2808\">Senior Secondary School Certificate (Completing 12 years of formal schooling; diploma not accepted)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cjse4g\" data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2836\">Additional Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2939\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5yjmc\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2939\">Students should possess basic English communication and comprehension skills for academic learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"3046\">Foreign students should ensure that all educational qualifications are issued by recognized institutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"oe6t60\" data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3092\">Why English Proficiency is Important?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3233\">English communication plays a major role in technical education, coding documentation, project development, and professional communication.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a64prc\" data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3272\">Benefits of Strong English Skills</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3273\" data-end=\"3537\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11aulzz\" data-start=\"3273\" data-end=\"3321\">Better understanding of programming concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10sk843\" data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3375\">Easier communication during projects and teamwork</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16e9x68\" data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3433\">Improved technical documentation and reporting skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x1i616\" data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3480\">Better placement and interview preparation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yuajo1\" data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3537\">Enhanced professional growth in global IT industries</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3623\">Strong communication abilities support both academic success and career development.</p>', '<p data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"485\">The BBA in Business Analytics fee structure is designed to provide students with affordable and flexible payment options while pursuing industry-focused business and analytics education. The program combines management concepts with data analytics, business intelligence, and digital decision-making skills, making it a valuable career-oriented course for modern business industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"637\">Students can choose from flexible payment methods including semester-wise payment and 24-month zero-cost EMI facilities for easier financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"642\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1d2e0ow\" data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"694\">BBA in Business Analytics Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"993\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"743\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"743\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"713\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"727\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"743\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Benefits</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"993\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"834\">\r\n<td data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"776\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Course Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"788\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,30,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"834\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete program fee for the entire course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<td data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"854\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"864\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹38,400</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"905\">Flexible semester-wise payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"993\">\r\n<td data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"932\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"947\">₹9,104/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"993\">Interest-free monthly installment facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"998\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w5653i\" data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1017\">Full Course Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1136\">The total fee for the BBA in Business Analytics program covers the complete academic curriculum and learning support.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1153\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1830woy\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1184\">Full Course Fee: ₹2,30,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dcq6v4\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1207\">What Students Get</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4f6wkz\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1260\">Access to complete business analytics curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"186ptbt\" data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1303\">Learning resources and study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9r0r9a\" data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1343\">Online classes and academic support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9m7vf5\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1400\">Industry-oriented management and analytics education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ts6ttq\" data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1450\">Project-based learning and practical exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1543\">The full payment option is suitable for students who prefer a one-time academic investment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1575\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1697\">Students can also choose the semester-wise payment option for more convenient fee management during the course duration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1714\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1744\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kajgd3\" data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1744\">Per Semester Fee: ₹38,400</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1758\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1955\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlr07f\" data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1799\">Reduced financial burden at one time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rpce7w\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1853\">Easier payment planning for families and students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d7ivq2\" data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1906\">Flexible payment schedule throughout the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tt4310\" data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1955\">Convenient option for self-financed learners</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"2053\">This payment structure helps students continue their education without major financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2058\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hilery\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2094\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2230\">The zero-cost EMI option allows students to pay the course fee in affordable monthly installments without additional interest charges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2247\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2311\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1of789d\" data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2280\">EMI Amount: ₹9,104 per month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y9c8j\" data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2311\">Interest: 0% Interest Free</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fxs65l\" data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2339\">Benefits of EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2506\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hurfrk\" data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2380\">Affordable monthly payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2gpvw\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2411\">No hidden interest charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xcxnsc\" data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2444\">Better financial flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x407hs\" data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2506\">Easy access to quality management and analytics education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2606\">This option is especially useful for students looking for manageable monthly educational expenses.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"516\">The BCA in Applied Data Engineering program is designed to provide students with strong foundations in computer applications, programming, cloud computing, DevOps, database management, and modern data engineering technologies. The curriculum combines core computer science concepts with practical industry-focused skills required in software development, cloud infrastructure, and data-driven industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"784\">The semester-wise syllabus gradually develops technical expertise in programming, web technologies, databases, cloud computing, AI, and DevOps, preparing students for careers in software engineering, data engineering, cloud technologies, and application development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"789\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16syj38\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"847\">BCA in Applied Data Engineering Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"871\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"980\">The first semester focuses on programming fundamentals, communication skills, and basic computing concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ohwsgi\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1009\">Basic Mathematics &ndash; I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1112\">Introduces mathematical concepts and logical problem-solving techniques used in computer applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"41le4g\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1142\">Business Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1217\">Develops communication, presentation, and professional interaction skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o13yow\" data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1260\">Computer and Information Technology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1349\">Provides an introduction to computer systems, software, networking, and IT fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"564l9g\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1383\">Human Computer Interaction</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1454\">Focuses on user interaction, interface design, and usability concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1a66auz\" data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1478\">Programming in C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1579\">Introduces programming logic, coding fundamentals, and problem-solving using C programming language.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1665\">This semester builds a strong foundation in computer science and programming basics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1670\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1694\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1801\">The second semester strengthens knowledge of software systems, data structures, and software engineering.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x9xtp1\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1832\">Data Structures Using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1911\">Covers arrays, linked lists, stacks, queues, and data organization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aa32vr\" data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1940\">Environmental Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"2013\">Introduces environmental awareness and sustainable development concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vsjjss\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2061\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2130\">Focuses on personality development, leadership, and teamwork skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11okhu5\" data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2163\">Operating System Concepts</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2253\">Explains operating system architecture, process management, and memory handling concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1curtec\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2294\">Software Engineering and Modeling</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2387\">Introduces software development life cycle, system design, and software modeling techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2480\">Students begin understanding software development processes and system management concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2485\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2509\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2608\">The third semester introduces databases, statistics, networking, and object-oriented programming.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c8ei6\" data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2658\">Introduction to Database Management System</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2729\">Focuses on database design, SQL concepts, and data management systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kxhqjn\" data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2761\">Computational Statistics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2835\">Introduces statistical methods and analytical concepts used in computing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"141mhnx\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2858\">Green Computing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2936\">Covers energy-efficient computing practices and sustainable technology usage.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4ol01\" data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2958\">Network Basics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"3045\">Explains computer networking, protocols, internet concepts, and communication systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"abraii\" data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3091\">Object Oriented Programming Using Java</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3162\">Introduces object-oriented programming principles using Java language.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3164\" data-end=\"3247\">This semester helps students develop programming and database management expertise.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3249\" data-end=\"3252\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"3254\" data-end=\"3276\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3379\">The fourth semester focuses on scripting, Python programming, Java applications, and web development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"btbxx4\" data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3430\">Unix Operating System and Shell Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3499\">Introduces Linux/Unix environments and shell scripting fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ap1xl7\" data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3525\">Python Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3598\">Covers Python syntax, programming concepts, and application development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lrzaqq\" data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3643\">Getting Started with Java Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3644\" data-end=\"3706\">Focuses on Java application development and programming logic.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10x9v5y\" data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3739\">Java Database Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3812\">Introduces database connectivity and application integration using Java.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5fz3pp\" data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3846\">Developing Web Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"3907\">Covers website and web application development fundamentals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"3992\">Students gain practical exposure to backend development and scripting technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"3997\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nyzmvl\" data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4021\">Semester 5 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4023\" data-end=\"4106\">The fifth semester introduces AI, cloud computing, DevOps, and e-commerce concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16ms3fy\" data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4153\">Introduction to Artificial Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4154\" data-end=\"4227\">Introduces AI concepts, machine learning basics, and intelligent systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sv58j\" data-start=\"4229\" data-end=\"4260\">Fundamentals of Ecommerce</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4261\" data-end=\"4343\">Covers online business systems, digital transactions, and e-commerce technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4370\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4371\" data-end=\"4453\">Focuses on ethical practices and professional responsibilities in the IT industry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ivxp4u\" data-start=\"4455\" data-end=\"4480\">Getting Cloud Ready</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4481\" data-end=\"4549\">Introduces cloud computing concepts and cloud infrastructure basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rwgbz\" data-start=\"4551\" data-end=\"4606\">DevOps Principles, Practices and Tools with Cloud</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4688\">Focuses on DevOps workflows, automation, deployment tools, and cloud integration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4690\" data-end=\"4768\">This semester develops industry-ready skills in cloud and DevOps technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4770\" data-end=\"4773\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10le376\" data-start=\"4775\" data-end=\"4797\">Semester 6 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4909\">The final semester focuses on project execution, Agile methodologies, and cloud-based application development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ydv96w\" data-start=\"4911\" data-end=\"4930\">Major Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"5011\">Students develop a real-world industry-oriented software or cloud-based project.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mma75g\" data-start=\"5013\" data-end=\"5041\">Planning for a Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5118\">Introduces project planning, requirement analysis, and execution strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17xnjo2\" data-start=\"5120\" data-end=\"5179\">Cloud (AWS) Based Application Development with DevOps</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5180\" data-end=\"5246\">Focuses on cloud deployment, AWS services, and DevOps integration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d5dflb\" data-start=\"5248\" data-end=\"5298\">Apply Agile Principles and Develop a Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5299\" data-end=\"5378\">Introduces Agile development methodologies and collaborative project execution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5380\" data-end=\"5480\">This semester provides practical implementation experience and prepares students for industry roles.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 230000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(358, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 303, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 06:10:35', '2026-06-17 00:11:50', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"330\">The admission process for the BCA in FinTech &amp; AI program is designed to be simple, fully online, and student-friendly. The process allows students to complete registration, document submission, fee payment, and enrollment smoothly from anywhere.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"520\">This industry-oriented program is ideal for students interested in artificial intelligence, financial technology, cloud computing, cybersecurity, programming, and digital business systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"525\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"owj31y\" data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"566\">BCA in FinTech &amp; AI Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"688\">The admission procedure is divided into five simple steps to help students complete their enrollment without difficulty.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"693\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"720\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"842\">The first step is choosing the BCA in FinTech &amp; AI program according to your academic interests and future career goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uo5xys\" data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"871\">What Students Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3cn644\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"934\">Review the complete curriculum and specialization subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3oo60i\" data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"999\">Understand career opportunities in AI and FinTech industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l0pp60\" data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1048\">Check eligibility criteria and fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t61hav\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1134\">Explore subjects like programming, blockchain, cloud computing, and cybersecurity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1166\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1300\">Selecting the right program helps students build a strong foundation for careers in modern technology and digital finance industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1305\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1338\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1468\">After selecting the program, students must fill out the online application form with the required academic and personal details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1490\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1636\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1515\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1546\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1566\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1585\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ry4c1f\" data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1636\">Academic certificates and supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1655\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1791\">Students should carefully verify all information before submission to avoid delays during document verification and admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1825\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1924\">Once the application form is completed, students can proceed with the online fee payment process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1955\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2065\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fdsh7e\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1983\">Full course fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ys9h9b\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2013\">Semester-wise fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18nxqlm\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2065\">EMI and flexible payment options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2079\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2237\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yhjme5\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2119\">Safe and secure online transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12yfd7b\" data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2150\">Convenient payment methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kkakx4\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2195\">Flexible financial planning for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ygfpqq\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2237\">Faster admission confirmation process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2337\">Students are advised to keep payment receipts and transaction details safely for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2342\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2367\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2483\">After successful fee payment, students need to complete the final application submission and registration process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2514\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2671\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmwi46\" data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2560\">Final submission of admission application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1swlyme\" data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2599\">Verification of uploaded documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkq1vh\" data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2637\">Registration confirmation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sj6t3c\" data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2671\">Admission approval initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2691\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2791\">Students should ensure all documents are clear and correctly uploaded to avoid verification issues.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2796\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g5inpu\" data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2828\">5. Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2936\">After successful verification and approval, students receive enrollment information and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1an5f5j\" data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2958\">Students Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"3152\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2986\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3016\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj90sq\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3059\">Access to the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h08oec\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3106\">Academic schedules and orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckxgom\" data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3152\">Guidance regarding classes and coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3241\">This step officially begins the student&rsquo;s learning journey in FinTech and AI education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3246\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3248\" data-end=\"3282\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3364\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3540\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jv793l\" data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3401\">10th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9g1oz\" data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3437\">12th mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vgcg9r\" data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3474\">Government-issued identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3503\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pd3dhz\" data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3540\">Valid mobile number and email ID</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3614\">Foreign students may require additional academic verification documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"502\">The eligibility criteria for the BCA in FinTech &amp; AI program are designed for students who want to build careers in computer applications, artificial intelligence, financial technology, cybersecurity, cloud computing, and software development. The program is suitable for fresh 10+2 pass-out students, technology enthusiasts, and learners planning to enter the growing IT and FinTech industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"677\">Students interested in programming, AI systems, digital finance, blockchain technology, and data-driven industries can apply for this industry-focused undergraduate program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"682\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vlthft\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"735\">BCA in FinTech &amp; AI Eligibility Criteria Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"862\">The program accepts applications from Indian and international students who meet the academic and communication requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"867\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19vvan1\" data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"912\">Who Should Apply for BCA in FinTech &amp; AI?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1048\">This program is ideal for students looking to build strong technical and analytical skills in modern technology and financial systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1066\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1516\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pc5oaa\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1140\">Fresh 10+2 pass-out students seeking careers in Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e6iyg5\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1216\">Students interested in Artificial Intelligence and Financial Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11at85d\" data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1292\">Learners aiming to work in IT, banking, FinTech, and digital industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkzfgc\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1365\">Aspirants planning careers in software development and cybersecurity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"155roze\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1440\">Students interested in cloud computing, blockchain, and data analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g40duv\" data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1516\">Learners planning higher studies in technology or computer applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1619\">The course helps students develop strong technical foundations required in modern digital industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1624\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7j9uzd\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1656\">English Language Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1756\">Applicants must possess sufficient understanding and communication skills in the English language.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rm4s9r\" data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1783\">Important Requirement</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n56m5x\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1923\">Candidates who have not studied in English for at least three years in their academic qualifications may not be eligible for admission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"2081\">Since the program includes technical subjects, programming languages, and professional communication, English proficiency is important for academic success.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2086\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2130\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2242\">Indian students applying for the BCA in FinTech &amp; AI program must fulfill the following academic requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2283\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2283\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2272\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Qualification Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2283\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2389\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2315\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10th Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2389\">10th Class Certificate with completion of 10 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2485\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2411\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12th Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2485\">12th Class Certificate with completion of 12 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2606\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2507\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Appearing Students</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2606\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations can also apply, subject to final result submission</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2625\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted Boards</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2713\" data-col-size=\"md\">Recognized boards including CBSE, State Boards, ISC, and NIOS are generally accepted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2788\">Students from Science, Commerce, or Arts streams can apply for admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2793\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2838\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2927\">International applicants must meet equivalent educational qualifications for admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"3244\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2968\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2968\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2957\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Qualification Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2968\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3244\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3056\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3010\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Secondary School Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3056\">Completion of 10 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3141\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3095\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Senior Secondary School Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3141\">Completion of 12 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3244\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3163\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diploma Acceptance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3244\">Diplomas are generally not accepted in place of formal schooling certificates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3337\">Foreign students may also need additional verification documents as per admission policies.</p>', '<p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"491\">The BCA in FinTech &amp; AI fee structure is designed to provide students with flexible and affordable payment options while pursuing industry-focused education in financial technology, artificial intelligence, cloud computing, programming, and digital business systems. The program combines computer applications with emerging technologies used in modern banking, finance, and AI-driven industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"643\">Students can choose from multiple payment options including semester-wise payment and 24-month zero-cost EMI facilities for easier financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"648\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1bc3878\" data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"694\">BCA in FinTech &amp; AI Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"743\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"743\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"713\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"727\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"743\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Benefits</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"839\">\r\n<td data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"776\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Course Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"800\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,75,000 &ndash; ₹3,49,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"839\">Complete fee for the entire program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<td data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"859\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"869\">₹45,900</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"910\">Flexible semester-wise payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<td data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"937\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"953\">₹10,885/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"999\">Interest-free monthly installment facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w5653i\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1023\">Full Course Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1156\">The total fee for the BCA in FinTech &amp; AI program covers the complete academic curriculum and industry-oriented learning resources.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1173\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m5f6dj\" data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1216\">Full Course Fee: ₹2,75,000 &ndash; ₹3,49,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dcq6v4\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1239\">What Students Get</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hng6yj\" data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1288\">Access to complete FinTech and AI curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lrh9s6\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1341\">Programming and cloud computing learning modules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l094tu\" data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1392\">Digital study materials and academic resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bfe1rr\" data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1445\">Practical exposure to financial technology tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kn9z57\" data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1501\">Project-based and industry-focused learning support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1619\">The full payment option is suitable for students planning long-term investment in future-ready technology education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1624\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1651\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1768\">Students can also choose the semester-wise payment option for easier fee management throughout the course duration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1785\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1815\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"to3pio\" data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1815\">Per Semester Fee: ₹45,900</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1829\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"2023\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlr07f\" data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1870\">Reduced financial burden at one time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gcte1c\" data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1918\">Flexible payment structure across semesters</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pt4mpi\" data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1974\">Better financial planning for students and families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tt4310\" data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2023\">Convenient option for self-financed learners</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2110\">This payment method helps students continue their education with manageable expenses.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2115\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hilery\" data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2151\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2287\">The zero-cost EMI option allows students to pay the course fee in affordable monthly installments without additional interest charges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2304\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2369\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18r59hl\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2338\">EMI Amount: ₹10,885 per month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y9c8j\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2369\">Interest: 0% Interest Free</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fxs65l\" data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2397\">Benefits of EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2586\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hurfrk\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2438\">Affordable monthly payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"169pxrd\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2487\">No hidden interest or additional EMI charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xtsqel\" data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2533\">Better financial flexibility for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2w82s5\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2586\">Easy access to advanced FinTech and AI education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2679\">This option is especially useful for students looking for low monthly educational expenses.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"493\">The BCA in FinTech &amp; AI program is designed to combine computer applications, artificial intelligence, blockchain technology, cloud computing, cybersecurity, and financial technology concepts into one industry-focused curriculum. The program helps students build strong technical knowledge along with practical skills required in modern banking, finance, AI, and digital business industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"714\">The semester-wise syllabus gradually develops expertise in programming, databases, analytics, FinTech systems, AI applications, blockchain, and cloud technologies, preparing students for future-ready technology careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"719\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rr3s71\" data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"765\">BCA in FinTech &amp; AI Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"789\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"889\">The first semester focuses on computer fundamentals, communication skills, and programming basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"83dk4h\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"916\">Basic Mathematics I</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1007\">Introduces mathematical concepts and logical problem-solving techniques used in computing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"41le4g\" data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1037\">Business Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1112\">Develops communication, presentation, and professional interaction skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o13yow\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1155\">Computer and Information Technology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1232\">Provides an introduction to computer systems, software, and IT fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"564l9g\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1266\">Human Computer Interaction</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1350\">Focuses on user interface design and interaction between users and digital systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1a66auz\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1374\">Programming in C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1463\">Introduces programming fundamentals, coding logic, and problem-solving using C language.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1551\">This semester builds the foundation for programming and computer application learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1580\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1696\">The second semester strengthens knowledge of software systems, data structures, and software engineering concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16vo7ba\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1726\">Data Structure Using C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1805\">Covers arrays, linked lists, stacks, queues, and data organization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aa32vr\" data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1834\">Environmental Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1907\">Introduces environmental awareness and sustainable development concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vsjjss\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1955\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2024\">Focuses on leadership, teamwork, and personality development skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11okhu5\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2057\">Operating System Concepts</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2147\">Explains operating system architecture, process handling, and memory management concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1curtec\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2188\">Software Engineering and Modeling</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2264\">Introduces software development life cycle and system design methodologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2348\">Students begin understanding software development and technical system management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2353\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2377\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2476\">The third semester introduces databases, networking, statistics, and object-oriented programming.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kxhqjn\" data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2508\">Computational Statistics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2585\">Focuses on statistical concepts and analytical techniques used in computing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"141mhnx\" data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2608\">Green Computing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2673\">Introduces sustainable and energy-efficient computing practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"187r3dp\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2724\">Introduction to Database Management Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2794\">Covers database design, SQL concepts, and data management techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4ol01\" data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2816\">Network Basics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2893\">Explains networking concepts, internet protocols, and communication systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"abraii\" data-start=\"2895\" data-end=\"2939\">Object Oriented Programming Using Java</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"3018\">Introduces Java programming and object-oriented software development concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3103\">This semester helps students develop programming and database management expertise.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3108\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3132\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3237\">The fourth semester introduces FinTech concepts, AI foundations, analytics, and blockchain development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ap1xl7\" data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3263\">Python Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3342\">Covers Python syntax, programming logic, and application development concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"btbxx4\" data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3393\">Unix Operating System and Shell Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3462\">Introduces Linux/Unix environments and shell scripting fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cv1kwu\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3528\">Foundations of FinTech, Data Analytics &amp; Financial Markets</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3624\">Provides knowledge of financial technologies, analytics systems, and digital financial markets.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zv4the\" data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3694\">Programming for FinTech (Python, R, and Java) + Data Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3779\">Focuses on programming applications used in financial analytics and data processing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jp9bpf\" data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3831\">Foundations of AI and Blockchain Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3926\">Introduces artificial intelligence, blockchain systems, and decentralized technology concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"4000\">Students gain exposure to emerging financial and AI-driven technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4005\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nyzmvl\" data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4029\">Semester 5 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4137\">The fifth semester focuses on AI applications, cybersecurity, cloud computing, and modern FinTech systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19sv58j\" data-start=\"4139\" data-end=\"4170\">Fundamentals of Ecommerce</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4171\" data-end=\"4237\">Introduces online business systems and digital commerce platforms.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16ms3fy\" data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4284\">Introduction to Artificial Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4285\" data-end=\"4354\">Covers AI concepts, intelligent systems, and machine learning basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4381\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4476\">Focuses on ethical practices and professional responsibility in the IT and finance industries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"riorpx\" data-start=\"4478\" data-end=\"4530\">AI Cybersecurity and API Innovation in FinTech</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4531\" data-end=\"4622\">Introduces cybersecurity practices, API integration, and AI-based FinTech security systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1es082x\" data-start=\"4624\" data-end=\"4680\">Cloud Computing, Big Data and InsurTech in FinTech</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4765\">Focuses on cloud platforms, big data systems, and insurance technology applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4767\" data-end=\"4865\">This semester strengthens technical skills in AI, cloud technologies, and digital finance systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4867\" data-end=\"4870\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10le376\" data-start=\"4872\" data-end=\"4894\">Semester 6 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4896\" data-end=\"5004\">The final semester focuses on practical FinTech implementation, compliance systems, and product development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ydv96w\" data-start=\"5006\" data-end=\"5025\">Major Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5118\">Students work on industry-oriented projects related to FinTech, AI, or software development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qihaaw\" data-start=\"5120\" data-end=\"5180\">RegTech Compliance and FinTech Application Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5181\" data-end=\"5267\">Introduces regulatory technology systems and FinTech application development concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pjb71\" data-start=\"5269\" data-end=\"5329\">FinTech Trends, Compliance &amp; Product Conceptualization</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5330\" data-end=\"5407\">Focuses on modern FinTech trends, compliance standards, and product planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c7a1q3\" data-start=\"5409\" data-end=\"5467\">FinTech Product Development &amp; Prototype Presentation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5468\" data-end=\"5561\">Students design and present FinTech product prototypes using technical and business concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5563\" data-end=\"5647\">This semester provides practical exposure to real-world FinTech and AI applications.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(359, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 304, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 06:44:14', '2026-06-17 00:12:13', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"375\">The admission process for the MCA in FinTech &amp; AI program is designed to be simple, fully online, and convenient for both fresh graduates and working professionals. The process allows students to complete registration, fee payment, document submission, and enrollment smoothly from anywhere.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"566\">This advanced MCA program is ideal for students interested in artificial intelligence, financial technology, cybersecurity, blockchain, cloud computing, analytics, and software development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"571\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fjxkop\" data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"612\">MCA in FinTech &amp; AI Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"729\">The admission process is divided into five simple steps to help students complete enrollment without complications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"734\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"761\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"877\">The first step is selecting the MCA in FinTech &amp; AI program according to your academic interests and career goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uo5xys\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"906\">What Students Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hyy0c0\" data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"945\">Review the complete MCA curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c6jp1w\" data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"999\">Understand AI and FinTech specialization subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l0pp60\" data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1048\">Check eligibility criteria and fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7o295o\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1129\">Explore career opportunities in software and financial technology industries</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1161\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1291\">Selecting the right program helps students align their education with future career opportunities in advanced technology sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1296\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1329\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1441\">After selecting the program, students must fill out the online application form with the required information.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f6n0kt\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1463\">Details Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1609\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1484\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1515\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1539\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1558\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ry4c1f\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1609\">Academic certificates and supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1628\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1740\">Students should carefully verify all details before submission to avoid delays during the verification process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1745\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1774\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1873\">Once the application form is completed, students can proceed with the online fee payment process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1frahit\" data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1904\">Payment Options Available</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2014\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fdsh7e\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1932\">Full course fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ys9h9b\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1962\">Semester-wise fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18nxqlm\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2014\">EMI and flexible payment options (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2028\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2208\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h3iqa2\" data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2072\">Secure and simple online payment system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edyjjt\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2112\">Flexible financial planning options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r8kelq\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2146\">Faster application processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ug452d\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2208\">Convenient payment methods for students and professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2287\">Students should keep payment confirmations and receipts for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2292\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2317\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2430\">After successful fee payment, students must complete the final registration and application submission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2461\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2605\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkogt2\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2494\">Final application submission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1swlyme\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2533\">Verification of uploaded documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkq1vh\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2571\">Registration confirmation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sj6t3c\" data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2605\">Admission approval initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2625\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2734\">Students should ensure all uploaded documents are accurate and clearly visible to avoid verification delays.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g5inpu\" data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2771\">5. Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2875\">After successful verification and approval, students receive enrollment details and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1an5f5j\" data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2897\">Students Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"3091\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2925\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2955\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj90sq\" data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2998\">Access to the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h08oec\" data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3045\">Academic schedules and orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckxgom\" data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3091\">Guidance regarding classes and coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3183\">This step officially begins the student&rsquo;s learning journey in FinTech and AI technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3188\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3224\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3306\">Students should keep the following documents ready while applying for admission:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3500\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dfca1g\" data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3351\">Graduation mark sheets and certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vgcg9r\" data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3388\">Government-issued identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3417\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wvpk2f\" data-start=\"3418\" data-end=\"3454\">Valid email ID and mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q1lq3y\" data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3500\">Additional academic documents if required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3576\">Foreign students may need additional qualification verification documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"522\">The MCA in FinTech &amp; AI eligibility criteria are designed for graduates and working professionals who want to build advanced careers in software development, artificial intelligence, financial technology, cybersecurity, cloud computing, and digital innovation. The program is suitable for students from technical and non-technical backgrounds who are interested in modern computing and financial technology systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"705\">This industry-focused MCA program combines computer applications with AI, blockchain, analytics, and FinTech technologies to prepare students for rapidly growing digital industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"710\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"c9k2yu\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"763\">MCA in FinTech &amp; AI Eligibility Criteria Overview</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"900\">Students applying for the MCA in FinTech &amp; AI program must fulfill the required academic qualifications and communication requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"mw8gmq\" data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"950\">Who Should Apply for MCA in FinTech &amp; AI?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1084\">The program is suitable for students and professionals aiming to build expertise in advanced technology and digital finance systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qmgibc\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1099\">Ideal For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1584\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y308pa\" data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1196\">Fresh graduates or final year students seeking careers in the computer and software industry</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"135f73t\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1271\">Working professionals planning higher education in computer technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9fjr5x\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1354\">Learners interested in AI, blockchain, cybersecurity, and financial technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mb1iy1\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1427\">Students aiming to solve real-world business and technology problems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19zdiov\" data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1508\">Aspirants planning careers in IT, banking, analytics, and FinTech industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r46aho\" data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1584\">Professionals interested in software engineering and cloud technologies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1704\">The program helps students develop technical and analytical skills required in modern technology-driven organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1753\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1849\">Indian students must meet one of the following academic qualifications to apply for admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"2395\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1890\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1890\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1879\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Qualification Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1890\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"2395\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1957\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1914\" data-col-size=\"sm\">BCA Degree</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1957\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2052\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1996\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer Science/Engineering Degree</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2052\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in Computer Science or Engineering</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2162\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2080\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Other Graduation Degrees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2162\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in Science, Commerce, or Arts with Mathematics at 10+2 level</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2294\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2294\">Students without Mathematics at 10+2 or graduation level can apply after qualifying the bridge course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2395\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2316\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Appearing Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2395\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Final year graduation students can also apply, subject to result submission</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2493\">Students from various academic backgrounds can apply if they fulfill the eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2498\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2543\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2635\">International applicants must satisfy equivalent educational qualifications for admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2867\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2676\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2676\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2665\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Qualification Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2676\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2867\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2778\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2712\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2778\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree equivalent to accepted Indian qualifications</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2867\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2801\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Proficiency</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2867\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidates should be well versed in spoken and written English</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2971\">Foreign students may also need additional academic verification documents as per admission guidelines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"2976\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4qytsj\" data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3022\">Bridge Course for Non-Mathematics Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3168\">Students who have not studied Mathematics at 10+2 or graduation level can still apply for admission after qualifying the required bridge course.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vscger\" data-start=\"3170\" data-end=\"3203\">Why the Bridge Course Matters</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3408\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"20di0e\" data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3270\">Helps students understand mathematical and analytical concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y8dbze\" data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3335\">Builds the foundation for programming and technical subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"195und3\" data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3408\">Supports learning in AI, analytics, and software development modules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3497\">This option makes the program accessible to students from diverse academic backgrounds.</p>', '<p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"501\">The MCA in FinTech &amp; AI fee structure is designed for students and working professionals who want to build advanced expertise in artificial intelligence, financial technology, cloud computing, cybersecurity, analytics, and software development. The program combines technical computing knowledge with modern financial technology applications used across banking, digital finance, and AI-driven industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"651\">Students can choose flexible payment options including semester-wise payments and 24-month zero-cost EMI facilities for easier financial management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"656\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jiunor\" data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"702\">MCA in FinTech &amp; AI Fee Structure Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"1003\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"747\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"747\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"721\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"735\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"747\" data-col-size=\"md\">Benefits</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"1003\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"839\">\r\n<td data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"780\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Course Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"804\">₹2,75,000 &ndash; ₹3,79,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"839\">Covers the complete MCA program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<td data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"859\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"869\">₹68,800</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"910\">Flexible semester-wise payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"1003\">\r\n<td data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"937\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"957\">₹10,885 per month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1003\">Interest-free monthly installment facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1008\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1w5653i\" data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1027\">Full Course Fee</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1167\">The total course fee covers the complete MCA in FinTech &amp; AI program including academic learning resources and technical training support.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1184\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1227\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ixj8k\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1227\">Full Course Fee: ₹2,75,000 &ndash; ₹3,79,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u84h0c\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1254\">What the Fee Includes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kabqb6\" data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1294\">Access to AI and FinTech curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mymzny\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1332\">Learning management system access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oplx5a\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1376\">Digital study materials and assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ak33s9\" data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1418\">Programming and technical lab support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wnh5pv\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1460\">Project-based learning and mentorship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uoj2mt\" data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1501\">Industry-oriented technical exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1603\">This option is suitable for students planning long-term investment in advanced technology education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1608\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15my2q2\" data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1635\">Per Semester Fee Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1721\">Students can also pay the course fee semester-wise for better financial flexibility.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aszbcy\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1738\">Fee Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1768\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10issvy\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1768\">Per Semester Fee: ₹68,800</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1inq21m\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1807\">Benefits of Semester-Wise Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1990\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k7wy0j\" data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1845\">Reduced one-time financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ssugrr\" data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1884\">Easier academic expense management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gcte1c\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1932\">Flexible payment structure across semesters</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s5mnq\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1990\">Suitable for self-financed students and professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2086\">This payment mode helps students continue higher education with manageable financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2091\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2125\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2268\">The zero-cost EMI facility allows students to pay the course fee through affordable monthly installments without additional interest charges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h99s05\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2285\">EMI Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2350\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18r59hl\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2319\">EMI Amount: ₹10,885 per month</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y9c8j\" data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2350\">Interest: 0% Interest Free</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fvwx6b\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2382\">Advantages of EMI Facility</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2562\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ukdeeu\" data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2414\">Affordable monthly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2gpvw\" data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2445\">No hidden interest charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xlpyo6\" data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2514\">Easier financial planning for working professionals and students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cqzu1x\" data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2562\">Convenient access to advanced MCA education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2665\">This option is highly useful for students looking for budget-friendly higher education opportunities.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"509\">The MCA in FinTech &amp; AI program is designed to provide advanced technical knowledge in artificial intelligence, financial technology, machine learning, blockchain, cloud computing, cybersecurity, and software development. The curriculum combines core computer application concepts with modern FinTech innovations used in digital banking, financial analytics, automation, and intelligent business systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"756\">The semester-wise syllabus focuses on practical learning, programming expertise, analytics, cloud technologies, and emerging financial technology applications to prepare students for future-ready careers in the technology and finance industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"761\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17ur6a\" data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"807\">MCA in FinTech &amp; AI Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"831\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"943\">The first semester focuses on advanced programming, software engineering, databases, and communication skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yokps9\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"981\">Graph Theory and Combinatorics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1101\">Introduces mathematical structures, logical problem-solving, and algorithmic concepts used in computing and AI systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fkbvz5\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1118\">Core Java</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1222\">Focuses on object-oriented programming concepts, Java development, and application-building techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d7i67s\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1266\">Advanced Database Management Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1359\">Covers database architecture, SQL, data handling, and advanced database management concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1164lrf\" data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1407\">Advanced Software Engineering Principles</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1515\">Introduces software development methodologies, software lifecycle management, and system design principles.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gwmigd\" data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1549\">Professional Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1643\">Develops business communication, presentation, teamwork, and professional interaction skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1762\">This semester builds a strong technical and programming foundation required for advanced FinTech and AI applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1791\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1916\">The second semester introduces AI-based analytics, machine learning, blockchain, cybersecurity, and research methodologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n69exc\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1978\">Cognitive Analytics and Social Skills for Professional</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2071\">Focuses on analytical thinking, personality development, and workplace communication skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ube3pi\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2115\">Data Structures and Algorithm Design</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2221\">Covers algorithms, data organization methods, optimization, and computational problem-solving techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6k98s3\" data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2262\">Network Security and Cryptography</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2371\">Introduces cybersecurity concepts, encryption methods, network protection, and secure communication systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"twrsqa\" data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2399\">Research Methodology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2493\">Provides knowledge of research techniques, data analysis, and academic project methodologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l8qg6u\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2540\">Programming Analytics and AI in FinTech</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2629\">Focuses on AI applications and analytics systems used in financial technology platforms.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k6w24j\" data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2694\">Machine Learning, Data Science and Blockchain Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2784\">Introduces machine learning algorithms, blockchain concepts, and data science techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2890\">This semester helps students develop expertise in intelligent systems and modern financial technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2895\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2919\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"3042\">The third semester focuses on cloud systems, cybersecurity, FinTech innovation, and advanced infrastructure technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uombsl\" data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3083\">Cloud Infrastructure and Services</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3187\">Covers cloud computing architecture, virtualization, cloud deployment, and service management concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"v5yfp8\" data-start=\"3189\" data-end=\"3217\">Unix/Linux Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3305\">Introduces Linux environments, shell scripting, and server-side programming techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qboyhq\" data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3333\">Seminar (Evaluation)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3334\" data-end=\"3424\">Students present technical topics and participate in academic discussions and evaluations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zr9vaf\" data-start=\"3426\" data-end=\"3453\">Quantitative Aptitude</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3548\">Develops analytical, mathematical, and logical reasoning skills for technical problem-solving.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"3550\" data-end=\"3575\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3676\">Focuses on ethical responsibilities and professional standards in technology and finance industries.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fdw5y1\" data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3738\">Cybersecurity, Cloud Computing and Big Data in FinTech</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3739\" data-end=\"3842\">Explains cybersecurity systems, big data processing, and cloud-based financial technology applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kjcamc\" data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3892\">WealthTech, RegTech and FinTech Innovation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"4003\">Introduces modern digital finance innovations including regulatory technology and wealth management platforms.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4117\">This semester strengthens industry-oriented technical expertise in cloud, security, and digital finance systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4119\" data-end=\"4122\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"4124\" data-end=\"4146\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4238\">The final semester focuses on practical implementation and real-world project development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ydv96w\" data-start=\"4240\" data-end=\"4259\">Major Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4381\">Students work on industry-oriented projects related to FinTech, AI, cloud computing, blockchain, or software development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4383\" data-end=\"4482\">The project helps students apply technical knowledge to practical business and technology problems.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(360, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 234, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-09 07:12:35', '2026-06-17 00:12:33', '<p data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"447\">The MBA in Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management admission process is designed to provide a smooth, fully online, and student-friendly enrollment experience for fresh graduates, working professionals, and healthcare aspirants. The process allows candidates to apply, upload documents, pay fees, and complete registration conveniently from anywhere.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"651\">This healthcare-focused MBA program is ideal for students aiming to build careers in hospital administration, healthcare operations, medical management, healthcare consulting, and healthcare leadership.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"656\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"p4a91h\" data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"717\">MBA in Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"833\">The admission procedure is divided into five simple steps to help students complete enrollment without difficulty.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17s9r3r\" data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"865\">1. Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"1004\">The first step is choosing the MBA in Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management program according to your career interests and professional goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uo5xys\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1033\">What Students Should Do</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1293\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ouhmit\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1090\">Review the complete healthcare management curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a9rqry\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1151\">Understand specialization subjects and industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l0pp60\" data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1200\">Check eligibility criteria and fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f6rmth\" data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1293\">Explore future career opportunities in healthcare administration and hospital management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1325\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1445\">Choosing the right specialization helps students align their education with long-term healthcare industry career goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1uw8zcr\" data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1483\">2. Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1615\">After selecting the program, candidates must fill out the online application form with the required academic and personal details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19msnr7\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1641\">Information Required</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1787\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1666\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1697\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1717\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6qwl6\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1736\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ry4c1f\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1787\">Academic certificates and supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1806\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1928\">Students should carefully verify all details before submission to avoid delays during the admission verification process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5u75r4\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1962\">3. Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2056\">Once the application form is completed, students can proceed with secure online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qcs7g5\" data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2087\">Available Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2201\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1irbo3f\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2117\">One-time full fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oweka\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2150\">Semester-wise payment option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xzb5xq\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2201\">EMI and flexible payment plans (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sh8d0e\" data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2233\">Benefits of Online Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2399\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mr8faz\" data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2273\">Fast and secure transaction process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sk806e\" data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2308\">Convenient payment flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"172rwfa\" data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2344\">Simplified admission processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9nd2yp\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2399\">Easy fee management for students and professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2485\">Students should save payment receipts and confirmation details for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2490\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u7lux0\" data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2515\">4. Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2618\">After successful fee payment, candidates must complete final application submission and registration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idc46m\" data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2649\">What Happens in This Step</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2814\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q9mn8w\" data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2694\">Final submission of the application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wd2acj\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2742\">Verification of uploaded academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkq1vh\" data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2780\">Registration confirmation process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sj6t3c\" data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2814\">Admission approval initiation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2834\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2951\">All documents should be uploaded clearly and accurately to ensure smooth verification and faster admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2956\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g5inpu\" data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2988\">5. Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3113\">After document verification and admission approval, students receive official enrollment information and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1an5f5j\" data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3135\">Students Receive</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3337\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0s2jn\" data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3163\">Enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"3164\" data-end=\"3193\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jlu8w\" data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3233\">Access to online learning platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h08oec\" data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3280\">Academic schedules and orientation details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11xz01c\" data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3337\">Guidance regarding classes, projects, and coursework</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3431\">This step officially marks the beginning of the student&rsquo;s MBA healthcare management journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3436\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3472\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3554\">Students should keep the following documents ready while applying for admission:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3759\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dfca1g\" data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3599\">Graduation mark sheets and certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oqysp5\" data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3638\">Government-approved identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yc9fs\" data-start=\"3639\" data-end=\"3667\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wvpk2f\" data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3704\">Valid email ID and mobile number</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pya4a5\" data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3759\">Additional documents if required by the university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"3850\">International students may also need equivalence certificates and visa-related documents.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"549\">The MBA in Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management eligibility criteria are designed for graduates, working professionals, and entrepreneurs who want to build careers in healthcare administration, hospital operations, healthcare consulting, medical management, and healthcare leadership. The program is suitable for candidates from different academic backgrounds who are interested in management and the rapidly growing healthcare sector.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"819\">This specialized MBA program combines business management principles with healthcare industry knowledge to prepare students for leadership and operational roles in hospitals, healthcare organizations, pharmaceutical companies, insurance firms, and healthcare startups.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"824\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1685915\" data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"888\">MBA in Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"1045\">Students applying for the MBA in Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management program must fulfill the required academic qualifications and communication requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1050\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"r6l3bi\" data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1115\">Who Should Apply for MBA in Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1266\">The program is suitable for both fresh graduates and experienced professionals aiming to build management careers in healthcare and business sectors.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qmgibc\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1281\">Ideal For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1728\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ko6yy7\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1359\">Fresh graduates looking to enter healthcare management and administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137xbey\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1445\">Working professionals seeking career growth in healthcare and business management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bjj0w9\" data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1525\">Entrepreneurs planning to manage healthcare-related businesses and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vnitdw\" data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1634\">Aspirants interested in management, finance, marketing, operations, logistics, and healthcare leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rdhf95\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1728\">Professionals aiming to transition into hospital administration and healthcare consulting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1837\">The program provides industry-oriented management knowledge combined with healthcare operational expertise.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1842\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1886\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1979\">Indian applicants must meet the following academic and language requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2512\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2018\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2018\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2007\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2018\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2512\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2118\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2057\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2118\" data-col-size=\"md\">Graduation in any discipline from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2200\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2144\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks Required</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2200\">Minimum 40% marks in the last qualifying examination</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2299\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2230\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Test Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2299\">Candidates scoring below 40% marks must qualify an admission test</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2410\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2331\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2410\" data-col-size=\"md\">Applicants should possess sufficient knowledge and understanding of English</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2512\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2432\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Appearing Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2512\" data-col-size=\"md\">Final year graduation students can also apply subject to document submission</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2580\">Students from all academic streams can apply for this MBA program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2585\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2630\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2705\">International students must fulfill the following admission requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"3055\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2733\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2744\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"3055\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2845\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2780\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2845\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidates must have completed a recognized graduation degree</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2961\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2872\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Equivalence Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2961\">Certificate of equivalence from the Association of Indian Universities (AIU) required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2962\" data-end=\"3055\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2962\" data-end=\"2993\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3055\">Good understanding of spoken and written English preferred</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3169\">Foreign students should ensure that all academic documents meet university admission and verification standards.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3174\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1eq22x7\" data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3219\">Important Note for International Students</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ooebir\" data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3249\">Observership Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3419\">International students may need to travel to India for observership programs and healthcare-related practical exposure as per visa regulations and university guidelines.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"181lajy\" data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3441\">Why This Matters</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3672\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qvbxoy\" data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3488\">Provides real healthcare industry exposure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"24mhvk\" data-start=\"3489\" data-end=\"3550\">Helps students understand hospital operations practically</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l9s70h\" data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3605\">Enhances healthcare management learning experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t8k0tt\" data-start=\"3606\" data-end=\"3672\">Builds professional understanding of Indian healthcare systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3765\">Students should check visa and travel requirements in advance for smooth academic planning.</p>', '<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"509\">The MBA in Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management fee structure is designed to provide flexible payment options for students and working professionals who want to build careers in healthcare administration, hospital operations, medical management, healthcare consulting, and healthcare analytics. The program offers multiple payment modes including one-time payment, semester-wise fee payment, and zero-cost EMI options for better financial convenience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"705\">This healthcare-focused MBA program combines business management skills with healthcare industry knowledge, making it suitable for students aiming to enter the rapidly growing healthcare sector.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"710\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"12p94r7\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"764\">MBA Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"787\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"840\">\r\n<td data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"827\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"840\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,99,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"879\">\r\n<td data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"866\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment Offer</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"879\">₹3,29,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<td data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"899\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"910\">₹82,300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"958\">\r\n<td data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"937\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"958\">₹13,023 per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<td data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"974\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Interest</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"989\">0% Interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1083\">The one-time payment option offers significant savings compared to the standard program fee.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1088\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4u6h7o\" data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1117\">One-Time Payment Benefits</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1241\">Students choosing the one-time payment option can reduce the overall program cost and avoid long-term payment commitments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kx7bmx\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1261\">Key Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1500\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pgbtqz\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1292\">Lower overall tuition cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p1m11p\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1358\">Savings of approximately ₹70,000 compared to the standard fee</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fo7efg\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1399\">No recurring semester payment stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fze3uq\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1459\">Better financial planning for long-term education goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ag7clp\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1500\">Faster completion of fee formalities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1587\">This option is beneficial for students who prefer paying the complete amount upfront.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1l1hhn6\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1628\">Semester-Wise Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1759\">The semester-wise payment structure provides flexibility for students who prefer manageable installment-based education expenses.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1835\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1794\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1794\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1784\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1794\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1835\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1835\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1824\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1835\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹82,300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lbyyin\" data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1869\">Benefits of Semester Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"2053\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlr07f\" data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1910\">Reduced financial burden at one time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hhoxy\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1957\">Easier budgeting for working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19scywc\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1998\">Flexible academic financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pz5dsw\" data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2053\">Convenient for students balancing work and studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2159\">This payment mode is commonly preferred by professionals pursuing higher education alongside their jobs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2164\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yfht2g\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2198\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2331\">The zero-cost EMI option allows students to pay the course fee in smaller monthly installments without additional interest charges.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2454\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2354\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2354\">\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2344\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Plan</th>\r\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2354\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2454\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2390\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2379\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2390\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹13,023</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2419\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2406\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2419\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2454\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2439\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2454\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0% Interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fvwx6b\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2486\">Advantages of EMI Facility</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2673\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hurfrk\" data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2527\">Affordable monthly payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1su4d24\" data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2561\">No additional interest burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43nr5q\" data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2625\">Better financial flexibility for students and professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tpkt8b\" data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2673\">Easy access to premium management education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2768\">This option helps students continue their education without heavy upfront financial pressure.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"586\">The MBA in Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management syllabus is designed to prepare students for leadership roles in hospitals, healthcare organizations, pharmaceutical companies, healthcare startups, insurance firms, and public health systems. The curriculum combines core business management principles with specialized healthcare management training to help students understand hospital administration, patient care systems, healthcare operations, strategic leadership, and healthcare technology.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"783\">The semester-wise curriculum focuses on practical healthcare management skills, strategic decision-making, healthcare innovation, emergency care management, and digital healthcare transformation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"788\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wphxpq\" data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"854\">MBA in Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"878\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"1000\">The first semester builds a strong foundation in management, communication, economics, marketing, and analytical skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kfupdo\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1031\">Accounting for Managers</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1168\">Introduces financial accounting concepts, budgeting, cost analysis, and financial decision-making required in healthcare administration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gwmigd\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1202\">Professional Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1329\">Develops communication, presentation, leadership, and interpersonal skills required for healthcare and corporate environments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cxb9sd\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1357\">Managerial Economics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1469\">Focuses on economic concepts, market behavior, healthcare economics, and managerial decision-making strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"memnht\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1497\">Marketing Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1600\">Covers marketing principles, consumer behavior, branding, and healthcare service marketing strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ka92j\" data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1633\">Statistics for Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1751\">Introduces statistical tools, data interpretation, forecasting, and business analytics used in healthcare management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1877\">This semester helps students develop a strong understanding of management fundamentals required in healthcare organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1906\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"2019\">The second semester focuses on finance, human resources, legal frameworks, and business research methodologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fhagti\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2061\">Conflict Resolution and Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2175\">Teaches negotiation techniques, workplace conflict handling, team coordination, and organizational communication.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ksf6ho\" data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2203\">Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2308\">Covers investment planning, financial analysis, hospital budgeting, and healthcare financial operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"j4eke8\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2341\">Human Resource Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2453\">Focuses on recruitment, employee management, training, workforce planning, and healthcare staff administration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ihwy6h\" data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2486\">Legal Aspects of Business</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2587\">Introduces legal regulations, healthcare laws, ethical compliance, and business governance concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h63el1\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2620\">Business Research Methods</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2732\">Develops research, data collection, analysis, and decision-making skills for healthcare and management studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2846\">This semester strengthens administrative and operational management capabilities required in healthcare systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2851\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2875\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"3001\">The third semester introduces strategic healthcare leadership, emergency care systems, and advanced patient care management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76y3zh\" data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3028\">Professional Ethics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3129\">Focuses on ethical responsibilities, healthcare standards, patient rights, and professional conduct.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2gyxr1\" data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3157\">Strategic Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3262\">Covers organizational strategy, competitive planning, business growth, and healthcare leadership models.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"m83xac\" data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3283\">Minor Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3381\">Provides practical exposure through research-based projects related to healthcare and management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fosuil\" data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3436\">Decision Leadership and Emergency Care Settings</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3547\">Explains emergency healthcare management, crisis response systems, and leadership in critical care situations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ducvb4\" data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3604\">Complex Case Management in Internal Medicine (IM)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3605\" data-end=\"3702\">Introduces patient care coordination and healthcare decision-making in internal medicine systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bkpd05\" data-start=\"3704\" data-end=\"3758\">Patient Care Management in Critical Care Context</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3868\">Focuses on healthcare operations, patient monitoring systems, and management of critical healthcare services.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"iumhr2\" data-start=\"3870\" data-end=\"3907\">Strategic Healthcare Leadership</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3908\" data-end=\"4022\">Develops leadership skills for hospital administration, healthcare operations, and medical institution management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4024\" data-end=\"4135\">This semester provides specialized healthcare management knowledge aligned with real-world hospital operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4140\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"4142\" data-end=\"4164\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4294\">The final semester focuses on healthcare innovation, digital transformation, AI applications, and strategic hospital operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ydv96w\" data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4315\">Major Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4316\" data-end=\"4441\">Students work on industry-oriented healthcare management projects involving research, analysis, and strategic implementation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qkd0a9\" data-start=\"4443\" data-end=\"4506\">Management in Action: Social, Economic and Ethical Issues</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4507\" data-end=\"4621\">Explores healthcare challenges, ethical concerns, social healthcare systems, and policy-related management issues.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u0q8k8\" data-start=\"4623\" data-end=\"4646\">Digital Marketing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4769\">Covers digital healthcare branding, online healthcare campaigns, patient engagement, and digital communication strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1209ig7\" data-start=\"4771\" data-end=\"4802\">AI Tools and Applications</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4803\" data-end=\"4914\">Introduces artificial intelligence technologies and their applications in healthcare management and operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xwnyn5\" data-start=\"4916\" data-end=\"4969\">Driving Innovation and Technology in Healthcare</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4970\" data-end=\"5086\">Focuses on healthcare innovation, digital transformation, smart healthcare systems, and modern medical technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1b42gka\" data-start=\"5088\" data-end=\"5147\">Advanced Hospital Operations and Strategic Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5148\" data-end=\"5276\">Provides advanced understanding of hospital administration, operational planning, quality management, and healthcare leadership.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5278\" data-end=\"5378\">This semester prepares students for senior healthcare administration and strategic leadership roles.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 400000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(361, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 240, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-13 00:49:59', '2026-06-17 00:12:57', '<p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"421\">The MBA in Data Science &amp; Analytics admission process is designed to provide a simple, flexible, and student-friendly enrollment experience for fresh graduates, working professionals, and aspiring data analytics professionals. The entire process can be completed online, allowing students to apply from anywhere conveniently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"649\">This industry-oriented MBA program combines business management with data science, analytics, machine learning, artificial intelligence, and business intelligence, helping students prepare for modern technology-driven careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"654\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1iwhepl\" data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"707\">MBA in Data Science &amp; Analytics Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"825\">The admission process is divided into five easy steps to help students complete enrollment smoothly and efficiently.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"830\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"eeuf76\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"861\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"992\">The first step is choosing the MBA in Data Science &amp; Analytics program according to your career goals and professional interests.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"s0g26v\" data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1039\">What Students Should Check Before Applying</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1070\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1070\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1059\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Important Areas</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1070\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1104\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Curriculum Structure</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1173\">Review semester-wise subjects and analytics specialization topics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1197\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Criteria</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1258\">Verify academic qualifications and admission requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1345\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1282\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Career Opportunities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1345\">Explore future job roles in analytics, AI, and data science</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1362\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Structure</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1422\">Understand payment options, EMI plans, and semester fees</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1446\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Flexibility</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1501\" data-col-size=\"md\">Check online learning features and academic support</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1533\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1683\">Selecting the right MBA specialization helps students align their education with future career growth in analytics and business intelligence sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1688\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1viqrjy\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1725\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1853\">After selecting the program, candidates must fill out the online application form with accurate academic and personal details.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"bxh93t\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1897\">Information Required During Application</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"2288\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1922\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Information</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1933\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2288\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1963\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Personal Details</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2020\" data-col-size=\"md\">Name, date of birth, address, and contact information</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2047\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Information</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2090\">Graduation details and academic records</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2150\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identification Documents</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2150\">Government-approved ID proof</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2210\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2173\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Contact Credentials</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2210\" data-col-size=\"md\">Active mobile number and email ID</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2288\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2234\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Supporting Documents</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2288\">Academic certificates and passport-size photograph</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2307\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2430\">Students should carefully review all details before submission to avoid delays during verification and admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2435\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16w6tlx\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2468\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2561\">After completing the application form, students can proceed with secure online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2591\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2873\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2621\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2621\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2621\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2873\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2694\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2655\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2694\">Simplified one-time payment process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2753\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2719\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-Wise Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2753\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexible fee payment structure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2811\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Affordable monthly installment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2873\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2835\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online Payment Modes</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2873\">Secure and convenient transactions</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zp8axk\" data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2909\">Benefits of Online Fee Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"3058\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vafvz9\" data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2945\">Fast and secure payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ouw09\" data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2977\">Flexible financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"57jdc3\" data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3018\">Convenient for working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pci6zv\" data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3058\">Easy digital transaction management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3148\">Students should save fee receipts and payment confirmation details for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3153\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cfgr7l\" data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3182\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3290\">Once the fee payment is completed, candidates must submit the final application and complete registration.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qgj9yr\" data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3328\">What Happens During Registration?</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3651\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3365\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3365\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3354\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3365\" data-col-size=\"md\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3651\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3439\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3401\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Submission</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3401\" data-end=\"3439\" data-col-size=\"md\">Final submission of admission form</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3513\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3464\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document Verification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3513\">Validation of academic and identity documents</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3590\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3533\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Review</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3590\">University checks eligibility and application details</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3651\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3615\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Initiation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3651\">Processing of admission approval</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3671\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3672\" data-end=\"3785\">Students should upload clear and valid documents to ensure smooth verification and faster admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3790\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1tozxz\" data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3826\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3944\">After successful verification and admission approval, students receive enrollment information and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b1z5xw\" data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"3965\">Students Receive</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"4340\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"3999\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"3999\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"3988\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Support</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"3999\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4340\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4071\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4036\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4071\">Official admission confirmation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4072\" data-end=\"4137\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4072\" data-end=\"4100\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student Login Credentials</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4137\" data-col-size=\"md\">Access to learning portal and LMS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4205\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4158\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Guidance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4205\">Information regarding classes and schedules</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4206\" data-end=\"4270\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4206\" data-end=\"4228\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Orientation Support</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4228\" data-end=\"4270\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to online learning system</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4340\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4296\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Study Resources Access</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4340\">Learning materials and recorded sessions</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4342\" data-end=\"4430\">This step officially begins the student&rsquo;s MBA Data Science &amp; Analytics learning journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4432\" data-end=\"4435\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cr1nfg\" data-start=\"4437\" data-end=\"4503\">Documents Required for MBA in Data Science &amp; Analytics Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4505\" data-end=\"4587\">Students should keep the following documents ready during the application process.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4927\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4621\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4621\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Documents</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4610\" data-end=\"4621\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4632\" data-end=\"4927\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4632\" data-end=\"4697\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4632\" data-end=\"4658\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Certificates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4658\" data-end=\"4697\">Academic qualification verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4698\" data-end=\"4745\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4698\" data-end=\"4720\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Government ID Proof</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4720\" data-end=\"4745\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identity verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4806\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4773\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport-Size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4773\" data-end=\"4806\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student profile documentation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4868\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4834\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mobile Number &amp; Email ID</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4834\" data-end=\"4868\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Communication and login access</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4869\" data-end=\"4927\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4869\" data-end=\"4895\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Certificates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4895\" data-end=\"4927\" data-col-size=\"sm\">If required for verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4929\" data-end=\"5014\">International students may also need equivalence certificates from authorized bodies.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"566\">The MBA in Data Science &amp; Analytics eligibility criteria are designed for students and professionals who want to build careers in data science, business analytics, machine learning, artificial intelligence, and data-driven business management. The program welcomes fresh graduates, working professionals, and final-year students from technical and non-technical academic backgrounds who want to develop expertise in analytics and strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"783\">This MBA specialization is especially suitable for individuals interested in combining business management skills with modern technologies such as big data analytics, machine learning, AI, and business intelligence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"788\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ll67et\" data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"844\">MBA in Data Science &amp; Analytics Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"994\">Candidates applying for the MBA in Data Science &amp; Analytics program must fulfill the academic and language proficiency requirements mentioned below.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13qflgx\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1035\">General Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1565\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1074\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1074\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1063\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1074\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1565\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1174\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1113\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1174\" data-col-size=\"md\">Graduation in any discipline from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1200\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks Required</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1251\" data-col-size=\"md\">Minimum 40% marks in the qualifying examination</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1352\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1281\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Test Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1352\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidates with below 40% marks must qualify for the admission test</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1470\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1384\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1470\">Applicants must possess sufficient knowledge of English language and communication</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1565\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1498\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Candidate Types</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1565\">Fresh graduates, working professionals, and final-year students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1654\">The program is designed to support both technical and management-oriented career goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1659\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9qb35e\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1716\">Who Should Apply for MBA in Data Science &amp; Analytics?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1850\">This program is suitable for students and professionals aiming to build careers in analytics, AI, and business intelligence sectors.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rtq3iu\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1877\">Recommended Candidates</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1914\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1914\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1894\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suitable For</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1914\" data-col-size=\"md\">Career Objective</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"2032\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1949\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Working Professionals</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"2032\">Upskill in analytics, AI, machine learning, and data-driven business management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2134\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2064\" data-col-size=\"sm\">IT &amp; Analytics Professionals</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2134\">Gain managerial and strategic expertise in data science industries</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2220\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2159\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Engineering Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2220\">Build careers in AI, analytics, and business intelligence</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2319\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2257\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics &amp; Statistics Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2319\" data-col-size=\"md\">Apply analytical skills in business and technology domains</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2410\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2342\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final-Year Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2410\" data-col-size=\"md\">Prepare for future-focused careers in data science and analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2436\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Professionals</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2499\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn data-driven decision-making and analytical leadership</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2577\">The program supports both technical skill development and managerial growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2582\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uhj2b3\" data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2617\">Eligibility for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2707\">Students with Indian educational qualifications must fulfill the following requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"3176\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2734\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2734\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2734\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"3176\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2849\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2765\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Degree</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2849\">Candidates must have completed a graduation degree from a recognized institution</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2914\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2866\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2914\" data-col-size=\"md\">40% marks in the last qualifying examination</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"3005\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2937\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Proficiency</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"3005\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basic understanding and communication skills in English required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3074\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3023\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Test</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3074\" data-col-size=\"md\">Required for candidates scoring below 40% marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3176\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3093\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Career Interest</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3176\">Interest in analytics, business intelligence, entrepreneurship, or data science</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3196\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3339\">Final-year students appearing for graduation examinations may also apply if they complete their degree before the commencement of the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3344\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g5t9g4\" data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3380\">Eligibility for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3463\">International students seeking admission must fulfill the following requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3855\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3490\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3490\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3479\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3479\" data-end=\"3490\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3855\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3568\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3521\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Degree</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3568\" data-col-size=\"md\">Must possess a recognized graduation degree</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3684\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3595\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Equivalence Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"3684\">Certificate of equivalence from the Association of Indian Universities (AIU) required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3767\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Skills</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3767\">Good spoken and written English proficiency required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3855\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3791\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Recognition</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"3855\">Foreign qualifications must meet Indian university standards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3962\">International applicants should ensure all academic documents are verified and approved before admission.</p>', '<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"512\">The MBA in Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management fee structure is designed to provide flexible and affordable payment options for students and working professionals who want to build careers in healthcare administration, hospital operations, healthcare consulting, and medical management. The program offers semester-wise payment flexibility along with a 24-month zero-cost EMI facility, making it easier for learners to manage their educational expenses.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"765\">This industry-focused MBA program combines healthcare knowledge with modern business management skills, preparing students for leadership roles in hospitals, healthcare organizations, pharmaceutical companies, insurance firms, and healthcare startups.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"770\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1un57jb\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"828\">MBA in Hospital &amp; Healthcare Management Fees Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"866\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"866\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"846\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"855\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"866\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"954\">\r\n<td data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"900\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"912\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"954\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total fee for the complete MBA program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<td data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"984\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Starting From</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"994\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹56,300</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1043\" data-col-size=\"md\">Pay fees semester-wise for better flexibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1133\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1070\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1089\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹8,906 per month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1133\" data-col-size=\"md\">Interest-free monthly installment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1157\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1171\">0% Interest</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1213\">No additional interest on EMI payments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s5zdhp\" data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1242\">Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1386\">The 24-month zero-cost EMI facility allows students to pay the course fee in smaller monthly installments without additional financial burden.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ybvuhk\" data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1408\">EMI Details Table</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1593\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1435\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1435\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1424\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Feature</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1435\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1593\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1477\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1467\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly EMI Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1477\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹8,906</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1506\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1493\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1506\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1541\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1526\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1541\">0% Interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1593\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1564\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Flexibility</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1593\">Easy monthly installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fxs65l\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1621\">Benefits of EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1825\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hurfrk\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1662\">Affordable monthly payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p4nny4\" data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1692\">No extra interest charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h14h5q\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1753\">Better financial planning for students and professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"120jlpc\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1825\">Convenient option for working individuals pursuing higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1830\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1l1hhn6\" data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1866\">Semester-Wise Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1997\">Students can also choose the semester-wise fee payment structure for easier financial management throughout the program duration.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16r5gyb\" data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2020\">Semester Fee Table</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2098\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2047\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2047\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2037\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2047\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2098\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2098\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2087\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Starting From</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2098\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹56,300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1taph5y\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2139\">Advantages of Semester-Wise Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2299\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19uqe24\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2174\">Lower upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e6mq93\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2206\">Flexible payment scheduling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nsjayg\" data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2259\">Suitable for students balancing work and studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kwoqiw\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2299\">Easier education expense management</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"417\">The MBA in Data Science &amp; Analytics syllabus is designed to combine core business management education with advanced knowledge of data science, machine learning, analytics, and business intelligence. The program helps students develop strategic decision-making abilities using modern data-driven technologies and analytical tools.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"642\">This industry-oriented MBA specialization prepares students for careers in business analytics, data science, AI-driven management, digital transformation, marketing analytics, and technology-based business leadership roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"647\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1c6dec2\" data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"705\">MBA in Data Science &amp; Analytics Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"729\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"866\">The first semester focuses on management fundamentals, communication skills, economics, accounting, and business analytics foundations.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"1510\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"878\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"893\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1510\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\n<td data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"927\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Managerial Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1020\">Covers economic concepts, business decision-making, demand analysis, and market behavior.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1155\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1049\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Statistics for Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1155\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Introduces statistical methods, data interpretation, forecasting, and business analytics fundamentals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1185\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1275\">Develops communication, presentation, leadership, and professional interaction skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1391\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1302\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accounting for Managers</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1391\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Focuses on financial accounting, budgeting, and managerial financial decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1510\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1415\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1510\">Explains marketing strategies, branding, consumer behavior, and market analysis techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1601\">This semester helps students build strong business management and analytical foundations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1606\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1630\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1755\">The second semester focuses on finance, research, legal frameworks, human resource management, and organizational behavior.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1767\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1782\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspects of Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1905\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduces business laws, corporate regulations, and ethical business practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"2030\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1934\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Research Methods</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2030\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers research techniques, data collection, analysis, and business problem-solving methods.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2141\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2054\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2141\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focuses on investment planning, budgeting, financial analysis, and risk management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2268\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2170\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2268\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explains employee management, workforce planning, recruitment, and organizational development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2306\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Conflict Resolution and Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2400\">Develops negotiation, leadership, communication, and workplace conflict management skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2507\">This semester strengthens managerial and operational understanding required in data-driven organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2512\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2536\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2655\">The third semester introduces advanced analytics, data engineering, visualization, and strategic management concepts.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"3545\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2682\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2682\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2667\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2682\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"3545\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2828\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2725\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Analytics for Decision Making</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2828\">Focuses on data-driven business decisions using analytical tools and business intelligence methods.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2829\" data-end=\"2945\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2829\" data-end=\"2848\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Engineering</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2945\">Covers data processing systems, data pipelines, and large-scale data infrastructure concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"3072\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2975\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Visualization and EDA</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3072\">Introduces exploratory data analysis and data visualization techniques for business insights.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3073\" data-end=\"3199\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3073\" data-end=\"3104\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Data Science</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3199\" data-col-size=\"md\">Provides knowledge of data science concepts, analytics models, and predictive technologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3313\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3216\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minor Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3313\" data-col-size=\"md\">Practical project work focused on analytics, business intelligence, or data-driven solutions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3432\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3336\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3432\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers ethical responsibilities and professional conduct in business and technology sectors.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3545\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3456\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3545\">Focuses on business strategy, organizational growth, and competitive decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3653\">This semester helps students gain practical exposure to data science and analytical business applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3655\" data-end=\"3658\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3682\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3684\" data-end=\"3801\">The final semester focuses on machine learning, deep learning, AI applications, and strategic project implementation.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"4483\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"3828\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"3828\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"3813\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3813\" data-end=\"3828\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"4483\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3955\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3863\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advance Deep Learning</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3955\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers advanced neural networks, AI systems, and deep learning applications in business.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"4074\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"3976\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3976\" data-end=\"4074\">Introduces digital branding, online marketing strategies, and data-driven customer engagement.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4075\" data-end=\"4185\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4075\" data-end=\"4091\" data-col-size=\"md\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4185\">Industry-oriented research or implementation project related to analytics or data science.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4331\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4246\" data-col-size=\"md\">Management in Action &ndash; Social Economic and Ethical Issues</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4331\">Focuses on social, economic, ethical, and managerial challenges in organizations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4332\" data-end=\"4483\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4332\" data-end=\"4379\" data-col-size=\"md\">Supervised and Unsupervised Machine Learning</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4379\" data-end=\"4483\">Covers machine learning algorithms, predictive analytics, clustering, and AI-based decision systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4485\" data-end=\"4593\">The final semester prepares students for real-world analytical and leadership roles in modern organizations.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 225000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(362, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 216, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-13 01:08:23', '2026-06-17 00:13:43', '<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"469\">The MBA in Business Analytics admission process is designed to provide a smooth, flexible, and student-friendly enrollment experience for fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, and aspiring analytics professionals. The complete admission procedure can be completed online, making it convenient for students from different educational and professional backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"692\">This MBA specialization combines management education with analytics, business intelligence, forecasting, machine learning, and data visualization to prepare students for data-driven leadership roles in modern industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"697\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16fra4d\" data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"744\">MBA in Business Analytics Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"866\">The admission procedure is divided into five simple steps that help students complete enrollment easily and efficiently.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"871\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"eeuf76\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"902\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1041\">The first step is choosing the MBA in Business Analytics program according to your career goals, interests, and professional aspirations.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"umvhuz\" data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1089\">What Students Should Review Before Applying</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1119\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1119\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1108\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Important Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1119\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1209\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1151\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Curriculum</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1209\" data-col-size=\"md\">Review semester-wise analytics and management subjects</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1233\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Criteria</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1281\" data-col-size=\"md\">Verify graduation and admission requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1372\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1305\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Career Opportunities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1372\">Explore future job roles in analytics and business intelligence</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1455\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1389\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Structure</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1455\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand semester fees, EMI options, and payment flexibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1472\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Mode</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1528\">Check online learning support and academic resources</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t6kxfg\" data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1555\">Why This Step Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1739\">Choosing the right specialization helps students align their education with future career opportunities in business analytics, consulting, data intelligence, and strategic management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1744\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1viqrjy\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1781\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1915\">After selecting the program, students must fill out the online application form with all required academic and personal information.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"bxh93t\" data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1959\">Information Required During Application</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2357\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1995\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1995\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1984\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Information</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"1995\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2357\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2081\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2029\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Personal Information</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2081\" data-col-size=\"md\">Name, address, contact number, and date of birth</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2168\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Details</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2168\">Graduation marks, university details, and qualification records</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2228\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2196\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identification Documents</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2228\">Government-approved ID proof</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2293\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2251\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Contact Credentials</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2293\">Active mobile number and email address</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2357\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2317\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Supporting Documents</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2357\" data-col-size=\"md\">Photograph and academic certificates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2376\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2505\">Students should carefully review all entered details before submission to avoid application delays during document verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2510\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16w6tlx\" data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2543\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2638\">After completing the application form, candidates can proceed with secure online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2668\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2960\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2698\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2698\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2687\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2698\" data-col-size=\"md\">Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2960\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2771\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2732\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2771\" data-col-size=\"md\">Simplified one-time payment process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2830\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2796\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-Wise Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2830\" data-col-size=\"md\">Flexible fee payment structure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2890\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2847\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2890\" data-col-size=\"md\">Affordable monthly installment facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2960\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2914\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online Payment Modes</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2960\">Secure and convenient digital transactions</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zp8axk\" data-start=\"2962\" data-end=\"2996\">Benefits of Online Fee Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3157\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14kark0\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3033\">Quick and secure payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edyjjt\" data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3073\">Flexible financial planning options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"57jdc3\" data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3114\">Convenient for working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wyvmfa\" data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3157\">Supports hassle-free online enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3251\">Students are advised to save payment receipts and confirmation details for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3256\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cfgr7l\" data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3285\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3389\">Once fee payment is completed, candidates must submit the final application and complete registration.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ndoczk\" data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3429\">Activities Included in Registration</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3747\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3465\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3465\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3454\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Process</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3465\" data-col-size=\"md\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3747\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3539\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3501\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Submission</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3539\" data-col-size=\"md\">Final submission of admission form</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3613\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3564\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document Verification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3613\">Validation of academic and identity documents</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"3677\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"3635\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Review</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3677\">Verification of admission requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3747\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3702\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Processing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3747\" data-col-size=\"md\">Official admission confirmation procedure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3767\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3859\">Uploading clear and valid documents helps speed up the verification and enrollment process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3861\" data-end=\"3864\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1tozxz\" data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3900\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3902\" data-end=\"4008\">After successful verification and approval, students receive enrollment information and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b1z5xw\" data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4029\">Students Receive</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4421\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4063\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4063\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4052\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Support</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4052\" data-end=\"4063\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4421\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4138\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4099\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4138\">Official confirmation of enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4139\" data-end=\"4211\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4139\" data-end=\"4167\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student Login Credentials</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4167\" data-end=\"4211\" data-col-size=\"md\">Access to LMS and online learning portal</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4212\" data-end=\"4275\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4212\" data-end=\"4232\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Guidance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4275\">Information about classes and schedules</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4276\" data-end=\"4344\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4276\" data-end=\"4298\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Orientation Support</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4298\" data-end=\"4344\" data-col-size=\"md\">Guidance regarding online learning systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4421\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4369\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Study Material Access</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4421\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital learning resources and recorded lectures</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4423\" data-end=\"4508\">This step officially begins the student&rsquo;s MBA in Business Analytics learning journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4510\" data-end=\"4513\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1f3lzmg\" data-start=\"4515\" data-end=\"4575\">Documents Required for MBA in Business Analytics Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4577\" data-end=\"4644\">Students should keep the following documents ready before applying.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4984\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4677\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4677\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4666\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4677\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4984\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4753\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4714\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Certificates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4714\" data-end=\"4753\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic qualification verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4801\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4776\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Government ID Proof</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4776\" data-end=\"4801\">Identity verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4802\" data-end=\"4862\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4802\" data-end=\"4829\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport-Size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4829\" data-end=\"4862\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student profile documentation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4922\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4890\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mobile Number &amp; Email ID</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4890\" data-end=\"4922\">Communication and LMS access</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4923\" data-end=\"4984\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4923\" data-end=\"4949\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Certificates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4949\" data-end=\"4984\" data-col-size=\"sm\">If required during verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4986\" data-end=\"5082\">International students may additionally require equivalence certificates from authorized bodies.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"495\">The MBA in Business Analytics eligibility criteria are designed for students and professionals who want to build careers in business analytics, data analysis, business intelligence, forecasting, and data-driven management. The program is suitable for fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, and final-year students who want to develop analytical and strategic business skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"698\">This MBA specialization combines management education with analytics, visualization, forecasting, and business intelligence tools, making it highly valuable in today&rsquo;s data-driven business environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"703\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"mb3k1t\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"753\">MBA in Business Analytics Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"890\">Candidates applying for the MBA in Business Analytics program must fulfill the academic and communication requirements mentioned below.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"895\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13qflgx\" data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"931\">General Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"970\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"970\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"959\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"970\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<td data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1009\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1077\" data-col-size=\"md\">Graduation degree in any discipline from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1103\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks Required</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1159\" data-col-size=\"md\">Minimum 40% marks in the last qualifying examination</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Test Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1258\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidates below 40% marks must qualify through an admission test</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1376\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1290\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1376\" data-col-size=\"md\">Applicants must possess sufficient knowledge and understanding of English language</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1404\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Candidate Types</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1486\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, and final-year students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1577\">The program welcomes students from both technical and non-technical academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1582\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jqk3w6\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1633\">Who Should Apply for MBA in Business Analytics?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1773\">This program is suitable for individuals looking to build careers in analytics, management, consulting, and business intelligence domains.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rtq3iu\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1800\">Recommended Candidates</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"2353\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1837\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1837\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1817\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitable For</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1837\" data-col-size=\"md\">Career Objective</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"2353\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1941\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1897\" data-col-size=\"md\">Working Professionals in IT/Finance/Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1941\">Upgrade analytical and managerial skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1958\" data-col-size=\"md\">Entrepreneurs</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2031\">Improve business analytics and strategic decision-making capabilities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2110\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2056\" data-col-size=\"md\">Engineering Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2110\" data-col-size=\"md\">Build careers in business analytics and consulting</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2199\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2147\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematics &amp; Statistics Students</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2199\">Apply analytical skills in business environments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2270\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2222\" data-col-size=\"md\">Final-Year Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2270\" data-col-size=\"md\">Prepare for future-focused analytics careers</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2353\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2296\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Professionals</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2353\">Learn data-driven business management and forecasting</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2444\">The program is designed to support career growth in multiple analytics-driven industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2449\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hduzhj\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2499\">Eligibility for Students with Indian Education</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2599\">Students with Indian educational qualifications must fulfill the following admission requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"3040\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2615\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2626\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"3040\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2741\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2657\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Degree</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2741\">Candidates must have completed a graduation degree from a recognized institution</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2809\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2758\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2809\">Minimum 40% marks in the qualifying examination</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2900\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2832\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Proficiency</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2900\">Basic understanding and communication skills in English required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"2970\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"2918\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Test</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2970\">Mandatory for candidates scoring below 40% marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3040\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2993\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Background</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3040\">Candidates from any discipline are eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3060\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3204\">Final-year students appearing for graduation examinations are also eligible if they complete their degree before the program commencement date.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3209\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"soimpo\" data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3260\">Eligibility for Students with Foreign Education</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3357\">International students applying for MBA in Business Analytics must meet the following criteria.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3744\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3384\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3384\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3373\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3384\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3744\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3469\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3415\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Degree</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3469\" data-col-size=\"md\">Must possess a recognized graduation qualification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3562\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3500\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AIU Equivalence Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3562\" data-col-size=\"md\">Required from the Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3563\" data-end=\"3645\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3563\" data-end=\"3589\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Skills</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3645\">Good spoken and written English proficiency required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3744\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3670\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Verification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3744\">Foreign qualifications must meet Indian university admission standards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3850\">International applicants should ensure all academic documents are verified before the admission process.</p>', '<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"401\">The MBA in Data Science &amp; Analytics program is designed for students and professionals who want to build careers in data science, business analytics, artificial intelligence, machine learning, and business intelligence. The fee structure is planned to provide affordability and flexibility through semester-wise payments and zero-cost EMI options.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"566\">This program combines management education with advanced analytical technologies, helping learners gain industry-ready skills for modern data-driven organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"571\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rxng20\" data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"620\">MBA in Data Science &amp; Analytics Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"662\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"662\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"638\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"647\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"662\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<td data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"696\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"750\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total fee for the complete MBA program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n<td data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"780\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹56,300</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexible semester-wise payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"899\">\r\n<td data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"848\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"867\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹8,906 per month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"899\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly installment facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<td data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"923\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"937\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0% Interest</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"974\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No additional interest applicable</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1afz7mx\" data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1014\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1146\">The zero-cost EMI option helps students divide the program fee into affordable monthly installments without paying extra interest.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1374\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1162\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Feature</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1173\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1374\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1215\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1205\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly EMI Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1215\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹8,906</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1244\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1231\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1244\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1279\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1264\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1279\">0% Interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1319\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1295\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1319\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1374\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1340\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1374\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lower upfront financial burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fxs65l\" data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1402\">Benefits of EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1581\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i0uwck\" data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1436\">Easy monthly payment planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2gpvw\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1467\">No hidden interest charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmbzvr\" data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1509\">Convenient for salaried professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xcxnsc\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1542\">Better financial flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wt2ys5\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1581\">Reduces immediate payment pressure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1586\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1l1hhn6\" data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1622\">Semester-Wise Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1714\">Students who prefer paying fees in stages can opt for the semester-wise payment structure.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1741\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1741\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1731\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1741\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1771\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹56,300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bux5kz\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1818\">Advantages of Semester Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1979\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"156pwuv\" data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1847\">Easier budget management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tr47oy\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1878\">Flexible payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"133abd\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1915\">Lower immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9je25f\" data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1979\">Suitable for working professionals and self-funded students</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"461\">The MBA in Business Analytics syllabus is designed to develop strong managerial, analytical, and data-driven decision-making skills required in modern businesses. The program combines core management education with advanced business analytics, forecasting, visualization, machine learning, and big data concepts to prepare students for leadership roles in data-focused industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"691\">This industry-oriented MBA specialization is ideal for students and professionals who want to build careers in business analytics, data analytics, business intelligence, consulting, marketing analytics, and strategic management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"696\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"140nkba\" data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"748\">MBA in Business Analytics Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"772\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"891\">The first semester focuses on business fundamentals, communication, accounting, statistics, and managerial economics.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"1546\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"918\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"918\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"903\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"918\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1546\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1062\">\r\n<td data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"952\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Managerial Economics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1062\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers economic principles, business decision-making, market analysis, and resource management strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1202\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Statistics for Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1202\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Introduces statistical techniques, data interpretation, probability, and business forecasting fundamentals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1322\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1232\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1322\">Develops communication, presentation, leadership, and professional interaction skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1349\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accounting for Managers</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1431\">Focuses on financial accounting, budgeting, and managerial financial analysis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1546\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1455\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1546\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers branding, consumer behavior, marketing strategies, and market research concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1572\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1683\">Students develop a strong foundation in business management and analytical thinking during the first semester.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1688\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1712\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1831\">The second semester focuses on financial management, research, human resources, and organizational management skills.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"2505\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1858\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1858\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1843\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1858\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"2505\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1985\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1897\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspects of Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1985\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explains business laws, corporate governance, and legal compliance in organizations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2117\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2014\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Research Methods</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2117\">Covers research design, data collection, analysis techniques, and business problem-solving methods.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2241\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2141\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2241\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduces investment planning, capital budgeting, risk analysis, and financial decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2370\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2270\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2370\">Focuses on employee management, recruitment, workforce planning, and organizational development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2505\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2408\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Conflict Resolution and Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2505\">Develops leadership, negotiation, communication, and workplace conflict management abilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2531\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2633\">This semester strengthens managerial decision-making and organizational problem-solving capabilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2638\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2662\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2793\">The third semester introduces core business analytics concepts, data visualization, forecasting, and machine learning techniques.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"3728\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2820\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2820\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2805\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2820\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"3728\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2987\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2878\" data-col-size=\"md\">Analyzing and Visualizing Data with Power BI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2987\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers dashboard creation, data visualization, reporting, and business intelligence tools using Power BI.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3112\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3013\" data-col-size=\"md\">Forecasting Techniques</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3112\">Introduces predictive analytics, forecasting models, and trend analysis for business decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3244\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3150\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to Business Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3244\">Explains analytics frameworks, data-driven strategies, and business intelligence concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3355\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3261\" data-col-size=\"md\">Minor Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3355\">Practical project focused on business analytics applications and industry problem-solving.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3478\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3378\" data-col-size=\"md\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3478\">Covers ethical business practices and professional responsibilities in analytics and management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3479\" data-end=\"3596\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3479\" data-end=\"3502\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3596\">Focuses on organizational strategy, competitive analysis, and long-term business planning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3728\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3630\" data-col-size=\"md\">Supervised Learning Techniques</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3728\">Introduces machine learning algorithms used for classification, prediction, and data analysis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3754\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3862\">Students gain hands-on exposure to analytics tools, predictive modeling, and business intelligence systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3864\" data-end=\"3867\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"3869\" data-end=\"3891\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"4003\">The final semester focuses on advanced analytics, optimization techniques, and industry-oriented project work.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4726\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4030\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4030\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4015\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4030\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4041\" data-end=\"4726\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4041\" data-end=\"4169\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4041\" data-end=\"4062\" data-col-size=\"md\">Big Data Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4169\">Covers large-scale data processing, analytics systems, and big data technologies used in organizations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4170\" data-end=\"4294\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4170\" data-end=\"4190\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4294\">Introduces online marketing strategies, analytics-driven campaigns, and customer engagement methods.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4424\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4311\" data-col-size=\"md\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4311\" data-end=\"4424\">Industry-oriented research or implementation project related to business analytics or data-driven management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4574\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4485\" data-col-size=\"md\">Management in Action &ndash; Social Economic and Ethical Issues</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4485\" data-end=\"4574\">Focuses on social, economic, ethical, and managerial challenges in modern businesses.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4575\" data-end=\"4726\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4575\" data-end=\"4625\" data-col-size=\"md\">Optimization and Dimension Reduction Techniques</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4625\" data-end=\"4726\">Covers advanced analytical methods for improving business efficiency and handling large datasets.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"4728\" data-end=\"4752\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4753\" data-end=\"4870\">The final semester helps students apply analytics and strategic management concepts to real-world business scenarios.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 225000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(363, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 306, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-13 01:18:31', '2026-06-17 00:13:58', '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"473\">The MBA in Blockchain Technology admission process is designed to provide a smooth, flexible, and student-friendly enrollment experience for fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, and aspiring blockchain professionals. The complete admission procedure can be completed online, making it convenient for students from different academic and professional backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"723\">This industry-oriented MBA specialization combines blockchain technology, fintech, cryptocurrency ecosystems, enterprise blockchain applications, and business management to prepare students for future-focused leadership roles in digital industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"728\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"du5acv\" data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"778\">MBA in Blockchain Technology Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"898\">The admission procedure is divided into five simple and easy steps that help students complete enrollment efficiently.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"903\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"eeuf76\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"934\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"1087\">The first step is selecting the MBA in Blockchain Technology program according to your career goals, technical interests, and professional aspirations.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"umvhuz\" data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1135\">What Students Should Review Before Applying</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1582\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1165\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1165\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1154\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Important Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1165\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1582\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1197\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Curriculum</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1264\" data-col-size=\"md\">Review blockchain, fintech, management, and technology subjects</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1288\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Criteria</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1351\" data-col-size=\"md\">Verify academic qualifications and mathematics requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1419\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1375\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Career Opportunities</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1419\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore blockchain and fintech job roles</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1502\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1436\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Structure</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1502\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand semester fees, EMI options, and payment flexibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1582\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1522\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Support</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1582\" data-col-size=\"md\">Check online learning tools and student support services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1614\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1812\">Choosing the right specialization helps students align their education with growing career opportunities in blockchain management, fintech, Web3 technologies, and enterprise digital transformation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1817\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1viqrjy\" data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1854\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1982\">After selecting the program, candidates must fill out the online application form with accurate academic and personal details.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"bxh93t\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2026\">Information Required During Application</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2423\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2062\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2062\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2051\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Information</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2062\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2423\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2148\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2096\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Personal Information</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2148\">Name, contact number, address, and date of birth</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2220\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2171\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Details</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2220\">Graduation qualification and academic records</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2280\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2248\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identification Documents</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2280\">Government-approved ID proof</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2345\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2303\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Contact Credentials</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2345\">Active email address and mobile number</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2423\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2369\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Supporting Documents</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2423\" data-col-size=\"md\">Academic certificates and passport-size photograph</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2442\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2563\">Students should carefully review all entered information before submission to avoid delays during document verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2568\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16w6tlx\" data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2601\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2694\">After completing the application form, students can proceed with secure online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2724\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"3015\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2754\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2754\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2743\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2754\" data-col-size=\"md\">Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"3015\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2827\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2788\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2827\" data-col-size=\"md\">Simplified one-time payment process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2882\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2852\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-Wise Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2882\">Flexible payment structure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2942\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2899\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2899\" data-end=\"2942\" data-col-size=\"md\">Affordable monthly installment facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"3015\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"2966\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online Payment Modes</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"3015\" data-col-size=\"md\">Secure and convenient digital payment methods</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zp8axk\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3051\">Benefits of Online Fee Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3215\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mr8faz\" data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3091\">Fast and secure transaction process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edyjjt\" data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3131\">Flexible financial planning options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"57jdc3\" data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3172\">Convenient for working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wyvmfa\" data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3215\">Supports hassle-free online enrollment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3301\">Students should save payment receipts and confirmation details for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3306\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cfgr7l\" data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3335\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3443\">Once the fee payment is completed, candidates must submit the final application and complete registration.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ndoczk\" data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3483\">Activities Included in Registration</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3797\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3519\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3519\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3508\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Process</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3519\" data-col-size=\"md\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3797\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3593\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3555\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Submission</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3593\" data-col-size=\"md\">Final submission of admission form</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3667\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3618\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document Verification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3667\">Validation of academic and identity documents</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3731\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3689\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Review</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3731\">Confirmation of admission requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3797\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3756\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Processing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3797\" data-col-size=\"md\">Official admission approval procedure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3817\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3919\">Uploading valid and clear documents helps speed up the admission verification and enrollment process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3921\" data-end=\"3924\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1tozxz\" data-start=\"3926\" data-end=\"3960\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"4068\">After successful verification and approval, students receive enrollment information and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b1z5xw\" data-start=\"4070\" data-end=\"4089\">Students Receive</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4472\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4123\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4123\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4112\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Support</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4112\" data-end=\"4123\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4472\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4191\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4159\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4191\" data-col-size=\"md\">Official enrollment approval</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4192\" data-end=\"4264\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4192\" data-end=\"4220\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student Login Credentials</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4220\" data-end=\"4264\" data-col-size=\"md\">Access to LMS and online learning portal</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4332\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4285\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Guidance</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4285\" data-end=\"4332\" data-col-size=\"md\">Information regarding classes and schedules</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4395\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4355\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Orientation Support</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4395\" data-col-size=\"md\">Guidance for online learning systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4472\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4420\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Study Material Access</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4420\" data-end=\"4472\">Digital learning resources and recorded lectures</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4474\" data-end=\"4562\">This step officially begins the student&rsquo;s MBA in Blockchain Technology learning journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4564\" data-end=\"4567\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"p19fre\" data-start=\"4569\" data-end=\"4632\">Documents Required for MBA in Blockchain Technology Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4634\" data-end=\"4701\">Students should keep the following documents ready before applying.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"5041\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4734\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4734\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4723\" data-end=\"4734\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"5041\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4810\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4771\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Certificates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4771\" data-end=\"4810\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic qualification verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4811\" data-end=\"4858\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4811\" data-end=\"4833\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Government ID Proof</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4833\" data-end=\"4858\">Identity verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4859\" data-end=\"4919\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4859\" data-end=\"4886\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport-Size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4886\" data-end=\"4919\">Student profile documentation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4920\" data-end=\"4979\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4920\" data-end=\"4947\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Email ID &amp; Mobile Number</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4947\" data-end=\"4979\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Communication and LMS access</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4980\" data-end=\"5041\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4980\" data-end=\"5006\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Certificates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5006\" data-end=\"5041\" data-col-size=\"sm\">If required during verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"5043\" data-end=\"5120\">International students may additionally require AIU equivalence certificates.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"576\">The MBA in Blockchain Technology eligibility criteria are designed for students and professionals who want to build careers in blockchain management, fintech, decentralized technologies, cryptocurrency ecosystems, enterprise blockchain solutions, and digital transformation industries. The program combines management education with blockchain technology, making it suitable for both technical and non-technical learners interested in emerging digital business systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"845\">This blockchain-focused MBA specialization is ideal for fresh graduates, final-year students, entrepreneurs, business managers, and working professionals looking to develop expertise in blockchain implementation, business innovation, and technology-driven management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16h7hlf\" data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"903\">MBA in Blockchain Technology Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"1043\">Candidates applying for the MBA in Blockchain Technology program must fulfill the academic and communication requirements mentioned below.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1048\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13qflgx\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1084\">General Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1773\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1123\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1123\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1112\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1123\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1773\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1212\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1162\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1212\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1340\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1245\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Academic Backgrounds</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1340\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Commerce, Engineering, IT, Computer Science, Mathematics, Science, Arts, and related fields</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1406\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1367\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1406\">Mathematics at 10+2 level preferred</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1535\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1430\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bridge Course Option</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1535\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Students without Mathematics at 10+2 or graduation level can apply after qualifying the bridge course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1655\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1563\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Candidate Types</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1655\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Fresh graduates, final-year students, working professionals, managers, and entrepreneurs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1773\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1687\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1773\">Applicants must possess sufficient spoken and written English communication skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1860\">The program supports learners from multiple educational and professional backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1865\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hl23z8\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1919\">Who Should Apply for MBA in Blockchain Technology?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"2051\">The program is suitable for individuals interested in blockchain-based business transformation and emerging technology management.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rtq3iu\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2078\">Recommended Candidates</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2686\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2115\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2115\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2095\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suitable For</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2115\" data-col-size=\"md\">Career Objective</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2686\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2206\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2147\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Commerce Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2206\">Build careers in fintech and blockchain-enabled finance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2294\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2236\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Engineering &amp; IT Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2294\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop blockchain technology and management expertise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2367\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2318\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics Students</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2367\">Apply analytical skills in blockchain systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2450\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2388\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Managers</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2450\" data-col-size=\"md\">Implement blockchain solutions in organizational processes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2531\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2467\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entrepreneurs</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2531\" data-col-size=\"md\">Build blockchain-driven startups and digital business models</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2614\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2556\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Working Professionals</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2614\" data-col-size=\"md\">Transition into blockchain and Web3 technology domains</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2686\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2637\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final-Year Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2686\" data-col-size=\"md\">Prepare for future-focused blockchain careers</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2797\">The program helps students understand both technical blockchain concepts and strategic business applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2802\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hduzhj\" data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2852\">Eligibility for Students with Indian Education</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2933\">Indian students must fulfill the following academic requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"3420\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2960\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2960\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2949\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2960\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3420\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2996\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2984\" data-col-size=\"md\">BCA Degree</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"2996\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3063\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3051\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science / Engineering</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3063\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3156\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3113\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in Science / Commerce / Arts</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3156\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligible with Mathematics at 10+2 level</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3236\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3183\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematics Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3236\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematics at 10+2 or graduation level preferred</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3342\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3265\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bridge Course Eligibility</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3342\">Students without Mathematics can apply after qualifying the bridge course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3420\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3365\" data-col-size=\"md\">English Proficiency</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3365\" data-end=\"3420\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basic spoken and written English knowledge required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3440\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3441\" data-end=\"3579\">Students appearing for final-year graduation examinations are also eligible if they complete their degree before the program commencement.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3584\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"soimpo\" data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3635\">Eligibility for Students with Foreign Education</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3637\" data-end=\"3735\">International students applying for MBA in Blockchain Technology must meet the following criteria.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"4180\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3762\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3762\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3751\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3751\" data-end=\"3762\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3773\" data-end=\"4180\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3773\" data-end=\"3847\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3773\" data-end=\"3793\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3793\" data-end=\"3847\" data-col-size=\"md\">Must possess a recognized graduation qualification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3928\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3867\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted Degrees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3867\" data-end=\"3928\">Any equivalent qualification accepted for Indian students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3929\" data-end=\"4011\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3929\" data-end=\"3955\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Skills</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"4011\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good spoken and written English proficiency required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4091\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AIU Equivalence Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4091\">Mandatory for students with foreign education</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4180\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4116\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Verification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4116\" data-end=\"4180\" data-col-size=\"md\">Foreign qualifications must meet Indian university standards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4277\">International applicants should ensure all educational documents are verified before admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4279\" data-end=\"4282\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"y5cgme\" data-start=\"4284\" data-end=\"4338\">Mathematics Requirement in MBA Blockchain Technology</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4472\">Mathematics knowledge helps students understand blockchain algorithms, cryptography, analytics, and decentralized system structures.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4474\" data-end=\"4574\">However, students without mathematics backgrounds can still apply through the bridge course pathway.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4795\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4622\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4622\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4602\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics Eligibility</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4602\" data-end=\"4622\" data-col-size=\"md\">Admission Status</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4795\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4673\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4661\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics at 10+2 Level</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4661\" data-end=\"4673\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4674\" data-end=\"4720\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4674\" data-end=\"4708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics at Graduation Level</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4708\" data-end=\"4720\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4721\" data-end=\"4795\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4721\" data-end=\"4749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No Mathematics Background</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4749\" data-end=\"4795\">Eligible after bridge course qualification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4797\" data-end=\"4879\">This flexible eligibility structure allows broader access to blockchain education.</p>', '<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"378\">The MBA in Blockchain&nbsp; fee structure is designed to provide flexible and affordable payment options for students, fresh graduates, entrepreneurs, and working professionals who want to build careers in business analytics, business intelligence, forecasting, and data-driven management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"582\">The program offers semester-wise fee payment and 24-month zero-cost EMI facilities, making advanced analytics education more accessible for learners from different academic and professional backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"587\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19qo4lo\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"630\">MBA Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"990\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"668\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"668\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"648\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"657\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"668\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"990\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"756\">\r\n<td data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"702\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"714\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,99,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"756\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total fee for the complete MBA program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"837\">\r\n<td data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"786\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Starting From</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"796\">₹49,800</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"837\">Flexible semester-wise payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"915\">\r\n<td data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"864\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"883\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹7,877 per month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"915\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly installment facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"990\">\r\n<td data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"939\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"953\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0% Interest</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"990\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No additional interest applicable</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"995\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1afz7mx\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1030\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1180\">The zero-cost EMI option allows students to divide the total program fee into affordable monthly installments without paying extra interest charges.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1207\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1207\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1196\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Feature</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1207\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1249\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1239\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly EMI Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1249\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹7,877</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1265\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1278\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1298\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1313\">0% Interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1353\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1329\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1353\">Monthly Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1376\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Advantage</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1412\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reduces upfront financial burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13bw1eo\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1442\">Benefits of Zero Cost EMI</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1635\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f87mbw\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1478\">Easy monthly payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2gpvw\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1509\">No hidden interest charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1abrmtp\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1552\">Better financial planning for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmbzvr\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1594\">Convenient for salaried professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c1c7rp\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1635\">Supports affordable higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1724\">The EMI option is especially useful for working professionals and self-funded learners.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1l1hhn6\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1765\">Semester-Wise Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1856\">Students who prefer paying fees in stages can choose the semester-wise payment structure.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1934\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1883\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1883\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1873\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1883\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1934\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1934\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1923\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Starting From</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1934\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹49,800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e6bhnq\" data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1973\">Advantages of Semester Fee Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2126\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"clfgo5\" data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2011\">Lower immediate payment pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173suuv\" data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2042\">Flexible budgeting support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y7r94r\" data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2074\">Easier financial management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qjbc96\" data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2126\">Suitable for students and working professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2224\">This payment flexibility helps students continue their education without major financial stress.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"461\">The MCA in Blockchain Technology syllabus is designed to provide advanced knowledge in blockchain development, cybersecurity, cryptography, cloud security, enterprise blockchain applications, and decentralized technologies. The program combines core computer application subjects with specialized blockchain concepts to prepare students for modern technology-driven industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"859\">This industry-focused MCA specialization helps students develop expertise in blockchain architecture, Ethereum applications, smart contracts, distributed ledger systems, and secure digital transactions. The curriculum is highly suitable for students and professionals aiming to build careers in blockchain development, fintech, cybersecurity, cloud computing, and enterprise technology solutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"864\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10jnfp\" data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"919\">MCA in Blockchain Technology Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"943\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1106\">The first semester focuses on advanced programming, database management, software engineering, and mathematical foundations required for blockchain technologies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1955\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1133\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1133\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1133\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1955\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1305\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1183\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Database Management Systems</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1305\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers advanced database concepts, transaction management, distributed databases, and secure data handling techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1476\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1349\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Software Engineering Principles</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1476\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Focuses on software development methodologies, system architecture, software testing, and scalable application development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1629\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1489\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core Java</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1629\">Introduces object-oriented programming concepts, Java application development, exception handling, and backend programming fundamentals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1798\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1663\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graph Theory and Combinatorics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1798\">Covers mathematical structures, graphs, combinational analysis, and algorithmic problem-solving concepts used in computing systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1955\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1828\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Communication</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1955\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Develops communication, presentation, teamwork, and professional interaction skills essential for technology professionals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1981\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2132\">Students build strong programming, database, and software engineering foundations required for advanced blockchain and distributed system development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2137\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2161\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2288\">The second semester introduces blockchain technologies, cryptography, cloud security, and enterprise blockchain applications.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"3285\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2315\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2315\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2300\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2315\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"3285\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2486\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2365\" data-col-size=\"md\">Blockchain Technology and Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2486\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Explains blockchain fundamentals, distributed ledger systems, consensus mechanisms, and blockchain governance models.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2665\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2545\" data-col-size=\"md\">Information Security, Cloud Security, Risk &amp; Compliance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2665\">Covers cybersecurity frameworks, cloud protection techniques, compliance management, and risk mitigation strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2820\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2705\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Structures and Algorithm Design</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2820\">Focuses on efficient data organization, algorithms, problem-solving, and computational optimization techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"3019\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2900\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to Ethereum, Enterprise Blockchain Applications and Hyperledger</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"3019\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Introduces Ethereum networks, Hyperledger frameworks, smart contracts, and enterprise blockchain deployment models.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3156\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3056\" data-col-size=\"md\">Network Security and Cryptography</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3156\">Covers encryption, authentication, secure communication protocols, and cybersecurity mechanisms.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3285\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3180\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3285\">Develops research, analytical, and technical documentation skills for academic and industry projects.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3311\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3454\">Students gain technical understanding of blockchain ecosystems, cybersecurity principles, and enterprise blockchain implementation strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3459\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3483\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3616\">The third semester focuses on blockchain application development, Ethereum programming, smart contracts, and decentralized systems.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"4827\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3643\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3643\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3628\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3628\" data-end=\"3643\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"4827\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3817\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3690\" data-col-size=\"md\">Architecting Blockchain Solutions</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3817\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers blockchain system architecture, decentralized application frameworks, and scalable blockchain infrastructure design.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3965\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3851\" data-col-size=\"md\">Building Ethereum Applications</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3851\" data-end=\"3965\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Focuses on developing decentralized applications (DApps) and implementing Ethereum-based blockchain solutions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3966\" data-end=\"4096\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3966\" data-end=\"3988\" data-col-size=\"md\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"4096\">Explains ethical practices, digital responsibility, and professional standards in technology industries.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4097\" data-end=\"4267\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4097\" data-end=\"4145\" data-col-size=\"md\">Programming Fundamentals: Golang and Solidity</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4267\">Introduces blockchain-focused programming languages used for smart contract and decentralized application development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4268\" data-end=\"4382\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4268\" data-end=\"4292\" data-col-size=\"md\">Quantitative Aptitude</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4292\" data-end=\"4382\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Develops analytical reasoning, numerical problem-solving, and logical aptitude skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4383\" data-end=\"4511\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4383\" data-end=\"4406\" data-col-size=\"md\">Seminar (Evaluation)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4406\" data-end=\"4511\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Provides opportunities for technical presentations, research discussions, and concept demonstrations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4512\" data-end=\"4682\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4512\" data-end=\"4562\" data-col-size=\"md\">Technicalities and Implementation of Blockchain</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4562\" data-end=\"4682\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers practical blockchain deployment, integration techniques, consensus implementation, and blockchain frameworks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4683\" data-end=\"4827\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4683\" data-end=\"4708\" data-col-size=\"md\">Unix/Linux Programming</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4708\" data-end=\"4827\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Introduces Linux operating systems, shell scripting, system administration, and server-side computing environments.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"4829\" data-end=\"4853\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4854\" data-end=\"5016\">Students gain practical blockchain development expertise along with hands-on experience in Ethereum applications, smart contracts, and decentralized technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5018\" data-end=\"5021\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"5023\" data-end=\"5045\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5047\" data-end=\"5141\">The final semester focuses on project implementation and industry-oriented practical learning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5326\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5168\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5168\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5153\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5153\" data-end=\"5168\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5179\" data-end=\"5326\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5179\" data-end=\"5326\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5179\" data-end=\"5195\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5195\" data-end=\"5326\">Industry-focused project involving blockchain application development, decentralized systems, or blockchain security solutions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"5328\" data-end=\"5352\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5353\" data-end=\"5506\">The major project helps students apply blockchain development, programming, security, and distributed computing concepts to real-world industry problems.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(364, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 218, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-13 01:28:52', '2026-06-17 00:14:16', '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"462\">The MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning admission process is designed to provide a smooth, flexible, and student-friendly enrollment experience for fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, and technology enthusiasts. The complete admission procedure can be completed online, making it convenient for students from different academic and professional backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"717\">This advanced MCA specialization combines artificial intelligence, machine learning, deep learning, cloud computing, data analytics, and intelligent software technologies to prepare students for future-focused careers in the rapidly growing AI industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"722\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1v2o0wj\" data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"772\">MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"895\">The admission procedure is divided into five simple steps that help students complete enrollment quickly and efficiently.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"eeuf76\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"931\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"1079\">The first step is selecting the MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning program according to your academic interests, technical background, and career goals.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"umvhuz\" data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1127\">What Students Should Review Before Applying</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1600\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1146\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Important Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1157\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1600\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1265\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Curriculum</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1265\" data-col-size=\"md\">Review AI, machine learning, deep learning, and cloud computing subjects</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1289\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Criteria</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1351\" data-col-size=\"md\">Verify academic qualification and mathematics requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1420\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1375\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Career Opportunities</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1420\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore AI and machine learning job roles</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1506\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1437\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Structure</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1506\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand semester fees, EMI facilities, and payment flexibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1600\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1526\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Support</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1600\" data-col-size=\"md\">Check online learning tools, LMS access, and academic support services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1632\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1826\">Selecting the right AI specialization helps students align their education with future career opportunities in artificial intelligence, automation, analytics, and intelligent computing systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1831\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1viqrjy\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1868\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"2000\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application form with accurate academic and personal information.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"bxh93t\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2044\">Information Required During Application</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2080\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2080\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2069\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Information</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2080\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2166\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2114\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Personal Information</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2166\" data-col-size=\"md\">Name, address, contact number, and date of birth</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2238\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2195\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2238\" data-col-size=\"md\">Graduation details and academic records</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2304\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2256\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identity Proof</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2304\" data-col-size=\"md\">Government-approved identification documents</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2364\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2327\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Contact Credentials</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2364\">Active email ID and mobile number</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2388\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Supporting Documents</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2442\" data-col-size=\"md\">Academic certificates and passport-size photograph</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2461\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2589\">Students should carefully verify all entered information before final submission to avoid delays during admission verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2594\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16w6tlx\" data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2627\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2721\">After filling out the application form, students can proceed with secure online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2751\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"3037\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2781\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2781\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2781\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"3037\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2850\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2815\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2850\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Simple one-time payment process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2909\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2875\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-Wise Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2909\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexible fee payment structure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2969\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2926\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2969\">Affordable monthly installment facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"3037\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"2993\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online Payment Modes</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3037\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Safe and convenient digital transactions</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zp8axk\" data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3073\">Benefits of Online Fee Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3251\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mr8faz\" data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3113\">Fast and secure transaction process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edyjjt\" data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3153\">Flexible financial planning options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9nd2yp\" data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3208\">Easy fee management for students and professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12cv6l5\" data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3251\">Convenient online admission experience</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3336\">Students should keep payment receipts and transaction details for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3341\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cfgr7l\" data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3370\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3490\">Once the fee payment is completed, candidates must submit the final application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ndoczk\" data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3530\">Activities Included in Registration</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3841\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3566\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3566\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3555\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Process</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3566\" data-col-size=\"md\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3841\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3641\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3602\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Submission</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3641\" data-col-size=\"md\">Final online application submission</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3715\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3666\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document Verification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3666\" data-end=\"3715\" data-col-size=\"md\">Validation of academic and identity documents</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3716\" data-end=\"3785\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3716\" data-end=\"3743\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3785\">Verification of admission requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3841\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3808\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Approval</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3841\" data-col-size=\"md\">Official admission processing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3861\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3961\">Uploading valid and clear documents helps speed up the verification and admission approval process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"3966\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1tozxz\" data-start=\"3968\" data-end=\"4002\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4004\" data-end=\"4106\">After successful verification and approval, students receive enrollment details and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b1z5xw\" data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4127\">Students Receive</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4497\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4161\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4161\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Support</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4161\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4497\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4229\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4197\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4229\" data-col-size=\"md\">Official enrollment approval</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4295\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4258\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student Login Credentials</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4258\" data-end=\"4295\" data-col-size=\"md\">Access to LMS and learning portal</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4363\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4316\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Guidance</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4316\" data-end=\"4363\" data-col-size=\"md\">Information regarding schedules and classes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4364\" data-end=\"4429\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4364\" data-end=\"4386\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Orientation Support</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4429\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to online learning systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4430\" data-end=\"4497\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4430\" data-end=\"4454\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Study Material Access</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4454\" data-end=\"4497\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital resources and recorded lectures</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4499\" data-end=\"4587\">This step officially begins the student&rsquo;s MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning academic journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4592\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"107jad2\" data-start=\"4594\" data-end=\"4657\">Documents Required for MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4659\" data-end=\"4748\">Students should keep the following documents ready before starting the admission process.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"5089\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"4781\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"4781\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"4770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4770\" data-end=\"4781\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4792\" data-end=\"5089\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4792\" data-end=\"4857\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4792\" data-end=\"4818\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Certificates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4818\" data-end=\"4857\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic qualification verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4858\" data-end=\"4903\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4858\" data-end=\"4880\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Government ID Proof</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4880\" data-end=\"4903\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identity validation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4904\" data-end=\"4964\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4904\" data-end=\"4931\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport-Size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4964\">Student profile documentation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"5027\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"4992\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Email ID &amp; Mobile Number</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4992\" data-end=\"5027\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Communication and portal access</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5028\" data-end=\"5089\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5028\" data-end=\"5054\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Certificates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5054\" data-end=\"5089\">If required during verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"5091\" data-end=\"5168\">International students may additionally require AIU equivalence certificates.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"542\">The MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning eligibility criteria are designed for students and professionals who want to build advanced careers in artificial intelligence, machine learning, big data analytics, cloud computing, automation, intelligent systems, and software development. The program is suitable for learners from technical, analytical, and mathematical backgrounds who aim to develop future-ready AI and machine learning expertise.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"792\">This industry-oriented MCA specialization combines computer applications, AI technologies, machine learning algorithms, data analytics, cloud infrastructure, and intelligent automation systems to prepare students for high-demand technology careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gqzgbz\" data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"850\">MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"998\">Candidates seeking admission to the MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning program must fulfill the academic and communication requirements mentioned below.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1003\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13qflgx\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1039\">General Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1067\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1078\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1167\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1117\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1167\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1266\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1191\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Backgrounds</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1266\" data-col-size=\"md\">IT, Computer Science, Engineering, Mathematics, Science, Commerce, Arts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1346\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1293\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1346\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematics at 10+2 or graduation level preferred</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1370\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bridge Course Option</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1447\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students without Mathematics can apply after qualifying the bridge course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1479\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1547\" data-col-size=\"md\">Applicants should possess spoken and written English proficiency</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1575\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Candidate Types</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1657\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fresh graduates, final-year students, entrepreneurs, and working professionals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1780\">The program offers flexible eligibility pathways for learners from both technical and non-technical academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1785\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1g5tt5k\" data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1839\">Who Should Apply for MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1974\">The program is highly suitable for students and professionals interested in AI-driven technologies and intelligent computing systems.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rtq3iu\" data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2001\">Recommended Candidates</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2586\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2038\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2038\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2018\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suitable For</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2038\" data-col-size=\"md\">Career Objective</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2586\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2121\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2068\" data-col-size=\"sm\">IT Professionals</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2121\" data-col-size=\"md\">Upgrade skills in AI, ML, and intelligent systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2217\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2159\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Analytics &amp; Big Data Professionals</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2217\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn predictive analytics and machine learning models</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2290\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2245\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Statistics Professionals</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2290\" data-col-size=\"md\">Build expertise in data-driven AI systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2354\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2307\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entrepreneurs</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2354\" data-col-size=\"md\">Create AI and ML-based products or services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2432\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2379\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Engineering Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2432\" data-col-size=\"md\">Transition into AI and advanced computing careers</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2514\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2456\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2514\" data-col-size=\"md\">Apply analytical skills in machine learning algorithms</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2586\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2537\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final-Year Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2586\" data-col-size=\"md\">Prepare for future-focused technology careers</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2709\">The program supports both career advancement and career transition opportunities in the AI and machine learning industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2714\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hduzhj\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2764\">Eligibility for Students with Indian Education</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2850\">Indian students must fulfill the following educational qualifications for admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"3370\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2877\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2877\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2866\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2877\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"3370\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2942\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2930\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2942\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"3009\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"2997\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science / Engineering</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3009\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3102\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3059\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in Science / Commerce / Arts</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3102\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligible with Mathematics at 10+2 level</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3182\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3129\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematics Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3182\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematics at 10+2 or graduation level preferred</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3288\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3211\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bridge Course Eligibility</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3288\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students without Mathematics can apply after qualifying the bridge course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3370\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3311\" data-col-size=\"md\">English Proficiency</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3370\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basic spoken and written English understanding required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3390\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3536\">Students appearing for final-year graduation examinations are also eligible if they complete their degree before the commencement of the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3538\" data-end=\"3541\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"soimpo\" data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3592\">Eligibility for Students with Foreign Education</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3692\">International students applying for MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning must meet the following criteria.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"4123\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3719\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3719\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3719\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"4123\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3793\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3750\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3793\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mandatory from a recognized institution</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3871\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3813\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted Degrees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3813\" data-end=\"3871\" data-col-size=\"md\">Equivalent qualifications accepted for Indian students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3954\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3898\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Skills</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3954\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good spoken and written English proficiency required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"4031\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"3985\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AIU Equivalence Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"4031\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mandatory for foreign education applicants</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4123\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4056\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Verification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4056\" data-end=\"4123\" data-col-size=\"md\">Foreign qualifications must satisfy Indian university standards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4209\">International students should ensure proper academic documentation before admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"462\">&nbsp;</p>', '<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"405\">The MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning fee structure is designed to provide affordable and flexible payment options for students, fresh graduates, and working professionals who want to build careers in artificial intelligence, machine learning, data science, deep learning, automation, and advanced software technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"619\">The program offers semester-wise fee payment flexibility along with a 24-month zero-cost EMI option, helping students manage educational expenses conveniently while pursuing industry-oriented technical education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"624\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1eoy63m\" data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"670\">MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"1041\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"708\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"708\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"688\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"697\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"1041\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"796\">\r\n<td data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"742\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"754\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,99,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"796\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total fee for the complete MCA program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"877\">\r\n<td data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"826\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Starting From</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"836\">₹49,800</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"877\">Flexible semester-wise payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"966\">\r\n<td data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"904\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"923\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹7,877 per month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"966\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Affordable monthly installment facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1041\">\r\n<td data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"990\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1004\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0% Interest</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1041\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No additional interest applicable</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1046\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1afz7mx\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1081\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1227\">The zero-cost EMI facility helps students divide the total program fee into manageable monthly installments without additional financial burden.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1243\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Feature</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1254\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1296\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1286\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly EMI Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1296\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹7,877</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1325\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1312\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1325\">24 Months</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1360\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1345\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1360\">0% Interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1376\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1400\">Monthly Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1421\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1457\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reduced upfront payment pressure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13bw1eo\" data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1487\">Benefits of Zero Cost EMI</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1675\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i0uwck\" data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1522\">Easy monthly payment planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2gpvw\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1553\">No hidden interest charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"190cxp\" data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1592\">Financial flexibility for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmbzvr\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1634\">Convenient for salaried professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c1c7rp\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1675\">Supports affordable higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1807\">The EMI option makes advanced AI and machine learning education more accessible for learners from different financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1812\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1l1hhn6\" data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1848\">Semester-Wise Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1933\">Students who prefer phased fee payments can choose the semester-wise fee structure.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1960\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1960\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1950\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1960\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2000\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Starting From</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2011\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹49,800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e6bhnq\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2050\">Advantages of Semester Fee Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2210\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"133abd\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2088\">Lower immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14nbjvl\" data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2118\">Easier academic budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b6t5xk\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2146\">Flexible fee management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9je25f\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2210\">Suitable for working professionals and self-funded students</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2319\">This structure allows students to manage educational expenses more comfortably during the program duration.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"510\">The MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning syllabus is designed to provide advanced knowledge in artificial intelligence, machine learning, deep learning, cloud computing, data analytics, neural networks, software engineering, and intelligent application development. The program combines core computer application subjects with modern AI-driven technologies to prepare students for rapidly evolving technology industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"936\">This industry-oriented MCA specialization helps students develop expertise in machine learning algorithms, AI systems, deep learning models, data processing, cloud infrastructure, and intelligent software solutions. The curriculum is highly suitable for students and professionals aiming to build successful careers in artificial intelligence, data science, automation, cloud technologies, and advanced software development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hqhbso\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"996\">MCA in AI &amp; Machine Learning Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1020\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1194\">The first semester focuses on programming foundations, advanced databases, software engineering, and communication skills required for AI and machine learning technologies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"2029\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1221\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1221\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1206\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1221\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"2029\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1386\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1261\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1386\">Develops professional speaking, writing, presentation, and workplace communication skills essential for IT professionals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1523\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1399\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Core Java</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1523\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers object-oriented programming concepts, Java development, exception handling, and backend programming fundamentals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1563\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Database Management Systems</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1689\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Introduces advanced database concepts, distributed databases, transaction management, and secure data handling techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1871\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1733\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Software Engineering Principles</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1871\">Focuses on software development life cycle, system architecture, software testing, and scalable application development methodologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"2029\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1905\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graph Theory and Combinatorics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2029\">Covers mathematical foundations, graph structures, combinational analysis, and computational problem-solving techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2055\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2209\">Students build strong programming, database, analytical, and software engineering foundations required for advanced AI and machine learning applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2238\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2370\">The second semester introduces machine learning, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, and research-oriented technical learning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"3350\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2397\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2397\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2382\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2397\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"3350\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2574\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2465\" data-col-size=\"md\">Cognitive Analytics and Social Skills for Professional</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2574\">Develops analytical thinking, professional behavior, decision-making, and workplace collaboration skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2614\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Structures and Algorithm Design</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2744\">Covers efficient data organization, algorithm development, optimization techniques, and computational problem-solving methods.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2919\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2791\" data-col-size=\"md\">Machine Learning for Real World Application</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2919\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Introduces supervised and unsupervised learning models, predictive analytics, and practical machine learning implementation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"3077\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"2973\" data-col-size=\"md\">Artificial Intelligence for Real World Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3077\">Focuses on intelligent systems, AI algorithms, automation technologies, and real-world AI solutions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3227\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3114\" data-col-size=\"md\">Network Security and Cryptography</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3227\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers encryption, cybersecurity frameworks, secure communication systems, and network protection techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3350\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3251\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3350\">Develops technical research, data analysis, academic writing, and project documentation skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3376\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3526\">Students gain practical exposure to artificial intelligence models, machine learning systems, cybersecurity, and intelligent automation technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3531\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3555\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3667\">The third semester focuses on deep learning, cloud technologies, text analytics, and advanced AI applications.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"4649\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3694\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3694\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3679\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3679\" data-end=\"3694\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"4649\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3845\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Unix/Linux Programming</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3845\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Introduces Linux operating systems, shell scripting, server-side computing, and system administration concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3976\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3868\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3868\" data-end=\"3976\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers ethical practices, digital responsibility, and professional standards in the technology industry.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"4094\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"4001\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Quantitative Aptitude</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4001\" data-end=\"4094\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Develops logical reasoning, analytical thinking, and quantitative problem-solving skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4095\" data-end=\"4215\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4095\" data-end=\"4118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Seminar (Evaluation)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4215\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Enhances presentation skills, technical discussions, and research-based analytical abilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4372\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4252\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cloud Infrastructure and Services</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4252\" data-end=\"4372\">Covers cloud computing platforms, virtualization, infrastructure management, and cloud-based application deployment.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4373\" data-end=\"4507\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4373\" data-end=\"4406\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Deep Learning &amp; Neural Network</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4406\" data-end=\"4507\">Introduces neural networks, deep learning architectures, computer vision, and advanced AI models.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4649\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4540\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Social Media &amp; Text Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4540\" data-end=\"4649\">Focuses on natural language processing, text mining, sentiment analysis, and social media data analytics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"4651\" data-end=\"4675\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4676\" data-end=\"4807\">Students develop expertise in advanced AI technologies including deep learning, NLP, cloud systems, and intelligent data analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4809\" data-end=\"4812\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"4814\" data-end=\"4836\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4838\" data-end=\"4928\">The final semester focuses on industry-oriented implementation and project-based learning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4930\" data-end=\"5121\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4930\" data-end=\"4955\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4930\" data-end=\"4955\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4930\" data-end=\"4940\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4940\" data-end=\"4955\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4966\" data-end=\"5121\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4966\" data-end=\"5121\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4966\" data-end=\"4982\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4982\" data-end=\"5121\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Industry-focused project involving AI models, machine learning applications, data analytics systems, or intelligent software solutions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"5123\" data-end=\"5147\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5148\" data-end=\"5327\">The major project allows students to apply artificial intelligence, machine learning, deep learning, and cloud computing concepts to real-world business and technology challenges.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 200000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(365, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 258, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-13 01:39:53', '2026-06-17 00:14:36', '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"426\">The MBA in International Finance admission process is designed to provide a smooth, flexible, and student-friendly enrollment experience for fresh graduates, entrepreneurs, final-year students, and working professionals. The complete admission procedure can be completed online, allowing students to apply conveniently from anywhere.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"791\">This MBA specialization focuses on global finance, investment management, financial analytics, corporate finance, international business operations, taxation, auditing, and strategic financial decision-making. The admission process is structured to help students complete enrollment quickly and begin their journey toward international finance leadership careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"796\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"l036zj\" data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"846\">MBA in International Finance Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"914\">The admission process consists of five simple and organized steps.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"919\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"eeuf76\" data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"950\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1106\">The first step is selecting the MBA in International Finance program according to your academic background, career objectives, and professional interests.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"umvhuz\" data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1154\">What Students Should Review Before Applying</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1624\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1173\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Important Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1184\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1624\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1304\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1216\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Curriculum</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1304\" data-col-size=\"md\">Review international finance, investment, taxation, and financial reporting subjects</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1380\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1328\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Criteria</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1380\" data-col-size=\"md\">Verify graduation and minimum marks requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1455\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1404\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Career Opportunities</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1455\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore global finance and banking career roles</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1538\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1472\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Structure</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1538\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand semester fees, EMI options, and payment flexibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1624\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1558\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Support</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1624\">Check online classes, LMS access, and student support services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0deo8\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1656\">Why This Step is Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1869\">Choosing the right finance specialization helps students align their education with future career opportunities in global banking, financial management, fintech, consulting, and multinational business operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1874\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1viqrjy\" data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1911\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"2043\">After selecting the program, candidates must fill out the online application form with accurate personal and academic information.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jjistz\" data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2083\">Details Required During Application</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2119\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2119\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2108\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Information</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2119\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2211\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2153\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Personal Information</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2211\" data-col-size=\"md\">Full name, address, contact details, and date of birth</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2283\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2240\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2283\" data-col-size=\"md\">Graduation details and academic records</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2308\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identity Verification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2340\" data-col-size=\"md\">Government-approved ID proof</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2363\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Contact Credentials</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2400\">Active email ID and mobile number</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2424\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Supporting Documents</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2478\">Academic certificates and passport-size photograph</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nfbwt\" data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2497\">Important Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2607\">Students should carefully verify all details before submission to avoid delays during admission verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2612\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16w6tlx\" data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2645\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2741\">Once the application form is completed, candidates can proceed with secure online fee payment.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1e78k6u\" data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2771\">Available Payment Options</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"3063\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2799\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2799\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2788\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2799\" data-col-size=\"md\">Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"3063\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2864\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2833\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2864\">Simple one-time fee payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2932\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2893\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-Wise Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2932\" data-col-size=\"md\">Flexible academic payment structure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2990\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2949\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2990\" data-col-size=\"md\">Affordable monthly installment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3063\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3016\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online Payment Gateway</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3063\">Safe and secure digital transaction process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zp8axk\" data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3099\">Benefits of Online Fee Payment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3272\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a2jvc2\" data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3140\">Convenient and secure payment system</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1edyjjt\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3180\">Flexible financial planning options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gd1xij\" data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3217\">Reduced upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9nd2yp\" data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3272\">Easy fee management for students and professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3362\">Students should save fee receipts and payment confirmation details for future reference.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3367\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cfgr7l\" data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3396\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3398\" data-end=\"3498\">After fee payment, students must submit the final application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19p078\" data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3542\">Activities Included During Registration</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3544\" data-end=\"3842\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3544\" data-end=\"3578\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3544\" data-end=\"3578\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3544\" data-end=\"3567\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Process</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3578\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3842\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3655\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Application Submission</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3655\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Completion of admission process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3656\" data-end=\"3718\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3656\" data-end=\"3680\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document Verification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3718\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic and identity verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3786\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3746\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3786\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Validation of admission requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3842\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3809\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Approval</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3842\">Official admission processing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3862\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3951\">Uploading clear and valid documents helps speed up verification and enrollment approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"3956\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1tozxz\" data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"3992\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4109\">After successful verification and approval, students receive official enrollment information and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b1z5xw\" data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4130\">Students Receive</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4516\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4164\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4164\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4153\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enrollment Support</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4153\" data-end=\"4164\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4516\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4232\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4200\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Confirmation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4232\" data-col-size=\"md\">Official enrollment approval</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4233\" data-end=\"4305\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4233\" data-end=\"4261\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student Login Credentials</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4261\" data-end=\"4305\" data-col-size=\"md\">Access to LMS and online learning portal</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4373\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4326\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Guidance</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4373\" data-col-size=\"md\">Information regarding classes and schedules</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4439\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4396\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Orientation Support</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4439\">Introduction to online learning systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4516\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4464\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Study Material Access</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4516\">Digital learning resources and recorded lectures</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4596\">This step officially begins the MBA in International Finance learning journey.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4601\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hkhq9m\" data-start=\"4603\" data-end=\"4666\">Documents Required for MBA in International Finance Admission</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4757\">Students should keep the following documents ready before starting the admission process.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"5098\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4790\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4790\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4779\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Required Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4779\" data-end=\"4790\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4801\" data-end=\"5098\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4801\" data-end=\"4866\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4801\" data-end=\"4827\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Certificates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4866\">Academic qualification verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4867\" data-end=\"4912\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4867\" data-end=\"4889\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Government ID Proof</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4889\" data-end=\"4912\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identity validation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4913\" data-end=\"4973\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4913\" data-end=\"4940\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport-Size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4940\" data-end=\"4973\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student profile documentation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4974\" data-end=\"5036\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4974\" data-end=\"5001\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Email ID &amp; Mobile Number</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5001\" data-end=\"5036\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Communication and portal access</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5037\" data-end=\"5098\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5037\" data-end=\"5063\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Certificates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5063\" data-end=\"5098\">If required during verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"5100\" data-end=\"5177\">International students may additionally require AIU equivalence certificates.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"440\">The MBA in International Finance eligibility criteria are designed for students, fresh graduates, entrepreneurs, and working professionals who want to build successful careers in global finance, investment banking, financial analytics, corporate finance, fintech, wealth management, and international business operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"803\">This specialized MBA program is highly suitable for learners who want to develop expertise in international financial systems, financial reporting, investment analysis, taxation, global markets, strategic finance, and business leadership. The eligibility structure is flexible and accessible for candidates from diverse educational and professional backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1eyrujn\" data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"861\">MBA in International Finance Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"1009\">Candidates seeking admission to the MBA in International Finance program must fulfill the academic and communication requirements mentioned below.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1048\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1048\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1037\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1048\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1087\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1148\">Graduation in any discipline from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1225\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1174\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks Required</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1225\" data-col-size=\"md\">Minimum 40% marks in the qualifying examination</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1244\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Below 40% Marks</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1287\" data-col-size=\"md\">Admission test required for eligibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1397\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1315\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Candidate Types</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1397\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fresh graduates, entrepreneurs, working professionals, and final-year students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1429\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1486\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basic spoken and written English proficiency required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1613\">The program allows students from multiple academic streams to build careers in finance and international business management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1618\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ji434k\" data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1672\">Who Should Apply for MBA in International Finance?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1823\">The program is suitable for learners interested in financial management, international markets, analytics, investment systems, and business strategy.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rtq3iu\" data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1850\">Recommended Candidates</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"2382\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1867\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitable For</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1887\" data-col-size=\"md\">Career Objective</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"2382\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1992\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1951\" data-col-size=\"md\">Working Professionals in IT / Finance / Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1992\">Upgrade finance and analytical skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2069\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2009\" data-col-size=\"md\">Entrepreneurs</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2069\" data-col-size=\"md\">Build strong business and financial management expertise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2143\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2094\" data-col-size=\"md\">Engineering Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2143\" data-col-size=\"md\">Transition into finance and analytics careers</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2232\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2178\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematics Background Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2232\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop financial and quantitative analysis skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2308\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2251\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fresh Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2308\">Start careers in international finance and consulting</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2382\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2331\" data-col-size=\"md\">Final-Year Students</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2382\">Prepare for future global finance opportunities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2492\">The curriculum supports both career advancement and career transition into finance-focused leadership roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2497\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uhj2b3\" data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2532\">Eligibility for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2632\">Students with Indian educational qualifications must satisfy the following admission requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"3035\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2659\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2659\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2648\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2659\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"3035\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2732\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2690\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Degree</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2732\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mandatory from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2788\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2761\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted Academic Streams</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2788\" data-col-size=\"md\">Any discipline eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2838\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2805\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2838\">40% in qualifying examination</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2897\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2860\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Below 40% Criteria</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2897\" data-col-size=\"md\">Admission through qualifying test</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2956\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2924\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Skills</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2956\">Basic understanding required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"3035\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2985\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entrepreneurship Interest</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3035\" data-col-size=\"md\">Preferred for management and business learning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3055\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3201\">Students appearing for final-year graduation examinations are also eligible if they complete their degree before the commencement of the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3206\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g5t9g4\" data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3242\">Eligibility for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3342\">International applicants must fulfill additional academic verification requirements for admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3680\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3369\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3369\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3358\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3369\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3680\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3443\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Degree</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3400\" data-end=\"3443\">Mandatory from a recognized institution</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3524\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3475\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Proficiency</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3524\" data-col-size=\"md\">Spoken and written English knowledge required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3599\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3555\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AIU Equivalence Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3599\">Mandatory for foreign education students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3680\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3624\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Verification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3680\" data-col-size=\"md\">Foreign qualifications must satisfy Indian standards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3780\">International students should ensure all academic documents are properly verified before applying.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3782\" data-end=\"3785\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ux6rxl\" data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3814\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3923\">The program follows a flexible eligibility structure to support students from diverse academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"4119\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3968\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3968\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3948\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Performance</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"3968\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Status</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4119\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4016\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"3994\" data-col-size=\"sm\">40% or Above</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4016\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Direct eligibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4056\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4029\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Below 40%</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4029\" data-end=\"4056\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission test required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4119\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4079\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final-Year Students</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4079\" data-end=\"4119\">Eligible before program commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4121\" data-end=\"4230\">This flexible system helps deserving students continue higher education and career development opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4235\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7j9uzd\" data-start=\"4237\" data-end=\"4267\">English Language Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4269\" data-end=\"4460\">Since the program includes international finance concepts, business communication, financial reporting, and strategic management, applicants should possess basic English communication skills.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hbplit\" data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"4506\">English Skills Helpful During the Program</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4804\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4535\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4535\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4521\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Skill Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4521\" data-end=\"4535\" data-col-size=\"md\">Importance</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4804\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4617\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4571\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4617\">Professional interaction and presentations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4618\" data-end=\"4676\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4618\" data-end=\"4640\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Reporting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4640\" data-end=\"4676\">Understanding business documents</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4677\" data-end=\"4735\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4677\" data-end=\"4700\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research &amp; Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4735\" data-col-size=\"md\">Report preparation and analysis</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4804\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4762\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Communication</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4762\" data-end=\"4804\" data-col-size=\"md\">Leadership and workplace collaboration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4806\" data-end=\"4887\">Students gradually improve professional communication throughout the MBA program.</p>', '<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"420\">The MBA in International Finance fee structure is designed to provide flexible and affordable payment options for students, fresh graduates, and working professionals who want to build successful careers in global finance, investment banking, financial analytics, international business, corporate finance, and fintech industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"660\">The program offers semester-wise payment flexibility along with a 24-month zero-cost EMI facility, helping students manage educational expenses conveniently while pursuing advanced management education in the international finance domain.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"665\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fcgl4e\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"711\">MBA in International Finance Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"1083\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"749\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"749\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"729\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"738\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"1083\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"837\">\r\n<td data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"783\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"795\">₹3,29,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"837\">Total fee for the complete MBA program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"918\">\r\n<td data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"867\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Starting From</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"877\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹82,300</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"918\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexible semester-wise payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"1008\">\r\n<td data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"945\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"965\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹13,023 per month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1008\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Affordable monthly installment facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1083\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1032\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1046\">0% Interest</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1083\">No additional interest applicable</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1088\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1afz7mx\" data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1123\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1269\">The zero-cost EMI facility helps students divide the total program fee into manageable monthly installments without additional financial burden.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1499\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1296\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1296\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1285\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Feature</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1296\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1499\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1339\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1328\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly EMI Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1339\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹13,023</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1368\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1355\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1368\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1403\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1388\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1403\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0% Interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1448\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1424\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Structure</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1448\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1499\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1469\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1499\">Reduced upfront fee burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13bw1eo\" data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1529\">Benefits of Zero Cost EMI</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1740\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i0uwck\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1564\">Easy monthly payment planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2gpvw\" data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1595\">No hidden interest charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p0xwxa\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1652\">Financial flexibility for students and professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wj79mc\" data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1682\">Convenient fee management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hqa59u\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1740\">Makes international finance education more accessible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1866\">The EMI option is highly beneficial for working professionals and self-funded students seeking quality management education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1871\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1l1hhn6\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1907\">Semester-Wise Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1997\">Students who prefer flexible fee payment can choose the semester-wise payment structure.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2024\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2024\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2014\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2064\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Starting From</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2075\">₹82,300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e6bhnq\" data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2114\">Advantages of Semester Fee Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2274\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t2f7fa\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2154\">Lower immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yoknmg\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2184\">Better academic budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yml52y\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2214\">Flexible payment planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ntc6ag\" data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2274\">Suitable for salaried professionals and fresh graduates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2379\">This structure helps students manage educational expenses more comfortably during the program duration.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"579\">The MBA in International Finance syllabus is designed to provide advanced knowledge in global financial management, investment analysis, international business operations, corporate finance, taxation, auditing, strategic finance, and financial reporting. The program combines management education with specialized international finance subjects to prepare students for leadership roles in banking, multinational corporations, financial consulting, and global investment industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"1008\">This industry-oriented MBA specialization helps students develop expertise in financial decision-making, international financial systems, global investment strategies, auditing, taxation, and strategic business management. The curriculum is highly suitable for students and working professionals aiming to build careers in international finance, banking, fintech, wealth management, corporate finance, and financial consulting.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1013\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"i8u584\" data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1068\">MBA in International Finance Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1092\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1257\">The first semester focuses on management fundamentals, communication skills, economics, marketing, and business statistics required for financial leadership roles.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1284\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1284\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1269\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1284\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1332\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accounting for Managers (Exempted)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1459\">Covers managerial accounting concepts, financial statement analysis, budgeting, and financial decision-making fundamentals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1595\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1483\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1595\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Introduces marketing strategies, consumer behavior, branding, market research, and business growth planning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1630\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Managerial Economics (Exempted)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1729\">Focuses on economic principles, business decision-making, demand analysis, and market dynamics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1875\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1758\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Statistics for Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1875\">Covers statistical methods, business analytics, data interpretation, and quantitative decision-making techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1905\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Communication</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2008\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Develops professional speaking, business writing, presentation, and workplace communication skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2034\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2171\">Students build strong business management, communication, and analytical foundations essential for advanced international finance roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2176\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2200\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2339\">The second semester introduces financial management, legal business frameworks, research methods, and organizational management concepts.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"3036\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2366\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2366\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2351\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2366\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"3036\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2495\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2405\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Research Methods</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2495\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Develops research, data analysis, report writing, and business problem-solving skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2625\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2519\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2625\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers investment decisions, financial planning, capital management, and corporate finance strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2760\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2654\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2760\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Focuses on workforce planning, employee management, organizational behavior, and leadership practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2894\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2800\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspects of Business (Exempted)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2894\">Introduces business laws, regulatory frameworks, contracts, and legal compliance concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2895\" data-end=\"3036\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2895\" data-end=\"2932\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Conflict Resolution and Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"3036\">Develops negotiation, communication, problem-solving, and conflict-handling skills in organizations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3062\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3205\">Students gain understanding of financial operations, research methodologies, legal business structures, and organizational management systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3210\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3234\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3359\">The third semester focuses on strategic finance, taxation, financial reporting, international finance, and business ethics.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"4363\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3386\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3386\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3371\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3386\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"4363\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3531\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3420\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3531\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers long-term business planning, competitive strategy, leadership, and organizational growth management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3673\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3554\" data-col-size=\"md\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3673\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Explains ethical business practices, corporate governance, and professional responsibility in financial management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3778\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3690\" data-col-size=\"md\">Minor Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3778\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Provides practical exposure through industry-oriented research or business projects.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3927\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3815\" data-col-size=\"md\">Performance Management (Exempted)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3815\" data-end=\"3927\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Focuses on performance evaluation systems, organizational productivity, and employee performance strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"4050\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"3959\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Taxation (Exempted)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"4050\">Covers taxation principles, corporate tax structures, and financial compliance systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4187\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4084\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Reporting (Exempted)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4084\" data-end=\"4187\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Introduces financial statement preparation, reporting standards, and financial analysis techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4188\" data-end=\"4363\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4188\" data-end=\"4236\" data-col-size=\"md\">International Financial Management (Exempted)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4363\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers foreign exchange markets, international investments, global financial systems, and multinational finance operations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"4365\" data-end=\"4389\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4390\" data-end=\"4511\">Students develop expertise in global financial management, taxation, strategic planning, and financial reporting systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4516\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4540\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4668\">The final semester focuses on strategic reporting, auditing, digital business practices, and project-based practical learning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4670\" data-end=\"5425\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4670\" data-end=\"4695\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4670\" data-end=\"4695\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4670\" data-end=\"4680\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4680\" data-end=\"4695\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4706\" data-end=\"5425\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4706\" data-end=\"4867\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4706\" data-end=\"4767\" data-col-size=\"md\">Management in Action &ndash; Social, Economic and Ethical Issues</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4767\" data-end=\"4867\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers social responsibility, ethical business practices, and economic challenges in management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4868\" data-end=\"5016\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4868\" data-end=\"4884\" data-col-size=\"md\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4884\" data-end=\"5016\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Industry-oriented project focused on finance, investment analysis, international business, or financial strategy implementation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5017\" data-end=\"5154\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5017\" data-end=\"5037\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5037\" data-end=\"5154\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Introduces online marketing strategies, digital branding, customer engagement, and business promotion techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5155\" data-end=\"5279\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5155\" data-end=\"5186\" data-col-size=\"md\">Audit &amp; Assurance (Exempted)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5186\" data-end=\"5279\">Covers auditing standards, risk assessment, compliance systems, and assurance frameworks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5280\" data-end=\"5425\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5280\" data-end=\"5326\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strategic Business Reporting (Non-Exempted)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5326\" data-end=\"5425\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Focuses on advanced financial reporting, strategic analysis, and corporate reporting standards.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"5427\" data-end=\"5451\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5452\" data-end=\"5577\">Students gain practical experience in financial reporting, auditing, strategic analysis, and business project implementation.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 329000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(366, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 307, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-13 01:58:18', '2026-06-17 00:14:52', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"478\">The M.Com in FinTech eligibility criteria are designed for students and graduates who want to build careers in financial technology, digital banking, blockchain, cryptocurrency, investment analytics, financial management, and fintech innovation. The program is suitable for learners seeking advanced commerce education combined with modern financial technology expertise.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"784\">This industry-oriented postgraduate program helps students develop strong knowledge in digital finance systems, financial analytics, blockchain technology, AI-driven finance, and modern financial operations. The eligibility structure is flexible and accessible for both Indian and international students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"789\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yhis3q\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"830\">M.Com in FinTech Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"966\">Candidates seeking admission to the M.Com in FinTech program must fulfill the academic and communication requirements mentioned below.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"994\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1005\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1044\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1094\" data-col-size=\"md\">Graduation Degree from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1163\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1122\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Degree Duration Accepted</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1163\" data-col-size=\"md\">3-year or 4-year degree programs only</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1185\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diploma Acceptance</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1228\" data-col-size=\"md\">Diploma qualifications are not accepted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1299\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1256\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Candidate Types</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1299\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fresh graduates and final-year students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1331\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1388\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basic spoken and written English proficiency required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1542\">The program is designed to support students who want to build careers in finance, fintech, analytics, digital banking, and financial technology sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1i5oxyp\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1589\">Who Should Apply for M.Com in FinTech?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1725\">The program is suitable for students interested in commerce, finance, investment systems, digital banking, and financial technologies.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rtq3iu\" data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1752\">Recommended Candidates</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"2269\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1789\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1789\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1769\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suitable For</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1789\" data-col-size=\"md\">Career Objective</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"2269\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1866\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1818\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fresh Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1866\">Build careers in fintech and digital finance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1941\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1889\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final-Year Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1941\" data-col-size=\"md\">Prepare for future-focused finance opportunities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2013\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1962\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Commerce Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2013\" data-col-size=\"md\">Gain expertise in modern financial technologies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2085\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2034\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Finance Aspirants</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2085\">Develop skills in analytics and fintech systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2169\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2110\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Banking Professionals</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2169\" data-col-size=\"md\">Upgrade digital finance and financial technology skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2269\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2202\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business &amp; Analytics Learners</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2269\">Explore AI-driven financial systems and investment technologies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2358\">The program combines traditional commerce knowledge with advanced fintech applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2363\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hduzhj\" data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2413\">Eligibility for Students with Indian Education</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2501\">Indian students applying for M.Com in FinTech must fulfill the following requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2881\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2528\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2528\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2517\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2528\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2881\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2601\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2559\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Degree</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2601\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mandatory from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2664\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2629\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted Degree Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2664\" data-col-size=\"md\">3-year or 4-year degree program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2719\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2689\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diploma Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2719\" data-col-size=\"md\">Not accepted for admission</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2802\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2742\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Proficiency</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2802\" data-col-size=\"md\">Applicants must possess sufficient English understanding</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2881\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Stream</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2881\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students from multiple educational backgrounds can apply</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2901\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"3056\">Students appearing for final-year graduation examinations are also eligible if they complete their degree before the commencement of the academic session.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3061\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"soimpo\" data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3112\">Eligibility for Students with Foreign Education</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3196\">International students must satisfy additional academic verification requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3607\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3223\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3223\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3212\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3223\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3607\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3297\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3254\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3254\" data-end=\"3297\">Mandatory from a recognized institution</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3378\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3324\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted Qualifications</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3378\" data-col-size=\"md\">Equivalent to degrees accepted for Indian students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3461\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3410\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Communication Skills</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3461\" data-col-size=\"md\">Spoken and written English proficiency required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3538\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3492\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AIU Equivalence Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3538\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mandatory for foreign education applicants</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3607\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3563\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Verification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3563\" data-end=\"3607\">Required for admission approval in India</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3708\">International students should ensure all academic documents are properly verified before admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3713\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7j9uzd\" data-start=\"3715\" data-end=\"3745\">English Language Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3954\">Since the program includes fintech systems, financial analytics, business communication, digital finance technologies, and research-based learning, students should possess basic English communication skills.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hbplit\" data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"4000\">English Skills Helpful During the Program</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4327\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4029\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4029\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4015\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Skill Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4029\" data-col-size=\"md\">Importance</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4327\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4111\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4065\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4065\" data-end=\"4111\">Professional interaction and presentations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4112\" data-end=\"4183\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4112\" data-end=\"4134\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Reporting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4183\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understanding financial documents and reports</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4251\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4207\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research &amp; Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4207\" data-end=\"4251\">Data interpretation and academic writing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4252\" data-end=\"4327\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4252\" data-end=\"4278\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Communication</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4278\" data-end=\"4327\" data-col-size=\"md\">Workplace collaboration and leadership growth</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4414\">The program gradually develops professional communication and presentation abilities.</p>', '<p data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"404\">The M.Com in FinTech fee structure is designed to provide affordable and flexible payment options for students, commerce graduates, finance professionals, and working individuals who want to build careers in financial technology, digital banking, blockchain, investment technology, financial analytics, and fintech innovation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"618\">The program offers semester-wise payment flexibility along with a 24-month zero-cost EMI facility, making advanced commerce and fintech education more accessible for learners from different financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"623\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17fscvf\" data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"657\">M.Com in FinTech Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"695\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"695\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"675\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"684\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"695\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"793\">\r\n<td data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"729\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"741\">₹1,50,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"793\">Total fee for the complete M.Com FinTech program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"874\">\r\n<td data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"823\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Starting From</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"833\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹37,500</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"874\" data-col-size=\"md\">Flexible semester-wise payment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"963\">\r\n<td data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"901\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"920\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹5,938 per month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"963\" data-col-size=\"md\">Affordable monthly installment facility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\n<td data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"987\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1001\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0% Interest</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1038\">No additional interest applicable</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1afz7mx\" data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1078\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Details</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1209\">The zero-cost EMI option helps students divide the total fee into smaller monthly payments without additional financial pressure.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1444\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1236\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1236\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1225\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Feature</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1236\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1444\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1268\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly EMI Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1278\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹5,938</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1294\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1307\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1342\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1327\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1342\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0% Interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1363\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Structure</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1387\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1444\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1408\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1444\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reduced upfront financial burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13bw1eo\" data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1474\">Benefits of Zero Cost EMI</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1687\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kle4sq\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1511\">Easy monthly payment management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2gpvw\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1542\">No hidden interest charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p0xwxa\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1599\">Financial flexibility for students and professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1compxs\" data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1643\">Affordable higher education opportunity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ipxk3m\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1687\">Better budgeting and financial planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1784\">This EMI structure is especially beneficial for working professionals and self-funded students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1789\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1l1hhn6\" data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1825\">Semester-Wise Fee Payment Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1924\">Students who prefer paying fees semester-wise can choose the flexible academic payment structure.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"2002\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1951\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1951\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1941\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1951\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2002\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2002\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1991\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee Starting From</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2002\">₹37,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e6bhnq\" data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2041\">Advantages of Semester Fee Payment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2210\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"133abd\" data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2079\">Lower immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kwoqiw\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2119\">Easier education expense management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sioogy\" data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2168\">Flexible budgeting for students and families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmbzvr\" data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2210\">Convenient for salaried professionals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2299\">Semester-wise payment helps students continue education without major financial stress.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"537\">The M.Com in FinTech syllabus is designed to combine advanced commerce education with modern financial technology concepts such as blockchain, cryptocurrency, digital payments, financial analytics, AI-driven finance, investment technology, risk management, and fintech regulations. The curriculum prepares students for rapidly growing careers in digital finance, banking technology, investment management, financial consulting, and fintech innovation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"913\">This industry-focused postgraduate program helps students develop expertise in modern financial systems, data-driven decision-making, digital currencies, financial engineering, treasury management, and AI-powered financial technologies. The syllabus combines theoretical knowledge with practical fintech applications to build strong professional and analytical capabilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"918\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"461utt\" data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"961\">M.Com in FinTech Semester Wise Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cadmad\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"985\">Semester 1 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1109\">The first semester builds strong foundations in finance, accounting, management economics, and professional communication.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1866\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1136\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1136\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1121\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1136\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1866\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1308\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1179\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Financial Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1308\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers advanced accounting principles, corporate financial statements, accounting standards, and financial reporting systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1451\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1332\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Managerial Economics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1451\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Introduces economic theories, business decision-making, market analysis, and strategic financial planning concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1591\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1475\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1591\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Focuses on capital management, investment planning, corporate finance, and financial decision-making techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Statistics for Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1730\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers statistical analysis, data interpretation, business forecasting, and quantitative management tools.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1866\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1760\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Communication</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1866\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Develops business communication, presentation, professional writing, and workplace interaction skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1892\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"2024\">Students develop strong accounting, financial management, analytical, and communication skills required for modern fintech careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2029\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ows2ly\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2053\">Semester 2 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2181\">The second semester focuses on risk management, financial engineering, research methods, analytics, and investment management.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2940\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2208\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2208\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2193\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2208\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2940\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2237\" data-col-size=\"md\">Risk Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2340\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Covers financial risk identification, assessment, mitigation strategies, and compliance frameworks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2477\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2369\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Research Methods</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2477\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Introduces research techniques, business data analysis, report preparation, and problem-solving methods.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2640\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2535\" data-col-size=\"md\">Cognitive Analytics and Social Skills for Professional</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2640\">Develops analytical thinking, professional behavior, teamwork, and workplace communication abilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2804\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2686\" data-col-size=\"md\">Security Analysis and Portfolio Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2804\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Focuses on investment analysis, portfolio construction, stock market evaluation, and wealth management strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2940\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2829\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Engineering</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2829\" data-end=\"2940\">Covers financial modeling, derivative instruments, quantitative finance, and modern financial technologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2966\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"3089\">Students gain practical understanding of investments, risk analysis, financial modeling, and business research techniques.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3094\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1og8l3r\" data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3118\">Semester 3 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3266\">The third semester introduces blockchain, digital currencies, fintech regulations, financial analytics, and data-driven financial decision-making.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"4324\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3293\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3293\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3278\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3293\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"4324\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3489\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3375\" data-col-size=\"md\">Cryptocurrency and Blockchain: An Introduction to Digital Currencies</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3489\">Covers blockchain technology, cryptocurrency systems, decentralized finance, and digital financial ecosystems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3650\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3544\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data-Driven Decision Making and Generating Insights</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3544\" data-end=\"3650\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Focuses on financial data interpretation, business analytics, and strategic decision-making processes.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3651\" data-end=\"3783\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3651\" data-end=\"3670\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Currency</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3783\">Introduces central bank digital currencies, electronic payment systems, and digital financial infrastructure.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3784\" data-end=\"3930\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3784\" data-end=\"3826\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Reporting and Decision Making</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3930\">Covers advanced financial reporting, business analysis, and strategic financial planning techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"4075\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"3977\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fintech: Overview, Payments, and Regulation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"4075\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Explains fintech ecosystems, payment technologies, digital banking, and financial regulations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4201\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4092\" data-col-size=\"md\">Minor Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4201\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Industry-oriented practical project related to fintech, finance, analytics, or digital financial systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4324\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4224\" data-col-size=\"md\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4324\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Develops ethical business behavior, financial transparency, and responsible corporate practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4350\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4351\" data-end=\"4477\">Students build expertise in blockchain, cryptocurrency, fintech regulations, digital finance systems, and financial analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4479\" data-end=\"4482\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v20fsg\" data-start=\"4484\" data-end=\"4506\">Semester 4 Subjects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4645\">The final semester focuses on AI applications, treasury management, crowdfunding systems, fintech innovation, and advanced data modeling.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"5385\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4672\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4672\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4657\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4657\" data-end=\"4672\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4683\" data-end=\"5385\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4683\" data-end=\"4837\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4683\" data-end=\"4742\" data-col-size=\"md\">Application of AI, Insurtech, and Real Estate Technology</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4742\" data-end=\"4837\">Covers AI applications in finance, insurance technology, and real estate financial systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4838\" data-end=\"4970\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4838\" data-end=\"4855\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Modelling</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4970\">Introduces financial data structures, predictive modeling, and analytical frameworks for business intelligence.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4971\" data-end=\"5094\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4971\" data-end=\"4986\" data-col-size=\"md\">Dissertation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4986\" data-end=\"5094\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Research-based academic project focused on fintech, digital finance, or financial technology innovation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5095\" data-end=\"5257\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5095\" data-end=\"5141\" data-col-size=\"md\">Lending, Crowdfunding, and Modern Investing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5141\" data-end=\"5257\">Covers alternative financing systems, peer-to-peer lending, crowdfunding platforms, and investment technologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5258\" data-end=\"5385\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5258\" data-end=\"5280\" data-col-size=\"md\">Treasury Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5280\" data-end=\"5385\">Focuses on corporate cash management, liquidity planning, financial operations, and treasury systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coxc8f\" data-start=\"5387\" data-end=\"5411\">Key Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5412\" data-end=\"5542\">Students gain practical exposure to AI-driven finance, alternative investments, treasury operations, and advanced fintech systems.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 150000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(367, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 308, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-13 07:56:19', '2026-06-17 00:15:12', '<p data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"348\">The admission process for BCA Data Analytics is designed to be simple, student-friendly, and fully streamlined for quick enrollment. Students can complete the entire process by submitting basic academic details, selecting their preferred program, and completing fee payment and registration formalities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"491\">The step-by-step admission system helps students avoid unnecessary confusion during application and ensures a smoother enrollment experience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"496\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tpg9a9\" data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"545\">BCA Data Analytics Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"583\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"583\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"554\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"572\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"583\" data-col-size=\"md\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n<td data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"607\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"629\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Select Your Program</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"692\" data-col-size=\"md\">Choose the BCA Data Analytics program based on career goals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"781\">\r\n<td data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"702\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Complete Your Application</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"781\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fill in personal, academic, and contact details</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"877\">\r\n<td data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"791\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"810\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Pay Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"877\" data-col-size=\"md\">Securely complete fee payment through available payment options</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"961\">\r\n<td data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"887\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"907\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit &amp; Register</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"961\" data-col-size=\"md\">Submit final application and complete registration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<td data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"971\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"998\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Await Enrollment Details</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1055\" data-col-size=\"md\">Receive enrollment confirmation and academic guidance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1m69hdl\" data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1113\">Step-by-Step BCA Data Analytics Admission Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f67ya9\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1145\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1304\">Students must first choose the BCA Data Analytics program according to their career interests in technology, analytics, software, and data-driven industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1352\">Before selecting the program, students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1526\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tc460r\" data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1384\">Review the syllabus carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16fxqec\" data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1418\">Compare specialization benefits</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sui72p\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1452\">Understand career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"izwv73\" data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1485\">Check eligibility requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"caqg4a\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1526\">Evaluate fee structure and EMI options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1650\">Choosing the correct specialization is important because it directly impacts future career pathways and skill development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1655\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"chdhb1\" data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1693\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1801\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the application form with the required information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1838\">Details generally required include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1961\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18iy9j0\" data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1861\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1887\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b09bze\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1905\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ygyz8u\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1934\">Identification information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ritf3d\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1961\">Educational certificates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2088\">Students should carefully verify all details before submission because incorrect information may delay the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2093\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zz7wxy\" data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2127\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2236\">Once the application is completed, students must pay the program fee through the available payment methods.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2266\">Payment options may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2359\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tar46f\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2285\">Full fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1khgit5\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2309\">Semester-wise payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"avrho0\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2333\">Zero Cost EMI options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18a65ee\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2359\">Online payment gateways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2384\">Students should always:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2506\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkysqk\" data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2408\">Save payment receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wtj3vz\" data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2436\">Verify transaction status</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ylwsx\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2465\">Review EMI terms carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rmvrqy\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2506\">Check refund and cancellation policies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2584\">Financial planning before payment helps avoid future academic interruptions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2589\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2xelpe\" data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2619\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2736\">After successful payment, students can submit the final application and complete the official registration process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2752\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2871\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wub1tw\" data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2777\">Documents are verified</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uus8uo\" data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2805\">Registration is confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rnbbp6\" data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2841\">Student enrollment process begins</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105gr6k\" data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2871\">Academic profile is created</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2975\">Students should ensure that all required documents are uploaded correctly to avoid delays in approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"2980\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vw8oac\" data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3017\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3122\">After successful registration, students receive enrollment-related communication and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3155\">Enrollment details may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3284\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r16p5m\" data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3183\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nyka5o\" data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3208\">Learning portal access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fxj6ky\" data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3234\">Orientation information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pwegko\" data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3254\">Academic schedule</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"huhm4k\" data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3284\">Course commencement details</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3286\" data-end=\"3383\">Students should regularly check their registered email and contact details for important updates.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3388\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hchuex\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3433\">Documents Commonly Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3811\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3457\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3457\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3446\" data-col-size=\"md\">Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3457\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3811\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3516\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3491\" data-col-size=\"md\">Class 10 Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3491\" data-end=\"3516\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3568\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3540\" data-col-size=\"md\">Class 12 Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3568\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility confirmation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3610\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3586\" data-col-size=\"md\">Identity Proof</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3662\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3638\" data-col-size=\"md\">Passport Size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3662\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3713\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3679\" data-col-size=\"md\">Address Proof</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3679\" data-end=\"3713\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Communication and verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3811\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3767\" data-col-size=\"md\">AIU Equivalence Certificate (for foreign students)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3767\" data-end=\"3811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International qualification verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"398\">The BCA in Data Analytics program is designed for students and professionals who want to build strong careers in the IT, software, analytics, and technology sectors. The eligibility criteria focus on ensuring that students have the basic academic foundation required to understand programming, databases, analytics, and modern computing technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"635\">This program is suitable for fresh Class 12 pass students, final-year learners, and working professionals who wish to upgrade their technical knowledge and explore career opportunities in the rapidly growing data and software industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"640\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1xtll1q\" data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"683\">BCA Data Analytics Eligibility Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"724\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"724\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"709\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"724\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"796\">\r\n<td data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"759\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"796\" data-col-size=\"md\">10+2 / Senior Secondary Education</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"887\">\r\n<td data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"817\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"887\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fresh graduates, appearing for Class 12, and working professionals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"956\">\r\n<td data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"906\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted Boards</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"956\" data-col-size=\"md\">Recognized Indian and foreign education boards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1012\">\r\n<td data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"976\" data-col-size=\"sm\">NIOS Eligibility</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1012\" data-col-size=\"md\">NIOS board students are eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1054\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diploma Acceptance (Foreign Education)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1109\" data-col-size=\"md\">Diploma not acceptable in place of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1142\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foreign Education Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1218\" data-col-size=\"md\">Certificate of Equivalence from Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1755\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1860\">Students applying through the Indian education system must fulfill the following academic requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"2206\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1876\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1887\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"2206\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1979\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1929\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Secondary School Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1979\" data-col-size=\"md\">Completion of Class 10 from a recognized board</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2061\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2011\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Senior Secondary Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2061\" data-col-size=\"md\">Completion of Class 12 from a recognized board</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2146\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2083\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Appearing Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2146\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations can also apply</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2206\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2163\" data-col-size=\"sm\">NIOS Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2206\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidates from NIOS board are eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vy4wqc\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2246\">Important Note for Indian Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2428\">Students from any stream including Science, Commerce, or Arts may generally apply, making the program accessible to a wide range of learners interested in technology and analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2433\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1mkn12l\" data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2488\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Education Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2602\">International students or candidates with foreign education qualifications must meet the following requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2965\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2629\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2629\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2618\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2629\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2965\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2717\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2671\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Secondary School Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2717\" data-col-size=\"md\">Completion of 10 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2795\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Senior Secondary Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2795\" data-col-size=\"md\">Completion of 12 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2884\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2817\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diploma Acceptance</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2884\" data-col-size=\"md\">Diplomas are not accepted as equivalent schooling qualification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2885\" data-end=\"2965\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2885\" data-end=\"2915\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AIU Equivalence Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2965\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mandatory for admission in Indian universities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5osz5m\" data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"2998\">AIU Equivalence Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3275\">Students with foreign qualifications must obtain a Certificate of Equivalence from the Association of Indian Universities (AIU). This certificate verifies that the student&rsquo;s international education is equivalent to Indian academic standards required for university admission.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"317\">The BCA Data Analytics program offers flexible payment options for students, including semester-wise payments and Zero Cost EMI facilities. This helps students manage their education expenses more comfortably while pursuing a career-focused degree in analytics and technology.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gsakd2\" data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"345\">BCA Data Analytics Fees</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"675\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"391\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"391\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"363\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"372\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"391\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"675\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"475\">\r\n<td data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"425\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"437\">₹2,50,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"475\">Total fee for the complete program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"534\">\r\n<td data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"491\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"509\">₹41,700 onwards</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"534\">Payable semester-wise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"620\">\r\n<td data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"561\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"576\">₹9,896/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"620\">Interest-free monthly installment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"675\">\r\n<td data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Interest</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"641\">₹0</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"675\">No additional interest charges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fovlc9\" data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"699\">Fee Payment Options</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"919\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"727\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"727\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"716\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"727\" data-col-size=\"md\">Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"919\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<td data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"757\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"797\">One-time payment for complete course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"856\">\r\n<td data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"822\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-Wise Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"856\">Lower upfront financial burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"919\">\r\n<td data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"873\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"919\">Easy monthly installments without interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"tqsd5o\" data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"940\">Important Points</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1183\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"regldb\" data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"991\">Flexible payment options available for students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"26jmv3\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1049\">Zero Cost EMI helps reduce immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"84ax1c\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1106\">Semester fee structure allows easier budget management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mafej2\" data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1183\">Students should verify additional charges, if applicable, before admission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1r8frcv\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1214\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1552\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1227\" data-col-size=\"md\">Question</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1237\" data-col-size=\"md\">Answer</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1552\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1309\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1296\" data-col-size=\"md\">What is the total fee for BCA Data Analytics?</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1309\">₹2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1363\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1338\" data-col-size=\"md\">What is the semester fee?</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1363\">Starting from ₹41,700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1429\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1384\" data-col-size=\"md\">Is EMI available?</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1429\">Yes, 24 Months Zero Cost EMI is available</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1484\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1464\" data-col-size=\"md\">What is the monthly EMI amount?</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1484\">₹9,896 per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1552\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1513\" data-col-size=\"md\">Is the EMI interest-free?</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1552\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Yes, it is completely interest free</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"398\">The BCA in Data Analytics program is designed to help students build strong technical, analytical, and problem-solving skills required in the modern IT and data-driven industry. The curriculum gradually moves from programming fundamentals and computer applications to advanced subjects like data mining, artificial intelligence, big data, and data visualization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"665\">This program focuses on practical learning, analytical thinking, database management, cloud technologies, and business-oriented data interpretation, helping students prepare for careers in Data Analytics, IT, Software Development, and Business Intelligence domains.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1l9cnd7\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"705\">BCA Data Analytics Course Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"935\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"726\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"737\" data-col-size=\"md\">3 Years</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"935\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"781\">\r\n<td data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"766\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"781\" data-col-size=\"md\">6 Semesters</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"814\">\r\n<td data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Level</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"814\" data-col-size=\"md\">Undergraduate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<td data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"828\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"885\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Analytics, Programming, Databases, AI &amp; Big Data</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"935\">\r\n<td data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"902\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Mode</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"935\" data-col-size=\"md\">Theory + Practical + Projects</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"940\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qcmkis\" data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"985\">Semester-Wise BCA Data Analytics Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9m\" data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1000\">Semester 1</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1151\">The first semester builds the foundation of computing, communication, mathematics, and programming concepts required for advanced analytics learning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1179\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1179\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1164\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1179\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1280\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1214\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Basic Mathematics &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1280\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers mathematical concepts used in programming and analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1369\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1306\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1369\" data-col-size=\"md\">Improves professional communication and presentation skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1464\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1408\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer and Information Technology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1464\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to computer systems and IT fundamentals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1551\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1494\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Computer Interaction</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1551\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understanding user interaction and interface concepts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1571\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Programming in C</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1641\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basics of programming logic, coding structure, and problem-solving</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3mjpbb\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1674\">Semester 1 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1787\">Students develop fundamental programming skills and basic technical understanding required for future semesters.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9l\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1807\">Semester 2</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1910\">The second semester introduces system-level computing concepts and software development fundamentals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"2410\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1938\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1938\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1923\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1938\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"2410\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"2040\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1975\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Structures Using C</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2040\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning algorithms, arrays, stacks, queues, and linked lists</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2131\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2065\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Environmental Studies</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2131\" data-col-size=\"md\">Awareness of sustainability and environmental responsibilities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2215\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2175\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2215\" data-col-size=\"md\">Personality and teamwork development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2310\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2244\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operating System Concepts</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2310\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basics of memory, processes, scheduling, and system management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2410\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2347\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Software Engineering and Modeling</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2410\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to software development lifecycle and modeling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"go7f2c\" data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2443\">Semester 2 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2556\">Students gain deeper knowledge of software architecture, structured programming, and computer system operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2561\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9k\" data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2576\">Semester 3</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2670\">This semester focuses on databases, networking, statistics, and object-oriented programming.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"3181\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2698\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2698\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2683\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2698\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"3181\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2816\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2755\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to Database Management Systems</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2816\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning SQL, databases, normalization, and data handling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2909\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2844\" data-col-size=\"md\">Computational Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2909\" data-col-size=\"md\">Statistical methods used in analytics and data interpretation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2992\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2928\" data-col-size=\"md\">Green Computing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2992\" data-col-size=\"md\">Sustainable computing practices and energy-efficient systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3067\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3010\" data-col-size=\"md\">Network Basics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3067\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to computer networking and communication</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3181\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3109\" data-col-size=\"md\">Object Oriented Programming Using Java</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3181\" data-col-size=\"md\">Concepts of classes, inheritance, polymorphism, and Java programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nbvp9h\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3214\">Semester 3 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3335\">Students start developing analytical thinking and database management capabilities essential for data analytics careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3340\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9r\" data-start=\"3342\" data-end=\"3355\">Semester 4</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3441\">The fourth semester introduces analytics-focused technologies and programming tools.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3934\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3469\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3469\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3454\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3469\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3934\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3568\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3526\" data-col-size=\"md\">Unix Operating System and Shell Programming</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3568\" data-col-size=\"md\">Linux and shell scripting fundamentals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3652\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3590\" data-col-size=\"md\">Python Programming</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3652\" data-col-size=\"md\">Python coding for analytics, automation, and data handling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3748\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3681\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Analysis using Excel</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3681\" data-end=\"3748\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data reporting, formulas, dashboards, and spreadsheet analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3842\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3775\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Mining &amp; Warehouse</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3775\" data-end=\"3842\" data-col-size=\"md\">Concepts of data extraction, warehousing, and mining techniques</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3934\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3887\" data-col-size=\"md\">Usability Design for Software Application</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3934\" data-col-size=\"md\">User-friendly application design principles</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"czj1ky\" data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"3967\">Semester 4 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3968\" data-end=\"4087\">Students begin practical exposure to analytics tools, data processing, and reporting systems widely used in industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4089\" data-end=\"4092\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9q\" data-start=\"4094\" data-end=\"4107\">Semester 5</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4109\" data-end=\"4196\">This semester focuses on advanced analytics, visualization, and professional practices.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4717\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4224\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4224\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4209\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4224\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4235\" data-end=\"4717\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4235\" data-end=\"4351\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4235\" data-end=\"4277\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Artificial Intelligence</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4277\" data-end=\"4351\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basics of AI concepts, machine learning logic, and intelligent systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4445\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4380\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fundamentals of Ecommerce</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4380\" data-end=\"4445\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understanding digital business and online transaction systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4446\" data-end=\"4516\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4446\" data-end=\"4468\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4468\" data-end=\"4516\" data-col-size=\"md\">Ethical practices in technology and business</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4517\" data-end=\"4616\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4517\" data-end=\"4546\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Analytics &amp; Reporting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4616\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data interpretation, reporting strategies, and analytical insights</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4617\" data-end=\"4717\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4617\" data-end=\"4650\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Modelling &amp; Visualization</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4650\" data-end=\"4717\" data-col-size=\"md\">Creating dashboards, charts, and business visualization reports</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jn7bs3\" data-start=\"4719\" data-end=\"4750\">Semester 5 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4751\" data-end=\"4862\">Students gain industry-oriented analytical skills required for business intelligence and decision-making roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4864\" data-end=\"4867\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9p\" data-start=\"4869\" data-end=\"4882\">Semester 6</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4884\" data-end=\"4986\">The final semester focuses on project implementation, innovation, and advanced technology integration.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4988\" data-end=\"5350\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4988\" data-end=\"5014\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4988\" data-end=\"5014\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4988\" data-end=\"4999\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4999\" data-end=\"5014\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5025\" data-end=\"5350\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5025\" data-end=\"5109\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5025\" data-end=\"5041\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5041\" data-end=\"5109\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industry-oriented practical project based on real-world problems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5110\" data-end=\"5190\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5110\" data-end=\"5130\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Big Data on Cloud</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5130\" data-end=\"5190\" data-col-size=\"md\">Cloud computing and large-scale data processing concepts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5191\" data-end=\"5266\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5191\" data-end=\"5209\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Design Thinking</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5209\" data-end=\"5266\" data-col-size=\"md\">Creative problem-solving and innovation methodologies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5267\" data-end=\"5350\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5267\" data-end=\"5293\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Intelligent Game Design</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5293\" data-end=\"5350\" data-col-size=\"md\">AI-based gaming logic and intelligent system concepts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wov1j4\" data-start=\"5352\" data-end=\"5383\">Semester 6 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5384\" data-end=\"5521\">Students apply theoretical learning into practical projects and gain exposure to emerging technologies like cloud computing and big data.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 250000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
