er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(368, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 277, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-13 08:14:39', '2026-06-17 00:15:29', '<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"346\">The admission process for B.Com International Finance is designed to provide students with a smooth and simple enrollment experience. The process allows students to apply online, submit academic details, complete fee payment, and receive enrollment guidance without unnecessary complications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"519\">This step-by-step admission system helps students complete their registration efficiently while ensuring all academic and verification requirements are properly fulfilled.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"524\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1x1n5eg\" data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"582\">B.Com International Finance Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"620\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"620\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"591\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"609\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"620\" data-col-size=\"md\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"738\">\r\n<td data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"644\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"666\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Select Your Program</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"738\" data-col-size=\"md\">Choose the B.Com International Finance program based on career goals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"827\">\r\n<td data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"748\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"776\">Complete Your Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"827\">Fill in academic, personal, and contact details</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"911\">\r\n<td data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"837\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"856\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Pay Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"911\">Complete fee payment through secure payment methods</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"995\">\r\n<td data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"921\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"941\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit &amp; Register</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"995\">Submit final application and complete registration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<td data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1005\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1032\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Await Enrollment Details</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1089\">Receive enrollment confirmation and academic guidance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q8ttpc\" data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1156\">Step-by-Step B.Com International Finance Admission Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f67ya9\" data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1188\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1366\">Students must first choose the B.Com International Finance program according to their interest in finance, accounting, banking, taxation, and international business management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1413\">Before selecting the course, students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ik7yi5\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1444\">Review the complete syllabus</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sui72p\" data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1478\">Understand career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yeknv\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1512\">Compare finance specializations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8u2vfi\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1546\">Verify eligibility requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"29lexn\" data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1585\">Review fee structure and EMI options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1722\">Choosing the correct specialization is important because it directly impacts future career pathways in finance and commerce industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1727\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"chdhb1\" data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1765\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1873\">After selecting the program, students need to fill out the application form with all required information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1915\">The application form generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"2038\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t7bwlu\" data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1934\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1960\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1982\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n73vj9\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2014\">Identity verification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vmvxo3\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2038\">Educational documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2161\">Students should carefully check all information before submission because incorrect details may delay admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2166\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zz7wxy\" data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2200\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2321\">Once the application form is completed, students must pay the required program fee using the available payment methods.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2351\">Payment options may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2451\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tar46f\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2370\">Full fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"syk7bz\" data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2398\">Semester-wise fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wh8q8z\" data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2425\">Zero Cost EMI facilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18a65ee\" data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2451\">Online payment gateways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2476\">Students should always:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2607\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkysqk\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2500\">Save payment receipts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3axipg\" data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2533\">Verify successful transactions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kflpvz\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2566\">Understand EMI terms carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rmvrqy\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2607\">Check refund and cancellation policies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2690\">Proper financial planning before payment helps avoid future academic disruptions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2695\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2xelpe\" data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2725\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2848\">After successful fee payment, students can submit their final application and complete the official registration process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2864\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2990\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lxzdoh\" data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2898\">Academic documents are verified</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"seyxux\" data-start=\"2899\" data-end=\"2926\">Registration is processed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5fox6l\" data-start=\"2927\" data-end=\"2958\">Enrollment profile is created</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wffjkq\" data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2990\">Admission confirmation begins</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3093\">Students should ensure all required documents are uploaded correctly to avoid delays in verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3098\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vw8oac\" data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3135\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3249\">After registration approval, students receive enrollment information and academic guidance from the institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3288\">Enrollment communication may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3428\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r16p5m\" data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3316\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nyka5o\" data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3341\">Learning portal access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q9xsyw\" data-start=\"3342\" data-end=\"3365\">Orientation schedules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4b5gt9\" data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3393\">Academic calendar details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjwcx9\" data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3428\">Course commencement instructions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3430\" data-end=\"3527\">Students should regularly check their registered email and contact details for important updates.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3532\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hchuex\" data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"3577\">Documents Commonly Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3959\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3601\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3601\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3590\" data-col-size=\"md\">Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3601\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3959\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3662\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3637\" data-col-size=\"md\">10th Class Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3637\" data-end=\"3662\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3716\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3688\" data-col-size=\"md\">12th Class Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3688\" data-end=\"3716\">Eligibility confirmation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3758\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3734\" data-col-size=\"md\">Identity Proof</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3758\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3810\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3786\" data-col-size=\"md\">Passport Size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3810\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"3861\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"3827\" data-col-size=\"md\">Address Proof</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3861\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Communication and verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3959\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3915\" data-col-size=\"md\">AIU Equivalence Certificate (for foreign students)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3959\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International qualification verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"444\">The B.Com International Finance program is designed for students who want to build careers in global finance, accounting, banking, taxation, auditing, and international business management. The eligibility criteria ensure that students have the required academic background and communication skills needed to understand commerce, finance, and international financial systems effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"631\">The program is suitable for fresh Class 12 students, appearing students, and learners interested in developing strong financial and analytical knowledge for global career opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"636\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"18efefr\" data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"688\">B.Com International Finance Eligibility Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"1241\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"729\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"729\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"714\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"729\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"1241\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"801\">\r\n<td data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"764\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"801\" data-col-size=\"md\">10+2 / Senior Secondary Education</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"873\">\r\n<td data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"825\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"873\">Basic understanding of English communication</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<td data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"894\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Students</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"964\">Fresh students, appearing for Class 12, and international students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<td data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"983\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted Boards</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1033\">Recognized Indian and foreign education boards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1053\" data-col-size=\"sm\">NIOS Eligibility</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1089\">NIOS board students are eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1111\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diploma Acceptance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1168\">Diplomas are not accepted as equivalent qualification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1241\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1201\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foreign Education Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1241\">AIU Equivalence Certificate required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1el2hda\" data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1278\">General Eligibility Criteria</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1503\">Applicants must possess sufficient knowledge and understanding of the English language and communication because the program includes subjects related to finance, accounting, international business, and corporate reporting.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1653\">Students whose first language is not English must have completed at least the last three years of their academic education under the English medium.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1687\">This requirement helps students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1889\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ti3838\" data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1727\">Understand finance terminology easily</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kcza6d\" data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1779\">Participate in business communication effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ofglv7\" data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1837\">Improve corporate and professional communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sdyzwg\" data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1889\">Handle international finance concepts confidently</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1894\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"15lt9v8\" data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1953\">Eligibility Criteria for Students with Indian Education</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"2046\">Students applying through the Indian education system must meet the following requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2416\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2073\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2073\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2062\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2073\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2416\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2179\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10th Class Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2179\">Completion of 10 years of formal schooling from a recognized board</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2275\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2205\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12th Class Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2275\">Completion of 12 years of formal schooling from a recognized board</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2355\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2297\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Appearing Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2355\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations can apply</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2416\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2375\" data-col-size=\"sm\">NIOS Eligibility</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2416\">Students from NIOS board are eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vy4wqc\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2456\">Important Note for Indian Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2723\">Students from Commerce, Science, or Arts streams may generally apply if they fulfill the academic eligibility requirements. However, students with an interest in finance, accounting, and business management may find the program more aligned with their career goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2728\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"71mqrz\" data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2788\">Eligibility Criteria for Students with Foreign Education</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2894\">International students and applicants with foreign qualifications must satisfy the following conditions.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"3251\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2910\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2921\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"3251\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"3000\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2954\" data-col-size=\"sm\">O Level Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"3000\">Completion of 10 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3069\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3023\" data-col-size=\"sm\">A Level Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3069\">Completion of 12 years of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3149\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diploma Acceptance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3149\">Diplomas are not accepted in place of formal schooling</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3251\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3168\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AIU Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3251\">Certificate of Equivalence from Association of Indian Universities is mandatory</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3256\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13t5khb\" data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3299\">AIU Equivalence Certificate Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3587\">Students with foreign education qualifications must obtain a Certificate of Equivalence from the Association of Indian Universities (AIU). This certificate confirms that the foreign qualification is equivalent to the Indian education system standards required for university admissions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3695\">Without AIU equivalence approval, admission processing may remain incomplete for international applicants.</p>', '<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"418\">The B.Com in International Finance program is designed for students who want to build careers in global finance, banking, accounting, investment management, financial analysis, and international business operations. Understanding the complete fee structure is important before admission because it helps students and parents plan their educational investment properly.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"595\">The program offers flexible payment options including semester-wise fee payment and Zero Cost EMI facilities, making higher education more financially accessible for students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"600\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"44648a\" data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"645\">B.Com International Finance Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"683\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"683\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"663\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"672\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"683\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"795\">\r\n<td data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"717\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"729\">₹2,75,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"795\">Total fee for the complete B.Com International Finance program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"846\">\r\n<td data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹45,900</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"846\">Payable semester-wise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n<td data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"873\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"890\">₹10,885/month*</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"934\">Interest-free monthly installment option</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\n<td data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"958\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Interest Charges</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"963\">₹0</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1004\">No additional interest under EMI plan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1009\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1yaeap6\" data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1032\">Fee Payment Options</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1257\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1061\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1061\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1049\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Mode</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1061\" data-col-size=\"md\">Benefits</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1257\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1127\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1127\">Complete course fee paid at once</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1152\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-Wise Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1188\">Lower immediate financial burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1257\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1205\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1257\">Easy monthly installments without extra interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1a2ntq5\" data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1879\">Semester-Wise Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"2033\">The semester fee is ₹45,900, allowing students to divide the total academic cost into manageable payments instead of paying the complete amount upfront.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2061\">This option is useful for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2221\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"179o46t\" data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2087\">Fresh Class 12 students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qb480m\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2133\">Families planning yearly education expenses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xh6oet\" data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2175\">Students managing self-funded education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y4jfmj\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2221\">Learners comparing commerce specializations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2311\">Semester-based payment provides better financial flexibility during the course duration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2316\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ovxciw\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2343\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2492\">Students can also choose the 24 Months Zero Cost EMI option, where the monthly installment starts from ₹10,885 without additional interest charges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fxs65l\" data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2520\">Benefits of EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2647\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vatc0\" data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2549\">Reduced financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13nq44m\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2574\">Easy monthly budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bxrj32\" data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2599\">No extra interest cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1guvsqv\" data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2647\">Better affordability for students and parents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2693\">Before choosing EMI, students should review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2799\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1et9iud\" data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2718\">Eligibility conditions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lau2te\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2741\">Banking requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pci6cf\" data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2762\">Auto-debit process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1myflbc\" data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2799\">Penalty rules for delayed payments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"495\">The B.Com in International Finance program is designed to provide students with strong knowledge of accounting, taxation, corporate finance, auditing, international financial systems, and global business management. The curriculum combines commerce fundamentals with advanced international finance concepts, helping students prepare for careers in banking, financial consulting, taxation, investment management, and multinational business operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"856\">The course gradually develops students&rsquo; understanding from basic accounting and business mathematics to strategic financial management, international reporting standards, and corporate governance. The syllabus also includes industry-oriented subjects that help students gain practical financial and analytical skills required in modern global finance sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"861\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13uqjd3\" data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"908\">B.Com International Finance Course Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"943\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"943\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"928\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"943\" data-col-size=\"md\">Information</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<td data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"968\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Name</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"999\" data-col-size=\"md\">B.Com International Finance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1029\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1018\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1029\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1063\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1048\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1063\">6 Semesters</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1079\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Level</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1096\">Undergraduate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1111\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Areas</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1191\">Accounting, Taxation, International Finance, Auditing &amp; Corporate Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Structure</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1246\" data-col-size=\"md\">Theory + Practical + Projects</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8swi3h\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1305\">Semester-Wise B.Com International Finance Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9m\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1320\">Semester 1</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1485\">The first semester focuses on building the foundation of accounting, business communication, legal studies, and mathematical concepts used in commerce and finance.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1978\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1513\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1513\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1498\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1513\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1978\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1624\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1549\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Mathematics I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1624\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basic mathematical concepts used in business and financial calculations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1724\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1653\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Environmental Studies &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1724\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to environmental awareness and sustainability concepts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1829\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1752\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Accounting &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1829\">Fundamentals of accounting principles and financial statement preparation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1889\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1847\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mercantile Law</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1889\">Basics of commercial and business laws</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1978\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1915\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1978\">Professional communication and corporate interaction skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3mjpbb\" data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2011\">Semester 1 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2136\">Students develop foundational commerce knowledge and basic analytical understanding required for advanced financial studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2141\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9l\" data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2156\">Semester 2</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2269\">This semester introduces corporate law, macroeconomics, marketing concepts, and advanced accounting principles.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2297\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2297\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2282\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2297\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2334\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Mathematics II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2393\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced business calculation and financial mathematics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2422\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Accounting &ndash; II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2478\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced accounting concepts and financial reporting</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2565\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2511\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fundamentals of Corporate Law</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2565\">Corporate legal structure and business regulations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2650\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2584\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Macro Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2650\">Understanding economic systems and national financial policies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2677\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Principles of Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2739\">Introduction to marketing concepts and business strategies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"go7f2c\" data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2772\">Semester 2 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2879\">Students gain knowledge of financial systems, economic environments, and corporate operational structures.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2884\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9k\" data-start=\"2886\" data-end=\"2899\">Semester 3</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"2994\">The third semester focuses on taxation, accounting management, statistics, and cost analysis.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3446\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3022\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3022\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3007\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3022\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3446\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3120\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3060\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Accounting &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3120\">Corporate financial statements and accounting procedures</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3198\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3139\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cost Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3198\">Cost analysis and managerial decision-making techniques</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3280\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3216\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Direct Tax &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3280\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to direct taxation systems and tax calculations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3355\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3303\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3355\" data-col-size=\"md\">Statistical methods used in commerce and finance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3446\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3399\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Individual Excellence and Social Dynamic</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3446\">Personality development and teamwork skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nbvp9h\" data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3479\">Semester 3 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3573\">Students develop analytical and taxation skills important for finance and accounting careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3578\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9r\" data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3593\">Semester 4</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"3696\">This semester focuses on auditing, taxation, performance management, and advanced accounting systems.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"4066\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3724\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3724\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3709\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3724\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"4066\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3821\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3763\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Accounting &ndash; II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3763\" data-end=\"3821\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced corporate accounting and reporting techniques</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3892\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3840\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Direct Tax &ndash; II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3840\" data-end=\"3892\">Advanced direct taxation concepts and compliance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3981\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3913\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Audit &amp; Assurance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"3981\">Auditing principles, assurance standards, and compliance systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3982\" data-end=\"4066\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3982\" data-end=\"4007\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Performance Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4066\">Measuring and improving business performance efficiency</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"czj1ky\" data-start=\"4068\" data-end=\"4099\">Semester 4 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4221\">Students gain deeper understanding of financial auditing, corporate compliance, and organizational financial performance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4223\" data-end=\"4226\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9q\" data-start=\"4228\" data-end=\"4241\">Semester 5</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4327\">The fifth semester introduces strategic finance and international financial systems.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4821\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4355\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4355\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4340\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4355\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4821\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4463\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4405\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fundamentals of Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4405\" data-end=\"4463\">Financial planning, budgeting, and investment concepts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4545\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4486\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4486\" data-end=\"4545\">Ethical practices in finance and corporate environments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4628\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4578\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Business Leadership</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4628\">Leadership and strategic management principles</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4629\" data-end=\"4732\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4629\" data-end=\"4666\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4732\">Global financial operations and international business finance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4733\" data-end=\"4821\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4733\" data-end=\"4769\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Financial Reporting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4769\" data-end=\"4821\">International accounting and reporting standards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jn7bs3\" data-start=\"4823\" data-end=\"4854\">Semester 5 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4953\">Students gain exposure to international finance operations and strategic business decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4955\" data-end=\"4958\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9p\" data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"4973\">Semester 6</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4975\" data-end=\"5096\">The final semester focuses on strategic reporting, corporate governance, taxation planning, and practical implementation.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5098\" data-end=\"5450\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5098\" data-end=\"5124\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5098\" data-end=\"5124\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5098\" data-end=\"5109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5109\" data-end=\"5124\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5135\" data-end=\"5450\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5135\" data-end=\"5223\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5135\" data-end=\"5169\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ethics and Corporate Governance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5169\" data-end=\"5223\">Corporate responsibility and governance frameworks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5224\" data-end=\"5287\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5224\" data-end=\"5240\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5240\" data-end=\"5287\">Practical industry-oriented finance project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5364\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5313\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Tax Planning</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5313\" data-end=\"5364\" data-col-size=\"md\">Tax management and corporate financial planning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5365\" data-end=\"5450\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5365\" data-end=\"5396\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Business Reporting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5396\" data-end=\"5450\">Advanced business reporting and financial analysis</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wov1j4\" data-start=\"5452\" data-end=\"5483\">Semester 6 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5484\" data-end=\"5605\">Students apply financial concepts through projects and develop professional-level business reporting and taxation skills.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(369, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 228, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 00:35:42', '2026-06-17 00:15:49', '<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"377\">The admission process for MBA in Digital Marketing is designed to be simple, structured, and student-friendly so that applicants can complete their enrollment without confusion. The process focuses on easy program selection, smooth application submission, secure fee payment, and final registration with proper academic guidance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"513\">This step-by-step admission system ensures transparency and helps students track their application from selection to final enrollment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"518\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1eezatz\" data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"570\">MBA Digital Marketing Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"1032\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"608\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"608\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"579\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"597\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"608\" data-col-size=\"md\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"1032\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"708\">\r\n<td data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"632\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"654\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Select Your Program</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"708\" data-col-size=\"md\">Choose MBA Digital Marketing based on career goals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"787\">\r\n<td data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"718\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"746\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Complete Your Application</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"787\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fill in personal and academic details</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"869\">\r\n<td data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"816\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Pay Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"869\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete secure payment through available options</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"949\">\r\n<td data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"879\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"899\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit &amp; Register</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"949\" data-col-size=\"md\">Finalize application and complete registration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1032\">\r\n<td data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"959\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"986\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Await Enrollment Details</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1032\" data-col-size=\"md\">Receive confirmation and academic guidance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"lfzd3j\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1093\">Step-by-Step MBA Digital Marketing Admission Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f67ya9\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1125\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1309\">Students begin the admission process by selecting the MBA in Digital Marketing program according to their interest in marketing, branding, analytics, and digital business strategies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1357\">Before selecting the program, students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1597\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tbvuaz\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1414\">Understand the syllabus and specialization structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qodtom\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1460\">Compare it with other MBA specializations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"soc40m\" data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1513\">Review career opportunities in digital marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xymo5r\" data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1554\">Check eligibility criteria carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12wvau2\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1597\">Evaluate fee structure and EMI options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1730\">Choosing the right program is important because it directly influences long-term career growth in marketing and digital industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1735\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"chdhb1\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1773\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1892\">After selecting the program, students must fill out the application form with accurate personal and academic details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1937\">The application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7orss\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1962\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1993\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl7yi2\" data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2013\">Contact details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19bce1z\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2039\">Identity verification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9keg54\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2071\">Supporting documents upload</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2207\">Students should carefully review all details before submission, as incorrect information may delay admission approval or verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2212\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zz7wxy\" data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2246\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2359\">Once the application form is completed, students need to proceed with fee payment using secure payment methods.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2399\">Available payment options may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2520\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6e4qb7\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2428\">Full program fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ys9h9b\" data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2458\">Semester-wise fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jii7zs\" data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2492\">24-month Zero Cost EMI option</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1spo5sm\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2520\">Online payment gateways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2545\">Students should ensure:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2709\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k6h1n9\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2581\">Payment receipt is saved safely</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vr8jph\" data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2618\">EMI terms are clearly understood</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jo8zva\" data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2659\">Transaction confirmation is received</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15c6woh\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2709\">Refund and cancellation policies are reviewed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2809\">Proper financial planning helps students manage their education smoothly without financial stress.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2814\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2xelpe\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2844\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2953\">After successful fee payment, students must submit their application and complete the registration process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2969\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"3095\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gxphym\" data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"2997\">Application is verified</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v9marp\" data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3023\">Documents are checked</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18wy2hw\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3064\">Registration is officially confirmed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18w1ks0\" data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3095\">Student profile is created</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3201\">Students should ensure that all documents are uploaded correctly to avoid delays in enrollment approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3206\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vw8oac\" data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3243\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3365\">Once registration is completed, students receive enrollment confirmation and academic instructions from the institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3367\" data-end=\"3398\">Enrollment details may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3534\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3428\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f8do07\" data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3457\">Learning platform access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u8tzjv\" data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3482\">Orientation schedule</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qhkgm7\" data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3504\">Academic calendar</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g1kpq6\" data-start=\"3505\" data-end=\"3534\">Course start instructions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3633\">Students should regularly check their email and registered contact details for important updates.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3638\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxi2kh\" data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3674\">Documents Required for Admission</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"4023\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3698\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3698\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3687\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3698\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"4023\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3762\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3734\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3762\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3763\" data-end=\"3807\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3763\" data-end=\"3777\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mark Sheets</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"3807\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic performance proof</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3851\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3825\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identity Proof</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3825\" data-end=\"3851\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Student identification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3852\" data-end=\"3908\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3852\" data-end=\"3879\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport Size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3879\" data-end=\"3908\">Registration requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"3955\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"3925\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Address Proof</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3955\">Communication verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"4023\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"3995\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entrance Test Result (if applicable)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"4023\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility confirmation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"441\">The MBA in Digital Marketing is a professional postgraduate program designed for graduates and working professionals who want to build careers in digital marketing, branding, performance advertising, entrepreneurship, and digital business strategy. The eligibility criteria ensure that students have a basic academic foundation and interest in business, marketing, and digital technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"617\">This program is suitable for marketers, entrepreneurs, product managers, and professionals who want to upgrade their skills and grow in the rapidly expanding digital economy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"622\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"61scbc\" data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"668\">MBA Digital Marketing Eligibility Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"1176\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"709\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"709\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"694\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"709\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"1176\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n<td data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"744\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"776\" data-col-size=\"md\">Graduation in any discipline</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"844\">\r\n<td data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"802\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks Required</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"844\" data-col-size=\"md\">40% in the last qualifying examination</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<td data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"863\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Below 40% Marks</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"905\" data-col-size=\"md\">Entrance test required for eligibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<td data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"928\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Candidates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"971\" data-col-size=\"md\">Graduates, professionals, entrepreneurs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<td data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"995\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1043\">Basic understanding of English communication</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1103\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1063\" data-col-size=\"sm\">NIOS Eligibility</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1103\" data-col-size=\"md\">Not applicable (graduation required)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1176\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1136\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foreign Education Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1176\">AIU Equivalence Certificate required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1181\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"uzm7ju\" data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1225\">Who Can Apply for MBA Digital Marketing?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1291\">The program is suitable for a wide range of learners, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"urrkxc\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1359\">Marketers and brand managers aiming to enter digital marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6a561c\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1433\">Business managers and product owners expanding into digital platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r2sf81\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1490\">Entrepreneurs promoting products and services online</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6tbcw3\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1559\">Working professionals seeking career growth in digital marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mwma3n\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1641\">Graduates interested in building careers in digital and performance marketing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1759\">This makes the program highly flexible and industry-oriented for both fresh graduates and experienced professionals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1764\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1808\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1904\">Students applying under Indian education qualifications must fulfill the following conditions:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"2243\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1931\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1931\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1920\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1931\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2243\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2023\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1962\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Degree</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2023\" data-col-size=\"md\">Must have completed a bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2092\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2040\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2092\">At least 40% in the final qualifying examination</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2165\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2114\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Below 40% Criteria</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2165\">Students must clear an entrance test to qualify</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2243\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2188\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Proficiency</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2243\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basic understanding of English language is required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vy4wqc\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2283\">Important Note for Indian Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2506\">Students from any academic background such as commerce, arts, or science can apply. However, an interest in marketing, business strategy, and digital platforms is highly beneficial for better understanding of the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2511\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1mkn12l\" data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2566\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Education Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2670\">International applicants or students with foreign qualifications must meet the following requirements:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2959\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2697\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2697\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2686\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2697\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2959\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2776\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2728\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Degree</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2776\" data-col-size=\"md\">Completion of a recognized bachelor&rsquo;s degree</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2857\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2804\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Equivalent Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2857\">Must be equivalent to Indian graduation standards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2959\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2876\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AIU Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2959\">Certificate of Equivalence from Association of Indian Universities is mandatory</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5osz5m\" data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2992\">AIU Equivalence Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3205\">Foreign education students must obtain an AIU Equivalence Certificate to verify that their degree is valid and equivalent to Indian university standards. Without this certificate, admission may not be processed.</p>', '<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"464\">The MBA in Digital Marketing is a professional postgraduate program designed for students who want to build strong careers in online marketing, brand strategy, social media management, performance marketing, SEO, and digital business growth. Before choosing this program, understanding the complete fee structure is important because it helps students plan their education investment in a structured and stress-free way.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"712\">This program offers flexible payment options such as semester-wise fees and 24-month Zero Cost EMI, making it easier for students and working professionals to manage their finances while pursuing higher education in a high-demand marketing field.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"717\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1xyl6dh\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"756\">MBA Digital Marketing Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"794\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"794\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"774\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"783\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"794\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"896\">\r\n<td data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"828\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"840\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"896\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total fee for complete MBA Digital Marketing program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"946\">\r\n<td data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"912\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"922\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹56,300</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"946\" data-col-size=\"md\">Payable per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"1034\">\r\n<td data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"973\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"988\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹8,906/month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1034\" data-col-size=\"md\">Monthly installment option (interest-free)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1050\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Interest</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1055\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹0</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1089\" data-col-size=\"md\">No additional interest charges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"p08ig7\" data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1138\">Understanding MBA Digital Marketing Fees</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1r0zrl0\" data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1159\">Full Program Fee</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1380\">The total fee for the MBA Digital Marketing program is ₹2,25,000. This fee generally includes academic learning, digital marketing modules, online resources, assignments, examinations, and specialization-based training.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1467\">Students should always verify whether the fee includes additional components such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qex11m\" data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1491\">Examination charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t3aqv3\" data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1517\">Certification support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"miry2m\" data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1545\">Project evaluation fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"utoobq\" data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1571\">Internship assistance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ftgx4\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1602\">Placement training modules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1710\">Understanding the complete cost structure helps students avoid hidden expenses during the course duration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1715\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ibdn2w\" data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1742\">Semester Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1935\">The semester fee for the MBA Digital Marketing program is ₹56,300, which allows students to pay the course fee in smaller, manageable installments instead of paying the entire amount at once.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1965\">This option is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2146\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16sgn9i\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2008\">Working professionals upgrading skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1brmx4x\" data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2054\">Students managing self-financed education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19bddr7\" data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2101\">Learners planning budget-friendly payments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2q1q9q\" data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2146\">Candidates comparing MBA specializations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2247\">Semester-wise payment provides better financial flexibility and reduces upfront financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2252\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4l4rmz\" data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2287\">24 Months Zero Cost EMI Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2425\">Students can also choose the 24-month Zero Cost EMI plan, where the monthly installment starts from ₹8,906 without any interest charges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10v02qm\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2457\">Key Benefits of EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rhp65o\" data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2496\">No interest burden (Zero Cost EMI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f87mbw\" data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2531\">Easy monthly payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d9k5jl\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2574\">Reduced financial pressure on families</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"myjj6u\" data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2623\">Better affordability for MBA-level education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jkcofo\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2668\">Smooth financial planning during studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2708\">Students should still carefully check:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2838\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ivdogn\" data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2737\">EMI eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h1jn7p\" data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2768\">Bank approval requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r8wmha\" data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2795\">Auto-debit setup rules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vgm2z4\" data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2838\">Late payment penalties (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"429\">The MBA in Digital Marketing is a modern, industry-focused postgraduate program designed to equip students with advanced marketing, analytics, branding, and digital strategy skills. The syllabus is structured to develop a strong foundation in management concepts in the initial semesters, followed by specialized digital marketing subjects, analytics tools, and real-world project exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"621\">This program prepares students for high-demand roles in digital marketing, performance advertising, social media strategy, brand management, and marketing analytics across global industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"626\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"p4hs72\" data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"668\">MBA Digital Marketing Course Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"959\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"703\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"703\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"688\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"703\" data-col-size=\"md\">Information</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"959\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"753\">\r\n<td data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"728\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Name</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"753\">MBA Digital Marketing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"783\">\r\n<td data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"772\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"783\" data-col-size=\"md\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"817\">\r\n<td data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"802\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"817\" data-col-size=\"md\">4 Semesters</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"892\">\r\n<td data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"838\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Approach</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"892\">Management + Digital Skills + Analytics + Projects</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"959\">\r\n<td data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"907\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Areas</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"959\" data-col-size=\"md\">Marketing, Branding, Analytics, Digital Strategy</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1pdsxjm\" data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1012\">Semester-Wise MBA Digital Marketing Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9m\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1027\">Semester 1</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1181\">The first semester focuses on building core management foundations, analytical thinking, and communication skills required for business decision-making.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1209\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1209\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1194\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1209\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1309\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1243\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Managerial Economics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1309\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understanding economic principles for business decision-making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1338\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Statistics for Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1400\">Statistical tools for business analysis and interpretation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1489\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1430\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1489\">Business communication and corporate interaction skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1516\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accounting for Managers</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1580\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial accounting concepts for managerial decision-making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1604\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1660\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basics of marketing strategies and consumer behavior</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3mjpbb\" data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1693\">Semester 1 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1829\">Students develop strong management fundamentals and analytical thinking required for advanced marketing and business strategy subjects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1834\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9l\" data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1849\">Semester 2</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1967\">The second semester introduces business laws, finance, HR management, and research-based decision-making techniques.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2423\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1995\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1995\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1980\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"1995\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2423\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2082\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2034\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspects of Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2082\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business laws and corporate legal frameworks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2163\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2111\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Research Methods</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2163\">Research techniques for business decision-making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2243\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2187\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2243\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial planning, budgeting, and investment basics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2324\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2272\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2324\">Workforce management and organizational behavior</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2423\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2362\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Conflict Resolution and Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2423\">Techniques to handle workplace conflicts and negotiations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"go7f2c\" data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2456\">Semester 2 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2565\">Students gain a deeper understanding of business operations, financial systems, and organizational behavior.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2570\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9k\" data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2585\">Semester 3</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2716\">The third semester focuses on digital marketing specialization, analytics, branding, and performance-driven marketing strategies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"3359\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2729\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2744\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"3359\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2838\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2784\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Digital Customer Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2838\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understanding customer behavior using digital data</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2944\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2879\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Digital Journey with Brand Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2944\" data-col-size=\"md\">Building and managing brand presence across digital platforms</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"3025\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2969\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Performance Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3025\">Paid advertising strategies and ROI-driven campaigns</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3122\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3066\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Social Media and Technology Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3122\">Marketing through social platforms and digital tools</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3202\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3146\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3202\" data-col-size=\"md\">Long-term business planning and strategy development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3280\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3225\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3225\" data-end=\"3280\" data-col-size=\"md\">Ethical practices in business and digital marketing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3359\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3297\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minor Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3359\">Practical project based on marketing or analytics concepts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nbvp9h\" data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3392\">Semester 3 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3514\">Students begin working on real digital marketing concepts including branding, analytics, and performance-based campaigns.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3516\" data-end=\"3519\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9r\" data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3534\">Semester 4</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3672\">The final semester focuses on advanced digital commerce, marketing analytics, business transformation, and major project implementation.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"4200\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3700\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3700\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3685\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3700\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"4200\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3821\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3760\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Commerce &ndash; Reinventing Business Models</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3760\" data-end=\"3821\">E-commerce strategies and digital business transformation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3906\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3842\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3906\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced digital marketing strategies and campaign execution</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"4016\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3957\" data-col-size=\"md\">Marketing Analytics &ndash; Data Tools and Techniques</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"4016\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data-driven marketing analysis and performance tracking</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4126\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4078\" data-col-size=\"md\">Management in Action &ndash; Social, Economic and Ethical Issues</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4126\">Understanding real-world business challenges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4200\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4143\" data-col-size=\"md\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4143\" data-end=\"4200\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industry-based practical project in digital marketing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"czj1ky\" data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4233\">Semester 4 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4363\">Students apply all learned concepts into real-world digital marketing strategies, campaigns, and analytics-based decision-making.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 225000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(370, 74, '0d71ea76-3650-4d93-a77f-88e5faf8f8f1', '27c98e1c-78e1-4df6-9ccb-915d4fc5c535', 245, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 00:46:41', '2026-06-17 00:16:02', '<p data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"348\">The admission process for MBA General Management is designed to provide students with a smooth, structured, and hassle-free enrollment experience. The process allows applicants to complete program selection, application submission, fee payment, and registration through a simple step-by-step system.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"531\">This streamlined admission structure helps fresh graduates, working professionals, and entrepreneurs apply easily while ensuring proper academic verification and enrollment support.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"536\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1nhomp8\" data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"589\">MBA General Management Admission Process Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"627\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"627\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"598\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"616\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"627\" data-col-size=\"md\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<td data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"651\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"673\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Select Your Program</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"732\">Choose MBA General Management according to career goals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n<td data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"742\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Complete Your Application</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"821\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fill in academic, personal, and contact details</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"903\">\r\n<td data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"831\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"850\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Pay Program Fees</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"903\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete secure payment through available options</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"983\">\r\n<td data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"913\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"933\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Submit &amp; Register</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"983\">Finalize application and complete registration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<td data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"993\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Step 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1020\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Await Enrollment Details</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1077\">Receive enrollment confirmation and academic guidance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1082\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1qwjino\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1139\">Step-by-Step MBA General Management Admission Process</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1f67ya9\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1171\">Step 1: Select Your Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1353\">Students must first select the MBA General Management program based on their career interests in leadership, operations, marketing, finance, business strategy, or management roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1400\">Before choosing the program, students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e6levb\" data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1445\">Review the syllabus and course structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cq1szk\" data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1484\">Compare management specializations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4nqkx\" data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1520\">Understand career opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"39hoxt\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1552\">Verify eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11xkahz\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1592\">Check fee structure and EMI options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1719\">Selecting the right MBA specialization is important because it influences long-term career growth and industry opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1724\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"chdhb1\" data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1762\">Step 2: Complete Your Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1888\">After selecting the program, students need to complete the application form with accurate academic and personal information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1933\">The application process generally requires:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2077\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsuaa\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1954\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itkbd9\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1985\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17w11ok\" data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2009\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a19gx1\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2043\">Identity verification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rckef2\" data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2077\">Supporting academic documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2201\">Students should carefully verify all information before submission because incorrect details may delay admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2206\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zz7wxy\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2240\">Step 3: Pay Your Program Fees</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2356\">Once the application form is completed, students must pay the required program fee through secure payment methods.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2396\">Available payment options may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2506\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2yxayw\" data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2421\">One-time fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rj4yp9\" data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2444\">Annual fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ys9h9b\" data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2474\">Semester-wise fee payment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qvx3iu\" data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2506\">24-month no-cost EMI option</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2524\">Students should:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2688\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10l154o\" data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2557\">Save payment receipts safely</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rvg8fg\" data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2593\">Review EMI conditions carefully</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"109q8mg\" data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2640\">Verify successful transaction confirmation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2vouw\" data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2688\">Understand refund and cancellation policies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2773\">Proper financial planning helps students manage their MBA journey more effectively.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2778\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2xelpe\" data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2808\">Step 4: Submit &amp; Register</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2927\">After successful payment, students can submit their final application and complete the official registration process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2943\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3079\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v6ghz8\" data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"2970\">Documents are verified</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6s0rk\" data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3008\">Student registration is processed</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i7fvrw\" data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3040\">Academic profile is created</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rjigno\" data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3079\">Enrollment approval process begins</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3186\">Students should ensure that all required documents are uploaded properly to avoid delays in verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3188\" data-end=\"3191\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vw8oac\" data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3228\">Step 5: Await Enrollment Details</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3337\">Once registration is successfully completed, students receive enrollment information and academic guidance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3376\">Enrollment details generally include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3516\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0tzdm\" data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3406\">Student login credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j50tbg\" data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3433\">Learning portal access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u8tzjv\" data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3458\">Orientation schedule</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qhkgm7\" data-start=\"3459\" data-end=\"3480\">Academic calendar</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s73nl6\" data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3516\">Course commencement information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3631\">Students should regularly check their registered email and mobile number for important updates and communication.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3636\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1su95my\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3695\">Documents Required for MBA General Management Admission</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"4069\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3719\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3719\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3719\" data-col-size=\"md\">Purpose</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"4069\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3783\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3755\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3783\">Eligibility verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3784\" data-end=\"3839\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3784\" data-end=\"3809\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Mark Sheets</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3839\" data-col-size=\"md\">Academic performance proof</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3840\" data-end=\"3881\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3840\" data-end=\"3857\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identity Proof</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3881\">Student verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"3933\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"3909\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Passport Size Photograph</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"3933\">Registration process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3934\" data-end=\"3980\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3934\" data-end=\"3950\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Address Proof</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3980\">Communication verification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3981\" data-end=\"4069\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3981\" data-end=\"4021\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Test Result (if applicable)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4069\">Eligibility confirmation for below 40% marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"449\">The MBA in General Management program is designed for graduates, working professionals, and entrepreneurs who want to build strong leadership, business management, and strategic decision-making skills. The eligibility criteria are structured to ensure that students possess the academic foundation and communication abilities required to understand modern business management concepts effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"629\">This program is suitable for learners who want to build careers in management, finance, marketing, operations, sales, logistics, and corporate leadership roles across industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"634\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gocig3\" data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"681\">MBA General Management Eligibility Overview</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"1180\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"722\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"722\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"707\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"722\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"1180\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"789\">\r\n<td data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"757\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"789\">Graduation in any discipline</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"842\">\r\n<td data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"815\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks Required</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"842\" data-col-size=\"md\">40% marks in graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"891\">\r\n<td data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"864\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Below 40% Criteria</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"891\" data-col-size=\"md\">Admission test required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<td data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"914\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Candidates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"971\">Fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1027\">\r\n<td data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"995\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Language Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1027\">English proficiency required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1106\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1054\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted Qualifications</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1106\">Indian and foreign recognized university degrees</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1180\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1139\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foreign Education Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1180\">AIU Equivalence Certificate mandatory</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1185\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1d6h28x\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1230\">Who Can Apply for MBA General Management?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1257\">The program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1565\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rqau5a\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1304\">Fresh graduates seeking management careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ggxkf0\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1355\">Working professionals aiming for career growth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rg0yz5\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1415\">Entrepreneurs managing business operations and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kr2427\" data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1474\">Aspirants interested in leadership and corporate roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10xx8h\" data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1565\">Professionals planning careers in finance, marketing, sales, logistics, and operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1704\">The course is highly suitable for students who want broad management knowledge instead of limiting themselves to a single specialization.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"93j0ik\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1753\">Eligibility Criteria for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1846\">Students applying through the Indian education system must meet the following requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"2142\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1873\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1873\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1862\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1873\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"2142\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1943\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1904\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Degree</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1943\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1996\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1960\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1996\" data-col-size=\"md\">At least 40% marks in graduation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2058\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2015\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Below 40% Marks</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2058\" data-col-size=\"md\">Admission test required for eligibility</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2142\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2081\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English Proficiency</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2142\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basic understanding and communication in English required</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vy4wqc\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2182\">Important Note for Indian Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2335\">Students from Commerce, Science, Arts, Engineering, or other academic backgrounds can apply if they meet the graduation and communication requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2456\">The program focuses on business management fundamentals, so prior management experience is not mandatory for admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2461\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"hdt213\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2506\">Eligibility Criteria for Foreign Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2614\">International applicants and students with foreign qualifications must satisfy the following requirements.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2641\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2641\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2630\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2641\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2718\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2679\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Graduation Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2718\">Degree from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2798\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2742\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Equivalence</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2798\">Qualification must match Indian university standards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2817\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AIU Certificate</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2866\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mandatory Certificate of Equivalence from AIU</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"458\">The MBA in General Management is a versatile postgraduate program designed for students who want to build careers in leadership, business administration, operations, human resource management, marketing, and corporate strategy. Before enrolling, understanding the complete fee structure is essential because it helps students plan their academic investment effectively and choose the most suitable payment option.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"664\">This program offers multiple payment modes such as one-time payment, annual fee plan, semester-wise fee structure, and 24-month no-cost EMI, making it flexible for both students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"669\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pw9nq6\" data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"709\">MBA General Management Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"755\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"755\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"727\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"736\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"755\" data-col-size=\"md\">Payment Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"867\">\r\n<td data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"789\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"801\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"867\" data-col-size=\"md\">Standard total fee for complete MBA General Management program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"967\">\r\n<td data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"887\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Time Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"899\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,07,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"967\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discounted upfront payment option (Self Pay Benefits applicable)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1034\">\r\n<td data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"981\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"993\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,06,880</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1034\">Payable yearly with self-pay benefits</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1084\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1050\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1060\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹56,300</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1084\" data-col-size=\"md\">Payable per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">24 Months No-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1124\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹8,906/month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1168\" data-col-size=\"md\">Monthly installment option (0% interest)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"6w95b0\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1218\">Understanding MBA General Management Fees</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1r0zrl0\" data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1239\">Full Program Fee</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1496\">The total fee for the MBA General Management program is ₹2,25,000. This fee generally covers academic learning, business management subjects, case studies, assessments, and specialization-based modules designed to develop leadership and managerial skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1547\">Students should confirm whether the fee includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1704\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qex11m\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1571\">Examination charges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"miry2m\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1599\">Project evaluation fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14f4r2n\" data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1622\">Internship support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yp9m3r\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1663\">Certification and academic resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2mlbz8\" data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1704\">Placement assistance (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1810\">Understanding the full cost structure helps avoid unexpected financial burdens later during the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1815\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jdosw0\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1843\">One-Time Payment Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"2016\">Students who prefer paying the complete fee at once can opt for the one-time payment option of ₹2,07,000, which provides cost savings compared to the standard program fee.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vyi0sv\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2035\">Key Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2165\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1npb90g\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2068\">Reduced total payable amount</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wyrm8y\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2100\">No recurring payment stress</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bquo5t\" data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2130\">Simplified fee management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rej9hw\" data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2165\">Faster enrollment confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2263\">This option is ideal for students or parents who want to complete financial commitments upfront.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2268\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c6p32n\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2293\">Annual Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2449\">The annual fee for MBA General Management is ₹1,06,880, which allows students to pay the course fee year-wise instead of paying the full amount in one go.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21za6q\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2482\">Benefits of Annual Payment:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2593\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"akrylx\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2512\">Easier financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wuay3n\" data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2537\">Reduced upfront cost</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pii3m\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2567\">Flexible payment schedule</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zlrj96\" data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2593\">Better budget control</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2669\">This option is suitable for students who prefer yearly financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2674\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ibdn2w\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2701\">Semester Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2830\">The semester fee is ₹56,300, allowing students to distribute their academic payments across semesters for better affordability.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pb8wvq\" data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2849\">Suitable For:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2958\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11bz7gk\" data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2869\">Fresh graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vq5dn3\" data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2896\">Self-financed students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2922\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l104ex\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2958\">Students comparing MBA programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"3051\">Semester-wise payment ensures smoother financial management throughout the course duration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3056\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1lxfzet\" data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3089\">24 Months No-Cost EMI Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3242\">Students can also choose the 24-month no-cost EMI option starting from ₹8,906 per month, making the program more accessible without financial pressure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vyi0sv\" data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3261\">Key Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3386\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vuqfm2\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3293\">0% interest (no extra cost)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ckietb\" data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3329\">Affordable monthly installments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"akrylx\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3359\">Easier financial planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vozlz6\" data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3386\">Reduced upfront burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3443\">Before selecting EMI, students should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3560\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ofzl67\" data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3477\">Bank eligibility requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ih89zd\" data-start=\"3478\" data-end=\"3498\">Auto-debit rules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ltcrne\" data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3520\">Payment timelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fvd81k\" data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3560\">Penalty terms (if any delay occurs)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"418\">The MBA in General Management is a comprehensive postgraduate program designed to build strong managerial, leadership, and strategic decision-making skills. The syllabus is structured to gradually move from core business fundamentals in the early semesters to advanced strategic management, digital transformation, analytics, and real-world project execution in later semesters.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"616\">This program prepares students for leadership roles across industries by combining finance, marketing, HR, operations, analytics, and digital business concepts into a single integrated curriculum.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"621\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"qdxzid\" data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"664\">MBA General Management Course Structure</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"965\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"699\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"699\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"684\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"699\" data-col-size=\"md\">Information</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"965\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<td data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"724\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Name</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"750\" data-col-size=\"md\">MBA General Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"773\">\r\n<td data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"762\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"773\" data-col-size=\"md\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"807\">\r\n<td data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"792\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"807\" data-col-size=\"md\">4 Semesters</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"881\">\r\n<td data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"828\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Approach</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"881\" data-col-size=\"md\">Core Management + Strategy + Analytics + Projects</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"965\">\r\n<td data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"896\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Areas</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"965\" data-col-size=\"md\">Leadership, Business Strategy, Marketing, Finance, HR, Operations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"970\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2bf1u1\" data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1019\">Semester-Wise MBA General Management Syllabus</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9m\" data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1034\">Semester 1</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1202\">The first semester builds a strong foundation in business management, finance, marketing, economics, and communication skills required for managerial decision-making.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1675\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1230\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1230\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1215\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1230\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1675\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1331\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1267\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accounting for Managers</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1331\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial accounting concepts for managerial decision-making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1408\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1355\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Managerial Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1408\">Economic principles applied to business decisions</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1494\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1432\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1494\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fundamentals of marketing strategies and consumer behavior</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1586\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1523\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Statistics for Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1586\">Statistical tools for business analysis and decision-making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1675\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1616\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Communication</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1675\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business communication and corporate interaction skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3mjpbb\" data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1708\">Semester 1 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1837\">Students develop core business understanding and analytical skills required for advanced management subjects in later semesters.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1842\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9l\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1857\">Semester 2</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1998\">The second semester focuses on business operations, legal frameworks, financial systems, HR management, and research-based decision-making.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2459\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2026\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2026\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2011\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2026\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2459\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2117\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2065\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Research Methods</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2117\">Research techniques for business decision-making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2199\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2141\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2199\">Financial planning, budgeting, and investment concepts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2280\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2228\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2280\">Workforce management and organizational behavior</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2362\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2309\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspects of Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2362\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business laws and corporate regulatory frameworks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2459\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Conflict Resolution and Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2459\">Managing workplace conflicts and negotiation strategies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"go7f2c\" data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2492\">Semester 2 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2612\">Students gain knowledge of business operations, financial systems, HR practices, and legal compliance in organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2617\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9k\" data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2632\">Semester 3</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2769\">The third semester focuses on strategic thinking, brand management, financial services, operations, ethics, and project-based learning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"3388\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2797\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2797\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2782\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2797\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"3388\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2887\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2831\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2887\">Business strategy development and long-term planning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2979\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2923\" data-col-size=\"md\">Management of Financial Services</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2979\">Banking, insurance, and financial service operations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3073\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3018\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strategic Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3073\">Advanced HR planning aligned with business strategy</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3152\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3105\" data-col-size=\"md\">Product and Brand Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3152\">Building and managing strong brand identity</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3246\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3199\" data-col-size=\"md\">Operations Planning, Scheduling and Control</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3246\">Efficient management of business operations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3247\" data-end=\"3321\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3247\" data-end=\"3269\" data-col-size=\"md\">Professional Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3321\">Ethical decision-making in business environments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3388\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3338\" data-col-size=\"md\">Minor Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3388\">Practical project based on management concepts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nbvp9h\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3421\">Semester 3 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3546\">Students develop strategic thinking skills and apply theoretical knowledge to real-world business problems through projects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3548\" data-end=\"3551\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9r\" data-start=\"3553\" data-end=\"3566\">Semester 4</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3689\">The final semester focuses on modern business transformation, digital technologies, analytics, and advanced project work.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"4171\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"3717\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"3717\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"3702\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3717\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"4171\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3806\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3749\" data-col-size=\"md\">Big Data Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3806\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data-driven decision-making and analytics in business</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3807\" data-end=\"3917\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3807\" data-end=\"3856\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Commerce &ndash; Reinventing Business Models</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3856\" data-end=\"3917\" data-col-size=\"md\">E-commerce strategies and digital business transformation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3990\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3938\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3938\" data-end=\"3990\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online marketing strategies and digital branding</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3991\" data-end=\"4108\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3991\" data-end=\"4052\" data-col-size=\"md\">Management in Action &ndash; Social, Economic and Ethical Issues</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4052\" data-end=\"4108\" data-col-size=\"md\">Real-world management challenges and decision-making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4109\" data-end=\"4171\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4109\" data-end=\"4125\" data-col-size=\"md\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4171\" data-col-size=\"md\">Final industry-oriented management project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"czj1ky\" data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4204\">Semester 4 Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4352\">Students apply all learned concepts in real-world business scenarios, focusing on digital transformation, analytics, and strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4354\" data-end=\"4357\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ccldmn\" data-start=\"4359\" data-end=\"4407\">Key Skills Developed in MBA General Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4409\" data-end=\"4450\">Throughout the program, students develop:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4451\" data-end=\"4810\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b0x2o2\" data-start=\"4451\" data-end=\"4492\">Leadership and decision-making skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3w7ji\" data-start=\"4493\" data-end=\"4542\">Financial and managerial accounting knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k5vvia\" data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4587\">Strategic planning and business analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9fi8ce\" data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4632\">Marketing and brand management expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yw00br\" data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4681\">HR and organizational behavior understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mieseq\" data-start=\"4682\" data-end=\"4720\">Operations and supply chain basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dr9qmj\" data-start=\"4721\" data-end=\"4762\">Digital business and analytics skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4p0tj\" data-start=\"4763\" data-end=\"4810\">Problem-solving and communication abilities</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 225000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(371, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 207, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 01:23:05', '2026-06-17 00:19:22', '<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"367\">The admission process for the Online MBA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to be simple, flexible, and fully online. The university has streamlined the application journey to help students, graduates, and working professionals complete the admission process conveniently from any location.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"497\">From program selection to final enrollment, the process focuses on providing a smooth and student-friendly admission experience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"502\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"t2kkt3\" data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"535\">Choose the Online MBA Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"848\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the Online MBA program based on career goals, academic interests, and professional aspirations. Students should carefully review the program structure, eligibility criteria, curriculum, fee details, and learning format before proceeding with the application.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"889\">The Online MBA program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"1085\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rqau5a\" data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"936\">Fresh graduates seeking management careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ggxkf0\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"987\">Working professionals aiming for career growth</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jfqyfb\" data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1025\">Entrepreneurs and business owners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4afbrv\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1085\">Candidates looking for flexible online higher education</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1234\">Choosing the right program helps students align their learning objectives with long-term career opportunities in management and leadership domains.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1239\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1255\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1471\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the university&rsquo;s admission portal. Applicants are required to fill in personal, academic, and contact details accurately.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1524\">During the application stage, students may need to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1749\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18c8dcr\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1565\">Complete the online application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11wk82f\" data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1620\">Upload academic documents and identification proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oq0cn8\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1673\">Submit graduation and 10+2 qualification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4stxf\" data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1713\">Pay the applicable registration fee</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wqpdzy\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1749\">Verify eligibility requirements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1839\">Final-year students can also apply using the results of their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1986\">The online application process is designed to minimize paperwork and provide faster admission processing for students across different locations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"1991\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2011\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2183\">Once the application is reviewed and eligibility verification is completed, eligible candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment details from the university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2226\">After successful admission, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2468\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2266\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g4o3sq\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2304\">Attend live and recorded sessions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mok3bn\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2362\">Participate in assignments, projects, and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jlxoim\" data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2413\">Connect with faculty members and peer learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173g2be\" data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2468\">Begin their MBA learning journey from any location</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2600\">The university provides a flexible digital learning environment that supports both academic learning and professional development.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"453\">The Online MBA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for graduates, final-year students, and working professionals who want to build strong managerial and leadership skills through a flexible online learning format. The eligibility requirements are structured to ensure that applicants possess the academic foundation needed to successfully pursue advanced business education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"625\">The program is suitable for individuals seeking career growth in areas such as management, finance, marketing, operations, analytics, consulting, and business leadership.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"630\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"667\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"761\">Candidates applying for the Online MBA program must fulfill the following academic criteria:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cgen7y\" data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"791\">Minimum Graduation Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"908\">Applicants must secure at least <strong data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"847\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in their undergraduate degree from a recognized institution.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"913\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18awfdb\" data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"937\">10+2 Qualification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1031\">Candidates must have successfully completed their <strong data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1006\">10+2 education</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1036\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"j3l1bk\" data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1074\">Undergraduate Degree Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1202\">Applicants must hold a <strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1154\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with a minimum duration of 3 years</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1244\">Eligible degree backgrounds may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1338\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1252\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wajosr\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1261\">BCom</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z4e4a\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1269\">BSc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1276\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1284\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11eyk1k\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1297\">BE/BTech</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"md1hz7\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1338\">Or equivalent undergraduate programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1343\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gbi164\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1379\">Final-Year Student Eligibility</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1577\">Students currently appearing for the final year of their graduation are also eligible to apply. Admission consideration is generally based on the marks obtained up to the latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1696\">This provides flexibility for students who want to secure admission before completing their final graduation results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1701\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xfhmya\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1732\">Work Experience Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1882\">Although prior work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience may receive an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1920\">Work experience can help applicants:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aph8z8\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1970\">Understand business concepts more effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j0d5uq\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2033\">Contribute practical industry perspectives during learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jq104h\" data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2084\">Improve managerial and leadership capabilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19qccf4\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2145\">Enhance career growth opportunities after MBA completion</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2150\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vsr4pw\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2180\">Online MBA Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2300\">The Online MBA program offers flexible learning timelines suitable for both fresh graduates and working professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2403\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2331\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2331\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2320\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2331\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2403\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2372\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2361\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2372\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2403\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2392\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2403\">4 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2563\">The flexible duration structure allows students to balance academics with professional or personal commitments while completing the program at their own pace.</p>', '<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"398\">The Online MBA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide flexible and affordable management education for both Indian and international students. The fee structure is organized in multiple payment options, allowing students to choose semester-wise payments, annual payments with discounts, or EMI-based learning support.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"566\">The university also offers a zero-cost EMI facility, making the program more accessible for working professionals and students who prefer manageable monthly payments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"571\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ltwc52\" data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"610\">Online MBA Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"720\">Indian students can choose from different payment plans based on their convenience and financial preference.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"886\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"748\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"748\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"738\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"748\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"886\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"786\">\r\n<td data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"775\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"786\">₹7,792*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"813\">\r\n<td data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"802\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"813\">₹44,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"852\">\r\n<td data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"841\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"852\">₹83,600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"886\">\r\n<td data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"873\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"886\">₹1,76,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"910\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1019\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"939\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"939\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"929\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"939\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1019\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"977\">\r\n<td data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"969\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"977\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1019\">\r\n<td data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"996\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1019\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1211\">The semester-wise payment model helps students distribute the financial burden over the duration of the course, while the yearly payment option offers cost savings through discount benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rdyfu\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1257\">Online MBA Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1387\">The university also provides online MBA access to international learners through a separate fee structure for foreign nationals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1415\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1415\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1405\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1415\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1441\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1452\">₹53,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1493\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1480\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1493\">₹1,00,700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1514\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1527\">₹2,12,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1551\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1570\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1580\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1618\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1618\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1637\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1660\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1804\">The international fee structure is designed to support global learners seeking an Indian management degree with flexible online accessibility.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1809\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1835\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"2066\">One of the major advantages of the Online MBA program is the availability of a <strong data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1940\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> for eligible students. This feature allows learners to pursue higher education without paying the entire tuition fee upfront.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fxs65l\" data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2094\">Benefits of EMI Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2321\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vikkm\" data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2135\">Reduces immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v42bwt\" data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2203\">Supports working professionals with monthly payment flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mzi56v\" data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2250\">Makes management education more affordable</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eoqrht\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2321\">Enables students to continue education without career interruption</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2404\">The approximate monthly EMI starts from <strong data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2383\">₹7,792 per month</strong> for Indian students.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"519\">The Online MBA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide students with strong managerial knowledge, leadership abilities, analytical thinking, and industry-oriented business skills. The curriculum combines theoretical learning with practical business applications through case studies, projects, and expert-led sessions. The program is suitable for fresh graduates as well as working professionals looking to strengthen their management expertise.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"697\">The syllabus is structured across four semesters, gradually covering core management concepts, strategic business functions, analytics, finance, leadership, and sustainability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"702\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1y1vktw\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"763\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundation of Management and Business Skills</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"889\">The first semester focuses on introducing students to the fundamentals of business management and organizational operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"912\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"1153\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wt388f\" data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"970\">Fundamentals of Management &amp; Organizational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14jg9zy\" data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1030\">Human Resources Management &amp; Organizational Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rvgr0e\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1076\">Marketing Management &amp; Consumer Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvtyp9\" data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1117\">Soft Skills and Employability Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"61zzrw\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1153\">Elective: Management Consulting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1178\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1409\">Students develop an understanding of management principles, employee behavior, marketing strategies, and workplace communication. The semester also improves professional and interpersonal skills required in corporate environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1414\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"qgvc2c\" data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1474\">Semester 2 &ndash; Finance, Operations, and Strategic Thinking</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1611\">The second semester strengthens analytical and operational business understanding while introducing strategic decision-making concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1634\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x28dfq\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1655\">Business Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lnxy6g\" data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1698\">Operations and Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jnnti8\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1730\">Data-Driven Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzp1lq\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1775\">Business Ethics and Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hpqs9\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1811\">Elective: Leadership Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1836\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"2038\">Students gain knowledge of financial planning, supply chain systems, business analytics, and ethical management practices. Leadership and strategic thinking skills are also developed during this phase.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2043\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"fd8vae\" data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2098\">Semester 3 &ndash; Global Business and Advanced Analytics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2215\">The third semester focuses on international business exposure, analytical tools, and corporate governance concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2238\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2455\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2265\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18jukye\" data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2311\">Business Analytics and Business Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"og5gib\" data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2377\">Elective: Financial Statement Analysis and Business Valuation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rxjumr\" data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2432\">Elective: Business Ethics and Corporate Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2nf5r\" data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2455\">Education for Life</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2480\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2668\">Students understand global business operations, business modelling techniques, and financial evaluation methods. The semester also emphasizes ethical leadership and value-based education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2673\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4sok9k\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2740\">Semester 4 &ndash; Sustainability, Research, and Industry Application</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2854\">The final semester emphasizes practical implementation, sustainability concepts, and research-oriented learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2877\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"3058\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6n7ual\" data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2923\">Environment Sustainability and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s1t5st\" data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2935\">Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s01kyv\" data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"2970\">Elective: Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d6vvwb\" data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3009\">Elective: Mergers and Acquisitions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tcicup\" data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3058\">Elective: Intellectual Property Rights (IPR)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3083\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3287\">Students work on industry-oriented projects and learn research methodologies, sustainability practices, business expansion strategies, and intellectual property concepts relevant to modern organizations.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 176000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(372, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 01:39:58', '2026-05-14 01:39:58', '<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"462\">The Online MCA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students and working professionals who want to build advanced technical expertise in computer applications, software development, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, and emerging IT domains. The program combines flexible online learning with industry-oriented curriculum, expert mentorship, placement assistance, and practical skill development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"652\">With a strong academic framework and support from experienced faculty members, the program helps students prepare for careers in leading technology companies and modern digital industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"657\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"r7ptok\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"689\">Online MCA Admission Process</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"864\">The admission process for the Online MCA program is designed to be simple, fully online, and convenient for learners from different educational and professional backgrounds.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18wh3rh\" data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"885\">Choose a Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"1129\">The first step is selecting the Online MCA specialization or program based on career goals and technical interests. Students can review the curriculum, eligibility criteria, fee structure, and learning format before proceeding with admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1159\">The program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1396\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ld07k\" data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1198\">Fresh graduates seeking IT careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dc3re0\" data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1256\">Working professionals aiming for technical upskilling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5u3cn1\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1330\">Students interested in software development and emerging technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10o62e2\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1396\">Professionals planning career growth in the technology sector</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1401\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"q3xyce\" data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1418\">Apply Online</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1584\">Candidates can complete the application process through the online admission portal by submitting academic details, required documents, and application information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1636\">The online application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1830\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aakuos\" data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1673\">Filling out the application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2g8aa\" data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1706\">Uploading academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vyv51h\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1758\">Providing graduation and identification details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmgdny\" data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1790\">Paying the registration fee</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"as6kj4\" data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1830\">Completing eligibility verification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1961\">This fully digital admission system makes the enrollment process faster and more accessible for students across India and abroad.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1966\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4r48cq\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1987\">Join the Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2127\">After successful verification and admission approval, students receive enrollment confirmation and access to the online learning platform.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2157\">Once enrolled, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2371\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2194\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m75fnf\" data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2232\">Access digital learning resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsy1iu\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2276\">Participate in assignments and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yx6w3j\" data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2314\">Interact with faculty and mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zklukf\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2371\">Continue learning from any location with flexibility</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"468\">The Online MCA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students and professionals who want to build advanced knowledge in computer applications, software development, programming, and modern technology systems. The eligibility criteria are structured to ensure that applicants possess the required academic foundation for pursuing higher studies in computer science and IT-related domains.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"662\">The program is suitable for graduates from technical, science, commerce, and related academic backgrounds who want flexible online learning opportunities in the field of computer applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"667\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"704\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"803\">Candidates applying for the Online MCA program must fulfill the following eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cgen7y\" data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"833\">Minimum Graduation Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"969\">Applicants must secure a minimum of <strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"894\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in their undergraduate degree from a recognized university or institution.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18awfdb\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"998\">10+2 Qualification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1093\">Candidates must have successfully completed their <strong data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1068\">10+2 education</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1098\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9biwtp\" data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1127\">Mathematics Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1181\">Applicants must have studied <strong data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1173\">Mathematics</strong> either:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1245\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rmat7\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1211\">At the <strong data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1205\">10+2 level</strong>, or</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ixh4os\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1245\">During the <strong data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1245\">graduation level</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1446\">This requirement is important because the MCA curriculum includes logical reasoning, algorithms, programming concepts, and computational problem-solving that require basic mathematical understanding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1451\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xyhwbm\" data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1489\">Undergraduate Degree Eligibility</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1618\">Candidates who have completed any recognized undergraduate degree are eligible, provided they meet the mathematics requirement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1660\">Eligible degree backgrounds may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1746\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1668\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z4e4a\" data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1676\">BSc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wajosr\" data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1685\">BCom</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1692\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ob6kyg\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1705\">BTech/BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"md1hz7\" data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1746\">Or equivalent undergraduate programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1751\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gbi164\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1787\">Final-Year Student Eligibility</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1939\">Students appearing for the final year of their graduation can also apply for admission using the marks obtained up to their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"2047\">This allows students to secure admission opportunities before their final results are officially declared.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2052\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xfhmya\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2083\">Work Experience Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2228\">Although work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience may receive an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2264\">Work experience can help students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2485\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2engbl\" data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2315\">Understand technical concepts more effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15za2y4\" data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2377\">Connect academic learning with real industry applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cmcpl3\" data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2435\">Improve practical software and problem-solving skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xnxozk\" data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2485\">Enhance career opportunities in the IT sector</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2615\">The online learning format is especially beneficial for working professionals seeking career growth while continuing their jobs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2620\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xgc8qt\" data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2650\">Online MCA Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2763\">The Online MCA program offers flexible completion timelines to support both students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2794\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2794\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2783\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2794\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2835\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2824\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2835\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2855\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2866\">4 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2978\">The extended duration flexibility helps learners balance academics with professional and personal commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"506\">The Online MCA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to offer flexible and affordable postgraduate education for students aiming to build careers in software development, information technology, data analytics, and computer applications. The university provides multiple payment options, including semester-wise payment plans, annual fee discounts, and zero-cost EMI facilities to support students from different financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"671\">The fee structure is suitable for both fresh graduates and working professionals seeking industry-oriented online technical education from a recognized university.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"676\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1j28rg7\" data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"715\">Online MCA Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"835\">Indian students can choose from different payment options depending on their convenience and preferred payment method.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"1001\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"853\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"863\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"1001\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"901\">\r\n<td data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"890\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"901\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹6,292*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"928\">\r\n<td data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"917\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"928\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹35,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"967\">\r\n<td data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"956\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"967\">₹66,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1001\">\r\n<td data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"988\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1001\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,40,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1025\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1044\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1054\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1084\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1092\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1111\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1134\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1311\">The semester-wise fee model helps students manage educational expenses more efficiently, while the yearly payment option provides additional savings through discount benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9fpa1n\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1357\">Online MCA Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1503\">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham also offers the Online MCA program for international students through a separate fee structure for foreign nationals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1531\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1531\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1521\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1531\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1557\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1568\">₹41,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1596\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1607\">₹77,900</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1628\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1641\">₹1,64,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1665\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1684\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1694\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1732\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1724\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1732\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1751\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1774\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1935\">The international fee structure supports global learners looking for flexible online postgraduate education in computer applications from an Indian university.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1940\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s5zdhp\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1964\">Zero Cost EMI Option</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2194\">One of the major advantages of the Online MCA program is the availability of a <strong data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2071\">Zero Cost EMI facility</strong> for eligible students. This option allows students to pursue higher education without paying the full tuition fee upfront.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7yj81i\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2228\">Benefits of the EMI Facility</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2450\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ecuzil\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2266\">Easier monthly payment management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x28w7w\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2334\">Reduced financial burden for students and working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fhnp5d\" data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2392\">Affordable access to postgraduate technical education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a4tqef\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2450\">Flexible learning support without career interruption</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2535\">The monthly EMI for Indian students starts from approximately <strong data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2534\">₹6,292 per month</strong>.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"522\">The Online MCA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to develop strong technical expertise, programming knowledge, analytical thinking, and software development skills required in the modern IT industry. The curriculum focuses on both theoretical computer science concepts and practical application-based learning, helping students prepare for careers in software development, data analytics, system design, cloud computing, and emerging technology domains.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"750\">The program is structured across four semesters and gradually progresses from programming fundamentals to advanced computing concepts, project development, research methodologies, and industry-oriented specialization subjects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"918\">The syllabus also emphasizes problem-solving abilities, project management skills, and real-world technical implementation through case studies and capstone projects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lwec3p\" data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"993\">Semester 1 &ndash; Building Programming and Computer Science Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1141\">The first semester focuses on developing a strong understanding of computer systems, mathematical logic, and object-oriented programming concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1164\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1334\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g7qfk8\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1200\">Foundations of Computer Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jvuhdb\" data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1255\">Mathematical Foundations for Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2nhx0\" data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1298\">Object Oriented Programming using Java</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x9fx6m\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1316\">Stream Core 1</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x9fxz1\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1334\">Stream Core 2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1359\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1622\">Students gain foundational knowledge of computer architecture, computational mathematics, and Java programming. The semester helps learners build essential coding skills and logical thinking abilities required for advanced software development and system design.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1732\">The stream core subjects introduce specialization-oriented concepts depending on the chosen academic stream.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1737\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"bys3k5\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1801\">Semester 2 &ndash; Data Structures and Technical Skill Development</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1928\">The second semester strengthens algorithmic thinking, data organization techniques, and professional communication abilities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1951\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18z8ykp\" data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1986\">Data Structures and Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6co4v8\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2002\">Soft Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zbulvs\" data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2032\">Stream Core &ndash; Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x9fvi4\" data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2050\">Stream Core 3</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x9fwaj\" data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2068\">Stream Core 4</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljkqmr\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2096\">Professional Elective 1</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2121\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2299\">Students learn how data is structured, processed, and optimized using algorithms. This semester also improves communication and workplace readiness through soft skills training.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2460\">The inclusion of electives and stream core subjects allows students to explore advanced computing concepts aligned with industry requirements and career goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2465\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yhyekd\" data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2526\">Semester 3 &ndash; Advanced Computing and Research Applications</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2638\">The third semester focuses on project management, research-based learning, and specialized technical subjects.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2661\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2825\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wlmmu9\" data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2693\">Software Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jpcxlo\" data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2718\">Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x9fttm\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2736\">Stream Core 5</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x9fum1\" data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2754\">Stream Core 6</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljkpqo\" data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2782\">Professional Elective 2</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljkoy9\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2810\">Professional Elective 3</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q4jmlv\" data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2825\">Case Study</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2850\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"3142\">Students develop knowledge of software project planning, execution strategies, and research techniques used in technical problem-solving. The semester also introduces advanced specialization topics and case-study-based learning to improve practical understanding of real-world IT challenges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3274\">This phase helps students strengthen analytical thinking, technical decision-making, and industry-oriented problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3279\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"qonnnx\" data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3346\">Semester 4 &ndash; Capstone Project and Career-Focused Specialization</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3348\" data-end=\"3462\">The final semester is designed to provide hands-on implementation experience and advanced elective-based learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3485\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3486\" data-end=\"3562\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qfdcvg\" data-start=\"3486\" data-end=\"3506\">Capstone Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljkus6\" data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3534\">Professional Elective 4</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljktzr\" data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3562\">Professional Elective 5</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3587\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3825\">Students work on a major capstone project where they apply programming, analytical, and software development concepts to solve practical problems. This project helps students gain industry exposure and improve technical execution skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"4002\">The professional electives provide deeper expertise in specialized technology areas, helping students align their learning with career interests and emerging industry demands.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 140000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(373, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 273, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 01:53:51', '2026-06-17 00:19:52', '<p data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"434\">The admission process for the Online BCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Data Science at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to be simple, flexible, and completely online. The university provides a smooth digital admission experience that allows students from different educational backgrounds to apply conveniently from anywhere.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"627\">The process is structured to help students quickly begin their journey in emerging technology fields such as artificial intelligence, data science, machine learning, and software development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"654\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"817\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the Online BCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Data Science program based on career interests and future goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"869\">Before applying, students should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"1000\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b9sc1t\" data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"892\">Program curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvng9i\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"917\">Eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr5ji3\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"935\">Fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lvv0qz\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"955\">Course duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14821qv\" data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1000\">Learning format and specialization focus</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1030\">The program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1215\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ndv5es\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1085\">Students interested in AI and data science careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3c4ekc\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1110\">Fresh 10+2 graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"26t3xs\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1158\">Diploma holders seeking technical education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lkhslp\" data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1215\">Learners looking for flexible online degree programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1341\">Choosing the right program helps students align their education with future career opportunities in the technology industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1346\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1362\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1489\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1534\">The application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1737\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ag5yr\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1578\">Filling out the online application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2g8aa\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1611\">Uploading academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1402cq0\" data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1658\">Providing personal and educational details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0obln\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1705\">Submitting identity verification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmgdny\" data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1737\">Paying the registration fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1860\">The online admission system reduces paperwork and allows students to complete the process conveniently from any location.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1865\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1885\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"2032\">Once the university verifies the application and confirms eligibility, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2076\">After successful enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2298\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2116\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2153\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsy1iu\" data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2197\">Participate in assignments and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yx6w3j\" data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2235\">Interact with faculty and mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w7zk7s\" data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2298\">Begin learning from anywhere with flexible study schedules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2425\">The online learning environment is designed to support both academic understanding and practical technical skill development.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"634\">The Online BCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Data Science at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students who want to build careers in emerging technology fields such as artificial intelligence, machine learning, data analytics, software development, and intelligent computing systems. The eligibility criteria are structured to provide accessible admission opportunities for students from different academic backgrounds while ensuring they possess the foundational qualifications required for undergraduate technical education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"799\">The program is suitable for fresh 10+2 students, diploma holders, and learners seeking flexible online education in the rapidly growing AI and data science domain.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"804\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"841\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"982\">Candidates applying for the Online BCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Data Science program must fulfill the following eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a7tjrd\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1013\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1107\">Applicants must secure a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1074\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in their qualifying examination.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1268\">The eligibility criteria are designed to support students from diverse educational backgrounds who are interested in technology and digital innovation careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1273\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18awfdb\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1297\">10+2 Qualification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1392\">Candidates must have successfully completed their <strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1367\">10+2 education</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1432\">Students from various streams such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y83j8c\" data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1444\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4h0lx\" data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1457\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wkddks\" data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1466\">Arts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1554\">can apply for the program, provided they meet the university&rsquo;s admission requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1559\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kdwbvl\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1591\">Diploma Holder Eligibility</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1723\">Candidates who have completed a <strong data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1651\">3-year diploma program</strong> from a recognized institution are also eligible to apply for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1890\">This creates additional opportunities for diploma students who want to continue higher education in computer applications, artificial intelligence, and data science.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1895\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xfhmya\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1926\">Work Experience Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"2077\">Although prior work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience may receive an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2113\">Work experience can help learners:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ycd0hp\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2179\">Understand practical technology applications more effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ah10ow\" data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2223\">Improve technical and analytical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ls1z6c\" data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2280\">Connect academic concepts with industry requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mun92t\" data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2340\">Strengthen career growth opportunities in the IT sector</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2489\">The online learning format is especially beneficial for working professionals seeking flexible undergraduate education while continuing their jobs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2494\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"o52w8w\" data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2542\">Online BCA AI &amp; Data Science Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2662\">The program provides flexible learning timelines to support students with different academic and personal commitments.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2765\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2693\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2693\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2693\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2765\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2734\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2734\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2765\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2754\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2765\">6 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2939\">The extended duration flexibility allows students to complete the program at a comfortable pace while balancing education with work, internships, or other responsibilities.</p>', '<p data-start=\"101\" data-end=\"595\">The Online BCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Data Science at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide affordable and flexible undergraduate education for students interested in modern technology domains such as artificial intelligence, machine learning, data analytics, and software development. The university offers multiple fee payment options, including semester-wise payments, yearly discounts, and zero-cost EMI facilities to support students from different financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"782\">The fee structure is planned to make quality online technical education accessible for fresh students, diploma holders, and working professionals seeking future-ready technology skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"787\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"iu69hu\" data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"844\">Online BCA AI &amp; Data Science Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"965\">Indian students can choose different payment options according to their financial convenience and learning preferences.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1131\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"993\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"993\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"983\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"993\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1131\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1031\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1020\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1031\">₹5,042*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1047\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1058\">₹27,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1086\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1097\">₹52,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1131\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1131\">₹1,65,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1155\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1174\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1184\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1222\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1214\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1222\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1241\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1264\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1438\">The semester-wise fee structure helps students manage educational expenses gradually, while the yearly payment option provides additional savings through discount benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1443\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fgjlq\" data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1502\">Online BCA AI &amp; Data Science Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1637\">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham also offers the program for international students through a separate fee structure for foreign nationals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1775\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1665\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1665\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1655\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1665\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1775\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1691\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1702\">₹33,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1741\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1741\">₹62,700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1775\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1762\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1775\">₹1,98,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1799\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1908\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1828\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1828\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1818\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1828\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1908\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1866\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1858\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1866\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1908\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1885\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1908\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"2085\">The international fee structure supports global learners seeking flexible online undergraduate education in artificial intelligence and data science from an Indian university.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2116\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2368\">One of the major advantages of the Online BCA AI &amp; Data Science program is the availability of a <strong data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2239\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> for eligible students. This facility allows students to pursue higher education without paying the complete tuition fee upfront.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10dg977\" data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2404\">Benefits of EMI Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2611\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rttxl\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2443\">Reduces immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2g8hx4\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2495\">Provides affordable monthly payment flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x8czks\" data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2543\">Supports students and working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9s8j1k\" data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2611\">Enables uninterrupted learning without major financial pressure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2696\">The monthly EMI for Indian students starts from approximately <strong data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2695\">₹5,042 per month</strong>.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"482\">The Online BCA in AI &amp; Data Science at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to prepare students for modern careers in artificial intelligence, data science, software development, machine learning, and emerging digital technologies. The program combines core computer application subjects with specialized AI and data science learning, helping students build strong technical, analytical, and problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"837\">The curriculum is structured across six semesters and gradually progresses from programming fundamentals and computer systems to advanced concepts such as machine learning, data mining, cybersecurity, and application development. The program also includes practical labs, electives, case studies, and a capstone project to strengthen industry readiness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"842\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"qjd8r9\" data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"918\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundation of Computer Applications and Analytical Thinking</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1058\">The first semester focuses on building communication skills, mathematical understanding, management basics, and problem-solving abilities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1081\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1252\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yhqhg2\" data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1111\">Communicative English &ndash; I</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aeu11u\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1154\">Foundations of Applied Mathematics &ndash; I</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ebawn\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1183\">Principles of Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xweema\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1207\">Computer Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dj91mj\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1252\">Problem Solving and Algorithmic Thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1277\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1514\">Students develop a basic understanding of computer systems, logical reasoning, and algorithmic thinking. The semester also improves communication and mathematical foundations that are important for programming and data science learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1519\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ejx76y\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1573\">Semester 2 &ndash; Programming and Database Fundamentals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1684\">The second semester introduces students to programming concepts, database systems, and computer architecture.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1707\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1985\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y6virn\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1738\">Professional Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13y6rmj\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1782\">Foundations of Applied Mathematics &ndash; II</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5iv66h\" data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1829\">Operating System and Computer Architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2nhx0\" data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1872\">Object Oriented Programming using Java</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yovjob\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1903\">Database Management System</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"731yl0\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1938\">Database Management System Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kdzjej\" data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1985\">Object Oriented Programming using Java Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2010\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2270\">Students gain practical programming knowledge using Java and learn how databases are designed and managed. The semester also provides understanding of operating systems and computer architecture fundamentals essential for software and application development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2275\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"b6o6mz\" data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2339\">Semester 3 &ndash; Data Structures, Networking, and AI Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2487\">The third semester focuses on data organization, networking concepts, and the initial introduction to AI and data science specialization subjects.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2510\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2717\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18z8ykp\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2545\">Data Structures and Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16l4p2a\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2567\">Computer Networks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13kk5be\" data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2612\">Environmental Science and Sustainability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ily23\" data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2631\">Linear Algebra</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jfvy61\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2654\">AI &amp; DS Elective I</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hsehw0\" data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2678\">AI &amp; DS Elective II</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e91jpi\" data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2717\">Data Structures and Algorithms Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2742\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2998\">Students learn how data is stored, processed, and optimized using algorithms and data structures. Networking fundamentals and mathematical concepts like linear algebra help build a strong base for artificial intelligence and machine learning applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3117\">The AI &amp; DS electives introduce specialization-oriented concepts in artificial intelligence and data science domains.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3122\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"22zcpt\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3173\">Semester 4 &ndash; Web Development and Data Analytics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3271\">The fourth semester emphasizes software development, web technologies, and data mining concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3273\" data-end=\"3294\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3468\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6co4v8\" data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3310\">Soft Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bti781\" data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3342\">Web Application Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bruzqq\" data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3358\">Data Mining</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u08d4u\" data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3383\">Software Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yam1cp\" data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3408\">AI &amp; DS Elective III</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hseff3\" data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3432\">AI &amp; DS Elective IV</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19qkk66\" data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3468\">Web Application Development Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3493\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3737\">Students develop web application development skills and understand how large datasets are analyzed using data mining techniques. Software engineering concepts help students learn software design, testing, and project development methodologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3739\" data-end=\"3826\">Soft skills training also improves communication, teamwork, and professional readiness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3831\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ssc6wd\" data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3883\">Semester 5 &ndash; Machine Learning and Cyber Security</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"4017\">The fifth semester introduces advanced technologies such as machine learning, cybersecurity, and enterprise application development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"4019\" data-end=\"4040\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4041\" data-end=\"4197\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xldk3y\" data-start=\"4041\" data-end=\"4066\">C# and .NET Framework</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr3aaw\" data-start=\"4067\" data-end=\"4102\">Foundations of Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"146dsk5\" data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4135\">Essentials of Cyber Security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jfvgkm\" data-start=\"4136\" data-end=\"4158\">AI &amp; DS Elective V</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hs0a7j\" data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4182\">AI &amp; DS Elective VI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q4jmlv\" data-start=\"4183\" data-end=\"4197\">Case Study</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4222\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4223\" data-end=\"4454\">Students explore machine learning fundamentals, cybersecurity principles, and modern software development frameworks. The case study component helps learners apply technical knowledge to practical business and technology scenarios.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4456\" data-end=\"4543\">This semester plays a major role in preparing students for emerging technology careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4548\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7xhewz\" data-start=\"4550\" data-end=\"4607\">Semester 6 &ndash; Industry Application and Capstone Learning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4609\" data-end=\"4750\">The final semester focuses on project implementation, mobile application development, and advanced AI &amp; data science specialization subjects.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"4752\" data-end=\"4773\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4774\" data-end=\"4880\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qfdcvg\" data-start=\"4774\" data-end=\"4794\">Capstone Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13tyjdt\" data-start=\"4795\" data-end=\"4829\">Mobile Application Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xxkksm\" data-start=\"4830\" data-end=\"4854\">AI &amp; DS Elective VII</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ysa9fz\" data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4880\">AI &amp; DS Elective VIII</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"4882\" data-end=\"4905\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4906\" data-end=\"5131\">Students work on a capstone project that allows them to apply programming, machine learning, and analytical concepts to real-world problems. Mobile application development introduces modern app design and deployment concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5133\" data-end=\"5264\">The advanced electives help students strengthen expertise in specialized AI and data science domains aligned with industry demands.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 165000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(374, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 02:07:47', '2026-06-17 00:20:14', '<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"358\">The admission process for the Online BBA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to be simple, flexible, and completely online. The university provides a smooth digital admission experience that allows students from different educational backgrounds to apply conveniently from anywhere.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"569\">The process is structured to help students quickly begin their journey in business management, entrepreneurship, finance, marketing, and corporate administration through a flexible online learning environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"574\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"596\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"740\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the Online BBA program based on career interests, academic goals, and future aspirations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"792\">Before applying, students should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b9sc1t\" data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"815\">Program curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvng9i\" data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"840\">Eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr5ji3\" data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"858\">Fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lvv0qz\" data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"878\">Course duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5u7adl\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"923\">Learning format and career opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"964\">The Online BBA program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3c4ekc\" data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"989\">Fresh 10+2 graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ggije\" data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1034\">Diploma holders seeking higher education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmdn7h\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1093\">Students interested in management and business careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8zua8x\" data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1148\">Aspiring entrepreneurs and future business leaders</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1294\">Choosing the right program helps students align their education with long-term career growth opportunities in the business and corporate sector.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1299\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1315\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1442\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1494\">The online application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aakuos\" data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1531\">Filling out the application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2g8aa\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1564\">Uploading academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1402cq0\" data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1611\">Providing personal and educational details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0obln\" data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1658\">Submitting identity verification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmgdny\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1690\">Paying the registration fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1819\">The fully online admission system reduces paperwork and allows students to complete the process conveniently from any location.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1824\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1844\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"2016\">Once the application is reviewed and eligibility verification is completed, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment details from the university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2060\">After successful enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2280\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2100\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g4o3sq\" data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2138\">Attend live and recorded sessions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsy1iu\" data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2182\">Participate in assignments and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"li63rw\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2228\">Interact with faculty members and mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zni54j\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2280\">Continue learning with flexible study schedules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2397\">The digital learning ecosystem is designed to support both academic development and professional skill enhancement.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"509\">The Online BBA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students who want to build strong knowledge in business management, marketing, finance, entrepreneurship, and corporate administration. The eligibility criteria are structured to provide flexible admission opportunities for students from different academic backgrounds while ensuring they possess the foundational qualifications required for undergraduate business education.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"679\">The program is suitable for fresh 10+2 graduates, diploma holders, and learners seeking flexible online management education with career-focused learning opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"684\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"721\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"820\">Candidates applying for the Online BBA program must fulfill the following eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a7tjrd\" data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"851\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"945\">Applicants must secure a minimum of <strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"912\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in their qualifying examination.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"1083\">The eligibility criteria are designed to make management education accessible to students interested in business and leadership careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1088\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18awfdb\" data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1112\">10+2 Qualification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1207\">Candidates must have successfully completed their <strong data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1182\">10+2 education</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1249\">Students from different streams such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1283\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4h0lx\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1262\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y83j8c\" data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1274\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wkddks\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1283\">Arts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1323\">are eligible to apply for the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1328\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kdwbvl\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1360\">Diploma Holder Eligibility</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1483\">Candidates who have completed a <strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1420\">3-year diploma program</strong> from a recognized institution are also eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1625\">This provides additional opportunities for diploma students who want to continue higher education in management and business administration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1630\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xfhmya\" data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1661\">Work Experience Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1812\">Although prior work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience may receive an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1848\">Work experience can help students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"2064\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jlik8a\" data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1898\">Understand business concepts more practically</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13cltrg\" data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1946\">Improve managerial and communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"30vfpx\" data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"2001\">Relate academic learning to workplace environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v6x9r8\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2064\">Strengthen career growth opportunities in business sectors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2206\">The online learning format is especially beneficial for working professionals seeking flexible higher education while continuing their jobs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2211\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1mg0vor\" data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2241\">Online BBA Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2349\">The Online BBA program offers flexible learning timelines suitable for students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2452\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2380\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2380\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2369\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2380\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2452\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2421\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2410\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2421\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2452\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2441\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2452\" data-col-size=\"sm\">6 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2614\">The extended maximum duration allows learners to complete the program at a comfortable pace while balancing academics with personal or professional commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"536\">The Online BBA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide affordable and flexible undergraduate management education for students interested in business administration, marketing, finance, entrepreneurship, and corporate management. The university offers multiple payment options, including semester-wise payments, yearly discounts, and zero-cost EMI facilities, making the program accessible for students from different educational and financial backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"715\">The fee structure is planned to support fresh 10+2 graduates, diploma holders, and working professionals seeking flexible online business education from a recognized university.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"720\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1p025p5\" data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"759\">Online BBA Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"869\">Indian students can select from different payment plans based on their convenience and financial preference.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"1035\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"897\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"897\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"887\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"897\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"1035\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"935\">\r\n<td data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"924\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"935\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,375*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n<td data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"951\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"962\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹23,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1001\">\r\n<td data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"990\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1001\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹44,650</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1035\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1022\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1035\">₹1,41,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1059\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1088\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1088\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1078\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1088\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1126\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1126\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1145\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1168\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1347\">The semester-wise payment structure helps students manage educational expenses more comfortably, while the annual payment option provides cost savings through discount benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1352\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1to32b9\" data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1393\">Online BBA Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1539\">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham also offers the Online BBA program for international learners through a separate fee structure for foreign nationals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1677\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1567\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1567\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1557\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1567\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1677\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1593\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1604\">₹28,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1643\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1632\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1643\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹53,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1677\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1664\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1677\">₹1,68,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1701\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1810\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1720\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1810\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1768\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1760\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1768\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1810\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1787\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1810\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1956\">The international fee structure supports global students looking for flexible online undergraduate business education from an Indian university.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1961\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1987\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2220\">One of the major advantages of the Online BBA program is the availability of a <strong data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2092\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> for eligible students. This feature allows learners to pursue higher education without paying the complete tuition fee upfront.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10dg977\" data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2256\">Benefits of EMI Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2447\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vikkm\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2297\">Reduces immediate financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ieravt\" data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2347\">Provides flexible monthly payment convenience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x8czks\" data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2395\">Supports students and working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yg96bh\" data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2447\">Makes online business education more affordable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2532\">The monthly EMI for Indian students starts from approximately <strong data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2531\">₹4,375 per month</strong>.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"388\">The Online BBA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to build strong business, management, leadership, and analytical skills required in the modern corporate world. The curriculum combines core business subjects with practical management concepts, communication training, strategic thinking, and industry-oriented learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"764\">The program is structured across six semesters and gradually develops students&rsquo; understanding of management principles, finance, marketing, operations, entrepreneurship, international business, and organizational leadership. The syllabus also includes electives, research-oriented subjects, sustainability concepts, and internship exposure to improve professional readiness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"943\">The Online BBA program is suitable for students aiming for careers in management, marketing, finance, human resources, operations, entrepreneurship, and business administration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"948\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"m8sljq\" data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1002\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundation of Business and Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1147\">The first semester focuses on introducing students to the fundamentals of business operations, accounting, economics, and communication skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1170\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1328\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozme4o\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1196\">Communicative English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ebawn\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1225\">Principles of Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1250\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dlif4i\" data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1271\">Business and MIS</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g6463g\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1305\">Basic Concepts of Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1328\">Business Economics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1353\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1597\">Students develop foundational knowledge of management principles, accounting systems, business communication, and economic concepts. The semester also strengthens analytical and mathematical understanding required for business decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7mlyw1\" data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1664\">Semester 2 &ndash; Business Systems and Entrepreneurial Learning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1788\">The second semester introduces students to business structures, entrepreneurship, legal systems, and statistical analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1811\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1999\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y6virn\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1842\">Professional Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ew816w\" data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1880\">Business Organization and Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rbjgcc\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1912\">Entrepreneurial Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13kk5be\" data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1957\">Environmental Science and Sustainability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ppdf6v\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1975\">Business Laws</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j6xavf\" data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"1999\">Business Statistics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2024\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2279\">Students understand how organizations function, how businesses are legally regulated, and how entrepreneurial ventures are developed. Business statistics and sustainability concepts also help students improve analytical and responsible business thinking.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2284\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ae6azy\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2349\">Semester 3 &ndash; Marketing, Banking, and Organizational Behaviour</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2483\">The third semester focuses on organizational management, marketing fundamentals, business technology, and financial service sectors.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2506\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2679\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmmd8u\" data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2535\">Organisational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1auxnr8\" data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2576\">Introduction to Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qehge7\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2602\">Banking and Insurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zw7n8o\" data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2636\">Basics of Business Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kg60\" data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2651\">Elective 1</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"skuumi\" data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2679\">Quantitative Techniques</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2704\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2938\">Students learn how employee behavior impacts organizations, how marketing strategies are developed, and how banking and insurance systems operate. Quantitative techniques help improve business analysis and data interpretation skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"3045\">The elective subject allows students to begin specialization-oriented learning based on career interests.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3050\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1stbbl9\" data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3099\">Semester 4 &ndash; Finance, HR, and Research Skills</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3234\">The fourth semester develops advanced management understanding in areas such as finance, operations, marketing, and research methods.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3257\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3450\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o3wjk1\" data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3291\">Advanced Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pyby5\" data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3332\">Basics of Human Resources Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e3zi1y\" data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3369\">Introduction to Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pbto8i\" data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3394\">Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k01zf9\" data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3435\">Production and Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kh23\" data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3450\">Elective 2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3452\" data-end=\"3475\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3709\">Students gain knowledge of financial planning, HR practices, marketing strategies, and operational management systems. Research methods also help learners understand data collection, analysis, and business problem-solving techniques.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3714\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7l6tsy\" data-start=\"3716\" data-end=\"3776\">Semester 5 &ndash; Strategic and International Business Concepts</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3904\">The fifth semester focuses on global business operations, strategic planning, ethics, and sustainable business administration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3906\" data-end=\"3927\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"4135\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a1ycd4\" data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"3968\">Principles of International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19fzvjl\" data-start=\"3969\" data-end=\"4024\">Business Ethics and Corporate Social Responsibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3khui\" data-start=\"4025\" data-end=\"4039\">Elective 3</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kiql\" data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4054\">Elective 4</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fbq1m0\" data-start=\"4055\" data-end=\"4095\">Introduction to Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suxde5\" data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4135\">Sustainable Business Administration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4160\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4161\" data-end=\"4373\">Students understand international trade, corporate ethics, sustainability practices, and long-term business strategy development. The elective subjects allow students to deepen expertise in chosen business areas.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4375\" data-end=\"4468\">This semester also emphasizes socially responsible and ethical business management practices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4473\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"g66tr2\" data-start=\"4475\" data-end=\"4542\">Semester 6 &ndash; Industry Exposure and Advanced Business Applications</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4544\" data-end=\"4676\">The final semester focuses on enterprise systems, supply chain management, specialization subjects, and practical industry exposure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"4678\" data-end=\"4699\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4820\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kjj0\" data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4714\">Elective 5</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kkf3\" data-start=\"4715\" data-end=\"4729\">Elective 6</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kl7i\" data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4744\">Elective 7</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ionq16\" data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4777\">Enterprise Resource Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2eg05\" data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4805\">Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hp4qxs\" data-start=\"4806\" data-end=\"4820\">Internship</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"4822\" data-end=\"4845\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4846\" data-end=\"5082\">Students learn how organizations manage enterprise systems, logistics, and supply chain operations. The internship component provides practical industry exposure and helps students apply business concepts in real corporate environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5084\" data-end=\"5167\">The advanced electives further strengthen career-oriented specialization knowledge.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 141000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(375, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 311, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 02:23:49', '2026-06-17 00:20:47', '<p data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"395\">The admission process for the Online MBA in Artificial Intelligence at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to be simple, flexible, and completely online. The university provides a smooth digital admission experience that allows students and working professionals to apply conveniently from any location.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"571\">The process is structured to help learners quickly begin their journey in management education combined with emerging artificial intelligence and technology-focused learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"576\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"598\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"773\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the Online MBA in Artificial Intelligence program based on career goals, professional interests, and future aspirations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"825\">Before applying, students should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"984\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b9sc1t\" data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"848\">Program curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvng9i\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"873\">Eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr5ji3\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"891\">Fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lvv0qz\" data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"911\">Course duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ff282o\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"942\">AI specialization subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c5w0k5\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"984\">Career opportunities after completion</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1014\">The program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3wcm4\" data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1072\">Graduates interested in AI-driven business management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fo8aup\" data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1134\">Working professionals seeking technology leadership roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qbtcqd\" data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1200\">Learners aiming to build careers in business analytics and AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o6cwd1\" data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1270\">Entrepreneurs interested in digital transformation and innovation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1418\">Choosing the right program helps students align their education with future industry demands and evolving technology-driven business environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1439\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1566\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1618\">The online application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1806\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aakuos\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1655\">Filling out the application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2g8aa\" data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1688\">Uploading academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"enyolz\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1734\">Providing graduation and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o8gevy\" data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1774\">Submitting identification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmgdny\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1806\">Paying the registration fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1934\">The fully digital admission system minimizes paperwork and allows students to complete the process conveniently from anywhere.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"2024\">Final-year students can also apply using the results of their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2029\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2049\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2196\">Once the university verifies the application and confirms eligibility, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2240\">After successful enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2482\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2280\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2317\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13jobrn\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2375\">Participate in projects, assignments, and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kac9ly\" data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2430\">Interact with faculty members and industry mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zni54j\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2482\">Continue learning with flexible study schedules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2645\">The online learning ecosystem is designed to support both academic learning and professional skill development in management and artificial intelligence domains.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"485\">The Online MBA in Artificial Intelligence at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students and professionals who want to build expertise in business management combined with emerging AI technologies. The program is suitable for learners aiming to develop careers in artificial intelligence, business analytics, digital transformation, technology management, and data-driven business operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"723\">The eligibility criteria are structured to ensure that applicants possess the required academic foundation for postgraduate management education while also making the program accessible to graduates from diverse educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"728\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"765\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"891\">Candidates applying for the Online MBA in Artificial Intelligence program must fulfill the following eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cgen7y\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"921\">Minimum Graduation Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1057\">Applicants must secure a minimum of <strong data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"982\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in their undergraduate degree from a recognized university or institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1243\">The program welcomes graduates from different academic disciplines who are interested in combining management education with artificial intelligence and modern technology applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1248\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18awfdb\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1272\">10+2 Qualification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1367\">Candidates must have successfully completed their <strong data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1342\">10+2 education</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1517\">Students from Science, Commerce, Arts, or other educational streams are eligible to apply after completing the required undergraduate qualification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"j3l1bk\" data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1560\">Undergraduate Degree Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1685\">Applicants must have completed an undergraduate degree with a minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1655\">3 years</strong> from a recognized university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1723\">Eligible qualifications may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1817\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1731\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wajosr\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1740\">BCom</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1748\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z4e4a\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1756\">BSc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1763\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ob6kyg\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1776\">BTech/BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"md1hz7\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1817\">Or equivalent undergraduate programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1944\">This flexibility allows students from both technical and non-technical backgrounds to pursue AI-focused management education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1949\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gbi164\" data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1985\">Final-Year Student Eligibility</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2134\">Students appearing for the final year of their undergraduate program can also apply using the marks obtained up to their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2242\">This allows students to secure admission opportunities before the declaration of final graduation results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2247\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xfhmya\" data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2278\">Work Experience Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2429\">Although prior work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience may receive an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2465\">Work experience can help learners:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2700\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r44wvj\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2525\">Understand business applications of AI more effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ymj9vu\" data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2578\">Relate management concepts to industry practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tysonf\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2631\">Improve strategic and analytical thinking skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oakrtb\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2700\">Enhance career growth opportunities in technology-driven sectors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2832\">The online learning format is especially suitable for working professionals seeking career advancement without leaving their jobs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2837\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8jp2ls\" data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2894\">Online MBA in Artificial Intelligence Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"3022\">The program offers flexible learning timelines to support students and professionals with different schedules and commitments.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3125\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3053\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3053\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3053\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3125\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3094\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3083\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3094\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3125\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3114\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3294\">The extended maximum duration allows learners to complete the program at a comfortable pace while balancing academics, work responsibilities, and personal commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"426\">The Online MBA in Artificial Intelligence at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide advanced management education combined with emerging AI and technology-focused learning. The fee structure is planned to support students and working professionals through flexible payment options, yearly discounts, and zero-cost EMI facilities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"660\">The program offers a balanced combination of management studies, business analytics, machine learning concepts, and AI applications, making it suitable for learners aiming to build careers in technology-driven business environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"665\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19fe3he\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"731\">Online MBA in Artificial Intelligence Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"855\">Indian students can choose from multiple payment options based on their financial convenience and preferred learning plan.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"1024\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"883\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"883\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"873\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"883\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"1024\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"922\">\r\n<td data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"910\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"922\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹10,625*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"949\">\r\n<td data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"938\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"949\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹61,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"990\">\r\n<td data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"977\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"990\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,15,900</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1024\">\r\n<td data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1011\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,44,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1048\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1067\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1077\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1115\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1107\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1115\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1134\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1157\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1332\">The semester-wise payment model allows students to manage educational expenses more conveniently, while the yearly payment option provides savings through discount benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ymedq\" data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1405\">Online MBA in Artificial Intelligence Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1541\">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham also offers the program for international learners through a dedicated fee structure for foreign nationals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1569\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1569\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1559\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1606\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1595\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1606\">₹73,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1634\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1647\">₹1,38,700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1668\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1681\">₹2,92,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1705\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1734\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1734\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1724\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1734\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1772\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1764\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1772\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1791\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1814\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1957\">The international fee structure supports global learners interested in AI-integrated business management education from an Indian university.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1988\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2143\">One of the major advantages of the Online MBA in Artificial Intelligence program is the availability of a <strong data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2120\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> for eligible students.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10dg977\" data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2179\">Benefits of EMI Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ybwizg\" data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2216\">Reduces upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ieravt\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2266\">Provides flexible monthly payment convenience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pn9ykf\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2326\">Supports working professionals and self-funded learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2g4azp\" data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2393\">Makes advanced AI-focused management education more accessible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2479\">The monthly EMI for Indian students starts from approximately <strong data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2478\">₹10,625 per month</strong>.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"464\">The Online MBA in Artificial Intelligence at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to combine modern business management education with advanced AI and technology-focused learning. The program helps students develop managerial expertise along with practical understanding of artificial intelligence, machine learning, business analytics, data visualization, and emerging digital technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"864\">The curriculum is structured to prepare students for leadership roles in technology-driven industries where business decisions increasingly depend on automation, analytics, intelligent systems, and data-driven strategies. The program is suitable for graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, and learners aiming to build careers at the intersection of management and artificial intelligence.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"1028\">The syllabus is divided across four semesters and gradually progresses from management fundamentals to advanced AI applications and machine learning technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"rzclm8\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1093\">Semester 1 &ndash; Management Foundations and Technical Basics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1253\">The first semester focuses on building a strong foundation in management principles, organizational behavior, communication, and computer system fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1276\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1511\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wt388f\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1334\">Fundamentals of Management &amp; Organizational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4jl9c\" data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1385\">Human Resources and Organizational Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u3iiww\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1422\">Marketing and Consumer Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xn3dgi\" data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1470\">Elective 1: Foundations of Computer Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvtyp9\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1511\">Soft Skills and Employability Skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1536\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1796\">Students develop understanding of management functions, employee behavior, marketing concepts, and organizational development strategies. The semester also introduces foundational computer system knowledge that supports later AI and machine learning subjects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1920\">Soft skills and employability training help students improve communication, leadership, teamwork, and workplace readiness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1925\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"e1euhf\" data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1995\">Semester 2 &ndash; Business Operations and Machine Learning Introduction</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2132\">The second semester focuses on financial management, operations, strategic decision-making, and introductory machine learning concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2155\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2345\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x28dfq\" data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2176\">Business Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lnxy6g\" data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2219\">Operations and Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jnnti8\" data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2251\">Data-Driven Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzp1lq\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2296\">Business Ethics and Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uqm04r\" data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2345\">Elective 2: Introduction to Machine Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2370\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2661\">Students learn how businesses manage finance, operations, and supply chain systems while making strategic decisions using data analysis techniques. The introduction to machine learning helps students understand the basics of intelligent systems, predictive models, and AI-driven automation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2752\">The semester also emphasizes ethical business practices and long-term strategic planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2757\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1meybm1\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2833\">Semester 3 &ndash; Business Analytics and Artificial Intelligence Applications</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2951\">The third semester focuses on international business, analytics, AI applications, and data visualization techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2974\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3166\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3001\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18jukye\" data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3047\">Business Analytics and Business Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"njlfmn\" data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3108\">Elective 3: Artificial Intelligence and its Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rybsd\" data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3143\">Elective 4: Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2nf5r\" data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3166\">Education for Life</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3191\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3473\">Students gain knowledge of global business operations, business modelling, and analytical decision-making. Artificial intelligence subjects help learners understand how AI technologies are applied across industries such as finance, healthcare, marketing, retail, and manufacturing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3609\">Data visualization concepts help students convert complex business data into meaningful visual insights for strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3734\">The &ldquo;Education for Life&rdquo; component focuses on ethical values, social responsibility, and holistic professional development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3739\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"326nzn\" data-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3801\">Semester 4 &ndash; Advanced AI Technologies and Project Learning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"3923\">The final semester focuses on sustainability, advanced AI specialization subjects, and project-based practical learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3946\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"4120\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6n7ual\" data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3992\">Environment Sustainability and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s1t5st\" data-start=\"3993\" data-end=\"4004\">Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14b3ofd\" data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4046\">Elective 5: Advanced Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u3lv1\" data-start=\"4047\" data-end=\"4090\">Elective 6: Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xj2cpw\" data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4120\">Elective 7: Deep Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4145\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4146\" data-end=\"4385\">Students explore advanced machine learning models, natural language processing systems, and deep learning technologies used in modern AI applications such as chatbots, recommendation systems, speech recognition, and intelligent automation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4387\" data-end=\"4540\">The project component provides practical exposure where students apply management and AI concepts to solve real-world business and technology challenges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4704\">The sustainability and governance subject also helps students understand responsible business leadership and environmental considerations in modern organizations.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 244000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(376, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 312, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 02:42:21', '2026-06-17 00:21:13', '<p data-start=\"69\" data-end=\"355\">The admission process for the Online MBA in ESG at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to be simple, flexible, and completely online. The university provides a smooth digital admission experience that allows students and working professionals to apply conveniently from any location.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"506\">The process is structured to help learners quickly begin their journey in sustainability-focused management education and ESG leadership development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"511\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"533\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"688\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the Online MBA in ESG program based on career goals, professional interests, and future aspirations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"740\">Before applying, students should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b9sc1t\" data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"763\">Program curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvng9i\" data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"788\">Eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr5ji3\" data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"806\">Fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lvv0qz\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"826\">Course duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eto1bt\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"858\">ESG specialization subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c5w0k5\" data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"900\">Career opportunities after completion</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"930\">The program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1209\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w3ogv3\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"996\">Graduates interested in sustainability and governance careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uajzly\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1059\">Working professionals seeking ESG-focused leadership roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dcg9fb\" data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1133\">Learners aiming to build expertise in responsible business management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7y8o5\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1209\">Professionals interested in sustainability consulting and ESG analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1352\">Choosing the right program helps students align their education with future industry demands and sustainability-driven business environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1357\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1373\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1500\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1552\">The online application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1747\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aakuos\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1589\">Filling out the application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2g8aa\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1622\">Uploading academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"enyolz\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1668\">Providing graduation and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0obln\" data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1715\">Submitting identity verification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmgdny\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1747\">Paying the registration fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1875\">The fully digital admission system minimizes paperwork and allows students to complete the process conveniently from anywhere.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1975\">Final-year students can also apply using the marks obtained up to their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"1980\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2000\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2147\">Once the university verifies the application and confirms eligibility, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2191\">After successful enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2424\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2231\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2268\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13jobrn\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2326\">Participate in projects, assignments, and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"li63rw\" data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2372\">Interact with faculty members and mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zni54j\" data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2424\">Continue learning with flexible study schedules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2579\">The online learning ecosystem is designed to support both academic development and professional skill enhancement in ESG and business management domains.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"471\">The Online MBA in ESG at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students and professionals who want to build expertise in Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) practices along with modern business management skills. The program is suitable for learners interested in sustainability management, corporate governance, responsible business leadership, ESG analytics, and ethical business operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"705\">The eligibility criteria are structured to provide flexible admission opportunities for graduates from diverse academic backgrounds while ensuring they possess the required educational foundation for postgraduate management studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"710\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"747\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"853\">Candidates applying for the Online MBA in ESG program must fulfill the following eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cgen7y\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"883\">Minimum Graduation Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"1019\">Applicants must secure a minimum of <strong data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"944\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in their undergraduate degree from a recognized university or institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1178\">The program welcomes graduates from different educational backgrounds who are interested in sustainable business management and ESG-focused leadership roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1183\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18awfdb\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1207\">10+2 Qualification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1302\">Candidates must have successfully completed their <strong data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1277\">10+2 education</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1453\">Students from Science, Commerce, Arts, and other educational streams are eligible to apply after completing the required undergraduate qualification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"j3l1bk\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1496\">Undergraduate Degree Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1621\">Applicants must have completed an undergraduate degree with a minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1591\">3 years</strong> from a recognized university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1659\">Eligible qualifications may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1753\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1667\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wajosr\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1676\">BCom</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1683\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z4e4a\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1691\">BSc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1699\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ob6kyg\" data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1712\">BTech/BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"md1hz7\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1753\">Or equivalent undergraduate programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1881\">This flexibility allows students from both management and non-management backgrounds to pursue ESG-focused business education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1886\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gbi164\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1922\">Final-Year Student Eligibility</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"2060\">Students appearing for the final year of their graduation can also apply using the marks obtained up to their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2164\">This allows learners to secure admission opportunities before the declaration of final degree results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2169\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xfhmya\" data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2200\">Work Experience Advantage</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2345\">Although work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience may receive an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2381\">Work experience can help learners:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2637\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w2u627\" data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2447\">Understand practical sustainability and governance challenges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w3t28\" data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2501\">Relate ESG concepts to real business environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10f9pa\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2561\">Improve strategic and managerial decision-making skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iife8u\" data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2637\">Strengthen career opportunities in corporate and sustainability sectors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2782\">The online learning format is especially beneficial for working professionals seeking flexible higher education while continuing their careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2787\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2rx5aq\" data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2824\">Online MBA in ESG Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2926\">The program offers flexible learning timelines suitable for both students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"3029\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2957\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2957\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2946\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2957\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3029\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"2998\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"2987\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"2998\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3029\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3018\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3029\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3188\">The extended maximum duration allows students to complete the program at a comfortable pace while balancing academic, professional, and personal commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"457\">The Online MBA in ESG at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide advanced management education focused on Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) practices, sustainability management, and responsible business leadership. The fee structure is planned to support students and working professionals through flexible payment options, annual discounts, and zero-cost EMI facilities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"711\">The program combines management education with sustainability-focused business strategies, making it suitable for learners aiming to build careers in ESG consulting, corporate governance, sustainability analytics, and responsible investment management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"716\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lzjqm8\" data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"762\">Online MBA in ESG Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"886\">Indian students can choose from multiple payment options based on their financial convenience and preferred learning plan.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"1052\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"914\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"914\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"904\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"914\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"1052\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<td data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"941\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"952\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹8,625*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<td data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"968\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"979\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹49,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1018\">\r\n<td data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1007\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1018\">₹93,100</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1052\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1039\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1052\">₹1,96,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1076\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1185\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1105\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1105\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1095\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1105\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1185\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1135\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1143\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1185\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1162\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1185\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1359\">The semester-wise payment structure helps students manage educational expenses more comfortably, while the yearly payment option provides savings through discount benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1364\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1rhcxws\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1412\">Online MBA in ESG Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1548\">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham also offers the program for international students through a dedicated fee structure for foreign nationals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1688\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1576\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1576\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1566\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1576\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1688\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1602\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1613\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹59,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1641\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1654\">₹1,12,100</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1688\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1675\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1688\">₹2,36,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1712\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1821\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1741\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1741\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1731\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1741\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1821\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1779\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1771\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1779\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1821\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1798\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1985\">The international fee structure supports global learners interested in ESG-focused business and sustainability education through a flexible online learning model.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"1990\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2016\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2151\">One of the major advantages of the Online MBA in ESG program is the availability of a <strong data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2128\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> for eligible students.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10dg977\" data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2187\">Benefits of EMI Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2406\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ybwizg\" data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2224\">Reduces upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2g8hx4\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2276\">Provides affordable monthly payment flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pn9ykf\" data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2336\">Supports working professionals and self-funded learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mx1p2\" data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2406\">Makes sustainability-focused management education more accessible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2491\">The monthly EMI for Indian students starts from approximately <strong data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2490\">₹8,625 per month</strong>.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"429\">The Online MBA in ESG at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to prepare students and professionals for modern business leadership roles focused on Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) practices. The program combines core management education with sustainability-focused business strategies, responsible governance, ESG analytics, and ethical corporate decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"827\">As organizations across the world increasingly focus on sustainability, corporate responsibility, environmental impact, and governance compliance, the demand for ESG professionals is growing rapidly. This program helps students develop management expertise along with specialized knowledge in sustainable business operations, ESG investment practices, risk management, and responsible leadership.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"975\">The curriculum is structured across four semesters and gradually progresses from management fundamentals to advanced ESG strategies and analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"980\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1reblvf\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1040\">Semester 1 &ndash; Management Foundations and ESG Introduction</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1176\">The first semester focuses on core management principles, organizational behaviour, marketing concepts, and foundational ESG learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1199\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wt388f\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1257\">Fundamentals of Management &amp; Organizational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4jl9c\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1308\">Human Resources and Organizational Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u3iiww\" data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1345\">Marketing and Consumer Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uggsj\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1405\">Elective 1: Business Sustainability and ESG Foundations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvtyp9\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1446\">Soft Skills and Employability Skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1471\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1795\">Students develop a strong understanding of business management, organizational structure, employee management, and consumer behaviour. The ESG foundation subject introduces sustainability concepts, responsible business practices, and the growing importance of environmental and governance standards in modern organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1914\">Soft skills and employability training help improve communication, leadership, teamwork, and professional confidence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1919\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ktpi52\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1985\">Semester 2 &ndash; Strategic Management and Corporate Responsibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2105\">The second semester focuses on finance, operations, strategic business management, and corporate governance practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2128\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2330\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x28dfq\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2149\">Business Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lnxy6g\" data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2192\">Operations and Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jnnti8\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2224\">Data-Driven Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzp1lq\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2269\">Business Ethics and Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tjgcpp\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2330\">Elective 2: Corporate Governance &amp; Social Responsibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2355\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2623\">Students learn financial management, supply chain operations, and strategic business decision-making using data-driven approaches. The corporate governance subject focuses on ethical leadership, social responsibility, transparency, and sustainable corporate policies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2742\">This semester helps students understand how responsible governance practices impact long-term organizational success.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2747\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cfjrms\" data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2808\">Semester 3 &ndash; ESG Applications and Sustainable Investments</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2960\">The third semester focuses on global business operations, ESG integration in business models, sustainability practices, and ESG investment strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2962\" data-end=\"2983\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3160\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3010\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18jukye\" data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3056\">Business Analytics and Business Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zhw4hh\" data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3103\">Elective 3: ESG in Business Sustainability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"inzwgg\" data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3137\">Elective 4: ESG in Investment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2nf5r\" data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3160\">Education for Life</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3185\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3465\">Students explore how ESG principles are applied in international business operations and sustainable corporate strategies. ESG investment concepts help learners understand how investors evaluate organizations based on sustainability, ethical governance, and environmental impact.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3570\">Business analytics and modelling subjects also improve strategic decision-making and analytical skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3695\">The &ldquo;Education for Life&rdquo; component focuses on ethical values, mindfulness, and socially responsible leadership development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3700\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1tpgz3h\" data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3759\">Semester 4 &ndash; Advanced ESG Analytics and Risk Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"3883\">The final semester focuses on sustainability governance, ESG analytics, compliance management, and project-based learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3906\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"4081\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6n7ual\" data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3952\">Environment Sustainability and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s1t5st\" data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"3964\">Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"twirvf\" data-start=\"3965\" data-end=\"4002\">Elective 5: ESG in Key Industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y1dcsi\" data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4032\">Elective 6: ESG Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cbehha\" data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4081\">Elective 7: ESG Risk Management &amp; Compliance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4106\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4375\">Students gain advanced understanding of ESG implementation across industries such as finance, manufacturing, energy, healthcare, and technology. ESG analytics subjects help learners analyze sustainability performance, governance metrics, and environmental impact data.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4377\" data-end=\"4537\">The ESG risk management and compliance subject focuses on identifying regulatory risks, governance challenges, and sustainable business compliance requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4539\" data-end=\"4672\">The project component provides practical exposure where students apply ESG and management concepts to real-world business situations.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 196000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(377, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 313, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 02:59:42', '2026-06-17 00:21:38', '<p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"397\">The admission process for the Online BCom in International Finance and Accounting at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to be simple, flexible, and completely online. The university provides a smooth digital admission experience that allows students to apply conveniently from any location.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"600\">The process is structured to help learners quickly begin their journey in accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, and international financial management through a flexible online learning environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"605\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"627\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"812\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the Online BCom in International Finance and Accounting program based on career goals, academic interests, and future aspirations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"864\">Before applying, students should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"1029\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b9sc1t\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"887\">Program curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvng9i\" data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"912\">Eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr5ji3\" data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"930\">Fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lvv0qz\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"950\">Course duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ce2ais\" data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"991\">ACCA-oriented learning opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1prktmh\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1029\">Career prospects after graduation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1059\">The program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1364\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wqpnq9\" data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1117\">Students interested in accounting and finance careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18cprl4\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1169\">Learners planning to pursue ACCA qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13dp2kg\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1226\">Diploma holders seeking higher education in commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vxy3ve\" data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1294\">Students aiming for global finance and accounting opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wqgx26\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1364\">Working professionals planning career growth in financial sectors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1533\">Choosing the right program helps students align their education with future career opportunities in accounting, auditing, banking, taxation, and international finance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1538\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1554\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1681\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1733\">The online application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1929\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aakuos\" data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1770\">Filling out the application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2g8aa\" data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1803\">Uploading academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1402cq0\" data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1850\">Providing personal and educational details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0obln\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1897\">Submitting identity verification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmgdny\" data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1929\">Paying the registration fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"2056\">The fully online admission system minimizes paperwork and allows students to complete the process conveniently from anywhere.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2185\">Candidates with marks below the direct admission criteria may also undergo a short interview as part of the evaluation process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2190\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2210\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2357\">Once the university verifies the application and confirms eligibility, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2401\">After successful enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2634\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2441\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2478\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mok3bn\" data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2536\">Participate in assignments, projects, and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"li63rw\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2582\">Interact with faculty members and mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zni54j\" data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2634\">Continue learning with flexible study schedules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2782\">The online learning ecosystem is designed to support both academic development and professional skill enhancement in commerce and finance domains.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"445\">The Online BCom with ACCA at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students who want to build strong expertise in accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, and international financial reporting. The program is suitable for learners aiming to develop careers in corporate finance, banking, accounting services, investment management, and global financial operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"687\">The eligibility criteria are structured to provide flexible admission opportunities for students from different academic backgrounds while ensuring they possess the required foundational qualifications for commerce and accounting education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"729\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"839\">Candidates applying for the Online BCom with ACCA program must fulfill the following eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a7tjrd\" data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"870\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"992\">Candidates with an aggregate minimum of <strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"925\">55% marks</strong> in their qualifying examination are eligible for direct admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1168\">Applicants scoring below 55% marks may also be considered for admission after successfully completing a short interview conducted as part of the admission evaluation process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1323\">This flexible admission approach allows deserving students from different academic backgrounds to access commerce and accounting education opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1328\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vbakrz\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1350\">10+2 Qualification</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1445\">Candidates must have successfully completed their <strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1420\">10+2 education</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1487\">Students from different streams such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4h0lx\" data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1500\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y83j8c\" data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1512\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wkddks\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1521\">Arts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1561\">are eligible to apply for the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1700\">The program is especially beneficial for students interested in accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, and business management careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1705\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"d8ymbl\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1735\">Diploma Holder Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1867\">Candidates who have completed a <strong data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1795\">3-year diploma program</strong> from a recognized institution are also eligible to apply for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"2024\">This creates additional higher education opportunities for diploma holders who want to continue their studies in commerce, accounting, and finance domains.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2029\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aur382\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2058\">Work Experience Advantage</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2226\">Although work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience may receive an added advantage during the admission process for BCom in Accounting.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2262\">Work experience can help students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zxxfbj\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2328\">Understand financial and accounting concepts more practically</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsbzy0\" data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2389\">Improve professional communication and analytical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"akv6oj\" data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2448\">Relate academic learning to real business environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"twowbg\" data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2523\">Strengthen career growth opportunities in commerce and finance sectors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2663\">The flexible online learning format is especially suitable for working professionals seeking higher education while continuing their jobs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1roal3f\" data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2709\">Online BCom with ACCA Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2806\">The program offers flexible learning timelines suitable for students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2909\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2837\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2837\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2826\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2837\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2909\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2878\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2867\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2878\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2909\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2898\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2909\">6 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"470\">The Online BCom in International Finance and Accounting at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide industry-oriented education in accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, and global financial management. The program integrates commerce education with ACCA-oriented learning, helping students develop internationally relevant financial and accounting expertise.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"683\">The fee structure is planned to support students through flexible payment options, yearly discounts, and zero-cost EMI facilities, making the program accessible for both fresh learners and working professionals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"688\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"a5li9w\" data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"768\">Online BCom in International Finance and Accounting Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"890\">Indian students can select from different payment options based on their convenience and financial planning preferences.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"1056\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"918\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"918\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"908\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"918\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1056\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"956\">\r\n<td data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"945\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"956\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹7,208*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"983\">\r\n<td data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"972\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"983\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹40,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1022\">\r\n<td data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1011\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1022\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹76,950</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1056\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1043\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1056\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,43,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1080\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1099\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1147\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1139\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1147\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1166\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1189\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1363\">The semester-wise payment model allows students to manage educational expenses more comfortably, while the annual payment option provides savings through discount benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1368\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14kodew\" data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1450\">Online BCom in International Finance and Accounting Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1585\">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham also offers the program for international learners through a separate fee structure for foreign nationals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1603\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1613\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1650\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1639\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1650\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹49,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1678\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1689\">₹93,100</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1710\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,49,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1747\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1856\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1776\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1776\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1766\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1776\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1856\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1806\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1814\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1856\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1833\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1856\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"2003\">The international fee structure supports global learners interested in finance and accounting education through a flexible online learning model.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1udxi39\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2043\">ACCA Additional Fee Information</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2108\">Students pursuing the ACCA-integrated pathway should note that:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2181\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13qs0cs\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2135\">ACCA registration fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uqgvcr\" data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2181\">ACCA non-exemption paper examination fees</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2242\">must be paid separately and directly to ACCA as applicable.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2383\">These charges are independent of the university tuition fee structure and may vary according to ACCA policies and examination requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2388\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2414\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2583\">One of the major advantages of the Online BCom in International Finance and Accounting program is the availability of a <strong data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2560\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> for eligible students.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10dg977\" data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2619\">Benefits of EMI Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2824\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ybwizg\" data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2656\">Reduces upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ieravt\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2706\">Provides flexible monthly payment convenience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ra8z9\" data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2766\">Supports self-funded students and working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j9tkyu\" data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2824\">Makes international finance education more affordable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2909\">The monthly EMI for Indian students starts from approximately <strong data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2908\">₹7,208 per month</strong>.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"413\">The Online BCom with ACCA at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide students with strong expertise in commerce, accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, and international financial management. The program combines traditional commerce education with ACCA-oriented subjects, helping students build globally relevant accounting and financial skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"799\">The curriculum is structured to prepare students for careers in accounting, auditing, taxation, banking, financial analysis, investment management, and corporate finance. The program also focuses on international accounting standards, financial reporting systems, taxation laws, and business management concepts that are highly valued in modern corporate and global financial sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"995\">The syllabus is divided across six semesters and gradually progresses from commerce fundamentals to advanced accounting, financial management, auditing, taxation, and corporate finance concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1000\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"gp65ez\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1063\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundation of Commerce and Business Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1197\">The first semester focuses on introducing students to accounting principles, management concepts, mathematics, and business systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1220\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1380\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozme4o\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1246\">Communicative English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bavhoc\" data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1262\">Accountancy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ebawn\" data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1291\">Principles of Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g6463g\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1325\">Basic Concepts of Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dlif4i\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1346\">Business and MIS</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bjou3c\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1380\">Economics for Decision Making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1405\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1635\">Students develop foundational knowledge in accounting, economics, management principles, and business information systems. The semester also improves communication and analytical skills essential for commerce and finance careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1788\">The subject &ldquo;Economics for Decision Making&rdquo; helps students understand economic principles used in business planning and organizational decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1793\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1yg0201\" data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1846\">Semester 2 &ndash; Advanced Accounting and Business Law</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1968\">The second semester focuses on advanced accounting systems, legal frameworks, costing methods, and statistical analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"1991\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2184\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y6virn\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2022\">Professional Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xgegte\" data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2047\">Advanced Accountancy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mcurrp\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2063\">Company Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18kavi7\" data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2111\">Business Statistics and Operations Research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13kk5be\" data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2156\">Environmental Science and Sustainability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rckc0u\" data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2184\">Fundamentals of Costing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2209\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2448\">Students gain deeper understanding of accounting systems, business laws, costing concepts, and quantitative business analysis techniques. Company law introduces legal regulations governing corporate organizations and financial operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2579\">The semester also develops analytical and operational decision-making abilities important for commerce and finance professionals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2584\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"13ti0zi\" data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2643\">Semester 3 &ndash; Corporate Accounting and Financial Systems</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2760\">The third semester focuses on banking, taxation, financial reporting standards, and management accounting concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2783\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2968\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"31l6dm\" data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2808\">Corporate Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u3ddbd\" data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2842\">Insurance and Risk Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cjp643\" data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"2866\">Introduction to GST</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6z7ji\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2878\">Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jccnay\" data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2904\">Management Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"581hye\" data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2968\">Introduction to International Financial Reporting Standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"2993\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3280\">Students learn corporate accounting practices, banking operations, GST concepts, and risk management strategies. The introduction to International Financial Reporting Standards (IFRS) helps students understand globally accepted accounting frameworks used by multinational organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3404\">Management accounting subjects also help learners understand budgeting, cost control, and business performance evaluation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3409\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"4l4rtp\" data-start=\"3411\" data-end=\"3481\">Semester 4 &ndash; Auditing, Financial Management, and Accounting Software</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3623\">The fourth semester focuses on auditing principles, financial management, accounting software applications, and legal compliance procedures.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3646\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3909\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"41uwq8\" data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3686\">Auditing &ndash; Principles and Practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sc04vv\" data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3703\">Elective A 3</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqhhik\" data-start=\"3704\" data-end=\"3741\">Introduction to Research Projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19s8kji\" data-start=\"3742\" data-end=\"3780\">Principles of Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b6aa1r\" data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3812\">Accounting Packages &ndash; Tally</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nzxsgz\" data-start=\"3813\" data-end=\"3832\">Mercantile Laws</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i5wxu8\" data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3868\">Accounting Packages &ndash; Tally Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bomny4\" data-start=\"3869\" data-end=\"3909\">Customs Law &ndash; Practice and Procedure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3911\" data-end=\"3934\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"4211\">Students gain practical understanding of auditing systems, financial planning, accounting software operations, and business law procedures. Tally software training helps students develop industry-relevant accounting software skills widely used in commerce and finance sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4213\" data-end=\"4299\">The research project component also improves analytical and problem-solving abilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4301\" data-end=\"4304\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1j7sz4r\" data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4362\">Semester 5 &ndash; Investment and Corporate Finance Learning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4364\" data-end=\"4475\">The fifth semester focuses on investment strategies, capital markets, taxation systems, and financial services.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"4477\" data-end=\"4498\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4499\" data-end=\"4659\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i66lsh\" data-start=\"4499\" data-end=\"4541\">Capital Markets and Financial Services</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xh3osa\" data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4567\">Investment Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tz8fnn\" data-start=\"4568\" data-end=\"4589\">Corporate Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sfhi2g\" data-start=\"4590\" data-end=\"4606\">Elective B 3</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sdevnd\" data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4623\">Elective C 3</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iq8cg4\" data-start=\"4624\" data-end=\"4659\">Direct Taxes and Indirect Taxes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"4661\" data-end=\"4684\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4685\" data-end=\"4955\">Students learn how capital markets operate, how investment portfolios are managed, and how businesses handle corporate financial planning. Taxation subjects provide understanding of direct and indirect tax systems applicable in business and corporate finance operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4957\" data-end=\"5068\">The elective subjects allow students to strengthen specialization-oriented knowledge based on career interests.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5070\" data-end=\"5073\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9tajq2\" data-start=\"5075\" data-end=\"5133\">Semester 6 &ndash; Entrepreneurship and Project-Based Learning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5135\" data-end=\"5252\">The final semester focuses on entrepreneurship development, advanced electives, and project-based practical learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"5254\" data-end=\"5275\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5276\" data-end=\"5370\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sett4v\" data-start=\"5276\" data-end=\"5292\">Elective E 3</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sib6bg\" data-start=\"5293\" data-end=\"5309\">Elective F 3</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rbjgcc\" data-start=\"5310\" data-end=\"5341\">Entrepreneurial Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sgwfjy\" data-start=\"5342\" data-end=\"5358\">Elective D 3</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s1t5st\" data-start=\"5359\" data-end=\"5370\">Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"5372\" data-end=\"5395\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5396\" data-end=\"5638\">Students develop entrepreneurial thinking, business planning abilities, and practical project implementation skills. The project component allows learners to apply accounting, finance, and management concepts to real-world business scenarios.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5640\" data-end=\"5736\">Advanced electives help students strengthen expertise in specialized commerce and finance areas.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 243000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(378, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 314, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 03:18:56', '2026-06-17 00:22:02', '<p data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"417\">The admission process for the Online MBA in International Finance and Accounting at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to be simple, flexible, and completely online. The university provides a smooth digital admission experience that allows students and working professionals to apply conveniently from anywhere.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"629\">The process is structured to help learners quickly begin their journey in international finance, accounting, auditing, taxation, and strategic business management through a flexible online learning environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"634\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"656\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"844\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the Online MBA in International Finance and Accounting program based on career goals, professional interests, and future aspirations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"896\">Before applying, students should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"1075\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b9sc1t\" data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"919\">Program curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvng9i\" data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"944\">Eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr5ji3\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"962\">Fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lvv0qz\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"982\">Course duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4rey4q\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1033\">Finance and accounting specialization subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c5w0k5\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1075\">Career opportunities after completion</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1105\">The program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16lokd\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1164\">Graduates interested in finance and accounting careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qflsvq\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1236\">Working professionals seeking leadership roles in financial sectors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iusfu5\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1298\">Learners aiming for multinational corporate opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16nb7g7\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1378\">Students interested in auditing, taxation, and strategic finance management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ffqbko\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1447\">Professionals planning careers in banking and investment sectors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1595\">Choosing the right program helps students align their education with future opportunities in global finance and corporate management environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1600\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1616\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1743\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1795\">The online application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1990\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aakuos\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1832\">Filling out the application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2g8aa\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1865\">Uploading academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"enyolz\" data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1911\">Providing graduation and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0obln\" data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1958\">Submitting identity verification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmgdny\" data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1990\">Paying the registration fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2122\">The fully digital admission system minimizes paperwork and allows students to complete the process conveniently from any location.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2212\">Final-year students can also apply using the results of their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2217\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2237\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2384\">Once the university verifies the application and confirms eligibility, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2428\">After successful enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2661\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2468\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2505\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mok3bn\" data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2563\">Participate in assignments, projects, and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"li63rw\" data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2609\">Interact with faculty members and mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zni54j\" data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2661\">Continue learning with flexible study schedules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2821\">The online learning ecosystem is designed to support both academic learning and professional skill development in finance, accounting, and management domains.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"561\">The Online MBA in International Finance with ACCA at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students and professionals who want to build expertise in global finance, accounting, taxation, auditing, financial reporting, and strategic business management. The program is suitable for learners aiming to develop careers in corporate finance, international accounting, investment management, banking, financial consulting, and multinational business operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"809\">The eligibility criteria are structured to provide flexible admission opportunities for graduates from diverse academic backgrounds while ensuring they possess the required educational foundation for postgraduate management and finance education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"814\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"851\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"985\">Candidates applying for the Online MBA in International Finance with ACCA program must fulfill the following eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cgen7y\" data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1015\">Minimum Graduation Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1151\">Applicants must secure a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1076\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in their undergraduate degree from a recognized university or institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1308\">The program welcomes graduates from multiple academic disciplines who are interested in international finance, accounting, and business management careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vbakrz\" data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1335\">10+2 Qualification</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1430\">Candidates must have successfully completed their <strong data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1405\">10+2 education</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1581\">Students from Science, Commerce, Arts, and other educational streams are eligible to apply after completing the required undergraduate qualification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1586\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1eg6nv4\" data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1622\">Undergraduate Degree Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1747\">Applicants must have completed an undergraduate degree with a minimum duration of <strong data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1717\">3 years</strong> from a recognized university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1785\">Eligible qualifications may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1879\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wajosr\" data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1794\">BCom</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1802\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1810\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1817\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z4e4a\" data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1825\">BSc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ob6kyg\" data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1838\">BTech/BE</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"md1hz7\" data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1879\">Or equivalent undergraduate programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"2014\">This flexibility allows students from both commerce and non-commerce backgrounds to pursue advanced finance and management education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2019\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ybnbik\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2053\">Final-Year Student Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2202\">Students appearing for the final year of their undergraduate program can also apply using the marks obtained up to their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2315\">This provides students an opportunity to begin the admission process before receiving final graduation results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2320\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aur382\" data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2349\">Work Experience Advantage</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2494\">Although work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience may receive an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2530\">Work experience can help learners:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2801\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dejs9c\" data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2606\">Understand practical financial and business operations more effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mlusbr\" data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2668\">Relate management concepts to real corporate environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oki9nr\" data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2731\">Improve analytical and strategic decision-making abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ua4fxt\" data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2801\">Strengthen career opportunities in finance and accounting sectors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2945\">The flexible online learning model is especially beneficial for working professionals seeking higher education while continuing their careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2950\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"vbf5rn\" data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"3015\">Online MBA in International Finance with ACCA Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3117\">The program offers flexible learning timelines suitable for both students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3220\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3148\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3148\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3137\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3148\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3220\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3189\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3178\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3220\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3209\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3220\">4 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3397\">The extended maximum duration allows learners to complete the program at a comfortable pace while balancing academics, professional commitments, and personal responsibilities.</p>', '<p data-start=\"99\" data-end=\"583\">The Online MBA in International Finance and Accounting at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide advanced management education combined with global finance, accounting, auditing, taxation, and strategic financial reporting expertise. The program integrates MBA-level business management learning with internationally relevant finance and accounting concepts, making it suitable for students and professionals aiming to build careers in multinational financial environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"806\">The fee structure is planned to provide flexibility, affordability, and convenient payment options for both Indian and international students through semester-wise payments, annual discounts, and zero-cost EMI facilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"811\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"dchbzd\" data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"890\">Online MBA in International Finance and Accounting Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"1018\">Indian students can select from different payment plans based on their financial convenience and preferred learning structure.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1046\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1046\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1036\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1046\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1085\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1073\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1085\">₹11,292*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1112\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1112\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹65,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1153\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1140\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1153\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,23,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1174\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1187\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,60,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1211\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1240\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1240\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1230\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1240\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1270\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1278\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1297\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1320\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1499\">The semester-wise fee structure allows students to manage educational expenses more comfortably, while the yearly payment option provides cost savings through discount benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1504\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"az66x1\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1585\">Online MBA in International Finance and Accounting Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1721\">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham also offers the program for international learners through a dedicated fee structure for foreign nationals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1861\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1749\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1749\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1739\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1861\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1786\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1775\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1786\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹76,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1827\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1814\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1827\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,44,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1861\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1848\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1861\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,04,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1885\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1994\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1914\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1914\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1904\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1914\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1994\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1952\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1944\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1952\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1994\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1971\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1994\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2156\">The international fee structure supports global learners interested in advanced finance and accounting education through a flexible online learning environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2161\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2187\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2355\">One of the major advantages of the Online MBA in International Finance and Accounting program is the availability of a <strong data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2332\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> for eligible students.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10dg977\" data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2391\">Benefits of EMI Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2593\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kvtcc3\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2430\">Reduces upfront financial pressure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpntc3\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2482\">Provides convenient monthly payment flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pn9ykf\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2542\">Supports working professionals and self-funded learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ygtib\" data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2593\">Makes global finance education more accessible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2679\">The monthly EMI for Indian students starts from approximately <strong data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2678\">₹11,292 per month</strong>.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"487\">The Online MBA in International Finance with ACCA at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide advanced management education combined with global finance, accounting, taxation, auditing, and strategic financial reporting expertise. The program integrates core MBA subjects with ACCA-oriented finance and accounting modules, helping students build internationally relevant financial management skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"910\">The curriculum is structured to prepare learners for leadership roles in banking, investment management, corporate finance, auditing, taxation, international accounting, and global business operations. The program is especially beneficial for students and working professionals aiming to build careers in multinational organizations, financial consulting firms, banking institutions, and global corporate finance sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1088\">The syllabus is divided across four semesters and gradually progresses from management fundamentals to advanced international finance and strategic business reporting concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1093\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1fro7vb\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1159\">Semester 1 &ndash; Management Fundamentals and Financial Performance</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1309\">The first semester focuses on building a strong foundation in management, organizational behaviour, marketing, and financial performance management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1332\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wt388f\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1390\">Fundamentals of Management &amp; Organizational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4jl9c\" data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1441\">Human Resources and Organizational Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u3iiww\" data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1478\">Marketing and Consumer Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sij5s\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1527\">Elective 1: Financial Performance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvtyp9\" data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1568\">Soft Skills and Employability Skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1593\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1867\">Students develop understanding of management functions, organizational structures, employee management, and marketing strategies. The financial performance management subject introduces concepts related to business financial evaluation, budgeting, and performance analysis.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1982\">Soft skills and employability training help improve communication, leadership, teamwork, and workplace readiness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"1987\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"10daagd\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2057\">Semester 2 &ndash; Financial Reporting and Strategic Business Operations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2173\">The second semester focuses on finance management, operations, business strategy, and financial reporting systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2196\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2373\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x28dfq\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2217\">Business Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lnxy6g\" data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2260\">Operations and Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jnnti8\" data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2292\">Data-Driven Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzp1lq\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2337\">Business Ethics and Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vl6r9i\" data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2373\">Elective 2: Financial Reporting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2398\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2669\">Students gain knowledge of corporate finance, operational planning, supply chain systems, and data-driven business decision-making. The financial reporting subject focuses on preparation and interpretation of financial statements using professional accounting standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2767\">The semester also emphasizes ethical business practices and strategic organizational management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2772\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wmpong\" data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2834\">Semester 3 &ndash; International Finance, Taxation, and Auditing</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2955\">The third semester focuses on global business operations, taxation systems, auditing standards, and business analytics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2978\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3143\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3005\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18jukye\" data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3051\">Business Analytics and Business Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mc65st\" data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3081\">Elective 3: Taxation &ndash; UK</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i1edim\" data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3120\">Elective 4: Auditing and Assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2nf5r\" data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3143\">Education for Life</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3168\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3418\">Students explore international business environments, analytical business modelling, and cross-border financial operations. The UK taxation subject introduces global taxation concepts and compliance systems relevant to international finance careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3592\">Auditing and assurance subjects help students understand financial audits, corporate compliance, risk assessment, and internal control systems used in modern organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3715\">The &ldquo;Education for Life&rdquo; component focuses on ethical values, social responsibility, and holistic leadership development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3720\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"nv3b0g\" data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"3787\">Semester 4 &ndash; Advanced Financial Strategy and Business Reporting</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3896\">The final semester focuses on sustainability, strategic finance, corporate law, and project-based learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3919\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3920\" data-end=\"4102\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6n7ual\" data-start=\"3920\" data-end=\"3965\">Environment Sustainability and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s1t5st\" data-start=\"3966\" data-end=\"3977\">Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uw7al8\" data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"4014\">Elective 5: Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tcykxd\" data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4057\">Elective 6: Corporate and Business Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aezz5w\" data-start=\"4058\" data-end=\"4102\">Elective 7: Strategic Business Reporting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"4104\" data-end=\"4127\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4128\" data-end=\"4422\">Students gain advanced understanding of financial management strategies, business law regulations, and strategic financial reporting frameworks. The strategic business reporting subject focuses on analyzing complex financial reports and making informed financial decisions at leadership levels.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4424\" data-end=\"4574\">The project component provides practical exposure where students apply finance and management concepts to real-world business and financial scenarios.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4692\">The sustainability and governance subject also helps learners understand responsible corporate management practices.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 260000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(379, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 265, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 04:33:20', '2026-05-14 04:33:20', '<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"387\">The admission process for the Online MCom in Finance &amp; Accounting at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to be simple, flexible, and fully online. The university provides a streamlined digital admission system that allows students and working professionals to apply conveniently from any location.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"595\">The process is structured to help learners quickly begin their academic journey in accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, and international business finance through a flexible online learning environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"600\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"622\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"798\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the Online MCom in Finance &amp; Accounting program based on academic interests, career goals, and future professional plans.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"850\">Before applying, students should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"1029\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b9sc1t\" data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"873\">Program curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvng9i\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"898\">Eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr5ji3\" data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"916\">Fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lvv0qz\" data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"936\">Course duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4rey4q\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"987\">Finance and accounting specialization subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c5w0k5\" data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1029\">Career opportunities after completion</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1059\">The program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"119pp87\" data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1117\">Commerce graduates seeking advanced finance education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uxopsz\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1178\">Working professionals in accounting and taxation sectors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fj0etq\" data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1244\">Students interested in auditing and corporate finance careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hoyxlq\" data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1308\">Learners aiming for banking and investment management roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zwm0wy\" data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1382\">Professionals planning career growth in financial services industries</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1516\">Choosing the right program helps students align their education with long-term career opportunities in finance and commerce sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1537\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1664\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1716\">The online application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1911\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aakuos\" data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1753\">Filling out the application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2g8aa\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1786\">Uploading academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"enyolz\" data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1832\">Providing graduation and personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0obln\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1879\">Submitting identity verification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmgdny\" data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1911\">Paying the registration fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"2050\">The digital admission system reduces paperwork and allows students to complete the entire application process conveniently from anywhere.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2140\">Final-year students can also apply using the results of their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2165\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2312\">Once the university verifies the application and confirms eligibility, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2356\">After successful enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2598\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2396\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2433\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mok3bn\" data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2491\">Participate in assignments, projects, and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43c8qh\" data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2546\">Interact with faculty members and academic mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zni54j\" data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2598\">Continue learning with flexible study schedules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2743\">The online learning ecosystem is designed to support both academic growth and professional skill development in finance and accounting domains.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"517\">The Online MCom in Finance &amp; Accounting at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students and professionals who want to build advanced expertise in accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, financial reporting, and international business finance. The program is suitable for learners aiming to develop careers in corporate finance, banking, accounting services, taxation, auditing, investment management, and financial consulting.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"765\">The eligibility criteria are structured to provide flexible admission opportunities for graduates from different academic backgrounds while ensuring they possess the required educational foundation for postgraduate commerce and finance education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"770\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"807\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"931\">Candidates applying for the Online MCom in Finance &amp; Accounting program must fulfill the following eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cgen7y\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"961\">Minimum Graduation Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1097\">Applicants must secure a minimum of <strong data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1022\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in their undergraduate degree from a recognized university or institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1287\">The eligibility structure allows graduates interested in finance, accounting, taxation, and auditing careers to pursue advanced commerce education through a flexible online learning model.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2bml5b\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1333\">Educational Qualification Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1379\">Candidates must have successfully completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1510\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18w9ghj\" data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1424\">10 + 2 education from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvjw1g\" data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1510\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with a minimum duration of 3 years from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1562\">Eligible undergraduate qualifications may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1636\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wajosr\" data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1571\">BCom</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1579\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1586\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z4e4a\" data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1594\">BSc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1602\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14q3bze\" data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1636\">Or equivalent degree programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1744\">This flexibility allows students from both commerce and non-commerce backgrounds to apply for the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1749\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ybnbik\" data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1783\">Final-Year Student Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1928\">Students appearing for the final year of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree can also apply using the marks obtained up to their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"2047\">This provides students an opportunity to begin the admission process before receiving their final graduation results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2052\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aur382\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2081\">Work Experience Advantage</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2259\">Although work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience may receive an added advantage during the admission process for MCom in Accounts and Finance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2295\">Work experience can help learners:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2577\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v7ak7q\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2371\">Understand practical accounting and finance operations more effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dlp910\" data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2430\">Relate academic concepts to real business environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ni91x0\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2501\">Improve financial analysis and strategic decision-making abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6hmzoi\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2577\">Strengthen career growth opportunities in finance and corporate sectors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2713\">The online learning format is especially beneficial for working professionals seeking higher education while continuing their careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2718\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hixrm6\" data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2773\">Online MCom in Finance &amp; Accounting Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2870\">The program offers flexible learning timelines suitable for students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2973\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2901\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2901\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2890\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2901\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2973\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2942\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2931\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2942\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"2973\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"2962\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2962\" data-end=\"2973\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3150\">The extended maximum duration allows learners to complete the program at a comfortable pace while balancing academics, professional commitments, and personal responsibilities.</p>', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"458\">The Online MCom in Finance &amp; Accounting at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide advanced education in accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, financial reporting, and international business finance. The program combines theoretical commerce knowledge with practical financial management and analytical skills required in modern corporate and financial sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"655\">The fee structure is planned to provide affordability and flexibility for students and working professionals through semester-wise payment options, annual discounts, and zero-cost EMI facilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"660\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1k6r7ks\" data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"724\">Online MCom in Finance &amp; Accounting Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"852\">Indian students can choose from multiple payment options based on their financial convenience and preferred payment structure.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"1018\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"880\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"880\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"870\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"880\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"1018\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"918\">\r\n<td data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"907\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"918\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹5,458*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"945\">\r\n<td data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"934\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"945\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹30,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"984\">\r\n<td data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"973\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"984\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹57,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1018\">\r\n<td data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1005\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1018\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,20,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1042\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1151\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1071\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1071\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1061\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1071\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1151\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1151\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1128\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1151\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1334\">The semester-wise payment structure helps students manage educational expenses more comfortably, while the yearly payment option offers additional savings through discount benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1339\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1k5h3jk\" data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1405\">Online MCom in Finance &amp; Accounting Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1540\">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham also offers the program for international learners through a separate fee structure for foreign nationals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1678\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1558\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1568\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1678\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1605\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1594\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1605\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹36,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1644\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1633\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1644\">₹68,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1678\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1665\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1678\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,44,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1702\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1731\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1731\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1721\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1731\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1761\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1769\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1788\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1973\">The international fee structure supports global learners interested in advanced finance and accounting education through a flexible online learning environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"1978\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2004\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2157\">One of the major advantages of the Online MCom in Finance &amp; Accounting program is the availability of a <strong data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2134\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> for eligible students.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10dg977\" data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2193\">Benefits of EMI Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2399\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rttxl\" data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2232\">Reduces immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpntc3\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2284\">Provides convenient monthly payment flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pn9ykf\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2344\">Supports working professionals and self-funded learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1duud7p\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2399\">Makes higher education more financially accessible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2484\">The monthly EMI for Indian students starts from approximately <strong data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2483\">₹5,458 per month</strong>.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"514\">The Online MCom in International Finance at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide advanced knowledge in accounting, global finance, taxation, auditing, financial reporting, analytics, and corporate governance. The program combines traditional commerce education with modern financial technologies, data analytics, and international business finance concepts to prepare students for careers in global financial and corporate sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"934\">The curriculum is structured to help learners develop expertise in advanced accounting systems, auditing standards, taxation regulations, portfolio management, financial analysis, and enterprise resource planning. The program is suitable for commerce graduates, finance professionals, accountants, auditors, and learners planning careers in banking, corporate finance, taxation, and international financial management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"1122\">The syllabus is divided across four semesters and gradually progresses from management fundamentals to advanced finance, auditing, taxation, and international business analysis concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1127\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7ljlm4\" data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1198\">Semester 1 &ndash; Management Foundations and Financial Technology Basics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1355\">The first semester focuses on management concepts, organizational behaviour, marketing, and foundational technical skills in programming and data handling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1378\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1620\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wt388f\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1436\">Fundamentals of Management &amp; Organizational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4jl9c\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1487\">Human Resources and Organizational Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u3iiww\" data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1524\">Marketing and Consumer Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ch08st\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1579\">Elective 1: Python Programming &amp; Data Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvtyp9\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1620\">Soft Skills and Employability Skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1645\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1971\">Students develop understanding of management principles, organizational systems, marketing strategies, and professional communication skills. The Python programming and data fundamentals subject introduces learners to basic programming concepts and data handling techniques increasingly used in finance and analytics sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2086\">Soft skills and employability training help improve leadership, teamwork, communication, and workplace readiness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2091\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xh7vnf\" data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2152\">Semester 2 &ndash; Advanced Finance, Accounting, and Governance</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2303\">The second semester focuses on advanced accounting systems, financial management, auditing, predictive analytics, and corporate governance practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2326\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2543\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"crgteu\" data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2366\">Accounting for Managerial Decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"623sq4\" data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2400\">Advanced Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5ebms1\" data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2418\">Corporate Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"co5vg4\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2452\">Advanced Accounting Tally Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xzd9sp\" data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2477\">Predictive Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t5ziyt\" data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2502\">Corporate Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5apfgu\" data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2543\">Advanced Auditing and Attestation II</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2568\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2825\">Students gain deeper understanding of managerial accounting, financial planning, auditing procedures, and corporate legal frameworks. Predictive analytics subjects help learners analyze financial data for business forecasting and strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2989\">Practical exposure to Tally software also helps students develop industry-relevant accounting software skills used in corporate finance and accounting operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"2994\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"cw0lg2\" data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3065\">Semester 3 &ndash; Taxation, Investment Management, and Advanced Auditing</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3218\">The third semester focuses on taxation systems, investment management, entrepreneurship, enterprise resource planning, and advanced auditing standards.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3241\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3567\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18i0qh1\" data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3266\">Corporate Income Tax</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d0bbpq\" data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3313\">Security Analysis and Portfolio Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wa534m\" data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3354\">Enterprise Resource Planning and MIS</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hxb17\" data-start=\"3355\" data-end=\"3394\">Small Business and Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wr0nwn\" data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3436\">Advanced Auditing and Attestation III</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5apgcx\" data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3477\">Advanced Auditing and Attestation IV</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7w5blc\" data-start=\"3478\" data-end=\"3516\">Advanced Taxation and Regulation I</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e1la3o\" data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3567\">Advanced Financial Accounting and Reporting IV</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3592\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3593\" data-end=\"3908\">Students learn corporate taxation systems, portfolio management strategies, investment analysis techniques, and financial reporting frameworks. Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) and Management Information Systems (MIS) subjects help learners understand integrated business operations and digital financial systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"4021\">Entrepreneurship subjects also help students understand business development and startup management principles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4023\" data-end=\"4026\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ybne4e\" data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4095\">Semester 4 &ndash; International Business Finance and Advanced Taxation</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4097\" data-end=\"4220\">The final semester focuses on global business finance, international financial analysis, and advanced taxation regulations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"4222\" data-end=\"4243\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4244\" data-end=\"4370\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"haxsh1\" data-start=\"4244\" data-end=\"4291\">International Business Finance and Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pjf5sq\" data-start=\"4292\" data-end=\"4330\">Federal Taxation and Regulation II</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bdixbt\" data-start=\"4331\" data-end=\"4370\">Advanced Taxation and Regulation II</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4395\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4710\">Students gain advanced understanding of international finance systems, cross-border business operations, taxation regulations, and financial analysis techniques. The subjects help learners develop expertise in handling complex financial environments within multinational organizations and global financial markets.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4874\">The curriculum emphasizes strategic financial thinking, analytical decision-making, and advanced taxation knowledge relevant to international business operations.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 120000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(380, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 315, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 05:02:44', '2026-05-14 05:02:44', '<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"401\">The admission process for the Online BBA in International Finance at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to be simple, flexible, and fully online. The university provides a streamlined digital admission system that allows students to apply conveniently from anywhere without the need for physical campus visits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"605\">The process is structured to help learners begin their journey in business management, finance, banking, accounting, and international business through a modern and flexible online learning environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"610\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"632\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"801\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the Online BBA in International Finance program based on career goals, academic interests, and future aspirations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"853\">Before applying, students should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b9sc1t\" data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"876\">Program curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvng9i\" data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"901\">Eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr5ji3\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"919\">Fee structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lvv0qz\" data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"939\">Course duration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w6sj71\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"988\">Finance and business specialization subjects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c5w0k5\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1030\">Career opportunities after completion</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1060\">The program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1357\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uoef52\" data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1115\">Students interested in finance and banking careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w2usjz\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1171\">Learners planning careers in international business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"94ka69\" data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1234\">Students seeking management and entrepreneurship knowledge</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yep0h\" data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1297\">Diploma holders looking for higher education opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r5psm3\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1357\">Working professionals aiming to upgrade business skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1510\">Choosing the right program helps students align their education with future opportunities in finance, management, banking, and global business sectors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1515\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1531\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1658\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1710\">The online application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1906\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aakuos\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1747\">Filling out the application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2g8aa\" data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1780\">Uploading academic documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1402cq0\" data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1827\">Providing personal and educational details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0obln\" data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1874\">Submitting identity verification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmgdny\" data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1906\">Paying the registration fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"2036\">The fully digital admission system reduces paperwork and allows students to complete the process conveniently from any location.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2160\">Candidates who have completed 10+2 or a 3-year diploma from recognized institutions are eligible to apply for the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2165\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2185\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2332\">Once the university verifies the application and confirms eligibility, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2376\">After successful enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2618\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2416\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2453\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mok3bn\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2511\">Participate in assignments, projects, and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"43c8qh\" data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2566\">Interact with faculty members and academic mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zni54j\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2618\">Continue learning with flexible study schedules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2766\">The online learning ecosystem is designed to support both academic development and professional skill enhancement in business and finance domains.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"492\">The Online BBA in International Finance at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students who want to build strong knowledge in business management, finance, accounting, banking, marketing, and international business operations. The program is suitable for learners aiming to develop careers in corporate management, financial services, banking, entrepreneurship, and global business environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"728\">The eligibility criteria are structured to provide flexible admission opportunities for students from different educational backgrounds while ensuring they possess the required academic foundation for undergraduate business education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"733\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"770\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"894\">Candidates applying for the Online BBA in International Finance program must fulfill the following eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a7tjrd\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"925\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1019\">Applicants must secure a minimum of <strong data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"986\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in their qualifying examination.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1183\">The flexible eligibility structure allows students from various academic streams to pursue business and finance education through a modern online learning format.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vbakrz\" data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1210\">10+2 Qualification</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1305\">Candidates must have successfully completed their <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1280\">10+2 education</strong> from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1321\">Students from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1355\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4h0lx\" data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1334\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y83j8c\" data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1346\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wkddks\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1355\">Arts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1422\">and other academic streams are eligible to apply for the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1578\">The curriculum is designed to support both beginners and students already interested in finance, business management, and international commerce concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1583\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"d8ymbl\" data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1613\">Diploma Holder Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1731\">Candidates who have completed a <strong data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1673\">3-year diploma program</strong> from a recognized institution are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1898\">This provides additional higher education opportunities for diploma holders who want to continue their studies in business administration and finance-related fields.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1903\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aur382\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1932\">Work Experience Advantage</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2077\">Although work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience may receive an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2113\">Work experience can help learners:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2352\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b5cknz\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2165\">Understand business operations more practically</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13cltrg\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2213\">Improve managerial and communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ztftiz\" data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2278\">Relate academic concepts to real-world business environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o6vcae\" data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2352\">Enhance career growth opportunities in finance and management sectors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2497\">The flexible online learning structure is especially beneficial for working professionals seeking higher education while continuing their jobs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2502\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1o1hdq6\" data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2557\">Online BBA in International Finance Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2665\">The program offers flexible learning timelines suitable for both fresh students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2768\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2696\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2696\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2685\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2696\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2768\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2737\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2726\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2737\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2768\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2757\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2768\" data-col-size=\"sm\">6 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2933\">The extended maximum duration allows learners to complete the program at their own pace while balancing academics, work responsibilities, and personal commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"498\">The Online BBA in International Finance at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide students with strong knowledge in business administration, finance, banking, accounting, marketing, and international business operations. The program combines management education with finance-oriented learning to help students build industry-relevant business and analytical skills required in modern corporate sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"699\">The fee structure is planned to provide flexibility and affordability through semester-wise payment options, annual discounts, and zero-cost EMI facilities for both Indian and international students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1mxxh2k\" data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"768\">Online BBA in International Finance Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"889\">Indian students can select from multiple payment options based on their convenience and financial planning preferences.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"917\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"917\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"907\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"917\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<td data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"944\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"955\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹7,403*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<td data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"971\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"982\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹41,667</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<td data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1010\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1021\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹79,167</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1055\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1079\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1108\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1108\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1098\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1108\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1146\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1138\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1146\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1165\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1188\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1360\">The semester-wise payment structure helps students manage educational expenses more comfortably, while the annual payment option offers savings through discount benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1365\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dh934\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1431\">Online BBA in International Finance Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1566\">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham also offers the program for international learners through a separate fee structure for foreign nationals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1704\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1594\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1594\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1584\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1594\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1704\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1631\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1631\">₹50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1670\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1659\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1670\">₹95,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1704\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1691\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1704\">₹3,00,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1728\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1837\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1757\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1757\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1747\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1757\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1837\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1787\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1795\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1837\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1814\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1837\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1988\">The international fee structure supports global learners interested in business and finance education through a flexible online learning environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"1993\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2019\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2172\">One of the major advantages of the Online BBA in International Finance program is the availability of a <strong data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2149\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> for eligible students.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10dg977\" data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2208\">Benefits of EMI Payment Option</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2418\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rttxl\" data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2247\">Reduces immediate financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpntc3\" data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2299\">Provides convenient monthly payment flexibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ra8z9\" data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2359\">Supports self-funded students and working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qwp1ov\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2418\">Makes management education more financially accessible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2503\">The monthly EMI for Indian students starts from approximately <strong data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2502\">₹7,403 per month</strong>.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"524\">The Online BBA in International Finance with ACCA at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to provide students with strong foundational knowledge in business management, finance, accounting, marketing, operations, and international business practices. The program combines modern business administration education with finance-oriented and ACCA-aligned learning concepts to help students build globally relevant managerial and financial skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"909\">The curriculum is structured to prepare learners for careers in banking, finance, accounting, business operations, financial services, marketing, corporate management, and international business environments. The program also focuses on communication skills, analytical thinking, entrepreneurship, business technology, and strategic management to create industry-ready professionals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"1099\">The syllabus is divided across six semesters and gradually progresses from business fundamentals to advanced management, international finance, operations, and strategic business concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ptphuz\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1167\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundations of Business and Financial Learning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1316\">The first semester focuses on introducing students to management principles, accounting fundamentals, economics, mathematics, and business systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1339\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1497\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozme4o\" data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1365\">Communicative English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ebawn\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1394\">Principles of Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1419\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dlif4i\" data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1440\">Business and MIS</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g6463g\" data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1474\">Basic Concepts of Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1497\">Business Economics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1522\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1781\">Students develop foundational understanding of business management, financial accounting, economics, and business information systems. The semester also improves communication abilities and analytical thinking skills required in business and finance sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1928\">Business Economics helps learners understand economic principles and their application in organizational decision-making and market environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16g0d5i\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"2001\">Semester 2 &ndash; Business Operations and Entrepreneurial Development</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2135\">The second semester focuses on business systems, communication, entrepreneurship, legal concepts, and statistical business analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2158\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2346\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y6virn\" data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2189\">Professional Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ew816w\" data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2227\">Business Organization and Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rbjgcc\" data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2259\">Entrepreneurial Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13kk5be\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2304\">Environmental Science and Sustainability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ppdf6v\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2322\">Business Laws</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j6xavf\" data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2346\">Business Statistics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2371\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2622\">Students gain knowledge of organizational structures, business communication, entrepreneurship concepts, and legal frameworks governing business operations. Business Statistics helps learners analyze data for decision-making and operational planning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2734\">The semester also introduces sustainability concepts and environmental awareness in modern business practices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17u8g0x\" data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2799\">Semester 3 &ndash; Marketing, Banking, and Business Technology</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2943\">The third semester focuses on organizational behaviour, marketing management, banking systems, business technology, and quantitative analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2966\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"3139\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmmd8u\" data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"2995\">Organisational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1auxnr8\" data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3036\">Introduction to Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qehge7\" data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3062\">Banking and Insurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zw7n8o\" data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3096\">Basics of Business Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kg60\" data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3111\">Elective 1</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"skuumi\" data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3139\">Quantitative Techniques</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3164\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3413\">Students learn how organizations function, how marketing strategies are developed, and how banking and insurance sectors operate. Business technology subjects help learners understand digital tools and modern business systems used in organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3538\">Quantitative techniques improve analytical and problem-solving abilities required in business management and finance roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3543\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1pt10gt\" data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3605\">Semester 4 &ndash; Financial Management and Operational Strategy</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3607\" data-end=\"3750\">The fourth semester focuses on advanced marketing, human resource management, financial planning, research methods, and operational management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3773\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3774\" data-end=\"3966\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o3wjk1\" data-start=\"3774\" data-end=\"3807\">Advanced Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pyby5\" data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3848\">Basics of Human Resources Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e3zi1y\" data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3885\">Introduction to Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pbto8i\" data-start=\"3886\" data-end=\"3910\">Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k01zf9\" data-start=\"3911\" data-end=\"3951\">Production and Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kh23\" data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"3966\">Elective 2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3968\" data-end=\"3991\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4245\">Students gain understanding of financial decision-making, operational planning, marketing strategy development, and employee management systems. Research methodology subjects help learners develop analytical research and business problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4247\" data-end=\"4367\">The financial management subject introduces investment planning, budgeting, and corporate financial operations concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4372\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"173uwki\" data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4436\">Semester 5 &ndash; International Business and Strategic Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4438\" data-end=\"4576\">The fifth semester focuses on international business operations, business ethics, sustainability, and strategic organizational management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4599\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4600\" data-end=\"4807\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a1ycd4\" data-start=\"4600\" data-end=\"4640\">Principles of International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19fzvjl\" data-start=\"4641\" data-end=\"4696\">Business Ethics and Corporate Social Responsibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3khui\" data-start=\"4697\" data-end=\"4711\">Elective 3</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kiql\" data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4726\">Elective 4</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fbq1m0\" data-start=\"4727\" data-end=\"4767\">Introduction to Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suxde5\" data-start=\"4768\" data-end=\"4807\">Sustainable Business Administration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"4809\" data-end=\"4832\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4833\" data-end=\"5109\">Students explore global business environments, international trade systems, ethical business practices, and sustainability-focused management approaches. Strategic management subjects help learners understand organizational growth planning and competitive business strategies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5111\" data-end=\"5217\">The semester prepares students for leadership and management roles in modern global business environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5219\" data-end=\"5222\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kakn58\" data-start=\"5224\" data-end=\"5279\">Semester 6 &ndash; Enterprise Systems and Industry Exposure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5281\" data-end=\"5406\">The final semester focuses on enterprise systems, supply chain operations, internships, and advanced specialization learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"5408\" data-end=\"5429\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5430\" data-end=\"5550\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kjj0\" data-start=\"5430\" data-end=\"5444\">Elective 5</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kkf3\" data-start=\"5445\" data-end=\"5459\">Elective 6</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kl7i\" data-start=\"5460\" data-end=\"5474\">Elective 7</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ionq16\" data-start=\"5475\" data-end=\"5507\">Enterprise Resource Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2eg05\" data-start=\"5508\" data-end=\"5535\">Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hp4qxs\" data-start=\"5536\" data-end=\"5550\">Internship</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"5552\" data-end=\"5575\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5576\" data-end=\"5836\">Students gain exposure to enterprise management systems, logistics, supply chain operations, and practical business environments through internship opportunities. ERP subjects help learners understand integrated organizational systems used in modern companies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5838\" data-end=\"5979\">The internship component provides practical industry exposure and helps students apply business and finance concepts in real-world scenarios.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 250000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(381, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 216, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 05:27:28', '2026-05-14 05:27:28', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"482\">The admission process for the Online MBA in Business Analytics at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to be simple, fully digital, and accessible for students as well as working professionals. The process focuses on making enrollment smooth so that learners can quickly begin their journey into data analytics, artificial intelligence, machine learning, and modern business intelligence systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"629\">The structured admission flow ensures clarity at every stage, from selecting the program to final enrollment and access to the learning platform.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"634\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"656\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"830\">The first step is selecting the Online MBA in Business Analytics based on academic background, career goals, and interest in data-driven technologies and business strategy.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"884\">Before applying, candidates should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g77ki5\" data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"919\">Program structure and syllabus</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvng9i\" data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"944\">Eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"195ryy\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"982\">Fee structure and payment options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qvlrf8\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1028\">Career scope in business analytics and AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2hbp25\" data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1064\">Course duration and flexibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1092\">This program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bs1pq2\" data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1150\">Graduates interested in data analytics and AI careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yadwyb\" data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1211\">Working professionals transitioning into analytics roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"42befb\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1276\">Students from commerce, engineering, or computer backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2svz30\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1343\">Learners aiming for leadership roles in data-driven industries</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nutr5z\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1418\">Individuals interested in business intelligence and consulting careers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1553\">Choosing the right program ensures alignment between education and long-term career growth in analytics and technology-driven fields.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1558\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1574\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1699\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the official admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1734\">The application process includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1945\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ag5yr\" data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1778\">Filling out the online application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j4mgr8\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1821\">Entering personal and academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12c6fi1\" data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1866\">Uploading required educational documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0obln\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1913\">Submitting identity verification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmgdny\" data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1945\">Paying the registration fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"2105\">The fully online system eliminates the need for physical paperwork and allows students to apply from anywhere, making the process efficient and user-friendly.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2202\">Students in their final year of graduation can also apply using their current academic results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2207\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2227\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2386\">Once the application is reviewed and eligibility is confirmed, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment details from the university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2419\">After enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2636\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2459\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gn6t6g\" data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2497\">Attend live and recorded lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10dsl9p\" data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2551\">Participate in assignments, quizzes, and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yx6w3j\" data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2589\">Interact with faculty and mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3olvef\" data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2636\">Learn at a flexible pace from any location</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2793\">The learning environment is designed to support both academic understanding and practical skill development in business analytics and related technologies.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"495\">The Online MBA in Business Analytics at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for learners who want to build strong expertise in data analytics, artificial intelligence, machine learning, business intelligence, and data-driven decision-making. The program is suitable for graduates aiming to develop careers in analytics, consulting, IT-driven business roles, financial analytics, and strategic management domains.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"691\">The eligibility criteria are structured to ensure that students have a strong academic foundation while still offering flexible entry options for learners from different educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"696\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"733\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"847\">Candidates applying for the MBA in Business Analytics program must fulfill the following eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cgen7y\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"877\">Minimum Graduation Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"1019\">Applicants must have secured a minimum of <strong data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"944\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in their undergraduate degree from a recognized university or institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1196\">This ensures that students entering the program have a basic academic foundation required for advanced studies in analytics, management, and technology-driven business fields.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2bml5b\" data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1242\">Educational Qualification Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1275\">Candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1405\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18w9ghj\" data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1320\">10 + 2 education from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16twqhi\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1405\">A Bachelor&rsquo;s degree of minimum <strong data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1374\">3 years duration</strong> from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1450\">Eligible undergraduate degrees may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1541\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wajosr\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1459\">BCom</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1467\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1475\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1482\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z4e4a\" data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1490\">BSc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y0aa6w\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1505\">BE / BTech</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lfmrj2\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1541\">Or any equivalent qualification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1658\">This wide eligibility base allows both commerce and non-commerce students to pursue a career in business analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ybnbik\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1697\">Final-Year Student Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1849\">Students who are currently in the final year of their undergraduate program can also apply using marks obtained up to their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1987\">This allows learners to begin the admission process early and secure their academic progression into postgraduate studies without delay.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"1992\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aur382\" data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2021\">Work Experience Advantage</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2164\">Although work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience will have an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2197\">Work experience helps learners:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2428\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jokep8\" data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2257\">Understand real-world business and data problems better</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mlbo8t\" data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2311\">Relate academic concepts to industry applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr5fqh\" data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2361\">Improve analytical and decision-making skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ro5cmp\" data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2428\">Enhance career opportunities in analytics and management roles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2523\">This is especially beneficial for working professionals transitioning into data-driven roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2528\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"t0a9rw\" data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2573\">MBA in Business Analytics Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2667\">The program offers flexible learning timelines suitable for both students and professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2770\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2698\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2698\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2687\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2698\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2770\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2728\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2739\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2770\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2759\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2770\">4 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2907\">This flexibility allows learners to complete the program at a comfortable pace while balancing studies, work, and personal commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"460\">The Online MBA in Business Analytics at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to deliver advanced knowledge in data analytics, artificial intelligence, machine learning, business intelligence, and data-driven decision-making. The program combines management education with modern analytics tools, helping learners build strong careers in technology-driven business environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"646\">The fee structure is designed to remain flexible and affordable through EMI options, semester-wise payments, and discounted annual fee plans for both Indian and international students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"651\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1gxznfl\" data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"712\">Online MBA in Business Analytics Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"803\">Indian students can choose flexible payment options based on their financial convenience.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"831\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"831\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"831\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"869\">\r\n<td data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"858\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"869\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹9,792*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"896\">\r\n<td data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"885\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"896\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹56,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"937\">\r\n<td data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"924\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"937\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,06,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<td data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"958\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"971\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,24,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"995\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1024\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1024\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1014\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1062\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1054\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1062\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1081\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1104\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1254\">The semester-wise structure allows students to manage payments efficiently, while the annual payment option provides cost savings through discounts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1259\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"lgsu19\" data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1322\">Online MBA in Business Analytics Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1430\">For international learners, the program offers a separate fee structure designed for global accessibility.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1570\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1448\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1458\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1570\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1495\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1484\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1495\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹67,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1523\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1536\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,27,300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1570\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1557\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1570\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,68,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1594\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1703\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1623\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1623\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1613\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1623\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1703\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1661\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1653\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1661\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1703\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1680\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1703\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1845\">This structure supports international students who wish to pursue advanced education in business analytics through a flexible online format.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1850\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1876\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"2022\">The program provides a <strong data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1925\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> for eligible students, making it easier to manage educational expenses without financial stress.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2040\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2235\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h2bpak\" data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2093\">Monthly payment flexibility starting from ₹9,792</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gd1xij\" data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2130\">Reduced upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h3rtae\" data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2171\">Easy access to premium MBA education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9je25f\" data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2235\">Suitable for working professionals and self-funded students</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"530\">The Online MBA in Business Analytics at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is a modern, industry-focused postgraduate program designed to develop strong expertise in data-driven decision-making, artificial intelligence applications, machine learning techniques, and business intelligence systems. The program integrates core management education with advanced analytics and emerging technologies, enabling learners to understand how data shapes modern business strategies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"905\">This MBA program is highly suitable for students and working professionals aiming to build careers in business analytics, data science, consulting, IT-driven business roles, financial analytics, and strategic management domains. The curriculum emphasizes analytical thinking, problem-solving, and the practical application of data tools in real-world business environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1091\">The syllabus is structured across four semesters, gradually progressing from management fundamentals to advanced machine learning, deep learning, and modern AI-based analytics systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ezdp3i\" data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1157\">Semester 1 &ndash; Management Foundations and Data Fundamentals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1302\">The first semester focuses on building a strong foundation in management principles along with the introduction of programming and data basics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1325\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1567\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wt388f\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1383\">Fundamentals of Management &amp; Organizational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4jl9c\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1434\">Human Resources and Organizational Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u3iiww\" data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1471\">Marketing and Consumer Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ch08st\" data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1526\">Elective 1: Python Programming &amp; Data Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvtyp9\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1567\">Soft Skills and Employability Skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1592\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1890\">Students develop a strong understanding of management principles, organizational behavior, marketing strategies, and human resource development. Alongside this, Python programming and data fundamentals introduce learners to coding basics and data handling concepts essential for analytics careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"2001\">Soft skills training enhances communication, teamwork, and professional readiness for corporate environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2006\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"5m1cdu\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2078\">Semester 2 &ndash; Data-Driven Decision Making and Machine Learning Basics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2217\">The second semester focuses on business finance, operations, analytics-based decision-making, and introductory machine learning concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2240\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2436\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x28dfq\" data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2261\">Business Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lnxy6g\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2304\">Operations and Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jnnti8\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2336\">Data-Driven Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzp1lq\" data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2381\">Business Ethics and Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fks175\" data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2436\">Elective 2: Supervised Machine Learning Essentials</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2461\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2698\">Students gain knowledge of financial systems, operational efficiency, and strategic decision-making using data. The supervised machine learning subject introduces algorithms and predictive modeling techniques used in business analytics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2806\">This semester strengthens the ability to analyze data and apply it to real business decisions effectively.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2811\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"uwklso\" data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2873\">Semester 3 &ndash; Advanced Analytics and Deep Learning Concepts</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"3006\">The third semester focuses on international business, business analytics modeling, and advanced artificial intelligence techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3029\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3210\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3056\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18jukye\" data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3102\">Business Analytics and Business Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"443a27\" data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3144\">Elective 3: Advanced Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fvtkqb\" data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3187\">Elective 4: Deep Learning Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2nf5r\" data-start=\"3188\" data-end=\"3210\">Education for Life</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3235\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3489\">Students explore global business environments while developing advanced skills in machine learning and deep learning systems. Business analytics modeling helps learners understand how data is used for forecasting, trend analysis, and strategic planning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3491\" data-end=\"3623\">The &ldquo;Education for Life&rdquo; component focuses on ethical values, leadership development, and holistic thinking for professional growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3628\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zbufut\" data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3694\">Semester 4 &ndash; Cloud Analytics, Visualization, and Generative AI</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3826\">The final semester focuses on sustainability, advanced data tools, cloud computing, visualization, and generative AI technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3849\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"4033\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6n7ual\" data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3895\">Environment Sustainability and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s1t5st\" data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"3907\">Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aotbtg\" data-start=\"3908\" data-end=\"3961\">Elective 5: Data Visualization and Communications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pw4hj0\" data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"4003\">Elective 6: Data Analytics over Cloud</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sx0hjs\" data-start=\"4004\" data-end=\"4033\">Elective 7: Generative AI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4058\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4059\" data-end=\"4291\">Students gain expertise in presenting data insights through visualization tools and communicating analytics effectively. Cloud-based data analytics introduces modern distributed computing systems used in large-scale data processing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4293\" data-end=\"4441\">Generative AI provides exposure to advanced artificial intelligence systems used in content generation, automation, and intelligent decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4443\" data-end=\"4553\">The project component allows students to apply all learned concepts to real-world business analytics problems.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 224000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(382, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 236, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 05:47:50', '2026-05-14 05:47:50', '<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"494\">The Online MBA in Operations Management at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham follows a simple and fully digital admission process designed to make enrollment easy for students and working professionals. The process ensures a smooth transition from application to final admission, allowing learners to quickly begin their journey in operations, supply chain management, logistics, and business process optimization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"671\">The structured admission flow focuses on convenience, transparency, and accessibility so that candidates can complete the process from anywhere without physical campus visits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"676\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"698\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"874\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the Online MBA in Operations Management based on academic background, career interests, and long-term professional goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"928\">Before applying, candidates should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1158\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lwm09d\" data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"974\">Program curriculum and semester structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dp2t10\" data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1025\">Eligibility criteria and academic requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"195ryy\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1063\">Fee structure and payment options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yactjb\" data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1122\">Career scope in operations and supply chain management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2hbp25\" data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1158\">Course duration and flexibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1189\">This program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1539\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"doxxz5\" data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1250\">Graduates interested in operations and logistics careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r2wo7g\" data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1318\">Working professionals in manufacturing and supply chain sectors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9y7sj\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1385\">Students from management, commerce, or engineering backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hd519x\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1465\">Individuals aiming for roles in process improvement and business efficiency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134zo0x\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1539\">Learners seeking leadership positions in operations-driven industries</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1661\">Choosing the right program helps students align their education with career opportunities in global business operations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1666\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1682\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1807\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the official admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1852\">The application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"2063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ag5yr\" data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1896\">Filling out the online application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j4mgr8\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1939\">Entering personal and academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12c6fi1\" data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1984\">Uploading required educational documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0obln\" data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2031\">Submitting identity verification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmgdny\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2063\">Paying the registration fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2213\">The fully online system eliminates the need for physical paperwork, making the admission process fast, convenient, and accessible from any location.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2309\">Students in their final year of graduation can also apply using their latest semester results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2314\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2334\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2493\">Once the application is reviewed and eligibility is confirmed, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment details from the university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2537\">After successful enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2577\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2614\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mok3bn\" data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2672\">Participate in assignments, projects, and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ckcfu\" data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2719\">Interact with faculty and academic mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3olvef\" data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2766\">Learn at a flexible pace from any location</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2915\">The digital learning environment is designed to support both theoretical understanding and practical application of operations management concepts.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"519\">The Online MBA in Operations Management at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students and professionals who want to build strong expertise in operations strategy, supply chain management, logistics, production planning, quality control, and business process optimization. The program focuses on developing analytical thinking and managerial skills required to improve efficiency and productivity in modern organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"698\">The eligibility criteria are structured to ensure students have a solid academic foundation while also offering flexible entry pathways for graduates from different disciplines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"703\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"740\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"853\">Candidates applying for the Online MBA in Operations Management must meet the following eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cgen7y\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"883\">Minimum Graduation Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"1025\">Applicants must have secured a minimum of <strong data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"950\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in their undergraduate degree from a recognized university or institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1172\">This ensures that learners entering the program are academically prepared for advanced studies in operations, management, and business analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1177\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2bml5b\" data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1218\">Educational Qualification Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1251\">Candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18w9ghj\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1296\">10 + 2 education from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16twqhi\" data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1381\">A Bachelor&rsquo;s degree of minimum <strong data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1350\">3 years duration</strong> from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1426\">Eligible undergraduate backgrounds include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1434\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wajosr\" data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1443\">BCom</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1450\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z4e4a\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1458\">BSc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1466\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187s0u7\" data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1503\">Engineering / Technology degrees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yfyxdn\" data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1536\">Or equivalent qualifications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1666\">This wide eligibility scope allows students from both management and technical backgrounds to pursue operations-focused careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1671\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ybnbik\" data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1705\">Final-Year Student Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1848\">Students currently in the final year of their undergraduate degree can also apply using marks obtained up to their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1938\">This helps learners plan their higher education early without waiting for final results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1943\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aur382\" data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1972\">Work Experience Advantage</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2115\">Although work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience will have an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2148\">Work experience helps learners:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2355\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lbwzyp\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2197\">Understand real-world operational challenges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c82h4f\" data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2250\">Improve decision-making in business environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2t398\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2301\">Relate academic concepts to industry practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kds4l1\" data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2355\">Strengthen leadership and managerial capabilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2479\">This is especially beneficial for professionals working in logistics, manufacturing, supply chain, and service industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2484\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"f0bfw6\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2539\">Online MBA in Operations Management Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2639\">The program offers flexible duration options suitable for both students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2742\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2670\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2670\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2659\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2670\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2742\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2711\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2700\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2742\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2731\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2742\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2873\">This flexibility allows learners to complete the program at their own pace while balancing work, study, and personal commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"524\">The Online MBA in Operations Management at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to build strong expertise in operations strategy, supply chain management, logistics, production planning, quality management, and business process optimization. The program combines core management education with advanced operational tools to prepare students for industry-ready roles in manufacturing, services, consulting, and global supply chain systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"712\">The fee structure is designed to offer flexibility and affordability through EMI options, semester-wise payments, and annual discount benefits for both Indian and international learners.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"717\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11foi78\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"781\">Online MBA in Operations Management Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"872\">Indian students can choose flexible payment options based on their financial convenience.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"1040\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"890\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"900\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"1040\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"938\">\r\n<td data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"927\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"938\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹9,792*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"965\">\r\n<td data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"954\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"965\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹56,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n<td data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"993\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1006\">₹1,06,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1040\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1027\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1040\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,24,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1064\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1093\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1093\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1083\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1093\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1131\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1123\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1131\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1173\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1317\">The semester-wise payment option helps students manage fees easily, while the annual payment plan offers additional savings through discounts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1322\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"p583ig\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1388\">Online MBA in Operations Management Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1517\">For international learners, the university provides a separate fee structure designed for global accessibility and flexibility.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1545\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1545\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1535\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1545\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1582\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1571\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1582\">₹67,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1623\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1623\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,27,300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1644\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1657\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,68,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1681\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1790\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1710\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1710\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1700\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1710\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1790\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1748\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1740\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1748\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1790\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1767\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1790\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1945\">This structure ensures that international students can also access high-quality operations management education through a flexible online learning model.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1950\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1976\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2077\">The program offers a <strong data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2023\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> to make higher education more financially manageable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2095\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2293\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqfskx\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2136\">Monthly payment starting from ₹9,792</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17krbkn\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2184\">Reduced financial burden at admission stage</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vbmmjq\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2229\">Easy installment-based payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vbym3t\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2293\">Suitable for working professionals and self-funded learners</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"69\" data-end=\"545\">The Online MBA in Operations Management at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is a professionally designed postgraduate program focused on developing strong expertise in production planning, supply chain management, logistics, quality control, business operations, and data-driven decision-making. The program is structured to help learners understand how organizations efficiently manage resources, streamline processes, and improve productivity in competitive business environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"921\">This MBA program is ideal for graduates and working professionals aiming to build careers in operations, supply chain management, manufacturing systems, consulting, logistics, and enterprise resource planning (ERP)-based roles. The curriculum combines management fundamentals with advanced operational strategies and analytical tools to prepare industry-ready professionals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1110\">The syllabus is divided into four semesters, progressing from foundational management concepts to advanced operations strategy, forecasting, ERP systems, and quality management practices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1115\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"yiag29\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1177\">Semester 1 &ndash; Management Foundations and Service Operations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1321\">The first semester focuses on building core management knowledge along with the introduction to operations and service-based business systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1344\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1578\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wt388f\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1402\">Fundamentals of Management &amp; Organizational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4jl9c\" data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1453\">Human Resources and Organizational Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u3iiww\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1490\">Marketing and Consumer Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"135d3p5\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1537\">Elective 1: Services Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvtyp9\" data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1578\">Soft Skills and Employability Skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1603\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1872\">Students develop a strong understanding of management principles, organizational structure, human resource development, and customer behavior. The services operations module introduces how service-based industries manage efficiency, quality, and customer satisfaction.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1965\">Soft skills training enhances communication, teamwork, leadership, and workplace readiness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1970\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cvcgfr\" data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2034\">Semester 2 &ndash; Supply Chain Systems and Manufacturing Planning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2159\">The second semester focuses on finance, operations systems, manufacturing planning, and strategic business decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2182\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2374\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x28dfq\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2203\">Business Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lnxy6g\" data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2246\">Operations and Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jnnti8\" data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2278\">Data-Driven Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzp1lq\" data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2323\">Business Ethics and Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cjlbxs\" data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2374\">Elective 2: Manufacturing Control and Planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2399\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2622\">Students gain knowledge of financial decision-making, supply chain systems, and manufacturing processes. Manufacturing control and planning focuses on production scheduling, inventory management, and resource optimization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2754\">Data-driven decision-making helps learners understand how operational decisions are supported through analytics and business data.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2759\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dh3vno\" data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2823\">Semester 3 &ndash; Forecasting, ERP Systems, and Global Operations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2953\">The third semester focuses on international business, forecasting methods, enterprise systems, and business modeling techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2976\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3154\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3003\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18jukye\" data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3049\">Business Analytics and Business Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ot8pz1\" data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3086\">Elective 3: Business Forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dood2d\" data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3131\">Elective 4: Enterprise Resource Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2nf5r\" data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3154\">Education for Life</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3179\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3423\">Students explore global business operations and develop forecasting skills used in demand planning and supply chain optimization. ERP systems introduce integrated business software used for managing large-scale operations across organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3532\">Business analytics enhances the ability to model business problems and support operational decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"3537\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"mbpn5l\" data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3605\">Semester 4 &ndash; Advanced Operations Strategy and Quality Management</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3607\" data-end=\"3725\">The final semester focuses on sustainability, advanced operations tools, project work, and quality management systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3727\" data-end=\"3748\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3932\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6n7ual\" data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3794\">Environment Sustainability and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s1t5st\" data-start=\"3795\" data-end=\"3806\">Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x2bpqx\" data-start=\"3807\" data-end=\"3842\">Elective 5: Operations Research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pp7qwm\" data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3891\">Elective 6: Advanced Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f7f594\" data-start=\"3892\" data-end=\"3932\">Elective 7: Total Quality Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3934\" data-end=\"3957\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"4149\">Students gain expertise in operations research techniques used for solving complex business problems. Advanced supply chain management focuses on global logistics and efficiency optimization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4289\">Total Quality Management (TQM) helps learners understand continuous improvement strategies and quality assurance systems in organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4291\" data-end=\"4397\">The project component allows students to apply theoretical knowledge to real-world operational challenges.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 224000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(383, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 225, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 06:06:40', '2026-05-14 06:06:40', '<p data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"447\">The Online MBA in Human Resource Management at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham follows a simple, structured, and fully online admission process designed to ensure convenience for students and working professionals. The process is created to help learners smoothly transition from application to enrollment without geographical limitations or complex procedures.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"659\">The admission workflow is streamlined to ensure transparency, quick processing, and easy access to the program in human resource management, organizational development, recruitment, and strategic HR leadership.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"664\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"686\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"866\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the Online MBA in Human Resource Management based on academic background, career interests, and long-term professional goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"922\">Before applying, candidates should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1130\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5xikf\" data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"959\">Program structure and curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dp2t10\" data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1010\">Eligibility criteria and academic requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"195ryy\" data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1048\">Fee structure and payment options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qq5774\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1094\">Career opportunities in HR and management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2hbp25\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1130\">Course duration and flexibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1161\">This program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1511\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eojx26\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1222\">Graduates interested in HR and people management careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xu2yez\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1290\">Working professionals in HR, administration, or corporate roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xk3cdi\" data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1358\">Students from commerce, arts, science, or technical backgrounds</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1llnlp7\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1430\">Individuals aiming for leadership roles in human capital management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7oaecm\" data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1511\">Learners seeking career growth in recruitment and organizational development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1648\">Choosing the right program ensures alignment between education and future career opportunities in human resource and management fields.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1653\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1669\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1794\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the official admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1839\">The application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"2050\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ag5yr\" data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1883\">Filling out the online application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j4mgr8\" data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1926\">Entering personal and academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12c6fi1\" data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1971\">Uploading required educational documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0obln\" data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2018\">Submitting identity verification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qmgdny\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2050\">Paying the registration fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2206\">The fully digital system eliminates the need for physical paperwork and allows candidates to apply from anywhere, making the process simple and efficient.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2311\">Students who are in their final year of graduation can also apply using their current academic results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2316\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2336\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2500\">Once the application is reviewed and eligibility is confirmed, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment instructions from the university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2533\">After enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2759\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2573\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gn6t6g\" data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2611\">Attend live and recorded lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10dsl9p\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2665\">Participate in assignments, quizzes, and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ckcfu\" data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2712\">Interact with faculty and academic mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15jtu24\" data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2759\">Study at a flexible pace from any location</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2904\">The learning system is designed to support both theoretical knowledge and practical HR skill development, ensuring students are industry-ready.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"517\">The Online MBA in Human Resource Management at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students and professionals who want to build strong expertise in people management, organizational development, recruitment, performance management, labour laws, and strategic HR practices. The program focuses on developing leadership skills and analytical thinking required for modern HR roles in corporate and global organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"700\">The eligibility criteria are structured to ensure that applicants have a solid academic foundation while maintaining flexibility for candidates from diverse educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"705\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"742\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"862\">Candidates applying for the Online MBA in Human Resource Management must fulfill the following eligibility conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cgen7y\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"892\">Minimum Graduation Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"1034\">Applicants must have secured a minimum of <strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"959\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in their undergraduate degree from a recognized university or institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1177\">This ensures that students entering the program have the necessary academic background to handle advanced management and HR-related subjects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2bml5b\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1223\">Educational Qualification Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1256\">Candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1386\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18w9ghj\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1301\">10 + 2 education from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16twqhi\" data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1386\">A Bachelor&rsquo;s degree of minimum <strong data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1355\">3 years duration</strong> from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1431\">Eligible undergraduate backgrounds include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1542\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ynlwp\" data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1439\">BBA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wajosr\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1448\">BCom</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j42u0b\" data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1455\">BA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z4e4a\" data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1463\">BSc</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1471\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b6pcb1\" data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1509\">Engineering or Technology degrees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yfyxdn\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1542\">Or equivalent qualifications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1667\">This wide eligibility scope allows students from multiple academic streams to pursue a career in human resource management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1672\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ybnbik\" data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1706\">Final-Year Student Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1858\">Students who are currently in the final year of their undergraduate program can also apply using marks obtained up to their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"2003\">This enables learners to begin the admission process early and smoothly transition into postgraduate studies without waiting for final results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aur382\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2037\">Work Experience Advantage</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2178\">Although work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional exposure will have an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2211\">Work experience helps learners:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2434\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wqu6cy\" data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2269\">Understand real workplace challenges in HR management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gsmnux\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2324\">Develop better communication and leadership skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g9ng1i\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2379\">Relate academic concepts to practical HR functions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xlyvdu\" data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2434\">Improve career readiness in corporate environments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2547\">This is especially useful for professionals already working in HR, administration, or management-related roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2552\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"jfchoq\" data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2599\">Online MBA in HR Management Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2699\">The program offers flexible duration options suitable for both students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2802\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2730\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2730\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2719\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2802\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2771\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2760\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2771\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2802\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2791\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2802\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2939\">This flexibility allows learners to complete the program at a comfortable pace while balancing studies, work, and personal commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"537\">The Online MBA in Human Resource Management at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to develop advanced expertise in human resource planning, talent acquisition, organizational development, employee relations, performance management, and strategic HR leadership. The program combines core management education with modern HR practices and analytics-based decision-making, preparing learners for dynamic roles in corporate and global organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"734\">The fee structure is designed to ensure affordability and flexibility through monthly EMI options, semester-wise payments, and annual discount benefits for both Indian and international students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"739\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1f8bc2f\" data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"807\">Online MBA in Human Resource Management Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"896\">Indian students can choose flexible payment plans based on their financial convenience.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"924\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"924\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"914\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"924\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n<td data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"951\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"962\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹9,625*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<td data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"978\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"989\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹55,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<td data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1017\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1030\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,04,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1051\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1064\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,20,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1088\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1117\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1117\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1107\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1117\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1155\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1147\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1155\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1174\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1197\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1362\">The semester-wise fee structure helps students manage payments in a structured manner, while the yearly payment option offers additional savings through discounts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1367\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"nqq9a3\" data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1437\">Online MBA in Human Resource Management Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1557\">For international learners, the university provides a separate fee structure designed to support global accessibility.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1697\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1575\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1585\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1697\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1622\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1611\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1622\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹64,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1650\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1663\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,22,550</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1697\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1684\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1697\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,58,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1721\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1830\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1750\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1750\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1740\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1750\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1830\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1788\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1780\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1788\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1830\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1807\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1830\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1977\">This structure ensures that international students can also pursue high-quality HR management education through a flexible online learning model.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"1982\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2008\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2124\">The program offers a <strong data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2055\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> to make higher education more accessible and financially manageable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2142\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2346\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dpudzw\" data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2183\">Monthly payment starting from ₹9,625</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r8zymu\" data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2237\">Reduced financial burden at the time of admission</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vbmmjq\" data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2282\">Easy installment-based payment structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vbym3t\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2346\">Suitable for working professionals and self-funded learners</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"504\">The Online MBA in Human Resource Management at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is a professionally designed postgraduate program focused on developing advanced expertise in people management, organizational development, talent acquisition, performance management, and strategic HR practices. The program blends core management education with modern HR technologies such as people analytics, HR auditing, and data-driven decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"869\">This MBA program is ideal for graduates and working professionals aiming to build careers in human resource management, recruitment, talent development, employee relations, organizational leadership, and corporate management roles. The curriculum is structured to strengthen both managerial capabilities and analytical thinking required in modern HR environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"1046\">The syllabus is divided into four semesters, gradually progressing from foundational management concepts to advanced HR strategy, analytics, and organizational transformation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1051\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1y94nc4\" data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1110\">Semester 1 &ndash; Management Foundations and HR Fundamentals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1231\">The first semester focuses on building core management knowledge along with essential HR concepts and workplace skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1254\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1480\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wt388f\" data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1312\">Fundamentals of Management &amp; Organizational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4jl9c\" data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1363\">Human Resources and Organizational Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u3iiww\" data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1400\">Marketing and Consumer Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qfrtxl\" data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1439\">Elective 1: Performance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvtyp9\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1480\">Soft Skills and Employability Skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1505\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1777\">Students develop a strong understanding of management principles, workplace behavior, and organizational structures. The Human Resources and Organizational Development subject introduces key HR functions such as employee engagement, training, and organizational planning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1905\">Performance management helps learners understand how employee productivity is measured and improved in corporate environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1910\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1i5jsft\" data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1968\">Semester 2 &ndash; Finance, Operations, and People Analytics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2083\">The second semester focuses on business finance, operational systems, ethics, and data-driven HR decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2106\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2280\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x28dfq\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2127\">Business Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lnxy6g\" data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2170\">Operations and Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jnnti8\" data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2202\">Data-Driven Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzp1lq\" data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2247\">Business Ethics and Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l04638\" data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2280\">Elective 2: People Analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2305\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2558\">Students gain knowledge of financial fundamentals, business operations, and ethical decision-making in organizations. People analytics introduces the use of data and metrics to understand employee performance, hiring trends, and workforce optimization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2640\">This semester builds analytical HR skills essential for modern HR professionals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2645\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"z8kr35\" data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2710\">Semester 3 &ndash; Labour Laws, Recruitment, and Business Analytics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2833\">The third semester focuses on international business exposure, labour regulations, recruitment systems, and HR analytics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2856\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"3058\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xeug44\" data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2883\">International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18jukye\" data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2929\">Business Analytics and Business Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dg4rjr\" data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2982\">Elective 3: Industrial Relations and Labour Laws</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k5bzr\" data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3035\">Elective 4: Recruitment and Retention Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2nf5r\" data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3058\">Education for Life</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3083\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3305\">Students learn how global organizations operate and how HR systems function in international environments. Labour laws and industrial relations provide legal knowledge related to employee rights and workplace regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3407\">Recruitment and retention management focuses on hiring strategies and employee engagement practices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3412\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1oxjxzl\" data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3475\">Semester 4 &ndash; Strategic HR and Organizational Transformation</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3593\">The final semester focuses on advanced HR strategy, organizational change, auditing, and sustainability in business.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"3616\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3785\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6n7ual\" data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3662\">Environment Sustainability and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s1t5st\" data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3674\">Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vtoewj\" data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3708\">Elective 5: Change Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lp22b6\" data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3733\">Elective 6: HR Audit</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yewqy\" data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3785\">Elective 7: Strategic Human Resource Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fu8vnm\" data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3810\">What Students Learn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"4028\">Students develop expertise in managing organizational change, conducting HR audits, and designing strategic HR systems. Strategic Human Resource Management focuses on aligning HR practices with overall business goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4030\" data-end=\"4129\">The project component allows learners to apply HR concepts to real-world organizational challenges.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 220000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(384, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 218, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 06:20:15', '2026-05-14 06:20:15', '<p data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"459\">The Online MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham follows a simple, fully online, and structured admission process designed to make enrollment easy for students and working professionals. The process is created to ensure transparency, accessibility, and a smooth transition from application to final admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"692\">This streamlined admission system allows learners to quickly begin their journey in artificial intelligence, machine learning, deep learning, and advanced computing without complex procedures or physical documentation requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"697\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"719\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"918\">The first step in the admission process is selecting the Online MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning based on academic background, career goals, and long-term professional aspirations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"972\">Before applying, candidates should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1212\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sidqj8\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1023\">Program structure and semester-wise curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aqwg4q\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1085\">Eligibility requirements including mathematics background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"195ryy\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1123\">Fee structure and payment options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"scef9w\" data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1176\">Career opportunities in AI, ML, and data science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2hbp25\" data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1212\">Course duration and flexibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1243\">This program is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1578\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4vifl3\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1316\">Graduates interested in artificial intelligence and machine learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rjeos8\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1373\">Students with programming and mathematics background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l7evmk\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1441\">Working professionals in IT, software development, or analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gflntw\" data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1511\">Individuals aiming for careers in AI engineering and data science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3m9oar\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1578\">Learners seeking advanced computing and research opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1676\">Choosing the right program ensures better alignment with career growth in emerging technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1697\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1822\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the official admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1867\">The application process generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"2120\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hsfb9n\" data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1933\">Filling out the online application form with personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yzyw60\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1981\">Entering academic qualification information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12c6fi1\" data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2026\">Uploading required educational documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0obln\" data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2073\">Submitting identity verification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13b7kyx\" data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2120\">Paying the application or registration fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2259\">The fully digital process removes the need for physical paperwork, making it convenient and time-saving for applicants from any location.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2356\">Students in their final year of graduation can also apply using their current academic results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2361\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2381\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2544\">Once the application is reviewed and eligibility is verified, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment instructions from the university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2577\">After enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2797\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2617\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2654\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mok3bn\" data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2712\">Participate in assignments, projects, and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yx6w3j\" data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2750\">Interact with faculty and mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3olvef\" data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2797\">Learn at a flexible pace from any location</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2960\">The learning environment is designed to support both theoretical understanding and practical AI skill development through interactive and project-based learning.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"521\">The Online MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students and professionals who want to build advanced careers in artificial intelligence, machine learning, deep learning, data science, and intelligent software systems. The program focuses on strengthening both theoretical and practical knowledge in computing, mathematics, and AI-driven technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"719\">The eligibility criteria are structured to ensure that applicants have a strong academic foundation in computer science and mathematics, which are essential for understanding advanced AI concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"724\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"761\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"892\">Candidates applying for the Online MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning must meet the following academic conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cgen7y\" data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"922\">Minimum Graduation Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"1064\">Applicants must have secured a minimum of <strong data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"989\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in their undergraduate degree from a recognized university or institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1205\">This ensures that learners have the required academic consistency to handle advanced-level programming, mathematics, and AI-based subjects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1210\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2bml5b\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1251\">Educational Qualification Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1284\">Candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1414\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18w9ghj\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1329\">10 + 2 education from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16twqhi\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1414\">A Bachelor&rsquo;s degree of minimum <strong data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1383\">3 years duration</strong> from a recognized university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1482\">Additionally, candidates must have studied <strong data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1474\">Mathematics</strong> either:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zca7ky\" data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1506\">At 10 + 2 level, or</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hezzw3\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1530\">At graduation level</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1575\">Eligible undergraduate backgrounds include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1740\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yrbgo\" data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1583\">BCA</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2mzl9d\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1629\">BSc (Computer Science / IT / Mathematics)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3sk5tf\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1657\">BTech / BE (Any stream)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bbaro0\" data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1707\">BBA / BCom / BA (with Mathematics background)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yfyxdn\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1740\">Or equivalent qualifications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1858\">This ensures that students have the required analytical and logical foundation for AI and machine learning concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1863\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ybnbik\" data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1897\">Final-Year Student Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"2049\">Students who are currently in the final year of their undergraduate program can also apply using marks obtained up to their latest completed semester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2207\">This allows learners to plan their higher education without waiting for final examination results and ensures a smooth transition into postgraduate studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2212\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aur382\" data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2241\">Work Experience Advantage</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2372\">Although work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional experience will have an added advantage during admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2405\">Work experience helps learners:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2629\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"172fod1\" data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2463\">Understand real-world software development challenges</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nhoiol\" data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2511\">Apply AI concepts in practical environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ohdhhf\" data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2570\">Improve problem-solving and analytical thinking skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s61eg0\" data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2629\">Gain exposure to industry-level tools and technologies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2750\">This is especially beneficial for professionals working in IT, software development, analytics, and data-related roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2755\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9fap3h\" data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2796\">Online MCA in AI &amp; ML Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2896\">The program offers flexible duration options suitable for both students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2999\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2927\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2927\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2916\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2927\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2999\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2968\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2957\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2968\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"2999\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"2988\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"2999\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3148\">This flexible structure allows learners to complete the program at their own pace while balancing academic, professional, and personal commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"573\">The Online MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is a specialized postgraduate program designed to develop advanced expertise in artificial intelligence, machine learning, deep learning, data science, and intelligent computing systems. The program is structured to provide strong technical knowledge along with practical exposure to real-world AI applications, making it highly suitable for students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"770\">The fee structure is designed to ensure affordability, flexibility, and accessibility through EMI options, semester-wise payments, and annual discounts for both Indian and international learners.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"775\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"v4o7un\" data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"825\">Online MCA in AI &amp; ML Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"934\">Indian students can choose from flexible payment options based on their convenience and financial planning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"952\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"962\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1000\">\r\n<td data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"989\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1000\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹7,958*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1027\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1016\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1027\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹45,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1066\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1055\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1066\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹90,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1087\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1100\">₹1,95,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1124\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1233\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1153\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1153\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1143\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1153\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1233\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1183\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1191\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1233\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1210\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1233\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1376\">The EMI-based structure helps students manage payments easily, while the annual payment option provides additional savings through discounts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1votq6r\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1433\">Online MCA in AI &amp; ML Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1566\">For international students, the university provides a separate fee structure to support global accessibility and flexible learning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1706\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1594\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1594\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1584\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1594\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1706\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1631\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1631\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹53,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1672\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1659\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1672\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,05,925</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1706\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1693\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1706\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,28,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1730\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1839\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1759\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1839\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1797\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1789\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1839\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1816\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1839\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1975\">This structure ensures that international learners can pursue advanced AI and machine learning education without financial complexity.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"1980\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2006\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2110\">The program offers a <strong data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2053\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> to make higher education more affordable and accessible.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2128\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2305\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ufpcr8\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2167\">Monthly payment starting at ₹7,958</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15nk099\" data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2205\">No heavy upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjdg89\" data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2253\">Flexible installment-based learning support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qjbc96\" data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2305\">Suitable for students and working professionals</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"556\">The Online MCA in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is a future-focused postgraduate program designed to build strong expertise in advanced computing, machine learning systems, deep learning, natural language processing, and AI-based software development. The program integrates core computer science foundations with modern AI technologies to prepare learners for high-demand roles in the technology and data science industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"831\">This MCA program is suitable for graduates who want to specialize in artificial intelligence, data-driven systems, intelligent software development, and emerging machine learning applications across industries such as IT, healthcare, finance, automation, and cybersecurity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"1025\">The curriculum is structured across four semesters, gradually progressing from foundational computing concepts to advanced AI models, research applications, and real-world project development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"y2r8mg\" data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1082\">Semester 1 &ndash; Computing Foundations and AI Basics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1208\">The first semester focuses on building strong programming and mathematical foundations required for AI and machine learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1231\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1461\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g7qfk8\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1267\">Foundations of Computer Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jvuhdb\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1322\">Mathematical Foundations for Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2nhx0\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1365\">Object Oriented Programming using Java</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mvejdm\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1410\">Stream Core 1: Python Programming for AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14k2i9z\" data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1461\">Stream Core 2: Foundations of Machine Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1484\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1764\">Students develop a strong understanding of programming languages, system architecture, and mathematical concepts essential for AI development. Python programming introduces practical AI implementation, while machine learning fundamentals provide the base for predictive modeling.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"7z22hz\" data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1826\">Semester 2 &ndash; Data Structures and Core AI Technologies</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1960\">The second semester focuses on strengthening algorithms, mathematical concepts, and core AI technologies like deep learning and NLP.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1983\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2195\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18z8ykp\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2018\">Data Structures and Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6co4v8\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2034\">Soft Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"102g473\" data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2081\">Stream Core &ndash; Computational Linear Algebra</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e2byxh\" data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2121\">Stream Core 3: Deep Learning for AI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5bab0p\" data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2168\">Stream Core 4: Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"agd28w\" data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2195\">MCA AI &amp; ML Elective I</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2218\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2429\">Students gain expertise in algorithm design, computational mathematics, and advanced AI techniques. Deep learning helps in building neural networks, while NLP focuses on text and language-based AI applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2434\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"b4zh7a\" data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2491\">Semester 3 &ndash; Advanced AI Systems and Research Methods</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2604\">The third semester focuses on advanced AI models, research methodology, and real-world case study applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2627\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2842\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wlmmu9\" data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2659\">Software Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jpcxlo\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2684\">Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hxvlcc\" data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2728\">Stream Core 5: Complex Network Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vxxa94\" data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2770\">Stream Core 6: Reinforcement Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ovlai1\" data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2798\">MCA AI &amp; ML Elective II</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k3dmio\" data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2827\">MCA AI &amp; ML Elective III</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q4jmlv\" data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2842\">Case Study</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2865\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"3088\">Students learn how AI systems are managed in real-world projects and how research is conducted in advanced computing fields. Reinforcement learning and network analysis help in building intelligent decision-making systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3093\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1lpvt4h\" data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3154\">Semester 4 &ndash; Capstone Project and Advanced Specialization</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3253\">The final semester focuses on applied learning through a capstone project and advanced electives.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3276\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3352\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qfdcvg\" data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3297\">Capstone Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ovljsm\" data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3325\">MCA AI &amp; ML Elective IV</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"agdtxb\" data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3352\">MCA AI &amp; ML Elective V</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3375\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3620\">Students apply all their knowledge to a real-world AI project, demonstrating skills in machine learning, software development, and data-driven problem-solving. This semester prepares learners for industry-ready roles and research opportunities.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 195000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(385, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 229, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 07:03:35', '2026-05-14 07:03:35', '<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"422\">The Online MCA in Cyber Security at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham follows a simple, fully online admission process designed to make enrollment smooth for students and working professionals. The process is structured to ensure transparency, convenience, and quick access to the program without the need for physical visits or complex formalities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"601\">This streamlined admission pathway allows learners to easily transition into a career-focused program in cybersecurity, ethical hacking, network security, and digital forensics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"606\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"628\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"794\">The first step is selecting the Online MCA in Cyber Security based on academic background, technical interest, and long-term career goals in the IT security domain.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"850\">Before applying, candidates should carefully evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"el2cva\" data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"899\">Program structure and semester-wise syllabus</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j8qs9e\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"975\">Eligibility requirements including mathematics and technical background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gn6phd\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1009\">Fee structure and EMI options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iysvu4\" data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1073\">Career opportunities in cybersecurity and IT security roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2hbp25\" data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1109\">Course duration and flexibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1137\">This program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11tbjha\" data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1192\">Graduates in BCA, Computer Science, or Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p2xz5k\" data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1249\">Students with mathematics and programming background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fwyizz\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1303\">Working professionals in IT and networking fields</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zk9vgw\" data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1372\">Individuals aiming for cybersecurity and ethical hacking careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cmlfhf\" data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1441\">Learners interested in digital forensics and security operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1573\">Selecting the right program helps ensure alignment with future career growth in cybersecurity and information security industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1578\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1594\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1719\">After selecting the program, candidates must complete the online application process through the official admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1754\">The application process includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"2007\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hsfb9n\" data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1820\">Filling out the online application form with personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yzyw60\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1868\">Entering academic qualification information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12c6fi1\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1913\">Uploading required educational documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0obln\" data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1960\">Submitting identity verification documents</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nxkpyh\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2007\">Paying the registration or application fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2144\">The fully digital system eliminates paperwork and allows candidates to apply from any location, making the process fast and convenient.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2252\">Students in their final year of graduation are also eligible to apply using their latest semester results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2257\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2277\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2440\">Once the application is reviewed and eligibility is verified, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment instructions from the university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2473\">After enrollment, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2694\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2513\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2550\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10dsl9p\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2604\">Participate in assignments, quizzes, and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ckcfu\" data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2651\">Interact with faculty and academic mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ahu2lj\" data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2694\">Learn at a flexible pace from anywhere</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2829\">The digital learning environment is designed to support both theoretical understanding and practical cybersecurity skill development.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"521\">The Online MCA in Cyber Security at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students and professionals who want to build advanced careers in cybersecurity, ethical hacking, network protection, digital forensics, and information security management. The program requires a strong academic background in computer science, mathematics, or related technical fields to ensure learners can effectively handle advanced cybersecurity concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"693\">The eligibility structure is carefully designed to maintain academic standards while allowing graduates from multiple technical streams to enter this specialized program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"698\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"735\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"841\">Candidates applying for the Online MCA in Cyber Security must fulfill the following academic conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cgen7y\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"871\">Minimum Graduation Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"1013\">Applicants must have secured a minimum of <strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"938\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in their undergraduate degree from a recognized university or institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1142\">This ensures that students have a strong academic foundation required for advanced cybersecurity and computer science learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1147\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2bml5b\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1188\">Educational Qualification Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1221\">Candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1497\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18w9ghj\" data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1266\">10 + 2 education from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c5ihqf\" data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1497\">A Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any one of the following fields:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1497\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7p4s2a\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1372\">Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u205fe\" data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1431\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science or Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wh8jys\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1497\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in Science with Mathematics at 10+2 level</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1629\">This ensures that learners have sufficient programming, analytical, and mathematical knowledge required for cybersecurity studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1634\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ybnbik\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1668\">Final-Year Student Eligibility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1811\">Students currently in the final year of their undergraduate program are also eligible to apply using their latest completed semester results.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1935\">This allows learners to begin the admission process early and smoothly transition into postgraduate studies without delay.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1940\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aur382\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1969\">Work Experience Advantage</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2110\">Although work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional exposure will have an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2143\">Work experience helps learners:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2380\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18yq9ow\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2203\">Understand real-world cybersecurity threats and systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ftfb66\" data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2261\">Apply theoretical knowledge in practical environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bzybzg\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2320\">Develop stronger analytical and problem-solving skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vfbzdb\" data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2380\">Gain industry-level exposure in IT and security domains</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2521\">This is particularly beneficial for professionals working in IT support, networking, software development, and cybersecurity-related roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2526\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"unzcxn\" data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2574\">Online MCA in Cyber Security Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2674\">The program offers flexible duration options suitable for both students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2705\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2705\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2694\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2705\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2746\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2735\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2746\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2766\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2777\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2919\">This flexible structure allows learners to complete the program at their own pace while balancing education, work, and personal commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"527\">The Online MCA in Cyber Security at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is a specialized postgraduate program designed to build advanced expertise in cybersecurity operations, ethical hacking, network protection, cryptography, cyber forensics, and secure system development. The program is structured to provide strong theoretical knowledge along with practical cybersecurity applications, preparing learners for high-demand roles in the IT security industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"732\">The fee structure is designed to ensure affordability, flexibility, and accessibility for both Indian and international students through EMI options, semester-wise payments, and annual discount benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1uvsp6x\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"794\">Online MCA in Cyber Security Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"892\">Indian students can choose flexible payment options based on convenience and financial planning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"920\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"920\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"910\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"920\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"958\">\r\n<td data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"947\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Per Month EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"958\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹7,958*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"985\">\r\n<td data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"974\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"985\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹45,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1024\">\r\n<td data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1013\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹90,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1045\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1058\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,95,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1082\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1111\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1111\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1111\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1141\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1168\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1191\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1336\">The EMI-based structure helps reduce financial pressure, while the annual payment option provides additional savings through discount benefits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"114mxlx\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1400\">Online MCA in Cyber Security Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1509\">For international learners, the university offers a separate fee structure to support global accessibility.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1649\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1537\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1537\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1527\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1537\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1649\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1574\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1563\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1574\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹53,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1615\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1602\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1&ndash;Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1615\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,05,925</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1649\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1649\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,28,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1673\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1692\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1702\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1740\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1732\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1740\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1759\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1920\">This structure ensures that international students can pursue advanced cybersecurity education through a flexible online learning model.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1925\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1951\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"2042\">The program provides a <strong data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2000\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong> to make higher education more affordable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2060\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2233\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ufpcr8\" data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2099\">Monthly payment starting at ₹7,958</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15nk099\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2137\">No heavy upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vzjgeq\" data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2181\">Easy installment-based learning support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qjbc96\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2233\">Suitable for students and working professionals</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"517\">The Online MCA in Cyber Security at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is a specialized postgraduate program designed to build strong expertise in network security, cyber defense systems, ethical hacking concepts, cryptography, digital forensics, and secure software development. The program integrates core computer science foundations with advanced cybersecurity technologies to prepare learners for high-demand roles in IT security and digital risk management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"795\">This program is ideal for graduates who want to build careers in cybersecurity engineering, security analysis, threat intelligence, ethical hacking, and information security management across industries such as IT services, banking, government systems, and global enterprises.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"984\">The curriculum is structured across four semesters, progressing from foundational computing knowledge to advanced cybersecurity operations, research, and real-world security applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1mnbx2u\" data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1047\">Semester 1 &ndash; Computing Foundations and Security Basics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1171\">The first semester focuses on building strong programming and mathematical foundations required for cybersecurity systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1194\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1432\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g7qfk8\" data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1230\">Foundations of Computer Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jvuhdb\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1285\">Mathematical Foundations for Computer Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2nhx0\" data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1328\">Object Oriented Programming using Java</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r69zle\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1377\">Stream Core 1: Python Scripting for Security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bk1416\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1432\">Stream Core 2: Fundamentals of Security Operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1455\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1720\">Students develop a strong understanding of computer systems, programming logic, and scripting techniques used in cybersecurity environments. Fundamentals of security operations help learners understand how security systems are monitored and protected in real-time.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1725\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"9yyhyc\" data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1787\">Semester 2 &ndash; Network Security and Cryptography Foundations</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1903\">The second semester focuses on strengthening algorithmic thinking and introducing advanced cybersecurity concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1926\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"2139\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18z8ykp\" data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1961\">Data Structures and Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6co4v8\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1977\">Soft Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1acxson\" data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2023\">Mathematical Foundations for Cryptography</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ro8xm\" data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2069\">Stream Core 3: ML and AI in Cybersecurity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bu5nmx\" data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2105\">Stream Core 4: Network Security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tr2xg6\" data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2139\">MCA Cyber Security Elective I</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2162\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2395\">Students gain expertise in cryptography principles, secure network systems, and AI applications in cybersecurity. Network security training helps learners understand how to protect systems from cyber threats and unauthorized access.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xj6vig\" data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2462\">Semester 3 &ndash; Advanced Security Systems and Cyber Forensics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2582\">The third semester focuses on advanced security technologies, research methods, and forensic investigation techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2605\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2844\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wlmmu9\" data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2637\">Software Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jpcxlo\" data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2662\">Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ig10k6\" data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2723\">Stream Core 5: Blockchain and Decentralized Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x6z8mu\" data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2758\">Stream Core 6: Cyber Forensics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12wbyzj\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2793\">MCA Cyber Security Elective II</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"530452\" data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2829\">MCA Cyber Security Elective III</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q4jmlv\" data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2844\">Case Study</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2867\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"3100\">Students learn how blockchain technology enhances security systems and how cyber forensic tools are used to investigate cybercrimes. Research methodology and case studies help learners understand real-world cybersecurity challenges.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3105\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1x7k5u6\" data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3179\">Semester 4 &ndash; Capstone Project and Advanced Cyber Security Applications</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3278\">The final semester focuses on applied learning through a capstone project and advanced electives.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3301\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3302\" data-end=\"3392\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qfdcvg\" data-start=\"3302\" data-end=\"3322\">Capstone Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12wbakg\" data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3357\">MCA Cyber Security Elective IV</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12wbyzj\" data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3392\">MCA Cyber Security Elective II</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3415\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3609\">Students apply their knowledge to real-world cybersecurity problems through a major project. This includes designing secure systems, analyzing threats, and implementing cybersecurity solutions.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 195000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(386, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 39, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 07:18:10', '2026-05-14 07:18:10', '<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"466\">The Online BCA admission process at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to be simple, fully digital, and student-friendly. It ensures that applicants can complete the entire admission journey without any physical paperwork or campus visits. The process is structured in three main steps, making it easy for students from any location to apply and begin their academic journey in computer applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"471\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"493\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"630\">The first step is selecting the Online BCA program based on academic interest and career goals in the field of computer science and IT.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"709\">Before proceeding with the application, students should carefully understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"el2cva\" data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"758\">Program structure and semester-wise syllabus</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dp2t10\" data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"809\">Eligibility criteria and academic requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"spzxq0\" data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"865\">Career opportunities in software development and IT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mxvxil\" data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"909\">Course duration and flexibility options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13c4dfq\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"947\">Fee structure and payment methods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1110\">This step helps students ensure that the program aligns with their future goals in areas such as programming, web development, data analytics, and cybersecurity.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1115\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1131\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1257\">Once the program is selected, candidates need to complete the online application form through the official admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1292\">The application process includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1562\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5rdpdj\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1348\">Filling in personal and academic details accurately</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5nyebu\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1414\">Uploading required documents such as mark sheets and ID proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"egmwji\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1464\">Providing contact and educational information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h0p2cy\" data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1507\">Submitting the application form online</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"acefpu\" data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1562\">Completing any applicable registration fee payment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1684\">The entire process is digital, allowing students to apply easily from anywhere without physical submission of documents.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1793\">Students who are currently in their final year of study can also apply using their latest academic results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1798\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1818\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1951\">After successful verification of eligibility and documents, selected candidates receive admission confirmation from the university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1981\">Once enrolled, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2190\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2021\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2058\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10dsl9p\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2112\">Participate in assignments, quizzes, and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qawshs\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2153\">Communicate with faculty and mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"woy09f\" data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2190\">Study flexibly from any location</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2320\">The learning system is designed to support both academic understanding and practical skill development in computer applications.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"401\">The Online BCA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students who want to build a strong foundation in computer science, programming, software development, and emerging technologies. The program focuses on developing technical, analytical, and problem-solving skills required for careers in the IT and software industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"627\">The eligibility criteria are structured to ensure that students entering the program have the necessary academic background while still keeping the admission process flexible and inclusive for different learning backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"669\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"762\">Candidates applying for the Online BCA program must meet the following academic conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a7tjrd\" data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"793\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"932\">Applicants must have secured a minimum of <strong data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"860\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in their qualifying examination from a recognized board or institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"1054\">This ensures that students have the basic academic readiness required for computer applications and programming studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1059\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2bml5b\" data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1100\">Educational Qualification Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1133\">Candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1178\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18w9ghj\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1178\">10 + 2 education from a recognized board</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1302\">Additionally, candidates who have completed a <strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1244\">3-year diploma</strong> from a recognized institution are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1427\">This flexible eligibility structure allows students from both academic and technical backgrounds to pursue the BCA program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1432\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aur382\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1461\">Work Experience Advantage</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1590\">Although work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional exposure will have an added advantage during admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1623\">Work experience helps students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1817\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n02q8y\" data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1665\">Understand real-world IT environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"97pv08\" data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1712\">Improve logical and problem-solving skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"beuibm\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1760\">Gain better exposure to technical workflows</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ktkt0f\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1817\">Strengthen career readiness in the software industry</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1822\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"8go3ey\" data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1852\">Online BCA Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1948\">The Online BCA program offers flexible duration options suitable for different learning paces.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"2051\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1979\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1979\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1968\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1979\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2051\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2009\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2020\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2051\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2040\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2051\" data-col-size=\"sm\">6 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2197\">This flexibility helps students balance education with personal or professional commitments while completing their degree at a comfortable pace.</p>', '<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"519\">The Online BCA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to offer affordable and flexible higher education in computer applications. The fee structure is structured to support students from different financial backgrounds through monthly payments, semester-wise options, and annual discounts. This makes the program accessible for both Indian and international learners who want to build a career in IT, software development, and emerging technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"524\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wz8q54\" data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"563\">Online BCA Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"671\">Indian students can choose flexible payment options depending on their convenience and financial planning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"699\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"699\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"689\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"699\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"747\">\r\n<td data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"736\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly EMI (Zero Cost)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"747\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,375*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"774\">\r\n<td data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"763\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"774\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹23,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"813\">\r\n<td data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"802\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"813\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹44,650</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<td data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"834\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"847\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,41,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"871\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"894\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"894\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"884\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"894\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"932\">\r\n<td data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"924\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"932\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<td data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"951\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"974\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1112\">The EMI option allows students to pay in small monthly installments, making higher education more manageable without financial pressure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1117\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"to8ayc\" data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1158\">Online BCA Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1256\">For international students, a separate fee structure is provided to ensure global accessibility.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1284\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1284\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1274\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1284\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1321\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1310\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1321\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹28,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1360\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1349\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1360\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹53,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1381\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1394\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,68,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1418\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1431\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1441\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1479\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1471\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1479\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1498\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1521\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1668\">This structure allows international learners to access high-quality online education in computer applications with flexibility and affordability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"zr2oob\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1699\">Zero Cost EMI Facility</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1825\">The program provides a <strong data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1748\">Zero Cost EMI option</strong>, allowing students to pay monthly instead of making a large upfront payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1843\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"2043\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3t9th\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1891\">Easy monthly installment starting at ₹4,375</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qgubfk\" data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1939\">No heavy financial burden at admission time</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xtdeaa\" data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1991\">Flexible payment structure for working students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ek2tfh\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2043\">Better financial planning throughout the course</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"470\">The Online BCA program at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is a comprehensive undergraduate degree designed to build strong foundations in computer science, programming, software development, data management, and emerging technologies. The program blends theoretical concepts with practical applications to prepare students for careers in IT, software engineering, data analytics, cybersecurity, and application development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"688\">The curriculum is structured across six semesters, gradually progressing from basic computing concepts to advanced programming, software engineering, machine learning fundamentals, and real-world project development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"693\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"xixoz8\" data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"750\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundations of Computing and Mathematics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"904\">The first semester introduces students to essential communication skills, mathematics, and core computing principles required for computer applications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"927\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"1098\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yhpi96\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"957\">Communicative English &ndash; 1</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aeu11u\" data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1000\">Foundations of Applied Mathematics &ndash; I</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ebawn\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1029\">Principles of Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xweema\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1053\">Computer Essentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dj91mj\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1098\">Problem Solving and Algorithmic Thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1121\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1344\">Students develop a basic understanding of computer systems, logical thinking, and problem-solving skills. This semester builds the foundation required for programming and software development in later stages of the course.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1r7dgqh\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1410\">Semester 2 &ndash; Programming Fundamentals and System Concepts</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1524\">The second semester focuses on programming logic, operating systems, databases, and object-oriented programming.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1547\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1825\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y6virn\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1578\">Professional Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13y6rmj\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1622\">Foundations of Applied Mathematics &ndash; II</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5iv66h\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1669\">Operating System and Computer Architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2nhx0\" data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1712\">Object Oriented Programming using Java</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yovjob\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1743\">Database Management System</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"731yl0\" data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1778\">Database Management System Lab</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kdzjej\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1825\">Object Oriented Programming using Java Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1848\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"2060\">Students gain hands-on experience in Java programming and database management systems. This semester helps learners understand how software interacts with hardware and how data is stored and managed efficiently.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2065\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tfz4bj\" data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2119\">Semester 3 &ndash; Data Structures and Computer Networks</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2242\">The third semester builds strong technical skills in algorithms, networking, and mathematical concepts used in computing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2265\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2501\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18z8ykp\" data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2300\">Data Structures and Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16l4p2a\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2322\">Computer Networks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13kk5be\" data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2367\">Environmental Science and Sustainability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7zmjqy\" data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2405\">Stream Core: Discrete Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljjup7\" data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2433\">Professional Elective I</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g4a91e\" data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2462\">Professional Elective II</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e91jpi\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2501\">Data Structures and Algorithms Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2524\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2708\">Students learn how data is organized, processed, and transmitted in computer systems. Discrete mathematics strengthens logical reasoning required for programming and algorithm design.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ciozbc\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2771\">Semester 4 &ndash; Software Development and Web Technologies</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2895\">The fourth semester focuses on software engineering principles, web application development, and data analysis techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2918\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"3102\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6co4v8\" data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2934\">Soft Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bti781\" data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2966\">Web Application Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bruzqq\" data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"2982\">Data Mining</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u08d4u\" data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3007\">Software Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f6pxaj\" data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3037\">Professional Elective III</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g4au3h\" data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3066\">Professional Elective IV</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19qkk66\" data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3102\">Web Application Development Lab</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3125\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3330\">Students gain practical skills in developing web applications and understanding software development life cycles. Data mining introduces learners to basic data analysis and pattern recognition techniques.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3335\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"x4xbpk\" data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3399\">Semester 5 &ndash; Advanced Technologies and Industry Applications</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3401\" data-end=\"3527\">The fifth semester introduces advanced technologies such as machine learning, cybersecurity, and enterprise development tools.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3550\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3717\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xldk3y\" data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3576\">C# and .NET Framework</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr3aaw\" data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3612\">Foundations of Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"146dsk5\" data-start=\"3613\" data-end=\"3645\">Essentials of Cyber Security</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljk0ms\" data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3673\">Professional Elective V</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g4hlrx\" data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3702\">Professional Elective VI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q4jmlv\" data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3717\">Case Study</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3740\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3932\">Students explore machine learning fundamentals, cybersecurity basics, and enterprise-level programming using .NET. Case studies help bridge theoretical knowledge with real-world applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3934\" data-end=\"3937\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1y59pov\" data-start=\"3939\" data-end=\"3995\">Semester 6 &ndash; Capstone Project and Advanced Development</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4079\">The final semester focuses on project development and advanced application skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"4081\" data-end=\"4102\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4219\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qfdcvg\" data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4123\">Capstone Project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13tyjdt\" data-start=\"4124\" data-end=\"4158\">Mobile Application Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fdg6hg\" data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4188\">Professional Elective VII</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a3zj19\" data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4219\">Professional Elective VIII</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"imdy0b\" data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4242\">Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4423\">Students apply their knowledge to build real-world applications through a capstone project. Mobile application development enhances practical coding and software deployment skills.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 141000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(387, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 284, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 07:24:46', '2026-05-14 07:30:26', '<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"432\">The Online BBA in Data Analytics at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham follows a simple, fully online admission process designed to make enrollment smooth, fast, and accessible for students from all backgrounds. The process is structured in a clear step-by-step format so that applicants can easily complete their admission journey without confusion or delays.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"641\">This streamlined system ensures that students can quickly move from application to enrollment and begin their academic journey in business analytics, data interpretation, and modern business decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"646\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1px6fiu\" data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"668\">Choose the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"835\">The first step is selecting the Online BBA in Data Analytics based on academic interest, career goals, and future opportunities in the analytics and business domain.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"887\">Before applying, students should carefully review:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"1152\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"el2cva\" data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"936\">Program structure and semester-wise syllabus</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9d86j2\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"997\">Eligibility requirements (10+2 or diploma qualification)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iyk38b\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1039\">Fee structure and EMI payment options</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s0iwkx\" data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1108\">Career opportunities in business analytics and data-driven roles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mxvxil\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1152\">Course duration and flexibility options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1180\">This program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1471\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v7ixnc\" data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1238\">Students interested in business and analytics careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ihqrti\" data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1289\">Commerce, science, or arts background learners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"180aq6j\" data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1348\">Diploma holders seeking a degree in business analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qhb2t1\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1410\">Working professionals aiming to upgrade analytical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uhj4ze\" data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1471\">Learners interested in data-driven decision-making roles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1615\">Selecting the right program ensures alignment with long-term career goals in business intelligence, finance analytics, and corporate strategy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1620\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"q73y1p\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1636\">Apply Online</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1764\">After selecting the program, candidates need to complete the online application process through the official admission portal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1799\">The application process includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"2093\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hsfb9n\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1865\">Filling out the online application form with personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3x8gj\" data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1928\">Entering academic qualifications (10+2 or diploma details)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5nyebu\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1994\">Uploading required documents such as mark sheets and ID proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h0p2cy\" data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2037\">Submitting the application form online</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11n41qi\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2093\">Completing registration fee payment (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2215\">The entire process is digital, allowing students to apply from anywhere without physical documentation or campus visits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2335\">Students who are currently completing their qualifying examination can also apply using their latest academic results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11q99mx\" data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2360\">Join the Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2503\">Once the application is reviewed and eligibility is verified, selected candidates receive admission confirmation and enrollment instructions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2545\">After joining the program, students can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2770\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyjv5\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2585\">Access the online learning platform</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suq8pb\" data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2622\">Attend live and recorded classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10dsl9p\" data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2676\">Participate in assignments, quizzes, and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ckcfu\" data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2723\">Interact with faculty and academic mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3olvef\" data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2770\">Learn at a flexible pace from any location</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2925\">The learning environment is designed to support both theoretical knowledge and practical skill development in business analytics and data interpretation.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"449\">The Online BBA in Data Analytics at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed for students who want to build a strong foundation in business management along with analytical and data-driven decision-making skills. The program welcomes students from different academic backgrounds while ensuring they have the basic readiness required for business and analytics studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"672\">The eligibility criteria are structured to maintain academic standards while also offering flexibility for diploma holders and working professionals who want to pursue a career in data analytics and business intelligence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"677\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1s4hrya\" data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"714\">Academic Eligibility Requirements</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"817\">Candidates applying for the Online BBA in Data Analytics must meet the following academic conditions:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19ra5op\" data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"850\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"973\">Applicants must have secured a minimum of <strong data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"916\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in their qualifying examination from a recognized board.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1130\">This ensures that students have a basic academic foundation in mathematics, communication, and analytical thinking required for business analytics studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1135\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"2bml5b\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1176\">Educational Qualification Requirement</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1209\">Candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19f16f\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1258\"><strong data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1232\">10 + 2 education</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1390\">Additionally, candidates who have completed a <strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1332\">3-year diploma program</strong> from a recognized institution are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1512\">This flexible eligibility structure allows students from both academic and technical backgrounds to pursue this program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1517\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aur382\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1546\">Work Experience Advantage</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1684\">While work experience is not mandatory, candidates with professional exposure will have an added advantage during the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1717\">Work experience helps students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1920\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vk7ph5\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1763\">Understand real-world business operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr5fqh\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1813\">Improve analytical and decision-making skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ed7nf\" data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1862\">Gain exposure to data handling and reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itwwey\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1920\">Build stronger industry readiness for analytics roles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"2026\">This is especially useful for students aiming to transition into business analytics and corporate roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"11vuoqy\" data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2079\">Online BBA in Data Analytics Course Duration</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2168\">The program offers flexible completion timelines suitable for different learning needs.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2271\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2199\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2199\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2188\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2199\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2271\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2240\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2229\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2240\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2271\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2260\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2271\" data-col-size=\"sm\">6 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2380\">This flexibility allows students to balance their studies with personal responsibilities or part-time work.</p>', '<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"564\">The Online BBA in Data Analytics at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is designed to make quality business and analytics education accessible through a flexible and affordable fee structure. The program offers multiple payment options, including monthly installments, semester-wise payments, and annual plans with discounts. This structure is suitable for students as well as working professionals who want to build careers in business analytics, data interpretation, and decision-making roles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"569\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"dcdlg8\" data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"626\">Online BBA in Data Analytics Fees for Indian Students</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"741\">Indian students can choose from flexible payment options based on their financial convenience and study planning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"917\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"759\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"769\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"917\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"817\">\r\n<td data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"806\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly EMI (Zero Cost)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"817\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹5,042*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"844\">\r\n<td data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"833\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"844\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹27,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"883\">\r\n<td data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"872\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"883\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹52,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"917\">\r\n<td data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"904\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"917\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,65,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"941\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"1044\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"954\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"964\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1044\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1002\">\r\n<td data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"994\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1002\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1044\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1021\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1044\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1197\">The EMI option allows students to pay in small monthly installments, reducing financial pressure while ensuring continuous access to quality education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1202\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"wdm704\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1261\">Online BBA in Data Analytics Fees for Foreign Nationals</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1382\">For international students, a separate fee structure is provided to ensure global accessibility and ease of enrollment.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1520\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1410\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1520\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1436\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1447\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹33,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1475\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1486\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹62,700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1520\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1507\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1520\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,98,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1544\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1567\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1567\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1557\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1567\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1605\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1597\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1605\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1624\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1647\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1790\">This structure ensures that international learners can pursue a globally relevant business analytics degree through a flexible online format.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"csxza1\" data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1820\">Zero Cost EMI Benefit</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1936\">The program offers a <strong data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1869\">Zero Cost EMI facility</strong>, making it easier for students to manage their education expenses.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f5p69f\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1957\">Key Advantages:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2131\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nmada8\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2000\">Low monthly payment starting at ₹5,042</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15nk099\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2038\">No heavy upfront financial burden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i14uw7\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2079\">Flexible installment-based structure</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qjbc96\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2131\">Suitable for students and working professionals</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"464\">The Online BBA in Data Analytics at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is a structured undergraduate program designed to build a strong foundation in business management along with essential analytical and data interpretation skills. The program combines core management subjects with data-oriented learning to prepare students for modern business environments where decision-making is driven by data insights.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"675\">This program is suitable for learners who want to develop careers in business analytics, data-driven marketing, financial analysis, operations management, and corporate decision-making roles across industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"823\">The curriculum is divided into six semesters, gradually developing from basic business concepts to advanced analytical and strategic applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"828\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1cmkdfk\" data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"882\">Semester 1 &ndash; Foundations of Business and Analytics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"1016\">The first semester introduces students to fundamental business concepts, communication skills, and basic quantitative understanding.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1039\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozme4o\" data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1065\">Communicative English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ebawn\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1094\">Principles of Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1119\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dlif4i\" data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1140\">Business and MIS</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g6463g\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1174\">Basic Concepts of Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1197\">Business Economics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dh8sns\" data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1219\">Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1389\">Students build a strong foundation in business principles and numerical reasoning, which forms the base for understanding data-driven decision-making in later semesters.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1f2fv5s\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1450\">Semester 2 &ndash; Business Systems and Statistical Basics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1555\">The second semester focuses on communication, legal aspects of business, and statistical understanding.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1578\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1766\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y6virn\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1609\">Professional Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ew816w\" data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1647\">Business Organization and Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rbjgcc\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1679\">Entrepreneurial Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13kk5be\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1724\">Environmental Science and Sustainability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ppdf6v\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1742\">Business Laws</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j6xavf\" data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1766\">Business Statistics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dh8sns\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1788\">Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1920\">Students develop an understanding of business structure, legal frameworks, and statistical tools used in basic data interpretation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1925\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"97q9ot\" data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1980\">Semester 3 &ndash; Organizational and Analytical Thinking</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2072\">This semester strengthens managerial understanding and introduces quantitative techniques.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2095\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2268\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmmd8u\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2124\">Organisational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1auxnr8\" data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2165\">Introduction to Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qehge7\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2191\">Banking and Insurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zw7n8o\" data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2225\">Basics of Business Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kg60\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2240\">Elective 1</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"skuumi\" data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2268\">Quantitative Techniques</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dh8sns\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2290\">Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2412\">Students learn how organizations function and how quantitative methods support business analysis and marketing decisions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2417\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"3bq9tz\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2468\">Semester 4 &ndash; Financial and Operational Analysis</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2562\">The fourth semester focuses on finance, human resources, and research-based decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2585\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2778\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o3wjk1\" data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2619\">Advanced Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pyby5\" data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2660\">Basics of Human Resources Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e3zi1y\" data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2697\">Introduction to Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pbto8i\" data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2722\">Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k01zf9\" data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2763\">Production and Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kh23\" data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2778\">Elective 2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dh8sns\" data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2800\">Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2934\">Students gain analytical understanding of financial systems, operational efficiency, and research methods used in business analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"2939\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"uv2qo7\" data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"3002\">Semester 5 &ndash; Strategic and International Business Analytics</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3088\">The fifth semester introduces strategic management and global business perspectives.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3111\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3319\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a1ycd4\" data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3152\">Principles of International Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19fzvjl\" data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3208\">Business Ethics and Corporate Social Responsibility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3khui\" data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3223\">Elective 3</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kiql\" data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3238\">Elective 4</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fbq1m0\" data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3279\">Introduction to Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suxde5\" data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3319\">Sustainable Business Administration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dh8sns\" data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3341\">Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3342\" data-end=\"3468\">Students understand global business operations, ethical decision-making, and strategic analysis for long-term business growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3473\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"v1y7so\" data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3533\">Semester 6 &ndash; Advanced Applications and Industry Exposure</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3654\">The final semester focuses on specialization electives, enterprise systems, and practical exposure through internships.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"134o47l\" data-start=\"3656\" data-end=\"3677\">Subjects Included</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3798\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kjj0\" data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3692\">Elective 5</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kkf3\" data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3707\">Elective 6</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3kl7i\" data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3722\">Elective 7</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ionq16\" data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3755\">Enterprise Resource Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2eg05\" data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3783\">Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hp4qxs\" data-start=\"3784\" data-end=\"3798\">Internship</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dh8sns\" data-start=\"3800\" data-end=\"3820\">Learning Outcome</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3938\">Students apply their knowledge in real-world business environments through internships and enterprise system studies.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 165000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(388, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 138, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 23:51:13', '2026-05-14 23:51:13', '<p data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"657\">The admission process for BBA in Digital Marketing &amp; Sales (Online) is simple, fully digital, and designed to make enrollment easy for students from any location. The process mainly includes selecting a program, submitting an online application, and completing enrollment formalities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"662\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xsv9tg\" data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"691\">Step 1: Choose a Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"807\">The first step is to carefully select the <strong data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"771\">BBA in Digital Marketing &amp; Sales</strong> program based on your career goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"1123\">At this stage, students should review course details such as subjects, eligibility criteria, duration, and career opportunities. Choosing the right specialization is important because it directly impacts future career paths in areas like digital marketing, sales management, branding, and online business strategy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1128\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dungdg\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1153\">Step 2: Apply Online</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1245\">After selecting the program, students need to complete the <strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1244\">online application process</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1539\">This includes filling out personal details, academic qualifications, and uploading required documents such as mark sheets and identity proof. The online application system makes the process quick and accessible, allowing students to apply from anywhere without visiting the campus physically.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1639\">It is important to ensure all details are entered correctly to avoid delays in admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1644\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18xxip\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1673\">Step 3: Join the Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1766\">Once the application is reviewed and approved, students receive confirmation for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"2096\">At this stage, candidates complete the fee payment process (as per selected plan such as EMI, semester-wise, or yearly payment). After successful verification and enrollment, students officially become part of the BBA in Digital Marketing &amp; Sales program and gain access to study materials, online classes, and academic support.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8dtpi\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2116\">&nbsp;</h2>', 1, '<p data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"673\">BBA in Digital Marketing &amp; Sales is an undergraduate program designed for students who want to build careers in modern marketing, sales strategies, and digital business growth. The eligibility criteria are kept simple so that students from different academic backgrounds can apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"678\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17b33f5\" data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"705\">Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"815\">To apply for this program, candidates must have completed their <strong data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"814\">10+2 (Class 12) from a recognized board</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"1068\">Students from any stream such as Arts, Commerce, or Science are generally eligible, depending on the institution&rsquo;s guidelines. This makes the program accessible for a wide range of students who are interested in business, marketing, and sales careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1073\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1103\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1199\">Candidates must have secured at least <strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1166\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in their qualifying examination.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1472\">This minimum percentage ensures that students have a basic academic foundation in communication, analytical thinking, and general subjects required for business studies. However, some institutions may offer relaxation based on admission policies or entrance requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1477\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qm7gnl\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1509\">Diploma Holders Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1602\">Students who have completed a <strong data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1574\">3-year diploma after Class 10</strong> are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1857\">This pathway is beneficial for students who have taken a skill-based or technical route after secondary education but now want to shift into business, marketing, or digital sales careers. It provides flexibility for non-traditional academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1862\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15gv5ip\" data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1892\">Work Experience Advantage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"2050\">Candidates with <strong data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1935\">prior work experience</strong> in marketing, sales, customer service, or business-related fields may get an <strong data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2049\">added advantage during admission</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2306\">While it is not always mandatory, work experience helps candidates stand out because it shows practical understanding of business environments, customer handling, and communication skills. Some institutions may consider it during selection or counseling.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2311\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1merre3\" data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2345\">Course Duration (Online Mode)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2414\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g6n05\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2380\"><strong data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2370\">Minimum Duration:</strong> 3 years</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gii7i\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2414\"><strong data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2404\">Maximum Duration:</strong> 6 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2678\">The flexible duration structure is designed for online learners and working professionals. Students can complete the program at their own pace within the allowed time frame, making it suitable for those managing studies along with jobs or other responsibilities.</p>', '<p data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"313\">View complete BBA in Digital Marketing &amp; Sales fee structure in a clear table format including EMI, semester fees, total cost, and additional charges for Indian and foreign students.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"318\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"114yubi\" data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"379\">BBA in Digital Marketing &amp; Sales (Online) &ndash; Fee Structure</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dctg5u\" data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"417\">Fee Structure for Indian Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"884\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"459\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"459\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"435\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"444\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"459\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"884\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"619\">\r\n<td data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"531\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly Fee (Zero Cost EMI)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"546\">₹5,042/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"619\">Flexible EMI option to pay fees monthly without extra interest burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"709\">\r\n<td data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"635\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"645\">₹27,500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"709\">Fee payable for each semester in a structured academic cycle</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"800\">\r\n<td data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"737\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"747\">₹52,250</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"800\">Discounted yearly payment option for cost savings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"884\">\r\n<td data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"833\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,65,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"884\">Complete program fee for the full 3-year course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1x1dvi6\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"929\">Fee Structure for Foreign Nationals</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1268\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"947\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"956\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"971\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1268\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1093\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1028\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1038\">₹33,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1093\">Fee payable per semester for international students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1121\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1131\">₹62,700</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1188\">Discounted yearly payment option for foreign students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1268\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1209\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1221\">₹1,98,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1268\">Total program cost for full course duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1273\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c2ndyx\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1325\">Additional Charges (Applicable to All Students)</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1588\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1338\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1347\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1362\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1588\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1483\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1418\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1436\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700 (one-time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1483\" data-col-size=\"md\">Paid during admission to confirm enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1588\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1502\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1524\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1588\" data-col-size=\"md\">Charged for each semester examination and evaluation process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1593\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"lqxu6f\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1630\">Fee Payment Flexibility Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1956\">The program offers multiple payment options so students can choose according to their financial comfort. Monthly EMI is best for reducing upfront burden, semester-wise payment offers structured planning, and yearly payment provides discount benefits. This flexibility makes the course accessible to a wide range of students.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"640\">BBA in Digital Marketing is a 3-year undergraduate program that combines basic business education with modern digital marketing concepts. The course is divided into 6 semesters and gradually moves from foundation subjects to advanced marketing, strategy, and practical industry exposure.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"645\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11it8cb\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"684\">Semester 1 &ndash; Business Fundamentals</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"797\">This semester focuses on building a base in communication, management, accounting, and basic business concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"947\">Subjects include Communicative English, Principles of Management, Financial Accounting, Business and MIS, Basic Mathematics, and Business Economics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1169\">Students learn basic business communication, how organizations work, simple accounting principles, and introductory economics. It helps in developing logical thinking and communication skills needed for higher semesters.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1174\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c27hcu\" data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1217\">Semester 2 &ndash; Business Systems &amp; Skills</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1316\">This semester focuses on improving communication skills and understanding how businesses operate.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1489\">Subjects include Professional Communication, Business Organization and Systems, Entrepreneurial Development, Environmental Science, Business Laws, and Business Statistics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1668\">Students learn about business structure, basic legal rules, entrepreneurship ideas, and data handling through statistics. It also improves analytical and decision-making skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4cjp4k\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1716\">Semester 3 &ndash; Introduction to Marketing</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1794\">This semester introduces marketing and technology-related business subjects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1973\">Subjects include Organisational Behaviour, Introduction to Marketing Management, Banking and Insurance, Basics of Business Technology, Quantitative Techniques, and one elective.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2145\">Students begin learning marketing basics like customer behavior, segmentation, and branding. They also get exposure to business technology and data-based decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2150\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rnydt\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2203\">Semester 4 &ndash; Advanced Marketing &amp; Finance Basics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2299\">This semester focuses on advanced marketing concepts and basic research and finance knowledge.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2460\">Subjects include Advanced Marketing Management, Basics of HRM, Introduction to Research Methods, Financial Management, Operations Management, and one elective.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2615\">Students learn how marketing strategies are planned, how financial decisions are made, and how business research is conducted for better decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2620\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hhih99\" data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2664\">Semester 5 &ndash; Strategy &amp; Global Business</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2745\">This semester focuses on strategy, ethics, and international business concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2888\">Subjects include International Business, Business Ethics &amp; CSR, Strategic Management, Sustainable Business Administration, and two electives.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"3053\">Students understand global markets, business ethics, and long-term strategic planning. Electives allow specialization in areas like digital marketing or analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3058\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"q3rb1u\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3114\">Semester 6 &ndash; Practical Training &amp; Industry Exposure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3177\">This is the final semester focused on real-world application.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3258\">Subjects include ERP, Supply Chain Management, Internship, and three electives.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3397\">Students gain hands-on industry experience through internships and learn how large organizations manage operations using digital systems.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 165000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(389, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-14 23:58:42', '2026-05-14 23:58:42', '<p data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"733\">The admission process for the Online BCom in Taxation and Finance (Integrated with CA subjects) is simple, fully digital, and designed for easy access. Students can complete the entire process online without visiting the campus physically. It mainly includes three basic steps: choosing a program, applying online, and joining the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"738\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xsv9tg\" data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"767\">Step 1: Choose a Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"902\">The first step is to carefully select the <strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"866\">Online BCom in Taxation and Finance (CA Integrated)</strong> program based on your career goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1210\">At this stage, students should review important details such as eligibility criteria, syllabus, fee structure, duration, and career opportunities. This helps in understanding whether the program aligns with goals like becoming an accountant, tax consultant, financial analyst, or pursuing CA-level careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1215\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dungdg\" data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1240\">Step 2: Apply Online</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1329\">After selecting the program, students need to complete the <strong data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1328\">online application form</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1608\">This includes entering personal details, academic qualifications, and uploading required documents such as 10+2 mark sheets, ID proof, and other relevant certificates. The online application process is simple and can be completed from anywhere using a mobile phone or computer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1723\">It is important to fill in accurate information to avoid delays or rejection during the admission review process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1728\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18xxip\" data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1757\">Step 3: Join the Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1846\">Once the application is reviewed and approved, students receive admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"2127\">At this stage, candidates complete the fee payment process based on their chosen plan (EMI, semester-wise, or yearly payment). After successful verification, students are officially enrolled in the program and gain access to study materials, online classes, and academic support.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2229\">This marks the beginning of their academic journey in taxation, finance, and CA-integrated subjects.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"760\">BCom in Taxation and Finance (Integrated with CA subjects) is a specialized commerce program designed for students who want to build strong careers in accounting, taxation, finance, and professional CA-level subjects. The eligibility criteria are simple and accessible, allowing students from different academic backgrounds to apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"765\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17b33f5\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"792\">Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"898\">Candidates must have completed <strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"868\">10+2 (Class 12) from a recognized board</strong> to be eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1125\">Students from Commerce, Science, or Arts streams can apply depending on institutional guidelines. This makes the program flexible and suitable for students interested in taxation, finance, and professional accounting careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1130\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1160\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1256\">Applicants must have secured at least <strong data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1223\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in their qualifying examination.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1496\">This minimum requirement ensures that students have a basic academic foundation in mathematics, commerce concepts, and analytical thinking, which are essential for understanding taxation laws, financial systems, and accounting principles.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qm7gnl\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1533\">Diploma Holders Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1643\">Students who have completed a <strong data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1598\">3-year diploma after Class 10</strong> are also eligible to apply for this program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1832\">This provides an alternative entry route for students who pursued skill-based or technical education but now want to shift into commerce, taxation, or finance-related professional fields.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1837\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15gv5ip\" data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1867\">Work Experience Advantage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"2018\">Candidates with <strong data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1910\">prior work experience</strong> in accounting, taxation, banking, or finance-related roles may receive an added advantage during admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2186\">Although not mandatory, work experience helps students better understand practical financial systems and improves their chances during selection in some institutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2191\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1merre3\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2225\">Course Duration (Online Mode)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2294\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g6n05\" data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2260\"><strong data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2250\">Minimum Duration:</strong> 3 years</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gii7i\" data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2294\"><strong data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2284\">Maximum Duration:</strong> 6 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2514\">The flexible duration structure allows students to complete the program at their own pace. It is especially useful for working professionals or students who need additional time due to personal or academic commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"727\">The Online BCom in Taxation and Finance (Integrated with CA subjects) is designed with an affordable and flexible fee system for both Indian and international students. The structure includes monthly EMI options, semester-wise payments, and yearly discounts to make higher education more accessible.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dctg5u\" data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"770\">Fee Structure for Indian Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"812\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"812\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"788\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"812\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<td data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"884\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly Fee (Zero Cost EMI)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"899\">₹3,792/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"972\">Flexible EMI option to pay fees monthly without extra interest burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1051\">\r\n<td data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"988\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"998\">₹20,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1051\">Fee payable per semester for academic progression</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1142\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1079\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1089\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹38,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1142\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discounted yearly payment option for cost savings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1163\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1175\">₹1,20,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1224\">Complete course fee for full program duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1229\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1x1dvi6\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1269\">Fee Structure for Foreign Nationals</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1612\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1311\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1311\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1287\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1296\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1311\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1612\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1433\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1368\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1378\">₹24,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1433\">Fee payable per semester for international students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1461\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1471\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹45,600</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1528\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discounted annual payment option for foreign learners</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1612\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1549\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1561\">₹1,44,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1612\">Total program cost for complete course duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1617\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c2ndyx\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1669\">Additional Charges (Applicable to All Students)</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1706\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1706\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1691\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1706\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1835\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1762\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1780\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700 (one-time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1835\">Paid at the time of admission to confirm enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1854\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1876\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1933\" data-col-size=\"md\">Charged for each semester exam and evaluation process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1938\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ud876s\" data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1966\">Fee Payment Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2068\">This program offers multiple payment options to suit different financial needs. Students can choose:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j5e65i\" data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2122\">Monthly Zero Cost EMI for easy budget management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qe2i4u\" data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2172\">Semester-wise payment for structured planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ptvt2r\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2214\">Yearly payment with discount benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2350\">This flexibility makes the course suitable for both students and working professionals who want to manage education costs efficiently.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"659\">BCom (Bachelor of Commerce) is a 3-year undergraduate program designed to build strong foundations in accounting, finance, taxation, business law, and management. The curriculum is divided into 6 semesters, gradually moving from basic commerce concepts to advanced financial and industry-oriented subjects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"664\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hrjccs\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"702\">Semester 1 &ndash; Commerce Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"794\">The first semester focuses on basic commerce subjects and foundational business knowledge.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"958\">Subjects include Communicative English, Accountancy, Principles of Management, Basic Concepts of Mathematics, Business and MIS, and Economics for Decision Making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1149\">Students learn the basics of accounting, business operations, and economic decision-making. This semester builds core analytical and numerical skills required for advanced commerce studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1154\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11e8bdk\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1204\">Semester 2 &ndash; Accounting &amp; Business Law Basics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1299\">This semester strengthens accounting knowledge and introduces legal and statistical concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1496\">Subjects include Professional Communication, Advanced Accountancy, Company Law, Business Statistics and Operations Research, Environmental Science and Sustainability, and Fundamentals of Costing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1660\">Students gain deeper understanding of financial reporting, business regulations, and cost analysis, along with statistical tools used in business decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1665\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ygr3qp\" data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1712\">Semester 3 &ndash; Corporate &amp; Financial Systems</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1801\">This semester focuses on corporate accounting and financial systems used in businesses.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1981\">Subjects include Corporate Accounting, Insurance and Risk Management, Introduction to GST, Banking, Management Accounting, and IFRS (International Financial Reporting Standards).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2129\">Students learn taxation systems, banking operations, risk management, and international accounting standards used in global business environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2134\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rs6e05\" data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2178\">Semester 4 &ndash; Auditing &amp; Financial Tools</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2255\">This semester introduces auditing practices and practical accounting tools.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2504\">Subjects include Auditing &ndash; Principles and Practices, Principles of Financial Management, Mercantile Laws, Introduction to Research Projects, Accounting Packages (Tally), Tally Lab, and Customs Law &ndash; Practice and Procedure along with one elective.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2655\">Students gain hands-on experience in accounting software like Tally and learn auditing procedures, financial management, and business laws in detail.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2660\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15pvtek\" data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2707\">Semester 5 &ndash; Advanced Finance &amp; Investment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2788\">This semester focuses on advanced financial management and investment concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2940\">Subjects include Capital Markets and Financial Services, Investment Management, Corporate Finance, Direct Taxes and Indirect Taxes, and two electives.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"3078\">Students understand stock markets, corporate funding, taxation systems, and investment strategies used in real-world financial planning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3083\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1sjzn83\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3130\">Semester 6 &ndash; Specialization &amp; Project Work</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3203\">The final semester focuses on specialization and practical application.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3288\">Subjects include Entrepreneurial Development, Project Work, and multiple electives.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3508\">Students work on real-time projects and choose electives based on their specialization such as finance, accounting, taxation, or business analytics. This semester prepares students for industry roles or higher studies.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 120000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(390, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 77, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-15 00:08:01', '2026-05-15 00:08:01', '<p data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"618\">The admission process for the Online MCom in Finance &amp; Systems is simple, fully digital, and designed to make enrollment easy for students and working professionals. The process is divided into three main steps: choosing the program, applying online, and joining the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"623\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xsv9tg\" data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"652\">Step 1: Choose a Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"785\">The first step is to carefully select the <strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"725\">MCom in Finance &amp; Systems</strong> program based on your academic background and career goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"1087\">At this stage, students should review key details such as eligibility criteria, syllabus structure, fee options, duration flexibility, and career opportunities. This helps in understanding whether the program aligns with future goals in finance, accounting, taxation, analytics, or corporate systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dungdg\" data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1117\">Step 2: Apply Online</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1208\">After selecting the program, candidates need to complete the <strong data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1207\">online application form</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1495\">This includes filling in personal details, educational qualifications, and uploading required documents such as graduation mark sheets, identity proof, and academic certificates. The application process is fully online, making it easy to complete from anywhere without physical visits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1597\">It is important to ensure all details are accurate to avoid delays or rejection during verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18xxip\" data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1631\">Step 3: Join the Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1720\">Once the application is reviewed and approved, students receive admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"2004\">At this stage, candidates complete the fee payment using their chosen plan such as EMI, semester-wise, or yearly payment options. After successful verification, students are officially enrolled in the program and gain access to online classes, study materials, and academic support.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2084\">This marks the beginning of their postgraduate journey in finance and systems.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"729\">MCom in Finance &amp; Systems is a postgraduate program designed for students who want to build advanced careers in finance, accounting, taxation, and business systems. The eligibility criteria are structured to ensure that students have a strong academic foundation in commerce or related fields before entering this specialized program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"734\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17b33f5\" data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"761\">Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"821\">To apply for this program, candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"935\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m7bljs\" data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"864\"><strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"862\">10+2 (Higher Secondary Education)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"it85mg\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"935\"><strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"935\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree (Minimum 3-year program) in any relevant field</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1138\">Students must complete both levels of education from a recognized board and university. This ensures they have basic and advanced knowledge required for postgraduate-level finance and systems subjects.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1173\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1272\">Candidates must have secured at least <strong data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1271\">50% aggregate marks in their undergraduate degree (UG)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1525\">This minimum percentage ensures that students have a strong academic background in commerce, finance, accounting, or related subjects, which is essential for understanding advanced concepts like corporate finance, taxation, analytics, and ERP systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15jsh1t\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1566\">Final Year Students Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1662\">Students who are currently in their <strong data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1632\">final year of graduation</strong> can also apply for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1943\">However, they must submit their <strong data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1731\">last completed semester results</strong> at the time of application. Final admission is confirmed after successful completion of the bachelor&rsquo;s degree. This allows students to plan their postgraduate studies without waiting for full graduation results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1948\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15gv5ip\" data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1978\">Work Experience Advantage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2139\">Candidates with <strong data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2021\">prior work experience</strong> in finance, accounting, taxation, banking, or business-related roles may receive an added advantage during admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2336\">While work experience is not mandatory, it helps candidates demonstrate practical knowledge of real-world financial systems, which can improve their chances during selection in some institutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2341\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1merre3\" data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2375\">Course Duration (Online Mode)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2444\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ab7rg4\" data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2410\"><strong data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2400\">Minimum Duration:</strong> 2 years</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1241grw\" data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2444\"><strong data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2434\">Maximum Duration:</strong> 4 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2657\">The flexible duration structure is designed to support both full-time students and working professionals. It allows learners to complete the program at their own pace depending on their schedule and commitments</p>', '<p data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"694\">The Online MCom in Finance &amp; Systems program offers a flexible and affordable fee structure designed for both Indian and international students. The course provides multiple payment options such as monthly EMI, semester-wise payment, and yearly discounted plans to make higher education more accessible and manageable.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"699\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dctg5u\" data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"737\">Fee Structure for Indian Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"779\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"779\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"755\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"764\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"779\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"932\">\r\n<td data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"851\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly Fee (Zero Cost EMI)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"866\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,208/month</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"932\">Easy monthly payment option without additional interest burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"1011\">\r\n<td data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"948\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"958\">₹22,500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1011\">Fee payable per semester for academic progression</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1102\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1039\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1049\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹42,750</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1102\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discounted annual payment option for cost savings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1123\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1133\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹90,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1182\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete program fee for full course duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1x1dvi6\" data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1227\">Fee Structure for Foreign Nationals</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1569\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1245\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1254\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1269\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1569\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1391\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1326\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1336\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹26,500</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1391\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fee payable per semester for international students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1419\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1429\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹50,350</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1486\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discounted yearly payment option for foreign students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1569\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1507\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1519\">₹1,06,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1569\">Full program cost for complete course duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1574\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c2ndyx\" data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1626\">Additional Charges (Applicable to All Students)</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1639\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1648\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1663\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1784\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1719\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1737\">₹700 (one-time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1784\">Paid during admission to confirm enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1803\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1825\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1882\">Charged for each semester exam and evaluation process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ud876s\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1915\">Fee Payment Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"2055\">The program is designed with flexible payment options so students can choose according to their financial situation. Students can opt for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2198\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zk5lgq\" data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2105\">Monthly Zero Cost EMI for easy affordability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"caogza\" data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2156\">Semester-wise payment for structured budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ptvt2r\" data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2198\">Yearly payment with discount benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2295\">This flexibility makes the program suitable for both fresh graduates and working professionals.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"704\">MCom in Finance &amp; Systems is a postgraduate program designed to build advanced expertise in corporate accounting, financial management, taxation, analytics, and enterprise systems. The course focuses on developing strong analytical, financial, and research-based skills required for corporate and academic careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"909\">The syllabus is structured into three main semesters along with project work and electives, gradually moving from advanced accounting concepts to financial analytics and business decision-making systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"914\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tmi9cw\" data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"976\">Semester 1 &ndash; Advanced Accounting &amp; Analytical Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1102\">The first semester focuses on strengthening advanced accounting knowledge along with analytical and research-based subjects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1313\">Subjects include Advanced Corporate Accounting, Business Correspondence, Research Methodology, Applied Statistics, Analysis using Advanced Excel Lab, and Economic Analysis for Managers along with one elective.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1624\">Students learn corporate-level accounting practices, data analysis using Excel, and statistical tools for financial decision-making. Research Methodology helps in developing academic and business research skills, while Economics for Managers builds understanding of business decision-making at a higher level.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1629\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"j6tp0\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1676\">Semester 2 &ndash; Finance, Law &amp; Data Analytics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1784\">The second semester focuses on financial management, corporate laws, governance, and predictive analytics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1978\">Subjects include Accounting for Managerial Decisions, Advanced Financial Management, Corporate Law, Advanced Accounting Tally Lab, Predictive Analytics, Corporate Governance, and one elective.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2264\">Students gain deeper knowledge of financial planning, investment decisions, legal frameworks, and corporate governance systems. Predictive Analytics introduces data-driven forecasting techniques, while Tally Lab provides practical exposure to accounting software used in the industry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2269\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"unadnc\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2319\">Semester 3 &ndash; Taxation, ERP &amp; Business Finance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2423\">The third semester focuses on taxation, investment analysis, entrepreneurship, and enterprise systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2700\">Subjects include Corporate Income Tax, Security Analysis and Portfolio Management, Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) and MIS, Small Business and Entrepreneurship, Elective subjects, Minor Project (for F &amp; S), and Major Project / Electives (for International Finance stream).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2925\">Students learn how corporate taxation works, how investment portfolios are managed, and how ERP systems support business operations. Entrepreneurship subjects help in understanding startup development and business planning.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"foe4oo\" data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2964\">&nbsp;</h2>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 106000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(391, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 227, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-15 00:18:52', '2026-05-15 00:18:52', '<p data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"591\">The admission process for the Online MBA in Marketing is simple, fully digital, and designed for easy access for students and working professionals. The process is divided into three main steps: choosing a program, applying online, and joining the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"596\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xsv9tg\" data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"625\">Step 1: Choose a Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"736\">The first step is to select the <strong data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"686\">Online MBA in Marketing</strong> program based on your career goals and interests.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"1044\">At this stage, students should carefully review important details such as eligibility criteria, syllabus, fee structure, duration, and career opportunities. This helps in understanding whether the program aligns with long-term goals in marketing, branding, digital marketing, sales, or business management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1049\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dungdg\" data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1074\">Step 2: Apply Online</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1165\">After selecting the program, candidates need to complete the <strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1164\">online application form</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1428\">This includes filling in personal details, academic qualifications, and uploading required documents such as graduation certificates, mark sheets, and identity proof. The process is fully online, allowing students to apply from anywhere without physical visits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1519\">It is important to ensure all details are accurate to avoid delays in admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1524\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18xxip\" data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1553\">Step 3: Join the Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1645\">Once the application is reviewed and approved, students receive confirmation of admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1931\">At this stage, candidates complete the fee payment using their preferred option such as EMI, semester-wise, or yearly payment plan. After successful verification, students are officially enrolled in the program and gain access to online classes, study materials, and academic support.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"2029\">This marks the beginning of their journey in advanced marketing and business management studies.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"707\">MBA in Marketing is a postgraduate program designed for students who want to build careers in marketing management, branding, sales strategy, digital marketing, and business leadership. The eligibility criteria ensure that applicants have a strong academic foundation and basic business understanding before entering the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"712\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17b33f5\" data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"739\">Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"803\">To apply for MBA in Marketing, candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"939\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hcmk39\" data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"870\"><strong data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"844\">10+2 (Higher Secondary Education)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"en0ds3\" data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"939\"><strong data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"919\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree (Minimum 3-year program)</strong> in any discipline</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1105\">Students from any academic background such as Commerce, Science, or Arts can apply, but they must have completed a recognized undergraduate degree before admission.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1110\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1140\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1239\">Candidates must have secured at least <strong data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1238\">50% aggregate marks in their undergraduate degree (UG)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1448\">This requirement ensures that students have a strong academic base in analytical thinking, business understanding, and communication skills, which are essential for advanced marketing and management studies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1453\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15jsh1t\" data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1489\">Final Year Students Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1594\">Students who are currently in the <strong data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1566\">final year of their bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1850\">They must submit their <strong data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1654\">last completed semester results</strong> at the time of admission. Final enrollment is confirmed only after successful completion of the degree. This allows students to plan their MBA journey without waiting for full graduation results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1855\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15gv5ip\" data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1885\">Work Experience Advantage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"2038\">Candidates with <strong data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1928\">prior work experience</strong> in marketing, sales, business development, or related fields may receive an added advantage during admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2204\">Although not mandatory, work experience helps students better understand real-world business scenarios and may improve their selection chances in some institutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1merre3\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2243\">Course Duration (Online Mode)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2312\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ab7rg4\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2278\"><strong data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2268\">Minimum Duration:</strong> 2 years</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1241grw\" data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2312\"><strong data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2302\">Maximum Duration:</strong> 4 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2502\">The flexible duration allows students to complete the MBA program at their own pace. It is especially useful for working professionals who need additional time due to job responsibilities.</p>', '<p data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"662\">The Online MBA in Marketing offers a flexible and structured fee system designed to support both Indian and international students. The program includes multiple payment options such as monthly EMI, semester-wise payments, and yearly discounted plans, making it easier to manage higher education costs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"667\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dctg5u\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"705\">Fee Structure for Indian Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"747\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"747\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"732\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"747\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"899\">\r\n<td data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"819\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly Fee (Zero Cost EMI)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"834\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹9,625/month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"899\" data-col-size=\"md\">Easy monthly installment option without extra interest burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"978\">\r\n<td data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"915\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"925\">₹55,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"978\">Fee payable per semester for academic progression</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1071\">\r\n<td data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1006\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1018\">₹1,04,500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1071\">Discounted yearly payment option for cost savings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1092\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1104\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,20,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1157\">Complete program fee for full MBA course duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1162\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1x1dvi6\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1202\">Fee Structure for Foreign Nationals</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1244\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1244\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1220\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1229\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1244\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1301\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1311\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹64,500</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1366\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fee payable per semester for international students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1463\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1394\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1406\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,22,550</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1463\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discounted yearly payment option for foreign learners</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1484\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1496\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,58,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1547\">Total program cost for complete course duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1552\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c2ndyx\" data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1604\">Additional Charges (Applicable to All Students)</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1854\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1617\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1626\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1641\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1854\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1762\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1697\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1715\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700 (one-time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1762\" data-col-size=\"md\">Paid during admission to confirm enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1854\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1781\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1803\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1854\">Charged for each semester exams and evaluations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1859\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ud876s\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1887\">Fee Payment Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1969\">The program provides multiple payment options to suit different financial needs:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2112\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zk5lgq\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2019\">Monthly Zero Cost EMI for easy affordability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"caogza\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2070\">Semester-wise payment for structured budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ptvt2r\" data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2112\">Yearly payment with discount benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2218\">This flexibility makes the MBA in Marketing suitable for both fresh graduates and working professionals.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"689\">MBA in Marketing is a postgraduate program designed to develop advanced knowledge in marketing strategy, consumer behavior, branding, digital marketing, and business analytics. The course is structured across four semesters and combines core management subjects with specialized marketing electives and practical learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7ivwy1\" data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"753\">Semester 1 &ndash; Management Foundations &amp; Marketing Basics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"894\">The first semester focuses on building a strong foundation in management principles, organizational behavior, and basic marketing concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"1128\">Subjects include Fundamentals of Management &amp; Organizational Behaviour, Human Resources and Organizational Development, Marketing and Consumer Behaviour, Marketing Communications (Elective 1), and Soft Skills &amp; Employability Skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1368\">Students learn how organizations function, how consumer behavior influences marketing decisions, and how communication strategies are used in branding. Soft skills training helps improve professional communication and workplace readiness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kjz56e\" data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1431\">Semester 2 &ndash; Business Strategy &amp; Data Decision Making</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1535\">The second semester focuses on business operations, finance, strategy, and data-based decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1734\">Subjects include Business Finance, Operations and Supply Chain Management, Data-Driven Decision Making, Business Ethics and Strategic Management, and Sales and Distribution Management (Elective 2).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"2005\">Students gain knowledge of financial planning, supply chain systems, and ethical business practices. Data-driven decision-making introduces analytical tools used in modern marketing strategies, while sales management focuses on distribution channels and revenue growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2010\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1chuck4\" data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2072\">Semester 3 &ndash; Digital Transformation &amp; Marketing Analytics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2160\">The third semester introduces advanced marketing domains and global business concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2332\">Subjects include International Business, Business Analytics and Business Modelling, Digital Marketing (Elective 3), Retail Marketing (Elective 4), and Education for Life.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2578\">Students learn how businesses operate globally and how analytics is used for marketing insights. Digital marketing and retail marketing electives help develop skills in online branding, e-commerce strategies, and customer engagement techniques.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2583\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"5z352o\" data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2642\">Semester 4 &ndash; Advanced Marketing &amp; Industry Application</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2748\">The final semester focuses on sustainability, research, customer management, and practical project work.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2943\">Subjects include Environment Sustainability and Governance, Project Work, Data Driven Marketing (Elective 5), Marketing Research (Elective 6), and Customer Relationship Management (Elective 7).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"3191\">Students apply their knowledge through real-world projects and research-based learning. CRM and data-driven marketing help in understanding customer lifecycle management, while sustainability introduces ethical and responsible business practices.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 220000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(392, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 231, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-15 00:30:40', '2026-05-15 00:30:40', '<p data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"573\">The admission process for the Online MBA in FinTech is simple, fully online, and designed for easy access for students and working professionals. It is divided into three main steps: choosing a program, applying online, and joining the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"578\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xsv9tg\" data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"607\">Step 1: Choose a Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"760\">The first step is to select the <strong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"666\">Online MBA in FinTech</strong> program based on your career goals and interests in finance, technology, and digital banking.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"1075\">At this stage, students should carefully review important details such as eligibility criteria, syllabus, fee structure, duration, and career opportunities. This helps in understanding whether the program aligns with long-term goals in fintech, financial analytics, banking technology, or digital finance systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1080\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dungdg\" data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1105\">Step 2: Apply Online</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1196\">After selecting the program, candidates need to complete the <strong data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1195\">online application form</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1465\">This includes filling in personal details, academic qualifications, and uploading required documents such as graduation certificates, mark sheets, and identity proof. The entire process is digital, allowing students to apply from anywhere without visiting the campus.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1587\">It is important to ensure that all details are accurate and properly submitted to avoid delays in the admission process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18xxip\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1621\">Step 3: Join the Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1710\">Once the application is reviewed and approved, students receive admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1997\">At this stage, candidates complete the fee payment using their preferred option such as EMI, semester-wise, or yearly payment plans. After successful verification, students are officially enrolled in the program and gain access to online classes, study materials, and academic support.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2081\">This marks the beginning of their learning journey in fintech and digital finance.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"629\">MBA in FinTech is a specialized postgraduate program that combines finance, technology, analytics, and digital banking systems. The eligibility criteria ensure that students have a strong academic base in business or related fields before entering this advanced program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"634\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17b33f5\" data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"661\">Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"723\">To apply for MBA in FinTech, candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"859\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hcmk39\" data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"790\"><strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"764\">10+2 (Higher Secondary Education)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"en0ds3\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"859\"><strong data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"839\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree (Minimum 3-year program)</strong> in any discipline</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1041\">Students from Commerce, Science, or Management backgrounds are generally preferred, but candidates from other streams are also eligible if they meet the required academic criteria.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1046\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1076\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1175\">Candidates must have secured at least <strong data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1174\">50% aggregate marks in their undergraduate degree (UG)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1422\">This requirement ensures that students have a strong academic foundation in analytical thinking, business concepts, and financial understanding, which are essential for studying advanced FinTech systems, digital banking, and financial analytics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15jsh1t\" data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1463\">Final Year Students Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1559\">Students who are currently in their <strong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1529\">final year of graduation</strong> can also apply for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1800\">They must provide their <strong data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1620\">last completed semester results</strong> during the application process. Final admission is confirmed only after successful completion of the degree. This allows students to plan their postgraduate studies without delay.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1805\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15gv5ip\" data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1835\">Work Experience Advantage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1978\">Candidates with <strong data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1878\">prior work experience</strong> in finance, banking, IT, or business-related roles may receive an added advantage during admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2178\">Although not mandatory, work experience helps students better understand real-world financial systems and digital technologies, which can improve their chances during selection in some institutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2183\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1merre3\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2217\">Course Duration (Online Mode)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ab7rg4\" data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2252\"><strong data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2242\">Minimum Duration:</strong> 2 years</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1241grw\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2286\"><strong data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2276\">Maximum Duration:</strong> 4 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2439\">The flexible duration allows students and working professionals to complete the program at their own pace, depending on their schedule and commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"677\">The Online MBA in FinTech program offers a flexible and structured fee system designed for both Indian and international students. The program provides multiple payment options such as monthly EMI, semester-wise payments, and yearly discounted plans, making it easier for students to manage their education expenses.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"682\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dctg5u\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"720\">Fee Structure for Indian Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"1171\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"762\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"762\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"738\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"747\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"762\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"1171\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"920\">\r\n<td data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"834\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly Fee (Zero Cost EMI)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"849\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹9,625/month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"920\" data-col-size=\"md\">Easy monthly installment option without additional interest charges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<td data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"936\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"946\">₹55,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"999\">Fee payable per semester for academic progression</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1027\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1039\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,04,500</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1092\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discounted yearly payment option for cost savings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1171\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1113\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1125\">₹2,20,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1171\">Complete program fee for full MBA duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1176\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1x1dvi6\" data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1216\">Fee Structure for Foreign Nationals</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1234\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1243\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1258\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1380\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1315\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1325\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹64,500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1380\">Fee payable per semester for international students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1477\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1408\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1420\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,22,550</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1477\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discounted yearly payment option for foreign learners</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1498\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1510\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,58,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1560\">Full program cost for complete course duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1565\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c2ndyx\" data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1617\">Additional Charges (Applicable to All Students)</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1867\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1630\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1639\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1654\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1867\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1775\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1710\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1728\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹700 (one-time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1775\" data-col-size=\"md\">Paid during admission to confirm enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1867\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1794\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1816\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1867\" data-col-size=\"md\">Charged for each semester exams and evaluations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1872\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ud876s\" data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1900\">Fee Payment Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1980\">The program offers multiple payment options to suit different financial needs:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2123\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zk5lgq\" data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2030\">Monthly Zero Cost EMI for easy affordability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"caogza\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2081\">Semester-wise payment for structured budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ptvt2r\" data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2123\">Yearly payment with discount benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2227\">This flexibility makes the MBA in FinTech suitable for both fresh graduates and working professionals.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"736\">MBA in Finance &amp; Analytics is a modern postgraduate program designed to combine traditional finance knowledge with advanced data analytics, artificial intelligence, and digital financial technologies. The course focuses on developing skills in financial decision-making, business analytics, automation, and emerging technologies like AI and blockchain.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"893\">The syllabus is structured across four semesters, gradually moving from core management concepts to advanced finance systems and future-ready technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"898\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hysqfq\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"955\">Semester 1 &ndash; Management Foundations &amp; FinTech Basics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1099\">The first semester builds a strong foundation in management principles, organizational behavior, marketing, and basic financial understanding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1334\">Subjects include Fundamentals of Management &amp; Organizational Behaviour, Human Resources and Organizational Development, Marketing and Consumer Behaviour, FinTech RegTech InsurTech (Elective 1), and Soft Skills &amp; Employability Skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1579\">Students learn how organizations function, how financial technologies are transforming industries, and how consumer behavior influences business decisions. Soft skills training helps improve communication, teamwork, and professional readiness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1584\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9zla1x\" data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1646\">Semester 2 &ndash; Finance, Operations &amp; Digital Transformation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1792\">The second semester focuses on financial systems, business operations, strategic thinking, and digital transformation in finance and accounting.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1988\">Subjects include Business Finance, Operations and Supply Chain Management, Data-Driven Decision Making, Business Ethics and Strategic Management, and Digital Transformations in F&amp;A (Elective 2).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2303\">Students develop understanding of financial planning, operational efficiency, and ethical decision-making. Data-driven decision-making introduces analytical tools used in modern financial environments, while digital transformation in finance and accounting explains how technology is reshaping business processes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2308\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1majuce\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2367\">Semester 3 &ndash; Analytics, AI Tools &amp; Financial Modelling</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2481\">The third semester introduces advanced analytics, programming-based finance tools, and global business exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2684\">Subjects include International Business, Business Analytics and Business Modelling, Robotic Process Automation (Elective 3), Financial Analytics using Python &amp; SQL (Elective 4), and Education for Life.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2893\">Students gain hands-on exposure to automation, coding-based financial analysis, and business modelling techniques. Python and SQL help in handling large financial datasets and performing predictive analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2895\" data-end=\"2898\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1lr5bel\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2956\">Semester 4 &ndash; Emerging Technologies &amp; Industry Project</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"3075\">The final semester focuses on advanced technologies, sustainability, and real-world application through project work.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3307\">Subjects include Environment Sustainability and Governance, Project Work, Artificial Intelligence and Analytics (Elective 5), Blockchain and Applications (Elective 6), and Generative AI, Prompt Engineering &amp; AI Tools (Elective 7).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3309\" data-end=\"3539\">Students explore next-generation technologies like AI, blockchain, and generative AI tools used in finance and business analytics. The project allows students to apply theoretical and technical knowledge to real industry problems.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 220000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(393, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 230, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-15 00:43:00', '2026-05-15 00:43:00', '<p data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"592\">The admission process for the Online MBA in Finance is simple, fully digital, and designed to make enrollment easy for students and working professionals. The process is divided into three clear steps: choosing a program, applying online, and joining the program.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"597\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xsv9tg\" data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"626\">Step 1: Choose a Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"822\">The first step is to select the <strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"685\">Online MBA in Finance</strong> program based on your career goals and interest in areas like banking, corporate finance, investment management, and financial analysis.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"1077\">At this stage, students should review key details such as eligibility criteria, syllabus, fee structure, course duration, and career opportunities. This helps in understanding whether the program matches their academic background and professional goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1082\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dungdg\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1107\">Step 2: Apply Online</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1198\">After selecting the program, candidates need to complete the <strong data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1197\">online application form</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1474\">This includes entering personal information, academic qualifications, and uploading required documents such as graduation mark sheets, identity proof, and certificates. The process is completely online, so students can apply easily from anywhere without visiting the campus.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1573\">It is important to carefully fill in all details correctly to avoid delays in admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1578\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18xxip\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1607\">Step 3: Join the Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1699\">Once the application is reviewed and approved, students receive confirmation of admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1986\">At this stage, candidates complete the fee payment using their preferred option such as EMI, semester-wise, or yearly payment plans. After successful verification, students are officially enrolled in the program and gain access to online classes, study materials, and academic support.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2065\">This marks the beginning of their academic journey in finance and management.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"707\">The Online MBA in Finance is a postgraduate program designed for students who want to build careers in corporate finance, banking, investment management, and financial consulting. The eligibility criteria ensure that applicants have a strong academic background and basic understanding of business and finance concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"712\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17b33f5\" data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"739\">Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"812\">To apply for the Online MBA in Finance, candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"948\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hcmk39\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"879\"><strong data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"853\">10+2 (Higher Secondary Education)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"en0ds3\" data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"948\"><strong data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"928\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree (Minimum 3-year program)</strong> in any discipline</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1134\">Students from Commerce, Management, Science, or related backgrounds are generally preferred, but candidates from other streams can also apply if they meet the eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1139\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1169\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1268\">Candidates must have secured at least <strong data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1267\">50% aggregate marks in their undergraduate degree (UG)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1518\">This ensures that students have a strong academic foundation in analytical thinking, financial concepts, and business understanding, which are essential for advanced finance subjects like investment analysis, risk management, and corporate finance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1523\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15jsh1t\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1559\">Final Year Students Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1653\">Students who are currently in their <strong data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1625\">final year of graduation</strong> are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1897\">They must submit their <strong data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1713\">last completed semester results</strong> during the admission process. Final admission is confirmed after successful completion of the degree. This allows students to plan their MBA journey without waiting for final results.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1902\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15gv5ip\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1932\">Work Experience Advantage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2083\">Candidates with <strong data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1975\">prior work experience</strong> in finance, banking, accounting, or business-related roles may receive an added advantage during admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2242\">Although not mandatory, work experience helps students understand real-world financial systems better and may improve selection chances in some institutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2247\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1merre3\" data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2281\">Course Duration (Online Mode)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2350\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ab7rg4\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2316\"><strong data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2306\">Minimum Duration:</strong> 2 years</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1241grw\" data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2350\"><strong data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2340\">Maximum Duration:</strong> 4 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2505\">The flexible duration allows students and working professionals to complete the program at their own pace based on personal and professional commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"674\">The Online MBA in Finance program offers a flexible and transparent fee structure designed for both Indian and international students. The program provides multiple payment options such as monthly EMI, semester-wise fees, and yearly discounted plans, making it easier for students to manage their education costs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"679\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dctg5u\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"717\">Fee Structure for Indian Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"1167\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"735\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"744\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"759\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"1167\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"916\">\r\n<td data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"831\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly Fee (Zero Cost EMI)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"846\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹9,625/month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"916\" data-col-size=\"md\">Flexible monthly installment option without extra interest charges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"995\">\r\n<td data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"932\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"942\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹55,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"995\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fee payable per semester for academic progression</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1088\">\r\n<td data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1023\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1035\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,04,500</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1088\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discounted annual payment option for cost savings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1167\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1121\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,20,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1167\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete program fee for full MBA duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1172\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1x1dvi6\" data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1212\">Fee Structure for Foreign Nationals</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1557\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1230\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1239\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1254\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1557\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1376\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1311\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1321\">₹64,500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1376\">Fee payable per semester for international students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1473\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1404\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1416\">₹1,22,550</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1473\">Discounted yearly payment option for foreign students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1557\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1494\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1506\">₹2,58,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1557\">Total program cost for complete course duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1562\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c2ndyx\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1614\">Additional Charges (Applicable to All Students)</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1864\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1651\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1651\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1627\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1651\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1864\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1772\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1707\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1725\">₹700 (one-time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1772\">Paid during admission to confirm enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1864\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1791\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1813\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1864\">Charged for each semester exams and evaluations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1869\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ud876s\" data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1897\">Fee Payment Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1990\">The program is designed with multiple payment options to support different financial needs:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2133\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zk5lgq\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2040\">Monthly Zero Cost EMI for easy affordability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"caogza\" data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2091\">Semester-wise payment for structured budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ptvt2r\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2133\">Yearly payment with discount benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2237\">This flexibility makes the MBA in Finance suitable for both fresh graduates and working professionals</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"696\">MBA in Finance is a postgraduate program designed to build strong expertise in financial management, investment planning, banking systems, and modern financial technologies. The course focuses on developing analytical, managerial, and decision-making skills required for careers in corporate finance, banking, and financial consulting.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"866\">The syllabus is structured across four semesters, gradually moving from core management subjects to advanced financial strategies and industry-oriented specializations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"871\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gt7tvx\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"923\">Semester 1 &ndash; Management &amp; Financial Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"1058\">The first semester focuses on building strong fundamentals in management, organizational behavior, marketing, and financial concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1297\">Subjects include Fundamentals of Management &amp; Organizational Behaviour, Human Resources and Organizational Development, Marketing and Consumer Behaviour, Advanced Financial Management (Elective 1), and Soft Skills &amp; Employability Skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1527\">Students learn how organizations function, how financial decisions are made at a basic level, and how consumer behavior influences business strategies. Soft skills training helps improve communication and professional readiness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1532\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yj4bvu\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1586\">Semester 2 &ndash; Business Finance &amp; Investment Basics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1687\">The second semester focuses on finance, operations, ethics, and investment-related decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1897\">Subjects include Business Finance, Operations and Supply Chain Management, Data-Driven Decision Making, Business Ethics and Strategic Management, and Investment Analysis and Portfolio Management (Elective 2).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"2122\">Students gain knowledge of financial planning, investment evaluation, risk assessment, and supply chain systems. This semester builds the foundation for understanding corporate financial strategies and investment decisions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2127\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rkjmx2\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2185\">Semester 3 &ndash; FinTech, Analytics &amp; Financial Modelling</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2283\">The third semester introduces advanced financial tools, analytics, and global business exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2448\">Subjects include International Business, Business Analytics and Business Modelling, FinTech (Elective 3), Financial Modelling (Elective 4), and Education for Life.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2658\">Students develop skills in financial modelling, data analytics, and fintech applications. These subjects help in understanding how technology is transforming modern financial systems and investment processes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2663\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kay2gj\" data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2716\">Semester 4 &ndash; Advanced Finance &amp; Industry Project</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2825\">The final semester focuses on sustainability, risk management, banking systems, and practical project work.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"3036\">Subjects include Environment Sustainability and Governance, Project Work, Strategic Financial Management (Elective 5), Insurance and Risk Management (Elective 6), and Treasury and Bank Management (Elective 7).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3208\">Students apply their learning through a real-world project and gain advanced knowledge of banking operations, risk control, treasury management, and financial governance.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 220000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(394, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 316, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-15 00:56:33', '2026-05-15 00:56:33', '<p data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"620\">The admission process for the BBA Banking &amp; FinTech online program is simple, fully digital, and designed for easy access for students from different educational backgrounds. The process mainly includes choosing the program, applying online, and joining the course after verification.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"625\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xsv9tg\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"654\">Step 1: Choose a Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"770\">The first step is to select the <strong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"713\">BBA Banking &amp; FinTech</strong> program based on your career interests and future goals.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"1080\">At this stage, students should carefully review details such as eligibility criteria, syllabus, fee structure, duration, and career opportunities. This helps in understanding whether the program aligns with interests in banking, financial services, digital payments, fintech systems, and business management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1217\">Choosing the right program is important because it forms the foundation for future careers in finance and technology-driven industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1222\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dungdg\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1247\">Step 2: Apply Online</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1338\">After selecting the program, candidates need to complete the <strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1337\">online application form</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1608\">Students are required to enter personal details, academic qualifications, and upload necessary documents such as mark sheets, ID proof, and certificates. Since the process is fully online, students can apply easily from anywhere without visiting the campus physically.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1737\">It is important to ensure that all information provided is accurate to avoid delays during verification and admission approval.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18xxip\" data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1771\">Step 3: Join the Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1860\">Once the application is reviewed and approved, students receive admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"2149\">At this stage, candidates complete the fee payment using their preferred payment option such as EMI, semester-wise, or yearly payment plans. After successful verification, students are officially enrolled and gain access to online classes, study materials, and academic support services.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2235\">This marks the beginning of their academic journey in banking and fintech education.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"652\">BBA in Banking &amp; FinTech is an undergraduate program designed for students who want to build careers in banking, financial services, digital finance, and fintech industries. The eligibility criteria are simple and flexible, allowing students from different educational backgrounds to apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"657\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17b33f5\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"684\">Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"812\">To apply for the BBA in Banking &amp; FinTech program, candidates must have completed <strong data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"811\">10+2 (Class 12) from a recognized board</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"1041\">Students from any stream such as Commerce, Science, or Arts are generally eligible to apply. The program is suitable for students interested in banking systems, financial technologies, digital payments, and business management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1208\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations can also apply in many institutions based on admission guidelines. NIOS board candidates are generally eligible as well.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1243\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1339\">Candidates must have secured at least <strong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1306\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in their qualifying examination.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1537\">This minimum requirement ensures students have a basic academic foundation in communication, mathematics, and analytical skills, which are important for understanding banking and fintech concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1542\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qm7gnl\" data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1574\">Diploma Holders Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1685\">Candidates who have completed a <strong data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1641\">3-year diploma after Class 10</strong> are also eligible to apply for the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1834\">This provides flexibility for students from technical or vocational backgrounds who want to move into banking, finance, or fintech-related careers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1839\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15gv5ip\" data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1869\">Work Experience Advantage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"2034\">Candidates with <strong data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1912\">prior work experience</strong> in banking, finance, sales, customer service, or business-related fields may receive an added advantage during admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2159\">Although work experience is not mandatory, it may help students better understand practical business and financial systems.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2164\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1merre3\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2198\">Course Duration (Online Mode)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2267\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g6n05\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2233\"><strong data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2223\">Minimum Duration:</strong> 3 years</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17gii7i\" data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2267\"><strong data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2257\">Maximum Duration:</strong> 6 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2426\">The flexible course duration is especially beneficial for online learners and working professionals, allowing them to complete the program at their own pace.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8dtpi\" data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2446\">&nbsp;</h2>', '<p data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"684\">The BBA Banking &amp; FinTech online program offers a flexible and student-friendly fee structure designed for both Indian and international students. The course includes multiple payment options such as monthly EMI, semester-wise payment, and yearly discounted plans to make higher education more affordable and accessible.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"689\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dctg5u\" data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"727\">Fee Structure for Indian Students</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"1190\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"745\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"754\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"769\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"1190\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<td data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"841\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly Fee (Zero Cost EMI)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"856\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹5,042/month</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"926\" data-col-size=\"md\">Flexible monthly payment option without additional interest burden</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<td data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"942\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"952\">₹27,500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1005\">Fee payable per semester for academic progression</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1033\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1043\">₹52,250</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1104\">Discounted yearly payment option for reduced overall cost</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1190\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1137\">₹1,65,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1190\">Complete program fee for the full course duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1x1dvi6\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1235\">Fee Structure for Foreign Nationals</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1581\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1253\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1262\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1277\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1581\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1399\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1334\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1344\">₹33,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1399\">Fee payable per semester for international students</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1494\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1427\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1-Year Fee (5% Discount)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1437\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹62,700</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1494\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discounted annual payment option for foreign learners</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1581\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1515\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1527\">₹1,98,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1581\">Total course fee for the complete program duration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1586\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c2ndyx\" data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1638\">Additional Charges (Applicable to All Students)</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1897\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1675\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1675\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1651\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1660\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1675\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1897\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1731\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1749\">₹700 (one-time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1796\">Paid during admission to confirm enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1897\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1815\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1837\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,750 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1897\">Charged for semester examinations and evaluation process</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1902\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ud876s\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1930\">Fee Payment Flexibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"2012\">The program provides flexible payment options to suit different financial needs:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2157\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u6vrf1\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2064\">Monthly Zero Cost EMI for easier affordability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"caogza\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2115\">Semester-wise payment for structured budgeting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ptvt2r\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2157\">Yearly payment with discount benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2304\">This flexibility makes the course suitable for students as well as working professionals who want to manage their education expenses efficiently.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"720\">BBA in Banking &amp; FinTech is a modern undergraduate program designed to combine business management education with banking, finance, and emerging financial technologies. The course focuses on developing knowledge in banking operations, financial systems, digital business tools, management principles, and fintech-based business models.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"881\">The syllabus is structured across six semesters and gradually moves from business fundamentals to advanced management, finance, and industry-oriented learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"886\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eo6uw\" data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"936\">Semester 1 &ndash; Business &amp; Financial Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1052\">The first semester focuses on building strong foundations in communication, management, accounting, and economics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1214\">Subjects include Communicative English, Principles of Management, Financial Accounting, Business and MIS, Basic Concepts of Mathematics, and Business Economics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1463\">Students learn the basics of business operations, financial accounting, economic concepts, and management principles. Mathematics and MIS subjects help in developing analytical and technical understanding useful for fintech and banking industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1468\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c816yj\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1524\">Semester 2 &ndash; Business Systems &amp; Legal Understanding</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1629\">The second semester focuses on business structure, entrepreneurship, communication, and legal concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1821\">Subjects include Professional Communication, Business Organization and Systems, Entrepreneurial Development, Environmental Science and Sustainability, Business Laws, and Business Statistics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"2052\">Students gain understanding of organizational systems, business regulations, entrepreneurship concepts, and statistical methods used in business decision-making. This semester also strengthens communication and analytical skills.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2057\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1oezu4v\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2107\">Semester 3 &ndash; Banking &amp; Marketing Introduction</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2195\">This semester introduces banking systems, marketing concepts, and business technology.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2374\">Subjects include Organisational Behaviour, Introduction to Marketing Management, Banking and Insurance, Basics of Business Technology, Quantitative Techniques, and one elective.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2589\">Students learn banking operations, insurance systems, consumer behavior, and marketing basics. Business technology subjects introduce digital tools and systems widely used in modern banking and fintech industries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2594\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16tocgb\" data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2650\">Semester 4 &ndash; Financial Management &amp; Research Skills</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2742\">The fourth semester focuses on advanced management concepts and financial decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2941\">Subjects include Advanced Marketing Management, Basics of Human Resources Management, Introduction to Research Methods, Financial Management, Production and Operations Management, and one elective.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"3151\">Students develop knowledge of financial planning, business research, operational systems, and human resource management. Research methods also help students understand data collection and analysis techniques.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3156\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69evb1\" data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3210\">Semester 5 &ndash; Strategic &amp; Global Business Concepts</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3298\">This semester focuses on international business, ethics, strategy, and sustainability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3501\">Subjects include Principles of International Business, Business Ethics and Corporate Social Responsibility, Introduction to Strategic Management, Sustainable Business Administration, and two electives.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3734\">Students gain understanding of global business operations, strategic planning, ethical business practices, and sustainable management systems. Electives allow students to specialize in areas related to finance, fintech, or banking.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3739\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1502nt2\" data-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3795\">Semester 6 &ndash; Industry Exposure &amp; Practical Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3904\">The final semester focuses on enterprise systems, supply chain operations, and practical industry exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3906\" data-end=\"4016\">Subjects include Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP), Supply Chain Management, Internship, and three electives.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4018\" data-end=\"4239\">The internship provides real-world exposure in banking, financial services, fintech companies, or corporate environments. ERP subjects help students understand how organizations manage integrated digital business systems.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 165000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(395, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 317, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-15 01:39:55', '2026-05-15 01:39:55', NULL, 1, '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"722\">The Certification Program in Data Analytics is designed for students and learners who want to develop practical skills in data analysis, visualization, and business intelligence tools. The eligibility criteria are simple and flexible, making the course accessible to students from different educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"727\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17b33f5\" data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"754\">Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"889\">To apply for the Certification Program in Data Analytics, candidates must have completed <strong data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"888\">10+2 (Class 12) from a recognized board</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"1097\">Students from any stream such as Commerce, Science, or Arts can generally apply. The program is suitable for learners interested in analytics, reporting, business intelligence, and data visualization tools.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1257\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations may also be eligible depending on institutional guidelines. NIOS board candidates are generally eligible as well.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pihfuy\" data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1292\">Minimum Marks Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1388\">Candidates must have secured at least <strong data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1355\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in their qualifying examination.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1582\">This minimum requirement ensures that students have a basic academic foundation in analytical thinking, problem-solving, and communication skills required for learning data analytics concepts.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1587\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qm7gnl\" data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1619\">Diploma Holders Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1714\">Candidates who have completed a <strong data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1686\">3-year diploma after Class 10</strong> are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1889\">This allows students from technical and vocational backgrounds to enter the field of data analytics and business intelligence without requiring a traditional degree pathway.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1894\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o8b6g0\" data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1918\">Assessment Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"2075\">To successfully complete the program and receive the certification, participants must achieve the <strong data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2074\">minimum marks or grades prescribed by the university</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2112\">The assessment process may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2257\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"130fp9x\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2153\">Assignments and practical exercises</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"20tmec\" data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2184\">Tool-based analytics tasks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bguvvf\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2225\">Dashboard and visualization projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rkw196\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2257\">Online evaluations or tests</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2397\">Students who meet the required academic performance criteria receive a <strong data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2359\">certificate of completion</strong> for the online Data Analytics course.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2402\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w7s54z\" data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2429\">Course Mode &amp; Duration</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2532\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"183cb4z\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2458\"><strong data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2449\">Course Mode:</strong> Online</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ezdaev\" data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2532\"><strong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2474\">Duration:</strong> Flexible as per program structure and learning schedule</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2670\">The online format allows students and working professionals to learn from anywhere while balancing academic or professional commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"640\">The Data Analytics Certificate Program is designed to provide affordable and industry-oriented training in analytics, data visualization, and business intelligence tools. The fee structure is simple, transparent, and includes flexible EMI options for easier accessibility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"791\">The program also includes internship opportunities and transferable academic credits, making it valuable for both students and working professionals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"796\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1d9t1ba\" data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"847\">Data Analytics Certificate Program Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"865\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"874\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"889\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1012\">\r\n<td data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"945\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"955\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹14,999</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1012\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total course fee for the complete certificate program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1027\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GST Charges</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1039\" data-col-size=\"sm\">18% Extra</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1092\" data-col-size=\"md\">Applicable GST added separately to the course fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1132\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Starting from ₹5,899</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1182\">Flexible EMI option for easier monthly payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1202\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1209\">₹500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1251\">One-time fee payable during enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1340\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1271\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1282\">3 Months</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1340\">Total course duration for completing the certification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1428\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1363\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Internship Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1373\">45 Days</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1428\">Industry-oriented internship for practical exposure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1452\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Transferable Credits</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1465\" data-col-size=\"sm\">11 Credits</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1530\">Academic credits that may support future educational pathways</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1535\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ywab60\" data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1580\">Internship &amp; Practical Learning Benefits</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1729\">The program includes a <strong data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1626\">45-day internship</strong>, which helps students gain practical exposure to real-world analytics tasks and business environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1761\">The internship helps learners:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1961\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f2vnn7\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1815\">Apply theoretical concepts to practical projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ah10ow\" data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1859\">Improve technical and analytical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h34qym\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1914\">Gain industry exposure and professional experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yt14hn\" data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1961\">Enhance employability and career readiness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2081\">This practical component makes the program more industry-focused compared to purely theoretical certification courses.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2086\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fwuju6\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2120\">EMI &amp; Flexible Payment Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2256\">The program offers a <strong data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2188\">Zero Cost EMI option starting from ₹5,899</strong>, helping students manage their education expenses more comfortably.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2308\">This payment flexibility is especially useful for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2416\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o3y5uh\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2330\">College students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11bz7gk\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2350\">Fresh graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4k469d\" data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2376\">Working professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mm67wc\" data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2416\">Learners upgrading technical skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2421\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"599r5u\" data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2455\">Transferable Credit Advantage</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2597\">The course includes <strong data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2504\">11 transferable credits</strong>, which may help students in future academic progression depending on institutional policies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2687\">This adds additional academic value to the certification beyond skill development alone.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"725\">The Certification Program in Data Analytics is designed to provide practical knowledge of data analysis, visualization, and business intelligence tools used in modern industries. The program focuses on building analytical skills through hands-on learning in Microsoft Excel, Power BI, and Tableau along with internship exposure and industry webinars.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"893\">This course is suitable for students, fresh graduates, and working professionals who want to develop career-ready skills in business analytics and data visualization.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"898\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"19p45i9\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"937\">Data Analysis Using Microsoft Excel</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1059\">The program begins with Microsoft Excel, which is one of the most widely used tools in business analytics and reporting.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1084\">Topics covered include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xazbsf\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1125\">Data Analysis Using Microsoft Excel</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sy9p37\" data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1164\">Introduction to Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mycpsp\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1208\">Working with Excel Functions and Charts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10rn3tg\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1244\">Statistical Analysis with Excel</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ekutcw\" data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1282\">What-if Analysis and Pivot Tables</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"luo6hk\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1318\">Building Dashboards using Excel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1548\">Students learn how to organize, analyze, and interpret data using formulas, functions, and visualization tools. Excel dashboards and pivot tables help in understanding business performance, trends, and decision-making processes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1664\">Statistical analysis concepts also help students work with real business datasets and improve analytical thinking.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"183cugu\" data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1706\">Data Visualization Using Power BI</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1811\">The second module focuses on Power BI, a popular business intelligence and data visualization platform.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1836\">Topics covered include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"2025\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8splqx\" data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1876\">Introduction to Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dhtkov\" data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1910\">Introduction to Power BI Tool</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s920ub\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1955\">Storytelling through Data using Power BI</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3f4wjv\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2025\">Dashboards and Communication using Data Visualization in Power BI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2271\">Students learn how to convert raw data into meaningful visual insights using charts, graphs, and interactive dashboards. Power BI training also helps students understand how organizations use data visualization for strategic business decisions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2367\">Storytelling through data improves the ability to present insights clearly and professionally.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2372\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"17ic7wk\" data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2409\">Tableau for Business Intelligence</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2523\">This module introduces Tableau, one of the leading tools used in business intelligence and analytics industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2548\">Topics covered include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2684\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3npx5l\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2577\">Introduction to Tableau</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y05itd\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2612\">Data Extraction and Formatting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r6ubyg\" data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2643\">Functions and Calculations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1de9hyj\" data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2661\">Group Editing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9wyf6\" data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2684\">Data Visualization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2901\">Students gain practical exposure to handling datasets, creating interactive reports, and building visual dashboards. Tableau skills are highly valuable for careers in analytics, reporting, and business intelligence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2906\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1tt1oy2\" data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2935\">45-Day Internship Program</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"3071\">The program also includes a <strong data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"2986\">45-day internship</strong> along with industry webinars conducted by <strong data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3070\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">TCS iON</span></span></strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3073\" data-end=\"3302\">The internship provides practical exposure to real-world analytics tasks and business environments. Students get opportunities to apply theoretical concepts to practical projects, improving both technical and professional skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3415\">The virtual internship model also provides flexibility, allowing students to gain industry experience remotely.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3420\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1n4xyp7\" data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3441\">Industry Webinars</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3552\">Industry webinars are designed to bridge the gap between academic learning and real-world business practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3583\">These sessions help students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3585\" data-end=\"3816\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tt35d1\" data-start=\"3585\" data-end=\"3623\">Understand current industry trends</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3i7fea\" data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3675\">Learn practical applications of analytics tools</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l1qf7e\" data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3716\">Interact with industry professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16sly3p\" data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3763\">Gain career guidance and business insights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s9zi7t\" data-start=\"3764\" data-end=\"3816\">Improve employability and professional awareness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3946\">Such webinars provide exposure to real business challenges and help students understand how analytics is used across industries.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<h2 data-section-id=\"1x43m4o\" data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1392\">Industry Webinars</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1527\">The program also includes industry webinars that provide direct interaction with professionals and experts from industry backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1558\">These webinars help students:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1799\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tt35d1\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1598\">Understand current industry trends</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10hthkf\" data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1650\">Learn real-world applications of data analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12eka2e\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1705\">Gain exposure to business challenges and solutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ilyzrt\" data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1752\">Receive career guidance from professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9uwaez\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1799\">Improve awareness of industry expectations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1961\">Industry webinars act as an important supplement to classroom learning by providing practical insights that are often not covered in theoretical training alone.</p>', '<p data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"696\">The 45-day internship provides students with hands-on practical exposure to business and analytics-related tasks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"989\">During the internship, students get opportunities to work on practical assignments, reporting tasks, dashboards, documentation, and data-based problem-solving activities. This helps learners understand how analytical tools and business intelligence techniques are used in real organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1031\">The internship experience also improves:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1245\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"135s874\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1083\">Practical understanding of analytics workflows</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqtenv\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1127\">Problem-solving and analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"145xam5\" data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1166\">Documentation and reporting skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nzod53\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1207\">Professional communication abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dsrrkd\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1245\">Industry readiness and confidence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1365\">This practical exposure is highly valuable for students who want to strengthen their resume and improve employability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1370\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kk4sga\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2010\">Benefits of Remote / Virtual Internship</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2149\">The internship is conducted in a remote or virtual mode, allowing students to participate from anywhere with flexibility and convenience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2172\">Key benefits include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2392\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"56kdr0\" data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2207\">Flexible learning environment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12jfh21\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2241\">Hands-on practical experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vrwhj0\" data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2275\">Better time management skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c5gqq3\" data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2330\">Improved communication and documentation abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1htlrvb\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2392\">Exposure to digital work culture and remote collaboration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2568\">Virtual internships are especially useful for students and working professionals who want practical industry exposure without relocating or affecting their regular schedules.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2573\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kkhta1\" data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2611\">Career &amp; Employability Advantages</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2768\">The combination of internship training and industry webinars helps students become more industry-ready by improving both technical and professional skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2796\">Students gain exposure to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2986\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y8aiy\" data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2835\">Real business analytics practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6i15no\" data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2870\">Professional work environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1315bsp\" data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2912\">Industry-standard tools and processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"173hwfx\" data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2950\">Communication and teamwork skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rr7iej\" data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2986\">Career networking opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3121\">This experience can significantly improve employability in analytics, reporting, business intelligence, and technology-related roles.</p>', '[\"1\"]', 14999.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(396, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 319, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-15 01:48:20', '2026-05-15 01:48:20', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"707\">Digital Marketing Programs are designed for students, fresh graduates, entrepreneurs, and working professionals who want to develop practical skills in online marketing, social media management, and digital branding. The eligibility criteria are simple and flexible, making the program accessible to learners from different educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"712\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vc7859\" data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"750\">Minimum Qualification Requirement</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"877\">Candidates applying for the Digital Marketing Program must have secured at least <strong data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"876\">45% marks in the qualifying examination</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"960\">The course is suitable for learners who want to build knowledge in areas such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1119\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p9zf3n\" data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"988\">Social media marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"trsinh\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1011\">Online advertising</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p5atdx\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1033\">Content marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k22zts\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1053\">Email marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ej532\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1087\">Website planning and branding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v0rg8v\" data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1119\">Digital campaign management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1255\">Students from Commerce, Science, Arts, Management, or technical backgrounds can generally apply depending on institutional guidelines.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1393\">Students appearing for qualifying examinations may also be eligible in some cases. NIOS board candidates are generally eligible as well.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1398\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yund9o\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1454\">Online Digital Marketing Course Assessment Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1594\">To successfully complete the certification program, participants must secure the <strong data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1593\">minimum marks or grades prescribed by the university</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1631\">The assessment process may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1779\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mv3nk7\" data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1655\">Online assignments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qu8fpw\" data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1690\">Practical marketing activities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13sdscs\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1718\">Campaign-based projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ei38uh\" data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1745\">Tool-based evaluations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fcuche\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1779\">Internal assessments or tests</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1914\">Students who meet the required performance standards receive a <strong data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1873\">certificate of completion</strong> for the online Digital Marketing course.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1919\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w7s54z\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1946\">Course Mode &amp; Duration</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"2126\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1979\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1979\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1964\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Detail</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1979\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Information</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2126\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2036\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2026\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Mode</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2036\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2068\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2056\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2068\">3 Months</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2126\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2088\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2126\">Flexible as per program guidelines</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2291\">The online learning format allows students and working professionals to complete the course at their own pace while balancing academic or professional commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"656\">The Digital Marketing Online Course is designed to provide affordable and industry-oriented training in digital marketing, social media management, online advertising, and branding strategies. The course offers flexible payment options along with internship opportunities and practical learning support.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"759\">The fee structure is simple, transparent, and suitable for students as well as working professionals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"764\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rrbc99\" data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"812\">Digital Marketing Online Course Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"854\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"854\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"830\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"839\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"854\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"978\">\r\n<td data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"912\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"922\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹5,000*</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"978\" data-col-size=\"md\">Flexible EMI payment option for easier affordability</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1063\">\r\n<td data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"997\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Course Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1007\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹30,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1063\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total fee for the complete digital marketing program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1131\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1083\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1090\">₹500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1131\">One-time fee payable during admission</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1208\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1161\">3 Months</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1208\">Total duration of the certification program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1231\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Internship Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1241\">45 Days</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1287\">Practical internship for industry exposure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1306\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Teaching Method</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1333\">Recorded &amp; Live Sessions</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1400\">Combination of self-paced learning and live interactive classes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1447\">*Terms and conditions apply for EMI options.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ywab60\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1497\">Internship &amp; Practical Learning Benefits</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1633\">The course includes a <strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1542\">45-day internship</strong> designed to provide practical exposure to real digital marketing activities and campaigns.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1690\">During the internship, students may gain experience in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1865\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xh1ly2\" data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1728\">Social media campaign management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1getuk8\" data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1761\">Content marketing strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19fkrzn\" data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1796\">Digital advertising activities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17b9gu\" data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1831\">Audience engagement techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8k39zt\" data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1865\">Online branding and reporting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1942\">This practical exposure helps improve industry readiness and employability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1947\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eqh80w\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1985\">Recorded &amp; Live Learning Sessions</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2072\">The program uses a combination of <strong data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2071\">recorded classes and live interactive sessions</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2125\">This hybrid learning model offers several benefits:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2343\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zxycap\" data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2185\">Flexibility to learn anytime through recorded lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ikowl\" data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2232\">Live interaction with trainers and mentors</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rzxqav\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2287\">Better understanding through practical discussions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pa6yy7\" data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2343\">Revision support through repeated access to content</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2448\">This structure is especially useful for students and working professionals managing flexible schedules.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2453\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fwuju6\" data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2487\">EMI &amp; Flexible Payment Option</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2611\">The Zero Cost EMI option helps students manage education expenses more comfortably without paying the full amount at once.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2656\">This payment flexibility is beneficial for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2767\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o3y5uh\" data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2678\">College students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11bz7gk\" data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2698\">Fresh graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xjulh4\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2716\">Entrepreneurs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ya2dj0\" data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2767\">Working professionals upgrading digital skills</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"725\">The Certification in Digital Marketing is designed to provide practical knowledge of online marketing strategies, social media platforms, digital advertising, and brand promotion techniques. The program focuses on helping students understand how businesses use digital channels to attract customers, increase engagement, and improve online visibility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"929\">This course is suitable for students, fresh graduates, entrepreneurs, and working professionals who want to build careers in digital marketing, social media management, online branding, and advertising.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"znugoz\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"971\">Introduction to Digital Marketing</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1065\">The program begins with the fundamentals of digital marketing and online business promotion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1090\">Topics covered include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p3eljh\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1129\">Introduction to Digital Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xl3sc\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1163\">Website Planning and Creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kus4hf\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1190\">Social Media Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5a7kb\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1217\">Digital Media Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nk36io\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1237\">Email Marketing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1455\">Students learn how digital marketing works across websites, search engines, social media, and online communication platforms. Website planning introduces the basics of creating and managing digital business presence.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1587\">Email marketing and digital media planning help students understand customer engagement strategies and online campaign management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"dv3u7l\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1625\">Advertising &amp; Sales Promotion</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1730\">This module focuses on advertising management, branding, and promotional strategies used by businesses.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1755\">Topics covered include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fnzajf\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1795\">Overview of Advertising Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aslerq\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1834\">Structure of an Advertising Agency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1drxpg4\" data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1858\">Advertising Budgets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ilf9km\" data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1903\">Laws for Protection Against Malpractices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mpc7pv\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1923\">Sales Promotion</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"2150\">Students gain understanding of how advertising campaigns are planned, managed, and monitored. They also learn about budgeting strategies, ethical advertising practices, and legal regulations related to promotional activities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2281\">Sales promotion concepts help students understand customer attraction and brand awareness techniques used in competitive markets.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1wswx31\" data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2312\">Social Media Marketing</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2425\">The social media marketing module focuses on major digital platforms used for branding and customer engagement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2450\">Topics covered include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2567\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xbrdk4\" data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2474\">Facebook Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ni9kzu\" data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2497\">LinkedIn Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17wvexg\" data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2545\">Twitter, Instagram, and Pinterest Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qh1urt\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2567\">YouTube Marketing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2829\">Students learn how businesses use social media platforms to run campaigns, build audiences, generate leads, and increase brand visibility. This module also introduces content promotion strategies, audience targeting, and platform-specific marketing techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2931\">YouTube marketing helps students understand video-based branding and audience engagement strategies.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, '<p data-start=\"15\" data-end=\"404\"><strong data-start=\"15\" data-end=\"56\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">MaxEd</span></span></strong> is promoted by <strong data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"113\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">i-miRa Knowledge Solutions</span></span></strong>, a business technology company that has been working at the intersection of academia and industry for more than a decade. The organization focuses on creating industry-relevant learning solutions that help students and professionals build practical, job-oriented skills in emerging domains.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"734\">MaxEd is designed with the vision of supporting modern learners through skill development, reskilling, and upskilling programs aligned with current industry requirements. The platform places strong emphasis on areas such as data analytics, business intelligence, digital technologies, and career-oriented professional education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"739\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eke119\" data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"778\">Industry-Focused Learning Approach</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"1007\">MaxEd focuses on delivering programs that combine academic concepts with practical industry applications. The goal is to help learners gain knowledge that is directly relevant to real-world business and technology environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1033\">The platform emphasizes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1274\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s6x6le\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1088\">Data analytics and business intelligence learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vqqi8k\" data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1134\">Technology-integrated education solutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cku1ir\" data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1179\">Industry-relevant certification programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvcf3j\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1217\">Career-oriented skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fj2y91\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1274\">Professional upskilling and reskilling opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1411\">This practical approach helps students and professionals stay aligned with changing industry demands and evolving digital technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1416\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fbozpx\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1449\">Experienced Team &amp; Expertise</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1588\">The MaxEd team includes experienced professionals from management and technology backgrounds with more than <strong data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1584\">20 years of expertise</strong> in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1734\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jqchja\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1617\">Research and consulting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kvym5q\" data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1636\">Data analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1siym7f\" data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1659\">Corporate training</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11v8gea\" data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1693\">Business technology solutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b7nmkt\" data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1734\">Professional education and mentoring</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1857\">This experience helps the platform design programs that are aligned with current market trends and employer expectations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1862\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"mnt77w\" data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1919\">MaxUpskill &ndash; Technology Integrated Learning Platform</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"2076\"><strong data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1935\">MaxUpskill</strong>, the technology-enabled platform developed by MaxEd, is designed to help users identify suitable learning pathways and career opportunities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2112\">The platform supports learners by:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2344\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10b46p6\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2152\">Helping identify the right courses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fgq8jy\" data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2196\">Providing career mentoring and guidance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uwj4e\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2242\">Supporting professional skill development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eetw2u\" data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2296\">Assisting in career planning and growth decisions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m3kj1e\" data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2344\">Offering technology-driven learning support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2431\">This integrated approach helps learners make informed educational and career choices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2436\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4ijybl\" data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2483\">Focus on Skilling, Reskilling &amp; Upskilling</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2560\">MaxEd aims to support learners at different stages of their career journey.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2589\">The platform is useful for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2779\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u60urq\" data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2634\">Students preparing for industry careers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"154zr8t\" data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2679\">Fresh graduates seeking practical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1huxm7p\" data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2725\">Working professionals upgrading expertise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aza26k\" data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2779\">Individuals transitioning into new career domains</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2924\">By focusing on skilling, reskilling, and upskilling, MaxEd helps learners stay competitive in fast-changing business and technology industries.</p>', NULL, '[\"1\"]', 30000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(397, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 320, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-15 01:57:46', '2026-05-15 01:59:07', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"689\">Cognitive Science Courses are designed for students, professionals, educators, and individuals interested in understanding human cognition, psychology, emotional intelligence, and mental functioning. The eligibility criteria are flexible, allowing learners from different educational and professional backgrounds to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"877\">The program is suitable for individuals who want to improve critical thinking, decision-making, emotional resilience, and cognitive performance in personal and professional environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"882\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17b33f5\" data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"909\">Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"982\">To apply for Cognitive Science Courses, candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1049\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hcmk39\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1049\"><strong data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1023\">10+2 (Higher Secondary Education)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1144\">Candidates who have completed a <strong data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1116\">3-year diploma after Class 10</strong> are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1325\">Students from Commerce, Science, Arts, Management, Healthcare, Education, and other academic backgrounds can generally enroll in the program depending on institutional guidelines.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1461\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations may also be eligible in some cases. NIOS board candidates are generally eligible as well.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15bjjbr\" data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1504\">Who Should Apply for This Course?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1563\">The Cognitive Science program is especially suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1754\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15fzbez\" data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1591\">Educators and Trainers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y3vbkm\" data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1621\">Managers and Team Leaders</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f50l4m\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1643\">NGO Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k6oeqe\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1662\">Social Workers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rv8ttn\" data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1688\">Medical Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkfycb\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1711\">10+2 Pass Students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8iqx8o\" data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1754\">UG and PG Graduates looking to upskill</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1926\">The course is designed for learners who want to improve cognitive understanding, communication, emotional intelligence, leadership abilities, and human behavior analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1931\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o8b6g0\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1955\">Assessment Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"2106\">To successfully complete the course and receive certification, participants must secure the <strong data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2105\">minimum marks or grades prescribed by the university</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2143\">The assessment process may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2276\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3kcr9k\" data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2175\">Assignments and activities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"plc8zl\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2199\">Case study analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rkw196\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2231\">Online evaluations or tests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j8e6e6\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2276\">Participation in projects or discussions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2413\">Students who meet the required academic performance standards receive a <strong data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2379\">certificate of completion</strong> for the Cognitive Science course.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2418\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w7s54z\" data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2445\">Course Mode &amp; Duration</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2583\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2463\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Detail</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2478\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Information</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2583\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2535\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2525\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Mode</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2535\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2583\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2547\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2583\">Flexible as per course structure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2704\">The online learning format allows students and working professionals to complete the course conveniently from anywhere.</p>', '<p data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"683\">The Cognitive Science Course is designed to provide affordable and flexible learning for students and professionals interested in human cognition, neuroscience, emotional intelligence, and personal development. The fee structure is simple and transparent, making the course accessible for learners from different educational and professional backgrounds.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"795\">The program combines theoretical concepts with practical insights through recorded and live learning sessions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"800\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bbjmkq\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"841\">Cognitive Science Course Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"1279\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"883\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"883\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"859\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"868\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"883\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"1279\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\n<td data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"939\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"949\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,900*</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1004\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total fee for the complete Cognitive Science course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1073\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1031\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹500</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1073\" data-col-size=\"md\">One-time fee payable during enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1092\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1102\" data-col-size=\"sm\">6 Weeks</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1159\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total duration required to complete the certification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1279\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1178\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Teaching Method</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1205\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Recorded &amp; Live Sessions</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1279\">Combination of flexible recorded classes and interactive live sessions</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1325\">*Applicable terms and conditions may apply.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"872\">The Cognitive Science in Interdisciplinary Certification program is designed to help students understand human cognition, mental processes, emotional intelligence, and optimal human functioning through an interdisciplinary learning approach. The course combines concepts from cognitive psychology, neuroscience, philosophy, behavioral science, and critical thinking to help learners improve personal efficiency, resilience, and decision-making abilities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"1055\">Students gain access to high-quality learning content including videos, case studies, projects, and practical insights developed by industry experts and experienced faculty members.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tk6yx6\" data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1112\">Cognitive Efficiency &amp; Optimal Human Functioning</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1292\">The program focuses on understanding how the human mind functions and how cognitive science principles can improve learning, productivity, emotional balance, and personal growth.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1326\">Students explore topics such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y64772\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1368\">Human cognition and mental processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mvgcww\" data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1404\">Brain function and neuroscience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mzvh4n\" data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1441\">Emotional agility and resilience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0ec8o\" data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1483\">Critical thinking and problem-solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdlpux\" data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1527\">Self-development and personal potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oikn7n\" data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1568\">Mindfulness and cognitive well-being</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1721\">The interdisciplinary structure helps learners understand the connection between psychology, neuroscience, philosophy, and practical life applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1726\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"a5n8hd\" data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1758\">Module-Wise Course Structure</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1iqefud\" data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1845\">Module 1: The Interdisciplinary Nature of Cognitive Sciences &amp; Unfolding Potential</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"2059\">This module introduces the foundations of cognitive science and explains how different disciplines such as psychology, neuroscience, philosophy, and behavioral science work together to understand human cognition.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2177\">Students learn how cognitive science can support personal growth, learning efficiency, and professional development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2182\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3noeu5\" data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2245\">Module 2: Cognitive Psychology, Neuroscience, and the Mind</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2361\">This module focuses on understanding the relationship between the brain, behavior, emotions, and mental processes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2380\">Students explore:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2545\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eh6s56\" data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2415\">Cognitive psychology concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f498i1\" data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2458\">Brain function and neuroscience basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1muj9fd\" data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2496\">Memory, attention, and perception</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1spoy3v\" data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2545\">Human thinking and decision-making processes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2643\">The module helps learners understand how the mind processes information and influences behavior.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2648\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3h7gyj\" data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2687\">Module 3: You and Your Future-Self</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2765\">This module focuses on personal transformation and future-oriented thinking.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2788\">Key concepts include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2919\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k4qcdm\" data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2815\">Executive functioning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"luevgk\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2858\">Mental time-travel and future planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n2kupl\" data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2880\">Emotional agility</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o2qrgw\" data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2919\">Self-awareness and personal growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"3031\">Students learn techniques to improve focus, adaptability, motivation, and long-term decision-making abilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3036\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1t2ksit\" data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3081\">Module 4: The Power of Critical Thinking</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3165\">Critical thinking is an essential skill in academics, business, and everyday life.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3202\">This module helps students develop:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3328\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qaewr1\" data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3232\">Logical reasoning skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qt0d84\" data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3266\">Analytical thinking abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8wxlp\" data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3297\">Decision-making techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13f4aug\" data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3328\">Problem-solving approaches</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3407\">The focus is on improving intellectual clarity and reducing cognitive biases.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3412\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"89jpgc\" data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3449\">Module 5: Diversity in Cognition</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3451\" data-end=\"3538\">This module explores how individuals think, learn, and process information differently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3571\">Students gain understanding of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3687\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"imuiwh\" data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3596\">Cognitive diversity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vywazh\" data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3626\">Different learning styles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"azfjt9\" data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3653\">Behavioral differences</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"evobik\" data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3687\">Inclusive thinking approaches</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3779\">This helps learners improve communication, collaboration, and interpersonal understanding.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3784\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vj1fhi\" data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3840\">Module 6: Vedantic Philosophy of Cognition and Mind</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3967\">This module introduces philosophical perspectives related to cognition, consciousness, and the mind from Vedantic traditions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3969\" data-end=\"4006\">Students explore concepts related to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4156\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a92lgg\" data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4044\">Consciousness and self-awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dh9o1r\" data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4071\">Mind-body relationship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12fb3ic\" data-start=\"4072\" data-end=\"4116\">Philosophical understanding of cognition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aekbz0\" data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4156\">Mental balance and inner well-being</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4253\">The module provides a holistic understanding of cognition beyond scientific perspectives alone.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4258\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xpda4j\" data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4298\">Module 7: Harnessing Your Potential</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4397\">The final module focuses on practical tools for improving efficiency, resilience, and well-being.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4399\" data-end=\"4429\">Students learn strategies for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4431\" data-end=\"4567\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vrjus0\" data-start=\"4431\" data-end=\"4459\">Productivity improvement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yx4z63\" data-start=\"4460\" data-end=\"4481\">Stress management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1br50d7\" data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4506\">Emotional resilience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y3gblb\" data-start=\"4507\" data-end=\"4528\">Mental well-being</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ayw377\" data-start=\"4529\" data-end=\"4567\">Cognitive performance optimization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4569\" data-end=\"4655\">This module helps learners apply cognitive science principles in real-life situations.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 4900.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(398, 75, '6fd01ea2-14cc-41d7-8c10-a94807550f1c', 'acc96fe9-f3b0-4239-abbb-1366ebb6aff4', 321, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-15 02:06:44', '2026-05-15 02:06:44', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"775\">The Cognitive Psychology Online Course is designed for learners who want to understand human cognition, learning behavior, instructional design, and psychological processes involved in education and training. The eligibility criteria are flexible, allowing students and professionals from different backgrounds to enroll and develop specialized cognitive science and learning design skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"906\">The course is especially beneficial for individuals involved in teaching, training, content development, and learning management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"911\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17b33f5\" data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"938\">Academic Qualification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1024\">To apply for the Cognitive Psychology Online Course, candidates must have completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hcmk39\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1091\"><strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1065\">10+2 (Higher Secondary Education)</strong> from a recognized board</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1186\">Candidates who have completed a <strong data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1158\">3-year diploma after Class 10</strong> are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1334\">Students from Commerce, Science, Arts, Education, Management, and technical backgrounds can generally apply depending on institutional guidelines.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1470\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations may also be eligible in some cases. NIOS board candidates are generally eligible as well.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15bjjbr\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1513\">Who Should Apply for This Course?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1545\">The course is best suited for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1964\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1blgew\" data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1572\">Teachers and Trainers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zl3fob\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1614\">Heads of Schools and Academic Leaders</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o9dy88\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1675\">Professionals working in Learning &amp; Teaching Departments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19hgx4y\" data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1713\">Learning Technology Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oou9dg\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1798\">Technical Writers and Content Developers transitioning into Instructional Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"21sbtk\" data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1857\">Professionals involved in designing training materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkfycb\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1880\">10+2 Pass Students</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15vpmyc\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1964\">UG and PG Graduates looking to upskill in cognitive science and learning design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2111\">The program is designed for individuals interested in improving learning experiences, instructional methods, and educational content development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2116\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o8b6g0\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2140\">Assessment Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2292\">To successfully complete the course and receive certification, participants must achieve the <strong data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2291\">minimum marks or grades prescribed by the university</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2329\">The assessment process may include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2485\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ngx8hq\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2363\">Assignments and case studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tqnwjo\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2399\">Instructional design activities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rkw196\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2431\">Online evaluations or tests</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f3hlpp\" data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2485\">Participation in projects and practical exercises</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2610\">Students who meet the required academic performance standards receive a <strong data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2609\">certificate of completion in cognitive science</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2615\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"w7s54z\" data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2642\">Course Mode &amp; Duration</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2780\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2675\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2675\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2660\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Detail</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2675\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Information</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2780\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2732\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2722\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Mode</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2732\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2780\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2744\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2780\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexible as per course structure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2912\">The online learning format allows learners to study from anywhere while balancing academic, teaching, or professional commitments.</p>', '<p data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"655\">The Cognitive Science Course is designed to provide affordable and flexible online learning for students and professionals interested in cognitive psychology, learning science, instructional design, and human behavior. The program combines interdisciplinary learning with practical exposure through recorded and live sessions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"790\">The fee structure is simple, transparent, and suitable for learners looking to upskill in cognitive science and learning development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"795\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1mrs59f\" data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"837\">Cognitive Science Program Fee Details</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"879\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"879\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"855\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"864\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"879\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"1015\">\r\n<td data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"935\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"945\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,500*</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1015\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total fee for the complete Cognitive Science certification program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1084\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1035\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹500</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1084\" data-col-size=\"md\">One-time fee payable during enrollment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1163\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1103\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1113\" data-col-size=\"sm\">6 Weeks</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1163\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total duration required to complete the course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1182\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Teaching Method</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1209\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Recorded &amp; Live Sessions</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1277\" data-col-size=\"md\">Combination of self-paced learning and live interactive sessions</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1323\">*Applicable terms and conditions may apply.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1328\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fxryqw\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1364\">Flexible Online Learning Format</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1463\">The program uses a blended learning model that includes both recorded lectures and live sessions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1503\">This format provides several benefits:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1717\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1muq0h3\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1556\">Learn at your own pace through recorded content</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"159khzr\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1612\">Attend live sessions for interaction and discussion</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yqo1bh\" data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1656\">Access learning materials from anywhere</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1watl5p\" data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1717\">Balance learning with professional or academic schedules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1829\">The flexible structure makes the course suitable for students, educators, trainers, and working professionals.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"790\">The Cognitive Science Behind Designing Instructions certification program is designed to help learners understand how cognitive science principles can improve instructional design, learning experiences, and educational content development. The course combines concepts from psychology, learning science, instructional design, and project management to create effective and engaging learning environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"1009\">During the certification program, students gain access to high-quality learning resources including videos, case studies, projects, and practical insights developed by industry experts and experienced faculty members.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tizsmd\" data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1065\">Cognitive Science Behind Designing Instructions</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1275\">The program focuses on understanding how people learn, process information, and retain knowledge. It helps learners design instructional content that improves engagement, understanding, and learning outcomes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1308\">Students explore areas such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"147wlhg\" data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1347\">Learning psychology and cognition</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1giqvvu\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1383\">Instructional design principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9k65yt\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1419\">Educational content development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lmj0n3\" data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1452\">Learning experience planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q7kchb\" data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1490\">Assessment and evaluation methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rvek6z\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1527\">Instructional project management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1694\">This interdisciplinary approach helps learners build practical skills useful in education, corporate training, e-learning, and professional development environments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1699\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"a5n8hd\" data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1731\">Module-Wise Course Structure</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jiqhct\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1814\">Module 1: Exploring Multidisciplinary Perspectives on Instruction and Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1941\">This module introduces the foundations of instructional design and learning sciences from multiple disciplinary perspectives.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1964\">Students learn about:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2148\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"typkcs\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2010\">How humans learn and process information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wt1b1r\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2057\">Cognitive and behavioral learning theories</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19o8bzw\" data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2095\">Psychology of learning and memory</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nmf44y\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2148\">The role of instruction in knowledge development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2257\">The module helps learners understand the relationship between cognition and effective learning experiences.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2262\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"169x2hi\" data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2327\">Module 2: Designing the Instructions and Learning Experience</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2417\">This module focuses on creating engaging and learner-centered instructional experiences.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2436\">Students explore:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2600\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lsh2cv\" data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2475\">Instructional planning techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uva191\" data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2517\">Learning experience design principles</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fq6o9i\" data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2553\">Structuring educational content</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i7wbpy\" data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2600\">Improving learner engagement and retention</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2706\">The module helps learners design instructional systems that are clear, interactive, and outcome-focused.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2711\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6xtw3t\" data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2759\">Module 3: Developing Instructional Material</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2855\">This module provides insights into creating effective instructional and educational materials.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2879\">Students learn how to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"3079\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gmhvad\" data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2920\">Develop structured learning content</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3vin8p\" data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2972\">Create learner-friendly instructional resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iif19o\" data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3019\">Organize educational materials effectively</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ysriit\" data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3079\">Use cognitive science principles in content development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3184\">The focus is on designing instructional material that improves understanding and practical application.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3189\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1lbxcf9\" data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3250\">Module 4: Evaluation &ndash; Developing Evaluation Instruments</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3252\" data-end=\"3322\">Assessment and evaluation are essential parts of instructional design.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3347\">This module focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3507\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ssql5z\" data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3389\">Evaluation strategies and frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oeyuk9\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3437\">Developing assessment tools and instruments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b5uwl4\" data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3469\">Measuring learning outcomes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w4epc0\" data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3507\">Feedback and performance analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3602\">Students understand how to evaluate learning effectiveness and improve instructional quality.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3604\" data-end=\"3607\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1whfqx1\" data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3656\">Module 5: Instruction and Project Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3755\">The final module focuses on managing instructional projects and learning initiatives effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3774\">Students explore:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3951\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nivanp\" data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3810\">Instructional project planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yxghox\" data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"3856\">Team coordination and workflow management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wscnw7\" data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3904\">Resource management in educational projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15of6cn\" data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3951\">Managing timelines and learning objectives</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"4073\">This module helps learners understand how instructional projects are designed and executed in professional environments.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 4500.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
