er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(412, 77, '7f5fd513-96c0-4a34-baea-573948e1ee78', '4809357d-d380-4637-bc50-4f4e2ccb4790', 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-15 07:05:46', '2026-05-15 07:05:46', '<p data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"423\">The admission process for the programme is designed to be simple, fully online, and easy for students from different academic backgrounds. It follows a step-by-step system that ensures smooth registration, accurate application submission, and secure fee payment. The process is structured to reduce complexity and help students complete admission without any physical documentation challenges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"457\">Step-by-Step Admission Process</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"794\">Registration<br data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"474\">The first step is registration on the official admission portal. Candidates need to create their personal account by entering basic details such as name, contact number, email ID, and academic information. Once the registration is completed, login credentials are generated, allowing access to the application dashboard.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"1155\">Fill Online Application Form<br data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"827\">After registration, candidates must proceed to fill out the online application form. In this stage, students are required to enter personal details, educational qualifications, and select their desired programme. It is important to carefully fill in all information as per official documents to avoid errors during verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1504\">Complete Your Payment<br data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1181\">Once the application form is submitted and verified, candidates must proceed with the payment of the programme fee. The payment is done through secure online modes provided on the portal. After successful payment, the admission process is confirmed and the student receives official enrollment details from the institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1839\">Admission Process Explained<br data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1536\">The entire admission process is designed to be transparent, efficient, and student-friendly. It allows applicants to complete all steps from registration to payment in a single online system. This eliminates the need for physical submission of documents and makes the process faster and more accessible.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"2119\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">After payment confirmation, the institution verifies the application and confirms final admission based on eligibility and document validation. This structured approach ensures that students are properly enrolled while maintaining academic standards and administrative accuracy.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"510\">Eligibility Requirements<br data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"83\">The B.Com programme is designed for students who have completed a minimum level of education equivalent to the 10+2 system. The eligibility structure is inclusive and allows students from various academic, vocational, and open schooling backgrounds to apply. The main requirement is completion of a recognised qualification that demonstrates at least twelve years of formal study or an equivalent level of academic preparation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"747\">This flexible eligibility approach ensures that students from commerce, arts, science, and vocational streams can all pursue higher education in commerce without restriction, provided they meet the basic academic equivalency standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"780\">Detailed Eligibility Criteria</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iduzxg\" data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"857\">Intermediate (10+2) or equivalent qualification from a recognised board</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mrgvf\" data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"930\">Candidates appearing for Class 12 examinations are eligible to apply</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ldjvbd\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"991\">Two-year ITI qualification from a recognised institution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gm6kt8\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1065\">APOS (Open School Society) or other recognised open schooling systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nyoeb1\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1127\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling) qualification</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tgd0l\" data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1166\">Polytechnic Diploma after Class 10</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"drqa25\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1224\">Veterinary, Agriculture, or allied diploma programmes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ek7qxu\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1316\">Any other qualification considered equivalent to 10+2 years of study by the institution</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1650\">Eligibility Criteria Explained<br data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1351\">To apply for the B.Com programme, candidates must have successfully completed Intermediate or any equivalent 10+2 level qualification. Students who are currently appearing for their Class 12 examinations are also eligible to apply, although final admission is granted only after result verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1948\">The programme also accepts candidates from vocational and technical backgrounds such as ITI, Polytechnic Diplomas, and specialized diplomas in fields like Agriculture or Veterinary Sciences. These qualifications are considered equivalent based on institutional recognition and academic standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"2298\">Students who have completed their education through open schooling systems such as NIOS or APOS are fully eligible, ensuring that non-traditional learners also have access to commerce education at the undergraduate level. Additionally, any other qualification that satisfies the required twelve years of study is accepted after proper verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2547\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, the eligibility criteria for the B.Com programme are structured to be broad, inclusive, and flexible, allowing students from diverse educational pathways to build a strong foundation in commerce, accounting, finance, and business studies.</p>', '<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\">\r\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:fd2e46ee-654d-4dda-82e5-8b7286d7b428-35\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"relative w-full overflow-visible\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:fd2e46ee-654d-4dda-82e5-8b7286d7b428-35\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:fd2e46ee-654d-4dda-82e5-8b7286d7b428-35\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-22\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"18dbccd6-1af4-483e-b714-de5a2c5c31da\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"505\">The fee structure for the Online Bachelor of Commerce programme is designed to be simple, transparent, and affordable for students from different financial backgrounds. It is divided across academic years and includes key components such as registration fee, examination fee, and tuition fee. This structured approach helps students clearly understand the total cost of the programme before admission and plan their education expenses effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"531\">Detailed Fee Structure</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"879\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"549\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"562\" data-col-size=\"sm\">First Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"576\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Second Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"590\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Third Year</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"879\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"714\">\r\n<td data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"667\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"679\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 1,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"696\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Not applicable</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"714\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Not applicable</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"770\">\r\n<td data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"733\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"745\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"757\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"822\">\r\n<td data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"785\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 5,250</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"809\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 5,250</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"822\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 5,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"879\">\r\n<td data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"842\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"854\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 8,250</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"866\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 7,250</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"879\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 7,250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"1184\"><strong>Total Programme Fee</strong><br data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"903\">The complete Online Bachelor of Commerce programme costs Rs.<strong> 22,750,</strong> which includes all academic years, tuition charges, and examination-related fees. This consolidated fee structure ensures clarity and helps students manage their financial planning throughout the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1540\">Fee Structure Explained<br data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1212\">The fee system is structured in a way that ensures affordability and consistency. A one-time registration fee is charged at the beginning of the programme, which confirms admission and enrollment. Examination fees are applicable every academic year as they cover assessment and evaluation processes conducted by the institution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1782\">The tuition fee remains constant throughout the programme, providing financial stability and predictability for students. This helps learners focus on their studies without worrying about unexpected fee increases during the course duration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"2007\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, the Online B.Com fee structure is designed to be student-friendly, transparent, and easy to manage, making higher education in commerce accessible while maintaining academic quality and structured learning support.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"contents\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"471\">The B.Com programme is designed to provide students with a strong foundation in commerce, accounting, business management, finance, and economics. The curriculum follows a progressive academic structure that begins with basic concepts and gradually advances toward specialized and professional-level subjects. This helps students develop both theoretical understanding and practical business knowledge required for modern commercial careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"506\">Semester-wise Program Structure</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"520\">Semester I</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"647\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11iesgc\" data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"540\">General English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pwfqqc\" data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"594\">Telugu / Hindi / Sanskrit / Communicative English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nnm7a2\" data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"617\">Contemporary India</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f97gh3\" data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"647\">Introduction to Computers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"662\">Semester II</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"782\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c2el3o\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"693\">Fundamentals of Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eovt40\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"718\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tpxlzh\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"759\">Business Organization and Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17zw8b6\" data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"782\">Business Economics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"798\">Semester III</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11iesgc\" data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"818\">General English</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sqodde\" data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"873\">Telugu / Hindi / Sanskrit / Business Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"44r9wx\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"900\">Science and Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g9d8hl\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"926\">Environmental Studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"941\">Semester IV</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1062\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f60ctz\" data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"965\">Advanced Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j6xavf\" data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"989\">Business Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s9wvuh\" data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1036\">Financial Services (Banking and Insurance)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jccnay\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1062\">Management Accounting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1076\">Semester V</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1199\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"31l6dm\" data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1101\">Corporate Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7yxyic\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1129\">Business Law &ndash; Part One</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dlqk2i\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1175\">Cost and Management Accounting &ndash; Part One</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1us1ztx\" data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1199\">Auditing &ndash; Part One</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1214\">Semester VI</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1346\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x0tyz8\" data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1248\">Advanced Corporate Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7f3e58\" data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1276\">Business Law &ndash; Part Two</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dl4nzm\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1322\">Cost and Management Accounting &ndash; Part Two</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uyayfh\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1346\">Auditing &ndash; Part Two</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1688\">Program Overview Explained<br data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1377\">The B.Com curriculum is structured to develop strong conceptual clarity in accounting, financial systems, and business operations. In the initial phase, students are introduced to language skills, basic computing, and foundational business concepts, which help build a strong academic base for commerce studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1964\">As the programme progresses, students move into core commerce subjects such as accounting principles, business organization, and business economics. These subjects help develop an understanding of how businesses operate and how financial records are maintained and analyzed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2249\">In the intermediate stage, the focus shifts toward advanced accounting practices, business statistics, and financial services including banking and insurance. This phase strengthens analytical skills and introduces students to real-world financial systems and corporate environments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2521\">In the final stage, students study specialized subjects such as corporate accounting, business law, cost and management accounting, and auditing. These subjects prepare learners for professional roles in accounting, taxation, auditing, finance, and corporate management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2761\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Overall, the programme is designed to build strong professional competence in commerce by combining theoretical knowledge with practical financial and business applications, making students industry-ready for diverse career opportunities.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 22750.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(413, 77, '7f5fd513-96c0-4a34-baea-573948e1ee78', '4809357d-d380-4637-bc50-4f4e2ccb4790', 77, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 00:16:51', '2026-05-29 00:16:51', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"345\">Candidates seeking admission to the Master of Commerce (M.Com) program must fulfill the eligibility requirements prescribed by the university. The program is designed for graduates who wish to build advanced knowledge in accounting, finance, taxation, business management, economics, and commerce-related subjects.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18b7v41\" data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"388\">Basic Eligibility for M.Com Admission</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iqdubq\" data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"476\">Candidates must have completed a <strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"446\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g002zb\" data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"587\">Graduates from any recognized discipline are eligible to apply, subject to university admission regulations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p8jea4\" data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"771\">Final-year undergraduate students who are <strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"685\">appearing for their qualifying degree examination</strong> may also apply, provided they submit proof of passing within the prescribed timeline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cpohek\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"902\">Candidates from regular, distance learning, or online education modes recognized by relevant authorities are generally eligible.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"364\">The Online Master of Commerce (M.Com) program is designed to offer affordable postgraduate education for students and working professionals seeking advanced knowledge in commerce, accounting, finance, banking, and business management. The fee structure includes registration, examination, and tuition fees spread across two academic years.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"410\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"410\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"382\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"395\" data-col-size=\"sm\">First Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"410\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Second Year</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"490\">\r\n<td data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"473\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"485\">Rs. 1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"490\">-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"534\">\r\n<td data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"509\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"521\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"534\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"574\">\r\n<td data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"549\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"561\">Rs. 7,350</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"574\">Rs. 7,350</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<td data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"598\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"597\">Total Annual Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"615\"><strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"614\">Rs. 10,350</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"632\"><strong data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"630\">Rs. 9,350</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"741\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"666\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"666\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"656\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Fee Details</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"666\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"741\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"741\">\r\n<td data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"723\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"722\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"741\"><strong data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"739\">Rs. 19,700</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fym0om\" data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"769\">Fee Structure Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"1292\">The first-year fee includes a one-time registration fee along with tuition and examination charges. From the second year onwards, students are required to pay only the tuition and examination fees. With a total program fee of <strong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1011\">Rs. 19,700</strong>, the online M.Com program offers a cost-effective pathway for graduates looking to enhance their expertise in commerce, accounting, finance, taxation, banking, and corporate management without incurring the higher costs typically associated with traditional postgraduate programs.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"412\">The Master of Commerce (M.Com) curriculum is designed to provide advanced knowledge in accounting, finance, economics, management, marketing, human resources, banking, and business analytics. The program gradually develops students\' analytical, managerial, and decision-making skills, preparing them for careers in finance, accounting, banking, corporate management, consultancy, and research.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q69\" data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"428\">Semester I</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"466\">Advanced Business Economics &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"790\">This subject introduces advanced economic concepts and their application in business decision-making. Students learn demand analysis, consumer behavior, production theories, market structures, pricing strategies, and economic principles that help organizations make effective business decisions in competitive environments.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"831\">Advanced Management Accounting &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"1105\">The course focuses on accounting techniques used for managerial planning and control. Students gain knowledge of budgeting, cost analysis, financial statement interpretation, variance analysis, and performance evaluation methods that support organizational decision-making.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1132\">Business Environment</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1426\">This subject helps students understand the external factors that influence business operations. Topics include economic policies, government regulations, globalization, industrial policies, business ethics, technological developments, and the impact of socio-economic changes on organizations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1463\">Management Theory and Practice</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1758\">Students are introduced to the foundations of management, including planning, organizing, staffing, directing, and controlling. The subject also covers various management theories, leadership approaches, organizational structures, and modern management practices used in business organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1763\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hscdyg\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1780\">Semester II</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1819\">Advanced Business Economics &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"2082\">Building upon the concepts learned in the first semester, this subject focuses on advanced economic analysis, macroeconomic policies, economic forecasting, business cycles, inflation, employment trends, and their impact on business growth and strategic planning.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2124\">Advanced Management Accounting &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2406\">This paper explores advanced accounting tools used for managerial decision-making. Students study capital budgeting, responsibility accounting, transfer pricing, strategic cost management, and other financial techniques that help organizations improve efficiency and profitability.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2437\">Organizational Behaviour</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2709\">The subject examines human behavior within organizations. Students learn about motivation, leadership, teamwork, communication, organizational culture, conflict management, and employee performance, helping them understand how people contribute to organizational success.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2753\">Statistics for Business Decisions &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"3012\">This course develops quantitative and analytical skills required in business. Students learn statistical methods, data collection techniques, probability concepts, hypothesis testing, and business forecasting methods that support data-driven decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3017\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1y8nh7l\" data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3035\">Semester III</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3080\">Statistics for Business Decisions &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3321\">This advanced statistics course focuses on business research and analytical techniques. Students study regression analysis, correlation, sampling methods, statistical modeling, and decision-making tools used in modern business environments.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3348\">Financial Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3636\">The subject provides in-depth knowledge of financial planning and corporate finance. Students learn investment decisions, capital structure, working capital management, risk analysis, dividend policies, and financial strategies that contribute to organizational growth and profitability.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3663\">Marketing Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3926\">This course focuses on the principles and practices of marketing. Students explore consumer behavior, market segmentation, branding, product management, pricing strategies, promotional techniques, digital marketing concepts, and customer relationship management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"3958\">Human Resource Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"4223\">The subject covers the effective management of human resources within organizations. Key topics include recruitment, training and development, performance appraisal, compensation management, employee relations, workforce planning, and talent management strategies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4228\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hscdyv\" data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4245\">Semester IV</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4247\" data-end=\"4282\">Financial Accounting and Audit</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4283\" data-end=\"4552\">This paper focuses on advanced accounting standards, corporate accounting practices, financial reporting, and auditing procedures. Students gain knowledge of financial statement preparation, audit principles, compliance requirements, and corporate governance practices.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4554\" data-end=\"4584\">Cost Accounting and Audit</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4585\" data-end=\"4823\">Students learn advanced cost accounting techniques used to control costs and improve operational efficiency. The subject also covers cost audits, cost reporting, cost control systems, and methods for evaluating organizational performance.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4825\" data-end=\"4864\">Banking and Financial Institutions</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4865\" data-end=\"5151\">This subject provides an understanding of the banking sector and financial systems. Students study commercial banking operations, central banking functions, financial institutions, credit management, banking regulations, and the role of financial intermediaries in economic development.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5153\" data-end=\"5188\">Financial Markets and Services</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5189\" data-end=\"5454\">The course introduces students to financial markets and investment services. Topics include capital markets, money markets, stock exchanges, mutual funds, investment instruments, financial services, portfolio management, and emerging trends in the financial sector.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 19700.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(414, 77, '7f5fd513-96c0-4a34-baea-573948e1ee78', '4809357d-d380-4637-bc50-4f4e2ccb4790', 104, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'OFFLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 00:33:28', '2026-05-29 00:33:28', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"315\">Candidates seeking admission to the Master of Commerce (M.Com) program must meet the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for graduates who wish to gain advanced knowledge in commerce, accounting, finance, taxation, banking, economics, and business management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"351\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"961\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iqdubq\" data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"439\">Candidates must have completed a <strong data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"409\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2sght\" data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"517\">Graduates from any academic discipline are eligible to apply for admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1upkx0b\" data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"708\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"602\">appearing for their final-year bachelor\'s degree examinations</strong> may also apply, subject to fulfilling the eligibility requirements at the time of admission confirmation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl0426\" data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"844\">Candidates who have completed their qualifying education through recognized distance learning or online modes are generally eligible.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"445\">The Online M.A. Political Science program offers an affordable pathway for students and working professionals who wish to develop expertise in political theory, public administration, governance, international relations, public policy, and political research. The fee structure is designed to provide quality postgraduate education at a reasonable cost while ensuring flexibility through online learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mrz28j\" data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"485\">M.A. Political Science Fee Details</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"753\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"531\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"531\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"503\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"516\" data-col-size=\"sm\">First Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"531\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Second Year</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"753\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"611\">\r\n<td data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"594\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"606\">Rs. 1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"611\">-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"655\">\r\n<td data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"630\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"642\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"655\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"695\">\r\n<td data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"670\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 7,350</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"695\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 7,350</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"753\">\r\n<td data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"719\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"718\">Total Annual Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"736\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"735\">Rs. 10,350</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"753\"><strong data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"751\">Rs. 9,350</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bbv01i\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"776\">Total Program Fee</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"810\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"810\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"800\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"810\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<td data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"867\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"866\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"885\"><strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"883\">Rs. 19,700</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fym0om\" data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"913\">Fee Structure Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"1362\">The first-year fee includes a one-time registration charge along with tuition and examination fees. In the second year, students are required to pay only the tuition and examination fees. With a total program cost of <strong data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1146\">Rs. 19,700</strong>, the Online M.A. Political Science program provides an economical option for graduates seeking advanced knowledge in political systems, governance, public policy, international relations, and administrative studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1604\">The affordable fee structure makes the program suitable for fresh graduates, government job aspirants, civil services candidates, and working professionals looking to enhance their academic qualifications without interrupting their careers.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"483\">The Master of Arts (M.A.) in Political Science is designed to provide students with a comprehensive understanding of political systems, international relations, public administration, public policy, governance, and political thought. The program develops analytical, research, and critical thinking skills while helping students understand political institutions, government functioning, public welfare policies, and global political developments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q69\" data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"499\">Semester I</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"533\">Indian Political System &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"807\">This subject introduces the structure and functioning of the Indian political system. Students learn about the Constitution, democratic institutions, fundamental rights, directive principles, electoral processes, and the role of various constitutional bodies in governance.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"851\">Theory of International Relations &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"1079\">The course focuses on the foundations of international relations, including major theories, concepts, and approaches used to understand interactions among nations, international organizations, and global political developments.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1110\">Indian Political Thought</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1353\">This paper examines the political ideas and philosophies of prominent Indian thinkers. Students explore concepts related to nationalism, democracy, social justice, secularism, and political reform that have shaped India\'s political landscape.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1387\">Foreign Policy of India &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1608\">Students gain an understanding of India\'s foreign policy objectives, principles, and evolution. The course covers India\'s relations with neighboring countries, regional cooperation, and its role in international affairs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hscdyg\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1630\">Semester II</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1666\">Western Political Thought &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1919\">This subject introduces students to the ideas of influential Western political philosophers. Topics include concepts such as justice, liberty, equality, rights, state authority, and democracy that have significantly influenced modern political systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1946\">Comparative Politics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"2169\">The course focuses on comparing political systems, institutions, governments, and political processes across different countries. Students learn how various political structures function and influence governance worldwide.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2227\">State Government and Politics in Andhra Pradesh &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2422\">This paper examines the political and administrative structure of Andhra Pradesh. Students study state governance, political developments, public administration, and regional political dynamics.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2462\">Readings in Indian Administration</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2649\">Students gain insights into the administrative framework of India, including bureaucracy, public administration, governance mechanisms, policy implementation, and administrative reforms.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2654\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1y8nh7l\" data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2672\">Semester III</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2707\">Indian Political System &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2922\">Building upon earlier concepts, this subject explores contemporary issues in Indian politics, including political parties, pressure groups, coalition politics, electoral reforms, and emerging governance challenges.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2967\">Theory of International Relations &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3173\">This advanced course focuses on contemporary international issues such as globalization, international security, diplomacy, global governance, international organizations, and emerging geopolitical trends.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3200\">Research Methods &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3431\">The subject introduces students to social science research techniques. Topics include research design, data collection methods, hypothesis formulation, literature review, and basic research methodologies used in political studies.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3468\">Social Welfare Policy in India</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3716\">Students study the development and implementation of welfare policies aimed at social and economic development. The course examines government initiatives related to education, healthcare, poverty alleviation, social justice, and inclusive growth.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3752\">Readings in Indian Federalism</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3753\" data-end=\"3983\">This paper explores the federal structure of India and the relationship between the Union and State governments. Students examine constitutional provisions, financial relations, administrative coordination, and federal challenges.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"3988\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hscdyv\" data-start=\"3990\" data-end=\"4005\">Semester IV</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4034\">Public Policy Analysis</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4263\">This subject focuses on the formulation, implementation, and evaluation of public policies. Students learn how governments address social, economic, and political issues through effective policy-making and governance strategies.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4298\">Foreign Policy of India &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4483\">The course provides advanced knowledge of India\'s foreign relations, strategic partnerships, international diplomacy, defense policies, and India\'s role in regional and global affairs.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4485\" data-end=\"4511\">Research Methods &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4512\" data-end=\"4696\">Building on the previous semester, students develop advanced research skills involving data analysis, interpretation, report writing, policy research, and academic project preparation.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4698\" data-end=\"4755\">State Government and Politics in Andhra Pradesh &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4932\">This paper examines contemporary political developments, governance challenges, public administration practices, and policy implementation at the state level in Andhra Pradesh.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4934\" data-end=\"4968\">Readings in Political Thought</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"5189\">The subject provides an in-depth understanding of classical and modern political ideologies. Students study various schools of political thought, democratic values, governance principles, and evolving political theories.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 19700.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(415, 77, '7f5fd513-96c0-4a34-baea-573948e1ee78', '4809357d-d380-4637-bc50-4f4e2ccb4790', 101, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 00:37:24', '2026-06-17 00:26:34', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"352\">Candidates seeking admission to the Master of Arts (M.A.) in Economics program must meet the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for graduates who want to develop advanced knowledge in economics, public policy, economic analysis, finance, development studies, and research methodologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"388\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"984\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iqdubq\" data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"476\">Candidates must have completed a <strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"446\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2sght\" data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"554\">Graduates from any academic discipline are eligible to apply for admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a4emyn\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"734\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"639\">appearing for their final-year bachelor\'s degree examinations</strong> may also apply, subject to meeting the admission requirements upon completion of their degree.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl0426\" data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"870\">Candidates who have completed their qualifying education through recognized distance learning or online modes are generally eligible.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"419\">The Online M.A. Economics program is designed for students and working professionals who want to build expertise in economic analysis, public policy, international trade, development economics, finance, and research. The fee structure is affordable and enables learners to pursue postgraduate education through a flexible online learning format without compromising on academic quality.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"87ic1e\" data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"451\">M.A. Economics Fee Details</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"719\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"497\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"497\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"469\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"482\" data-col-size=\"sm\">First Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"497\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Second Year</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"719\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"577\">\r\n<td data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"560\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"572\">Rs. 1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"577\">-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"621\">\r\n<td data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"596\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"608\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"621\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"661\">\r\n<td data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"648\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 7,350</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"661\">Rs. 7,350</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"719\">\r\n<td data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"685\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"684\">Total Annual Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"702\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"701\">Rs. 10,350</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"719\"><strong data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"717\">Rs. 9,350</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bbv01i\" data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"742\">Total Program Fee</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"851\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"766\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"776\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"851\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"851\">\r\n<td data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"833\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"832\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"851\"><strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"849\">Rs. 19,700</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fym0om\" data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"879\">Fee Structure Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"1263\">The first-year fee includes a one-time registration charge along with tuition and examination fees. During the second year, students are required to pay only the tuition and examination fees. The total cost of the Online M.A. Economics program is <strong data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1142\">Rs. 19,700</strong>, making it a cost-effective postgraduate degree for learners seeking advanced knowledge in economics and related fields.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1607\">The program offers excellent value for graduates preparing for careers in economics, banking, finance, public policy, research, consulting, government services, and competitive examinations. The online learning format also provides flexibility for working professionals who wish to upgrade their qualifications while continuing their careers.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"488\">The Master of Arts (M.A.) in Economics is designed to provide advanced knowledge of economic theories, quantitative techniques, public finance, international trade, development economics, and policy analysis. The program helps students understand how economies function at national and global levels while developing analytical, research, and decision-making skills required in government, financial institutions, research organizations, and corporate sectors.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q69\" data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"504\">Semester I</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"538\">Micro Economic Analysis &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"828\">This subject introduces advanced microeconomic concepts related to consumer behavior, demand analysis, production theories, market structures, pricing strategies, and resource allocation. Students learn how individuals and businesses make economic decisions in different market conditions.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"862\">Macro Economic Analysis &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"1083\">The course focuses on the functioning of the economy as a whole. Topics include national income, inflation, unemployment, economic growth, monetary systems, and macroeconomic policies that influence economic performance.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1114\">Quantitative Methods &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1330\">Students learn mathematical and statistical techniques used in economic analysis. The subject develops quantitative skills required for solving economic problems, interpreting data, and conducting economic research.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1357\">Public Economics &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1566\">This paper introduces the role of government in economic activities. Students study taxation, public expenditure, resource allocation, fiscal policy, and government intervention in promoting economic welfare.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1571\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hscdyg\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1588\">Semester II</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1623\">Micro Economic Analysis &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1838\">Building on previous concepts, this course explores advanced theories of consumer choice, market equilibrium, game theory, welfare economics, and business decision-making in competitive and non-competitive markets.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1873\">Macro Economic Analysis &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"2053\">Students gain deeper knowledge of macroeconomic theories, economic stabilization policies, international economic interactions, economic fluctuations, and long-term growth models.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2085\">Quantitative Methods &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2287\">This subject focuses on advanced statistical and analytical techniques used in economics. Students learn forecasting methods, data interpretation, econometric concepts, and quantitative research tools.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2315\">Public Economics &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2498\">The course examines advanced public finance concepts, fiscal federalism, budgetary policies, public debt management, taxation systems, and the economic impact of government programs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2503\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1y8nh7l\" data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2521\">Semester III</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2547\">Economics of Growth</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2790\">This paper focuses on the theories and determinants of economic growth. Students study factors such as capital formation, technological progress, productivity, investment, and policy measures that contribute to long-term economic development.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2816\">International Trade</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"3018\">The subject explores global trade theories, trade policies, international market dynamics, export-import practices, trade agreements, and the economic benefits and challenges of international commerce.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3047\">Indian Economic Policy</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3256\">Students gain an understanding of India\'s economic policies, planning strategies, reforms, industrial development, agricultural policies, and initiatives aimed at promoting economic growth and social welfare.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3283\">Industrial Economics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3500\">This course examines the structure and performance of industries. Topics include industrial organization, market competition, pricing behavior, industrial policies, and the role of industries in economic development.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3523\">Labour Economics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3706\">The subject focuses on labor markets, employment trends, wage determination, labor productivity, workforce participation, labor laws, and issues related to human capital development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3711\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hscdyv\" data-start=\"3713\" data-end=\"3728\">Semester IV</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3759\">Economics of Development</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3760\" data-end=\"3975\">This paper studies the economic challenges faced by developing countries. Students learn about poverty, inequality, sustainable development, economic planning, human development, and strategies for inclusive growth.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"4003\">International Finance</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4004\" data-end=\"4205\">The course provides knowledge of global financial systems, foreign exchange markets, international monetary institutions, balance of payments, exchange rate mechanisms, and international capital flows.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4207\" data-end=\"4238\">Economics of Social Sector</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4423\">Students explore the economic aspects of education, healthcare, social security, welfare programs, and public investments aimed at improving the quality of life and social development.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4446\">Labour Economics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4447\" data-end=\"4621\">This advanced paper further examines labor market policies, employment generation, workforce management, industrial relations, and labor welfare measures in modern economies.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4623\" data-end=\"4638\">Demography</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4639\" data-end=\"4874\">The subject focuses on population studies and their economic implications. Students learn about population growth, migration, fertility, mortality, urbanization, workforce trends, and demographic factors affecting economic development.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 19700.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(416, 77, '7f5fd513-96c0-4a34-baea-573948e1ee78', '4809357d-d380-4637-bc50-4f4e2ccb4790', 102, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 00:47:10', '2026-06-17 00:26:52', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"464\">Candidates seeking admission to the Master of Arts (M.A.) in English program must meet the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for graduates who wish to develop advanced knowledge of English literature, language studies, literary criticism, communication, and research. It is an excellent choice for students interested in teaching, writing, publishing, content creation, media, and academic research.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"500\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"1081\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iqdubq\" data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"588\">Candidates must have completed a <strong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"558\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2sght\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"666\">Graduates from any academic discipline are eligible to apply for admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p6xa3g\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"831\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"751\">appearing for their final-year bachelor\'s degree examinations</strong> may also apply, subject to meeting the admission requirements after graduation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl0426\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"967\">Candidates who have completed their qualifying education through recognized distance learning or online modes are generally eligible.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"448\">The Online M.A. English program is an affordable postgraduate degree designed for students who wish to gain advanced knowledge of English literature, linguistics, literary criticism, language studies, and communication. The program offers the flexibility of online learning, making it suitable for fresh graduates, working professionals, educators, and individuals preparing for academic and competitive examinations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3ie0s\" data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"478\">M.A. English Fee Details</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"746\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"524\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"524\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"496\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"509\" data-col-size=\"sm\">First Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"524\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Second Year</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"746\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"604\">\r\n<td data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"587\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"599\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 1,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"604\" data-col-size=\"sm\">-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"648\">\r\n<td data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"623\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"635\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"648\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"688\">\r\n<td data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"663\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"675\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 7,350</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"688\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 7,350</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"746\">\r\n<td data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"712\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"711\">Total Annual Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"729\"><strong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"728\">Rs. 10,350</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"746\"><strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"744\">Rs. 9,350</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bbv01i\" data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"769\">Total Program Fee</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"878\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"803\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"803\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"793\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"803\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"878\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"878\">\r\n<td data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"860\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"859\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"878\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"876\">Rs. 19,700</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fym0om\" data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"906\">Fee Structure Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"1327\">The first-year fee includes a one-time registration fee along with tuition and examination charges. In the second year, students are required to pay only the tuition and examination fees. With a total program cost of <strong data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1139\">Rs. 19,700</strong>, the Online M.A. English program provides an economical opportunity to earn a postgraduate degree while developing expertise in literature, language, critical analysis, and communication.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1631\">The affordable fee structure makes the program accessible to students seeking careers in teaching, content writing, publishing, journalism, public relations, corporate communication, and research. The online mode also allows learners to balance their studies with professional and personal commitments.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"504\">The Master of Arts (M.A.) in English is designed to provide advanced knowledge of English literature, linguistics, literary criticism, language teaching, and cultural studies. The program helps students develop strong analytical, communication, writing, and research skills while exploring major literary traditions from Britain, America, and India. It is ideal for students aspiring to build careers in teaching, publishing, content writing, journalism, research, and academia.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q69\" data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"520\">Semester I</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"545\">British Poetry &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"776\">This subject introduces students to major British poets and poetic traditions. Students study important literary movements, poetic forms, themes, and styles while developing skills in literary interpretation and critical analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"800\">British Drama &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"1000\">The course focuses on the evolution of British drama and major playwrights. Students explore dramatic techniques, character development, themes, and historical influences that shaped English theatre.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1036\">British Prose and Fiction &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1262\">This paper examines significant works of British prose and fiction. Students study novels, essays, and prose writings while understanding literary styles, narrative techniques, and social contexts reflected in literary works.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1288\">English Linguistics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1512\">Students gain an understanding of the scientific study of language. Topics include phonetics, phonology, morphology, syntax, semantics, and language structure, helping learners understand how language functions and evolves.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1517\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hscdyg\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1534\">Semester II</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1560\">British Poetry &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1774\">Building on the previous semester, this course explores advanced British poetry from different literary periods. Students analyze major poets, poetic movements, and contemporary developments in British literature.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1799\">British Drama &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1998\">The subject examines advanced dramatic works and modern theatrical developments. Students study influential playwrights, dramatic theories, and the social and cultural significance of British drama.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2035\">British Prose and Fiction &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2241\">This paper focuses on advanced literary works in British fiction and prose. Students develop deeper insights into literary themes, narrative structures, critical interpretations, and historical influences.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2290\">History and Growth of the English Language</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2527\">Students explore the origin and development of the English language from its early stages to modern usage. The course covers language evolution, vocabulary development, language change, and the influence of historical events on English.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2532\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1y8nh7l\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2550\">Semester III</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2590\">Literary Criticism and Theory &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2823\">This subject introduces students to major literary theories and critical approaches used in literary analysis. Topics include classical criticism, modern literary theories, interpretation methods, and critical evaluation techniques.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2853\">American Literature &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"3060\">The course focuses on significant American literary works, authors, and movements. Students study the cultural, historical, and social influences that shaped American literature and its global significance.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3096\">Indian English Literature &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3298\">Students explore literary works written in English by Indian authors. The subject examines themes of identity, culture, nationalism, postcolonialism, and contemporary Indian society through literature.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3334\">English Language Teaching &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3561\">This paper introduces the principles and methods of teaching English. Students learn language teaching techniques, classroom strategies, curriculum design, and communication skills necessary for effective language instruction.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3563\" data-end=\"3566\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hscdyv\" data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3583\">Semester IV</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3585\" data-end=\"3624\">Literary Criticism and Theory &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3822\">This advanced course focuses on contemporary literary theories and critical frameworks. Students develop deeper analytical skills for interpreting literature from multiple theoretical perspectives.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"3853\">American Literature &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"4028\">Students continue exploring major American literary texts and authors while examining modern literary trends, cultural issues, and evolving themes within American literature.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4030\" data-end=\"4065\">Indian English Literature &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4066\" data-end=\"4260\">This paper provides advanced study of Indian English literary works, focusing on contemporary writers, emerging literary themes, and the global influence of Indian literature written in English.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4297\">English Language Teaching &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4298\" data-end=\"4483\">The course builds advanced skills in language teaching, assessment methods, educational technology, language acquisition theories, and modern approaches to English language instructions.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 19700.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(417, 77, '7f5fd513-96c0-4a34-baea-573948e1ee78', '4809357d-d380-4637-bc50-4f4e2ccb4790', 328, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 01:00:37', '2026-06-17 00:27:15', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"414\">Candidates seeking admission to the Master of Arts (M.A.) in Human Resource Management program must meet the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for graduates who want to build expertise in human resource management, organizational behavior, talent acquisition, employee relations, training and development, and workforce management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"450\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"1049\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iqdubq\" data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"538\">Candidates must have completed a <strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"508\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2sght\" data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"616\">Graduates from any academic discipline are eligible to apply for admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tj435i\" data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"799\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"701\">appearing for their final-year bachelor\'s degree examinations</strong> may also apply, subject to fulfilling the admission requirements upon completion of their degree.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl0426\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"935\">Candidates who have completed their qualifying education through recognized distance learning or online modes are generally eligible.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"457\">The Master of Human Resource Management (MHRM) program is designed for students and professionals who want to develop expertise in human resource management, talent acquisition, employee relations, organizational development, labor laws, and strategic workforce planning. The program combines theoretical knowledge with practical HR skills, making it suitable for careers in corporate HR, recruitment, training, and people management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x8a1aw\" data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"479\">MHRM Fee Details</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"525\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"525\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"497\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"510\" data-col-size=\"sm\">First Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"525\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Second Year</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"605\">\r\n<td data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"588\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"600\">Rs. 1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"605\">-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"649\">\r\n<td data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"624\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"649\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"691\">\r\n<td data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"664\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"677\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 11,550</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"691\">Rs. 11,550</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<td data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"715\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"714\">Total Annual Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"732\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"731\">Rs. 14,550</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"750\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"748\">Rs. 13,550</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bbv01i\" data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"773\">Total Program Fee</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"882\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"807\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"807\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"807\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"882\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"882\">\r\n<td data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"864\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"863\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"882\"><strong data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"880\">Rs. 28,100</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fym0om\" data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"910\">Fee Structure Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1304\">The first-year fee includes a one-time registration charge along with tuition and examination fees. In the second year, students are required to pay only the tuition and examination fees. The overall program fee of <strong data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1141\">Rs. 28,100</strong> makes the MHRM program an affordable postgraduate option for individuals seeking specialized knowledge in human resource management and organizational leadership.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1665\">The program is particularly beneficial for graduates who aspire to build careers in recruitment, employee engagement, compensation management, training and development, industrial relations, and strategic human resource management. The flexible learning format also enables working professionals to upgrade their qualifications while continuing their careers.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"575\">The Master of Arts (M.A.) in Human Resource Management is designed to provide comprehensive knowledge of workforce management, organizational behavior, labor laws, industrial relations, employee development, and strategic human resource practices. The program equips students with the skills required to manage people effectively, improve organizational performance, and address modern workplace challenges. It is ideal for aspiring HR professionals, managers, and individuals seeking leadership roles in human resource management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q69\" data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"591\">Semester I</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"623\">Human Resource Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"893\">This subject introduces the fundamentals of human resource management, including recruitment, selection, training, performance evaluation, compensation management, and employee engagement. Students learn how organizations manage and develop their workforce effectively.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"924\">Principles of Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"1156\">The course focuses on the core functions of management such as planning, organizing, staffing, directing, and controlling. Students gain an understanding of managerial principles and decision-making processes used in organizations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1198\">Labour Legislation and Case Law &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1432\">This paper provides knowledge of labor laws and legal regulations governing employer-employee relationships. Students study workplace rights, labor welfare provisions, industrial laws, and important legal cases related to employment.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1463\">Organisational Behaviour</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1656\">The subject examines human behavior within organizations. Topics include motivation, leadership, teamwork, communication, organizational culture, conflict management, and employee performance.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1661\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hscdyg\" data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1678\">Semester II</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1705\">Industrial Relations</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1934\">Students learn about the relationship between employers, employees, and trade unions. The course covers collective bargaining, dispute resolution, industrial conflicts, and strategies for maintaining healthy workplace relations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1967\">Human Resource Development</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2171\">This subject focuses on employee growth and organizational development. Students study training methods, career planning, leadership development, performance improvement, and talent management practices.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2220\">Employee Welfare and Labour Administration</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2414\">The course examines employee welfare measures, workplace safety, labor administration systems, social security provisions, and policies designed to improve employee well-being and productivity.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2441\">Business Environment</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2613\">Students gain an understanding of economic, political, social, technological, and legal factors that influence business operations and human resource management practices.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2649\">Observation Visits and Report</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2860\">This practical component allows students to observe organizational and workplace practices. Students prepare reports based on their observations to gain real-world insights into HR functions and administration.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2865\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1y8nh7l\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2883\">Semester III</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2885\" data-end=\"2943\">Strategic and International Human Resource Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3156\">This paper focuses on aligning HR strategies with organizational goals. Students also learn about global workforce management, international HR practices, cross-cultural management, and global talent acquisition.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3199\">Labour Legislation and Case Law &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3400\">Building on previous concepts, this course explores advanced labor regulations, industrial laws, compliance requirements, and significant legal decisions affecting employment and workplace management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3456\">Industrial Economics and Management of Technology</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3457\" data-end=\"3651\">Students study the economic aspects of industries, technological advancements, productivity management, innovation, and the role of technology in organizational growth and workforce development.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3688\">Research Methods and HR Skills</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3881\">This subject introduces research techniques used in human resource studies. Students learn data collection, analysis methods, report writing, problem-solving, and professional HR competencies.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"3941\">Practicals &ndash; Visits to Government Agencies and Report</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3942\" data-end=\"4159\">Students visit relevant government agencies and institutions to understand labor administration, employment policies, and workforce regulations. Practical exposure is supported through report preparation and analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4161\" data-end=\"4164\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hscdyv\" data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4181\">Semester IV</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4183\" data-end=\"4220\">Management of Unorganised Labour</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4429\">The course focuses on labor management in the unorganized sector. Students examine employment challenges, labor welfare initiatives, social security issues, and policies aimed at improving working conditions.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4431\" data-end=\"4497\">Information Technology and Human Resource Information Systems</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4694\">Students learn how technology supports HR functions. Topics include HR information systems (HRIS), digital workforce management, employee databases, performance tracking systems, and HR analytics.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4696\" data-end=\"4715\">Project Report</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4716\" data-end=\"4932\">This practical research component allows students to conduct an independent study on a human resource management topic. It helps develop research, analytical, and problem-solving skills relevant to the HR profession.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4934\" data-end=\"4962\">Comprehensive Viva-Voce</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4963\" data-end=\"5176\">The viva-voce assesses students\' understanding of key concepts covered throughout the program. It evaluates communication skills, subject knowledge, and the ability to apply HR principles to real-world situation</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 28100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(418, 77, '7f5fd513-96c0-4a34-baea-573948e1ee78', '4809357d-d380-4637-bc50-4f4e2ccb4790', 287, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 01:06:39', '2026-06-18 01:03:39', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"424\">Candidates seeking admission to the Master of Arts (M.A.) in Journalism and Mass Communication program must fulfill the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for graduates who wish to build careers in journalism, digital media, broadcasting, public relations, advertising, content creation, corporate communication, and media management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"460\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"1073\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iqdubq\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"548\">Candidates must have completed a <strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"518\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2sght\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"626\">Graduates from any academic discipline are eligible to apply for admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w6aczu\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"820\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"711\">appearing for their final-year bachelor\'s degree examinations</strong> may also apply, subject to fulfilling the admission requirements upon successful completion of their degree.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cl0426\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"956\">Candidates who have completed their qualifying education through recognized distance learning or online modes are generally eligible.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"495\">The Online M.A. Journalism and Mass Communication (JMC) program is designed for students and professionals who want to build expertise in journalism, digital media, broadcasting, public relations, advertising, corporate communication, and media management. The program offers a flexible online learning environment, allowing learners to develop industry-relevant communication skills while balancing academic and professional commitments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t3g6sr\" data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"523\">M.A. (JMC) Fee Details</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"792\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"569\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"569\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"541\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"554\" data-col-size=\"sm\">First Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Second Year</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"792\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"649\">\r\n<td data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"632\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"644\">Rs. 1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"649\">-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"693\">\r\n<td data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"668\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"680\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"693\">Rs. 2,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"733\">\r\n<td data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"720\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 8,400</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"733\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rs. 8,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"792\">\r\n<td data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"757\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"756\">Total Annual Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"774\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"773\">Rs. 11,400</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"792\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"790\">Rs. 10,400</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bbv01i\" data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"815\">Total Program Fee</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"924\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"839\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"849\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"924\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"924\">\r\n<td data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"906\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"905\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"924\"><strong data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"922\">Rs. 21,800</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fym0om\" data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"952\">Fee Structure Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1400\">The first-year fee includes a one-time registration charge along with tuition and examination fees. During the second year, students are required to pay only the tuition and examination fees. With a total program fee of <strong data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1188\">Rs. 21,800</strong>, the Online M.A. Journalism and Mass Communication program provides an affordable opportunity to gain advanced knowledge of media studies, journalism, public relations, advertising, and communication strategies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1678\">The program is particularly beneficial for aspiring journalists, content creators, media professionals, public relations executives, and communication specialists who want to strengthen their skills and career prospects in the rapidly growing media and communication industry.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"543\">The Master of Arts (M.A.) in Journalism and Mass Communication is designed to provide students with comprehensive knowledge of media studies, journalism, advertising, public relations, broadcasting, communication theories, and digital media practices. The program develops reporting, writing, editing, research, and communication skills required for successful careers in journalism, media organizations, advertising agencies, public relations firms, and corporate communication departments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q69\" data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"559\">Semester I</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"587\">History of Mass Media</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"817\">This subject introduces the evolution and development of mass media across different periods. Students learn about the growth of print, radio, television, digital media, and their influence on society, culture, and communication.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"838\">News Reporting</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"1061\">The course focuses on the principles and techniques of news gathering and reporting. Students learn how to identify newsworthy events, conduct interviews, verify information, and prepare accurate and engaging news stories.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1084\">Media Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1313\">This paper provides knowledge of media organizations and their management practices. Students study media planning, organizational structures, media economics, leadership, and decision-making processes within media institutions.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1331\">Advertising</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1524\">Students gain an understanding of advertising concepts, campaign planning, consumer behavior, branding, creative strategies, and promotional communication used by businesses and organizations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1529\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hscdyg\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1546\">Semester II</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1581\">Inter-Cultural Communication</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1785\">This subject examines communication across different cultures and societies. Students learn how cultural values, beliefs, and traditions influence communication and media practices in a globalized world.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1817\">Development Communication</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"2050\">The course focuses on the role of communication in social and economic development. Topics include communication strategies used in education, healthcare, rural development, public awareness campaigns, and social change initiatives.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2073\">Radio Journalism</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2301\">Students learn the fundamentals of radio broadcasting, script writing, audio production, news presentation, and radio program development. The subject provides insights into the role of radio as a powerful communication medium.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2329\">Media Laws and Ethics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2576\">This paper introduces legal and ethical principles governing media operations. Students study freedom of expression, media regulations, press laws, intellectual property rights, and ethical responsibilities of journalists and media professionals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2581\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1y8nh7l\" data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2599\">Semester III</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2626\">Communication Theory</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2808\">The course explores major communication models, theories, and concepts that explain how information is created, transmitted, and interpreted across different communication channels.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2842\">International Communication</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"3050\">Students gain an understanding of global communication systems, international media networks, cross-border information flow, global media policies, and the impact of globalization on communication practices.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3078\">Television Journalism</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3258\">This subject focuses on television news production, reporting techniques, script writing, video journalism, news presentation, and broadcasting practices used in television media.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3292\">Environmental Communication</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3505\">The paper examines communication strategies related to environmental awareness, sustainability, climate change, and public engagement. Students learn how media contributes to environmental education and advocacy.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3510\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hscdyv\" data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3527\">Semester IV</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3568\">Communication Research Methodology</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3774\">This subject introduces research techniques used in communication and media studies. Students learn research design, data collection methods, content analysis, survey techniques, and report writing skills.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3825\">Public Relations and Corporate Communication</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"4046\">The course focuses on building and managing organizational reputation. Students study public relations strategies, stakeholder communication, crisis communication, brand management, and corporate communication practices.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4048\" data-end=\"4076\">Editing for Print Media</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4077\" data-end=\"4265\">Students learn editing techniques used in newspapers, magazines, and publishing. Topics include copy editing, headline writing, content organization, proofreading, and editorial standards.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4294\">Human Rights and Media</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4503\">This paper explores the relationship between media and human rights. Students examine the role of journalism in promoting social justice, equality, freedom of expression, and awareness of human rights issues.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 21800.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(419, 78, '15a1b1dc-4623-4f7b-a9c4-b372497491f7', 'ecc46421-3a2c-4e62-8da5-417a843540a4', 39, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 01:27:58', '2026-05-29 01:32:26', '<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"268\">The admission process for the Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is designed to be simple and student-friendly. Candidates can complete the entire process through a few easy steps, from application submission to final enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dlwfyc\" data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"294\">Step 1: Apply Online</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"534\">Begin your admission journey by filling out the online application form. Applicants are required to provide personal information, academic details, and upload the necessary documents, including their Class 12 marksheet and identity proof.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s7eze\" data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"591\">Step 2: Merit-Based Selection / Entrance Assessment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"812\">Applications are evaluated based on Class 12 academic performance from any recognized stream. Depending on the admission criteria, candidates may also be considered through the university\'s entrance examination process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lh8jsy\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"845\">Step 3: Counselling Session</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"1099\">Shortlisted candidates participate in a personalized counselling session. During this stage, academic advisors help students understand the program structure, career opportunities, specialization options, and future growth prospects in the IT industry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iecth8\" data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1125\">Step 4: Offer Letter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1314\">After successful evaluation and counselling, eligible candidates receive an admission offer letter. The offer confirms program eligibility, admission status, and batch allocation details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y0veyg\" data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1360\">Step 5: Enrollment and Seat Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1592\">To complete the admission process, students must pay the required fee and submit the necessary documents for verification. Once the verification process is completed successfully, the seat is confirmed and enrollment is finalized.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ym8t36\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1629\">Documents Required for Admission</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1839\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"377nvn\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1667\">Class 10 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3y2t5t\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1704\">Class 12 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzlgvv\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1732\">Passport-Size Photographs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uq6gua\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1760\">Valid Government ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"122irsi\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1800\">Migration Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1839\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"369\">Candidates seeking admission to the Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program must fulfill the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for students who wish to build a strong foundation in computer applications, programming, software development, database management, web technologies, and information technology.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"405\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"1027\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10uo0e1\" data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"510\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"456\">Class 12 (10+2)</strong> or an equivalent examination from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7emwlq\" data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"677\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"569\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> are also eligible to apply, subject to meeting the admission requirements after the declaration of results.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1na4pza\" data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"779\">Students from any stream, including Science, Commerce, and Arts, can generally apply for admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d76mtt\" data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"878\">Candidates who have completed their qualifying education through recognized boards are eligible.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tlc1j\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"1027\"><strong data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"939\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling) candidates</strong> are also eligible to apply, provided they meet the university\'s admission requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 'Medium', '<p>The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is designed to build strong foundations in programming, software development, databases, artificial intelligence, cloud computing, web technologies, and cybersecurity. The curriculum combines theoretical knowledge with practical labs and industry projects, helping students develop technical skills required for modern IT careers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mvgv37\" data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"456\">Year 1: Programming, Frontend &amp; Backend Foundations</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"585\">The first year focuses on core programming concepts, web development fundamentals, computer systems, and emerging technologies.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"602\">Semester 1</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"740\"><strong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"654\">Problem Solving &amp; Computational Thinking (C++)</strong><br data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"657\">Introduces programming logic, algorithms, and problem-solving techniques using C++.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"878\"><strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"789\">Digital Electronics &amp; Computer Organization</strong><br data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\">Covers the basic structure and functioning of computer systems and digital components.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"1022\"><strong data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"935\">Frontend Development Basics (HTML, CSS, JavaScript)</strong><br data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"938\">Focuses on creating responsive and interactive websites using core web technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1144\"><strong data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1059\">Python Programming Fundamentals</strong><br data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1062\">Provides foundational knowledge of Python programming and application development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1235\"><strong data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1175\">Communicative English &ndash; I</strong><br data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1178\">Develops communication, writing, and presentation skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1344\"><strong data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1265\">Environmental Management</strong><br data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1268\">Introduces environmental sustainability and responsible resource management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1429\"><strong data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1367\">Labs &amp; Practicals</strong><br data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1370\">Hands-on training in C++, Python, and frontend development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1558\"><strong data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1476\">Foundations of AI &amp; Emerging Technologies</strong><br data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1479\">Provides an overview of artificial intelligence and emerging technology trends.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1575\">Semester 2</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1701\"><strong data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1628\">Data Structures &amp; Algorithms Fundamentals (C++)</strong><br data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1631\">Introduces data organization techniques and algorithm design concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1818\"><strong data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1748\">Operating System &amp; Unix Shell Programming</strong><br data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1751\">Covers operating system functions and Unix command-line operations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1963\"><strong data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1885\">Backend Development Fundamentals (React.js, Node.js, Express)</strong><br data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1888\">Focuses on server-side development and modern web application architecture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2061\"><strong data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1994\">UI/UX Design Fundamentals</strong><br data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"1997\">Introduces user interface design and user experience principles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2156\"><strong data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2092\">Data Science Fundamentals</strong><br data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2095\">Provides basic knowledge of data analysis using modern tools.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2269\"><strong data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2193\">AI Ethics &amp; Social Implications</strong><br data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2196\">Explores ethical concerns and responsible use of artificial intelligence.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2386\"><strong data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2292\">Labs &amp; Practicals</strong><br data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2295\">Practical training in algorithms, backend development, operating systems, and UI/UX design.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2391\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u87i68\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2443\">Year 2: OOP, Databases, Cloud &amp; AI Foundations</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2586\">The second year develops expertise in object-oriented programming, databases, networking, cloud computing, and machine learning fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2603\">Semester 3</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2716\"><strong data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2656\">Object-Oriented Programming Fundamentals (Java)</strong><br data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2659\">Introduces Java programming and object-oriented concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2829\"><strong data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2762\">Database Management Systems Fundamentals</strong><br data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2765\">Focuses on database design, SQL, and data management techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2926\"><strong data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2856\">Computational Methods</strong><br data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2859\">Covers mathematical and computational approaches used in computing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"3046\"><strong data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2980\">Cloud Computing Concepts &amp; Services (AWS, Azure)</strong><br data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"2983\">Provides knowledge of cloud platforms and cloud-based services.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3125\"><strong data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3072\">AI &amp; ML Fundamentals</strong><br data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3075\">Introduces machine learning concepts and AI tools.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3235\"><strong data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3168\">Logical Skills Building &amp; Soft Skills</strong><br data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3171\">Develops analytical thinking, teamwork, and professional skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3317\"><strong data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3258\">Labs &amp; Practicals</strong><br data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3261\">Hands-on experience in Java, databases, and AI/ML tools.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3334\">Semester 4</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3434\"><strong data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3371\">Design &amp; Analysis of Algorithms</strong><br data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3374\">Focuses on algorithm efficiency and optimization techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3560\"><strong data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3478\">Computer Networks &amp; Data Communication</strong><br data-start=\"3478\" data-end=\"3481\">Covers networking concepts, communication protocols, and internet technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3671\"><strong data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3592\">Applied Python Programming</strong><br data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3595\">Explores advanced Python applications in software development and analytics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3764\"><strong data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3702\">Data Warehousing &amp; Mining</strong><br data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3705\">Introduces data storage, processing, and mining techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3886\"><strong data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3820\">Personality Development and Decision-Making Skills</strong><br data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3823\">Enhances leadership, confidence, and decision-making abilities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"3981\"><strong data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"3909\">Labs &amp; Practicals</strong><br data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"3912\">Practical implementation of algorithms and Python-based applications.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"3986\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qezrk8\" data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"4044\">Year 3: Specialization, Capstone &amp; Industry Projects</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4171\">The final year focuses on advanced development technologies, machine learning, cybersecurity, and industry-oriented projects.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4188\">Semester 5</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4303\"><strong data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4235\">Statistical Analysis &amp; Data Visualization</strong><br data-start=\"4235\" data-end=\"4238\">Introduces statistical techniques and data visualization methods.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4305\" data-end=\"4407\"><strong data-start=\"4305\" data-end=\"4329\">Research Methodology</strong><br data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4332\">Focuses on research techniques, data collection, and project documentation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4409\" data-end=\"4512\"><strong data-start=\"4409\" data-end=\"4450\">Research Project / Industry Project I</strong><br data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4453\">Provides practical exposure through project-based learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4514\" data-end=\"4620\"><strong data-start=\"4514\" data-end=\"4554\">Advanced React &amp; Next.js Development</strong><br data-start=\"4554\" data-end=\"4557\">Covers modern frontend frameworks and advanced web development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4622\" data-end=\"4707\"><strong data-start=\"4622\" data-end=\"4659\">Node.js &amp; RESTful API Development</strong><br data-start=\"4659\" data-end=\"4662\">Focuses on backend services and API creation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4709\" data-end=\"4808\"><strong data-start=\"4709\" data-end=\"4750\">Elective: AI-Powered Web Applications</strong><br data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"4753\">Introduces AI integration into modern web applications.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4810\" data-end=\"4825\">Semester 6</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4938\"><strong data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4870\">Applied Machine Learning &amp; MLOps Basics</strong><br data-start=\"4870\" data-end=\"4873\">Covers machine learning deployment and model management concepts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4940\" data-end=\"5056\"><strong data-start=\"4940\" data-end=\"4977\">Information Security &amp; Cyber Laws</strong><br data-start=\"4977\" data-end=\"4980\">Introduces cybersecurity principles, data protection, and cyber regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5058\" data-end=\"5155\"><strong data-start=\"5058\" data-end=\"5087\">Industry Capstone Project</strong><br data-start=\"5087\" data-end=\"5090\">A major project that demonstrates technical and practical skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5157\" data-end=\"5269\"><strong data-start=\"5157\" data-end=\"5203\">Microservices Architecture &amp; System Design</strong><br data-start=\"5203\" data-end=\"5206\">Focuses on scalable application design and distributed systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5271\" data-end=\"5396\"><strong data-start=\"5271\" data-end=\"5321\">Progressive Web Apps &amp; Performance Engineering</strong><br data-start=\"5321\" data-end=\"5324\">Covers advanced web application optimization and performance techniques.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5508\"><strong data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5440\">Elective: AI-Integrated REST &amp; GraphQL</strong><br data-start=\"5440\" data-end=\"5443\">Explores intelligent API development and AI-powered integrations.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"458\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is designed to prepare students for careers in software development, web technologies, data analytics, cloud computing, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, and IT services. Through industry-relevant coursework, practical training, project-based learning, and career support initiatives, students gain the skills required to succeed in today\'s competitive technology sector.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6ea05q\" data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"493\">BCA Placement Statistics 2024</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"715\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"528\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"528\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"517\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Placement Parameter</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"528\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"715\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"595\">\r\n<td data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"584\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"583\">Placement Rate</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"595\"><strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"593\">90%</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<td data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"618\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"617\">Average Package</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"632\"><strong data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"630\">₹8 LPA</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"670\">\r\n<td data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"655\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"654\">Highest Package</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"670\"><strong data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"668\">₹28 LPA</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"715\">\r\n<td data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"693\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"692\">Hiring Partners</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"715\"><strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"713\">150+ Companies</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c9shzg\" data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"739\">Placement Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"1090\">The BCA program focuses on developing technical expertise, problem-solving abilities, and practical project experience that align with current industry requirements. Students receive exposure to programming languages, full-stack development, cloud technologies, data science, and emerging technologies, helping them become job-ready upon graduation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1411\">With a <strong data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1121\">90% placement rate</strong>, graduates have secured opportunities across leading IT companies, software firms, technology startups, and digital enterprises. The program\'s emphasis on real-world projects, internships, coding practice, and technical skill development contributes significantly to student employability.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"31\",\"148\",\"149\",\"151\",\"152\",\"153\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(420, 78, '15a1b1dc-4623-4f7b-a9c4-b372497491f7', 'ecc46421-3a2c-4e62-8da5-417a843540a4', 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 01:50:59', '2026-05-29 01:55:15', '<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"368\">The admission process for the Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) program is designed to be simple, transparent, and student-friendly. Candidates can complete their application and enrollment through a structured process that helps identify the right program and specialization based on their academic background and career aspirations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dlwfyc\" data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"394\">Step 1: Apply Online</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"658\">The first step is to complete the online application form by providing personal, academic, and contact details. Applicants must upload the required documents, including their <strong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"593\">Class 12 marksheet</strong> and other supporting credentials as specified by the university.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hfpahz\" data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"716\">Step 2: Merit-Based Selection / Entrance Examination</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"971\">Admission is granted based on Class 12 academic performance or through the <strong data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"836\">Sharda University Admission Test (SUAT)</strong>, depending on the applicable admission criteria. The evaluation process helps assess a candidate\'s readiness for management education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10a4nba\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1019\">Step 3: Counselling and Personal Interview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1276\">Shortlisted candidates participate in a counselling session and personal interview. This stage helps students understand the program structure, specialization options, career opportunities, and future growth prospects in the business and management field.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iecth8\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1302\">Step 4: Offer Letter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1531\">Candidates who successfully complete the selection process receive an admission offer letter. The letter contains important information regarding the program, specialization choices, admission status, and enrollment guidelines.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y0veyg\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1577\">Step 5: Enrollment and Seat Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1797\">To confirm admission, students must complete the fee payment process and submit the required documents for verification. Once verification is successfully completed, the seat is officially confirmed in the BBA program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ym8t36\" data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1834\">Documents Required for Admission</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"2053\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"377nvn\" data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1872\">Class 10 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3y2t5t\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1909\">Class 12 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzlgvv\" data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1937\">Passport-Size Photographs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uq6gua\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1965\">Valid Government ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzi5yu\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2014\">Transfer/Migration Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2053\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"335\">Candidates seeking admission to the Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) program must meet the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for students who want to build a strong foundation in business management, marketing, finance, entrepreneurship, human resources, and leadership.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"371\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"938\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10uo0e1\" data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"476\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"422\">Class 12 (10+2)</strong> or an equivalent examination from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7emwlq\" data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"643\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"535\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> are also eligible to apply, subject to meeting the admission requirements after the declaration of results.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wysdi1\" data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"724\">Students from <strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"691\">Science, Commerce, and Arts</strong> streams can apply for admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e4r464\" data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"820\">Candidates who have completed their qualifying education from recognized boards are eligible.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ipgldb\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"938\"><strong data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"881\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling) candidates</strong> are also eligible to apply as per university guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"17\" data-end=\"450\">The Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) program is designed to provide students with a strong foundation in business management, finance, marketing, entrepreneurship, business law, and organizational leadership. The curriculum combines theoretical knowledge with practical projects, industry exposure, and specialization-focused learning to prepare students for careers in the corporate sector, startups, and family businesses.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"455\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ip75gg\" data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"502\">Year 1: Business Foundations &amp; Core Skills</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"656\">The first year focuses on building fundamental knowledge of business operations, management principles, accounting, economics, and communication skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q61\" data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"672\">Semester 1</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"697\">Business Economics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"797\">Introduces economic concepts and their application in business decision-making and market analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"824\">Financial Accounting</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"917\">Focuses on accounting principles, financial statements, and recording business transactions.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"948\">Principles of Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1057\">Provides an understanding of planning, organizing, staffing, directing, and controlling business activities.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1090\">Basic Business Mathematics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1175\">Develops quantitative skills required for business calculations and decision-making.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1205\">Communicative English I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1272\">Enhances communication, writing, and professional language skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q62\" data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1288\">Semester 2</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1327\">Economic Environment of Business</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1400\">Examines economic factors that influence business operations and growth.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1448\">Cost Accounting and Management Accounting</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1527\">Introduces cost analysis, budgeting, and financial decision-making techniques.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1558\">Organisational Behaviour</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1636\">Focuses on employee behavior, motivation, leadership, and workplace dynamics.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1663\">Marketing Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1757\">Provides knowledge of marketing strategies, branding, consumer behavior, and market planning.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1796\">Computer Application in Business</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1874\">Introduces digital tools and software commonly used in business environments.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1927\">Universal Human Values and Professional Ethics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1993\">Develops ethical decision-making and professional responsibility.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2019\">Business Statistics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2093\">Covers statistical techniques used for business analysis and forecasting.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2124\">Communicative English II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2205\">Builds advanced communication and presentation skills for professional settings.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gcjx11\" data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2235\">Year 1 Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2458\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mx8190\" data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2293\">Strong foundation in business and management concepts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v72848\" data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2349\">Understanding of accounting and economics principles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"29koot\" data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2403\">Development of communication and analytical skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pzk804\" data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2458\">Exposure to marketing and organizational management.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2463\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15xvic1\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2523\">Year 2: Business Law, Research &amp; International Business</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2649\">The second year focuses on legal aspects of business, research techniques, entrepreneurship, and global business operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q63\" data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2665\">Semester 3</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2684\">Business Law</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2782\">Provides knowledge of legal principles governing business activities and commercial transactions.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2814\">Business Research Methods</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2894\">Introduces research techniques, data collection methods, and business analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2923\">Business Communication</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"3007\">Develops professional communication, negotiation, and corporate interaction skills.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3035\">Environmental Studies</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3111\">Focuses on environmental sustainability and responsible business practices.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3189\">Elective: Consumer Intelligence with AI / AI-Powered Marketing Strategy</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3301\">Introduces the use of artificial intelligence in understanding customer behavior and marketing decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q64\" data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3317\">Semester 4</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3346\">International Business</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3430\">Explores global trade, international markets, and cross-border business operations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3465\">Entrepreneurship Development</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3555\">Focuses on business creation, innovation, startup management, and entrepreneurial skills.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3575\">Corporate Law</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3669\">Provides an understanding of legal regulations related to companies and corporate governance.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3671\" data-end=\"3705\">Total Personality Development</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3770\">Enhances leadership, confidence, teamwork, and career readiness.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"3787\">Internship</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3788\" data-end=\"3863\">Students gain practical industry exposure through professional internships.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3934\">Elective: AI-Powered Sales Forecasting / Marketing Operations AI</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"4017\">Introduces AI-driven tools for sales analysis and marketing operations management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uumoxi\" data-start=\"4019\" data-end=\"4047\">Year 2 Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4253\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gonutn\" data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4108\">Understanding of business laws and corporate regulations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13qq409\" data-start=\"4109\" data-end=\"4157\">Knowledge of international business practices.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jijg3q\" data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4199\">Practical exposure through internships.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sluwa3\" data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4253\">Development of entrepreneurial and research skills.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4258\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"gutpdz\" data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4314\">Year 3: Specialization Capstone &amp; Industry Projects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4316\" data-end=\"4437\">The final year focuses on strategic management, innovation, taxation, project management, and industry-oriented learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q65\" data-start=\"4439\" data-end=\"4453\">Semester 5</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4455\" data-end=\"4478\">Corporate Strategy</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4479\" data-end=\"4564\">Focuses on strategic planning, competitive advantage, and business growth strategies.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4566\" data-end=\"4601\">Innovation and Design Thinking</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4602\" data-end=\"4689\">Introduces creative problem-solving and innovation techniques for business development.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4691\" data-end=\"4713\">Business Taxation</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4714\" data-end=\"4792\">Provides knowledge of taxation systems, compliance, and business tax planning.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4794\" data-end=\"4824\">Research Based Learning I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4825\" data-end=\"4897\">Allows students to apply research concepts to business-related projects.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4899\" data-end=\"4972\">Elective: AI-Powered Brand Management / Neuromarketing &amp; AI Insights</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4973\" data-end=\"5054\">Explores the role of AI in branding, customer engagement, and marketing analysis.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q66\" data-start=\"5056\" data-end=\"5070\">Semester 6</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5072\" data-end=\"5117\">Corporate Governance and Business Ethics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5118\" data-end=\"5207\">Examines ethical business practices, corporate accountability, and governance principles.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5209\" data-end=\"5250\">Project Management for Entrepreneurs</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5251\" data-end=\"5326\">Focuses on planning, executing, and managing business projects effectively.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5328\" data-end=\"5350\">Consumer Behavior</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5351\" data-end=\"5423\">Studies customer preferences, purchasing decisions, and market behavior.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5425\" data-end=\"5456\">Research Based Learning II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5457\" data-end=\"5523\">Provides advanced project-based learning and research application.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5525\" data-end=\"5613\">Elective: AI in Integrated Marketing Communications / Marketing AI Capstone Project</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"5614\" data-end=\"5703\">Introduces AI-powered marketing communication strategies and practical capstone projects.</p>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"444\">The Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) program is designed to prepare students for careers in management, marketing, finance, human resources, business development, and entrepreneurship. Through industry-oriented learning, internships, live projects, case study-based training, and professional mentoring, students develop the practical skills required to succeed in today\'s competitive business environment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"m3dffz\" data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"479\">BBA Placement Statistics 2024</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"706\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"514\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"514\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"503\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Placement Parameter</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"514\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"706\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"581\">\r\n<td data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"570\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"569\">Placement Rate</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"581\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"579\">88%</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"618\">\r\n<td data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"604\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"603\">Average Package</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"618\"><strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"616\">₹7 LPA</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"656\">\r\n<td data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"641\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"640\">Highest Package</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"656\"><strong data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"654\">₹22 LPA</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"706\">\r\n<td data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"684\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"683\">Recruiting Companies</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"706\"><strong data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"704\">120+ Companies</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c9shzg\" data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"730\">Placement Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"1049\">The BBA program emphasizes business fundamentals, leadership development, communication skills, strategic thinking, and industry exposure. Students participate in internships, case studies, business simulations, and project-based learning that help bridge the gap between academics and real-world business challenges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1376\">With an <strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1081\">88% placement rate</strong>, graduates have secured opportunities in leading corporate organizations, startups, consulting firms, financial institutions, marketing agencies, and multinational companies. The curriculum is designed to enhance employability and prepare students for entry-level management and business roles.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"35\",\"38\",\"154\",\"155\",\"156\",\"157\"]', 5.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(421, 78, '15a1b1dc-4623-4f7b-a9c4-b372497491f7', 'ecc46421-3a2c-4e62-8da5-417a843540a4', 75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 02:02:31', '2026-05-29 02:02:31', '<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"385\">The admission process for the Master of Computer Applications (MCA) program is designed to help eligible graduates seamlessly transition into advanced computing and technology education. From application submission to final enrollment, each step is structured to evaluate academic readiness and align students with the right specialization and career pathway.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dlwfyc\" data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"411\">Step 1: Apply Online</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"698\">Candidates must complete the online application form by providing their personal, academic, and contact details. Applicants are required to upload their graduation marksheet, such as <strong data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"659\">BCA, B.Sc. Computer Science, or an equivalent qualification</strong>, along with other necessary documents.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hfpahz\" data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"756\">Step 2: Merit-Based Selection / Entrance Examination</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"1014\">Admission is offered based on graduation performance or through the <strong data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"869\">Sharda University Admission Test (SUAT)</strong>. The assessment may evaluate technical aptitude, logical reasoning, and problem-solving skills relevant to computer applications and technology.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1we4xan\" data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1049\">Step 3: Technical Counselling</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1307\">Shortlisted candidates participate in a one-on-one counselling session with academic experts. This stage helps students understand the curriculum, specialization options, industry trends, and career opportunities available after completing the MCA program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iecth8\" data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1333\">Step 4: Offer Letter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1521\">After successful evaluation and counselling, eligible candidates receive an admission offer letter. The offer confirms the program, batch allocation, and selected specialization pathway.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y0veyg\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1567\">Step 5: Enrollment and Seat Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1788\">To finalize admission, students must complete the fee payment process and submit all required documents for verification. Once verification is completed successfully, the seat is officially confirmed in the MCA program.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"390\">Candidates seeking admission to the Master of Computer Applications (MCA) program must meet the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for students who wish to gain advanced knowledge in computer applications, software development, artificial intelligence, data science, cloud computing, cybersecurity, and modern information technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"426\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"1141\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"an8qf0\" data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"566\">Candidates must have completed a <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"506\">BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)</strong> or <strong data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"536\">B.Sc. Computer Science</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16e3ose\" data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"687\">Applicants should possess a strong foundation in computer programming, databases, and information technology concepts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r6xr14\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"854\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"772\">appearing for their final-year bachelor\'s degree examinations</strong> may also apply, subject to meeting the eligibility requirements after graduation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vzndha\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"988\">Candidates who have completed their qualifying degree through recognized regular, distance, or online modes are generally eligible.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"17\" data-end=\"495\">The Master of Computer Applications (MCA) program is designed to provide advanced knowledge in software development, programming, databases, artificial intelligence, machine learning, data analytics, and modern computing technologies. The curriculum combines theoretical learning with practical projects, industry exposure, and specialization-focused subjects to prepare students for careers in software engineering, data science, AI, cloud computing, and technology management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"500\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1i239ev\" data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"553\">Year 1: Computing Foundations &amp; Core Development</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"711\">The first year focuses on strengthening core computing concepts, programming skills, system architecture, networking, and software development fundamentals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q61\" data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"727\">Semester 1</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"772\">Mathematical Foundations for Computing</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"885\">This subject develops mathematical and analytical skills required for computing, programming, and data analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"938\">Problem Solving &amp; Computational Thinking (C++)</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1026\">Students learn programming logic, algorithms, and problem-solving techniques using C++.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1074\">Operating System &amp; Unix Shell Programming</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1181\">Introduces operating system concepts, process management, file systems, and Unix command-line programming.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1226\">Computer Architecture and Organization</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1344\">Focuses on the structure and functioning of computer hardware, processors, memory systems, and computer organization.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1391\">Data Communication and Computer Networks</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1508\">Provides knowledge of networking concepts, communication protocols, internet technologies, and network architecture.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1553\">Introduction to Computers &amp; Technology</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1641\">Introduces fundamental computing concepts, digital technologies, and modern IT systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1665\">Foundations of AI</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1769\">Offers an overview of artificial intelligence, machine learning concepts, and emerging AI technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q62\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1790\">Semester 2</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1844\">Data Structures &amp; Algorithms Fundamentals (C++)</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1938\">Covers data organization techniques, algorithm design, and efficient problem-solving methods.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1972\">Database Management Systems</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2057\">Introduces database design, SQL, data storage, and database administration concepts.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2097\">Software Engineering Fundamentals</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2203\">Focuses on software development life cycles, software design, testing, and project management principles.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2239\">Java Programming Fundamentals</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2334\">Provides knowledge of Java programming, object-oriented concepts, and application development.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2378\">Logical Skills Building &amp; Soft Skills</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2458\">Develops analytical thinking, communication, teamwork, and professional skills.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2499\">AI Ethics &amp; Responsible Technology</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2599\">Examines ethical considerations, responsible AI practices, data privacy, and technology governance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gcjx11\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2629\">Year 1 Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2873\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7x01av\" data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2691\">Strong foundation in programming and software development.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bxplz7\" data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2756\">Understanding of databases, networking, and operating systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqqx3i\" data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2804\">Knowledge of software engineering principles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qltdwd\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2873\">Introduction to artificial intelligence and emerging technologies.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2878\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"173uf3a\" data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2934\">Year 2: Specialization Capstone &amp; Industry Projects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"3076\">The second year focuses on advanced analytics, artificial intelligence, machine learning, research projects, and industry-oriented learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q63\" data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3092\">Semester 3</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3132\">Application Programming in Python</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3237\">Students learn advanced Python programming for application development, automation, and data processing.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3275\">Design &amp; Analysis of Algorithms</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3374\">Focuses on algorithm efficiency, optimization techniques, and advanced problem-solving strategies.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3419\">Statistical Methods in Decision Making</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3529\">Introduces statistical techniques used for business intelligence, analytics, and data-driven decision-making.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3554\">Data Visualization</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3653\">Provides knowledge of presenting complex data through charts, dashboards, and visualization tools.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3655\" data-end=\"3688\">Elective: Big Data Analytics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3792\">Focuses on large-scale data processing, analytics tools, and extracting insights from massive datasets.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3797\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q64\" data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3813\">Semester 4</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3815\" data-end=\"3874\">Technology Product Management &amp; Agile Delivery (Scrum)</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3990\">Introduces product development processes, agile methodologies, Scrum frameworks, and technology project management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4047\">Research Project / Industry / Open-Dataset Problem</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4048\" data-end=\"4153\">Students work on real-world projects to apply technical concepts and solve practical industry challenges.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4204\">Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4298\">Covers AI models, machine learning algorithms, predictive analytics, and intelligent systems.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4338\">Neural Networks and Deep Learning</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4424\">Focuses on deep learning concepts, neural network architectures, and AI applications.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4426\" data-end=\"4462\">Elective: Time Series Analytics</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4560\">Introduces forecasting techniques, trend analysis, and predictive modeling using time-based data.</p>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"460\">The Master of Computer Applications (MCA) program is designed to prepare students for advanced careers in software development, artificial intelligence, machine learning, data analytics, cloud computing, cybersecurity, and technology consulting. Through industry-focused training, technical workshops, research projects, and hands-on learning, students gain the skills required to succeed in the rapidly evolving technology sector.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vhplvl\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"495\">MCA Placement Statistics 2024</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"722\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"530\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"530\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"519\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Placement Parameter</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"530\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"722\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"597\">\r\n<td data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"586\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"585\">Placement Rate</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"597\"><strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"595\">90%</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"634\">\r\n<td data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"620\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"619\">Average Package</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"634\"><strong data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"632\">₹8 LPA</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"672\">\r\n<td data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"657\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"656\">Highest Package</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"672\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"670\">₹28 LPA</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"722\">\r\n<td data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"700\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"699\">Recruiting Companies</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"722\"><strong data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"720\">150+ Companies</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c9shzg\" data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"746\">Placement Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"1068\">The MCA curriculum emphasizes advanced programming, software engineering, artificial intelligence, machine learning, database technologies, and system design. Students gain practical exposure through industry projects, research-based learning, internships, and technical assignments that help build real-world expertise.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1402\">With a <strong data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1099\">90% placement rate</strong>, MCA graduates have secured opportunities in leading technology companies, IT service organizations, software development firms, multinational corporations, and emerging technology startups. The program\'s focus on technical excellence and project-based learning significantly enhances career readiness.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(422, 78, '15a1b1dc-4623-4f7b-a9c4-b372497491f7', 'ecc46421-3a2c-4e62-8da5-417a843540a4', 207, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 02:17:23', '2026-06-17 00:28:29', '<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"389\">The admission process for the Master of Business Administration (MBA) program is designed to identify candidates with strong academic potential, leadership qualities, and managerial aptitude. The process includes application submission, entrance evaluation, interaction rounds, and final enrollment to ensure students are prepared for advanced business education.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dlwfyc\" data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"415\">Step 1: Apply Online</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"686\">Candidates must complete the online application form by providing personal, academic, and professional details. Applicants are required to submit their graduation marksheet, relevant documents, and work experience details (if applicable) during the application process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19yebf2\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"713\">Step 2: Entrance Test</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"993\">Applicants are evaluated through recognized management entrance examinations such as <strong data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"823\">CAT, MAT, XAT, GMAT</strong>, or the <strong data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"875\">Sharda University Admission Test (SUAT)</strong>. The assessment helps evaluate analytical ability, quantitative aptitude, reasoning skills, and management potential.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c1poxs\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1028\">Step 3: Group Discussion (GD)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1268\">Shortlisted candidates participate in a Group Discussion round where they are assessed on communication skills, critical thinking, teamwork, leadership qualities, and the ability to express ideas effectively in a professional environment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gbriej\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1300\">Step 4: Personal Interview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1568\">Candidates who qualify the previous stages are invited for a personal interview with a faculty or admission panel. The interview evaluates academic background, career goals, management aptitude, problem-solving abilities, and overall suitability for the MBA program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11l0smp\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1612\">Step 5: Final Admission and Enrollment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1872\">Successful candidates receive an admission offer letter. To confirm admission, students must complete the fee payment process and submit all required documents for verification. Upon successful verification, enrollment is finalized and the seat is confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ym8t36\" data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1909\">Documents Required for Admission</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"2192\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j8ay68\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1956\">Graduation Marksheet and Degree Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"377nvn\" data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1993\">Class 10 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3y2t5t\" data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2030\">Class 12 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c8dhnm\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2072\">Entrance Exam Scorecard (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ijqh7i\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2092\">Updated Resume/CV</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzlgvv\" data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2120\">Passport-Size Photographs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uq6gua\" data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2148\">Valid Government ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1csv18o\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2192\">Work Experience Documents (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"374\">Candidates seeking admission to the Master of Business Administration (MBA) program must meet the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for graduates who wish to develop advanced knowledge in business management, leadership, finance, marketing, human resources, operations, entrepreneurship, and strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"410\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m7l1a7\" data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"511\">Candidates must have completed a <strong data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"481\">Bachelor\'s Degree (Graduation)</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2sght\" data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"589\">Graduates from any academic discipline are eligible to apply for admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bg1blm\" data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"760\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"667\">appearing for their final-year graduation examinations</strong> may also apply, subject to meeting the admission requirements after completing their degree.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mjsmbd\" data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"896\">Candidates who have completed their graduation through recognized regular, distance, or online learning modes are generally eligible.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"17\" data-end=\"531\">he Master of Business Administration (MBA) program is designed to develop managerial, leadership, analytical, and strategic decision-making skills. The curriculum covers key areas of business management, including finance, marketing, human resources, operations, entrepreneurship, analytics, and business strategy. Through industry projects, research-based learning, and specialization-focused electives, students gain practical knowledge required for leadership roles in today\'s competitive business environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"536\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zv7cy9\" data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"587\">Year 1: Management Foundations &amp; Core Business</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"744\">The first year focuses on building a strong foundation in management principles, business functions, communication, finance, and organizational leadership.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q61\" data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"760\">Semester 1</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"813\">Management Processes &amp; Organisational Behavior</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"978\">This subject introduces management functions and explores individual and group behavior within organizations, leadership styles, motivation, and workplace dynamics.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1036\">Financial Accounting, Reporting and Analysis (FARA)</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1163\">Students learn accounting principles, financial statement preparation, financial reporting, and business performance analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1209\">Economic Analysis for Business Decision</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1342\">The course focuses on economic concepts and their application in managerial decision-making, business planning, and market analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1394\">Quantitative Techniques for Business Decision</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1508\">Students develop analytical and quantitative skills used for business forecasting, planning, and problem-solving.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1539\">Managerial Communication</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1647\">This paper enhances business communication, presentation, negotiation, and professional interaction skills.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1689\">Governance, Ethics &amp; Sustainability</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1818\">The subject covers corporate governance, ethical business practices, sustainability principles, and responsible decision-making.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1823\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q62\" data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1839\">Semester 2</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1866\">Marketing Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1983\">Students learn marketing concepts, consumer behavior, branding, market research, and marketing strategy development.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2015\">Human Resource Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2132\">The course focuses on recruitment, performance management, employee engagement, training, and workforce development.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2164\">Business Research Methods</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2287\">Students gain knowledge of research design, data collection, analysis techniques, and business problem-solving approaches.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2331\">Corporate Finance &amp; Financial Markets</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2449\">This subject introduces financial management, investment decisions, capital markets, and financial planning concepts.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2493\">Technology and Analytics for Business</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2606\">The course explores the use of technology, business analytics, and data-driven decision-making in organizations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2638\">Legal Aspects in Business</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2754\">Students learn business laws, corporate regulations, contracts, and legal frameworks governing business operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gcjx11\" data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2784\">Year 1 Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"3038\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s9syic\" data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2836\">Strong understanding of core business functions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wvfl5o\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2902\">Knowledge of finance, marketing, and human resource management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"111phdn\" data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2967\">Development of managerial communication and leadership skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1klnoxn\" data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3038\">Ability to apply analytical and business decision-making techniques.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3040\" data-end=\"3043\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cst7lb\" data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3099\">Year 2: Specialisation Capstone &amp; Industry Projects</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3260\">The second year focuses on strategic management, entrepreneurship, specialization electives, and practical business applications through projects and research.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q63\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3276\">Semester 3</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3320\">Entrepreneurship and Startup Ideation</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3431\">This subject focuses on innovation, business planning, startup development, and entrepreneurial opportunities.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3474\">Production and Operations Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3594\">Students learn how organizations manage production systems, supply chains, quality control, and operational efficiency.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3626\">Cross Functional Elective</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3749\">This elective allows students to gain knowledge beyond their chosen specialization and broaden their business perspective.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3751\" data-end=\"3780\">Specialization Electives</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3782\" data-end=\"3908\"><strong data-start=\"3782\" data-end=\"3809\">AI in Consumer Behavior</strong><br data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3812\">Explores how artificial intelligence helps analyze customer preferences and purchasing patterns.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"4044\"><strong data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"3951\">AI in Sales &amp; Distribution Management</strong><br data-start=\"3951\" data-end=\"3954\">Focuses on AI-driven sales forecasting, customer targeting, and distribution optimization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4174\"><strong data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4079\">AI in International Marketing</strong><br data-start=\"4079\" data-end=\"4082\">Introduces AI applications in global marketing strategies and international market analysis.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4179\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q64\" data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4195\">Semester 4</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4222\">Strategic Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4223\" data-end=\"4358\">This core subject focuses on long-term business planning, competitive strategies, organizational growth, and strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4360\" data-end=\"4388\">Research Based Learning</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4389\" data-end=\"4516\">Students undertake research-oriented projects to solve real-world business challenges using analytical and management concepts.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4548\">Cross Functional Elective</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4549\" data-end=\"4630\">Provides interdisciplinary business knowledge to enhance managerial capabilities.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4632\" data-end=\"4661\">Specialization Electives</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4783\"><strong data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4696\">AI in Service Marketing &amp; CRM</strong><br data-start=\"4696\" data-end=\"4699\">Examines the use of AI in customer relationship management and service optimization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4785\" data-end=\"4909\"><strong data-start=\"4785\" data-end=\"4811\">AI in Brand Management</strong><br data-start=\"4811\" data-end=\"4814\">Focuses on AI-powered branding strategies, customer engagement, and brand performance analysis.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4911\" data-end=\"5056\"><strong data-start=\"4911\" data-end=\"4938\">AI in Digital Marketing</strong><br data-start=\"4938\" data-end=\"4941\">Introduces artificial intelligence applications in digital campaigns, customer targeting, and marketing automation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uumoxi\" data-start=\"5058\" data-end=\"5086\">Year 2 Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5088\" data-end=\"5387\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b7o1sy\" data-start=\"5088\" data-end=\"5155\">Advanced understanding of business strategy and entrepreneurship.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ygi3ie\" data-start=\"5156\" data-end=\"5202\">Exposure to AI-driven business applications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18usese\" data-start=\"5203\" data-end=\"5265\">Practical experience through research and industry projects.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b5r9h2\" data-start=\"5266\" data-end=\"5321\">Enhanced decision-making and leadership capabilities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v1o7ko\" data-start=\"5322\" data-end=\"5387\">Specialization-focused expertise aligned with industry demands.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"428\">The Master of Business Administration (MBA) program is designed to prepare students for leadership and managerial roles across industries. Through industry-focused learning, live projects, case studies, internships, corporate interactions, and career development initiatives, students gain the practical skills and business knowledge required to succeed in today\'s competitive corporate environment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hpuuao\" data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"463\">MBA Placement Statistics 2024</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"691\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"498\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"498\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"487\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Placement Parameter</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"498\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"691\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"565\">\r\n<td data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"554\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"553\">Placement Rate</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"565\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"563\">95%</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"603\">\r\n<td data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"588\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"587\">Average Package</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"603\"><strong data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"601\">₹12 LPA</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"641\">\r\n<td data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"626\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"625\">Highest Package</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"641\"><strong data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"639\">₹40 LPA</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"691\">\r\n<td data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"669\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"668\">Recruiting Companies</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"691\"><strong data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"689\">200+ Companies</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c9shzg\" data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"715\">Placement Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"1046\">The MBA curriculum focuses on developing expertise in business strategy, finance, marketing, human resources, operations, analytics, and leadership. Students benefit from industry-oriented training, business simulations, case study discussions, and real-world projects that enhance their employability and professional readiness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1404\">With a <strong data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1077\">95% placement rate</strong>, MBA graduates have secured opportunities with leading multinational corporations, Fortune 500 companies, consulting firms, financial institutions, technology companies, and fast-growing startups. The program\'s strong industry connections and placement support help students access diverse career opportunities across sectors.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"32\",\"33\",\"34\",\"37\",\"38\"]', 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(423, 78, '15a1b1dc-4623-4f7b-a9c4-b372497491f7', 'ecc46421-3a2c-4e62-8da5-417a843540a4', 77, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 02:45:51', '2026-06-17 00:28:17', '<p data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"387\">The admission process for the Master of Commerce (M.Com) program is designed to be simple and convenient for graduates seeking advanced education in accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, and business management. The process includes application submission, evaluation, counselling, and enrollment to help students begin their postgraduate journey smoothly.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dlwfyc\" data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"413\">Step 1: Apply Online</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"664\">Candidates must complete the online application form by providing their personal, academic, and contact details. Applicants are required to upload their bachelor\'s degree transcripts and other supporting documents as part of the application process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hfpahz\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"722\">Step 2: Merit-Based Selection / Entrance Examination</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"979\">Applications are evaluated based on graduation performance, with a minimum qualifying percentage as prescribed by the university. Candidates may also be considered through the university\'s entrance examination process, depending on the admission criteria.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lh8jsy\" data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1012\">Step 3: Counselling Session</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1250\">Shortlisted candidates participate in a personalized counselling session. During this stage, academic advisors help students understand the program structure, specialization opportunities, career prospects, and future academic pathways.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iecth8\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1276\">Step 4: Offer Letter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1493\">Candidates who successfully complete the selection process receive an admission offer letter. The letter contains important details regarding admission status, specialization allocation, and enrollment instructions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y0veyg\" data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1539\">Step 5: Enrollment and Seat Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1773\">To confirm admission, students must complete the fee payment process and submit all required documents for verification. Once the verification process is completed successfully, the seat is officially confirmed in the M.Com program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ym8t36\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1810\">Documents Required for Admission</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"2066\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1km3usw\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1857\">Bachelor\'s Degree Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"377nvn\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1894\">Class 10 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3y2t5t\" data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1931\">Class 12 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzlgvv\" data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1959\">Passport-Size Photographs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uq6gua\" data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1987\">Valid Government ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"122irsi\" data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2027\">Migration Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2066\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"338\">Candidates seeking admission to the Master of Commerce (M.Com) program must meet the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for graduates who wish to develop advanced knowledge in accounting, finance, taxation, banking, business management, economics, and commerce-related disciplines.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"374\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iqdubq\" data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"462\">Candidates must have completed a <strong data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"432\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qoemis\" data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"542\">Graduates from any recognized discipline are eligible to apply for admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jrn0qd\" data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"710\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"627\">appearing for their final-year bachelor\'s degree examinations</strong> may also apply, subject to fulfilling the admission requirements after graduation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8w43e2\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"853\">Candidates who have completed their qualifying degree through recognized regular, distance, or online learning modes are generally eligible.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"469\">The Master of Commerce (M.Com) program is designed to provide advanced knowledge in accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, business law, and financial management. The curriculum combines core commerce concepts with modern technologies such as AI-driven financial analysis and intelligent auditing systems, helping students develop practical and industry-relevant skills for careers in finance, banking, taxation, auditing, and corporate management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"474\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"i485v4\" data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"524\">Year 1: Financial Foundations &amp; Core Commerce</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"643\">The first year focuses on building a strong foundation in accounting, economics, finance, taxation, and business law.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q61\" data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"659\">Semester 1</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"704\">Financial Accounting and Reporting &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"827\">Introduces accounting principles, financial statement preparation, and reporting standards used in business organizations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"856\">Business Economics &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"956\">Focuses on economic concepts and their application in business decision-making and market analysis.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"979\">Business Law &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1077\">Provides knowledge of legal principles, contracts, and regulations governing business activities.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1105\">Management Accounting</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1200\">Covers budgeting, cost control, financial planning, and managerial decision-making techniques.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1227\">Business Finance &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1323\">Introduces financial management concepts, capital allocation, and business financing decisions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1328\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q62\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1344\">Semester 2</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1390\">Financial Accounting and Reporting &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1498\">Builds advanced knowledge of financial reporting, accounting standards, and corporate accounting practices.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1545\">Not-for-Profit &amp; Governmental Accounting</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1631\">Focuses on accounting systems used by government bodies and non-profit organizations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1661\">Business Economics &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1761\">Examines advanced economic theories and their impact on business operations and strategic planning.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1789\">Business Finance &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1872\">Explores investment decisions, risk management, and financial planning techniques.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1899\">Federal Taxation &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1977\">Introduces taxation principles, tax regulations, and compliance requirements.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"1996\">Auditing &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2092\">Provides foundational knowledge of auditing procedures, internal controls, and audit standards.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gcjx11\" data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2122\">Year 1 Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2341\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"esiti\" data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2178\">Understanding of accounting and financial reporting.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1au6q4f\" data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2229\">Knowledge of taxation and auditing fundamentals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3yidts\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2284\">Strong foundation in business finance and economics.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5ons9p\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2341\">Awareness of legal and regulatory business frameworks.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2346\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qyxwfk\" data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2402\">Year 2: Specialisation Capstone &amp; Advanced Commerce</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2520\">The second year focuses on advanced accounting, taxation, auditing, financial analysis, and research-based learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q63\" data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2536\">Semester 3</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2556\">Auditing &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2636\">Covers advanced auditing techniques, audit planning, and compliance procedures.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2669\">Management Accounting &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2762\">Focuses on strategic cost management, performance evaluation, and financial decision-making.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2802\">Advanced Financial Accounting &ndash; I</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2896\">Introduces complex accounting concepts, corporate accounts, and advanced financial reporting.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2924\">Federal Taxation &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"3005\">Explores advanced taxation regulations, tax planning, and compliance management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3034\">Business Finance &ndash; III</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3123\">Focuses on corporate finance, investment management, and financial strategy development.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3196\">Elective: AI in Financial Reporting / Intelligent Auditing Systems</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3304\">Introduces artificial intelligence applications in accounting, auditing, and financial reporting processes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3309\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q64\" data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3325\">Semester 4</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3327\" data-end=\"3349\">Business Law &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3441\">Provides advanced knowledge of corporate laws, legal compliance, and governance frameworks.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3482\">Advanced Financial Accounting &ndash; II</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3570\">Focuses on advanced accounting standards, financial analysis, and reporting techniques.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3591\">Auditing &ndash; III</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3671\">Examines specialized auditing practices, risk assessment, and audit management.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3700\">Federal Taxation &ndash; III</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3777\">Covers advanced tax planning, corporate taxation, and regulatory compliance.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3813\">Research Project &amp; Viva (RBL)</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3927\">Students undertake a research project to apply commerce concepts to real-world business and financial challenges.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3929\" data-end=\"4001\">Elective: AI-Driven Investment Analysis / Automated Risk Management</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4098\">Explores AI-powered financial analysis, investment decision-making, and risk management systems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uumoxi\" data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4128\">Year 2 Learning Outcomes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4414\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t5jva1\" data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4189\">Advanced expertise in accounting, auditing, and taxation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hi1j8z\" data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4249\">Understanding of AI applications in finance and commerce.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ogtosp\" data-start=\"4250\" data-end=\"4299\">Strong financial analysis and reporting skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zylfku\" data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4353\">Practical exposure through research-based projects.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ye93rw\" data-start=\"4354\" data-end=\"4414\">Industry-ready knowledge for commerce and finance careers.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"439\">The Master of Commerce (M.Com) program is designed to prepare students for successful careers in accounting, finance, taxation, auditing, banking, investment management, and corporate administration. Through industry-oriented learning, practical projects, internships, and professional mentoring, students develop the technical and analytical skills required by leading organizations in the financial sector.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4gy3os\" data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"476\">M.Com Placement Statistics 2024</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"511\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"511\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"500\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Placement Parameter</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"511\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"578\">\r\n<td data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"567\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"566\">Placement Rate</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"578\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"576\">92%</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"616\">\r\n<td data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"601\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"600\">Average Package</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"616\"><strong data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"614\">₹10 LPA</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"654\">\r\n<td data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"639\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"638\">Highest Package</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"654\"><strong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"652\">₹32 LPA</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<td data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"682\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"681\">Recruiting Companies</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"704\"><strong data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"702\">200+ Companies</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c9shzg\" data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"728\">Placement Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"1044\">The M.Com curriculum combines advanced knowledge of accounting, auditing, taxation, finance, and business management with practical industry exposure. Students gain hands-on experience through case studies, research projects, internships, and financial analysis exercises that enhance their professional readiness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1387\">With a <strong data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1075\">92% placement rate</strong>, graduates have secured opportunities in leading financial institutions, accounting firms, banking organizations, consulting companies, multinational corporations, and fintech enterprises. The program equips students with the expertise required to meet the growing demand for finance and commerce professionals.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(424, 79, 'a8e52fda-dd0d-42a1-8153-4a4c8729dbf1', '6d0176e3-00d3-4a49-8675-eca65508b38a', 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 03:06:09', '2026-05-29 03:25:57', '<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"314\">The admission process for the BBA program is simple, transparent, and designed to help students complete their enrollment smoothly. From registration to final admission confirmation, each step can be completed online, making the process convenient for applicants from different locations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1443chv\" data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"357\">Step 1: Complete the Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"556\">Begin your admission journey by accessing the university\'s registration portal. Fill in the application form with accurate personal, academic, and contact details to initiate the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d5cu1m\" data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"594\">Step 2: Pay the Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"796\">After completing the application form, candidates must pay the <strong data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"686\">₹1,000 registration fee</strong>. The registration fee enables the university to process the application and verify the submitted information.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pva3u7\" data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"830\">Step 3: Pay the Academic Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"1060\">Once registered, applicants are required to pay the academic fee for the <strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"956\">first semester, first year, or the full program</strong>, depending on the selected payment plan. This step helps secure the application for further processing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cv7vsc\" data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1095\">Step 4: Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1324\">Candidates must upload all required documents, including academic certificates, identity proof, photographs, and other mandatory records. The university reviews these documents to verify eligibility and academic qualifications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1azb1\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1360\">Step 5: Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1592\">After successful document verification and fee payment, the university confirms the admission. Students receive confirmation of enrollment and can proceed with the next steps related to academic onboarding and course commencement.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ym8t36\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1629\">Documents Required for Admission</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1839\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"377nvn\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1667\">Class 10 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3y2t5t\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1704\">Class 12 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzlgvv\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1732\">Passport-Size Photographs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uq6gua\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1760\">Valid Government ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"122irsi\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1800\">Migration Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1839\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"328\">Candidates seeking admission to the Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) program must fulfill the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for students who aspire to build careers in management, marketing, finance, human resources, entrepreneurship, and business leadership.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"364\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"960\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kcmptd\" data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"493\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"444\">Class 12 (10+2) or an equivalent examination</strong> from a recognized Board, Council, or University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlhfu7\" data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"572\">Students from <strong data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"541\">Science, Commerce, and Arts</strong> streams are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tfysye\" data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"729\">Candidates who are <strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"633\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> can also apply, subject to meeting the admission requirements after the declaration of results.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"htkzea\" data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"832\">Applicants must have completed their qualifying education from a recognized educational institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tv8xom\" data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"960\"><strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"893\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling) candidates</strong> are also eligible to apply as per university admission guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"374\">The BBA program offers flexible fee payment options for both Indian and international students. Learners can choose between semester-wise payments, annual payments with concessions, or a one-time payment option that provides the maximum fee benefit. This flexibility allows students to select a payment plan that best suits their financial preferences.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g89msy\" data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"430\">BBA Fee Structure for Indian and Foreign Nationals</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"841\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"487\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"487\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"447\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fee Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"466\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Nationals</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"487\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foreign Nationals</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"841\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"599\">\r\n<td data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"566\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"565\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"582\"><strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"581\">₹1,32,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"599\"><strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"597\">₹2,64,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"679\">\r\n<td data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"632\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"631\">Semester Fee Payment Plan</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"655\">₹22,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"679\">₹44,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"766\">\r\n<td data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"727\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"726\">Annual Fee Payment Plan (10% Concession)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"746\">₹39,600 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"766\">₹79,200 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"841\">\r\n<td data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"816\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"815\">One-Time Fee Payment Plan (15% Concession)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"828\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,12,200</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"841\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,24,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c7isgb\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"862\">Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"892\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"892\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"882\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"892\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"967\">\r\n<td data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"944\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"943\">Indian Learners</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"967\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,500 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\n<td data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"997\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"996\">International Learners</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1020\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fym0om\" data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1048\">Fee Structure Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1347\">The BBA fee structure is designed to provide affordability and convenience through multiple payment options. Students opting for the annual payment plan can avail a <strong data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1233\">10% concession</strong>, while those choosing the one-time payment option can benefit from a <strong data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1321\">15% concession</strong> on the total program fee.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1676\">In addition to tuition fees, students are required to pay the prescribed examination fee each semester. The program provides value through industry-focused curriculum, practical learning opportunities, skill development initiatives, and career-oriented training designed to prepare students for business and management careers.</p>', NULL, '<p data-start=\"17\" data-end=\"435\">The Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) program is designed to provide students with a strong foundation in business management, finance, marketing, human resources, entrepreneurship, analytics, and strategic decision-making. The curriculum combines theoretical learning with practical business applications, helping students develop managerial, analytical, and leadership skills required in the corporate world.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"440\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9m\" data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"455\">Semester 1</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"o7lcx4\" data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"487\">Fundamentals of Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"589\">Introduces the basic principles of management, planning, organizing, leadership, and decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t4kb5t\" data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"614\">Business Accounting</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"714\">Provides knowledge of accounting concepts, financial records, and preparation of business accounts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"izonay\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"732\">Business Law</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"819\">Focuses on legal principles, contracts, and regulations governing business operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16zcub8\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"853\">Entrepreneurship Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"949\">Develops entrepreneurial skills, business planning abilities, and innovation-oriented thinking.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uc6im8\" data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"977\">Business Communication</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1054\">Enhances professional communication, presentation, and interpersonal skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7e8j7u\" data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1081\">Environmental Science</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1157\">Introduces environmental sustainability and responsible business practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1br7cmu\" data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1173\">Elective 1</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1246\">Students can choose a subject based on their interests and career goals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9l\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1266\">Semester 2</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gaaurx\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1292\">Managerial Economics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1372\">Focuses on economic concepts and their application in business decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6dx2we\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1410\">Statistics for Business Decision</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1488\">Introduces statistical techniques used for business analysis and forecasting.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pwcs64\" data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1517\">Organizational Behavior</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1592\">Studies employee behavior, leadership, motivation, and workplace dynamics.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nmnkqo\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1623\">Human Resource Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1716\">Provides knowledge of recruitment, training, performance management, and employee relations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w1fi1a\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1745\">Principles of Marketing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1833\">Covers marketing fundamentals, consumer behavior, branding, and promotional strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hzra7q\" data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1857\">Business Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1946\">Introduces data analysis techniques and business intelligence tools for decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1br7cmt\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1962\">Elective 2</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2031\">Allows students to explore specialized areas of business management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2036\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9k\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2051\">Semester 3</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xpizlf\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2084\">Macroeconomics for Managers</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2169\">Focuses on economic policies, inflation, economic growth, and business implications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1at33hx\" data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2195\">Business Environment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2280\">Examines economic, political, legal, and technological factors affecting businesses.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1q7ieqw\" data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2312\">System Analysis and Design</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2404\">Introduces information systems, business process analysis, and system development concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sv6wvd\" data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2433\">Business Ethics and CSR</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2520\">Focuses on ethical business practices and corporate social responsibility initiatives.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mbepn4\" data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2566\">Business Policy and Strategic Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2651\">Provides knowledge of business strategy formulation and competitive decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"99hsiv\" data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2680\">Elective 3 &amp; Elective 4</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2759\">Students can select specialization-oriented subjects based on their interests.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2764\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9r\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2779\">Semester 4</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bsf5hx\" data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2810\">Business Research Methods</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2899\">Introduces research techniques, data collection, analysis, and business problem-solving.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l8ju8p\" data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"2924\">Operations Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"3001\">Focuses on quantitative methods used for business planning and optimization.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nmp4hf\" data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3017\">E-Commerce</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3111\">Provides knowledge of online business models, digital transactions, and e-commerce platforms.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w6b8b\" data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3137\">Cyber Crimes and Law</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3215\">Introduces cyber security concepts, digital laws, and cybercrime regulations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"68mke2\" data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3243\">International Business</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3327\">Examines global trade, international markets, and cross-border business operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"53ctb7\" data-start=\"3329\" data-end=\"3356\">Elective 5 &amp; Elective 6</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3426\">Offers additional specialization and skill development opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3431\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9q\" data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3446\">Semester 5</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wd8pb8\" data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3475\">Quantitative Techniques</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3554\">Focuses on analytical and mathematical tools used in business decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1spyeko\" data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3595\">Production and Operation Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3680\">Introduces production planning, quality control, and operations management concepts.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gu4o2\" data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3720\">Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3799\">Provides knowledge of integrated business management systems and ERP software.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ri4z2y\" data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3829\">Total Quality Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3902\">Focuses on quality improvement techniques and organizational excellence.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18xsw0w\" data-start=\"3904\" data-end=\"3926\">Project Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3927\" data-end=\"3999\">Introduces project planning, execution, monitoring, and risk management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ummywf\" data-start=\"4001\" data-end=\"4028\">Elective 7 &amp; Elective 8</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4029\" data-end=\"4100\">Allows students to strengthen expertise in chosen specialization areas.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4105\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"narw9p\" data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4120\">Semester 6</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hl52mi\" data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4142\">Research Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4143\" data-end=\"4274\">Students undertake a practical research project to apply business concepts and analytical skills to real-world business challenges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xp9e3f\" data-start=\"4276\" data-end=\"4304\">Corporate Tax Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4305\" data-end=\"4387\">Provides knowledge of corporate taxation, tax planning, and regulatory compliance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nxjemt\" data-start=\"4389\" data-end=\"4412\">Corporate Readiness</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4413\" data-end=\"4521\">Focuses on employability skills, interview preparation, professional communication, and workplace readiness.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ehrqhk\" data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"4551\">Elective 9 &amp; Elective 10</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4638\">Advanced elective subjects designed to support career-focused specialization learning.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 132000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(425, 79, 'a8e52fda-dd0d-42a1-8153-4a4c8729dbf1', '6d0176e3-00d3-4a49-8675-eca65508b38a', 39, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 03:42:00', '2026-05-29 03:42:00', '<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"315\">The admission process for the Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is simple and fully online, allowing students to complete their application and enrollment from anywhere. The process is designed to ensure a smooth admission experience, from registration to final confirmation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1443chv\" data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"358\">Step 1: Complete the Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"575\">Begin by locating the university\'s registration portal and filling out the online application form. Applicants must provide their personal, academic, and contact details accurately to initiate the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d5cu1m\" data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"613\">Step 2: Pay the Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"788\">After submitting the application form, candidates are required to pay the <strong data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"716\">₹1,000 registration fee</strong>. This fee enables the university to process and review the application.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pva3u7\" data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"822\">Step 3: Pay the Academic Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"1025\">Applicants must pay the academic fee for the <strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"924\">first semester, first year, or the complete program</strong>, depending on the selected payment option. This step moves the application forward for verification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cv7vsc\" data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1060\">Step 4: Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1269\">Students need to upload all mandatory documents, including academic certificates, photographs, and identification proof. The university reviews these documents to verify eligibility and academic credentials.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1azb1\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1305\">Step 5: Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1511\">Once the documents are successfully verified and all admission requirements are fulfilled, the university confirms the admission. Students receive confirmation and can proceed with their academic journey.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ym8t36\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1548\">Documents Required for Admission</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1758\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"377nvn\" data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1586\">Class 10 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3y2t5t\" data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1623\">Class 12 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzlgvv\" data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1651\">Passport-Size Photographs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uq6gua\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1679\">Valid Government ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"122irsi\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1719\">Migration Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1758\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"345\">Candidates seeking admission to the Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program must meet the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for students who wish to build a career in software development, information technology, web development, data analytics, and other technology-driven fields.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"381\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kcmptd\" data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"510\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"461\">Class 12 (10+2) or an equivalent examination</strong> from a recognized Board, Council, or University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlhfu7\" data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"589\">Students from <strong data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"558\">Science, Commerce, and Arts</strong> streams are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1notbnj\" data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"749\">Candidates who are <strong data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"650\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> can also apply, subject to fulfilling the admission requirements after the declaration of results.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lfp7n9\" data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"840\">Applicants must have completed their qualifying education from a recognized institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yxs885\" data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"953\"><strong data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"901\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling) candidates</strong> are also eligible to apply as per university norms.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"404\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program offers a flexible and affordable fee structure for both Indian and international students. Multiple payment options are available, allowing students to choose a plan that best suits their financial needs. Students can pay semester-wise, annually with a concession, or opt for a one-time payment to receive the maximum fee benefit.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h348oj\" data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"460\">BCA Fee Structure for Indian and Foreign Nationals</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"871\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"517\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"517\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"477\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fee Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"496\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Nationals</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"517\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foreign Nationals</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"871\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"629\">\r\n<td data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"596\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"595\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"612\"><strong data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"611\">₹1,32,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"629\"><strong data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"627\">₹2,64,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"709\">\r\n<td data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"662\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"661\">Semester Fee Payment Plan</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"685\">₹22,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"709\">₹44,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"796\">\r\n<td data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"757\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"756\">Annual Fee Payment Plan (10% Concession)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"776\">₹39,600 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"796\">₹79,200 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"871\">\r\n<td data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"846\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"845\">One-Time Fee Payment Plan (15% Concession)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"858\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,12,200</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"871\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,24,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fym0om\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"899\">Fee Structure Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"1213\">The BCA program provides students with the flexibility to manage their educational expenses through different payment plans. Students choosing the <strong data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1073\">annual payment option</strong> can avail a <strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1104\">10% concession</strong>, while those opting for the <strong data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1158\">one-time payment plan</strong> receive a <strong data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1187\">15% concession</strong> on the total program fee.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1533\">The curriculum is designed to provide practical knowledge in programming, software development, databases, networking, web technologies, and emerging IT fields. The fee structure reflects the value of industry-relevant education, hands-on learning, and career-oriented skill development offered throughout the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pq3oxw\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1573\">&nbsp;</h3>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"17\" data-end=\"411\">The Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) program is designed to provide students with a strong foundation in programming, software development, databases, networking, web technologies, and emerging IT concepts. The curriculum combines theoretical knowledge with practical laboratory sessions and project-based learning to prepare students for careers in the technology and software industry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q61\" data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"427\">Semester 1</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"1144\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"454\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"454\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"439\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"454\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"1144\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"592\">\r\n<td data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"501\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Basic Mathematics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"592\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develops mathematical and analytical skills required for computing and problem-solving.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"681\">\r\n<td data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"612\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fundamental of C</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"681\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduces programming concepts using the C programming language.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"775\">\r\n<td data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"702\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Basic Electronics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"775\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers the fundamentals of electronic components and digital systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<td data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"813\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Principle of Programming Languages</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"885\" data-col-size=\"md\">Provides an overview of programming language concepts and paradigms.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"965\">\r\n<td data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"910\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fundamentals of C Lab</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"965\" data-col-size=\"md\">Practical implementation of C programming concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1073\">\r\n<td data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"995\" data-col-size=\"sm\">PC Software and Automation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1073\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduces computer applications, office tools, and automation techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1144\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1087\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1144\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized subject chosen based on student interest.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q62\" data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1165\">Semester 2</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1772\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1177\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1192\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1772\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1258\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Object Oriented Programming with C++</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1316\">Covers object-oriented programming concepts using C++.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1415\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1350\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Structures and Algorithms</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1415\">Introduces data organization and algorithm design techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1517\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1448\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Management Information System</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1517\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focuses on information systems used for business decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1594\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1537\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OOP with C++ Lab</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1594\" data-col-size=\"md\">Practical implementation of C++ programming concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1617\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Structures Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1673\">Hands-on training in data structures and algorithms.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1772\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1713\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soft Skill and Professional Aptitude</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1772\">Develops communication, teamwork, and workplace skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1777\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q63\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1793\">Semester 3</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"2385\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1820\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1820\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1805\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1820\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"2385\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1939\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1877\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Database Management Systems</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1939\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers database design, SQL, and data management concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"2035\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1960\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer Networks</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"2035\">Introduces networking principles, protocols, and communication systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2131\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2067\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Internet and Web Application</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2131\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focuses on web technologies and internet-based applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2202\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2143\" data-col-size=\"sm\">DBMS Lab</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2202\" data-col-size=\"md\">Practical training in database creation and management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2291\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2236\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Internet &amp; Web Programming Lab</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2291\" data-col-size=\"md\">Hands-on experience in web application development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2338\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2305\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2338\">Specialized elective subject.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2385\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2352\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2385\">Specialized elective subject.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2390\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q64\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2406\">Semester 4</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2933\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2433\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2433\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2418\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2433\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2933\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2551\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2482\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Programming in Java</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2551\">Introduces Java programming and application development concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2647\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2572\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operating Systems</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2647\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers operating system architecture, processes, and memory management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2757\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2686\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer Graphics and Visualization</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2757\">Focuses on graphics design, visualization, and multimedia concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2852\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer Graphics Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2852\">Practical implementation of graphics and visualization techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2933\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2879\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Programming in Java Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2933\">Hands-on Java programming and project development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2938\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q65\" data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"2954\">Semester 5</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"3459\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2981\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2981\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2966\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"2981\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3459\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3110\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3031\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Software Engineering</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3110\">Introduces software development life cycle and project management concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3111\" data-end=\"3202\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3111\" data-end=\"3138\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Software Engineering Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3202\">Practical application of software engineering methodologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3295\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3224\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Python Programming</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3295\">Covers Python programming for application and software development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3296\" data-end=\"3353\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3296\" data-end=\"3309\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Python Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3309\" data-end=\"3353\">Hands-on training in Python programming.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3459\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3390\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project Formulation and Appraisal</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3459\">Focuses on project planning, analysis, and evaluation techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3464\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q66\" data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3480\">Semester 6</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"4020\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3507\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3507\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3492\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3507\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"4020\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"3625\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"3550\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3550\" data-end=\"3625\">Industry-oriented project demonstrating technical and practical skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3675\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3639\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 9</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3639\" data-end=\"3675\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced specialization subject.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3726\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3690\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 10</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3726\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced specialization subject.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3727\" data-end=\"3824\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3727\" data-end=\"3753\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Knowledge System</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3753\" data-end=\"3824\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduces India\'s traditional knowledge systems and contributions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3825\" data-end=\"3913\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3825\" data-end=\"3850\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Universal Human Values</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3913\">Focuses on ethics, values, and professional responsibility.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"4020\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"3951\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Automation Concepts and Techniques</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3951\" data-end=\"4020\">Covers automation technologies and modern computing applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 132000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(426, 79, 'a8e52fda-dd0d-42a1-8153-4a4c8729dbf1', '6d0176e3-00d3-4a49-8675-eca65508b38a', 52, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 03:53:30', '2026-05-29 03:53:30', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"335\">The admission process for the Bachelor of Arts (B.A.) program is designed to be simple, convenient, and fully online. Students can complete the entire admission procedure from registration to enrollment through a few easy steps. The process ensures quick application review and smooth admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1443chv\" data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"378\">Step 1: Complete the Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"585\">Begin by accessing the university\'s registration portal and filling out the online application form. Applicants must provide accurate personal, academic, and contact details to start the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d5cu1m\" data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"623\">Step 2: Pay the Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"812\">After completing the application form, candidates are required to pay the <strong data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"726\">₹1,000 registration fee</strong>. This fee is necessary for processing the application and initiating document review.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pva3u7\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"846\">Step 3: Pay the Academic Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"1052\">Applicants must pay the academic fee for the <strong data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"948\">first semester, first year, or the complete program</strong>, depending on the selected payment plan. This step helps secure the application for further processing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cv7vsc\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1087\">Step 4: Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1305\">Candidates are required to upload all mandatory documents, including academic certificates, photographs, and identity proof. The university verifies these documents to confirm eligibility and academic qualifications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1azb1\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1341\">Step 5: Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1556\">Once the documents are successfully verified and all admission requirements are fulfilled, the university confirms the admission. Students receive official confirmation and can proceed with their academic journey.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ym8t36\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1593\">Documents Required for Admission</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1803\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"377nvn\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1631\">Class 10 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3y2t5t\" data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1668\">Class 12 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzlgvv\" data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1696\">Passport-Size Photographs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uq6gua\" data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1724\">Valid Government ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"122irsi\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1764\">Migration Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1803\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"337\">Candidates seeking admission to the Bachelor of Arts (B.A.) program must meet the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for students who wish to build knowledge in humanities, social sciences, communication, public administration, media, education, and other interdisciplinary fields.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"373\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"950\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kcmptd\" data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"502\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"453\">Class 12 (10+2) or an equivalent examination</strong> from a recognized Board, Council, or University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlhfu7\" data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"581\">Students from <strong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"550\">Science, Commerce, and Arts</strong> streams are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1notbnj\" data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"741\">Candidates who are <strong data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"642\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> can also apply, subject to fulfilling the admission requirements after the declaration of results.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lfp7n9\" data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"832\">Applicants must have completed their qualifying education from a recognized institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ipgldb\" data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"950\"><strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"893\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling) candidates</strong> are also eligible to apply as per university guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"436\">The Bachelor of Arts (B.A.) program offers an affordable and flexible fee structure for both Indian and international students. Students can choose from semester-wise, annual, or one-time payment plans based on their convenience. The program is designed to provide quality education in humanities, social sciences, communication, and interdisciplinary studies while ensuring cost-effective learning opportunities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q6wwnk\" data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"493\">B.A. Fee Structure for Indian and Foreign Nationals</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" style=\"width: 100%;\" data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"550\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"550\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" style=\"width: 46.4897%;\" data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"510\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fee Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" style=\"width: 26.7123%;\" data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"529\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Nationals</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" style=\"width: 26.7123%;\" data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"550\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foreign Nationals</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"660\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.4897%;\" data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"629\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"628\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.7123%;\" data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"643\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"642\">₹72,000</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.7123%;\" data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"660\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"658\">₹1,44,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"740\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.4897%;\" data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"693\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"692\">Semester Fee Payment Plan</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.7123%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"716\">₹12,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.7123%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"740\">₹24,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"827\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.4897%;\" data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"788\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"787\">Annual Fee Payment Plan (10% Concession)</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.7123%;\" data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"807\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹21,600 per year</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.7123%;\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"827\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹43,200 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.4897%;\" data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"877\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"876\">One-Time Fee Payment Plan (15% Concession)</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.7123%;\" data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"887\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹61,200</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.7123%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"900\">₹1,22,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c7isgb\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"921\">Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"950\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"964\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1051\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1028\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1027\">Indian Learners</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1051\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,500 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1081\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1080\">International Learners</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1104\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fym0om\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1132\">Fee Structure Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1406\">The B.A. fee structure is designed to provide financial flexibility and affordability. Students who choose the annual payment option can avail a <strong data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1297\">10% concession</strong>, while those opting for the one-time payment plan can receive a <strong data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1380\">15% concession</strong> on the total program fee.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1727\">Apart from the tuition fee, students are required to pay the applicable examination fee each semester. The program offers excellent value through a comprehensive curriculum, skill development opportunities, and career-oriented learning designed to prepare students for higher education and diverse professional careers.</p>', 'Medium', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"457\">The Bachelor of Arts (B.A.) program is designed to provide students with a broad understanding of humanities, social sciences, communication, technology, and professional skills. The curriculum combines academic knowledge with practical learning, helping students develop critical thinking, communication abilities, creativity, and career-oriented competencies. Students can also choose electives based on their interests and career goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q61\" data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"473\">Semester 1</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"956\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"500\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"500\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"485\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"500\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"956\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"623\">\r\n<td data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"541\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"623\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develops reading, writing, comprehension, and communication skills in English.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<td data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"653\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Microsoft Office Practices</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"732\">Introduces MS Word, Excel, PowerPoint, and other office productivity tools.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"810\">\r\n<td data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"746\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"810\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject chosen according to the student\'s academic interest.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<td data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"825\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"885\" data-col-size=\"md\">Provides specialized knowledge in a selected discipline.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"956\">\r\n<td data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"901\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective III</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"956\" data-col-size=\"md\">Enhances subject-specific understanding and skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"961\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q62\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"977\">Semester 2</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1414\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"989\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1004\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1414\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1110\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1046\" data-col-size=\"sm\">English &ndash; II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1110\">Builds advanced language, writing, and communication skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1202\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1132\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Visual Design Tool</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1202\">Introduces design software and visual content creation techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1216\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1278\">Offers further specialization in the chosen area of study.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1348\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1293\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1348\" data-col-size=\"md\">Expands knowledge in selected academic disciplines.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1414\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1364\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective III</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1414\" data-col-size=\"md\">Supports academic and career-focused learning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1419\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q63\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1435\">Semester 3</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1890\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1462\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1462\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1447\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1462\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1890\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1594\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1512\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Communication Skills</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1594\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focuses on professional communication, presentation, and interpersonal skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1701\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1626\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entrepreneurship Development</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1701\">Introduces business creation, innovation, and entrepreneurial concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1768\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1715\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1768\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized subject based on student preferences.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1826\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1783\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1826\">Enhances knowledge in the chosen field.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1890\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1842\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1890\">Provides additional academic specialization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1895\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q64\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1911\">Semester 4</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"2375\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1938\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1938\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1923\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1938\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2375\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2067\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1993\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foundation of Mathematics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2067\">Develops quantitative and analytical skills useful across disciplines.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2152\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2093\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Universal Human Values</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2152\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focuses on ethics, values, and responsible citizenship.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2230\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2166\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2230\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject selected according to career and academic interests.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2308\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2245\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2308\">Builds advanced understanding of the chosen specialization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2375\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2324\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective III</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2375\" data-col-size=\"md\">Supports skill development and academic growth.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2380\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q65\" data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2396\">Semester 5</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2783\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2423\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2423\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2408\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2423\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2783\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2553\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2485\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elementary Computer Applications</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2553\">Introduces computer fundamentals and basic digital technologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2660\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2582\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer Applications Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2660\">Provides practical experience in computer applications and software usage.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2720\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2674\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2720\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized subject chosen by the student.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2783\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2735\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2783\" data-col-size=\"md\">Enhances expertise in a selected discipline.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2788\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q66\" data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2804\">Semester 6</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"3296\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2831\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2831\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2816\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2831\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"3296\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2964\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2882\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Environmental Science</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2964\">Provides knowledge of environmental sustainability and conservation practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3077\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"2991\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Knowledge System</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3077\">Introduces India\'s traditional knowledge, culture, and intellectual contributions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3149\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3149\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced subject related to the chosen specialization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3221\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3164\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3164\" data-end=\"3221\">Provides deeper academic and practical understanding.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3296\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3237\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3296\">Supports career-oriented and subject-specific learning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 72000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(427, 79, 'a8e52fda-dd0d-42a1-8153-4a4c8729dbf1', '6d0176e3-00d3-4a49-8675-eca65508b38a', 207, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 04:03:01', '2026-06-17 00:29:18', '<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"459\">The admission process for the Master of Business Administration (MBA) program is designed to be simple, transparent, and completely online. From application submission to final enrollment, candidates can complete every step conveniently while receiving guidance throughout the admission journey. The process ensures that eligible students can secure admission smoothly and begin their management education without unnecessary delays.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1443chv\" data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"502\">Step 1: Complete the Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"803\">The first step is to access the university\'s registration portal and complete the online application form. Applicants must provide accurate personal, academic, and contact information. It is important to carefully review all details before submission to avoid delays during the verification process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d5cu1m\" data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"841\">Step 2: Pay the Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"1070\">After submitting the application form, candidates are required to pay the <strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"944\">₹1,000 registration fee</strong>. Payment of the registration fee confirms the application and allows the university to initiate the admission review process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pva3u7\" data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1104\">Step 3: Pay the Academic Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1404\">Once the application is processed, students need to pay the academic fee for the <strong data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1255\">first semester, first academic year, or the complete MBA program</strong>, depending on the selected payment option. This step helps reserve the candidate\'s place in the program and moves the application to the next stage.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cv7vsc\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1439\">Step 4: Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1713\">Applicants must upload all required documents, including academic certificates, identity proof, photographs, and other supporting documents. The university carefully verifies these records to ensure that candidates meet the eligibility criteria and admission requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1azb1\" data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1749\">Step 5: Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1989\">After successful document verification and fee payment, the university confirms the admission. Students receive official confirmation of enrollment and can proceed with orientation, academic onboarding, and course commencement activities.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"smr8ks\" data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2030\">Documents Required for MBA Admission</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2328\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j8ay68\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2077\">Graduation Marksheet and Degree Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"377nvn\" data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2114\">Class 10 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3y2t5t\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2151\">Class 12 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzlgvv\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2179\">Passport-Size Photographs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uq6gua\" data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2207\">Valid Government ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"122irsi\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2247\">Migration Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2286\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m1zoss\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2328\">Work Experience Documents (if required)</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"336\">Candidates seeking admission to the Master of Business Administration (MBA) program must meet the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for graduates who want to develop advanced skills in management, leadership, finance, marketing, human resources, operations, and business strategy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"372\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"896\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x3tqfn\" data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"475\">Candidates must possess a <strong data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"430\">3-year Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized University or Institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c15dcj\" data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"539\">Graduates from any academic discipline are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18616d0\" data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"703\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"618\">appearing for the final year of their bachelor\'s degree</strong> may also apply, subject to fulfilling the eligibility requirements after graduation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"186u93l\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"775\">The qualifying degree must be obtained from a recognized institution.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"436\">The Master of Business Administration (MBA) program offers flexible fee payment options for both Indian and international students. Students can choose between semester-wise, annual, or one-time payment plans based on their convenience. The fee structure is designed to provide access to industry-oriented management education, leadership development, business analytics, and career-focused learning opportunities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cy9pp9\" data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"492\">MBA Fee Structure for Indian and Foreign Nationals</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"549\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"549\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"509\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fee Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"528\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Nationals</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"549\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foreign Nationals</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"661\">\r\n<td data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"628\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"627\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"644\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"643\">₹1,50,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"661\"><strong data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"659\">₹3,00,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"741\">\r\n<td data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"694\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"693\">Semester Fee Payment Plan</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"717\">₹37,500 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"741\">₹75,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"830\">\r\n<td data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"789\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"788\">Annual Fee Payment Plan (10% Concession)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"808\">₹67,500 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"830\">₹1,35,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<td data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"880\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"879\">One-Time Fee Payment Plan (15% Concession)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"892\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,27,500</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"905\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,55,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c7isgb\" data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"926\">Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"969\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"969\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"955\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"969\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1056\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1033\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1032\">Indian Learners</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1056\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,500 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1086\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1085\">International Learners</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fym0om\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1137\">Fee Structure Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1432\">The MBA fee structure provides multiple payment options to accommodate different financial preferences. Students who opt for the annual payment plan can avail a <strong data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1318\">10% concession</strong>, while those choosing the one-time payment option can benefit from a <strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1406\">15% concession</strong> on the total program fee.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1707\">Apart from tuition fees, students are required to pay the prescribed examination fee each semester. The program offers strong value through industry-relevant coursework, business projects, leadership training, strategic management education, and career development support.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"17\" data-end=\"390\">The Master of Business Administration (MBA) program is designed to develop leadership, managerial, analytical, and strategic decision-making skills. The curriculum covers core areas such as finance, marketing, human resources, operations, entrepreneurship, and business strategy while providing practical exposure through projects, research, and industry-oriented learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q61\" data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"406\">Semester 1</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"1255\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"433\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"433\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"418\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"433\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"1255\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"566\">\r\n<td data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"483\" data-col-size=\"md\">Managerial Economics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"566\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focuses on economic concepts and their application in business decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"677\">\r\n<td data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"605\" data-col-size=\"md\">Quantitative Methods for Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"677\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduces statistical and analytical techniques used in management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"795\">\r\n<td data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"704\" data-col-size=\"md\">Accounting for Managers</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"795\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers financial statements, accounting principles, and managerial accounting concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"902\">\r\n<td data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"824\" data-col-size=\"md\">Legal Aspects of Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"902\" data-col-size=\"md\">Provides knowledge of business laws, contracts, and regulatory frameworks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<td data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"954\" data-col-size=\"md\">Management Concepts and Organizational Behaviour</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1037\" data-col-size=\"md\">Examines management principles, leadership, motivation, and workplace behavior.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1061\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Environment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1149\" data-col-size=\"md\">Studies economic, political, social, and technological factors affecting businesses.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1255\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1175\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1255\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develops professional communication, presentation, and interpersonal skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1260\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q62\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1276\">Semester 2</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"2311\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1303\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1303\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1288\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1303\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"2311\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1439\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1358\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1439\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers recruitment, training, performance management, and employee relations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1543\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1463\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1543\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focuses on financial planning, investment decisions, and capital management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1653\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1567\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1653\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduces marketing strategies, branding, consumer behavior, and market analysis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1770\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1677\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1770\" data-col-size=\"md\">Provides knowledge of research design, data collection, and business analysis techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1876\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1803\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Management Information System</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1876\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explores information systems used for organizational decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"2000\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1913\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Business Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"2000\">Examines global trade, international markets, and cross-border business operations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2103\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2028\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Quality Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2103\">Focuses on quality improvement and organizational excellence practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2198\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2124\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Digital Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2198\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduces online marketing, social media, SEO, and digital campaigns.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2311\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2230\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Innovation &amp; Design Thinking</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2311\">Encourages creative problem-solving and innovation-driven business solutions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2316\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q63\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2332\">Semester 3</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2359\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2359\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2344\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2359\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2479\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2407\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2479\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers project planning, execution, monitoring, and risk management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2595\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2506\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Supply Chain Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2595\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focuses on logistics, procurement, inventory management, and supply chain operations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2696\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2619\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2696\">Introduces business strategy formulation and competitive decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2740\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entrepreneurship &amp; Innovation Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2815\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develops entrepreneurial skills and innovation management capabilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2820\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q64\" data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2836\">Semester 4</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"3352\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2863\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2863\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2848\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2863\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"3352\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2996\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2909\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2996\">Industry-oriented project applying management concepts to real business challenges.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3091\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3019\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Readiness</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3091\">Enhances employability, leadership, interview, and workplace skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3197\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Knowledge System</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3118\" data-end=\"3197\">Introduces India\'s traditional knowledge systems and business perspectives.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3273\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3211\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3273\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced specialization subject based on career interests.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3352\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3287\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 6</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3352\">Specialized elective designed to strengthen domain expertise.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 150000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(428, 79, 'a8e52fda-dd0d-42a1-8153-4a4c8729dbf1', '6d0176e3-00d3-4a49-8675-eca65508b38a', 258, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 04:16:01', '2026-05-29 04:27:26', '<p data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"439\">The admission process for the MBA (Finance) program is designed to be simple, transparent, and completely online. Candidates can complete the entire admission journey, from application submission to final enrollment, through a few straightforward steps. The process ensures a smooth experience for students seeking advanced education in finance, accounting, banking, taxation, and investment management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1443chv\" data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"482\">Step 1: Complete the Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"692\">Begin by accessing the university\'s registration portal and filling out the online application form. Applicants must provide accurate personal, academic, and contact details to initiate the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d5cu1m\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"730\">Step 2: Pay the Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"939\">After submitting the application form, candidates are required to pay the <strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"833\">₹1,000 registration fee</strong>. This one-time fee allows the university to process the application and begin the verification procedure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pva3u7\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"973\">Step 3: Pay the Academic Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1202\">Applicants must pay the academic fee for the <strong data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1084\">first semester, first academic year, or the complete program</strong>, depending on the selected payment option. This step helps secure the applicant\'s place in the MBA (Finance) program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cv7vsc\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1237\">Step 4: Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1468\">Candidates are required to upload all mandatory documents, including educational certificates, identity proof, photographs, and other supporting records. The university reviews and verifies these documents to confirm eligibility.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n1azb1\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1504\">Step 5: Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1731\">Once document verification is successfully completed and all admission requirements are fulfilled, the university confirms the admission. Students receive official enrollment confirmation and can begin their academic journey.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ym8t36\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1768\">Documents Required for Admission</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"2024\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j8ay68\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1815\">Graduation Marksheet and Degree Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"377nvn\" data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1852\">Class 10 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3y2t5t\" data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1889\">Class 12 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzlgvv\" data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1917\">Passport-Size Photographs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uq6gua\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1945\">Valid Government ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"122irsi\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1985\">Migration Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2024\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"339\">Candidates seeking admission to the MBA (Finance) program must meet the prescribed eligibility requirements. The program is designed for graduates who wish to develop expertise in financial management, investment analysis, banking, taxation, corporate finance, and strategic business decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4p31tp\" data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"375\">Basic Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ricveb\" data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"478\">Candidates must possess a <strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"433\">3-Year Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized University or Institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2sght\" data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"556\">Graduates from any academic discipline are eligible to apply for admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jq9i2l\" data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"717\">Students who are <strong data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"635\">appearing for the final year of their bachelor\'s degree</strong> may also apply, subject to meeting the eligibility requirements after graduation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"186u93l\" data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"789\">The qualifying degree must be obtained from a recognized institution.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"441\">The MBA (Finance) program offers flexible payment options for both Indian and international students. The fee structure is designed to provide access to advanced management education combined with finance-focused specialization, industry-oriented learning, and professional certification opportunities. Students can choose semester-wise, annual, or one-time payment plans based on their financial preferences.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"96qff6\" data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"474\">MBA (Finance) Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"891\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"531\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"531\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"491\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fee Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"510\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Nationals</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"531\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foreign Nationals</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"891\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"643\">\r\n<td data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"610\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"609\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"626\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"625\">₹2,40,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"643\"><strong data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"641\">₹4,80,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"725\">\r\n<td data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"676\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"675\">Semester Fee Payment Plan</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"699\">₹60,000 per semester</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"725\">₹1,20,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"816\">\r\n<td data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"773\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"772\">Annual Fee Payment Plan (10% Concession)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"794\">₹1,08,000 per year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"816\">₹2,16,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"891\">\r\n<td data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"866\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"865\">One-Time Fee Payment Plan (15% Concession)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"878\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹2,04,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"891\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,08,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c7isgb\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"912\">Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"941\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"955\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<td data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1020\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1019\">Indian Learners</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1043\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,500 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1073\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1072\">International Learners</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1096\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uebpna\" data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1120\">Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1147\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1147\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1136\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1147\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1233\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1196\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1195\">Registration Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1233\">₹1,000 (One-Time, Non-Refundable)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1271\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1270\">ACCA/CMA/FM Certification Fees</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1337\">Charged separately by the respective certification authorities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1361\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1360\">ACCA Fee Benefit</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1491\">Students pursuing MBA (Finance) with integrated ACCA electives may receive up to <strong data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1461\">60% reduction</strong> in ACCA certification costs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fym0om\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1519\">Fee Structure Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1790\">The MBA (Finance) program provides multiple payment options to improve affordability. Students opting for the annual payment plan can avail a <strong data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1681\">10% concession</strong>, while those choosing the one-time payment option can receive a <strong data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1764\">15% concession</strong> on the total program fee.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"2045\">In addition to the academic fee, examination fees are payable separately each semester. Professional certification charges such as ACCA, CMA, or FM are not included in the program fee and must be paid directly to the respective certifying organizations.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"432\">The MBA (Finance) program is designed to develop expertise in financial management, corporate finance, accounting, taxation, investment analysis, and strategic decision-making. The curriculum combines core management subjects with advanced finance-focused learning, helping students build the skills required for careers in banking, financial services, investment firms, consulting, and corporate finance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q61\" data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"448\">Semester 1</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"475\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"475\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"460\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"475\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"610\">\r\n<td data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"525\" data-col-size=\"md\">Managerial Economics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"610\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focuses on economic principles and their application in business decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"743\">\r\n<td data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"663\" data-col-size=\"md\">Managerial Practices and Organizational Behaviour</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"743\">Examines leadership, motivation, teamwork, and organizational effectiveness.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"851\">\r\n<td data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"768\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business &amp; Technology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"851\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduces the role of technology in modern business operations and management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"959\">\r\n<td data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"875\" data-col-size=\"md\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"959\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers marketing concepts, consumer behavior, and strategic marketing practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1067\">\r\n<td data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"983\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1067\" data-col-size=\"md\">Provides knowledge of accounting principles and financial statement preparation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1102\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strategic Management Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1188\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focuses on accounting techniques used for managerial planning and decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1228\" data-col-size=\"md\">Operations and Production Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1307\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduces production planning, operations control, and process management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1312\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q62\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1328\">Semester 2</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1355\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1355\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1340\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1355\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1494\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1416\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Research Method</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1494\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers research design, data collection, and business research techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1600\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1524\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate and Business Law</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1600\">Provides knowledge of legal frameworks governing business organizations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1715\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1628\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Management &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1715\">Introduces corporate governance, management functions, and organizational strategy.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1791\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1729\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1791\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized finance-related subject chosen by the student.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1857\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1805\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1857\" data-col-size=\"md\">Enhances knowledge in a selected finance domain.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1871\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1923\" data-col-size=\"md\">Supports career-focused specialization learning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1928\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q63\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1944\">Semester 3</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"2497\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1971\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1971\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1956\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1971\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2497\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2114\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2034\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Management for Managers</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2114\">Focuses on financial planning, investment decisions, and capital management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2220\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2143\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Management &ndash; II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2220\">Examines advanced corporate management and strategic leadership concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2323\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2249\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2323\">Covers recruitment, performance management, and workforce development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2373\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2337\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2373\">Advanced specialization subject.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2444\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2387\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2444\" data-col-size=\"md\">Finance-focused elective for deeper domain expertise.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2497\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2458\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 6</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2497\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industry-oriented elective subject.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2502\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pb1q64\" data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2518\">Semester 4</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"3039\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2545\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2545\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2530\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2545\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"3039\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2683\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2589\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AI for Finance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2683\">Introduces artificial intelligence applications in financial analysis and decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2767\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2695\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Taxation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2767\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers tax planning, corporate taxation, and compliance regulations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2864\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Management &ndash; III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2864\">Focuses on advanced corporate strategy and business leadership.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2911\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2878\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 7</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2911\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized finance elective.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2962\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2925\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 8</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2962\">Advanced domain-specific subject.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"3039\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"2976\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 9</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2976\" data-end=\"3039\" data-col-size=\"md\">Career-oriented elective supporting finance specialization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 240000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(429, 79, 'a8e52fda-dd0d-42a1-8153-4a4c8729dbf1', '6d0176e3-00d3-4a49-8675-eca65508b38a', 75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 06:05:31', '2026-06-17 00:29:53', '<h2>Admission Process</h2>\r\n<p>Getting started with your academic journey is simple and hassle-free. Follow the steps below to complete your admission process and secure your place in your chosen program.</p>\r\n<h3>Application Form</h3>\r\n<p>Begin your admission by accessing the online registration portal. Complete the application form carefully by providing your personal, academic, and contact details to initiate the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3>Registration Fee Payment</h3>\r\n<p>After filling out the application form, pay the registration fee of INR 1,000 to proceed further. Successful payment confirms your application submission and allows you to move to the next stage.</p>\r\n<h3>Academic Fee Submission</h3>\r\n<p>To reserve your seat, pay the academic fee for the first semester, first year, or the complete program, depending on the selected admission option. Fee payment ensures your enrollment is processed without delay.</p>\r\n<h3>Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p>Upload all required documents, including academic certificates, identity proof, photographs, and other supporting documents. The university reviews these documents to verify eligibility and admission details.</p>\r\n<h3>Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p>Once your application and documents are successfully verified, the university will confirm your admission. You will receive an official admission confirmation along with further instructions regarding your program commencement.</p>', 1, '<h2>Eligibility Criteria</h2>\r\n<p>Candidates who have completed a Bachelor\'s degree in any discipline such as B.E., B.Tech., B.Sc., B.Com., B.A., B.Voc., BCA, or an equivalent qualification from a recognized institution are eligible to apply for the program.</p>\r\n<h3>Academic Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>A valid graduation degree from a recognized university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Mathematics as a subject at the 10+2 level or during graduation is preferred.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Candidates from any academic background can apply, subject to meeting the university\'s admission requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>For Non-Mathematics Background Students</h3>\r\n<p>Applicants who have not studied Mathematics at the 10+2 or graduation level may still be eligible for admission. However, they will be required to complete the mandatory bridge courses prescribed by the university. These courses are designed to strengthen fundamental knowledge in Mathematics and Computer Science, helping learners build a strong foundation for the program.</p>\r\n<p>Students are advised to review the university guidelines regarding bridge courses and eligibility requirements before applying.</p>', '<h2>Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<p>The program offers flexible payment options to suit the financial preferences of both Indian and international learners. Students can choose to pay semester-wise, annually, or through a one-time payment plan and benefit from available fee concessions.</p>\r\n<h3>Program Fee Details</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Fee Category</th>\r\n<th>Indian Nationals</th>\r\n<th>Foreign Nationals</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td>₹1,50,000</td>\r\n<td>₹3,00,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester Fee Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>₹37,500</td>\r\n<td>₹75,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Fee Payment Plan (10% Concession)</td>\r\n<td>₹67,500</td>\r\n<td>₹1,35,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>One-Time Fee Payment Plan (15% Concession)</td>\r\n<td>₹1,27,500</td>\r\n<td>₹2,55,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Learner Category</th>\r\n<th>Examination Fee (Per Semester)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Indian Learners</td>\r\n<td>₹1,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>International Learners</td>\r\n<td>₹3,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Payment Options &amp; Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Flexible payment plans are available for greater convenience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Annual fee payments offer a 10% concession on tuition fees.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>One-time program fee payment provides a 15% concession, making it the most cost-effective option.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Examination fees are charged separately each semester.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Students should review the applicable fee structure before completing admission formalities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The fee structure is designed to provide affordability and flexibility while ensuring access to quality education and academic support throughout the program.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"653\">The Online MCA (Master of Computer Applications) program is designed to equip learners with advanced computing knowledge, industry-relevant technical skills, and practical expertise required in today\'s technology-driven world. The curriculum combines core computer science concepts with emerging technologies such as Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Cloud Computing, Cybersecurity, Blockchain, and Business Intelligence. Through a structured semester-wise learning journey, students develop strong programming, analytical, and problem-solving abilities that prepare them for diverse IT and software development careers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k8fwpf\" data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"703\">Online MCA Semester-Wise Curriculum Overview</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"2571\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"739\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"739\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"716\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"739\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Curriculum Overview</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"2571\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"1240\">\r\n<td data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"792\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"791\">Semester 1</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"1240\" data-col-size=\"xl\">The first semester focuses on building a strong foundation in computer applications and programming. Students learn fundamental programming concepts, database management, operating systems, software engineering principles, and cloud technologies. The curriculum also introduces web development and mathematical foundations, helping learners develop logical thinking and technical problem-solving skills essential for advanced computing studies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1678\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1258\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1257\">Semester 2</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1678\">During the second semester, students strengthen their software development and system management capabilities. The curriculum covers Java programming, data structures, algorithms, computer networks, Linux administration, and machine learning fundamentals. This semester emphasizes practical programming skills and introduces learners to intelligent computing techniques that are widely used across modern industries.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"2112\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1696\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1695\">Semester 3</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"2112\">The third semester focuses on advanced and emerging technologies that are transforming the global IT landscape. Students explore Artificial Intelligence, Big Data Analytics, Internet of Things (IoT), Cloud Security, and Cryptography. Elective subjects provide flexibility to specialize in areas aligned with individual career aspirations, allowing learners to develop expertise in high-demand technology domains.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2571\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2130\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2129\">Semester 4</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2571\" data-col-size=\"xl\">The final semester is designed to enhance industry readiness through specialized technologies and hands-on application. Learners study Cloud Operations, Ethical Hacking, Blockchain, and Business Intelligence while working on a comprehensive project. The project enables students to apply theoretical knowledge to real-world challenges, strengthen their professional portfolio, and gain practical experience before entering the workforce.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12nnnku\" data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2626\">Key Skills Developed During the Online MCA Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"3163\">The Online MCA curriculum helps students develop a broad range of technical and professional competencies required in the modern IT industry. Throughout the program, learners gain expertise in software development, database management, cloud computing, cybersecurity, data analytics, artificial intelligence, networking, and emerging technologies. The project-based learning approach further strengthens critical thinking, analytical reasoning, and problem-solving capabilities that employers actively seek in technology professionals.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 150000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(430, 79, 'a8e52fda-dd0d-42a1-8153-4a4c8729dbf1', '6d0176e3-00d3-4a49-8675-eca65508b38a', 217, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 07:00:28', '2026-05-29 07:00:28', '<p data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"292\">Getting admission to the <strong data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"99\">Online M.Sc Mathematics</strong> program is simple and completely online. The university follows a streamlined admission process that allows students to apply from anywhere and begin their postgraduate journey without hassle.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"336\">Step 1: Complete the Application Form</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"541\">Visit the registration portal and fill out the online application form with your personal, academic, and contact details. Ensure all information is entered accurately to avoid delays during verification.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"580\">Step 2: Pay the Registration Fee</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"788\">After submitting the application form, pay the <strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"656\">₹1,000 registration fee</strong> to initiate the admission process. This fee confirms your application and allows the university to process your enrollment request.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"823\">Step 3: Pay the Academic Fee</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"1024\">Once registered, proceed with the payment of the academic fee. Students can choose to pay for the first semester, annual plan, or the complete program according to their preferred fee payment option.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1064\">Step 4: Upload Required Documents</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1280\">Submit all mandatory documents through the online portal. Documents typically include academic certificates, identity proof, passport-size photograph, and other admission-related records required by the university.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1317\">Step 5: Admission Confirmation</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1537\">The university will review and verify the submitted documents. After successful verification, your admission will be confirmed, and you will receive enrollment details to begin your <strong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1528\">Online M.Sc Mathematics</strong> program.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"410\">Candidates seeking admission to the <strong data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"112\">Online M.Sc Mathematics</strong> program must meet the university\'s prescribed academic requirements. The program is designed for graduates who have a strong foundation in mathematics and wish to build advanced knowledge in areas such as algebra, statistics, numerical analysis, differential equations, and mathematical computing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k0xf5z\" data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"440\">Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzfm5a\" data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"518\">Candidates must hold a <strong data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"488\">Bachelor\'s degree</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fu2w11\" data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"599\">Applicants with <strong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"576\">B.A., B.Sc., or Engineering degrees</strong> are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kf21te\" data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"693\"><strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"674\">Mathematics must have been studied as one of the three main subjects</strong> during graduation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16yn7b5\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"776\">Candidates from recognized universities across India are eligible for admission.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"414\">The <strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"74\">Online M.Sc Mathematics</strong> program offers an affordable and flexible fee structure for both Indian and international learners. Students can choose from semester-wise, annual, or one-time payment options based on their convenience. Special concessions are available for annual and full-program fee payments, helping learners reduce their overall educational expenses.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"434\">Fee Structure</h4>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"766\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"487\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"487\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"447\" data-col-size=\"md\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"466\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Nationals</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"487\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foreign Nationals</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"766\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"582\">\r\n<td data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"559\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹72,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"582\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,44,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<td data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"611\" data-col-size=\"md\">Semester Fee Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"621\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹18,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"632\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹36,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"697\">\r\n<td data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"676\" data-col-size=\"md\">Annual Fee Payment Plan (10% Concession)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"686\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹32,400</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"697\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹64,800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"766\">\r\n<td data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"743\" data-col-size=\"md\">One-Time Fee Payment Plan (15% Concession)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"753\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹61,200</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"766\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,22,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"788\">Examination Fee</h4>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"942\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"820\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"820\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"801\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"820\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"942\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<td data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"870\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Learners</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"893\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,500 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"942\">\r\n<td data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"919\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Learners</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"942\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹3,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9q8v0q\" data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"967\">Fee Payment Options</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1377\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jq2t82\" data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1065\"><strong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"997\">Semester-Wise Payment:</strong> Pay fees in smaller installments at the beginning of each semester.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzazx3\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1153\"><strong data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1092\">Annual Payment Plan:</strong> Avail a <strong data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1119\">10% concession</strong> by paying yearly fees in advance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7jr7bk\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1262\"><strong data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1182\">One-Time Payment Plan:</strong> Save more with a <strong data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1218\">15% concession</strong> by paying the complete program fee at once.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mtns1h\" data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1377\"><strong data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1298\">Flexible Learning Investment:</strong> Multiple payment options make higher education accessible and budget-friendly.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"671\">The <strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"81\">Online M.Sc Mathematics</strong> curriculum is designed to provide a strong foundation in advanced mathematical concepts while developing analytical, computational, and research-oriented skills. The program covers core areas of pure and applied mathematics along with programming, statistics, optimization techniques, and emerging technologies such as Artificial Intelligence. Through a blend of theoretical learning, practical applications, laboratory work, and project-based learning, students gain the expertise required for careers in research, education, data analytics, finance, technology, and scientific computing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1px0lan\" data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"722\">Semester 1: Advanced Mathematical Foundations</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"749\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"749\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"734\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"749\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n<td data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"802\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced Abstract Algebra</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"923\">Study advanced algebraic structures such as groups, rings, and fields that form the foundation of higher mathematics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<td data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"935\" data-col-size=\"md\">Topology</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1055\">Learn the properties of mathematical spaces, continuity, and transformations used in advanced mathematical research.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1078\" data-col-size=\"md\">Integral Transforms</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1187\">Understand mathematical techniques used to solve complex differential equations and engineering problems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1317\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1208\" data-col-size=\"md\">Special Functions</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1317\">Explore important mathematical functions widely applied in physics, engineering, and scientific research.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1328\" data-col-size=\"md\">MAT-LAB</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1438\">Gain practical experience in mathematical computation, modeling, and problem-solving using software tools.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1493\" data-col-size=\"md\">Object-Oriented Programming with C++ (Theory &amp; Lab)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1602\">Develop programming skills and learn object-oriented concepts for computational mathematics applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17h1tl\" data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1659\">Semester 2: Computational and Numerical Mathematics</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"2463\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1686\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1686\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1671\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1686\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"2463\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1838\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1738\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematical Programming</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1838\">Learn optimization methods and mathematical modeling techniques for solving real-world problems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1869\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced Numerical Analysis</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1962\">Study numerical methods used to approximate solutions for complex mathematical equations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2115\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2011\" data-col-size=\"md\">Integral Equations and Calculus of Variations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2115\">Understand advanced mathematical methods used in optimization, engineering, and scientific analysis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2233\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2151\" data-col-size=\"md\">Discrete Mathematical Structures</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2233\">Explore logic, graph theory, combinatorics, and discrete mathematical systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2344\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2259\" data-col-size=\"md\">Numerical Analysis Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2344\">Apply numerical techniques and computational methods through practical exercises.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2463\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2376\" data-col-size=\"md\">Computer System Organization</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2463\">Gain knowledge of computer architecture, memory systems, and hardware fundamentals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1r8wqgb\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2517\">Semester 3: Advanced Applications of Mathematics</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"3297\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2544\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2544\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2529\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2544\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"3297\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2679\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2595\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Linear Algebra</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2679\">Study vector spaces, matrices, eigenvalues, and advanced linear transformations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2810\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2714\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Differential Equations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2810\">Learn techniques for solving complex differential equations used in science and engineering.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2931\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2829\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tensor Analysis</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2829\" data-end=\"2931\">Understand tensor concepts and their applications in physics, mechanics, and advanced mathematics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"3039\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2950\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fluid Mechanics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"3039\">Explore mathematical principles governing fluid flow and behavior in various systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3040\" data-end=\"3186\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3040\" data-end=\"3068\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics in Multimedia</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3186\">Learn how mathematical concepts are applied in graphics, animation, image processing, and multimedia technologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3187\" data-end=\"3297\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3187\" data-end=\"3218\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematical Programming Lab</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3297\">Develop practical skills in optimization and computational problem-solving.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tlo8cm\" data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3362\">Semester 4: Research and Emerging Mathematical Technologies</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"4040\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3389\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3389\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3374\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3374\" data-end=\"3389\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"4040\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3561\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3424\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3424\" data-end=\"3561\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Complete a comprehensive research project that demonstrates practical application of mathematical concepts and analytical techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3681\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3588\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Artificial Intelligence</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3681\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Understand the mathematical foundations of AI, machine learning, and intelligent systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3790\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematical Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3790\">Learn statistical methods for data analysis, forecasting, and decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"3908\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"3812\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operation Research</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3812\" data-end=\"3908\">Study optimization techniques and resource allocation methods used in business and industry.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"4040\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"3942\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Partial Differential Equations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3942\" data-end=\"4040\">Explore advanced equations used to model scientific, engineering, and technological phenomena.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 72000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(431, 79, 'a8e52fda-dd0d-42a1-8153-4a4c8729dbf1', '6d0176e3-00d3-4a49-8675-eca65508b38a', 102, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 23:43:43', '2026-05-29 23:43:43', '<h2>MA English Admission Process</h2>\r\n<p>Ready to begin your journey in advanced literary studies and language learning? The MA English admission process is simple, fully online, and designed to help students complete their enrollment quickly and conveniently. Follow the steps below to secure your admission.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 1: Complete the Application Form</h3>\r\n<p>Begin by accessing the university\'s online registration portal. Fill in your basic personal, academic, and contact details accurately to start your application process.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 2: Pay the Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<p>After completing the application form, pay the <strong>₹1,000 registration fee</strong> to proceed with your admission. Ensure all information submitted during registration is correct to avoid delays during verification.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 3: Pay the Academic Fee</h3>\r\n<p>Once registered, select your preferred fee payment option and pay the academic fee for the <strong>first semester, annual plan, or full program</strong>, depending on the payment structure offered by the university.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 4: Upload Required Documents</h3>\r\n<p>Submit all mandatory documents through the admission portal for verification. Commonly required documents may include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Graduation mark sheets and certificates</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Government-issued ID proof</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Passport-size photograph</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Signature copy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Any additional documents required by the university</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Step 5: Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p>The university will review and verify the submitted documents. Upon successful verification and fee confirmation, your admission will be approved, and you will receive an official admission confirmation.</p>\r\n<h3>Important Admission Tips</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Keep scanned copies of all documents ready before applying.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Ensure that your academic details match the supporting documents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Complete fee payment within the prescribed timeline to avoid application delays.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Regularly check your registered email and mobile number for admission updates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>With a streamlined online admission process, students can enroll in the MA English program from anywhere and begin building expertise in literature, linguistics, critical theory, research, and communication studies.</p>', 1, '<h2>MA English Eligibility Criteria</h2>\r\n<p>Candidates seeking admission to the MA English program must fulfill the following eligibility requirements. The program is designed for graduates who wish to deepen their understanding of English literature, language studies, literary criticism, linguistics, and research.</p>\r\n<h3>Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Applicants must hold a <strong>Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Graduates from any academic discipline are eligible to apply.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Candidates who have completed their undergraduate studies through a recognized institution can seek admission.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Final-year undergraduate students awaiting results may apply, subject to meeting the university\'s admission requirements</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Important Admission Insight</h3>\r\n<p>Students from non-English academic backgrounds can also pursue MA English successfully. However, developing strong reading, writing, and analytical skills before the program begins can help learners adapt more effectively to advanced literary studies, critical theories, and research-based coursework.</p>', '<h2>MA English Fees Structure</h2>\r\n<p>The MA English program offers an affordable and flexible fee structure, allowing learners to choose a payment option that best suits their financial planning. Students can pay semester-wise, annually with a concession, or opt for a one-time payment to maximize savings. The program is designed to provide quality postgraduate education in English literature, language studies, literary criticism, and research at a cost-effective fee.</p>\r\n<h3>Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Category</th>\r\n<th>Indian Nationals</th>\r\n<th>Foreign Nationals</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td>₹72,000</td>\r\n<td>₹144,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester Fee Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>₹18,000</td>\r\n<td>₹36,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Fee Payment Plan (10% Concession)</td>\r\n<td>₹32,400</td>\r\n<td>₹64,800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>One Installment Fee Payment Plan (15% Concession)</td>\r\n<td>₹61,200</td>\r\n<td>₹122,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Category</th>\r\n<th>Examination Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Indian Learners</td>\r\n<td>₹1,500 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>International Learners</td>\r\n<td>₹3,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Fee Payment Options</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Semester-Wise Payment Plan</strong><br>Students can pay their academic fee at the beginning of each semester, making the program financially manageable while continuing their postgraduate studies.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Annual Payment Plan (10% Concession)</strong><br>Learners who choose the yearly payment option receive a 10% concession on tuition fees, helping reduce the overall academic cost.</p>\r\n<p><strong>One-Time Payment Plan (15% Concession)</strong><br>Students seeking maximum savings can opt for the full program payment at once and receive a 15% concession on the total tuition fee.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"611\">The <strong data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"45\">MA English</strong> curriculum is designed to provide learners with a deep understanding of English literature, language studies, literary criticism, linguistics, and research methodologies. Throughout four semesters, students explore literary movements from the medieval period to contemporary literature while developing advanced analytical, communication, and research skills. The program balances classical literary traditions with modern critical theories, preparing learners for careers in academia, research, content development, publishing, media, and communication industries.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"676\">Semester 1: Foundations of English Literature and Language</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"910\">The first semester introduces students to the historical development of English literature and language studies. Learners begin with communication skills while exploring major literary periods from Chaucer to the nineteenth century.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"937\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"937\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"922\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"937\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<td data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1001\" data-col-size=\"md\">Language &amp; Communication Skills I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1101\">Develops academic writing, professional communication, grammar, and language proficiency skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1145\" data-col-size=\"md\">Chaucer and Sixteenth Century Literature</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1261\">Explores medieval and Renaissance literature, including the works of Geoffrey Chaucer and early English writers.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1409\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1309\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eighteenth and Nineteenth Century Literature</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1409\">Introduces major literary movements, authors, and texts that shaped English literary traditions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1444\" data-col-size=\"md\">Nineteenth Century Literature I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1536\">Focuses on important nineteenth-century literary works, themes, and cultural influences.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1646\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1561\" data-col-size=\"md\">American Literature I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1646\">Examines the foundations of American literary traditions and influential writers.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1674\" data-col-size=\"md\">Language &amp; Linguistics I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1769\">Introduces the scientific study of language, linguistic structures, and language functions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1819\">Semester 2: Expanding Literary Perspectives</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1988\">The second semester deepens students\' understanding of literary history and language studies while covering significant literary developments across different periods.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2789\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2015\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2015\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2000\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2015\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2789\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2162\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2080\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Language &amp; Communication Skills II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2162\">Enhances advanced writing, presentation, and critical communication abilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2294\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2196\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Seventeenth Century Literature</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2294\">Studies major literary works from the seventeenth century, including poetry, prose, and drama.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2426\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2330\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eighteenth Century Literature II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2426\">Examines literary developments, social influences, and intellectual movements of the period.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2559\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2462\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Nineteenth Century Literature II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2559\">Provides advanced analysis of nineteenth-century literary texts and critical interpretations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2672\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2585\" data-col-size=\"sm\">American Literature II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2672\">Explores influential American authors, literary movements, and cultural narratives.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2789\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2701\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Language &amp; Linguistics II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2789\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers advanced linguistic theories, language structures, and communication systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2847\">Semester 3: Literary Theory and Modern Perspectives</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"3022\">The third semester focuses on literary criticism, modern literature, and Indian writing in English. Students learn to interpret texts through various theoretical frameworks.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3807\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3049\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3049\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3034\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3049\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3807\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3204\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3111\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Literary Criticism and Theory I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3111\" data-end=\"3204\">Introduces major literary theories and approaches to textual interpretation and analysis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3327\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3238\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Twentieth Century Literature I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3327\">Explores significant literary works, movements, and authors of the twentieth century.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3457\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3358\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Writing in English I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3457\">Examines the growth of Indian English literature and contributions of prominent Indian writers.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3582\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3494\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Nineteenth Century Literature III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3582\">Provides specialized study of selected nineteenth-century literary themes and texts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3583\" data-end=\"3692\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3583\" data-end=\"3609\" data-col-size=\"sm\">American Literature III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3692\">Studies advanced American literary traditions and contemporary interpretations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3807\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3722\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Language &amp; Linguistics III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"3807\">Covers advanced topics in linguistics, discourse analysis, and language research.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3876\">Semester 4: Research, Criticism, and Advanced Literary Studies</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"3878\" data-end=\"4025\">The final semester emphasizes advanced literary criticism, contemporary literary analysis, and independent research through a dissertation project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4593\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4052\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4052\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4037\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4037\" data-end=\"4052\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4593\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4204\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4115\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Literary Theory and Criticism II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4204\">Explores contemporary critical theories and advanced literary interpretation methods.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4323\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4239\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Twentieth Century Literature II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4323\">Studies modern and contemporary literary works from diverse global perspectives.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4436\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4355\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Writing in English II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4436\">Examines contemporary Indian English literature and emerging literary voices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4437\" data-end=\"4593\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4437\" data-end=\"4452\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dissertation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4593\" data-col-size=\"lg\">A major research project that allows learners to investigate a specialized topic in literature or linguistics under academic supervision.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 72000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(432, 79, 'a8e52fda-dd0d-42a1-8153-4a4c8729dbf1', '6d0176e3-00d3-4a49-8675-eca65508b38a', 287, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-29 23:53:37', '2026-06-17 00:30:06', '<h2>MA Journalism and Mass Communication Admission Process</h2>\r\n<p>The admission process for the MA Journalism and Mass Communication program is simple, fully online, and designed to help students complete their enrollment with ease. From registration to admission confirmation, every step can be completed digitally, allowing learners to begin their postgraduate journey without unnecessary delays.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 1: Fill Out the Application Form</h3>\r\n<p>Start your application by accessing the university\'s registration portal. Complete the online application form by providing your personal, academic, and contact details accurately.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 2: Pay the Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<p>After submitting the application form, pay the <strong>₹1,000 registration fee</strong> to proceed with the admission process. Ensure all information entered during registration is correct to avoid verification issues later.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 3: Pay the Academic Fee</h3>\r\n<p>Once registration is completed, pay the academic fee according to your preferred payment option. Students can typically choose to pay for the <strong>first semester, annual plan, or full program</strong> as per the university\'s fee structure.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 4: Upload Required Documents</h3>\r\n<p>Submit all mandatory documents through the admission portal for verification. Commonly required documents may include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Graduation mark sheets and degree certificate</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Government-issued identity proof</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Recent passport-size photograph</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Signature copy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Any additional documents specified by the university</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Step 5: Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p>The university will verify the submitted documents and fee payment details. After successful verification, your admission will be confirmed, and you will receive official communication regarding enrollment and program access.</p>\r\n<h3>Important Admission Tips</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Keep digital copies of all required documents ready before applying.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Ensure that the information provided in the application matches your official records.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Complete fee payment within the prescribed timeline to avoid delays.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Regularly check your registered email and mobile number for admission updates and notifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<h2>MA Journalism and Mass Communication Eligibility Criteria</h2>\r\n<p>The MA Journalism and Mass Communication program is designed for graduates who wish to build expertise in journalism, digital media, public relations, advertising, broadcasting, and corporate communication. The program welcomes learners from diverse academic backgrounds and provides a strong foundation in both traditional and modern media practices.</p>\r\n<h3>Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Candidates must hold a <strong>Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Graduates from any discipline are eligible to apply for admission.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Applicants must have completed their undergraduate education from a recognized institution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Final-year bachelor\'s degree students awaiting their results may apply, subject to the university\'s admission guidelines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>MA Journalism and Mass Communication Fees Structure</h2>\r\n<p>The MA Journalism and Mass Communication program offers an affordable fee structure with multiple payment options to suit different learner requirements. Students can choose to pay semester-wise, annually with a concession, or make a one-time payment to benefit from maximum savings. The fee structure is designed to make quality education in journalism, media studies, digital communication, advertising, and public relations accessible to both Indian and international learners.</p>\r\n<h3>Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Category</th>\r\n<th>Indian Nationals</th>\r\n<th>Foreign Nationals</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td>₹72,000</td>\r\n<td>₹144,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester Fee Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>₹18,000</td>\r\n<td>₹36,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Fee Payment Plan (10% Concession)</td>\r\n<td>₹32,400</td>\r\n<td>₹64,800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>One Installment Fee Payment Plan (15% Concession)</td>\r\n<td>₹61,200</td>\r\n<td>₹122,400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Examination Fee</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Category</th>\r\n<th>Examination Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Indian Learners</td>\r\n<td>₹1,500 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>International Learners</td>\r\n<td>₹3,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Flexible Payment Options</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Semester-Wise Payment Plan</strong><br>Students can pay the fee at the beginning of each semester, making it easier to manage educational expenses throughout the program duration.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Annual Payment Plan (10% Concession)</strong><br>Learners who choose the yearly payment option receive a 10% concession on tuition fees, reducing the overall cost of the program.</p>\r\n<p><strong>One-Time Payment Plan (15% Concession)</strong><br>Students opting for full program payment in a single installment receive a 15% concession, making it the most economical payment option available.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Medium', '<h2>MA Journalism and Mass Communication Curriculum</h2>\r\n<p>The MA Journalism and Mass Communication program is designed to equip learners with a strong understanding of media, journalism, digital communication, public relations, advertising, broadcasting, and multimedia production. The curriculum combines theoretical knowledge with practical media skills, helping students develop expertise for careers in journalism, television, digital media, corporate communication, advertising, and content creation.</p>\r\n<h3>Semester 1: Foundations of Media and Journalism</h3>\r\n<p>The first semester introduces students to the fundamentals of communication, journalism, media writing, ethics, and media management. Learners build a strong foundation in how modern media organizations operate and communicate with audiences.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Subject</th>\r\n<th>Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Communication Theory</td>\r\n<td>Introduces key communication models, concepts, and communication processes in media industries.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Journalism: Concepts &amp; Principles</td>\r\n<td>Covers the fundamentals of journalism, news values, reporting principles, and media responsibilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Print Media: Production Tools &amp; Techniques</td>\r\n<td>Explores newspaper and magazine production, editing, layout design, and publishing processes.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Media Laws &amp; Ethics</td>\r\n<td>Provides understanding of media regulations, ethical practices, freedom of expression, and legal frameworks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Media Management</td>\r\n<td>Examines media organization structures, operations, leadership, and business management practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Writing for Media</td>\r\n<td>Develops writing skills for news, digital platforms, broadcasting, and professional communication.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Semester 2: Broadcasting, Advertising, and Media Research</h3>\r\n<p>The second semester focuses on electronic media, advertising strategies, new media technologies, and research methodologies used in communication studies.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Subject</th>\r\n<th>Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Radio: Concepts &amp; Principles</td>\r\n<td>Covers radio broadcasting, programming formats, production techniques, and audience engagement.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Advertising: Concepts &amp; Principles</td>\r\n<td>Introduces advertising strategies, campaign planning, branding, and consumer communication.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>New Media</td>\r\n<td>Explores digital platforms, online communication, social media, and emerging media technologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Media &amp; Communication Research</td>\r\n<td>Develops research skills used in media analysis, audience studies, and communication projects.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>TV &amp; Film Appreciation</td>\r\n<td>Studies television and film language, visual storytelling, and media aesthetics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Business Journalism</td>\r\n<td>Focuses on financial reporting, business news analysis, and economic communication.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Semester 3: Advanced Media Production and Global Communication</h3>\r\n<p>This semester provides practical exposure to visual communication, global media systems, public relations, and multimedia journalism.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Subject</th>\r\n<th>Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Photography</td>\r\n<td>Develops professional photography skills for journalism, media reporting, and visual storytelling.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Video Production Techniques &amp; Programme Formats</td>\r\n<td>Covers video shooting, editing, production workflows, and television program formats.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Global Media</td>\r\n<td>Examines international media systems, global communication trends, and cross-cultural media practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Development Communication</td>\r\n<td>Studies the role of media in social change, public awareness, and community development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Public Relations &amp; Corporate Communication</td>\r\n<td>Focuses on reputation management, stakeholder communication, and corporate messaging strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Multimedia Journalism</td>\r\n<td>Introduces digital storytelling using text, images, audio, video, and interactive media tools.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Semester 4: Digital Media and Specialized Journalism</h3>\r\n<p>The final semester focuses on digital journalism, media impact, specialized reporting areas, and independent research through a major project.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Subject</th>\r\n<th>Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Digital Journalism</td>\r\n<td>Explores online news production, mobile journalism, digital reporting, and audience engagement.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Media and Society</td>\r\n<td>Examines the relationship between media, culture, politics, and social development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Research Project</td>\r\n<td>Enables students to conduct independent research on a selected media or communication topic.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Rural Journalism</td>\r\n<td>Focuses on reporting issues related to rural communities, agriculture, and regional development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Environment Journalism</td>\r\n<td>Covers environmental reporting, sustainability issues, and climate communication.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td>Introduces marketing principles, consumer behavior, and strategic communication practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Key Skills Developed During the Program</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>News reporting and media writing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Digital journalism and content creation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Public relations and corporate communication</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Advertising and brand communication</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Photography and video production</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Multimedia storytelling</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Media research and audience analysis</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Social media and digital communication strategies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Media ethics and legal awareness</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Communication and presentation skills</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 72000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(433, 80, 'f9c4cae4-f03e-42d2-8b49-8b4e4081e015', '811f2dad-2583-4a70-9965-33f26cbbf10a', 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 00:08:19', '2026-05-30 00:08:19', NULL, 1, '<p><strong>Candidates must fulfill the following eligibility requirements to apply for the Online BBA program:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Educational Qualification:</strong> Applicants should have passed their 10+2 (Higher Secondary/Intermediate) examination from a recognized board in any stream, including Arts, Commerce, or Science.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Appearing Candidates:</strong> Students who are appearing for their Class 12 examinations are also eligible to apply, subject to the fulfillment of admission requirements at the time of enrollment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>NIOS Eligibility:</strong> Candidates who have completed their qualifying education through the National Institute of Open Schooling (NIOS) are eligible to apply for the program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>No Age Limit:</strong> There is no upper age restriction for admission, making the program suitable for both fresh school graduates and working professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The Online BBA program is designed to provide flexible access to business and management education for learners from diverse academic backgrounds. Whether you are planning to start your management career after Class 12 or looking to upgrade your qualifications while continuing your professional commitments, the program offers a convenient and industry-relevant learning pathway.</p>', '<p>The Online BBA program offers flexible fee payment options, allowing students to choose a plan that best suits their financial requirements. Learners can opt for annual payments, a one-time lump sum payment, or convenient EMI facilities for a hassle-free admission experience.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Fee Component</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>