er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(444, 81, 'a43ce1c1-07c6-48ac-9fe4-9e7e2a0894ec', '99ab210c-64fc-4773-adb7-798ae6d00459', 332, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 02:00:41', '2026-05-30 02:00:41', '<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"340\">The online admission process is designed to provide a simple, transparent, and student-friendly experience for applicants seeking admission. Students are advised to complete their registration and fee payment within the prescribed timelines to avoid late fees and secure their admission without any delays.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"621\">Whether you are a new applicant applying for admission or an existing learner planning re-registration for the next academic cycle, following the admission schedule carefully can help ensure uninterrupted access to academic resources, examinations, and learning support services.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rn74wc\" data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"650\">Admission Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"905\">Students seeking fresh admission must complete the registration and admission formalities within the dates announced by the university. Early registration is recommended to avoid late charges and last-minute technical issues during the admission period.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"936\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"936\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"928\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"936\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1000\">\r\n<td data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"983\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1000\">19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1030\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1064\">19 March 2026 &ndash; 10 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1099\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission with Late Fee of ₹500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1134\">11 August 2026 &ndash; 31 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1211\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1171\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1211\">1 September 2026 &ndash; 16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1237\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Last Date of Admission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1258\">16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zhi5kv\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1294\">Step-by-Step Admission Process</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1436\">The university follows a streamlined online admission process that allows students to complete the entire application journey from anywhere.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1470\">Step 1: Online Registration</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1619\">Applicants must begin by creating an account through the online admission portal and providing their basic personal, academic, and contact details.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1661\">Step 2: Application Form Submission</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1827\">Candidates are required to fill out the complete online application form accurately and upload all mandatory academic and identification documents for verification.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1853\">Step 3: Fee Payment</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"2019\">After submitting the application form, students must pay the applicable program fee through the available online payment methods to confirm their admission request.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2055\">Step 4: Document Verification</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2192\">The university reviews the submitted documents and verifies eligibility criteria, academic qualifications, and supporting certificates.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2229\">Step 5: Admission Confirmation</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2405\">Once verification is completed successfully, admission is confirmed and students receive enrollment details along with access to the learning platform and academic resources.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18znm4u\" data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2440\">Re-Registration Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2622\">Existing students must complete the re-registration process within the prescribed timeline to continue their studies in the upcoming semester or academic year without interruption.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2925\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2659\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2659\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2651\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2659\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2925\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2726\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2709\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2726\">19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2794\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2762\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2794\">19 March 2026 &ndash; 31 July 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2874\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2837\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2874\">1 August 2026 &ndash; 10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2925\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2904\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Closure of Re-Registration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2925\">10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"365\">Before applying for an Online MBA program, candidates must ensure they meet the prescribed academic requirements. The eligibility criteria are designed to ensure that learners possess the foundational knowledge and educational background required to successfully pursue advanced studies in management and business administration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"674\">The Online MBA program welcomes graduates from diverse academic disciplines, making it an excellent choice for fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, and individuals looking to enhance their managerial skills, leadership capabilities, and career prospects through a flexible learning format.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k8fv3a\" data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"715\">Online MBA Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"820\">To be eligible for admission to the Online MBA program, candidates must fulfill the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"1296\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16twwrh\" data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"909\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"861\">Bachelor\'s Degree (10+2+3)</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9o4wxg\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1046\">Candidates with an equivalent qualification recognized by the <strong data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1018\">Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</strong> are also eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14w971x\" data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1154\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1109\">50% aggregate marks at the graduation level</strong> is required for General category candidates.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6gi4ib\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1296\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1216\">SC, ST, OBC, and PwD categories</strong> are eligible with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1271\">45% aggregate marks</strong> at the graduation level.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s0drs4\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1334\">Who Can Apply for an Online MBA?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1411\">The Online MBA program is suitable for a wide range of learners, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"2006\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"55bsg3\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1514\"><strong data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1434\">Fresh Graduates</strong> seeking advanced management education after completing their bachelor\'s degree.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r1y5c8\" data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1606\"><strong data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1542\">Working Professionals</strong> aiming for career advancement, promotions, or leadership roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ha8mv\" data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1732\"><strong data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1646\">Entrepreneurs and Business Owners</strong> looking to strengthen their business management and strategic decision-making skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9aq7fi\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1873\"><strong data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1755\">Career Switchers</strong> planning to transition into management, marketing, finance, human resources, operations, or business analytics roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hgbywk\" data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"2006\"><strong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1919\">Government and Private Sector Employees</strong> seeking flexible higher education without interrupting their professional commitments.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>Online MBA Fee Structure 2026</h2>\r\n<p>The Online MBA program offers flexible fee payment options to accommodate the needs of working professionals, fresh graduates, entrepreneurs, and career-focused learners. Students can choose between annual and semester-wise payment plans based on their financial preferences and learning goals.</p>\r\n<p>With industry-relevant curriculum, flexible online learning, and multiple financing options, the program is designed to make quality management education more accessible without compromising academic excellence.</p>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Payment (2 Years)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹105,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester-Wise Payment (4 Semesters)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹55,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>One-Time Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Additional Charges</h3>\r\n<p>Apart from the tuition fee, students should consider the following academic and administrative charges while planning their overall education investment.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Particulars</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admission Processing Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Initial Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹10,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per subject per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Project Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Fee Payment Options and Benefits</h3>\r\n<p>The university provides multiple payment modes to ensure flexibility and convenience for learners.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Annual Payment Plan:</strong> Suitable for students who prefer manageable yearly payments while reducing administrative formalities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Semester-Wise Payment Plan:</strong> Ideal for learners looking for smaller payment commitments spread across four semesters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>One-Time Payment Option:</strong> Allows students to complete the entire fee payment at the beginning of the program for added convenience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Choosing the right payment plan depends on individual financial planning, career goals, and preferred payment flexibility.</p>\r\n<h3>Scholarship Benefits</h3>\r\n<p>To support the educational aspirations of service personnel and their families, the university offers a special scholarship policy.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Armed Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Paramilitary Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Other Defence Service Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Eligible Dependents</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Qualified candidates can avail a <strong>20% concession on the program fee</strong>, helping reduce the overall cost of pursuing an Online MBA degree.</p>\r\n<h3>Education Loan and EMI Facilities</h3>\r\n<p>Students who wish to finance their education can take advantage of various payment support options offered by the university and its financial partners.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>No Cost EMI options available for eligible applicants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Education loan facilities without requiring a credit card.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Flexible repayment solutions for working professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Guidance from admission counsellors regarding financing options.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These facilities help learners pursue higher education without placing significant financial pressure on themselves or their families.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"495\">The Online MBA in Marketing Management is designed to develop future-ready marketing professionals with expertise in branding, consumer behavior, digital marketing, sales strategy, market research, and business leadership. The curriculum combines core management subjects with specialized marketing courses, helping students build a strong foundation in business operations while gaining in-demand marketing skills required by modern organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"884\">Throughout the program, learners gain exposure to strategic decision-making, customer-centric marketing approaches, financial management, business analytics, and international marketing practices. The industry-focused curriculum ensures graduates are prepared for leadership roles across advertising, branding, sales, digital marketing, market research, and business development domains.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ixa7tr\" data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"950\">Semester 1: Building Core Business and Marketing Foundations</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1113\">The first semester introduces students to fundamental management concepts that form the backbone of successful business operations and marketing decision-making.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1818\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1150\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1150\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1150\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1818\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1200\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1282\">Develop professional communication, presentation, and business writing skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1306\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1389\">Understand financial statements, accounting principles, and business reporting.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1496\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1426\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Micro Economics &amp; Macro Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1496\">Learn economic concepts influencing business and market decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1600\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1524\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Organisational Behaviour</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1600\">Study employee behavior, leadership, motivation, and workplace dynamics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1713\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1624\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1713\">Understand core marketing concepts, market segmentation, and customer value creation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1818\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1741\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Quantitative Methods &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1818\">Learn statistical and analytical techniques for business decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qps1ns\" data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1878\">Semester 2: Developing Strategic and Analytical Skills</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"2034\">The second semester focuses on management functions, business strategy, analytics, and operational excellence while strengthening managerial competencies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2702\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2046\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2071\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2702\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2197\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2127\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cost &amp; Management Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2197\">Learn cost analysis, budgeting, and managerial financial planning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2305\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2226\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2305\">Understand workforce planning, talent management, and employee development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2405\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2329\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2405\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop skills for long-term business planning and competitive strategy.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2427\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2499\">Learn data-driven decision-making and business performance analysis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2595\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2527\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspect of Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2595\">Understand corporate laws, contracts, and regulatory frameworks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2702\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operations Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2702\">Study process optimization, productivity improvement, and resource management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1npttyo\" data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2757\">Semester 3: Advanced Marketing and Brand Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2923\">The third semester transitions into specialized marketing subjects that help students understand customer behavior, branding, market research, and sales management.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"3686\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2960\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2960\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2935\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2960\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3686\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3085\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3005\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Finance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3085\">Understand investment decisions, financial planning, and capital management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3184\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3184\">Learn research design, data collection, and market analysis techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3264\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3204\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project Pre-work</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3264\">Develop research frameworks and project planning skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3364\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3284\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Brand Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3364\">Learn how brands are created, positioned, and managed for long-term success.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3365\" data-end=\"3469\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3365\" data-end=\"3386\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Consumer Behaviour</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3469\">Understand customer psychology, buying patterns, and decision-making processes.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3588\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3508\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Integrated Marketing Communications</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3588\">Study advertising, public relations, and multi-channel marketing strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3686\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3608\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sales Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3686\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn sales planning, customer acquisition, and revenue growth strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wkt7vt\" data-start=\"3688\" data-end=\"3747\">Semester 4: Global Marketing and Digital Transformation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3945\">The final semester focuses on emerging marketing trends, sustainability, international business, and digital marketing while allowing students to apply their knowledge through a practical project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"4690\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3982\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3982\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3957\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"3982\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4690\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4097\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4031\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Ethos &amp; Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4097\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Explore ethical leadership and responsible business practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4098\" data-end=\"4191\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4098\" data-end=\"4125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Sustainability</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4191\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Understand sustainable business strategies and ESG principles.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4192\" data-end=\"4288\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4192\" data-end=\"4217\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4217\" data-end=\"4288\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Learn global business operations and international market dynamics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4289\" data-end=\"4371\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4289\" data-end=\"4299\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4371\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Apply theoretical knowledge to solve real-world business challenges.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4471\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4398\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4398\" data-end=\"4471\">Study global branding, export marketing, and cross-border strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4553\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4493\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Services Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4493\" data-end=\"4553\">Learn marketing strategies for service-based industries.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4554\" data-end=\"4690\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4554\" data-end=\"4574\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Digital Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4574\" data-end=\"4690\">Gain expertise in SEO, social media marketing, content marketing, paid advertising, and online brand management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 105000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(445, 81, 'a43ce1c1-07c6-48ac-9fe4-9e7e2a0894ec', '99ab210c-64fc-4773-adb7-798ae6d00459', 333, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 02:18:40', '2026-05-30 02:18:40', '<p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"488\">The <strong data-start=\"99\" data-end=\"127\">Online Admission Process</strong> is designed to provide a seamless and convenient enrollment experience for students seeking admission to the online program. Candidates are encouraged to complete their registration and admission formalities within the prescribed timelines to avoid late fees and ensure timely access to learning resources, academic support, examinations, and student services.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"750\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"537\">Online Admission Schedule</strong>, registration deadlines, and re-registration dates is essential for both new applicants and existing learners. Applying early not only helps avoid additional charges but also ensures a smoother admission journey.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1prduqr\" data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"786\">Online Admission Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"1001\">Students applying for fresh admission must complete the registration and fee payment process within the specified admission window. Early application is recommended to secure admission without incurring late fees.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1033\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1087\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1104\">19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1134\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1168\">19 March 2026 &ndash; 10 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1238\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1203\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission with Late Fee of ₹500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1238\">11 August 2026 &ndash; 31 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1315\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1275\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1315\">1 September 2026 &ndash; 16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1341\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Last Date of Admission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1362\">16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c5uu40\" data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1405\">Step-by-Step Online Admission Process</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1519\">The <strong data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1439\">Online Admission Process</strong> is simple, transparent, and can be completed entirely online from any location.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1553\">Step 1: Online Registration</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1690\">Begin the admission process by registering on the university admission portal using your basic personal, academic, and contact details.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1741\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1898\">Fill out the online application form carefully and provide accurate educational and personal information. Ensure all details match your official documents.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1938\">Step 3: Upload Required Documents</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"2055\">Submit the necessary academic certificates, identity proof, photographs, and supporting documents for verification.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2081\">Step 4: Fee Payment</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2209\">Pay the applicable program fee through the available online payment methods to confirm your application and admission request.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2245\">Step 5: Document Verification</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2374\">The university verifies the submitted documents and checks whether the applicant meets the prescribed eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2411\">Step 6: Admission Confirmation</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2549\">Upon successful verification, candidates receive admission confirmation, enrollment details, and access to the online learning platform.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bqziht\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2591\">Online Re-Registration Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2783\">Existing students must complete the <strong data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2663\">Online Re-Registration Process</strong> within the specified timeline to continue their studies in the upcoming semester or academic year without interruption.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"3101\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2821\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2821\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2812\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"3101\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2902\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2885\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2885\" data-end=\"2902\">19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2970\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2938\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2970\">19 March 2026 &ndash; 31 July 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3050\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3013\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3050\">1 August 2026 &ndash; 10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3101\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3080\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Closure of Re-Registration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3101\">10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"522\">The <strong data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"135\">Online MBA Eligibility Criteria</strong> are designed to ensure that candidates have the academic foundation required to successfully pursue advanced management education. The Online MBA program welcomes graduates from diverse academic backgrounds, making it an ideal choice for fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, business owners, and individuals seeking career advancement through flexible online learning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"778\">Whether you aim to build leadership skills, transition into management roles, improve your career prospects, or enhance your business knowledge, meeting the prescribed <strong data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"741\">Online MBA admission eligibility requirements</strong> is the first step toward enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k8fv3a\" data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"819\">Online MBA Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"921\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"860\">Online MBA Program</strong>, candidates must fulfill the following eligibility criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1499\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16twwrh\" data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1010\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"962\">Bachelor\'s Degree (10+2+3)</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9o4wxg\" data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1147\">Candidates with an equivalent qualification recognized by the <strong data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1119\">Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</strong> are also eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14w971x\" data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1255\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1210\">50% aggregate marks at the graduation level</strong> is required for General category candidates.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6gi4ib\" data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1397\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1317\">SC, ST, OBC, and PwD categories</strong> are eligible with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1372\">45% aggregate marks</strong> at the graduation level.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13q5n51\" data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1499\">Admission is subject to document verification and fulfillment of university admission requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10p9b96\" data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1542\">Online MBA Qualification Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1743\">The Online MBA program accepts graduates from a wide range of academic streams. Unlike specialized postgraduate programs, an MBA does not restrict applicants to a particular undergraduate discipline.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1779\">Eligible candidates may come from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1998\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gsnogm\" data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1819\">Commerce and Business Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qjzq7l\" data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1844\">Science and Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fsyzuy\" data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1866\">Arts and Humanities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b5uzfz\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1897\">Engineering and Architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d8ggy8\" data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1928\">Computer Applications and IT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sig3f6\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1959\">Healthcare and Allied Fields</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"34x62k\" data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1998\">Management and Professional Programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2140\">This diverse learning environment helps students gain broader business perspectives while developing managerial and leadership competencies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uwqhq9\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2181\">Who Should Apply for an Online MBA?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2321\">The Online MBA program is suitable for individuals seeking professional growth, career advancement, and business leadership opportunities.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2792\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15xvlmu\" data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2404\"><strong data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2344\">Fresh Graduates</strong> looking to strengthen their management and business skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ibszka\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2495\"><strong data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2432\">Working Professionals</strong> aiming for promotions, leadership positions, or salary growth.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"idn6l3\" data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2611\"><strong data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2535\">Entrepreneurs and Business Owners</strong> seeking expertise in business strategy, finance, marketing, and operations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1taab7f\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2694\"><strong data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2634\">Career Switchers</strong> planning to transition into management and corporate roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ouoo32\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2792\"><strong data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2720\">Corporate Employees</strong> looking to enhance managerial capabilities while continuing their jobs.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>Online MBA Fee Structure 2026: Semester-Wise Fees, Annual Fees, Scholarship &amp; Payment Options</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Online MBA Fee Structure</strong> is designed to provide flexibility and affordability for students, working professionals, entrepreneurs, and aspiring business leaders. To accommodate different financial preferences, the university offers convenient <strong>semester-wise fee payment</strong>, <strong>annual fee payment</strong>, and a <strong>one-time full fee payment option</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you are looking for an affordable Online MBA, flexible payment plans, education loan support, or scholarship benefits, understanding the complete Online MBA fees can help you make an informed admission decision.</p>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<p>Students can choose their preferred Online MBA fee payment option based on their convenience and financial planning.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester-Wise Fee (4 Semesters)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹55,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Fee (2 Years)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹105,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>One-Time Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Additional Fees &amp; Charges</h3>\r\n<p>Apart from the Online MBA program fee, students should consider the following academic and administrative charges.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Particulars</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admission Processing Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Initial Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹10,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per subject per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Project Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Fee Payment Options</h3>\r\n<p>The university provides multiple payment plans to make higher education more accessible and manageable for learners from diverse professional and academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<h4>Semester-Wise Fee Payment</h4>\r\n<p>The semester-wise payment option allows students to pay the program fee across four semesters, making it easier to manage educational expenses while continuing professional or personal commitments.</p>\r\n<h4>Annual Fee Payment</h4>\r\n<p>Students who prefer yearly payments can opt for the annual fee plan, which divides the Online MBA fees across two academic years.</p>\r\n<h4>One-Time Full Fee Payment</h4>\r\n<p>Applicants also have the option to pay the complete <strong>Online MBA program fee of ₹196,000</strong> at the time of admission for added convenience and simplified financial planning.</p>\r\n<h3>Scholarship for Defence &amp; Paramilitary Personnel</h3>\r\n<p>As part of its commitment to supporting the nation\'s service personnel, the university offers a special scholarship policy for eligible candidates.</p>\r\n<h4>Scholarship Benefits</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Armed Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Paramilitary Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Defence Service Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Eligible Dependents of Service Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Qualified applicants can avail a <strong>20% discount on the Online MBA program fee</strong>, helping reduce the overall cost of earning a postgraduate management degree.</p>\r\n<h3>Education Loan &amp; No Cost EMI Facilities</h3>\r\n<p>To make quality management education accessible to a wider audience, the university offers various financing solutions.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Education loan facilities available for eligible students.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>No Cost EMI options for convenient fee payment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Financial assistance without requiring a credit card.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Flexible repayment options through approved financing partners.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These financing options allow students to pursue an Online MBA without creating a significant financial burden.</p>\r\n<h3>Why Understanding the Online MBA Fee Structure Matters</h3>\r\n<p>When comparing Online MBA programs, students should evaluate more than just the tuition fee. Factors such as scholarship opportunities, examination charges, project fees, financing options, and payment flexibility play a crucial role in determining the actual cost of education.</p>\r\n<p>A well-planned fee structure enables learners to balance their academic goals with their financial responsibilities while gaining access to quality management education and career advancement opportunities.</p>\r\n<h3>Important Fee Guidelines</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>An admission processing fee of ₹1,200 is applicable for all admissions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>₹10,000 is collected during registration and adjusted against the program fee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Examination fees are charged separately at ₹800 per subject per attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Project evaluation fees are charged separately at ₹800 per attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Fee structure and university policies are subject to revision.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Demand Draft payments should be made in favour of <strong>&ldquo;SVKM\'s NMIMS&rdquo;</strong>, payable at Mumbai.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Students are advised to contact a student counsellor for the latest Online MBA fee details and financing options.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>fee payment.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"390\">The Online MBA curriculum is strategically designed to develop future business leaders, managers, entrepreneurs, and decision-makers. The program combines core management principles with modern business practices, helping students build expertise in finance, marketing, human resources, operations, analytics, digital business, and strategic management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"822\">This industry-focused MBA syllabus equips learners with practical business knowledge, analytical thinking, leadership capabilities, and problem-solving skills required in today\'s competitive corporate environment. Through a combination of management fundamentals, business analytics, digital transformation, and project-based learning, students gain the skills needed to succeed across diverse industries and management functions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vke2d0\" data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"873\">Semester 1: Foundation of Business Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"1065\">The first semester introduces students to the fundamental concepts of business, economics, communication, and management that form the backbone of effective decision-making in organizations.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1102\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1102\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1077\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1102\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1247\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1152\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1247\">Develop professional communication, presentation, negotiation, and business writing skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1364\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1271\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1364\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand financial statements, accounting principles, and business reporting practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1484\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1403\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Micro Economics and Macro Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1484\">Learn economic concepts that influence business strategy and market dynamics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1593\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1512\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Organisational Behaviour</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1593\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study employee behavior, motivation, leadership, and workplace effectiveness.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1710\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1617\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1710\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore marketing principles, customer value creation, and market positioning strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1738\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Quantitative Methods &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1811\" data-col-size=\"md\">Build analytical and statistical skills for business decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12i35y7\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1864\">Semester 2: Strategic and Functional Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"2043\">The second semester focuses on developing managerial capabilities across key business functions while introducing students to strategic thinking and data-driven decision-making.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2080\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2080\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2055\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2080\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2228\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2136\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cost &amp; Management Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2228\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn budgeting, cost control, financial planning, and managerial accounting techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2342\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2257\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2342\">Understand talent acquisition, performance management, and workforce development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2458\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2366\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2458\">Develop skills for long-term planning, competitive advantage, and organizational growth.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2564\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2480\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2564\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn how data analytics supports business intelligence and strategic decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2670\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2592\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspect of Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2670\">Understand business laws, corporate governance, and regulatory compliance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2695\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operations Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2777\">Study process optimization, productivity improvement, and resource management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ktf8aa\" data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2842\">Semester 3: Advanced Business and Organizational Excellence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2995\">The third semester strengthens students\' understanding of finance, research, organizational design, technology management, and supply chain operations.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3812\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3032\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3032\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3007\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3032\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3812\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3152\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3077\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Finance</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3152\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn investment decisions, capital management, and financial strategy.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3262\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3176\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3262\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop business research, data collection, and analytical problem-solving skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3353\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3282\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project Pre-work</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3353\">Build the foundation for successful project planning and execution.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3473\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3391\" data-col-size=\"md\">Information Systems for Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3473\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand how technology and information systems support business operations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3568\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3495\" data-col-size=\"md\">Consumer Behaviour</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3568\">Analyze customer psychology, purchasing decisions, and market trends.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3697\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3615\" data-col-size=\"md\">Organisational Theory, Structure and Design</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3697\">Learn how organizational structures influence business performance and growth.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3812\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3724\" data-col-size=\"md\">Supply Chain Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3812\">Explore procurement, logistics, inventory management, and supply chain optimization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dk6bia\" data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3880\">Semester 4: Innovation, Leadership and Business Transformation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"4115\">The final semester focuses on entrepreneurship, sustainability, international business, digital transformation, and project management while enabling students to apply their learning through a comprehensive industry-oriented project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4977\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4152\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4152\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4127\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4152\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4977\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4286\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4201\" data-col-size=\"md\">Indian Ethos &amp; Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4286\">Understand ethical leadership, corporate values, and responsible decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4287\" data-end=\"4395\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4287\" data-end=\"4314\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Sustainability</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4314\" data-end=\"4395\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn sustainable business practices and long-term value creation strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4507\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4421\" data-col-size=\"md\">International Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4507\">Explore global markets, international trade, and cross-border business operations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4608\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4518\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4608\" data-col-size=\"md\">Apply MBA concepts to solve real-world business challenges through practical research.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4609\" data-end=\"4754\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4609\" data-end=\"4659\" data-col-size=\"md\">Entrepreneurship and Venture Capital Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4659\" data-end=\"4754\">Learn startup development, business innovation, fundraising, and venture growth strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4755\" data-end=\"4869\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4755\" data-end=\"4775\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4775\" data-end=\"4869\">Gain knowledge of SEO, social media marketing, content marketing, and digital advertising.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4870\" data-end=\"4977\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4870\" data-end=\"4891\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4891\" data-end=\"4977\">Develop expertise in project planning, execution, monitoring, and risk management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nvvoej\" data-start=\"4979\" data-end=\"5027\">Key Skills Developed Through the MBA Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5029\" data-end=\"5157\">Upon completion of the Online MBA program, students develop highly sought-after business and management competencies, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5159\" data-end=\"5525\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199nojf\" data-start=\"5159\" data-end=\"5188\">Strategic Business Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18wo778\" data-start=\"5189\" data-end=\"5221\">Leadership and Team Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d89pe\" data-start=\"5222\" data-end=\"5262\">Financial Analysis and Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qxexu1\" data-start=\"5263\" data-end=\"5307\">Business Analytics and Data Interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"164zzg\" data-start=\"5308\" data-end=\"5341\">Marketing and Consumer Insights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1povz9k\" data-start=\"5342\" data-end=\"5382\">Operations and Supply Chain Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16lt0w0\" data-start=\"5383\" data-end=\"5424\">Digital Business and Marketing Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xmerwc\" data-start=\"5425\" data-end=\"5469\">Entrepreneurship and Innovation Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ly77e3\" data-start=\"5470\" data-end=\"5495\">Corporate Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9blra\" data-start=\"5496\" data-end=\"5525\">Project and Risk Management</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 196000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(446, 81, 'a43ce1c1-07c6-48ac-9fe4-9e7e2a0894ec', '99ab210c-64fc-4773-adb7-798ae6d00459', 334, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 02:33:26', '2026-06-17 00:32:04', '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"499\">he <strong data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"151\">Online MBA Finance Admission Process</strong> is designed to provide students and working professionals with a simple, transparent, and fully online enrollment experience. Candidates interested in pursuing an <strong data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"340\">Online MBA in Finance</strong> should complete their registration, document verification, and fee payment within the prescribed admission deadlines to secure their seat and avoid late fees.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"841\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"549\">Online MBA admission dates</strong>, registration schedule, application deadlines, and re-registration timeline is essential for a smooth admission journey. Applying early helps students receive faster admission confirmation, quicker document verification, and timely access to academic resources and online learning platforms.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h3qs1x\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"889\">Online MBA Finance Admission Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"1022\">Students seeking admission to the <strong data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"955\">Online MBA Finance program</strong> must complete the admission process within the specified timeline.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1383\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1045\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1054\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1383\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1108\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1155\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1189\">19 March 2026 &ndash; 10 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1259\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1224\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission with Late Fee of ₹500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1259\">11 August 2026 &ndash; 31 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1336\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1296\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1336\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1 September 2026 &ndash; 16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1383\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1362\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Last Date of Admission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1383\">16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6autjq\" data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1438\">Step-by-Step Online MBA Finance Admission Process</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1629\">The <strong data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1484\">Online MBA Finance admission process</strong> can be completed entirely online, making it convenient for graduates, working professionals, and business executives across different locations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1663\">Step 1: Online Registration</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1793\">Begin your Online MBA Finance application by registering on the university admission portal and creating your applicant account.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1844\">Step 2: Fill Out the Online Application Form</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1980\">Complete the Online MBA admission form by entering your academic qualifications, personal details, and contact information accurately.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2020\">Step 3: Upload Required Documents</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2159\">Submit all necessary documents, including graduation mark sheets, identity proof, photographs, and category certificates (if applicable).</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2195\">Step 4: Pay the Admission Fee</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2304\">Complete the fee payment using the available online payment options to confirm your application submission.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2340\">Step 5: Document Verification</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2477\">The university reviews and verifies the submitted documents to ensure that candidates meet the Online MBA Finance eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2514\">Step 6: Admission Confirmation</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2653\">After successful verification, candidates receive admission confirmation, enrollment details, and access to the online learning platform.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q3dmx3\" data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2707\">Online MBA Finance Re-Registration Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2859\">Existing students must complete the <strong data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2783\">Online MBA re-registration process</strong> within the specified period to continue their studies without interruption.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"3177\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2897\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2897\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2888\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2897\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"3177\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"2978\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"2961\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2978\">19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3046\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3014\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3046\">19 March 2026 &ndash; 31 July 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3126\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3089\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3126\">1 August 2026 &ndash; 10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3177\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3156\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Closure of Re-Registration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3177\">10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"r3ym7c\" data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3234\">Documents Required for Online MBA Finance Admission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3338\">Applicants should keep the following documents ready before starting the Online MBA admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3340\" data-end=\"3554\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"118nfzx\" data-start=\"3340\" data-end=\"3388\">Graduation degree certificate and mark sheets.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mjrufx\" data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3430\">Government-issued photo identity proof.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tq1vja\" data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3458\">Passport-size photograph.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tt35z4\" data-start=\"3459\" data-end=\"3498\">Category certificate (if applicable).</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u6jh4z\" data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3554\">Any additional documents requested by the university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3650\">Preparing these documents in advance can help speed up the admission and verification process.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"594\">The <strong data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"151\">Online MBA Finance Eligibility Criteria</strong> are designed to ensure that applicants possess the academic foundation required to successfully pursue advanced studies in finance, investment management, banking, corporate finance, and business strategy. The <strong data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"392\">Online MBA Finance program</strong> is open to graduates from all academic backgrounds, making it an excellent choice for fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, and individuals seeking career growth in the finance sector.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"823\">Before applying, candidates should carefully review the <strong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"709\">Online MBA Finance admission eligibility requirements</strong>, minimum marks criteria, and qualification requirements to ensure they meet the university\'s admission standards.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"in497y\" data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"872\">Online MBA Finance Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"977\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"916\">Online MBA in Finance</strong>, candidates must fulfill the following eligibility criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1566\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16twwrh\" data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1066\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1018\">Bachelor\'s Degree (10+2+3)</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9o4wxg\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1203\">Candidates with an equivalent qualification recognized by the <strong data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1175\">Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</strong> are also eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14w971x\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1311\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1266\">50% aggregate marks at the graduation level</strong> is required for General category candidates.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6gi4ib\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1453\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1373\">SC, ST, OBC, and PwD categories</strong> are eligible with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1428\">45% aggregate marks</strong> at the graduation level.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3gjjy1\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1566\">Admission is subject to successful document verification and fulfillment of university admission requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kp2roy\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1617\">Online MBA Finance Qualification Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1819\">One of the key advantages of an Online MBA Finance program is that it accepts graduates from diverse educational backgrounds. Candidates are not required to have a finance or commerce degree to apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1855\">Eligible applicants may come from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"2131\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ukdlxb\" data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1882\">Commerce and Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1capbbs\" data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1923\">Business Administration and Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqsb7g\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1952\">Engineering and Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h2rz43\" data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1978\">Science and Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fsyzuy\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2000\">Arts and Humanities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1adxps7\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2051\">Computer Applications and Information Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sig3f6\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2082\">Healthcare and Allied Fields</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b8pqnm\" data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2131\">Any other recognized bachelor\'s degree program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2283\">This multidisciplinary approach allows students to develop financial expertise while benefiting from varied perspectives and professional experiences.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ifciuk\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2329\">Who Can Apply for an Online MBA Finance?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2497\">The <strong data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2364\">Online MBA Finance course</strong> is suitable for individuals looking to build expertise in financial management, investment planning, banking, and corporate finance.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2968\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ziv07\" data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2573\"><strong data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2520\">Fresh Graduates</strong> seeking specialized management education in finance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bs15on\" data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2676\"><strong data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2601\">Working Professionals</strong> aiming for career advancement in finance, banking, and investment sectors.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xgyqme\" data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2771\"><strong data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2701\">Finance Executives</strong> looking to strengthen their financial analysis and leadership skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc7utg\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2866\"><strong data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2811\">Entrepreneurs and Business Owners</strong> seeking better financial decision-making capabilities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ik9hpe\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2968\"><strong data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2889\">Career Switchers</strong> planning to transition into finance, banking, investment, or consulting roles.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>Online MBA Finance Fee Structure 2026: Semester-Wise Fees, Annual Fees, Scholarship &amp; EMI Options</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Online MBA Finance Fee Structure</strong> is designed to provide students and working professionals with flexible payment options that make quality management education more accessible. Whether you prefer paying semester-wise, annually, or through a one-time payment, the program offers multiple fee plans to suit different financial requirements.</p>\r\n<p>For students comparing the <strong>Online MBA Finance fees</strong>, it is important to consider not only the tuition fees but also additional charges, scholarship benefits, financing options, and the long-term career value offered by the program. With specialized finance subjects, industry-focused learning, and flexible payment modes, the program provides strong value for learners seeking careers in banking, investment management, corporate finance, financial consulting, and wealth management.</p>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Finance Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<p>Students can choose the most convenient fee payment option based on their financial planning and learning preferences.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester-Wise Fee (4 Semesters)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹55,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Fee (2 Years)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹105,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>One-Time Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Additional Fees &amp; Charges</h3>\r\n<p>Apart from the Online MBA Finance program fee, students should also consider the following academic and administrative charges.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Particulars</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admission Processing Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Initial Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹10,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per subject per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Project Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Finance Fee Payment Options</h3>\r\n<p>The university offers multiple fee payment options to help students manage their educational investment effectively.</p>\r\n<h4>Semester-Wise Payment Plan</h4>\r\n<p>The semester-wise fee option allows students to spread the program cost across four semesters, making higher education more manageable and budget-friendly.</p>\r\n<h4>Annual Payment Plan</h4>\r\n<p>Students can choose the annual fee payment option and pay the program fee across two academic years, reducing the need for frequent payments.</p>\r\n<h4>One-Time Full Fee Payment</h4>\r\n<p>Applicants also have the flexibility to pay the entire <strong>Online MBA Finance program fee of ₹196,000</strong> in a single payment if preferred.</p>\r\n<h3>Scholarship for Armed Forces &amp; Paramilitary Personnel</h3>\r\n<p>To support service personnel and their families, the university offers a dedicated scholarship benefit.</p>\r\n<h4>Scholarship Eligibility</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Armed Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Paramilitary Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Defence Service Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Eligible Dependents</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Qualified candidates can receive a <strong>20% discount on the Online MBA Finance program fee</strong>, helping reduce the overall cost of earning a postgraduate finance degree.</p>\r\n<h3>Education Loan &amp; No Cost EMI Facilities</h3>\r\n<p>The university understands that financing higher education is an important consideration for many learners. To support students, several financing solutions are available.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Education loan facilities for eligible applicants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>No Cost EMI options for convenient fee payment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Flexible financing plans for working professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Financial support available even without a credit card.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Assistance from admission counsellors regarding available payment options.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These facilities help students pursue an Online MBA Finance without placing excessive pressure on their finances.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"587\">The <strong data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"149\">Online MBA Finance syllabus</strong> is designed to equip students with advanced knowledge of financial management, investment analysis, corporate finance, banking, taxation, portfolio management, and international finance. This industry-oriented <strong data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"393\">Online MBA Finance curriculum</strong> combines core business management subjects with specialized finance courses, helping learners develop the analytical, strategic, and decision-making skills required in today\'s financial sector.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"1034\">The <strong data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"632\">Online MBA Finance course structure</strong> focuses on building expertise in financial planning, investment strategies, risk management, corporate valuation, capital markets, and global financial systems. Through a blend of management fundamentals and finance specialization subjects, students gain practical knowledge that can be applied across banking, investment firms, financial consulting, insurance, fintech, and corporate finance domains.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"iqbnwx\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1080\">Online MBA Finance Curriculum Highlights</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1107\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1107\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1096\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1107\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1174\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Name</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1174\">Online MBA in Finance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1205\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1194\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1205\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1229\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1224\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1229\">4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1246\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Mode</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1256\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1296\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1274\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1296\">Finance Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1312\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project Work</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1324\">Included</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1342\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Industry Focus</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1394\">Finance, Banking, Investment &amp; Corporate Finance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"p9cbrt\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1454\">What Will You Learn in the Online MBA Finance Program?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1841\">The <strong data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1490\">Online MBA Finance program</strong> helps students understand how organizations manage capital, investments, financial risks, taxation, and global financial operations. Learners develop expertise in financial decision-making, business valuation, investment banking, portfolio management, and strategic financial planning while strengthening their managerial and leadership capabilities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1oyic0m\" data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1906\">Semester 1: Foundation of Business and Financial Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"2051\">The first semester establishes a strong foundation in business administration, economics, accounting, communication, and quantitative analysis.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2108\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2108\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2083\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online MBA Finance Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2108\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2248\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2158\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2248\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop professional communication, presentation, and managerial communication skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2350\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2272\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2350\">Learn accounting principles, financial statements, and business reporting.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2468\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2387\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Micro Economics &amp; Macro Economics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2468\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand economic concepts that influence financial and business decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2571\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2496\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Organisational Behaviour</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2571\">Study workplace behavior, leadership, and organizational effectiveness.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2656\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2595\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2656\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn customer-focused business and marketing strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2684\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Quantitative Methods &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2766\" data-col-size=\"md\">Build analytical and statistical skills for business and finance applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xcvcr7\" data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2822\">Semester 2: Core Business Management and Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2940\">The second semester focuses on strategic management, business operations, analytics, and managerial decision-making.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"3603\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2997\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2997\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2972\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online MBA Finance Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"2997\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3603\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3124\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3053\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cost &amp; Management Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3124\">Understand budgeting, cost analysis, and financial control systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3219\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3153\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3219\">Learn workforce planning and organizational talent management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3319\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3243\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3319\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop strategic thinking and long-term business planning capabilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3413\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3341\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3413\">Use data-driven insights for business and financial decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3509\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3441\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspect of Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3441\" data-end=\"3509\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand corporate laws, compliance, and business regulations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3603\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3534\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operations Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"3603\">Learn process optimization and operational efficiency management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gbnm2f\" data-start=\"3605\" data-end=\"3661\">Semester 3: Advanced Finance Specialization Subjects</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3822\">The third semester introduces specialized <strong data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3729\">MBA Finance subjects</strong> that focus on investments, financial markets, valuation, and strategic financial management.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"4612\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"3879\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"3879\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"3854\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online MBA Finance Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3879\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3904\" data-end=\"4612\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3904\" data-end=\"4005\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3904\" data-end=\"3924\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Finance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"4005\">Learn capital budgeting, funding decisions, and corporate financial strategy.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4098\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4029\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4029\" data-end=\"4098\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop financial research and analytical problem-solving skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4181\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project Pre-work</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4181\" data-col-size=\"md\">Prepare frameworks and methodologies for the final project.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4304\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4224\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Capital Market and Portfolio Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4304\">Understand stock markets, investment strategies, and portfolio optimization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4305\" data-end=\"4413\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4305\" data-end=\"4326\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Valuation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4413\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn valuation techniques used in mergers, acquisitions, and investment decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4414\" data-end=\"4512\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4414\" data-end=\"4438\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Derivatives</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4438\" data-end=\"4512\">Study futures, options, hedging strategies, and risk management tools.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4612\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4541\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Cost Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4541\" data-end=\"4612\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn cost optimization and value-driven financial decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"z1x1f8\" data-start=\"4614\" data-end=\"4666\">Semester 4: Global Finance, Banking and Taxation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4821\">The final semester focuses on international finance, taxation, investment banking, and real-world financial applications through a comprehensive project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4823\" data-end=\"5603\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4823\" data-end=\"4878\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4823\" data-end=\"4878\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4823\" data-end=\"4853\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online MBA Finance Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4853\" data-end=\"4878\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4903\" data-end=\"5603\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4903\" data-end=\"4996\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4903\" data-end=\"4927\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Ethos &amp; Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4927\" data-end=\"4996\">Understand ethical leadership and responsible business practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4997\" data-end=\"5090\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4997\" data-end=\"5024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Sustainability</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5024\" data-end=\"5090\">Learn sustainable financial and business management practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5091\" data-end=\"5191\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5091\" data-end=\"5116\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5116\" data-end=\"5191\">Explore global trade, finance, and international business environments.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5192\" data-end=\"5283\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5192\" data-end=\"5202\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5202\" data-end=\"5283\" data-col-size=\"md\">Apply financial concepts to solve real-world business and finance challenges.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5284\" data-end=\"5376\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5284\" data-end=\"5309\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Tax Planning</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5309\" data-end=\"5376\">Learn tax strategies, compliance, and corporate tax management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5377\" data-end=\"5486\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5377\" data-end=\"5398\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Investment Banking</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5486\">Understand mergers, acquisitions, capital raising, and investment advisory services.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5487\" data-end=\"5603\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5487\" data-end=\"5511\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Finance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5511\" data-end=\"5603\">Study foreign exchange markets, global investments, and international financial systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14yclo1\" data-start=\"5605\" data-end=\"5651\">Online MBA Finance Skills You Will Develop</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5653\" data-end=\"5796\">The <strong data-start=\"5657\" data-end=\"5690\">Online MBA Finance curriculum</strong> helps learners build highly sought-after finance and management skills that are valued across industries.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5798\" data-end=\"6132\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t6zfg6\" data-start=\"5798\" data-end=\"5832\">Financial Analysis and Reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"79zr0w\" data-start=\"5833\" data-end=\"5863\">Corporate Finance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"algwyj\" data-start=\"5864\" data-end=\"5885\">Investment Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10codd\" data-start=\"5886\" data-end=\"5908\">Portfolio Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qjs07x\" data-start=\"5909\" data-end=\"5929\">Business Valuation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rmdg7l\" data-start=\"5930\" data-end=\"5957\">Financial Risk Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6wcnuj\" data-start=\"5958\" data-end=\"5982\">Corporate Tax Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jkl3b0\" data-start=\"5983\" data-end=\"6012\">Investment Banking Concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bqhov0\" data-start=\"6013\" data-end=\"6038\">Capital Market Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ybf7\" data-start=\"6039\" data-end=\"6076\">Strategic Financial Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v3fx4\" data-start=\"6077\" data-end=\"6097\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j6s3pn\" data-start=\"6098\" data-end=\"6132\">Leadership and Management Skills</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 196000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(447, 81, 'a43ce1c1-07c6-48ac-9fe4-9e7e2a0894ec', '99ab210c-64fc-4773-adb7-798ae6d00459', 225, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 02:51:28', '2026-05-30 02:51:28', '<p data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"542\">The <strong data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"187\">Online MBA Human Resource Management Admission Process</strong> is designed to provide a smooth, transparent, and fully digital enrollment experience for students and working professionals. Candidates interested in pursuing an <strong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"400\">Online MBA in Human Resource Management (HRM)</strong> should complete their registration, application submission, document verification, and fee payment within the prescribed admission deadlines.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"829\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"595\">Online MBA HR admission dates</strong>, registration timeline, application deadlines, and re-registration schedule is essential for securing admission without late fees and ensuring uninterrupted access to academic resources, online classes, and learning support services.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"olnb6f\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"872\">Online MBA HR Admission Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"1046\">Applicants seeking admission to the <strong data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"958\">Online MBA Human Resource Management program</strong> must complete the admission process according to the official schedule mentioned below.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1069\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1078\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1132\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1179\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">19 March 2026 &ndash; 10 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1283\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1248\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission with Late Fee of ₹500</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1283\" data-col-size=\"sm\">11 August 2026 &ndash; 31 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1360\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1320\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1360\">1 September 2026 &ndash; 16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1386\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Last Date of Admission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1407\">16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a7urok\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1457\">Step-by-Step Online MBA HR Admission Process</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1662\">The <strong data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1498\">Online MBA HR admission process</strong> can be completed entirely online, making it convenient for graduates, HR professionals, managers, entrepreneurs, and working executives across different locations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1696\">Step 1: Online Registration</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1834\">Start your admission journey by registering on the university admission portal using your basic personal, academic, and contact details.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1885\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"2003\">Fill out the Online MBA HR application form carefully and provide accurate educational and professional information.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2043\">Step 3: Upload Required Documents</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2210\">Submit all necessary documents, including graduation certificates, mark sheets, identity proof, passport-size photographs, and category certificates (if applicable).</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2246\">Step 4: Pay the Admission Fee</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2357\">Complete the fee payment through the available online payment options to confirm your application submission.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2393\">Step 5: Document Verification</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2532\">The university verifies the submitted documents and checks whether applicants meet the prescribed <strong data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2531\">Online MBA HR eligibility criteria</strong>.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2569\">Step 6: Admission Confirmation</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2712\">After successful verification, candidates receive admission confirmation, enrollment credentials, and access to the online learning platform.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"z9s4r9\" data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2761\">Online MBA HR Re-Registration Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2940\">Existing students must complete the <strong data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2837\">Online MBA re-registration process</strong> within the specified timeline to continue their studies in the upcoming semester without interruption.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"3258\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2978\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2978\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2969\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"2978\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3258\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3059\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3059\" data-col-size=\"sm\">19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3127\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3095\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3127\">19 March 2026 &ndash; 31 July 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3207\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3170\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3170\" data-end=\"3207\">1 August 2026 &ndash; 10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3258\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3237\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Closure of Re-Registration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3258\">10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"waoepm\" data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3310\">Documents Required for Online MBA HR Admission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3419\">To ensure a smooth admission process, applicants should keep the following documents ready before applying:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3641\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"118nfzx\" data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3469\">Graduation degree certificate and mark sheets.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mjrufx\" data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3511\">Government-issued photo identity proof.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ptkenh\" data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3546\">Recent passport-size photograph.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tt35z4\" data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3586\">Category certificate (if applicable).</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"coumxm\" data-start=\"3587\" data-end=\"3641\">Any additional documents required by the university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3744\">Having all required documents prepared in advance helps speed up verification and admission approval.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"122\" data-end=\"699\">The <strong data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"187\">Online MBA Human Resource Management Eligibility Criteria</strong> are designed to ensure that applicants have the academic foundation needed to succeed in advanced studies related to talent management, employee relations, organizational development, workforce planning, leadership, and strategic human resource management. The <strong data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"474\">Online MBA HR program</strong> is open to graduates from all academic backgrounds, making it an ideal choice for fresh graduates, working professionals, HR executives, entrepreneurs, and individuals looking to build a successful career in human resources.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"935\">Before applying, candidates should carefully review the <strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"799\">Online MBA HR eligibility requirements</strong>, minimum marks criteria, qualification requirements, and admission conditions to ensure they meet the university\'s admission standards.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ytg1q4\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"979\">Online MBA HR Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1102\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1041\">Online MBA in Human Resource Management</strong>, candidates must fulfill the following eligibility criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1691\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16twwrh\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1191\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1143\">Bachelor\'s Degree (10+2+3)</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9o4wxg\" data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1328\">Candidates with an equivalent qualification recognized by the <strong data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1300\">Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</strong> are also eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14w971x\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1436\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1391\">50% aggregate marks at the graduation level</strong> is required for General category candidates.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6gi4ib\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1578\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1498\">SC, ST, OBC, and PwD categories</strong> are eligible with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1553\">45% aggregate marks</strong> at the graduation level.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3gjjy1\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1691\">Admission is subject to successful document verification and fulfillment of university admission requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xt0pzw\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1760\">Online MBA Human Resource Management Qualification Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1988\">One of the key advantages of an <strong data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1818\">Online MBA HR course</strong> is that it welcomes candidates from diverse educational streams. Applicants are not required to have a background in management or human resources to pursue the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2024\">Eligible candidates may come from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2294\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gsnogm\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2064\">Commerce and Business Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fsyzuy\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2086\">Arts and Humanities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h2rz43\" data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2112\">Science and Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqsb7g\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2141\">Engineering and Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d8ggy8\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2172\">Computer Applications and IT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sig3f6\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2203\">Healthcare and Allied Fields</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"34x62k\" data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2242\">Management and Professional Programs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tu8sss\" data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2294\">Any other recognized bachelor\'s degree discipline</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2442\">This multidisciplinary learning environment enables students to combine their previous academic knowledge with modern HR and management practices.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dl3n7u\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2491\">Who Can Apply for an Online MBA HR Program?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2697\">The <strong data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2545\">Online MBA Human Resource Management program</strong> is suitable for individuals looking to build expertise in workforce management, employee engagement, talent acquisition, and organizational leadership.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"3268\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ardu8b\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2779\"><strong data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2720\">Fresh Graduates</strong> seeking a career in human resources and people management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jucj7b\" data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2870\"><strong data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2807\">Working Professionals</strong> aiming for promotions, leadership roles, or HR specialization.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9633i2\" data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2954\"><strong data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2905\">HR Executives and Recruiters</strong> looking to enhance their strategic HR knowledge.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m5cdr8\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"3044\"><strong data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2986\">Team Leaders and Managers</strong> seeking stronger people management and leadership skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cqsvvg\" data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3146\"><strong data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3084\">Entrepreneurs and Business Owners</strong> wanting to build effective workforce management capabilities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t2h0dd\" data-start=\"3147\" data-end=\"3268\"><strong data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3169\">Career Switchers</strong> planning to transition into HR, talent acquisition, training, or organizational development roles.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>Online MBA Human Resource Management Fee Structure 2026: Semester-Wise Fees, Annual Fees, Scholarship &amp; EMI Options</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Online MBA Human Resource Management Fee Structure</strong> is designed to provide flexibility, affordability, and convenience for students and working professionals seeking advanced HR and management education. With multiple payment options, scholarship benefits, and financing facilities, the program enables learners to pursue a recognized management degree without disrupting their financial planning.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you are comparing <strong>Online MBA HR fees</strong>, evaluating payment plans, exploring scholarship opportunities, or looking for education loan support, understanding the complete fee structure can help you make an informed admission decision.</p>\r\n<h3>Online MBA HR Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<p>Students can choose their preferred fee payment option based on convenience and financial requirements.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester-Wise Fee (4 Semesters)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹55,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Fee (2 Years)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹105,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>One-Time Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Additional Fees &amp; Charges</h3>\r\n<p>Apart from the Online MBA Human Resource Management program fee, students should consider the following academic and administrative charges.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Particulars</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admission Processing Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Initial Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹10,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per subject per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Project Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Online MBA HR Fee Payment Options</h3>\r\n<p>The university offers flexible payment plans to make quality management education accessible to a wider range of learners.</p>\r\n<h4>Semester-Wise Payment Plan</h4>\r\n<p>The semester-wise fee payment option allows students to distribute the total cost across four semesters, making it easier to manage educational expenses while continuing professional commitments.</p>\r\n<h4>Annual Payment Plan</h4>\r\n<p>Students who prefer yearly payments can opt for the annual fee plan, which divides the Online MBA HR fees into two manageable installments.</p>\r\n<h4>One-Time Full Fee Payment</h4>\r\n<p>Applicants also have the option to pay the complete <strong>Online MBA Human Resource Management program fee of ₹196,000</strong> in a single payment for added convenience and simplified financial planning.</p>\r\n<h3>Scholarship for Armed Forces &amp; Paramilitary Personnel</h3>\r\n<p>The university recognizes the contribution of defence and service personnel by offering a dedicated scholarship benefit.</p>\r\n<h4>Scholarship Eligibility</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Armed Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Paramilitary Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Defence Service Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Eligible Dependents</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Qualified applicants can avail a <strong>20% discount on the Online MBA HR program fee</strong>, reducing the overall cost of pursuing a postgraduate management degree.</p>\r\n<h3>Education Loan &amp; No Cost EMI Facilities</h3>\r\n<p>To support students in financing their higher education, the university provides multiple financial assistance options.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Education loan facilities for eligible applicants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>No Cost EMI options for convenient fee payment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Flexible financing solutions for working professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Financial assistance available even without a credit card.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Guidance from admission counsellors regarding available payment options.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These facilities help students pursue an Online MBA HR degree without creating a significant financial burden.</p>\r\n<h3>Important Fee Guidelines</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>An admission processing fee of ₹1,200 is applicable for all admissions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>₹10,000 is collected during registration and adjusted against the program fee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Examination fees are charged separately at ₹800 per subject per attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Project fees are charged separately at ₹800 per attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>The fee structure and university policies are subject to change.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Demand Draft payments should be made in favour of <strong>&ldquo;SVKM\'s NMIMS&rdquo;</strong>, payable at Mumbai.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Students are encouraged to contact a student counsellor for the latest fee details, scholarship information, and financing options.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Online MBA HR Fee Structure Highlights</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Particulars</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Program</td>\r\n<td>Online MBA Human Resource Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Duration</td>\r\n<td>2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td>4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td>₹55,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td>₹105,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td>₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Scholarship Available</td>\r\n<td>Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>EMI Facility</td>\r\n<td>Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Education Loan Support</td>\r\n<td>Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"599\">The <strong data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"191\">Online MBA Human Resource Management (HRM) syllabus</strong> is designed to prepare future HR leaders, talent management professionals, learning and development specialists, and organizational development experts. The program combines core business management subjects with specialized HR courses, enabling students to develop expertise in recruitment, employee engagement, compensation management, industrial relations, performance management, and workforce planning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"980\">The <strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"633\">Online MBA HR curriculum</strong> focuses on building strategic leadership, people management, organizational development, and business decision-making capabilities. Through a combination of management fundamentals, HR specialization subjects, and project-based learning, students gain the practical skills required to manage human capital in today\'s dynamic business environment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"arv4sj\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1021\">Online MBA HR Curriculum Highlights</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1048\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1048\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1037\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1048\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1133\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1090\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Name</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1133\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online MBA in Human Resource Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1164\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1153\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1164\" data-col-size=\"md\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1183\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1188\" data-col-size=\"md\">4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1215\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1205\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Mode</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1215\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1233\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1262\" data-col-size=\"md\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1290\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1278\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project Work</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1290\" data-col-size=\"md\">Included</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1308\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Industry Focus</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1389\">HR Management, Talent Acquisition, Learning &amp; Development, Employee Relations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x7ewb\" data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1444\">What Will You Learn in the Online MBA HR Program?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1854\">The <strong data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1484\">Online MBA HR course structure</strong> is designed to help students understand modern workforce management, employee development, organizational behavior, talent acquisition, compensation strategies, and leadership practices. The curriculum develops both managerial and human resource competencies required to build high-performing organizations and drive business growth through effective people management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1avd995\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1925\">Semester 1: Foundation of Business Management and Human Resources</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"2112\">The first semester introduces students to business fundamentals, communication, economics, marketing, and organizational behavior, which form the foundation for effective HR management.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2801\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2164\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2164\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2139\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online MBA HR Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2164\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2801\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2293\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2214\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2293\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop professional communication, presentation, and interpersonal skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2382\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2317\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2382\">Understand accounting concepts and financial decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2489\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2419\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Micro Economics &amp; Macro Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2489\">Learn economic principles that influence organizational decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2596\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2516\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Organisational Behavior</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2596\">Study employee motivation, leadership, workplace culture, and team dynamics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2695\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2695\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand marketing concepts and customer-focused business strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2801\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Quantitative Methods &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2801\" data-col-size=\"md\">Build analytical and data interpretation skills for business applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jbgamp\" data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2864\">Semester 2: Core Management and Strategic Decision-Making</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2998\">The second semester strengthens management capabilities while introducing strategic planning, analytics, and operational excellence.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3668\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3050\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3050\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3025\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online MBA HR Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3050\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3668\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3177\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3106\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cost &amp; Management Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3177\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn budgeting, cost control, and managerial accounting practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3289\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3206\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3289\">Understand recruitment, employee relations, training, and workforce management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3385\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3313\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3385\">Develop long-term business planning and strategic leadership skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3480\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3407\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3480\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn data-driven decision-making and workforce analytics techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3575\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3508\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspect of Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3575\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand business laws, compliance, and corporate governance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3668\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3600\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operations Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3668\">Study operational efficiency and resource management strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13mhaae\" data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3735\">Semester 3: Advanced Human Resource Management Specialization</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3881\">The third semester focuses on specialized <strong data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3798\">MBA HR subjects</strong> that prepare students for strategic HR leadership and workforce development roles.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"4715\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"3933\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"3933\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"3908\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online MBA HR Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3908\" data-end=\"3933\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"4715\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"4072\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"3978\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Finance</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"4072\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand financial planning and corporate decision-making from a managerial perspective.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4171\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4096\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4171\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn research techniques, employee surveys, and data analysis methods.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4244\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4191\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project Pre-work</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4191\" data-end=\"4244\">Develop project planning and research frameworks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4348\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4271\" data-col-size=\"md\">Compensation &amp; Benefits</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4348\">Learn employee compensation structures, rewards, and benefits management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4349\" data-end=\"4466\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4349\" data-end=\"4386\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industrial Relations &amp; Labour Laws</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4466\">Understand labour regulations, employee relations, and workplace compliance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4467\" data-end=\"4592\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4467\" data-end=\"4514\" data-col-size=\"md\">Manpower Planning, Recruitment and Selection</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4514\" data-end=\"4592\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop expertise in talent acquisition and workforce planning strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4593\" data-end=\"4715\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4593\" data-end=\"4631\" data-col-size=\"md\">Organisational Development &amp; Change</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4631\" data-end=\"4715\">Learn change management, organizational transformation, and culture development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ojzvwo\" data-start=\"4717\" data-end=\"4787\">Semester 4: Leadership, Learning &amp; Employee Performance Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4789\" data-end=\"4994\">The final semester emphasizes leadership development, employee performance, learning strategies, and emotional intelligence while allowing students to apply their knowledge through a comprehensive project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5762\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5046\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5046\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5021\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online MBA HR Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5021\" data-end=\"5046\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5071\" data-end=\"5762\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5071\" data-end=\"5166\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5071\" data-end=\"5095\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Ethos &amp; Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5095\" data-end=\"5166\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand ethical leadership and responsible management practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5167\" data-end=\"5262\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5167\" data-end=\"5194\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Sustainability</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5194\" data-end=\"5262\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn sustainable workforce and business development strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5263\" data-end=\"5368\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5263\" data-end=\"5288\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5368\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore global workforce management and international business environments.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5369\" data-end=\"5447\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5369\" data-end=\"5379\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5379\" data-end=\"5447\">Apply HR concepts to solve real-world organizational challenges.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5448\" data-end=\"5547\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5448\" data-end=\"5480\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Performance Management System</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5480\" data-end=\"5547\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn employee performance evaluation and appraisal techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5548\" data-end=\"5649\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5548\" data-end=\"5573\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning &amp; Development</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5573\" data-end=\"5649\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop strategies for employee training, upskilling, and career growth.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5650\" data-end=\"5762\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5650\" data-end=\"5675\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Emotional Intelligence</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5675\" data-end=\"5762\">Build leadership, interpersonal, conflict-resolution, and people management skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a74483\" data-start=\"5764\" data-end=\"5805\">Online MBA HR Skills You Will Develop</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5807\" data-end=\"5935\">The <strong data-start=\"5811\" data-end=\"5862\">Online MBA Human Resource Management curriculum</strong> helps students develop industry-relevant HR and leadership competencies.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5937\" data-end=\"6316\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vq7jcg\" data-start=\"5937\" data-end=\"5973\">Talent Acquisition and Recruitment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16qk5e1\" data-start=\"5974\" data-end=\"5994\">Workforce Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s5k4to\" data-start=\"5995\" data-end=\"6026\">Employee Relations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18rmpjh\" data-start=\"6027\" data-end=\"6063\">Compensation &amp; Benefits Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rbm8wl\" data-start=\"6064\" data-end=\"6096\">Performance Management Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jyjwb8\" data-start=\"6097\" data-end=\"6132\">Learning &amp; Development Strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"teiffx\" data-start=\"6133\" data-end=\"6161\">Organizational Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d4pu71\" data-start=\"6162\" data-end=\"6181\">Change Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqylxk\" data-start=\"6182\" data-end=\"6205\">Labour Law Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18wo778\" data-start=\"6206\" data-end=\"6238\">Leadership and Team Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124ez85\" data-start=\"6239\" data-end=\"6273\">HR Analytics and Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t43acg\" data-start=\"6274\" data-end=\"6316\">Emotional Intelligence and Communication</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 196000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(448, 81, 'a43ce1c1-07c6-48ac-9fe4-9e7e2a0894ec', '99ab210c-64fc-4773-adb7-798ae6d00459', 335, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 03:14:11', '2026-05-30 03:14:11', '<p data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"602\">The <strong data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"221\">Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management Admission Process</strong> is designed to provide a simple, transparent, and fully online enrollment experience for students and working professionals. This industry-focused MBA specialization combines operations management, business analytics, data science, big data applications, and operational intelligence, making it an ideal choice for learners seeking careers in analytics-driven business management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"881\">Candidates interested in the <strong data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"694\">Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management program</strong> should complete their registration, application submission, document verification, and fee payment within the prescribed admission timeline to secure their admission and avoid late fees.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uzgpw7\" data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"960\">Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management Admission Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1117\">Students applying for admission to the <strong data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1057\">Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management</strong> must follow the official admission schedule provided below.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1478\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1140\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1478\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1220\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1203\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1220\">19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1284\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1250\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1284\" data-col-size=\"sm\">19 March 2026 &ndash; 10 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1354\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1319\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission with Late Fee of ₹500</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1354\">11 August 2026 &ndash; 31 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1391\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1431\">1 September 2026 &ndash; 16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1478\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1457\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Last Date of Admission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1478\">16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fbnxes\" data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1564\">Step-by-Step Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management Admission Process</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1706\">The <strong data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1602\">Online MBA admission process</strong> can be completed entirely online, allowing students to apply from anywhere without visiting the campus.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1740\">Step 1: Online Registration</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1934\">Begin the admission process by registering on the university admission portal. Candidates must provide their basic personal, academic, and contact information to create an application account.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1985\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2126\">Fill out the Online MBA application form carefully and ensure all educational and personal details are accurate and match official records.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2166\">Step 3: Upload Required Documents</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2332\">Upload the required documents, including graduation certificates, mark sheets, identity proof, passport-size photographs, and category certificates (if applicable).</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2368\">Step 4: Pay the Admission Fee</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2504\">Complete the program fee payment through the available online payment options to confirm your application and proceed to verification.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2540\">Step 5: Document Verification</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2701\">The university verifies the submitted documents and checks eligibility criteria for admission to the Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management program.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2738\">Step 6: Admission Confirmation</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2898\">After successful verification, students receive admission confirmation, enrollment details, and access to the online learning platform and academic resources.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17c4f67\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2944\">Online MBA Re-Registration Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"3096\">Existing students must complete the <strong data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3020\">Online MBA re-registration process</strong> within the specified period to continue their studies without interruption.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3414\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3134\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3134\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3134\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3414\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3215\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3198\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3215\" data-col-size=\"sm\">19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3283\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3251\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3283\" data-col-size=\"sm\">19 March 2026 &ndash; 31 July 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3363\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3326\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3363\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1 August 2026 &ndash; 10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3414\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3393\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Closure of Re-Registration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3414\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mji8gw\" data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3463\">Documents Required for Online MBA Admission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3557\">Applicants should keep the following documents ready before beginning the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3772\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"118nfzx\" data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3607\">Graduation degree certificate and mark sheets.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mjrufx\" data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3649\">Government-issued photo identity proof.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tq1vja\" data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3677\">Passport-size photograph.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tt35z4\" data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3717\">Category certificate (if applicable).</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"coumxm\" data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3772\">Any additional documents required by the university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3774\" data-end=\"3865\">Preparing these documents in advance helps speed up the admission and verification process.</p>', 1, '<h2>Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management Fee Structure 2026: Semester-Wise Fees, Annual Fees, Scholarship &amp; EMI Options</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management Fee Structure</strong> is designed to provide flexibility and affordability for students, working professionals, business analysts, and aspiring managers. The program offers multiple payment options, allowing learners to choose a fee plan that best matches their financial requirements while pursuing a future-focused MBA specialization.</p>\r\n<p>When evaluating the <strong>Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management fees</strong>, students should consider tuition fees, scholarship benefits, financing options, examination charges, and the long-term career value of the program. With a curriculum that combines operations management, business analytics, data science, big data applications, and business intelligence, the program delivers strong career-focused value for professionals seeking leadership roles in data-driven organizations.</p>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<p>Students can select their preferred fee payment option based on convenience and financial planning.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester-Wise Fee (4 Semesters)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹55,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Fee (2 Years)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹105,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>One-Time Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Additional Fees &amp; Charges</h3>\r\n<p>Apart from the Online MBA program fee, students should also account for the following academic and administrative charges.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Particulars</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admission Processing Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Initial Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹10,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per subject per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Project Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Fee Payment Options</h3>\r\n<p>The university offers flexible payment plans to make higher education accessible to a wider range of learners.</p>\r\n<h4>Semester-Wise Payment Plan</h4>\r\n<p>The semester-wise fee option enables students to spread the cost of the program across four semesters, helping them manage educational expenses more effectively.</p>\r\n<h4>Annual Payment Plan</h4>\r\n<p>Students can opt for the annual fee structure and pay the program fee over two academic years, reducing the need for frequent payments.</p>\r\n<h4>One-Time Full Fee Payment</h4>\r\n<p>Applicants also have the option to pay the complete <strong>Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management program fee of ₹196,000</strong> in a single payment for added convenience and simplified financial planning.</p>\r\n<h3>Scholarship Benefits for Defence &amp; Paramilitary Personnel</h3>\r\n<p>The university offers a special scholarship policy to support service personnel and their families.</p>\r\n<h4>Scholarship Eligibility</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Armed Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Paramilitary Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Defence Service Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Eligible Dependents</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Qualified candidates can avail a <strong>20% discount on the program fee</strong>, reducing the overall cost of pursuing an Online MBA degree.</p>\r\n<h3>Education Loan &amp; No Cost EMI Facilities</h3>\r\n<p>To support students in financing their education, the university provides various payment assistance options.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Education loan facilities available for eligible applicants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>No Cost EMI options for convenient fee payment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Flexible financing solutions for working professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Financial assistance available even without a credit card.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Guidance from admission counsellors regarding available payment plans.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These facilities allow learners to pursue an Online MBA without placing significant financial pressure on themselves or their families.</p>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management ROI</h3>\r\n<p>When comparing <strong>Online MBA fees</strong>, students should look beyond tuition costs and evaluate the long-term return on investment. The program develops expertise in business analytics, operations management, data visualization, business intelligence, project management, big data applications, and operational decision-making.</p>\r\n<p>These highly sought-after skills can lead to career opportunities in:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Business Analytics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Operations Management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Data Analytics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Business Intelligence</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Digital Transformation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Project Management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Operations Analytics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Consulting and Strategy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The combination of management education, analytical expertise, and operational knowledge makes this program a valuable investment for long-term career growth.</p>\r\n<h3>Important Fee Guidelines</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>An admission processing fee of ₹1,200 is applicable for all admissions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>₹10,000 is collected during registration and adjusted against the program fee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Examination fees are charged separately at ₹800 per subject per attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Project fees are charged separately at ₹800 per attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Fee structure and university policies are subject to revision.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Demand Draft payments should be made in favour of <strong>&ldquo;SVKM\'s NMIMS&rdquo;</strong>, payable at Mumbai.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Students are encouraged to contact a student counsellor for the latest fee details, scholarship information, and financing options.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management Fee Highlights</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Particulars</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Program</td>\r\n<td>Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Duration</td>\r\n<td>2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td>4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td>₹55,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Fee</td>\r\n<td>₹105,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td>₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Scholarship Available</td>\r\n<td>Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>EMI Facility</td>\r\n<td>Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Education Loan Support</td>\r\n<td>Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\r\n<p><strong>What is the semester-wise fee for the Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management?</strong><br>The semester-wise fee is ₹55,000 per semester for four semesters.</p>\r\n<p><strong>What is the annual fee for the Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management?</strong><br>Students opting for the annual payment plan are required to pay ₹105,000 per year for two years.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Can I pay the full Online MBA fee at once?</strong><br>Yes, students can choose the one-time payment option and pay the complete program fee of ₹196,000.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Is there any scholarship available for Online MBA students?</strong><br>Yes, eligible Armed Forces, Paramilitary personnel, and their dependents can avail a 20% scholarship on the program fee.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Are examination fees included in the Online MBA fee structure?</strong><br>No, examination fees are charged separately at ₹800 per subject per attempt.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Does the university provide EMI and education loan facilities?</strong><br>Yes, eligible students can take advantage of No Cost EMI and education loan options for convenient fee payment.</p>', '<h2>Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management Fee Structure 2026: Semester-Wise Fees, Annual Fees, Scholarship &amp; EMI Options</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management Fee Structure</strong> is designed to provide flexibility and affordability for students, working professionals, business analysts, and aspiring managers. The program offers multiple payment options, allowing learners to choose a fee plan that best matches their financial requirements while pursuing a future-focused MBA specialization.</p>\r\n<p>When evaluating the <strong>Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management fees</strong>, students should consider tuition fees, scholarship benefits, financing options, examination charges, and the long-term career value of the program. With a curriculum that combines operations management, business analytics, data science, big data applications, and business intelligence, the program delivers strong career-focused value for professionals seeking leadership roles in data-driven organizations.</p>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<p>Students can select their preferred fee payment option based on convenience and financial planning.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester-Wise Fee (4 Semesters)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹55,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Fee (2 Years)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹105,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>One-Time Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Additional Fees &amp; Charges</h3>\r\n<p>Apart from the Online MBA program fee, students should also account for the following academic and administrative charges.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Particulars</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admission Processing Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Initial Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹10,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per subject per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Project Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Fee Payment Options</h3>\r\n<p>The university offers flexible payment plans to make higher education accessible to a wider range of learners.</p>\r\n<h4>Semester-Wise Payment Plan</h4>\r\n<p>The semester-wise fee option enables students to spread the cost of the program across four semesters, helping them manage educational expenses more effectively.</p>\r\n<h4>Annual Payment Plan</h4>\r\n<p>Students can opt for the annual fee structure and pay the program fee over two academic years, reducing the need for frequent payments.</p>\r\n<h4>One-Time Full Fee Payment</h4>\r\n<p>Applicants also have the option to pay the complete <strong>Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management program fee of ₹196,000</strong> in a single payment for added convenience and simplified financial planning.</p>\r\n<h3>Scholarship Benefits for Defence &amp; Paramilitary Personnel</h3>\r\n<p>The university offers a special scholarship policy to support service personnel and their families.</p>\r\n<h4>Scholarship Eligibility</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Armed Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Paramilitary Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Defence Service Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Eligible Dependents</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Qualified candidates can avail a <strong>20% discount on the program fee</strong>, reducing the overall cost of pursuing an Online MBA degree.</p>\r\n<h3>Education Loan &amp; No Cost EMI Facilities</h3>\r\n<p>To support students in financing their education, the university provides various payment assistance options.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Education loan facilities available for eligible applicants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>No Cost EMI options for convenient fee payment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Flexible financing solutions for working professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Financial assistance available even without a credit card.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Guidance from admission counsellors regarding available payment plans.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These facilities allow learners to pursue an Online MBA without placing significant financial pressure on themselves or their families.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3>Important Fee Guidelines</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>An admission processing fee of ₹1,200 is applicable for all admissions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>₹10,000 is collected during registration and adjusted against the program fee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Examination fees are charged separately at ₹800 per subject per attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Project fees are charged separately at ₹800 per attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Fee structure and university policies are subject to revision.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Demand Draft payments should be made in favour of <strong>&ldquo;SVKM\'s NMIMS&rdquo;</strong>, payable at Mumbai.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Students are encouraged to contact a student counsellor for the latest fee details, scholarship information, and financing options.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"571\">The <strong data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"208\">Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management</strong> is designed for professionals and graduates who want to combine operational excellence with data-driven decision-making. The program integrates core management principles, operations management, business analytics, supply chain strategies, big data technologies, and data visualization techniques to prepare students for leadership roles in modern organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"984\">The <strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"639\">Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management syllabus</strong> focuses on developing expertise in operations analytics, business intelligence, strategic sourcing, project management, process optimization, and digital transformation. Through a blend of management fundamentals and advanced analytical concepts, students gain the skills required to solve complex business challenges using data and technology.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v1hjr8\" data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1064\">Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management Curriculum Highlights</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1454\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1080\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1091\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1454\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1133\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Name</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1189\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1220\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1209\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1220\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1244\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1239\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1244\" data-col-size=\"md\">4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1271\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1261\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Mode</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1271\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1331\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1289\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1331\" data-col-size=\"md\">Operations and Data Science Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1347\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project Work</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1359\" data-col-size=\"md\">Included</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1454\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1377\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Industry Focus</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1454\" data-col-size=\"md\">Operations, Analytics, Data Science, Business Intelligence &amp; Supply Chain</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10iaz57\" data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1545\">What Will You Learn in the Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management Program?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1946\">The <strong data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1621\">Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management course structure</strong> is designed to help students understand how businesses use data, analytics, and operational strategies to improve efficiency, reduce costs, optimize processes, and drive growth. Students learn to apply business analytics, big data, operations management, and decision-making frameworks to solve real-world business problems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2ii0mh\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"2011\">Semester 1: Foundation of Business Management and Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2146\">The first semester builds a strong foundation in business communication, accounting, economics, marketing, and quantitative analysis.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2898\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2223\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2223\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2198\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online MBA Operations and Data Science Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2223\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2898\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2349\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2273\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2349\">Develop professional communication, leadership, and presentation skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2461\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2373\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2461\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn financial reporting, accounting principles, and business finance fundamentals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2581\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2498\" data-col-size=\"md\">Micro Economics &amp; Macro Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2581\">Understand economic concepts that influence business and operational decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2690\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2608\" data-col-size=\"md\">Organisational Behavior</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2690\">Study leadership, workplace culture, employee motivation, and team management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2795\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2714\" data-col-size=\"md\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2795\">Learn customer-focused business strategies and market positioning techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2898\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2823\" data-col-size=\"md\">Quantitative Methods &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2898\">Develop statistical and analytical skills for business problem-solving.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lz0a8z\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2955\">Semester 2: Core Business and Operations Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"3082\">The second semester strengthens management capabilities while introducing analytics and operational decision-making concepts.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3781\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3159\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3159\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3134\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online MBA Operations and Data Science Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3159\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3781\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3284\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3215\" data-col-size=\"md\">Cost &amp; Management Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3284\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn budgeting, cost control, and financial planning techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3285\" data-end=\"3377\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3285\" data-end=\"3313\" data-col-size=\"md\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3377\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand workforce planning and organizational management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3477\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3401\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3401\" data-end=\"3477\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop strategic thinking and long-term business planning capabilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3478\" data-end=\"3574\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3478\" data-end=\"3499\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3574\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn data-driven decision-making and business intelligence techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3676\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3602\" data-col-size=\"md\">Legal Aspect of Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3676\">Understand business regulations, compliance, and corporate governance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3677\" data-end=\"3781\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3677\" data-end=\"3701\" data-col-size=\"md\">Operations Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3781\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study process optimization, operational efficiency, and resource management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gnqy5\" data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3844\">Semester 3: Advanced Data Science and Operations Strategy</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"4010\">The third semester focuses on specialized <strong data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"3932\">MBA Operations and Data Science subjects</strong> that combine technology, analytics, procurement, and supply chain strategies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4838\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4087\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4087\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4062\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online MBA Operations and Data Science Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4087\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4112\" data-end=\"4838\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4112\" data-end=\"4202\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4112\" data-end=\"4132\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Finance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4202\">Learn financial decision-making and capital management strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4203\" data-end=\"4298\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4203\" data-end=\"4224\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4298\">Develop expertise in project planning, execution, and risk management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4386\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4318\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project Pre-work</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4318\" data-end=\"4386\">Build research frameworks and project implementation strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4387\" data-end=\"4480\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4387\" data-end=\"4410\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4410\" data-end=\"4480\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn data collection, research design, and analytical techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4481\" data-end=\"4623\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4481\" data-end=\"4526\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strategic Applications of IoT and Big Data</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4526\" data-end=\"4623\">Understand how IoT and big data technologies support business innovation and decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4624\" data-end=\"4736\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4624\" data-end=\"4663\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strategic Sourcing and E-Procurement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4736\">Learn digital procurement systems and supplier management strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4737\" data-end=\"4838\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4737\" data-end=\"4763\" data-col-size=\"md\">Supply Chain Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4763\" data-end=\"4838\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand logistics, inventory control, and supply chain optimization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"42543y\" data-start=\"4840\" data-end=\"4902\">Semester 4: Operations Analytics and Business Intelligence</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4904\" data-end=\"5088\">The final semester emphasizes analytics, sustainability, quality management, and business intelligence while allowing students to apply their knowledge through a comprehensive project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5090\" data-end=\"5912\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5090\" data-end=\"5165\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5090\" data-end=\"5165\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5090\" data-end=\"5140\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online MBA Operations and Data Science Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5140\" data-end=\"5165\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5190\" data-end=\"5912\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5190\" data-end=\"5296\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5190\" data-end=\"5217\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Sustainability</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5217\" data-end=\"5296\">Learn sustainable business practices and responsible operations management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5297\" data-end=\"5410\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5297\" data-end=\"5326\" data-col-size=\"md\">EDA and Data Visualization</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5326\" data-end=\"5410\">Develop skills in exploratory data analysis, dashboards, and business reporting.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5411\" data-end=\"5501\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5411\" data-end=\"5435\" data-col-size=\"md\">Indian Ethos &amp; Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5435\" data-end=\"5501\">Understand ethical leadership and responsible decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5502\" data-end=\"5600\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5502\" data-end=\"5527\" data-col-size=\"md\">International Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5527\" data-end=\"5600\">Explore global business operations and international market dynamics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5601\" data-end=\"5705\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5601\" data-end=\"5624\" data-col-size=\"md\">Operations Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5624\" data-end=\"5705\">Use analytics tools to improve operational performance and business outcomes.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5706\" data-end=\"5797\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5706\" data-end=\"5716\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5716\" data-end=\"5797\">Apply operations and data science concepts to solve real business challenges.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5798\" data-end=\"5912\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5798\" data-end=\"5825\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total Quality Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5825\" data-end=\"5912\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn quality improvement frameworks and continuous process enhancement techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2s4n1f\" data-start=\"5914\" data-end=\"5991\">Online MBA Operations and Data Science Management Skills You Will Develop</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5993\" data-end=\"6157\">The <strong data-start=\"5997\" data-end=\"6064\">Online MBA in Operations and Data Science Management curriculum</strong> helps students build highly sought-after technical, analytical, and managerial competencies.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6159\" data-end=\"6462\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v3fx4\" data-start=\"6159\" data-end=\"6179\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gwptu\" data-start=\"6180\" data-end=\"6200\">Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m8jm1k\" data-start=\"6201\" data-end=\"6223\">Operations Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q34wfb\" data-start=\"6224\" data-end=\"6245\">Big Data Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16qco2j\" data-start=\"6246\" data-end=\"6269\">Business Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7lwcgn\" data-start=\"6270\" data-end=\"6297\">Supply Chain Optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16jpedc\" data-start=\"6298\" data-end=\"6332\">Strategic Sourcing &amp; Procurement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ln1uz2\" data-start=\"6333\" data-end=\"6353\">Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h1oa17\" data-start=\"6354\" data-end=\"6375\">Process Improvement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uresk6\" data-start=\"6376\" data-end=\"6396\">Quality Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"195eb59\" data-start=\"6397\" data-end=\"6426\">Data-Driven Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11lcppr\" data-start=\"6427\" data-end=\"6462\">Leadership and Strategic Planning</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 196000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
