er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(449, 81, 'a43ce1c1-07c6-48ac-9fe4-9e7e2a0894ec', '99ab210c-64fc-4773-adb7-798ae6d00459', 231, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 03:32:59', '2026-05-30 03:32:59', '<p data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"601\">The <strong data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"211\">Online MBA in Information Technology Management Admission Process</strong> is designed to provide a seamless and fully digital enrollment experience for students and working professionals. This future-focused MBA specialization combines management education with information technology, cybersecurity, business analytics, digital transformation, and artificial intelligence, making it an ideal choice for learners seeking leadership roles in the technology sector.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"869\">Candidates interested in the <strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"688\">Online MBA Information Technology Management program</strong> should complete their registration, application submission, document verification, and fee payment within the prescribed admission timeline to secure admission and avoid late fees.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v3jwms\" data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"943\">Online MBA Information Technology Management Admission Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1104\">Applicants seeking admission to the <strong data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1032\">Online MBA in Information Technology Management</strong> must complete the admission process according to the official schedule.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1465\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1136\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1136\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1127\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1136\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1465\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1207\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1190\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1207\" data-col-size=\"sm\">19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1271\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1237\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1271\" data-col-size=\"sm\">19 March 2026 &ndash; 10 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1306\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission with Late Fee of ₹500</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1341\" data-col-size=\"sm\">11 August 2026 &ndash; 31 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1378\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1418\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1 September 2026 &ndash; 16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1465\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1444\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Last Date of Admission</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1465\" data-col-size=\"sm\">16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lfvk9z\" data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1546\">Step-by-Step Online MBA Information Technology Management Admission Process</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1722\">The <strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1598\">Online MBA IT Management admission process</strong> can be completed entirely online, allowing students to apply from anywhere while continuing their professional commitments.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1756\">Step 1: Online Registration</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1901\">Begin by registering on the university admission portal and creating your applicant account using your personal, academic, and contact details.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1952\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2089\">Fill out the Online MBA application form carefully and ensure that all educational and personal information is accurate and up to date.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2129\">Step 3: Upload Required Documents</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2303\">Submit the necessary documents, including graduation mark sheets, degree certificates, identity proof, passport-size photographs, and category certificates (if applicable).</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2339\">Step 4: Pay the Admission Fee</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2477\">Complete the fee payment through the available online payment methods to confirm your application and proceed to the verification stage.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2513\">Step 5: Document Verification</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2689\">The university verifies all submitted documents and evaluates whether candidates satisfy the prescribed <strong data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2688\">Online MBA Information Technology Management eligibility criteria</strong>.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2726\">Step 6: Admission Confirmation</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2902\">After successful verification, students receive admission confirmation, enrollment credentials, and access to the Learning Management System (LMS) and online study resources.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17c4f67\" data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2948\">Online MBA Re-Registration Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"3100\">Existing students must complete the <strong data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"3024\">Online MBA re-registration process</strong> within the specified period to continue their studies without interruption.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3418\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3138\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3138\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3129\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Activity</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3138\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3418\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3219\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3202\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3219\">19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3287\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3255\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3287\">19 March 2026 &ndash; 31 July 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3288\" data-end=\"3367\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3288\" data-end=\"3330\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Re-Registration with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3367\">1 August 2026 &ndash; 10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3418\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3397\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Closure of Re-Registration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3418\">10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"198opm6\" data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3481\">Documents Required for Online MBA IT Management Admission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3575\">Applicants should keep the following documents ready before beginning the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3790\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"118nfzx\" data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3625\">Graduation degree certificate and mark sheets.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mjrufx\" data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3667\">Government-issued photo identity proof.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tq1vja\" data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3695\">Passport-size photograph.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tt35z4\" data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3735\">Category certificate (if applicable).</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"coumxm\" data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3790\">Any additional documents required by the university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3894\">Preparing these documents in advance helps ensure faster document verification and admission approval.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"621\">The <strong data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"209\">Online MBA in Information Technology Management Eligibility Criteria</strong> are designed for graduates who want to build expertise in technology management, digital transformation, cybersecurity, business analytics, IT strategy, and artificial intelligence-driven business solutions. The program combines advanced management education with modern technology concepts, making it an ideal choice for aspiring technology leaders, IT professionals, business analysts, and working executives.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"865\">The <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"683\">Online MBA Information Technology Management program</strong> is open to candidates from diverse academic backgrounds, enabling learners to develop both managerial and technology-focused skills required in today\'s digital business environment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gccsvz\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"940\">Online MBA Information Technology Management Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1071\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1010\">Online MBA in Information Technology Management</strong>, candidates must fulfill the following eligibility criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16twwrh\" data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1160\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1112\">Bachelor\'s Degree (10+2+3)</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9o4wxg\" data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1297\">Candidates with an equivalent qualification recognized by the <strong data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1269\">Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</strong> are also eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14w971x\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1405\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1360\">50% aggregate marks at the graduation level</strong> is required for General category candidates.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6gi4ib\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1547\">Candidates belonging to <strong data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1467\">SC, ST, OBC, and PwD categories</strong> are eligible with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1522\">45% aggregate marks</strong> at the graduation level.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3gjjy1\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1660\">Admission is subject to successful document verification and fulfillment of university admission requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xvb4pv\" data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1737\">Online MBA Information Technology Management Qualification Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1973\">One of the biggest advantages of the <strong data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1811\">Online MBA IT Management course</strong> is that applicants from any academic stream can apply. Prior experience in information technology, computer science, programming, or management is not mandatory.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2009\">Eligible candidates may come from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2281\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqsb7g\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2039\">Engineering and Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1adxps7\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2090\">Computer Applications and Information Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gsnogm\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2129\">Commerce and Business Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h2rz43\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2155\">Science and Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fsyzuy\" data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2177\">Arts and Humanities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wxued6\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2204\">Economics and Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sig3f6\" data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2235\">Healthcare and Allied Fields</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bhnhpk\" data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2281\">Any recognized bachelor\'s degree discipline</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2434\">This multidisciplinary approach allows students to combine their existing academic knowledge with technology management and digital business expertise.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"20eii\" data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2509\">Who Can Apply for an Online MBA in Information Technology Management?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2611\">The program is ideal for individuals seeking careers at the intersection of business and technology.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"3202\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gtbq7j\" data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2698\"><strong data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2634\">Fresh Graduates</strong> looking to build careers in IT management and digital business.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iyj6in\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2786\"><strong data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2726\">Working Professionals</strong> seeking career advancement in technology-driven industries.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"io0ou7\" data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2853\"><strong data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2809\">IT Professionals</strong> aiming for leadership and managerial roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n5n66y\" data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2934\"><strong data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2877\">Business Analysts</strong> looking to strengthen technology and strategy expertise.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2z5lqw\" data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"3028\"><strong data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2957\">Project Managers</strong> seeking knowledge of digital transformation and technology governance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kvv4xe\" data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3105\"><strong data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3048\">Entrepreneurs</strong> interested in leveraging technology for business growth.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jm606b\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3202\"><strong data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3128\">Career Switchers</strong> planning to move into technology management and digital leadership roles.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>Online MBA in Information Technology Management Fee Structure 2026: Semester-Wise Fees, Annual Fees, Scholarship &amp; EMI Options</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Online MBA in Information Technology Management Fee Structure</strong> is designed to provide flexibility, affordability, and convenience for students and working professionals seeking advanced expertise in information technology, digital transformation, cybersecurity, business analytics, and technology management. With multiple payment options and financial assistance facilities, learners can choose a fee plan that aligns with their educational and career goals.</p>\r\n<p>The <strong>Online MBA IT Management fees</strong> offer excellent value for students looking to build skills in technology leadership, AI-driven business solutions, IT governance, cybersecurity management, and digital innovation while benefiting from the flexibility of online learning.</p>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Information Technology Management Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<p>Students can select the most suitable fee payment option based on their financial preferences.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester-Wise Fee (4 Semesters)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹55,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Fee (2 Years)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹105,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>One-Time Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Additional Fees &amp; Charges</h3>\r\n<p>Apart from the program fee, students should consider the following academic and administrative charges.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Particulars</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admission Processing Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Initial Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹10,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per subject per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Project Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Online MBA IT Management Fee Payment Options</h3>\r\n<p>The university offers multiple payment plans to make higher education more accessible for students and professionals.</p>\r\n<h4>Semester-Wise Payment Plan</h4>\r\n<p>The semester-wise fee option allows students to distribute the total program cost across four semesters, making fee payments more manageable.</p>\r\n<h4>Annual Payment Plan</h4>\r\n<p>Students can opt for the annual fee payment option and pay the fee across two academic years, reducing the need for frequent payments.</p>\r\n<h4>One-Time Full Fee Payment</h4>\r\n<p>Applicants also have the option to pay the complete <strong>Online MBA in Information Technology Management program fee of ₹196,000</strong> in a single payment for simplified financial planning.</p>\r\n<h3>Scholarship Benefits</h3>\r\n<p>The university offers special financial support for eligible service personnel and their dependents.</p>\r\n<h4>Eligible Categories</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Armed Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Paramilitary Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Defence Service Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Eligible Dependents</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Qualified candidates can avail a <strong>20% scholarship on the program fee</strong>, helping reduce the overall cost of pursuing an Online MBA degree.</p>\r\n<h3>Education Loan &amp; No Cost EMI Facilities</h3>\r\n<p>To support students in financing their education, the university provides flexible funding options.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Education loan facilities available for eligible students.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>No Cost EMI options for convenient fee payment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Flexible financing solutions for working professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Financial assistance available even without a credit card.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Personalized guidance from admission counsellors regarding payment plans.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These facilities make it easier for students to pursue an Online MBA without significant financial strain.</p>\r\n<h3>Important Fee Guidelines</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Admission Processing Fee of ₹1,200 is applicable for all admissions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>₹10,000 will be collected at the time of registration and adjusted against the program fee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Examination Fee of ₹800 is applicable per subject per attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Project Fee of ₹800 is applicable per attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Fee structure is subject to revision as per university policies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Demand Draft payments should be made in favour of <strong>&ldquo;SVKM\'s NMIMS&rdquo;</strong>, payable at Mumbai.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Students are advised to contact a student counsellor for the latest fee details and scholarship information.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"604\">The <strong data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"198\">Online MBA in Information Technology Management</strong> is designed for students and working professionals who want to develop expertise in business management, information technology, digital transformation, cybersecurity, business analytics, and technology leadership. The program combines core management principles with emerging technology concepts, helping learners build the strategic and technical skills required to lead technology-driven organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"1030\">The <strong data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"667\">Online MBA Information Technology Management syllabus</strong> focuses on business strategy, IT governance, cybersecurity, digital product development, technology risk management, artificial intelligence, and business process transformation. Through a blend of management education and technology-focused learning, students gain the expertise needed to bridge the gap between business objectives and technological innovation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sa3ts\" data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1102\">Online MBA Information Technology Management Curriculum Highlights</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1482\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1129\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1482\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1222\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1171\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Name</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1222\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online MBA in Information Technology Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1253\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1242\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1253\" data-col-size=\"md\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1272\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1277\" data-col-size=\"md\">4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1304\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1294\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Mode</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1304\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1322\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1359\" data-col-size=\"md\">Information Technology Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1375\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project Work</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1387\" data-col-size=\"md\">Included</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1482\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1405\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Industry Focus</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1482\" data-col-size=\"md\">IT Management, Digital Transformation, Cybersecurity &amp; Business Analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q8sdmw\" data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1568\">What Will You Learn in the Online MBA Information Technology Management Program?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1936\">The <strong data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1619\">Online MBA IT Management course structure</strong> is designed to help students understand how technology drives business growth, innovation, operational efficiency, and competitive advantage. Learners develop expertise in cybersecurity, technology governance, business analytics, digital product management, AI applications, and enterprise transformation strategies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jwjnkp\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2002\">Semester 1: Foundation of Business and Technology Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2146\">The first semester establishes a strong foundation in business communication, accounting, economics, marketing, and organizational management.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2885\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2184\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online MBA IT Management Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2209\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2885\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2335\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2259\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2335\">Develop professional communication, presentation, and leadership skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2447\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2359\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2447\">Learn financial reporting, accounting principles, and business finance fundamentals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2558\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2471\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2558\">Understand marketing strategies, customer engagement, and business growth concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2673\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2595\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Micro Economics &amp; Macro Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2673\">Study economic principles influencing business and technology investments.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2784\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2701\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Organisational Behaviour</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2784\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn leadership, employee motivation, team management, and workplace dynamics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2885\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2812\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Quantitative Methods &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2885\" data-col-size=\"md\">Build analytical and statistical skills for business decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xcvcr7\" data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2941\">Semester 2: Core Business Management and Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"3060\">The second semester strengthens managerial capabilities while introducing strategic business and analytical concepts.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3730\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3123\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3123\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3098\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online MBA IT Management Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3123\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3730\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3244\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3169\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3244\">Learn data-driven decision-making and business intelligence techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3350\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3276\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cost &amp; Management Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3350\">Understand budgeting, cost control, and financial planning strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3453\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3378\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspect of Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3453\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study business laws, compliance requirements, and corporate governance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3540\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3477\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3540\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop long-term planning and strategic leadership skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3631\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3631\">Learn workforce planning and talent management principles.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3730\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3656\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operations Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3656\" data-end=\"3730\">Understand process optimization and operational efficiency strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15fp4yu\" data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3790\">Semester 3: Advanced Information Technology Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3976\">The third semester introduces specialized <strong data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3884\">MBA Information Technology Management subjects</strong> that focus on cybersecurity, risk management, governance, and modern technology frameworks.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"4816\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"4039\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"4039\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"4014\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online MBA IT Management Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4039\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4816\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4158\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4084\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Finance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4084\" data-end=\"4158\">Learn corporate financial planning and strategic investment decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4249\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4182\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4249\">Develop research, analytical, and problem-solving capabilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4250\" data-end=\"4326\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4250\" data-end=\"4269\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project Pre-work</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4269\" data-end=\"4326\">Build project planning and implementation frameworks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4426\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4343\" data-col-size=\"md\">Cybersecurity</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4343\" data-end=\"4426\">Understand information security, cyber threats, and risk mitigation strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4427\" data-end=\"4552\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4427\" data-end=\"4465\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Privacy, Security &amp; Governance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4465\" data-end=\"4552\">Learn data protection regulations, governance frameworks, and compliance standards.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4553\" data-end=\"4673\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4553\" data-end=\"4595\" data-col-size=\"md\">Technology Risk &amp; Compliance Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4595\" data-end=\"4673\">Study IT risk assessment, regulatory compliance, and governance practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4674\" data-end=\"4816\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4674\" data-end=\"4722\" data-col-size=\"md\">Applying Agile Concepts in Program Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4722\" data-end=\"4816\">Learn Agile methodologies, project delivery frameworks, and team collaboration techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gmyum6\" data-start=\"4818\" data-end=\"4882\">Semester 4: Digital Transformation and Emerging Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4884\" data-end=\"5015\">The final semester focuses on innovation, AI applications, digital business transformation, and technology-enabled business growth.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5017\" data-end=\"5850\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5017\" data-end=\"5078\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5017\" data-end=\"5078\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5017\" data-end=\"5053\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online MBA IT Management Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5053\" data-end=\"5078\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5103\" data-end=\"5850\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5103\" data-end=\"5197\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5103\" data-end=\"5130\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Sustainability</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5130\" data-end=\"5197\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn sustainable business and technology management practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5198\" data-end=\"5288\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5198\" data-end=\"5222\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Ethos &amp; Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5222\" data-end=\"5288\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand ethical leadership and responsible decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5289\" data-end=\"5390\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5289\" data-end=\"5314\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5314\" data-end=\"5390\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore global business operations and international technology markets.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5391\" data-end=\"5480\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5391\" data-end=\"5401\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5401\" data-end=\"5480\" data-col-size=\"md\">Apply technology and management concepts to solve real business challenges.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5481\" data-end=\"5606\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5481\" data-end=\"5522\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Digital Product Design and Development</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5522\" data-end=\"5606\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn product lifecycle management, digital innovation, and user-centric design.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5607\" data-end=\"5720\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5607\" data-end=\"5641\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Process Transformation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5641\" data-end=\"5720\">Understand digital transformation strategies and operational modernization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5721\" data-end=\"5850\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5721\" data-end=\"5764\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AI Concepts and Applications in Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5764\" data-end=\"5850\">Explore artificial intelligence applications, automation, and business innovation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fvt4qo\" data-start=\"5852\" data-end=\"5924\">Online MBA Information Technology Management Skills You Will Develop</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5926\" data-end=\"6048\">The <strong data-start=\"5930\" data-end=\"5969\">Online MBA IT Management curriculum</strong> helps students develop highly valuable technology and management competencies.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6050\" data-end=\"6406\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yd7oiz\" data-start=\"6050\" data-end=\"6078\">IT Strategy and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v3fx4\" data-start=\"6079\" data-end=\"6099\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12lhcki\" data-start=\"6100\" data-end=\"6126\">Cybersecurity Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i8ba5k\" data-start=\"6127\" data-end=\"6156\">Data Privacy and Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hfrhoe\" data-start=\"6157\" data-end=\"6185\">Technology Risk Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x1gvmr\" data-start=\"6186\" data-end=\"6210\">Digital Transformation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6dohs8\" data-start=\"6211\" data-end=\"6237\">Agile Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16icov8\" data-start=\"6238\" data-end=\"6269\">Business Process Optimization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cjghjm\" data-start=\"6270\" data-end=\"6308\">Artificial Intelligence Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"obs0yy\" data-start=\"6309\" data-end=\"6338\">Digital Product Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5sy09s\" data-start=\"6339\" data-end=\"6371\">Leadership and Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rjrvio\" data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6406\">Technology Innovation Management</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 196000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
