er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(450, 81, 'a43ce1c1-07c6-48ac-9fe4-9e7e2a0894ec', '99ab210c-64fc-4773-adb7-798ae6d00459', 216, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 03:45:20', '2026-05-30 03:45:20', '<h2>Online MBA in Business Analytics Management Admission Process 2026: Important Dates, Registration Schedule &amp; Application Timeline</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Online MBA in Business Analytics Management Admission Process</strong> is designed to provide a seamless and fully online enrollment experience for students, graduates, and working professionals. As one of the most in-demand MBA specializations, the <strong>Online MBA in Business Analytics</strong> equips learners with expertise in business analytics, data analytics, machine learning, business intelligence, consumer analytics, and digital transformation.</p>\r\n<p>Candidates interested in pursuing the <strong>Online MBA Business Analytics Management program</strong> should complete their registration, application submission, document verification, and fee payment within the prescribed admission timeline to secure admission and avoid late fees.</p>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Business Analytics Admission Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p>Applicants seeking admission to the <strong>Online MBA in Business Analytics Management</strong> must follow the official admission schedule provided below.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Admission Activity</th>\r\n<th>Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td>19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admission Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td>19 March 2026 &ndash; 10 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admission with Late Fee of ₹500</td>\r\n<td>11 August 2026 &ndash; 31 August 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admission with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td>1 September 2026 &ndash; 16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Last Date of Admission</td>\r\n<td>16 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Step-by-Step Online MBA Business Analytics Admission Process</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Online MBA admission process</strong> can be completed entirely online, allowing students to apply from anywhere while continuing their academic or professional commitments.</p>\r\n<h4>Step 1: Online Registration</h4>\r\n<p>Register on the university admission portal by providing your basic personal, academic, and contact details to create your application account.</p>\r\n<h4>Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h4>\r\n<p>Fill out the Online MBA Business Analytics application form carefully and ensure all information is accurate and matches your official documents.</p>\r\n<h4>Step 3: Upload Required Documents</h4>\r\n<p>Upload the required documents, including graduation certificates, mark sheets, government-issued identity proof, passport-size photographs, and category certificates (if applicable).</p>\r\n<h4>Step 4: Pay the Admission Fee</h4>\r\n<p>Complete the program fee payment through the available online payment methods to confirm your application and move to the verification stage.</p>\r\n<h4>Step 5: Document Verification</h4>\r\n<p>The university verifies all submitted documents and evaluates eligibility criteria for admission to the Online MBA Business Analytics Management program.</p>\r\n<h4>Step 6: Admission Confirmation</h4>\r\n<p>Upon successful verification, candidates receive admission confirmation, enrollment credentials, and access to the Learning Management System (LMS), study materials, and academic resources.</p>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Re-Registration Schedule 2026</h3>\r\n<p>Existing students enrolled in the program must complete the re-registration process within the prescribed timeline to continue their studies without interruption.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Re-Registration Activity</th>\r\n<th>Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Re-Registration Starts</td>\r\n<td>19 March 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Re-Registration Without Late Fee</td>\r\n<td>19 March 2026 &ndash; 31 July 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Re-Registration with Late Fee of ₹1,000</td>\r\n<td>1 August 2026 &ndash; 10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Closure of Re-Registration</td>\r\n<td>10 September 2026</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Documents Required for Online MBA Business Analytics Admission</h3>\r\n<p>Before starting the admission process, applicants should keep the following documents ready:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Graduation degree certificate and mark sheets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Government-issued photo identity proof.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Passport-size photograph.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Category certificate (if applicable).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Any additional documents required by the university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Having these documents prepared in advance helps ensure faster admission processing and verification.</p>\r\n<h3>Important Admission Guidelines</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Submit your Online MBA Business Analytics application before the final admission date.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Ensure all academic and personal details are accurate.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Upload clear and valid supporting documents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Complete fee payment within the prescribed admission timeline.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Existing students should complete re-registration before the deadline to maintain academic continuity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, '<h2>Online MBA in Business Analytics Management Eligibility Criteria 2026: Qualification, Minimum Marks &amp; Admission Requirements</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Online MBA in Business Analytics Management Eligibility Criteria</strong> are designed for graduates who want to build expertise in business analytics, data analytics, business intelligence, machine learning applications, consumer analytics, and data-driven decision-making. As businesses increasingly rely on data to drive strategy and growth, the demand for professionals with both management and analytics skills continues to rise across industries.</p>\r\n<p>The <strong>Online MBA Business Analytics Management program</strong> is open to candidates from diverse academic backgrounds, making it an excellent choice for fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, IT professionals, business analysts, and aspiring managers looking to develop expertise in analytics and digital business transformation.</p>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Business Analytics Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<p>To apply for the <strong>Online MBA in Business Analytics Management</strong>, candidates must fulfill the following eligibility criteria:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Hold a <strong>Bachelor\'s Degree (10+2+3)</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Candidates with an equivalent qualification recognized by the <strong>Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</strong> are also eligible to apply.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>A minimum of <strong>50% aggregate marks at the graduation level</strong> is required for General category candidates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Candidates belonging to <strong>SC, ST, OBC, and PwD categories</strong> are eligible with a minimum of <strong>45% aggregate marks</strong> at the graduation level.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Admission is subject to successful document verification and fulfillment of university admission requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Business Analytics Qualification Requirements</h3>\r\n<p>One of the key advantages of the <strong>Online MBA Business Analytics course</strong> is that it welcomes graduates from all academic streams. Applicants do not need prior experience in analytics, data science, programming, or technology to pursue the program.</p>\r\n<p>Eligible candidates may come from:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Commerce and Business Administration</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Science and Mathematics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Engineering and Technology</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Computer Applications and Information Technology</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Economics and Statistics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Arts and Humanities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Healthcare and Allied Fields</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Any recognized bachelor\'s degree discipline</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This multidisciplinary approach helps students combine domain knowledge with modern analytics and business management skills.</p>\r\n<h3>Who Can Apply for an Online MBA in Business Analytics Management?</h3>\r\n<p>The program is ideal for individuals who want to build careers in analytics, business intelligence, digital transformation, and strategic management.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Fresh Graduates</strong> seeking a future-ready management specialization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Working Professionals</strong> aiming for career growth in analytics-driven roles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Business Analysts</strong> looking to strengthen managerial and leadership capabilities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>IT Professionals</strong> interested in business analytics and data-driven decision-making.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Entrepreneurs</strong> seeking to leverage analytics for business growth.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Managers and Team Leaders</strong> looking to develop advanced analytical skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Career Switchers</strong> planning to transition into business analytics and consulting roles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>.</p>', '<h2>Online MBA in Business Analytics Management Fee Structure 2026: Semester-Wise Fees, Annual Fees, Scholarship &amp; EMI Options</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Online MBA in Business Analytics Management Fee Structure</strong> is designed to provide flexibility, affordability, and convenience for students and working professionals looking to build expertise in business analytics, data analytics, business intelligence, machine learning, and digital transformation. The program offers multiple fee payment options, enabling learners to choose a plan that aligns with their financial goals while pursuing an industry-relevant MBA specialization.</p>\r\n<p>As one of the fastest-growing management domains, <strong>Online MBA Business Analytics</strong> delivers strong career value by combining advanced analytics skills with strategic business knowledge, making it an attractive investment for future-focused professionals.</p>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Business Analytics Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<p>Students can choose from flexible fee payment options according to their convenience.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Fee Payment Option</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Semester-Wise Fee (4 Semesters)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹55,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Annual Fee (2 Years)</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹105,000 per year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>One-Time Full Program Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹196,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Additional Fees &amp; Charges</h3>\r\n<p>In addition to the program fee, students should consider the following academic and administrative charges.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Particulars</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admission Processing Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Initial Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹10,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per subject per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Project Fee</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">₹800 per attempt</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Online MBA Business Analytics Payment Options</h3>\r\n<p>The university provides multiple payment plans to make higher education more accessible and manageable.</p>\r\n<h4>Semester-Wise Payment Plan</h4>\r\n<p>The semester-wise payment option allows students to divide the total program cost across four semesters, making financial planning easier throughout the course duration.</p>\r\n<h4>Annual Payment Plan</h4>\r\n<p>Students can opt for the annual fee structure and pay the program fee over two academic years.</p>\r\n<h4>One-Time Full Fee Payment</h4>\r\n<p>Applicants who prefer simplified financial planning can choose to pay the complete <strong>Online MBA in Business Analytics Management program fee of ₹196,000</strong> in a single installment.</p>\r\n<h3>Scholarship Benefits</h3>\r\n<p>The university offers a special scholarship policy to support service personnel and their families.</p>\r\n<h4>Eligible Categories</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Armed Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Paramilitary Forces Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Defence Service Personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Eligible Dependents</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Qualified applicants can avail a <strong>20% scholarship on the program fee</strong>, helping reduce the overall cost of earning a postgraduate management degree.</p>\r\n<h3>Education Loan &amp; No Cost EMI Facilities</h3>\r\n<p>To support students in financing their education, the university offers multiple payment assistance options.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Education loan facilities for eligible applicants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>No Cost EMI options for convenient fee payment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Flexible financing solutions for working professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Financial assistance available even without a credit card.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Guidance from admission counsellors regarding financing and payment plans.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These facilities help learners pursue their academic goals without placing excessive financial pressure on themselves or their families.</p>\r\n<h3>Important Fee Guidelines</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Admission Processing Fee of ₹1,200 is applicable for all admissions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>₹10,000 is collected at the time of registration and adjusted against the program fee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Examination Fee of ₹800 is applicable per subject per attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Project Fee of ₹800 is applicable per attempt.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Fee structure is subject to revision as per university policies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Demand Draft payments should be made in favour of <strong>&ldquo;SVKM\'s NMIMS&rdquo;</strong>, payable at Mumbai.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Students are advised to contact a student counsellor for updated fee details, scholarship information, and financing options.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"591\">The <strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"190\">Online MBA in Business Analytics Management</strong> is designed for students and working professionals who want to develop expertise in business analytics, data-driven decision-making, machine learning, data visualization, business intelligence, and digital transformation. As organizations increasingly rely on data to drive growth and innovation, the demand for professionals with analytical and managerial skills continues to rise across industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"884\">The <strong data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"639\">Online MBA Business Analytics syllabus</strong> combines core management education with advanced analytics subjects, enabling students to understand how data can be used to improve business performance, optimize operations, enhance customer experiences, and support strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jsc9x6\" data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"952\">Online MBA Business Analytics Management Curriculum Highlights</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1335\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"968\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"979\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1335\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1068\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1021\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Name</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1068\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online MBA in Business Analytics Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1099\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1088\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1099\" data-col-size=\"md\">2 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1123\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Semesters</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1123\" data-col-size=\"md\">4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1150\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1140\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Mode</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1150\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1168\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specialization</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1201\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Analytics Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1229\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1217\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project Work</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1229\" data-col-size=\"md\">Included</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1335\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1247\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Industry Focus</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1335\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Analytics, Data Science, AI, Business Intelligence &amp; Digital Transformation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3vb2td\" data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1406\">What Will You Learn in the Online MBA Business Analytics Program?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1797\">The <strong data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1476\">Online MBA in Business Analytics Management course structure</strong> is designed to help students understand how organizations collect, analyze, interpret, and utilize data to make better business decisions. The curriculum focuses on analytics, machine learning, operational intelligence, consumer analytics, business process optimization, and leadership in technology-driven environments.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kqthp0\" data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1861\">Semester 1: Foundation of Business and Analytical Thinking</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1996\">The first semester builds a strong foundation in business management, communication, economics, marketing, and quantitative analysis.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2678\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2064\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2064\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2039\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online MBA Business Analytics Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2064\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2678\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2190\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2114\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2190\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop professional communication, presentation, and leadership skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2281\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2214\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2281\">Learn financial reporting and business accounting fundamentals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2374\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2305\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2374\">Understand customer behavior, branding, and marketing strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2488\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2411\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Micro Economics &amp; Macro Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2488\">Study economic concepts influencing business decisions and market trends.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2582\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2516\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Organisational Behaviour</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2582\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn workplace dynamics, leadership, and employee management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2678\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Quantitative Methods &ndash; I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2678\">Develop analytical and statistical problem-solving capabilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xcvcr7\" data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2734\">Semester 2: Core Business Management and Analytics</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2868\">The second semester strengthens managerial competencies while introducing business analytics and strategic decision-making concepts.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"3536\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2936\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2936\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2911\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online MBA Business Analytics Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2936\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"3536\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"3057\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2982\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3057\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn data-driven decision-making and business intelligence techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3155\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3089\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cost &amp; Management Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3155\">Understand budgeting, financial planning, and cost management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3252\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3183\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspect of Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3252\">Study business regulations, corporate governance, and compliance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3344\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3276\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3344\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop strategic planning and organizational leadership skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3437\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3373\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3437\">Learn workforce management and talent development practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3536\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3462\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operations Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3536\">Understand process optimization and operational efficiency techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tki8h5\" data-start=\"3538\" data-end=\"3611\">Semester 3: Advanced Business Analytics and Data Science Applications</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3613\" data-end=\"3759\">The third semester focuses on specialized <strong data-start=\"3655\" data-end=\"3690\">MBA Business Analytics subjects</strong> that help students transform business data into actionable insights.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"4550\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"3827\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"3827\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"3802\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online MBA Business Analytics Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3802\" data-end=\"3827\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3852\" data-end=\"4550\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3852\" data-end=\"3942\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3852\" data-end=\"3872\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Finance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3942\">Learn corporate financial planning and investment decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3943\" data-end=\"4036\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3943\" data-end=\"3966\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3966\" data-end=\"4036\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop research, analytical, and business problem-solving skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4037\" data-end=\"4119\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4037\" data-end=\"4056\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project Pre-work</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4056\" data-end=\"4119\">Prepare frameworks and methodologies for the final project.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4120\" data-end=\"4218\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4120\" data-end=\"4150\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Analytics for Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4218\">Learn data analysis techniques for strategic business decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4219\" data-end=\"4328\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4219\" data-end=\"4251\" data-col-size=\"md\">Machine Learning for Managers</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4251\" data-end=\"4328\">Understand AI and machine learning applications in business environments.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4453\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4373\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Process Modelling and Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4373\" data-end=\"4453\">Learn process mapping, optimization, and performance improvement techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4454\" data-end=\"4550\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4454\" data-end=\"4473\" data-col-size=\"md\">Visual Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4550\">Develop expertise in dashboards, reporting, and data visualization tools.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pf8ds2\" data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4633\">Semester 4: Consumer Analytics, Supply Chain Analytics and Digital Leadership</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4635\" data-end=\"4818\">The final semester focuses on advanced analytics applications, leadership, and digital transformation while allowing students to apply their knowledge through a comprehensive project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4820\" data-end=\"5630\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4820\" data-end=\"4886\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4820\" data-end=\"4886\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4820\" data-end=\"4861\" data-col-size=\"md\">Online MBA Business Analytics Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4861\" data-end=\"4886\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4911\" data-end=\"5630\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4911\" data-end=\"5006\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4911\" data-end=\"4938\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Sustainability</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4938\" data-end=\"5006\">Learn sustainable business practices and responsible management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5007\" data-end=\"5094\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5007\" data-end=\"5031\" data-col-size=\"md\">Indian Ethos &amp; Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5031\" data-end=\"5094\">Understand ethical leadership and corporate responsibility.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5095\" data-end=\"5193\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5095\" data-end=\"5120\" data-col-size=\"md\">International Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5120\" data-end=\"5193\">Explore global markets, international trade, and business strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5194\" data-end=\"5273\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5194\" data-end=\"5204\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5204\" data-end=\"5273\">Apply analytics concepts to solve real-world business challenges.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5274\" data-end=\"5385\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5274\" data-end=\"5315\" data-col-size=\"md\">Operational and Supply Chain Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5315\" data-end=\"5385\">Use analytics to optimize operations and supply chain performance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5386\" data-end=\"5520\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5386\" data-end=\"5434\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Leadership in the Age of Industry 5.0</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5434\" data-end=\"5520\">Learn leadership strategies for AI-driven and digitally transformed organizations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5521\" data-end=\"5630\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5521\" data-end=\"5547\" data-col-size=\"md\">Consumer Data Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5547\" data-end=\"5630\" data-col-size=\"md\">Analyze customer data to improve business performance and customer experiences.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11nyytl\" data-start=\"5632\" data-end=\"5689\">Online MBA Business Analytics Skills You Will Develop</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5691\" data-end=\"5831\">The <strong data-start=\"5695\" data-end=\"5739\">Online MBA Business Analytics curriculum</strong> helps students build highly valuable analytical, managerial, and technology-focused skills.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5833\" data-end=\"6140\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v3fx4\" data-start=\"5833\" data-end=\"5853\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yeyxxq\" data-start=\"5854\" data-end=\"5870\">Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12dlm0g\" data-start=\"5871\" data-end=\"5902\">Machine Learning Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gwptu\" data-start=\"5903\" data-end=\"5923\">Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16qco2j\" data-start=\"5924\" data-end=\"5947\">Business Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dydbq8\" data-start=\"5948\" data-end=\"5968\">Consumer Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ly3eu1\" data-start=\"5969\" data-end=\"5991\">Predictive Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tc5gty\" data-start=\"5992\" data-end=\"6021\">Business Process Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rgti00\" data-start=\"6022\" data-end=\"6046\">Supply Chain Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mcm96i\" data-start=\"6047\" data-end=\"6074\">Strategic Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wa1zu\" data-start=\"6075\" data-end=\"6110\">Digital Transformation Leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p49qai\" data-start=\"6111\" data-end=\"6140\">Data-Driven Problem Solving</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x0u873\" data-start=\"6142\" data-end=\"6188\">&nbsp;</h3>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 196000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(451, 82, '022a1ab4-2826-4816-9b66-4680447d1bf7', '0e21062c-78c5-4b5a-8327-0af8287be913', 207, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 04:17:21', '2026-05-30 04:17:21', '<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"335\">The <strong data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"74\">Online MBA admission process</strong> is designed to be simple, transparent, and student-friendly. From registration to final enrollment, each step ensures that eligible candidates can complete their admission smoothly and begin their management education journey without unnecessary complications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"556\">Whether you are a fresh graduate or a working professional, understanding the complete <strong data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"458\">Online MBA admission procedure</strong> can help you avoid delays, document issues, and application errors during the enrollment process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s1h535\" data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"589\">Step 1: Online Registration</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"683\">The admission journey begins with candidate registration on the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"870\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cnlbnn\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"758\">Create your admission account using a valid email ID and mobile number.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"149pk5c\" data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"803\">Enter basic personal and academic details.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13xb0sm\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"870\">Generate your unique applicant ID for future admission tracking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"1029\"><strong data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"880\">Tip:</strong> Use an active email address and mobile number as all admission updates, verification links, and enrollment communications will be sent through them.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hzednt\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1061\">Step 2: Email Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1137\">After registration, candidates must verify their registered email address.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u4uqpk\" data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1187\">Open the verification link sent to your email.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uwuq5i\" data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1222\">Activate your admission account.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m4i1e5\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1264\">Proceed to the online application form.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1385\">Email verification ensures secure communication and prevents application-related issues later in the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hcnjqm\" data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1435\">Step 3: Complete the Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1527\">Once the account is verified, candidates need to fill out the Online MBA application form.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kl7go9\" data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1561\">Enter academic qualifications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9lswc0\" data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1590\">Upload required documents.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9ihmxb\" data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1639\">Select the desired program and specialization.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ypllkh\" data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1689\">Review all details carefully before submission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1790\">Applicants who do not meet the eligibility criteria may not proceed further in the admission cycle.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hko7uf\" data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1827\">Step 4: Pay the Application Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1920\">To successfully submit the application, candidates must pay the prescribed application fee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1958\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1958\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1948\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1958\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2001\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2011\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2109\">After successful payment, the application is formally submitted for evaluation and verification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1eyevgz\" data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2151\">Step 5: Merit-Based Admission Review</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2253\">The university evaluates applications based on academic qualifications and eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2363\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cdo228\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2287\">Academic records are reviewed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z7qig8\" data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2324\">Eligibility criteria are verified.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lwnx9w\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2363\">Merit-based assessment is conducted.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2476\">If additional clarification is required, an admission counselor may contact the candidate for further guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hxzm31\" data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2517\">Step 6: Provisional Admission Offer</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2617\">Candidates who successfully meet the admission requirements receive a provisional admission offer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2633\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2757\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"163yyat\" data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2675\">Eligibility verification is completed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jkgc1g\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2706\">Admission status is updated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p4jsgt\" data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2757\">Offer details are communicated to the applicant.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2856\">This confirms that the candidate has been shortlisted for admission subject to final formalities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19ic73e\" data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2922\">Step 7: Document Verification and Final Admission Processing</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2990\">Before final enrollment, submitted documents undergo verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3028\">Commonly required documents include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3213\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwipmb\" data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3077\">Graduation Mark Sheets and Degree Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2mxnc\" data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3105\">Government Photo ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1omr008\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3132\">Passport-Size Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3171\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m1zoss\" data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3213\">Work Experience Documents (if required)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3263\">Applications may be rejected in cases involving:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3388\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvdcok\" data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3291\">Incomplete documentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3r19\" data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3315\">Incorrect information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mxfkh3\" data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3345\">Fake or forged certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ott8jv\" data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3388\">Failure to meet eligibility requirements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ni84e\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3421\">Step 8: Program Fee Payment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3523\">After successful verification, candidates must pay the applicable program fee to confirm their seat.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3770\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3557\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3557\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3541\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3557\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3770\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3630\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3630\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3631\" data-end=\"3663\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3631\" data-end=\"3653\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3663\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3696\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3685\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3696\">₹35,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3731\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3721\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3731\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3770\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3755\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3754\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3770\"><strong data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3768\">₹80,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"3837\">Seat confirmation is completed only after successful fee payment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1eixhrl\" data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3873\">Step 9: Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3921\">Once all admission requirements are fulfilled:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3923\" data-end=\"4084\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgxf0r\" data-start=\"3923\" data-end=\"3949\">Enrollment is confirmed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dhvxv2\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3986\">Student credentials are generated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ikuji\" data-start=\"3987\" data-end=\"4041\">Learning Management System (LMS) access is provided.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1di1554\" data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4084\">Academic orientation details are shared.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4086\" data-end=\"4179\">Students can then access study materials, live sessions, assignments, and academic resources.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"113i17w\" data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4228\">Step 10: Commencement of Online MBA Classes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4311\">After admission confirmation, students officially begin their Online MBA program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4313\" data-end=\"4344\">The program typically includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4552\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zpqaf4\" data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4375\">Interactive online lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1bj5l\" data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4403\">Recorded learning content</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vwg3l1\" data-start=\"4404\" data-end=\"4429\">Digital study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xowqc3\" data-start=\"4430\" data-end=\"4458\">Industry-oriented projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gcrk5i\" data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4488\">Assignments and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s1jkbi\" data-start=\"4489\" data-end=\"4512\">Semester examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18nfo21\" data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4552\">Career and placement support services</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"442\">The <strong data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"75\">Online MBA eligibility criteria</strong> are designed to ensure that applicants have the academic foundation required to understand advanced business, management, finance, marketing, and leadership concepts taught during the program. Whether you are a recent graduate or a working professional looking to advance your career, meeting the eligibility requirements is the first step toward securing admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s0drs4\" data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"480\">Who Can Apply for an Online MBA?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"577\">Candidates seeking admission to the Online MBA program must fulfill the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hkan6i\" data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"667\">A <strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"604\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university or institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"501h63\" data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"828\">Graduates from fields such as Commerce, Science, Arts, Engineering, Management, Computer Applications, and other recognized disciplines are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hyb6j\" data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"960\">Final-year bachelor\'s degree students may apply subject to the submission of qualifying documents within the prescribed timeline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ir7u7l\" data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1060\">Candidates must satisfy any additional university-specific admission requirements, if applicable.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"349\">The <strong data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"66\">Online MBA fee structure</strong> is designed to provide an affordable pathway for students and working professionals seeking a recognized management degree. The total program fee includes tuition fees, examination charges, registration fees, and alumni fees, ensuring complete transparency in the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nhkvvj\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"380\">Online MBA Fees Breakdown</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"626\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"414\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"414\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"398\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"414\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"626\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"486\">\r\n<td data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"476\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"486\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"519\">\r\n<td data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"509\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"519\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"552\">\r\n<td data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"541\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"552\">₹35,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"587\">\r\n<td data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"577\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"587\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"626\">\r\n<td data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"611\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"610\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"626\"><strong data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"624\">₹80,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"go6bbp\" data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"678\">What is Included in the Online MBA Course Fee?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"866\">The Online MBA program fee generally covers multiple academic and student support services, helping learners access quality management education without relocating or leaving their jobs.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"1164\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dk3gq1\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"925\">Access to online learning resources and study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gj2rue\" data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"954\">Live and recorded lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yvfy2l\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"996\">Learning Management System (LMS) access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ugo5l\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1033\">Online assignments and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fyx8p8\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1068\">Semester and annual examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n9h3pf\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1111\">Academic support and faculty interaction</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bzlcwy\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1164\">Alumni network membership after program completion<br><br>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17b5b6j\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2515\">mportant Fee-Related Points</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2917\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bmelal\" data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2572\">Registration Fee and Alumni Fee are one-time charges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6lwso3\" data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2611\">Examination Fee is charged annually.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wb65fa\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2683\">Tuition Fee constitutes the major component of the total program fee.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lgjgc9\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2802\">Students should verify the latest fee structure during admission as university policies may be updated periodically.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mlu3h6\" data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2917\">Additional charges, if any, may apply for re-examinations, certification requests, or special academic services.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"451\">The <strong data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"102\">Online MBA syllabus</strong> is designed to develop strong business management, leadership, analytical, and strategic decision-making skills. The curriculum combines core management subjects, business analytics, finance, marketing, human resource management, operations, entrepreneurship, and specialization electives to prepare students for leadership roles across industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"835\">Unlike traditional management programs that focus heavily on theory, this <strong data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"552\">Online MBA curriculum</strong> emphasizes practical business applications, data-driven decision-making, corporate strategy, digital transformation, and real-world problem-solving. The inclusion of elective specializations and a master\'s thesis further helps students build expertise in their chosen career domain.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vke2d0\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1332\">Semester 1: Foundation of Business Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1588\">The first semester builds a strong understanding of core management concepts that form the backbone of modern business organizations. Students learn how businesses operate, make decisions, manage resources, and respond to economic and legal environments.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"2207\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1615\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1615\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1600\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1615\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"2207\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1735\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1666\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1735\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understanding consumer behavior, branding, and market strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1833\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1762\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accounting for Managers</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1833\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial reporting, budgeting, and managerial accounting concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1924\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1861\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Organizational Behaviour</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1924\">Study of workplace behavior, leadership, and team dynamics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1967\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Statistics for Decision Making</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2031\">Statistical tools for business analysis and decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2116\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2060\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspects of Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2116\">Business laws, contracts, and regulatory compliance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2207\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2140\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Managerial Economics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2207\" data-col-size=\"md\">Economic principles used in managerial and strategic decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14pv70n\" data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2269\">Semester 2: Business Analytics and Functional Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2490\">The second semester focuses on business analytics, financial management, operations, human resources, and digital business strategies. Students develop analytical skills that are increasingly demanded across industries.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"3225\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2517\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2517\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2502\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2517\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"3225\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2640\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2582\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Business Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2640\">Data analysis techniques for business decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2730\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2661\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corporate Finance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2730\">Financial planning, investment analysis, and corporate valuation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2830\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2759\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2830\">Talent acquisition, employee development, and workforce management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2925\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2858\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Research Method</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2925\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research techniques and business problem-solving methodologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"3031\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2967\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operations and Supply Chain Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"3031\">Managing production, logistics, and supply chain efficiency.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3129\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3052\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Digital Marketing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3129\">SEO, social media marketing, online advertising, and customer engagement.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3225\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entrepreneurship</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3225\" data-col-size=\"md\">Startup creation, innovation management, and business growth strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mjkd0t\" data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3294\">Semester 3: Strategic Management and Specialization Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3296\" data-end=\"3459\">During the third semester, students begin focusing on their chosen specialization while strengthening strategic thinking, communication, and research capabilities.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"4179\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3486\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3486\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3471\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3486\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"4179\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3614\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3539\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3614\">Professional communication, presentations, and business writing skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3707\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3638\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3707\">Long-term business planning and competitive strategy formulation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3775\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3731\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major 1 &ndash; Elective 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3775\">Specialization-focused advanced subject.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3859\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3799\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major 1 &ndash; Elective 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3859\">Specialized domain knowledge and practical applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3860\" data-end=\"3934\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3860\" data-end=\"3883\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major 1 &ndash; Elective 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"3934\">Advanced concepts in the chosen specialization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"3995\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"3958\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major 2 &ndash; Elective 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"3995\" data-col-size=\"md\">Secondary specialization subject.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4072\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4019\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major 2 &ndash; Elective 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4019\" data-end=\"4072\">Advanced elective for cross-functional expertise.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4179\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4105\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Master Thesis &ndash; Initial Phase</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4179\">Research topic selection, proposal development, and literature review.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nr8655\" data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4229\">Semester 4: Advanced Management and Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4231\" data-end=\"4389\">The final semester emphasizes ethical leadership, corporate responsibility, advanced specialization learning, and completion of the master\'s research project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4839\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4416\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4416\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4401\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4401\" data-end=\"4416\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"4839\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"4537\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"4470\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Ethics and CSR</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4537\">Ethical business practices and corporate social responsibility.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4538\" data-end=\"4596\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4538\" data-end=\"4561\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major 1 &ndash; Elective 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4561\" data-end=\"4596\">Advanced specialization course.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4597\" data-end=\"4655\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4597\" data-end=\"4620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major 2 &ndash; Elective 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4620\" data-end=\"4655\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized business knowledge.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4656\" data-end=\"4735\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4656\" data-end=\"4679\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major 2 &ndash; Elective 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4679\" data-end=\"4735\">Advanced elective focusing on industry applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4839\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4766\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Master Thesis &ndash; Final Phase</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4766\" data-end=\"4839\">Research execution, analysis, report submission, and project defense.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aqdmcx\" data-start=\"4841\" data-end=\"4906\">Key Skills You Will Develop Through the Online MBA Curriculum</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4908\" data-end=\"5048\">The Online MBA course structure is designed to help learners develop industry-relevant management competencies that employers actively seek.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5050\" data-end=\"5463\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rrnmd1\" data-start=\"5050\" data-end=\"5081\">Strategic Business Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18wo778\" data-start=\"5082\" data-end=\"5114\">Leadership and Team Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nhhmbr\" data-start=\"5115\" data-end=\"5145\">Marketing and Brand Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oke86n\" data-start=\"5146\" data-end=\"5186\">Financial Analysis and Decision Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aogelq\" data-start=\"5187\" data-end=\"5214\">Human Resource Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qxexu1\" data-start=\"5215\" data-end=\"5259\">Business Analytics and Data Interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"409qfc\" data-start=\"5260\" data-end=\"5300\">Supply Chain and Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"atved0\" data-start=\"5301\" data-end=\"5327\">Digital Marketing Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10vbd2n\" data-start=\"5328\" data-end=\"5361\">Entrepreneurship and Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c92kkx\" data-start=\"5362\" data-end=\"5401\">Business Research and Problem Solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ly77e3\" data-start=\"5402\" data-end=\"5427\">Corporate Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ld4vm2\" data-start=\"5428\" data-end=\"5463\">Ethical Leadership and Governance</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 80200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(452, 82, '022a1ab4-2826-4816-9b66-4680447d1bf7', '0e21062c-78c5-4b5a-8327-0af8287be913', 75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 04:51:55', '2026-05-30 04:51:55', '<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"477\">The <strong data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"74\">Online MCA admission process</strong> is designed to provide a smooth and hassle-free enrollment experience for graduates aspiring to build successful careers in software development, data science, cloud computing, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, and other high-demand technology domains. The admission journey follows a structured process that ensures transparency, eligibility verification, and timely enrollment into the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"682\">Whether you are a fresh graduate or a working professional, understanding the complete <strong data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"600\">Online MCA admission procedure</strong> can help you secure your admission quickly and avoid common application mistakes.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ub3eys\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"729\">Step 1: Register for Online MCA Admission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"833\">The first step is to complete the online registration process through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cqo4b\" data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"867\">Create your admission account.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15zh0v4\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"903\">Enter basic personal information.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mds5jf\" data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"949\">Provide a valid email ID and mobile number.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c65443\" data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1014\">Generate your applicant profile for future admission tracking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1126\">A successful registration allows candidates to access the Online MCA application form and admission dashboard.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qahkao\" data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1165\">Step 2: Verify Your Email Address</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1234\">After registration, candidates must verify their email credentials.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1360\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fvewl6\" data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1295\">Open the verification email received from the university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kcjz33\" data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1325\">Confirm your email address.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uwuq5i\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1360\">Activate your admission account.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1473\">Email verification is mandatory to receive admission updates, fee notifications, and enrollment communications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y6vmgx\" data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1527\">Step 3: Complete the Online MCA Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1604\">Once the account is activated, applicants must complete the admission form.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1743\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kl7go9\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1638\">Enter academic qualifications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9lswc0\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1667\">Upload required documents.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yltsx3\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1710\">Verify personal and educational details.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m63a9v\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1743\">Select the Online MCA program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1864\">Applicants must ensure that all information is accurate before submission to avoid delays during document verification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hko7uf\" data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1901\">Step 4: Pay the Application Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1992\">After completing the application form, candidates must pay the admission application fee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2077\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2010\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2020\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2077\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2077\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2067\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2077\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2178\">Once the payment is successfully processed, the application is submitted for evaluation and review.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v7bsvz\" data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2224\">Step 5: Merit-Based Admission Evaluation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2309\">Applications are reviewed based on academic eligibility and admission requirements.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2430\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i4o910\" data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2344\">Academic records are evaluated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z7qig8\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2381\">Eligibility criteria are verified.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175j0n1\" data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2430\">Merit-based admission assessment is conducted.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2564\">In some cases, admission counselors may contact applicants for additional clarification or guidance regarding the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wxmmau\" data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2613\">Step 6: Receive Provisional Admission Offer</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2703\">Candidates who satisfy the admission requirements receive a provisional admission offer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2730\">This stage confirms that:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2865\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ri0j2l\" data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2773\">Eligibility requirements have been met.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10pr0ss\" data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2819\">Academic qualifications have been reviewed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hjtp5m\" data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2865\">The applicant is shortlisted for admission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2966\">The provisional admission notification is shared through the registered email and admission portal.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"383tsa\" data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3024\">Step 7: Document Verification and Admission Approval</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3137\">The university verifies all submitted academic and personal documents before granting final admission approval.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3175\">Commonly required documents include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3327\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i15x41\" data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3208\">Bachelor\'s Degree Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7h5qe1\" data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3233\">Graduation Mark Sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2mxnc\" data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3261\">Government Photo ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1omr008\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3288\">Passport-Size Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3327\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3329\" data-end=\"3483\">Applications may be rejected if documents are incomplete, incorrect, fraudulent, or if the applicant does not satisfy the prescribed eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"132z4j9\" data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3527\">Step 8: Pay the Online MCA Program Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3628\">After successful verification, candidates must pay the prescribed program fee to confirm admission.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3874\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3662\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3662\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3646\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3662\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3874\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3734\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3724\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3734\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3767\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3757\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3767\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3800\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3789\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3800\">₹37,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3835\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3825\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3825\" data-end=\"3835\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3836\" data-end=\"3874\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3836\" data-end=\"3859\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3838\" data-end=\"3858\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3859\" data-end=\"3874\"><strong data-start=\"3861\" data-end=\"3872\">₹84,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3876\" data-end=\"3943\">Fee payment secures the candidate\'s seat in the Online MCA program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xfjfrx\" data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"3985\">Step 9: Final Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3987\" data-end=\"4041\">Upon successful fee payment and document verification:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4216\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8vdwv3\" data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4080\">Enrollment is officially confirmed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dhvxv2\" data-start=\"4081\" data-end=\"4117\">Student credentials are generated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18yxs38\" data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4173\">LMS (Learning Management System) access is activated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1di1554\" data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4216\">Academic orientation details are shared.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4218\" data-end=\"4300\">Students can then begin accessing their digital learning resources and coursework.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5ottfx\" data-start=\"4302\" data-end=\"4349\">Step 10: Commencement of Online MCA Classes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4351\" data-end=\"4434\">After admission confirmation, students can start their Online MCA learning journey.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4467\">The program typically includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4699\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"171fkap\" data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4502\">Live interactive online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u3bgu2\" data-start=\"4503\" data-end=\"4528\">Recorded video lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vwg3l1\" data-start=\"4529\" data-end=\"4554\">Digital study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wr75vy\" data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4591\">Coding assignments and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k411zx\" data-start=\"4592\" data-end=\"4612\">Practical projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g7hyj9\" data-start=\"4613\" data-end=\"4633\">Faculty mentorship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s1jkbi\" data-start=\"4634\" data-end=\"4657\">Semester examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3bso1t\" data-start=\"4658\" data-end=\"4699\">Career support and placement assistance</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"525\">The <strong data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"109\">Online MCA (Master of Computer Applications) eligibility criteria</strong> are designed to ensure that students have the academic background necessary to understand advanced concepts in computer science, software development, programming, databases, networking, cloud computing, artificial intelligence, and emerging technologies. As a postgraduate program, the Online MCA is ideal for graduates looking to build specialized technical expertise and advance their careers in the IT industry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kftvx1\" data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"580\">Eligibility Requirements for Online MCA Admission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"673\">Candidates seeking admission to the Online MCA program must fulfill the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gnaq9a\" data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"750\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"705\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university or institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b77o23\" data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"852\">Candidates from various academic backgrounds may apply, subject to university admission guidelines.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gu6e2f\" data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"960\">Applicants must meet the eligibility requirements prescribed by the institution at the time of admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcu43v\" data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1097\">Final-year bachelor\'s degree students may also apply, subject to the submission of qualifying documents within the specified timeline.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"537\">The <strong data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"86\">Online MCA (Master of Computer Applications)</strong> program is designed for graduates who want to build advanced expertise in software development, programming, cloud computing, artificial intelligence, data analytics, cybersecurity, and modern IT technologies. With an affordable fee structure and flexible online learning format, the program provides an excellent opportunity for students and working professionals to earn a postgraduate computer applications degree without disrupting their careers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h09s0l\" data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"567\">Online MCA Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"813\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"601\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"601\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"585\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"601\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"813\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"673\">\r\n<td data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"663\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"673\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"706\">\r\n<td data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"696\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"706\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"739\">\r\n<td data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"728\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"739\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹37,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"774\">\r\n<td data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"764\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"774\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"813\">\r\n<td data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"798\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"797\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"813\"><strong data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"811\">₹84,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"slo371\" data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"843\">Online MCA Fee Breakdown</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"1007\">The Online MCA course fee is structured to cover academic learning, examinations, digital resources, and student support services throughout the program duration.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1034\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1034\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1023\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1034\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1146\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1074\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1146\">Covers academic instruction, faculty support, and learning resources</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1210\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1165\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1210\">Annual examination and assessment charges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1230\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1270\">One-time admission processing charge</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1338\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1284\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1338\">Lifetime alumni membership and networking benefits</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1360\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Cost</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1410\">Comprehensive fee for the complete MCA program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2vezot\" data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1453\">What Does the Online MCA Fee Include?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1527\">Students enrolled in the Online MCA program typically receive access to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1824\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yo7004\" data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1571\">Digital learning platform and LMS access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvh35a\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1606\">Live and recorded online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uqey9t\" data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1647\">E-learning content and study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ugo5l\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1684\">Online assignments and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i36byu\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1725\">Faculty mentoring and academic support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s1jkbi\" data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1749\">Semester examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ceieu\" data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1783\">Project guidance and evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14pa2fw\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1824\">Alumni network access after graduation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n91iug\" data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3380\">Important Fee-Related Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3770\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bmelal\" data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3437\">Registration Fee and Alumni Fee are one-time charges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aasorj\" data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3476\">Examination Fee is payable annually.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14boqg2\" data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3538\">Tuition Fee constitutes the primary academic fee component.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qamnyb\" data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3650\">Students should verify the latest fee details during admission as fee structures may be revised periodically.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mnun8q\" data-start=\"3651\" data-end=\"3770\">Additional charges may apply for re-examinations, duplicate certificates, or special academic services if applicable</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"542\">The <strong data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"94\">Online MCA (Master of Computer Applications)</strong> curriculum is carefully designed to equip students with advanced technical knowledge, programming expertise, software development skills, and emerging technology competencies required by today\'s IT industry. The program combines core computer science concepts with practical learning in areas such as <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"541\">Java Programming, Machine Learning, Cloud Computing, Mobile App Development, Data Structures, Algorithms, Database Management, and Networking</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"804\">This industry-focused Online MCA syllabus helps students build strong problem-solving abilities while preparing them for high-demand careers in software development, artificial intelligence, cloud technologies, cybersecurity, data analytics, and IT management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xx7l2m\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"837\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11ezi9a\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1276\">Semester 1: Building Strong Computing Foundations</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1541\">The first semester focuses on developing fundamental programming, analytical, mathematical, and database management skills. Students gain a solid understanding of how computer systems operate and learn the core concepts required for advanced software development.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"2306\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1553\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1568\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"2306\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1712\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1639\" data-col-size=\"md\">Problem Solving and Computer Programming</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1712\">Develop programming logic, coding skills, and computational thinking.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1851\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1756\" data-col-size=\"md\">Computational Mathematics and Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1851\">Learn mathematical concepts and statistical techniques used in computing and data analysis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1959\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1881\" data-col-size=\"md\">Database Management System</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1959\">Understand database design, SQL, data storage, and information management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"2079\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1992\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Computer Organization</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2079\">Study computer architecture, processors, memory systems, and hardware fundamentals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2193\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2124\" data-col-size=\"md\">English Proficiency and Aptitude Building</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2193\">Enhance professional communication and workplace language skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2306\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2232\" data-col-size=\"md\">Quantitative Aptitude and Reasoning</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2306\">Strengthen logical reasoning and analytical problem-solving abilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ajuj25\" data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2373\">Semester 2: Core Software Development and Intelligent Systems</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2582\">The second semester introduces students to advanced programming concepts, machine learning fundamentals, networking technologies, and operating systems that form the backbone of modern software applications.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"3378\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2609\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2609\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2594\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2609\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"3378\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2737\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2677\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Object Oriented Programming with Java</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2737\">Learn object-oriented programming principles using Java.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2855\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2769\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Machine Learning with Python</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2855\">Explore predictive models, data analysis, and AI-based problem-solving techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2944\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2874\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Structures</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2944\">Study efficient data organization, storage, and retrieval methods.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"3064\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2981\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Verbal and Quantitative Reasoning</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3064\">Improve analytical, logical, and communication skills for professional success.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3187\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3099\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Communication &amp; Networking</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3187\">Understand network architecture, communication protocols, and internet technologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3188\" data-end=\"3288\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3188\" data-end=\"3208\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operating Systems</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3288\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn process management, memory management, and system resource allocation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3378\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3302\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3302\" data-end=\"3378\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized subject based on career interests and industry requirements.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"iv8phd\" data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3443\">Semester 3: Advanced Application Development and Algorithms</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3640\">The third semester focuses on application development and computational efficiency. Students gain practical exposure to modern software development frameworks and advanced algorithmic techniques.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"4077\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3667\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3667\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3652\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3667\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"4077\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3792\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3720\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mobile App Development</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3720\" data-end=\"3792\">Design and develop mobile applications for modern digital platforms.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3793\" data-end=\"3923\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3793\" data-end=\"3827\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Design &amp; Analysis of Algorithms</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3923\">Learn algorithm optimization, complexity analysis, and efficient problem-solving techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"4002\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3938\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3938\" data-end=\"4002\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced specialization course aligned with industry trends.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4077\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4018\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4018\" data-end=\"4077\">Career-oriented elective for domain-specific expertise.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mtf5ax\" data-start=\"4079\" data-end=\"4147\">Semester 4: Industry Readiness and Real-World Project Experience</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4149\" data-end=\"4374\">The final semester emphasizes practical implementation, cloud technologies, and project-based learning. Students apply their technical knowledge to solve real-world challenges through a comprehensive industry-focused project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4747\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4401\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4401\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4386\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4401\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4429\" data-end=\"4747\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4429\" data-end=\"4535\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4429\" data-end=\"4445\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4535\">Execute a full-scale software or technology project demonstrating technical expertise.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4536\" data-end=\"4642\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4536\" data-end=\"4561\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Readiness</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4561\" data-end=\"4642\">Develop interview preparation, communication, teamwork, and workplace skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4643\" data-end=\"4747\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4643\" data-end=\"4661\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cloud Computing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4661\" data-end=\"4747\">Learn cloud infrastructure, virtualization, deployment models, and cloud services.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xv7sit\" data-start=\"4749\" data-end=\"4804\">Key Skills Developed Through the Online MCA Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4806\" data-end=\"4917\">The Online MCA curriculum is designed to build technical competencies that align with current industry demands.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4919\" data-end=\"5332\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jfe3ja\" data-start=\"4919\" data-end=\"4957\">Programming and Software Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kw8m8t\" data-start=\"4958\" data-end=\"4988\">Java Application Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hk9mzp\" data-start=\"4989\" data-end=\"5009\">Python Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b2r0rx\" data-start=\"5010\" data-end=\"5041\">Machine Learning Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jw0gfb\" data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5074\">Database Design and Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91j18p\" data-start=\"5075\" data-end=\"5107\">Data Structures and Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11zxeld\" data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5140\">Mobile Application Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"glnl8p\" data-start=\"5141\" data-end=\"5171\">Cloud Computing Technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"akd8ye\" data-start=\"5172\" data-end=\"5210\">Networking and System Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1spsrxh\" data-start=\"5211\" data-end=\"5251\">Analytical and Logical Problem Solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7gmzmp\" data-start=\"5252\" data-end=\"5282\">Software Project Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y70jga\" data-start=\"5283\" data-end=\"5332\">Professional Communication and Career Readiness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19seh7u\" data-start=\"5334\" data-end=\"5379\">&nbsp;</h3>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 84200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(453, 82, '022a1ab4-2826-4816-9b66-4680447d1bf7', '0e21062c-78c5-4b5a-8327-0af8287be913', 77, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 05:03:27', '2026-05-30 05:03:27', '<p data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"506\">The <strong data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"78\">Online M.Com admission process</strong> is designed to make enrollment simple, transparent, and accessible for graduates seeking advanced knowledge in <strong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"287\">accounting, finance, banking, taxation, auditing, financial management, and business strategy</strong>. The admission procedure follows a structured step-by-step approach, ensuring that eligible candidates can complete their application smoothly and begin their postgraduate commerce education without unnecessary delays.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"709\">Whether you are a fresh graduate or a working professional aiming to enhance your commerce and finance expertise, understanding the complete admission process can help you secure your seat efficiently.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s1h535\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"742\">Step 1: Online Registration</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"841\">The admission journey begins with candidate registration through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cnlbnn\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"916\">Create your admission account using a valid email ID and mobile number.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"149pk5c\" data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"961\">Enter basic personal and academic details.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v54et\" data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1021\">Generate your applicant ID for future admission tracking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1101\">A successful registration enables access to the Online M.Com application form.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hzednt\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1133\">Step 2: Email Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1198\">After registration, candidates must verify their email address.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1330\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v8i1cg\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1259\">Open the verification link sent to your registered email.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kxc0os\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1295\">Confirm your account credentials.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2jpang\" data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1330\">Activate your admission profile.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1436\">Email verification ensures secure communication regarding admission updates and important notifications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hcnjqm\" data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1486\">Step 3: Complete the Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1577\">Once the account is verified, applicants must fill out the Online M.Com application form.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1715\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a19wdn\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1614\">Enter educational qualifications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9lswc0\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1643\">Upload required documents.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"197ngy3\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1687\">Verify personal and academic information.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qev4wx\" data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1715\">Select the M.Com program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1798\">Candidates should carefully review all details before submitting the application.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hko7uf\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1835\">Step 4: Pay the Application Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1928\">To complete the application process, candidates must submit the prescribed application fee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"2034\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1966\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1966\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1956\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1966\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2034\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2034\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2034\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2117\">After successful payment, the application is submitted for review and evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v7bsvz\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2163\">Step 5: Merit-Based Admission Evaluation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2261\">The university evaluates applications based on eligibility criteria and academic qualifications.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2385\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cdo228\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2295\">Academic records are reviewed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n5vn7b\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2336\">Eligibility requirements are verified.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175j0n1\" data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2385\">Merit-based admission assessment is conducted.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2485\">If required, admission counselors may contact applicants for additional guidance or clarification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wxmmau\" data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2534\">Step 6: Receive Provisional Admission Offer</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2634\">Candidates who successfully meet the admission requirements receive a provisional admission offer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2650\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2764\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fyhqw7\" data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2688\">Academic eligibility is confirmed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jkgc1g\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2719\">Admission status is updated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1spcut4\" data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2764\">Candidates are shortlisted for enrollment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2865\">The provisional admission notification is shared through the admission portal and registered email.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3rv2rz\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2900\">Step 7: Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"2980\">Before final admission approval, all submitted documents undergo verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3018\">Commonly required documents include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3170\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i15x41\" data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3051\">Bachelor\'s Degree Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7h5qe1\" data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3076\">Graduation Mark Sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2mxnc\" data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3104\">Government Photo ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1omr008\" data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3131\">Passport-Size Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3170\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3276\">Applications may be rejected if documents are incomplete, inaccurate, or fail verification requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1medm45\" data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3309\">Step 8: Pay the Program Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3405\">After successful verification, candidates must pay the program fee to confirm their admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12fha0o\" data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3437\">Online M.Com Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3683\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3471\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3471\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3455\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3471\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3683\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3543\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3533\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3543\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3544\" data-end=\"3576\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3544\" data-end=\"3566\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3576\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3609\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3598\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3598\" data-end=\"3609\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹20,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3610\" data-end=\"3644\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3610\" data-end=\"3634\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3634\" data-end=\"3644\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3645\" data-end=\"3683\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3645\" data-end=\"3668\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3667\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3683\"><strong data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3681\">₹50,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3766\">Fee payment officially reserves the candidate\'s seat in the Online M.Com program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xfjfrx\" data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3808\">Step 9: Final Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3810\" data-end=\"3867\">Once fee payment and document verification are completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3869\" data-end=\"4033\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgxf0r\" data-start=\"3869\" data-end=\"3895\">Enrollment is confirmed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dhvxv2\" data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"3932\">Student credentials are generated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18yxs38\" data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"3988\">LMS (Learning Management System) access is activated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sph3zb\" data-start=\"3989\" data-end=\"4033\">Academic onboarding information is shared.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4105\">Students can then access their study materials and learning resources.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15tgzq8\" data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4156\">Step 10: Commencement of Online M.Com Classes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4239\">After admission confirmation, students begin their Online M.Com learning journey.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4241\" data-end=\"4272\">The program generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4274\" data-end=\"4548\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hywzem\" data-start=\"4274\" data-end=\"4296\">Live online lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hn1g2u\" data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4337\">Recorded classes for flexible learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vwg3l1\" data-start=\"4338\" data-end=\"4363\">Digital study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gcrk5i\" data-start=\"4364\" data-end=\"4393\">Assignments and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"plimb6\" data-start=\"4394\" data-end=\"4430\">Research-based learning activities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i36byu\" data-start=\"4431\" data-end=\"4471\">Faculty mentoring and academic support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12josyn\" data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4493\">Online examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"crv3a8\" data-start=\"4494\" data-end=\"4548\">Career guidance and professional development support</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"471\">The <strong data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"100\">Online M.Com (Master of Commerce) eligibility criteria</strong> are designed for graduates who want to build advanced expertise in <strong data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"285\">accounting, finance, banking, taxation, auditing, corporate finance, financial management, and business analytics</strong>. As a postgraduate commerce degree, the program helps learners develop specialized knowledge and professional skills required for leadership and finance-focused roles across industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"700\">Whether you are a recent graduate planning higher studies or a working professional seeking career advancement, understanding the eligibility requirements is the first step toward securing admission to the Online M.Com program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qpsdd6\" data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"743\">Online M.Com Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"828\">To apply for the Online M.Com program, candidates must meet the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gheqyl\" data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"922\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"860\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university or higher education institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fgeonp\" data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1036\">Candidates from Commerce and other recognized academic backgrounds may apply, subject to university guidelines.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11naiv\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1179\">Final-year undergraduate students may apply provisionally, subject to the submission of qualifying documents within the prescribed timeline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lhzf0g\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1277\">Applicants must satisfy the admission and document verification requirements of the university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kbyosl\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1316\">Online M.Com Eligibility Overview</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1634\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1329\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Criteria</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1344\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1634\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1405\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1389\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Level</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1405\" data-col-size=\"md\">Postgraduate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1451\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1430\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1451\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor\'s Degree</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1473\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Degree Recognition</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1498\" data-col-size=\"md\">Recognized University</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1521\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Applicants</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1560\" data-col-size=\"md\">Graduates from approved disciplines</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1634\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1579\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Basis</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1634\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligibility Verification and Academic Qualification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rw1zg6\" data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2176\">Who Should Pursue an Online M.Com?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2216\">The Online M.Com program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2564\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rlzkc4\" data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2271\">Commerce graduates seeking advanced specialization.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1imp6d2\" data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2341\">Professionals working in finance, banking, accounting, or taxation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nmqd2c\" data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2411\">Candidates preparing for careers in corporate finance and auditing.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z3xpz2\" data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2485\">Individuals interested in financial analysis and investment management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2zs1q\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2564\">Aspirants planning higher studies, research, or professional certifications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"456\">The <strong data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"77\">Online M.Com (Master of Commerce)</strong> program is designed for graduates who want to deepen their knowledge of accounting, finance, taxation, banking, auditing, business management, and corporate finance. With an affordable fee structure and flexible online learning format, the program enables students and working professionals to pursue higher education while continuing their personal or professional commitments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"684\">The Online M.Com degree offers excellent value for learners seeking career advancement in the fields of <strong data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"683\">commerce, finance, accounting, banking, taxation, investment management, financial analysis, and corporate governance</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12fha0o\" data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"716\">Online M.Com Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"734\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"750\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"822\">\r\n<td data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"812\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"822\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"855\">\r\n<td data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"845\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"855\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"888\">\r\n<td data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"877\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"888\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹20,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n<td data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"913\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"923\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n<td data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"947\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"946\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"962\"><strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"960\">₹50,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"46bdtb\" data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"987\">M.Com Fee Breakdown</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1128\">The Online M.Com fee structure is designed to provide students with access to quality postgraduate commerce education at a reasonable cost.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1515\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1155\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1155\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1144\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1155\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1515\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1267\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1195\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1267\">Covers academic instruction, learning resources, and faculty support</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1331\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1286\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1331\" data-col-size=\"md\">Annual assessment and examination charges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1351\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1388\" data-col-size=\"md\">One-time admission processing fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1402\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1441\">Lifetime alumni membership benefits</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1515\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1462\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1515\">Complete cost of pursuing the Online M.Com degree</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n91iug\" data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3550\">Important Fee-Related Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3946\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bmelal\" data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3607\">Registration Fee and Alumni Fee are one-time charges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aasorj\" data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3646\">Examination Fee is payable annually.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xw4ua5\" data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3716\">Tuition Fee covers academic delivery and learning support services.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11nxdna\" data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3835\">Students should verify the latest fee structure during admission as university policies may be revised periodically.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rlqdte\" data-start=\"3836\" data-end=\"3946\">Additional charges may apply for re-examinations, certificate issuance, or other optional academic services.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"476\">The <strong data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"85\">Online M.Com (Master of Commerce)</strong> curriculum is designed to provide advanced knowledge in <strong data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"288\">accounting, finance, banking, auditing, taxation, business management, financial analysis, corporate governance, and strategic decision-making</strong>. The program goes beyond undergraduate commerce concepts and equips learners with the analytical, managerial, and financial expertise required in today\'s competitive business environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"823\">This industry-oriented <strong data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"526\">Online M.Com syllabus</strong> combines core commerce subjects with modern areas such as <strong data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"703\">ESG Finance, International Financial Management, Strategic Management, Research Methodology, and Advanced Auditing</strong>, helping students build specialized skills for leadership roles in finance, banking, consulting, and corporate sectors.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wi7rmr\" data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"858\">Online M.Com Course Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"871\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"885\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"993\">\r\n<td data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"926\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"993\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced Accounting, Finance, Economics, and Business Analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1086\">\r\n<td data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1007\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1086\" data-col-size=\"md\">Banking, Marketing, ESG Finance, International Finance, and IT Applications</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1174\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1100\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1174\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research, Auditing, Strategic Management, and Elective Specializations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1188\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1258\">Global Financial Systems, Research Project, and Advanced Electives</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ieqtzu\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1319\">Semester 1: Advanced Commerce and Financial Foundations</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1569\">The first semester establishes a strong foundation in advanced accounting, business economics, statistics, and financial management. Students develop analytical skills required for financial planning, decision-making, and organizational management.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"2201\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1581\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1596\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"2201\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1721\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1646\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1721\">Learn statistical techniques for business analysis and decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1849\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1755\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Management Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1849\">Study cost control, budgeting, performance evaluation, and strategic accounting practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1958\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1877\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Organizational Behaviour</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1958\">Understand workplace dynamics, leadership, motivation, and employee behavior.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2089\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2002\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Financial Management and Policy</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2089\">Explore investment decisions, capital structure, and financial planning strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2201\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2120\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Business Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2201\">Analyze economic principles affecting business growth and market performance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d118gr\" data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2267\">Semester 2: Finance, Banking, and Global Business Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2423\">The second semester focuses on financial markets, banking systems, international finance, marketing strategies, and technology-driven business management.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"3154\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2450\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2450\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2435\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2450\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"3154\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2584\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2500\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operations Research</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2584\">Apply quantitative techniques to solve complex business and management problems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2695\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2608\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2695\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand consumer behavior, branding, marketing strategy, and market development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2798\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2710\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ESG Finance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2798\">Learn environmental, social, and governance factors influencing financial decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2930\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2836\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2930\">Study global financial markets, foreign exchange, and international investment strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"3028\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2951\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Money and Banking</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"3028\">Explore banking operations, monetary systems, and financial institutions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3154\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3067\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Information Technology for Managers</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3154\">Understand technology tools and digital systems used in modern business management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n7cbfb\" data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3216\">Semester 3: Strategic Decision-Making and Specialization</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3388\">The third semester develops research, auditing, and strategic management capabilities while allowing students to build expertise through elective specialization subjects.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"4014\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3415\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3415\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3400\" data-end=\"3415\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"4014\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3553\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3466\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3553\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn research design, data collection, analysis, and business research techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3658\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3574\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Auditing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3658\">Study auditing standards, compliance frameworks, and corporate audit procedures.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3659\" data-end=\"3754\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3659\" data-end=\"3682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3754\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop long-term business planning and competitive strategy skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3845\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3774\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective Major 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3774\" data-end=\"3845\">Specialized subject aligned with career goals and domain expertise.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3930\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3865\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective Major 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3930\">Advanced specialization subject for professional development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"4014\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"3950\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective Minor 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"4014\">Complementary subject supporting interdisciplinary learning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"155n1pu\" data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4067\">Semester 4: Global Finance and Applied Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4297\">The final semester emphasizes international financial systems, advanced specialization subjects, and independent research. Students apply their learning to real-world business and financial challenges through a research project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4793\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4324\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4324\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4309\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4324\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4793\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4482\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4385\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Financial System</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4385\" data-end=\"4482\">Understand global financial architecture, regulations, and cross-border financial operations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4483\" data-end=\"4582\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4483\" data-end=\"4502\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4582\">Conduct in-depth research on a commerce, finance, or business-related topic.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4583\" data-end=\"4637\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4583\" data-end=\"4602\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective Major 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4602\" data-end=\"4637\">Advanced specialization course.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4638\" data-end=\"4708\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4638\" data-end=\"4657\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective Major 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4657\" data-end=\"4708\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industry-focused elective for deeper expertise.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4709\" data-end=\"4793\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4709\" data-end=\"4728\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective Minor 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4728\" data-end=\"4793\" data-col-size=\"md\">Supporting elective enhancing broader business understanding.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1db8cy0\" data-start=\"4795\" data-end=\"4852\">Key Skills Developed Through the Online M.Com Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4854\" data-end=\"4992\">The Online M.Com curriculum helps students develop highly valued skills required across commerce, finance, banking, and corporate sectors.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4994\" data-end=\"5461\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t6zfg6\" data-start=\"4994\" data-end=\"5028\">Financial Analysis and Reporting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rnmh4v\" data-start=\"5029\" data-end=\"5060\">Advanced Accounting Practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ymo24x\" data-start=\"5061\" data-end=\"5104\">Banking and Financial Services Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gw86wk\" data-start=\"5105\" data-end=\"5148\">Corporate Finance and Investment Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rrnmd1\" data-start=\"5149\" data-end=\"5180\">Strategic Business Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xki4vn\" data-start=\"5181\" data-end=\"5206\">Auditing and Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"30wo1k\" data-start=\"5207\" data-end=\"5235\">Research and Data Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1quvrt1\" data-start=\"5236\" data-end=\"5283\">Risk Assessment and Financial Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3rgcz\" data-start=\"5284\" data-end=\"5327\">ESG and Sustainable Finance Understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8i7jet\" data-start=\"5328\" data-end=\"5377\">International Business and Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dx230f\" data-start=\"5378\" data-end=\"5420\">Leadership and Organizational Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mookwu\" data-start=\"5421\" data-end=\"5461\">Business Analytics and Problem Solving</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 50200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(454, 82, '022a1ab4-2826-4816-9b66-4680447d1bf7', '0e21062c-78c5-4b5a-8327-0af8287be913', 101, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 05:11:29', '2026-05-30 05:11:29', '<p data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"544\">The <strong data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"92\">Online MA Economics admission process</strong> is designed to provide a seamless and student-friendly enrollment experience for graduates who want to build expertise in <strong data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"361\">economics, econometrics, data analytics, public policy, international trade, development economics, financial economics, and economic research</strong>. The admission procedure follows a transparent step-by-step process that allows eligible candidates to complete their application and begin their postgraduate studies without hassle.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"782\">Whether you are a fresh graduate aiming for a career in economics or a working professional looking to enhance your analytical and research skills, understanding the complete admission process can help ensure a smooth admission journey.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s1h535\" data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"815\">Step 1: Online Registration</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"909\">The admission process begins with candidate registration on the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"1099\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o88zti\" data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"984\">Create your applicant account using a valid email ID and mobile number.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ai1vxe\" data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1032\">Enter basic personal and educational details.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13xb0sm\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1099\">Generate your unique applicant ID for future admission tracking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1185\">Successful registration provides access to the Online MA Economics application form.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hzednt\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1217\">Step 2: Email Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1293\">After registration, candidates must verify their registered email address.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1420\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fvewl6\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1354\">Open the verification email received from the university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wpnh1k\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1385\">Click the verification link.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uwuq5i\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1420\">Activate your admission account.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1551\">Email verification is essential for receiving admission updates, application status notifications, and enrollment communications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hcnjqm\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1601\">Step 3: Complete the Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1683\">Once the account is activated, applicants can proceed with the application form.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1835\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kl7go9\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1717\">Enter academic qualifications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9lswc0\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1746\">Upload required documents.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"104gjt5\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1793\">Verify personal and educational information.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kuam7w\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1835\">Select the Online MA Economics program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1912\">Candidates should review all information carefully before final submission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hko7uf\" data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1949\">Step 4: Pay the Application Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"2042\">To complete the application process, candidates must submit the prescribed application fee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2148\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2080\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2080\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2070\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2080\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2148\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2148\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2138\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2148\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2231\">After successful payment, the application is officially submitted for evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1eyevgz\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2273\">Step 5: Merit-Based Admission Review</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2375\">The university evaluates applications based on academic qualifications and eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2495\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1inob8u\" data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2409\">Academic records are assessed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z7qig8\" data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2446\">Eligibility criteria are verified.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gv1qt9\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2495\">Merit-based admission evaluation is conducted.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2595\">If additional clarification is required, admission counselors may contact applicants for guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wxmmau\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2644\">Step 6: Receive Provisional Admission Offer</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2744\">Candidates who successfully meet the admission requirements receive a provisional admission offer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2766\">This stage confirms:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2871\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o6ruie\" data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2806\">Eligibility verification completion.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pc47at\" data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2841\">Academic qualification approval.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u0wxfo\" data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2871\">Shortlisting for admission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2961\">The provisional offer is communicated through the registered email and admission portal.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3rv2rz\" data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"2996\">Step 7: Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3076\">Before final admission approval, all submitted documents undergo verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3114\">Commonly required documents include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3266\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i15x41\" data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3147\">Bachelor\'s Degree Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7h5qe1\" data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3172\">Graduation Mark Sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2mxnc\" data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3200\">Government Photo ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1omr008\" data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3227\">Passport-Size Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3266\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3356\">Admission may be cancelled if documents are incomplete, incorrect, or fail verification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1medm45\" data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3389\">Step 8: Pay the Program Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3494\">After successful document verification, candidates must pay the program fee to confirm their admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n6s2cq\" data-start=\"3496\" data-end=\"3533\">Online MA Economics Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3779\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3567\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3567\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3551\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3567\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3779\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3639\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3629\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3629\" data-end=\"3639\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3672\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3662\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3672\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3705\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3694\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3705\">₹15,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3740\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3740\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3779\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3764\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3763\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3764\" data-end=\"3779\"><strong data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3777\">₹40,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3865\">Program fee payment secures the candidate\'s seat in the Online MA Economics program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xfjfrx\" data-start=\"3867\" data-end=\"3907\">Step 9: Final Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"3955\">After fee payment and successful verification:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"4135\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s85njm\" data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"3993\">Admission is officially confirmed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x8zpp\" data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4036\">Student login credentials are generated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18yxs38\" data-start=\"4037\" data-end=\"4092\">LMS (Learning Management System) access is activated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1di1554\" data-start=\"4093\" data-end=\"4135\">Academic orientation details are shared.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4214\">Students can begin accessing learning resources immediately after enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mt5bki\" data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4272\">Step 10: Commencement of Online MA Economics Classes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4274\" data-end=\"4354\">Upon admission confirmation, students begin their academic journey in economics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4387\">The program generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4389\" data-end=\"4642\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19z47nt\" data-start=\"4389\" data-end=\"4410\">Live online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1smez75\" data-start=\"4411\" data-end=\"4452\">Recorded lectures for flexible learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vwg3l1\" data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4478\">Digital study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jonxz0\" data-start=\"4479\" data-end=\"4514\">Research assignments and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i36byu\" data-start=\"4515\" data-end=\"4555\">Faculty mentoring and academic support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5g8xkd\" data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4588\">Internship and thesis guidance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12josyn\" data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4610\">Online examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gixny7\" data-start=\"4611\" data-end=\"4642\">Career development assistance</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"593\">The <strong data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"93\">Online MA Economics eligibility criteria</strong> are designed for graduates who want to develop advanced expertise in <strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"309\">economics, econometrics, public policy, development economics, international trade, financial economics, data analytics, and economic research</strong>. As a postgraduate degree program, the Online MA Economics equips students with analytical, quantitative, and research-oriented skills that are highly valued across government organizations, financial institutions, consulting firms, research agencies, and multinational corporations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"787\">Whether you are planning a career in economics, policy analysis, banking, finance, or academia, meeting the eligibility requirements is the first step toward securing admission to the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2vliay\" data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"851\">Eligibility Requirements for Online MA Economics Admission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"953\">Candidates seeking admission to the Online MA Economics program must fulfill the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1456\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gheqyl\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1047\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"985\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university or higher education institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yr72v2\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1201\">Candidates from Economics, Commerce, Management, Arts, Science, and other recognized disciplines may apply, subject to university admission guidelines.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2epv46\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1348\">Final-year bachelor\'s degree students may apply provisionally, subject to the submission of qualifying documents within the prescribed timeline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n81i3s\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1456\">Applicants must satisfy all admission and document verification requirements specified by the university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"b1c253\" data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1502\">Online MA Economics Eligibility Overview</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1820\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1515\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Criteria</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1530\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1820\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1591\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1575\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Level</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1591\" data-col-size=\"md\">Postgraduate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1637\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1616\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1637\">Bachelor\'s Degree</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1684\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1659\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Degree Recognition</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1684\" data-col-size=\"md\">Recognized University</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1746\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1707\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Applicants</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1746\">Graduates from approved disciplines</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1820\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1765\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Basis</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1820\">Eligibility Verification and Academic Qualification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"505\">The <strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"70\">Online MA Economics</strong> program is designed for students and working professionals who want to develop advanced expertise in <strong data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"319\">microeconomics, macroeconomics, econometrics, public policy, financial economics, international economics, data analysis, and economic research</strong>. With a flexible learning format and affordable fee structure, the program enables learners to gain specialized economic knowledge while balancing professional and personal commitments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"732\">The Online MA Economics degree is particularly valuable for individuals aspiring to build careers in <strong data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"731\">economic research, banking, finance, policy analysis, consulting, government services, business analytics, and academia</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n6s2cq\" data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"771\">Online MA Economics Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"805\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"805\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"789\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"805\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"877\">\r\n<td data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"867\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"877\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<td data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"900\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"910\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"943\">\r\n<td data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"932\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"943\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹15,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"978\">\r\n<td data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"968\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"978\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\n<td data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1002\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1001\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1017\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1015\">₹40,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1puyijh\" data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1049\">MA Economics Fee Breakdown</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1228\">The fee structure is designed to provide quality postgraduate economics education at an affordable cost while ensuring access to academic resources and student support services.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1255\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1255\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1244\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1255\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1363\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1295\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1363\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers academic learning, faculty support, and digital resources</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1382\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1427\" data-col-size=\"md\">Annual examination and assessment charges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1484\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1447\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1484\" data-col-size=\"md\">One-time admission processing fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1537\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1498\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1537\" data-col-size=\"md\">Lifetime alumni membership benefits</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1558\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1610\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete fee for the Online MA Economics program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pgc16z\" data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1671\">What is Included in the Online MA Economics Course Fee?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1754\">Students enrolled in the Online MA Economics program typically receive access to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4gqz89\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1790\">Learning Management System (LMS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvh35a\" data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1825\">Live and recorded online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a78aos\" data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1863\">Digital study materials and e-books</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ww3a4j\" data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1902\">Assignments and academic assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1srb3jj\" data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1944\">Faculty mentoring and academic guidance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12josyn\" data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1966\">Online examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9da3ds\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1997\">Research and project support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rfobln\" data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2031\">Alumni networking opportunities<br><br>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n91iug\" data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3471\">Important Fee-Related Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3856\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bmelal\" data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3528\">Registration Fee and Alumni Fee are one-time charges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aasorj\" data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3567\">Examination Fee is payable annually.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x2b5o5\" data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3630\">Tuition Fee covers academic delivery and learning resources.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lgjgc9\" data-start=\"3631\" data-end=\"3749\">Students should verify the latest fee structure during admission as university policies may be updated periodically.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5jurvr\" data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3856\">Additional charges may apply for re-examinations, duplicate certificates, or optional academic services.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"504\">The <strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"78\">Online MA Economics</strong> curriculum is designed to provide advanced knowledge of <strong data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"266\">economic theory, econometrics, public policy, development economics, international trade, data analytics, and economic research</strong>. The program combines theoretical foundations with quantitative techniques, enabling students to analyze complex economic issues, evaluate policies, and make data-driven decisions in business, government, research, and financial sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"781\">The curriculum emphasizes modern tools such as <strong data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"662\">Econometrics, Time Series Analysis, R/SPSS, Advanced Excel, Research Methodology, and Operations Research</strong>, making graduates industry-ready for careers in economics, finance, consulting, banking, analytics, and policy-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c6iu7l\" data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"823\">Online MA Economics Course Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"1245\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"836\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"850\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"1245\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<td data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"891\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"972\" data-col-size=\"md\">Economic Theory, Statistics, Mathematical Economics, and Research Foundations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1063\">\r\n<td data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"986\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1063\" data-col-size=\"md\">Indian Economy, Development Economics, Econometrics, and Applied Research</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1151\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1077\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1151\">Advanced Econometrics, Data Analytics Tools, Electives, and Internship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1245\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1165\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1245\">International Economics, Operations Research, Advanced Electives, and Thesis</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pq9j0\" data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1301\">Semester 1: Building Advanced Economic Foundations</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1472\">The first semester develops a strong understanding of economic theories and quantitative methods that form the basis of advanced economic analysis and policy evaluation.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"2061\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1499\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1499\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1484\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1499\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"2061\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1646\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1554\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Micro Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1646\">Study consumer behavior, market structures, pricing strategies, and resource allocation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1674\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Macro Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1765\">Analyze national income, inflation, unemployment, monetary policy, and economic growth.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1855\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1779\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1855\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn statistical methods for economic research and data interpretation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1954\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1881\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematical Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1954\">Apply mathematical techniques to economic models and decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"2061\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1978\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Review Paper Writing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2061\">Develop academic writing, literature review, and research documentation skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wd1588\" data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2121\">Semester 2: Development Economics and Applied Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2252\">The second semester focuses on economic development, policy analysis, econometric modeling, and sector-specific economic studies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2943\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2279\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2279\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2264\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2279\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2943\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2403\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2324\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Economy</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2403\" data-col-size=\"md\">Examine the structure, challenges, and growth trends of the Indian economy.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2535\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2439\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Growth and Development Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2535\">Study economic development theories, poverty, inequality, and sustainable growth strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2649\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2572\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Methodology in Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2649\">Learn research design, data collection, and economic research techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2740\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2665\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Econometrics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2740\" data-col-size=\"md\">Apply statistical models to economic data for forecasting and analysis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2856\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2765\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Agriculture Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2856\">Understand agricultural markets, rural development, and agricultural policy frameworks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2943\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2872\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Field Survey</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2943\">Gain practical experience in economic data collection and analysis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16bm0uj\" data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"3001\">Semester 3: Advanced Analytics and Industry Exposure</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3166\">The third semester introduces advanced analytical techniques and industry-oriented learning while allowing students to explore specialized areas through electives.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3767\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3193\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3193\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3178\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3193\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3767\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3326\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3248\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Time Series Econometrics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3248\" data-end=\"3326\">Analyze economic trends, forecasting models, and time-based economic data.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3327\" data-end=\"3406\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3327\" data-end=\"3346\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Elective I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3406\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized economics subject based on career interests.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3488\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3427\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Elective II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3488\">Advanced elective focusing on a specific economic domain.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3489\" data-end=\"3589\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3489\" data-end=\"3514\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to R/SPSS</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3589\">Learn statistical software used in economic research and data analysis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3676\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3607\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Excel</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3607\" data-end=\"3676\">Develop advanced data modeling, reporting, and analytical skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3677\" data-end=\"3767\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3677\" data-end=\"3690\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Internship</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3767\">Gain practical exposure to real-world economic and business environments.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"udoy0c\" data-start=\"3769\" data-end=\"3829\">Semester 4: Global Economics and Research Specialization</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3831\" data-end=\"3978\">The final semester emphasizes international economics, advanced analytical decision-making, and independent research through a postgraduate thesis.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3980\" data-end=\"4480\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3980\" data-end=\"4005\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3980\" data-end=\"4005\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3980\" data-end=\"3990\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3990\" data-end=\"4005\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4480\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4143\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4066\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Trade and Policy</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4066\" data-end=\"4143\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study global trade systems, international markets, and trade regulations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4201\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4165\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Elective III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4165\" data-end=\"4201\">Advanced specialization subject.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4280\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4222\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Elective IV</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4222\" data-end=\"4280\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industry-focused elective for deeper domain expertise.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4281\" data-end=\"4390\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4281\" data-end=\"4316\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operations Research in Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4316\" data-end=\"4390\">Apply quantitative models to optimize economic and business decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4480\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4414\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Post Graduate Thesis</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4414\" data-end=\"4480\">Conduct independent research on a contemporary economic issue.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1i1pjei\" data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4546\">Key Skills Developed Through the Online MA Economics Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4697\">The curriculum equips students with highly valuable analytical and research skills that are increasingly sought after in today\'s data-driven economy.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4699\" data-end=\"5137\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wq8d5x\" data-start=\"4699\" data-end=\"4734\">Economic Analysis and Forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dmfofc\" data-start=\"4735\" data-end=\"4774\">Econometrics and Statistical Modeling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d4xnoz\" data-start=\"4775\" data-end=\"4806\">Economic Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ku8d2q\" data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4840\">Data Analytics Using R and SPSS</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10xpnu\" data-start=\"4841\" data-end=\"4880\">Advanced Excel for Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"63jqsb\" data-start=\"4881\" data-end=\"4905\">Public Policy Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s5o8a0\" data-start=\"4906\" data-end=\"4948\">International Trade and Global Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"172hq3j\" data-start=\"4949\" data-end=\"4989\">Financial and Economic Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kayr8z\" data-start=\"4990\" data-end=\"5024\">Quantitative Research Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xj3qet\" data-start=\"5025\" data-end=\"5065\">Development and Agricultural Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wfet5p\" data-start=\"5066\" data-end=\"5096\">Economic Data Interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w83q57\" data-start=\"5097\" data-end=\"5137\">Problem-Solving and Strategic Thinking</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 40200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(455, 82, '022a1ab4-2826-4816-9b66-4680447d1bf7', '0e21062c-78c5-4b5a-8327-0af8287be913', 102, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 05:22:39', '2026-05-30 05:22:39', '<p data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"540\">The <strong data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"88\">Online MA English admission process</strong> is designed to provide a smooth, transparent, and student-friendly enrollment experience for graduates who want to build expertise in <strong data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"347\">English Literature, Linguistics, Literary Theory, Cultural Studies, Academic Writing, Communication Skills, and Research</strong>. The admission procedure follows a structured process that allows eligible candidates to complete their application efficiently and begin their postgraduate studies without unnecessary delays.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"775\">Whether you are aspiring to build a career in teaching, content writing, publishing, journalism, research, media, or corporate communication, understanding the complete admission process can help you secure admission with confidence.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s1h535\" data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"808\">Step 1: Online Registration</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"899\">The admission journey begins with creating an account on the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"1063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ptnauv\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"953\">Register using a valid email ID and mobile number.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"149pk5c\" data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"998\">Enter basic personal and academic details.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c65443\" data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1063\">Generate your applicant profile for future admission tracking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1165\">Successful registration allows candidates to proceed with the Online MA English application process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hzednt\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1197\">Step 2: Email Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1262\">After registration, applicants must verify their email address.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fvewl6\" data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1323\">Open the verification email received from the university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wpnh1k\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1354\">Click the verification link.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uwuq5i\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1389\">Activate your admission account.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1495\">Email verification ensures secure communication regarding admission updates and important notifications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"91jlrc\" data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1541\">Step 3: Fill the Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1619\">Once the account is activated, candidates can complete the application form.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a19wdn\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1656\">Enter educational qualifications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9lswc0\" data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1685\">Upload required documents.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oy5hid\" data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1725\">Verify personal and academic details.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6c4sky\" data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1765\">Select the Online MA English program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1865\">Candidates should carefully review all information before submission to avoid verification delays.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hko7uf\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1902\">Step 4: Pay the Application Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1995\">To successfully submit the application, candidates must pay the prescribed application fee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2101\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2033\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2033\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2023\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2033\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2101\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2101\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2184\">After successful payment, the application is forwarded for review and evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1eyevgz\" data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2226\">Step 5: Merit-Based Admission Review</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2328\">The university evaluates applications based on academic qualifications and eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2451\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16v4ujw\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2365\">Educational records are assessed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z7qig8\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2402\">Eligibility criteria are verified.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gv1qt9\" data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2451\">Merit-based admission evaluation is conducted.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2550\">If necessary, admission counselors may contact applicants for additional information or guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wxmmau\" data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2599\">Step 6: Receive Provisional Admission Offer</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2689\">Candidates who satisfy the admission requirements receive a provisional admission offer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2710\">This confirms that:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2847\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b7drsi\" data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2749\">Eligibility criteria have been met.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10yz4cc\" data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2795\">Academic qualifications have been approved.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oixlme\" data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2847\">The applicant has been shortlisted for admission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2937\">The provisional offer is communicated through the admission portal and registered email.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3rv2rz\" data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2972\">Step 7: Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2974\" data-end=\"3044\">Before final admission approval, all submitted documents are verified.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3082\">Commonly required documents include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3234\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i15x41\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3115\">Bachelor\'s Degree Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7h5qe1\" data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3140\">Graduation Mark Sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2mxnc\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3168\">Government Photo ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1omr008\" data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3195\">Passport-Size Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3234\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3339\">Applications may be rejected if documents are incomplete, incorrect, or fail verification requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1medm45\" data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3372\">Step 8: Pay the Program Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3374\" data-end=\"3481\">Following successful document verification, candidates must pay the program fee to confirm their admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1svjo84\" data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3518\">Online MA English Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3764\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3552\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3552\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3536\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3552\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3584\" data-end=\"3764\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3584\" data-end=\"3624\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3584\" data-end=\"3614\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"3624\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3657\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3647\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3657\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3690\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3679\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3679\" data-end=\"3690\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹15,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"3725\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"3715\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3715\" data-end=\"3725\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3764\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3749\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3748\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3764\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3751\" data-end=\"3762\">₹40,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3855\">Payment of the program fee secures the candidate\'s seat in the Online MA English program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xfjfrx\" data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3897\">Step 9: Final Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3899\" data-end=\"3945\">After fee payment and successful verification:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"4125\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s85njm\" data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3983\">Admission is officially confirmed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x8zpp\" data-start=\"3984\" data-end=\"4026\">Student login credentials are generated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18yxs38\" data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4082\">LMS (Learning Management System) access is activated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1di1554\" data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4125\">Academic orientation details are shared.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4222\">Students can begin accessing study materials and course resources immediately after enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"228fks\" data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4278\">Step 10: Commencement of Online MA English Classes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4347\">Once admission is confirmed, students begin their academic journey.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4349\" data-end=\"4380\">The program typically includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4687\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hywzem\" data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4404\">Live online lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hn1g2u\" data-start=\"4405\" data-end=\"4445\">Recorded classes for flexible learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n1zls\" data-start=\"4446\" data-end=\"4495\">Digital study materials and e-library resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gcrk5i\" data-start=\"4496\" data-end=\"4525\">Assignments and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xdlkeq\" data-start=\"4526\" data-end=\"4569\">Research projects and academic activities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i36byu\" data-start=\"4570\" data-end=\"4610\">Faculty mentoring and academic support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12josyn\" data-start=\"4611\" data-end=\"4632\">Online examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"crv3a8\" data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4687\">Career guidance and professional development support</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"571\">The <strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"89\">Online MA English eligibility criteria</strong> are designed for graduates who wish to gain advanced knowledge in <strong data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"303\">English Literature, Linguistics, Literary Theory, Cultural Studies, Academic Writing, Language Studies, Communication, and Research Methodology</strong>. As a postgraduate degree, the program helps students develop critical thinking, analytical reasoning, research expertise, and professional communication skills that are highly valued across education, media, publishing, corporate communication, and research sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"799\">Whether you are a recent graduate planning higher studies or a working professional seeking career advancement, meeting the eligibility requirements is the first step toward securing admission to the Online MA English program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12l1wk\" data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"861\">Eligibility Requirements for Online MA English Admission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"954\">To apply for the Online MA English program, candidates must fulfill the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1397\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gheqyl\" data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1048\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"986\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university or higher education institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lro6mi\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1146\">Graduates from any recognized discipline may apply, subject to university admission guidelines.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2epv46\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1293\">Final-year bachelor\'s degree students may apply provisionally, subject to the submission of qualifying documents within the prescribed timeline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11tufry\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1397\">Applicants must meet all academic and document verification requirements specified by the university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"166t7h5\" data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1441\">Online MA English Eligibility Overview</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1469\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1469\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1454\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Criteria</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1469\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1514\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Level</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1530\" data-col-size=\"md\">Postgraduate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1576\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1555\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1576\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor\'s Degree</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1623\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1598\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Degree Recognition</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1623\">Recognized University</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1685\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1646\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Applicants</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1685\">Graduates from approved disciplines</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1704\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Basis</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1759\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligibility Verification and Academic Qualification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"520\">he <strong data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"66\">Online MA English</strong> program is designed for graduates who want to develop advanced expertise in <strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"298\">English Literature, Linguistics, Literary Theory, Cultural Studies, Critical Analysis, Academic Writing, Communication Skills, and Research Methodology</strong>. With a flexible online learning model and affordable fee structure, the program allows students and working professionals to pursue higher education while balancing their academic, professional, and personal commitments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"747\">The Online MA English degree is an excellent choice for individuals aspiring to build careers in <strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"746\">teaching, content writing, publishing, journalism, research, media, communication, civil services preparation, and academia</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1svjo84\" data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"784\">Online MA English Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"818\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"818\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"802\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"818\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"890\">\r\n<td data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"880\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"890\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n<td data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"913\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"923\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"956\">\r\n<td data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"945\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"956\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹15,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"991\">\r\n<td data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"981\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"991\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<td data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1015\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1014\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1030\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1028\">₹40,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d9na6r\" data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1060\">MA English Fee Breakdown</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1259\">The fee structure is designed to provide affordable access to quality postgraduate education in English language and literature while ensuring comprehensive academic support throughout the program.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1286\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1286\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1275\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1286\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1396\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1326\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1396\">Covers academic instruction, study materials, and faculty guidance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1460\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1415\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1460\" data-col-size=\"md\">Annual examination and assessment charges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1517\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1480\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1517\" data-col-size=\"md\">One-time admission processing fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1570\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1531\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1570\" data-col-size=\"md\">Lifetime alumni membership benefits</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1591\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1641\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete cost of the Online MA English program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12gdu9x\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1700\">What is Included in the Online MA English Course Fee?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1781\">Students enrolled in the Online MA English program typically receive access to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"2066\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4gqz89\" data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1817\">Learning Management System (LMS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mcz01l\" data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1853\">Live and recorded online lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pf0b7j\" data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1895\">Digital study materials and e-resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ugo5l\" data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1932\">Online assignments and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i36byu\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1973\">Faculty mentoring and academic support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zdlkfz\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2010\">Research and dissertation guidance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12josyn\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2032\">Online examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rfobln\" data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2066\">Alumni networking opportunities<br><br>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n91iug\" data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3726\">Important Fee-Related Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"4115\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bmelal\" data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3783\">Registration Fee and Alumni Fee are one-time charges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aasorj\" data-start=\"3784\" data-end=\"3822\">Examination Fee is payable annually.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n2ib3s\" data-start=\"3823\" data-end=\"3891\">Tuition Fee covers academic learning and student support services.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w70c32\" data-start=\"3892\" data-end=\"4008\">Students should verify the latest fee details during admission as university policies may be updated periodically.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5jurvr\" data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4115\">Additional charges may apply for re-examinations, duplicate certificates, or optional academic services</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"461\">The <strong data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"74\">Online MA English</strong> curriculum is designed to provide a comprehensive understanding of <strong data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"273\">English Literature, Literary Theory, Linguistics, Cultural Studies, Language Teaching, Academic Research, and Critical Analysis</strong>. The program combines classical and contemporary literary studies with advanced language learning, helping students develop strong analytical, communication, writing, and research skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"829\">This industry-relevant curriculum prepares learners for careers in <strong data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"666\">teaching, content writing, publishing, journalism, editing, research, media, public relations, corporate communication, and academia</strong>. The inclusion of internships, research projects, seminars, and elective specializations ensures a balanced blend of theoretical knowledge and practical exposure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t3ly2n\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"869\">Online MA English Course Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"1322\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"896\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"896\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"882\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"896\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"1322\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"1018\">\r\n<td data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"937\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1018\" data-col-size=\"md\">British Literature, Literary Criticism, Linguistics, and Communication Skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1032\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1125\" data-col-size=\"md\">American Literature, Modern Critical Theories, Research Methodology, and Language Studies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1220\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1139\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1220\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized Literature Electives, Research Writing, and Internship Experience</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1322\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1234\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1322\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced Literary Studies, Language Teaching, Cultural Studies, and Research Project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gmlwa\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1378\">Semester 1: Foundations of Literature and Language</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1583\">The first semester builds a strong foundation in literary studies and language analysis. Students explore major works of British literature while developing essential linguistic and communication skills.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"2165\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1595\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1610\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"2165\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1731\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1661\" data-col-size=\"md\">British Literature I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1731\">Study major literary works from early British literary traditions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1848\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1756\" data-col-size=\"md\">British Literature II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1848\">Explore significant literary developments and influential authors in British literature.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1902\" data-col-size=\"md\">Critical Approaches I (Aristotle to New Criticism)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1972\">Understand foundational literary theories and critical frameworks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2058\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"1997\" data-col-size=\"md\">The Study of Language</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2058\">Learn key concepts in linguistics and language structure.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2165\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2090\" data-col-size=\"md\">Phonetics and Spoken English</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2165\">Develop pronunciation, speech clarity, and spoken communication skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1capgyk\" data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2231\">Semester 2: Modern Literary Perspectives and Research Skills</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2400\">The second semester expands literary knowledge through American literature and modern critical theories while strengthening academic research and language proficiency.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"3077\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2427\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2427\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2412\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2427\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"3077\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2545\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2480\" data-col-size=\"md\">British Literature III</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2545\">Analyze advanced literary movements and modern British texts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2642\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2568\" data-col-size=\"md\">American Literature</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2642\">Explore influential American writers, themes, and literary traditions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2695\" data-col-size=\"md\">Critical Approaches II (Modern Critical Theories)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2766\">Study contemporary literary criticism and theoretical perspectives.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2851\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2786\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced Grammar</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2851\">Strengthen language accuracy and advanced grammatical skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2966\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2887\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research Methods and Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2966\">Learn academic research design, analysis, and scholarly writing techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"3077\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"2988\" data-col-size=\"md\">Seminar/Field Work</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3077\" data-col-size=\"md\">Gain practical exposure through presentations, discussions, and field-based learning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7bw1f3\" data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3134\">Semester 3: Specialization and Research Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3316\">The third semester introduces specialized literary and linguistic electives while focusing on research writing and professional exposure through internships or teaching assistance.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3824\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3343\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3343\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3328\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3343\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3824\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3465\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3390\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Elective I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3465\">Choose between Classical Literature or Literature and Social Movements.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3550\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3486\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Elective II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3486\" data-end=\"3550\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore Literature and Cinema or Modern European Literature.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3623\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3572\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Elective III</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3623\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study Semantics or Second Language Acquisition.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3711\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3649\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Writing Research Paper</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3711\">Develop academic writing and scholarly publication skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3824\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3750\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Internship/MOOC/Teaching Assistance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3824\">Gain practical experience through professional or academic engagement.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sjx0k2\" data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3880\">Semester 4: Advanced Literary and Cultural Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"4024\">The final semester focuses on advanced literary analysis, cultural studies, language policy, and independent research through a major project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4579\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4051\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4051\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4036\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4051\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4079\" data-end=\"4579\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4079\" data-end=\"4192\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4079\" data-end=\"4098\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Elective I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4098\" data-end=\"4192\">Choose between Indian Poetics or Nation, Region and Literature in Post-Colonial Societies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4274\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Elective II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4213\" data-end=\"4274\">Study Indian Writing in English or Literature and Gender.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4373\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4296\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Elective III</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4373\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore Comparative Cultural Studies or Translation Theory and Practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4471\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4394\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Major Elective IV</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4394\" data-end=\"4471\">Learn Language Policy and Politics in India or English Language Teaching.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4579\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4491\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4491\" data-end=\"4579\">Conduct an independent research study on a specialized literary or linguistic topic.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hnkovo\" data-start=\"4581\" data-end=\"4643\">Key Skills Developed Through the Online MA English Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4645\" data-end=\"4760\">The Online MA English curriculum develops a combination of literary, linguistic, research, and professional skills.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4762\" data-end=\"5194\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eycepj\" data-start=\"4762\" data-end=\"4800\">Literary Analysis and Interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"152w213\" data-start=\"4801\" data-end=\"4832\">Academic and Research Writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yuwbli\" data-start=\"4833\" data-end=\"4870\">Critical Thinking and Argumentation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kezsr5\" data-start=\"4871\" data-end=\"4901\">English Language Proficiency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uv1v86\" data-start=\"4902\" data-end=\"4936\">Linguistics and Language Studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lb1phf\" data-start=\"4937\" data-end=\"4968\">Literary Theory and Criticism</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h345uf\" data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"5008\">Communication and Presentation Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vocbid\" data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5042\">Content Development and Editing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8v0omb\" data-start=\"5043\" data-end=\"5077\">Cultural and Comparative Studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9qvyxe\" data-start=\"5078\" data-end=\"5114\">Translation and Language Practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i0zq8t\" data-start=\"5115\" data-end=\"5148\">Teaching and Educational Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1asgwgo\" data-start=\"5149\" data-end=\"5194\">Research Methodology and Scholarly Analysis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5622\" data-end=\"5856\">&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 40200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(456, 82, '022a1ab4-2826-4816-9b66-4680447d1bf7', '0e21062c-78c5-4b5a-8327-0af8287be913', 104, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 05:31:18', '2026-05-30 05:31:18', '<p data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"513\">The <strong data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"88\">Online MA English admission process</strong> is designed to provide a seamless enrollment experience for graduates who want to build expertise in <strong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"326\">English Literature, Linguistics, Literary Theory, Cultural Studies, Academic Writing, Research Methodology, and Communication Skills</strong>. The admission procedure follows a transparent and merit-based approach, allowing eligible candidates to complete their application quickly and begin their postgraduate learning journey.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"725\">Whether you aspire to become a teacher, lecturer, content writer, editor, journalist, researcher, or communication professional, understanding the admission process can help you secure your seat without delays.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"84rcrd\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"754\">Step 1: Register Online</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"850\">The admission process begins with online registration through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"994\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cqo4b\" data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"884\">Create your admission account.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15i249d\" data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"934\">Enter your basic personal and academic details.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v54et\" data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"994\">Generate your applicant ID for future admission tracking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1080\">A successful registration allows candidates to proceed with the application process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qahkao\" data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1119\">Step 2: Verify Your Email Address</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1184\">After registration, applicants must verify their email account.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1311\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fvewl6\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1245\">Open the verification email received from the university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wpnh1k\" data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1276\">Click the verification link.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2jpang\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1311\">Activate your admission profile.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1394\">Email verification ensures secure communication throughout the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hcnjqm\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1444\">Step 3: Complete the Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1539\">Once the account is verified, candidates can fill out the Online MA English application form.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1691\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a19wdn\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1576\">Enter educational qualifications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gwqm2d\" data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1614\">Upload required academic documents.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"197ngy3\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1658\">Verify personal and academic information.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1negnnh\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1691\">Select the MA English program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1764\">Applicants should carefully review all details before final submission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hko7uf\" data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1801\">Step 4: Pay the Application Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1891\">To complete the application process, candidates must pay the prescribed application fee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1997\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1929\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1929\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1919\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1929\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1997\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1997\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1987\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"1997\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2069\">After successful payment, the application is submitted for evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v7bsvz\" data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2115\">Step 5: Merit-Based Admission Evaluation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2215\">The university reviews applications based on eligibility requirements and academic qualifications.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2337\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16v4ujw\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2252\">Educational records are assessed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z7qig8\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2289\">Eligibility criteria are verified.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tk50qv\" data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2337\">Merit-based admission screening is conducted.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2424\">If additional clarification is required, admission counselors may contact applicants.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wxmmau\" data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2473\">Step 6: Receive Provisional Admission Offer</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2576\">Candidates who successfully satisfy the admission requirements receive a provisional admission offer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2592\">At this stage:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2705\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"129e7z\" data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2629\">Academic eligibility is approved.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jkgc1g\" data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2660\">Admission status is updated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1spcut4\" data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2705\">Candidates are shortlisted for enrollment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2793\">The admission offer is communicated through the admission portal and registered email.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3rv2rz\" data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2828\">Step 7: Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2907\">Before final admission approval, all uploaded documents undergo verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2945\">Commonly required documents include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"3097\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i15x41\" data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2978\">Bachelor\'s Degree Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7h5qe1\" data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3003\">Graduation Mark Sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2mxnc\" data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3031\">Government Photo ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1omr008\" data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3058\">Passport-Size Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3097\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3202\">Applications may be rejected if documents are incomplete, incorrect, or fail verification requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1medm45\" data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3235\">Step 8: Pay the Program Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3335\">Following successful verification, candidates must pay the program fee to confirm their admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1svjo84\" data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3372\">Online MA English Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3374\" data-end=\"3618\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3374\" data-end=\"3406\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3374\" data-end=\"3406\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3374\" data-end=\"3390\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3406\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3618\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3478\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3468\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3478\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3479\" data-end=\"3511\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3479\" data-end=\"3501\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3511\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3544\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3533\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3544\">₹15,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3579\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3579\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3618\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3603\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3602\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3618\"><strong data-start=\"3605\" data-end=\"3616\">₹40,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3713\">Program fee payment officially secures the candidate\'s seat in the Online MA English program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xfjfrx\" data-start=\"3715\" data-end=\"3755\">Step 9: Final Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3812\">After fee payment and successful document verification:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3992\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s85njm\" data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3850\">Admission is officially confirmed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x8zpp\" data-start=\"3851\" data-end=\"3893\">Student login credentials are generated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18yxs38\" data-start=\"3894\" data-end=\"3949\">LMS (Learning Management System) access is activated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1di1554\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3992\">Academic orientation details are shared.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4072\">Students can immediately access their course materials and learning resources.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"228fks\" data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4128\">Step 10: Commencement of Online MA English Classes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4197\">Upon admission confirmation, students begin their academic journey.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4230\">The program generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4525\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19z47nt\" data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4253\">Live online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1smez75\" data-start=\"4254\" data-end=\"4295\">Recorded lectures for flexible learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9njbh9\" data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4342\">Digital study materials and e-library access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gcrk5i\" data-start=\"4343\" data-end=\"4372\">Assignments and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19i1ks7\" data-start=\"4373\" data-end=\"4407\">Research activities and projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i36byu\" data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4448\">Faculty mentoring and academic support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12josyn\" data-start=\"4449\" data-end=\"4470\">Online examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"crv3a8\" data-start=\"4471\" data-end=\"4525\">Career guidance and professional development support</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"525\">The <strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"68\">Online MA English</strong> program is designed for graduates who wish to deepen their understanding of <strong data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"279\">English Literature, Literary Criticism, Linguistics, Cultural Studies, Language Theory, Academic Writing, and Research Methodology</strong>. As a postgraduate degree, the program equips learners with advanced analytical, communication, and research skills that are highly valued across education, media, publishing, journalism, content development, and corporate communication sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"717\">Whether you are aiming for a career in academia, research, content creation, publishing, or communication management, meeting the eligibility requirements is the first step toward admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mzp371\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"769\">Eligibility Requirements for Online MA English</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"859\">To apply for the Online MA English program, candidates must meet the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1284\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gheqyl\" data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"953\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"891\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university or higher education institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ryrz0z\" data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1029\">Candidates from any recognized academic discipline are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2epv46\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1176\">Final-year bachelor\'s degree students may apply provisionally, subject to the submission of qualifying documents within the prescribed timeline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"msbeqj\" data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1284\">Applicants must fulfill all admission and document verification requirements specified by the university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"166t7h5\" data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1328\">Online MA English Eligibility Overview</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1640\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1356\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1356\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1341\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Criteria</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1356\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1640\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1417\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1401\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Level</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1417\" data-col-size=\"md\">Postgraduate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1463\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1442\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1463\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor\'s Degree</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1510\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1485\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Degree Recognition</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1510\" data-col-size=\"md\">Recognized University</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1566\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1533\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Applicants</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1566\" data-col-size=\"md\">Graduates from any discipline</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1640\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1585\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Basis</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1640\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligibility Verification and Academic Qualification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ng5mui\" data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2289\">Who Should Pursue an Online MA English?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2334\">The Online MA English program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2747\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n8yvhd\" data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2394\">Graduates interested in literature and language studies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gb90dq\" data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2452\">Aspiring lecturers, teachers, and academic researchers.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tntavf\" data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2510\">Content writers, editors, and publishing professionals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ls7php\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2549\">Journalists and media professionals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5jn3ft\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2608\">Public relations and corporate communication executives.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sfinrt\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2675\">Civil services aspirants seeking a strong humanities background.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14j5pft\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2747\">Professionals looking to enhance communication and analytical skills.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"522\">The <strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"86\">Online MA Political Science</strong> program is designed for graduates who want to develop advanced knowledge of <strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"335\">political theory, international relations, public administration, comparative politics, public policy, governance, political institutions, diplomacy, and global affairs</strong>. The program offers a flexible learning environment that enables students and working professionals to pursue higher education while managing their personal and professional commitments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"826\">With a strong focus on political analysis, policy-making, governance systems, and contemporary political issues, the Online MA Political Science degree prepares learners for careers in government, civil services, policy research, international organizations, academia, media, and public administration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n4kydn\" data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"873\">Online MA Political Science Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"1119\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"907\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"907\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"891\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"907\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1119\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<td data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"969\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"979\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1012\">\r\n<td data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1002\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1012\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1045\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1034\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1045\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹15,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1080\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1070\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1080\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1119\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1104\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1103\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1119\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1117\">₹40,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1etj4xo\" data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1159\">MA Political Science Fee Breakdown</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1338\">The fee structure is designed to provide affordable access to postgraduate education in political science while ensuring quality academic support and digital learning resources.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1365\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1365\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1354\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1365\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1405\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1475\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers academic instruction, study materials, and faculty guidance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1539\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1494\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1539\" data-col-size=\"md\">Annual examination and assessment charges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1559\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1596\" data-col-size=\"md\">One-time admission processing fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1649\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1649\" data-col-size=\"md\">Lifetime alumni membership benefits</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1670\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1730\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete cost of the Online MA Political Science program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t54zhm\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1799\">What is Included in the Online MA Political Science Course Fee?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1890\">Students enrolled in the Online MA Political Science program generally receive access to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"2168\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4gqz89\" data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1926\">Learning Management System (LMS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mcz01l\" data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1962\">Live and recorded online lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a78aos\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2000\">Digital study materials and e-books</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ww3a4j\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2039\">Assignments and academic assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i36byu\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2080\">Faculty mentoring and academic support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19u91p5\" data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2112\">Research and project guidance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12josyn\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2134\">Online examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rfobln\" data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2168\">Alumni networking opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"564\">The <strong data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"94\">Online MA Political Science</strong> curriculum is designed to provide an in-depth understanding of <strong data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"342\">political theory, international relations, public policy, governance, constitutional studies, political thought, diplomacy, security studies, human rights, and research methodology</strong>. The program combines theoretical foundations with contemporary political developments, helping students develop analytical, research, and policy-making skills required in today\'s dynamic political and global environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"961\">The curriculum is particularly valuable for students aspiring to build careers in <strong data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"801\">civil services, public administration, policy analysis, international relations, political consulting, journalism, research, academia, and governance</strong>. Through field work, internships, seminars, and dissertation-based learning, students gain both academic and practical exposure to real-world political issues.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1owe7qo\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1011\">Online MA Political Science Course Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1433\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1038\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1433\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1163\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1079\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1163\" data-col-size=\"md\">Political Theory, Indian Politics, International Relations, and Academic Writing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1177\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1256\">Political Thought, Foreign Policy, Citizenship Studies, and Research Skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1340\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1270\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1340\">Geopolitics, Law, Gender Studies, Research Methods, and Internship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1433\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1354\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1433\" data-col-size=\"md\">Social Movements, Security Studies, Human Rights, and Dissertation Research</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"145v0y2\" data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1498\">Semester 1: Foundations of Political Science and Governance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1663\">The first semester develops a strong understanding of political theories, constitutional systems, international relations, and contemporary political developments.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"2482\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1675\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1690\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"2482\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1839\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1755\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to Political Theory I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1839\">Learn core concepts of power, state, democracy, justice, and political ideology.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1941\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1869\" data-col-size=\"md\">Western Political Thinkers</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1941\">Study the ideas of influential political philosophers and theorists.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1988\" data-col-size=\"md\">Indian Constitution and Political Processes</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2090\">Understand constitutional principles, governance structures, and democratic institutions in India.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2235\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2147\" data-col-size=\"md\">World History and Theories of International Relations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2235\">Explore global political developments and major theories of international relations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2351\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2286\" data-col-size=\"md\">Writing Skills and Practice in Social Science I</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2351\">Develop academic writing, analysis, and communication skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2482\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2393\" data-col-size=\"md\">Contemporary Issues in Indian Politics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2482\">Examine current political challenges, governance issues, and policy debates in India.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9xgjek\" data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2536\">Semester 2: Political Thought and Global Affairs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2684\">The second semester focuses on advanced political thought, citizenship issues, migration studies, foreign policy, and academic research practices.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"3458\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2711\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2711\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2696\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2711\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"3458\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2791\" data-col-size=\"md\">Political Thought: Hegel to Contemporary Thinkers</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2866\">Analyze modern political philosophies and contemporary political ideas.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2974\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2895\" data-col-size=\"md\">Indian Political Thinkers</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2895\" data-end=\"2974\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study the contributions of major Indian political philosophers and leaders.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3104\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3013\" data-col-size=\"md\">Citizenship, Refugees and Migration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3104\">Explore citizenship rights, migration policies, and refugee issues in a global context.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3218\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3130\" data-col-size=\"md\">India&rsquo;s Foreign Policy</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3218\">Understand India\'s diplomatic relations, strategic interests, and global engagement.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3336\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3270\" data-col-size=\"md\">Writing Skills and Practice in Social Science II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3336\">Enhance research writing and academic communication abilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3458\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3358\" data-col-size=\"md\">Seminar/Field Work</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3458\">Gain practical exposure through presentations, discussions, and field-based learning activities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1au4cmr\" data-start=\"3460\" data-end=\"3506\">Semester 3: Geopolitics, Law, and Research</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3674\">The third semester introduces regional politics, legal frameworks, gender studies, and research methodology while providing professional exposure through internships.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"4291\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3701\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3701\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3686\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3701\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3729\" data-end=\"4291\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3729\" data-end=\"3831\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3729\" data-end=\"3757\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Geopolitics in South Asia</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3831\" data-col-size=\"md\">Examine political, strategic, and security dynamics within South Asia.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3961\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3868\" data-col-size=\"sm\">European Union in Global Politics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3868\" data-end=\"3961\">Understand the role of the European Union in international affairs and global governance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"4061\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"3988\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Women and Laws in India</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"4061\">Study gender justice, women\'s rights, and legal protections in India.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4173\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4087\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Methodology I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4087\" data-end=\"4173\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn research design, data collection, and political science research techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4291\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4192\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Internship/MOOC</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4192\" data-end=\"4291\">Gain practical experience through internships, online certifications, or professional projects.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qxz9sz\" data-start=\"4293\" data-end=\"4345\">Semester 4: Advanced Policy and Research Studies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4347\" data-end=\"4461\">The final semester focuses on human rights, security studies, social movements, and independent academic research.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"5074\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4488\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4488\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4473\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4488\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4516\" data-end=\"5074\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4516\" data-end=\"4636\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4516\" data-end=\"4568\" data-col-size=\"md\">Social Movements in India / Environmental Studies</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4568\" data-end=\"4636\">Analyze social change movements and environmental policy issues.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4637\" data-end=\"4765\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4637\" data-end=\"4680\" data-col-size=\"md\">International Law, Human Rights &amp; Gender</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4680\" data-end=\"4765\">Study global legal systems, human rights frameworks, and gender-related policies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4766\" data-end=\"4857\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4766\" data-end=\"4792\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research Methodology II</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4792\" data-end=\"4857\">Apply advanced research techniques and analytical frameworks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4858\" data-end=\"4964\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4858\" data-end=\"4877\" data-col-size=\"md\">Security Studies</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4877\" data-end=\"4964\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore national security, strategic studies, and contemporary security challenges.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"5074\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"4994\" data-col-size=\"md\">Post Graduate Dissertation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4994\" data-end=\"5074\" data-col-size=\"md\">Conduct independent research on a political, social, or international issue.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"b5e2l7\" data-start=\"5076\" data-end=\"5148\">Key Skills Developed Through the Online MA Political Science Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5150\" data-end=\"5273\">The Online MA Political Science curriculum develops highly relevant analytical, research, and policy-oriented competencies.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5275\" data-end=\"5738\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"188m7e6\" data-start=\"5275\" data-end=\"5317\">Political Analysis and Policy Evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10nbj7c\" data-start=\"5318\" data-end=\"5357\">Constitutional and Governance Studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yd9bic\" data-start=\"5358\" data-end=\"5397\">International Relations and Diplomacy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eda9pe\" data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5436\">Public Administration and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gwahux\" data-start=\"5437\" data-end=\"5481\">Political Research and Data Interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xs5e5a\" data-start=\"5482\" data-end=\"5515\">Human Rights and Legal Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11yicpm\" data-start=\"5516\" data-end=\"5543\">Public Policy Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ix1ed\" data-start=\"5544\" data-end=\"5579\">Academic and Professional Writing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vnvtqw\" data-start=\"5580\" data-end=\"5619\">Critical Thinking and Problem-Solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5sy09s\" data-start=\"5620\" data-end=\"5652\">Leadership and Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"47i33x\" data-start=\"5653\" data-end=\"5690\">Geopolitical and Strategic Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3hdk3g\" data-start=\"5691\" data-end=\"5738\">Research Methodology and Dissertation Writing</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 40200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(457, 82, '022a1ab4-2826-4816-9b66-4680447d1bf7', '0e21062c-78c5-4b5a-8327-0af8287be913', 39, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 05:43:16', '2026-05-30 05:43:16', '<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"544\">The <strong data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"74\">Online BCA admission process</strong> is designed to provide a simple, transparent, and student-friendly enrollment experience for candidates aspiring to build careers in <strong data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"372\">software development, web development, data science, artificial intelligence, cloud computing, cybersecurity, mobile app development, and information technology</strong>. The admission procedure follows a structured process that ensures eligible students can complete their application and secure admission without unnecessary complications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"765\">Whether you are a Class 12 graduate, an appearing student, or someone looking to begin a career in the technology sector, understanding the complete admission process can help you start your BCA journey with confidence.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s1h535\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"798\">Step 1: Online Registration</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"897\">The admission process begins with candidate registration through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"1079\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cqo4b\" data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"931\">Create your admission account.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z1oov\" data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"968\">Enter your basic personal details.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mds5jf\" data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1014\">Provide a valid email ID and mobile number.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c65443\" data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1079\">Generate your applicant profile for future admission tracking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1159\">Successful registration allows candidates to proceed to the application stage.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qahkao\" data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1198\">Step 2: Verify Your Email Address</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1263\">After registration, candidates must verify their email address.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1384\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m6sh84\" data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1318\">Open the verification email sent by the university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wpnh1k\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1349\">Click the verification link.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uwuq5i\" data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1384\">Activate your admission account.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1498\">Email verification is essential for receiving admission updates, fee notifications, and academic communications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"91jlrc\" data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1544\">Step 3: Fill the Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1627\">Once the account is activated, applicants must complete the BCA application form.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1770\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kl7go9\" data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1661\">Enter academic qualifications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9lswc0\" data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1690\">Upload required documents.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"104gjt5\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1737\">Verify personal and educational information.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kiz19o\" data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1770\">Select the Online BCA program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1867\">Candidates should carefully review all information before submission to avoid admission delays.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hko7uf\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1904\">Step 4: Pay the Application Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1997\">To complete the application process, candidates must submit the prescribed application fee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2103\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2035\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2035\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2025\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2035\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2103\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2103\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2093\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2103\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2186\">After successful payment, the application is officially submitted for evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1eyevgz\" data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2228\">Step 5: Merit-Based Admission Review</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2318\">Applications are reviewed based on academic qualifications and eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2441\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gykvn3\" data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2355\">Educational records are verified.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xjg7zf\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2392\">Eligibility criteria are assessed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gv1qt9\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2441\">Merit-based admission evaluation is conducted.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2543\">In some cases, admission counselors may contact candidates for additional guidance or clarification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wxmmau\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2592\">Step 6: Receive Provisional Admission Offer</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2679\">Candidates who meet the admission requirements receive a provisional admission offer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2701\">This stage confirms:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2795\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohcvjm\" data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2730\">Eligibility verification.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pc47at\" data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2765\">Academic qualification approval.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u0wxfo\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2795\">Shortlisting for admission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2883\">The admission offer is communicated through the registered email and admission portal.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3rv2rz\" data-start=\"2885\" data-end=\"2918\">Step 7: Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"2990\">Before final admission approval, all submitted documents are verified.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3028\">Commonly required documents include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3167\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2syl9\" data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3051\">Class 10 Mark Sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cronrz\" data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3073\">Class 12 Mark Sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2mxnc\" data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3101\">Government Photo ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1omr008\" data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3128\">Passport-Size Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3167\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3273\">Applications may be rejected if documents are incomplete, inaccurate, or fail verification requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1medm45\" data-start=\"3275\" data-end=\"3306\">Step 8: Pay the Program Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3402\">After successful verification, candidates must pay the program fee to confirm their admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"l1sqai\" data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3432\">Online BCA Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3678\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3466\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3466\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3450\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3466\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3678\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3538\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3528\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3538\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3571\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3561\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3561\" data-end=\"3571\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3604\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3593\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3593\" data-end=\"3604\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹23,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3605\" data-end=\"3639\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3605\" data-end=\"3629\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3629\" data-end=\"3639\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3678\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3663\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3662\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3678\"><strong data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3676\">₹83,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3747\">Fee payment secures the candidate\'s seat in the Online BCA program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xfjfrx\" data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3789\">Step 9: Final Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"3846\">After successful fee payment and document verification:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"4021\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s85njm\" data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3884\">Admission is officially confirmed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qw1m70\" data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3919\">Student enrollment is completed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g0f04k\" data-start=\"3920\" data-end=\"3978\">LMS (Learning Management System) credentials are issued.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1di1554\" data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4021\">Academic orientation details are shared.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4023\" data-end=\"4101\">Students can immediately access their learning resources and course materials.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jlsipu\" data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4150\">Step 10: Commencement of Online BCA Classes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4244\">Once admission is confirmed, students begin their academic journey in computer applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4277\">The program generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4279\" data-end=\"4526\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hywzem\" data-start=\"4279\" data-end=\"4301\">Live online lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ifp28d\" data-start=\"4302\" data-end=\"4326\">Recorded video classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vwg3l1\" data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4352\">Digital study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rwph0e\" data-start=\"4353\" data-end=\"4396\">Coding assignments and practical projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f52fgg\" data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4438\">Faculty mentoring and technical support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12josyn\" data-start=\"4439\" data-end=\"4460\">Online examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zn3sbs\" data-start=\"4461\" data-end=\"4494\">Internship and project guidance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gixny7\" data-start=\"4495\" data-end=\"4526\">Career development assistance</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"548\">The <strong data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"90\">Online BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)</strong> program is designed for students who want to build a strong foundation in <strong data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"336\">computer science, software development, programming, artificial intelligence, data science, cloud computing, cybersecurity, web development, and information technology</strong>. As one of the most sought-after undergraduate technology programs, Online BCA prepares learners for high-growth careers in the digital economy while providing flexibility and industry-relevant technical skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"719\">Whether you are a recent school graduate or planning a career in the IT industry, understanding the eligibility requirements is the first step toward securing admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3ccsgq\" data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"774\">Eligibility Requirements for Online BCA Admission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"860\">To apply for the Online BCA program, candidates must fulfill the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w4qore\" data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"944\">Passed <strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"890\">Class 12 (10+2)</strong> or an equivalent examination from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13j626o\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1105\">Students <strong data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"995\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> are also eligible to apply, subject to the submission of qualifying documents within the prescribed timeline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"163aq1e\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1185\">Candidates from any stream, including Science, Commerce, and Arts, may apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b2ln9u\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1302\"><strong data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1235\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> and other recognized open schooling board candidates are eligible.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wr2n6s\" data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1395\">Applicants must satisfy the university\'s admission and document verification requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14xi5nr\" data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1432\">Online BCA Eligibility Overview</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1460\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1460\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1445\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Criteria</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1460\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1505\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Level</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1522\" data-col-size=\"md\">Undergraduate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1566\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1547\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1566\" data-col-size=\"md\">Class 12 (10+2)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1587\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Board Recognition</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1607\" data-col-size=\"md\">Recognized Board</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1627\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Streams</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1654\" data-col-size=\"md\">Science, Commerce, Arts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1678\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Appearing Candidates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1690\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1721\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1709\" data-col-size=\"sm\">NIOS Candidates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1721\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1740\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Basis</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1795\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligibility Verification and Academic Qualification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s0b8lw\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2422\">Who Should Pursue an Online BCA?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2460\">The Online BCA program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2870\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17b7u2q\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2519\">Students interested in computer science and technology.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"idj9lf\" data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2579\">Aspirants seeking careers in software development and IT.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t384tc\" data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2649\">Individuals interested in artificial intelligence and data science.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r2q5tx\" data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2720\">Students planning careers in web and mobile application development.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zim9sa\" data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2789\">Learners looking for flexible technology-focused higher education.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15s0run\" data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2870\">Future entrepreneurs interested in technology startups and digital innovation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"518\">The <strong data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"88\">Online BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)</strong> program is one of the most popular undergraduate degrees for students aspiring to build careers in <strong data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"341\">software development, web development, data science, artificial intelligence, cloud computing, cybersecurity, programming, and information technology</strong>. Designed for both fresh Class 12 graduates and learners seeking flexible education, the program combines industry-relevant technical knowledge with practical computing skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"678\">With an affordable fee structure and strong career potential, the Online BCA program provides an excellent pathway into the rapidly growing technology sector.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"l1sqai\" data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"708\">Online BCA Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"954\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"742\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"742\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"726\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"742\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"954\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"814\">\r\n<td data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"804\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"814\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<td data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"837\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"847\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"880\">\r\n<td data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"869\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"880\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹23,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"915\">\r\n<td data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"905\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"915\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"954\">\r\n<td data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"939\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"938\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"954\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"952\">₹83,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17fy0gd\" data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"977\">BCA Fee Breakdown</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1114\">The Online BCA fee structure is designed to offer quality computer applications education while maintaining affordability for students.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1141\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1141\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1130\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1141\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1250\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1181\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1250\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers academic learning, technical training, and faculty support</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1314\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1269\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1314\">Annual examination and assessment charges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1371\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1334\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1371\">One-time admission processing fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1424\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1385\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1424\" data-col-size=\"md\">Lifetime alumni membership benefits</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1445\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1487\">Complete fee for the Online BCA degree</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19lpzp7\" data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1539\">What is Included in the Online BCA Course Fee?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1613\">Students enrolled in the Online BCA program typically receive access to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1915\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4gqz89\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1649\">Learning Management System (LMS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvh35a\" data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1684\">Live and recorded online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"npf3hq\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1736\">Digital study materials and programming resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jv1r7h\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1783\">Coding assignments and practical assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pq4l5\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1826\">Faculty mentoring and technical guidance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"24lo7e\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1865\">Project-based learning opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12josyn\" data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1887\">Online examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1apit3f\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1915\">Alumni networking support<br><br>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n91iug\" data-start=\"3460\" data-end=\"3497\">Important Fee-Related Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3885\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bmelal\" data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3554\">Registration Fee and Alumni Fee are one-time charges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aasorj\" data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3593\">Examination Fee is payable annually.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rsv3xt\" data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3659\">Tuition Fee covers academic instruction and learning resources.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lgjgc9\" data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3778\">Students should verify the latest fee structure during admission as university policies may be updated periodically.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xgdlfw\" data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3885\">Additional charges may apply for re-examinations, certification requests, or optional academic services.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"517\">The <strong data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"96\">Online BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)</strong> curriculum is designed to prepare students for careers in <strong data-start=\"155\" data-end=\"321\">software development, full stack web development, data science, artificial intelligence, cloud computing, mobile app development, cybersecurity, and IT management</strong>. The program combines fundamental computer science concepts with modern technologies and hands-on project experience, ensuring students develop both technical expertise and industry-ready skills.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"833\">The curriculum covers high-demand areas such as <strong data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"765\">Programming, Data Structures, Database Management Systems, Full Stack Development, Python, Machine Learning, Cloud Computing, Software Engineering, Mobile Application Development, and Algorithms</strong>, making it highly relevant to today\'s technology-driven job market.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1swqj0h\" data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"866\">Online BCA Course Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"879\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"893\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\n<td data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"934\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"1020\" data-col-size=\"md\">Computing Fundamentals, Programming, Communication Skills, and Office Applications</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1034\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1094\" data-col-size=\"md\">Core Computer Science Concepts and Database Technologies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1108\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1187\" data-col-size=\"md\">Networking, Operating Systems, Full Stack Development, and Java Programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1201\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1277\" data-col-size=\"md\">Python, Machine Learning, Mobile Applications, and Emerging Technologies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1367\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1291\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1367\" data-col-size=\"md\">Software Engineering, Cloud Computing, Internship, and Industry Projects</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1381\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 6</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1440\" data-col-size=\"md\">Capstone Project and Professional Application of Skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xmfdoj\" data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1497\">Semester 1: Foundation of Computing and Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1663\">The first semester introduces students to the fundamentals of computer applications, programming logic, communication skills, and essential business software tools.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"2257\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1675\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1690\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"2257\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1820\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1746\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics for Computing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1820\" data-col-size=\"md\">Build mathematical and logical foundations for computing applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1852\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer System Organisation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1933\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand computer architecture, hardware components, and system operations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2041\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1968\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Programming for Problem Solving</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2041\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn programming concepts and develop computational thinking skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2140\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2068\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Office Automation Tools</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2140\" data-col-size=\"md\">Gain proficiency in productivity and business software applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2257\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2183\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication &amp; Report Writing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2257\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop professional communication and technical documentation skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wwlicm\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2322\">Semester 2: Core Computer Science and Database Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2445\">The second semester focuses on problem-solving techniques, data management, programming structures, and web technologies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2985\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2472\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2472\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2457\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2472\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2985\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2595\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2523\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discrete Mathematics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2595\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn mathematical concepts used in computer science and algorithms.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2674\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2614\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Data Structures</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2674\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study efficient methods of organizing and managing data.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2792\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2715\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Object Oriented Programming using C++</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2792\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop software applications using object-oriented programming concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2894\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2823\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Database Management Systems</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2894\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn database design, SQL, data storage, and retrieval techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2895\" data-end=\"2985\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2895\" data-end=\"2908\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Web Design</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2985\" data-col-size=\"md\">Create responsive and interactive websites using modern web technologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5bglew\" data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3038\">Semester 3: Software Development and Networking</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3040\" data-end=\"3181\">The third semester introduces advanced software development concepts and networking fundamentals that form the backbone of modern IT systems.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3830\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3208\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3208\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3193\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3208\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3830\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3330\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3256\" data-col-size=\"md\">Computer Networks</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3330\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand networking concepts, protocols, and internet communication.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3331\" data-end=\"3422\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3331\" data-end=\"3351\" data-col-size=\"md\">Operating Systems</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3422\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn process management, memory allocation, and system operations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3553\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3470\" data-col-size=\"md\">Full Stack Development using React &amp; Node.js</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3553\" data-col-size=\"md\">Build complete web applications using modern frontend and backend technologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3645\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3573\" data-col-size=\"md\">Entrepreneurship</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3645\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand startup ecosystems, innovation, and business development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3753\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3665\" data-col-size=\"md\">Java Programming</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3753\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop applications using Java programming language and object-oriented principles.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3754\" data-end=\"3830\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3754\" data-end=\"3767\" data-col-size=\"md\">Elective I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3767\" data-end=\"3830\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized subject aligned with industry and career goals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gq867m\" data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3894\">Semester 4: Emerging Technologies and Advanced Programming</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"4001\">The fourth semester focuses on modern technologies that are transforming the global technology landscape.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4503\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4028\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4028\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4013\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4013\" data-end=\"4028\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4056\" data-end=\"4503\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4056\" data-end=\"4172\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4056\" data-end=\"4077\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Python Programming</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4077\" data-end=\"4172\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn one of the most widely used programming languages for software and data applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4261\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4192\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Machine Learning</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4192\" data-end=\"4261\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore AI models, predictive analytics, and intelligent systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4352\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4295\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mobile Application Development</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4352\" data-col-size=\"md\">Design and develop applications for mobile platforms.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4353\" data-end=\"4444\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4353\" data-end=\"4377\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Environmental Studies</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4377\" data-end=\"4444\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand sustainability and environmental awareness concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4503\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4459\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4503\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized technology-focused elective.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"deg36l\" data-start=\"4505\" data-end=\"4576\">Semester 5: Industry-Oriented Learning and Professional Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4732\">The fifth semester prepares students for professional careers through software engineering practices, cloud technologies, and practical industry exposure.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4734\" data-end=\"5343\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4734\" data-end=\"4759\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4734\" data-end=\"4759\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4734\" data-end=\"4744\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4744\" data-end=\"4759\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4787\" data-end=\"5343\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4787\" data-end=\"4897\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4787\" data-end=\"4823\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Design and Analysis of Algorithms</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4823\" data-end=\"4897\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn efficient problem-solving and algorithm optimization techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4898\" data-end=\"5013\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4898\" data-end=\"4933\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Software Engineering and Testing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4933\" data-end=\"5013\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand software development life cycles and quality assurance practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5014\" data-end=\"5065\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5014\" data-end=\"5029\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective III</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5029\" data-end=\"5065\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced specialization subject.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5066\" data-end=\"5168\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5066\" data-end=\"5084\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cloud Computing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5084\" data-end=\"5168\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore cloud platforms, virtualization, and modern infrastructure technologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5169\" data-end=\"5272\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5169\" data-end=\"5185\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minor Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5185\" data-end=\"5272\" data-col-size=\"md\">Apply technical knowledge to solve real-world problems through project development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5273\" data-end=\"5343\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5273\" data-end=\"5286\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Internship</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5343\" data-col-size=\"md\">Gain industry exposure and practical work experience.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1q3iae8\" data-start=\"5345\" data-end=\"5377\">Semester 6: Capstone Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5379\" data-end=\"5461\">The final semester focuses on practical implementation and professional readiness.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5463\" data-end=\"5656\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5463\" data-end=\"5488\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5463\" data-end=\"5488\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5463\" data-end=\"5473\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5473\" data-end=\"5488\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5516\" data-end=\"5656\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5516\" data-end=\"5656\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5516\" data-end=\"5535\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Capstone Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5535\" data-end=\"5656\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Develop a comprehensive industry-oriented project demonstrating technical expertise and problem-solving capabilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k4t86i\" data-start=\"5658\" data-end=\"5713\">Key Skills Developed Through the Online BCA Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5715\" data-end=\"5822\">The Online BCA curriculum equips students with highly sought-after technical and professional competencies.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5824\" data-end=\"6204\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jfe3ja\" data-start=\"5824\" data-end=\"5862\">Programming and Software Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vxrtx2\" data-start=\"5863\" data-end=\"5891\">Full Stack Web Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hk9mzp\" data-start=\"5892\" data-end=\"5912\">Python Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wybcvb\" data-start=\"5913\" data-end=\"5931\">Java Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"151tiij\" data-start=\"5932\" data-end=\"5961\">Database Management and SQL</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b2r0rx\" data-start=\"5962\" data-end=\"5993\">Machine Learning Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11zxeld\" data-start=\"5994\" data-end=\"6026\">Mobile Application Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"glnl8p\" data-start=\"6027\" data-end=\"6057\">Cloud Computing Technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5r3eig\" data-start=\"6058\" data-end=\"6098\">Software Testing and Quality Assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16l55td\" data-start=\"6099\" data-end=\"6120\">Computer Networking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oci6la\" data-start=\"6121\" data-end=\"6159\">Problem-Solving and Algorithm Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16da6dz\" data-start=\"6160\" data-end=\"6204\">Project Development and Team Collaboration</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 83200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(458, 82, '022a1ab4-2826-4816-9b66-4680447d1bf7', '0e21062c-78c5-4b5a-8327-0af8287be913', 208, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 05:48:29', '2026-05-30 05:50:58', '<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"519\">The <strong data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"74\">Online BBA admission process</strong> is designed to provide a simple, transparent, and hassle-free enrollment experience for students who want to build successful careers in <strong data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"355\">business management, marketing, finance, human resources, entrepreneurship, business analytics, digital marketing, and corporate leadership</strong>. The admission procedure follows a structured process that ensures eligible candidates can complete their application smoothly and secure admission to the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"709\">Whether you are a Class 12 graduate or an aspiring management professional, understanding the complete admission process can help you begin your business education journey with confidence.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"84rcrd\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"738\">Step 1: Register Online</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"834\">The admission process begins with online registration through the university admission portal.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cnlbnn\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"909\">Create your admission account using a valid email ID and mobile number.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"149pk5c\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"954\">Enter basic personal and academic details.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v54et\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1014\">Generate your applicant ID for future admission tracking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1101\">Successful registration enables candidates to access the Online BBA application form.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qahkao\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1140\">Step 2: Verify Your Email Address</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1205\">After registration, candidates must verify their email address.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fvewl6\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1266\">Open the verification email received from the university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wpnh1k\" data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1297\">Click the verification link.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2jpang\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1332\">Activate your admission profile.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1438\">Email verification ensures secure communication regarding admission updates and important notifications.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hcnjqm\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1488\">Step 3: Complete the Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1570\">Once the account is activated, applicants can proceed with the application form.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1721\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a19wdn\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1607\">Enter educational qualifications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gwqm2d\" data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1645\">Upload required academic documents.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yltsx3\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1688\">Verify personal and educational details.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"20doz1\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1721\">Select the Online BBA program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1798\">Candidates should review all information carefully before final submission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hko7uf\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1835\">Step 4: Pay the Application Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1925\">To complete the application process, candidates must pay the prescribed application fee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1963\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1963\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1953\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1963\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2021\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Application Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2031\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2114\">After successful payment, the application is officially submitted for evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1v7bsvz\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2160\">Step 5: Merit-Based Admission Evaluation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2260\">The university reviews applications based on academic qualifications and eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2376\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1inob8u\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2294\">Academic records are assessed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z7qig8\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2331\">Eligibility criteria are verified.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ij85t\" data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2376\">Merit-based admission review is conducted.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2478\">In some cases, admission counselors may contact applicants for additional clarification or guidance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wxmmau\" data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2527\">Step 6: Receive Provisional Admission Offer</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2630\">Candidates who successfully satisfy the admission requirements receive a provisional admission offer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2652\">This stage confirms:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2757\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o6ruie\" data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2692\">Eligibility verification completion.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pc47at\" data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2727\">Academic qualification approval.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u0wxfo\" data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2757\">Shortlisting for admission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2847\">The provisional offer is communicated through the registered email and admission portal.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3rv2rz\" data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2882\">Step 7: Document Verification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2961\">Before final admission approval, all uploaded documents undergo verification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"2999\">Commonly required documents include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3138\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2syl9\" data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3022\">Class 10 Mark Sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cronrz\" data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3044\">Class 12 Mark Sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2mxnc\" data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3072\">Government Photo ID Proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1omr008\" data-start=\"3073\" data-end=\"3099\">Passport-Size Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8duxhq\" data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3138\">Category Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3244\">Applications may be rejected if documents are incomplete, inaccurate, or fail verification requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1medm45\" data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3277\">Step 8: Pay the Program Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3373\">After successful verification, candidates must pay the program fee to confirm their admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rbuldn\" data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3403\">Online BBA Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3649\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3437\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3437\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3421\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3437\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3649\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3509\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3499\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3509\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3542\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3532\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3542\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3575\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3564\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3575\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹21,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3610\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3600\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3649\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3634\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3613\" data-end=\"3633\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3634\" data-end=\"3649\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3636\" data-end=\"3647\">₹77,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3651\" data-end=\"3737\">Program fee payment officially secures the candidate\'s seat in the Online BBA program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xfjfrx\" data-start=\"3739\" data-end=\"3779\">Step 9: Final Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3838\">Once fee payment and document verification are completed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3840\" data-end=\"4029\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s85njm\" data-start=\"3840\" data-end=\"3876\">Admission is officially confirmed.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqnxka\" data-start=\"3877\" data-end=\"3924\">Student enrollment credentials are generated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18yxs38\" data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3980\">LMS (Learning Management System) access is activated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6cukot\" data-start=\"3981\" data-end=\"4029\">Orientation and onboarding details are shared.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4108\">Students can begin accessing learning materials immediately after enrollment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15rymw3\" data-start=\"4110\" data-end=\"4157\">Step 10: Commencement of Online BBA Classes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4239\">After admission confirmation, students begin their management education journey.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4241\" data-end=\"4272\">The program generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4274\" data-end=\"4568\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19z47nt\" data-start=\"4274\" data-end=\"4295\">Live online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1smez75\" data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4337\">Recorded lectures for flexible learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1340dtf\" data-start=\"4338\" data-end=\"4380\">Digital study materials and case studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tbeqrn\" data-start=\"4381\" data-end=\"4416\">Assignments and business projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i36byu\" data-start=\"4417\" data-end=\"4457\">Faculty mentoring and academic support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12josyn\" data-start=\"4458\" data-end=\"4479\">Online examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cygpml\" data-start=\"4480\" data-end=\"4528\">Internship and industry exposure opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16280y9\" data-start=\"4529\" data-end=\"4568\">Career guidance and placement support</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"502\">The <strong data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"92\">Online BBA (Bachelor of Business Administration)</strong> program is designed for students who aspire to build successful careers in <strong data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"321\">business management, marketing, finance, human resource management, entrepreneurship, business analytics, digital marketing, and corporate leadership</strong>. As one of the most popular undergraduate management programs, the Online BBA provides a strong foundation in business principles, leadership skills, and strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"689\">Whether you are a recent school graduate or planning to enter the corporate world, understanding the eligibility requirements is the first step toward securing admission to the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"97n3uj\" data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"744\">Eligibility Requirements for Online BBA Admission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"830\">To apply for the Online BBA program, candidates must fulfill the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"1365\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w4qore\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"914\">Passed <strong data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"860\">Class 12 (10+2)</strong> or an equivalent examination from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13j626o\" data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"1075\">Students <strong data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"965\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> are also eligible to apply, subject to the submission of qualifying documents within the prescribed timeline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"163aq1e\" data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1155\">Candidates from any stream, including Science, Commerce, and Arts, may apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b2ln9u\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1272\"><strong data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1205\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> and other recognized open schooling board candidates are eligible.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wr2n6s\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1365\">Applicants must satisfy the university\'s admission and document verification requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t8xu5i\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1402\">Online BBA Eligibility Overview</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1430\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1430\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1415\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Criteria</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1430\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1492\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1475\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Level</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1492\">Undergraduate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1517\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1536\">Class 12 (10+2)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1577\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1557\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Board Recognition</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1577\">Recognized Board</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1624\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1597\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Streams</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1624\" data-col-size=\"md\">Science, Commerce, Arts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1648\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Appearing Candidates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1660\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1691\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1679\" data-col-size=\"sm\">NIOS Candidates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1691\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1710\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Basis</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1765\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligibility Verification and Academic Qualification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s0b9ed\" data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2414\">Who Should Pursue an Online BBA?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2452\">The Online BBA program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2798\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"brmvbn\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2511\">Students interested in business and management careers.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hclinn\" data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2558\">Aspiring entrepreneurs and startup founders.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qj5s3g\" data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2602\">Future marketing and sales professionals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mju1ou\" data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2656\">Candidates planning careers in finance and banking.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oih23x\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2715\">Students aiming for leadership and managerial positions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e3ja43\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2798\">Learners preparing for higher studies such as MBA and other management programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"511\">The <strong data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"90\">Online BBA (Bachelor of Business Administration)</strong> program is one of the most sought-after undergraduate management degrees for students aspiring to build careers in <strong data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"359\">business management, marketing, finance, human resource management, entrepreneurship, digital marketing, business analytics, and corporate leadership</strong>. The program combines business fundamentals with practical management skills, helping students prepare for the evolving demands of the corporate world.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"761\">With an affordable fee structure and flexible online learning format, the Online BBA program provides an excellent foundation for students who want to pursue managerial careers, start their own businesses, or continue higher studies such as an MBA.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rbuldn\" data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"791\">Online BBA Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"825\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"825\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"809\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"825\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"897\">\r\n<td data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"887\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"897\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"930\">\r\n<td data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"920\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exam Fee (Per Year)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"930\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹4,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"963\">\r\n<td data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"952\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yearly Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"963\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹21,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"998\">\r\n<td data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"988\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee (One-Time)</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"998\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<td data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1022\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1021\">Total Course Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1037\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1035\">₹77,200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ag6e7g\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1060\">BBA Fee Breakdown</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1227\">The Online BBA fee structure is designed to make quality business education accessible while providing students with industry-oriented learning and academic support.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1243\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1254\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1374\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1294\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1374\" data-col-size=\"md\">Covers academic learning, faculty guidance, and business education resources</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1393\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1438\" data-col-size=\"md\">Annual examination and assessment charges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1495\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1458\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1495\" data-col-size=\"md\">One-time admission processing fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1509\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Alumni Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1548\" data-col-size=\"md\">Lifetime alumni membership benefits</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1611\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete cost of the Online BBA degree</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ljzeai\" data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1663\">What is Included in the Online BBA Course Fee?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1737\">Students enrolled in the Online BBA program typically receive access to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"2023\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4gqz89\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1773\">Learning Management System (LMS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvh35a\" data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1808\">Live and recorded online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"skp445\" data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1860\">Digital study materials and business case studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gcrk5i\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1890\">Assignments and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i36byu\" data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1931\">Faculty mentoring and academic support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12josyn\" data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1953\">Online examinations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"brruam\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1989\">Project-based learning activities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rfobln\" data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2023\">Alumni networking opportunities<br><br>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n91iug\" data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3623\">Important Fee-Related Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"4004\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bmelal\" data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3680\">Registration Fee and Alumni Fee are one-time charges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aasorj\" data-start=\"3681\" data-end=\"3719\">Examination Fee is payable annually.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x2b5o5\" data-start=\"3720\" data-end=\"3782\">Tuition Fee covers academic delivery and learning resources.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w70c32\" data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3899\">Students should verify the latest fee details during admission as university policies may be updated periodically.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13dht8h\" data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"4004\">Additional charges may apply for re-examinations, certificate requests, or optional academic services.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"494\">The <strong data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"98\">Online BBA (Bachelor of Business Administration)</strong> curriculum is designed to develop future business leaders, managers, entrepreneurs, and corporate professionals. The program combines foundational business concepts with modern management practices, helping students gain expertise in <strong data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"493\">marketing, finance, human resource management, business analytics, operations management, entrepreneurship, international business, and strategic management</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"740\">This industry-focused curriculum emphasizes practical learning, business communication, internships, research projects, and leadership development, ensuring graduates are prepared for the dynamic business environment and competitive job market.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zk07sw\" data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"773\">Online BBA Course Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"1314\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"800\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"800\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"786\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"800\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus Area</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1314\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"915\">\r\n<td data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"841\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"915\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Fundamentals, Accounting, Marketing, and Communication Skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"1002\">\r\n<td data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"929\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1002\" data-col-size=\"md\">Organizational Management, Economics, Operations, and Decision-Making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1073\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1016\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1073\" data-col-size=\"md\">Finance, HRM, Analytics, Supply Chain, and E-Business</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1087\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1149\" data-col-size=\"md\">Research, Business Law, Customer Management, and Electives</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1227\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1163\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1227\" data-col-size=\"md\">International Business, Corporate Governance, and Internship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1314\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1241\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 6</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1314\" data-col-size=\"md\">Entrepreneurship, Strategy, Project Management, and Industry Research</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1beiy73\" data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1369\">Semester 1: Foundation of Business and Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1524\">The first semester introduces students to the fundamentals of business administration, accounting, management principles, and professional communication.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"2281\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1551\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1551\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1536\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1551\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"2281\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1683\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1602\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1683\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn accounting principles, financial statements, and business transactions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1791\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Principles of Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1791\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand planning, organizing, leadership, and managerial decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1893\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1815\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Environment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1893\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study economic, political, legal, and social factors affecting businesses.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"2001\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1927\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Theory and Practices</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"2001\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore consumer behavior, marketing strategies, and brand management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2094\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2094\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn statistical tools for business analysis and decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2182\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2119\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Communicative English</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2182\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop professional communication and presentation skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2281\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2208\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Office Automation Tool</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2281\" data-col-size=\"md\">Gain proficiency in business productivity software and digital tools.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pj69el\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2340\">Semester 2: Management and Organizational Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2465\">The second semester focuses on organizational behavior, operational efficiency, economics, and modern management practices.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"3207\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2492\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2492\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2477\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2492\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"3207\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2616\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2547\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Organisational Behaviour</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2616\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand employee behavior, motivation, and workplace dynamics.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2719\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2650\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Management and Cost Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2719\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn cost analysis, budgeting, and financial control techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2833\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2759\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Production and Operations Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2833\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study production systems, operations planning, and quality management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2929\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2865\" data-col-size=\"sm\">IT Tools for Decision Making</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2929\" data-col-size=\"md\">Use technology and data tools to support business decisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"3013\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2948\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Design Thinking</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"3013\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop creative problem-solving and innovation capabilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3097\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3035\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Economics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3097\" data-col-size=\"md\">Analyze economic concepts and their business applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3207\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3207\" data-col-size=\"md\">Enhance written and verbal communication skills for professional environments.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yrncli\" data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3269\">Semester 3: Business Analytics and Functional Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3371\">The third semester introduces specialized management disciplines and emerging business technologies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"4130\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3398\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3398\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3383\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3398\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3426\" data-end=\"4130\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3426\" data-end=\"3524\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3426\" data-end=\"3449\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3524\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn investment, financing, and corporate financial planning concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3620\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3553\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Communication II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3553\" data-end=\"3620\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop advanced business communication and negotiation skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3621\" data-end=\"3734\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3621\" data-end=\"3649\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3734\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand recruitment, training, performance management, and employee relations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3845\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3772\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Business Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"3845\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn data-driven decision-making and business intelligence concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3947\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3872\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Supply Chain Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3947\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study logistics, procurement, and supply chain optimization strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"4028\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"3961\" data-col-size=\"sm\">E-Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3961\" data-end=\"4028\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore digital business models and online commerce operations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4029\" data-end=\"4130\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4029\" data-end=\"4053\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Environmental Studies</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4053\" data-end=\"4130\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand sustainability and environmental responsibilities in business.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jq73ov\" data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4199\">Semester 4: Research, Legal Frameworks, and Customer Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4327\">The fourth semester helps students develop research capabilities and understand legal and customer-centric business practices.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"5069\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4354\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4354\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4339\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4354\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"5069\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4483\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4405\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Research Methodology</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4405\" data-end=\"4483\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn business research methods, data collection, and analysis techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4484\" data-end=\"4603\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4484\" data-end=\"4519\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Customer Relationship Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4519\" data-end=\"4603\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand customer retention, engagement, and relationship-building strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4604\" data-end=\"4703\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4604\" data-end=\"4619\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Law</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4619\" data-end=\"4703\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study legal regulations governing business operations and commercial activities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4704\" data-end=\"4792\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4704\" data-end=\"4717\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective I</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4717\" data-end=\"4792\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized subject aligned with career interests and business domains.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4793\" data-end=\"4860\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4793\" data-end=\"4807\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective II</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4860\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced elective for focused business expertise.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4861\" data-end=\"4964\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4861\" data-end=\"4897\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indian Management Thought / Minor</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4897\" data-end=\"4964\" data-col-size=\"md\">Explore management philosophies and interdisciplinary learning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"5069\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"4984\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Workshop/Seminar</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4984\" data-end=\"5069\" data-col-size=\"md\">Gain practical exposure through industry interactions and professional workshops.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1idbqdo\" data-start=\"5071\" data-end=\"5127\">Semester 5: Global Business and Corporate Governance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5129\" data-end=\"5262\">The fifth semester prepares students for leadership roles through international business exposure and corporate governance practices.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5846\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5289\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5289\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5274\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5274\" data-end=\"5289\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5317\" data-end=\"5846\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5317\" data-end=\"5426\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5317\" data-end=\"5342\" data-col-size=\"sm\">International Business</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5342\" data-end=\"5426\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study global trade, international markets, and cross-border business strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5427\" data-end=\"5530\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5427\" data-end=\"5460\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Ethics and Governance</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5460\" data-end=\"5530\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn ethical decision-making and corporate governance principles.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5531\" data-end=\"5633\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5531\" data-end=\"5559\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Summer Internship Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5559\" data-end=\"5633\" data-col-size=\"md\">Gain hands-on industry experience through practical business projects.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5704\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5649\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective III</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5649\" data-end=\"5704\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized business subject for advanced learning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5705\" data-end=\"5773\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5705\" data-end=\"5719\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective IV</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5719\" data-end=\"5773\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industry-focused elective supporting career goals.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5774\" data-end=\"5846\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5774\" data-end=\"5787\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective V</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5787\" data-end=\"5846\" data-col-size=\"md\">Additional specialization subject for domain expertise.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mfqp64\" data-start=\"5848\" data-end=\"5918\">Semester 6: Leadership, Entrepreneurship, and Strategic Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5920\" data-end=\"6029\">The final semester focuses on entrepreneurship, strategic planning, project execution, and industry research.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"6031\" data-end=\"6743\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"6031\" data-end=\"6056\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6031\" data-end=\"6056\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6031\" data-end=\"6041\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6041\" data-end=\"6056\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"6084\" data-end=\"6743\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6084\" data-end=\"6176\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6084\" data-end=\"6103\" data-col-size=\"md\">Entrepreneurship</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6103\" data-end=\"6176\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn startup development, innovation, and business venture creation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6177\" data-end=\"6282\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6177\" data-end=\"6200\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6200\" data-end=\"6282\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand competitive strategy, business growth, and organizational planning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6283\" data-end=\"6378\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6283\" data-end=\"6304\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6304\" data-end=\"6378\" data-col-size=\"md\">Study project planning, execution, monitoring, and control techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6379\" data-end=\"6428\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6379\" data-end=\"6392\" data-col-size=\"md\">Elective V</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6392\" data-end=\"6428\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced specialization subject.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6429\" data-end=\"6508\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6429\" data-end=\"6443\" data-col-size=\"md\">Elective VI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6443\" data-end=\"6508\" data-col-size=\"md\">Career-oriented elective supporting professional development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6509\" data-end=\"6635\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6509\" data-end=\"6559\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Etiquettes and Personality Development</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6559\" data-end=\"6635\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop leadership presence, workplace professionalism, and soft skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6636\" data-end=\"6743\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6636\" data-end=\"6666\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industrial Research Project</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6666\" data-end=\"6743\" data-col-size=\"md\">Conduct industry-based research and solve real-world business challenges.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"31x68b\" data-start=\"6745\" data-end=\"6800\">Key Skills Developed Through the Online BBA Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6802\" data-end=\"6900\">The Online BBA curriculum helps students develop highly employable business and management skills.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6902\" data-end=\"7312\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q8mxwv\" data-start=\"6902\" data-end=\"6938\">Business Management and Leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nmhl9r\" data-start=\"6939\" data-end=\"6971\">Marketing and Brand Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3e8tt1\" data-start=\"6972\" data-end=\"7005\">Financial Analysis and Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aogelq\" data-start=\"7006\" data-end=\"7033\">Human Resource Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qxexu1\" data-start=\"7034\" data-end=\"7078\">Business Analytics and Data Interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b42yhn\" data-start=\"7079\" data-end=\"7113\">Customer Relationship Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10vbd2n\" data-start=\"7114\" data-end=\"7147\">Entrepreneurship and Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mcm96i\" data-start=\"7148\" data-end=\"7175\">Strategic Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1we2xhi\" data-start=\"7176\" data-end=\"7216\">Business Communication and Negotiation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"409qfc\" data-start=\"7217\" data-end=\"7257\">Supply Chain and Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ln1uz2\" data-start=\"7258\" data-end=\"7278\">Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uig5ce\" data-start=\"7279\" data-end=\"7312\">Corporate Governance and Ethics</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 77200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(459, 83, 'bab4483e-6161-460f-be1a-3abfe5752de8', '36540279-0957-4cc4-b717-736dcb1f39f1', 207, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 06:06:51', '2026-05-30 06:06:51', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"438\">Candidates seeking admission to the <strong data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"142\">SRM University Online MBA in Marketing</strong> program must meet the university\'s minimum academic requirements. The eligibility criteria are designed to ensure that students have the foundational knowledge necessary to successfully pursue advanced studies in marketing, business management, digital marketing, brand strategy, and leadership.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"700\">The Online MBA Marketing program welcomes graduates from diverse educational backgrounds, making it an excellent choice for fresh graduates, working professionals, entrepreneurs, and individuals looking to build a successful career in marketing and management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pn29gq\" data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"766\">SRM University Online MBA Marketing Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"845\">To be eligible for admission, candidates must fulfill the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b7jp2a\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"944\">Must hold a <strong data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"882\">Bachelor\'s Degree</strong> from a recognized university or higher education institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t32c07\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1059\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"997\">50% aggregate marks in graduation</strong> is required for candidates belonging to the General category.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hrtuu1\" data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1177\">Candidates from <strong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1098\">SC/ST categories</strong> must have secured at least <strong data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1149\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in their qualifying degree.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"btbovk\" data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1313\">Applicants from any academic discipline can apply, provided they meet the minimum percentage requirement specified by the university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4b3sy\" data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1370\">Who Can Apply for the Online MBA Marketing Program?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1431\">The SRM University Online MBA in Marketing is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1851\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hm4bax\" data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1509\">Graduates seeking specialized knowledge in marketing and brand management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1le01ov\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1583\">Working professionals aiming for career advancement in marketing roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"va7anu\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1648\">Sales professionals looking to move into managerial positions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s1jwaw\" data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1734\">Entrepreneurs wanting to strengthen their marketing and business growth strategies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r8j7p8\" data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1851\">Professionals interested in digital marketing, customer relationship management, and business development careers.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"424\">Understanding the <strong data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"103\">Online MBA fees at SRM University</strong> is one of the most important factors for students planning to pursue a flexible and career-focused management degree. The university offers an affordable fee structure with multiple payment options, scholarship benefits, and fee waivers, making the program accessible to fresh graduates as well as working professionals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ebfvmk\" data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"469\">SRM University Online MBA Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"801\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"497\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"497\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"487\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"497\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"801\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"566\">\r\n<td data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"553\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Online MBA Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"566\">₹1,00,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"606\">\r\n<td data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"582\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"606\">₹27,500 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"652\">\r\n<td data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"625\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"652\">Included in Program Fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"700\">\r\n<td data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"666\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI Option</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"700\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Starting from ₹4,584 per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"747\">\r\n<td data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"730\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Payment Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"747\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5% Fee Waiver</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"801\">\r\n<td data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"783\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee Payment Benefit</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"801\">10% Fee Waiver</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"937\"><strong data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"812\">Note:</strong> The Online MBA fee includes examination charges, helping students avoid additional exam-related expenses during the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7ag56w\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"987\">Scholarship Benefits for Online MBA Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1119\">SRM University offers special scholarship opportunities to support deserving candidates and make higher education more affordable.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1144\" data-col-size=\"md\">Scholarship Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1159\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1227\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1208\" data-col-size=\"md\">Defence Personnel</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1227\" data-col-size=\"sm\">20% Scholarship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1260\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1241\" data-col-size=\"md\">SRM Alumni</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1260\">20% Scholarship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1305\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidates from Sikkim &amp; Northeast Region</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1324\">30% Scholarship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1479\">These scholarship benefits can significantly reduce the overall cost of pursuing an Online MBA and improve the return on investment (ROI) of the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ns1kwz\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1524\">Flexible Payment Options for Online MBA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1716\">One of the key advantages of the SRM University Online MBA program is its student-friendly payment structure. Learners can choose the payment option that best suits their financial planning:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"2056\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h4i8g9\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1772\"><strong data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1746\">Semester-Wise Payment:</strong> Pay ₹27,500 per semester.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xe4y33\" data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1838\"><strong data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1794\">Annual Payment:</strong> Receive a 5% fee waiver on yearly payments.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vwdvgs\" data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1933\"><strong data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1866\">Full Program Payment:</strong> Avail a 10% fee waiver by paying the complete program fee at once.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vu13ad\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2056\"><strong data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1963\">Zero-Cost EMI Facility:</strong> Monthly EMI starts from ₹4,584, allowing students to manage education expenses conveniently.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"577\">The <strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"100\">SRM University Online MBA in Marketing</strong> curriculum is strategically designed to develop strong business management expertise while building specialized knowledge in modern marketing, consumer behavior, digital marketing, brand management, customer relationship management, and sales strategy. The program combines core MBA subjects with industry-focused marketing specialization courses, helping learners develop the analytical, managerial, and leadership skills required in today\'s competitive business environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"988\">Through a structured four-semester format, students gain exposure to key areas such as finance, operations, human resources, business analytics, strategic management, and contemporary marketing practices. The curriculum emphasizes practical decision-making, market research, customer engagement, and digital business growth, making it highly relevant for aspiring marketing professionals and business leaders.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w1ir1f\" data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1046\">SRM University Online MBA Marketing Course Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"2246\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1059\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1074\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Key Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1092\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Learning Focus</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"2246\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1290\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Managerial Economics, Financial Accounting, Marketing Management, Production and Operations Management, Communication Skills for Managers</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1427\">Business fundamentals, managerial decision-making, accounting concepts, operations management, and professional communication skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1441\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1584\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Legal Aspects of Business, Business Analytics, Human Resource Management, Financial Management, Business Statistics and Quantitative Methods</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1698\">Data-driven decision-making, financial planning, HR management, business laws, and analytical problem-solving.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1960\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1712\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1842\">Research Methodology in Business, Strategic Management, Consumer Behaviour, Sales and Distribution Management, Brand Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1960\">Strategic thinking, market research, consumer psychology, sales channel management, and brand-building strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2246\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1974\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2113\">Entrepreneurship and Design Thinking, Project Work, Digital Marketing &amp; E-Commerce, Services Marketing, Customer Relationship Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2246\">Innovation, business development, digital marketing expertise, customer retention strategies, and real-world project application.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2251\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1usbcsk\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2299\">Semester-Wise Online MBA Marketing Syllabus</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13155fu\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2354\">Semester 1: Building a Strong Business Foundation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2671\">The first semester introduces students to the fundamental concepts of management and business operations. Learners develop an understanding of economic principles, financial reporting, operational efficiency, and marketing fundamentals while enhancing managerial communication skills essential for leadership roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2694\"><strong data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2694\">Subjects Covered:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2839\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o2fp2b\" data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2718\">Managerial Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hy7yn4\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2741\">Financial Accounting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wi7tun\" data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2764\">Marketing Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sgm26t\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2803\">Production and Operations Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"won8x\" data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2839\">Communication Skills for Managers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bl6o4w\" data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2906\">Semester 2: Analytics, Finance, and Organizational Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"3187\">The second semester focuses on developing analytical and managerial capabilities required in modern organizations. Students learn how businesses use data, finance, legal frameworks, and human resource strategies to drive sustainable growth and improve organizational performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3189\" data-end=\"3210\"><strong data-start=\"3189\" data-end=\"3210\">Subjects Covered:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3358\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uolesn\" data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3239\">Legal Aspects of Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v3fx4\" data-start=\"3240\" data-end=\"3260\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aogelq\" data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3288\">Human Resource Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r5tqwi\" data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3311\">Financial Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5elr41\" data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3358\">Business Statistics and Quantitative Methods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ii8myz\" data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3419\">Semester 3: Advanced Marketing and Strategic Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3719\">This semester introduces the marketing specialization and focuses on understanding customer behavior, brand development, and strategic business planning. Students learn how successful organizations position products, manage sales channels, and create strong brand identities in competitive markets.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3738\"><strong data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3738\">Core Subjects</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3797\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2on1\" data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3774\">Research Methodology in Business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kgcawj\" data-start=\"3775\" data-end=\"3797\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3836\"><strong data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3836\">Marketing Specialization Subjects</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3838\" data-end=\"3913\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zy1ixb\" data-start=\"3838\" data-end=\"3858\">Consumer Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1spw75u\" data-start=\"3859\" data-end=\"3894\">Sales and Distribution Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hm2h7k\" data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"3913\">Brand Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uxlvkf\" data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3976\">Semester 4: Digital Marketing and Customer-Centric Growth</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"4239\">The final semester prepares students for modern marketing challenges by focusing on digital transformation, entrepreneurship, customer engagement, and innovation. A project component allows learners to apply theoretical concepts to practical business scenarios.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4241\" data-end=\"4258\"><strong data-start=\"4241\" data-end=\"4258\">Core Subjects</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4313\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4a1v34\" data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4298\">Entrepreneurship and Design Thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"idsu1o\" data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4313\">Project Work</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4315\" data-end=\"4352\"><strong data-start=\"4315\" data-end=\"4352\">Marketing Specialization Subjects</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4354\" data-end=\"4442\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x3p5wl\" data-start=\"4354\" data-end=\"4386\">Digital Marketing &amp; E-Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bfny9u\" data-start=\"4387\" data-end=\"4407\">Services Marketing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b42yhn\" data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4442\">Customer Relationship Management</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 100000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(460, 83, 'bab4483e-6161-460f-be1a-3abfe5752de8', '36540279-0957-4cc4-b717-736dcb1f39f1', 75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 06:17:06', '2026-05-30 06:17:06', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"455\">The <strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"124\">Online MCA (Master of Computer Applications) at SRM University</strong> is designed for students who want to build advanced expertise in software development, programming, database management, web technologies, cloud computing, and modern IT systems. The program welcomes candidates from both computer science backgrounds and other academic disciplines who meet the prescribed eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"656\">The flexible eligibility structure allows graduates from various streams to pursue a career in the technology sector while gaining the technical and analytical skills required by today\'s IT industry.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15jz5gs\" data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"711\">SRM University Online MCA Eligibility Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"819\">Candidates applying for the Online MCA program must satisfy <strong data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"818\">one of the following eligibility criteria</strong>:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ssvspf\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"862\">Option 1: Computer Science Background</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"901\">Applicants are eligible if they have:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"1211\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q035a6\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"1033\">A <strong data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1003\">Bachelor\'s Degree in Computer Science Engineering (CSE), BCA, or an equivalent qualification</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aa0r6o\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1124\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1091\">50% aggregate marks or equivalent CGPA</strong> for General category candidates.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3dr80x\" data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1211\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1163\">45% aggregate marks</strong> for candidates belonging to the SC/ST category.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zhmwre\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1257\">Option 2: Non-Computer Science Graduates</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1330\">Candidates from other academic backgrounds can also apply if they have:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1644\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1db9jwg\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1383\">A recognized bachelor\'s degree in any discipline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1elkjgw\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1511\">Studied <strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1446\">Mathematics, Business Mathematics, or Statistics</strong> as a subject at either:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1511\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ji8sif\" data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1489\">10+2 level, or</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gz55ig\" data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1511\">Graduation level.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t9dxkd\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1644\">Candidates who do not meet the mathematics requirement may be required to complete <strong data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1615\">bridge courses</strong> as per SRM University norms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11bxusd\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1683\">Eligibility Highlights at a Glance</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"2202\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Criteria</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1723\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"2202\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1841\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1791\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1841\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bachelor\'s Degree from a recognized university</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1935\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1872\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer Science Applicants</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1935\" data-col-size=\"md\">BCA, B.Sc. Computer Science, B.E./B.Tech CSE, or equivalent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1976\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1961\" data-col-size=\"sm\">General Category Marks</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1976\" data-col-size=\"md\">Minimum 50%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2015\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2000\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SC/ST Category Marks</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2015\" data-col-size=\"md\">Minimum 45%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2122\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mathematics Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2122\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematics, Business Mathematics, or Statistics at 10+2 or Graduation Level</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2202\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2140\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bridge Courses</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2202\" data-col-size=\"md\">Applicable as per university norms for eligible candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ktpk01\" data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2251\">Who Should Apply for the Online MCA Program?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2296\">The SRM University Online MCA is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2652\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zbojzu\" data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2356\">BCA graduates seeking advanced technical specialization.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"feqfox\" data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2425\">Computer Science and IT graduates aiming for higher career growth.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0d7dd\" data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2502\">Science and commerce graduates with Mathematics or Statistics backgrounds.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nqea0q\" data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2578\">Working professionals planning to upgrade their technical qualifications.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vj59a7\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2652\">Individuals aspiring to enter the software development and IT industry.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"81xa3a\" data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2703\">Why Mathematics Is Important for MCA Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"3006\">Subjects such as programming, algorithms, data structures, databases, software engineering, and analytical problem-solving require a strong logical and mathematical foundation. Therefore, candidates with Mathematics, Business Mathematics, or Statistics are better prepared for advanced MCA coursework.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3164\">For applicants without sufficient mathematical exposure, bridge courses help build the foundational knowledge required to successfully complete the program.</p>', '<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"511\">The <strong data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"98\">Online MCA fee structure at SRM University</strong> is designed to make quality postgraduate computer application education affordable and accessible for students and working professionals. With flexible payment plans, zero-cost EMI options, scholarship opportunities, and examination fees included in the program cost, the university offers a cost-effective pathway to earn a recognized <strong data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"456\">Online MCA degree</strong> while balancing academic and professional commitments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"749\">Whether you are planning a career in software development, web technologies, cloud computing, database management, cybersecurity, or IT consulting, understanding the total program cost is an important step before applying for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"72covy\" data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"793\">SRM University Online MCA Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"1018\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"821\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"1018\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"881\">\r\n<td data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"868\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"881\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,00,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"921\">\r\n<td data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"897\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"921\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹25,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"967\">\r\n<td data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"940\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"967\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Included in Program Fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1018\">\r\n<td data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"984\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1018\">Starting from ₹4,167 per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1154\"><strong data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1029\">Note:</strong> The Online MCA fee includes examination charges, ensuring students do not have to pay separate exam fees during the program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qqnlhr\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1185\">Online MCA Payment Options</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1288\">SRM University offers multiple payment options to provide greater financial flexibility for learners.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1535\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1307\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1318\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1535\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1399\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1371\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-Wise Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1399\">Pay ₹25,000 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1421\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1438\">5% Fee Waiver</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1484\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1466\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1484\">10% Fee Waiver</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1535\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1501\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1535\">Starting from ₹4,167 per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1656\">Students can choose the payment mode that best suits their financial planning while pursuing their postgraduate degree.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1solsve\" data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1705\">Scholarship Benefits for Online MCA Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1819\">To support deserving learners, SRM University provides scholarship benefits for eligible categories of students.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"2027\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1855\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1855\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1844\" data-col-size=\"md\">Scholarship Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1855\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"2027\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1930\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1911\" data-col-size=\"md\">Defence Personnel</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1930\" data-col-size=\"sm\">20% Scholarship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1963\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1944\" data-col-size=\"md\">SRM Alumni</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1963\" data-col-size=\"sm\">20% Scholarship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2027\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2008\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidates from Sikkim &amp; Northeast Region</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2027\">30% Scholarship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2180\">These scholarships can significantly reduce the overall cost of the Online MCA program, making higher education more accessible to eligible candidates.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jo96ym\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2232\">What Is Included in the Online MCA Program Fee?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2327\">The Online MCA course fee covers several academic services and learning resources, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2611\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wzhktu\" data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2389\">Access to online learning materials and digital resources.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"squ7fc\" data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2419\">Live and recorded lectures.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ebtcs3\" data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2462\">Learning Management System (LMS) access.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rubjug\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2482\">Examination fees.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wt3ls0\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2523\">Academic support and student services.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13b396g\" data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2558\">Project and assessment guidance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n0xhgw\" data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2611\">Industry-oriented curriculum and learning modules.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"486\">The <strong data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"114\">Online MCA (Master of Computer Applications) at SRM University</strong> is designed to equip students with advanced knowledge in computer applications, software development, programming, database management, web technologies, networking, and emerging IT solutions. The curriculum follows a structured approach that helps learners build strong technical foundations while developing practical skills required for modern software and IT careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"910\">Through a combination of programming languages, web development technologies, data structures, software engineering, project management, and industry-focused projects, the program prepares students for high-demand roles in the technology sector. The Online MCA course is suitable for graduates seeking career growth in software development, application development, cloud computing, database management, and IT consulting.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bv2v39\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"957\">SRM University Online MCA Course Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1889\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1007\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1007\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"970\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"989\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Subjects Covered</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1007\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Focus</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1889\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1248\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1069\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1163\">Bridge Courses, Java Programming, Operating Systems, Database Technology, Computer Networks</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1248\">Computer fundamentals, programming, databases, networking, and system management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1468\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1262\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1385\">Python Programming, Advanced Data Structures &amp; Algorithms, Advanced Web Application Development, Optimization Techniques</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1468\">Advanced coding, algorithm design, web technologies, and software optimization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1688\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1482\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1596\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning, IT Infrastructure Management, Android Development/IoT, Mini Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1688\">Modern technologies, IT infrastructure, mobile applications, and practical project work.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1889\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1702\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1785\">MEAN Stack Development, Software Engineering &amp; Project Management, Major Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1889\">Full-stack development, software lifecycle management, and industry-oriented project implementation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1894\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cqcwyp\" data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1932\">Semester-Wise Online MCA Syllabus</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwyfxr\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1985\">Semester 1: Foundation of Computer Applications</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2235\">The first semester focuses on developing a strong understanding of programming, operating systems, database management, and computer networking. Students build the technical foundation required for advanced software development and IT applications.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2530\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2249\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2530\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2301\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2301\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basic Mathematics (Bridge Course)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2346\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2346\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fundamentals of Computer (Bridge Course)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2370\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2370\" data-col-size=\"md\">Programming in Java</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2391\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2391\" data-col-size=\"md\">Operating System</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2415\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2415\" data-col-size=\"md\">Database Technology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2437\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2437\" data-col-size=\"md\">Computer Networks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2473\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2473\" data-col-size=\"md\">Programming in Java &ndash; Practical</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2530\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2530\" data-col-size=\"md\">Operating System and Database Technology &ndash; Practical</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yd5hbw\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2589\">Semester 2: Advanced Programming and Web Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2801\">The second semester enhances programming proficiency and introduces students to advanced web application development, algorithms, and optimization techniques that form the backbone of modern software solutions.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"3072\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2815\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"3072\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2852\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2852\" data-col-size=\"md\">Python Programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2895\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2895\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced Data Structure and Algorithms</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2936\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2936\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced Web Application Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2964\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2964\" data-col-size=\"md\">Optimization Techniques</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3019\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3019\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced Data Structure and Algorithms &ndash; Practical</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3072\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3072\" data-col-size=\"md\">Advanced Web Application Development &ndash; Practical</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dyrgu4\" data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3129\">Semester 3: Emerging Technologies and IT Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3305\">In the third semester, students explore advanced computing concepts and practical technologies while gaining exposure to infrastructure management and project-based learning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3498\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3319\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3319\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3319\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3334\" data-end=\"3498\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3334\" data-end=\"3382\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3334\" data-end=\"3382\" data-col-size=\"md\">Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3415\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3415\" data-col-size=\"md\">IT Infrastructure Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3452\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3452\" data-col-size=\"md\">Android Applications Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3453\" data-end=\"3481\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3453\" data-end=\"3481\" data-col-size=\"md\">Internet of Things (IoT)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3498\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3498\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mini Project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j0flum\" data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3557\">Semester 4: Software Development and Industry Project</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3764\">The final semester focuses on full-stack application development, software engineering principles, project management, and real-world project execution to prepare students for professional IT environments.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3888\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3778\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3778\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3778\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3793\" data-end=\"3888\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3793\" data-end=\"3823\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3793\" data-end=\"3823\" data-col-size=\"md\">MEAN Stack Web Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"3871\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"3871\" data-col-size=\"md\">Software Engineering and Project Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3888\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3888\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project Work</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3890\" data-end=\"3893\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xxmg83\" data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"3956\">Key Skills Developed Through the SRM Online MCA Curriculum</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"4068\">The Online MCA syllabus helps students acquire industry-relevant technical and professional skills, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4070\" data-end=\"4477\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3hwff3\" data-start=\"4070\" data-end=\"4116\">Java Programming and Application Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hk9mzp\" data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4137\">Python Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91j18p\" data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4170\">Data Structures and Algorithms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wigi8h\" data-start=\"4171\" data-end=\"4207\">Database Management Systems (DBMS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kummaq\" data-start=\"4208\" data-end=\"4227\">Computer Networks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jpt43n\" data-start=\"4228\" data-end=\"4247\">Operating Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2m8n3p\" data-start=\"4248\" data-end=\"4274\">Advanced Web Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19a0xne\" data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4308\">Android Application Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wmp93a\" data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4335\">Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sd9q0u\" data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4358\">Software Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y7owrq\" data-start=\"4359\" data-end=\"4383\">Full Stack Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ln1uz2\" data-start=\"4384\" data-end=\"4404\">Project Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sjr5b5\" data-start=\"4405\" data-end=\"4435\">IT Infrastructure Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wqeel7\" data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4477\">Problem-Solving and Analytical Thinking</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 100000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(461, 83, 'bab4483e-6161-460f-be1a-3abfe5752de8', '36540279-0957-4cc4-b717-736dcb1f39f1', 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 06:24:47', '2026-05-30 06:24:47', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"494\">The <strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"128\">Online BBA (Bachelor of Business Administration) at SRM University</strong> is designed for students who want to build a strong foundation in business management, marketing, finance, entrepreneurship, human resource management, business analytics, and leadership. The program is suitable for learners who have completed their higher secondary education and are looking to pursue a flexible, industry-oriented undergraduate management degree.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"715\">With a curriculum aligned to modern business requirements, the Online BBA prepares students for careers in corporate management, startups, family businesses, banking, retail, consulting, and emerging digital industries.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1k349qa\" data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"770\">SRM University Online BBA Eligibility Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"865\">To apply for the Online BBA program, candidates must meet the following eligibility criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pyyvkd\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"1001\">Must have successfully completed the <strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"945\">Higher Secondary Examination (10+2)</strong> or an equivalent qualification from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l987sg\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1083\">Candidates from both <strong data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1060\">Academic and Vocational streams</strong> are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137fw0p\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1219\">Students from any stream, including Commerce, Science, Arts, Humanities, and Vocational Education, can seek admission to the program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11bxusd\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1258\">Eligibility Highlights at a Glance</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1553\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1286\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1286\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1271\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Criteria</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1286\" data-col-size=\"md\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1553\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1342\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1395\">Higher Secondary Examination (10+2) or Equivalent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1415\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Streams</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1450\">Academic and Vocational Streams</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1489\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1482\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Recognized Board Requirement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1489\">Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1523\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1506\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Level</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1523\">Undergraduate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1553\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1543\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mode of Learning</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1553\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15upuh6\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1599\">Who Can Apply for the Online BBA Program?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1632\">The Online BBA is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"2032\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ci64l7\" data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1697\">Students who have completed Class 12 from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12br8a8\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1766\">Students from Commerce, Science, Arts, and Humanities backgrounds.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u2i25e\" data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1824\">Vocational stream students seeking a management career.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pnkbaz\" data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1887\">Aspiring entrepreneurs planning to start their own business.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c9fol5\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1951\">Students looking for flexible higher education opportunities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tsk7y\" data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2032\">Learners interested in management, marketing, finance, and business analytics</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"457\">The <strong data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"98\">Online BBA fee structure at SRM University</strong> is designed to provide affordable access to high-quality undergraduate business education. With flexible payment plans, zero-cost EMI options, scholarship opportunities, and examination fees included in the program cost, the university enables students to pursue a career-focused <strong data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"431\">Online Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA)</strong> without financial burden.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"721\">Whether you are a Class 12 pass-out, an aspiring entrepreneur, or a student planning a career in management, marketing, finance, business analytics, human resources, or operations, understanding the total course fee is an important part of the admission process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18fdj2o\" data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"765\">SRM University Online BBA Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"991\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"793\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"793\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"783\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"793\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"991\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"854\">\r\n<td data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"841\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"854\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,17,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"894\">\r\n<td data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"870\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"894\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹19,500 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"940\">\r\n<td data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"913\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"940\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Included in Program Fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"991\">\r\n<td data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"957\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"991\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Starting from ₹3,250 per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1135\"><strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1002\">Note:</strong> The Online BBA fee includes examination charges, allowing students to avoid additional exam-related expenses throughout the program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"uc8jq9\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1166\">Online BBA Payment Options</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1275\">SRM University offers multiple payment modes to help students manage their education expenses conveniently.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1305\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1305\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1294\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1305\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1358\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-Wise Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1382\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹19,500 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1421\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1404\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1421\">5% Fee Waiver</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1467\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1449\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1467\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10% Fee Waiver</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1493\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero-Cost EMI Facility</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1527\">Starting from ₹3,250 per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1637\">Students can select the payment option that best aligns with their financial preferences and academic goals.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ag4f5w\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1686\">Scholarship Benefits for Online BBA Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1781\">To support deserving learners, SRM University offers scholarships across selected categories.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1989\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1817\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1817\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1806\" data-col-size=\"md\">Scholarship Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1817\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1989\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1892\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1873\" data-col-size=\"md\">Defence Personnel</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1892\">20% Scholarship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1925\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1906\" data-col-size=\"md\">SRM Alumni</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1925\" data-col-size=\"sm\">20% Scholarship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1989\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1970\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidates from Sikkim &amp; Northeast Region</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"1989\">30% Scholarship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2098\">These scholarship opportunities can significantly reduce the overall cost of pursuing an Online BBA degree.<br><br><br></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xq9mq8\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2150\">What Is Included in the Online BBA Program Fee?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2245\">The Online BBA course fee covers a range of academic and student support services, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2544\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dgnhi7\" data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2295\">Access to the Learning Management System (LMS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mcz01l\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2331\">Live and recorded online lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ppn5qb\" data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2380\">Digital learning resources and study materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lb1geu\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2399\">Examination fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gcrk5i\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2429\">Assignments and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j929n3\" data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2470\">Academic mentoring and student support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ceieu\" data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2504\">Project guidance and evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xi5bwt\" data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2544\">Industry-relevant curriculum delivery</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"606\">The <strong data-start=\"99\" data-end=\"182\">Online BBA in Business Analytics with Artificial Intelligence at SRM University</strong> is designed for students who want to build strong business management expertise while gaining in-demand analytical and AI-driven decision-making skills. The curriculum combines core business subjects such as management, accounting, finance, marketing, human resources, and entrepreneurship with specialized training in <strong data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"605\">Business Analytics, Artificial Intelligence, Data Visualization, Power BI, and E-Commerce Analytics</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"982\">This industry-focused program helps learners understand how modern organizations use data, analytics, and AI technologies to improve business performance, customer experiences, operational efficiency, and strategic decision-making. By the end of the program, students develop a blend of managerial, analytical, and technology skills that are highly valued across industries.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qu1tpt\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1056\">SRM University Online BBA Business Analytics with AI Course Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"2028\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1069\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1092\" data-col-size=\"md\">Major Learning Areas</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1101\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"2028\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1161\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1225\">Management Fundamentals, Accounting, Economics, Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1291\">Build a strong foundation in business and managerial concepts.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1444\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1305\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1375\">Organizational Behaviour, Cost Accounting, MIS, Business Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1444\">Develop analytical thinking and organizational management skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1584\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1458\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1519\">Finance, HRM, Marketing, Business Law, Operations Research</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1584\">Learn core business functions and decision-making techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1725\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1598\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1659\">Strategic Management, Consumer Behaviour, Entrepreneurship</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1725\">Understand business growth, leadership, and market strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1863\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1739\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1798\">Research Methods, Project Management, Quality Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1863\">Develop project execution and business research capabilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"2028\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1877\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 6</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1949\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Governance, Investment Analysis, Business Analytics with AI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"2028\">Gain expertise in data-driven business decision-making and AI applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2033\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"r1cxdp\" data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2073\">Semester-Wise Online BBA Curriculum</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"179c36t\" data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2126\">Semester 1: Business and Management Foundations</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2390\">The first semester introduces students to the fundamentals of business operations, management principles, accounting practices, economics, and professional communication skills. These subjects establish the foundation for future business and analytical learning.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2604\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2404\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2404\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2404\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2604\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2449\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2449\" data-col-size=\"md\">Professional Communication</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2478\" data-col-size=\"md\">Principles of Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2503\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2503\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Accounting</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2553\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2553\" data-col-size=\"md\">Basics of Production and Operation Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2578\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2578\" data-col-size=\"md\">Managerial Economics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2604\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2604\" data-col-size=\"md\">Environmental Science</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2630\"><strong data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2630\">Key Skills Developed</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2763\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hwvu7i\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2656\">Business Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lnr8lh\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2685\">Managerial Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2oi4r9\" data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2710\">Financial Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4sjy45\" data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2730\">Economic Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mn9ol7\" data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2763\">Business Operations Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2768\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kb1knt\" data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2836\">Semester 2: Organizational and Business Analytics Fundamentals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"3015\">The second semester focuses on understanding organizational dynamics, business information systems, cost management, and statistical techniques used in business decision-making.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3206\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3029\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3029\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3029\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3206\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3078\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3078\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Management and Cost Accounting</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3119\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3119\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Organizational Culture and Behaviour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3154\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3154\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Management Information Systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3179\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3179\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Environment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3206\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3206\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Statistics in Business</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3232\"><strong data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3232\">Key Skills Developed</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3358\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1udr63\" data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3255\">Business Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1010zjb\" data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3282\">Organizational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mqi20x\" data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3315\">Management Information Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5tdyk1\" data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3331\">Cost Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j9j1fn\" data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3358\">Business Problem Solving</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3363\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wo2mse\" data-start=\"3365\" data-end=\"3415\">Semester 3: Core Business Management Functions</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3560\">Students gain knowledge of essential business domains including finance, marketing, human resources, legal frameworks, and operations research.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3734\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3574\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3574\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3574\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3734\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3624\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3624\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operations Research in Business</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3649\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3649\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financial Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3679\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3679\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Human Resource Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3704\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3704\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3734\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3734\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Legal Aspects of Business</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3760\"><strong data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3760\">Key Skills Developed</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3762\" data-end=\"3879\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b7y73w\" data-start=\"3762\" data-end=\"3782\">Financial Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19xza5z\" data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3803\">Marketing Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e3zj5t\" data-start=\"3804\" data-end=\"3819\">HR Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1amy9lc\" data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3848\">Business Law Understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bmfv7j\" data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3879\">Quantitative Decision-Making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3884\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5mzx9a\" data-start=\"3886\" data-end=\"3943\">Semester 4: Leadership and Business Growth Strategies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"4103\">The fourth semester develops leadership abilities and entrepreneurial thinking while helping students understand consumer behavior and promotional strategies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4293\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4117\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4117\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4117\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4293\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4156\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4156\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4157\" data-end=\"4189\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4157\" data-end=\"4189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Basics of Consumer Behaviour</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4225\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4225\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advertising and Sales Promotion</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4226\" data-end=\"4260\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4226\" data-end=\"4260\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Leadership and Team Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4261\" data-end=\"4293\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4261\" data-end=\"4293\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entrepreneurship Development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4319\"><strong data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4319\">Key Skills Developed</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4321\" data-end=\"4445\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13djaxu\" data-start=\"4321\" data-end=\"4345\">Leadership Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oom1tp\" data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4366\">Strategic Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tdm8hv\" data-start=\"4367\" data-end=\"4386\">Consumer Insights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"21w4y3\" data-start=\"4387\" data-end=\"4412\">Entrepreneurship Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cgh2p7\" data-start=\"4413\" data-end=\"4445\">Sales and Promotion Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4447\" data-end=\"4450\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"l3z1bf\" data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4519\">Semester 5: Research, Quality Management, and Business Projects</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4521\" data-end=\"4661\">This semester emphasizes business research, project execution, and quality improvement practices that are essential in modern organizations.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4899\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4680\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4680\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4680\" data-col-size=\"md\">Core Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4699\" data-end=\"4899\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4699\" data-end=\"4735\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4699\" data-end=\"4735\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to Research Methods</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4758\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4758\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4787\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4787\" data-col-size=\"md\">Total Quality Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4788\" data-end=\"4852\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4788\" data-end=\"4852\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Institutions and Markets / Elective Specialization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4853\" data-end=\"4899\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4853\" data-end=\"4899\" data-col-size=\"md\">Brand Management / Elective Specialization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4901\" data-end=\"4925\"><strong data-start=\"4901\" data-end=\"4925\">Key Skills Developed</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4927\" data-end=\"5039\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a0cmgn\" data-start=\"4927\" data-end=\"4946\">Business Research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f9wutc\" data-start=\"4947\" data-end=\"4965\">Project Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uresk6\" data-start=\"4966\" data-end=\"4986\">Quality Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m476o1\" data-start=\"4987\" data-end=\"5019\">Financial Market Understanding</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tzdaps\" data-start=\"5020\" data-end=\"5039\">Brand Development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5041\" data-end=\"5044\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ru8j7u\" data-start=\"5046\" data-end=\"5124\">Semester 6: Business Analytics with Artificial Intelligence Specialization</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5126\" data-end=\"5396\">The final semester integrates business management knowledge with advanced analytics and AI-driven business applications. Students learn how organizations use data visualization, analytics platforms, and AI-powered insights to improve performance and customer engagement.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5416\">Core Subjects</h4>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5418\" data-end=\"5626\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5418\" data-end=\"5430\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5418\" data-end=\"5430\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5418\" data-end=\"5430\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5445\" data-end=\"5626\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5445\" data-end=\"5492\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5445\" data-end=\"5492\" data-col-size=\"md\">Ethics and Corporate Governance in Business</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5493\" data-end=\"5522\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5493\" data-end=\"5522\" data-col-size=\"md\">Small Business Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5523\" data-end=\"5582\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5523\" data-end=\"5582\" data-col-size=\"md\">Investment Analysis and Portfolio Management / Elective</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5583\" data-end=\"5614\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5583\" data-end=\"5614\" data-col-size=\"md\">Retail Marketing / Elective</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5615\" data-end=\"5626\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5615\" data-end=\"5626\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5628\" data-end=\"5674\">Business Analytics with AI Specialization</h4>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5676\" data-end=\"5818\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5676\" data-end=\"5703\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5676\" data-end=\"5703\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5676\" data-end=\"5703\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialization Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5731\" data-end=\"5818\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5731\" data-end=\"5767\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5731\" data-end=\"5767\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Visualization with Power BI</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5768\" data-end=\"5818\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5768\" data-end=\"5818\" data-col-size=\"md\">Analytics for E-commerce and Retail Operations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5844\"><strong data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5844\">Key Skills Developed</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5846\" data-end=\"6021\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v3fx4\" data-start=\"5846\" data-end=\"5866\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"haahij\" data-start=\"5867\" data-end=\"5899\">Power BI Dashboard Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gwptu\" data-start=\"5900\" data-end=\"5920\">Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sq867t\" data-start=\"5921\" data-end=\"5939\">Retail Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4j1ru3\" data-start=\"5940\" data-end=\"5962\">E-commerce Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xw2qnj\" data-start=\"5963\" data-end=\"5991\">AI-Based Business Insights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jzcen4\" data-start=\"5992\" data-end=\"6021\">Data-Driven Decision Making</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 117000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(462, 83, 'bab4483e-6161-460f-be1a-3abfe5752de8', '36540279-0957-4cc4-b717-736dcb1f39f1', 209, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 06:32:34', '2026-06-18 01:07:35', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"539\">The <strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"126\">Online BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications) at SRM University</strong> is designed for students who aspire to build successful careers in <strong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"349\">software development, programming, web development, cloud computing, data analytics, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, and information technology</strong>. The program provides a strong foundation in computer applications and modern digital technologies, making it an ideal choice for students seeking a technology-focused undergraduate degree.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"742\">The eligibility requirements are structured to allow students from diverse academic backgrounds to pursue computer education while ensuring they have the necessary foundation to succeed in the program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k0yog3\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"797\">SRM University Online BCA Eligibility Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"880\">To apply for the Online BCA program, candidates must meet the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"1236\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oklni5\" data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"981\">Must have successfully completed <strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"956\">10+2 or an equivalent qualification</strong> from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8cnz2j\" data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1057\">Candidates from the <strong data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1022\">Science stream</strong> are eligible for direct admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hnte0\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1127\">Students from <strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1097\">non-science streams</strong> can also apply for admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dbkeab\" data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1236\">Candidates from non-science backgrounds must complete a <strong data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1203\">bridge course</strong> as prescribed by the university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11bxusd\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1275\">Eligibility Highlights at a Glance</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1303\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1303\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1288\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Criteria</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1303\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Requirement</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1359\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1381\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10+2 or Equivalent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible Stream</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1418\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Science Stream</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1483\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1442\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Non-Science Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1483\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligible with Mandatory Bridge Course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1517\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1500\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Level</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1517\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Undergraduate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1537\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mode of Learning</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1547\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kvy8vu\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1598\">Can Non-Science Students Apply for Online BCA?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1759\">Yes. One of the major advantages of the SRM University Online BCA program is that students from non-science backgrounds are also eligible to pursue the course.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"2115\">To help such learners build the required technical foundation, the university mandates a <strong data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1867\">bridge course</strong> that introduces essential concepts related to mathematics, computing, and logical reasoning. This ensures that all students can effectively understand programming, databases, networking, and software development subjects covered in the curriculum.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o2ohwu\" data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2164\">Who Should Apply for the Online BCA Program?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2197\">The Online BCA is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2653\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xsyetx\" data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2256\">Students who have completed 10+2 in the Science stream.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qedsdh\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2368\">Students from Commerce, Arts, Humanities, or other non-science streams willing to complete the bridge course.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"292owv\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2440\">Learners interested in software development and computer programming.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19t33mq\" data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2501\">Students planning careers in the IT and technology sector.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kvnvih\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2564\">Individuals seeking flexible online undergraduate education.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q0q33z\" data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2653\">Aspiring professionals interested in emerging technologies and digital transformation.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"507\">The <strong data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"98\">Online BCA fee structure at SRM University</strong> is designed to provide affordable and flexible access to quality computer application education. With a comprehensive fee model that includes examination charges, scholarship opportunities, zero-cost EMI facilities, and fee waiver benefits, students can pursue a career-focused <strong data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"427\">Online Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</strong> without the financial burden often associated with traditional degree programs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"736\">The program is ideal for students aspiring to build careers in <strong data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"735\">software development, web development, cloud computing, data analytics, cybersecurity, artificial intelligence, database management, and information technology</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fobc6p\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"780\">SRM University Online BCA Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"798\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"808\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"869\">\r\n<td data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"856\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"869\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,17,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"909\">\r\n<td data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"885\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"909\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹19,500 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<td data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"928\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Examination Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"955\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Included in Program Fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n<td data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"972\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero-Cost EMI</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1006\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Starting from ₹3,250 per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1160\"><strong data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1017\">Note:</strong> The Online BCA program fee is inclusive of examination charges, ensuring there are no additional examination costs during the course duration.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"183hd8g\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1191\">Online BCA Payment Options</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1294\">SRM University offers flexible payment options to make higher education more accessible for students.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1546\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1313\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Option</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1324\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1546\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1401\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1377\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester-Wise Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1401\">₹19,500 per semester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1423\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Annual Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1440\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5% Fee Waiver</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1468\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Program Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1486\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10% Fee Waiver</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1546\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1512\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zero-Cost EMI Facility</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1546\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Starting from ₹3,250 per month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1652\">Students can choose the payment plan that best suits their financial requirements and educational goals.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qvwzb9\" data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1701\">Scholarship Benefits for Online BCA Students</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1798\">To support deserving candidates, SRM University provides scholarships under various categories.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"2006\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1834\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1834\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1823\" data-col-size=\"md\">Scholarship Category</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1834\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Benefit</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"2006\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1909\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1890\" data-col-size=\"md\">Defence Personnel</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1909\" data-col-size=\"sm\">20% Scholarship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1923\" data-col-size=\"md\">SRM Alumni</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1942\" data-col-size=\"sm\">20% Scholarship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"2006\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1987\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidates from Sikkim &amp; Northeast Region</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2006\" data-col-size=\"sm\">30% Scholarship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2130\">These scholarship opportunities can substantially reduce the overall cost of the Online BCA program for eligible students.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4v668h\" data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2182\">What Is Included in the Online BCA Program Fee?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2269\">The Online BCA fee covers a wide range of academic and learning resources, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2547\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yvfy2l\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2312\">Learning Management System (LMS) access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvh35a\" data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2347\">Live and recorded online classes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ojr8dn\" data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2398\">Digital study materials and e-learning resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lb1geu\" data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2417\">Examination fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gcrk5i\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2447\">Assignments and assessments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zed224\" data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2475\">Academic support services</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15ceieu\" data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2509\">Project guidance and evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u6g8ek\" data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2547\">Industry-oriented curriculum access</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<h2 data-section-id=\"1vsw50q\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"42\">Online BCA Curriculum at SRM University</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"484\">The <strong data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"116\">Online BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications) at SRM University</strong> is designed to provide students with a strong foundation in computer science, programming, software development, database management, cloud computing, data analytics, networking, and emerging technologies. The curriculum combines theoretical concepts with practical learning to help students develop the technical skills required for today\'s fast-growing IT industry.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"824\">Through a structured six-semester format, students learn programming languages, data structures, databases, operating systems, web technologies, cloud computing, software engineering, and analytics tools. The program prepares learners for careers in software development, web development, data analytics, cloud computing, and IT services.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v4zfgq\" data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"871\">SRM University Online BCA Course Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"1784\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"916\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"916\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"884\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"907\" data-col-size=\"md\">Major Learning Areas</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"916\" data-col-size=\"md\">Focus</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1784\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1118\">\r\n<td data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"976\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1055\" data-col-size=\"md\">Programming Fundamentals, Computer Science Basics, Data Science Introduction</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1118\" data-col-size=\"md\">Build a strong foundation in computing and problem-solving.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1260\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1132\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1198\" data-col-size=\"md\">Java Programming, Databases, Operating Systems, Cloud Computing</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1260\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop software development and system management skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1396\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1274\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1348\" data-col-size=\"md\">Python Programming, Artificial Intelligence Fundamentals, Data Analysis</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1396\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learn programming and analytical techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1515\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1410\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1462\" data-col-size=\"md\">Machine Learning, Data Visualization, Data Mining</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1515\" data-col-size=\"md\">Develop data-driven problem-solving capabilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1645\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1529\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1584\" data-col-size=\"md\">Web Technologies, Networking, Information Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1645\" data-col-size=\"md\">Gain practical knowledge of web and network technologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1784\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1659\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semester 6</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1718\" data-col-size=\"md\">Software Engineering, Big Data, Blockchain, Project Work</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1784\" data-col-size=\"md\">Apply technical skills to real-world software and IT projects.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1789\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nu68r2\" data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1827\">Semester-Wise Online BCA Syllabus</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9n4cjs\" data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1873\">Semester 1: Computer Science Foundations</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"2096\">The first semester introduces students to computer fundamentals, programming concepts, mathematical foundations, and communication skills. These subjects create the base required for advanced computer application studies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2313\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2110\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2110\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2110\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2313\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2155\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2155\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Communication</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2188\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2188\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Introduction to Data Science</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2224\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2224\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Programming for Problem Solving</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2250\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2250\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Computer Fundamentals</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2287\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2287\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discrete Mathematical Structures</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2313\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2313\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Environmental Science</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2337\"><strong data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2337\">Key Learning Areas</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2456\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ja7kan\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2358\">Programming Logic</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"brr7f\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2382\">Computer Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9bji7b\" data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2407\">Problem Solving Skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1icg6f9\" data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2429\">Data Science Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eemx8a\" data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2456\">Mathematical Foundations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2461\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1g1rxkn\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2516\">Semester 2: Programming and Database Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2657\">Students develop programming expertise while learning how operating systems, databases, and cloud technologies support modern applications.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2922\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2671\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2671\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2671\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2922\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2709\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2709\" data-col-size=\"md\">Programming in Java</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2744\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Structures and Algorithms</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2765\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2765\" data-col-size=\"md\">Database Systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2795\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2795\" data-col-size=\"md\">Operating System Concepts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2831\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2831\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to Cloud Computing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2879\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2879\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Structures and DBMS &ndash; Online Practical</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2922\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2922\" data-col-size=\"md\">Programming in Java &ndash; Online Practical</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2946\"><strong data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2946\">Key Learning Areas</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"3064\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xmyc5p\" data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2966\">Java Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cwk47c\" data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"2996\">Database Management Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hiab7h\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3027\">Cloud Computing Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"97psm6\" data-start=\"3028\" data-end=\"3045\">Data Structures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k8pixh\" data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3064\">Algorithm Design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3069\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x8s4yc\" data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3127\">Semester 3: Data Analytics and Emerging Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3296\">The third semester introduces students to Python programming, artificial intelligence fundamentals, and exploratory data analysis techniques used in modern businesses.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3534\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3310\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3310\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3310\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3534\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3347\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3347\" data-col-size=\"md\">Python Programming</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3348\" data-end=\"3377\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3348\" data-end=\"3377\" data-col-size=\"md\">Exploratory Data Analysis</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3421\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3421\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to Artificial Intelligence</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3443\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3443\" data-col-size=\"md\">Statistics with R</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3492\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3492\" data-col-size=\"md\">Exploratory Data Analysis &ndash; Online Practical</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3493\" data-end=\"3534\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3493\" data-end=\"3534\" data-col-size=\"md\">Python Programming &ndash; Online Practical</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3558\"><strong data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3558\">Key Learning Areas</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3675\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vovfkf\" data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3580\">Python Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"li7ex6\" data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3596\">Data Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1driq6q\" data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3629\">Artificial Intelligence Basics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jk6ywz\" data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3653\">Statistical Computing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"168a10w\" data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3675\">Analytical Thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3677\" data-end=\"3680\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c1ctuy\" data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3728\">Semester 4: Analytics and Machine Learning</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3860\">Students learn how organizations collect, process, analyze, and visualize data to make informed business and technology decisions.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"4116\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3874\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3874\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3874\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"4116\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3917\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3917\" data-col-size=\"md\">Programming for Analysis</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3940\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3940\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Visualization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3941\" data-end=\"3961\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3941\" data-end=\"3961\" data-col-size=\"md\">Machine Learning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"3996\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"3996\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Pre-processing Techniques</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4026\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4026\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Mining &amp; Warehousing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4074\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4074\" data-col-size=\"md\">Programming for Analysis &ndash; Online Practical</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4075\" data-end=\"4116\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4075\" data-end=\"4116\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Visualization &ndash; Online Practical</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4140\"><strong data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4140\">Key Learning Areas</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4142\" data-end=\"4244\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gwptu\" data-start=\"4142\" data-end=\"4162\">Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lfxxm2\" data-start=\"4163\" data-end=\"4190\">Machine Learning Concepts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d5jx0y\" data-start=\"4191\" data-end=\"4204\">Data Mining</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gjanaw\" data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4223\">Data Warehousing</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v3fx4\" data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4244\">Business Analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4249\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5zzdnm\" data-start=\"4251\" data-end=\"4298\">Semester 5: Networking and Web Technologies</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4431\">The fifth semester focuses on networking concepts, information management, web technologies, and practical application development.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4433\" data-end=\"4679\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4433\" data-end=\"4445\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4433\" data-end=\"4445\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4433\" data-end=\"4445\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4460\" data-end=\"4679\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4460\" data-end=\"4480\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4460\" data-end=\"4480\" data-col-size=\"md\">Web Technologies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4481\" data-end=\"4516\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4481\" data-end=\"4516\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Communication and Networks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4517\" data-end=\"4555\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4517\" data-end=\"4555\" data-col-size=\"md\">Information Storage and Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4584\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4584\" data-col-size=\"md\">Internet of Things (IoT)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4585\" data-end=\"4624\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4585\" data-end=\"4624\" data-col-size=\"md\">Web Technologies &ndash; Online Practical</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4625\" data-end=\"4679\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4625\" data-end=\"4679\" data-col-size=\"md\">Data Communication and Networks &ndash; Online Practical</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4703\"><strong data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4703\">Key Learning Areas</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4705\" data-end=\"4818\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ihirfv\" data-start=\"4705\" data-end=\"4722\">Web Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16l55td\" data-start=\"4723\" data-end=\"4744\">Computer Networking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ia7ut3\" data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4769\">Information Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wmp93a\" data-start=\"4770\" data-end=\"4796\">Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"swv494\" data-start=\"4797\" data-end=\"4818\">System Connectivity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4820\" data-end=\"4823\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ghx0h1\" data-start=\"4825\" data-end=\"4883\">Semester 6: Software Engineering and Industry Projects</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"5053\">The final semester emphasizes software development methodologies, emerging technologies, innovation, and project execution to prepare students for professional careers.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5055\" data-end=\"5210\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5055\" data-end=\"5067\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5055\" data-end=\"5067\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5055\" data-end=\"5067\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5082\" data-end=\"5210\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5082\" data-end=\"5117\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5082\" data-end=\"5117\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Innovation and Entrepreneurship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5118\" data-end=\"5142\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5118\" data-end=\"5142\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Software Engineering</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5165\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5165\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Big Data Analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5193\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5193\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Blockchain Technologies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5194\" data-end=\"5210\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5194\" data-end=\"5210\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project Work</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"5212\" data-end=\"5234\"><strong data-start=\"5212\" data-end=\"5234\">Key Learning Areas</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5236\" data-end=\"5343\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sd9q0u\" data-start=\"5236\" data-end=\"5258\">Software Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9fzate\" data-start=\"5259\" data-end=\"5279\">Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r4iy5m\" data-start=\"5280\" data-end=\"5303\">Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15qe4o9\" data-start=\"5304\" data-end=\"5322\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ln1uz2\" data-start=\"5323\" data-end=\"5343\">Project Management</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 117000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(463, 86, 'd9b0df4c-fec3-4a5b-844a-62a2eb8bd2c6', '390b2c01-666d-463d-ba81-e984c0590b9c', 207, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 06:57:58', '2026-05-30 06:57:58', '<h2>MBA Admission Process at Doon Business School</h2>\r\n<p>The MBA admission process at Doon Business School is designed to identify candidates with strong academic backgrounds, leadership potential, analytical thinking abilities, and managerial aptitude. The selection process follows a merit-based approach that evaluates applicants through academic performance, entrance examination scores, and personal assessment rounds.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 1: Submit the MBA Application Form</h3>\r\n<p>Candidates seeking admission to the MBA program must complete the online application form and provide their academic details, entrance examination scores, and supporting documents for evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 2: Appear for an Accepted Entrance Examination</h3>\r\n<p>Applicants must possess a valid score in any of the following management entrance examinations:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>CAT</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>CMAT</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>XAT</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>NMAT</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>GMAT</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>GRE</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>DBS Global University Entrance Examination</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Candidates without a national-level management entrance test score can appear for the DBS Global University Entrance Examination conducted by the university.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 3: Attend the Online Interview</h3>\r\n<p>Shortlisted candidates are invited for an online personal interview. This stage evaluates communication skills, business awareness, leadership potential, problem-solving ability, career goals, and overall suitability for management education.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 4: Complete the DBS Global University Entrance Examination</h3>\r\n<p>The DBS Global University Entrance Examination is conducted as an online writing test during the interview process. The assessment helps evaluate a candidate\'s analytical thinking, written communication skills, creativity, and managerial aptitude.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 5: Merit-Based Selection</h3>\r\n<p>Final admission is granted based on a composite merit score calculated using academic performance, entrance examination scores, and interview performance.</p>\r\n<h3>MBA Selection Weightage</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Selection Component</th>\r\n<th>Weightage</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Class XII &amp; Graduation Marks</td>\r\n<td>30%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>CAT/CMAT/XAT/NMAT/GMAT/GRE or DBS Global University Entrance Examination Score</td>\r\n<td>40%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Online Personal Interview</td>\r\n<td>30%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Admission Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p>Candidates who successfully meet the required merit criteria receive an admission offer from Doon Business School. To confirm their seat, applicants must complete document verification and pay the prescribed admission fee within the specified deadline.</p>\r\n<p>The MBA admission process at Doon Business School ensures a holistic evaluation of every applicant by considering academic excellence, management aptitude, communication skills, and leadership potential. This comprehensive selection methodology helps build a diverse and high-performing MBA cohort prepared for successful careers in business and management.</p>', 1, '<p>To be eligible for admission to this program at Doon Business School, candidates must have secured a minimum of 60% marks in their Graduation from a recognized university. Applicants are also required to appear for a recognized National Level Entrance Examination as prescribed by the institute.</p>\r\n<p>The final selection process is designed to assess a candidate\'s academic excellence, communication skills, analytical thinking, and overall management potential. Shortlisted candidates must participate in an Online Interview and a Writing Test conducted by Doon Business School.</p>\r\n<p>Admission is granted strictly on the basis of merit, which is calculated through a comprehensive evaluation of the candidate\'s academic and selection performance. The merit score is determined by considering the cumulative performance in Class X, Class XII, Graduation, Online Interview, and Writing Test.</p>\r\n<p>This holistic admission process ensures that students with strong academic backgrounds, leadership potential, critical thinking abilities, and professional aptitude are selected for the program. Candidates are advised to prepare thoroughly for the interview and writing assessment, as these components play a significant role in the final admission decision.</p>', '<h2>Doon Business School MBA Fees Structure 2026-28</h2>\r\n<p>The MBA program at Doon Business School is designed to provide industry-focused management education with global exposure, international immersion opportunities, professional certifications, and specialized career-oriented training. The fee structure varies according to the chosen MBA specialization and the additional value-added certifications or international programs included within the curriculum.</p>\r\n<h3>MBA Fee Structure 2026-28</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>MBA Specialization</th>\r\n<th>Total Academic Fee*</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>MBA HR, Marketing, Finance, Healthcare &amp; Pharma</td>\r\n<td>₹10,30,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>MBA Digital &amp; AI Transformation</td>\r\n<td>₹10,90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>MBA International Business</td>\r\n<td>₹10,90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>MBA Luxury &amp; Fashion Management (SDA Bocconi Collaboration)</td>\r\n<td>₹17,10,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>MBA Business Analytics (SAS Included)</td>\r\n<td>₹10,90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>MBA Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management</td>\r\n<td>₹10,90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>MBA Global Program</td>\r\n<td>₹17,10,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>MBA Agribusiness</td>\r\n<td>₹8,20,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>MBA Finance with NISM Academy Mumbai</td>\r\n<td>₹10,90,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>*Fee includes Admission Fee, Tuition Fee, and applicable Compulsory Value Added (CVA) components after scholarship adjustments wherever applicable.</p>\r\n<h3>What is Included in the MBA Program Fee?</h3>\r\n<p>Depending on the selected specialization, students may receive access to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>International Business Exposure Programs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Global Education Immersion Opportunities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>SAP Certification Training</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>SAS Analytics Certification</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>NISM Academy Mumbai Residential Training</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>SDA Bocconi International Learning Experience</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Industry-Oriented Skill Development Modules</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Corporate Workshops and Live Projects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Leadership Development Programs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Career Readiness and Placement Training</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>International Immersion Opportunities</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Global Learning Experience</th>\r\n<th>Charges</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>One Week International Tour (Singapore, Dubai, Malaysia, Hong Kong or Thailand)</td>\r\n<td>₹85,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Two-Month International Immersion with up to 12 Academic Credits</td>\r\n<td>₹6,80,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Europe Immersion Program (3-4 Weeks with Academic Credits)</td>\r\n<td>Included in Select Programs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>Certain MBA specializations include these international experiences as part of the program fee, while others offer them as optional add-on opportunities.</p>\r\n<h3>Additional Mandatory Charges</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Particulars</th>\r\n<th>Fees</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>University Examination Fee (Per Semester)</td>\r\n<td>₹5,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Uniform &amp; Business Suits (One Time)</td>\r\n<td>₹9,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Book Bank Fee (One Time)</td>\r\n<td>₹4,500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Alumni Registration Fee (One Time)</td>\r\n<td>₹5,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Day Boarding Fee (If Hostel Not Opted - First Year)</td>\r\n<td>₹25,000 Per Year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Optional Professional Certification Programs</h3>\r\n<p>Students can further enhance their MBA profile by choosing additional globally recognized certifications and industry immersion programs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>SAP Certification Program</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>SAS Certification Program</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>ISCEA Supply Chain Certification</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>IIM Rohtak Residential Strategy Program</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>NISM Academy Mumbai Investment Banking Program</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The fee for each optional certification program is ₹70,000.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
