er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(464, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 336, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 07:27:30', '2026-05-30 07:27:30', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"435\">Students seeking admission to the <strong data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"155\">Online B.Sc Psychology at OP Jindal University</strong> must fulfill the university\'s academic eligibility requirements. The program is designed for students who wish to build a strong foundation in psychology, mental health, human behavior, counseling, and behavioral sciences while studying through a flexible online learning format.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ie7e8\" data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"466\">Educational Qualification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"602\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"540\">OP Jindal University Online B.Sc Psychology program</strong>, candidates must meet the following eligibility requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"1023\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rpfgio\" data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"688\">Passed <strong data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"663\">Class 12 (10+2) or an equivalent qualification</strong> from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ul1u9l\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"773\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"727\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in Class 12 is required for direct admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gde5cx\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"878\">Students from any stream, including <strong data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"854\">Science, Commerce, and Humanities/Arts</strong>, are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xmc3x2\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"1023\">Candidates <strong data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"931\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> may also apply, subject to submission of qualifying documents as per university guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"str4c5\" data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1047\">Selection Criteria</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1212\">Applicants who have secured <strong data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1128\">less than 50% marks in Class 12 (or equivalent)</strong> can still become eligible for admission through alternative qualification pathways.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1282\">Such candidates must successfully complete any one of the following:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1595\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3xlayk\" data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1381\">Achieve a minimum <strong data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1363\">50% score in the JSAT (Jindal Scholastic Aptitude Test)</strong> conducted online.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"huizqo\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1486\">Submit a valid score from recognized international aptitude tests such as:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4r2m\" data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1466\">SAT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4fdq\" data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1474\">ACT</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jaz9kc\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1486\">LNAT-UK</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wjuqsx\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1595\">Successfully complete a designated <strong data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1561\">MOOC (Massive Open Online Course)</strong> approved by OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1761\">This flexible admission policy enables motivated students to pursue a psychology degree even if their Class 12 score falls below the standard eligibility benchmark.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ruzz5\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1799\">Documents Required for Admission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1898\">Applicants are generally required to submit the following documents during the admission process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"377nvn\" data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1936\">Class 10 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3y2t5t\" data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1973\">Class 12 Marksheet and Certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1132qkj\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2007\">Recent Passport-Size Photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199lc0c\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2019\">Signature</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y9m1jd\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2060\">Valid Government-Issued Identity Proof</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2127\">For international learners, any one of the following is required:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2186\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i82cgw\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2139\">Passport</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1torqqy\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2186\">Government-Issued National Identity Document</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"570\">Understanding the complete fee structure is an important step before applying for the <strong data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"209\">Online B.Sc Psychology program at OP Jindal University</strong>. The university follows a <strong data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"268\">trimester-wise payment model</strong>, allowing students to spread the program cost across multiple installments rather than paying the entire fee upfront. This flexible approach makes higher education more accessible for students and working professionals seeking a career in psychology, counseling, behavioral sciences, or mental health.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7n2st6\" data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"633\">OP Jindal University Online B.Sc Psychology Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"1139\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"672\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"672\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"651\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"660\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"672\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"1139\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"778\">\r\n<td data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"733\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"743\">₹36,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"778\">Upon acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"833\">\r\n<td data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"794\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"804\">₹32,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"833\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"881\">\r\n<td data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"849\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"859\">₹32,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"881\">By 31 January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"927\">\r\n<td data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"897\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"907\">₹50,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"927\">By 1 August 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"975\">\r\n<td data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"943\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"953\">₹50,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"975\">By 31 January 2028</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<td data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"991\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1001\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹50,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1021\">By 1 August 2028</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1069\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1037\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 6</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1047\">₹50,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1069\">By 31 January 2029</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1139\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1094\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1093\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1110\"><strong data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1109\">₹3,00,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1139\">As per trimester schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ls40wf\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1166\">Fee Payment Structure</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1462\">The <strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1223\">OP Jindal University Online B.Sc Psychology fee</strong> is divided across six installments after the initial registration payment. This trimester-based structure helps students manage educational expenses efficiently while continuing their academic journey without significant financial burden.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1487\">Key highlights include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1786\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qew66\" data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1532\">Flexible trimester-wise payment schedule.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vpvood\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1590\">No requirement to pay the complete program fee upfront.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3t6wm2\" data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1662\">Structured installment plan spread across the duration of the degree.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvf1rv\" data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1726\">Suitable for students seeking affordable payment flexibility.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19bdy7c\" data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1786\">Enables better financial planning throughout the program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cpyayw\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1824\">What Does the Program Fee Cover?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1894\">The Online B.Sc Psychology program fee generally supports access to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"2223\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ddmrc6\" data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1937\">Comprehensive online learning resources</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gj2rue\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1966\">Live and recorded lectures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ba7el\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2001\">Digital learning platform access</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qlyupd\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2046\">Psychology curriculum and academic content</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15blwlw\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2088\">Faculty mentorship and academic support</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18was48\" data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2140\">Research and project-based learning opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gyxt68\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2187\">Internship and practical learning components</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1emhes5\" data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2223\">Assessments and academic guidance</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"525\">he <strong data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"124\">Online B.Sc Psychology program at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to build a strong foundation in human behavior, mental processes, psychological assessment, counseling, research, and workplace psychology. The curriculum combines core psychology subjects, practical learning, internships, industry certifications, and specialization electives to prepare students for careers in mental health, counseling, HR, education, research, and behavioral sciences.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"833\">Unlike traditional psychology degrees that focus primarily on theory, this program emphasizes <strong data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"746\">applied psychology, research methodology, psychological testing, industry exposure, and real-world problem-solving skills</strong>, making graduates industry-ready for modern psychology and behavioral science careers.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"901\">Year 1: Building Foundations in Psychology and Human Behavior</h4>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"1761\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"949\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"949\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"915\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Trimester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"926\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"949\" data-col-size=\"lg\">What You Will Learn</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1761\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\n<td data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1009\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1008\">Trimester 1</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1083\">Introduction to Psychology, Developmental Psychology, Social Psychology</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1235\">Understand the fundamentals of psychology, human development across life stages, and how social environments influence behavior and decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1254\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1253\">Trimester 2</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1349\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Life Stress Management, Cognitive Psychology, Statistical Methods for Psychological Research</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1491\">Learn stress management techniques, memory and learning processes, and statistical tools used in psychological research and data analysis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1761\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1510\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1509\">Trimester 3</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1617\">Environmental Psychology, Psychology of Personality, Brain &amp; Behaviour, Introduction to Academic Writing</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1761\">Explore personality theories, brain-behavior relationships, environmental influences on mental health, and academic research writing skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1840\">Year 2: Developing Research, Assessment, and Practical Psychology Skills</h4>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"2594\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1854\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Trimester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1865\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1888\" data-col-size=\"lg\">What You Will Learn</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"2594\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"2174\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1948\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1947\">Trimester 4</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"2024\">Cross Cultural Psychology, Psychological Testing &amp; Assessment, Elective 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2174\">Study cultural influences on behavior and gain practical knowledge of psychological testing, assessment tools, and personality evaluation methods.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2392\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2193\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2192\">Trimester 5</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2260\">Abnormal Psychology, Positive Psychology, Elective 2, Elective 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2392\">Learn about psychological disorders, mental health conditions, emotional well-being, resilience, and positive human functioning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2594\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2411\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2410\">Trimester 6</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2479\">Research Methods, Elective 4, Elective 5, Internship/Term Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2594\">Develop research design and analytical skills while gaining practical exposure through projects or internships.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2663\">Year 3: Advanced Psychology Applications and Industry Exposure</h4>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"3444\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2711\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2711\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2677\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Trimester</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2688\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2711\" data-col-size=\"lg\">What You Will Learn</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"3444\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"3012\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2771\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2770\">Trimester 7</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2880\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Clinical &amp; Counselling Psychology, Industrial/Organizational Behaviour, Elective 6, Industry Certification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"3012\">Gain insights into counseling techniques, workplace behavior, employee psychology, leadership, and organizational effectiveness.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3242\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3031\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3030\">Trimester 8</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3113\">Forensic Psychology, Educational Psychology, Elective 7, Industry Certification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3242\">Explore criminal behavior analysis, legal psychology applications, learning psychology, and educational assessment practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3444\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3261\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3260\">Trimester 9</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3324\">Elective 8, Elective 9, Elective 10, Internship/Term Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3444\">Specialize in chosen psychology domains while completing practical projects and industry-based learning experiences.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76lgc\" data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3509\">Key Subjects Included in the Online B.Sc Psychology Program</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3595\">Some of the most sought-after psychology subjects covered in the curriculum include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"4002\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e771lc\" data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3625\">Introduction to Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x6xxw5\" data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3652\">Developmental Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n95ikw\" data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3672\">Social Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kl6c5l\" data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3695\">Cognitive Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14l8ela\" data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3723\">Psychology of Personality</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"119u1d8\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3745\">Brain and Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ndopsr\" data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3767\">Abnormal Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qwl6ps\" data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3789\">Positive Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qq605a\" data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3828\">Psychological Testing and Assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bwqpkt\" data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3847\">Research Methods</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ytfeku\" data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3885\">Clinical and Counselling Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wsrmmj\" data-start=\"3886\" data-end=\"3927\">Industrial and Organizational Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gngdf0\" data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"3952\">Educational Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"919av6\" data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"3974\">Forensic Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wvwzch\" data-start=\"3975\" data-end=\"4002\">Cross Cultural Psychology</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 300000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(465, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 337, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 07:37:38', '2026-06-17 00:33:23', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"514\">The <strong data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"135\">Online B.Sc Risk Management at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for ambitious students who want to build expertise in <strong data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"348\">risk management, finance, business analytics, enterprise risk management (ERM), compliance, governance, fintech, and strategic decision-making</strong>. The program is ideal for recent school graduates and early-career professionals seeking future-ready skills in one of the fastest-growing business domains globally.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ie7e8\" data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"545\">Educational Qualification</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"686\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"624\">OP Jindal University Online B.Sc Risk Management program</strong>, candidates must fulfill the following academic requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"1179\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tazsol\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"767\">Passed <strong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"742\">Class 12 (10+2) or equivalent examination</strong> from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"npdf6u\" data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"827\">Secured a minimum of <strong data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"826\">50% aggregate marks in Class 12</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ukww42\" data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1040\">Must have studied at least one of the following subjects in Class 12:\r\n<ul data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"1040\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rnalek\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"915\">Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tim97n\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"927\">Physics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13y29ne\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"952\">Business Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wt3kb1\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"967\">Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h8t22m\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"999\">Information Technology (IT)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzgj7b\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1040\">Management Information Systems (MIS)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2fjrax\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1179\">Students <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1091\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> may also apply, subject to meeting the final eligibility requirements during admission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pt7jnx\" data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1202\">Selection Process</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1389\">Admission to the B.Sc Risk Management program follows a multi-stage evaluation process designed to identify students with strong analytical, quantitative, and problem-solving abilities.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1425\">Step 1: Application Screening</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1522\">All submitted applications are reviewed based on academic performance and eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1575\">Step 2: Jindal Scholastic Aptitude Test (JSAT)</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1711\">Eligible applicants are required to appear for the <strong data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1670\">Jindal Scholastic Aptitude Test (JSAT)</strong> after the application screening process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1738\">The assessment evaluates:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1854\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kf75ih\" data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1763\">Quantitative aptitude</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vma3rj\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1783\">Logical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10v4scw\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1805\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"109ijwq\" data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1831\">Problem-solving ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1854\">Communication skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uq0v1c\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1883\">JSAT Exemption Criteria</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"2011\">Applicants may receive exemption from the JSAT requirement if they meet any of the following standardized test score criteria:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2055\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2055\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2029\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entrance Test</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2055\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Score Required</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2119\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2102\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SAT</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2119\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1100 or above</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2141\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2126\" data-col-size=\"sm\">ACT</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2141\">27 or above</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">UGAT</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2175\">60 Percentile or above</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2183\" data-col-size=\"sm\">CUET</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2209\" data-col-size=\"sm\">60 Percentile or above</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2311\">Candidates meeting these benchmarks can directly proceed to the next stage of the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l6x9q5\" data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2340\">Faculty Interview Round</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2444\">Shortlisted candidates are invited for an interaction with the faculty panel. This stage helps assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2599\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"93jvvh\" data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2466\">Academic readiness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h221mk\" data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2481\">Career goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vxrgnu\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2523\">Interest in risk management and finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1br49ft\" data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2561\">Communication and analytical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pbnzc\" data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2599\">Overall suitability for the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cejil7\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2626\">Final Admission Offer</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2836\">After successful completion of the screening process, aptitude assessment (where applicable), and faculty interview, selected candidates receive the <strong data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2835\">final admission offer letter from OP Jindal University</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1y3mt9q\" data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2896\">Who Should Apply for the B.Sc Risk Management Program?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2940\">This program is particularly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"3359\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"alb3i6\" data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"3003\">Students interested in finance and risk management careers.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bikk54\" data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3066\">Learners aspiring to work in banking and financial services.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17toa66\" data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3127\">Candidates interested in enterprise risk management (ERM).</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"198hay1\" data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3194\">Students seeking careers in compliance and corporate governance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"129yx7o\" data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3270\">Future professionals aiming to work in consulting and business analytics.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6h43uu\" data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3359\">Individuals interested in fintech, AI-driven finance, and data-driven decision-making.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"542\">The <strong data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"115\">B.Sc Risk Management at OP Jindal University</strong> offers students the opportunity to gain specialized knowledge in <strong data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"330\">enterprise risk management, financial risk analysis, corporate governance, compliance, fintech, business analytics, and strategic risk management</strong>. To make the program financially accessible, the university follows a structured installment-based fee payment model that allows students to spread the cost of their education across the duration of the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lb5k5i\" data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"603\">OP Jindal University B.Sc Risk Management Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"965\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"642\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"642\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"621\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"630\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"642\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"965\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"748\">\r\n<td data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"703\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"713\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"748\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Upon acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"803\">\r\n<td data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"764\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"774\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹65,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"803\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"848\">\r\n<td data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"819\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"829\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹65,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"848\" data-col-size=\"sm\">By 30 July 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<td data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"864\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"874\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹65,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"893\" data-col-size=\"sm\">By 30 July 2028</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"965\">\r\n<td data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"918\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"917\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"934\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"933\">₹2,20,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"965\" data-col-size=\"sm\">As per the payment schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k8mzb3\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"991\">Fee Payment Schedule</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1178\">The university follows a phased payment structure that enables students to manage their educational investment efficiently without the burden of paying the complete program fee at once.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1203\">Key highlights include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iov8et\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1247\">Flexible installment-based payment plan.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s5e2kk\" data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1306\">Affordable fee distribution across the program duration.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vi9gpm\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1349\">Simple and transparent payment schedule.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"akrh35\" data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1404\">Easier financial planning for students and families.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"etcfcw\" data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1486\">Access to a globally relevant risk management curriculum at a competitive cost.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f2gcyl\" data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1528\">What Is Included in the Program Fee?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1639\">The B.Sc Risk Management fee generally supports access to various academic and learning resources, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"2000\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g51qpe\" data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1683\">Comprehensive digital learning materials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ao9ew\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1727\">Expert faculty instruction and mentorship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fppf85\" data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1760\">Industry-integrated curriculum</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zkuomf\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1809\">Risk management and finance-focused coursework</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1682bg5\" data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1845\">IRM-supported learning components</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ugriac\" data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1904\">Business analytics and technology-based learning modules</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xxg3xl\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1960\">Project-based and experiential learning opportunities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11l3aem\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2000\">Academic support and student services</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"717\">The <strong data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"126\">Online B.Sc Risk Management at OP Jindal University</strong> is a future-focused undergraduate program designed for students who want to build expertise in <strong data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"377\">enterprise risk management, financial risk analysis, business strategy, fintech, corporate governance, AI-driven decision-making, and risk intelligence</strong>. Developed in collaboration with the <strong data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"457\">Institute of Risk Management (IRM), UK</strong>, the curriculum combines business fundamentals, finance, technology, and global risk management practices to prepare students for high-growth careers in banking, consulting, insurance, financial services, compliance, governance, and corporate risk management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"1048\">Unlike conventional commerce or management degrees, this program integrates <strong data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"961\">Enterprise Risk Management (ERM), financial analytics, artificial intelligence, fintech, blockchain, strategic risk assessment, and industry-led IRM masterclasses</strong>, ensuring graduates develop both technical and practical risk management capabilities.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kvjtei\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1120\">Year 1: Building Business, Finance, and Risk Management Foundations</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1364\">During the first year, students develop a strong understanding of economics, management, accounting, financial mathematics, business analytics, and emerging financial technologies while being introduced to the fundamentals of risk management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rk\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1381\">Trimester 1</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"2045\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1392\" data-col-size=\"md\">Course</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1402\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1423\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"2045\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1594\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1505\" data-col-size=\"md\">Microscopes and Markets: Parallel Histories</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1509\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1594\">Understand the evolution of economies, markets, innovation, and business systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1621\" data-col-size=\"md\">Principles of Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1625\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1711\">Learn microeconomics and macroeconomics concepts used in business decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1736\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Mathematics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1740\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1814\">Build quantitative skills for finance, investments, and risk analysis.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1937\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1854\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fundamental Principles of Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1858\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1937\">Understand management functions, leadership, and organizational operations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2045\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1961\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1965\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2045\">Learn accounting principles, financial reporting, and business transactions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rn\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2062\">Trimester 2</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2747\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2104\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2104\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2073\" data-col-size=\"md\">Course</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2083\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2104\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2747\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2266\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2184\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Statistics and Decision Sciences</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2188\">6</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2266\">Apply statistical techniques for business forecasting and decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2392\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2314\" data-col-size=\"md\">Workplace Dynamics and Professional Presence</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2318\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2392\">Develop professional communication and workplace effectiveness skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2534\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2449\" data-col-size=\"md\">Critical Thinking, Self Reflection, and Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2453\">6</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2534\">Strengthen analytical thinking, communication, and problem-solving abilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2555\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Finance</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2559\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2626\" data-col-size=\"md\">Understand corporate financial planning and capital management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2747\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2671\" data-col-size=\"md\">FinTech, Blockchain, and Digital Currency</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2675\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2747\">Explore emerging technologies transforming modern financial systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rm\" data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2764\">Trimester 3</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"3412\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2806\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2806\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2775\" data-col-size=\"md\">Course</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2785\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2806\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"3412\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2944\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2875\" data-col-size=\"md\">Tableau for Data Visualisation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2879\" data-col-size=\"sm\">6</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2944\">Learn data visualization and business intelligence reporting.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2971\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Law and Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2975\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3051\">Understand legal frameworks, compliance, and ethical business practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3173\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3108\" data-col-size=\"md\">Environment, Sustainability, and Governance Practices</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3112\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3173\">Study ESG principles and sustainable business strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3297\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3231\" data-col-size=\"md\">Introduction to Risk Management and IRM Master Classes</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3235\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3297\">Gain foundational knowledge of enterprise risk management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3412\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3350\" data-col-size=\"md\">ERM Process, ERM Standards and IRM Master Classes</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3354\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3412\">Learn global risk management frameworks and standards.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3442\"><strong data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3442\">Year 1 Total Credits: 64</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3447\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xdclko\" data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3508\">Year 2: Advanced Risk Management and Financial Analytics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3721\">The second year focuses on applying risk management concepts to real business environments through financial analysis, artificial intelligence, strategic planning, project management, and global risk assessment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rp\" data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3738\">Trimester 4</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"4347\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3780\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3780\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3759\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3780\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"4347\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3924\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3853\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Python for Financial Data Analysis</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3853\" data-end=\"3857\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3924\">Use Python for financial modelling, analytics, and forecasting.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"4039\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3955\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AI for Finance and Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"3959\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"4039\">Explore artificial intelligence applications in finance and risk management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4144\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4069\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Corporate Finance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4073\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4144\">Study complex corporate financial strategies and valuation methods.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4249\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4176\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Risk Management &amp; Assessment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4180\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4180\" data-end=\"4249\">Learn risk identification, evaluation, and mitigation techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4250\" data-end=\"4347\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4250\" data-end=\"4273\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Marketing Simulation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4273\" data-end=\"4277\">6</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4277\" data-end=\"4347\">Apply business strategies through real-world simulation exercises.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0ro\" data-start=\"4349\" data-end=\"4364\">Trimester 5</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4977\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4406\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4406\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4375\" data-col-size=\"md\">Course</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4375\" data-end=\"4385\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4385\" data-end=\"4406\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4442\" data-end=\"4977\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4442\" data-end=\"4544\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4442\" data-end=\"4478\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fundamentals of Financial Markets</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4478\" data-end=\"4482\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4544\">Understand global financial systems and market operations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4659\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4586\" data-col-size=\"md\">Managing Global and Geopolitical Risks</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4586\" data-end=\"4590\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4590\" data-end=\"4659\">Analyze international business risks and geopolitical challenges.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4660\" data-end=\"4780\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4660\" data-end=\"4708\" data-col-size=\"md\">Credit, Market, and Liquidity Risk Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4708\" data-end=\"4712\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4780\">Learn risk assessment techniques used by financial institutions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4781\" data-end=\"4854\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4781\" data-end=\"4794\" data-col-size=\"md\">Elective 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4794\" data-end=\"4798\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4798\" data-end=\"4854\">Develop expertise in a specialized area of interest.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4977\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4903\" data-col-size=\"md\">Risk Appetite, Culture &amp; Resilience (IRM Led)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4903\" data-end=\"4907\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4907\" data-end=\"4977\">Understand organizational resilience and risk culture development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rr\" data-start=\"4979\" data-end=\"4994\">Trimester 6</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5571\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5036\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5036\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5005\" data-col-size=\"md\">Course</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5005\" data-end=\"5015\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5015\" data-end=\"5036\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5072\" data-end=\"5571\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5072\" data-end=\"5175\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5072\" data-end=\"5104\" data-col-size=\"md\">Risk Management and Modelling</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5104\" data-end=\"5108\">6</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5175\">Apply quantitative models for risk measurement and forecasting.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5176\" data-end=\"5280\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5176\" data-end=\"5223\" data-col-size=\"md\">Organizational and Strategic Risk Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5223\" data-end=\"5227\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5227\" data-end=\"5280\">Study enterprise-wide risk management strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5281\" data-end=\"5387\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5281\" data-end=\"5315\" data-col-size=\"md\">Project Management and Planning</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5315\" data-end=\"5319\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5319\" data-end=\"5387\">Learn project execution, monitoring, and risk control practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5388\" data-end=\"5448\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5388\" data-end=\"5401\" data-col-size=\"md\">Elective 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5401\" data-end=\"5405\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5405\" data-end=\"5448\" data-col-size=\"md\">Gain advanced specialization knowledge.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5449\" data-end=\"5571\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5449\" data-end=\"5498\" data-col-size=\"md\">Brand &amp; Reputational Risk Management (IRM Led)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5498\" data-end=\"5502\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5502\" data-end=\"5571\">Understand brand protection and reputation management strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"5573\" data-end=\"5601\"><strong data-start=\"5573\" data-end=\"5601\">Year 2 Total Credits: 60</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5603\" data-end=\"5606\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tny17a\" data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5675\">Year 3: Investment Strategy, Risk Hedging, and Industry Exposure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5677\" data-end=\"5828\">The final year emphasizes advanced investment management, risk hedging strategies, electives, industry engagement, and practical internship experience.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rq\" data-start=\"5830\" data-end=\"5845\">Trimester 7</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5847\" data-end=\"6359\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5847\" data-end=\"5887\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5847\" data-end=\"5887\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5847\" data-end=\"5856\" data-col-size=\"md\">Course</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5856\" data-end=\"5866\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5866\" data-end=\"5887\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5923\" data-end=\"6359\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5923\" data-end=\"6064\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5923\" data-end=\"5970\" data-col-size=\"md\">Investment Analysis and Portfolio Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"5970\" data-end=\"5974\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5974\" data-end=\"6064\">Learn portfolio construction, investment evaluation, and wealth management principles.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6065\" data-end=\"6193\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6065\" data-end=\"6117\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Derivatives and Risk Hedging Strategies</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6117\" data-end=\"6121\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6121\" data-end=\"6193\">Study derivatives, futures, options, and risk mitigation techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6194\" data-end=\"6243\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6194\" data-end=\"6207\" data-col-size=\"md\">Elective 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6207\" data-end=\"6211\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6211\" data-end=\"6243\">Specialized domain learning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6244\" data-end=\"6305\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6244\" data-end=\"6257\" data-col-size=\"md\">Elective 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6257\" data-end=\"6261\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6261\" data-end=\"6305\">Advanced professional skill development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6306\" data-end=\"6359\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6306\" data-end=\"6319\" data-col-size=\"md\">Elective 5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6319\" data-end=\"6323\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6323\" data-end=\"6359\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industry-focused specialization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rt\" data-start=\"6361\" data-end=\"6376\">Trimester 8</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"6378\" data-end=\"6801\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"6378\" data-end=\"6418\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6378\" data-end=\"6418\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6378\" data-end=\"6387\" data-col-size=\"md\">Course</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6387\" data-end=\"6397\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6397\" data-end=\"6418\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"6454\" data-end=\"6801\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6454\" data-end=\"6513\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6454\" data-end=\"6467\" data-col-size=\"md\">Elective 6</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6467\" data-end=\"6471\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6471\" data-end=\"6513\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized industry-focused learning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6514\" data-end=\"6573\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6514\" data-end=\"6527\" data-col-size=\"md\">Elective 7</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6527\" data-end=\"6531\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6531\" data-end=\"6573\">Advanced domain expertise development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6574\" data-end=\"6706\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6574\" data-end=\"6637\" data-col-size=\"md\">Horizon Scanning, Scenario Planning and Simulation (IRM Led)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6637\" data-end=\"6641\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6641\" data-end=\"6706\">Learn strategic forecasting and scenario planning techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6707\" data-end=\"6801\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6707\" data-end=\"6734\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industry Visit (IRM Led)</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6734\" data-end=\"6738\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6738\" data-end=\"6801\">Gain practical industry exposure and professional insights.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rs\" data-start=\"6803\" data-end=\"6818\">Trimester 9</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"6820\" data-end=\"6998\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"6820\" data-end=\"6860\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6820\" data-end=\"6860\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6820\" data-end=\"6829\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6829\" data-end=\"6839\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Credits</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6839\" data-end=\"6860\" data-col-size=\"md\">Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"6896\" data-end=\"6998\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6896\" data-end=\"6998\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6896\" data-end=\"6909\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Internship</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6909\" data-end=\"6914\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6914\" data-end=\"6998\" data-col-size=\"md\">Apply classroom knowledge to real-world risk management and business challenges.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"7000\" data-end=\"7028\"><strong data-start=\"7000\" data-end=\"7028\">Year 3 Total Credits: 44</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7030\" data-end=\"7033\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vk83s5\" data-start=\"7035\" data-end=\"7106\">Key Skills Developed Through the Online B.Sc Risk Management Program</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7108\" data-end=\"7184\">Throughout the program, students build highly sought-after skills including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7186\" data-end=\"7669\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dgoh7a\" data-start=\"7186\" data-end=\"7220\">Enterprise Risk Management (ERM)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15i767k\" data-start=\"7221\" data-end=\"7246\">Financial Risk Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q13ubj\" data-start=\"7247\" data-end=\"7282\">Credit and Market Risk Assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s2r6wu\" data-start=\"7283\" data-end=\"7308\">Strategic Risk Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"139etv\" data-start=\"7309\" data-end=\"7346\">Corporate Governance and Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"txym3a\" data-start=\"7347\" data-end=\"7389\">Data Analytics and Business Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r1gpfx\" data-start=\"7390\" data-end=\"7422\">Python for Financial Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fqnu6s\" data-start=\"7423\" data-end=\"7459\">Artificial Intelligence in Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vv85r8\" data-start=\"7460\" data-end=\"7495\">ESG and Sustainability Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6aie17\" data-start=\"7496\" data-end=\"7533\">Investment and Portfolio Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fhpqus\" data-start=\"7534\" data-end=\"7560\">Business Decision-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"138q5m3\" data-start=\"7561\" data-end=\"7596\">Scenario Planning and Forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fbejp1\" data-start=\"7597\" data-end=\"7634\">FinTech and Blockchain Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vucrwk\" data-start=\"7635\" data-end=\"7669\">Crisis and Resilience Management</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5.0, '<p data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"420\">One of the strongest advantages of pursuing the <strong data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"178\">Online B.Sc Risk Management at OP Jindal University</strong> is its collaboration with the <strong data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"263\">Institute of Risk Management (IRM) India Affiliate</strong>, a globally recognized organization dedicated to advancing risk management education, professional certifications, and enterprise risk management practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"922\">As businesses increasingly face challenges related to financial uncertainty, cyber threats, regulatory compliance, operational disruptions, climate risks, and strategic decision-making, the demand for qualified risk management professionals continues to grow across industries. Through this industry partnership, students gain exposure to globally accepted risk management frameworks, industry best practices, and practical risk assessment methodologies that are highly valued by employers worldwide.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1eac9gr\" data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"953\">About IRM India Affiliate</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1278\">The <strong data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"997\">Institute of Risk Management (IRM)</strong> is headquartered in the <strong data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1040\">United Kingdom</strong> and was established in <strong data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1072\">1986</strong>. It is widely recognized as the world\'s leading professional body for <strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1179\">Enterprise Risk Management (ERM)</strong> education, certifications, and qualifications, with a presence across more than <strong data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1277\">140 countries</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1534\">The <strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1307\">IRM India Affiliate</strong> works closely with universities, academic institutions, corporate organizations, and industry leaders to promote risk intelligence, governance, compliance, and strategic risk management capabilities among future professionals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tk6nvc\" data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1587\">How This Industry Partnership Benefits Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1786\">Students enrolled in the <strong data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1674\">OP Jindal University Online B.Sc Risk Management program</strong> benefit from a curriculum that aligns with global industry expectations and emerging risk management practices.</p>', NULL, '[\"1\"]', 220000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(466, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 338, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 00:17:19', '2026-06-01 00:17:19', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"554\">Students seeking admission to the <strong data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"211\">OP Jindal University B.Com (Hons.) International Accounting and Finance</strong> program must meet the prescribed academic requirements. The eligibility criteria are designed to ensure that applicants possess a strong foundation in commerce, mathematics, economics, and analytical thinking, which are essential for success in accounting, finance, investment management, financial analysis, and related business disciplines.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8q0mfd\" data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"631\">Eligibility Requirements for B.Com International Accounting and Finance</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"235k6e\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"739\">Candidates must have successfully passed <strong data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"714\">Class 12 or equivalent examination</strong> from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hs84ei\" data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"871\">Students <strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"790\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> are also eligible to apply, subject to meeting the final admission requirements.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wr8a3q\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"935\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"922\">50% aggregate marks in Class 12</strong> is required.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l8dctr\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"1091\">Applicants must have studied at least one of the following subjects:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rnalek\" data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1022\">Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13y29ne\" data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1047\">Business Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wt3kb1\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1062\">Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c1jzmc\" data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1076\">Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nlcqeh\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1091\">Accounting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cntv75\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1218\">Students from recognized boards, including <strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1145\">NIOS</strong>, are eligible to apply if they satisfy the prescribed academic criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"683\">The <strong data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"165\">OP Jindal University B.Com (Hons.) International Accounting and Finance</strong> program offers a future-focused commerce education designed for students aiming to build careers in <strong data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"407\">accounting, corporate finance, investment banking, financial analysis, auditing, taxation, risk management, and global financial services</strong>. With a curriculum that combines traditional commerce knowledge with emerging areas such as <strong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"586\">FinTech, Financial Analytics, AI in Finance, Blockchain, and Investment Management</strong>, the program provides strong academic and professional value for aspiring finance professionals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ge1nsw\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"745\">B.Com International Accounting and Finance Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"1081\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"763\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"772\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"784\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"1081\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"890\">\r\n<td data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"845\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"855\">₹25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"890\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"945\">\r\n<td data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"906\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"916\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹65,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"945\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"990\">\r\n<td data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"971\">₹65,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"990\">By 30 July 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1035\">\r\n<td data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1006\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1016\">₹65,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1035\">By 30 July 2028</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1081\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1060\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1059\">Total Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1076\"><strong data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1075\">₹2,20,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1081\">&mdash;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qy184j\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1101\">Fee Highlights</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1347\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1128\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1128\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1117\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1128\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1347\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1173\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Program Duration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1184\">3 Years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1205\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1218\">₹2,20,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1252\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1241\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Average Annual Cost</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1252\">₹73,333</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1293\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1280\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexible Instalment Plan</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1293\">Available</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1347\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1312\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Format</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1347\">Full-Time Undergraduate Program</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"679\">The <strong data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"177\">OP Jindal University B.Com (Hons.) International Accounting and Finance</strong> program is designed for students who want to build expertise in <strong data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"404\">accounting, finance, investment analysis, corporate finance, taxation, auditing, fintech, financial technology, risk management, and global business practices</strong>. The curriculum combines strong business fundamentals with emerging technologies such as <strong data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"603\">Artificial Intelligence (AI), Python for Finance, Blockchain, Financial Analytics, and Data Visualization</strong>, helping students develop industry-ready skills for modern finance careers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"953\">Unlike traditional commerce degrees, this program focuses on practical financial decision-making, international accounting standards, corporate governance, investment management, and real-world industry exposure through internships and experiential learning opportunities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"41gjmj\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1018\">B.Com International Accounting and Finance Course Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1065\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1065\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1027\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Year</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1040\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Focus Area</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1065\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Key Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1126\" data-col-size=\"sm\">First Year</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1160\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Commerce &amp; Business Foundations</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1282\">Accounting principles, economics, management, business law, finance fundamentals, statistics, and financial technology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1456\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1297\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Second Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1328\">Advanced Finance &amp; Analytics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1456\">Corporate finance, financial markets, taxation, AI in finance, banking technology, risk management, and strategic management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1470\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Third Year</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1507\">Investment &amp; Professional Practice</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1611\">Portfolio management, auditing, corporate law, advanced electives, and intensive industry internship</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1616\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1p8rlad\" data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1682\">First Year: Building Strong Commerce and Finance Fundamentals</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1961\">The first year introduces students to the foundations of accounting, finance, economics, management, and business analytics. Students gain a comprehensive understanding of how businesses operate while developing quantitative and analytical skills essential for finance careers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rk\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1978\">Trimester 1</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2586\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2013\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2013\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"1991\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2013\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2586\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2166\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2092\" data-col-size=\"md\">Microscopes &amp; Markets: Parallel Histories</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2166\">Understanding the evolution of science, innovation, and global markets</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2266\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2193\" data-col-size=\"md\">Principles of Economics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2266\">Microeconomics, macroeconomics, demand, supply, and market structures</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2382\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2291\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Mathematics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2382\">Business calculations, interest rates, financial modelling, and quantitative techniques</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2489\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2422\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fundamental Principles of Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2489\">Organizational structures, leadership, and management practices</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2586\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2513\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2586\" data-col-size=\"md\">Accounting concepts, financial statements, bookkeeping, and reporting</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rn\" data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2603\">Trimester 2</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"3213\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2638\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2638\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2616\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2638\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"3213\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2788\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2715\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Statistics &amp; Decision Sciences</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2788\">Data analysis, probability, forecasting, and business decision-making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2888\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2834\" data-col-size=\"md\">Workplace Dynamics &amp; Professional Presence</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2888\">Professional communication and workplace readiness</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2999\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2942\" data-col-size=\"md\">Critical Thinking, Self Reflection &amp; Communication</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2999\">Analytical thinking and business communication skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3087\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3020\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Finance</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3087\" data-col-size=\"md\">Capital budgeting, financing decisions, and corporate valuation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3213\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3129\" data-col-size=\"md\">FinTech, Blockchain &amp; Digital Currency</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3213\">Digital finance, cryptocurrency, blockchain applications, and fintech innovation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rm\" data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3230\">Trimester 3</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3760\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3265\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3265\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3243\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3265\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3760\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3392\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3333\" data-col-size=\"md\">Tableau for Data Visualisation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3392\">Business dashboards, reporting, and financial analytics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3470\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3417\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Law &amp; Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3470\">Commercial law, contracts, compliance, and ethics</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3576\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3524\" data-col-size=\"md\">Environment, Sustainability &amp; Governance Practices</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3576\">ESG reporting and responsible business practices</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3661\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3601\" data-col-size=\"md\">Management Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3661\">Cost analysis, budgeting, and managerial decision-making</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3760\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3695\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Reporting &amp; Analysis</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3760\">Financial statement interpretation and performance evaluation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3762\" data-end=\"3765\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1d3yk1e\" data-start=\"3767\" data-end=\"3841\">Second Year: Advanced Finance, Financial Analytics, and Risk Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"4119\">The second year strengthens financial expertise by introducing investment concepts, corporate finance strategies, taxation, banking technology, risk management, and AI-powered financial analysis. Students begin applying analytical tools to solve real-world financial problems.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rp\" data-start=\"4121\" data-end=\"4136\">Trimester 4</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4579\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4171\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4171\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4149\" data-end=\"4171\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4206\" data-end=\"4579\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4206\" data-end=\"4304\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4206\" data-end=\"4243\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Python for Financial Data Analysis</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4304\">Financial modelling, automation, and data-driven insights</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4305\" data-end=\"4396\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4305\" data-end=\"4333\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AI for Finance &amp; Business</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4396\">Artificial Intelligence applications in banking and finance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4487\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4428\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Banking Systems &amp; Technology</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4428\" data-end=\"4487\">Modern banking operations and digital banking platforms</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4488\" data-end=\"4533\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4488\" data-end=\"4501\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4501\" data-end=\"4533\">Specialized area of interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4534\" data-end=\"4579\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4534\" data-end=\"4547\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4547\" data-end=\"4579\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specialized area of interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0ro\" data-start=\"4581\" data-end=\"4596\">Trimester 5</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4953\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4631\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4631\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4609\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4609\" data-end=\"4631\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4953\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4754\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4702\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fundamentals of Financial Markets</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4702\" data-end=\"4754\">Equity, debt, derivatives, and market operations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4755\" data-end=\"4852\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4755\" data-end=\"4784\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced Corporate Finance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4784\" data-end=\"4852\">Business valuation, mergers, acquisitions, and capital structure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4853\" data-end=\"4907\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4853\" data-end=\"4864\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Taxation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4864\" data-end=\"4907\" data-col-size=\"md\">Direct and indirect taxation principles</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4908\" data-end=\"4953\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4908\" data-end=\"4921\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4921\" data-end=\"4953\">Specialized area of interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rr\" data-start=\"4955\" data-end=\"4970\">Trimester 6</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4972\" data-end=\"5369\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4972\" data-end=\"5005\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4972\" data-end=\"5005\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4972\" data-end=\"4983\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4983\" data-end=\"5005\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5040\" data-end=\"5369\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5040\" data-end=\"5147\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5040\" data-end=\"5070\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Risk Management &amp; Modelling</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5070\" data-end=\"5147\">Financial risk assessment, mitigation strategies, and quantitative models</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5148\" data-end=\"5237\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5148\" data-end=\"5171\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5171\" data-end=\"5237\">Corporate strategy, business growth, and competitive advantage</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5238\" data-end=\"5323\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5238\" data-end=\"5263\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Performance Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5263\" data-end=\"5323\">Performance measurement and organizational effectiveness</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5324\" data-end=\"5369\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5324\" data-end=\"5337\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5337\" data-end=\"5369\">Specialized area of interest</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5371\" data-end=\"5374\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vcb0rn\" data-start=\"5376\" data-end=\"5447\">Third Year: Investment Management, Auditing, and Industry Experience</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5449\" data-end=\"5733\">The final year focuses on advanced finance functions, portfolio management, auditing, corporate governance, and professional industry exposure. Students gain practical experience through a structured internship, helping bridge the gap between classroom learning and corporate careers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rq\" data-start=\"5735\" data-end=\"5750\">Trimester 7</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5752\" data-end=\"6144\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5752\" data-end=\"5785\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5752\" data-end=\"5785\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5752\" data-end=\"5763\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5763\" data-end=\"5785\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"6144\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5933\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5865\" data-col-size=\"md\">Investment Analysis &amp; Portfolio Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5865\" data-end=\"5933\">Security analysis, portfolio construction, and wealth management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5934\" data-end=\"6019\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5934\" data-end=\"5950\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Law</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5950\" data-end=\"6019\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate governance, legal compliance, and regulatory frameworks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6020\" data-end=\"6103\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6020\" data-end=\"6040\" data-col-size=\"md\">Audit &amp; Assurance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6040\" data-end=\"6103\">Auditing standards, risk assessment, and assurance services</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6104\" data-end=\"6144\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6104\" data-end=\"6117\" data-col-size=\"md\">Elective 5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6117\" data-end=\"6144\">Advanced specialization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rt\" data-start=\"6146\" data-end=\"6161\">Trimester 8</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"6163\" data-end=\"6353\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"6163\" data-end=\"6196\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6163\" data-end=\"6196\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6163\" data-end=\"6174\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subjects</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6174\" data-end=\"6196\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"6231\" data-end=\"6353\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6231\" data-end=\"6271\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6231\" data-end=\"6244\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 6</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6244\" data-end=\"6271\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced specialization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6272\" data-end=\"6312\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6272\" data-end=\"6285\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 7</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6285\" data-end=\"6312\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Advanced specialization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6313\" data-end=\"6353\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6313\" data-end=\"6326\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elective 8</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6326\" data-end=\"6353\">Advanced specialization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14ya0rs\" data-start=\"6355\" data-end=\"6370\">Trimester 9</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6554\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6395\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6395\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6384\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6384\" data-end=\"6395\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"6421\" data-end=\"6554\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6421\" data-end=\"6482\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6421\" data-end=\"6437\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Co-op Program</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6437\" data-end=\"6482\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industry-integrated experiential learning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6483\" data-end=\"6554\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6483\" data-end=\"6506\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Intensive Internship</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6506\" data-end=\"6554\">Four months of hands-on corporate experience</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 220000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(467, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 339, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 00:35:12', '2026-06-01 00:35:12', NULL, 1, '<h2>OP Jindal University M.A. in Teaching English to Speakers of Other Languages (TESOL) Eligibility Criteria 2026</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>OP Jindal University M.A. in Teaching English to Speakers of Other Languages (TESOL)</strong> program is designed for graduates, educators, language trainers, content developers, academic professionals, and working individuals who want to build advanced expertise in <strong>English Language Teaching (ELT), TESOL, Applied Linguistics, Curriculum Design, Language Assessment, and Digital Pedagogy</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>The program welcomes applicants from diverse academic backgrounds, making it an excellent choice for individuals seeking careers in English language education, teacher training, educational technology, corporate communication, and international language instruction.</p>\r\n<h3>M.A. TESOL Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<p>To apply for admission to the <strong>OP Jindal University M.A. TESOL</strong> program, candidates must fulfill the following eligibility criteria:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Applicants must hold a <strong>Bachelor\'s degree in any discipline</strong> from a recognized university or higher education institution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Candidates with <strong>relevant professional or teaching experience</strong> may also strengthen their application profile.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Indian applicants must provide a valid <strong>Government-Issued ID Proof</strong> during the admission process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>International applicants are required to submit a valid <strong>Passport</strong> as proof of identity and nationality.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Who Should Apply for the M.A. TESOL Program?</h3>\r\n<p>The program is suitable for candidates who are interested in:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>English Language Teaching (ELT)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Teaching English to Speakers of Other Languages (TESOL)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>ESL and EFL Teaching Careers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Academic and Language Research</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Curriculum Development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Educational Technology and Digital Learning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Teacher Training and Professional Development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Corporate Communication and Language Training</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>International Education and Language Programs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Graduates from Arts, Commerce, Science, Management, Humanities, Social Sciences, Education, and other academic disciplines can apply for this program.</p>\r\n<h2>OP Jindal University TESOL Selection Process</h2>\r\n<p>Admission to the M.A. TESOL program follows a profile-based evaluation process designed to assess a candidate\'s academic interests, communication abilities, professional goals, and commitment to language education.</p>\r\n<h3>Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h3>\r\n<p>As part of the selection process, applicants are required to submit a <strong>Statement of Purpose (SOP) of 500&ndash;1000 words</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>The SOP should clearly explain:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Motivation for pursuing M.A. TESOL</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Interest in English language teaching and education</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Academic and professional background</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Career goals and future aspirations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Reasons for choosing OP Jindal University</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Areas of interest within TESOL, Applied Linguistics, or Language Education</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>A well-structured SOP allows applicants to demonstrate their passion for teaching, language learning, educational innovation, and professional development.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<h2>OP Jindal University M.A. in Teaching English to Speakers of Other Languages (TESOL) Fees 2026</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>OP Jindal University M.A. in Teaching English to Speakers of Other Languages (TESOL)</strong> is a specialized postgraduate program designed for graduates and professionals seeking expertise in <strong>English Language Teaching (ELT), TESOL, Applied Linguistics, Digital Pedagogy, Curriculum Development, Language Assessment, and Educational Technology</strong>. With a curriculum that integrates modern teaching methodologies, multilingual education, AI-powered learning tools, and research-based pedagogy, the program prepares students for careers in both traditional and technology-enabled learning environments.</p>\r\n<p>For students evaluating the cost of higher education, understanding the complete fee structure is an important step in assessing the program\'s academic value, career potential, and long-term return on investment.</p>\r\n<h2>OP Jindal University M.A. TESOL Fee Structure 2026</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Fee Component</th>\r\n<th>Amount</th>\r\n<th>Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td>₹25,000</td>\r\n<td>Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td>₹1,25,000</td>\r\n<td>Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td>₹1,25,000</td>\r\n<td>By 15 January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Total Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>₹2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td>&mdash;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Fee Overview</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Particulars</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Course Name</td>\r\n<td>M.A. in Teaching English to Speakers of Other Languages (TESOL)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>University</td>\r\n<td>OP Jindal University</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Duration</td>\r\n<td>1 Year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td>₹2,75,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td>₹25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Option</td>\r\n<td>Instalment-Based Fee Plan Available</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Learning Focus</td>\r\n<td>TESOL, English Language Teaching, Applied Linguistics, Digital Pedagogy &amp; Educational Technology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2>What Does the M.A. TESOL Fee Include?</h2>\r\n<p>The fee supports a comprehensive postgraduate learning experience that combines language education theory with practical teaching skills. Students gain exposure to contemporary areas of English language teaching that are increasingly valued by schools, universities, language institutes, EdTech companies, and international education organizations.</p>\r\n<p>Key learning areas covered within the program include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Teaching English to Speakers of Other Languages (TESOL)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>English Language Teaching (ELT)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Applied Linguistics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Curriculum Design and Assessment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Bilingual and Multilingual Education</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>English for Specific Purposes (ESP)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Critical Pedagogy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Digital Pedagogy and Multimedia Learning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Artificial Intelligence in Education</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Corpus Linguistics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Academic Research and Scholarly Writing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Capstone Project and Applied Learning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>', 'Medium', '<h2>OP Jindal University M.A. in Teaching English to Speakers of Other Languages (TESOL) Syllabus &amp; Curriculum 2026</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Master of Arts (M.A.) in Teaching English to Speakers of Other Languages (TESOL)</strong> at <strong>OP Jindal University</strong> is a specialized postgraduate program designed for aspiring English language educators, language trainers, curriculum developers, teacher trainers, and academic professionals who want to build expertise in modern English language teaching methodologies.</p>\r\n<p>The curriculum combines the foundations of <strong>TESOL, Applied Linguistics, English Language Teaching (ELT), Multilingual Education, Digital Learning, AI-Powered Teaching Tools, Curriculum Design, Language Assessment, and Research-Based Pedagogy</strong>. Students develop both theoretical knowledge and practical teaching skills required to teach English effectively in multilingual and international learning environments.</p>\r\n<p>Unlike traditional English programs that focus primarily on literature, the M.A. TESOL program emphasizes <strong>language acquisition, classroom practice, educational technology, multilingual communication, and contemporary teaching strategies</strong>, making graduates highly relevant for the rapidly growing global English education sector.</p>\r\n<h3>M.A. TESOL Course Structure</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Trimester</th>\r\n<th>Academic Focus</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Trimester 1</td>\r\n<td>Foundations of TESOL, Language Teaching Methods, Curriculum Design, and Assessment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Trimester 2</td>\r\n<td>Linguistics, Critical Pedagogy, English for Specific Purposes, and Digital Learning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Trimester 3</td>\r\n<td>Literature-Based Language Teaching, Corpus Linguistics, and Research Project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2>Trimester 1: Building Foundations in English Language Teaching</h2>\r\n<p>The first trimester introduces students to the core principles of English language education, research writing, multilingual learning environments, and curriculum planning. Learners develop a strong understanding of how languages are taught, learned, and assessed across diverse educational settings.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Course</th>\r\n<th>Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Introduction to Critical Reading &amp; Research Writing</td>\r\n<td>Academic reading, scholarly writing, research skills, and critical analysis</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Approaches to Teaching English</td>\r\n<td>Traditional and contemporary English language teaching methodologies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Bilingual and Multilingual Classroom</td>\r\n<td>Strategies for teaching English in linguistically diverse classrooms</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Curriculum and Assessment in TESOL</td>\r\n<td>Course planning, learning outcomes, testing, and language assessment frameworks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Skills Developed in Trimester 1</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Academic Writing and Research Skills</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Language Teaching Methodologies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Curriculum Development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Classroom Communication</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Assessment Design</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Multilingual Education Strategies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2>Trimester 2: Advanced Language Teaching and Digital Pedagogy</h2>\r\n<p>The second trimester focuses on language structure, critical educational theories, specialized English instruction, and technology-enhanced learning. Students learn how modern educators use digital tools, multimedia resources, and Artificial Intelligence to improve language teaching outcomes.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Course</th>\r\n<th>Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Introduction to Linguistics</td>\r\n<td>Language structure, phonetics, syntax, semantics, and language systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Critical Pedagogy</td>\r\n<td>Inclusive teaching practices and learner-centered education</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>English for Specific Purposes (ESP)</td>\r\n<td>Teaching English for business, healthcare, academic, and professional contexts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Digital Pedagogy: Multimedia &amp; AI</td>\r\n<td>Technology-driven teaching, AI tools, multimedia learning resources, and online education</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3>Skills Developed in Trimester 2</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Applied Linguistics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Digital Teaching Strategies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>AI-Assisted Language Learning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Online Instruction Techniques</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Professional English Training</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Educational Technology Integration</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2>Trimester 3: Research, Language Analysis, and Professional Application</h2>\r\n<p>The final trimester helps students connect linguistic theory with classroom practice. Learners explore how literature can support language development while gaining expertise in language data analysis and research-based problem solving.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Course</th>\r\n<th>Learning Outcomes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Teaching English Language through Literature</td>\r\n<td>Using literary texts to improve language proficiency and communication skills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Corpus Linguistics</td>\r\n<td>Language analysis using real-world linguistic data and digital corpora</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Capstone Project</td>\r\n<td>Independent research project addressing contemporary TESOL challenges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>Why Choose OP Jindal University for M.A. TESOL?</h2>\r\n<p>The OP Jindal University M.A. TESOL program stands out by combining language teaching expertise with emerging educational technologies, multilingual education practices, and research-based learning. The inclusion of <strong>Digital Pedagogy, AI in Education, Corpus Linguistics, Critical Pedagogy, and English for Specific Purposes</strong> ensures that graduates are prepared for both traditional teaching careers and modern technology-enabled learning environments.</p>\r\n<p>For students aspiring to become highly skilled English language educators, curriculum specialists, academic researchers, or global communication professionals, the M.A. TESOL curriculum offers a comprehensive pathway to success in the evolving field of English language education.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
