er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(476, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 347, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 03:12:19', '2026-06-01 03:12:19', '<h2>OP Jindal University M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance Admission Process 2026</h2>\r\n<p>The admission process for the <strong>M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance</strong> at <strong>OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify aspiring education leaders, academic administrators, school managers, policy professionals, and educators who demonstrate the potential to contribute to the future of educational leadership and institutional governance. The process follows a holistic evaluation approach, focusing on academic qualifications, career aspirations, leadership potential, and commitment to advancing educational excellence.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 1: Complete the Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p>Applicants must submit the online application form through the university admission portal by providing accurate personal, academic, and professional details.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 2: Upload Required Documents</h3>\r\n<p>Candidates are required to upload the necessary documents for verification, including:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Bachelor\'s degree certificate and academic transcripts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Aadhaar Card for Indian applicants</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Passport for international applicants</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Recent passport-size photograph</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Any supporting academic or professional documents, if applicable</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Step 3: Submit the Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h3>\r\n<p>Applicants must submit a <strong>Statement of Purpose (300&ndash;500 Words)</strong> outlining:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Motivation for pursuing the program</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Relevant academic and professional experience</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Interest in educational leadership and governance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Career aspirations and future goals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>How the program aligns with their professional development plans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The SOP is an important component of the admission process and allows applicants to showcase their leadership vision and commitment to the education sector.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 4: Application and Profile Evaluation</h3>\r\n<p>The admissions committee conducts a comprehensive review of:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Academic qualifications</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Submitted documents</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Statement of Purpose</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Professional experience (if applicable)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Overall profile and leadership potential</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This holistic review helps identify candidates who can benefit from and contribute to the program.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 5: Admission Decision</h3>\r\n<p>Based on the profile assessment and SOP evaluation, eligible candidates are shortlisted and offered admission to the program.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 6: Receive and Accept the Offer Letter</h3>\r\n<p>Selected applicants receive an official admission offer from the university. Candidates must confirm their acceptance within the specified deadline.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 7: Pay the Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<p>To secure their seat in the program, candidates must complete the registration fee payment as outlined in the offer letter.</p>\r\n<h3>Step 8: Complete Enrollment Formalities</h3>\r\n<p>After successful fee payment and document verification, students complete the enrollment process and gain access to academic resources, orientation sessions, and program-related information.</p>\r\n<h2>Admission Process Overview</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th>Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Online Application</td>\r\n<td>Complete and submit the application form</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Document Upload</td>\r\n<td>Upload academic and identity documents</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>SOP Submission</td>\r\n<td>Submit Statement of Purpose</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Profile Evaluation</td>\r\n<td>Review of academic and professional profile</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admission Decision</td>\r\n<td>Selection based on holistic assessment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Offer Letter Acceptance</td>\r\n<td>Confirm admission offer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Registration Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td>Secure admission seat</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Final Enrollment</td>\r\n<td>Complete admission formalities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>The <strong>OP Jindal University M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance admission process</strong> is designed to ensure a transparent, student-centric, and merit-based selection experience while identifying future educational leaders who are committed to improving institutions, driving educational innovation, and shaping the future of learning.</p>', 1, '<h2>OP Jindal University M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance Eligibility Criteria 2026</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance</strong> at <strong>OP Jindal University</strong> is a specialized postgraduate program designed for aspiring school leaders, academic administrators, educators, policy professionals, EdTech practitioners, and education sector managers who want to develop expertise in <strong>educational leadership, school administration, education policy, academic governance, institutional management, quality assurance, and educational innovation</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>As educational institutions increasingly focus on leadership excellence, digital transformation, academic quality, and institutional effectiveness, there is growing demand for professionals who can successfully lead schools, universities, educational organizations, and learning ecosystems. This program prepares learners to address contemporary educational challenges through strategic leadership, governance, policy understanding, and organizational development.</p>\r\n<h2>Eligibility Criteria for M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance</h2>\r\n<p>Candidates seeking admission to the OP Jindal University M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance program must fulfill the following eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<h3>Academic Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Applicants must possess a <strong>minimum three-year Bachelor\'s degree</strong> in any specialization from a recognized university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Graduates from Arts, Commerce, Science, Education, Management, Engineering, Humanities, Social Sciences, Law, and other disciplines are eligible to apply.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>The program welcomes both fresh graduates and working professionals interested in educational leadership and institutional development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The interdisciplinary nature of educational leadership allows applicants from diverse academic backgrounds to contribute unique perspectives while developing specialized leadership and governance expertise.</p>\r\n<h3>Identity Verification Requirements</h3>\r\n<p>Applicants are required to provide valid identification documents during the admission process.</p>\r\n<h4>For Indian Applicants</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Aadhaar Card (Mandatory)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>For International Applicants</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Valid Passport (Mandatory)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These documents are required for identity verification and admission processing.</p>\r\n<h2>OP Jindal University Selection Criteria</h2>\r\n<p>Admission to the M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance program follows a holistic profile-based assessment process.</p>\r\n<h3>Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h3>\r\n<p>Applicants must submit a <strong>Statement of Purpose (300&ndash;500 Words)</strong> outlining:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Motivation for pursuing the program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Academic background and achievements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Relevant professional or educational experience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Interest in educational leadership and governance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Career aspirations and professional goals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>How the program aligns with their future plans.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The Statement of Purpose enables applicants to demonstrate their leadership potential, commitment to education, and readiness for advanced study in educational leadership and governance.</p>\r\n<h2>What Does the Admissions Committee Evaluate?</h2>\r\n<p>The admissions team evaluates applicants based on:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Academic qualifications</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Quality of the Statement of Purpose</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Career objectives and professional aspirations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Leadership potential</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Interest in education and institutional development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Communication and analytical skills</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Overall profile suitability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The university follows a holistic review process to identify candidates who can contribute meaningfully to the learning environment and future educational leadership landscape.</p>\r\n<h2>Who Should Apply for the M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance?</h2>\r\n<p>This program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>School teachers aspiring to leadership positions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Academic coordinators and administrators.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Education sector professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>School principals and vice principals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>EdTech professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Education policy enthusiasts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Learning and development professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Graduates interested in educational management and governance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Individuals seeking leadership roles in schools, colleges, universities, and educational organizations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The program is designed to help learners understand both the strategic and operational dimensions of educational leadership.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<h2 data-section-id=\"a9p184\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"77\">OP Jindal University M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance Fees 2026</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"587\">The <strong data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"130\">M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance</strong> at <strong data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"158\">OP Jindal University</strong> is a specialized postgraduate program designed for educators, academic administrators, school leaders, higher education professionals, policymakers, and aspiring institutional managers. The program focuses on developing expertise in <strong data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"586\">educational leadership, school administration, education policy, academic governance, quality assurance, institutional management, digital transformation in education, and strategic planning</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"1021\">With the education sector undergoing rapid transformation due to technology, policy reforms, AI integration, and changing learning models, institutions require leaders who can effectively manage change, improve educational outcomes, and drive institutional excellence. This program prepares professionals to take on leadership roles across schools, universities, educational organizations, EdTech companies, and policy institutions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n7h104\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1104\">OP Jindal University M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1401\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1122\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1131\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1143\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1401\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1248\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1203\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1248\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1305\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1264\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1276\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1305\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1355\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1321\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1333\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1355\" data-col-size=\"sm\">By 15 January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1401\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1380\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1379\">Total Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1396\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1395\">₹2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1401\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&mdash;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1w74i3k\" data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1418\">Fee Overview</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1781\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1445\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1445\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1434\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1445\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1781\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1532\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1485\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Name</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1532\" data-col-size=\"md\">M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1570\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1546\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1570\" data-col-size=\"md\">OP Jindal University</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1582\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1592\" data-col-size=\"md\">1 Year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1626\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1613\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1626\" data-col-size=\"md\">₹2,75,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1646\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1657\" data-col-size=\"md\">₹25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1678\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Structure</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1698\" data-col-size=\"md\">Instalment-Based</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1781\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1716\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Focus</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1781\" data-col-size=\"md\">Educational Leadership, Governance &amp; Institutional Management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4k3s8k\" data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1853\">What Does the M.A. Educational Leadership &amp; Governance Fee Include?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"2139\">The tuition fee supports a comprehensive curriculum that combines educational leadership theory with practical management and governance applications. Students gain exposure to contemporary challenges in education while developing the skills required to lead institutions effectively.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2182\">Key areas covered in the program include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2651\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2slv6b\" data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2227\">Educational Leadership and Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19yn3xf\" data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2270\">Strategic Planning and Change Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1czj6fb\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2304\">Education Policy and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17liu47\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2345\">School and Higher Education Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gwl0cz\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2372\">Education Law and Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0ysct\" data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2417\">Digital Transformation and AI in Education</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ij9wut\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2463\">Educational Finance and Resource Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2sv2r\" data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2501\">Quality Assurance and Accreditation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ktcx1\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2538\">Teacher Development and Leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gx69by\" data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2570\">Inclusive Education Practices</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qkeb6h\" data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2598\">Monitoring and Evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u9ymzd\" data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2651\">Institutional Action Research and Capstone Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2805\">The curriculum is designed to create future-ready education leaders capable of managing institutions in an increasingly dynamic educational environment.</p>', 'Medium', '<h2>OP Jindal University M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance Syllabus &amp; Curriculum 2026</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>M.A. in Educational Leadership &amp; Governance</strong> at <strong>OP Jindal University</strong> is a specialized postgraduate program designed for educators, academic administrators, school leaders, education professionals, policymakers, and aspiring institutional leaders who want to build expertise in <strong>educational leadership, education management, school administration, education policy, academic governance, educational planning, institutional development, and quality assurance</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>As educational institutions adapt to rapid technological change, evolving learning models, and increasing accountability requirements, there is growing demand for professionals who can effectively lead schools, universities, EdTech organizations, and educational systems. This program equips students with the leadership, strategic management, governance, and policy skills required to drive innovation and excellence in education.</p>\r\n<p>The curriculum integrates <strong>educational leadership, strategic planning, education policy, digital transformation, AI in education, institutional governance, quality assurance, educational finance, and inclusive education</strong>, making it highly relevant for modern education leaders.</p>\r\n<h2>M.A. Educational Leadership &amp; Governance Course Structure</h2>\r\n<p>The curriculum follows a progressive learning approach that develops expertise in educational leadership, policy analysis, governance systems, institutional management, and educational innovation.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2>Term 1: Foundations of Educational Leadership and Strategic Management</h2>\r\n<p>The first term introduces students to leadership theories, organizational transformation, and global education systems. Students develop a strong understanding of how educational institutions are managed and how effective leadership influences learning outcomes.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Courses</th>\r\n<th>Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Leadership Theories and Practices in Education</td>\r\n<td>Educational leadership models, decision-making, organizational leadership, and institutional effectiveness</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Strategic Planning and Change Management</td>\r\n<td>Educational planning, organizational transformation, innovation, and change leadership</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Comparative and Global Education Policy</td>\r\n<td>International education systems, policy frameworks, and global education trends</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Skills Developed in Term 1</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Educational Leadership</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Strategic Thinking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Change Management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Policy Analysis</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Institutional Planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Leadership Communication</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2>Term 2: Governance, Technology and Educational Resource Management</h2>\r\n<p>The second term focuses on governance structures, legal frameworks, digital transformation, and financial management within educational institutions.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Courses</th>\r\n<th>Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Education Law, Ethics &amp; Institutional Governance</td>\r\n<td>Educational regulations, governance frameworks, ethics, and compliance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Digital Transformation and AI in Education</td>\r\n<td>Educational technology, artificial intelligence, digital learning ecosystems, and innovation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Finance, Budgeting &amp; Resource Mobilization in Education</td>\r\n<td>Educational finance, budgeting, resource allocation, and institutional sustainability</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Why This Term Matters</h3>\r\n<p>Educational leaders today must balance academic excellence with operational efficiency. Understanding governance, technology integration, and financial management is essential for building sustainable and future-ready educational institutions.</p>\r\n<h3>Skills Developed in Term 2</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Educational Governance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Financial Planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Institutional Management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>AI and Digital Education Strategy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Policy Compliance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Resource Management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2>Term 3: Human Capital Development and Educational Quality</h2>\r\n<p>The third term focuses on strengthening teaching quality, staff development, learning outcomes, and inclusive educational practices.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Courses</th>\r\n<th>Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Teachers &amp; Staff Professional Development</td>\r\n<td>Faculty development, performance enhancement, leadership coaching, and workforce planning</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Learning Assessment &amp; Quality Assurance in Education</td>\r\n<td>Academic assessment systems, accreditation, educational quality standards, and performance evaluation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Creating and Promoting Inclusive Learning Environment</td>\r\n<td>Inclusive education, diversity, accessibility, student engagement, and equitable learning practices</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Skills Developed in Term 3</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Faculty Leadership</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Quality Assurance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Academic Evaluation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Inclusive Education Planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Workforce Development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Student-Centered Learning Design</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2>Term 4: Educational Research and Institutional Improvement</h2>\r\n<p>The final term enables students to apply their knowledge through research, monitoring systems, evaluation frameworks, and a capstone project focused on real-world educational challenges.</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Courses</th>\r\n<th>Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Institutional Action Research</td>\r\n<td>Research methodologies, educational problem-solving, and institutional improvement initiatives</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Monitoring &amp; Evaluation in Education</td>\r\n<td>Educational performance measurement, impact assessment, and continuous improvement systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Capstone Project</td>\r\n<td>Applied educational leadership project addressing real institutional or policy challenges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Capstone Project Experience</h3>\r\n<p>The capstone project provides students with an opportunity to apply leadership and governance concepts to practical educational issues. Students may work on projects related to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>School Improvement Planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Education Policy Analysis</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Institutional Transformation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Digital Learning Strategies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Academic Quality Enhancement</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Inclusive Education Models</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Educational Leadership Frameworks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Student Success Initiatives</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This practical experience helps strengthen leadership, research, and decision-making capabilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(477, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 348, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 03:22:38', '2026-06-01 03:22:38', '<p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"557\">The admission process for the <strong data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"177\">M.Sc. in Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy</strong> at <strong data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"205\">OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify creative thinkers, future innovators, aspiring entrepreneurs, business strategists, and professionals who demonstrate strong problem-solving abilities and leadership potential. The selection process evaluates applicants based on their academic performance, statement of purpose, entrance test scores, and interview performance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qupoa4\" data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"607\">Step 1: Complete the Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"759\">Applicants must submit the online application form through the university admission portal with accurate personal, academic, and professional details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k12mfe\" data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"798\">Step 2: Upload Required Documents</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"886\">Candidates are required to upload all necessary documents for verification, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"1178\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vteber\" data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"925\">Class 10 mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bhpx4x\" data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"963\">Class 12 mark sheet and certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12ykj2y\" data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1020\">Bachelor\'s degree certificate and academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xrh0kk\" data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1049\">Government-issued ID proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c1570v\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1091\">Passport (for international applicants)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40xgv7\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1125\">Recent passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5qnvfe\" data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1178\">Any additional supporting documents, if applicable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qei4un\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1229\">Step 3: Submit the Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1288\">Applicants must submit a Statement of Purpose explaining:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rr4dn7\" data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1354\">Why they want to pursue Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"av0c75\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1399\">Their academic and professional background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yxnasl\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1437\">Career goals and future aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rjpv1t\" data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1523\">Interest in innovation, entrepreneurship, business strategy, or product development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r39u4e\" data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1580\">How the program aligns with their long-term objectives</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1696\">The SOP helps the admissions committee assess the applicant\'s motivation, vision, and suitability for the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dykngx\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1743\">Step 4: Submit Valid Entrance Test Scores</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1831\">Candidates must provide a valid score from any of the following accepted examinations:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1947\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"184fv58\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1873\">JSAT (Jindal Scholastic Aptitude Test)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"180v571\" data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1903\">CAT (Common Admission Test)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mrgzdb\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1947\">GMAT (Graduate Management Admission Test)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"2058\">These scores help evaluate analytical aptitude, problem-solving skills, and readiness for postgraduate study.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ql10oa\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2090\">Step 5: Personal Interview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2180\">Shortlisted candidates are invited for a personal interview conducted by the university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2215\">The interview typically assesses:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2390\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2239\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kk1qq1\" data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2260\">Innovation mindset</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8v7wdd\" data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2283\">Leadership potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"od25pu\" data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2312\">Strategic thinking ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ln14ta\" data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2339\">Problem-solving approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qn84m5\" data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2360\">Career aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kw6562\" data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2390\">Overall fit for the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13j10dl\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2436\">Step 6: Comprehensive Profile Evaluation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2503\">The admissions committee conducts a holistic assessment based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2653\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oy2id\" data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2527\">Academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r25quh\" data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2541\">SOP quality</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a1psx\" data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2564\">Entrance test scores</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m9p109\" data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2588\">Interview performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ol7rb\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2626\">Leadership and innovation potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eiiomh\" data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2653\">Overall profile strength</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"meh608\" data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2682\">Step 7: Admission Offer</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2803\">Candidates who successfully meet the admission requirements receive an official offer letter from OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1aixsl5\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2859\">Step 8: Confirm Admission and Pay Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2998\">Selected applicants must accept the offer and pay the registration fee within the specified deadline to secure their seat in the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ou2dab\" data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3043\">Step 9: Complete Enrollment Formalities</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3218\">After fee payment and document verification, students complete the enrollment process and receive access to academic resources, orientation details, and program information.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n6olxg\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3249\">Admission Process Overview</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3847\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3284\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3284\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3269\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3284\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3847\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3370\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3339\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online Application</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3370\">Submit the application form</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3431\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3389\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document Upload</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3431\">Upload academic and identity documents</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3480\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3449\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SOP Submission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3480\">Submit Statement of Purpose</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3553\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3514\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entrance Test Score Submission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3553\">JSAT, CAT, or GMAT score submission</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3614\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3575\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Personal Interview</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3614\">Interview with the admissions panel</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3674\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Profile Evaluation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3636\" data-end=\"3674\">Holistic assessment of application</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3739\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3693\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Offer</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3739\">Offer letter issued to selected candidates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3793\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3767\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3767\" data-end=\"3793\">Confirm admission seat</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3847\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3813\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Enrollment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3813\" data-end=\"3847\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete admission formalities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"4299\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The <strong data-start=\"3853\" data-end=\"3943\">OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy admission process</strong> is designed to identify ambitious individuals with strong creative, analytical, and leadership capabilities. Through a combination of academic evaluation, SOP assessment, entrance test performance, and personal interviews, the program selects candidates who are prepared to become future innovators, entrepreneurs, strategists, and transformation leaders.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"99\" data-end=\"683\">The <strong data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\">M.Sc. in Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy</strong> at <strong data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"182\">OP Jindal University</strong> is a specialized postgraduate program designed for students and professionals who aspire to become innovation leaders, business strategists, product innovators, entrepreneurs, design thinking practitioners, and transformation specialists. The program combines <strong data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"599\">design thinking, innovation management, business strategy, customer experience, entrepreneurship, product development, and organizational transformation</strong> to prepare graduates for leadership roles in a rapidly evolving business landscape.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"1109\">With organizations increasingly prioritizing innovation, digital transformation, customer-centricity, and business agility, there is growing demand for professionals who can solve complex problems, create innovative solutions, and drive sustainable growth. The program is ideal for individuals seeking careers in innovation consulting, product strategy, startup ecosystems, business transformation, and strategic management.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wmzrpg\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1186\">Eligibility Criteria for M.Sc. in Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1353\">Candidates seeking admission to the OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy program must satisfy the following eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"129mv2n\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1380\">Academic Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1442\">Applicants must meet all of the following academic criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1642\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"febckw\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1504\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1479\">60% marks in Class 10</strong> from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ihtbn6\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1565\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1540\">60% marks in Class 12</strong> from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2sl4hr\" data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1642\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1612\">50% marks in a Bachelor\'s degree</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1721\">The program welcomes applicants from diverse academic backgrounds, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1881\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p06fqp\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1736\">Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9rx33v\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1749\">Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fr3fit\" data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1760\">Commerce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tue68s\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1770\">Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ttf991\" data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1783\">Humanities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uduuhm\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1792\">Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2py4b2\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1805\">Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c1jzmc\" data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1817\">Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g29lh0\" data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1835\">Social Sciences</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1asn125\" data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1850\">Architecture</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"85bldh\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1881\">Other recognized disciplines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"2008\">This multidisciplinary approach allows students to bring different perspectives to innovation and problem-solving challenges.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"m4j3s9\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2579\">OP Jindal University Selection Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2811\">Admission to the M.Sc. in Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy program follows a comprehensive evaluation process designed to assess academic potential, innovation mindset, leadership capabilities, and strategic thinking skills.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16cxhoi\" data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2844\">Application Form Submission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2964\">Candidates must complete and submit the official application form with all required academic and personal information.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d651h5\" data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"2996\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3066\">Applicants are required to submit a Statement of Purpose explaining:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3293\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a7p647\" data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3112\">Their motivation for pursuing the program.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ihmbiw\" data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3169\">Interest in design thinking, innovation, and strategy.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r0wgif\" data-start=\"3170\" data-end=\"3211\">Academic and professional achievements.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1npfl5a\" data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3243\">Career goals and aspirations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jqzau8\" data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3293\">How the program aligns with their future plans.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3423\">A strong SOP demonstrates creativity, problem-solving ability, leadership potential, and a clear vision for professional growth.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aejdnb\" data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3447\">Personal Interview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3523\">Shortlisted applicants are invited to participate in a personal interview.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3559\">The interview typically evaluates:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3561\" data-end=\"3725\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"3561\" data-end=\"3583\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8v7wdd\" data-start=\"3584\" data-end=\"3606\">Leadership potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"od25pu\" data-start=\"3607\" data-end=\"3635\">Strategic thinking ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kk1qq1\" data-start=\"3636\" data-end=\"3656\">Innovation mindset</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dwzlh2\" data-start=\"3657\" data-end=\"3676\">Career objectives</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ln14ta\" data-start=\"3677\" data-end=\"3703\">Problem-solving approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mycmq0\" data-start=\"3704\" data-end=\"3725\">Overall program fit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3727\" data-end=\"3826\">The interview helps the admissions committee understand the applicant beyond academic achievements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"skc6ex\" data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3858\">Valid Entrance Test Scores</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3860\" data-end=\"3936\">Applicants must submit a valid score from any of the following examinations:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3938\" data-end=\"4052\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"184fv58\" data-start=\"3938\" data-end=\"3978\">JSAT (Jindal Scholastic Aptitude Test)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"180v571\" data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4008\">CAT (Common Admission Test)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mrgzdb\" data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4052\">GMAT (Graduate Management Admission Test)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4054\" data-end=\"4194\">These assessments help evaluate analytical reasoning, quantitative aptitude, problem-solving capabilities, and readiness for advanced study.</p>', '<h2 data-section-id=\"h0grwt\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"81\">OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy Fees 2026</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"535\">The <strong data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"138\">M.Sc. in Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy</strong> at <strong data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"166\">OP Jindal University</strong> is a next-generation postgraduate program designed for students, entrepreneurs, innovation managers, product strategists, business consultants, and future leaders who want to develop expertise in <strong data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"534\">design thinking, innovation management, business strategy, customer experience, product innovation, entrepreneurship, business transformation, and strategic leadership</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"967\">As organizations increasingly focus on innovation-led growth, digital transformation, and customer-centric business models, professionals with expertise in design thinking and strategic innovation are among the most sought-after talent globally. This program equips students with the skills required to identify opportunities, solve complex business challenges, create innovative solutions, and lead organizational transformation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pwjd65\" data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1054\">OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1353\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1093\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1093\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1072\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1081\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1093\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1353\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1200\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1155\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1165\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1200\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1257\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1216\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1228\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1257\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1273\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1285\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1307\" data-col-size=\"sm\">By 15 January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1353\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1332\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1331\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1348\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1347\">₹2,50,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1353\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&mdash;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1w74i3k\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1370\">Fee Overview</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1397\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1397\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1386\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1397\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1488\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1437\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Name</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1488\" data-col-size=\"md\">M.Sc. in Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1526\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1502\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1526\" data-col-size=\"md\">OP Jindal University</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1538\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1548\" data-col-size=\"md\">1 Year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1582\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1582\" data-col-size=\"md\">₹2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1616\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1605\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1616\" data-col-size=\"md\">₹25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1637\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Structure</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1657\" data-col-size=\"md\">Instalment-Based</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1675\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Focus</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1742\" data-col-size=\"md\">Design Thinking, Innovation, Strategy &amp; Business Transformation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"mk350t\" data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1818\">What Does the M.Sc. Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy Fee Include?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"2167\">The program fee supports a highly specialized curriculum that combines innovation methodologies, business strategy, leadership development, customer-centric design, and entrepreneurial thinking. Students gain exposure to real-world business challenges while learning how successful organizations innovate, scale, and sustain competitive advantage.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2198\">Major learning areas include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2610\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y24kbn\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2243\">Design Thinking and Innovation Frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kz2kuq\" data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2283\">Business Strategy and Growth Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19xza5z\" data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2304\">Marketing Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y4azds\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2333\">Customer Experience Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmuyh8\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2361\">Business Model Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187qzl1\" data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2402\">Strategic Foresight and Transformation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bzmb9t\" data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2448\">Organizational Growth and Change Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uwhiy7\" data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2484\">Leadership and Talent Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lzla6f\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2501\">Service Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zlk63g\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2541\">Entrepreneurship and Startup Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1curby1\" data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2565\">Innovation Consulting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dbiegr\" data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2610\">Capstone Project and Experiential Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2733\">The curriculum is designed to bridge creativity and business strategy, helping students become innovation-driven leaders.</p>', 'Medium', '<h2 data-section-id=\"z8m6ks\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"98\">OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy Syllabus &amp; Curriculum 2026</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"545\">The <strong data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"155\">M.Sc. in Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy</strong> at <strong data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"183\">OP Jindal University</strong> is a future-focused postgraduate program designed for students, entrepreneurs, business professionals, innovation managers, consultants, and aspiring leaders who want to master <strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"544\">design thinking, business innovation, strategic management, product innovation, customer experience design, business transformation, innovation strategy, and organizational growth</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"1031\">In today\'s rapidly evolving business environment, organizations are constantly seeking professionals who can solve complex problems, develop innovative solutions, create customer-centric products, and drive sustainable growth. This program combines the principles of <strong data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"956\">design thinking, strategic management, innovation leadership, business model innovation, service design, and organizational transformation</strong> to prepare graduates for leadership roles in innovation-driven industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1315\">Unlike traditional management programs, this curriculum focuses on the intersection of creativity, strategy, technology, customer experience, and business innovation, helping students develop the mindset and tools required to lead transformation in a competitive global marketplace.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1w63tri\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1381\">M.Sc. Design Thinking, Innovation &amp; Strategy Course Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1607\">The curriculum is designed to help students understand how innovation drives business success while developing practical skills in problem-solving, strategy formulation, customer experience design, and innovation management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1612\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"tbuka6\" data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1671\">Term 1: Foundations of Innovation and Strategic Growth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1909\">The first term introduces students to innovation ecosystems, competitive strategy, and growth-oriented business thinking. Students learn how innovation creates value and how organizations leverage strategy to succeed in dynamic markets.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"2471\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1943\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1943\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1921\" data-col-size=\"md\">Courses</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1943\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2471\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2064\" data-col-size=\"md\">The Technology &amp; Innovation Imperative: What and Why of Innovation &amp; Design Thinking</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2175\">Innovation frameworks, design thinking principles, problem-solving methodologies, and innovation ecosystems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2304\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2221\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Growth Engine: Marketing Strategy</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2304\">Customer behavior, market positioning, growth strategies, and brand development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2471\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2371\" data-col-size=\"md\">Competing to Win: Business Strategy in a Rapidly Changing World</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2471\">Strategic decision-making, competitive advantage, market disruption, and business transformation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l4soxo\" data-start=\"2473\" data-end=\"2503\">Skills Developed in Term 1</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2656\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fsay3i\" data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2535\">Design Thinking Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w4ej6\" data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2556\">Strategic Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6wrqc6\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2580\">Innovation Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19xza5z\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2601\">Marketing Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j9j1fn\" data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2628\">Business Problem Solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g9nhrp\" data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2656\">Customer-Centric Thinking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2661\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kptf2u\" data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2721\">Term 2: Human-Centered Design and Innovation Leadership</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2964\">The second term focuses on understanding customer needs, organizational culture, leadership, and innovation management. Students learn how successful organizations build innovative environments that support creativity and sustainable growth.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"3475\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"2998\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"2998\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"2976\" data-col-size=\"md\">Courses</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2976\" data-end=\"2998\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3475\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3156\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3075\" data-col-size=\"md\">Design Thinking-I: Immersion and Insight</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3156\">User research, empathy mapping, customer insights, and problem identification</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3288\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3199\" data-col-size=\"md\">Responsible Conduct: Business &amp; Society</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3288\">Business ethics, sustainability, corporate responsibility, and stakeholder management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3475\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3384\" data-col-size=\"md\">Leading &amp; Managing Growth: Culture, Structure and Talent for Growth, Innovation &amp; Creativity</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3475\">Leadership development, organizational culture, innovation teams, and talent management</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1g2eq74\" data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3502\">Why This Term Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3788\">Innovation is not only about generating ideas; it also requires understanding customers, building the right organizational culture, and creating systems that encourage creativity. This term helps students develop the leadership capabilities required to manage innovation successfully.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l4soxr\" data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3820\">Skills Developed in Term 2</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3966\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1leqedc\" data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3837\">User Research</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zhjgyf\" data-start=\"3838\" data-end=\"3865\">Leadership and Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"teiffx\" data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3894\">Organizational Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7wv2\" data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"3921\">Creative Problem Solving</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ev0ky3\" data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"3946\">Stakeholder Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rre1ls\" data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3966\">Growth Leadership</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3968\" data-end=\"3971\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1lrw1v8\" data-start=\"3973\" data-end=\"4038\">Term 3: Business Model Innovation and Strategic Transformation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4188\">The third term focuses on converting ideas into viable business opportunities while exploring strategic foresight and organizational transformation.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4716\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4222\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4222\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4200\" data-col-size=\"md\">Courses</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4222\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4256\" data-end=\"4716\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4256\" data-end=\"4382\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4256\" data-end=\"4299\" data-col-size=\"md\">Design Thinking-II: Ideas Implementation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4382\">Prototyping, solution development, innovation execution, and product validation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4383\" data-end=\"4546\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4383\" data-end=\"4460\" data-col-size=\"md\">Business Model Design &amp; Innovation: Creating, Delivering &amp; Capturing Value</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4460\" data-end=\"4546\">Business model innovation, value creation, entrepreneurship, and growth strategies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4547\" data-end=\"4716\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4547\" data-end=\"4628\" data-col-size=\"md\">Competing to Win: Driving Change &amp; Transformation Based on Strategic Foresight</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4628\" data-end=\"4716\">Strategic foresight, future trends, innovation strategy, and business transformation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l4soxq\" data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4748\">Skills Developed in Term 3</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"4895\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s5uv3r\" data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"4772\">Innovation Execution</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eo5qoi\" data-start=\"4773\" data-end=\"4801\">Business Model Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11vou8v\" data-start=\"4802\" data-end=\"4823\">Strategic Foresight</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15qe4o9\" data-start=\"4824\" data-end=\"4842\">Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d4pu71\" data-start=\"4843\" data-end=\"4862\">Change Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hnmteg\" data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4895\">Product and Service Innovation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4897\" data-end=\"4900\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n508cq\" data-start=\"4902\" data-end=\"4953\">Term 4: Experience Design and Applied Innovation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4955\" data-end=\"5129\">The final term focuses on designing meaningful customer experiences and applying innovation concepts through a capstone project, thesis, or experiential learning opportunity.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5131\" data-end=\"5506\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5131\" data-end=\"5163\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5131\" data-end=\"5163\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5131\" data-end=\"5141\" data-col-size=\"md\">Courses</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5141\" data-end=\"5163\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5197\" data-end=\"5506\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5197\" data-end=\"5339\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5197\" data-end=\"5252\" data-col-size=\"md\">Creating Enduring Value: Service &amp; Experience Design</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5252\" data-end=\"5339\">Customer experience design, service innovation, user engagement, and value creation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5506\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5392\" data-col-size=\"md\">Capstone Project / Thesis / Experiential Learning</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5392\" data-end=\"5506\">Applied innovation project, business research, consulting assignment, or real-world problem-solving initiative</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11y4vni\" data-start=\"5508\" data-end=\"5557\">Capstone and Experiential Learning Experience</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5559\" data-end=\"5725\">The capstone component allows students to apply design thinking and innovation frameworks to solve real business challenges. Students may work on projects related to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5727\" data-end=\"5923\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nfydim\" data-start=\"5727\" data-end=\"5747\">Product Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lzla6f\" data-start=\"5748\" data-end=\"5764\">Service Design</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wjq36x\" data-start=\"5765\" data-end=\"5795\">Customer Experience Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1biw1dr\" data-start=\"5796\" data-end=\"5821\">Business Transformation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1curby1\" data-start=\"5822\" data-end=\"5845\">Innovation Consulting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vqm273\" data-start=\"5846\" data-end=\"5866\">Digital Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ey4ge6\" data-start=\"5867\" data-end=\"5888\">Startup Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16dxyh7\" data-start=\"5889\" data-end=\"5923\">Organizational Change Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5925\" data-end=\"6043\">This practical experience strengthens strategic thinking, innovation management, and business leadership capabilities.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 250000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(478, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 349, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 03:32:08', '2026-06-01 03:32:08', '<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\">\r\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:52779e75-d9b9-408d-b925-af2ee750d75a-54\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:52779e75-d9b9-408d-b925-af2ee750d75a-54\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:52779e75-d9b9-408d-b925-af2ee750d75a-54\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-104\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"8bf099fb-5183-4c92-96de-f258ba6d746f\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-5\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"613\">The admission process for the <strong data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"171\">M.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</strong> at <strong data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"199\">OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify candidates with strong analytical abilities, quantitative aptitude, and an interest in emerging fields such as <strong data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"486\">Artificial Intelligence, FinTech, Financial Analytics, Machine Learning, Quantitative Finance, Blockchain, Digital Banking, and Algorithmic Trading</strong>. The university follows a holistic evaluation process that assesses academic performance, motivation, and overall program fit.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qupoa4\" data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"663\">Step 1: Complete the Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"820\">Candidates must submit the online application form through the university admission portal by providing their personal, academic, and professional details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k12mfe\" data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"859\">Step 2: Upload Required Documents</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"929\">Applicants are required to upload all relevant documents, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1145\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7nyp84\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"965\">Undergraduate degree certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"117dusa\" data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1004\">Academic transcripts and mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xrh0kk\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1033\">Government-issued ID proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40xgv7\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1067\">Recent passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8flj6f\" data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1096\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d5pd3g\" data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1145\">Additional supporting documents, if applicable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qei4un\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1196\">Step 3: Submit the Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1255\">Applicants must submit a Statement of Purpose explaining:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1468\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"144gezf\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1312\">Their interest in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkcfkz\" data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1351\">Academic and professional background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yorba8\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1382\">Career goals and aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"130ct5n\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1420\">Motivation for pursuing the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1blzadq\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1468\">How the degree aligns with their future plans</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1586\">The SOP helps the admissions committee evaluate the applicant\'s commitment, vision, and suitability for the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wruydq\" data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1623\">Step 4: Academic Profile Review</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1680\">The admissions team conducts a comprehensive review of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1832\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qnn60\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1718\">Undergraduate academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1741\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n7w4a\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1764\">Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bjcsw\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1792\">Overall applicant profile</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ttwtm1\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1832\">Relevant achievements and experiences</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1951\">This evaluation helps determine the candidate\'s readiness for postgraduate study in AI-driven financial technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"m0cz8w\" data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"2005\">Step 5: JSAT Requirement for Eligible Candidates</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2077\">Applicants with <strong data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2060\">less than 50% marks in graduation</strong> are required to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2179\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"he3hh5\" data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2138\">Appear for the <strong data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2138\">JSAT (Jindal Scholastic Aptitude Test)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lx956\" data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2179\">Qualify as per university requirements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2258\">The test helps assess aptitude, analytical reasoning, and academic potential.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cri5sa\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2306\">Step 6: Personal Interview (If Applicable)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2371\">Shortlisted candidates may be invited for a personal interview.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2398\">The interview may assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2599\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eqxox6\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2428\">Motivation for the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2451\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1opxju7\" data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2494\">Analytical and problem-solving abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4tzhc0\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2536\">Understanding of finance and technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qn84m5\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2557\">Career aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gfr4r3\" data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2599\">Overall fit with the program objectives</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2683\">For candidates with less than 50% marks in graduation, the interview is mandatory.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4kbosg\" data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2715\">Step 7: Admission Decision</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2905\">Based on the overall evaluation of academic performance, SOP, JSAT score (where applicable), interview performance, and profile strength, the university makes the final admission decision.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"q6oujt\" data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2954\">Step 8: Receive and Accept the Offer Letter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"3104\">Selected candidates receive an official admission offer from OP Jindal University. Applicants must confirm acceptance within the specified deadline.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pri6j5\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3142\">Step 9: Pay the Registration Fee</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3239\">To secure admission, candidates must pay the registration fee as mentioned in the offer letter.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1r2qo7v\" data-start=\"3241\" data-end=\"3285\">Step 10: Complete Enrollment Formalities</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3471\">After successful fee payment and document verification, students complete the enrollment process and receive access to orientation details, academic resources, and program information.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n6olxg\" data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3502\">Admission Process Overview</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"4180\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3537\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3537\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3522\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Stage</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3537\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3571\" data-end=\"4180\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3571\" data-end=\"3623\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3571\" data-end=\"3592\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online Application</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3623\" data-col-size=\"md\">Submit the application form</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3684\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3642\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document Upload</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3684\">Upload academic and identity documents</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3733\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3702\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SOP Submission</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3733\">Submit Statement of Purpose</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3810\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3760\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Profile Review</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3760\" data-end=\"3810\" data-col-size=\"md\">Evaluation of academic performance and profile</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"3893\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"3830\" data-col-size=\"sm\">JSAT Examination</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3893\">Required for candidates with less than 50% graduation marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3894\" data-end=\"3955\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3894\" data-end=\"3915\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Personal Interview</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3955\">Conducted for shortlisted applicants</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"4019\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"3977\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Admission Decision</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"4019\" data-col-size=\"md\">Selection based on holistic assessment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4020\" data-end=\"4073\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4020\" data-end=\"4046\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Offer Letter Acceptance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4073\">Confirm admission offer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4126\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4101\" data-end=\"4126\" data-col-size=\"md\">Secure admission seat</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4180\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4146\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Enrollment</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4146\" data-end=\"4180\" data-col-size=\"md\">Complete admission formalities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4512\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The <strong data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4273\">OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance admission process</strong> follows a merit-based and holistic approach, ensuring that applicants with strong academic potential, analytical thinking skills, and a passion for AI-powered financial innovation are selected for this future-focused postgraduate program.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', 1, '<p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"589\">The <strong data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"148\">M.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</strong> at <strong data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"176\">OP Jindal University</strong> is an advanced postgraduate program designed for students who want to build expertise at the intersection of <strong data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"461\">Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Financial Analytics, FinTech, Quantitative Finance, Algorithmic Trading, Blockchain, Digital Banking, and Financial Data Science</strong>. The program is ideal for learners seeking future-ready careers in the rapidly evolving world of AI-powered financial services.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"1037\">As financial institutions increasingly adopt <strong data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"793\">AI in Finance, predictive analytics, robo-advisory platforms, algorithmic trading systems, blockchain technologies, and data-driven investment strategies</strong>, there is growing demand for professionals who possess both financial knowledge and technological expertise. This program equips students with the skills required to lead innovation in modern financial markets and digital financial ecosystems.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x1wskq\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1111\">Eligibility Criteria for M.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1275\">Candidates seeking admission to the OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance program must satisfy the following eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p1jjjm\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1303\">Academic Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1766\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x92auk\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1385\">Applicants must hold an <strong data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1384\">undergraduate degree from a recognized university</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qfg2yv\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1460\">Candidates should have secured a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1459\">50% marks in graduation</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ehtme\" data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1650\">Graduates from Commerce, Economics, Finance, Management, Engineering, Mathematics, Statistics, Computer Science, Data Science, Technology, and related disciplines are encouraged to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z6vij\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1766\">Students from other academic backgrounds with a strong interest in finance and technology may also be considered.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1961\">The interdisciplinary nature of the program allows students from diverse educational streams to develop expertise in AI-driven financial technologies and data-centric financial decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pkvxzc\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2018\">Eligibility for Candidates with Less Than 50% Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2190\">Applicants who have scored below 50% marks in their undergraduate degree are still eligible to be considered for admission, subject to additional evaluation requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2213\">Such candidates must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2344\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5oakxj\" data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2275\">Appear for the <strong data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2274\">JSAT (Jindal Scholastic Aptitude Test)</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dh1a0c\" data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2344\">Attend a mandatory personal interview conducted by the university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2484\">This process enables the admissions committee to evaluate the applicant\'s aptitude, motivation, and potential beyond academic performance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"m4j3s9\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2528\">OP Jindal University Selection Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2656\">Admission to the M.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance program follows a holistic and profile-based assessment process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11h1gev\" data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2694\">Comprehensive Profile Evaluation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2769\">The university evaluates applicants based on multiple factors, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2933\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oy2id\" data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2793\">Academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n4mntt\" data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2818\">Educational background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8flj6f\" data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2847\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2870\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eiiomh\" data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2897\">Overall profile strength</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12n0lnm\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2933\">Career aspirations and motivation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"3107\">The selection process is designed to identify candidates who demonstrate strong analytical ability, intellectual curiosity, and interest in emerging financial technologies.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d651h5\" data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3139\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3208\">Applicants are required to submit a Statement of Purpose outlining:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3425\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14j06ip\" data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3237\">Their academic background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljhqgp\" data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3287\">Interest in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2e3yj\" data-start=\"3288\" data-end=\"3331\">Career goals and professional aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"130ct5n\" data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3369\">Motivation for pursuing the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"neyq0u\" data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3425\">How the degree aligns with their long-term objectives</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3547\">A well-written SOP helps applicants showcase their passion for technology, finance, innovation, and future career plans.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eh2sc0\" data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3585\">Personal Interview (If Required)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3587\" data-end=\"3650\">Shortlisted candidates may be invited for a personal interview.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3677\">The interview may assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3679\" data-end=\"3833\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"3679\" data-end=\"3701\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10v4scw\" data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3723\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bbj29e\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3771\">Interest in finance and emerging technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dwzlh2\" data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"3791\">Career objectives</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17h3kp3\" data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3805\">Program fit</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s8qys4\" data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"3833\">Motivation and commitment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3835\" data-end=\"3951\">The interview helps the university gain deeper insight into the applicant\'s potential and readiness for the program.</p>', '<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"573\">The <strong data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"132\">M.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</strong> at <strong data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"160\">OP Jindal University</strong> is a future-ready postgraduate program that combines the power of <strong data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"413\">Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Financial Analytics, FinTech, Quantitative Finance, Blockchain Technology, Algorithmic Trading, Digital Banking, and Financial Data Science</strong>. Designed for ambitious graduates and professionals, the program prepares learners for leadership roles in the rapidly evolving financial technology ecosystem.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"931\">As AI continues to transform global financial services, organizations are actively seeking professionals who can leverage data, automation, predictive analytics, and intelligent systems to improve financial decision-making. The program provides students with advanced technical and financial expertise required to thrive in next-generation finance careers.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3q8yf7\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"1015\">OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1312\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1033\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1042\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1054\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1312\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1114\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1124\">₹25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1159\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1175\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1187\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1216\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1266\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1232\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1244\" data-col-size=\"sm\">₹1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1266\" data-col-size=\"sm\">By 15 January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1312\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1291\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1290\">Total Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1307\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1306\">₹2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1312\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&mdash;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1w74i3k\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1329\">Fee Overview</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1356\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1356\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1345\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1356\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1444\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1396\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Course Name</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1444\" data-col-size=\"md\">M.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1482\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1458\" data-col-size=\"sm\">University</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1482\" data-col-size=\"md\">OP Jindal University</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1504\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1494\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Duration</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1504\" data-col-size=\"md\">1 Year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1538\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1525\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1538\" data-col-size=\"md\">₹2,75,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1572\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1561\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1572\" data-col-size=\"md\">₹25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1593\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Payment Structure</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1613\" data-col-size=\"md\">Instalment-Based</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1631\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Learning Focus</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1711\" data-col-size=\"md\">Artificial Intelligence, FinTech, Financial Analytics &amp; Quantitative Finance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bvp2gz\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1784\">What Does the M.Sc. Artificial Intelligence and Finance Fee Include?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1964\">The tuition fee covers a comprehensive curriculum that integrates finance, technology, analytics, and artificial intelligence to address the future needs of the financial sector.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1998\">Major areas of learning include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2423\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fqnu6s\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2036\">Artificial Intelligence in Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12dlm0g\" data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2068\">Machine Learning Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1722gfr\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2090\">Financial Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fjxo91\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2115\">Financial Data Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q89ff1\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2138\">Quantitative Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10gp4j2\" data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2160\">Algorithmic Trading</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xs0raz\" data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2196\">Financial Markets and Instruments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ag27dw\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2226\">FinTech and Digital Banking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x29kmb\" data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2258\">Blockchain and Cryptocurrency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10codd\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2281\">Portfolio Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kkhani\" data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2305\">Robo-Advisory Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rmdg7l\" data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2333\">Financial Risk Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7m3p7a\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2366\">Python Programming for Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"139etv\" data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2404\">Corporate Governance and Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s9m358\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2423\">Capstone Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2570\">The curriculum combines theoretical foundations with practical applications, enabling students to develop both technical and strategic expertise.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"635\">The <strong data-start=\"101\" data-end=\"149\">M.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</strong> at <strong data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"177\">OP Jindal University</strong> is a cutting-edge postgraduate program designed to bridge the gap between <strong data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"436\">artificial intelligence, financial technology, quantitative finance, data analytics, algorithmic trading, fintech innovation, blockchain, digital banking, and investment management</strong>. The program prepares students for the future of finance, where AI-powered decision-making, machine learning models, automation, and data-driven financial strategies are transforming global markets.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"1077\">As financial institutions increasingly adopt <strong data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"830\">AI in finance, fintech solutions, robo-advisory platforms, predictive analytics, blockchain technology, quantitative trading, and digital assets</strong>, the demand for professionals with expertise in both finance and artificial intelligence continues to grow rapidly. This program equips students with the technical, analytical, and strategic skills needed to thrive in modern financial ecosystems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1341\">Unlike traditional finance degrees, the curriculum combines financial theory with emerging technologies, helping students understand how artificial intelligence is reshaping banking, investment management, risk assessment, trading, and financial decision-making.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pnfxog\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1404\">M.Sc. Artificial Intelligence and Finance Course Structure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1631\">The curriculum is structured across four terms and progressively develops expertise in finance, data analytics, machine learning applications, fintech innovations, quantitative strategies, and emerging financial technologies.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1636\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1d3hghp\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1696\">Term 1: Foundations of Finance and Financial Technology</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1876\">The first term establishes a strong foundation in financial management, financial markets, quantitative methods, and programming skills required for AI-driven financial analysis.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"2437\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1910\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1910\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1888\" data-col-size=\"md\">Courses</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1910\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2437\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2050\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1967\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Management</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2050\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate finance, investment decisions, financial planning, and value creation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2184\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2090\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Mathematics and Statistics</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2184\" data-col-size=\"md\">Quantitative methods, statistical analysis, probability models, and financial calculations</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2312\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2221\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Markets and Instruments</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2312\" data-col-size=\"md\">Equity markets, debt markets, derivatives, financial instruments, and market structures</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2437\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2361\" data-col-size=\"md\">Python Programming for Financial Applications</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2437\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial coding, automation, data analysis, and programming for finance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l4soxo\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2469\">Skills Developed in Term 1</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2613\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y6ldw3\" data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2491\">Financial Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q89ff1\" data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2514\">Quantitative Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hk9mzp\" data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2535\">Python Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fv7qvx\" data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2561\">Investment Fundamentals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gxjgts\" data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2585\">Statistical Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bm1u3f\" data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2613\">Financial Decision-Making</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2618\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bsfnqc\" data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2675\">Term 2: Financial Analytics, Risk and Global Markets</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2838\">The second term focuses on data analytics, risk management, ethical finance, and understanding the global economic environment that influences financial markets.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"3452\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2872\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2872\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2850\" data-col-size=\"md\">Courses</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2872\" data-col-size=\"md\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"3452\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"3040\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"2949\" data-col-size=\"md\">Financial Data Analytics and Time Series</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"3040\">Financial forecasting, predictive modelling, market analytics, and time-series analysis</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3189\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3100\" data-col-size=\"md\">International Corporate Social Responsibility and Ethics</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3189\">ESG principles, ethical investing, sustainability, and responsible business practices</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3316\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3219\" data-col-size=\"md\">Technology Risk Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3316\">Cybersecurity risks, technology governance, digital finance risks, and operational resilience</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3452\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3356\" data-col-size=\"md\">Global Economy and Geopolitical Risk</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3452\">International economics, geopolitical events, market volatility, and global financial trends</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1g2eq74\" data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3479\">Why This Term Matters</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3724\">Financial institutions increasingly rely on data-driven insights to evaluate market movements, assess risks, and make strategic decisions. This term develops the analytical and risk management skills required in modern financial organizations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l4soxr\" data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3756\">Skills Developed in Term 2</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3903\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3o7y6f\" data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3784\">Financial Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sgkf19\" data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3802\">Risk Assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pmb3tj\" data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"3832\">ESG and Sustainable Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rvapn3\" data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3853\">Forecasting Models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1deypy5\" data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3882\">Geopolitical Risk Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f2a9a0\" data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"3903\">Financial Research</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3908\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dipkir\" data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"3958\">Term 3: AI Applications in Financial Services</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3960\" data-end=\"4100\">The third term introduces advanced technologies and their application across financial services, investment management, and digital banking.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4745\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4134\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4134\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4112\" data-col-size=\"md\">Courses</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4112\" data-end=\"4134\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4168\" data-end=\"4745\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4168\" data-end=\"4332\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4168\" data-end=\"4220\" data-col-size=\"md\">Natural Language Processing for Financial Markets</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4220\" data-end=\"4332\">AI-powered market sentiment analysis, text analytics, financial news interpretation, and predictive insights</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4463\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4375\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fintech Innovations and Digital Banking</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4375\" data-end=\"4463\">Digital payments, banking technologies, fintech ecosystems, and financial innovation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4605\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4505\" data-col-size=\"md\">Portfolio Management and Robo-Advisory</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4505\" data-end=\"4605\">Investment strategies, automated wealth management, asset allocation, and portfolio optimization</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4606\" data-end=\"4745\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4606\" data-end=\"4644\" data-col-size=\"md\">Corporate Governance and Compliance</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4644\" data-end=\"4745\">Regulatory frameworks, compliance management, governance structures, and financial accountability</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1l4soxq\" data-start=\"4747\" data-end=\"4777\">Skills Developed in Term 3</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4779\" data-end=\"4925\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"184pbd4\" data-start=\"4779\" data-end=\"4797\">Fintech Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jvyh0c\" data-start=\"4798\" data-end=\"4827\">NLP Applications in Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10codd\" data-start=\"4828\" data-end=\"4850\">Portfolio Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qzmoxe\" data-start=\"4851\" data-end=\"4879\">Digital Banking Operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bgxrbw\" data-start=\"4880\" data-end=\"4902\">Financial Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tk4akf\" data-start=\"4903\" data-end=\"4925\">Investment Analytics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4927\" data-end=\"4930\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dloqsd\" data-start=\"4932\" data-end=\"4979\">Term 4: Advanced AI and Quantitative Finance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4981\" data-end=\"5166\">The final term focuses on advanced artificial intelligence applications, algorithmic trading, blockchain technology, and real-world financial problem-solving through a capstone project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5776\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5200\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5200\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5178\" data-col-size=\"md\">Courses</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5178\" data-end=\"5200\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Key Learning Areas</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5234\" data-end=\"5776\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5234\" data-end=\"5376\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5234\" data-end=\"5276\" data-col-size=\"md\">Theories and Applications of Agentic AI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5276\" data-end=\"5376\">Autonomous AI systems, intelligent decision-making, AI agents, and future financial applications</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5377\" data-end=\"5520\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5377\" data-end=\"5427\" data-col-size=\"md\">Algorithmic Trading and Quantitative Strategies</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5427\" data-end=\"5520\">Trading algorithms, quantitative models, automated trading systems, and market strategies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5521\" data-end=\"5650\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5521\" data-end=\"5555\" data-col-size=\"md\">Blockchain and Digital Currency</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5555\" data-end=\"5650\">Cryptocurrency ecosystems, blockchain technology, digital assets, and decentralized finance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5651\" data-end=\"5776\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5651\" data-end=\"5670\" data-col-size=\"md\">Capstone Project</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5670\" data-end=\"5776\">Applied research, industry project, financial innovation challenge, or AI-finance solution development</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11g9e0s\" data-start=\"5778\" data-end=\"5809\">Capstone Project Experience</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5811\" data-end=\"5921\">The capstone project allows students to apply finance and AI concepts to solve real-world industry challenges.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5923\" data-end=\"5955\">Potential project areas include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5957\" data-end=\"6201\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eusyfm\" data-start=\"5957\" data-end=\"5985\">Algorithmic Trading Models</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vyr47y\" data-start=\"5986\" data-end=\"6019\">AI-Powered Investment Platforms</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k3dik4\" data-start=\"6020\" data-end=\"6046\">Financial Risk Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4wouvf\" data-start=\"6047\" data-end=\"6076\">Fintech Product Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a8vjir\" data-start=\"6077\" data-end=\"6115\">Blockchain-Based Financial Solutions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gk7r2d\" data-start=\"6116\" data-end=\"6148\">Predictive Financial Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3rgit5\" data-start=\"6149\" data-end=\"6177\">Digital Banking Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kkhani\" data-start=\"6178\" data-end=\"6201\">Robo-Advisory Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6203\" data-end=\"6320\">This practical experience strengthens technical, analytical, and strategic skills while enhancing industry readiness.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(479, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 350, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 03:47:53', '2026-06-01 03:47:53', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"531\">The <strong data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"172\">Online M.Sc. in Global Risk Management admission process at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify candidates with strong academic potential, professional aspirations, and an interest in building expertise in risk management, financial analysis, compliance, and business resilience. The admission process is straightforward and focuses on evaluating the overall profile of the applicant rather than relying solely on academic scores.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"682\">Whether you are a recent graduate or a working professional, following the admission steps carefully can help ensure a smooth application experience.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qupoa4\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"732\">Step 1: Complete the Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"1000\">Begin your application by filling out the online admission form with accurate personal, academic, and professional details. Applicants should ensure that all information provided is correct and matches the supporting documents submitted during the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gojyoh\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1039\">Step 2: Submit Academic Documents</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1168\">After completing the application form, candidates must upload the required documents for verification. These generally include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1370\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gt8d9c\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1218\">Graduation mark sheets and degree certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1241\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kvg7of\" data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1276\">Government-issued identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40xgv7\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1310\">Recent passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h62prn\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1370\">Other supporting documents, if required by the university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1464\">Providing complete and accurate documentation helps speed up the application review process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qei4un\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1515\">Step 3: Submit the Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1723\">Applicants are required to submit a <strong data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1583\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</strong> outlining their academic background, professional goals, interest in Global Risk Management, and reasons for choosing OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1872\">A strong SOP can significantly enhance an application by demonstrating clarity of career objectives and commitment to the field of risk management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1se8obw\" data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1927\">Step 4: Application Review and Profile Evaluation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"2046\">The admissions team conducts a comprehensive review of each application. During this stage, the university evaluates:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2188\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oy2id\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2070\">Academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n7w4a\" data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2093\">Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2116\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bjcsw\" data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2144\">Overall applicant profile</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12dtkup\" data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2188\">Professional experience, where applicable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2295\">This holistic evaluation process ensures that candidates are assessed beyond their academic scores alone.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1x5em65\" data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2351\">Step 5: JSAT and Interview Process (If Applicable)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2442\">Candidates with less than <strong data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2422\">50% marks in their undergraduate degree</strong> may be required to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2552\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l0fxyx\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2503\">Appear for the <strong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2503\">Jindal Scholastic Aptitude Test (JSAT)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rkb25p\" data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2552\">Participate in a mandatory admission interview</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2708\">The assessment helps the university evaluate the candidate\'s aptitude, motivation, and suitability for the Online M.Sc. in Global Risk Management program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tq19hh\" data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2767\">Step 6: Personal Interview for Shortlisted Candidates</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2898\">Based on the profile review, some applicants may be invited for a brief personal interview. The interview is conducted to assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"3022\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qn84m5\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2920\">Career aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vxrgnu\" data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2962\">Interest in risk management and finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"2985\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oa4iy9\" data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"3022\">Program fit and professional goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3121\">The interview forms an important part of the final admission decision for shortlisted candidates.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qjx0o8\" data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3178\">Step 7: Admission Offer and Enrollment Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3333\">Candidates who successfully complete the evaluation process receive an admission offer from OP Jindal University. To confirm enrollment, applicants must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3442\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yocdfk\" data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3363\">Accept the admission offer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"su6wdr\" data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3398\">Complete the fee payment process</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"glw9ur\" data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3442\">Submit any pending documents, if required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3578\">Once the verification and payment formalities are completed, admission to the <strong data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3564\">Online M.Sc. in Global Risk Management</strong> is confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1a4odlv\" data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3644\">Selection Criteria for Online M.Sc. in Global Risk Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3646\" data-end=\"3744\">Admission decisions are based on a comprehensive assessment of the applicant\'s profile, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3949\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w2oj56\" data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3782\">Academic performance in graduation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8flj6f\" data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3811\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"3812\" data-end=\"3834\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wozaz4\" data-start=\"3835\" data-end=\"3864\">Overall application quality</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ccynbx\" data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3902\">JSAT performance (where applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1px3mpy\" data-start=\"3903\" data-end=\"3949\">Personal interview performance (if required)</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"461\">Candidates seeking admission to the <strong data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"189\">Online M.Sc. in Global Risk Management at OP Jindal University</strong> must meet the university\'s academic requirements. The program is designed for graduates who want to build expertise in enterprise risk management, financial risk analysis, regulatory compliance, business resilience, and strategic decision-making across global industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"712\">Whether you are a recent graduate or a working professional looking to advance your career in risk management, finance, consulting, insurance, banking, or corporate governance, meeting the eligibility requirements is the first step toward admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1rzfg42\" data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"785\">Eligibility Requirements for Online M.Sc. in Global Risk Management</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"916\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"867\">OP Jindal University Online M.Sc. in Global Risk Management</strong>, candidates must fulfill the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1214\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g8vw58\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"978\">Hold an undergraduate degree from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eco5pz\" data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1039\">Secure a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1024\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in graduation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"195hcij\" data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1142\">Candidates from any academic discipline can apply, subject to the university\'s admission guidelines.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oth01h\" data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1214\">Working professionals and fresh graduates are both eligible to apply.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pkvxzc\" data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1271\">Eligibility for Candidates with Less Than 50% Marks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1425\">Applicants who have scored below 50% marks in their undergraduate degree may still be considered for admission through an additional evaluation process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1448\">Such candidates must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1670\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4ln93\" data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1510\">Appear for the <strong data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1509\">Jindal Scholastic Aptitude Test (JSAT)</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wfe277\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1577\">Successfully complete the mandatory admission interview process.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hhiw48\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1670\">Meet the performance standards prescribed by the university during the evaluation process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1844\">This pathway allows motivated learners to demonstrate their academic potential and suitability for the Online Global Risk Management program beyond their graduation scores.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1aouky9\" data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1887\">OP Jindal University Selection Process</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"2153\">Admission to the <strong data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1948\">Online M.Sc. in Global Risk Management</strong> is based on a holistic evaluation process rather than academic performance alone. The university assesses each applicant\'s academic background, career aspirations, and overall suitability for the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"str4c5\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2177\">Selection Criteria</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2233\">The admission committee evaluates candidates based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2498\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3fqqq4\" data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2286\">Academic performance in the undergraduate degree.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t7eexl\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2316\">Statement of Purpose (SOP).</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o2o6a6\" data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2365\">Academic transcripts and supporting documents.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11cyhpv\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2436\">Professional achievements and relevant experience, where applicable.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18d38pd\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2498\">Personal interview for shortlisted candidates, if required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16qyy7h\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2541\">Statement of Purpose (SOP) Importance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2652\">The Statement of Purpose plays an important role in the admission process. Applicants should clearly explain:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2852\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ai7su\" data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2697\">Their interest in Global Risk Management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12049zj\" data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2747\">Career objectives and professional aspirations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h08h9\" data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2792\">Reasons for choosing OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ch0n94\" data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2852\">How the program aligns with their long-term career goals.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"3042\">A well-written SOP can strengthen an application by highlighting the candidate\'s motivation, industry interests, and commitment to building expertise in risk management and related fields.</p>', '<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"495\">The <strong data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"151\">Online M.Sc. in Global Risk Management at OP Jindal University</strong> offers a flexible fee payment structure designed to make postgraduate education more accessible for graduates and working professionals. The program combines advanced learning in enterprise risk management, financial risk analysis, market risk, credit risk, and business resilience while providing convenient installment-based payment options.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"690\">Students can pay the program fee in scheduled installments, allowing them to plan their educational investment effectively while pursuing a globally relevant master\'s degree in risk management.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gjptvo\" data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"769\">OP Jindal University Online M.Sc. in Global Risk Management Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"1106\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"787\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"796\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"808\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"1106\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"916\">\r\n<td data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"868\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"881\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"916\">Upon acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"976\">\r\n<td data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"932\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"947\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"976\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1031\">\r\n<td data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"992\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1007\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1031\">By 15th January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1106\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1056\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1055\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1075\"><strong data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1074\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1106\">As per the payment schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1coibsr\" data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1137\">Fee Breakdown at a Glance</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1163\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1163\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1153\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1163\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1209\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1223\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1238\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1254\">INR 2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1275\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Program Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1291\">INR 2,75,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"564\">The <strong data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"147\">Online M.Sc. in Global Risk Management at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to prepare professionals for leadership roles in enterprise risk management, financial risk analysis, investment management, regulatory compliance, crisis management, and business resilience. The curriculum combines theoretical knowledge with practical applications, helping learners understand how organizations identify, assess, manage, and mitigate risks in an increasingly complex global environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"903\">Aligned with globally recognized risk management practices and incorporating key concepts from the <strong data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"697\">Financial Risk Manager (FRM)</strong> body of knowledge, the program equips students with expertise in financial markets, quantitative risk analysis, market risk, credit risk, operational risk, geopolitical risk, and strategic decision-making.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7cb7o6\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"971\">Term 1: Foundations of Enterprise and Financial Risk Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1224\">The first term establishes a strong foundation in risk management principles, quantitative analysis, financial systems, and organizational behavior. Students gain a comprehensive understanding of how risks impact businesses and financial institutions.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1236\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1251\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1554\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1334\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1333\">Principles of Enterprise Risk Management (FRM 1)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1554\">Introduces enterprise-wide risk management frameworks, risk identification techniques, risk assessment methodologies, and governance structures used by organizations to manage uncertainty and improve decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1806\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1628\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1627\">Financial Mathematics &amp; Statistics (Quantitative Analysis) (FRM 1)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1806\">Develops analytical and quantitative skills required for financial risk measurement, probability analysis, statistical modeling, forecasting, and data-driven decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"2038\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1853\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1852\">Financial Markets &amp; Instruments (FRM 1)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"2038\">Covers the structure and functioning of global financial markets, including equity, debt, derivatives, and fixed-income instruments used for investment and risk management purposes.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2083\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2082\">Organizational Structures &amp; Behaviour</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2249\">Examines organizational design, leadership styles, workplace behavior, team dynamics, and decision-making processes that influence risk culture within businesses.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1527zyi\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2313\">Term 2: Risk Models, Ethics, and Global Business Challenges</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2510\">The second term focuses on advanced risk assessment models, ethical business practices, technology-related risks, and the impact of global economic and geopolitical developments on organizations.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"3414\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2537\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2537\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2522\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2537\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"3414\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2761\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2603\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2602\">Valuation &amp; Risk Models (FRM 1)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2761\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Explores valuation techniques, risk measurement frameworks, forecasting models, and financial analysis tools used to assess business and investment risks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2983\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2823\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2822\">International Corporate Social Responsibility &amp; Ethics</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2983\">Develops understanding of ethical decision-making, sustainability practices, corporate governance, and responsible business conduct in a global environment.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3201\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3017\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"3016\">Technology Risk Management</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3201\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Covers cybersecurity risks, digital transformation challenges, information security, data privacy regulations, and technology governance strategies adopted by modern organizations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3414\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3243\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3242\">Global Economy &amp; Geopolitical Risk</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3414\">Examines economic trends, international trade dynamics, political uncertainty, and geopolitical events that influence global business operations and financial markets.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1iq57kw\" data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3477\">Term 3: Advanced Financial Risk and Operational Resilience</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3479\" data-end=\"3735\">This term provides in-depth knowledge of financial risk management techniques used by banks, investment firms, multinational corporations, and consulting organizations. Students learn how to manage liquidity, market volatility, and operational disruptions.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"4676\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3762\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3762\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3747\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3762\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"4676\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3992\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3844\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3843\">Risk Management &amp; Investment Management (FRM 2)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3992\">Focuses on portfolio construction, investment strategies, asset allocation, and techniques used to evaluate and manage investment-related risks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3993\" data-end=\"4231\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3993\" data-end=\"4058\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"4057\">Liquidity &amp; Treasury Risk Measurement &amp; Management (FRM 2)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4058\" data-end=\"4231\">Covers treasury operations, cash flow management, liquidity planning, funding risks, and financial stability strategies used by organizations and financial institutions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4449\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4283\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4282\">Market Risk Measurement &amp; Management (FRM 2)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4283\" data-end=\"4449\">Introduces methods for assessing market volatility, interest rate risk, foreign exchange risk, and other market-related exposures affecting investment portfolios.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4676\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4509\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4508\">Operational &amp; Supply Chain Risk &amp; Resilience (FRM 2)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4509\" data-end=\"4676\">Explores operational risk management, supply chain disruptions, business continuity planning, and resilience strategies for sustainable organizational performance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bphd59\" data-start=\"4678\" data-end=\"4750\">Term 4: Credit Risk, Crisis Leadership, and Strategic Risk Governance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4752\" data-end=\"4987\">The final term focuses on specialized risk domains and strategic leadership capabilities. Students learn to manage financial uncertainty, respond to crises, and apply risk governance principles through a comprehensive capstone project.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4989\" data-end=\"5962\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4989\" data-end=\"5014\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4989\" data-end=\"5014\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4989\" data-end=\"4999\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4999\" data-end=\"5014\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5962\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5260\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5093\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5092\">Credit Risk Measurement &amp; Management (FRM 2)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"5093\" data-end=\"5260\">Covers credit analysis, borrower assessment, default risk evaluation, credit scoring models, and risk mitigation techniques used in lending and financial services.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5261\" data-end=\"5481\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5261\" data-end=\"5309\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"5263\" data-end=\"5308\">Strategic Leadership in Crisis Management</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"5309\" data-end=\"5481\">Develops leadership capabilities required to manage organizational crises, make critical decisions under uncertainty, and ensure business continuity during disruptions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5482\" data-end=\"5696\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5482\" data-end=\"5532\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"5484\" data-end=\"5531\">Current Issues in Financial Markets (FRM 2)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"5532\" data-end=\"5696\">Examines emerging trends, regulatory developments, market disruptions, and evolving challenges impacting global financial systems and risk management practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5697\" data-end=\"5962\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5697\" data-end=\"5764\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"5699\" data-end=\"5763\">Capstone (Case on Risk Architecture &amp; Financial Regulations)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"5764\" data-end=\"5962\">Provides hands-on exposure to real-world risk scenarios, financial regulations, governance frameworks, and enterprise risk architecture through case-based analysis and strategic recommendations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(480, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 351, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 03:57:06', '2026-06-01 03:57:06', '<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"609\">The <strong data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"158\">Online M.Sc. in Family Business admission process at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify aspiring family business leaders, entrepreneurs, and next-generation successors who have the vision and commitment to create meaningful impact within their family enterprises. Unlike conventional postgraduate admissions, the selection process focuses not only on academic qualifications but also on business involvement, leadership potential, and the applicant\'s ability to execute a strategic business transformation project.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"802\">The admission process follows a holistic evaluation approach that assesses the applicant\'s family business background, professional experience, project proposal, and long-term business goals.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ze8s1k\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"846\">Step 1: Check Eligibility Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"933\">Before applying, candidates should ensure they meet the program eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"951\">Applicants must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1310\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uh110j\" data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1027\">Hold a Bachelor\'s degree or equivalent diploma/vocational qualification.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jbaalc\" data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1105\">Be actively involved in a family-owned business or entrepreneurial venture.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lpbkq3\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1226\">Demonstrate a clear intention to contribute to the growth, transformation, or sustainability of the family enterprise.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l1fyvj\" data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1310\">Have a defined Strategic Impact Project that can be developed during the program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1439\">Candidates with 1&ndash;3 years of professional experience after graduation are preferred, although work experience is not mandatory.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"r4ksmn\" data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1489\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1610\">Eligible candidates must submit the online application form with accurate personal, academic, and professional details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1671\">Applicants should carefully provide information related to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1838\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1701\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1490umu\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1730\">Family business background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pgzedp\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1766\">Current business responsibilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eejxr1\" data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1792\">Professional experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r18i3t\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1838\">Leadership and entrepreneurial achievements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1931\">Ensuring complete and accurate information helps streamline the application review process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k2q2f1\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1985\">Step 3: Prepare and Submit the Application Essay</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2174\">A key component of the admission process is the Application Essay, which enables the admissions committee to understand the applicant\'s family business context and leadership aspirations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2199\">The essay should cover:</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2230\">Family Business Overview</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2274\">Applicants must provide details regarding:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2539\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ulk3e2\" data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2308\">History of the family business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i789hy\" data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2348\">Nature of the industry and operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1z0bi68\" data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2397\">Business size, assets, turnover, and workforce</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ca2quq\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2430\">Number of generations involved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rlspwn\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2479\">Family members participating in the enterprise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w6txfz\" data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2539\">Applicant\'s role and responsibilities within the business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2579\">Strategic Impact Project Proposal</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2669\">Candidates must outline a business initiative they intend to pursue through the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2699\">The proposal should include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2876\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b5tjk7\" data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2733\">Project background and context</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dgmk79\" data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2759\">Key business objectives</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137ff4t\" data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2796\">Expected impact and value creation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uum1wf\" data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2827\">Current stage of development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hjkmfp\" data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2876\">Strategic importance for the family enterprise</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"3040\">Projects may focus on business expansion, governance reforms, digital transformation, succession planning, innovation, wealth management, or new venture creation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1y7jorh\" data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3081\">Step 4: Submit Supporting Documents</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3164\">Applicants are required to upload the necessary documents for profile evaluation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3166\" data-end=\"3190\">These typically include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3393\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7rr2k5\" data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3231\">Academic certificates and transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xcmbjv\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3263\">Updated curriculum vitae (CV)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9yt0qi\" data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3280\">Identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wby98i\" data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3332\">Professional experience documents (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14iih3j\" data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3352\">Application Essay</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"108oybg\" data-start=\"3353\" data-end=\"3393\">Project-related supporting information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3472\">All documents should be submitted within the prescribed application timeline.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wfnkcj\" data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3534\">Step 5: Submit Statement of Support from Project Sponsor</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3677\">A distinctive feature of the <strong data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3623\">OP Jindal University Family Business admission process</strong> is the requirement for a project sponsor or champion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3679\" data-end=\"3716\">The statement should clearly mention:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3903\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sictb3\" data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3756\">Sponsor\'s identity and business role</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qu5w8r\" data-start=\"3757\" data-end=\"3786\">Relationship to the project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u0o009\" data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3815\">Expected business outcomes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qf95u3\" data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3855\">Resources committed to the initiative</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nef1e8\" data-start=\"3856\" data-end=\"3903\">Implementation timeline and support structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3995\">This ensures that the proposed project has organizational backing and practical relevance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"r7sltg\" data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4041\">Step 6: Comprehensive Application Review</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4160\">Once all documents are submitted, the admissions committee conducts a detailed evaluation of the applicant\'s profile.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4162\" data-end=\"4184\">The review focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4421\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1378l5v\" data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4207\">Academic background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ldj1xn\" data-start=\"4208\" data-end=\"4237\">Family business involvement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19vjxh3\" data-start=\"4238\" data-end=\"4265\">Professional achievements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8v7wdd\" data-start=\"4266\" data-end=\"4288\">Leadership potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"od25pu\" data-start=\"4289\" data-end=\"4317\">Strategic thinking ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p5au4s\" data-start=\"4318\" data-end=\"4351\">Quality of the project proposal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mm4143\" data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4379\">Long-term business vision</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ewv0ge\" data-start=\"4380\" data-end=\"4421\">Sponsor support and project feasibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4423\" data-end=\"4544\">The university adopts a holistic selection process to identify candidates capable of creating measurable business impact.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x6zidp\" data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4593\">Step 7: Admission Decision and Offer Letter</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4595\" data-end=\"4705\">Candidates who successfully meet the evaluation criteria receive an admission offer from OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4707\" data-end=\"4729\">The offer is based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4731\" data-end=\"4895\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zz4c7b\" data-start=\"4731\" data-end=\"4760\">Strength of the application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"irboiv\" data-start=\"4761\" data-end=\"4797\">Strategic impact project potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17t0iw7\" data-start=\"4798\" data-end=\"4823\">Family business context</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1raq07a\" data-start=\"4824\" data-end=\"4859\">Professional and academic profile</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsjb8d\" data-start=\"4860\" data-end=\"4895\">Alignment with program objectives</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4897\" data-end=\"4989\">Selected candidates receive an official admission offer outlining the next enrollment steps.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"colj1m\" data-start=\"4991\" data-end=\"5042\">Step 8: Fee Payment and Enrollment Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5081\">To secure admission, candidates must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5083\" data-end=\"5228\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yocdfk\" data-start=\"5083\" data-end=\"5111\">Accept the admission offer</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14vf35c\" data-start=\"5112\" data-end=\"5151\">Complete the registration formalities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1utj62d\" data-start=\"5152\" data-end=\"5185\">Pay the applicable program fees</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gpea5r\" data-start=\"5186\" data-end=\"5228\">Submit any pending documents if required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5230\" data-end=\"5344\">After successful verification and fee payment, enrollment in the <strong data-start=\"5295\" data-end=\"5330\">Online M.Sc. in Family Business</strong> is confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"waeb7s\" data-start=\"5346\" data-end=\"5403\">Selection Criteria for Online M.Sc. in Family Business</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5405\" data-end=\"5468\">Admission decisions are based on a comprehensive assessment of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5470\" data-end=\"5736\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"5470\" data-end=\"5495\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1490umu\" data-start=\"5496\" data-end=\"5524\">Family business background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14iih3j\" data-start=\"5525\" data-end=\"5544\">Application Essay</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oaovnf\" data-start=\"5545\" data-end=\"5580\">Strategic Impact Project proposal</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jnka02\" data-start=\"5581\" data-end=\"5623\">Professional experience and achievements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h8oknh\" data-start=\"5624\" data-end=\"5666\">Leadership and entrepreneurial potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vq9kb2\" data-start=\"5667\" data-end=\"5694\">Sponsor support statement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gfr4r3\" data-start=\"5695\" data-end=\"5736\">Overall fit with the program objectives</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"602\">The <strong data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"143\">Online M.Sc. in Family Business at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for next-generation family business leaders, entrepreneurs, business owners, and family enterprise members who aspire to drive growth, innovation, succession planning, governance, and long-term wealth creation. Unlike traditional postgraduate management programs, this specialized master\'s degree focuses on helping learners create measurable strategic impact within their family businesses through real-world projects and leadership development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"783\">The program welcomes individuals who are actively involved in a family-owned enterprise and are committed to contributing to its future growth, transformation, and sustainability.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1t0qhsp\" data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"849\">Eligibility Requirements for Online M.Sc. in Family Business</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"974\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"924\">OP Jindal University Online M.Sc. in Family Business</strong>, applicants must meet the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1444\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q7q1f5\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1079\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1048\">Bachelor\'s degree or equivalent diploma/vocational training</strong> from a recognized institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sd2f9u\" data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1156\">Be an active member of an entrepreneurial family or family-owned business.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1srvrkr\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1263\">Demonstrate a genuine intention to scale, strengthen, or transform some aspect of the family enterprise.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fevfki\" data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1349\">Have a clearly defined <strong data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1317\">Strategic Impact Project</strong> related to the family business.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1klvmtn\" data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1444\">Be willing to apply program learning directly to real business challenges and opportunities.<br>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xaibom\" data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1486\">Strategic Impact Project Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1726\">A unique feature of the Online M.Sc. in Family Business admission process is the requirement for a strategic impact project. Applicants should identify a business initiative that can contribute meaningful value to their family enterprise.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1745\">Examples include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"2053\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c9p4z4\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1784\">Business transformation initiatives</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m78m7g\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1810\">New venture development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ysv64o\" data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1842\">Family governance enhancement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yhsaf9\" data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1876\">Digital transformation projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1auwgnc\" data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1906\">Market expansion strategies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"114c8xa\" data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1953\">Wealth creation and preservation initiatives</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dkxv8x\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1986\">Succession planning frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j32g55\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2019\">Innovation and growth projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kwz129\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2053\">Operational excellence programs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2161\">The project should have clearly defined objectives, measurable outcomes, and long-term business relevance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19b5nx8\" data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2192\">Preferred Work Experience</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2258\">While not mandatory, the university prefers applicants who have:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2556\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14dn0vj\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2364\">Approximately <strong data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2316\">1&ndash;3 years of professional experience</strong> after completing their undergraduate education.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d6k6nc\" data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2468\">Exposure to family business operations, entrepreneurship, management, or leadership responsibilities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13rngrc\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2556\">Experience contributing to business growth, innovation, or strategic decision-making.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2721\">This experience can strengthen an applicant\'s ability to engage with advanced concepts in family business management, entrepreneurship, governance, and leadership.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"i6sua8\" data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2779\">Selection Process for Online M.Sc. in Family Business</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"3093\">Admission to the <strong data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2854\">OP Jindal University Online M.Sc. in Family Business</strong> is based on a comprehensive profile evaluation rather than academic performance alone. The university assesses each applicant\'s family business background, leadership potential, project vision, and commitment to creating strategic impact.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pdi11p\" data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3129\">Application Essay Requirements</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3217\">Applicants must submit a detailed application essay covering the following components.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hfj6s6\" data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3251\">Family Business Introduction</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3329\">Candidates should provide an overview of their family enterprise, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3331\" data-end=\"3692\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5j2rym\" data-start=\"3331\" data-end=\"3370\">History and evolution of the business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sn59qn\" data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3406\">Industry and nature of operations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m9hxfc\" data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3432\">Business size and scale</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ldhz6f\" data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3482\">Revenue turnover, assets, and workforce details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ca2quq\" data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3515\">Number of generations involved</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18qy1lo\" data-start=\"3516\" data-end=\"3579\">Family members and stakeholders participating in the business</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11k9aey\" data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3630\">Applicant\'s current role within the organization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e4vinz\" data-start=\"3631\" data-end=\"3692\">Applicant\'s generation within the family business structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3816\">This section helps the admissions committee understand the context and complexity of the applicant\'s business environment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1atcw51\" data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3855\">Strategic Impact Project Proposal</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3947\">Applicants must present a proposed project that they intend to develop during the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3949\" data-end=\"3977\">The proposal should explain:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4236\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ogqc2p\" data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4020\">Project background and business context</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7us8pb\" data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4059\">Key objectives and expected outcomes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zdwogl\" data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4107\">Strategic importance to the family enterprise</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iwf4zy\" data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4155\">Estimated business value and impact potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qc45ox\" data-start=\"4156\" data-end=\"4236\">Current stage of development, whether exploration, planning, or implementation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4238\" data-end=\"4367\">A well-defined project demonstrates the applicant\'s ability to connect academic learning with real-world business transformation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zwpy0v\" data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4418\">Applicant Profile and Professional Background</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4420\" data-end=\"4481\">Candidates are required to submit an updated CV highlighting:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4483\" data-end=\"4672\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"4483\" data-end=\"4511\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eejxr1\" data-start=\"4512\" data-end=\"4537\">Professional experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17akyor\" data-start=\"4538\" data-end=\"4567\">Leadership responsibilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v8c2g0\" data-start=\"4568\" data-end=\"4597\">Entrepreneurial initiatives</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ezwgca\" data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4621\">Business achievements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10pbd40\" data-start=\"4622\" data-end=\"4672\">Awards, recognitions, or notable accomplishments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4674\" data-end=\"4784\">This helps the university evaluate the applicant\'s readiness for a leadership-focused family business program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15hxwyw\" data-start=\"4786\" data-end=\"4843\">Statement of Support from Project Sponsor or Champion</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4845\" data-end=\"4976\">Applicants must also provide a statement from a project sponsor, mentor, or business champion who supports the proposed initiative.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4978\" data-end=\"5007\">The statement should include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5232\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sictb3\" data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5047\">Sponsor\'s identity and business role</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nxppaa\" data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5079\">Relationship with the project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5nowjj\" data-start=\"5080\" data-end=\"5107\">Desired business outcomes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgz2hk\" data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5143\">Expected impact of the initiative</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n19c2u\" data-start=\"5144\" data-end=\"5192\">Resources and support committed to the project</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17xtxop\" data-start=\"5193\" data-end=\"5232\">Proposed timelines for implementation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5234\" data-end=\"5341\">This requirement ensures that the project has organizational backing and a realistic pathway for execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"554\">The <strong data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"137\">Online M.Sc. in Family Business at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for entrepreneurs, family business owners, successors, and next-generation leaders who want to build expertise in family business management, succession planning, governance, entrepreneurship, wealth management, and business transformation. The program offers a flexible fee structure that allows learners to invest in their professional and business growth through convenient installment-based payments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"766\">With a curriculum focused on real-world family business challenges and strategic impact projects, the program delivers significant value for individuals seeking to strengthen and scale their family enterprises.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18u7eun\" data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"838\">OP Jindal University Online M.Sc. in Family Business Fee Structure</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"1175\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"877\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"877\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"856\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"865\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"877\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"1175\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"986\">\r\n<td data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"938\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"951\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"986\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1046\">\r\n<td data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1002\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1017\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1046\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1062\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1077\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">By 15th January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1175\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1126\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1125\">Total Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1145\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1144\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1175\" data-col-size=\"sm\">As Per University Schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d6uabw\" data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1192\">Fee Summary</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1354\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1208\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1218\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1354\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1264\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1278\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1309\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1293\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1309\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1354\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1334\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1333\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1354\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1352\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k1e8kr\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1391\">What Does the Program Fee Cover?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1637\">The <strong data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1446\">Online M.Sc. in Family Business fee structure</strong> supports access to a specialized curriculum focused on family enterprise growth, governance, entrepreneurship, succession planning, wealth management, innovation, and leadership development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1665\">Students gain exposure to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5jnf9\" data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1706\">Family Business Strategy and Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10vbd2n\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1740\">Entrepreneurship and Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fs45f8\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1784\">Succession Planning and Estate Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v603fm\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1819\">Family Governance and Leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lr4hph\" data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1857\">Family Office and Wealth Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11y6i82\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1903\">Digital Transformation in Family Businesses</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d7huv6\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1940\">Venture Capital and Private Equity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g7w3wz\" data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1981\">Risk Management for Family Enterprises</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8jq12c\" data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2020\">Strategic Impact Project Development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2199\">The program is designed to help learners apply academic concepts directly within their own family businesses, creating measurable organizational impact during the course itself.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"574\">The <strong data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"133\">Online M.Sc. in Family Business at OP Jindal University</strong> is a specialized postgraduate program designed for entrepreneurs, next-generation business leaders, family business owners, and professionals seeking expertise in family enterprise management. The curriculum combines business strategy, entrepreneurship, innovation, succession planning, wealth management, governance, and leadership to help learners successfully manage and grow family-owned businesses in a rapidly evolving global economy.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"1013\">Unlike traditional management programs, this curriculum focuses on the unique challenges faced by family enterprises, including business continuity, generational transition, governance structures, wealth preservation, innovation, and long-term value creation. Students gain practical insights into modern business leadership while developing the strategic capabilities required to sustain and expand family businesses across generations.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qim9ua\" data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1067\">Term 1: Foundations of Family Business Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1336\">The first term introduces students to the fundamentals of family business management, strategic thinking, and business planning. Learners develop a strong understanding of how successful family enterprises are structured, managed, and positioned for long-term growth.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"2066\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1363\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1363\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1348\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1363\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"2066\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1643\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1429\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1428\">Introduction to Family Business</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1643\">Provides an overview of family-owned enterprises, their unique characteristics, governance structures, growth challenges, and the factors that contribute to long-term business sustainability across generations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1873\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1686\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1685\">Design Thinking for Family Business</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1873\">Introduces innovation-driven problem-solving approaches that help family businesses improve customer experiences, develop new business models, and adapt to changing market conditions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"2066\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1911\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1910\">Business Strategy and Planning</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"2066\">Focuses on strategic decision-making, competitive positioning, business growth planning, and sustainable value creation for family-owned organizations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hc79qr\" data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2136\">Term 2: Entrepreneurship, Innovation, and Business Transformation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2354\">The second term explores entrepreneurial thinking, innovation management, risk assessment, and digital transformation strategies that help family businesses remain competitive in today\'s dynamic business environment.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"3291\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2381\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2381\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2366\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2381\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"3291\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2447\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2446\">Entrepreneurship and Innovation</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2626\">Covers opportunity identification, venture creation, innovation strategies, business model development, and entrepreneurial leadership essential for modern family enterprises.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2843\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2678\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2677\">Risk Management in Startups and Family Firms</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2843\">Examines financial, operational, strategic, and market risks faced by startups and family-owned businesses while developing practical risk mitigation strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"3058\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2903\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2902\">Finance &amp; Accounting for Entrepreneurs (Elective 2A)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"3058\">Develops financial management skills including budgeting, cash flow management, financial analysis, and investment decision-making for business growth.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3291\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3121\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3120\">Digital Transformation in Family Business (Elective 2B)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3291\">Explores digital technologies, business automation, data-driven decision-making, digital marketing, and transformation strategies that support business modernization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xsddtj\" data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3355\">Term 3: Wealth Creation, Succession, and Business Expansion</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3535\">This term focuses on preserving family wealth, planning leadership transitions, and exploring advanced growth strategies that support long-term business continuity and expansion.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"4443\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3562\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3562\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3547\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3562\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"4443\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3794\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3630\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3629\">Family Office &amp; Wealth Management</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3794\">Introduces wealth preservation strategies, investment planning, asset management, family office structures, and financial decision-making for business families.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3795\" data-end=\"4015\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3795\" data-end=\"3841\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3840\">Succession Planning &amp; Estate Management</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3841\" data-end=\"4015\">Covers leadership transition planning, succession frameworks, inheritance planning, estate management, and strategies for ensuring business continuity across generations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4233\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4080\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4018\" data-end=\"4079\">Mergers &amp; Acquisitions in Family Businesses (Elective 3A)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4233\">Examines business valuation, mergers, acquisitions, strategic partnerships, and expansion opportunities that support long-term organizational growth.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4443\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4287\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4286\">Venture Capital &amp; Private Equity (Elective 3B)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4287\" data-end=\"4443\">Provides insights into startup funding, venture capital investments, private equity financing, fundraising strategies, and growth capital opportunities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15bkfq5\" data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4500\">Term 4: Governance, Leadership, and Capstone Project</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4682\">The final term develops leadership capabilities and governance expertise required to manage complex family enterprises while ensuring sustainable growth and organizational harmony.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4684\" data-end=\"5193\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4684\" data-end=\"4709\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4684\" data-end=\"4709\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4684\" data-end=\"4694\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4694\" data-end=\"4709\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4737\" data-end=\"5193\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4737\" data-end=\"4959\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4737\" data-end=\"4774\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4739\" data-end=\"4773\">Family Governance &amp; Leadership</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4774\" data-end=\"4959\">Focuses on governance frameworks, leadership development, conflict resolution, family constitutions, decision-making structures, and stakeholder management within family businesses.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"5193\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"4983\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4962\" data-end=\"4982\">Capstone Project</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4983\" data-end=\"5193\">Provides practical exposure through an industry-oriented project where students apply concepts related to family business management, entrepreneurship, governance, succession planning, and strategic growth.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(481, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 352, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 04:29:11', '2026-06-01 04:29:11', '<p data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"580\">The <strong data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"186\">Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies admission process at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify passionate learners who are interested in museums, cultural heritage, conservation, curation, heritage management, and cultural research. Unlike traditional admission processes that focus primarily on academic scores, this program places significant emphasis on the applicant\'s motivation, career aspirations, and commitment to the field of heritage and museum studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"780\">The admission process is straightforward, allowing students and professionals from diverse academic backgrounds to apply and demonstrate their interest in preserving and promoting cultural heritage.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"823\" data-section-id=\"1kzovtn\">Step 1: Check Eligibility Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"912\">Before applying, candidates should ensure they meet the program\'s eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"930\">Applicants must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<li data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"988\" data-section-id=\"hlf6v\">Hold a Bachelor\'s degree from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1101\" data-section-id=\"16wqtmb\">Have an interest in museums, heritage studies, conservation, curation, cultural management, or related fields.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1188\" data-section-id=\"18a2bc2\">Be prepared to submit a Statement of Purpose (SOP) as part of the admission process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1328\">The program welcomes applicants from various academic disciplines, making it accessible to both fresh graduates and working professionals.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1377\" data-section-id=\"107tu6k\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1502\">Eligible candidates must submit the online application form with accurate personal, academic, and professional information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1540\">Applicants should carefully provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1680\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1560\" data-section-id=\"t7bwlu\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1589\" data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1611\" data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1630\" data-section-id=\"zwhvvz\">Academic history</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1680\" data-section-id=\"tmpiqo\">Relevant professional experience, if applicable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1777\">Providing complete and accurate information helps facilitate a smooth admission review process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1839\" data-section-id=\"clfzmu\">Step 3: Prepare and Submit the Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"2016\">A crucial part of the <strong data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1951\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies admission process</strong> is the submission of a <strong data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2015\">Statement of Purpose (600&ndash;800 words)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2049\">The SOP should clearly explain:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2362\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2101\" data-section-id=\"2hyiy1\">Your interest in Museology and Heritage Studies.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2141\" data-section-id=\"16s8qy5\">Academic and professional background.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2173\" data-section-id=\"1npfl5a\">Career goals and aspirations.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2263\" data-section-id=\"mtevix\">Interest in museums, cultural heritage, conservation, curation, or cultural management.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2308\" data-section-id=\"2h08h9\">Reasons for choosing OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2362\" data-section-id=\"1srfrrj\">How the program aligns with your future objectives.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2522\">A thoughtful and well-structured SOP allows applicants to showcase their passion for cultural heritage and demonstrate their readiness for postgraduate study.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2562\" data-section-id=\"vbkd49\">Step 4: Upload Supporting Documents</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2662\">Candidates are required to submit the necessary documents for verification and profile evaluation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2700\">Typically, applicants should upload:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2936\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2733\" data-section-id=\"1rvomy9\">Graduation degree certificate</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2772\" data-section-id=\"117dusa\">Academic transcripts and mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2807\" data-section-id=\"1kvg7of\">Government-issued identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2841\" data-section-id=\"40xgv7\">Recent passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2870\" data-section-id=\"8flj6f\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2936\" data-section-id=\"144qkdz\">Additional supporting documents, if requested by the university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"3034\">Ensuring all documents are complete and accurate can help avoid delays in the admission process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3080\" data-section-id=\"1tesy9x\">Step 5: Application Review and Evaluation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3227\">Once the application and supporting documents are submitted, the admissions committee conducts a comprehensive review of the candidate\'s profile.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3264\">The evaluation generally considers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3430\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3291\" data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3329\" data-section-id=\"14whrwn\">Quality of the Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3371\" data-section-id=\"1y1z5wc\">Interest in museum and heritage studies</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3392\" data-section-id=\"qn84m5\">Career aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3430\" data-section-id=\"3pbnzc\">Overall suitability for the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3593\">The university follows a holistic assessment approach to identify applicants who demonstrate a strong commitment to the field of museology and cultural heritage.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"3624\" data-section-id=\"cbmjoi\">Step 6: Admission Decision</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3736\">Following the evaluation process, eligible candidates receive an admission decision from OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3738\" data-end=\"3764\">The selection is based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3910\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3807\" data-section-id=\"1scqtlu\">Fulfillment of eligibility requirements</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3846\" data-section-id=\"1gsmazz\">Strength of the Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"3868\" data-section-id=\"1378l5v\">Academic background</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3869\" data-end=\"3910\" data-section-id=\"33o0i8\">Alignment with the program\'s objectives</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3912\" data-end=\"3990\">Successful applicants receive an official admission offer from the university.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4042\" data-section-id=\"1jp3gp2\">Step 7: Fee Payment and Enrollment Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4044\" data-end=\"4090\">To secure admission, selected candidates must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4202\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4121\" data-section-id=\"7tjfou\">Accept the admission offer.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4157\" data-section-id=\"s9uyxt\">Complete the fee payment process.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4202\" data-section-id=\"1eusne5\">Submit any pending documents, if required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4204\" data-end=\"4370\">Once the university verifies all requirements and payment formalities are completed, enrollment in the <strong data-start=\"4307\" data-end=\"4356\">Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies</strong> is confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4443\" data-section-id=\"eqtj3q\">Selection Criteria for Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4586\">Admission to the program is based on a comprehensive review of the applicant\'s profile, with particular emphasis on the Statement of Purpose.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4620\">The selection process evaluates:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4622\" data-end=\"4874\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4622\" data-end=\"4643\" data-section-id=\"1378l5v\">Academic background</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4644\" data-end=\"4687\" data-section-id=\"wwhoyq\">Interest in museums and cultural heritage</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4725\" data-section-id=\"130ct5n\">Motivation for pursuing the program</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4726\" data-end=\"4769\" data-section-id=\"2e3yj\">Career goals and professional aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4770\" data-end=\"4819\" data-section-id=\"p2til0\">Quality and clarity of the Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4820\" data-end=\"4874\" data-section-id=\"1j75c9n\">Overall alignment with the objectives of the program</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"668\">The <strong data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"171\">Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for students, researchers, heritage enthusiasts, museum professionals, cultural practitioners, and working professionals who wish to build expertise in museum studies, heritage conservation, cultural management, curation, and heritage research. The program provides a strong academic foundation in cultural heritage preservation while equipping learners with the practical skills required for careers in museums, galleries, archives, cultural institutions, and heritage organizations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"900\">Whether you aspire to work in museum curation, heritage management, conservation, cultural tourism, or heritage research, meeting the eligibility requirements is the first step toward joining this specialized postgraduate program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ek62xn\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"975\">Eligibility Criteria for Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1116\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1064\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies</strong>, candidates must fulfill the following requirement:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1352\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uyci7b\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1178\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1177\">Bachelor\'s degree from a recognized university</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v0ovar\" data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1243\">Candidates from any academic discipline are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gpd0v2\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1352\">Fresh graduates, researchers, heritage professionals, and working professionals can apply for the program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1590\">The interdisciplinary nature of the program makes it suitable for applicants from humanities, social sciences, history, archaeology, fine arts, architecture, tourism, cultural studies, management, and other related academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eo7kda\" data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1629\">Who Should Apply for This Program?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1863\">The <strong data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1684\">Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies</strong> is ideal for individuals who are passionate about preserving cultural heritage and promoting historical awareness through museums, galleries, archives, and cultural institutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1907\">This program is particularly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"2372\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ehq5uu\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1974\">Graduates interested in Museum Studies and Heritage Management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b7lenz\" data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2037\">Museum and Gallery Professionals seeking advanced knowledge.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fzenlq\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2067\">Historians and Researchers.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17jhate\" data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2120\">Archaeology and Heritage Conservation Enthusiasts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n44glf\" data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2166\">Cultural Resource Management Professionals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1341s9t\" data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2204\">Art and Cultural Studies Graduates.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"194o1nf\" data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2251\">Tourism and Cultural Heritage Professionals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vb8c22\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2305\">Archivists and Collection Management Professionals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9hqk4h\" data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2372\">Individuals interested in Museum Curation and Exhibition Design.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"li1mum\" data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2444\">Selection Process for Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2681\">Admission to the <strong data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2533\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies</strong> is based on a qualitative assessment of the applicant\'s academic background, motivation, and interest in the field of museums and heritage studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2887\">A key component of the admission process is the <strong data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2761\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</strong>, which allows applicants to demonstrate their passion, career aspirations, and understanding of the cultural heritage sector.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"omgi1y\" data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2931\">Statement of Purpose (SOP) Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"3011\">Applicants must submit a <strong data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2999\">Statement of Purpose of 600&ndash;800 words</strong> explaining:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3418\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11v88ze\" data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3064\">Their interest in Museology and Heritage Studies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s8qy5\" data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3104\">Academic and professional background.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rpql1\" data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3143\">Motivation for pursuing the program.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vur50r\" data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3182\">Career goals and future aspirations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mt2qm3\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3284\">Areas of interest within museums, heritage management, conservation, curation, or cultural studies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h08h9\" data-start=\"3285\" data-end=\"3329\">Reasons for choosing OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vfftjn\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3418\">How the program will contribute to their professional growth and long-term objectives.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3554\">The SOP helps the admissions committee assess the applicant\'s commitment to the field and their potential to benefit from the program.</p>', '<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"593\">The <strong data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"165\">Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for students, researchers, museum professionals, cultural practitioners, and heritage enthusiasts who want to build expertise in museum studies, heritage conservation, cultural management, exhibition curation, and heritage research. The program offers a flexible tuition payment structure, allowing learners to invest in a specialized postgraduate degree while balancing their academic and professional commitments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"901\">With a curriculum that combines heritage preservation, museum management, digital heritage technologies, curatorial practice, and field-based learning, the program provides a strong foundation for careers in museums, galleries, archives, cultural institutions, heritage organizations, and research centers.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fw6xwy\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"986\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1331\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1025\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1025\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1004\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1013\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1025\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1331\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1086\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1099\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1134\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1194\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1165\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1194\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1249\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1210\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1225\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1249\">By 15th January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1331\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1274\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1273\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1293\"><strong data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1292\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1331\">As Per University Payment Schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"81m6rz\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1347\">Fee Summary</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1363\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1373\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1433\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1419\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1433\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1464\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1448\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1464\">INR 2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1481\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1480\">Total Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1501\"><strong data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1499\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k1e8kr\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1538\">What Does the Program Fee Cover?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1832\">The <strong data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1607\">Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies fee structure</strong> supports access to a comprehensive curriculum focused on museum management, cultural heritage preservation, curatorial studies, conservation practices, exhibition design, digital heritage technologies, and heritage research.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1861\">Key learning areas include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"culycg\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1893\">Museum Studies and Museology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"czi89z\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1934\">Heritage Conservation and Preservation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"df2pxk\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1973\">Museum Management and Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18dtc4w\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2012\">Exhibition Design and Interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cspsv2\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2043\">Cultural Heritage Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bhz7ob\" data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2065\">Curatorial Practice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bgn8q2\" data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2095\">Museum Research Methodology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ec1z39\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2137\">Digital Museums and Virtual Exhibitions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14486m0\" data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2176\">AR and VR in Heritage Interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1el4i99\" data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2211\">Collection Care and Conservation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17apeg9\" data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2249\">Heritage Documentation and Research</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2414\">The curriculum is designed to provide both theoretical knowledge and practical exposure, preparing learners for modern careers in the cultural and heritage sector.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"577\">The <strong data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"161\">Online M.A. in Museology and Heritage Studies at OP Jindal University</strong> is a multidisciplinary program designed for students and professionals interested in museums, cultural heritage, conservation, curation, exhibition design, heritage management, and cultural research. The curriculum combines theoretical foundations with practical applications, helping learners understand how museums preserve history, interpret culture, and engage modern audiences in an increasingly digital world.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"853\">With a strong focus on museum studies, heritage preservation, cultural management, digital technologies, and curatorial practices, the program prepares students for careers in museums, galleries, heritage institutions, cultural organizations, archives, and research centers.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1myg4fh\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"919\">Trimester 1: Foundations of Museology and Heritage Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"1210\">The first trimester introduces learners to the historical, theoretical, and managerial aspects of museums and cultural heritage institutions. Students develop a comprehensive understanding of how museums function as spaces of education, preservation, interpretation, and public engagement.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"2235\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1222\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1237\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"2235\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1514\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1321\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1320\">Cultural Heritage and Museums: History and Theory</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1514\">Explores the evolution of museums and cultural heritage institutions, examining their social, historical, and educational significance in preserving collective memory and cultural identity.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1750\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1539\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1538\">Museum Typologies</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1750\">Introduces different types of museums, including art museums, history museums, science museums, community museums, and specialized cultural institutions, while examining their unique functions and audiences.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1987\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1807\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1806\">Museum and Heritage Management and Administration</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1987\">Focuses on museum operations, heritage site management, strategic planning, resource allocation, policy development, and organizational leadership within cultural institutions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2235\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2055\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2054\">Museum Spaces, Cultural Stages: Exhibitions &amp; Interpretation</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2235\">Examines exhibition planning, storytelling techniques, visitor engagement strategies, interpretive frameworks, and the role of exhibitions in communicating cultural narratives.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2bhuhq\" data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2297\">Trimester 2: Digital Heritage, Conservation, and Research</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2495\">The second trimester explores the growing role of technology in museums and heritage institutions while providing insights into conservation practices and research methodologies used in the field.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"3448\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2522\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2522\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2507\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2522\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"3448\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2776\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2584\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2583\">Digital Futures (AR and VR)</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2776\">Introduces emerging technologies such as Augmented Reality (AR) and Virtual Reality (VR), highlighting their role in creating immersive museum experiences and enhancing visitor engagement.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2998\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2820\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2819\">Conservation, Preservation, and Care</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2998\">Covers techniques and principles used to preserve artifacts, artworks, documents, and cultural heritage resources while ensuring their long-term protection and accessibility.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3220\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3040\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3039\">Experiencing Museums: Case Studies</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3040\" data-end=\"3220\">Analyzes national and international museum case studies to understand best practices in museum management, exhibition development, visitor engagement, and cultural programming.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3448\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3269\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3223\" data-end=\"3268\">Research Method in Museology and Heritage</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3448\">Develops research skills required for heritage studies, museum analysis, cultural documentation, and academic inquiry through qualitative and quantitative research approaches.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ddd5pl\" data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3510\">Trimester 3: Curatorial Practice and Field-Based Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3722\">The final trimester focuses on curatorial expertise, historical interpretation, and experiential learning through field research. Students gain practical exposure to real-world heritage and museum environments.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"4387\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3749\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3749\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3734\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3749\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"4387\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"3983\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"3818\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3817\">Curating Contemporary Art: A Guide</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3983\">Provides an understanding of contemporary art curation, exhibition development, artist engagement, collection management, and audience interpretation strategies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3984\" data-end=\"4173\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3984\" data-end=\"4009\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3986\" data-end=\"4008\">Curating Histories</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4173\">Explores how historical narratives are researched, interpreted, and presented through museum collections, exhibitions, archives, and public history initiatives.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4387\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4209\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4208\">Immersion and Field Research</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4387\">Offers hands-on learning through fieldwork, heritage site visits, museum observation, cultural documentation, and applied research projects that connect theory with practice.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
