er_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(482, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 353, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 04:43:54', '2026-06-17 00:33:39', '<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"570\">The <strong data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"192\">Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management admission process at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify individuals with a strong interest in politics, elections, governance, public policy, political communication, and campaign strategy. The program welcomes graduates from diverse academic backgrounds who aspire to build careers in political consulting, election management, public affairs, policy research, political analytics, and democratic governance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"786\">The admission process follows a holistic evaluation approach, focusing not only on academic qualifications but also on the applicant\'s motivation, career goals, and understanding of political and electoral systems.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e43i7e\" data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"830\">Step 1: Verify Eligibility Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"933\">Before starting the application process, candidates should ensure they meet the eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"951\">Applicants must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"twshsd\" data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1050\">Hold an undergraduate degree in any discipline from a recognized university in India or abroad.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ibrdb\" data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1112\">Possess valid identity documents for verification purposes.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"26241\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1201\">Be prepared to submit a Statement of Purpose (SOP) as part of the application process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1369\">The program is open to fresh graduates, working professionals, public policy enthusiasts, political aspirants, and individuals interested in elections and governance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"107tu6k\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1418\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1545\">Eligible candidates must fill out the online application form with accurate academic, personal, and professional information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1592\">Applicants are generally required to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t7bwlu\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1612\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1638\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1660\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6yuei6\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1702\">Professional background (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g4ur6d\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1729\">Supporting documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1825\">Ensuring complete and accurate information helps facilitate a smooth admission review process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xuooss\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1875\">Step 3: Submit the Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"2056\">A key component of the <strong data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1991\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management admission process</strong> is the submission of a <strong data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2055\">Statement of Purpose (600&ndash;800 words)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2089\">The SOP should clearly explain:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2385\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c9shv9\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2141\">Interest in elections, politics, and governance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s8qy5\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2181\">Academic and professional background.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17sg84n\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2223\">Career aspirations and long-term goals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"npckam\" data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2284\">Motivation for pursuing Elections and Campaign Management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h08h9\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2329\">Reasons for choosing OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p1k1ek\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2385\">How the program aligns with future career objectives.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2537\">A well-written SOP allows applicants to demonstrate their passion for democratic processes, political strategy, public affairs, and electoral systems.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g9b30v\" data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2575\">Step 4: Upload Required Documents</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2664\">Applicants must submit all necessary documents for verification and profile evaluation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2703\">Typically required documents include:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s2tv07\" data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2730\">For Indian Applicants</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2845\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5qjqn7\" data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2769\">Aadhaar Card, PAN Card, or Voter ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qwehzo\" data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2811\">Graduation certificates and mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40xgv7\" data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2845\">Recent passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sujezs\" data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2879\">For International Applicants</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2978\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2vcnq\" data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2897\">Valid Passport</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7rr2k5\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2937\">Academic certificates and transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"drc0ck\" data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2978\">Other supporting documents as required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3091\">Applicants should ensure that all documents are clear, complete, and submitted within the prescribed timelines.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6ny5fy\" data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3145\">Step 5: Application Review and Profile Evaluation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3147\" data-end=\"3266\">Once the application is submitted, the admissions committee conducts a comprehensive review of the candidate\'s profile.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3303\">The evaluation generally considers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3508\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3330\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14whrwn\" data-start=\"3331\" data-end=\"3368\">Quality of the Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tak1wv\" data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3416\">Interest in elections and campaign management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yorba8\" data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3447\">Career goals and aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8v7wdd\" data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3470\">Leadership potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pbnzc\" data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3508\">Overall suitability for the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3685\">The university adopts a holistic admission approach to identify applicants who demonstrate strong motivation and potential for success in the field of politics and governance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cbmjoi\" data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3716\">Step 6: Admission Decision</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3827\">Following the evaluation process, successful candidates receive an admission offer from OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3864\">The admission decision is based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"4056\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1scqtlu\" data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3907\">Fulfillment of eligibility requirements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14kwhdo\" data-start=\"3908\" data-end=\"3958\">Strength and clarity of the Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1378l5v\" data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"3980\">Academic background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ndn7sk\" data-start=\"3981\" data-end=\"4027\">Alignment with the objectives of the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ov6ca\" data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4056\">Overall profile assessment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4058\" data-end=\"4144\">Selected applicants are notified through the university\'s official admission channels.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jp3gp2\" data-start=\"4146\" data-end=\"4196\">Step 7: Fee Payment and Enrollment Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4235\">To secure admission, candidates must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4237\" data-end=\"4366\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tjfou\" data-start=\"4237\" data-end=\"4266\">Accept the admission offer.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"129w4l7\" data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4319\">Complete the registration and fee payment process.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3hpk9\" data-start=\"4320\" data-end=\"4366\">Submit any pending documents, if applicable.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4368\" data-end=\"4499\">After successful verification and fee payment, enrollment in the <strong data-start=\"4433\" data-end=\"4485\">Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management</strong> is confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rdky33\" data-start=\"4501\" data-end=\"4575\">Selection Criteria for Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4577\" data-end=\"4675\">Admission to the program is based on a comprehensive review of the applicant\'s profile, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4677\" data-end=\"4897\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"4677\" data-end=\"4702\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b9xddn\" data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4741\">Statement of Purpose (600&ndash;800 words)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4vp997\" data-start=\"4742\" data-end=\"4791\">Interest in politics, elections, and governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zgdu1t\" data-start=\"4792\" data-end=\"4831\">Professional and leadership potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ht27xl\" data-start=\"4832\" data-end=\"4866\">Career objectives and motivation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k8ei37\" data-start=\"4867\" data-end=\"4897\">Overall fit with the program</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"629\">The <strong data-start=\"101\" data-end=\"177\">Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for aspiring political leaders, campaign managers, political consultants, policy professionals, election analysts, governance experts, public affairs specialists, and individuals interested in understanding the dynamics of elections and democratic processes. The program provides a comprehensive understanding of political strategy, voter behaviour, political communication, campaign management, electoral systems, and political analytics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"937\">Whether you are a recent graduate looking to enter the political and public policy sector or a working professional seeking expertise in election management and political strategy, the program offers a strong foundation for building a career in politics, governance, public affairs, and electoral research.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ozguwy\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1015\">Eligibility Criteria for Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1157\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1107\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management</strong>, candidates must meet the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dai1l9\" data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1260\">Hold an <strong data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1211\">undergraduate degree in any discipline</strong> from a recognized university in India or abroad.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g81u4a\" data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1326\">Applicants from all academic backgrounds are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1amm5rq\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1397\">Fresh graduates and working professionals can apply for the program.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qh2y9o\" data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1487\">Candidates must submit valid identification documents as part of the admission process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vwpntf\" data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1511\">Required Documents</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1587\">Applicants are required to provide the following identification documents:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1614\"><strong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1614\">For Indian Applicants</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jrsd6q\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1630\">Aadhaar Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15vnh37\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1641\">PAN Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19tjwdn\" data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1657\">Voter ID Card</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1691\"><strong data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1691\">For International Applicants</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2vcnq\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1709\">Valid Passport</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1791\">These documents are required for identity verification and admission processing.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eo7kda\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1830\">Who Should Apply for This Program?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"2052\">The <strong data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1888\">Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management</strong> is ideal for individuals who want to understand electoral systems, political strategy, campaign planning, voter behaviour, governance, and democratic institutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2096\">This program is particularly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2441\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wmtb2r\" data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2127\">Political Science Graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"litrp4\" data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2153\">Public Policy Aspirants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"148784n\" data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2188\">Political Campaign Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eydpnl\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2228\">Political Consultants and Strategists</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15xgh6q\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2264\">Election Researchers and Analysts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11i56u1\" data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2295\">Public Affairs Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1owisb\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2338\">Governance and Development Practitioners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"asst6t\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2371\">Social and Political Activists</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qdfzfi\" data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2412\">Journalists and Political Commentators</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kr6jrk\" data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2441\">Aspiring Political Leaders</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"sd01av\" data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2516\">Selection Process for Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2853\">Admission to the <strong data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2608\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management</strong> is based on a profile-based evaluation process. Rather than relying solely on academic qualifications, the university seeks candidates who demonstrate a genuine interest in politics, elections, governance, leadership, and democratic engagement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2936\">A major component of the selection process is the <strong data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2935\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"omgi1y\" data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2980\">Statement of Purpose (SOP) Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3114\">Applicants must submit a <strong data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3061\">Statement of Purpose ranging between 600&ndash;800 words</strong> explaining their motivation for joining the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3141\">The SOP should highlight:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3495\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nr03vl\" data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3191\">Interest in elections and campaign management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s8qy5\" data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3231\">Academic and professional background.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ms6oxg\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3311\">Career aspirations in politics, governance, public policy, or public affairs.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h08h9\" data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3356\">Reasons for choosing OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g1rrbf\" data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3424\">Understanding of contemporary political and electoral challenges.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12udiqk\" data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3495\">How the program will contribute to personal and professional growth.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3641\">The Statement of Purpose allows applicants to showcase their passion, vision, and commitment to the field of elections and political management.</p>', '<p data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"539\">The <strong data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"171\">Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management at OP Jindal University</strong> is a specialized postgraduate program designed for individuals seeking careers in political consulting, election strategy, campaign management, public policy, governance, political analytics, and public affairs. The program combines academic rigor with practical insights into modern electoral systems, voter behaviour, political communication, and campaign planning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"709\">To make the program accessible to students and working professionals, OP Jindal University offers a structured fee payment schedule with convenient installment options.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"asxp7v\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"797\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"815\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"824\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"836\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"945\">\r\n<td data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"897\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"910\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"945\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<td data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"976\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1005\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1021\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1036\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1060\">By 15th January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1085\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1084\">Total Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1104\"><strong data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1103\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1134\">As Per University Schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"81m6rz\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1150\">Fee Summary</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1312\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1176\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1176\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1166\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1176\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1312\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1236\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1222\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1236\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1267\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1251\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1267\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1312\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1292\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1291\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1312\"><strong data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1310\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1q5y09m\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1351\">What Does the Program Fee Include?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1615\">The <strong data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1423\">Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management fee structure</strong> provides access to a comprehensive curriculum focused on political strategy, campaign management, election studies, voter behaviour, political analytics, electoral governance, and leadership.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1644\">Students gain expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n4ktcc\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1677\">Political Campaign Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vtq3iu\" data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1710\">Election Strategy and Planning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9lxcyu\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1756\">Political Analytics and Data Interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hs4j4a\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1799\">Political Psychology and Voter Behaviour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2jrpzb\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1837\">Psephology and Election Forecasting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fjhse1\" data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1884\">Election Monitoring and Electoral Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vfmnci\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1925\">Public Policy and Political Leadership</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z8cfuh\" data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1964\">Political Communication and Outreach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a7dnuv\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1990\">Constituency Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qr56h3\" data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2031\">Democratic Institutions and Governance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2166\">The curriculum is designed to provide both conceptual understanding and practical exposure to modern political and electoral systems.<br><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"147p351\" data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4492\">Important Fee Notes</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4494\" data-end=\"4881\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5rikcc\" data-start=\"4494\" data-end=\"4568\">The registration fee is payable after acceptance of the admission offer.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17lpirk\" data-start=\"4569\" data-end=\"4646\">Tuition fees must be paid according to the prescribed installment schedule.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h141ak\" data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4796\">Students are advised to complete payments before the specified deadlines to ensure uninterrupted access to academic resources and program services.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2o19ya\" data-start=\"4797\" data-end=\"4881\">Any future revisions to the fee structure will be governed by university policies.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"618\">The <strong data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"167\">Online M.A. in Elections and Campaign Management at OP Jindal University</strong> is a specialized postgraduate program designed for aspiring political strategists, campaign managers, policy professionals, political consultants, election analysts, public affairs specialists, and governance professionals. The curriculum combines political science, election studies, political analytics, campaign strategy, voter behavior, leadership, and electoral management to provide a comprehensive understanding of modern democratic processes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"1056\">As elections become increasingly data-driven and technology-enabled, organizations, political parties, advocacy groups, and public institutions require professionals who can analyze voter behavior, design campaign strategies, monitor elections, and interpret political trends. This program equips learners with the practical knowledge and analytical skills needed to navigate the evolving landscape of politics and electoral management.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v3j53g\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1118\">Quarter 1: Foundations of Politics and Political Analysis</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1419\">The first quarter introduces students to the core concepts of politics, governance, comparative political systems, and political data analysis. Learners develop a strong understanding of how political institutions function and how political behavior can be studied through evidence-based approaches.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"2149\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1431\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1446\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"2149\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1695\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1498\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1497\">What is Politics?</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1695\">Explores the fundamental concepts of politics, power, governance, public institutions, political ideologies, and democratic systems that shape societies and influence decision-making processes.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1722\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1721\">Political Analytics</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1923\">Introduces data-driven approaches to political analysis, including voter data interpretation, electoral trends, polling analysis, political forecasting, and evidence-based campaign decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"2149\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1960\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1959\">Comparative Political Systems</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"2149\">Examines different political systems across the world, comparing democratic, parliamentary, presidential, and mixed governance models to understand their impact on policy and elections.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pf5j0l\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2216\">Quarter 2: Voter Behaviour, Leadership, and Electoral Dynamics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2430\">The second quarter focuses on the economic, ethical, and psychological dimensions of elections. Students gain insights into voter decision-making, political leadership, campaign influence, and electoral behavior.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"3094\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2457\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2457\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2442\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2457\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"3094\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2690\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2514\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2513\">Economics of Elections</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2690\">Analyzes the relationship between economics and electoral outcomes, including campaign spending, public policy incentives, voter preferences, and political decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2886\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2719\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2718\">Ethics and Leadership</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2886\">Examines ethical leadership principles, political accountability, governance standards, public trust, and responsible decision-making in political and public life.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"3094\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2928\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2927\">Political Psychology and Behaviour</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"3094\">Studies voter attitudes, political identity, decision-making processes, public opinion formation, and the psychological factors that influence electoral behavior.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1675tsf\" data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3150\">Quarter 3: Campaign Strategy and Electoral Analysis</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3152\" data-end=\"3351\">The third quarter provides specialized knowledge in election campaign planning, political communication, and psephology. Students learn how successful campaigns are designed, executed, and evaluated.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3353\" data-end=\"3981\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3353\" data-end=\"3378\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3353\" data-end=\"3378\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3353\" data-end=\"3363\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3363\" data-end=\"3378\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3981\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3600\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3431\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3430\">Election Campaigns</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3600\">Covers campaign strategy, voter outreach, political messaging, grassroots mobilization, digital campaigning, media management, and election communication techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3796\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3634\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3633\">Introduction to Psephology</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3634\" data-end=\"3796\">Introduces the scientific study of elections, voting patterns, opinion polls, electoral forecasting, demographic analysis, and political trend interpretation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3981\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3814\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3813\">Elective 1</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3981\">Allows students to explore a specialized area related to elections, political strategy, governance, public policy, campaign management, or political communication.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pxks3r\" data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"4042\">Quarter 4: Elections, Identity, and Electoral Governance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4044\" data-end=\"4270\">The final quarter focuses on the relationship between elections and identity politics, election integrity, and practical electoral management. Students gain exposure to real-world electoral processes and monitoring frameworks.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4917\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4297\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4297\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4282\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4282\" data-end=\"4297\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4917\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4526\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4354\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4353\">Elections and Identity</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4354\" data-end=\"4526\">Examines how factors such as caste, religion, ethnicity, region, gender, and social identity influence voting behavior, political participation, and electoral outcomes.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4527\" data-end=\"4715\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4527\" data-end=\"4553\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4529\" data-end=\"4552\">Election Monitoring</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4553\" data-end=\"4715\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Focuses on election observation, electoral integrity, democratic accountability, monitoring frameworks, and mechanisms used to ensure free and fair elections.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4716\" data-end=\"4917\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4716\" data-end=\"4752\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4751\">Elective 2 / Constituency Lab</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4752\" data-end=\"4917\">Provides practical exposure through constituency-level analysis, field-based electoral studies, campaign simulations, or specialized political research projects.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(483, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 354, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 04:55:44', '2026-06-01 04:55:44', '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"602\">The <strong data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"172\">Online M.A. in Political Communication admission process at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify motivated individuals who aspire to build careers in political communication, campaign strategy, public affairs, media management, governance, public policy, political consulting, and digital political engagement. The university follows a holistic admission approach that evaluates academic qualifications, career aspirations, communication skills, and the applicant\'s overall suitability for the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"870\">Unlike traditional admission models that focus solely on academic performance, this program emphasizes purpose, leadership potential, and a clear understanding of how political communication shapes public opinion, elections, governance, and democratic participation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e43i7e\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"914\">Step 1: Verify Eligibility Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"1003\">Before applying, candidates should ensure they meet the program\'s eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1021\">Applicants must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1259\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"twshsd\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1120\">Hold an undergraduate degree in any discipline from a recognized university in India or abroad.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aa3cl9\" data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1170\">Possess valid government-issued identity proof.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"38e62z\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1259\">Be prepared to submit the required admission essay as part of the application process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1469\">The program welcomes applicants from diverse academic and professional backgrounds, including political science, journalism, media studies, public policy, law, management, social sciences, and related fields.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"107tu6k\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1518\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1634\">Candidates must submit the online application form with accurate personal, academic, and professional information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1681\">Applicants are generally required to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1820\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t7bwlu\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1701\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1730\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1752\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j594z7\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1793\">Professional experience, if applicable</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g4ur6d\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1820\">Supporting documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1913\">Providing complete and accurate information helps ensure a smooth admission review process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fa2br\" data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1952\">Step 3: Submit the Admission Essay</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2099\">A key component of the <strong data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2058\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Political Communication admission process</strong> is the submission of an admission essay.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2157\">Applicants are required to write on the following topic:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2274\"><strong data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2274\">\"What are your long-term career goals and aspirations, and how will this degree support you in achieving them?\"</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2320\">The essay enables applicants to demonstrate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2602\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9kudw5\" data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2369\">Career ambitions and professional aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s0uxj6\" data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2426\">Interest in political communication and public affairs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rcuqjf\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2463\">Motivation for pursuing the degree</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uol38h\" data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2540\">Understanding of political communication, media, governance, and elections</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qnlqnc\" data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2602\">Alignment between personal goals and the program curriculum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2693\">A thoughtful and well-structured essay significantly strengthens the overall application.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g9b30v\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2731\">Step 4: Upload Required Documents</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2820\">Applicants must submit all necessary documents for profile evaluation and verification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s2tv07\" data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2847\">For Indian Applicants</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2962\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5qjqn7\" data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2886\">Aadhaar Card, PAN Card, or Voter ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qwehzo\" data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2928\">Graduation certificates and mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40xgv7\" data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2962\">Recent passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sujezs\" data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"2996\">For International Applicants</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3101\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2vcnq\" data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3014\">Valid Passport</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7rr2k5\" data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3054\">Academic certificates and transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kr5miw\" data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3101\">Additional supporting documents, if required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3180\">All documents should be submitted within the specified application timelines.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6ny5fy\" data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3234\">Step 5: Application Review and Profile Evaluation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3335\">After submission, the admissions committee conducts a comprehensive assessment of each application.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3368\">The review typically considers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3598\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3395\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ifv01\" data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3421\">Admission essay quality</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fiavjm\" data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3464\">Professional background and achievements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0t1et\" data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3517\">Interest in political communication and governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8v7wdd\" data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3540\">Leadership potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3563\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ht27xl\" data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3598\">Career objectives and motivation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3774\">The university adopts a profile-based evaluation process to identify applicants who can benefit most from the program and contribute meaningfully to the learning environment.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fttmx2\" data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3832\">Step 6: Personal Interview for Shortlisted Candidates</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3930\">Based on the application review, shortlisted candidates may be invited for a personal interview.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"3959\">The interview helps assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3961\" data-end=\"4163\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sb5lun\" data-start=\"3961\" data-end=\"4010\">Motivation for pursuing Political Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2q2gt1\" data-start=\"4011\" data-end=\"4035\">Long-term career goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f3yrzj\" data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4076\">Communication and analytical abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zg735o\" data-start=\"4077\" data-end=\"4141\">Understanding of contemporary political and media environments</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mycmq0\" data-start=\"4142\" data-end=\"4163\">Overall program fit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4165\" data-end=\"4340\">The interview serves as an additional opportunity for applicants to demonstrate their passion for political communication, elections, governance, media, and public engagement.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yj6tao\" data-start=\"4342\" data-end=\"4391\">Step 7: Admission Offer and Selection Decision</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4500\">Following the evaluation process, selected candidates receive an admission offer from OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4535\">Admission decisions are based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4537\" data-end=\"4734\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17tx0u5\" data-start=\"4537\" data-end=\"4574\">Fulfillment of eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8wvsx\" data-start=\"4575\" data-end=\"4607\">Quality of the admission essay</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1378l5v\" data-start=\"4608\" data-end=\"4629\">Academic background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x4n3ne\" data-start=\"4630\" data-end=\"4669\">Interview performance (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ov6ca\" data-start=\"4670\" data-end=\"4698\">Overall profile assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsjb8d\" data-start=\"4699\" data-end=\"4734\">Alignment with program objectives</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4824\">Successful applicants are notified through the university\'s official admission channels.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ukunvt\" data-start=\"4826\" data-end=\"4876\">Step 8: Fee Payment and Enrollment Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4878\" data-end=\"4924\">To secure admission, selected candidates must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4926\" data-end=\"5071\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tjfou\" data-start=\"4926\" data-end=\"4955\">Accept the admission offer.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zf0fzg\" data-start=\"4956\" data-end=\"4992\">Complete the registration process.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1utj608\" data-start=\"4993\" data-end=\"5026\">Pay the applicable program fee.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eusne5\" data-start=\"5027\" data-end=\"5071\">Submit any pending documents, if required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5073\" data-end=\"5207\">Once all formalities are completed and verified, enrollment in the <strong data-start=\"5140\" data-end=\"5182\">Online M.A. in Political Communication</strong> is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wylgzk\" data-start=\"5209\" data-end=\"5273\">Selection Criteria for Online M.A. in Political Communication</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5275\" data-end=\"5338\">Admission to the program is based on a comprehensive review of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5632\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4n59xu\" data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5379\">Undergraduate academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lpup24\" data-start=\"5380\" data-end=\"5397\">Admission essay</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tg2eaz\" data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5441\">Career aspirations and professional goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s0uxj6\" data-start=\"5442\" data-end=\"5498\">Interest in political communication and public affairs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lms32i\" data-start=\"5499\" data-end=\"5539\">Communication and leadership potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12isqto\" data-start=\"5540\" data-end=\"5601\">Personal interview performance (for shortlisted candidates)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pn6hug\" data-start=\"5602\" data-end=\"5632\">Overall application strength</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1it0dva\" data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5694\">&nbsp;</h2>', 1, '<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"598\">The <strong data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"157\">Online M.A. in Political Communication at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for individuals who aspire to build careers in political communication, campaign management, public affairs, political consulting, media strategy, governance, public policy, advocacy, and political journalism. The program welcomes applicants from diverse academic and professional backgrounds who are interested in understanding how communication shapes political processes, public opinion, elections, and democratic engagement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"888\">Whether you are a recent graduate, media professional, political enthusiast, policy researcher, or working professional seeking specialized expertise in political communication, the program provides an opportunity to develop industry-relevant knowledge and strategic communication skills.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1aeqn9p\" data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"956\">Eligibility Criteria for Online M.A. in Political Communication</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1091\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1038\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Political Communication</strong>, candidates must fulfill the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1416\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dai1l9\" data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1194\">Hold an <strong data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1145\">undergraduate degree in any discipline</strong> from a recognized university in India or abroad.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5xwzs\" data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1256\">Applicants from all academic streams are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6qxr9c\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1311\">Fresh graduates and working professionals can apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4dseup\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1416\">Candidates must provide valid government-issued identification documents during the admission process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1636\">The interdisciplinary nature of the program makes it suitable for learners from political science, journalism, media studies, public policy, management, law, social sciences, humanities, and other academic backgrounds.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vwpntf\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1660\">Required Documents</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1761\">Applicants are required to submit identity verification documents as part of the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1788\"><strong data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1788\">For Indian Applicants</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1831\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jrsd6q\" data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1804\">Aadhaar Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15vnh37\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1815\">PAN Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19tjwdn\" data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1831\">Voter ID Card</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1865\"><strong data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1865\">For International Applicants</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1883\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2vcnq\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1883\">Valid Passport</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1974\">These documents are required for identity verification and admission processing purposes.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eo7kda\" data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2013\">Who Should Apply for This Program?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2175\">The <strong data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2061\">Online M.A. in Political Communication</strong> is ideal for individuals interested in politics, media, elections, public discourse, and strategic communication.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2219\">This program is particularly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2631\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jrnkvt\" data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2260\">Political Communication Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dy9u4f\" data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2290\">Political Campaign Managers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tjhp4t\" data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2319\">Public Affairs Specialists</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b5v8s5\" data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2343\">Political Consultants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wmtb2r\" data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2373\">Political Science Graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fwzwn7\" data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2411\">Journalists and Media Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m08o7p\" data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2432\">Policy Researchers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ef7p51\" data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2473\">Government Communication Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175uvps\" data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2521\">Advocacy and Development Sector Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cxhgqv\" data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2569\">Social Media and Digital Campaign Strategists</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jlm10\" data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2602\">Public Relations Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kr6jrk\" data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2631\">Aspiring Political Leaders</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gkxkyg\" data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2696\">Selection Process for Online M.A. in Political Communication</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2938\">Admission to the <strong data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2778\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Political Communication</strong> is based on a profile-based evaluation process that focuses on an applicant\'s academic background, motivation, career aspirations, and communication potential.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"3023\">A major component of the selection process is the submission of an admission essay.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1de6hn1\" data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3056\">Admission Essay Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3132\">Applicants are required to submit an essay addressing the following topic:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3249\"><strong data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3249\">\"What are your long-term career goals and aspirations, and how will this degree support you in achieving them?\"</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3443\">The essay provides applicants with an opportunity to demonstrate their interest in political communication, leadership, media strategy, electoral communication, governance, and public affairs.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1it0dva\" data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5694\">&nbsp;</h2>', '<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"470\">The <strong data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"151\">Online M.A. in Political Communication at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for aspiring political strategists, campaign managers, public affairs professionals, political consultants, journalists, media specialists, and governance experts who want to develop advanced expertise in political communication, digital campaigning, voter engagement, media strategy, and public discourse.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"912\">With a curriculum focused on political messaging, election campaigns, voter behaviour, digital communication, political leadership, and media analytics, the program provides a strong foundation for building successful careers in politics, governance, public policy, media, and strategic communications. To support students and working professionals, OP Jindal University offers a structured fee payment plan through convenient installments.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"tm4c10\" data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"990\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Political Communication Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1327\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1029\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1029\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1008\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1017\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1029\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1327\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1138\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1090\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1103\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1138\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1198\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1154\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1169\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1198\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1253\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1214\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1229\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1253\" data-col-size=\"sm\">By 15th January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1327\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1278\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1277\">Total Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1297\"><strong data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1296\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1327\">As Per University Schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"81m6rz\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1343\">Fee Summary</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1505\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1369\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1369\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1359\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1369\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1505\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1429\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1415\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1429\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1460\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1444\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1460\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1505\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1485\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1484\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1505\"><strong data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1503\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k1e8kr\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1542\">What Does the Program Fee Cover?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1804\">The <strong data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1604\">Online M.A. in Political Communication fee structure</strong> provides access to a specialized curriculum covering political communication theory, election campaigns, political messaging, media strategy, voter psychology, public affairs, and digital engagement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1833\">Key learning areas include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"2233\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e3827p\" data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1879\">Political Communication and Media Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"naaifq\" data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1910\">Election Campaign Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9kcgi\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1955\">Political Messaging and Narrative Building</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y0zabd\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1982\">Voter Behaviour Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"60qpqa\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2005\">Political Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jnq60z\" data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2053\">Digital Campaigning and Social Media Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mc309b\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2098\">Political Leadership and Public Engagement</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cguuqb\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2144\">Research Methods in Political Communication</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pclfc9\" data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2189\">Media Literacy and Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xo2ovx\" data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2233\">Political Analytics and Audience Insights</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2424\">The program combines theoretical foundations with practical applications, helping students understand how communication influences elections, governance, policy debates, and public opinion.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"607\">The <strong data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"147\">Online M.A. in Political Communication at OP Jindal University</strong> is a future-focused postgraduate program designed for aspiring political strategists, communication professionals, public affairs specialists, campaign managers, policy advocates, journalists, and governance professionals. The curriculum explores the intersection of politics, media, technology, public opinion, and electoral communication, helping students understand how political narratives are created, communicated, and interpreted in modern democracies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"1086\">As political communication increasingly shapes elections, governance, public discourse, and citizen engagement, organizations require professionals who can develop effective communication strategies, analyze voter behaviour, manage digital campaigns, and build meaningful public narratives. This program combines political theory with practical communication skills to prepare learners for careers in politics, media, public relations, policy advocacy, and campaign management.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hjsinv\" data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1158\">Quarter 1: Foundations of Political Communication and Media Systems</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1464\">The first quarter introduces students to the core principles of political communication, media influence, electoral stakeholders, and the relationship between politics and public discourse. Learners develop a strong understanding of how communication shapes political processes and democratic engagement.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"2276\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1476\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1491\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"2276\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1564\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1563\">Foundations of Political Communication</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1767\">Explores the fundamental concepts, theories, and models of political communication, examining how political actors, institutions, media organizations, and citizens interact within democratic systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1805\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1804\">The Political Economy of Media</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"2020\">Examines the relationship between media ownership, economic structures, political power, and public communication, helping students understand how media systems influence political narratives and public opinion.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2276\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2082\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2081\">Parties, Politics and Stakeholders in Indian Elections</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2276\">Provides insights into India\'s political landscape, including political parties, electoral institutions, stakeholders, campaign structures, and the dynamics that influence election outcomes.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"q8lg2v\" data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2348\">Quarter 2: Voter Behaviour and Political Communication Perspectives</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2607\">The second quarter focuses on voter psychology, cross-cultural communication, and the historical evolution of political communication practices in India. Students gain a deeper understanding of how audiences engage with political messages and form opinions.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"3354\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2634\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2634\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2619\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2634\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"3354\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2858\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2684\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2683\">Voter Behaviour</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2858\">Studies the social, economic, cultural, and psychological factors that influence voting decisions, political participation, and public opinion formation during elections.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"3129\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2934\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2933\">Alternative Approaches to Political and Cross-Cultural Communication</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"3129\">Explores diverse communication frameworks, intercultural communication strategies, and alternative perspectives that influence political engagement across different societies and communities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3354\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3180\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3179\">History of Political Communication in India</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3354\">Examines the evolution of political communication in India, from traditional political mobilization and mass movements to contemporary digital and media-driven campaigns.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6xa9na\" data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3427\">Quarter 3: Strategic Communication and Digital Political Campaigning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3671\">This quarter focuses on modern political communication strategies, digital engagement, political branding, and research methodologies. Students learn how political campaigns create narratives, engage audiences, and influence public discourse.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"4412\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3698\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3698\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3683\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3698\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"4412\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3953\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3777\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3776\">Strategic Narratives and Political Messaging</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"3953\">Focuses on message development, political storytelling, narrative building, persuasion strategies, and communication frameworks used by political leaders and organizations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3954\" data-end=\"4206\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3954\" data-end=\"4017\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"4016\">Digital Strategy and Audience Engagement on Social Media</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4206\">Explores social media campaigns, digital communication strategies, audience targeting, online engagement techniques, and the role of digital platforms in modern political communication.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4207\" data-end=\"4412\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4207\" data-end=\"4257\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4256\">Research Methods in Political Communication</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4412\">Develops analytical and research skills used to study political communication, media effects, public opinion, electoral trends, and audience behaviour.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"bnemb5\" data-start=\"4414\" data-end=\"4484\">Quarter 4: Leadership Communication and Emerging Media Technologies</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4486\" data-end=\"4691\">The final quarter prepares students for leadership roles by examining communication styles, campaign execution, media literacy, and the growing impact of artificial intelligence on political communication.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"5389\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4718\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4718\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4703\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4718\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"5389\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4973\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4798\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4748\" data-end=\"4797\">Political Leadership and Communication Styles</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4798\" data-end=\"4973\">Examines leadership communication, public speaking, persuasion techniques, crisis communication, and the communication approaches adopted by influential political leaders.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4974\" data-end=\"5180\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4974\" data-end=\"5008\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4976\" data-end=\"5007\">Campaign Lab and Simulation</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"5008\" data-end=\"5180\">Provides practical exposure through campaign planning exercises, communication simulations, voter outreach strategies, and real-world political communication scenarios.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5181\" data-end=\"5389\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5181\" data-end=\"5209\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"5183\" data-end=\"5208\">Media Literacy and AI</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"5209\" data-end=\"5389\">Explores media literacy, misinformation, digital ethics, artificial intelligence in communication, algorithm-driven content distribution, and the future of political messaging.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(485, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 355, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 05:09:02', '2026-06-01 05:09:02', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"585\">The <strong data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"158\">Online M.A. in American Studies admission process at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify intellectually curious learners who are interested in American politics, society, culture, international relations, public policy, global affairs, diplomacy, media, and global leadership. The university follows a holistic admission approach that evaluates academic qualifications, career aspirations, research interests, and the applicant\'s motivation for pursuing advanced studies in American Studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"798\">Unlike traditional admission models that rely solely on academic performance, the program places significant emphasis on an applicant\'s purpose, analytical thinking, and long-term academic or professional goals.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e43i7e\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"842\">Step 1: Verify Eligibility Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"937\">Before applying, candidates should ensure they meet the eligibility criteria for the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"955\">Applicants must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1203\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"twshsd\" data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1054\">Hold an undergraduate degree in any discipline from a recognized university in India or abroad.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"30jdrt\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1114\">Possess valid government-issued identification documents.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"26241\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1203\">Be prepared to submit a Statement of Purpose (SOP) as part of the application process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1422\">The program welcomes applicants from diverse academic backgrounds, including political science, international relations, history, economics, law, journalism, management, public policy, social sciences, and humanities.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"107tu6k\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1471\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1596\">Eligible candidates must submit the online application form with accurate academic, personal, and professional information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1643\">Applicants are generally required to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t7bwlu\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1663\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1692\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1714\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j594z7\" data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1755\">Professional experience, if applicable</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g4ur6d\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1782\">Supporting documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1893\">Providing complete and accurate information helps facilitate a smooth and efficient admission review process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xuooss\" data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1943\">Step 3: Submit the Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"2107\">A key component of the <strong data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2042\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in American Studies admission process</strong> is the submission of a <strong data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2106\">Statement of Purpose (500&ndash;750 words)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2140\">The SOP should clearly explain:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2530\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jebjz5\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2178\">Your interest in American Studies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s8qy5\" data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2218\">Academic and professional background.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ac3ev\" data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2260\">Long-term career goals and aspirations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jz701n\" data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2403\">Areas of interest such as American politics, U.S. foreign policy, international relations, culture, media, public policy, or global affairs.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h08h9\" data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2448\">Reasons for choosing OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h1oqdf\" data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2530\">How the program will contribute to your future academic or professional growth.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2660\">A strong SOP helps applicants demonstrate their motivation, intellectual curiosity, and alignment with the program\'s objectives.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g9b30v\" data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2698\">Step 4: Upload Required Documents</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2787\">Applicants must upload all necessary documents for verification and profile evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s2tv07\" data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2814\">For Indian Applicants</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2929\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5qjqn7\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2853\">Aadhaar Card, PAN Card, or Voter ID</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qwehzo\" data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2895\">Graduation certificates and mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40xgv7\" data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2929\">Recent passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sujezs\" data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2963\">For International Applicants</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3068\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2vcnq\" data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"2981\">Valid Passport</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7rr2k5\" data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3021\">Academic certificates and transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kr5miw\" data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3068\">Additional supporting documents, if required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3184\">Candidates should ensure that all documents are complete, accurate, and submitted within the prescribed deadlines.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6ny5fy\" data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3238\">Step 5: Application Review and Profile Evaluation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3240\" data-end=\"3339\">After submission, the admissions committee conducts a comprehensive assessment of each application.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3376\">The evaluation generally considers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3659\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3403\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mbs113\" data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3434\">Statement of Purpose quality</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12filtb\" data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3477\">Career objectives and future aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bvnqu\" data-start=\"3478\" data-end=\"3527\">Interest in American Studies and global affairs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4p883\" data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3575\">Research potential and intellectual curiosity</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ornhiz\" data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3621\">Professional achievements, where applicable</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pbnzc\" data-start=\"3622\" data-end=\"3659\">Overall suitability for the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3661\" data-end=\"3876\">The university adopts a profile-based evaluation approach to identify candidates who can contribute meaningfully to discussions on American society, politics, international relations, culture, and global leadership.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fttmx2\" data-start=\"3878\" data-end=\"3934\">Step 6: Personal Interview for Shortlisted Candidates</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"4076\">Based on the submitted Statement of Purpose and overall application profile, shortlisted candidates may be invited for a personal interview.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4078\" data-end=\"4105\">The interview helps assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4307\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1heqgxt\" data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4149\">Motivation for pursuing American Studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uqnigt\" data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4195\">Understanding of contemporary global issues</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1br49ft\" data-start=\"4196\" data-end=\"4233\">Communication and analytical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k18d22\" data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4273\">Academic and professional aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8891df\" data-start=\"4274\" data-end=\"4307\">Program fit and long-term goals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4445\">The interview provides applicants with an opportunity to discuss their interests and demonstrate their readiness for postgraduate study.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yj6tao\" data-start=\"4447\" data-end=\"4496\">Step 7: Admission Offer and Selection Decision</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4611\">Candidates who successfully complete the evaluation process receive an admission offer from OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4613\" data-end=\"4648\">The admission decision is based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4650\" data-end=\"4852\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17tx0u5\" data-start=\"4650\" data-end=\"4687\">Fulfillment of eligibility criteria</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14whrwn\" data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4725\">Quality of the Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1378l5v\" data-start=\"4726\" data-end=\"4747\">Academic background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x4n3ne\" data-start=\"4748\" data-end=\"4787\">Interview performance (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ov6ca\" data-start=\"4788\" data-end=\"4816\">Overall profile assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsjb8d\" data-start=\"4817\" data-end=\"4852\">Alignment with program objectives</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4854\" data-end=\"4942\">Successful applicants are notified through the university\'s official admission channels.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ukunvt\" data-start=\"4944\" data-end=\"4994\">Step 8: Fee Payment and Enrollment Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5042\">To secure admission, selected candidates must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5189\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tjfou\" data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5073\">Accept the admission offer.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zf0fzg\" data-start=\"5074\" data-end=\"5110\">Complete the registration process.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1utj608\" data-start=\"5111\" data-end=\"5144\">Pay the applicable program fee.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eusne5\" data-start=\"5145\" data-end=\"5189\">Submit any pending documents, if required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5191\" data-end=\"5354\">Once the university verifies all requirements and payment formalities are completed, enrollment in the <strong data-start=\"5294\" data-end=\"5329\">Online M.A. in American Studies</strong> is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1v7vywu\" data-start=\"5356\" data-end=\"5413\">Selection Criteria for Online M.A. in American Studies</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5415\" data-end=\"5478\">Admission to the program is based on a comprehensive review of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5480\" data-end=\"5779\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4n59xu\" data-start=\"5480\" data-end=\"5519\">Undergraduate academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12qbp82\" data-start=\"5520\" data-end=\"5558\">Statement of Purpose (500&ndash;750 words)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yorba8\" data-start=\"5559\" data-end=\"5589\">Career goals and aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ul8d2\" data-start=\"5590\" data-end=\"5659\">Interest in American politics, society, culture, and global affairs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hs4p4y\" data-start=\"5660\" data-end=\"5695\">Research and analytical potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bpq6k4\" data-start=\"5696\" data-end=\"5748\">Interview performance (for shortlisted candidates)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pn6hug\" data-start=\"5749\" data-end=\"5779\">Overall application strength</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"669\">The <strong data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"143\">Online M.A. in American Studies at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for students, researchers, educators, policy professionals, media practitioners, public affairs specialists, and working professionals who want to gain a deeper understanding of American politics, society, culture, economy, foreign policy, and global influence. The program offers an interdisciplinary approach to studying the United States, making it suitable for individuals interested in international relations, public policy, diplomacy, global affairs, political science, media studies, and cultural studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"991\">Whether you aspire to work in policy research, international organizations, diplomacy, academia, journalism, or global strategy, the program provides the academic foundation and analytical skills required to understand one of the world\'s most influential nations and its role in shaping contemporary global developments.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ayt1jn\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1052\">Eligibility Criteria for Online M.A. in American Studies</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1189\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1127\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in American Studies</strong>, candidates must meet the following eligibility requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1518\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dai1l9\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1292\">Hold an <strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1243\">undergraduate degree in any discipline</strong> from a recognized university in India or abroad.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g81u4a\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1358\">Applicants from all academic backgrounds are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6qxr9c\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1413\">Fresh graduates and working professionals can apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4dseup\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1518\">Candidates must provide valid government-issued identification documents during the admission process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1787\">The interdisciplinary nature of the program makes it accessible to learners from diverse fields including political science, international relations, history, economics, journalism, law, management, public policy, humanities, social sciences, and related disciplines.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vwpntf\" data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1811\">Required Documents</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1890\">Applicants must submit valid identity proof as part of the admission process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1917\"><strong data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1917\">For Indian Applicants</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1960\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jrsd6q\" data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1933\">Aadhaar Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15vnh37\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1944\">PAN Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19tjwdn\" data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1960\">Voter ID Card</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1994\"><strong data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1994\">For International Applicants</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2012\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2vcnq\" data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2012\">Valid Passport</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2094\">These documents are required for applicant verification and enrollment purposes.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1v9psti\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2156\">Who Should Apply for the Online M.A. in American Studies?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2369\">The program is ideal for individuals who want to develop expertise in American politics, U.S. foreign policy, international relations, global leadership, public policy, media, culture, and international affairs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2413\">This program is particularly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2775\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y0ibiu\" data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2450\">International Relations Aspirants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18tvs7l\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2480\">Public Policy Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wmtb2r\" data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2510\">Political Science Graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rxltwo\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2538\">Researchers and Academics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1489kz4\" data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2582\">Diplomacy and Foreign Affairs Enthusiasts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fwzwn7\" data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2620\">Journalists and Media Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l94jo3\" data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2665\">Government and Public Sector Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vt3hsl\" data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2690\">Think Tank Researchers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mgen8k\" data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2716\">Global Affairs Analysts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2zb558\" data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2775\">Working Professionals seeking international perspectives</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1twjf52\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2833\">Selection Process for Online M.A. in American Studies</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"3075\">Admission to the <strong data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2908\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in American Studies</strong> is based on a profile-based evaluation process that assesses an applicant\'s academic background, motivation, intellectual curiosity, and interest in American Studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3172\">A key component of the selection process is the submission of a <strong data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3171\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"omgi1y\" data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3216\">Statement of Purpose (SOP) Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3385\">Applicants are required to submit a <strong data-start=\"3254\" data-end=\"3295\">Statement of Purpose of 500&ndash;750 words</strong> explaining their interest in the program and future academic or professional aspirations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3387\" data-end=\"3410\">The SOP should address:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3721\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lfcvzr\" data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3454\">Why you want to pursue American Studies.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1otnb18\" data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3499\">Your academic and professional background.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9x0yff\" data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3585\">Interest in American politics, culture, society, economy, media, or foreign policy.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m31qzr\" data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3627\">Career goals and long-term aspirations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p6hfir\" data-start=\"3628\" data-end=\"3676\">How the program aligns with your future plans.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h08h9\" data-start=\"3677\" data-end=\"3721\">Reasons for choosing OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3867\">A well-structured SOP helps the admissions committee understand the applicant\'s motivation, intellectual interests, and commitment to the field.</p>', '<p data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"570\">The <strong data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"137\">Online M.A. in American Studies at OP Jindal University</strong> is a unique interdisciplinary postgraduate program that explores American politics, society, culture, economy, foreign policy, technology, media, and global leadership. Designed for students, researchers, policy professionals, diplomats, educators, journalists, and international affairs enthusiasts, the program offers a comprehensive understanding of the United States and its influence on global politics, economics, and culture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"758\">To make quality higher education accessible to both students and working professionals, OP Jindal University provides a structured tuition payment plan with flexible installment options.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1trjare\" data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"829\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in American Studies Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"1174\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"868\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"868\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"847\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"856\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"868\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1174\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"977\">\r\n<td data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"929\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"942\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"977\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<td data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"993\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1008\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1037\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1053\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1068\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1092\">By 15th January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1174\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1117\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1116\">Total Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1136\"><strong data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1135\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1174\">As Per University Payment Schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"81m6rz\" data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1190\">Fee Summary</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1352\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1206\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1216\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1352\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1276\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1262\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1276\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1291\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1307\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1352\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1332\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1331\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1352\"><strong data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1350\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k1e8kr\" data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1389\">What Does the Program Fee Cover?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1626\">The <strong data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1444\">Online M.A. in American Studies fee structure</strong> provides access to a specialized curriculum that combines political science, international relations, public policy, cultural studies, economics, law, media studies, and technology.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1655\">Students gain expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"2050\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"243enz\" data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1691\">American Politics and Government</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wvvz10\" data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1741\">U.S. Foreign Policy and International Relations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t6dsz2\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1781\">American Society and Cultural Studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16vksih\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1815\">Global Leadership and Diplomacy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w7h0ss\" data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1846\">Public Policy and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ycox2g\" data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1881\">Media, Technology, and Democracy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p12q1p\" data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1919\">American Economy and Global Markets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pygxbs\" data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1955\">Law and the American Legal System</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1567kmn\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2002\">Artificial Intelligence and Future Economies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3hdk3g\" data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2050\">Research Methodology and Dissertation Writing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2237\">The program is designed to help learners understand the historical evolution, contemporary challenges, and future trajectory of the United States in a rapidly changing global landscape.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"3115\">&nbsp;</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"575\">The <strong data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"133\">Online M.A. in American Studies at OP Jindal University</strong> is an interdisciplinary postgraduate program that explores the political, social, cultural, economic, legal, and technological foundations of the United States. Designed for students interested in global affairs, international relations, public policy, history, political science, media studies, and cultural studies, the program provides a comprehensive understanding of America\'s evolution, influence, and role in shaping the modern world.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"1048\">The curriculum combines the study of <strong data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"729\">American politics, society, economy, culture, law, foreign policy, technology, democracy, and global leadership</strong>, helping learners develop critical analytical skills and a deeper understanding of one of the world\'s most influential nations. Through research-driven learning and contemporary case studies, students examine how American institutions, ideas, and innovations continue to impact global politics, economics, and culture.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vlzpaq\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1115\">Trimester 1: Building America &ndash; Politics, Society, and Economy</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1351\">The first trimester introduces students to the historical foundations of the United States, exploring the development of American political institutions, social structures, and economic systems that continue to shape the nation today.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1378\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1378\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1363\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1378\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1487\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1486\">The American Republic: Revolution, Constitution, and Political Development</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1663\">Examines the origins of the United States, the American Revolution, constitutional development, democratic institutions, and the evolution of the American political system.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1725\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1724\">Society, Race, and Identity in the American Experience</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1882\">Explores issues of race, ethnicity, diversity, immigration, identity politics, social movements, and their influence on American society and public life.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1960\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1959\">American Economic Power: From Industrial Capitalism to the Digital Age</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"2145\">Analyzes the transformation of the U.S. economy from industrial growth to technological innovation, focusing on capitalism, globalization, entrepreneurship, and economic leadership.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yifk27\" data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2214\">Trimester 2: American Authority &ndash; Culture, Law, and Global Power</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2435\">The second trimester focuses on American culture, legal institutions, and international influence, helping students understand how the United States projects both soft power and strategic leadership on the global stage.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"3191\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2462\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2462\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2447\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2462\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"3191\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2727\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2546\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2545\">Culture, Literature, and the American Imagination</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2727\">Studies American literature, popular culture, artistic expression, media narratives, and cultural movements that have shaped national identity and global perceptions of America.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2972\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2791\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2790\">U.S. Foreign Policy: Ideals, Realities, and Global Power</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2972\">Examines the principles, strategies, and challenges of U.S. foreign policy while exploring America\'s role in international relations, diplomacy, security, and global governance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3191\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3023\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3022\">Law, Justice, and the American Legal System</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3191\">Provides insights into the U.S. legal framework, constitutional principles, judicial institutions, civil liberties, and the role of law in shaping American society.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16eptia\" data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3235\">Trimester 3: American Ideas and Systems</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3392\">This trimester explores the institutions and intellectual traditions that influence American democracy, innovation, education, media, and public discourse.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"4125\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3419\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3419\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3404\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3419\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"4125\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3661\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3497\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3496\">Media, Technology, and Democracy in America</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3661\">Investigates the relationship between media, technology, public opinion, political communication, and democratic participation in contemporary American society.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3902\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3735\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3734\">American Education, Innovation, Science and Environmental Politics</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3735\" data-end=\"3902\">Examines the role of education, scientific advancement, technological innovation, environmental policy, and sustainability in shaping America\'s future development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3903\" data-end=\"4125\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3903\" data-end=\"3957\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3956\">American Thought, Ethics, and Public Philosophy</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"4125\">Explores influential philosophical traditions, ethical debates, political ideas, and intellectual movements that have shaped American public life and policy-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8gv8xn\" data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4165\">Trimester 4: America and the Future</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4167\" data-end=\"4389\">The final trimester focuses on emerging challenges and opportunities facing the United States, including technological disruption, artificial intelligence, global competition, and evolving leadership in a multipolar world.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"5169\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4416\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4416\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4401\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4401\" data-end=\"4416\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"5169\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"4687\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"4505\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4446\" data-end=\"4504\">Technology, AI, and the Future of the American Economy</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4505\" data-end=\"4687\">Analyzes the impact of artificial intelligence, automation, digital transformation, innovation ecosystems, and emerging technologies on economic growth and workforce development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4928\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4765\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4690\" data-end=\"4764\">America and the World: Comparative Civilizations and Global Leadership</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4765\" data-end=\"4928\">Compares American institutions and values with other civilizations while examining global leadership, international cooperation, and the future of world order.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4929\" data-end=\"5169\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4929\" data-end=\"4972\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4971\">Master Dissertation Research Project</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4972\" data-end=\"5169\">A supervised research project that enables students to conduct in-depth analysis of a selected topic related to American politics, society, culture, economy, law, foreign policy, or technology.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(486, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 356, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 05:16:23', '2026-06-01 05:16:23', '<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"555\">The <strong data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"166\">Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting admission process at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify motivated learners who aspire to build expertise in legislative drafting, statutory interpretation, public policy, regulatory governance, and law-making. The university follows a comprehensive admission approach that evaluates academic qualifications, professional potential, analytical abilities, and an applicant\'s interest in legislative and policy development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"825\">Whether you are a law graduate, legal professional, government official, policy researcher, compliance specialist, or governance practitioner, the admission process is structured to assess your readiness for advanced study in legislative drafting and legal governance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kzovtn\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"868\">Step 1: Check Eligibility Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"982\">Before beginning the application process, candidates should ensure they meet the program\'s eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1000\">Applicants must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1308\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15kr3mh\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1067\">Hold a Bachelor\'s degree from a globally recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vnfuop\" data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1131\">Secure at least 50% aggregate marks in the qualifying degree.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3d2n5\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1196\">Submit a Statement of Purpose (SOP) and Curriculum Vitae (CV).</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lot28f\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1308\">Candidates with less than 50% marks may be required to appear for the Jindal Scholastic Aptitude Test (JSAT).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1406\">Meeting the eligibility requirements is the first step toward securing admission to the program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"107tu6k\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1455\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1571\">Candidates must submit the online application form with accurate personal, academic, and professional information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1618\">Applicants are generally required to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1753\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t7bwlu\" data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1638\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1667\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1689\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j594z7\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1730\">Professional experience, if applicable</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cejtkr\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1753\">Supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1846\">Providing complete and accurate information helps ensure a smooth admission review process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xuooss\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1896\">Step 3: Submit the Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"2068\">A crucial component of the <strong data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"2003\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting admission process</strong> is the submission of a <strong data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2067\">Statement of Purpose (700&ndash;750 words)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2101\">The SOP should clearly explain:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2383\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gsqlkv\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2156\">Interest in legislative drafting and public policy.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s8qy5\" data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2196\">Academic and professional background.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vur50r\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2235\">Career goals and future aspirations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rpql1\" data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2274\">Motivation for pursuing the program.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h08h9\" data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2319\">Reasons for choosing OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nc6by1\" data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2383\">How the degree aligns with long-term professional objectives.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2491\">A strong SOP demonstrates the applicant\'s commitment to legislative studies, governance, and legal reform.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14jkx63\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2532\">Step 4: Submit Curriculum Vitae (CV)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2595\">Applicants are required to submit an updated CV highlighting:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2794\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2622\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eejxr1\" data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2648\">Professional experience</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hdy1iz\" data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2692\">Legal, policy, or governance-related work</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7vr7xz\" data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2712\">Research projects</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1em9c7b\" data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2756\">Internships and professional achievements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d5blpa\" data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2794\">Relevant skills and accomplishments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2909\">The CV helps the admissions committee evaluate the applicant\'s academic and professional profile comprehensively.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3aa1l4\" data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2949\">Step 5: Upload Supporting Documents</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"3030\">Candidates must upload all necessary documents for verification and evaluation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3058\">Typical documents include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3276\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"apnf1d\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3091\">Bachelor\'s degree certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"117dusa\" data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3130\">Academic transcripts and mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eqv48\" data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3143\">Updated CV</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n7w4a\" data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3166\">Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kvg7of\" data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3201\">Government-issued identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lye5s8\" data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3228\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19jcdgx\" data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3276\">Additional supporting documents, if requested</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3365\">Ensuring all documentation is complete helps avoid delays during the admission process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1k154go\" data-start=\"3367\" data-end=\"3419\">Step 6: JSAT Assessment (For Eligible Candidates)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3568\">Applicants who have scored below 50% marks in their bachelor\'s degree may be required to appear for the <strong data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3567\">Jindal Scholastic Aptitude Test (JSAT)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3615\">The assessment helps the university evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3737\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i13wli\" data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3646\">Analytical reasoning skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xoq8j0\" data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3674\">Problem-solving abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b038kh\" data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3694\">Academic aptitude</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aw4upa\" data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3737\">Overall readiness for postgraduate study</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3739\" data-end=\"3837\">Performance in the JSAT may form part of the overall admission evaluation for eligible candidates.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g69jg\" data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3891\">Step 7: Application Review and Profile Evaluation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"4000\">After submission, the admissions committee conducts a comprehensive assessment of each applicant\'s profile.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4037\">The evaluation generally considers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4280\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oy2id\" data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4061\">Academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mbs113\" data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4092\">Statement of Purpose quality</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fiavjm\" data-start=\"4093\" data-end=\"4135\">Professional background and achievements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18jr322\" data-start=\"4136\" data-end=\"4154\">Curriculum Vitae</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q03i1q\" data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4204\">Interest in legislative drafting and governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ccynbx\" data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4242\">JSAT performance (where applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pbnzc\" data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4280\">Overall suitability for the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4282\" data-end=\"4434\">The university follows a holistic admission approach to identify candidates with strong potential for success in legislative and policy-related careers.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hpqlen\" data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4485\">Step 8: Admission Offer and Selection Decision</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4487\" data-end=\"4600\">Candidates who successfully complete the evaluation process receive an admission offer from OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4602\" data-end=\"4634\">The final selection is based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4791\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jvptfr\" data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4661\">Eligibility fulfillment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"4662\" data-end=\"4687\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n7w4a\" data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4710\">Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18jr322\" data-start=\"4711\" data-end=\"4729\">Curriculum Vitae</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o67vkv\" data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4764\">JSAT performance (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eiiomh\" data-start=\"4765\" data-end=\"4791\">Overall profile strength</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4793\" data-end=\"4879\">Selected candidates are notified through the university\'s official admission channels.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3co9oo\" data-start=\"4881\" data-end=\"4931\">Step 9: Fee Payment and Enrollment Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4933\" data-end=\"4979\">To secure admission, selected candidates must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4981\" data-end=\"5126\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tjfou\" data-start=\"4981\" data-end=\"5010\">Accept the admission offer.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zf0fzg\" data-start=\"5011\" data-end=\"5047\">Complete the registration process.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1utj608\" data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5081\">Pay the applicable program fee.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eusne5\" data-start=\"5082\" data-end=\"5126\">Submit any pending documents, if required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5128\" data-end=\"5257\">Upon successful completion of all formalities, enrollment in the <strong data-start=\"5193\" data-end=\"5232\">Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting</strong> is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ilg4b\" data-start=\"5259\" data-end=\"5320\">Selection Criteria for Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5322\" data-end=\"5385\">Admission to the program is based on a comprehensive review of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5387\" data-end=\"5664\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aytf2a\" data-start=\"5387\" data-end=\"5431\">Bachelor\'s degree and academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ts2r00\" data-start=\"5432\" data-end=\"5470\">Statement of Purpose (700&ndash;750 words)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jiuvri\" data-start=\"5471\" data-end=\"5494\">Curriculum Vitae (CV)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jvpwtt\" data-start=\"5495\" data-end=\"5547\">Interest in legislative drafting and public policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h77tw9\" data-start=\"5548\" data-end=\"5588\">Professional and academic achievements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"167jwl\" data-start=\"5589\" data-end=\"5633\">JSAT performance (for eligible candidates)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pn6hug\" data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5664\">Overall application strength</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"650\">The <strong data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"151\">Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for law graduates, legal professionals, policy researchers, government officials, compliance specialists, public administrators, and individuals interested in law-making, public policy, statutory drafting, and regulatory governance. The program provides advanced knowledge of legislative drafting, constitutional frameworks, legal research, policy analysis, and regulatory design, helping learners build expertise in one of the most specialized areas of the legal and governance sector.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"937\">Whether you aspire to work in legislative affairs, government departments, parliamentary research, regulatory authorities, public policy institutions, or legal consulting, the program offers a strong foundation for developing professional legislative drafting and policy-making skills.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fyikmu\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1002\">Eligibility Criteria for Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1140\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1081\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting</strong>, candidates must meet the following academic requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1510\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1zfw61\" data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1211\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1210\">Bachelor\'s degree from a globally recognized university</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ztefx\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1283\">Secure a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1257\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in the qualifying degree.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pory6s\" data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1385\">Candidates from diverse academic backgrounds may apply, subject to university admission guidelines.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13isjgc\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1510\">Applicants must submit a Statement of Purpose (SOP) and an updated Curriculum Vitae (CV) as part of the admission process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1677\">The program welcomes both fresh graduates and working professionals seeking specialized expertise in legislative drafting, law reform, public policy, and governance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xkskwb\" data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1733\">Eligibility for Candidates with Less Than 50% Marks</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1884\">Applicants who have scored below 50% marks in their bachelor\'s degree may still be considered for admission through an additional evaluation process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1918\">Such candidates are required to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"2147\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4ln93\" data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1980\">Appear for the <strong data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1979\">Jindal Scholastic Aptitude Test (JSAT)</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1igw4gc\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2019\">Submit a Statement of Purpose (SOP).</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9n567i\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2062\">Submit an updated Curriculum Vitae (CV).</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gb3n7y\" data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2147\">Meet the university\'s assessment requirements during the admission review process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2321\">This pathway allows motivated applicants to demonstrate their aptitude, academic potential, and suitability for the program beyond their undergraduate academic performance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ym8t36\" data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2358\">Documents Required for Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2463\">Candidates applying for the Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting should generally be prepared to submit:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"apnf1d\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2496\">Bachelor\'s degree certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"117dusa\" data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2535\">Academic transcripts and mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y9omnv\" data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2567\">Updated Curriculum Vitae (CV)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8flj6f\" data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2596\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kvg7of\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2631\">Government-issued identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lye5s8\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2658\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"399cl4\" data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2713\">Additional documents, if requested by the university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2812\">Providing complete and accurate documentation helps facilitate a smooth admission review process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eo7kda\" data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2851\">Who Should Apply for This Program?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"3009\">The <strong data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2896\">Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting</strong> is ideal for individuals seeking careers in law-making, legislative affairs, policy development, and governance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3052\">The program is particularly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3356\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"125xr78\" data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3069\">Law Graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1if7a8j\" data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3091\">Legal Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"583f7m\" data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3117\">Legislative Researchers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13javlz\" data-start=\"3118\" data-end=\"3135\">Policy Analysts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwvca7\" data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3158\">Government Officials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ryc1hb\" data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3196\">Public Administration Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"apao6c\" data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3229\">Regulatory Affairs Specialists</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vi04ae\" data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3268\">Parliamentary Research Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i2hwi0\" data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3310\">Compliance and Governance Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"litrp4\" data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3336\">Public Policy Aspirants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hva2db\" data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3356\">Legal Consultants</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ijtlfn\" data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3418\">Selection Process for Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3708\">Admission to the <strong data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3497\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting</strong> is based on a profile-based evaluation process that assesses academic qualifications, professional potential, communication skills, and the applicant\'s motivation to pursue specialized legal and policy studies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3789\">A key component of the selection process is the <strong data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3788\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"omgi1y\" data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"3833\">Statement of Purpose (SOP) Requirement</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3835\" data-end=\"4009\">Applicants are required to submit a <strong data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3912\">Statement of Purpose of 700&ndash;750 words</strong> explaining their interest in legislative drafting and their reasons for applying to the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4011\" data-end=\"4034\">The SOP should address:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4370\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s8qy5\" data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4075\">Academic and professional background.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"icy9op\" data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4155\">Interest in legislative drafting, public policy, governance, or legal reform.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vur50r\" data-start=\"4156\" data-end=\"4194\">Career goals and future aspirations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h08h9\" data-start=\"4195\" data-end=\"4239\">Reasons for choosing OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s6lfk3\" data-start=\"4240\" data-end=\"4306\">How the program aligns with professional development objectives.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t60f9l\" data-start=\"4307\" data-end=\"4370\">Areas of interest within legislative and regulatory drafting.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4509\">A well-structured SOP helps the admissions committee understand the applicant\'s motivation, commitment, and readiness for advanced study.</p>', '<p data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"623\">The <strong data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"145\">Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting at OP Jindal University</strong> is a specialized postgraduate program designed for legal professionals, policy analysts, legislative researchers, government officials, compliance experts, and governance practitioners who want to build expertise in legislative drafting, statutory interpretation, public policy, and regulatory governance. The program combines legal knowledge with practical drafting skills, preparing learners to contribute effectively to law-making, policy development, and regulatory reform.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"807\">To make advanced legal education accessible to both students and working professionals, OP Jindal University offers a structured fee payment plan with convenient installment options.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1oonj3\" data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"882\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"921\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"921\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"900\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"909\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"921\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<td data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"982\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"995\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1030\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1090\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1046\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1061\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1090\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1145\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1106\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1121\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1145\" data-col-size=\"sm\">By 15th January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1170\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1169\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1189\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1188\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1219\" data-col-size=\"sm\">As Per University Schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"81m6rz\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1235\">Fee Summary</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1251\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1261\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1321\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1307\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1321\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1352\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1336\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1352\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1369\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1368\">Total Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1389\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1387\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k1e8kr\" data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1426\">What Does the Program Fee Cover?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1671\">The <strong data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1485\">Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting fee structure</strong> provides access to a comprehensive curriculum covering legislative drafting, statutory interpretation, constitutional law, policy formulation, legal research, and regulatory governance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1723\">Students gain knowledge and practical exposure in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"2239\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ii8718\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1772\">Legislative Drafting and Law-Making Processes</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sj7066\" data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1815\">Constitutional Frameworks and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"okpbyn\" data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1861\">Statutory Interpretation and Legal Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k9nfah\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1904\">Public Policy and Regulatory Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16nmbeh\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1935\">Legal Research Methodologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncp0oy\" data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1982\">Plain Language and Legal Drafting Techniques</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jw1ub9\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2023\">Financial and Tax Legislative Drafting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5majbp\" data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2061\">Commercial and Economic Legislation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ws43t0\" data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2095\">Comparative Legislative Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eb4p0h\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2152\">Ethics, Transparency, and Accountability in Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g8j04w\" data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2199\">Legislative Reform and Regulatory Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1th79a\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2239\">Capstone Legislative Drafting Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2396\">The curriculum is designed to help learners understand how laws are conceptualized, drafted, interpreted, and implemented within modern governance systems.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"656\">The <strong data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"141\">Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting at OP Jindal University</strong> is a specialized postgraduate program designed for legal professionals, policy practitioners, government officials, legislative researchers, public administrators, and law graduates seeking expertise in law-making, statutory drafting, legislative policy, and regulatory governance. The curriculum provides a comprehensive understanding of the legislative process, constitutional principles, statutory interpretation, policy formulation, and advanced drafting techniques used in modern legal and regulatory systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"1162\">As governments and institutions increasingly require professionals who can draft clear, effective, and legally sound legislation, this program equips learners with the practical skills needed to contribute to public policy, legal reform, regulatory frameworks, and legislative governance. Through a combination of legal theory, policy analysis, and drafting practice, students develop expertise in creating laws that are precise, enforceable, and aligned with constitutional and public policy objectives.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1y8yz1e\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1228\">Quarter 1: Foundations of Legislative Drafting and Law-Making</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1495\">The first quarter introduces students to the legislative process, constitutional principles, and statutory interpretation. Learners develop a strong foundation in understanding how laws are created, interpreted, and implemented within democratic governance systems.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"2292\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1507\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1522\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"2292\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1621\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1620\">Introduction to Legislative Drafting and the Legislative Process</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1814\">Provides an overview of the legislative drafting profession, law-making procedures, parliamentary processes, bill development, and the role of legislative counsels in shaping public policy.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1871\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1870\">Constitutional Framework for Legislative Drafting</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"2060\">Examines constitutional principles, separation of powers, legislative competence, fundamental rights, and constitutional limitations that influence the drafting of laws and regulations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2292\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2130\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2129\">Statutory Interpretation for Legislative Counsels and Drafters</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2292\">Focuses on the principles and techniques used by courts, legislators, and legal professionals to interpret statutes, legislative intent, and legal provisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"124pe2m\" data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2368\">Quarter 2: Legal Language, Policy Development, and Legislative Research</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2586\">The second quarter develops the technical and analytical skills required for effective legislative drafting. Students learn how to communicate legal concepts clearly while aligning legislation with policy objectives.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"3305\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2613\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2613\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2598\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2613\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"3305\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2855\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2690\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2689\">Legal Language and Plain Language Drafting</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2855\">Explores legislative writing techniques that improve clarity, accessibility, precision, and legal effectiveness while reducing ambiguity in statutory provisions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"3093\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2916\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2915\">Policy Analysis for Legislative Counsels and Drafters</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"3093\">Introduces policy evaluation frameworks, regulatory impact analysis, stakeholder assessment, and evidence-based approaches used in legislative and public policy development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3305\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3142\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3141\">Research Methods for Legislative Drafting</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3305\">Develops legal research, comparative analysis, legislative review, and data collection skills required to support effective law-making and regulatory drafting.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jd509u\" data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3362\">Quarter 3: Specialized Legislative Drafting Practice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3601\">The third quarter focuses on practical legislative drafting across different legal and policy domains. Students gain hands-on exposure to drafting legislation that addresses social, economic, commercial, financial, and regulatory issues.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"4309\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3628\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3628\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3613\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3613\" data-end=\"3628\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3656\" data-end=\"4309\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3656\" data-end=\"3881\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3656\" data-end=\"3722\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3721\">Drafting of Primary Legislation and Subordinate Legislation</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"3881\">Covers the drafting of Acts, Bills, Rules, Regulations, Notifications, and delegated legislation while ensuring legal consistency and policy effectiveness.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"4112\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"3950\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3884\" data-end=\"3949\">Legislative Drafting for Social, Economic and Commercial Laws</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"4112\">Examines drafting approaches used in labour law, social welfare legislation, economic regulation, commercial governance, and public policy reform initiatives.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4309\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4158\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4157\">Financial and Tax Legislative Drafting</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4309\">Focuses on drafting financial regulations, taxation statutes, fiscal policies, revenue laws, and compliance frameworks governing economic activity.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"198l19g\" data-start=\"4311\" data-end=\"4374\">Quarter 4: Global Perspectives, Ethics, and Capstone Project</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4548\">The final quarter expands students\' understanding of international legislative practices while emphasizing ethical governance and professional responsibility in law-making.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4550\" data-end=\"5296\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4550\" data-end=\"4575\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4550\" data-end=\"4575\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4550\" data-end=\"4560\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4575\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4603\" data-end=\"5296\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4603\" data-end=\"4813\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4603\" data-end=\"4642\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4641\">Comparative Legislative Drafting</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4642\" data-end=\"4813\">Explores legislative drafting systems and law-making practices across different jurisdictions, helping students understand global approaches to legislative governance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4814\" data-end=\"5056\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4814\" data-end=\"4885\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4816\" data-end=\"4884\">Ethics, Accountability, and Transparency in Legislative Drafting</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"5056\">Examines ethical responsibilities, public accountability, transparency standards, conflict management, and integrity principles in legislative and regulatory drafting.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5057\" data-end=\"5296\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5057\" data-end=\"5101\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"5059\" data-end=\"5100\">Capstone Legislative Drafting Project</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"5101\" data-end=\"5296\">Provides practical experience through a comprehensive legislative drafting project where students prepare and defend a legislative or regulatory proposal addressing a real-world policy issue.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"15mzpfo\" data-start=\"5298\" data-end=\"5369\">Key Skills Developed Through the Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5371\" data-end=\"5586\">The <strong data-start=\"5375\" data-end=\"5446\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Legislative Drafting curriculum</strong> develops highly specialized legal, analytical, and policy-oriented skills required in legislative, regulatory, and governance environments.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5588\" data-end=\"6073\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"goczpd\" data-start=\"5588\" data-end=\"5625\">Legislative Drafting and Law-Making</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yl94id\" data-start=\"5626\" data-end=\"5652\">Statutory Interpretation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9sld6z\" data-start=\"5653\" data-end=\"5682\">Legal Research and Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pgabrb\" data-start=\"5683\" data-end=\"5718\">Policy Formulation and Evaluation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yee5xx\" data-start=\"5719\" data-end=\"5740\">Regulatory Drafting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2u59w4\" data-start=\"5741\" data-end=\"5773\">Constitutional Law Application</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"63jqsb\" data-start=\"5774\" data-end=\"5798\">Public Policy Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15fxz05\" data-start=\"5799\" data-end=\"5842\">Legal Writing and Plain Language Drafting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"woq4jr\" data-start=\"5843\" data-end=\"5883\">Financial and Tax Legislation Drafting</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c3gsyq\" data-start=\"5884\" data-end=\"5929\">Regulatory Compliance Framework Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t5wgob\" data-start=\"5930\" data-end=\"5961\">Legislative Impact Assessment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ygxcy\" data-start=\"5962\" data-end=\"6000\">Governance and Public Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m1vtv8\" data-start=\"6001\" data-end=\"6029\">Comparative Legal Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16syg56\" data-start=\"6030\" data-end=\"6073\">Legal Problem-Solving and Decision-Making</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(487, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 357, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 05:34:25', '2026-06-01 05:34:25', '<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"568\">The <strong data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"184\">B.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance admission process at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify students with strong analytical abilities, quantitative aptitude, critical thinking skills, and an interest in emerging technologies and modern finance. The university follows a structured selection process that evaluates academic performance, aptitude for finance and technology, and overall potential to succeed in an interdisciplinary learning environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"860\">The admission process is designed to ensure that students entering the program are prepared to excel in areas such as <strong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"859\">Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Financial Analytics, FinTech, Data Science, Blockchain Technology, Risk Management, Investment Analysis, and Digital Finance</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e43i7e\" data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"904\">Step 1: Verify Eligibility Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"993\">Before applying, candidates should ensure they meet the program\'s eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1011\">Applicants must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oof5w7\" data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1107\">Have successfully completed Class 12 or an equivalent qualification from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmk9oo\" data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1150\">Secure a minimum of 50% aggregate marks.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k1b1xm\" data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1282\">Have studied at least one of the following subjects:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rnalek\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1221\">Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13y29ne\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1246\">Business Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wt3kb1\" data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1261\">Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xewgp3\" data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1282\">Business Studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1409\">Students appearing for Class 12 examinations are also eligible to apply, subject to meeting the final admission requirements.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p2nus1\" data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1456\">Step 2: Submit the Online Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1575\">Eligible candidates must complete the online application form and provide accurate academic and personal information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1621\">Applicants are generally required to submit:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1762\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t7bwlu\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1641\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1667\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1689\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ai1596\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1730\">Class 10 and Class 12 academic records</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d5athu\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1762\">Required supporting documents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1854\">Completing the application form accurately helps ensure a smooth admission review process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n3ehxn\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1903\">Step 3: Document Submission and Verification</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1968\">Applicants must upload the required documents for verification.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s2tv07\" data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"1995\">For Indian Applicants</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2121\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2syl9\" data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2018\">Class 10 Mark Sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u4ghwo\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2055\">Class 12 Mark Sheet (if available)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"srys6z\" data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2094\">Aadhaar Card or valid identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lye5s8\" data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2121\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sujezs\" data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2155\">For International Applicants</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2254\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i82cgw\" data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2167\">Passport</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19wyp6d\" data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2207\">Academic transcripts and certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kr5miw\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2254\">Additional supporting documents, if required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2365\">The university verifies all submitted documents before proceeding to the next stage of the admission process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1p2mfgy\" data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2405\">Step 4: Appear for FACTA Assessment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2545\">Applicants are required to appear for the <strong data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2510\">FACTA (Finance Aptitude and Critical Thinking Assessment)</strong> conducted by OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2572\">The assessment evaluates:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2725\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kf75ih\" data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2597\">Quantitative aptitude</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vma3rj\" data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2617\">Logical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10v4scw\" data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2639\">Analytical thinking</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6on59d\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2673\">Critical problem-solving skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csuu31\" data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2694\">Financial aptitude</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1twehyc\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2725\">Decision-making capabilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2846\">The FACTA assessment helps identify students who have the aptitude required for a technology-driven finance curriculum.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gv9fwp\" data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2877\">Step 5: Personal Interview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2980\">Candidates shortlisted after the assessment stage are invited to participate in a personal interview.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3006\">The interview evaluates:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3189\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljhqgp\" data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3057\">Interest in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"czmyah\" data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3079\">Academic motivation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3102\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xoq8j0\" data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3130\">Problem-solving abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qn84m5\" data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3151\">Career aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pbnzc\" data-start=\"3152\" data-end=\"3189\">Overall suitability for the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3328\">This stage allows applicants to demonstrate their enthusiasm for emerging technologies, financial innovation, and future-focused careers.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"92iloq\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3373\">Step 6: Comprehensive Profile Evaluation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3502\">Following the assessment and interview process, the admissions committee conducts a holistic review of the applicant\'s profile.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3539\">The evaluation typically considers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3769\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hhpkqg\" data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3572\">Class 12 academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f95r1x\" data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3599\">FACTA Assessment results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l9mla9\" data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3632\">Personal Interview performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gszn90\" data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3677\">Analytical and critical thinking abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"672qs\" data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3723\">Interest in AI, Finance, and Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tvympe\" data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3769\">Overall academic and professional potential</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3771\" data-end=\"3894\">The university follows a merit-based selection process that focuses on identifying high-potential students for the program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yj6tao\" data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"3945\">Step 7: Admission Offer and Selection Decision</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"4069\">Candidates who successfully meet the admission requirements receive an official admission offer from OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4103\">The final selection is based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4242\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jvptfr\" data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4130\">Eligibility fulfillment</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oy2id\" data-start=\"4131\" data-end=\"4153\">Academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f95r1x\" data-start=\"4154\" data-end=\"4180\">FACTA Assessment results</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l9mla9\" data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4213\">Personal Interview performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ov6ca\" data-start=\"4214\" data-end=\"4242\">Overall profile assessment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4244\" data-end=\"4344\">Selected applicants are informed through the university\'s official admission communication channels.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ukunvt\" data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4396\">Step 8: Fee Payment and Enrollment Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4398\" data-end=\"4444\">To secure admission, selected candidates must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4446\" data-end=\"4592\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tjfou\" data-start=\"4446\" data-end=\"4475\">Accept the admission offer.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zf0fzg\" data-start=\"4476\" data-end=\"4512\">Complete the registration process.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"342uyj\" data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4547\">Pay the applicable program fees.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eusne5\" data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4592\">Submit any pending documents, if required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4594\" data-end=\"4734\">Once all formalities are completed and verified, enrollment in the <strong data-start=\"4661\" data-end=\"4709\">B.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</strong> is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18rr2x4\" data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4806\">Selection Criteria for B.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4808\" data-end=\"4875\">Admission to the program is based on a comprehensive evaluation of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4877\" data-end=\"5080\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hhpkqg\" data-start=\"4877\" data-end=\"4908\">Class 12 academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fs4au2\" data-start=\"4909\" data-end=\"4968\">FACTA (Finance Aptitude and Critical Thinking Assessment)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tnvnax\" data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"4989\">Personal Interview</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"60qt9m\" data-start=\"4990\" data-end=\"5028\">Analytical and quantitative aptitude</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"5029\" data-end=\"5051\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"196ocya\" data-start=\"5052\" data-end=\"5080\">Overall academic potential</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"655\">The <strong data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"169\">B.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for students who want to build expertise in the rapidly growing fields of <strong data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"417\">Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Financial Analytics, FinTech, Investment Management, Data Science, Blockchain Technology, and Quantitative Finance</strong>. The program combines technology-driven learning with modern financial knowledge, preparing students for careers in the future of banking, fintech, financial services, wealth management, risk analytics, and AI-powered business solutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"891\">As organizations increasingly adopt AI and automation to transform financial decision-making, this interdisciplinary degree provides students with the analytical, technical, and business skills needed to thrive in the digital economy.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qe4u85\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"965\">Eligibility Criteria for B.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1118\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1053\">OP Jindal University B.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</strong>, candidates must satisfy the following eligibility requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1693\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3s99d9\" data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1213\">Successfully completed <strong data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1188\">Class 12 or an equivalent qualification</strong> from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19zcoti\" data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1291\">Secured a minimum of <strong data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1260\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in the qualifying examination.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rzu927\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1440\">Must have studied at least one of the following subjects in Class 12:\r\n<ul data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rnalek\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1379\">Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13y29ne\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1404\">Business Mathematics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wt3kb1\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1419\">Statistics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xewgp3\" data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1440\">Business Studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tniswd\" data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1569\">Students <strong data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1491\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> are also eligible to apply, subject to fulfillment of admission requirements.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5elkr6\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1693\">Applicants from recognized boards, including NIOS or equivalent boards, may apply as per university admission guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ym8t36\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1730\">Documents Required for Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1811\">Candidates are required to submit valid documents during the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s2tv07\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1838\">For Indian Applicants</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1970\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2syl9\" data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1861\">Class 10 Mark Sheet</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u4ghwo\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1898\">Class 12 Mark Sheet (if available)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1agiufz\" data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1943\">Aadhaar Card or other valid identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lye5s8\" data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1970\">Passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sujezs\" data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2004\">For International Applicants</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2109\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i82cgw\" data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2016\">Passport</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19wyp6d\" data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2056\">Academic transcripts and certificates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l8hrgw\" data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2109\">Additional documents as required by the university</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2184\">Proper documentation ensures a smooth admission and verification process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eo7kda\" data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2223\">Who Should Apply for This Program?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2417\">The <strong data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2277\">B.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</strong> is ideal for students who are interested in technology, data analytics, financial markets, artificial intelligence, and digital innovation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2461\">This program is particularly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2912\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lypvqt\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2533\">Students interested in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mva7wm\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2598\">Aspirants seeking careers in FinTech and Financial Technology.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"llg313\" data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2656\">Future Financial Analysts and Investment Professionals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hvgof7\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2718\">Students interested in Data Science and Business Analytics.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ijejs\" data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2792\">Individuals aspiring to work in Digital Banking and Financial Services.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wrwyy5\" data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2858\">Learners interested in Quantitative Finance and Risk Analytics.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j76c4q\" data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2912\">Future AI Consultants and Technology Professionals.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18wstqo\" data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2983\">Selection Process for B.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3220\">Admission to the <strong data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3071\">OP Jindal University B.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</strong> is based on a multi-stage evaluation process designed to assess academic preparedness, analytical aptitude, and overall suitability for the program.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3416\">The university evaluates applicants through an aptitude assessment and personal interview process to identify students with strong potential for success in finance and technology-driven careers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"150ksvy\" data-start=\"3418\" data-end=\"3457\">Step 1: Submit the Application Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3459\" data-end=\"3577\">Applicants must complete and submit the online admission application form with accurate academic and personal details.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3705\">Candidates should ensure that all required information and supporting documents are submitted within the prescribed timelines.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ib0d17\" data-start=\"3707\" data-end=\"3735\">Step 2: FACTA Assessment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3869\">Applicants are required to appear for the <strong data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3840\">FACTA (Finance Aptitude and Critical Thinking Assessment)</strong> conducted by the university.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3910\">The assessment is designed to evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3912\" data-end=\"4041\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kf75ih\" data-start=\"3912\" data-end=\"3935\">Quantitative aptitude</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vma3rj\" data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"3955\">Logical reasoning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10sj9ht\" data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"3983\">Critical thinking ability</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kst59m\" data-start=\"3984\" data-end=\"4005\">Financial awareness</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xg8qua\" data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4041\">Analytical problem-solving skills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4207\">The FACTA assessment helps identify candidates who possess the foundational skills necessary for success in AI, finance, analytics, and data-driven decision-making.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eu3m0c\" data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4239\">Step 3: Personal Interview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4241\" data-end=\"4328\">Candidates shortlisted after the assessment stage are invited for a personal interview.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4330\" data-end=\"4359\">The interview helps evaluate:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4361\" data-end=\"4525\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"4361\" data-end=\"4383\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"czmyah\" data-start=\"4384\" data-end=\"4405\">Academic motivation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljhqgp\" data-start=\"4406\" data-end=\"4455\">Interest in Artificial Intelligence and Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ln14ta\" data-start=\"4456\" data-end=\"4482\">Problem-solving approach</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qn84m5\" data-start=\"4483\" data-end=\"4503\">Career aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mycmq0\" data-start=\"4504\" data-end=\"4525\">Overall program fit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4527\" data-end=\"4667\">The interaction allows applicants to demonstrate their enthusiasm for technology, innovation, financial markets, and future-focused careers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wzhzw6\" data-start=\"4669\" data-end=\"4696\">Step 4: Final Selection</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4698\" data-end=\"4799\">Final admission is granted based on the applicant\'s overall performance across all evaluation stages.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4801\" data-end=\"4826\">The university considers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4828\" data-end=\"4992\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hv344f\" data-start=\"4828\" data-end=\"4862\">Academic performance in Class 12</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pp35jr\" data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4893\">FACTA Assessment performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l9mla9\" data-start=\"4894\" data-end=\"4926\">Personal Interview performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eiiomh\" data-start=\"4927\" data-end=\"4953\">Overall profile strength</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v1j4zu\" data-start=\"4954\" data-end=\"4992\">Potential for success in the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4994\" data-end=\"5076\">Selected candidates receive an official admission offer from OP Jindal University.</p>', '<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"596\">The <strong data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"163\">B.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance at OP Jindal University</strong> is a future-focused undergraduate program that combines the power of <strong data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"387\">Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Financial Analytics, FinTech, Data Science, Blockchain Technology, Risk Management, and Investment Analysis</strong>. Designed for students who want to build careers in the rapidly evolving intersection of finance and technology, the program equips learners with the skills needed to thrive in AI-driven financial ecosystems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"937\">With growing demand for professionals who can leverage artificial intelligence to solve complex financial challenges, this program provides a strong foundation in both finance and emerging technologies. To make quality education accessible, OP Jindal University offers a structured tuition payment plan with convenient installment options.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"apra98\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1021\">OP Jindal University B.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1401\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1039\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1048\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1060\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1401\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1169\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1121\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1134\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1169\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1227\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1185\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1198\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 65,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1227\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1243\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1256\">INR 65,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1277\">By 30th July 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1327\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1293\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1306\">INR 65,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1327\">By 30th July 2028</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1401\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1352\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1351\">Total Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1371\"><strong data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1370\">INR 2,20,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1401\">As Per University Schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"81m6rz\" data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1417\">Fee Summary</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1579\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1443\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1443\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1433\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1443\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1579\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1503\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1489\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1503\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1534\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1518\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1534\">INR 1,95,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1579\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1559\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1558\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1579\"><strong data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1577\">INR 2,20,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k1e8kr\" data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1616\">What Does the Program Fee Cover?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1872\">The <strong data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1684\">B.Sc. in Artificial Intelligence and Finance fee structure</strong> provides access to an interdisciplinary curriculum that combines advanced technology with modern finance, helping students develop expertise in some of the fastest-growing career domains.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1904\">Key areas of learning include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"2428\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14q4qe9\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1952\">Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9w01l\" data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1999\">Financial Analytics and Quantitative Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m96qbe\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2035\">FinTech and Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q59ff2\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2079\">Financial Markets and Investment Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dse63w\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2116\">Python for Financial Data Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vimsbe\" data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2163\">Data Visualization and Business Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12lma2h\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2205\">Risk Management and Financial Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aeyf34\" data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2251\">Cybersecurity and Financial Data Protection</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x5d8b4\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2294\">Digital Banking and Financial Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pcf1gx\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2338\">Deep Learning and Agentic AI Applications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"drdoze\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2383\">Portfolio Management and Wealth Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7c9n9y\" data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2428\">Industry Internship and Practical Learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2611\">The curriculum is designed to prepare students for technology-driven financial careers through a combination of theoretical knowledge, practical applications, and industry exposure.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"654\">The <strong data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"127\">B.Sc. AI and Finance at OP Jindal University</strong> is a next-generation undergraduate program that combines <strong data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"338\">Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Data Science, FinTech, Financial Analytics, Risk Management, Investment Analysis, and Financial Technology</strong> into a single industry-focused curriculum. Designed for students who want to build careers at the intersection of finance and technology, the program prepares graduates for the rapidly evolving world of AI-driven financial services, digital banking, fintech innovation, quantitative finance, and business analytics.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"1095\">The curriculum follows a progressive learning approach where students first develop strong foundations in economics, finance, accounting, management, and analytics before advancing to artificial intelligence, machine learning, financial modelling, deep learning, cybersecurity, and investment management. The inclusion of a four-month intensive internship further ensures that learners gain practical industry experience before graduation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"q9iett\" data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1160\">Trimester 1: Foundations of Business, Economics, and Finance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1349\">The first trimester establishes the fundamental concepts of economics, finance, management, and accounting that form the backbone of modern financial systems and business decision-making.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1376\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1376\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1361\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1376\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1627\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1454\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1453\">Microscopes and Markets: Parallel Histories</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1627\">Explores the evolution of scientific discovery and economic systems, helping students understand how innovation influences markets, industries, and societal development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1807\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1658\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1657\">Principles of Economics</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1807\">Introduces microeconomics and macroeconomics, focusing on market structures, economic behaviour, demand and supply, and economic decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1952\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1836\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1835\">Financial Mathematics</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1952\">Develops quantitative skills required for financial analysis, investment calculations, and business forecasting.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"2105\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1996\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1995\">Fundamental Principles of Management</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2105\">Covers key management concepts including planning, organizing, leadership, and strategic decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2133\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2132\">Financial Accounting</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2249\">Provides a foundation in financial reporting, accounting principles, and interpretation of financial statements.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"bbmqia\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2316\">Trimester 2: Data-Driven Decision Making and Corporate Finance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2473\">Students begin applying quantitative and analytical tools to business and financial environments while strengthening communication and professional skills.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"3281\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2500\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2500\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2485\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2500\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"3281\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2681\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2576\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2575\">Business Statistics and Decision Sciences</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2681\">Introduces statistical methods, probability, forecasting, and data-driven decision-making techniques.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2818\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2733\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2732\">Workplace Dynamics and Professional Presence</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2818\">Develops communication, teamwork, leadership, and workplace effectiveness skills.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2971\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2879\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2878\">Critical Thinking, Self Reflection, and Communication</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2971\">Enhances analytical thinking, problem-solving, and professional communication abilities.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3096\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"2996\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2974\" data-end=\"2995\">Corporate Finance</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3096\">Explores capital structure, investment decisions, valuation, and corporate financial management.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3281\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3145\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3144\">FinTech, Blockchain, and Digital Currency</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3281\">Examines emerging financial technologies, blockchain ecosystems, cryptocurrencies, and digital transformation in financial services.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jis0ag\" data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3339\">Trimester 3: Analytics, ESG, and Financial Technology</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3488\">The third trimester introduces students to financial analytics, business intelligence, legal frameworks, sustainability, and emerging technologies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"4285\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3515\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3515\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3500\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3515\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"4285\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3679\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3580\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3579\">Tableau for Data Visualisation</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3679\">Develops skills in data visualization, dashboard creation, and business intelligence reporting.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3815\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3710\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3709\">Business Law and Ethics</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3815\">Covers legal frameworks, corporate governance, regulatory compliance, and ethical business practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3984\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3878\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3877\">Introduction to Environmental Science and ESG Practices</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3878\" data-end=\"3984\">Explores sustainability, environmental governance, social responsibility, and ESG reporting standards.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"4149\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"4045\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3987\" data-end=\"4044\">Introduction to Analytics and Artificial Intelligence</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4149\">Provides a foundation in AI concepts, predictive analytics, and intelligent decision-making systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4285\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4187\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4186\">Banking Systems and Technology</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4187\" data-end=\"4285\">Examines modern banking infrastructure, digital banking platforms, and financial technologies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qx38r\" data-start=\"4287\" data-end=\"4355\">Trimester 4: Artificial Intelligence and Financial Data Analytics</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4357\" data-end=\"4468\">Students begin applying artificial intelligence and programming tools to solve financial and business problems.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"5304\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4495\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4495\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4480\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4480\" data-end=\"4495\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"5304\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"4676\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"4564\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4525\" data-end=\"4563\">Python for Financial Data Analysis</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4564\" data-end=\"4676\">Introduces Python programming for financial modelling, data analysis, and quantitative finance applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4677\" data-end=\"4821\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4677\" data-end=\"4711\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4679\" data-end=\"4710\">AI for Finance and Business</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4711\" data-end=\"4821\">Explores AI-powered decision-making, automation, predictive modelling, and intelligent business solutions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4822\" data-end=\"4975\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4822\" data-end=\"4866\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4824\" data-end=\"4865\">Cybersecurity and Privacy Regulations</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"4866\" data-end=\"4975\">Covers digital security frameworks, cyber risk management, data protection laws, and privacy regulations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4976\" data-end=\"5122\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4976\" data-end=\"5025\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4978\" data-end=\"5024\">Behavioral Economics and Social Psychology</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5025\" data-end=\"5122\">Studies human decision-making, consumer behaviour, investor psychology, and market sentiment.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5123\" data-end=\"5304\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5123\" data-end=\"5198\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"5125\" data-end=\"5197\">Economics for Change: Community Engagement &amp; Responsible Citizenship</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5198\" data-end=\"5304\">Examines inclusive development, social responsibility, and the role of economics in societal progress.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1k28f9r\" data-start=\"5306\" data-end=\"5372\">Trimester 5: Financial Markets, Databases, and Machine Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5374\" data-end=\"5499\">This trimester focuses on advanced finance concepts and the technological systems that support modern financial institutions.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5501\" data-end=\"6170\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5501\" data-end=\"5526\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5501\" data-end=\"5526\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5501\" data-end=\"5511\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"5511\" data-end=\"5526\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5554\" data-end=\"6170\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5554\" data-end=\"5697\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5554\" data-end=\"5594\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5556\" data-end=\"5593\">Fundamentals of Financial Markets</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5594\" data-end=\"5697\">Covers capital markets, securities, trading mechanisms, investment products, and market structures.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5698\" data-end=\"5856\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5698\" data-end=\"5744\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5700\" data-end=\"5743\">Database Management Systems for Finance</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5744\" data-end=\"5856\">Introduces financial databases, data storage systems, and information management for financial applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5857\" data-end=\"6008\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5857\" data-end=\"5896\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5859\" data-end=\"5895\">Introduction to Machine Learning</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5896\" data-end=\"6008\">Explores supervised and unsupervised learning techniques, predictive analytics, and machine learning models.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6009\" data-end=\"6170\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6009\" data-end=\"6047\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"6011\" data-end=\"6046\">Marketing of Financial Services</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"6047\" data-end=\"6170\">Examines strategies used by banks, insurance firms, fintech companies, and investment institutions to engage customers.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"148pjw3\" data-start=\"6172\" data-end=\"6235\">Trimester 6: Advanced AI, Risk Management, and Deep Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6237\" data-end=\"6356\">Students build expertise in risk analytics, artificial intelligence, automation, and ethical technology implementation.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"6358\" data-end=\"7023\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"6358\" data-end=\"6383\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6358\" data-end=\"6383\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6358\" data-end=\"6368\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"6368\" data-end=\"6383\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"6411\" data-end=\"7023\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6411\" data-end=\"6555\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6411\" data-end=\"6447\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"6413\" data-end=\"6446\">Risk Management and Modelling</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"6447\" data-end=\"6555\">Covers financial risk assessment, risk measurement frameworks, portfolio risk, and predictive modelling.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6556\" data-end=\"6715\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6556\" data-end=\"6602\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"6558\" data-end=\"6601\">Theories and Applications of Agentic AI</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"6602\" data-end=\"6715\">Explores autonomous AI systems, intelligent agents, decision-making frameworks, and emerging AI applications.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6716\" data-end=\"6862\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6716\" data-end=\"6756\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"6718\" data-end=\"6755\">Neural Networks and Deep Learning</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"6756\" data-end=\"6862\">Introduces advanced machine learning architectures used in AI-driven financial and business solutions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6863\" data-end=\"7023\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6863\" data-end=\"6891\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"6865\" data-end=\"6890\">AI Ethics and Society</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"6891\" data-end=\"7023\">Examines responsible AI development, algorithmic fairness, privacy, governance, and ethical implications of intelligent systems.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ys84ce\" data-start=\"7025\" data-end=\"7089\">Trimester 7: Investment Management and Intelligent Automation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7091\" data-end=\"7188\">The curriculum shifts toward advanced investment strategies and business automation technologies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"7190\" data-end=\"7835\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"7190\" data-end=\"7215\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"7190\" data-end=\"7215\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"7190\" data-end=\"7200\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"7200\" data-end=\"7215\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"7243\" data-end=\"7835\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"7243\" data-end=\"7427\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7243\" data-end=\"7294\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"7245\" data-end=\"7293\">Investment Analysis and Portfolio Management</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"7294\" data-end=\"7427\">Covers investment strategies, portfolio construction, asset allocation, performance evaluation, and wealth management principles.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7428\" data-end=\"7580\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7428\" data-end=\"7461\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"7430\" data-end=\"7460\">Robotic Process Automation</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"7461\" data-end=\"7580\">Examines automation technologies that improve efficiency in financial services, operations, and business processes.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7581\" data-end=\"7723\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7581\" data-end=\"7598\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"7583\" data-end=\"7597\">Elective 1</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"7598\" data-end=\"7723\">Allows students to specialize in entrepreneurship, finance, innovation, business strategy, or technology-focused domains.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7724\" data-end=\"7835\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7724\" data-end=\"7741\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"7726\" data-end=\"7740\">Elective 2</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"7741\" data-end=\"7835\">Provides additional opportunities for domain specialization and industry-focused learning.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11esm1m\" data-start=\"7837\" data-end=\"7897\">Trimester 8: Specialization and Industry-Focused Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7899\" data-end=\"7998\">Students customize their academic journey through elective choices aligned with their career goals.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"8000\" data-end=\"8398\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"8000\" data-end=\"8025\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"8000\" data-end=\"8025\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"8000\" data-end=\"8010\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"8010\" data-end=\"8025\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"8053\" data-end=\"8398\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"8053\" data-end=\"8182\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8053\" data-end=\"8070\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"8055\" data-end=\"8069\">Elective 3</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"8070\" data-end=\"8182\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Advanced specialization subject selected from finance, entrepreneurship, innovation, or management pathways.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8183\" data-end=\"8298\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8183\" data-end=\"8200\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"8185\" data-end=\"8199\">Elective 4</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"8200\" data-end=\"8298\">Focuses on practical and industry-relevant applications within the chosen specialization area.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"8299\" data-end=\"8398\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8299\" data-end=\"8316\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"8301\" data-end=\"8315\">Elective 5</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"8316\" data-end=\"8398\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Enables deeper expertise in emerging business, finance, or technology domains.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16reigt\" data-start=\"8400\" data-end=\"8441\">Trimester 9: Co-op Industry Internship</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"8443\" data-end=\"8728\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"8443\" data-end=\"8470\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"8443\" data-end=\"8470\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"8443\" data-end=\"8455\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"8455\" data-end=\"8470\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"8500\" data-end=\"8728\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"8500\" data-end=\"8728\">\r\n<td data-start=\"8500\" data-end=\"8533\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"8502\" data-end=\"8532\">Co-op Intensive Internship</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"8533\" data-end=\"8728\">A four-month industry internship that provides real-world experience in finance, fintech, AI, banking, investment analysis, business analytics, consulting, or technology-driven organizations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1b7g9ky\" data-start=\"8730\" data-end=\"8786\">Elective Specializations and Career-Oriented Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8788\" data-end=\"8952\">Students can choose from a diverse range of electives that support career development in entrepreneurship, finance, innovation, technology, and business leadership.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"8954\" data-end=\"8981\">Key elective areas include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8983\" data-end=\"9407\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bw9z1u\" data-start=\"8983\" data-end=\"9008\">Social Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ej4w05\" data-start=\"9009\" data-end=\"9044\">Startup Incubation and Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11n1yr7\" data-start=\"9045\" data-end=\"9071\">Digital Entrepreneurship</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9vkgfq\" data-start=\"9072\" data-end=\"9108\">Innovation and Product Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rdjbze\" data-start=\"9109\" data-end=\"9145\">Business Strategy for New Ventures</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"803ld7\" data-start=\"9146\" data-end=\"9179\">Digital Marketing and Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j0qdsm\" data-start=\"9180\" data-end=\"9214\">Financial Reporting and Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o2gjq5\" data-start=\"9215\" data-end=\"9243\">Advanced Corporate Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mf5rzs\" data-start=\"9244\" data-end=\"9254\">Taxation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kgcawj\" data-start=\"9255\" data-end=\"9277\">Strategic Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y1wgsx\" data-start=\"9278\" data-end=\"9293\">Corporate Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rqccxh\" data-start=\"9294\" data-end=\"9326\">Banking Systems and Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"118wvgh\" data-start=\"9327\" data-end=\"9348\">Audit and Assurance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aypdcz\" data-start=\"9349\" data-end=\"9373\">Performance Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18k0b4k\" data-start=\"9374\" data-end=\"9407\">Family Business and MSME Growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nhww3q\" data-start=\"9409\" data-end=\"9452\">Key Skills Developed Through the Program</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9454\" data-end=\"9826\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fqnu6s\" data-start=\"9454\" data-end=\"9490\">Artificial Intelligence in Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e0satu\" data-start=\"9491\" data-end=\"9527\">Machine Learning and Deep Learning</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1722gfr\" data-start=\"9528\" data-end=\"9549\">Financial Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"algwyj\" data-start=\"9550\" data-end=\"9571\">Investment Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10codd\" data-start=\"9572\" data-end=\"9594\">Portfolio Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14oo3gc\" data-start=\"9595\" data-end=\"9619\">FinTech and Blockchain</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a2qrya\" data-start=\"9620\" data-end=\"9641\">Financial Modelling</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gwptu\" data-start=\"9642\" data-end=\"9662\">Data Visualization</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hk9mzp\" data-start=\"9663\" data-end=\"9683\">Python Programming</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vk5fqw\" data-start=\"9684\" data-end=\"9701\">Risk Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16qco2j\" data-start=\"9702\" data-end=\"9725\">Business Intelligence</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5c41uw\" data-start=\"9726\" data-end=\"9746\">Banking Technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y45302\" data-start=\"9747\" data-end=\"9775\">Robotic Process Automation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q89ff1\" data-start=\"9776\" data-end=\"9798\">Quantitative Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bm1u3f\" data-start=\"9799\" data-end=\"9826\">Financial Decision-Making</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 220000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(488, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 358, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 05:42:04', '2026-06-01 05:42:04', '<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"593\">The <strong data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"190\">Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice admission process at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify motivated individuals who are passionate about understanding crime, justice systems, criminal law, victim rights, public policy, and social change. The university follows a holistic admission process that evaluates academic performance, motivation, communication skills, and the applicant\'s potential to contribute meaningfully to the fields of criminology and criminal justice.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"845\">Whether you are a recent graduate, legal professional, law enforcement practitioner, social worker, researcher, or public policy enthusiast, the admission process is structured to assess your readiness for advanced study in crime and justice studies.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e43i7e\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"889\">Step 1: Verify Eligibility Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"978\">Before applying, candidates should ensure they meet the program\'s eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"996\">Applicants must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ld2mnx\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1082\">Hold a Bachelor\'s degree with a minimum of 50% marks from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jx2pfo\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1249\">Be from any academic discipline, although graduates from Psychology, Sociology, Law, Political Science, and Social Work may find direct relevance to the curriculum.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hypgwt\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1366\">Have an interest in criminology, criminal justice, criminal law, public policy, social justice, or related fields.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1428\">Professional work experience is not mandatory for admission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"107tu6k\" data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1477\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1602\">Eligible candidates must submit the online application form with accurate personal, academic, and professional information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1649\">Applicants are generally required to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1794\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t7bwlu\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1669\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1698\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1720\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1wgk9\" data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1744\">Academic achievements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tmpiqo\" data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1794\">Relevant professional experience, if applicable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1890\">Submitting complete and accurate information helps ensure a smooth application review process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kn2ntm\" data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1930\">Step 3: Submit Academic Transcripts</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"2032\">Candidates are required to upload academic transcripts and mark sheets from their qualifying degree.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2093\">The admissions committee reviews these documents to assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2235\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oy2id\" data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2117\">Academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n4mntt\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2142\">Educational background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cwzt16\" data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2183\">Readiness for postgraduate-level study</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e4kaae\" data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2235\">Ability to engage with research-oriented learning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2328\">Academic transcripts form an important component of the overall profile evaluation process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jnealn\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2378\">Step 4: Submit the Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2538\">A key component of the <strong data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2493\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice admission process</strong> is the submission of a Statement of Purpose.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2571\">The SOP should clearly explain:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2923\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u0kc04\" data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2620\">Interest in criminology and criminal justice.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s8qy5\" data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2660\">Academic and professional background.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1npfl5a\" data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2692\">Career goals and aspirations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rpql1\" data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2731\">Motivation for pursuing the program.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g8y2gb\" data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2849\">Areas of interest within crime, law, justice, victimology, policing, corrections, public policy, or social justice.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ei3uel\" data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2923\">How the program aligns with future academic or professional objectives.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"3069\">A strong SOP enables applicants to demonstrate their passion, intellectual curiosity, and commitment to understanding crime and justice systems.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6ny5fy\" data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3123\">Step 5: Application Review and Profile Evaluation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3284\">Once the application, transcripts, and Statement of Purpose are submitted, the admissions committee conducts a comprehensive review of the applicant\'s profile.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3286\" data-end=\"3321\">The evaluation generally considers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3538\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3348\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3371\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14whrwn\" data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3409\">Quality of the Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13nj6wa\" data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3456\">Interest in criminology and criminal justice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tg2eaz\" data-start=\"3457\" data-end=\"3500\">Career aspirations and professional goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pbnzc\" data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3538\">Overall suitability for the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3680\">The university adopts a profile-based assessment approach to identify candidates who can contribute effectively to the learning environment.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fttmx2\" data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3738\">Step 6: Personal Interview for Shortlisted Candidates</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3835\">Candidates shortlisted after the application review stage are invited for a personal interview.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3837\" data-end=\"3864\">The interview helps assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"4075\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"130ct5n\" data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3903\">Motivation for pursuing the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ueu63h\" data-start=\"3904\" data-end=\"3944\">Communication and interpersonal skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj3r3o\" data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"3989\">Critical thinking and analytical abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qmembn\" data-start=\"3990\" data-end=\"4033\">Understanding of crime and justice issues</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dwzlh2\" data-start=\"4034\" data-end=\"4053\">Career objectives</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mycmq0\" data-start=\"4054\" data-end=\"4075\">Overall program fit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4077\" data-end=\"4204\">The interview provides applicants with an opportunity to discuss their interests and demonstrate their commitment to the field.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fbdo86\" data-start=\"4206\" data-end=\"4241\">Step 7: Final Selection Decision</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4337\">Following the evaluation process, the admissions committee makes the final selection decision.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4361\">Admission is based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4363\" data-end=\"4521\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oy2id\" data-start=\"4363\" data-end=\"4385\">Academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4408\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n7w4a\" data-start=\"4409\" data-end=\"4431\">Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hzuowx\" data-start=\"4432\" data-end=\"4464\">Personal interview performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"31t02r\" data-start=\"4465\" data-end=\"4494\">Motivation and career goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eiiomh\" data-start=\"4495\" data-end=\"4521\">Overall profile strength</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"4605\">Selected applicants receive an official admission offer from OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ukunvt\" data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4657\">Step 8: Fee Payment and Enrollment Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4659\" data-end=\"4705\">To secure admission, selected candidates must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4707\" data-end=\"4856\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tjfou\" data-start=\"4707\" data-end=\"4736\">Accept the admission offer.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y8swbi\" data-start=\"4737\" data-end=\"4777\">Complete the registration formalities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1utj608\" data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4811\">Pay the applicable program fee.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eusne5\" data-start=\"4812\" data-end=\"4856\">Submit any pending documents, if required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4858\" data-end=\"5002\">Once all requirements are fulfilled and verified, enrollment in the <strong data-start=\"4926\" data-end=\"4977\">Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice</strong> is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1p7i8qy\" data-start=\"5004\" data-end=\"5077\">Selection Criteria for Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5142\">Admission to the program is based on a comprehensive review of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5144\" data-end=\"5388\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aytf2a\" data-start=\"5144\" data-end=\"5188\">Bachelor\'s degree and academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"5189\" data-end=\"5211\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8flj6f\" data-start=\"5212\" data-end=\"5240\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hzuowx\" data-start=\"5241\" data-end=\"5273\">Personal interview performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13nj6wa\" data-start=\"5274\" data-end=\"5320\">Interest in criminology and criminal justice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1br49ft\" data-start=\"5321\" data-end=\"5358\">Communication and analytical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2z8q5y\" data-start=\"5359\" data-end=\"5388\">Overall application profile</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"573\">The <strong data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"175\">Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for students and professionals who want to develop expertise in crime analysis, criminal justice systems, criminal law, victimology, criminological research, public policy, law enforcement, and social justice. The program provides an interdisciplinary understanding of crime and justice by combining insights from criminology, sociology, psychology, law, governance, and public policy.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"915\">Whether you aspire to work in criminal justice administration, law enforcement agencies, legal services, victim advocacy, social policy, corrections, research organizations, or public institutions, the program offers the academic foundation and analytical skills required to understand and address contemporary crime and justice challenges.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"l16p5z\" data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"992\">Eligibility Criteria for Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1145\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1083\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice</strong>, candidates must fulfill the following academic requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lxkceb\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1235\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1205\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with a minimum of 50% marks</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c15dcj\" data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1299\">Graduates from any academic discipline are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w9xolk\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1374\">Candidates from diverse educational backgrounds are encouraged to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e1k9dk\" data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1441\">Professional work experience is <strong data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1426\">not mandatory</strong> for admission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1551\">While applicants from all disciplines may apply, the program is particularly well-suited for graduates from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1680\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o99p57\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1565\">Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ypifik\" data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1577\">Sociology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o472q\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1583\">Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqbpbp\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1603\">Political Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ps7khe\" data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1617\">Social Work</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z08lux\" data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1633\">Public Policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t2vpwo\" data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1647\">Criminology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jg5ffm\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1680\">Humanities and Social Sciences</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1830\">The interdisciplinary structure of the program enables learners from multiple academic backgrounds to contribute to and benefit from the curriculum.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eo7kda\" data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1869\">Who Should Apply for This Program?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"2074\">The <strong data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1926\">Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice</strong> is ideal for individuals interested in understanding crime, justice systems, criminal behaviour, social policy, legal processes, and public safety.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2118\">This program is particularly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2491\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hxnokt\" data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2142\">Psychology Graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vbtlt6\" data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2164\">Sociology Graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"125xr78\" data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2180\">Law Graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wmtb2r\" data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2210\">Political Science Graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9i3w3u\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2238\">Social Work Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ow89wl\" data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2271\">Criminal Justice Practitioners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5u7nsj\" data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2310\">Police and Law Enforcement Personnel</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"litrp4\" data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2336\">Public Policy Aspirants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rxltwo\" data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2364\">Researchers and Academics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lnj7x6\" data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2402\">NGO and Social Sector Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wcu9fc\" data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2427\">Human Rights Advocates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zqsr3w\" data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2491\">Professionals working in Governance and Public Administration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1k8kq8i\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2565\">Selection Process for Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2874\">Admission to the <strong data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2656\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice</strong> follows a holistic and profile-based evaluation process. The university assesses an applicant\'s academic qualifications, motivation, communication skills, and interest in the field of criminology and criminal justice.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"3025\">The selection process focuses on identifying candidates who demonstrate a genuine commitment to understanding crime, justice, law, and social change.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gznjis\" data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3053\">Application Submission</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3163\">Applicants are required to submit a complete application form along with the necessary supporting documents.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3196\">The application should include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3308\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bjwm6n\" data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3216\">Academic details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18iy9j0\" data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3239\">Personal information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"3240\" data-end=\"3268\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ttwtm1\" data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3308\">Relevant achievements and experiences</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3405\">Providing complete and accurate information helps facilitate a smooth admission review process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bafq3a\" data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3431\">Academic Transcripts</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3522\">Candidates must submit academic transcripts and mark sheets from their qualifying degree.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3671\">The admissions committee reviews academic performance to assess the applicant\'s preparedness for postgraduate study and research-oriented learning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d651h5\" data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3703\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3784\">A key component of the admission process is the <strong data-start=\"3753\" data-end=\"3783\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3820\">Applicants should clearly explain:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"4140\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40xz1i\" data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3875\">Their interest in criminology and criminal justice.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s8qy5\" data-start=\"3876\" data-end=\"3915\">Academic and professional background.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1npfl5a\" data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"3947\">Career goals and aspirations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rpql1\" data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"3986\">Motivation for pursuing the program.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ygban6\" data-start=\"3987\" data-end=\"4091\">Areas of interest within crime, law, justice, policing, victimology, public policy, or social justice.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8gvb4w\" data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4140\">How the degree aligns with their future plans.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4142\" data-end=\"4243\">A well-written SOP helps demonstrate the applicant\'s passion, commitment, and intellectual curiosity.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pswjw8\" data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4293\">Personal Interview for Shortlisted Candidates</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4394\">Shortlisted applicants are invited for a personal interview as part of the final selection process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4433\">The interview is conducted to assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4435\" data-end=\"4669\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"130ct5n\" data-start=\"4435\" data-end=\"4472\">Motivation for pursuing the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4495\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gszn90\" data-start=\"4496\" data-end=\"4540\">Analytical and critical thinking abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y9uh2y\" data-start=\"4541\" data-end=\"4597\">Understanding of contemporary crime and justice issues</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ushnzv\" data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4631\">Academic and professional goals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pbnzc\" data-start=\"4632\" data-end=\"4669\">Overall suitability for the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4671\" data-end=\"4822\">The interview allows applicants to discuss their interests and demonstrate their potential to succeed in the field of criminology and criminal justice.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"bvgn96\" data-start=\"4824\" data-end=\"4851\">Final Selection Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4853\" data-end=\"4918\">Final admission decisions are based on a comprehensive review of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4920\" data-end=\"5117\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aytf2a\" data-start=\"4920\" data-end=\"4964\">Bachelor\'s degree and academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"4987\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n7w4a\" data-start=\"4988\" data-end=\"5010\">Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hzuowx\" data-start=\"5011\" data-end=\"5043\">Personal interview performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13nj6wa\" data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5090\">Interest in criminology and criminal justice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eiiomh\" data-start=\"5091\" data-end=\"5117\">Overall profile strength</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5119\" data-end=\"5251\">The university follows a merit-based and holistic selection approach that evaluates both academic potential and personal motivation.</p>', '<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"701\">The <strong data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"169\">Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice at OP Jindal University</strong> is a specialized postgraduate program designed for students and professionals seeking expertise in <strong data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"419\">criminology, criminal justice systems, criminal law, victimology, restorative justice, crime prevention, public policy, and justice administration</strong>. The program combines theoretical foundations with practical insights into contemporary crime and justice challenges, preparing learners for careers in law enforcement, legal services, policy research, social justice organizations, corrections, and criminal justice administration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"873\">To support learners from diverse academic and professional backgrounds, OP Jindal University offers a structured tuition payment plan with convenient installment options.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wyf3ny\" data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"960\">OP Jindal University Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1297\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"978\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"987\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"999\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1297\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1108\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1060\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1073\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1108\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1124\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1139\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1168\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1184\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1199\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1223\" data-col-size=\"sm\">By 15th January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1297\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1248\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1247\">Total Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1267\"><strong data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1266\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1297\">As Per University Schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"81m6rz\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1313\">Fee Summary</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1339\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1339\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1329\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1339\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1399\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1385\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1399\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1430\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1414\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1430\">INR 2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1455\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1454\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1475\"><strong data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1473\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k1e8kr\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1512\">What Does the Program Fee Cover?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1739\">The <strong data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1583\">Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice fee structure</strong> provides access to a comprehensive curriculum focused on crime, law, justice systems, victim rights, criminal behaviour, public policy, and justice reform.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1768\">Students gain expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"2196\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i0wi4h\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1802\">Criminology and Crime Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19h5g2e\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1829\">Criminal Justice Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18sznm2\" data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1865\">Criminal Law and Legal Frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w90o14\" data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1903\">Victimology and Restorative Justice</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5i1jib\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1924\">Global Criminology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hegtzc\" data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1961\">Crime Prevention and Public Safety</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jwwq0q\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1995\">Research Methods in Criminology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c6agw0\" data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2033\">Environmental and Green Criminology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x0qle6\" data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2068\">Media, Youth, and Gender Studies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11wxl31\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2111\">Criminal Behaviour and Social Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n5n21m\" data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2143\">Justice Policy and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x3ysu5\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2196\">Capstone, Thesis, or Experiential Learning Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2381\">The curriculum is designed to help learners understand the causes of crime, evaluate justice systems, and develop evidence-based solutions to contemporary criminal justice challenges.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"659\">The <strong data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"165\">Online M.A. in Criminology and Criminal Justice at OP Jindal University</strong> is an interdisciplinary postgraduate program that examines crime, criminal behaviour, criminal law, justice systems, victim rights, punishment, rehabilitation, and contemporary challenges in criminal justice. Designed for graduates, legal professionals, law enforcement personnel, researchers, policymakers, social sector practitioners, and criminal justice professionals, the program provides a comprehensive understanding of the causes of crime and the functioning of modern justice systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"1181\">The curriculum integrates <strong data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"867\">criminological theory, criminal law, victimology, restorative justice, forensic perspectives, social psychology, environmental crime, gender studies, and research methodologies</strong> to help students analyze crime from legal, social, psychological, and policy perspectives. Through research-driven learning and practical exposure, students develop the analytical and investigative skills required for careers in criminal justice, law enforcement, public policy, research, and social intervention.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10qqulu\" data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1241\">Term 1: Foundations of Criminology and Criminal Justice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1510\">The first term introduces students to the core concepts of criminology, criminal justice systems, criminal behaviour, and research methods. Learners gain a strong foundation in understanding how crime is defined, regulated, investigated, and addressed within society.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"2354\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1537\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1537\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1522\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1537\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"2354\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1771\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1608\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1607\">Criminal Justice and Penal Processes</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1771\">Examines the structure and functioning of criminal justice institutions, including policing, courts, corrections, sentencing systems, and penal administration.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1956\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1797\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1796\">Global Criminology</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1956\">Explores crime patterns, criminal justice systems, transnational crime, and comparative criminological perspectives across different countries and regions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"2008\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2007\">Psychosocial Aspects of Crime and Punishment</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2145\">Studies the psychological, social, and behavioural factors that influence criminal conduct, deviance, punishment, and rehabilitation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2354\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2195\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2194\">Research Design and Methods in Criminology</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2354\">Introduces qualitative and quantitative research methods, data collection techniques, crime analysis, and evidence-based criminological research practices.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7xnj4x\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2413\">Term 2: Contemporary Issues in Crime, Law, and Justice</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2613\">The second term focuses on emerging criminological challenges, criminal law principles, victim rights, environmental harm, and the role of media and social institutions in shaping crime and justice.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"3448\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2640\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2640\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2625\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2640\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"3448\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2864\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2715\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2714\">Green Criminology and Environmental Harm</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2864\">Examines environmental crimes, ecological harm, climate justice, corporate environmental violations, and sustainability-related legal frameworks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"3060\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2906\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2905\">General Principles of Criminal Law</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"3060\">Provides a comprehensive understanding of criminal liability, offences, legal doctrines, criminal responsibility, and the foundations of criminal law.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3247\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3103\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3102\">Victimology and Restorative Justice</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3247\">Explores victim rights, victim support systems, restorative justice mechanisms, conflict resolution, and community-based justice approaches.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3248\" data-end=\"3448\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3248\" data-end=\"3306\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3305\">Media, Youth and Gender in Contemporary Criminology</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3306\" data-end=\"3448\">Analyzes the relationship between media representation, youth crime, gender dynamics, social inequalities, and criminal justice responses.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10bzy2q\" data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3503\">Term 3: Thesis, Capstone, or Experiential Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3505\" data-end=\"3665\">The final term provides students with an opportunity to apply theoretical knowledge to practical research, policy analysis, or field-based learning experiences.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3667\" data-end=\"3748\">Students are required to successfully complete <strong data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3747\">one of the following pathways</strong>:</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76bb91\" data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3767\">Thesis Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3769\" data-end=\"4005\">Students undertake independent academic research under faculty supervision and prepare a comprehensive thesis on a topic related to criminology, criminal justice, criminal law, victimology, policing, crime prevention, or social justice.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gfepz5\" data-start=\"4007\" data-end=\"4034\">Capstone Project Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4259\">Students work on a practice-oriented project addressing real-world criminal justice, public policy, legal reform, law enforcement, or social intervention challenges. A final capstone report must be submitted for evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x41qd5\" data-start=\"4261\" data-end=\"4293\">Experiential Learning Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4570\">Students participate in hands-on learning experiences that may involve field engagement, institutional exposure, practical observations, or applied criminal justice work. This option requires physical presence on campus and submission of a final experiential learning report.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15mpzdg\" data-start=\"4572\" data-end=\"4600\">Mentorship Opportunities</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4602\" data-end=\"4622\">Students may choose:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4624\" data-end=\"4783\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oklu58\" data-start=\"4624\" data-end=\"4683\">A faculty mentor or supervisor from OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"48kvdp\" data-start=\"4684\" data-end=\"4783\">A mentor from an approved external institution or organization, subject to university guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4785\" data-end=\"4873\">All pathways require the submission of a final report or thesis for academic assessment.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(489, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 359, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 05:55:26', '2026-06-01 05:55:26', '<p data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"663\">The <strong data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"208\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy admission process at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify ambitious learners who are interested in public policy, digital governance, global affairs, international relations, economic policy, technology regulation, and governance innovation. The university follows a holistic admission process that evaluates academic performance, intellectual curiosity, career aspirations, and an applicant\'s potential to contribute to policy and governance discussions in an increasingly digital world.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"846\">The admission process focuses on selecting candidates who can thrive in an interdisciplinary learning environment that combines governance, economics, technology, and public policy.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e43i7e\" data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"890\">Step 1: Verify Eligibility Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"1004\">Before beginning the application process, candidates should ensure they meet the program\'s eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1022\">Applicants must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1295\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vs50c9\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1104\">Hold a Bachelor\'s degree with at least 50% marks from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vdmyzy\" data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1139\">Be from any academic discipline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pup09f\" data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1295\">Have an interest in digital governance, public policy, global political economy, international relations, technology governance, or economic development.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1530\">Although applicants from all academic backgrounds are eligible, graduates from Political Science, Sociology, Law, Psychology, Social Work, Economics, Public Policy, and related disciplines may find direct relevance to the curriculum.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"107tu6k\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1579\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1695\">Candidates must submit the online application form with accurate personal, academic, and professional information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1732\">The application generally includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1868\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t7bwlu\" data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1752\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1781\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1803\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1wgk9\" data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1827\">Academic achievements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j594z7\" data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1868\">Professional experience, if applicable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1969\">Providing complete and accurate information helps facilitate an efficient admission review process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kn2ntm\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2009\">Step 3: Submit Academic Transcripts</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2111\">Applicants are required to upload academic transcripts and mark sheets from their qualifying degree.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2168\">The admissions committee reviews transcripts to assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2297\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oy2id\" data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2192\">Academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n4mntt\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2217\">Educational background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11cx5no\" data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2256\">Analytical and research capabilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cwzt16\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2297\">Readiness for postgraduate-level study</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2381\">Academic records play an important role in the overall profile evaluation process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jnealn\" data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2431\">Step 4: Submit the Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2600\">A key component of the <strong data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2555\">OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy admission process</strong> is the submission of a Statement of Purpose.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2633\">The SOP should clearly explain:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"3037\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u4srs6\" data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2697\">Interest in digital governance and global political economy.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s8qy5\" data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2737\">Academic and professional background.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l32t8r\" data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2776\">Career aspirations and future goals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rpql1\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2815\">Motivation for pursuing the program.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sjaoqx\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2927\">Interest in public policy, governance, international affairs, economic development, or technology regulation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h08h9\" data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2972\">Reasons for choosing OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k1qdfd\" data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3037\">How the program aligns with long-term professional objectives.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3175\">A strong SOP helps the admissions committee understand the applicant\'s motivation, commitment, and potential for success in the program.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6ny5fy\" data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3229\">Step 5: Application Review and Profile Evaluation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3382\">Once the application, academic transcripts, and SOP are submitted, the admissions committee conducts a comprehensive review of the candidate\'s profile.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3419\">The evaluation generally considers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3630\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3446\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3469\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mbs113\" data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3500\">Statement of Purpose quality</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yorba8\" data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3531\">Career goals and aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xl66ek\" data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3567\">Interest in governance and policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hs4p4y\" data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3603\">Research and analytical potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eiiomh\" data-start=\"3604\" data-end=\"3630\">Overall profile strength</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3761\">The university adopts a profile-based evaluation approach to identify candidates with strong academic and professional potential.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fttmx2\" data-start=\"3763\" data-end=\"3819\">Step 6: Personal Interview for Shortlisted Candidates</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3920\">Shortlisted applicants are invited for a personal interview as part of the final selection process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"3949\">The interview helps assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3951\" data-end=\"4154\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"130ct5n\" data-start=\"3951\" data-end=\"3988\">Motivation for pursuing the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kopbu3\" data-start=\"3989\" data-end=\"4043\">Understanding of governance and public policy issues</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qc877u\" data-start=\"4044\" data-end=\"4066\">Communication skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gj3r3o\" data-start=\"4067\" data-end=\"4111\">Critical thinking and analytical abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qn84m5\" data-start=\"4112\" data-end=\"4132\">Career aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mycmq0\" data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4154\">Overall program fit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4156\" data-end=\"4288\">The interview provides applicants with an opportunity to discuss their interests and demonstrate their readiness for advanced study.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fbdo86\" data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4325\">Step 7: Final Selection Decision</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4438\">Following the completion of all evaluation stages, the admissions committee makes the final selection decision.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4462\">Admission is based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4657\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oy2id\" data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4486\">Academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"4487\" data-end=\"4509\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n7w4a\" data-start=\"4510\" data-end=\"4532\">Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hzuowx\" data-start=\"4533\" data-end=\"4565\">Personal interview performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13nnt6w\" data-start=\"4566\" data-end=\"4627\">Interest in digital governance and global political economy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2z8q5y\" data-start=\"4628\" data-end=\"4657\">Overall application profile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4659\" data-end=\"4743\">Successful candidates receive an official admission offer from OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ukunvt\" data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4795\">Step 8: Fee Payment and Enrollment Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4797\" data-end=\"4843\">To secure admission, selected candidates must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4845\" data-end=\"4994\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tjfou\" data-start=\"4845\" data-end=\"4874\">Accept the admission offer.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y8swbi\" data-start=\"4875\" data-end=\"4915\">Complete the registration formalities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1utj608\" data-start=\"4916\" data-end=\"4949\">Pay the applicable program fee.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eusne5\" data-start=\"4950\" data-end=\"4994\">Submit any pending documents, if required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5146\">After successful verification and fee payment, enrollment in the <strong data-start=\"5061\" data-end=\"5121\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy</strong> is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kiorqu\" data-start=\"5148\" data-end=\"5230\">Selection Criteria for M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5232\" data-end=\"5295\">Admission to the program is based on a comprehensive review of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5297\" data-end=\"5547\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aytf2a\" data-start=\"5297\" data-end=\"5341\">Bachelor\'s degree and academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"5342\" data-end=\"5364\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8flj6f\" data-start=\"5365\" data-end=\"5393\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hzuowx\" data-start=\"5394\" data-end=\"5426\">Personal interview performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t4t35b\" data-start=\"5427\" data-end=\"5479\">Interest in governance, policy, and global affairs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f3yrzj\" data-start=\"5480\" data-end=\"5520\">Communication and analytical abilities</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eiiomh\" data-start=\"5521\" data-end=\"5547\">Overall profile strength</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, '<p data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"706\">The <strong data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"193\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for graduates and professionals who want to develop expertise in <strong data-start=\"271\" data-end=\"447\">digital governance, public policy, global political economy, international relations, technology regulation, economic governance, digital transformation, and global affairs</strong>. As governments, international organizations, corporations, and policy institutions increasingly rely on technology-driven governance models, the demand for professionals who understand the intersection of policy, economics, and technology continues to grow.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"936\">This program welcomes applicants from diverse academic backgrounds who are interested in addressing contemporary challenges related to governance, economic development, digital innovation, geopolitical change, and public policy.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2gyyt7\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1022\">Eligibility Criteria for M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1184\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1122\">OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy</strong>, candidates must meet the following eligibility requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1463\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ewm3c3\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1274\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1244\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree with a minimum of 50% marks</strong> from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c15dcj\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1338\">Graduates from any academic discipline are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljkzy0\" data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1401\">Professional work experience is not mandatory for admission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"it1th5\" data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1463\">Fresh graduates as well as working professionals can apply.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1587\">While applicants from all academic backgrounds are welcome, the program may be particularly beneficial for graduates from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1764\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqbpbp\" data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1608\">Political Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z08lux\" data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1624\">Public Policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ypifik\" data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1636\">Sociology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o472q\" data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1642\">Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o99p57\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1655\">Psychology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ps7khe\" data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1669\">Social Work</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c1jzmc\" data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1681\">Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q4f4qv\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1707\">International Relations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xq2rpj\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1731\">Public Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jg5ffm\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1764\">Humanities and Social Sciences</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1966\">The interdisciplinary structure of the program allows learners from different educational backgrounds to contribute unique perspectives to discussions on governance, policy, economics, and technology.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eo7kda\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2005\">Who Should Apply for This Program?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2233\">The <strong data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2071\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy</strong> is ideal for individuals seeking careers in governance, policy analysis, international development, public administration, technology policy, and global affairs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2277\">This program is particularly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2622\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"litrp4\" data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2304\">Public Policy Aspirants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pkbhnp\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2331\">Government Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wmtb2r\" data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2361\">Political Science Graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ghpfgf\" data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2401\">International Relations Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v7g82\" data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2436\">Development Sector Practitioners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"125xr78\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2452\">Law Graduates</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ryc1hb\" data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2490\">Public Administration Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m08o7p\" data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2511\">Policy Researchers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w2xiia\" data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2536\">Governance Consultants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e02mwz\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2568\">Technology Policy Enthusiasts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40jvb\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2598\">Social Sector Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b8ocjo\" data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2622\">Future Public Leaders</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1a8a99q\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2705\">Selection Process for M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2983\">Admission to the <strong data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2805\">OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy</strong> follows a holistic profile-based evaluation process that focuses on academic potential, intellectual curiosity, career aspirations, and interest in governance and public policy.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3019\">Applicants are required to submit:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3098\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q397qj\" data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3046\">Online application form</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3069\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8flj6f\" data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3098\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3249\">The admissions committee reviews each application comprehensively to identify candidates who demonstrate strong potential for success in the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bafq3a\" data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3275\">Academic Transcripts</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3360\">Applicants must provide official academic transcripts from their qualifying degree.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3362\" data-end=\"3418\">The university evaluates academic performance to assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3538\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n4mntt\" data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3444\">Educational background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jijpsz\" data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3467\">Academic consistency</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eja9kx\" data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3502\">Readiness for postgraduate study</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t962jm\" data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3538\">Analytical and research potential</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3630\">Academic achievements form an important component of the overall admission review process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d651h5\" data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3662\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3741\">The <strong data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3698\">Statement of Purpose (SOP)</strong> is a key element of the selection process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3777\">Applicants should clearly explain:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"4157\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17sceis\" data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3847\">Their interest in digital governance and global political economy.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16s8qy5\" data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3887\">Academic and professional background.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l32t8r\" data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"3926\">Career aspirations and future goals.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iactw6\" data-start=\"3927\" data-end=\"4051\">Interest in public policy, technology governance, international relations, economic governance, or digital transformation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2h08h9\" data-start=\"4052\" data-end=\"4096\">Reasons for choosing OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i34j1u\" data-start=\"4097\" data-end=\"4157\">How the program aligns with their professional objectives.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4159\" data-end=\"4272\">A well-crafted SOP helps applicants demonstrate motivation, intellectual engagement, and commitment to the field.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pswjw8\" data-start=\"4274\" data-end=\"4322\">Personal Interview for Shortlisted Candidates</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4421\">Candidates shortlisted after the initial profile evaluation are invited for a personal interview.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4423\" data-end=\"4450\">The interview helps assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4644\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"130ct5n\" data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4489\">Motivation for pursuing the program</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1br49ft\" data-start=\"4490\" data-end=\"4527\">Communication and analytical skills</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1js7une\" data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4575\">Understanding of governance and policy issues</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yorba8\" data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4606\">Career goals and aspirations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pbnzc\" data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4644\">Overall suitability for the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4820\">The interview provides applicants with an opportunity to showcase their interest in governance, policy innovation, economic development, and technology-driven transformation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"bvgn96\" data-start=\"4822\" data-end=\"4849\">Final Selection Criteria</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4851\" data-end=\"4920\">Final admission decisions are based on a comprehensive assessment of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4922\" data-end=\"5123\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aytf2a\" data-start=\"4922\" data-end=\"4966\">Bachelor\'s degree and academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"4967\" data-end=\"4989\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17n7w4a\" data-start=\"4990\" data-end=\"5012\">Statement of Purpose</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hzuowx\" data-start=\"5013\" data-end=\"5045\">Personal interview performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vgaoxr\" data-start=\"5046\" data-end=\"5096\">Interest in governance and policy-related fields</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eiiomh\" data-start=\"5097\" data-end=\"5123\">Overall profile strength</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5125\" data-end=\"5275\">The university follows a merit-based and holistic selection process designed to identify future leaders, policy professionals, and governance experts.</p>', '<p data-start=\"99\" data-end=\"680\">The <strong data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"187\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy at OP Jindal University</strong> is a future-oriented postgraduate program designed for individuals seeking expertise in <strong data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"452\">digital governance, public policy, global political economy, international relations, technology regulation, economic governance, digital transformation, and global affairs</strong>. The program equips students with the knowledge and analytical skills needed to understand how governments, businesses, and international institutions navigate the challenges of an increasingly digital and interconnected world.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"857\">To make advanced education accessible to students and working professionals, OP Jindal University offers a structured tuition payment plan with convenient installment options.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ue5zki\" data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"953\">OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1290\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"992\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"992\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"971\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"980\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"992\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1290\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1053\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1066\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1101\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1161\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1117\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1132\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1161\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1177\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1192\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1216\" data-col-size=\"sm\">By 15th January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1290\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1241\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1240\">Total Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1260\"><strong data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1259\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1290\">As Per University Schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"81m6rz\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1306\">Fee Summary</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1468\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1322\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1332\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1468\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1392\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1378\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1392\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1407\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1423\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1468\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1448\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1447\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1468\"><strong data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1466\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k1e8kr\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1505\">What Does the Program Fee Cover?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1719\">The <strong data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1585\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy fee structure</strong> provides access to a multidisciplinary curriculum that combines governance, economics, public policy, technology, and global affairs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1747\">Students gain exposure to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pnzbti\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1787\">Digital Governance and Public Policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nqpzzq\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1814\">Global Political Economy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v0a6zt\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1862\">International Relations and Global Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e2xl7c\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1905\">Technology Regulation and Digital Rights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dydkhr\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1939\">Economic Policy and Development</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11341of\" data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1966\">Cybersecurity Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g69uok\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2007\">Data Governance and Privacy Frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wx50rc\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2041\">Digital Transformation Strategy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aznafb\" data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2080\">Geopolitical Risk and Global Affairs</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1omejjx\" data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2122\">AI Governance and Emerging Technologies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zbglac\" data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2161\">Research Methods and Policy Analysis</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18qa9a5\" data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2214\">Thesis, Capstone, or Experiential Learning Project</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2379\">The curriculum is designed to help learners understand how technology, governance, and economics intersect to shape contemporary societies and global institutions.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"676\">The <strong data-start=\"99\" data-end=\"183\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Global Political Economy at OP Jindal University</strong> is an interdisciplinary postgraduate program designed to equip students with advanced knowledge of <strong data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"469\">digital governance, public policy, global political economy, technology regulation, international institutions, digital transformation, economic governance, and geopolitical strategy</strong>. The program explores how governments, international organizations, businesses, and societies are adapting to rapid technological change and the growing influence of digital ecosystems on global governance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"1094\">In an era shaped by artificial intelligence, digital platforms, cybersecurity, data governance, and economic interdependence, organizations require professionals who can understand the complex relationship between technology, policy, economics, and governance. This program prepares students to analyze global challenges and contribute to policy-making, governance innovation, and digital transformation initiatives.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8hmmnv\" data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1162\">Term 1: Foundations of Digital Governance and Political Economy</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1357\">The first term introduces students to the core concepts of governance, public institutions, global economic systems, policy frameworks, and the digital transformation of government and society.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"2220\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1384\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1384\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1369\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1384\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"2220\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1627\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1461\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1460\">Digital Governance and Public Institutions</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1627\">Examines how governments use digital technologies to improve public administration, service delivery, citizen engagement, transparency, and policy implementation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1823\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1674\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1673\">Foundations of Global Political Economy</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1823\">Introduces the interaction between politics, economics, international trade, global markets, and economic governance in a rapidly changing world.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"2005\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1869\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1868\">Technology, Society, and Public Policy</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"2005\">Explores how emerging technologies influence governance systems, regulatory frameworks, public institutions, and social development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2220\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2062\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2061\">Research Design and Methods in Governance Studies</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2220\">Develops research skills, policy analysis techniques, data interpretation methods, and evidence-based approaches to governance and public policy research.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hdwf76\" data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2290\">Term 2: Digital Transformation, Regulation, and Global Governance</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2470\">The second term focuses on technology governance, regulatory systems, digital economies, geopolitical challenges, and contemporary policy issues shaping the future of governance.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"3368\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2497\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2497\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2482\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2497\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"3368\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2741\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2573\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2572\">Digital Economies and Platform Governance</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2741\">Examines digital markets, platform economies, fintech ecosystems, e-commerce regulation, and the governance challenges created by technology-driven economic growth.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2975\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2797\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2796\">Global Governance and International Institutions</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2975\">Explores the role of international organizations, multilateral institutions, and global governance frameworks in addressing economic, political, and technological challenges.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2976\" data-end=\"3170\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2976\" data-end=\"3033\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3032\">Cybersecurity, Data Governance, and Digital Rights</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3170\">Studies cybersecurity policy, data protection regulations, privacy frameworks, digital rights, and responsible technology governance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3368\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3221\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3220\">Geopolitics, Technology, and Economic Power</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3368\">Analyzes the relationship between geopolitical competition, technological innovation, economic influence, and global strategic decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10bzy2q\" data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3423\">Term 3: Thesis, Capstone, or Experiential Learning</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3575\">The final term enables students to apply their knowledge through advanced research, policy development, or hands-on professional learning experiences.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3681\">All participants must successfully complete one of the following pathways to fulfil degree requirements.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"76bb91\" data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3700\">Thesis Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3982\">Students undertake independent research under academic supervision and prepare a comprehensive thesis on a topic related to digital governance, public policy, global political economy, technology regulation, international relations, digital transformation, or economic governance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gfepz5\" data-start=\"3984\" data-end=\"4011\">Capstone Project Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4013\" data-end=\"4229\">Students work on a real-world governance, policy, economic, or technology challenge and develop practical recommendations through an applied capstone project. A final capstone report must be submitted for evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x41qd5\" data-start=\"4231\" data-end=\"4263\">Experiential Learning Option</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4516\">Students gain hands-on exposure through field-based learning, institutional engagement, policy projects, or governance-focused practical experiences. This pathway requires on-campus participation and submission of a final experiential learning report.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1elsr9v\" data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4554\">Mentorship and Academic Guidance</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4576\">Students may choose:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4735\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oklu58\" data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4637\">A faculty mentor or supervisor from OP Jindal University.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18xmdzp\" data-start=\"4638\" data-end=\"4735\">An approved mentor from an external institution, organization, research centre, or policy body.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4737\" data-end=\"4836\">Each pathway requires the submission of a final report, thesis, or project for academic assessment.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(490, 84, '79639da0-12e5-4abe-a2a7-90acfa099a40', '47933c11-475d-4ee4-ab70-4bb32e29c731', 360, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 06:18:41', '2026-06-18 01:08:20', '<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"653\">The <strong data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"218\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Digital Public Infrastructure admission process at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed to identify motivated learners who are interested in public policy, digital governance, technology regulation, digital transformation, data governance, AI governance, and digital public infrastructure. The university follows a holistic admission approach that evaluates academic qualifications, intellectual curiosity, and an applicant\'s potential to contribute to the rapidly evolving fields of governance and technology.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"854\">The admission process is structured to ensure that students from diverse academic backgrounds can successfully transition into the interdisciplinary world of digital governance and public innovation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kzovtn\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"897\">Step 1: Check Eligibility Requirements</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"986\">Before applying, candidates should ensure they meet the program\'s eligibility criteria.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1004\">Applicants must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1271\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlf6v\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1062\">Hold a Bachelor\'s degree from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wskk7g\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1111\">Be eligible regardless of academic discipline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aa3cl9\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1161\">Possess valid government-issued identity proof.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s8s8dw\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1271\">Demonstrate an interest in governance, public policy, technology, digital transformation, or related areas.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1378\">The program welcomes both fresh graduates and working professionals from diverse educational backgrounds.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"107tu6k\" data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1427\">Step 2: Complete the Online Application Form</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1528\">Candidates must submit the online application form with accurate academic and personal information.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1575\">Applicants are generally required to provide:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1706\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t7bwlu\" data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1595\">Personal details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp69vx\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1624\">Educational qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qe3f7o\" data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1646\">Contact information</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zwhvvz\" data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1665\">Academic history</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j594z7\" data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1706\">Professional experience, if applicable</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1803\">Providing complete and accurate information helps facilitate a smooth admission review process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"45x7hb\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1841\">Step 3: Submit Required Documents</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1922\">Applicants must upload the necessary documents for verification and evaluation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s2tv07\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1949\">For Indian Applicants</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"apnf1d\" data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1982\">Bachelor\'s degree certificate</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"117dusa\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2021\">Academic transcripts and mark sheets</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kvg7of\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2056\">Government-issued identity proof</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40xgv7\" data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2090\">Recent passport-size photograph</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sujezs\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2124\">For International Applicants</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2229\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2vcnq\" data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2142\">Valid Passport</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7rr2k5\" data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2182\">Academic certificates and transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kr5miw\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2229\">Additional supporting documents, if required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2339\">Document verification is an essential part of the admission process and helps ensure eligibility compliance.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n3qyj3\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2393\">Step 4: Profile Evaluation and Application Review</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2540\">Once the application and supporting documents are submitted, the admissions committee conducts a comprehensive review of the applicant\'s profile.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2577\">The evaluation generally considers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2786\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17m1rbj\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2604\">Academic qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n4mntt\" data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2629\">Educational background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pgfeif\" data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2680\">Interest in digital governance and public policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1wgk9\" data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2704\">Academic achievements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12dtkup\" data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2748\">Professional experience, where applicable</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pbnzc\" data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2786\">Overall suitability for the program</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2975\">The university follows a profile-based assessment model to identify candidates who can contribute effectively to discussions on governance, policy, technology, and digital transformation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"90in9s\" data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3027\">Step 5: Admission Review and Selection Decision</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3223\">The admissions team evaluates each application holistically to assess the candidate\'s readiness for postgraduate study and their potential to succeed in a multidisciplinary learning environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3225\" data-end=\"3252\">Key considerations include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3254\" data-end=\"3433\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4oy2id\" data-start=\"3254\" data-end=\"3276\">Academic performance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10i0fzr\" data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3302\">Educational credentials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgcrfd\" data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3357\">Interest in governance and technology-related fields</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pyfkio\" data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3402\">Analytical and critical thinking potential</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pn6hug\" data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3433\">Overall application strength</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3529\">Successful applicants are shortlisted for admission based on their overall profile evaluation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1aq41k1\" data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3565\">Step 6: Receive Admission Offer</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3689\">Candidates who successfully meet the admission requirements receive an official admission offer from OP Jindal University.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3691\" data-end=\"3720\">The admission offer outlines:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"3822\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ep8w5a\" data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"3739\">Program details</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v52tt3\" data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3765\">Enrollment instructions</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"or2qho\" data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3789\">Fee payment timelines</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ll55rb\" data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3822\">Important academic information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"3928\">Applicants should carefully review the offer and complete the next steps within the specified deadlines.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jp3gp2\" data-start=\"3930\" data-end=\"3980\">Step 7: Fee Payment and Enrollment Confirmation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3982\" data-end=\"4028\">To secure admission, selected candidates must:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4030\" data-end=\"4196\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tjfou\" data-start=\"4030\" data-end=\"4059\">Accept the admission offer.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y8swbi\" data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4100\">Complete the registration formalities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"93ukth\" data-start=\"4101\" data-end=\"4150\">Pay the required registration and tuition fees.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g9n0b8\" data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4196\">Submit any pending documents, if requested.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4364\">Upon successful completion of all admission requirements, enrollment in the <strong data-start=\"4274\" data-end=\"4339\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Digital Public Infrastructure</strong> is officially confirmed.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1l0kk50\" data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4453\">Selection Criteria for M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Digital Public Infrastructure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4455\" data-end=\"4518\">Admission to the program is based on a comprehensive review of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4702\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1slisgm\" data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4554\">Bachelor\'s degree qualifications</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mr2obc\" data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4577\">Academic transcripts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n4mntt\" data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4602\">Educational background</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"128py7e\" data-start=\"4603\" data-end=\"4651\">Interest in governance, policy, and technology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1wgk9\" data-start=\"4652\" data-end=\"4675\">Academic achievements</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eiiomh\" data-start=\"4676\" data-end=\"4702\">Overall profile strength</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4704\" data-end=\"4832\">The university follows a merit-based and holistic admission process that values both academic preparedness and future potential.</p>', 1, '<p data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"662\">The <strong data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"203\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Digital Public Infrastructure at OP Jindal University</strong> is designed for individuals who aspire to build expertise in <strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"448\">digital governance, public policy, digital transformation, technology regulation, digital public infrastructure (DPI), AI governance, data governance, and public sector innovation</strong>. The program welcomes graduates from diverse academic backgrounds who are interested in understanding how technology is transforming governance, economic systems, public service delivery, and societal development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"1058\">As governments and organizations increasingly invest in digital public infrastructure, digital identity systems, financial inclusion initiatives, data governance frameworks, and smart governance solutions, there is growing demand for professionals who can bridge the gap between technology, policy, and governance. This program prepares students to contribute to these rapidly evolving sectors.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hp8azd\" data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1149\">Eligibility Criteria for M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Digital Public Infrastructure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1316\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1254\">OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Digital Public Infrastructure</strong>, candidates must meet the following eligibility requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1563\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7a4ord\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1378\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1377\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree from a recognized university</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"22ufq2\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1447\">Applicants from <strong data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1424\">any academic discipline</strong> are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6qxr9c\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1502\">Fresh graduates and working professionals can apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18h5ksq\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1563\">No specific subject background is mandatory for admission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1691\">The interdisciplinary nature of the program makes it suitable for graduates from a wide range of educational fields including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqbpbp\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1712\">Political Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z08lux\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1728\">Public Policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c1jzmc\" data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1740\">Economics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o472q\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1746\">Law</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ypifik\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1758\">Sociology</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9rx33v\" data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1771\">Management</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n5uyxn\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1790\">Computer Science</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p06fqp\" data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1804\">Engineering</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q4f4qv\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1830\">International Relations</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xq2rpj\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1854\">Public Administration</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jg5ffm\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1887\">Humanities and Social Sciences</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"2055\">Students from both technical and non-technical backgrounds can benefit from the curriculum due to its balanced focus on governance, policy, economics, and technology.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2ot2ma\" data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2092\">Required Documents for Admission</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2193\">Applicants are required to submit identity verification documents as part of the admission process.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s2tv07\" data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2220\">For Indian Applicants</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2295\">Candidates must provide a valid government-issued identity proof such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2356\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jrsd6q\" data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2311\">Aadhaar Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15vnh37\" data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2322\">PAN Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19tjwdn\" data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2338\">Voter ID Card</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wt2g1m\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2356\">Driving License</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sujezs\" data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2390\">For International Applicants</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2440\">International candidates are required to submit:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2458\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2vcnq\" data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2458\">Valid Passport</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2571\">The passport serves as the primary identity and nationality verification document during the admission process.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1eo7kda\" data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2610\">Who Should Apply for This Program?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2822\">The <strong data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2681\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Digital Public Infrastructure</strong> is ideal for individuals interested in policy innovation, governance transformation, technology regulation, and public sector modernization.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2866\">This program is particularly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"3313\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18tvs7l\" data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2897\">Public Policy Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwvca7\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2920\">Government Officials</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v7g82\" data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2955\">Development Sector Practitioners</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e02mwz\" data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2987\">Technology Policy Enthusiasts</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ryc1hb\" data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3025\">Public Administration Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6r8p6f\" data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3062\">Digital Transformation Consultants</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v9rkgr\" data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3087\">Governance Researchers</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ewzkt5\" data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3129\">International Development Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"apao6c\" data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3162\">Regulatory Affairs Specialists</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ekw5wh\" data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3210\">Smart City and Urban Governance Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ui34mw\" data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3257\">Data Governance and Compliance Professionals</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1771wj6\" data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3313\">Graduates interested in Digital Public Infrastructure</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"737\">The <strong data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"197\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Digital Public Infrastructure at OP Jindal University</strong> is a future-ready postgraduate program designed for individuals seeking expertise in <strong data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"466\">digital governance, digital public infrastructure (DPI), public policy, AI governance, technology regulation, data governance, digital transformation, and smart governance systems</strong>. As governments and institutions across the world increasingly adopt digital-first governance models, professionals with specialized knowledge of digital infrastructure and policy frameworks are becoming highly valuable across public, private, and international sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"1003\">The program combines governance, technology, economics, and policy studies to help learners understand how digital platforms, identity systems, financial inclusion initiatives, and public digital ecosystems can drive large-scale social and economic transformation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"84frg0\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1104\">OP Jindal University M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Digital Public Infrastructure Fee Structure</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1122\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fee Component</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1131\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1143\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Due Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1252\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1204\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Amount</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1217\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1252\">Upon Acceptance of Offer Letter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1312\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1268\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1283\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1312\">Before Batch Commencement</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1367\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1328\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Instalment 2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1343\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 1,25,000</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1367\">By 15th January 2027</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1392\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1391\">Total Tuition Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1411\"><strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1410\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1441\">As Per University Schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"81m6rz\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1457\">Fee Summary</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1619\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1483\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1483\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1473\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1483\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Amount</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1619\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1543\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1529\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration Fee</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1543\">INR 25,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1574\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1558\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuition Fee</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1574\" data-col-size=\"sm\">INR 2,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1619\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1599\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1598\">Total Program Fee</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1619\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1617\">INR 2,75,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k1e8kr\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1656\">What Does the Program Fee Cover?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1893\">The <strong data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1741\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Digital Public Infrastructure fee structure</strong> provides access to a specialized curriculum that explores the intersection of governance, technology, public policy, economics, and digital innovation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1922\">Students gain expertise in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pnzbti\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1962\">Digital Governance and Public Policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cprr6w\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2000\">Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mhops5\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2027\">AI Governance and Ethics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rldd7w\" data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2066\">Technology Regulation and Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g69uok\" data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2107\">Data Governance and Privacy Frameworks</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ewkxh2\" data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2158\">Digital Identity and Financial Inclusion Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b9i9pu\" data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2202\">Platform Governance and Digital Economies</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lkqdjn\" data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2237\">Cybersecurity and Digital Rights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14f0slg\" data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2285\">Smart Governance and Public Sector Innovation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"86yx92\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2323\">Geopolitics and Digital Sovereignty</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d1ibs2\" data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2366\">Policy Research and Governance Analytics</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wx50rc\" data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2400\">Digital Transformation Strategy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2566\">The curriculum equips learners with practical and policy-oriented knowledge required to navigate the evolving landscape of digital governance and public innovation.</p>', 'Medium', '<p data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"735\">The <strong data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"193\">M.Sc. in Digital Governance and Digital Public Infrastructure at OP Jindal University</strong> is a future-focused postgraduate program designed to develop expertise in <strong data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"474\">digital governance, digital public infrastructure (DPI), public policy, technology regulation, AI governance, digital transformation, data governance, platform regulation, and digital economy management</strong>. As governments worldwide increasingly adopt digital-first governance models, there is a growing demand for professionals who can design, regulate, and manage large-scale digital ecosystems that promote inclusion, innovation, transparency, and economic growth.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"1164\">The program provides a deep understanding of how digital technologies, public institutions, economic systems, and regulatory frameworks interact to shape modern governance. Students explore global best practices in digital public infrastructure while gaining specialized knowledge of India\'s globally recognized digital governance initiatives, including Aadhaar, UPI, DigiLocker, and other Digital Public Infrastructure models.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zo7ert\" data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1238\">Term 1: Foundations of Governance, Policy, and Digital Infrastructure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1520\">The first term introduces students to the principles of governance, economic systems, digital infrastructure, and policy analysis. Learners develop a strong foundation for understanding how digital technologies are transforming governments, economies, and public service delivery.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"2454\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1532\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1547\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"2454\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1777\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1628\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1627\">Foundations of Governance and Economic Systems</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1777\">Examines governance models, public institutions, economic structures, and policy frameworks that influence development and public administration.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"2048\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1851\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1850\">Introduction to Digital Public Infrastructure: Concepts and Models</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"2048\">Provides a comprehensive understanding of Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI), including digital identity systems, payment infrastructure, data-sharing frameworks, and public digital platforms.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2258\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2112\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2111\">Regulatory Frameworks and the Economy in the Digital Age</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2258\">Explores the impact of digital technologies on markets, economic regulation, competition policy, innovation ecosystems, and digital economies.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2454\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2302\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2301\">Research Methods for Policy Analysis</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2454\">Develops analytical, quantitative, and qualitative research skills used in governance studies, policy evaluation, and public sector decision-making.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jjzo0k\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2523\">Term 2: Technology Governance, Regulation, and Digital Economies</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2687\">The second term focuses on technology governance, labour market transformation, inclusion, regulatory design, and the global flow of capital and digital services.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"3599\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2714\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2714\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2699\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2714\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"3599\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2962\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2794\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2793\">Technology, Platforms, AI, and Labour Markets</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2962\">Examines how artificial intelligence, automation, digital platforms, and emerging technologies are transforming employment, productivity, and workforce development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"3177\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"3024\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3023\">Rights, Inclusion, and Access in Technology Governance</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3177\">Explores digital inclusion, accessibility, digital rights, social equity, and governance strategies that promote inclusive technological development.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3397\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3235\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3234\">Regulation, Jurisdiction, and Institutional Design</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3397\">Analyzes regulatory frameworks, institutional governance models, legal jurisdictions, and policy mechanisms used to govern digital technologies and platforms.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3398\" data-end=\"3599\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3398\" data-end=\"3458\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3400\" data-end=\"3457\">Trade, Capital and Economic Flows in Digital Contexts</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3599\">Studies cross-border digital trade, global investment flows, digital commerce, economic integration, and technology-driven globalization.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxwjtf\" data-start=\"3601\" data-end=\"3673\">Term 3: Advanced Digital Governance and Public Infrastructure Systems</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3847\">The third term focuses on strategic governance challenges, artificial intelligence regulation, digital development, and real-world digital public infrastructure ecosystems.</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"4788\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3874\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3874\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3859\" data-col-size=\"md\">Subject</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3859\" data-end=\"3874\" data-col-size=\"xl\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3902\" data-end=\"4788\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3902\" data-end=\"4130\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3902\" data-end=\"3967\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3904\" data-end=\"3966\">Digital Sovereignty, Geopolitics, and Strategic Statecraft</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"4130\">Examines digital sovereignty, geopolitical competition, technology diplomacy, national digital strategies, and global governance challenges in the digital age.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4131\" data-end=\"4326\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4131\" data-end=\"4186\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4185\">AI Governance, Ethics, and Regulatory Approaches</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4326\">Explores responsible AI development, ethical frameworks, algorithmic accountability, risk governance, and emerging AI regulatory models.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4531\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4376\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4375\">Development and Inequality: Sectoral Cases</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4531\">Studies the impact of digital technologies on healthcare, financial inclusion, education, social protection systems, and economic development outcomes.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4532\" data-end=\"4788\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4532\" data-end=\"4588\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4534\" data-end=\"4587\">India Stack: Aadhaar, UPI, DigiLocker, and Beyond</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4788\">Provides an in-depth analysis of India\'s Digital Public Infrastructure ecosystem and its role in enabling digital identity, financial inclusion, governance innovation, and public service delivery.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"lp074b\" data-start=\"4790\" data-end=\"4845\">Term 4: Project and Advanced Elective Specialization</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4847\" data-end=\"5132\">The final phase of the program allows students to deepen their expertise through specialized electives and a project-based learning experience. Students engage with contemporary policy challenges while applying their knowledge to practical governance and digital infrastructure issues.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6wy30c\" data-start=\"5134\" data-end=\"5155\">Project Component</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5157\" data-end=\"5448\">Students complete a major project focused on digital governance, digital public infrastructure, public policy, technology regulation, digital transformation, or related domains. The project provides an opportunity to apply theoretical learning to real-world governance and policy challenges.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fepyzp\" data-start=\"5450\" data-end=\"5479\">Indicative Elective Areas</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5481\" data-end=\"5552\">Students may have opportunities to explore specialized domains such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5554\" data-end=\"5884\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tmn4d\" data-start=\"5554\" data-end=\"5587\">Data Justice and Digital Rights</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lv78rx\" data-start=\"5588\" data-end=\"5620\">Data Protection and Compliance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d9lbkg\" data-start=\"5621\" data-end=\"5656\">Climate Technology and Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16k4z9f\" data-start=\"5657\" data-end=\"5678\">Platform Regulation</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dd7agh\" data-start=\"5679\" data-end=\"5701\">Cybersecurity Policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tw18tx\" data-start=\"5702\" data-end=\"5729\">Digital Industrial Policy</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15gvwtd\" data-start=\"5730\" data-end=\"5758\">Public Procurement Systems</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1czb466\" data-start=\"5759\" data-end=\"5800\">Financial Inclusion and Digital Finance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h2wa6x\" data-start=\"5801\" data-end=\"5847\">Smart Cities and Urban Technology Governance</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hcrda4\" data-start=\"5848\" data-end=\"5884\">Surveillance, Privacy, and Society</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5886\" data-end=\"5960\">Elective offerings may vary based on faculty expertise and student demand.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', 275000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(491, 85, 'f8946380-78e3-4e17-9345-635c0f76e250', 'a37c66e8-e7f9-486b-b6ff-149653f61664', 207, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 06:32:07', '2026-06-17 00:34:26', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"400\">The <strong data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"85\">UPES Online MBA eligibility criteria</strong> are designed to ensure that students from diverse academic and professional backgrounds can pursue advanced management education. Whether you are a recent graduate, a working professional seeking career growth, or a qualified finance and accounting professional, the program offers multiple pathways for admission.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18glz9j\" data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"446\">Academic Eligibility for UPES Online MBA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"549\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"492\">UPES Online MBA program</strong>, candidates must meet one of the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"898\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mze5n\" data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"672\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"609\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or equivalent qualification</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university or institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ztefx\" data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"744\">Secure a minimum of <strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"718\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in the qualifying degree.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2llom5\" data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"898\">Candidates from any academic background, including Commerce, Science, Arts, Engineering, Management, or other recognized fields, are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p0bkz5\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"949\">Eligibility for Distance and Online Graduates</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"1077\">UPES recognizes the growing importance of flexible education pathways. Candidates who have completed their graduation through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5i1eed\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1113\"><strong data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1109\">Online Learning Programs</strong>, or</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xr47t1\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1157\"><strong data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1157\">Open and Distance Learning (ODL) Mode</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1298\">are also eligible for admission, provided their university or institution is recognized by the <strong data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1297\">UGC Distance Education Bureau (UGC-DEB)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1433\">This makes the program an excellent option for working professionals and learners who have pursued flexible higher education formats.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"o31wd5\" data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1486\">Eligibility Through Professional Qualifications</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1615\">Apart from traditional bachelor\'s degrees, UPES also accepts candidates with recognized professional qualifications, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1713\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"141lqbv\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1644\">Chartered Accountant (CA)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"shn36\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1669\">Company Secretary (CS)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o3cbks\" data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1713\">Cost and Management Accountant (ICWA/CMA)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1947\">These qualifications are considered equivalent pathways for admission and are particularly beneficial for professionals looking to strengthen their leadership, business strategy, finance, and management skills through an Online MBA.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d8mshw\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1994\">Who Should Apply for the UPES Online MBA?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2032\">The UPES Online MBA is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2424\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugeawy\" data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2090\">Fresh graduates looking to build management expertise.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r4xwtf\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2158\">Working professionals aiming for leadership and managerial roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1akno7f\" data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2231\">Entrepreneurs seeking business growth and strategic management skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i5x15e\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2319\">CA, CS, and ICWA professionals planning to expand into business leadership positions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"121uyf5\" data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2424\">Individuals looking for career advancement, salary growth, and industry-relevant management knowledge.<br><br>\r\n<p data-start=\"69\" data-end=\"348\">UPES provides a special <strong data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"149\">eligibility relaxation for experienced professionals</strong>, making it easier for working individuals to pursue an Online MBA and accelerate their career growth. This flexibility recognizes the value of professional experience alongside academic performance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qsn390\" data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"412\">Eligibility Relaxation for Candidates with Work Experience</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"589\">Candidates who have a <strong data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"487\">minimum of 2 years of full-time work experience</strong> are eligible for relaxed admission criteria. Such applicants must fulfill the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"842\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gsb18w\" data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"694\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"649\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or equivalent qualification</strong> from a recognized university or institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sxhkk3\" data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"755\">Secure a minimum of <strong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"740\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in graduation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nn49jb\" data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"842\">Possess at least <strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"814\">2 years of relevant work experience</strong> at the time of application.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h0u328\" data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"882\">Benefits for Working Professionals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"1107\">This relaxation enables experienced candidates to leverage their industry knowledge while gaining advanced management skills through the <strong data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1040\">UPES Online MBA</strong>. The program is particularly beneficial for professionals seeking:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6z1ma\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1167\">Career advancement into managerial and leadership roles.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ssic1o\" data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1222\">Higher salary potential and promotion opportunities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"csnce2\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1303\">Expertise in business strategy, finance, marketing, operations, and analytics.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w8gh05\" data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1375\">Industry-relevant management education without taking a career break.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b5r9h2\" data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1431\">Enhanced decision-making and leadership capabilities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 'Medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `organisation_courses` (`id`, `organisation_id`, `campus_id`, `department_id`, `course_id`, `academic_unit_name`, `slug`, `entrance_exam_id`, `entrance_exam_ids`, `entrance_exam_category`, `mode`, `fees`, `duration`, `status`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `admission_process`, `provisional_admission`, `eligibility`, `fees_structure`, `roi`, `curriculum`, `career_prospects`, `placement_details`, `program_level_id`, `stream_offered_id`, `discipline_id`, `specialization_id`, `specialization_ids`, `rating`, `industrial_collaboration`, `internship_ranking`, `course_languages`, `total_fees`, `school_type`, `education_board`, `board_affiliation_number`, `affiliation_valid_from`, `affiliation_valid_to`, `medium_of_instruction`, `grade_range`, `streams_offered`, `student_strength`, `total_teachers`, `trained_teachers_percentage`, `student_teacher_ratio`, `special_educator_available`, `school_counsellor_available`, `average_class_size`, `assessment_pattern`, `homework_policy`, `parent_teacher_meet_frequency`, `remedial_classes_available`, `board_result_classes`, `average_board_result_percentage`, `highest_score`, `distinction_percentage`, `olympiad_participation`, `competitive_exam_preparation_support`, `annual_fee_range`, `admission_fee`, `transport_fee`, `hostel_fee`, `fee_payment_frequency`, `parent_app_available`, `attendance_tracking_available`, `sports_offered`, `arts_music_programs_available`, `clubs_and_societies`, `annual_events`, `delivery_mode`, `integrated_schooling_available`, `total_batches`, `average_batch_size`, `min_batch_size`, `max_batch_size`, `separate_batches_for_droppers`, `merit_based_batching`, `total_faculty_count`, `senior_faculty_count`, `average_faculty_experience_years`, `full_time_faculty_percentage`, `visiting_faculty_available`, `doubt_solving_mode`, `personal_mentorship_available`, `extra_classes_for_weak_students`, `parent_counselling_available`, `study_material_type`, `dpp_provided`, `test_series_available`, `tests_per_month`, `full_syllabus_tests_count`, `online_test_platform_available`, `results_years_available`, `total_selections_all_time`, `selections_last_year`, `highest_rank_achieved`, `average_selection_rate`, `result_verification_status`, `average_course_fee_range`, `installment_available`, `scholarship_available`, `refund_policy_available`, `verified_reviews_only`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`) VALUES
(492, 85, 'f8946380-78e3-4e17-9345-635c0f76e250', 'a37c66e8-e7f9-486b-b6ff-149653f61664', 68, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 06:38:30', '2026-06-17 00:34:34', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"432\">The <strong data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"85\">UPES Online BBA eligibility criteria</strong> are designed to provide aspiring business professionals with an accessible pathway to earn a recognized undergraduate management degree. Whether you have completed Class 12 or hold a diploma qualification, the program offers an opportunity to build a strong foundation in business management, marketing, finance, entrepreneurship, and leadership.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18gm1oo\" data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"478\">Academic Eligibility for UPES Online BBA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"625\">Candidates seeking admission to the <strong data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"573\">UPES Online Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA)</strong> must fulfill any one of the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"819\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"159c4n1\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"708\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"683\">45% marks or equivalent in Class 12 (10+2)</strong> from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o7aqkv\" data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"819\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"766\">45% marks or equivalent in a 3-year Diploma</strong> recognized by AICTE, completed after SSC (Class 10).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1czzthz\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"871\">Eligibility for Students Appearing in Class 12</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"1140\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fb9cqn\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"1068\">Candidates <strong data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"925\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> are also eligible to apply, subject to the submission of qualifying examination results and required documents within the prescribed timeline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3cmb0d\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1140\">Students from recognized boards across India can apply for admission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hwasfh\" data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1183\">NIOS and Equivalent Board Eligibility</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1406\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1026399\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1406\">Candidates who have completed their Class 12 education through <strong data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1297\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> or any other recognized board are eligible to apply, provided they meet the minimum percentage requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d8p08b\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1453\">Who Should Apply for the UPES Online BBA?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1488\">The UPES Online BBA is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1906\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g36vnc\" data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1545\">Students seeking an Online BBA degree after Class 12.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4wout3\" data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1625\">Learners aiming to build careers in business management and entrepreneurship.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tzzpdn\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1703\">Individuals planning to pursue higher studies such as an MBA in the future.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tifhvo\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1794\">Students looking for flexible online learning with industry-relevant business education.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1au0b00\" data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1906\">Aspiring professionals interested in marketing, finance, human resources, operations, and business analytics.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 'Medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(493, 85, 'f8946380-78e3-4e17-9345-635c0f76e250', 'a37c66e8-e7f9-486b-b6ff-149653f61664', 75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 06:41:41', '2026-06-01 06:41:41', NULL, 1, '<div class=\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\" data-voice-floating-orb-focus-background=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm\">\r\n<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\">\r\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:54428524-16fe-4567-9ef9-3b2d3a59c0aa-47\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\">\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:54428524-16fe-4567-9ef9-3b2d3a59c0aa-47\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:54428524-16fe-4567-9ef9-3b2d3a59c0aa-47\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-8\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"486d4854-767e-441d-a7bc-a2ec02756ca2\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-5\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"430\">The <strong data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"98\">UPES Online MCA (Master of Computer Applications)</strong> program is designed for graduates who want to build advanced expertise in software development, programming, data management, cloud technologies, artificial intelligence, and emerging IT domains. The eligibility criteria ensure that students from diverse academic backgrounds can pursue a rewarding career in the technology sector.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18glzae\" data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"476\">Academic Eligibility for UPES Online MCA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"579\">Candidates seeking admission to the <strong data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"541\">UPES Online MCA program</strong> must meet the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ycdmge\" data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"684\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"639\">Bachelor\'s degree or equivalent qualification</strong> from a recognized university or institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1av0cxv\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"820\">Graduates from disciplines such as <strong data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"773\">B.E., B.Tech., B.Sc., B.Com., B.A., B.Voc., BCA</strong>, or equivalent programs are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10xm2vm\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"902\">Preferably have studied <strong data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"901\">Mathematics at the 10+2 level or during graduation</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yi6u5m\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"979\">Obtain a minimum of <strong data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"948\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in the qualifying examination.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u6b0ho\" data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1053\">Eligibility for Non-Mathematics and Non-Computer Background Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1303\">UPES provides an opportunity for students from non-technical backgrounds to pursue an Online MCA. Candidates who have not studied <strong data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1250\">Mathematics, Information Technology (IT), or Computer Science</strong> at the Class 12 or graduation level can still apply.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1350\">However, such candidates will be required to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1635\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14p4ve5\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1462\">Complete a <strong data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1386\">Basic Mathematics</strong> course and/or <strong data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1439\">Basic Computer Information Systems</strong> course, as applicable.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f6wvhy\" data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1551\">Successfully qualify these bridge courses within <strong data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1550\">6 weeks of provisional admission</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17eyr17\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1635\">Fulfill the bridge course requirements to confirm final admission to the program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1783\">This pathway allows learners from Commerce, Arts, and other non-technical streams to transition into the rapidly growing IT and software industry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ybhpk2\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1849\">Relaxation in Eligibility Criteria for Working Professionals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1943\">UPES offers special eligibility relaxation for candidates with professional work experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1965\">Candidates who have:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2116\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ghdhs9\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2017\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2012\">2 years of work experience</strong>, and</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jv4uzh\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2116\">A <strong data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2071\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or equivalent qualification</strong> from a recognized university or institution,</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2236\">are eligible to apply with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2181\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in graduation instead of the standard 50% requirement.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e7ewcn\" data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2261\">Eligibility Summary</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2300\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2300\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2289\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2300\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2406\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2353\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2406\">Bachelor\'s degree or equivalent in any discipline</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2440\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2423\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2440\" data-col-size=\"md\">50% aggregate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2507\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2464\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Preferred Background</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2507\">Mathematics at 10+2 or Graduation level</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2620\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2537\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Non-Mathematics Candidates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2620\">Required to complete bridge courses in Mathematics/Computer Information Systems</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2650\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Work Experience Relaxation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2713\">45% aggregate marks with minimum 2 years of work experience</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2733\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accepted Degrees</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2815\">BCA, B.Sc., B.Com., B.A., B.Voc., B.E., B.Tech., and equivalent qualifications</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d8mtad\" data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2862\">Who Should Apply for the UPES Online MCA?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2864\" data-end=\"2897\">The UPES Online MCA is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2899\" data-end=\"3320\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12zqxag\" data-start=\"2899\" data-end=\"2968\">Graduates aspiring to build careers in software development and IT.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8rgf2t\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3056\">Working professionals seeking career growth in technology and digital transformation.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12svfrz\" data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3131\">BCA, B.Sc., B.Com., and B.A. graduates looking to enter the IT industry.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8tl7n9\" data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3239\">Professionals interested in cloud computing, data analytics, cybersecurity, AI, and software engineering.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bvw993\" data-start=\"3240\" data-end=\"3320\">Individuals seeking a flexible Online MCA degree from a recognized university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"thread-bottom-container\" class=\"sticky bottom-0 z-10 group/thread-bottom-container relative isolate w-full basis-auto has-data-has-thread-error:pt-2 has-data-has-thread-error:[box-shadow:var(--sharp-edge-bottom-shadow)] md:border-transparent md:pt-0 dark:border-white/20 md:dark:border-transparent print:hidden content-fade single-line\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"text-base mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 mb-[var(--thread-component-gap,1rem)]\">\r\n<div class=\"w-full\">\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-auto relative z-1 flex h-(--composer-container-height,100%) max-w-full flex-(--composer-container-flex,1) flex-col\"><form class=\"group/composer w-full\" data-type=\"unified-composer\">\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-token-bg-primary dark:bg-token-bg-elevated-primary dark-oled:bg-token-bg-primary corner-superellipse/1.1 relative cursor-text overflow-clip bg-clip-padding p-2.5 contain-inline-size motion-safe:transition-colors motion-safe:duration-200 motion-safe:ease-in-out grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] [grid-template-areas:\'header_header_header\'_\'leading_primary_trailing\'_\'._footer_.\'] group-data-expanded/composer:[grid-template-areas:\'header_header_header\'_\'primary_primary_primary\'_\'leading_footer_trailing\'] max-sm:[grid-template-areas:\'header_header_header\'_\'primary_primary_primary\'_\'leading_footer_trailing\'] shadow-short-composer\" data-composer-surface=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 [grid-area:trailing]\">\r\n<div class=\"ms-auto flex items-center gap-1.5\">\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, 'Medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(494, 85, 'f8946380-78e3-4e17-9345-635c0f76e250', 'a37c66e8-e7f9-486b-b6ff-149653f61664', 39, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 06:43:06', '2026-06-01 06:43:06', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"456\">The <strong data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"100\">UPES Online BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)</strong> program is designed for students who want to build a strong foundation in computer applications, software development, programming, data analytics, cloud computing, and emerging digital technologies. The eligibility requirements ensure that learners from both technical and non-technical backgrounds can pursue a career in the rapidly growing IT industry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18gm1rd\" data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"502\">Academic Eligibility for UPES Online BCA</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"615\">Candidates seeking admission to the <strong data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"567\">UPES Online BCA program</strong> must fulfill any one of the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"887\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fj872e\" data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"787\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"673\">45% marks or equivalent in Class 12 (10+2)</strong> from a recognized board with <strong data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"763\">Mathematics, Computer Science, or Information Technology</strong> as one of the subjects.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohkkfi\" data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"887\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"845\">45% marks or equivalent in a 3-year Diploma</strong> recognized by AICTE after SSC (Class 10).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1czzthz\" data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"939\">Eligibility for Students Appearing in Class 12</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b5rg03\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1143\">Candidates <strong data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"993\">appearing for Class 12 examinations</strong> can also apply for admission, subject to fulfilling the eligibility requirements and submitting the required documents within the specified timeline.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yx8lor\" data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1213\">Students from recognized boards across India are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hwasfh\" data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1256\">NIOS and Equivalent Board Eligibility</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1484\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eehm34\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1484\">Candidates who have completed their Class 12 education through <strong data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1370\">NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling)</strong> or any other recognized board are eligible for admission, provided they satisfy the minimum eligibility criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u6b0ho\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1558\">Eligibility for Non-Mathematics and Non-Computer Background Students</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1693\">UPES provides flexibility for students who have not studied Mathematics, Computer Science, or Information Technology during Class 12.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1751\">Such candidates can still apply but will be required to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"2043\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14p4ve5\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1863\">Complete a <strong data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1787\">Basic Mathematics</strong> course and/or <strong data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1840\">Basic Computer Information Systems</strong> course, as applicable.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m91fks\" data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1960\">Successfully qualify the prescribed bridge course within <strong data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1959\">6 weeks of provisional admission</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aw9j1a\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2043\">Fulfill the bridge course requirements to secure final admission to the program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2218\">This provision enables students from Commerce, Arts, Humanities, and other academic streams to transition into the field of computer applications and information technology.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e7ewcn\" data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2243\">Eligibility Summary</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2799\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2282\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2282\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2271\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2282\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2799\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2392\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2335\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2392\" data-col-size=\"md\">Class 12 (10+2) or equivalent from a recognized board</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2435\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2418\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks Required</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2435\" data-col-size=\"md\">45% aggregate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2517\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2457\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Preferred Subjects</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2517\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mathematics, Computer Science, or Information Technology</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2590\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2540\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diploma Eligibility</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2590\" data-col-size=\"md\">3-year AICTE-recognized Diploma after Class 10</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2662\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2627\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Non-Technical Background Students</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2662\" data-col-size=\"md\">Eligible through bridge courses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2731\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2686\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Appearing Candidates</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2731\" data-col-size=\"md\">Students appearing for Class 12 can apply</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2799\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2751\" data-col-size=\"sm\">NIOS Eligibility</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2799\" data-col-size=\"md\">Accepted if eligibility requirements are met</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d8ow6i\" data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2846\">Who Should Apply for the UPES Online BCA?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2895\">The UPES Online BCA is an excellent choice for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"3340\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e7e4s9\" data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2952\">Students seeking an Online BCA degree after Class 12.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c60a2p\" data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"3033\">Aspirants planning careers in software development and information technology.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f0194p\" data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3140\">Learners interested in programming, web development, cloud computing, cybersecurity, and data analytics.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kpt8pg\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3239\">Students aiming to pursue higher education such as MCA, MBA, or specialized technology programs.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17vaqsj\" data-start=\"3240\" data-end=\"3340\">Individuals looking for a flexible online learning pathway into the digital and technology sector.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 'Medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(495, 85, 'f8946380-78e3-4e17-9345-635c0f76e250', 'a37c66e8-e7f9-486b-b6ff-149653f61664', 361, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 06:49:25', '2026-06-01 06:49:25', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"507\">The <strong data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"88\">UPES Online PGP (Post Graduate Program)</strong> is designed for graduates and working professionals who want to gain specialized industry knowledge, leadership capabilities, and career-focused skills in high-demand domains. With a flexible eligibility framework, the program welcomes candidates from diverse academic and professional backgrounds, making it an ideal choice for learners seeking career advancement, industry specialization, or professional upskilling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18gmgz2\" data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"553\">Academic Eligibility for UPES Online PGP</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"690\">Candidates applying for the <strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"626\">UPES Online Post Graduate Program (PGP)</strong> must satisfy any one of the following eligibility requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i01600\" data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"844\">Bachelor\'s degree or equivalent qualification in any discipline from a recognized university or institution with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"843\">50% aggregate marks</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1md7tw9\" data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"994\"><strong data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"879\">3-Year Undergraduate Diploma</strong> or equivalent qualification from a recognized university or institution with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"993\">50% aggregate marks</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d09737\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1224\">Candidates who have completed their graduation through <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1071\">Online Learning</strong> or <strong data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1111\">Open and Distance Learning (ODL)</strong> mode from a university recognized by the <strong data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1196\">UGC Distance Education Bureau (UGC-DEB)</strong> are also eligible to apply.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kr344m\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1282\">Candidates holding professional qualifications such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1367\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17r877v\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1316\"><strong data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1316\">Chartered Accountant (CA)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c5bzc2\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1347\"><strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1347\">Company Secretary (CS)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eeu4lw\" data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1364\"><strong data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1364\">ICWA/CMA</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1412\">are eligible for admission to the program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"21clli\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1466\">Eligibility Relaxation for Working Professionals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1588\">UPES recognizes the value of industry experience and offers relaxed academic requirements for experienced professionals.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1645\">Candidates with Minimum 2 Years of Work Experience</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1741\">Applicants who possess at least <strong data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1722\">2 years of professional work experience</strong> are eligible with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1906\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15wv7s\" data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1841\">Bachelor\'s degree, 3-Year UG Diploma, or equivalent qualification from a recognized institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3es4pl\" data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1906\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1875\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in the qualifying examination.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1963\">Candidates with Minimum 4 Years of Work Experience</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2048\">Applicants with substantial professional experience receive additional flexibility:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2265\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15wv7s\" data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2148\">Bachelor\'s degree, 3-Year UG Diploma, or equivalent qualification from a recognized institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5o7m3g\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2213\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2182\">40% aggregate marks</strong> in the qualifying examination.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sggnsh\" data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2265\">At least <strong data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2264\">4 years of relevant work experience</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e7ewcn\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2290\">Eligibility Summary</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2740\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2329\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2329\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2318\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2329\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2740\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2405\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2374\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bachelor\'s Degree</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2405\">Minimum 50% aggregate marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2457\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2426\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3-Year UG Diploma</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2457\">Minimum 50% aggregate marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2486\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online/Distance Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2523\">Accepted if recognized by UGC-DEB</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2583\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2554\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Qualifications</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2583\">CA, CS, ICWA/CMA eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2641\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2 Years Work Experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2641\">Minimum 45% aggregate marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2699\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2668\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4 Years Work Experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2699\">Minimum 40% aggregate marks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2740\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2722\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Background</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2740\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Any discipline</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d881u5\" data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2787\">Who Should Apply for the UPES Online PGP?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2822\">The UPES Online PGP is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"3278\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17z55yx\" data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2899\">Working professionals seeking career growth and leadership opportunities.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a3uyat\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2959\">Graduates looking to gain specialized industry expertise.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lbfo04\" data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"3027\">Professionals planning a career transition into emerging sectors.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zswxa2\" data-start=\"3028\" data-end=\"3096\">Entrepreneurs aiming to strengthen business and management skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17iisxn\" data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3180\">CA, CS, and CMA professionals seeking broader managerial and strategic knowledge.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jcgqef\" data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3278\">Learners interested in enhancing employability through industry-focused certification programs.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 'Medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(496, 85, 'f8946380-78e3-4e17-9345-635c0f76e250', 'a37c66e8-e7f9-486b-b6ff-149653f61664', 140, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ONLINE', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-06-01 06:53:42', '2026-06-01 06:53:42', NULL, 1, '<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"486\">The <strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"84\">UPES Online B.Com (Hons.)</strong> program is designed for graduates and professionals who want to strengthen their expertise in accounting, finance, taxation, business management, and corporate governance. With a flexible admission framework, the program welcomes candidates from diverse academic and professional backgrounds, making it an excellent choice for individuals seeking career advancement in the commerce and finance sector.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1107oxd\" data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"542\">Academic Eligibility for UPES Online B.Com (Hons.)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"662\">To apply for the <strong data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"598\">UPES Online B.Com (Hons.) program</strong>, candidates must fulfill any one of the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"991\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7i0ij9\" data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"785\">Hold a <strong data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"722\">Bachelor\'s degree or equivalent qualification</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university or institution.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yi6u5m\" data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"862\">Obtain a minimum of <strong data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"831\">50% aggregate marks</strong> in the qualifying examination.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eh62s4\" data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"991\">Candidates from Commerce, Science, Arts, Management, Engineering, and other recognized academic streams are eligible to apply.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"v1rug5\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1051\">Eligibility for Online and Distance Learning Graduates</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1182\">UPES recognizes qualifications earned through flexible learning pathways. Candidates who have completed their graduation through:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5i1eed\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1218\"><strong data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1214\">Online Learning Programs</strong>, or</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xr47t1\" data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1262\"><strong data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1262\">Open and Distance Learning (ODL) Mode</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1387\">from universities or institutions recognized by the <strong data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1359\">UGC Distance Education Bureau (UGC-DEB)</strong> are eligible for admission.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1519\">This provision enables working professionals and distance learners to pursue advanced commerce education without any disadvantage.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"o31wd5\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1572\">Eligibility Through Professional Qualifications</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1705\">Apart from conventional graduation degrees, UPES also accepts candidates holding recognized professional qualifications, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1815\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17r877v\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1738\"><strong data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1738\">Chartered Accountant (CA)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c5bzc2\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1767\"><strong data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1767\">Company Secretary (CS)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y7c21z\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1815\"><strong data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1815\">ICWA/CMA (Cost and Management Accounting)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1979\">These qualifications provide a strong foundation in finance, accounting, taxation, and corporate laws, making professionals eligible for admission to the program.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ybhpk2\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2045\">Relaxation in Eligibility Criteria for Working Professionals</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2181\">UPES offers special admission flexibility for experienced professionals who may not meet the standard academic percentage requirement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2199\">Candidates with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2346\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ghdhs9\" data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2251\">A minimum of <strong data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2246\">2 years of work experience</strong>, and</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tpv8ir\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2346\">A Bachelor\'s degree or equivalent qualification from a recognized university or institution,</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2432\">can apply with a minimum of <strong data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2399\">45% aggregate marks</strong> in their qualifying examination.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2565\">This relaxation recognizes practical industry experience as an important component of professional learning and career development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e7ewcn\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2590\">Eligibility Summary</h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2629\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2629\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2618\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eligibility Requirement</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2629\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2735\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Educational Qualification</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2735\">Bachelor\'s degree or equivalent in any discipline</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2778\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2761\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimum Marks Required</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2778\">50% aggregate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2846\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2809\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online &amp; Distance Graduates</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2846\">Accepted if recognized by UGC-DEB</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2906\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2877\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Professional Qualifications</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2906\">CA, CS, ICWA/CMA eligible</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2999\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2936\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Work Experience Relaxation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"2999\">45% aggregate marks with minimum 2 years of work experience</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3022\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Academic Background</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3051\">Any recognized discipline</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8rc36\" data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3108\">Who Should Apply for the UPES Online B.Com (Hons.)?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3135\">The program is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3548\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fwkzjl\" data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3202\">Graduates seeking advanced knowledge in accounting and finance.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"126cir\" data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3281\">Working professionals looking to upgrade their commerce and business skills.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y4iysj\" data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3359\">CA, CS, and CMA professionals aiming to broaden their managerial expertise.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eefrvj\" data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3457\">Individuals planning careers in finance, taxation, auditing, banking, and corporate management.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ax7bn9\" data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3548\">Professionals seeking a flexible online learning program while continuing their careers.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 'Medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0, NULL, NULL, '[\"1\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL);

